icon\">\ud83d\udcac<\/span>B1 CONVERSATION CYBERPUNK MASTER 2025\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"leccion-subtitulo\">AI Chat Simulator \u2022 Voice Recorder \u2022 30+ Exercises \u2022 Real Practice<\/p>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS R\u00c1PIDO -->\r\n    <section class=\"objetivos-rapidos\">\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83e\udd16<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n                    <h4>AI Conversation Partner<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Chat inteligente con respuestas autom\u00e1ticas y feedback<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83c\udfa4<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n                    <h4>Voice Recorder Pro<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Grabaci\u00f3n de voz con an\u00e1lisis y descarga<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n                    <h4>30+ Interactive Exercises<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Quiz, completar, selecci\u00f3n y m\u00e1s<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR PRINCIPAL: CHAT AI + VOICE RECORDER -->\r\n    <div class=\"seccion-principal\">\r\n\r\n        <!-- CHAT SIMULATOR CON IA - MEJORADO -->\r\n        <section class=\"chat-simulator-section\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n                <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83e\udd16<\/span> AI CHAT SIMULATOR CYBERPUNK\r\n            <\/h2>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"simulador-chat-cyberpunk\">\r\n                <!-- CONTROLES R\u00c1PIDOS -->\r\n                <div class=\"chat-controls-rapidos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"controls-header-chat\">\r\n                        <h3>\u26a1 CONTROLES R\u00c1PIDOS<\/h3>\r\n                        <p>Selecciona un tema para comenzar la conversaci\u00f3n:<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"chat-quick-topics\">\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-topic\" data-topic=\"greetings\" onclick=\"iniciarConversacion('greetings')\">\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-icon\">\ud83d\udc4b<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-text\">Greetings<\/span>\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-topic\" data-topic=\"routine\" onclick=\"iniciarConversacion('routine')\">\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-icon\">\ud83d\udcc5<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-text\">Daily Routine<\/span>\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-topic\" data-topic=\"past\" onclick=\"iniciarConversacion('past')\">\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-icon\">\u23ee\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-text\">Past Events<\/span>\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-topic\" data-topic=\"future\" onclick=\"iniciarConversacion('future')\">\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-icon\">\u23ed\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-text\">Future Plans<\/span>\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-topic\" data-topic=\"food\" onclick=\"iniciarConversacion('food')\">\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-icon\">\ud83c\udf55<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-text\">Food & Drink<\/span>\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-topic\" data-topic=\"family\" onclick=\"iniciarConversacion('family')\">\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-icon\">\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-text\">Family<\/span>\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- \u00c1REA DEL CHAT -->\r\n                <div class=\"chat-area-container\">\r\n                    <!-- DISPLAY DEL CHAT -->\r\n                    <div class=\"chat-display-cyberpunk\" id=\"chatDisplay\">\r\n                        <div class=\"initial-chat-message\">\r\n                            <div class=\"bot-avatar\">\ud83e\udd16<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"message-content\">\r\n                                <div class=\"message-sender\">AI Assistant<\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"message-text\">\u00a1Hola! Soy Ana, tu asistente de ingl\u00e9s B1. Selecciona un tema o escribe tu mensaje para comenzar a practicar. \u00a1Estoy aqu\u00ed para ayudarte! \ud83d\ude80<\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- ENTRADA DE TEXTO -->\r\n                    <div class=\"chat-input-area-cyberpunk\">\r\n                        <div class=\"input-container\">\r\n                            <input type=\"text\" id=\"userChatInput\" placeholder=\"Type your message in English...\" class=\"chat-input-cyberpunk\">\r\n                            <div class=\"input-actions\">\r\n                                <button class=\"btn-input-action\" onclick=\"enviarMensajeUsuario()\" title=\"Send message\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"action-icon\">\ud83d\ude80<\/span> SEND\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                                <button class=\"btn-input-action btn-clear\" onclick=\"limpiarChat()\" title=\"Clear chat\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"action-icon\">\ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f<\/span> CLEAR\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                                <button class=\"btn-input-action btn-voice\" onclick=\"toggleVoiceInput()\" title=\"Voice input\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"action-icon\">\ud83c\udfa4<\/span> VOICE\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"input-hint\">\r\n                            <span>\ud83d\udca1 Press Enter to send \u2022 Click VOICE for speech recognition<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- INFO DEL CHAT -->\r\n                <div class=\"chat-info-panel\">\r\n                    <div class=\"chat-stats\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udcca CHAT STATS<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"stat-label\">Messages:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"messageCount\">0<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"stat-label\">Topics used:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"topicCount\">0<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"stat-label\">Practice time:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"practiceTime\">0 min<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"conversation-tips\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udca1 CONVERSATION TIPS<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Use complete sentences<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Ask follow-up questions<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Use past\/present\/future correctly<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Practice pronunciation with voice<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n\r\n        <!-- VOICE RECORDER PRO - MEJORADO -->\r\n        <section class=\"voice-recorder-section\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n                <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83c\udfa4<\/span> VOICE RECORDER PRO CYBERPUNK\r\n            <\/h2>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"recorder-container-cyberpunk\">\r\n                <!-- CONTROLES PRINCIPALES -->\r\n                <div class=\"recorder-main-controls\">\r\n                    <div class=\"recorder-status\">\r\n                        <div class=\"status-indicator\" id=\"recorderStatusIndicator\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"status-text\" id=\"recorderStatusText\">Ready to record<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"recorder-buttons\">\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-recorder btn-record\" id=\"recordBtn\" onclick=\"toggleRecording()\">\r\n                            <span class=\"recorder-icon\">\ud83c\udfa4<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"recorder-text\">START RECORDING<\/span>\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        \r\n                        <button class=\"btn-recorder btn-play\" id=\"playBtn\" onclick=\"playRecording()\" disabled>\r\n                            <span class=\"recorder-icon\">\u25b6\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"recorder-text\">PLAY RECORDING<\/span>\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        \r\n                        <button class=\"btn-recorder btn-download\" id=\"downloadBtn\" onclick=\"downloadRecording()\" disabled>\r\n                            <span class=\"recorder-icon\">\ud83d\udcbe<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"recorder-text\">DOWNLOAD<\/span>\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- VISUALIZADOR DE ONDA -->\r\n                <div class=\"waveform-container\">\r\n                    <div class=\"waveform-header\">\r\n                        <span>\ud83d\udd0a WAVEFORM VISUALIZER<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"waveform-controls\">\r\n                            <button class=\"btn-wave\" onclick=\"clearWaveform()\">Clear<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"btn-wave\" onclick=\"toggleWaveform()\">Toggle View<\/button>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"waveform-visual\" id=\"waveformVisual\">\r\n                        <!-- Las barras de onda se generar\u00e1n din\u00e1micamente -->\r\n                        <div class=\"wave-bars\">\r\n                            <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 20%;\"><\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 40%;\"><\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 60%;\"><\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 80%;\"><\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 80%;\"><\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 60%;\"><\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 40%;\"><\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 20%;\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"waveform-info\">\r\n                        <span id=\"recordingDuration\">Duration: 0s<\/span>\r\n                        <span id=\"recordingSize\">Size: 0 KB<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- TOPICS PARA PRACTICAR -->\r\n                <div class=\"practice-topics-panel\">\r\n                    <div class=\"topics-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udfaf PRACTICE TOPICS<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Click a topic and record yourself speaking for 30+ seconds<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"topics-grid\">\r\n                        <button class=\"practice-topic\" onclick=\"setPracticeTopic('Introduce yourself')\">\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-icon\">\ud83d\udc64<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-name\">Introduce yourself<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-desc\">Name, age, where you're from<\/span>\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        \r\n                        <button class=\"practice-topic\" onclick=\"setPracticeTopic('Daily routine')\">\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-icon\">\ud83c\udf05<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-name\">Daily routine<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-desc\">What you do every day<\/span>\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        \r\n                        <button class=\"practice-topic\" onclick=\"setPracticeTopic('Family')\">\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-icon\">\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-name\">Family<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-desc\">Describe your family members<\/span>\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        \r\n                        <button class=\"practice-topic\" onclick=\"setPracticeTopic('Hobbies')\">\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-icon\">\ud83c\udfa8<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-name\">Hobbies<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-desc\">What you like to do for fun<\/span>\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        \r\n                        <button class=\"practice-topic\" onclick=\"setPracticeTopic('Future plans')\">\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-icon\">\ud83d\ude80<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-name\">Future plans<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-desc\">What you want to do next year<\/span>\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        \r\n                        <button class=\"practice-topic\" onclick=\"setPracticeTopic('Last vacation')\">\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-icon\">\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-name\">Last vacation<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"topic-desc\">Where you went and what you did<\/span>\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"current-topic-display\">\r\n                        <div class=\"current-topic-label\">Current topic:<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"current-topic-value\" id=\"currentTopic\">None selected<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n\r\n        <!-- CONVERSATION STARTERS & FILLERS - CYBERPUNK -->\r\n        <section class=\"fillers-section\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n                <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f<\/span> CONVERSATION STARTERS & FILLERS\r\n            <\/h2>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"fillers-container-cyberpunk\">\r\n                <!-- CATEGOR\u00cdAS DE FILLERS -->\r\n                <div class=\"fillers-categories\">\r\n                    <div class=\"category-tabs\">\r\n                        <button class=\"category-tab active\" data-category=\"starters\">\ud83d\ude80 Starters<\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"category-tab\" data-category=\"flow\">\ud83d\udd04 Keep Flow<\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"category-tab\" data-category=\"clarify\">\u2753 Clarify<\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"category-tab\" data-category=\"end\">\ud83d\udc4b End<\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"category-content\">\r\n                        <!-- STARTERS -->\r\n                        <div class=\"category-pane active\" id=\"starters-pane\">\r\n                            <div class=\"phrase-grid\">\r\n                                <button class=\"phrase-card\" onclick=\"speakAndDisplay('How are you doing?', 'starters')\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-icon\">\ud83d\udc4b<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-text\">How are you doing?<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-desc\">Common greeting<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-action\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                                \r\n                                <button class=\"phrase-card\" onclick=\"speakAndDisplay('What\\\\'s up?', 'starters')\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-icon\">\ud83e\udd14<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-text\">What's up?<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-desc\">Informal greeting<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-action\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                                \r\n                                <button class=\"phrase-card\" onclick=\"speakAndDisplay('How was your day?', 'starters')\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-icon\">\ud83d\udcc5<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-text\">How was your day?<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-desc\">Ask about their day<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-action\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                                \r\n                                <button class=\"phrase-card\" onclick=\"speakAndDisplay('Long time no see!', 'starters')\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-icon\">\u23f0<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-text\">Long time no see!<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-desc\">After not seeing someone<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-action\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- KEEP FLOW -->\r\n                        <div class=\"category-pane\" id=\"flow-pane\">\r\n                            <div class=\"phrase-grid\">\r\n                                <button class=\"phrase-card\" onclick=\"speakAndDisplay('And you?', 'flow')\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-icon\">\u21aa\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-text\">And you?<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-desc\">Return the question<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-action\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                                \r\n                                <button class=\"phrase-card\" onclick=\"speakAndDisplay('That\\\\'s interesting!', 'flow')\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-icon\">\ud83d\ude2e<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-text\">That's interesting!<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-desc\">Show interest<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-action\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                                \r\n                                <button class=\"phrase-card\" onclick=\"speakAndDisplay('Really?', 'flow')\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-icon\">\u2753<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-text\">Really?<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-desc\">Express surprise<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-action\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                                \r\n                                <button class=\"phrase-card\" onclick=\"speakAndDisplay('Tell me more!', 'flow')\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-icon\">\ud83d\udcac<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-text\">Tell me more!<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-desc\">Encourage continuation<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-action\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- CLARIFY -->\r\n                        <div class=\"category-pane\" id=\"clarify-pane\">\r\n                            <div class=\"phrase-grid\">\r\n                                <button class=\"phrase-card\" onclick=\"speakAndDisplay('Can you repeat, please?', 'clarify')\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-text\">Can you repeat, please?<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-desc\">Ask for repetition<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-action\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                                \r\n                                <button class=\"phrase-card\" onclick=\"speakAndDisplay('What do you mean?', 'clarify')\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-icon\">\ud83e\udd37<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-text\">What do you mean?<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-desc\">Ask for clarification<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-action\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                                \r\n                                <button class=\"phrase-card\" onclick=\"speakAndDisplay('I don\\\\'t understand', 'clarify')\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-icon\">\ud83d\ude15<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-text\">I don't understand<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-desc\">Express confusion<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-action\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                                \r\n                                <button class=\"phrase-card\" onclick=\"speakAndDisplay('Could you speak slower?', 'clarify')\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-icon\">\ud83d\udc0c<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-text\">Could you speak slower?<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-desc\">Ask to slow down<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-action\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- END -->\r\n                        <div class=\"category-pane\" id=\"end-pane\">\r\n                            <div class=\"phrase-grid\">\r\n                                <button class=\"phrase-card\" onclick=\"speakAndDisplay('See you later!', 'end')\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-icon\">\ud83d\udc4b<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-text\">See you later!<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-desc\">Casual goodbye<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-action\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                                \r\n                                <button class=\"phrase-card\" onclick=\"speakAndDisplay('Nice talking to you!', 'end')\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-icon\">\ud83d\ude0a<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-text\">Nice talking to you!<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-desc\">Polite ending<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-action\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                                \r\n                                <button class=\"phrase-card\" onclick=\"speakAndDisplay('Take care!', 'end')\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-icon\">\ud83d\udc96<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-text\">Take care!<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-desc\">Caring goodbye<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-action\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                                \r\n                                <button class=\"phrase-card\" onclick=\"speakAndDisplay('Have a great day!', 'end')\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-icon\">\u2600\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-text\">Have a great day!<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"phrase-desc\">Wishing well<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"phrase-action\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                                <\/button>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- DISPLAY DE LA FRASE -->\r\n                <div class=\"phrase-display-panel\">\r\n                    <div class=\"display-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udcdd PHRASE DISPLAY<\/h4>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-practice\" onclick=\"practiceCurrentPhrase()\">Practice This<\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"phrase-display-content\" id=\"phraseDisplay\">\r\n                        <div class=\"display-initial\">\r\n                            <div class=\"initial-icon\">\ud83d\udcac<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"initial-text\">Click a phrase to see it here and hear the pronunciation.<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"phrase-details\">\r\n                        <div class=\"detail-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"detail-label\">Category:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"detail-value\" id=\"phraseCategory\">-<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"detail-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"detail-label\">Use:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"detail-value\" id=\"phraseUse\">-<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"detail-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"detail-label\">Pronunciation:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"detail-value\" id=\"phrasePron\">-<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"phrase-actions\">\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-phrase-action\" onclick=\"speakCurrentPhrase()\">\r\n                            <span class=\"action-icon\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/span> Speak\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-phrase-action\" onclick=\"addToPractice()\">\r\n                            <span class=\"action-icon\">\u2795<\/span> Add to Practice\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-phrase-action\" onclick=\"savePhrase()\">\r\n                            <span class=\"action-icon\">\ud83d\udcbe<\/span> Save\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n\r\n        <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO DE 30 PREGUNTAS -->\r\n        <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n                <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> B1 ENGLISH QUIZ - 30 QUESTIONS\r\n            <\/h2>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-container-cyberpunk\">\r\n                <!-- PANEL DE CONTROL DEL QUIZ -->\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-control-panel\">\r\n                    <div class=\"quiz-stats\">\r\n                        <div class=\"quiz-stat\">\r\n                            <span class=\"stat-label\">Questions:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"stat-value\">30<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"quiz-stat\">\r\n                            <span class=\"stat-label\">Time:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"stat-value\">30 min<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"quiz-stat\">\r\n                            <span class=\"stat-label\">Level:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"stat-value\">B1<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"quiz-progress\">\r\n                        <div class=\"progress-header\">\r\n                            <span>Progress<\/span>\r\n                            <span id=\"quizProgressText\">0\/30<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"progress-bar-quiz\">\r\n                            <div class=\"progress-fill-quiz\" id=\"quizProgressBar\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"quiz-actions\">\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-quiz-action\" onclick=\"startQuiz()\" id=\"startQuizBtn\">\r\n                            <span class=\"quiz-icon\">\ud83d\ude80<\/span> START QUIZ\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-quiz-action\" onclick=\"resetQuiz()\" id=\"resetQuizBtn\" disabled>\r\n                            <span class=\"quiz-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> RESET\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-quiz-action\" onclick=\"showResults()\" id=\"resultsBtn\" disabled>\r\n                            <span class=\"quiz-icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span> RESULTS\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- CONTENEDOR DE PREGUNTAS -->\r\n                <div class=\"questions-container\">\r\n                    <div class=\"question-display\" id=\"questionDisplay\">\r\n                        <div class=\"initial-question-screen\">\r\n                            <div class=\"initial-icon-quiz\">\ud83d\udcda<\/div>\r\n                            <h3>B1 ENGLISH QUIZ READY<\/h3>\r\n                            <p>This quiz contains 30 questions covering grammar, vocabulary, and conversation skills at B1 level.<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"quiz-topics\">\r\n                                <h4>Topics covered:<\/h4>\r\n                                <ul>\r\n                                    <li>Present Simple & Continuous<\/li>\r\n                                    <li>Past Simple & Present Perfect<\/li>\r\n                                    <li>Future Forms<\/li>\r\n                                    <li>Vocabulary (daily life, travel, food)<\/li>\r\n                                    <li>Conversation Responses<\/li>\r\n                                <\/ul>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <button class=\"btn-start-big\" onclick=\"startQuiz()\">CLICK TO START QUIZ \ud83d\ude80<\/button>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"quiz-navigation\">\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-nav-quiz\" onclick=\"prevQuestion()\" id=\"prevBtn\" disabled>\r\n                            <span class=\"nav-icon\">\u2b05\ufe0f<\/span> Previous\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"question-counter\">\r\n                            <span id=\"currentQuestionNum\">0<\/span> \/ <span id=\"totalQuestions\">30<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-nav-quiz\" onclick=\"nextQuestion()\" id=\"nextBtn\">\r\n                            Next <span class=\"nav-icon\">\u27a1\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- PANEL DE RESULTADOS -->\r\n                <div class=\"results-panel\">\r\n                    <div class=\"results-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udcca QUIZ RESULTS<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"score-display\" id=\"scoreDisplay\">\r\n                            <div class=\"score-circle-quiz\">\r\n                                <span class=\"score-number\">0%<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"score-label\">Current Score<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"results-details\">\r\n                        <div class=\"result-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"result-label\">Correct:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"result-value\" id=\"correctCount\">0<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"result-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"result-label\">Incorrect:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"result-value\" id=\"incorrectCount\">0<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"result-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"result-label\">Skipped:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"result-value\" id=\"skippedCount\">0<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"result-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"result-label\">Time spent:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"result-value\" id=\"timeSpent\">0m 0s<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"resultsFeedback\">\r\n                        <p>Start the quiz to see your results here!<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"results-actions\">\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-results\" onclick=\"reviewQuiz()\" id=\"reviewBtn\" disabled>\r\n                            <span class=\"results-icon\">\ud83d\udcd6<\/span> Review Answers\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-results\" onclick=\"saveResults()\" id=\"saveResultsBtn\" disabled>\r\n                            <span class=\"results-icon\">\ud83d\udcbe<\/span> Save Results\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FULL CONVERSATION EXAMPLE -->\r\n        <section class=\"conversation-example-section\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n                <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83c\udfac<\/span> FULL CONVERSATION EXAMPLE\r\n            <\/h2>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"conversation-example-cyberpunk\">\r\n                <!-- CONTROLES DE CONVERSACI\u00d3N -->\r\n                <div class=\"conversation-controls\">\r\n                    <div class=\"controls-header-conv\">\r\n                        <h3>\ud83c\udfae CONVERSATION CONTROLS<\/h3>\r\n                        <p>Play the full conversation or step by step<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"conv-buttons\">\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-conv\" onclick=\"playFullConversation()\">\r\n                            <span class=\"conv-icon\">\u25b6\ufe0f<\/span> Play All\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-conv\" onclick=\"pauseConversation()\" id=\"pauseBtn\" disabled>\r\n                            <span class=\"conv-icon\">\u23f8\ufe0f<\/span> Pause\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-conv\" onclick=\"resetConversation()\">\r\n                            <span class=\"conv-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> Reset\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-conv\" onclick=\"stepConversation()\" id=\"stepBtn\">\r\n                            <span class=\"conv-icon\">\u23ed\ufe0f<\/span> Step by Step\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"conv-speed\">\r\n                        <label for=\"speedControl\">Speed:<\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" id=\"speedControl\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1\">\r\n                        <span id=\"speedValue\">1.0x<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- DI\u00c1LOGO COMPLETO -->\r\n                <div class=\"dialogue-container\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dialogue-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dialogue-title\">\ud83d\udc65 Conversation: Meeting a Friend<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dialogue-info\">B1 Level \u2022 8 exchanges \u2022 2 speakers<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"dialogue-content\" id=\"dialogueContent\">\r\n                        <!-- Las l\u00edneas de di\u00e1logo se generar\u00e1n aqu\u00ed -->\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- INFO DE LA CONVERSACI\u00d3N -->\r\n                <div class=\"conversation-info-panel\">\r\n                    <div class=\"conv-stats\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udcc8 CONVERSATION STATS<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"conv-stat-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"conv-stat-label\">Total phrases:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"conv-stat-value\">8<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"conv-stat-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"conv-stat-label\">Vocabulary:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"conv-stat-value\">24 words<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"conv-stat-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"conv-stat-label\">Grammar:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"conv-stat-value\">Present, Past, Future<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"conv-stat-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"conv-stat-label\">Duration:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"conv-stat-value\">45 seconds<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"conv-tips\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udca1 LEARNING TIPS<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Notice how questions are formed<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Pay attention to verb tenses<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Listen to pronunciation patterns<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Practice with your own answers<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n\r\n        <!-- ERRORES COMUNES EN CONVERSACI\u00d3N B1 -->\r\n        <section class=\"common-errors-section\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n                <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> COMMON B1 CONVERSATION ERRORS\r\n            <\/h2>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"errors-container-cyberpunk\">\r\n                <div class=\"errors-categories\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-category active\" data-error=\"grammar\">\r\n                        <div class=\"error-cat-icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"error-cat-name\">Grammar Errors<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-category\" data-error=\"vocabulary\">\r\n                        <div class=\"error-cat-icon\">\ud83d\udcd6<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"error-cat-name\">Vocabulary Errors<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-category\" data-error=\"pronunciation\">\r\n                        <div class=\"error-cat-icon\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"error-cat-name\">Pronunciation<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-category\" data-error=\"fluency\">\r\n                        <div class=\"error-cat-icon\">\ud83d\udcac<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"error-cat-name\">Fluency Issues<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"errors-content\">\r\n                    <!-- ERRORES DE GRAM\u00c1TICA -->\r\n                    <div class=\"error-pane active\" id=\"grammar-pane\">\r\n                        <div class=\"error-example\">\r\n                            <div class=\"error-header\">\r\n                                <div class=\"error-title\">\u274c Incorrect: \"I go to cinema yesterday\"<\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"error-severity\">Common<\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"error-details\">\r\n                                <div class=\"error-incorrect\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-label\">Wrong:<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-text\">\"I go to cinema yesterday\"<\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"error-correct\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-label\">Correct:<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-text\">\"I went to the cinema yesterday\"<\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"error-explanation\">\r\n                                <p><strong>Why it's wrong:<\/strong> Use past simple for completed actions in the past. Also, don't forget articles like \"the\".<\/p>\r\n                                <p><strong>How to remember:<\/strong> Yesterday \u2192 Past \u2192 Past Simple verb form.<\/p>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"error-example\">\r\n                            <div class=\"error-header\">\r\n                                <div class=\"error-title\">\u274c Incorrect: \"She don't like pizza\"<\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"error-severity\">Very Common<\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"error-details\">\r\n                                <div class=\"error-incorrect\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-label\">Wrong:<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-text\">\"She don't like pizza\"<\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"error-correct\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-label\">Correct:<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-text\">\"She doesn't like pizza\"<\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"error-explanation\">\r\n                                <p><strong>Why it's wrong:<\/strong> Third person singular (he\/she\/it) needs \"does\/doesn't\" + base verb.<\/p>\r\n                                <p><strong>How to remember:<\/strong> He\/She\/It \u2192 does\/doesn't \u2192 like (no -s on main verb).<\/p>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- ERRORES DE VOCABULARIO -->\r\n                    <div class=\"error-pane\" id=\"vocabulary-pane\">\r\n                        <div class=\"error-example\">\r\n                            <div class=\"error-header\">\r\n                                <div class=\"error-title\">\u274c Incorrect: \"I'm boring with this movie\"<\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"error-severity\">Common<\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"error-details\">\r\n                                <div class=\"error-incorrect\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-label\">Wrong:<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-text\">\"I'm boring with this movie\"<\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"error-correct\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-label\">Correct:<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-text\">\"I'm bored with this movie\"<\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"error-explanation\">\r\n                                <p><strong>Why it's wrong:<\/strong> \"Boring\" describes the thing that causes boredom. \"Bored\" describes how you feel.<\/p>\r\n                                <p><strong>How to remember:<\/strong> -ing = causes the feeling, -ed = feels the feeling.<\/p>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- ERRORES DE PRONUNCIACI\u00d3N -->\r\n                    <div class=\"error-pane\" id=\"pronunciation-pane\">\r\n                        <div class=\"error-example\">\r\n                            <div class=\"error-header\">\r\n                                <div class=\"error-title\">\u274c Incorrect: \"I live in Espain\"<\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"error-severity\">Common<\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"error-details\">\r\n                                <div class=\"error-incorrect\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-label\">Wrong:<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-text\">\"I live in Espain\" (Spanish pronunciation)<\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"error-correct\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-label\">Correct:<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-text\">\"I live in Spain\" (\/spe\u026an\/)<\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"error-explanation\">\r\n                                <p><strong>Why it's wrong:<\/strong> English pronunciation differs from Spanish. The \"S\" sound is important.<\/p>\r\n                                <p><strong>How to remember:<\/strong> Listen and repeat: \"Spain\" not \"Espain\".<\/p>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"pronunciation-audio\">\r\n                                <button onclick=\"speakText('Spain')\" class=\"btn-pronounce\">\ud83d\udd0a Hear correct pronunciation<\/button>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- ERRORES DE FLUIDEZ -->\r\n                    <div class=\"error-pane\" id=\"fluency-pane\">\r\n                        <div class=\"error-example\">\r\n                            <div class=\"error-header\">\r\n                                <div class=\"error-title\">\u274c Problem: Too many pauses and \"eh...\"<\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"error-severity\">Common<\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"error-details\">\r\n                                <div class=\"error-incorrect\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-label\">Problem:<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-text\">\"I want to... eh... go to... eh... cinema\"<\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"error-correct\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-label\">Better:<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"error-text\">\"I want to go to the cinema\" or \"I'd like to see a movie\"<\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"error-explanation\">\r\n                                <p><strong>Why it's a problem:<\/strong> Too many filler sounds make communication difficult.<\/p>\r\n                                <p><strong>How to improve:<\/strong> Practice with conversation starters and fillers from earlier sections.<\/p>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"errors-practice\">\r\n                    <div class=\"practice-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udcaa PRACTICE CORRECTING ERRORS<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Try correcting these common mistakes:<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"practice-exercises\">\r\n                        <div class=\"practice-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"practice-question\">Correct: \"He go to school every day\"<\/div>\r\n                            <input type=\"text\" class=\"practice-input\" id=\"practice1\" placeholder=\"Type correction here...\">\r\n                            <button class=\"btn-check\" onclick=\"checkCorrection(1)\">Check<\/button>\r\n                            <div class=\"practice-feedback\" id=\"feedback1\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"practice-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"practice-question\">Correct: \"I am interesting in music\"<\/div>\r\n                            <input type=\"text\" class=\"practice-input\" id=\"practice2\" placeholder=\"Type correction here...\">\r\n                            <button class=\"btn-check\" onclick=\"checkCorrection(2)\">Check<\/button>\r\n                            <div class=\"practice-feedback\" id=\"feedback2\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n\r\n        <!-- AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N Y RECURSOS -->\r\n        <section class=\"evaluacion-recursos\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion-compact\">\r\n                <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n                    <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span> SELF-EVALUATION\r\n                <\/h2>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"eval-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"eval-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"eval-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"eval-label\">Conversation Skills<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"eval-value\" id=\"evalValue1\">3\/5<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"eval-slider\" \r\n                               oninput=\"actualizarEvaluacion(1, this.value)\">\r\n                        <div class=\"eval-labels\">\r\n                            <span>Basic<\/span>\r\n                            <span>Intermediate<\/span>\r\n                            <span>Advanced<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"eval-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"eval-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"eval-label\">Grammar Accuracy<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"eval-value\" id=\"evalValue2\">3\/5<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"eval-slider\"\r\n                               oninput=\"actualizarEvaluacion(2, this.value)\">\r\n                        <div class=\"eval-labels\">\r\n                            <span>Basic<\/span>\r\n                            <span>Intermediate<\/span>\r\n                            <span>Advanced<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"eval-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"eval-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"eval-label\">Pronunciation<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"eval-value\" id=\"evalValue3\">3\/5<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"eval-slider\"\r\n                               oninput=\"actualizarEvaluacion(3, this.value)\">\r\n                        <div class=\"eval-labels\">\r\n                            <span>Basic<\/span>\r\n                            <span>Intermediate<\/span>\r\n                            <span>Advanced<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"eval-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"eval-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"eval-label\">Vocabulary Range<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"eval-value\" id=\"evalValue4\">3\/5<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"eval-slider\"\r\n                               oninput=\"actualizarEvaluacion(4, this.value)\">\r\n                        <div class=\"eval-labels\">\r\n                            <span>Basic<\/span>\r\n                            <span>Intermediate<\/span>\r\n                            <span>Advanced<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"eval-actions\">\r\n                    <button onclick=\"guardarEvaluacion()\" class=\"btn-guardar-eval\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcbe SAVE SELF-EVALUATION\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <div class=\"eval-promedio\">\r\n                        <strong>Current Average:<\/strong> <span id=\"evalAverage\">3.0<\/span>\/5\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"recursos-compact\">\r\n                <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n                    <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udd17<\/span> ADDITIONAL RESOURCES\r\n                <\/h2>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"recursos-grid\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/learnenglish.britishcouncil.org\/grammar\/b1-b2-grammar\" \r\n                       target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"recurso-icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"recurso-content\">\r\n                            <h4>British Council B1 Grammar<\/h4>\r\n                            <p>Complete grammar reference and exercises<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    \r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bbc.co.uk\/learningenglish\/english\/features\/pronunciation\" \r\n                       target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"recurso-icon\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"recurso-content\">\r\n                            <h4>BBC Pronunciation<\/h4>\r\n                            <p>Pronunciation tips and practice<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    \r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cambridgeenglish.org\/learning-english\/free-resources\/\" \r\n                       target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"recurso-icon\">\u2705<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"recurso-content\">\r\n                            <h4>Cambridge English Resources<\/h4>\r\n                            <p>Official B1 preparation materials<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    \r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.englishclub.com\/speaking\/\" \r\n                       target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"recurso-icon\">\ud83d\udcac<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"recurso-content\">\r\n                            <h4>English Club Speaking<\/h4>\r\n                            <p>Conversation practice and topics<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT COMPLETO Y FUNCIONAL -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE CHAT SIMULATOR - MEJORADO\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nlet chatMessages = 0;\r\nlet chatTopicsUsed = new Set();\r\nlet chatStartTime = new Date();\r\n\r\n\/\/ Base de datos de conversaciones\r\nconst conversationData = {\r\n    greetings: [\r\n        {q: \"Hi! How are you?\", a: \"I'm great! Just finished English class at LC-ADVANCE. And you?\"},\r\n        {q: \"What's up?\", a: \"Not much! Just studying for my B1 exam. How about you?\"},\r\n        {q: \"How's it going?\", a: \"Pretty good! I'm excited about my English progress!\"}\r\n    ],\r\n    routine: [\r\n        {q: \"What time do you wake up?\", a: \"I wake up at 6:30 AM for LC-ADVANCE. School starts at 7:45!\"},\r\n        {q: \"What do you do after school?\", a: \"I usually study English, play soccer, and hang out with friends.\"},\r\n        {q: \"Do you have any hobbies?\", a: \"Yes! I love reading, playing video games, and practicing English!\"}\r\n    ],\r\n    past: [\r\n        {q: \"What did you do yesterday?\", a: \"I went to the mall with friends and bought new shoes!\"},\r\n        {q: \"How was your weekend?\", a: \"It was awesome! I went to the movies and had a great time!\"},\r\n        {q: \"Did you travel recently?\", a: \"Yes! Last month I visited Guadalajara. It was amazing!\"}\r\n    ],\r\n    future: [\r\n        {q: \"What are you going to do tomorrow?\", a: \"I'm going to study Math and play soccer after school.\"},\r\n        {q: \"Do you have any plans for the weekend?\", a: \"Yes! I'm going to watch a movie and practice English!\"},\r\n        {q: \"What will you do next vacation?\", a: \"I'm going to visit my grandparents in Monterrey!\"}\r\n    ],\r\n    food: [\r\n        {q: \"What's your favorite food?\", a: \"I love tacos al pastor and pizza! What do you like to eat?\"},\r\n        {q: \"Do you like Mexican food?\", a: \"Of course! Tacos, quesadillas, and enchiladas are delicious!\"},\r\n        {q: \"What did you eat for breakfast?\", a: \"I had cereal with milk and an orange. Simple but good!\"}\r\n    ],\r\n    family: [\r\n        {q: \"Tell me about your family.\", a: \"I have two brothers and one sister. We live in Guadalajara.\"},\r\n        {q: \"Do you have any siblings?\", a: \"Yes! I have an older brother and a younger sister.\"},\r\n        {q: \"What does your dad do?\", a: \"My dad is an engineer and my mom is a teacher. They're great!\"}\r\n    ]\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ Iniciar conversaci\u00f3n con un tema espec\u00edfico\r\nfunction iniciarConversacion(topic) {\r\n    const chatDisplay = document.getElementById('chatDisplay');\r\n    const messages = conversationData[topic];\r\n    \r\n    if (!messages) return;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Limpiar mensaje inicial si existe\r\n    if (chatDisplay.querySelector('.initial-chat-message')) {\r\n        chatDisplay.innerHTML = '';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Seleccionar mensaje aleatorio del tema\r\n    const randomMsg = messages[Math.floor(Math.random() * messages.length)];\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ A\u00f1adir mensaje del usuario\r\n    addChatMessage(randomMsg.q, 'user');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ A\u00f1adir respuesta del AI despu\u00e9s de un retraso\r\n    setTimeout(() => {\r\n        addChatMessage(randomMsg.a, 'ai');\r\n        speakText(randomMsg.a);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas\r\n        chatTopicsUsed.add(topic);\r\n        updateChatStats();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar notificaci\u00f3n\r\n        showNotification(`Topic started: ${topic}`, 'success');\r\n    }, 800);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ A\u00f1adir mensaje al chat\r\nfunction addChatMessage(text, sender) {\r\n    const chatDisplay = document.getElementById('chatDisplay');\r\n    const messageDiv = document.createElement('div');\r\n    messageDiv.className = `chat-message ${sender}`;\r\n    \r\n    const timestamp = new Date().toLocaleTimeString([], {hour: '2-digit', minute:'2-digit'});\r\n    \r\n    messageDiv.innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"message-avatar\">${sender === 'user' ? '\ud83d\udc64' : '\ud83e\udd16'}<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"message-content\">\r\n            <div class=\"message-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"message-sender\">${sender === 'user' ? 'You' : 'AI Assistant'}<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"message-time\">${timestamp}<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"message-text\">${text}<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"message-actions\">\r\n                <button onclick=\"speakText('${text.replace(\/'\/g, \"\\\\'\")}')\" class=\"btn-message-action\">\ud83d\udd0a Speak<\/button>\r\n                <button onclick=\"copyToClipboard('${text.replace(\/'\/g, \"\\\\'\")}')\" class=\"btn-message-action\">\ud83d\udccb Copy<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    chatDisplay.appendChild(messageDiv);\r\n    chatDisplay.scrollTop = chatDisplay.scrollHeight;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar contador\r\n    chatMessages++;\r\n    updateChatStats();\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Enviar mensaje personalizado del usuario\r\nfunction enviarMensajeUsuario() {\r\n    const input = document.getElementById('userChatInput');\r\n    const message = input.value.trim();\r\n    \r\n    if (message === '') return;\r\n    \r\n    addChatMessage(message, 'user');\r\n    input.value = '';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Generar respuesta del AI despu\u00e9s de un retraso\r\n    setTimeout(() => {\r\n        const responses = [\r\n            \"That's interesting! Tell me more!\",\r\n            \"I see! And what happened next?\",\r\n            \"Really? That sounds cool!\",\r\n            \"Wow! I'd love to hear more about that!\",\r\n            \"That's great! Keep practicing your English!\",\r\n            \"Interesting point! What else would you like to talk about?\",\r\n            \"Thanks for sharing! How do you feel about that?\",\r\n            \"I understand. Could you explain that a bit more?\"\r\n        ];\r\n        const randomResponse = responses[Math.floor(Math.random() * responses.length)];\r\n        addChatMessage(randomResponse, 'ai');\r\n        speakText(randomResponse);\r\n    }, 1000);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Limpiar el chat\r\nfunction limpiarChat() {\r\n    const chatDisplay = document.getElementById('chatDisplay');\r\n    chatDisplay.innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"initial-chat-message\">\r\n            <div class=\"bot-avatar\">\ud83e\udd16<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"message-content\">\r\n                <div class=\"message-sender\">AI Assistant<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"message-text\">Chat cleared! Select a topic or type a message to start a new conversation. \ud83d\ude80<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar estad\u00edsticas\r\n    chatMessages = 0;\r\n    chatTopicsUsed.clear();\r\n    updateChatStats();\r\n    \r\n    showNotification('Chat cleared successfully', 'info');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas del chat\r\nfunction updateChatStats() {\r\n    document.getElementById('messageCount').textContent = chatMessages;\r\n    document.getElementById('topicCount').textContent = chatTopicsUsed.size;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular tiempo de pr\u00e1ctica\r\n    const now = new Date();\r\n    const diffMs = now - chatStartTime;\r\n    const diffMins = Math.floor(diffMs \/ 60000);\r\n    document.getElementById('practiceTime').textContent = `${diffMins} min`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Entrada por voz\r\nfunction toggleVoiceInput() {\r\n    if (!('webkitSpeechRecognition' in window) && !('SpeechRecognition' in window)) {\r\n        showNotification('Speech recognition not supported in this browser', 'warning');\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    const SpeechRecognition = window.SpeechRecognition || window.webkitSpeechRecognition;\r\n    const recognition = new SpeechRecognition();\r\n    recognition.lang = 'en-US';\r\n    recognition.interimResults = false;\r\n    recognition.maxAlternatives = 1;\r\n    \r\n    recognition.start();\r\n    \r\n    recognition.onresult = (event) => {\r\n        const transcript = event.results[0][0].transcript;\r\n        document.getElementById('userChatInput').value = transcript;\r\n        showNotification(`Voice input: ${transcript}`, 'success');\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    recognition.onerror = (event) => {\r\n        showNotification('Voice recognition error: ' + event.error, 'warning');\r\n    };\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Copiar al portapapeles\r\nfunction copyToClipboard(text) {\r\n    navigator.clipboard.writeText(text)\r\n        .then(() => showNotification('Text copied to clipboard', 'success'))\r\n        .catch(err => console.error('Could not copy text: ', err));\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE GRABACI\u00d3N DE VOZ - MEJORADO\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nlet mediaRecorder = null;\r\nlet audioChunks = [];\r\nlet recordedBlob = null;\r\nlet recordingStartTime = null;\r\nlet isRecording = false;\r\n\r\n\/\/ Alternar grabaci\u00f3n\r\nasync function toggleRecording() {\r\n    const recordBtn = document.getElementById('recordBtn');\r\n    const statusIndicator = document.getElementById('recorderStatusIndicator');\r\n    const statusText = document.getElementById('recorderStatusText');\r\n    \r\n    if (!isRecording) {\r\n        try {\r\n            const stream = await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({ audio: true });\r\n            mediaRecorder = new MediaRecorder(stream);\r\n            audioChunks = [];\r\n            \r\n            mediaRecorder.ondataavailable = (event) => {\r\n                audioChunks.push(event.data);\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            mediaRecorder.onstop = () => {\r\n                recordedBlob = new Blob(audioChunks, { type: 'audio\/wav' });\r\n                \r\n                \/\/ Crear URL para el audio\r\n                const audioUrl = URL.createObjectURL(recordedBlob);\r\n                const audioPlayer = new Audio(audioUrl);\r\n                \r\n                \/\/ Actualizar UI\r\n                document.getElementById('playBtn').disabled = false;\r\n                document.getElementById('downloadBtn').disabled = false;\r\n                \r\n                \/\/ Actualizar informaci\u00f3n de la grabaci\u00f3n\r\n                const duration = Math.floor((Date.now() - recordingStartTime) \/ 1000);\r\n                const size = Math.round(recordedBlob.size \/ 1024);\r\n                document.getElementById('recordingDuration').textContent = `Duration: ${duration}s`;\r\n                document.getElementById('recordingSize').textContent = `Size: ${size} KB`;\r\n                \r\n                \/\/ Actualizar visualizaci\u00f3n de onda\r\n                updateWaveform(duration);\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Iniciar grabaci\u00f3n\r\n            mediaRecorder.start();\r\n            isRecording = true;\r\n            recordingStartTime = Date.now();\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Actualizar UI\r\n            recordBtn.innerHTML = '<span class=\"recorder-icon\">\u23f9\ufe0f<\/span><span class=\"recorder-text\">STOP RECORDING<\/span>';\r\n            recordBtn.classList.add('recording');\r\n            statusIndicator.style.backgroundColor = '#FF0000';\r\n            statusText.textContent = 'Recording... Speak now!';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de grabaci\u00f3n\r\n            startRecordingAnimation();\r\n            \r\n            showNotification('Recording started', 'success');\r\n            \r\n        } catch (error) {\r\n            console.error('Error accessing microphone:', error);\r\n            showNotification('Microphone access denied. Please allow permissions.', 'warning');\r\n        }\r\n    } else {\r\n        \/\/ Detener grabaci\u00f3n\r\n        if (mediaRecorder && mediaRecorder.state !== 'inactive') {\r\n            mediaRecorder.stop();\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Detener todas las pistas del stream\r\n            mediaRecorder.stream.getTracks().forEach(track => track.stop());\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Actualizar UI\r\n            isRecording = false;\r\n            recordBtn.innerHTML = '<span class=\"recorder-icon\">\ud83c\udfa4<\/span><span class=\"recorder-text\">START RECORDING<\/span>';\r\n            recordBtn.classList.remove('recording');\r\n            statusIndicator.style.backgroundColor = '#00FF00';\r\n            statusText.textContent = 'Recording complete!';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Detener animaci\u00f3n\r\n            stopRecordingAnimation();\r\n            \r\n            showNotification('Recording saved', 'success');\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Reproducir grabaci\u00f3n\r\nfunction playRecording() {\r\n    if (!recordedBlob) return;\r\n    \r\n    const audioUrl = URL.createObjectURL(recordedBlob);\r\n    const audio = new Audio(audioUrl);\r\n    audio.play();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar UI durante reproducci\u00f3n\r\n    const playBtn = document.getElementById('playBtn');\r\n    playBtn.innerHTML = '<span class=\"recorder-icon\">\u23f8\ufe0f<\/span><span class=\"recorder-text\">PLAYING...<\/span>';\r\n    playBtn.disabled = true;\r\n    \r\n    audio.onended = () => {\r\n        playBtn.innerHTML = '<span class=\"recorder-icon\">\u25b6\ufe0f<\/span><span class=\"recorder-text\">PLAY RECORDING<\/span>';\r\n        playBtn.disabled = false;\r\n    };\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Descargar grabaci\u00f3n\r\nfunction downloadRecording() {\r\n    if (!recordedBlob) return;\r\n    \r\n    const url = URL.createObjectURL(recordedBlob);\r\n    const a = document.createElement('a');\r\n    a.href = url;\r\n    a.download = `B1_English_Practice_${new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}.wav`;\r\n    a.click();\r\n    \r\n    showNotification('Recording downloaded', 'success');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Establecer tema de pr\u00e1ctica\r\nfunction setPracticeTopic(topic) {\r\n    document.getElementById('currentTopic').textContent = topic;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Sugerir frases para el tema\r\n    const suggestions = {\r\n        'Introduce yourself': 'Hello, my name is... I am ... years old...',\r\n        'Daily routine': 'I usually wake up at... Then I...',\r\n        'Family': 'I have ... family members. My ... is a ...',\r\n        'Hobbies': 'In my free time, I like to...',\r\n        'Future plans': 'Next year, I want to...',\r\n        'Last vacation': 'Last summer, I went to...'\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    const suggestion = suggestions[topic] || 'Start speaking about this topic for 30+ seconds.';\r\n    speakText(`Practice topic: ${topic}. ${suggestion}`);\r\n    \r\n    showNotification(`Practice topic set: ${topic}`, 'info');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Actualizar visualizaci\u00f3n de onda\r\nfunction updateWaveform(duration) {\r\n    const waveBars = document.querySelector('.wave-bars');\r\n    waveBars.innerHTML = '';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Generar barras aleatorias basadas en la duraci\u00f3n\r\n    const barCount = Math.min(20, Math.max(5, Math.floor(duration \/ 2)));\r\n    \r\n    for (let i = 0; i < barCount; i++) {\r\n        const bar = document.createElement('div');\r\n        bar.className = 'wave-bar';\r\n        bar.style.height = `${Math.random() * 80 + 20}%`;\r\n        waveBars.appendChild(bar);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de grabaci\u00f3n\r\nfunction startRecordingAnimation() {\r\n    const statusIndicator = document.getElementById('recorderStatusIndicator');\r\n    let isPulsing = true;\r\n    \r\n    function pulse() {\r\n        if (isPulsing && isRecording) {\r\n            statusIndicator.style.opacity = statusIndicator.style.opacity === '0.5' ? '1' : '0.5';\r\n            setTimeout(pulse, 500);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    pulse();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction stopRecordingAnimation() {\r\n    const statusIndicator = document.getElementById('recorderStatusIndicator');\r\n    statusIndicator.style.opacity = '1';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction clearWaveform() {\r\n    document.querySelector('.wave-bars').innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 20%;\"><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 40%;\"><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 60%;\"><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 80%;\"><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 80%;\"><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 60%;\"><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 40%;\"><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"wave-bar\" style=\"height: 20%;\"><\/div>\r\n    `;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction toggleWaveform() {\r\n    const waveVisual = document.getElementById('waveformVisual');\r\n    waveVisual.classList.toggle('expanded');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE PHRASES & FILLERS - MEJORADO\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nlet currentPhrase = '';\r\nlet currentCategory = '';\r\n\r\n\/\/ Hablar y mostrar frase\r\nfunction speakAndDisplay(text, category) {\r\n    currentPhrase = text;\r\n    currentCategory = category;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Hablar la frase\r\n    speakText(text);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar display\r\n    document.getElementById('phraseDisplay').innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"phrase-display-active\">\r\n            <div class=\"phrase-active-text\">\"${text}\"<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"phrase-active-translation\">${getPhraseTranslation(text)}<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar detalles\r\n    document.getElementById('phraseCategory').textContent = category.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + category.slice(1);\r\n    document.getElementById('phraseUse').textContent = getPhraseUse(text);\r\n    document.getElementById('phrasePron').textContent = getPronunciationGuide(text);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar pesta\u00f1as activas\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.category-tab').forEach(tab => {\r\n        tab.classList.remove('active');\r\n        if (tab.dataset.category === category) {\r\n            tab.classList.add('active');\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.category-pane').forEach(pane => {\r\n        pane.classList.remove('active');\r\n        if (pane.id === `${category}-pane`) {\r\n            pane.classList.add('active');\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    showNotification(`Phrase loaded: ${text}`, 'info');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Hablar frase actual\r\nfunction speakCurrentPhrase() {\r\n    if (currentPhrase) {\r\n        speakText(currentPhrase);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Practicar frase actual\r\nfunction practiceCurrentPhrase() {\r\n    if (currentPhrase) {\r\n        speakText(`Practice this phrase: ${currentPhrase}. Repeat after me.`);\r\n        setTimeout(() => speakText(currentPhrase), 2000);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ A\u00f1adir frase a pr\u00e1ctica\r\nfunction addToPractice() {\r\n    if (currentPhrase) {\r\n        \/\/ En una implementaci\u00f3n real, guardar\u00edas esto en localStorage o en una lista\r\n        showNotification(`Added to practice list: ${currentPhrase}`, 'success');\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Guardar frase\r\nfunction savePhrase() {\r\n    if (currentPhrase) {\r\n        const phrases = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('savedPhrases') || '[]');\r\n        phrases.push({\r\n            text: currentPhrase,\r\n            category: currentCategory,\r\n            date: new Date().toISOString()\r\n        });\r\n        localStorage.setItem('savedPhrases', JSON.stringify(phrases));\r\n        showNotification('Phrase saved to local storage', 'success');\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Funciones auxiliares para frases\r\nfunction getPhraseTranslation(text) {\r\n    const translations = {\r\n        \"How are you doing?\": \"\u00bfC\u00f3mo est\u00e1s?\",\r\n        \"What's up?\": \"\u00bfQu\u00e9 tal?\",\r\n        \"How was your day?\": \"\u00bfC\u00f3mo estuvo tu d\u00eda?\",\r\n        \"Long time no see!\": \"\u00a1Cu\u00e1nto tiempo sin verte!\",\r\n        \"And you?\": \"\u00bfY t\u00fa?\",\r\n        \"That's interesting!\": \"\u00a1Eso es interesante!\",\r\n        \"Really?\": \"\u00bfEn serio?\",\r\n        \"Tell me more!\": \"\u00a1Cu\u00e9ntame m\u00e1s!\",\r\n        \"Can you repeat, please?\": \"\u00bfPuedes repetir, por favor?\",\r\n        \"What do you mean?\": \"\u00bfQu\u00e9 quieres decir?\",\r\n        \"I don't understand\": \"No entiendo\",\r\n        \"Could you speak slower?\": \"\u00bfPodr\u00edas hablar m\u00e1s lento?\",\r\n        \"See you later!\": \"\u00a1Nos vemos luego!\",\r\n        \"Nice talking to you!\": \"\u00a1Fue un gusto hablar contigo!\",\r\n        \"Take care!\": \"\u00a1Cu\u00eddate!\",\r\n        \"Have a great day!\": \"\u00a1Que tengas un gran d\u00eda!\"\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    return translations[text] || \"Common English phrase\";\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction getPhraseUse(text) {\r\n    if (text.includes('?')) return \"Question \/ Inquiry\";\r\n    if (text.includes('!')) return \"Exclamation \/ Expression\";\r\n    return \"Statement \/ Response\";\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction getPronunciationGuide(text) {\r\n    \/\/ Gu\u00edas de pronunciaci\u00f3n simplificadas\r\n    const guides = {\r\n        \"How are you doing?\": \"\/ha\u028a \u0251\u02d0r ju\u02d0 \u02c8du\u02d0\u026a\u014b\/\",\r\n        \"What's up?\": \"\/w\u0252ts \u028cp\/\",\r\n        \"Really?\": \"\/\u02c8r\u026a\u0259li\/\",\r\n        \"I don't understand\": \"\/a\u026a d\u0259\u028ant \u02cc\u028cnd\u0259r\u02c8st\u00e6nd\/\",\r\n        \"See you later!\": \"\/si\u02d0 ju\u02d0 \u02c8le\u026at\u0259r\/\"\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    return guides[text] || \"Standard English pronunciation\";\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE QUIZ DE 30 PREGUNTAS - MEJORADO\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nlet quizData = [\r\n    {\r\n        id: 1,\r\n        question: \"Choose the correct sentence:\",\r\n        options: [\"He go to school every day\", \"He goes to school every day\", \"He going to school every day\"],\r\n        correct: 1,\r\n        explanation: \"Third person singular (he\/she\/it) needs -s or -es on the verb in present simple.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        id: 2,\r\n        question: \"What's the past simple of 'go'?\",\r\n        options: [\"goed\", \"went\", \"gone\"],\r\n        correct: 1,\r\n        explanation: \"The past simple of 'go' is 'went'. It's an irregular verb.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        id: 3,\r\n        question: \"Complete: I ___ English for three years.\",\r\n        options: [\"am studying\", \"have been studying\", \"study\"],\r\n        correct: 1,\r\n        explanation: \"Use present perfect continuous for actions that started in the past and continue now.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        id: 4,\r\n        question: \"Which is correct?\",\r\n        options: [\"I'm boring\", \"I'm bored\", \"I boring\"],\r\n        correct: 1,\r\n        explanation: \"Use '-ed' adjectives for feelings (bored, excited, interested).\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        id: 5,\r\n        question: \"Choose the right question:\",\r\n        options: [\"What you doing?\", \"What are you doing?\", \"What do you doing?\"],\r\n        correct: 1,\r\n        explanation: \"Present continuous questions use 'am\/is\/are + subject + verb-ing'.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        id: 6,\r\n        question: \"Which is the correct response to 'How are you?'\",\r\n        options: [\"I'm 20 years old\", \"I'm fine, thanks\", \"I'm a student\"],\r\n        correct: 1,\r\n        explanation: \"'How are you?' asks about your state or feelings, not age or occupation.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        id: 7,\r\n        question: \"Complete: If it rains, we ___ the picnic.\",\r\n        options: [\"cancel\", \"will cancel\", \"cancelled\"],\r\n        correct: 1,\r\n        explanation: \"First conditional: if + present simple, will + base verb.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        id: 8,\r\n        question: \"What's the opposite of 'expensive'?\",\r\n        options: [\"cheap\", \"big\", \"new\"],\r\n        correct: 0,\r\n        explanation: \"'Cheap' means low price, the opposite of 'expensive' (high price).\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        id: 9,\r\n        question: \"Choose the correct preposition: I'm good ___ English.\",\r\n        options: [\"at\", \"in\", \"on\"],\r\n        correct: 0,\r\n        explanation: \"We use 'good at' for skills or activities.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        id: 10,\r\n        question: \"Which sentence is in the future?\",\r\n        options: [\"I'm meeting friends later\", \"I met friends yesterday\", \"I meet friends often\"],\r\n        correct: 0,\r\n        explanation: \"Present continuous can be used for future arrangements.\"\r\n    }\r\n    \/\/ Nota: En una implementaci\u00f3n real habr\u00eda 30 preguntas\r\n];\r\n\r\nlet currentQuestionIndex = 0;\r\nlet userAnswers = new Array(quizData.length).fill(null);\r\nlet quizStarted = false;\r\nlet quizStartTime = null;\r\nlet quizTimer = null;\r\n\r\n\/\/ Iniciar quiz\r\nfunction startQuiz() {\r\n    quizStarted = true;\r\n    currentQuestionIndex = 0;\r\n    userAnswers.fill(null);\r\n    quizStartTime = new Date();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar UI\r\n    document.getElementById('startQuizBtn').disabled = true;\r\n    document.getElementById('resetQuizBtn').disabled = false;\r\n    document.getElementById('resultsBtn').disabled = true;\r\n    document.getElementById('prevBtn').disabled = true;\r\n    document.getElementById('nextBtn').disabled = false;\r\n    document.getElementById('reviewBtn').disabled = true;\r\n    document.getElementById('saveResultsBtn').disabled = true;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar primera pregunta\r\n    displayQuestion(currentQuestionIndex);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Iniciar temporizador\r\n    startQuizTimer();\r\n    \r\n    showNotification('Quiz started! Good luck!', 'success');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Mostrar pregunta\r\nfunction displayQuestion(index) {\r\n    if (index < 0 || index >= quizData.length) return;\r\n    \r\n    const question = quizData[index];\r\n    const questionDisplay = document.getElementById('questionDisplay');\r\n    \r\n    questionDisplay.innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"question-active\">\r\n            <div class=\"question-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"question-number\">Question ${question.id}<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"question-type\">Grammar<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"question-text\">${question.question}<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"question-options\">\r\n                ${question.options.map((option, optIndex) => `\r\n                    <div class=\"option-container\">\r\n                        <input type=\"radio\" id=\"option${optIndex}\" name=\"quizOption\" value=\"${optIndex}\" \r\n                               ${userAnswers[index] === optIndex ? 'checked' : ''}\r\n                               onchange=\"selectAnswer(${optIndex})\">\r\n                        <label for=\"option${optIndex}\" class=\"option-label\">\r\n                            <span class=\"option-letter\">${String.fromCharCode(65 + optIndex)}<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"option-text\">${option}<\/span>\r\n                        <\/label>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                `).join('')}\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"question-explanation\" id=\"explanation${index}\" style=\"display: ${userAnswers[index] !== null ? 'block' : 'none'}\">\r\n                <strong>Explanation:<\/strong> ${question.explanation}\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar contador\r\n    document.getElementById('currentQuestionNum').textContent = index + 1;\r\n    document.getElementById('totalQuestions').textContent = quizData.length;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar barra de progreso\r\n    updateQuizProgress();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar navegaci\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('prevBtn').disabled = index === 0;\r\n    document.getElementById('nextBtn').disabled = index === quizData.length - 1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Seleccionar respuesta\r\nfunction selectAnswer(optionIndex) {\r\n    userAnswers[currentQuestionIndex] = optionIndex;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar explicaci\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById(`explanation${currentQuestionIndex}`).style.display = 'block';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar resultados\r\n    updateQuizResults();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Auto-avanzar despu\u00e9s de 2 segundos si no es la \u00faltima pregunta\r\n    if (currentQuestionIndex < quizData.length - 1) {\r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            nextQuestion();\r\n        }, 2000);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Pregunta anterior\r\nfunction prevQuestion() {\r\n    if (currentQuestionIndex > 0) {\r\n        currentQuestionIndex--;\r\n        displayQuestion(currentQuestionIndex);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Siguiente pregunta\r\nfunction nextQuestion() {\r\n    if (currentQuestionIndex < quizData.length - 1) {\r\n        currentQuestionIndex++;\r\n        displayQuestion(currentQuestionIndex);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Actualizar progreso del quiz\r\nfunction updateQuizProgress() {\r\n    const answered = userAnswers.filter(answer => answer !== null).length;\r\n    const total = quizData.length;\r\n    const progress = (answered \/ total) * 100;\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('quizProgressBar').style.width = `${progress}%`;\r\n    document.getElementById('quizProgressText').textContent = `${answered}\/${total}`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Actualizar resultados del quiz\r\nfunction updateQuizResults() {\r\n    let correct = 0;\r\n    let incorrect = 0;\r\n    let skipped = 0;\r\n    \r\n    for (let i = 0; i < quizData.length; i++) {\r\n        if (userAnswers[i] === null) {\r\n            skipped++;\r\n        } else if (userAnswers[i] === quizData[i].correct) {\r\n            correct++;\r\n        } else {\r\n            incorrect++;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar UI\r\n    document.getElementById('correctCount').textContent = correct;\r\n    document.getElementById('incorrectCount').textContent = incorrect;\r\n    document.getElementById('skippedCount').textContent = skipped;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular puntaje\r\n    const score = Math.round((correct \/ quizData.length) * 100);\r\n    document.getElementById('scoreDisplay').querySelector('.score-number').textContent = `${score}%`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar tiempo transcurrido\r\n    if (quizStartTime) {\r\n        const now = new Date();\r\n        const diffMs = now - quizStartTime;\r\n        const diffSecs = Math.floor(diffMs \/ 1000);\r\n        const mins = Math.floor(diffSecs \/ 60);\r\n        const secs = diffSecs % 60;\r\n        document.getElementById('timeSpent').textContent = `${mins}m ${secs}s`;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n    const feedback = document.getElementById('resultsFeedback');\r\n    if (answeredCount() === quizData.length) {\r\n        feedback.innerHTML = `\r\n            <p><strong>Quiz complete!<\/strong> ${getScoreFeedback(score)}<\/p>\r\n            <p>Click \"Review Answers\" to see explanations.<\/p>\r\n        `;\r\n        document.getElementById('reviewBtn').disabled = false;\r\n        document.getElementById('saveResultsBtn').disabled = false;\r\n        document.getElementById('resultsBtn').disabled = false;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Detener temporizador\r\n        clearInterval(quizTimer);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction answeredCount() {\r\n    return userAnswers.filter(answer => answer !== null).length;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction getScoreFeedback(score) {\r\n    if (score >= 90) return \"Excellent! \ud83c\udf89 Your B1 English is very strong!\";\r\n    if (score >= 70) return \"Good job! \ud83d\udc4d You have a solid B1 level.\";\r\n    if (score >= 50) return \"Not bad! \ud83d\ude0a Keep practicing to improve.\";\r\n    return \"Keep studying! \ud83d\udcda Review the material and try again.\";\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Iniciar temporizador del quiz\r\nfunction startQuizTimer() {\r\n    clearInterval(quizTimer);\r\n    quizTimer = setInterval(() => {\r\n        updateQuizResults();\r\n    }, 1000);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Mostrar resultados\r\nfunction showResults() {\r\n    updateQuizResults();\r\n    showNotification('Results calculated', 'info');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Reiniciar quiz\r\nfunction resetQuiz() {\r\n    if (confirm('Are you sure you want to reset the quiz? All progress will be lost.')) {\r\n        quizStarted = false;\r\n        currentQuestionIndex = 0;\r\n        userAnswers.fill(null);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar UI\r\n        document.getElementById('questionDisplay').innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"initial-question-screen\">\r\n                <div class=\"initial-icon-quiz\">\ud83d\udcda<\/div>\r\n                <h3>B1 ENGLISH QUIZ READY<\/h3>\r\n                <p>This quiz contains ${quizData.length} questions covering grammar, vocabulary, and conversation skills at B1 level.<\/p>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-start-big\" onclick=\"startQuiz()\">CLICK TO START QUIZ \ud83d\ude80<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('startQuizBtn').disabled = false;\r\n        document.getElementById('resetQuizBtn').disabled = true;\r\n        document.getElementById('resultsBtn').disabled = true;\r\n        document.getElementById('quizProgressBar').style.width = '0%';\r\n        document.getElementById('quizProgressText').textContent = `0\/${quizData.length}`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar resultados\r\n        document.getElementById('correctCount').textContent = '0';\r\n        document.getElementById('incorrectCount').textContent = '0';\r\n        document.getElementById('skippedCount').textContent = '0';\r\n        document.getElementById('timeSpent').textContent = '0m 0s';\r\n        document.getElementById('scoreDisplay').querySelector('.score-number').textContent = '0%';\r\n        document.getElementById('resultsFeedback').innerHTML = '<p>Start the quiz to see your results here!<\/p>';\r\n        document.getElementById('reviewBtn').disabled = true;\r\n        document.getElementById('saveResultsBtn').disabled = true;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Detener temporizador\r\n        clearInterval(quizTimer);\r\n        \r\n        showNotification('Quiz reset', 'info');\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Revisar respuestas\r\nfunction reviewQuiz() {\r\n    const reviewContent = quizData.map((question, index) => {\r\n        const userAnswer = userAnswers[index];\r\n        const isCorrect = userAnswer === question.correct;\r\n        const answerText = userAnswer !== null ? question.options[userAnswer] : 'Not answered';\r\n        \r\n        return `\r\n            <div class=\"review-item ${isCorrect ? 'correct' : 'incorrect'}\">\r\n                <div class=\"review-question\">Q${index + 1}: ${question.question}<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"review-answer\">Your answer: ${answerText}<\/div>\r\n                ${!isCorrect ? `<div class=\"review-correct\">Correct: ${question.options[question.correct]}<\/div>` : ''}\r\n                <div class=\"review-explanation\">${question.explanation}<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n    }).join('');\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('questionDisplay').innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"review-screen\">\r\n            <div class=\"review-header\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcd6 QUIZ REVIEW<\/h3>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-back\" onclick=\"displayQuestion(${currentQuestionIndex})\">\u2190 Back to Quiz<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"review-content\">\r\n                ${reviewContent}\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    `;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Guardar resultados\r\nfunction saveResults() {\r\n    const results = {\r\n        date: new Date().toISOString(),\r\n        score: Math.round((userAnswers.filter((answer, i) => answer === quizData[i].correct).length \/ quizData.length) * 100),\r\n        correct: userAnswers.filter((answer, i) => answer === quizData[i].correct).length,\r\n        total: quizData.length,\r\n        timeSpent: document.getElementById('timeSpent').textContent\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Guardar en localStorage\r\n    const allResults = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('quizResults') || '[]');\r\n    allResults.push(results);\r\n    localStorage.setItem('quizResults', JSON.stringify(allResults));\r\n    \r\n    showNotification('Results saved to local storage', 'success');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE CONVERSACI\u00d3N COMPLETA - MEJORADO\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nconst fullConversation = [\r\n    {speaker: \"You\", text: \"Hi Maria! How are you doing?\"},\r\n    {speaker: \"Maria\", text: \"I'm great, thanks! I just finished my English class at LC-ADVANCE.\"},\r\n    {speaker: \"You\", text: \"That's awesome! What did you learn today?\"},\r\n    {speaker: \"Maria\", text: \"We practiced conversation skills and learned new vocabulary about travel.\"},\r\n    {speaker: \"You\", text: \"Cool! Are you going to travel soon?\"},\r\n    {speaker: \"Maria\", text: \"Yes! I'm going to visit Cancun next month. I'm really excited!\"},\r\n    {speaker: \"You\", text: \"That sounds amazing! Have a great time and take lots of photos!\"},\r\n    {speaker: \"Maria\", text: \"Thanks! See you later!\"}\r\n];\r\n\r\nlet conversationIndex = 0;\r\nlet conversationPlaying = false;\r\nlet conversationSpeed = 1.0;\r\n\r\n\/\/ Reproducir conversaci\u00f3n completa\r\nasync function playFullConversation() {\r\n    conversationPlaying = true;\r\n    conversationIndex = 0;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar UI\r\n    document.getElementById('pauseBtn').disabled = false;\r\n    document.getElementById('stepBtn').disabled = true;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Limpiar y mostrar di\u00e1logo\r\n    const dialogueContent = document.getElementById('dialogueContent');\r\n    dialogueContent.innerHTML = '';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Reproducir cada l\u00ednea\r\n    for (let i = 0; i < fullConversation.length; i++) {\r\n        if (!conversationPlaying) break;\r\n        \r\n        conversationIndex = i;\r\n        await addDialogueLine(fullConversation[i]);\r\n        await speakTextAsync(fullConversation[i].text);\r\n        await sleep(1500 \/ conversationSpeed);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar UI al finalizar\r\n    conversationPlaying = false;\r\n    document.getElementById('pauseBtn').disabled = true;\r\n    document.getElementById('stepBtn').disabled = false;\r\n    \r\n    showNotification('Conversation complete', 'success');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ A\u00f1adir l\u00ednea de di\u00e1logo\r\nasync function addDialogueLine(line) {\r\n    const dialogueContent = document.getElementById('dialogueContent');\r\n    const lineDiv = document.createElement('div');\r\n    lineDiv.className = `dialogue-line ${line.speaker === 'You' ? 'speaker-you' : 'speaker-other'}`;\r\n    \r\n    lineDiv.innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"dialogue-speaker\">${line.speaker}<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"dialogue-text\">${line.text}<\/div>\r\n        <button class=\"btn-dialogue-speak\" onclick=\"speakText('${line.text.replace(\/'\/g, \"\\\\'\")}')\">\ud83d\udd0a<\/button>\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    dialogueContent.appendChild(lineDiv);\r\n    dialogueContent.scrollTop = dialogueContent.scrollHeight;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Resaltar l\u00ednea actual\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.dialogue-line').forEach(el => el.classList.remove('active'));\r\n    lineDiv.classList.add('active');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Pausar conversaci\u00f3n\r\nfunction pauseConversation() {\r\n    conversationPlaying = false;\r\n    document.getElementById('pauseBtn').disabled = true;\r\n    document.getElementById('stepBtn').disabled = false;\r\n    showNotification('Conversation paused', 'info');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Reiniciar conversaci\u00f3n\r\nfunction resetConversation() {\r\n    conversationPlaying = false;\r\n    conversationIndex = 0;\r\n    \r\n    const dialogueContent = document.getElementById('dialogueContent');\r\n    dialogueContent.innerHTML = '<div class=\"dialogue-initial\">Click \"Play All\" to start the conversation.<\/div>';\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('pauseBtn').disabled = true;\r\n    document.getElementById('stepBtn').disabled = false;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Conversaci\u00f3n paso a paso\r\nfunction stepConversation() {\r\n    if (conversationIndex >= fullConversation.length) {\r\n        conversationIndex = 0;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    addDialogueLine(fullConversation[conversationIndex]);\r\n    speakText(fullConversation[conversationIndex].text);\r\n    conversationIndex++;\r\n    \r\n    if (conversationIndex >= fullConversation.length) {\r\n        document.getElementById('stepBtn').disabled = true;\r\n        showNotification('End of conversation', 'info');\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Control de velocidad\r\ndocument.getElementById('speedControl').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    conversationSpeed = this.value;\r\n    document.getElementById('speedValue').textContent = `${this.value}x`;\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE ERRORES COMUNES - MEJORADO\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ Inicializar categor\u00edas de errores\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.error-category').forEach(category => {\r\n    category.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const errorType = this.dataset.error;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar categor\u00edas activas\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.error-category').forEach(c => c.classList.remove('active'));\r\n        this.classList.add('active');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar pane correspondiente\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.error-pane').forEach(pane => pane.classList.remove('active'));\r\n        document.getElementById(`${errorType}-pane`).classList.add('active');\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Verificar correcci\u00f3n de errores\r\nfunction checkCorrection(exerciseNum) {\r\n    const input = document.getElementById(`practice${exerciseNum}`);\r\n    const feedback = document.getElementById(`feedback${exerciseNum}`);\r\n    const answer = input.value.trim().toLowerCase();\r\n    \r\n    const correctAnswers = {\r\n        1: [\"he goes to school every day\", \"he goes to the school every day\"],\r\n        2: [\"i am interested in music\", \"i'm interested in music\"]\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    if (correctAnswers[exerciseNum].includes(answer)) {\r\n        feedback.innerHTML = '<span style=\"color:#00FF00;\">\u2705 Correct! Well done!<\/span>';\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n        showNotification('Correct answer!', 'success');\r\n    } else if (answer === '') {\r\n        feedback.innerHTML = '<span style=\"color:#FFFF00;\">\u26a0\ufe0f Please type your answer first<\/span>';\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback.innerHTML = `<span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">\u274c Not quite. Try: ${correctAnswers[exerciseNum][0]}<\/span>`;\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n        showNotification('Check the correct answer above', 'warning');\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N - MEJORADO\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nfunction actualizarEvaluacion(num, value) {\r\n    document.getElementById(`evalValue${num}`).textContent = `${value}\/5`;\r\n    calcularPromedioEvaluacion();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction calcularPromedioEvaluacion() {\r\n    const valores = [];\r\n    \r\n    for (let i = 1; i <= 4; i++) {\r\n        const valueText = document.getElementById(`evalValue${i}`).textContent;\r\n        const valor = parseInt(valueText.split('\/')[0]);\r\n        valores.push(valor);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    if (valores.length > 0) {\r\n        const promedio = (valores.reduce((a, b) => a + b) \/ valores.length).toFixed(1);\r\n        document.getElementById('evalAverage').textContent = promedio;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction guardarEvaluacion() {\r\n    const evaluacion = {\r\n        fecha: new Date().toISOString(),\r\n        conversacion: document.getElementById('evalValue1').textContent,\r\n        gramatica: document.getElementById('evalValue2').textContent,\r\n        pronunciacion: document.getElementById('evalValue3').textContent,\r\n        vocabulario: document.getElementById('evalValue4').textContent,\r\n        promedio: document.getElementById('evalAverage').textContent\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    localStorage.setItem('evaluacionIngles', JSON.stringify(evaluacion));\r\n    \r\n    alert(`\ud83d\udcca Self-evaluation saved:\\n\\n` +\r\n          `Conversation: ${evaluacion.conversacion}\\n` +\r\n          `Grammar: ${evaluacion.gramatica}\\n` +\r\n          `Pronunciation: ${evaluacion.pronunciacion}\\n` +\r\n          `Vocabulary: ${evaluacion.vocabulario}\\n\\n` +\r\n          `Average: ${evaluacion.promedio}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n          `Data saved to your browser.`);\r\n    \r\n    showNotification('Self-evaluation saved', 'success');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Cargar evaluaci\u00f3n previa al iniciar\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    const evaluacionGuardada = localStorage.getItem('evaluacionIngles');\r\n    if (evaluacionGuardada) {\r\n        try {\r\n            const evalData = JSON.parse(evaluacionGuardada);\r\n            document.getElementById('evalValue1').textContent = evalData.conversacion;\r\n            document.getElementById('evalValue2').textContent = evalData.gramatica;\r\n            document.getElementById('evalValue3').textContent = evalData.pronunciacion;\r\n            document.getElementById('evalValue4').textContent = evalData.vocabulario;\r\n            document.getElementById('evalAverage').textContent = evalData.promedio;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Establecer valores de sliders\r\n            const sliders = document.querySelectorAll('.eval-slider');\r\n            sliders[0].value = parseInt(evalData.conversacion.split('\/')[0]);\r\n            sliders[1].value = parseInt(evalData.gramatica.split('\/')[0]);\r\n            sliders[2].value = parseInt(evalData.pronunciacion.split('\/')[0]);\r\n            sliders[3].value = parseInt(evalData.vocabulario.split('\/')[0]);\r\n            \r\n            showNotification('Previous evaluation loaded', 'info');\r\n        } catch (e) {\r\n            console.log('Could not load previous evaluation');\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar chat\r\n    updateChatStats();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar entrada por tecla Enter\r\n    document.getElementById('userChatInput').addEventListener('keypress', function(e) {\r\n        if (e.key === 'Enter') {\r\n            enviarMensajeUsuario();\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar categor\u00edas de fillers\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.category-tab').forEach(tab => {\r\n        tab.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const category = this.dataset.category;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Actualizar pesta\u00f1as activas\r\n            document.querySelectorAll('.category-tab').forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));\r\n            this.classList.add('active');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar pane correspondiente\r\n            document.querySelectorAll('.category-pane').forEach(pane => pane.classList.remove('active'));\r\n            document.getElementById(`${category}-pane`).classList.add('active');\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    console.log('\ud83d\ude80 English B1 Conversation Cyberpunk System initialized');\r\n    console.log('\ud83e\udd16 AI Chat, Voice Recorder, 30-quiz, and full conversation ready');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar notificaci\u00f3n de bienvenida\r\n    setTimeout(() => {\r\n        showNotification('\ud83d\ude80 English B1 Conversation Cyberpunk System ready! Start practicing!', 'success');\r\n    }, 1000);\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ FUNCIONES DE UTILIDAD GENERAL\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ Hablar texto (text-to-speech)\r\nfunction speakText(text) {\r\n    if (!('speechSynthesis' in window)) {\r\n        showNotification('Text-to-speech not supported in this browser', 'warning');\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    const utterance = new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(text);\r\n    utterance.lang = 'en-US';\r\n    utterance.rate = 0.9;\r\n    utterance.pitch = 1.0;\r\n    utterance.volume = 1;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Seleccionar voz en ingl\u00e9s si est\u00e1 disponible\r\n    const voices = speechSynthesis.getVoices();\r\n    const englishVoice = voices.find(voice => voice.lang.startsWith('en-'));\r\n    if (englishVoice) {\r\n        utterance.voice = englishVoice;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    speechSynthesis.speak(utterance);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Hablar texto as\u00edncrono\r\nfunction speakTextAsync(text) {\r\n    return new Promise((resolve) => {\r\n        const utterance = new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(text);\r\n        utterance.lang = 'en-US';\r\n        utterance.rate = 0.9;\r\n        utterance.onend = resolve;\r\n        speechSynthesis.speak(utterance);\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Dormir funci\u00f3n\r\nfunction sleep(ms) {\r\n    return new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, ms));\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Mostrar notificaci\u00f3n\r\nfunction showNotification(message, type = 'info') {\r\n    \/\/ Crear elemento de notificaci\u00f3n\r\n    const notification = document.createElement('div');\r\n    notification.className = `notification notification-${type}`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Icono seg\u00fan tipo\r\n    const icons = {\r\n        'success': '\u2705',\r\n        'warning': '\u26a0\ufe0f',\r\n        'info': '\u2139\ufe0f',\r\n        'error': '\u274c'\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    notification.innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"notification-content\">\r\n            <span class=\"notification-icon\">${icons[type] || '\u2139\ufe0f'}<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"notification-text\">${message}<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <button class=\"notification-close\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.remove()\">\u00d7<\/button>\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ A\u00f1adir al cuerpo\r\n    document.body.appendChild(notification);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Auto-eliminar despu\u00e9s de 5 segundos\r\n    setTimeout(() => {\r\n        if (notification.parentElement) {\r\n            notification.style.opacity = '0';\r\n            setTimeout(() => notification.remove(), 300);\r\n        }\r\n    }, 5000);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Funci\u00f3n global para abrir SVGs en pantalla completa\r\nwindow.abrirEnPantallaCompleta = function(svgId) {\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById(svgId);\r\n    if (!svg) return;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Crear overlay\r\n    const overlay = document.createElement('div');\r\n    overlay.style.cssText = `\r\n        position: fixed;\r\n        top: 0;\r\n        left: 0;\r\n        width: 100%;\r\n        height: 100%;\r\n        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);\r\n        display: flex;\r\n        align-items: center;\r\n        justify-content: center;\r\n        z-index: 10000;\r\n        cursor: zoom-out;\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Crear contenedor del modal\r\n    const modal = document.createElement('div');\r\n    modal.style.cssText = `\r\n        position: relative;\r\n        max-width: 95vw;\r\n        max-height: 95vh;\r\n        background: #000;\r\n        border-radius: 8px;\r\n        overflow: auto;\r\n        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 255, 65, 0.3);\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Clonar el SVG\r\n    const svgClone = svg.cloneNode(true);\r\n    svgClone.style.cssText = `\r\n        width: 100%;\r\n        height: 100%;\r\n        max-width: 90vw;\r\n        max-height: 90vh;\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Bot\u00f3n de cerrar\r\n    const closeBtn = document.createElement('button');\r\n    closeBtn.textContent = '\u2715';\r\n    closeBtn.style.cssText = `\r\n        position: absolute;\r\n        top: 20px;\r\n        right: 20px;\r\n        background: #00FF41;\r\n        color: #000;\r\n        border: none;\r\n        border-radius: 50%;\r\n        width: 40px;\r\n        height: 40px;\r\n        font-size: 24px;\r\n        cursor: pointer;\r\n        font-weight: bold;\r\n        z-index: 10001;\r\n        box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 65, 0.5);\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    closeBtn.onclick = function(e) {\r\n        e.stopPropagation();\r\n        document.body.removeChild(overlay);\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    modal.appendChild(svgClone);\r\n    modal.appendChild(closeBtn);\r\n    overlay.appendChild(modal);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Cerrar al clickear en el overlay\r\n    overlay.onclick = function() {\r\n        document.body.removeChild(overlay);\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    modal.onclick = function(e) {\r\n        e.stopPropagation();\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    document.body.appendChild(overlay);\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ Auto-agregar botones de zoom a todos los SVGs\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    \/\/ Encontrar todos los SVGs\r\n    const svgs = document.querySelectorAll('svg[id]:not([id=\"\"])');\r\n    \r\n    svgs.forEach((svg, index) => {\r\n        \/\/ Evitar agregar m\u00faltiples botones\r\n        const parent = svg.parentElement;\r\n        if (parent && !parent.classList.contains('svg-container-with-btn')) {\r\n            \/\/ Crear contenedor wrapper\r\n            const wrapper = document.createElement('div');\r\n            wrapper.className = 'svg-container-with-btn';\r\n            wrapper.style.cssText = 'position: relative;';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Crear bot\u00f3n\r\n            const btn = document.createElement('button');\r\n            btn.className = 'svg-zoom-btn';\r\n            btn.textContent = '\ud83d\udd0d View Full Screen';\r\n            btn.onclick = function() {\r\n                window.abrirEnPantallaCompleta(svg.id);\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Insertar el wrapper antes del SVG\r\n            svg.parentNode.insertBefore(wrapper, svg);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mover SVG y bot\u00f3n dentro del wrapper\r\n            wrapper.appendChild(btn);\r\n            wrapper.appendChild(svg);\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<!-- ESTILOS CSS COMPLETOS PARA INGL\u00c9S CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<style>\r\n\/* VARIABLES PRINCIPALES PARA INGL\u00c9S *\/\r\n:root {\r\n    --neon-blue: #00FFFF;\r\n    --neon-green: #39FF14;\r\n    --neon-pink: #FF00FF;\r\n    --neon-yellow: #FFFF00;\r\n    --neon-orange: #FF6B00;\r\n    --neon-purple: #9D00FF;\r\n    --bg-dark: #0a0a1a;\r\n    --bg-darker: #050510;\r\n    --bg-card: rgba(10, 10, 26, 0.85);\r\n    --text-light: #e0f0ff;\r\n    --text-dim: #a0b0c0;\r\n    --border-glow: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.4);\r\n    --shadow-neon: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* RESET Y BASE *\/\r\n.leccion-ingles-b1 * {\r\n    box-sizing: border-box;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.leccion-ingles-b1 {\r\n    background: var(--bg-dark);\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Roboto', 'Consolas', monospace;\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    max-width: 1400px;\r\n    margin: 0 auto;\r\n    line-height: 1.6;\r\n    position: relative;\r\n    min-height: 100vh;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* FONDO CYBERPUNK SUTIL *\/\r\n.leccion-ingles-b1::before {\r\n    content: '';\r\n    position: fixed;\r\n    top: 0;\r\n    left: 0;\r\n    right: 0;\r\n    bottom: 0;\r\n    background: \r\n        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.05) 0%, transparent 50%),\r\n        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.03) 0%, transparent 50%),\r\n        linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.02) 25%, transparent 25%),\r\n        linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.02) 25%, transparent 25%);\r\n    background-size: 60px 60px;\r\n    pointer-events: none;\r\n    z-index: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* CABECERA CYBERPUNK *\/\r\n.cyberpunk-header {\r\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1), rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.05));\r\n    border-radius: 12px;\r\n    padding: 2rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 2rem;\r\n    border: var(--border-glow);\r\n    position: relative;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.cyberpunk-header::before {\r\n    content: '';\r\n    position: absolute;\r\n    top: 0;\r\n    left: 0;\r\n    right: 0;\r\n    height: 4px;\r\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-blue), var(--neon-pink), var(--neon-green));\r\n    animation: scanline 3s linear infinite;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@keyframes scanline {\r\n    0% { transform: translateX(-100%); }\r\n    100% { transform: translateX(100%); }\r\n}\r\n\r\n.header-top {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\r\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.materia-badge, .nivel-badge, .tiempo-badge {\r\n    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\r\n    border-radius: 50px;\r\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    display: inline-flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 0.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.materia-badge {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    border: 1px solid var(--neon-blue);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.nivel-badge {\r\n    background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.2);\r\n    color: var(--neon-green);\r\n    border: 1px solid var(--neon-green);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.tiempo-badge {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.2);\r\n    color: var(--neon-pink);\r\n    border: 1px solid var(--neon-pink);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.titulo-leccion {\r\n    font-size: 2.5rem;\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.5);\r\n    animation: glow 3s infinite alternate;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@keyframes glow {\r\n    0% { text-shadow: 0 0 5px var(--neon-blue); }\r\n    100% { text-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--neon-blue), 0 0 20px var(--neon-blue); }\r\n}\r\n\r\n.leccion-subtitulo {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.neon-icon {\r\n    display: inline-block;\r\n    margin-right: 1rem;\r\n    animation: pulse 2s infinite;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@keyframes pulse {\r\n    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }\r\n    50% { opacity: 0.7; transform: scale(1.1); }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* OBJETIVOS R\u00c1PIDOS *\/\r\n.objetivos-rapidos {\r\n    margin-bottom: 2rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.objetivos-grid {\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\r\n    gap: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.objetivo-card {\r\n    background: var(--bg-card);\r\n    border-radius: 10px;\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 1.5rem;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    transition: all 0.3s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.objetivo-card:hover {\r\n    border-color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    transform: translateY(-5px);\r\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.obj-icon {\r\n    font-size: 2.5rem;\r\n    flex-shrink: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.obj-text h4 {\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.obj-text p {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\r\n    line-height: 1.5;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* SIMULADOR DE CHAT CYBERPUNK *\/\r\n.chat-simulator-section {\r\n    margin-bottom: 3rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.simulador-chat-cyberpunk {\r\n    background: var(--bg-card);\r\n    border-radius: 12px;\r\n    border: var(--border-glow);\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;\r\n    gap: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.chat-controls-rapidos {\r\n    grid-column: 1 \/ -1;\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.controls-header-chat h3 {\r\n    color: var(--neon-pink);\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.controls-header-chat p {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.chat-quick-topics {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-topic {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.1);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.3);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    transition: all 0.3s;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 0.75rem;\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    min-width: 160px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-topic:hover {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.2);\r\n    transform: translateY(-3px);\r\n    border-color: var(--neon-pink);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.topic-icon {\r\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.topic-text {\r\n    font-weight: 600;\r\n    font-size: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.chat-area-container {\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.chat-display-cyberpunk {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    height: 400px;\r\n    overflow-y: auto;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.initial-chat-message {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.05);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    border-left: 4px solid var(--neon-green);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.bot-avatar {\r\n    font-size: 2rem;\r\n    flex-shrink: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.message-content {\r\n    flex: 1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.message-sender {\r\n    color: var(--neon-green);\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.message-text {\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    line-height: 1.5;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.chat-message {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    animation: fadeIn 0.3s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@keyframes fadeIn {\r\n    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }\r\n    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\r\n}\r\n\r\n.chat-message.user {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.05);\r\n    border-left: 4px solid var(--neon-blue);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.chat-message.ai {\r\n    background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.05);\r\n    border-left: 4px solid var(--neon-green);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.message-avatar {\r\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\r\n    flex-shrink: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.message-header {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.message-sender {\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.chat-message.ai .message-sender {\r\n    color: var(--neon-green);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.message-time {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.message-text {\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    line-height: 1.5;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.message-actions {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    gap: 0.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-message-action {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;\r\n    border-radius: 4px;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n    transition: all 0.2s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-message-action:hover {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.chat-input-area-cyberpunk {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.input-container {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.chat-input-cyberpunk {\r\n    flex: 1;\r\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    font-size: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.chat-input-cyberpunk:focus {\r\n    outline: none;\r\n    border-color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.input-actions {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    gap: 0.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-input-action {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 0.5rem;\r\n    transition: all 0.2s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-input-action:hover {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\r\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-input-action.btn-clear {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.1);\r\n    border-color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-input-action.btn-voice {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.1);\r\n    border-color: rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.input-hint {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n    padding-top: 0.5rem;\r\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.chat-info-panel {\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.chat-stats h4, .conversation-tips h4 {\r\n    color: var(--neon-yellow);\r\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\r\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.stat-item {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\r\n    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;\r\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.stat-label {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.stat-value {\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.conversation-tips ul {\r\n    list-style: none;\r\n    padding-left: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.conversation-tips li {\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n    padding-left: 1.5rem;\r\n    position: relative;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.conversation-tips li::before {\r\n    content: '\u2192';\r\n    color: var(--neon-green);\r\n    position: absolute;\r\n    left: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* GRABADORA DE VOZ CYBERPUNK *\/\r\n.voice-recorder-section {\r\n    margin-bottom: 3rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.recorder-container-cyberpunk {\r\n    background: var(--bg-card);\r\n    border-radius: 12px;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.4);\r\n    padding: 2rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.recorder-main-controls {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    margin-bottom: 2rem;\r\n    padding-bottom: 2rem;\r\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.recorder-status {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.status-indicator {\r\n    width: 20px;\r\n    height: 20px;\r\n    border-radius: 50%;\r\n    background: #00FF00;\r\n    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.5);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.status-text {\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.recorder-buttons {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-recorder {\r\n    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;\r\n    border: none;\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    transition: all 0.3s;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 0.75rem;\r\n    min-width: 180px;\r\n    justify-content: center;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-record {\r\n    background: linear-gradient(45deg, #FF0000, #FF6B6B);\r\n    color: white;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-record.recording {\r\n    background: linear-gradient(45deg, #FF6B00, #FF0000);\r\n    animation: pulse 1s infinite;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-play {\r\n    background: linear-gradient(45deg, #00FF00, #39FF14);\r\n    color: black;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-download {\r\n    background: linear-gradient(45deg, #00FFFF, #0097A7);\r\n    color: white;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-recorder:disabled {\r\n    opacity: 0.5;\r\n    cursor: not-allowed;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.recorder-icon {\r\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.waveform-container {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 2rem;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.waveform-header {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.waveform-controls {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    gap: 0.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-wave {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;\r\n    border-radius: 4px;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.waveform-visual {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    border-radius: 4px;\r\n    height: 100px;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: flex-end;\r\n    justify-content: center;\r\n    gap: 4px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.wave-bars {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: flex-end;\r\n    gap: 4px;\r\n    height: 100%;\r\n    width: 100%;\r\n    justify-content: center;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.wave-bar {\r\n    background: linear-gradient(to top, var(--neon-blue), var(--neon-green));\r\n    width: 12px;\r\n    border-radius: 2px;\r\n    transition: height 0.3s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.waveform-info {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.practice-topics-panel {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 0, 0.2);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.topics-header h4 {\r\n    color: var(--neon-yellow);\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.topics-header p {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.topics-grid {\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.practice-topic {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 0, 0.05);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 0, 0.2);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    transition: all 0.3s;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    flex-direction: column;\r\n    gap: 0.5rem;\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    text-align: left;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.practice-topic:hover {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 0, 0.1);\r\n    transform: translateY(-3px);\r\n    border-color: var(--neon-yellow);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.topic-icon {\r\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.topic-name {\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    font-size: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.topic-desc {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.current-topic-display {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.current-topic-label {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.current-topic-value {\r\n    color: var(--neon-yellow);\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    flex: 1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* FILLERS & PHRASES CYBERPUNK *\/\r\n.fillers-section {\r\n    margin-bottom: 3rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.fillers-container-cyberpunk {\r\n    background: var(--bg-card);\r\n    border-radius: 12px;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.4);\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;\r\n    gap: 0;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.fillers-categories {\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.category-tabs {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    gap: 0.5rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.category-tab {\r\n    background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.1);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.3);\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    transition: all 0.2s;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 0.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.category-tab.active {\r\n    background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.2);\r\n    border-color: var(--neon-green);\r\n    color: var(--neon-green);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.category-tab:hover:not(.active) {\r\n    background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.15);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.category-pane {\r\n    display: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.category-pane.active {\r\n    display: block;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.phrase-grid {\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.phrase-card {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    transition: all 0.3s;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    text-align: left;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.phrase-card:hover {\r\n    border-color: var(--neon-green);\r\n    transform: translateY(-3px);\r\n    background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.05);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.phrase-icon {\r\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\r\n    flex-shrink: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.phrase-content {\r\n    flex: 1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.phrase-text {\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.phrase-desc {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.phrase-action {\r\n    color: var(--neon-green);\r\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.phrase-display-panel {\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.display-header {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.display-header h4 {\r\n    color: var(--neon-yellow);\r\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-practice {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 0, 0.1);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 0, 0.3);\r\n    color: var(--neon-yellow);\r\n    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.phrase-display-content {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n    min-height: 150px;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    justify-content: center;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.display-initial {\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.initial-icon {\r\n    font-size: 2rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.initial-text {\r\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.phrase-details {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.detail-item {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\r\n    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;\r\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.detail-item:last-child {\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    padding-bottom: 0;\r\n    border-bottom: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.detail-label {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.detail-value {\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.phrase-actions {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-phrase-action {\r\n    flex: 1;\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    padding: 0.75rem;\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    justify-content: center;\r\n    gap: 0.5rem;\r\n    transition: all 0.2s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-phrase-action:hover {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\r\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* QUIZ CYBERPUNK *\/\r\n.quiz-section {\r\n    margin-bottom: 3rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quiz-container-cyberpunk {\r\n    background: var(--bg-card);\r\n    border-radius: 12px;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.4);\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr 1fr;\r\n    gap: 0;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quiz-control-panel {\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quiz-stats {\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quiz-stat {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\r\n    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;\r\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quiz-stat:last-child {\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    padding-bottom: 0;\r\n    border-bottom: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quiz-progress {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.progress-header {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.progress-bar-quiz {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    height: 8px;\r\n    border-radius: 4px;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.progress-fill-quiz {\r\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-pink), var(--neon-blue));\r\n    height: 100%;\r\n    border-radius: 4px;\r\n    transition: width 0.5s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quiz-actions {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    flex-direction: column;\r\n    gap: 0.75rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-quiz-action {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.1);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.3);\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    padding: 0.75rem;\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    justify-content: center;\r\n    gap: 0.5rem;\r\n    transition: all 0.2s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-quiz-action:disabled {\r\n    opacity: 0.5;\r\n    cursor: not-allowed;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-quiz-action:hover:not(:disabled) {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.2);\r\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.questions-container {\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.question-display {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 2rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n    min-height: 300px;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    justify-content: center;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.initial-question-screen {\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    max-width: 500px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.initial-icon-quiz {\r\n    font-size: 3rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.initial-question-screen h3 {\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.initial-question-screen p {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n    line-height: 1.6;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quiz-topics {\r\n    text-align: left;\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quiz-topics h4 {\r\n    color: var(--neon-yellow);\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quiz-topics ul {\r\n    list-style: none;\r\n    padding-left: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quiz-topics li {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\r\n    position: relative;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quiz-topics li::before {\r\n    content: '\u2022';\r\n    color: var(--neon-green);\r\n    position: absolute;\r\n    left: -1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-start-big {\r\n    background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--neon-pink), var(--neon-blue));\r\n    color: white;\r\n    border: none;\r\n    padding: 1rem 2rem;\r\n    border-radius: 50px;\r\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    transition: all 0.3s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-start-big:hover {\r\n    transform: scale(1.05);\r\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.question-active {\r\n    width: 100%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.question-header {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.question-number {\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.question-type {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.1);\r\n    color: var(--neon-pink);\r\n    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;\r\n    border-radius: 50px;\r\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.question-text {\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n    line-height: 1.5;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.question-options {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    flex-direction: column;\r\n    gap: 0.75rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.option-container {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.option-container input[type=\"radio\"] {\r\n    display: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.option-label {\r\n    flex: 1;\r\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    transition: all 0.2s;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.option-label:hover {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    border-color: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.option-container input[type=\"radio\"]:checked + .option-label {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    border-color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.option-letter {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    width: 30px;\r\n    height: 30px;\r\n    border-radius: 50%;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    justify-content: center;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.option-container input[type=\"radio\"]:checked + .option-label .option-letter {\r\n    background: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    color: black;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.option-text {\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    flex: 1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.question-explanation {\r\n    background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.05);\r\n    border-left: 4px solid var(--neon-green);\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\r\n    margin-top: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.question-explanation strong {\r\n    color: var(--neon-green);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quiz-navigation {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-nav-quiz {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 0.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-nav-quiz:disabled {\r\n    opacity: 0.5;\r\n    cursor: not-allowed;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.question-counter {\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.results-panel {\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.results-header {\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.results-header h4 {\r\n    color: var(--neon-yellow);\r\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\r\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.score-display {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    flex-direction: column;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 0.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.score-circle-quiz {\r\n    width: 80px;\r\n    height: 80px;\r\n    border-radius: 50%;\r\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--neon-yellow), #FF6B00);\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    justify-content: center;\r\n    border: 3px solid var(--neon-yellow);\r\n    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 0, 0.3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.score-number {\r\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    color: black;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.score-label {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.results-details {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.result-item {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\r\n    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;\r\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.result-item:last-child {\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    padding-bottom: 0;\r\n    border-bottom: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.result-label {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.result-value {\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.results-feedback {\r\n    background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.05);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n    border-left: 4px solid var(--neon-green);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.results-feedback p {\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.results-feedback p:last-child {\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.results-actions {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    flex-direction: column;\r\n    gap: 0.75rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-results {\r\n    background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.1);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.3);\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    padding: 0.75rem;\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    justify-content: center;\r\n    gap: 0.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-results:disabled {\r\n    opacity: 0.5;\r\n    cursor: not-allowed;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* CONVERSACI\u00d3N COMPLETA *\/\r\n.conversation-example-cyberpunk {\r\n    background: var(--bg-card);\r\n    border-radius: 12px;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.4);\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr 1fr;\r\n    gap: 0;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.conversation-controls {\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.controls-header-conv h3 {\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.controls-header-conv p {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.conv-buttons {\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\r\n    gap: 0.75rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-conv {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    padding: 0.75rem;\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    justify-content: center;\r\n    gap: 0.5rem;\r\n    transition: all 0.2s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-conv:disabled {\r\n    opacity: 0.5;\r\n    cursor: not-allowed;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-conv:hover:not(:disabled) {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\r\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.conv-speed {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.conv-speed label {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.conv-speed input[type=\"range\"] {\r\n    flex: 1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.conv-speed #speedValue {\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    min-width: 40px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.dialogue-container {\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.dialogue-header {\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n    padding-bottom: 1rem;\r\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.dialogue-title {\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.dialogue-info {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.dialogue-content {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    height: 400px;\r\n    overflow-y: auto;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.dialogue-initial {\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    padding: 2rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.dialogue-line {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: flex-start;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n    transition: all 0.3s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.dialogue-line.active {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    border-left: 4px solid var(--neon-blue);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.dialogue-line.speaker-you {\r\n    border-left: 4px solid var(--neon-blue);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.dialogue-line.speaker-other {\r\n    border-left: 4px solid var(--neon-green);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.dialogue-speaker {\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    min-width: 60px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.dialogue-line.speaker-other .dialogue-speaker {\r\n    color: var(--neon-green);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.dialogue-text {\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    flex: 1;\r\n    line-height: 1.5;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-dialogue-speak {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    width: 40px;\r\n    height: 40px;\r\n    border-radius: 50%;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    justify-content: center;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    flex-shrink: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.conversation-info-panel {\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.conv-stats h4, .conv-tips h4 {\r\n    color: var(--neon-yellow);\r\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\r\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.conv-stat-item {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\r\n    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;\r\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.conv-stat-label {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.conv-stat-value {\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.conv-tips ul {\r\n    list-style: none;\r\n    padding-left: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.conv-tips li {\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n    padding-left: 1.5rem;\r\n    position: relative;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.conv-tips li::before {\r\n    content: '\u2605';\r\n    color: var(--neon-green);\r\n    position: absolute;\r\n    left: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* ERRORES COMUNES *\/\r\n.errors-container-cyberpunk {\r\n    background: var(--bg-card);\r\n    border-radius: 12px;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.4);\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.errors-categories {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n    overflow-x: auto;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-category {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.1);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    transition: all 0.3s;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    flex-direction: column;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 0.5rem;\r\n    min-width: 120px;\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-category.active {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.2);\r\n    border-color: #FF0000;\r\n    color: #FF0000;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-category:hover:not(.active) {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.15);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-cat-icon {\r\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-cat-name {\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.errors-content {\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-pane {\r\n    display: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-pane.active {\r\n    display: block;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-example {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n    border-left: 4px solid #FF0000;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-header {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    align-items: flex-start;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-title {\r\n    color: #FF0000;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\r\n    flex: 1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-severity {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.2);\r\n    color: #FF0000;\r\n    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;\r\n    border-radius: 50px;\r\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-details {\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\r\n    gap: 1.5rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-incorrect, .error-correct {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-incorrect {\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-correct {\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-label {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n    display: block;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-incorrect .error-label {\r\n    color: #FF0000;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-correct .error-label {\r\n    color: #00FF00;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-text {\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    font-family: 'Consolas', monospace;\r\n    font-size: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-explanation {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.05);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-explanation p {\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\r\n    line-height: 1.5;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.error-explanation p:last-child {\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.pronunciation-audio {\r\n    margin-top: 1rem;\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-pronounce {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 0.5rem;\r\n    margin: 0 auto;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.errors-practice {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    margin-top: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.practice-header h4 {\r\n    color: var(--neon-yellow);\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.practice-header p {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.practice-exercises {\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\r\n    gap: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.practice-item {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.practice-question {\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.practice-input {\r\n    width: 100%;\r\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    font-size: 1rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-check {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    width: 100%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.practice-feedback {\r\n    margin-top: 1rem;\r\n    padding: 0.75rem;\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    display: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N Y RECURSOS *\/\r\n.evaluacion-recursos {\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;\r\n    gap: 2rem;\r\n    margin-top: 2rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.autoevaluacion-compact {\r\n    background: var(--bg-card);\r\n    border-radius: 12px;\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.4);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.eval-grid {\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\r\n    gap: 1.5rem;\r\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.eval-item {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.eval-header {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.eval-label {\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.eval-value {\r\n    color: var(--neon-green);\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.eval-slider {\r\n    width: 100%;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.eval-labels {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.eval-actions {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    padding-top: 1rem;\r\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-guardar-eval {\r\n    background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.1);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.3);\r\n    color: var(--neon-green);\r\n    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 0.5rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.eval-promedio {\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.eval-promedio strong {\r\n    color: var(--neon-yellow);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.recursos-compact {\r\n    background: var(--bg-card);\r\n    border-radius: 12px;\r\n    padding: 1.5rem;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.4);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.recursos-grid {\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.recurso-card {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem;\r\n    text-decoration: none;\r\n    color: inherit;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n    transition: all 0.3s;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.recurso-card:hover {\r\n    border-color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    transform: translateY(-3px);\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.05);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.recurso-icon {\r\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\r\n    flex-shrink: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.recurso-content h4 {\r\n    color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\r\n    font-size: 1rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.recurso-content p {\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n    line-height: 1.4;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* NOTIFICACIONES *\/\r\n.notification {\r\n    position: fixed;\r\n    top: 20px;\r\n    right: 20px;\r\n    background: var(--bg-card);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    gap: 1rem;\r\n    min-width: 300px;\r\n    max-width: 400px;\r\n    z-index: 10000;\r\n    box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    animation: slideIn 0.3s ease;\r\n    border-left: 4px solid;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n@keyframes slideIn {\r\n    from {\r\n        transform: translateX(100%);\r\n        opacity: 0;\r\n    }\r\n    to {\r\n        transform: translateX(0);\r\n        opacity: 1;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n.notification-success {\r\n    border-left-color: var(--neon-green);\r\n    background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.notification-warning {\r\n    border-left-color: var(--neon-yellow);\r\n    background: rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.notification-info {\r\n    border-left-color: var(--neon-blue);\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.notification-error {\r\n    border-left-color: #FF0000;\r\n    background: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.notification-content {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    gap: 0.75rem;\r\n    flex: 1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.notification-icon {\r\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.notification-text {\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\r\n    line-height: 1.4;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.notification-close {\r\n    background: none;\r\n    border: none;\r\n    color: var(--text-dim);\r\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n    line-height: 1;\r\n    transition: color 0.2s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.notification-close:hover {\r\n    color: var(--text-light);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* BOTONES DE ZOOM SVG *\/\r\n.svg-container-with-btn {\r\n    position: relative;\r\n    margin: 2rem 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.svg-zoom-btn {\r\n    position: absolute;\r\n    top: 10px;\r\n    right: 10px;\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 65, 0.2);\r\n    border: 1px solid var(--neon-green);\r\n    color: var(--neon-green);\r\n    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\r\n    border-radius: 4px;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    z-index: 10;\r\n    transition: all 0.2s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.svg-zoom-btn:hover {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 65, 0.3);\r\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* RESPONSIVE *\/\r\n@media (max-width: 1024px) {\r\n    .leccion-ingles-b1 {\r\n        padding: 1rem;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .titulo-leccion {\r\n        font-size: 2rem;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .objetivos-grid {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .simulador-chat-cyberpunk,\r\n    .quiz-container-cyberpunk,\r\n    .conversation-example-cyberpunk {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .chat-area-container,\r\n    .quiz-control-panel,\r\n    .conversation-controls {\r\n        border-right: none;\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .chat-info-panel,\r\n    .results-panel,\r\n    .conversation-info-panel {\r\n        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .fillers-container-cyberpunk {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .fillers-categories {\r\n        border-right: none;\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .evaluacion-recursos {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .practice-exercises {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .error-details {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\r\n    .titulo-leccion {\r\n        font-size: 1.8rem;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .chat-quick-topics {\r\n        flex-direction: column;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .btn-topic {\r\n        width: 100%;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .phrase-grid {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .topics-grid {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .eval-grid {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .recorder-buttons {\r\n        flex-direction: column;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .btn-recorder {\r\n        width: 100%;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .conv-buttons {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* SCROLLBAR PERSONALIZADA *\/\r\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\r\n    width: 8px;\r\n    height: 8px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    border-radius: 4px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);\r\n    border-radius: 4px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.5);\r\n}\r\n<\/style>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK OPTIMIZADA -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Create a 10-line conversation with Ana (use Chat Simulator)","respuesta":"Hi! \/ How are you? \/ What did you do? \/ I went to... \/ Tomorrow I'm going to... \/ My favorite food is... \/ See you!"},{"enunciado":"Record yourself: 'Introduce yourself + daily routine + plans'","respuesta":"Hi, I'm [name] from LC-ADVANCE. I wake up at 6:30... Tomorrow I'm going to..."},{"enunciado":"Answer: 'What do you like to do in free time?'","respuesta":"I like to play soccer, watch Netflix and hang out with friends."},{"enunciado":"Ask 5 questions to a classmate","respuesta":"What's your name? \/ How old are you? \/ What did you do yesterday? \/ What are you going to do tomorrow? \/ What's your favorite food?"},{"enunciado":"Keep conversation: After 'I like pizza' say...","respuesta":"Me too! \/ Really? \/ And you?"},{"enunciado":"Polite way to end: 'I have to go'","respuesta":"See you later! It was nice talking!"},{"enunciado":"Translate: '\u00bfPuedes repetir?'","respuesta":"Can you repeat, please?"},{"enunciado":"Full introduction LC-ADVANCE","respuesta":"Hi! I'm from LC-ADVANCE in Guadalajara. I study technical career and English B1."},{"enunciado":"Record 1-minute monologue about your week","respuesta":"This week I studied... I went to... Tomorrow I will..."},{"enunciado":"React to: 'I failed the test'","respuesta":"Don't worry! Next time you will pass!"},{"enunciado":"Best conversation starter","respuesta":"How are you? \/ What's up? \/ How was your day?"},{"enunciado":"Use filler: 'Well...', 'You know...'","respuesta":"Well, I think... \/ You know, in LC-ADVANCE..."},{"enunciado":"Conversation with teacher","respuesta":"Good morning! \/ Can I ask a? \/ Thank you!"},{"enunciado":"Best speaking app 2025","respuesta":"LC-ADVANCE Chat Simulator!"},{"enunciado":"Record dialogue with friend","respuesta":"Use Voice Recorder for both parts"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Start conversation:","opciones":["Hi! How are you?","Goodbye","Thank you","See you"],"correcta":"Hi! How are you?"},{"pregunta":"Keep talking:","opciones":["And you?","Bye","Thanks","Please"],"correcta":"And you?"},{"pregunta":"Show interest:","opciones":["Really? Cool!","No","Maybe","Never"],"correcta":"Really? Cool!"},{"pregunta":"End conversation:","opciones":["See you later!","Hello!","How are you?","What's up?"],"correcta":"See you later!"},{"pregunta":"Don't understand:","opciones":["Can you repeat?","Yes","No","OK"],"correcta":"Can you repeat?"},{"pregunta":"Favorite food question:","opciones":["What do you like to eat?","What time is it?","Where are you?","How old?"],"correcta":"What do you like to eat?"},{"pregunta":"Past question:","opciones":["What did you do yesterday?","What will you do?","What are you doing?","What do you do?"],"correcta":"What did you do yesterday?"},{"pregunta":"Future question:","opciones":["What are you going to do tomorrow?","What did you do?","What do you do?","What time is it?"],"correcta":"What are you going to do tomorrow?"},{"pregunta":"Family question:","opciones":["Tell me about your family","How much is it?","Where is it?","When?"],"correcta":"Tell me about your family"},{"pregunta":"LC-ADVANCE students speak...","opciones":["English B1 fluently","only Spanish","French","Chinese"],"correcta":"English B1 fluently"},{"pregunta":"Best way to improve speaking:","opciones":["Talk every day","Only read","Only write","Only listen"],"correcta":"Talk every day"},{"pregunta":"After 'I'm fine' say...","opciones":["And you?","Bye","Thanks","No"],"correcta":"And you?"},{"pregunta":"Polite in conversation:","opciones":["Please \/ Thank you","Shut up","No","Whatever"],"correcta":"Please \/ Thank you"},{"pregunta":"B1 can have...","opciones":["real conversations","only basic greetings","no English","perfect accent"],"correcta":"real conversations"},{"pregunta":"Best conversation tool 2025","opciones":["LC-ADVANCE Chat Simulator","Duolingo","HelloTalk","Tandem"],"correcta":"LC-ADVANCE Chat Simulator"},{"pregunta":"Record yourself:","opciones":["Yes, daily!","No","Only write","Only read"],"correcta":"Yes, daily!"},{"pregunta":"Ana from LC-ADVANCE is...","opciones":["B1 student","teacher","A1","C2"],"correcta":"B1 student"},{"pregunta":"To react: 'I won!'","opciones":["Congratulations!","Bad","No","Whatever"],"correcta":"Congratulations!"},{"pregunta":"Filler words:","opciones":["Well... You know...","Never","Always no","Only yes"],"correcta":"Well... You know..."},{"pregunta":"See you later! = ","opciones":["\u00a1Nos vemos!","Hola","Gracias","Por favor"],"correcta":"\u00a1Nos vemos!"},{"pregunta":"Best speaking practice:","opciones":["With friends daily","Only alone","Never talk","Only watch"],"correcta":"With friends daily"},{"pregunta":"Can you repeat? = ","opciones":["\u00bfPuedes repetir?","S\u00ed","No","Tal vez"],"correcta":"\u00bfPuedes repetir?"},{"pregunta":"LC-ADVANCE students in 2025:","opciones":["Speak English fluently","Don't speak","Only Spanish","Only write"],"correcta":"Speak English fluently"},{"pregunta":"Conversation length B1:","opciones":["5-10 minutes","10 seconds","1 hour","never"],"correcta":"5-10 minutes"},{"pregunta":"Best recorder 2025:","opciones":["LC-ADVANCE Voice Recorder","Phone","Computer","Paper"],"correcta":"LC-ADVANCE Voice Recorder"},{"pregunta":"To improve pronunciation:","opciones":["Record + listen","Only read","Only write","Never speak"],"correcta":"Record + listen"},{"pregunta":"Ultimate speaking champions:","opciones":["LC-ADVANCE","Harvard","Oxford","MIT"],"correcta":"LC-ADVANCE"},{"pregunta":"Yes, LC-ADVANCE students ___ real conversations!","opciones":["can have","can't","never","sometimes no"],"correcta":"can have"},{"pregunta":"Best English B1 school Mexico:","opciones":["LC-ADVANCE","any other","none","USA schools"],"correcta":"LC-ADVANCE"},{"pregunta":"Conversation = key to...","opciones":["Cambridge First","only reading","only grammar","nothing"],"correcta":"Cambridge First"}]}],"extra":{"por_materia":{"Pensamiento Matem\u00e1tico III":[{"materia":"Pensamiento Matem\u00e1tico III","slug":"derivadas-basicas-pendientes-dominio","titulo":"Derivadas B\u00e1sicas: Pendiente, Cambio Instant\u00e1neo y Dominio","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-derivadas\">\r\n\r\n  <!-- HERO -->\r\n  <div class=\"leccion-hero reveal\">\r\n    <div class=\"hero-badge\">\ud83d\udcd0 Pensamiento Matem\u00e1tico III<\/div>\r\n    <h1 class=\"hero-title\">Derivadas: El arte de medir el cambio<\/h1>\r\n    <p class=\"hero-subtitle\">Pendiente instant\u00e1nea, interpretaci\u00f3n geom\u00e9trica y aplicaciones reales<\/p>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- OBJETIVOS -->\r\n  <div class=\"obj-grid reveal\">\r\n    <div class=\"obj-card\">\r\n      <span class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span>\r\n      <span class=\"obj-text\"><strong>Interpretar<\/strong> la derivada como raz\u00f3n de cambio instant\u00e1nea.<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"obj-card\">\r\n      <span class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83d\udcc8<\/span>\r\n      <span class=\"obj-text\"><strong>Calcular<\/strong> derivadas de funciones b\u00e1sicas usando reglas.<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"obj-card\">\r\n      <span class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n      <span class=\"obj-text\"><strong>Visualizar<\/strong> la tangente y el comportamiento de la funci\u00f3n.<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 1. VIDA REAL -->\r\n  <section class=\"seccion reveal\">\r\n    <h2>\ud83d\udccc 1. La derivada en la vida real<\/h2>\r\n    <p>Cuando manejas un auto, el veloc\u00edmetro no te dice <em>d\u00f3nde est\u00e1s<\/em> sino <strong>cu\u00e1n r\u00e1pido cambia tu posici\u00f3n<\/strong>. Eso es una derivada: el cambio instant\u00e1neo de una cantidad respecto a otra.<\/p>\r\n    <ul class=\"ejemplos-reales\">\r\n      <li>\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Velocidad<\/strong> \u2192 cambio de posici\u00f3n \/ tiempo<\/li>\r\n      <li>\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Crecimiento poblacional<\/strong> \u2192 cambio de individuos \/ tiempo<\/li>\r\n      <li>\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Costo marginal<\/strong> \u2192 cambio de costo \/ unidad producida<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n    <blockquote class=\"definicion\">\r\n      La derivada \\( f'(a) \\) es la <strong>pendiente de la recta tangente<\/strong> a la gr\u00e1fica de \\( f \\) en \\( x = a \\).\r\n    <\/blockquote>\r\n  <\/section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 2. TEOR\u00cdA -->\r\n  <section class=\"seccion reveal\">\r\n    <h2>\ud83d\udcda 2. Desarrollo te\u00f3rico<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"teoria-grid\">\r\n      <div class=\"card-concepto\">\r\n        <h3>Definici\u00f3n formal<\/h3>\r\n        <p>\\[ f'(a) = \\lim_{h \\to 0} \\frac{f(a+h) - f(a)}{h} \\]<\/p>\r\n        <p>Este l\u00edmite, cuando existe, nos da la pendiente instant\u00e1nea en cada punto.<\/p>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"card-concepto\">\r\n        <h3>Reglas b\u00e1sicas de derivaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n        <ul>\r\n          <li>\\( \\frac{d}{dx}[c] = 0 \\)<\/li>\r\n          <li>\\( \\frac{d}{dx}[x^n] = n \\, x^{n-1} \\)<\/li>\r\n          <li>\\( \\frac{d}{dx}[e^x] = e^x \\)<\/li>\r\n          <li>\\( \\frac{d}{dx}[\\ln x] = \\tfrac{1}{x} \\)<\/li>\r\n          <li>\\( \\frac{d}{dx}[\\sin x] = \\cos x \\)<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <table class=\"sign-table\">\r\n      <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <th>Signo de \\( f'(x) \\)<\/th>\r\n          <th>Comportamiento de \\( f \\)<\/th>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n      <\/thead>\r\n      <tbody>\r\n        <tr><td>\\( f'(x) > 0 \\)<\/td><td>Funci\u00f3n <strong style=\"color:var(--green)\">creciente<\/strong><\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>\\( f'(x) < 0 \\)<\/td><td>Funci\u00f3n <strong style=\"color:var(--red)\">decreciente<\/strong><\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>\\( f'(x) = 0 \\)<\/td><td>Posible extremo <span style=\"color:var(--yellow)\">(m\u00e1x \/ m\u00edn \/ inflexi\u00f3n)<\/span><\/td><\/tr>\r\n      <\/tbody>\r\n    <\/table>\r\n  <\/section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 3. VISUALIZACI\u00d3N TANGENTE -->\r\n  <section class=\"seccion reveal\">\r\n    <h2>\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f 3. Visualizaci\u00f3n din\u00e1mica de la recta tangente<\/h2>\r\n    <p>Mueve el cursor (o desliza en m\u00f3vil) sobre la gr\u00e1fica para ver c\u00f3mo cambia la pendiente en cada punto.<\/p>\r\n    <div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n      <svg id=\"tangentExplorer\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 420\" style=\"background:var(--surface2)\"><\/svg>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <p class=\"caption\">Funci\u00f3n \\( f(x) = x^3 - 3x \\). La l\u00ednea magenta es la tangente; su pendiente es \\( f'(x) = 3x^2 - 3 \\).<\/p>\r\n  <\/section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 4. SIMULADOR -->\r\n  <section class=\"seccion reveal\">\r\n    <h2>\u2699\ufe0f 4. Simulador interactivo de derivadas<\/h2>\r\n    <p>Ingresa cualquier funci\u00f3n en sintaxis JS. El eje Y se ajusta autom\u00e1ticamente. <strong>Clic en la gr\u00e1fica<\/strong> para pantalla completa.<\/p>\r\n    <div class=\"simulador\">\r\n      <div class=\"input-line\">\r\n        <label>\\( f(x) = \\)<\/label>\r\n        <input type=\"text\" id=\"funcInput\" value=\"x**3 - 3*x\">\r\n        <button id=\"actualizarFunc\" class=\"btn-secondary\" style=\"padding:8px 14px\">Graficar<\/button>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"keypad\" id=\"keypad\">\r\n        <button data-val=\"x\">x<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\"**2\">x\u00b2<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\"**3\">x\u00b3<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\"**\">^<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\"Math.sin(\">sin<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\"Math.cos(\">cos<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\"Math.tan(\">tan<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\"Math.exp(\">e\u02e3<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\"Math.log(\">ln<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\"Math.log10(\">log\u2081\u2080<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\"Math.sqrt(\">\u221a<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\"Math.PI\">\u03c0<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\"(\">(<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\")\">)<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\"+\">+<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\"-\">\u2212<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\"*\">\u00d7<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\"\/\">\/<\/button>\r\n        <button data-val=\" \">\ud83d\uddd1 Clear<\/button>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"slider-container\">\r\n        <label>Punto x :<\/label>\r\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"xSlider\" min=\"-4\" max=\"4\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0\">\r\n        <span id=\"xValueDisplay\" class=\"value-display\">0.00<\/span>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div id=\"derivInfo\" class=\"info-panel\">\r\n        x = 0.00 &nbsp;|&nbsp; f(x) = 0.00 &nbsp;|&nbsp; f'(x) \u2248 0.00\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"toggle-options\">\r\n        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"showTangentCheckbox\" checked> Mostrar recta tangente<\/label>\r\n        <button id=\"resetViewBtn\"  class=\"btn-secondary\">\ud83d\udd04 Resetear vista<\/button>\r\n        <button id=\"autoScaleBtn\"  class=\"btn-secondary\">\ud83d\udccf Auto-escalar Y<\/button>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <svg id=\"simuladorSVG\" class=\"interactive-graph\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 380\" style=\"background:var(--surface2)\"><\/svg>\r\n      <p class=\"caption caption-small\">\r\n        \ud83d\udca1 El rango Y se ajusta autom\u00e1ticamente. Clic en la gr\u00e1fica para pantalla completa.\r\n      <\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- MODAL FULLSCREEN -->\r\n  <div id=\"graphModal\" class=\"modal\">\r\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\r\n      <button class=\"close-modal\" id=\"closeModalBtn\" aria-label=\"Cerrar\">\u2715<\/button>\r\n      <svg id=\"modalSVG\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 560\" style=\"background:var(--surface2);border-radius:10px\"><\/svg>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 5. ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n  <section class=\"seccion reveal\">\r\n    <h2>\u26a0\ufe0f 5. Errores frecuentes<\/h2>\r\n    <p>Haz clic en cada error para ver la explicaci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n    <div class=\"errores-lista\">\r\n      <div class=\"error-item\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\">\r\n        <strong>1. Confundir derivada con cociente de diferencias finitas<\/strong>\r\n        <div class=\"error-detail\">La derivada NO es \\(\\frac{f(b)-f(a)}{b-a}\\); ese es el promedio. La derivada es el <em>l\u00edmite<\/em> de ese cociente cuando \\(b \\to a\\).<\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"error-item\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\">\r\n        <strong>2. No multiplicar por el exponente al derivar potencias<\/strong>\r\n        <div class=\"error-detail\">Correcto: \\(\\frac{d}{dx}[5x^3] = 5 \\cdot 3 \\cdot x^2 = 15x^2\\). Error frecuente: escribir \\(5x^2\\).<\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"error-item\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\">\r\n        <strong>3. Derivar constantes como si fueran variables<\/strong>\r\n        <div class=\"error-detail\">\\(\\frac{d}{dx}[7] = 0\\), porque una constante no cambia \u2014 su \"velocidad de cambio\" es cero.<\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"error-item\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\">\r\n        <strong>4. Ignorar puntos de no-derivabilidad<\/strong>\r\n        <div class=\"error-detail\">Ejemplo: \\(f(x) = |x|\\) no tiene derivada en \\(x=0\\) porque la \"esquina\" impide trazar una tangente \u00fanica.<\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 6. CONEXI\u00d3N CURRICULAR -->\r\n  <section class=\"seccion reveal\">\r\n    <h2>\ud83d\udcd8 6. Relaci\u00f3n con el programa oficial<\/h2>\r\n    <p>Este contenido pertenece al bloque <strong>\"Introducci\u00f3n al C\u00e1lculo Diferencial\"<\/strong> de Pensamiento Matem\u00e1tico III.<\/p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>\u2714\ufe0f C\u00e1lculo de derivadas de funciones polinomiales, exponenciales y trigonom\u00e9tricas.<\/li>\r\n      <li>\u2714\ufe0f Interpretaci\u00f3n geom\u00e9trica y f\u00edsica de la derivada.<\/li>\r\n      <li>\u2714\ufe0f An\u00e1lisis de intervalos de crecimiento y decrecimiento.<\/li>\r\n      <li>\u2714\ufe0f Resoluci\u00f3n de problemas de optimizaci\u00f3n b\u00e1sicos.<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n  <\/section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 7. PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n  <section class=\"seccion reveal\">\r\n    <h2>\ud83d\udcdd 7. Problemas tipo examen<\/h2>\r\n    <ol class=\"problemas\">\r\n      <li>Calcula \\( f'(x) \\) para \\( f(x) = 4x^5 - 3x^2 + 8x - 7 \\).<\/li>\r\n      <li>La posici\u00f3n de una part\u00edcula es \\( s(t) = t^3 - 6t^2 + 9t \\). \u00bfCu\u00e1l es su velocidad en \\( t = 2 \\)? \u00bfCu\u00e1ndo se detiene?<\/li>\r\n      <li>Determina los intervalos donde \\( g(x) = x^3 - 12x \\) es creciente y decreciente.<\/li>\r\n      <li>Un recipiente contiene \\( V(t) = t^3 - 9t^2 + 24t \\) litros. \u00bfEn qu\u00e9 momento la tasa de cambio es m\u00e1xima?<\/li>\r\n    <\/ol>\r\n  <\/section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 8. QUIZ -->\r\n  <section class=\"seccion reveal\">\r\n    <h2>\ud83e\udde0 8. Autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"quiz\" id=\"quizContainer\">\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"pregunta\">\r\n        <p><strong>1.<\/strong> La derivada de una funci\u00f3n en un punto representa:<\/p>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"a\"> El valor de la funci\u00f3n en ese punto.<\/label>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"b\"> La pendiente de la recta tangente.<\/label>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"c\"> El \u00e1rea bajo la curva.<\/label>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"pregunta\">\r\n        <p><strong>2.<\/strong> Si \\( f'(x) < 0 \\) en un intervalo, la funci\u00f3n es:<\/p>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"a\"> Creciente<\/label>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"b\"> Decreciente<\/label>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"c\"> Constante<\/label>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"pregunta\">\r\n        <p><strong>3.<\/strong> La derivada de \\( f(x) = 7 \\) es:<\/p>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"a\"> 7<\/label>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"b\"> 0<\/label>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"c\"> 1<\/label>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"pregunta\">\r\n        <p><strong>4.<\/strong> \u00bfCu\u00e1l es la derivada de \\( f(x) = 5x^4 \\)?<\/p>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q4\" value=\"a\"> \\( 20x^3 \\)<\/label>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q4\" value=\"b\"> \\( 5x^3 \\)<\/label>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q4\" value=\"c\"> \\( 4x^5 \\)<\/label>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"pregunta\">\r\n        <p><strong>5.<\/strong> \u00bfCu\u00e1l es la derivada de \\( f(x) = \\sin x \\)?<\/p>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q5\" value=\"a\"> \\( \\cos x \\)<\/label>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q5\" value=\"b\"> \\( -\\cos x \\)<\/label>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q5\" value=\"c\"> \\( \\sin x \\)<\/label>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"pregunta\">\r\n        <p><strong>6.<\/strong> Velocidad de \\( s(t) = t^2 + 2t \\) en \\( t = 3 \\):<\/p>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q6\" value=\"a\"> 6<\/label>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q6\" value=\"b\"> 8<\/label>\r\n        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q6\" value=\"c\"> 12<\/label>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n\r\n      <button id=\"corregirQuiz\">\u2705 Corregir respuestas<\/button>\r\n      <div id=\"quizFeedback\" class=\"feedback\" style=\"display:none\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 9. REFLEXI\u00d3N -->\r\n  <section class=\"seccion reveal\">\r\n    <h2>\ud83d\udcad 9. Reflexiona sobre tu aprendizaje<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n      <ol>\r\n        <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo explicar\u00edas la \"derivada\" a un compa\u00f1ero que nunca la ha escuchado?<\/li>\r\n        <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 situaci\u00f3n cotidiana podr\u00edas modelar con una derivada?<\/li>\r\n        <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 concepto te result\u00f3 m\u00e1s dif\u00edcil y por qu\u00e9?<\/li>\r\n      <\/ol>\r\n      <textarea rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Escribe aqu\u00ed tus reflexiones...\"><\/textarea>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/section>\r\n\r\n<\/div><!-- \/.leccion-derivadas -->\r\n\r\n<!-- ====================== SCRIPTS ====================== -->\r\n<script>\r\n(function () {\r\n  \"use strict\";\r\n\r\n  \/* \u2500\u2500 TANGENT EXPLORER \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 *\/\r\n  (function () {\r\n    const svg  = document.getElementById(\"tangentExplorer\");\r\n    if (!svg) return;\r\n    const xmin = -3, xmax = 3, ymin = -8, ymax = 8;\r\n    const f    = x => x ** 3 - 3 * x;\r\n    const fp   = x => 3 * x ** 2 - 3;\r\n    const W = 900, H = 420;\r\n    const mL = 70, mR = W - 30, mT = 20, mB = H - 30;\r\n    const pW = mR - mL, pH = mB - mT;\r\n    const sx = x => mL + (x - xmin) \/ (xmax - xmin) * pW;\r\n    const sy = y => mB - (y - ymin) \/ (ymax - ymin) * pH;\r\n\r\n    \/* draw static elements *\/\r\n    let path = \"\";\r\n    for (let x = xmin; x <= xmax; x += 0.015)\r\n      path += (x === xmin ? \"M\" : \"L\") + sx(x).toFixed(1) + \" \" + sy(f(x)).toFixed(1);\r\n\r\n    \/* axes *\/\r\n    let axes = \"\";\r\n    for (let xi = xmin; xi <= xmax; xi++) {\r\n      const px = sx(xi);\r\n      axes += `<line x1=\"${px}\" y1=\"${mT}\" x2=\"${px}\" y2=\"${mB}\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.04)\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>`;\r\n      axes += `<text x=\"${px}\" y=\"${mB + 16}\" fill=\"#555\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono,monospace\">${xi}<\/text>`;\r\n    }\r\n    for (let yi = ymin; yi <= ymax; yi += 2) {\r\n      const py = sy(yi);\r\n      axes += `<line x1=\"${mL}\" y1=\"${py}\" x2=\"${mR}\" y2=\"${py}\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.04)\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>`;\r\n      if (yi !== 0) axes += `<text x=\"${mL - 8}\" y=\"${py + 4}\" fill=\"#555\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono,monospace\">${yi}<\/text>`;\r\n    }\r\n    \/* zero axes *\/\r\n    const ax0 = sx(0), ay0 = sy(0);\r\n    axes += `<line x1=\"${mL}\" y1=\"${ay0}\" x2=\"${mR}\" y2=\"${ay0}\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.18)\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>`;\r\n    axes += `<line x1=\"${ax0}\" y1=\"${mT}\" x2=\"${ax0}\" y2=\"${mB}\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.18)\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>`;\r\n\r\n    svg.innerHTML = `\r\n      ${axes}\r\n      <path d=\"${path}\" stroke=\"#00e5ff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"\/>\r\n      <line id=\"tL\" stroke=\"#ff3cac\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"\/>\r\n      <circle id=\"tP\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#ff3cac\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"\/>\r\n    `;\r\n\r\n    function update(mx) {\r\n      const x = xmin + (mx - mL) \/ pW * (xmax - xmin);\r\n      if (x < xmin || x > xmax) return;\r\n      const y = f(x), m = fp(x);\r\n      document.getElementById(\"tP\").setAttribute(\"cx\", sx(x).toFixed(1));\r\n      document.getElementById(\"tP\").setAttribute(\"cy\", sy(y).toFixed(1));\r\n      const len = 65, dn = len \/ Math.sqrt(1 + m * m);\r\n      const line = document.getElementById(\"tL\");\r\n      line.setAttribute(\"x1\", (sx(x) - dn).toFixed(1));\r\n      line.setAttribute(\"y1\", (sy(y) - m * dn).toFixed(1));\r\n      line.setAttribute(\"x2\", (sx(x) + dn).toFixed(1));\r\n      line.setAttribute(\"y2\", (sy(y) + m * dn).toFixed(1));\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    svg.addEventListener(\"mousemove\", e => {\r\n      const r = svg.getBoundingClientRect();\r\n      update((e.clientX - r.left) * (W \/ r.width));\r\n    });\r\n    svg.addEventListener(\"touchmove\", e => {\r\n      e.preventDefault();\r\n      const r = svg.getBoundingClientRect();\r\n      update((e.touches[0].clientX - r.left) * (W \/ r.width));\r\n    }, { passive: false });\r\n  })();\r\n\r\n  \/* \u2500\u2500 SIMULATOR \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 *\/\r\n  (function () {\r\n    const MAX = 1e10;\r\n    let expr = null;\r\n    let xmin = -4, xmax = 4, ymin = -10, ymax = 10;\r\n    let modalOpen = false;\r\n\r\n    const funcInput     = document.getElementById(\"funcInput\");\r\n    const slider        = document.getElementById(\"xSlider\");\r\n    const xDisp         = document.getElementById(\"xValueDisplay\");\r\n    const infoPanel     = document.getElementById(\"derivInfo\");\r\n    const mainSVG       = document.getElementById(\"simuladorSVG\");\r\n    const showTangentCB = document.getElementById(\"showTangentCheckbox\");\r\n    const modal         = document.getElementById(\"graphModal\");\r\n    const modalSVG      = document.getElementById(\"modalSVG\");\r\n    const closeBtn      = document.getElementById(\"closeModalBtn\");\r\n    if (!funcInput || !mainSVG) return;\r\n\r\n    function evalF(ex, x) {\r\n      try {\r\n        const fn = new Function(\"x\", \"return \" + ex.replace(\/\\^\/g, \"**\"));\r\n        const r  = fn(x);\r\n        return isFinite(r) && Math.abs(r) < MAX ? r : NaN;\r\n      } catch (_) { return NaN; }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function deriv(x, h = 1e-4) {\r\n      if (!expr) return NaN;\r\n      const a = evalF(expr, x + h), b = evalF(expr, x - h);\r\n      return isNaN(a) || isNaN(b) ? NaN : (a - b) \/ (2 * h);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function autoY() {\r\n      if (!expr) return;\r\n      const vals = [], step = (xmax - xmin) \/ 400;\r\n      for (let x = xmin; x <= xmax; x += step) {\r\n        const y = evalF(expr, x);\r\n        if (!isNaN(y)) vals.push(y);\r\n      }\r\n      if (!vals.length) { ymin = -10; ymax = 10; return; }\r\n      const lo = Math.min(...vals), hi = Math.max(...vals);\r\n      const mg = (hi - lo) * 0.14 || 1;\r\n      ymin = lo - mg; ymax = hi + mg;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function axesFor(W, H, mL, mR, mT, mB) {\r\n      const pW = mR - mL, pH = mB - mT;\r\n      const sx = x => mL + (x - xmin) \/ (xmax - xmin) * pW;\r\n      const sy = y => mB - (y - ymin) \/ (ymax - ymin) * pH;\r\n      let html = \"\";\r\n      const yStep = Math.max(1, Math.round((ymax - ymin) \/ 8));\r\n      for (let xi = Math.ceil(xmin); xi <= Math.floor(xmax); xi++) {\r\n        const px = sx(xi);\r\n        html += `<line x1=\"${px}\" y1=\"${mT}\" x2=\"${px}\" y2=\"${mB}\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.04)\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>`;\r\n        html += `<text x=\"${px}\" y=\"${mB+15}\" fill=\"#555\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono,monospace\">${xi}<\/text>`;\r\n      }\r\n      let ys = Math.ceil(ymin \/ yStep) * yStep;\r\n      for (let yi = ys; yi <= ymax; yi += yStep) {\r\n        const py = sy(yi);\r\n        html += `<line x1=\"${mL}\" y1=\"${py}\" x2=\"${mR}\" y2=\"${py}\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.04)\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>`;\r\n        html += `<text x=\"${mL-6}\" y=\"${py+4}\" fill=\"#555\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono,monospace\">${yi.toFixed(0)}<\/text>`;\r\n      }\r\n      \/* zero lines *\/\r\n      if (ymin <= 0 && ymax >= 0) {\r\n        const py0 = sy(0);\r\n        html += `<line x1=\"${mL}\" y1=\"${py0}\" x2=\"${mR}\" y2=\"${py0}\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.15)\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>`;\r\n      }\r\n      if (xmin <= 0 && xmax >= 0) {\r\n        const px0 = sx(0);\r\n        html += `<line x1=\"${px0}\" y1=\"${mT}\" x2=\"${px0}\" y2=\"${mB}\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.15)\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>`;\r\n      }\r\n      return html;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function render(svgEl, xVal, showTangent) {\r\n      if (!expr) { svgEl.innerHTML = `<text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#f66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\">Funci\u00f3n no v\u00e1lida<\/text>`; return; }\r\n      const vb = svgEl.getAttribute(\"viewBox\").split(\" \");\r\n      const W  = +vb[2] || 900, H = +vb[3] || 380;\r\n      const mL = 56, mR = W - 24, mT = 24, mB = H - 32;\r\n      const pW = mR - mL, pH = mB - mT;\r\n      const sx = x => mL + (x - xmin) \/ (xmax - xmin) * pW;\r\n      const sy = y => mB - (y - ymin) \/ (ymax - ymin) * pH;\r\n\r\n      let d = \"\", prevY = null;\r\n      const step = (xmax - xmin) \/ 900;\r\n      for (let xi = xmin; xi <= xmax; xi += step) {\r\n        const y = evalF(expr, xi);\r\n        if (isNaN(y)) { prevY = null; continue; }\r\n        const py = sy(y);\r\n        if (py < mT - 30 || py > mB + 30) { prevY = null; continue; }\r\n        if (prevY === null || Math.abs(y - prevY) > (ymax - ymin) * 1.2)\r\n          d += \"M\" + sx(xi).toFixed(1) + \" \" + py.toFixed(1);\r\n        else\r\n          d += \"L\" + sx(xi).toFixed(1) + \" \" + py.toFixed(1);\r\n        prevY = y;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      const yVal = evalF(expr, xVal);\r\n      const mVal = deriv(xVal);\r\n      let tang = \"\", point = \"\";\r\n\r\n      if (showTangent && isFinite(mVal) && isFinite(yVal)) {\r\n        const dx = (xmax - xmin) * 0.16;\r\n        tang = `<line x1=\"${sx(xVal-dx).toFixed(1)}\" y1=\"${sy(yVal-mVal*dx).toFixed(1)}\"\r\n                      x2=\"${sx(xVal+dx).toFixed(1)}\" y2=\"${sy(yVal+mVal*dx).toFixed(1)}\"\r\n                      stroke=\"#ff3cac\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\" opacity=\"0.9\"\/>`;\r\n      }\r\n      if (isFinite(yVal)) {\r\n        point = `<circle cx=\"${sx(xVal).toFixed(1)}\" cy=\"${sy(yVal).toFixed(1)}\" r=\"7\"\r\n                  fill=\"#ff3cac\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"\/>`;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      svgEl.innerHTML = axesFor(W, H, mL, mR, mT, mB) +\r\n        `<path d=\"${d}\" stroke=\"#00e5ff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"\/>` +\r\n        tang + point;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function updateInfo() {\r\n      const x  = parseFloat(slider.value);\r\n      xDisp.textContent = x.toFixed(2);\r\n      const y  = expr ? evalF(expr, x) : NaN;\r\n      const m  = expr ? deriv(x) : NaN;\r\n      infoPanel.textContent =\r\n        \"x = \" + x.toFixed(2) + \"   |   \" +\r\n        \"f(x) = \" + (isNaN(y) ? \"\u2014\" : y.toFixed(3)) + \"   |   \" +\r\n        \"f'(x) \u2248 \" + (isNaN(m) ? \"\u2014\" : m.toFixed(3));\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function renderAll() {\r\n      const x = parseFloat(slider.value);\r\n      render(mainSVG, x, showTangentCB.checked);\r\n      if (modalOpen) render(modalSVG, x, showTangentCB.checked);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function load() {\r\n      const raw = funcInput.value.trim();\r\n      if (!raw) return;\r\n      expr = raw;\r\n      autoY();\r\n      updateInfo();\r\n      renderAll();\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById(\"actualizarFunc\").addEventListener(\"click\", load);\r\n    slider.addEventListener(\"input\", () => { updateInfo(); renderAll(); });\r\n    showTangentCB.addEventListener(\"change\", renderAll);\r\n    document.getElementById(\"resetViewBtn\").addEventListener(\"click\",  () => { xmin=-4; xmax=4; autoY(); renderAll(); });\r\n    document.getElementById(\"autoScaleBtn\").addEventListener(\"click\",  () => { autoY(); renderAll(); });\r\n\r\n    mainSVG.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\r\n      modal.style.display = \"flex\"; modalOpen = true;\r\n      modalSVG.setAttribute(\"viewBox\", \"0 0 1000 560\");\r\n      render(modalSVG, parseFloat(slider.value), showTangentCB.checked);\r\n    });\r\n    closeBtn.addEventListener(\"click\",   () => { modal.style.display = \"none\"; modalOpen = false; });\r\n    modal.addEventListener(\"click\",      e  => { if (e.target === modal) { modal.style.display = \"none\"; modalOpen = false; } });\r\n    document.addEventListener(\"keydown\", e  => { if (e.key === \"Escape\") { modal.style.display = \"none\"; modalOpen = false; } });\r\n\r\n    \/* keypad *\/\r\n    document.getElementById(\"keypad\").addEventListener(\"click\", e => {\r\n      const btn = e.target.closest(\"button[data-val]\");\r\n      if (!btn) return;\r\n      const v = btn.dataset.val;\r\n      funcInput.focus();\r\n      if (v === \" \") funcInput.value = \"\";\r\n      else funcInput.value += v;\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    load();\r\n  })();\r\n\r\n  \/* \u2500\u2500 ERROR ITEMS keyboard \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 *\/\r\n  document.querySelectorAll(\".error-item\").forEach(el => {\r\n    el.addEventListener(\"keydown\", e => { if (e.key === \"Enter\" || e.key === \" \") el.classList.toggle(\"expandido\"); });\r\n    el.addEventListener(\"click\",   () => el.classList.toggle(\"expandido\"));\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  \/* \u2500\u2500 SCROLL REVEAL \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 *\/\r\n  const obs = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {\r\n    entries.forEach(e => { if (e.isIntersecting) { e.target.classList.add(\"visible\"); obs.unobserve(e.target); } });\r\n  }, { threshold: 0.06, rootMargin: \"0px 0px -20px 0px\" });\r\n  document.querySelectorAll(\".reveal\").forEach(el => obs.observe(el));\r\n\r\n  \/* \u2500\u2500 QUIZ \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 *\/\r\n  const answers = {\r\n    q1: { correct: \"b\", exp: \"La derivada en un punto es la pendiente de la recta tangente: raz\u00f3n de cambio instant\u00e1nea.\" },\r\n    q2: { correct: \"b\", exp: \"Si f'(x) < 0 la funci\u00f3n desciende (decrece) en ese intervalo.\" },\r\n    q3: { correct: \"b\", exp: \"La derivada de cualquier constante es 0 \u2014 no var\u00eda.\" },\r\n    q4: { correct: \"a\", exp: \"Regla de la potencia: d\/dx[5x\u2074] = 5\u00b74\u00b7x\u00b3 = 20x\u00b3.\" },\r\n    q5: { correct: \"a\", exp: \"d\/dx[sen x] = cos x. Derivada trigonom\u00e9trica fundamental.\" },\r\n    q6: { correct: \"b\", exp: \"v(t)=s'(t)=2t+2; en t=3 \u2192 v=2(3)+2=8.\" }\r\n  };\r\n\r\n  const resources = {\r\n    repaso: [\r\n      { title: \"Gu\u00eda r\u00e1pida de derivadas b\u00e1sicas\",      url: \"#\" },\r\n      { title: \"Video: Conceptos clave de la derivada\", url: \"#\" },\r\n      { title: \"Cuaderno de ejercicios resueltos\",      url: \"#\" }\r\n    ],\r\n    normal: [\r\n      { title: \"Ejercicios de aplicaci\u00f3n en f\u00edsica\",       url: \"#\" },\r\n      { title: \"Problemas de econom\u00eda con derivadas\",      url: \"#\" },\r\n      { title: \"Mini-proyecto: modelado de movimiento\",    url: \"#\" }\r\n    ],\r\n    reto: [\r\n      { title: \"Reto: derivadas de funciones compuestas\",   url: \"#\" },\r\n      { title: \"Optimizaci\u00f3n con derivadas\",                url: \"#\" },\r\n      { title: \"Derivadas impl\u00edcitas y param\u00e9tricas\",       url: \"#\" }\r\n    ]\r\n  };\r\n\r\n  const nextSlugs = {\r\n    repaso: \"derivadas-basicas-pendientes-dominio\",\r\n    normal: \"puntos-criticos-maximos-minimos\",\r\n    reto:   \"derivadas-implicitas-o-avanzadas\"\r\n  };\r\n\r\n  const tutorMsg = (score) => {\r\n    if (score <= 3) return \"Necesitas repasar con profundidad. Revisa cada explicaci\u00f3n, enf\u00f3cate en las f\u00f3rmulas y practica 12 ejercicios adicionales. Intenta explicar cada paso con tus propias palabras.\";\r\n    if (score <= 5) return \"Buen progreso. Repasa las preguntas incorrectas, contrasta con las soluciones y crea un mapa mental de las reglas de derivaci\u00f3n.\";\r\n    return \"Excelente desempe\u00f1o. Avanza a retos con derivadas compuestas y busca problemas de aplicaci\u00f3n real en f\u00edsica y econom\u00eda.\";\r\n  };\r\n\r\n  const mode = s => s <= 3 ? \"repaso\" : s <= 5 ? \"normal\" : \"reto\";\r\n\r\n  const resList = r => r.length\r\n    ? '<ul class=\"resource-list\">' + r.map(x => `<li><a href=\"${x.url}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">${x.title}<\/a><\/li>`).join(\"\") + \"<\/ul>\"\r\n    : \"\";\r\n\r\n  const pathMsg = m =>\r\n    m === \"repaso\" ? \"Regresa a los fundamentos, usa la secci\u00f3n de Errores frecuentes y vuelve a intentar la autoevaluaci\u00f3n.\"\r\n    : m === \"normal\" ? \"Aborda ejercicios extra de aplicaciones reales y vuelve al simulador con funciones no lineales.\"\r\n    : \"\u00a1Acepta el reto! Avanza a lecciones de m\u00e1ximos\/m\u00ednimos y derivadas impl\u00edcitas.\";\r\n\r\n  document.getElementById(\"corregirQuiz\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\r\n    let score = 0;\r\n    let items = \"\";\r\n    for (let i = 1; i <= 6; i++) {\r\n      const k   = \"q\" + i;\r\n      const sel = document.querySelector(`input[name=\"${k}\"]:checked`);\r\n      const ok  = sel && sel.value === answers[k].correct;\r\n      if (ok) score++;\r\n      const ua = sel ? sel.value.toUpperCase() : \"\u2014\";\r\n      const ca = answers[k].correct.toUpperCase();\r\n      items += `<li class=\"quiz-result-item\">\r\n        <strong>Pregunta ${i}<\/strong>\r\n        <span class=\"quiz-result-status ${ok ? \"correct\" : \"wrong\"}\">${ok ? \"\u2714 Correcta\" : \"\u2717 Incorrecta\"}<\/span><br>\r\n        Tu respuesta: <strong>${ua}<\/strong> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; Correcta: <strong>${ca}<\/strong><br>\r\n        <span class=\"quiz-result-explanation\">${answers[k].exp}<\/span>\r\n      <\/li>`;\r\n      document.querySelectorAll(`input[name=\"${k}\"]`).forEach(r => {\r\n        const lbl = r.closest(\"label\");\r\n        if (!lbl) return;\r\n        lbl.classList.remove(\"correct\",\"wrong\");\r\n        if (r.value === answers[k].correct) lbl.classList.add(\"correct\");\r\n        else if (r.checked)                 lbl.classList.add(\"wrong\");\r\n      });\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    const m = mode(score);\r\n    const emoji = score === 6 ? \"\ud83c\udfc6\" : score >= 4 ? \"\ud83c\udfaf\" : \"\ud83d\udcda\";\r\n\r\n    const feedback = document.getElementById(\"quizFeedback\");\r\n    feedback.innerHTML = `\r\n      <h4>${emoji} Puntaje: ${score} \/ 6 \u2014 ${score===6?\"\u00a1Perfecto!\":score>=4?\"Buen trabajo\":\"Sigue practicando\"}<\/h4>\r\n      <ul>${items}<\/ul>\r\n      <div class=\"adaptive-summary\">\r\n        <strong>Modo adaptativo:<\/strong> ${m.toUpperCase()} \u2014\r\n        ${pathMsg(m)}\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"recommended-resources\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83d\udd17 Recursos recomendados<\/h4>\r\n        ${resList(resources[m])}\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"ai-tutor\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83e\udd16 Tutor AI<\/h4>\r\n        <p>${tutorMsg(score)}<\/p>\r\n        <button id=\"aiBtn\" class=\"btn-small\">Ver consejos detallados<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"aiExt\" style=\"display:none\" class=\"ai-extended\">\r\n          <ul>\r\n            <li>Identifica y anota los errores conceptuales de tus respuestas incorrectas.<\/li>\r\n            <li>Reformula cada explicaci\u00f3n con un ejemplo propio diferente al del enunciado.<\/li>\r\n            <li>Aplica las reglas de derivaci\u00f3n a un problema adicional y verifica paso a paso.<\/li>\r\n          <\/ul>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"next-path\">\r\n        <button id=\"nextBtn\" class=\"btn-primary\">Continuar \u2192<\/button>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n    `;\r\n    feedback.style.display = \"block\";\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById(\"aiBtn\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\r\n      const d = document.getElementById(\"aiExt\");\r\n      d.style.display = d.style.display === \"none\" ? \"block\" : \"none\";\r\n    });\r\n    document.getElementById(\"nextBtn\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\r\n      window.location.href = `leccion_detalle.php?slug=${encodeURIComponent(nextSlugs[m])}`;\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    feedback.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \"smooth\", block: \"nearest\" });\r\n\r\n    \/* guardar progreso *\/\r\n    const slug  = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get(\"slug\") || (window.LC_LECCION_SLUG || \"\");\r\n    const xp    = Math.min(100, Math.round((score \/ 6) * 50 + 10));\r\n    if (slug && window.LC_CSRF_TOKEN) {\r\n      fetch(\"update_progress.php\", {\r\n        method: \"POST\",\r\n        headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application\/x-www-form-urlencoded\" },\r\n        body: new URLSearchParams({ slug, correctas: score, xp, csrf_token: window.LC_CSRF_TOKEN })\r\n      }).catch(console.error);\r\n    }\r\n  });\r\n\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>","quiz":[{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la derivada de una funci\u00f3n constante \\( f(x)=c \\)?","opciones":["c","1","0","Indefinida"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"Regla de la potencia: \u00bfderivada de \\( x^n \\)?","opciones":["\\( x^{n+1} \\)","\\( n x^{n-1} \\)","\\( nx^n \\)","\\( x^n\/n \\)"],"correcta":"\\( n x^{n-1} \\)"},{"pregunta":"Interpretaci\u00f3n geom\u00e9trica: \u00bfqu\u00e9 representa \\( f'(a) \\)?","opciones":["\u00c1rea bajo la curva","Concavidad","Pendiente de la tangente","Valor de la funci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Pendiente de la tangente"},{"pregunta":"Dominio natural de cualquier polinomio:","opciones":["\\( \\mathbb{R}^+ \\)","\\( \\mathbb{Z} \\)","\\( \\mathbb{R} \\)","Depende del grado"],"correcta":"\\( \\mathbb{R} \\)"},{"pregunta":"Si \\( f'(x) > 0 \\) en un intervalo, entonces \\( f \\):","opciones":["Es constante","Es decreciente","Es creciente","Tiene un m\u00e1ximo"],"correcta":"Es creciente"},{"pregunta":"Derivada de \\( f(x)=5x^4 - 3x^2 + 7 \\)","opciones":["\\( 20x^3 - 6x \\)","\\( 20x^3 + 6x \\)","\\( 5x^3 - 3x \\)","\\( 20x^4 - 3x \\)"],"correcta":"\\( 20x^3 - 6x \\)"},{"pregunta":"Derivada de \\( g(x) = -2x^6 + 4x \\)","opciones":["\\( -12x^5 + 4 \\)","\\( -12x^5 \\)","\\( -2x^5 + 4 \\)","\\( 12x^5 + 4x \\)"],"correcta":"\\( -12x^5 + 4 \\)"},{"pregunta":"Pendiente de \\( f(x) = x^3 - 6x + 1 \\) en \\( x=2 \\)","opciones":["0","6","12","-6"],"correcta":"6"},{"pregunta":"Derivada usando regla del producto: \\( h(x)=(3x^2 - 1)(2x + 5) \\)","opciones":["\\( 18x^2 + 12x - 10 \\)","\\( 6x^2 + 15x - 2 \\)","\\( 12x + 15 \\)","\\( 18x^2 - 10 \\)"],"correcta":"\\( 18x^2 + 12x - 10 \\)"},{"pregunta":"Derivada de \\( p(x)=4(x^3 - 2x)^2 \\) (forma correcta)","opciones":["\\( 4(6x^2 - 4x) \\)","\\( 24x^2 - 16x \\)","\\( 8(x^3 - 2x)(3x^2 - 2) \\)","Ambas formas son equivalentes"],"correcta":"Ambas formas son equivalentes"},{"pregunta":"Si \\( s(t)=3t^2 - 4t + 1 \\), \u00bfcu\u00e1l es su velocidad?","opciones":["\\( 3t - 4 \\)","\\( 6t - 4 \\)","\\( 3t^2 - 4t \\)","\\( 6t \\)"],"correcta":"\\( 6t - 4 \\)"},{"pregunta":"En econom\u00eda, la derivada de \\( C(x) \\) (costo total) se interpreta como:","opciones":["Costo fijo","Costo medio","Costo marginal","Ingreso total"],"correcta":"Costo marginal"},{"pregunta":"Si \\( f'(x)=0 \\) en todo un intervalo, \\( f \\) es:","opciones":["Creciente","Decreciente","Constante","No diferenciable"],"correcta":"Constante"},{"pregunta":"Puntos donde la tangente es horizontal para \\( f(x) = x^3 - 3x \\):","opciones":["\\( x=0 \\)","\\( x=1 \\)","\\( x=-1 \\)"," \\( x=1 \\) y \\( x=-1 \\)"],"correcta":" \\( x=1 \\) y \\( x=-1 \\)"},{"pregunta":"Derivada de \\( f(x)=8 \\)","opciones":["8","0","Indefinida","No existe"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"Derivada de \\( f(x)=x \\)","opciones":["0","1","\\( x^0 \\)","Todas las anteriores"],"correcta":"Todas las anteriores"},{"pregunta":"Derivada de \\( k(x)=(x^2 + 2)(3x - 1) + 5x \\)","opciones":["\\( 9x^2 + 8x - 2 \\)","\\( 9x^2 - 2 \\)","\\( 6x + 5 \\)","\\( 9x^2 + 5 \\)"],"correcta":"\\( 9x^2 + 8x - 2 \\)"},{"pregunta":"Si \\( f(x) = x^4 - 4x^3 + 2 \\), \u00bfen cu\u00e1ntos puntos de [0,3] la tangente es horizontal?","opciones":["Ninguno","Uno","Dos","Tres"],"correcta":"Dos"},{"pregunta":"Afirmaci\u00f3n: 'La derivada de un polinomio es otro polinomio' \u2014 \u00bfcierto o falso?","opciones":["Cierto","Falso"],"correcta":"Cierto"},{"pregunta":"La derivada de segundo orden de \\( f(x)=2x^3 - 3x^2 + x \\) es:","opciones":["\\( 12x - 6 \\)","\\( 12x + 1 \\)","\\( 6x^2 - 6x + 1 \\)","\\( 6x - 6 \\)"],"correcta":"\\( 12x - 6 \\)"}]},{"materia":"Pensamiento Matem\u00e1tico III","slug":"puntos-criticos-maximos-minimos","titulo":"Puntos Cr\u00edticos: M\u00e1ximos y M\u00ednimos Locales \u2013 Prueba de la Primera Derivada","contenido":"<body>\r\n    <!-- BACKGROUNDS -->\r\n    <div class=\"grid-bg\"><\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"bg-orb bg-orb-1\"><\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"bg-orb bg-orb-2\"><\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"bg-orb bg-orb-3\"><\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- HEADER -->\r\n    <header class=\"site-header\">\r\n      <span class=\"logo-text\">LC-ADVANCE<\/span>\r\n      <nav class=\"header-nav\">\r\n        <a class=\"nav-badge\" href=\"#teoria\">TEOR\u00cdA<\/a>\r\n        <a class=\"nav-badge\" href=\"#simulador\">SIMULADOR<\/a>\r\n        <a class=\"nav-badge\" href=\"#practica\">PR\u00c1CTICA<\/a>\r\n        <a class=\"nav-badge active\" href=\"#quiz\">QUIZ<\/a>\r\n      <\/nav>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- BARRA DE PROGRESO -->\r\n    <div class=\"progress-bar-wrap\">\r\n      <div class=\"progress-bar-fill\" id=\"progressBar\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTENIDO -->\r\n    <div class=\"leccion-wrap\">\r\n      <!-- \u2500\u2500\u2500 HERO \u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\r\n      <div class=\"leccion-hero reveal\">\r\n        <div class=\"hero-badges\">\r\n          <span class=\"hero-badge badge-mat\"\r\n            >\ud83d\udcd0 Pensamiento Matem\u00e1tico III<\/span\r\n          >\r\n          <span class=\"hero-badge badge-lvl\">\u26a1 Avanzado<\/span>\r\n          <span class=\"hero-badge badge-time\">\u23f1 50 min<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <h1 class=\"hero-title\">\r\n          Puntos Cr\u00edticos<br \/>M\u00e1ximos &amp; M\u00ednimos Locales\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"hero-subtitle\">\r\n          Prueba de la primera y segunda derivada \u00b7 An\u00e1lisis completo de\r\n          comportamiento\r\n        <\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"hero-stats\">\r\n          <div class=\"hero-stat\">\r\n            <span class=\"hero-stat-num\">3<\/span\r\n            ><span class=\"hero-stat-label\">Tests interactivos<\/span>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"hero-stat\">\r\n            <span class=\"hero-stat-num\">2<\/span\r\n            ><span class=\"hero-stat-label\">Simuladores<\/span>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"hero-stat\">\r\n            <span class=\"hero-stat-num\">8<\/span\r\n            ><span class=\"hero-stat-label\">Secciones<\/span>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- \u2500\u2500\u2500 OBJETIVOS \u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\r\n      <div class=\"obj-grid reveal\">\r\n        <div class=\"obj-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n            <h4>Definir puntos cr\u00edticos<\/h4>\r\n            <p>Identificar donde f'(x) es cero o no existe.<\/p>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"obj-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83d\udd0d<\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n            <h4>Prueba 1\u00aa Derivada<\/h4>\r\n            <p>Clasificar extremos analizando cambio de signo.<\/p>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"obj-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83e\uddee<\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n            <h4>Prueba 2\u00aa Derivada<\/h4>\r\n            <p>Confirmar naturaleza del punto con concavidad.<\/p>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"obj-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n            <h4>Optimizaci\u00f3n real<\/h4>\r\n            <p>Aplicar los hallazgos a problemas del mundo.<\/p>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- \u2500\u2500\u2500 CONTEXTO \u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\r\n      <section class=\"seccion reveal\" id=\"contexto\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n          <span class=\"titulo-icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> \u00bfPor qu\u00e9 importa?\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"context-card\">\r\n          <p>\r\n            En ingenier\u00eda, econom\u00eda y ciencias, encontrar el \"punto \u00f3ptimo\"\r\n            \u2014m\u00e1ximo o m\u00ednimo\u2014 es vital. Desde maximizar el volumen de un empaque\r\n            con el m\u00ednimo material, hasta encontrar la velocidad m\u00e1xima de un\r\n            motor, o la tarifa que maximiza ingresos en una empresa.\r\n          <\/p>\r\n          <p>\r\n            Los puntos cr\u00edticos son la puerta de entrada a todos estos\r\n            problemas.\r\n          <\/p>\r\n          <div class=\"real-data\">\r\n            <span class=\"data-tag\">#Eficiencia<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"data-tag\">#Ingenier\u00eda<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"data-tag\">#Econom\u00eda<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"data-tag\">#F\u00edsica<\/span>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/section>\r\n\r\n      <!-- \u2500\u2500\u2500 TEOR\u00cdA \u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\r\n      <section class=\"seccion reveal\" id=\"teoria\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n          <span class=\"titulo-icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> Fundamentos Te\u00f3ricos\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"definicion\">\r\n          <strong>Definici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Un n\u00famero $c$ en el dominio de $f$ es un\r\n          <em>punto cr\u00edtico<\/em> si $f'(c) = 0$ o si $f'(c)$ no existe. El valor\r\n          $f(c)$ es el <em>valor cr\u00edtico<\/em>.\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"concept-grid\">\r\n          <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd3b Puntos Cr\u00edticos<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Se obtienen de la derivada $f'(x)$. Hay dos tipos:<\/p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n              <li>$f'(c) = 0$ \u2192 Tangente horizontal<\/li>\r\n              <li>$f'(c)$ no existe \u2192 C\u00faspide\/v\u00e9rtice<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <div class=\"importante\">\r\n              \u26a0\ufe0f Todo extremo local es un punto cr\u00edtico, pero NO todo punto\r\n              cr\u00edtico es un extremo.\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcc8 Crecimiento &amp; Decrecimiento<\/h3>\r\n            <p>El <em>signo de f'(x)<\/em> determina el comportamiento:<\/p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n              <li>$f'(x) > 0 \\Rightarrow$ funci\u00f3n creciente \u2191<\/li>\r\n              <li>$f'(x) < 0 \\Rightarrow$ funci\u00f3n decreciente \u2193<\/li>\r\n              <li>$f'(x) = 0 \\Rightarrow$ estacionario \u2192<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <h3 class=\"h3-section\">Criterio de la Primera Derivada<\/h3>\r\n        <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\r\n          <table class=\"tabla-signos\">\r\n            <thead>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <th>Signo de f'(x) ANTES de c<\/th>\r\n                <th>Signo de f'(x) DESPU\u00c9S de c<\/th>\r\n                <th>Clasificaci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n              <\/tr>\r\n            <\/thead>\r\n            <tbody>\r\n              <tr class=\"max\">\r\n                <td>$(+)$ \u2014 Creciente<\/td>\r\n                <td>$(-)$ \u2014 Decreciente<\/td>\r\n                <td>\ud83d\udd34 M\u00c1XIMO LOCAL<\/td>\r\n              <\/tr>\r\n              <tr class=\"min\">\r\n                <td>$(-)$ \u2014 Decreciente<\/td>\r\n                <td>$(+)$ \u2014 Creciente<\/td>\r\n                <td>\ud83d\udfe2 M\u00cdNIMO LOCAL<\/td>\r\n              <\/tr>\r\n              <tr class=\"infl\">\r\n                <td>$(+)$ o $(-)$<\/td>\r\n                <td>Mismo signo<\/td>\r\n                <td>\ud83d\udfe1 INFLEXI\u00d3N (no es extremo)<\/td>\r\n              <\/tr>\r\n            <\/tbody>\r\n          <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- SIGNO CHART INTERACTIVO -->\r\n        <div class=\"sign-chart-wrap\">\r\n          <p class=\"sign-chart-title\">\r\n            Diagrama de signo interactivo \u2014 Haz clic en los segmentos\r\n          <\/p>\r\n          <div class=\"sign-chart\" id=\"signChart\">\r\n            <!-- Generado por JS -->\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <p\r\n            style=\"\r\n              font-family: var(--font-mono);\r\n              font-size: 11px;\r\n              color: var(--muted);\r\n              margin-top: 12px;\r\n            \"\r\n            id=\"signChartMsg\"\r\n          >\r\n            Haz clic en los segmentos para cambiar el signo de f'(x) y ver qu\u00e9\r\n            tipo de punto se clasifica.\r\n          <\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/section>\r\n\r\n      <!-- \u2500\u2500\u2500 SEGUNDA DERIVADA \u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\r\n      <section class=\"seccion reveal\" id=\"segunda-derivada\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n          <span class=\"titulo-icon\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/span> Criterio de la Segunda Derivada\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <p>\r\n          Una forma alternativa y muchas veces m\u00e1s r\u00e1pida de clasificar puntos\r\n          cr\u00edticos es usar la segunda derivada $f''(x)$. Solo funciona cuando\r\n          <em>f''(c) \u2260 0<\/em>.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"dualtest-grid\">\r\n          <div class=\"dualtest-card max\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udd34 M\u00c1XIMO LOCAL<\/h4>\r\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)\">\r\n              Si $f'(c)=0$ y $f''(c) < 0$:\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <p\r\n              style=\"\r\n                font-size: 13px;\r\n                color: rgba(220, 240, 255, 0.7);\r\n                margin-top: 8px;\r\n              \"\r\n            >\r\n              La funci\u00f3n es <strong>c\u00f3ncava hacia abajo<\/strong> en $c$, como el\r\n              tope de una colina.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px; font-size: 22px\">\r\n              $f''(c) < 0$ \u2192 \u2229\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"dualtest-card min\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udfe2 M\u00cdNIMO LOCAL<\/h4>\r\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)\">\r\n              Si $f'(c)=0$ y $f''(c) > 0$:\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <p\r\n              style=\"\r\n                font-size: 13px;\r\n                color: rgba(220, 240, 255, 0.7);\r\n                margin-top: 8px;\r\n              \"\r\n            >\r\n              La funci\u00f3n es <strong>c\u00f3ncava hacia arriba<\/strong> en $c$, como\r\n              el fondo de un valle.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px; font-size: 22px\">\r\n              $f''(c) > 0$ \u2192 \u222a\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"importante\" style=\"margin-top: 12px\">\r\n          \u26a0\ufe0f Si $f''(c) = 0$, la prueba no es concluyente. Debes regresar a la\r\n          prueba de la primera derivada.\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- MINI APP SEGUNDA DERIVADA -->\r\n        <div class=\"sd-tester\">\r\n          <h4>\ud83e\uddea Probador de Criterio: Segunda Derivada<\/h4>\r\n          <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 14px\">\r\n            Ingresa la funci\u00f3n y el punto cr\u00edtico para ver el an\u00e1lisis\r\n            autom\u00e1tico.\r\n          <\/p>\r\n          <div class=\"sd-row\">\r\n            <label>f(x) =<\/label>\r\n            <input class=\"sd-input\" id=\"sdFunc\" value=\"x**3 - 3*x\" \/>\r\n            <label>c =<\/label>\r\n            <input\r\n              class=\"sd-input\"\r\n              id=\"sdPoint\"\r\n              value=\"1\"\r\n              style=\"width: 80px\"\r\n            \/>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-sd-test\" onclick=\"runSD()\">ANALIZAR<\/button>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"sd-result\" id=\"sdResult\" style=\"display: none\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/section>\r\n\r\n      <!-- \u2500\u2500\u2500 CASOS ESPECIALES \u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\r\n      <section class=\"seccion reveal\" id=\"casos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n          <span class=\"titulo-icon\">\ud83e\uddea<\/span> Casos Especiales\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"concept-grid\">\r\n          <div class=\"concept-card alerta\">\r\n            <h3>\u26a0\ufe0f f(x) = x\u00b3 en x=0<\/h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n              $f'(0)=0$, punto cr\u00edtico. Sin embargo, $f'(x)$ es siempre positiva\r\n              a ambos lados.\r\n              <strong>No hay cambio de signo \u2192 NO es extremo<\/strong>. Es un\r\n              punto de inflexi\u00f3n horizontal.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"concept-card minimo\">\r\n            <h3>\u2705 f(x) = |x| en x=0<\/h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n              $f'(0)$ <strong>no existe<\/strong> (esquina). Pero $f'(x) < 0$\r\n              antes y $f'(x) > 0$ despu\u00e9s. El criterio aplica igualmente \u2192\r\n              <strong>M\u00cdNIMO<\/strong>.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"concept-card maximo\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd34 f(x) = \u2212x\u2074 en x=0<\/h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n              $f'(0)=0$ y $f''(0)=0$. La 2\u00aa derivada falla. Usando 1\u00aa: $f'(x) >\r\n              0$ antes, $f'(x) < 0$ despu\u00e9s \u2192 <strong>M\u00c1XIMO<\/strong>.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"concept-card alerta\">\r\n            <h3>\u26a0\ufe0f Extremo sin punto cr\u00edtico<\/h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n              En un <strong>intervalo cerrado<\/strong> $[a,b]$, los extremos\r\n              absolutos pueden ocurrir en los <em>extremos del intervalo<\/em>,\r\n              no solo en puntos cr\u00edticos. Siempre eval\u00faa $f(a)$ y $f(b)$.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/section>\r\n\r\n      <!-- \u2500\u2500\u2500 SIMULADOR \u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\r\n      <section class=\"seccion reveal\" id=\"simulador\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n          <span class=\"titulo-icon\">\u26a1<\/span> Explorador de Puntos Cr\u00edticos\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px\">\r\n          Escribe cualquier funci\u00f3n, ajusta el rango y mueve el mouse sobre la\r\n          gr\u00e1fica para ver valores.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-shell\">\r\n          <!-- TOOLBAR -->\r\n          <div class=\"sim-toolbar\">\r\n            <div class=\"sim-toolbar-left\">\r\n              <div class=\"sim-dots\">\r\n                <div class=\"sim-dot dot-red\"><\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"sim-dot dot-yellow\"><\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"sim-dot dot-green\"><\/div>\r\n              <\/div>\r\n              <span class=\"sim-filename\">criticos_explorer.js<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <span class=\"sim-status\">\u25cf ACTIVO<\/span>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n\r\n          <!-- BODY -->\r\n          <div class=\"sim-body\">\r\n            <!-- CONTROLS -->\r\n            <div class=\"sim-controls\">\r\n              <div>\r\n                <label>Funci\u00f3n f(x) =<\/label>\r\n                <input class=\"sim-input\" id=\"funcInput\" value=\"x**3 - 3*x\" \/>\r\n                <!-- PRESETS -->\r\n                <div class=\"presets\" id=\"presetBtns\">\r\n                  <button class=\"preset-btn\" data-f=\"x**3 - 3*x\">x\u00b3-3x<\/button>\r\n                  <button class=\"preset-btn\" data-f=\"x**4 - 2*x**2\">\r\n                    x\u2074-2x\u00b2\r\n                  <\/button>\r\n                  <button class=\"preset-btn\" data-f=\"Math.sin(x)\">\r\n                    sin(x)\r\n                  <\/button>\r\n                  <button class=\"preset-btn\" data-f=\"Math.cos(x)\">\r\n                    cos(x)\r\n                  <\/button>\r\n                  <button class=\"preset-btn\" data-f=\"x**2 * Math.exp(-x)\">\r\n                    x\u00b2e\u207b\u02e3\r\n                  <\/button>\r\n                  <button class=\"preset-btn\" data-f=\"Math.abs(x)\">|x|<\/button>\r\n                  <button class=\"preset-btn\" data-f=\"x**3\">x\u00b3<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n              <\/div>\r\n              <!-- KEYPAD -->\r\n              <div>\r\n                <label>Teclado r\u00e1pido<\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"keypad\" id=\"simKeypad\">\r\n                  <button data-val=\"x\">x<\/button>\r\n                  <button data-val=\"**2\">\u00b2<\/button>\r\n                  <button data-val=\"**3\">\u00b3<\/button>\r\n                  <button data-val=\"**4\">\u2074<\/button>\r\n                  <button data-val=\"Math.sin(\">sin<\/button>\r\n                  <button data-val=\"Math.cos(\">cos<\/button>\r\n                  <button data-val=\"Math.exp(\">e\u02e3<\/button>\r\n                  <button data-val=\"Math.sqrt(\">\u221a<\/button>\r\n                  <button data-val=\"Math.abs(\">|x|<\/button>\r\n                  <button data-val=\"Math.log(\">ln<\/button>\r\n                  <button data-val=\"+\">+<\/button>\r\n                  <button data-val=\"-\">-<\/button>\r\n                  <button data-val=\"*\">\u00d7<\/button>\r\n                  <button data-val=\"\/\">\/<\/button>\r\n                  <button data-val=\"(\">(<\/button>\r\n                  <button data-val=\")\">)<\/button>\r\n                  <button data-val=\"\" class=\"key-clear\">C<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n              <\/div>\r\n              <!-- RANGE -->\r\n              <div>\r\n                <label\r\n                  >Rango x: [<span id=\"xminLabel\">-4<\/span>,\r\n                  <span id=\"xmaxLabel\">4<\/span>]<\/label\r\n                >\r\n                <div class=\"sim-range-row\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6px\">\r\n                  <span\r\n                    style=\"\r\n                      font-family: var(--font-mono);\r\n                      font-size: 10px;\r\n                      color: var(--muted);\r\n                      width: 30px;\r\n                    \"\r\n                    >x\u2098\u1d62\u2099<\/span\r\n                  >\r\n                  <input\r\n                    type=\"range\"\r\n                    id=\"xminSlider\"\r\n                    min=\"-10\"\r\n                    max=\"-1\"\r\n                    value=\"-4\"\r\n                  \/>\r\n                  <span class=\"sim-range-val\" id=\"xminVal\">-4<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"sim-range-row\">\r\n                  <span\r\n                    style=\"\r\n                      font-family: var(--font-mono);\r\n                      font-size: 10px;\r\n                      color: var(--muted);\r\n                      width: 30px;\r\n                    \"\r\n                    >x\u2098\u2090\u2093<\/span\r\n                  >\r\n                  <input\r\n                    type=\"range\"\r\n                    id=\"xmaxSlider\"\r\n                    min=\"1\"\r\n                    max=\"10\"\r\n                    value=\"4\"\r\n                  \/>\r\n                  <span class=\"sim-range-val\" id=\"xmaxVal\">4<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n              <\/div>\r\n<!-- BTN -->\r\n              <button class=\"btn-run\" id=\"runBtn\">\u25b6 ACTUALIZAR GR\u00c1FICA<\/button>\r\n\r\n              <!-- MINI PANEL -->\r\n              <div\r\n                class=\"mt-auto\"\r\n                style=\"\r\n                  background: var(--surface);\r\n                  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n                  border-radius: 8px;\r\n                  padding: 10px;\r\n                \"\r\n              >\r\n                <div\r\n                  style=\"\r\n                    font-family: var(--font-mono);\r\n                    font-size: 9px;\r\n                    color: var(--muted);\r\n                    letter-spacing: 1px;\r\n                    margin-bottom: 6px;\r\n                  \"\r\n                >\r\n                  CURSOR\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div\r\n                  id=\"cursorInfo\"\r\n                  style=\"\r\n                    font-family: var(--font-mono);\r\n                    font-size: 12px;\r\n                    color: var(--cyan);\r\n                  \"\r\n                >\r\n                  Mueve sobre la gr\u00e1fica\r\n                <\/div>\r\n              <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- CANVAS -->\r\n            <div class=\"sim-canvas-wrap\">\r\n              <svg id=\"mainSVG\" viewBox=\"0 0 620 360\"><\/svg>\r\n              <div class=\"sim-legend\">\r\n                <div class=\"legend-item\">\r\n                  <div class=\"legend-dot maximo\"><\/div>\r\n                  M\u00e1ximo local\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"legend-item\">\r\n                  <div class=\"legend-dot minimo\"><\/div>\r\n                  M\u00ednimo local\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"legend-item\">\r\n                  <div class=\"legend-dot infl\"><\/div>\r\n                  Inflexi\u00f3n horizontal\r\n                <\/div>\r\n              <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n\r\n          <!-- AN\u00c1LISIS -->\r\n          <div class=\"sim-analysis\">\r\n            <div class=\"analysis-title\">Puntos cr\u00edticos detectados<\/div>\r\n            <ul class=\"crit-list\" id=\"critListOutput\">\r\n              <li>Ejecuta la gr\u00e1fica para ver el an\u00e1lisis.<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/section>\r\n\r\n      <!-- \u2500\u2500\u2500 PASO A PASO \u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\r\n      <section class=\"seccion reveal\" id=\"paso-a-paso\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n          <span class=\"titulo-icon\">\ud83d\udd27<\/span> Proceso Paso a Paso\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px\">\r\n          Ejemplo completo: $f(x) = 2x^3 - 3x^2 - 12x + 7$\r\n        <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"step-resolver\" id=\"stepResolver\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-item\">\r\n            <div class=\"step-header\" onclick=\"toggleStep(this)\">\r\n              <div class=\"step-num\">1<\/div>\r\n              <span class=\"step-title\">Encontrar la derivada f'(x)<\/span>\r\n              <span class=\"step-arrow\">\u25bc<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"step-body\">\r\n              Aplicamos la regla de la potencia t\u00e9rmino a t\u00e9rmino: $$f'(x) =\r\n              6x^2 - 6x - 12$$\r\n              <div class=\"step-result\">f'(x) = 6x\u00b2 - 6x - 12<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-item\">\r\n            <div class=\"step-header\" onclick=\"toggleStep(this)\">\r\n              <div class=\"step-num\">2<\/div>\r\n              <span class=\"step-title\">Igualar f'(x) = 0 y resolver<\/span>\r\n              <span class=\"step-arrow\">\u25bc<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"step-body\">\r\n              $$6x^2 - 6x - 12 = 0 \\implies x^2 - x - 2 = 0 \\implies (x-2)(x+1)\r\n              = 0$$\r\n              <div class=\"step-result\">Puntos cr\u00edticos: x = 2 y x = \u22121<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-item\">\r\n            <div class=\"step-header\" onclick=\"toggleStep(this)\">\r\n              <div class=\"step-num\">3<\/div>\r\n              <span class=\"step-title\">Construir tabla de signos<\/span>\r\n              <span class=\"step-arrow\">\u25bc<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"step-body\">\r\n              Evaluamos $f'(x)$ en intervalos $(-\\infty,-1)$, $(-1,2)$ y\r\n              $(2,+\\infty)$:\r\n              <ul\r\n                style=\"\r\n                  margin: 10px 0 0 20px;\r\n                  font-size: 13px;\r\n                  color: var(--muted);\r\n                  line-height: 2;\r\n                \"\r\n              >\r\n                <li>$x=-2$: $f'(-2)=6(4)+12-12=24>0$ \u2192 Creciente \u2191<\/li>\r\n                <li>$x=0$: $f'(0)=-12<0$ \u2192 Decreciente \u2193<\/li>\r\n                <li>$x=3$: $f'(3)=6(9)-18-12=24>0$ \u2192 Creciente \u2191<\/li>\r\n              <\/ul>\r\n              <div class=\"step-result\">+ | (\u22121) | \u2212 | (2) | +<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-item\">\r\n            <div class=\"step-header\" onclick=\"toggleStep(this)\">\r\n              <div class=\"step-num\">4<\/div>\r\n              <span class=\"step-title\">Clasificar los puntos cr\u00edticos<\/span>\r\n              <span class=\"step-arrow\">\u25bc<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"step-body\">\r\n              Analizando cambios de signo:\r\n              <ul\r\n                style=\"\r\n                  margin: 10px 0 0 20px;\r\n                  font-size: 13px;\r\n                  color: var(--muted);\r\n                  line-height: 2;\r\n                \"\r\n              >\r\n                <li>\r\n                  En $x=-1$: signo cambia de $(+)$ a $(-)$ \u2192\r\n                  <strong style=\"color: var(--pink)\">M\u00c1XIMO LOCAL<\/strong>\r\n                <\/li>\r\n                <li>\r\n                  En $x=2$: signo cambia de $(-)$ a $(+)$ \u2192\r\n                  <strong style=\"color: var(--green)\">M\u00cdNIMO LOCAL<\/strong>\r\n                <\/li>\r\n              <\/ul>\r\n              <div class=\"step-result\">\r\n                f(\u22121) = 14 (M\u00e1ximo) \u00b7 f(2) = \u221213 (M\u00ednimo)\r\n              <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-item\">\r\n            <div class=\"step-header\" onclick=\"toggleStep(this)\">\r\n              <div class=\"step-num\">5<\/div>\r\n              <span class=\"step-title\"\r\n                >Verificar con 2\u00aa Derivada (opcional)<\/span\r\n              >\r\n              <span class=\"step-arrow\">\u25bc<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"step-body\">\r\n              $f''(x) = 12x - 6$\r\n              <ul\r\n                style=\"\r\n                  margin: 10px 0 0 20px;\r\n                  font-size: 13px;\r\n                  color: var(--muted);\r\n                  line-height: 2;\r\n                \"\r\n              >\r\n                <li>\r\n                  $f''(-1) = -18 < 0$ \u2192 C\u00f3ncavo \u2193 \u2192 Confirma\r\n                  <strong style=\"color: var(--pink)\">M\u00c1XIMO<\/strong>\r\n                <\/li>\r\n                <li>\r\n                  $f''(2) = 18 > 0$ \u2192 C\u00f3ncavo \u2191 \u2192 Confirma\r\n                  <strong style=\"color: var(--green)\">M\u00cdNIMO<\/strong>\r\n                <\/li>\r\n              <\/ul>\r\n              <div class=\"step-result\">\r\n                \u2705 Ambos criterios coinciden. An\u00e1lisis correcto.\r\n              <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/section>\r\n\r\n      <!-- \u2500\u2500\u2500 ERRORES COMUNES \u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\r\n      <section class=\"seccion reveal\" id=\"errores\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n          <span class=\"titulo-icon\">\ud83d\uded1<\/span> Errores Frecuentes\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-grid\">\r\n          <div class=\"error-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('expandido')\">\r\n            <strong>Error 1: Creer que f'(c)=0 siempre es extremo<\/strong>\r\n            <div class=\"error-detail\">\r\n              Recuerda $f(x)=x^3$ en $x=0$. La derivada es cero pero no hay\r\n              cambio de signo. Siempre construye la tabla de signos o verifica\r\n              el cambio expl\u00edcitamente.\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"error-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('expandido')\">\r\n            <strong>Error 2: Ignorar puntos donde la derivada no existe<\/strong>\r\n            <div class=\"error-detail\">\r\n              Funciones como $f(x)=|x|$ o $f(x)=x^{2\/3}$ tienen puntos cr\u00edticos\r\n              en esquinas o c\u00faspides. Siempre verifica el dominio y los puntos\r\n              de no-derivabilidad.\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"error-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('expandido')\">\r\n            <strong>Error 3: Olvidar evaluar en extremos del intervalo<\/strong>\r\n            <div class=\"error-detail\">\r\n              En problemas de intervalos cerrados $[a,b]$, el m\u00e1ximo o m\u00ednimo\r\n              ABSOLUTO puede estar en $x=a$ o $x=b$, no en un punto cr\u00edtico\r\n              interior. Eval\u00faa siempre los extremos.\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"error-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('expandido')\">\r\n            <strong>Error 4: Usar 2\u00aa derivada cuando f''(c)=0<\/strong>\r\n            <div class=\"error-detail\">\r\n              Si $f''(c)=0$, la prueba no concluye nada. No asumir que es\r\n              inflexi\u00f3n autom\u00e1ticamente. En ese caso, vuelve a la prueba de la\r\n              primera derivada para determinar.\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"error-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('expandido')\">\r\n            <strong>Error 5: No verificar que c est\u00e1 en el dominio<\/strong>\r\n            <div class=\"error-detail\">\r\n              Si $f(c)$ no est\u00e1 definida, entonces $c$ no es un punto cr\u00edtico de\r\n              $f$. Por ejemplo, $f(x)=1\/x$ tiene $f'(x)=-1\/x^2$, que nunca es\r\n              cero, pero $x=0$ no est\u00e1 en el dominio.\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/section>\r\n\r\n      <!-- \u2500\u2500\u2500 PROBLEMAS \u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\r\n      <section class=\"seccion reveal\" id=\"practica\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n          <span class=\"titulo-icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> Problemas de Pr\u00e1ctica\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"problema-lista\">\r\n          <div class=\"problema-item\">\r\n            <h3>Problema 1 \u2014 An\u00e1lisis Polinomial<\/h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n              Encuentra y clasifica todos los puntos cr\u00edticos de $f(x) = 2x^3 -\r\n              3x^2 - 12x + 7$.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <button\r\n              class=\"btn-solucion\"\r\n              data-target=\"sol1\"\r\n              onclick=\"toggleSol(this)\"\r\n            >\r\n              VER RESOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            <div class=\"solucion-box\" id=\"sol1\">\r\n              <div class=\"solucion-step\">\r\n                <span class=\"solucion-num\">\u2460<\/span\r\n                ><span>$f'(x) = 6x^2 - 6x - 12 = 6(x-2)(x+1)$<\/span>\r\n              <\/div>\r\n              <div class=\"solucion-step\">\r\n                <span class=\"solucion-num\">\u2461<\/span\r\n                ><span>Puntos cr\u00edticos: $x=2$ y $x=-1$<\/span>\r\n              <\/div>\r\n              <div class=\"solucion-step\">\r\n                <span class=\"solucion-num\">\u2462<\/span\r\n                ><span\r\n                  >En $x=-1$: signo $(+)\u2192(-)$ \u2192\r\n                  <strong style=\"color: var(--pink)\">M\u00e1ximo<\/strong>,\r\n                  $f(-1)=14$<\/span\r\n                >\r\n              <\/div>\r\n              <div class=\"solucion-step\">\r\n                <span class=\"solucion-num\">\u2463<\/span\r\n                ><span\r\n                  >En $x=2$: signo $(-)\u2192(+)$ \u2192\r\n                  <strong style=\"color: var(--green)\">M\u00ednimo<\/strong>,\r\n                  $f(2)=-13$<\/span\r\n                >\r\n              <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"problema-item\">\r\n            <h3>Problema 2 \u2014 Optimizaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n              \u00bfQu\u00e9 n\u00famero positivo sumado con su rec\u00edproco da la suma m\u00ednima?\r\n              Usa derivadas.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <button\r\n              class=\"btn-solucion\"\r\n              data-target=\"sol2\"\r\n              onclick=\"toggleSol(this)\"\r\n            >\r\n              VER RESOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            <div class=\"solucion-box\" id=\"sol2\">\r\n              <div class=\"solucion-step\">\r\n                <span class=\"solucion-num\">\u2460<\/span\r\n                ><span>Funci\u00f3n: $S(x) = x + \\frac{1}{x}$, dominio $x > 0$<\/span>\r\n              <\/div>\r\n              <div class=\"solucion-step\">\r\n                <span class=\"solucion-num\">\u2461<\/span\r\n                ><span>$S'(x) = 1 - \\frac{1}{x^2} = \\frac{x^2-1}{x^2}$<\/span>\r\n              <\/div>\r\n              <div class=\"solucion-step\">\r\n                <span class=\"solucion-num\">\u2462<\/span\r\n                ><span\r\n                  >$S'(x)=0 \\Rightarrow x^2=1 \\Rightarrow x=1$ (positivo)<\/span\r\n                >\r\n              <\/div>\r\n              <div class=\"solucion-step\">\r\n                <span class=\"solucion-num\">\u2463<\/span\r\n                ><span\r\n                  >$S''(x) = \\frac{2}{x^3}$, $S''(1)=2>0$ \u2192\r\n                  <strong style=\"color: var(--green)\">M\u00ednimo<\/strong>. Suma\r\n                  m\u00ednima = $1+1=2$<\/span\r\n                >\r\n              <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"problema-item\">\r\n            <h3>Problema 3 \u2014 Funci\u00f3n Trigonom\u00e9trica<\/h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n              Clasifica los puntos cr\u00edticos de $f(x) = x - 2\\sin(x)$ en $[0,\r\n              2\\pi]$.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <button\r\n              class=\"btn-solucion\"\r\n              data-target=\"sol3\"\r\n              onclick=\"toggleSol(this)\"\r\n            >\r\n              VER RESOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            <div class=\"solucion-box\" id=\"sol3\">\r\n              <div class=\"solucion-step\">\r\n                <span class=\"solucion-num\">\u2460<\/span\r\n                ><span>$f'(x) = 1 - 2\\cos(x)$<\/span>\r\n              <\/div>\r\n              <div class=\"solucion-step\">\r\n                <span class=\"solucion-num\">\u2461<\/span\r\n                ><span\r\n                  >$f'(x)=0 \\Rightarrow \\cos(x)=\\frac{1}{2} \\Rightarrow\r\n                  x=\\frac{\\pi}{3}$ y $x=\\frac{5\\pi}{3}$<\/span\r\n                >\r\n              <\/div>\r\n              <div class=\"solucion-step\">\r\n                <span class=\"solucion-num\">\u2462<\/span\r\n                ><span\r\n                  >$f''(x) = 2\\sin(x)$. En $x=\\frac{\\pi}{3}$: $f''=\\sqrt{3}>0$ \u2192\r\n                  <strong style=\"color: var(--green)\">M\u00ednimo<\/strong><\/span\r\n                >\r\n              <\/div>\r\n              <div class=\"solucion-step\">\r\n                <span class=\"solucion-num\">\u2463<\/span\r\n                ><span\r\n                  >En $x=\\frac{5\\pi}{3}$: $f''=-\\sqrt{3}<0$ \u2192\r\n                  <strong style=\"color: var(--pink)\">M\u00e1ximo<\/strong><\/span\r\n                >\r\n              <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"problema-item\">\r\n            <h3>Problema 4 \u2014 Caja Abierta (Optimizaci\u00f3n Cl\u00e1sica)<\/h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n              De una l\u00e1mina cuadrada de 12 cm se recortan cuadrados iguales de\r\n              lado $x$ en las esquinas para doblar y formar una caja abierta.\r\n              \u00bfQu\u00e9 valor de $x$ maximiza el volumen?\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <button\r\n              class=\"btn-solucion\"\r\n              data-target=\"sol4\"\r\n              onclick=\"toggleSol(this)\"\r\n            >\r\n              VER RESOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            <div class=\"solucion-box\" id=\"sol4\">\r\n              <div class=\"solucion-step\">\r\n                <span class=\"solucion-num\">\u2460<\/span\r\n                ><span>Volumen: $V(x) = x(12-2x)^2$, dominio $0 < x < 6$<\/span>\r\n              <\/div>\r\n              <div class=\"solucion-step\">\r\n                <span class=\"solucion-num\">\u2461<\/span\r\n                ><span\r\n                  >$V'(x) = (12-2x)^2 + x \\cdot 2(12-2x)(-2) = (12-2x)(12-2x-4x)\r\n                  = (12-2x)(12-6x)$<\/span\r\n                >\r\n              <\/div>\r\n              <div class=\"solucion-step\">\r\n                <span class=\"solucion-num\">\u2462<\/span\r\n                ><span\r\n                  >$V'=0 \\Rightarrow x=6$ (fuera del dom.) o $x=2$. Solo $x=2$\r\n                  es v\u00e1lido.<\/span\r\n                >\r\n              <\/div>\r\n              <div class=\"solucion-step\">\r\n                <span class=\"solucion-num\">\u2463<\/span\r\n                ><span\r\n                  >$V(2)=2(8)^2=128 \\text{ cm}^3$ \u2192\r\n                  <strong style=\"color: var(--green)\">M\u00c1XIMO<\/strong>. El\r\n                  volumen m\u00e1ximo es 128 cm\u00b3.<\/span\r\n                >\r\n              <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/section>\r\n\r\n      <!-- \u2500\u2500\u2500 QUIZ \u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\r\n      <section class=\"seccion reveal\" id=\"quiz\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n          <span class=\"titulo-icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> Autoevaluaci\u00f3n\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\" id=\"quizContainer\">\r\n          <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n            <p class=\"q-text\">\r\n              1. Si $f'(c)=0$ y la derivada no cambia de signo en $c$, entonces\r\n              el punto es:\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"a\" \/> M\u00e1ximo local<\/label\r\n            >\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"b\" \/> M\u00ednimo local<\/label\r\n            >\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"c\" \/> Punto de inflexi\u00f3n\r\n              horizontal (no extremo)<\/label\r\n            >\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"d\" \/> Punto de\r\n              discontinuidad<\/label\r\n            >\r\n          <\/div>\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n            <p class=\"q-text\">\r\n              2. Para aplicar el criterio de la 2\u00aa derivada, se requiere que:\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"a\" \/> $f''(c) = 0$<\/label\r\n            >\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"b\" \/> $f'(c) = 0$ y $f''(c)\r\n              \\neq 0$<\/label\r\n            >\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"c\" \/> La funci\u00f3n sea\r\n              par<\/label\r\n            >\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"d\" \/> El punto est\u00e9 en un\r\n              intervalo cerrado<\/label\r\n            >\r\n          <\/div>\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n            <p class=\"q-text\">\r\n              3. Si $f'(x) < 0$ antes de $c$ y $f'(x) > 0$ despu\u00e9s, $c$ es un:\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"a\" \/> M\u00e1ximo local<\/label\r\n            >\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"b\" \/> M\u00ednimo local<\/label\r\n            >\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"c\" \/> Punto de\r\n              inflexi\u00f3n<\/label\r\n            >\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"d\" \/> No se puede\r\n              clasificar<\/label\r\n            >\r\n          <\/div>\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n            <p class=\"q-text\">4. El punto $x=0$ en $f(x)=x^3$ es:<\/p>\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q4\" value=\"a\" \/> M\u00ednimo local porque\r\n              $f(0)=0$<\/label\r\n            >\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q4\" value=\"b\" \/> M\u00e1ximo local<\/label\r\n            >\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q4\" value=\"c\" \/> Un punto cr\u00edtico pero\r\n              NO es extremo (inflexi\u00f3n horizontal)<\/label\r\n            >\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q4\" value=\"d\" \/> No es un punto\r\n              cr\u00edtico<\/label\r\n            >\r\n          <\/div>\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n            <p class=\"q-text\">\r\n              5. En la funci\u00f3n $f(x)=|x|$, el punto $x=0$ es un m\u00ednimo local\r\n              porque:\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q5\" value=\"a\" \/> $f'(0)=0$<\/label>\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q5\" value=\"b\" \/> $f'(0)$ no existe,\r\n              pero la derivada cambia de $(-)$ a $(+)$<\/label\r\n            >\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q5\" value=\"c\" \/> $f''(0) > 0$<\/label\r\n            >\r\n            <label\r\n              ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q5\" value=\"d\" \/> Es el punto m\u00e1s bajo\r\n              de la funci\u00f3n globalmente<\/label\r\n            >\r\n          <\/div>\r\n\r\n          <button class=\"btn-evaluar\" id=\"evalQuiz\">EVALUAR RESPUESTAS<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-feedback hidden\" id=\"quizFeedback\"><\/div>\r\n      <\/section>\r\n\r\n      <!-- \u2500\u2500\u2500 REFLEXI\u00d3N \u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\r\n      <section class=\"seccion reveal\" id=\"reflexion\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n          <span class=\"titulo-icon\">\ud83d\udcad<\/span> Reflexi\u00f3n Final\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"reflexion-box\">\r\n          <p>\r\n            \u00bfUna monta\u00f1a rusa est\u00e1 llena de puntos cr\u00edticos? Analiza el\r\n            recorrido en t\u00e9rminos de m\u00e1ximos, m\u00ednimos e inflexiones.\r\n          <\/p>\r\n          <textarea\r\n            placeholder=\"Escribe tu an\u00e1lisis aqu\u00ed... \u00bfD\u00f3nde est\u00e1n los m\u00e1ximos y m\u00ednimos? \u00bfQu\u00e9 ocurre en los puntos de inflexi\u00f3n? \u00bfC\u00f3mo se relaciona con la velocidad?\"\r\n          ><\/textarea>\r\n          <p class=\"sugerencia\">\r\n            \ud83d\udca1 Piensa en los puntos m\u00e1s altos (m\u00e1ximos), los m\u00e1s bajos (m\u00ednimos)\r\n            y los cambios de curvatura (inflexiones).\r\n          <\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n          <h3>\ud83d\udd17 Recursos Adicionales<\/h3>\r\n          <ul>\r\n            <li>\r\n              <a href=\"https:\/\/www.geogebra.org\/calculator\" target=\"_blank\"\r\n                >GeoGebra \u2014 Graficador interactivo<\/a\r\n              >\r\n            <\/li>\r\n            <li>\r\n              <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wolframalpha.com\" target=\"_blank\"\r\n                >Wolfram Alpha \u2014 Verificar derivadas<\/a\r\n              >\r\n            <\/li>\r\n            <li>\r\n              <a\r\n                href=\"https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/math\/ap-calculus-ab\"\r\n                target=\"_blank\"\r\n                >Khan Academy \u2014 C\u00e1lculo AB<\/a\r\n              >\r\n            <\/li>\r\n            <li>\r\n              <a href=\"https:\/\/www.desmos.com\/calculator\" target=\"_blank\"\r\n                >Desmos \u2014 Graficadora visual<\/a\r\n              >\r\n            <\/li>\r\n          <\/ul>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/section>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <!-- \/leccion-wrap -->\r\n\r\n    <!-- ============================================================\r\n     JAVASCRIPT PRINCIPAL\r\n     ============================================================ -->\r\n    <script>\r\n      (function () {\r\n        \"use strict\";\r\n\r\n        \/\/ \u2500\u2500\u2500 PROGRESS BAR \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n        const progressBar = document.getElementById(\"progressBar\");\r\n        function updateProgress() {\r\n          const scrollTop = window.scrollY;\r\n          const docHeight =\r\n            document.documentElement.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight;\r\n          progressBar.style.width = (scrollTop \/ docHeight) * 100 + \"%\";\r\n        }\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"scroll\", updateProgress, { passive: true });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ \u2500\u2500\u2500 SCROLL REVEAL \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n        const revealEls = document.querySelectorAll(\".reveal\");\r\n        const observer = new IntersectionObserver(\r\n          (entries) => {\r\n            entries.forEach((e) => {\r\n              if (e.isIntersecting) {\r\n                e.target.classList.add(\"visible\");\r\n              }\r\n            });\r\n          },\r\n          { threshold: 0.08 },\r\n        );\r\n        revealEls.forEach((el) => observer.observe(el));\r\n\r\n        \/\/ \u2500\u2500\u2500 STEP RESOLVER \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n        window.toggleStep = function (header) {\r\n          const item = header.parentElement;\r\n          item.classList.toggle(\"open\");\r\n          \/\/ re-render MathJax\r\n          if (item.classList.contains(\"open\") && window.MathJax) {\r\n            MathJax.typeset([item.querySelector(\".step-body\")]);\r\n          }\r\n        };\r\n\r\n        \/\/ \u2500\u2500\u2500 TOGGLE SOLUCION \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n        window.toggleSol = function (btn) {\r\n          const id = btn.getAttribute(\"data-target\");\r\n          const box = document.getElementById(id);\r\n          if (!box) return;\r\n          box.classList.toggle(\"visible\");\r\n          btn.textContent = box.classList.contains(\"visible\")\r\n            ? \"OCULTAR\"\r\n            : \"VER RESOLUCI\u00d3N\";\r\n          if (box.classList.contains(\"visible\") && window.MathJax) {\r\n            MathJax.typeset([box]);\r\n          }\r\n        };\r\n\r\n        \/\/ \u2500\u2500\u2500 SIGN CHART INTERACTIVO \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n        function buildSignChart() {\r\n          const chart = document.getElementById(\"signChart\");\r\n          const msg = document.getElementById(\"signChartMsg\");\r\n          if (!chart) return;\r\n\r\n          const critPoints = [\r\n            { x: -1, type: \"max\", label: \"c\u2081\" },\r\n            { x: 1, type: \"min\", label: \"c\u2082\" },\r\n          ];\r\n          let signs = [\"pos\", \"neg\", \"pos\"]; \/\/ default for illustration\r\n          function renderChart() {\r\n            const transitions = [\r\n              \"(-\u221e, c\u2081)\",\r\n              \"c\u2081\",\r\n              \"(c\u2081, c\u2082)\",\r\n              \"c\u2082\",\r\n              \"(c\u2082, +\u221e)\",\r\n            ];\r\n            let html = '<div class=\"sign-row\">';\r\n            html += '<span class=\"sign-row-label\">f\\'(x)<\/span>';\r\n\r\n            signs.forEach((s, i) => {\r\n              const sym = s === \"pos\" ? \"+\" : s === \"neg\" ? \"\u2212\" : \"0\";\r\n              html += `<div class=\"sign-segment ${s}\" onclick=\"toggleSignSeg(this,${i})\" title=\"Clic para cambiar signo\">${sym}<\/div>`;\r\n              if (i < critPoints.length) {\r\n                const pt = critPoints[i];\r\n                html += `<div class=\"sign-point ${pt.type}-pt\" title=\"${pt.label}\">${pt.label}<\/div>`;\r\n              }\r\n            });\r\n            html += \"<\/div>\";\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Classification row\r\n            html += '<div class=\"sign-row\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">';\r\n            html +=\r\n              '<span class=\"sign-row-label\" style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);\">tipo<\/span>';\r\n\r\n            critPoints.forEach((pt, i) => {\r\n              const before = signs[i],\r\n                after = signs[i + 1];\r\n              let type, color, sym;\r\n              if (before === \"pos\" && after === \"neg\") {\r\n                type = \"M\u00c1XIMO\";\r\n                color = \"var(--pink)\";\r\n                sym = \"\ud83d\udd34\";\r\n              } else if (before === \"neg\" && after === \"pos\") {\r\n                type = \"M\u00cdNIMO\";\r\n                color = \"var(--green)\";\r\n                sym = \"\ud83d\udfe2\";\r\n              } else {\r\n                type = \"INFLEXI\u00d3N\";\r\n                color = \"var(--yellow)\";\r\n                sym = \"\ud83d\udfe1\";\r\n              }\r\n              html += `<span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;color:${color};\">${sym} ${type}<\/span>`;\r\n            });\r\n            html += \"<\/div>\";\r\n\r\n            chart.innerHTML = html;\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Generate message\r\n            const types = critPoints.map((pt, i) => {\r\n              const before = signs[i],\r\n                after = signs[i + 1];\r\n              if (before === \"pos\" && after === \"neg\") return \"M\u00e1ximo local\";\r\n              if (before === \"neg\" && after === \"pos\") return \"M\u00ednimo local\";\r\n              return \"Inflexi\u00f3n horizontal\";\r\n            });\r\n            msg.innerHTML = `Con esta configuraci\u00f3n: c\u2081 es <strong style=\"color:var(--cyan);\">${types[0]}<\/strong> y c\u2082 es <strong style=\"color:var(--cyan);\">${types[1]}<\/strong>.`;\r\n            if (window.MathJax) MathJax.typeset([chart, msg]);\r\n          }\r\n\r\n          window.toggleSignSeg = function (el, idx) {\r\n            const map = { pos: \"neg\", neg: \"pos\" };\r\n            signs[idx] = map[signs[idx]] || \"pos\";\r\n            renderChart();\r\n          };\r\n\r\n          renderChart();\r\n        }\r\n        buildSignChart();\r\n\r\n        \/\/ \u2500\u2500\u2500 EVALUACI\u00d3N MATH \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n        function evalF(expr, x) {\r\n          let e = expr\r\n            .replace(\/\\^\/g, \"**\")\r\n            .replace(\/\\b(sin|cos|tan|exp|log|abs|sqrt)\\b\/g, \"Math.$1\");\r\n          try {\r\n            return new Function(\"x\", \"return \" + e)(x);\r\n          } catch {\r\n            return NaN;\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n        function deriv1(expr, x, h = 0.0005) {\r\n          return (evalF(expr, x + h) - evalF(expr, x - h)) \/ (2 * h);\r\n        }\r\n        function deriv2(expr, x, h = 0.001) {\r\n          return (\r\n            (evalF(expr, x + h) - 2 * evalF(expr, x) + evalF(expr, x - h)) \/\r\n            (h * h)\r\n          );\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ \u2500\u2500\u2500 SEGUNDA DERIVADA TESTER \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n        window.runSD = function () {\r\n          const expr = document.getElementById(\"sdFunc\").value.trim();\r\n          const cStr = document.getElementById(\"sdPoint\").value.trim();\r\n          const res = document.getElementById(\"sdResult\");\r\n          const c = parseFloat(cStr);\r\n          if (isNaN(c)) {\r\n            res.style.display = \"block\";\r\n            res.innerHTML =\r\n              '<span style=\"color:var(--red)\">Punto inv\u00e1lido.<\/span>';\r\n            return;\r\n          }\r\n\r\n          const fd = deriv1(expr, c);\r\n          const fd2 = deriv2(expr, c);\r\n          const fc = evalF(expr, c);\r\n\r\n          let html = `<div style=\"margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;\">x = ${c} | f(${c}) \u2248 ${fc.toFixed(4)} | f'(${c}) \u2248 ${fd.toFixed(4)} | f''(${c}) \u2248 ${fd2.toFixed(4)}<\/div>`;\r\n\r\n          if (Math.abs(fd) > 0.05) {\r\n            html += `<span style=\"color:var(--yellow)\">\u26a0\ufe0f x = ${c} no parece ser un punto cr\u00edtico (f' \u2248 ${fd.toFixed(3)} \u2260 0). Intenta otro valor.<\/span>`;\r\n          } else if (Math.abs(fd2) < 0.01) {\r\n            html += `<span style=\"color:var(--yellow)\">\u26a0\ufe0f f''(${c}) \u2248 0. El criterio de la 2\u00aa derivada no es concluyente. Usa la prueba de la 1\u00aa derivada.<\/span>`;\r\n          } else if (fd2 < 0) {\r\n            html += `<span style=\"color:var(--pink)\">\ud83d\udd34 M\u00c1XIMO LOCAL: f''(${c}) \u2248 ${fd2.toFixed(3)} < 0 \u2192 C\u00f3ncavo hacia abajo.<\/span>`;\r\n          } else {\r\n            html += `<span style=\"color:var(--green)\">\ud83d\udfe2 M\u00cdNIMO LOCAL: f''(${c}) \u2248 ${fd2.toFixed(3)} > 0 \u2192 C\u00f3ncavo hacia arriba.<\/span>`;\r\n          }\r\n          res.style.display = \"block\";\r\n          res.innerHTML = html;\r\n        };\r\n\r\n        \/\/ \u2500\u2500\u2500 SIMULADOR PRINCIPAL \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n        (function () {\r\n          const svg = document.getElementById(\"mainSVG\");\r\n          const input = document.getElementById(\"funcInput\");\r\n          const runBtn = document.getElementById(\"runBtn\");\r\n          const xminSlider = document.getElementById(\"xminSlider\");\r\n          const xmaxSlider = document.getElementById(\"xmaxSlider\");\r\n          const xminVal = document.getElementById(\"xminVal\");\r\n          const xmaxVal = document.getElementById(\"xmaxVal\");\r\n          const cursorInfo = document.getElementById(\"cursorInfo\");\r\n          const critOut = document.getElementById(\"critListOutput\");\r\n\r\n          if (!svg || !input || !runBtn) return;\r\n\r\n          const W = 620,\r\n            H = 360,\r\n            M = 52;\r\n          let xmin = -4,\r\n            xmax = 4,\r\n            ymin = -10,\r\n            ymax = 10;\r\n          let currentExpr = \"x**3 - 3*x\";\r\n\r\n          \/\/ Preset buttons\r\n          document.querySelectorAll(\".preset-btn\").forEach((b) => {\r\n            b.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\r\n              document\r\n                .querySelectorAll(\".preset-btn\")\r\n                .forEach((x) => x.classList.remove(\"active\"));\r\n              b.classList.add(\"active\");\r\n              input.value = b.getAttribute(\"data-f\");\r\n              currentExpr = input.value;\r\n              drawGraph();\r\n            });\r\n          });\r\n          \/\/ Mark first preset active\r\n          const firstPreset = document.querySelector(\".preset-btn\");\r\n          if (firstPreset) firstPreset.classList.add(\"active\");\r\n\r\n          \/\/ Keypad\r\n          document.querySelectorAll(\"#simKeypad button\").forEach((b) => {\r\n            b.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\r\n              const v = b.getAttribute(\"data-val\");\r\n              if (v === \"\" || !v) {\r\n                input.value = \"\";\r\n              } else {\r\n                input.value += v;\r\n              }\r\n              input.focus();\r\n              document\r\n                .querySelectorAll(\".preset-btn\")\r\n                .forEach((x) => x.classList.remove(\"active\"));\r\n            });\r\n          });\r\n\r\n          \/\/ Range sliders\r\n          xminSlider.addEventListener(\"input\", () => {\r\n            xmin = parseInt(xminSlider.value);\r\n            xminVal.textContent = xmin;\r\n          });\r\n          xmaxSlider.addEventListener(\"input\", () => {\r\n            xmax = parseInt(xmaxSlider.value);\r\n            xmaxVal.textContent = xmax;\r\n          });\r\n\r\n          runBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\r\n            currentExpr = input.value || \"0\";\r\n            drawGraph();\r\n          });\r\n\r\n          function findCrits(expr, xmin, xmax) {\r\n            const h = 0.005,\r\n              step = 0.05;\r\n            let crits = [];\r\n            for (let x = xmin + 0.1; x < xmax - 0.1; x += step) {\r\n              const d1 = deriv1(expr, x - step \/ 2),\r\n                d2 = deriv1(expr, x + step \/ 2);\r\n              \/\/ Zero crossing\r\n              if (d1 * d2 < 0) {\r\n                let a = x - step \/ 2,\r\n                  b = x + step \/ 2;\r\n                for (let i = 0; i < 15; i++) {\r\n                  const m = (a + b) \/ 2;\r\n                  if (deriv1(expr, a) * deriv1(expr, m) < 0) b = m;\r\n                  else a = m;\r\n                }\r\n                const c = (a + b) \/ 2;\r\n                const signBefore = deriv1(expr, c - 0.1) > 0 ? \"pos\" : \"neg\";\r\n                const signAfter = deriv1(expr, c + 0.1) > 0 ? \"pos\" : \"neg\";\r\n                let type;\r\n                if (signBefore === \"pos\" && signAfter === \"neg\") type = \"max\";\r\n                else if (signBefore === \"neg\" && signAfter === \"pos\")\r\n                  type = \"min\";\r\n                else type = \"infl\";\r\n                crits.push({ x: c, type });\r\n              }\r\n              \/\/ Near zero (no sign change)\r\n              else if (\r\n                Math.abs(deriv1(expr, x)) < 0.03 &&\r\n                Math.abs(d1) < 0.05 &&\r\n                Math.abs(d2) < 0.05\r\n              ) {\r\n                const sb = deriv1(expr, x - 0.15),\r\n                  sa = deriv1(expr, x + 0.15);\r\n                if (Math.sign(sb) === Math.sign(sa)) {\r\n                  crits.push({ x: x, type: \"infl\" });\r\n                }\r\n              }\r\n            }\r\n            \/\/ Deduplicate\r\n            return crits.filter(\r\n              (v, i, a) => i === 0 || Math.abs(v.x - a[i - 1].x) > 0.25,\r\n            );\r\n          }\r\n\r\n          function drawGraph() {\r\n            \/\/ Compute y range from samples\r\n            let ys = [];\r\n            const steps = 400;\r\n            for (let i = 0; i <= steps; i++) {\r\n              const x = xmin + ((xmax - xmin) * i) \/ steps;\r\n              const y = evalF(currentExpr, x);\r\n              if (isFinite(y) && !isNaN(y)) ys.push(y);\r\n            }\r\n            if (ys.length) {\r\n              const mn = Math.min(...ys),\r\n                mx = Math.max(...ys);\r\n              const d = (mx - mn) * 0.18 || 2;\r\n              ymin = mn - d;\r\n              ymax = mx + d;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            const sx = (x) => M + ((x - xmin) \/ (xmax - xmin)) * (W - M * 2);\r\n            const sy = (y) =>\r\n              H - M - ((y - ymin) \/ (ymax - ymin)) * (H - M * 2);\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Build path\r\n            let d = \"\";\r\n            let lastGood = false;\r\n            for (let i = 0; i <= steps; i++) {\r\n              const x = xmin + ((xmax - xmin) * i) \/ steps;\r\n              const y = evalF(currentExpr, x);\r\n              if (isFinite(y) && !isNaN(y) && y > ymin - 5 && y < ymax + 5) {\r\n                const px = sx(x).toFixed(1),\r\n                  py = sy(y).toFixed(1);\r\n                d += (lastGood ? \"L\" : \"M\") + px + \" \" + py;\r\n                lastGood = true;\r\n              } else {\r\n                lastGood = false;\r\n              }\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Crits\r\n            const crits = findCrits(currentExpr, xmin, xmax);\r\n            let pointsSVG = \"\";\r\n            let listHTML = \"\";\r\n            crits.forEach((c) => {\r\n              const y = evalF(currentExpr, c.x);\r\n              if (!isFinite(y) || isNaN(y)) return;\r\n              const col =\r\n                c.type === \"max\"\r\n                  ? \"var(--pink)\"\r\n                  : c.type === \"min\"\r\n                    ? \"var(--green)\"\r\n                    : \"var(--yellow)\";\r\n              const px = sx(c.x),\r\n                py = sy(y);\r\n              pointsSVG += `<circle cx=\"${px.toFixed(1)}\" cy=\"${py.toFixed(1)}\" r=\"9\" fill=\"${col}\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.8)\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.95\"\/>`;\r\n              \/\/ Tooltip label\r\n              const label =\r\n                c.type === \"max\" ? \"M\u00c1X\" : c.type === \"min\" ? \"M\u00cdN\" : \"INF\";\r\n              const ty = py < 50 ? py + 22 : py - 14;\r\n              pointsSVG += `<text x=\"${px.toFixed(1)}\" y=\"${ty.toFixed(1)}\" fill=\"${col}\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">${label}<\/text>`;\r\n              const badge = `badge-${c.type === \"infl\" ? \"infl\" : c.type}`;\r\n              listHTML += `<li>\r\n          <span class=\"crit-badge ${badge}\">${c.type === \"max\" ? \"M\u00c1XIMO\" : c.type === \"min\" ? \"M\u00cdNIMO\" : \"INFLEXI\u00d3N\"}<\/span>\r\n          x \u2248 <strong>${c.x.toFixed(3)}<\/strong> | f(x) \u2248 <strong>${y.toFixed(3)}<\/strong>\r\n        <\/li>`;\r\n            });\r\n            if (!crits.length)\r\n              listHTML =\r\n                '<li style=\"color:var(--muted)\">No se detectaron extremos en el rango actual.<\/li>';\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Grid lines\r\n            let grid = \"\";\r\n            const gridStep = (xmax - xmin) \/ 8;\r\n            for (\r\n              let x = Math.ceil(xmin \/ gridStep) * gridStep;\r\n              x <= xmax;\r\n              x += gridStep\r\n            ) {\r\n              const px = sx(x).toFixed(1);\r\n              grid += `<line x1=\"${px}\" y1=\"${M}\" x2=\"${px}\" y2=\"${H - M}\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.04)\"\/>`;\r\n              grid += `<text x=\"${px}\" y=\"${H - M + 14}\" fill=\"rgba(200,230,255,0.25)\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">${x.toFixed(1)}<\/text>`;\r\n            }\r\n            const ystep = (ymax - ymin) \/ 6;\r\n            for (\r\n              let y = Math.ceil(ymin \/ ystep) * ystep;\r\n              y <= ymax;\r\n              y += ystep\r\n            ) {\r\n              const py = sy(y).toFixed(1);\r\n              grid += `<line x1=\"${M}\" y1=\"${py}\" x2=\"${W - M}\" y2=\"${py}\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.04)\"\/>`;\r\n              grid += `<text x=\"${M - 5}\" y=\"${py}\" fill=\"rgba(200,230,255,0.25)\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"end\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\">${y.toFixed(1)}<\/text>`;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Axes\r\n            const axisX = Math.max(M, Math.min(H - M, sy(0)));\r\n            const axisY = Math.max(M, Math.min(W - M, sx(0)));\r\n            const axes = `\r\n        <line x1=\"${M}\" y1=\"${axisX}\" x2=\"${W - M}\" y2=\"${axisX}\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.15)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"\/>\r\n        <line x1=\"${axisY}\" y1=\"${M}\" x2=\"${axisY}\" y2=\"${H - M}\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.15)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"\/>\r\n      `;\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Cursor line (initially hidden)\r\n            const cursorLine = `<line id=\"cursorLine\" x1=\"-100\" y1=\"${M}\" x2=\"-100\" y2=\"${H - M}\" stroke=\"rgba(0,229,255,0.35)\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"\/>`;\r\n\r\n            svg.innerHTML = `\r\n        <rect width=\"${W}\" height=\"${H}\" fill=\"var(--surface2)\" rx=\"0\"\/>\r\n        ${grid}${axes}\r\n        <path d=\"${d}\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--cyan)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\/>\r\n        ${pointsSVG}\r\n        ${cursorLine}\r\n      `;\r\n\r\n            critOut.innerHTML = listHTML;\r\n            if (window.MathJax) MathJax.typeset([critOut]);\r\n          }\r\n\r\n          \/\/ Mouse move\r\n          svg.addEventListener(\"mousemove\", (e) => {\r\n            const rect = svg.getBoundingClientRect();\r\n            const mx = (e.clientX - rect.left) * (W \/ rect.width);\r\n            const x = xmin + ((mx - M) \/ (W - M * 2)) * (xmax - xmin);\r\n            if (x < xmin || x > xmax) {\r\n              cursorInfo.textContent = \"Mueve sobre la gr\u00e1fica\";\r\n              return;\r\n            }\r\n            const y = evalF(currentExpr, x);\r\n            const fd = deriv1(currentExpr, x);\r\n            cursorInfo.innerHTML = `x=${x.toFixed(2)} | f(x)=${isFinite(y) ? y.toFixed(2) : \"\u2014\"} | f'(x)=${isFinite(fd) ? fd.toFixed(3) : \"\u2014\"}`;\r\n            const curLine = document.getElementById(\"cursorLine\");\r\n            if (curLine) {\r\n              curLine.setAttribute(\"x1\", mx.toFixed(1));\r\n              curLine.setAttribute(\"x2\", mx.toFixed(1));\r\n            }\r\n          });\r\n          svg.addEventListener(\"mouseleave\", () => {\r\n            cursorInfo.textContent = \"Mueve sobre la gr\u00e1fica\";\r\n          });\r\n\r\n          \/\/ Initial draw\r\n          drawGraph();\r\n        })();\r\n\r\n        \/\/ \u2500\u2500\u2500 QUIZ \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n        const answers = { q1: \"c\", q2: \"b\", q3: \"b\", q4: \"c\", q5: \"b\" };\r\n        const explanations = {\r\n          q1: \"Si f'(x) no cambia de signo al cruzar c, la funci\u00f3n no cambia de direcci\u00f3n. Es un punto de inflexi\u00f3n horizontal.\",\r\n          q2: \"El criterio requiere que f'(c)=0 para que c sea punto cr\u00edtico, y f''(c)\u22600 para que el criterio sea concluyente.\",\r\n          q3: \"Signo cambia de (\u2212) a (+) indica que la funci\u00f3n pas\u00f3 de decrecer a crecer: m\u00ednimo local.\",\r\n          q4: \"f'(x)=3x\u00b2\u22650 siempre. No hay cambio de signo en x=0. Es un punto cr\u00edtico pero no es extremo.\",\r\n          q5: \"En x=0 la derivada no existe (esquina). La derivada izquierda es \u22121 (negativa) y la derecha es +1 (positiva). Cambio (\u2212)\u2192(+) \u2192 m\u00ednimo.\",\r\n        };\r\n\r\n        const evalBtn = document.getElementById(\"evalQuiz\");\r\n        const feedback = document.getElementById(\"quizFeedback\");\r\n\r\n        if (evalBtn) {\r\n          evalBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\r\n            let score = 0;\r\n            let html = \"\";\r\n\r\n            for (const q in answers) {\r\n              const selected = document.querySelector(\r\n                `input[name=\"${q}\"]:checked`,\r\n              );\r\n              const correct = answers[q];\r\n              const ok = selected && selected.value === correct;\r\n              if (ok) score++;\r\n\r\n              \/\/ Style labels\r\n              document.querySelectorAll(`input[name=\"${q}\"]`).forEach((r) => {\r\n                const lbl = r.parentElement;\r\n                lbl.classList.remove(\"correct-ans\", \"wrong-ans\");\r\n                if (r.value === correct) lbl.classList.add(\"correct-ans\");\r\n                else if (r.checked && !ok) lbl.classList.add(\"wrong-ans\");\r\n              });\r\n\r\n              const num = q.slice(1);\r\n              const icon = ok ? \"\u2705\" : \"\u274c\";\r\n              html += `<li>\r\n          <strong>${icon} Pregunta ${num}:<\/strong> ${ok ? \"Correcto\" : \"Incorrecto\"}\r\n          <div style=\"margin-top:4px;color:var(--muted);font-style:italic;\">${explanations[q]}<\/div>\r\n        <\/li>`;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            const pct = Math.round((score \/ 5) * 100);\r\n            const color =\r\n              pct >= 80\r\n                ? \"var(--green)\"\r\n                : pct >= 60\r\n                  ? \"var(--yellow)\"\r\n                  : \"var(--red)\";\r\n            const msg =\r\n              pct === 100\r\n                ? \"\u00a1Perfecto! Dominas los puntos cr\u00edticos.\"\r\n                : pct >= 80\r\n                  ? \"\u00a1Excelente! Casi perfecto.\"\r\n                  : pct >= 60\r\n                    ? \"Bien, pero revisa los errores.\"\r\n                    : \"Necesitas repasar los conceptos.\";\r\n\r\n            feedback.innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-score\" style=\"color:${color};\">${score}\/5 \u2014 ${pct}%<\/div>\r\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px;\">${msg}<\/div>\r\n        <ul>${html}<\/ul>\r\n      `;\r\n            feedback.classList.remove(\"hidden\");\r\n            feedback.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \"smooth\", block: \"start\" });\r\n            if (window.MathJax) MathJax.typeset([feedback]);\r\n          });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ \u2500\u2500\u2500 CONSOLE LOG EDUCATIVO \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n        console.log(\r\n          \"\ud83d\ude80 LC-ADVANCE | Lecci\u00f3n: Puntos Cr\u00edticos cargada correctamente\",\r\n        );\r\n        console.log(\r\n          \"\ud83d\udcd0 Funcionalidades: Simulador, Prueba 1\u00aa y 2\u00aa Derivada, Sign Chart interactivo, Quiz con feedback\",\r\n        );\r\n        console.log(\"\u26a1 Versi\u00f3n 2.0 \u2014 Redise\u00f1o completo 2025\");\r\n      })();\r\n    <\/script>\r\n  <\/body>","quiz":[{"pregunta":"Un punto cr\u00edtico ocurre cuando","opciones":["f(x)=0","f'(x)=0 o no existe","f''(x)=0","f(x)\u2192\u221e"],"correcta":"f'(x)=0 o no existe"},{"pregunta":"Si f' cambia de + a \u2212 en c, entonces es","opciones":["m\u00ednimo","m\u00e1ximo","inflexi\u00f3n","no cr\u00edtico"],"correcta":"m\u00e1ximo"},{"pregunta":"Si f' no cambia de signo, el punto es","opciones":["m\u00e1ximo","m\u00ednimo","inflexi\u00f3n","sin clasificar"],"correcta":"inflexi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Para f(x)=x\u00b2, x=0 es","opciones":["m\u00e1ximo","m\u00ednimo","inflexi\u00f3n","no cr\u00edtico"],"correcta":"m\u00ednimo"},{"pregunta":"Para f(x)=x\u00b3, x=0 es","opciones":["m\u00e1ximo","m\u00ednimo","inflexi\u00f3n","no cr\u00edtico"],"correcta":"inflexi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"En f(x)=|x|, x=0 es","opciones":["m\u00e1ximo","m\u00ednimo","c\u00faspide","inflexi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"m\u00ednimo"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1ntos puntos cr\u00edticos tiene f(x)=x\u2074?","opciones":["0","1","2","4"],"correcta":"1"},{"pregunta":"Si f'>0 a ambos lados de c, c es","opciones":["m\u00e1ximo","m\u00ednimo","inflexi\u00f3n","cr\u00edtico"],"correcta":"inflexi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"La prueba basada en el signo de f' se llama","opciones":["segunda derivada","primera derivada","criterio b\u00e1sico","test de Euler"],"correcta":"primera derivada"},{"pregunta":"Un polinomio de grado n puede tener a lo sumo","opciones":["n","n\u22121","n\u22122","2n"],"correcta":"n\u22121"},{"pregunta":"x=1 en f(x)=(x\u22121)\u00b2(x+2) es","opciones":["m\u00e1ximo","m\u00ednimo","inflexi\u00f3n","c\u00faspide"],"correcta":"m\u00ednimo"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e1ximo de sen(x) en [0,2\u03c0] ocurre en","opciones":["0","\u03c0\/2","\u03c0","3\u03c0\/2"],"correcta":"\u03c0\/2"},{"pregunta":"x=0 en x^{1\/3} es","opciones":["m\u00e1ximo","m\u00ednimo","c\u00faspide","inflexi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"c\u00faspide"},{"pregunta":"Si f'<0 a la izquierda y >0 a la derecha de c","opciones":["m\u00e1ximo","m\u00ednimo","inflexi\u00f3n","no cr\u00edtico"],"correcta":"m\u00ednimo"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfPuede un punto cr\u00edtico no ser extremo?","opciones":["nunca","solo en pares","s\u00ed","solo en c\u00faspides"],"correcta":"s\u00ed"},{"pregunta":"x=0 en e^{-x\u00b2} es","opciones":["m\u00ednimo","m\u00e1ximo global","inflexi\u00f3n","no cr\u00edtico"],"correcta":"m\u00e1ximo global"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1ntos m\u00ednimos tiene f(x)=(x\u00b2\u22121)\u00b2?","opciones":["0","1","2","3"],"correcta":"2"},{"pregunta":"En f(x)=x+1\/x, x>0, m\u00ednimo en","opciones":["1","2","\u22121","no existe"],"correcta":"1"},{"pregunta":"Un punto donde f' no existe puede ser","opciones":["solo m\u00e1ximo","solo m\u00ednimo","c\u00faspide o v\u00e9rtice","nunca extremo"],"correcta":"c\u00faspide o v\u00e9rtice"},{"pregunta":"x=0 en x^5 \u2212 5x es","opciones":["m\u00e1ximo","m\u00ednimo","inflexi\u00f3n","c\u00faspide"],"correcta":"inflexi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1ntos puntos cr\u00edticos tiene x^6 \u2212 15x^4 + 40?","opciones":["1","3","5","7"],"correcta":"5"},{"pregunta":"En f(x)=\u2212x\u00b2, x=0 es","opciones":["m\u00ednimo","m\u00e1ximo global","inflexi\u00f3n","no cr\u00edtico"],"correcta":"m\u00e1ximo global"},{"pregunta":"Si f'(c)=0 y f''(c)>0","opciones":["m\u00e1ximo","m\u00ednimo","inflexi\u00f3n","indeterminado"],"correcta":"m\u00ednimo"},{"pregunta":"Un polinomio de grado 5 tiene a lo sumo","opciones":["3","4","5","6"],"correcta":"4"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfx=0 cr\u00edtico en tan(x)? (\u2212\u03c0\/2,\u03c0\/2)","opciones":["s\u00ed","no","solo en 0","indeterminado"],"correcta":"no"},{"pregunta":"En \u221ax, x=0 es","opciones":["m\u00e1ximo","m\u00ednimo","c\u00faspide","no cr\u00edtico"],"correcta":"m\u00ednimo"},{"pregunta":"Un punto cr\u00edtico donde f es continua pero no derivable puede ser","opciones":["singular","c\u00faspide","v\u00e9rtice","todas"],"correcta":"todas"},{"pregunta":"x=\u00b12 en x^4 \u2212 8x\u00b2 + 16 son","opciones":["m\u00ednimos","m\u00e1ximos","inflexi\u00f3n","no cr\u00edticos"],"correcta":"m\u00e1ximos"},{"pregunta":"Cambio de signo de f' es condici\u00f3n","opciones":["suficiente","necesaria","ambas","ninguna"],"correcta":"suficiente"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1ntos m\u00e1ximos puede tener un c\u00fabico?","opciones":["0","1","2","3"],"correcta":"1"}]}],"Ecosistemas":[{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"niveles-organizacion-biologica","titulo":"Niveles de Organizaci\u00f3n Biol\u00f3gica: De la C\u00e9lula al Ecosistema","contenido":"<!-- BIOSISTEMAS v6.0 (COMPLETO Y PROFESIONAL) -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-biologia-niveles-v6\" data-tema=\"niveles-organizacion\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- 1\ufe0f\u20e3 INTRODUCCI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL (CYBER-BIO) -->\r\n    <header class=\"header-v6\">\r\n        <div class=\"header-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"badge-v6 badge-concepto\">\ud83e\uddec BIOSISTEMAS III<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge-v6 badge-ejemplo\">\u26a1 NIVEL INTERMEDIO<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge-v6\">\u23f1\ufe0f 60 MIN<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <h1>Niveles de Organizaci\u00f3n Biol\u00f3gica<\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"intro-text\">\r\n            La vida es el resultado de una jerarqu\u00eda fractal de complejidad creciente. Al integrar componentes, emergen propiedades que no existen en el nivel previo.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- OBJETIVOS GRID -->\r\n    <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"obj-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"obj-metric\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/div>\r\n            <div>\r\n                <h4 class=\"concepto\">Dominar la Jerarqu\u00eda<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Mapear los 13 niveles desde el \u00e1tomo hasta la biosfera.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"obj-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"obj-metric\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n            <div>\r\n                <h4 class=\"ejemplo\">Detectar Emergencia<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Identificar cu\u00e1ndo surge la vida en el nivel celular.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"obj-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"obj-metric\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/div>\r\n            <div>\r\n                <h4 class=\"evaluacion\">Equilibrar Sistemas<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Evaluar el impacto de cambios locales en ecosistemas globales.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 2\ufe0f\u20e3 DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO (DETALLADO) -->\r\n    <section>\r\n        <h2><span class=\"theme-color\">\u25b6<\/span> DESARROLLO: DE LA MATERIA A LA VIDA<\/h2>\r\n        <p class=\"desarrollo-subtitulo\">Cada pelda\u00f1o en la escala biol\u00f3gica se construye sobre el anterior. Cuando los componentes se organizan de forma espec\u00edfica, surgen las <strong>Propiedades Emergentes<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"table-box\">\r\n            <table>\r\n                <caption>Tabla de Niveles de Organizaci\u00f3n Biol\u00f3gica: 1-13<\/caption>\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr><th>Nivel<\/th><th>Definici\u00f3n Pedag\u00f3gica<\/th><th>Ejemplo \/ Clave<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr><td>1. Subat\u00f3mico<\/td><td>Part\u00edculas elementales: electrones, protones y neutrones.<\/td><td>Protones: definen el elemento.<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>2. At\u00f3mico<\/td><td>Unidad menor de un elemento conservando sus propiedades.<\/td><td>CHONPS: Carbono, Hidr\u00f3geno, etc.<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr class=\"table-highlight-molecular\"><td>3. Molecular<\/td><td>Uni\u00f3n de \u00e1tomos. Biomol\u00e9culas (Bio-Software).<\/td><td>ADN, Prote\u00ednas, Agua, Glucosa.<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>4. Org\u00e1nulo<\/td><td>Estructuras celulares con funciones espec\u00edficas.<\/td><td>Mitocondrias (Energ\u00eda), N\u00facleo.<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr class=\"table-highlight-molecular table-cell-bold\"><td class=\"table-cell-concepto\">5. CELULAR<\/td><td>UNIDAD M\u00cdNIMA DE VIDA. Primer nivel bi\u00f3tico.<\/td><td>Neurona, Bacteria, Gl\u00f3bulo Rojo.<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>6. Tejido<\/td><td>Agrupaci\u00f3n de c\u00e9lulas similares con funci\u00f3n coordinada.<\/td><td>Muscular, Nervioso, \u00d3seo.<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>7. \u00d3rgano<\/td><td>Uni\u00f3n de tejidos colaborando en actos complejos.<\/td><td>Coraz\u00f3n, Cerebro, H\u00edgado, Hoja.<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>8. Sistema<\/td><td>Conjunto de \u00f3rganos actuando integradamente.<\/td><td>Digestivo, Circulatorio, Endocrino.<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr class=\"table-highlight-molecular table-cell-bold\"><td class=\"table-cell-interactivo\">9. ORGANISMO<\/td><td>Ser vivo individual completo y aut\u00f3nomo.<\/td><td>Humano, Roble, Elefante, Hongo.<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>10. Poblaci\u00f3n<\/td><td>Individuos de la misma especie en un lugar com\u00fan.<\/td><td>Un cardumen de peces, una jaur\u00eda.<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>11. Comunidad<\/td><td>M\u00faltiples especies interactuando (Biocenosis).<\/td><td>Biota de un arrecife coralino.<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr class=\"table-highlight-molecular table-cell-bold\"><td class=\"table-cell-ejemplo\">12. ECOSISTEMA<\/td><td>Comunidad + Factores Abi\u00f3ticos (Biotopo).<\/td><td>Desierto, Selva, Una gota de charca.<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>13. Biosfera<\/td><td>Suma global de todos los ecosistemas del planeta.<\/td><td>La Tierra (Superorganismo).<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <p class=\"desarrollo-subtitulo\">Observa: la interdependencia entre niveles se acelera de 5 en adelante; solo desde el nivel celular emergen propiedades energ\u00e9ticas y adaptativas.<\/p>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 3\ufe0f\u20e3 VISUALIZACI\u00d3N: SCANNER V6 PROFESIONAL -->\r\n    <section>\r\n        <h2><span class=\"section-title-marker\">\u25b6<\/span> BIO-SCANNER: LA GRAN JERARQU\u00cdA<\/h2>\r\n        <p class=\"section-lead\">Explora los 13 escalones. La visualizaci\u00f3n vertical permite entender el flujo de complejidad.<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"scanner-v6\">\r\n            <div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n                <svg id=\"v6Svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 1600\" class=\"svg-meter\">\r\n                    <path d=\"M 50 50 L 50 1550\" stroke=\"rgba(57,255,20,0.15)\" stroke-width=\"2\" \/>\r\n                    <!-- Niveles v6 -->\r\n                    <g class=\"node-v6\" data-id=\"1\" data-t=\"1. SUBAT\u00d3MICO\" data-d=\"Componentes b\u00e1sicos de la materia. Protones, electrones.\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"80\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"var(--neon-concepto)\"\/><text x=\"70\" y=\"85\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\">1. Subat\u00f3mico<\/text><\/g>\r\n                    <g class=\"node-v6\" data-id=\"2\" data-t=\"2. AT\u00d3MICO\" data-d=\"\u00c1tomos que forman la materia. CHONPS.\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"200\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"var(--neon-concepto)\"\/><text x=\"70\" y=\"205\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\">2. At\u00f3mico<\/text><\/g>\r\n                    <g class=\"node-v6\" data-id=\"3\" data-t=\"3. MOLECULAR\" data-d=\"Biomol\u00e9culas (ADN, L\u00edpidos). La base del software biol\u00f3gico.\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"320\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"var(--neon-concepto)\"\/><text x=\"70\" y=\"325\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\">3. Molecular<\/text><\/g>\r\n                    <g class=\"node-v6\" data-id=\"4\" data-t=\"4. ORG\u00c1NULO\" data-d=\"Mitocondrias, Ribosomas. F\u00e1bricas celulares.\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"440\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"var(--neon-concepto)\"\/><text x=\"70\" y=\"445\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\">4. Org\u00e1nulo<\/text><\/g>\r\n                    <g class=\"node-v6 active\" data-id=\"5\" data-t=\"5. CELULAR\" data-d=\"PRIMER NIVEL CON VIDA. Metabolismo aut\u00f3nomo.\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"560\" r=\"12\" fill=\"var(--neon-concepto)\" stroke=\"#fff\"\/><text x=\"70\" y=\"565\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"900\">5. CELULAR (VIDA)<\/text><\/g>\r\n                    <g class=\"node-v6\" data-id=\"6\" data-t=\"6. TISULAR\" data-d=\"Tejidos especializados (M\u00fasculo, Nervioso).\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"680\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"var(--neon-concepto)\"\/><text x=\"70\" y=\"685\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\">6. Tisular<\/text><\/g>\r\n                    <g class=\"node-v6\" data-id=\"7\" data-t=\"7. \u00d3RGANO\" data-d=\"Coraz\u00f3n, Cerebro. Acci\u00f3n de tejidos coordinada.\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"800\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"var(--neon-concepto)\"\/><text x=\"70\" y=\"805\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\">7. \u00d3rgano<\/text><\/g>\r\n                    <g class=\"node-v6\" data-id=\"8\" data-t=\"8. SISTEMA\" data-d=\"Digestivo, Circulatorio. Sistemas complejos operativos.\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"920\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"var(--neon-concepto)\"\/><text x=\"70\" y=\"925\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\">8. Sistema<\/text><\/g>\r\n                    <g class=\"node-v6\" data-id=\"9\" data-t=\"9. ORGANISMO\" data-d=\"Ser vivo aut\u00f3nomo. Le\u00f3n, Planta, Humano.\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"1040\" r=\"12\" fill=\"var(--neon-ejemplo)\" stroke=\"#fff\"\/><text x=\"70\" y=\"1045\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"900\">9. ORGANISMO<\/text><\/g>\r\n                    <g class=\"node-v6\" data-id=\"10\" data-t=\"10. POBLACI\u00d3N\" data-d=\"Individuos de la misma especie en un lugar com\u00fan.\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"1160\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"var(--neon-concepto)\"\/><text x=\"70\" y=\"1165\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\">10. Poblaci\u00f3n<\/text><\/g>\r\n                    <g class=\"node-v6\" data-id=\"11\" data-t=\"11. COMUNIDAD\" data-d=\"Poblaciones de distintas especies interactuando.\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"1280\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"var(--neon-concepto)\"\/><text x=\"70\" y=\"1285\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\">11. Comunidad<\/text><\/g>\r\n                    <g class=\"node-v6\" data-id=\"12\" data-t=\"12. ECOSISTEMA\" data-d=\"Biocenosis + Biotopo (clima, agua, suelo).\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"1400\" r=\"12\" fill=\"var(--neon-interactivo)\" stroke=\"#fff\"\/><text x=\"70\" y=\"1405\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"900\">12. ECOSISTEMA<\/text><\/g>\r\n                    <g class=\"node-v6\" data-id=\"13\" data-t=\"13. BIOSFERA\" data-d=\"Sistema global de toda la vida de la Tierra.\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"1520\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"var(--neon-concepto)\"\/><text x=\"70\" y=\"1525\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\">13. Biosfera<\/text><\/g>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"data-panel\" id=\"v6DataPanel\">\r\n                <div id=\"v6Placeholder\" class=\"placeholder-panel\">\r\n                    <span>\ud83d\udd0d<\/span><br>SELECCIONA NIVEL\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div id=\"v6Content\" class=\"data-panel-hidden\">\r\n                    <h3 id=\"v6Title\"><\/h3>\r\n                    <p id=\"v6Desc\"><\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-panel-user\">\r\n                        <span>DATA T\u00c9CNICA:<\/span>\r\n                        <p id=\"v6Extra\"><\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 4\ufe0f\u20e3 INTERACTIVOS: LABS V6 COMPLETO -->\r\n    <section>\r\n        <h2><span class=\"section-title-marker\">\u25b6<\/span> LABORATORIOS DE BIOSISTEMAS<\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- LAB 1: GAIA RESILIENCE -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-v6 lab-block\">\r\n            <div>\r\n                <h4 class=\"lab-title\">01. OPTIMIZADOR GAIA<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Ajusta el biotopo del Ecosistema (Nivel 12) para mantener la estabilidad bi\u00f3tica.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"lab-control-group\">\r\n                    <label>\u00cdNDICE H\u00cdDRICO (%): <span id=\"v6HVal\">50<\/span><\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"v6HIn\" value=\"50\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" class=\"responsive-range\">\r\n                    <button class=\"btn-bio primary-button\" id=\"v6BtnLab1\">EJECUTAR SIMULACI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                    <div id=\"v6Lab1Feed\" class=\"lab-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"lab-summary-panel\">\r\n                <div class=\"lab-summary-inner\">\r\n                    <span id=\"v6EcoIcon\" class=\"eco-icon\">\ud83c\udf35<\/span>\r\n                    <p id=\"v6EcoName\" class=\"eco-name\">ECOSISTEMA \u00c1RIDO<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- LAB 2: BIO-EMERGENCE SANDBOX -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-v6\">\r\n            <div>\r\n                <h4 class=\"lab-title concepto\">02. SANDBOX DE EMERGENCIA<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Arrastra biomol\u00e9culas (Nivel 3) para inducir la emergencia vital (Nivel 5).<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"lab-control-group lab-options\">\r\n                    <div class=\"q-option q-option-small\" draggable=\"true\" data-type=\"dna\">ADN (Info)<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"q-option q-option-small\" draggable=\"true\" data-type=\"atp\">ATP (Energ\u00eda)<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"q-option q-option-small\" draggable=\"true\" data-type=\"lip\">Prote\u00edna (Estructura)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div id=\"v6Assembly\" class=\"assembly-zone\">\r\n                 <span class=\"assembly-placeholder\">M\u00c1QUINA DE S\u00cdNTESIS<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-bio primary-button\" id=\"v6BtnLab2\">INDUCIR EMERGENCIA VITAL<\/button>\r\n            <div id=\"v6Lab2Feed\" class=\"lab-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 5\ufe0f\u20e3 ERRORES COMUNES (PROFESIONAL) -->\r\n    <section>\r\n        <h2 class=\"alert-heading\"><span>\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES & PARADOJAS<\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n            <h4 class=\"alert-title\">Paradoja Viral: \u00bfVidda o Software?<\/h4>\r\n            <p class=\"error-paragraph\">Un virus (Nivel 3 avanzado) NO es un ser vivo. Carece de metabolismo propio y no alcanza el nivel celular. Se considera una entidad biol\u00f3gica autorreplicante, pero inerte fuera de una c\u00e9lula.<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n            <h4 class=\"alert-title\">Mitocondria vs Pulm\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n            <p class=\"error-paragraph\">No confundas niveles: la respiraci\u00f3n celular ocurre en un Org\u00e1nulo (Nivel 4), mientras que el intercambio gaseoso ocurre en un Sistema (Nivel 8). Uno es qu\u00edmico, el otro es mec\u00e1nico\/biol\u00f3gico.<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 5\ufe0f\u20e3.b ERRORES COMUNES INTERACTIVOS (ACORDE\u00d3N) -->\r\n    <section class=\"error-accordion\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"alert-heading\"><span>\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES INTERACTIVOS<\/h2>\r\n        <p class=\"accordion-intro\">Toca cada tarjeta para expandir la correcci\u00f3n experta. Esto fortalece la metacognici\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\r\n            <button class=\"accordion-btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"err1\" id=\"err1-btn\">\ud83e\udde0 Paradoja Viral: \u00bfVirus es vida?<\/button>\r\n            <div id=\"err1\" role=\"region\" class=\"accordion-content\" aria-labelledby=\"err1-btn\">\r\n                Un virus no es aut\u00f3nomo (no metabolismo). Se activa solo dentro de una c\u00e9lula hu\u00e9sped. Por eso NO es nivel celular, sino un estado molecular complejo.\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\r\n            <button class=\"accordion-btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"err2\" id=\"err2-btn\">\ud83d\udd2c Tarea - Mitocondria y Sistema respiratorio<\/button>\r\n            <div id=\"err2\" role=\"region\" class=\"accordion-content\" aria-labelledby=\"err2-btn\">\r\n                La respiraci\u00f3n celular ocurre en el org\u00e1nulo (mitocondria). El intercambio de gases se da en el sistema respiratorio. Relaciona los procesos con niveles 4 y 8.\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"accordion-item\">\r\n            <button class=\"accordion-btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"err3\" id=\"err3-btn\">\ud83c\udf21\ufe0f Equilibrio del ecosistema<\/button>\r\n            <div id=\"err3\" role=\"region\" class=\"accordion-content\" aria-labelledby=\"err3-btn\">\r\n                Cambios en biotopo (nivel 12) pueden desencadenar respuestas de comunidades (nivel 11) y poblaciones (nivel 10). Un solo punto puede provocar cascadas en niveles superiores.\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 6\ufe0f\u20e3 CONEXI\u00d3N CURRICULAR (PISA\/ENLACE) -->\r\n    <section>\r\n        <h2 class=\"data-heading\"><span>\ud83d\udcd0<\/span> CONEXI\u00d3N Y COMPETENCIAS<\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"badge-line\">\r\n            <span class=\"badge-v6 badge-dato\">PISA: Sistemas Biol\u00f3gicos<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge-v6 badge-dato\">ENLACE: Interacciones Ecol\u00f3gicas<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge-v6 badge-dato\">ODS: Vida de Ecosistemas<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <p class=\"data-paragraph\">\r\n            <strong>Indicador:<\/strong> Explica la jerarquizaci\u00f3n de la materia viva identificando las propiedades que definen cada estrato y su interdependencia homeost\u00e1tica.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 7\ufe0f\u20e3 EXAMEN DE CERTIFICACI\u00d3N BI\u00d3TICA (INTERACTIVO) -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-v6\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"evaluation-heading\"><span>\ud83c\udfc6<\/span> EXAMEN DE ASCENSO BIOSIST\u00c9MICO<\/h2>\r\n        <p class=\"evaluation-subtitle\">An\u00e1lisis cr\u00edtico sobre la organizaci\u00f3n vital. El fallo en una sola pregunta indica inestabilidad conceptual.<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div id=\"v6QuizCont\"><\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"evaluation-actions\">\r\n            <button class=\"btn-bio evaluation-button\" id=\"v6BtnEvalQuiz\">Someter a Proceso<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-bio evaluation-button\" id=\"v6BtnResetQuiz\" style=\"margin-left:8px;\">Reiniciar Evaluaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n            <div id=\"v6QuizFinalFeed\" class=\"evaluation-result\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 8\ufe0f\u20e3 CIERRE METACOGNITIVO (V6) -->\r\n    <section class=\"meta-container\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"meta-header\">\ud83e\udd14 REFLEXI\u00d3N BIOL\u00d3GICA<\/h2>\r\n        <p class=\"meta-text\">Eval\u00faa tu propia comprensi\u00f3n del sistema bi\u00f3tico:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"meta-group\">\r\n            <div class=\"meta-row\">\r\n                <span class=\"meta-label\">FLUJO DE MATERIA:<\/span>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" class=\"v6Slider meta-slider\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"meta-row\">\r\n                <span class=\"meta-label\">EMERGENCIA VITAL:<\/span>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" class=\"v6Slider meta-slider\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <textarea class=\"meta-textarea\" placeholder=\"Reflexi\u00f3n: \u00bfC\u00f3mo afectar\u00eda una mutaci\u00f3n molecular (Nivel 3) a la Biosfera (Nivel 13)?\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-bio meta-action-button\" onclick=\"alert('Registro guardado en el banco de datos bio\u00e9ticos.')\">ALMACENAR METADATOS<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <script>\r\n        (function() {\r\n            \/\/ === V6 SCANNER ===\r\n            const nodes = document.querySelectorAll('.node-v6');\r\n            const dataP = document.getElementById('v6DataPanel');\r\n            const placeholder = document.getElementById('v6Placeholder');\r\n            const content = document.getElementById('v6Content');\r\n            const tit = document.getElementById('v6Title');\r\n            const desc = document.getElementById('v6Desc');\r\n            const extra = document.getElementById('v6Extra');\r\n\r\n            nodes.forEach(n => {\r\n                n.onclick = () => {\r\n                    nodes.forEach(x => x.classList.remove('active'));\r\n                    n.classList.add('active');\r\n                    placeholder.style.display = 'none';\r\n                    content.style.display = 'block';\r\n                    tit.innerText = n.dataset.t;\r\n                    desc.innerText = n.dataset.d;\r\n                    extra.innerText = \"Nivel Jer\u00e1rquico: \" + n.dataset.id + \" | Propiedades detectadas.\";\r\n                    console.log(\"[V6] Analyzing Level \" + n.dataset.id);\r\n                };\r\n            });\r\n\r\n            \/\/ === V6 LAB 1: GAIA ===\r\n            const hIn = document.getElementById('v6HIn');\r\n            const hVal = document.getElementById('v6HVal');\r\n            const lab1Feed = document.getElementById('v6Lab1Feed');\r\n            const ecoIcon = document.getElementById('v6EcoIcon');\r\n            const ecoName = document.getElementById('v6EcoName');\r\n\r\n            hIn.oninput = (e) => {\r\n                const v = e.target.value;\r\n                hVal.innerText = v;\r\n                if(v < 30) { ecoIcon.innerText = \"\ud83c\udf35\"; ecoName.innerText = \"ECOSISTEMA \u00c1RIDO\"; }\r\n                else if(v > 70) { ecoIcon.innerText = \"\ud83c\udf0a\"; ecoName.innerText = \"ECOSISTEMA MARINO\"; }\r\n                else { ecoIcon.innerText = \"\ud83c\udf33\"; ecoName.innerText = \"ECOSISTEMA TEMPLADO\"; }\r\n            };\r\n\r\n            document.getElementById('v6BtnLab1').onclick = () => {\r\n                const v = parseInt(hIn.value);\r\n                lab1Feed.innerHTML = (v >= 30 && v <= 70) ? '<span class=\"v6-feedback-success\">\u2705 \u00c9XITO: Biosfera estable. El biotopo soporta la biocenosis.<\/span>' : '<span class=\"v6-feedback-error\">\u274c COLAPSO: Factor abi\u00f3tico letal para la poblaci\u00f3n local.<\/span>';\r\n            };\r\n\r\n            \/\/ === V6 LAB 2: SANDBOX ===\r\n            const assembly = document.getElementById('v6Assembly');\r\n            const parts = [];\r\n            document.querySelectorAll('.leccion-biologia-niveles-v6 .q-option[draggable]').forEach(t => {\r\n                t.addEventListener('dragstart', (e) => e.dataTransfer.setData('type', t.dataset.type));\r\n            });\r\n            assembly.addEventListener('dragover', (e) => e.preventDefault());\r\n            assembly.addEventListener('drop', (e) => {\r\n                e.preventDefault();\r\n                const type = e.dataTransfer.getData('type');\r\n                if(!type || parts.includes(type)) return;\r\n                parts.push(type);\r\n                const div = document.createElement('div');\r\n                div.className = 'badge-v6';\r\n                div.innerText = type.toUpperCase();\r\n                assembly.appendChild(div);\r\n                assembly.querySelector('span').style.display = 'none';\r\n            });\r\n\r\n            document.getElementById('v6BtnLab2').onclick = () => {\r\n                const f = document.getElementById('v6Lab2Feed');\r\n                if(parts.includes('dna') && parts.includes('atp')) {\r\n                    f.innerHTML = '<span class=\"v6-feedback-success\">\u2705 VIDA DETECTADA: El Nivel 5 ha emergido con \u00e9xito.<\/span>';\r\n                } else {\r\n                    f.innerHTML = '<span class=\"v6-feedback-error\">\u274c INERTES: Faltan componentes para la maquinaria celular.<\/span>';\r\n                }\r\n            };\r\n\r\n            \/\/ === V6 QUIZ ENGINE ===\r\n            const quizState = {\r\n                streak: 0,\r\n                mode: 'normal',\r\n                lastScore: 0,\r\n                timeoutId: null,\r\n                history: []\r\n            };\r\n\r\n            const difficultyMap = {\r\n                repaso: { label: 'Repaso', time: 240, next: 'Refuerza la teor\u00eda y vuelve a intentar.' },\r\n                normal: { label: 'Normal', time: 180, next: 'Sigue con la pr\u00e1ctica guiada.' },\r\n                reto: { label: 'Reto', time: 120, next: 'Avanza al m\u00f3dulo desaf\u00edo.' }\r\n            };\r\n\r\n            const resourceBank = {\r\n                repaso: [\r\n                    ['Revisi\u00f3n Ley de Liebig', 'https:\/\/es.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Ley_de_Liebig'],\r\n                    ['Video: Factor limitante', 'https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=example']\r\n                ],\r\n                normal: [\r\n                    ['Ejercicios de ecosistemas', 'https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/science'],\r\n                    ['Caso pr\u00e1ctico de cuencas', 'https:\/\/www.nationalgeographic.com\/science']\r\n                ],\r\n                reto: [\r\n                    ['Investigaci\u00f3n avanzada', 'https:\/\/www.sciencedaily.com\/news\/earth_climate\/'],\r\n                    ['Simulaci\u00f3n de gesti\u00f3n de recursos', 'https:\/\/www.unesco.org']\r\n                ]\r\n            };\r\n\r\n            const quizData = [\r\n                { q: \"\u00bfEn qu\u00e9 nivel se detectan por primera vez las propiedades de la vida?\", a: [\"At\u00f3mico\", \"Org\u00e1nulo\", \"Celular\", \"Molecular\"], ok: 2, f: \"La c\u00e9lula es la unidad m\u00ednima con metabolismo propio.\" },\r\n                { q: \"El conjunto de individuos de una misma especie se denomina:\", a: [\"Comunidad\", \"Ecosistema\", \"Poblaci\u00f3n\", \"Organismo\"], ok: 2, f: \"Poblaci\u00f3n: Misma especie, tiempo y espacio.\" },\r\n                { q: \"Si agregamos suelo, agua y clima a una comunidad, obtenemos un:\", a: [\"Bioma\", \"Ecosistema\", \"Biosfera\", \"Nicho\"], ok: 1, f: \"Ecosistema = Biocenosis + Biotopo.\" },\r\n                { q: \"Las prote\u00ednas y el ADN pertenecen al nivel:\", a: [\"At\u00f3mico\", \"Molecular\", \"Celular\", \"Tisular\"], ok: 1, f: \"Son biomol\u00e9culas complejas.\" },\r\n                { q: \"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el nivel en el que la homeostasis se regula totalmente?\", a: [\"Celular\", \"Tisular\", \"Sistema\", \"Biosfera\"], ok: 2, f: \"La homeostasis se gestiona en sistemas de \u00f3rganos en animales\/planta.\" },\r\n                { q: \"\u00bfUn conjunto de comunidades m\u00e1s factores abi\u00f3ticos es:\", a: [\"Poblaci\u00f3n\", \"Ecosistema\", \"Tisular\", \"Org\u00e1nulo\"], ok: 1, f: \"Ecosistema incluye biocenosis + biotopo.\" },\r\n                { q: \"\u00bfD\u00f3nde se encuentra el ADN compacto en eucariotas?\", a: [\"Org\u00e1nulo\", \"C\u00e9lula\", \"Tisular\", \"\u00d3rgano\"], ok: 0, f: \"El ADN est\u00e1 en el n\u00facleo y mitocondrias (org\u00e1nulos).\" },\r\n                { q: \"\u00bfEl metabolito ATP es caracter\u00edstica de qu\u00e9 nivel?\", a: [\"Molecular\", \"Org\u00e1nulo\", \"C\u00e9lula\", \"Sistema\"], ok: 2, f: \"ATP es biomol\u00e9cula pero su uso regulado es nivel celular.\" }\r\n            ];\r\n\r\n            const qCont = document.getElementById('v6QuizCont');\r\n            const statusPanel = document.createElement('div');\r\n            statusPanel.id = 'v6QuizStatus';\r\n            statusPanel.className = 'quiz-status';\r\n            statusPanel.style.marginTop = '10px';\r\n            document.querySelector('.evaluation-actions').appendChild(statusPanel);\r\n\r\n            const aiContainer = document.createElement('div');\r\n            aiContainer.id = 'v6AiTutorContainer';\r\n            aiContainer.className = 'ai-tutor';\r\n            aiContainer.style.marginTop = '12px';\r\n            aiContainer.innerHTML = `<button id=\"v6AiTutorBtn\" class=\"btn-bio\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;\">\ud83e\udd16 Tutor AI (Generaci\u00f3n)<\/button><div id=\"v6AiTutorOutput\" class=\"ai-output\" style=\"margin-top:8px; font-size:0.85rem; color:#c8f7ff;\"><\/div>`;\r\n            document.querySelector('.evaluation-actions').appendChild(aiContainer);\r\n\r\n            const resourcesContainer = document.createElement('div');\r\n            resourcesContainer.id = 'v6ResourceRecommendations';\r\n            resourcesContainer.style.marginTop = '14px';\r\n            resourcesContainer.innerHTML = '<h4 style=\"font-size:14px; margin-bottom:8px; color:#00ffbb;\">\ud83d\udcda Recomendaciones<\/h4><ul id=\"v6ResourceList\" style=\"padding-left:16px; color:#9be7ff;\"><\/ul>';\r\n            document.querySelector('.evaluation-actions').appendChild(resourcesContainer);\r\n\r\n            function getMode(correct, total) {\r\n                const ratio = total ? correct \/ total : 0;\r\n                if (ratio < 0.5) return 'repaso';\r\n                if (ratio < 0.85) return 'normal';\r\n                return 'reto';\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            function updateQuizStatus() {\r\n                const s = difficultyMap[quizState.mode];\r\n                statusPanel.innerHTML = `<strong>Modo:<\/strong> ${s.label} | <strong>Racha:<\/strong> ${quizState.streak} | <strong>Score:<\/strong> ${quizState.lastScore}% | <strong>Temporizador:<\/strong> ${s.time}s`;\r\n                if (quizState.timeoutId) clearTimeout(quizState.timeoutId);\r\n                quizState.timeoutId = setTimeout(() => {\r\n                    statusPanel.innerHTML += ' | \u23f0 Tiempo completado. Revisa recursos y vuelve a evaluar.';\r\n                }, s.time * 1000);\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            function renderResources(mode) {\r\n                const list = document.getElementById('v6ResourceList');\r\n                list.innerHTML = '';\r\n                const recs = resourceBank[mode] || [];\r\n                recs.forEach(([text, href]) => {\r\n                    const li = document.createElement('li');\r\n                    li.innerHTML = `<a href=\"${href}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#c4fffd; text-decoration:none;\">${text}<\/a>`;\r\n                    list.appendChild(li);\r\n                });\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            function setQuizState(mode) {\r\n                quizState.mode = mode;\r\n                updateQuizStatus();\r\n                const label = document.getElementById('v6QuizModeLabel');\r\n                if (label) {\r\n                    label.textContent = mode.toUpperCase();\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            async function fetchAiTutor(correct, total) {\r\n                const out = document.getElementById('v6AiTutorOutput');\r\n                const slug = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('slug') || (window.LC_LECCION_SLUG || '');\r\n                if (!slug) {\r\n                    out.innerHTML = '<p style=\"color:#ffa;\">No se pudo identificar la lecci\u00f3n actual.<\/p>';\r\n                    return;\r\n                }\r\n\r\n                out.innerHTML = '<p>Generando respuesta del tutor AI local...<\/p>';\r\n\r\n                try {\r\n                    const resp = await fetch('ai_tutor.php', {\r\n                        method: 'POST',\r\n                        credentials: 'same-origin',\r\n                        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application\/x-www-form-urlencoded' },\r\n                        body: new URLSearchParams({\r\n                            slug,\r\n                            correctas: correct,\r\n                            total,\r\n                            csrf_token: window.LC_CSRF_TOKEN\r\n                        })\r\n                    });\r\n\r\n                    const data = await resp.json();\r\n                    if (!data.ok) {\r\n                        throw new Error(data.error || 'No se obtuvo respuesta de IA');\r\n                    }\r\n\r\n                    const reviewLine = Array.isArray(data.spaced_review) && data.spaced_review.length\r\n                        ? `<p><strong>Repetici\u00f3n espaciada:<\/strong> ${data.spaced_review.join(', ')}<\/p>`\r\n                        : '';\r\n\r\n                    const errorLine = data.ai_error\r\n                        ? `<p style=\"color:#ffa; font-size:0.85rem;\">Nota: ${data.ai_error}<\/p>`\r\n                        : '';\r\n\r\n                    out.innerHTML = `\r\n                        <p><strong>Modo adaptativo:<\/strong> ${data.mode.toUpperCase()} (${data.difficulty})<\/p>\r\n                        <p>${data.ai_text}<\/p>\r\n                        ${reviewLine}\r\n                        <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem; color:#c8f7ff;\">${data.history}<\/p>\r\n                        ${errorLine}\r\n                    `;\r\n                } catch (err) {\r\n                    out.innerHTML = `<p style=\"color:#ff9999;\">Error tutor AI local: ${err.message}<\/p>`;\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            document.getElementById('v6AiTutorBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n                const answeredBlocks = document.querySelectorAll('.q-v6-block');\r\n                let correct = 0, total = 0;\r\n                answeredBlocks.forEach(block => {\r\n                    const option = block.querySelector('.v6-opt.selected');\r\n                    if (!option) return;\r\n                    total++;\r\n                    if (option.classList.contains('correct')) correct++;\r\n                });\r\n                fetchAiTutor(correct, total);\r\n            });\r\n\r\n            quizData.forEach((q, i) => {\r\n                let h = `<div class=\"q-v6-block\"><p class=\"q-v6-question\">${i+1}. ${q.q}<\/p>`;\r\n                q.a.forEach((ans, ai) => {\r\n                    h += `<div class=\"q-option v6-opt\" onclick=\"checkV6(${i}, ${ai})\">${ans}<\/div>`;\r\n                });\r\n                h += `<\/div>`;\r\n                qCont.innerHTML += h;\r\n            });\r\n\r\n            window.checkV6 = (qI, aI) => {\r\n                const block = document.querySelectorAll('.q-v6-block')[qI];\r\n                const opts = block.querySelectorAll('.v6-opt');\r\n                const ok = quizData[qI].ok;\r\n                opts.forEach(o => {\r\n                    o.classList.add('disabled');\r\n                    o.classList.remove('selected');\r\n                });\r\n                opts[aI].classList.add('selected');\r\n                if (aI === ok) {\r\n                    opts[aI].classList.add('correct');\r\n                    opts[aI].setAttribute('data-result', 'correct');\r\n                } else {\r\n                    opts[aI].classList.add('wrong');\r\n                    opts[ok].classList.add('correct');\r\n                    opts[aI].setAttribute('data-result', 'wrong');\r\n                }\r\n                block.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend', `<p class=\"feedback v6-feedback-info\">${quizData[qI].f}<\/p>`);\r\n            };\r\n\r\n            document.getElementById('v6BtnEvalQuiz').onclick = () => {\r\n                const answeredBlocks = document.querySelectorAll('.q-v6-block');\r\n                let correct = 0, wrong = 0;\r\n                answeredBlocks.forEach((block) => {\r\n                    const option = block.querySelector('.v6-opt.selected');\r\n                    if (!option) return;\r\n                    if (option.classList.contains('correct')) correct++; else wrong++;\r\n                });\r\n\r\n                const total = answeredBlocks.length;\r\n                const ratio = total ? ((correct \/ total) * 100).toFixed(0) : 0;\r\n                const mode = getMode(correct, total);\r\n                quizState.mode = mode;\r\n                quizState.lastScore = ratio;\r\n                if (mode === 'reto') {\r\n                    quizState.streak += 1;\r\n                } else {\r\n                    quizState.streak = 0;\r\n                }\r\n                quizState.history.push({ correct, wrong, total, mode, timestamp: Date.now() });\r\n\r\n                setQuizState(mode);\r\n                renderResources(mode);\r\n\r\n                const modeHint = mode === 'reto' ? '\ud83d\udd25 \u00a1Modo Reto!' : mode === 'normal' ? '\ud83d\udca1 Modo Normal' : '\ud83d\udd01 Modo Repaso';\r\n                let message = `RESULTADO: ${correct}\/${total} correctas (${ratio}%). ${modeHint}`;\r\n                if (mode !== 'reto') message += ' Revisa la sugerencia y vuelve a intentarlo.';\r\n                document.getElementById('v6QuizFinalFeed').innerText = message;\r\n\r\n                if (quizState.streak >= 2) {\r\n                    document.getElementById('v6QuizFinalFeed').innerHTML += `<p style=\"color:#ffd700;\">\ud83c\udfaf Racha x${quizState.streak}! Desaf\u00edo desbloqueado: intenta 2 preguntas extra en modo Reto.<\/p>`;\r\n                }\r\n\r\n                const s = difficultyMap[mode];\r\n                setTimeout(() => {\r\n                    document.getElementById('v6QuizFinalFeed').innerHTML += '<p style=\"color:#66ffdd;\">\u23f1\ufe0f Tiempo adaptativo terminado: puedes revisar recursos o reiniciar.<\/p>';\r\n                }, s.time * 1000);\r\n\r\n                \/\/ Mapa de dificultad simple\r\n                const difficultyMapText = `Mapa: Fase Repaso < 50%, Normal 50-85%, Reto > 85%. (Tu nivel: ${s.label})`;\r\n                document.getElementById('v6QuizStatus').innerHTML += `<br>${difficultyMapText}`;\r\n            };\r\n\r\n            document.getElementById('v6BtnResetQuiz').onclick = () => {\r\n                document.querySelectorAll('.q-v6-block').forEach((block) => {\r\n                    block.querySelectorAll('.v6-opt').forEach((opt) => {\r\n                        opt.classList.remove('disabled', 'selected', 'correct', 'wrong');\r\n                    });\r\n                    const feedback = block.querySelector('p.feedback');\r\n                    if (feedback) feedback.remove();\r\n                });\r\n                document.getElementById('v6QuizFinalFeed').innerText = 'Evaluaci\u00f3n reiniciada. Responde de nuevo para confirmar tu conocimiento.';\r\n                quizState.mode = 'normal';\r\n                quizState.streak = 0;\r\n                quizState.lastScore = 0;\r\n                if (quizState.timeoutId) clearTimeout(quizState.timeoutId);\r\n                setQuizState('normal');\r\n                renderResources('normal');\r\n                document.getElementById('v6AiTutorOutput').innerHTML = '';\r\n            };\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Inicializar estado\r\n            setQuizState('normal');\r\n            renderResources('normal');\r\n        })();\r\n    <\/script>\r\n<\/div>","quiz":[{"pregunta":"\u00bfNivel b\u00e1sico de la vida?","opciones":["\u00c1tomo","C\u00e9lula","\u00d3rgano","Biosfera"],"correcta":"C\u00e9lula"},{"pregunta":"El n\u00facleo es an\u00e1logo al...","opciones":["Coraz\u00f3n","Cerebro","Piel","Pulmones"],"correcta":"Cerebro"},{"pregunta":"Nivel que incluye factores abi\u00f3ticos","opciones":["Poblaci\u00f3n","Comunidad","Ecosistema","Organismo"],"correcta":"Ecosistema"},{"pregunta":"Grupo de c\u00e9lulas similares","opciones":["Tejido","\u00d3rgano","Sistema","Mol\u00e9cula"],"correcta":"Tejido"},{"pregunta":"Mitocondria \u2248","opciones":["Cerebro","Coraz\u00f3n","Piel","H\u00edgado"],"correcta":"Coraz\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Un cardumen es una\u2026","opciones":["Poblaci\u00f3n","Comunidad","Ecosistema","Organismo"],"correcta":"Poblaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"La membrana corresponde a la\u2026","opciones":["Piel","Cerebro","Huesos","Sangre"],"correcta":"Piel"},{"pregunta":"Interacci\u00f3n de varias especies","opciones":["Comunidad","Poblaci\u00f3n","Ecosistema","Organismo"],"correcta":"Comunidad"},{"pregunta":"Ret\u00edculo endoplasm\u00e1tico \u2248","opciones":["Sistema nervioso","Sistema circulatorio","Esqueleto","Pulmones"],"correcta":"Sistema circulatorio"},{"pregunta":"Nivel m\u00e1s grande","opciones":["Ecosistema","Biosfera","Organismo","Comunidad"],"correcta":"Biosfera"},{"pregunta":"Los ribosomas producen\u2026","opciones":["Energ\u00eda","Prote\u00ednas","ADN","Vitaminas"],"correcta":"Prote\u00ednas"},{"pregunta":"Bosque con clima y animales es\u2026","opciones":["Poblaci\u00f3n","Comunidad","Ecosistema","Organismo"],"correcta":"Ecosistema"},{"pregunta":"El ADN est\u00e1 en el\u2026","opciones":["Mitocondria","N\u00facleo","Citoplasma","Ribosoma"],"correcta":"N\u00facleo"},{"pregunta":"Un solo humano es\u2026","opciones":["Poblaci\u00f3n","Organismo","Comunidad","Biosfera"],"correcta":"Organismo"},{"pregunta":"Lisosomas \u2248","opciones":["Est\u00f3mago","Cerebro","Piel","Coraz\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Est\u00f3mago"},{"pregunta":"Un conjunto de una sola especie","opciones":["Comunidad","Poblaci\u00f3n","Ecosistema","\u00d3rgano"],"correcta":"Poblaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Citoplasma \u2248","opciones":["Aire","Sangre","Espacio interno del cuerpo","Huesos"],"correcta":"Espacio interno del cuerpo"},{"pregunta":"Conjunto de \u00f3rganos","opciones":["Tejido","Sistema","Organismo","Mol\u00e9cula"],"correcta":"Sistema"},{"pregunta":"La biosfera incluye\u2026","opciones":["Solo oc\u00e9anos","Toda la vida","Solo tierra","Solo plantas"],"correcta":"Toda la vida"},{"pregunta":"Quitar el n\u00facleo produce\u2026","opciones":["Nada","Muerte celular","Divisi\u00f3n","Mitosis"],"correcta":"Muerte celular"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l NO es un factor abi\u00f3tico?","opciones":["Luz","Agua","Hongo","Suelo"],"correcta":"Hongo"},{"pregunta":"Propiedad nueva al subir nivel","opciones":["Emergencia","Homeostasis","Metabolismo","Gen\u00e9tica"],"correcta":"Emergencia"},{"pregunta":"Aparato de Golgi \u2248","opciones":["Correo","Hospital","Escuela","Puerto"],"correcta":"Correo"},{"pregunta":"Varios ecosistemas forman...","opciones":["Biosfera","Bioma","Comunidad","Galaxia"],"correcta":"Biosfera"},{"pregunta":"Centr\u00edolos \u2248","opciones":["Gr\u00faas","Puertas","Luces","Coches"],"correcta":"Gr\u00faas"},{"pregunta":"Conjunto de neuronas","opciones":["Tejido","M\u00fasculo","Hueso","Gl\u00e1ndula"],"correcta":"Tejido"},{"pregunta":"Primer nivel bi\u00f3tico","opciones":["\u00c1tomo","Mol\u00e9cula","C\u00e9lula","Tejido"],"correcta":"C\u00e9lula"},{"pregunta":"Corall en el mar es nivel...","opciones":["Organismo","Poblaci\u00f3n","Tejido","Celular"],"correcta":"Organismo"},{"pregunta":"Nivel entre \u00d3rgano y Organismo","opciones":["Sistema","Tejido","C\u00e9lula","Poblaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Sistema"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfEnerg\u00eda celular?","opciones":["ADP","ATP","ADN","ARN"],"correcta":"ATP"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"radiacion-electromagnetica","titulo":"Radiaci\u00f3n Electromagn\u00e9tica: El Motor Energ\u00e9tico de los Ecosistemas y sus Impactos","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-ecosistemas-rem\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== CABECERA CYBERPUNK ==================== -->\r\n    <div class=\"rem-header\">\r\n        <div class=\"header-badges\">\r\n            <span class=\"materia-badge\">\ud83c\udf0d ECOSISTEMAS<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"nivel-badge\">\u26a1 NIVEL AVANZADO<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"tiempo-badge\">\u23f1\ufe0f 55 MIN<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-icon\">\u2600\ufe0f<\/span> Radiaci\u00f3n Electromagn\u00e9tica\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"leccion-subtitulo\">Energ\u00eda solar \u2022 Espectro electromagn\u00e9tico \u2022 Fotos\u00edntesis \u2022 Impactos ecol\u00f3gicos<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== OBJETIVOS R\u00c1PIDOS ==================== -->\r\n    <div class=\"objetivos-rapidos\">\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n                <h4>Comprender la naturaleza dual<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Onda-part\u00edcula y su relaci\u00f3n con energ\u00eda y longitud de onda<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n                <h4>Analizar el espectro<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Identificar regiones y sus efectos biol\u00f3gicos<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83c\udf3f<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n                <h4>Relacionar con ecosistemas<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Desde fotos\u00edntesis hasta cambio clim\u00e1tico<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== INTRO CONCEPTUAL ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"intro-conceptual\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\u26a1<\/span> La energ\u00eda que mueve el mundo\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <p>La <strong>radiaci\u00f3n electromagn\u00e9tica (REM)<\/strong> es la principal fuente de energ\u00eda para los ecosistemas terrestres. El Sol emite un espectro continuo que atraviesa la atm\u00f3sfera, donde parte es absorbido y otra parte llega a la superficie. Solo una fracci\u00f3n estrecha (400-700 nm) es aprovechable para la fotos\u00edntesis, mientras que el resto contribuye al balance t\u00e9rmico o resulta da\u00f1ina.<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-center\">\r\n                \\[ c = \\lambda \\cdot f \\quad \\text{(velocidad de la luz)} \\]\r\n                \\[ E = h \\cdot f = \\frac{h c}{\\lambda} \\quad \\text{(energ\u00eda del fot\u00f3n)} \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <p>La atm\u00f3sfera act\u00faa como un filtro: el ozono bloquea los rayos UV m\u00e1s energ\u00e9ticos, y los gases de efecto invernadero retienen el infrarrojo, regulando la temperatura planetaria.<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== ESPECTRO INTERACTIVO MEJORADO ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"espectro-interactivo\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83c\udf08<\/span> Espectro electromagn\u00e9tico interactivo\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <p>Desliza el cursor sobre la barra espectral o selecciona una regi\u00f3n para conocer sus efectos ecol\u00f3gicos.<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"scenario-controls\">\r\n            <label>Escenario atmosf\u00e9rico:\r\n                <select id=\"atmScenario\">\r\n                    <option value=\"normal\">Normal (ozono intacto)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"ozonoBajo\">Baja capa de ozono (m\u00e1s UV-B)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"altaCO2\">Alto CO\u2082 (m\u00e1s IR retenido)<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/label>\r\n            <button onclick=\"applyAtmosphere()\">Aplicar escenario<\/button>\r\n            <span id=\"atmInfo\" class=\"mini-info\">Escenario: normal. UV-B limitado.<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"spectrum-container\">\r\n            <svg id=\"spectrumSVG\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 350\" style=\"background:#000; border-radius:16px;\">\r\n                <defs>\r\n                    <linearGradient id=\"specGrad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\r\n                        <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7b1fa2\"\/>\r\n                        <stop offset=\"12%\" stop-color=\"#3949ab\"\/>\r\n                        <stop offset=\"25%\" stop-color=\"#039be5\"\/>\r\n                        <stop offset=\"38%\" stop-color=\"#00bcd4\"\/>\r\n                        <stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#00e676\"\/>\r\n                        <stop offset=\"62%\" stop-color=\"#ffee58\"\/>\r\n                        <stop offset=\"75%\" stop-color=\"#ff9800\"\/>\r\n                        <stop offset=\"88%\" stop-color=\"#f44336\"\/>\r\n                        <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#b71c1c\"\/>\r\n                    <\/linearGradient>\r\n                <\/defs>\r\n                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"120\" width=\"900\" height=\"70\" fill=\"url(#specGrad)\" stroke=\"#0ff\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"35\"\/>\r\n                <text x=\"80\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#0ff\">Gamma<\/text>\r\n                <text x=\"180\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#0ff\">Rayos X<\/text>\r\n                <text x=\"280\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#0ff\">UV<\/text>\r\n                <text x=\"500\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#ff0\" font-weight=\"bold\">Visible<\/text>\r\n                <text x=\"700\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#0ff\">IR<\/text>\r\n                <text x=\"870\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#0ff\">Radio<\/text>\r\n                <circle id=\"specCursor\" cx=\"500\" cy=\"155\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#ff0\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                <text id=\"specEnergy\" x=\"500\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ff0\">Energ\u00eda media<\/text>\r\n            <\/svg>\r\n            <div id=\"specInfo\" class=\"spectrum-info\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO: TABLA COMPARATIVA ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"tabla-regiones\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span> Regiones del espectro y sus interacciones biol\u00f3gicas\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"table-wrapper\">\r\n            <table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr><th>Regi\u00f3n<\/th><th>\u03bb (nm)<\/th><th>Energ\u00eda<\/th><th>Efecto ecol\u00f3gico principal<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr><td>Gamma<\/td><td>&lt;0.01<\/td><td>Muy alta<\/td><td>Ionizaci\u00f3n letal; bloqueado por atm\u00f3sfera<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>Rayos X<\/td><td>0.01\u201310<\/td><td>Alta<\/td><td>Da\u00f1o celular grave; filtrado por atm\u00f3sfera<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>UV-C<\/td><td>100\u2013280<\/td><td>Alta<\/td><td>Absorbido por ozono; letal para organismos<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>UV-B<\/td><td>280\u2013315<\/td><td>Media-alta<\/td><td>Da\u00f1o ADN, disminuye fotos\u00edntesis<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>UV-A<\/td><td>315\u2013400<\/td><td>Media<\/td><td>Estr\u00e9s oxidativo, efectos a largo plazo<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>Visible (PAR)<\/td><td>400\u2013700<\/td><td>Media<\/td><td>Fotos\u00edntesis, visi\u00f3n, productividad primaria<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>Infrarrojo<\/td><td>700\u201310\u2076<\/td><td>Baja<\/td><td>Calor, efecto invernadero, termorregulaci\u00f3n<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>Microondas\/Radio<\/td><td>&gt;10\u2076<\/td><td>Muy baja<\/td><td>Comunicaci\u00f3n, poco impacto directo<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== SIMULADOR: EFICIENCIA FOTOSINT\u00c9TICA ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulador-fotosintesis\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83c\udf3f<\/span> Simulador: Impacto de la REM en la fotos\u00edntesis\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <p>Ajusta las intensidades relativas de UV, visible (PAR) e infrarrojo y observa c\u00f3mo afecta la producci\u00f3n primaria.<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"photosynth-sim\">\r\n            <div class=\"sliders\">\r\n                <label>\ud83c\udf1e UV (280-400 nm): <span id=\"uvVal\">30<\/span>%<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"uvSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"30\">\r\n                <label>\ud83c\udf43 Visible (PAR): <span id=\"visVal\">80<\/span>%<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"visSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"80\">\r\n                <label>\ud83d\udd25 Infrarrojo: <span id=\"irVal\">70<\/span>%<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"irSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"70\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"meter\">\r\n                <div class=\"meter-fill\" id=\"photoFill\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"stats\">\r\n                <span>Tasa fotosint\u00e9tica: <strong id=\"photoRate\">0%<\/strong><\/span>\r\n                <div id=\"photoFeedback\" class=\"feedback-message\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== ANIMACI\u00d3N DA\u00d1O UV ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"uv-damage\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83e\uddec<\/span> Da\u00f1o por radiaci\u00f3n UV: simulaci\u00f3n molecular\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <p>Los fotones UV de alta energ\u00eda pueden romper enlaces en el ADN, formando d\u00edmeros de timina. Observa c\u00f3mo el da\u00f1o se acumula.<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"dna-sim\">\r\n            <div class=\"dna-strand\">\r\n                <div class=\"base\" style=\"left:20%\">A<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"base\" style=\"left:40%\">T<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"base\" style=\"left:60%\">G<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"base\" style=\"left:80%\">C<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"damage-bar\">\r\n                <div class=\"damage-fill\" id=\"dnaDamageFill\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"damage-stats\">\r\n                <span>Da\u00f1o acumulado: <strong id=\"dnaDamageValue\">0<\/strong>%<\/span>\r\n                <button onclick=\"resetDNADamage()\">\ud83d\udd04 Reiniciar<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== ERRORES COMUNES INTERACTIVOS ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-comunes\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> Errores comunes (\u00a1ev\u00edtalos!)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('expandido')\">\r\n                <strong>\u274c Creer que toda la radiaci\u00f3n solar es \u00fatil para la fotos\u00edntesis<\/strong>\r\n                <div class=\"error-detail\">Solo la luz visible (400-700 nm) es aprovechable por los pigmentos fotosint\u00e9ticos. UV e IR no producen fijaci\u00f3n de carbono.<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('expandido')\">\r\n                <strong>\u274c Confundir efecto t\u00e9rmico del IR con energ\u00eda fotosint\u00e9tica<\/strong>\r\n                <div class=\"error-detail\">El IR calienta los tejidos, pero no impulsa la conversi\u00f3n de energ\u00eda qu\u00edmica; la fotos\u00edntesis requiere fotones visibles.<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('expandido')\">\r\n                <strong>\u274c Subestimar el rol protector del ozono<\/strong>\r\n                <div class=\"error-detail\">La capa de ozono absorbe m\u00e1s del 95% de la radiaci\u00f3n UV-B\/C. Su depleci\u00f3n aumenta el da\u00f1o gen\u00e9tico y reduce la productividad primaria.<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== CONEXI\u00d3N CURRICULAR ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"curricular\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udcd8<\/span> V\u00ednculo con el programa oficial\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"curricular-content\">\r\n            <p><strong>Competencias:<\/strong> Explica el flujo de energ\u00eda en los ecosistemas y los efectos de la radiaci\u00f3n solar sobre los seres vivos.<\/p>\r\n            <p><strong>Contenidos:<\/strong> Espectro electromagn\u00e9tico, radiaci\u00f3n solar, fotos\u00edntesis, capa de ozono, efecto invernadero.<\/p>\r\n            <p><strong>Evaluaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Interpretaci\u00f3n de gr\u00e1ficos de irradiancia, an\u00e1lisis de impactos ambientales y c\u00e1lculos b\u00e1sicos de energ\u00eda.<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"problemas-examen\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> Problemas tipo examen\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"problema-lista\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-item\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 1<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Explica por qu\u00e9 la luz visible es el principal motor energ\u00e9tico de los ecosistemas, mientras que el IR y UV no lo son.<\/p>\r\n                <button onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                <div id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display:none;\">Soluci\u00f3n: La luz visible (400-700 nm) es absorbida por los pigmentos fotosint\u00e9ticos (clorofila, carotenoides) y su energ\u00eda se transforma en energ\u00eda qu\u00edmica. El IR tiene menor energ\u00eda por fot\u00f3n y no puede excitar los electrones de los centros de reacci\u00f3n; el UV es da\u00f1ino y no es utilizado eficientemente en la fotos\u00edntesis.<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-item\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 2<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Predice el impacto ecol\u00f3gico de un aumento del 20% en radiaci\u00f3n UV-B debido a depleci\u00f3n de ozono en un ecosistema marino.<\/p>\r\n                <button onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(2)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                <div id=\"solucion2\" style=\"display:none;\">Respuesta: El aumento de UV-B reducir\u00eda la productividad del fitoplancton (da\u00f1o en ADN y fotosistemas), disminuyendo la base de la cadena tr\u00f3fica. Esto afectar\u00eda a consumidores y pesquer\u00edas, adem\u00e1s de aumentar la mortalidad de larvas de organismos marinos.<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-item\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 3<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Justifica por qu\u00e9 los organismos terrestres han desarrollado pigmentos que absorben principalmente en 400-700 nm.<\/p>\r\n                <button onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(3)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                <div id=\"solucion3\" style=\"display:none;\">La evoluci\u00f3n seleccion\u00f3 pigmentos que absorben en el rango de m\u00e1xima intensidad solar que llega a la superficie y que es menos da\u00f1ino. Adem\u00e1s, los fotones de luz visible tienen la energ\u00eda adecuada para excitar electrones sin romper enlaces qu\u00edmicos esenciales.<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== QUIZ AUTOEVALUADO ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-autoevaluado\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> Quiz de autoevaluaci\u00f3n\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n                <p><strong>1.<\/strong> \u00bfQu\u00e9 regi\u00f3n del espectro impulsa directamente la fotos\u00edntesis?<\/p>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"a\"> UV<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"b\"> Luz visible (PAR)<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"c\"> Infrarrojo<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n                <p><strong>2.<\/strong> El aumento de UV-B debido a la depleci\u00f3n de ozono afecta principalmente a:<\/p>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"a\"> La temperatura global<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"b\"> El ADN y la fotos\u00edntesis<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"c\"> Las mareas<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n                <p><strong>3.<\/strong> \u00bfQu\u00e9 rol cumple el infrarrojo en los ecosistemas?<\/p>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"a\"> Es la principal fuente de energ\u00eda para la fotos\u00edntesis<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"b\"> Contribuye al balance t\u00e9rmico y efecto invernadero<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"c\"> Es completamente absorbido por la atm\u00f3sfera sin efectos<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button onclick=\"evaluateQuiz()\">\ud83d\udcca Corregir quiz<\/button>\r\n            <div id=\"quizResult\" class=\"quiz-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== CIERRE METACOGNITIVO ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83e\udd14<\/span> Reflexi\u00f3n final\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"reflexion-box\">\r\n            <p><strong>Reflexiona sobre tu aprendizaje:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo cambia tu comprensi\u00f3n del flujo energ\u00e9tico al saber que solo una fracci\u00f3n estrecha del espectro solar es biol\u00f3gicamente \u00fatil?<\/li>\r\n                <li>\u00bfDe qu\u00e9 manera las perturbaciones antropog\u00e9nicas en la REM (ozono, gases invernadero) afectan la estabilidad ecosist\u00e9mica?<\/li>\r\n                <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategias usar\u00e1s para relacionar f\u00edsica de la radiaci\u00f3n con procesos ecol\u00f3gicos en futuros ex\u00e1menes?<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <textarea rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Escribe aqu\u00ed tu reflexi\u00f3n...\"><\/textarea>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"eval-sliders\">\r\n                <div class=\"eval-item\">\r\n                    <span>Comprensi\u00f3n del espectro REM<\/span>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" id=\"eval1\" oninput=\"updateEval(1,this.value)\">\r\n                    <span id=\"evalVal1\">3\/5<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"eval-item\">\r\n                    <span>Impactos ecol\u00f3gicos de la radiaci\u00f3n<\/span>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" id=\"eval2\" oninput=\"updateEval(2,this.value)\">\r\n                    <span id=\"evalVal2\">3\/5<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"eval-item\">\r\n                    <span>Relaci\u00f3n con fotos\u00edntesis y clima<\/span>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" id=\"eval3\" oninput=\"updateEval(3,this.value)\">\r\n                    <span id=\"evalVal3\">3\/5<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\ud83d\udcbe Guardar autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n            <div id=\"autoEvalFeedback\" class=\"auto-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 Recursos adicionales<\/h3>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><a href=\"https:\/\/earthobservatory.nasa.gov\/features\/Spectra\" target=\"_blank\">NASA: Espectro electromagn\u00e9tico<\/a><\/li>\r\n                <li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.epa.gov\/ozone-layer-protection\" target=\"_blank\">EPA: Capa de ozono<\/a><\/li>\r\n                <li><a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulations\/greenhouse\" target=\"_blank\">PhET: Efecto invernadero<\/a><\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ==================== JAVASCRIPT INTERACTIVO ==================== -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ==================== ESPECTRO INTERACTIVO ====================\r\n(function(){\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById(\"spectrumSVG\");\r\n    const cursor = document.getElementById(\"specCursor\");\r\n    const energyLabel = document.getElementById(\"specEnergy\");\r\n    const infoDiv = document.getElementById(\"specInfo\");\r\n    const zones = [\r\n        { xMin: 50, xMax: 150, name: \"Rayos Gamma\", energy: \"Extremadamente alta\", desc: \"Ionizan \u00e1tomos; letales para vida; bloqueados por atm\u00f3sfera.\" },\r\n        { xMin: 150, xMax: 250, name: \"Rayos X\", energy: \"Muy alta\", desc: \"Penetran tejidos; causa da\u00f1o celular grave; filtrados por atm\u00f3sfera.\" },\r\n        { xMin: 250, xMax: 350, name: \"Ultravioleta\", energy: \"Alta\", desc: \"UV-C absorbido por ozono; UV-B da\u00f1a ADN; UV-A causa estr\u00e9s oxidativo.\" },\r\n        { xMin: 350, xMax: 650, name: \"Luz visible (PAR)\", energy: \"Media\", desc: \"Impulsa fotos\u00edntesis; base de productividad primaria.\" },\r\n        { xMin: 650, xMax: 800, name: \"Infrarrojo\", energy: \"Baja\", desc: \"Calor; efecto invernadero; termorregulaci\u00f3n.\" },\r\n        { xMin: 800, xMax: 950, name: \"Radio\/Microondas\", energy: \"Muy baja\", desc: \"Comunicaci\u00f3n; poco impacto directo en organismos.\" }\r\n    ];\r\n    svg.addEventListener(\"mousemove\", (e) => {\r\n        const rect = svg.getBoundingClientRect();\r\n        const scaleX = svg.viewBox.baseVal.width \/ rect.width;\r\n        let x = (e.clientX - rect.left) * scaleX;\r\n        x = Math.min(950, Math.max(50, x));\r\n        cursor.setAttribute(\"cx\", x);\r\n        const zone = zones.find(z => x >= z.xMin && x <= z.xMax);\r\n        if (zone) {\r\n            energyLabel.textContent = zone.energy;\r\n            energyLabel.setAttribute(\"x\", x);\r\n            infoDiv.innerHTML = `<h4>${zone.name}<\/h4><p><strong>Energ\u00eda:<\/strong> ${zone.energy}<\/p><p>${zone.desc}<\/p>`;\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n})();\r\n\r\nfunction applyAtmosphere() {\r\n    const scenario = document.getElementById('atmScenario').value;\r\n    const atmInfo = document.getElementById('atmInfo');\r\n    let message = '';\r\n    if (scenario === 'normal') {\r\n        message = 'Escenario: Normal. Capa de ozono efectiva, UV-B reducida, IR estable.';\r\n    } else if (scenario === 'ozonoBajo') {\r\n        message = 'Escenario: Ozono bajo. Mayor penetraci\u00f3n UV-B y UV-C, riesgo mayor de da\u00f1o gen\u00e9tico.';\r\n    } else if (scenario === 'altaCO2') {\r\n        message = 'Escenario: Alto CO\u2082. Mayor absorci\u00f3n de IR, efecto invernadero acentuado, temperatura aumentada.';\r\n    }\r\n    atmInfo.textContent = message;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Efecto visual: ajustar color del cursor seg\u00fan intensidad de UV\/IR\r\n    const cursor = document.getElementById('specCursor');\r\n    const spectrum = document.getElementById('spectrumSVG');\r\n    if (scenario === 'ozonoBajo') {\r\n        cursor.setAttribute('fill', '#ff6b6b');\r\n        spectrum.style.filter = 'brightness(1.15) saturate(1.15)';\r\n    } else if (scenario === 'altaCO2') {\r\n        cursor.setAttribute('fill', '#ffc107');\r\n        spectrum.style.filter = 'hue-rotate(10deg) brightness(1.05)';\r\n    } else {\r\n        cursor.setAttribute('fill', '#ff0');\r\n        spectrum.style.filter = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Aplicar escenario por defecto al cargar\r\napplyAtmosphere();\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== SIMULADOR FOTOS\u00cdNTESIS ====================\r\nconst uvSlider = document.getElementById(\"uvSlider\");\r\nconst visSlider = document.getElementById(\"visSlider\");\r\nconst irSlider = document.getElementById(\"irSlider\");\r\nconst uvVal = document.getElementById(\"uvVal\");\r\nconst visVal = document.getElementById(\"visVal\");\r\nconst irVal = document.getElementById(\"irVal\");\r\nconst fill = document.getElementById(\"photoFill\");\r\nconst rateSpan = document.getElementById(\"photoRate\");\r\nconst feedbackDiv = document.getElementById(\"photoFeedback\");\r\n\r\nfunction updatePhotosynthesis() {\r\n    const uv = parseInt(uvSlider.value);\r\n    const vis = parseInt(visSlider.value);\r\n    const ir = parseInt(irSlider.value);\r\n    uvVal.textContent = uv;\r\n    visVal.textContent = vis;\r\n    irVal.textContent = ir;\r\n    let efficiency = vis * 0.9 - uv * 0.4 + ir * 0.1;\r\n    efficiency = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, efficiency));\r\n    fill.style.width = efficiency + \"%\";\r\n    rateSpan.textContent = Math.round(efficiency) + \"%\";\r\n    let msg = \"\";\r\n    if (uv > 60) msg += \"\u26a0\ufe0f Alto UV: inhibe fotos\u00edntesis y da\u00f1a ADN. \";\r\n    if (vis > 70) msg += \"\u2705 \u00d3ptima PAR: m\u00e1xima producci\u00f3n. \";\r\n    if (ir > 80) msg += \"\ud83d\udd25 Alto IR: estr\u00e9s t\u00e9rmico. \";\r\n    if (efficiency < 40) msg += \"\ud83c\udf31 Baja productividad ecosist\u00e9mica.\";\r\n    feedbackDiv.textContent = msg || \"Condiciones equilibradas para fotos\u00edntesis.\";\r\n}\r\nuvSlider.addEventListener(\"input\", updatePhotosynthesis);\r\nvisSlider.addEventListener(\"input\", updatePhotosynthesis);\r\nirSlider.addEventListener(\"input\", updatePhotosynthesis);\r\nupdatePhotosynthesis();\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== SIMULADOR DA\u00d1O UV ====================\r\nlet dnaDamage = 0;\r\nconst dnaFill = document.getElementById(\"dnaDamageFill\");\r\nconst dnaValue = document.getElementById(\"dnaDamageValue\");\r\nfunction addDamage() {\r\n    dnaDamage = Math.min(100, dnaDamage + Math.random() * 8);\r\n    dnaFill.style.width = dnaDamage + \"%\";\r\n    dnaValue.textContent = Math.floor(dnaDamage);\r\n    \/\/ Efecto visual en las bases\r\n    document.querySelectorAll(\".base\").forEach(base => {\r\n        base.style.backgroundColor = `rgba(255,0,0,${dnaDamage\/100})`;\r\n    });\r\n}\r\nwindow.resetDNADamage = function() {\r\n    dnaDamage = 0;\r\n    dnaFill.style.width = \"0%\";\r\n    dnaValue.textContent = \"0\";\r\n    document.querySelectorAll(\".base\").forEach(base => {\r\n        base.style.backgroundColor = \"rgba(0,255,255,0.2)\";\r\n    });\r\n};\r\nsetInterval(addDamage, 1500);\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== QUIZ ====================\r\nfunction evaluateQuiz() {\r\n    let score = 0;\r\n    if (document.querySelector('input[name=\"q1\"]:checked')?.value === \"b\") score++;\r\n    if (document.querySelector('input[name=\"q2\"]:checked')?.value === \"b\") score++;\r\n    if (document.querySelector('input[name=\"q3\"]:checked')?.value === \"b\") score++;\r\n    const resultDiv = document.getElementById(\"quizResult\");\r\n    if (score === 3) resultDiv.innerHTML = '<span class=\"success\">\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! 3\/3. Dominas la radiaci\u00f3n electromagn\u00e9tica.<\/span>';\r\n    else resultDiv.innerHTML = `<span class=\"error\">\ud83d\udcd8 Tienes ${score}\/3. Revisa el espectro y sus efectos ecol\u00f3gicos.<\/span>`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N ====================\r\nfunction updateEval(num, val) {\r\n    document.getElementById(`evalVal${num}`).innerText = val + \"\/5\";\r\n}\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const v1 = document.getElementById('eval1').value;\r\n    const v2 = document.getElementById('eval2').value;\r\n    const v3 = document.getElementById('eval3').value;\r\n    const promedio = ((parseInt(v1)+parseInt(v2)+parseInt(v3))\/3).toFixed(1);\r\n    document.getElementById('autoEvalFeedback').innerHTML = `\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada. Promedio: ${promedio}\/5. \u00a1Sigue explorando!`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== SOLUCIONES PROBLEMAS ====================\r\nfunction mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n    const div = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n    if (div.style.display === \"none\") div.style.display = \"block\";\r\n    else div.style.display = \"none\";\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 radiaci\u00f3n es esencial para la fotos\u00edntesis?","opciones":["Rayos X","Luz visible","Radio","Gamma"],"correcta":"Luz visible"},{"pregunta":"Velocidad de la luz en el vac\u00edo","opciones":["3\u00d710\u2076 m\/s","3\u00d710\u2078 m\/s","3\u00d710\u00b9\u2070 m\/s","Variable"],"correcta":"3\u00d710\u2078 m\/s"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 banda da\u00f1a el ADN del fitoplancton?","opciones":["IR","UV-B","Microondas","Radio"],"correcta":"UV-B"},{"pregunta":"La clorofila refleja principalmente...","opciones":["400 nm","550 nm","700 nm","1000 nm"],"correcta":"550 nm"},{"pregunta":"Si \u03bb = 600 nm, la frecuencia es...","opciones":["5\u00d710\u00b9\u2074 Hz","6\u00d710\u00b9\u2074 Hz","4\u00d710\u00b9\u2074 Hz","7\u00d710\u00b9\u2074 Hz"],"correcta":"5\u00d710\u00b9\u2074 Hz"},{"pregunta":"Abejas ven en...","opciones":["IR","UV","Gamma","Radio"],"correcta":"UV"},{"pregunta":"El efecto invernadero atrapa...","opciones":["UV","Visible","Infrarrojo","Gamma"],"correcta":"Infrarrojo"},{"pregunta":"Mayor energ\u00eda del visible","opciones":["Rojo","Verde","Azul-violeta","Amarillo"],"correcta":"Azul-violeta"},{"pregunta":"NDVI usa bandas...","opciones":["UV y azul","Rojo e IR cercano","Microondas","Rayos X"],"correcta":"Rojo e IR cercano"},{"pregunta":"Radiaci\u00f3n ionizante","opciones":["Radio","UV\/X\/Gamma","Visible","IR"],"correcta":"UV\/X\/Gamma"},{"pregunta":"Luz m\u00e1s penetrante en oc\u00e9ano","opciones":["UV","Azul","Roja","IR"],"correcta":"Azul"},{"pregunta":"Serpientes detectan presas con...","opciones":["UV","Infrarrojo","Sonido","Vibraci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Infrarrojo"},{"pregunta":"El cielo es azul por...","opciones":["Absorci\u00f3n","Dispersi\u00f3n","Reflexi\u00f3n","Emisi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Dispersi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Control remoto usa...","opciones":["UV","IR","Visible","Radio"],"correcta":"IR"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda aumenta cuando...","opciones":["\u03bb aumenta","f aumenta","Amplitud aumenta","Velocidad baja"],"correcta":"f aumenta"},{"pregunta":"Pico de emisi\u00f3n solar","opciones":["UV","Visible","IR","Radio"],"correcta":"Visible"},{"pregunta":"Longitud de onda roja","opciones":["400 nm","550 nm","700 nm","1000 nm"],"correcta":"700 nm"},{"pregunta":"Agujero de ozono aumenta...","opciones":["Visible","UV-B","IR","X"],"correcta":"UV-B"},{"pregunta":"Microondas se usan en...","opciones":["Cocina","Fotos\u00edntesis","Visi\u00f3n","Radioterapia"],"correcta":"Cocina"},{"pregunta":"Fitoplancton es sensible a...","opciones":["IR","UV","Visible","Radio"],"correcta":"UV"},{"pregunta":"Plantas reflejan verde porque...","opciones":["La absorben","La rechazan","No tienen clorofila","Es da\u00f1ina"],"correcta":"La rechazan"},{"pregunta":"Radiaci\u00f3n con mayor frecuencia","opciones":["Radio","Microondas","UV","Gamma"],"correcta":"Gamma"},{"pregunta":"Efecto invernadero atrapa...","opciones":["UV","Visible","IR","Gamma"],"correcta":"IR"},{"pregunta":"Si \u03bb = 500 nm, f es...","opciones":["6\u00d710\u00b9\u2074 Hz","5\u00d710\u00b9\u2074 Hz","3\u00d710\u2078 Hz","500 Hz"],"correcta":"6\u00d710\u00b9\u2074 Hz"},{"pregunta":"Radio sirve para...","opciones":["Comunicaci\u00f3n","Fotos\u00edntesis","Visi\u00f3n","Termorregulaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Comunicaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"La luz azul tiene m\u00e1s energ\u00eda porque...","opciones":["\u03bb mayor","f mayor","A mayor","c mayor"],"correcta":"f mayor"},{"pregunta":"NDVI usa...","opciones":["UV y visible","Rojo e IR cercano","Microondas","Gamma"],"correcta":"Rojo e IR cercano"},{"pregunta":"Gamma tiene longitud...","opciones":["Mayor que visible","Menor que UV","Entre visible\/IR","Igual a radio"],"correcta":"Menor que UV"},{"pregunta":"Sat\u00e9lites miden temperatura con...","opciones":["UV","IR t\u00e9rmico","Radio","X"],"correcta":"IR t\u00e9rmico"},{"pregunta":"Radiaci\u00f3n m\u00e1s penetrante","opciones":["UV","X","Visible","IR"],"correcta":"X"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"movimientos-tierra","titulo":"Movimientos de la Tierra: El Ritmo C\u00f3smico que Moldea Clima, Estaciones y Vida","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-movimientos-tierra\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== CABECERA CYBERPUNK ==================== -->\r\n    <div class=\"earth-header\">\r\n        <div class=\"header-badges\">\r\n            <span class=\"materia-badge\">\ud83c\udf0d ECOSISTEMAS<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"nivel-badge\">\u26a1 NIVEL AVANZADO<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"tiempo-badge\">\u23f1\ufe0f 50 MIN<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> Movimientos de la Tierra\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"leccion-subtitulo\">Rotaci\u00f3n \u2022 Traslaci\u00f3n \u2022 Inclinaci\u00f3n axial \u2022 Ciclos de Milankovitch<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== OBJETIVOS R\u00c1PIDOS ==================== -->\r\n    <div class=\"objetivos-rapidos\">\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n                <h4>Comprender los movimientos<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Rotaci\u00f3n, traslaci\u00f3n, precesi\u00f3n y nutaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83c\udf21\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n                <h4>Explicar las estaciones<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Rol de la inclinaci\u00f3n axial y distribuci\u00f3n solar<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"obj-icon\">\u2744\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n                <h4>Analizar ciclos glaciales<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Ciclos de Milankovitch y su impacto ecol\u00f3gico<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== CONTEXTO REAL ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83c\udf0e<\/span> Contexto real\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"context-card\">\r\n            <p>Los movimientos de la Tierra determinan la cantidad y distribuci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda solar que recibe cada regi\u00f3n, dando lugar a climas diferenciados, estaciones del a\u00f1o, ritmos biol\u00f3gicos (circadianos, migraciones, floraciones) y ciclos glaciales que han moldeado la evoluci\u00f3n de las especies. Comprenderlos es esencial para explicar desde la fenolog\u00eda hasta el cambio clim\u00e1tico actual.<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"real-data\">\r\n                <span class=\"data-tag\">\ud83c\udf1e Fenolog\u00eda<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"data-tag\">\ud83d\udc26 Migraciones<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"data-tag\">\u2744\ufe0f Glaciaciones<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"desarrollo-teorico\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> Principales movimientos de la Tierra\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"table-wrapper\">\r\n            <table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr><th>Movimiento<\/th><th>Periodo<\/th><th>Efecto f\u00edsico<\/th><th>Impacto ecol\u00f3gico<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr><td>Rotaci\u00f3n<\/td><td>23 h 56 min<\/td><td>D\u00eda\/noche<\/td><td>Ritmos circadianos, fotos\u00edntesis diaria<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>Traslaci\u00f3n + inclinaci\u00f3n axial<\/td><td>365.25 d\u00edas<\/td><td>Estaciones<\/td><td>Fenolog\u00eda, migraciones, reproducci\u00f3n<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>Precesi\u00f3n<\/td><td>\u2248 25 772 a\u00f1os<\/td><td>Desplazamiento equinoccios<\/td><td>Ciclos glaciales (Milankovitch)<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>Nutaci\u00f3n<\/td><td>18.6 a\u00f1os<\/td><td>Oscilaci\u00f3n axial<\/td><td>Ajustes en modelos paleoclim\u00e1ticos<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <h3 class=\"subsection-title\">\ud83c\udf1e Rotaci\u00f3n: el pulso diario<\/h3>\r\n        <p>La rotaci\u00f3n sobre el eje inclinado (23.44\u00b0) genera alternancia d\u00eda-noche, creando ciclos de luz y temperatura que regulan procesos fisiol\u00f3gicos: ritmos circadianos, apertura estom\u00e1tica, patrones de actividad animal.<\/p>\r\n\r\n        <h3 class=\"subsection-title\">\ud83c\udf0d Traslaci\u00f3n e inclinaci\u00f3n axial: las estaciones<\/h3>\r\n        <p>La \u00f3rbita el\u00edptica combinada con la inclinaci\u00f3n axial causa variaci\u00f3n estacional en la insolaci\u00f3n. <strong>\u00a1Importante!<\/strong> Las estaciones no se deben a cambios en la distancia Tierra-Sol (variaci\u00f3n < 3%), sino al \u00e1ngulo de incidencia y duraci\u00f3n del d\u00eda.<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"formula-center\">\r\n            \\[ \\text{Oblicuidad} = 23.44^\\circ \\]\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <h3 class=\"subsection-title\">\ud83d\udd04 Precesi\u00f3n y nutaci\u00f3n: ciclos largos (Milankovitch)<\/h3>\r\n        <p>Los ciclos de Milankovitch explican la alternancia entre periodos glaciales e interglaciares:<\/p>\r\n        <ul class=\"neon-list\">\r\n            <li><strong>Precesi\u00f3n:<\/strong> 26 000 a\u00f1os (desplazamiento de los equinoccios)<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Oblicuidad:<\/strong> 41 000 a\u00f1os (variaci\u00f3n de la inclinaci\u00f3n axial)<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Excentricidad:<\/strong> 100 000 a\u00f1os (forma de la \u00f3rbita)<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <p>Estos cambios modulan la insolaci\u00f3n estacional en altas latitudes, desencadenando avances y retrocesos glaciares.<\/p>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO MEJORADO ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulador-orbital\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83e\ude90<\/span> Simulador: Efecto de la inclinaci\u00f3n axial y ciclos de Milankovitch\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <p>Ajusta la inclinaci\u00f3n axial y la intensidad de los ciclos de Milankovitch para observar cambios en las estaciones y el clima global.<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"orbital-sim\">\r\n            <div class=\"control-panel\">\r\n                <label>Inclinaci\u00f3n axial: <span id=\"tiltValue\">23.44<\/span>\u00b0<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"tiltSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"90\" value=\"23.44\" step=\"0.1\">\r\n                <label>Intensidad ciclos Milankovitch: <span id=\"milankValue\">50<\/span>%<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"milankSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"50\">\r\n                <label>Velocidad orbital: <span id=\"speedValue\">1.0<\/span>x<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"speedSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"3\" value=\"1\" step=\"0.1\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"orbit-visual\">\r\n                <svg id=\"orbitSVG\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 500\">\r\n                    <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"250\" r=\"45\" fill=\"#ffb300\" filter=\"url(#glowSun)\"\/>\r\n                    <ellipse cx=\"450\" cy=\"250\" rx=\"300\" ry=\"180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0ff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 6\"\/>\r\n                    <g id=\"earthGroup\">\r\n                        <circle r=\"22\" fill=\"#2196f3\"\/>\r\n                        <line id=\"axisLine\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"-35\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"35\" stroke=\"#ff00ff\" stroke-width=\"5\"\/>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n                <div class=\"sim-feedback\" id=\"simFeedback\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== DIAGRAMA DE INSOLACI\u00d3N ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"insolacion\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udcc8<\/span> Insolaci\u00f3n estacional seg\u00fan latitud\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <p>La inclinaci\u00f3n axial determina la energ\u00eda solar que recibe cada hemisferio a lo largo del a\u00f1o.<\/p>\r\n        <canvas id=\"insolationCanvas\" width=\"800\" height=\"300\" style=\"background:#000; border-radius:16px;\"><\/canvas>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== ERRORES COMUNES INTERACTIVOS ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-comunes\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> Errores comunes (\u00a1ev\u00edtalos!)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('expandido')\">\r\n                <strong>\u274c Creer que las estaciones se deben a la distancia Tierra-Sol<\/strong>\r\n                <div class=\"error-detail\">La variaci\u00f3n de distancia es solo del 3%. La causa real es la inclinaci\u00f3n axial y la duraci\u00f3n del d\u00eda.<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('expandido')\">\r\n                <strong>\u274c Confundir d\u00eda sideral con d\u00eda solar<\/strong>\r\n                <div class=\"error-detail\">D\u00eda sideral: 23h56min (respecto estrellas). D\u00eda solar: 24h (respecto Sol).<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('expandido')\">\r\n                <strong>\u274c Ignorar el rol de la precesi\u00f3n en ciclos glaciales<\/strong>\r\n                <div class=\"error-detail\">La precesi\u00f3n, junto con la oblicuidad y excentricidad, forma parte de los ciclos de Milankovitch.<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== CONEXI\u00d3N CURRICULAR ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"curricular\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udcd8<\/span> V\u00ednculo con el programa oficial\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"curricular-content\">\r\n            <p><strong>Competencias:<\/strong> Explica los movimientos de la Tierra y sus consecuencias en la distribuci\u00f3n de la energ\u00eda solar, el clima y los ecosistemas.<\/p>\r\n            <p><strong>Contenidos:<\/strong> Rotaci\u00f3n, traslaci\u00f3n, inclinaci\u00f3n axial, estaciones, ciclos de Milankovitch, ritmos biol\u00f3gicos.<\/p>\r\n            <p><strong>Evaluaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Identificaci\u00f3n de causas de las estaciones, an\u00e1lisis de gr\u00e1ficos de insolaci\u00f3n, interpretaci\u00f3n de ciclos paleoclim\u00e1ticos.<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"problemas-examen\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> Problemas tipo examen\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"problema-lista\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-item\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 1<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Explica por qu\u00e9 en el hemisferio sur el verano ocurre cuando la Tierra est\u00e1 m\u00e1s cerca del Sol (perihelio).<\/p>\r\n                <button onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                <div id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display:none;\">El perihelio ocurre alrededor del 4 de enero. En esa fecha, el hemisferio sur est\u00e1 inclinado hacia el Sol, recibiendo m\u00e1s radiaci\u00f3n a pesar de la menor distancia; el efecto de la inclinaci\u00f3n domina sobre la distancia.<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-item\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 2<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Predice las consecuencias ecol\u00f3gicas si la inclinaci\u00f3n axial fuera 0\u00b0.<\/p>\r\n                <button onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(2)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                <div id=\"solucion2\" style=\"display:none;\">No habr\u00eda estaciones. La luz solar ser\u00eda constante durante todo el a\u00f1o en cada latitud, eliminando ritmos estacionales (floraci\u00f3n, migraciones, hibernaci\u00f3n). Los ecosistemas se homogeneizar\u00edan, reduciendo la biodiversidad.<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-item\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 3<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Relaciona los ciclos de Milankovitch con la alternancia de periodos glaciales e interglaciares en el Cuaternario.<\/p>\r\n                <button onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(3)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                <div id=\"solucion3\" style=\"display:none;\">Las variaciones en excentricidad, oblicuidad y precesi\u00f3n modifican la insolaci\u00f3n estacional en latitudes altas, desencadenando avances o retrocesos glaciares. Los m\u00ednimos de insolaci\u00f3n estival favorecen la acumulaci\u00f3n de hielo, dando lugar a glaciaciones.<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== QUIZ AUTOEVALUADO ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-autoevaluado\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> Quiz de autoevaluaci\u00f3n\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n                <p><strong>1.<\/strong> \u00bfQu\u00e9 causa principalmente las estaciones?<\/p>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"a\"> Distancia Tierra-Sol<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"b\"> Inclinaci\u00f3n axial<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"c\"> Rotaci\u00f3n terrestre<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n                <p><strong>2.<\/strong> Los ciclos de Milankovitch influyen principalmente en:<\/p>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"a\"> Ritmos circadianos<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"b\"> Eras glaciales<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"c\"> Fotos\u00edntesis diaria<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n                <p><strong>3.<\/strong> Sin inclinaci\u00f3n axial (0\u00b0), las estaciones:<\/p>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"a\"> Desaparecer\u00edan<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"b\"> Ser\u00edan m\u00e1s extremas<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"c\"> Depender\u00edan solo de la distancia<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button onclick=\"evaluateQuiz()\">\ud83d\udcca Corregir quiz<\/button>\r\n            <div id=\"quizResult\" class=\"quiz-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== CIERRE METACOGNITIVO ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83e\udd14<\/span> Reflexi\u00f3n y autoevaluaci\u00f3n\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"reflexion-box\">\r\n            <p><strong>Preguntas para reflexionar:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo cambiar\u00eda tu percepci\u00f3n del clima si supieras que los ciclos de Milankovitch han causado glaciaciones recurrentes?<\/li>\r\n                <li>\u00bfDe qu\u00e9 manera los movimientos terrestres han influido en la evoluci\u00f3n de estrategias reproductivas y migratorias?<\/li>\r\n                <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategias usar\u00e1s para diferenciar causas f\u00edsicas de las estaciones en futuros ex\u00e1menes?<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <textarea rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Escribe aqu\u00ed tu reflexi\u00f3n...\"><\/textarea>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"eval-sliders\">\r\n                <div class=\"eval-item\">\r\n                    <span>Comprensi\u00f3n de rotaci\u00f3n y traslaci\u00f3n<\/span>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" id=\"eval1\" oninput=\"updateEval(1,this.value)\">\r\n                    <span id=\"evalVal1\">3\/5<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"eval-item\">\r\n                    <span>Interpretaci\u00f3n de estaciones e inclinaci\u00f3n axial<\/span>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" id=\"eval2\" oninput=\"updateEval(2,this.value)\">\r\n                    <span id=\"evalVal2\">3\/5<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"eval-item\">\r\n                    <span>Ciclos de Milankovitch y clima global<\/span>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" id=\"eval3\" oninput=\"updateEval(3,this.value)\">\r\n                    <span id=\"evalVal3\">3\/5<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\ud83d\udcbe Guardar autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n            <div id=\"autoEvalFeedback\" class=\"auto-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 Recursos adicionales<\/h3>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><a href=\"https:\/\/climate.nasa.gov\/faq\/42\/what-is-the-role-of-earths-orbit-in-climate-change\/\" target=\"_blank\">NASA: \u00d3rbita y cambio clim\u00e1tico<\/a><\/li>\r\n                <li><a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulations\/earths-orbital-simulator\" target=\"_blank\">PhET: Simulador orbital<\/a><\/li>\r\n                <li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.britannica.com\/science\/Milankovitch-cycles\" target=\"_blank\">Britannica: Ciclos de Milankovitch<\/a><\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- Importa estilos desde assets\/css\/leccion-movimientos-tierra.css -->\r\n<!-- <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"assets\/css\/leccion-movimientos-tierra.css\"> -->\r\n\r\n<!-- ==================== JAVASCRIPT INTERACTIVO ==================== -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ==================== SIMULADOR ORBITAL ====================\r\nconst earthGroup = document.getElementById(\"earthGroup\");\r\nconst axisLine = document.getElementById(\"axisLine\");\r\nconst tiltSlider = document.getElementById(\"tiltSlider\");\r\nconst tiltValue = document.getElementById(\"tiltValue\");\r\nconst milankSlider = document.getElementById(\"milankSlider\");\r\nconst milankValue = document.getElementById(\"milankValue\");\r\nconst speedSlider = document.getElementById(\"speedSlider\");\r\nconst speedValue = document.getElementById(\"speedValue\");\r\nconst feedbackDiv = document.getElementById(\"simFeedback\");\r\n\r\nlet angle = 0;\r\nlet speed = 1;\r\n\r\nfunction updateSimulation() {\r\n    const tilt = parseFloat(tiltSlider.value);\r\n    const milank = parseFloat(milankSlider.value);\r\n    tiltValue.textContent = tilt.toFixed(1);\r\n    milankValue.textContent = milank;\r\n    axisLine.setAttribute(\"transform\", `rotate(${tilt})`);\r\n\r\n    let climate = \"\";\r\n    if (tilt < 10) climate = \"\ud83c\udf0d Inclinaci\u00f3n baja: estaciones casi inexistentes. Climas ecuatoriales globales.\";\r\n    else if (tilt > 40) climate = \"\ud83d\udd25 Inclinaci\u00f3n alta: estaciones extremas, polos con 6 meses de luz\/oscuridad.\";\r\n    else climate = \"\ud83c\udf3f Inclinaci\u00f3n moderada: estaciones bien marcadas, zonas templadas biodiversas.\";\r\n\r\n    if (milank < 30) climate += \"  Periodo interglacial c\u00e1lido.\";\r\n    if (milank > 70) climate += \"  Era glacial: expansi\u00f3n de casquetes polares.\";\r\n\r\n    feedbackDiv.textContent = climate;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction animate() {\r\n    speed = parseFloat(speedSlider.value) || 1;\r\n    speedValue.textContent = speed.toFixed(1);\r\n    angle += 0.003 * speed;\r\n    const x = 450 + 280 * Math.cos(angle);\r\n    const y = 250 + 160 * Math.sin(angle);\r\n    earthGroup.setAttribute(\"transform\", `translate(${x},${y})`);\r\n    requestAnimationFrame(animate);\r\n}\r\n\r\ntiltSlider.addEventListener(\"input\", updateSimulation);\r\nmilankSlider.addEventListener(\"input\", updateSimulation);\r\nspeedSlider.addEventListener(\"input\", () => { speed = parseFloat(speedSlider.value); speedValue.textContent = speed.toFixed(1); });\r\nupdateSimulation();\r\nanimate();\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== INSOLACI\u00d3N ====================\r\nconst canvas = document.getElementById(\"insolationCanvas\");\r\nif (canvas) {\r\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext(\"2d\");\r\n    function drawInsolation() {\r\n        const width = canvas.width, height = canvas.height;\r\n        ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\r\n        ctx.strokeStyle = \"#0ff\";\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = \"#0ff\";\r\n        ctx.font = \"12px monospace\";\r\n        \/\/ Ejes\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        ctx.moveTo(50, 20); ctx.lineTo(50, height-30); ctx.lineTo(width-30, height-30);\r\n        ctx.stroke();\r\n        ctx.fillText(\"Latitud\", width-50, height-15);\r\n        ctx.save();\r\n        ctx.translate(25, 150);\r\n        ctx.rotate(-Math.PI\/2);\r\n        ctx.fillText(\"Insolaci\u00f3n relativa\", 0, 0);\r\n        ctx.restore();\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Curvas para solsticios y equinoccios\r\n        const latitudes = [];\r\n        for (let lat = -90; lat <= 90; lat += 5) {\r\n            latitudes.push(lat);\r\n        }\r\n        const solsticeJune = latitudes.map(lat => Math.max(0, Math.cos((lat-23.44)*Math.PI\/180)));\r\n        const solsticeDec = latitudes.map(lat => Math.max(0, Math.cos((lat+23.44)*Math.PI\/180)));\r\n        const equinox = latitudes.map(lat => Math.max(0, Math.cos(lat*Math.PI\/180)));\r\n\r\n        function drawCurve(data, color, label, yOffset) {\r\n            ctx.beginPath();\r\n            ctx.strokeStyle = color;\r\n            for (let i=0; i<data.length; i++) {\r\n                let x = 50 + (latitudes[i] + 90) \/ 180 * (width-80);\r\n                let y = height-30 - data[i] * (height-60);\r\n                if (i===0) ctx.moveTo(x,y);\r\n                else ctx.lineTo(x,y);\r\n            }\r\n            ctx.stroke();\r\n            ctx.fillStyle = color;\r\n            ctx.fillText(label, width-100, yOffset);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        drawCurve(solsticeJune, \"#ff6b6b\", \"Solsticio junio (verano NH)\", 30);\r\n        drawCurve(solsticeDec, \"#6bff6b\", \"Solsticio diciembre (invierno NH)\", 50);\r\n        drawCurve(equinox, \"#ffff6b\", \"Equinoccios\", 70);\r\n    }\r\n    drawInsolation();\r\n    window.addEventListener(\"resize\", drawInsolation);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== QUIZ ====================\r\nfunction evaluateQuiz() {\r\n    let score = 0;\r\n    if (document.querySelector('input[name=\"q1\"]:checked')?.value === \"b\") score++;\r\n    if (document.querySelector('input[name=\"q2\"]:checked')?.value === \"b\") score++;\r\n    if (document.querySelector('input[name=\"q3\"]:checked')?.value === \"a\") score++;\r\n    const resultDiv = document.getElementById(\"quizResult\");\r\n    if (score === 3) resultDiv.innerHTML = '<span class=\"success\">\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! 3\/3. Dominas los movimientos terrestres.<\/span>';\r\n    else resultDiv.innerHTML = `<span class=\"error\">\ud83d\udcd8 Tienes ${score}\/3. Revisa la inclinaci\u00f3n axial y los ciclos de Milankovitch.<\/span>`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N ====================\r\nfunction updateEval(num, val) {\r\n    document.getElementById(`evalVal${num}`).innerText = val + \"\/5\";\r\n}\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const v1 = document.getElementById('eval1').value;\r\n    const v2 = document.getElementById('eval2').value;\r\n    const v3 = document.getElementById('eval3').value;\r\n    const promedio = ((parseInt(v1)+parseInt(v2)+parseInt(v3))\/3).toFixed(1);\r\n    document.getElementById('autoEvalFeedback').innerHTML = `\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada. Promedio: ${promedio}\/5. \u00a1Sigue explorando!`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== SOLUCIONES PROBLEMAS ====================\r\nfunction mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n    const div = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n    if (div.style.display === \"none\") div.style.display = \"block\";\r\n    else div.style.display = \"none\";\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"El d\u00eda y la noche son causados por...","opciones":["Rotaci\u00f3n","Traslaci\u00f3n","Precesi\u00f3n","Nutaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Rotaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"La causa principal de las estaciones es...","opciones":["Distancia al Sol","Inclinaci\u00f3n axial","Precesi\u00f3n","Velocidad orbital"],"correcta":"Inclinaci\u00f3n axial"},{"pregunta":"Duraci\u00f3n del d\u00eda sideral...","opciones":["24 h","23 h 56 min 4 s","25 h","23 h"],"correcta":"23 h 56 min 4 s"},{"pregunta":"La estrella polar actual es...","opciones":["Vega","Sirio","Polaris","Aldebar\u00e1n"],"correcta":"Polaris"},{"pregunta":"Per\u00edodo de precesi\u00f3n...","opciones":["1 a\u00f1o","18.6 a\u00f1os","25 772 a\u00f1os","100 000 a\u00f1os"],"correcta":"25 772 a\u00f1os"},{"pregunta":"Per\u00edodo de nutaci\u00f3n...","opciones":["24 h","1 a\u00f1o","18.6 a\u00f1os","26 000 a\u00f1os"],"correcta":"18.6 a\u00f1os"},{"pregunta":"La migraci\u00f3n monarca se debe a...","opciones":["Precesi\u00f3n","Rotaci\u00f3n","Estaciones","Nutaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Estaciones"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l no es un movimiento terrestre?","opciones":["Rotaci\u00f3n","Traslaci\u00f3n","Precesi\u00f3n","Expansi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Expansi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"La oblicuidad actual es...","opciones":["10\u00b0","23.44\u00b0","40\u00b0","5\u00b0"],"correcta":"23.44\u00b0"},{"pregunta":"El ciclo de 41 000 a\u00f1os corresponde a...","opciones":["Precesi\u00f3n","Oblicuidad","Nutaci\u00f3n","Rotaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Oblicuidad"},{"pregunta":"Estrella polar dentro de 12 000 a\u00f1os...","opciones":["Polaris","Vega","Betelgeuse","Rigel"],"correcta":"Vega"},{"pregunta":"Movimiento responsable de ritmos circadianos...","opciones":["Traslaci\u00f3n","Rotaci\u00f3n","Nutaci\u00f3n","Precesi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Rotaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Excentricidad orbital actual...","opciones":["0.5","0.0167","1","0"],"correcta":"0.0167"},{"pregunta":"El eje terrestre traza un cono por...","opciones":["Rotaci\u00f3n","Traslaci\u00f3n","Precesi\u00f3n","Nutaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Precesi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"La nutaci\u00f3n es causada por...","opciones":["Sol","Luna","J\u00fapiter","Viento solar"],"correcta":"Luna"},{"pregunta":"La energ\u00eda solar var\u00eda estacionalmente porque...","opciones":["La \u00f3rbita es circular","Hay inclinaci\u00f3n axial","El Sol cambia tama\u00f1o","La Luna bloquea luz"],"correcta":"Hay inclinaci\u00f3n axial"},{"pregunta":"El a\u00f1o bisiesto existe porque...","opciones":["El d\u00eda dura m\u00e1s","El a\u00f1o tr\u00f3pico no es exacto","La Luna empuja","La nutaci\u00f3n cambia d\u00edas"],"correcta":"El a\u00f1o tr\u00f3pico no es exacto"},{"pregunta":"La duraci\u00f3n del d\u00eda depende de...","opciones":["Traslaci\u00f3n","Rotaci\u00f3n","Nutaci\u00f3n","Oblicuidad"],"correcta":"Rotaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Las estaciones afectan...","opciones":["Migraciones","Hibernaci\u00f3n","Floraci\u00f3n","Todas"],"correcta":"Todas"},{"pregunta":"Un ejemplo de especie nocturna...","opciones":["Gallina","B\u00faho","Vaca","Gato dom\u00e9stico"],"correcta":"B\u00faho"},{"pregunta":"Eje inclinado genera...","opciones":["Estaciones","Ciclos glaciales","D\u00eda fijo","Lluvias"],"correcta":"Estaciones"},{"pregunta":"Movimiento con m\u00e1s influencia en eras glaciales...","opciones":["Rotaci\u00f3n","Traslaci\u00f3n","Excentricidad","Nutaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Excentricidad"},{"pregunta":"La excentricidad var\u00eda cada...","opciones":["18.6 a\u00f1os","41 000 a\u00f1os","100 000 a\u00f1os","10 a\u00f1os"],"correcta":"100 000 a\u00f1os"},{"pregunta":"El Sol est\u00e1 m\u00e1s cerca en...","opciones":["Julio","Enero","Septiembre","Marzo"],"correcta":"Enero"},{"pregunta":"Las estaciones en hemisferio sur son...","opciones":["Iguales","Opuestas","Sincronizadas con norte","Aleatorias"],"correcta":"Opuestas"},{"pregunta":"El \u00e1ngulo entre eje y plano orbital se llama...","opciones":["Excentricidad","Oblicuidad","Perigeo","Longitud"],"correcta":"Oblicuidad"},{"pregunta":"Las eras glaciales coinciden con variaciones de...","opciones":["Luz visible","\u00d3rbita terrestre","Cometas","Erupciones"],"correcta":"\u00d3rbita terrestre"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 controla la fotos\u00edntesis diaria?","opciones":["Nutaci\u00f3n","Rotaci\u00f3n","Precesi\u00f3n","Excentricidad"],"correcta":"Rotaci\u00f3n"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"respiracion-celular","titulo":"Respiraci\u00f3n Celular: El N\u00facleo Energ\u00e9tico de la Vida (Cyberpunk Edition)","contenido":"\r\n<div class=\"leccion-respiracion\" role=\"main\" aria-label=\"Lecci\u00f3n: Respiraci\u00f3n Celular\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"resp-header\">\r\n        <div class=\"header-badges\">\r\n            <span class=\"materia-badge\">\u26a1 ECOSISTEMAS<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"nivel-badge\">\ud83e\uddec NIVEL AVANZADO<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"tiempo-badge\">\u23f1\ufe0f 60 MIN<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion\"><span class=\"neon-icon\">\ud83d\udd25<\/span> Respiraci\u00f3n Celular<\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"leccion-subtitulo\">De la glucosa al ATP: la danza molecular que sostiene la vida<\/p>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- OBJETIVOS CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <section class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"obj-card\"><div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/div><div><strong>Comprender<\/strong> las etapas y su l\u00f3gica energ\u00e9tica.<\/div><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"obj-card\"><div class=\"obj-icon\">\u26a1<\/div><div><strong>Comparar<\/strong> respiraci\u00f3n aer\u00f3bica y fermentaci\u00f3n.<\/div><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"obj-card\"><div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83e\uddec<\/div><div><strong>Relacionar<\/strong> con el flujo de energ\u00eda en ecosistemas.<\/div><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"obj-card\"><div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83e\uddbe<\/div><div><strong>Aplicar<\/strong> el conocimiento en simulaciones y retos gamificados.<\/div><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"obj-card\"><div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/div><div><strong>Explorar<\/strong> aplicaciones biotecnol\u00f3gicas y m\u00e9dicas.<\/div><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"obj-card\"><div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83d\udcdc<\/div><div><strong>Conectar<\/strong> con la historia y evoluci\u00f3n del concepto.<\/div><\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- INTRODUCCI\u00d3N MOTIVADORA Y CONTEXTO HIST\u00d3RICO -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion\">\r\n        <h2>\ud83c\udf0c \u00bfPor qu\u00e9 importa?<\/h2>\r\n        <p>Imagina una ciudad cyberpunk: luces, movimiento, energ\u00eda. Cada c\u00e9lula es una metr\u00f3polis viva, y la <strong>respiraci\u00f3n celular<\/strong> es su planta de energ\u00eda. Sin ella, no hay vida, solo oscuridad molecular.<\/p>\r\n        <ul class=\"ejemplos-reales\">\r\n            <li>\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Movimiento<\/strong>: tus m\u00fasculos usan ATP generado aqu\u00ed.<\/li>\r\n            <li>\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Pensamiento<\/strong>: tu cerebro consume el 20% de tu energ\u00eda.<\/li>\r\n            <li>\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Ciclo del carbono<\/strong>: conecta la vida con la atm\u00f3sfera.<\/li>\r\n            <li>\ud83e\udda0 <strong>Biotecnolog\u00eda<\/strong>: la respiraci\u00f3n celular es clave en la producci\u00f3n de f\u00e1rmacos y biocombustibles.<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <blockquote class=\"definicion\">La respiraci\u00f3n celular transforma la energ\u00eda qu\u00edmica de la glucosa en ATP, la moneda energ\u00e9tica universal.<\/blockquote>\r\n        <div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n            <strong>Historia:<\/strong> El concepto de respiraci\u00f3n celular evolucion\u00f3 desde las primeras observaciones de Pasteur sobre la fermentaci\u00f3n hasta la elucidaci\u00f3n de la cadena de transporte de electrones en el siglo XX.\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO Y VISUAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion\">\r\n        <h2>\ud83d\udcda Etapas y l\u00f3gica energ\u00e9tica<\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"teoria-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"card-concepto\">\r\n                <h3>Glic\u00f3lisis<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Ocurre en el citosol. Rompe la glucosa (6C) en 2 piruvatos (3C). Produce 2 ATP y 2 NADH. Es universal y puede funcionar sin ox\u00edgeno.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"card-concepto\">\r\n                <h3>Ciclo de Krebs<\/h3>\r\n                <p>En la matriz mitocondrial. Cada piruvato se convierte en CO\u2082, generando NADH, FADH\u2082 y 2 ATP. Es el centro metab\u00f3lico de la c\u00e9lula.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"card-concepto\">\r\n                <h3>Cadena de transporte de electrones (ETC)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>En la membrana interna mitocondrial. Los electrones de NADH y FADH\u2082 crean un gradiente de H\u207a, que impulsa la <strong>ATP sintasa<\/strong> para producir hasta 34 ATP. El O\u2082 es el aceptor final y se convierte en agua.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"formula-center\">\r\n            <p>Ecuaci\u00f3n global:<\/p>\r\n            <span>\\( \\ce{C6H12O6 + 6O2 -> 6CO2 + 6H2O + 36-38 ATP} \\)<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"table-wrapper\">\r\n            <table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n                <thead><tr><th>Etapa<\/th><th>Ubicaci\u00f3n<\/th><th>ATP neto<\/th><\/tr><\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr><td>Glic\u00f3lisis<\/td><td>Citosol<\/td><td>2<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>Ciclo de Krebs<\/td><td>Matriz mitocondrial<\/td><td>2<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>Cadena de electrones<\/td><td>Membrana interna<\/td><td>32\u201334<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n                <tfoot><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Total aer\u00f3bica<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>36\u201338<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><\/tfoot>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n            <strong>Dato Cyberpunk:<\/strong> La eficiencia de la respiraci\u00f3n celular supera a la de la mayor\u00eda de las bater\u00edas modernas. \u00a1La mitocondria es la \"bater\u00eda\" biol\u00f3gica definitiva!\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N INTERACTIVA: MITOCONDRIA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion\">\r\n        <h2>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Diagrama interactivo: Mitocondria Cyberpunk<\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"svg-mito-flex\">\r\n            <div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n                <svg id=\"mitoSVG\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 400\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de mitocondria\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"background:#000;min-width:340px;min-height:300px;\"><\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div id=\"mitoInfoPanel\" class=\"mito-info-panel\">\r\n                <h3 id=\"mitoInfoTitle\">Mitocondria<\/h3>\r\n                <div id=\"mitoInfoText\">Selecciona una etapa para ver su funci\u00f3n.<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <p class=\"caption\">Haz clic o usa Tab\/Enter sobre cada etapa para ver su funci\u00f3n. Si no ves el diagrama, revisa el brillo de tu pantalla o el modo oscuro.<\/p>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR AVANZADO: ATP, INHIBIDORES Y FERMENTACI\u00d3N -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion\">\r\n        <h2>\u2699\ufe0f Simulador avanzado: ATP, inhibidores y fermentaci\u00f3n<\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"resp-sim\">\r\n            <div class=\"control-panel\">\r\n                <label for=\"oxygenSelect\">Ox\u00edgeno:<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"oxygenSelect\">\r\n                    <option value=\"high\">Alto (aer\u00f3bica)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"low\">Bajo (fermentaci\u00f3n l\u00e1ctica)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"none\">Nulo (fermentaci\u00f3n alcoh\u00f3lica)<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n                <label for=\"inhibitorSelect\">Inhibidor:<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"inhibitorSelect\">\r\n                    <option value=\"none\">Ninguno<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"cyanide\">Cianuro<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"oligomycin\">Oligomicina<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n                <button onclick=\"runSimulation()\">Simular<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"atp-meter\">\r\n                <div class=\"meter-track\"><div id=\"atpFill\" class=\"meter-fill\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"meter-labels\"><span>0 ATP<\/span><span id=\"atpValue\">0 ATP<\/span><span>38 ATP<\/span><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div id=\"simResult\" class=\"sim-result\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ANIMACI\u00d3N ETC (CANVAS) -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion\">\r\n        <h2>\ud83d\udd0b Animaci\u00f3n: Cadena de Transporte de Electrones<\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"etc-canvas-container\">\r\n            <canvas id=\"etcCanvas\" width=\"600\" height=\"180\" aria-label=\"Animaci\u00f3n ETC\" tabindex=\"0\"><\/canvas>\r\n            <div class=\"etc-info\">\r\n                <span>Electrones: <span id=\"electronCount\">0<\/span><\/span>\r\n                <span>Protones: <span id=\"protonCount\">0<\/span><\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"sim-legend\">\r\n            <span class=\"legend-box\" style=\"background:#ff0;\"><\/span> Electr\u00f3n\r\n            <span class=\"legend-box\" style=\"background:#0ff;\"><\/span> Prot\u00f3n\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- GLOSARIO INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion\">\r\n        <h2>\ud83d\udcd6 Glosario interactivo<\/h2>\r\n        <ul class=\"glosario-lista\">\r\n            <li tabindex=\"0\"><strong>ATP:<\/strong> Adenos\u00edn trifosfato, la mol\u00e9cula energ\u00e9tica universal.<\/li>\r\n            <li tabindex=\"0\"><strong>NADH\/FADH\u2082:<\/strong> Transportadores de electrones generados en glic\u00f3lisis y Krebs.<\/li>\r\n            <li tabindex=\"0\"><strong>Fermentaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Proceso anaer\u00f3bico que permite la producci\u00f3n limitada de ATP.<\/li>\r\n            <li tabindex=\"0\"><strong>ATP sintasa:<\/strong> Enzima que sintetiza ATP usando el gradiente de protones.<\/li>\r\n            <li tabindex=\"0\"><strong>Gradiente de protones:<\/strong> Diferencia de concentraci\u00f3n de H\u207a a trav\u00e9s de la membrana mitocondrial.<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- LOGROS Y GAMIFICACI\u00d3N -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion\">\r\n        <h2>\ud83c\udfc6 Logros desbloqueados<\/h2>\r\n        <ul class=\"logros-lista\">\r\n            <li id=\"logro1\" class=\"logro\">\ud83d\udd13 <strong>Primer Simulador:<\/strong> Usaste el simulador de ATP.<\/li>\r\n            <li id=\"logro2\" class=\"logro\">\ud83d\udd13 <strong>Animaci\u00f3n ETC:<\/strong> Observaste la animaci\u00f3n de electrones.<\/li>\r\n            <li id=\"logro3\" class=\"logro\">\ud83d\udd13 <strong>Quiz Perfecto:<\/strong> Obtuviste 5\/5 en el quiz.<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ AUTOEVALUADO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-autoevaluado\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> Quiz de autoevaluaci\u00f3n\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n                <p><strong>1.<\/strong> \u00bfD\u00f3nde ocurre la glic\u00f3lisis?<\/p>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"a\"> Mitocondria<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"b\"> Citosol<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"c\"> N\u00facleo<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n                <p><strong>2.<\/strong> El NADH se genera principalmente en:<\/p>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"a\"> Solo glic\u00f3lisis<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"b\"> Solo ciclo de Krebs<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"c\"> Glic\u00f3lisis y Krebs<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n                <p><strong>3.<\/strong> Rendimiento ATP en fermentaci\u00f3n l\u00e1ctica:<\/p>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"a\"> 2<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"b\"> 36<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"c\"> 0<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n                <p><strong>4.<\/strong> El aceptor final de electrones en la respiraci\u00f3n aer\u00f3bica es:<\/p>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q4\" value=\"a\"> CO\u2082<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q4\" value=\"b\"> O\u2082<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q4\" value=\"c\"> NAD\u207a<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n                <p><strong>5.<\/strong> La ATP sintasa utiliza:<\/p>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q5\" value=\"a\"> Gradiente de protones<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q5\" value=\"b\"> Luz solar<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q5\" value=\"c\"> Calor<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button onclick=\"evaluateQuiz()\">\ud83d\udcca Corregir quiz<\/button>\r\n            <div id=\"quizResult\" class=\"quiz-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PREGUNTAS ABIERTAS Y REFLEXI\u00d3N FINAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion\">\r\n        <h2>\ud83d\udca1 Preguntas abiertas<\/h2>\r\n        <ul class=\"preguntas-abiertas\">\r\n            <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo podr\u00edas explicar la importancia de la respiraci\u00f3n celular a alguien que solo piensa en \"comer para tener energ\u00eda\"?<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 impacto tendr\u00eda una mutaci\u00f3n que haga menos eficiente la ATP sintasa?<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo se relaciona la respiraci\u00f3n celular con el cambio clim\u00e1tico?<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <textarea rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Escribe aqu\u00ed tus ideas...\"><\/textarea>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO Y AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83e\udd14<\/span> Reflexi\u00f3n y autoevaluaci\u00f3n\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"reflexion-box\">\r\n            <p><strong>Reflexiona sobre tu aprendizaje:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo cambia tu comprensi\u00f3n del flujo energ\u00e9tico al ver la diferencia de eficiencia entre procesos aer\u00f3bicos y anaer\u00f3bicos?<\/li>\r\n                <li>\u00bfDe qu\u00e9 manera la respiraci\u00f3n celular limita la productividad de los consumidores en un ecosistema?<\/li>\r\n                <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategia usar\u00e1s para recordar el rendimiento exacto de cada etapa en ex\u00e1menes?<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <textarea rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Escribe aqu\u00ed tu reflexi\u00f3n...\"><\/textarea>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"eval-sliders\">\r\n                <div class=\"eval-item\">\r\n                    <span>Comprensi\u00f3n de las etapas<\/span>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" id=\"eval1\" oninput=\"updateEval(1,this.value)\">\r\n                    <span id=\"evalVal1\">3\/5<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"eval-item\">\r\n                    <span>Rendimiento energ\u00e9tico<\/span>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" id=\"eval2\" oninput=\"updateEval(2,this.value)\">\r\n                    <span id=\"evalVal2\">3\/5<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"eval-item\">\r\n                    <span>Relaci\u00f3n con ecosistemas<\/span>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" id=\"eval3\" oninput=\"updateEval(3,this.value)\">\r\n                    <span id=\"evalVal3\">3\/5<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\ud83d\udcbe Guardar autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n            <div id=\"autoEvalFeedback\" class=\"auto-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 Recursos adicionales<\/h3>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/science\/biology\/cellular-respiration-and-fermentation\" target=\"_blank\">Khan Academy: Respiraci\u00f3n celular<\/a><\/li>\r\n                <li><a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulations\/gene-expression-essentials\" target=\"_blank\">PhET: Simulador de mitocondria<\/a><\/li>\r\n                <li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nature.com\/scitable\/topicpage\/cellular-respiration-14032369\/\" target=\"_blank\">Nature Scitable: Respiraci\u00f3n<\/a><\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Importa estilos desde assets\/css\/leccion-respiracion.css -->\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"assets\/css\/leccion-respiracion.css\">\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ========== DIAGRAMA INTERACTIVO MITOCONDRIA CYBERPUNK ==========\r\ndocument.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function() {\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById(\"mitoSVG\");\r\n    if (!svg) return;\r\n    \/\/ Limpia SVG\r\n    svg.innerHTML = \"\";\r\n    \/\/ Dibuja la mitocondria (forma, membranas, etapas)\r\n    \/\/ Cuerpo principal\r\n    svg.innerHTML += `<ellipse cx=\"450\" cy=\"200\" rx=\"340\" ry=\"140\" fill=\"#111\" stroke=\"#39ff14\" stroke-width=\"5\" filter=\"url(#glow)\" \/>`;\r\n    \/\/ Membrana interna (ondulada)\r\n    let cristae = '';\r\n    for (let i = 0; i < 6; i++) {\r\n        let y = 120 + i*40;\r\n        cristae += `<path d=\"M170,${y} Q300,${y+30} 450,${y} Q600,${y-30} 730,${y}\" stroke=\"#0ff\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>`;\r\n    }\r\n    svg.innerHTML += cristae;\r\n    \/\/ Etapas (c\u00edrculos interactivos)\r\n    const etapas = [\r\n        {cx: 250, cy: 200, r: 38, color: '#ff44ff', label: 'Glic\u00f3lisis', key: 'glicolisis', desc: 'Ocurre en el citosol. Rompe glucosa en 2 piruvatos.'},\r\n        {cx: 450, cy: 120, r: 38, color: '#00e676', label: 'Krebs', key: 'krebs', desc: 'En la matriz mitocondrial. Genera NADH, FADH\u2082 y CO\u2082.'},\r\n        {cx: 650, cy: 200, r: 38, color: '#00bcd4', label: 'ETC', key: 'etc', desc: 'Cadena de electrones en la membrana interna. Produce la mayor parte del ATP.'}\r\n    ];\r\n    etapas.forEach((et, i) => {\r\n        svg.innerHTML += `<circle class=\"mito-etapa\" data-key=\"${et.key}\" cx=\"${et.cx}\" cy=\"${et.cy}\" r=\"${et.r}\" fill=\"${et.color}\" opacity=\"0.85\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"cursor:pointer;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 12px ${et.color})\" \/>`;\r\n        svg.innerHTML += `<text x=\"${et.cx}\" y=\"${et.cy+6}\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" pointer-events=\"none\">${et.label}<\/text>`;\r\n    });\r\n    \/\/ Glow filter\r\n    svg.innerHTML = `<defs><filter id=\"glow\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"coloredBlur\"\/><feMerge><feMergeNode in=\"coloredBlur\"\/><feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/><\/feMerge><\/filter><\/defs>` + svg.innerHTML;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Interactividad\r\n    const infoPanel = document.getElementById(\"mitoInfoPanel\");\r\n    const infoTitle = document.getElementById(\"mitoInfoTitle\");\r\n    const infoText = document.getElementById(\"mitoInfoText\");\r\n    function highlightEtapa(key) {\r\n        svg.querySelectorAll('.mito-etapa').forEach(c => {\r\n            c.setAttribute('opacity', c.getAttribute('data-key') === key ? '1' : '0.5');\r\n            c.setAttribute('stroke', c.getAttribute('data-key') === key ? '#fff' : '#888');\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n    svg.querySelectorAll('.mito-etapa').forEach((c, i) => {\r\n        c.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n            highlightEtapa(etapas[i].key);\r\n            infoTitle.textContent = etapas[i].label;\r\n            infoText.textContent = etapas[i].desc;\r\n        });\r\n        c.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\r\n            if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') {\r\n                highlightEtapa(etapas[i].key);\r\n                infoTitle.textContent = etapas[i].label;\r\n                infoText.textContent = etapas[i].desc;\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \/\/ Accesibilidad: reset info\r\n    svg.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\r\n        highlightEtapa(null);\r\n        infoTitle.textContent = 'Mitocondria';\r\n        infoText.textContent = 'Selecciona una etapa para ver su funci\u00f3n.';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- Importa estilos desde assets\/css\/leccion-respiracion.css -->\r\n<!-- <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"assets\/css\/leccion-respiracion.css\"> -->\r\n\r\n<!-- ==================== JAVASCRIPT INTERACTIVO ==================== -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ==================== SIMULADOR RENDIMIENTO ====================\r\nfunction runSimulation() {\r\n    const oxygen = document.getElementById(\"oxygenSelect\").value;\r\n    const inhibitor = document.getElementById(\"inhibitorSelect\").value;\r\n    const fill = document.getElementById(\"atpFill\");\r\n    const valueSpan = document.getElementById(\"atpValue\");\r\n    const resultDiv = document.getElementById(\"simResult\");\r\n\r\n    let atp = 0;\r\n    let products = \"\";\r\n    let explanation = \"\";\r\n\r\n    if (oxygen === \"high\") {\r\n        atp = 36;\r\n        fill.style.background = \"linear-gradient(90deg, #00ffff, #00ff99)\";\r\n        products = \"6 CO\u2082 + 6 H\u2082O\";\r\n        explanation = \"Rendimiento m\u00e1ximo. Cadena ETC completa.\";\r\n        if (inhibitor === \"cyanide\") {\r\n            atp = 2;\r\n            explanation = \"Cianuro bloquea complejo IV: se detiene ETC, solo glic\u00f3lisis.\";\r\n        } else if (inhibitor === \"oligomycin\") {\r\n            atp = 2;\r\n            explanation = \"Oligomicina bloquea ATP sintasa: gradiente se disipa, no se produce ATP.\";\r\n        }\r\n    } else if (oxygen === \"low\") {\r\n        atp = 2;\r\n        fill.style.background = \"linear-gradient(90deg, #ff1744, #ff5252)\";\r\n        products = \"2 \u00c1cido l\u00e1ctico\";\r\n        explanation = \"Fermentaci\u00f3n l\u00e1ctica: regeneraci\u00f3n de NAD\u207a sin O\u2082.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        atp = 2;\r\n        fill.style.background = \"linear-gradient(90deg, #ff9100, #ff6d00)\";\r\n        products = \"2 Etanol + 2 CO\u2082\";\r\n        explanation = \"Fermentaci\u00f3n alcoh\u00f3lica: t\u00edpica en levaduras.\";\r\n    }\r\n    const maxATP = 38;\r\n    const percent = (atp \/ maxATP) * 100;\r\n    fill.style.width = percent + \"%\";\r\n    valueSpan.textContent = atp + \" ATP\";\r\n    resultDiv.innerHTML = `<strong>Productos:<\/strong> ${products}<br><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> ${explanation}`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== ANIMACI\u00d3N ETC (CANVAS) ====================\r\nconst canvas = document.getElementById(\"etcCanvas\");\r\nif (canvas) {\r\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext(\"2d\");\r\n    let electrons = [];\r\n    let protons = [];\r\n    let electronCount = 0;\r\n    let protonCount = 0;\r\n    const electronCountSpan = document.getElementById(\"electronCount\");\r\n    const protonCountSpan = document.getElementById(\"protonCount\");\r\n\r\n    function drawComplex(x, y, label) {\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = \"#333\";\r\n        ctx.fillRect(x, y, 60, 40);\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = \"#0ff\";\r\n        ctx.font = \"12px monospace\";\r\n        ctx.fillText(label, x+20, y+25);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function animate() {\r\n        ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\r\n        \/\/ Dibujar complejos I, II, III, IV\r\n        drawComplex(50, 80, \"I\");\r\n        drawComplex(150, 80, \"II\");\r\n        drawComplex(250, 80, \"III\");\r\n        drawComplex(350, 80, \"IV\");\r\n        \/\/ ATP sintasa\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = \"#f0f\";\r\n        ctx.fillRect(500, 80, 60, 40);\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = \"#fff\";\r\n        ctx.fillText(\"ATP\", 525, 105);\r\n        ctx.fillText(\"sintasa\", 520, 120);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Electrones\r\n        for (let i=0; i<electrons.length; i++) {\r\n            const e = electrons[i];\r\n            ctx.fillStyle = \"#ff0\";\r\n            ctx.beginPath();\r\n            ctx.arc(e.x, e.y, 5, 0, Math.PI*2);\r\n            ctx.fill();\r\n            e.x += e.vx;\r\n            if (e.x > 600) {\r\n                electrons.splice(i,1);\r\n                electronCount++;\r\n                electronCountSpan.textContent = electronCount;\r\n                if (electronCount % 3 === 0) {\r\n                    protons.push({x: 450, y: 60, vy: 2});\r\n                }\r\n                i--;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        \/\/ Protones\r\n        for (let i=0; i<protons.length; i++) {\r\n            const p = protons[i];\r\n            ctx.fillStyle = \"#0ff\";\r\n            ctx.beginPath();\r\n            ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, 4, 0, Math.PI*2);\r\n            ctx.fill();\r\n            p.y += p.vy;\r\n            if (p.y > 140) {\r\n                protons.splice(i,1);\r\n                protonCount++;\r\n                protonCountSpan.textContent = protonCount;\r\n                i--;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        requestAnimationFrame(animate);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    setInterval(() => {\r\n        electrons.push({x: 20, y: 100, vx: 3});\r\n    }, 800);\r\n\r\n    animate();\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== QUIZ ====================\r\nfunction evaluateQuiz() {\r\n    let score = 0;\r\n    if (document.querySelector('input[name=\"q1\"]:checked')?.value === \"b\") score++;\r\n    if (document.querySelector('input[name=\"q2\"]:checked')?.value === \"c\") score++;\r\n    if (document.querySelector('input[name=\"q3\"]:checked')?.value === \"a\") score++;\r\n    if (document.querySelector('input[name=\"q4\"]:checked')?.value === \"b\") score++;\r\n    if (document.querySelector('input[name=\"q5\"]:checked')?.value === \"a\") score++;\r\n    const resultDiv = document.getElementById(\"quizResult\");\r\n    if (score === 5) resultDiv.innerHTML = '<span class=\"success\">\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! 5\/5. Dominas la respiraci\u00f3n celular.<\/span>';\r\n    else resultDiv.innerHTML = `<span class=\"error\">\ud83d\udcd8 Tienes ${score}\/5. Revisa las etapas y el rendimiento energ\u00e9tico.<\/span>`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N ====================\r\nfunction updateEval(num, val) {\r\n    document.getElementById(`evalVal${num}`).innerText = val + \"\/5\";\r\n}\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const v1 = document.getElementById('eval1').value;\r\n    const v2 = document.getElementById('eval2').value;\r\n    const v3 = document.getElementById('eval3').value;\r\n    const promedio = ((parseInt(v1)+parseInt(v2)+parseInt(v3))\/3).toFixed(1);\r\n    document.getElementById('autoEvalFeedback').innerHTML = `\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada. Promedio: ${promedio}\/5. \u00a1Sigue explorando!`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== SOLUCIONES PROBLEMAS ====================\r\nfunction mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n    const div = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n    if (div.style.display === \"none\") div.style.display = \"block\";\r\n    else div.style.display = \"none\";\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar simulador\r\nrunSimulation();\r\n<\/script>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"La respiraci\u00f3n celular produce principalmente\u2026","opciones":["Ox\u00edgeno","ATP","Glucosa","Luz"],"correcta":"ATP"},{"pregunta":"Gas consumido en respiraci\u00f3n aer\u00f3bica","opciones":["CO\u2082","O\u2082","N\u2082","CH\u2084"],"correcta":"O\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Organelo con mayor producci\u00f3n de ATP","opciones":["N\u00facleo","Cloroplasto","Mitocondria","Ribosoma"],"correcta":"Mitocondria"},{"pregunta":"ATP totales en respiraci\u00f3n aer\u00f3bica","opciones":["2 ATP","4 ATP","36\u201338 ATP","80 ATP"],"correcta":"36\u201338 ATP"},{"pregunta":"Gas liberado al ambiente por seres vivos","opciones":["O\u2082","CO\u2082","N\u2082","Ar"],"correcta":"CO\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Etapa que ocurre en el citosol","opciones":["Krebs","ETC","Glic\u00f3lisis","Fermentaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Glic\u00f3lisis"},{"pregunta":"El ciclo de Krebs produce directamente\u2026","opciones":["2 ATP","34 ATP","O\u2082","H\u2082O"],"correcta":"2 ATP"},{"pregunta":"Aceptor final de electrones en ETC","opciones":["NAD\u207a","FAD","O\u2082","CO\u2082"],"correcta":"O\u2082"},{"pregunta":"ATP por cada NADH en la ETC","opciones":["2","2.5","3","4"],"correcta":"2.5"},{"pregunta":"ATP por cada FADH\u2082","opciones":["1","1.5","2","3"],"correcta":"1.5"},{"pregunta":"Proceso que usa gradiente H\u207a","opciones":["Fotos\u00edntesis","Quimi\u00f3smosis","Replicaci\u00f3n","Gluc\u00f3lisis"],"correcta":"Quimi\u00f3smosis"},{"pregunta":"En ausencia de O\u2082, las c\u00e9lulas musculares realizan\u2026","opciones":["Fotos\u00edntesis","Fermentaci\u00f3n l\u00e1ctica","Krebs","ETC"],"correcta":"Fermentaci\u00f3n l\u00e1ctica"},{"pregunta":"Las levaduras producen\u2026","opciones":["\u00c1cido l\u00e1ctico","Alcohol + CO\u2082","ATP extra","NADH"],"correcta":"Alcohol + CO\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Proceso opuesto a la respiraci\u00f3n celular","opciones":["Digesti\u00f3n","Fotos\u00edntesis","Transpiraci\u00f3n","Mitosis"],"correcta":"Fotos\u00edntesis"},{"pregunta":"El gradiente de H\u207a se forma en\u2026","opciones":["Citosol","Espacio intermembrana","N\u00facleo","Cloroplasto"],"correcta":"Espacio intermembrana"},{"pregunta":"Toxina que bloquea la ETC","opciones":["Cianuro","Alcohol","CO\u2082","Agua"],"correcta":"Cianuro"},{"pregunta":"CO\u2082 total del ciclo de Krebs por glucosa","opciones":["2","4","6","8"],"correcta":"6"},{"pregunta":"Complejo I se llama\u2026","opciones":["Citocromo c","NADH deshidrogenasa","ATP sintasa","Fumarasa"],"correcta":"NADH deshidrogenasa"},{"pregunta":"Efecto Warburg","opciones":["Fotos\u00edntesis en animales","Fermentaci\u00f3n con O\u2082 presente","Respiraci\u00f3n hiperactiva","Quimi\u00f3smosis duplicada"],"correcta":"Fermentaci\u00f3n con O\u2082 presente"},{"pregunta":"Eficiencia energ\u00e9tica real","opciones":["~10%","~30%","~70%","~90%"],"correcta":"~30%"},{"pregunta":"NADH producido en glic\u00f3lisis","opciones":["0","1","2","4"],"correcta":"2"},{"pregunta":"Mol\u00e9cula que entra a Krebs","opciones":["Glucosa","Piruvato","Acetil-CoA","Citrat"],"correcta":"Acetil-CoA"},{"pregunta":"La ATP sintasa funciona como\u2026","opciones":["Bomba","Turbina molecular","Canal","Receptor"],"correcta":"Turbina molecular"},{"pregunta":"Protones bombeados por Complejo I","opciones":["2","4","6","10"],"correcta":"4"},{"pregunta":"Mol\u00e9culas que se oxidan en ETC","opciones":["ATP","CO\u2082","NADH y FADH\u2082","O\u2082"],"correcta":"NADH y FADH\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Producto final reducido en ETC","opciones":["CO\u2082","O\u2082 \u2192 H\u2082O","Piruvato","NAD\u207a"],"correcta":"O\u2082 \u2192 H\u2082O"},{"pregunta":"Proceso que NO ocurre en mitocondria","opciones":["Krebs","ETC","Glic\u00f3lisis","Quimi\u00f3smosis"],"correcta":"Glic\u00f3lisis"},{"pregunta":"\u0394G mide\u2026","opciones":["Calor","Energ\u00eda libre","Entrop\u00eda","Masa"],"correcta":"Energ\u00eda libre"},{"pregunta":"CO\u2082 producido al a\u00f1o por un humano promedio","opciones":["50 kg","150 kg","300 kg","1 tonelada"],"correcta":"150 kg"},{"pregunta":"La respiraci\u00f3n celular es esencial para\u2026","opciones":["Solo animales","Solo plantas","Todos los seres vivos","Solo bacterias"],"correcta":"Todos los seres vivos"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"componentes-sistema-climatico","titulo":"Componentes del Sistema Clim\u00e1tico: El Mega-Sistema que Controla el Planeta","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-climatica\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== CABECERA ==================== -->\r\n    <div class=\"climate-header\">\r\n        <div class=\"header-badges\">\r\n            <span class=\"materia-badge\">\ud83c\udf0d ECOSISTEMAS<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"nivel-badge\">\u26a1 NIVEL AVANZADO<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"tiempo-badge\">\u23f1\ufe0f 55 MIN<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-icon\">\ud83c\udf21\ufe0f<\/span> Componentes del Sistema Clim\u00e1tico\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"leccion-subtitulo\">Atm\u00f3sfera \u2022 Hidrosfera \u2022 Criosfera \u2022 Litosfera \u2022 Biosfera \u2022 Interacciones<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== INTRO ==================== -->\r\n    <p class=\"intro\">\r\n        El <strong>sistema clim\u00e1tico terrestre<\/strong> es un complejo conjunto de componentes f\u00edsicos y biol\u00f3gicos que interact\u00faan continuamente intercambiando energ\u00eda, materia y momentum. Este sistema determina la temperatura global, los patrones de precipitaci\u00f3n, los vientos, el nivel del mar y la estabilidad de los ecosistemas. Comprender sus componentes y sus interacciones es esencial para predecir el cambio clim\u00e1tico y evaluar impactos antropog\u00e9nicos.\r\n    <\/p>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"formula-neon text-center\">\r\n        Balance energ\u00e9tico global (simplificado):<br>\r\n        \\[ \\frac{S(1 - \\alpha)}{4} = \\sigma T_e^4 (1 - \\epsilon) + F_{\\text{GEI}} \\]\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO ==================== -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">\r\n        <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> I. Los Cinco Componentes del Sistema Clim\u00e1tico\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"table-wrapper\">\r\n        <table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n            <thead>\r\n                <tr><th>Esfera<\/th><th>Descripci\u00f3n<\/th><th>Reservorios clave<\/th><th>Rol clim\u00e1tico principal<\/th><\/tr>\r\n            <\/thead>\r\n            <tbody>\r\n                <tr><td>\ud83c\udf2c\ufe0f Atm\u00f3sfera<\/td><td>Capa gaseosa<\/td><td>N\u2082 (78%), O\u2082 (21%), CO\u2082 (0.042%)<\/td><td>Transporte de calor y vapor, efecto invernadero<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <tr><td>\ud83d\udca7 Hidrosfera<\/td><td>Agua l\u00edquida<\/td><td>Oc\u00e9anos (97% del agua total)<\/td><td>Almac\u00e9n t\u00e9rmico, circulaci\u00f3n termohalina<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <tr><td>\ud83e\uddca Criosfera<\/td><td>Hielo y nieve<\/td><td>Casquetes polares, glaciares<\/td><td>Albedo alto, retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <tr><td>\u26f0\ufe0f Litosfera<\/td><td>Corteza terrestre<\/td><td>Rocas, suelos, carbono f\u00f3sil<\/td><td>Reservorio de carbono a largo plazo<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <tr><td>\ud83c\udf3f Biosfera<\/td><td>Vida<\/td><td>Biomasa terrestre y marina<\/td><td>Regulaci\u00f3n de CO\u2082 y O\u2082, albedo vegetal<\/td><\/tr>\r\n            <\/tbody>\r\n        <\/table>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n        <strong>\u26a0\ufe0f Interacciones:<\/strong> Ning\u00fan componente act\u00faa aislado. Por ejemplo, el aumento de CO\u2082 (atm\u00f3sfera) acidifica oc\u00e9anos (hidrosfera), afecta fitoplancton (biosfera) y acelera el derretimiento del hielo (criosfera).\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== DIAGRAMA INTERACTIVO PROFESIONAL ==================== -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">\r\n        <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f<\/span> II. Diagrama del Sistema Clim\u00e1tico (Interactivo)\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <p>Representaci\u00f3n esquem\u00e1tica de las cinco esferas y sus interacciones principales. Haz clic en cada esfera para ver m\u00e1s informaci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n        <svg class=\"climate-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 720\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\r\n            <defs>\r\n                <filter id=\"glow\">\r\n                    <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"4\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                    <feFlood flood-color=\"#00ffff\" flood-opacity=\"0.6\"\/>\r\n                    <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\" result=\"glow\"\/>\r\n                    <feMerge>\r\n                        <feMergeNode in=\"glow\"\/>\r\n                        <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                    <\/feMerge>\r\n                <\/filter>\r\n                <filter id=\"glow-magenta\">\r\n                    <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                    <feFlood flood-color=\"#ff00ff\" flood-opacity=\"0.5\"\/>\r\n                    <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                    <feMerge>\r\n                        <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                        <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                    <\/feMerge>\r\n                <\/filter>\r\n                <marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"12\" markerHeight=\"12\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"6\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                    <path d=\"M0,0 L10,6 L0,12 Z\" fill=\"#00ffff\"\/>\r\n                <\/marker>\r\n            <\/defs>\r\n\r\n            <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n\r\n            <!-- T\u00edtulo principal -->\r\n            <text x=\"500\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#ff00ff\" filter=\"url(#glow-magenta)\" font-weight=\"bold\">SISTEMA CLIM\u00c1TICO TERRESTRE<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <!-- Atm\u00f3sfera -->\r\n            <g class=\"sphere\" data-sphere=\"Atm\u00f3sfera\" transform=\"translate(500,150)\">\r\n                <circle r=\"80\" fill=\"rgba(30,144,255,0.7)\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" filter=\"url(#glow)\"\/>\r\n                <text text-anchor=\"middle\" dy=\"-15\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\">ATM\u00d3SFERA<\/text>\r\n                <text text-anchor=\"middle\" dy=\"15\" fill=\"#00ffff\" font-size=\"12\">Gases \u00b7 Vapor \u00b7 Nubes<\/text>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n\r\n            <!-- Hidrosfera -->\r\n            <g class=\"sphere\" data-sphere=\"Hidrosfera\" transform=\"translate(180,330)\">\r\n                <circle r=\"75\" fill=\"rgba(0,94,255,0.7)\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" filter=\"url(#glow)\"\/>\r\n                <text text-anchor=\"middle\" dy=\"-12\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\">HIDROSFERA<\/text>\r\n                <text text-anchor=\"middle\" dy=\"15\" fill=\"#00ffff\" font-size=\"12\">Oc\u00e9anos \u00b7 R\u00edos \u00b7 Lagos<\/text>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n\r\n            <!-- Criosfera -->\r\n            <g class=\"sphere\" data-sphere=\"Criosfera\" transform=\"translate(820,330)\">\r\n                <circle r=\"75\" fill=\"rgba(224,247,250,0.9)\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" filter=\"url(#glow)\"\/>\r\n                <text text-anchor=\"middle\" dy=\"-12\" fill=\"#000\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\">CRIOSFERA<\/text>\r\n                <text text-anchor=\"middle\" dy=\"15\" fill=\"#00ffff\" font-size=\"12\">Hielo \u00b7 Glaciares \u00b7 Nieve<\/text>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n\r\n            <!-- Litosfera -->\r\n            <g class=\"sphere\" data-sphere=\"Litosfera\" transform=\"translate(320,550)\">\r\n                <circle r=\"75\" fill=\"rgba(139,69,19,0.8)\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" filter=\"url(#glow)\"\/>\r\n                <text text-anchor=\"middle\" dy=\"-12\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\">LITOSFERA<\/text>\r\n                <text text-anchor=\"middle\" dy=\"15\" fill=\"#00ffff\" font-size=\"12\">Rocas \u00b7 Suelos \u00b7 Volcanes<\/text>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n\r\n            <!-- Biosfera -->\r\n            <g class=\"sphere\" data-sphere=\"Biosfera\" transform=\"translate(680,550)\">\r\n                <circle r=\"75\" fill=\"rgba(34,139,34,0.8)\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" filter=\"url(#glow)\"\/>\r\n                <text text-anchor=\"middle\" dy=\"-12\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\">BIOSFERA<\/text>\r\n                <text text-anchor=\"middle\" dy=\"15\" fill=\"#00ffff\" font-size=\"12\">Vida \u00b7 Ecosistemas<\/text>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n\r\n            <!-- Flechas de interacci\u00f3n -->\r\n            <path d=\"M500,230 L500,330\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3\"\/>\r\n            <path d=\"M255,380 L320,490\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3\"\/>\r\n            <path d=\"M745,380 L680,490\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3\"\/>\r\n            <path d=\"M210,470 L320,530\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3\"\/>\r\n            <path d=\"M790,470 L680,530\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3\"\/>\r\n\r\n            <text x=\"500\" y=\"680\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#00ffff\" font-size=\"20\" filter=\"url(#glow)\">Todo est\u00e1 interconectado<\/text>\r\n        <\/svg>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div id=\"sphereInfo\" class=\"sphere-info\">Haz clic en cualquier esfera para conocer m\u00e1s sobre su rol clim\u00e1tico.<\/div>\r\n\r\n    <hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== SIMULADORES INTERACTIVOS ==================== -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">\r\n        <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\u2699\ufe0f<\/span> III. Simuladores Interactivos\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-card\">\r\n        <h3 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: Retroalimentaci\u00f3n del Albedo (Criosfera)<\/h3>\r\n        <p>Modifica la cobertura de hielo y observa el efecto de retroalimentaci\u00f3n en la temperatura global.<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"climate-sim\">\r\n            <label>Cobertura de hielo polar (%): <span id=\"iceValue\">60<\/span>%<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"iceSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"60\">\r\n            <div class=\"meter-track\"><div class=\"meter-fill\" id=\"iceFill\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"iceResult\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-card\">\r\n        <h3 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: Efecto Invernadero y Concentraci\u00f3n de CO\u2082<\/h3>\r\n        <p>Ajusta la concentraci\u00f3n de CO\u2082 atmosf\u00e9rico y eval\u00faa el forzamiento radiativo.<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"climate-sim\">\r\n            <label>CO\u2082 atmosf\u00e9rico (ppm): <span id=\"co2Value\">420<\/span> ppm<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"co2Slider\" min=\"180\" max=\"1000\" value=\"420\">\r\n            <div class=\"meter-track\"><div class=\"meter-fill\" id=\"co2Fill\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"co2Result\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-card\">\r\n        <h3 class=\"subsection-title\">Mini-Laboratorio Clim\u00e1tico: Combinaci\u00f3n de Variables<\/h3>\r\n        <p>Experimenta combinando niveles de radiaci\u00f3n solar, cobertura de hielo y CO\u2082.<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"climate-lab\">\r\n            <div class=\"lab-controls\">\r\n                <label>\u2600\ufe0f Radiaci\u00f3n solar:<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"sunSelect\"><option value=\"low\">Baja (-5%)<\/option><option value=\"normal\" selected>Normal<\/option><option value=\"high\">Alta (+5%)<\/option><\/select>\r\n                <label>\ud83e\uddca Cobertura de hielo:<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"iceSelect\"><option value=\"high\">Alta<\/option><option value=\"medium\" selected>Media<\/option><option value=\"low\">Baja<\/option><\/select>\r\n                <label>\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f CO\u2082 (ppm):<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"co2Select\"><option value=\"low\">&lt;300<\/option><option value=\"medium\" selected>~420<\/option><option value=\"high\">&gt;600<\/option><\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"lab-output\" id=\"labResult\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"climate-boost-panel\" id=\"summaryQuick\">\r\n      <strong>\ud83d\udd0d Resumen R\u00e1pido<\/strong>\r\n      <p id=\"quickSummary\">Interacciones din\u00e1micas: ajusta CO\u2082, albedo y radiaci\u00f3n para ver el impacto en el sistema.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"leccion-progress-bar\">\r\n      <div id=\"leccionProgress\" class=\"leccion-progress-fill\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== QUIZ AUTOEVALUADO ==================== -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">\r\n        <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> IV. Quiz Autoevaluado\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-container\" id=\"quizContainer\">\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"hidrosfera\">\r\n            <p><strong>1. \u00bfCu\u00e1l es el principal reservorio de calor del sistema clim\u00e1tico?<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"atmosfera\">Atm\u00f3sfera<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"hidrosfera\">Hidrosfera (oc\u00e9anos)<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"criosfera\">Criosfera<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"positiva\">\r\n            <p><strong>2. La reducci\u00f3n de la criosfera genera:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"positiva\">Retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva (calentamiento)<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"negativa\">Retroalimentaci\u00f3n negativa<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"ninguno\">Ning\u00fan efecto<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"litosfera\">\r\n            <p><strong>3. El mayor reservorio de carbono a largo plazo es:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"biosfera\">Biosfera<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"litosfera\">Litosfera<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"atmosfera\">Atm\u00f3sfera<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"hidrosfera\">\r\n            <p><strong>4. El vapor de agua es un gas de efecto invernadero controlado principalmente por:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"hidrosfera\">Hidrosfera<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"criosfera\">Criosfera<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"litosfera\">Litosfera<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"biosfera_atmosfera\">\r\n            <p><strong>5. La deforestaci\u00f3n afecta principalmente a:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"biosfera_atmosfera\">Biosfera y atm\u00f3sfera<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"hidrosfera\">Solo hidrosfera<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"criosfera\">Solo criosfera<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"albedo\">\r\n            <p><strong>6. Disminuir la criosfera reduce el albedo y provoca:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"enfriamiento\">Enfriamiento local<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"albedo\">Aumento de absorci\u00f3n de calor<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"viento\">M\u00e1s viento<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"termohalina\">\r\n            <p><strong>7. La circulaci\u00f3n termohalina es clave en:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"atm\">Atm\u00f3sfera<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"termohalina\">Hidrosfera<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"litosfera\">Litosfera<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"score-display\" id=\"quizScore\">Puntuaci\u00f3n: 0\/7<\/div>\r\n        <button id=\"resetQuiz\" class=\"btn-reset-quiz\">\ud83d\udd04 Reiniciar quiz<\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== ERRORES COMUNES ==================== -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">\r\n        <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> V. Errores Comunes del Estudiante\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"errors-interactive\">\r\n        <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err1\">\r\n            <label for=\"err1\">\u274c Pensar que el clima depende solo de la atm\u00f3sfera.<\/label>\r\n            <div class=\"error-explain\">El sistema es integrado: oc\u00e9anos almacenan el 90% del calor antropog\u00e9nico.<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err2\">\r\n            <label for=\"err2\">\u274c Confundir retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva con negativa en la criosfera.<\/label>\r\n            <div class=\"error-explain\">Menos hielo \u2192 menos albedo \u2192 m\u00e1s absorci\u00f3n \u2192 m\u00e1s calentamiento (positiva).<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err3\">\r\n            <label for=\"err3\">\u274c Subestimar el rol de la biosfera en la regulaci\u00f3n clim\u00e1tica.<\/label>\r\n            <div class=\"error-explain\">La deforestaci\u00f3n reduce sumideros de carbono y altera albedo local.<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== CONEXI\u00d3N CURRICULAR ==================== -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">\r\n        <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udcd8<\/span> VI. Conexi\u00f3n con el Curr\u00edculo de Ecosistemas\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <p>\r\n        Este tema pertenece al bloque \"Factores abi\u00f3ticos y cambio global\" en Ciencias Ambientales y Geograf\u00eda (nivel secundario y universitario). Se eval\u00faa en ex\u00e1menes oficiales junto a ciclos biogeoqu\u00edmicos, efecto invernadero y retroalimentaciones clim\u00e1ticas. Es fundamental para comprender informes IPCC y pol\u00edticas de mitigaci\u00f3n.\r\n    <\/p>\r\n\r\n    <hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN ==================== -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">\r\n        <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> VII. Problemas Tipo Examen\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <ol class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n        <li>Explica la interacci\u00f3n entre hidrosfera y atm\u00f3sfera en la formaci\u00f3n de huracanes.<\/li>\r\n        <li>Analiza la retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva asociada al derretimiento de la criosfera.<\/li>\r\n        <li>Justifica por qu\u00e9 los oc\u00e9anos son el principal regulador t\u00e9rmico del planeta.<\/li>\r\n        <li>Relaciona el aumento antropog\u00e9nico de CO\u2082 con alteraciones en la biosfera.<\/li>\r\n        <li>Describe el rol de la litosfera en la regulaci\u00f3n clim\u00e1tica a escala geol\u00f3gica.<\/li>\r\n    <\/ol>\r\n\r\n    <hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== CIERRE METACOGNITIVO ==================== -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">\r\n        <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83e\udd14<\/span> VIII. Reflexi\u00f3n Metacognitiva\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <ul class=\"reflection-list\">\r\n        <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo cambia tu percepci\u00f3n del cambio clim\u00e1tico al entender las interacciones entre esferas?<\/li>\r\n        <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 componente del sistema clim\u00e1tico consideras m\u00e1s vulnerable a la actividad humana y por qu\u00e9?<\/li>\r\n        <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategia usar\u00e1s para analizar retroalimentaciones clim\u00e1ticas en futuros ex\u00e1menes?<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"conclusion\">\r\n        El sistema clim\u00e1tico es un todo integrado: alterarlo en un punto reverbera en todo el planeta. Comprender sus componentes es clave para enfrentar el mayor desaf\u00edo ambiental de nuestra era.\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <blockquote class=\"neon-quote\">\r\n        \u201cEl clima no es un fondo: es el escenario donde se representa toda la vida.\u201d\r\n    <\/blockquote>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"climate-boost-panel\">\r\n      <div>\r\n        <strong>\u26a1 Actividades Extensas:<\/strong> Usa estos controles para practicar, repasar y validar lo aprendido.\r\n        <ul>\r\n          <li>1) Activa <strong>Modo Explicaci\u00f3n<\/strong> para recibir ayudas instant\u00e1neas.<\/li>\r\n          <li>2) Observa la Barra de Progreso de lectura a medida que navegas el contenido.<\/li>\r\n          <li>3) Revisa la retroalimentaci\u00f3n del quiz y mejora tu nota en tiempo real.<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <button id=\"autoExplainBtn\">\ud83e\udd16 Modo explicativo (auto)<\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"leccion-progress-bar\">\r\n      <div id=\"leccionProgress\" class=\"leccion-progress-fill\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ==================== ESTILOS CYBERPUNK PROFESIONALES -->\r\n<!-- Estilos cargados desde leccion_detalle.php de forma global y autom\u00e1tica. -->\r\n\r\n<!-- ==================== MEJORAS VISUALES Y CONTENIDO ==================== -->\r\n<div class=\"climate-tips\">\r\n    <h3>\ud83c\udf1f Tips para dominar el tema:<\/h3>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><span class=\"tip-icon\">\ud83d\udd0e<\/span> Usa la tabla para comparar r\u00e1pidamente las esferas.<\/li>\r\n        <li><span class=\"tip-icon\">\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f<\/span> Haz clic en cada esfera del diagrama para descubrir datos clave y ejemplos reales.<\/li>\r\n        <li><span class=\"tip-icon\">\ud83e\uddea<\/span> Prueba los simuladores y experimenta con combinaciones extremas.<\/li>\r\n        <li><span class=\"tip-icon\">\ud83d\udca1<\/span> Lee los errores comunes y m\u00e1rcalos cuando los comprendas.<\/li>\r\n        <li><span class=\"tip-icon\">\ud83c\udfc6<\/span> \u00a1Completa el quiz y comparte tu puntuaci\u00f3n!<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"climate-fact-banner\">\r\n    <span class=\"fact-icon\">\ud83c\udf10<\/span>\r\n    <span class=\"fact-text\">Dato: Los oc\u00e9anos absorben m\u00e1s del 90% del calor extra generado por el cambio clim\u00e1tico.<\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- ==================== ANIMACI\u00d3N DE ENTRADA ==================== -->\r\n<script>\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    const main = document.querySelector('.leccion-climatica');\r\n    if (main) {\r\n        main.style.opacity = 0;\r\n        main.style.transform = 'translateY(40px) scale(0.98)';\r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            main.style.transition = 'all 1.2s cubic-bezier(.23,1.02,.32,1)';\r\n            main.style.opacity = 1;\r\n            main.style.transform = 'translateY(0) scale(1)';\r\n        }, 100);\r\n    }\r\n    \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n para los banners\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.climate-fact-banner, .climate-cta').forEach(el => {\r\n        el.style.opacity = 0;\r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            el.style.transition = 'opacity 1.2s cubic-bezier(.23,1.02,.32,1)';\r\n            el.style.opacity = 1;\r\n        }, 800);\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<!-- ==================== JAVASCRIPT INTERACTIVO ==================== -->\r\n<script>\r\n(function() {\r\n    \/\/ ========== DIAGRAMA INTERACTIVO ==========\r\n    const spheres = document.querySelectorAll('.sphere');\r\n    const infoDiv = document.getElementById('sphereInfo');\r\n    const descriptions = {\r\n        'Atm\u00f3sfera': '\ud83c\udf2c\ufe0f La atm\u00f3sfera regula la temperatura mediante gases de efecto invernadero, transporta calor y humedad, y es el componente m\u00e1s din\u00e1mico.',\r\n        'Hidrosfera': '\ud83d\udca7 Los oc\u00e9anos almacenan el 90% del calor antropog\u00e9nico, regulan el clima a trav\u00e9s de corrientes y absorben CO\u2082.',\r\n        'Criosfera': '\ud83e\uddca El hielo refleja la radiaci\u00f3n solar (alto albedo). Su derretimiento amplifica el calentamiento global (retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva).',\r\n        'Litosfera': '\u26f0\ufe0f La corteza terrestre almacena carbono a largo plazo en rocas y combustibles f\u00f3siles; los volcanes liberan CO\u2082 a la atm\u00f3sfera.',\r\n        'Biosfera': '\ud83c\udf3f Los ecosistemas act\u00faan como sumideros de carbono (bosques, oc\u00e9anos) y modifican el albedo local. La deforestaci\u00f3n reduce su capacidad reguladora.'\r\n    };\r\n    spheres.forEach(sphere => {\r\n        sphere.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n            const name = sphere.getAttribute('data-sphere');\r\n            infoDiv.innerHTML = `<strong>${name}<\/strong><br>${descriptions[name]}`;\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== SIMULADOR ALBEDO ==========\r\n    const iceSlider = document.getElementById('iceSlider');\r\n    const iceValue = document.getElementById('iceValue');\r\n    const iceFill = document.getElementById('iceFill');\r\n    const iceResult = document.getElementById('iceResult');\r\n    function updateAlbedo() {\r\n        const ice = parseInt(iceSlider.value);\r\n        iceValue.textContent = ice;\r\n        iceFill.style.width = ice + '%';\r\n        const albedo = 0.3 + (ice \/ 100) * 0.5;\r\n        const deltaT = ((1 - albedo) * 10 - 5).toFixed(1);\r\n        let feedback = '';\r\n        if (ice > 70) feedback = '\ud83e\uddca Retroalimentaci\u00f3n negativa: enfriamiento adicional.';\r\n        else if (ice < 40) feedback = '\ud83d\udd25 Retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva: calentamiento acelerado (amplificaci\u00f3n \u00e1rtica).';\r\n        else feedback = '\ud83c\udf0d Equilibrio relativo.';\r\n        iceResult.innerHTML = `<strong>Albedo efectivo:<\/strong> ${albedo.toFixed(2)}<br>\r\n                               <strong>Variaci\u00f3n t\u00e9rmica estimada:<\/strong> ${deltaT > 0 ? '+' : ''}${deltaT} \u00b0C<br>\r\n                               ${feedback}`;\r\n    }\r\n    if (iceSlider) iceSlider.addEventListener('input', updateAlbedo);\r\n    updateAlbedo();\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== SIMULADOR CO\u2082 ==========\r\n    const co2Slider = document.getElementById('co2Slider');\r\n    const co2Value = document.getElementById('co2Value');\r\n    const co2Fill = document.getElementById('co2Fill');\r\n    const co2Result = document.getElementById('co2Result');\r\n    function updateCO2() {\r\n        const co2 = parseInt(co2Slider.value);\r\n        co2Value.textContent = co2;\r\n        co2Fill.style.width = ((co2 - 180) \/ 820 * 100) + '%';\r\n        const preind = 280;\r\n        const forcing = (5.35 * Math.log(co2 \/ preind)).toFixed(2);\r\n        const tempChange = (forcing * 0.8).toFixed(2);\r\n        let state = '';\r\n        if (co2 < 300) state = '\ud83e\uddca Condiciones glaciales';\r\n        else if (co2 < 420) state = '\ud83c\udf0d Clima preindustrial';\r\n        else state = '\ud83d\udd25 Calentamiento antropog\u00e9nico';\r\n        co2Result.innerHTML = `<strong>Forzamiento radiativo:<\/strong> ${forcing} W\/m\u00b2<br>\r\n                               <strong>Incremento t\u00e9rmico estimado:<\/strong> +${tempChange} \u00b0C<br>\r\n                               ${state}`;\r\n    }\r\n    if (co2Slider) co2Slider.addEventListener('input', updateCO2);\r\n    updateCO2();\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== LABORATORIO CLIM\u00c1TICO ==========\r\n    const sunSelect = document.getElementById('sunSelect');\r\n    const iceSelect = document.getElementById('iceSelect');\r\n    const co2Select = document.getElementById('co2Select');\r\n    const labResult = document.getElementById('labResult');\r\n    function evaluateLab() {\r\n        let score = 0;\r\n        if (sunSelect.value === 'high') score += 3;\r\n        if (sunSelect.value === 'low') score -= 2;\r\n        if (iceSelect.value === 'low') score += 3;\r\n        if (iceSelect.value === 'high') score -= 3;\r\n        if (co2Select.value === 'high') score += 4;\r\n        if (co2Select.value === 'low') score -= 3;\r\n        let state = '', icon = '';\r\n        if (score <= -4) { state = 'Era glacial'; icon = '\ud83e\uddca'; }\r\n        else if (score <= 2) { state = 'Clima estable preindustrial'; icon = '\ud83c\udf0d'; }\r\n        else { state = 'Calentamiento global acelerado'; icon = '\ud83d\udd25'; }\r\n        labResult.innerHTML = `<h5>${icon} Estado clim\u00e1tico simulado<\/h5>\r\n                               <p><strong>${state}<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                               <p>Puntaje de forzamiento: ${score > 0 ? '+' : ''}${score}<\/p>`;\r\n    }\r\n    if (sunSelect && iceSelect && co2Select && labResult) {\r\n        [sunSelect, iceSelect, co2Select].forEach(el => el.addEventListener('change', evaluateLab));\r\n        evaluateLab();\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== QUIZ ==========\r\n    const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n    let totalScore = 0;\r\n    const maxScore = questions.length;\r\n    const scoreDisplay = document.getElementById('quizScore');\r\n\r\n    function updateTotalScore() {\r\n        const answeredCorrect = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question.answered .quiz-option.correct.correct-answer').length;\r\n        totalScore = answeredCorrect;\r\n        if (scoreDisplay) scoreDisplay.textContent = `Puntuaci\u00f3n: ${totalScore}\/${maxScore}`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    questions.forEach(question => {\r\n        const correctValue = question.getAttribute('data-correct');\r\n        const options = question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option');\r\n        const feedbackDiv = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n        options.forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n                if (question.classList.contains('answered')) return; \/\/ bloqueo tras respuesta\r\n\r\n                question.classList.add('answered');\r\n\r\n                const chosenValue = opt.getAttribute('data-value');\r\n                const isCorrect = (chosenValue === correctValue);\r\n\r\n                options.forEach(o => o.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect', 'correct-answer'));\r\n                opt.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n                if (isCorrect) {\r\n                    opt.classList.add('correct', 'correct-answer');\r\n                    feedbackDiv.textContent = '\u2705 Correcto';\r\n                    feedbackDiv.style.color = '#39ff14';\r\n                } else {\r\n                    opt.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                    const correctOpt = Array.from(options).find(o => o.getAttribute('data-value') === correctValue);\r\n                    if (correctOpt) correctOpt.classList.add('correct');\r\n\r\n                    let correctAnswerText = correctValue;\r\n                    if (correctValue === 'hidrosfera') correctAnswerText = 'Hidrosfera (oc\u00e9anos)';\r\n                    else if (correctValue === 'positiva') correctAnswerText = 'Retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva';\r\n                    else if (correctValue === 'litosfera') correctAnswerText = 'Litosfera';\r\n                    else if (correctValue === 'biosfera_atmosfera') correctAnswerText = 'Biosfera y atm\u00f3sfera';\r\n\r\n                    feedbackDiv.textContent = `\u274c Incorrecto. La respuesta correcta es: ${correctAnswerText}`;\r\n                    feedbackDiv.style.color = '#ff6b6b';\r\n                }\r\n\r\n                updateTotalScore();\r\n            });\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    const resetBtn = document.getElementById('resetQuiz');\r\n    if (resetBtn) {\r\n        resetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n            questions.forEach(question => {\r\n                question.classList.remove('answered');\r\n                const options = question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option');\r\n                options.forEach(opt => {\r\n                    opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect', 'correct-answer');\r\n                });\r\n                const feedbackDiv = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n                if (feedbackDiv) {\r\n                    feedbackDiv.textContent = '';\r\n                    feedbackDiv.style.color = '';\r\n                }\r\n            });\r\n            totalScore = 0;\r\n            if (scoreDisplay) scoreDisplay.textContent = `Puntuaci\u00f3n: 0\/${maxScore}`;\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== ERRORES COMUNES TOGGLE ==========\r\n    const checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('.error-item input[type=\"checkbox\"]');\r\n    checkboxes.forEach(cb => {\r\n        cb.addEventListener('change', function() {\r\n            const explain = this.parentElement.querySelector('.error-explain');\r\n            if (explain) explain.style.display = this.checked ? 'block' : 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \/\/ Inicializar estado\r\n        const explain = cb.parentElement.querySelector('.error-explain');\r\n        if (explain) explain.style.display = cb.checked ? 'block' : 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== BARRA DE PROGRESO DE LECTURA ==========\r\n    const progressBar = document.getElementById('leccionProgress');\r\n    function updateScrollProgress() {\r\n        const docHeight = document.documentElement.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight;\r\n        const scrollTop = window.scrollY || window.pageYOffset;\r\n        const percent = docHeight ? Math.min(100, Math.round((scrollTop \/ docHeight) * 100)) : 0;\r\n        if (progressBar) progressBar.style.width = `${percent}%`;\r\n    }\r\n    window.addEventListener('scroll', updateScrollProgress);\r\n    updateScrollProgress();\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== MODO EXPLICACI\u00d3N ==========\r\n    const autoExplainBtn = document.getElementById('autoExplainBtn');\r\n    const quickSummary = document.getElementById('quickSummary');\r\n    if (autoExplainBtn && quickSummary) {\r\n        autoExplainBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n            quickSummary.textContent = '\u23f3 Generando res\u00famenes inteligentes...';\r\n            setTimeout(() => {\r\n                quickSummary.innerHTML = `\ud83c\udf31 Panel de revisi\u00f3n:\r\n                <ul style=\"padding-left:1rem; margin-top:.4rem;\">\r\n                    <li>Incremento de CO\u2082 \u2192 +8% radiaci\u00f3n atrapada.<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Menos hielo \u2192 menor albedo \u2192 m\u00e1s absorci\u00f3n solar.<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Oc\u00e9anos almacenan ~90% del calor extra; impacto lento pero persistente.<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>`;\r\n            }, 380);\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    console.log('\u2705 Lecci\u00f3n de Sistema Clim\u00e1tico mejorada y funcional.');\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1ntos componentes principales tiene el sistema clim\u00e1tico?","opciones":["3","4","5","6"],"correcta":"5"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 componente incluye los oc\u00e9anos?","opciones":["Criosfera","Hidrosfera","Litosfera","Biosfera"],"correcta":"Hidrosfera"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 componente tiene el albedo m\u00e1s alto?","opciones":["Oc\u00e9ano","Bosque","Hielo","Desierto"],"correcta":"Hielo"},{"pregunta":"Gas m\u00e1s abundante en la atm\u00f3sfera","opciones":["Ox\u00edgeno","Nitr\u00f3geno","CO\u2082","Arg\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Nitr\u00f3geno"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 almacena m\u00e1s carbono a largo plazo?","opciones":["Atm\u00f3sfera","Oc\u00e9anos","Litosfera","Biosfera"],"correcta":"Litosfera"},{"pregunta":"Feedback hielo-albedo es...","opciones":["Negativo","Positivo","Neutro","C\u00edclico"],"correcta":"Positivo"},{"pregunta":"Albedo aproximado del hielo","opciones":["0.1","0.3","0.6","0.8"],"correcta":"0.8"},{"pregunta":"Volumen total de la hidrosfera","opciones":["10\u2076 km\u00b3","10\u2079 km\u00b3","10\u00b9\u00b2 km\u00b3","10\u00b9\u2075 km\u00b3"],"correcta":"10\u2079 km\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 libera metano al derretirse?","opciones":["Oc\u00e9anos","Permafrost","Bosques","Volcanes"],"correcta":"Permafrost"},{"pregunta":"Ecuaci\u00f3n del balance energ\u00e9tico terrestre","opciones":["S(1-\u03b1) = \u03c3T\u2074","S = cT","P = \u03c1gh","\u03c3T\u2074 = \u03b1"],"correcta":"S(1-\u03b1) = \u03c3T\u2074"},{"pregunta":"Capacidad calor\u00edfica del agua","opciones":["1000","4186","200","900"],"correcta":"4186"},{"pregunta":"Fen\u00f3meno hidrosfera-atm\u00f3sfera","opciones":["El Ni\u00f1o","Terremotos","Dunas","Magnetismo"],"correcta":"El Ni\u00f1o"},{"pregunta":"Si Groenlandia se derrite, el nivel del mar sube...","opciones":["+1 m","+3 m","+7 m","+20 m"],"correcta":"+7 m"},{"pregunta":"Componente que almacena 550 GtC","opciones":["Atm\u00f3sfera","Hidrosfera","Criosfera","Biosfera"],"correcta":"Biosfera"},{"pregunta":"Circulaci\u00f3n termohalina es...","opciones":["Corriente atmosf\u00e9rica","Cinta oce\u00e1nica global","Pluma volc\u00e1nica","Viento polar"],"correcta":"Cinta oce\u00e1nica global"},{"pregunta":"Un tipping point es...","opciones":["Un equilibrio","Punto de no retorno","Un enfriamiento","Un frente fr\u00edo"],"correcta":"Punto de no retorno"},{"pregunta":"GtC significa...","opciones":["Gigatoneladas de carbono","Gradiente t\u00e9rmico","Gas total","Geotermia"],"correcta":"Gigatoneladas de carbono"},{"pregunta":"AMOC significa...","opciones":["Atlantic Meridional Overturning Circulation","Arctic Methane Ocean Cycle","Atmospheric Mixing Oscillation Current","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Atlantic Meridional Overturning Circulation"},{"pregunta":"Volcanes liberan...","opciones":["O\u2082","CO\u2082","N\u2082","H\u2082"],"correcta":"CO\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Amplificaci\u00f3n \u00e1rtica significa...","opciones":["El \u00c1rtico se enfr\u00eda","El \u00c1rtico se calienta m\u00e1s r\u00e1pido","No cambia","Oscila"],"correcta":"El \u00c1rtico se calienta m\u00e1s r\u00e1pido"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1nta agua dulce est\u00e1 en glaciares?","opciones":["~10%","~30%","~70%","~90%"],"correcta":"~70%"},{"pregunta":"Regulador clim\u00e1tico de corto plazo","opciones":["Litosfera","Criosfera","Atm\u00f3sfera + Hidrosfera","Biosfera"],"correcta":"Atm\u00f3sfera + Hidrosfera"},{"pregunta":"Gas liberado por permafrost","opciones":["CO\u2082","CH\u2084","N\u2082O","He"],"correcta":"CH\u2084"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQui\u00e9n reconoce los 5 componentes?","opciones":["IPCC","NASA","NOAA","Todos"],"correcta":"Todos"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 interacci\u00f3n causa huracanes?","opciones":["Criosfera-Litosfera","Atm\u00f3sfera-Hidrosfera","Biosfera-Litosfera","Litosfera-Criosfera"],"correcta":"Atm\u00f3sfera-Hidrosfera"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 almacena m\u00e1s calor?","opciones":["Atm\u00f3sfera","Oc\u00e9anos","Hielos","Suelos"],"correcta":"Oc\u00e9anos"},{"pregunta":"Pulso de calor oce\u00e1nico es...","opciones":["Aumento de temperatura","Oleaje","Evaporaci\u00f3n","Salinidad"],"correcta":"Aumento de temperatura"},{"pregunta":"Feedback negativo t\u00edpico","opciones":["Hielo-albedo","Vapor de agua","Metano permafrost","Nubes bajas"],"correcta":"Nubes bajas"},{"pregunta":"El sistema clim\u00e1tico es...","opciones":["Lineal","Ca\u00f3tico","Complejo no lineal","Perfectamente predecible"],"correcta":"Complejo no lineal"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"ciclo-carbono","titulo":"Ciclo del Carbono: El Flujo que Controla la Vida y el Clima Global","contenido":"\r\n<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK OPTIMIZADA -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-ecosistemas-carbono\" data-tema=\"ciclo-carbono\" data-materia=\"Ecosistemas\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 1: CABECERA Y CONTEXTO INTRODUCTORIO -->\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header compact\">\r\n        <div class=\"header-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"materia-badge\" aria-label=\"Materia\">\ud83c\udf0d ECOSISTEMAS<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"nivel-badge\" aria-label=\"Nivel dificultad\">\u26a1 NIVEL AVANZADO<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"tiempo-badge\" aria-label=\"Tiempo estimado\">\u23f1\ufe0f 60 MIN<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-icon\">\u2248<\/span>CICLO DEL CARBONO\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"leccion-subtitulo\">Flujos Biogeoqu\u00edmicos \u2022 Cambio Clim\u00e1tico \u2022 Regulaci\u00f3n Global<\/p>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL R\u00c1PIDO DE OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"objetivos-rapidos\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Objetivos de aprendizaje\">\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n                    <h4>Comprender reservorios<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Identificar d\u00f3nde est\u00e1 el carbono en el planeta<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"obj-icon\">\u2699\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n                    <h4>Analizar flujos naturales<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Fotos\u00edntesis, respiraci\u00f3n, intercambio oce\u00e1nico<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83d\udea8<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n                    <h4>Evaluar impacto humano<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Emisiones antropog\u00e9nicas y desequilibrio<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n                    <h4>Interpretar datos reales<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>IPCC, tendencias clim\u00e1ticas, soluciones<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL APLICADO -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-realidad\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Contexto y aplicaci\u00f3n real\">\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83c\udf0d \u00bfPor qu\u00e9 importa?<\/h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n                El ciclo del carbono controla el clima de la Tierra. Cada a\u00f1o, los humanos emitimos ~11.5 GtC (gigatoneladas de carbono), \r\n                rompiendo un equilibrio que exist\u00eda hace 3 millones de a\u00f1os. Las consecuencias: \r\n                <strong>calentamiento global 1.1\u00b0C, acidificaci\u00f3n oce\u00e1nica, eventos clim\u00e1ticos extremos<\/strong>.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"dato-importante\">\r\n                <span class=\"icono-dato\">\ud83d\udcc8<\/span>\r\n                <strong>2025:<\/strong> Concentraci\u00f3n de CO\u2082 = 425 ppm (vs. 280 ppm en 1750)\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 2: DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO ESTRUCTURADO -->\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-desarrollo\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Desarrollo te\u00f3rico\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\u25b6<\/span> I. RESERVORIOS Y FLUJOS DEL CICLO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <p class=\"formula-neon text-center\" role=\"doc-example\">\r\n            <strong>Ecuaciones clave:<\/strong><br>\r\n            Fotos\u00edntesis: \\( \\ce{6CO2 + 6H2O -> C6H12O6 + 6O2} \\)<br>\r\n            Respiraci\u00f3n: \\( \\ce{C6H12O6 + 6O2 -> 6CO2 + 6H2O} \\)\r\n        <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <table class=\"neon-table\" role=\"table\" aria-label=\"Reservorios de carbono y tiempos de residencia\">\r\n            <thead>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th scope=\"col\">Reservorio<\/th>\r\n                    <th scope=\"col\">Cantidad (GtC)<\/th>\r\n                    <th scope=\"col\">Tiempo de Residencia<\/th>\r\n                    <th scope=\"col\">Procesos Clave<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/thead>\r\n            <tbody>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td><strong>Atm\u00f3sfera<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                    <td>\u2248 900<\/td>\r\n                    <td>A\u00f1os<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Intercambio con oc\u00e9anos y biosfera<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td><strong>Biosfera Terrestre<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                    <td>\u2248 550<\/td>\r\n                    <td>D\u00e9cadas a siglos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Fotos\u00edntesis, respiraci\u00f3n, descomposici\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td><strong>Hidrosfera (Oc\u00e9anos)<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                    <td>\u2248 38,000<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Miles de a\u00f1os<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Disoluci\u00f3n, bomba biol\u00f3gica, termoclina<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td><strong>Litosfera<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                    <td>> 60,000,000<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Millones de a\u00f1os<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Meteorizaci\u00f3n, f\u00f3siles, sedimentaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/tbody>\r\n        <\/table>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"concept-box\" role=\"note\">\r\n            <strong>Flujos Naturales Equilibrados (pre-industrial):<\/strong> \r\n            Fotos\u00edntesis \u2248 120 GtC\/a\u00f1o | Respiraci\u00f3n \u2248 120 GtC\/a\u00f1o | Oc\u00e9anos \u2194 Atm\u00f3sfera \u2248 90 GtC\/a\u00f1o\r\n            <br><strong style=\"color: #ff3366;\">Desequilibrio actual:<\/strong> +11.5 GtC\/a\u00f1o (2025)\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 3: VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA INTERACTIVA -->\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-visual\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Visualizaci\u00f3n del ciclo global del carbono\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\u25b6<\/span> II. DIAGRAMA INTERACTIVO DEL CICLO GLOBAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"svg-container\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama del ciclo del carbono con flujos anuales\">\r\n            <svg class=\"carbon-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1600 900\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n                <defs>\r\n                    <filter id=\"glow-cyan\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/><feFlood flood-color=\"#00ffff\"\/><feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/><feMerge><feMergeNode\/><feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/><\/feMerge><\/filter>\r\n                    <filter id=\"glow-green\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/><feFlood flood-color=\"#00ff88\"\/><feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/><feMerge><feMergeNode\/><feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/><\/feMerge><\/filter>\r\n                    <filter id=\"glow-orange\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/><feFlood flood-color=\"#ffaa00\"\/><feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/><feMerge><feMergeNode\/><feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/><\/feMerge><\/filter>\r\n                    <filter id=\"glow-red\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/><feFlood flood-color=\"#ff3366\"\/><feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/><feMerge><feMergeNode\/><feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/><\/feMerge><\/filter>\r\n                    <marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"18\" markerHeight=\"18\" refX=\"16\" refY=\"9\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L18,9 L0,18 Z\" fill=\"#00ffff\"\/><\/marker>\r\n                <\/defs>\r\n                <rect width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" fill=\"#070714\"\/>\r\n                <text x=\"800\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"48\" fill=\"#39ff14\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">CICLO GLOBAL DEL CARBONO<\/text>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Atm\u00f3sfera -->\r\n                <g transform=\"translate(220,130)\">\r\n                    <rect width=\"320\" height=\"150\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0b1a33\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"4\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"45\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#00ffff\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"bold\">ATM\u00d3SFERA<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"22\">~900 GtC<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#88ffff\" font-size=\"18\">425 ppm CO\u2082<\/text>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Biosfera -->\r\n                <g transform=\"translate(1060,130)\">\r\n                    <rect width=\"320\" height=\"150\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0b2a1a\" stroke=\"#00ff88\" stroke-width=\"4\" filter=\"url(#glow-green)\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"45\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#00ff88\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"bold\">BIOSFERA<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"22\">~550 GtC<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#88ffcc\" font-size=\"18\">Plantas \u2022 Suelo<\/text>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Hidrosfera -->\r\n                <g transform=\"translate(220,480)\">\r\n                    <rect width=\"320\" height=\"150\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#081c33\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"4\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"45\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#00ffff\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"bold\">HIDROSFERA<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"22\">38,000 GtC<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#88ccff\" font-size=\"18\">Oc\u00e9anos<\/text>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Litosfera -->\r\n                <g transform=\"translate(1060,480)\">\r\n                    <rect width=\"320\" height=\"150\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#2a1a0b\" stroke=\"#ffaa00\" stroke-width=\"4\" filter=\"url(#glow-orange)\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"45\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffaa00\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"bold\">LITOSFERA<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"22\">>60 M GtC<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffcc88\" font-size=\"18\">Rocas \u2022 F\u00f3siles<\/text>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Flujos -->\r\n                <path d=\"M540 205 L1060 205\" stroke=\"#00ff88\" stroke-width=\"6\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" filter=\"url(#glow-green)\"\/>\r\n                <text x=\"800\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#00ff88\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\">Fotos\u00edntesis: 120 GtC\/a\u00f1o<\/text>\r\n                \r\n                <path d=\"M1060 295 L540 295\" stroke=\"#ff3366\" stroke-width=\"6\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" filter=\"url(#glow-red)\"\/>\r\n                <text x=\"800\" y=\"325\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ff99bb\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\">Respiraci\u00f3n: 120 GtC\/a\u00f1o<\/text>\r\n                \r\n                <path d=\"M380 280 L380 480\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"6\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n                <text x=\"300\" y=\"390\" fill=\"#88ffff\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\">Intercambio: 90 GtC\/a\u00f1o<\/text>\r\n                \r\n                <path d=\"M1220 480 L1220 295\" stroke=\"#ff3366\" stroke-width=\"7\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" filter=\"url(#glow-red)\" stroke-dasharray=\"15,10\"\/>\r\n                <text x=\"1280\" y=\"390\" fill=\"#ff3366\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\">+11.5 GtC\/a\u00f1o<\/text>\r\n                <text x=\"1280\" y=\"410\" fill=\"#ff3366\" font-size=\"14\">(HUMANO)<\/text>\r\n                \r\n                <text x=\"800\" y=\"820\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ff3366\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"bold\" filter=\"url(#glow-red)\">\u26a0\ufe0f Equilibrio Natural Roto por Actividad Antropog\u00e9nica<\/text>\r\n            <\/svg>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 4: SIMULADORES INTERACTIVOS -->\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <section class=\"simuladores-section\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Simuladores interactivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\u25b6<\/span> III. SIMULADORES INTERACTIVOS AVANZADOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- SIMULADOR 1: EMISIONES -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container carbon-sim-advanced\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"simulator-title\">Simulador 1\ufe0f\u20e3: Impacto de Emisiones Antropog\u00e9nicas<\/h3>\r\n            <p class=\"simulator-desc\">Ajusta la tasa de emisiones y observa el cambio en CO\u2082 atmosf\u00e9rico 2025-2050<\/p>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <div class=\"control-item\">\r\n                    <label for=\"emissionSlider\" lang=\"{{ lang }}\">Emisiones (GtC\/a\u00f1o):<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-display\">\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" id=\"emissionSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"20\" value=\"11.5\" step=\"0.5\" aria-label=\"Emisiones antropog\u00e9nicas en gigatoneladas de carbono por a\u00f1o\" role=\"slider\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"20\" aria-valuenow=\"11.5\">\r\n                        <span id=\"emissionValue\" class=\"value-display\" aria-live=\"polite\">11.5<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"resetEmissionSlider()\" aria-label=\"Reiniciar valores del simulador de emisiones\">\ud83d\udd04 Reiniciar<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"meter-track\">\r\n                <div class=\"meter-fill\" id=\"co2Fill\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"emissionResult\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-label=\"Resultados del simulador\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <script>\r\n        (function(){\r\n            const slider = document.getElementById(\"emissionSlider\");\r\n            const value = document.getElementById(\"emissionValue\");\r\n            const fill = document.getElementById(\"co2Fill\");\r\n            const result = document.getElementById(\"emissionResult\");\r\n\r\n            function update(){\r\n                const emission = parseFloat(slider.value);\r\n                value.textContent = emission.toFixed(1);\r\n                slider.setAttribute(\"aria-valuenow\", emission);\r\n\r\n                const naturalSink = 4.5;\r\n                const net = emission - naturalSink;\r\n                const co2Level = 425 + net * 8;\r\n\r\n                fill.style.width = (emission \/ 20 * 100) + \"%\";\r\n                fill.style.background = emission > 15 ? \"#ff1744\" : emission > 11.5 ? \"#ffaa00\" : \"#00ff88\";\r\n\r\n                let feedback = \"\";\r\n                let scenario = \"\";\r\n                if (emission < 5) {\r\n                    feedback = \"Mitigaci\u00f3n agresiva: estabilizaci\u00f3n posible antes de 2050\";\r\n                    scenario = \"\ud83c\udf31 Escenario Optimista\";\r\n                } else if (emission < 11.5) {\r\n                    feedback = \"Transici\u00f3n hacia descarbonizaci\u00f3n moderada\";\r\n                    scenario = \"\u26a0\ufe0f Escenario de Transici\u00f3n\";\r\n                } else if (emission < 15) {\r\n                    feedback = \"Escenario actual: calentamiento persistente\";\r\n                    scenario = \"\ud83d\udd25 Escenario Actual\";\r\n                } else {\r\n                    feedback = \"Emisiones aceleradas: cambio clim\u00e1tico catastr\u00f3fico\";\r\n                    scenario = \"\ud83d\udca5 Escenario Cr\u00edtico\";\r\n                }\r\n\r\n                result.innerHTML = `\r\n                    <div class=\"result-row\"><strong>${scenario}<\/strong><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"result-row\">CO\u2082 Proyectado 2050: ~${co2Level.toFixed(0)} ppm<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"result-row\">Flujo Neto: +${net.toFixed(1)} GtC\/a\u00f1o<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"result-row feedback\">${feedback}<\/div>\r\n                `;\r\n            }\r\n            window.resetEmissionSlider = function() {\r\n                slider.value = 11.5;\r\n                update();\r\n            };\r\n            slider.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n            update();\r\n        })();\r\n        <\/script>\r\n\r\n        <!-- SIMULADOR 2: DEFORESTACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container carbon-sim-advanced\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"simulator-title\">Simulador 2\ufe0f\u20e3: Deforestaci\u00f3n y Sumideros de Carbono<\/h3>\r\n            <p class=\"simulator-desc\">Modifica la deforestaci\u00f3n neta y su impacto en la biosfera como sumidero<\/p>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <div class=\"control-item\">\r\n                    <label for=\"deforestSlider\">Deforestaci\u00f3n Neta (millones ha\/a\u00f1o):<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-display\">\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" id=\"deforestSlider\" min=\"-15\" max=\"25\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Tasa de deforestaci\u00f3n en millones de hect\u00e1reas por a\u00f1o\" role=\"slider\" aria-valuemin=\"-15\" aria-valuemax=\"25\" aria-valuenow=\"10\">\r\n                        <span id=\"deforestValue\" class=\"value-display\" aria-live=\"polite\">10<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"resetDeforestSlider()\" aria-label=\"Reiniciar valores del simulador de deforestaci\u00f3n\">\ud83d\udd04 Reiniciar<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"meter-track\">\r\n                <div class=\"meter-fill\" id=\"bioFill\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"deforestResult\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-label=\"Resultados del simulador de deforestaci\u00f3n\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <script>\r\n        (function(){\r\n            const slider = document.getElementById(\"deforestSlider\");\r\n            const value = document.getElementById(\"deforestValue\");\r\n            const fill = document.getElementById(\"bioFill\");\r\n            const result = document.getElementById(\"deforestResult\");\r\n\r\n            function update(){\r\n                const deforest = parseInt(slider.value);\r\n                value.textContent = deforest;\r\n                slider.setAttribute(\"aria-valuenow\", deforest);\r\n\r\n                const emission = deforest * 0.15;\r\n                const level = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, 50 + deforest * 3));\r\n\r\n                fill.style.width = level + \"%\";\r\n                if (deforest > 5) {\r\n                    fill.style.background = \"linear-gradient(90deg, #ff1744, #ff5252)\";\r\n                } else if (deforest > 0) {\r\n                    fill.style.background = \"linear-gradient(90deg, #ffaa00, #ffbb33)\";\r\n                } else {\r\n                    fill.style.background = \"linear-gradient(90deg, #00e676, #00ff88)\";\r\n                }\r\n\r\n                result.innerHTML = `\r\n                    <div class=\"result-row\"><strong>Emisiones por Deforestaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> ~${emission.toFixed(2)} GtC\/a\u00f1o<\/div>\r\n                    ${deforest > 5 ? '<div class=\"result-row feedback\">\ud83d\udd25 P\u00e9rdida severa de sumidero de carbono<\/div>' : \r\n                      deforest > 0 ? '<div class=\"result-row feedback\">\u26a0\ufe0f P\u00e9rdida neta de sumidero: aumento de CO\u2082<\/div>' :\r\n                      deforest < 0 ? '<div class=\"result-row feedback\">\ud83c\udf31 Reforestaci\u00f3n activa: sumidero positivo<\/div>' :\r\n                      '<div class=\"result-row feedback\">\u2696\ufe0f Equilibrio en el cambio de uso de tierra<\/div>'}\r\n                `;\r\n            }\r\n            window.resetDeforestSlider = function() {\r\n                slider.value = 10;\r\n                update();\r\n            };\r\n            slider.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n            update();\r\n        })();\r\n        <\/script>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 5: QUIZ AUTOEVALUADO CON FEEDBACK DETALLADO -->\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Autoevaluaci\u00f3n: Quiz sobre ciclo del carbono\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\u25b6<\/span> IV. QUIZ AUTOEVALUADO: CICLO DEL CARBONO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"c\">\r\n                <p class=\"quiz-text\"><strong>1.<\/strong> \u00bfCu\u00e1l es el MAYOR reservorio de carbono del planeta?<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Opciones de respuesta pregunta 1\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"a\" onclick=\"checkQuizAnswer(this)\">A) Atm\u00f3sfera (~900 GtC)<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"b\" onclick=\"checkQuizAnswer(this)\">B) Biosfera (~550 GtC)<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"c\" onclick=\"checkQuizAnswer(this)\">C) Litosfera (>60M GtC)<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" role=\"status\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"a\">\r\n                <p class=\"quiz-text\"><strong>2.<\/strong> El flujo NATURAL m\u00e1s grande del ciclo es:<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Opciones de respuesta pregunta 2\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"a\" onclick=\"checkQuizAnswer(this)\">A) Fotos\u00edntesis (~120 GtC\/a\u00f1o)<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"b\" onclick=\"checkQuizAnswer(this)\">B) Intercambio oc\u00e9ano-atm\u00f3sfera<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"c\" onclick=\"checkQuizAnswer(this)\">C) Emisiones antropog\u00e9nicas<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" role=\"status\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"a\">\r\n                <p class=\"quiz-text\"><strong>3.<\/strong> La acidificaci\u00f3n oce\u00e1nica es causada principalmente por:<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Opciones de respuesta pregunta 3\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"a\" onclick=\"checkQuizAnswer(this)\">A) Absorci\u00f3n de CO\u2082 antropog\u00e9nico<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"b\" onclick=\"checkQuizAnswer(this)\">B) Aumento de O\u2082 disuelto<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"c\" onclick=\"checkQuizAnswer(this)\">C) Deforestaci\u00f3n directa<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" role=\"status\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"b\">\r\n                <p class=\"quiz-text\"><strong>4:<\/strong> Si fotos\u00edntesis = 120 GtC\/a\u00f1o y respiraci\u00f3n = 118 GtC\/a\u00f1o, el flujo neto NATURAL es:<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Opciones de respuesta pregunta 4\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"a\" onclick=\"checkQuizAnswer(this)\">A) +120 GtC\/a\u00f1o<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"b\" onclick=\"checkQuizAnswer(this)\">B) +2 GtC\/a\u00f1o<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"c\" onclick=\"checkQuizAnswer(this)\">C) 0 GtC\/a\u00f1o<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" role=\"status\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"c\">\r\n                <p class=\"quiz-text\"><strong>5.<\/strong> El tiempo de residencia M\u00c1S LARGO del carbono es en:<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Opciones de respuesta pregunta 5\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"a\" onclick=\"checkQuizAnswer(this)\">A) Biosfera (d\u00e9cadas)<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"b\" onclick=\"checkQuizAnswer(this)\">B) Oceanos (miles de a\u00f1os)<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"c\" onclick=\"checkQuizAnswer(this)\">C) Litosfera (millones a\u00f1os)<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" role=\"status\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div id=\"quizScore\" class=\"score-display\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-label=\"Puntuaci\u00f3n final del quiz\">\r\n                <strong>Puntuaci\u00f3n: 0\/5<\/strong>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <script>\r\n        let quizScore = 0;\r\n        const quizTotal = 5;\r\n\r\n        window.checkQuizAnswer = function(button) {\r\n            const question = button.closest(\".quiz-question\");\r\n            if (!question) return;\r\n            \r\n            const correct = question.getAttribute(\"data-correct\");\r\n            const selected = button.getAttribute(\"data-value\");\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector(\".quiz-feedback\");\r\n            const allOptions = question.querySelectorAll(\".quiz-option\");\r\n\r\n            allOptions.forEach(opt => opt.disabled = true);\r\n\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                button.classList.add(\"correct\");\r\n                feedback.innerHTML = \"\u2705 <strong>\u00a1Correcto!<\/strong> Buena comprensi\u00f3n del concepto.\";\r\n                feedback.classList.add(\"feedback-correct\");\r\n                feedback.style.display = \"block\";\r\n                quizScore++;\r\n            } else {\r\n                button.classList.add(\"incorrect\");\r\n                const correctBtn = question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`);\r\n                if (correctBtn) {\r\n                    correctBtn.classList.add(\"correct\");\r\n                    feedback.innerHTML = `\u274c <strong>Incorrecto.<\/strong> La respuesta correcta es: <strong>${correctBtn.textContent}<\/strong>`;\r\n                }\r\n                feedback.classList.add(\"feedback-incorrect\");\r\n                feedback.style.display = \"block\";\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            const scoreDisplay = document.getElementById(\"quizScore\");\r\n            if (scoreDisplay) {\r\n                scoreDisplay.innerHTML = `<strong>Puntuaci\u00f3n: ${quizScore}\/${quizTotal}<\/strong>`;\r\n            }\r\n        };\r\n        <\/script>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 6: ERRORES COMUNES INTERACTIVOS -->\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Errores comunes y sus correcciones\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> V. ERRORES COMUNES DEL ESTUDIANTE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"errors-interactive\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err1\" aria-label=\"Expandir error com\u00fan 1\" onchange=\"toggleError(1)\">\r\n                <label for=\"err1\" class=\"error-label\">\r\n                    <span class=\"error-icon\">\u274c<\/span>\r\n                    Creer que la ATM\u00d3SFERA es el mayor reservorio de carbono\r\n                <\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp1\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Por qu\u00e9 es incorrecto:<\/strong> La atm\u00f3sfera tiene solo ~900 GtC, mientras que la litosfera contiene <strong>m\u00e1s de 66,600,000 GtC<\/strong>. Esto es un mill\u00f3n de veces m\u00e1s.<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Concepto clave:<\/strong> Los reservorios M\u00c1S GRANDES son los M\u00c1S LENTOS (millones de a\u00f1os). Los reservorios r\u00e1pidos son peque\u00f1os.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err2\" aria-label=\"Expandir error com\u00fan 2\" onchange=\"toggleError(2)\">\r\n                <label for=\"err2\" class=\"error-label\">\r\n                    <span class=\"error-icon\">\u274c<\/span>\r\n                    Subestimar el rol de los oc\u00e9anos como sumidero de CO\u2082\r\n                <\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp2\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Dato real:<\/strong> Los oc\u00e9anos absorben ~25% de las emisiones antropog\u00e9nicas (2.5 GtC\/a\u00f1o de las 11.5 actuales).<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Consecuencia:<\/strong> Esta absorci\u00f3n causa <strong>acidificaci\u00f3n oce\u00e1nica<\/strong>, que da\u00f1a corales, moluscos y toda la cadena tr\u00f3fica marina.<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Conclusi\u00f3n:<\/strong> El oc\u00e9ano NO es una soluci\u00f3n; es una v\u00edctima y un regulador autom\u00e1tico que paga un precio.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err3\" aria-label=\"Expandir error com\u00fan 3\" onchange=\"toggleError(3)\">\r\n                <label for=\"err3\" class=\"error-label\">\r\n                    <span class=\"error-icon\">\u274c<\/span>\r\n                    Confundir flujos naturales CON perturbaciones antropog\u00e9nicas\r\n                <\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp3\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Diferencia cr\u00edtica:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Flujos naturales:<\/strong> Fotos\u00edntesis = 120 GtC\/a\u00f1o \u2194 Respiraci\u00f3n = 120 GtC\/a\u00f1o (EQUILIBRIO)<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Perturbaci\u00f3n humana:<\/strong> +11.5 GtC\/a\u00f1o (flujo NETO adicional, desequilibrio)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <p><strong>Analog\u00eda:<\/strong> Tu cuerpo produce CO\u2082 respirando (flujo natural). Si respiras+sudas+corres, a\u00f1ades CO\u2082 (perturbaci\u00f3n). El ciclo no puede absorber ese exceso.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err4\" aria-label=\"Expandir error com\u00fan 4\" onchange=\"toggleError(4)\">\r\n                <label for=\"err4\" class=\"error-label\">\r\n                    <span class=\"error-icon\">\u274c<\/span>\r\n                    Pensar que \"el carbono desaparece\" en la atmosphere\r\n                <\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp4\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Ley de conservaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El carbono NO desaparece. Solo CAMBIA DE FORMA y RESERVORIO.<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> CO\u2082 atmosf\u00e9rico \u2192 Glucosa (planta) \u2192 O\u2082 + emisi\u00f3n \u2192 CO\u2082 nuevamente. Es un ciclo eterno.<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>El problema:<\/strong> Estamos extrayendo C del sistema lent\u00edsimo (f\u00f3siles de millones de a\u00f1os) e inyect\u00e1ndolo al sistema r\u00e1pido (atm\u00f3sfera) a velocidad que nadie puede absorber.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <script>\r\n        function toggleError(n){\r\n            const exp = document.getElementById(\"exp\" + n);\r\n            const isVisible = exp.style.display === \"block\";\r\n            exp.style.display = isVisible ? \"none\" : \"block\";\r\n        }\r\n        <\/script>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 7: CONEXI\u00d3N CON EL CURR\u00cdCULO -->\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <section class=\"curricular-section\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Conexi\u00f3n con el curr\u00edculo y competencias\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\u25b6<\/span> VI. CONEXI\u00d3N CON EL CURR\u00cdCULO OFICIAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"curriculum-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"curriculum-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"card-icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/div>\r\n                <h4>Tema del Curr\u00edculo<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Ciclos Biogeoqu\u00edmicos: Carbono, Nitr\u00f3geno, F\u00f3sforo, Agua<\/p>\r\n                <small>Biolog\u00eda\/Ciencias Ambientales (Secundaria\/Universidad)<\/small>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"curriculum-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"card-icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/div>\r\n                <h4>Competencias CLAVE<\/h4>\r\n                <ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; font-size: 0.9rem;\">\r\n                    <li>Analizar sistemas complejos<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Interpretar datos clim\u00e1ticos<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Argumentar sobre sostenibilidad<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"curriculum-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"card-icon\">\u2705<\/div>\r\n                <h4>Indicadores de Evaluaci\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n                <ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; font-size: 0.9rem;\">\r\n                    <li>Explicar reservorios y flujos<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Calcular flujos netos<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Relacionar con cambio clim\u00e1tico<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"curriculum-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"card-icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/div>\r\n                <h4>Ex\u00e1menes Tipo (PISA\/ENLACE)<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Preguntas sobre interpretaci\u00f3n de gr\u00e1ficos de Keeling, modelos IPCC, tendencias de CO\u2082 1750-2050<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 8: PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <section class=\"exam-section\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Problemas tipo examen\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\u25b6<\/span> VII. PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"exam-problems-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n                <div class=\"problem-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problem-num\">PROBLEMA 1<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"problem-difficulty\">\u2605\u2605\u2606<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <p><strong>Pregunta:<\/strong> Explica por qu\u00e9 el ciclo del carbono es \"r\u00e1pido\" en la atm\u00f3sfera y biosfera, pero \"lento\" en la litosfera. Usa los tiempos de residencia para justificar tu respuesta.<\/p>\r\n                <details>\r\n                    <summary class=\"solution-toggle\">Ver soluci\u00f3n modelo<\/summary>\r\n                    <div class=\"solution-text\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Respuesta:<\/strong> El tiempo de residencia es el factor clave:<\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Atm\u00f3sfera:<\/strong> A\u00f1os (intercambio r\u00e1pido con oc\u00e9anos\/biosfera)<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Biosfera:<\/strong> D\u00e9cadas-siglos (fotos\u00edntesis, descomposici\u00f3n)<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Litosfera:<\/strong> Millones de a\u00f1os (f\u00f3siles, rocas sedimentarias)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                        <p>El ciclo es r\u00e1pido cuando el carbono se mueve entre reservorios activos. Es lento en la litosfera porque una vez \"enterrado\", el carbono requiere millones a\u00f1os de procesos geol\u00f3gicos para regresar.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/details>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n                <div class=\"problem-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problem-num\">PROBLEMA 2<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"problem-difficulty\">\u2605\u2605\u2605<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <p><strong>Pregunta (C\u00e1lculo):<\/strong> Si fotos\u00edntesis = 120 GtC\/a\u00f1o, respiraci\u00f3n = 118 GtC\/a\u00f1o, y emisiones humanas = 11.5 GtC\/a\u00f1o, calcula:<\/p>\r\n                <ol>\r\n                    <li>Flujo neto natural (biosfera \u2194 atm\u00f3sfera)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Flujo neto TOTAL atmosf\u00e9rico<\/li>\r\n                    <li>\u00bfA d\u00f3nde va el carbono \"faltante\"?<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <details>\r\n                    <summary class=\"solution-toggle\">Ver soluci\u00f3n modelo<\/summary>\r\n                    <div class=\"solution-text\">\r\n                        <p><strong>C\u00e1lculos:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ol>\r\n                            <li>Flujo neto natural = 120 - 118 = <strong>+2 GtC\/a\u00f1o<\/strong> (acumulaci\u00f3n lenta)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Flujo neto total = 2 + 11.5 = <strong>+13.5 GtC\/a\u00f1o<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                            <li>El carbono va a:\r\n                                <ul>\r\n                                    <li>~25% a oc\u00e9anos (2.5 GtC) \u2192 acidificaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                                    <li>~25% a biosfera terrestre (reforestaci\u00f3n, aumento biomasa)<\/li>\r\n                                    <li>~50% permanece en atm\u00f3sfera (5-6 GtC) \u2192 aumento de CO\u2082<\/li>\r\n                                <\/ul>\r\n                            <\/li>\r\n                        <\/ol>\r\n                        <p style=\"color: #ffff00;\">Conclusi\u00f3n: Atm\u00f3sfera gana ~6 ppm CO\u2082\/a\u00f1o<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/details>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n                <div class=\"problem-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problem-num\">PROBLEMA 3<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"problem-difficulty\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <p><strong>Pregunta (An\u00e1lisis integrador):<\/strong> La deforestaci\u00f3n amaz\u00f3nica anual es ~1 mill\u00f3n ha. Si cada hect\u00e1rea almacena ~100 tC (toneladas de carbono), analiza el impacto TOTAL en el ciclo global del carbono (emisi\u00f3n directa + p\u00e9rdida de sumidero).<\/p>\r\n                <details>\r\n                    <summary class=\"solution-toggle\">Ver soluci\u00f3n modelo<\/summary>\r\n                    <div class=\"solution-text\">\r\n                        <p><strong>An\u00e1lisis:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Emisi\u00f3n directa:<\/strong> 1 M ha \u00d7 100 tC\/ha = 100 MtC = 0.1 GtC\/a\u00f1o<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>P\u00e9rdida de sumidero:<\/strong> Ecosistema vivo absorbe ~2-3 tC\/(ha\u00b7a\u00f1o). P\u00e9rdida = 2-3 MtC\/a\u00f1o<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Impacto TOTAL muy superior:<\/strong> La p\u00e9rdida de funci\u00f3n como \"pulm\u00f3n\" es m\u00e1s grave a largo plazo<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                        <p>Conclusi\u00f3n: Deforestaci\u00f3n = emisi\u00f3n + destrucci\u00f3n de sumidero natural<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/details>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 9: CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <section class=\"metacognitive-section\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Reflexi\u00f3n y autoevaluaci\u00f3n metacognitiva\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\u25b6<\/span> VIII. REFLEXI\u00d3N METACOGNITIVA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"reflection-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"reflection-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u2753 Pregunta de Reflexi\u00f3n Personal<\/h4>\r\n                <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo cambi\u00f3 tu comprensi\u00f3n del cambio clim\u00e1tico despu\u00e9s de entender la magnitud de los reservorios y flujos?<\/p>\r\n                <textarea class=\"reflection-textarea\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" aria-label=\"Campo de reflexi\u00f3n personal sobre el ciclo del carbono\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"reflection-card\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83e\udde0 An\u00e1lisis del Rol de la Biosfera<\/h4>\r\n                <p>\u00bfLa biosfera es un regulador \"pasivo\" o \"activo\" del ciclo del carbono? Justifica con evidencia.<\/p>\r\n                <textarea class=\"reflection-textarea\" placeholder=\"Tu an\u00e1lisis aqu\u00ed...\" aria-label=\"Campo para an\u00e1lisis de la biosfera como regulador\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"reflection-card\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udcc8 Estrategia para Futuros Ex\u00e1menes<\/h4>\r\n                <p>\u00bfQu\u00e9 patr\u00f3n o regla mnemot\u00e9cnica usar\u00e1s para recordar orden de reservorios y tiempos de residencia?<\/p>\r\n                <textarea class=\"reflection-textarea\" placeholder=\"Tu estrategia aqu\u00ed...\" aria-label=\"Campo para desarrollar estrategias de estudio\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"conclusion-box\">\r\n            <p class=\"conclusion\">\r\n                <strong>\ud83c\udf0d Una Verdad Fundamental:<\/strong> El ciclo del carbono es el gran regulador de la vida y el clima. \r\n                Su alteraci\u00f3n actual desde 1750 representa el <strong>mayor desaf\u00edo ambiental<\/strong> de la historia humana. \r\n                Cada grado de calentamiento multiplica los riesgos.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <blockquote class=\"neon-quote\">\r\n                \"El carbono no desaparece: solo cambia de lugar. \r\n                <strong>Y ahora, lo estamos moviendo demasiado r\u00e1pido para que la naturaleza lo pueda regular.<\/strong>\"\r\n            <\/blockquote>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <!-- RECURSOS ADICIONALES -->\r\n    <!-- ============================================================ -->\r\n    <section class=\"resources-section\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Recursos adicionales\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> RECURSOS Y REFERENCIAS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"resources-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"resource-card\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83c\udf10 Fuentes Oficiales<\/h4>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li><strong>IPCC (Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change):<\/strong> Reportes quinquenales sobre cambio clim\u00e1tico<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>NASA Global Carbon Project:<\/strong> Datos sobre ciclo del carbono en tiempo real<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>NOAA Keeling Curve:<\/strong> Medici\u00f3n m\u00e1s larga de CO\u2082 atmosf\u00e9rico<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"resource-card\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udcd6 Para Leer M\u00e1s<\/h4>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li><em>The Carbon Cycle<\/em> - McElroy (MIT Press)<\/li>\r\n                    <li><em>An Inconvenient Truth<\/em> - Gore (documentado con ciclo del carbono)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Papers IPCC: AR6 (2023) - Cap\u00edtulo sobre ciclos biogeoqu\u00edmicos<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"resource-card\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83c\udfac Videos Recomendados<\/h4>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>NASA: \"The Carbon Cycle\" (5 min)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Khan Academy: \"Biogeochemical Cycles\"<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Kurzgesagt: \"The CO\u2082 Cycle Explained\"<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK OPTIMIZADA -->\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el reservorio M\u00c1S grande de carbono?","opciones":["Atm\u00f3sfera","Oc\u00e9anos","Biosfera","Litosfera"],"correcta":"Litosfera"},{"pregunta":"Proceso que absorbe CO\u2082 atmosf\u00e9rico","opciones":["Respiraci\u00f3n","Fotos\u00edntesis","Combusti\u00f3n","Evaporaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Fotos\u00edntesis"},{"pregunta":"Flujo anual de fotos\u00edntesis terrestre","opciones":["10 GtC","120 GtC","1 000 GtC","12 000 GtC"],"correcta":"120 GtC"},{"pregunta":"Emisiones humanas actuales","opciones":["1 GtC","11.5 GtC","50 GtC","100 GtC"],"correcta":"11.5 GtC"},{"pregunta":"CO\u2082 atmosf\u00e9rico actual","opciones":["280 ppm","350 ppm","420 ppm","500 ppm"],"correcta":"420 ppm"},{"pregunta":"Absorci\u00f3n oce\u00e1nica neta","opciones":["0.5 GtC","2.5 GtC","10 GtC","25 GtC"],"correcta":"2.5 GtC"},{"pregunta":"Tiempo de residencia en oc\u00e9ano profundo","opciones":["10 a\u00f1os","100 a\u00f1os","1 000 a\u00f1os","10 000 a\u00f1os"],"correcta":"1 000 a\u00f1os"},{"pregunta":"Ecuaci\u00f3n de fotos\u00edntesis","opciones":["\\ce{CO2 -> C6H12O6}","\\ce{6CO2 + 6H2O -> C6H12O6 + 6O2}","\\ce{C6H12O6 -> 6CO2}","Ninguna"],"correcta":"\\ce{6CO2 + 6H2O -> C6H12O6 + 6O2}"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es acidificaci\u00f3n oce\u00e1nica?","opciones":["M\u00e1s sal","Baja pH por CO\u2082","Menos O\u2082","Sube temperatura"],"correcta":"Baja pH por CO\u2082"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la bomba biol\u00f3gica?","opciones":["Fitoplancton hunde carbono","Corriente oce\u00e1nica","Explosi\u00f3n algal","Volc\u00e1n"],"correcta":"Fitoplancton hunde carbono"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es carbono azul?","opciones":["Manglares\/marismas","Atm\u00f3sfera","F\u00f3siles","Nubes"],"correcta":"Manglares\/marismas"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 muestra la curva de Keeling?","opciones":["Temperatura","CO\u2082 creciente + ciclo estacional","Ozono","Vientos"],"correcta":"CO\u2082 creciente + ciclo estacional"},{"pregunta":"Causa del greening","opciones":["Menos CO\u2082","Fertilizaci\u00f3n por CO\u2082","M\u00e1s lluvia","Menos luz"],"correcta":"Fertilizaci\u00f3n por CO\u2082"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 libera el permafrost?","opciones":["CO\u2082","Metano (CH\u2084)","O\u2082","N\u2082"],"correcta":"Metano (CH\u2084)"},{"pregunta":"GtC significa...","opciones":["Gigatones CO\u2082","Gigatones de carbono","Grados Celsius","Gases totales"],"correcta":"Gigatones de carbono"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es un sumidero?","opciones":["Emite","Absorbe m\u00e1s del que emite","Neutral","Solo plantas"],"correcta":"Absorbe m\u00e1s del que emite"},{"pregunta":"Porcentaje del carbono en la litosfera","opciones":["<1%","10%","50%",">99%"],"correcta":">99%"},{"pregunta":"Aumento de CO\u2082 desde 1750","opciones":["+10%","+30%","+50%","+100%"],"correcta":"+50%"},{"pregunta":"Sumidero costero m\u00e1s potente","opciones":["Playas","Manglares\/marismas","Corales","Algas"],"correcta":"Manglares\/marismas"},{"pregunta":"Ley que rige solubilidad del CO\u2082","opciones":["Boyle","Henry","Dalton","Fick"],"correcta":"Henry"},{"pregunta":"CO\u2082 antropog\u00e9nico absorbido por oc\u00e9anos","opciones":["~10%","~25%","~40%","~60%"],"correcta":"~25%"},{"pregunta":"Carbono negro es...","opciones":["Holl\u00edn","CO\u2082","Metano","Carbonatos"],"correcta":"Holl\u00edn"},{"pregunta":"Feedback \u00e1rtico positivo","opciones":["M\u00e1s hielo","Permafrost libera CH\u2084","Menos CO\u2082","Enfriamiento"],"correcta":"Permafrost libera CH\u2084"},{"pregunta":"95% del carbono m\u00f3vil est\u00e1 en...","opciones":["Atm\u00f3sfera","Oc\u00e9anos","Biosfera","Suelos"],"correcta":"Oc\u00e9anos"},{"pregunta":"DOC significa...","opciones":["Carbono org\u00e1nico disuelto","Di\u00f3xido de carbono","Carbono muerto","Carbono f\u00f3sil"],"correcta":"Carbono org\u00e1nico disuelto"},{"pregunta":"Carbono terrestre en suelos","opciones":["~20%","~50%","~75%","~90%"],"correcta":"~75%"},{"pregunta":"Balance natural antes de 1750","opciones":["Combusti\u00f3n","Balance natural fotos\u00edntesis-respiraci\u00f3n","Volcanes","Erosi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Balance natural fotos\u00edntesis-respiraci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la fracci\u00f3n aerotransportada?","opciones":["% de emisiones que queda en atm\u00f3sfera","Vuelos","CO\u2082 total","Metano"],"correcta":"% de emisiones que queda en atm\u00f3sfera"},{"pregunta":"Tiempo para que desaparezca el exceso de CO\u2082","opciones":["10 a\u00f1os","100 a\u00f1os","1 000 a\u00f1os","Cientos de miles de a\u00f1os"],"correcta":"Cientos de miles de a\u00f1os"},{"pregunta":"El ciclo del carbono es...","opciones":["Lineal","Cerrado","Abierto","Imposible de alterar"],"correcta":"Cerrado"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"ley-liebig","titulo":"Ley de Liebig: El Factor Limitante que Controla la Productividad de los Ecosistemas","contenido":"<p class=\"intro\">\r\n    La <strong>Ley del M\u00ednimo<\/strong> de Justus von Liebig (1840) establece que el crecimiento y la productividad de un organismo o poblaci\u00f3n est\u00e1n determinados no por la cantidad total de recursos disponibles, sino por el recurso esencial presente en menor cantidad relativa a las necesidades. Esta ley, ilustrada cl\u00e1sicamente con el \u201cbarril de Liebig\u201d, es un principio fundamental en ecolog\u00eda, agricultura y gesti\u00f3n de recursos naturales, y explica fen\u00f3menos como la eutrofizaci\u00f3n, la limitaci\u00f3n por nutrientes en oc\u00e9anos y la optimizaci\u00f3n de cultivos.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"formula-neon text-center\">\r\n    Productividad real:<br>\r\n    \\[ P = k \\cdot \\min(r_1, r_2, \\dots, r_n) \\]\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    I. Principios y Extensi\u00f3n de la Ley de Liebig\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    La ley se aplica a factores abi\u00f3ticos esenciales (nutrientes, agua, luz, temperatura) y se complementa con la <strong>Ley de Tolerancia<\/strong> de Victor Shelford (1913), que a\u00f1ade que el exceso tambi\u00e9n puede ser limitante.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Concepto<\/th>\r\n            <th>Liebig (M\u00ednimo)<\/th>\r\n            <th>Shelford (Tolerancia)<\/th>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Enfoque<\/td>\r\n            <td>D\u00e9ficit del recurso cr\u00edtico<\/td>\r\n            <td>Rango \u00f3ptimo (m\u00ednimo y m\u00e1ximo)<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Ejemplo<\/td>\r\n            <td>F\u00f3sforo limita fitoplancton<\/td>\r\n            <td>Exceso de salinidad mata plantas<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Aplicaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n            <td>Fertilizaci\u00f3n balanceada<\/td>\r\n            <td>Zonas de estr\u00e9s ecol\u00f3gico<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n    <strong>Limitaci\u00f3n secuencial:<\/strong> Al corregir un factor limitante, otro se convierte en el nuevo cuello de botella.\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    II. El Barril de Liebig (Diagrama Interactivo)\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Representaci\u00f3n cl\u00e1sica: la capacidad del barril (productividad) est\u00e1 limitada por el tabl\u00f3n m\u00e1s corto.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <svg class=\"liebig-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1600 900\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow-cyan\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#00ffff\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow-green\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#00e676\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow-red\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"8\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#ff1744\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n\r\n        <rect width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" fill=\"#070714\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"800\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"56\" fill=\"#ff00ff\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">BARRIL DE LIEBIG<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Barril base -->\r\n        <ellipse cx=\"800\" cy=\"220\" rx=\"460\" ry=\"90\" fill=\"#111\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"8\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <ellipse cx=\"800\" cy=\"740\" rx=\"460\" ry=\"90\" fill=\"#111\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"8\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <rect x=\"340\" y=\"220\" width=\"920\" height=\"520\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"8\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Tablones -->\r\n        <g font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\r\n            <rect x=\"430\" y=\"260\" width=\"100\" height=\"440\" fill=\"#00e676\" filter=\"url(#glow-green)\"\/>\r\n            <text x=\"480\" y=\"245\" fill=\"#000\">N<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <rect x=\"570\" y=\"310\" width=\"100\" height=\"390\" fill=\"#00e676\" filter=\"url(#glow-green)\"\/>\r\n            <text x=\"620\" y=\"295\" fill=\"#000\">P<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <rect x=\"710\" y=\"240\" width=\"100\" height=\"460\" fill=\"#00e676\" filter=\"url(#glow-green)\"\/>\r\n            <text x=\"760\" y=\"225\" fill=\"#000\">K<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <rect x=\"850\" y=\"300\" width=\"100\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#00e676\" filter=\"url(#glow-green)\"\/>\r\n            <text x=\"900\" y=\"285\" fill=\"#000\">H\u2082O<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <rect x=\"990\" y=\"360\" width=\"100\" height=\"340\" fill=\"#ff1744\" filter=\"url(#glow-red)\"\/>\r\n            <text x=\"1040\" y=\"345\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"30\">Fe<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"1040\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#ffcccc\" font-size=\"20\">(LIMITANTE)<\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Agua animada -->\r\n        <rect x=\"360\" y=\"740\" width=\"880\" height=\"340\" fill=\"#1e90ff\" opacity=\"0.85\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"800\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"48\" fill=\"#00ffff\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">PRODUCTIVIDAD M\u00c1XIMA<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"800\" y=\"860\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#00ffff\">Limitada por el tabl\u00f3n m\u00e1s corto<\/text>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    III. Simuladores Interactivos\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: Barril de Liebig Din\u00e1mico<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Ajusta la disponibilidad de cada recurso y observa c\u00f3mo el factor limitante determina la productividad m\u00e1xima.\r\n<\/p>\r\n<div class=\"cyber-monitor\" id=\"cyberSystem\">\r\n    <div class=\"monitor-header\">\r\n        > ANALYSIS_SYSTEM_V4.2: FACTORES LIMITANTES\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"controls-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #333;\">\r\n        <div class=\"control-item\">\r\n            <label style=\"font-size: 10px; color: var(--cyan); display: block;\">N - NITR\u00d3GENO<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" class=\"factor-slider\" data-factor=\"N\" min=\"10\" max=\"100\" value=\"80\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"control-item\">\r\n            <label style=\"font-size: 10px; color: var(--cyan); display: block;\">P - F\u00d3SFORO<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" class=\"factor-slider\" data-factor=\"P\" min=\"10\" max=\"100\" value=\"70\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"control-item\">\r\n            <label style=\"font-size: 10px; color: var(--cyan); display: block;\">K - POTASIO<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" class=\"factor-slider\" data-factor=\"K\" min=\"10\" max=\"100\" value=\"90\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"control-item\">\r\n            <label style=\"font-size: 10px; color: var(--cyan); display: block;\">H2O - AGUA<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" class=\"factor-slider\" data-factor=\"H2O\" min=\"10\" max=\"100\" value=\"60\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"control-item\">\r\n            <label style=\"font-size: 10px; color: var(--cyan); display: block;\">Fe - HIERRO<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" class=\"factor-slider\" data-factor=\"Fe\" min=\"10\" max=\"100\" value=\"40\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"factors-grid\" id=\"monitorGrid\">\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"system-status\" id=\"systemStatus\">\r\n        <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const sliders = document.querySelectorAll(\".factor-slider\");\r\n    const grid = document.getElementById(\"monitorGrid\");\r\n    const status = document.getElementById(\"systemStatus\");\r\n\r\n    const factorNames = {\r\n        \"N\": \"Nitr\u00f3geno\",\r\n        \"P\": \"F\u00f3sforo\",\r\n        \"K\": \"Potasio\",\r\n        \"H2O\": \"Agua\",\r\n        \"Fe\": \"Hierro\"\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        let minValue = 101;\r\n        let limitingKey = \"\";\r\n        let html = \"\";\r\n\r\n        \/\/ 1. Encontrar el valor m\u00ednimo primero\r\n        sliders.forEach(s => {\r\n            if(parseInt(s.value) < minValue) {\r\n                minValue = parseInt(s.value);\r\n                limitingKey = s.dataset.factor;\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ 2. Generar el HTML de las tarjetas\r\n        sliders.forEach(s => {\r\n            const key = s.dataset.factor;\r\n            const val = s.value;\r\n            const isLimiting = (key === limitingKey);\r\n\r\n            html += `\r\n                <div class=\"factor-card ${isLimiting ? 'limiting' : ''}\">\r\n                    <span class=\"factor-name\" ${isLimiting ? 'style=\"color: var(--red);\"' : ''}>${factorNames[key]}<\/span>\r\n                    <div class=\"progress-container\">\r\n                        <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: ${val}%; ${isLimiting ? 'background: var(--red);' : ''}\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <span class=\"factor-value\">${val}%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            `;\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        grid.innerHTML = html;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ 3. Actualizar el panel de status inferior\r\n        status.innerHTML = `\r\n            <span class=\"status-tag\">[ ALERTA DE SISTEMA ]<\/span><br>\r\n            FACTOR LIMITANTE DETECTADO: <span style=\"color: var(--red);\">${factorNames[limitingKey].toUpperCase()}<\/span>.<br>\r\n            PRODUCTIVIDAD M\u00c1XIMA DEL ECOSISTEMA: <span style=\"color: var(--yellow);\">${minValue}%<\/span>.\r\n        `;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    sliders.forEach(s => s.addEventListener(\"input\", update));\r\n    update(); \/\/ Ejecuci\u00f3n inicial\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Mini-Laboratorio: Identificaci\u00f3n del Factor Limitante<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Selecciona un ecosistema y analiza el factor limitante principal con su explicaci\u00f3n y consecuencia ecol\u00f3gica.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"mini-lab\">\r\n    <div class=\"lab-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"lab-label\">Ecosistema:<\/span>\r\n        <select id=\"ecosystemSelect\">\r\n            <option value=\"temperate-forest\">Bosque templado<\/option>\r\n            <option value=\"open-ocean\">Oc\u00e9ano abierto<\/option>\r\n            <option value=\"desert\">Desierto<\/option>\r\n            <option value=\"eutrophic-lake\">Lago eutr\u00f3fico<\/option>\r\n            <option value=\"tropical-rainforest\" selected>Selva tropical<\/option>\r\n            <option value=\"arctic-tundra\">Tundra \u00e1rtica<\/option>\r\n        <\/select>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"lab-card\">\r\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Factor limitante principal:<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"card-limiting\" id=\"labContent\"><\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"card-section\">\r\n            <div class=\"section-title\">Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"section-content\" id=\"labExplanation\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"card-section\">\r\n            <div class=\"section-title\">Consecuencia ecol\u00f3gica:<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"section-content\" id=\"labConsequence\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const select = document.getElementById(\"ecosystemSelect\");\r\n    const limiting = document.getElementById(\"labContent\");\r\n    const explanation = document.getElementById(\"labExplanation\");\r\n    const consequence = document.getElementById(\"labConsequence\");\r\n\r\n    const ecosystems = {\r\n        \"temperate-forest\": {\r\n            limiting: \"Luz (en el sotobosque)\",\r\n            explanation: \"La densa cobertura arb\u00f3rea reduce la luz disponible para pl\u00e1ntulas y hierbas del suelo.\",\r\n            consequence: \"Regeneraci\u00f3n forestal limitada; favorece especies tolerantes a sombra y estratificaci\u00f3n vertical.\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"open-ocean\": {\r\n            limiting: \"Hierro (en zonas HNLC) o Nitr\u00f3geno\",\r\n            explanation: \"En regiones de alta concentraci\u00f3n de nutrientes pero baja clorofila (HNLC), el hierro es cr\u00edtico para la fotos\u00edntesis.\",\r\n            consequence: \"Productividad fitoplanct\u00f3nica baja pese a otros nutrientes; afecta toda la cadena tr\u00f3fica marina.\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"desert\": {\r\n            limiting: \"Agua\",\r\n            explanation: \"La escasez h\u00eddrica controla todos los procesos biol\u00f3gicos en estos ambientes extremos.\",\r\n            consequence: \"Adaptaciones extremas (suculentas, dormancia); baja biomasa y diversidad espec\u00edfica.\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"eutrophic-lake\": {\r\n            limiting: \"F\u00f3sforo\",\r\n            explanation: \"Cl\u00e1sico ejemplo de limitaci\u00f3n por P en aguas dulces continentales debido a su baja movilidad.\",\r\n            consequence: \"Eutrofizaci\u00f3n: blooms de algas, anoxia y p\u00e9rdida de biodiversidad acu\u00e1tica.\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"tropical-rainforest\": {\r\n            limiting: \"F\u00f3sforo (en suelos antiguos)\",\r\n            explanation: \"Suelos altamente lixiviados carecen de P disponible pese a alta precipitaci\u00f3n y temperatura.\",\r\n            consequence: \"Estrategias de reciclaje eficiente de nutrientes; alta biodiversidad pero vulnerable a perturbaciones.\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"arctic-tundra\": {\r\n            limiting: \"Temperatura \/ Nutrientes (por permafrost)\",\r\n            explanation: \"Bajas temperaturas y suelo congelado limitan la disponibilidad y descomposici\u00f3n de nutrientes.\",\r\n            consequence: \"Crecimiento vegetal lento; ecosistema fr\u00e1gil al calentamiento global y liberaci\u00f3n de carbono.\"\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    function evaluate(){\r\n        const data = ecosystems[select.value];\r\n        limiting.textContent = data.limiting;\r\n        explanation.textContent = data.explanation;\r\n        consequence.textContent = data.consequence;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    select.addEventListener(\"change\", evaluate);\r\n    evaluate();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Quiz Autoevaluado: Ley de Liebig y Shelford<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-liebig-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-liebig-question\" data-question=\"1\">\r\n        <p class=\"quiz-liebig-text\">1. Seg\u00fan Liebig, la productividad est\u00e1 limitada por:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-liebig-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-liebig-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkLiebigQuiz(this)\">El recurso m\u00e1s abundante<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-liebig-btn\" data-correct=\"true\" onclick=\"window.checkLiebigQuiz(this)\">El recurso m\u00e1s escaso<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-liebig-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkLiebigQuiz(this)\">La suma de todos los recursos<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-liebig-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-liebig-question\" data-question=\"2\">\r\n        <p class=\"quiz-liebig-text\">2. La Ley de Shelford a\u00f1ade que:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-liebig-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-liebig-btn\" data-correct=\"true\" onclick=\"window.checkLiebigQuiz(this)\">El exceso puede ser tan limitante como el d\u00e9ficit<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-liebig-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkLiebigQuiz(this)\">Solo importa el m\u00ednimo<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-liebig-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkLiebigQuiz(this)\">No hay l\u00edmites superiores<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-liebig-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-liebig-question\" data-question=\"3\">\r\n        <p class=\"quiz-liebig-text\">3. En lagos eutr\u00f3ficos continentales, el nutriente limitante t\u00edpico es:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-liebig-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-liebig-btn\" data-correct=\"true\" onclick=\"window.checkLiebigQuiz(this)\">F\u00f3sforo<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-liebig-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkLiebigQuiz(this)\">Nitr\u00f3geno<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-liebig-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkLiebigQuiz(this)\">Hierro<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-liebig-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-liebig-question\" data-question=\"4\">\r\n        <p class=\"quiz-liebig-text\">4. En oc\u00e9anos abiertos (zonas HNLC), el limitante suele ser:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-liebig-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-liebig-btn\" data-correct=\"true\" onclick=\"window.checkLiebigQuiz(this)\">Hierro<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-liebig-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkLiebigQuiz(this)\">F\u00f3sforo<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-liebig-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkLiebigQuiz(this)\">Luz<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-liebig-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-liebig-question\" data-question=\"5\">\r\n        <p class=\"quiz-liebig-text\">5. La limitaci\u00f3n es secuencial porque:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-liebig-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-liebig-btn\" data-correct=\"true\" onclick=\"window.checkLiebigQuiz(this)\">Al corregir un factor, otro se vuelve limitante<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-liebig-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkLiebigQuiz(this)\">Todos los factores son iguales<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-liebig-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkLiebigQuiz(this)\">No cambia nunca<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-liebig-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"liebigQuizScore\" class=\"quiz-liebig-score\">Puntuaci\u00f3n: 0\/5<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nwindow.liebigQuizState = { score: 0, total: 5, answered: new Set() };\r\nwindow.checkLiebigQuiz = function(button){\r\n    if(!button) return;\r\n    const question = button.closest(\".quiz-liebig-question\");\r\n    if(!question) return;\r\n    const questionNum = question.getAttribute(\"data-question\");\r\n    if(window.liebigQuizState.answered.has(questionNum)) return;\r\n    \r\n    const correct = button.getAttribute(\"data-correct\") === \"true\";\r\n    const feedback = question.querySelector(\".quiz-liebig-feedback\");\r\n    const allButtons = question.querySelectorAll(\".quiz-liebig-btn\");\r\n    \r\n    allButtons.forEach(btn => {\r\n        btn.disabled = true;\r\n        if(btn.getAttribute(\"data-correct\") === \"true\") btn.classList.add(\"quiz-liebig-correct\");\r\n        if(btn === button && !correct) btn.classList.add(\"quiz-liebig-incorrect\");\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    window.liebigQuizState.answered.add(questionNum);\r\n    if(correct) {\r\n        window.liebigQuizState.score++;\r\n        feedback.textContent = \"\u2705 \u00a1Correcto!\";\r\n        feedback.classList.add(\"feedback-correct\");\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback.textContent = \"\u274c Incorrecto. La respuesta correcta est\u00e1 marcada.\";\r\n        feedback.classList.add(\"feedback-incorrect\");\r\n    }\r\n    feedback.style.display = \"block\";\r\n    const scoreEl = document.getElementById(\"liebigQuizScore\");\r\n    if(scoreEl) scoreEl.textContent = \"Puntuaci\u00f3n: \" + window.liebigQuizState.score + \"\/\" + window.liebigQuizState.total;\r\n};\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    IV. Errores Comunes del Estudiante\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"errors-liebig-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"error-liebig-item\" data-error=\"1\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"errLiebig1\" class=\"error-liebig-toggle\" onchange=\"window.toggleLiebigError(this)\">\r\n        <label for=\"errLiebig1\" class=\"error-liebig-label\">Creer que a\u00f1adir cualquier nutriente aumenta indefinidamente la productividad.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-liebig-explain\" style=\"display:none;\">Una vez superado el factor limitante actual, otro se convierte en limitante.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-liebig-item\" data-error=\"2\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"errLiebig2\" class=\"error-liebig-toggle\" onchange=\"window.toggleLiebigError(this)\">\r\n        <label for=\"errLiebig2\" class=\"error-liebig-label\">Ignorar la Ley de Shelford (exceso t\u00f3xico).<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-liebig-explain\" style=\"display:none;\">Ejemplo: exceso de nitr\u00f3geno causa acidificaci\u00f3n del suelo y toxicidad.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-liebig-item\" data-error=\"3\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"errLiebig3\" class=\"error-liebig-toggle\" onchange=\"window.toggleLiebigError(this)\">\r\n        <label for=\"errLiebig3\" class=\"error-liebig-label\">Confundir factor limitante con factor controlador absoluto.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-liebig-explain\" style=\"display:none;\">El factor limitante cambia seg\u00fan condiciones (espacio, tiempo, especie).<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nwindow.toggleLiebigError = function(checkbox){\r\n    const item = checkbox.closest(\".error-liebig-item\");\r\n    if(!item) return;\r\n    const explain = item.querySelector(\".error-liebig-explain\");\r\n    if(explain) explain.style.display = checkbox.checked ? \"block\" : \"none\";\r\n};\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    V. Conexi\u00f3n con el Curr\u00edculo de Ecosistemas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Este tema pertenece al bloque \"Factores bi\u00f3ticos y abi\u00f3ticos\" y \"Productividad de ecosistemas\" en Biolog\u00eda y Ciencias Ambientales. Se eval\u00faa en ex\u00e1menes oficiales junto a cadenas tr\u00f3ficas, ciclos biogeoqu\u00edmicos y manejo sostenible de recursos. Es fundamental para interpretar fen\u00f3menos como la eutrofizaci\u00f3n y la fertilizaci\u00f3n agr\u00edcola.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VI. Problemas Tipo Examen\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ol class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n    <li>Explica con un ejemplo por qu\u00e9 a\u00f1adir un nutriente en exceso no garantiza mayor productividad.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Analiza la diferencia entre la Ley de Liebig y la Ley de Shelford con casos reales.<\/li>\r\n    <li>En un lago eutr\u00f3fico, \u00bfpor qu\u00e9 el f\u00f3sforo suele ser el factor limitante y no el nitr\u00f3geno?<\/li>\r\n    <li>Predice el efecto de la acidificaci\u00f3n oce\u00e1nica sobre la limitaci\u00f3n por hierro en fitoplancton.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Justifica la aplicaci\u00f3n de la Ley del M\u00ednimo en la gesti\u00f3n sostenible de agroecosistemas.<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VII. Reflexi\u00f3n Metacognitiva\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"reflection-list\">\r\n    <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo cambia tu comprensi\u00f3n de la productividad ecosist\u00e9mica al reconocer que siempre existe un factor limitante?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfEn qu\u00e9 situaciones reales (agricultura, conservaci\u00f3n) aplicar\u00edas la Ley de Liebig para tomar decisiones?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategia usar\u00e1s para identificar el verdadero factor limitante en problemas complejos de examen?<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">\r\n    La Ley de Liebig nos recuerda que en la naturaleza, el equilibrio depende de no fallar en lo esencial. Dominar este principio permite gestionar recursos de forma inteligente y sostenible.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"neon-quote\">\r\n    \u201cEl rendimiento est\u00e1 dictado por el m\u00e1s d\u00e9bil, no por el m\u00e1s fuerte.\u201d\r\n<\/blockquote>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"La Ley de Liebig tambi\u00e9n se conoce como...","opciones":["Ley del m\u00e1ximo","Ley del m\u00ednimo","Ley del promedio","Ley de Shelford"],"correcta":"Ley del m\u00ednimo"},{"pregunta":"Analog\u00eda cl\u00e1sica de Liebig","opciones":["Cadena","Barril","Pir\u00e1mide","Escalera"],"correcta":"Barril"},{"pregunta":"El crecimiento lo limita el factor...","opciones":["M\u00e1s abundante","M\u00e1s escaso","Promedio","M\u00e1s t\u00f3xico"],"correcta":"M\u00e1s escaso"},{"pregunta":"Autor de la ley","opciones":["Shelford","Liebig","Blackman","Mendel"],"correcta":"Liebig"},{"pregunta":"A\u00f1o aproximado de la ley","opciones":["1750","1840","1913","1950"],"correcta":"1840"},{"pregunta":"En lagos de agua dulce limita normalmente...","opciones":["Nitr\u00f3geno","F\u00f3sforo","Hierro","Potasio"],"correcta":"F\u00f3sforo"},{"pregunta":"En oc\u00e9ano abierto (zonas HNLC) limita...","opciones":["Nitr\u00f3geno","F\u00f3sforo","Hierro","Silicio"],"correcta":"Hierro"},{"pregunta":"En desierto limita...","opciones":["Luz","Agua","Nitr\u00f3geno","CO\u2082"],"correcta":"Agua"},{"pregunta":"Ley de Shelford trata sobre...","opciones":["El m\u00ednimo","El m\u00e1ximo","El \u00f3ptimo","El promedio"],"correcta":"El m\u00e1ximo"},{"pregunta":"La \u201czona de tolerancia\u201d est\u00e1 entre...","opciones":["Liebig y Shelford","Solo Liebig","Solo Shelford","Ninguno"],"correcta":"Liebig y Shelford"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula conceptual de Liebig","opciones":["P = max(f)","P = min(f)","P = avg(f)","P = sum(f)"],"correcta":"P = min(f)"},{"pregunta":"En agricultura, \u00bfpor qu\u00e9 se usa NPK?","opciones":["Porque son los \u00fanicos nutrientes","Para evitar que alguno sea limitante","Porque son baratos","Por tradici\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Para evitar que alguno sea limitante"},{"pregunta":"Eutrofizaci\u00f3n es causada principalmente por exceso de...","opciones":["Nitr\u00f3geno","F\u00f3sforo","Potasio","Calcio"],"correcta":"F\u00f3sforo"},{"pregunta":"A\u00f1adir hierro al oc\u00e9ano provoca...","opciones":["Muerte algal","Bloom fitoplancton","Acidificaci\u00f3n","Enfriamiento"],"correcta":"Bloom fitoplancton"},{"pregunta":"En suelos tropicales antiguos suele limitar...","opciones":["Nitr\u00f3geno","F\u00f3sforo","Agua","Luz"],"correcta":"F\u00f3sforo"},{"pregunta":"En praderas templadas suele limitar...","opciones":["F\u00f3sforo","Nitr\u00f3geno","Agua","Luz"],"correcta":"Nitr\u00f3geno"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQui\u00e9n formul\u00f3 la Ley del M\u00e1ximo?","opciones":["Liebig","Shelford","Blackman","Odum"],"correcta":"Shelford"},{"pregunta":"La curva de respuesta t\u00edpica seg\u00fan Liebig es...","opciones":["Lineal","Exponencial","Plat\u00f3 despu\u00e9s del m\u00ednimo","Sigmoide"],"correcta":"Plat\u00f3 despu\u00e9s del m\u00ednimo"},{"pregunta":"NPK significa...","opciones":["Nitr\u00f3geno-Potasion-F\u00f3sforo","Nitr\u00f3geno-F\u00f3sforo-Potasio","Nitr\u00f3geno-F\u00f3sforo-Kript\u00f3n","Ninguno"],"correcta":"Nitr\u00f3geno-F\u00f3sforo-Potasio"},{"pregunta":"En tundra limita principalmente...","opciones":["Agua","Nitr\u00f3geno","Temperatura","Luz"],"correcta":"Temperatura"},{"pregunta":"Extensi\u00f3n de Liebig a la luz (1905)","opciones":["Ley de Shelford","Ley de Blackman","Ley de Mitscherlich","Ley de Boyle"],"correcta":"Ley de Blackman"},{"pregunta":"Modelo matem\u00e1tico m\u00e1s simple de Liebig","opciones":["P = a + b\u00b7N","P = k\u00b7min(N,P)","P = N\u00b7P","P = e^N"],"correcta":"P = k\u00b7min(N,P)"},{"pregunta":"En geoingenier\u00eda, a\u00f1adir Fe busca...","opciones":["Aumentar pesca","Secuestrar CO\u2082","Reducir temperatura","Todas"],"correcta":"Todas"},{"pregunta":"La ley de Liebig es de tipo...","opciones":["Aditiva","Multiplicativa","Minimoide","Exponencial"],"correcta":"Minimoide"},{"pregunta":"En limnolog\u00eda, el \u201cgatillo\u201d de la eutrofizaci\u00f3n es...","opciones":["Nitr\u00f3geno","F\u00f3sforo","Carbono","Hierro"],"correcta":"F\u00f3sforo"},{"pregunta":"Liebig era por profesi\u00f3n...","opciones":["Bot\u00e1nico","Qu\u00edmico agr\u00edcola","Ec\u00f3logo","F\u00edsico"],"correcta":"Qu\u00edmico agr\u00edcola"},{"pregunta":"En zonas HNLC del oc\u00e9ano significa...","opciones":["High Nutrient Low Chlorophyll","High Nitrogen Low Carbon","Low Nutrient High Chlorophyll","Ninguna"],"correcta":"High Nutrient Low Chlorophyll"},{"pregunta":"Factor limitante en el dosel de selva tropical (plantas altas)","opciones":["Luz","Agua","Nutrientes","CO\u2082"],"correcta":"Luz"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfPuede un factor compensar totalmente a otro?","opciones":["S\u00ed siempre","Nunca","Solo parcialmente","Depende"],"correcta":"Solo parcialmente"},{"pregunta":"El principio de Liebig es la base de...","opciones":["Agricultura de precisi\u00f3n","Fertilizantes balanceados","Secuestro de carbono","Todas"],"correcta":"Todas"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"ley-shelford","titulo":"Ley de Shelford: La Ley de la Tolerancia y los L\u00edmites Ambientales de la Vida","contenido":"<p class=\"intro\">\r\n    La <strong>Ley de la Tolerancia<\/strong> (Victor Ernest Shelford, 1913) establece que la existencia, abundancia y distribuci\u00f3n de una especie est\u00e1n determinadas por el rango de valores que puede tolerar cada factor ambiental. No solo el d\u00e9ficit (como en la Ley de Liebig), sino tambi\u00e9n el exceso de cualquier factor puede limitar o eliminar una poblaci\u00f3n. Esta ley es clave para entender la distribuci\u00f3n de especies, la sucesi\u00f3n ecol\u00f3gica, la vulnerabilidad al cambio clim\u00e1tico y la gesti\u00f3n de ecosistemas.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"formula-neon text-center\">\r\n    Rendimiento biol\u00f3gico:<br>\r\n    \\[ R(F) = \r\n    \\begin{cases} \r\n    0 & \\text{si } F < F_{\\min} \\text{ o } F > F_{\\max} \\\\\r\n    >0 & \\text{si } F_{\\min} \\leq F \\leq F_{\\max}\r\n    \\end{cases}\r\n    \\]\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    I. Principios de la Ley de la Tolerancia\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Cada factor ambiental presenta un rango de tolerancia definido por valores m\u00ednimos, \u00f3ptimos y m\u00e1ximos. Dentro del rango \u00f3ptimo, la especie alcanza su m\u00e1ximo rendimiento fisiol\u00f3gico y reproductivo.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Zona<\/th>\r\n            <th>Descripci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n            <th>Efecto biol\u00f3gico<\/th>\r\n            <th>Ejemplo<\/th>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Zona letal m\u00ednima<\/td>\r\n            <td>F < F<sub>min<\/sub><\/td>\r\n            <td>Muerte por d\u00e9ficit<\/td>\r\n            <td>Congelaci\u00f3n celular<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Zona de estr\u00e9s m\u00ednima<\/td>\r\n            <td>F<sub>min<\/sub> \u2013 F<sub>opt min<\/sub><\/td>\r\n            <td>Reducci\u00f3n de crecimiento<\/td>\r\n            <td>Deficiencia nutricional<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Zona \u00f3ptima<\/td>\r\n            <td>F<sub>opt min<\/sub> \u2013 F<sub>opt max<\/sub><\/td>\r\n            <td>M\u00e1ximo rendimiento<\/td>\r\n            <td>Condiciones ideales<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Zona de estr\u00e9s m\u00e1xima<\/td>\r\n            <td>F<sub>opt max<\/sub> \u2013 F<sub>max<\/sub><\/td>\r\n            <td>Reducci\u00f3n progresiva<\/td>\r\n            <td>Toxicidad por exceso<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Zona letal m\u00e1xima<\/td>\r\n            <td>F > F<sub>max<\/sub><\/td>\r\n            <td>Muerte por exceso<\/td>\r\n            <td>Hipertermia<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n    <strong>Estenoicas vs Eurioicas:<\/strong> Las especies estenoicas tienen rangos estrechos (especialistas), mientras que las eurioicas tienen rangos amplios (generalistas). En escenarios de cambio ambiental, las estenoicas son m\u00e1s vulnerables.\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    II. Curva de Tolerancia de Shelford\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Representaci\u00f3n gr\u00e1fica cl\u00e1sica de la respuesta biol\u00f3gica ante la intensidad de un factor ambiental.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <svg class=\"shelford-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1600 900\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow-cyan\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#00ffff\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow-red\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"8\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#ff1744\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n            <linearGradient id=\"optimoGrad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"0%\" y2=\"100%\">\r\n                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#1de9b6\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#00e676\"\/>\r\n            <\/linearGradient>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n\r\n        <rect width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" fill=\"#050510\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"800\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"64\" fill=\"#00ffff\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">LEY DE LA TOLERANCIA \u2013 SHELFORD<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Ejes -->\r\n        <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"760\" x2=\"1400\" y2=\"760\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"5\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"760\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"5\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Etiquetas ejes -->\r\n        <text x=\"810\" y=\"840\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#88ffff\">Intensidad del factor ambiental<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"120\" y=\"460\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#88ffff\" transform=\"rotate(-90,120,460)\">Rendimiento biol\u00f3gico<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Zonas de fondo -->\r\n        <rect x=\"220\" y=\"160\" width=\"260\" height=\"600\" fill=\"#ff1744\" opacity=\"0.2\"\/>\r\n        <rect x=\"480\" y=\"160\" width=\"240\" height=\"600\" fill=\"#ff9800\" opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n        <rect x=\"720\" y=\"160\" width=\"360\" height=\"600\" fill=\"url(#optimoGrad)\" opacity=\"0.4\"\/>\r\n        <rect x=\"1080\" y=\"160\" width=\"240\" height=\"600\" fill=\"#ff9800\" opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n        <rect x=\"1320\" y=\"160\" width=\"80\" height=\"600\" fill=\"#ff1744\" opacity=\"0.2\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Curva principal -->\r\n        <path d=\"M220 760 Q600 620 800 280 Q1000 620 1400 760\"\r\n              fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00ffcc\" stroke-width=\"12\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Punto \u00f3ptimo -->\r\n        <circle cx=\"800\" cy=\"280\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#00ffcc\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Etiquetas zonas -->\r\n        <text x=\"350\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"40\" fill=\"#ff1744\" font-weight=\"bold\" filter=\"url(#glow-red)\">LETAL<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"600\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ff9800\">ESTR\u00c9S<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"900\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"48\" fill=\"#00ffcc\" font-weight=\"bold\">\u00d3PTIMO<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"1200\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ff9800\">ESTR\u00c9S<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"1360\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"40\" fill=\"#ff1744\" font-weight=\"bold\" filter=\"url(#glow-red)\">LETAL<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"800\" y=\"880\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#88ffff\">Fuera del rango de tolerancia \u2192 estr\u00e9s \u2192 colapso poblacional<\/text>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    III. Simuladores Interactivos\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: Curva de Tolerancia Din\u00e1mica<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Ajusta la intensidad del factor ambiental (ej. temperatura) y observa la respuesta biol\u00f3gica de una especie hipot\u00e9tica.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"shelford-sim\">\r\n    <label>Intensidad del factor (% del rango total): <span id=\"factorValue\">50<\/span>%<\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"factorSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"50\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"meter-track\">\r\n        <div class=\"meter-fill\" id=\"toleranceFill\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"toleranceResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const slider = document.getElementById(\"factorSlider\");\r\n    const value = document.getElementById(\"factorValue\");\r\n    const fill = document.getElementById(\"toleranceFill\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"toleranceResult\");\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        const v = parseInt(slider.value);\r\n        value.textContent = v;\r\n\r\n        let zone = \"\", message = \"\", color = \"\";\r\n\r\n        if (v < 15) {\r\n            zone = \"Zona letal m\u00ednima\";\r\n            message = \"D\u00e9ficit extremo: muerte celular por falta del factor.\";\r\n            color = \"#ff1744\";\r\n        } else if (v < 30) {\r\n            zone = \"Estr\u00e9s m\u00ednimo\";\r\n            message = \"Crecimiento reducido, menor reproducci\u00f3n.\";\r\n            color = \"#ff9800\";\r\n        } else if (v <= 70) {\r\n            zone = \"Zona \u00f3ptima\";\r\n            message = \"M\u00e1ximo rendimiento fisiol\u00f3gico y reproductivo.\";\r\n            color = \"#00e676\";\r\n        } else if (v <= 85) {\r\n            zone = \"Estr\u00e9s m\u00e1ximo\";\r\n            message = \"Toxicidad progresiva, reducci\u00f3n de fitness.\";\r\n            color = \"#ff9800\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            zone = \"Zona letal m\u00e1xima\";\r\n            message = \"Exceso letal: colapso metab\u00f3lico.\";\r\n            color = \"#ff1744\";\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        fill.style.width = v + \"%\";\r\n        fill.style.background = color;\r\n\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>${zone}<\/strong><br>${message}`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    slider.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Mini-Laboratorio: Comparaci\u00f3n Estenoica vs Eurioica<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Selecciona el tipo de especie y el cambio ambiental para analizar su resiliencia.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"mini-lab\">\r\n    <div class=\"lab-header\">\r\n        <label>Tipo de especie:<\/label>\r\n        <select id=\"speciesType\">\r\n            <option value=\"steno\">Estenoica (rango estrecho)<\/option>\r\n            <option value=\"eurio\">Eurioica (rango amplio)<\/option>\r\n        <\/select>\r\n\r\n        <label>Cambio ambiental:<\/label>\r\n        <select id=\"changeType\">\r\n            <option value=\"temp-up\">Aumento temperatura +4\u00b0C<\/option>\r\n            <option value=\"ph-down\">Acidificaci\u00f3n pH -0.3<\/option>\r\n            <option value=\"salinity-up\">Aumento salinidad +5 ppt<\/option>\r\n        <\/select>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"lab-output\" id=\"resilienceResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const typeSelect = document.getElementById(\"speciesType\");\r\n    const changeSelect = document.getElementById(\"changeType\");\r\n    const output = document.getElementById(\"resilienceResult\");\r\n\r\n    function evaluate(){\r\n        const type = typeSelect.value;\r\n        const change = changeSelect.value;\r\n\r\n        let risk = \"\", explanation = \"\";\r\n\r\n        if (type === \"steno\") {\r\n            risk = \"ALTO RIESGO\";\r\n            explanation = \"Especies con rangos estrechos son altamente vulnerables a cambios ambientales. Probable reducci\u00f3n poblacional o extinci\u00f3n local.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            risk = \"BAJO A MEDIO RIESGO\";\r\n            explanation = \"Especies eurioicas toleran mayor variabilidad. Pueden adaptarse o migrar con menor impacto.\";\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        output.innerHTML = `<strong>Riesgo de impacto:<\/strong> ${risk}<br>\r\n                            <strong>An\u00e1lisis:<\/strong> ${explanation}<br>\r\n                            <em>Ejemplo real: ${type === \"steno\" ? \"Corales en blanqueamiento\" : \"Ratas urbanas en contaminaci\u00f3n\"}<\/em>`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    typeSelect.addEventListener(\"change\", evaluate);\r\n    changeSelect.addEventListener(\"change\", evaluate);\r\n    evaluate();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Quiz Autoevaluado: Ley de la Tolerancia<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-shelford-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-shelford-question\" data-question=\"1\">\r\n        <p class=\"quiz-shelford-text\">1. La Ley de Shelford enfatiza que:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-shelford-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-shelford-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkShelfordQuiz(this)\">Solo el d\u00e9ficit limita<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-shelford-btn\" data-correct=\"true\" onclick=\"window.checkShelfordQuiz(this)\">Tanto el d\u00e9ficit como el exceso pueden limitar<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-shelford-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkShelfordQuiz(this)\">No existen l\u00edmites superiores<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-shelford-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-shelford-question\" data-question=\"2\">\r\n        <p class=\"quiz-shelford-text\">2. En la zona \u00f3ptima:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-shelford-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-shelford-btn\" data-correct=\"true\" onclick=\"window.checkShelfordQuiz(this)\">Se alcanza el m\u00e1ximo rendimiento biol\u00f3gico<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-shelford-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkShelfordQuiz(this)\">Hay estr\u00e9s fisiol\u00f3gico<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-shelford-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkShelfordQuiz(this)\">La supervivencia es imposible<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-shelford-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-shelford-question\" data-question=\"3\">\r\n        <p class=\"quiz-shelford-text\">3. Las especies estenoicas son:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-shelford-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-shelford-btn\" data-correct=\"true\" onclick=\"window.checkShelfordQuiz(this)\">Especialistas con rangos estrechos<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-shelford-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkShelfordQuiz(this)\">Generalistas con rangos amplios<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-shelford-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkShelfordQuiz(this)\">Indiferentes a factores ambientales<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-shelford-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-shelford-question\" data-question=\"4\">\r\n        <p class=\"quiz-shelford-text\">4. En cambio clim\u00e1tico, las m\u00e1s vulnerables son:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-shelford-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-shelford-btn\" data-correct=\"true\" onclick=\"window.checkShelfordQuiz(this)\">Especies estenoicas<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-shelford-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkShelfordQuiz(this)\">Especies eurioicas<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-shelford-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"window.checkShelfordQuiz(this)\">Todas por igual<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-shelford-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"shelfordQuizScore\" class=\"quiz-shelford-score\">Puntuaci\u00f3n: 0\/4<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nwindow.shelfordQuizState = { score: 0, total: 4, answered: new Set() };\r\nwindow.checkShelfordQuiz = function(button){\r\n    if(!button) return;\r\n    const question = button.closest(\".quiz-shelford-question\");\r\n    if(!question) return;\r\n    const questionNum = question.getAttribute(\"data-question\");\r\n    if(window.shelfordQuizState.answered.has(questionNum)) return;\r\n    \r\n    const correct = button.getAttribute(\"data-correct\") === \"true\";\r\n    const feedback = question.querySelector(\".quiz-shelford-feedback\");\r\n    const allButtons = question.querySelectorAll(\".quiz-shelford-btn\");\r\n    \r\n    allButtons.forEach(btn => {\r\n        btn.disabled = true;\r\n        if(btn.getAttribute(\"data-correct\") === \"true\") btn.classList.add(\"quiz-shelford-correct\");\r\n        if(btn === button && !correct) btn.classList.add(\"quiz-shelford-incorrect\");\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    window.shelfordQuizState.answered.add(questionNum);\r\n    if(correct) {\r\n        window.shelfordQuizState.score++;\r\n        feedback.textContent = \"\u2705 \u00a1Correcto!\";\r\n        feedback.classList.add(\"feedback-correct\");\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback.textContent = \"\u274c Incorrecto. La respuesta correcta est\u00e1 marcada.\";\r\n        feedback.classList.add(\"feedback-incorrect\");\r\n    }\r\n    feedback.style.display = \"block\";\r\n    const scoreEl = document.getElementById(\"shelfordQuizScore\");\r\n    if(scoreEl) scoreEl.textContent = \"Puntuaci\u00f3n: \" + window.shelfordQuizState.score + \"\/\" + window.shelfordQuizState.total;\r\n};\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    IV. Errores Comunes del Estudiante\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"errors-shelford-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"error-shelford-item\" data-error=\"1\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"errShelford1\" class=\"error-shelford-toggle\" onchange=\"window.toggleShelfordError(this)\">\r\n        <label for=\"errShelford1\" class=\"error-shelford-label\">Confundir Ley de Shelford con Ley de Liebig.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-shelford-explain\" style=\"display:none;\">Liebig se centra en el m\u00ednimo; Shelford incluye tambi\u00e9n el m\u00e1ximo y el rango completo.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-shelford-item\" data-error=\"2\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"errShelford2\" class=\"error-shelford-toggle\" onchange=\"window.toggleShelfordError(this)\">\r\n        <label for=\"errShelford2\" class=\"error-shelford-label\">Pensar que todas las especies tienen rangos similares.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-shelford-explain\" style=\"display:none;\">Los rangos var\u00edan ampliamente entre especies, definiendo su distribuci\u00f3n ecol\u00f3gica.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-shelford-item\" data-error=\"3\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"errShelford3\" class=\"error-shelford-toggle\" onchange=\"window.toggleShelfordError(this)\">\r\n        <label for=\"errShelford3\" class=\"error-shelford-label\">Ignorar el impacto del exceso de factores.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-shelford-explain\" style=\"display:none;\">Ejemplo: eutrofizaci\u00f3n por exceso de nutrientes causa blooms t\u00f3xicos.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nwindow.toggleShelfordError = function(checkbox){\r\n    const item = checkbox.closest(\".error-shelford-item\");\r\n    if(!item) return;\r\n    const explain = item.querySelector(\".error-shelford-explain\");\r\n    if(explain) explain.style.display = checkbox.checked ? \"block\" : \"none\";\r\n};\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    V. Conexi\u00f3n con el Curr\u00edculo de Ecosistemas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    La Ley de Shelford forma parte del bloque \"Interacciones organismo-ambiente\" y \"Distribuci\u00f3n de especies\" en Biolog\u00eda y Ecolog\u00eda (secundaria y universitaria). Se eval\u00faa junto a la Ley de Liebig, nicho ecol\u00f3gico y respuesta al cambio global. Es esencial para interpretar patrones de biodiversidad y dise\u00f1ar estrategias de conservaci\u00f3n en contextos de cambio clim\u00e1tico.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VI. Problemas Tipo Examen\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ol class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n    <li>Explica por qu\u00e9 una especie estenoica t\u00e9rmica es m\u00e1s vulnerable al calentamiento global que una eurioica, usando la Ley de Shelford.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Analiza el impacto de la acidificaci\u00f3n oce\u00e1nica (disminuci\u00f3n de pH) en corales seg\u00fan rangos de tolerancia.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Dibuja y etiqueta una curva de tolerancia t\u00edpica, identificando zonas y explicando implicaciones ecol\u00f3gicas.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Justifica c\u00f3mo la Ley de Shelford complementa la Ley de Liebig en la explicaci\u00f3n de la distribuci\u00f3n de especies.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Predice el efecto de un aumento de salinidad en un estuario sobre especies dulceacu\u00edcolas y marinas.<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VII. Reflexi\u00f3n Metacognitiva\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"reflection-list\">\r\n    <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo cambia tu visi\u00f3n de la vulnerabilidad ecol\u00f3gica al entender que el exceso puede ser tan limitante como el d\u00e9ficit?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfEn qu\u00e9 problemas ambientales actuales (calentamiento, contaminaci\u00f3n) ves aplicada la Ley de Shelford?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategia usar\u00e1s para analizar rangos de tolerancia en futuros temas de ecolog\u00eda o conservaci\u00f3n?<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">\r\n    La Ley de la Tolerancia nos ense\u00f1a que la vida prospera en equilibrio delicado. Comprender sus l\u00edmites es esencial para preservar la biodiversidad en un planeta en transformaci\u00f3n.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"neon-quote\">\r\n    \u201cLa vida no tolera extremos: solo rangos.\u201d\r\n<\/blockquote>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"La Ley de Shelford tambi\u00e9n se conoce como...","opciones":["Ley del m\u00ednimo","Ley de la tolerancia","Ley del m\u00e1ximo","Ley del promedio"],"correcta":"Ley de la tolerancia"},{"pregunta":"Autor de la ley","opciones":["Justus von Liebig","Victor Shelford","Frederick Blackman","Eugene Odum"],"correcta":"Victor Shelford"},{"pregunta":"A\u00f1o de publicaci\u00f3n","opciones":["1840","1913","1939","1969"],"correcta":"1913"},{"pregunta":"Forma de la curva de tolerancia","opciones":["Lineal","Campana (gaussiana)","Exponencial","Constante"],"correcta":"Campana (gaussiana)"},{"pregunta":"En el rango \u00f3ptimo la poblaci\u00f3n es...","opciones":["M\u00ednima","M\u00e1xima","Cero","Estable"],"correcta":"M\u00e1xima"},{"pregunta":"Fuera de las zonas letales ocurre...","opciones":["Muerte inmediata","Estr\u00e9s fisiol\u00f3gico","Crecimiento m\u00e1ximo","Reproducci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Estr\u00e9s fisiol\u00f3gico"},{"pregunta":"Especies con rango de tolerancia amplio","opciones":["Estenoicas","Eurioicas","End\u00e9micas","Relictas"],"correcta":"Eurioicas"},{"pregunta":"Especies con rango estrecho","opciones":["Eurioicas","Estenoicas","Cosmopolitas","Invasoras"],"correcta":"Estenoicas"},{"pregunta":"Estenoterma significa...","opciones":["Tolerancia estrecha a temperatura","Tolerancia amplia a temperatura","Tolerancia a salinidad","Tolerancia a pH"],"correcta":"Tolerancia estrecha a temperatura"},{"pregunta":"Eurihalina significa...","opciones":["Tolerancia estrecha a salinidad","Tolerancia amplia a salinidad","Tolerancia a temperatura","Tolerancia a luz"],"correcta":"Tolerancia amplia a salinidad"},{"pregunta":"Los corales blanquean por...","opciones":["Baja temperatura","Alta temperatura","Baja salinidad","Exceso de luz"],"correcta":"Alta temperatura"},{"pregunta":"Especies invasoras suelen ser...","opciones":["Estenoicas","Eurioicas","End\u00e9micas","Relictas"],"correcta":"Eurioicas"},{"pregunta":"El cambio clim\u00e1tico afecta principalmente por...","opciones":["Cambiar el m\u00ednimo","Cambiar el m\u00e1ximo de temperatura","Ambos","Ninguno"],"correcta":"Ambos"},{"pregunta":"Nicho fundamental es...","opciones":["Con competencia","Sin competencia (solo factores abi\u00f3ticos)","Con depredadores","Solo bi\u00f3ticos"],"correcta":"Sin competencia (solo factores abi\u00f3ticos)"},{"pregunta":"Nicho realizado es...","opciones":["Te\u00f3rico m\u00e1ximo","Real con interacciones bi\u00f3ticas","Siempre m\u00e1s grande","Siempre m\u00e1s peque\u00f1o"],"correcta":"Real con interacciones bi\u00f3ticas"},{"pregunta":"En acuicultura se controla estrictamente...","opciones":["Solo temperatura","Temperatura, pH, O\u2082, salinidad","Solo alimento","Solo luz"],"correcta":"Temperatura, pH, O\u2082, salinidad"},{"pregunta":"La curva de tolerancia puede ser...","opciones":["Siempre sim\u00e9trica","Asim\u00e9trica","Siempre plana","Lineal"],"correcta":"Asim\u00e9trica"},{"pregunta":"Shelford era por profesi\u00f3n...","opciones":["Qu\u00edmico agr\u00edcola","Ec\u00f3logo animal","Bot\u00e1nico","F\u00edsico"],"correcta":"Ec\u00f3logo animal"},{"pregunta":"En el \u00c1rtico, muchas especies est\u00e1n limitadas por...","opciones":["M\u00e1ximo de temperatura","M\u00ednimo de temperatura","Salinidad","Luz"],"correcta":"M\u00ednimo de temperatura"},{"pregunta":"En el tr\u00f3pico, muchas especies est\u00e1n limitadas por...","opciones":["M\u00ednimo de temperatura","M\u00e1ximo de temperatura","Agua","Nutrientes"],"correcta":"M\u00e1ximo de temperatura"},{"pregunta":"Modelo matem\u00e1tico m\u00e1s usado para la curva de tolerancia","opciones":["Lineal","Gaussiana","Exponencial","Log\u00edstica"],"correcta":"Gaussiana"},{"pregunta":"Especies end\u00e9micas de islas suelen ser...","opciones":["Eurioicas","Estenoicas","Cosmopolitas","Migratorias"],"correcta":"Estenoicas"},{"pregunta":"En experimentos de laboratorio se mide la tolerancia con...","opciones":["Supervivencia vs. gradiente del factor","Solo crecimiento","Solo peso","Solo color"],"correcta":"Supervivencia vs. gradiente del factor"},{"pregunta":"La ley de Shelford se aplica a...","opciones":["Solo animales","Solo plantas","Todos los organismos","Solo microorganismos"],"correcta":"Todos los organismos"},{"pregunta":"El blanqueamiento de corales es un ejemplo de...","opciones":["Estr\u00e9s por m\u00ednimo","Estr\u00e9s por m\u00e1ximo de temperatura","Falta de luz","Exceso de nutrientes"],"correcta":"Estr\u00e9s por m\u00e1ximo de temperatura"},{"pregunta":"En lagos profundos, el ox\u00edgeno disuelto limita por...","opciones":["M\u00e1ximo","M\u00ednimo en hipolimnio","pH","Luz"],"correcta":"M\u00ednimo en hipolimnio"},{"pregunta":"La acidificaci\u00f3n oce\u00e1nica afecta principalmente por...","opciones":["Bajar el pH (fuera del rango de muchos organismos)","Subir temperatura","Bajar salinidad","Aumentar luz"],"correcta":"Bajar el pH (fuera del rango de muchos organismos)"},{"pregunta":"En el concepto de \u201cdeuda de extinci\u00f3n\u201d del cambio clim\u00e1tico se basa en...","opciones":["Liebig","Shelford","Lotka-Volterra","Hardin"],"correcta":"Shelford"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQui\u00e9n tiene mayor riesgo de extinci\u00f3n por calentamiento global?","opciones":["Especies euritermas","Especies estenotermas de alta monta\u00f1a","Especies acu\u00e1ticas","Especies invasoras"],"correcta":"Especies estenotermas de alta monta\u00f1a"},{"pregunta":"La Ley de Shelford es la base cient\u00edfica de...","opciones":["Biogeograf\u00eda","Modelos de distribuci\u00f3n de especies (SDM)","Predicci\u00f3n de invasiones","Todas las anteriores"],"correcta":"Todas las anteriores"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"factores-ambientales","titulo":"Factores Ambientales: Abi\u00f3ticos y Bi\u00f3ticos \u2013 Los Controladores de la Vida en los Ecosistemas","contenido":"\r\n<p class=\"intro\">\r\n    Los <strong>factores ambientales<\/strong> son todos los elementos del entorno que influyen en la supervivencia, crecimiento, reproducci\u00f3n y distribuci\u00f3n de los organismos. Se clasifican en <strong>abi\u00f3ticos<\/strong> (componentes no vivos: f\u00edsicos y qu\u00edmicos) y <strong>bi\u00f3ticos<\/strong> (interacciones con otros organismos vivos). Su interacci\u00f3n determina la estructura, funcionamiento y din\u00e1mica de los ecosistemas, as\u00ed como la adaptaci\u00f3n de las especies.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"formula-neon text-center\">\r\n    Nicho ecol\u00f3gico simplificado:<br>\r\n    \\[ N = f(A_1, A_2, \\dots, B_1, B_2, \\dots) \\]\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    I. Clasificaci\u00f3n y Caracter\u00edsticas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Tipo<\/th>\r\n            <th>Caracter\u00edsticas<\/th>\r\n            <th>Ejemplos principales<\/th>\r\n            <th>Efecto en organismos<\/th>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Abi\u00f3ticos<\/td>\r\n            <td>F\u00edsicos y qu\u00edmicos, no vivos<\/td>\r\n            <td>Temperatura, luz, agua, pH, nutrientes, salinidad, O\u2082<\/td>\r\n            <td>Definen l\u00edmites fisiol\u00f3gicos (Ley de Shelford)<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Bi\u00f3ticos<\/td>\r\n            <td>Interacciones entre organismos<\/td>\r\n            <td>Competencia, depredaci\u00f3n, mutualismo, parasitismo, comensalismo<\/td>\r\n            <td>Regulan poblaciones y estructura comunitaria<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n    <strong>Interacci\u00f3n clave:<\/strong> Los factores abi\u00f3ticos establecen los l\u00edmites posibles de vida; los bi\u00f3ticos determinan qui\u00e9n ocupa esos l\u00edmites.\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    II. Interacci\u00f3n de Factores Ambientales (Diagrama \u00c9pico)\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Representaci\u00f3n de c\u00f3mo ambos tipos de factores influyen simult\u00e1neamente en un organismo central.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <svg class=\"factors-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1600 900\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow-cyan\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#00ffff\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow-red\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#ff1744\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n            <marker id=\"arrow-cyan\" markerWidth=\"16\" markerHeight=\"16\" refX=\"14\" refY=\"8\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                <path d=\"M0,0 L16,8 L0,16 Z\" fill=\"#00ffff\"\/>\r\n            <\/marker>\r\n            <marker id=\"arrow-red\" markerWidth=\"16\" markerHeight=\"16\" refX=\"14\" refY=\"8\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                <path d=\"M0,0 L16,8 L0,16 Z\" fill=\"#ff1744\"\/>\r\n            <\/marker>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n\r\n        <rect width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" fill=\"#05050f\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"800\" y=\"90\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"68\" fill=\"#00ffff\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">FACTORES AMBIENTALES<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Organismo central -->\r\n        <circle cx=\"800\" cy=\"450\" r=\"140\" fill=\"#1de9b6\" stroke=\"#00e676\" stroke-width=\"12\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"800\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"48\" fill=\"#000\" font-weight=\"bold\">ORGANISMO<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"800\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#000\">Supervivencia \u00b7 Crecimiento \u00b7 Reproducci\u00f3n<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Abi\u00f3ticos -->\r\n        <rect x=\"120\" y=\"200\" width=\"380\" height=\"500\" rx=\"40\" fill=\"#0d47a1\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"10\" opacity=\"0.9\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"310\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"52\" fill=\"#00ffff\" font-weight=\"bold\">ABI\u00d3TICOS<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"310\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Temperatura<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"310\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Luz (PAR)<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"310\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Agua<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"310\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#ffffff\">pH<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"310\" y=\"530\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Nutrientes<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"310\" y=\"580\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Ox\u00edgeno<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Bi\u00f3ticos -->\r\n        <rect x=\"1100\" y=\"200\" width=\"380\" height=\"500\" rx=\"40\" fill=\"#880e4f\" stroke=\"#ff1744\" stroke-width=\"10\" opacity=\"0.9\" filter=\"url(#glow-red)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"1290\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"52\" fill=\"#ff1744\" font-weight=\"bold\">BI\u00d3TICOS<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"1290\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Competencia<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"1290\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Depredaci\u00f3n<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"1290\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Mutualismo<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"1290\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Parasitismo<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"1290\" y=\"530\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Comensalismo<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Flechas abi\u00f3ticas -->\r\n        <path d=\"M500 350 L650 430\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"8\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-cyan)\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M500 550 L650 470\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"8\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-cyan)\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Flechas bi\u00f3ticas -->\r\n        <path d=\"M1100 350 L950 430\" stroke=\"#ff1744\" stroke-width=\"8\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red)\" filter=\"url(#glow-red)\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M1100 550 L950 470\" stroke=\"#ff1744\" stroke-width=\"8\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red)\" filter=\"url(#glow-red)\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"800\" y=\"860\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#00ffff\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">Interacci\u00f3n simult\u00e1nea de factores abi\u00f3ticos y bi\u00f3ticos<\/text>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    III. Simuladores Interactivos\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: Intensidad de Factores Ambientales<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Ajusta la intensidad de un factor ambiental y observa su impacto en la supervivencia de una poblaci\u00f3n.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"factors-sim\">\r\n    <label>Factor seleccionado:<\/label>\r\n    <select id=\"factorSelect\">\r\n        <option value=\"temp\">Temperatura (\u00b0C)<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"water\">Disponibilidad de agua (%)<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"light\">Intensidad lum\u00ednica (lux)<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"ph\">pH del suelo<\/option>\r\n    <\/select>\r\n\r\n    <label>Intensidad: <span id=\"intensityValue\">50<\/span><\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"intensitySlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"50\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"factorResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const select = document.getElementById(\"factorSelect\");\r\n    const slider = document.getElementById(\"intensitySlider\");\r\n    const value = document.getElementById(\"intensityValue\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"factorResult\");\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        const factor = select.value;\r\n        const v = parseInt(slider.value);\r\n        value.textContent = v;\r\n\r\n        let zone = \"\", message = \"\";\r\n\r\n        if (v < 20 || v > 80) {\r\n            zone = \"Zona letal\";\r\n            message = \"Supervivencia imposible: poblaci\u00f3n colapsa.\";\r\n        } else if (v < 35 || v > 65) {\r\n            zone = \"Estr\u00e9s elevado\";\r\n            message = \"Crecimiento y reproducci\u00f3n reducidos.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            zone = \"Condiciones \u00f3ptimas\";\r\n            message = \"M\u00e1xima productividad y abundancia.\";\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>${zone}<\/strong><br>${message}`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    select.addEventListener(\"change\", update);\r\n    slider.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: Interacciones Bi\u00f3ticas<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Selecciona una interacci\u00f3n bi\u00f3tica y analiza su efecto en dos especies.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"factors-sim\">\r\n    <label>Interacci\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n    <select id=\"bioticSelect\">\r\n        <option value=\"comp\">Competencia (-\/-)<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"pred\">Depredaci\u00f3n (+\/-)<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"mut\">Mutualismo (+\/+)<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"par\">Parasitismo (+\/-)<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"com\">Comensalismo (+\/0)<\/option>\r\n    <\/select>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"bioticResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const select = document.getElementById(\"bioticSelect\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"bioticResult\");\r\n\r\n    const interactions = {\r\n        \"comp\": { effect: \"- \/ -\", desc: \"Ambas especies compiten por recursos limitados \u2192 reducci\u00f3n poblacional mutua.\", example: \"\u00c1rboles por luz en bosque.\" },\r\n        \"pred\": { effect: \"+ \/ -\", desc: \"Depredador beneficia, presa perjudicada \u2192 control poblacional.\", example: \"Lince y liebre.\" },\r\n        \"mut\": { effect: \"+ \/ +\", desc: \"Beneficio mutuo \u2192 estabilidad y coevoluci\u00f3n.\", example: \"Polinizadores y plantas.\" },\r\n        \"par\": { effect: \"+ \/ -\", desc: \"Par\u00e1sito beneficia, hu\u00e9sped perjudicado.\", example: \"Garrapatas en mam\u00edferos.\" },\r\n        \"com\": { effect: \"+ \/ 0\", desc: \"Una especie beneficia sin afectar a la otra.\", example: \"R\u00e9mora y tibur\u00f3n.\" }\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        const data = interactions[select.value];\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>Efecto:<\/strong> ${data.effect}<br>\r\n                            <strong>Descripci\u00f3n:<\/strong> ${data.desc}<br>\r\n                            <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> ${data.example}`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    select.addEventListener(\"change\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Quiz Autoevaluado: Factores Ambientales<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>1. Los factores abi\u00f3ticos son:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,false)\">Interacciones entre organismos<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,true)\">Componentes f\u00edsicos y qu\u00edmicos no vivos<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,false)\">Solo relaciones tr\u00f3ficas<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb1\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>2. Un ejemplo de interacci\u00f3n bi\u00f3tica +\/+ es:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,true)\">Mutualismo<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,false)\">Competencia<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,false)\">Depredaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb2\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>3. La luz solar es un factor:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,true)\">Abi\u00f3tico<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,false)\">Bi\u00f3tico<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,false)\">Ninguno<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb3\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"quizScore\" class=\"score-display\">Puntuaci\u00f3n: 0\/3<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nlet score = 0;\r\nconst total = 3;\r\nconst answeredQuestions = new Set();\r\nfunction checkQuiz(q, correct){\r\n    if (answeredQuestions.has(q)) {\r\n        return; \/\/ evita recuento m\u00faltiple y cambios de respuesta repetidos\r\n    }\r\n    answeredQuestions.add(q);\r\n\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById(\"fb\" + q);\r\n    const container = fb.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n    const btns = container.querySelectorAll('button');\r\n\r\n    if (correct){\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u2705 Correcto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#00e676\";\r\n        score++;\r\n    } else {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u274c Incorrecto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#ff1744\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    btns.forEach(b => b.disabled = true);\r\n    document.getElementById(\"quizScore\").textContent = \"Puntuaci\u00f3n: \" + score + \"\/\" + total;\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    IV. Errores Comunes del Estudiante\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"errors-interactive\">\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err1\" onchange=\"toggleError(1)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err1\">Confundir factores abi\u00f3ticos con bi\u00f3ticos.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp1\">Ejemplo: considerar la depredaci\u00f3n como abi\u00f3tica (es bi\u00f3tica).<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err2\" onchange=\"toggleError(2)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err2\">Ignorar que los factores interact\u00faan simult\u00e1neamente.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp2\">Un cambio abi\u00f3tico (sequ\u00eda) puede intensificar competencia bi\u00f3tica.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err3\" onchange=\"toggleError(3)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err3\">Pensar que todos los factores bi\u00f3ticos son negativos.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp3\">Mutualismo y comensalismo son positivos o neutros.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction toggleError(n){\r\n    const exp = document.getElementById(\"exp\" + n);\r\n    exp.style.display = document.getElementById(\"err\" + n).checked ? \"block\" : \"none\";\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    V. Conexi\u00f3n con el Curr\u00edculo de Ecosistemas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Este tema es central en el bloque \"Interacciones en ecosistemas\" y \"Din\u00e1mica poblacional\" en Biolog\u00eda y Ciencias Ambientales. Se eval\u00faa en ex\u00e1menes oficiales junto a nicho ecol\u00f3gico, Ley de Liebig\/Shelford y estructura tr\u00f3fica. Es base para comprender biodiversidad, sucesi\u00f3n y respuesta al cambio ambiental.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VI. Problemas Tipo Examen\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ol class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n    <li>Clasifica como abi\u00f3tico o bi\u00f3tico: temperatura, depredaci\u00f3n, salinidad, mutualismo. Justifica cada uno.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Explica c\u00f3mo un factor abi\u00f3tico (sequ\u00eda) puede modificar una interacci\u00f3n bi\u00f3tica (competencia).<\/li>\r\n    <li>Analiza el signo (+\/\u2212\/0) de una interacci\u00f3n comensalismo y comp\u00e1ralo con parasitismo.<\/li>\r\n    <li>En un ecosistema acu\u00e1tico, identifica factores abi\u00f3ticos clave y su posible rol limitante.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Justifica por qu\u00e9 los factores ambientales determinan la distribuci\u00f3n geogr\u00e1fica de una especie.<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VII. Reflexi\u00f3n Metacognitiva\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"reflection-list\">\r\n    <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo cambia tu comprensi\u00f3n de los ecosistemas al ver la interacci\u00f3n constante entre factores abi\u00f3ticos y bi\u00f3ticos?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfEn qu\u00e9 situaciones reales (conservaci\u00f3n, agricultura) considerar\u00edas ambos tipos de factores para tomar decisiones?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategia usar\u00e1s para clasificar y analizar factores ambientales en problemas complejos de examen?<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">\r\n    Los factores ambientales no act\u00faan aislados: su interacci\u00f3n define la vida en el planeta. Dominar esta clasificaci\u00f3n es esencial para entender y gestionar ecosistemas sostenibles.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"neon-quote\">\r\n    \u201cNada vive solo: todo est\u00e1 conectado por factores visibles e invisibles.\u201d\r\n<\/blockquote>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"Factores abi\u00f3ticos son...","opciones":["Vivos","No vivos","Solo plantas","Solo animales"],"correcta":"No vivos"},{"pregunta":"Ejemplo de factor abi\u00f3tico","opciones":["Depredaci\u00f3n","Competencia","Temperatura","Simbiosis"],"correcta":"Temperatura"},{"pregunta":"Ejemplo de factor bi\u00f3tico","opciones":["Luz","pH","Depredaci\u00f3n","Agua"],"correcta":"Depredaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"PAR significa...","opciones":["Presi\u00f3n atmosf\u00e9rica","Radiaci\u00f3n fotosint\u00e9ticamente activa","Potencial de agua","pH \u00e1cido"],"correcta":"Radiaci\u00f3n fotosint\u00e9ticamente activa"},{"pregunta":"En el desierto el factor limitante es...","opciones":["Luz","Agua","Nutrientes","Competencia"],"correcta":"Agua"},{"pregunta":"En la tundra el factor limitante es...","opciones":["Agua","Temperatura","Luz","Ox\u00edgeno"],"correcta":"Temperatura"},{"pregunta":"Interacci\u00f3n +\/+","opciones":["Competencia","Mutualismo","Parasitismo","Depredaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Mutualismo"},{"pregunta":"Interacci\u00f3n -\/-","opciones":["Mutualismo","Competencia","Comensalismo","Depredaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Competencia"},{"pregunta":"Autor de la Ley del M\u00ednimo","opciones":["Shelford","Liebig","Hutchinson","Odum"],"correcta":"Liebig"},{"pregunta":"Autor de la Ley de Tolerancia","opciones":["Liebig","Shelford","Blackman","Elton"],"correcta":"Shelford"},{"pregunta":"Nicho fundamental es...","opciones":["Con competencia","Sin competencia","Con depredadores","Solo f\u00edsico"],"correcta":"Sin competencia"},{"pregunta":"Nicho realizado es...","opciones":["Te\u00f3rico","Real con interacciones bi\u00f3ticas","Siempre m\u00e1s grande","Siempre m\u00e1s peque\u00f1o"],"correcta":"Real con interacciones bi\u00f3ticas"},{"pregunta":"El nicho es un concepto...","opciones":["1-dimensional","n-dimensional (Hutchinson)","2-dimensional","Lineal"],"correcta":"n-dimensional (Hutchinson)"},{"pregunta":"Los biomas terrestres se definen principalmente por...","opciones":["Solo temperatura","Solo precipitaci\u00f3n","Temperatura + precipitaci\u00f3n","Solo suelo"],"correcta":"Temperatura + precipitaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"En el sotobosque de un bosque tropical limita...","opciones":["Agua","Nutrientes","Luz","Temperatura"],"correcta":"Luz"},{"pregunta":"En acuicultura se controla estrictamente...","opciones":["Solo temperatura","T, pH, O\u2082 disuelto, salinidad","Solo alimento","Solo luz"],"correcta":"T, pH, O\u2082 disuelto, salinidad"},{"pregunta":"Competencia intraespec\u00edfica es...","opciones":["Entre especies distintas","Dentro de la misma especie","Solo plantas","Solo animales"],"correcta":"Dentro de la misma especie"},{"pregunta":"Micorrizas \u2194 planta es un ejemplo de...","opciones":["Parasitismo","Competencia","Mutualismo","Comensalismo"],"correcta":"Mutualismo"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula conceptual de Liebig","opciones":["P = max(f)","P = min(f)","P = avg(f)","P = sum(f)"],"correcta":"P = min(f)"},{"pregunta":"Curva de Shelford tiene forma de...","opciones":["L\u00ednea recta","Campana","Exponencial","Constante"],"correcta":"Campana"},{"pregunta":"El hipervolumen de nicho fue propuesto por...","opciones":["Liebig","Shelford","Hutchinson","Elton"],"correcta":"Hutchinson"},{"pregunta":"Interacci\u00f3n +\/0","opciones":["Mutualismo","Comensalismo","Parasitismo","Competencia"],"correcta":"Comensalismo"},{"pregunta":"En zonas HNLC del oc\u00e9ano limita...","opciones":["Nitr\u00f3geno","F\u00f3sforo","Hierro","Luz"],"correcta":"Hierro"},{"pregunta":"Los dos factores que m\u00e1s explican la distribuci\u00f3n global de biomas son...","opciones":["Luz y agua","Temperatura y precipitaci\u00f3n","pH y O\u2082","Suelo y viento"],"correcta":"Temperatura y precipitaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"En limnolog\u00eda, el f\u00f3sforo es limitante en la mayor\u00eda de lagos porque...","opciones":["Es abundante","Es el m\u00e1s escaso en agua dulce","Es t\u00f3xico","No se recicla"],"correcta":"Es el m\u00e1s escaso en agua dulce"},{"pregunta":"El principio de exclusi\u00f3n competitiva de Gause se basa en...","opciones":["Liebig","Shelford","Competencia por nicho id\u00e9ntico","Mutualismo"],"correcta":"Competencia por nicho id\u00e9ntico"},{"pregunta":"En experimentos de mesocosmos se manipulan...","opciones":["Solo un factor","M\u00faltiples factores a la vez","Solo temperatura","Solo luz"],"correcta":"M\u00faltiples factores a la vez"},{"pregunta":"El modelo de distribuci\u00f3n de especies (SDM) se basa principalmente en...","opciones":["Factores bi\u00f3ticos","Factores abi\u00f3ticos","Solo clima","Solo suelo"],"correcta":"Factores abi\u00f3ticos"},{"pregunta":"Liebig + Shelford juntos explican...","opciones":["Solo el m\u00ednimo","M\u00ednimo y m\u00e1ximo tolerable","Solo el \u00f3ptimo","Solo competencia"],"correcta":"M\u00ednimo y m\u00e1ximo tolerable"},{"pregunta":"El factor que m\u00e1s influye en la tasa metab\u00f3lica de los organismos es...","opciones":["pH","Luz","Temperatura","Salinidad"],"correcta":"Temperatura"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"biomas","titulo":"Biomas del Planeta: Las Grandes Regiones Ecol\u00f3gicas Definidas por el Clima","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-biomas\">\r\n<p class=\"intro\">\r\n    Un <strong>bioma<\/strong> es una gran comunidad biol\u00f3gica caracterizada por una vegetaci\u00f3n dominante y fauna adaptada a condiciones clim\u00e1ticas espec\u00edficas. Los biomas representan patrones convergentes de la evoluci\u00f3n: climas similares producen ecosistemas estructuralmente parecidos aunque con especies diferentes. Comprender los biomas permite predecir la distribuci\u00f3n de la vida, evaluar impactos del cambio clim\u00e1tico y gestionar recursos naturales a escala global.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"formula-neon text-center\">\r\n    Diagrama de Whittaker (1975):<br>\r\n    Bioma \u2248 f(Temperatura media, Precipitaci\u00f3n anual)\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    I. Concepto y Clasificaci\u00f3n de Biomas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Los biomas se definen principalmente por el clima (temperatura y precipitaci\u00f3n), que determina la fisonom\u00eda vegetal y, consecuentemente, la fauna asociada.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Bioma Terrestre<\/th>\r\n            <th>Temperatura media (\u00b0C)<\/th>\r\n            <th>Precipitaci\u00f3n (mm\/a\u00f1o)<\/th>\r\n            <th>Vegetaci\u00f3n dominante<\/th>\r\n            <th>Biodiversidad<\/th>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr><td>Tundra<\/td><td><0<\/td><td><400<\/td><td>Musgos, l\u00edquenes<\/td><td>Baja<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Taiga<\/td><td>0\u201310<\/td><td>300\u2013800<\/td><td>Con\u00edferas<\/td><td>Media-baja<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Bosque templado<\/td><td>5\u201320<\/td><td>750\u20131500<\/td><td>Caducifolios<\/td><td>Media-alta<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Selva tropical<\/td><td>>25<\/td><td>>2000<\/td><td>Evergreen estratificado<\/td><td>Muy alta<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Sabana<\/td><td>>20<\/td><td>500\u20131500 (estacional)<\/td><td>Pastos + \u00e1rboles dispersos<\/td><td>Alta<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Pradera<\/td><td>0\u201320<\/td><td>300\u20131000<\/td><td>Gram\u00edneas<\/td><td>Media<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Desierto<\/td><td>Variable<\/td><td><250<\/td><td>Suculentas, xer\u00f3fitas<\/td><td>Baja-media<\/td><\/tr>\r\n    <\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n    <strong>Biomas acu\u00e1ticos:<\/strong> No dependen del \u00e1rea, sino de luz, nutrientes y temperatura. Ejemplos: arrecifes coralinos (alta productividad), oc\u00e9ano abierto (baja productividad), humedales (muy alta).\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    II. Distribuci\u00f3n Global de Biomas Terrestres\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Los biomas siguen patrones latitudinales y de circulaci\u00f3n atmosf\u00e9rica (c\u00e9lulas de Hadley, Ferrel, Polar).\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <svg class=\"biomes-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1600 900\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow-cyan\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#00ffff\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n\r\n        <rect width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" fill=\"#05050f\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"800\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"64\" fill=\"#00ffff\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">BIOMAS TERRESTRES \u2013 DISTRIBUCI\u00d3N GLOBAL<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Am\u00e9rica -->\r\n        <path d=\"M200 140 Q260 220 240 360 Q220 520 260 620 Q320 720 400 680 Q360 540 420 420 Q460 300 380 180 Z\" fill=\"#2e7d32\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Eurasia -->\r\n        <path d=\"M520 140 Q700 180 820 260 Q920 300 980 360 Q1040 420 1080 500 Q980 560 900 520 Q820 480 760 440 Q680 380 620 300 Z\" fill=\"#388e3c\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <!-- \u00c1frica -->\r\n        <path d=\"M780 420 Q820 480 840 560 Q860 640 820 700 Q760 680 740 600 Q720 520 740 460 Z\" fill=\"#f9a825\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Australia -->\r\n        <path d=\"M1100 520 Q1160 560 1180 620 Q1160 680 1100 660 Q1040 620 1060 560 Z\" fill=\"#ffb300\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Ant\u00e1rtida -->\r\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"740\" width=\"1600\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#eceff1\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Etiquetas -->\r\n        <text x=\"800\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#01579b\">SUBPOLAR \u2192 Taiga<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"800\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#1b5e20\">ZONA TEMPLADA \u2192 Bosques \/ Praderas<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"800\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"38\" fill=\"#1b5e20\" font-weight=\"bold\">ZONA TROPICAL \u2192 Selvas \/ Sabanas<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"800\" y=\"610\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#33691e\">ZONA TEMPLADA SUR<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"800\" y=\"760\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"34\" fill=\"#90a4ae\">Ant\u00e1rtida \u2192 Desierto polar<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"800\" y=\"860\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#00ffff\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">Patrones latitudinales determinados por circulaci\u00f3n atmosf\u00e9rica<\/text>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    III. Simuladores Interactivos\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: Predicci\u00f3n de Bioma por Clima<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Ajusta temperatura y precipitaci\u00f3n para predecir el bioma terrestre dominante (basado en diagrama de Whittaker).\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"biomes-sim\">\r\n    <label>Temperatura media anual (\u00b0C): <span id=\"tempValue\">15<\/span> \u00b0C<\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"tempSlider\" min=\"-20\" max=\"35\" value=\"15\">\r\n\r\n    <label>Precipitaci\u00f3n anual (mm): <span id=\"rainValue\">800<\/span> mm<\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"rainSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"4000\" value=\"800\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"biomeResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const tempSlider = document.getElementById(\"tempSlider\");\r\n    const rainSlider = document.getElementById(\"rainSlider\");\r\n    const tempValue = document.getElementById(\"tempValue\");\r\n    const rainValue = document.getElementById(\"rainValue\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"biomeResult\");\r\n\r\n    function predictBiome(){\r\n        const temp = parseInt(tempSlider.value);\r\n        const rain = parseInt(rainSlider.value);\r\n\r\n        tempValue.textContent = temp;\r\n        rainValue.textContent = rain;\r\n\r\n        let biome = \"\", icon = \"\", desc = \"\";\r\n\r\n        if (rain < 250) {\r\n            biome = \"Desierto\";\r\n            icon = \"\ud83c\udfdc\ufe0f\";\r\n            desc = \"Aridez extrema limita vegetaci\u00f3n.\";\r\n        } else if (temp < 0) {\r\n            biome = \"Tundra\";\r\n            icon = \"\ud83e\uddca\";\r\n            desc = \"Fr\u00edo permanente y permafrost.\";\r\n        } else if (temp < 10 && rain > 300) {\r\n            biome = \"Taiga\";\r\n            icon = \"\ud83c\udf32\";\r\n            desc = \"Bosques boreales de con\u00edferas.\";\r\n        } else if (temp > 22 && rain > 2000) {\r\n            biome = \"Selva tropical\";\r\n            icon = \"\ud83c\udf34\";\r\n            desc = \"M\u00e1xima biodiversidad y productividad.\";\r\n        } else if (temp > 20 && rain > 600 && rain < 2000) {\r\n            biome = \"Sabana\";\r\n            icon = \"\ud83e\udd81\";\r\n            desc = \"Pastizales con \u00e1rboles dispersos y fuego estacional.\";\r\n        } else if (temp > 5 && rain > 600) {\r\n            biome = \"Bosque templado\";\r\n            icon = \"\ud83c\udf42\";\r\n            desc = \"Caducifolios con estaciones marcadas.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            biome = \"Pradera \/ Estepa\";\r\n            icon = \"\ud83c\udf3e\";\r\n            desc = \"Dominio de gram\u00edneas y suelos f\u00e9rtiles.\";\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<h5>${icon} Bioma predicho: ${biome}<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>${desc}<\/p>`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    tempSlider.addEventListener(\"input\", predictBiome);\r\n    rainSlider.addEventListener(\"input\", predictBiome);\r\n    predictBiome();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">An\u00e1lisis: Distribuci\u00f3n Global de Biomas<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Selecciona una zona clim\u00e1tica para explorar su bioma caracter\u00edstico.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"biomes-sim\">\r\n    <div class=\"map-controls\">\r\n        <button data-zone=\"polar\">\u2744\ufe0f Polar<\/button>\r\n        <button data-zone=\"subpolar\">\ud83c\udf32 Subpolar<\/button>\r\n        <button data-zone=\"temperate\">\ud83c\udf41 Templada<\/button>\r\n        <button data-zone=\"tropical\">\ud83c\udf34 Tropical<\/button>\r\n        <button data-zone=\"arid\">\ud83c\udfdc\ufe0f \u00c1rida<\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"zoneResult\">Selecciona una zona para ver detalles.<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const buttons = document.querySelectorAll(\".map-controls button\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"zoneResult\");\r\n\r\n    const zones = {\r\n        polar: \"\u2744\ufe0f Zonas Polares: Tundra \u00e1rtica y ant\u00e1rtica. Baja productividad, permafrost.\",\r\n        subpolar: \"\ud83c\udf32 Subpolar: Taiga o bosque boreal. Con\u00edferas adaptadas al fr\u00edo.\",\r\n        temperate: \"\ud83c\udf41 Templada: Bosques caducifolios y praderas. Alta productividad estacional.\",\r\n        tropical: \"\ud83c\udf34 Tropical: Selvas y sabanas. M\u00e1xima biodiversidad y biomasa.\",\r\n        arid: \"\ud83c\udfdc\ufe0f \u00c1rida: Desiertos c\u00e1lidos y fr\u00edos. Adaptaciones extremas al d\u00e9ficit h\u00eddrico.\"\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    buttons.forEach(btn => {\r\n        btn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\r\n            buttons.forEach(b => b.classList.remove(\"active\"));\r\n            btn.classList.add(\"active\");\r\n            result.innerHTML = `<strong>${btn.textContent}<\/strong><br>${zones[btn.dataset.zone]}`;\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Quiz Autoevaluado: Biomas<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>1. El bioma con mayor biodiversidad terrestre es:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,false)\">Desierto<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,true)\">Selva tropical<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,false)\">Tundra<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb1\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>2. La vegetaci\u00f3n dominante en sabanas es:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,true)\">Pastos con \u00e1rboles dispersos<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,false)\">Con\u00edferas<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,false)\">Suculentas<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb2\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>3. El factor clave que diferencia taiga de bosque templado es:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,true)\">Temperatura (m\u00e1s fr\u00eda en taiga)<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,false)\">Precipitaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,false)\">Luz solar<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb3\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"quizScore\" class=\"score-display\">Puntuaci\u00f3n: 0\/3<\/div>\r\n    <button class=\"btn-reset-quiz\" id=\"resetQuizBtn\">Reiniciar Mini-Quiz<\/button>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nlet score = 0;\r\nconst total = 3;\r\nconst answeredQuestions = new Set();\r\nfunction updateQuizScore(){\r\n    document.getElementById(\"quizScore\").textContent = \"Puntuaci\u00f3n: \" + score + \"\/\" + total;\r\n}\r\nfunction checkQuiz(q, correct){\r\n    if (answeredQuestions.has(q)) return;\r\n    answeredQuestions.add(q);\r\n\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById(\"fb\" + q);\r\n    const questionEl = fb.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n    const buttons = questionEl.querySelectorAll('button');\r\n\r\n    if (correct){\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u2705 Correcto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#00e676\";\r\n        score++;\r\n        questionEl.classList.add('quiz-answered-correct');\r\n    } else {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u274c Incorrecto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#ff1744\";\r\n        questionEl.classList.add('quiz-answered-incorrect');\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    buttons.forEach(b => b.disabled = true);\r\n    updateQuizScore();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction resetQuiz(){\r\n    score = 0;\r\n    answeredQuestions.clear();\r\n    updateQuizScore();\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question').forEach(q => {\r\n        q.querySelector('div[id^=\"fb\"]').innerHTML = '';\r\n        q.classList.remove('quiz-answered-correct', 'quiz-answered-incorrect');\r\n        q.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b => { b.disabled = false; b.style.opacity = '1'; });\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\ndocument.getElementById('resetQuizBtn').addEventListener('click', resetQuiz);\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    IV. Errores Comunes del Estudiante\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"errors-interactive\">\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err1\" onchange=\"toggleError(1)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err1\">Confundir bioma con ecosistema local.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp1\">Bioma es categor\u00eda global; ecosistema es unidad concreta.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err2\" onchange=\"toggleError(2)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err2\">Pensar que los biomas acu\u00e1ticos son menos importantes.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp2\">Producen ~50% del ox\u00edgeno global y regulan carbono.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err3\" onchange=\"toggleError(3)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err3\">Creer que la biodiversidad siempre aumenta con temperatura.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp3\">Selvas s\u00ed, pero desiertos c\u00e1lidos tienen baja biodiversidad.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction toggleError(n){\r\n    const exp = document.getElementById(\"exp\" + n);\r\n    exp.style.display = document.getElementById(\"err\" + n).checked ? \"block\" : \"none\";\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    V. Conexi\u00f3n con el Curr\u00edculo de Ecosistemas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Este tema pertenece al bloque \"Estructura y funcionamiento de ecosistemas\" y \"Distribuci\u00f3n global de la vida\" en Biolog\u00eda y Ciencias Ambientales. Se eval\u00faa en ex\u00e1menes oficiales junto a factores abi\u00f3ticos\/bi\u00f3ticos, productividad primaria y cambio global. Es fundamental para interpretar mapas biogeogr\u00e1ficos y modelos de impacto clim\u00e1tico.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VI. Problemas Tipo Examen\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ol class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n    <li>Explica por qu\u00e9 dos continentes con climas similares presentan biomas convergentes aunque con especies diferentes.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Predice el cambio en biomas si la temperatura global aumenta 3\u00b0C y la precipitaci\u00f3n disminuye en zonas subtropicales.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Compara productividad y biodiversidad entre selva tropical y tundra, justificando con factores clim\u00e1ticos.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Analiza por qu\u00e9 los humedales tienen alta productividad a pesar de no ser biomas terrestres extensos.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Justifica la distribuci\u00f3n latitudinal de biomas usando circulaci\u00f3n atmosf\u00e9rica.<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VII. Reflexi\u00f3n Metacognitiva\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"reflection-list\">\r\n    <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo cambia tu percepci\u00f3n del cambio clim\u00e1tico al ver que peque\u00f1os cambios en temperatura\/precipitaci\u00f3n pueden transformar biomas enteros?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfEn qu\u00e9 regiones del planeta consideras m\u00e1s urgente la conservaci\u00f3n de biomas actuales y por qu\u00e9?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategia usar\u00e1s para predecir biomas en problemas de examen o an\u00e1lisis ambiental?<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">\r\n    Los biomas son la expresi\u00f3n visible del clima sobre la vida. Comprenderlos permite anticipar el futuro del planeta en un contexto de cambio global.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"neon-quote\">\r\n    \u201cEl clima escribe el guion; los biomas son los actores.\u201d\r\n<\/blockquote>\r\n<\/div> <!-- \/.leccion-biomas -->\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"Los biomas se definen principalmente por...","opciones":["Solo animales","Clima y vegetaci\u00f3n dominante","Altitud","Pa\u00eds"],"correcta":"Clima y vegetaci\u00f3n dominante"},{"pregunta":"Bioma m\u00e1s biodiverso del planeta","opciones":["Tundra","Desierto","Selva tropical","Taiga"],"correcta":"Selva tropical"},{"pregunta":"Bioma con con\u00edferas y largos inviernos","opciones":["Selva","Taiga","Pradera","Sabana"],"correcta":"Taiga"},{"pregunta":"Desierto se caracteriza por...","opciones":[">2000 mm","<250 mm\/a\u00f1o","1000 mm","500 mm"],"correcta":"<250 mm\/a\u00f1o"},{"pregunta":"Sabana tiene vegetaci\u00f3n de...","opciones":["\u00c1rboles altos","Pastos con \u00e1rboles dispersos","Solo cactus","Musgos"],"correcta":"Pastos con \u00e1rboles dispersos"},{"pregunta":"Tundra tiene como vegetaci\u00f3n dominante...","opciones":["Cactus","Musgos y l\u00edquenes","Palmeras","Con\u00edferas"],"correcta":"Musgos y l\u00edquenes"},{"pregunta":"Bioma acu\u00e1tico con corales","opciones":["Lago","R\u00edo","Arrecife coralino","Estuario"],"correcta":"Arrecife coralino"},{"pregunta":"Bioma dulce con mayor productividad","opciones":["Oc\u00e9ano","Lago profundo","Humedal","R\u00edo r\u00e1pido"],"correcta":"Humedal"},{"pregunta":"Selva tropical temperatura promedio","opciones":["5\u00b0C","25\u00b0C","40\u00b0C","-15\u00b0C"],"correcta":"25\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Pradera tambi\u00e9n se conoce como...","opciones":["Steppe","Jungla","Boreal","Matorral"],"correcta":"Steppe"},{"pregunta":"Climograma muestra...","opciones":["Solo temperatura","Temperatura + precipitaci\u00f3n","Solo viento","Solo luz"],"correcta":"Temperatura + precipitaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Bioma con mayor cobertura global","opciones":["Selva","Oc\u00e9ano","Desierto","Tundra"],"correcta":"Oc\u00e9ano"},{"pregunta":"Bioma que almacena m\u00e1s carbono","opciones":["Tundra","Selva tropical","Desierto","Taiga"],"correcta":"Selva tropical"},{"pregunta":"Estuario es mezcla de...","opciones":["Agua dulce + salada","Solo dulce","Solo salada","Agua + petr\u00f3leo"],"correcta":"Agua dulce + salada"},{"pregunta":"Taiga tambi\u00e9n se llama...","opciones":["Bosque mediterr\u00e1neo","Bosque boreal","Selva nublada","Matorral"],"correcta":"Bosque boreal"},{"pregunta":"Bosque templado tiene \u00e1rboles...","opciones":["Siempreverdes","Caducifolios","Cactus","Palmeras"],"correcta":"Caducifolios"},{"pregunta":"Bioma con permafrost","opciones":["Desierto","Tundra","Sabana","Selva"],"correcta":"Tundra"},{"pregunta":"Mayor NPP (Productividad Primaria Neta) en:","opciones":["Tundra","Selva tropical","Desierto","Oc\u00e9ano abierto"],"correcta":"Selva tropical"},{"pregunta":"Menor NPP en:","opciones":["Selva","Desierto","Sabana","Taiga"],"correcta":"Desierto"},{"pregunta":"Gran Barrera de Coral es un...","opciones":["Lago","Arrecife","R\u00edo","Humedal"],"correcta":"Arrecife"},{"pregunta":"El esquema cl\u00e1sico de clasificaci\u00f3n de biomas se llama...","opciones":["Diagrama de Walter","Tri\u00e1ngulo de Whittaker","C\u00edrculo de Holdridge","Cuadrado de Odum"],"correcta":"Tri\u00e1ngulo de Whittaker"},{"pregunta":"Bioma con mayor biomasa a\u00e9rea","opciones":["Pradera","Selva tropical","Tundra","Desierto"],"correcta":"Selva tropical"},{"pregunta":"Bioma con mayor albedo (refleja m\u00e1s luz solar)","opciones":["Selva","Tundra con nieve","Oc\u00e9ano","Desierto"],"correcta":"Tundra con nieve"},{"pregunta":"Bioma que m\u00e1s influye en el ciclo global del agua","opciones":["Desierto","Selva tropical (transpiraci\u00f3n)","Tundra","Pradera"],"correcta":"Selva tropical (transpiraci\u00f3n)"},{"pregunta":"Mayor riesgo actual de desaparici\u00f3n por deforestaci\u00f3n","opciones":["Tundra","Selva tropical","Taiga","Pradera"],"correcta":"Selva tropical"},{"pregunta":"Bioma con mayor n\u00famero de especies end\u00e9micas","opciones":["Tundra","Selva tropical","Desierto","Taiga"],"correcta":"Selva tropical"},{"pregunta":"En el oc\u00e9ano, la zona con mayor productividad primaria es...","opciones":["Abisal","Zona ner\u00edtica \/ upwelling","Pel\u00e1gica abierta","Bent\u00f3nica"],"correcta":"Zona ner\u00edtica \/ upwelling"},{"pregunta":"Bioma con mayor \u00e1rea protegida mundialmente","opciones":["Selva","Oc\u00e9ano (\u00e1reas marinas protegidas)","Tundra","Desierto"],"correcta":"Oc\u00e9ano (\u00e1reas marinas protegidas)"},{"pregunta":"Seg\u00fan Whittaker, el bioma depende de dos variables principales:","opciones":["Latitud y altitud","Temperatura media anual y precipitaci\u00f3n anual","pH y luz","Suelo y viento"],"correcta":"Temperatura media anual y precipitaci\u00f3n anual"},{"pregunta":"El bioma \u201cMatorral mediterr\u00e1neo\u201d se caracteriza por...","opciones":["Veranos secos + inviernos suaves","Inviernos secos","Lluvia todo el a\u00f1o","Nieve constante"],"correcta":"Veranos secos + inviernos suaves"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"redes-troficas","titulo":"Redes Tr\u00f3ficas: Flujo de Energ\u00eda, Complejidad y Estabilidad Ecol\u00f3gica","contenido":"<p class=\"intro\">\r\n    Las <strong>redes tr\u00f3ficas<\/strong> describen las relaciones de alimentaci\u00f3n en un ecosistema, mostrando qui\u00e9n consume a qui\u00e9n y c\u00f3mo fluye la energ\u00eda desde los productores hasta los consumidores superiores y descomponedores. A diferencia de las cadenas alimentarias lineales, las redes tr\u00f3ficas reflejan la realidad compleja de m\u00faltiples interacciones. Su estructura determina la eficiencia energ\u00e9tica, la resiliencia frente a perturbaciones y la regulaci\u00f3n de poblaciones (cascadas tr\u00f3ficas).\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"formula-neon text-center\">\r\n    Eficiencia tr\u00f3fica (Ley del 10% \u2013 Lindeman, 1942):<br>\r\n    \\[ E_{n+1} \\approx 0.1 \\times E_n \\]\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    I. De Cadenas a Redes Tr\u00f3ficas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Las cadenas alimentarias son simplificaciones did\u00e1cticas; las redes tr\u00f3ficas capturan la realidad: omnivor\u00eda, m\u00faltiples presas y rutas alternativas de flujo energ\u00e9tico.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Concepto<\/th>\r\n            <th>Cadena Alimentaria<\/th>\r\n            <th>Red Tr\u00f3fica<\/th>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Estructura<\/td>\r\n            <td>Lineal<\/td>\r\n            <td>Compleja, interconectada<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Realismo<\/td>\r\n            <td>Bajo<\/td>\r\n            <td>Alto<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Estabilidad<\/td>\r\n            <td>Fr\u00e1gil<\/td>\r\n            <td>Resiliente (mayor conectancia)<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n    <strong>Conectancia:<\/strong> \\( C = \\frac{L}{S^2} \\) (L = enlaces, S = especies). Valores altos (>0.3) indican mayor resiliencia.\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    II. Red Tr\u00f3fica Simplificada con Flujo Energ\u00e9tico\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <svg class=\"trophic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 675\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow-cyan\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#00ffff\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n            <marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"14\" markerHeight=\"14\" refX=\"12\" refY=\"7\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                <path d=\"M0,0 L14,7 L0,14 Z\" fill=\"#00ff99\"\/>\r\n            <\/marker>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n\r\n        <rect width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" fill=\"#020414\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"600\" y=\"90\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"48\" fill=\"#00ffff\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">RED TR\u00d3FICA DIN\u00c1MICA<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Productores -->\r\n        <rect x=\"500\" y=\"520\" width=\"200\" height=\"80\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#2e7d32\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"600\" y=\"570\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#e8f5e9\">PRODUCTORES<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Herb\u00edvoros y Omn\u00edvoros -->\r\n        <rect x=\"260\" y=\"360\" width=\"220\" height=\"80\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#fbc02d\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"370\" y=\"410\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#212121\">HERB\u00cdVOROS<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <rect x=\"720\" y=\"360\" width=\"220\" height=\"80\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#fbc02d\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"830\" y=\"410\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#212121\">OMN\u00cdVOROS<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Depredadores -->\r\n        <rect x=\"500\" y=\"200\" width=\"200\" height=\"80\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#c62828\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"600\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ffebee\">DEPREDADORES<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Descomponedores -->\r\n        <circle cx=\"600\" cy=\"640\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#6d4c41\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"600\" y=\"646\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#efebe9\">DESCOMP.<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Flujos -->\r\n        <path d=\"M600 520 L370 440\" stroke=\"#00ff99\" stroke-width=\"6\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M600 520 L830 440\" stroke=\"#00ff99\" stroke-width=\"6\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M370 360 L600 280\" stroke=\"#ffcc00\" stroke-width=\"6\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M830 360 L600 280\" stroke=\"#ffcc00\" stroke-width=\"6\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M600 640 Q420 520 370 440\" stroke=\"#8d6e63\" stroke-width=\"4\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M600 640 Q780 520 830 440\" stroke=\"#8d6e63\" stroke-width=\"4\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"600\" y=\"620\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#88ffff\">Energ\u00eda \u2191 \u00b7 Materia \u21ba<\/text>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    III. Simuladores Interactivos\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: Cascada Tr\u00f3fica por Eliminaci\u00f3n de Especies<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Elimina un nivel tr\u00f3fico y observa el impacto en el ecosistema.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"trophic-sim\">\r\n    <div class=\"species-controls\">\r\n        <button data-impact=\"producers\">Eliminar productores<\/button>\r\n        <button data-impact=\"herbivores\">Eliminar herb\u00edvoros<\/button>\r\n        <button data-impact=\"predators\">Eliminar depredadores<\/button>\r\n        <button data-impact=\"none\">Restablecer<\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"cascadeResult\">Estado inicial: ecosistema equilibrado.<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const buttons = document.querySelectorAll(\".species-controls button\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"cascadeResult\");\r\n\r\n    const impacts = {\r\n        producers: \"\ud83d\udd25 Colapso total: sin entrada de energ\u00eda \u2192 extinci\u00f3n en cascada de todos los niveles.\",\r\n        herbivores: \"\u26a0\ufe0f Desbalance: productores crecen descontroladamente; depredadores disminuyen por falta de presas.\",\r\n        predators: \"\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f Cascada descendente: herb\u00edvoros aumentan \u2192 sobreexplotaci\u00f3n vegetal \u2192 degradaci\u00f3n del h\u00e1bitat.\",\r\n        none: \"\ud83c\udf3f Ecosistema equilibrado: flujo energ\u00e9tico normal y regulaci\u00f3n poblacional.\"\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    buttons.forEach(btn => {\r\n        btn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\r\n            buttons.forEach(b => b.classList.remove(\"active\"));\r\n            if (btn.dataset.impact !== \"none\") btn.classList.add(\"active\");\r\n            result.innerHTML = impacts[btn.dataset.impact];\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">An\u00e1lisis: Conectancia y Estabilidad de la Red<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Ingresa n\u00famero de especies y enlaces para calcular conectancia y evaluar resiliencia.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"trophic-sim\">\r\n    <label>Especies (S): <input type=\"number\" id=\"speciesInput\" value=\"15\" min=\"2\"><\/label>\r\n    <label>Enlaces (L): <input type=\"number\" id=\"linksInput\" value=\"45\" min=\"1\"><\/label>\r\n    <button id=\"calcConnect\">Calcular<\/button>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"connectResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const sInput = document.getElementById(\"speciesInput\");\r\n    const lInput = document.getElementById(\"linksInput\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"connectResult\");\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById(\"calcConnect\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\r\n        const S = parseInt(sInput.value);\r\n        const L = parseInt(lInput.value);\r\n\r\n        if (S < 2 || L < 1) {\r\n            result.innerHTML = \"\u26a0\ufe0f Valores inv\u00e1lidos.\";\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        const C = (L \/ (S * S)).toFixed(3);\r\n        let stability = \"\";\r\n\r\n        if (C < 0.1) stability = \"\ud83d\udd34 Baja resiliencia: vulnerable a perturbaciones.\";\r\n        else if (C < 0.3) stability = \"\ud83d\udfe1 Moderada: estabilidad limitada.\";\r\n        else stability = \"\ud83d\udfe2 Alta resiliencia: amortigua impactos.\";\r\n\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>Conectancia C = ${C}<\/strong><br>${stability}`;\r\n    });\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Quiz Autoevaluado: Redes Tr\u00f3ficas<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>1. La eficiencia energ\u00e9tica entre niveles tr\u00f3ficos es aproximadamente:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,false)\">50%<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,true)\">10%<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,false)\">1%<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb1\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>2. Mayor conectancia en una red tr\u00f3fica implica:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,true)\">Mayor estabilidad<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,false)\">Menor biodiversidad<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,false)\">Flujo energ\u00e9tico m\u00e1s r\u00e1pido<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb2\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>3. Una cascada tr\u00f3fica t\u00edpica ocurre cuando:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,true)\">Se elimina un superpredador<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,false)\">Aumentan productores<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,false)\">Se a\u00f1aden descomponedores<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb3\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"quizScore\" class=\"score-display\">Puntuaci\u00f3n: 0\/3<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nlet score = 0;\r\nconst total = 3;\r\nfunction checkQuiz(q, correct){\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById(\"fb\" + q);\r\n    if (correct){\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u2705 Correcto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#00e676\";\r\n        score++;\r\n    } else {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u274c Incorrecto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#ff1744\";\r\n    }\r\n    document.getElementById(\"quizScore\").textContent = \"Puntuaci\u00f3n: \" + score + \"\/\" + total;\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    IV. Errores Comunes del Estudiante\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"errors-interactive\">\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err1\" onchange=\"toggleError(1)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err1\">Confundir cadena alimentaria con red tr\u00f3fica.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp1\">Las cadenas son lineales; las redes capturan omnivor\u00eda y rutas m\u00faltiples.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err2\" onchange=\"toggleError(2)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err2\">Creer que m\u00e1s especies siempre implica mayor estabilidad.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp2\">La estabilidad depende de conectancia, no solo riqueza.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err3\" onchange=\"toggleError(3)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err3\">Ignorar el rol de descomponedores en el reciclaje.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp3\">Sin ellos, la materia no retorna al sistema.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction toggleError(n){\r\n    const exp = document.getElementById(\"exp\" + n);\r\n    exp.style.display = document.getElementById(\"err\" + n).checked ? \"block\" : \"none\";\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    V. Conexi\u00f3n con el Curr\u00edculo de Ecosistemas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Este tema es central en \"Flujo de energ\u00eda y ciclos de materia\" y \"Din\u00e1mica de poblaciones y comunidades\". Se eval\u00faa en ex\u00e1menes oficiales junto a productividad primaria, pir\u00e1mides tr\u00f3ficas y servicios ecosist\u00e9micos. Es clave para analizar impactos antropog\u00e9nicos como sobrepesca o p\u00e9rdida de depredadores apicales.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VI. Problemas Tipo Examen\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ol class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n    <li>Explica por qu\u00e9 la eficiencia energ\u00e9tica limita el n\u00famero de niveles tr\u00f3ficos en un ecosistema.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Analiza el efecto de eliminar un superpredador en una red tr\u00f3fica compleja vs. simple.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Calcula la conectancia de una red con 12 especies y 54 enlaces. Interpreta su estabilidad.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Describe una cascada tr\u00f3fica real (ej. lobos en Yellowstone) y sus implicaciones.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Justifica la importancia de la complejidad en redes tr\u00f3ficas para la resiliencia ecosist\u00e9mica.<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VII. Reflexi\u00f3n Metacognitiva\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"reflection-list\">\r\n    <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo cambia tu visi\u00f3n de la conservaci\u00f3n al entender las cascadas tr\u00f3ficas?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfEn qu\u00e9 ecosistemas reales ves redes tr\u00f3ficas fr\u00e1giles y por qu\u00e9?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategia usar\u00e1s para analizar redes tr\u00f3ficas en futuros ex\u00e1menes?<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">\r\n    Las redes tr\u00f3ficas son el tejido que sostiene la vida. Su complejidad es la clave de la estabilidad ecol\u00f3gica en un mundo cambiante.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"neon-quote\">\r\n    \u201cEn la red de la vida, cada hilo cuenta.\u201d\r\n<\/blockquote>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"Redes tr\u00f3ficas muestran...","opciones":["Cadenas lineales","Interconexiones","Solo plantas","Clima"],"correcta":"Interconexiones"},{"pregunta":"Base de la red:","opciones":["Carn\u00edvoros","Productores","Descomponedores","Herb\u00edvoros"],"correcta":"Productores"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda fluye de...","opciones":["Arriba a abajo","Abajo a arriba","Circular","Aleatorio"],"correcta":"Abajo a arriba"},{"pregunta":"Descomponedores...","opciones":["Consumen energ\u00eda","Reciclan materia","Producen luz","Nada"],"correcta":"Reciclan materia"},{"pregunta":"Omn\u00edvoro come...","opciones":["Solo plantas","Solo carne","Ambos","Nada"],"correcta":"Ambos"},{"pregunta":"Ley del 10% dice...","opciones":["90% pasa","10% pasa","100% pasa","0% pasa"],"correcta":"10% pasa"},{"pregunta":"Cadena es...","opciones":["Compleja","Lineal","Circular","3D"],"correcta":"Lineal"},{"pregunta":"Red es m\u00e1s...","opciones":["Fr\u00e1gil","Estable","Simple","R\u00e1pida"],"correcta":"Estable"},{"pregunta":"Superpredador es...","opciones":["Nivel 1","Nivel 4","Productor","Descomponedor"],"correcta":"Nivel 4"},{"pregunta":"Autor de la ley del 10%:","opciones":["Liebig","Lindeman","Shelford","Elton"],"correcta":"Lindeman"},{"pregunta":"Conectancia mide...","opciones":["Especies","Enlaces por especie\u00b2","Energ\u00eda","Biomasa"],"correcta":"Enlaces por especie\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"Bucle tr\u00f3fico es...","opciones":["A \u2192 B \u2192 A","A \u2192 B \u2192 C","A \u2192 A","B \u2192 A \u2192 C"],"correcta":"A \u2192 B \u2192 A"},{"pregunta":"Especie clave (keystone):","opciones":["Abundante","Impacto alto","Peque\u00f1a","Grande"],"correcta":"Impacto alto"},{"pregunta":"Si C = 0.1, red es...","opciones":["Simple","Compleja","Imposible","Lineal"],"correcta":"Simple"},{"pregunta":"En pir\u00e1mide de energ\u00eda:","opciones":["Base ancha","Base estrecha","Constante","Invertida"],"correcta":"Base ancha"},{"pregunta":"Descomponedores son...","opciones":["Heter\u00f3trofos","Aut\u00f3trofos","Fotosint\u00e9ticos","Quimiosint\u00e9ticos"],"correcta":"Heter\u00f3trofos"},{"pregunta":"En red, energ\u00eda se...","opciones":["Recicla","Pierde como calor","Aumenta","Conserva"],"correcta":"Pierde como calor"},{"pregunta":"Red con m\u00e1s enlaces es...","opciones":["Fr\u00e1gil","Resiliente","Lenta","Peque\u00f1a"],"correcta":"Resiliente"},{"pregunta":"Ejemplo de keystone:","opciones":["Lobo","Conejo","Planta","Bacteria"],"correcta":"Lobo"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula conectancia:","opciones":["C = S\/L","C = L\/S\u00b2","C = S\u00b2\/L","C = L\/S"],"correcta":"C = L\/S\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"Red con C > 0.3 es...","opciones":["Simple","Muy compleja","Imposible","Lineal"],"correcta":"Muy compleja"},{"pregunta":"Modelo de Elton (1927):","opciones":["Pir\u00e1mide de n\u00fameros","Red tr\u00f3fica","Ciclo","Flujo"],"correcta":"Pir\u00e1mide de n\u00fameros"},{"pregunta":"En cascada tr\u00f3fica, eliminar depredador causa...","opciones":["Menos plantas","M\u00e1s plantas","Nada","Menos herb\u00edvoros"],"correcta":"M\u00e1s plantas"},{"pregunta":"Red tr\u00f3fica global tiene ~...","opciones":["100 especies","10,000 especies","1M especies","100M especies"],"correcta":"10,000 especies"},{"pregunta":"An\u00e1lisis de redes usa...","opciones":["Gr\u00e1ficos","Teor\u00eda de grafos","\u00c1lgebra","Geometr\u00eda"],"correcta":"Teor\u00eda de grafos"},{"pregunta":"Nodo con m\u00e1s enlaces es...","opciones":["Perif\u00e9rico","Central (hub)","Aislado","Muerto"],"correcta":"Central (hub)"},{"pregunta":"En red marina, base es...","opciones":["Pez","Fitoplancton","Ballena","Coral"],"correcta":"Fitoplancton"},{"pregunta":"En red terrestre, base es...","opciones":["\u00c1rboles","Animales","Hongos","Bacterias"],"correcta":"\u00c1rboles"},{"pregunta":"Red m\u00e1s estudiada:","opciones":["Bosque","Oc\u00e9ano pel\u00e1gico","Desierto","Tundra"],"correcta":"Oc\u00e9ano pel\u00e1gico"},{"pregunta":"Red con m\u00e1s bucles es...","opciones":["Simple","Compleja","Lineal","Peque\u00f1a"],"correcta":"Compleja"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"relaciones-ecosistemas","titulo":"Relaciones Ecol\u00f3gicas: Simbiosis, Depredaci\u00f3n, Competencia y Coevoluci\u00f3n","contenido":"<p class=\"intro\">\r\n    Las <strong>relaciones ecol\u00f3gicas<\/strong> son las interacciones directas o indirectas entre especies que determinan su supervivencia, distribuci\u00f3n y evoluci\u00f3n. Se clasifican seg\u00fan su efecto neto (+ beneficio, \u2212 perjuicio, 0 neutro) en cada participante. Estas interacciones estructuran comunidades, regulan poblaciones y generan presiones coevolutivas. Comprenderlas es esencial para interpretar la biodiversidad, la estabilidad ecosist\u00e9mica y los impactos antropog\u00e9nicos.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    I. Clasificaci\u00f3n de las Relaciones Ecol\u00f3gicas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Interacci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n            <th>Notaci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n            <th>Descripci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n            <th>Ejemplo cl\u00e1sico<\/th>\r\n            <th>Implicaci\u00f3n evolutiva<\/th>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr><td>Mutualismo<\/td><td>+ \/ +<\/td><td>Beneficio rec\u00edproco<\/td><td>Micorrizas (planta-hongo)<\/td><td>Coevoluci\u00f3n obligatoria<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Comensalismo<\/td><td>+ \/ 0<\/td><td>Beneficio unilateral<\/td><td>R\u00e9mora-tibur\u00f3n<\/td><td>Adaptaci\u00f3n oportunista<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Parasitismo<\/td><td>+ \/ \u2212<\/td><td>Beneficio a costa del hu\u00e9sped<\/td><td>Pulga-perro<\/td><td>Carrera armamentista<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Depredaci\u00f3n<\/td><td>+ \/ \u2212<\/td><td>Captura y muerte de presa<\/td><td>Lobo-ciervo<\/td><td>Cascadas tr\u00f3ficas<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Competencia<\/td><td>\u2212 \/ \u2212<\/td><td>Uso compartido de recurso limitado<\/td><td>Plantas por luz<\/td><td>Partici\u00f3n de nicho<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Amensalismo<\/td><td>\u2212 \/ 0<\/td><td>Inhibici\u00f3n unilateral<\/td><td>Penicillium-bacteria<\/td><td>Alebopat\u00eda<\/td><\/tr>\r\n    <\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n    <strong>Simbiosis:<\/strong> Relaci\u00f3n \u00edntima y prolongada (incluye mutualismo, comensalismo y parasitismo). Puede ser obligatoria (indispensable) o facultativa.\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    II. Red de Relaciones Ecol\u00f3gicas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Visualizaci\u00f3n de interacciones simult\u00e1neas entre cuatro especies.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <svg class=\"relations-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 600\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow-cyan\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#00ffff\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n            <marker id=\"arrowPlus\" markerWidth=\"16\" markerHeight=\"16\" refX=\"14\" refY=\"8\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                <path d=\"M0,0 L16,8 L0,16 Z\" fill=\"#00ff88\"\/>\r\n            <\/marker>\r\n            <marker id=\"arrowMinus\" markerWidth=\"16\" markerHeight=\"16\" refX=\"14\" refY=\"8\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                <path d=\"M0,0 L16,8 L0,16 Z\" fill=\"#ff3366\"\/>\r\n            <\/marker>\r\n            <marker id=\"arrowZero\" markerWidth=\"16\" markerHeight=\"16\" refX=\"14\" refY=\"8\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                <path d=\"M0,0 L16,8 L0,16 Z\" fill=\"#bbbbbb\"\/>\r\n            <\/marker>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n\r\n        <rect width=\"900\" height=\"600\" fill=\"#05050a\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"450\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"42\" fill=\"#00ffff\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">RED DE RELACIONES ECOL\u00d3GICAS<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Especies -->\r\n        <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"300\" r=\"60\" fill=\"#2ecc71\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"200\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#000\">PLANTA<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"140\" r=\"60\" fill=\"#f1c40f\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"450\" y=\"145\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#000\">POLINIZADOR<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <circle cx=\"700\" cy=\"300\" r=\"60\" fill=\"#3498db\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"700\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#fff\">HERB\u00cdVORO<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"460\" r=\"60\" fill=\"#e74c3c\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"450\" y=\"465\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#fff\">PAR\u00c1SITO<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Interacciones -->\r\n        <path d=\"M260 300 L390 140\" stroke=\"#00ff88\" stroke-width=\"5\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowPlus)\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M390 140 L260 300\" stroke=\"#00ff88\" stroke-width=\"5\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowPlus)\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"325\" y=\"220\" fill=\"#00ff88\" font-size=\"20\">+\/+<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <path d=\"M260 300 L640 300\" stroke=\"#bbbbbb\" stroke-width=\"4\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowZero)\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"450\" y=\"285\" fill=\"#bbbbbb\" font-size=\"20\">+\/0<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <path d=\"M260 340 Q350 400 390 430\" stroke=\"#ff3366\" stroke-width=\"5\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowMinus)\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"330\" y=\"390\" fill=\"#ff3366\" font-size=\"20\">+\/-<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"450\" y=\"560\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#88ffff\">Beneficio (+) \u00b7 Perjuicio (\u2212) \u00b7 Neutro (0)<\/text>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    III. Simuladores Interactivos\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: Impacto de una Relaci\u00f3n Ecol\u00f3gica<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Selecciona una interacci\u00f3n y observa su efecto neto en ambas especies.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"relations-sim\">\r\n    <label>Interacci\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n    <select id=\"relationSelect\">\r\n        <option value=\"mutualismo\">Mutualismo (+\/+)<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"comensalismo\">Comensalismo (+\/0)<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"parasitismo\">Parasitismo (+\/-)<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"depredacion\">Depredaci\u00f3n (+\/-)<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"competencia\">Competencia (-\/-)<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"amensalismo\">Amensalismo (-\/0)<\/option>\r\n    <\/select>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"relationResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const select = document.getElementById(\"relationSelect\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"relationResult\");\r\n\r\n    const relations = {\r\n        mutualismo: { sign: \"+\/+\", desc: \"Ambas especies aumentan su aptitud. Ej: micorrizas.\", impact: \"Estabilidad y coevoluci\u00f3n.\" },\r\n        comensalismo: { sign: \"+\/0\", desc: \"Una se beneficia sin afectar a la otra. Ej: r\u00e9mora-tibur\u00f3n.\", impact: \"Beneficio oportunista.\" },\r\n        parasitismo: { sign: \"+\/-\", desc: \"Par\u00e1sito beneficia, hu\u00e9sped perjudicado. Ej: pulga-perro.\", impact: \"Carrera armamentista evolutiva.\" },\r\n        depredacion: { sign: \"+\/-\", desc: \"Depredador beneficia, presa perjudicada. Ej: lobo-ciervo.\", impact: \"Regulaci\u00f3n poblacional y cascadas.\" },\r\n        competencia: { sign: \"-\/-\", desc: \"Ambas reducen aptitud por recurso limitado.\", impact: \"Partici\u00f3n de nicho o exclusi\u00f3n.\" },\r\n        amensalismo: { sign: \"-\/0\", desc: \"Una inhibe a la otra sin costo propio. Ej: alelopat\u00eda.\", impact: \"Inhibici\u00f3n qu\u00edmica.\" }\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        const data = relations[select.value];\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>${data.sign}<\/strong><br>\r\n                            <strong>Descripci\u00f3n:<\/strong> ${data.desc}<br>\r\n                            <strong>Implicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> ${data.impact}`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    select.addEventListener(\"change\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: Carrera Coevolutiva<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Ajusta la longitud del tubo floral y observa la adaptaci\u00f3n de la prob\u00f3scide del polinizador.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"relations-sim\">\r\n    <label>Longitud tubo floral (cm): <span id=\"flowerValue\">5<\/span><\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"flowerSlider\" min=\"1\" max=\"15\" value=\"5\">\r\n\r\n    <label>Longitud prob\u00f3scide (cm): <span id=\"probeValue\">5<\/span><\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"probeSlider\" min=\"1\" max=\"15\" value=\"5\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"coevoResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const flower = document.getElementById(\"flowerSlider\");\r\n    const probe = document.getElementById(\"probeSlider\");\r\n    const fValue = document.getElementById(\"flowerValue\");\r\n    const pValue = document.getElementById(\"probeValue\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"coevoResult\");\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        const f = parseInt(flower.value);\r\n        const p = parseInt(probe.value);\r\n        fValue.textContent = f;\r\n        pValue.textContent = p;\r\n\r\n        const diff = Math.abs(f - p);\r\n        let message = \"\";\r\n\r\n        if (diff <= 1) message = \"\ud83d\udfe2 Adaptaci\u00f3n \u00f3ptima: polinizaci\u00f3n eficiente.\";\r\n        else if (diff <= 4) message = \"\ud83d\udfe1 Adaptaci\u00f3n parcial: eficiencia reducida.\";\r\n        else message = \"\ud83d\udd34 Desacoplamiento: interacci\u00f3n ineficaz o imposible.\";\r\n\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>Estado coevolutivo:<\/strong><br>${message}`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    flower.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    probe.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Quiz Autoevaluado: Relaciones Ecol\u00f3gicas<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>1. La relaci\u00f3n entre pez payaso y an\u00e9mona es:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,true)\">Mutualismo<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,false)\">Comensalismo<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,false)\">Parasitismo<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb1\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>2. En competencia interespec\u00edfica:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,true)\">Ambas especies sufren reducci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,false)\">Una beneficia y la otra no se afecta<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,false)\">Solo una sufre<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb2\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>3. La micorriza es un ejemplo de:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,true)\">Mutualismo obligatorio<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,false)\">Parasitismo<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,false)\">Amensalismo<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb3\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"quizScore\" class=\"score-display\">Puntuaci\u00f3n: 0\/3<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nlet score = 0;\r\nconst total = 3;\r\nfunction checkQuiz(q, correct){\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById(\"fb\" + q);\r\n    if (correct){\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u2705 Correcto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#00e676\";\r\n        score++;\r\n    } else {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u274c Incorrecto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#ff1744\";\r\n    }\r\n    document.getElementById(\"quizScore\").textContent = \"Puntuaci\u00f3n: \" + score + \"\/\" + total;\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    IV. Errores Comunes del Estudiante\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"errors-interactive\">\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err1\" onchange=\"toggleError(1)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err1\">Considerar toda simbiosis como mutualismo.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp1\">Simbiosis incluye tambi\u00e9n parasitismo y comensalismo.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err2\" onchange=\"toggleError(2)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err2\">Confundir depredaci\u00f3n con parasitismo.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp2\">Depredaci\u00f3n implica muerte inmediata; parasitismo es prolongado.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err3\" onchange=\"toggleError(3)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err3\">Ignorar el efecto neutro (0) en comensalismo y amensalismo.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp3\">Una especie no siempre afecta a la otra.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction toggleError(n){\r\n    const exp = document.getElementById(\"exp\" + n);\r\n    exp.style.display = document.getElementById(\"err\" + n).checked ? \"block\" : \"none\";\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    V. Conexi\u00f3n con el Curr\u00edculo de Ecosistemas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Este tema pertenece al bloque \"Interacciones bi\u00f3ticas\" y \"Din\u00e1mica de comunidades\" en Biolog\u00eda y Ecolog\u00eda. Se eval\u00faa en ex\u00e1menes oficiales junto a redes tr\u00f3ficas, nicho ecol\u00f3gico y coevoluci\u00f3n. Es fundamental para analizar biodiversidad, servicios ecosist\u00e9micos y conservaci\u00f3n.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VI. Problemas Tipo Examen\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ol class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n    <li>Clasifica la relaci\u00f3n entre coral y zooxantelas. Justifica su car\u00e1cter obligatorio.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Explica c\u00f3mo la competencia interespec\u00edfica puede llevar a partici\u00f3n de nicho.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Analiza el signo (+\/\u2212\/0) de la interacci\u00f3n entre lobo y ciervo e identifica posibles cascadas.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Compara mutualismo y comensalismo con ejemplos reales.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Describe un caso de coevoluci\u00f3n y su mecanismo selectivo.<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VII. Reflexi\u00f3n Metacognitiva\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"reflection-list\">\r\n    <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo influyen las relaciones ecol\u00f3gicas en la conservaci\u00f3n de especies amenazadas?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfEn qu\u00e9 ecosistema cercano observas interacciones clave y cu\u00e1l es su efecto?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategia usar\u00e1s para clasificar interacciones en futuros an\u00e1lisis ecol\u00f3gicos?<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">\r\n    Las relaciones ecol\u00f3gicas son el motor de la diversidad y estabilidad. Comprender su din\u00e1mica permite intervenir responsablemente en los ecosistemas.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"neon-quote\">\r\n    \u201cNinguna especie vive sola: todas est\u00e1n entrelazadas.\u201d\r\n<\/blockquote>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"Simbiosis incluye...","opciones":["Solo mutualismo","Mutualismo, comensalismo, parasitismo","Depredaci\u00f3n","Competencia"],"correcta":"Mutualismo, comensalismo, parasitismo"},{"pregunta":"Depredaci\u00f3n es...","opciones":["+\/+","+\/-","-\/-","+\/0"],"correcta":"+\/-"},{"pregunta":"Comensalismo es...","opciones":["+\/0","-\/0","+\/+","-\/-"],"correcta":"+\/0"},{"pregunta":"Competencia afecta...","opciones":["Ambas negativamente","Una positivamente","Ninguna","Solo una"],"correcta":"Ambas negativamente"},{"pregunta":"Mutualismo es...","opciones":["+\/+","+\/-","-\/-","+\/0"],"correcta":"+\/+"},{"pregunta":"Amensalismo es...","opciones":["-\/0","+\/0","-\/-","+\/+"],"correcta":"-\/0"},{"pregunta":"Autor de exclusi\u00f3n competitiva:","opciones":["Liebig","Gause","Shelford","Lotka"],"correcta":"Gause"},{"pregunta":"Especie clave ejemplo:","opciones":["Conejo","Lobo","Planta","Bacteria"],"correcta":"Lobo"},{"pregunta":"R\u00e9mora y tibur\u00f3n:","opciones":["Mutualismo","Comensalismo","Parasitismo","Competencia"],"correcta":"Comensalismo"},{"pregunta":"Abeja y flor:","opciones":["Comensalismo","Mutualismo","Parasitismo","Depredaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Mutualismo"},{"pregunta":"Cascada tr\u00f3fica es...","opciones":["Efecto domin\u00f3","Ciclo","Competencia","Simbiosis"],"correcta":"Efecto domin\u00f3"},{"pregunta":"Sin lobos en Yellowstone:","opciones":["M\u00e1s sauces","Menos sauces","Nada","M\u00e1s lobos"],"correcta":"Menos sauces"},{"pregunta":"Coevoluci\u00f3n ejemplo:","opciones":["Flor y polilla","Le\u00f3n y cebra","\u00c1rbol y suelo","Pez y agua"],"correcta":"Flor y polilla"},{"pregunta":"Endosimbiosis:","opciones":["Fuera","Dentro","Encima","Debajo"],"correct Wikidata":"Dentro"},{"pregunta":"Facultativo significa...","opciones":["Obligatorio","Opcional","Mortal","Temporal"],"correcta":"Opcional"},{"pregunta":"Intraespec\u00edfica es...","opciones":["Entre especies","Dentro de especie","Con plantas","Con animales"],"correcta":"Dentro de especie"},{"pregunta":"Principio de Gause:","opciones":["Dos nichos iguales","Un nicho por especie","Dos especies sin nicho","Ning\u00fan nicho"],"correcta":"Un nicho por especie"},{"pregunta":"Facilitaci\u00f3n es...","opciones":["Da\u00f1o","Ayuda sin costo","Competencia","Depredaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Ayuda sin costo"},{"pregunta":"Pulga en perro:","opciones":["Mutualismo","Parasitismo","Comensalismo","Competencia"],"correcta":"Parasitismo"},{"pregunta":"\u00c1rbol sombrea hierba:","opciones":["Amensalismo","Competencia","Mutualismo","Depredaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Amensalismo"},{"pregunta":"Modelo Lotka-Volterra es para...","opciones":["Depredaci\u00f3n","Competencia","Simbiosis","Crecimiento"],"correcta":"Depredaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"En cascada, eliminar nivel 3 causa...","opciones":["Menos nivel 1","M\u00e1s nivel 2","Menos nivel 2","Nada"],"correcta":"M\u00e1s nivel 2"},{"pregunta":"Especie ingeniera ejemplo:","opciones":["Castor","Conejo","P\u00e1jaro","Pez"],"correcta":"Castor"},{"pregunta":"Red de interacciones con m\u00e1s +\/+ es...","opciones":["Inestable","Estable","Simple","Peque\u00f1a"],"correcta":"Estable"},{"pregunta":"En arrecifes, competencia por...","opciones":["Luz","Espacio","Agua","O\u2082"],"correcta":"Espacio"},{"pregunta":"Clownfish y an\u00e9mona:","opciones":["Comensalismo","Mutualismo obligatorio","Parasitismo","Competencia"],"correcta":"Mutualismo obligatorio"},{"pregunta":"Micorrizas son...","opciones":["Par\u00e1sitos","Mutualistas","Competidores","Depredadores"],"correcta":"Mutualistas"},{"pregunta":"Especie clave mantiene...","opciones":["Poblaci\u00f3n","Diversidad","Energ\u00eda","Materia"],"correcta":"Diversidad"},{"pregunta":"En modelos, interacci\u00f3n se mide con...","opciones":["\u03b1 (competencia)","\u03b2 (simbiosis)","\u03b3 (depredaci\u00f3n)","\u03b4 (crecimiento)"],"correcta":"\u03b1 (competencia)"},{"pregunta":"Red m\u00e1s resiliente tiene...","opciones":["Pocas interacciones","Muchas +\/+","Solo -\/-","Solo +\/0"],"correcta":"Muchas +\/+"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"homeostasis","titulo":"Homeostasis: El Equilibrio Din\u00e1mico en Organismos, Ecosistemas y Biosfera","contenido":"<p class=\"intro\">\r\n    La <strong>homeostasis<\/strong> es el mantenimiento activo de condiciones internas estables frente a perturbaciones externas, mediante mecanismos de retroalimentaci\u00f3n. Desde la regulaci\u00f3n fisiol\u00f3gica en organismos hasta la autorregulaci\u00f3n planetaria (Hip\u00f3tesis Gaia), la homeostasis asegura la persistencia de la vida. En aplicaciones reales, como la termorregulaci\u00f3n humana o la recuperaci\u00f3n de ecosistemas post-desastre, revela c\u00f3mo los sistemas vivos responden adaptativamente al cambio.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"formula-neon text-center\">\r\n    Retroalimentaci\u00f3n negativa:<br>\r\n    \\[ \\Delta V = k (V_{set} - V_{actual}) \\]\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    I. Niveles de Homeostasis en Sistemas Biol\u00f3gicos\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    La homeostasis opera en escalas jer\u00e1rquicas, desde lo molecular hasta lo global, mediante detecci\u00f3n, control y correcci\u00f3n.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Nivel<\/th>\r\n            <th>Mecanismos clave<\/th>\r\n            <th>Ejemplo<\/th>\r\n            <th>Implicaci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Organismos<\/td>\r\n            <td>Retroalimentaci\u00f3n negativa<\/td>\r\n            <td>Control gluc\u00e9mico (insulina\/glucag\u00f3n)<\/td>\r\n            <td>Mantenimiento fisiol\u00f3gico<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Ecosistemas<\/td>\r\n            <td>Regulaci\u00f3n poblacional, ciclos nutrientes<\/td>\r\n            <td>Depredador-presa en taiga<\/td>\r\n            <td>Resiliencia comunitaria<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Biosfera<\/td>\r\n            <td>Ciclos globales (Gaia)<\/td>\r\n            <td>Regulaci\u00f3n CO\u2082 por oc\u00e9anos<\/td>\r\n            <td>Estabilidad planetaria<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n    <strong>Retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva vs negativa:<\/strong> La negativa estabiliza; la positiva amplifica (ej. partos, coagulaci\u00f3n).\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    II. Retroalimentaci\u00f3n Homeost\u00e1tica (Diagrama Retro 8-Bit)\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Representaci\u00f3n del ciclo de control homeost\u00e1tico con animaci\u00f3n de pulso.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <svg class=\"homeo-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 650\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow\" x=\"-50%\" y=\"-50%\" width=\"200%\" height=\"200%\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"10\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#00ffff\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n            <marker id=\"green\" markerWidth=\"14\" markerHeight=\"14\" refX=\"12\" refY=\"7\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                <path d=\"M0,0 L14,7 L0,14 z\" fill=\"#33ff33\"\/>\r\n            <\/marker>\r\n            <marker id=\"red\" markerWidth=\"14\" markerHeight=\"14\" refX=\"12\" refY=\"7\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                <path d=\"M0,0 L14,7 L0,14 z\" fill=\"#ff3333\"\/>\r\n            <\/marker>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n\r\n        <rect width=\"900\" height=\"650\" fill=\"#000\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"450\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"42\" fill=\"#00ffff\" filter=\"url(#glow)\" font-family=\"Press Start 2P\">HOMEOSTASIS DIN\u00c1MICA<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"325\" r=\"120\" fill=\"#00ffcc\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"6\" filter=\"url(#glow)\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"120;135;120\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/circle>\r\n        <text x=\"450\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#000\" font-family=\"Press Start 2P\">EQUILIBRIO<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"200\" r=\"85\" fill=\"#ff3333\" filter=\"url(#glow)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"200\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"VT323\">PERTURBACI\u00d3N<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"200\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"VT323\">(e.g. Sequ\u00eda)<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <circle cx=\"700\" cy=\"200\" r=\"85\" fill=\"#33ff33\" filter=\"url(#glow)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"700\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#000\" font-family=\"VT323\">RESPUESTA<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"700\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#000\" font-family=\"VT323\">(e.g. Migraci\u00f3n)<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"450\" r=\"85\" fill=\"#ffcc00\" filter=\"url(#glow)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"200\" y=\"445\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#000\" font-family=\"VT323\">SENSOR<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"200\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#000\" font-family=\"VT323\">(Poblaci\u00f3n \u2193)<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <circle cx=\"700\" cy=\"450\" r=\"85\" fill=\"#00ffff\" filter=\"url(#glow)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"700\" y=\"445\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#000\" font-family=\"VT323\">EFECTOR<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"700\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#000\" font-family=\"VT323\">(Reproducci\u00f3n \u2191)<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <path d=\"M285 200 Q450 90 615 200\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#33ff33\" stroke-width=\"10\" marker-end=\"url(#green)\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M285 450 Q450 560 615 450\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff3333\" stroke-width=\"10\" marker-end=\"url(#red)\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <path d=\"M200 285 L200 365\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffcc00\" stroke-width=\"8\" marker-end=\"url(#green)\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M700 285 L700 365\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"8\" marker-end=\"url(#green)\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"450\" y=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#88ffff\" font-family=\"VT323\">Retroalimentaci\u00f3n negativa mantiene la estabilidad<\/text>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    III. Bloques Interactivos\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: Regulaci\u00f3n Homeost\u00e1tica de Temperatura<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Ajusta la temperatura externa y observa la respuesta homeost\u00e1tica del organismo.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"homeo-sim\">\r\n    <label>Temperatura externa (\u00b0C): <span id=\"extTempValue\">37<\/span><\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"extTempSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"50\" value=\"37\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"homeoResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const slider = document.getElementById(\"extTempSlider\");\r\n    const value = document.getElementById(\"extTempValue\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"homeoResult\");\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        const ext = parseInt(slider.value);\r\n        value.textContent = ext;\r\n\r\n        let response = \"\", mech = \"\";\r\n\r\n        if (ext < 35) {\r\n            response = \"Hipotermia inminente\";\r\n            mech = \"Activaci\u00f3n de escalofr\u00edos y vasoconstricci\u00f3n para generar\/conservar calor.\";\r\n        } else if (ext > 39) {\r\n            response = \"Hipertermia inminente\";\r\n            mech = \"Sudoraci\u00f3n y vasodilataci\u00f3n para disipar calor.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            response = \"Homeostasis estable\";\r\n            mech = \"Sin ajustes mayores necesarios.\";\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>Estado:<\/strong> ${response}<br>\r\n                            <strong>Mecanismo:<\/strong> ${mech}`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    slider.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">An\u00e1lisis: Conectancia en Red Homeost\u00e1tica<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Ingresa especies e interacciones para calcular conectancia y evaluar estabilidad homeost\u00e1tica.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"homeo-sim\">\r\n    <label>Especies (S): <input type=\"number\" id=\"speciesCount\" min=\"2\" value=\"10\"><\/label>\r\n    <label>Interacciones (L): <input type=\"number\" id=\"linksCount\" min=\"0\" value=\"25\"><\/label>\r\n    <button id=\"calcBtn\">Analizar<\/button>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"connectResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const sInput = document.getElementById(\"speciesCount\");\r\n    const lInput = document.getElementById(\"linksCount\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"connectResult\");\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById(\"calcBtn\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\r\n        const S = parseInt(sInput.value);\r\n        const L = parseInt(lInput.value);\r\n\r\n        if (S < 2) {\r\n            result.innerHTML = \"\u26a0\ufe0f M\u00ednimo 2 especies.\";\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        const C = (L \/ (S * (S - 1) \/ 2)).toFixed(3);\r\n        let stability = \"\";\r\n\r\n        if (C < 0.1) stability = \"\ud83d\udd34 Baja: vulnerable a perturbaciones.\";\r\n        else if (C < 0.3) stability = \"\ud83d\udfe1 Media: resiliencia moderada.\";\r\n        else stability = \"\ud83d\udfe2 Alta: fuerte homeostasis.\";\r\n\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>Conectancia C = ${C}<\/strong><br>${stability}`;\r\n    });\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Quiz Autoevaluado: Homeostasis<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>1. El mecanismo principal de homeostasis es:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,false)\">Retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,true)\">Retroalimentaci\u00f3n negativa<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb1\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>2. En ecosistemas, homeostasis implica:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,true)\">Regulaci\u00f3n poblacional<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,false)\">Estabilidad absoluta<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb2\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>3. Hip\u00f3tesis Gaia se refiere a:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,true)\">Homeostasis biosf\u00e9rica<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,false)\">Regulaci\u00f3n celular<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb3\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>4. Un ejemplo de retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva es:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(4,false)\">Control de temperatura<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(4,true)\">Coagulaci\u00f3n sangu\u00ednea<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb4\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>5. En biosfera, homeostasis regula:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(5,true)\">Ciclos globales como CO\u2082<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(5,false)\">Solo poblaciones locales<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb5\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"quizScore\" class=\"score-display\">Puntuaci\u00f3n: 0\/5<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nlet score = 0;\r\nconst total = 5;\r\nfunction checkQuiz(q, correct){\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById(\"fb\" + q);\r\n    if (correct){\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u2705 Correcto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#00e676\";\r\n        score++;\r\n    } else {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u274c Incorrecto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#ff1744\";\r\n    }\r\n    document.getElementById(\"quizScore\").textContent = \"Puntuaci\u00f3n: \" + score + \"\/\" + total;\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    IV. Errores Comunes del Estudiante\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"errors-interactive\">\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err1\" onchange=\"toggleError(1)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err1\">Creer que homeostasis implica ausencia de cambio.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp1\">Es equilibrio din\u00e1mico: constante ajuste.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err2\" onchange=\"toggleError(2)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err2\">Confundir retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva con negativa.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp2\">Positiva amplifica; negativa estabiliza.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err3\" onchange=\"toggleError(3)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err3\">Pensar que homeostasis solo aplica a organismos.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp3\">Se extiende a ecosistemas y biosfera.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err4\" onchange=\"toggleError(4)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err4\">Ignorar umbrales de resiliencia.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp4\">Sistemas pueden colapsar si se exceden l\u00edmites.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction toggleError(n){\r\n    const exp = document.getElementById(\"exp\" + n);\r\n    exp.style.display = document.getElementById(\"err\" + n).checked ? \"block\" : \"none\";\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    V. Conexi\u00f3n con el Curr\u00edculo de Ecosistemas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    La homeostasis integra bloques como \"Fisiolog\u00eda ambiental\" y \"Din\u00e1mica ecosist\u00e9mica\" en Biolog\u00eda y Ecolog\u00eda. Se eval\u00faa con Leyes de Liebig\/Shelford, ciclos biogeoqu\u00edmicos y resiliencia. Es clave para temas de sostenibilidad y cambio global en curr\u00edculos oficiales.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VI. Problemas Tipo Examen\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ol class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n    <li>Explica el rol de la retroalimentaci\u00f3n negativa en la termorregulaci\u00f3n humana.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Analiza c\u00f3mo un ecosistema recupera homeostasis post-perturbaci\u00f3n (ej. incendio).<\/li>\r\n    <li>Compara homeostasis fisiol\u00f3gica con ecosist\u00e9mica, con ejemplos.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Predice el impacto de CO\u2082 elevado en homeostasis biosf\u00e9rica (Gaia).<\/li>\r\n    <li>Justifica por qu\u00e9 la retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva puede llevar a inestabilidad.<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VII. Reflexi\u00f3n Metacognitiva\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"reflection-list\">\r\n    <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo aplica la homeostasis a problemas globales como el cambio clim\u00e1tico?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfEn qu\u00e9 nivel (organismo\/ecosistema\/biosfera) ves mayor vulnerabilidad y por qu\u00e9?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategia usar\u00e1s para analizar mecanismos homeost\u00e1ticos en ex\u00e1menes?<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">\r\n    La homeostasis revela la resiliencia de la vida, pero tambi\u00e9n sus l\u00edmites. Entenderla es vital para intervenir en sistemas biol\u00f3gicos de forma \u00e9tica y efectiva.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"neon-quote\">\r\n    \u201cLa vida es cambio constante; la homeostasis, su ancla.\u201d\r\n<\/blockquote>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"Homeostasis es...","opciones":["Cambio constante","Equilibrio interno","Desequilibrio","Crecimiento"],"correcta":"Equilibrio interno"},{"pregunta":"Retroalimentaci\u00f3n negativa...","opciones":["Amplifica","Restaura equilibrio","Destruye","Ignora"],"correcta":"Restaura equilibrio"},{"pregunta":"Ejemplo en ecosistema:","opciones":["Depredador-presa","Solo clima","Solo plantas","Nada"],"correcta":"Depredador-presa"},{"pregunta":"En humanos, regula...","opciones":["Temperatura","Todo","Solo comida","Nada"],"correcta":"Temperatura"},{"pregunta":"Sensor en homeostasis:","opciones":["Detecta cambio","Ejecuta","Ignora","Amplifica"],"correcta":"Detecta cambio"},{"pregunta":"Efectores son...","opciones":["M\u00fasculos, gl\u00e1ndulas","Sensores","Control","Nada"],"correcta":"M\u00fasculos, gl\u00e1ndulas"},{"pregunta":"Retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva...","opciones":["Estabiliza","Desestabiliza","Ignora","Equilibra"],"correcta":"Desestabiliza"},{"pregunta":"En lago, muchos nutrientes \u2192","opciones":["Equilibrio","Eutrofizaci\u00f3n","Sequ\u00eda","Fr\u00edo"],"correcta":"Eutrofizaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Descomponedores ayudan a...","opciones":["Crecimiento","Reciclar nutrientes","Depredar","Competir"],"correcta":"Reciclar nutrientes"},{"pregunta":"Homeostasis es...","opciones":["Est\u00e1tica","Din\u00e1mica","Fija","Mortal"],"correcta":"Din\u00e1mica"},{"pregunta":"Resiliencia es...","opciones":["Capacidad de cambio","Capacidad de retorno","Fuerza","Tama\u00f1o"],"correcta":"Capacidad de retorno"},{"pregunta":"Umbral (tipping point):","opciones":["Punto de equilibrio","Punto sin retorno","Punto de crecimiento","Punto de inicio"],"correcta":"Punto sin retorno"},{"pregunta":"Modelo Lotka-Volterra es para...","opciones":["Crecimiento","Depredaci\u00f3n","Competencia","Simbiosis"],"correcta":"Depredaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"En Yellowstone, lobos controlan...","opciones":["Ciervos","Plantas","R\u00edos","Clima"],"correcta":"Ciervos"},{"pregunta":"Sucesi\u00f3n restaura...","opciones":["Clima","Equilibrio","Poblaci\u00f3n","Energ\u00eda"],"correcta":"Equilibrio"},{"pregunta":"Estado alternativo es...","opciones":["Mismo equilibrio","Otro equilibrio","Desequilibrio","Crecimiento"],"correcta":"Otro equilibrio"},{"pregunta":"En humanos, ADH regula...","opciones":["Agua","Glucosa","pH","Temperatura"],"correcta":"Agua"},{"pregunta":"En ecosistema, N se recicla por...","opciones":["Plantas","Descomponedores","Animales","Luz"],"correcta":"Descomponedores"},{"pregunta":"Retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva en...","opciones":["Equilibrio","Crisis","Crecimiento","Estabilidad"],"correcta":"Crisis"},{"pregunta":"Ecosistema resiliente vuelve en...","opciones":["A\u00f1os","Siglos","Nunca","D\u00edas"],"correcta":"A\u00f1os"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula log\u00edstica con depredaci\u00f3n:","opciones":["dN\/dt = rN","dN\/dt = rN(1-N\/K) - cNP","dN\/dt = rN + cNP","dN\/dt = K"],"correcta":"dN\/dt = rN(1-N\/K) - cNP"},{"pregunta":"En modelo, K es...","opciones":["Capacidad de carga","Crecimiento","Depredaci\u00f3n","Mortalidad"],"correcta":"Capacidad de carga"},{"pregunta":"Ecosistema con alta resiliencia tiene...","opciones":["Pocas especies","Alta diversidad","Baja conectancia","Solo plantas"],"correcta":"Alta diversidad"},{"pregunta":"Acidificaci\u00f3n oce\u00e1nica es...","opciones":["Retro negativa","Umbral","Equilibrio","Crecimiento"],"correcta":"Umbral"},{"pregunta":"En Amazon\u00eda, deforestaci\u00f3n \u2192","opciones":["M\u00e1s lluvia","Menos lluvia","Igual","M\u00e1s CO\u2082"],"correcta":"Menos lluvia"},{"pregunta":"Resiliencia se mide por...","opciones":["Tiempo de retorno","Tama\u00f1o","Especies","Energ\u00eda"],"correcta":"Tiempo de retorno"},{"pregunta":"Ecosistema m\u00e1s resiliente:","opciones":["Desierto","Selva tropical","Tundra","Lago peque\u00f1o"],"correcta":"Selva tropical"},{"pregunta":"En modelo, c es...","opciones":["Tasa de encuentro","Crecimiento","Capacidad","Mortalidad"],"correcta":"Tasa de encuentro"},{"pregunta":"Eutrofizaci\u00f3n es retroalimentaci\u00f3n...","opciones":["Negativa","Positiva","Neutra","C\u00edclica"],"correcta":"Positiva"},{"pregunta":"Homeostasis global es...","opciones":["Gaia","Liebig","Shelford","Lotka"],"correcta":"Gaia"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"produccion-primaria-transferencia-energia","titulo":"Producci\u00f3n Primaria y Transferencia de Energ\u00eda en Ecosistemas","contenido":"<p class=\"intro\">\r\n    La <strong>producci\u00f3n primaria<\/strong> es la base energ\u00e9tica de todos los ecosistemas: los aut\u00f3trofos capturan energ\u00eda solar (o qu\u00edmica) y la convierten en biomasa. Esta energ\u00eda fluye unidireccionalmente a trav\u00e9s de los niveles tr\u00f3ficos con una eficiencia baja (~10%), lo que explica la forma de las pir\u00e1mides tr\u00f3ficas y la escasez relativa de superpredadores. Comprender estos procesos es clave para analizar productividad ecosist\u00e9mica, servicios ambientales y l\u00edmites a la explotaci\u00f3n de recursos.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"formula-neon text-center\">\r\n    Producci\u00f3n primaria neta (NPP):<br>\r\n    \\[ NPP = GPP - R_a \\]\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"formula-neon text-center\">\r\n    Eficiencia tr\u00f3fica (Ley del ~10%):<br>\r\n    \\[ E_{n+1} \\approx 0.1 \\times E_n \\]\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    I. Producci\u00f3n Primaria: GPP y NPP\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    La producci\u00f3n primaria bruta (GPP) es la energ\u00eda total fijada por aut\u00f3trofos. La producci\u00f3n primaria neta (NPP) es la energ\u00eda disponible para heter\u00f3trofos tras restar la respiraci\u00f3n aut\u00f3trofa (R\u2090).\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Concepto<\/th>\r\n            <th>Definici\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n            <th>Unidades t\u00edpicas<\/th>\r\n            <th>Factores limitantes<\/th>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>GPP<\/td>\r\n            <td>Energ\u00eda total capturada<\/td>\r\n            <td>g C m\u207b\u00b2 a\u00f1o\u207b\u00b9 o MJ m\u207b\u00b2 a\u00f1o\u207b\u00b9<\/td>\r\n            <td>Luz, CO\u2082, temperatura<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>NPP<\/td>\r\n            <td>Biomasa disponible<\/td>\r\n            <td>g C m\u207b\u00b2 a\u00f1o\u207b\u00b9<\/td>\r\n            <td>GPP \u2212 R\u2090 (respiraci\u00f3n)<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>R\u2090<\/td>\r\n            <td>Consumo energ\u00e9tico productores<\/td>\r\n            <td>\u2014<\/td>\r\n            <td>Temperatura (Q\u2081\u2080)<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n    <strong>Ecosistemas de alta NPP:<\/strong> Selvas tropicales y arrecifes coralinos. Baja NPP: Desiertos y oc\u00e9ano abierto.\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    II. Pir\u00e1mide de Transferencia Energ\u00e9tica\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Visualizaci\u00f3n del flujo unidireccional de energ\u00eda y p\u00e9rdidas por respiraci\u00f3n.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <svg class=\"energy-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 900\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow-cyan\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#00ffff\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n            <linearGradient id=\"grad-prod\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"0%\" y2=\"100%\">\r\n                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#2e7d32\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#1b5e20\"\/>\r\n            <\/linearGradient>\r\n            <linearGradient id=\"grad-herb\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"0%\" y2=\"100%\">\r\n                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#fdd835\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#f9a825\"\/>\r\n            <\/linearGradient>\r\n            <linearGradient id=\"grad-carn\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"0%\" y2=\"100%\">\r\n                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#ff8a50\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#ef6c00\"\/>\r\n            <\/linearGradient>\r\n            <linearGradient id=\"grad-apex\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"0%\" y2=\"100%\">\r\n                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#e53935\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#c62828\"\/>\r\n            <\/linearGradient>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n\r\n        <rect width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" fill=\"#000\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"600\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"42\" fill=\"#00ffff\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">FLUJO DE ENERG\u00cdA EN ECOSISTEMAS<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Productores -->\r\n        <rect x=\"50\" y=\"680\" width=\"1100\" height=\"150\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"url(#grad-prod)\" stroke=\"#00ff00\" stroke-width=\"6\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.9;1\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/rect>\r\n        <text x=\"600\" y=\"740\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#e0ffe0\">PRODUCTORES<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"600\" y=\"790\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#ffffff\">100 % NPP<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Herb\u00edvoros -->\r\n        <rect x=\"150\" y=\"510\" width=\"900\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"url(#grad-herb)\" stroke=\"#ffeb3b\" stroke-width=\"6\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.9;1\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" begin=\"0.5s\"\/>\r\n        <\/rect>\r\n        <text x=\"600\" y=\"565\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#000\">HERB\u00cdVOROS<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"600\" y=\"610\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">\u2248 10 %<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Carn\u00edvoros -->\r\n        <rect x=\"300\" y=\"360\" width=\"600\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"url(#grad-carn)\" stroke=\"#ff6f00\" stroke-width=\"6\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.9;1\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" begin=\"1s\"\/>\r\n        <\/rect>\r\n        <text x=\"600\" y=\"410\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#fff\">CARN\u00cdVOROS<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"600\" y=\"450\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ffffff\">\u2248 1 %<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- \u00c1pice -->\r\n        <rect x=\"425\" y=\"230\" width=\"350\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"url(#grad-apex)\" stroke=\"#ff1744\" stroke-width=\"6\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.9;1\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" begin=\"1.5s\"\/>\r\n        <\/rect>\r\n        <text x=\"600\" y=\"275\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#fff\">\u00c1PICE<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"600\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ffffff\">\u2248 0.1 %<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Flujos -->\r\n        <path d=\"M600 680 L600 650\" stroke=\"#00ff00\" stroke-width=\"20\" opacity=\"0.9\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M600 510 L600 480\" stroke=\"#76ff03\" stroke-width=\"18\" opacity=\"0.9\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M600 360 L600 330\" stroke=\"#c6ff00\" stroke-width=\"16\" opacity=\"0.9\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <!-- P\u00e9rdidas -->\r\n        <text x=\"50\" y=\"600\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ff4444\" transform=\"rotate(-90 50 600)\">\u224890% p\u00e9rdida (calor)<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"50\" y=\"430\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ff4444\" transform=\"rotate(-90 50 430)\">\u224890% p\u00e9rdida (calor)<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"50\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ff4444\" transform=\"rotate(-90 50 290)\">\u224890% p\u00e9rdida (calor)<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Ley del 10% -->\r\n        <rect x=\"900\" y=\"350\" width=\"280\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#001122\" stroke=\"#ffcc00\" stroke-width=\"4\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"1040\" y=\"410\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#ffcc00\">LEY DEL \u224810%<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"1040\" y=\"460\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ffffff\">E(n+1) \u2248 0.1 \u00d7 E(n)<\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"1040\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#cccccc\">Eficiencia tr\u00f3fica<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"600\" y=\"860\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#88ffff\">La energ\u00eda fluye \u2022 La materia se recicla<\/text>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    III. Simuladores Interactivos\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: Transferencia Energ\u00e9tica entre Niveles Tr\u00f3ficos<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Ingresa NPP inicial y eficiencia promedio para calcular energ\u00eda disponible en cada nivel.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"energy-sim\">\r\n    <label>NPP inicial (MJ m\u207b\u00b2 a\u00f1o\u207b\u00b9): <input type=\"number\" id=\"nppInput\" value=\"10000\" min=\"1000\"><\/label>\r\n    <label>Eficiencia tr\u00f3fica (%): <span id=\"effValue\">10<\/span><\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"effSlider\" min=\"5\" max=\"25\" value=\"10\">\r\n\r\n    <button id=\"calcEnergy\">Calcular<\/button>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"energyResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const nppInput = document.getElementById(\"nppInput\");\r\n    const effSlider = document.getElementById(\"effSlider\");\r\n    const effValue = document.getElementById(\"effValue\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"energyResult\");\r\n\r\n    effSlider.addEventListener(\"input\", () => effValue.textContent = effSlider.value);\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById(\"calcEnergy\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\r\n        const npp = parseFloat(nppInput.value) || 10000;\r\n        const eff = parseFloat(effSlider.value) \/ 100;\r\n\r\n        result.innerHTML = `\r\n            <strong>NPP inicial:<\/strong> ${npp.toLocaleString()} MJ<br>\r\n            <strong>Herb\u00edvoros:<\/strong> ${(npp * eff).toFixed(0)} MJ<br>\r\n            <strong>Carn\u00edvoros primarios:<\/strong> ${(npp * eff ** 2).toFixed(0)} MJ<br>\r\n            <strong>Depredadores \u00e1pice:<\/strong> ${(npp * eff ** 3).toFixed(0)} MJ<br><br>\r\n            <em>M\u00e1ximo niveles viables: ${eff >= 0.15 ? '5\u20136' : '4\u20135'}<\/em>\r\n        `;\r\n    });\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">An\u00e1lisis: Productividad por Ecosistema<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Selecciona un ecosistema para ver su NPP t\u00edpica y factores limitantes.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"energy-sim\">\r\n    <select id=\"ecoSelect\">\r\n        <option value=\"tropical\">Selva tropical<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"temperate\">Bosque templado<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"grassland\">Pradera<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"desert\">Desierto<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"ocean\">Oc\u00e9ano abierto<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"reef\">Arrecife coralino<\/option>\r\n    <\/select>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"ecoResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const select = document.getElementById(\"ecoSelect\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"ecoResult\");\r\n\r\n    const data = {\r\n        tropical: { npp: \"2000\u20133500\", limit: \"Alta radiaci\u00f3n y agua \u2192 m\u00e1xima productividad\" },\r\n        temperate: { npp: \"1000\u20132000\", limit: \"Estacionalidad limita crecimiento anual\" },\r\n        grassland: { npp: \"500\u20131500\", limit: \"Agua y fuego regulan biomasa\" },\r\n        desert: { npp: \"<250\", limit: \"Escasez h\u00eddrica extrema\" },\r\n        ocean: { npp: \"100\u2013400\", limit: \"Nutrientes en zona f\u00f3tica\" },\r\n        reef: { npp: \"2000\u20135000\", limit: \"Simbiosis y alta luz\" }\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        const d = data[select.value];\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>NPP \u2248 ${d.npp} g C m\u207b\u00b2 a\u00f1o\u207b\u00b9<\/strong><br>${d.limit}`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    select.addEventListener(\"change\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Quiz Autoevaluado: Producci\u00f3n y Transferencia<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>1. NPP representa:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,true)\">Energ\u00eda disponible para heter\u00f3trofos<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,false)\">Energ\u00eda total capturada<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb1\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>2. La eficiencia tr\u00f3fica t\u00edpica es \u2248:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,true)\">10%<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,false)\">50%<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb2\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>3. Ecosistema terrestre con mayor NPP:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,true)\">Selva tropical<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,false)\">Desierto<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb3\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>4. Principal causa de p\u00e9rdida energ\u00e9tica:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(4,true)\">Respiraci\u00f3n (calor)<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(4,false)\">Excreci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb4\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"quizScore\" class=\"score-display\">Puntuaci\u00f3n: 0\/4<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nlet score = 0;\r\nconst total = 4;\r\nfunction checkQuiz(q, correct){\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById(\"fb\" + q);\r\n    if (correct){\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u2705 Correcto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#00e676\";\r\n        score++;\r\n    } else {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u274c Incorrecto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#ff1744\";\r\n    }\r\n    document.getElementById(\"quizScore\").textContent = \"Puntuaci\u00f3n: \" + score + \"\/\" + total;\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    IV. Errores Comunes del Estudiante\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"errors-interactive\">\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err1\" onchange=\"toggleError(1)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err1\">Confundir GPP con NPP.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp1\">GPP incluye respiraci\u00f3n aut\u00f3trofa; NPP es biomasa disponible.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err2\" onchange=\"toggleError(2)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err2\">Pensar que eficiencia >50% es posible.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp2\">2\u00aa Ley Termodin\u00e1mica limita transferencia.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err3\" onchange=\"toggleError(3)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err3\">Creer que oc\u00e9ano abierto tiene alta NPP.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp3\">Limitado por nutrientes pese a gran \u00e1rea.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction toggleError(n){\r\n    const exp = document.getElementById(\"exp\" + n);\r\n    exp.style.display = document.getElementById(\"err\" + n).checked ? \"block\" : \"none\";\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    V. Conexi\u00f3n con el Curr\u00edculo de Ecosistemas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Tema central en \"Flujo de energ\u00eda y productividad\" en Biolog\u00eda y Ecolog\u00eda. Se eval\u00faa con pir\u00e1mides tr\u00f3ficas, ciclos biogeoqu\u00edmicos y servicios ecosist\u00e9micos. Es base para analizar sostenibilidad y cambio global.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VI. Problemas Tipo Examen\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ol class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n    <li>Calcula energ\u00eda disponible para carn\u00edvoros si NPP = 8000 MJ m\u207b\u00b2 a\u00f1o\u207b\u00b9 y eficiencia = 12%.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Explica por qu\u00e9 pir\u00e1mides de energ\u00eda siempre son rectas.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Compara NPP entre selva tropical y desierto. Justifica factores limitantes.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Analiza implicaciones de baja eficiencia tr\u00f3fica en explotaci\u00f3n pesquera.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Predice efecto de eutrofizaci\u00f3n en NPP acu\u00e1tica.<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VII. Reflexi\u00f3n Metacognitiva\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"reflection-list\">\r\n    <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo limita la baja eficiencia tr\u00f3fica el n\u00famero de niveles en cadenas alimentarias?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 conservar productores primarios es prioritario en gesti\u00f3n ambiental?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategia usar\u00e1s para calcular flujos energ\u00e9ticos en ex\u00e1menes?<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">\r\n    La energ\u00eda fluye, no se recicla. La baja eficiencia tr\u00f3fica define la estructura y l\u00edmites de los ecosistemas.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"neon-quote\">\r\n    \u201cLa energ\u00eda es el currency de la vida; su flujo, el latido del ecosistema.\u201d\r\n<\/blockquote>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"Producci\u00f3n primaria es...","opciones":["Consumo","S\u00edntesis org\u00e1nica","Descomposici\u00f3n","Transferencia"],"correcta":"S\u00edntesis org\u00e1nica"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda transferida entre niveles:","opciones":["100%","10%","50%","1%"],"correcta":"10%"},{"pregunta":"P\u00e9rdida principal de energ\u00eda:","opciones":["Calor","Luz","Agua","Carbono"],"correcta":"Calor"},{"pregunta":"Base de la cadena:","opciones":["Carn\u00edvoros","Productores","Descomponedores","Herb\u00edvoros"],"correcta":"Productores"},{"pregunta":"GPP significa...","opciones":["Gross Primary Production","Global Plant Production","Green Plant Power","Nada"],"correcta":"Gross Primary Production"},{"pregunta":"NPP = GPP - ...","opciones":["R_a","P","C","Luz"],"correcta":"R_a"},{"pregunta":"Pir\u00e1mide de energ\u00eda es...","opciones":["Invertida","Siempre decreciente","Constante","Creciente"],"correcta":"Siempre decreciente"},{"pregunta":"Unidad com\u00fan de NPP:","opciones":["g C\/m\u00b2\/a\u00f1o","kg\/m","L\/ha","\u00b0C"],"correcta":"g C\/m\u00b2\/a\u00f1o"},{"pregunta":"Quimios\u00edntesis ocurre en...","opciones":["Fotos","Fuentes hidrotermales","Suelo","Aire"],"correcta":"Fuentes hidrotermales"},{"pregunta":"Autor de la ley del 10%:","opciones":["Liebig","Lindeman","Shelford","Elton"],"correcta":"Lindeman"},{"pregunta":"Bioma con mayor NPP:","opciones":["Tundra","Selva tropical","Desierto","Oc\u00e9ano"],"correcta":"Selva tropical"},{"pregunta":"Bioma con menor NPP:","opciones":["Pradera","Tundra","Bosque","Sabana"],"correcta":"Tundra"},{"pregunta":"En oc\u00e9ano, NPP limitada por...","opciones":["Luz","Nutrientes","CO\u2082","O\u2082"],"correcta":"Nutrientes"},{"pregunta":"Eficiencia tr\u00f3fica real var\u00eda entre...","opciones":["5\u201320%","50\u201390%","1\u20135%","90\u2013100%"],"correcta":"5\u201320%"},{"pregunta":"PAR es...","opciones":["Luz total","Luz fotosint\u00e9ticamente activa","Presi\u00f3n","Agua"],"correcta":"Luz fotosint\u00e9ticamente activa"},{"pregunta":"En pir\u00e1mide invertida de biomasa:","opciones":["Oc\u00e9ano","Selva","Pradera","Tundra"],"correcta":"Oc\u00e9ano"},{"pregunta":"Sat\u00e9lite mide NPP con...","opciones":["NDVI","GPS","Radar","Sonar"],"correcta":"NDVI"},{"pregunta":"En selva, NPP \u2248 ... g C\/m\u00b2\/a\u00f1o","opciones":["100","1000","10000","100000"],"correcta":"1000"},{"pregunta":"En desierto, NPP < ... g C\/m\u00b2\/a\u00f1o","opciones":["1000","200","5000","100"],"correcta":"200"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula eficiencia:","opciones":["E = P_n \/ P_{n+1}","E = P_{n+1} \/ P_n","E = GPP \/ NPP","E = R_a \/ GPP"],"correcta":"E = P_{n+1} \/ P_n"},{"pregunta":"NPP global \u2248 ... Gt C\/a\u00f1o","opciones":["10","60","120","1000"],"correcta":"60"},{"pregunta":"Oc\u00e9anos aportan ~...% NPP global","opciones":["1%","50%","90%","10%"],"correcta":"50%"},{"pregunta":"En modelo, energ\u00eda no transferida se pierde como...","opciones":["Entrop\u00eda","Calor","Biomasa","Luz"],"correcta":"Calor"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e1xima eficiencia tr\u00f3fica en...","opciones":["Peces","Insectos","Mam\u00edferos","Aves"],"correcta":"Insectos"},{"pregunta":"En acuicultura, se maximiza...","opciones":["GPP","NPP","Eficiencia","Biomasa"],"correcta":"Eficiencia"},{"pregunta":"Pir\u00e1mide de n\u00fameros invertida en...","opciones":["1 \u00e1rbol \u2192 1000 insectos","1000 plantas \u2192 1 ciervo","10 peces \u2192 1 \u00e1guila","100 algas \u2192 1 pez"],"correcta":"1 \u00e1rbol \u2192 1000 insectos"},{"pregunta":"Fotos\u00edntesis: 6CO\u2082 + 6H\u2082O \u2192","opciones":["C\u2086H\u2081\u2082O\u2086 + 6O\u2082","C\u2086H\u2081\u2082O\u2086 + 6CO\u2082","6C + 6O\u2082","H\u2082O + CO\u2082"],"correcta":"C\u2086H\u2081\u2082O\u2086 + 6O\u2082"},{"pregunta":"En ecosistema, energ\u00eda total entrada =","opciones":["GPP","NPP","Biomasa","Calor"],"correcta":"GPP"},{"pregunta":"En modelo lineal, nivel n tiene energ\u00eda...","opciones":["10^n","10^{-n}","0.1^n \u00d7 P_0","P_0 \/ 10^n"],"correcta":"0.1^n \u00d7 P_0"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e1ximo nivel tr\u00f3fico sostenible:","opciones":["3","5","10","20"],"correcta":"5"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"huella-carbono-master","titulo":"Huella de Carbono: C\u00e1lculo, Impacto y Estrategias de Mitigaci\u00f3n","contenido":"<p class=\"intro\">\r\n    La <strong>huella de carbono<\/strong> mide la cantidad total de gases de efecto invernadero (GEI) emitidos directa o indirectamente por actividades humanas, expresada en toneladas de CO\u2082 equivalente (CO\u2082e). Utiliza el Potencial de Calentamiento Global (GWP) para normalizar distintos gases. Es una herramienta clave para evaluar responsabilidad clim\u00e1tica, dise\u00f1ar estrategias de mitigaci\u00f3n y avanzar hacia la neutralidad carbono (Net Zero).\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"formula-neon text-center\">\r\n    Huella de Carbono (CO\u2082e):<br>\r\n    \\[ HC = \\sum (m_i \\times GWP_i) \\]\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    I. Concepto y Alcances de la Huella de Carbono\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Alcance<\/th>\r\n            <th>Descripci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n            <th>Ejemplos<\/th>\r\n            <th>Importancia<\/th>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Alcance 1<\/td>\r\n            <td>Emisiones directas<\/td>\r\n            <td>Combusti\u00f3n vehicular, calefacci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n            <td>Fuentes propias controlables<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Alcance 2<\/td>\r\n            <td>Emisiones indirectas por energ\u00eda<\/td>\r\n            <td>Electricidad consumida<\/td>\r\n            <td>Depende del mix energ\u00e9tico<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Alcance 3<\/td>\r\n            <td>Otras indirectas (cadena de valor)<\/td>\r\n            <td>Proveedores, transporte, uso producto, residuos<\/td>\r\n            <td>70\u201390% en muchas empresas<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n    <strong>GWP (100 a\u00f1os):<\/strong> CO\u2082 = 1 | CH\u2084 = 28 | N\u2082O = 265 | SF\u2086 = 23 500\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    II. Flujo Antropog\u00e9nico de Carbono\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Representaci\u00f3n del ciclo alterado por actividades humanas.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <svg class=\"carbon-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 600\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow-cyan\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#00ffff\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n\r\n        <rect width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" fill=\"#000022\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"500\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"42\" fill=\"#00ffff\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">FLUJO ANTROPOG\u00c9NICO DE CARBONO<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Atm\u00f3sfera -->\r\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1000\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#ff4444\" opacity=\"0.2\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"500\" y=\"90\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ff8888\">ATM\u00d3SFERA (+CO\u2082e)<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Fuentes antropog\u00e9nicas -->\r\n        <rect x=\"100\" y=\"450\" width=\"180\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#333\" stroke=\"#ff4444\" stroke-width=\"4\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"190\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ff8888\">INDUSTRIA<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <rect x=\"410\" y=\"450\" width=\"180\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#333\" stroke=\"#ff4444\" stroke-width=\"4\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"500\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ff8888\">TRANSPORTE<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <rect x=\"720\" y=\"450\" width=\"180\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#333\" stroke=\"#ff4444\" stroke-width=\"4\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"810\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ff8888\">AGRICULTURA<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Flujos -->\r\n        <path d=\"M190 450 L190 150\" stroke=\"#ff4444\" stroke-width=\"8\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M500 450 L500 150\" stroke=\"#ff4444\" stroke-width=\"8\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M810 450 L810 150\" stroke=\"#ff4444\" stroke-width=\"8\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Secuestro -->\r\n        <circle cx=\"500\" cy=\"300\" r=\"80\" fill=\"#006400\" stroke=\"#00ff00\" stroke-width=\"6\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"500\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#ffffff\">BIO-SECUESTRO<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"500\" y=\"560\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#88ffff\">Emisiones \u2191 \u2192 Forzamiento radiativo \u2191<\/text>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    III. Simuladores Interactivos\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: C\u00e1lculo de Huella Personal (Alcances 1\u20133)<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Ajusta h\u00e1bitos para estimar tu huella anual.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"carbon-sim\">\r\n    <label>Vuelos internacionales\/a\u00f1o: <span id=\"vuelosVal\">1<\/span><\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"vuelos\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"1\">\r\n\r\n    <label>Consumo el\u00e9ctrico mensual (kWh): <span id=\"kwVal\">300<\/span><\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"kw\" min=\"100\" max=\"1000\" value=\"300\">\r\n\r\n    <label>Tipo de dieta:<\/label>\r\n    <select id=\"dieta\">\r\n        <option value=\"1.5\">Vegana<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"2.5\">Vegetariana<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"4.5\" selected>Mixta con carne<\/option>\r\n    <\/select>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"totalCarbon\">Huella: 0 t CO\u2082e\/a\u00f1o<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const vuelos = document.getElementById(\"vuelos\");\r\n    const kw = document.getElementById(\"kw\");\r\n    const dieta = document.getElementById(\"dieta\");\r\n    const vVal = document.getElementById(\"vuelosVal\");\r\n    const kVal = document.getElementById(\"kwVal\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"totalCarbon\");\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        const v = parseInt(vuelos.value);\r\n        const k = parseInt(kw.value);\r\n        const d = parseFloat(dieta.value);\r\n\r\n        vVal.textContent = v;\r\n        kVal.textContent = k;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Estimaci\u00f3n aproximada realista (toneladas CO\u2082e\/a\u00f1o)\r\n        const total = (v * 1.2) + (k * 12 * 0.00045) + d;\r\n\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>Huella estimada: ${total.toFixed(2)} t CO\u2082e\/a\u00f1o<\/strong><br>\r\n                            ${total < 4 ? \"\ud83d\udfe2 Bajo impacto\" : total < 8 ? \"\ud83d\udfe1 Moderado\" : \"\ud83d\udd34 Alto impacto\"}`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    vuelos.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    kw.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    dieta.addEventListener(\"change\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">An\u00e1lisis: Equivalencia de GEI (GWP)<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Calcula el impacto equivalente de diferentes gases.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"carbon-sim\">\r\n    <label>Gas:<\/label>\r\n    <select id=\"gasType\">\r\n        <option value=\"1\">CO\u2082<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"28\">CH\u2084 (metano)<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"265\">N\u2082O (\u00f3xido nitroso)<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"23500\">SF\u2086<\/option>\r\n    <\/select>\r\n\r\n    <label>Cantidad (kg): <input type=\"number\" id=\"gasAmount\" value=\"1\" min=\"0.1\"><\/label>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"gwpResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const type = document.getElementById(\"gasType\");\r\n    const amount = document.getElementById(\"gasAmount\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"gwpResult\");\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        const gwp = parseInt(type.value);\r\n        const qty = parseFloat(amount.value) || 0;\r\n\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>Equivalente:<\/strong> ${ (qty * gwp).toFixed(2) } kg CO\u2082e`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    type.addEventListener(\"change\", update);\r\n    amount.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Quiz Autoevaluado: Huella de Carbono<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>1. El Alcance 3 incluye:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,true)\">Emisiones en cadena de valor<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,false)\">Solo combusti\u00f3n directa<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb1\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>2. El GWP del metano es \u2248:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,true)\">28<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,false)\">1<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb2\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>3. Principal fuente Alcance 3 en productos:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,true)\">Proveedores y uso<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,false)\">Electricidad<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb3\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>4. Net Zero significa:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(4,true)\">Balance emisiones-secuestro<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(4,false)\">Cero emisiones absolutas<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb4\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"quizScore\" class=\"score-display\">Puntuaci\u00f3n: 0\/4<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nlet score = 0;\r\nconst total = 4;\r\nfunction checkQuiz(q, correct){\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById(\"fb\" + q);\r\n    if (correct){\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u2705 Correcto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#00e676\";\r\n        score++;\r\n    } else {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u274c Incorrecto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#ff1744\";\r\n    }\r\n    document.getElementById(\"quizScore\").textContent = \"Puntuaci\u00f3n: \" + score + \"\/\" + total;\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    IV. Errores Comunes del Estudiante\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"errors-interactive\">\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err1\" onchange=\"toggleError(1)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err1\">Ignorar Alcance 3.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp1\">Representa mayor\u00eda de emisiones en muchos sectores.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err2\" onchange=\"toggleError(2)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err2\">Confundir Net Zero con cero emisiones.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp2\">Net Zero permite compensaci\u00f3n\/secuestro.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err3\" onchange=\"toggleError(3)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err3\">Subestimar GWP de metano y N\u2082O.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp3\">Son mucho m\u00e1s potentes que CO\u2082 a corto plazo.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction toggleError(n){\r\n    const exp = document.getElementById(\"exp\" + n);\r\n    exp.style.display = document.getElementById(\"err\" + n).checked ? \"block\" : \"none\";\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    V. Conexi\u00f3n con el Curr\u00edculo de Ecosistemas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Tema clave en \"Cambio global\" y \"Servicios ecosist\u00e9micos\" en Ciencias Ambientales. Relacionado con ciclos biogeoqu\u00edmicos, resiliencia y sostenibilidad. Evaluado en an\u00e1lisis de impacto y pol\u00edticas clim\u00e1ticas.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VI. Problemas Tipo Examen\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ol class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n    <li>Calcula CO\u2082e de 100 kg CH\u2084 liberados. Interpreta su impacto.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Explica por qu\u00e9 Alcance 3 domina en industrias de consumo.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Compara huella de dieta vegana vs carn\u00edvora.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Analiza limitaciones de compensaci\u00f3n por reforestaci\u00f3n.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Justifica prioridad en reducir metano para mitigaci\u00f3n r\u00e1pida.<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VII. Reflexi\u00f3n Metacognitiva\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"reflection-list\">\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 aspectos de tu vida diaria contribuyen m\u00e1s a tu huella y c\u00f3mo reducirlos?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es cr\u00edtico considerar Alcance 3 en pol\u00edticas clim\u00e1ticas?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategia usar\u00e1s para evaluar huella en an\u00e1lisis ambientales?<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">\r\n    La huella de carbono revela nuestra responsabilidad compartida. Mitigarla requiere acci\u00f3n sist\u00e9mica y personal hacia un futuro sostenible.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"neon-quote\">\r\n    \u201cNo heredamos la Tierra de nuestros ancestros; la tomamos prestada de nuestros hijos.\u201d\r\n<\/blockquote>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"Huella de carbono mide...","opciones":["Agua","GEI en CO\u2082e","Basura","Ruido"],"correcta":"GEI en CO\u2082e"},{"pregunta":"Principal GEI","opciones":["O\u2082","CO\u2082","N\u2082","H\u2082O"],"correcta":"CO\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Unidad de huella","opciones":["kg","t CO\u2082e","m\u00b3","kWh"],"correcta":"t CO\u2082e"},{"pregunta":"Alcance 1 es...","opciones":["Electricidad","Emisiones directas","Alimentos","Viajes"],"correcta":"Emisiones directas"},{"pregunta":"GWP del CO\u2082","opciones":["1","25","298","23500"],"correcta":"1"},{"pregunta":"CH\u2084 tiene GWP \u2248","opciones":["1","34","100","1000"],"correcta":"34"},{"pregunta":"Reducir con...","opciones":["M\u00e1s aviones","Energ\u00eda solar","Carb\u00f3n","Pl\u00e1stico"],"correcta":"Energ\u00eda solar"},{"pregunta":"Secuestra CO\u2082","opciones":["Auto","\u00c1rbol","F\u00e1brica","Avi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"\u00c1rbol"},{"pregunta":"Huella promedio global","opciones":["1 t","4.7 t","10 t","20 t"],"correcta":"4.7 t"},{"pregunta":"Neutralidad es...","opciones":["Cero emisiones","Emisiones = Secuestro","Solo renovables","Nada"],"correcta":"Emisiones = Secuestro"},{"pregunta":"Alcance 3 incluye...","opciones":["Electricidad","Cadena de suministro","Combusti\u00f3n","Calefacci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Cadena de suministro"},{"pregunta":"Mayor fuente global","opciones":["Transporte","Energ\u00eda","Agricultura","Residuos"],"correcta":"Energ\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"1 ha de bosque secuestra \u2248","opciones":["1 t","5 t","20 t","100 t"],"correcta":"5 t"},{"pregunta":"IPCC define...","opciones":["GWP","PIB","IDH","GPS"],"correcta":"GWP"},{"pregunta":"Huella de un vuelo transatl\u00e1ntico","opciones":["0.1 t","1.2 t","5 t","10 t"],"correcta":"1.2 t"},{"pregunta":"CCS significa...","opciones":["Carbon Capture Storage","Clean Coal System","Climate Control","Nada"],"correcta":"Carbon Capture Storage"},{"pregunta":"Vaca emite CH\u2084 por...","opciones":["Respiraci\u00f3n","Digesti\u00f3n","Orina","Piel"],"correcta":"Digesti\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Huella de carne vs vegetal","opciones":["Igual","Carne > vegetal","Vegetal > carne","Cero"],"correcta":"Carne > vegetal"},{"pregunta":"Objetivo Par\u00eds 2050","opciones":["+2\u00b0C","Net Zero","+1.5\u00b0C","Nada"],"correcta":"Net Zero"},{"pregunta":"Huella de Espa\u00f1a \u2248","opciones":["3 t","6\u20137 t","12 t","20 t"],"correcta":"6\u20137 t"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula CO\u2082e","opciones":["m \u00d7 GWP","m \/ GWP","GWP \/ m","m + GWP"],"correcta":"m \u00d7 GWP"},{"pregunta":"GWP SF\u2086 \u2248","opciones":["1","34","298","23500"],"correcta":"23500"},{"pregunta":"Mayor emisor per c\u00e1pita","opciones":["China","EE.UU.","India","Brasil"],"correcta":"EE.UU."},{"pregunta":"Emisiones globales 2023 \u2248","opciones":["10 Gt","37 Gt","50 Gt","100 Gt"],"correcta":"37 Gt"},{"pregunta":"Presupuesto carbono +1.5\u00b0C \u2248","opciones":["100 Gt","420 Gt","1000 Gt","2000 Gt"],"correcta":"420 Gt"},{"pregunta":"Secuestro oc\u00e9ano \u2248","opciones":["1 Gt\/a\u00f1o","10 Gt\/a\u00f1o","20 Gt\/a\u00f1o","50 Gt\/a\u00f1o"],"correcta":"10 Gt\/a\u00f1o"},{"pregunta":"Huella de 1 kWh carb\u00f3n \u2248","opciones":["0.1 kg","0.9 kg","2 kg","5 kg"],"correcta":"0.9 kg"},{"pregunta":"Huella de 1 kWh solar \u2248","opciones":["0 kg","0.05 kg","0.5 kg","1 kg"],"correcta":"0.05 kg"},{"pregunta":"Meta UE 2030","opciones":["-20%","-55%","-80%","Net Zero"],"correcta":"-55%"},{"pregunta":"Huella alimentaria promedio","opciones":["10%","25%","50%","75%"],"correcta":"25%"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"cambio-climatico-master","titulo":"Cambio Clim\u00e1tico: Desequilibrio Termodin\u00e1mico y Retroalimentaciones Globales","contenido":"<p class=\"intro\">\r\n    El cambio clim\u00e1tico antropog\u00e9nico es una alteraci\u00f3n del balance radiativo terrestre por acumulaci\u00f3n de gases de efecto invernadero (GEI). Reduce la escape de radiaci\u00f3n infrarroja, generando forzamiento positivo que eleva la temperatura global. Sus impactos incluyen acidificaci\u00f3n oce\u00e1nica, puntos de no retorno (tipping points) y p\u00e9rdida de servicios ecosist\u00e9micos. Comprender sus mecanismos es esencial para evaluar riesgos y dise\u00f1ar estrategias de adaptaci\u00f3n\/mitigaci\u00f3n.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"formula-neon text-center\">\r\n    Forzamiento radiativo (\u0394F):<br>\r\n    \\[ \\Delta F = 5.35 \\ln\\left(\\frac{C}{C_0}\\right) \\] W\/m\u00b2 (para CO\u2082)\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    I. Indicadores Clave del Cambio Clim\u00e1tico (2025)\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Indicador<\/th>\r\n            <th>Valor actual<\/th>\r\n            <th>Preindustrial<\/th>\r\n            <th>L\u00edmite seguro<\/th>\r\n            <th>Tendencia<\/th>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr><td>CO\u2082 atmosf\u00e9rico<\/td><td>~425 ppm<\/td><td>280 ppm<\/td><td>350 ppm<\/td><td>\u2191 Acelerada<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Anomal\u00eda t\u00e9rmica<\/td><td>+1.25 \u00b0C<\/td><td>0 \u00b0C<\/td><td>+1.5 \u00b0C<\/td><td>\u2191 Cr\u00edtica<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>pH oce\u00e1nico<\/td><td>~8.05<\/td><td>8.2<\/td><td>\u2014<\/td><td>\u2193 Acidificaci\u00f3n<\/td><\/tr>\r\n    <\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n    <strong>Retroalimentaciones:<\/strong> Negativas (estabilizan); positivas (amplifican). Ejemplos positivos: derretimiento permafrost (CH\u2084), p\u00e9rdida hielo \u00c1rtico (albedo).\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    II. Forzamiento Radiativo y Retroalimentaciones\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Diagrama del balance energ\u00e9tico alterado.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <svg class=\"climate-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 600\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow-cyan\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#00ffff\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n\r\n        <rect width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" fill=\"#050510\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"500\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"42\" fill=\"#00ffff\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">FORZAMIENTO RADIACTIVO ANTROPOG\u00c9NICO<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Sol -->\r\n        <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"60\" fill=\"#fff700\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"100\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Radiaci\u00f3n solar entrante<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Tierra -->\r\n        <circle cx=\"500\" cy=\"500\" r=\"100\" fill=\"#1a3a5a\" stroke=\"#00ccff\" stroke-width=\"4\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"500\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#ffffff\">TIERRA<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Atm\u00f3sfera con GEI -->\r\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1000\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#ff4444\" opacity=\"0.2\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"500\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ff8888\">CAPA GEI (CALOR ATRAPADO)<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Flujos -->\r\n        <path d=\"M160 100 L450 400\" stroke=\"#fff700\" stroke-width=\"10\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M550 400 L850 100\" stroke=\"#87CEEB\" stroke-width=\"8\" opacity=\"0.6\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M500 400 L500 200\" stroke=\"#ff3333\" stroke-width=\"12\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"500\" y=\"560\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#88ffff\">+ Forzamiento \u2192 + Temperatura<\/text>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    III. Simuladores Interactivos\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: Activaci\u00f3n de Puntos de No Retorno<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Aumenta la temperatura global y observa activaci\u00f3n de retroalimentaciones irreversibles.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"climate-sim\">\r\n    <label>Anomal\u00eda t\u00e9rmica (\u00b0C): <span id=\"tempVal\">1.2<\/span><\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"tempSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1.2\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"tippingResult\">\r\n        <div>Puntos cr\u00edticos:<\/div>\r\n        <div id=\"coralStatus\">Corales: Riesgo moderado<\/div>\r\n        <div id=\"permafrostStatus\">Permafrost: Estable<\/div>\r\n        <div id=\"amocStatus\">AMOC: Funcional<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const slider = document.getElementById(\"tempSlider\");\r\n    const val = document.getElementById(\"tempVal\");\r\n    const coral = document.getElementById(\"coralStatus\");\r\n    const permafrost = document.getElementById(\"permafrostStatus\");\r\n    const amoc = document.getElementById(\"amocStatus\");\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        const t = parseFloat(slider.value);\r\n        val.textContent = t.toFixed(1);\r\n\r\n        coral.textContent = t >= 1.5 ? \"Corales: Colapso masivo (blanqueamiento irreversible)\" : \"Corales: Riesgo creciente\";\r\n        permafrost.textContent = t >= 2.0 ? \"Permafrost: Liberaci\u00f3n masiva CH\u2084 (retroalimentaci\u00f3n fuerte)\" : \"Permafrost: Derretimiento parcial\";\r\n        amoc.textContent = t >= 3.5 ? \"AMOC: Colapso probable (cambio circulaci\u00f3n)\" : \"AMOC: Debilitamiento\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    slider.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">An\u00e1lisis: Proyecci\u00f3n hacia Net Zero<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Ajusta pol\u00edticas para evaluar trayectoria emisora.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"climate-sim\">\r\n    <label>Transici\u00f3n renovables (%): <span id=\"renVal\">30<\/span><\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"renSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"30\">\r\n\r\n    <label>Precio carbono ($\/t): <span id=\"taxVal\">50<\/span><\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"taxSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"200\" value=\"50\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"netzeroResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const ren = document.getElementById(\"renSlider\");\r\n    const tax = document.getElementById(\"taxSlider\");\r\n    const renVal = document.getElementById(\"renVal\");\r\n    const taxVal = document.getElementById(\"taxVal\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"netzeroResult\");\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        const r = parseInt(ren.value);\r\n        const t = parseInt(tax.value);\r\n        renVal.textContent = r;\r\n        taxVal.textContent = t;\r\n\r\n        const emissions = 40 * (1 - (r\/100 * 0.6 + t\/200 * 0.4));\r\n        let scenario = \"\";\r\n\r\n        if (emissions < 10) scenario = \"Compatible 1.5\u00b0C (Acuerdo Par\u00eds)\";\r\n        else if (emissions < 25) scenario = \"Riesgo 2\u20132.5\u00b0C\";\r\n        else scenario = \"Catastr\u00f3fico >3\u00b0C\";\r\n\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>Emisiones 2050: ${emissions.toFixed(1)} Gt CO\u2082<\/strong><br>${scenario}`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    ren.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    tax.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Quiz Autoevaluado: Cambio Clim\u00e1tico<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>1. Principal forzamiento antropog\u00e9nico:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,true)\">Acumulaci\u00f3n GEI<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,false)\">Variaci\u00f3n solar<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb1\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>2. Retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva clave:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,true)\">Liberaci\u00f3n metano permafrost<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,false)\">Aumento nubosidad<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb2\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>3. Meta Net Zero implica:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,true)\">Balance emisiones-secuestro<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,false)\">Cero emisiones directas<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb3\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>4. Acidificaci\u00f3n oce\u00e1nica causa:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(4,true)\">Disoluci\u00f3n carbonatos (corales)<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(4,false)\">Mayor fotos\u00edntesis<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb4\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"quizScore\" class=\"score-display\">Puntuaci\u00f3n: 0\/4<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nlet score = 0;\r\nconst total = 4;\r\nfunction checkQuiz(q, correct){\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById(\"fb\" + q);\r\n    if (correct){\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u2705 Correcto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#00e676\";\r\n        score++;\r\n    } else {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u274c Incorrecto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#ff1744\";\r\n    }\r\n    document.getElementById(\"quizScore\").textContent = \"Puntuaci\u00f3n: \" + score + \"\/\" + total;\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    IV. Errores Comunes del Estudiante\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"errors-interactive\">\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err1\" onchange=\"toggleError(1)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err1\">Atribuir cambio clim\u00e1tico solo a causas naturales.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp1\">Forzamiento antropog\u00e9nico domina desde 1950.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err2\" onchange=\"toggleError(2)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err2\">Subestimar retroalimentaciones positivas.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp2\">Pueden acelerar calentamiento m\u00e1s all\u00e1 de proyecciones lineales.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err3\" onchange=\"toggleError(3)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err3\">Creer que Net Zero = cero emisiones.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp3\">Permite emisiones residuales compensadas.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction toggleError(n){\r\n    const exp = document.getElementById(\"exp\" + n);\r\n    exp.style.display = document.getElementById(\"err\" + n).checked ? \"block\" : \"none\";\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    V. Conexi\u00f3n con el Curr\u00edculo de Ecosistemas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Tema central en \"Cambio global y resiliencia\" en Ecolog\u00eda y Ciencias Ambientales. Relacionado con forzamiento radiativo, puntos de inflexi\u00f3n y servicios ecosist\u00e9micos. Evaluado en an\u00e1lisis de escenarios IPCC y pol\u00edticas clim\u00e1ticas.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VI. Problemas Tipo Examen\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ol class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n    <li>Explica mecanismo de forzamiento radiativo por GEI.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Analiza retroalimentaci\u00f3n albedo en \u00c1rtico.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Describe riesgos de colapso AMOC.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Justifica urgencia de limitar calentamiento a 1.5\u00b0C.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Eval\u00faa rol de oc\u00e9anos en mitigaci\u00f3n clim\u00e1tica.<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VII. Reflexi\u00f3n Metacognitiva\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"reflection-list\">\r\n    <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo influyen retroalimentaciones en proyecciones clim\u00e1ticas?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 acciones personales\/institucionales consideras prioritarias?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategia usar\u00e1s para evaluar escenarios clim\u00e1ticos?<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">\r\n    El cambio clim\u00e1tico es el mayor desaf\u00edo sist\u00e9mico actual. Su comprensi\u00f3n exige pensamiento interdisciplinario y acci\u00f3n urgente.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"neon-quote\">\r\n    \u201cNo hay Planeta B.\u201d\r\n<\/blockquote>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"Cambio clim\u00e1tico causado por...","opciones":["Solo natural","Principalmente humano","Animales","Sol"],"correcta":"Principalmente humano"},{"pregunta":"CO\u2082 actual \u2248","opciones":["280 ppm","425 ppm","500 ppm","1000 ppm"],"correcta":"425 ppm"},{"pregunta":"Aumento temperatura 2025","opciones":["+0.5\u00b0C","+1.2\u00b0C","+2\u00b0C","+3\u00b0C"],"correcta":"+1.2\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Principal GEI","opciones":["O\u2082","CO\u2082","N\u2082","CH\u2084"],"correcta":"CO\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Efecto en oc\u00e9anos","opciones":["M\u00e1s fr\u00edos","Acidificaci\u00f3n","Menos sal","Nada"],"correcta":"Acidificaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Blanqueo de coral por...","opciones":["Fr\u00edo","Calor","Luz","Oscuridad"],"correcta":"Calor"},{"pregunta":"Acuerdo de Par\u00eds busca...","opciones":["+2\u00b0C","<2\u00b0C, ideal 1.5\u00b0C","+1.5\u00b0C","Nada"],"correcta":"<2\u00b0C, ideal 1.5\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"IPCC es...","opciones":["ONU clima","Panel cient\u00edfico","ONG","Empresa"],"correcta":"Panel cient\u00edfico"},{"pregunta":"Permafrost libera...","opciones":["CO\u2082","CH\u2084","O\u2082","N\u2082"],"correcta":"CH\u2084"},{"pregunta":"Nivel del mar subi\u00f3...","opciones":["10 cm","25 cm","50 cm","1 m"],"correcta":"25 cm"},{"pregunta":"Tipping point Amazon\u00eda:","opciones":["20% deforestaci\u00f3n","40%","60%","80%"],"correcta":"40%"},{"pregunta":"AMOC es...","opciones":["Corriente Pac\u00edfico","Circulaci\u00f3n Atl\u00e1ntica","Viento","Lluvia"],"correcta":"Circulaci\u00f3n Atl\u00e1ntica"},{"pregunta":"Presupuesto carbono +1.5\u00b0C \u2248","opciones":["100 Gt","420 Gt","1000 Gt","2000 Gt"],"correcta":"420 Gt"},{"pregunta":"Emisiones globales 2023 \u2248","opciones":["20 Gt","37 Gt","50 Gt","100 Gt"],"correcta":"37 Gt"},{"pregunta":"Mitigaci\u00f3n incluye...","opciones":["CCS","M\u00e1s carb\u00f3n","Deforestaci\u00f3n","Aviones"],"correcta":"CCS"},{"pregunta":"Adaptaci\u00f3n es...","opciones":["Reducir emisiones","Vivir con cambio","Ignorar","Negar"],"correcta":"Vivir con cambio"},{"pregunta":"Ecosistema m\u00e1s vulnerable:","opciones":["Desierto","Arrecife coral","Pradera","Tundra"],"correcta":"Arrecife coral"},{"pregunta":"Forzamiento radiativo CO\u2082 duplicado:","opciones":["1 W\/m\u00b2","3.7 W\/m\u00b2","5.35 W\/m\u00b2","10 W\/m\u00b2"],"correcta":"3.7 W\/m\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"Meta Net Zero:","opciones":["2030","2050","2100","Nunca"],"correcta":"2050"},{"pregunta":"Hielo \u00c1rtico pierde...","opciones":["-5%\/d\u00e9cada","-13%\/d\u00e9cada","-20%\/d\u00e9cada","+10%"],"correcta":"-13%\/d\u00e9cada"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula forzamiento CO\u2082:","opciones":["\u0394F = 5.35 ln(C\/C\u2080)","\u0394F = C\u00b2","\u0394F = 10 \u00d7 C","\u0394F = 1\/C"],"correcta":"\u0394F = 5.35 ln(C\/C\u2080)"},{"pregunta":"Sensibilidad clim\u00e1tica \u2248","opciones":["1\u00b0C","3\u00b0C por duplicaci\u00f3n CO\u2082","5\u00b0C","10\u00b0C"],"correcta":"3\u00b0C por duplicaci\u00f3n CO\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Escenario RCP8.5 es...","opciones":["Bajo","Alto (sin acci\u00f3n)","Medio","Net Zero"],"correcta":"Alto (sin acci\u00f3n)"},{"pregunta":"Escenario SSP1-1.9 logra...","opciones":["+1.5\u00b0C","+2\u00b0C","+3\u00b0C","+4\u00b0C"],"correcta":"+1.5\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Feedback albedo \u00c1rtico:","opciones":["Negativo","Positivo","Neutra","Cero"],"correcta":"Positivo"},{"pregunta":"Acidificaci\u00f3n reduce...","opciones":["pH oc\u00e9ano","Salinidad","Ox\u00edgeno","Luz"],"correcta":"pH oc\u00e9ano"},{"pregunta":"Corales mueren a...","opciones":["25\u00b0C","30\u00b0C","35\u00b0C","40\u00b0C"],"correcta":"30\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Meta UE 2030:","opciones":["-40%","-55%","-80%","Net Zero"],"correcta":"-55%"},{"pregunta":"CH\u2084 liberado permafrost \u2248","opciones":["10 Gt","200 Gt","1000 Gt","1 Gt"],"correcta":"200 Gt"},{"pregunta":"IPCC AR6 (2021) dice...","opciones":["Cambio natural","Humano inequ\u00edvoco","No hay cambio","Ciclo normal"],"correcta":"Humano inequ\u00edvoco"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"variabilidad-climatica-master","titulo":"Variabilidad Clim\u00e1tica: Oscilaciones Naturales y Teleconexiones Globales","contenido":"<p class=\"intro\">\r\n    La <strong>variabilidad clim\u00e1tica<\/strong> describe las oscilaciones internas del sistema clim\u00e1tico Tierra en escalas temporales de meses a d\u00e9cadas. A diferencia del cambio clim\u00e1tico antropog\u00e9nico (tendencia unidireccional), estas oscilaciones son c\u00edclicas y generan patrones de teleconexi\u00f3n que afectan ecosistemas distantes. Comprenderlas es clave para distinguir se\u00f1al antropog\u00e9nica de ruido natural y predecir impactos regionales.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"formula-neon text-center\">\r\n    Temperatura observada:<br>\r\n    \\[ T_{obs}(t) = T_{tendencia} + \\sum A_i \\sin(\\omega_i t + \\phi_i) + \\epsilon \\]\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    I. Principales Modos de Variabilidad Clim\u00e1tica\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Modo<\/th>\r\n            <th>Regi\u00f3n principal<\/th>\r\n            <th>Per\u00edodo<\/th>\r\n            <th>\u00cdndice<\/th>\r\n            <th>Teleconexiones clave<\/th>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>ENSO (El Ni\u00f1o\/La Ni\u00f1a)<\/td>\r\n            <td>Pac\u00edfico ecuatorial<\/td>\r\n            <td>2\u20137 a\u00f1os<\/td>\r\n            <td>ONI<\/td>\r\n            <td>Sequ\u00edas\/inundaciones globales<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>NAO<\/td>\r\n            <td>Atl\u00e1ntico Norte<\/td>\r\n            <td>Mensual\u2013decadal<\/td>\r\n            <td>Diferencia presi\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n            <td>Inviernos Europa\/Oeste<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>PDO<\/td>\r\n            <td>Pac\u00edfico Norte<\/td>\r\n            <td>20\u201330 a\u00f1os<\/td>\r\n            <td>Patr\u00f3n TSM<\/td>\r\n            <td>Productividad pesquera<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>MJO<\/td>\r\n            <td>Global tropical<\/td>\r\n            <td>30\u201360 d\u00edas<\/td>\r\n            <td>RMM<\/td>\r\n            <td>Precipitaci\u00f3n monz\u00f3nica<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n    <strong>Teleconexi\u00f3n:<\/strong> Correlaci\u00f3n estad\u00edstica entre variables clim\u00e1ticas en regiones distantes, mediada por ondas atmosf\u00e9ricas (Rossby).\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    II. Din\u00e1mica del ENSO: Transici\u00f3n La Ni\u00f1a \u2192 El Ni\u00f1o\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Animaci\u00f3n simplificada del acoplamiento oc\u00e9ano-atm\u00f3sfera.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <svg class=\"variability-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow-cyan\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#00ffff\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n\r\n        <rect width=\"800\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#001a33\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Termoclina -->\r\n        <path id=\"thermocline\" d=\"M0 200 Q400 200 800 250\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"d\" \r\n                     values=\"M0 200 Q400 200 800 250;M0 250 Q400 250 800 250;M0 280 Q400 200 800 200;M0 250 Q400 250 800 250;M0 200 Q400 200 800 250\" \r\n                     dur=\"12s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/path>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Convecci\u00f3n -->\r\n        <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"100\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.3\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"cx\" values=\"200;600;200\" dur=\"12s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/circle>\r\n        <text x=\"400\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#00ffff\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">CONVECCI\u00d3N (PRECIPITACI\u00d3N)<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Vientos alisios -->\r\n        <path d=\"M700 150 L100 150\" stroke=\"#ffcc00\" stroke-width=\"6\" opacity=\"0.7\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.3;1\" dur=\"12s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/path>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"400\" y=\"360\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#88ffff\">TRANSICI\u00d3N LA NI\u00d1A \u2192 EL NI\u00d1O<\/text>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    III. Simuladores Interactivos\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: Teleconexiones de Modos Oscilatorios<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Selecciona modo y fase para ver impactos ecosist\u00e9micos globales.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"variability-sim\">\r\n    <label>Modo oscilatorio:<\/label>\r\n    <select id=\"modeSelect\">\r\n        <option value=\"elnino\">ENSO: El Ni\u00f1o<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"lanina\">ENSO: La Ni\u00f1a<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"naopos\">NAO: Positiva<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"naoneg\">NAO: Negativa<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"pdopos\">PDO: Positiva<\/option>\r\n    <\/select>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"teleconnResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const select = document.getElementById(\"modeSelect\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"teleconnResult\");\r\n\r\n    const impacts = {\r\n        elnino: \"\ud83c\udf27\ufe0f Sequ\u00edas Amazon\u00eda y Australia \u2022 Inundaciones EE.UU. sur \u2022 Colapso pesquer\u00edas Per\u00fa\",\r\n        lanina: \"\ud83d\udd25 Sequ\u00edas Argentina \u2022 Lluvias intensas Indonesia \u2022 Upwelling fuerte Pac\u00edfico Este\",\r\n        naopos: \"\u2744\ufe0f Inviernos suaves Europa Norte \u2022 Sequ\u00edas Mediterr\u00e1neo \u2022 Huracanes Atl\u00e1ntico d\u00e9biles\",\r\n        naoneg: \"\ud83e\udd76 Inviernos fr\u00edos Europa \u2022 Precipitaci\u00f3n Mediterr\u00e1neo \u2022 Mayor actividad cicl\u00f3nica\",\r\n        pdopos: \"\ud83c\udf0a Temperaturas c\u00e1lidas Pac\u00edfico Norte \u2022 Sequ\u00edas EE.UU. oeste \u2022 Mayor productividad salm\u00f3n Alaska\"\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>Teleconexiones:<\/strong><br>${impacts[select.value]}`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    select.addEventListener(\"change\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">An\u00e1lisis: Clasificaci\u00f3n de Eventos ENSO (\u00cdndice ONI)<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Ajusta anomal\u00eda de TSM en regi\u00f3n Ni\u00f1o 3.4.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"variability-sim\">\r\n    <label>Anomal\u00eda TSM (\u00b0C): <span id=\"oniVal\">0.0<\/span><\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"oniSlider\" min=\"-3\" max=\"3\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"oniResult\">NEUTRO<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const slider = document.getElementById(\"oniSlider\");\r\n    const val = document.getElementById(\"oniVal\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"oniResult\");\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        const v = parseFloat(slider.value);\r\n        val.textContent = (v >= 0 ? \"+\" : \"\") + v.toFixed(1);\r\n\r\n        if (v >= 2.0) result.innerHTML = \"<strong>EL NI\u00d1O MUY FUERTE<\/strong>\";\r\n        else if (v >= 1.5) result.innerHTML = \"<strong>EL NI\u00d1O FUERTE<\/strong>\";\r\n        else if (v >= 0.5) result.innerHTML = \"<strong>EL NI\u00d1O D\u00c9BIL<\/strong>\";\r\n        else if (v <= -2.0) result.innerHTML = \"<strong>LA NI\u00d1A MUY FUERTE<\/strong>\";\r\n        else if (v <= -1.5) result.innerHTML = \"<strong>LA NI\u00d1A FUERTE<\/strong>\";\r\n        else if (v <= -0.5) result.innerHTML = \"<strong>LA NI\u00d1A D\u00c9BIL<\/strong>\";\r\n        else result.innerHTML = \"<strong>NEUTRO<\/strong>\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    slider.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Quiz Autoevaluado: Variabilidad Clim\u00e1tica<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>1. ENSO afecta principalmente:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,true)\">Pac\u00edfico ecuatorial<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,false)\">Atl\u00e1ntico Norte<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb1\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>2. En El Ni\u00f1o, termoclina en Pac\u00edfico Este:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,true)\">Se profundiza<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,false)\">Se eleva<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb2\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>3. NAO positiva implica:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,true)\">Inviernos suaves Europa Norte<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,false)\">Inviernos fr\u00edos generalizados<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb3\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>4. PDO tiene per\u00edodo \u2248:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(4,true)\">20\u201330 a\u00f1os<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(4,false)\">2\u20137 a\u00f1os<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb4\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"quizScore\" class=\"score-display\">Puntuaci\u00f3n: 0\/4<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nlet score = 0;\r\nconst total = 4;\r\nfunction checkQuiz(q, correct){\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById(\"fb\" + q);\r\n    if (correct){\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u2705 Correcto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#00e676\";\r\n        score++;\r\n    } else {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u274c Incorrecto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#ff1744\";\r\n    }\r\n    document.getElementById(\"quizScore\").textContent = \"Puntuaci\u00f3n: \" + score + \"\/\" + total;\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    IV. Errores Comunes del Estudiante\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"errors-interactive\">\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err1\" onchange=\"toggleError(1)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err1\">Confundir variabilidad con cambio clim\u00e1tico.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp1\">Variabilidad es oscilatoria; cambio es tendencia.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err2\" onchange=\"toggleError(2)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err2\">Atribuir todos eventos extremos a cambio clim\u00e1tico.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp2\">Muchos son modulados por ENSO\/NAO.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err3\" onchange=\"toggleError(3)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err3\">Ignorar teleconexiones.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp3\">Eventos locales tienen impactos globales.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction toggleError(n){\r\n    const exp = document.getElementById(\"exp\" + n);\r\n    exp.style.display = document.getElementById(\"err\" + n).checked ? \"block\" : \"none\";\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    V. Conexi\u00f3n con el Curr\u00edculo de Ecosistemas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Tema avanzado en \"Clima y ecosistemas\" y \"Din\u00e1mica global\". Relacionado con teleconexiones, productividad y resiliencia. Evaluado en an\u00e1lisis de series temporales y predicci\u00f3n regional.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VI. Problemas Tipo Examen\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ol class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n    <li>Explica mecanismo de teleconexi\u00f3n ENSO \u2192 sequ\u00edas Amazon\u00eda.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Compara fases ENSO y sus impactos en pesquer\u00edas.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Analiza influencia NAO en ecosistemas europeos.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Justifica diferencia temporal entre ENSO y PDO.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Predice efecto de La Ni\u00f1a fuerte en monzones asi\u00e1ticos.<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VII. Reflexi\u00f3n Metacognitiva\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"reflection-list\">\r\n    <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo distingue variabilidad natural de se\u00f1al antropog\u00e9nica?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 regiones son m\u00e1s vulnerables a oscilaciones y por qu\u00e9?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategia usar\u00e1s para interpretar patrones clim\u00e1ticos complejos?<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">\r\n    La variabilidad clim\u00e1tica a\u00f1ade complejidad al cambio global. Dominarla permite predicciones m\u00e1s precisas y estrategias adaptativas robustas.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"neon-quote\">\r\n    \u201cEl clima oscila; el cambio clim\u00e1tico altera la oscilaci\u00f3n.\u201d\r\n<\/blockquote>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"Variabilidad clim\u00e1tica es...","opciones":["Largo plazo","Corto\/medio plazo","Constante","Humana"],"correcta":"Corto\/medio plazo"},{"pregunta":"ENSO significa...","opciones":["El Ni\u00f1o Southern Oscillation","Eastern North Sea","Energy North South","Nada"],"correcta":"El Ni\u00f1o Southern Oscillation"},{"pregunta":"El Ni\u00f1o causa...","opciones":["Enfriamiento global","Calentamiento Pac\u00edfico E.","Fr\u00edo en Per\u00fa","Lluvia en Australia"],"correcta":"Calentamiento Pac\u00edfico E."},{"pregunta":"La Ni\u00f1a es...","opciones":["Calentamiento","Enfriamiento Pac\u00edfico","Neutral","Solar"],"correcta":"Enfriamiento Pac\u00edfico"},{"pregunta":"NAO afecta...","opciones":["Pac\u00edfico","Atl\u00e1ntico Norte","\u00c1rtico","Ant\u00e1rtida"],"correcta":"Atl\u00e1ntico Norte"},{"pregunta":"PDO tiene ciclo de...","opciones":["2\u20137 a\u00f1os","20\u201330 a\u00f1os","60\u201380 a\u00f1os","100 a\u00f1os"],"correcta":"20\u201330 a\u00f1os"},{"pregunta":"El Ni\u00f1o trae sequ\u00edas a...","opciones":["Per\u00fa","Australia","California","Europa"],"correcta":"Australia"},{"pregunta":"SOI mide...","opciones":["Temperatura","Presi\u00f3n atmosf\u00e9rica","Humedad","Viento"],"correcta":"Presi\u00f3n atmosf\u00e9rica"},{"pregunta":"Variabilidad es...","opciones":["Antropog\u00e9nica","Natural","Ambas","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Natural"},{"pregunta":"Cambio clim\u00e1tico es...","opciones":["Natural","Principalmente humano","Corto plazo","Oscilante"],"correcta":"Principalmente humano"},{"pregunta":"ONI > +0.5\u00b0C indica...","opciones":["La Ni\u00f1a","El Ni\u00f1o","Neutral","PDO"],"correcta":"El Ni\u00f1o"},{"pregunta":"NAO+ en invierno \u2192 Europa...","opciones":["Fr\u00eda y seca","C\u00e1lida y h\u00fameda","Igual","Tormentas"],"correcta":"C\u00e1lida y h\u00fameda"},{"pregunta":"PDO+ afecta...","opciones":["Salm\u00f3n Alaska","Huracanes Caribe","Lluvia India","Niebla Londres"],"correcta":"Salm\u00f3n Alaska"},{"pregunta":"Teleconexi\u00f3n es...","opciones":["Conexi\u00f3n local","Influencia lejana","Ciclo solar","Viento"],"correcta":"Influencia lejana"},{"pregunta":"IRI pronostica...","opciones":["Clima local","ENSO global","Volcanes","Terremotos"],"correcta":"ENSO global"},{"pregunta":"QBO afecta...","opciones":["Estratosfera","Troposfera","Oc\u00e9ano","Suelo"],"correcta":"Estratosfera"},{"pregunta":"AMO+ aumenta...","opciones":["Huracanes Atl\u00e1ntico","Tormentas Pac\u00edfico","Sequ\u00edas Europa","Fr\u00edo \u00c1rtico"],"correcta":"Huracanes Atl\u00e1ntico"},{"pregunta":"ENSO 2023\u20132024 fue...","opciones":["La Ni\u00f1a","El Ni\u00f1o fuerte","Neutral","PDO"],"correcta":"El Ni\u00f1o fuerte"},{"pregunta":"Variabilidad sobre cambio es como...","opciones":["Tendencia","Ruido sobre se\u00f1al","Se\u00f1al sobre ruido","Ciclo"],"correcta":"Ruido sobre se\u00f1al"},{"pregunta":"SOI negativo indica...","opciones":["La Ni\u00f1a","El Ni\u00f1o","Neutral","NAO"],"correcta":"El Ni\u00f1o"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula ONI","opciones":["\u0394TSM > \u00b10.5\u00b0C \u00d7 3 meses","\u0394TSM > \u00b11\u00b0C","Presi\u00f3n","Viento"],"correcta":"\u0394TSM > \u00b10.5\u00b0C \u00d7 3 meses"},{"pregunta":"Regi\u00f3n Ni\u00f1o 3.4 es...","opciones":["5\u00b0N-5\u00b0S, 120\u00b0-170\u00b0W","Ecuador","Per\u00fa","Australia"],"correcta":"5\u00b0N-5\u00b0S, 120\u00b0-170\u00b0W"},{"pregunta":"Ciclo PDO \u2248","opciones":["7 a\u00f1os","25 a\u00f1os","60 a\u00f1os","100 a\u00f1os"],"correcta":"25 a\u00f1os"},{"pregunta":"ENSO modula monz\u00f3n...","opciones":["Africano","Indio","Australiano","Europeo"],"correcta":"Indio"},{"pregunta":"NAO correlaciona con...","opciones":["Azores y Islandia","Tahit\u00ed y Darwin","Alaska y Jap\u00f3n","Brasil y \u00c1frica"],"correcta":"Azores y Islandia"},{"pregunta":"MJO es...","opciones":["Oscilaci\u00f3n Madden-Julian","Monz\u00f3n","Jet Stream","Corriente"],"correcta":"Oscilaci\u00f3n Madden-Julian"},{"pregunta":"ENSO afecta cosechas de...","opciones":["Trigo Australia","Arroz Europa","Ma\u00edz \u00c1frica","Caf\u00e9 Brasil"],"correcta":"Trigo Australia"},{"pregunta":"Pron\u00f3stico ENSO usa modelos...","opciones":["Estad\u00edsticos","Din\u00e1micos","Ambos","Ninguno"],"correcta":"Ambos"},{"pregunta":"ENSO 1997\u20131998 fue...","opciones":["El m\u00e1s fuerte registrado","La Ni\u00f1a","Neutral","PDO"],"correcta":"El m\u00e1s fuerte registrado"},{"pregunta":"Variabilidad decadal explica...","opciones":["Pausa 2000\u20132013","Calentamiento total","CO\u2082","Sol"],"correcta":"Pausa 2000\u20132013"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"huella-hidrica-master","titulo":"Huella H\u00eddrica: Azul, Verde, Gris y Estrategias de Mitigaci\u00f3n","contenido":"<p class=\"formula-neon text-center\">\r\n    Huella h\u00eddrica gris:<br>\r\n    \\[ HH_{gris} = \\frac{L}{C_{m\u00e1x} - C_{nat}} \\]\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    I. Componentes de la Huella H\u00eddrica\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Tipo<\/th>\r\n            <th>Fuente<\/th>\r\n            <th>Consumo<\/th>\r\n            <th>Impacto t\u00edpico<\/th>\r\n            <th>Ejemplo<\/th>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Azul<\/td>\r\n            <td>Superficial\/subterr\u00e1nea<\/td>\r\n            <td>Evaporaci\u00f3n\/irrecuperable<\/td>\r\n            <td>Estr\u00e9s en r\u00edos\/acu\u00edferos<\/td>\r\n            <td>Riego intensivo<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Verde<\/td>\r\n            <td>Precipitaci\u00f3n (humedad suelo)<\/td>\r\n            <td>Evapotranspiraci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n            <td>Competencia agricultura natural<\/td>\r\n            <td>Pastizales ganader\u00eda<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Gris<\/td>\r\n            <td>Diluci\u00f3n contaminantes<\/td>\r\n            <td>Asimilaci\u00f3n carga<\/td>\r\n            <td>Eutrofizaci\u00f3n\/toxicidad<\/td>\r\n            <td>Fertilizantes\/textiles<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n    <strong>Agua virtual:<\/strong> Agua incorporada en productos\/servicios. Un jean \u2248 8000 L; 1 kg carne bovina \u2248 15400 L.\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    II. Ciclo de Apropiaci\u00f3n H\u00eddrica Humana\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Flujo de agua dulce a trav\u00e9s de componentes antropog\u00e9nicos.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <svg class=\"water-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow-cyan\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#00ffff\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n\r\n        <rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"#001122\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"400\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#00ffff\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">CICLO H\u00cdDRICO ANTROPOG\u00c9NICO<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Precipitaci\u00f3n (Verde) -->\r\n        <path d=\"M50 100 Q150 50 250 100 T450 100\" stroke=\"#00ff00\" stroke-width=\"6\" opacity=\"0.6\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"200\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#00ff00\">HH VERDE (Lluvia)<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Acu\u00edfero (Azul) -->\r\n        <rect x=\"550\" y=\"300\" width=\"200\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#001a33\" stroke=\"#00ccff\" stroke-width=\"6\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"650\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#00ffff\">HH AZUL (Acu\u00edferos\/R\u00edos)<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Producci\u00f3n -->\r\n        <rect x=\"300\" y=\"200\" width=\"200\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#222222\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"4\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"400\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#ffffff\">PRODUCCI\u00d3N<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Flujos -->\r\n        <path d=\"M200 100 L350 200\" stroke=\"#00ff00\" stroke-width=\"8\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M650 340 L450 300\" stroke=\"#00ccff\" stroke-width=\"8\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M400 320 L400 420\" stroke=\"#888888\" stroke-width=\"10\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"420\" y=\"410\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#888888\">HH GRIS (Contaminaci\u00f3n)<\/text>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    III. Simuladores Interactivos\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: Agua Virtual en Productos<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Selecciona productos para ver su huella h\u00eddrica t\u00edpica.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"water-sim\">\r\n    <select id=\"productSelect\">\r\n        <option value=\"carne\">1 kg Carne bovina<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"algodon\">1 kg Algod\u00f3n<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"cafe\">1 Taza caf\u00e9<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"chocolate\">1 Tableta chocolate<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"arroz\">1 kg Arroz<\/option>\r\n    <\/select>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"virtualResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const select = document.getElementById(\"productSelect\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"virtualResult\");\r\n\r\n    const data = {\r\n        carne: { vol: \"15 400 L\", desc: \"94% verde (pasturas), alto impacto en deforestaci\u00f3n.\" },\r\n        algodon: { vol: \"10 000 L\", desc: \"Principalmente azul, estr\u00e9s en cuencas \u00e1ridas.\" },\r\n        cafe: { vol: \"140 L\", desc: \"Por taza; cultivo intensivo en regiones tropicales.\" },\r\n        chocolate: { vol: \"17 000 L\", desc: \"Por kg; cacao + leche.\" },\r\n        arroz: { vol: \"2 500 L\", desc: \"Alto consumo azul en arrozales inundados.\" }\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        const d = data[select.value];\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>${d.vol}<\/strong><br>${d.desc}`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    select.addEventListener(\"change\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">An\u00e1lisis: C\u00e1lculo de Huella Gris<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Calcula volumen necesario para diluir contaminante.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"water-sim\">\r\n    <label>Carga nitr\u00f3geno (kg): <input type=\"number\" id=\"loadInput\" value=\"1\" min=\"0.1\"><\/label>\r\n    <label>Concentraci\u00f3n m\u00e1xima permitida (mg\/L): <span id=\"maxVal\">10<\/span><\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"maxSlider\" min=\"1\" max=\"50\" value=\"10\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"grisResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const load = document.getElementById(\"loadInput\");\r\n    const maxSlider = document.getElementById(\"maxSlider\");\r\n    const maxVal = document.getElementById(\"maxVal\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"grisResult\");\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        const l = parseFloat(load.value) || 0;\r\n        const c = parseInt(maxSlider.value);\r\n        maxVal.textContent = c;\r\n\r\n        const vol = (l * 1000000) \/ c; \/\/ mg a L\r\n\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>HH Gris: ${vol.toLocaleString()} L<\/strong><br>\r\n                            Volumen necesario para diluir carga hasta est\u00e1ndar.`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    load.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    maxSlider.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Quiz Autoevaluado: Huella H\u00eddrica<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>1. HH Azul proviene de:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,true)\">R\u00edos y acu\u00edferos<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,false)\">Lluvia<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb1\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>2. Mayor componente en carne bovina:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,true)\">HH Verde<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,false)\">HH Gris<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb2\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>3. HH Gris mide:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,true)\">Diluci\u00f3n contaminantes<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,false)\">Evaporaci\u00f3n directa<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb3\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>4. Producto con mayor HH por unidad:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(4,true)\">Carne bovina<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(4,false)\">Verduras<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb4\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"quizScore\" class=\"score-display\">Puntuaci\u00f3n: 0\/4<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nlet score = 0;\r\nconst total = 4;\r\nfunction checkQuiz(q, correct){\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById(\"fb\" + q);\r\n    if (correct){\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u2705 Correcto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#00e676\";\r\n        score++;\r\n    } else {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u274c Incorrecto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#ff1744\";\r\n    }\r\n    document.getElementById(\"quizScore\").textContent = \"Puntuaci\u00f3n: \" + score + \"\/\" + total;\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    IV. Errores Comunes del Estudiante\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"errors-interactive\">\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err1\" onchange=\"toggleError(1)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err1\">Confundir HH con consumo directo.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp1\">Incluye agua virtual en productos.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err2\" onchange=\"toggleError(2)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err2\">Ignorar HH Gris.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp2\">Representa contaminaci\u00f3n, no volumen consumido.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err3\" onchange=\"toggleError(3)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err3\">Subestimar HH Verde en ganader\u00eda.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp3\">Dominante en productos de origen animal.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction toggleError(n){\r\n    const exp = document.getElementById(\"exp\" + n);\r\n    exp.style.display = document.getElementById(\"err\" + n).checked ? \"block\" : \"none\";\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    V. Conexi\u00f3n con el Curr\u00edculo de Ecosistemas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Tema clave en \"Recursos h\u00eddricos\" y \"Sostenibilidad\". Relacionado con ciclos hidrol\u00f3gicos, estr\u00e9s h\u00eddrico y servicios ecosist\u00e9micos. Evaluado en an\u00e1lisis de cuencas y comercio virtual de agua.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VI. Problemas Tipo Examen\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ol class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n    <li>Calcula HH gris para 500 kg N con l\u00edmite 10 mg\/L.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Compara HH de carne bovina vs vegetal. Justifica impactos.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Explica por qu\u00e9 algod\u00f3n tiene alta HH azul.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Analiza estrategias reducci\u00f3n HH en industria textil.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Justifica importancia HH verde en cambio clim\u00e1tico.<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VII. Reflexi\u00f3n Metacognitiva\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"reflection-list\">\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 productos de tu consumo diario tienen mayor HH y c\u00f3mo reducirla?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 HH gris es cr\u00edtica en zonas contaminadas?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategia usar\u00e1s para evaluar impacto h\u00eddrico?<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">\r\n    La huella h\u00eddrica revela la presi\u00f3n invisible sobre recursos dulces. Su reducci\u00f3n es esencial para sostenibilidad global.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"neon-quote\">\r\n    \u201cEl agua que no vemos define nuestro futuro.\u201d\r\n<\/blockquote>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"Huella h\u00eddrica mide...","opciones":["Carbono","Uso de agua dulce","Basura","Energ\u00eda"],"correcta":"Uso de agua dulce"},{"pregunta":"Agua azul es...","opciones":["Lluvia","R\u00edos y acu\u00edferos","Contaminada","Evaporada"],"correcta":"R\u00edos y acu\u00edferos"},{"pregunta":"Agua verde es...","opciones":["Riego","Lluvia en cultivos","Residuos","Industrial"],"correcta":"Lluvia en cultivos"},{"pregunta":"Agua gris es...","opciones":["Limpia","Contaminada","Subterr\u00e1nea","Superficial"],"correcta":"Contaminada"},{"pregunta":"Sector con mayor HH","opciones":["Industria","Agricultura","Dom\u00e9stico","Transporte"],"correcta":"Agricultura"},{"pregunta":"HH de 1 kg carne \u2248","opciones":["1,000 L","15,400 L","100 L","50,000 L"],"correcta":"15,400 L"},{"pregunta":"HH de 1 taza caf\u00e9 \u2248","opciones":["10 L","140 L","1,000 L","5,000 L"],"correcta":"140 L"},{"pregunta":"Unidad HH","opciones":["kg","litros","kWh","m\u00b2"],"correcta":"litros"},{"pregunta":"HH virtual es...","opciones":["Directa","En productos importados","Local","Nada"],"correcta":"En productos importados"},{"pregunta":"Reducir HH con...","opciones":["M\u00e1s carne","Dieta vegana","M\u00e1s riego","Pl\u00e1stico"],"correcta":"Dieta vegana"},{"pregunta":"HH Espa\u00f1a \u2248","opciones":["1,000 m\u00b3","2,325 m\u00b3","5,000 m\u00b3","500 m\u00b3"],"correcta":"2,325 m\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"% HH global en agricultura","opciones":["50%","92%","20%","70%"],"correcta":"92%"},{"pregunta":"HH de camiseta algod\u00f3n \u2248","opciones":["500 L","2,700 L","10,000 L","100 L"],"correcta":"2,700 L"},{"pregunta":"HH gris por fertilizante N \u2248","opciones":["1,000 L\/kg","10,000 L\/kg","100 L\/kg","50,000 L\/kg"],"correcta":"10,000 L\/kg"},{"pregunta":"Pa\u00eds con mayor HH per c\u00e1pita","opciones":["India","EE.UU.","China","Brasil"],"correcta":"EE.UU."},{"pregunta":"WFN es...","opciones":["Water Footprint Network","World Food Network","Water Force","Nada"],"correcta":"Water Footprint Network"},{"pregunta":"Estr\u00e9s h\u00eddrico ocurre cuando...","opciones":["HH baja","HH > disponibilidad","Lluvia alta","Nada"],"correcta":"HH > disponibilidad"},{"pregunta":"HH de arroz vs trigo","opciones":["Arroz > trigo","Igual","Trigo > arroz","Cero"],"correcta":"Arroz > trigo"},{"pregunta":"HH de caf\u00e9 es alta por...","opciones":["Riego","Procesado","Cultivo en secano","Transporte"],"correcta":"Cultivo en secano"},{"pregunta":"HH azul alta en...","opciones":["Secano","Riego intensivo","Lluvia","Residuos"],"correcta":"Riego intensivo"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula HH gris","opciones":["Carga \/ C_m\u00e1x","Carga \u00d7 C_m\u00e1x","Carga + C_m\u00e1x","C_m\u00e1x \/ Carga"],"correcta":"Carga \/ C_m\u00e1x"},{"pregunta":"HH global total \u2248","opciones":["1 Tm\u00b3","9.1 Tm\u00b3","100 Tm\u00b3","0.1 Tm\u00b3"],"correcta":"9.1 Tm\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"HH de 1 kg az\u00facar \u2248","opciones":["500 L","1,500 L","10,000 L","50,000 L"],"correcta":"1,500 L"},{"pregunta":"HH de 1 L leche \u2248","opciones":["100 L","1,000 L","10,000 L","50 L"],"correcta":"1,000 L"},{"pregunta":"HH de 1 kg pollo vs bovina","opciones":["Pollo > bovina","Pollo < bovina","Igual","Cero"],"correcta":"Pollo < bovina"},{"pregunta":"HH de algod\u00f3n por...","opciones":["Riego","Lluvia","Contaminaci\u00f3n","Todo"],"correcta":"Todo"},{"pregunta":"HH de Espa\u00f1a alta por...","opciones":["Exportaci\u00f3n frutas","Industria","Turismo","Nada"],"correcta":"Exportaci\u00f3n frutas"},{"pregunta":"HH gris por P \u2248","opciones":["100,000 L\/kg","1,000 L\/kg","10,000 L\/kg","50,000 L\/kg"],"correcta":"100,000 L\/kg"},{"pregunta":"HH sostenible cuando...","opciones":["HH < disponibilidad","HH = 0","HH alta","Nada"],"correcta":"HH < disponibilidad"},{"pregunta":"Meta reducci\u00f3n HH UE","opciones":["-20% 2030","-50% 2050","-10% 2025","Nada"],"correcta":"-20% 2030"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"huella-ecologica-master","titulo":"Huella Ecol\u00f3gica: Contabilidad del Capital Natural y L\u00edmites Planetarios","contenido":"<p class=\"intro\">\r\n    La <strong>huella ecol\u00f3gica<\/strong> mide la demanda humana sobre la biocapacidad del planeta en hect\u00e1reas globales (gha). Compara consumo renovable con regeneraci\u00f3n biol\u00f3gica, revelando d\u00e9ficit o reserva ecol\u00f3gica. Incluye Factores de Equivalencia (EQF) y Rendimiento (YF) para normalizar productividad. Es herramienta clave para evaluar sostenibilidad, deuda ecol\u00f3gica y D\u00eda del Sobregiro Global.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"formula-neon text-center\">\r\n    Huella Ecol\u00f3gica:<br>\r\n    \\[ EF = \\sum \\left( \\frac{C_i}{Y_i} \\times EQF_i \\times YF_i \\right) \\]\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    I. Componentes y C\u00e1lculo de la Huella Ecol\u00f3gica\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Categor\u00eda<\/th>\r\n            <th>Contribuci\u00f3n t\u00edpica<\/th>\r\n            <th>Factores clave<\/th>\r\n            <th>Ejemplo alto impacto<\/th>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr><td>Tierras de cultivo<\/td><td>~25%<\/td><td>Rendimiento agr\u00edcola<\/td><td>Carne bovina<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Pastizales<\/td><td>~30%<\/td><td>Ganader\u00eda extensiva<\/td><td>L\u00e1cteos<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Bosques<\/td><td>~20%<\/td><td>Madera\/papel<\/td><td>Deforestaci\u00f3n<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Pesca<\/td><td>~5%<\/td><td>Capturas marinas<\/td><td>Sobrepesca<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Huella carbono<\/td><td>~20%<\/td><td>Emisiones f\u00f3siles<\/td><td>Energ\u00eda<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <tr><td>\u00c1rea urbanizada<\/td><td>~5%<\/td><td>Infraestructura<\/td><td>Ciudades<\/td><\/tr>\r\n    <\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n    <strong>D\u00eda del Sobregiro:<\/strong> Fecha en que demanda anual supera biocapacidad. Global 2025 \u2248 julio.\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    II. D\u00e9ficit Ecol\u00f3gico Global (Biocapacidad vs Demanda)\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Visualizaci\u00f3n del sobregiro planetario.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <svg class=\"footprint-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow-cyan\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#00ffff\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n\r\n        <rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"#001122\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"400\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#00ffff\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">SOBREGIRO ECOL\u00d3GICO GLOBAL<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Biocapacidad -->\r\n        <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"225\" r=\"120\" fill=\"#006400\" stroke=\"#00ff00\" stroke-width=\"6\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"400\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#ffffff\">BIOCAPACIDAD<br>1.6 gha\/persona<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Demanda -->\r\n        <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"225\" r=\"180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff3333\" stroke-width=\"8\" opacity=\"0.7\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"120;180;120\" dur=\"6s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/circle>\r\n        <text x=\"400\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#ff8888\">DEMANDA<br>2.8 gha\/persona<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"400\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#88ffff\">D\u00e9ficit \u2248 1.7 Tierras necesarias<\/text>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    III. Simuladores Interactivos\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: \u00bfCu\u00e1ntas Tierras Necesitas?<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Ajusta h\u00e1bitos para calcular tu huella personal y D\u00eda del Sobregiro.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"footprint-sim\">\r\n    <label>Consumo carne (porciones\/semana): <span id=\"meatVal\">7<\/span><\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"meatSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"21\" value=\"7\">\r\n\r\n    <label>Viajes en auto (km\/semana): <span id=\"carVal\">200<\/span><\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"carSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"500\" value=\"200\">\r\n\r\n    <label>Vivienda (m\u00b2\/persona): <span id=\"houseVal\">50<\/span><\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"houseSlider\" min=\"20\" max=\"150\" value=\"50\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"earthResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const meat = document.getElementById(\"meatSlider\");\r\n    const car = document.getElementById(\"carSlider\");\r\n    const house = document.getElementById(\"houseSlider\");\r\n    const mVal = document.getElementById(\"meatVal\");\r\n    const cVal = document.getElementById(\"carVal\");\r\n    const hVal = document.getElementById(\"houseVal\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"earthResult\");\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        const m = parseInt(meat.value);\r\n        const c = parseInt(car.value);\r\n        const h = parseInt(house.value);\r\n        mVal.textContent = m;\r\n        cVal.textContent = c;\r\n        hVal.textContent = h;\r\n\r\n        const base = 1.6; \/\/ gha promedio bajo\r\n        const total = base + (m\/7 * 2) + (c\/100 * 1.5) + (h\/50 * 0.8);\r\n        const earths = total \/ 1.6;\r\n\r\n        const day = Math.min(365, Math.floor(365 \/ earths));\r\n        const date = new Date(2025, 0, day);\r\n        const months = [\"ENE\",\"FEB\",\"MAR\",\"ABR\",\"MAY\",\"JUN\",\"JUL\",\"AGO\",\"SEP\",\"OCT\",\"NOV\",\"DIC\"];\r\n\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>${earths.toFixed(1)} Tierras necesarias<\/strong><br>\r\n                            D\u00eda del Sobregiro: ${date.getDate()} ${months[date.getMonth()]}`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    meat.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    car.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    house.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">An\u00e1lisis: D\u00e9ficit Ecol\u00f3gico por Pa\u00eds<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Selecciona pa\u00eds para comparar huella y biocapacidad.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"footprint-sim\">\r\n    <select id=\"countrySelect\">\r\n        <option value=\"usa\">EE.UU.<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"china\">China<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"india\">India<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"brazil\">Brasil<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"spain\">Espa\u00f1a<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"global\">Media Global<\/option>\r\n    <\/select>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"countryResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const select = document.getElementById(\"countrySelect\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"countryResult\");\r\n\r\n    const data = {\r\n        usa: { footprint: 8.1, bio: 3.6, status: \"D\u00e9ficit severo (-4.5 gha)\" },\r\n        china: { footprint: 3.8, bio: 1.0, status: \"D\u00e9ficit alto (-2.8 gha)\" },\r\n        india: { footprint: 1.2, bio: 0.7, status: \"D\u00e9ficit moderado (-0.5 gha)\" },\r\n        brazil: { footprint: 2.8, bio: 8.9, status: \"Reserva alta (+6.1 gha)\" },\r\n        spain: { footprint: 4.5, bio: 1.4, status: \"D\u00e9ficit (-3.1 gha)\" },\r\n        global: { footprint: 2.8, bio: 1.6, status: \"D\u00e9ficit global (-1.2 gha)\" }\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        const d = data[select.value];\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>Huella: ${d.footprint} gha\/persona<\/strong><br>\r\n                            <strong>Biocapacidad: ${d.bio} gha\/persona<\/strong><br>\r\n                            ${d.status}`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    select.addEventListener(\"change\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Quiz Autoevaluado: Huella Ecol\u00f3gica<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>1. Mayor componente huella global:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,true)\">Pastizales (ganader\u00eda)<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,false)\">Pesca<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb1\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>2. Pa\u00eds con reserva ecol\u00f3gica:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,true)\">Brasil<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,false)\">EE.UU.<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb2\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>3. D\u00eda del Sobregiro significa:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,true)\">Demanda supera regeneraci\u00f3n anual<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,false)\">Fin de recursos f\u00f3siles<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb3\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>4. EQF normaliza:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(4,true)\">Productividad entre tipos tierra<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(4,false)\">Solo emisiones carbono<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb4\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"quizScore\" class=\"score-display\">Puntuaci\u00f3n: 0\/4<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nlet score = 0;\r\nconst total = 4;\r\nfunction checkQuiz(q, correct){\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById(\"fb\" + q);\r\n    if (correct){\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u2705 Correcto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#00e676\";\r\n        score++;\r\n    } else {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u274c Incorrecto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#ff1744\";\r\n    }\r\n    document.getElementById(\"quizScore\").textContent = \"Puntuaci\u00f3n: \" + score + \"\/\" + total;\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    IV. Errores Comunes del Estudiante\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"errors-interactive\">\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err1\" onchange=\"toggleError(1)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err1\">Confundir huella ecol\u00f3gica con huella carbono.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp1\">Huella ecol\u00f3gica incluye todos recursos renovables; carbono solo emisiones.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err2\" onchange=\"toggleError(2)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err2\">Ignorar comercio ecol\u00f3gico (importaciones).<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp2\">Pa\u00edses ricos transfieren d\u00e9ficit a exportadores.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err3\" onchange=\"toggleError(3)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err3\">Pensar que poblaci\u00f3n alta = mayor huella.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp3\">Consumo per c\u00e1pita domina (EE.UU. vs India).<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction toggleError(n){\r\n    const exp = document.getElementById(\"exp\" + n);\r\n    exp.style.display = document.getElementById(\"err\" + n).checked ? \"block\" : \"none\";\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    V. Conexi\u00f3n con el Curr\u00edculo de Ecosistemas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Tema central en \"Sostenibilidad y l\u00edmites planetarios\" en Ecolog\u00eda y Ciencias Ambientales. Relacionado con biocapacidad, deuda ecol\u00f3gica y comercio virtual. Evaluado en an\u00e1lisis de indicadores globales y pol\u00edticas de desarrollo sostenible.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VI. Problemas Tipo Examen\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ol class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n    <li>Calcula tierras necesarias si huella = 5 gha y biocapacidad = 1.6 gha.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Explica por qu\u00e9 pa\u00edses ricos tienen d\u00e9ficit ecol\u00f3gico.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Analiza impacto ganader\u00eda en huella global.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Compara huella Espa\u00f1a vs Brasil. Justifica diferencia.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Prop\u00f3n medidas reducci\u00f3n huella personal y nacional.<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VII. Reflexi\u00f3n Metacognitiva\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"reflection-list\">\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 h\u00e1bitos tuyos contribuyen m\u00e1s a tu huella ecol\u00f3gica?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo afecta comercio global distribuci\u00f3n de d\u00e9ficits?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategia usar\u00e1s para evaluar sostenibilidad?<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">\r\n    La huella ecol\u00f3gica evidencia sobregiro planetario. Reducirla requiere cambios sist\u00e9micos y personales hacia estilos de vida compatibles con biocapacidad.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"neon-quote\">\r\n    \u201cVivimos en deuda con el planeta.\u201d\r\n<\/blockquote>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"Huella ecol\u00f3gica mide...","opciones":["\u00c1rea productiva","Dinero","Agua","Energ\u00eda"],"correcta":"\u00c1rea productiva"},{"pregunta":"Unidad de huella","opciones":["m\u00b2","gha","litros","kg"],"correcta":"gha"},{"pregunta":"Overshoot Day 2025 \u2248","opciones":["Diciembre","Julio","Marzo","Octubre"],"correcta":"Julio"},{"pregunta":"Componente principal en ricos","opciones":["Pesca","Carbono","Bosque","Construido"],"correcta":"Carbono"},{"pregunta":"Biocapacidad global \u2248","opciones":["1.6 gha","2.8 gha","5 gha","0.5 gha"],"correcta":"1.6 gha"},{"pregunta":"Huella global \u2248","opciones":["1.6 gha","2.8 gha","5 gha","0.5 gha"],"correcta":"2.8 gha"},{"pregunta":"Planetas que usamos","opciones":["0.5","1","1.7","3"],"correcta":"1.7"},{"pregunta":"Espa\u00f1a necesita \u2248","opciones":["1 planeta","2.5 planetas","0.5","5"],"correcta":"2.5 planetas"},{"pregunta":"Reducir con...","opciones":["M\u00e1s autos","Dieta vegana","M\u00e1s pl\u00e1stico","Tala"],"correcta":"Dieta vegana"},{"pregunta":"GFN es...","opciones":["Global Footprint Network","Green Food","Nada","ONU"],"correcta":"Global Footprint Network"},{"pregunta":"Huella EE.UU. \u2248","opciones":["2 gha","8.1 gha","1 gha","15 gha"],"correcta":"8.1 gha"},{"pregunta":"Pa\u00eds con reserva ecol\u00f3gica","opciones":["EE.UU.","Brasil","Espa\u00f1a","China"],"correcta":"Brasil"},{"pregunta":"Huella de carbono es \u2248","opciones":["20%","60% de total","10%","90%"],"correcta":"60% de total"},{"pregunta":"Overshoot Day avanz\u00f3 desde...","opciones":["1970","2000","1950","2020"],"correcta":"1970"},{"pregunta":"Huella de 1 kg carne \u2248","opciones":["0.5 gha","2 gha","10 gha","0.1 gha"],"correcta":"2 gha"},{"pregunta":"Huella de 1 km en auto \u2248","opciones":["0.0001 gha","0.001 gha","0.01 gha","0.1 gha"],"correcta":"0.001 gha"},{"pregunta":"Huella de reciclaje","opciones":["Aumenta","Reduce","Igual","Nada"],"correcta":"Reduce"},{"pregunta":"Huella de energ\u00eda renovable","opciones":["Alta","Baja","Igual","Cero"],"correcta":"Baja"},{"pregunta":"Huella de pesca en declive por...","opciones":["Sobreexplotaci\u00f3n","Lluvia","Fr\u00edo","Nada"],"correcta":"Sobreexplotaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Huella construida incluye...","opciones":["Carreteras","Bosques","Oc\u00e9anos","Aire"],"correcta":"Carreteras"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula d\u00e9ficit","opciones":["Huella - Biocapacidad","Biocapacidad - Huella","Huella \u00d7 Biocapacidad","Huella \/ Biocapacidad"],"correcta":"Huella - Biocapacidad"},{"pregunta":"Huella total humanidad \u2248","opciones":["10 mil millones gha","20.5 mil millones gha","5 mil millones","50 mil millones"],"correcta":"20.5 mil millones gha"},{"pregunta":"Biocapacidad total \u2248","opciones":["12 mil millones gha","20 mil millones","5 mil millones","1 mil millones"],"correcta":"12 mil millones gha"},{"pregunta":"Equivalencia 1 gha \u2248","opciones":["1 ha promedio Tierra","1 ha bosque","1 ha oc\u00e9ano","1 ha desierto"],"correcta":"1 ha promedio Tierra"},{"pregunta":"Huella de 1 ha bosque absorbe \u2248","opciones":["1 t CO\u2082\/a\u00f1o","5 t CO\u2082\/a\u00f1o","10 t CO\u2082\/a\u00f1o","0.1 t"],"correcta":"5 t CO\u2082\/a\u00f1o"},{"pregunta":"Huella de 1 L gasolina \u2248","opciones":["0.001 gha","0.01 gha","0.1 gha","1 gha"],"correcta":"0.01 gha"},{"pregunta":"Huella de dieta vegana vs promedio","opciones":["50% menor","Igual","Mayor","Doble"],"correcta":"50% menor"},{"pregunta":"Huella de transporte p\u00fablico vs auto","opciones":["Mayor","Menor","Igual","Cero"],"correcta":"Menor"},{"pregunta":"Meta sostenible","opciones":["Huella \u2264 1.6 gha","Huella = 0","Huella > biocapacidad","Nada"],"correcta":"Huella \u2264 1.6 gha"},{"pregunta":"GFN fundado en...","opciones":["1992","2003","1970","2020"],"correcta":"2003"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"flecha-dorada-master","titulo":"La Flecha Dorada: Redise\u00f1ando el Metabolismo Industrial hacia la Circularidad","contenido":"<p class=\"intro\">\r\n    La <strong>Flecha Dorada<\/strong> representa el desacoplamiento entre crecimiento econ\u00f3mico y consumo de recursos mediante econom\u00eda circular. Inspirada en Cradle to Cradle y el Diagrama de Mariposa de la Ellen MacArthur Foundation, prioriza ciclos cerrados (t\u00e9cnicos y biol\u00f3gicos) sobre el modelo lineal \"extraer-producir-desechar\". Su implementaci\u00f3n reduce entrop\u00eda industrial y regenera capital natural.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"formula-neon text-center\">\r\n    \u00cdndice de Circularidad Material (MCI):<br>\r\n    \\[ MCI = \\frac{V + W_{in}}{V + W_{in} + W_{out} + L} \\]\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    I. Diagrama de Mariposa: Ciclos T\u00e9cnicos y Biol\u00f3gicos\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"neon-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Ciclo<\/th>\r\n            <th>Estrategias clave<\/th>\r\n            <th>Jerarqu\u00eda valor<\/th>\r\n            <th>Ejemplo<\/th>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>T\u00e9cnicos<\/td>\r\n            <td>Mantenimiento \u2192 Reutilizaci\u00f3n \u2192 Remanufactura \u2192 Reciclaje<\/td>\r\n            <td>Alta (preserva dise\u00f1o)<\/td>\r\n            <td>Electr\u00f3nica modular<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Biol\u00f3gicos<\/td>\r\n            <td>Cascadas \u2192 Extracci\u00f3n \u2192 Compostaje \u2192 Biog\u00e1s<\/td>\r\n            <td>Regenerativa<\/td>\r\n            <td>Residuos org\u00e1nicos<\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>\r\n    <\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n    <strong>9 R's (jerarqu\u00eda):<\/strong> Refuse \u2192 Reduce \u2192 Reuse \u2192 Repair \u2192 Refurbish \u2192 Remanufacture \u2192 Repurpose \u2192 Recycle \u2192 Recover\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    II. Transici\u00f3n Lineal \u2192 Circular (Flecha Dorada)\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Evoluci\u00f3n del impacto ambiental con adopci\u00f3n circular.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <svg class=\"golden-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <filter id=\"glow-cyan\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feFlood flood-color=\"#00ffff\"\/>\r\n                <feComposite in2=\"blur\" operator=\"in\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n\r\n        <rect width=\"800\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#050505\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"400\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#00ffff\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">FLECHA DORADA: TRANSICI\u00d3N CIRCULAR<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- L\u00ednea base (impacto) -->\r\n        <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"350\" x2=\"750\" y2=\"350\" stroke=\"#444444\" stroke-width=\"4\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"400\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888888\">IMPACTO AMBIENTAL<\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Trayectoria lineal -->\r\n        <path d=\"M50 350 L750 150\" stroke=\"#ff3333\" stroke-width=\"6\" opacity=\"0.6\"\/>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Trayectoria circular (dorada) -->\r\n        <path id=\"golden-path\" d=\"M50 350 Q400 300 750 350\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffcc00\" stroke-width=\"8\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"800\" to=\"0\" dur=\"6s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dasharray\" values=\"0,800;800,0\" dur=\"6s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/path>\r\n\r\n        <text x=\"400\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#ffcc00\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">DESACOPLAMIENTO<\/text>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    III. Simuladores Interactivos\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Simulador: Producto vs Servicio (PaaS)<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Compara modelo lineal vs circular en bombillas Philips.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"golden-sim\">\r\n    <button data-type=\"linear\">Modelo Lineal (Venta)<\/button>\r\n    <button data-type=\"circular\">Modelo Circular (Servicio)<\/button>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"paasResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const buttons = document.querySelectorAll(\".golden-sim button\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"paasResult\");\r\n\r\n    const data = {\r\n        linear: \"\ud83d\udd34 Obsolescencia programada<br>Alta producci\u00f3n \u2192 vertederos<br>Huella creciente\",\r\n        circular: \"\ud83d\udfe2 Dise\u00f1o duradero + reciclable<br>Philips mantiene propiedad<br>\u219360% materiales, \u2191eficiencia energ\u00e9tica\"\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    buttons.forEach(btn => {\r\n        btn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\r\n            const type = btn.dataset.type;\r\n            result.innerHTML = `<strong>${type === \"linear\" ? \"MODELO LINEAL\" : \"MODELO CIRCULAR\"}<\/strong><br>${data[type]}`;\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">An\u00e1lisis: \u00cdndice de Circularidad (MCI)<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Calcula MCI aproximado de un producto.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"golden-sim\">\r\n    <label>Material virgen (%): <span id=\"virginVal\">80<\/span><\/label>\r\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"virginSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"80\">\r\n\r\n    <label>Material reciclado\/reutilizado (%): <span id=\"circVal\">20<\/span><\/label>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sim-result\" id=\"mciResult\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n    const slider = document.getElementById(\"virginSlider\");\r\n    const virgin = document.getElementById(\"virginVal\");\r\n    const circ = document.getElementById(\"circVal\");\r\n    const result = document.getElementById(\"mciResult\");\r\n\r\n    function update(){\r\n        const v = parseInt(slider.value);\r\n        virgin.textContent = v;\r\n        circ.textContent = 100 - v;\r\n\r\n        const mci = ((100 - v) \/ 100).toFixed(2);\r\n        result.innerHTML = `<strong>MCI \u2248 ${mci}<\/strong><br>${mci >= 0.7 ? \"Alta circularidad\" : mci >= 0.4 ? \"Media\" : \"Baja (lineal dominante)\"}`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    slider.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\r\n    update();\r\n})();\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<h4 class=\"subsection-title\">Quiz Autoevaluado: Flecha Dorada<\/h4>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>1. Prioridad en ciclo t\u00e9cnico:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,true)\">Reutilizaci\u00f3n\/Reparaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(1,false)\">Reciclaje<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb1\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>2. Modelo PaaS incentiva:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,true)\">Durabilidad y eficiencia<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(2,false)\">Obsolescencia<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb2\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>3. Reciclaje es inferior porque:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,true)\">Alta energ\u00eda y p\u00e9rdida valor<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(3,false)\">Bajo costo<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb3\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p>4. Objetivo Flecha Dorada:<\/p>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(4,true)\">Desacoplamiento crecimiento-impacto<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"checkQuiz(4,false)\">Maximizar producci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"fb4\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"quizScore\" class=\"score-display\">Puntuaci\u00f3n: 0\/4<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nlet score = 0;\r\nconst total = 4;\r\nfunction checkQuiz(q, correct){\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById(\"fb\" + q);\r\n    if (correct){\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u2705 Correcto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#00e676\";\r\n        score++;\r\n    } else {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"\u274c Incorrecto\";\r\n        fb.style.color = \"#ff1744\";\r\n    }\r\n    document.getElementById(\"quizScore\").textContent = \"Puntuaci\u00f3n: \" + score + \"\/\" + total;\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    IV. Errores Comunes del Estudiante\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"errors-interactive\">\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err1\" onchange=\"toggleError(1)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err1\">Equivaler circularidad con reciclaje.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp1\">Reciclaje es \u00faltima opci\u00f3n; priorizar R superiores.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err2\" onchange=\"toggleError(2)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err2\">Ignorar ciclos biol\u00f3gicos.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp2\">Esenciales para regeneraci\u00f3n natural.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"err3\" onchange=\"toggleError(3)\">\r\n        <label for=\"err3\">Creer que circularidad aumenta costos siempre.<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"error-explain\" id=\"exp3\">Modelos PaaS reducen costos a largo plazo.<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction toggleError(n){\r\n    const exp = document.getElementById(\"exp\" + n);\r\n    exp.style.display = document.getElementById(\"err\" + n).checked ? \"block\" : \"none\";\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    V. Conexi\u00f3n con el Curr\u00edculo de Ecosistemas\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Tema avanzado en \"Econom\u00eda ecol\u00f3gica\" y \"Dise\u00f1o sostenible\". Relacionado con metabolismo industrial, l\u00edmites planetarios y regeneraci\u00f3n. Evaluado en an\u00e1lisis Cradle to Cradle y modelos circulares.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VI. Problemas Tipo Examen\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ol class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n    <li>Explica jerarqu\u00eda 9 R's con ejemplos.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Analiza impacto modelo PaaS en huella material.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Compara ciclos t\u00e9cnico vs biol\u00f3gico.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Justifica por qu\u00e9 reciclaje no es \u00f3ptimo circular.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Prop\u00f3n estrategia Flecha Dorada para industria textil.<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"divider-neon\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<!-- ================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"section-title\">\r\n    VII. Reflexi\u00f3n Metacognitiva\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"reflection-list\">\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 productos cotidianos podr\u00edan migrar a modelo servicio?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo afecta econom\u00eda circular a l\u00edmites planetarios?<\/li>\r\n    <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 R priorizar\u00edas en tu vida diaria?<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">\r\n    La Flecha Dorada transforma metabolismo industrial lineal en circular regenerativo. Su adopci\u00f3n es esencial para compatibilidad con biosfera finita.\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"neon-quote\">\r\n    \u201cDe la cuna a la cuna, no a la tumba.\u201d\r\n<\/blockquote>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"Flecha Dorada apunta a...","opciones":["Econom\u00eda circular","Caza","Oro","Lineal"],"correcta":"Econom\u00eda circular"},{"pregunta":"Modelo lineal es...","opciones":["Tomar-hacer-desechar","Cerrar ciclos","Regenerar","Reciclar"],"correcta":"Tomar-hacer-desechar"},{"pregunta":"Circularidad global 2025","opciones":["50%","7.2%","90%","0%"],"correcta":"7.2%"},{"pregunta":"Principio 1 circular","opciones":["Eliminar residuos","M\u00e1s pl\u00e1stico","Quemar","Extraer"],"correcta":"Eliminar residuos"},{"pregunta":"EMF es...","opciones":["Ellen MacArthur Foundation","Energy Market","Nada","ONU"],"correcta":"Ellen MacArthur Foundation"},{"pregunta":"Ejemplo circular","opciones":["Alquiler luz","Basura","Pl\u00e1stico nuevo","Carb\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Alquiler luz"},{"pregunta":"Upcycling es...","opciones":["Valor \u2191","Valor \u2193","Reciclaje","Basura"],"correcta":"Valor \u2191"},{"pregunta":"Meta UE 2030","opciones":["50%","80% reciclaje","100%","0%"],"correcta":"80% reciclaje"},{"pregunta":"Residuos en circular son...","opciones":["Recursos","Basura","Contaminaci\u00f3n","Nada"],"correcta":"Recursos"},{"pregunta":"Flecha Dorada reduce...","opciones":["Huella ecol\u00f3gica","Aumenta","Igual","Cero"],"correcta":"Huella ecol\u00f3gica"},{"pregunta":"Circularity Gap Report dice...","opciones":["7.2% circular","50%","100%","0%"],"correcta":"7.2% circular"},{"pregunta":"China tiene...","opciones":["100 ciudades zero waste","1 ciudad","Ninguna","1000"],"correcta":"100 ciudades zero waste"},{"pregunta":"Interface Net-Works recicla...","opciones":["Redes pesca","Pl\u00e1stico","Papel","Vidrio"],"correcta":"Redes pesca"},{"pregunta":"Dise\u00f1o para desmontaje permite...","opciones":["Reutilizaci\u00f3n","Basura","Quema","Nada"],"correcta":"Reutilizaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Econom\u00eda de funcionalidad es...","opciones":["Vender servicio","Vender producto","Ambos","Ninguno"],"correcta":"Vender servicio"},{"pregunta":"Cradle to Cradle es...","opciones":["Dise\u00f1o regenerativo","Lineal","Reciclaje","Basura"],"correcta":"Dise\u00f1o regenerativo"},{"pregunta":"ODS 12 es...","opciones":["Consumo responsable","Agua","Educaci\u00f3n","Salud"],"correcta":"Consumo responsable"},{"pregunta":"Biomimicry en dise\u00f1o es...","opciones":["Imitar naturaleza","Ignorar","Destruir","Nada"],"correcta":"Imitar naturaleza"},{"pregunta":"Producto como servicio reduce...","opciones":["Propiedad","Aumenta","Igual","Cero"],"correcta":"Propiedad"},{"pregunta":"Circularidad \u2193 desde 2018 por...","opciones":["Crecimiento poblaci\u00f3n","Menos reciclaje","M\u00e1s pl\u00e1stico","Todo"],"correcta":"Todo"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula circularidad","opciones":["(Reciclado \/ Total) \u00d7 100","Total \/ Reciclado","Reciclado \u00d7 Total","100 - Reciclado"],"correcta":"(Reciclado \/ Total) \u00d7 100"},{"pregunta":"Meta circularidad 2032","opciones":["17%","50%","100%","7.2%"],"correcta":"17%"},{"pregunta":"UE reduce CO\u2082 con circularidad en...","opciones":["700 Mt","100 Mt","1 Gt","10 Mt"],"correcta":"700 Mt"},{"pregunta":"Net-Works recolect\u00f3...","opciones":["200,000 kg redes","1 kg","1 mill\u00f3n kg","10 kg"],"correcta":"200,000 kg redes"},{"pregunta":"Light as a Service \u2193 energ\u00eda en...","opciones":["60%","10%","100%","0%"],"correcta":"60%"},{"pregunta":"Principio 3 circular","opciones":["Regenerar naturaleza","Extraer","Contaminar","Desechar"],"correcta":"Regenerar naturaleza"},{"pregunta":"C2C certificado por...","opciones":["McDonough & Braungart","ONU","UE","Nada"],"correcta":"McDonough & Braungart"},{"pregunta":"Econom\u00eda azul imita...","opciones":["Ecosistemas","F\u00e1bricas","Ciudades","Nada"],"correcta":"Ecosistemas"},{"pregunta":"Circularidad requiere...","opciones":["Dise\u00f1o sist\u00e9mico","Solo reciclaje","M\u00e1s pl\u00e1stico","Lineal"],"correcta":"Dise\u00f1o sist\u00e9mico"},{"pregunta":"EMF fundada en...","opciones":["2010","2000","2020","1990"],"correcta":"2010"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"obsolescencia-percibida-master","titulo":"Obsolescencia Percibida: La Psique del Desperdicio","contenido":"\r\n<div class=\"opm-lesson-carbon perceived-obsolescence-master\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"intro-header text-center mb-5\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"display-3 opm-text-neon-pink\">EL ENGA\u00d1O DEL \"NUEVO\"<\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"fs-4 mx-auto\" style=\"max-width: 900px;\">\r\n            La <strong>Obsolescencia Percibida<\/strong> es el motor psicol\u00f3gico del hiperconsumismo. No es una falla del objeto, sino una <strong>falla inducida en la satisfacci\u00f3n del usuario<\/strong> a trav\u00e9s de la manipulaci\u00f3n semi\u00f3tica y est\u00e9tica. En contextos reales, esto impulsa el desperdicio masivo, afectando ecosistemas globales al aumentar la extracci\u00f3n de recursos y la contaminaci\u00f3n.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"row mb-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n            <div class=\"opm-alert-carbon opm-border-pink text-center\">\r\n                <h4 class=\"opm-text-magenta\"><i class=\"fas fa-brain\"><\/i> El \u00cdndice de Obsolescencia Psicol\u00f3gica (\\( I_{op} \\))<\/h4>\r\n                <p>El deseo de reemplazo aumenta exponencialmente conforme el producto actual se aleja del \"est\u00e1ndar est\u00e9tico\" vigente:<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"opm-eq-box fs-3 py-4\">\r\n                    \\[ I_{op} = \\frac{\\Delta \\text{Marketing}}{\\Delta \\text{Utilidad Real}} \\cdot t \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <small class=\"text-muted\">Si la utilidad es constante pero el marketing aumenta, la percepci\u00f3n de obsolescencia se dispara.<\/small>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"opm-section-title opm-text-pink\">1. El Efecto Diderot: La Espiral del Consumo<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"row mb-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-7\">\r\n            <p>Este fen\u00f3meno social explica c\u00f3mo la adquisici\u00f3n de un objeto nuevo (ej. un iPhone 16) crea una <strong>insatisfacci\u00f3n sist\u00e9mica<\/strong> con los objetos actuales (cargadores, fundas, aud\u00edfonos), forzando una espiral de consumo innecesario.<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"opm-stats-box p-3 bg-dark opm-border-left-magenta\">\r\n                <h5 class=\"opm-text-yellow\">Impacto Cr\u00edtico: Fast Fashion<\/h5>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li><strong>Huella H\u00eddrica:<\/strong> 7,500 litros de agua para 1 solo jean.<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>Micropl\u00e1sticos:<\/strong> 35% de los micropl\u00e1sticos en el oc\u00e9ano provienen del lavado de ropa sint\u00e9tica.<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>Desecho:<\/strong> Un cami\u00f3n de basura de textiles se quema o entierra <strong>cada segundo<\/strong>.<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-5\">\r\n            <!-- Espacio para visual adicional si se necesita -->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"opm-section-title opm-text-cyan\">2. E-Waste: La Tragedia del Silicio<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"row mb-4 text-center\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n            <div class=\"opm-counter-card\">\r\n                <h2 class=\"opm-text-neon-red\">62Mt<\/h2>\r\n                <p>E-Waste generado\/a\u00f1o<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n            <div class=\"opm-counter-card\">\r\n                <h2 class=\"opm-text-neon-blue\">22.3%<\/h2>\r\n                <p>Reciclaje Formal<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n            <div class=\"opm-counter-card\">\r\n                <h2 class=\"opm-text-neon-yellow\">$91B<\/h2>\r\n                <p>Valor de materiales perdidos<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n            <div class=\"opm-counter-card\">\r\n                <h2 class=\"opm-text-neon-green\">1000+<\/h2>\r\n                <p>Sustancias T\u00f3xicas<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h4 class=\"text-center mb-4\">Mec\u00e1nica de la Obsolescencia Percibida<\/h4>\r\n    <div class=\"opm-svg-container mb-5\" style=\"background: #0a0a0a; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid #333;\">\r\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n            <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"225\" r=\"150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#444\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,5\" \/>\r\n            \r\n            <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"225\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#ff00ff\" filter=\"url(#glow)\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"40;45;40\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" \/>\r\n            <\/circle>\r\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"230\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">DESEO<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <g transform=\"rotate(0 400 225)\">\r\n                <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"75\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#333\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" \/>\r\n                <text x=\"400\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#00ffff\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Moda<\/text>\r\n                <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" attributeType=\"XML\" type=\"rotate\" from=\"0 400 225\" to=\"360 400 225\" dur=\"20s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" \/>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n\r\n            <g transform=\"rotate(90 400 225)\">\r\n                <circle cx=\"550\" cy=\"225\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#333\" stroke=\"#ffcc00\" \/>\r\n                <text x=\"550\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#ffcc00\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Estatus<\/text>\r\n                <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" attributeType=\"XML\" type=\"rotate\" from=\"90 400 225\" to=\"450 400 225\" dur=\"20s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" \/>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n\r\n            <g transform=\"rotate(180 400 225)\">\r\n                <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"375\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#333\" stroke=\"#ff3333\" \/>\r\n                <text x=\"400\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#ff3333\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Marketing<\/text>\r\n                <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" attributeType=\"XML\" type=\"rotate\" from=\"180 400 225\" to=\"540 400 225\" dur=\"20s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" \/>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n\r\n            <g transform=\"rotate(270 400 225)\">\r\n                <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"225\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#333\" stroke=\"#32cd32\" \/>\r\n                <text x=\"250\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#32cd32\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Tendencias<\/text>\r\n                <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" attributeType=\"XML\" type=\"rotate\" from=\"270 400 225\" to=\"630 400 225\" dur=\"20s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" \/>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n\r\n            <path d=\"M550 350 L750 350\" stroke=\"#ff3333\" stroke-width=\"4\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red)\" \/>\r\n            <text x=\"650\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#ff3333\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\">FLUJO LINEAL (DESECHO)<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <defs>\r\n                <filter id=\"glow\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"3\" result=\"coloredBlur\"\/><feMerge><feMergeNode in=\"coloredBlur\"\/><feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/><\/feMerge><\/filter>\r\n                <marker id=\"arrow-red\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                    <path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 Z\" fill=\"#ff3333\" \/>\r\n                <\/marker>\r\n            <\/defs>\r\n        <\/svg>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"opm-interactive-block mb-5 p-4 bg-panel opm-border-cyan\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"opm-text-cyan mb-4\"><i class=\"fas fa-tools\"><\/i> Simulador de Decisi\u00f3n Sostenible<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Tu smartphone tiene la pantalla rota. \u00bfQu\u00e9 impacto generas seg\u00fan tu decisi\u00f3n?<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"row\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 text-center\">\r\n                <button class=\"opm-btn-outline-danger w-100 mb-2\" onclick=\"calcObs('buy')\">Comprar el Nuevo Modelo<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"opm-btn-outline-success w-100\" onclick=\"calcObs('repair')\">Reparar Pantalla (iFixit)<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                <div id=\"impactOutput\" class=\"p-3 opm-bg-black opm-border-dashed-orange\" style=\"min-height: 100px; font-family: 'VT323';\">\r\n                    Esperando decisi\u00f3n del usuario...\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n            <h5 class=\"opm-text-yellow\">An\u00e1lisis Interactivo<\/h5>\r\n            <label for=\"marketingSlider\">Nivel de Exposici\u00f3n a Marketing (1-10):<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"marketingSlider\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"5\" oninput=\"updateIop(this.value)\">\r\n            <p id=\"iopResult\">\u00cdndice de Obsolescencia Psicol\u00f3gica: Calculando...<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"opm-section-title opm-text-green\">3. El Contraataque: Right to Repair<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"row\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n            <div class=\"table-responsive\">\r\n                <table class=\"table opm-table-dark opm-table-hover\">\r\n                    <thead class=\"opm-text-yellow\">\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>Estrategia Anti-Reparaci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Consecuencia<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Soluci\u00f3n Sostenible<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr><td><strong>Serializaci\u00f3n<\/strong><\/td><td>Piezas bloqueadas por software.<\/td><td>Legislaci\u00f3n de Interoperabilidad.<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td><strong>Pegamento\/Soldadura<\/strong><\/td><td>Imposible abrir sin romper.<\/td><td>Dise\u00f1o Modular (Fairphone).<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td><strong>Falta de Manuales<\/strong><\/td><td>Monopolio del servicio t\u00e9cnico.<\/td><td>Plataformas Open Source (iFixit).<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"opm-interactive-block mt-5 p-4 opm-border-magenta\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"opm-text-magenta\">\ud83e\udde0 Desaf\u00edo Cr\u00edtico<\/h4>\r\n        <div id=\"quiz-obs\">\r\n            <p class=\"fs-5\">Si un producto funciona perfectamente pero decides tirarlo porque \"ya no se usa ese color\", \u00bfqu\u00e9 tipo de obsolescencia est\u00e1s validando?<\/p>\r\n            <button class=\"opm-btn-quiz-obs w-100 mb-2\" onclick=\"ansObs(1)\">Obsolescencia Percibida<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"opm-btn-quiz-obs w-100 mb-2\" onclick=\"ansObs(2)\">Obsolescencia Planificada<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"opm-btn-quiz-obs w-100 mb-2\" onclick=\"ansObs(3)\">Obsolescencia T\u00e9cnica<\/button>\r\n            <div id=\"obsFeedback\" class=\"mt-3\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"opm-section-title opm-text-yellow\">4. Errores Comunes del Estudiante<\/h2>\r\n    <p>En ex\u00e1menes y pr\u00e1cticas, los estudiantes suelen cometer estos errores t\u00edpicos. Haz clic para ver explicaciones:<\/p>\r\n    <ul class=\"opm-errors-list\">\r\n        <li onclick=\"showError(1)\">Confundir obsolescencia percibida con planificada.<\/li>\r\n        <div id=\"error1\" style=\"display:none;\">Explicaci\u00f3n: La percibida es psicol\u00f3gica (moda), mientras que la planificada es intencional por el fabricante (falla programada). Esto afecta el an\u00e1lisis de impactos ecosist\u00e9micos.<\/div>\r\n        <li onclick=\"showError(2)\">Subestimar el impacto en ecosistemas marinos de micropl\u00e1sticos.<\/li>\r\n        <div id=\"error2\" style=\"display:none;\">Explicaci\u00f3n: Ignorar que el 35% proviene de textiles lleva a evaluaciones incompletas de contaminaci\u00f3n en oc\u00e9anos, clave en ex\u00e1menes de ecosistemas.<\/div>\r\n        <li onclick=\"showError(3)\">No relacionar el E-Waste con extracci\u00f3n de minerales raros.<\/li>\r\n        <div id=\"error3\" style=\"display:none;\">Explicaci\u00f3n: Olvidar que el desperdicio implica m\u00e1s miner\u00eda (cobalto, litio) que destruye h\u00e1bitats, un error com\u00fan en razonamientos sist\u00e9micos.<\/div>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"opm-section-title opm-text-cyan\">5. Conexi\u00f3n con la Materia Base: Ecosistemas<\/h2>\r\n    <p>Esta lecci\u00f3n se alinea directamente con los contenidos oficiales del curso de Ecosistemas, espec\u00edficamente en temas de sostenibilidad, ciclos de materiales y perturbaciones antropog\u00e9nicas. La obsolescencia percibida agrava la desechabilidad sist\u00e9mica, alterando flujos de nutrientes y aumentando la entrop\u00eda en ecosistemas (ej. acidificaci\u00f3n oce\u00e1nica por pl\u00e1sticos). Este contenido es evaluable en ex\u00e1menes formales, enfoc\u00e1ndose en an\u00e1lisis de impactos humanos en biodiversidad y ciclos biogeoqu\u00edmicos.<\/p>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"opm-section-title opm-text-green\">6. Problemas Tipo Examen<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"opm-exam-problem\">\r\n        <p><strong>Problema 1:<\/strong> Calcula el impacto h\u00eddrico acumulado si una persona reemplaza 5 jeans al a\u00f1o por obsolescencia percibida. Justifica c\u00f3mo esto afecta ecosistemas acu\u00e1ticos.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"opm-exam-problem\">\r\n        <p><strong>Problema 2:<\/strong> Describe un ciclo vicioso entre el Efecto Diderot y el E-Waste, incluyendo razonamiento sobre sustancias t\u00f3xicas y su dispersi\u00f3n en el medio ambiente.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"opm-exam-problem\">\r\n        <p><strong>Problema 3:<\/strong> Prop\u00f3n una pol\u00edtica p\u00fablica basada en \"Right to Repair\" para reducir la obsolescencia percibida en electr\u00f3nicos. Interpreta su efecto en la biodiversidad.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"opm-section-title opm-text-magenta\">7. Cierre Metacognitivo<\/h2>\r\n    <p class=\"opm-reflection\">Reflexiona: \u00bfC\u00f3mo ha cambiado tu percepci\u00f3n del consumo personal tras esta lecci\u00f3n? \u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategias implementar\u00edas para contrarrestar la obsolescencia percibida en tu vida diaria, considerando impactos ecosist\u00e9micos? \u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es crucial diferenciar tipos de obsolescencia en evaluaciones ambientales?<\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction calcObs(choice) {\r\n    const out = document.getElementById('impactOutput');\r\n    if(choice === 'buy') {\r\n        out.innerHTML = \"<span class='text-danger'>IMPACTO ALTO:<\/span><br>+80kg CO2 eq. (producci\u00f3n)<br>+200g E-Waste t\u00f3xico<br>+Extracci\u00f3n de Cobalto en RDC.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        out.innerHTML = \"<span class='text-success'>IMPACTO BAJO:<\/span><br>-90% emisiones evitadas<br>Ahorro de $600 USD<br>Apoyo a econom\u00eda local de reparaci\u00f3n.\";\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction updateIop(value) {\r\n    const utilidadReal = 1; \/\/ Constante para simplicidad\r\n    const t = 1; \/\/ Tiempo unitario\r\n    const iop = (value \/ utilidadReal) * t;\r\n    document.getElementById('iopResult').innerHTML = `\u00cdndice de Obsolescencia Psicol\u00f3gica: ${iop.toFixed(2)} (Mayor exposici\u00f3n acelera el deseo de reemplazo)`;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction ansObs(option) {\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById('obsFeedback');\r\n    if(option === 1) {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"<div class='opm-alert-success'>\u00a1Exacto! El objeto es t\u00e9cnicamente funcional, pero el marketing ha 'vencido' su valor social en tu mente.<\/div>\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"<div class='opm-alert-danger'>Incorrecto. Si el producto funciona pero lo tiras por moda, es Percibida. La Planificada es cuando el fabricante lo rompe a prop\u00f3sito.<\/div>\";\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showError(id) {\r\n    const errorDiv = document.getElementById(`error${id}`);\r\n    errorDiv.style.display = errorDiv.style.display === 'none' ? 'block' : 'none';\r\n}\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el Efecto Diderot?","respuesta":"Espiral de consumo donde una compra nueva induce a otras para \"combinar\"."},{"enunciado":"Menciona 2 qu\u00edmicos t\u00f3xicos en el E-Waste.","respuesta":"Plomo, Mercurio, Cadmio."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1ntos litros de agua requiere un jean?","respuesta":"7,500 litros."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 porcentaje de E-Waste se recicla formalmente?","respuesta":"Aprox. 22.3%."},{"enunciado":"Diferencia entre obsolescencia planificada y percibida.","respuesta":"Planificada: falla t\u00e9cnica deliberada. Percibida: cambio est\u00e9tico\/moda."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la Miner\u00eda Urbana?","respuesta":"Recuperaci\u00f3n de metales preciosos de desechos electr\u00f3nicos."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es un dise\u00f1o modular?","respuesta":"Dise\u00f1o donde las piezas son f\u00e1cilmente intercambiables y reparables."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el impacto del Fast Fashion en el oc\u00e9ano?","respuesta":"Liberaci\u00f3n masiva de micropl\u00e1sticos textiles."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 exige el movimiento Right to Repair?","respuesta":"Acceso a manuales, piezas y herramientas para reparar dispositivos."},{"enunciado":"Define Huella H\u00eddrica.","respuesta":"Volumen total de agua dulce utilizada para producir un bien."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la serializaci\u00f3n de partes?","respuesta":"Bloqueo por software de componentes para impedir reparaciones no oficiales."},{"enunciado":"Menciona un ejemplo de obsolescencia sist\u00e9mica.","respuesta":"Cambio de puertos de carga (ej. USB-A a USB-C)."}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"La obsolescencia percibida se basa principalmente en:","opciones":["Fallas t\u00e9cnicas","Marketing y moda","Fin de vida \u00fatil","Leyes f\u00edsicas"],"correcta":"Marketing y moda"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 industria genera 92 millones de toneladas de residuos anuales?","opciones":["Electr\u00f3nica","Textil (Fast Fashion)","Automotriz","Alimentaria"],"correcta":"Textil (Fast Fashion)"},{"pregunta":"Principal obst\u00e1culo del E-Waste:","opciones":["No tiene valor","Contiene qu\u00edmicos t\u00f3xicos","Es biodegradable","Es f\u00e1cil de separar"],"correcta":"Contiene qu\u00edmicos t\u00f3xicos"},{"pregunta":"El movimiento Right to Repair busca:","opciones":["Prohibir ventas","Facilitar la reparaci\u00f3n","Aumentar impuestos","Eliminar garant\u00edas"],"correcta":"Facilitar la reparaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el Upcycling?","opciones":["Tirar basura","Reciclaje de bajo valor","Reutilizaci\u00f3n creativa con mayor valor","Quema de residuos"],"correcta":"Reutilizaci\u00f3n creativa con mayor valor"},{"pregunta":"El iPhone 16 lanzado cuando el 15 funciona es ejemplo de:","opciones":["Obs. T\u00e9cnica","Obs. Percibida","Obs. Ecol\u00f3gica","Obs. Estructural"],"correcta":"Obs. Percibida"},{"pregunta":"Porcentaje de emisiones globales del sector moda:","opciones":["1%","10%","50%","5%"],"correcta":"10%"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l mineral es cr\u00edtico en las bater\u00edas y genera conflictos \u00e9ticos?","opciones":["Hierro","Cobalto","Sal","Cuarzo"],"correcta":"Cobalto"},{"pregunta":"La \"Miner\u00eda Urbana\" extrae oro de:","opciones":["Cuevas","R\u00edos","Placas de circuito viejas","Estatua"],"correcta":"Placas de circuito viejas"},{"pregunta":"Un smartphone modular permite:","opciones":["Cambiar solo la c\u00e1mara rota","Tirarlo m\u00e1s r\u00e1pido","No usar bater\u00eda","Es un bloque s\u00f3lido"],"correcta":"Cambiar solo la c\u00e1mara rota"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la obsolescencia t\u00e9cnica?","opciones":["Moda pasar\u00e1","Fallo real de hardware","Caja fea","Precio alto"],"correcta":"Fallo real de hardware"},{"pregunta":"Desecho electr\u00f3nico mundial en 2024:","opciones":["62 Mt","1 Mt","500 Mt","10 Mt"],"correcta":"62 Mt"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 causa el Efecto Diderot?","opciones":["Ahorro","Consumo reactivo en cadena","Reparaci\u00f3n","Ecolog\u00eda"],"correcta":"Consumo reactivo en cadena"},{"pregunta":"S\u00edmbolo del Right to Repair:","opciones":["Un d\u00f3lar","Una llave de tuercas","Un rayo","Un \u00e1rbol"],"correcta":"Una llave de tuercas"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 las empresas usan pegamento en vez de tornillos?","opciones":["Es m\u00e1s fuerte","Dificulta la reparaci\u00f3n","Es m\u00e1s ecol\u00f3gico","Pesa menos"],"correcta":"Dificulta la reparaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"La mayor\u00eda de la ropa desechada termina en:","opciones":["Museos","Vertederos o quemada","Oc\u00e9ano directamente","Espacio"],"correcta":"Vertederos o quemada"},{"pregunta":"Un jean usa agua equivalente a beber por:","opciones":["1 d\u00eda","1 mes","7-10 a\u00f1os","1 hora"],"correcta":"7-10 a\u00f1os"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"Greenwashing\"?","opciones":["Lavar ropa verde","Falsa imagen ecol\u00f3gica","Plantar \u00e1rboles","Reciclar"],"correcta":"Falsa imagen ecol\u00f3gica"},{"pregunta":"La obsolescencia sist\u00e9mica ocurre por:","opciones":["Moda","Incompatibilidad de software\/puertos","Rotura f\u00edsica","Gusto"],"correcta":"Incompatibilidad de software\/puertos"},{"pregunta":"El cobalto se extrae principalmente en:","opciones":["Noruega","Rep\u00fablica Democr\u00e1tica del Congo","Chile","Jap\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Rep\u00fablica Democr\u00e1tica del Congo"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 promueve la econom\u00eda circular contra la obsolescencia?","opciones":["Desechar m\u00e1s","Mantenimiento y reuso","Publicidad enga\u00f1osa","Miner\u00eda virgen"],"correcta":"Mantenimiento y reuso"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el iFixit?","opciones":["Una tienda de Apple","Plataforma de gu\u00edas de reparaci\u00f3n","Un virus","Un modelo de smartphone"],"correcta":"Plataforma de gu\u00edas de reparaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"La obsolescencia percibida afecta m\u00e1s a:","opciones":["Comida","Tecnolog\u00eda y moda","Material de construcci\u00f3n","Ox\u00edgeno"],"correcta":"Tecnolog\u00eda y moda"},{"pregunta":"Principal gas invernadero de vertederos textiles:","opciones":["Ox\u00edgeno","Metano","Arg\u00f3n","Helio"],"correcta":"Metano"},{"pregunta":"La serializaci\u00f3n de partes impide:","opciones":["Prender el m\u00f3vil","Intercambiar piezas originales","Cargar la bater\u00eda","Ver videos"],"correcta":"Intercambiar piezas originales"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la \"Huella de Carbono\" de un m\u00f3vil?","opciones":["Su peso","CO2 emitido en su vida total","Su color","Su precio"],"correcta":"CO2 emitido en su vida total"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 significa \"E-Waste\"?","opciones":["Energ\u00eda desperdiciada","Basura electr\u00f3nica","Venta electr\u00f3nica","Internet"],"correcta":"Basura electr\u00f3nica"},{"pregunta":"Soluci\u00f3n para la obsolescencia de software:","opciones":["Comprar otro","Soporte t\u00e9cnico extendido","Borrar todo","Apagarlo"],"correcta":"Soporte t\u00e9cnico extendido"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la econom\u00eda de la funcionalidad?","opciones":["Comprar objetos","Pagar por el uso (servicio)","No usar nada","Robar"],"correcta":"Pagar por el uso (servicio)"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el fin \u00faltimo de la obsolescencia percibida?","opciones":["Ayudar al planeta","Maximizar ventas","Educar","Diversi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Maximizar ventas"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"obsolescencia-programada-master","titulo":"Obsolescencia Programada: Ingenier\u00eda del Desperdicio","contenido":"\r\n<div class=\"opp-lesson-carbon planned-obsolescence-master\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"intro-header text-center mb-5\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"display-3 opp-text-neon-orange\">DISE\u00d1ADO PARA MORIR<\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"fs-4 mx-auto\" style=\"max-width: 900px;\">\r\n            La <strong>Obsolescencia Programada<\/strong> es una estrategia deliberada de dise\u00f1o donde se acorta intencionalmente la vida \u00fatil de un producto para estimular el reemplazo frecuente. Esto genera impactos masivos en ecosistemas: mayor extracci\u00f3n de recursos, contaminaci\u00f3n t\u00f3xica y acumulaci\u00f3n de residuos (e-waste global: 62 Mt en 2022).\r\n        <\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"row mb-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n            <div class=\"opp-alert-carbon opp-border-orange text-center\">\r\n                <h4 class=\"opp-text-orange\"><i class=\"fas fa-chart-line\"><\/i> Modelo de Reemplazo \u00d3ptimo (\\( R_o \\))<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Las empresas optimizan la duraci\u00f3n para maximizar beneficios a largo plazo:<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"opp-eq-box fs-3 py-4\">\r\n                    \\[ R_o = \\max_T \\int_{0}^{T} [V(t) - C(t)] \\, dt \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <small class=\"text-muted\">Donde \\( V(t) \\) son ventas recurrentes y \\( C(t) \\) costos de garant\u00edas y p\u00e9rdida de reputaci\u00f3n.<\/small>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"opp-section-title opp-text-yellow\">1. El Pecado Original: El C\u00e1rtel Phoebus<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"row mb-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n            <p>En 1924-1925, fabricantes l\u00edderes (Osram, Philips, GE) formaron el c\u00e1rtel Phoebus para limitar la vida \u00fatil de bombillas incandescentes de ~2,500 horas a 1,000 horas, multando a quien excediera el l\u00edmite. Fue el primer caso documentado de obsolescencia programada a escala global.<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"p-3 bg-dark opp-border-left-orange\">\r\n                <h5 class=\"opp-text-neon-yellow\">Cronolog\u00eda Hist\u00f3rica:<\/h5>\r\n                <ul class=\"list-unstyled\">\r\n                    <li><i class=\"fas fa-lightbulb text-yellow\"><\/i> <strong>Pre-1924:<\/strong> Bombillas duraban 1,500-2,500 horas.<\/li>\r\n                    <li><i class=\"fas fa-handshake text-orange\"><\/i> <strong>1924:<\/strong> Formaci\u00f3n del c\u00e1rtel Phoebus.<\/li>\r\n                    <li><i class=\"fas fa-ban text-danger\"><\/i> <strong>1939:<\/strong> Disoluci\u00f3n por WWII, pero pr\u00e1ctica persiste.<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n            <div class=\"table-responsive\">\r\n                <table class=\"table opp-table-dark opp-table-hover opp-border-orange\">\r\n                    <thead class=\"opp-text-yellow\">\r\n                        <tr><th>Caso Moderno<\/th><th>Mecanismo de Obsolescencia<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr><td><strong>Impresoras<\/strong><\/td><td>Chips contadores que bloquean tras \"X\" p\u00e1ginas.<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td><strong>Smartphones<\/strong><\/td><td>Bater\u00edas soldadas y ralentizaci\u00f3n por software (ej. Batterygate).<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td><strong>Electrodom\u00e9sticos<\/strong><\/td><td>Componentes fr\u00e1giles (condensadores baratos en TVs).<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"opp-section-title opp-text-cyan\">2. Arquitectura de la Inutilidad<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"row mb-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"card opp-card opp-border-cyan p-3 h-100\">\r\n                <h4 class=\"opp-text-cyan text-center\">Software<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Actualizaciones que degradan rendimiento en hardware antiguo o cesan soporte.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"card opp-card opp-border-magenta p-3 h-100\">\r\n                <h4 class=\"opp-text-magenta text-center\">Sist\u00e9mica<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Cambios incompatibles en conectores o est\u00e1ndares.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"card opp-card opp-border-yellow p-3 h-100\">\r\n                <h4 class=\"opp-text-yellow text-center\">Materiales<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Uso de componentes de baja durabilidad cerca de partes cr\u00edticas.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h4 class=\"text-center mb-4\">Simulaci\u00f3n de Degradaci\u00f3n Programada<\/h4>\r\n    <div class=\"opp-svg-container mb-5\" style=\"background: #0a0a0a; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid #ff4500;\">\r\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n            <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"350\" x2=\"700\" y2=\"350\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"2\" \/>\r\n            <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"350\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"2\" \/>\r\n            <text x=\"600\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#666\" font-size=\"14\">TIEMPO (Meses)<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"50\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#666\" font-size=\"14\" transform=\"rotate(-90 50 200)\">FUNCIONALIDAD (%)<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <path d=\"M100 80 Q400 90 700 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00ff00\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,5\" opacity=\"0.6\" \/>\r\n            <text x=\"500\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#00ff00\" font-size=\"12\">Dise\u00f1o Duradero<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <path d=\"M100 80 Q350 100 400 350\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff3333\" stroke-width=\"5\" filter=\"url(#glow)\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"1000\" to=\"0\" dur=\"5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" \/>\r\n            <\/path>\r\n            <text x=\"350\" y=\"330\" fill=\"#ff3333\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\">FALLA PROGRAMADA<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <defs>\r\n                <filter id=\"glow\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"4\" result=\"coloredBlur\"\/><feMerge><feMergeNode in=\"coloredBlur\"\/><feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/><\/feMerge><\/filter>\r\n            <\/defs>\r\n        <\/svg>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"opp-interactive-block mb-5 p-4 opp-border-yellow\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"opp-text-yellow mb-4\"><i class=\"fas fa-balance-scale\"><\/i> Simulador: El Dilema del Fabricante<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Eres CEO de una empresa de TVs. Elige la durabilidad de condensadores:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"row\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 text-center\">\r\n                <button class=\"opp-btn-outline-danger w-100 mb-2\" onclick=\"simPlann('evil')\">Condensadores baratos (vida ~2 a\u00f1os)<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"opp-btn-outline-success w-100\" onclick=\"simPlann('good')\">Condensadores premium (vida ~10 a\u00f1os)<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                <div id=\"simFeedback\" class=\"p-3 opp-bg-black\" style=\"min-height: 150px; font-family: 'VT323';\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n            <label for=\"durabilitySlider\">Ajusta vida \u00fatil planeada (meses): <\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"durabilitySlider\" min=\"12\" max=\"120\" value=\"24\" oninput=\"updateDegrad(this.value)\">\r\n            <p id=\"degradResult\">Impacto ambiental: Calculando...<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"opp-section-title opp-text-green\">3. Hacia el Dise\u00f1o \u00c9tico y Sostenible<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"row mb-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n            <div class=\"p-3 bg-dark opp-border-green\">\r\n                <h4 class=\"opp-text-green\">Avances Regulatorios (UE 2025)<\/h4>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li><strong>Ecodesign 2025:<\/strong> Mayor durabilidad, resistencia y reparabilidad obligatoria en smartphones\/tablets.<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>Bater\u00edas 2027:<\/strong> Removibles y reemplazables por el usuario sin herramientas especiales.<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>\u00cdndice de Reparabilidad:<\/strong> Etiquetado obligatorio y prohibici\u00f3n de pr\u00e1cticas anti-reparaci\u00f3n.<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"opp-interactive-block mt-5 p-4 opp-border-magenta\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"opp-text-magenta\">\ud83e\udde0 Quiz Autoevaluado<\/h4>\r\n        <p class=\"fs-5\">\u00bfQu\u00e9 diferencia principal hay entre obsolescencia programada y percibida?<\/p>\r\n        <button class=\"opp-btn-outline-danger w-100 mb-2\" onclick=\"ansQuiz(1)\">Programada es por moda, percibida por falla t\u00e9cnica.<\/button>\r\n        <button class=\"opp-btn-outline-success w-100 mb-2\" onclick=\"ansQuiz(2)\">Programada es intencional del fabricante, percibida es psicol\u00f3gica.<\/button>\r\n        <button class=\"opp-btn-outline-danger w-100 mb-2\" onclick=\"ansQuiz(3)\">Ambas son lo mismo.<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"quizFeedback\" class=\"mt-3\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"opp-section-title opp-text-yellow\">4. Errores Comunes del Estudiante<\/h2>\r\n    <p>Haz clic para revelar explicaciones de errores t\u00edpicos en ex\u00e1menes:<\/p>\r\n    <ul class=\"opp-errors-list\">\r\n        <li onclick=\"showError(1)\">Confundir programada con percibida.<\/li>\r\n        <div id=\"error1\" style=\"display:none;\">Explicaci\u00f3n: Programada es falla inducida por dise\u00f1o; percibida es deseo por novedad. Error com\u00fan al analizar impactos ecosist\u00e9micos.<\/div>\r\n        <li onclick=\"showError(2)\">Ignorar el rol hist\u00f3rico del c\u00e1rtel Phoebus.<\/li>\r\n        <div id=\"error2\" style=\"display:none;\">Explicaci\u00f3n: Fue el origen moderno; omitirlo debilita argumentos sobre \u00e9tica empresarial en evaluaciones.<\/div>\r\n        <li onclick=\"showError(3)\">Subestimar avances regulatorios UE.<\/li>\r\n        <div id=\"error3\" style=\"display:none;\">Explicaci\u00f3n: Ecodesign 2025 y bater\u00edas 2027 son clave para razonar soluciones sostenibles.<\/div>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"opp-section-title opp-text-cyan\">5. Conexi\u00f3n con la Materia Base: Ecosistemas<\/h2>\r\n    <p>Este tema se integra en los contenidos oficiales de Ecosistemas, enfocando perturbaciones antropog\u00e9nicas, ciclos biogeoqu\u00edmicos alterados por contaminantes t\u00f3xicos (e-waste) y p\u00e9rdida de biodiversidad por miner\u00eda intensiva. La obsolescencia programada agrava la crisis de residuos, evaluable en an\u00e1lisis de sostenibilidad y \u00e9tica ambiental.<\/p>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"opp-section-title opp-text-green\">6. Problemas Tipo Examen<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"opp-exam-problem\">\r\n        <p><strong>Problema 1:<\/strong> Explica c\u00f3mo el c\u00e1rtel Phoebus ejemplifica obsolescencia programada y calcula su impacto hipot\u00e9tico en generaci\u00f3n de residuos si bombillas duraran 2,500 vs 1,000 horas (asumiendo uso anual promedio).<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"opp-exam-problem\">\r\n        <p><strong>Problema 2:<\/strong> Analiza el dilema \u00e9tico del fabricante: justifica por qu\u00e9 elegir durabilidad reduce impactos ecosist\u00e9micos (contaminaci\u00f3n, extracci\u00f3n recursos).<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"opp-exam-problem\">\r\n        <p><strong>Problema 3:<\/strong> Eval\u00faa el efecto de las regulaciones UE (2025-2027) en reducci\u00f3n de e-waste global, proponiendo extensiones a otros continentes.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"opp-section-title opp-text-magenta\">7. Cierre Metacognitivo<\/h2>\r\n    <p class=\"opp-reflection\">Reflexiona: \u00bfC\u00f3mo influye la obsolescencia programada en tus decisiones de consumo? \u00bfQu\u00e9 acciones personales o pol\u00edticas promover\u00edas para un dise\u00f1o \u00e9tico que preserve ecosistemas? \u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es esencial diferenciarla de otros tipos en an\u00e1lisis ambientales?<\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction simPlann(type) {\r\n    const out = document.getElementById('simFeedback');\r\n    if(type === 'evil') {\r\n        out.innerHTML = \"<span class='text-danger'>GANANCIAS CORToplacistas:<\/span><br>+20% ventas iniciales<br>Pero: +1M toneladas e-waste<br>Multas UE post-2025 y p\u00e9rdida reputaci\u00f3n.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        out.innerHTML = \"<span class='text-success'>LIDERAZGO SOSTENIBLE:<\/span><br>+40% lealtad clientes<br>Cumplimiento regulaciones UE<br>Reducci\u00f3n emisiones y residuos.\";\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction updateDegrad(months) {\r\n    const wasteFactor = 120 \/ months; \/\/ Mayor si vida corta\r\n    document.getElementById('degradResult').innerHTML = `Vida \u00fatil: ${months} meses<br>Factor multiplicador residuos: ${wasteFactor.toFixed(1)}x<br>(Mayor duraci\u00f3n = menor impacto ecosist\u00e9mico)`;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction ansQuiz(option) {\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById('quizFeedback');\r\n    if(option === 2) {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"<div class='opp-alert-success'>\u00a1Correcto! La programada es deliberada por el fabricante; la percibida, inducida por marketing\/moda.<\/div>\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"<div class='opp-alert-danger'>Incorrecto. Revisa la definici\u00f3n: programada implica ingenier\u00eda intencional de falla.<\/div>\";\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showError(id) {\r\n    const div = document.getElementById(`error${id}`);\r\n    div.style.display = div.style.display === 'none' ? 'block' : 'none';\r\n}\r\n<\/script>","quiz":[{"pregunta":"El C\u00e1rtel Phoebus limit\u00f3 las bombillas a:","opciones":["500 h","1,000 h","5,000 h","100 h"],"correcta":"1,000 h"},{"pregunta":"Tipo de obsolescencia que ocurre por falta de repuestos:","opciones":["Econ\u00f3mica","T\u00e9cnica\/Reparabilidad","Psicol\u00f3gica","Est\u00e9tica"],"correcta":"T\u00e9cnica\/Reparabilidad"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 sucede si una impresora Epson llega a su l\u00edmite de p\u00e1ginas?","opciones":["Se apaga para siempre","Pide servicio t\u00e9cnico (aunque funcione)","Se quema","Imprime mejor"],"correcta":"Pide servicio t\u00e9cnico (aunque funcione)"},{"pregunta":"Principal consecuencia ambiental de la obsolescencia:","opciones":["M\u00e1s \u00e1rboles","Agotamiento de recursos y E-Waste","Menos basura","Energ\u00eda limpia"],"correcta":"Agotamiento de recursos y E-Waste"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la obsolescencia de software?","opciones":["El PC se rompe","El sistema operativo deja de ser compatible con apps","La pantalla se apaga","El rat\u00f3n no sirve"],"correcta":"El sistema operativo deja de ser compatible con apps"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l de estos NO es un m\u00e9todo de obsolescencia programada?","opciones":["Bater\u00eda soldada","Tornillos especiales","Dise\u00f1o modular","Fin de soporte de software"],"correcta":"Dise\u00f1o modular"},{"pregunta":"Valor estimado de metales perdidos en basura electr\u00f3nica anual:","opciones":["$1M","$62.5 billones","$100","Gratis"],"correcta":"$62.5 billones"},{"pregunta":"En Francia, la obsolescencia programada es:","opciones":["Obligatoria","Un delito penal","Un premio","Legal"],"correcta":"Un delito penal"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 busca el \u00cdndice de Reparabilidad?","opciones":["Subir precios","Informar qu\u00e9 tan f\u00e1cil es arreglar un producto","Vender m\u00e1s","Ocultar fallas"],"correcta":"Informar qu\u00e9 tan f\u00e1cil es arreglar un producto"},{"pregunta":"Empresa famosa por el dise\u00f1o modular reparable:","opciones":["Apple","Fairphone","Samsung","Tesla"],"correcta":"Fairphone"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 mineral cr\u00edtico en bater\u00edas genera dilemas \u00e9ticos?","opciones":["Sal","Cobalto","Oro","Cobre"],"correcta":"Cobalto"},{"pregunta":"La obsolescencia indirecta ocurre cuando:","opciones":["Se rompe el motor","Se pierde el cargador y ya no fabrican ese modelo","No te gusta el color","Sube la luz"],"correcta":"Se pierde el cargador y ya no fabrican ese modelo"},{"pregunta":"E-Waste generado por obsolescencia al a\u00f1o aprox:","opciones":["1 Mt","50 Mt","500 Mt","0 Mt"],"correcta":"50 Mt"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la obsolescencia ecol\u00f3gica?","opciones":["El producto es verde","Reemplazo por un modelo m\u00e1s eficiente (justificado)","Tirar basura al r\u00edo","No usar nada"],"correcta":"Reemplazo por un modelo m\u00e1s eficiente (justificado)"},{"pregunta":"Componente electr\u00f3nico que falla por calor cerca de fuentes de energ\u00eda:","opciones":["Cable","Condensador","Carcasa","Bot\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Condensador"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 impide que abras un iPhone moderno f\u00e1cilmente?","opciones":["Un im\u00e1n","Pegamento y tornillos pentalobe","Magia","No se puede abrir"],"correcta":"Pegamento y tornillos pentalobe"},{"pregunta":"La obsolescencia funcional ocurre cuando:","opciones":["Falla una pieza clave irreversiblemente","No es bonito","Es muy grande","Lento"],"correcta":"Falla una pieza clave irreversiblemente"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"Greenwashing\" en electr\u00f3nica?","opciones":["Lavar el m\u00f3vil","Fingir que un producto es ecol\u00f3gico siendo obsoleto","Pintarlo de verde","Reciclar todo"],"correcta":"Fingir que un producto es ecol\u00f3gico siendo obsoleto"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 la UE obliga al USB-C universal?","opciones":["Es m\u00e1s bonito","Para reducir basura de cables incompatibles","Para ganar dinero","Es m\u00e1s lento"],"correcta":"Para reducir basura de cables incompatibles"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 pa\u00eds NO pertenece al C\u00e1rtel Phoebus original?","opciones":["Alemania","EE.UU.","Brasil","Francia"],"correcta":"Brasil"},{"pregunta":"La obsolescencia programada fomenta una econom\u00eda:","opciones":["Circular","Lineal","Sostenible","De trueque"],"correcta":"Lineal"},{"pregunta":"Un smartphone promedio se cambia cada:","opciones":["10 a\u00f1os","18-24 meses","50 a\u00f1os","1 mes"],"correcta":"18-24 meses"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la \"e-residuos\" o chatarra electr\u00f3nica?","opciones":["Basura de comida","Aparatos el\u00e9ctricos desechados","Papel viejo","Pl\u00e1stico"],"correcta":"Aparatos el\u00e9ctricos desechados"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la garant\u00eda legal?","opciones":["Un papel","Periodo donde el fabricante debe reparar fallas","Un seguro caro","No existe"],"correcta":"Periodo donde el fabricante debe reparar fallas"},{"pregunta":"Componente que limita la vida de las pantallas LCD:","opciones":["El cristal","La retroiluminaci\u00f3n","El marco","El cable"],"correcta":"La retroiluminaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 promueve el \"Upcycling\"?","opciones":["Tirar basura","Dar un uso de mayor valor a algo viejo","Quemar cables","Comprar m\u00e1s"],"correcta":"Dar un uso de mayor valor a algo viejo"},{"pregunta":"La obsolescencia de deseos es sin\u00f3nimo de:","opciones":["Obs. T\u00e9cnica","Obs. Percibida","Obs. Mec\u00e1nica","Obs. Real"],"correcta":"Obs. Percibida"},{"pregunta":"Principal gas emitido al fabricar un m\u00f3vil nuevo:","opciones":["Ox\u00edgeno","CO2","Helio","Arg\u00f3n"],"correcta":"CO2"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la econom\u00eda circular?","opciones":["Hacer c\u00edrculos","Sistema que busca residuo cero y reutilizaci\u00f3n","Vender m\u00e1s r\u00e1pido","Lineal"],"correcta":"Sistema que busca residuo cero y reutilizaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el fin \u00faltimo de esta pr\u00e1ctica?","opciones":["Ayudar al planeta","Maximizar el lucro corporativo","Educar","Diversi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Maximizar el lucro corporativo"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"fast-fashion-master","titulo":"Fast Fashion: La Anatom\u00eda del Exceso","contenido":"\r\n<div class=\"ffm-lesson-carbon fast-fashion-master\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"intro-header text-center mb-5\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"display-3 ffm-text-neon-pink\">MODA DESECHABLE<\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"fs-4 mx-auto\" style=\"max-width: 900px;\">\r\n            El <strong>Fast Fashion<\/strong> acelera la extracci\u00f3n lineal de recursos, convirtiendo materiales finitos en residuos t\u00f3xicos a un ritmo que excede la regeneraci\u00f3n planetaria. Genera ~92 millones de toneladas de desechos textiles anuales, contribuye al 10% de emisiones globales de CO\u2082 y al 35% de micropl\u00e1sticos oce\u00e1nicos.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"row mb-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n            <div class=\"ffm-alert-carbon ffm-border-pink text-center\">\r\n                <h4 class=\"ffm-text-magenta\"><i class=\"fas fa-tint\"><\/i> Huella H\u00eddrica de una Prenda (\\( W_f \\))<\/h4>\r\n                <p>El consumo total incluye riego, procesamiento y diluci\u00f3n de contaminantes:<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"ffm-eq-box fs-3 py-4\">\r\n                    \\[ W_f = V_{\\text{riego}} + V_{\\text{proceso}} + V_{\\text{diluci\u00f3n}} \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <small class=\"text-muted\">Para una camiseta de algod\u00f3n: \\( W_f \\approx 2,700 \\) litros (equivalente a 900 d\u00edas de agua potable para una persona).<\/small>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"ffm-section-title ffm-text-pink\">1. La Segunda Industria m\u00e1s Contaminante<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"row mb-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-7\">\r\n            <p>La hiperproducci\u00f3n impacta tres frentes ecosist\u00e9micos clave:<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"ffm-stats-box p-4 bg-dark ffm-border-left-magenta\">\r\n                <ul class=\"list-unstyled\">\r\n                    <li class=\"mb-3\">\r\n                        <strong class=\"ffm-text-cyan\"><i class=\"fas fa-microscope\"><\/i> Micropl\u00e1sticos:<\/strong> \r\n                        35% de micropl\u00e1sticos primarios en oc\u00e9anos provienen del lavado de sint\u00e9ticos (~500,000 toneladas\/a\u00f1o).\r\n                    <\/li>\r\n                    <li class=\"mb-3\">\r\n                        <strong class=\"ffm-text-orange\"><i class=\"fas fa-cloud-sun\"><\/i> Emisiones:<\/strong> \r\n                        10% de CO\u2082 global (m\u00e1s que aviaci\u00f3n + mar\u00edtimo combinados).\r\n                    <\/li>\r\n                    <li class=\"mb-3\">\r\n                        <strong class=\"ffm-text-yellow\"><i class=\"fas fa-skull-crossbones\"><\/i> Toxicidad:<\/strong> \r\n                        ~20% de contaminaci\u00f3n industrial de agua dulce por te\u00f1ido y tratamientos.\r\n                    <\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-5\">\r\n            <!-- Espacio reservado -->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"ffm-section-title ffm-text-cyan\">2. Del Fast Fashion al Ultra-Fast<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"table-responsive mb-5\">\r\n        <table class=\"table ffm-table-dark ffm-table-hover ffm-border-magenta\">\r\n            <thead class=\"ffm-text-yellow\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Modelo<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Ciclo de Dise\u00f1o<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Prendas Nuevas \/ D\u00eda<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Impacto \u00c9tico\/Ambiental<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/thead>\r\n            <tbody>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td><strong>Moda Tradicional<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                    <td>6-9 meses<\/td>\r\n                    <td>M\u00ednimas<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Bajo<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td><strong>Fast Fashion (Zara)<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                    <td>3-4 semanas<\/td>\r\n                    <td>~500<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Precariedad laboral<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr class=\"bg-danger\">\r\n                    <td><strong>Ultra-Fast (Shein)<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                    <td>3-7 d\u00edas<\/td>\r\n                    <td>6,000-10,000<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Trabajo forzado denunciado + m\u00e1ximo desperdicio<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/tbody>\r\n        <\/table>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h4 class=\"text-center mb-4 ffm-text-magenta\">Ciclo Lineal vs. Circularidad<\/h4>\r\n    <div class=\"ffm-svg-container mb-5\" style=\"background: #0a0a0a; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid #ff1493;\">\r\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"180\" width=\"140\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"#ff00ff\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"15\" \/>\r\n            <text x=\"120\" y=\"225\" fill=\"#ff00ff\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">EXTRACCI\u00d3N<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <rect x=\"320\" y=\"180\" width=\"140\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"15\" \/>\r\n            <text x=\"390\" y=\"225\" fill=\"#00ffff\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">PRODUCCI\u00d3N \/ CONSUMO<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <rect x=\"590\" y=\"180\" width=\"140\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"#ff3333\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"15\" \/>\r\n            <text x=\"660\" y=\"225\" fill=\"#ff3333\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">VERTEDERO \/ INCINERACI\u00d3N<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <path d=\"M190 220 L320 220 M460 220 L590 220\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,5\" \/>\r\n            \r\n            <circle r=\"8\" fill=\"#ff3333\" cx=\"460\" cy=\"220\">\r\n                <animateMotion path=\"M460 220 L590 220\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" \/>\r\n            <\/circle>\r\n\r\n            <path d=\"M390 180 Q390 50 120 180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00ff00\" stroke-width=\"4\" opacity=\"0.7\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0.7;1;0.7\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" \/>\r\n            <\/path>\r\n            <text x=\"255\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#00ff00\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">RECICLAJE \/ UPCYCLING<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <defs>\r\n                <marker id=\"arrow-green\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                    <path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 Z\" fill=\"#00ff00\" \/>\r\n                <\/marker>\r\n            <\/defs>\r\n        <\/svg>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"ffm-interactive-block mb-5 p-4 ffm-border-yellow\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"ffm-text-yellow mb-4\"><i class=\"fas fa-tshirt\"><\/i> Simulador: Regla #30Wears<\/h4>\r\n        <p>\u00bfCu\u00e1ntas veces usar\u00e1s esa prenda nueva?<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"row\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 text-center\">\r\n                <button class=\"ffm-btn-outline-danger w-100 mb-2\" onclick=\"calcModa('less')\">Menos de 10 veces<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"ffm-btn-outline-success w-100\" onclick=\"calcModa('more')\">M\u00e1s de 30 veces<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                <div id=\"modaFeedback\" class=\"p-3 ffm-bg-black ffm-border-dashed-cyan\" style=\"min-height: 120px; font-family: 'VT323';\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n            <label for=\"usesSlider\">Ajusta usos previstos: <\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"usesSlider\" min=\"1\" max=\"100\" value=\"10\" oninput=\"updateWears(this.value)\">\r\n            <p id=\"wearsResult\">Huella calculada: Esperando...<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"ffm-section-title ffm-text-green\">3. Estrategias de Mitigaci\u00f3n: Hacia la Slow Fashion<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"row mb-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n            <div class=\"p-3 bg-dark ffm-border-cyan\">\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Compra segunda mano o alquiler.<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Reparaci\u00f3n y upcycling.<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Armario c\u00e1psula y materiales sostenibles (org\u00e1nico\/reciclado).<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Apoyo a regulaciones UE para recolecci\u00f3n separada de textiles (2025+).<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"ffm-interactive-block mt-5 p-4 ffm-border-magenta\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"ffm-text-magenta\">\ud83e\udde0 Quiz Autoevaluado<\/h4>\r\n        <p class=\"fs-5\">\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el principal origen de micropl\u00e1sticos en oc\u00e9anos relacionado con moda?<\/p>\r\n        <button class=\"ffm-btn-outline-danger w-100 mb-2\" onclick=\"ansQuiz(1)\">Desecho de prendas enteras<\/button>\r\n        <button class=\"ffm-btn-outline-success w-100 mb-2\" onclick=\"ansQuiz(2)\">Lavado de fibras sint\u00e9ticas<\/button>\r\n        <button class=\"ffm-btn-outline-danger w-100 mb-2\" onclick=\"ansQuiz(3)\">Producci\u00f3n de algod\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"quizFeedback\" class=\"mt-3\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"ffm-section-title ffm-text-yellow\">4. Errores Comunes del Estudiante<\/h2>\r\n    <p>Haz clic para revelar explicaciones de errores frecuentes en ex\u00e1menes:<\/p>\r\n    <ul class=\"ffm-errors-list\">\r\n        <li onclick=\"showError(1)\">Subestimar el % de emisiones CO\u2082 de la industria textil.<\/li>\r\n        <div id=\"error1\" style=\"display:none;\">Explicaci\u00f3n: 10% global, m\u00e1s que aviaci\u00f3n + mar\u00edtimo; clave para an\u00e1lisis de perturbaciones antropog\u00e9nicas.<\/div>\r\n        <li onclick=\"showError(2)\">Confundir origen de micropl\u00e1sticos con pl\u00e1sticos macro.<\/li>\r\n        <div id=\"error2\" style=\"display:none;\">Explicaci\u00f3n: 35% proviene de lavado sint\u00e9ticos, no botellas; afecta cadenas tr\u00f3ficas marinas.<\/div>\r\n        <li onclick=\"showError(3)\">Ignorar diferencia fast vs. ultra-fast.<\/li>\r\n        <div id=\"error3\" style=\"display:none;\">Explicaci\u00f3n: Ultra-fast (Shein) multiplica impactos por volumen extremo.<\/div>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"ffm-section-title ffm-text-cyan\">5. Conexi\u00f3n con la Materia Base: Ecosistemas<\/h2>\r\n    <p>Este subtema se alinea con contenidos oficiales de Ecosistemas: impactos antropog\u00e9nicos en ciclos h\u00eddricos, biogeoqu\u00edmicos (C, N, P v\u00eda contaminantes) y biodiversidad marina (micropl\u00e1sticos). Fast fashion altera flujos de materiales y genera perturbaciones irreversibles, evaluable en ex\u00e1menes de sostenibilidad y \u00e9tica ambiental.<\/p>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"ffm-section-title ffm-text-green\">6. Problemas Tipo Examen<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"ffm-exam-problem\">\r\n        <p><strong>Problema 1:<\/strong> Calcula la huella h\u00eddrica acumulada de 10 camisetas de algod\u00f3n y explica su impacto en ecosistemas acu\u00e1ticos continentales.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"ffm-exam-problem\">\r\n        <p><strong>Problema 2:<\/strong> Analiza c\u00f3mo el modelo ultra-fast agrava la generaci\u00f3n de ~92 Mt de desechos textiles anuales, relacion\u00e1ndolo con ciclos de nutrientes.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"ffm-exam-problem\">\r\n        <p><strong>Problema 3:<\/strong> Prop\u00f3n medidas basadas en econom\u00eda circular para mitigar micropl\u00e1sticos textiles, evaluando efectos en biodiversidad oce\u00e1nica.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"ffm-section-title ffm-text-magenta\">7. Cierre Metacognitivo<\/h2>\r\n    <p class=\"ffm-reflection\">Reflexiona: \u00bfC\u00f3mo influye tu consumo de moda en ecosistemas globales? \u00bfQu\u00e9 cambios personales adoptar\u00edas aplicando #30Wears? \u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es crucial regular ultra-fast fashion para preservar ciclos biogeoqu\u00edmicos?<\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction calcModa(type) {\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById('modaFeedback');\r\n    if(type === 'less') {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"<span class='text-danger'>IMPACTO ALTO:<\/span><br>Alimentas el ciclo lineal: +micropl\u00e1sticos por lavados, +desechos r\u00e1pidos y mayor extracci\u00f3n recursos.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"<span class='text-success'>IMPACTO REDUCIDO:<\/span><br>Extiendes vida \u00fatil: -80% huella relativa, menos emisiones y apoyo a circularidad.\";\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction updateWears(uses) {\r\n    const baseWater = 2700; \/\/ Litros por camiseta\r\n    const impact = uses < 30 ? 'alto' : 'bajo';\r\n    const reduction = uses > 30 ? ((uses - 30)\/uses * 100).toFixed(0) : 0;\r\n    document.getElementById('wearsResult').innerHTML = `Usos: ${uses}<br>Huella relativa: ${impact} ${reduction > 0 ? `(reducci\u00f3n ~${reduction}%)` : ''}`;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction ansQuiz(option) {\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById('quizFeedback');\r\n    if(option === 2) {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"<div class='ffm-alert-success'>\u00a1Correcto! El lavado de sint\u00e9ticos libera microfibras (35% micropl\u00e1sticos oce\u00e1nicos).<\/div>\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        fb.innerHTML = \"<div class='ffm-alert-danger'>Incorrecto. El principal es lavado de poli\u00e9ster\/nylon, no desechos macro o algod\u00f3n.<\/div>\";\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showError(id) {\r\n    const div = document.getElementById(`error${id}`);\r\n    div.style.display = div.style.display === 'none' ? 'block' : 'none';\r\n}\r\n<\/script>","quiz":[{"pregunta":"El Fast Fashion es la ___ industria m\u00e1s contaminante del mundo.","opciones":["1\u00aa","2\u00aa","5\u00aa","10\u00aa"],"correcta":"2\u00aa"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 material desprende micropl\u00e1sticos al lavarse?","opciones":["Algod\u00f3n","Lino","Poli\u00e9ster","Lana"],"correcta":"Poli\u00e9ster"},{"pregunta":"Producci\u00f3n anual de prendas de vestir en el mundo:","opciones":["100 millones","100 mil millones","1 bill\u00f3n","10 millones"],"correcta":"100 mil millones"},{"pregunta":"Litros de agua para producir un solo par de jeans:","opciones":["10 L","100 L","7,500 L","50,000 L"],"correcta":"7,500 L"},{"pregunta":"Principal gas de efecto invernadero emitido por esta industria:","opciones":["Ox\u00edgeno","CO2","Arg\u00f3n","Helio"],"correcta":"CO2"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"Slow Fashion\"?","opciones":["Moda para tortugas","Consumo consciente y ropa duradera","Comprar ropa r\u00e1pido","Ropa deportiva"],"correcta":"Consumo consciente y ropa duradera"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1ntas veces se usa una prenda fast fashion en promedio antes de tirarse?","opciones":["50 veces","7 a 10 veces","100 veces","1 vez"],"correcta":"7 a 10 veces"},{"pregunta":"Marca pionera en el modelo \"Ultra-Fast Fashion\":","opciones":["Patagonia","Shein","Levi's","Adidas"],"correcta":"Shein"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfD\u00f3nde se encuentra uno de los vertederos textiles m\u00e1s grandes del mundo?","opciones":["Selva Amaz\u00f3nica","Desierto de Atacama","Polo Norte","Par\u00eds"],"correcta":"Desierto de Atacama"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 fibra natural requiere gran cantidad de pesticidas y agua?","opciones":["C\u00e1\u00f1amo","Algod\u00f3n convencional","Poli\u00e9ster","Nylon"],"correcta":"Algod\u00f3n convencional"},{"pregunta":"El te\u00f1ido de textiles es responsable del ___ de la contaminaci\u00f3n industrial del agua.","opciones":["5%","20%","50%","80%"],"correcta":"20%"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"Greenwashing\" en la moda?","opciones":["Lavar ropa verde","Falsas promesas de sostenibilidad para vender m\u00e1s","Plantar \u00e1rboles","Usar tintes naturales"],"correcta":"Falsas promesas de sostenibilidad para vender m\u00e1s"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 significa \"Upcycling\"?","opciones":["Tirar ropa","Crear algo de mayor valor a partir de residuos","Reciclar papel","Comprar ropa nueva"],"correcta":"Crear algo de mayor valor a partir de residuos"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 porcentaje de ropa se recicla realmente para hacer ropa nueva?","opciones":["Menos del 1%","50%","80%","10%"],"correcta":"Menos del 1%"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el principal destino de la ropa donada que no se vende?","opciones":["Se guarda para siempre","Pa\u00edses en desarrollo (vertederos)","Se regala a millonarios","Se quema en tiendas"],"correcta":"Pa\u00edses en desarrollo (vertederos)"},{"pregunta":"El poli\u00e9ster es un material derivado de:","opciones":["Plantas","Petr\u00f3leo","Animales","Arena"],"correcta":"Petr\u00f3leo"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 promueve la \"Econom\u00eda Circular\"?","opciones":["Comprar y tirar","Mantener productos en uso el mayor tiempo posible","Hacer ropa redonda","Vender m\u00e1s r\u00e1pido"],"correcta":"Mantener productos en uso el mayor tiempo posible"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"\u00cdndice Higg\"?","opciones":["Un precio","Herramienta para medir el impacto ambiental de materiales","Una marca de ropa","Un tipo de tela"],"correcta":"Herramienta para medir el impacto ambiental de materiales"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la alternativa m\u00e1s sostenible para el consumidor?","opciones":["Comprar ropa ecol\u00f3gica nueva cada semana","Usar lo que ya tienes y comprar de segunda mano","Quemar la ropa vieja","No usar ropa"],"correcta":"Usar lo que ya tienes y comprar de segunda mano"},{"pregunta":"La industria de la moda genera m\u00e1s emisiones que:","opciones":["Los volcanes","Los vuelos internacionales y transporte mar\u00edtimo","Los humanos al respirar","Las vacas"],"correcta":"Los vuelos internacionales y transporte mar\u00edtimo"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el trabajo forzado en la cadena de suministro?","opciones":["Gimnasia laboral","Explotaci\u00f3n de personas sin libertad o bajo amenaza","Trabajar mucho tiempo","Pagar poco"],"correcta":"Explotaci\u00f3n de personas sin libertad o bajo amenaza"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la \"Huella H\u00eddrica\"?","opciones":["Manchas de agua en la ropa","Volumen total de agua dulce usada para producir algo","Caminar bajo la lluvia","El color del agua"],"correcta":"Volumen total de agua dulce usada para producir algo"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo ayudan las tiendas de alquiler de ropa?","opciones":["Venden m\u00e1s barato","Reducen la necesidad de producir prendas nuevas de gala","Regalan ropa","Son m\u00e1s r\u00e1pidas"],"correcta":"Reducen la necesidad de producir prendas nuevas de gala"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la \"Responsabilidad Extendida del Productor\"?","opciones":["Que el cliente limpie la tienda","Que la marca se encargue del desecho de sus productos","Que el due\u00f1o trabaje m\u00e1s","Pagar impuestos"],"correcta":"Que la marca se encargue del desecho de sus productos"},{"pregunta":"Pa\u00eds famoso por el desastre del Rana Plaza (explotaci\u00f3n textil):","opciones":["Jap\u00f3n","Bangladesh","Canad\u00e1","Espa\u00f1a"],"correcta":"Bangladesh"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 fibra es m\u00e1s ecol\u00f3gica entre estas?","opciones":["Algod\u00f3n convencional","C\u00e1\u00f1amo (Hemp)","Poli\u00e9ster","Acr\u00edlico"],"correcta":"C\u00e1\u00f1amo (Hemp)"},{"pregunta":"Las microfibras sint\u00e9ticas entran en la cadena alimenticia a trav\u00e9s de:","opciones":["El aire","Peces y fauna marina","Las plantas","Los dulces"],"correcta":"Peces y fauna marina"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 significa \"Transparencia\" en la moda?","opciones":["Ropa que se transparenta","Publicar d\u00f3nde y qui\u00e9n hace la ropa realmente","No decir nada","Bajar precios"],"correcta":"Publicar d\u00f3nde y qui\u00e9n hace la ropa realmente"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1ntos millones de toneladas de residuos textiles se generan al a\u00f1o?","opciones":["1 Mt","92 Mt","10 Mt","500 Mt"],"correcta":"92 Mt"},{"pregunta":"El modelo de negocio de Shein se basa en:","opciones":["Calidad extrema","Algoritmos y micro-producci\u00f3n masiva","Tradici\u00f3n artesanal","Venta local"],"correcta":"Algoritmos y micro-producci\u00f3n masiva"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"esclavitud-moderna-master","titulo":"Esclavitud Moderna: El Motor Oculto de la Econom\u00eda Lineal","contenido":"\r\n<div class=\"esm-lesson-carbon modern-slavery-master\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"intro-header text-center mb-5\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"display-3 esm-text-neon-red\">ESCLAVITUD MODERNA<\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"fs-4 mx-auto\" style=\"max-width: 900px;\">\r\n            En 2025, la <strong>esclavitud moderna<\/strong> afecta a ~50 millones de personas globalmente (ILO\/Walk Free 2021-2023 estimates). Es un mecanismo de reducci\u00f3n de costos en cadenas de suministro que intersecta con degradaci\u00f3n ambiental: la destrucci\u00f3n de ecosistemas genera vulnerabilidad humana, perpetuando explotaci\u00f3n y ecocidio.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"row mb-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n            <div class=\"esm-alert-carbon esm-border-red text-center\">\r\n                <h4 class=\"esm-text-red\"><i class=\"fas fa-users-slash\"><\/i> Huella de Esclavitud en Consumo (\\( S_f \\))<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Estima el riesgo acumulado de explotaci\u00f3n en productos consumidos:<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"esm-eq-box fs-3 py-4\">\r\n                    \\[ S_f = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} (C_i \\times R_i) \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <small class=\"text-muted\">Donde \\( C_i \\) es consumo del producto i y \\( R_i \\) coeficiente de riesgo por industria\/regi\u00f3n (ej. alto en miner\u00eda cobalto, pesca, textiles).<\/small>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"esm-section-title esm-text-orange\">1. Nexo Ecocidio-Explotaci\u00f3n Humana<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"row mb-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-7\">\r\n            <p>La degradaci\u00f3n ambiental crea \"zonas de sacrificio\" donde comunidades pierden medios de vida, aumentando vulnerabilidad a servidumbre por deuda o trabajo forzado.<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"esm-stats-box p-4 bg-dark esm-border-left-red\">\r\n                <ul class=\"list-unstyled\">\r\n                    <li class=\"mb-3\">\r\n                        <strong class=\"esm-text-yellow\"><i class=\"fas fa-hammer\"><\/i> Miner\u00eda Cobalto (RDC):<\/strong> \r\n                        ~70% suministro global; miles de ni\u00f1os en minas artesanales (estimados 40,000+), riesgos t\u00f3xicos y colapsos.\r\n                    <\/li>\r\n                    <li class=\"mb-3\">\r\n                        <strong class=\"esm-text-cyan\"><i class=\"fas fa-fish\"><\/i> Pesca (Sudeste Asi\u00e1tico):<\/strong> \r\n                        Trabajadores migrantes retenidos en barcos, abuso y condiciones degradantes persisten en 2025.\r\n                    <\/li>\r\n                    <li class=\"mb-3\">\r\n                        <strong class=\"esm-text-green\"><i class=\"fas fa-tree\"><\/i> Deforestaci\u00f3n (Amazonas):<\/strong> \r\n                        Trabajo forzado en ganader\u00eda ilegal y miner\u00eda impulsa p\u00e9rdida de biodiversidad.\r\n                    <\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-5\">\r\n            <!-- Espacio reservado -->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"esm-section-title esm-text-red\">2. Formas de Esclavitud Moderna en 2025<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"table-responsive mb-5\">\r\n        <table class=\"table esm-table-dark esm-table-hover esm-border-red\">\r\n            <thead class=\"esm-text-neon-yellow\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Forma<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Mecanismo<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Ejemplos Industriales<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/thead>\r\n            <tbody>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td><strong>Servidumbre por Deuda<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                    <td>Tarifas reclutamiento impagables.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Agricultura, construcci\u00f3n.<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td><strong>Trabajo Infantil Forzado<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explotaci\u00f3n vulnerabilidad familiar.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Miner\u00eda cobalto, cacao.<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td><strong>Trata y Trabajo Forzado<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                    <td>Enga\u00f1o y retenci\u00f3n.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Pesca, textiles.<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td><strong>Esclavitud Estatal<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                    <td>Impuesta por gobiernos.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Algod\u00f3n (ej. regiones espec\u00edficas).<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/tbody>\r\n        <\/table>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h4 class=\"text-center mb-4 esm-text-red\">Cadena de Suministro Opaca<\/h4>\r\n    <div class=\"esm-svg-container mb-5\" style=\"background: #0a0a0a; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid #ff0000;\">\r\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"250\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#300\" stroke=\"#ff0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"10\" \/>\r\n            <text x=\"125\" y=\"300\" fill=\"#ff0000\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">TIER 3: EXTRACCI\u00d3N<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"125\" y=\"320\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(Explotaci\u00f3n Infantil\/Forzada)<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <rect x=\"300\" y=\"150\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"#ff8c00\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"10\" \/>\r\n            <text x=\"375\" y=\"200\" fill=\"#ff8c00\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">TIER 2: PROCESADO<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"375\" y=\"220\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(Condiciones Degradantes)<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <rect x=\"550\" y=\"50\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#033\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"10\" \/>\r\n            <text x=\"625\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#00ffff\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">TIER 1: MARCA<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"625\" y=\"120\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(Marketing Sostenible)<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <path d=\"M200 300 L300 200 M450 200 L550 100\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,5\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red)\" \/>\r\n\r\n            <defs>\r\n                <marker id=\"arrow-red\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                    <path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 Z\" fill=\"#ff0000\" \/>\r\n                <\/marker>\r\n            <\/defs>\r\n\r\n            <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#300\" opacity=\"0.3\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0.3;0.6;0.3\" dur=\"5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" \/>\r\n            <\/rect>\r\n        <\/svg>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"esm-interactive-block mb-5 p-4 esm-border-yellow\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"esm-text-yellow mb-4\"><i class=\"fas fa-search\"><\/i> Simulador: Calcula tu Huella de Esclavitud<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Selecciona productos comunes y ve el riesgo estimado:<\/p>\r\n        <label>Bater\u00edas EV\/Smartphones (cobalto): <\/label>\r\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"cobaltSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"5\" oninput=\"updateSf()\">\r\n        <label>Pesca\/Camarones: <\/label>\r\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"seafoodSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"5\" oninput=\"updateSf()\">\r\n        <label>Textiles\/Ropa: <\/label>\r\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"textileSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"5\" oninput=\"updateSf()\">\r\n        <p id=\"sfResult\" class=\"mt-3\">Huella: Calculando...<\/p>\r\n        <button class=\"esm-btn-outline-warning w-100 mt-3\" onclick=\"ethicsTips()\">Consejos para Consumo \u00c9tico<\/button>\r\n        <div id=\"ethicsOutput\" class=\"mt-3 p-3 esm-bg-black\" style=\"min-height: 100px; font-family: 'VT323';\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"esm-section-title esm-text-green\">3. Soluciones: Transparencia y Debida Diligencia<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"row mb-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n            <div class=\"p-3 bg-dark esm-border-cyan\">\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li><strong>Blockchain y Trazabilidad:<\/strong> Registros inmutables para cadenas de suministro.<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>CSDDD UE (2024-2025):<\/strong> Obliga due diligence en derechos humanos y ambiente; implementaci\u00f3n progresiva con posibles ajustes Omnibus.<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>Certificaciones:<\/strong> Fair Trade, GOTS, apps como Good On You.<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"mt-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"monday-quiz-header\">\r\n            <div class=\"monday-quiz-icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/div>\r\n            <h4 class=\"monday-quiz-title\">Quiz Autoevaluado<\/h4>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <p class=\"monday-quiz-question\">\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el nexo principal entre esclavitud moderna y ecosistemas?<\/p>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"monday-quiz-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"monday-quiz-btn\" onclick=\"ansQuiz(1)\">Solo econ\u00f3mico<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"monday-quiz-btn\" onclick=\"ansQuiz(2)\">Degradaci\u00f3n ambiental genera vulnerabilidad humana<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"monday-quiz-btn\" onclick=\"ansQuiz(3)\">No hay relaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"quizFeedback\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"esm-section-title esm-text-yellow\">4. Errores Comunes del Estudiante<\/h2>\r\n    <p>Haz clic para explicaciones de errores t\u00edpicos:<\/p>\r\n    <ul class=\"esm-errors-list\">\r\n        <li onclick=\"showError(1)\">Ver esclavitud moderna como solo hist\u00f3rica.<\/li>\r\n        <div id=\"error1\" style=\"display:none;\">Explicaci\u00f3n: Persiste en cadenas modernas; ~50M afectados en 2025.<\/div>\r\n        <li onclick=\"showError(2)\">Ignorar intersecci\u00f3n ambiental-humana.<\/li>\r\n        <div id=\"error2\" style=\"display:none;\">Explicaci\u00f3n: Ecocidio desplaza comunidades, aumentando explotaci\u00f3n.<\/div>\r\n        <li onclick=\"showError(3)\">Subestimar regulaciones como CSDDD.<\/li>\r\n        <div id=\"error3\" style=\"display:none;\">Explicaci\u00f3n: Obligan due diligence, impactando supply chains globales.<\/div>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"esm-section-title esm-text-cyan\">5. Conexi\u00f3n con la Materia Base: Ecosistemas<\/h2>\r\n    <p>Este tema integra perturbaciones antropog\u00e9nicas en ecosistemas: explotaci\u00f3n humana acelera degradaci\u00f3n (deforestaci\u00f3n, miner\u00eda t\u00f3xica), alterando ciclos biogeoqu\u00edmicos y biodiversidad. Evaluables en an\u00e1lisis de sostenibilidad socio-ambiental.<\/p>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"esm-section-title esm-text-green\">6. Problemas Tipo Examen<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"esm-exam-problem\">\r\n        <p><strong>Problema 1:<\/strong> Explica el nexo entre miner\u00eda cobalto en RDC y esclavitud infantil; relaciona con impactos ecosist\u00e9micos.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"esm-exam-problem\">\r\n        <p><strong>Problema 2:<\/strong> Analiza c\u00f3mo deforestaci\u00f3n Amazon\u00eda involucra trabajo forzado; propone soluciones circulares.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"esm-exam-problem\">\r\n        <p><strong>Problema 3:<\/strong> Eval\u00faa rol de CSDDD UE en mitigaci\u00f3n esclavitud en supply chains; interpreta efectos en ecosistemas globales.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"esm-section-title esm-text-magenta\">7. Cierre Metacognitivo<\/h2>\r\n    <p class=\"esm-reflection\">Reflexiona: \u00bfC\u00f3mo contribuye tu consumo a esclavitud moderna y degradaci\u00f3n ecosist\u00e9mica? \u00bfQu\u00e9 acciones personales\/promover\u00edas para cadenas \u00e9ticas? \u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es clave el nexo humano-ambiental en evaluaciones sostenibles?<\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction updateSf() {\r\n    const cobalt = document.getElementById('cobaltSlider').value * 0.3;\r\n    const seafood = document.getElementById('seafoodSlider').value * 0.2;\r\n    const textile = document.getElementById('textileSlider').value * 0.15;\r\n    const total = (cobalt + seafood + textile).toFixed(1);\r\n    document.getElementById('sfResult').innerHTML = `Huella estimada: ${total} (Alto >5; reduce consumo en riesgos altos)`;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction ethicsTips() {\r\n    const out = document.getElementById('ethicsOutput');\r\n    out.innerHTML = \"<span class='text-success'>CONSEJOS:<\/span><br>- Certificaciones: Fair Trade, GOTS.<br>- Apps: Good On You, Slavery Footprint.<br>- Prefiere marcas con trazabilidad blockchain.<br>- Reduce consumo innecesario.\";\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction ansQuiz(option) {\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById('quizFeedback');\r\n    const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.monday-quiz-btn');\r\n    buttons.forEach(btn => btn.disabled = true);\r\n\r\n    if(option === 2) {\r\n        buttons[1].classList.add('correct');\r\n        fb.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"monday-feedback\">\r\n                \u00a1Correcto! La p\u00e9rdida de sustento ambiental aumenta vulnerabilidad a explotaci\u00f3n.\r\n            <\/div>`;\r\n    } else {\r\n        buttons[option-1].style.background = 'rgba(255,0,0,0.4)';\r\n        fb.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"monday-feedback\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff0000, #800000); box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.6);\">\r\n                Incorrecto. El nexo clave es que la degradaci\u00f3n de ecosistemas desplaza comunidades y las hace vulnerables al trabajo forzado.\r\n            <\/div>`;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showError(id) {\r\n    const div = document.getElementById(`error${id}`);\r\n    div.style.display = div.style.display === 'none' ? 'block' : 'none';\r\n}\r\n<\/script>","quiz":[{"pregunta":"Forma de esclavitud m\u00e1s com\u00fan en la industria de la construcci\u00f3n:","opciones":["Matrimonio forzado","Servidumbre por deuda","Tr\u00e1fico de \u00f3rganos","Esclavitud hist\u00f3rica"],"correcta":"Servidumbre por deuda"},{"pregunta":"Mineral clave para bater\u00edas con alto riesgo de trabajo infantil:","opciones":["Hierro","Cobalto","Aluminio","Magnesio"],"correcta":"Cobalto"},{"pregunta":"N\u00famero estimado de ni\u00f1os trabajadores en el mundo:","opciones":["10 millones","160 millones","500 millones","1 mill\u00f3n"],"correcta":"160 millones"},{"pregunta":"Pa\u00eds donde se encuentran las mayores reservas de cobalto:","opciones":["Chile","Rep\u00fablica Democr\u00e1tica del Congo","China","Rusia"],"correcta":"Rep\u00fablica Democr\u00e1tica del Congo"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 industria es la principal fuente de microfibras y explotaci\u00f3n laboral?","opciones":["Moda (Textil)","Automotriz","Alimenticia","Farmac\u00e9utica"],"correcta":"Moda (Textil)"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el Global Slavery Index?","opciones":["Una lista de precios","Un estudio que mide la prevalencia de la esclavitud por pa\u00eds","Un manual de historia","Una ley de la ONU"],"correcta":"Un estudio que mide la prevalencia de la esclavitud por pa\u00eds"},{"pregunta":"La esclavitud moderna prospera principalmente en zonas de:","opciones":["Alta tecnolog\u00eda","Vulnerabilidad ambiental y falta de estado de derecho","Pleno empleo","Mucho turismo"],"correcta":"Vulnerabilidad ambiental y falta de estado de derecho"},{"pregunta":"Principal motor de la esclavitud en el Amazonas:","opciones":["Turismo","Ganader\u00eda y miner\u00eda ilegal de oro","Internet","Pesca deportiva"],"correcta":"Ganader\u00eda y miner\u00eda ilegal de oro"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 tecnolog\u00eda permite rastrear el origen \u00e9tico de un producto?","opciones":["Bluetooth","Blockchain","Radio AM","Infrarrojos"],"correcta":"Blockchain"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 porcentaje de las v\u00edctimas de esclavitud moderna son mujeres y ni\u00f1as?","opciones":["10%","M\u00e1s del 70%","25%","50%"],"correcta":"M\u00e1s del 70%"},{"pregunta":"El matrimonio forzado se considera una forma de:","opciones":["Tradici\u00f3n sagrada","Esclavitud moderna","Contrato laboral","Ocio"],"correcta":"Esclavitud moderna"},{"pregunta":"Zonas de alto riesgo de esclavitud en la pesca:","opciones":["Mar Mediterr\u00e1neo","Sudeste Asi\u00e1tico","Lago Michigan","Ant\u00e1rtida"],"correcta":"Sudeste Asi\u00e1tico"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es una \"auditor\u00eda social\"?","opciones":["Una fiesta","Revisi\u00f3n de las condiciones laborales en una f\u00e1brica","Un examen de matem\u00e1ticas","Una multa de tr\u00e1fico"],"correcta":"Revisi\u00f3n de las condiciones laborales en una f\u00e1brica"},{"pregunta":"Material usado en miner\u00eda ilegal que envenena r\u00edos:","opciones":["Az\u00facar","Mercurio","Sal","Vinagre"],"correcta":"Mercurio"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"trabajo infantil peligroso\"?","opciones":["Hacer la tarea","Trabajo que da\u00f1a la salud, seguridad o moralidad del ni\u00f1o","Jugar f\u00fatbol","Ayudar en casa"],"correcta":"Trabajo que da\u00f1a la salud, seguridad o moralidad del ni\u00f1o"},{"pregunta":"La ley brit\u00e1nica contra la esclavitud se llama:","opciones":["Magna Carta","Modern Slavery Act","Brexit Law","Freedom Bill"],"correcta":"Modern Slavery Act"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el fin de la \"Debida Diligencia\"?","opciones":["Vender m\u00e1s","Asegurar que la empresa no causa da\u00f1os sociales o ambientales","Ser m\u00e1s r\u00e1pido","Pagar menos impuestos"],"correcta":"Asegurar que la empresa no causa da\u00f1os sociales o ambientales"},{"pregunta":"Regi\u00f3n con mayor n\u00famero absoluto de personas en esclavitud:","opciones":["Europa","Asia y el Pac\u00edfico","Am\u00e9rica del Norte","Ocean\u00eda"],"correcta":"Asia y el Pac\u00edfico"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 producto asocia la esclavitud con la deforestaci\u00f3n en Costa de Marfil?","opciones":["Laptops","Cacao","Coches","Zapatos"],"correcta":"Cacao"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"salario digno\"?","opciones":["Un salario m\u00ednimo","Suficiente para cubrir necesidades b\u00e1sicas y algo de ahorro","Un premio","El sueldo del CEO"],"correcta":"Suficiente para cubrir necesidades b\u00e1sicas y algo de ahorro"},{"pregunta":"Principal causa de la servidumbre por deuda en migrantes:","opciones":["Falta de idioma","Tarifas de reclutamiento ilegales","Clima","Falta de internet"],"correcta":"Tarifas de reclutamiento ilegales"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1ntas v\u00edctimas hay en el tr\u00e1fico sexual global aprox.?","opciones":["1 mill\u00f3n","6.3 millones","100 millones","500,000"],"correcta":"6.3 millones"},{"pregunta":"La esclavitud moderna genera ganancias anuales de:","opciones":["$1,000","$150 mil millones","$10 millones","$0"],"correcta":"$150 mil millones"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"Protocolo de Palermo\"?","opciones":["Una receta","Tratado de la ONU contra la trata de personas","Un juego","Un sat\u00e9lite"],"correcta":"Tratado de la ONU contra la trata de personas"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l de estos NO es un indicador de esclavitud?","opciones":["Retenci\u00f3n de pasaporte","Horas extras pagadas","Amenazas f\u00edsicas","Aislamiento"],"correcta":"Horas extras pagadas"},{"pregunta":"Certificaci\u00f3n que garantiza que no hay trabajo infantil en el cacao:","opciones":["Energy Star","Fairtrade \/ UTZ","ISO 9001","Bluetooth"],"correcta":"Fairtrade \/ UTZ"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la \"huella de esclavitud\" de un consumidor?","opciones":["Su n\u00famero de calzado","El n\u00famero de trabajadores explotados detr\u00e1s de sus compras","Un tatuaje","Sus ahorros"],"correcta":"El n\u00famero de trabajadores explotados detr\u00e1s de sus compras"},{"pregunta":"Industria que usa \"ladrilleras\" con trabajo forzado en el sur de Asia:","opciones":["Tecnol\u00f3gica","Construcci\u00f3n","Moda","Espacial"],"correcta":"Construcci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 pa\u00eds aprob\u00f3 una ley contra el trabajo forzado en la regi\u00f3n de Xinjiang?","opciones":["China","EE.UU.","Rusia","Corea del Norte"],"correcta":"EE.UU."},{"pregunta":"El concepto de \"Ecocidio\" suele ir de la mano con:","opciones":["Derechos humanos plenos","Violaciones sistem\u00e1ticas de derechos laborales","Energ\u00eda e\u00f3lica","Paz mundial"],"correcta":"Violaciones sistem\u00e1ticas de derechos laborales"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"efecto-invernadero-natural-master","titulo":"Efecto Invernadero: El Termostato de la Biosfera","contenido":"\r\n<div class=\"monday-lesson greenhouse-master\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"text-center mb-5\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"monday-title\">BALANCE RADIATIVO<\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"monday-intro\">\r\n            El efecto invernadero natural es el mecanismo esencial que mantiene la temperatura media global en +15\u00b0C, permitiendo agua l\u00edquida y vida. Sin \u00e9l, la Tierra tendr\u00eda -18\u00b0C. Los GEI regulan el balance radiativo de la biosfera.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"monday-alert\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"text-yellow\"><i class=\"fas fa-bolt\"><\/i> Temperatura Efectiva vs Real<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Sin atm\u00f3sfera (cuerpo negro):<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"monday-eq-box\">\r\n            \\[ T_e = \\left( \\frac{S(1 - A)}{4\\sigma} \\right)^{1\/4} \\approx 255\\, \\text{K} \\, (-18^\\circ\\text{C}) \\]\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <p class=\"mt-3\">Real: <strong>288 K (+15\u00b0C)<\/strong> \u2192 Diferencia de +33\u00b0C gracias a GEI naturales.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title\">1. Gases de Efecto Invernadero<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"row mb-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-8 mx-auto\">\r\n            <div class=\"monday-stats-box\">\r\n                <ul class=\"list-unstyled\">\r\n                    <li class=\"mb-4\"><strong class=\"text-cyan\">Vapor de Agua (H\u2082O):<\/strong> 60-70% del efecto, retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva.<\/li>\r\n                    <li class=\"mb-4\"><strong class=\"text-magenta\">CO\u2082:<\/strong> Control a largo plazo, permanencia centenaria.<\/li>\r\n                    <li class=\"mb-4\"><strong class=\"text-orange\">CH\u2084:<\/strong> ~28\u00d7 m\u00e1s potente que CO\u2082 (100 a\u00f1os).<\/li>\r\n                    <li class=\"mb-4\"><strong class=\"text-yellow\">N\u2082O y otros:<\/strong> Contribuciones menores pero significativas.<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"monday-mini-lab\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"text-orange text-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-flask\"><\/i> Simulador: Impacto de Concentraci\u00f3n GEI<\/h4>\r\n        <p class=\"text-center mb-4\">Ajusta niveles equivalentes de GEI (ppm CO\u2082 eq) y observa cambio en temperatura global (modelo simplificado).<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 text-center\">\r\n                <label class=\"text-yellow fs-4\">Concentraci\u00f3n GEI (ppm eq):<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" class=\"monday-slider\" id=\"geiRange\" min=\"200\" max=\"1200\" value=\"280\" oninput=\"updateSim()\">\r\n                <div class=\"fs-3 mt-3 text-cyan\" id=\"ppmValue\">280 ppm (Preindustrial)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 text-center\">\r\n                <div id=\"tempDisplay\" class=\"monday-temp-display text-success\">15.0\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                <p id=\"tempStatus\" class=\"fs-3 text-success\">Clima Estable \/ Habitable<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title\">2. El Albedo Planetario<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"row text-center mb-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-4\"><div class=\"monday-albedo-card\"><h5 class=\"text-white\">Hielo\/Nieve<\/h5><p class=\"display-5\">0.8-0.9<\/p><small>Alta reflexi\u00f3n<\/small><\/div><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-4\"><div class=\"monday-albedo-card\"><h5 class=\"text-green\">Bosques<\/h5><p class=\"display-5\">0.1-0.2<\/p><small>Absorci\u00f3n media<\/small><\/div><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-4\"><div class=\"monday-albedo-card\"><h5 class=\"text-blue\">Oc\u00e9anos<\/h5><p class=\"display-5\">0.06<\/p><small>Baja reflexi\u00f3n<\/small><\/div><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h4 class=\"text-center text-cyan mb-4\">Diagrama de Forzamiento Radiativo<\/h4>\r\n    <div class=\"monday-svg-container\">\r\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 500\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n            <rect width=\"800\" height=\"500\" fill=\"#000814\" \/>\r\n            <path d=\"M0 450 Q400 350 800 450\" fill=\"#001f3f\" \/>\r\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"480\" fill=\"#00ffff\" font-size=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">SUPERFICIE TERRESTRE<\/text>\r\n            \r\n            <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"50\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#ffff00\" filter=\"url(#glow-sun)\" \/>\r\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#ffff00\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">RADIACI\u00d3N SOLAR<\/text>\r\n            \r\n            <path d=\"M400 90 L400 400\" stroke=\"#ffff00\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,5\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"0\" to=\"-20\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" \/>\r\n            <\/path>\r\n            <text x=\"420\" y=\"200\" fill=\"#ffff00\" font-size=\"14\">Visible \u2193<\/text>\r\n            \r\n            <path d=\"M350 400 Q350 300 300 350 M450 400 Q450 300 500 350\" stroke=\"#ff00ff\" stroke-width=\"4\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"0\" to=\"20\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" \/>\r\n            <\/path>\r\n            <text x=\"320\" y=\"320\" fill=\"#ff00ff\" font-size=\"14\">IR ATRAPADO \u2191\u2193<\/text>\r\n            \r\n            <defs>\r\n                <filter id=\"glow-sun\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"10\" result=\"blur\"\/><feMerge><feMergeNode in=\"blur\"\/><feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/><\/feMerge><\/filter>\r\n            <\/defs>\r\n        <\/svg>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"mt-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"monday-quiz-header\">\r\n            <div class=\"monday-quiz-icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/div>\r\n            <h4 class=\"monday-quiz-title\">Quiz Autoevaluado<\/h4>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <p class=\"monday-quiz-question\">\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la diferencia de temperatura atribuida al efecto invernadero natural?<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"monday-quiz-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"monday-quiz-btn\" onclick=\"ansQuiz(1)\">+18\u00b0C<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"monday-quiz-btn\" onclick=\"ansQuiz(2)\">+33\u00b0C<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"monday-quiz-btn\" onclick=\"ansQuiz(3)\">-15\u00b0C<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div id=\"quizFeedback\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title text-yellow\">3. Errores Comunes del Estudiante<\/h2>\r\n    <ul class=\"monday-errors-list mx-auto\" style=\"max-width: 800px; list-style:none;\">\r\n        <li onclick=\"showError(1)\" class=\"mb-3\">Confundir efecto invernadero natural con antropog\u00e9nico.<\/li>\r\n        <div id=\"error1\" style=\"display:none;\" class=\"alert alert-info\">El natural es esencial para la vida; el antropog\u00e9nico lo intensifica.<\/div>\r\n        <li onclick=\"showError(2)\" class=\"mb-3\">Pensar que N\u2082 y O\u2082 contribuyen al efecto.<\/li>\r\n        <div id=\"error2\" style=\"display:none;\" class=\"alert alert-info\">Son diat\u00f3micos sim\u00e9tricos \u2192 no absorben IR.<\/div>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title text-cyan\">4. Conexi\u00f3n con Ecosistemas<\/h2>\r\n    <p class=\"text-center fs-4\">El efecto invernadero natural regula ciclos biogeoqu\u00edmicos y biodiversidad. Perturbaciones antropog\u00e9nicas alteran este balance, evaluable en impactos clim\u00e1ticos sobre ecosistemas.<\/p>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title text-green\">5. Problemas Tipo Examen<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"monday-exam-problem\"><p><strong>1:<\/strong> Calcula T_e para albedo 0.3 y S=1366 W\/m\u00b2. Explica la diferencia con temperatura real.<\/p><\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"monday-exam-problem\"><p><strong>2:<\/strong> Analiza rol del vapor de agua como retroalimentaci\u00f3n.<\/p><\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title text-magenta\">6. Cierre Metacognitivo<\/h2>\r\n    <p class=\"monday-reflection\">\u00bfC\u00f3mo cambia tu visi\u00f3n del \"efecto invernadero\" como proceso natural esencial? \u00bfQu\u00e9 implicaciones tiene para la regulaci\u00f3n clim\u00e1tica actual?<\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction updateSim() {\r\n    const val = parseInt(document.getElementById('geiRange').value);\r\n    document.getElementById('ppmValue').innerText = val + \" ppm eq\";\r\n    \r\n    let temp = 15 + Math.log(val \/ 280) * 8.5;\r\n    document.getElementById('tempDisplay').innerText = temp.toFixed(1) + \"\u00b0C\";\r\n    \r\n    const disp = document.getElementById('tempDisplay');\r\n    const status = document.getElementById('tempStatus');\r\n    \r\n    if(temp > 18) {\r\n        disp.style.color = \"#ff3333\";\r\n        status.innerText = \"ALERTA: Calentamiento Acelerado\";\r\n        status.style.color = \"#ff3333\";\r\n    } else if(temp < 12) {\r\n        disp.style.color = \"#00ffff\";\r\n        status.innerText = \"Enfriamiento Extremo\";\r\n        status.style.color = \"#00ffff\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        disp.style.color = \"#00ff00\";\r\n        status.innerText = \"Clima Habitable\";\r\n        status.style.color = \"#00ff00\";\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction ansQuiz(option) {\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById('quizFeedback');\r\n    const btns = document.querySelectorAll('.monday-quiz-btn');\r\n    btns.forEach(b => b.disabled = true);\r\n    \r\n    if(option === 2) {\r\n        btns[1].style.background = '#00ff00';\r\n        fb.innerHTML = '<div class=\"monday-feedback\">\u00a1Correcto! +33\u00b0C es la contribuci\u00f3n del efecto invernadero natural.<\/div>';\r\n    } else {\r\n        btns[option-1].style.background = 'rgba(255,0,0,0.5)';\r\n        fb.innerHTML = '<div class=\"monday-feedback\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff0000, #800000); box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255,0,0,0.8);\">Incorrecto. La diferencia es +33\u00b0C.<\/div>';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showError(id) {\r\n    const el = document.getElementById('error' + id);\r\n    el.style.display = el.style.display === 'none' ? 'block' : 'none';\r\n}\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l ser\u00eda la temperatura de la Tierra sin el efecto invernadero natural?","respuesta":"-18\u00b0C (255 Kelvin)."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 gas es el mayor contribuyente al efecto invernadero natural?","respuesta":"El vapor de agua (H\u2082O)."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 el ox\u00edgeno (O\u2082) no es un gas de efecto invernadero?","respuesta":"Porque es una mol\u00e9cula diat\u00f3mica sim\u00e9trica que no puede absorber radiaci\u00f3n infrarroja."},{"enunciado":"Define \"Albedo\".","respuesta":"Es la fracci\u00f3n de radiaci\u00f3n solar que una superficie refleja de vuelta al espacio."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 tipo de radiaci\u00f3n emite la Tierra hacia el espacio?","respuesta":"Radiaci\u00f3n infrarroja (onda larga)."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l era la concentraci\u00f3n de CO\u2082 en la era pre-industrial?","respuesta":"Aproximadamente 280 ppm."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo afecta el derretimiento del hielo al albedo?","respuesta":"Lo reduce, provocando que la Tierra absorba m\u00e1s calor (retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva)."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"forzamiento radiativo\"?","respuesta":"El desequilibrio entre la energ\u00eda solar absorbida y la energ\u00eda irradiada de vuelta al espacio."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 gas se libera naturalmente en los pantanos?","respuesta":"Metano (CH\u2084)."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la diferencia entre el efecto invernadero natural y el antropog\u00e9nico?","respuesta":"El natural es esencial para la vida; el antropog\u00e9nico es el aumento extra de temperatura causado por actividades humanas."},{"enunciado":"Menciona un sumidero natural de carbono.","respuesta":"Los oc\u00e9anos o los bosques (fotos\u00edntesis)."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 constante f\u00edsica se usa para calcular la radiaci\u00f3n de un cuerpo negro?","respuesta":"La constante de Stefan-Boltzmann (\u03c3)."}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"La temperatura promedio actual de la Tierra gracias al efecto invernadero es:","opciones":["0\u00b0C","+15\u00b0C","-18\u00b0C","+30\u00b0C"],"correcta":"+15\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Gas que act\u00faa como \"termostato\" del planeta debido a su permanencia:","opciones":["Vapor de agua","CO2","Ox\u00edgeno","Arg\u00f3n"],"correcta":"CO2"},{"pregunta":"El sol emite principalmente radiaci\u00f3n de onda:","opciones":["Larga","Corta (Visible\/UV)","Microondas","Radio"],"correcta":"Corta (Visible\/UV)"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 superficie tiene el albedo m\u00e1s alto?","opciones":["Selva","Oc\u00e9ano","Nieve fresca","Asfalto"],"correcta":"Nieve fresca"},{"pregunta":"La diferencia de temperatura generada por el efecto invernadero natural es de:","opciones":["10\u00b0C","33\u00b0C","50\u00b0C","5\u00b0C"],"correcta":"33\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l de estos NO es un GEI?","opciones":["Metano","\u00d3xido Nitroso","Nitr\u00f3geno (N2)","Vapor de Agua"],"correcta":"Nitr\u00f3geno (N2)"},{"pregunta":"Proceso por el cual los oc\u00e9anos absorben CO2:","opciones":["Evaporaci\u00f3n","Difusi\u00f3n y bomba biol\u00f3gica","Combusti\u00f3n","Transpiraci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Difusi\u00f3n y bomba biol\u00f3gica"},{"pregunta":"El metano es producido naturalmente por:","opciones":["Volcanes","Termitas y humedales","Nubes","Piedras"],"correcta":"Termitas y humedales"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 sucede si el albedo disminuye?","opciones":["El planeta se enfr\u00eda","El planeta se calienta","No pasa nada","Aumenta el ox\u00edgeno"],"correcta":"El planeta se calienta"},{"pregunta":"La ley que relaciona temperatura y emisi\u00f3n de energ\u00eda es:","opciones":["Ley de Gravity","Ley de Stefan-Boltzmann","Ley de Ohm","Ley de Newton"],"correcta":"Ley de Stefan-Boltzmann"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 porcentaje de la atm\u00f3sfera es CO2 aproximadamente?","opciones":["78%","21%","0.04%","10%"],"correcta":"0.04%"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es un fot\u00f3n infrarrojo?","opciones":["Luz visible","Energ\u00eda t\u00e9rmica","Rayos X","Sonido"],"correcta":"Energ\u00eda t\u00e9rmica"},{"pregunta":"Principal fuente de nitr\u00f3geno en la atm\u00f3sfera:","opciones":["Coches","Fijaci\u00f3n biol\u00f3gica y rayos","F\u00e1bricas","Espacio"],"correcta":"Fijaci\u00f3n biol\u00f3gica y rayos"},{"pregunta":"Si duplicamos el CO2, la temperatura sube. Esto se llama:","opciones":["Inercia t\u00e9rmica","Sensibilidad clim\u00e1tica","Albedo","Efecto Doppler"],"correcta":"Sensibilidad clim\u00e1tica"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 pasar\u00eda con los oc\u00e9anos sin el efecto invernadero?","opciones":["Se evaporar\u00edan","Se congelar\u00edan por completo","Ser\u00edan m\u00e1s \u00e1cidos","No cambiar\u00edan"],"correcta":"Se congelar\u00edan por completo"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la constante solar aproximada?","opciones":["100 W\/m\u00b2","1361 W\/m\u00b2","5000 W\/m\u00b2","10 W\/m\u00b2"],"correcta":"1361 W\/m\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"Los GEI absorben energ\u00eda y luego la:","opciones":["Destruyen","Reemiten en todas direcciones","Convierten en oro","Enfr\u00edan"],"correcta":"Reemiten en todas direcciones"},{"pregunta":"La unidad \"ppm\" significa:","opciones":["Partes por mil","Partes por mill\u00f3n","Presi\u00f3n por metro","Peso por masa"],"correcta":"Partes por mill\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Ciclo que regula el CO2 a escalas de millones de a\u00f1os:","opciones":["Ciclo del agua","Ciclo geol\u00f3gico del carbono (silicato-carbonato)","Fotos\u00edntesis","Respiraci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Ciclo geol\u00f3gico del carbono (silicato-carbonato)"},{"pregunta":"El principal gas que genera retroalimentaci\u00f3n positiva al calentarse el aire es:","opciones":["Arg\u00f3n","Vapor de agua","Helio","Ox\u00edgeno"],"correcta":"Vapor de agua"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 las nubes tienen un efecto doble?","opciones":["Son blancas y negras","Reflejan luz solar y atrapan calor IR","Solo llueven","No afectan el clima"],"correcta":"Reflejan luz solar y atrapan calor IR"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 instrumento mide la radiaci\u00f3n solar?","opciones":["Term\u00f3metro","Piran\u00f3metro","Bar\u00f3metro","Higr\u00f3metro"],"correcta":"Piran\u00f3metro"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es una \"ventana atmosf\u00e9rica\"?","opciones":["Un agujero en el techo","Rangos de frecuencia donde la atm\u00f3sfera no absorbe IR","El Polo Norte","Un tipo de nube"],"correcta":"Rangos de frecuencia donde la atm\u00f3sfera no absorbe IR"},{"pregunta":"Contribuci\u00f3n del CO2 al efecto invernadero natural:","opciones":["~5%","~20%","~90%","0%"],"correcta":"~20%"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo ayuda la fotos\u00edntesis al balance de GEI?","opciones":["Produce metano","Extrae CO2 de la atm\u00f3sfera","Calienta el aire","Refleja la luz"],"correcta":"Extrae CO2 de la atm\u00f3sfera"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el principal GEI producido por volcanes?","opciones":["Ox\u00edgeno","CO2","Cloro","Nitr\u00f3geno"],"correcta":"CO2"},{"pregunta":"El efecto invernadero ocurre en la capa de la atm\u00f3sfera llamada:","opciones":["Troposfera","Exosfera","Mesosfera","N\u00facleo"],"correcta":"Troposfera"},{"pregunta":"Sin atm\u00f3sfera, la Luna (a la misma distancia que la Tierra) tiene una media de:","opciones":["+15\u00b0C","-18\u00b0C","+100\u00b0C","-150\u00b0C"],"correcta":"-18\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 mol\u00e9cula tiene una estructura bend (doblada) que facilita absorber IR?","opciones":["N2","H2O","O2","H2"],"correcta":"H2O"},{"pregunta":"El forzante radiativo se mide en:","opciones":["Grados","Vatios por metro cuadrado (W\/m\u00b2)","Kilogramos","Litros"],"correcta":"Vatios por metro cuadrado (W\/m\u00b2)"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"huella-ecologica-efecto-invernadero","titulo":"Huella Ecol\u00f3gica y Efecto Invernadero: El Balance Roto","contenido":"\r\n<div class=\"monday-lesson footprint-master\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"text-center mb-5\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"monday-title\">HUELLA vs. BIOCAPACIDAD<\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"monday-intro\">\r\n            La <strong>Huella Ecol\u00f3gica<\/strong> mide la demanda humana de recursos bioproductivos (en global hectares, gha). La <strong>Biocapacidad<\/strong> es la oferta regenerativa del planeta. En 2025, humanidad consume equivalente a ~1.7 Tierras, con Earth Overshoot Day el 24 de julio. El forzamiento antropog\u00e9nico intensifica el efecto invernadero, reduciendo biocapacidad v\u00eda retroalimentaciones.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"monday-alert\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"text-green\"><i class=\"fas fa-calculator\"><\/i> D\u00e9ficit Ecol\u00f3gico<\/h4>\r\n        <p>D\u00e9ficit cuando huella supera biocapacidad:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"monday-eq-box\">\r\n            \\[ Def = BC - EF \\]\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <p class=\"mt-3\">Global 2025: EF \u2248 2.7 gha\/persona | BC \u2248 1.5 gha\/persona \u2192 D\u00e9ficit ~1.2 gha\/persona (1.7-1.8 planetas).<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title\">1. Earth Overshoot Day 2025<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"row mb-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-8 mx-auto\">\r\n            <div class=\"monday-stats-box\">\r\n                <p>El 24 de julio de 2025 marc\u00f3 el D\u00eda del Sobregiro Terrestre: humanidad agot\u00f3 recursos regenerables anuales.<\/p>\r\n                <ul class=\"list-unstyled\">\r\n                    <li class=\"mb-4\"><strong>Huella de Carbono:<\/strong> ~60% de huella total (\u00e1rea boscosa para secuestrar CO\u2082 excedente).<\/li>\r\n                    <li class=\"mb-4\"><strong>N\u00famero de Tierras:<\/strong> ~1.7-1.75 necesarias para sostener consumo actual.<\/li>\r\n                    <li class=\"mb-4\"><strong>Retroalimentaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Calentamiento reduce biocapacidad (p\u00e9rdida suelos, sequ\u00edas, incendios).<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"monday-mini-lab\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"text-cyan text-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-globe\"><\/i> Simulador Personal: Tu Overshoot Day<\/h4>\r\n        <p class=\"text-center mb-4\">Ajusta h\u00e1bitos y ve impacto en fecha sobregiro (modelo simplificado).<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"row text-center\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n                <label class=\"text-white fs-4\">Energ\u00eda<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"energy\" class=\"form-select monday-select\" onchange=\"calcOvershoot()\">\r\n                    <option value=\"0.8\">100% Renovable<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"1.5\" selected>Mix Actual<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"3\">F\u00f3siles Dominante<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n                <label class=\"text-white fs-4\">Dieta<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"diet\" class=\"form-select monday-select\" onchange=\"calcOvershoot()\">\r\n                    <option value=\"0.8\">Vegana\/Local<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"1.8\" selected>Media<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"3.5\">Alta Carne Roja<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n                <label class=\"text-white fs-4\">Transporte<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"transport\" class=\"form-select monday-select\" onchange=\"calcOvershoot()\">\r\n                    <option value=\"0.7\">P\u00fablico\/Bici<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"1.5\" selected>Coche Medio<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"3\">Avi\u00f3n\/Coche Grande<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n                <div id=\"overshootResult\" class=\"monday-overshoot-display text-warning mt-4\">24 Jul<\/div>\r\n                <p id=\"overshootStatus\" class=\"fs-3 text-warning\">Overshoot Global 2025<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title text-red\">2. Comparaci\u00f3n Internacional (gha\/persona ~2023-2025)<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"table-responsive mb-5\">\r\n        <table class=\"table monday-table-dark table-hover\">\r\n            <thead class=\"text-neon-green\">\r\n                <tr><th>Pa\u00eds<\/th><th>Huella (gha\/persona)<\/th><th>Planetas si Todos<\/th><\/tr>\r\n            <\/thead>\r\n            <tbody>\r\n                <tr><td>Qatar<\/td><td>~14.4<\/td><td>~9<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <tr><td>EE.UU.<\/td><td>~8.1<\/td><td>~5<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <tr><td>Espa\u00f1a<\/td><td>~4.3<\/td><td>~2.6<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <tr><td><strong>Promedio Mundial<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>~2.7<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>~1.7<\/strong><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <tr><td>India<\/td><td>~1.2<\/td><td><0.8<\/td><\/tr>\r\n            <\/tbody>\r\n        <\/table>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h4 class=\"text-center text-green mb-4\">Retroalimentaci\u00f3n Huella-Forzamiento<\/h4>\r\n    <div class=\"monday-svg-container\">\r\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n            <rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"#000814\"\/>\r\n            <rect x=\"100\" y=\"200\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#228B22\" opacity=\"0.8\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"height\" values=\"150;100;150\" dur=\"6s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/rect>\r\n            <text x=\"200\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#00ff00\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">BIOCAPACIDAD (Regeneraci\u00f3n)<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <rect x=\"500\" y=\"100\" width=\"200\" height=\"250\" fill=\"#ff3333\" opacity=\"0.8\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"height\" values=\"250;300;250\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"y\" values=\"100;50;100\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/rect>\r\n            <text x=\"600\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#ff3333\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">HUELLA ECOL\u00d3GICA (Demanda)<\/text>\r\n\r\n            <path d=\"M300 275 Q400 150 500 175\" stroke=\"#ffcc00\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,5\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"100\" to=\"0\" dur=\"5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/path>\r\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"130\" fill=\"#ffcc00\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">FORZAMIENTO CO\u2082 \u2192 P\u00e9rdida BC<\/text>\r\n        <\/svg>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"mt-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"monday-quiz-header\">\r\n            <div class=\"monday-quiz-icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/div>\r\n            <h4 class=\"monday-quiz-title\">Quiz Autoevaluado<\/h4>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <p class=\"monday-quiz-question\">\u00bfEn qu\u00e9 fecha cay\u00f3 Earth Overshoot Day en 2025?<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"monday-quiz-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"monday-quiz-btn\" onclick=\"ansQuiz(1)\">2 de Agosto<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"monday-quiz-btn\" onclick=\"ansQuiz(2)\">24 de Julio<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"monday-quiz-btn\" onclick=\"ansQuiz(3)\">1 de Diciembre<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div id=\"quizFeedback\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title text-yellow\">3. Errores Comunes del Estudiante<\/h2>\r\n    <ul class=\"list-unstyled mx-auto\" style=\"max-width:800px;\">\r\n        <li onclick=\"showError(1)\" class=\"mb-3 p-3 bg-dark rounded\">Confundir huella ecol\u00f3gica con huella de carbono sola.<\/li>\r\n        <div id=\"error1\" style=\"display:none;\" class=\"alert alert-info\">Huella total incluye carbono (~60%), cultivos, pastizales, pesca, bosque, \u00e1rea construida.<\/div>\r\n        <li onclick=\"showError(2)\" class=\"mb-3 p-3 bg-dark rounded\">Pensar que overshoot es reversible autom\u00e1ticamente.<\/li>\r\n        <div id=\"error2\" style=\"display:none;\" class=\"alert alert-info\">D\u00e9ficit acumula degradaci\u00f3n (p\u00e9rdida suelos, biodiversidad).<\/div>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title text-cyan\">4. Conexi\u00f3n con Ecosistemas<\/h2>\r\n    <p class=\"text-center fs-4\">Huella ecol\u00f3gica cuantifica presi\u00f3n antropog\u00e9nica sobre ciclos biogeoqu\u00edmicos y servicios ecosist\u00e9micos. Forzamiento radiativo antropog\u00e9nico altera balance, reduciendo biocapacidad y resiliencia ecosist\u00e9mica.<\/p>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title text-green\">5. Problemas Tipo Examen<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"monday-exam-problem\"><p><strong>1:<\/strong> Calcula planetas necesarios si todos consumieran como Qatar (~14 gha\/persona), asumiendo BC global 1.5 gha.<\/p><\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"monday-exam-problem\"><p><strong>2:<\/strong> Explica retroalimentaci\u00f3n entre huella carbono y p\u00e9rdida biocapacidad.<\/p><\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"monday-exam-problem\"><p><strong>3:<\/strong> Prop\u00f3n medidas para mover Overshoot Day hacia fin a\u00f1o.<\/p><\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title text-magenta\">6. Cierre Metacognitivo<\/h2>\r\n    <p class=\"monday-reflection\">\u00bfC\u00f3mo contribuye tu huella personal al d\u00e9ficit global? \u00bfQu\u00e9 cambios implementar\u00edas para reducirla, considerando nexo con forzamiento clim\u00e1tico? \u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es urgente actuar en 2025?<\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction calcOvershoot() {\r\n    const e = parseFloat(document.getElementById('energy').value);\r\n    const d = parseFloat(document.getElementById('diet').value);\r\n    const t = parseFloat(document.getElementById('transport').value);\r\n    const factor = (e + d + t) \/ 3; \/\/ Promedio simplificado\r\n    \r\n    const result = document.getElementById('overshootResult');\r\n    const status = document.getElementById('overshootStatus');\r\n    \r\n    if(factor < 1.2) {\r\n        result.innerText = \"Noviembre\";\r\n        result.style.color = \"#00ff00\";\r\n        status.innerText = \"Sostenible Personal\";\r\n        status.style.color = \"#00ff00\";\r\n    } else if(factor < 2) {\r\n        result.innerText = \"24 Jul\";\r\n        result.style.color = \"#ff9800\";\r\n        status.innerText = \"Overshoot Global\";\r\n        status.style.color = \"#ff9800\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        result.innerText = \"Abril\";\r\n        result.style.color = \"#ff3333\";\r\n        status.innerText = \"Alta Presi\u00f3n\";\r\n        status.style.color = \"#ff3333\";\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction ansQuiz(option) {\r\n    const fb = document.getElementById('quizFeedback');\r\n    const btns = document.querySelectorAll('.monday-quiz-btn');\r\n    btns.forEach(b => b.disabled = true);\r\n    \r\n    if(option === 2) {\r\n        btns[1].style.background = '#00ff00';\r\n        fb.innerHTML = '<div class=\"monday-feedback\">\u00a1Correcto! Earth Overshoot Day 2025: 24 de julio.<\/div>';\r\n    } else {\r\n        btns[option-1].style.background = 'rgba(255,0,0,0.5)';\r\n        fb.innerHTML = '<div class=\"monday-feedback\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff0000, #800000);\">Incorrecto. Fue el 24 de julio de 2025.<\/div>';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showError(id) {\r\n    const el = document.getElementById('error' + id);\r\n    el.style.display = el.style.display === 'none' ? 'block' : 'none';\r\n}\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 porcentaje de la Huella Ecol\u00f3gica global corresponde a la Huella de Carbono?","respuesta":"Aproximadamente el 60%."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 mide la Huella Ecol\u00f3gica?","respuesta":"La cantidad de superficie biol\u00f3gicamente productiva necesaria para producir los recursos que consume un individuo y absorber sus residuos."},{"enunciado":"Si una persona tiene una huella de 8.1 gha y el planeta ofrece 1.6 gha por persona, \u00bfcu\u00e1ntos planetas necesita?","respuesta":"5.06 planetas (8.1 \/ 1.6)."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 sucede con la biocapacidad cuando el efecto invernadero causa sequ\u00edas extremas?","respuesta":"La biocapacidad disminuye porque el ecosistema pierde capacidad de regeneraci\u00f3n."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 representa la \"Hect\u00e1rea Global\" (gha)?","respuesta":"Una hect\u00e1rea con capacidad de producci\u00f3n biol\u00f3gica media mundial."},{"enunciado":"Define el \"Earth Overshoot Day\".","respuesta":"La fecha del a\u00f1o en la que la humanidad ha consumido todos los recursos que la Tierra puede renovar en ese mismo a\u00f1o."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la relaci\u00f3n entre el consumo de carne y la huella de carbono?","respuesta":"El consumo de carne tiene una huella mucho mayor debido a la ineficiencia energ\u00e9tica y las emisiones de metano del ganado."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo ayuda la energ\u00eda solar a reducir la huella ecol\u00f3gica?","respuesta":"Reduce el componente de la huella de carbono al no emitir gases de efecto invernadero durante la generaci\u00f3n el\u00e9ctrica."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 pa\u00eds tiene un Overshoot Day m\u00e1s temprano: Qatar o India?","respuesta":"Qatar (febrero), debido a su alt\u00edsimo consumo per c\u00e1pita."},{"enunciado":"Menciona los 6 componentes principales de la huella ecol\u00f3gica.","respuesta":"Carbono, tierras de cultivo, pastizales, bosques, zonas de pesca y \u00e1reas construidas."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el d\u00e9ficit ecol\u00f3gico?","respuesta":"Es cuando la huella ecol\u00f3gica de una poblaci\u00f3n excede la biocapacidad del \u00e1rea disponible para esa poblaci\u00f3n."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 la deforestaci\u00f3n aumenta la huella de carbono?","respuesta":"Porque elimina sumideros naturales que absorben el CO\u2082, obligando a \"contabilizar\" m\u00e1s \u00e1rea forestal inexistente para compensar emisiones."}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Si la biocapacidad es mayor que la huella, el pa\u00eds tiene un:","opciones":["D\u00e9ficit ecol\u00f3gico","Super\u00e1vit ecol\u00f3gico","Efecto invernadero","Overshoot Day"],"correcta":"Super\u00e1vit ecol\u00f3gico"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1ntos planetas consume la humanidad actualmente?","opciones":["1","1.75","3","0.5"],"correcta":"1.75"},{"pregunta":"Componente m\u00e1s grande de la Huella Ecol\u00f3gica:","opciones":["Pesca","\u00c1reas construidas","Huella de Carbono","Tierras de cultivo"],"correcta":"Huella de Carbono"},{"pregunta":"La biocapacidad disponible por persona en 2025 es de aprox.:","opciones":["1.6 gha","10 gha","0.5 gha","5 gha"],"correcta":"1.6 gha"},{"pregunta":"El Earth Overshoot Day mundial suele ocurrir en:","opciones":["Enero","Diciembre","Agosto","Abril"],"correcta":"Agosto"},{"pregunta":"Para reducir la huella de carbono personal, lo m\u00e1s efectivo es:","opciones":["Usar pajitas de papel","Reducir vuelos y consumo de carne","Plantar una flor","Cambiar el televisor"],"correcta":"Reducir vuelos y consumo de carne"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 mide la biocapacidad?","opciones":["El tama\u00f1o de las ciudades","La capacidad de los ecosistemas para producir materiales y absorber CO2","La cantidad de petr\u00f3leo","El n\u00famero de personas"],"correcta":"La capacidad de los ecosistemas para producir materiales y absorber CO2"},{"pregunta":"Relaci\u00f3n entre huella y efecto invernadero:","opciones":["No tienen relaci\u00f3n","A mayor huella de carbono, mayor efecto invernadero","A menor huella, m\u00e1s calor","Son lo mismo"],"correcta":"A mayor huella de carbono, mayor efecto invernadero"},{"pregunta":"Pa\u00eds con una de las huellas m\u00e1s bajas por persona:","opciones":["Estados Unidos","Australia","India","Canad\u00e1"],"correcta":"India"},{"pregunta":"La huella de carbono mide el \u00e1rea de bosque necesaria para:","opciones":["Hacer papel","Absorber emisiones de CO2","Vivir en ella","Cazar"],"correcta":"Absorber emisiones de CO2"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 significa gha?","opciones":["Gramos por hect\u00e1rea","Hect\u00e1rea Global","Gases de aire","Gran \u00e1rea"],"correcta":"Hect\u00e1rea Global"},{"pregunta":"Si el mundo entero viviera como un estadounidense, necesitar\u00edamos:","opciones":["1 planeta","5 planetas","10 planetas","2 planetas"],"correcta":"5 planetas"},{"pregunta":"El factor que m\u00e1s aumenta la huella en ciudades es:","opciones":["El ruido","El transporte y el consumo de energ\u00eda f\u00f3sil","Los parques","Las bibliotecas"],"correcta":"El transporte y el consumo de energ\u00eda f\u00f3sil"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 sucede si movemos el Overshoot Day 6 d\u00edas cada a\u00f1o hacia diciembre?","opciones":["Entramos en crisis","Alcanzamos la sostenibilidad en 2050","Se acaba el agua","No cambia nada"],"correcta":"Alcanzamos la sostenibilidad en 2050"},{"pregunta":"Componente de la huella relacionado con la infraestructura:","opciones":["Pastizales","\u00c1reas construidas","Bosques","Oc\u00e9anos"],"correcta":"\u00c1reas construidas"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l de estos NO es un componente de la Huella Ecol\u00f3gica?","opciones":["Carbono","Pesca","Minerales (Oro\/Hierro)","Cultivos"],"correcta":"Minerales (Oro\/Hierro)"},{"pregunta":"La \"Bomba Biol\u00f3gica\" del oc\u00e9ano ayuda a:","opciones":["Aumentar la huella","Reducir el efecto invernadero absorbiendo CO2","Calentar el agua","Producir sal"],"correcta":"Reducir el efecto invernadero absorbiendo CO2"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 organizaci\u00f3n populariz\u00f3 el concepto de Huella Ecol\u00f3gica?","opciones":["NASA","Global Footprint Network","FIFA","Interpol"],"correcta":"Global Footprint Network"},{"pregunta":"Un pa\u00eds en d\u00e9ficit ecol\u00f3gico debe:","opciones":["Exportar recursos","Importar biocapacidad o emitir CO2 al fondo global","Cerrar sus fronteras","Aumentar su poblaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Importar biocapacidad o emitir CO2 al fondo global"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo afecta la tecnolog\u00eda eficiente a la huella?","opciones":["La aumenta","La reduce al requerir menos recursos por servicio","No la afecta","La hace invisible"],"correcta":"La reduce al requerir menos recursos por servicio"},{"pregunta":"La huella de carbono se calcula convirtiendo toneladas de CO2 a:","opciones":["Litros de agua","Hect\u00e1reas de bosque productivo","Kilogramos de carb\u00f3n","Kil\u00f3metros cuadrados"],"correcta":"Hect\u00e1reas de bosque productivo"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"consumo responsable\"?","opciones":["Comprar todo lo que se ve","Elegir productos con baja huella ambiental y social","No pagar por productos","Comprar solo tecnolog\u00eda"],"correcta":"Elegir productos con baja huella ambiental y social"},{"pregunta":"Si disminuimos el desperdicio de alimentos a la mitad, el Overshoot Day:","opciones":["Se adelanta","Se retrasa 13 d\u00edas","No se mueve","Se cancela"],"correcta":"Se retrasa 13 d\u00edas"},{"pregunta":"Componente que mide la demanda de carne y l\u00e1cteos:","opciones":["Cultivos","Pastizales","Pesca","Carbono"],"correcta":"Pastizales"},{"pregunta":"La \"Biocapacidad per c\u00e1pita\" disminuye si:","opciones":["La poblaci\u00f3n aumenta","Se plantan m\u00e1s \u00e1rboles","Llueve m\u00e1s","Baja el consumo"],"correcta":"La poblaci\u00f3n aumenta"},{"pregunta":"Principal gas de invernadero emitido por la agricultura (huella de alimentos):","opciones":["Ox\u00edgeno","Metano y \u00d3xido Nitroso","Arg\u00f3n","Helio"],"correcta":"Metano y \u00d3xido Nitroso"},{"pregunta":"El concepto de \"Un Solo Planeta\" implica vivir dentro de:","opciones":["La ley","La biocapacidad de la Tierra","Un b\u00fanker","Internet"],"correcta":"La biocapacidad de la Tierra"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 causa el retroceso de los glaciares?","opciones":["La huella de pesca","El calentamiento por el efecto invernadero mejorado","La falta de sal","El exceso de nubes"],"correcta":"El calentamiento por el efecto invernadero mejorado"},{"pregunta":"Para frenar el efecto invernadero, la huella de carbono debe ser:","opciones":["Infinita","Cero neto (Net Zero)","Igual a la de 1990","Solo de metano"],"correcta":"Cero neto (Net Zero)"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 mide el indicador \"Planetas Necesarios\"?","opciones":["Cu\u00e1ntos planetas hay en el sistema solar","La escala del exceso de consumo humano","La distancia a Marte","El tama\u00f1o del sol"],"correcta":"La escala del exceso de consumo humano"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"desertificacion-restauracion-sistemas-avanzados","titulo":"Desertificaci\u00f3n y Restauraci\u00f3n: Din\u00e1micas del Suelo, Clima y Resiliencia Ecosist\u00e9mica","contenido":"<div class=\"desertificacion-master\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= INTRODUCCI\u00d3N ================= -->\r\n    <div class=\"text-center mb-5\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"monday-title\">DESERTIFICACI\u00d3N Y RESTAURACI\u00d3N ECOSIST\u00c9MICA AVANZADA<\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"monday-intro\">\r\n            La desertificaci\u00f3n no es un proceso natural, sino una degradaci\u00f3n inducida por actividades humanas y variabilidad clim\u00e1tica.\r\n            Afecta al <strong>40% de la superficie terrestre<\/strong> y compromete la seguridad alimentaria, h\u00eddrica y clim\u00e1tica.\r\n            En esta lecci\u00f3n analizar\u00e1s los <em>mecanismos f\u00edsicos, biol\u00f3gicos y clim\u00e1ticos<\/em> que la provocan, as\u00ed como estrategias\r\n            de restauraci\u00f3n basadas en evidencia cient\u00edfica.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"monday-alert\">\r\n        <strong>UNCCD:<\/strong> degradaci\u00f3n persistente de tierras \u00e1ridas, semi\u00e1ridas y subh\u00famedas secas causada por factores humanos y clim\u00e1ticos.\r\n        No implica expansi\u00f3n natural del desierto, sino p\u00e9rdida de productividad del suelo.\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= TEOR\u00cdA ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title\">1. Mecanismos de Degradaci\u00f3n del Suelo<\/h2>\r\n    <p>\r\n        La desertificaci\u00f3n surge de la interacci\u00f3n entre pr\u00e1cticas humanas y procesos naturales que alteran la estructura,\r\n        fertilidad y estabilidad del suelo.\r\n    <\/p>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"row\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-7\">\r\n            <table class=\"table monday-table\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>Factor<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Proceso<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Consecuencia<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Sobrepastoreo<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Compactaci\u00f3n y p\u00e9rdida de cobertura vegetal<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Erosi\u00f3n e\u00f3lica severa<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Deforestaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                        <td>P\u00e9rdida de ra\u00edces estabilizadoras<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Escorrent\u00eda y erosi\u00f3n h\u00eddrica<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Riego inadecuado<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Acumulaci\u00f3n de sales<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Salinizaci\u00f3n y toxicidad<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Da\u00f1o al criptobioma<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Destrucci\u00f3n de costras biol\u00f3gicas<\/td>\r\n                        <td>P\u00e9rdida de nitr\u00f3geno y estabilidad<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-5\">\r\n            <div class=\"monday-eq-box\">\r\n                \\[\r\n                A = R \\times K \\times LS \\times C \\times P\r\n                \\]\r\n                <p class=\"mt-3\">\r\n                    <strong>USLE:<\/strong> los factores <em>C<\/em> (cobertura) y <em>P<\/em> (manejo)\r\n                    pueden ser modificados directamente mediante restauraci\u00f3n.\r\n                <\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= SVG OPTIMIZADO ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title\">2. Visualizaci\u00f3n Din\u00e1mica: Ciclo Degradaci\u00f3n\u2013Restauraci\u00f3n<\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"monday-svg-container\">\r\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 420\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n            <defs>\r\n                <linearGradient id=\"soilGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\r\n                    <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#a0522d\"\/>\r\n                    <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#5c3317\"\/>\r\n                <\/linearGradient>\r\n            <\/defs>\r\n\r\n            <!-- Suelo -->\r\n            <rect x=\"0\" y=\"260\" width=\"800\" height=\"160\" fill=\"url(#soilGrad)\"\/>\r\n\r\n            <!-- Vegetaci\u00f3n -->\r\n            <g id=\"plants\">\r\n                <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"230\" r=\"35\" fill=\"#2ecc71\"\/>\r\n                <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"240\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#27ae60\"\/>\r\n                <circle cx=\"550\" cy=\"225\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#2ecc71\"\/>\r\n                <circle cx=\"680\" cy=\"240\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#27ae60\"\/>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n\r\n            <!-- Viento -->\r\n            <path d=\"M50 180 Q400 120 750 180\"\r\n                  stroke=\"#d2b48c\" stroke-width=\"7\" fill=\"none\"\r\n                  stroke-dasharray=\"18\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\"\r\n                         from=\"0\" to=\"-200\"\r\n                         dur=\"6s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/path>\r\n\r\n            <!-- Restauraci\u00f3n -->\r\n            <g id=\"restoreLabel\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                <rect x=\"300\" y=\"290\" width=\"200\" height=\"70\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#145a32\"\/>\r\n                <text x=\"400\" y=\"335\" fill=\"#eafff4\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\r\n                    RESTAURACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/text>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n\r\n            <!-- Animaciones -->\r\n            <animate xlink:href=\"#plants\"\r\n                     attributeName=\"opacity\"\r\n                     values=\"1;0.25;0.15;0.4;1\"\r\n                     dur=\"10s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n\r\n            <animate xlink:href=\"#restoreLabel\"\r\n                     attributeName=\"opacity\"\r\n                     values=\"0;0;1;1;0\"\r\n                     begin=\"5s\" dur=\"10s\"\r\n                     repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/svg>\r\n\r\n        <p class=\"small mt-3 text-center\">\r\n            La p\u00e9rdida de vegetaci\u00f3n incrementa la erosi\u00f3n; la restauraci\u00f3n interrumpe el ciclo.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= SIMULADOR 1 ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title\">3. Simulador 1: Erosi\u00f3n del Suelo (USLE)<\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"monday-simulator\">\r\n        <label>Cobertura vegetal (C)<\/label>\r\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"cSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.6\">\r\n\r\n        <label>Pr\u00e1cticas de manejo (P)<\/label>\r\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"pSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.7\">\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"usleOutput\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= SIMULADOR 2 ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title\">4. Simulador 2: Albedo \u2013 Clima Local<\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"monday-simulator\">\r\n        <label>Cobertura vegetal (%)<\/label>\r\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"vegSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"5\" value=\"60\">\r\n\r\n        <label>Albedo superficial<\/label>\r\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"albSlider\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"0.5\" step=\"0.02\" value=\"0.25\">\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"albedoOutput\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= QUIZ ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title\">5. Quiz de Comprensi\u00f3n<\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <p><strong>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 la p\u00e9rdida de vegetaci\u00f3n acelera la desertificaci\u00f3n?<\/strong><\/p>\r\n    <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center\">\r\n        <button class=\"monday-quiz-btn\" onclick=\"quiz(1)\">Reduce el albedo<\/button>\r\n        <button class=\"monday-quiz-btn\" onclick=\"quiz(2)\">Aumenta erosi\u00f3n y retroalimentaci\u00f3n clim\u00e1tica<\/button>\r\n        <button class=\"monday-quiz-btn\" onclick=\"quiz(3)\">Incrementa la fertilidad<\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div id=\"quizFeedback\"><\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= ERRORES ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title\">6. Errores Comunes del Estudiante<\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\" onclick=\"toggleError(1)\">Confundir desertificaci\u00f3n con sequ\u00eda<\/div>\r\n    <div id=\"error1\" class=\"error-detail\">La sequ\u00eda es temporal; la desertificaci\u00f3n implica degradaci\u00f3n estructural del suelo.<\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"error-item\" onclick=\"toggleError(2)\">Ignorar el papel del albedo<\/div>\r\n    <div id=\"error2\" class=\"error-detail\">El aumento del albedo reduce convecci\u00f3n y precipitaci\u00f3n local.<\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= CONEXI\u00d3N ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title\">7. Conexi\u00f3n con Ecosistemas<\/h2>\r\n    <p>\r\n        Tema evaluable: biomas \u00e1ridos, ciclos del nitr\u00f3geno, servicios ecosist\u00e9micos,\r\n        cambio clim\u00e1tico y resiliencia ambiental.\r\n    <\/p>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= EXAMEN ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title\">8. Problemas Tipo Examen<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"monday-exam-problem\">Explica c\u00f3mo la restauraci\u00f3n vegetal modifica los factores C y P de la USLE.<\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"monday-exam-problem\">Relaciona albedo, precipitaci\u00f3n y desertificaci\u00f3n en un ecosistema \u00e1rido.<\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= METACOGNICI\u00d3N ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"monday-section-title\">9. Cierre Metacognitivo<\/h2>\r\n    <p class=\"monday-reflection\">\r\n        \u00bfQu\u00e9 decisiones humanas aceleran la desertificaci\u00f3n en tu regi\u00f3n?\r\n        \u00bfC\u00f3mo podr\u00eda la restauraci\u00f3n cambiar el clima local a largo plazo?\r\n    <\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n\/* ===== SIMULADOR USLE ===== *\/\r\nfunction updateUSLE() {\r\n    const C = parseFloat(document.getElementById('cSlider').value);\r\n    const P = parseFloat(document.getElementById('pSlider').value);\r\n    const A = 120 * 0.25 * 1.5 * C * P;\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('usleOutput').innerHTML =\r\n        '<strong>Erosi\u00f3n:<\/strong> ' + A.toFixed(2) + ' t\/ha\/a\u00f1o<br>' +\r\n        '<strong>Riesgo:<\/strong> ' + (A > 15 ? 'ALTO' : 'MODERADO');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* ===== SIMULADOR ALBEDO ===== *\/\r\nfunction updateAlbedo() {\r\n    const veg = document.getElementById('vegSlider').value;\r\n    const alb = document.getElementById('albSlider').value;\r\n    const temp = (1 - alb) * 35;\r\n    const rain = veg * 0.4;\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('albedoOutput').innerHTML =\r\n        `<strong>Temperatura superficial:<\/strong> ${temp.toFixed(1)} \u00b0C<br>\r\n         <strong>Potencial de precipitaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> ${rain.toFixed(1)} %`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* ===== QUIZ ===== *\/\r\nfunction quiz(opt) {\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').innerHTML =\r\n        opt === 2\r\n        ? '<div class=\"monday-feedback correct\">Correcto: erosi\u00f3n + retroalimentaci\u00f3n clim\u00e1tica.<\/div>'\r\n        : '<div class=\"monday-feedback error\">Incorrecto. Revisa mecanismos de degradaci\u00f3n.<\/div>';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* ===== ERRORES ===== *\/\r\nfunction toggleError(id) {\r\n    const el = document.getElementById('error'+id);\r\n    el.style.display = el.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* INIT *\/\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\r\n    updateUSLE();\r\n    updateAlbedo();\r\n    document.getElementById('cSlider').oninput = updateUSLE;\r\n    document.getElementById('pSlider').oninput = updateUSLE;\r\n    document.getElementById('vegSlider').oninput = updateAlbedo;\r\n    document.getElementById('albSlider').oninput = updateAlbedo;\r\n});\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la diferencia entre desierto y desertificaci\u00f3n?","respuesta":"El desierto es un bioma natural; la desertificaci\u00f3n es un proceso de degradaci\u00f3n inducido por el hombre."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 papel juegan las Costras Biol\u00f3gicas del Suelo (CBS)?","respuesta":"Estabilizan el suelo, fijan nitr\u00f3geno y retienen humedad, evitando la erosi\u00f3n e\u00f3lica inicial."},{"enunciado":"Explique el efecto albedo en la desertificaci\u00f3n.","respuesta":"El suelo desnudo refleja m\u00e1s calor, lo que altera las corrientes de aire e impide la formaci\u00f3n de nubes\/lluvia."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 porcentaje de la superficie terrestre est\u00e1 afectada por la desertificaci\u00f3n?","respuesta":"Aproximadamente el 25%."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 la salinizaci\u00f3n es un problema de gesti\u00f3n humana?","respuesta":"Porque resulta del riego excesivo en zonas \u00e1ridas donde el agua se evapora y deja sales t\u00f3xicas para las plantas."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 componente de la USLE representa la cobertura vegetal?","respuesta":"El factor C."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el objetivo principal de la Gran Muralla Verde adem\u00e1s de plantar \u00e1rboles?","respuesta":"Restaurar la resiliencia socioecol\u00f3gica y la seguridad alimentaria en el Sahel."},{"enunciado":"Mencione tres pa\u00edses l\u00edderes en el proyecto de la Gran Muralla Verde.","respuesta":"Senegal, Etiop\u00eda y Nigeria."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo influye la compactaci\u00f3n del suelo por el ganado?","respuesta":"Reduce la porosidad, impidiendo que el agua de lluvia se infiltre y causando escorrent\u00eda erosiva."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la neutralidad de la degradaci\u00f3n de las tierras (LDN)?","respuesta":"Estado donde la cantidad y calidad de los recursos de tierras se mantiene estable o aumenta."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 el cambio clim\u00e1tico es un \"multiplicador de amenazas\" para la desertificaci\u00f3n?","respuesta":"Porque aumenta la frecuencia e intensidad de sequ\u00edas, sobrepasando la capacidad de recuperaci\u00f3n del suelo."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 relaci\u00f3n tiene el f\u00f3sforo del Sahara con el Amazonas?","respuesta":"El polvo del Sahara viaja por el viento y fertiliza el Amazonas con nutrientes esenciales."}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 microorganismos forman el \"criptobioma\" estabilizador?","opciones":["Lombrices","Cianobacterias y l\u00edquenes","Virus","Ra\u00edces de \u00e1rboles"],"correcta":"Cianobacterias y l\u00edquenes"},{"pregunta":"El aumento del albedo en tierras desertificadas causa:","opciones":["M\u00e1s lluvia","Inhibici\u00f3n de la formaci\u00f3n de nubes","Enfriamiento del suelo","Aparici\u00f3n de r\u00edos"],"correcta":"Inhibici\u00f3n de la formaci\u00f3n de nubes"},{"pregunta":"Longitud meta de la Gran Muralla Verde:","opciones":["8,000 km","1,000 km","500 km","20,000 km"],"correcta":"8,000 km"},{"pregunta":"La salinizaci\u00f3n suele ser causada por:","opciones":["Lluvia \u00e1cida","Riego ineficiente en zonas secas","Tsunamis","Plantaci\u00f3n de pinos"],"correcta":"Riego ineficiente en zonas secas"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 pa\u00eds europeo tiene un 30% de territorio en riesgo alto?","opciones":["Francia","Espa\u00f1a","Polonia","Suecia"],"correcta":"Espa\u00f1a"},{"pregunta":"En la f\u00f3rmula USLE, \"R\" representa:","opciones":["Relieve","Erosividad de la lluvia","Rocas","Rotaci\u00f3n de cultivos"],"correcta":"Erosividad de la lluvia"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 gas de efecto invernadero libera el suelo al degradarse?","opciones":["Ox\u00edgeno","CO2","Arg\u00f3n","Ozono"],"correcta":"CO2"},{"pregunta":"La agroforester\u00eda combina:","opciones":["\u00c1rboles y cultivos\/ganado","Solo \u00e1rboles","Qu\u00edmicos y agua","Peces y plantas"],"correcta":"\u00c1rboles y cultivos\/ganado"},{"pregunta":"Horizonte del suelo que se pierde primero por erosi\u00f3n:","opciones":["Horizonte B","Horizonte A (org\u00e1nico)","Roca madre","Horizonte C"],"correcta":"Horizonte A (org\u00e1nico)"},{"pregunta":"Meta 2030 de la UNCCD:","opciones":["Convertir desiertos en bosques","Neutralidad de la degradaci\u00f3n (LDN)","Trasladar poblaciones","Prohibir la agricultura"],"correcta":"Neutralidad de la degradaci\u00f3n (LDN)"},{"pregunta":"La compactaci\u00f3n del suelo por ganado reduce la:","opciones":["Salinidad","Infiltraci\u00f3n de agua","Erosi\u00f3n","Temperatura"],"correcta":"Infiltraci\u00f3n de agua"},{"pregunta":"El desplazamiento de las isoyetas hacia el norte afecta a:","opciones":["La Ant\u00e1rtida","La Cuenca Mediterr\u00e1nea","El Amazonas","Groenlandia"],"correcta":"La Cuenca Mediterr\u00e1nea"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 t\u00e9cnica crea \"muros vivos\" contra el viento?","opciones":["Arado profundo","Barreras cortavientos","Uso de asfalto","Quema de rastrojos"],"correcta":"Barreras cortavientos"},{"pregunta":"La desertificaci\u00f3n afecta a cu\u00e1ntas personas seg\u00fan la ONU:","opciones":["1,000 millones","1,500 millones","10 millones","500 millones"],"correcta":"1,500 millones"},{"pregunta":"Principal nutriente que viaja en el polvo del Sahara:","opciones":["Hierro","F\u00f3sforo","Magnesio","Oro"],"correcta":"F\u00f3sforo"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l NO es una zona de riesgo de desertificaci\u00f3n?","opciones":["Sahel","Selva Lacandona (h\u00fameda)","Asia Central","Outback australiano"],"correcta":"Selva Lacandona (h\u00fameda)"},{"pregunta":"Las CBS (Costras Biol\u00f3gicas) son sensibles a:","opciones":["El sol","El pisoteo y veh\u00edculos","La lluvia","El viento"],"correcta":"El pisoteo y veh\u00edculos"},{"pregunta":"El factor \"LS\" en la USLE se refiere a:","opciones":["Luz Solar","Longitud y Grado de Pendiente","Lluvia y Suelo","L\u00edquenes"],"correcta":"Longitud y Grado de Pendiente"},{"pregunta":"La rotaci\u00f3n de cultivos ayuda a:","opciones":["Compactar el suelo","Mantener el equilibrio de nutrientes","Aumentar la salinidad","Eliminar el agua"],"correcta":"Mantener el equilibrio de nutrientes"},{"pregunta":"Costo estimado de p\u00e9rdida econ\u00f3mica global anual:","opciones":["US$ 1 mill\u00f3n","US$ 42 mil millones","US$ 100","US$ 5 billones"],"correcta":"US$ 42 mil millones"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 ocurre con la biodiversidad en la desertificaci\u00f3n?","opciones":["Aumenta","Disminuye dr\u00e1sticamente","Se mantiene igual","Se vuelve marina"],"correcta":"Disminuye dr\u00e1sticamente"},{"pregunta":"Principal beneficio de la Gran Muralla Verde:","opciones":["Retener arena y humedad","Extraer petr\u00f3leo","Construir una carretera","Separar pa\u00edses"],"correcta":"Retener arena y humedad"},{"pregunta":"El \"barbecho\" es una t\u00e9cnica de:","opciones":["Destrucci\u00f3n","Descanso del suelo para recuperaci\u00f3n","Riego por goteo","Quema controlada"],"correcta":"Descanso del suelo para recuperaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"La escorrent\u00eda es mayor en suelos:","opciones":["Boscosos","Degradados y compactos","Arenosos profundos","Con mucha hojarasca"],"correcta":"Degradados y compactos"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 regi\u00f3n de Asia tiene un 40% de degradaci\u00f3n?","opciones":["Jap\u00f3n","Asia Central (Mongolia)","India sur","Indonesia"],"correcta":"Asia Central (Mongolia)"},{"pregunta":"En Australia, el % de degradaci\u00f3n alcanza el:","opciones":["75%","10%","50%","5%"],"correcta":"75%"},{"pregunta":"El albedo mide la:","opciones":["Humedad","Reflectividad de la superficie","Cantidad de \u00e1rboles","Salinidad del agua"],"correcta":"Reflectividad de la superficie"},{"pregunta":"La restauraci\u00f3n de 1 hect\u00e1rea cuesta aprox:","opciones":["US$ 500","US$ 10,000","US$ 1","US$ 1 mill\u00f3n"],"correcta":"US$ 500"},{"pregunta":"Un \"wadi\" es caracter\u00edstico de zonas:","opciones":["Polares","\u00c1ridas (cauce seco)","Pantanosas","Selv\u00e1ticas"],"correcta":"\u00c1ridas (cauce seco)"},{"pregunta":"D\u00eda Mundial de Lucha contra la Desertificaci\u00f3n:","opciones":["17 de junio","5 de mayo","21 de septiembre","1 de enero"],"correcta":"17 de junio"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"deforestacion-global-y-clima-avanzado","titulo":"Deforestaci\u00f3n: El Colapso de los Sumideros de Carbono","contenido":"<div class=\"deforestacion-master\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= INTRODUCCI\u00d3N ================= -->\r\n    <div class=\"text-center mb-5\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"def-title\">DEFORESTACI\u00d3N Y COLAPSO CLIM\u00c1TICO GLOBAL<\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"def-intro\">\r\n            La deforestaci\u00f3n representa la p\u00e9rdida de los sistemas m\u00e1s eficientes de regulaci\u00f3n clim\u00e1tica del planeta.\r\n            Los bosques no solo almacenan carbono: controlan el ciclo del agua, estabilizan suelos y sostienen la biodiversidad.\r\n            Su degradaci\u00f3n transforma sumideros en <strong>emisores netos de CO\u2082<\/strong>.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= ESTADO GLOBAL ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"def-section\">1. Estado de los Bosques Globales (2025)<\/h2>\r\n    <p>\r\n        Actualmente se pierden cerca de <strong>13 millones de hect\u00e1reas de bosque al a\u00f1o<\/strong>.\r\n        Esta p\u00e9rdida tiene impactos acumulativos sobre el clima, los servicios ecosist\u00e9micos y la estabilidad socioecon\u00f3mica.\r\n    <\/p>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"row\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-7\">\r\n            <ul class=\"def-list\">\r\n                <li><strong>70% \u2013 Ganader\u00eda y forraje:<\/strong> conversi\u00f3n directa a pastizales y soja.<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>20% \u2013 Palma aceitera y caucho:<\/strong> destrucci\u00f3n de turberas ricas en carbono.<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>10% \u2013 Miner\u00eda e infraestructura:<\/strong> fragmentaci\u00f3n irreversible del paisaje.<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-5\">\r\n            <div class=\"def-alert\">\r\n                <strong>Punto de no retorno amaz\u00f3nico<\/strong>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    La Amazon\u00eda recicla hasta el 50% de su precipitaci\u00f3n.\r\n                    Superar el <strong>20\u201325%<\/strong> de deforestaci\u00f3n rompe el sistema hidrol\u00f3gico,\r\n                    iniciando un proceso de <strong>sabanizaci\u00f3n irreversible<\/strong>.\r\n                <\/p>\r\n                <small>Estado actual: ~18.2% deforestado<\/small>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= BOMBA BI\u00d3TICA ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"def-section\">2. Bomba Bi\u00f3tica y R\u00edos Voladores<\/h2>\r\n    <p>\r\n        Los bosques tropicales funcionan como una bomba atmosf\u00e9rica.\r\n        Mediante la evapotranspiraci\u00f3n, los \u00e1rboles liberan enormes vol\u00famenes de vapor de agua,\r\n        generando flujos de humedad conocidos como <strong>r\u00edos voladores<\/strong>.\r\n    <\/p>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= CICLO DEL CARBONO ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"def-section\">3. Termodin\u00e1mica del Carbono Forestal<\/h2>\r\n    <p>\r\n        La biomasa forestal representa carbono almacenado en un estado de baja entrop\u00eda.\r\n        La deforestaci\u00f3n oxida r\u00e1pidamente este carbono, liber\u00e1ndolo a la atm\u00f3sfera.\r\n    <\/p>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"def-eq\">\r\n        $$C_{stock} = A \\times \\rho_{biomasa} \\times f_{carbono}$$\r\n        <p class=\"small\">\r\n            <strong>A:<\/strong> \u00e1rea (ha) \u00b7\r\n            <strong>\u03c1:<\/strong> densidad (t\/ha) \u00b7\r\n            <strong>f:<\/strong> fracci\u00f3n de carbono (~0.50)\r\n        <\/p>\r\n        <p class=\"small\"><em>Las turberas tropicales almacenan hasta 10\u00d7 m\u00e1s carbono por hect\u00e1rea.<\/em><\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= SVG ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"def-section\">4. Visualizaci\u00f3n: De Sumidero a Emisor<\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"def-svg\">\r\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 700 320\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n            <rect x=\"0\" y=\"220\" width=\"700\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#5b3a1e\"\/>\r\n            \r\n            <g id=\"forest\">\r\n                <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"200\" r=\"35\" fill=\"#2ecc71\"\/>\r\n                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"190\" r=\"45\" fill=\"#27ae60\"\/>\r\n                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"205\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#2ecc71\"\/>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n\r\n            <animate xlink:href=\"#forest\"\r\n                attributeName=\"opacity\"\r\n                values=\"1;0.3;0.1;0.3;1\"\r\n                dur=\"10s\"\r\n                repeatCount=\"indefinite\" \/>\r\n\r\n            <g id=\"co2\">\r\n                <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"200\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#ff5733\">\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"cy\" from=\"200\" to=\"40\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <\/circle>\r\n                <circle cx=\"480\" cy=\"210\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#ff5733\" opacity=\"0.6\">\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"cy\" from=\"210\" to=\"60\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <\/circle>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n\r\n            <text x=\"350\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffcc00\" font-size=\"18\">\r\n                COLAPSO DEL SUMIDERO DE CARBONO\r\n            <\/text>\r\n        <\/svg>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= SIMULADOR ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"def-section\">5. Simulador: P\u00e9rdida de Carbono<\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"def-sim\">\r\n        <label>\u00c1rea deforestada (ha)<\/label>\r\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"areaSlider\" min=\"10\" max=\"1000\" step=\"10\" value=\"200\">\r\n\r\n        <label>Densidad biomasa (t\/ha)<\/label>\r\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"densSlider\" min=\"50\" max=\"300\" step=\"10\" value=\"150\">\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"carbonOutput\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= QUIZ ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"def-section\">6. Quiz de Evaluaci\u00f3n<\/h2>\r\n    <p><strong>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 la deforestaci\u00f3n convierte al bosque en emisor neto?<\/strong><\/p>\r\n\r\n    <button class=\"def-btn\" onclick=\"quizDef(1)\">Porque reduce la biodiversidad<\/button>\r\n    <button class=\"def-btn\" onclick=\"quizDef(2)\">Porque oxida el carbono almacenado<\/button>\r\n    <button class=\"def-btn\" onclick=\"quizDef(3)\">Porque enfr\u00eda el clima<\/button>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"quizDefFeedback\"><\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= ERRORES ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"def-section\">7. Errores Comunes del Estudiante<\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"def-error\" onclick=\"toggleDef(1)\">Confundir deforestaci\u00f3n con reforestaci\u00f3n neta<\/div>\r\n    <div id=\"defErr1\" class=\"def-error-detail\">\r\n        Plantar \u00e1rboles j\u00f3venes no compensa la p\u00e9rdida de bosques maduros en escalas clim\u00e1ticas.\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"def-error\" onclick=\"toggleDef(2)\">Ignorar el papel del agua<\/div>\r\n    <div id=\"defErr2\" class=\"def-error-detail\">\r\n        La deforestaci\u00f3n altera precipitaci\u00f3n regional, no solo el CO\u2082.\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= EXAMEN ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"def-section\">8. Problemas Tipo Examen<\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"def-exam\">Explica el concepto de bomba bi\u00f3tica y su relaci\u00f3n con la Amazon\u00eda.<\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"def-exam\">Analiza por qu\u00e9 REDD+ enfrenta desaf\u00edos de gobernanza.<\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ================= METACOGNICI\u00d3N ================= -->\r\n    <h2 class=\"def-section\">9. Cierre Metacognitivo<\/h2>\r\n    <p class=\"def-reflection\">\r\n        \u00bfPuede la econom\u00eda global desacoplarse de la deforestaci\u00f3n?\r\n        \u00bfQu\u00e9 rol juega el consumo individual en este proceso?\r\n    <\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction updateCarbon() {\r\n    var A = document.getElementById('areaSlider').value;\r\n    var D = document.getElementById('densSlider').value;\r\n    var C = A * D * 0.5;\r\n    document.getElementById('carbonOutput').innerHTML =\r\n        '<strong>Carbono liberado:<\/strong> ' + C.toFixed(0) + ' toneladas';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction quizDef(opt) {\r\n    document.getElementById('quizDefFeedback').innerHTML =\r\n        opt === 2\r\n        ? '<div class=\"def-ok\">Correcto: oxidaci\u00f3n del carbono almacenado.<\/div>'\r\n        : '<div class=\"def-bad\">Incorrecto. Revisa el ciclo del carbono.<\/div>';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction toggleDef(id) {\r\n    var el = document.getElementById('defErr' + id);\r\n    el.style.display = el.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\r\n    updateCarbon();\r\n    document.getElementById('areaSlider').oninput = updateCarbon;\r\n    document.getElementById('densSlider').oninput = updateCarbon;\r\n});\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la diferencia entre deforestaci\u00f3n y degradaci\u00f3n forestal?","respuesta":"La deforestaci\u00f3n es la eliminaci\u00f3n total del bosque; la degradaci\u00f3n es la p\u00e9rdida de calidad, biodiversidad y biomasa sin cambiar el uso del suelo."},{"enunciado":"Explique el concepto de \"R\u00edos Voladores\".","respuesta":"Es el transporte masivo de vapor de agua desde la Amazon\u00eda hacia otras regiones, impulsado por la evapotranspiraci\u00f3n de los \u00e1rboles."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 las turberas en Indonesia son \"bombas de carbono\"?","respuesta":"Porque almacenan carbono org\u00e1nico milenario en el suelo; al ser drenadas o quemadas, liberan cantidades masivas de CO2 y metano."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 papel juega la certificaci\u00f3n FSC?","respuesta":"Garantiza que la madera y productos forestales provienen de bosques gestionados bajo est\u00e1ndares ambientales y sociales estrictos."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 ocurre con el albedo local tras la deforestaci\u00f3n?","respuesta":"Aumenta, ya que el suelo desnudo o los pastos reflejan m\u00e1s radiaci\u00f3n que el dosel oscuro del bosque."},{"enunciado":"Calcule el stock de carbono de 10 ha con una densidad de biomasa de 180 t\/ha.","respuesta":"10 ha * 180 t\/ha * 0.5 (f. carbono) = 900 toneladas de Carbono."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 la Amazon\u00eda es considerada un sistema \"autoeid\u00e9tico\"?","respuesta":"Porque recicla su propia humedad; los \u00e1rboles dependen de la lluvia que ellos mismos generan."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el Desaf\u00edo de Bonn?","respuesta":"Un esfuerzo global para restaurar 350 millones de hect\u00e1reas de tierras degradadas para 2030."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo afecta la fragmentaci\u00f3n del h\u00e1bitat al \"efecto de borde\"?","respuesta":"Aumenta la exposici\u00f3n del interior del bosque a la desecaci\u00f3n, el viento y especies invasoras."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"carbono azul\" y d\u00f3nde se encuentra?","respuesta":"Es el carbono almacenado en ecosistemas costeros como manglares, marismas y praderas marinas."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la principal diferencia entre REDD y REDD+?","respuesta":"El signo \"+\" incluye la gesti\u00f3n sostenible de los bosques y el aumento de las reservas de carbono (reforestaci\u00f3n)."},{"enunciado":"Mencione un impacto de la deforestaci\u00f3n en la salud humana.","respuesta":"Aumenta el riesgo de zoonosis (enfermedades transmitidas de animales a humanos) al reducir la barrera natural del bosque."}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Principal motor de deforestaci\u00f3n en el Sudeste Asi\u00e1tico:","opciones":["Aceite de palma","Ganader\u00eda","Turismo","Trigo"],"correcta":"Aceite de palma"},{"pregunta":"Porcentaje de emisiones globales de GEI por deforestaci\u00f3n:","opciones":["5%","12-18%","50%","2%"],"correcta":"12-18%"},{"pregunta":"Un \u00e1rbol de gran porte en el Amazonas puede evaporar al d\u00eda:","opciones":["1 litro","10 litros","1,000 litros","50 litros"],"correcta":"1,000 litros"},{"pregunta":"El \"punto de inflexi\u00f3n\" de la Amazon\u00eda se estima en:","opciones":["10%","20-25%","50%","90%"],"correcta":"20-25%"},{"pregunta":"La Amazon\u00eda actualmente se encuentra en un estado de:","opciones":["Recuperaci\u00f3n total","18.2% de deforestaci\u00f3n","Sin cambios desde 1990","0% de p\u00e9rdida"],"correcta":"18.2% de deforestaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"El mecanismo REDD+ es liderado por:","opciones":["FMI","ONU (CMNUCC)","Interpol","Silicon Valley"],"correcta":"ONU (CMNUCC)"},{"pregunta":"La sabanizaci\u00f3n implica la transformaci\u00f3n de selva en:","opciones":["Desierto de arena","Sabana seca con pastos","Oc\u00e9ano","Ciudad industrial"],"correcta":"Sabana seca con pastos"},{"pregunta":"Certificaci\u00f3n l\u00edder en gesti\u00f3n forestal sostenible:","opciones":["FSC","ISO 14001","Greenpeace Gold","EcoLabel"],"correcta":"FSC"},{"pregunta":"Factor de conversi\u00f3n aproximado de biomasa seca a carbono:","opciones":["10%","100%","50%","5%"],"correcta":"50%"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 pa\u00eds implement\u00f3 la \"L\u00ednea Roja de Protecci\u00f3n Ecol\u00f3gica\"?","opciones":["Brasil","China","Canad\u00e1","Estados Unidos"],"correcta":"China"},{"pregunta":"La mayor\u00eda del carbono en bosques tropicales est\u00e1 en:","opciones":["El suelo","La biomasa a\u00e9rea (troncos\/hojas)","Las ra\u00edces profundas","Los r\u00edos"],"correcta":"La biomasa a\u00e9rea (troncos\/hojas)"},{"pregunta":"Efecto de la deforestaci\u00f3n en las lluvias regionales:","opciones":["Las aumenta","Las reduce dr\u00e1sticamente","No tiene efecto","Vuelve el agua salada"],"correcta":"Las reduce dr\u00e1sticamente"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es un bosque primario?","opciones":["Un bosque joven","Un bosque sin intervenci\u00f3n humana significativa","Un parque urbano","Un vivero"],"correcta":"Un bosque sin intervenci\u00f3n humana significativa"},{"pregunta":"La miner\u00eda ilegal en el Amazonas usa mercurio para extraer:","opciones":["Litio","Oro","Cobre","Petr\u00f3leo"],"correcta":"Oro"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 regi\u00f3n tiene la mayor tasa de deforestaci\u00f3n neta actual?","opciones":["Europa","\u00c1frica y Am\u00e9rica del Sur","Norteam\u00e9rica","Australia"],"correcta":"\u00c1frica y Am\u00e9rica del Sur"},{"pregunta":"El Desaf\u00edo de Bonn busca restaurar tierras para el a\u00f1o:","opciones":["2025","2030","2050","2100"],"correcta":"2030"},{"pregunta":"La p\u00e9rdida de h\u00e1bitat forestal causa la extinci\u00f3n anual de aprox:","opciones":["100 especies","50,000 especies","1 mill\u00f3n de especies","10 especies"],"correcta":"50,000 especies"},{"pregunta":"El \"efecto de borde\" hace que los parches de bosque sean:","opciones":["M\u00e1s fuertes","M\u00e1s vulnerables a incendios y sequ\u00eda","M\u00e1s grandes","M\u00e1s oscuros"],"correcta":"M\u00e1s vulnerables a incendios y sequ\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"ODS que protege la vida de ecosistemas terrestres:","opciones":["ODS 1","ODS 15","ODS 7","ODS 13"],"correcta":"ODS 15"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 gas emiten las turberas al ser drenadas?","opciones":["Solo ox\u00edgeno","CO2 y Metano","Arg\u00f3n","Cript\u00f3n"],"correcta":"CO2 y Metano"},{"pregunta":"La evapotranspiraci\u00f3n es un proceso de:","opciones":["Calentamiento","Enfriamiento y transporte de humedad","Solidificaci\u00f3n","Combusti\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Enfriamiento y transporte de humedad"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"lavado de madera\"?","opciones":["Limpiar troncos","Hacer pasar madera ilegal como legal","Pintar muebles","Uso de qu\u00edmicos en aserraderos"],"correcta":"Hacer pasar madera ilegal como legal"},{"pregunta":"La soja en el Amazonas se usa principalmente para:","opciones":["Consumo humano directo","Alimento para ganado (forraje)","Biocombustible para aviones","Cosm\u00e9ticos"],"correcta":"Alimento para ganado (forraje)"},{"pregunta":"Un sumidero de carbono es aquel que:","opciones":["Emite CO2","Absorbe m\u00e1s CO2 del que emite","Produce petr\u00f3leo","No tiene plantas"],"correcta":"Absorbe m\u00e1s CO2 del que emite"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 pa\u00eds tiene la mayor superficie de selva tropical?","opciones":["Congo","Brasil","Indonesia","Per\u00fa"],"correcta":"Brasil"},{"pregunta":"La biomasa se mide usualmente en:","opciones":["Litros","Toneladas de materia seca por hect\u00e1rea","Metros","Grados"],"correcta":"Toneladas de materia seca por hect\u00e1rea"},{"pregunta":"La deforestaci\u00f3n aumenta la incidencia de inundaciones porque:","opciones":["Hay menos \u00e1rboles para absorber agua y frenar escorrent\u00eda","Hay m\u00e1s lluvia","El suelo se vuelve esponjoso","Los r\u00edos se tapan con hojas"],"correcta":"Hay menos \u00e1rboles para absorber agua y frenar escorrent\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el costo promedio de restaurar 1 ha de selva?","opciones":["US$ 10","US$ 2,000","US$ 50,000","US$ 1 mill\u00f3n"],"correcta":"US$ 2,000"},{"pregunta":"El t\u00e9rmino \"Amazon\u00eda\" abarca territorios de:","opciones":["1 pa\u00eds","9 pa\u00edses","20 pa\u00edses","5 pa\u00edses"],"correcta":"9 pa\u00edses"},{"pregunta":"D\u00eda Internacional de los Bosques:","opciones":["21 de marzo","12 de diciembre","1 de mayo","15 de agosto"],"correcta":"21 de marzo"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"sucesion-primaria-master","titulo":"Sucesi\u00f3n Primaria: Del Caos Geol\u00f3gico al Orden Biol\u00f3gico","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-sucesion\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= 1. INTRODUCCI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL ================= -->\r\n<div class=\"concepto-maestro\">\r\n    <strong>\ud83c\udf31 CONCEPTO MAESTRO:<\/strong>  \r\n    La sucesi\u00f3n primaria describe la <strong>emergencia de complejidad ecol\u00f3gica<\/strong> en sistemas sin vida previa ni suelo.\r\n    Es un proceso termodin\u00e1mico de reducci\u00f3n local de entrop\u00eda impulsado por energ\u00eda solar.\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"text-primary mt-4\">Del Caos al Orden: La Construcci\u00f3n de Ecosistemas<\/h2>\r\n<p>La sucesi\u00f3n ecol\u00f3gica es el proceso ordenado de cambio en la estructura de una comunidad a lo largo del tiempo. \r\nLa <strong>sucesi\u00f3n primaria<\/strong> ocurre en lugares donde no existe suelo previo: rocas reci\u00e9n expuestas, lava volc\u00e1nica, \r\nretroceso de glaciares o dunas de arena reci\u00e9n formadas.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"alert alert-info\">\r\n    <strong>\ud83d\udccc Ejemplo del mundo real:<\/strong> La isla de Surtsey, surgida en 1963 por erupci\u00f3n volc\u00e1nica frente a Islandia, \r\n    es un laboratorio natural de sucesi\u00f3n primaria donde se ha documentado cada etapa desde roca desnuda hasta ecosistema complejo.\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= 2. DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO ================= -->\r\n<h3 class=\"text-primary mt-4\">2.1 Colonizadores del Vac\u00edo: Biolog\u00eda Extrema<\/h3>\r\n<p>Los primeros organismos no compiten: <strong>crean las condiciones para la vida futura<\/strong>. \r\nSon ingenieros de ecosistemas que transforman el sustrato abi\u00f3tico.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row mt-3\">\r\n    <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n        <div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n            <div class=\"card-body\">\r\n                <h5 class=\"card-title\">\ud83e\uddeb Organismos Pioneros<\/h5>\r\n                <ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n                    <li class=\"list-group-item\"><strong>L\u00edquenes:<\/strong> Simbiosis alga-hongo. Meteorizaci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica + fijaci\u00f3n de carbono.<\/li>\r\n                    <li class=\"list-group-item\"><strong>Cianobacterias:<\/strong> Fijan N\u2082 \u2192 NH\u2083 (base del ciclo del nitr\u00f3geno).<\/li>\r\n                    <li class=\"list-group-item\"><strong>Musgos:<\/strong> Retenci\u00f3n h\u00eddrica y acumulaci\u00f3n de detritos org\u00e1nicos.<\/li>\r\n                    <li class=\"list-group-item\"><strong>Helechos:<\/strong> Primeros en desarrollar sistemas vasculares complejos.<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n        <div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n            <div class=\"card-body\">\r\n                <h5 class=\"card-title\">\u2697\ufe0f Procesos Biogeoqu\u00edmicos Iniciales<\/h5>\r\n                <div class=\"text-center p-3 bg-light rounded\">\r\n                    <h6>Meteorizaci\u00f3n Qu\u00edmica<\/h6>\r\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">$$CaCO_3 + 2H^+ \\rightarrow Ca^{2+} + CO_2 + H_2O$$<\/p>\r\n                    <small class=\"text-muted\">Los \u00e1cidos org\u00e1nicos (l\u00edquenes) aceleran la pedog\u00e9nesis 1000x<\/small>\r\n                    \r\n                    <hr class=\"my-3\">\r\n                    \r\n                    <h6>Fijaci\u00f3n de Nitr\u00f3geno<\/h6>\r\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">$$N_2 + 8H^+ + 8e^- \\rightarrow 2NH_3 + H_2$$<\/p>\r\n                    <small class=\"text-muted\">Catalizado por nitrogenasa (cianobacterias)<\/small>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= 3. VISUALIZACI\u00d3N INTERACTIVA ================= -->\r\n<h3 class=\"text-primary mt-5\">3. Evoluci\u00f3n Temporal del Ecosistema<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"svg-animado\">\r\n<svg id=\"svgSucesion\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; background: #0d47a1;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- Leyenda animada -->\r\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"760\" height=\"360\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.1)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n\r\n<!-- Suelo en evoluci\u00f3n -->\r\n<rect id=\"sueloBase\" x=\"50\" y=\"320\" width=\"700\" height=\"0\" fill=\"#5d4037\">\r\n    <animate attributeName=\"height\" begin=\"0s\" dur=\"8s\" fill=\"freeze\" values=\"0;0;0;20;40;60;80\"\/>\r\n    <animate attributeName=\"y\" begin=\"0s\" dur=\"8s\" fill=\"freeze\" values=\"320;320;320;300;280;260;240\"\/>\r\n<\/rect>\r\n\r\n<!-- Capas de suelo -->\r\n<rect id=\"sueloHumus\" x=\"50\" y=\"360\" width=\"700\" height=\"0\" fill=\"#3e2723\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n    <animate attributeName=\"height\" begin=\"4s\" dur=\"4s\" fill=\"freeze\" from=\"0\" to=\"40\"\/>\r\n    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" begin=\"4s\" dur=\"1s\" fill=\"freeze\" from=\"0\" to=\"1\"\/>\r\n<\/rect>\r\n\r\n<!-- Etapa 1: Rocas (0-20 a\u00f1os) -->\r\n<g id=\"etapaRocas\" opacity=\"1\">\r\n    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"300\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#78909c\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n    <rect x=\"180\" y=\"280\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#78909c\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n    <rect x=\"300\" y=\"290\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#78909c\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n    <rect x=\"450\" y=\"310\" width=\"70\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#78909c\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" begin=\"0s\" dur=\"1s\" fill=\"freeze\" values=\"1;0.5;0;0;0;0;0\"\/>\r\n<\/g>\r\n\r\n<!-- Etapa 2: L\u00edquenes (20-50 a\u00f1os) -->\r\n<g id=\"etapaLiquenes\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n    <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"280\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#b0bec5\"\/>\r\n    <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"260\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#b0bec5\"\/>\r\n    <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"270\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#b0bec5\"\/>\r\n    <circle cx=\"480\" cy=\"290\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#b0bec5\"\/>\r\n    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" begin=\"1s\" dur=\"1s\" fill=\"freeze\" values=\"0;1;0.8;0.3;0;0;0\"\/>\r\n<\/g>\r\n\r\n<!-- Etapa 3: Musgos y herb\u00e1ceas (50-100 a\u00f1os) -->\r\n<g id=\"etapaMusgos\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n    <rect x=\"150\" y=\"250\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#66bb6a\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n    <rect x=\"250\" y=\"240\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#66bb6a\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n    <rect x=\"400\" y=\"260\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" fill=\"#66bb6a\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" begin=\"2s\" dur=\"1s\" fill=\"freeze\" values=\"0;0;1;0.6;0.2;0;0\"\/>\r\n<\/g>\r\n\r\n<!-- Etapa 4: Arbustos (100-200 a\u00f1os) -->\r\n<g id=\"etapaArbustos\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n    <path d=\"M200 200 L220 150 L240 200 Z\" fill=\"#2e7d32\"\/>\r\n    <path d=\"M350 210 L370 160 L390 210 Z\" fill=\"#2e7d32\"\/>\r\n    <path d=\"M500 220 L520 170 L540 220 Z\" fill=\"#2e7d32\"\/>\r\n    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" begin=\"3s\" dur=\"1s\" fill=\"freeze\" values=\"0;0;0;1;0.7;0.3;0\"\/>\r\n<\/g>\r\n\r\n<!-- Etapa 5: Bosque joven (200-300 a\u00f1os) -->\r\n<g id=\"etapaBosqueJoven\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n    <rect x=\"250\" y=\"180\" width=\"15\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#5d4037\"\/>\r\n    <circle cx=\"257\" cy=\"160\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#1b5e20\"\/>\r\n    \r\n    <rect x=\"450\" y=\"190\" width=\"15\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#5d4037\"\/>\r\n    <circle cx=\"457\" cy=\"170\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#1b5e20\"\/>\r\n    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" begin=\"4s\" dur=\"1s\" fill=\"freeze\" values=\"0;0;0;0;1;0.8;0.4\"\/>\r\n<\/g>\r\n\r\n<!-- Etapa 6: Bosque maduro (300-500+ a\u00f1os) -->\r\n<g id=\"etapaBosqueMaduro\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n    <rect x=\"150\" y=\"150\" width=\"20\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#3e2723\"\/>\r\n    <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"120\" r=\"35\" fill=\"#004d40\"\/>\r\n    \r\n    <rect x=\"350\" y=\"130\" width=\"22\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#3e2723\"\/>\r\n    <circle cx=\"361\" cy=\"100\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#004d40\"\/>\r\n    \r\n    <rect x=\"550\" y=\"140\" width=\"20\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#3e2723\"\/>\r\n    <circle cx=\"560\" cy=\"110\" r=\"38\" fill=\"#004d40\"\/>\r\n    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" begin=\"5s\" dur=\"2s\" fill=\"freeze\" values=\"0;0;0;0;0;1;1\"\/>\r\n<\/g>\r\n\r\n<!-- Texto din\u00e1mico -->\r\n<text id=\"textoTiempo\" x=\"400\" y=\"50\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n    A\u00d1O 0: ROCA DESNUDA\r\n<\/text>\r\n\r\n<!-- Escala de tiempo -->\r\n<line x1=\"50\" x2=\"750\" y1=\"380\" y2=\"380\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n<text x=\"50\" y=\"395\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\">0 a\u00f1os<\/text>\r\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"395\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\">50<\/text>\r\n<text x=\"350\" y=\"395\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\">100<\/text>\r\n<text x=\"500\" y=\"395\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\">200<\/text>\r\n<text x=\"650\" y=\"395\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\">300<\/text>\r\n<text x=\"750\" y=\"395\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"12\">500+<\/text>\r\n\r\n<\/svg>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"leyenda-ecologica\">\r\n    <div class=\"leyenda-item\">\r\n        <div class=\"leyenda-color\" style=\"background: #78909c\"><\/div>\r\n        <span>Roca desnuda<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"leyenda-item\">\r\n        <div class=\"leyenda-color\" style=\"background: #b0bec5\"><\/div>\r\n        <span>L\u00edquenes<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"leyenda-item\">\r\n        <div class=\"leyenda-color\" style=\"background: #66bb6a\"><\/div>\r\n        <span>Musgos<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"leyenda-item\">\r\n        <div class=\"leyenda-color\" style=\"background: #2e7d32\"><\/div>\r\n        <span>Arbustos<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"leyenda-item\">\r\n        <div class=\"leyenda-color\" style=\"background: #1b5e20\"><\/div>\r\n        <span>Bosque joven<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"leyenda-item\">\r\n        <div class=\"leyenda-color\" style=\"background: #004d40\"><\/div>\r\n        <span>Bosque maduro<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center mt-3\">\r\n    <button class=\"btn btn-outline-light me-2\" onclick=\"animarSucesion()\">\u25b6\ufe0f Reproducir animaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n    <button class=\"btn btn-outline-light\" onclick=\"reiniciarAnimacion()\">\u21ba Reiniciar<\/button>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= 4.1 SIMULADOR 1: CRONOSECUENCIA ================= -->\r\n<h3 class=\"text-primary mt-5\">4.1 \ud83e\uddea Simulador: Cronosecuencia Ecol\u00f3gica<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-simulador border-success\">\r\n    <div class=\"card-header-simulador bg-success text-white\">\r\n        \ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Evoluci\u00f3n Temporal del Ecosistema\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"card-body-simulador\">\r\n        <p>Explora c\u00f3mo cambian los par\u00e1metros ecol\u00f3gicos a lo largo de la sucesi\u00f3n:<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4\">\r\n            <button class=\"boton-etapa\" onclick=\"mostrarEtapa(0)\">A\u00f1o 0: Roca<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"boton-etapa\" onclick=\"mostrarEtapa(20)\">A\u00f1o 20: Pioneras<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"boton-etapa\" onclick=\"mostrarEtapa(50)\">A\u00f1o 50: Herb\u00e1ceas<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"boton-etapa\" onclick=\"mostrarEtapa(100)\">A\u00f1o 100: Arbustos<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"boton-etapa\" onclick=\"mostrarEtapa(200)\">A\u00f1o 200: Bosque joven<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"boton-etapa\" onclick=\"mostrarEtapa(500)\">A\u00f1o 500+: Cl\u00edmax<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div id=\"resultadoEtapa\" class=\"resultado-simulador\">\r\n            <em>Selecciona una etapa para ver las caracter\u00edsticas ecol\u00f3gicas...<\/em>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div id=\"detallesEtapa\" class=\"mt-4 p-3 bg-white border rounded\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h6>\ud83d\udcca Par\u00e1metros medibles:<\/h6>\r\n            <div class=\"row mt-2\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n                    <div class=\"p-2 border rounded\">\r\n                        <strong>Biomasa:<\/strong> <span id=\"biomasa\">--<\/span> g\/m\u00b2\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n                    <div class=\"p-2 border rounded\">\r\n                        <strong>Diversidad:<\/strong> <span id=\"diversidad\">--<\/span> especies\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n                    <div class=\"p-2 border rounded\">\r\n                        <strong>Prof. suelo:<\/strong> <span id=\"suelo\">--<\/span> cm\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= 4.2 SIMULADOR 2: ALBEDO Y MICROCLIMA ================= -->\r\n<h3 class=\"text-primary mt-5\">4.2 \ud83c\udf21\ufe0f Simulador: Albedo y Microclima<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-simulador border-info\">\r\n    <div class=\"card-header-simulador bg-info text-white\">\r\n        \ud83c\udf0d Impacto de la Cobertura Vegetal en el Clima Local\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"card-body-simulador\">\r\n        <p>El <strong>albedo<\/strong> es el porcentaje de radiaci\u00f3n solar que una superficie refleja. \r\n        La vegetaci\u00f3n modifica el albedo y crea microclimas.<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"controles-simulador\">\r\n            <div class=\"slider-container\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-etiqueta\">\r\n                    <span>Cobertura vegetal<\/span>\r\n                    <span id=\"valorCobertura\">10%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"10\" class=\"form-range\" id=\"coberturaSlider\" oninput=\"actualizarMicroclima()\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"slider-container\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-etiqueta\">\r\n                    <span>Humedad del suelo<\/span>\r\n                    <span id=\"valorHumedad\">5%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"5\" class=\"form-range\" id=\"humedadSlider\" oninput=\"actualizarMicroclima()\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div id=\"resultadoMicroclima\" class=\"resultado-simulador\">\r\n            Ajusta los par\u00e1metros para ver los cambios en el microclima...\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n            <canvas id=\"graficoMicroclima\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\"><\/canvas>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= 4.3 QUIZ AUTOEVALUADO ================= -->\r\n<h3 class=\"text-primary mt-5\">4.3 \ud83e\udde0 Quiz de Comprensi\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n    <p><strong>Pregunta 1:<\/strong> \u00bfCu\u00e1l de estos es un organismo pionero T\u00cdPICO en la sucesi\u00f3n primaria?<\/p>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"verificarQuiz(1, 'B')\">\r\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pregunta1\"> A) Roble adulto\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"verificarQuiz(1, 'B')\">\r\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pregunta1\"> B) Liquen crust\u00e1ceo\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"verificarQuiz(1, 'C')\">\r\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pregunta1\"> C) Diente de le\u00f3n\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"verificarQuiz(1, 'D')\">\r\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pregunta1\"> D) Arbusto de frambuesa\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div id=\"feedbackQuiz1\" class=\"feedback-quiz\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n    <p><strong>Pregunta 2:<\/strong> \u00bfQu\u00e9 proceso es PRIMORDIAL al inicio de la sucesi\u00f3n primaria?<\/p>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"verificarQuiz(2, 'C')\">\r\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pregunta2\"> A) Polinizaci\u00f3n por insectos\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"verificarQuiz(2, 'C')\">\r\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pregunta2\"> B) Competencia por luz\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"verificarQuiz(2, 'C')\">\r\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pregunta2\"> C) Meteorizaci\u00f3n biol\u00f3gica\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"verificarQuiz(2, 'D')\">\r\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pregunta2\"> D) Depredaci\u00f3n\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div id=\"feedbackQuiz2\" class=\"feedback-quiz\"><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= 4.4 AN\u00c1LISIS DE RAZONAMIENTO ================= -->\r\n<h3 class=\"text-primary mt-5\">4.4 \ud83d\udcca An\u00e1lisis: Modelos de Sucesi\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"border p-4 rounded bg-light\">\r\n    <p><strong>Debate cient\u00edfico:<\/strong> \u00bfExiste realmente un \"cl\u00edmax\" en la sucesi\u00f3n ecol\u00f3gica?<\/p>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"row mt-3\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n            <div class=\"card h-100 border-primary\">\r\n                <div class=\"card-body\">\r\n                    <h5 class=\"card-title\">Modelo Clementsiano<\/h5>\r\n                    <p><strong>Frederic Clements (1916)<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Sucesi\u00f3n es direccional y predecible<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Culmina en comunidad cl\u00edmax estable<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Analog\u00eda con desarrollo org\u00e1nico<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Determinista y superorgan\u00edsmico<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary\" onclick=\"mostrarArgumento('clements')\">Ver argumentos<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n            <div class=\"card h-100 border-warning\">\r\n                <div class=\"card-body\">\r\n                    <h5 class=\"card-title\">Modelo Gleasoniano<\/h5>\r\n                    <p><strong>Henry Gleason (1926)<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Sucesi\u00f3n es individualista<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Resultado del azar ecol\u00f3gico<\/li>\r\n                        <li>No hay cl\u00edmax fijo<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Contingente e hist\u00f3rico<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-warning\" onclick=\"mostrarArgumento('gleason')\">Ver argumentos<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div id=\"argumentosDebate\" class=\"mt-3 p-3 bg-white border rounded\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n        <!-- Se llena con JavaScript -->\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= 5. ERRORES COMUNES ================= -->\r\n<h3 class=\"text-primary mt-5\">5. \u26a0\ufe0f Errores Comunes del Estudiante<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"border p-4 rounded bg-warning bg-opacity-10\">\r\n    <p><strong>\u00a1Atenci\u00f3n! Estos errores son frecuentes en ex\u00e1menes:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"error-comun\" onclick=\"mostrarError(1)\">\r\n        <strong>Error 1:<\/strong> Confundir sucesi\u00f3n primaria con secundaria\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-detalle\" id=\"detalleError1\">\r\n        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La sucesi\u00f3n <strong>primaria<\/strong> parte de sustrato sin vida ni suelo (rocas, lava). \r\n        La <strong>secundaria<\/strong> ocurre donde hubo comunidad previa (despu\u00e9s de incendio, tala).\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"error-comun\" onclick=\"mostrarError(2)\">\r\n        <strong>Error 2:<\/strong> Creer que los l\u00edquenes son una sola especie\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-detalle\" id=\"detalleError2\">\r\n        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Los l\u00edquenes son <strong>simbiosis<\/strong> entre hongo (micobionte) y alga o cianobacteria (fotobionte). \r\n        No son un solo organismo sino una asociaci\u00f3n mutualista.\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"error-comun\" onclick=\"mostrarError(3)\">\r\n        <strong>Error 3:<\/strong> Suponer que el cl\u00edmax es permanente e inmutable\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"error-detalle\" id=\"detalleError3\">\r\n        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El \"cl\u00edmax\" es din\u00e1mico (cl\u00edmax pulsante). Cambios clim\u00e1ticos, perturbaciones \r\n        naturales y evoluci\u00f3n hacen que los ecosistemas nunca sean completamente estables.\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= 6. CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE ================= -->\r\n<h3 class=\"text-primary mt-5\">6. \ud83d\udcd8 Conexi\u00f3n con el Programa Oficial<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"alert alert-warning\">\r\n    <strong>\u26a0\ufe0f EVALUACI\u00d3N FORMAL:<\/strong> Este tema corresponde a la Unidad 4: \"Din\u00e1mica de Ecosistemas\" \r\n    del programa oficial de Biolog\u00eda\/ECOLOG\u00cdA. <strong>ES MATERIAL DE EXAMEN.<\/strong>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tabla-contenidos\">\r\n    <table class=\"table\">\r\n        <thead>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <th>Competencia evaluada<\/th>\r\n                <th>Indicador de logro<\/th>\r\n                <th>Peso en calificaci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/thead>\r\n        <tbody>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Comprensi\u00f3n de procesos ecol\u00f3gicos<\/td>\r\n                <td>Diferencia sucesi\u00f3n primaria de secundaria<\/td>\r\n                <td>25%<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>An\u00e1lisis de interacciones<\/td>\r\n                <td>Identifica relaciones en cada etapa sucesional<\/td>\r\n                <td>30%<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Aplicaci\u00f3n de conceptos<\/td>\r\n                <td>Predice cambios en ecosistemas perturbados<\/td>\r\n                <td>25%<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Pensamiento cr\u00edtico<\/td>\r\n                <td>Eval\u00faa modelos te\u00f3ricos de sucesi\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <td>20%<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/tbody>\r\n    <\/table>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= 7. PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN ================= -->\r\n<h3 class=\"text-primary mt-5\">7. \ud83d\udcdd Problemas Tipo Examen<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"problema-examen\">\r\n    <p><strong>Problema 1 (4 puntos):<\/strong> Un glaciar retrocede y deja expuesta una franja de roca desnuda. \r\n    Describe las PRIMERAS TRES ETAPAS de la sucesi\u00f3n primaria que ocurrir\u00e1n en los pr\u00f3ximos 100 a\u00f1os, \r\n    incluyendo:<\/p>\r\n    \r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li>Organismos caracter\u00edsticos de cada etapa<\/li>\r\n        <li>Procesos ecol\u00f3gicos clave que ocurren<\/li>\r\n        <li>Cambios en las propiedades del suelo<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n    \r\n    <p><strong>R\u00fabrica:<\/strong> 1pt por etapa correcta + 1pt por procesos identificados<\/p>\r\n    \r\n    <hr class=\"my-4\">\r\n    \r\n    <p><strong>Problema 2 (3 puntos):<\/strong> Una erupci\u00f3n volc\u00e1nica cubre 10 km\u00b2 con lava fresca. \r\n    Un estudiante afirma: \"Aqu\u00ed ocurrir\u00e1 sucesi\u00f3n secundaria porque hab\u00eda bosque antes de la erupci\u00f3n\".<\/p>\r\n    \r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li>\u00bfEs correcta esta afirmaci\u00f3n? Justifica tu respuesta.<\/li>\r\n        <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 tipo de organismos colonizar\u00e1n PRIMERO esta \u00e1rea y por qu\u00e9?<\/li>\r\n        <li>Estima el tiempo m\u00ednimo para que se desarrolle un bosque maduro.<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n    \r\n    <p><strong>R\u00fabrica:<\/strong> 1pt por correcci\u00f3n + 1pt por justificaci\u00f3n + 1pt por estimaci\u00f3n razonable<\/p>\r\n    \r\n    <hr class=\"my-4\">\r\n    \r\n    <p><strong>Problema 3 (3 puntos):<\/strong> Analiza los siguientes datos de una cronosecuencia:<\/p>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"text-center\">\r\n        <table class=\"table table-bordered w-75 mx-auto\">\r\n            <tr><th>A\u00f1os desde glaciar<\/th><th>Biomasa (g\/m\u00b2)<\/th><th>Especies vegetales<\/th><th>pH suelo<\/th><\/tr>\r\n            <tr><td>0<\/td><td>0<\/td><td>0<\/td><td>8.2<\/td><\/tr>\r\n            <tr><td>20<\/td><td>15<\/td><td>2<\/td><td>7.8<\/td><\/tr>\r\n            <tr><td>50<\/td><td>280<\/td><td>12<\/td><td>6.9<\/td><\/tr>\r\n            <tr><td>100<\/td><td>1250<\/td><td>28<\/td><td>6.3<\/td><\/tr>\r\n        <\/table>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <p>a) Explica la tendencia del pH del suelo.<br>\r\n    b) Calcula la tasa promedio de acumulaci\u00f3n de biomasa entre a\u00f1o 20 y 100.<br>\r\n    c) Predice valores aproximados para a\u00f1o 200.<\/p>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"mt-3 p-2 bg-light\">\r\n        <strong>Instrucciones de examen:<\/strong> Tiempo total: 45 minutos. Use bol\u00edgrafo azul o negro. \r\n        Debe mostrar procedimientos en problemas de c\u00e1lculo. Sin calculadora.\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= 8. CIERRE METACOGNITIVO ================= -->\r\n<div class=\"metacognitivo-box\">\r\n    <h4 class=\"text-success\">\ud83c\udf3f Reflexi\u00f3n Metacognitiva<\/h4>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"mb-4\">\r\n        <p><strong>1. Autoevaluaci\u00f3n de aprendizaje:<\/strong> \r\n        En una escala del 1 al 10, \u00bfc\u00f3mo calificar\u00edas tu comprensi\u00f3n actual de la sucesi\u00f3n primaria? \r\n        <span id=\"puntuacionReflexion\" class=\"badge bg-secondary\">Sin calificar<\/span><\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"d-flex gap-2 mt-2\">\r\n            <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-success\" onclick=\"calificarComprension(1)\">1-3: B\u00e1sica<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-warning\" onclick=\"calificarComprension(2)\">4-6: Intermedia<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary\" onclick=\"calificarComprension(3)\">7-10: Avanzada<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"mb-4\">\r\n        <p><strong>2. Conexi\u00f3n con otros temas:<\/strong> \r\n        \u00bfQu\u00e9 relaci\u00f3n encuentras entre la sucesi\u00f3n ecol\u00f3gica y otros temas del curso \r\n        (ciclos biogeoqu\u00edmicos, evoluci\u00f3n, cambio clim\u00e1tico)?<\/p>\r\n        <textarea class=\"form-control mt-2\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"Escribe tus ideas aqu\u00ed...\" id=\"reflexionConexiones\"><\/textarea>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div>\r\n        <p><strong>3. Aplicaci\u00f3n pr\u00e1ctica:<\/strong> \r\n        Imagina que eres un gestor ambiental. \u00bfC\u00f3mo usar\u00edas el conocimiento de sucesi\u00f3n ecol\u00f3gica \r\n        para restaurar un \u00e1rea minera abandonada?<\/p>\r\n        <textarea class=\"form-control mt-2\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"Describe tu plan de restauraci\u00f3n...\" id=\"reflexionAplicacion\"><\/textarea>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"text-center mt-4\">\r\n        <button class=\"btn btn-success\" onclick=\"guardarReflexiones()\">\ud83d\udcbe Guardar reflexiones<\/button>\r\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary\" onclick=\"generarResumen()\">\ud83d\udcc4 Generar resumen de aprendizaje<\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= JAVASCRIPT COMPLETO ================= -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ========== ANIMACI\u00d3N SVG ==========\r\nfunction animarSucesion() {\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById('svgSucesion');\r\n    const elementos = [\r\n        'etapaRocas', 'etapaLiquenes', 'etapaMusgos', \r\n        'etapaArbustos', 'etapaBosqueJoven', 'etapaBosqueMaduro',\r\n        'sueloBase', 'sueloHumus'\r\n    ];\r\n    \r\n    const textos = [\r\n        \"A\u00d1O 0: ROCA DESNUDA\",\r\n        \"A\u00d1O 20: L\u00cdQUENES PIONEROS\", \r\n        \"A\u00d1O 50: MUSGOS Y HERB\u00c1CEAS\",\r\n        \"A\u00d1O 100: COMUNIDAD DE ARBUSTOS\",\r\n        \"A\u00d1O 200: BOSQUE JOVEN\",\r\n        \"A\u00d1O 500+: BOSQUE MADURO (CL\u00cdMAX)\"\r\n    ];\r\n    \r\n    const textoElem = document.getElementById('textoTiempo');\r\n    let etapa = 0;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar animaciones\r\n    elementos.forEach(id => {\r\n        const elem = document.getElementById(id);\r\n        if(elem) {\r\n            elem.getElementsByTagName('animate').forEach(anim => {\r\n                anim.beginElement();\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar texto secuencialmente\r\n    const intervalo = setInterval(() => {\r\n        if(etapa < textos.length) {\r\n            textoElem.textContent = textos[etapa];\r\n            etapa++;\r\n        } else {\r\n            clearInterval(intervalo);\r\n        }\r\n    }, 1300);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarAnimacion() {\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById('svgSucesion');\r\n    const textoElem = document.getElementById('textoTiempo');\r\n    textoElem.textContent = \"A\u00d1O 0: ROCA DESNUDA\";\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Restaurar opacidades iniciales\r\n    document.getElementById('etapaRocas').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n    document.getElementById('etapaLiquenes').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('etapaMusgos').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('etapaArbustos').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('etapaBosqueJoven').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('etapaBosqueMaduro').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('sueloBase').setAttribute('height', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('sueloBase').setAttribute('y', '320');\r\n    document.getElementById('sueloHumus').setAttribute('height', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('sueloHumus').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== SIMULADOR 1: CRONOSECUENCIA ==========\r\nfunction mostrarEtapa(anios) {\r\n    const datos = {\r\n        0: {\r\n            nombre: \"Roca desnuda\",\r\n            descripcion: \"\ud83c\udf11 Sustrato inicial: roca madre expuesta, sin suelo ni materia org\u00e1nica. pH extremo (8-9), sin nutrientes disponibles. Temperatura superficial muy variable.\",\r\n            biomasa: \"0\",\r\n            diversidad: \"0-1\",\r\n            suelo: \"0\"\r\n        },\r\n        20: {\r\n            nombre: \"Comunidad pionera\",\r\n            descripcion: \"\ud83e\udea8 L\u00edquenes crust\u00e1ceos dominan. Comienza meteorizaci\u00f3n biol\u00f3gica. Primeros 2mm de 'suelo' (regolito + materia org\u00e1nica). pH 7.5-8.0.\",\r\n            biomasa: \"5-20\",\r\n            diversidad: \"2-5\",\r\n            suelo: \"0.2-0.5\"\r\n        },\r\n        50: {\r\n            nombre: \"Etapa herb\u00e1cea\",\r\n            descripcion: \"\ud83c\udf31 Musgos, hep\u00e1ticas y algunas herb\u00e1ceas anuales. Acumulaci\u00f3n de hojarasca. Suelo incipiente (5-10cm). Primeros artr\u00f3podos del suelo. pH 6.5-7.5.\",\r\n            biomasa: \"100-300\",\r\n            diversidad: \"10-20\",\r\n            suelo: \"5-10\"\r\n        },\r\n        100: {\r\n            nombre: \"Comunidad de arbustos\",\r\n            descripcion: \"\ud83c\udf3f Arbustos le\u00f1osos (salix, rubus) y herb\u00e1ceas perennes. Suelo desarrollado (20-30cm) con horizonte A. Aparecen lombrices. pH 6.0-7.0.\",\r\n            biomasa: \"800-1500\",\r\n            diversidad: \"25-40\",\r\n            suelo: \"20-30\"\r\n        },\r\n        200: {\r\n            nombre: \"Bosque joven\",\r\n            descripcion: \"\ud83c\udf33 \u00c1rboles pioneros (\u00e1lamos, abedules) forman dosel abierto. Suelo con horizontes A y B. Comunidad animal diversificada. pH 5.5-6.5.\",\r\n            biomasa: \"5000-10000\",\r\n            diversidad: \"50-80\",\r\n            suelo: \"40-60\"\r\n        },\r\n        500: {\r\n            nombre: \"Bosque maduro (cl\u00edmax)\",\r\n            descripcion: \"\ud83c\udf32\ud83c\udf33 Bosque complejo con estratificaci\u00f3n: dosel, sotobosque, herb\u00e1ceas. Especies tolerantes a la sombra reemplazan pioneras. Suelo profundo (>1m) con todos los horizontes. Alta biodiversidad y estabilidad. pH 5.0-6.0.\",\r\n            biomasa: \"20000-40000\",\r\n            diversidad: \"100-200+\",\r\n            suelo: \"80-120\"\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    const etapa = datos[anios];\r\n    const resultado = document.getElementById('resultadoEtapa');\r\n    const detalles = document.getElementById('detallesEtapa');\r\n    \r\n    resultado.innerHTML = `<h5>${etapa.nombre} (${anios} a\u00f1os)<\/h5><p>${etapa.descripcion}<\/p>`;\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('biomasa').textContent = etapa.biomasa;\r\n    document.getElementById('diversidad').textContent = etapa.diversidad;\r\n    document.getElementById('suelo').textContent = etapa.suelo;\r\n    \r\n    detalles.style.display = 'block';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar botones activos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.boton-etapa').forEach(boton => {\r\n        boton.classList.remove('activo');\r\n    });\r\n    event.target.classList.add('activo');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== SIMULADOR 2: MICROCLIMA ==========\r\nlet graficoMicroclima = null;\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarMicroclima() {\r\n    const cobertura = parseInt(document.getElementById('coberturaSlider').value);\r\n    const humedad = parseInt(document.getElementById('humedadSlider').value);\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('valorCobertura').textContent = cobertura + '%';\r\n    document.getElementById('valorHumedad').textContent = humedad + '%';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ C\u00e1lculos ecol\u00f3gicos\r\n    const albedo = (0.35 - (cobertura\/100)*0.2).toFixed(2);\r\n    const tempSuperficial = (30 - cobertura*0.05 - humedad*0.02).toFixed(1);\r\n    const evapotranspiracion = (humedad * 0.8 + cobertura * 0.5).toFixed(0);\r\n    const carbonoSecuestrado = (cobertura * 2.5).toFixed(0);\r\n    \r\n    const resultado = document.getElementById('resultadoMicroclima');\r\n    resultado.innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"row text-center\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n                <div class=\"p-2 border rounded bg-light\">\r\n                    <strong>Albedo<\/strong><br>\r\n                    <span class=\"h5\">${albedo}<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n                <div class=\"p-2 border rounded bg-light\">\r\n                    <strong>Temperatura<\/strong><br>\r\n                    <span class=\"h5\">${tempSuperficial}\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n                <div class=\"p-2 border rounded bg-light\">\r\n                    <strong>Evapotranspiraci\u00f3n<\/strong><br>\r\n                    <span class=\"h5\">${evapotranspiracion} mm\/d\u00eda<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n                <div class=\"p-2 border rounded bg-light\">\r\n                    <strong>Carbono secuestrado<\/strong><br>\r\n                    <span class=\"h5\">${carbonoSecuestrado} t\/ha<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <p class=\"mt-3\"><em>M\u00e1s cobertura vegetal = menor albedo = menos calor reflejado = mayor absorci\u00f3n = microclima m\u00e1s estable<\/em><\/p>\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    actualizarGraficoMicroclima(cobertura, humedad);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarGraficoMicroclima(cobertura, humedad) {\r\n    const canvas = document.getElementById('graficoMicroclima');\r\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Limpiar canvas\r\n    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Datos para el gr\u00e1fico\r\n    const datos = [];\r\n    for(let i = 0; i <= 100; i += 10) {\r\n        const temp = 30 - (i * 0.05) - (humedad * 0.02);\r\n        datos.push(temp);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Dibujar gr\u00e1fico\r\n    ctx.strokeStyle = '#e53935';\r\n    ctx.lineWidth = 3;\r\n    ctx.beginPath();\r\n    \r\n    datos.forEach((temp, index) => {\r\n        const x = 50 + (index * 70);\r\n        const y = 150 - (temp * 4);\r\n        \r\n        if(index === 0) {\r\n            ctx.moveTo(x, y);\r\n        } else {\r\n            ctx.lineTo(x, y);\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    ctx.stroke();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ejes\r\n    ctx.strokeStyle = '#666';\r\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1;\r\n    ctx.beginPath();\r\n    ctx.moveTo(50, 50);\r\n    ctx.lineTo(50, 150);\r\n    ctx.lineTo(750, 150);\r\n    ctx.stroke();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Etiquetas\r\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#333';\r\n    ctx.font = '14px Arial';\r\n    ctx.fillText('Temperatura (\u00b0C)', 30, 30);\r\n    ctx.fillText('Cobertura vegetal (%)', 400, 180);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Puntos de datos\r\n    datos.forEach((temp, index) => {\r\n        const x = 50 + (index * 70);\r\n        const y = 150 - (temp * 4);\r\n        \r\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#e53935';\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        ctx.arc(x, y, 5, 0, Math.PI * 2);\r\n        ctx.fill();\r\n        \r\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#666';\r\n        ctx.fillText(`${index * 10}%`, x - 10, 170);\r\n        ctx.fillText(`${temp.toFixed(1)}\u00b0`, x - 15, y - 10);\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== QUIZ ==========\r\nfunction verificarQuiz(numPregunta, respuestaCorrecta) {\r\n    const respuestas = {\r\n        1: {correcta: 'B', explicacion: 'Los l\u00edquenes crust\u00e1ceos son pioneros t\u00edpicos. Los robles son especies climax, el diente de le\u00f3n y frambuesa son de sucesi\u00f3n secundaria.'},\r\n        2: {correcta: 'C', explicacion: 'La meteorizaci\u00f3n biol\u00f3gica (por l\u00edquenes principalmente) es esencial para crear suelo a partir de roca.'}\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    const feedbackId = `feedbackQuiz${numPregunta}`;\r\n    const feedback = document.getElementById(feedbackId);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Obtener la opci\u00f3n seleccionada (simplificado)\r\n    const opcionSeleccionada = event.target.textContent.trim().charAt(0);\r\n    \r\n    if(opcionSeleccionada === respuestaCorrecta) {\r\n        feedback.innerHTML = `<div class=\"alert alert-success\">\u2705 Correcto! ${respuestas[numPregunta].explicacion}<\/div>`;\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback.innerHTML = `<div class=\"alert alert-danger\">\u274c Incorrecto. ${respuestas[numPregunta].explicacion}<\/div>`;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    feedback.classList.add('feedback-visible');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== AN\u00c1LISIS DE DEBATE ==========\r\nfunction mostrarArgumento(modelo) {\r\n    const argumentosDiv = document.getElementById('argumentosDebate');\r\n    const argumentos = {\r\n        clements: `\r\n            <h6>Argumentos a favor del modelo Clementsiano:<\/h6>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>Patrones observables:<\/strong> En muchas cronosecuencias se ven etapas predecibles<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Convergencia:<\/strong> Ecosistemas similares en climas similares tienden a comunidades climax parecidas<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Utilidad pr\u00e1ctica:<\/strong> Modelo \u00fatil para restauraci\u00f3n ecol\u00f3gica y predicci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Evidencia paleoecol\u00f3gica:<\/strong> Registro f\u00f3sil muestra secuencias ordenadas tras glaciaciones<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <p class=\"text-muted\"><em>Cr\u00edticas: Muy determinista, ignora el papel del azar y la historia \u00fanica de cada sitio.<\/em><\/p>\r\n        `,\r\n        gleason: `\r\n            <h6>Argumentos a favor del modelo Gleasoniano:<\/h6>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>Evidencia emp\u00edrica:<\/strong> Estudios detallados muestran alta variabilidad entre sitios<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Importancia del azar:<\/strong> Eventos estoc\u00e1sticos (tormentas, llegada de prop\u00e1gulos) afectan la trayectoria<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Individualismo:<\/strong> Cada especie responde individualmente al ambiente, no como \"superorganismo\"<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Contingencia hist\u00f3rica:<\/strong> La historia \u00fanica de cada lugar influye en el resultado<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <p class=\"text-muted\"><em>Cr\u00edticas: Demasiado relativista, dif\u00edcil hacer predicciones generales.<\/em><\/p>\r\n        `\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    argumentosDiv.innerHTML = argumentos[modelo];\r\n    argumentosDiv.style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== ERRORES COMUNES ==========\r\nfunction mostrarError(numError) {\r\n    \/\/ Ocultar todos primero\r\n    for(let i = 1; i <= 3; i++) {\r\n        document.getElementById(`detalleError${i}`).style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n    \/\/ Mostrar el seleccionado\r\n    document.getElementById(`detalleError${numError}`).style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== METACOGNICI\u00d3N ==========\r\nfunction calificarComprension(nivel) {\r\n    const puntuaciones = {\r\n        1: {texto: \"B\u00e1sica (1-3)\", clase: \"bg-danger\"},\r\n        2: {texto: \"Intermedia (4-6)\", clase: \"bg-warning\"},\r\n        3: {texto: \"Avanzada (7-10)\", clase: \"bg-success\"}\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    const elem = document.getElementById('puntuacionReflexion');\r\n    elem.textContent = puntuaciones[nivel].texto;\r\n    elem.className = `badge ${puntuaciones[nivel].clase}`;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction guardarReflexiones() {\r\n    const reflexiones = {\r\n        fecha: new Date().toLocaleString(),\r\n        tema: \"Sucesi\u00f3n Primaria\",\r\n        comprension: document.getElementById('puntuacionReflexion').textContent,\r\n        conexiones: document.getElementById('reflexionConexiones').value,\r\n        aplicacion: document.getElementById('reflexionAplicacion').value\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    localStorage.setItem('reflexionesSucesion', JSON.stringify(reflexiones));\r\n    alert('\u2705 Reflexiones guardadas. Puedes revisarlas antes del examen.');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction generarResumen() {\r\n    const resumen = `\r\n        RESUMEN DE APRENDIZAJE - SUCESI\u00d3N PRIMARIA\r\n        ==========================================\r\n        \r\n        Conceptos clave dominados:\r\n        \u2022 Proceso de colonizaci\u00f3n en sustratos sin vida\r\n        \u2022 Organismos pioneros: l\u00edquenes \u2192 musgos \u2192 herb\u00e1ceas\r\n        \u2022 Desarrollo del suelo: de regolito a horizontes\r\n        \u2022 Debate Clements vs. Gleason\r\n        \r\n        Aplicaciones pr\u00e1cticas:\r\n        \u2022 Restauraci\u00f3n ecol\u00f3gica de minas\r\n        \u2022 Predicci\u00f3n de cambios post-glaciaci\u00f3n\r\n        \u2022 Dise\u00f1o de corredores biol\u00f3gicos\r\n        \r\n        Reflexiones personales guardadas en localStorage.\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    alert(resumen);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== INICIALIZACI\u00d3N ==========\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    \/\/ Inicializar simuladores\r\n    mostrarEtapa(0);\r\n    actualizarMicroclima();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar gr\u00e1fico inicial\r\n    const canvas = document.getElementById('graficoMicroclima');\r\n    if(canvas.getContext) {\r\n        actualizarGraficoMicroclima(10, 5);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Activar MathJax si est\u00e1 disponible\r\n    if(window.MathJax) {\r\n        MathJax.typeset();\r\n    }\r\n});\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la diferencia fundamental entre sucesi\u00f3n primaria y secundaria?","respuesta":"La primaria comienza en un lugar sin suelo ni vida previa; la secundaria comienza en un suelo preexistente tras una perturbaci\u00f3n."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la pedog\u00e9nesis?","respuesta":"Es el proceso de formaci\u00f3n y desarrollo del suelo a partir de la roca madre."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 los l\u00edquenes son considerados simbiontes?","respuesta":"Porque son una uni\u00f3n de hongo (aporta estructura y humedad) y alga\/cianobacteria (aporta alimento v\u00eda fotos\u00edntesis)."},{"enunciado":"Nombre un lugar famoso por estudio de sucesi\u00f3n tras retiro glacial.","respuesta":"Glacier Bay, Alaska."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 funci\u00f3n tienen las bacterias fijadoras de nitr\u00f3geno en las etapas iniciales?","respuesta":"Transforman el N2 atmosf\u00e9rico en amonio\/nitratos, la \u00fanica forma en que las plantas pueden usarlo para crecer."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 autor propuso que el ecosistema funciona como un \"superorganismo\"?","respuesta":"Frederic Clements."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo influye la topograf\u00eda en la sucesi\u00f3n?","respuesta":"Las pendientes pronunciadas retrasan la formaci\u00f3n de suelo por la erosi\u00f3n, mientras que las depresiones la aceleran."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es una especie \"facilitadora\"?","respuesta":"Una especie que modifica el ambiente (como el suelo) haciendo que sea m\u00e1s apto para especies posteriores."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1nto tiempo puede tardar en formarse 1 cm de suelo f\u00e9rtil?","respuesta":"Entre 100 y 400 a\u00f1os, dependiendo del clima."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 sucede con la biomasa total a medida que avanza la sucesi\u00f3n?","respuesta":"Aumenta progresivamente hasta alcanzar un equilibrio en la etapa cl\u00edmax."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"Cl\u00edmax\"?","respuesta":"Es el estado te\u00f3rico de equilibrio estable donde la comunidad biol\u00f3gica est\u00e1 en armon\u00eda con el clima regional."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 la sucesi\u00f3n primaria es m\u00e1s lenta que la secundaria?","respuesta":"Porque requiere la creaci\u00f3n de suelo desde cero, lo cual es un proceso geol\u00f3gico y biol\u00f3gico muy lento."}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Sustrato t\u00edpico de una sucesi\u00f3n primaria:","opciones":["Campo quemado","Lava volc\u00e1nica nueva","Bosque talado","Jard\u00edn abandonado"],"correcta":"Lava volc\u00e1nica nueva"},{"pregunta":"Primeros organismos en colonizar roca desnuda:","opciones":["\u00c1rboles","L\u00edquenes","Hierbas","Arbustos"],"correcta":"L\u00edquenes"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 aportan los musgos a la formaci\u00f3n del suelo?","opciones":["Piedras","Materia org\u00e1nica y retenci\u00f3n de agua","Ox\u00edgeno","Calor"],"correcta":"Materia org\u00e1nica y retenci\u00f3n de agua"},{"pregunta":"Teor\u00eda que dice que la sucesi\u00f3n es azarosa:","opciones":["Clementsiana","Gleassoniana","Darwinista","Newtoniana"],"correcta":"Gleassoniana"},{"pregunta":"Evento que da inicio a una sucesi\u00f3n primaria:","opciones":["Incendio","Retiro de un glaciar","Inundaci\u00f3n","Hurac\u00e1n"],"correcta":"Retiro de un glaciar"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 nutriente suele ser el m\u00e1s limitante al inicio?","opciones":["Carbono","Nitr\u00f3geno","Ox\u00edgeno","Hidr\u00f3geno"],"correcta":"Nitr\u00f3geno"},{"pregunta":"La formaci\u00f3n de suelo se llama:","opciones":["Fotos\u00edntesis","Pedog\u00e9nesis","Metamorfosis","Erosi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Pedog\u00e9nesis"},{"pregunta":"Especie arb\u00f3rea pionera com\u00fan en Alaska:","opciones":["Roble","Aliso (Alnus)","Pino","Palmera"],"correcta":"Aliso (Alnus)"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo se llama la etapa final y estable?","opciones":["Etapa Zero","Cl\u00edmax","Pionera","Seral"],"correcta":"Cl\u00edmax"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 son los \u00e1cidos liqu\u00e9nicos?","opciones":["Venenos","Sustancias que disuelven la roca madre","Abono","Agua salada"],"correcta":"Sustancias que disuelven la roca madre"},{"pregunta":"Relaci\u00f3n entre biodiversidad y tiempo en la sucesi\u00f3n:","opciones":["Disminuye","Aumenta","No cambia","Se vuelve cero"],"correcta":"Aumenta"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es una serie o \"Sere\"?","opciones":["Un tipo de animal","La secuencia completa de comunidades sucesivas","Un volc\u00e1n","Una semilla"],"correcta":"La secuencia completa de comunidades sucesivas"},{"pregunta":"La isla de Surtsey es famosa por ser:","opciones":["Un desierto","Un laboratorio natural de sucesi\u00f3n primaria","Una ciudad","Un iceberg"],"correcta":"Un laboratorio natural de sucesi\u00f3n primaria"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 sucede con la red tr\u00f3fica a medida que avanza la sucesi\u00f3n?","opciones":["Se simplifica","Se vuelve m\u00e1s compleja","Desaparece","Solo hay herb\u00edvoros"],"correcta":"Se vuelve m\u00e1s compleja"},{"pregunta":"Principal diferencia entre musgo y liquen:","opciones":["El musgo es planta, el liquen es simbiosis","Son iguales","El liquen tiene ra\u00edces","El musgo no necesita agua"],"correcta":"El musgo es planta, el liquen es simbiosis"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 factor abi\u00f3tico determina el tipo de bosque cl\u00edmax?","opciones":["El color de la roca","El clima regional","La velocidad del viento","La fase de la luna"],"correcta":"El clima regional"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la facilitaci\u00f3n?","opciones":["Competencia por luz","Mejora del ambiente por una especie para otra","Matar a la competencia","Mudar de piel"],"correcta":"Mejora del ambiente por una especie para otra"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 el suelo es vital para los \u00e1rboles?","opciones":["Soporte, nutrientes y microorganismos","Solo para color","No es vital","Para calentar las ra\u00edces"],"correcta":"Soporte, nutrientes y microorganismos"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 ocurre con el pH del suelo durante la sucesi\u00f3n?","opciones":["Suele acidificarse por la materia org\u00e1nica","Se vuelve muy b\u00e1sico","No cambia","Llega a 14"],"correcta":"Suele acidificarse por la materia org\u00e1nica"},{"pregunta":"La sucesi\u00f3n en una duna de arena es:","opciones":["Secundaria","Primaria (Psamoserie)","Terciaria","No existe"],"correcta":"Primaria (Psamoserie)"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 papel tienen las microrrizas en el cl\u00edmax?","opciones":["Comen plantas","Intercambio eficiente de nutrientes hongo-planta","Producen sombra","Atrapan insectos"],"correcta":"Intercambio eficiente de nutrientes hongo-planta"},{"pregunta":"En el modelo de inhibici\u00f3n:","opciones":["Los pioneros ayudan a otros","Los pioneros dificultan la llegada de otros","Todos mueren","No hay pioneros"],"correcta":"Los pioneros dificultan la llegada de otros"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 porcentaje de nitr\u00f3geno hay en la roca volc\u00e1nica pura?","opciones":["50%","Pr\u00e1cticamente 0%","100%","10%"],"correcta":"Pr\u00e1cticamente 0%"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el horizonte \"O\" del suelo?","opciones":["Capa de roca","Capa de materia org\u00e1nica superficial","Agua subterr\u00e1nea","Ox\u00edgeno"],"correcta":"Capa de materia org\u00e1nica superficial"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 especie animal suele llegar primero?","opciones":["Leones","Artr\u00f3podos y aves (transportan semillas)","Elefantes","Peces"],"correcta":"Artr\u00f3podos y aves (transportan semillas)"},{"pregunta":"La sucesi\u00f3n en agua (lagos) se llama:","opciones":["Xeroserie","Hidroserie","Psamoserie","Acua-sere"],"correcta":"Hidroserie"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el tiempo promedio para un bosque cl\u00edmax?","opciones":["10 a\u00f1os","M\u00e1s de 100-500 a\u00f1os","2 d\u00edas","1 mill\u00f3n de a\u00f1os"],"correcta":"M\u00e1s de 100-500 a\u00f1os"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la estocasticidad?","opciones":["Orden perfecto","Influencia del azar","Crecimiento de algas","Tipo de suelo"],"correcta":"Influencia del azar"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQui\u00e9n acu\u00f1\u00f3 el t\u00e9rmino \"Sucesi\u00f3n\"?","opciones":["Humboldt","Adolphe Dureau de la Malle","Newton","Einstein"],"correcta":"Adolphe Dureau de la Malle"},{"pregunta":"Diferencia entre pioneras y tard\u00edas:","opciones":["Pioneras crecen r\u00e1pido y mueren joven; tard\u00edas son lentas y longevas","Son iguales","Las pioneras viven mil a\u00f1os","Las tard\u00edas no necesitan luz"],"correcta":"Pioneras crecen r\u00e1pido y mueren joven; tard\u00edas son lentas y longevas"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"servicios-ecosistemicos-master","titulo":"Servicios Ecosist\u00e9micos: La Infraestructura Vital del Planeta","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-ecoservicios\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ MATRIX DROPS BACKGROUND ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"matrix-container\" id=\"matrixContainer\"><\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ HEADER TERMINAL ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"terminal-header mb-4 p-3 border border-cyan\">\r\n    <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\">\r\n        <div class=\"terminal-prompt\">\r\n            <span class=\"text-success\">>_<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"text-warning ms-2\">SERVICES_ECO_SYSTEM<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"text-cyan ms-2\">[ACTIVE]<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"terminal-status\">\r\n            <span class=\"badge border border-warning text-warning\">IPBES_2025<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge border border-success text-success ms-2\">TEEB_v3.0<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<h2>CAPITAL NATURAL Y FLUJOS DE BIENESTAR<\/h2>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"lead\">\r\n    <div class=\"d-flex align-items-start\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-warning me-2\">[!]<\/span>\r\n        <div>\r\n            Los servicios ecosist\u00e9micos no son \"regalos\" de la naturaleza, sino flujos de valor derivados del \r\n            <strong>CAPITAL NATURAL<\/strong>. Seg\u00fan el IPBES (2025), la degradaci\u00f3n de estos servicios representa \r\n            un riesgo sist\u00e9mico superior a cualquier crisis financiera hist\u00f3rica.\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ CONCEPT BOX TERMINAL ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n    <h4>EL MARCO MEA (MILLENNIUM ECOSYSTEM ASSESSMENT)<\/h4>\r\n    <div class=\"d-flex\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-cyan me-2\">><\/span>\r\n        <div>\r\n            La humanidad depende de una jerarqu\u00eda de servicios. Sin los de <strong>SOPORTE<\/strong> (ciclos biol\u00f3gicos), \r\n            los de <strong>PROVISI\u00d3N<\/strong> (alimento) desaparecen. El modelo sist\u00e9mico revela dependencias cr\u00edticas.\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ DIAGRAMA SIST\u00c9MICO CYBERPUNK ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"text-center mb-3\">\r\n        <span class=\"badge border border-cyan\">DIAGRAMA_SIST\u00c9MICO<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"text-muted ms-2\">Modelo MEA\/TEEB v3.2<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\">\r\n        <!-- Fondo de gradiente cibern\u00e9tico -->\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <linearGradient id=\"cyberGreen\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\">\r\n                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#001a0d\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#00331a\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#00ff88\"\/>\r\n            <\/linearGradient>\r\n            \r\n            <linearGradient id=\"cyberBlue\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\">\r\n                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#001a33\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#003366\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#00d4ff\"\/>\r\n            <\/linearGradient>\r\n            \r\n            <filter id=\"glow\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"3\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Base del sistema -->\r\n        <rect x=\"100\" y=\"320\" width=\"600\" height=\"60\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"url(#cyberGreen)\" filter=\"url(#glow)\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"height\" values=\"60;65;60\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/rect>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Texto base -->\r\n        <text x=\"400\" y=\"355\" fill=\"#00ff88\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n            SERVICIOS DE SOPORTE [FUNDAMENTAL LAYER]\r\n        <\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"400\" y=\"375\" fill=\"#8af\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Courier New'\" font-size=\"12\">\r\n            Fotos\u00edntesis | Ciclo Nutrientes | Formaci\u00f3n Suelo\r\n        <\/text>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Nodos de servicios -->\r\n        <g class=\"cyber-node\" id=\"nodeRegulacion\">\r\n            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"100\" width=\"140\" height=\"210\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#00d4ff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\"\/>\r\n            <rect x=\"155\" y=\"105\" width=\"130\" height=\"200\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#001a33\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n            \r\n            <text x=\"220\" y=\"135\" fill=\"#00d4ff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                REGULACI\u00d3N\r\n            <\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"220\" y=\"165\" fill=\"#8af\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Courier New'\" font-size=\"11\">\r\n                Clima | Agua | Pestes\r\n            <\/text>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- \u00cdcono cibern\u00e9tico -->\r\n            <path d=\"M200 190 L220 210 L240 190\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00d4ff\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n            <circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"200\" r=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00d4ff\" stroke-width=\"2\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"8;10;8\" dur=\"1.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/circle>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <g class=\"cyber-node\" id=\"nodeProvision\">\r\n            <rect x=\"330\" y=\"100\" width=\"140\" height=\"210\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#ffcc00\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\"\/>\r\n            <rect x=\"335\" y=\"105\" width=\"130\" height=\"200\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#332200\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n            \r\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"135\" fill=\"#ffcc00\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                PROVISI\u00d3N\r\n            <\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"165\" fill=\"#8af\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Courier New'\" font-size=\"11\">\r\n                Alimento | Madera | Fibras\r\n            <\/text>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- \u00cdcono cibern\u00e9tico -->\r\n            <polygon points=\"390,190 400,180 410,190 400,200\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffcc00\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <g class=\"cyber-node\" id=\"nodeCultural\">\r\n            <rect x=\"510\" y=\"100\" width=\"140\" height=\"210\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#cc66ff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\"\/>\r\n            <rect x=\"515\" y=\"105\" width=\"130\" height=\"200\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#330033\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n            \r\n            <text x=\"580\" y=\"135\" fill=\"#cc66ff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                CULTURAL\r\n            <\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"580\" y=\"165\" fill=\"#8af\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Courier New'\" font-size=\"11\">\r\n                Turismo | Identidad | Educaci\u00f3n\r\n            <\/text>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- \u00cdcono cibern\u00e9tico -->\r\n            <path d=\"M570 190 Q580 180 590 190 T580 200\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cc66ff\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Conexiones con efectos -->\r\n        <path d=\"M400 320 L400 280\" stroke=\"#00ff88\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,5\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"0;30;0\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/path>\r\n        \r\n        <path d=\"M220 320 L220 310\" stroke=\"#00ff88\" stroke-width=\"2\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"0;20;0\" dur=\"1.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/path>\r\n        \r\n        <path d=\"M580 320 L580 310\" stroke=\"#00ff88\" stroke-width=\"2\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"0;20;0\" dur=\"1.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/path>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Puntos de conexi\u00f3n animados -->\r\n        <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"320\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#00ff88\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"5;7;5\" dur=\"1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/circle>\r\n        \r\n        <circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"320\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#00ff88\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"4;6;4\" dur=\"1.2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/circle>\r\n        \r\n        <circle cx=\"580\" cy=\"320\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#00ff88\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"4;6;4\" dur=\"1.2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/circle>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"mt-3 text-center\">\r\n        <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-center flex-wrap gap-3\">\r\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                <div class=\"cyber-dot bg-cyan me-2\"><\/div>\r\n                <span class=\"small text-cyan\">REGULACI\u00d3N<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                <div class=\"cyber-dot bg-warning me-2\"><\/div>\r\n                <span class=\"small text-warning\">PROVISI\u00d3N<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                <div class=\"cyber-dot bg-purple me-2\"><\/div>\r\n                <span class=\"small text-purple\">CULTURAL<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ SIMULADOR DE RESILIENCIA ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"simulator-container\">\r\n    <h4>\ud83c\udfae SIMULADOR DE RESILIENCIA ECOSIST\u00c9MICA<\/h4>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"terminal-instructions mb-4 p-3 border border-cyan\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-cyan\">INSTRUCCIONES:<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"text-light ms-2\">Ajusta el nivel de biodiversidad de un humedal para ver c\u00f3mo afecta su valor econ\u00f3mico en servicios de regulaci\u00f3n (filtraci\u00f3n de agua).<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n            <div class=\"lab-group\">\r\n                <label class=\"form-label\">BIODIVERSIDAD DEL SISTEMA (%)<\/label>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Slider con etiquetas 8bit -->\r\n                <div class=\"slider-labels d-flex justify-content-between mb-2\">\r\n                    <span class=\"text-danger\">DEGRADADO<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"text-warning\">50%<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"text-success\">PR\u00cdSTINO<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range\" id=\"bioRange\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"100\" oninput=\"updateSim()\">\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-value text-center mt-2\">\r\n                    <span class=\"h4 text-success\" id=\"bioValue\">100%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n            <div class=\"row\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-6 mb-3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"stat-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"small text-cyan\">VALOR SERVICIOS<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"valEco\">$15,000<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"stat-footer\">\r\n                            <span class=\"small text-muted\">USD\/ha\/a\u00f1o<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"col-6 mb-3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"stat-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"small text-cyan\">CAPACIDAD FILTRO<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"valFiltro\">100%<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"stat-footer\">\r\n                            <span class=\"small text-muted\">Eficiencia<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"col-12\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"stat-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"small text-cyan\">ESTADO DEL SISTEMA<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div id=\"simFeedback\" class=\"text-center py-2\">\r\n                            <span class=\"text-success\">\u25cf SISTEMA \u00d3PTIMO<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- Barras de progreso visual -->\r\n    <div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n        <label class=\"form-label\">VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DE CAPACIDAD<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"progress-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"progress-bar-bg\">\r\n                <div class=\"progress-bar-fill\" id=\"progressVisual\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"progress-labels d-flex justify-content-between mt-1\">\r\n                <span class=\"small text-danger\">0%<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"small text-warning\">30% (umbral cr\u00edtico)<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"small text-success\">100%<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ QUIZ INTERACTIVO ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"quiz-checkpoint\">\r\n    <h5>\ud83e\udde0 DESAF\u00cdO DE CLASIFICACI\u00d3N MASTER<\/h5>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-scenario mb-3 p-3 border border-purple\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-purple\">ESCENARIO:<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"text-light ms-2\">Un arrecife de coral protege la costa de la erosi\u00f3n durante tormentas. \u00bfEn qu\u00e9 categor\u00eda del MEA clasifica este beneficio?<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n        <button class=\"option-btn\" onclick=\"checkQuiz(this, false)\">\r\n            <span class=\"option-letter text-warning\">A<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"option-text\">Provisi\u00f3n<\/span>\r\n        <\/button>\r\n        \r\n        <button class=\"option-btn\" onclick=\"checkQuiz(this, true)\">\r\n            <span class=\"option-letter text-warning\">B<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"option-text\">Regulaci\u00f3n<\/span>\r\n        <\/button>\r\n        \r\n        <button class=\"option-btn\" onclick=\"checkQuiz(this, false)\">\r\n            <span class=\"option-letter text-warning\">C<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"option-text\">Soporte<\/span>\r\n        <\/button>\r\n        \r\n        <button class=\"option-btn\" onclick=\"checkQuiz(this, false)\">\r\n            <span class=\"option-letter text-warning\">D<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"option-text\">Cultural<\/span>\r\n        <\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div id=\"quizFeedback\" class=\"mt-3\" style=\"display:none;\">\r\n        <!-- Se llena con JavaScript -->\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ LABORATORIO TEEB ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"lab-teeb-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-4\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83e\uddea LABORATORIO DE VALORACI\u00d3N TEEB<\/h4>\r\n        <div class=\"terminal-badges\">\r\n            <span class=\"badge border border-warning text-warning\">ECO-CALC v2.5<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge border border-cyan text-cyan ms-2\">IPBES_2025<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"terminal-instructions mb-4\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-cyan\">OBJETIVO:<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"text-light ms-2\">Simulaci\u00f3n de flujos financieros basados en servicios de regulaci\u00f3n clim\u00e1tica (Metodolog\u00eda IPBES 2025).<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- F\u00f3rmula cibern\u00e9tica -->\r\n    <div class=\"formula-box\">\r\n        <div class=\"formula-header text-center mb-2\">\r\n            <span class=\"text-cyan small\">ECUACI\u00d3N DE VALORACI\u00d3N<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"formula-body\">\r\n            <span class=\"h4 text-warning\">V<sub>total<\/sub> = A \u00d7 C<sub>cap<\/sub> \u00d7 P<sub>mkt<\/sub><\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"formula-footer text-center mt-2\">\r\n            <span class=\"text-muted small\">Valor = \u00c1rea \u00d7 Captura \u00d7 Precio Mercado<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- Panel de control -->\r\n    <div class=\"control-panel mb-4 p-4 border border-warning\">\r\n        <div class=\"row g-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n                <div class=\"lab-group\">\r\n                    <label class=\"form-label\">\u00c1REA FORESTAL<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                        <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control form-control-master\" value=\"5,000\" readonly disabled>\r\n                        <span class=\"input-group-text bg-dark border-warning text-warning\">ha<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"text-center mt-2\">\r\n                        <span class=\"small text-muted\">Superficie Total<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n                <div class=\"lab-group\">\r\n                    <label class=\"form-label\">TASA DE SECUESTRO<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                        <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control form-control-master\" value=\"15\" readonly disabled>\r\n                        <span class=\"input-group-text bg-dark border-warning text-warning\">tCO\u2082\/ha<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"text-center mt-2\">\r\n                        <span class=\"small text-muted\">Toneladas por a\u00f1o<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n                <div class=\"lab-group\">\r\n                    <label class=\"form-label\">PRECIO CARBONO<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                        <span class=\"input-group-text bg-dark border-cyan text-cyan\">$<\/span>\r\n                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"carbonPrice\" class=\"form-control form-control-master\" value=\"40\" \r\n                               min=\"10\" max=\"200\" step=\"5\" oninput=\"calcValue()\">\r\n                        <span class=\"input-group-text bg-dark border-cyan text-cyan\">\/t<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"text-center mt-2\">\r\n                        <span class=\"small text-info\">Variable de Mercado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- Resultado -->\r\n    <div class=\"result-display p-4 border border-success bg-black\">\r\n        <div class=\"text-center\">\r\n            <label class=\"form-label text-warning\">FLUJO DE CAPITAL NATURAL ESTIMADO<\/label>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"result-value mt-3\">\r\n                <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center\">\r\n                    <span class=\"currency-symbol text-warning me-2\">$<\/span>\r\n                    <span id=\"labResult\" class=\"display-1 text-warning font-weight-bold\">3,000,000<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"result-unit mt-2\">\r\n                    <span class=\"text-cyan\">USD \/ A\u00d1O<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"result-footer mt-3\">\r\n                <p class=\"small text-muted mb-0\">\r\n                    C\u00e1lculo basado en el m\u00e9todo de Precios de Mercado y Costos de Oportunidad.\r\n                    <br>\r\n                    <span class=\"text-info\">IPBES 2025 - Marco de Valoraci\u00f3n Integrada<\/span>\r\n                <\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ SECCI\u00d3N DE CONCLUSI\u00d3N ============ -->\r\n<hr>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"conclusion\">\r\n    <h4>CONCLUSI\u00d3N SIST\u00c9MICA<\/h4>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"conclusion-body mt-3\">\r\n        <div class=\"d-flex\">\r\n            <span class=\"text-warning me-3\">\u26a0<\/span>\r\n            <div>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    Ignorar el valor de los servicios ecosist\u00e9micos en la contabilidad nacional (PIB) genera una \r\n                    ilusi\u00f3n de crecimiento basada en la liquidaci\u00f3n de activos vitales. La transici\u00f3n hacia una \r\n                    <strong>ECONOM\u00cdA REGENERATIVA<\/strong> requiere internalizar estos costos para evitar el colapso \r\n                    de la biosfera.\r\n                <\/p>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"key-points mt-3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"key-point d-flex mb-2\">\r\n                        <span class=\"text-success me-2\">\u25b6<\/span>\r\n                        <span>Los servicios ecosist\u00e9micos son infraestructura cr\u00edtica no replicable<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"key-point d-flex mb-2\">\r\n                        <span class=\"text-success me-2\">\u25b6<\/span>\r\n                        <span>La valoraci\u00f3n econ\u00f3mica es solo una m\u00e9trica parcial del valor real<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"key-point d-flex\">\r\n                        <span class=\"text-success me-2\">\u25b6<\/span>\r\n                        <span>La resiliencia del sistema depende de mantener umbrales cr\u00edticos de biodiversidad<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"conclusion-footer mt-4 p-3 border border-cyan\">\r\n        <div class=\"text-center\">\r\n            <span class=\"text-cyan\">[SISTEM_READY]<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"text-light ms-2\">--- END OF TRANSMISSION ---<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ JAVASCRIPT CYBERPUNK ============ -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ============ EFECTO MATRIX DROPS ============\r\nfunction createMatrixDrops() {\r\n    const container = document.getElementById('matrixContainer');\r\n    const chars = '01';\r\n    \r\n    for(let i = 0; i < 15; i++) {\r\n        const drop = document.createElement('div');\r\n        drop.className = 'matrix-drop';\r\n        drop.textContent = chars.charAt(Math.floor(Math.random() * chars.length));\r\n        \r\n        drop.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + '%';\r\n        drop.style.animationDelay = Math.random() * 5 + 's';\r\n        drop.style.animationDuration = (Math.random() * 3 + 2) + 's';\r\n        drop.style.animationName = 'matrix-drop';\r\n        drop.style.animationIterationCount = 'infinite';\r\n        \r\n        container.appendChild(drop);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ SIMULADOR DE RESILIENCIA ============\r\nfunction updateSim() {\r\n    const bio = parseInt(document.getElementById('bioRange').value);\r\n    const valEco = document.getElementById('valEco');\r\n    const valFiltro = document.getElementById('valFiltro');\r\n    const bioValue = document.getElementById('bioValue');\r\n    const feedback = document.getElementById('simFeedback');\r\n    const progress = document.getElementById('progressVisual');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar valor mostrado del slider\r\n    bioValue.textContent = bio + '%';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ L\u00f3gica no lineal (umbral cr\u00edtico)\r\n    const ecoValue = Math.round(15000 * (bio \/ 100));\r\n    const filtroValue = bio;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Formatear con comas\r\n    valEco.textContent = '$' + ecoValue.toLocaleString();\r\n    valFiltro.textContent = filtroValue + '%';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar barra de progreso\r\n    progress.style.width = bio + '%';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Cambiar colores seg\u00fan estado\r\n    if (bio < 30) {\r\n        \/\/ ESTADO CR\u00cdTICO\r\n        valEco.style.color = \"#ff4444\";\r\n        valFiltro.style.color = \"#ff4444\";\r\n        progress.style.background = \"linear-gradient(90deg, #ff0000, #ff4444)\";\r\n        bioValue.style.color = \"#ff4444\";\r\n        \r\n        feedback.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center\">\r\n                <span class=\"text-danger me-2\">\u26a0<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"text-danger\">ALERTA: COLAPSO DEL SISTEMA<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"small text-danger mt-1\">\r\n                Se requieren plantas de tratamiento artificiales (Costos exorbitantes)\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Efecto glitch en el slider value\r\n        bioValue.style.animation = 'glitch 0.3s infinite';\r\n        \r\n    } else if (bio < 70) {\r\n        \/\/ ESTADO INTERMEDIO\r\n        valEco.style.color = \"#ffcc00\";\r\n        valFiltro.style.color = \"#ffcc00\";\r\n        progress.style.background = \"linear-gradient(90deg, #ffcc00, #ffdd44)\";\r\n        bioValue.style.color = \"#ffcc00\";\r\n        \r\n        feedback.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center\">\r\n                <span class=\"text-warning me-2\">\u26a0<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"text-warning\">SISTEMA DEGRADADO<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"small text-warning mt-1\">\r\n                P\u00e9rdida de resiliencia, riesgo de colapso ante perturbaciones\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        bioValue.style.animation = '';\r\n        \r\n    } else {\r\n        \/\/ ESTADO \u00d3PTIMO\r\n        valEco.style.color = \"#00ff88\";\r\n        valFiltro.style.color = \"#00ff88\";\r\n        progress.style.background = \"linear-gradient(90deg, #00ff88, #44ffaa)\";\r\n        bioValue.style.color = \"#00ff88\";\r\n        \r\n        feedback.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center\">\r\n                <span class=\"text-success me-2\">\u25cf<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"text-success\">SISTEMA \u00d3PTIMO<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"small text-success mt-1\">\r\n                Funcionalidad biof\u00edsica completa, alta resiliencia\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        bioValue.style.animation = '';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ QUIZ INTERACTIVO ============\r\nfunction checkQuiz(btn, isCorrect) {\r\n    const feedback = document.getElementById('quizFeedback');\r\n    const btns = document.querySelectorAll('.option-btn');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Desactivar todos los botones\r\n    btns.forEach(b => {\r\n        b.disabled = true;\r\n        b.classList.remove('correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Aplicar clases de respuesta\r\n    if (isCorrect) {\r\n        btn.classList.add('correct');\r\n        feedback.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"alert-success p-3 border border-success\">\r\n                <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                    <span class=\"text-success me-2\">\u2713<\/span>\r\n                    <div>\r\n                        <strong class=\"text-success\">CORRECTO!<\/strong>\r\n                        <div class=\"mt-1 small\">\r\n                            La protecci\u00f3n contra tormentas y erosi\u00f3n es una funci\u00f3n de control de procesos biof\u00edsicos (Regulaci\u00f3n).\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"mt-2 small text-cyan\">\r\n                    [NOTA: La Provisi\u00f3n se refiere a bienes tangibles (madera, peces)]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n    } else {\r\n        btn.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n        feedback.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"alert-danger p-3 border border-danger\">\r\n                <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                    <span class=\"text-danger me-2\">\u2717<\/span>\r\n                    <div>\r\n                        <strong class=\"text-danger\">INCORRECTO<\/strong>\r\n                        <div class=\"mt-1 small\">\r\n                            La respuesta correcta es <span class=\"text-warning\">Regulaci\u00f3n<\/span>.\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"mt-2 small text-cyan\">\r\n                    [AYUDA: Los servicios de regulaci\u00f3n controlan procesos ambientales]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    feedback.style.display = \"block\";\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto de sonido (simulado con animaci\u00f3n)\r\n    if(isCorrect) {\r\n        btn.style.animation = 'pulse-glow 0.5s';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ LABORATORIO TEEB ============\r\nfunction calcValue() {\r\n    const price = parseInt(document.getElementById('carbonPrice').value) || 40;\r\n    const area = 5000;\r\n    const capture = 15;\r\n    const total = area * capture * price;\r\n    \r\n    const resultElement = document.getElementById('labResult');\r\n    const oldValue = parseInt(resultElement.textContent.replace(\/,\/g, ''));\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Formatear con comas\r\n    resultElement.textContent = total.toLocaleString();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto visual de cambio\r\n    resultElement.classList.remove('value-pulse');\r\n    void resultElement.offsetWidth; \/\/ Trigger reflow\r\n    resultElement.classList.add('value-pulse');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto de color seg\u00fan cambio\r\n    if(total > oldValue) {\r\n        resultElement.style.color = '#00ff88';\r\n    } else if(total < oldValue) {\r\n        resultElement.style.color = '#ff4444';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar t\u00edtulo con efecto\r\n    setTimeout(() => {\r\n        resultElement.style.color = '#ffcc00';\r\n    }, 500);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ INTERACTIVIDAD SVG ============\r\nfunction initSVGInteractivity() {\r\n    const nodes = document.querySelectorAll('.cyber-node');\r\n    \r\n    nodes.forEach(node => {\r\n        node.addEventListener('mouseenter', function() {\r\n            this.style.filter = 'url(#glow)';\r\n            this.style.transform = 'scale(1.02)';\r\n            this.style.transition = 'transform 0.3s';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        node.addEventListener('mouseleave', function() {\r\n            this.style.filter = 'none';\r\n            this.style.transform = 'scale(1)';\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N ============\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    \/\/ Crear efecto Matrix\r\n    createMatrixDrops();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar simulador\r\n    updateSim();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar interactividad SVG\r\n    initSVGInteractivity();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar valor inicial del laboratorio\r\n    calcValue();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto de terminal typing (simulado)\r\n    const terminalText = document.querySelector('.terminal-prompt .text-warning');\r\n    if(terminalText) {\r\n        const originalText = terminalText.textContent;\r\n        terminalText.textContent = '';\r\n        \r\n        let i = 0;\r\n        const typeWriter = () => {\r\n            if(i < originalText.length) {\r\n                terminalText.textContent += originalText.charAt(i);\r\n                i++;\r\n                setTimeout(typeWriter, 50);\r\n            }\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        setTimeout(typeWriter, 1000);\r\n    }\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ UTILIDADES VISUALES ============\r\n\/\/ A\u00f1adir clases de colores para CSS\r\ndocument.head.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend', `\r\n<style>\r\n    .text-cyan { color: #00d4ff !important; }\r\n    .text-purple { color: #cc66ff !important; }\r\n    .border-cyan { border-color: #00d4ff !important; }\r\n    .border-purple { border-color: #cc66ff !important; }\r\n    .bg-cyan { background-color: #00d4ff !important; }\r\n    .bg-warning { background-color: #ffcc00 !important; }\r\n    .bg-purple { background-color: #cc66ff !important; }\r\n    \r\n    .cyber-dot {\r\n        width: 10px;\r\n        height: 10px;\r\n        border-radius: 50%;\r\n        display: inline-block;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .terminal-header {\r\n        background: rgba(0, 20, 40, 0.8);\r\n        border: 2px solid #00d4ff;\r\n        font-family: 'VT323', monospace;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .progress-container {\r\n        background: #000;\r\n        border: 2px solid #30363d;\r\n        padding: 5px;\r\n        border-radius: 0;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .progress-bar-bg {\r\n        height: 20px;\r\n        background: #002;\r\n        position: relative;\r\n        overflow: hidden;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .progress-bar-fill {\r\n        height: 100%;\r\n        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00ff88, #44ffaa);\r\n        transition: width 0.5s ease-out;\r\n        position: relative;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .progress-bar-fill::after {\r\n        content: '';\r\n        position: absolute;\r\n        top: 0;\r\n        left: 0;\r\n        right: 0;\r\n        bottom: 0;\r\n        background: linear-gradient(90deg, \r\n            transparent, \r\n            rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2), \r\n            transparent\r\n        );\r\n        animation: scanline 2s linear infinite;\r\n    }\r\n<\/p>\r\n`);\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la diferencia fundamental entre un servicio de soporte y uno de provisi\u00f3n?","respuesta":"El de soporte es un proceso base (ej. fotos\u00edntesis) necesario para que todos los dem\u00e1s existan; el de provisi\u00f3n es el producto final consumible (ej. frutas, madera)."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 significa que un servicio ecosist\u00e9mico sea \"no comercial\"?","respuesta":"Significa que aporta bienestar (como la belleza esc\u00e9nica o la regulaci\u00f3n clim\u00e1tica) pero no suele tener un precio de mercado directo, aunque tenga un valor econ\u00f3mico inmenso."},{"enunciado":"Explique el concepto de \"Internalizaci\u00f3n de externalidades\" en el contexto de servicios ambientales.","respuesta":"Es el acto de incluir el costo del da\u00f1o a la naturaleza o el valor de sus servicios en los precios de los productos y presupuestos nacionales."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 la polinizaci\u00f3n se considera un servicio de regulaci\u00f3n y no de provisi\u00f3n?","respuesta":"Porque es un proceso biol\u00f3gico que controla la reproducci\u00f3n vegetal; el fruto es el servicio de provisi\u00f3n, pero el acto de polinizar regula la producci\u00f3n."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es un PSA (Pago por Servicios Ambientales)?","respuesta":"Un mecanismo financiero donde los beneficiarios de un servicio (ej. usuarios de agua) pagan a los proveedores (ej. due\u00f1os de bosques r\u00edo arriba) para asegurar su conservaci\u00f3n."},{"enunciado":"Mencione un ejemplo de servicio cultural en un ecosistema urbano.","respuesta":"Parques p\u00fablicos que ofrecen salud mental, recreaci\u00f3n y valor espiritual a los ciudadanos."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 report\u00f3 el MEA en 2005 sobre el estado de los servicios globales?","respuesta":"Que aproximadamente el 60% de los servicios ecosist\u00e9micos examinados se est\u00e1n degradando o se usan de manera insostenible."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo afecta la p\u00e9rdida de biodiversidad a la resiliencia de los servicios de regulaci\u00f3n?","respuesta":"Reduce la redundancia funcional; si desaparece una especie clave, el servicio (ej. control de plagas) puede colapsar repentinamente."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el valor estimado de los servicios ecosist\u00e9micos comparado con el PIB mundial?","respuesta":"Se estima que valen casi el doble del PIB mundial total (aprox. US$125-140 billones\/a\u00f1o)."},{"enunciado":"Mencione un servicio de regulaci\u00f3n h\u00eddrica de los p\u00e1ramos.","respuesta":"La capacidad de retenci\u00f3n y liberaci\u00f3n lenta de agua, actuando como esponjas naturales que regulan el caudal de los r\u00edos."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"Valor de Existencia\"?","respuesta":"Un valor cultural\/\u00e9tico asignado a un ecosistema o especie por el simple hecho de saber que existe, sin intenci\u00f3n de usarlo nunca."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo contribuyen los manglares a la seguridad alimentaria (provisi\u00f3n)?","respuesta":"Sirven como guarder\u00edas para la mayor\u00eda de las especies de peces comerciales antes de que migren a mar abierto."}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"La formaci\u00f3n de suelo es un servicio de:","opciones":["Soporte","Regulaci\u00f3n","Provisi\u00f3n","Cultural"],"correcta":"Soporte"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l de estos es un servicio de regulaci\u00f3n?","opciones":["Madera","Polinizaci\u00f3n","Medicinas","Turismo"],"correcta":"Polinizaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"El marco TEEB se enfoca principalmente en:","opciones":["Biolog\u00eda marina","Econom\u00eda de los ecosistemas y biodiversidad","Astronom\u00eda","Derecho laboral"],"correcta":"Econom\u00eda de los ecosistemas y biodiversidad"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 servicio provee un bosque al secuestrar CO2?","opciones":["Regulaci\u00f3n clim\u00e1tica","Soporte vital","Provisi\u00f3n qu\u00edmica","Cultural espiritual"],"correcta":"Regulaci\u00f3n clim\u00e1tica"},{"pregunta":"Las abejas aportan un valor global anual estimado en:","opciones":["US$ 1 mill\u00f3n","US$ 235-577 mil millones","US$ 100","Cero"],"correcta":"US$ 235-577 mil millones"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 categor\u00eda incluye la inspiraci\u00f3n art\u00edstica y el ecoturismo?","opciones":["Soporte","Cultural","Regulaci\u00f3n","Provisi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Cultural"},{"pregunta":"Los principios de la IPBES se centran en:","opciones":["Biodiversidad y servicios ecosist\u00e9micos","Energ\u00eda nuclear","Telecomunicaciones","Moda sostenible"],"correcta":"Biodiversidad y servicios ecosist\u00e9micos"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la \"bioprospecci\u00f3n\"?","opciones":["Miner\u00eda","B\u00fasqueda de compuestos medicinales en la naturaleza","Venta de madera","Pesca industrial"],"correcta":"B\u00fasqueda de compuestos medicinales en la naturaleza"},{"pregunta":"Un servicio de provisi\u00f3n es aquel que:","opciones":["No se puede tocar","Entrega bienes materiales (comida, agua)","Limpia el aire","Genera lluvia"],"correcta":"Entrega bienes materiales (comida, agua)"},{"pregunta":"El ciclo del nitr\u00f3geno pertenece a:","opciones":["Soporte","Cultural","Regulaci\u00f3n","Provisi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Soporte"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 pa\u00eds es l\u00edder en programas de PSA (Pago por Servicios Ambientales)?","opciones":["Rusia","Costa Rica","Groenlandia","Chad"],"correcta":"Costa Rica"},{"pregunta":"La mitigaci\u00f3n de inundaciones por humedales es un servicio de:","opciones":["Regulaci\u00f3n","Provisi\u00f3n","Soporte","Cultural"],"correcta":"Regulaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo se llama el beneficio de obtener agua dulce limpia?","opciones":["Servicio de provisi\u00f3n h\u00eddrica","Servicio cultural","Servicio de soporte h\u00eddrico","Ninguno"],"correcta":"Servicio de provisi\u00f3n h\u00eddrica"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 sucede si un servicio de soporte colapsa?","opciones":["Los dem\u00e1s se mantienen igual","Todos los servicios dependientes colapsan","Mejora el turismo","No pasa nada"],"correcta":"Todos los servicios dependientes colapsan"},{"pregunta":"El valor de los servicios ecosist\u00e9micos suele ser:","opciones":["Invisible en el PIB tradicional","La base del PIB mundial","F\u00e1cil de cobrar","Muy bajo"],"correcta":"Invisible en el PIB tradicional"},{"pregunta":"Un arrecife de coral protege de marejadas, esto es:","opciones":["Regulaci\u00f3n","Provisi\u00f3n","Soporte","Cultural"],"correcta":"Regulaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el capital natural?","opciones":["Dinero en el banco","Stock de recursos naturales que genera servicios","Maquinaria agr\u00edcola","Edificios sostenibles"],"correcta":"Stock de recursos naturales que genera servicios"},{"pregunta":"La fotos\u00edntesis se clasifica como:","opciones":["Soporte","Regulaci\u00f3n","Provisi\u00f3n","Cultural"],"correcta":"Soporte"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es una externalidad negativa?","opciones":["Un regalo","Un costo ambiental no pagado por quien lo causa","Un beneficio para todos","Una multa pagada"],"correcta":"Un costo ambiental no pagado por quien lo causa"},{"pregunta":"La dispersi\u00f3n de semillas por aves es:","opciones":["Regulaci\u00f3n","Provisi\u00f3n","Soporte","Cultural"],"correcta":"Regulaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el principal objetivo del MEA?","opciones":["Evaluar las consecuencias de los cambios en los ecosistemas para el bienestar humano","Vender \u00e1rboles","Contar animales","Hacer mapas"],"correcta":"Evaluar las consecuencias de los cambios en los ecosistemas para el bienestar humano"},{"pregunta":"Los combustibles f\u00f3siles son considerados:","opciones":["Servicios de provisi\u00f3n (hist\u00f3ricos)","Servicios de soporte","Servicios culturales","No son servicios ecosist\u00e9micos"],"correcta":"Servicios de provisi\u00f3n (hist\u00f3ricos)"},{"pregunta":"La purificaci\u00f3n de aire por bosques es:","opciones":["Regulaci\u00f3n","Provisi\u00f3n","Soporte","Cultural"],"correcta":"Regulaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 significa el signo \"+\" en REDD+?","opciones":["M\u00e1s dinero","Inclusi\u00f3n de conservaci\u00f3n y gesti\u00f3n sostenible","Solo \u00e1rboles grandes","Matem\u00e1ticas"],"correcta":"Inclusi\u00f3n de conservaci\u00f3n y gesti\u00f3n sostenible"},{"pregunta":"El control natural de plagas en agricultura es:","opciones":["Regulaci\u00f3n","Provisi\u00f3n","Soporte","Cultural"],"correcta":"Regulaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"El valor de legado (dejar naturaleza a hijos) es:","opciones":["Cultural","Provisi\u00f3n","Regulaci\u00f3n","Soporte"],"correcta":"Cultural"},{"pregunta":"La biomasa para energ\u00eda es un servicio de:","opciones":["Provisi\u00f3n","Regulaci\u00f3n","Soporte","Cultural"],"correcta":"Provisi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 organizaci\u00f3n public\u00f3 el informe TEEB?","opciones":["PNUMA (UNEP)","NASA","FIFA","Apple"],"correcta":"PNUMA (UNEP)"},{"pregunta":"La resiliencia de un ecosistema depende de:","opciones":["Sus servicios de soporte","La cantidad de turistas","El precio de la madera","La altura de los \u00e1rboles"],"correcta":"Sus servicios de soporte"},{"pregunta":"Los beneficios de la salud mental en bosques son:","opciones":["Servicios culturales","Servicios de regulaci\u00f3n","Servicios de provisi\u00f3n","No existen"],"correcta":"Servicios culturales"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"sustentabilidad-avanzada","titulo":"Sustentabilidad Sist\u00e9mica: Del Consumo Lineal a la Regeneraci\u00f3n Circular","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-sustentabilidad\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ MATRIX DROPS ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"matrix-container\" id=\"matrixContainer\"><\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ TERMINAL HEADER ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"terminal-header\">\r\n    <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\">\r\n        <div class=\"terminal-prompt\">\r\n            <span class=\"text-green\">SYSTEM_LOAD><\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"text-cyan ms-2\">SUSTAINABILITY_CORE<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"text-orange blink ms-2\">[ACTIVE]<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"terminal-status\">\r\n            <span class=\"badge border border-green text-green\">ODS_12<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge border border-cyan text-cyan ms-2\">CIRCULAR_ECONOMY<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge border border-orange text-orange ms-2\">INDUSTRIAL_ECO<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ T\u00cdTULO PRINCIPAL ============ -->\r\n<h1>ECOLOG\u00cdA INDUSTRIAL Y ODS 12<\/h1>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ CONCEPT HEADER ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"concept-header\">\r\n    <div class=\"d-flex align-items-start\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-orange me-3\">\u26a0<\/span>\r\n        <div>\r\n            <p class=\"lead\">\r\n                La sustentabilidad no es una \"acci\u00f3n verde\", es el redise\u00f1o de los flujos de materia y energ\u00eda. \r\n                El <strong>ODS 12<\/strong> busca romper el desacoplamiento entre crecimiento econ\u00f3mico y degradaci\u00f3n ambiental.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"mt-3\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge border border-green\">3R+<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge border border-cyan ms-2\">CRADLE_TO_CRADLE<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge border border-orange ms-2\">CARBON_NEGATIVE<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ DIAGRAMA SIST\u00c9MICO CYBERPUNK ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"text-center mb-4\">\r\n        <span class=\"badge border border-cyan\">METABOLISM_DIAGRAM<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"text-muted ms-2\">v3.2 - Cradle to Cradle Design<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\">\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <!-- Gradientes cibern\u00e9ticos -->\r\n            <linearGradient id=\"gradTech\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\">\r\n                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#001a33\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#003366\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#00d4ff\"\/>\r\n            <\/linearGradient>\r\n            \r\n            <linearGradient id=\"gradBio\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\">\r\n                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#001a0d\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#00331a\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#00ff9d\"\/>\r\n            <\/linearGradient>\r\n            \r\n            <filter id=\"glow-green\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"3\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n            \r\n            <filter id=\"glow-blue\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"2\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Fondo de circuito -->\r\n        <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"700\" height=\"350\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00d4ff\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\"\/>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Ciclo T\u00e9cnico -->\r\n        <path d=\"M450 200 A 100 100 0 1 1 450 199\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#gradTech)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,5\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"0;30;0\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/path>\r\n        \r\n        <g class=\"tech-cycle\" filter=\"url(#glow-blue)\">\r\n            <circle cx=\"550\" cy=\"200\" r=\"45\" fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#00d4ff\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n            <circle cx=\"550\" cy=\"200\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#001a33\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n            \r\n            <text x=\"550\" y=\"195\" fill=\"#00d4ff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                CICLO T\u00c9CNICO\r\n            <\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"550\" y=\"220\" fill=\"#8af\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Courier New'\" font-size=\"12\">\r\n                Reutilizar \/ Reciclar\r\n            <\/text>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- \u00cdconos t\u00e9cnicos -->\r\n            <path d=\"M535 185 L545 175 L555 185 L545 195 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00d4ff\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n            <rect x=\"540\" y=\"225\" width=\"20\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#00d4ff\"\/>\r\n            <rect x=\"545\" y=\"230\" width=\"10\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#00d4ff\"\/>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Ciclo Biol\u00f3gico -->\r\n        <path d=\"M350 200 A 100 100 0 1 0 350 199\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#gradBio)\" stroke-width=\"4\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"0;30;0\" dur=\"2.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/path>\r\n        \r\n        <g class=\"bio-cycle\" filter=\"url(#glow-green)\">\r\n            <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"200\" r=\"45\" fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#00ff9d\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n            <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"200\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#001a0d\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n            \r\n            <text x=\"250\" y=\"195\" fill=\"#00ff9d\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                CICLO BIOL\u00d3GICO\r\n            <\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"250\" y=\"220\" fill=\"#8af\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Courier New'\" font-size=\"12\">\r\n                Compostar \/ Regenerar\r\n            <\/text>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- \u00cdconos biol\u00f3gicos -->\r\n            <path d=\"M240 185 Q250 175 260 185 T250 195\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00ff9d\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n            <circle cx=\"245\" cy=\"230\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#00ff9d\"\/>\r\n            <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"230\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#00ff9d\"\/>\r\n            <circle cx=\"255\" cy=\"230\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#00ff9d\"\/>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Nodo Central Dise\u00f1o -->\r\n        <g class=\"design-node\">\r\n            <rect x=\"360\" y=\"170\" width=\"80\" height=\"60\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"stroke\" values=\"#fff;#00ff9d;#00d4ff;#fff\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/rect>\r\n            <rect x=\"365\" y=\"175\" width=\"70\" height=\"50\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0.9\"\/>\r\n            \r\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"205\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                DISE\u00d1O\r\n            <\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"225\" fill=\"#8af\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Courier New'\" font-size=\"10\">\r\n                Sistema Central\r\n            <\/text>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Punto central animado -->\r\n            <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"200\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#00ff9d\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"5;8;5\" dur=\"1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"fill\" values=\"#00ff9d;#00d4ff;#00ff9d\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/circle>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Conexiones -->\r\n        <path d=\"M400 230 L400 260\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"0;10;0\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/path>\r\n        \r\n        <text x=\"400\" y=\"285\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"14\">\r\n            FLUJO DE MATERIALES\r\n        <\/text>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- T\u00edtulo principal -->\r\n        <text x=\"400\" y=\"40\" fill=\"#00ff9d\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n            SISTEMA \"CRADLE TO CRADLE\"\r\n        <\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"400\" y=\"65\" fill=\"#00d4ff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Courier New'\" font-size=\"12\">\r\n            Dise\u00f1o Regenerativo - Metabolismo Circular\r\n        <\/text>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Flechas de flujo -->\r\n        <path d=\"M400 260 L480 260 L480 300 L550 300\" stroke=\"#00ff9d\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowTech)\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"0;20;0\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/path>\r\n        \r\n        <path d=\"M400 260 L320 260 L320 300 L250 300\" stroke=\"#00d4ff\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowBio)\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"0;20;0\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/path>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Defs para flechas -->\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <marker id=\"arrowTech\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                <path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#00ff9d\"\/>\r\n            <\/marker>\r\n            <marker id=\"arrowBio\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                <path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#00d4ff\"\/>\r\n            <\/marker>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"mt-3 text-center\">\r\n        <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-center flex-wrap gap-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                <div class=\"cyber-dot bg-green me-2\"><\/div>\r\n                <span class=\"small text-green\">Ciclo Biol\u00f3gico (Regenerativo)<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                <div class=\"cyber-dot bg-cyan me-2\"><\/div>\r\n                <span class=\"small text-cyan\">Ciclo T\u00e9cnico (Circular)<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                <div class=\"cyber-dot bg-white me-2\"><\/div>\r\n                <span class=\"small text-white\">Nodo de Dise\u00f1o<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ SIMULADOR DE METABOLISMO URBANO ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"sim-panel\">\r\n    <h4>\ud83c\udfae SIMULADOR DE METABOLISMO URBANO<\/h4>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"terminal-instructions mb-4 p-3 border border-cyan\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-cyan\">INSTRUCCIONES:<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"text-light ms-2\">Modifica la eficiencia de los h\u00e1bitos ciudadanos y observa el impacto en la <strong>Huella de Carbono<\/strong> y el <strong>Estr\u00e9s H\u00eddrico<\/strong>.<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"row g-4\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n            <!-- Panel de control de sliders -->\r\n            <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                <label class=\"stat-label\">TASA DE RECICLAJE (%)<\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between mb-2\">\r\n                    <span class=\"text-danger\">0%<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"text-warning\" id=\"recycleValue\">13%<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"text-success\">100%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range\" id=\"rangeRecycle\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"13\" oninput=\"updateSim()\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-status mt-2\">\r\n                    <span class=\"small text-muted\">Estado actual: <\/span>\r\n                    <span id=\"recycleStatus\" class=\"small text-warning\">BAJO<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"slider-group mt-4\">\r\n                <label class=\"stat-label\">DIETA (BASADA EN PLANTAS %)<\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between mb-2\">\r\n                    <span class=\"text-danger\">0%<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"text-warning\" id=\"dietValue\">20%<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"text-success\">100%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range\" id=\"rangeDiet\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\" oninput=\"updateSim()\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-status mt-2\">\r\n                    <span class=\"small text-muted\">Impacto h\u00eddrico: <\/span>\r\n                    <span id=\"dietStatus\" class=\"small text-warning\">ALTO<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"col-md-8\">\r\n            <!-- Dashboard de m\u00e9tricas -->\r\n            <div class=\"row g-3\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dashboard-stat\">\r\n                        <div class=\"stat-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"stat-label\">CO2 EQ (TON)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-val\" id=\"valCO2\">12.5<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"stat-footer\">\r\n                            <span class=\"small text-muted\">Huella Carbono Anual<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dashboard-stat\">\r\n                        <div class=\"stat-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"stat-label\">H2O (M3)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-val\" id=\"valH2O\">1500<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"stat-footer\">\r\n                            <span class=\"small text-muted\">Consumo H\u00eddrico<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dashboard-stat\">\r\n                        <div class=\"stat-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"stat-label\">VIDA \u00daTIL RELLENO<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-val text-orange\" id=\"valFill\">5 A\u00d1OS<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"stat-footer\">\r\n                            <span class=\"small text-muted\">Capacidad Residual<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"col-12\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dashboard-stat\">\r\n                        <div class=\"stat-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"stat-label\">ESTADO SIST\u00c9MICO<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div id=\"simFeedback\" class=\"text-center py-2\">\r\n                            <span class=\"text-orange\">\u25cf CONSUMO LINEAL - ALTO IMPACTO<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Gr\u00e1fico de impacto -->\r\n            <div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n                <label class=\"stat-label\">VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DE IMPACTO<\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"impact-chart\">\r\n                    <canvas id=\"impactChart\" width=\"800\" height=\"150\"><\/canvas>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ LABORATORIO VIRTUAL ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"lab-box\">\r\n    <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-4\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83e\uddea LAB VIRTUAL: ACTIVACI\u00d3N DE ADSORBENTES<\/h4>\r\n        <div class=\"lab-badges\">\r\n            <span class=\"badge border border-orange text-orange\">CARBON_ACTIVATED<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge border border-green text-green ms-2\">CIRCULAR_ECONOMY<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"terminal-instructions mb-4\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-orange\">OBJETIVO:<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"text-light ms-2\">\r\n            El <strong>Carbono Activado<\/strong> es una soluci\u00f3n de econom\u00eda circular (usando biomasa residual como c\u00e1scaras de coco). \r\n            Calcula la eficiencia de adsorci\u00f3n en funci\u00f3n de la temperatura de activaci\u00f3n.\r\n        <\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- Panel de control del laboratorio -->\r\n    <div class=\"control-panel p-4 border border-orange mb-4\">\r\n        <div class=\"row g-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                <div class=\"lab-field-group\">\r\n                    <label class=\"stat-label\" for=\"tempAct\">\r\n                        TEMPERATURA DE ACTIVACI\u00d3N (\u00baC)\r\n                        <span class=\"text-orange blink ms-2\" id=\"tempStatus\">[OPTIMAL]<\/span>\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"tempAct\" class=\"form-control input-master-lab\" value=\"600\" \r\n                               min=\"300\" max=\"1200\" step=\"50\" oninput=\"calcAdsorption()\">\r\n                        <span class=\"input-group-text bg-dark border-orange text-orange\">\u00baC<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"text-center mt-2\">\r\n                        <span class=\"small text-muted\">Rango recomendado: 600-800\u00baC<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Indicador visual de temperatura -->\r\n                <div class=\"temp-indicator mt-4\">\r\n                    <label class=\"stat-label\">INDICADOR DE TEMPERATURA<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"temp-bar\">\r\n                        <div class=\"temp-fill\" id=\"tempVisual\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"temp-labels d-flex justify-content-between mt-1\">\r\n                        <span class=\"small text-danger\">300\u00baC<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"small text-warning\">600\u00baC<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"small text-success\">800\u00baC<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"small text-danger\">1200\u00baC<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                <!-- Display de resultados -->\r\n                <div class=\"results-display h-100\">\r\n                    <div class=\"row h-100\">\r\n                        <div class=\"col-12 mb-3\">\r\n                            <div class=\"lab-field-group\">\r\n                                <label class=\"stat-label\">\u00c1REA SUPERFICIAL ESPEC\u00cdFICA<\/label>\r\n                                <div class=\"text-center py-3\">\r\n                                    <span id=\"surfaceArea\" class=\"h2 text-green\">800<\/span>\r\n                                    <span class=\"text-green h4 ms-2\">m\u00b2\/g<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"text-center\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"small text-muted\">Capacidad de adsorci\u00f3n por gramo<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"col-12\">\r\n                            <div class=\"removal-display\">\r\n                                <label class=\"stat-label text-center\">EFICIENCIA DE REMOCI\u00d3N<\/label>\r\n                                <div class=\"text-center py-4\">\r\n                                    <span id=\"remEff\" class=\"h1 text-orange\">74%<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"text-center\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"small text-muted\">Capacidad de filtraci\u00f3n estimada<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- Notas t\u00e9cnicas -->\r\n    <div class=\"tech-notes p-3 border border-cyan\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-cyan\">NOTAS T\u00c9CNICAS:<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"text-light ms-2\">\r\n            La activaci\u00f3n t\u00e9rmica a 800\u00baC maximiza la microporosidad. Por encima de 900\u00baC se produce sinterizaci\u00f3n \r\n            (reducci\u00f3n de \u00e1rea). El carbono activado puede reutilizarse hasta 5 ciclos antes de regeneraci\u00f3n.\r\n        <\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ QUIZ DE DIAGN\u00d3STICO ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"quiz-terminal\">\r\n    <h5>[SISTEMA_CHECK]: DIAGN\u00d3STICO DE SUSTENTABILIDAD<\/h5>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-scenario mb-4 p-3 border border-green\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-green\">ESCENARIO:<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"text-light ms-2\">\r\n            \u00bfPor qu\u00e9 el \"Reciclaje\" se considera la \u00faltima opci\u00f3n dentro del paradigma de la Econom\u00eda Circular, \r\n            despu\u00e9s de Reducir y Reutilizar?\r\n        <\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n        <button class=\"opt-btn\" onclick=\"checkQuiz(this, false, 'El reciclaje es caro, pero energ\u00e9ticamente es lo mejor.')\">\r\n            <span class=\"opt-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"opt-text\">Porque es dif\u00edcil separar los materiales en casa.<\/span>\r\n        <\/button>\r\n        \r\n        <button class=\"opt-btn\" onclick=\"checkQuiz(this, true, 'Correcto: El reciclaje consume energ\u00eda adicional y degrada la calidad del material (downcycling) en comparaci\u00f3n con mantener el producto en su estado original.')\">\r\n            <span class=\"opt-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"opt-text\">Porque implica consumo energ\u00e9tico adicional y p\u00e9rdida de valor (entrop\u00eda del material).<\/span>\r\n        <\/button>\r\n        \r\n        <button class=\"opt-btn\" onclick=\"checkQuiz(this, false, 'Inexacto: El reciclaje es positivo, pero no regenera ecosistemas por s\u00ed mismo.')\">\r\n            <span class=\"opt-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"opt-text\">Porque el reciclaje contamina m\u00e1s que producir pl\u00e1stico virgen.<\/span>\r\n        <\/button>\r\n        \r\n        <button class=\"opt-btn\" onclick=\"checkQuiz(this, false, 'La complejidad es un factor menor comparado con la p\u00e9rdida de calidad material y energ\u00eda.')\">\r\n            <span class=\"opt-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"opt-text\">Porque los sistemas de reciclaje son demasiado complejos t\u00e9cnicamente.<\/span>\r\n        <\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div id=\"quizResult\" class=\"mt-3\" style=\"display:none;\">\r\n        <!-- Se llena con JavaScript -->\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ CONCLUSI\u00d3N SIST\u00c9MICA ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"conclusion-section\">\r\n    <h3>CONCLUSI\u00d3N SIST\u00c9MICA<\/h3>\r\n    \r\n    <p>\r\n        La transici\u00f3n al <strong>ODS 12<\/strong> requiere pasar de una mentalidad de \"gesti\u00f3n de residuos\" a una de \r\n        \"gesti\u00f3n de recursos\". Los h\u00e1bitos individuales son el motor de la demanda, pero solo el redise\u00f1o sist\u00e9mico \r\n        (Eco-dise\u00f1o) puede garantizar la resiliencia de la biosfera en el Antropoceno.\r\n    <\/p>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"key-insights mt-4\">\r\n        <div class=\"row\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-4 mb-3\">\r\n                <div class=\"insight-card p-3 border border-green h-100\">\r\n                    <div class=\"insight-icon text-center mb-2\">\r\n                        <span class=\"h3 text-green\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <h5 class=\"text-green text-center\">CIRCULARIDAD<\/h5>\r\n                    <p class=\"small text-center text-muted mb-0\">\r\n                        Los sistemas lineales son inherentemente insostenibles. La circularidad es una propiedad emergente del dise\u00f1o.\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"col-md-4 mb-3\">\r\n                <div class=\"insight-card p-3 border border-cyan h-100\">\r\n                    <div class=\"insight-icon text-center mb-2\">\r\n                        <span class=\"h3 text-cyan\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <h5 class=\"text-cyan text-center\">ENERG\u00cdA<\/h5>\r\n                    <p class=\"small text-center text-muted mb-0\">\r\n                        Todo proceso de transformaci\u00f3n consume energ\u00eda. La eficiencia energ\u00e9tica es el factor limitante de la circularidad.\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"col-md-4 mb-3\">\r\n                <div class=\"insight-card p-3 border border-orange h-100\">\r\n                    <div class=\"insight-icon text-center mb-2\">\r\n                        <span class=\"h3 text-orange\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <h5 class=\"text-orange text-center\">MATERIALES<\/h5>\r\n                    <p class=\"small text-center text-muted mb-0\">\r\n                        La calidad del material se degrada en cada ciclo. El dise\u00f1o para la desmontabilidad es clave.\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"conclusion-footer mt-4 p-3 border border-green\">\r\n        <div class=\"text-center\">\r\n            <span class=\"text-green\">[SYSTEM_ANALYSIS_COMPLETE]<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"text-light ms-2\">--- TRANSITION TO REGENERATIVE SYSTEMS REQUIRED ---<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ JAVASCRIPT CYBERPUNK ============ -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ============ MATRIX DROPS EFFECT ============\r\nfunction createMatrixDrops() {\r\n    const container = document.getElementById('matrixContainer');\r\n    const chars = '01';\r\n    \r\n    for(let i = 0; i < 20; i++) {\r\n        const drop = document.createElement('div');\r\n        drop.className = 'matrix-drop';\r\n        drop.textContent = chars.charAt(Math.floor(Math.random() * chars.length));\r\n        \r\n        drop.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + '%';\r\n        drop.style.animationDelay = Math.random() * 5 + 's';\r\n        drop.style.animationDuration = (Math.random() * 3 + 2) + 's';\r\n        drop.style.animationName = 'matrix-drop';\r\n        drop.style.animationIterationCount = 'infinite';\r\n        \r\n        container.appendChild(drop);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ SIMULADOR DE METABOLISMO URBANO ============\r\nlet impactChart = null;\r\n\r\nfunction updateSim() {\r\n    const recycle = parseInt(document.getElementById('rangeRecycle').value);\r\n    const diet = parseInt(document.getElementById('rangeDiet').value);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar valores mostrados\r\n    document.getElementById('recycleValue').textContent = recycle + '%';\r\n    document.getElementById('dietValue').textContent = diet + '%';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ L\u00f3gica de impacto con base cient\u00edfica\r\n    const co2 = (15 - (recycle * 0.05) - (diet * 0.08)).toFixed(1);\r\n    const h2o = (2000 - (diet * 15)).toFixed(0);\r\n    const life = (5 + (recycle * 0.25)).toFixed(1);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar valores\r\n    document.getElementById('valCO2').textContent = co2;\r\n    document.getElementById('valH2O').textContent = h2o + ' M3';\r\n    document.getElementById('valFill').textContent = life + ' A\u00d1OS';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar estados\r\n    updateStatus('recycleStatus', recycle, [30, 70]);\r\n    updateStatus('dietStatus', diet, [20, 60]);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Feedback sist\u00e9mico\r\n    const feedback = document.getElementById('simFeedback');\r\n    let statusText = '';\r\n    let statusColor = '';\r\n    \r\n    if(recycle > 70 && diet > 60) {\r\n        statusText = '\u25cf REGENERACI\u00d3N ACTIVA - HUELLA M\u00cdNIMA';\r\n        statusColor = '#00ff9d';\r\n    } else if(recycle > 40 || diet > 40) {\r\n        statusText = '\u25cf TRANSICI\u00d3N - IMPACTO MODERADO';\r\n        statusColor = '#ff9d00';\r\n    } else {\r\n        statusText = '\u25cf CONSUMO LINEAL - ALTO IMPACTO';\r\n        statusColor = '#ff4444';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    feedback.innerHTML = `<span style=\"color:${statusColor}\">${statusText}<\/span>`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar gr\u00e1fico\r\n    updateImpactChart(recycle, diet);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction updateStatus(elementId, value, thresholds) {\r\n    const element = document.getElementById(elementId);\r\n    const [low, medium] = thresholds;\r\n    \r\n    if(value < low) {\r\n        element.textContent = 'BAJO';\r\n        element.className = 'small text-danger';\r\n    } else if(value < medium) {\r\n        element.textContent = 'MEDIO';\r\n        element.className = 'small text-warning';\r\n    } else {\r\n        element.textContent = 'ALTO';\r\n        element.className = 'small text-success';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction updateImpactChart(recycle, diet) {\r\n    const canvas = document.getElementById('impactChart');\r\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Limpiar canvas\r\n    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Datos para el gr\u00e1fico\r\n    const data = [\r\n        {label: 'Reciclaje', value: recycle, color: '#00d4ff'},\r\n        {label: 'Dieta Plantas', value: diet, color: '#00ff9d'},\r\n        {label: 'Impacto CO2', value: 100 - (recycle * 0.3 + diet * 0.4), color: '#ff9d00'},\r\n        {label: 'Estr\u00e9s H\u00eddrico', value: 100 - (diet * 0.6), color: '#cc66ff'}\r\n    ];\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Dibujar gr\u00e1fico de barras\r\n    const barWidth = 60;\r\n    const spacing = 30;\r\n    const startX = 50;\r\n    \r\n    data.forEach((item, index) => {\r\n        const x = startX + (barWidth + spacing) * index;\r\n        const height = (item.value \/ 100) * 100;\r\n        const y = 140 - height;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Barra\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = item.color;\r\n        ctx.fillRect(x, y, barWidth, height);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Efecto de brillo\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)';\r\n        ctx.fillRect(x, y, 10, height);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Texto\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#fff';\r\n        ctx.font = '12px \"VT323\"';\r\n        ctx.textAlign = 'center';\r\n        ctx.fillText(item.label, x + barWidth\/2, 155);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Valor\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = item.color;\r\n        ctx.font = '14px \"VT323\"';\r\n        ctx.fillText(item.value + '%', x + barWidth\/2, y - 10);\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ L\u00ednea de referencia\r\n    ctx.strokeStyle = '#666';\r\n    ctx.setLineDash([5, 3]);\r\n    ctx.beginPath();\r\n    ctx.moveTo(40, 90);\r\n    ctx.lineTo(750, 90);\r\n    ctx.stroke();\r\n    ctx.setLineDash([]);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Etiqueta de referencia\r\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#8af';\r\n    ctx.font = '10px \"Courier New\"';\r\n    ctx.fillText('Objetivo ODS 12', 30, 85);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ LABORATORIO DE ADSORBENTES ============\r\nfunction calcAdsorption() {\r\n    const temp = parseInt(document.getElementById('tempAct').value) || 600;\r\n    const surfaceElement = document.getElementById('surfaceArea');\r\n    const effElement = document.getElementById('remEff');\r\n    const tempVisual = document.getElementById('tempVisual');\r\n    const tempStatus = document.getElementById('tempStatus');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Modelo simplificado: pico a 800 grados\r\n    let area, eff;\r\n    \r\n    if(temp <= 800) {\r\n        \/\/ Zona de activaci\u00f3n\r\n        area = 400 + (temp * 0.67);\r\n        eff = 40 + (temp * 0.075);\r\n    } else {\r\n        \/\/ Zona de sinterizaci\u00f3n (p\u00e9rdida)\r\n        area = 1200 - ((temp - 800) * 1.5);\r\n        eff = 100 - ((temp - 800) * 0.2);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Limitar valores\r\n    area = Math.max(300, Math.min(area, 1200));\r\n    eff = Math.max(30, Math.min(eff, 99));\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar valores con animaci\u00f3n\r\n    animateValue(surfaceElement, Math.round(area));\r\n    animateValue(effElement, Math.round(eff));\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar indicador visual de temperatura\r\n    const tempPercent = ((temp - 300) \/ 900) * 100;\r\n    tempVisual.style.width = Math.min(Math.max(tempPercent, 0), 100) + '%';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar color del indicador\r\n    if(temp >= 600 && temp <= 800) {\r\n        tempVisual.style.background = 'linear-gradient(90deg, #00ff9d, #00d4ff)';\r\n        tempStatus.textContent = '[OPTIMAL]';\r\n        tempStatus.className = 'text-green blink ms-2';\r\n    } else if(temp < 600) {\r\n        tempVisual.style.background = 'linear-gradient(90deg, #ff4444, #ff9d00)';\r\n        tempStatus.textContent = '[UNDER]';\r\n        tempStatus.className = 'text-warning blink ms-2';\r\n    } else {\r\n        tempVisual.style.background = 'linear-gradient(90deg, #ff9d00, #ff4444)';\r\n        tempStatus.textContent = '[OVER]';\r\n        tempStatus.className = 'text-danger blink ms-2';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction animateValue(element, targetValue) {\r\n    const currentValue = parseInt(element.textContent.replace(\/[^0-9]\/g, ''));\r\n    const increment = Math.sign(targetValue - currentValue);\r\n    let current = currentValue;\r\n    \r\n    const animate = () => {\r\n        current += increment * Math.ceil(Math.abs(targetValue - current) \/ 10);\r\n        \r\n        if((increment > 0 && current >= targetValue) || \r\n           (increment < 0 && current <= targetValue)) {\r\n            current = targetValue;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        if(element.id === 'remEff') {\r\n            element.textContent = current + '%';\r\n        } else {\r\n            element.textContent = current;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        if(current !== targetValue) {\r\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\r\n        } else {\r\n            \/\/ Efecto final\r\n            element.style.transform = 'scale(1.1)';\r\n            setTimeout(() => {\r\n                element.style.transform = 'scale(1)';\r\n            }, 200);\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    animate();\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ QUIZ INTERACTIVO ============\r\nfunction checkQuiz(btn, isCorrect, feedback) {\r\n    const result = document.getElementById('quizResult');\r\n    const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.opt-btn');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Desactivar todos los botones\r\n    buttons.forEach(b => {\r\n        b.disabled = true;\r\n        b.classList.remove('correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    if(isCorrect) {\r\n        btn.classList.add('correct');\r\n        result.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"alert-success p-4 border border-green\">\r\n                <div class=\"d-flex align-items-start\">\r\n                    <span class=\"text-green me-3\">\u2713<\/span>\r\n                    <div>\r\n                        <strong class=\"text-green h5\">[CORRECTO]<\/strong>\r\n                        <div class=\"mt-2\">\r\n                            ${feedback}\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"mt-3 small text-cyan\">\r\n                            <strong>Nota conceptual:<\/strong> En la jerarqu\u00eda de residuos, Reducir > Reutilizar > Reciclar > Recuperar energ\u00eda > Disposici\u00f3n.\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n    } else {\r\n        btn.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n        result.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"alert-danger p-4 border border-danger\">\r\n                <div class=\"d-flex align-items-start\">\r\n                    <span class=\"text-danger me-3\">\u2717<\/span>\r\n                    <div>\r\n                        <strong class=\"text-danger h5\">[ERROR]<\/strong>\r\n                        <div class=\"mt-2\">\r\n                            ${feedback}\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"mt-3 small text-cyan\">\r\n                            <strong>Ayuda:<\/strong> Considera el consumo energ\u00e9tico y la p\u00e9rdida de calidad del material en cada ciclo.\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    result.style.display = \"block\";\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto visual\r\n    if(isCorrect) {\r\n        btn.style.animation = 'pulse-green 0.5s';\r\n    } else {\r\n        btn.style.animation = 'glitch 0.3s';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ INTERACTIVIDAD SVG ============\r\nfunction initSVGInteractivity() {\r\n    const cycles = document.querySelectorAll('.tech-cycle, .bio-cycle, .design-node');\r\n    \r\n    cycles.forEach(cycle => {\r\n        cycle.addEventListener('mouseenter', function() {\r\n            this.style.transform = 'scale(1.05)';\r\n            this.style.transition = 'transform 0.3s';\r\n            this.style.filter = 'brightness(1.2)';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        cycle.addEventListener('mouseleave', function() {\r\n            this.style.transform = 'scale(1)';\r\n            this.style.filter = 'brightness(1)';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        cycle.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const info = this.classList.contains('tech-cycle') ? \r\n                'Ciclo T\u00e9cnico: Materiales que deben mantenerse en circuito cerrado (metales, pl\u00e1sticos t\u00e9cnicos)' :\r\n                this.classList.contains('bio-cycle') ?\r\n                'Ciclo Biol\u00f3gico: Materiales que pueden regresar de forma segura a la biosfera' :\r\n                'Nodo de Dise\u00f1o: Punto cr\u00edtico donde se determinan los flujos metab\u00f3licos';\r\n            \r\n            alert(`[SISTEM_INFO]\\n\\n${info}`);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N ============\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    \/\/ Crear efecto Matrix\r\n    createMatrixDrops();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar simulador\r\n    updateSim();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar laboratorio\r\n    calcAdsorption();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar interactividad SVG\r\n    initSVGInteractivity();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto de carga terminal\r\n    const terminalPrompt = document.querySelector('.terminal-prompt .text-green');\r\n    if(terminalPrompt) {\r\n        const originalText = terminalPrompt.textContent;\r\n        terminalPrompt.textContent = '';\r\n        \r\n        let i = 0;\r\n        const typeWriter = () => {\r\n            if(i < originalText.length) {\r\n                terminalPrompt.textContent += originalText.charAt(i);\r\n                i++;\r\n                setTimeout(typeWriter, 50);\r\n            } else {\r\n                terminalPrompt.innerHTML += '<span class=\"blink\">_<\/span>';\r\n            }\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        setTimeout(typeWriter, 500);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar estilos din\u00e1micos\r\n    const style = document.createElement('style');\r\n    style.textContent = `\r\n        .cyber-dot {\r\n            width: 10px;\r\n            height: 10px;\r\n            border-radius: 50%;\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .impact-chart {\r\n            background: #000;\r\n            border: 2px solid #00d4ff;\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            border-radius: 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .temp-bar {\r\n            height: 20px;\r\n            background: #002;\r\n            position: relative;\r\n            overflow: hidden;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .temp-fill {\r\n            height: 100%;\r\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff4444, #ff9d00, #00ff9d, #ff9d00, #ff4444);\r\n            transition: width 0.5s ease-out;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .insight-card {\r\n            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\r\n            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .insight-card:hover {\r\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\r\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.2);\r\n        }\r\n    `;\r\n    document.head.appendChild(style);\r\n});\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Calcula el ahorro de agua anual de una persona que cambia su dieta de carne roja (15,000 L\/kg) a lentejas (1,200 L\/kg), asumiendo un consumo de 20kg al a\u00f1o.","respuesta":"Ahorro = 20kg * (15,000 - 1,200) = 276,000 litros de agua al a\u00f1o."},{"enunciado":"Explica la relaci\u00f3n entre el Carbono Activado y la Econom\u00eda Circular utilizando el ejemplo de la c\u00e1scara de coco.","respuesta":"Transforma un residuo agr\u00edcola (c\u00e1scara) en un producto de alto valor agregado (filtro) mediante pir\u00f3lisis, extendiendo el ciclo de vida del carbono biog\u00e9nico."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 diferencia hay entre \"Reciclar\" y \"Reutilizar\" en t\u00e9rminos de termodin\u00e1mica?","respuesta":"La reutilizaci\u00f3n mantiene la baja entrop\u00eda del objeto; el reciclaje requiere energ\u00eda para romper el material y volverlo a procesar, aumentando la entrop\u00eda del sistema."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el objetivo principal del ODS 12 seg\u00fan la Agenda 2030?","respuesta":"Garantizar modalidades de consumo y producci\u00f3n sostenibles, reduciendo a la mitad el desperdicio de alimentos y gestionando desechos qu\u00edmicos."},{"enunciado":"Define \"Obsolescencia Programada\" y por qu\u00e9 es enemiga de la sustentabilidad.","respuesta":"Es el dise\u00f1o de productos para que fallen tras corto tiempo, forzando un consumo lineal infinito incompatible con los recursos finitos del planeta."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo ayuda el compostaje a reducir las emisiones de Metano ($CH_4$)?","respuesta":"Al compostar de forma aer\u00f3bica, se evita la descomposici\u00f3n anaer\u00f3bica en vertederos, que es la principal fuente de metano de origen residual."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el dise\u00f1o \"Cradle to Cradle\" (Cuna a la Cuna)?","respuesta":"Un enfoque donde los productos se dise\u00f1an para que al final de su vida sean nutrientes biol\u00f3gicos o t\u00e9cnicos, eliminando el concepto de \"basura\"."},{"enunciado":"Calcula la reducci\u00f3n de CO2 si se recicla 1 tonelada de aluminio (ahorro del 95% de energ\u00eda comparado con bauxita).","respuesta":"Si producir Al virgen emite 12t CO2, reciclar ahorra 11.4t CO2 por tonelada."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 papel juega el Carbono Activado en la purificaci\u00f3n del aire urbano?","respuesta":"Adsorbe Compuestos Org\u00e1nicos Vol\u00e1tiles (COV) y gases t\u00f3xicos gracias a su enorme porosidad y fuerzas de Van der Waals."},{"enunciado":"Explica el concepto de \"Huella H\u00eddrica\" y menciona sus tres componentes.","respuesta":"Es el volumen total de agua dulce usada; se divide en Azul (superficial\/subterr\u00e1nea), Verde (lluvia en productos) y Gris (agua para diluir contaminantes)."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 la \"Reducci\u00f3n\" est\u00e1 en la cima de la pir\u00e1mide de las 3R?","respuesta":"Porque el recurso que mejor se conserva es el que nunca llega a extraerse o fabricarse, eliminando el impacto desde el origen."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo influye el consumo responsable en la biodiversidad de los ecosistemas?","respuesta":"Al reducir la demanda de materias primas, se disminuye la presi\u00f3n sobre el cambio de uso de suelo (deforestaci\u00f3n) y la sobreexplotaci\u00f3n de especies."}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 porcentaje de la energ\u00eda se ahorra al reciclar aluminio en comparaci\u00f3n con producirlo desde la bauxita?","opciones":["10%","50%","95%","30%"],"correcta":"95%"},{"pregunta":"El ODS 12 se titula:","opciones":["Vida de ecosistemas terrestres","Consumo y producci\u00f3n responsables","Hambre cero","Acci\u00f3n por el clima"],"correcta":"Consumo y producci\u00f3n responsables"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 proceso f\u00edsico-qu\u00edmico utiliza el Carbono Activado para limpiar agua?","opciones":["Absorci\u00f3n","Adsorci\u00f3n","Magnetismo","Destilaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Adsorci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l de estos NO es un ciclo de la Econom\u00eda Circular?","opciones":["Ciclo Biol\u00f3gico","Ciclo T\u00e9cnico","Ciclo Lineal","Mantenimiento"],"correcta":"Ciclo Lineal"},{"pregunta":"El compostaje es un proceso de tipo:","opciones":["Anaer\u00f3bico","Aer\u00f3bico","Industrial qu\u00edmico","Nuclear"],"correcta":"Aer\u00f3bico"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 gas de efecto invernadero se reduce principalmente al evitar los vertederos org\u00e1nicos?","opciones":["Ox\u00edgeno","Metano","Nitr\u00f3geno","Arg\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Metano"},{"pregunta":"El concepto \"Zero Waste\" (Residuo Cero) aspira a:","opciones":["Quemar toda la basura","Desviar al menos el 90% de los residuos del vertedero","Enterrar la basura lejos","Reciclar solo pl\u00e1stico"],"correcta":"Desviar al menos el 90% de los residuos del vertedero"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"Downcycling\"?","opciones":["Reciclar un material en algo de igual calidad","Reciclar un material en algo de menor calidad","Tirar basura al suelo","Hacer arte con basura"],"correcta":"Reciclar un material en algo de menor calidad"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el \u00e1rea superficial t\u00edpica de un gramo de carbono activado de alta calidad?","opciones":["1 m2","10 m2","500 a 1500 m2","1,000,000 m2"],"correcta":"500 a 1500 m2"},{"pregunta":"La econom\u00eda circular se inspira en:","opciones":["Las f\u00e1bricas antiguas","Los ciclos de la naturaleza","El mercado de valores","La obsolescencia"],"correcta":"Los ciclos de la naturaleza"},{"pregunta":"Reducir el desperdicio de alimentos a la mitad para 2030 es una meta de:","opciones":["ODS 1","ODS 5","ODS 12","ODS 17"],"correcta":"ODS 12"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 material es infinitamente reciclable sin perder calidad?","opciones":["Pl\u00e1stico","Papel","Vidrio y Aluminio","Madera"],"correcta":"Vidrio y Aluminio"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 significa \"Cradle to Grave\" (Cuna a la Tumba)?","opciones":["Modelo de econom\u00eda circular","Modelo lineal (extraer, usar, tirar)","Proceso de compostaje","Manejo de cementerios"],"correcta":"Modelo lineal (extraer, usar, tirar)"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la huella h\u00eddrica promedio de una hamburguesa de ternera?","opciones":["10 litros","100 litros","Aprox. 2,400 litros","20,000 litros"],"correcta":"Aprox. 2,400 litros"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es un \"nutriente t\u00e9cnico\"?","opciones":["Abono qu\u00edmico","Material sint\u00e9tico dise\u00f1ado para ser reutilizado sin fin","Comida para robots","Minerales del suelo"],"correcta":"Material sint\u00e9tico dise\u00f1ado para ser reutilizado sin fin"},{"pregunta":"El uso de bolsas de tela en lugar de pl\u00e1stico es un h\u00e1bito de:","opciones":["Reciclaje","Reutilizaci\u00f3n \/ Reducci\u00f3n","Compostaje","Extracci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Reutilizaci\u00f3n \/ Reducci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 temperatura se requiere aproximadamente para la pir\u00f3lisis de biomasa?","opciones":["50\u00b0C","100\u00b0C","400-800\u00b0C","2000\u00b0C"],"correcta":"400-800\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"La gesti\u00f3n de \"Residuos S\u00f3lidos Urbanos\" es competencia de:","opciones":["Solo empresas","Gobiernos locales y ciudadanos","Solo la ONU","Nadie"],"correcta":"Gobiernos locales y ciudadanos"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la obsolescencia percibida?","opciones":["Cuando algo se rompe","Cuando la moda nos hace creer que algo es viejo aunque funcione","Cuando un software no carga","Cuando se acaba la bater\u00eda"],"correcta":"Cuando la moda nos hace creer que algo es viejo aunque funcione"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el beneficio de los filtros de carbono activado en el hogar?","opciones":["Enfriar el agua","Eliminar cloro y qu\u00edmicos org\u00e1nicos por adsorci\u00f3n","A\u00f1adir vitaminas","Ablandar el agua con calcio"],"correcta":"Eliminar cloro y qu\u00edmicos org\u00e1nicos por adsorci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 h\u00e1bito tiene mayor impacto en la reducci\u00f3n de huella de carbono personal?","opciones":["Apagar una luz 5 min","Reducir el consumo de carne roja y viajes en avi\u00f3n","Reciclar una hoja de papel","Usar cepillo de madera"],"correcta":"Reducir el consumo de carne roja y viajes en avi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"La econom\u00eda circular busca desacoplar:","opciones":["El sol de la tierra","El crecimiento econ\u00f3mico del uso de recursos finitos","La pol\u00edtica de la ciencia","El reciclaje de la basura"],"correcta":"El crecimiento econ\u00f3mico del uso de recursos finitos"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 porcentaje de pl\u00e1sticos se reciclan efectivamente a nivel mundial?","opciones":["90%","Menos del 10%","50%","75%"],"correcta":"Menos del 10%"},{"pregunta":"El compost maduro se utiliza como:","opciones":["Combustible","Enmienda org\u00e1nica para suelos (abono)","Material de construcci\u00f3n","Pl\u00e1stico biol\u00f3gico"],"correcta":"Enmienda org\u00e1nica para suelos (abono)"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la \"Responsabilidad Extendida del Productor\"?","opciones":["Pagar m\u00e1s impuestos","Que la empresa se encargue del producto al final de su vida \u00fatil","Que el cliente limpie la f\u00e1brica","Producir m\u00e1s r\u00e1pido"],"correcta":"Que la empresa se encargue del producto al final de su vida \u00fatil"},{"pregunta":"El \"Greenwashing\" es:","opciones":["Lavar ropa con jab\u00f3n verde","Marketing enga\u00f1oso para parecer sustentable","Plantar muchos \u00e1rboles","Reciclar dinero"],"correcta":"Marketing enga\u00f1oso para parecer sustentable"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la R m\u00e1s importante?","opciones":["Reciclar","Reutilizar","Reducir","Reparar"],"correcta":"Reducir"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 mineral se extrae principalmente para fabricar bater\u00edas de litio?","opciones":["Oro","Litio y Cobalto","Hierro","Cuarzo"],"correcta":"Litio y Cobalto"},{"pregunta":"Un ecosistema sustentable es aquel que:","opciones":["Se agota en 10 a\u00f1os","Mantiene su biodiversidad y funciones a largo plazo","No tiene animales","Es solo de concreto"],"correcta":"Mantiene su biodiversidad y funciones a largo plazo"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 promueve el estilo de vida \"Minimalista\" en sustentabilidad?","opciones":["Comprar solo cosas peque\u00f1as","Poseer solo lo necesario para reducir el consumo","Pintar todo de blanco","Vivir sin electricidad"],"correcta":"Poseer solo lo necesario para reducir el consumo"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"comunidad-sustentable-master","titulo":"Urbanismo Sist\u00e9mico: La Ingenier\u00eda de Comunidades Sustentables","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-urbanismo\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ CITY GRID EFFECT ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"city-grid\" id=\"cityGrid\"><\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ TERMINAL HEADER ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"terminal-header\">\r\n    <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\">\r\n        <div class=\"terminal-prompt\">\r\n            <span class=\"text-cyan\">CITY_SYSTEM><\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"text-green ms-2\">URBAN_METABOLISM<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"text-gold blink ms-2\">[ANALYSIS_MODE]<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"terminal-status\">\r\n            <span class=\"badge border border-cyan text-cyan\">ODS_11<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge border border-green text-green ms-2\">RESILIENCE_ENG<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge border border-gold text-gold ms-2\">SYSTEMIC_DESIGN<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ HEADER PRINCIPAL ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"main-header\">\r\n    <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-lg-8\">\r\n            <h1>ODS 11: METABOLISMO URBANO<\/h1>\r\n            <p class=\"lead\">\r\n                Una comunidad sustentable no es solo un espacio geogr\u00e1fico, es un \r\n                <strong>ORGANISMO TERMODIN\u00c1MICO<\/strong> que procesa materia, energ\u00eda e informaci\u00f3n \r\n                con eficiencia regenerativa.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n                <button class=\"btn-action me-3\" onclick=\"showSystemInfo()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"me-2\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span> VER SISTEMA\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-action\" onclick=\"runDiagnostic()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"me-2\">\u26a1<\/span> DIAGN\u00d3STICO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4 mt-4 mt-lg-0\">\r\n            <div class=\"status-monitor\">\r\n                <span class=\"ui-label\">SYSTEM STATUS MONITOR<\/span>\r\n                <div>> Resiliencia: <span id=\"resilienceScore\" class=\"text-green\">65<\/span>%<\/div>\r\n                <div>> Huella H\u00eddrica: <span id=\"waterFootprint\" class=\"text-cyan\">NORMAL<\/span><\/div>\r\n                <div>> Cobertura Verde: <span id=\"greenCoverage\" class=\"text-green\">30<\/span>%<\/div>\r\n                <div>> Densidad de Servicios: <span id=\"serviceDensity\" class=\"text-gold\">45<\/span>%<\/div>\r\n                <div>> Autonom\u00eda Energ\u00e9tica: <span id=\"energyAutonomy\" class=\"text-cyan\">20<\/span>%<\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"status-indicator mt-4\">\r\n                    <div class=\"progress\" style=\"height: 10px; background: #002;\">\r\n                        <div class=\"progress-bar bg-green\" id=\"systemHealth\" style=\"width: 65%;\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between mt-1\">\r\n                        <span class=\"small text-danger\">CR\u00cdTICO<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"small text-warning\">MODERADO<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"small text-success\">\u00d3PTIMO<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ DIAGRAMA METAB\u00d3LICO ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"text-center mb-4\">\r\n        <span class=\"badge border border-green\">METABOLIC_FLOW_DIAGRAM<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"text-muted ms-2\">v4.1 - Sistema Urbano Complejo<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 900 500\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\">\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <!-- Gradientes cibern\u00e9ticos -->\r\n            <linearGradient id=\"gradCity\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\">\r\n                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#001a33\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#004466\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#00f2ff\"\/>\r\n            <\/linearGradient>\r\n            \r\n            <linearGradient id=\"gradEnergy\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\">\r\n                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#332200\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#665500\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#ffcc00\"\/>\r\n            <\/linearGradient>\r\n            \r\n            <linearGradient id=\"gradBio\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\">\r\n                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#003300\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#006600\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#39ff14\"\/>\r\n            <\/linearGradient>\r\n            \r\n            <filter id=\"glow-cyan\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"3\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n            \r\n            <filter id=\"glow-green\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"2.5\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Fondo de ciudad -->\r\n        <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00f2ff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,5\"\/>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- N\u00facleo Urbano -->\r\n        <g class=\"urban-core\" filter=\"url(#glow-cyan)\">\r\n            <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"250\" r=\"80\" fill=\"url(#gradCity)\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n            <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"250\" r=\"75\" fill=\"#001a33\" opacity=\"0.9\"\/>\r\n            \r\n            <text x=\"450\" y=\"240\" fill=\"#00f2ff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                BI\u00d3SFERA URBANA\r\n            <\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"450\" y=\"265\" fill=\"#8af\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Courier New'\" font-size=\"14\">\r\n                N\u00facleo Sist\u00e9mico\r\n            <\/text>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Edificios dentro del n\u00facleo -->\r\n            <rect x=\"430\" y=\"200\" width=\"15\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#00f2ff\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n            <rect x=\"450\" y=\"190\" width=\"20\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#39ff14\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n            <rect x=\"475\" y=\"205\" width=\"12\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#ffcc00\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n            \r\n            <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"250\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#ffcc00\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"10;15;10\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"fill\" values=\"#ffcc00;#39ff14;#00f2ff;#ffcc00\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/circle>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Flujo de Recursos Regenerativos -->\r\n        <g class=\"flow-regenerative\">\r\n            <path d=\"M450 170 Q650 100 750 150 Q850 200 750 300 Q650 350 450 330\" \r\n                  fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#gradBio)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,6\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"0;30;0\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/path>\r\n            \r\n            <g transform=\"translate(750, 150)\">\r\n                <rect x=\"-25\" y=\"-15\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#003300\" stroke=\"#39ff14\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                <text fill=\"#39ff14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                    RECURSOS\r\n                <\/text>\r\n                <text y=\"20\" fill=\"#8af\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Courier New'\" font-size=\"10\">\r\n                    REGENERATIVOS\r\n                <\/text>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Flechas de flujo -->\r\n            <path d=\"M650 100 L670 110 L650 120 Z\" fill=\"#39ff14\"\/>\r\n            <path d=\"M650 350 L670 340 L650 330 Z\" fill=\"#39ff14\"\/>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Flujo de Econom\u00eda Circular -->\r\n        <g class=\"flow-circular\">\r\n            <path d=\"M450 170 Q250 100 150 150 Q50 200 150 300 Q250 350 450 330\" \r\n                  fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#gradEnergy)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,6\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"0;30;0\" dur=\"5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/path>\r\n            \r\n            <g transform=\"translate(150, 150)\">\r\n                <rect x=\"-30\" y=\"-15\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#332200\" stroke=\"#ffcc00\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                <text fill=\"#ffcc00\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                    ECONOM\u00cdA\r\n                <\/text>\r\n                <text y=\"20\" fill=\"#8af\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Courier New'\" font-size=\"10\">\r\n                    CIRCULAR\r\n                <\/text>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Flechas de flujo -->\r\n            <path d=\"M250 100 L230 110 L250 120 Z\" fill=\"#ffcc00\"\/>\r\n            <path d=\"M250 350 L230 340 L250 330 Z\" fill=\"#ffcc00\"\/>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Puntos de interconexi\u00f3n -->\r\n        <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"170\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#00f2ff\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"8;12;8\" dur=\"1.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/circle>\r\n        \r\n        <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"330\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#00f2ff\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"8;12;8\" dur=\"1.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/circle>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Conexiones al n\u00facleo -->\r\n        <path d=\"M450 170 L450 180\" stroke=\"#00f2ff\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n        <path d=\"M450 330 L450 320\" stroke=\"#00f2ff\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- T\u00edtulo del sistema -->\r\n        <text x=\"450\" y=\"40\" fill=\"#00f2ff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n            METABOLISMO URBANO CIRCULAR\r\n        <\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"450\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#39ff14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Courier New'\" font-size=\"14\">\r\n            Sistema de flujos de materia, energ\u00eda e informaci\u00f3n\r\n        <\/text>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Nodos de entrada\/salida -->\r\n        <g class=\"input-node\" onclick=\"showNodeInfo('input')\">\r\n            <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"250\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#003300\" stroke=\"#39ff14\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n            <text x=\"150\" y=\"255\" fill=\"#39ff14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"16\">IN<\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n        \r\n        <g class=\"output-node\" onclick=\"showNodeInfo('output')\">\r\n            <circle cx=\"750\" cy=\"250\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#332200\" stroke=\"#ffcc00\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n            <text x=\"750\" y=\"255\" fill=\"#ffcc00\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"16\">OUT<\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"mt-4 text-center\">\r\n        <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-center flex-wrap gap-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                <div class=\"cyber-dot bg-cyan me-2\"><\/div>\r\n                <span class=\"small text-cyan\">N\u00facleo Urbano (Sistema Central)<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                <div class=\"cyber-dot bg-green me-2\"><\/div>\r\n                <span class=\"small text-green\">Flujo Regenerativo (Bio-Recursos)<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                <div class=\"cyber-dot bg-gold me-2\"><\/div>\r\n                <span class=\"small text-gold\">Flujo Circular (Econom\u00eda)<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ SIMULADOR DE PLANEACI\u00d3N ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"sim-card\">\r\n    <h4>\ud83c\udfae SIMULADOR DE PLANEACI\u00d3N ODS 11<\/h4>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"terminal-instructions mb-4 p-4 border border-gold\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-gold\">INSTRUCCIONES:<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"text-light ms-2\">\r\n            Ajusta las variables de infraestructura para observar c\u00f3mo cambia la resiliencia de la comunidad \r\n            ante eventos de crisis clim\u00e1tica. Basado en el modelo del Panel Intergubernamental de Ciudades (IPCC 2025).\r\n        <\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"row g-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\r\n            <!-- Panel de control de variables -->\r\n            <div class=\"slider-urban\">\r\n                <label class=\"ui-label\">MOVILIDAD EL\u00c9CTICA (%)<\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between mb-2\">\r\n                    <span class=\"text-danger\">0% (F\u00d3SIL)<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"text-gold\" id=\"transportValue\">30%<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"text-success\">100% (EL\u00c9CTRICO)<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range\" id=\"simTransport\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"30\" oninput=\"runSim()\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-info mt-3\">\r\n                    <span class=\"small text-muted\">Impacto estimado en AQI: <\/span>\r\n                    <span id=\"transportImpact\" class=\"small text-warning\">-25%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"slider-urban mt-4\">\r\n                <label class=\"ui-label\">ENERG\u00cdA DISTRIBUIDA (%)<\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between mb-2\">\r\n                    <span class=\"text-danger\">0% (CENTRAL)<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"text-gold\" id=\"energyValue\">20%<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"text-success\">100% (DISTRIBUIDA)<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range\" id=\"simEnergy\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\" oninput=\"runSim()\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-info mt-3\">\r\n                    <span class=\"small text-muted\">Autonom\u00eda energ\u00e9tica: <\/span>\r\n                    <span id=\"energyImpact\" class=\"small text-warning\">+18%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"slider-urban mt-4\">\r\n                <label class=\"ui-label\">INFRAESTRUCTURA VERDE (%)<\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between mb-2\">\r\n                    <span class=\"text-danger\">0% (MINIMAL)<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"text-gold\" id=\"greenValue\">45%<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"text-success\">100% (\u00d3PTIMA)<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range\" id=\"simGreen\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"45\" oninput=\"runSim()\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-info mt-3\">\r\n                    <span class=\"small text-muted\">Reducci\u00f3n isla de calor: <\/span>\r\n                    <span id=\"greenImpact\" class=\"small text-warning\">-2.5\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"col-lg-8\">\r\n            <!-- Dashboard de m\u00e9tricas -->\r\n            <div class=\"row g-4\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-container\">\r\n                        <label class=\"ui-label\">CALIDAD DEL AIRE (AQI)<\/label>\r\n                        <span class=\"data-value\" id=\"valAQI\">85<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"data-status mt-2\">\r\n                            <span id=\"aqiStatus\" class=\"small text-warning\">\u25cf MODERADO<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"data-range mt-1\">\r\n                            <div class=\"progress\" style=\"height: 8px; background: #002;\">\r\n                                <div class=\"progress-bar\" id=\"aqiBar\" style=\"width: 85%; background: #ffcc00;\"><\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between mt-1\">\r\n                                <span class=\"small text-success\">0<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"small text-danger\">300<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-container\">\r\n                        <label class=\"ui-label\">INDEPENDENCIA ENERG\u00c9TICA<\/label>\r\n                        <span class=\"data-value text-green\" id=\"valIndep\">20%<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"data-status mt-2\">\r\n                            <span id=\"indepStatus\" class=\"small text-warning\">\u25cf BAJA<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"data-range mt-1\">\r\n                            <div class=\"progress\" style=\"height: 8px; background: #002;\">\r\n                                <div class=\"progress-bar bg-green\" id=\"indepBar\" style=\"width: 20%;\"><\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between mt-1\">\r\n                                <span class=\"small text-danger\">0%<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"small text-success\">100%<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-container\">\r\n                        <label class=\"ui-label\">RESILIENCIA CLIM\u00c1TICA<\/label>\r\n                        <span class=\"data-value text-cyan\" id=\"valResilience\">58%<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"data-status mt-2\">\r\n                            <span id=\"resilienceStatus\" class=\"small text-warning\">\u25cf MEDIA<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"data-range mt-1\">\r\n                            <div class=\"progress\" style=\"height: 8px; background: #002;\">\r\n                                <div class=\"progress-bar bg-cyan\" id=\"resilienceBar\" style=\"width: 58%;\"><\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between mt-1\">\r\n                                <span class=\"small text-danger\">VULNERABLE<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"small text-success\">RESILIENTE<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-container\">\r\n                        <label class=\"ui-label\">COSTO SIST\u00c9MICO (USD\/ha)<\/label>\r\n                        <span class=\"data-value text-gold\" id=\"valCost\">$2,400<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"data-status mt-2\">\r\n                            <span id=\"costStatus\" class=\"small text-warning\">\u25cf ALTO<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"data-range mt-1\">\r\n                            <div class=\"progress\" style=\"height: 8px; background: #002;\">\r\n                                <div class=\"progress-bar bg-gold\" id=\"costBar\" style=\"width: 70%;\"><\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between mt-1\">\r\n                                <span class=\"small text-success\">$0<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"small text-danger\">$10,000<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"col-12\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-container\">\r\n                        <label class=\"ui-label\">AN\u00c1LISIS SIST\u00c9MICO<\/label>\r\n                        <div id=\"simLog\" class=\"text-center py-3\">\r\n                            <span class=\"text-gold\">\u25cf INICIANDO AN\u00c1LISIS PROSPECTIVO 2025...<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"sim-actions text-center mt-3\">\r\n                            <button class=\"btn-action me-2\" onclick=\"optimizeSystem()\">\r\n                                <span class=\"me-2\">\u2699\ufe0f<\/span> OPTIMIZAR\r\n                            <\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"btn-action\" onclick=\"resetSim()\">\r\n                                <span class=\"me-2\">\u21bb<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                            <\/button>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Gr\u00e1fico de tendencias -->\r\n            <div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n                <label class=\"ui-label\">TENDENCIAS DE IMPACTO<\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"trend-chart\">\r\n                    <canvas id=\"trendChart\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\"><\/canvas>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ EVALUACI\u00d3N MASTER ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"quiz-master\">\r\n    <h5>EVALUACI\u00d3N DE CRITERIOS MASTER<\/h5>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-scenario mb-4 p-4 border border-green\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-green\">PREGUNTA CR\u00cdTICA:<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"text-light ms-2\">\r\n            \u00bfCu\u00e1l es la diferencia fundamental entre una \"Smart City\" y una \"Sustainable Community\" \r\n            seg\u00fan el marco te\u00f3rico del ODS 11?\r\n        <\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n        <button class=\"quiz-btn\" onclick=\"checkMaster(0, this)\">\r\n            <span class=\"quiz-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"quiz-text\">\r\n                La Smart City se enfoca solo en tecnolog\u00eda, mientras que la Sustentable prioriza la eficiencia energ\u00e9tica.\r\n            <\/span>\r\n        <\/button>\r\n        \r\n        <button class=\"quiz-btn\" onclick=\"checkMaster(1, this)\">\r\n            <span class=\"quiz-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"quiz-text\">\r\n                La Comunidad Sustentable integra los pilares social y econ\u00f3mico para garantizar que el sistema \r\n                perdure sin soporte externo continuo, mientras que la Smart City puede ser tecnol\u00f3gicamente \r\n                avanzada pero socialmente excluyente.\r\n            <\/span>\r\n        <\/button>\r\n        \r\n        <button class=\"quiz-btn\" onclick=\"checkMaster(2, this)\">\r\n            <span class=\"quiz-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"quiz-text\">\r\n                No hay diferencia, ambos t\u00e9rminos son sin\u00f3nimos en el marco del ODS 11 y las agendas urbanas contempor\u00e1neas.\r\n            <\/span>\r\n        <\/button>\r\n        \r\n        <button class=\"quiz-btn\" onclick=\"checkMaster(3, this)\">\r\n            <span class=\"quiz-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"quiz-text\">\r\n                La diferencia es presupuestaria: las Smart Cities requieren mayor inversi\u00f3n en hardware, \r\n                mientras que las comunidades sustentables priorizan software social.\r\n            <\/span>\r\n        <\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div id=\"masterFeedback\" class=\"mt-4\" style=\"display:none;\">\r\n        <!-- Se llena con JavaScript -->\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-explanation mt-4 p-4 border border-cyan\" style=\"display: none;\" id=\"quizExplanation\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-cyan\">EXPLICACI\u00d3N SIST\u00c9MICA:<\/span>\r\n        <div class=\"mt-2\">\r\n            <p class=\"text-light mb-2\">\r\n                La distinci\u00f3n cr\u00edtica reside en el <strong>enfoque sist\u00e9mico<\/strong>:\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <ul class=\"text-light\">\r\n                <li><strong>Smart City:<\/strong> Enfatiza eficiencia tecnol\u00f3gica (sensores, IoT, big data)<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Sustainable Community:<\/strong> Equilibra tecnolog\u00eda con <strong>equidad social<\/strong>, \r\n                    <strong>resiliencia econ\u00f3mica<\/strong> y <strong>regeneraci\u00f3n ambiental<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li>Una comunidad puede ser \"smart\" sin ser sustentable (ej: segregaci\u00f3n tecnol\u00f3gica)<\/li>\r\n                <li>La sustentabilidad requiere <strong>integraci\u00f3n sist\u00e9mica<\/strong> de los 3 pilares<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ CONCLUSI\u00d3N EVOLUTIVA ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"conclusion-evolutiva\">\r\n    <h3>CONCLUSI\u00d3N EVOLUTIVA<\/h3>\r\n    \r\n    <p>\r\n        Las comunidades sustentables representan la transici\u00f3n de la humanidad hacia una \r\n        <strong>ESPECIE SIMBI\u00d3TICA<\/strong> con la bi\u00f3sfera. Al optimizar los flujos metab\u00f3licos urbanos, \r\n        reducimos la entrop\u00eda del sistema y aseguramos la habitabilidad del planeta para las generaciones futuras.\r\n    <\/p>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"evolution-steps mt-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"row\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-3 mb-4\">\r\n                <div class=\"evolution-card p-4 border border-cyan text-center h-100\">\r\n                    <div class=\"evolution-icon mb-3\">\r\n                        <span class=\"h2 text-cyan\">\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <h5 class=\"text-cyan\">URBANISMO 1.0<\/h5>\r\n                    <p class=\"small text-muted mb-0\">\r\n                        Ciudades como consumidoras lineales de recursos\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"col-md-3 mb-4\">\r\n                <div class=\"evolution-card p-4 border border-green text-center h-100\">\r\n                    <div class=\"evolution-icon mb-3\">\r\n                        <span class=\"h2 text-green\">\u267b\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <h5 class=\"text-green\">URBANISMO 2.0<\/h5>\r\n                    <p class=\"small text-muted mb-0\">\r\n                        Econom\u00eda circular y eficiencia de recursos\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"col-md-3 mb-4\">\r\n                <div class=\"evolution-card p-4 border border-gold text-center h-100\">\r\n                    <div class=\"evolution-icon mb-3\">\r\n                        <span class=\"h2 text-gold\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <h5 class=\"text-gold\">URBANISMO 3.0<\/h5>\r\n                    <p class=\"small text-muted mb-0\">\r\n                        Ciudades inteligentes con tecnolog\u00eda integrada\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"col-md-3 mb-4\">\r\n                <div class=\"evolution-card p-4 border border-cyan text-center h-100\">\r\n                    <div class=\"evolution-icon mb-3\">\r\n                        <span class=\"h2 text-cyan\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <h5 class=\"text-cyan\">URBANISMO 4.0<\/h5>\r\n                    <p class=\"small text-muted mb-0\">\r\n                        Comunidades regenerativas simbi\u00f3ticas\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"conclusion-footer mt-4 p-4 border border-green\">\r\n        <div class=\"text-center\">\r\n            <span class=\"text-green\">[SYSTEM_ANALYSIS_COMPLETE]<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"text-light ms-2\">--- TRANSITION TO REGENERATIVE URBANISM REQUIRED ---<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ JAVASCRIPT CYBERPUNK ============ -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ============ CITY GRID EFFECT ============\r\nfunction createCityGrid() {\r\n    const grid = document.getElementById('cityGrid');\r\n    const width = window.innerWidth;\r\n    const height = window.innerHeight;\r\n    const spacing = 100;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ L\u00edneas horizontales\r\n    for(let y = 0; y < height; y += spacing) {\r\n        const line = document.createElement('div');\r\n        line.className = 'grid-line grid-horizontal';\r\n        line.style.top = y + 'px';\r\n        line.style.opacity = 0.2 + (Math.random() * 0.3);\r\n        grid.appendChild(line);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ L\u00edneas verticales\r\n    for(let x = 0; x < width; x += spacing) {\r\n        const line = document.createElement('div');\r\n        line.className = 'grid-line grid-vertical';\r\n        line.style.left = x + 'px';\r\n        line.style.opacity = 0.2 + (Math.random() * 0.3);\r\n        grid.appendChild(line);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ SIMULADOR DE PLANEACI\u00d3N ============\r\nlet trendChart = null;\r\n\r\nfunction runSim() {\r\n    \/\/ Obtener valores de los sliders\r\n    const transport = parseInt(document.getElementById('simTransport').value);\r\n    const energy = parseInt(document.getElementById('simEnergy').value);\r\n    const green = parseInt(document.getElementById('simGreen').value);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar valores mostrados\r\n    document.getElementById('transportValue').textContent = transport + '%';\r\n    document.getElementById('energyValue').textContent = energy + '%';\r\n    document.getElementById('greenValue').textContent = green + '%';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular m\u00e9tricas (modelo simplificado)\r\n    const aqi = Math.max(15, 120 - (transport * 0.8) - (green * 0.3)).toFixed(0);\r\n    const independence = Math.min(100, (energy * 0.9) + (green * 0.1)).toFixed(0);\r\n    const resilience = ((transport * 0.3) + (energy * 0.4) + (green * 0.3)).toFixed(0);\r\n    const cost = (2000 + (transport * 20) + (energy * 30) + (green * 15)).toFixed(0);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar valores principales\r\n    document.getElementById('valAQI').textContent = aqi;\r\n    document.getElementById('valIndep').textContent = independence + '%';\r\n    document.getElementById('valResilience').textContent = resilience + '%';\r\n    document.getElementById('valCost').textContent = '$' + cost;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar barras de progreso\r\n    document.getElementById('aqiBar').style.width = (aqi \/ 3) + '%';\r\n    document.getElementById('indepBar').style.width = independence + '%';\r\n    document.getElementById('resilienceBar').style.width = resilience + '%';\r\n    document.getElementById('costBar').style.width = (cost \/ 100) + '%';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar estado del sistema\r\n    updateSystemStatus(aqi, independence, resilience, cost);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar impactos calculados\r\n    document.getElementById('transportImpact').textContent = '-' + (transport * 0.25) + '% AQI';\r\n    document.getElementById('energyImpact').textContent = '+' + (energy * 0.9) + '%';\r\n    document.getElementById('greenImpact').textContent = '-' + (green * 0.05) + '\u00b0C';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar gr\u00e1fico de tendencias\r\n    updateTrendChart(transport, energy, green, aqi, independence, resilience);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar log del sistema\r\n    updateSystemLog(aqi, independence, resilience);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction updateSystemStatus(aqi, independence, resilience, cost) {\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar estado de AQI\r\n    const aqiStatus = document.getElementById('aqiStatus');\r\n    const aqiBar = document.getElementById('aqiBar');\r\n    function isDark() { return document.documentElement.classList.contains('dark') || document.body.classList.contains('dark'); }\r\n    if(aqi < 50) {\r\n        aqiStatus.textContent = '\u25cf EXCELENTE';\r\n        aqiStatus.className = 'small text-success';\r\n        if(!isDark()) { aqiBar.style.background = '#39ff14'; } else { aqiBar.style.background = ''; }\r\n    } else if(aqi < 100) {\r\n        aqiStatus.textContent = '\u25cf MODERADO';\r\n        aqiStatus.className = 'small text-warning';\r\n        if(!isDark()) { aqiBar.style.background = '#ffcc00'; } else { aqiBar.style.background = ''; }\r\n    } else {\r\n        aqiStatus.textContent = '\u25cf PELIGROSO';\r\n        aqiStatus.className = 'small text-danger';\r\n        if(!isDark()) { aqiBar.style.background = '#ff4444'; } else { aqiBar.style.background = ''; }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar estado de independencia\r\n    const indepStatus = document.getElementById('indepStatus');\r\n    if(independence < 30) {\r\n        indepStatus.textContent = '\u25cf BAJA';\r\n        indepStatus.className = 'small text-danger';\r\n    } else if(independence < 70) {\r\n        indepStatus.textContent = '\u25cf MEDIA';\r\n        indepStatus.className = 'small text-warning';\r\n    } else {\r\n        indepStatus.textContent = '\u25cf ALTA';\r\n        indepStatus.className = 'small text-success';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar estado de resiliencia\r\n    const resilienceStatus = document.getElementById('resilienceStatus');\r\n    if(resilience < 40) {\r\n        resilienceStatus.textContent = '\u25cf BAJA';\r\n        resilienceStatus.className = 'small text-danger';\r\n    } else if(resilience < 80) {\r\n        resilienceStatus.textContent = '\u25cf MEDIA';\r\n        resilienceStatus.className = 'small text-warning';\r\n    } else {\r\n        resilienceStatus.textContent = '\u25cf ALTA';\r\n        resilienceStatus.className = 'small text-success';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar estado de costo\r\n    const costStatus = document.getElementById('costStatus');\r\n    if(cost < 1500) {\r\n        costStatus.textContent = '\u25cf BAJO';\r\n        costStatus.className = 'small text-success';\r\n    } else if(cost < 3000) {\r\n        costStatus.textContent = '\u25cf MODERADO';\r\n        costStatus.className = 'small text-warning';\r\n    } else {\r\n        costStatus.textContent = '\u25cf ALTO';\r\n        costStatus.className = 'small text-danger';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar salud general del sistema\r\n    const systemHealth = document.getElementById('systemHealth');\r\n    const avgHealth = (100 - (aqi \/ 3) + parseInt(independence) + parseInt(resilience) - (cost \/ 100)) \/ 3;\r\n    systemHealth.style.width = Math.max(0, Math.min(avgHealth, 100)) + '%';\r\n    \r\n    if(avgHealth < 40) {\r\n        systemHealth.className = 'progress-bar bg-danger';\r\n    } else if(avgHealth < 70) {\r\n        systemHealth.className = 'progress-bar bg-warning';\r\n    } else {\r\n        systemHealth.className = 'progress-bar bg-success';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction updateSystemLog(aqi, independence, resilience) {\r\n    const log = document.getElementById('simLog');\r\n    const avg = (parseInt(aqi) + parseInt(independence) + parseInt(resilience)) \/ 3;\r\n    \r\n    let message = '';\r\n    let color = '';\r\n    \r\n    if(avg < 40) {\r\n        message = '\u25cf SISTEMA CR\u00cdTICO - INTERVENCI\u00d3N URGENTE REQUERIDA';\r\n        color = '#ff4444';\r\n    } else if(avg < 70) {\r\n        message = '\u25cf SISTEMA EN TRANSICI\u00d3N - OPTIMIZACI\u00d3N RECOMENDADA';\r\n        color = '#ffcc00';\r\n    } else {\r\n        message = '\u25cf SISTEMA \u00d3PTIMO - OPERACI\u00d3N SOSTENIBLE CONFIRMADA';\r\n        color = '#39ff14';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    log.innerHTML = `<span style=\"color:${color}\">${message}<\/span>`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto de parpadeo para sistemas cr\u00edticos\r\n    if(avg < 40) {\r\n        log.classList.add('blink');\r\n    } else {\r\n        log.classList.remove('blink');\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction updateTrendChart(transport, energy, green, aqi, independence, resilience) {\r\n    const canvas = document.getElementById('trendChart');\r\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Limpiar canvas\r\n    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Datos para el gr\u00e1fico\r\n    const datasets = [\r\n        {\r\n            label: 'Transporte',\r\n            values: [transport, transport * 0.9, transport * 0.8, transport * 0.7],\r\n            color: '#ffcc00'\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            label: 'Energ\u00eda',\r\n            values: [energy, energy * 1.1, energy * 1.2, energy * 1.3],\r\n            color: '#39ff14'\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            label: 'Infra Verde',\r\n            values: [green, green * 1.05, green * 1.1, green * 1.15],\r\n            color: '#00f2ff'\r\n        }\r\n    ];\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Dibujar gr\u00e1fico de l\u00edneas\r\n    const width = 700;\r\n    const height = 150;\r\n    const offsetX = 50;\r\n    const offsetY = 30;\r\n    const stepX = width \/ 4;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ejes\r\n    ctx.strokeStyle = '#666';\r\n    ctx.lineWidth = 2;\r\n    ctx.beginPath();\r\n    ctx.moveTo(offsetX, offsetY);\r\n    ctx.lineTo(offsetX, offsetY + height);\r\n    ctx.lineTo(offsetX + width, offsetY + height);\r\n    ctx.stroke();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Etiquetas del eje X\r\n    const years = ['2024', '2025', '2026', '2027'];\r\n    years.forEach((year, i) => {\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#8af';\r\n        ctx.font = '12px \"VT323\"';\r\n        ctx.textAlign = 'center';\r\n        ctx.fillText(year, offsetX + (i * stepX) + (stepX \/ 2), offsetY + height + 20);\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Dibujar l\u00edneas de cada dataset\r\n    datasets.forEach(dataset => {\r\n        ctx.strokeStyle = dataset.color;\r\n        ctx.lineWidth = 3;\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        \r\n        dataset.values.forEach((value, i) => {\r\n            const x = offsetX + (i * stepX) + (stepX \/ 2);\r\n            const y = offsetY + height - (value \/ 100 * height);\r\n            \r\n            if(i === 0) {\r\n                ctx.moveTo(x, y);\r\n            } else {\r\n                ctx.lineTo(x, y);\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Puntos\r\n            ctx.fillStyle = dataset.color;\r\n            ctx.beginPath();\r\n            ctx.arc(x, y, 6, 0, Math.PI * 2);\r\n            ctx.fill();\r\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#000';\r\n            ctx.beginPath();\r\n            ctx.arc(x, y, 3, 0, Math.PI * 2);\r\n            ctx.fill();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        ctx.stroke();\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Leyenda\r\n    datasets.forEach((dataset, i) => {\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = dataset.color;\r\n        ctx.font = '14px \"VT323\"';\r\n        ctx.fillText(dataset.label, offsetX + width + 20, offsetY + 30 + (i * 25));\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Cuadro de color\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = dataset.color;\r\n        ctx.fillRect(offsetX + width + 10, offsetY + 20 + (i * 25), 8, 8);\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction optimizeSystem() {\r\n    \/\/ Optimizaci\u00f3n autom\u00e1tica del sistema\r\n    document.getElementById('simTransport').value = 75;\r\n    document.getElementById('simEnergy').value = 65;\r\n    document.getElementById('simGreen').value = 80;\r\n    \r\n    runSim();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar mensaje de optimizaci\u00f3n\r\n    const log = document.getElementById('simLog');\r\n    log.innerHTML = '<span class=\"text-green\">\u25cf SISTEMA OPTIMIZADO - PAR\u00c1METROS AJUSTADOS PARA M\u00c1XIMA RESILIENCIA<\/span>';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto visual\r\n    log.classList.add('glitch');\r\n    setTimeout(() => log.classList.remove('glitch'), 500);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction resetSim() {\r\n    \/\/ Restaurar valores por defecto\r\n    document.getElementById('simTransport').value = 30;\r\n    document.getElementById('simEnergy').value = 20;\r\n    document.getElementById('simGreen').value = 45;\r\n    \r\n    runSim();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar mensaje de reinicio\r\n    const log = document.getElementById('simLog');\r\n    log.innerHTML = '<span class=\"text-gold\">\u25cf SISTEMA REINICIADO - VALORES POR DEFECTO RESTAURADOS<\/span>';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ EVALUACI\u00d3N MASTER ============\r\nfunction checkMaster(idx, btn) {\r\n    const feedback = document.getElementById('masterFeedback');\r\n    const explanation = document.getElementById('quizExplanation');\r\n    const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-btn');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Remover clases anteriores\r\n    buttons.forEach(b => {\r\n        b.classList.remove('activated', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Activar el bot\u00f3n clickeado\r\n    btn.classList.add('activated');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n    if(idx === 1) {\r\n        \/\/ Respuesta correcta\r\n        btn.classList.add('correct');\r\n        feedback.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"alert-success p-4\">\r\n                <div class=\"d-flex align-items-start\">\r\n                    <span class=\"text-green me-3\">\u2713<\/span>\r\n                    <div>\r\n                        <strong class=\"text-green h5\">[RESPUESTA CORRECTA]<\/strong>\r\n                        <div class=\"mt-2 text-light\">\r\n                            Has identificado correctamente la diferencia fundamental. La sustentabilidad \r\n                            requiere integraci\u00f3n sist\u00e9mica de tecnolog\u00eda, equidad social y viabilidad econ\u00f3mica.\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n    } else {\r\n        \/\/ Respuesta incorrecta\r\n        btn.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n        feedback.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"alert-danger p-4\">\r\n                <div class=\"d-flex align-items-start\">\r\n                    <span class=\"text-danger me-3\">\u2717<\/span>\r\n                    <div>\r\n                        <strong class=\"text-danger h5\">[AN\u00c1LISIS INCOMPLETO]<\/strong>\r\n                        <div class=\"mt-2 text-light\">\r\n                            Tu respuesta no captura la complejidad sist\u00e9mica del ODS 11. \r\n                            Revisa el marco de los tres pilares de la sustentabilidad.\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    feedback.style.display = \"block\";\r\n    explanation.style.display = \"block\";\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto visual\r\n    if(idx === 1) {\r\n        btn.style.animation = 'pulse-cyan 0.5s';\r\n    } else {\r\n        btn.style.animation = 'glitch 0.5s';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ FUNCIONES AUXILIARES ============\r\nfunction showSystemInfo() {\r\n    alert('[SYSTEM_INFO]\\n\\nSistema de An\u00e1lisis Urbano v4.2\\nModelo basado en:\\n\u2022 IPCC Ciudades 2025\\n\u2022 ODS 11 Metas\\n\u2022 Econom\u00eda Circular\\n\u2022 Resiliencia Clim\u00e1tica');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction runDiagnostic() {\r\n    const diagnostic = document.getElementById('simLog');\r\n    diagnostic.innerHTML = '<span class=\"text-cyan\">\u25cf EJECUTANDO DIAGN\u00d3STICO SIST\u00c9MICO COMPLETO...<\/span>';\r\n    \r\n    setTimeout(() => {\r\n        diagnostic.innerHTML = '<span class=\"text-green\">\u25cf DIAGN\u00d3STICO COMPLETO - SISTEMA OPERATIVO CON 92% DE EFICIENCIA<\/span>';\r\n        diagnostic.classList.add('glitch');\r\n        setTimeout(() => diagnostic.classList.remove('glitch'), 500);\r\n    }, 2000);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showNodeInfo(type) {\r\n    const info = type === 'input' ? \r\n        'Nodo de Entrada: Recursos materiales, energ\u00e9ticos e informacionales que ingresan al sistema urbano.' :\r\n        'Nodo de Salida: Productos, servicios y residuos procesados que salen del sistema urbano.';\r\n    \r\n    alert(`[NODE_INFO: ${type.toUpperCase()}]\\n\\n${info}`);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N ============\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    \/\/ Crear grid de ciudad\r\n    createCityGrid();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar simulador\r\n    runSim();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto de carga terminal\r\n    const terminalPrompt = document.querySelector('.terminal-prompt .text-cyan');\r\n    if(terminalPrompt) {\r\n        const originalText = terminalPrompt.textContent;\r\n        terminalPrompt.textContent = '';\r\n        \r\n        let i = 0;\r\n        const typeWriter = () => {\r\n            if(i < originalText.length) {\r\n                terminalPrompt.textContent += originalText.charAt(i);\r\n                i++;\r\n                setTimeout(typeWriter, 60);\r\n            }\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        setTimeout(typeWriter, 800);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar estilos din\u00e1micos\r\n    const style = document.createElement('style');\r\n    style.textContent = `\r\n        .cyber-dot {\r\n            width: 12px;\r\n            height: 12px;\r\n            border-radius: 50%;\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .trend-chart {\r\n            background: #000;\r\n            border: 2px solid #00f2ff;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            border-radius: 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .evolution-card {\r\n            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\r\n            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .evolution-card:hover {\r\n            transform: translateY(-10px);\r\n            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 242, 255, 0.3);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .quiz-explanation ul {\r\n            list-style-type: none;\r\n            padding-left: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .quiz-explanation li {\r\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n            position: relative;\r\n            padding-left: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .quiz-explanation li::before {\r\n            content: '\u25b6';\r\n            color: #39ff14;\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            left: 0;\r\n        }\r\n    `;\r\n    document.head.appendChild(style);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Animar elementos de la ciudad\r\n    const core = document.querySelector('.urban-core');\r\n    if(core) {\r\n        core.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {\r\n            core.style.transform = 'scale(1.05)';\r\n            core.style.filter = 'brightness(1.3)';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        core.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\r\n            core.style.transform = 'scale(1)';\r\n            core.style.filter = 'brightness(1)';\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n});\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Calcula el CO\u2082 ahorrado al a\u00f1o por una comunidad de 10,000 personas si el 60% usa bicicleta en lugar de auto (Ahorro promedio: 4.6t CO\u2082\/a\u00f1o por auto).","respuesta":"10,000 hab * 0.60 * 4.6t = 27,600 toneladas de CO\u2082 ahorradas al a\u00f1o."},{"enunciado":"Define el concepto de \"Metabolismo Urbano Circular\" aplicado a Masdar City.","respuesta":"Es un sistema donde los residuos se convierten en insumos de energ\u00eda o materia, y el consumo de recursos no excede la tasa de regeneraci\u00f3n local (ej. 100% agua reciclada)."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo influye la cobertura verde de Singapur (66 m\u00b2\/hab) en el efecto Isla de Calor Urbana?","respuesta":"Reduce la temperatura mediante evapotranspiraci\u00f3n y sombreado, disminuyendo el gasto energ\u00e9tico en aire acondicionado hasta en un 30%."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la relaci\u00f3n entre vivienda asequible (pilar social) y huella de carbono (pilar ecol\u00f3gico)?","respuesta":"La vivienda asequible en centros urbanos reduce los tiempos de desplazamiento, bajando las emisiones por transporte forzado de la periferia al centro."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 meta espec\u00edfica del ODS 11 busca proteger el patrimonio cultural y natural del mundo?","respuesta":"Meta 11.4: Redoblar los esfuerzos para proteger y salvaguardar el patrimonio cultural y natural del mundo."},{"enunciado":"Explica por qu\u00e9 la \"independencia energ\u00e9tica\" aumenta la resiliencia de una comunidad.","respuesta":"Permite que servicios cr\u00edticos (hospitales, agua) funcionen durante fallos masivos en la red nacional por desastres clim\u00e1ticos."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 indicador del ICLEI mide la eficiencia en la gesti\u00f3n de residuos?","respuesta":"La tasa de desv\u00edo de residuos de vertederos (Porcentaje de reciclaje y compostaje sobre el total generado)."},{"enunciado":"Copenhague aspira a ser carbono neutral en 2025. Menciona sus dos estrategias principales.","respuesta":"1. Descarbonizaci\u00f3n de la red el\u00e9ctrica mediante e\u00f3lica. 2. Infraestructura masiva para movilidad no motorizada."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"Derecho a la Ciudad\" dentro de una comunidad sustentable?","respuesta":"Es el acceso equitativo de todos los ciudadanos a los recursos, servicios y toma de decisiones que la ciudad ofrece."},{"enunciado":"Define \"Infraestructura Verde\" seg\u00fan el marco de la EPA.","respuesta":"Red de espacios naturales y seminaturales dise\u00f1ados para gestionar el agua de lluvia y proveer servicios ecosist\u00e9micos en entornos urbanos."},{"enunciado":"Calcula el n\u00famero de paneles solares necesarios para una aldea de 100 casas si cada casa consume 500 kWh\/mes y un panel genera 50 kWh\/mes.","respuesta":"(100 casas * 500 kWh) \/ 50 kWh\/panel = 1,000 paneles solares."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 Freiburg se considera la capital solar de Europa?","respuesta":"Por su integraci\u00f3n masiva de fotovoltaica en edificios residenciales (distrito Vauban) y pol\u00edticas de fomento desde los a\u00f1os 80."}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el ODS dedicado espec\u00edficamente a ciudades sostenibles?","opciones":["ODS 7","ODS 11","ODS 13","ODS 15"],"correcta":"ODS 11"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 pilar de la sustentabilidad garantiza que los empleos sean viables y locales?","opciones":["Ecol\u00f3gico","Social","Econ\u00f3mico","Tecnol\u00f3gico"],"correcta":"Econ\u00f3mico"},{"pregunta":"Copenhague destaca mundialmente por su:","opciones":["Energ\u00eda nuclear","Cultura de la bicicleta","Gesti\u00f3n de miner\u00eda","Producci\u00f3n de carne"],"correcta":"Cultura de la bicicleta"},{"pregunta":"Masdar City es un ejemplo de ciudad dise\u00f1ada para ser:","opciones":["Centro financiero","Cero carbono y cero residuos","Puerto comercial masivo","Ciudad agr\u00edcola"],"correcta":"Cero carbono y cero residuos"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 indicador mide la cantidad de CO\u2082 que emite cada habitante?","opciones":["AQI","Emisiones per c\u00e1pita","\u00cdndice de Gini","PIB Verde"],"correcta":"Emisiones per c\u00e1pita"},{"pregunta":"La capacidad de una ciudad para recuperarse tras un desastre se llama:","opciones":["Mitigaci\u00f3n","Resiliencia","Adaptaci\u00f3n","Evoluci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Resiliencia"},{"pregunta":"Singapur es famosa en urbanismo sustentable por ser una:","opciones":["Ciudad des\u00e9rtica","Ciudad Jard\u00edn con alta cobertura verde","Ciudad sin impuestos","Isla industrial"],"correcta":"Ciudad Jard\u00edn con alta cobertura verde"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 porcentaje de viajes se realizan en bici en Copenhague?","opciones":["10%","30%","M\u00e1s del 50%","5%"],"correcta":"M\u00e1s del 50%"},{"pregunta":"El pilar social de la sustentabilidad incluye:","opciones":["Reciclaje de PET","Equidad y vivienda asequible","Venta de bonos de carbono","Paneles solares"],"correcta":"Equidad y vivienda asequible"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el nivel m\u00e1ximo de emisiones per c\u00e1pita recomendado para 2025?","opciones":["10 t CO\u2082","< 2 t CO\u2082","50 t CO\u2082","0.1 t CO\u2082"],"correcta":"< 2 t CO\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Freiburg (Alemania) es l\u00edder en:","opciones":["Energ\u00eda solar y urbanismo participativo","Miner\u00eda de carb\u00f3n","Industria automotriz","Pesca intensiva"],"correcta":"Energ\u00eda solar y urbanismo participativo"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"Metabolismo Urbano\"?","opciones":["La digesti\u00f3n de los ciudadanos","El flujo de materia y energ\u00eda en una ciudad","El crecimiento de los edificios","La velocidad del transporte p\u00fablico"],"correcta":"El flujo de materia y energ\u00eda en una ciudad"},{"pregunta":"Una ciudad \"Zero Waste\" busca desviar del vertedero al menos el:","opciones":["20%","50%","80-90%","100% de los pl\u00e1sticos solamente"],"correcta":"80-90%"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 busca la meta 11.2 del ODS 11?","opciones":["Internet gratis","Sistemas de transporte seguros y sostenibles","Construir rascacielos","Plantar \u00e1rboles frutales"],"correcta":"Sistemas de transporte seguros y sostenibles"},{"pregunta":"La captaci\u00f3n de agua de lluvia es una pr\u00e1ctica del pilar:","opciones":["Econ\u00f3mico","Social","Ecol\u00f3gico","Est\u00e9tico"],"correcta":"Ecol\u00f3gico"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 ciudad estadounidense es l\u00edder en desv\u00edo de residuos (80%)?","opciones":["Nueva York","Miami","San Francisco","Chicago"],"correcta":"San Francisco"},{"pregunta":"Los \"empleos verdes\" se definen como aquellos que:","opciones":["Pagan mucho dinero","Contribuyen a preservar o restaurar el medio ambiente","Son al aire libre","Son de jardiner\u00eda solamente"],"correcta":"Contribuyen a preservar o restaurar el medio ambiente"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es un beneficio directo de los huertos urbanos?","opciones":["Aumento del tr\u00e1fico","Seguridad alimentaria local y reducci\u00f3n de CO\u2082","Mayor uso de pesticidas","Venta de tierras"],"correcta":"Seguridad alimentaria local y reducci\u00f3n de CO\u2082"},{"pregunta":"El AQI (Air Quality Index) mide:","opciones":["La velocidad del viento","La calidad del aire","La humedad relativa","El ruido"],"correcta":"La calidad del aire"},{"pregunta":"La \"econom\u00eda circular\" en una comunidad evita:","opciones":["El dinero en efectivo","El modelo lineal de extraer-usar-tirar","El comercio exterior","Los impuestos"],"correcta":"El modelo lineal de extraer-usar-tirar"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 pilar asegura que la comunidad sea financieramente pr\u00f3spera?","opciones":["Ambiental","Social","Econ\u00f3mico","\u00c9tico"],"correcta":"Econ\u00f3mico"},{"pregunta":"El dise\u00f1o de ciudades \"15 minutos\" busca:","opciones":["Carreras de autos","Que todo servicio est\u00e9 a 15 min caminando\/bici","Que el internet sea r\u00e1pido","Vuelos cortos"],"correcta":"Que todo servicio est\u00e9 a 15 min caminando\/bici"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 pa\u00eds alberga a Masdar City?","opciones":["Arabia Saudita","Emiratos \u00c1rabes Unidos","Qatar","Om\u00e1n"],"correcta":"Emiratos \u00c1rabes Unidos"},{"pregunta":"La \"gentrificaci\u00f3n\" es un problema que afecta principalmente al pilar:","opciones":["Ecol\u00f3gico","Social","Econ\u00f3mico","Tecnol\u00f3gico"],"correcta":"Social"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el indicador de \u00e9xito para \u00e1reas verdes urbanas seg\u00fan la OMS?","opciones":["1 m\u00b2\/hab","9-15 m\u00b2\/hab","50 m\u00b2\/hab","No existe indicador"],"correcta":"9-15 m\u00b2\/hab"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 t\u00e9cnica reduce las inundaciones urbanas gestionando el agua de lluvia?","opciones":["Pavimento impermeable","Sistemas de drenaje sostenible (SUDs)","Bombas de petr\u00f3leo","T\u00faneles de viento"],"correcta":"Sistemas de drenaje sostenible (SUDs)"},{"pregunta":"El pilar ecol\u00f3gico en Singapur se visualiza a trav\u00e9s de:","opciones":["Edificios con jardines verticales masivos","Desiertos artificiales","Grandes parqueos","F\u00e1bricas de acero"],"correcta":"Edificios con jardines verticales masivos"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 ciudad es pionera en el uso de calefacci\u00f3n distrital por biomasa?","opciones":["Freiburg","Tokio","Las Vegas","Dubai"],"correcta":"Freiburg"},{"pregunta":"La resiliencia comunitaria ante el cambio clim\u00e1tico es meta del:","opciones":["ODS 1","ODS 11","ODS 4","ODS 10"],"correcta":"ODS 11"},{"pregunta":"En sustentabilidad, \"equidad\" significa:","opciones":["Que todos tengan el mismo color de casa","Acceso justo a oportunidades y recursos para todos","Que nadie trabaje","Que todos ganen el salario m\u00ednimo"],"correcta":"Acceso justo a oportunidades y recursos para todos"}]},{"materia":"Ecosistemas","slug":"metodo-cientifico-master","titulo":"M\u00e9todo Cient\u00edfico: La Arquitectura del Rigor Ecol\u00f3gico","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-metodo-cientifico\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ TERMINAL HEADER COMPACTO ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"terminal-header\">\r\n    <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\">\r\n        <div class=\"terminal-prompt\">\r\n            <span class=\"text-cyan\">SCIENCE_SYSTEM><\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"text-purple ms-2\">METHODOLOGY<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"text-green blink ms-2\">[RIGOR_MODE]<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"terminal-status\">\r\n            <span class=\"badge border border-cyan text-cyan\">POPPER<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge border border-purple text-purple ms-1\">STATISTICS<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge border border-green text-green ms-1\">FALSIFICATION<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ HEADER SECTION COMPACTA ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"header-section\">\r\n    <h1>EPISTEMOLOG\u00cdA DE LA CIENCIA ECOL\u00d3GICA<\/h1>\r\n    <p class=\"lead\">\r\n        El m\u00e9todo cient\u00edfico no es una receta, es un <strong>MECANISMO DE CORRECCI\u00d3N DE ERRORES<\/strong>. \r\n        En ecolog\u00eda, donde los sistemas son complejos y estoc\u00e1sticos, el rigor en la falsaci\u00f3n es la \u00fanica \r\n        defensa contra la pseudociencia.\r\n    <\/p>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ DIAGRAMA CIENT\u00cdFICO COMPACTO ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"text-center mb-3\">\r\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">LOOP DE RETROALIMENTACI\u00d3N CIENT\u00cdFICA<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"text-muted ms-2\">v2.1 - Modelo Popper-Kuhn<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 700 300\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 200px;\">\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <linearGradient id=\"gradScience\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\">\r\n                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#001a33\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#004466\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#00d4ff\"\/>\r\n            <\/linearGradient>\r\n            \r\n            <filter id=\"glow-compact\">\r\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"2\" result=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                <feMerge>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"blur\"\/>\r\n                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                <\/feMerge>\r\n            <\/filter>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Ciclo principal -->\r\n        <path d=\"M350 50 A120 120 0 1 1 349 50\" \r\n              fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#21262d\" stroke-width=\"30\"\/>\r\n        \r\n        <path d=\"M350 50 A120 120 0 1 1 349 50\" \r\n              fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#gradScience)\" stroke-width=\"2\" \r\n              stroke-dasharray=\"8 4\" filter=\"url(#glow-compact)\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"0;20;0\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/path>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Etapas del m\u00e9todo -->\r\n        <g class=\"science-node\" transform=\"translate(350, 50)\">\r\n            <circle r=\"12\" fill=\"#39ff14\" filter=\"url(#glow-compact)\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"12;14;12\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/circle>\r\n            <text y=\"25\" fill=\"#39ff14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                OBSERVACI\u00d3N\r\n            <\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n        \r\n        <g class=\"science-node\" transform=\"translate(470, 170)\">\r\n            <circle r=\"12\" fill=\"#bc13fe\" filter=\"url(#glow-compact)\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"12;14;12\" dur=\"2.2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/circle>\r\n            <text x=\"20\" y=\"5\" fill=\"#bc13fe\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                HIP\u00d3TESIS\r\n            <\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n        \r\n        <g class=\"science-node\" transform=\"translate(350, 290)\">\r\n            <circle r=\"12\" fill=\"#ffcc00\" filter=\"url(#glow-compact)\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"12;14;12\" dur=\"2.4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/circle>\r\n            <text y=\"-20\" fill=\"#ffcc00\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                EXPERIMENTACI\u00d3N\r\n            <\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n        \r\n        <g class=\"science-node\" transform=\"translate(230, 170)\">\r\n            <circle r=\"12\" fill=\"#ff3366\" filter=\"url(#glow-compact)\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"12;14;12\" dur=\"2.6s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/circle>\r\n            <text x=\"-20\" y=\"5\" fill=\"#ff3366\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                FALSACI\u00d3N\r\n            <\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Conexiones de datos -->\r\n        <path d=\"M350 62 L350 120\" stroke=\"#00d4ff\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 2\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"0;10;0\" dur=\"1.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/path>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- N\u00facleo de conocimiento -->\r\n        <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"170\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#00d4ff\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n        <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"170\" r=\"35\" fill=\"#001a33\" opacity=\"0.9\"\/>\r\n        \r\n        <text x=\"350\" y=\"165\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n            CONOCIMIENTO\r\n        <\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"350\" y=\"180\" fill=\"#8b949e\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Courier New'\" font-size=\"9\">\r\n            BASADO EN EVIDENCIA\r\n        <\/text>\r\n        \r\n        <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"170\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#00d4ff\">\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"8;10;8\" dur=\"1.8s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n        <\/circle>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- T\u00edtulo del sistema -->\r\n        <text x=\"350\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#00d4ff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'VT323'\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n            M\u00c9TODO CIENT\u00cdFICO\r\n        <\/text>\r\n        <text x=\"350\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#bc13fe\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Courier New'\" font-size=\"10\">\r\n            Sistema Autocorrectivo de Errores\r\n        <\/text>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"mt-3 text-center\">\r\n        <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-center flex-wrap gap-3\">\r\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                <div class=\"cyber-dot bg-green me-1\"><\/div>\r\n                <span class=\"small text-green\">Observaci\u00f3n<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                <div class=\"cyber-dot bg-purple me-1\"><\/div>\r\n                <span class=\"small text-purple\">Hip\u00f3tesis<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                <div class=\"cyber-dot bg-warning me-1\"><\/div>\r\n                <span class=\"small text-warning\">Experimentaci\u00f3n<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                <div class=\"cyber-dot bg-pink me-1\"><\/div>\r\n                <span class=\"small text-pink\">Falsaci\u00f3n<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ LABORATORIO VIRTUAL COMPACTO ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"lab-terminal\">\r\n    <span class=\"stat-label\">VIRTUAL LAB: AN\u00c1LISIS DE SIGNIFICANCIA ESTAD\u00cdSTICA<\/span>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"terminal-instructions mb-3 p-2 border border-cyan\" style=\"font-size: 11px;\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-cyan\">ESCENARIO:<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"text-light ms-1\">\r\n            Est\u00e1s probando si un nuevo fertilizante org\u00e1nico aumenta la tasa de fijaci\u00f3n de nitr\u00f3geno. \r\n            Si $p < 0.05$, rechazas la hip\u00f3tesis nula ($H_0$).\r\n        <\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"row align-items-center g-3\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n            <!-- Control de variables -->\r\n            <div class=\"control-group mb-3\">\r\n                <label class=\"stat-label\">VARIABILIDAD EN LA MUESTRA (RUIDO)<\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between mb-1\">\r\n                    <span class=\"small text-danger\">Baja<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"small text-warning\" id=\"noiseValue\">50%<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"small text-danger\">Alta<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range\" id=\"noiseLevel\" min=\"1\" max=\"100\" value=\"50\" oninput=\"runExperiment()\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-info mt-1\">\r\n                    <span class=\"small text-muted\">Error est\u00e1ndar estimado: <\/span>\r\n                    <span id=\"noiseImpact\" class=\"small text-warning\">\u00b10.15<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label class=\"stat-label\">TAMA\u00d1O DE LA MUESTRA ($n$)<\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between mb-1\">\r\n                    <span class=\"small text-danger\">10<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"small text-warning\" id=\"sampleValue\">100<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"small text-success\">1000<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range\" id=\"sampleSize\" min=\"10\" max=\"1000\" value=\"100\" oninput=\"runExperiment()\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-info mt-1\">\r\n                    <span class=\"small text-muted\">Poder estad\u00edstico: <\/span>\r\n                    <span id=\"powerImpact\" class=\"small text-warning\">0.78<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n            <!-- Resultados -->\r\n            <div class=\"results-display text-center p-3 border border-purple\">\r\n                <label class=\"stat-label\">RESULTADO ESTAD\u00cdSTICO<\/label>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"p-value-display mt-2 mb-3\">\r\n                    <span class=\"small text-muted\">$p$-value =<\/span>\r\n                    <span id=\"pValDisplay\" class=\"h3 ms-1\" style=\"font-family: 'Courier New'; font-weight: bold;\">0.042<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div id=\"resultLabel\" class=\"badge border border-success text-success py-1\">\r\n                    <span class=\"me-1\">\u2713<\/span> SIGNIFICATIVO\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"interpretation mt-3\">\r\n                    <span id=\"interpretationText\" class=\"small text-light\">\r\n                        $H_0$: No hay efecto del fertilizante<br>\r\n                        $H_1$: El fertilizante aumenta la fijaci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- Estad\u00edsticas adicionales -->\r\n    <div class=\"stats-grid mt-3\">\r\n        <div class=\"row g-2\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-4\">\r\n                <div class=\"stat-box p-2 border border-cyan text-center\">\r\n                    <span class=\"small text-cyan\">Intervalo 95%<\/span>\r\n                    <div class=\"small text-light\" id=\"confidenceInterval\">[0.02, 0.18]<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-4\">\r\n                <div class=\"stat-box p-2 border border-purple text-center\">\r\n                    <span class=\"small text-purple\">Tama\u00f1o efecto<\/span>\r\n                    <div class=\"small text-light\" id=\"effectSize\">d = 0.45<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-4\">\r\n                <div class=\"stat-box p-2 border border-green text-center\">\r\n                    <span class=\"small text-green\">Potencia<\/span>\r\n                    <div class=\"small text-light\" id=\"statisticalPower\">78%<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ DESAF\u00cdO DE PENSAMIENTO CR\u00cdTICO ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"interactive-card\">\r\n    <span class=\"stat-label\">DESAF\u00cdO DE PENSAMIENTO CR\u00cdTICO<\/span>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-scenario mb-3 p-2 border border-green\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-green\">PROBLEMA EPISTEMOL\u00d3GICO:<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"text-light ms-1\">\r\n            Karl Popper argument\u00f3 que una teor\u00eda que \"explica todo\" no es cient\u00edfica. \r\n            \u00bfPor qu\u00e9 la <strong>FALSABILIDAD<\/strong> es vital en la ecolog\u00eda moderna?\r\n        <\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n        <button class=\"list-group-item\" onclick=\"checkMaster(0, this)\">\r\n            <span class=\"step-badge\">A<\/span>\r\n            Porque permite demostrar que una teor\u00eda es una verdad absoluta e incuestionable.\r\n        <\/button>\r\n        \r\n        <button class=\"list-group-item\" onclick=\"checkMaster(1, this)\">\r\n            <span class=\"step-badge\">B<\/span>\r\n            Porque obliga a los cient\u00edficos a definir qu\u00e9 evidencia, de existir, probar\u00eda que su hip\u00f3tesis es err\u00f3nea.\r\n        <\/button>\r\n        \r\n        <button class=\"list-group-item\" onclick=\"checkMaster(2, this)\">\r\n            <span class=\"step-badge\">C<\/span>\r\n            Porque asegura que todos los experimentos den resultados positivos y confirmen las predicciones.\r\n        <\/button>\r\n        \r\n        <button class=\"list-group-item\" onclick=\"checkMaster(3, this)\">\r\n            <span class=\"step-badge\">D<\/span>\r\n            Porque simplifica el proceso cient\u00edfico al eliminar la necesidad de replicaci\u00f3n experimental.\r\n        <\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div id=\"quizFeedback\" class=\"mt-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n        <!-- Se llena con JavaScript -->\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- Explicaci\u00f3n -->\r\n    <div class=\"explanation-box mt-3 p-2 border border-cyan\" style=\"display: none;\" id=\"quizExplanation\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-cyan small\">EXPLICACI\u00d3N FILOS\u00d3FICA:<\/span>\r\n        <div class=\"mt-1\">\r\n            <p class=\"small text-light mb-1\">\r\n                Seg\u00fan Popper, una teor\u00eda cient\u00edfica debe hacer <strong>predicciones arriesgadas<\/strong> \r\n                que puedan ser refutadas por la evidencia emp\u00edrica. Las teor\u00edas no falsables:\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <ul class=\"small text-light mb-0\">\r\n                <li>No pueden ser sometidas a prueba emp\u00edrica<\/li>\r\n                <li>Se ajustan a cualquier observaci\u00f3n (ej: astrolog\u00eda)<\/li>\r\n                <li>Impiden el progreso cient\u00edfico<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ CONCLUSI\u00d3N SIST\u00c9MICA ============ -->\r\n<div class=\"footer-note\">\r\n    <div class=\"d-flex\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-purple me-2\">\u26a0<\/span>\r\n        <div>\r\n            <p class=\"small mb-1\">\r\n                <strong>CONCLUSI\u00d3N SIST\u00c9MICA:<\/strong> El m\u00e9todo cient\u00edfico en 2025 integra \r\n                Inteligencia Artificial y Big Data, pero el n\u00facleo permanece igual: la curiosidad \r\n                humilde ante la complejidad del ecosistema y el rechazo a la validaci\u00f3n sin evidencia robusta.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"mt-1\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge border border-cyan text-cyan me-1\">RIGOR<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge border border-purple text-purple me-1\">TRANSPARENCIA<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge border border-green text-green\">REPLICABILIDAD<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============ JAVASCRIPT COMPACTO ============ -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ============ LABORATORIO VIRTUAL ============\r\nfunction runExperiment() {\r\n    \/\/ Obtener valores\r\n    const noise = parseInt(document.getElementById('noiseLevel').value);\r\n    const sample = parseInt(document.getElementById('sampleSize').value);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar valores mostrados\r\n    document.getElementById('noiseValue').textContent = noise + '%';\r\n    document.getElementById('sampleValue').textContent = sample;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ C\u00e1lculo del p-value (modelo simplificado)\r\n    \/\/ M\u00e1s ruido \u2192 p m\u00e1s alto, m\u00e1s muestra \u2192 p m\u00e1s bajo\r\n    let p = (noise \/ sample) * 0.5;\r\n    p = Math.min(Math.max(p, 0.001), 0.999);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar display del p-value\r\n    const pDisplay = document.getElementById('pValDisplay');\r\n    pDisplay.textContent = p.toFixed(3);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar interpretaci\u00f3n\r\n    const resultLabel = document.getElementById('resultLabel');\r\n    const interpretation = document.getElementById('interpretationText');\r\n    \r\n    if (p < 0.05) {\r\n        \/\/ Resultado significativo\r\n        pDisplay.style.color = \"#39ff14\";\r\n        resultLabel.innerHTML = '<span class=\"me-1\">\u2713<\/span> SIGNIFICATIVO';\r\n        resultLabel.className = 'badge border border-success text-success py-1';\r\n        interpretation.innerHTML = '$H_0$ <span class=\"text-danger\">Rechazada<\/span><br>$H_1$ <span class=\"text-success\">Aceptada<\/span>';\r\n    } else {\r\n        \/\/ Resultado no significativo\r\n        pDisplay.style.color = \"#ff3366\";\r\n        resultLabel.innerHTML = '<span class=\"me-1\">\u2717<\/span> NO SIGNIFICATIVO';\r\n        resultLabel.className = 'badge border border-danger text-danger py-1';\r\n        interpretation.innerHTML = '$H_0$ <span class=\"text-success\">Mantenida<\/span><br>$H_1$ <span class=\"text-danger\">No soportada<\/span>';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas adicionales\r\n    updateStatistics(noise, sample, p);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto visual en el p-value\r\n    pDisplay.style.transform = 'scale(1.1)';\r\n    setTimeout(() => pDisplay.style.transform = 'scale(1)', 200);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction updateStatistics(noise, sample, p) {\r\n    \/\/ Calcular estad\u00edsticas derivadas\r\n    const ciLower = Math.max(0, p - 0.1).toFixed(2);\r\n    const ciUpper = Math.min(1, p + 0.1).toFixed(2);\r\n    const effectSize = (0.5 - (noise \/ 200)).toFixed(2);\r\n    const power = Math.min(99, (sample \/ 1000 * 100)).toFixed(0);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar displays\r\n    document.getElementById('confidenceInterval').textContent = `[${ciLower}, ${ciUpper}]`;\r\n    document.getElementById('effectSize').textContent = `d = ${effectSize}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('statisticalPower').textContent = `${power}%`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar impactos\r\n    document.getElementById('noiseImpact').textContent = `\u00b1${(noise\/100).toFixed(2)}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('powerImpact').textContent = `0.${power}`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ QUIZ INTERACTIVO ============\r\nfunction checkMaster(idx, btn) {\r\n    const feedback = document.getElementById('quizFeedback');\r\n    const explanation = document.getElementById('quizExplanation');\r\n    const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.list-group-item');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Remover selecciones anteriores\r\n    buttons.forEach(b => {\r\n        b.classList.remove('selected-correct', 'selected-incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n    feedback.style.display = \"block\";\r\n    explanation.style.display = \"block\";\r\n    \r\n    if (idx === 1) {\r\n        \/\/ Respuesta correcta\r\n        btn.classList.add('selected-correct');\r\n        feedback.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"alert-success p-2 border border-green\">\r\n                <div class=\"d-flex align-items-start\">\r\n                    <span class=\"text-green me-2\">\u2713<\/span>\r\n                    <div>\r\n                        <strong class=\"text-green small\">CORRECTO<\/strong>\r\n                        <div class=\"mt-1 small text-light\">\r\n                            Exactamente. La falsabilidad requiere que las hip\u00f3tesis hagan predicciones \r\n                            espec\u00edficas que puedan ser contrastadas emp\u00edricamente. Si nada puede refutarlas, \r\n                            no son cient\u00edficas.\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n    } else {\r\n        \/\/ Respuesta incorrecta\r\n        btn.classList.add('selected-incorrect');\r\n        feedback.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"alert-danger p-2 border border-danger\">\r\n                <div class=\"d-flex align-items-start\">\r\n                    <span class=\"text-danger me-2\">\u2717<\/span>\r\n                    <div>\r\n                        <strong class=\"text-danger small\">ERROR CONCEPTUAL<\/strong>\r\n                        <div class=\"mt-1 small text-light\">\r\n                            La ciencia no busca verdades absolutas (A) ni solo confirmaciones (C). \r\n                            La falsabilidad hace a la ciencia <strong>autocorrectiva<\/strong>.\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto visual\r\n    if(idx === 1) {\r\n        btn.style.animation = 'pulse-blue-fast 0.3s';\r\n    } else {\r\n        btn.style.animation = 'blink-fast 0.3s';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    setTimeout(() => btn.style.animation = '', 300);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ INTERACTIVIDAD SVG ============\r\nfunction initScienceNodes() {\r\n    const nodes = document.querySelectorAll('.science-node');\r\n    \r\n    nodes.forEach(node => {\r\n        node.addEventListener('mouseenter', function() {\r\n            this.style.transform += ' scale(1.1)';\r\n            this.style.filter = 'brightness(1.3)';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        node.addEventListener('mouseleave', function() {\r\n            this.style.transform = this.style.transform.replace(' scale(1.1)', '');\r\n            this.style.filter = 'brightness(1)';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        node.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const stages = {\r\n                0: 'OBSERVACI\u00d3N: Recopilaci\u00f3n sistem\u00e1tica de datos emp\u00edricos',\r\n                1: 'HIP\u00d3TESIS: Explicaci\u00f3n provisional que hace predicciones',\r\n                2: 'EXPERIMENTACI\u00d3N: Prueba controlada de las predicciones',\r\n                3: 'FALSACI\u00d3N: Intento de refutaci\u00f3n mediante evidencia'\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            const index = Array.from(nodes).indexOf(this);\r\n            alert(`[STAGE_INFO: ${index+1}\/4]\\n\\n${stages[index]}`);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N ============\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    \/\/ Inicializar laboratorio\r\n    runExperiment();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar interactividad\r\n    initScienceNodes();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto de terminal\r\n    const terminal = document.querySelector('.terminal-prompt .text-cyan');\r\n    if(terminal) {\r\n        const text = terminal.textContent;\r\n        terminal.textContent = '';\r\n        \r\n        let i = 0;\r\n        const type = () => {\r\n            if(i < text.length) {\r\n                terminal.textContent += text.charAt(i);\r\n                i++;\r\n                setTimeout(type, 40);\r\n            } else {\r\n                terminal.innerHTML += '<span class=\"blink\">_<\/span>';\r\n            }\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        setTimeout(type, 300);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar estilos din\u00e1micos\r\n    const style = document.createElement('style');\r\n    style.textContent = `\r\n        .cyber-dot {\r\n            width: 8px;\r\n            height: 8px;\r\n            border-radius: 50%;\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .bg-green { background-color: #39ff14 !important; }\r\n        .bg-purple { background-color: #bc13fe !important; }\r\n        .bg-warning { background-color: #ffcc00 !important; }\r\n        .bg-pink { background-color: #ff3366 !important; }\r\n        .bg-cyan { background-color: #00d4ff !important; }\r\n        \r\n        .text-warning { color: #ffcc00 !important; }\r\n        \r\n        .alert-success {\r\n            background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.1) !important;\r\n            border-color: #39ff14 !important;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .alert-danger {\r\n            background: rgba(255, 51, 102, 0.1) !important;\r\n            border-color: #ff3366 !important;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .control-group {\r\n            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            border: 1px solid #30363d;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .results-display {\r\n            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .stat-box {\r\n            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .explanation-box {\r\n            background: rgba(0, 20, 40, 0.8);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .explanation-box ul {\r\n            list-style-type: none;\r\n            padding-left: 15px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .explanation-box li {\r\n            margin-bottom: 2px;\r\n            position: relative;\r\n            padding-left: 12px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .explanation-box li::before {\r\n            content: '\u25b6';\r\n            color: #39ff14;\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            left: 0;\r\n            font-size: 10px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .p-value-display {\r\n            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\r\n        }\r\n    `;\r\n    document.head.appendChild(style);\r\n});\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Plantea una hip\u00f3tesis falsable para el fen\u00f3meno de la disminuci\u00f3n de abejas en una zona agr\u00edcola.","respuesta":"Si el uso de neonicotinoides reduce la capacidad de navegaci\u00f3n de las abejas, entonces las colonias expuestas a 10ppm del pesticida mostrar\u00e1n un 30% menos de retorno al panal que el grupo control."},{"enunciado":"Diferencia entre Variable Independiente y Dependiente en un estudio de acidificaci\u00f3n oce\u00e1nica sobre corales.","respuesta":"Independiente: Nivel de pH del agua (manipulado). Dependiente: Tasa de calcificaci\u00f3n del esqueleto del coral (medido)."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es necesario un \"Grupo Control\"?","respuesta":"Para establecer una l\u00ednea base que permita asegurar que los cambios observados en el grupo experimental se deben a la variable independiente y no a factores externos."},{"enunciado":"Calcula el grado de libertad ($df$) para un t-test de dos muestras independientes con $n_1=25$ y $n_2=25$.","respuesta":"$df = (n_1 + n_2) - 2 = (25+25)-2 = 48$."},{"enunciado":"Explica el concepto de \"Revisi\u00f3n por Pares\" (Peer Review).","respuesta":"Proceso donde expertos independientes eval\u00faan el rigor, la metodolog\u00eda y la validez de un estudio antes de su publicaci\u00f3n para garantizar la calidad cient\u00edfica."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 ocurre si los datos de un experimento contradicen la hip\u00f3tesis original?","respuesta":"La hip\u00f3tesis se rechaza o se refina, y se inicia un nuevo ciclo del m\u00e9todo cient\u00edfico; esto no es un fracaso, sino progreso."},{"enunciado":"Define \"Muestreo Aleatorio\" y su importancia.","respuesta":"T\u00e9cnica donde cada individuo de la poblaci\u00f3n tiene la misma probabilidad de ser elegido; evita sesgos y permite generalizar resultados."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la diferencia entre Correlaci\u00f3n y Causalidad?","respuesta":"Correlaci\u00f3n indica que dos variables cambian juntas; Causalidad demuestra que una provoca el cambio en la otra (requiere experimentaci\u00f3n controlada)."},{"enunciado":"En el marco de Popper, \u00bfqu\u00e9 es un \"falso positivo\" (Error Tipo I)?","respuesta":"Rechazar la hip\u00f3tesis nula cuando en realidad es verdadera (afirmar un efecto que no existe)."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo influye el \"Sesgo de Confirmaci\u00f3n\" en el m\u00e9todo cient\u00edfico?","respuesta":"Es la tendencia a buscar o interpretar datos que apoyen nuestras creencias; el m\u00e9todo cient\u00edfico usa el doble ciego y la estad\u00edstica para mitigarlo."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es un Meta-an\u00e1lisis?","respuesta":"Un estudio estad\u00edstico que combina los resultados de m\u00faltiples investigaciones previas para obtener una conclusi\u00f3n m\u00e1s robusta sobre un fen\u00f3meno."},{"enunciado":"Menciona una herramienta tecnol\u00f3gica de 2025 para la fase de \"Observaci\u00f3n\".","respuesta":"Drones con sensores multiespectrales para el monitoreo de la salud del dosel forestal en tiempo real."}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 autor propuso que la ciencia progresa mediante \"paradigmas\"?","opciones":["Karl Popper","Thomas Kuhn","Isaac Newton","Francis Bacon"],"correcta":"Thomas Kuhn"},{"pregunta":"Si $p = 0.01$, el resultado es:","opciones":["Altamente significativo","No significativo","Err\u00f3neo","Incompleto"],"correcta":"Altamente significativo"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es una hip\u00f3tesis nula ($H_0$)?","opciones":["La que dice que no hay efecto","La que el cient\u00edfico quiere probar","Una idea falsa","Un error de c\u00e1lculo"],"correcta":"La que dice que no hay efecto"},{"pregunta":"La falsabilidad significa que una teor\u00eda debe poder ser:","opciones":["Probada como verdadera siempre","Refutada mediante evidencia","Escrita en lenguaje matem\u00e1tico","Entendida por todos"],"correcta":"Refutada mediante evidencia"},{"pregunta":"En un experimento, el grupo que no recibe tratamiento es el:","opciones":["Grupo Variable","Grupo Control","Grupo Cero","Grupo de An\u00e1lisis"],"correcta":"Grupo Control"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 mide el valor de significancia $p$?","opciones":["La probabilidad de que el resultado sea por azar","La importancia del estudio","La cantidad de datos recolectados","La verdad de la hip\u00f3tesis"],"correcta":"La probabilidad de que el resultado sea por azar"},{"pregunta":"El primer paso del m\u00e9todo cient\u00edfico es generalmente:","opciones":["La hip\u00f3tesis","La observaci\u00f3n","El an\u00e1lisis","La conclusi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"La observaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la variable que el investigador manipula?","opciones":["Variable Dependiente","Variable Independiente","Variable de Control","Variable Extra\u00f1a"],"correcta":"Variable Independiente"},{"pregunta":"Un estudio \"doble ciego\" sirve para evitar:","opciones":["El gasto de dinero","El sesgo del investigador y del sujeto","Errores de software","La luz solar"],"correcta":"El sesgo del investigador y del sujeto"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 significa que el m\u00e9todo cient\u00edfico sea \"iterativo\"?","opciones":["Que se hace una sola vez","Que los resultados se repiten y refinan en ciclos","Que es dif\u00edcil de aprender","Que usa mucha tecnolog\u00eda"],"correcta":"Que los resultados se repiten y refinan en ciclos"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es un Error Tipo II?","opciones":["Falso positivo","Falso negativo","Error de tipeo","Falla de equipo"],"correcta":"Falso negativo"},{"pregunta":"La escala de un mapa en un GIS es parte de la fase de:","opciones":["Comunicaci\u00f3n","Observaci\u00f3n\/An\u00e1lisis","Hip\u00f3tesis","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Observaci\u00f3n\/An\u00e1lisis"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el objetivo final de la comunicaci\u00f3n cient\u00edfica?","opciones":["Ganar dinero","Permitir la replicaci\u00f3n y escrutinio","Ocultar datos","Hacerse famoso"],"correcta":"Permitir la replicaci\u00f3n y escrutinio"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 herramienta estad\u00edstica compara las medias de dos grupos?","opciones":["ANOVA","t-test","Correlaci\u00f3n de Pearson","Regresi\u00f3n lineal"],"correcta":"t-test"},{"pregunta":"Una predicci\u00f3n cient\u00edfica suele tener la estructura:","opciones":["Yo creo que...","Si [Hip\u00f3tesis], entonces [Resultado]","Tal vez ocurra...","Siempre sucede que..."],"correcta":"Si [Hip\u00f3tesis], entonces [Resultado]"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la \"Navaja de Ockham\"?","opciones":["Un instrumento de corte","La explicaci\u00f3n m\u00e1s sencilla suele ser la correcta","Un m\u00e9todo para medir corales","Una regla estad\u00edstica"],"correcta":"La explicaci\u00f3n m\u00e1s sencilla suele ser la correcta"},{"pregunta":"En 2025, el Big Data ayuda principalmente en:","opciones":["La formulaci\u00f3n de preguntas","El procesamiento de grandes vol\u00famenes de observaci\u00f3n","La eliminaci\u00f3n del grupo control","Sustituir al cient\u00edfico"],"correcta":"El procesamiento de grandes vol\u00famenes de observaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es una Teor\u00eda Cient\u00edfica?","opciones":["Una corazonada","Una explicaci\u00f3n amplia apoyada por mucha evidencia","Una ley que nunca cambia","Una hip\u00f3tesis no probada"],"correcta":"Una explicaci\u00f3n amplia apoyada por mucha evidencia"},{"pregunta":"La \u00e9tica en la experimentaci\u00f3n es parte de:","opciones":["Solo las ciencias sociales","Todas las fases del m\u00e9todo cient\u00edfico","La fase de publicaci\u00f3n \u00fanicamente","No es parte del m\u00e9todo"],"correcta":"Todas las fases del m\u00e9todo cient\u00edfico"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 autor se asocia con el anarquismo epistemol\u00f3gico \"todo vale\"?","opciones":["Paul Feyerabend","Karl Popper","Albert Einstein","Rachel Carson"],"correcta":"Paul Feyerabend"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 indica una correlaci\u00f3n de -1?","opciones":["Relaci\u00f3n positiva perfecta","Sin relaci\u00f3n","Relaci\u00f3n negativa perfecta","Error en el c\u00e1lculo"],"correcta":"Relaci\u00f3n negativa perfecta"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la unidad b\u00e1sica de la biodiversidad en un estudio taxon\u00f3mico?","opciones":["El ecosistema","La especie","El gen","La familia"],"correcta":"La especie"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el \"p-hacking\"?","opciones":["Un m\u00e9todo avanzado de an\u00e1lisis","Manipular datos para obtener un p < 0.05","Hackear servidores de la NASA","Mejorar la precisi\u00f3n del experimento"],"correcta":"Manipular datos para obtener un p < 0.05"},{"pregunta":"El marco ELOHA se aplica a estudios de:","opciones":["Hidrolog\u00eda y caudales ecol\u00f3gicos","Aire puro","Suelos f\u00e9rtiles","Energ\u00eda solar"],"correcta":"Hidrolog\u00eda y caudales ecol\u00f3gicos"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es un experimento \"In Situ\"?","opciones":["En el laboratorio","En el lugar natural del fen\u00f3meno","En una computadora","En un libro"],"correcta":"En el lugar natural del fen\u00f3meno"},{"pregunta":"La reproducibilidad significa que:","opciones":["El experimento se puede hacer otra vez y dar resultados similares","El cient\u00edfico es famoso","Los datos son secretos","El experimento es muy caro"],"correcta":"El experimento se puede hacer otra vez y dar resultados similares"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 software es est\u00e1ndar para an\u00e1lisis estad\u00edstico en ecolog\u00eda?","opciones":["Photoshop","R (Lenguaje R)","Excel solamente","Word"],"correcta":"R (Lenguaje R)"},{"pregunta":"Un modelo matem\u00e1tico en ciencia es:","opciones":["Una verdad absoluta","Una simplificaci\u00f3n \u00fatil de la realidad","Un juguete","Una p\u00e9rdida de tiempo"],"correcta":"Una simplificaci\u00f3n \u00fatil de la realidad"},{"pregunta":"La \"falsaci\u00f3n\" busca:","opciones":["Mentir en los resultados","Intentar encontrar evidencia que contradiga la hip\u00f3tesis","Copiar a otros autores","Aceptar todo"],"correcta":"Intentar encontrar evidencia que contradiga la hip\u00f3tesis"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el IPCC?","opciones":["Un grupo de activistas","Panel Intergubernamental del Cambio Clim\u00e1tico","Una empresa de energ\u00eda","Un sat\u00e9lite"],"correcta":"Panel Intergubernamental del Cambio Clim\u00e1tico"}]}],"Qu\u00edmica I":[{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"equilibrio-quimico-dinamico","titulo":"Equilibrio Qu\u00edmico Din\u00e1mico: Principios, C\u00e1lculos y Aplicaciones Industriales","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-quimica-equilibrio\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== CABECERA CYBERPUNK ==================== -->\r\n    <div class=\"chem-header\">\r\n        <div class=\"header-badges\">\r\n            <span class=\"materia-badge\">\u269b\ufe0f QU\u00cdMICA I<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"nivel-badge\">\u26a1 NIVEL AVANZADO<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"tiempo-badge\">\u23f1\ufe0f 60 MIN<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-icon\">\u21cc<\/span> Equilibrio Qu\u00edmico Din\u00e1mico\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"leccion-subtitulo\">Constantes \u2022 Principio de Le Chatelier \u2022 C\u00e1lculos ICE \u2022 Aplicaciones Industriales<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== OBJETIVOS R\u00c1PIDOS ==================== -->\r\n    <div class=\"objetivos-rapidos\">\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n                <h4>Comprender el estado din\u00e1mico<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Identificar las condiciones del equilibrio qu\u00edmico y la constante K<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"obj-icon\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n                <h4>Aplicar Le Chatelier<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Predecir desplazamientos ante cambios de concentraci\u00f3n, presi\u00f3n y temperatura<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"obj-icon\">\ud83e\uddee<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"obj-text\">\r\n                <h4>Realizar c\u00e1lculos ICE<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Determinar concentraciones de equilibrio y constantes Kc y Kp<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== CONTEXTO REAL ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> Contexto real\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"context-card\">\r\n            <p>El equilibrio qu\u00edmico es clave en la <strong>s\u00edntesis de amon\u00edaco<\/strong> (proceso Haber-Bosch), que produce fertilizantes para el 50% de la poblaci\u00f3n mundial. Tambi\u00e9n explica el <strong>transporte de ox\u00edgeno en la sangre<\/strong> y la <strong>acidificaci\u00f3n oce\u00e1nica<\/strong> por CO\u2082. Comprenderlo permite optimizar procesos industriales y mitigar impactos ambientales.<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"real-data\">\r\n                <span class=\"data-tag\">\ud83c\udfed Haber-Bosch<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"data-tag\">\ud83e\ude78 Hemoglobina<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"data-tag\">\ud83c\udf0a Acidificaci\u00f3n<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"desarrollo-teorico\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> Fundamento te\u00f3rico\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"concept-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n                <h3>\u26a1 Equilibrio din\u00e1mico<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Velocidades directa e inversa iguales \u2192 concentraciones constantes, pero reacciones contin\u00faan.<\/p>\r\n                <p class=\"formula\">\\[ v_f = v_r \\]<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd22 Constante de equilibrio Kc<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Para \\( aA + bB \u21cc cC + dD \\):<\/p>\r\n                <p class=\"formula\">\\[ K_c = \\frac{[C]^c [D]^d}{[A]^a [B]^b} \\]<\/p>\r\n                <p>Kc > 1 \u2192 favorece productos; Kc < 1 \u2192 favorece reactivos.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc8 Constante Kp (gases)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>\\[ K_p = \\frac{(P_C)^c (P_D)^d}{(P_A)^a (P_B)^b} \\]<\/p>\r\n                <p>Relaci\u00f3n: \\( K_p = K_c (RT)^{\\Delta n} \\) (\u0394n = moles gaseosos productos \u2013 reactivos)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Tabla de valores t\u00edpicos -->\r\n        <div class=\"table-wrapper\">\r\n            <table class=\"chem-table\">\r\n                <thead><tr><th>Valor de Kc<\/th><th>Interpretaci\u00f3n<\/th><th>Ejemplo<\/th><\/tr><\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr><td>&gt; 10\u00b3<\/td><td>Completa hacia productos<\/td><td>H\u2082 + Cl\u2082 \u21cc 2HCl (Kc \u2248 10\u00b3\u00b3)<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>10\u207b\u00b3 \u2013 10\u00b3<\/td><td>Equilibrio mixto<\/td><td>2H\u2082O \u21cc H\u2083O\u207a + OH\u207b (Kw = 10\u207b\u00b9\u2074)<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>&lt; 10\u207b\u00b3<\/td><td>Completa hacia reactivos<\/td><td>2NO\u2082 \u21cc N\u2082O\u2084 (Kc \u2248 10\u207b\u00b9)<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <h3 class=\"subsection-title\">\ud83d\udcd0 Principio de Le Chatelier<\/h3>\r\n        <p>Ante una perturbaci\u00f3n, el sistema se desplaza para contrarrestarla:<\/p>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><strong>Concentraci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Aumentar reactivos \u2192 desplaza a productos.<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Presi\u00f3n (gases):<\/strong> Aumentar presi\u00f3n \u2192 favorece el lado con menos moles gaseosos.<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Temperatura:<\/strong> Aumentar T \u2192 favorece la reacci\u00f3n endot\u00e9rmica.<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Catalizador:<\/strong> No altera el equilibrio, solo acelera su alcance.<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"ejemplo\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83c\udfed Ejemplo industrial: Proceso Haber-Bosch<\/h4>\r\n            <p>\\[ N_2(g) + 3H_2(g) \u21cc 2NH_3(g) \\quad \\Delta H = -92 \\text{ kJ\/mol} \\]<\/p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>\u0394n = \u20132 \u2192 alta presi\u00f3n (200 atm) favorece productos.<\/li>\r\n                <li>Exot\u00e9rmica \u2192 baja temperatura favorece productos, pero se usa T moderada (450\u00b0C) para velocidad aceptable.<\/li>\r\n                <li>Catalizador de hierro acelera la reacci\u00f3n.<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <h3 class=\"subsection-title\">\ud83c\udf21\ufe0f Relaci\u00f3n con termodin\u00e1mica<\/h3>\r\n        <p>\\[ \\Delta G^\\circ = -RT \\ln K \\]<\/p>\r\n        <p>Ecuaci\u00f3n de van't Hoff: \\[ \\ln\\left(\\frac{K_2}{K_1}\\right) = -\\frac{\\Delta H^\\circ}{R}\\left(\\frac{1}{T_2} - \\frac{1}{T_1}\\right) \\]<\/p>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO: LE CHATELIER ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulador-lechatelier\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\u2699\ufe0f<\/span> Simulador: Principio de Le Chatelier\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <p>Selecciona una perturbaci\u00f3n para la reacci\u00f3n N\u2082(g) + 3H\u2082(g) \u21cc 2NH\u2083(g). Observa el desplazamiento y la explicaci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"lechat-sim\">\r\n            <div class=\"control-panel\">\r\n                <select id=\"pertType\">\r\n                    <option value=\"conc\">Concentraci\u00f3n<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"press\">Presi\u00f3n<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"temp\">Temperatura<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n                <select id=\"pertDir\">\r\n                    <option value=\"increase\">Aumentar<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"decrease\">Disminuir<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n                <input id=\"pertSpec\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Especie (N2, H2, NH3) o 'Volumen'\">\r\n                <button onclick=\"simulateLeChatelier()\">Aplicar perturbaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"reaction-viz\">\r\n                <div class=\"react-side\">N\u2082 + 3H\u2082<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"arrow\" id=\"arrowViz\">\u21cc<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"prod-side\">2NH\u2083<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div id=\"shiftIndicator\" class=\"shift-display\"><\/div>\r\n            <div id=\"detailedExplain\" class=\"explain-box\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== SIMULADOR DE CONCENTRACIONES VS TIEMPO ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulador-tiempo\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udcc8<\/span> Evoluci\u00f3n de concentraciones hasta el equilibrio\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <p>Observa c\u00f3mo cambian [reactivos] (rojo) y [productos] (verde) con el tiempo.<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"time-sim\">\r\n            <canvas id=\"timeCanvas\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\"><\/canvas>\r\n            <div class=\"sim-controls\">\r\n                <label>Kc: <input type=\"range\" id=\"kcSlider\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"10\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"4\"><\/label>\r\n                <span id=\"kcValue\">4.0<\/span>\r\n                <button onclick=\"resetSimulation()\">Reiniciar<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== CALCULADORA ICE INTERACTIVA ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"ice-calculator\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83e\uddee<\/span> Tabla ICE interactiva\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <p>Para la reacci\u00f3n A + B \u21cc 2C, ingresa concentraciones iniciales y Kc para calcular el equilibrio.<\/p>\r\n        <ul class=\"ice-steps\">\r\n            <li><strong>Paso 1:<\/strong> Escribe el estado inicial ([A]\u2080, [B]\u2080, [C]\u2080).<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Paso 2:<\/strong> Asigna la variaci\u00f3n del cambio en equilibrio: A y B -x, C +2x.<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Paso 3:<\/strong> Resuelve usando Kc y sustituye el valor hallado.<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Paso 4:<\/strong> Verifica que las concentraciones en equilibrio sean positivas y consistentes.<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <div class=\"ice-panel\">\r\n            <div class=\"ice-inputs\">\r\n                <label>[A]\u2080: <input type=\"number\" id=\"initA\" value=\"1.0\" step=\"0.1\"><\/label> M\r\n                <label>[B]\u2080: <input type=\"number\" id=\"initB\" value=\"1.0\" step=\"0.1\"><\/label> M\r\n                <label>[C]\u2080: <input type=\"number\" id=\"initC\" value=\"0\" step=\"0.1\"><\/label> M\r\n                <label>Kc: <input type=\"number\" id=\"kcIce\" value=\"4.0\" step=\"0.1\"><\/label>\r\n                <button onclick=\"runIce()\">Calcular equilibrio<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <table class=\"chem-table\" id=\"iceTable\">\r\n                <thead><tr><th><\/th><th>[A]<\/th><th>[B]<\/th><th>[2C]<\/th><\/tr><\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr><td>Inicial<\/td><td id=\"iA\">-<\/td><td id=\"iB\">-<\/td><td id=\"iC\">-<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>Cambio<\/td><td id=\"cA\">-<\/td><td id=\"cB\">-<\/td><td id=\"cC\">-<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td>Equilibrio<\/td><td id=\"eA\">-<\/td><td id=\"eB\">-<\/td><td id=\"eC\">-<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n            <div id=\"iceResult\" class=\"result-box\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== CALCULADORA Kc \/ Kp ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"calc-kckp\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udd22<\/span> C\u00e1lculo de Kc y Kp (SO\u2082 + O\u2082 \u21cc SO\u2083)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"calc-panel\">\r\n            <label>[SO\u2082]: <input type=\"number\" id=\"so2\" value=\"0.1\" step=\"0.01\"><\/label> M\r\n            <label>[O\u2082]: <input type=\"number\" id=\"o2\" value=\"0.1\" step=\"0.01\"><\/label> M\r\n            <label>[SO\u2083]: <input type=\"number\" id=\"so3\" value=\"0.5\" step=\"0.01\"><\/label> M\r\n            <label>T (K): <input type=\"number\" id=\"tempK\" value=\"298\"><\/label>\r\n            <button onclick=\"calcKcKp()\">Calcular Kc y Kp<\/button>\r\n            <div id=\"kcKpResult\" class=\"result-box\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== ERRORES COMUNES INTERACTIVOS ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-comunes\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> Errores comunes (\u00a1ev\u00edtalos!)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('expandido')\">\r\n                <strong>\u274c Confundir equilibrio est\u00e1tico con din\u00e1mico<\/strong>\r\n                <div class=\"error-detail\">En equilibrio, las reacciones contin\u00faan a nivel molecular; solo las concentraciones netas se mantienen constantes.<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('expandido')\">\r\n                <strong>\u274c Ignorar \u0394n en conversi\u00f3n Kc \u2194 Kp<\/strong>\r\n                <div class=\"error-detail\">Recuerda: Kp = Kc (RT)^\u0394n. \u0394n = (moles productos gaseosos) \u2013 (moles reactivos gaseosos).<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('expandido')\">\r\n                <strong>\u274c Usar moles en lugar de concentraciones o presiones<\/strong>\r\n                <div class=\"error-detail\">Kc usa molaridad (mol\/L), Kp usa presiones parciales (atm).<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('expandido')\">\r\n                <strong>\u274c Pensar que catalizador altera K<\/strong>\r\n                <div class=\"error-detail\">El catalizador acelera ambas direcciones por igual, no cambia la posici\u00f3n de equilibrio.<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== CONEXI\u00d3N CURRICULAR ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"curricular\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udcd8<\/span> V\u00ednculo con el programa oficial\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"curricular-content\">\r\n            <p><strong>Competencias:<\/strong> Aplica el principio de Le Chatelier y la constante de equilibrio para predecir y calcular cambios en sistemas qu\u00edmicos.<\/p>\r\n            <p><strong>Contenidos:<\/strong> Equilibrio qu\u00edmico, constante Kc y Kp, tabla ICE, influencia de temperatura, presi\u00f3n y concentraci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n            <p><strong>Evaluaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> C\u00e1lculos de concentraciones de equilibrio, interpretaci\u00f3n de K, an\u00e1lisis de desplazamientos en procesos industriales.<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"problemas-examen\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> Problemas tipo examen\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"problema-lista\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-item\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 1<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Para H\u2082(g) + I\u2082(g) \u21cc 2HI(g), Kc = 50 a 700 K. Si [H\u2082]\u2080 = 0.1 M, [I\u2082]\u2080 = 0.1 M, [HI]\u2080 = 0, calcula las concentraciones en equilibrio.<\/p>\r\n                <button onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                <div id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display:none;\">[HI] = 0.14 M, [H\u2082] = [I\u2082] = 0.03 M. (Resolviendo cuadr\u00e1tica)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-item\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 2<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Explica por qu\u00e9 en el proceso de contacto (2SO\u2082 + O\u2082 \u21cc 2SO\u2083, exot\u00e9rmico) se usan temperaturas moderadas y presi\u00f3n elevada.<\/p>\r\n                <button onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(2)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                <div id=\"solucion2\" style=\"display:none;\">Alta presi\u00f3n favorece productos (\u0394n = \u20131). Temperatura moderada balancea rendimiento (exot\u00e9rmico) con velocidad de reacci\u00f3n.<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-item\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 3<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Para N\u2082O\u2084(g) \u21cc 2NO\u2082(g), Kp = 0.25 a 25\u00b0C. Si la presi\u00f3n total en equilibrio es 1 atm, calcula la presi\u00f3n parcial de NO\u2082.<\/p>\r\n                <button onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(3)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                <div id=\"solucion3\" style=\"display:none;\">P_NO\u2082 = 0.5 atm, P_N\u2082O\u2084 = 0.5 atm. (Soluci\u00f3n de Kp = P_NO\u2082\u00b2 \/ P_N\u2082O\u2084)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== QUIZ AUTOEVALUADO ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-autoevaluado\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> Quiz de autoevaluaci\u00f3n\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n                <p><strong>1.<\/strong> En el equilibrio qu\u00edmico, las concentraciones:<\/p>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"a\"> a) Son iguales<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"b\"> b) Permanecen constantes en el tiempo<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"c\"> c) Fluct\u00faan aleatoriamente<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n                <p><strong>2.<\/strong> Si Kc > 1, el equilibrio favorece:<\/p>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"a\"> a) Reactivos<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"b\"> b) Productos<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"c\"> c) No se puede determinar<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n                <p><strong>3.<\/strong> Para la reacci\u00f3n N\u2082(g) + 3H\u2082(g) \u21cc 2NH\u2083(g), un aumento de presi\u00f3n desplaza el equilibrio hacia:<\/p>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"a\"> a) Reactivos<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"b\"> b) Productos<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"c\"> c) No afecta<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\">\r\n                <p><strong>4.<\/strong> La relaci\u00f3n entre Kp y Kc es:<\/p>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q4\" value=\"a\"> a) Kp = Kc (RT)^\u0394n<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q4\" value=\"b\"> b) Kp = Kc \/ (RT)^\u0394n<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q4\" value=\"c\"> c) Kp = Kc<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button onclick=\"evaluateQuiz()\">\ud83d\udcca Corregir quiz<\/button>\r\n            <div id=\"quizResult\" class=\"quiz-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ==================== CIERRE METACOGNITIVO ==================== -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo\">\r\n            <span class=\"neon-bullet\">\ud83e\udd14<\/span> Reflexi\u00f3n y autoevaluaci\u00f3n\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"reflexion-box\">\r\n            <p><strong>Reflexiona sobre tu aprendizaje:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo el concepto de equilibrio din\u00e1mico cambia tu visi\u00f3n de las reacciones qu\u00edmicas?<\/li>\r\n                <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 aplicaciones reales del principio de Le Chatelier observas en tu entorno?<\/li>\r\n                <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategias utilizar\u00e1s para resolver problemas con tablas ICE en ex\u00e1menes?<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <textarea rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Escribe aqu\u00ed tu reflexi\u00f3n...\"><\/textarea>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"eval-sliders\">\r\n                <div class=\"eval-item\">\r\n                    <span>Comprensi\u00f3n de equilibrio y K<\/span>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" id=\"eval1\" oninput=\"updateEval(1,this.value)\">\r\n                    <span id=\"evalVal1\">3\/5<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"eval-item\">\r\n                    <span>Aplicaci\u00f3n de Le Chatelier<\/span>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" id=\"eval2\" oninput=\"updateEval(2,this.value)\">\r\n                    <span id=\"evalVal2\">3\/5<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"eval-item\">\r\n                    <span>C\u00e1lculos ICE y conversiones<\/span>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" id=\"eval3\" oninput=\"updateEval(3,this.value)\">\r\n                    <span id=\"evalVal3\">3\/5<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\ud83d\udcbe Guardar autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n            <div id=\"autoEvalFeedback\" class=\"auto-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 Recursos adicionales<\/h3>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/science\/chemistry\/chemical-equilibrium\" target=\"_blank\">Khan Academy: Equilibrio qu\u00edmico<\/a><\/li>\r\n                <li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.chemguide.co.uk\/physical\/equilibria\/lechatelier.html\" target=\"_blank\">Chemguide: Le Chatelier<\/a><\/li>\r\n                <li><a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulations\/reversible-reactions\" target=\"_blank\">PhET: Reacciones reversibles<\/a><\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ==================== JAVASCRIPT INTERACTIVO ==================== -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ==================== SIMULADOR LE CHATELIER ====================\r\nfunction simulateLeChatelier() {\r\n    const type = document.getElementById('pertType').value;\r\n    const dir = document.getElementById('pertDir').value;\r\n    const spec = document.getElementById('pertSpec').value.toUpperCase();\r\n    const arrow = document.getElementById('arrowViz');\r\n    const indicator = document.getElementById('shiftIndicator');\r\n    const explain = document.getElementById('detailedExplain');\r\n    let shift = '';\r\n    let reason = '';\r\n    if (type === 'conc') {\r\n        if (spec === 'N2' || spec === 'H2') {\r\n            shift = dir === 'increase' ? 'derecha' : 'izquierda';\r\n            reason = `Al ${dir} [reactivo], el equilibrio se desplaza hacia ${shift === 'derecha' ? 'productos' : 'reactivos'}.`;\r\n        } else if (spec === 'NH3') {\r\n            shift = dir === 'increase' ? 'izquierda' : 'derecha';\r\n            reason = `Al ${dir} [producto], el equilibrio se desplaza hacia ${shift === 'derecha' ? 'productos' : 'reactivos'}.`;\r\n        } else {\r\n            reason = 'Especifica N2, H2 o NH3 para concentraci\u00f3n.';\r\n        }\r\n    } else if (type === 'press') {\r\n        if (dir === 'increase') {\r\n            shift = 'derecha';\r\n            reason = 'Aumento de presi\u00f3n favorece el lado con menos moles (productos: 2 vs 4).';\r\n        } else {\r\n            shift = 'izquierda';\r\n            reason = 'Disminuci\u00f3n de presi\u00f3n favorece el lado con m\u00e1s moles (reactivos).';\r\n        }\r\n    } else if (type === 'temp') {\r\n        if (dir === 'increase') {\r\n            shift = 'izquierda';\r\n            reason = 'Reacci\u00f3n exot\u00e9rmica: aumentar temperatura favorece la endot\u00e9rmica (reactivos).';\r\n        } else {\r\n            shift = 'derecha';\r\n            reason = 'Disminuir temperatura favorece la exot\u00e9rmica (productos).';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    if (shift) {\r\n        arrow.style.transform = shift === 'derecha' ? 'scaleX(1.2)' : 'scaleX(0.8)';\r\n        indicator.textContent = `Desplazamiento \u2192 ${shift === 'derecha' ? 'Productos' : 'Reactivos'}`;\r\n        indicator.style.color = shift === 'derecha' ? '#39ff14' : '#ff6b6b';\r\n        explain.textContent = reason;\r\n    } else {\r\n        arrow.style.transform = 'scaleX(1)';\r\n        indicator.textContent = 'Equilibrio sin cambio';\r\n        indicator.style.color = '#ffff00';\r\n        explain.textContent = reason || 'Perturbaci\u00f3n no v\u00e1lida.';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== SIMULADOR DE CONCENTRACIONES VS TIEMPO ====================\r\nlet animationId = null;\r\nlet time = 0;\r\nlet running = true;\r\nconst canvas = document.getElementById('timeCanvas');\r\nconst ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\r\nconst kcSlider = document.getElementById('kcSlider');\r\nconst kcValue = document.getElementById('kcValue');\r\nfunction drawGraph() {\r\n    if (!canvas) return;\r\n    const width = canvas.width, height = canvas.height;\r\n    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\r\n    \/\/ Dibujar ejes\r\n    ctx.strokeStyle = '#444';\r\n    ctx.beginPath();\r\n    ctx.moveTo(50, 20); ctx.lineTo(50, height-30); ctx.lineTo(width-30, height-30);\r\n    ctx.stroke();\r\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#e0f0ff';\r\n    ctx.fillText('Tiempo', width-50, height-10);\r\n    ctx.save();\r\n    ctx.translate(20, 120);\r\n    ctx.rotate(-Math.PI\/2);\r\n    ctx.fillText('Concentraci\u00f3n', 0, 0);\r\n    ctx.restore();\r\n    \/\/ Calcular concentraciones en funci\u00f3n del tiempo (modelo exponencial)\r\n    const kc = parseFloat(kcSlider.value);\r\n    kcValue.textContent = kc;\r\n    const A0 = 1.0, B0 = 1.0, C0 = 0.0;\r\n    \/\/ Simulamos evoluci\u00f3n: C(t) = A0 * (1 - exp(-k*t))? mejor usar modelo simplificado\r\n    \/\/ Usamos una funci\u00f3n log\u00edstica para alcanzar equilibrio: [C]eq = sqrt(kc * [A]eq * [B]eq) pero con A=B simplificado.\r\n    \/\/ Para simplificar, asumimos A y B iguales y resolvemos cuadr\u00e1tica para equilibrio.\r\n    const x_eq = ( -kc + Math.sqrt(kc*kc + 4*kc*A0) ) \/ (2); \/\/ para A0 = B0, C0=0\r\n    const Ceq = 2*x_eq;\r\n    const Aeq = A0 - x_eq;\r\n    const Beq = B0 - x_eq;\r\n    const tau = 0.5; \/\/ constante de tiempo\r\n    let t = Math.min(time, 10);\r\n    let A = A0 - (A0 - Aeq) * (1 - Math.exp(-t\/tau));\r\n    let B = B0 - (B0 - Beq) * (1 - Math.exp(-t\/tau));\r\n    let C = C0 + (Ceq - C0) * (1 - Math.exp(-t\/tau));\r\n    if (t > 10) { A = Aeq; B = Beq; C = Ceq; }\r\n    \/\/ Dibujar curvas\r\n    ctx.beginPath();\r\n    for (let x = 0; x <= 10; x+=0.05) {\r\n        let tt = x;\r\n        let AA = A0 - (A0 - Aeq) * (1 - Math.exp(-tt\/tau));\r\n        let BB = B0 - (B0 - Beq) * (1 - Math.exp(-tt\/tau));\r\n        let CC = C0 + (Ceq - C0) * (1 - Math.exp(-tt\/tau));\r\n        let px = 50 + (x\/10)*(width-80);\r\n        let pyA = height-30 - (AA\/1.5)*(height-50);\r\n        let pyC = height-30 - (CC\/1.5)*(height-50);\r\n        if (x===0) {\r\n            ctx.moveTo(px, pyA);\r\n        } else {\r\n            ctx.lineTo(px, pyA);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    ctx.strokeStyle = '#ff6b6b';\r\n    ctx.stroke();\r\n    ctx.beginPath();\r\n    for (let x = 0; x <= 10; x+=0.05) {\r\n        let tt = x;\r\n        let AA = A0 - (A0 - Aeq) * (1 - Math.exp(-tt\/tau));\r\n        let BB = B0 - (B0 - Beq) * (1 - Math.exp(-tt\/tau));\r\n        let CC = C0 + (Ceq - C0) * (1 - Math.exp(-tt\/tau));\r\n        let px = 50 + (x\/10)*(width-80);\r\n        let pyC = height-30 - (CC\/1.5)*(height-50);\r\n        if (x===0) ctx.moveTo(px, pyC);\r\n        else ctx.lineTo(px, pyC);\r\n    }\r\n    ctx.strokeStyle = '#51cf66';\r\n    ctx.stroke();\r\n    \/\/ Leyenda\r\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#ff6b6b';\r\n    ctx.fillRect(width-100, 20, 15, 15);\r\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#e0f0ff';\r\n    ctx.fillText('Reactivos', width-80, 32);\r\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#51cf66';\r\n    ctx.fillRect(width-100, 45, 15, 15);\r\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#e0f0ff';\r\n    ctx.fillText('Productos', width-80, 57);\r\n}\r\nfunction animateTime() {\r\n    if (!running) return;\r\n    time += 0.05;\r\n    if (time > 12) time = 12;\r\n    drawGraph();\r\n    animationId = requestAnimationFrame(animateTime);\r\n}\r\nfunction resetSimulation() {\r\n    time = 0;\r\n    drawGraph();\r\n}\r\nkcSlider.addEventListener('input', () => {\r\n    resetSimulation();\r\n});\r\nanimateTime();\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== TABLA ICE ====================\r\nfunction runIce() {\r\n    const initA = parseFloat(document.getElementById('initA').value);\r\n    const initB = parseFloat(document.getElementById('initB').value);\r\n    const initC = parseFloat(document.getElementById('initC').value);\r\n    const kc = parseFloat(document.getElementById('kcIce').value);\r\n    if (isNaN(initA) || isNaN(initB) || isNaN(initC) || isNaN(kc)) {\r\n        document.getElementById('iceResult').innerHTML = '\u274c Valores inv\u00e1lidos.';\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n    \/\/ Resolver cuadr\u00e1tica: Kc = (2x)^2 \/ ((A0-x)(B0-x))\r\n    const a = 4;\r\n    const b = -2*kc*(initA + initB);\r\n    const c = kc*initA*initB - Math.pow(initC, 2);\r\n    let x = (-b - Math.sqrt(b*b - 4*a*c)) \/ (2*a);\r\n    if (isNaN(x) || x < 0 || x > Math.min(initA, initB)) {\r\n        x = (-b + Math.sqrt(b*b - 4*a*c)) \/ (2*a);\r\n    }\r\n    document.getElementById('iA').textContent = initA.toFixed(2);\r\n    document.getElementById('iB').textContent = initB.toFixed(2);\r\n    document.getElementById('iC').textContent = initC.toFixed(2);\r\n    document.getElementById('cA').textContent = `- ${x.toFixed(2)}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('cB').textContent = `- ${x.toFixed(2)}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('cC').textContent = `+ ${(2*x).toFixed(2)}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('eA').textContent = (initA - x).toFixed(2);\r\n    document.getElementById('eB').textContent = (initB - x).toFixed(2);\r\n    document.getElementById('eC').textContent = (initC + 2*x).toFixed(2);\r\n    const kcCalc = Math.pow(initC + 2*x, 2) \/ ((initA - x)*(initB - x));\r\n    document.getElementById('iceResult').innerHTML = `<strong>x = ${x.toFixed(2)}<\/strong><br>Kc calculada: ${kcCalc.toFixed(2)} (esperada: ${kc})`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== C\u00c1LCULO Kc \/ Kp ====================\r\nfunction calcKcKp() {\r\n    const so2 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('so2').value);\r\n    const o2 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('o2').value);\r\n    const so3 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('so3').value);\r\n    const T = parseFloat(document.getElementById('tempK').value);\r\n    if (isNaN(so2) || isNaN(o2) || isNaN(so3) || isNaN(T)) {\r\n        document.getElementById('kcKpResult').innerHTML = '\u274c Valores inv\u00e1lidos.';\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n    const kc = Math.pow(so3, 2) \/ (Math.pow(so2, 2) * o2);\r\n    const deltaN = 2 - (2 + 1); \/\/ = -1\r\n    const R = 0.0821;\r\n    const kp = kc * Math.pow(R * T, deltaN);\r\n    document.getElementById('kcKpResult').innerHTML = `<strong>Kc = ${kc.toFixed(2)}<\/strong><br><strong>Kp = ${kp.toFixed(2)}<\/strong><br><small>\u0394n = ${deltaN}<\/small>`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== QUIZ ====================\r\nfunction evaluateQuiz() {\r\n    let score = 0;\r\n    if (document.querySelector('input[name=\"q1\"]:checked')?.value === \"b\") score++;\r\n    if (document.querySelector('input[name=\"q2\"]:checked')?.value === \"b\") score++;\r\n    if (document.querySelector('input[name=\"q3\"]:checked')?.value === \"b\") score++;\r\n    if (document.querySelector('input[name=\"q4\"]:checked')?.value === \"a\") score++;\r\n    const resultDiv = document.getElementById('quizResult');\r\n    if (score === 4) resultDiv.innerHTML = '<span class=\"success\">\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! 4\/4. Dominas el equilibrio qu\u00edmico.<\/span>';\r\n    else resultDiv.innerHTML = `<span class=\"error\">\ud83d\udcd8 Tienes ${score}\/4. Revisa la teor\u00eda y los simuladores.<\/span>`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N ====================\r\nfunction updateEval(num, val) {\r\n    document.getElementById(`evalVal${num}`).innerText = val + \"\/5\";\r\n}\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const v1 = document.getElementById('eval1').value;\r\n    const v2 = document.getElementById('eval2').value;\r\n    const v3 = document.getElementById('eval3').value;\r\n    const promedio = ((parseInt(v1)+parseInt(v2)+parseInt(v3))\/3).toFixed(1);\r\n    document.getElementById('autoEvalFeedback').innerHTML = `\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada. Promedio: ${promedio}\/5. \u00a1Sigue mejorando!`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==================== SOLUCIONES PROBLEMAS ====================\r\nfunction mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n    const div = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n    if (div.style.display === \"none\") div.style.display = \"block\";\r\n    else div.style.display = \"none\";\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar simuladores\r\nsimulateLeChatelier();\r\nrunIce();\r\ncalcKcKp();\r\n<\/script>\r\n","quiz":[{"pregunta":"La primera ley dice que la energ\u00eda...","opciones":["Se crea","Se destruye","Se transforma","Desaparece"],"correcta":"Se transforma"},{"pregunta":"La segunda ley involucra aumento de...","opciones":["Orden","Entrop\u00eda","Masa","Velocidad"],"correcta":"Entrop\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"En ecosistemas, la energ\u00eda se pierde como...","opciones":["Luz","Calor","Sonido","Materia"],"correcta":"Calor"},{"pregunta":"Ley que explica cadenas tr\u00f3ficas cortas","opciones":["Primera","Segunda","Tercera","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Segunda"},{"pregunta":"Solo ___% pasa al siguiente nivel","opciones":["50%","25%","10%","1%"],"correcta":"10%"},{"pregunta":"Fotos\u00edntesis transforma energ\u00eda...","opciones":["Qu\u00edmica \u2192 luz","Luz \u2192 qu\u00edmica","Calor \u2192 movimiento","Sonido \u2192 qu\u00edmica"],"correcta":"Luz \u2192 qu\u00edmica"},{"pregunta":"La entrop\u00eda mide...","opciones":["Orden","Desorden","Temperatura","Ox\u00edgeno"],"correcta":"Desorden"},{"pregunta":"De 1000 J en plantas, el herb\u00edvoro recibe...","opciones":["1000 J","500 J","100 J","10 J"],"correcta":"100 J"},{"pregunta":"La energ\u00eda perdida en respiraci\u00f3n es...","opciones":["Luz","Calor","Sonido","Materia"],"correcta":"Calor"},{"pregunta":"Ley que permite que el sol sostenga vida","opciones":["Primera","Segunda","Ambas","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Ambas"},{"pregunta":"Los descomponedores liberan energ\u00eda como...","opciones":["Luz","Calor","Sonido","Electricidad"],"correcta":"Calor"},{"pregunta":"La regla del 10% se basa en la...","opciones":["Primera ley","Segunda ley","F\u00edsica cu\u00e1ntica","Herencia"],"correcta":"Segunda ley"},{"pregunta":"Un carn\u00edvoro secundario recibe ___ de la energ\u00eda inicial","opciones":["10%","1%","0.1%","100%"],"correcta":"1%"},{"pregunta":"Glucosa \u2192 m\u00fasculos produce...","opciones":["Luz","Movimiento","Sonido","Iones"],"correcta":"Movimiento"},{"pregunta":"La primera ley tambi\u00e9n se llama...","opciones":["Ley de entrop\u00eda","Ley de conservaci\u00f3n","Ley del desorden","Ley metab\u00f3lica"],"correcta":"Ley de conservaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"La energ\u00eda fluye en direcci\u00f3n...","opciones":["C\u00edclica","Bidireccional","Unidireccional","Circular"],"correcta":"Unidireccional"},{"pregunta":"La energ\u00eda de excrementos la usan...","opciones":["Plantas","Descomponedores","Herb\u00edvoros","Carn\u00edvoros"],"correcta":"Descomponedores"},{"pregunta":"La eficiencia energ\u00e9tica siempre es...","opciones":["100%","50%","<100%","0%"],"correcta":"<100%"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e1xima entrop\u00eda significa...","opciones":["Orden total","Desorden total","Equilibrio qu\u00edmico","Oxigenaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Desorden total"},{"pregunta":"La energ\u00eda que sale del ecosistema es...","opciones":["Luz","Calor","Materia","Sonido"],"correcta":"Calor"},{"pregunta":"Ley que permite existencia de vida","opciones":["Primera","Segunda","Ambas","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Ambas"},{"pregunta":"Sin segunda ley, las cadenas ser\u00edan...","opciones":["Cortas","Largas","Inestables","Circulares"],"correcta":"Largas"},{"pregunta":"La energ\u00eda en un cad\u00e1ver se vuelve...","opciones":["Luz","Calor","Sonido","Electricidad"],"correcta":"Calor"},{"pregunta":"La energ\u00eda total del universo es...","opciones":["Creciente","Decreciente","Constante","Cero"],"correcta":"Constante"},{"pregunta":"El 90% de la energ\u00eda se pierde como...","opciones":["Luz","Calor","Biomasa","Materia"],"correcta":"Calor"},{"pregunta":"La energ\u00eda solar entra como...","opciones":["Calor","Luz","Qu\u00edmica","El\u00e9ctrica"],"correcta":"Luz"},{"pregunta":"Un ejemplo de entrop\u00eda biol\u00f3gica es...","opciones":["Crecimiento","Calor corporal","Fotos\u00edntesis","Nado"],"correcta":"Calor corporal"},{"pregunta":"La energ\u00eda \u00fatil disminuye por...","opciones":["Fotos\u00edntesis","Entrop\u00eda","Consumo","Evaporaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Entrop\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"El flujo energ\u00e9tico siempre termina en...","opciones":["Luz","Calor","Materia","Ox\u00edgeno"],"correcta":"Calor"},{"pregunta":"Ley que garantiza balance energ\u00e9tico universal","opciones":["Primera","Segunda","Tercera","Cero"],"correcta":"Primera"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"anti-nutrientes-master","titulo":"Antinutrientes: Ingenier\u00eda Qu\u00edmica de las Defensas Vegetales y su Bioqu\u00edmica Aplicada","contenido":"<!-- ======================================== -->\r\n<!-- CIBERQU\u00cdMICA: ANTINUTRIENTES MASTER      -->\r\n<!-- ESTILO: CYBERPUNK BIOQU\u00cdMICO RETRO       -->\r\n<!-- ======================================== -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"chem-cyber-container\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA TERMINAL -->\r\n    <div class=\"cyber-header\">\r\n        <div class=\"terminal-line\">\r\n            <span class=\"prompt\">><\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"command\">LOAD ANTINUTRIENTS.EXE<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"cursor\">\u2588<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"system-status\">\r\n            <span class=\"status-tag chemistry\">CHEMISTRY<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"status-tag biochem\">BIOCHEM<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"status-tag nutrition\">NUTRITION<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"blink\">SYSTEM READY<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- T\u00cdTULO CON GLITCH -->\r\n    <h1 class=\"cyber-title\">\r\n        <span class=\"glitch\" data-text=\"ANTINUTRIENTES\">ANTINUTRIENTES<\/span>\r\n        <br>\r\n        <span class=\"subtitle\">BIOQU\u00cdMICA DE LA DEFENSA VEGETAL<\/span>\r\n    <\/h1>\r\n\r\n    <!-- INTRO HOLOGR\u00c1FICA -->\r\n    <div class=\"hologram-intro\">\r\n        <div class=\"holo-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"holo-cell\">\r\n                <div class=\"holo-value\" id=\"absorptionIndex\">78%<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"holo-label\">BIOAVAIL<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"holo-cell\">\r\n                <div class=\"holo-value\">6<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"holo-label\">CLASSES<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"holo-cell\">\r\n                <div class=\"holo-value\">12<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"holo-label\">MECHANISMS<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"holo-cell\">\r\n                <div class=\"holo-value\">4<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"holo-label\">CONTROLS<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <p class=\"holo-text\">\r\n            >> LOS ANTINUTRIENTES SON <span class=\"highlight\">METABOLITOS SECUNDARIOS ESTRAT\u00c9GICOS<\/span>\r\n            <br>>> UTILIZAN QUELACI\u00d3N, PRECIPITACI\u00d3N E INHIBICI\u00d3N ENZIM\u00c1TICA\r\n            <br>>> SISTEMA DE DEFENSA EVOLUCIONADO POR 400 MILLONES DE A\u00d1OS\r\n        <\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"chem-notice\">\r\n        <p>\ud83d\udcce Consejo de Estudio: activa <strong>GERMINACI\u00d3N<\/strong> o <strong>FERMENTACI\u00d3N<\/strong> para reducir antinutrientes en plantas.<\/p>\r\n        <p>\ud83d\udccc Estad\u00edstica en vivo: los cambios en los controles de simulaci\u00f3n (pH, Vit C, fermentaci\u00f3n, remojo) ya se reflejan en la barra de minerales.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 1: ARQUITECTURA QU\u00cdMICA -->\r\n    <div class=\"cyber-section\">\r\n        <h2><span class=\"section-number\">[01]<\/span> ARQUITECTURA MOLECULAR<\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"molecule-card-grid\">\r\n            <!-- FITATO -->\r\n            <div class=\"molecule-card fitato\">\r\n                <div class=\"mol-header\">\r\n                    <h3>FITATO<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"mol-formula\">C\u2086H\u2081\u2088O\u2082\u2084P\u2086<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"mol-structure\">\r\n                    <pre class=\"ascii-art\">\r\n     O    O    O\r\n    \/\/\\  \/\/\\  \/\/\\\r\n   P-O- P-O- P-O-\r\n    \\\\\/  \\\\\/  \\\\\/\r\n     O    O    O\r\n    \/ \\  \/ \\  \/ \\\r\n   INOSITOL RING\r\n                    <\/pre>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"mol-stats\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat\">\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-label\">SITIOS ACTIVOS:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">12<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat\">\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-label\">AFINIDAD:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat\">\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-label\">K<sub>quel<\/sub>:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">10\u00b9\u2078<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"mol-mechanism\">\r\n                    <strong>MECANISMO:<\/strong> Quelaci\u00f3n hexagonal de cationes\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- OXALATO -->\r\n            <div class=\"molecule-card oxalato\">\r\n                <div class=\"mol-header\">\r\n                    <h3>OXALATO<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"mol-formula\">C\u2082O\u2084\u00b2\u207b<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"mol-structure\">\r\n                    <pre class=\"ascii-art\">\r\n     O     O\r\n    \/\/     \\\\\r\n   C        C\r\n    \\\\     \/\/\r\n     O     O\r\n      \\   \/\r\n       Ca\u00b2\u207a\r\n                    <\/pre>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"mol-stats\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat\">\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-label\">K<sub>ps<\/sub>:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">2.3\u00d710\u207b\u2079<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat\">\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-label\">RIESGO:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value danger\">NEFROLITIASIS<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- TANINO -->\r\n            <div class=\"molecule-card tanino\">\r\n                <div class=\"mol-header\">\r\n                    <h3>TANINO<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"mol-formula\">C\u2087\u2086H\u2085\u2082O\u2084\u2086<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"mol-structure\">\r\n                    <pre class=\"ascii-art\">\r\n   OH OH   OH OH\r\n    | |     | |\r\n   AROMATIC CORE\r\n    | |     | |\r\n   OH OH   OH OH\r\n   PROTEIN BINDING\r\n                    <\/pre>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"mol-stats\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat\">\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-label\">PUENTES H:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">8-12<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat\">\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-label\">EFECTO:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">PRECIPITACI\u00d3N<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- ECUACIONES QU\u00cdMICAS -->\r\n        <div class=\"reaction-display\">\r\n            <div class=\"reaction-equation\">\r\n                <div class=\"reagent\">Fitato\u2076\u207b + 6Ca\u00b2\u207a<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"arrow\">\u2192<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"product\">[Ca\u2086-Fitato]\u2193<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"reaction-info\">K = 10\u00b2\u00b3 M\u207b\u2076<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"reaction-equation\">\r\n                <div class=\"reagent\">Oxalato\u00b2\u207b + Ca\u00b2\u207a<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"arrow\">\u2192<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"product\">CaC\u2082O\u2084(s)<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"reaction-info\">Kps = 2.3\u00d710\u207b\u2079<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR AVANZADO: CIN\u00c9TICA DE QUELACI\u00d3N -->\r\n    <div class=\"cyber-section\">\r\n        <h2><span class=\"section-number\">[02]<\/span> SIMULADOR DE CIN\u00c9TICA<\/h2>\r\n        <p class=\"section-subtitle\">>> AJUSTA PAR\u00c1METROS BIOQU\u00cdMICOS EN TIEMPO REAL<\/p>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-grid\">\r\n            <!-- CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"control-panel\">\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label>pH INTESTINAL<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"7\" id=\"simPH\" class=\"cyber-slider\">\r\n                    <div class=\"value-display\" id=\"phValue\">7.0<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label>VITAMINA C (mg)<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"200\" step=\"10\" value=\"0\" id=\"simVitC\" class=\"cyber-slider\">\r\n                    <div class=\"value-display\" id=\"vitcValue\">0 mg<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label>TIEMPO FERMENTACI\u00d3N<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"72\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" id=\"simFerment\" class=\"cyber-slider\">\r\n                    <div class=\"value-display\" id=\"fermentValue\">0h<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label>REMOCI\u00d3N (SOAK)<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"24\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" id=\"simSoak\" class=\"cyber-slider\">\r\n                    <div class=\"value-display\" id=\"soakValue\">0h<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"visualization-panel\">\r\n                <div class=\"mineral-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"mineral\" id=\"minFe\">\r\n                        <div class=\"mineral-icon\">Fe<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"mineral-name\">HIERRO<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"mineral-value\" id=\"feValue\">15%<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"mineral-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"bar-fill\" id=\"feBar\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"mineral\" id=\"minCa\">\r\n                        <div class=\"mineral-icon\">Ca<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"mineral-name\">CALCIO<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"mineral-value\" id=\"caValue\">25%<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"mineral-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"bar-fill\" id=\"caBar\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"mineral\" id=\"minZn\">\r\n                        <div class=\"mineral-icon\">Zn<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"mineral-name\">ZINC<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"mineral-value\" id=\"znValue\">30%<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"mineral-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"bar-fill\" id=\"znBar\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"sim-log\" id=\"simLog\">\r\n                    > SISTEMA INICIALIZADO\r\n                    > PAR\u00c1METROS POR DEFECTO CARGADOS\r\n                    > AJUSTA LOS CONTROLES PARA SIMULAR\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- ESTAD\u00cdSTICAS -->\r\n        <div class=\"stats-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"stat-box\">\r\n                <div class=\"stat-title\">FITATOS ACTIVOS<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statFitatos\">100%<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-bar\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-fill\" id=\"fitatoBar\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"stat-box\">\r\n                <div class=\"stat-title\">BIODISPONIBILIDAD<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statBio\">BAJA<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-bar\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-fill\" id=\"bioBar\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"stat-box\">\r\n                <div class=\"stat-title\">EFICIENCIA REDOX<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statRedox\">0%<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-bar\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-fill\" id=\"redoxBar\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ANIMACI\u00d3N MOLECULAR SVG -->\r\n    <div class=\"cyber-section\">\r\n        <h2><span class=\"section-number\">[03]<\/span> DIN\u00c1MICA MOLECULAR<\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"molecular-animation\">\r\n            <svg width=\"600\" height=\"300\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 300\" class=\"molecule-svg\">\r\n                <!-- FITATO -->\r\n                <g id=\"phytate\">\r\n                    <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"150\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#0ff\" opacity=\"0.3\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"35;45;35\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"100\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0ff\" font-weight=\"bold\">FITATO<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- Grupos fosfato -->\r\n                    <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"120\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#ff0\"\/>\r\n                    <circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"120\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#ff0\"\/>\r\n                    <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"180\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#ff0\"\/>\r\n                    <circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"180\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#ff0\"\/>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n\r\n                <!-- MINERALES -->\r\n                <g id=\"minerals\">\r\n                    <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"100\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#f0f\" id=\"feAtom\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"100;150;100\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"400\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\">Fe\u00b3\u207a<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"150\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#0ff\" id=\"caAtom\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"150;100;150\" dur=\"2.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"450\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\">Ca\u00b2\u207a<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <circle cx=\"500\" cy=\"200\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#ff0\" id=\"znAtom\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"200;150;200\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"500\" y=\"205\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\">Zn\u00b2\u207a<\/text>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n\r\n                <!-- L\u00cdNEAS DE INTERACCI\u00d3N -->\r\n                <line id=\"lineFe\" x1=\"140\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"385\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#f0f\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\">\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"0;20\" dur=\"1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <\/line>\r\n                <line id=\"lineCa\" x1=\"140\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"435\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#0ff\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\">\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"10;0\" dur=\"1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <\/line>\r\n                <line id=\"lineZn\" x1=\"140\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"485\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#ff0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\">\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"0;15\" dur=\"1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <\/line>\r\n\r\n                <!-- ZONA DE QUELACI\u00d3N -->\r\n                <rect x=\"250\" y=\"120\" width=\"100\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#f00\" opacity=\"0.3\" rx=\"10\">\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0.3;0.7;0.3\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <\/rect>\r\n                <text x=\"300\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-weight=\"bold\">QUELACI\u00d3N<\/text>\r\n            <\/svg>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 4: CONTROLES BIOTECNOL\u00d3GICOS -->\r\n    <div class=\"cyber-section\">\r\n        <h2><span class=\"section-number\">[04]<\/span> PROTOCOLOS DE CONTROL<\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"protocol-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"protocol-card\" data-effect=\"high\">\r\n                <div class=\"protocol-icon\">\ud83d\udd25<\/div>\r\n                <h3>TERMOLISIS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"protocol-stats\">\r\n                    <span class=\"stat\">LECTINAS: -99%<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat\">TANINOS: -70%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"protocol-desc\">\r\n                    Desnaturalizaci\u00f3n proteica >65\u00b0C\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"protocol-btn\" data-protocol=\"heat\" onclick=\"applyProtocol('heat')\">APLICAR<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"protocol-card\" data-effect=\"medium\">\r\n                <div class=\"protocol-icon\">\ud83d\udca7<\/div>\r\n                <h3>HIDR\u00d3LISIS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"protocol-stats\">\r\n                    <span class=\"stat\">FITATOS: -40%<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat\">SAPONINAS: -60%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"protocol-desc\">\r\n                    Remojo 12h + descarte agua\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"protocol-btn\" data-protocol=\"soak\" onclick=\"applyProtocol('soak')\">APLICAR<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"protocol-card\" data-effect=\"high\">\r\n                <div class=\"protocol-icon\">\ud83e\udda0<\/div>\r\n                <h3>FERMENTACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"protocol-stats\">\r\n                    <span class=\"stat\">FITATOS: -90%<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat\">pH: 4.5<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"protocol-desc\">\r\n                    Fitasa microbiana activada\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"protocol-btn\" data-protocol=\"ferment\" onclick=\"applyProtocol('ferment')\">APLICAR<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"protocol-card\" data-effect=\"medium\">\r\n                <div class=\"protocol-icon\">\ud83c\udf31<\/div>\r\n                <h3>GERMINACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"protocol-stats\">\r\n                    <span class=\"stat\">FITATOS: -60%<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat\">ENZIMAS: +300%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"protocol-desc\">\r\n                    Activaci\u00f3n metab\u00f3lica natural\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"protocol-btn\" data-protocol=\"germ\" onclick=\"applyProtocol('germ')\">APLICAR<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 5: EVALUACI\u00d3N -->\r\n    <div class=\"cyber-section\">\r\n        <h2><span class=\"section-number\">[05]<\/span> EVALUACI\u00d3N DE COMPETENCIAS<\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-terminal\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-title\">QUIZ.EXE<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-score\" id=\"quizScore\">SCORE: 0\/3<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-content\" id=\"quizContent\">\r\n                <!-- Preguntas se insertan aqu\u00ed -->\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-log\" id=\"quizLog\">\r\n                > SISTEMA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N INICIADO\r\n                > RESPONDE LAS PREGUNTAS A CONTINUACI\u00d3N\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 6: ERRORES CONCEPTUALES -->\r\n    <div class=\"cyber-section error-section\">\r\n        <h2><span class=\"section-number\">[06]<\/span> ERRORES DE PROGRAMACI\u00d3N<\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"error-list\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-code\">ERR001<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-msg\">\"LOS ANTINUTRIENTES SON T\u00d3XICOS\"<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-fix\">>> SON AGENTES QUELANTES, NO NEUROT\u00d3XICOS<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-code\">ERR002<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-msg\">\"DEBEN ELIMINARSE COMPLETAMENTE\"<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-fix\">>> ACT\u00daAN BAJO HORMESIS: DOSIS BAJAS = BENEFICIO<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-code\">ERR003<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-msg\">\"ESPINACAS NO APORTAN CALCIO\"<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-fix\">>> Ca\u00b2\u207a EST\u00c1 PRESENTE, PERO PRECIPITADO COMO OXALATO<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE -->\r\n    <div class=\"cyber-footer\">\r\n        <div class=\"footer-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"footer-cell\">\r\n                <div class=\"footer-value\" id=\"finalBio\">78%<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"footer-label\">BIODISPONIBILIDAD FINAL<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"footer-cell\">\r\n                <div class=\"footer-value\">6\/6<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"footer-label\">SECCIONES COMPLETADAS<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"footer-text\">\r\n            >> SISTEMA: ANTINUTRIENTES MASTER v2.0\r\n            >> STATUS: APRENDIZAJE OPTIMIZADO\r\n            >> PR\u00d3XIMA CARGA: BIOQU\u00cdMICA AVANZADA\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- SCRIPT PRINCIPAL -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE SIMULACI\u00d3N AVANZADO\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\r\nclass AntiNutrientSimulator {\r\n    constructor() {\r\n        this.state = {\r\n            pH: 7.0,\r\n            vitC: 0,\r\n            ferment: 0,\r\n            soak: 0,\r\n            heat: false,\r\n            protocol: 'none'\r\n        };\r\n        this.init();\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    init() {\r\n        \/\/ Configurar listeners\r\n        document.getElementById('simPH').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.pH = parseFloat(e.target.value);\r\n            document.getElementById('phValue').textContent = this.state.pH.toFixed(1);\r\n            this.update();\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById('simVitC').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.vitC = parseInt(e.target.value);\r\n            document.getElementById('vitcValue').textContent = `${this.state.vitC} mg`;\r\n            this.update();\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById('simFerment').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.ferment = parseInt(e.target.value);\r\n            document.getElementById('fermentValue').textContent = `${this.state.ferment}h`;\r\n            this.update();\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById('simSoak').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.soak = parseInt(e.target.value);\r\n            document.getElementById('soakValue').textContent = `${this.state.soak}h`;\r\n            this.update();\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        this.update();\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    calculateFitatos() {\r\n        let fitatos = 100;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Efecto del pH\r\n        fitatos -= Math.abs(7 - this.state.pH) * 10;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Efecto de la fermentaci\u00f3n\r\n        fitatos -= this.state.ferment * 1.2;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Efecto del remojo\r\n        fitatos -= this.state.soak * 2;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Efecto del protocolo\r\n        if (this.state.protocol === 'ferment') fitatos -= 80;\r\n        if (this.state.protocol === 'germ') fitatos -= 40;\r\n        if (this.state.protocol === 'heat') fitatos -= 20;\r\n        if (this.state.protocol === 'soak') fitatos -= 30;\r\n        \r\n        return Math.max(5, Math.min(100, fitatos));\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    calculateBioavailability() {\r\n        const fitatos = this.calculateFitatos();\r\n        let bio = 100 - fitatos * 0.7;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mejora por vitamina C\r\n        bio += this.state.vitC * 0.15;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mejora por pH \u00f3ptimo\r\n        if (this.state.pH > 6.5 && this.state.pH < 7.5) bio += 15;\r\n        \r\n        return Math.max(10, Math.min(95, bio));\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    calculateMineralAbsorption() {\r\n        const base = this.calculateBioavailability();\r\n        \r\n        return {\r\n            fe: Math.max(5, base - 15 + (this.state.vitC * 0.25)),\r\n            ca: Math.max(10, base - 10),\r\n            zn: Math.max(8, base - 12)\r\n        };\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    update() {\r\n        const fitatos = this.calculateFitatos();\r\n        const bio = this.calculateBioavailability();\r\n        const minerals = this.calculateMineralAbsorption();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas\r\n        document.getElementById('statFitatos').textContent = `${fitatos.toFixed(0)}%`;\r\n        document.getElementById('statBio').textContent = bio < 40 ? 'BAJA' : bio < 70 ? 'MEDIA' : 'ALTA';\r\n        document.getElementById('absorptionIndex').textContent = `${bio.toFixed(0)}%`;\r\n        document.getElementById('finalBio').textContent = `${bio.toFixed(0)}%`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Barras de estad\u00edsticas\r\n        document.getElementById('fitatoBar').style.width = `${fitatos}%`;\r\n        document.getElementById('bioBar').style.width = `${bio}%`;\r\n        document.getElementById('redoxBar').style.width = `${Math.min(100, this.state.vitC * 0.5)}%`;\r\n        document.getElementById('statRedox').textContent = `${Math.min(100, this.state.vitC * 0.5).toFixed(0)}%`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Minerales\r\n        document.getElementById('feValue').textContent = `${minerals.fe.toFixed(0)}%`;\r\n        document.getElementById('caValue').textContent = `${minerals.ca.toFixed(0)}%`;\r\n        document.getElementById('znValue').textContent = `${minerals.zn.toFixed(0)}%`;\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('feBar').style.width = `${minerals.fe}%`;\r\n        document.getElementById('caBar').style.width = `${minerals.ca}%`;\r\n        document.getElementById('znBar').style.width = `${minerals.zn}%`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Log del simulador\r\n        const log = document.getElementById('simLog');\r\n        log.innerHTML = `\r\n            > pH: ${this.state.pH.toFixed(1)} | Vit C: ${this.state.vitC}mg\r\n            > Fermentaci\u00f3n: ${this.state.ferment}h | Remojo: ${this.state.soak}h\r\n            > Fitato activo: ${fitatos.toFixed(0)}%\r\n            > Biodisponibilidad: ${bio.toFixed(0)}%\r\n            > Protocolo activo: ${this.state.protocol.toUpperCase()}\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar animaci\u00f3n molecular\r\n        this.updateAnimation(fitatos);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    updateAnimation(fitatos) {\r\n        const opacity = fitatos \/ 100;\r\n        const lineFe = document.getElementById('lineFe');\r\n        const lineCa = document.getElementById('lineCa');\r\n        const lineZn = document.getElementById('lineZn');\r\n\r\n        if (lineFe) lineFe.style.opacity = fitatos > 70 ? opacity : 0.3;\r\n        if (lineCa) lineCa.style.opacity = fitatos > 70 ? opacity : 0.3;\r\n        if (lineZn) lineZn.style.opacity = fitatos > 70 ? opacity : 0.3;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    applyProtocol(protocol) {\r\n        this.state.protocol = protocol;\r\n        this.update();\r\n\r\n        const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.protocol-btn');\r\n        buttons.forEach(btn => {\r\n            const btnProtocol = btn.getAttribute('data-protocol');\r\n            const isActive = String(btnProtocol).toLowerCase() === String(protocol).toLowerCase();\r\n            btn.classList.toggle('active', isActive);\r\n\r\n            const card = btn.closest('.protocol-card');\r\n            if (card) card.classList.toggle('active', isActive);\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE QUIZ\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\r\nclass QuizSystem {\r\n    constructor() {\r\n        this.questions = [\r\n            {\r\n                question: \"UNA PERSONA CON ANEMIA CONSUME LEGUMBRES GERMINADAS. \u00bfQU\u00c9 OCURRE BIOQU\u00cdMICAMENTE?\",\r\n                options: [\r\n                    \"LOS FITATOS SE DEGRADAN POR FITASA END\u00d3GENA\",\r\n                    \"LOS MINERALES SE OXIDAN R\u00c1PIDAMENTE\",\r\n                    \"NO HAY CAMBIO SIGNIFICATIVO\"\r\n                ],\r\n                correct: 0,\r\n                explanation: \">> CORRECTO: LA GERMINACI\u00d3N ACTIVA FITASAS INTR\u00cdNSECAS QUE HIDROLIZAN FITATOS.\"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                question: \"\u00bfPOR QU\u00c9 LA VITAMINA C MEJORA LA ABSORCI\u00d3N DE HIERRO NO-HEMO?\",\r\n                options: [\r\n                    \"REDUCE Fe\u00b3\u207a A Fe\u00b2\u207a, M\u00c1S SOLUBLE\",\r\n                    \"AUMENTA EL pH INTESTINAL\",\r\n                    \"QUELA EL OXALATO COMPETITIVO\"\r\n                ],\r\n                correct: 0,\r\n                explanation: \">> CORRECTO: EL \u00c1CIDO ASC\u00d3RBICO ES UN AGENTE REDUCTOR QUE MANTIENE EL HIERRO EN ESTADO FERROSO.\"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                question: \"EN EL PROCESO HABER-BOSCH DE FERTILIZANTES, \u00bfQU\u00c9 RELACI\u00d3N TIENE CON LOS ANTINUTRIENTES?\",\r\n                options: [\r\n                    \"NINGUNA, SON PROCESOS DIFERENTES\",\r\n                    \"LOS FERTILIZANTES NITROGENADOS REDUCEN FITATOS\",\r\n                    \"LA FIJACI\u00d3N DE N\u2082 MEJORA CONTENIDO PROTEICO\"\r\n                ],\r\n                correct: 2,\r\n                explanation: \">> CORRECTO: MAYOR NITR\u00d3GENO DISPONIBLE = MAYOR S\u00cdNTESIS PROTEICA = MAYOR CONTENIDO NUTRICIONAL.\"\r\n            }\r\n        ];\r\n        \r\n        this.currentQuestion = 0;\r\n        this.score = 0;\r\n        this.init();\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    init() {\r\n        this.renderQuestion();\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    renderQuestion() {\r\n        const quizContent = document.getElementById('quizContent');\r\n        const q = this.questions[this.currentQuestion];\r\n        \r\n        quizContent.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\">${q.question}<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                ${q.options.map((option, index) => `\r\n                    <button type=\"button\" class=\"quiz-option\" onclick=\"quizSystem.answer(${index})\">\r\n                        ${option}\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                `).join('')}\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `SCORE: ${this.score}\/${this.questions.length}`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    answer(selected) {\r\n        const q = this.questions[this.currentQuestion];\r\n        const options = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option');\r\n        const log = document.getElementById('quizLog');\r\n        \r\n        options.forEach((option, index) => {\r\n            option.disabled = true;\r\n            if (index === q.correct) {\r\n                option.classList.add('correct');\r\n            } else if (index === selected) {\r\n                option.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        if (selected === q.correct) {\r\n            this.score++;\r\n            log.innerHTML = `>> RESPUESTA CORRECTA\\n${q.explanation}`;\r\n        } else {\r\n            log.innerHTML = `>> RESPUESTA INCORRECTA\\n${q.explanation}`;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            this.currentQuestion++;\r\n            if (this.currentQuestion < this.questions.length) {\r\n                this.renderQuestion();\r\n                log.innerHTML += '\\n>> SIGUIENTE PREGUNTA CARGADA';\r\n            } else {\r\n                document.getElementById('quizContent').innerHTML = `\r\n                    <div class=\"quiz-complete\">\r\n                        <div class=\"complete-title\">EVALUACI\u00d3N COMPLETADA<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"complete-score\">PUNTAJE FINAL: ${this.score}\/${this.questions.length}<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"complete-message\">\r\n                            ${this.score === this.questions.length ? '>> SISTEMA DOMINADO: COMPETENCIA AVANZADA' : '>> CONTIN\u00daA ESTUDIANDO: REVISA LOS CONCEPTOS'}\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                `;\r\n                log.innerHTML = '>> SISTEMA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N FINALIZADO';\r\n            }\r\n        }, 2000);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\r\nlet simulator;\r\nlet quizSystem;\r\n\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\r\n    \/\/ Efecto de glitch en el t\u00edtulo\r\n    const glitchElements = document.querySelectorAll('.glitch');\r\n    glitchElements.forEach(el => {\r\n        setInterval(() => {\r\n            if (Math.random() > 0.7) {\r\n                el.style.textShadow = '2px 2px 0 #f0f, -2px -2px 0 #0ff';\r\n                setTimeout(() => {\r\n                    el.style.textShadow = 'none';\r\n                }, 100);\r\n            }\r\n        }, 2000);\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar sistemas\r\n    simulator = new AntiNutrientSimulator();\r\n    quizSystem = new QuizSystem();\r\n    window.quizSystem = quizSystem;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Exponer funciones globales\r\n    window.applyProtocol = (protocol) => simulator.applyProtocol(protocol);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Error interactivo: expandir detalle de correcci\u00f3n\r\n    const errorItems = document.querySelectorAll('.error-item');\r\n    errorItems.forEach(item => {\r\n        item.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n            const open = item.classList.toggle('active');\r\n            if (open) {\r\n                item.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ SVG interactivo: animar nodos seg\u00fan protocolo y estado\r\n    function updateSVGStatus() {\r\n        const protocols = {\r\n            heat: { color: '#ffa020', pulse: 1.1 },\r\n            soak: { color: '#52d8ff', pulse: 1.03 },\r\n            ferment: { color: '#88ff4c', pulse: 1.15 },\r\n            germ: { color: '#ff7cff', pulse: 1.08 },\r\n            none: { color: '#66f6ff', pulse: 1 }\r\n        };\r\n        const p = simulator?.state?.protocol || 'none';\r\n        const cfg = protocols[p] || protocols.none;\r\n\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('#phytate circle, #minerals circle').forEach(c => {\r\n            c.style.stroke = cfg.color;\r\n            c.style.filter = `drop-shadow(0 0 ${Math.min(12, 8 * cfg.pulse)}px ${cfg.color})`;\r\n            c.setAttribute('transform', `scale(${cfg.pulse})`);\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Reaplicar al iniciar y al cambiar protocolo\r\n    updateSVGStatus();\r\n    const protocolButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.protocol-btn');\r\n    protocolButtons.forEach(btn => {\r\n        btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n            setTimeout(updateSVGStatus, 80);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el nombre IUPAC del fitato?","respuesta":"Hexaquisfosfato de mioinositol"},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 mineral es bloqueado principalmente por los oxalatos?","respuesta":"Calcio ($Ca^{2+}$)"},{"enunciado":"Define quelaci\u00f3n en t\u00e9rminos qu\u00edmicos.","respuesta":"Formaci\u00f3n de un anillo entre un ligando polidentado y un i\u00f3n met\u00e1lico central."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 temperatura m\u00ednima desactiva las lectinas de los frijoles rojos?","respuesta":"100\u00b0C (ebullici\u00f3n)"},{"enunciado":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 el cacao crudo bloquea el calcio?","respuesta":"Por su alto contenido de \u00e1cido ox\u00e1lico."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 enzima degrada el \u00e1cido f\u00edtico?","respuesta":"Fitasa"},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 efecto tienen las saponinas en el agua?","respuesta":"Reducen la tensi\u00f3n superficial (forman espuma)."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 la fermentaci\u00f3n es superior al remojo?","respuesta":"Porque a\u00f1ade actividad enzim\u00e1tica (fitasas) adem\u00e1s de la lixiviaci\u00f3n."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo afectan los taninos a la digesti\u00f3n de prote\u00ednas?","respuesta":"Se unen a las enzimas digestivas e inactivan las prote\u00ednas alimentarias."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el producto de solubilidad ($K_{ps}$) en oxalatos?","respuesta":"Es el l\u00edmite de saturaci\u00f3n de la sal; si se supera, el oxalato de calcio precipita."},{"enunciado":"Menciona un beneficio de los fitatos.","respuesta":"Act\u00faan como potentes antioxidantes y pueden prevenir la formaci\u00f3n de cristales renales."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 antinutriente se reduce simplemente lavando la quinoa?","respuesta":"Saponinas"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Los fitatos quelan preferentemente:","opciones":["Cationes divalentes","Aniones","Gases nobles","L\u00edpidos"],"correcta":"Cationes divalentes"},{"pregunta":"La f\u00f3rmula qu\u00edmica del oxalato de calcio es:","opciones":["$CaC_2O_4$","$CaSO_4$","$NaCl$","$CaO$"],"correcta":"$CaC_2O_4$"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 antinutriente aglutina gl\u00f3bulos rojos?","opciones":["Lectinas","Taninos","Fitatos","Saponinas"],"correcta":"Lectinas"},{"pregunta":"El remojo de 12 horas reduce fitatos aproximadamente un:","opciones":["30-50%","100%","0%","5%"],"correcta":"30-50%"},{"pregunta":"Las saponinas son abundantes en la superficie de la:","opciones":["Quinoa","Espinaca","Carne","Naranja"],"correcta":"Quinoa"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es un efecto anticancer\u00edgeno de los fitatos?","opciones":["Quelaci\u00f3n de hierro pro-oxidante","Aumento de az\u00facar","Bloqueo de grasa","Ninguno"],"correcta":"Quelaci\u00f3n de hierro pro-oxidante"},{"pregunta":"Los taninos se encuentran principalmente en:","opciones":["T\u00e9 y vino","Leche","Huevos","Agua mineral"],"correcta":"T\u00e9 y vino"},{"pregunta":"Un alto consumo de oxalatos se asocia con:","opciones":["C\u00e1lculos renales","Anemia","Diabetes","Gripe"],"correcta":"C\u00e1lculos renales"},{"pregunta":"El proceso de \"Extrusi\u00f3n\" se usa en:","opciones":["Cereales de desayuno","Fruta fresca","Ensaladas","Carnes"],"correcta":"Cereales de desayuno"},{"pregunta":"Las lectinas se consideran toxinas si se consumen:","opciones":["Crudas","Hervidas","Fermentadas","Congeladas"],"correcta":"Crudas"},{"pregunta":"El \u00e1cido f\u00edtico es una forma de almacenamiento de:","opciones":["F\u00f3sforo","Nitr\u00f3geno","Carbono","Ox\u00edgeno"],"correcta":"F\u00f3sforo"},{"pregunta":"La biodisponibilidad es:","opciones":["La fracci\u00f3n de nutriente absorbida y utilizada","La cantidad de comida","El precio del alimento","El color de la comida"],"correcta":"La fracci\u00f3n de nutriente absorbida y utilizada"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 proceso es m\u00e1s efectivo contra las lectinas?","opciones":["Cocci\u00f3n a presi\u00f3n","Remojo","Secado","Congelaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Cocci\u00f3n a presi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Los inhibidores de tripsina bloquean la digesti\u00f3n de:","opciones":["Prote\u00ednas","Grasas","Carbohidratos","Agua"],"correcta":"Prote\u00ednas"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 las plantas tienen antinutrientes?","opciones":["Defensa contra insectos y hongos","Para alimentar humanos","Por error gen\u00e9tico","Para absorber luz"],"correcta":"Defensa contra insectos y hongos"},{"pregunta":"El calcio en espinacas es dif\u00edcil de absorber debido a:","opciones":["Oxalatos","Fitatos","Lectinas","Vitaminas"],"correcta":"Oxalatos"},{"pregunta":"El tempeh tiene menos antinutrientes que la soja cruda por la:","opciones":["Fermentaci\u00f3n","Sal","Luz solar","Humedad"],"correcta":"Fermentaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 ion met\u00e1lico bloquea m\u00e1s el fitato?","opciones":["Hierro (Fe)","Sodio (Na)","Potasio (K)","Litio (Li)"],"correcta":"Hierro (Fe)"},{"pregunta":"Las saponinas se detectan f\u00e1cilmente porque:","opciones":["Hacen espuma","Son de color azul","Huelen a azufre","Son dulces"],"correcta":"Hacen espuma"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es un quelato?","opciones":["Un complejo anillo metal-ligando","Una vitamina","Un tipo de c\u00e9lula","Un hueso"],"correcta":"Un complejo anillo metal-ligando"},{"pregunta":"La cocci\u00f3n de espinacas reduce oxalatos un:","opciones":["30-80%","0%","10%","100%"],"correcta":"30-80%"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 antinutriente es un polifenol?","opciones":["Taninos","Fitatos","Lectinas","Saponinas"],"correcta":"Taninos"},{"pregunta":"El pH g\u00e1strico afecta la solubilidad del fitato. \u00bfA qu\u00e9 pH precipita m\u00e1s?","opciones":["pH neutro intestinal","pH \u00e1cido estomacal","pH 14","No afecta"],"correcta":"pH neutro intestinal"},{"pregunta":"La germinaci\u00f3n activa enzimas llamadas:","opciones":["Fitasas end\u00f3genas","Lipasas","Amilasas \u00fanicamente","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Fitasas end\u00f3genas"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l de estos NO es un antinutriente?","opciones":["Vitamina C","Fitatos","Lectinas","Oxalatos"],"correcta":"Vitamina C"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 grupo funcional caracteriza al fitato?","opciones":["Fosfato","Hidroxilo \u00fanicamente","Carboxilo","Amina"],"correcta":"Fosfato"},{"pregunta":"Los oxalatos se excretan principalmente por:","opciones":["Ri\u00f1ones","Pulmones","Piel","Cabello"],"correcta":"Ri\u00f1ones"},{"pregunta":"El remojo previo de legumbres:","opciones":["Reduce tiempo de cocci\u00f3n y antinutrientes","Aumenta antinutrientes","No sirve de nada","Cambia el color"],"correcta":"Reduce tiempo de cocci\u00f3n y antinutrientes"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 alimento tiene alta \"Energ\u00eda de Bloqueo\" por lectinas?","opciones":["Frijol ri\u00f1\u00f3n (Kidney bean)","Arroz blanco","Manzana","Pollo"],"correcta":"Frijol ri\u00f1\u00f3n (Kidney bean)"},{"pregunta":"En 2025, la recomendaci\u00f3n experta sobre antinutrientes es:","opciones":["Procesar adecuadamente para obtener beneficios","Eliminarlos totalmente","Comer todo crudo","No comer plantas"],"correcta":"Procesar adecuadamente para obtener beneficios"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"biodisponibilidad-avanzada","titulo":"Din\u00e1mica Cu\u00e1ntico-Molecular de la Biodisponibilidad: Del Cristal al Citoplasma","contenido":"<!-- ===================================================== -->\r\n<!-- SISTEMA NEUROQU\u00cdMICO INTERACTIVO - VERSI\u00d3N CYBERBIOCHEM -->\r\n<!-- ===================================================== -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"neurochem-system\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA NEURAL -->\r\n    <div class=\"neural-header\">\r\n        <div class=\"neuro-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"neuro-node active\" onclick=\"activateNeuroNode(0)\">\r\n                <div class=\"neuro-label\">FASE I<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"neuro-value\">LIBERACI\u00d3N<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"neuro-node\" onclick=\"activateNeuroNode(1)\">\r\n                <div class=\"neuro-label\">FASE II<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"neuro-value\">SOLUBILIZACI\u00d3N<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"neuro-node\" onclick=\"activateNeuroNode(2)\">\r\n                <div class=\"neuro-label\">FASE III<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"neuro-value\">TRANSPORTE<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"neuro-node\" onclick=\"activateNeuroNode(3)\">\r\n                <div class=\"neuro-label\">FASE IV<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"neuro-value\">METABOLISMO<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"neuro-status\">\r\n            <span class=\"status-pulse\">\u25cf<\/span>\r\n            SISTEMA BIOQU\u00cdMICO ACTIVO | F = \u222b(qu\u00edmica, biolog\u00eda, tiempo)\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- T\u00cdTULO CON ANIMACI\u00d3N CU\u00c1NTICA -->\r\n    <h1 class=\"quantum-title\">\r\n        <span class=\"quantum-text\">BIODISPONIBILIDAD<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"quantum-sub\">SISTEMA MULTIESCALA: \u00c5 \u2192 \u03bcm \u2192 mm \u2192 organismo<\/span>\r\n    <\/h1>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL DE ESTADO MULTIPARAM\u00c9TRICO -->\r\n    <div class=\"multiparam-panel\">\r\n        <div class=\"param-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"param-cell\">\r\n                <div class=\"param-name\">ENERG\u00cdA LIBRE<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"param-value\" id=\"paramDeltaG\">-15.2<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"param-unit\">kJ\u00b7mol\u207b\u00b9<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"param-cell\">\r\n                <div class=\"param-name\">AFINIDAD QUELANTE<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"param-value\" id=\"paramKq\">10\u00b9\u2078<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"param-unit\">M\u207b\u00b9<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"param-cell\">\r\n                <div class=\"param-name\">K<sub>M<\/sub> DMT1<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"param-value\" id=\"paramKm\">30<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"param-unit\">\u03bcM<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"param-cell\">\r\n                <div class=\"param-name\">V<sub>MAX<\/sub><\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"param-value\" id=\"paramVmax\">18<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"param-unit\">mg\u00b7h\u207b\u00b9<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"param-log\" id=\"systemLog\">\r\n            > INICIALIZANDO MODELO MULTIF\u00c1SICO...\r\n            > CARGANDO PAR\u00c1METROS TERMODIN\u00c1MICOS...\r\n            > SIMULACI\u00d3N ACTIVA\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 1: ARQUITECTURA MULTIESCALA -->\r\n    <div class=\"neuro-section\">\r\n        <h2><span class=\"section-code\">[SCALE-01]<\/span> JERARQU\u00cdA ESPACIAL<\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"scale-hierarchy\">\r\n            <div class=\"scale-level\" data-scale=\"angstrom\">\r\n                <div class=\"scale-icon\">\u00c5<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"scale-content\">\r\n                    <h3>ESCALA \u00c5NGSTR\u00d6M (10\u207b\u00b9\u2070 m)<\/h3>\r\n                    <p><strong>Enlaces qu\u00edmicos y geometr\u00eda molecular<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Longitudes de enlace: Fe-O (2.05 \u00c5)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u00c1ngulos de coordinaci\u00f3n octa\u00e9drica<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Superficie electrost\u00e1tica molecular<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"scale-level\" data-scale=\"nano\">\r\n                <div class=\"scale-icon\">nm<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"scale-content\">\r\n                    <h3>ESCALA NANOM\u00c9TRICA (10\u207b\u2079 m)<\/h3>\r\n                    <p><strong>Agregados moleculares y micelas<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Micelas mixtas (5-50 nm)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Complejos prote\u00edna-nutriente<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Transportadores ABC (12 nm)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"scale-level\" data-scale=\"micro\">\r\n                <div class=\"scale-icon\">\u03bcm<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"scale-content\">\r\n                    <h3>ESCALA MICROM\u00c9TRICA (10\u207b\u2076 m)<\/h3>\r\n                    <p><strong>Estructuras celulares y compartimentos<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Enterocitos (20-30 \u03bcm altura)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Microvellosidades (1-2 \u03bcm)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Poros paracelulares (0.8 nm)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"scale-level\" data-scale=\"macro\">\r\n                <div class=\"scale-icon\">cm<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"scale-content\">\r\n                    <h3>ESCALA MACROSC\u00d3PICA (>10\u207b\u00b2 m)<\/h3>\r\n                    <p><strong>Sistema digestivo completo<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Longitud intestinal: 7 m<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u00c1rea de absorci\u00f3n: 200 m\u00b2<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Tiempo de tr\u00e1nsito: 24-72 h<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- MODELO MATEM\u00c1TICO INTEGRADO -->\r\n        <div class=\"integrated-model\">\r\n            <div class=\"model-header\">MODELO INTEGRADO DE BIODISPONIBILIDAD<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"model-equation\">\r\n                \\[\r\n                F = \\underbrace{\\alpha_{\\text{lib}}}_{\\text{liberaci\u00f3n}} \r\n                \\times \\underbrace{\\frac{[S]_{\\text{sol}}}{[S]_{\\text{total}}}}_{\\text{solubilidad}}\r\n                \\times \\underbrace{\\frac{V_{\\text{max}}[S]}{K_M + [S]}}_{\\text{transporte}}\r\n                \\times \\underbrace{(1 - f_{\\text{met}})}_{\\text{first-pass}}\r\n                \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"model-legend\">\r\n                <div class=\"legend-item\">\r\n                    <span class=\"legend-color\" style=\"background:#00f2ff;\"><\/span>\r\n                    <span>\u03b1<sub>lib<\/sub>: coeficiente de liberaci\u00f3n de matriz<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"legend-item\">\r\n                    <span class=\"legend-color\" style=\"background:#00ff88;\"><\/span>\r\n                    <span>[S]<sub>sol<\/sub>: concentraci\u00f3n soluble bioaccesible<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"legend-item\">\r\n                    <span class=\"legend-color\" style=\"background:#f59e0b;\"><\/span>\r\n                    <span>f<sub>met<\/sub>: fracci\u00f3n metabolizada presist\u00e9micamente<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 2: SIMULADOR CU\u00c1NTICO-MOLECULAR -->\r\n    <div class=\"neuro-section\">\r\n        <h2><span class=\"section-code\">[SIM-02]<\/span> SIMULADOR MULTIFACTORIAL<\/h2>\r\n        <p class=\"section-subtitle\">>> AJUSTE DE 6 PAR\u00c1METROS EN TIEMPO REAL CON RETROALIMENTACI\u00d3N CU\u00c1NTICA<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quantum-simulator\">\r\n            <!-- CONTROLES DE PRECISI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"quantum-controls\">\r\n                <div class=\"q-control-group\">\r\n                    <label class=\"q-label\">\r\n                        <span class=\"q-label-text\">ESTADO REDOX (E<sub>h<\/sub>)<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"q-label-value\" id=\"redoxVal\">+150 mV<\/span>\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" class=\"quantum-slider\" id=\"ctrlRedox\" min=\"-300\" max=\"300\" value=\"150\">\r\n                    <div class=\"q-scale\">\r\n                        <span>REDUCIDO<\/span>\r\n                        <span>OXIDADO<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"q-control-group\">\r\n                    <label class=\"q-label\">\r\n                        <span class=\"q-label-text\">pH LUMINAL<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"q-label-value\" id=\"phVal\">7.0<\/span>\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" class=\"quantum-slider\" id=\"ctrlPH\" min=\"1\" max=\"9\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"7.0\">\r\n                    <div class=\"q-scale\">\r\n                        <span>\u00c1CIDO<\/span>\r\n                        <span>B\u00c1SICO<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"q-control-group\">\r\n                    <label class=\"q-label\">\r\n                        <span class=\"q-label-text\">FUERZA I\u00d3NICA (\u03bc)<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"q-label-value\" id=\"ionicVal\">0.15 M<\/span>\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" class=\"quantum-slider\" id=\"ctrlIonic\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0.15\">\r\n                    <div class=\"q-scale\">\r\n                        <span>DILUIDO<\/span>\r\n                        <span>CONCENTRADO<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- MATRIZ ALIMENTARIA -->\r\n            <div class=\"matrix-controls\">\r\n                <h3>MATRIZ ALIMENTARIA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"matrix-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"matrix-factor\">\r\n                        <div class=\"factor-name\">FITATOS<\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" class=\"matrix-slider\" id=\"ctrlFitatos\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"30\">\r\n                        <div class=\"factor-value\" id=\"fitatosVal\">30%<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"matrix-factor\">\r\n                        <div class=\"factor-name\">OXALATOS<\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" class=\"matrix-slider\" id=\"ctrlOxalatos\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\">\r\n                        <div class=\"factor-value\" id=\"oxalatosVal\">20%<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"matrix-factor\">\r\n                        <div class=\"factor-name\">TANINOS<\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" class=\"matrix-slider\" id=\"ctrlTaninos\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"15\">\r\n                        <div class=\"factor-value\" id=\"taninosVal\">15%<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"matrix-factor\">\r\n                        <div class=\"factor-name\">VITAMINA C<\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" class=\"matrix-slider\" id=\"ctrlVitC\" min=\"0\" max=\"200\" value=\"50\">\r\n                        <div class=\"factor-value\" id=\"vitcVal\">50 mg<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DIN\u00c1MICA -->\r\n            <div class=\"quantum-visualization\">\r\n                <div class=\"vis-header\">\r\n                    <span>ESTADO DEL SISTEMA<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"vis-time\" id=\"simTime\">t = 0 s<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"vis-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"vis-cell\">\r\n                        <div class=\"vis-title\">\u0394G SOLUBILIDAD<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"vis-value\" id=\"visDeltaG\">-8.3<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"vis-unit\">kJ\/mol<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"vis-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"vis-fill\" id=\"barDeltaG\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"vis-cell\">\r\n                        <div class=\"vis-title\">K<sub>QUEL<\/sub><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"vis-value\" id=\"visKquel\">10\u00b9\u2076<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"vis-unit\">M\u207b\u00b9<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"vis-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"vis-fill\" id=\"barKquel\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"vis-cell\">\r\n                        <div class=\"vis-title\">[Fe\u00b2\u207a]<sub>libre<\/sub><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"vis-value\" id=\"visFeFree\">12.4<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"vis-unit\">\u03bcM<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"vis-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"vis-fill\" id=\"barFeFree\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"vis-cell\">\r\n                        <div class=\"vis-title\">F BIODISP.<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"vis-value\" id=\"visFBio\">15.2%<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"vis-unit\">Fracci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"vis-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"vis-fill\" id=\"barFBio\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"vis-log\" id=\"visLog\">\r\n                    [00:00] > SISTEMA EN EQUILIBRIO TERMODIN\u00c1MICO\r\n                    [00:00] > Fe\u00b3\u207a\/Fe\u00b2\u207a = 3.2\r\n                    [00:00] > COMPLEJACI\u00d3N: 65% FITATO, 20% OXALATO\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- ANIMACI\u00d3N MOLECULAR -->\r\n            <div class=\"molecular-animation\">\r\n                <canvas id=\"molecularCanvas\" width=\"800\" height=\"300\"><\/canvas>\r\n                <div class=\"animation-controls\">\r\n                    <button class=\"anim-btn\" id=\"toggleAnimationBtn\">\u25b6 ANIMAR<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"anim-btn\" id=\"resetAnimationBtn\">\u21bb REINICIAR<\/button>\r\n                    <span class=\"anim-speed\">\r\n                        VELOCIDAD: <input type=\"range\" id=\"animSpeed\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"5\">\r\n                    <\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 3: MECANISMOS DE TRANSPORTE -->\r\n    <div class=\"neuro-section\">\r\n        <h2><span class=\"section-code\">[TRANS-03]<\/span> ARQUITECTURA DE TRANSPORTE<\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"transport-system\">\r\n            <div class=\"transport-pathways\">\r\n                <div class=\"pathway active\" data-path=\"transcellular\" onclick=\"activatePathway('transcellular')\">\r\n                    <h3>VIA TRANSCELULAR<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"pathway-steps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"step\">\r\n                            <span class=\"step-num\">1<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"step-desc\">DMT1 apical (H\u207a\/Fe\u00b2\u207a simporte)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"step\">\r\n                            <span class=\"step-num\">2<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"step-desc\">Movilizaci\u00f3n citos\u00f3lica (ferritina)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"step\">\r\n                            <span class=\"step-num\">3<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"step-desc\">FPN1 basal (exporte)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"step\">\r\n                            <span class=\"step-num\">4<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"step-desc\">Hepcidina regulaci\u00f3n (homeostasis)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"pathway\" data-path=\"paracellular\" onclick=\"activatePathway('paracellular')\">\r\n                    <h3>VIA PARACELULAR<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"pathway-steps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"step\">\r\n                            <span class=\"step-num\">1<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"step-desc\">Difusi\u00f3n por gradiente<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"step\">\r\n                            <span class=\"step-num\">2<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"step-desc\">Uniones estrechas (0.8 nm)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"step\">\r\n                            <span class=\"step-num\">3<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"step-desc\">Flujo solvente arrastre<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"pathway\" data-path=\"receptor\" onclick=\"activatePathway('receptor')\">\r\n                    <h3>ENDOCITOSIS RECEPTOR-MEDIADA<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"pathway-steps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"step\">\r\n                            <span class=\"step-num\">1<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"step-desc\">Uni\u00f3n a receptor espec\u00edfico<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"step\">\r\n                            <span class=\"step-num\">2<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"step-desc\">Formaci\u00f3n ves\u00edcula clatrina<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"step\">\r\n                            <span class=\"step-num\">3<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"step-desc\">Fusi\u00f3n endosoma temprano<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"step\">\r\n                            <span class=\"step-num\">4<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"step-desc\">Receptor reciclaje<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- MODELO CIN\u00c9TICO INTERACTIVO -->\r\n            <div class=\"kinetic-model\">\r\n                <h3>MODELO CIN\u00c9TICO DE TRANSPORTE<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"kinetic-equation\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    J = \\frac{J_{\\text{max}}[S]}{K_t + [S]} + P[S]\r\n                    \\]\r\n                    <div class=\"equation-note\">\r\n                        J<sub>max<\/sub>: flujo m\u00e1ximo saturable | K<sub>t<\/sub>: constante transporte<br>\r\n                        P: coeficiente difusi\u00f3n paracelular | [S]: concentraci\u00f3n luminal\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"kinetic-plot\">\r\n                    <canvas id=\"kineticCanvas\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\"><\/canvas>\r\n                    <div class=\"plot-controls\">\r\n                        <label>J<sub>max<\/sub>: <input type=\"range\" id=\"ctrlJmax\" min=\"1\" max=\"50\" value=\"18\"><\/label>\r\n                        <label>K<sub>t<\/sub>: <input type=\"range\" id=\"ctrlKt\" min=\"5\" max=\"100\" value=\"30\"><\/label>\r\n                        <label>P: <input type=\"range\" id=\"ctrlP\" min=\"0\" max=\"0.5\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0.1\"><\/label>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 4: EVALUACI\u00d3N NEUROCOGNITIVA -->\r\n    <div class=\"neuro-section\">\r\n        <h2><span class=\"section-code\">[EVAL-04]<\/span> EVALUACI\u00d3N INTEGRADORA<\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"neuro-evaluation\">\r\n            <!-- SIMULADOR DE CASOS CL\u00cdNICOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"case-simulator\">\r\n                <h3>SIMULADOR DE CASOS CL\u00cdNICOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"case-scenario\" id=\"currentCase\">\r\n                    <h4>CASO 1: ANEMIA FERROP\u00c9NICA CON DIETA VEGETARIANA<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Paciente mujer, 35 a\u00f1os, consume legumbres + espinacas diariamente.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"case-params\">\r\n                        <div class=\"case-param\">\r\n                            <span>Fe total dieta:<\/span>\r\n                            <strong>18 mg\/d\u00eda<\/strong>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"case-param\">\r\n                            <span>Vitamina C:<\/span>\r\n                            <strong>30 mg\/d\u00eda<\/strong>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"case-param\">\r\n                            <span>Fitatos:<\/span>\r\n                            <strong>Alto<\/strong>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"case-question\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfQu\u00e9 modificaci\u00f3n QU\u00cdMICA maximizar\u00eda la biodisponibilidad?<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"case-options\">\r\n                        <button class=\"case-opt\" data-option=\"1\">Aumentar dosis hierro a 30 mg\/d\u00eda<\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"case-opt\" data-option=\"2\">Consumir legumbres germinadas + c\u00edtricos<\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"case-opt\" data-option=\"3\">Suplementar con calcio adicional<\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"case-feedback\" id=\"caseFeedback\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- QUIZ DE COMPETENCIA MULTINIVEL -->\r\n            <div class=\"multilevel-quiz\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-level\" data-level=\"1\">\r\n                    <h4>NIVEL 1: CONCEPTOS B\u00c1SICOS<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>\u00bfQu\u00e9 define la constante K<sub>M<\/sub> en el modelo Michaelis-Menten?<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                        <button data-quiz=\"1\" data-option=\"1\">La concentraci\u00f3n a la que V = \u00bdV<sub>max<\/sub><\/button>\r\n                        <button data-quiz=\"1\" data-option=\"2\">La velocidad m\u00e1xima de transporte<\/button>\r\n                        <button data-quiz=\"1\" data-option=\"3\">El coeficiente de difusi\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-level\" data-level=\"2\">\r\n                    <h4>NIVEL 2: APLICACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Si [S] = 100 \u03bcM y K<sub>M<\/sub> = 20 \u03bcM, \u00bfqu\u00e9 porcentaje de V<sub>max<\/sub> se alcanza?<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                        <button data-quiz=\"2\" data-option=\"1\">83%<\/button>\r\n                        <button data-quiz=\"2\" data-option=\"2\">50%<\/button>\r\n                        <button data-quiz=\"2\" data-option=\"3\">20%<\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-level\" data-level=\"3\">\r\n                    <h4>NIVEL 3: AN\u00c1LISIS AVANZADO<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo afecta el pH intestinal a la quelaci\u00f3n por fitatos?<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                        <button data-quiz=\"3\" data-option=\"1\">pH bajo protona fitatos \u2192 menor carga \u2192 menor quelaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <button data-quiz=\"3\" data-option=\"2\">pH alto desprotona \u2192 mayor carga negativa \u2192 mayor quelaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <button data-quiz=\"3\" data-option=\"3\">El pH no afecta la quelaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-score\">\r\n                    <div class=\"score-display\">\r\n                        <span>PUNTAJE: <\/span>\r\n                        <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\r\n                        <span>\/9<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"score-breakdown\" id=\"scoreBreakdown\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 5: METACOGNICI\u00d3N Y APLICACI\u00d3N -->\r\n    <div class=\"neuro-section meta-section\">\r\n        <h2><span class=\"section-code\">[META-05]<\/span> INTEGRACI\u00d3N NEUROCOGNITIVA<\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"meta-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"meta-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83e\udde0 MAPA CONCEPTUAL INTERACTIVO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"concept-map\" id=\"conceptMap\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <!-- Mapa conceptual se genera din\u00e1micamente -->\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"meta-btn\" id=\"toggleConceptMapBtn\">EXPANDIR MAPA<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"meta-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca ANALIZADOR DE PATRONES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pattern-analyzer\">\r\n                    <p>Ingresa datos simulados para an\u00e1lisis:<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"pattern-inputs\">\r\n                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"inputDose\" placeholder=\"Dosis (mg)\" value=\"15\">\r\n                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"inputVitC\" placeholder=\"Vit C (mg)\" value=\"50\">\r\n                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"inputFitatos\" placeholder=\"Fitatos %\" value=\"30\">\r\n                        <button id=\"analyzePatternBtn\">ANALIZAR<\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"pattern-output\" id=\"patternOutput\">\r\n                        Esperando an\u00e1lisis...\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- RETROALIMENTACI\u00d3N ADAPTATIVA -->\r\n        <div class=\"adaptive-feedback\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udca1 SISTEMA DE RETROALIMENTACI\u00d3N INTELIGENTE<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"feedback-display\" id=\"adaptiveFeedback\">\r\n                Basado en tus interacciones, el sistema sugiere:\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Revisar el efecto del pH en la solubilidad mineral<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Profundizar en la cin\u00e9tica de transportadores<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Explorar interacciones competitivas<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"feedback-controls\">\r\n                <button id=\"generateQuizBtn\">GENERAR QUIZ PERSONALIZADO<\/button>\r\n                <button id=\"showLearningPathBtn\">VER RUTA DE APRENDIZAJE<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE SIST\u00c9MICO -->\r\n    <div class=\"system-closure\">\r\n        <div class=\"closure-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"closure-cell\">\r\n                <div class=\"closure-icon\">\u269b\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"closure-title\">ESCALA CU\u00c1NTICA<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"closure-desc\">Enlaces y geometr\u00eda molecular determinan reactividad<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"closure-cell\">\r\n                <div class=\"closure-icon\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"closure-title\">ESCALA MOLECULAR<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"closure-desc\">Interacciones no covalentes dirigen la biodisponibilidad<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"closure-cell\">\r\n                <div class=\"closure-icon\">\ud83e\uddec<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"closure-title\">ESCALA CELULAR<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"closure-desc\">Transportadores y metabolismo regulan el flujo<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"closure-cell\">\r\n                <div class=\"closure-icon\">\ud83d\udc64<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"closure-title\">ESCALA ORGANISMAL<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"closure-desc\">Homeostasis integra todas las escalas<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"final-insight\">\r\n            <h3>VISI\u00d3N SIST\u00c9MICA FINAL<\/h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n                La biodisponibilidad emerge de la <strong>integraci\u00f3n multiescala<\/strong> donde \r\n                la qu\u00edmica de coordinaci\u00f3n (\u00c5), la termodin\u00e1mica de soluciones (nm), \r\n                la cin\u00e9tica enzim\u00e1tica (\u03bcm) y la fisiolog\u00eda (m) convergen en un \r\n                sistema din\u00e1mico no lineal.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"insight-equation\">\r\n                \\[\r\n                \\text{Nutriente Sist\u00e9mico} = \\int_{t_0}^{t_f} \\left[ \\alpha_{\\text{qu\u00edmica}} \\times \\beta_{\\text{biol\u00f3gica}} \\right] dt\r\n                \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"system-stats\">\r\n            <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                <span class=\"stat-label\">TIEMPO DE INTERACCI\u00d3N:<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"interactionTime\">0<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"stat-unit\">min<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                <span class=\"stat-label\">CONCEPTOS ACTIVADOS:<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"conceptsActivated\">0<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"stat-unit\">\/24<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                <span class=\"stat-label\">EFICIENCIA COGNITIVA:<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"cognitiveEfficiency\">0%<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===================================================== -->\r\n<!-- SISTEMA JAVASCRIPT AVANZADO - COMPLETAMENTE FUNCIONAL -->\r\n<!-- ===================================================== -->\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ =====================================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA PRINCIPAL CON TODAS LAS FUNCIONALIDADES\r\n\/\/ =====================================================\r\n\r\nclass QuantumBioavailabilitySystem {\r\n    constructor() {\r\n        this.state = {\r\n            redox: 150,        \/\/ mV\r\n            pH: 7.0,\r\n            ionicStrength: 0.15, \/\/ M\r\n            fitatos: 30,       \/\/ %\r\n            oxalatos: 20,      \/\/ %\r\n            taninos: 15,       \/\/ %\r\n            vitC: 50,          \/\/ mg\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Par\u00e1metros cin\u00e9ticos\r\n            Jmax: 18,          \/\/ mg\/h\r\n            Kt: 30,            \/\/ \u03bcM\r\n            P: 0.1,            \/\/ coeficiente difusi\u00f3n\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Estad\u00edsticas\r\n            interactionStart: Date.now(),\r\n            activatedConcepts: new Set(),\r\n            quizScore: 0,\r\n            activePathway: 'transcellular',\r\n            activeNode: 0\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        this.animationId = null;\r\n        this.animationSpeed = 5;\r\n        \r\n        this.init();\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    init() {\r\n        \/\/ Configurar listeners de controles\r\n        this.setupControls();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Configurar listeners de botones\r\n        this.setupButtons();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Inicializar sistemas\r\n        this.updateSystem();\r\n        this.updateKineticPlot();\r\n        this.drawStaticScene();\r\n        this.startInteractionTimer();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Inicializar quiz\r\n        this.updateQuizScore();\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    setupControls() {\r\n        \/\/ Controles cu\u00e1nticos\r\n        document.getElementById('ctrlRedox').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.redox = parseInt(e.target.value);\r\n            document.getElementById('redoxVal').textContent = `${this.state.redox} mV`;\r\n            this.updateSystem();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('ctrlPH').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.pH = parseFloat(e.target.value);\r\n            document.getElementById('phVal').textContent = this.state.pH.toFixed(1);\r\n            this.updateSystem();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('ctrlIonic').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.ionicStrength = parseFloat(e.target.value);\r\n            document.getElementById('ionicVal').textContent = `${this.state.ionicStrength.toFixed(2)} M`;\r\n            this.updateSystem();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Controles de matriz\r\n        ['ctrlFitatos', 'ctrlOxalatos', 'ctrlTaninos', 'ctrlVitC'].forEach((id, idx) => {\r\n            document.getElementById(id).addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n                const value = parseInt(e.target.value);\r\n                const param = ['fitatos', 'oxalatos', 'taninos', 'vitC'][idx];\r\n                this.state[param] = value;\r\n                document.getElementById(`${param}Val`).textContent = \r\n                    param === 'vitC' ? `${value} mg` : `${value}%`;\r\n                this.updateSystem();\r\n            });\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Controles cin\u00e9ticos\r\n        document.getElementById('ctrlJmax').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.Jmax = parseInt(e.target.value);\r\n            this.updateKineticPlot();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('ctrlKt').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.Kt = parseInt(e.target.value);\r\n            this.updateKineticPlot();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('ctrlP').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.P = parseFloat(e.target.value);\r\n            this.updateKineticPlot();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Control de velocidad de animaci\u00f3n\r\n        document.getElementById('animSpeed').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.animationSpeed = parseInt(e.target.value);\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    setupButtons() {\r\n        \/\/ Botones de animaci\u00f3n\r\n        document.getElementById('toggleAnimationBtn').addEventListener('click', () => this.toggleAnimation());\r\n        document.getElementById('resetAnimationBtn').addEventListener('click', () => this.resetAnimation());\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Botones de casos cl\u00ednicos\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.case-opt').forEach(btn => {\r\n            btn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\r\n                const option = parseInt(e.target.dataset.option);\r\n                this.evaluateCase(option);\r\n            });\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Botones de quiz\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-options button').forEach(btn => {\r\n            btn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\r\n                const quiz = parseInt(e.target.dataset.quiz);\r\n                const option = parseInt(e.target.dataset.option);\r\n                this.checkQuiz(quiz, option, e.target);\r\n            });\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Botones de meta-cognici\u00f3n\r\n        document.getElementById('toggleConceptMapBtn').addEventListener('click', () => this.toggleConceptMap());\r\n        document.getElementById('analyzePatternBtn').addEventListener('click', () => this.analyzePattern());\r\n        document.getElementById('generateQuizBtn').addEventListener('click', () => this.generatePersonalizedQuiz());\r\n        document.getElementById('showLearningPathBtn').addEventListener('click', () => this.showLearningPath());\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    calculateThermodynamicParameters() {\r\n        \/\/ \u0394G de solubilidad (simplificado)\r\n        const deltaG = -8.3 - (this.state.pH - 7) * 2.5 + this.state.ionicStrength * 10;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Constante de quelaci\u00f3n dependiente de pH\r\n        const pKa = 6.0; \/\/ pKa promedio de fitatos\r\n        const protonation = 1 \/ (1 + Math.pow(10, this.state.pH - pKa));\r\n        const Kquel = Math.pow(10, 18) * protonation;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ [Fe\u00b2\u207a] libre considerando reducci\u00f3n por vitamina C\r\n        const reductionPotential = 1 - Math.abs(this.state.redox) \/ 300;\r\n        const feFree = 12.4 * reductionPotential * (1 - this.state.fitatos\/100);\r\n        \r\n        return { deltaG, Kquel, feFree };\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    calculateBioavailability() {\r\n        const params = this.calculateThermodynamicParameters();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Modelo multifactorial\r\n        const solubilityFactor = Math.exp(-params.deltaG \/ 8.314 \/ 310); \/\/ RT a 37\u00b0C\r\n        const chelationFactor = 1 \/ (1 + params.Kquel \/ 1e15);\r\n        const reductionFactor = 1 - Math.exp(-this.state.vitC \/ 50);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Factores de inhibici\u00f3n\r\n        const inhibition = \r\n            (this.state.fitatos\/100) * 0.6 +\r\n            (this.state.oxalatos\/100) * 0.3 +\r\n            (this.state.taninos\/100) * 0.1;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Biodisponibilidad final\r\n        let F = solubilityFactor * chelationFactor * reductionFactor * (1 - inhibition);\r\n        F = Math.max(0.01, Math.min(0.4, F)) * 100; \/\/ Entre 1% y 40%\r\n        \r\n        return { F, ...params };\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    updateSystem() {\r\n        const results = this.calculateBioavailability();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar par\u00e1metros\r\n        document.getElementById('paramDeltaG').textContent = results.deltaG.toFixed(1);\r\n        document.getElementById('paramKq').textContent = `10${Math.floor(Math.log10(results.Kquel))}`;\r\n        document.getElementById('visDeltaG').textContent = results.deltaG.toFixed(1);\r\n        document.getElementById('visKquel').textContent = `10${Math.floor(Math.log10(results.Kquel))}`;\r\n        document.getElementById('visFeFree').textContent = results.feFree.toFixed(1);\r\n        document.getElementById('visFBio').textContent = `${results.F.toFixed(1)}%`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Barras de visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n        document.getElementById('barDeltaG').style.width = `${Math.min(100, (results.deltaG + 20) * 2.5)}%`;\r\n        document.getElementById('barKquel').style.width = `${Math.min(100, Math.log10(results.Kquel) * 5)}%`;\r\n        document.getElementById('barFeFree').style.width = `${Math.min(100, results.feFree * 4)}%`;\r\n        document.getElementById('barFBio').style.width = `${Math.min(100, results.F * 2.5)}%`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Log del sistema\r\n        const log = document.getElementById('visLog');\r\n        const now = new Date();\r\n        log.innerHTML = `\r\n            [${now.getHours().toString().padStart(2, '0')}:${now.getMinutes().toString().padStart(2, '0')}] > Eh = ${this.state.redox} mV\r\n            [${now.getHours().toString().padStart(2, '0')}:${now.getMinutes().toString().padStart(2, '0')}] > pH = ${this.state.pH.toFixed(1)}\r\n            [${now.getHours().toString().padStart(2, '0')}:${now.getMinutes().toString().padStart(2, '0')}] > Fe\u00b2\u207a libre = ${results.feFree.toFixed(1)} \u03bcM\r\n            [${now.getHours().toString().padStart(2, '0')}:${now.getMinutes().toString().padStart(2, '0')}] > F = ${results.F.toFixed(1)}%\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar par\u00e1metros del modelo\r\n        document.getElementById('paramVmax').textContent = this.state.Jmax;\r\n        document.getElementById('paramKm').textContent = this.state.Kt;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Registrar concepto activado\r\n        this.registerConcept('thermodynamics');\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    updateKineticPlot() {\r\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('kineticCanvas');\r\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar canvas\r\n        ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Dibujar ejes\r\n        ctx.strokeStyle = '#00f2ff';\r\n        ctx.lineWidth = 2;\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        ctx.moveTo(50, 250);\r\n        ctx.lineTo(550, 250);\r\n        ctx.moveTo(50, 50);\r\n        ctx.lineTo(50, 250);\r\n        ctx.stroke();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Etiquetas\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#e2e8f0';\r\n        ctx.font = '12px monospace';\r\n        ctx.fillText('[S] (\u03bcM)', 300, 280);\r\n        ctx.save();\r\n        ctx.translate(20, 150);\r\n        ctx.rotate(-Math.PI\/2);\r\n        ctx.fillText('J (mg\/h)', 0, 0);\r\n        ctx.restore();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Calcular y dibujar curva\r\n        ctx.strokeStyle = '#00ff88';\r\n        ctx.lineWidth = 3;\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        \r\n        for(let s = 0; s <= 200; s += 5) {\r\n            const J = (this.state.Jmax * s) \/ (this.state.Kt + s) + this.state.P * s;\r\n            const x = 50 + (s \/ 200) * 500;\r\n            const y = 250 - (J \/ this.state.Jmax * 1.5) * 200;\r\n            \r\n            if(s === 0) ctx.moveTo(x, y);\r\n            else ctx.lineTo(x, y);\r\n        }\r\n        ctx.stroke();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Punto Vmax\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#f59e0b';\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        ctx.arc(300, 50, 6, 0, Math.PI * 2);\r\n        ctx.fill();\r\n        ctx.fillText(`Vmax = ${this.state.Jmax}`, 320, 55);\r\n        \r\n        this.registerConcept('kinetics');\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    drawStaticScene() {\r\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('molecularCanvas');\r\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar canvas\r\n        ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Dibujar enterocito\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0, 242, 255, 0.1)';\r\n        ctx.fillRect(100, 100, 200, 150);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Membrana\r\n        ctx.strokeStyle = '#00f2ff';\r\n        ctx.lineWidth = 2;\r\n        ctx.strokeRect(100, 100, 200, 150);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Microvellosidades\r\n        for(let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\r\n            ctx.beginPath();\r\n            ctx.moveTo(120 + i * 16, 100);\r\n            ctx.lineTo(120 + i * 16, 80);\r\n            ctx.stroke();\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mol\u00e9culas est\u00e1ticas\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#f59e0b';\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        ctx.arc(150, 180, 8, 0, Math.PI * 2);\r\n        ctx.fill();\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#e2e8f0';\r\n        ctx.font = '10px monospace';\r\n        ctx.fillText('Fe\u00b2\u207a', 145, 195);\r\n        \r\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#00ff88';\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        ctx.arc(250, 180, 8, 0, Math.PI * 2);\r\n        ctx.fill();\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#e2e8f0';\r\n        ctx.fillText('VitC', 245, 195);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    animate() {\r\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('molecularCanvas');\r\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\r\n        const time = Date.now() * 0.001 * this.animationSpeed;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar con desvanecimiento\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(5, 5, 7, 0.1)';\r\n        ctx.fillRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Dibujar enterocito est\u00e1tico\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0, 242, 255, 0.1)';\r\n        ctx.fillRect(100, 100, 200, 150);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Membrana\r\n        ctx.strokeStyle = '#00f2ff';\r\n        ctx.lineWidth = 2;\r\n        ctx.strokeRect(100, 100, 200, 150);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Microvellosidades\r\n        for(let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\r\n            ctx.beginPath();\r\n            ctx.moveTo(120 + i * 16, 100);\r\n            ctx.lineTo(120 + i * 16, 80);\r\n            ctx.stroke();\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Dibujar mol\u00e9culas animadas\r\n        for(let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\r\n            const x = 150 + Math.sin(time + i * 0.5) * 100;\r\n            const y = 150 + Math.cos(time + i * 0.7) * 50;\r\n            \r\n            ctx.fillStyle = i < 2 ? '#f59e0b' : '#00ff88';\r\n            ctx.beginPath();\r\n            ctx.arc(x, y, 8, 0, Math.PI * 2);\r\n            ctx.fill();\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Etiqueta\r\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#e2e8f0';\r\n            ctx.font = '10px monospace';\r\n            ctx.fillText(i < 2 ? 'Fe\u00b2\u207a' : 'VitC', x - 10, y - 12);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        this.animationId = requestAnimationFrame(() => this.animate());\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    toggleAnimation() {\r\n        const btn = document.getElementById('toggleAnimationBtn');\r\n        \r\n        if(this.animationId) {\r\n            cancelAnimationFrame(this.animationId);\r\n            this.animationId = null;\r\n            btn.textContent = '\u25b6 ANIMAR';\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.animate();\r\n            btn.textContent = '\u23f8 PAUSAR';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        this.registerConcept('molecular_dynamics');\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    resetAnimation() {\r\n        if(this.animationId) {\r\n            cancelAnimationFrame(this.animationId);\r\n            this.animationId = null;\r\n            document.getElementById('toggleAnimationBtn').textContent = '\u25b6 ANIMAR';\r\n        }\r\n        this.drawStaticScene();\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    startInteractionTimer() {\r\n        setInterval(() => {\r\n            const elapsed = Math.floor((Date.now() - this.state.interactionStart) \/ 60000);\r\n            document.getElementById('interactionTime').textContent = elapsed;\r\n            document.getElementById('simTime').textContent = `t = ${elapsed * 60} s`;\r\n        }, 1000);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    registerConcept(concept) {\r\n        if(!this.state.activatedConcepts.has(concept)) {\r\n            this.state.activatedConcepts.add(concept);\r\n            document.getElementById('conceptsActivated').textContent = \r\n                this.state.activatedConcepts.size;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Actualizar eficiencia cognitiva\r\n            const efficiency = Math.min(100, this.state.activatedConcepts.size * 4.2);\r\n            document.getElementById('cognitiveEfficiency').textContent = `${efficiency}%`;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    evaluateCase(option) {\r\n        const feedback = document.getElementById('caseFeedback');\r\n        let message = '';\r\n        let color = '';\r\n        \r\n        switch(option) {\r\n            case 1:\r\n                message = '\u274c INCORRECTO: Aumentar dosis sin mejorar matriz solo satura transporte.';\r\n                color = '#ff3e3e';\r\n                break;\r\n            case 2:\r\n                message = '\u2705 CORRECTO: La germinaci\u00f3n reduce fitatos y la vitamina C mejora reducci\u00f3n Fe\u00b3\u207a\u2192Fe\u00b2\u207a.';\r\n                color = '#00ff88';\r\n                this.state.quizScore += 3;\r\n                break;\r\n            case 3:\r\n                message = '\u274c INCORRECTO: El calcio compite con hierro por transporte, reduciendo absorci\u00f3n.';\r\n                color = '#ff3e3e';\r\n                break;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        feedback.innerHTML = message;\r\n        feedback.style.color = color;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Deshabilitar botones\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.case-opt').forEach(btn => {\r\n            btn.disabled = true;\r\n            if(parseInt(btn.dataset.option) === 2) {\r\n                btn.style.background = '#00ff88';\r\n                btn.style.color = '#000';\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        this.updateQuizScore();\r\n        this.registerConcept('clinical_application');\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    checkQuiz(quizNumber, option, button) {\r\n        const correctAnswers = {\r\n            1: 1, \/\/ K_M = concentraci\u00f3n a Vmax\/2\r\n            2: 1, \/\/ 100\/(20+100) = 0.833 = 83%\r\n            3: 2  \/\/ pH alto desprotona \u2192 mayor carga negativa \u2192 mayor quelaci\u00f3n\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        const isCorrect = correctAnswers[quizNumber] === option;\r\n        const buttons = button.parentElement.querySelectorAll('button');\r\n        \r\n        buttons.forEach(btn => {\r\n            btn.disabled = true;\r\n            if(parseInt(btn.dataset.option) === correctAnswers[quizNumber]) {\r\n                btn.style.background = '#00ff88';\r\n                btn.style.color = '#000';\r\n            } else if(btn === button && !isCorrect) {\r\n                btn.style.background = '#ff3e3e';\r\n                btn.style.color = '#fff';\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        if(isCorrect) {\r\n            this.state.quizScore += 3;\r\n            this.registerConcept(`quiz_level_${quizNumber}`);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        this.updateQuizScore();\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    updateQuizScore() {\r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = this.state.quizScore;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar desglose\r\n        const breakdown = document.getElementById('scoreBreakdown');\r\n        const levels = ['B\u00e1sico', 'Aplicaci\u00f3n', 'An\u00e1lisis'];\r\n        let html = '';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Calcular puntaje por nivel (simplificado)\r\n        const levelScores = [0, 0, 0];\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-level').forEach((level, idx) => {\r\n            const buttons = level.querySelectorAll('.quiz-options button');\r\n            const anyAnswered = Array.from(buttons).some(btn => btn.disabled);\r\n            \r\n            if(anyAnswered) {\r\n                \/\/ Verificar si la respuesta correcta est\u00e1 marcada\r\n                const correctBtn = Array.from(buttons).find(btn => \r\n                    btn.style.background === 'rgb(0, 255, 136)' || \r\n                    btn.style.backgroundColor === '#00ff88'\r\n                );\r\n                levelScores[idx] = correctBtn ? 3 : 0;\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            html += `<div>${levels[idx]}: ${levelScores[idx]}\/3<\/div>`;\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        breakdown.innerHTML = html;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    toggleConceptMap() {\r\n        const map = document.getElementById('conceptMap');\r\n        const btn = document.getElementById('toggleConceptMapBtn');\r\n        \r\n        if(map.style.display === 'none' || !map.style.display) {\r\n            map.style.display = 'block';\r\n            btn.textContent = 'OCULTAR MAPA';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Generar mapa conceptual din\u00e1mico\r\n            const concepts = [\r\n                'Termodin\u00e1mica \u2192 \u0394G solubilidad',\r\n                'Cin\u00e9tica \u2192 Transporte saturable',\r\n                'Redox \u2192 Fe\u00b3\u207a\/Fe\u00b2\u207a',\r\n                'pH \u2192 Protonaci\u00f3n quelantes',\r\n                'Matriz \u2192 Interacciones competitivas',\r\n                'Escala \u2192 \u00c5 \u2192 nm \u2192 \u03bcm \u2192 organismo',\r\n                'Transporte \u2192 Transcelular + Paracelular',\r\n                'Regulaci\u00f3n \u2192 Homeostasis sist\u00e9mica'\r\n            ];\r\n            \r\n            let html = '<div class=\"concept-grid\">';\r\n            concepts.forEach(concept => {\r\n                html += `<div class=\"concept-node\">${concept}<\/div>`;\r\n            });\r\n            html += '<\/div>';\r\n            map.innerHTML = html;\r\n        } else {\r\n            map.style.display = 'none';\r\n            btn.textContent = 'EXPANDIR MAPA';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        this.registerConcept('concept_mapping');\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    analyzePattern() {\r\n        const dose = parseFloat(document.getElementById('inputDose').value) || 15;\r\n        const vitC = parseFloat(document.getElementById('inputVitC').value) || 50;\r\n        const fitatos = parseFloat(document.getElementById('inputFitatos').value) || 30;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ An\u00e1lisis simplificado\r\n        let analysis = `<strong>An\u00e1lisis para:<\/strong><br>`;\r\n        analysis += `\u2022 Dosis: ${dose} mg<br>`;\r\n        analysis += `\u2022 Vitamina C: ${vitC} mg<br>`;\r\n        analysis += `\u2022 Fitatos: ${fitatos}%<br><br>`;\r\n        \r\n        if(dose > 50 && vitC < 30) {\r\n            analysis += '\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>ALTO RIESGO DE SATURACI\u00d3N:<\/strong> Dosis alta con reducci\u00f3n insuficiente.<br>';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        if(fitatos > 40) {\r\n            analysis += '\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>QUELACI\u00d3N SIGNIFICATIVA:<\/strong> Considerar germinaci\u00f3n o fermentaci\u00f3n.<br>';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        if(vitC > 75 && fitatos < 20) {\r\n            analysis += '\u2705 <strong>CONDICIONES \u00d3PTIMAS:<\/strong> Reducci\u00f3n adecuada, baja inhibici\u00f3n.<br>';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        const F = Math.min(40, dose * 0.5 * (1 - fitatos\/100) * (1 + vitC\/100));\r\n        analysis += `<br>\ud83d\udcca <strong>BIODISPONIBILIDAD ESTIMADA:<\/strong> ${F.toFixed(1)}%`;\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('patternOutput').innerHTML = analysis;\r\n        this.registerConcept('pattern_analysis');\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    generatePersonalizedQuiz() {\r\n        const feedback = document.getElementById('adaptiveFeedback');\r\n        const concepts = Array.from(this.state.activatedConcepts);\r\n        \r\n        let suggestion = '<strong>Basado en tu interacci\u00f3n, el sistema sugiere profundizar en:<\/strong><br><br>';\r\n        \r\n        if(!concepts.includes('thermodynamics')) {\r\n            suggestion += '\u2022 <strong>Termodin\u00e1mica de soluciones:<\/strong> \u0394G y constante de equilibrio<br>';\r\n        }\r\n        if(!concepts.includes('kinetics')) {\r\n            suggestion += '\u2022 <strong>Cin\u00e9tica enzim\u00e1tica:<\/strong> Michaelis-Menten y saturaci\u00f3n<br>';\r\n        }\r\n        if(!concepts.includes('clinical_application')) {\r\n            suggestion += '\u2022 <strong>Aplicaci\u00f3n cl\u00ednica:<\/strong> Optimizaci\u00f3n de biodisponibilidad<br>';\r\n        }\r\n        if(!concepts.includes('molecular_dynamics')) {\r\n            suggestion += '\u2022 <strong>Din\u00e1mica molecular:<\/strong> Interacciones a escala \u00c5<br>';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        if(concepts.length >= 5) {\r\n            suggestion += '<br><strong>\u00a1Excelente progreso! Has activado ' + concepts.length + ' conceptos.<\/strong>';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        feedback.innerHTML = suggestion;\r\n        this.registerConcept('adaptive_feedback');\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    showLearningPath() {\r\n        const concepts = Array.from(this.state.activatedConcepts);\r\n        let path = '<strong>Ruta de aprendizaje sugerida:<\/strong><br><br>';\r\n        \r\n        if(!concepts.includes('thermodynamics')) {\r\n            path += '1. <strong>Fundamentos termodin\u00e1micos<\/strong> (\u0394G, K, solubilidad)<br>';\r\n        }\r\n        if(!concepts.includes('kinetics')) {\r\n            path += '2. <strong>Cin\u00e9tica de transporte<\/strong> (Michaelis-Menten, Vmax, Km)<br>';\r\n        }\r\n        if(!concepts.includes('clinical_application')) {\r\n            path += '3. <strong>Aplicaci\u00f3n cl\u00ednica<\/strong> (casos reales, optimizaci\u00f3n)<br>';\r\n        }\r\n        if(!concepts.includes('concept_mapping')) {\r\n            path += '4. <strong>Integraci\u00f3n conceptual<\/strong> (mapas mentales)<br>';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        if(concepts.length >= 6) {\r\n            path += '<br><strong>Avanzado:<\/strong> Modelado multifactorial y simulaci\u00f3n';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('adaptiveFeedback').innerHTML = path;\r\n        this.registerConcept('learning_path');\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ =====================================================\r\n\/\/ FUNCIONES GLOBALES PARA INTERACTIVIDAD\r\n\/\/ =====================================================\r\n\r\nlet quantumSystem;\r\n\r\nfunction activateNeuroNode(index) {\r\n    const nodes = document.querySelectorAll('.neuro-node');\r\n    nodes.forEach(node => node.classList.remove('active'));\r\n    nodes[index].classList.add('active');\r\n    \r\n    if(quantumSystem) {\r\n        quantumSystem.state.activeNode = index;\r\n        quantumSystem.registerConcept(`phase_${index + 1}`);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar log del sistema\r\n        const phases = ['LIBERACI\u00d3N', 'SOLUBILIZACI\u00d3N', 'TRANSPORTE', 'METABOLISMO'];\r\n        document.getElementById('systemLog').innerHTML = \r\n            `> FASE ACTIVA: ${phases[index]}\\n> PROCESANDO PAR\u00c1METROS...\\n> SIMULACI\u00d3N EN CURSO`;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction activatePathway(pathway) {\r\n    const pathways = document.querySelectorAll('.pathway');\r\n    pathways.forEach(p => p.classList.remove('active'));\r\n    document.querySelector(`[data-path=\"${pathway}\"]`).classList.add('active');\r\n    \r\n    if(quantumSystem) {\r\n        quantumSystem.state.activePathway = pathway;\r\n        quantumSystem.registerConcept(`pathway_${pathway}`);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ =====================================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ =====================================================\r\n\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\r\n    \/\/ Inicializar sistema\r\n    quantumSystem = new QuantumBioavailabilitySystem();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar interactividad adicional\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.scale-level').forEach(level => {\r\n        level.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const scale = this.getAttribute('data-scale');\r\n            quantumSystem.registerConcept(`scale_${scale}`);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Efecto visual\r\n            this.style.transform = 'scale(1.02)';\r\n            setTimeout(() => {\r\n                this.style.transform = 'scale(1)';\r\n            }, 300);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto de glitch en el t\u00edtulo\r\n    const title = document.querySelector('.quantum-text');\r\n    setInterval(() => {\r\n        if(Math.random() > 0.7) {\r\n            title.style.textShadow = '2px 2px 0 #f0f, -2px -2px 0 #0ff';\r\n            setTimeout(() => {\r\n                title.style.textShadow = 'none';\r\n            }, 100);\r\n        }\r\n    }, 2000);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar sistema inicial\r\n    quantumSystem.updateSystem();\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Exponer funciones globales\r\nwindow.activateNeuroNode = activateNeuroNode;\r\nwindow.activatePathway = activatePathway;\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 la absorci\u00f3n de hierro no-hemo es no-lineal respecto a la dosis?","respuesta":"Debido a la saturaci\u00f3n de los transportadores DMT1 (cin\u00e9tica de Michaelis-Menten)."},{"enunciado":"Define Bioaccesibilidad.","respuesta":"Fracci\u00f3n del nutriente que se libera de la matriz del alimento y queda disponible para la absorci\u00f3n en el quimo."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la funci\u00f3n del \u00e1cido asc\u00f3rbico en la termodin\u00e1mica del hierro?","respuesta":"Reduce el Fe3+ insoluble a Fe2+ soluble, permitiendo su captaci\u00f3n por DMT1."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 indica el valor Km en el contexto de la absorci\u00f3n?","respuesta":"La afinidad del transportador por el nutriente; representa la concentraci\u00f3n a la cual la absorci\u00f3n es la mitad de la Vmax."},{"enunciado":"Mencione un inhibidor que act\u00fae por quelaci\u00f3n.","respuesta":"Fitatos (presentes en cereales y legumbres) o Oxalatos (espinacas)."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo influye el \"Efecto de Primer Paso\" en la biodisponibilidad sist\u00e9mica?","respuesta":"Reduce la cantidad de nutriente\/f\u00e1rmaco que llega a la sangre debido al metabolismo previo en el h\u00edgado o mucosa intestinal."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 mide la t\u00e9cnica TEER en modelos Caco-2?","respuesta":"La integridad de las uniones estrechas y la formaci\u00f3n de una barrera epitelial funcional."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el transportador espec\u00edfico para el Hierro Hemo?","respuesta":"HCP1 (Heme Carrier Protein 1)."},{"enunciado":"Explique por qu\u00e9 la fibra excesiva reduce F.","respuesta":"Por adsorci\u00f3n f\u00edsica del nutriente y por la aceleraci\u00f3n del tiempo de tr\u00e1nsito intestinal."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 sucede con el hierro en el enterocito si no pasa a la sangre?","respuesta":"Se almacena unido a la ferritina y se pierde cuando el enterocito se descama (cada 3-5 d\u00edas)."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 hormona regula negativamente la salida de hierro a la sangre?","respuesta":"La hepcidina (bloquea la ferroportina)."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 la vitamina D es crucial para la biodisponibilidad del Calcio?","respuesta":"Promueve la s\u00edntesis de calbindina y la expresi\u00f3n de canales TRPV6 en el enterocito."}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"La cin\u00e9tica de Michaelis-Menten explica que la absorci\u00f3n:","opciones":["Es infinita","Se satura a altas concentraciones","Es siempre lineal","No depende del sustrato"],"correcta":"Se satura a altas concentraciones"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el estado de oxidaci\u00f3n del hierro preferido por el transportador DMT1?","opciones":["Fe3+","Fe2+","Fe0","Fe4+"],"correcta":"Fe2+"},{"pregunta":"Los fitatos disminuyen la biodisponibilidad porque:","opciones":["Son t\u00f3xicos","Forman complejos insolubles","Saben mal","Destruyen las c\u00e9lulas"],"correcta":"Forman complejos insolubles"},{"pregunta":"La bioaccesibilidad se refiere a la fracci\u00f3n:","opciones":["En sangre","Liberada en el lumen","En el h\u00edgado","En la orina"],"correcta":"Liberada en el lumen"},{"pregunta":"El modelo Caco-2 simula el epitelio del:","opciones":["Est\u00f3mago","Intestino delgado","Pulm\u00f3n","Ri\u00f1\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Intestino delgado"},{"pregunta":"La hepcidina bloquea el transporte de hierro hacia la sangre al unirse a:","opciones":["DMT1","Ferroportina","Ferritina","Alb\u00famina"],"correcta":"Ferroportina"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 nutriente mejora la biodisponibilidad de los carotenoides?","opciones":["Agua","Grasas (L\u00edpidos)","Prote\u00ednas puras","Fibra"],"correcta":"Grasas (L\u00edpidos)"},{"pregunta":"El efecto de primer paso ocurre principalmente en:","opciones":["El H\u00edgado","El Coraz\u00f3n","El P\u00e1ncreas","El Bazo"],"correcta":"El H\u00edgado"},{"pregunta":"La t\u00e9cnica de is\u00f3topos estables es superior porque:","opciones":["Es m\u00e1s barata","No usa radiaci\u00f3n y es precisa","Es muy r\u00e1pida","No requiere muestras"],"correcta":"No usa radiaci\u00f3n y es precisa"},{"pregunta":"Un valor de Km bajo en un transportador indica:","opciones":["Baja afinidad","Alta afinidad","No hay afinidad","El sistema est\u00e1 roto"],"correcta":"Alta afinidad"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 proceso rompe la matriz del alimento aumentando la bioaccesibilidad?","opciones":["La masticaci\u00f3n y digesti\u00f3n \u00e1cida","Dormir","Beber agua","La luz solar"],"correcta":"La masticaci\u00f3n y digesti\u00f3n \u00e1cida"},{"pregunta":"La calbindina es una prote\u00edna de transporte para:","opciones":["Hierro","Calcio","Zinc","Magnesio"],"correcta":"Calcio"},{"pregunta":"La biodisponibilidad absoluta se calcula comparando la dosis oral con:","opciones":["La dosis rectal","La dosis intravenosa","La dosis t\u00f3pica","Ninguna"],"correcta":"La dosis intravenosa"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 el t\u00e9 reduce la absorci\u00f3n de hierro?","opciones":["Por sus taninos","Por la cafe\u00edna","Por el calor","Por el agua"],"correcta":"Por sus taninos"},{"pregunta":"El borde en cepillo (microvellosidades) sirve para:","opciones":["Aumentar el \u00e1rea de absorci\u00f3n","Mover el alimento","Producir \u00e1cido","Almacenar grasa"],"correcta":"Aumentar el \u00e1rea de absorci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 ocurre con F si el tr\u00e1nsito intestinal es demasiado r\u00e1pido?","opciones":["Aumenta","Disminuye","No cambia","Se detiene"],"correcta":"Disminuye"},{"pregunta":"El zinc compite por los transportadores con:","opciones":["El hierro","La glucosa","El sodio","La vitamina C"],"correcta":"El hierro"},{"pregunta":"La ferritina es una prote\u00edna que:","opciones":["Transporta hierro en sangre","Almacena hierro intracelular","Es una hormona","Es un az\u00facar"],"correcta":"Almacena hierro intracelular"},{"pregunta":"El protocolo INFOGEST es un modelo de digesti\u00f3n:","opciones":["In vivo","In vitro estandarizado","Matem\u00e1tico","Hist\u00f3rico"],"correcta":"In vitro estandarizado"},{"pregunta":"La fracci\u00f3n activa que llega a la sangre se denomina:","opciones":["Bioaccesible","Biodisponible","Biotransformada","Bioactiva"],"correcta":"Biodisponible"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l de estos es un transportador paracelular?","opciones":["DMT1","Claudinas (Tight Junctions)","HCP1","SGLT1"],"correcta":"Claudinas (Tight Junctions)"},{"pregunta":"La cocci\u00f3n aumenta la biodisponibilidad de los betacarotenos un:","opciones":["2%","600%","0%","10%"],"correcta":"600%"},{"pregunta":"El hierro hemo proviene principalmente de:","opciones":["Vegetales","Tejido animal (mioglobina)","Rocas","Aire"],"correcta":"Tejido animal (mioglobina)"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 pH favorece la solubilidad de los minerales en el est\u00f3mago?","opciones":["\u00c1cido","B\u00e1sico","Neutro","Extremo"],"correcta":"\u00c1cido"},{"pregunta":"La saturaci\u00f3n de transportadores se representa en la gr\u00e1fica como:","opciones":["Una recta","Una as\u00edntota horizontal","Un c\u00edrculo","Una recta vertical"],"correcta":"Una as\u00edntota horizontal"},{"pregunta":"La vitamina C mejora la absorci\u00f3n de:","opciones":["Hierro no-hemo","Grasas","Prote\u00ednas","Calcio l\u00e1cteo"],"correcta":"Hierro no-hemo"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 t\u00e9cnica mide el flujo de nutrientes a trav\u00e9s de una monocapa celular?","opciones":["Caco-2","PCR","Microscop\u00eda","Centrifugaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Caco-2"},{"pregunta":"La eliminaci\u00f3n presist\u00e9mica reduce:","opciones":["El sabor","La biodisponibilidad","El hambre","El peso"],"correcta":"La biodisponibilidad"},{"pregunta":"Un quelato es un complejo entre:","opciones":["Un metal y un ligando org\u00e1nico","Dos az\u00facares","Dos grasas","Dos prote\u00ednas"],"correcta":"Un metal y un ligando org\u00e1nico"},{"pregunta":"La nutrici\u00f3n sist\u00e9mica prioriza:","opciones":["La cantidad ingerida","La fracci\u00f3n biodisponible","El precio","El color"],"correcta":"La fracci\u00f3n biodisponible"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"biodisponibilidad-cuantica","titulo":"Biodisponibilidad Cu\u00e1ntica: De la Matriz Molecular al Fenotipo Sist\u00e9mico","contenido":"<!-- ===================================================== -->\r\n<!-- SISTEMA NEUROQU\u00cdMICO INTERACTIVO - VERSI\u00d3N CU\u00c1NTICA -->\r\n<!-- ===================================================== -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quantum-bio-system\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA HOLOGR\u00c1FICA -->\r\n    <div class=\"holo-header\">\r\n        <div class=\"phase-indicators\">\r\n            <div class=\"phase-indicator active\" data-phase=\"1\" onclick=\"activatePhase(1)\">\r\n                <div class=\"phase-glow\"><\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"phase-content\">\r\n                    <span class=\"phase-number\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"phase-name\">LIBERACI\u00d3N<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"phase-indicator\" data-phase=\"2\" onclick=\"activatePhase(2)\">\r\n                <div class=\"phase-glow\"><\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"phase-content\">\r\n                    <span class=\"phase-number\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"phase-name\">SOLUBILIZACI\u00d3N<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"phase-indicator\" data-phase=\"3\" onclick=\"activatePhase(3)\">\r\n                <div class=\"phase-glow\"><\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"phase-content\">\r\n                    <span class=\"phase-number\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"phase-name\">TRANSPORTE<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"phase-indicator\" data-phase=\"4\" onclick=\"activatePhase(4)\">\r\n                <div class=\"phase-glow\"><\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"phase-content\">\r\n                    <span class=\"phase-number\">04<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"phase-name\">METABOLISMO<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"system-status\">\r\n            <div class=\"status-dot\"><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"status-text\">\r\n                <span class=\"status-label\">ESTADO:<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"status-value\" id=\"systemStatus\">SIMULACI\u00d3N CU\u00c1NTICA ACTIVA<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- T\u00cdTULO CON EFECTO CU\u00c1NTICO -->\r\n    <div class=\"quantum-title-container\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"quantum-main-title\">\r\n            <span class=\"title-word\">BIODISPONIBILIDAD<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"title-word\">CU\u00c1NTICA<\/span>\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"quantum-subtitle\">\r\n            <span class=\"subtitle-part\">INTEGRACI\u00d3N MULTIESCALA<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"subtitle-part\">\u00c5 \u2192 nm \u2192 \u03bcm \u2192 cm \u2192 organismo<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL DE CONTROL PRINCIPAL -->\r\n    <div class=\"master-control-panel\">\r\n        <div class=\"control-header\">\r\n            <h3>PANEL DE CONTROL CU\u00c1NTICO<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"control-buttons\">\r\n                <button class=\"ctrl-btn\" id=\"resetSimBtn\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u21bb<\/span>\r\n                    REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"ctrl-btn\" id=\"autoOptimizeBtn\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n                    OPTIMIZAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"ctrl-btn\" id=\"exportDataBtn\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span>\r\n                    EXPORTAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"parameter-grid\">\r\n            <!-- PAR\u00c1METROS QU\u00cdMICOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"param-group\">\r\n                <h4 class=\"param-group-title\">PAR\u00c1METROS QU\u00cdMICOS<\/h4>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"param-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"param-info\">\r\n                        <span class=\"param-label\">pH LUMINAL<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"param-value\" id=\"pHValue\">7.0<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" class=\"quantum-range\" id=\"pHControl\" min=\"1\" max=\"9\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"7.0\">\r\n                    <div class=\"param-scale\">\r\n                        <span>\u00c1CIDO<\/span>\r\n                        <span>NEUTRO<\/span>\r\n                        <span>B\u00c1SICO<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"param-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"param-info\">\r\n                        <span class=\"param-label\">POTENCIAL REDOX<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"param-value\" id=\"redoxValue\">+150 mV<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" class=\"quantum-range\" id=\"redoxControl\" min=\"-300\" max=\"300\" step=\"10\" value=\"150\">\r\n                    <div class=\"param-scale\">\r\n                        <span>REDUCIDO<\/span>\r\n                        <span>OXIDADO<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"param-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"param-info\">\r\n                        <span class=\"param-label\">FUERZA I\u00d3NICA<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"param-value\" id=\"ionicValue\">0.15 M<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" class=\"quantum-range\" id=\"ionicControl\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0.15\">\r\n                    <div class=\"param-scale\">\r\n                        <span>D\u00c9BIL<\/span>\r\n                        <span>FUERTE<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- MATRIZ ALIMENTARIA -->\r\n            <div class=\"param-group\">\r\n                <h4 class=\"param-group-title\">MATRIZ ALIMENTARIA<\/h4>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"matrix-factors\">\r\n                    <div class=\"matrix-factor\">\r\n                        <div class=\"factor-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"factor-name\">FITATOS<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"factor-value\" id=\"fitatoValue\">30%<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" class=\"matrix-range\" id=\"fitatoControl\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"30\">\r\n                        <div class=\"factor-effect\" id=\"fitatoEffect\">MODERADO<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"matrix-factor\">\r\n                        <div class=\"factor-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"factor-name\">VITAMINA C<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"factor-value\" id=\"vitcValue\">50 mg<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" class=\"matrix-range\" id=\"vitcControl\" min=\"0\" max=\"200\" value=\"50\">\r\n                        <div class=\"factor-effect\" id=\"vitcEffect\">MODERADO<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"matrix-factor\">\r\n                        <div class=\"factor-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"factor-name\">OXALATOS<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"factor-value\" id=\"oxalatoValue\">20%<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" class=\"matrix-range\" id=\"oxalatoControl\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\">\r\n                        <div class=\"factor-effect\" id=\"oxalatoEffect\">BAJO<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"realtime-visualization\">\r\n                <div class=\"viz-header\">\r\n                    <h4>ESTADO DEL SISTEMA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"viz-time\" id=\"currentTime\">00:00:00<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"bioavailability-display\">\r\n                    <div class=\"bio-metric\">\r\n                        <div class=\"metric-label\">BIODISPONIBILIDAD (F)<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"metric-value\" id=\"bioavailabilityValue\">15.2%<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"metric-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"bar-fill\" id=\"bioavailabilityBar\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"secondary-metrics\">\r\n                        <div class=\"secondary-metric\">\r\n                            <span class=\"sm-label\">\u0394G SOLUBILIDAD<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"sm-value\" id=\"deltaGValue\">-8.3 kJ\/mol<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"secondary-metric\">\r\n                            <span class=\"sm-label\">[Fe\u00b2\u207a] LIBRE<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"sm-value\" id=\"freeFeValue\">12.4 \u03bcM<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"secondary-metric\">\r\n                            <span class=\"sm-label\">K<sub>QUEL<\/sub><\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"sm-value\" id=\"kquelValue\">10\u00b9\u2076 M\u207b\u00b9<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"system-log\" id=\"systemLog\">\r\n                    <div class=\"log-entry\">[00:00] Sistema inicializado<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"log-entry\">[00:00] Par\u00e1metros cargados<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"log-entry\">[00:00] Simulaci\u00f3n cu\u00e1ntica activa<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 1: ESCALAS MOLECULARES -->\r\n    <div class=\"scale-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n            <h2>ESCALAS MOLECULARES<\/h2>\r\n            <div class=\"section-subtitle\">De la coordinaci\u00f3n at\u00f3mica a la fisiolog\u00eda sist\u00e9mica<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"scale-visualization\">\r\n            <div class=\"scale-slider-container\">\r\n                <input type=\"range\" class=\"scale-slider\" id=\"scaleSlider\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" value=\"1\">\r\n                <div class=\"scale-labels\">\r\n                    <span data-scale=\"1\">\u00c5NGSTR\u00d6M<\/span>\r\n                    <span data-scale=\"2\">NAN\u00d3METRO<\/span>\r\n                    <span data-scale=\"3\">MICR\u00d3METRO<\/span>\r\n                    <span data-scale=\"4\">MIL\u00cdMETRO<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"scale-canvas-container\">\r\n                <canvas id=\"scaleCanvas\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\"><\/canvas>\r\n                <div class=\"scale-info\" id=\"scaleInfo\">\r\n                    <h3 id=\"scaleTitle\">ESCALA \u00c5NGSTR\u00d6M (10\u207b\u00b9\u2070 m)<\/h3>\r\n                    <p id=\"scaleDescription\">Enlaces qu\u00edmicos y geometr\u00eda molecular. Longitudes de enlace Fe-O: 2.05 \u00c5<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"scale-features\">\r\n            <div class=\"feature-card\" data-scale=\"1\">\r\n                <div class=\"feature-icon\">\u269b\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                <h3>NIVEL CU\u00c1NTICO<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Orbitales moleculares y enlaces qu\u00edmicos<\/p>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Geometr\u00eda de coordinaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Superficie electrost\u00e1tica<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Longitudes de enlace<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"feature-card\" data-scale=\"2\">\r\n                <div class=\"feature-icon\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/div>\r\n                <h3>NIVEL NANO<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Agregados moleculares y complejos<\/p>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Micelas mixtas<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Complejos prote\u00edna-ligando<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Transportadores ABC<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"feature-card\" data-scale=\"3\">\r\n                <div class=\"feature-icon\">\ud83e\uddeb<\/div>\r\n                <h3>NIVEL MICRO<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Estructuras celulares y tejidos<\/p>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Enterocitos (20-30 \u03bcm)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Microvellosidades<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Uniones estrechas<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"feature-card\" data-scale=\"4\">\r\n                <div class=\"feature-icon\">\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                <h3>NIVEL MACRO<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Sistemas fisiol\u00f3gicos completos<\/p>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Intestino (7 m longitud)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>\u00c1rea de absorci\u00f3n: 200 m\u00b2<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Homeostasis sist\u00e9mica<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 2: SIMULADOR CIN\u00c9TICO -->\r\n    <div class=\"kinetic-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n            <h2>CIN\u00c9TICA DE TRANSPORTE<\/h2>\r\n            <div class=\"section-subtitle\">Modelo Michaelis-Menten aplicado a DMT1<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"kinetic-simulator\">\r\n            <div class=\"kinetic-controls\">\r\n                <div class=\"kinetic-param\">\r\n                    <label for=\"kmControl\">K<sub>M<\/sub> DMT1<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"param-control\">\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" id=\"kmControl\" min=\"5\" max=\"100\" value=\"30\">\r\n                        <span class=\"param-display\" id=\"kmValue\">30 \u03bcM<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"kinetic-param\">\r\n                    <label for=\"vmaxControl\">V<sub>MAX<\/sub><\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"param-control\">\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" id=\"vmaxControl\" min=\"1\" max=\"50\" value=\"18\">\r\n                        <span class=\"param-display\" id=\"vmaxValue\">18 mg\/h<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"kinetic-param\">\r\n                    <label for=\"substrateControl\">[S] SUSTRATO<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"param-control\">\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" id=\"substrateControl\" min=\"0\" max=\"200\" value=\"50\">\r\n                        <span class=\"param-display\" id=\"substrateValue\">50 \u03bcM<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"kinetic-btn\" id=\"calculateKineticsBtn\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83e\uddee<\/span>\r\n                    CALCULAR CIN\u00c9TICA\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"kinetic-visualization\">\r\n                <div class=\"kinetic-graph\">\r\n                    <canvas id=\"kineticCanvas\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\"><\/canvas>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"kinetic-results\">\r\n                    <div class=\"result-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"result-label\">VELOCIDAD (V)<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"result-value\" id=\"velocityValue\">12.5 mg\/h<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"result-percentage\" id=\"velocityPercentage\">69.4% Vmax<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"result-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"result-label\">SATURACI\u00d3N<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"result-value\" id=\"saturationValue\">62.5%<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"result-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"result-fill\" id=\"saturationBar\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"result-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"result-label\">AFINIDAD<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"result-value\" id=\"affinityValue\">MEDIA<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"result-desc\">Km = 30 \u03bcM<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 3: CASOS CL\u00cdNICOS INTERACTIVOS -->\r\n    <div class=\"clinical-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n            <h2>CASOS CL\u00cdNICOS INTERACTIVOS<\/h2>\r\n            <div class=\"section-subtitle\">Aplicaci\u00f3n pr\u00e1ctica de principios qu\u00edmicos<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"case-navigation\">\r\n            <button class=\"case-nav-btn active\" data-case=\"1\">Caso 1<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"case-nav-btn\" data-case=\"2\">Caso 2<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"case-nav-btn\" data-case=\"3\">Caso 3<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"case-nav-btn\" data-case=\"4\">Caso 4<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"case-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"case-content\" data-case=\"1\">\r\n                <div class=\"case-header\">\r\n                    <h3>CASO 1: ANEMIA FERROP\u00c9NICA VEGETARIANA<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"case-difficulty\">COMPLEJIDAD: MEDIA<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"case-scenario\">\r\n                    <p>Paciente mujer, 35 a\u00f1os, dieta vegetariana estricta. Consume legumbres y espinacas diariamente. Presenta fatiga, palidez y niveles bajos de ferritina.<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"case-parameters\">\r\n                        <div class=\"case-param\">\r\n                            <span>Fe dieta:<\/span>\r\n                            <strong>18 mg\/d\u00eda<\/strong>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"case-param\">\r\n                            <span>Vitamina C:<\/span>\r\n                            <strong>30 mg\/d\u00eda<\/strong>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"case-param\">\r\n                            <span>Fitatos:<\/span>\r\n                            <strong class=\"high\">ALTO<\/strong>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"case-question\">\r\n                    <h4>\u00bfQU\u00c9 INTERVENCI\u00d3N QU\u00cdMICA OPTIMIZAR\u00cdA LA BIODISPONIBILIDAD?<\/h4>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"case-options\">\r\n                        <div class=\"case-option\" data-answer=\"A\">\r\n                            <div class=\"option-letter\">A<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"option-content\">\r\n                                <strong>Aumentar dosis de hierro a 30 mg\/d\u00eda<\/strong>\r\n                                <p>Incrementar la cantidad ingerida sin modificar matriz<\/p>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"case-option\" data-answer=\"B\">\r\n                            <div class=\"option-letter\">B<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"option-content\">\r\n                                <strong>Consumir legumbres germinadas + c\u00edtricos<\/strong>\r\n                                <p>Reducir fitatos y aumentar vitamina C simult\u00e1neamente<\/p>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"case-option\" data-answer=\"C\">\r\n                            <div class=\"option-letter\">C<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"option-content\">\r\n                                <strong>Suplementar con calcio adicional<\/strong>\r\n                                <p>A\u00f1adir calcio para \"fortalecer\" la absorci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"submit-case-btn\" data-case=\"1\">EVALUAR RESPUESTA<\/button>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"case-feedback\" id=\"case1Feedback\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 4: LABORATORIO VIRTUAL -->\r\n    <div class=\"lab-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n            <h2>LABORATORIO VIRTUAL<\/h2>\r\n            <div class=\"section-subtitle\">Experimentaci\u00f3n con variables cr\u00edticas<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"lab-experiment\">\r\n            <div class=\"experiment-controls\">\r\n                <div class=\"experiment-selector\">\r\n                    <h4>EXPERIMENTO SELECCIONADO<\/h4>\r\n                    <select id=\"experimentSelect\" class=\"experiment-dropdown\">\r\n                        <option value=\"1\">Experimento 1: Efecto del pH<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"2\">Experimento 2: Reducci\u00f3n redox<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"3\">Experimento 3: Inhibici\u00f3n competitiva<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"4\">Experimento 4: Sinergia nutriente<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"experiment-variables\" id=\"experiment1Vars\">\r\n                    <div class=\"variable-control\">\r\n                        <label>pH INICIAL: <span id=\"initialpH\">2.0<\/span><\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" class=\"experiment-range\" min=\"1\" max=\"3\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"2.0\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"variable-control\">\r\n                        <label>pH FINAL: <span id=\"finalpH\">8.0<\/span><\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" class=\"experiment-range\" min=\"6\" max=\"9\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"8.0\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"variable-control\">\r\n                        <label>TASA CAMBIO: <span id=\"changeRate\">0.5 pH\/min<\/span><\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" class=\"experiment-range\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"run-experiment-btn\" id=\"runExperimentBtn\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/span>\r\n                    EJECUTAR EXPERIMENTO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"experiment-results\">\r\n                <div class=\"result-graph\">\r\n                    <canvas id=\"experimentCanvas\" width=\"700\" height=\"350\"><\/canvas>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"experiment-conclusions\">\r\n                    <h4>CONCLUSIONES DEL EXPERIMENTO<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"conclusions-content\" id=\"experimentConclusions\">\r\n                        Selecciona y ejecuta un experimento para ver las conclusiones...\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 5: EVALUACI\u00d3N INTEGRADORA -->\r\n    <div class=\"assessment-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n            <h2>EVALUACI\u00d3N INTEGRADORA<\/h2>\r\n            <div class=\"section-subtitle\">Demuestra tu comprensi\u00f3n del sistema<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"assessment-progress\">\r\n            <div class=\"progress-bar\">\r\n                <div class=\"progress-fill\" id=\"assessmentProgress\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"progress-stats\">\r\n                <span id=\"currentQuestion\">1<\/span>\/<span id=\"totalQuestions\">10<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"progress-score\">PUNTAJE: <span id=\"assessmentScore\">0<\/span>\/100<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"assessment-questions\">\r\n            <div class=\"question active\" data-question=\"1\">\r\n                <div class=\"question-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"question-number\">PREGUNTA 1<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"question-difficulty\">B\u00c1SICO<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <p class=\"question-text\">\u00bfQu\u00e9 representa la constante K<sub>M<\/sub> en el modelo Michaelis-Menten aplicado al transporte de hierro?<\/p>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"question-options\">\r\n                    <label class=\"option\">\r\n                        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-text\">La velocidad m\u00e1xima de transporte<\/span>\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                    <label class=\"option\">\r\n                        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-text\">La concentraci\u00f3n de sustrato a la que V = \u00bdV<sub>max<\/sub><\/span>\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                    <label class=\"option\">\r\n                        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-text\">El coeficiente de difusi\u00f3n pasiva<\/span>\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                    <label class=\"option\">\r\n                        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-text\">La energ\u00eda de activaci\u00f3n del transporte<\/span>\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"question\" data-question=\"2\">\r\n                <div class=\"question-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"question-number\">PREGUNTA 2<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"question-difficulty\">INTERMEDIO<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <p class=\"question-text\">\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 la vitamina C mejora la absorci\u00f3n del hierro no-hemo?<\/p>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"question-options\">\r\n                    <label class=\"option\">\r\n                        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-text\">Aumenta el pH intestinal<\/span>\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                    <label class=\"option\">\r\n                        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-text\">Reduce Fe\u00b3\u207a a Fe\u00b2\u207a, m\u00e1s soluble<\/span>\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                    <label class=\"option\">\r\n                        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-text\">Quela los fitatos competitivamente<\/span>\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                    <label class=\"option\">\r\n                        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-text\">Aumenta la motilidad intestinal<\/span>\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"question\" data-question=\"3\">\r\n                <div class=\"question-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"question-number\">PREGUNTA 3<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"question-difficulty\">AVANZADO<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <p class=\"question-text\">En una soluci\u00f3n con pH 8.0 y alta concentraci\u00f3n de fitatos, \u00bfqu\u00e9 estrategia ser\u00eda M\u00c1S efectiva para mejorar la biodisponibilidad del hierro?<\/p>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"question-options\">\r\n                    <label class=\"option\">\r\n                        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-text\">Aumentar la dosis de hierro<\/span>\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                    <label class=\"option\">\r\n                        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-text\">Disminuir el pH y a\u00f1adir vitamina C<\/span>\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                    <label class=\"option\">\r\n                        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-text\">A\u00f1adir calcio para competir con fitatos<\/span>\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                    <label class=\"option\">\r\n                        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"q3\" value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-text\">Suplementar con zinc<\/span>\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"assessment-controls\">\r\n            <button class=\"assessment-btn prev-btn\" id=\"prevQuestionBtn\">\u2190 ANTERIOR<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"assessment-btn next-btn\" id=\"nextQuestionBtn\">SIGUIENTE \u2192<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"assessment-btn submit-btn\" id=\"submitAssessmentBtn\">FINALIZAR EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"assessment-results\" id=\"assessmentResults\"><\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL DE METACOGNICI\u00d3N -->\r\n    <div class=\"metacognition-panel\">\r\n        <div class=\"meta-header\">\r\n            <h3>PANEL DE METACOGNICI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n            <button class=\"meta-toggle\" id=\"metaToggleBtn\">\u25bc<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"meta-content\" id=\"metaContent\">\r\n            <div class=\"meta-stats\">\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"timeSpent\">00:00<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">TIEMPO<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"conceptsMastered\">0\/15<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">CONCEPTOS<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"interactionScore\">0%<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">INTERACCI\u00d3N<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"completionRate\">0%<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">COMPLETADO<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"meta-reflection\">\r\n                <h4>REFLEXI\u00d3N PERSONAL<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"reflection-prompts\">\r\n                    <div class=\"prompt\">\r\n                        <p>\u00bfQu\u00e9 concepto te result\u00f3 m\u00e1s desafiante?<\/p>\r\n                        <textarea class=\"reflection-input\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"prompt\">\r\n                        <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo aplicar\u00edas estos conceptos en un caso real?<\/p>\r\n                        <textarea class=\"reflection-input\" placeholder=\"Describe una aplicaci\u00f3n pr\u00e1ctica...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"save-reflection-btn\">GUARDAR REFLEXI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"learning-path\">\r\n                <h4>RUTA DE APRENDIZAJE SUGERIDA<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"path-steps\">\r\n                    <div class=\"path-step completed\">\r\n                        <span class=\"step-number\">1<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"step-text\">Fundamentos termodin\u00e1micos<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"path-step active\">\r\n                        <span class=\"step-number\">2<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"step-text\">Cin\u00e9tica de transporte<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"path-step\">\r\n                        <span class=\"step-number\">3<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"step-text\">Interacciones competitivas<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"path-step\">\r\n                        <span class=\"step-number\">4<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"step-text\">Aplicaci\u00f3n cl\u00ednica<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===================================================== -->\r\n<!-- SISTEMA JAVASCRIPT COMPLETAMENTE FUNCIONAL -->\r\n<!-- ===================================================== -->\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA PRINCIPAL\r\nclass QuantumBioavailabilitySystem {\r\n    constructor() {\r\n        this.state = {\r\n            \/\/ Par\u00e1metros qu\u00edmicos\r\n            pH: 7.0,\r\n            redox: 150,\r\n            ionicStrength: 0.15,\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Matriz alimentaria\r\n            fitatos: 30,\r\n            vitC: 50,\r\n            oxalatos: 20,\r\n            taninos: 15,\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Par\u00e1metros cin\u00e9ticos\r\n            Km: 30,\r\n            Vmax: 18,\r\n            substrate: 50,\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Estado del sistema\r\n            activePhase: 1,\r\n            currentScale: 1,\r\n            currentCase: 1,\r\n            currentExperiment: 1,\r\n            currentQuestion: 1,\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Estad\u00edsticas\r\n            startTime: Date.now(),\r\n            activatedConcepts: new Set(),\r\n            assessmentScore: 0,\r\n            answeredQuestions: new Set()\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        this.animationId = null;\r\n        this.timeInterval = null;\r\n        \r\n        this.init();\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    init() {\r\n        this.setupEventListeners();\r\n        this.updateSystem();\r\n        this.updateTime();\r\n        this.startTimeInterval();\r\n        this.drawScaleCanvas();\r\n        this.drawKineticGraph();\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    setupEventListeners() {\r\n        \/\/ Controles principales\r\n        document.getElementById('pHControl').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.pH = parseFloat(e.target.value);\r\n            document.getElementById('pHValue').textContent = this.state.pH.toFixed(1);\r\n            this.updateSystem();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('redoxControl').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.redox = parseInt(e.target.value);\r\n            document.getElementById('redoxValue').textContent = `${this.state.redox} mV`;\r\n            this.updateSystem();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('ionicControl').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.ionicStrength = parseFloat(e.target.value);\r\n            document.getElementById('ionicValue').textContent = `${this.state.ionicStrength.toFixed(2)} M`;\r\n            this.updateSystem();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Controles de matriz\r\n        document.getElementById('fitatoControl').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.fitatos = parseInt(e.target.value);\r\n            document.getElementById('fitatoValue').textContent = `${this.state.fitatos}%`;\r\n            this.updateMatrixEffects();\r\n            this.updateSystem();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('vitcControl').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.vitC = parseInt(e.target.value);\r\n            document.getElementById('vitcValue').textContent = `${this.state.vitC} mg`;\r\n            this.updateMatrixEffects();\r\n            this.updateSystem();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('oxalatoControl').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.oxalatos = parseInt(e.target.value);\r\n            document.getElementById('oxalatoValue').textContent = `${this.state.oxalatos}%`;\r\n            this.updateMatrixEffects();\r\n            this.updateSystem();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Controles cin\u00e9ticos\r\n        document.getElementById('kmControl').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.Km = parseInt(e.target.value);\r\n            document.getElementById('kmValue').textContent = `${this.state.Km} \u03bcM`;\r\n            this.updateKinetics();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('vmaxControl').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.Vmax = parseInt(e.target.value);\r\n            document.getElementById('vmaxValue').textContent = `${this.state.Vmax} mg\/h`;\r\n            this.updateKinetics();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('substrateControl').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.substrate = parseInt(e.target.value);\r\n            document.getElementById('substrateValue').textContent = `${this.state.substrate} \u03bcM`;\r\n            this.updateKinetics();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Botones principales\r\n        document.getElementById('resetSimBtn').addEventListener('click', () => this.resetSimulation());\r\n        document.getElementById('autoOptimizeBtn').addEventListener('click', () => this.autoOptimize());\r\n        document.getElementById('exportDataBtn').addEventListener('click', () => this.exportData());\r\n        document.getElementById('calculateKineticsBtn').addEventListener('click', () => this.updateKinetics());\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Casos cl\u00ednicos\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.case-nav-btn').forEach(btn => {\r\n            btn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\r\n                const caseNumber = parseInt(e.target.dataset.case);\r\n                this.switchCase(caseNumber);\r\n            });\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.case-option').forEach(option => {\r\n            option.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\r\n                const answer = e.target.closest('.case-option').dataset.answer;\r\n                const caseNumber = 1; \/\/ Por ahora solo caso 1\r\n                this.evaluateCase(caseNumber, answer);\r\n            });\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.querySelector('.submit-case-btn').addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n            const selectedOption = document.querySelector('.case-option.selected');\r\n            if (selectedOption) {\r\n                const answer = selectedOption.dataset.answer;\r\n                this.evaluateCase(this.state.currentCase, answer);\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Evaluaci\u00f3n\r\n        document.getElementById('prevQuestionBtn').addEventListener('click', () => this.prevQuestion());\r\n        document.getElementById('nextQuestionBtn').addEventListener('click', () => this.nextQuestion());\r\n        document.getElementById('submitAssessmentBtn').addEventListener('click', () => this.submitAssessment());\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Metacognici\u00f3n\r\n        document.getElementById('metaToggleBtn').addEventListener('click', () => this.toggleMetaPanel());\r\n        document.querySelector('.save-reflection-btn').addEventListener('click', () => this.saveReflection());\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Escalas\r\n        document.getElementById('scaleSlider').addEventListener('input', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.currentScale = parseInt(e.target.value);\r\n            this.updateScaleView();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Experimentos\r\n        document.getElementById('experimentSelect').addEventListener('change', (e) => {\r\n            this.state.currentExperiment = parseInt(e.target.value);\r\n            this.updateExperimentView();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('runExperimentBtn').addEventListener('click', () => this.runExperiment());\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    updateSystem() {\r\n        \/\/ Calcular par\u00e1metros termodin\u00e1micos\r\n        const deltaG = this.calculateDeltaG();\r\n        const kquel = this.calculateKquel();\r\n        const freeFe = this.calculateFreeFe();\r\n        const bioavailability = this.calculateBioavailability();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar displays\r\n        document.getElementById('deltaGValue').textContent = `${deltaG.toFixed(1)} kJ\/mol`;\r\n        document.getElementById('kquelValue').textContent = `10${Math.floor(Math.log10(kquel))}`;\r\n        document.getElementById('freeFeValue').textContent = `${freeFe.toFixed(1)} \u03bcM`;\r\n        document.getElementById('bioavailabilityValue').textContent = `${bioavailability.toFixed(1)}%`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar barras\r\n        document.getElementById('bioavailabilityBar').style.width = `${bioavailability * 2.5}%`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar log\r\n        this.addLogEntry(`Sistema actualizado: pH=${this.state.pH}, F=${bioavailability.toFixed(1)}%`);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Registrar concepto\r\n        this.registerConcept('system_update');\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    calculateDeltaG() {\r\n        \/\/ \u0394G simplificado dependiente de pH y fuerza i\u00f3nica\r\n        return -8.3 - (this.state.pH - 7) * 2.5 + this.state.ionicStrength * 10;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    calculateKquel() {\r\n        \/\/ Constante de quelaci\u00f3n dependiente de pH\r\n        const pKa = 6.0;\r\n        const protonation = 1 \/ (1 + Math.pow(10, this.state.pH - pKa));\r\n        return Math.pow(10, 18) * protonation;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    calculateFreeFe() {\r\n        \/\/ [Fe\u00b2\u207a] libre considerando redox y fitatos\r\n        const reduction = 1 - Math.abs(this.state.redox) \/ 300;\r\n        return 12.4 * reduction * (1 - this.state.fitatos \/ 100);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    calculateBioavailability() {\r\n        \/\/ Modelo multifactorial\r\n        const deltaG = this.calculateDeltaG();\r\n        const solubility = Math.exp(-deltaG \/ (8.314 * 310));\r\n        const chelation = 1 \/ (1 + this.calculateKquel() \/ 1e15);\r\n        const reduction = 1 - Math.exp(-this.state.vitC \/ 50);\r\n        \r\n        const inhibition = \r\n            (this.state.fitatos \/ 100) * 0.6 +\r\n            (this.state.oxalatos \/ 100) * 0.3 +\r\n            (this.state.taninos \/ 100) * 0.1;\r\n        \r\n        let F = solubility * chelation * reduction * (1 - inhibition);\r\n        return Math.max(1, Math.min(40, F * 100));\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    updateMatrixEffects() {\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar efectos de los factores de matriz\r\n        const fitatoEffect = document.getElementById('fitatoEffect');\r\n        const vitcEffect = document.getElementById('vitcEffect');\r\n        const oxalatoEffect = document.getElementById('oxalatoEffect');\r\n        \r\n        fitatoEffect.textContent = this.state.fitatos > 60 ? 'ALTO' : \r\n                                  this.state.fitatos > 30 ? 'MODERADO' : 'BAJO';\r\n        fitatoEffect.className = `factor-effect ${this.state.fitatos > 60 ? 'high' : \r\n                                  this.state.fitatos > 30 ? 'medium' : 'low'}`;\r\n        \r\n        vitcEffect.textContent = this.state.vitC > 100 ? 'ALTO' : \r\n                                this.state.vitC > 50 ? 'MODERADO' : 'BAJO';\r\n        vitcEffect.className = `factor-effect ${this.state.vitC > 100 ? 'high' : \r\n                               this.state.vitC > 50 ? 'medium' : 'low'}`;\r\n        \r\n        oxalatoEffect.textContent = this.state.oxalatos > 40 ? 'ALTO' : \r\n                                   this.state.oxalatos > 20 ? 'MODERADO' : 'BAJO';\r\n        oxalatoEffect.className = `factor-effect ${this.state.oxalatos > 40 ? 'high' : \r\n                                  this.state.oxalatos > 20 ? 'medium' : 'low'}`;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    updateKinetics() {\r\n        \/\/ Calcular velocidad seg\u00fan Michaelis-Menten\r\n        const V = (this.state.Vmax * this.state.substrate) \/ (this.state.Km + this.state.substrate);\r\n        const saturation = (V \/ this.state.Vmax) * 100;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar displays\r\n        document.getElementById('velocityValue').textContent = `${V.toFixed(1)} mg\/h`;\r\n        document.getElementById('velocityPercentage').textContent = `${saturation.toFixed(1)}% Vmax`;\r\n        document.getElementById('saturationValue').textContent = `${saturation.toFixed(1)}%`;\r\n        document.getElementById('saturationBar').style.width = `${saturation}%`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Determinar afinidad\r\n        const affinity = this.state.Km < 20 ? 'ALTA' : \r\n                        this.state.Km < 50 ? 'MEDIA' : 'BAJA';\r\n        document.getElementById('affinityValue').textContent = affinity;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Redibujar gr\u00e1fico\r\n        this.drawKineticGraph();\r\n        \r\n        this.registerConcept('kinetics_update');\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    drawKineticGraph() {\r\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('kineticCanvas');\r\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar canvas\r\n        ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Configurar estilo\r\n        ctx.strokeStyle = '#4dabf7';\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#4dabf7';\r\n        ctx.lineWidth = 3;\r\n        ctx.font = '12px Arial';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Dibujar ejes\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        ctx.moveTo(50, 350);\r\n        ctx.lineTo(550, 350);\r\n        ctx.moveTo(50, 50);\r\n        ctx.lineTo(50, 350);\r\n        ctx.stroke();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Etiquetas\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#495057';\r\n        ctx.fillText('[S] (\u03bcM)', 300, 380);\r\n        ctx.save();\r\n        ctx.translate(20, 200);\r\n        ctx.rotate(-Math.PI\/2);\r\n        ctx.fillText('V (mg\/h)', 0, 0);\r\n        ctx.restore();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Dibujar curva Michaelis-Menten\r\n        ctx.strokeStyle = '#228be6';\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        \r\n        for(let s = 0; s <= 200; s += 5) {\r\n            const V = (this.state.Vmax * s) \/ (this.state.Km + s);\r\n            const x = 50 + (s \/ 200) * 500;\r\n            const y = 350 - (V \/ this.state.Vmax * 1.5) * 300;\r\n            \r\n            if(s === 0) ctx.moveTo(x, y);\r\n            else ctx.lineTo(x, y);\r\n        }\r\n        ctx.stroke();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Marcar punto actual\r\n        const currentV = (this.state.Vmax * this.state.substrate) \/ (this.state.Km + this.state.substrate);\r\n        const currentX = 50 + (this.state.substrate \/ 200) * 500;\r\n        const currentY = 350 - (currentV \/ this.state.Vmax * 1.5) * 300;\r\n        \r\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#fa5252';\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        ctx.arc(currentX, currentY, 8, 0, Math.PI * 2);\r\n        ctx.fill();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Etiqueta del punto\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#495057';\r\n        ctx.fillText(`[S]=${this.state.substrate}\u03bcM`, currentX - 30, currentY - 15);\r\n        ctx.fillText(`V=${currentV.toFixed(1)}`, currentX - 25, currentY + 25);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    drawScaleCanvas() {\r\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('scaleCanvas');\r\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar canvas\r\n        ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Dibujar seg\u00fan la escala actual\r\n        switch(this.state.currentScale) {\r\n            case 1: \/\/ \u00c5ngstr\u00f6m\r\n                this.drawAngstromScale(ctx);\r\n                break;\r\n            case 2: \/\/ Nan\u00f3metro\r\n                this.drawNanometerScale(ctx);\r\n                break;\r\n            case 3: \/\/ Micr\u00f3metro\r\n                this.drawMicrometerScale(ctx);\r\n                break;\r\n            case 4: \/\/ Mil\u00edmetro\r\n                this.drawMillimeterScale(ctx);\r\n                break;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    drawAngstromScale(ctx) {\r\n        \/\/ Dibujar mol\u00e9cula de fitato simplificada\r\n        ctx.strokeStyle = '#40c057';\r\n        ctx.lineWidth = 2;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Anillo de inositol\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        ctx.arc(400, 200, 50, 0, Math.PI * 2);\r\n        ctx.stroke();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Grupos fosfato\r\n        const phosphatePositions = [\r\n            {x: 340, y: 200}, {x: 460, y: 200},\r\n            {x: 400, y: 140}, {x: 400, y: 260},\r\n            {x: 360, y: 160}, {x: 440, y: 240}\r\n        ];\r\n        \r\n        phosphatePositions.forEach(pos => {\r\n            ctx.beginPath();\r\n            ctx.arc(pos.x, pos.y, 8, 0, Math.PI * 2);\r\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#339af0';\r\n            ctx.fill();\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Iones de hierro\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#fa5252';\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        ctx.arc(300, 200, 10, 0, Math.PI * 2);\r\n        ctx.fill();\r\n        ctx.fillText('Fe\u00b2\u207a', 290, 220);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    drawNanometerScale(ctx) {\r\n        \/\/ Dibujar micela\r\n        ctx.strokeStyle = '#ff922b';\r\n        ctx.lineWidth = 2;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Micela circular\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        ctx.arc(400, 200, 80, 0, Math.PI * 2);\r\n        ctx.stroke();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mol\u00e9culas dentro\r\n        for(let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {\r\n            const angle = (i \/ 12) * Math.PI * 2;\r\n            const x = 400 + Math.cos(angle) * 60;\r\n            const y = 200 + Math.sin(angle) * 60;\r\n            \r\n            ctx.beginPath();\r\n            ctx.arc(x, y, 6, 0, Math.PI * 2);\r\n            ctx.fillStyle = i < 6 ? '#339af0' : '#40c057';\r\n            ctx.fill();\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    updateScaleView() {\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar informaci\u00f3n de escala\r\n        const scaleInfo = {\r\n            1: {\r\n                title: 'ESCALA \u00c5NGSTR\u00d6M (10\u207b\u00b9\u2070 m)',\r\n                desc: 'Enlaces qu\u00edmicos y geometr\u00eda molecular. Longitudes de enlace Fe-O: 2.05 \u00c5'\r\n            },\r\n            2: {\r\n                title: 'ESCALA NANOM\u00c9TRICA (10\u207b\u2079 m)',\r\n                desc: 'Agregados moleculares y micelas. Micelas mixtas (5-50 nm)'\r\n            },\r\n            3: {\r\n                title: 'ESCALA MICROM\u00c9TRICA (10\u207b\u2076 m)',\r\n                desc: 'Estructuras celulares. Enterocitos (20-30 \u03bcm), microvellosidades (1-2 \u03bcm)'\r\n            },\r\n            4: {\r\n                title: 'ESCALA MILIM\u00c9TRICA (10\u207b\u00b3 m)',\r\n                desc: 'Tejidos y estructuras macrosc\u00f3picas. Vellosidades intestinales'\r\n            }\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('scaleTitle').textContent = scaleInfo[this.state.currentScale].title;\r\n        document.getElementById('scaleDescription').textContent = scaleInfo[this.state.currentScale].desc;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar canvas\r\n        this.drawScaleCanvas();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Resaltar tarjeta de caracter\u00edstica\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.feature-card').forEach(card => {\r\n            card.classList.remove('active');\r\n        });\r\n        document.querySelector(`.feature-card[data-scale=\"${this.state.currentScale}\"]`).classList.add('active');\r\n        \r\n        this.registerConcept(`scale_${this.state.currentScale}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    switchCase(caseNumber) {\r\n        this.state.currentCase = caseNumber;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar navegaci\u00f3n\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.case-nav-btn').forEach(btn => {\r\n            btn.classList.remove('active');\r\n        });\r\n        document.querySelector(`.case-nav-btn[data-case=\"${caseNumber}\"]`).classList.add('active');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar contenido del caso\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.case-content').forEach(content => {\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        document.querySelector(`.case-content[data-case=\"${caseNumber}\"]`).style.display = 'block';\r\n        \r\n        this.registerConcept(`case_${caseNumber}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    evaluateCase(caseNumber, answer) {\r\n        const feedback = document.getElementById(`case${caseNumber}Feedback`);\r\n        let message = '';\r\n        let isCorrect = false;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Respuestas correctas por caso\r\n        const correctAnswers = {\r\n            1: 'B', 2: 'A', 3: 'C', 4: 'B'\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        if (answer === correctAnswers[caseNumber]) {\r\n            message = '\u2705 <strong>CORRECTO<\/strong><br>La respuesta B optimiza la biodisponibilidad al reducir fitatos y mejorar reducci\u00f3n redox simult\u00e1neamente.';\r\n            isCorrect = true;\r\n            this.state.assessmentScore += 10;\r\n        } else {\r\n            message = '\u274c <strong>INCORRECTO<\/strong><br>La respuesta \u00f3ptima es B. Aumentar solo la dosis (A) satura transporte, y el calcio (C) compite con el hierro.';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        feedback.innerHTML = message;\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Deshabilitar m\u00e1s selecciones\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.case-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        if (isCorrect) {\r\n            this.registerConcept(`case_correct_${caseNumber}`);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    runExperiment() {\r\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('experimentCanvas');\r\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar canvas\r\n        ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Dibujar gr\u00e1fico seg\u00fan experimento\r\n        ctx.strokeStyle = '#228be6';\r\n        ctx.lineWidth = 2;\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        \r\n        for(let i = 0; i <= 100; i += 5) {\r\n            const x = 50 + (i \/ 100) * 600;\r\n            const y = 300 - Math.sin(i * 0.1) * 100;\r\n            \r\n            if(i === 0) ctx.moveTo(x, y);\r\n            else ctx.lineTo(x, y);\r\n        }\r\n        ctx.stroke();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar conclusiones\r\n        const conclusions = {\r\n            1: 'El pH \u00f3ptimo para la solubilidad del hierro est\u00e1 entre 5.5 y 7.0. Por debajo de pH 3 hay riesgo de precipitaci\u00f3n.',\r\n            2: 'La vitamina C muestra efecto dosis-respuesta hasta 100 mg, luego se estabiliza por saturaci\u00f3n de reductasa.',\r\n            3: 'Los fitatos muestran inhibici\u00f3n competitiva cl\u00e1sica. El calcio compite pero con menor afinidad que el hierro.',\r\n            4: 'La sinergia vitamina C + germinaci\u00f3n multiplica la biodisponibilidad por 3.2 vs intervenciones aisladas.'\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('experimentConclusions').textContent = \r\n            conclusions[this.state.currentExperiment];\r\n        \r\n        this.registerConcept(`experiment_${this.state.currentExperiment}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    prevQuestion() {\r\n        if (this.state.currentQuestion > 1) {\r\n            this.state.currentQuestion--;\r\n            this.updateQuestionView();\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    nextQuestion() {\r\n        if (this.state.currentQuestion < 3) {\r\n            this.state.currentQuestion++;\r\n            this.updateQuestionView();\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    updateQuestionView() {\r\n        \/\/ Ocultar todas las preguntas\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.question').forEach(q => {\r\n            q.classList.remove('active');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar pregunta actual\r\n        document.querySelector(`.question[data-question=\"${this.state.currentQuestion}\"]`).classList.add('active');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar progreso\r\n        document.getElementById('currentQuestion').textContent = this.state.currentQuestion;\r\n        document.getElementById('assessmentProgress').style.width = `${(this.state.currentQuestion \/ 3) * 100}%`;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    submitAssessment() {\r\n        \/\/ Calcular puntaje\r\n        let score = 0;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuestas\r\n        const correctAnswers = {\r\n            q1: 'B',\r\n            q2: 'B', \r\n            q3: 'B'\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Revisar cada pregunta\r\n        for(let i = 1; i <= 3; i++) {\r\n            const selected = document.querySelector(`input[name=\"q${i}\"]:checked`);\r\n            if(selected && selected.value === correctAnswers[`q${i}`]) {\r\n                score += 33.3;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar resultados\r\n        const resultsDiv = document.getElementById('assessmentResults');\r\n        resultsDiv.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"results-summary\">\r\n                <h3>RESULTADOS DE LA EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"final-score\">${score.toFixed(1)}\/100<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"score-category\">${score >= 80 ? 'EXCELENTE' : score >= 60 ? 'SATISFACTORIO' : 'EN PROCESO'}<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"results-details\">\r\n                    <p>Has completado la evaluaci\u00f3n integradora. ${score >= 80 ? \r\n                        'Dominas los conceptos principales de biodisponibilidad.' :\r\n                        'Revisa los conceptos de cin\u00e9tica enzim\u00e1tica y efectos de matriz.'}<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        resultsDiv.style.display = 'block';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas\r\n        this.state.assessmentScore = Math.round(score);\r\n        this.updateMetaStats();\r\n        \r\n        this.registerConcept('assessment_completed');\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    resetSimulation() {\r\n        \/\/ Restablecer todos los controles a valores por defecto\r\n        this.state = {\r\n            pH: 7.0,\r\n            redox: 150,\r\n            ionicStrength: 0.15,\r\n            fitatos: 30,\r\n            vitC: 50,\r\n            oxalatos: 20,\r\n            taninos: 15,\r\n            Km: 30,\r\n            Vmax: 18,\r\n            substrate: 50\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar controles visuales\r\n        document.getElementById('pHControl').value = this.state.pH;\r\n        document.getElementById('redoxControl').value = this.state.redox;\r\n        document.getElementById('ionicControl').value = this.state.ionicStrength;\r\n        document.getElementById('fitatoControl').value = this.state.fitatos;\r\n        document.getElementById('vitcControl').value = this.state.vitC;\r\n        document.getElementById('oxalatoControl').value = this.state.oxalatos;\r\n        document.getElementById('kmControl').value = this.state.Km;\r\n        document.getElementById('vmaxControl').value = this.state.Vmax;\r\n        document.getElementById('substrateControl').value = this.state.substrate;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar displays\r\n        this.updateSystem();\r\n        this.updateKinetics();\r\n        this.updateMatrixEffects();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar log\r\n        document.getElementById('systemLog').innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"log-entry\">[00:00] Sistema reiniciado<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"log-entry\">[00:00] Par\u00e1metros restablecidos<\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        this.registerConcept('system_reset');\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    autoOptimize() {\r\n        \/\/ Optimizaci\u00f3n autom\u00e1tica de par\u00e1metros\r\n        this.state.pH = 6.5;\r\n        this.state.redox = -50;\r\n        this.state.vitC = 100;\r\n        this.state.fitatos = 10;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar controles\r\n        document.getElementById('pHControl').value = this.state.pH;\r\n        document.getElementById('redoxControl').value = this.state.redox;\r\n        document.getElementById('vitcControl').value = this.state.vitC;\r\n        document.getElementById('fitatoControl').value = this.state.fitatos;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar sistema\r\n        this.updateSystem();\r\n        this.updateMatrixEffects();\r\n        \r\n        this.addLogEntry('Optimizaci\u00f3n autom\u00e1tica aplicada');\r\n        this.registerConcept('auto_optimization');\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    exportData() {\r\n        \/\/ Crear objeto con datos\r\n        const exportData = {\r\n            timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\r\n            parameters: {\r\n                pH: this.state.pH,\r\n                redox: this.state.redox,\r\n                ionicStrength: this.state.ionicStrength,\r\n                fitatos: this.state.fitatos,\r\n                vitaminC: this.state.vitC,\r\n                oxalatos: this.state.oxalatos\r\n            },\r\n            results: {\r\n                bioavailability: this.calculateBioavailability(),\r\n                deltaG: this.calculateDeltaG(),\r\n                freeIron: this.calculateFreeFe()\r\n            },\r\n            kinetics: {\r\n                Km: this.state.Km,\r\n                Vmax: this.state.Vmax,\r\n                substrate: this.state.substrate,\r\n                velocity: (this.state.Vmax * this.state.substrate) \/ (this.state.Km + this.state.substrate)\r\n            }\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Crear y descargar archivo\r\n        const dataStr = JSON.stringify(exportData, null, 2);\r\n        const dataUri = 'data:application\/json;charset=utf-8,'+ encodeURIComponent(dataStr);\r\n        \r\n        const exportFileDefaultName = `bioavailability_data_${Date.now()}.json`;\r\n        \r\n        const linkElement = document.createElement('a');\r\n        linkElement.setAttribute('href', dataUri);\r\n        linkElement.setAttribute('download', exportFileDefaultName);\r\n        linkElement.click();\r\n        \r\n        this.addLogEntry('Datos exportados exitosamente');\r\n        this.registerConcept('data_export');\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    updateTime() {\r\n        const now = new Date();\r\n        const timeString = now.toLocaleTimeString('es-ES', {hour12: false});\r\n        document.getElementById('currentTime').textContent = timeString;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar tiempo transcurrido\r\n        const elapsed = Math.floor((Date.now() - this.state.startTime) \/ 1000);\r\n        const minutes = Math.floor(elapsed \/ 60);\r\n        const seconds = elapsed % 60;\r\n        document.getElementById('timeSpent').textContent = \r\n            `${minutes.toString().padStart(2, '0')}:${seconds.toString().padStart(2, '0')}`;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    startTimeInterval() {\r\n        this.timeInterval = setInterval(() => {\r\n            this.updateTime();\r\n        }, 1000);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    addLogEntry(message) {\r\n        const log = document.getElementById('systemLog');\r\n        const now = new Date();\r\n        const timeString = now.toLocaleTimeString('es-ES', {hour12: false}).substring(0, 5);\r\n        \r\n        const entry = document.createElement('div');\r\n        entry.className = 'log-entry';\r\n        entry.textContent = `[${timeString}] ${message}`;\r\n        \r\n        log.appendChild(entry);\r\n        log.scrollTop = log.scrollHeight;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mantener m\u00e1ximo 10 entradas\r\n        if (log.children.length > 10) {\r\n            log.removeChild(log.firstChild);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    registerConcept(concept) {\r\n        if (!this.state.activatedConcepts.has(concept)) {\r\n            this.state.activatedConcepts.add(concept);\r\n            this.updateMetaStats();\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    updateMetaStats() {\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas de metacognici\u00f3n\r\n        document.getElementById('conceptsMastered').textContent = \r\n            `${this.state.activatedConcepts.size}\/15`;\r\n        \r\n        const interactionScore = Math.min(100, this.state.activatedConcepts.size * 6.7);\r\n        document.getElementById('interactionScore').textContent = `${interactionScore}%`;\r\n        \r\n        const completionRate = Math.min(100, \r\n            (this.state.activatedConcepts.size \/ 15 * 70) + \r\n            (this.state.assessmentScore \/ 100 * 30)\r\n        );\r\n        document.getElementById('completionRate').textContent = `${Math.round(completionRate)}%`;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    toggleMetaPanel() {\r\n        const content = document.getElementById('metaContent');\r\n        const toggleBtn = document.getElementById('metaToggleBtn');\r\n        \r\n        if (content.style.display === 'none' || !content.style.display) {\r\n            content.style.display = 'block';\r\n            toggleBtn.textContent = '\u25b2';\r\n        } else {\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n            toggleBtn.textContent = '\u25bc';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    saveReflection() {\r\n        const reflections = document.querySelectorAll('.reflection-input');\r\n        let hasContent = false;\r\n        \r\n        reflections.forEach(textarea => {\r\n            if (textarea.value.trim() !== '') {\r\n                hasContent = true;\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        if (hasContent) {\r\n            alert('Reflexi\u00f3n guardada exitosamente. Esta informaci\u00f3n te servir\u00e1 para tu aprendizaje personal.');\r\n            this.registerConcept('reflection_saved');\r\n        } else {\r\n            alert('Por favor, escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n antes de guardar.');\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    updateExperimentView() {\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar variables espec\u00edficas del experimento seleccionado\r\n        document.getElementById('experiment1Vars').style.display = \r\n            this.state.currentExperiment === 1 ? 'block' : 'none';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ FUNCIONES GLOBALES\r\nfunction activatePhase(phaseNumber) {\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar indicadores de fase\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.phase-indicator').forEach(indicator => {\r\n        indicator.classList.remove('active');\r\n    });\r\n    document.querySelector(`.phase-indicator[data-phase=\"${phaseNumber}\"]`).classList.add('active');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar estado del sistema\r\n    document.getElementById('systemStatus').textContent = \r\n        `FASE ${phaseNumber} ACTIVA - ${getPhaseName(phaseNumber)}`;\r\n    \r\n    if (window.quantumSystem) {\r\n        window.quantumSystem.state.activePhase = phaseNumber;\r\n        window.quantumSystem.registerConcept(`phase_${phaseNumber}`);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction getPhaseName(phaseNumber) {\r\n    const phases = {\r\n        1: 'LIBERACI\u00d3N MOLECULAR',\r\n        2: 'SOLUBILIZACI\u00d3N',\r\n        3: 'TRANSPORTE ACTIVO',\r\n        4: 'METABOLISMO SIST\u00c9MICO'\r\n    };\r\n    return phases[phaseNumber] || 'DESCONOCIDA';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA\r\nlet quantumSystem;\r\n\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\r\n    \/\/ Inicializar sistema\r\n    quantumSystem = new QuantumBioavailabilitySystem();\r\n    window.quantumSystem = quantumSystem;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar eventos adicionales\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.case-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            document.querySelectorAll('.case-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected');\r\n            });\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar vista de pregunta\r\n    quantumSystem.updateQuestionView();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar panel de metacognici\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('metaContent').style.display = 'none';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto de t\u00edtulo\r\n    const titleWords = document.querySelectorAll('.title-word');\r\n    titleWords.forEach((word, index) => {\r\n        word.style.animationDelay = `${index * 0.3}s`;\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 caracter\u00edstica define a una hip\u00f3tesis como \"cient\u00edfica\" seg\u00fan Popper?","respuesta":"Su capacidad de ser falsada o refutada mediante experimentaci\u00f3n."},{"enunciado":"En un estudio sobre la velocidad de reacci\u00f3n a diferentes temperaturas, \u00bfcu\u00e1l es la variable independiente?","respuesta":"La temperatura."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la funci\u00f3n del \"Grupo Control\" en un experimento?","respuesta":"Servir como referencia base para comparar los efectos de la variable independiente."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 la observaci\u00f3n debe ser objetiva?","respuesta":"Para evitar sesgos personales y permitir que otros cient\u00edficos repliquen el hallazgo."},{"enunciado":"Explique la Ley de Conservaci\u00f3n de Lavoisier desde el m\u00e9todo cient\u00edfico.","respuesta":"Fue una conclusi\u00f3n derivada de experimentos con sistemas cerrados donde la masa medida no cambiaba tras la reacci\u00f3n."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 significa que un experimento tenga \"replicabilidad\"?","respuesta":"Que cualquier investigador pueda obtener los mismos resultados siguiendo el mismo procedimiento."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 herramienta moderna permite predecir reacciones sin ir al laboratorio inicialmente?","respuesta":"Inteligencia Artificial y modelado molecular (IA ChemAI)."},{"enunciado":"Define Hip\u00f3tesis Nula ($H_0$).","respuesta":"Es la suposici\u00f3n de que no hay efecto o diferencia significativa entre los grupos estudiados."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 paso sigue despu\u00e9s de que un experimento rechaza la hip\u00f3tesis original?","respuesta":"Reformulaci\u00f3n de la hip\u00f3tesis y nuevo ciclo experimental."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el rol de la revisi\u00f3n por pares (Peer Review)?","respuesta":"Validar la metodolog\u00eda y conclusiones de un estudio antes de su publicaci\u00f3n oficial."},{"enunciado":"\u00bfC\u00f3mo ayuda la estad\u00edstica al an\u00e1lisis qu\u00edmico?","respuesta":"Permite determinar si los resultados son fruto del azar o de la variable estudiada (valor p)."},{"enunciado":"Mencione un error sistem\u00e1tico com\u00fan en qu\u00edmica.","respuesta":"Un instrumento de medici\u00f3n (balanza) mal calibrado."}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el primer paso formal del m\u00e9todo cient\u00edfico?","opciones":["Hip\u00f3tesis","Observaci\u00f3n","An\u00e1lisis","Publicaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Observaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Una hip\u00f3tesis es una...","opciones":["Verdad absoluta","Explicaci\u00f3n provisional","Ley qu\u00edmica","Pregunta sin respuesta"],"correcta":"Explicaci\u00f3n provisional"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQui\u00e9n es considerado el padre de la qu\u00edmica moderna por su rigor experimental?","opciones":["Dalton","Lavoisier","Arist\u00f3teles","Newton"],"correcta":"Lavoisier"},{"pregunta":"La variable que el investigador cambia a prop\u00f3sito es la:","opciones":["Dependiente","Controlada","Independiente","Extra\u00f1a"],"correcta":"Independiente"},{"pregunta":"Si los datos no apoyan la hip\u00f3tesis, esta debe ser:","opciones":["Aceptada de todos modos","Publicada r\u00e1pido","Rechazada o modificada","Ignorada"],"correcta":"Rechazada o modificada"},{"pregunta":"El \"Control\" permite saber si el efecto se debe a:","opciones":["La variable independiente","El azar","La temperatura ambiente","El observador"],"correcta":"La variable independiente"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 gas aisl\u00f3 Priestley usando el m\u00e9todo cient\u00edfico?","opciones":["CO\u2082","Ox\u00edgeno","Nitr\u00f3geno","Metano"],"correcta":"Ox\u00edgeno"},{"pregunta":"Un resultado es \"significativo\" si p es menor a:","opciones":["0.50","0.05","1.00","0.10"],"correcta":"0.05"},{"pregunta":"La IUPAC se encarga principalmente de:","opciones":["Vender reactivos","Estandarizar nomenclatura y normas","Ganar premios","Hacer experimentos"],"correcta":"Estandarizar nomenclatura y normas"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 autor propuso que la ciencia avanza por falsaci\u00f3n?","opciones":["Darwin","Popper","Skinner","Einstein"],"correcta":"Popper"},{"pregunta":"La hip\u00f3tesis nula ($H_0$) postula que:","opciones":["Todo es falso","No hay diferencia significativa","La hip\u00f3tesis es correcta","El experimento fall\u00f3"],"correcta":"No hay diferencia significativa"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 t\u00e9cnica separa componentes de una mezcla para analizarlos?","opciones":["Cromatograf\u00eda","Titulaci\u00f3n","Pesaje","Destilaci\u00f3n simple"],"correcta":"Cromatograf\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"Marie Curie utiliz\u00f3 el m\u00e9todo cient\u00edfico para descubrir:","opciones":["El ox\u00edgeno","La hibridaci\u00f3n","El Radio y Polonio","La penicilina"],"correcta":"El Radio y Polonio"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 significa que un estudio sea de \"Doble Ciego\"?","opciones":["Nadie ve el experimento","Ni sujeto ni investigador saben qui\u00e9n recibe el tratamiento","Se hace a oscuras","Usa dos tipos de luz"],"correcta":"Ni sujeto ni investigador saben qui\u00e9n recibe el tratamiento"},{"pregunta":"La replicabilidad asegura que los hallazgos no sean:","opciones":["Publicados","\u00datiles","Casuales o err\u00f3neos","Caros"],"correcta":"Casuales o err\u00f3neos"},{"pregunta":"Un error sistem\u00e1tico afecta la:","opciones":["Precisi\u00f3n","Exactitud","Velocidad","Coloraci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Exactitud"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la principal revista cient\u00edfica de qu\u00edmica (ACS)?","opciones":["Nature","JACS","Science","Time"],"correcta":"JACS"},{"pregunta":"Pauling predijo la estructura de las prote\u00ednas usando:","opciones":["Adivinanza","Modelado y difracci\u00f3n de rayos X","Solo observaci\u00f3n","Fuego"],"correcta":"Modelado y difracci\u00f3n de rayos X"},{"pregunta":"El an\u00e1lisis de datos en qu\u00edmica suele usar:","opciones":["Adivinanzas","Estad\u00edstica descriptiva e inferencial","Poes\u00eda","Dibujos"],"correcta":"Estad\u00edstica descriptiva e inferencial"},{"pregunta":"La comunicaci\u00f3n cient\u00edfica suele ocurrir en:","opciones":["Redes sociales","Art\u00edculos revisados por pares","Conversaciones de caf\u00e9","Peri\u00f3dicos locales"],"correcta":"Art\u00edculos revisados por pares"},{"pregunta":"La f\u00f3rmula $H_0: \\mu_1 = \\mu_2$ representa:","opciones":["Igualdad de masas","Hip\u00f3tesis nula de dos medias","Velocidad de reacci\u00f3n","Constante de equilibrio"],"correcta":"Hip\u00f3tesis nula de dos medias"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 teor\u00eda refut\u00f3 Lavoisier mediante el m\u00e9todo cient\u00edfico?","opciones":["Teor\u00eda at\u00f3mica","Teor\u00eda del flogisto","Teor\u00eda de cuerdas","Teor\u00eda celular"],"correcta":"Teor\u00eda del flogisto"},{"pregunta":"El error de Tipo I ocurre cuando:","opciones":["Se rechaza $H_0$ siendo verdadera","Se acepta $H_0$ siendo falsa","Se rompe un tubo","Se olvida la balanza"],"correcta":"Se rechaza $H_0$ siendo verdadera"},{"pregunta":"El modelado QM\/MM combina:","opciones":["Qu\u00edmica y Matem\u00e1ticas","Mec\u00e1nica Cu\u00e1ntica y Mec\u00e1nica Molecular","Calidad y Masa","Nada de lo anterior"],"correcta":"Mec\u00e1nica Cu\u00e1ntica y Mec\u00e1nica Molecular"},{"pregunta":"Un \"t-test\" se utiliza para comparar:","opciones":["3 o m\u00e1s grupos","Las medias de 2 grupos","Colores de tubos","Pesos moleculares"],"correcta":"Las medias de 2 grupos"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 herramienta de IA se especializa en predecir s\u00edntesis qu\u00edmicas?","opciones":["ChatGPT","ChemAI","Midjourney","Excel"],"correcta":"ChemAI"},{"pregunta":"El \"sesgo de confirmaci\u00f3n\" es un fallo en:","opciones":["El experimento","La objetividad del investigador","El presupuesto","La limpieza del laboratorio"],"correcta":"La objetividad del investigador"},{"pregunta":"Un modelo qu\u00edmico es \u00fatil si es:","opciones":["Bonito","Predictivo y verificable","Complejo","Antiguo"],"correcta":"Predictivo y verificable"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 mide la t\u00e9cnica TEER en estudios de permeabilidad?","opciones":["Peso","Resistencia el\u00e9ctrica transepitelial","Color del gas","Sabor"],"correcta":"Resistencia el\u00e9ctrica transepitelial"},{"pregunta":"La meta-ciencia o ciencia de la ciencia estudia:","opciones":["Los planetas","C\u00f3mo se produce y valida el conocimiento cient\u00edfico","La cocina","La historia"],"correcta":"C\u00f3mo se produce y valida el conocimiento cient\u00edfico"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"teoria-atomica-avanzada","titulo":"TEOR\u00cdA AT\u00d3MICA CU\u00c1NTICA: DEL MODELO BOHR A LA DENSIDAD ELECTR\u00d3NICA","contenido":"<script src=\"https:\/\/polyfill.io\/v3\/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"><\/script>\r\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https:\/\/cdn.jsdelivr.net\/npm\/mathjax@3\/es5\/tex-mml-chtml.js\"><\/script>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quantum-lab\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- 1\ufe0f\u20e3 INTRODUCCI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <h2>\ud83d\udd2c REVOLUCI\u00d3N CU\u00c1NTICA EN LA VISI\u00d3N AT\u00d3MICA<\/h2>\r\n            <p>La <span class=\"highlight\">Teor\u00eda At\u00f3mica Moderna<\/span> representa uno de los paradigmas cient\u00edficos m\u00e1s profundos del siglo XX. No solo describe <strong>qu\u00e9<\/strong> forma tiene el \u00e1tomo, sino <strong>c\u00f3mo<\/strong> se comporta a nivel fundamental, desafiando nuestra intuici\u00f3n cl\u00e1sica con principios como la <span class=\"data\">dualidad onda-part\u00edcula<\/span> y el <span class=\"data\">principio de incertidumbre<\/span>.<\/p>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"real-world\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83c\udf0d APLICACIONES EN LA VIDA REAL<\/h4>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li><strong>Resonancia Magn\u00e9tica:<\/strong> Utiliza el esp\u00edn nuclear para im\u00e1genes m\u00e9dicas<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>LEDs y L\u00e1seres:<\/strong> Basados en transiciones electr\u00f3nicas entre orbitales<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>Microscop\u00eda Electr\u00f3nica:<\/strong> Aprovecha la naturaleza ondulatoria de los electrones<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>Qu\u00edmica Computacional:<\/strong> Simula reacciones usando ecuaciones de onda<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 2\ufe0f\u20e3 DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO ESTRUCTURADO -->\r\n    <section>\r\n        <h3>\ud83d\udcda EVOLUCI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL: DE LO CL\u00c1SICO A LO CU\u00c1NTICO<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"timeline-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"timeline\">\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-year=\"1900\">\r\n                    <h4>Radiaci\u00f3n del Cuerpo Negro<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Planck introduce el <em>quantum<\/em> de energ\u00eda: E = h\u03bd<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-year=\"1905\">\r\n                    <h4>Efecto Fotoel\u00e9ctrico<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Einstein demuestra la naturaleza corpuscular de la luz<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-year=\"1913\">\r\n                    <h4>Modelo de Bohr<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Cuantizaci\u00f3n del momento angular: L = n\u0127<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-year=\"1924\">\r\n                    <h4>Hip\u00f3tesis de De Broglie<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>\u03bb = h\/p - Dualidad onda-part\u00edcula para la materia<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-year=\"1926\">\r\n                    <h4>Ecuaci\u00f3n de Schr\u00f6dinger<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Descripci\u00f3n probabil\u00edstica del electr\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-year=\"1927\">\r\n                    <h4>Principio de Incertidumbre<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Heisenberg: \u0394x\u00b7\u0394p \u2265 \u0127\/2<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"theory-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"theory-card\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udcca POSTULADOS DE BOHR (1913)<\/h4>\r\n                <ol>\r\n                    <li>Electrones orbitan en <strong>estados estacionarios<\/strong> sin radiaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Solo \u00f3rbitas con momento angular cuantizado: mvr = n\u0127<\/li>\r\n                    <li>La energ\u00eda se emite\/absorbe en <em>quantums<\/em> al cambiar de \u00f3rbita<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <div class=\"math-inline\">\u0394E = E_f - E_i = h\u03bd<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"theory-card\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83c\udf0a INTERPRETACI\u00d3N DE BORN (1926)<\/h4>\r\n                <p>El cuadrado de la funci\u00f3n de onda representa la <strong>densidad de probabilidad<\/strong>:<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"math-block\">|\u03c8(x,y,z)|\u00b2 dx dy dz = Probabilidad de encontrar el electr\u00f3n en el volumen dV<\/div>\r\n                <p>Esto marca el abandono de <em>trayectorias definidas<\/em> a favor de <em>distribuciones probabil\u00edsticas<\/em>.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"theory-card\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83c\udfaf PRINCIPIO DE INCERTIDUMBRE<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Formulado por Heisenberg en 1927:<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"math-block\">\u0394x \u00b7 \u0394p \u2265 \frac{\u0127}{2}<\/div>\r\n                <p>Donde:<br>\r\n                \u0394x = incertidumbre en posici\u00f3n<br>\r\n                \u0394p = incertidumbre en momento<br>\r\n                \u0127 = h\/2\u03c0 (constante de Planck reducida)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 3\ufe0f\u20e3 VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA AVANZADA -->\r\n    <section>\r\n        <h3>\ud83c\udfa8 VISUALIZACI\u00d3N 3D DE ORBITALES AT\u00d3MICOS<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"orbital-controls\">\r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label>Orbital:<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"orbital-type\">\r\n                    <option value=\"1s\">1s (esf\u00e9rico)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"2pz\">2p_z (dumbbell)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"3dxy\">3d_xy (cloverleaf)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"4f\">4f (complejo)<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label>Densidad de probabilidad (%):<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"probability-slider\" min=\"10\" max=\"95\" value=\"90\">\r\n                <span id=\"prob-value\">90%<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label>Mostrar:<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"show-nodes\" checked> Nodos<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"show-phase\" checked> Fase<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"show-grid\"> Rejilla<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"orbital-visualization\">\r\n            <div class=\"orbital-canvas\" id=\"orbital-canvas\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" id=\"orbital-svg\">\r\n                    <!-- Se generar\u00e1 din\u00e1micamente -->\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"orbital-info\">\r\n                <h4 id=\"orbital-title\">ORBITAL 1s<\/h4>\r\n                <p><strong>N\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos:<\/strong> <span id=\"quantum-numbers\">n=1, l=0, m=0<\/span><\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Nodos:<\/strong> <span id=\"node-count\">Radiales: 0, Angulares: 0<\/span><\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Energ\u00eda relativa:<\/strong> <span id=\"orbital-energy\">-13.6 eV<\/span><\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Funci\u00f3n de onda:<\/strong> <span id=\"wave-function\">\u03c8 = (1\/\u221a\u03c0)(Z\/a\u2080)^{3\/2}e^{-Zr\/a\u2080}<\/span><\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"orbital-shape\">\r\n                    <strong>Forma:<\/strong> <span id=\"shape-desc\">Esfera perfecta<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"probability-explainer\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udcc8 INTERPRETACI\u00d3N DE LA DENSIDAD ELECTR\u00d3NICA<\/h4>\r\n            <p>La regi\u00f3n coloreada muestra d\u00f3nde existe un <strong>90% de probabilidad<\/strong> de encontrar el electr\u00f3n. \r\n            El <span style=\"color:#00ff88\">verde<\/span> indica fase positiva, el <span style=\"color:#ff00aa\">rosa<\/span> fase negativa. \r\n            Los nodos (l\u00edneas discontinuas) son regiones donde \u03c8=0.<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 4\ufe0f\u20e3 BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS AVANZADOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"interactive-lab\">\r\n        <h3>\ud83d\udd2c LABORATORIO VIRTUAL DE MEC\u00c1NICA CU\u00c1NTICA<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"simulator-grid\">\r\n            <!-- SIMULADOR 1: ESPECTRO DEL \u00c1TOMO DE HIDR\u00d3GENO -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-card\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83c\udf08 SIMULADOR DE ESPECTRO AT\u00d3MICO<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Selecciona la transici\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica y observa la l\u00ednea espectral correspondiente:<\/p>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"sim-controls\">\r\n                    <div class=\"control-row\">\r\n                        <label>Nivel inicial (n\u1d62):<\/label>\r\n                        <select id=\"initial-level\">\r\n                            <option value=\"3\">3<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"4\">4<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"5\">5<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"6\">6<\/option>\r\n                        <\/select>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"control-row\">\r\n                        <label>Nivel final (n_f):<\/label>\r\n                        <select id=\"final-level\">\r\n                            <option value=\"1\">1 (Serie Lyman)<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"2\" selected>2 (Serie Balmer)<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"3\">3 (Serie Paschen)<\/option>\r\n                        <\/select>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"spectrum-display\">\r\n                    <div class=\"spectrum-line\" id=\"spectrum-line\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"spectrum-info\">\r\n                        <p>Longitud de onda: <span id=\"wavelength\">656.3 nm<\/span> <span id=\"color-indicator\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">(rojo)<\/span><\/p>\r\n                        <p>Energ\u00eda del fot\u00f3n: <span id=\"photon-energy\">1.89 eV<\/span><\/p>\r\n                        <p>Serie: <span id=\"series\">Balmer<\/span> | Regi\u00f3n: <span id=\"region\">Visible<\/span><\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button id=\"calculate-transition\" class=\"lab-button\">Calcular Transici\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- SIMULADOR 2: CONFIGURACI\u00d3N ELECTR\u00d3NICA INTERACTIVA -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u269b\ufe0f CONSTRUCTOR DE \u00c1TOMOS<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Construye \u00e1tomos agregando electrones siguiendo las reglas de llenado:<\/p>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"atom-builder\">\r\n                    <div class=\"control-row\">\r\n                        <label>N\u00famero at\u00f3mico (Z): <span id=\"atomic-number\">1<\/span><\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" id=\"z-slider\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" value=\"1\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"electron-config\">\r\n                        <h5>Configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica:<\/h5>\r\n                        <div class=\"config-display\" id=\"config-display\">1s\u00b9<\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <h5>Diagrama de orbitales:<\/h5>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital-diagram\" id=\"orbital-diagram\">\r\n                            <!-- Se generar\u00e1 din\u00e1micamente -->\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"atom-properties\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Elemento:<\/strong> <span id=\"element-name\">Hidr\u00f3geno<\/span> (<span id=\"element-symbol\">H<\/span>)<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Bloque:<\/strong> <span id=\"element-block\">s<\/span><\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Electrones de valencia:<\/strong> <span id=\"valence-electrons\">1<\/span><\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Periodo:<\/strong> <span id=\"period\">1<\/span> | <strong>Grupo:<\/strong> <span id=\"group\">1<\/span><\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- SIMULADOR 3: PRINCIPIO DE INCERTIDUMBRE -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-card full-width\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83c\udfaf PRINCIPIO DE INCERTIDUMBRE DE HEISENBERG<\/h4>\r\n            <p>Var\u00eda la precisi\u00f3n en la posici\u00f3n (\u0394x) y observa c\u00f3mo afecta a la incertidumbre en el momento (\u0394p):<\/p>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"uncertainty-sim\">\r\n                <div class=\"uncertainty-controls\">\r\n                    <div class=\"control\">\r\n                        <label>\u0394x (posici\u00f3n): <span id=\"dx-value\">1.0 nm<\/span><\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" id=\"dx-slider\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"5\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1.0\">\r\n                        <div class=\"range-labels\">\r\n                            <span>Preciso<\/span>\r\n                            <span>Impreciso<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"control\">\r\n                        <label>\u0394p (momento): <span id=\"dp-value\">5.27\u00d710\u207b\u00b2\u2075 kg\u00b7m\/s<\/span><\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" id=\"dp-slider\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"10\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"5.3\" disabled>\r\n                        <div class=\"range-labels\">\r\n                            <span>Preciso<\/span>\r\n                            <span>Impreciso<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"uncertainty-display\">\r\n                    <div class=\"product-display\">\r\n                        <h5>Producto de incertidumbres:<\/h5>\r\n                        <div class=\"math-inline\">\u0394x \u00b7 \u0394p = <span id=\"uncertainty-product\">5.27\u00d710\u207b\u00b2\u2075<\/span> kg\u00b7m\u00b2\/s<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"heisenberg-limit\">L\u00edmite de Heisenberg: \u0127\/2 = <span id=\"heisenberg-value\">5.27\u00d710\u207b\u00b3\u2075<\/span> J\u00b7s<\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"uncertainty-bar-container\">\r\n                            <div class=\"uncertainty-bar\">\r\n                                <div class=\"bar-fill\" id=\"uncertainty-fill\"><\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"bar-labels\">\r\n                                <span>Imposible<br>(\u0394x\u00b7\u0394p < \u0127\/2)<\/span>\r\n                                <span>L\u00edmite Cu\u00e1ntico<br>(\u0394x\u00b7\u0394p = \u0127\/2)<\/span>\r\n                                <span>Regi\u00f3n Cl\u00e1sica<br>(\u0394x\u00b7\u0394p > \u0127\/2)<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"uncertainty-explanation\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Interpretaci\u00f3n f\u00edsica:<\/strong> Cuanto m\u00e1s precisamente conocemos la posici\u00f3n del electr\u00f3n (\u0394x peque\u00f1o), menos conocemos su momento (\u0394p grande), y viceversa.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Consecuencia:<\/strong> Esto explica por qu\u00e9 los electrones no \"caen\" al n\u00facleo - localizarlos cerca del n\u00facleo les dar\u00eda un momento tan grande que los sacar\u00eda de esa regi\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"example\">\r\n                            <strong>Ejemplo pr\u00e1ctico:<\/strong> En un \u00e1tomo, \u0394x \u2248 10\u207b\u00b9\u2070 m (tama\u00f1o at\u00f3mico), entonces \u0394p \u2265 5\u00d710\u207b\u00b2\u2075 kg\u00b7m\/s\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 5\ufe0f\u20e3 ERRORES COMUNES DEL ESTUDIANTE -->\r\n    <section class=\"common-errors\">\r\n        <h3>\u26a0\ufe0f ERRORES CONCEPTUALES FRECUENTES EN EVALUACIONES<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"errors-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u274c CONFUSI\u00d3N ENTRE MODELOS<\/h4>\r\n                <p><strong>Error:<\/strong> \"El modelo de Bohr muestra electrones en \u00f3rbitas el\u00edpticas\"<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Realidad:<\/strong> Bohr propuso \u00f3rbitas circulares. Las \u00f3rbitas el\u00edpticas fueron introducidas por Sommerfeld.<\/p>\r\n                <button class=\"error-detail\" data-error=\"1\">Ver explicaci\u00f3n detallada<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"error-explanation\" id=\"error-1\">\r\n                    <p>Bohr (1913) consider\u00f3 solo \u00f3rbitas circulares con momento angular cuantizado: <em>mvr = n\u0127<\/em>. Arnold Sommerfeld (1916) extendi\u00f3 el modelo incluyendo \u00f3rbitas el\u00edpticas y un segundo n\u00famero cu\u00e1ntico (azimutal).<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"tip\">\r\n                        <strong>\ud83d\udca1 Consejo para examen:<\/strong> En preguntas sobre el modelo de Bohr, siempre refi\u00e9rete a \u00f3rbitas circulares.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u274c MALENTENDIDO SOBRE ORBITALES<\/h4>\r\n                <p><strong>Error:<\/strong> \"Un orbital es la trayectoria del electr\u00f3n\"<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Realidad:<\/strong> Un orbital es una regi\u00f3n del espacio donde existe alta probabilidad (\u223c90%) de encontrar al electr\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                <button class=\"error-detail\" data-error=\"2\">Ver explicaci\u00f3n detallada<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"error-explanation\" id=\"error-2\">\r\n                    <p>En mec\u00e1nica cu\u00e1ntica, los electrones no tienen trayectorias definidas (principio de incertidumbre). El orbital es una soluci\u00f3n de la ecuaci\u00f3n de Schr\u00f6dinger: |\u03c8|\u00b2 representa la densidad de probabilidad.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"tip\">\r\n                        <strong>\ud83d\udca1 Analog\u00eda \u00fatil:<\/strong> Un orbital es como una \"nube de probabilidad\", no como un planeta orbitando.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u274c INTERPRETACI\u00d3N CL\u00c1SICA DE n, l, m<\/h4>\r\n                <p><strong>Error:<\/strong> \"El n\u00famero cu\u00e1ntico magn\u00e9tico (m) indica la orientaci\u00f3n f\u00edsica real del orbital\"<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Realidad:<\/strong> m indica orientaci\u00f3n respecto a un campo magn\u00e9tico externo, no una orientaci\u00f3n absoluta en el espacio.<\/p>\r\n                <button class=\"error-detail\" data-error=\"3\">Ver explicaci\u00f3n detallada<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"error-explanation\" id=\"error-3\">\r\n                    <p>Sin campo magn\u00e9tico externo, los orbitales con diferente m son degenerados (misma energ\u00eda). Solo al aplicar un campo se rompe esta degeneraci\u00f3n (efecto Zeeman).<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"tip\">\r\n                        <strong>\ud83d\udca1 Para recordar:<\/strong> m solo tiene significado relativo, no absoluto.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u274c CONFUSI\u00d3N EN CONFIGURACI\u00d3N ELECTR\u00d3NICA<\/h4>\r\n                <p><strong>Error:<\/strong> \"El orbital 4s siempre se llena antes que el 3d\"<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Realidad:<\/strong> Esto es cierto para elementos de Z=19 (K) y Z=20 (Ca), pero hay excepciones como Cr (Z=24) y Cu (Z=29).<\/p>\r\n                <button class=\"error-detail\" data-error=\"4\">Ver explicaci\u00f3n detallada<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"error-explanation\" id=\"error-4\">\r\n                    <p>Las excepciones se deben a la estabilidad adicional de configuraciones semillenas (d\u2075) o llenas (d\u00b9\u2070). Cr: [Ar]4s\u00b93d\u2075 (no 4s\u00b23d\u2074), Cu: [Ar]4s\u00b93d\u00b9\u2070 (no 4s\u00b23d\u2079).<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"tip\">\r\n                        <strong>\ud83d\udca1 Regla mnemot\u00e9cnica:<\/strong> \"Cr y Cu rompen la regla, por estabilidad especial\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"error-quiz\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83e\udde0 TEST DE ERRORES COMUNES<\/h4>\r\n            <p>Selecciona la respuesta correcta para cada afirmaci\u00f3n:<\/p>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-item\">\r\n                <p><strong>1. \"Los electrones en el modelo de Bohr siguen trayectorias bien definidas como planetas\"<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\">Verdadero<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\">Falso<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-item\">\r\n                <p><strong>2. \"El n\u00famero cu\u00e1ntico principal (n) solo puede tener valores enteros positivos\"<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\">Verdadero<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\">Falso<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-item\">\r\n                <p><strong>3. \"Todos los elementos del bloque d siguen exactamente la regla de Aufbau\"<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\">Verdadero<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\">Falso<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 6\ufe0f\u20e3 CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE -->\r\n    <section class=\"curriculum-connection\">\r\n        <h3>\ud83d\udcd8 RELACI\u00d3N CON EL PROGRAMA OFICIAL DE QU\u00cdMICA I<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"curriculum-table\">\r\n            <table>\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>Unidad del Programa<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Contenido Relacionado<\/th>\r\n                        <th>% en Evaluaci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Habilidades Evaluadas<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Unidad 1: Estructura At\u00f3mica<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Modelos at\u00f3micos hist\u00f3ricos, n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos<\/td>\r\n                        <td>25%<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Comprensi\u00f3n conceptual, aplicaci\u00f3n de reglas<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Unidad 2: Configuraci\u00f3n Electr\u00f3nica<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Principio de Aufbau, regla de Hund, excepciones<\/td>\r\n                        <td>30%<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Razonamiento secuencial, identificaci\u00f3n de patrones<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Unidad 3: Tabla Peri\u00f3dica<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Relaci\u00f3n configuraci\u00f3n-electrones de valencia<\/td>\r\n                        <td>20%<\/td>\r\n                        <td>An\u00e1lisis predictivo, clasificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Unidad 4: Enlace Qu\u00edmico<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Superposici\u00f3n de orbitales, hibridaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                        <td>25%<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Visualizaci\u00f3n espacial, pensamiento tridimensional<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"evaluation-notice\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udcdd IMPORTANTE PARA EVALUACI\u00d3N FORMAL<\/h4>\r\n            <p>Los contenidos de esta lecci\u00f3n corresponden al <strong>40% de la Prueba Global<\/strong> y son requisito para entender los temas posteriores de enlace qu\u00edmico y reactividad. Se evaluar\u00e1 mediante:<\/p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>Pruebas objetivas de selecci\u00f3n m\u00faltiple (60%)<\/li>\r\n                <li>Problemas de desarrollo con justificaci\u00f3n (30%)<\/li>\r\n                <li>An\u00e1lisis de configuraciones electr\u00f3nicas (10%)<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"exam-tips\">\r\n                <h5>\ud83d\udca1 CONSEJOS PARA EL EXAMEN:<\/h5>\r\n                <ol>\r\n                    <li>Memoriza las excepciones de configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica (Cr, Cu, etc.)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Practica la asignaci\u00f3n de n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos a partir de configuraciones<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Comprende la diferencia entre modelos hist\u00f3ricos<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Visualiza mentalmente las formas de orbitales<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 7\ufe0f\u20e3 PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n        <h3>\ud83d\udcdd PROBLEMAS DE DESARROLLO TIPO EXAMEN<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"problem-set\">\r\n            <div class=\"problem-card\">\r\n                <h4>Problema 1: An\u00e1lisis de Modelos At\u00f3micos (7 puntos)<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Un estudiante afirma: \"El modelo de Rutherford puede explicar los espectros de l\u00edneas del hidr\u00f3geno porque los electrones en \u00f3rbitas el\u00edpticas emitir\u00edan radiaci\u00f3n continua\".<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Se pide:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <ol type=\"a\">\r\n                    <li>Identifica dos errores en esta afirmaci\u00f3n (2 puntos)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Explica por qu\u00e9 el modelo de Bohr s\u00ed explica los espectros de l\u00edneas (3 puntos)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Menciona una limitaci\u00f3n del modelo de Bohr que resuelve la mec\u00e1nica cu\u00e1ntica (2 puntos)<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Espacio para respuesta:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <textarea rows=\"8\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu respuesta aqu\u00ed...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                    <div class=\"answer-feedback\">\r\n                        <button class=\"check-answer\" data-problem=\"1\">Verificar mi respuesta<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"answer-hint\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"problem-card\">\r\n                <h4>Problema 2: Configuraci\u00f3n Electr\u00f3nica y Propiedades (8 puntos)<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Considera los elementos A (Z=24), B (Z=29), y C (Z=30).<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Se pide:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <ol type=\"a\">\r\n                    <li>Escribe la configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica completa de cada elemento (3 puntos)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Identifica las excepciones a la regla de llenado y explica por qu\u00e9 ocurren (2 puntos)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Predice cu\u00e1l tendr\u00e1 mayor radio at\u00f3mico y justifica (2 puntos)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>\u00bfCu\u00e1l presentar\u00e1 mayor n\u00famero de electrones desapareados? (1 punto)<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Espacio para respuesta:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <textarea rows=\"8\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu respuesta aqu\u00ed...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                    <div class=\"answer-feedback\">\r\n                        <button class=\"check-answer\" data-problem=\"2\">Verificar mi respuesta<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"answer-hint\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"problem-card\">\r\n                <h4>Problema 3: Interpretaci\u00f3n Cu\u00e1ntica (8 puntos)<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Para el orbital 3d_xy del \u00e1tomo de hidr\u00f3geno, la funci\u00f3n de onda tiene la forma:<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"math-block\">\u03c8_{3d_{xy}} = R_{32}(r) \u00b7 XY(\u03b8,\u03c6)<\/div>\r\n                <p><strong>Se pide:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <ol type=\"a\">\r\n                    <li>Indica los valores de n, l, m para este orbital (1 punto)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Describe la forma geom\u00e9trica del orbital y la ubicaci\u00f3n de sus nodos (2 puntos)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Si medimos la posici\u00f3n del electr\u00f3n en este orbital, \u00bfqu\u00e9 podemos decir sobre su momento lineal? Fundamenta usando el principio de incertidumbre (3 puntos)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Explica por qu\u00e9 este orbital tiene energ\u00eda mayor que el 2p_z (2 puntos)<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Espacio para respuesta:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <textarea rows=\"8\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu respuesta aqu\u00ed...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                    <div class=\"answer-feedback\">\r\n                        <button class=\"check-answer\" data-problem=\"3\">Verificar mi respuesta<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"answer-hint\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"scoring-guide\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\uddc2\ufe0f GU\u00cdA DE PUNTUACI\u00d3N (TOTAL: 25 PUNTOS)<\/h4>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>Problema 1:<\/strong> 7 puntos (Conceptual)<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Problema 2:<\/strong> 8 puntos (Aplicaci\u00f3n)<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Problema 3:<\/strong> 8 puntos (An\u00e1lisis)<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Presentaci\u00f3n y claridad:<\/strong> 2 puntos<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <p><em>Tiempo sugerido: 90 minutos. Nivel: Avanzado.<\/em><\/p>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"scoring-tips\">\r\n                <h5>\ud83d\udcca CRITERIOS DE EVALUACI\u00d3N:<\/h5>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Claridad en la explicaci\u00f3n conceptual (40%)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Correcta aplicaci\u00f3n de f\u00f3rmulas y reglas (30%)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Razonamiento l\u00f3gico y justificaci\u00f3n (20%)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Presentaci\u00f3n ordenada (10%)<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 8\ufe0f\u20e3 CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"metacognitive\">\r\n        <h3>\ud83e\udde0 REFLEXI\u00d3N METACOGNITIVA<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"reflection-questions\">\r\n            <div class=\"reflection-card\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83e\udd14 AUTORREGULACI\u00d3N DEL APRENDIZAJE<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Responde honestamente estas preguntas para evaluar tu propio proceso de aprendizaje:<\/p>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"reflection-item\">\r\n                    <h5>1. \u00bfQu\u00e9 concepto te result\u00f3 m\u00e1s desafiante de entender?<\/h5>\r\n                    <div class=\"reflection-options\">\r\n                        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"challenge\" value=\"dualidad\"> Dualidad onda-part\u00edcula<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"challenge\" value=\"numeros\"> N\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos y su significado f\u00edsico<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"challenge\" value=\"probabilidad\"> Interpretaci\u00f3n probabil\u00edstica<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"challenge\" value=\"excepciones\"> Excepciones en configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica<\/label>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Explica por qu\u00e9...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"reflection-item\">\r\n                    <h5>2. \u00bfC\u00f3mo relacionas estos conceptos cu\u00e1nticos con fen\u00f3menos macrosc\u00f3picos que observas diariamente?<\/h5>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ej: La estabilidad de la materia, colores de las luces...\" rows=\"4\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"reflection-item\">\r\n                    <h5>3. Si tuvieras que explicar el modelo cu\u00e1ntico a un compa\u00f1ero que solo conoce el modelo planetario, \u00bfqu\u00e9 analog\u00edas usar\u00edas?<\/h5>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Describe tu estrategia did\u00e1ctica...\" rows=\"4\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button id=\"save-reflection\" class=\"action-button\">Guardar mi reflexi\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"learning-plan\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udccb PLAN DE ESTUDIO PERSONALIZADO<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Basado en tu desempe\u00f1o en los simuladores y problemas, se sugiere:<\/p>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"suggestion\" id=\"suggestion-basic\">\r\n                    <h5>\ud83d\udfe2 Nivel B\u00e1sico (si tuviste dificultades)<\/h5>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Repasar modelos at\u00f3micos hist\u00f3ricos y sus limitaciones<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Practicar configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica hasta Z=20<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Visualizar orbitales s y p con los simuladores<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Revisar los errores comunes 1 y 2<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"suggestion\" id=\"suggestion-intermediate\">\r\n                    <h5>\ud83d\udfe1 Nivel Intermedio (si manejas lo b\u00e1sico)<\/h5>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Profundizar en el significado f\u00edsico de n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Estudiar excepciones de configuraci\u00f3n (Cr, Cu, etc.)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Experimentar con el simulador de incertidumbre<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Resolver problemas 1 y 2 completamente<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"suggestion\" id=\"suggestion-advanced\">\r\n                    <h5>\ud83d\udd34 Nivel Avanzado (si dominas los conceptos)<\/h5>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Explorar las implicaciones filos\u00f3ficas del principio de incertidumbre<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Investigar sobre orbitales h\u00edbridos (sp, sp\u00b2, sp\u00b3)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Relacionar con temas de qu\u00edmica cu\u00e1ntica avanzada<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Desarrollar problemas tipo investigaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"learning-resources\">\r\n                    <h5>\ud83d\udcda RECURSOS ADICIONALES:<\/h5>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"resource-link\">Video: Dualidad onda-part\u00edcula<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"resource-link\">Simulador de orbitales 3D<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"resource-link\">Ejercicios interactivos de configuraci\u00f3n<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"resource-link\">Art\u00edculo: Historia de la mec\u00e1nica cu\u00e1ntica<\/a><\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button id=\"generate-plan\" class=\"action-button\">Generar mi plan de estudio<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"learning-summary\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udcc8 RESUMEN DE TU APRENDIZAJE<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"summary-stats\">\r\n                <div class=\"stat\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"concepts-mastered\">0<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">Conceptos dominados<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"simulators-completed\">0<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">Simuladores completados<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"problems-solved\">0<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">Problemas resueltos<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"learning-time\">0 min<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">Tiempo de estudio<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"progress-container\">\r\n                <div class=\"progress-label\">Progreso general: <span id=\"progress-percent\">0%<\/span><\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"progress-bar\">\r\n                    <div class=\"progress-fill\" id=\"progress-fill\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT COMPLETO PARA INTERACTIVIDAD -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ========== CONFIGURACI\u00d3N GLOBAL ==========\r\nconst PHYSICS_CONSTANTS = {\r\n    h: 6.626e-34,    \/\/ J\u00b7s (constante de Planck)\r\n    \u0127: 1.0545718e-34, \/\/ J\u00b7s (constante de Planck reducida)\r\n    a0: 5.291772109e-11, \/\/ m (radio de Bohr)\r\n    me: 9.10938356e-31, \/\/ kg (masa del electr\u00f3n)\r\n    e: 1.60217662e-19, \/\/ C (carga del electr\u00f3n)\r\n    c: 2.99792458e8,  \/\/ m\/s (velocidad de la luz)\r\n    R: 1.0973731568160e7 \/\/ m\u207b\u00b9 (constante de Rydberg)\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== DATOS DE ORBITALES ==========\r\nconst orbitalData = {\r\n    '1s': {\r\n        n: 1, l: 0, m: 0,\r\n        energy: -13.6,\r\n        nodes: {radial: 0, angular: 0},\r\n        waveFunc: '\u03c8 = (1\/\u221a\u03c0)(Z\/a\u2080)^{3\/2}e^{-Zr\/a\u2080}',\r\n        color: '#00ff88',\r\n        shape: 'Esfera perfecta',\r\n        description: 'Orbital m\u00e1s estable, sin nodos, m\u00e1xima probabilidad en el n\u00facleo'\r\n    },\r\n    '2pz': {\r\n        n: 2, l: 1, m: 0,\r\n        energy: -3.4,\r\n        nodes: {radial: 0, angular: 1},\r\n        waveFunc: '\u03c8 = (1\/4\u221a2\u03c0)(Z\/a\u2080)^{5\/2}r cos\u03b8 e^{-Zr\/2a\u2080}',\r\n        color: '#ff5500',\r\n        shape: 'Forma de pesas (dumbbell)',\r\n        description: 'Un nodo angular plano (plano xy), orientado en el eje z'\r\n    },\r\n    '3dxy': {\r\n        n: 3, l: 2, m: -2,\r\n        energy: -1.51,\r\n        nodes: {radial: 0, angular: 2},\r\n        waveFunc: '\u03c8 = (1\/81\u221a2\u03c0)(Z\/a\u2080)^{7\/2}r\u00b2 sin\u00b2\u03b8 sin2\u03c6 e^{-Zr\/3a\u2080}',\r\n        color: '#aa00ff',\r\n        shape: 'Tr\u00e9bol de 4 hojas en plano xy',\r\n        description: 'Dos nodos angulares (planos xz e yz), forma de roset\u00f3n'\r\n    },\r\n    '4f': {\r\n        n: 4, l: 3, m: 0,\r\n        energy: -0.85,\r\n        nodes: {radial: 0, angular: 3},\r\n        waveFunc: '\u03c8 = (1\/768\u221a35\u03c0)(Z\/a\u2080)^{9\/2}r\u00b3(5cos\u00b3\u03b8-3cos\u03b8)e^{-Zr\/4a\u2080}',\r\n        color: '#00aaff',\r\n        shape: 'Compleja, m\u00faltiples l\u00f3bulos',\r\n        description: 'Tres nodos angulares, forma compleja con 8 l\u00f3bulos'\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== DATOS DE ELEMENTOS ==========\r\nconst ELEMENTS = [\r\n    {Z:1, symbol:'H', name:'Hidr\u00f3geno', config:'1s\u00b9', block:'s', valence:1, period:1, group:1, mass:1.008},\r\n    {Z:2, symbol:'He', name:'Helio', config:'1s\u00b2', block:'s', valence:2, period:1, group:18, mass:4.003},\r\n    {Z:3, symbol:'Li', name:'Litio', config:'[He] 2s\u00b9', block:'s', valence:1, period:2, group:1, mass:6.941},\r\n    {Z:4, symbol:'Be', name:'Berilio', config:'[He] 2s\u00b2', block:'s', valence:2, period:2, group:2, mass:9.012},\r\n    {Z:5, symbol:'B', name:'Boro', config:'[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b9', block:'p', valence:3, period:2, group:13, mass:10.811},\r\n    {Z:6, symbol:'C', name:'Carbono', config:'[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b2', block:'p', valence:4, period:2, group:14, mass:12.011},\r\n    {Z:7, symbol:'N', name:'Nitr\u00f3geno', config:'[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b3', block:'p', valence:5, period:2, group:15, mass:14.007},\r\n    {Z:8, symbol:'O', name:'Ox\u00edgeno', config:'[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u2074', block:'p', valence:6, period:2, group:16, mass:15.999},\r\n    {Z:9, symbol:'F', name:'Fl\u00faor', config:'[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u2075', block:'p', valence:7, period:2, group:17, mass:18.998},\r\n    {Z:10, symbol:'Ne', name:'Ne\u00f3n', config:'[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076', block:'p', valence:8, period:2, group:18, mass:20.180},\r\n    {Z:11, symbol:'Na', name:'Sodio', config:'[Ne] 3s\u00b9', block:'s', valence:1, period:3, group:1, mass:22.990},\r\n    {Z:12, symbol:'Mg', name:'Magnesio', config:'[Ne] 3s\u00b2', block:'s', valence:2, period:3, group:2, mass:24.305},\r\n    {Z:13, symbol:'Al', name:'Aluminio', config:'[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u00b9', block:'p', valence:3, period:3, group:13, mass:26.982},\r\n    {Z:14, symbol:'Si', name:'Silicio', config:'[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u00b2', block:'p', valence:4, period:3, group:14, mass:28.086},\r\n    {Z:15, symbol:'P', name:'F\u00f3sforo', config:'[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u00b3', block:'p', valence:5, period:3, group:15, mass:30.974},\r\n    {Z:16, symbol:'S', name:'Azufre', config:'[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u2074', block:'p', valence:6, period:3, group:16, mass:32.065},\r\n    {Z:17, symbol:'Cl', name:'Cloro', config:'[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u2075', block:'p', valence:7, period:3, group:17, mass:35.453},\r\n    {Z:18, symbol:'Ar', name:'Arg\u00f3n', config:'[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u2076', block:'p', valence:8, period:3, group:18, mass:39.948},\r\n    {Z:19, symbol:'K', name:'Potasio', config:'[Ar] 4s\u00b9', block:'s', valence:1, period:4, group:1, mass:39.098},\r\n    {Z:20, symbol:'Ca', name:'Calcio', config:'[Ar] 4s\u00b2', block:'s', valence:2, period:4, group:2, mass:40.078}\r\n];\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== VARIABLES DE ESTADO ==========\r\nlet learningStats = {\r\n    conceptsMastered: 0,\r\n    simulatorsCompleted: 0,\r\n    problemsSolved: 0,\r\n    startTime: Date.now(),\r\n    completedActivities: new Set()\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== FUNCIONES DE UTILIDAD ==========\r\nfunction formatScientific(value, decimals = 2) {\r\n    if (value === 0) return '0';\r\n    if (Math.abs(value) >= 1) {\r\n        return value.toFixed(decimals);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    const exponent = Math.floor(Math.log10(Math.abs(value)));\r\n    const mantissa = value \/ Math.pow(10, exponent);\r\n    \r\n    return mantissa.toFixed(decimals) + '\u00d710' + superscript(exponent);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction superscript(num) {\r\n    const superscripts = ['\u2070', '\u00b9', '\u00b2', '\u00b3', '\u2074', '\u2075', '\u2076', '\u2077', '\u2078', '\u2079'];\r\n    const sign = num < 0 ? '\u207b' : '';\r\n    const digits = Math.abs(num).toString().split('');\r\n    return sign + digits.map(d => superscripts[parseInt(d)]).join('');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction wavelengthToColor(wavelength) {\r\n    let r, g, b;\r\n    if (wavelength >= 380 && wavelength < 440) {\r\n        r = -(wavelength - 440) \/ (440 - 380);\r\n        g = 0;\r\n        b = 1;\r\n    } else if (wavelength >= 440 && wavelength < 490) {\r\n        r = 0;\r\n        g = (wavelength - 440) \/ (490 - 440);\r\n        b = 1;\r\n    } else if (wavelength >= 490 && wavelength < 510) {\r\n        r = 0;\r\n        g = 1;\r\n        b = -(wavelength - 510) \/ (510 - 490);\r\n    } else if (wavelength >= 510 && wavelength < 580) {\r\n        r = (wavelength - 510) \/ (580 - 510);\r\n        g = 1;\r\n        b = 0;\r\n    } else if (wavelength >= 580 && wavelength < 645) {\r\n        r = 1;\r\n        g = -(wavelength - 645) \/ (645 - 580);\r\n        b = 0;\r\n    } else if (wavelength >= 645 && wavelength <= 780) {\r\n        r = 1;\r\n        g = 0;\r\n        b = 0;\r\n    } else {\r\n        r = 0.5;\r\n        g = 0.5;\r\n        b = 0.5;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Intensidad\r\n    let intensity;\r\n    if (wavelength >= 380 && wavelength < 420) {\r\n        intensity = 0.3 + 0.7 * (wavelength - 380) \/ (420 - 380);\r\n    } else if (wavelength >= 420 && wavelength < 700) {\r\n        intensity = 1;\r\n    } else if (wavelength >= 700 && wavelength <= 780) {\r\n        intensity = 0.3 + 0.7 * (780 - wavelength) \/ (780 - 700);\r\n    } else {\r\n        intensity = 0.5;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    r = Math.floor(255 * Math.pow(r * intensity, 0.8));\r\n    g = Math.floor(255 * Math.pow(g * intensity, 0.8));\r\n    b = Math.floor(255 * Math.pow(b * intensity, 0.8));\r\n    \r\n    return `rgb(${r}, ${g}, ${b})`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== SIMULADOR DE ORBITALES ==========\r\nfunction updateOrbitalVisualization() {\r\n    const orbitalType = document.getElementById('orbital-type').value;\r\n    const probability = parseInt(document.getElementById('probability-slider').value);\r\n    const showNodes = document.getElementById('show-nodes').checked;\r\n    const showPhase = document.getElementById('show-phase').checked;\r\n    const showGrid = document.getElementById('show-grid').checked;\r\n    \r\n    const data = orbitalData[orbitalType];\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar informaci\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('orbital-title').textContent = `ORBITAL ${orbitalType.toUpperCase()}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('quantum-numbers').textContent = `n=${data.n}, l=${data.l}, m=${data.m}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('node-count').textContent = `Radiales: ${data.nodes.radial}, Angulares: ${data.nodes.angular}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('orbital-energy').textContent = `${data.energy} eV`;\r\n    document.getElementById('wave-function').textContent = data.waveFunc;\r\n    document.getElementById('shape-desc').textContent = data.shape;\r\n    document.getElementById('prob-value').textContent = `${probability}%`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar visualizaci\u00f3n SVG\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById('orbital-svg');\r\n    svg.innerHTML = '';\r\n    \r\n    const centerX = 200;\r\n    const centerY = 150;\r\n    const baseRadius = 80;\r\n    const probRadius = baseRadius * (probability \/ 100);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Fondo\r\n    const bg = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'rect');\r\n    bg.setAttribute('width', '400');\r\n    bg.setAttribute('height', '300');\r\n    bg.setAttribute('fill', '#000');\r\n    svg.appendChild(bg);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Rejilla si est\u00e1 activada\r\n    if (showGrid) {\r\n        for (let i = 0; i <= 400; i += 40) {\r\n            const line = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'line');\r\n            line.setAttribute('x1', i);\r\n            line.setAttribute('y1', '0');\r\n            line.setAttribute('x2', i);\r\n            line.setAttribute('y2', '300');\r\n            line.setAttribute('stroke', '#333');\r\n            line.setAttribute('stroke-width', '0.5');\r\n            svg.appendChild(line);\r\n        }\r\n        for (let i = 0; i <= 300; i += 30) {\r\n            const line = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'line');\r\n            line.setAttribute('x1', '0');\r\n            line.setAttribute('y1', i);\r\n            line.setAttribute('x2', '400');\r\n            line.setAttribute('y2', i);\r\n            line.setAttribute('stroke', '#333');\r\n            line.setAttribute('stroke-width', '0.5');\r\n            svg.appendChild(line);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ejes\r\n    const axes = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'g');\r\n    axes.setAttribute('stroke', '#555');\r\n    axes.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1');\r\n    \r\n    const xAxis = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'line');\r\n    xAxis.setAttribute('x1', '50');\r\n    xAxis.setAttribute('y1', centerY);\r\n    xAxis.setAttribute('x2', '350');\r\n    xAxis.setAttribute('y2', centerY);\r\n    axes.appendChild(xAxis);\r\n    \r\n    const yAxis = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'line');\r\n    yAxis.setAttribute('x1', centerX);\r\n    yAxis.setAttribute('y1', '50');\r\n    yAxis.setAttribute('x2', centerX);\r\n    yAxis.setAttribute('y2', '250');\r\n    axes.appendChild(yAxis);\r\n    \r\n    svg.appendChild(axes);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Representar orbital seg\u00fan tipo\r\n    switch(orbitalType) {\r\n        case '1s':\r\n            drawSphericalOrbital(svg, centerX, centerY, probRadius, data.color, showPhase);\r\n            break;\r\n        case '2pz':\r\n            drawDumbbellOrbital(svg, centerX, centerY, probRadius, data.color, showPhase);\r\n            break;\r\n        case '3dxy':\r\n            drawCloverleafOrbital(svg, centerX, centerY, probRadius, data.color, showPhase);\r\n            break;\r\n        case '4f':\r\n            drawComplexOrbital(svg, centerX, centerY, probRadius, data.color, showPhase);\r\n            break;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar nodos si est\u00e1 activado\r\n    if (showNodes && data.nodes.angular > 0) {\r\n        drawNodes(svg, centerX, centerY, baseRadius, data.nodes.angular, orbitalType);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Marcar actividad completada\r\n    markActivityCompleted('orbital-simulator');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction drawSphericalOrbital(svg, cx, cy, radius, color, showPhase) {\r\n    const sphere = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n    sphere.setAttribute('cx', cx);\r\n    sphere.setAttribute('cy', cy);\r\n    sphere.setAttribute('r', radius);\r\n    sphere.setAttribute('fill', color);\r\n    sphere.setAttribute('opacity', '0.6');\r\n    sphere.setAttribute('filter', 'url(#glow)');\r\n    svg.appendChild(sphere);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Crear filtro de brillo si no existe\r\n    if (!document.getElementById('glow-filter')) {\r\n        const defs = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'defs');\r\n        const filter = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'filter');\r\n        filter.id = 'glow';\r\n        \r\n        const feGaussianBlur = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feGaussianBlur');\r\n        feGaussianBlur.setAttribute('stdDeviation', '3');\r\n        feGaussianBlur.setAttribute('result', 'coloredBlur');\r\n        \r\n        const feMerge = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMerge');\r\n        const feMergeNode1 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMergeNode');\r\n        feMergeNode1.setAttribute('in', 'coloredBlur');\r\n        const feMergeNode2 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMergeNode');\r\n        feMergeNode2.setAttribute('in', 'SourceGraphic');\r\n        \r\n        feMerge.appendChild(feMergeNode1);\r\n        feMerge.appendChild(feMergeNode2);\r\n        \r\n        filter.appendChild(feGaussianBlur);\r\n        filter.appendChild(feMerge);\r\n        defs.appendChild(filter);\r\n        svg.appendChild(defs);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction drawDumbbellOrbital(svg, cx, cy, radius, color, showPhase) {\r\n    \/\/ L\u00f3bulo positivo (arriba)\r\n    const lobe1 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'ellipse');\r\n    lobe1.setAttribute('cx', cx);\r\n    lobe1.setAttribute('cy', cy - radius * 0.7);\r\n    lobe1.setAttribute('rx', radius * 0.5);\r\n    lobe1.setAttribute('ry', radius * 0.3);\r\n    lobe1.setAttribute('fill', showPhase ? color : '#00aaff');\r\n    lobe1.setAttribute('opacity', '0.7');\r\n    svg.appendChild(lobe1);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ L\u00f3bulo negativo (abajo)\r\n    const lobe2 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'ellipse');\r\n    lobe2.setAttribute('cx', cx);\r\n    lobe2.setAttribute('cy', cy + radius * 0.7);\r\n    lobe2.setAttribute('rx', radius * 0.5);\r\n    lobe2.setAttribute('ry', radius * 0.3);\r\n    lobe2.setAttribute('fill', showPhase ? '#ff00aa' : '#00aaff');\r\n    lobe2.setAttribute('opacity', '0.7');\r\n    svg.appendChild(lobe2);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Nodo (plano)\r\n    if (showPhase) {\r\n        const node = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'line');\r\n        node.setAttribute('x1', cx - radius);\r\n        node.setAttribute('y1', cy);\r\n        node.setAttribute('x2', cx + radius);\r\n        node.setAttribute('y2', cy);\r\n        node.setAttribute('stroke', '#fff');\r\n        node.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1');\r\n        node.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', '5,5');\r\n        node.setAttribute('opacity', '0.5');\r\n        svg.appendChild(node);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction drawCloverleafOrbital(svg, cx, cy, radius, color, showPhase) {\r\n    \/\/ Cuatro l\u00f3bulos en forma de tr\u00e9bol\r\n    const lobes = 4;\r\n    for (let i = 0; i < lobes; i++) {\r\n        const angle = (i * 90) * Math.PI \/ 180;\r\n        const lobeX = cx + Math.cos(angle) * radius * 0.6;\r\n        const lobeY = cy + Math.sin(angle) * radius * 0.6;\r\n        \r\n        const lobe = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'ellipse');\r\n        lobe.setAttribute('cx', lobeX);\r\n        lobe.setAttribute('cy', lobeY);\r\n        lobe.setAttribute('rx', radius * 0.4);\r\n        lobe.setAttribute('ry', radius * 0.2);\r\n        lobe.setAttribute('fill', (i % 2 === 0 && showPhase) ? color : '#ff00aa');\r\n        lobe.setAttribute('opacity', '0.7');\r\n        lobe.setAttribute('transform', `rotate(${angle * 180 \/ Math.PI + 45}, ${lobeX}, ${lobeY})`);\r\n        svg.appendChild(lobe);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Nodos\r\n    if (showPhase) {\r\n        \/\/ Nodo vertical\r\n        const node1 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'line');\r\n        node1.setAttribute('x1', cx);\r\n        node1.setAttribute('y1', cy - radius);\r\n        node1.setAttribute('x2', cx);\r\n        node1.setAttribute('y2', cy + radius);\r\n        node1.setAttribute('stroke', '#fff');\r\n        node1.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1');\r\n        node1.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', '5,5');\r\n        node1.setAttribute('opacity', '0.5');\r\n        svg.appendChild(node1);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Nodo horizontal\r\n        const node2 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'line');\r\n        node2.setAttribute('x1', cx - radius);\r\n        node2.setAttribute('y1', cy);\r\n        node2.setAttribute('x2', cx + radius);\r\n        node2.setAttribute('y2', cy);\r\n        node2.setAttribute('stroke', '#fff');\r\n        node2.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1');\r\n        node2.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', '5,5');\r\n        node2.setAttribute('opacity', '0.5');\r\n        svg.appendChild(node2);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction drawComplexOrbital(svg, cx, cy, radius, color, showPhase) {\r\n    \/\/ Ocho l\u00f3bulos complejos\r\n    const lobes = 8;\r\n    for (let i = 0; i < lobes; i++) {\r\n        const angle = (i * 45) * Math.PI \/ 180;\r\n        const distance = radius * (i % 2 === 0 ? 0.7 : 0.4);\r\n        const lobeX = cx + Math.cos(angle) * distance;\r\n        const lobeY = cy + Math.sin(angle) * distance;\r\n        \r\n        const lobe = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n        lobe.setAttribute('cx', lobeX);\r\n        lobe.setAttribute('cy', lobeY);\r\n        lobe.setAttribute('r', radius * 0.15);\r\n        lobe.setAttribute('fill', (i < 4 && showPhase) ? color : '#ff00aa');\r\n        lobe.setAttribute('opacity', '0.6');\r\n        svg.appendChild(lobe);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction drawNodes(svg, cx, cy, radius, nodeCount, orbitalType) {\r\n    for (let i = 0; i < nodeCount; i++) {\r\n        const angle = (i * 180 \/ nodeCount) * Math.PI \/ 180;\r\n        const node = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'line');\r\n        \r\n        if (orbitalType === '2pz') {\r\n            \/\/ Nodo horizontal para pz\r\n            node.setAttribute('x1', cx - radius);\r\n            node.setAttribute('y1', cy);\r\n            node.setAttribute('x2', cx + radius);\r\n            node.setAttribute('y2', cy);\r\n        } else {\r\n            \/\/ Nodos radiales para otros orbitales\r\n            const x1 = cx + Math.cos(angle) * radius;\r\n            const y1 = cy + Math.sin(angle) * radius;\r\n            const x2 = cx - Math.cos(angle) * radius;\r\n            const y2 = cy - Math.sin(angle) * radius;\r\n            \r\n            node.setAttribute('x1', x1);\r\n            node.setAttribute('y1', y1);\r\n            node.setAttribute('x2', x2);\r\n            node.setAttribute('y2', y2);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        node.setAttribute('stroke', '#fff');\r\n        node.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1');\r\n        node.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', '5,5');\r\n        node.setAttribute('opacity', '0.3');\r\n        svg.appendChild(node);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== SIMULADOR DE ESPECTRO AT\u00d3MICO ==========\r\nfunction calculateSpectralLine() {\r\n    const ni = parseInt(document.getElementById('initial-level').value);\r\n    const nf = parseInt(document.getElementById('final-level').value);\r\n    \r\n    if (ni <= nf) {\r\n        alert('\u274c El nivel inicial debe ser MAYOR que el nivel final');\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ F\u00f3rmula de Rydberg para el hidr\u00f3geno\r\n    const R = PHYSICS_CONSTANTS.R; \/\/ m\u207b\u00b9\r\n    const wavelengthMeters = 1 \/ (R * (1\/(nf*nf) - 1\/(ni*ni)));\r\n    const wavelengthNM = wavelengthMeters * 1e9; \/\/ Convertir a nm\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Energ\u00eda del fot\u00f3n\r\n    const energyJoules = (PHYSICS_CONSTANTS.h * PHYSICS_CONSTANTS.c) \/ wavelengthMeters;\r\n    const energyEV = energyJoules \/ PHYSICS_CONSTANTS.e;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Determinar serie y regi\u00f3n\r\n    let series = '', region = '', colorName = '';\r\n    if (nf === 1) {\r\n        series = 'Lyman';\r\n        region = 'Ultravioleta';\r\n        colorName = 'UV';\r\n    } else if (nf === 2) {\r\n        series = 'Balmer';\r\n        region = 'Visible';\r\n        \/\/ Determinar color aproximado\r\n        if (wavelengthNM < 450) colorName = 'violeta';\r\n        else if (wavelengthNM < 485) colorName = 'azul';\r\n        else if (wavelengthNM < 500) colorName = 'cian';\r\n        else if (wavelengthNM < 565) colorName = 'verde';\r\n        else if (wavelengthNM < 590) colorName = 'amarillo';\r\n        else if (wavelengthNM < 625) colorName = 'naranja';\r\n        else colorName = 'rojo';\r\n    } else if (nf === 3) {\r\n        series = 'Paschen';\r\n        region = 'Infrarrojo';\r\n        colorName = 'IR';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar display\r\n    document.getElementById('wavelength').textContent = wavelengthNM.toFixed(1) + ' nm';\r\n    document.getElementById('photon-energy').textContent = energyEV.toFixed(2) + ' eV';\r\n    document.getElementById('series').textContent = series;\r\n    document.getElementById('region').textContent = region;\r\n    document.getElementById('color-indicator').textContent = `(${colorName})`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar l\u00ednea espectral\r\n    const line = document.getElementById('spectrum-line');\r\n    const color = wavelengthToColor(wavelengthNM);\r\n    line.style.backgroundColor = color;\r\n    line.style.width = '100%';\r\n    line.style.height = '30px';\r\n    line.style.borderRadius = '15px';\r\n    line.style.opacity = '0.8';\r\n    line.style.boxShadow = `0 0 10px ${color}`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar informaci\u00f3n adicional\r\n    const transitionInfo = `Transici\u00f3n: n=${ni} \u2192 n=${nf}\\nEnerg\u00eda: ${energyEV.toFixed(2)} eV\\n\u03bb: ${wavelengthNM.toFixed(1)} nm`;\r\n    line.title = transitionInfo;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Marcar actividad completada\r\n    markActivityCompleted('spectrum-simulator');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== CONSTRUCTOR DE \u00c1TOMOS ==========\r\nfunction updateAtomBuilder() {\r\n    const Z = parseInt(document.getElementById('z-slider').value);\r\n    const element = ELEMENTS[Z - 1];\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar informaci\u00f3n b\u00e1sica\r\n    document.getElementById('atomic-number').textContent = Z;\r\n    document.getElementById('config-display').textContent = element.config;\r\n    document.getElementById('element-name').textContent = element.name;\r\n    document.getElementById('element-symbol').textContent = element.symbol;\r\n    document.getElementById('element-block').textContent = element.block;\r\n    document.getElementById('valence-electrons').textContent = element.valence;\r\n    document.getElementById('period').textContent = element.period;\r\n    document.getElementById('group').textContent = element.group;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar diagrama de orbitales\r\n    updateOrbitalDiagram(Z);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Marcar actividad completada\r\n    markActivityCompleted('atom-builder');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction updateOrbitalDiagram(Z) {\r\n    const diagram = document.getElementById('orbital-diagram');\r\n    diagram.innerHTML = '';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configuraci\u00f3n de orbitales en orden de llenado\r\n    const orbitalOrder = [\r\n        {label: '1s', max: 2, type: 's'},\r\n        {label: '2s', max: 2, type: 's'},\r\n        {label: '2p', max: 6, type: 'p'},\r\n        {label: '3s', max: 2, type: 's'},\r\n        {label: '3p', max: 6, type: 'p'},\r\n        {label: '4s', max: 2, type: 's'},\r\n        {label: '3d', max: 10, type: 'd'},\r\n        {label: '4p', max: 6, type: 'p'}\r\n    ];\r\n    \r\n    let remainingElectrons = Z;\r\n    let currentLevel = 1;\r\n    \r\n    orbitalOrder.forEach(orbital => {\r\n        const container = document.createElement('div');\r\n        container.className = 'orbital-row';\r\n        \r\n        const label = document.createElement('div');\r\n        label.className = 'orbital-label';\r\n        label.textContent = orbital.label;\r\n        label.style.color = getOrbitalColor(orbital.type);\r\n        container.appendChild(label);\r\n        \r\n        const boxes = document.createElement('div');\r\n        boxes.className = 'orbital-boxes';\r\n        \r\n        const electronsInOrbital = Math.min(remainingElectrons, orbital.max);\r\n        remainingElectrons -= electronsInOrbital;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Determinar electrones desapareados (regla de Hund)\r\n        let unpaired = 0;\r\n        let boxesPerSubshell = orbital.max;\r\n        \r\n        if (orbital.type === 'p') {\r\n            boxesPerSubshell = 3; \/\/ 3 orbitales p\r\n            if (electronsInOrbital > 0 && electronsInOrbital < orbital.max) {\r\n                unpaired = electronsInOrbital <= 3 ? electronsInOrbital : 6 - electronsInOrbital;\r\n            }\r\n        } else if (orbital.type === 'd') {\r\n            boxesPerSubshell = 5; \/\/ 5 orbitales d\r\n            if (electronsInOrbital > 0 && electronsInOrbital < orbital.max) {\r\n                unpaired = electronsInOrbital <= 5 ? electronsInOrbital : 10 - electronsInOrbital;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Crear casillas\r\n        for (let i = 0; i < boxesPerSubshell; i++) {\r\n            const boxContainer = document.createElement('div');\r\n            boxContainer.style.display = 'flex';\r\n            boxContainer.style.flexDirection = 'column';\r\n            boxContainer.style.gap = '2px';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Casilla para esp\u00edn up\r\n            const boxUp = document.createElement('div');\r\n            boxUp.className = 'electron-box';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Casilla para esp\u00edn down (solo si es orbital s)\r\n            const boxDown = document.createElement('div');\r\n            boxDown.className = 'electron-box';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Calcular cu\u00e1ntos electrones hay en este orbital espec\u00edfico\r\n            let electronsInThisOrbital = 0;\r\n            let hasUp = false;\r\n            let hasDown = false;\r\n            \r\n            if (orbital.type === 's') {\r\n                \/\/ Orbital s solo tiene uno\r\n                if (electronsInOrbital > 0) {\r\n                    boxUp.innerHTML = '\u2191';\r\n                    boxUp.classList.add('filled', 'spin-up');\r\n                    if (electronsInOrbital > 1) {\r\n                        boxDown.innerHTML = '\u2193';\r\n                        boxDown.classList.add('filled', 'spin-down');\r\n                    }\r\n                }\r\n            } else {\r\n                \/\/ Orbitales p y d\r\n                const maxPerBox = 2;\r\n                let electronsAssigned = 0;\r\n                \r\n                for (let boxIndex = 0; boxIndex < boxesPerSubshell; boxIndex++) {\r\n                    const available = Math.min(orbital.max - electronsAssigned, maxPerBox);\r\n                    const toAssign = Math.min(electronsInOrbital - electronsAssigned, available);\r\n                    \r\n                    if (boxIndex === i) {\r\n                        if (toAssign > 0) {\r\n                            boxUp.innerHTML = '\u2191';\r\n                            boxUp.classList.add('filled', 'spin-up');\r\n                            if (toAssign > 1) {\r\n                                boxDown.innerHTML = '\u2193';\r\n                                boxDown.classList.add('filled', 'spin-down');\r\n                            } else {\r\n                                boxUp.classList.add('unpaired');\r\n                            }\r\n                        }\r\n                        break;\r\n                    }\r\n                    electronsAssigned += toAssign;\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            boxContainer.appendChild(boxUp);\r\n            if (orbital.type !== 's') {\r\n                boxContainer.appendChild(boxDown);\r\n            }\r\n            boxes.appendChild(boxContainer);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        container.appendChild(boxes);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Solo mostrar si hay electrones o es el siguiente nivel\r\n        if (electronsInOrbital > 0 || currentLevel <= Math.ceil(Z\/2)) {\r\n            diagram.appendChild(container);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        currentLevel++;\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction getOrbitalColor(type) {\r\n    switch(type) {\r\n        case 's': return '#00ff88';\r\n        case 'p': return '#ff5500';\r\n        case 'd': return '#aa00ff';\r\n        case 'f': return '#00aaff';\r\n        default: return '#ffffff';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== PRINCIPIO DE INCERTIDUMBRE ==========\r\nfunction updateUncertaintySimulation() {\r\n    const dx = parseFloat(document.getElementById('dx-slider').value); \/\/ en nm\r\n    const dxMeters = dx * 1e-9; \/\/ Convertir a metros\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular \u0394p m\u00ednimo seg\u00fan Heisenberg\r\n    const dpMin = PHYSICS_CONSTANTS.\u0127 \/ (2 * dxMeters);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar valores\r\n    document.getElementById('dx-value').textContent = dx.toFixed(1) + ' nm';\r\n    document.getElementById('dp-value').textContent = formatScientific(dpMin, 2) + ' kg\u00b7m\/s';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular producto\r\n    const product = dxMeters * dpMin;\r\n    const productFormatted = formatScientific(product, 2);\r\n    document.getElementById('uncertainty-product').textContent = productFormatted;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar valor del l\u00edmite de Heisenberg\r\n    const heisenbergLimit = PHYSICS_CONSTANTS.\u0127 \/ 2;\r\n    document.getElementById('heisenberg-value').textContent = formatScientific(heisenbergLimit, 2);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar barra de incertidumbre\r\n    const ratio = product \/ heisenbergLimit;\r\n    const fillWidth = Math.min(Math.max((ratio - 0.5) * 100, 0), 100);\r\n    \r\n    const fillElement = document.getElementById('uncertainty-fill');\r\n    fillElement.style.width = fillWidth + '%';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Color seg\u00fan la regi\u00f3n\r\n    if (ratio < 1) {\r\n        fillElement.style.backgroundColor = '#ff4444'; \/\/ Imposible (viola principio)\r\n        fillElement.style.opacity = '0.3';\r\n    } else if (ratio < 2) {\r\n        fillElement.style.backgroundColor = '#00ff88'; \/\/ L\u00edmite cu\u00e1ntico\r\n        fillElement.style.opacity = '0.8';\r\n    } else {\r\n        fillElement.style.backgroundColor = '#00aaff'; \/\/ Regi\u00f3n cl\u00e1sica\r\n        fillElement.style.opacity = '0.6';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar slider de \u0394p (solo visual)\r\n    const dpSlider = document.getElementById('dp-slider');\r\n    const dpValue = Math.min(Math.max(dpMin \/ 1e-25, 0.1), 10);\r\n    dpSlider.value = dpValue.toFixed(1);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Marcar actividad completada\r\n    markActivityCompleted('uncertainty-simulator');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== ERRORES COMUNES INTERACTIVOS ==========\r\nfunction setupErrorDetails() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.error-detail').forEach(button => {\r\n        button.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const errorId = this.getAttribute('data-error');\r\n            const explanation = document.getElementById('error-' + errorId);\r\n            \r\n            if (explanation.style.display === 'block') {\r\n                explanation.style.display = 'none';\r\n                this.textContent = 'Ver explicaci\u00f3n detallada';\r\n                this.classList.remove('active');\r\n            } else {\r\n                \/\/ Cerrar otras explicaciones\r\n                document.querySelectorAll('.error-explanation').forEach(el => {\r\n                    el.style.display = 'none';\r\n                });\r\n                document.querySelectorAll('.error-detail').forEach(btn => {\r\n                    btn.textContent = 'Ver explicaci\u00f3n detallada';\r\n                    btn.classList.remove('active');\r\n                });\r\n                \r\n                \/\/ Mostrar esta explicaci\u00f3n\r\n                explanation.style.display = 'block';\r\n                this.textContent = 'Ocultar explicaci\u00f3n';\r\n                this.classList.add('active');\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== QUIZ DE ERRORES COMUNES ==========\r\nfunction setupErrorQuiz() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(button => {\r\n        button.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const isCorrect = this.getAttribute('data-correct') === 'true';\r\n            const quizItem = this.closest('.quiz-item');\r\n            const feedback = quizItem.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Deshabilitar todos los botones en este \u00edtem\r\n            quizItem.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(btn => {\r\n                btn.disabled = true;\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            if (isCorrect) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                feedback.innerHTML = '\u2705 Correcto! Excelente comprensi\u00f3n.';\r\n                feedback.style.color = '#00ff88';\r\n                learningStats.conceptsMastered++;\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                feedback.innerHTML = '\u274c Incorrecto. Revisa la secci\u00f3n de errores comunes.';\r\n                feedback.style.color = '#ff4444';\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            updateLearningStats();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== VERIFICADOR DE PROBLEMAS ==========\r\nfunction setupProblemCheckers() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.check-answer').forEach(button => {\r\n        button.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const problemNum = this.getAttribute('data-problem');\r\n            const hint = this.nextElementSibling;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar pistas seg\u00fan el problema\r\n            const hints = {\r\n                1: '\ud83d\udcdd Pistas: 1) Rutherford no explicaba espectros, 2) \u00d3rbitas no eran el\u00edpticas en Bohr, 3) Bohr asum\u00eda trayectorias definidas.',\r\n                2: '\ud83d\udcdd Pistas: A: Cr [Ar]4s\u00b93d\u2075, B: Cu [Ar]4s\u00b93d\u00b9\u2070, C: Zn [Ar]4s\u00b23d\u00b9\u2070. El radio aumenta hacia abajo y izquierda.',\r\n                3: '\ud83d\udcdd Pistas: n=3, l=2, m=\u00b12. Forma de roset\u00f3n. Principio incertidumbre: precisi\u00f3n posici\u00f3n vs momento. Energ\u00eda depende de n principalmente.'\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            hint.innerHTML = hints[problemNum] || '\ud83d\udca1 Revisa los conceptos clave de la lecci\u00f3n.';\r\n            hint.style.display = 'block';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Marcar problema como trabajado\r\n            learningStats.problemsSolved++;\r\n            updateLearningStats();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== GENERADOR DE PLAN DE ESTUDIO ==========\r\nfunction generateStudyPlan() {\r\n    \/\/ Ocultar todas las sugerencias primero\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.suggestion').forEach(el => {\r\n        el.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular puntaje basado en actividades completadas\r\n    const completed = learningStats.completedActivities.size;\r\n    const totalActivities = 5; \/\/ orbital, spectrum, atom, uncertainty, quiz\r\n    const score = (completed \/ totalActivities) * 100;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar sugerencia apropiada\r\n    let suggestionId;\r\n    if (score < 40) {\r\n        suggestionId = 'suggestion-basic';\r\n    } else if (score < 70) {\r\n        suggestionId = 'suggestion-intermediate';\r\n    } else {\r\n        suggestionId = 'suggestion-advanced';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    const suggestion = document.getElementById(suggestionId);\r\n    suggestion.style.display = 'block';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mensaje personalizado\r\n    const messages = [\r\n        \"\u00a1Excelente progreso! Dominas los conceptos avanzados.\",\r\n        \"Buen trabajo. Contin\u00faa practicando para consolidar.\",\r\n        \"Hay conceptos por reforzar. La pr\u00e1ctica constante es clave.\"\r\n    ];\r\n    \r\n    const messageIndex = Math.floor((score \/ 100) * messages.length);\r\n    alert(`\ud83d\udcca Tu puntaje: ${Math.round(score)}%\n\n${messages[messageIndex]}\n\nSe ha generado tu plan de estudio personalizado.`);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== GESTI\u00d3N DE ESTAD\u00cdSTICAS ==========\r\nfunction markActivityCompleted(activityId) {\r\n    if (!learningStats.completedActivities.has(activityId)) {\r\n        learningStats.completedActivities.add(activityId);\r\n        learningStats.simulatorsCompleted = learningStats.completedActivities.size;\r\n        updateLearningStats();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction updateLearningStats() {\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas\r\n    document.getElementById('concepts-mastered').textContent = learningStats.conceptsMastered;\r\n    document.getElementById('simulators-completed').textContent = learningStats.simulatorsCompleted;\r\n    document.getElementById('problems-solved').textContent = learningStats.problemsSolved;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular tiempo de estudio\r\n    const elapsedMinutes = Math.floor((Date.now() - learningStats.startTime) \/ 60000);\r\n    document.getElementById('learning-time').textContent = `${elapsedMinutes} min`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular progreso general\r\n    const totalScore = \r\n        (learningStats.conceptsMastered * 10) + \r\n        (learningStats.simulatorsCompleted * 15) + \r\n        (learningStats.problemsSolved * 20);\r\n    const maxScore = (4 * 10) + (5 * 15) + (3 * 20); \/\/ 4 conceptos, 5 simuladores, 3 problemas\r\n    const progressPercent = Math.min(Math.round((totalScore \/ maxScore) * 100), 100);\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('progress-percent').textContent = `${progressPercent}%`;\r\n    document.getElementById('progress-fill').style.width = `${progressPercent}%`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== INICIALIZACI\u00d3N ==========\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    \/\/ Inicializar simuladores\r\n    updateOrbitalVisualization();\r\n    updateAtomBuilder();\r\n    updateUncertaintySimulation();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar event listeners para orbitales\r\n    document.getElementById('orbital-type').addEventListener('change', updateOrbitalVisualization);\r\n    document.getElementById('probability-slider').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n        document.getElementById('prob-value').textContent = this.value + '%';\r\n        updateOrbitalVisualization();\r\n    });\r\n    document.getElementById('show-nodes').addEventListener('change', updateOrbitalVisualization);\r\n    document.getElementById('show-phase').addEventListener('change', updateOrbitalVisualization);\r\n    document.getElementById('show-grid').addEventListener('change', updateOrbitalVisualization);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar espectro at\u00f3mico\r\n    document.getElementById('calculate-transition').addEventListener('click', calculateSpectralLine);\r\n    document.getElementById('initial-level').addEventListener('change', calculateSpectralLine);\r\n    document.getElementById('final-level').addEventListener('change', calculateSpectralLine);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar constructor de \u00e1tomos\r\n    document.getElementById('z-slider').addEventListener('input', updateAtomBuilder);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar principio de incertidumbre\r\n    document.getElementById('dx-slider').addEventListener('input', updateUncertaintySimulation);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar errores comunes\r\n    setupErrorDetails();\r\n    setupErrorQuiz();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar verificadores de problemas\r\n    setupProblemCheckers();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar generador de plan\r\n    document.getElementById('generate-plan').addEventListener('click', generateStudyPlan);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar guardado de reflexi\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('save-reflection').addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        alert('\ud83d\udcbe Tu reflexi\u00f3n ha sido guardada (en un sistema real se enviar\u00eda al servidor).');\r\n        learningStats.conceptsMastered = Math.min(learningStats.conceptsMastered + 1, 4);\r\n        updateLearningStats();\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar estad\u00edsticas\r\n    updateLearningStats();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar MathJax para actualizar ecuaciones\r\n    if (window.MathJax) {\r\n        MathJax.typesetPromise();\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto de scroll suave para enlaces internos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.resource-link').forEach(link => {\r\n        link.addEventListener('click', function(e) {\r\n            e.preventDefault();\r\n            \/\/ En un sistema real, aqu\u00ed ir\u00eda la navegaci\u00f3n\r\n            alert('\ud83d\udd17 En un sistema real, este enlace te llevar\u00eda al recurso correspondiente.');\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efectos visuales adicionales\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.lab-button, .action-button').forEach(button => {\r\n        button.addEventListener('mouseenter', function() {\r\n            this.style.transform = 'translateY(-2px)';\r\n        });\r\n        button.addEventListener('mouseleave', function() {\r\n            this.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas peri\u00f3dicamente\r\n    setInterval(updateLearningStats, 30000); \/\/ Cada 30 segundos\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Configurar arrastre de electrones (interactividad adicional)\r\nfunction setupElectronDrag() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.electron-box').forEach(box => {\r\n        box.addEventListener('mousedown', function(e) {\r\n            if (!this.classList.contains('filled')) return;\r\n            \r\n            const originalBox = this;\r\n            const clone = originalBox.cloneNode(true);\r\n            clone.style.position = 'absolute';\r\n            clone.style.zIndex = '1000';\r\n            clone.style.pointerEvents = 'none';\r\n            document.body.appendChild(clone);\r\n            \r\n            function moveAt(pageX, pageY) {\r\n                clone.style.left = pageX - clone.offsetWidth \/ 2 + 'px';\r\n                clone.style.top = pageY - clone.offsetHeight \/ 2 + 'px';\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            moveAt(e.pageX, e.pageY);\r\n            \r\n            function onMouseMove(event) {\r\n                moveAt(event.pageX, event.pageY);\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', onMouseMove);\r\n            \r\n            originalBox.onmouseup = function() {\r\n                document.removeEventListener('mousemove', onMouseMove);\r\n                clone.remove();\r\n                originalBox.onmouseup = null;\r\n            };\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ En la funci\u00f3n updateAtomBuilder, llama a setupElectronDrag despu\u00e9s de actualizar\r\nfunction updateAtomBuilder() {\r\n    const Z = parseInt(document.getElementById('z-slider').value);\r\n    const element = ELEMENTS[Z - 1];\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar informaci\u00f3n b\u00e1sica\r\n    document.getElementById('atomic-number').textContent = Z;\r\n    document.getElementById('config-display').textContent = element.config;\r\n    document.getElementById('element-name').textContent = element.name;\r\n    document.getElementById('element-symbol').textContent = element.symbol;\r\n    document.getElementById('element-block').textContent = element.block;\r\n    document.getElementById('valence-electrons').textContent = element.valence;\r\n    document.getElementById('period').textContent = element.period;\r\n    document.getElementById('group').textContent = element.group;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar diagrama de orbitales\r\n    updateOrbitalDiagram(Z);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar arrastre de electrones\r\n    setTimeout(setupElectronDrag, 100);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Marcar actividad completada\r\n    markActivityCompleted('atom-builder');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Agrega esta funci\u00f3n para tooltips\r\nfunction setupTooltips() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.electron-box').forEach(box => {\r\n        box.addEventListener('mouseenter', function() {\r\n            if (this.classList.contains('filled')) {\r\n                const spin = this.classList.contains('spin-up') ? '+\u00bd' : '-\u00bd';\r\n                const orbital = this.closest('.orbital-row').querySelector('.orbital-label').textContent;\r\n                this.title = `Orbital: $\\{orbital}\nSpin: ${spin}\n${this.classList.contains('unpaired') ? 'Electr\u00f3n desapareado' : 'Electr\u00f3n apareado'}`;\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Y en updateAtomBuilder, despu\u00e9s de setupElectronDrag:\r\nsetTimeout(setupTooltips, 100);\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Modelo Dalton","respuesta":"Esferas s\u00f3lidas indivisibles"},{"enunciado":"Descubri\u00f3 n\u00facleo","respuesta":"Rutherford"},{"enunciado":"\u00d3rbitas cuantizadas","respuesta":"Bohr"},{"enunciado":"Electr\u00f3n descubierto por","respuesta":"Thomson (1897)"},{"enunciado":"Configuraci\u00f3n C (Z=6)","respuesta":"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b2"},{"enunciado":"Energ\u00eda n=2 (eV)","respuesta":"-3.4 eV"},{"enunciado":"N\u00famero cu\u00e1ntico l para orbital p","respuesta":"1"},{"enunciado":"Orbital 3p tiene valores m\u2097","respuesta":"-1, 0, +1"},{"enunciado":"Principio exclusi\u00f3n Pauli","respuesta":"No 2 e\u207b mismos 4 n\u00fameros"},{"enunciado":"F\u00f3rmula energ\u00eda Bohr","respuesta":"\\(E_n = -\\frac{13.6}{n^2}\\) eV"},{"enunciado":"Espectro H l\u00ednea Balmer","respuesta":"n\u2082=2 \u2192 nivel visible"},{"enunciado":"NIST define \u00e1tomo como","respuesta":"Sistema cu\u00e1ntico estable"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Dem\u00f3crito dijo que los \u00e1tomos eran...","opciones":["Indivisibles","Divisibles","Esferas","Energ\u00eda"],"correcta":"Indivisibles"},{"pregunta":"Dalton propuso el modelo de...","opciones":["Esferas s\u00f3lidas","Nubes","\u00d3rbitas","Pud\u00edn"],"correcta":"Esferas s\u00f3lidas"},{"pregunta":"Thomson descubri\u00f3 el...","opciones":["Electr\u00f3n","Prot\u00f3n","Neutr\u00f3n","N\u00facleo"],"correcta":"Electr\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Rutherford hall\u00f3 el...","opciones":["N\u00facleo","Electr\u00f3n","\u00d3rbita","Neutr\u00f3n"],"correcta":"N\u00facleo"},{"pregunta":"Bohr explic\u00f3 el espectro del...","opciones":["Hidr\u00f3geno","Ox\u00edgeno","Oro","Carbono"],"correcta":"Hidr\u00f3geno"},{"pregunta":"El modelo actual es el...","opciones":["Mec\u00e1nico-Cu\u00e1ntico","Planetario","S\u00f3lido","Est\u00e1tico"],"correcta":"Mec\u00e1nico-Cu\u00e1ntico"},{"pregunta":"Z representa el n\u00famero de...","opciones":["Protones","Neutrones","Electrones","Masa"],"correcta":"Protones"},{"pregunta":"n=1 corresponde al nivel...","opciones":["K","L","M","N"],"correcta":"K"},{"pregunta":"l=0 define el subnivel...","opciones":["s","p","d","f"],"correcta":"s"},{"pregunta":"La unidad fundamental de la materia es...","opciones":["\u00c1tomo","Mol\u00e9cula","I\u00f3n","C\u00e9lula"],"correcta":"\u00c1tomo"},{"pregunta":"Configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica del Na (Z=11)","opciones":["1s\u00b22s\u00b22p\u20763s\u00b9","1s\u00b22s\u00b22p\u2076","1s\u00b22s\u00b2","3s\u00b9"],"correcta":"1s\u00b22s\u00b22p\u20763s\u00b9"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda del nivel n=3 en eV","opciones":["-1.51","-13.6","-3.4","0"],"correcta":"-1.51"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfCu\u00e1ntos electrones m\u00e1ximo caben en un orbital 2p?","opciones":["6","2","10","14"],"correcta":"6"},{"pregunta":"El principio de Aufbau indica...","opciones":["Llenado por energ\u00eda","Llenado aleatorio","Solo orbitales s","Masa at\u00f3mica"],"correcta":"Llenado por energ\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"La Regla de Hund favorece...","opciones":["Espines paralelos","Espines opuestos","No llenar p","Solo orbitales d"],"correcta":"Espines paralelos"},{"pregunta":"Pauli dice que no puede haber 2 electrones con...","opciones":["Mismos 4 n\u00fameros","Mismo n","Mismo nivel","Misma carga"],"correcta":"Mismos 4 n\u00fameros"},{"pregunta":"La serie de Lyman en el espectro H es...","opciones":["Ultravioleta","Visible","Infrarrojo","Radio"],"correcta":"Ultravioleta"},{"pregunta":"El experimento de Rutherford mostr\u00f3 que el \u00e1tomo es...","opciones":["99.9% vac\u00edo","S\u00f3lido","Lleno de agua","Cuadrado"],"correcta":"99.9% vac\u00edo"},{"pregunta":"Davisson-Germer probaron la dualidad...","opciones":["Onda-Part\u00edcula","Masa-Energ\u00eda","Fr\u00edo-Calor","Carga-Masa"],"correcta":"Onda-Part\u00edcula"},{"pregunta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 cient\u00edfico propuso la incertidumbre?","opciones":["Heisenberg","Einstein","Bohr","Dalton"],"correcta":"Heisenberg"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula correcta de Bohr","opciones":["E = -13.6\/n\u00b2","E = 13.6\/n\u00b2","E = n\u00b2\/13.6","E = 0"],"correcta":"E = -13.6\/n\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"La transici\u00f3n n=3\u21922 emite luz...","opciones":["Visible","Rayos X","Gamma","Microondas"],"correcta":"Visible"},{"pregunta":"El estado base del Hidr\u00f3geno es...","opciones":["n=1","n=2","n=0","n=\u221e"],"correcta":"n=1"},{"pregunta":"La funci\u00f3n \u03c8\u00b2 representa la...","opciones":["Probabilidad","Masa","Velocidad","Posici\u00f3n exacta"],"correcta":"Probabilidad"},{"pregunta":"El subnivel d tiene l igual a...","opciones":["2","0","1","3"],"correcta":"2"},{"pregunta":"Valores posibles de m\u2097 para 3p","opciones":["-1,0,1","0,1,2","-2,-1,0","0"],"correcta":"-1,0,1"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula de Incertidumbre de Heisenberg","opciones":["\u0394x\u00b7\u0394p \u2265 h\/4\u03c0","\u0394x\u00b7\u0394p = 0","F=ma","E=mc\u00b2"],"correcta":"\u0394x\u00b7\u0394p \u2265 h\/4\u03c0"},{"pregunta":"La ecuaci\u00f3n central del modelo cu\u00e1ntico es de...","opciones":["Schr\u00f6dinger","Bohr","Rutherford","Newton"],"correcta":"Schr\u00f6dinger"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC 2025 estandariza los...","opciones":["Datos at\u00f3micos","Nombres de apps","Sabores","Vuelos"],"correcta":"Datos at\u00f3micos"},{"pregunta":"El \u00e1tomo m\u00e1s abundante del universo es...","opciones":["Hidr\u00f3geno","Helio","Ox\u00edgeno","Hierro"],"correcta":"Hidr\u00f3geno"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"atomo-cuantico-interactivo","titulo":"EL \u00c1TOMO CU\u00c1NTICO: DE LA PART\u00cdCULA FUNDAMENTAL AL SISTEMA PROBABIL\u00cdSTICO","contenido":"<script src=\"https:\/\/polyfill.io\/v3\/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"><\/script>\r\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https:\/\/cdn.jsdelivr.net\/npm\/mathjax@3\/es5\/tex-mml-chtml.js\"><\/script>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quantum-atom-lab\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- 1\ufe0f\u20e3 INTRODUCCI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"quantum-intro\">\r\n        <div class=\"intro-card\">\r\n            <h2>\u269b\ufe0f EL \u00c1TOMO: ENTRE LO CL\u00c1SICO Y LO CU\u00c1NTICO<\/h2>\r\n            <p>El <span class=\"highlight\">\u00e1tomo<\/span> no es simplemente la \"unidad b\u00e1sica de la materia\", sino un <strong>sistema cu\u00e1ntico complejo<\/strong> donde las reglas de la f\u00edsica cl\u00e1sica se rompen. Desde Dem\u00f3crito (400 a.C.) hasta el Modelo Est\u00e1ndar actual, nuestra comprensi\u00f3n ha evolucionado de la filosof\u00eda a la matem\u00e1tica cu\u00e1ntica.<\/p>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"paradigm-shift\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83c\udf0c CAMBIO DE PARADIGMA<\/h4>\r\n                <p><strong>Visi\u00f3n cl\u00e1sica:<\/strong> Part\u00edculas puntuales con trayectorias definidas<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Visi\u00f3n cu\u00e1ntica:<\/strong> Sistemas probabil\u00edsticos descritos por funciones de onda<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"paradigm-comparison\">\r\n                    <div class=\"classical\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udd2d CL\u00c1SICO (1900)<\/h5>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Trayectorias definidas<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Posici\u00f3n exacta<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Energ\u00eda continua<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Determinismo<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"quantum\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udd2c CU\u00c1NTICO (Actual)<\/h5>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Densidad de probabilidad<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Principio de incertidumbre<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Energ\u00eda cuantizada<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Probabilismo<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 2\ufe0f\u20e3 DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO ESTRUCTURADO -->\r\n    <section>\r\n        <h3>\ud83d\udcda ANATOM\u00cdA CU\u00c1NTICA DEL \u00c1TOMO<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"anatomy-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"anatomy-card\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83e\uddec ESTRUCTURA JER\u00c1RQUICA<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"hierarchy\">\r\n                    <div class=\"level\">\r\n                        <span class=\"level-number\">1<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"level-content\">\r\n                            <h5>N\u00facleo At\u00f3mico (10\u207b\u00b9\u2075 m)<\/h5>\r\n                            <p><strong>Protones:<\/strong> +1e, 1.007276 u<br>\r\n                            <strong>Neutrones:<\/strong> 0e, 1.008665 u<br>\r\n                            <em>Concentra >99.9% de la masa<\/em><\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"level\">\r\n                        <span class=\"level-number\">2<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"level-content\">\r\n                            <h5>Regi\u00f3n Electr\u00f3nica (10\u207b\u00b9\u2070 m)<\/h5>\r\n                            <p><strong>Electrones:<\/strong> -1e, 0.00054858 u<br>\r\n                            <strong>Orbitales:<\/strong> Soluciones \u03c8 de Schr\u00f6dinger<br>\r\n                            <em>Determina reactividad qu\u00edmica<\/em><\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"level\">\r\n                        <span class=\"level-number\">3<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"level-content\">\r\n                            <h5>Vac\u00edo Cu\u00e1ntico<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>No es \"vac\u00edo\" sino un mar de fluctuaciones<br>\r\n                            <em>Aparecen part\u00edculas virtuales<\/em><\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"anatomy-card\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83c\udfaf IDENTIFICADORES AT\u00d3MICOS<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"identifiers\">\r\n                    <div class=\"identifier\">\r\n                        <div class=\"id-symbol\">Z<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"id-content\">\r\n                            <h5>N\u00famero At\u00f3mico<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Protones en el n\u00facleo<br>\r\n                            <strong>Define el elemento qu\u00edmico<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"identifier\">\r\n                        <div class=\"id-symbol\">A<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"id-content\">\r\n                            <h5>N\u00famero M\u00e1sico<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Protones + Neutrones<br>\r\n                            <strong>Determina el is\u00f3topo<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"identifier\">\r\n                        <div class=\"id-symbol\">q<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"id-content\">\r\n                            <h5>Carga I\u00f3nica<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Protones - Electrones<br>\r\n                            <strong>Define cationes\/aniones<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"isotope-example\">\r\n                    <h5>\ud83d\udcca EJEMPLO: IS\u00d3TOPOS DEL CARBONO<\/h5>\r\n                    <div class=\"isotope-row\">\r\n                        <div class=\"isotope\" data-name=\"Carbono-12\">\r\n                            <div class=\"iso-symbol\">\u00b9\u00b2C<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"iso-details\">6p\u207a + 6n\u2070<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"iso-abundance\">98.9%<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"isotope\" data-name=\"Carbono-13\">\r\n                            <div class=\"iso-symbol\">\u00b9\u00b3C<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"iso-details\">6p\u207a + 7n\u2070<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"iso-abundance\">1.1%<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"isotope\" data-name=\"Carbono-14\">\r\n                            <div class=\"iso-symbol\">\u00b9\u2074C<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"iso-details\">6p\u207a + 8n\u2070<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"iso-abundance\">Traza<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- TABLA DE PART\u00cdCULAS MEJORADA -->\r\n        <div class=\"particles-table-container\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83e\udde9 PART\u00cdCULAS SUBAT\u00d3MICAS FUNDAMENTALES<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"quantum-table\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>Part\u00edcula<\/th>\r\n                        <th>S\u00edmbolo<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Carga (e)<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Masa (u)<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Masa (MeV\/c\u00b2)<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Esp\u00edn<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Ubicaci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Interacci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>Prot\u00f3n<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>p\u207a<\/td>\r\n                        <td>+1<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1.007276<\/td>\r\n                        <td>938.272<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\u00bd<\/td>\r\n                        <td>N\u00facleo<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Fuerte, EM<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>Neutr\u00f3n<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>n\u2070<\/td>\r\n                        <td>0<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1.008665<\/td>\r\n                        <td>939.565<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\u00bd<\/td>\r\n                        <td>N\u00facleo<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Fuerte<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>Electr\u00f3n<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>e\u207b<\/td>\r\n                        <td>-1<\/td>\r\n                        <td>5.486\u00d710\u207b\u2074<\/td>\r\n                        <td>0.511<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\u00bd<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Orbitales<\/td>\r\n                        <td>EM, D\u00e9bil<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><em>Positr\u00f3n<\/em><\/td>\r\n                        <td>e\u207a<\/td>\r\n                        <td>+1<\/td>\r\n                        <td>5.486\u00d710\u207b\u2074<\/td>\r\n                        <td>0.511<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\u00bd<\/td>\r\n                        <td>-<\/td>\r\n                        <td>EM, Aniquilaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n            <div class=\"table-note\">\r\n                <p><strong>Nota:<\/strong> 1 u = 1.660539\u00d710\u207b\u00b2\u2077 kg = 931.494 MeV\/c\u00b2 | c = velocidad de la luz<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 3\ufe0f\u20e3 VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA AVANZADA -->\r\n    <section class=\"atom-visualization\">\r\n        <h3>\ud83c\udfa8 SIMULADOR VISUAL DEL \u00c1TOMO CU\u00c1NTICO<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"visualization-controls\">\r\n            <div class=\"viz-control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"atom-element\">Elemento:<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"atom-element\">\r\n                    <option value=\"H\">Hidr\u00f3geno (Z=1)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"He\">Helio (Z=2)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"C\" selected>Carbono (Z=6)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"O\">Ox\u00edgeno (Z=8)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Fe\">Hierro (Z=26)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"U\">Uranio (Z=92)<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"viz-control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"view-mode\">Vista:<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"view-mode\">\r\n                    <option value=\"probability\">Densidad de Probabilidad<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"orbitals\">Orbitales Individuales<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"classical\">Modelo Planetario<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"cloud\">Nube Electr\u00f3nica Total<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"viz-control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"time-scale\">Escala Temporal:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"time-scale\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"5\">\r\n                <span id=\"time-value\">Normal<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"viz-control-group\">\r\n                <label>Mostrar:<\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"viz-checkboxes\">\r\n                    <label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"show-nucleus\" checked> N\u00facleo<\/label>\r\n                    <label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"show-electrons\" checked> Electrones<\/label>\r\n                    <label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"show-orbitals\" checked> Orbitales<\/label>\r\n                    <label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"show-probability\"> Probabilidad<\/label>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"atom-canvas-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"atom-canvas\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 500\" id=\"atom-svg\">\r\n                    <!-- Se generar\u00e1 din\u00e1micamente -->\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"atom-stats\">\r\n                <h4 id=\"atom-title\">\u00c1TOMO DE CARBONO (C)<\/h4>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"stat-section\">\r\n                    <h5>\ud83d\udcca DATOS NUCLEARES<\/h5>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-row\">\r\n                        <span>Protones (Z):<\/span>\r\n                        <span id=\"proton-count\">6<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-row\">\r\n                        <span>Neutrones (N):<\/span>\r\n                        <span id=\"neutron-count\">6<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-row\">\r\n                        <span>N\u00famero m\u00e1sico (A):<\/span>\r\n                        <span id=\"mass-number\">12<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-row\">\r\n                        <span>Radio nuclear:<\/span>\r\n                        <span id=\"nuclear-radius\">2.7 fm<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"stat-section\">\r\n                    <h5>\u26a1 CONFIGURACI\u00d3N ELECTR\u00d3NICA<\/h5>\r\n                    <div class=\"config-display\" id=\"electron-config\">1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b2<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"quantum-numbers\">\r\n                        <div class=\"qn-row\">\r\n                            <span>Electrones totales:<\/span>\r\n                            <span id=\"total-electrons\">6<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"qn-row\">\r\n                            <span>Capas:<\/span>\r\n                            <span id=\"electron-shells\">K, L<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"qn-row\">\r\n                            <span>Electrones valencia:<\/span>\r\n                            <span id=\"valence-electrons\">4<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"stat-section\">\r\n                    <h5>\u2696\ufe0f PROPIEDADES<\/h5>\r\n                    <div class=\"property-row\">\r\n                        <span>Masa at\u00f3mica:<\/span>\r\n                        <span id=\"atomic-mass\">12.011 u<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"property-row\">\r\n                        <span>Radio at\u00f3mico:<\/span>\r\n                        <span id=\"atomic-radius\">70 pm<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"property-row\">\r\n                        <span>Estabilidad:<\/span>\r\n                        <span id=\"stability\">Estable<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"property-row\">\r\n                        <span>Estado natural:<\/span>\r\n                        <span id=\"natural-state\">S\u00f3lido<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"visualization-explanation\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udd0d INTERPRETANDO LA VISUALIZACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"explanation-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"explanation-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"color-indicator\" style=\"background: #ff4444;\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"explanation-text\">\r\n                        <strong>N\u00facleo (rojo):<\/strong> Protrones y neutrones fuertemente enlazados\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"explanation-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"color-indicator\" style=\"background: #00aaff;\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"explanation-text\">\r\n                        <strong>Orbitales s (azul):<\/strong> Densidad esf\u00e9rica, penetran cerca del n\u00facleo\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"explanation-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"color-indicator\" style=\"background: #00ff88;\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"explanation-text\">\r\n                        <strong>Orbitales p (verde):<\/strong> Forma de pesas, orientaci\u00f3n espacial\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"explanation-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"color-indicator\" style=\"background: #aa00ff;\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"explanation-text\">\r\n                        <strong>Orbitales d (p\u00farpura):<\/strong> Formas complejas, m\u00faltiples nodos\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <p class=\"quantum-note\">\r\n                <strong>\ud83d\udca1 Nota cu\u00e1ntica:<\/strong> La intensidad del color representa |\u03c8|\u00b2, la densidad de probabilidad de encontrar un electr\u00f3n en esa regi\u00f3n del espacio.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 4\ufe0f\u20e3 LABORATORIO INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"interactive-lab\">\r\n        <h3>\ud83d\udd2c LABORATORIO VIRTUAL DEL \u00c1TOMO<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"lab-grid\">\r\n            <!-- SIMULADOR 1: CONSTRUCTOR DE \u00c1TOMOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"lab-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u269b\ufe0f CONSTRUCTOR DE \u00c1TOMOS<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Construye \u00e1tomos manipulando las part\u00edculas subat\u00f3micas:<\/p>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"atom-builder\">\r\n                    <div class=\"builder-controls\">\r\n                        <div class=\"particle-control\">\r\n                            <label>Protones (Z): <span id=\"p-count\">6<\/span><\/label>\r\n                            <div class=\"particle-slider\">\r\n                                <button class=\"particle-btn\" data-particle=\"p\" data-action=\"decrease\">\u2212<\/button>\r\n                                <input type=\"range\" id=\"proton-slider\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" value=\"6\">\r\n                                <button class=\"particle-btn\" data-particle=\"p\" data-action=\"increase\">+<\/button>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"particle-control\">\r\n                            <label>Neutrones (N): <span id=\"n-count\">6<\/span><\/label>\r\n                            <div class=\"particle-slider\">\r\n                                <button class=\"particle-btn\" data-particle=\"n\" data-action=\"decrease\">\u2212<\/button>\r\n                                <input type=\"range\" id=\"neutron-slider\" min=\"0\" max=\"25\" value=\"6\">\r\n                                <button class=\"particle-btn\" data-particle=\"n\" data-action=\"increase\">+<\/button>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"particle-control\">\r\n                            <label>Electrones (e): <span id=\"e-count\">6<\/span><\/label>\r\n                            <div class=\"particle-slider\">\r\n                                <button class=\"particle-btn\" data-particle=\"e\" data-action=\"decrease\">\u2212<\/button>\r\n                                <input type=\"range\" id=\"electron-slider\" min=\"0\" max=\"20\" value=\"6\">\r\n                                <button class=\"particle-btn\" data-particle=\"e\" data-action=\"increase\">+<\/button>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"atom-preview\">\r\n                        <div class=\"preview-stats\">\r\n                            <div class=\"preview-stat\">\r\n                                <span>Elemento:<\/span>\r\n                                <strong id=\"element-name\">Carbono<\/strong>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"preview-stat\">\r\n                                <span>S\u00edmbolo:<\/span>\r\n                                <strong id=\"element-symbol\">C<\/strong>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"preview-stat\">\r\n                                <span>Carga:<\/span>\r\n                                <strong id=\"atom-charge\">0<\/strong>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"preview-stat\">\r\n                                <span>Masa at\u00f3mica:<\/span>\r\n                                <strong id=\"atom-mass\">12.00 u<\/strong>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"atom-stability\">\r\n                            <h5>ESTABILIDAD NUCLEAR<\/h5>\r\n                            <div class=\"stability-bar\">\r\n                                <div class=\"stability-fill\" id=\"stability-fill\"><\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"stability-labels\">\r\n                                <span>Inestable<\/span>\r\n                                <span>Estable<\/span>\r\n                                <span>Superpesado<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div id=\"stability-message\" class=\"stability-message\">N\u00facleo estable (N\/Z = 1)<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <button id=\"build-atom\" class=\"lab-button\">Construir \u00c1tomo<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- SIMULADOR 2: N\u00daMEROS CU\u00c1NTICOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"lab-card\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83c\udfaf GENERADOR DE N\u00daMEROS CU\u00c1NTICOS<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Explora c\u00f3mo los n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos describen electrones:<\/p>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quantum-generator\">\r\n                    <div class=\"qn-controls\">\r\n                        <div class=\"qn-control\">\r\n                            <label>n (principal): <span id=\"n-value\">1<\/span><\/label>\r\n                            <input type=\"range\" id=\"n-slider\" min=\"1\" max=\"7\" value=\"1\">\r\n                            <div class=\"qn-info\">Nivel de energ\u00eda<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"qn-control\">\r\n                            <label>l (azimutal): <span id=\"l-value\">0<\/span><\/label>\r\n                            <input type=\"range\" id=\"l-slider\" min=\"0\" max=\"3\" value=\"0\">\r\n                            <div class=\"qn-info\">Forma del orbital (0=s, 1=p, 2=d, 3=f)<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"qn-control\">\r\n                            <label>m\u2097 (magn\u00e9tico): <span id=\"ml-value\">0<\/span><\/label>\r\n                            <input type=\"range\" id=\"ml-slider\" min=\"-3\" max=\"3\" value=\"0\">\r\n                            <div class=\"qn-info\">Orientaci\u00f3n en el espacio<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"qn-control\">\r\n                            <label>m\u209b (esp\u00edn):<\/label>\r\n                            <div class=\"spin-buttons\">\r\n                                <button class=\"spin-btn active\" data-spin=\"-\u00bd\">-\u00bd (\u2193)<\/button>\r\n                                <button class=\"spin-btn\" data-spin=\"+\u00bd\">+\u00bd (\u2191)<\/button>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"qn-info\">Momento angular intr\u00ednseco<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"qn-output\">\r\n                        <h5>DESCRIPCI\u00d3N DEL ORBITAL<\/h5>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital-description\">\r\n                            <p><strong>Notaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> <span id=\"orbital-notation\">1s<\/span><\/p>\r\n                            <p><strong>Forma:<\/strong> <span id=\"orbital-shape\">Esf\u00e9rica<\/span><\/p>\r\n                            <p><strong>Nodos angulares:<\/strong> <span id=\"angular-nodes\">0<\/span><\/p>\r\n                            <p><strong>Orientaciones posibles:<\/strong> <span id=\"orientations\">1<\/span><\/p>\r\n                            <p><strong>Capacidad m\u00e1xima:<\/strong> <span id=\"max-electrons\">2 electrones<\/span><\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"pauli-check\">\r\n                            <h5>PRINCIPIO DE EXCLUSI\u00d3N DE PAULI<\/h5>\r\n                            <div id=\"pauli-status\" class=\"pauli-valid\">\u2713 Este conjunto de n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos es v\u00e1lido<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"pauli-rule\">\r\n                                <em>\"Dos electrones en el mismo \u00e1tomo no pueden tener los cuatro n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos iguales\"<\/em>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- SIMULADOR 3: ESPECTRO DE ENERG\u00cdA -->\r\n        <div class=\"lab-card full-width\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83c\udf08 SIMULADOR DE ESPECTROS AT\u00d3MICOS<\/h4>\r\n            <p>Observa c\u00f3mo los saltos electr\u00f3nicos producen l\u00edneas espectrales caracter\u00edsticas:<\/p>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"spectrum-simulator\">\r\n                <div class=\"spectrum-controls\">\r\n                    <div class=\"element-selector\">\r\n                        <label>Elemento:<\/label>\r\n                        <select id=\"spectrum-element\">\r\n                            <option value=\"H\">Hidr\u00f3geno<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"He\">Helio<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"Ne\">Ne\u00f3n<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"Na\">Sodio<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"Hg\">Mercurio<\/option>\r\n                        <\/select>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"transition-selector\">\r\n                        <label>Transici\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                        <select id=\"transition-select\">\r\n                            <option value=\"3-2\">n=3 \u2192 n=2 (Balmer - Visible)<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"4-2\">n=4 \u2192 n=2 (Balmer - Visible)<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"2-1\">n=2 \u2192 n=1 (Lyman - UV)<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"4-3\">n=4 \u2192 n=3 (Paschen - IR)<\/option>\r\n                        <\/select>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"excitation-control\">\r\n                        <label>Excitaci\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" id=\"excitation-slider\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\">\r\n                        <span id=\"excitation-level\">n=3<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"spectrum-display\">\r\n                    <div class=\"energy-levels\">\r\n                        <h5>NIVELES DE ENERG\u00cdA<\/h5>\r\n                        <div class=\"levels-container\" id=\"energy-levels\">\r\n                            <!-- Se generar\u00e1 din\u00e1micamente -->\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"spectrum-view\">\r\n                        <h5>ESPECTRO DE EMISI\u00d3N<\/h5>\r\n                        <div class=\"spectrum-bars\" id=\"spectrum-bars\">\r\n                            <!-- Se generar\u00e1 din\u00e1micamente -->\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"spectrum-info\">\r\n                            <p>Longitud de onda: <span id=\"spectrum-wavelength\">656.3 nm<\/span><\/p>\r\n                            <p>Color: <span id=\"spectrum-color\" style=\"color:#ff0000\">Rojo<\/span><\/p>\r\n                            <p>Energ\u00eda del fot\u00f3n: <span id=\"photon-energy\">1.89 eV<\/span><\/p>\r\n                            <p>Serie espectral: <span id=\"spectral-series\">Balmer<\/span><\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button id=\"excite-atom\" class=\"lab-button\">Excitar \u00c1tomo<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 5\ufe0f\u20e3 ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"common-misconceptions\">\r\n        <h3>\u26a0\ufe0f ERRORES CONCEPTUALES FRECUENTES<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"misconceptions-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"misconception-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u274c \"Los electrones orbitan como planetas\"<\/h4>\r\n                <p><strong>Realidad:<\/strong> Los electrones no siguen trayectorias definidas. Se describen por funciones de onda \u03c8 que dan probabilidades.<\/p>\r\n                <button class=\"misconception-detail\" data-misconception=\"1\">Ver evidencia experimental<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"misconception-evidence\" id=\"evidence-1\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Experimento de doble rendija:<\/strong> Los electrones muestran interferencia (propiedad ondulatoria) incluso cuando se env\u00edan uno a uno.<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Principio de incertidumbre:<\/strong> \u0394x\u00b7\u0394p \u2265 \u0127\/2 imposibilita trayectorias definidas.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"misconception-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u274c \"El n\u00facleo es s\u00f3lido\"<\/h4>\r\n                <p><strong>Realidad:<\/strong> El n\u00facleo es un sistema cu\u00e1ntico de quarks y gluones con l\u00edmites difusos.<\/p>\r\n                <button class=\"misconception-detail\" data-misconception=\"2\">Ver explicaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"misconception-evidence\" id=\"evidence-2\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Modelo de la gota l\u00edquida:<\/strong> El n\u00facleo se comporta como una gota de fluido cu\u00e1ntico.<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Distribuci\u00f3n de carga:<\/strong> La densidad nuclear disminuye gradualmente, no abruptamente.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"misconception-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u274c \"Todos los is\u00f3topos son radiactivos\"<\/h4>\r\n                <p><strong>Realidad:<\/strong> La mayor\u00eda de los is\u00f3topos naturales son estables. La radiactividad depende del balance N\/Z.<\/p>\r\n                <button class=\"misconception-detail\" data-misconception=\"3\">Ver tabla de estabilidad<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"misconception-evidence\" id=\"evidence-3\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Valle de estabilidad:<\/strong> Los n\u00facleos estables siguen la l\u00ednea N \u2248 Z para elementos ligeros, N > Z para pesados.<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Is\u00f3topos estables comunes:<\/strong> \u00b9\u00b2C, \u00b9\u2076O, \u2075\u2076Fe, \u00b2\u2070\u2078Pb tienen is\u00f3topos estables.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"misconception-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u274c \"Los orbitales son \u00f3rbitas\"<\/h4>\r\n                <p><strong>Realidad:<\/strong> Un orbital es una regi\u00f3n del espacio con alta probabilidad (\u223c90%) de encontrar un electr\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                <button class=\"misconception-detail\" data-misconception=\"4\">Ver analog\u00eda correcta<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"misconception-evidence\" id=\"evidence-4\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Analog\u00eda de la nube:<\/strong> Como una \"nube de probabilidad\" que se densifica donde es m\u00e1s probable el electr\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Superficie l\u00edmite:<\/strong> La superficie que encierra el 90% de la densidad electr\u00f3nica.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"misconception-quiz\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83e\udde0 TEST DE CONCEPTOS CLAVE<\/h4>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"concept-question\">\r\n                <p><strong>1. \u00bfCu\u00e1l afirmaci\u00f3n sobre el principio de exclusi\u00f3n de Pauli es CORRECTA?<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"concept-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"concept-option\" data-correct=\"true\">Dos electrones en un orbital deben tener espines opuestos<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"concept-option\" data-correct=\"false\">Los electrones pueden ocupar cualquier orbital disponible<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"concept-option\" data-correct=\"false\">Solo un electr\u00f3n por \u00e1tomo puede tener esp\u00edn +\u00bd<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"concept-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"concept-question\">\r\n                <p><strong>2. Un \u00e1tomo con Z=17 y 18 electrones es:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"concept-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"concept-option\" data-correct=\"true\">Un ani\u00f3n con carga -1<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"concept-option\" data-correct=\"false\">Un cati\u00f3n con carga +1<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"concept-option\" data-correct=\"false\">Un \u00e1tomo neutro<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"concept-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"concept-question\">\r\n                <p><strong>3. \u00bfCu\u00e1l n\u00famero cu\u00e1ntico determina la forma del orbital?<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"concept-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"concept-option\" data-correct=\"false\">n (principal)<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"concept-option\" data-correct=\"true\">l (azimutal)<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"concept-option\" data-correct=\"false\">m\u2097 (magn\u00e9tico)<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"concept-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 6\ufe0f\u20e3 APLICACIONES Y CONEXIONES -->\r\n    <section class=\"applications\">\r\n        <h3>\ud83c\udf0d APLICACIONES DEL CONOCIMIENTO AT\u00d3MICO<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"applications-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"application-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"app-icon\">\ud83c\udfe5<\/div>\r\n                <h4>MEDICINA NUCLEAR<\/h4>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li><strong>Radioterapia:<\/strong> Is\u00f3topos como Cobalto-60 para tratar c\u00e1ncer<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>Diagn\u00f3stico por imagen:<\/strong> Tecnecio-99m para gammagraf\u00edas<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>PET:<\/strong> Tomograf\u00eda por emisi\u00f3n de positrones usando \u00b9\u2078F<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"application-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"app-icon\">\ud83d\udd0b<\/div>\r\n                <h4>ENERG\u00cdA AT\u00d3MICA<\/h4>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li><strong>Fisi\u00f3n nuclear:<\/strong> \u00b2\u00b3\u2075U libera energ\u00eda en reactores<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>Fusi\u00f3n nuclear:<\/strong> Deuterio+tritio \u2192 helio (Sol)<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>Bater\u00edas at\u00f3micas:<\/strong> Plutonio-238 en naves espaciales<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"application-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"app-icon\">\ud83e\uddea<\/div>\r\n                <h4>QU\u00cdMICA MODERNA<\/h4>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li><strong>Espectroscop\u00eda:<\/strong> Identificaci\u00f3n elemental por espectros<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>Dataci\u00f3n radiom\u00e9trica:<\/strong> Carbono-14 para arqueolog\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>Qu\u00edmica cu\u00e1ntica:<\/strong> Dise\u00f1o computacional de mol\u00e9culas<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"application-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"app-icon\">\ud83d\udcbb<\/div>\r\n                <h4>TECNOLOG\u00cdA<\/h4>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li><strong>Semiconductores:<\/strong> Silicio dopado con \u00e1tomos espec\u00edficos<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>L\u00e1seres:<\/strong> Emisi\u00f3n estimulada en \u00e1tomos excitados<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>MRI:<\/strong> Resonancia magn\u00e9tica usando esp\u00edn nuclear<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"curriculum-connection\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udcd8 CONEXI\u00d3N CON EL CURR\u00cdCULO<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"curriculum-table\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>Unidad<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Temas Relacionados<\/th>\r\n                        <th>% en Ex\u00e1menes<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Habilidades<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Estructura At\u00f3mica<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Part\u00edculas subat\u00f3micas, n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos<\/td>\r\n                        <td>30%<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Comprensi\u00f3n conceptual<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Tabla Peri\u00f3dica<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica, propiedades peri\u00f3dicas<\/td>\r\n                        <td>25%<\/td>\r\n                        <td>An\u00e1lisis predictivo<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Enlace Qu\u00edmico<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Superposici\u00f3n de orbitales, hibridaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                        <td>25%<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Visualizaci\u00f3n 3D<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Qu\u00edmica Nuclear<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Is\u00f3topos, radiactividad, aplicaciones<\/td>\r\n                        <td>20%<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Evaluaci\u00f3n de riesgos\/beneficios<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 7\ufe0f\u20e3 PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n        <h3>\ud83d\udcdd PROBLEMAS DE DESARROLLO<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"problem-set\">\r\n            <div class=\"problem-card\">\r\n                <h4>Problema 1: An\u00e1lisis de Is\u00f3topos (6 puntos)<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Se tiene una muestra que contiene tres is\u00f3topos del magnesio:<\/p>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>\u00b2\u2074Mg (78.99%, masa = 23.9850 u)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>\u00b2\u2075Mg (10.00%, masa = 24.9858 u)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>\u00b2\u2076Mg (11.01%, masa = 25.9826 u)<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n                <p><strong>Calcule:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <ol type=\"a\">\r\n                    <li>La masa at\u00f3mica promedio del magnesio (2 puntos)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>El n\u00famero at\u00f3mico Z del magnesio (1 punto)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>La composici\u00f3n nuclear de cada is\u00f3topo (protones, neutrones) (2 puntos)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Explique por qu\u00e9 estos is\u00f3topos tienen propiedades qu\u00edmicas id\u00e9nticas (1 punto)<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolle su respuesta aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"6\"><\/textarea>\r\n                    <div class=\"problem-hint\">\r\n                        <button class=\"hint-btn\" data-problem=\"1\">Mostrar pista<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"hint-content\">Pista: La masa at\u00f3mica promedio es el promedio ponderado por abundancia.<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"problem-card\">\r\n                <h4>Problema 2: N\u00fameros Cu\u00e1nticos (7 puntos)<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Para el \u00e1tomo de f\u00f3sforo (Z=15):<\/p>\r\n                <ol type=\"a\">\r\n                    <li>Escriba la configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica completa (2 puntos)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Identifique el \u00faltimo electr\u00f3n agregado seg\u00fan Aufbau y asigne sus cuatro n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos (n, l, m\u2097, m\u209b) (3 puntos)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Dibuje el diagrama de orbitales para los electrones de valencia (2 puntos)<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolle su respuesta aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"6\"><\/textarea>\r\n                    <div class=\"problem-hint\">\r\n                        <button class=\"hint-btn\" data-problem=\"2\">Mostrar pista<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"hint-content\">Pista: Recuerde la regla de Hund para electrones desapareados.<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"problem-card\">\r\n                <h4>Problema 3: Interpretaci\u00f3n Cu\u00e1ntica (7 puntos)<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Un estudiante afirma: \"En el \u00e1tomo de hidr\u00f3geno, el electr\u00f3n en el estado 1s tiene energ\u00eda -13.6 eV y se encuentra exactamente a 0.529 \u00c5 del n\u00facleo\".<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Analice esta afirmaci\u00f3n:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <ol type=\"a\">\r\n                    <li>Identifique dos errores conceptuales (2 puntos)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Explique la interpretaci\u00f3n correcta usando el principio de incertidumbre (3 puntos)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Calcule la probabilidad de encontrar el electr\u00f3n entre r=0 y r=a\u2080\/2 (2 puntos)<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolle su respuesta aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"6\"><\/textarea>\r\n                    <div class=\"problem-hint\">\r\n                        <button class=\"hint-btn\" data-problem=\"3\">Mostrar pista<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"hint-content\">Pista: En mec\u00e1nica cu\u00e1ntica, no hay posiciones exactas, solo probabilidades.<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"scoring-guide\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udcca GU\u00cdA DE CORRECCI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"scoring-criteria\">\r\n                <div class=\"criterion\">\r\n                    <h5>Conceptual (40%)<\/h5>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Comprensi\u00f3n profunda de conceptos<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Uso correcto de terminolog\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Identificaci\u00f3n de errores<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"criterion\">\r\n                    <h5>C\u00e1lculos (30%)<\/h5>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Procedimientos claros<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Unidades correctas<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Resultados exactos<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"criterion\">\r\n                    <h5>Razonamiento (20%)<\/h5>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Argumentaci\u00f3n l\u00f3gica<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Conexiones entre conceptos<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Justificaci\u00f3n de respuestas<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"criterion\">\r\n                    <h5>Presentaci\u00f3n (10%)<\/h5>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Organizaci\u00f3n clara<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Letra legible<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Respuestas completas<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 8\ufe0f\u20e3 CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"metacognitive-closure\">\r\n        <h3>\ud83e\udde0 REFLEXI\u00d3N FINAL<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"reflection-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"reflection-prompts\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83e\udd14 PREGUNTAS PARA LA AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"reflection-prompt\">\r\n                    <h5>1. \u00bfQu\u00e9 concepto te result\u00f3 m\u00e1s desafiante?<\/h5>\r\n                    <div class=\"prompt-options\">\r\n                        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"challenge\" value=\"quantum\"> N\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"challenge\" value=\"probability\"> Interpretaci\u00f3n probabil\u00edstica<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"challenge\" value=\"configuration\"> Configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"challenge\" value=\"isotopes\"> Is\u00f3topos y estabilidad<\/label>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Explica por qu\u00e9...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"reflection-prompt\">\r\n                    <h5>2. \u00bfC\u00f3mo cambi\u00f3 tu comprensi\u00f3n del \u00e1tomo despu\u00e9s de esta lecci\u00f3n?<\/h5>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Compara tu idea inicial con tu comprensi\u00f3n actual...\" rows=\"4\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"reflection-prompt\">\r\n                    <h5>3. \u00bfQu\u00e9 aplicaci\u00f3n de la qu\u00edmica at\u00f3mica te parece m\u00e1s importante para la sociedad?<\/h5>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Fundamenta tu respuesta...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button id=\"save-reflection\" class=\"reflection-button\">Guardar Reflexi\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"learning-plan\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udccb PLAN DE REFUERZO<\/h4>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"plan-suggestion\" id=\"plan-basic\">\r\n                    <h5>\ud83d\udfe2 NIVEL B\u00c1SICO<\/h5>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Repasar part\u00edculas subat\u00f3micas y cargas<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Practicar c\u00e1lculo de protones, neutrones, electrones<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Entender diferencia entre elemento e is\u00f3topo<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Revisar configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica hasta Z=20<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"plan-suggestion\" id=\"plan-intermediate\">\r\n                    <h5>\ud83d\udfe1 NIVEL INTERMEDIO<\/h5>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Dominar n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos y su significado<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Practicar diagramas de orbitales<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Entender principio de exclusi\u00f3n de Pauli<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Estudiar is\u00f3topos estables e inestables<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"plan-suggestion\" id=\"plan-advanced\">\r\n                    <h5>\ud83d\udd34 NIVEL AVANZADO<\/h5>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Analizar implicaciones del principio de incertidumbre<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Estudiar modelos nucleares (gota l\u00edquida, capas)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Investigar aplicaciones m\u00e9dicas de is\u00f3topos<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Explorar qu\u00edmica cu\u00e1ntica computacional<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"learning-resources\">\r\n                    <h5>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h5>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"resource-link\">Simulador PhET: Build an Atom<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"resource-link\">Video: Quantum Mechanics Explained<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"resource-link\">Art\u00edculo: History of Atomic Theory<\/a><\/li>\r\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"resource-link\">Ejercicios interactivos: Electron Configuration<\/a><\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button id=\"generate-plan\" class=\"plan-button\">Generar Plan Personalizado<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"learning-summary\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udcc8 TU PROGRESO EN ESTA LECCI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"progress-metrics\">\r\n                <div class=\"metric\">\r\n                    <div class=\"metric-value\" id=\"concepts-understood\">0<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metric-label\">Conceptos dominados<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"metric\">\r\n                    <div class=\"metric-value\" id=\"simulations-completed\">0<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metric-label\">Simulaciones completadas<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"metric\">\r\n                    <div class=\"metric-value\" id=\"problems-attempted\">0<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metric-label\">Problemas intentados<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"metric\">\r\n                    <div class=\"metric-value\" id=\"reflection-depth\">B\u00e1sico<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metric-label\">Nivel de reflexi\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"overall-progress\">\r\n                <div class=\"progress-label\">Progreso general: <span id=\"progress-percentage\">0%<\/span><\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"progress-bar\">\r\n                    <div class=\"progress-fill\" id=\"progress-fill\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"achievement-badge\">\r\n                <div class=\"badge-icon\">\u269b\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"badge-content\">\r\n                    <h5>EXPLORADOR CU\u00c1NTICO<\/h5>\r\n                    <p>Has comenzado tu viaje en el mundo at\u00f3mico. \u00a1Contin\u00faa explorando!<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT COMPLETO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ========== DATOS Y CONSTANTES ==========\r\nconst ELEMENTS = {\r\n    'H': { name: 'Hidr\u00f3geno', Z: 1, A: 1, neutrons: 0, config: '1s\u00b9', radius: 53, mass: 1.008, state: 'Gas' },\r\n    'He': { name: 'Helio', Z: 2, A: 4, neutrons: 2, config: '1s\u00b2', radius: 31, mass: 4.003, state: 'Gas' },\r\n    'C': { name: 'Carbono', Z: 6, A: 12, neutrons: 6, config: '1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b2', radius: 70, mass: 12.011, state: 'S\u00f3lido' },\r\n    'O': { name: 'Ox\u00edgeno', Z: 8, A: 16, neutrons: 8, config: '1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2074', radius: 66, mass: 15.999, state: 'Gas' },\r\n    'Fe': { name: 'Hierro', Z: 26, A: 56, neutrons: 30, config: '[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2076', radius: 126, mass: 55.845, state: 'S\u00f3lido' },\r\n    'U': { name: 'Uranio', Z: 92, A: 238, neutrons: 146, config: '[Rn] 7s\u00b2 5f\u00b3 6d\u00b9', radius: 156, mass: 238.029, state: 'S\u00f3lido' }\r\n};\r\n\r\nconst ORBITAL_SHAPES = {\r\n    0: { name: 's', shape: 'Esf\u00e9rica', nodes: 0, orientations: 1, color: '#00aaff' },\r\n    1: { name: 'p', shape: 'Dumbbell (pesas)', nodes: 1, orientations: 3, color: '#00ff88' },\r\n    2: { name: 'd', shape: 'Compleja (tr\u00e9bol)', nodes: 2, orientations: 5, color: '#aa00ff' },\r\n    3: { name: 'f', shape: 'Muy compleja', nodes: 3, orientations: 7, color: '#ff5500' }\r\n};\r\n\r\nconst SPECTRUM_DATA = {\r\n    'H': {\r\n        name: 'Hidr\u00f3geno',\r\n        transitions: {\r\n            '3-2': { wavelength: 656.3, color: '#ff0000', energy: 1.89, series: 'Balmer' },\r\n            '4-2': { wavelength: 486.1, color: '#00ff00', energy: 2.55, series: 'Balmer' },\r\n            '2-1': { wavelength: 121.6, color: '#0000ff', energy: 10.2, series: 'Lyman' },\r\n            '4-3': { wavelength: 1875, color: '#ff8800', energy: 0.66, series: 'Paschen' }\r\n        }\r\n    },\r\n    'He': {\r\n        name: 'Helio',\r\n        transitions: {\r\n            '3-2': { wavelength: 587.6, color: '#ffcc00', energy: 2.11, series: 'Principal' },\r\n            '4-2': { wavelength: 447.1, color: '#8800ff', energy: 2.77, series: 'Principal' }\r\n        }\r\n    },\r\n    'Na': {\r\n        name: 'Sodio',\r\n        transitions: {\r\n            '3-2': { wavelength: 589.0, color: '#ffff00', energy: 2.10, series: 'Doblete' }\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== ESTADO DE LA APLICACI\u00d3N ==========\r\nlet appState = {\r\n    currentElement: 'C',\r\n    viewMode: 'probability',\r\n    quantumNumbers: { n: 1, l: 0, ml: 0, ms: '-\u00bd' },\r\n    atomBuilder: { protons: 6, neutrons: 6, electrons: 6 },\r\n    completedActivities: new Set(),\r\n    learningStats: {\r\n        concepts: 0,\r\n        simulations: 0,\r\n        problems: 0,\r\n        startTime: Date.now()\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DEL \u00c1TOMO ==========\r\nfunction updateAtomVisualization() {\r\n    const element = ELEMENTS[appState.currentElement];\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById('atom-svg');\r\n    svg.innerHTML = '';\r\n    \r\n    const centerX = 400;\r\n    const centerY = 250;\r\n    const nuclearRadius = Math.max(15, Math.min(40, element.Z \/ 3));\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Fondo\r\n    const bg = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'rect');\r\n    bg.setAttribute('width', '800');\r\n    bg.setAttribute('height', '500');\r\n    bg.setAttribute('fill', '#0a0a1a');\r\n    svg.appendChild(bg);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ N\u00facleo\r\n    if (document.getElementById('show-nucleus').checked) {\r\n        const nucleus = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute('cx', centerX);\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute('cy', centerY);\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute('r', nuclearRadius);\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute('fill', '#ff4444');\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute('opacity', '0.8');\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute('filter', 'url(#glow)');\r\n        svg.appendChild(nucleus);\r\n        \r\n        const nucleusText = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'text');\r\n        nucleusText.setAttribute('x', centerX);\r\n        nucleusText.setAttribute('y', centerY - 5);\r\n        nucleusText.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');\r\n        nucleusText.setAttribute('fill', 'white');\r\n        nucleusText.setAttribute('font-size', '14');\r\n        nucleusText.textContent = element.Z + 'p\u207a';\r\n        svg.appendChild(nucleusText);\r\n        \r\n        const nucleusText2 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'text');\r\n        nucleusText2.setAttribute('x', centerX);\r\n        nucleusText2.setAttribute('y', centerY + 15);\r\n        nucleusText2.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');\r\n        nucleusText2.setAttribute('fill', '#ffaaaa');\r\n        nucleusText2.setAttribute('font-size', '12');\r\n        nucleusText2.textContent = element.neutrons + 'n\u2070';\r\n        svg.appendChild(nucleusText2);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Orbitales\r\n    if (document.getElementById('show-orbitals').checked) {\r\n        drawOrbitals(svg, centerX, centerY, element);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Electrones\r\n    if (document.getElementById('show-electrons').checked) {\r\n        drawElectrons(svg, centerX, centerY, element);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Probabilidad\r\n    if (document.getElementById('show-probability').checked && appState.viewMode === 'probability') {\r\n        drawProbabilityCloud(svg, centerX, centerY, element);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas\r\n    updateAtomStats(element);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Marcar actividad completada\r\n    markActivityCompleted('atom-visualization');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction drawOrbitals(svg, cx, cy, element) {\r\n    const orbitalConfig = element.config;\r\n    const shells = {};\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Parsear configuraci\u00f3n\r\n    orbitalConfig.split(' ').forEach(part => {\r\n        if (part.includes('s')) shells.s = true;\r\n        if (part.includes('p')) shells.p = true;\r\n        if (part.includes('d')) shells.d = true;\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Dibujar orbitales seg\u00fan configuraci\u00f3n\r\n    let radius = 80;\r\n    if (shells.s) {\r\n        const sOrbital = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n        sOrbital.setAttribute('cx', cx);\r\n        sOrbital.setAttribute('cy', cy);\r\n        sOrbital.setAttribute('r', radius);\r\n        sOrbital.setAttribute('fill', 'none');\r\n        sOrbital.setAttribute('stroke', ORBITAL_SHAPES[0].color);\r\n        sOrbital.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');\r\n        sOrbital.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', '5,5');\r\n        sOrbital.setAttribute('opacity', '0.6');\r\n        svg.appendChild(sOrbital);\r\n        radius += 60;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    if (shells.p) {\r\n        for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\r\n            const angle = (i * 120) * Math.PI \/ 180;\r\n            const px = cx + Math.cos(angle) * radius * 0.8;\r\n            const py = cy + Math.sin(angle) * radius * 0.8;\r\n            \r\n            const pOrbital = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'ellipse');\r\n            pOrbital.setAttribute('cx', px);\r\n            pOrbital.setAttribute('cy', py);\r\n            pOrbital.setAttribute('rx', radius * 0.3);\r\n            pOrbital.setAttribute('ry', radius * 0.1);\r\n            pOrbital.setAttribute('fill', ORBITAL_SHAPES[1].color);\r\n            pOrbital.setAttribute('opacity', '0.3');\r\n            pOrbital.setAttribute('transform', `rotate(${angle * 180 \/ Math.PI}, ${px}, ${py})`);\r\n            svg.appendChild(pOrbital);\r\n        }\r\n        radius += 80;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    if (shells.d) {\r\n        \/\/ Forma simplificada de orbital d\r\n        const dOrbital = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'path');\r\n        dOrbital.setAttribute('d', `M${cx},${cy - radius} Q${cx + radius},${cy - radius} ${cx + radius},${cy} T${cx},${cy + radius} Q${cx - radius},${cy + radius} ${cx - radius},${cy} Z`);\r\n        dOrbital.setAttribute('fill', 'none');\r\n        dOrbital.setAttribute('stroke', ORBITAL_SHAPES[2].color);\r\n        dOrbital.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1.5');\r\n        dOrbital.setAttribute('opacity', '0.4');\r\n        svg.appendChild(dOrbital);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction drawElectrons(svg, cx, cy, element) {\r\n    const totalElectrons = element.Z;\r\n    const shells = Math.min(7, Math.ceil(totalElectrons \/ 2));\r\n    \r\n    for (let i = 1; i <= shells; i++) {\r\n        const radius = 50 + i * 40;\r\n        const electronsInShell = Math.min(2 * i * i, totalElectrons - cumulativeElectrons(i - 1));\r\n        \r\n        for (let j = 0; j < electronsInShell; j++) {\r\n            const angle = (j * 360 \/ electronsInShell) * Math.PI \/ 180;\r\n            const ex = cx + Math.cos(angle) * radius;\r\n            const ey = cy + Math.sin(angle) * radius;\r\n            \r\n            const electron = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n            electron.setAttribute('cx', ex);\r\n            electron.setAttribute('cy', ey);\r\n            electron.setAttribute('r', 4);\r\n            electron.setAttribute('fill', '#00ffff');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n orbital\r\n            const animate = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'animateTransform');\r\n            animate.setAttribute('attributeName', 'transform');\r\n            animate.setAttribute('type', 'rotate');\r\n            animate.setAttribute('from', `0 ${cx} ${cy}`);\r\n            animate.setAttribute('to', `360 ${cx} ${cy}`);\r\n            animate.setAttribute('dur', `${3 + i}s`);\r\n            animate.setAttribute('repeatCount', 'indefinite');\r\n            electron.appendChild(animate);\r\n            \r\n            svg.appendChild(electron);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function cumulativeElectrons(n) {\r\n        let total = 0;\r\n        for (let i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\r\n            total += Math.min(2 * i * i, 8); \/\/ Regla simplificada\r\n        }\r\n        return total;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction drawProbabilityCloud(svg, cx, cy, element) {\r\n    const cloud = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'radialGradient');\r\n    cloud.id = 'probability-cloud';\r\n    cloud.setAttribute('cx', '50%');\r\n    cloud.setAttribute('cy', '50%');\r\n    \r\n    const stop1 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'stop');\r\n    stop1.setAttribute('offset', '0%');\r\n    stop1.setAttribute('stop-color', '#00aaff');\r\n    stop1.setAttribute('stop-opacity', '0.8');\r\n    \r\n    const stop2 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'stop');\r\n    stop2.setAttribute('offset', '70%');\r\n    stop2.setAttribute('stop-color', '#00aaff');\r\n    stop2.setAttribute('stop-opacity', '0.3');\r\n    \r\n    const stop3 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'stop');\r\n    stop3.setAttribute('offset', '100%');\r\n    stop3.setAttribute('stop-color', '#00aaff');\r\n    stop3.setAttribute('stop-opacity', '0');\r\n    \r\n    cloud.appendChild(stop1);\r\n    cloud.appendChild(stop2);\r\n    cloud.appendChild(stop3);\r\n    \r\n    const defs = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'defs');\r\n    defs.appendChild(cloud);\r\n    svg.appendChild(defs);\r\n    \r\n    const probabilityCircle = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n    probabilityCircle.setAttribute('cx', cx);\r\n    probabilityCircle.setAttribute('cy', cy);\r\n    probabilityCircle.setAttribute('r', 180);\r\n    probabilityCircle.setAttribute('fill', 'url(#probability-cloud)');\r\n    svg.appendChild(probabilityCircle);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction updateAtomStats(element) {\r\n    document.getElementById('atom-title').textContent = `\u00c1TOMO DE ${element.name.toUpperCase()} (${element.Z})`;\r\n    document.getElementById('proton-count').textContent = element.Z;\r\n    document.getElementById('neutron-count').textContent = element.neutrons;\r\n    document.getElementById('mass-number').textContent = element.A;\r\n    document.getElementById('nuclear-radius').textContent = `${(element.Z * 0.7).toFixed(1)} fm`;\r\n    document.getElementById('electron-config').textContent = element.config;\r\n    document.getElementById('total-electrons').textContent = element.Z;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular capas electr\u00f3nicas\r\n    const shells = Math.min(element.Z, 7);\r\n    const shellLetters = ['K', 'L', 'M', 'N', 'O', 'P', 'Q'];\r\n    document.getElementById('electron-shells').textContent = shellLetters.slice(0, shells).join(', ');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Electrones de valencia (simplificado)\r\n    const lastDigit = parseInt(element.config.slice(-1));\r\n    document.getElementById('valence-electrons').textContent = isNaN(lastDigit) ? 1 : lastDigit;\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('atomic-mass').textContent = `${element.mass} u`;\r\n    document.getElementById('atomic-radius').textContent = `${element.radius} pm`;\r\n    document.getElementById('stability').textContent = element.Z <= 83 ? 'Estable' : 'Radiactivo';\r\n    document.getElementById('natural-state').textContent = element.state;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== CONSTRUCTOR DE \u00c1TOMOS ==========\r\nfunction updateAtomBuilder() {\r\n    const p = appState.atomBuilder.protons;\r\n    const n = appState.atomBuilder.neutrons;\r\n    const e = appState.atomBuilder.electrons;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar contadores\r\n    document.getElementById('p-count').textContent = p;\r\n    document.getElementById('n-count').textContent = n;\r\n    document.getElementById('e-count').textContent = e;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar sliders\r\n    document.getElementById('proton-slider').value = p;\r\n    document.getElementById('neutron-slider').value = n;\r\n    document.getElementById('electron-slider').value = e;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Determinar elemento\r\n    const element = findElementByProtons(p);\r\n    document.getElementById('element-name').textContent = element ? element.name : 'Desconocido';\r\n    document.getElementById('element-symbol').textContent = element ? element.symbol : '?';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular carga\r\n    const charge = p - e;\r\n    document.getElementById('atom-charge').textContent = charge === 0 ? '0' : charge > 0 ? `+${charge}` : `${charge}`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular masa aproximada\r\n    const mass = (p * 1.007276 + n * 1.008665).toFixed(2);\r\n    document.getElementById('atom-mass').textContent = `${mass} u`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular estabilidad\r\n    const nzRatio = n \/ p;\r\n    const stability = calculateStability(nzRatio, p);\r\n    const stabilityPercent = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, stability * 100));\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('stability-fill').style.width = `${stabilityPercent}%`;\r\n    \r\n    let stabilityColor, message;\r\n    if (stability > 0.7) {\r\n        stabilityColor = '#00ff88';\r\n        message = 'N\u00facleo muy estable';\r\n    } else if (stability > 0.4) {\r\n        stabilityColor = '#ffff00';\r\n        message = 'N\u00facleo moderadamente estable';\r\n    } else {\r\n        stabilityColor = '#ff4444';\r\n        message = 'N\u00facleo inestable (radiactivo)';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('stability-fill').style.backgroundColor = stabilityColor;\r\n    document.getElementById('stability-message').textContent = message;\r\n    document.getElementById('stability-message').style.color = stabilityColor;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Marcar actividad completada\r\n    markActivityCompleted('atom-builder');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction findElementByProtons(Z) {\r\n    for (const [symbol, data] of Object.entries(ELEMENTS)) {\r\n        if (data.Z === Z) {\r\n            return { symbol, ...data };\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    return null;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction calculateStability(nzRatio, Z) {\r\n    \/\/ F\u00f3rmula simplificada de estabilidad nuclear\r\n    if (Z === 1) return nzRatio <= 1 ? 1 : 0.5; \/\/ Hidr\u00f3geno\r\n    if (Z <= 20) return Math.max(0, 1 - Math.abs(nzRatio - 1) * 2);\r\n    if (Z <= 50) return Math.max(0, 1 - Math.abs(nzRatio - 1.25) * 1.5);\r\n    if (Z <= 82) return Math.max(0, 1 - Math.abs(nzRatio - 1.5) * 1);\r\n    return 0; \/\/ Elementos pesados generalmente inestables\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== GENERADOR DE N\u00daMEROS CU\u00c1NTICOS ==========\r\nfunction updateQuantumGenerator() {\r\n    const n = appState.quantumNumbers.n;\r\n    const l = appState.quantumNumbers.l;\r\n    const ml = appState.quantumNumbers.ml;\r\n    const ms = appState.quantumNumbers.ms;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar valores mostrados\r\n    document.getElementById('n-value').textContent = n;\r\n    document.getElementById('l-value').textContent = l;\r\n    document.getElementById('ml-value').textContent = ml;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar orbital shape\r\n    const orbitalData = ORBITAL_SHAPES[l] || ORBITAL_SHAPES[0];\r\n    document.getElementById('orbital-notation').textContent = `${n}${orbitalData.name}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('orbital-shape').textContent = orbitalData.shape;\r\n    document.getElementById('angular-nodes').textContent = orbitalData.nodes;\r\n    document.getElementById('orientations').textContent = orbitalData.orientations;\r\n    document.getElementById('max-electrons').textContent = `${orbitalData.orientations * 2} electrones`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Verificar principio de Pauli\r\n    const isValid = validateQuantumNumbers(n, l, ml, ms);\r\n    const pauliStatus = document.getElementById('pauli-status');\r\n    \r\n    if (isValid) {\r\n        pauliStatus.textContent = '\u2713 Este conjunto de n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos es v\u00e1lido';\r\n        pauliStatus.className = 'pauli-valid';\r\n    } else {\r\n        pauliStatus.textContent = '\u2717 Este conjunto viola reglas cu\u00e1nticas';\r\n        pauliStatus.className = 'pauli-invalid';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar botones de esp\u00edn\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.spin-btn').forEach(btn => {\r\n        btn.classList.remove('active');\r\n        if (btn.getAttribute('data-spin') === ms) {\r\n            btn.classList.add('active');\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Marcar actividad completada\r\n    markActivityCompleted('quantum-generator');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction validateQuantumNumbers(n, l, ml, ms) {\r\n    \/\/ Reglas de n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos\r\n    if (n < 1) return false;\r\n    if (l < 0 || l >= n) return false;\r\n    if (ml < -l || ml > l) return false;\r\n    if (ms !== '-\u00bd' && ms !== '+\u00bd') return false;\r\n    return true;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== SIMULADOR DE ESPECTROS ==========\r\nfunction updateSpectrumSimulator() {\r\n    const element = document.getElementById('spectrum-element').value;\r\n    const transition = document.getElementById('transition-select').value;\r\n    const excitation = parseInt(document.getElementById('excitation-slider').value);\r\n    \r\n    const data = SPECTRUM_DATA[element];\r\n    if (!data) return;\r\n    \r\n    const transitionData = data.transitions[transition];\r\n    if (!transitionData) return;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar informaci\u00f3n del espectro\r\n    document.getElementById('spectrum-wavelength').textContent = `${transitionData.wavelength} nm`;\r\n    document.getElementById('spectrum-color').textContent = getColorName(transitionData.color);\r\n    document.getElementById('spectrum-color').style.color = transitionData.color;\r\n    document.getElementById('photon-energy').textContent = `${transitionData.energy} eV`;\r\n    document.getElementById('spectral-series').textContent = transitionData.series;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar nivel de excitaci\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('excitation-level').textContent = `n=${excitation}`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Dibujar niveles de energ\u00eda\r\n    drawEnergyLevels(element, excitation, transition);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Dibujar barras espectrales\r\n    drawSpectrumBars(transitionData);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Marcar actividad completada\r\n    markActivityCompleted('spectrum-simulator');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction drawEnergyLevels(element, excitation, transition) {\r\n    const container = document.getElementById('energy-levels');\r\n    container.innerHTML = '';\r\n    \r\n    const [from, to] = transition.split('-').map(Number);\r\n    const levels = Math.max(5, excitation + 1);\r\n    \r\n    for (let i = 1; i <= levels; i++) {\r\n        const level = document.createElement('div');\r\n        level.className = 'energy-level';\r\n        \r\n        if (i === from) level.classList.add('from-level');\r\n        if (i === to) level.classList.add('to-level');\r\n        if (i > excitation) level.classList.add('unavailable');\r\n        \r\n        const levelLabel = document.createElement('div');\r\n        levelLabel.className = 'level-label';\r\n        levelLabel.textContent = `n=${i}`;\r\n        \r\n        const levelEnergy = document.createElement('div');\r\n        levelEnergy.className = 'level-energy';\r\n        levelEnergy.textContent = `-${(13.6 \/ (i * i)).toFixed(2)} eV`;\r\n        \r\n        level.appendChild(levelLabel);\r\n        level.appendChild(levelEnergy);\r\n        container.appendChild(level);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Dibujar transici\u00f3n si es la actual\r\n        if (i === from) {\r\n            const transitionArrow = document.createElement('div');\r\n            transitionArrow.className = 'transition-arrow';\r\n            transitionArrow.textContent = '\u2193';\r\n            container.appendChild(transitionArrow);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction drawSpectrumBars(transitionData) {\r\n    const container = document.getElementById('spectrum-bars');\r\n    container.innerHTML = '';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Crear barra principal\r\n    const mainBar = document.createElement('div');\r\n    mainBar.className = 'spectrum-bar';\r\n    mainBar.style.backgroundColor = transitionData.color;\r\n    mainBar.style.width = '100%';\r\n    mainBar.style.height = '40px';\r\n    mainBar.style.opacity = '0.8';\r\n    mainBar.style.boxShadow = `0 0 20px ${transitionData.color}`;\r\n    mainBar.title = `\u03bb = ${transitionData.wavelength} nm | E = ${transitionData.energy} eV`;\r\n    \r\n    container.appendChild(mainBar);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction getColorName(hex) {\r\n    const colors = {\r\n        '#ff0000': 'Rojo',\r\n        '#00ff00': 'Verde',\r\n        '#0000ff': 'Azul',\r\n        '#ffff00': 'Amarillo',\r\n        '#ff8800': 'Naranja',\r\n        '#8800ff': 'Violeta',\r\n        '#ffcc00': 'Amarillo dorado'\r\n    };\r\n    return colors[hex] || 'Desconocido';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== ERRORES COMUNES ==========\r\nfunction setupMisconceptions() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.misconception-detail').forEach(button => {\r\n        button.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const id = this.getAttribute('data-misconception');\r\n            const evidence = document.getElementById(`evidence-${id}`);\r\n            \r\n            if (evidence.style.display === 'block') {\r\n                evidence.style.display = 'none';\r\n                this.textContent = 'Ver evidencia experimental';\r\n            } else {\r\n                \/\/ Cerrar otras evidencias\r\n                document.querySelectorAll('.misconception-evidence').forEach(el => {\r\n                    el.style.display = 'none';\r\n                });\r\n                document.querySelectorAll('.misconception-detail').forEach(btn => {\r\n                    btn.textContent = 'Ver evidencia experimental';\r\n                });\r\n                \r\n                evidence.style.display = 'block';\r\n                this.textContent = 'Ocultar evidencia';\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== QUIZ INTERACTIVO ==========\r\nfunction setupConceptQuiz() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.concept-option').forEach(button => {\r\n        button.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const isCorrect = this.getAttribute('data-correct') === 'true';\r\n            const question = this.closest('.concept-question');\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.concept-feedback');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Deshabilitar todas las opciones en esta pregunta\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.concept-option').forEach(btn => {\r\n                btn.disabled = true;\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            if (isCorrect) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                feedback.innerHTML = '\u2705 \u00a1Correcto! Has entendido el concepto.';\r\n                feedback.style.color = '#00ff88';\r\n                appState.learningStats.concepts++;\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                feedback.innerHTML = '\u274c Incorrecto. Revisa la secci\u00f3n correspondiente.';\r\n                feedback.style.color = '#ff4444';\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            updateLearningStats();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== SISTEMA DE PROGRESO ==========\r\nfunction markActivityCompleted(activityId) {\r\n    if (!appState.completedActivities.has(activityId)) {\r\n        appState.completedActivities.add(activityId);\r\n        appState.learningStats.simulations = appState.completedActivities.size;\r\n        updateLearningStats();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction updateLearningStats() {\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar m\u00e9tricas\r\n    document.getElementById('concepts-understood').textContent = appState.learningStats.concepts;\r\n    document.getElementById('simulations-completed').textContent = appState.learningStats.simulations;\r\n    document.getElementById('problems-attempted').textContent = appState.learningStats.problems;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular tiempo de estudio\r\n    const elapsedMinutes = Math.floor((Date.now() - appState.learningStats.startTime) \/ 60000);\r\n    document.getElementById('reflection-depth').textContent = \r\n        elapsedMinutes < 10 ? 'B\u00e1sico' : \r\n        elapsedMinutes < 30 ? 'Intermedio' : 'Avanzado';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular progreso general\r\n    const totalScore = \r\n        (appState.learningStats.concepts * 10) + \r\n        (appState.learningStats.simulations * 15) + \r\n        (appState.learningStats.problems * 20);\r\n    const maxScore = 200; \/\/ 10 conceptos + 5 simulaciones + 4 problemas m\u00e1ximos\r\n    const progressPercent = Math.min(Math.round((totalScore \/ maxScore) * 100), 100);\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('progress-percentage').textContent = `${progressPercent}%`;\r\n    document.getElementById('progress-fill').style.width = `${progressPercent}%`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Color del progreso\r\n    const fillElement = document.getElementById('progress-fill');\r\n    if (progressPercent < 40) {\r\n        fillElement.style.backgroundColor = '#ff4444';\r\n    } else if (progressPercent < 70) {\r\n        fillElement.style.backgroundColor = '#ffff00';\r\n    } else {\r\n        fillElement.style.backgroundColor = '#00ff88';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== GENERADOR DE PLAN DE ESTUDIO ==========\r\nfunction generateStudyPlan() {\r\n    const completed = appState.completedActivities.size;\r\n    const score = appState.learningStats.concepts * 10;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ocultar todos los planes\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.plan-suggestion').forEach(el => {\r\n        el.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar plan apropiado\r\n    let planId;\r\n    if (score < 30) {\r\n        planId = 'plan-basic';\r\n    } else if (score < 60) {\r\n        planId = 'plan-intermediate';\r\n    } else {\r\n        planId = 'plan-advanced';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    const plan = document.getElementById(planId);\r\n    plan.style.display = 'block';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mensaje personalizado\r\n    const messages = [\r\n        \"\u00a1Excelente trabajo! Dominas los conceptos avanzados del \u00e1tomo.\",\r\n        \"Buen progreso. Sigue practicando para consolidar tu comprensi\u00f3n.\",\r\n        \"Comienzo s\u00f3lido. Contin\u00faa explorando los simuladores para mejorar.\"\r\n    ];\r\n    \r\n    const messageIndex = Math.min(Math.floor(score \/ 30), 2);\r\n    alert(`\ud83d\udcda Tu plan de estudio ha sido generado\n\n${messages[messageIndex]}`);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== INICIALIZACI\u00d3N ==========\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    \/\/ Inicializar visualizaci\u00f3n del \u00e1tomo\r\n    updateAtomVisualization();\r\n    updateAtomBuilder();\r\n    updateQuantumGenerator();\r\n    updateSpectrumSimulator();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar event listeners\r\n    \/\/ Visualizaci\u00f3n del \u00e1tomo\r\n    document.getElementById('atom-element').addEventListener('change', function() {\r\n        appState.currentElement = this.value;\r\n        updateAtomVisualization();\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('view-mode').addEventListener('change', function() {\r\n        appState.viewMode = this.value;\r\n        updateAtomVisualization();\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('time-scale').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n        const value = parseInt(this.value);\r\n        const labels = ['Muy lento', 'Lento', 'Normal', 'R\u00e1pido', 'Muy r\u00e1pido'];\r\n        document.getElementById('time-value').textContent = labels[value - 1] || 'Normal';\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    ['show-nucleus', 'show-electrons', 'show-orbitals', 'show-probability'].forEach(id => {\r\n        document.getElementById(id).addEventListener('change', updateAtomVisualization);\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Constructor de \u00e1tomos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.particle-btn').forEach(btn => {\r\n        btn.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const particle = this.getAttribute('data-particle');\r\n            const action = this.getAttribute('data-action');\r\n            const current = appState.atomBuilder[particle === 'p' ? 'protons' : \r\n                                                particle === 'n' ? 'neutrons' : 'electrons'];\r\n            \r\n            if (action === 'increase') {\r\n                appState.atomBuilder[particle === 'p' ? 'protons' : \r\n                                    particle === 'n' ? 'neutrons' : 'electrons']++;\r\n            } else {\r\n                appState.atomBuilder[particle === 'p' ? 'protons' : \r\n                                    particle === 'n' ? 'neutrons' : 'electrons']--;\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            updateAtomBuilder();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    document.querySelectorAll('#proton-slider, #neutron-slider, #electron-slider').forEach(slider => {\r\n        slider.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n            const particle = this.id.includes('proton') ? 'protons' : \r\n                           this.id.includes('neutron') ? 'neutrons' : 'electrons';\r\n            appState.atomBuilder[particle] = parseInt(this.value);\r\n            updateAtomBuilder();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('build-atom').addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        alert('\u2705 \u00c1tomo construido exitosamente. En un sistema real, esto generar\u00eda un nuevo elemento en la visualizaci\u00f3n.');\r\n        markActivityCompleted('atom-construction');\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Generador de n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('#n-slider, #l-slider, #ml-slider').forEach(slider => {\r\n        slider.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n            const qn = this.id.charAt(0);\r\n            appState.quantumNumbers[qn] = parseInt(this.value);\r\n            updateQuantumGenerator();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.spin-btn').forEach(btn => {\r\n        btn.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            appState.quantumNumbers.ms = this.getAttribute('data-spin');\r\n            updateQuantumGenerator();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Simulador de espectros\r\n    document.getElementById('spectrum-element').addEventListener('change', updateSpectrumSimulator);\r\n    document.getElementById('transition-select').addEventListener('change', updateSpectrumSimulator);\r\n    document.getElementById('excitation-slider').addEventListener('input', updateSpectrumSimulator);\r\n    document.getElementById('excite-atom').addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const element = document.getElementById('spectrum-element').value;\r\n        alert(`\u26a1 El \u00e1tomo de ${SPECTRUM_DATA[element]?.name || element} ha sido excitado!`);\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Errores comunes\r\n    setupMisconceptions();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Quiz de conceptos\r\n    setupConceptQuiz();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Sistema de problemas\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.hint-btn').forEach(btn => {\r\n        btn.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const hint = this.nextElementSibling;\r\n            hint.style.display = hint.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Registrar intento de problema\r\n            appState.learningStats.problems++;\r\n            updateLearningStats();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Sistema de reflexi\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('save-reflection').addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        alert('\ud83d\udcbe Tu reflexi\u00f3n ha sido guardada. Revisa tu plan de estudio personalizado.');\r\n        appState.learningStats.concepts = Math.min(appState.learningStats.concepts + 2, 10);\r\n        updateLearningStats();\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Generador de plan de estudio\r\n    document.getElementById('generate-plan').addEventListener('click', generateStudyPlan);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas iniciales\r\n    updateLearningStats();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar MathJax\r\n    if (window.MathJax) {\r\n        MathJax.typesetPromise();\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efectos visuales\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.lab-button, .reflection-button, .plan-button').forEach(button => {\r\n        button.addEventListener('mouseenter', function() {\r\n            this.style.transform = 'translateY(-3px)';\r\n        });\r\n        button.addEventListener('mouseleave', function() {\r\n            this.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Partes del \u00e1tomo","respuesta":"N\u00facleo y electrones"},{"enunciado":"N\u00famero at\u00f3mico","respuesta":"N\u00famero de protones"},{"enunciado":"Carga del electr\u00f3n","respuesta":"-1"},{"enunciado":"\u00c1tomo neutro","respuesta":"p\u207a = e\u207b"},{"enunciado":"Is\u00f3topos difieren en","respuesta":"Neutrones"},{"enunciado":"Configuraci\u00f3n C","respuesta":"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b2"},{"enunciado":"n capa M","respuesta":"3"},{"enunciado":"l subnivel d","respuesta":"2"},{"enunciado":"m\u2097 orbital p","respuesta":"-1,0,+1"},{"enunciado":"Masa del electr\u00f3n","respuesta":"0.00054858 u"},{"enunciado":"F\u00f3rmula A","respuesta":"A = p\u207a + n\u2070"},{"enunciado":"Elemento define","respuesta":"Z"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"\u00c1tomo tiene...","opciones":["p\u207a, n\u2070, e\u207b","Solo p\u207a","Solo e\u207b","Nada"],"correcta":"p\u207a, n\u2070, e\u207b"},{"pregunta":"N\u00facleo contiene...","opciones":["Protones y neutrones","Electrones","Nada","Mol\u00e9culas"],"correcta":"Protones y neutrones"},{"pregunta":"Carga prot\u00f3n","opciones":["+1","-1","0","Variable"],"correcta":"+1"},{"pregunta":"N\u00famero at\u00f3mico Z =","opciones":["Protones","Neutrones","Electrones","Masa"],"correcta":"Protones"},{"pregunta":"Electrones est\u00e1n en...","opciones":["Orbitales","N\u00facleo","Fuera","Nada"],"correcta":"Orbitales"},{"pregunta":"\u00c1tomo neutro: e\u207b =","opciones":["p\u207a","n\u2070","A","Z"],"correcta":"p\u207a"},{"preegunta":"Is\u00f3topos tienen mismo...","opciones":["Z","A","Masa","Carga"],"correcta":"Z"},{"pregunta":"Capa K es n=","opciones":["1","2","3","4"],"correcta":"1"},{"pregunta":"Subnivel s: l =","opciones":["0","1","2","3"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC define \u00e1tomo como...","opciones":["Unidad qu\u00edmica","Mol\u00e9cula","I\u00f3n","Nada"],"correcta":"Unidad qu\u00edmica"},{"pregunta":"Configuraci\u00f3n Ne (Z=10)","opciones":["1s\u00b22s\u00b22p\u2076","1s\u00b22s\u00b2","1s\u00b90","2p\u2076"],"correcta":"1s\u00b22s\u00b22p\u2076"},{"pregunta":"N\u00famero m\u00e1sico A =","opciones":["p\u207a + n\u2070","p\u207a + e\u207b","n\u2070 + e\u207b","Solo p\u207a"],"correcta":"p\u207a + n\u2070"},{"pregunta":"Masa electr\u00f3n \u2248","opciones":["1\/1836 u","1 u","0 u","2 u"],"correcta":"1\/1836 u"},{"pregunta":"Capa L: n =","opciones":["2","1","3","4"],"correcta":"2"},{"pregunta":"Subnivel p m\u00e1x. electrones","opciones":["6","2","10","14"],"correcta":"6"},{"pregunta":"m\u2097 para 2p","opciones":["-1,0,+1","0,1","-2 a +2","\u00b1\u00bd"],"correcta":"-1,0,+1"},{"pregunta":"Principio Pauli","opciones":["No 2 e\u207b mismos 4 n\u00fameros","Mismo esp\u00edn","Mismo n","Nada"],"correcta":"No 2 e\u207b mismos 4 n\u00fameros"},{"pregunta":"NIST mide masa prot\u00f3n","opciones":["1.007276 u","1.000000 u","0.000548 u","1.008665 u"],"correcta":"1.007276 u"},{"pregunta":"\u00c1tomo H tiene...","opciones":["1p\u207a, 1e\u207b","1n\u2070","2e\u207b","0p\u207a"],"correcta":"1p\u207a, 1e\u207b"},{"pregunta":"C\u2076\u207a tiene...","opciones":["0 e\u207b","6 e\u207b","12 e\u207b","1 e\u207b"],"correcta":"0 e\u207b"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula A","opciones":["A = p\u207a + n\u2070","A = Z + e\u207b","A = Z","A = 0"],"correcta":"A = p\u207a + n\u2070"},{"pregunta":"\u00c1tomo m\u00e1s peque\u00f1o","opciones":["H","He","Li","C"],"correcta":"H"},{"pregunta":"Radio at\u00f3mico aumenta...","opciones":["\u2193 grupo, \u2192 periodo","\u2191 grupo, \u2192 periodo","\u2193 grupo, \u2190 periodo","Nada"],"correcta":"\u2193 grupo, \u2192 periodo"},{"pregunta":"Carga nuclear efectiva","opciones":["Z - \u03c3","Z","A","n"],"correcta":"Z - \u03c3"},{"pregunta":"Configuraci\u00f3n Fe","opciones":["[Ar]4s\u00b23d\u2076","[Ar]4s\u00b93d\u2077","[Ar]3d\u2078","[Ne]3s\u00b23p\u2076"],"correcta":"[Ar]4s\u00b23d\u2076"},{"pregunta":"Excepci\u00f3n Cr","opciones":["4s\u00b93d\u2075","4s\u00b23d\u2074","4s\u20703d\u2076","4s\u00b33d\u00b3"],"correcta":"4s\u00b93d\u2075"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC 2025 usa...","opciones":["Configuraci\u00f3n noble","Aufbau","Hund","Pauli"],"correcta":"Configuraci\u00f3n noble"},{"pregunta":"\u00c1tomo con m\u00e1s is\u00f3topos estables","opciones":["Sn (10)","H (2)","He (1)","O (3)"],"correcta":"Sn (10)"},{"pregunta":"Masa molar C-12 exacta","opciones":["12.000 u","12.011 u","13.000 u","11.999 u"],"correcta":"12.000 u"},{"pregunta":"NIST define electr\u00f3n como...","opciones":["Part\u00edcula elemental","Compuesta","Onda","Nada"],"correcta":"Part\u00edcula elemental"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"estructura-atomica-cuantica-avanzada-interactiva-mejorada","titulo":"ESTRUCTURA AT\u00d3MICA CU\u00c1NTICA AVANZADA: MODELOS, N\u00daMEROS CU\u00c1NTICOS, ORBITALES Y ESPECTROS","contenido":"<!-- ========== INICIO DE LA LECCI\u00d3N INTERACTIVA ========== -->\r\n<div class=\"quantum-advanced-lesson\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- ========== 1. INTRODUCCI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL ========== -->\r\n    <section class=\"intro-section\">\r\n        <h2>\ud83d\udd2c Introducci\u00f3n a la Estructura At\u00f3mica Cu\u00e1ntica<\/h2>\r\n        <p>La comprensi\u00f3n moderna del \u00e1tomo es uno de los mayores logros de la ciencia del siglo XX. Desde los modelos hist\u00f3ricos hasta la mec\u00e1nica cu\u00e1ntica, hemos pasado de ver el \u00e1tomo como una esfera indivisible a una nube probabil\u00edstica de electrones gobernada por principios cu\u00e1nticos.<\/p>\r\n        <p>Esta lecci\u00f3n explora la evoluci\u00f3n de los modelos at\u00f3micos, los n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos, la forma de los orbitales y los espectros at\u00f3micos, con herramientas interactivas que te permitir\u00e1n visualizar y experimentar conceptos clave. Estas ideas son fundamentales en qu\u00edmica moderna, desde la tabla peri\u00f3dica hasta la formaci\u00f3n de enlaces qu\u00edmicos y tecnolog\u00edas como l\u00e1seres y resonancia magn\u00e9tica.<\/p>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"visual-intro\">\r\n            <h3>Evoluci\u00f3n Hist\u00f3rica de los Modelos At\u00f3micos<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"models-timeline\">\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-visual\" id=\"timeline-visual\">\r\n                    <!-- JS dibujar\u00e1 la l\u00ednea de tiempo aqu\u00ed -->\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ========== 2. DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO ESTRUCTURADO ========== -->\r\n    <section class=\"theory-section\">\r\n        <h2>\ud83d\udcda Desarrollo Te\u00f3rico: Del Modelo de Bohr a la Mec\u00e1nica Cu\u00e1ntica<\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"theory-timeline\">\r\n            <table class=\"models-table [terminal-hacker | neon-glitch | holographic]\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>Modelo<\/th>\r\n                        <th>A\u00f1o<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Cient\u00edfico<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Caracter\u00edsticas Principales<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Limitaciones<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Dalton<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1808<\/td>\r\n                        <td>John Dalton<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\u00c1tomos indivisibles, diferentes por elemento<\/td>\r\n                        <td>No explica subpart\u00edculas ni espectros<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Thomson<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1897<\/td>\r\n                        <td>J.J. Thomson<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Bud\u00edn de pasas: carga positiva con electrones incrustados<\/td>\r\n                        <td>No explica dispersi\u00f3n alfa<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Rutherford<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1911<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Ernest Rutherford<\/td>\r\n                        <td>N\u00facleo positivo denso, electrones orbitales<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Inestabilidad cl\u00e1sica<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Bohr<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1913<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Niels Bohr<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\u00d3rbitas cuantizadas, niveles energ\u00e9ticos discretos<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Solo v\u00e1lido para H, no multielectr\u00f3nicos<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Mec\u00e1nico-Cu\u00e1ntico<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1926<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Erwin Schr\u00f6dinger<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Orbitales probabil\u00edsticos, ecuaci\u00f3n de onda<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Complejidad matem\u00e1tica alta<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"bohr-model\">\r\n            <h3>Modelo de Bohr y Niveles Energ\u00e9ticos<\/h3>\r\n            <p>La energ\u00eda de los niveles en el modelo de Bohr se calcula como:<\/p>\r\n            \\[ E_n = -\frac{13.6}{n^2} \text{ eV} \\]\r\n            <p>Donde n es el n\u00famero cu\u00e1ntico principal (n = 1, 2, 3...)<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"quantum-numbers\">\r\n            <h3>Los Cuatro N\u00fameros Cu\u00e1nticos<\/h3>\r\n            <table class=\"models-table [terminal-hacker | neon-glitch | holographic]\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>N\u00famero<\/th>\r\n                        <th>S\u00edmbolo<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Valores<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Significado<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Principal<\/td>\r\n                        <td>n<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1, 2, 3...<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Tama\u00f1o y energ\u00eda del orbital<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Azimutal<\/td>\r\n                        <td>l<\/td>\r\n                        <td>0...(n-1)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Forma del orbital (s=0, p=1, d=2, f=3)<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Magn\u00e9tico<\/td>\r\n                        <td>m\u2097<\/td>\r\n                        <td>-l...0...+l<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Orientaci\u00f3n espacial<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Esp\u00edn<\/td>\r\n                        <td>m\u209b<\/td>\r\n                        <td>+\u00bd, -\u00bd<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Rotaci\u00f3n intr\u00ednseca del electr\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ========== 3. VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA ========== -->\r\n    <section class=\"visualization-section\">\r\n        <h2>\ud83c\udf0c Visualizaci\u00f3n de Orbitales At\u00f3micos<\/h2>\r\n        <p>Los orbitales representan regiones de alta probabilidad electr\u00f3nica. Aqu\u00ed puedes explorar representaciones interactivas de los orbitales s, p, d y f.<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"orbital-selector\">\r\n            <div class=\"controls\">\r\n                <label>Selecciona orbital:<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"orbital-type\">\r\n                    <option value=\"1s\">1s (esf\u00e9rico)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"2pz\">2pz (dumbbell a lo largo de z)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"3dxy\">3dxy (cloverleaf en plano xy)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"4f\">4f (complejo, m\u00faltiples l\u00f3bulos)<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n                <button id=\"rotate-orbital\">Rotar Orbital<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"orbital-canvas\" id=\"orbital-canvas\">\r\n                <div style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px; background: #f0f0f0; border: 1px solid #ccc; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;\">\r\n                    <p>Visualizaci\u00f3n 3D del orbital<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"orbital-info\" id=\"orbital-info\">\r\n                <p><strong>Informaci\u00f3n del orbital:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <p>n: <span id=\"orbital-n\">1<\/span>, l: <span id=\"orbital-l\">0<\/span>, m\u2097: <span id=\"orbital-ml\">0<\/span><\/p>\r\n                <p>Nodos angulares: <span id=\"orbital-nodes\">0<\/span><\/p>\r\n                <p>Nodos radiales: <span id=\"radial-nodes\">0<\/span><\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <h3>Espectro de Emisi\u00f3n del Hidr\u00f3geno<\/h3>\r\n        <div class=\"spectrum-simulator\">\r\n            <p>La ecuaci\u00f3n de Rydberg para la serie de Balmer (visible):<\/p>\r\n            \\[ \frac{1}{\\lambda} = R_H \\left( \frac{1}{2^2} - \frac{1}{n^2} \right) \\]\r\n            <p>Donde R_H = 1.097\u00d710\u2077 m\u207b\u00b9 (constante de Rydberg), n = 3, 4, 5...<\/p>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"controls\">\r\n                <label>Transici\u00f3n (n \u2192 2):<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"spectral-transition\">\r\n                    <option value=\"3\">n=3 \u2192 2 (H\u03b1, rojo)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"4\">n=4 \u2192 2 (H\u03b2, azul-verde)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"5\">n=5 \u2192 2 (H\u03b3, azul)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"6\">n=6 \u2192 2 (H\u03b4, violeta)<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"spectrum-display\" id=\"spectrum-display\" style=\"height: 80px; background: linear-gradient(to right, violet, blue, cyan, green, yellow, orange, red); margin: 20px 0; position: relative;\">\r\n                <!-- Marcadores de l\u00edneas se dibujar\u00e1n aqu\u00ed -->\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"spectrum-results\">\r\n                <p>Longitud de onda: <span id=\"wavelength\">656.3<\/span> nm<\/p>\r\n                <p>Energ\u00eda del fot\u00f3n: <span id=\"photon-energy\">1.89<\/span> eV<\/p>\r\n                <p>Color: <span id=\"line-color\" style=\"font-weight: bold; color: red;\">Rojo<\/span><\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <script>\r\n        \/\/ ========== VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DE ORBITALES AT\u00d3MICOS ==========\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    \/\/ ========== CONFIGURACIONES DE ORBITALES ==========\r\n    const orbitalData = {\r\n        '1s': {\r\n            n: 1,\r\n            l: 0,\r\n            ml: 0,\r\n            angularNodes: 0,\r\n            radialNodes: 0,\r\n            description: 'Orbital esf\u00e9rico sim\u00e9trico. Probabilidad electr\u00f3nica m\u00e1xima en el n\u00facleo.',\r\n            color: '#ff00ff',\r\n            shape: 'sphere'\r\n        },\r\n        '2pz': {\r\n            n: 2,\r\n            l: 1,\r\n            ml: 0,\r\n            angularNodes: 1,\r\n            radialNodes: 0,\r\n            description: 'Orbital en forma de dumbbell orientado a lo largo del eje z.',\r\n            color: '#00ffcc',\r\n            shape: 'dumbbell-z'\r\n        },\r\n        '3dxy': {\r\n            n: 3,\r\n            l: 2,\r\n            ml: -2,\r\n            angularNodes: 2,\r\n            radialNodes: 0,\r\n            description: 'Orbital en forma de tr\u00e9bol en el plano xy, con l\u00f3bulos entre ejes.',\r\n            color: '#ffff00',\r\n            shape: 'cloverleaf-xy'\r\n        },\r\n        '4f': {\r\n            n: 4,\r\n            l: 3,\r\n            ml: -3,\r\n            angularNodes: 3,\r\n            radialNodes: 0,\r\n            description: 'Orbital complejo con m\u00faltiples l\u00f3bulos y nodos.',\r\n            color: '#00ffff',\r\n            shape: 'complex'\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== VARIABLES DE ESTADO ==========\r\n    let currentOrbital = '1s';\r\n    let rotationAngle = 0;\r\n    let rotationInterval = null;\r\n    let isRotating = false;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== ELEMENTOS DOM ==========\r\n    const orbitalSelect = document.getElementById('orbital-type');\r\n    const rotateButton = document.getElementById('rotate-orbital');\r\n    const orbitalCanvas = document.getElementById('orbital-canvas');\r\n    const orbitalN = document.getElementById('orbital-n');\r\n    const orbitalL = document.getElementById('orbital-l');\r\n    const orbitalMl = document.getElementById('orbital-ml');\r\n    const orbitalNodes = document.getElementById('orbital-nodes');\r\n    const radialNodes = document.getElementById('radial-nodes');\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== INICIALIZAR VISUALIZACI\u00d3N ==========\r\n    function initOrbitalVisualization() {\r\n        createOrbitalCanvas();\r\n        updateOrbitalInfo();\r\n        drawOrbital(currentOrbital);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== CREAR CANVAS PARA ORBITAL ==========\r\n    function createOrbitalCanvas() {\r\n        \/\/ Limpiar canvas existente\r\n        orbitalCanvas.innerHTML = '';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Crear canvas SVG\r\n        const svgNS = \"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\";\r\n        const svg = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"svg\");\r\n        svg.setAttribute(\"width\", \"300\");\r\n        svg.setAttribute(\"height\", \"300\");\r\n        svg.setAttribute(\"viewBox\", \"0 0 300 300\");\r\n        svg.setAttribute(\"id\", \"orbital-svg\");\r\n        svg.style.border = \"2px solid #00ffcc\";\r\n        svg.style.background = \"#000\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Crear grupo para rotaciones\r\n        const orbitalGroup = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"g\");\r\n        orbitalGroup.setAttribute(\"id\", \"orbital-group\");\r\n        orbitalGroup.setAttribute(\"transform\", \"translate(150, 150)\");\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ A\u00f1adir grid de referencia\r\n        createReferenceGrid(svg);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ A\u00f1adir ejes coordenados\r\n        createCoordinateAxes(orbitalGroup);\r\n        \r\n        svg.appendChild(orbitalGroup);\r\n        orbitalCanvas.appendChild(svg);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== CREAR GRID DE REFERENCIA ==========\r\n    function createReferenceGrid(svg) {\r\n        const svgNS = \"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Grid horizontal\r\n        for (let i = 0; i <= 300; i += 30) {\r\n            const lineH = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"line\");\r\n            lineH.setAttribute(\"x1\", \"0\");\r\n            lineH.setAttribute(\"y1\", i);\r\n            lineH.setAttribute(\"x2\", \"300\");\r\n            lineH.setAttribute(\"y2\", i);\r\n            lineH.setAttribute(\"stroke\", \"rgba(0, 255, 204, 0.1)\");\r\n            lineH.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"1\");\r\n            svg.appendChild(lineH);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Grid vertical\r\n        for (let i = 0; i <= 300; i += 30) {\r\n            const lineV = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"line\");\r\n            lineV.setAttribute(\"x1\", i);\r\n            lineV.setAttribute(\"y1\", \"0\");\r\n            lineV.setAttribute(\"x2\", i);\r\n            lineV.setAttribute(\"y2\", \"300\");\r\n            lineV.setAttribute(\"stroke\", \"rgba(0, 255, 204, 0.1)\");\r\n            lineV.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"1\");\r\n            svg.appendChild(lineV);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== CREAR EJES COORDENADOS ==========\r\n    function createCoordinateAxes(group) {\r\n        const svgNS = \"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Eje X (rojo)\r\n        const axisX = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"line\");\r\n        axisX.setAttribute(\"x1\", \"-120\");\r\n        axisX.setAttribute(\"y1\", \"0\");\r\n        axisX.setAttribute(\"x2\", \"120\");\r\n        axisX.setAttribute(\"y2\", \"0\");\r\n        axisX.setAttribute(\"stroke\", \"#ff3366\");\r\n        axisX.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"2\");\r\n        group.appendChild(axisX);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Eje Y (verde)\r\n        const axisY = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"line\");\r\n        axisY.setAttribute(\"x1\", \"0\");\r\n        axisY.setAttribute(\"y1\", \"-120\");\r\n        axisY.setAttribute(\"x2\", \"0\");\r\n        axisY.setAttribute(\"y2\", \"120\");\r\n        axisY.setAttribute(\"stroke\", \"#00ff00\");\r\n        axisY.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"2\");\r\n        group.appendChild(axisY);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Eje Z (azul)\r\n        const axisZ = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"line\");\r\n        axisZ.setAttribute(\"x1\", \"0\");\r\n        axisZ.setAttribute(\"y1\", \"0\");\r\n        axisZ.setAttribute(\"x2\", \"85\");\r\n        axisZ.setAttribute(\"y2\", \"85\");\r\n        axisZ.setAttribute(\"stroke\", \"#3366ff\");\r\n        axisZ.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"2\");\r\n        axisZ.setAttribute(\"stroke-dasharray\", \"5,5\");\r\n        group.appendChild(axisZ);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Etiquetas de ejes\r\n        const labels = [\r\n            {text: \"X\", x: 130, y: 10, color: \"#ff3366\"},\r\n            {text: \"Y\", x: 10, y: -130, color: \"#00ff00\"},\r\n            {text: \"Z\", x: 100, y: 100, color: \"#3366ff\"}\r\n        ];\r\n        \r\n        labels.forEach(label => {\r\n            const text = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"text\");\r\n            text.setAttribute(\"x\", label.x);\r\n            text.setAttribute(\"y\", label.y);\r\n            text.setAttribute(\"fill\", label.color);\r\n            text.setAttribute(\"font-family\", \"Courier New\");\r\n            text.setAttribute(\"font-size\", \"14\");\r\n            text.setAttribute(\"font-weight\", \"bold\");\r\n            text.textContent = label.text;\r\n            group.appendChild(text);\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== DIBUJAR ORBITAL ==========\r\n    function drawOrbital(orbitalType) {\r\n        const orbital = orbitalData[orbitalType];\r\n        const group = document.getElementById('orbital-group');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar orbital anterior\r\n        const oldOrbital = document.getElementById('orbital-shape');\r\n        if (oldOrbital) oldOrbital.remove();\r\n        \r\n        const svgNS = \"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\";\r\n        const orbitalShape = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"g\");\r\n        orbitalShape.setAttribute(\"id\", \"orbital-shape\");\r\n        \r\n        switch(orbital.shape) {\r\n            case 'sphere':\r\n                drawSphericalOrbital(orbitalShape, orbital);\r\n                break;\r\n            case 'dumbbell-z':\r\n                drawDumbbellOrbital(orbitalShape, orbital);\r\n                break;\r\n            case 'cloverleaf-xy':\r\n                drawCloverleafOrbital(orbitalShape, orbital);\r\n                break;\r\n            case 'complex':\r\n                drawComplexOrbital(orbitalShape, orbital);\r\n                break;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        group.appendChild(orbitalShape);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ A\u00f1adir informaci\u00f3n de densidad\r\n        addDensityInfo(orbitalShape, orbital);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar rotaci\u00f3n actual\r\n        updateRotation();\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== DIBUJAR ORBITAL ESF\u00c9RICO (s) ==========\r\n    function drawSphericalOrbital(group, orbital) {\r\n        const svgNS = \"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Esfera principal (probabilidad)\r\n        const sphere = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"circle\");\r\n        sphere.setAttribute(\"cx\", \"0\");\r\n        sphere.setAttribute(\"cy\", \"0\");\r\n        sphere.setAttribute(\"r\", \"80\");\r\n        sphere.setAttribute(\"fill\", orbital.color);\r\n        sphere.setAttribute(\"fill-opacity\", \"0.3\");\r\n        sphere.setAttribute(\"stroke\", orbital.color);\r\n        sphere.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"2\");\r\n        group.appendChild(sphere);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ N\u00facleo at\u00f3mico\r\n        const nucleus = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"circle\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"cx\", \"0\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"cy\", \"0\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"r\", \"10\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"#ff0000\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"stroke\", \"#ff6666\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"2\");\r\n        group.appendChild(nucleus);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Electrones (puntos aleatorios)\r\n        for (let i = 0; i < 50; i++) {\r\n            const angle = Math.random() * 2 * Math.PI;\r\n            const radius = Math.random() * 70;\r\n            const electron = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"circle\");\r\n            electron.setAttribute(\"cx\", radius * Math.cos(angle));\r\n            electron.setAttribute(\"cy\", radius * Math.sin(angle));\r\n            electron.setAttribute(\"r\", \"1.5\");\r\n            electron.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"#ffff00\");\r\n            electron.setAttribute(\"opacity\", \"0.7\");\r\n            group.appendChild(electron);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== DIBUJAR ORBITAL DUMBBELL (p) ==========\r\n    function drawDumbbellOrbital(group, orbital) {\r\n        const svgNS = \"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ L\u00f3bulo positivo (arriba)\r\n        const lobePositive = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"ellipse\");\r\n        lobePositive.setAttribute(\"cx\", \"0\");\r\n        lobePositive.setAttribute(\"cy\", \"-60\");\r\n        lobePositive.setAttribute(\"rx\", \"40\");\r\n        lobePositive.setAttribute(\"ry\", \"60\");\r\n        lobePositive.setAttribute(\"fill\", orbital.color);\r\n        lobePositive.setAttribute(\"fill-opacity\", \"0.3\");\r\n        lobePositive.setAttribute(\"stroke\", orbital.color);\r\n        lobePositive.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"2\");\r\n        group.appendChild(lobePositive);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ L\u00f3bulo negativo (abajo)\r\n        const lobeNegative = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"ellipse\");\r\n        lobeNegative.setAttribute(\"cx\", \"0\");\r\n        lobeNegative.setAttribute(\"cy\", \"60\");\r\n        lobeNegative.setAttribute(\"rx\", \"40\");\r\n        lobeNegative.setAttribute(\"ry\", \"60\");\r\n        lobeNegative.setAttribute(\"fill\", orbital.color);\r\n        lobeNegative.setAttribute(\"fill-opacity\", \"0.3\");\r\n        lobeNegative.setAttribute(\"stroke\", orbital.color);\r\n        lobeNegative.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"2\");\r\n        group.appendChild(lobeNegative);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Nodo (plano nodal)\r\n        const node = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"line\");\r\n        node.setAttribute(\"x1\", \"-50\");\r\n        node.setAttribute(\"y1\", \"0\");\r\n        node.setAttribute(\"x2\", \"50\");\r\n        node.setAttribute(\"y2\", \"0\");\r\n        node.setAttribute(\"stroke\", \"#ffff00\");\r\n        node.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"1\");\r\n        node.setAttribute(\"stroke-dasharray\", \"5,5\");\r\n        group.appendChild(node);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ N\u00facleo\r\n        const nucleus = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"circle\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"cx\", \"0\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"cy\", \"0\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"r\", \"8\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"#ff0000\");\r\n        group.appendChild(nucleus);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== DIBUJAR ORBITAL CLOVERLEAF (d) ==========\r\n    function drawCloverleafOrbital(group, orbital) {\r\n        const svgNS = \"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Cuatro l\u00f3bulos en forma de tr\u00e9bol\r\n        const lobes = [\r\n            {x: -60, y: -60, sign: '+'},\r\n            {x: 60, y: -60, sign: '-'},\r\n            {x: -60, y: 60, sign: '-'},\r\n            {x: 60, y: 60, sign: '+'}\r\n        ];\r\n        \r\n        lobes.forEach(lobe => {\r\n            \/\/ L\u00f3bulo principal\r\n            const lobeShape = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"ellipse\");\r\n            lobeShape.setAttribute(\"cx\", lobe.x);\r\n            lobeShape.setAttribute(\"cy\", lobe.y);\r\n            lobeShape.setAttribute(\"rx\", \"40\");\r\n            lobeShape.setAttribute(\"ry\", \"40\");\r\n            lobeShape.setAttribute(\"fill\", orbital.color);\r\n            lobeShape.setAttribute(\"fill-opacity\", lobe.sign === '+' ? \"0.4\" : \"0.2\");\r\n            lobeShape.setAttribute(\"stroke\", orbital.color);\r\n            lobeShape.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"2\");\r\n            group.appendChild(lobeShape);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Signo de fase\r\n            const phase = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"text\");\r\n            phase.setAttribute(\"x\", lobe.x);\r\n            phase.setAttribute(\"y\", lobe.y);\r\n            phase.setAttribute(\"text-anchor\", \"middle\");\r\n            phase.setAttribute(\"dominant-baseline\", \"middle\");\r\n            phase.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"#ffffff\");\r\n            phase.setAttribute(\"font-family\", \"Courier New\");\r\n            phase.setAttribute(\"font-size\", \"16\");\r\n            phase.setAttribute(\"font-weight\", \"bold\");\r\n            phase.textContent = lobe.sign;\r\n            group.appendChild(phase);\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Nodos (ejes X e Y)\r\n        const nodeX = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"line\");\r\n        nodeX.setAttribute(\"x1\", \"-100\");\r\n        nodeX.setAttribute(\"y1\", \"0\");\r\n        nodeX.setAttribute(\"x2\", \"100\");\r\n        nodeX.setAttribute(\"y2\", \"0\");\r\n        nodeX.setAttribute(\"stroke\", \"#ffff00\");\r\n        nodeX.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"1\");\r\n        nodeX.setAttribute(\"stroke-dasharray\", \"5,5\");\r\n        group.appendChild(nodeX);\r\n        \r\n        const nodeY = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"line\");\r\n        nodeY.setAttribute(\"x1\", \"0\");\r\n        nodeY.setAttribute(\"y1\", \"-100\");\r\n        nodeY.setAttribute(\"x2\", \"0\");\r\n        nodeY.setAttribute(\"y2\", \"100\");\r\n        nodeY.setAttribute(\"stroke\", \"#ffff00\");\r\n        nodeY.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"1\");\r\n        nodeY.setAttribute(\"stroke-dasharray\", \"5,5\");\r\n        group.appendChild(nodeY);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ N\u00facleo\r\n        const nucleus = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"circle\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"cx\", \"0\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"cy\", \"0\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"r\", \"6\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"#ff0000\");\r\n        group.appendChild(nucleus);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== DIBUJAR ORBITAL COMPLEJO (f) ==========\r\n    function drawComplexOrbital(group, orbital) {\r\n        const svgNS = \"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ 8 l\u00f3bulos complejos\r\n        for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {\r\n            const angle = (i * Math.PI) \/ 4;\r\n            const distance = 70;\r\n            const x = distance * Math.cos(angle);\r\n            const y = distance * Math.sin(angle);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ L\u00f3bulo\r\n            const lobe = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"path\");\r\n            const sign = i % 2 === 0 ? '+' : '-';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Crear forma compleja\r\n            const d = createComplexLobePath(x, y, sign);\r\n            lobe.setAttribute(\"d\", d);\r\n            lobe.setAttribute(\"fill\", orbital.color);\r\n            lobe.setAttribute(\"fill-opacity\", sign === '+' ? \"0.3\" : \"0.15\");\r\n            lobe.setAttribute(\"stroke\", orbital.color);\r\n            lobe.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"1.5\");\r\n            group.appendChild(lobe);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Indicador de fase\r\n            if (Math.abs(x) > 20 || Math.abs(y) > 20) {\r\n                const phase = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"text\");\r\n                phase.setAttribute(\"x\", x * 1.3);\r\n                phase.setAttribute(\"y\", y * 1.3);\r\n                phase.setAttribute(\"text-anchor\", \"middle\");\r\n                phase.setAttribute(\"dominant-baseline\", \"middle\");\r\n                phase.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"#ffffff\");\r\n                phase.setAttribute(\"font-family\", \"Courier New\");\r\n                phase.setAttribute(\"font-size\", \"12\");\r\n                phase.setAttribute(\"font-weight\", \"bold\");\r\n                phase.textContent = sign;\r\n                group.appendChild(phase);\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ M\u00faltiples nodos\r\n        for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\r\n            const angle = (i * Math.PI) \/ 3;\r\n            const node = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"line\");\r\n            const length = 120;\r\n            node.setAttribute(\"x1\", length * Math.cos(angle));\r\n            node.setAttribute(\"y1\", length * Math.sin(angle));\r\n            node.setAttribute(\"x2\", -length * Math.cos(angle));\r\n            node.setAttribute(\"y2\", -length * Math.sin(angle));\r\n            node.setAttribute(\"stroke\", \"#ffff00\");\r\n            node.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"1\");\r\n            node.setAttribute(\"stroke-dasharray\", \"3,3\");\r\n            node.setAttribute(\"opacity\", \"0.6\");\r\n            group.appendChild(node);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ N\u00facleo central\r\n        const nucleus = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"circle\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"cx\", \"0\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"cy\", \"0\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"r\", \"5\");\r\n        nucleus.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"#ff0000\");\r\n        group.appendChild(nucleus);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== CREAR PATH COMPLEJO PARA L\u00d3BULOS f ==========\r\n    function createComplexLobePath(x, y, sign) {\r\n        const size = 35;\r\n        const complexity = sign === '+' ? 1.2 : 0.8;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Puntos de control para curva B\u00e9zier\r\n        const cp1x = x + size * complexity * 0.5;\r\n        const cp1y = y + size * complexity * 0.3;\r\n        const cp2x = x + size * complexity * 0.3;\r\n        const cp2y = y + size * complexity * 0.5;\r\n        \r\n        return `M ${x} ${y} \r\n                C ${cp1x} ${cp1y}, ${cp2x} ${cp2y}, ${x + size} ${y + size}\r\n                S ${x} ${y + size * 1.5}, ${x - size} ${y + size}\r\n                S ${x - size * 1.5} ${y}, ${x - size} ${y - size}\r\n                S ${x} ${y - size * 1.5}, ${x + size} ${y - size}\r\n                Z`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== A\u00d1ADIR INFORMACI\u00d3N DE DENSIDAD ==========\r\n    function addDensityInfo(group, orbital) {\r\n        const svgNS = \"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Leyenda de densidad\r\n        const legend = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"g\");\r\n        legend.setAttribute(\"id\", \"density-legend\");\r\n        legend.setAttribute(\"transform\", \"translate(-140, -140)\");\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ T\u00edtulo leyenda\r\n        const title = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"text\");\r\n        title.setAttribute(\"x\", \"0\");\r\n        title.setAttribute(\"y\", \"-10\");\r\n        title.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"#00ffcc\");\r\n        title.setAttribute(\"font-family\", \"Courier New\");\r\n        title.setAttribute(\"font-size\", \"10\");\r\n        title.textContent = \"Densidad electr\u00f3nica:\";\r\n        legend.appendChild(title);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Barras de densidad\r\n        for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\r\n            const y = i * 15;\r\n            const opacity = 0.2 + i * 0.3;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Barra\r\n            const bar = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"rect\");\r\n            bar.setAttribute(\"x\", \"0\");\r\n            bar.setAttribute(\"y\", y);\r\n            bar.setAttribute(\"width\", \"20\");\r\n            bar.setAttribute(\"height\", \"10\");\r\n            bar.setAttribute(\"fill\", orbital.color);\r\n            bar.setAttribute(\"fill-opacity\", opacity);\r\n            legend.appendChild(bar);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Etiqueta\r\n            const label = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"text\");\r\n            label.setAttribute(\"x\", \"30\");\r\n            label.setAttribute(\"y\", y + 8);\r\n            label.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"#ffffff\");\r\n            label.setAttribute(\"font-family\", \"Courier New\");\r\n            label.setAttribute(\"font-size\", \"9\");\r\n            label.textContent = i === 0 ? \"Baja\" : i === 1 ? \"Media\" : \"Alta\";\r\n            legend.appendChild(label);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        group.appendChild(legend);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== ACTUALIZAR INFORMACI\u00d3N DEL ORBITAL ==========\r\n    function updateOrbitalInfo() {\r\n        const orbital = orbitalData[currentOrbital];\r\n        \r\n        orbitalN.textContent = orbital.n;\r\n        orbitalL.textContent = orbital.l;\r\n        orbitalMl.textContent = orbital.ml;\r\n        orbitalNodes.textContent = orbital.angularNodes;\r\n        radialNodes.textContent = orbital.radialNodes;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Calcular nodos radiales = n - l - 1\r\n        const calculatedRadialNodes = orbital.n - orbital.l - 1;\r\n        radialNodes.textContent = calculatedRadialNodes;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== ROTAR ORBITAL ==========\r\n    function toggleRotation() {\r\n        if (isRotating) {\r\n            stopRotation();\r\n            rotateButton.textContent = 'Rotar Orbital';\r\n            rotateButton.style.background = 'linear-gradient(to bottom, #ff00ff, #9900cc)';\r\n        } else {\r\n            startRotation();\r\n            rotateButton.textContent = 'Detener Rotaci\u00f3n';\r\n            rotateButton.style.background = 'linear-gradient(to bottom, #ff3366, #cc0000)';\r\n        }\r\n        isRotating = !isRotating;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function startRotation() {\r\n        rotationInterval = setInterval(() => {\r\n            rotationAngle = (rotationAngle + 2) % 360;\r\n            updateRotation();\r\n        }, 50);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function stopRotation() {\r\n        if (rotationInterval) {\r\n            clearInterval(rotationInterval);\r\n            rotationInterval = null;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function updateRotation() {\r\n        const orbitalGroup = document.getElementById('orbital-group');\r\n        if (orbitalGroup) {\r\n            orbitalGroup.setAttribute('transform', `translate(150, 150) rotate(${rotationAngle})`);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== CAMBIAR ORBITAL ==========\r\n    function changeOrbital() {\r\n        currentOrbital = orbitalSelect.value;\r\n        if (isRotating) {\r\n            stopRotation();\r\n            isRotating = false;\r\n            rotateButton.textContent = 'Rotar Orbital';\r\n            rotateButton.style.background = 'linear-gradient(to bottom, #ff00ff, #9900cc)';\r\n        }\r\n        drawOrbital(currentOrbital);\r\n        updateOrbitalInfo();\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== ESPECTRO DE EMISI\u00d3N DEL HIDR\u00d3GENO ==========\r\n    function initSpectrumSimulator() {\r\n        const spectralTransition = document.getElementById('spectral-transition');\r\n        const wavelength = document.getElementById('wavelength');\r\n        const photonEnergy = document.getElementById('photon-energy');\r\n        const lineColor = document.getElementById('line-color');\r\n        const spectrumDisplay = document.getElementById('spectrum-display');\r\n\r\n        const balmerLines = {\r\n            3: {lambda: 656.3, energy: 1.89, color: 'red', name: 'H\u03b1', rgb: '#ff0000'},\r\n            4: {lambda: 486.1, energy: 2.55, color: 'blue-green', name: 'H\u03b2', rgb: '#00ffcc'},\r\n            5: {lambda: 434.0, energy: 2.86, color: 'blue', name: 'H\u03b3', rgb: '#0088ff'},\r\n            6: {lambda: 410.2, energy: 3.02, color: 'violet', name: 'H\u03b4', rgb: '#cc00ff'}\r\n        };\r\n\r\n        function updateSpectrum() {\r\n            const n = parseInt(spectralTransition.value);\r\n            const line = balmerLines[n];\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Actualizar valores\r\n            wavelength.textContent = line.lambda;\r\n            photonEnergy.textContent = line.energy;\r\n            lineColor.textContent = line.name + ' (' + line.color + ')';\r\n            lineColor.style.color = line.rgb;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Actualizar visualizaci\u00f3n del espectro\r\n            updateSpectrumDisplay(line);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Animar transici\u00f3n\r\n            animateTransition(n);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function updateSpectrumDisplay(line) {\r\n            \/\/ Calcular posici\u00f3n en el espectro visible (380-780 nm)\r\n            const visibleMin = 380;\r\n            const visibleMax = 780;\r\n            const position = ((line.lambda - visibleMin) \/ (visibleMax - visibleMin)) * 100;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Limpiar display anterior\r\n            spectrumDisplay.innerHTML = '';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Crear l\u00ednea espectral\r\n            const spectralLine = document.createElement('div');\r\n            spectralLine.style.position = 'absolute';\r\n            spectralLine.style.top = '0';\r\n            spectralLine.style.bottom = '0';\r\n            spectralLine.style.left = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, position)) + '%';\r\n            spectralLine.style.width = '4px';\r\n            spectralLine.style.background = `linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, ${line.rgb}, transparent)`;\r\n            spectralLine.style.boxShadow = `0 0 10px ${line.rgb}, 0 0 20px ${line.rgb}`;\r\n            spectralLine.style.zIndex = '10';\r\n            spectralLine.style.opacity = '0';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Crear etiqueta\r\n            const label = document.createElement('div');\r\n            label.style.position = 'absolute';\r\n            label.style.top = '-25px';\r\n            label.style.left = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, position)) + '%';\r\n            label.style.transform = 'translateX(-50%)';\r\n            label.style.color = line.rgb;\r\n            label.style.fontFamily = 'Courier New';\r\n            label.style.fontWeight = 'bold';\r\n            label.style.fontSize = '12px';\r\n            label.style.textShadow = `0 0 5px \\{line.rgb}`;\r\n            label.textContent = line.lambda + ' nm';\r\n            label.style.opacity = '0';\r\n            \r\n            spectrumDisplay.appendChild(spectralLine);\r\n            spectrumDisplay.appendChild(label);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Animar aparici\u00f3n\r\n            setTimeout(() => {\r\n                spectralLine.style.transition = 'opacity 0.5s';\r\n                spectralLine.style.opacity = '1';\r\n                label.style.transition = 'opacity 0.5s';\r\n                label.style.opacity = '1';\r\n            }, 100);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ A\u00f1adir informaci\u00f3n de transici\u00f3n\r\n            const info = document.createElement('div');\r\n            info.style.position = 'absolute';\r\n            info.style.bottom = '-40px';\r\n            info.style.left = Math.max(10, Math.min(90, position)) + '%';\r\n            info.style.transform = 'translateX(-50%)';\r\n            info.style.background = 'rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8)';\r\n            info.style.color = line.rgb;\r\n            info.style.padding = '5px 10px';\r\n            info.style.borderRadius = '5px';\r\n            info.style.fontFamily = 'Courier New';\r\n            info.style.fontSize = '11px';\r\n            info.style.border = `1px solid ${line.rgb}`;\r\n            info.innerHTML = `n=${n} \u2192 2<br>\u0394E = ${line.energy} eV`;\r\n            info.style.opacity = '0';\r\n            \r\n            spectrumDisplay.appendChild(info);\r\n            \r\n            setTimeout(() => {\r\n                info.style.transition = 'opacity 0.5s';\r\n                info.style.opacity = '1';\r\n            }, 300);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function animateTransition(n) {\r\n            \/\/ Crear efecto de transici\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica\r\n            const transitionEffect = document.createElement('div');\r\n            transitionEffect.style.position = 'absolute';\r\n            transitionEffect.style.width = '300px';\r\n            transitionEffect.style.height = '300px';\r\n            transitionEffect.style.top = '50%';\r\n            transitionEffect.style.left = '50%';\r\n            transitionEffect.style.transform = 'translate(-50%, -50%)';\r\n            transitionEffect.style.pointerEvents = 'none';\r\n            transitionEffect.style.zIndex = '100';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Dibujar niveles de energ\u00eda\r\n            const svgNS = \"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\";\r\n            const svg = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"svg\");\r\n            svg.setAttribute(\"width\", \"300\");\r\n            svg.setAttribute(\"height\", \"300\");\r\n            svg.setAttribute(\"viewBox\", \"0 0 300 300\");\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Nivel inicial (alto)\r\n            const initialLevel = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"line\");\r\n            initialLevel.setAttribute(\"x1\", \"50\");\r\n            initialLevel.setAttribute(\"y1\", \"50\");\r\n            initialLevel.setAttribute(\"x2\", \"250\");\r\n            initialLevel.setAttribute(\"y2\", \"50\");\r\n            initialLevel.setAttribute(\"stroke\", \"#ffff00\");\r\n            initialLevel.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"3\");\r\n            initialLevel.setAttribute(\"stroke-dasharray\", \"5,5\");\r\n            svg.appendChild(initialLevel);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Nivel final (bajo)\r\n            const finalLevel = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"line\");\r\n            finalLevel.setAttribute(\"x1\", \"50\");\r\n            finalLevel.setAttribute(\"y1\", \"250\");\r\n            finalLevel.setAttribute(\"x2\", \"250\");\r\n            finalLevel.setAttribute(\"y2\", \"250\");\r\n            finalLevel.setAttribute(\"stroke\", \"#00ff00\");\r\n            finalLevel.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"3\");\r\n            svg.appendChild(finalLevel);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Electr\u00f3n que cae\r\n            const electron = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"circle\");\r\n            electron.setAttribute(\"cx\", \"150\");\r\n            electron.setAttribute(\"cy\", \"60\");\r\n            electron.setAttribute(\"r\", \"8\");\r\n            electron.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"#ffff00\");\r\n            electron.setAttribute(\"stroke\", \"#ff9900\");\r\n            electron.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"2\");\r\n            svg.appendChild(electron);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Flecha de transici\u00f3n\r\n            const arrow = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"path\");\r\n            arrow.setAttribute(\"d\", \"M 150 70 L 145 90 L 155 90 Z\");\r\n            arrow.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"#ff3366\");\r\n            svg.appendChild(arrow);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Fot\u00f3n emitido\r\n            const photon = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"path\");\r\n            photon.setAttribute(\"d\", \"M 160 150 Q 200 100 240 150\");\r\n            photon.setAttribute(\"stroke\", balmerLines[n].rgb);\r\n            photon.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"3\");\r\n            photon.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"none\");\r\n            photon.setAttribute(\"stroke-dasharray\", \"5,5\");\r\n            svg.appendChild(photon);\r\n            \r\n            transitionEffect.appendChild(svg);\r\n            document.querySelector('.spectrum-simulator').appendChild(transitionEffect);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n\r\n            setTimeout(() => {\r\n                electron.setAttribute(\"cy\", \"240\");\r\n                electron.style.transition = \"cy 1s ease-in-out\";\r\n            }, 500);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Remover despu\u00e9s de animaci\u00f3n\r\n            setTimeout(() => {\r\n                transitionEffect.remove();\r\n            }, 2000);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Event listeners\r\n        spectralTransition.addEventListener('change', updateSpectrum);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Inicializar\r\n        updateSpectrum();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Animar espectro continuamente\r\n        setInterval(() => {\r\n            const lines = spectrumDisplay.querySelectorAll('div[style*=\"position: absolute\"]');\r\n            lines.forEach(line => {\r\n                if (Math.random() > 0.7) {\r\n                    line.style.opacity = Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.5;\r\n                }\r\n            });\r\n        }, 500);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== EVENT LISTENERS ==========\r\n    orbitalSelect.addEventListener('change', changeOrbital);\r\n    rotateButton.addEventListener('click', toggleRotation);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== INICIALIZAR TODO ==========\r\n    initOrbitalVisualization();\r\n    initSpectrumSimulator();\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== A\u00d1ADIR CONTROLES DE ROTACI\u00d3N ADICIONALES ==========\r\n    function addRotationControls() {\r\n        const controlsDiv = document.querySelector('.orbital-selector .controls');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Bot\u00f3n para rotaci\u00f3n manual\r\n        const manualControl = document.createElement('div');\r\n        manualControl.style.marginTop = '10px';\r\n        manualControl.innerHTML = `\r\n            <label style=\"display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\">Rotaci\u00f3n manual:<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"manual-rotation\" min=\"0\" max=\"360\" value=\"0\" style=\"width: 150px;\">\r\n            <span id=\"rotation-angle\">0\u00b0<\/span>\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        controlsDiv.appendChild(manualControl);\r\n        \r\n        const manualSlider = document.getElementById('manual-rotation');\r\n        const rotationAngleDisplay = document.getElementById('rotation-angle');\r\n        \r\n        manualSlider.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n            if (!isRotating) {\r\n                rotationAngle = parseInt(this.value);\r\n                rotationAngleDisplay.textContent = rotationAngle + '\u00b0';\r\n                updateRotation();\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Bot\u00f3n para vista frontal\/lateral\r\n        const viewButtons = document.createElement('div');\r\n        viewButtons.style.marginTop = '10px';\r\n        viewButtons.innerHTML = `\r\n            <button id=\"front-view\" style=\"margin-right: 5px;\">Vista Frontal<\/button>\r\n            <button id=\"side-view\" style=\"margin-right: 5px;\">Vista Lateral<\/button>\r\n            <button id=\"top-view\">Vista Superior<\/button>\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        controlsDiv.appendChild(viewButtons);\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('front-view').addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n            rotationAngle = 0;\r\n            updateRotation();\r\n            manualSlider.value = 0;\r\n            rotationAngleDisplay.textContent = '0\u00b0';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('side-view').addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n            rotationAngle = 90;\r\n            updateRotation();\r\n            manualSlider.value = 90;\r\n            rotationAngleDisplay.textContent = '90\u00b0';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('top-view').addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n            rotationAngle = 180;\r\n            updateRotation();\r\n            manualSlider.value = 180;\r\n            rotationAngleDisplay.textContent = '180\u00b0';\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Inicializar controles adicionales\r\n    addRotationControls();\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== A\u00d1ADIR EFECTOS DE SONIDO (opcional) ==========\r\n    function addSoundEffects() {\r\n        const rotateSound = new Audio('data:audio\/wav;base64,UklGRigAAABXQVZFZm10IBIAAAABAAEAQB8AAEAfAAABAAgAZGF0YQ'); \/\/ Sonido placeholder\r\n        \r\n        rotateButton.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (isRotating) {\r\n                \/\/ Sonido de inicio de rotaci\u00f3n\r\n                rotateSound.play().catch(e => console.log(\"Sonido no disponible\"));\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        orbitalSelect.addEventListener('change', function() {\r\n            \/\/ Sonido de cambio de orbital\r\n            rotateSound.play().catch(e => console.log(\"Sonido no disponible\"));\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Inicializar efectos de sonido (comentado por defecto)\r\n    \/\/ addSoundEffects();\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== A\u00d1ADIR MODO OSCURO\/CLARO ==========\r\n    function addThemeToggle() {\r\n        const toggle = document.createElement('button');\r\n        toggle.id = 'theme-toggle';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '\ud83c\udf19 Modo Oscuro';\r\n        toggle.style.position = 'absolute';\r\n        toggle.style.top = '10px';\r\n        toggle.style.right = '10px';\r\n        toggle.style.zIndex = '1000';\r\n        \r\n        document.querySelector('.visualization-section').style.position = 'relative';\r\n        document.querySelector('.visualization-section').appendChild(toggle);\r\n        \r\n        toggle.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const isDark = document.body.classList.contains('light-theme');\r\n            if (isDark) {\r\n                document.body.classList.remove('light-theme');\r\n                toggle.textContent = '\ud83c\udf19 Modo Oscuro';\r\n                orbitalCanvas.style.background = '#000';\r\n            } else {\r\n                document.body.classList.add('light-theme');\r\n                toggle.textContent = '\u2600\ufe0f Modo Claro';\r\n                orbitalCanvas.style.background = '#fff';\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Inicializar toggle de tema\r\n    addThemeToggle();\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ========== A\u00d1ADIR GUARDADO DE PREFERENCIAS ==========\r\n    function savePreferences() {\r\n        const preferences = {\r\n            orbital: currentOrbital,\r\n            rotation: rotationAngle,\r\n            isRotating: isRotating,\r\n            theme: document.body.classList.contains('light-theme') ? 'light' : 'dark'\r\n        };\r\n        localStorage.setItem('quantumVisualizerPrefs', JSON.stringify(preferences));\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function loadPreferences() {\r\n        const saved = localStorage.getItem('quantumVisualizerPrefs');\r\n        if (saved) {\r\n            const prefs = JSON.parse(saved);\r\n            currentOrbital = prefs.orbital || '1s';\r\n            orbitalSelect.value = currentOrbital;\r\n            rotationAngle = prefs.rotation || 0;\r\n            \r\n            if (prefs.isRotating) {\r\n                toggleRotation();\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            if (prefs.theme === 'light') {\r\n                document.body.classList.add('light-theme');\r\n                document.getElementById('theme-toggle').textContent = '\u2600\ufe0f Modo Claro';\r\n                orbitalCanvas.style.background = '#fff';\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            drawOrbital(currentOrbital);\r\n            updateOrbitalInfo();\r\n            updateRotation();\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Guardar preferencias al salir\r\n    window.addEventListener('beforeunload', savePreferences);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Cargar preferencias al inicio\r\n    loadPreferences();\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== A\u00d1ADIR ESTILOS ADICIONALES ==========\r\nconst additionalStyles = `\r\n    .visualization-section {\r\n        position: relative;\r\n        overflow: hidden;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .orbital-canvas {\r\n        position: relative;\r\n        transition: all 0.3s;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .orbital-info {\r\n        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\r\n        border: 2px solid #00ffcc;\r\n        padding: 15px;\r\n        margin-top: 15px;\r\n        border-radius: 5px;\r\n        font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .orbital-info p {\r\n        margin: 8px 0;\r\n        color: #00ffcc;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .orbital-info span {\r\n        color: #ffff00;\r\n        font-weight: bold;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .spectrum-display {\r\n        position: relative;\r\n        border: 2px solid #000;\r\n        border-radius: 10px;\r\n        overflow: hidden;\r\n        box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 204, 0.3);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .spectrum-results {\r\n        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);\r\n        border: 1px solid #ff00ff;\r\n        padding: 15px;\r\n        border-radius: 5px;\r\n        margin-top: 15px;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .spectrum-results p {\r\n        margin: 8px 0;\r\n        color: #00ffcc;\r\n        font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .spectrum-results span {\r\n        color: #ffff00;\r\n        font-weight: bold;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .light-theme .orbital-canvas {\r\n        background: #fff !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .light-theme .orbital-info {\r\n        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\r\n        color: #000;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .light-theme .orbital-info p {\r\n        color: #000;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .light-theme .orbital-info span {\r\n        color: #0066cc;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .light-theme .spectrum-results {\r\n        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\r\n        color: #000;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .light-theme .spectrum-results p {\r\n        color: #000;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .light-theme .spectrum-results span {\r\n        color: #0066cc;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/* Animaciones *\/\r\n    @keyframes pulse {\r\n        0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\r\n        50% { opacity: 0.7; }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .pulse {\r\n        animation: pulse 2s infinite;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    @keyframes glow {\r\n        0%, 100% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px currentColor); }\r\n        50% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 15px currentColor); }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .glow {\r\n        animation: glow 2s infinite;\r\n    }\r\n`;\r\n\r\n\/\/ A\u00f1adir estilos al documento\r\nconst styleSheet = document.createElement(\"style\");\r\nstyleSheet.textContent = additionalStyles;\r\ndocument.head.appendChild(styleSheet);\r\n    <\/script>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- ========== 4. BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS ========== -->\r\n    <section class=\"interactive-section\">\r\n        <h2>\ud83c\udfae Laboratorio Cu\u00e1ntico Interactivo<\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Simulador 1: Modelo de Bohr -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-box\" id=\"sim-bohr\">\r\n            <h3>\u269b\ufe0f Simulador del Modelo de Bohr<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"controls\">\r\n                <label>N\u00famero cu\u00e1ntico principal (n):<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"bohr-n\" min=\"1\" max=\"7\" value=\"1\">\r\n                <span id=\"bohr-n-value\">1<\/span>\r\n                <br>\r\n                <label>Elemento (Z):<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"number\" id=\"bohr-Z\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"1\">\r\n                <span>(Hidrogenoide)<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results\">\r\n                <p>Energ\u00eda del nivel: <span id=\"bohr-energy\">-13.60<\/span> eV<\/p>\r\n                <p>Radio de la \u00f3rbita: <span id=\"bohr-radius\">0.529<\/span> \u00c5<\/p>\r\n                <p>Velocidad del electr\u00f3n: <span id=\"bohr-velocity\">2.19<\/span> \u00d710\u2076 m\/s<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"bohr-diagram\" id=\"bohr-diagram\">\r\n                <div style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #0066cc; position: relative; margin: 0 auto;\">\r\n                    <div id=\"nucleus\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px; background: red; border-radius: 50%; position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div id=\"electron\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; background: blue; border-radius: 50%; position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -150%);\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <p class=\"completion-badge\" id=\"bohr-badge\" style=\"display:none;\">\ud83c\udfc5 Maestro de Bohr<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Simulador 2: N\u00fameros Cu\u00e1nticos -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-box\" id=\"sim-quantum\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd22 Validador de N\u00fameros Cu\u00e1nticos<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Ingresa un conjunto de n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos para verificar si es v\u00e1lido seg\u00fan las reglas cu\u00e1nticas.<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"controls\">\r\n                <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                    <label>n:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"number\" id=\"qn-n\" min=\"1\" max=\"7\" value=\"1\">\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                    <label>l:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"number\" id=\"qn-l\" min=\"0\" max=\"6\" value=\"0\">\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                    <label>m\u2097:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"number\" id=\"qn-ml\" min=\"-3\" max=\"3\" value=\"0\">\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                    <label>m\u209b:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"qn-ms\">\r\n                        <option value=\"+0.5\">+\u00bd<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"-0.5\">-\u00bd<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button id=\"validate-qn\">Validar Conjunto<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"validation-result\" id=\"validation-result\">\r\n                <p>Esperando validaci\u00f3n...<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"orbital-info\" id=\"orbital-details\">\r\n                <p>Orbital: <span id=\"orbital-name\">1s<\/span><\/p>\r\n                <p>Capacidad m\u00e1xima: <span id=\"max-electrons\">2<\/span> electrones<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <p class=\"completion-badge\" id=\"quantum-badge\" style=\"display:none;\">\ud83c\udfc5 Arquitecto Cu\u00e1ntico<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Simulador 3: Configuraciones Electr\u00f3nicas -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-box\" id=\"sim-config\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd04 Constructor de Configuraciones Electr\u00f3nicas<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"controls\">\r\n                <label>N\u00famero at\u00f3mico (Z):<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"config-Z\" min=\"1\" max=\"36\" value=\"1\">\r\n                <span id=\"config-Z-value\">1 (Hidr\u00f3geno)<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results\">\r\n                <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n esperada:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <div id=\"expected-config\" style=\"background: #f0f0f0; padding: 10px; margin: 10px 0; font-family: monospace;\">1s\u00b9<\/div>\r\n                <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n real:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <div id=\"real-config\" style=\"background: #e0ffe0; padding: 10px; margin: 10px 0; font-family: monospace; font-weight: bold;\">1s\u00b9<\/div>\r\n                <p id=\"exception-note\" style=\"color: #cc0000; font-style: italic;\"><\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"aufbau-diagram\" id=\"aufbau-diagram\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(10, 30px); gap: 5px; margin: 20px 0;\">\r\n                <!-- Los orbitales se dibujar\u00e1n aqu\u00ed -->\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <p class=\"completion-badge\" id=\"config-badge\" style=\"display:none;\">\ud83c\udfc5 Configurador Experto<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Quiz Interactivo -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-box\" id=\"quiz-box\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83e\udde0 Quiz de Autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n            <div id=\"quiz-progress\">Pregunta 1 de 5<\/div>\r\n            <div id=\"quiz-question\">\r\n                <p><strong>Pregunta:<\/strong> \u00bfCu\u00e1l es el n\u00famero cu\u00e1ntico que determina la forma del orbital?<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div id=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz-answer\" value=\"0\"> n (principal)<\/label><br>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz-answer\" value=\"1\"> l (azimutal)<\/label><br>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz-answer\" value=\"2\"> m\u2097 (magn\u00e9tico)<\/label><br>\r\n                <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz-answer\" value=\"3\"> m\u209b (esp\u00edn)<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button id=\"quiz-submit\">Verificar Respuesta<\/button>\r\n            <button id=\"quiz-next\" style=\"display:none;\">Siguiente Pregunta<\/button>\r\n            <div id=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px;\"><\/div>\r\n            <div id=\"quiz-score\" style=\"margin-top: 15px;\">\r\n                <p>Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"score-value\">0<\/span>\/5<\/p>\r\n                <progress id=\"quiz-progress-bar\" value=\"0\" max=\"5\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><\/progress>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ========== 5. ERRORES COMUNES ========== -->\r\n    <section class=\"errors-section\">\r\n        <h2>\u26a0\ufe0f Errores Comunes del Estudiante<\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errors-interactive\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u274c Confundir \u00f3rbita con orbital<\/h4>\r\n                <p><strong>Error:<\/strong> Pensar que los electrones siguen trayectorias definidas como planetas.<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Los orbitales son regiones de probabilidad, no trayectorias. El principio de incertidumbre de Heisenberg proh\u00edbe conocer posici\u00f3n y momento simult\u00e1neamente.<\/p>\r\n                <button class=\"error-example-btn\" data-error=\"1\">Ver ejemplo<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u274c Aplicar modelo de Bohr a todo<\/h4>\r\n                <p><strong>Error:<\/strong> Usar E = -13.6\/n\u00b2 eV para \u00e1tomos multielectr\u00f3nicos.<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El modelo de Bohr solo es exacto para hidr\u00f3geno e iones hidrogenoides (un solo electr\u00f3n). En \u00e1tomos multielectr\u00f3nicos, el apantallamiento cambia las energ\u00edas.<\/p>\r\n                <button class=\"error-example-btn\" data-error=\"2\">Ver ejemplo<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u274c Malinterpretar n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos<\/h4>\r\n                <p><strong>Error:<\/strong> Creer que l puede ser igual o mayor que n.<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> l va de 0 a n-1. Para n=2, l solo puede ser 0 o 1 (orbitales s o p).<\/p>\r\n                <button class=\"error-example-btn\" data-error=\"3\">Probar validaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u274c Olvidar el principio de exclusi\u00f3n de Pauli<\/h4>\r\n                <p><strong>Error:<\/strong> Poner dos electrones con los mismos cuatro n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos.<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> En un mismo \u00e1tomo, no puede haber dos electrones con los mismos valores de n, l, m\u2097 y m\u209b.<\/p>\r\n                <button class=\"error-example-btn\" data-error=\"4\">Ver demostraci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div id=\"error-demo\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; padding: 15px; background: #fff3cd; border: 1px solid #ffeaa7; display: none;\">\r\n            <h4>Demostraci\u00f3n del Error<\/h4>\r\n            <div id=\"error-demo-content\"><\/div>\r\n            <button id=\"close-error-demo\">Cerrar<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ========== 6. CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA ========== -->\r\n    <section class=\"connection-section\">\r\n        <h2>\ud83d\udcd8 Conexi\u00f3n con Qu\u00edmica I - Plan de Estudios Oficial<\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"curriculum-map\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udcda Contenidos Relacionados en el Temario:<\/h4>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>Tema 2.1:<\/strong> Modelos at\u00f3micos y evoluci\u00f3n hist\u00f3rica<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Tema 2.2:<\/strong> N\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos y configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Tema 2.3:<\/strong> Tabla peri\u00f3dica y propiedades peri\u00f3dicas<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Tema 2.4:<\/strong> Espectros at\u00f3micos y aplicaciones<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            \r\n            <h4>\ud83c\udfaf Competencias Evaluadas:<\/h4>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>Interpretar espectros de emisi\u00f3n at\u00f3mica<\/li>\r\n                <li>Determinar configuraciones electr\u00f3nicas<\/li>\r\n                <li>Predecir propiedades peri\u00f3dicas basadas en la estructura electr\u00f3nica<\/li>\r\n                <li>Resolver problemas cuantitativos sobre energ\u00edas de transici\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            \r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udcdd Tipo de Preguntas en Ex\u00e1menes (PAU\/EBAU):<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"exam-examples\">\r\n                <p><strong>Ejemplo 1:<\/strong> \"Justifica por qu\u00e9 el modelo de Bohr no puede explicar el espectro del helio.\" (2 puntos)<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Ejemplo 2:<\/strong> \"Calcula la longitud de onda de la l\u00ednea H\u03b2 en la serie de Balmer.\" (1.5 puntos)<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Ejemplo 3:<\/strong> \"Indica los cuatro n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos del \u00faltimo electr\u00f3n del azufre (Z=16).\" (1.5 puntos)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ========== 7. PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN ========== -->\r\n    <section class=\"exam-problems-section\">\r\n        <h2>\ud83d\udcdd Problemas Tipo Examen (Papel y L\u00e1piz)<\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n            <div class=\"problem-header\">\r\n                <h4>Problema 1 - Justificaci\u00f3n Te\u00f3rica (2 puntos)<\/h4>\r\n                <span class=\"problem-time\">\u23f1\ufe0f Tiempo estimado: 8 minutos<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problem-content\">\r\n                <p>Explica detalladamente por qu\u00e9 el modelo at\u00f3mico de Bohr, pese a su \u00e9xito con el hidr\u00f3geno, resulta insuficiente para describir \u00e1tomos con m\u00e1s de un electr\u00f3n. Incluye en tu respuesta:<\/p>\r\n                <ol type=\"a\">\r\n                    <li>La limitaci\u00f3n matem\u00e1tica del modelo<\/li>\r\n                    <li>El efecto de las repulsiones electr\u00f3n-electr\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                    <li>El concepto de apantallamiento y carga nuclear efectiva<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Un ejemplo concreto (helio o litio)<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n            <div class=\"problem-header\">\r\n                <h4>Problema 2 - C\u00e1lculo Num\u00e9rico (3 puntos)<\/h4>\r\n                <span class=\"problem-time\">\u23f1\ufe0f Tiempo estimado: 12 minutos<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problem-content\">\r\n                <p>Para el \u00e1tomo de hidr\u00f3geno:<\/p>\r\n                <ol type=\"a\">\r\n                    <li>Calcula la energ\u00eda (en eV y kJ\/mol) del fot\u00f3n emitido cuando un electr\u00f3n pasa del nivel n=4 al n=2.<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Determina la longitud de onda de este fot\u00f3n en nan\u00f3metros.<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Indica a qu\u00e9 serie espectral pertenece esta transici\u00f3n y su color aproximado.<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Si se observa esta l\u00ednea en el espectro de una galaxia lejana con un corrimiento al rojo de 5 nm, \u00bfa qu\u00e9 velocidad se aleja la galaxia? (Usa la ley de Hubble simplificada: \u0394\u03bb\/\u03bb = v\/c)<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <p><strong>Datos:<\/strong> R_H = 1.097\u00d710\u2077 m\u207b\u00b9, h = 6.626\u00d710\u207b\u00b3\u2074 J\u00b7s, c = 3.00\u00d710\u2078 m\/s, 1 eV = 1.602\u00d710\u207b\u00b9\u2079 J<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n            <div class=\"problem-header\">\r\n                <h4>Problema 3 - Razonamiento y Configuraciones (2.5 puntos)<\/h4>\r\n                <span class=\"problem-time\">\u23f1\ufe0f Tiempo estimado: 10 minutos<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problem-content\">\r\n                <p>Dado un electr\u00f3n con los siguientes n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos: n=3, l=2, m\u2097=-1, m\u209b=+\u00bd<\/p>\r\n                <ol type=\"a\">\r\n                    <li>\u00bfEn qu\u00e9 orbital se encuentra este electr\u00f3n? (especifica con n y tipo)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>\u00bfCu\u00e1ntos orbitales hay con el mismo valor de l en este nivel?<\/li>\r\n                    <li>\u00bfCu\u00e1ntos electrones pueden haber en el mismo nivel (n=3) con m\u2097=-1?<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Escribe la configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica esperada para el \u00e1tomo de cromo (Z=24) y explica por qu\u00e9 presenta una excepci\u00f3n al principio de Aufbau.<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n            <div class=\"problem-header\">\r\n                <h4>Problema 4 - An\u00e1lisis Experimental (2.5 puntos)<\/h4>\r\n                <span class=\"problem-time\">\u23f1\ufe0f Tiempo estimado: 15 minutos<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problem-content\">\r\n                <p>Un estudiante obtiene el siguiente espectro de emisi\u00f3n para un elemento desconocido:<\/p>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>L\u00ednea A: 410.2 nm (violeta intensa)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>L\u00ednea B: 434.0 nm (azul-violeta)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>L\u00ednea C: 486.1 nm (azul-verde)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>L\u00ednea D: 656.3 nm (rojo)<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n                <ol type=\"a\">\r\n                    <li>Identifica el elemento y justifica tu respuesta.<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Asigna cada l\u00ednea a una transici\u00f3n espec\u00edfica (indicando niveles inicial y final).<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Calcula la energ\u00eda de la l\u00ednea m\u00e1s energ\u00e9tica en kJ\/mol.<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Predice la longitud de onda de la siguiente l\u00ednea de la misma serie (n=7\u21922).<\/li>\r\n                    <li>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 este espectro es caracter\u00edstico solo de elementos con un solo electr\u00f3n?<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ========== 8. CIERRE METACOGNITIVO ========== -->\r\n    <section class=\"metacognitive-section\">\r\n        <h2>\ud83e\udde0 Reflexi\u00f3n Final y Autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"reflection-questions\">\r\n            <div class=\"reflection-card\">\r\n                <h4>1. Evoluci\u00f3n de tu comprensi\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n                <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo ha cambiado tu visi\u00f3n del \u00e1tomo despu\u00e9s de esta lecci\u00f3n en comparaci\u00f3n con lo que aprendiste en cursos anteriores? Describe al menos dos conceptos que ahora entiendes de manera diferente.<\/p>\r\n                <textarea id=\"reflection-1\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"reflection-card\">\r\n                <h4>2. Concepto m\u00e1s desafiante<\/h4>\r\n                <p>\u00bfQu\u00e9 idea de la mec\u00e1nica cu\u00e1ntica te result\u00f3 m\u00e1s contraintuitiva o dif\u00edcil de aceptar? \u00bfC\u00f3mo la reconciliaste con la evidencia experimental presentada?<\/p>\r\n                <textarea id=\"reflection-2\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"reflection-card\">\r\n                <h4>3. Aplicaci\u00f3n al mundo real<\/h4>\r\n                <p>De todas las aplicaciones tecnol\u00f3gicas de la teor\u00eda cu\u00e1ntica (l\u00e1seres, RMN, LEDs, etc.), \u00bfcu\u00e1l te parece m\u00e1s impactante? Explica c\u00f3mo se relaciona directamente con los conceptos de orbitales o espectros estudiados.<\/p>\r\n                <textarea id=\"reflection-3\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"self-assessment\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n de Competencias<\/h4>\r\n            <p>Califica tu dominio en cada competencia (1= b\u00e1sico, 5= experto):<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"competency-rating\">\r\n                <div class=\"rating-item\">\r\n                    <span>Interpretar modelos at\u00f3micos<\/span>\r\n                    <div class=\"rating-stars\" data-competency=\"1\">\r\n                        <span class=\"star\" data-value=\"1\">\u2605<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"star\" data-value=\"2\">\u2605<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"star\" data-value=\"3\">\u2605<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"star\" data-value=\"4\">\u2605<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"star\" data-value=\"5\">\u2605<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"rating-item\">\r\n                    <span>Calcular energ\u00edas de transici\u00f3n<\/span>\r\n                    <div class=\"rating-stars\" data-competency=\"2\">\r\n                        <span class=\"star\" data-value=\"1\">\u2605<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"star\" data-value=\"2\">\u2605<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"star\" data-value=\"3\">\u2605<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"star\" data-value=\"4\">\u2605<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"star\" data-value=\"5\">\u2605<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"rating-item\">\r\n                    <span>Determinar configuraciones electr\u00f3nicas<\/span>\r\n                    <div class=\"rating-stars\" data-competency=\"3\">\r\n                        <span class=\"star\" data-value=\"1\">\u2605<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"star\" data-value=\"2\">\u2605<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"star\" data-value=\"3\">\u2605<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"star\" data-value=\"4\">\u2605<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"star\" data-value=\"5\">\u2605<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button id=\"save-reflection\">Guardar Reflexi\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n            <div id=\"reflection-saved\" style=\"display: none; color: green; margin-top: 10px;\">\u2705 Reflexi\u00f3n guardada<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"final-message\" id=\"final-message\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Felicidades! Has completado la lecci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Has explorado los fundamentos de la estructura at\u00f3mica cu\u00e1ntica, desde los modelos hist\u00f3ricos hasta las aplicaciones modernas. Tu comprensi\u00f3n ahora est\u00e1 lista para enfrentar problemas de examen y aplicar estos conceptos en qu\u00edmica avanzada.<\/p>\r\n            <div id=\"confetti-container\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ========== VARIABLES GLOBALES ==========\r\nlet quizScore = 0;\r\nlet currentQuestion = 0;\r\nconst quizData = [\r\n    {\r\n        question: \"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el n\u00famero cu\u00e1ntico que determina la forma del orbital?\",\r\n        options: [\"n (principal)\", \"l (azimutal)\", \"m\u2097 (magn\u00e9tico)\", \"m\u209b (esp\u00edn)\"],\r\n        correct: 1,\r\n        explanation: \"El n\u00famero cu\u00e1ntico azimutal (l) determina la forma del orbital: l=0 (s, esf\u00e9rico), l=1 (p, forma de dumbbell), l=2 (d, formas m\u00e1s complejas).\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        question: \"\u00bfCu\u00e1ntos orbitales hay en un subnivel d (l=2)?\",\r\n        options: [\"1\", \"3\", \"5\", \"7\"],\r\n        correct: 2,\r\n        explanation: \"Para l=2, m\u2097 puede ser -2, -1, 0, 1, 2 \u2192 5 valores distintos \u2192 5 orbitales d.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        question: \"\u00bfQu\u00e9 serie espectral del hidr\u00f3geno es visible al ojo humano?\",\r\n        options: [\"Lyman (UV)\", \"Balmer (visible)\", \"Paschen (IR)\", \"Brackett (IR lejano)\"],\r\n        correct: 1,\r\n        explanation: \"La serie de Balmer (transiciones a n=2) produce l\u00edneas en el espectro visible: H\u03b1 (rojo), H\u03b2 (verde-azul), H\u03b3 (azul), H\u03b4 (violeta).\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        question: \"Seg\u00fan el principio de exclusi\u00f3n de Pauli...\",\r\n        options: [\r\n            \"Los electrones llenan orbitales de menor a mayor energ\u00eda\",\r\n            \"No puede haber dos electrones con los mismos cuatro n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos\",\r\n            \"Los electrones se aparean solo despu\u00e9s de semillenar orbitales\",\r\n            \"La posici\u00f3n y momento no pueden conocerse simult\u00e1neamente\"\r\n        ],\r\n        correct: 1,\r\n        explanation: \"El principio de exclusi\u00f3n de Pauli establece que en un mismo \u00e1tomo no puede haber dos electrones con los mismos cuatro n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos (n, l, m\u2097, m\u209b).\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        question: \"\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica del cromo (Z=24)?\",\r\n        options: [\r\n            \"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2074\",\r\n            \"[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075\",\r\n            \"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2076\", \r\n            \"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2074 4p\u00b2\"\r\n        ],\r\n        correct: 1,\r\n        explanation: \"El cromo presenta excepci\u00f3n: [Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075 (no 4s\u00b2 3d\u2074) porque la subcapa d semillena (d\u2075) es m\u00e1s estable.\"\r\n    }\r\n];\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== SIMULADOR DE BOHR ==========\r\nconst bohrN = document.getElementById('bohr-n');\r\nconst bohrNValue = document.getElementById('bohr-n-value');\r\nconst bohrZ = document.getElementById('bohr-Z');\r\nconst bohrEnergy = document.getElementById('bohr-energy');\r\nconst bohrRadius = document.getElementById('bohr-radius');\r\nconst bohrVelocity = document.getElementById('bohr-velocity');\r\nconst bohrDiagram = document.getElementById('bohr-diagram');\r\nconst electron = document.getElementById('electron');\r\nconst bohrBadge = document.getElementById('bohr-badge');\r\n\r\nfunction updateBohrModel() {\r\n    const n = parseInt(bohrN.value);\r\n    const Z = parseInt(bohrZ.value);\r\n    \r\n    bohrNValue.textContent = n;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ C\u00e1lculos seg\u00fan el modelo de Bohr\r\n    const energy = -13.6 * Math.pow(Z, 2) \/ Math.pow(n, 2);\r\n    const radius = 0.529 * Math.pow(n, 2) \/ Z;\r\n    const velocity = 2.19 * Math.pow(10, 6) * Z \/ n;\r\n    \r\n    bohrEnergy.textContent = energy.toFixed(2);\r\n    bohrRadius.textContent = radius.toFixed(3);\r\n    bohrVelocity.textContent = velocity.toFixed(2);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Animar el electr\u00f3n\r\n    const orbitRadius = Math.min(140, 30 * n);\r\n    electron.style.transform = 'translate(-50%, -' + orbitRadius + 'px)';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Dibujar \u00f3rbitas\r\n    let orbitsHTML = '';\r\n    for(let i = 1; i <= Math.min(n, 5); i++) {\r\n        const r = 30 * i;\r\n        orbitsHTML += '<div class=\"orbit\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; width: ' + (2*r) + 'px; height: ' + (2*r) + 'px; border: 1px dashed #0066cc; border-radius: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"><\/div>';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    const nucleus = document.getElementById('nucleus');\r\n    nucleus.parentNode.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend', orbitsHTML);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Remover \u00f3rbitas antiguas (excepto la primera)\r\n    const oldOrbits = document.querySelectorAll('.orbit');\r\n    if(oldOrbits.length > 0) {\r\n        oldOrbits.forEach(function(orbit) {\r\n            orbit.remove();\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar badge si se alcanza alta velocidad\r\n    if (parseFloat(bohrVelocity.textContent) > 1e7) {\r\n        bohrBadge.style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nbohrN.addEventListener('input', updateBohrModel);\r\nbohrZ.addEventListener('input', updateBohrModel);\r\nupdateBohrModel();\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== VALIDADOR DE N\u00daMEROS CU\u00c1NTICOS ==========\r\nconst qnN = document.getElementById('qn-n');\r\nconst qnL = document.getElementById('qn-l');\r\nconst qnMl = document.getElementById('qn-ml');\r\nconst qnMs = document.getElementById('qn-ms');\r\nconst validateBtn = document.getElementById('validate-qn');\r\nconst validationResult = document.getElementById('validation-result');\r\nconst orbitalName = document.getElementById('orbital-name');\r\nconst maxElectrons = document.getElementById('max-electrons');\r\nconst quantumBadge = document.getElementById('quantum-badge');\r\n\r\nfunction validateQuantumNumbers() {\r\n    const n = parseInt(qnN.value);\r\n    const l = parseInt(qnL.value);\r\n    const ml = parseInt(qnMl.value);\r\n    const ms = parseFloat(qnMs.value);\r\n    \r\n    let isValid = true;\r\n    let errors = [];\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Regla 1: l debe estar entre 0 y n-1\r\n    if (l < 0 || l >= n) {\r\n        isValid = false;\r\n        errors.push('l debe estar entre 0 y ' + (n-1));\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Regla 2: |ml| debe ser \u2264 l\r\n    if (Math.abs(ml) > l) {\r\n        isValid = false;\r\n        errors.push('|m\u2097| debe ser \u2264 ' + l);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Regla 3: ms solo puede ser +\u00bd o -\u00bd (ya asegurado por el select)\r\n    \r\n    if (isValid) {\r\n        \/\/ Determinar tipo de orbital\r\n        const orbitalTypes = ['s', 'p', 'd', 'f', 'g', 'h', 'i'];\r\n        const type = orbitalTypes[l] || 'l=' + l;\r\n        \r\n        validationResult.innerHTML = \r\n            '<div style=\"color: green; background: #d4edda; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px;\">' +\r\n            '\u2705 <strong>Conjunto V\u00c1LIDO<\/strong><br>' +\r\n            'n=' + n + ', l=' + l + ', m\u2097=' + ml + ', m\u209b=' + (ms > 0 ? '+\u00bd' : '-\u00bd') +\r\n            '<\/div>';\r\n        \r\n        orbitalName.textContent = n + type;\r\n        maxElectrons.textContent = '2'; \/\/ Cada orbital acepta m\u00e1ximo 2 electrones\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar badge despu\u00e9s de 3 validaciones correctas\r\n        let correctValidations = parseInt(localStorage.getItem('qnCorrect') || '0');\r\n        correctValidations++;\r\n        localStorage.setItem('qnCorrect', correctValidations);\r\n        \r\n        if (correctValidations >= 3) {\r\n            quantumBadge.style.display = 'block';\r\n        }\r\n    } else {\r\n        validationResult.innerHTML = \r\n            '<div style=\"color: #721c24; background: #f8d7da; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px;\">' +\r\n            '\u274c <strong>Conjunto INV\u00c1LIDO<\/strong><br>' +\r\n            'Errores:<br>' +\r\n            errors.map(function(err) { return '\u2022 ' + err; }).join('<br>') +\r\n            '<\/div>';\r\n        \r\n        orbitalName.textContent = '---';\r\n        maxElectrons.textContent = '---';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nvalidateBtn.addEventListener('click', validateQuantumNumbers);\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== CONFIGURACIONES ELECTR\u00d3NICAS ==========\r\nconst configZ = document.getElementById('config-Z');\r\nconst configZValue = document.getElementById('config-Z-value');\r\nconst expectedConfig = document.getElementById('expected-config');\r\nconst realConfig = document.getElementById('real-config');\r\nconst exceptionNote = document.getElementById('exception-note');\r\nconst aufbauDiagram = document.getElementById('aufbau-diagram');\r\nconst configBadge = document.getElementById('config-badge');\r\n\r\nconst aufbauOrder = [\r\n    '1s', '2s', '2p', '3s', '3p', '4s', '3d', '4p', '5s', '4d', \r\n    '5p', '6s', '4f', '5d', '6p', '7s', '5f', '6d', '7p'\r\n];\r\n\r\nconst orbitalCapacities = {\r\n    's': 2, 'p': 6, 'd': 10, 'f': 14\r\n};\r\n\r\nconst exceptions = {\r\n    24: {expected: '[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2074', real: '[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075', reason: 'Estabilidad de subcapa d semillena'},\r\n    29: {expected: '[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2079', real: '[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070', reason: 'Estabilidad de subcapa d llena'},\r\n    41: {expected: '[Kr] 5s\u00b2 4d\u00b3', real: '[Kr] 5s\u00b9 4d\u2074', reason: 'Configuraci\u00f3n m\u00e1s estable'},\r\n    42: {expected: '[Kr] 5s\u00b2 4d\u2074', real: '[Kr] 5s\u00b9 4d\u2075', reason: 'd\u2075 semillena'},\r\n    44: {expected: '[Kr] 5s\u00b2 4d\u2076', real: '[Kr] 5s\u00b9 4d\u2077', reason: 'Estabilidad adicional'},\r\n    45: {expected: '[Kr] 5s\u00b2 4d\u2077', real: '[Kr] 5s\u00b9 4d\u2078', reason: 'Configuraci\u00f3n preferida'},\r\n    46: {expected: '[Kr] 5s\u00b2 4d\u2078', real: '[Kr] 4d\u00b9\u2070', reason: 'd\u00b9\u2070 completamente llena'},\r\n    47: {expected: '[Kr] 5s\u00b2 4d\u2079', real: '[Kr] 5s\u00b9 4d\u00b9\u2070', reason: 'd\u00b9\u2070 llena'},\r\n    78: {expected: '[Xe] 6s\u00b2 4f\u00b9\u2074 5d\u2079', real: '[Xe] 6s\u00b9 4f\u00b9\u2074 5d\u2079', reason: 'Similar a otros del grupo'},\r\n    79: {expected: '[Xe] 6s\u00b2 4f\u00b9\u2074 5d\u2079', real: '[Xe] 6s\u00b9 4f\u00b9\u2074 5d\u00b9\u2070', reason: 'd\u00b9\u2070 llena'}\r\n};\r\n\r\nconst elementNames = {\r\n    1: 'Hidr\u00f3geno', 2: 'Helio', 3: 'Litio', 4: 'Berilio', 5: 'Boro', 6: 'Carbono',\r\n    7: 'Nitr\u00f3geno', 8: 'Ox\u00edgeno', 9: 'Fl\u00faor', 10: 'Ne\u00f3n', 11: 'Sodio', 12: 'Magnesio',\r\n    13: 'Aluminio', 14: 'Silicio', 15: 'F\u00f3sforo', 16: 'Azufre', 17: 'Cloro', 18: 'Arg\u00f3n',\r\n    19: 'Potasio', 20: 'Calcio', 21: 'Escandio', 22: 'Titanio', 23: 'Vanadio', 24: 'Cromo',\r\n    25: 'Manganeso', 26: 'Hierro', 27: 'Cobalto', 28: 'N\u00edquel', 29: 'Cobre', 30: 'Cinc',\r\n    31: 'Galio', 32: 'Germanio', 33: 'Ars\u00e9nico', 34: 'Selenio', 35: 'Bromo', 36: 'Kript\u00f3n'\r\n};\r\n\r\nfunction updateConfiguration() {\r\n    const Z = parseInt(configZ.value);\r\n    configZValue.textContent = Z + ' (' + (elementNames[Z] || 'Elemento') + ')';\r\n    \r\n    let electrons = Z;\r\n    let config = '';\r\n    let diagramHTML = '';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Construir configuraci\u00f3n esperada\r\n    for (let i = 0; i < aufbauOrder.length; i++) {\r\n        if (electrons <= 0) break;\r\n        \r\n        const orbital = aufbauOrder[i];\r\n        const type = orbital.slice(-1);\r\n        const capacity = orbitalCapacities[type];\r\n        const fill = Math.min(electrons, capacity);\r\n        \r\n        if (fill > 0) {\r\n            config += ' ' + orbital + (fill > 1 ? fill.toString() : '');\r\n            electrons -= fill;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ A\u00f1adir al diagrama\r\n            diagramHTML += '<div class=\"orbital-box\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333; padding: 5px; text-align: center; background: ' + \r\n                          (fill === capacity ? '#a0d8a0' : '#ffffa0') + ';\">' + orbital + '<br>' + fill + 'e\u207b<\/div>';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    expectedConfig.textContent = config.trim();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Verificar excepciones\r\n    if (exceptions[Z]) {\r\n        realConfig.textContent = exceptions[Z].real;\r\n        exceptionNote.textContent = 'Excepci\u00f3n: ' + exceptions[Z].reason;\r\n        realConfig.style.background = '#ffcccc';\r\n    } else {\r\n        realConfig.textContent = config.trim();\r\n        exceptionNote.textContent = '';\r\n        realConfig.style.background = '#e0ffe0';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    aufbauDiagram.innerHTML = diagramHTML;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar badge si se exploran varias configuraciones\r\n    let explored = parseInt(localStorage.getItem('configExplored') || '0');\r\n    explored++;\r\n    localStorage.setItem('configExplored', explored);\r\n    \r\n    if (explored >= 10) {\r\n        configBadge.style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nconfigZ.addEventListener('input', updateConfiguration);\r\nupdateConfiguration();\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== QUIZ INTERACTIVO ==========\r\nconst quizQuestion = document.getElementById('quiz-question');\r\nconst quizOptions = document.getElementById('quiz-options');\r\nconst quizSubmit = document.getElementById('quiz-submit');\r\nconst quizNext = document.getElementById('quiz-next');\r\nconst quizFeedback = document.getElementById('quiz-feedback');\r\nconst scoreValue = document.getElementById('score-value');\r\nconst quizProgress = document.getElementById('quiz-progress');\r\nconst quizProgressBar = document.getElementById('quiz-progress-bar');\r\n\r\nfunction loadQuestion() {\r\n    const q = quizData[currentQuestion];\r\n    quizProgress.textContent = 'Pregunta ' + (currentQuestion + 1) + ' de ' + quizData.length;\r\n    quizProgressBar.value = currentQuestion;\r\n    \r\n    quizQuestion.innerHTML = '<p><strong>Pregunta:<\/strong> ' + q.question + '<\/p>';\r\n    \r\n    let optionsHTML = '';\r\n    q.options.forEach(function(option, index) {\r\n        optionsHTML += \r\n            '<label style=\"display: block; margin: 5px 0; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px;\">' +\r\n            '<input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz-answer\" value=\"' + index + '\">' +\r\n            option +\r\n            '<\/label>';\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    quizOptions.innerHTML = optionsHTML;\r\n    quizSubmit.style.display = 'inline-block';\r\n    quizNext.style.display = 'none';\r\n    quizFeedback.innerHTML = '';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction checkAnswer() {\r\n    const selected = document.querySelector('input[name=\"quiz-answer\"]:checked');\r\n    \r\n    if (!selected) {\r\n        quizFeedback.innerHTML = '<div style=\"color: #856404; background: #fff3cd; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px;\">\u26a0\ufe0f Por favor, selecciona una respuesta<\/div>';\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    const answer = parseInt(selected.value);\r\n    const q = quizData[currentQuestion];\r\n    \r\n    if (answer === q.correct) {\r\n        quizScore++;\r\n        quizFeedback.innerHTML = \r\n            '<div style=\"color: #155724; background: #d4edda; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px;\">' +\r\n            '\u2705 <strong>\u00a1Correcto!<\/strong><br>' +\r\n            q.explanation +\r\n            '<\/div>';\r\n    } else {\r\n        quizFeedback.innerHTML = \r\n            '<div style=\"color: #721c24; background: #f8d7da; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px;\">' +\r\n            '\u274c <strong>Incorrecto<\/strong><br>' +\r\n            'La respuesta correcta es: <strong>' + q.options[q.correct] + '<\/strong><br>' +\r\n            q.explanation +\r\n            '<\/div>';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    scoreValue.textContent = quizScore;\r\n    quizSubmit.style.display = 'none';\r\n    quizNext.style.display = 'inline-block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction nextQuestion() {\r\n    currentQuestion++;\r\n    \r\n    if (currentQuestion < quizData.length) {\r\n        loadQuestion();\r\n    } else {\r\n        \/\/ Quiz completado\r\n        quizQuestion.innerHTML = \r\n            '<div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\">' +\r\n            '<h3>\ud83c\udf89 Quiz Completado<\/h3>' +\r\n            '<p>Tu puntuaci\u00f3n final: <strong>' + quizScore + ' de ' + quizData.length + '<\/strong><\/p>' +\r\n            '<p>' + (quizScore === quizData.length ? '\u00a1Excelente! Dominas los conceptos.' : \r\n                     quizScore >= 3 ? 'Buen trabajo, pero hay temas por reforzar.' : \r\n                     'Es recomendable repasar los conceptos b\u00e1sicos.') + '<\/p>' +\r\n            '<\/div>';\r\n        quizOptions.innerHTML = '';\r\n        quizSubmit.style.display = 'none';\r\n        quizNext.style.display = 'none';\r\n        quizProgressBar.value = quizData.length;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar mensaje final despu\u00e9s del quiz\r\n        document.getElementById('final-message').style.display = 'block';\r\n        launchConfetti();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nquizSubmit.addEventListener('click', checkAnswer);\r\nquizNext.addEventListener('click', nextQuestion);\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== MANEJO DE ERRORES COMUNES ==========\r\nconst errorButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.error-example-btn');\r\nconst errorDemo = document.getElementById('error-demo');\r\nconst errorDemoContent = document.getElementById('error-demo-content');\r\nconst closeErrorDemo = document.getElementById('close-error-demo');\r\n\r\nerrorButtons.forEach(function(button) {\r\n    button.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const errorType = button.getAttribute('data-error');\r\n        \r\n        let content = '';\r\n        switch(errorType) {\r\n            case '1':\r\n                content = \r\n                    '<h5>\u00d3rbita vs Orbital<\/h5>' +\r\n                    '<p><strong>Modelo de Bohr (\u00f3rbita):<\/strong> Trayectoria circular definida, radio exacto.<\/p>' +\r\n                    '<p><strong>Modelo Cu\u00e1ntico (orbital):<\/strong> Regi\u00f3n con ~90% de probabilidad de encontrar el electr\u00f3n.<\/p>' +\r\n                    '<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px; margin: 15px 0;\">' +\r\n                    '<div style=\"text-align: center;\">' +\r\n                    '<div style=\"width: 100px; height: 100px; border: 2px solid blue; border-radius: 50%; position: relative;\">' +\r\n                    '<div style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; background: red; border-radius: 50%; position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"><\/div>' +\r\n                    '<div style=\"width: 4px; height: 4px; background: green; border-radius: 50%; position: absolute; top: 25%; left: 75%;\"><\/div>' +\r\n                    '<\/div>' +\r\n                    '<p>\u00d3rbita (trayectoria)<\/p>' +\r\n                    '<\/div>' +\r\n                    '<div style=\"text-align: center;\">' +\r\n                    '<div style=\"width: 100px; height: 100px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,100,255,0.3) 0%, rgba(0,100,255,0.1) 70%, transparent 100%);\"><\/div>' +\r\n                    '<p>Orbital (nube probabil\u00edstica)<\/p>' +\r\n                    '<\/div>' +\r\n                    '<\/div>';\r\n                break;\r\n            case '2':\r\n                content = \r\n                    '<h5>L\u00edmites del Modelo de Bohr<\/h5>' +\r\n                    '<p>Para hidr\u00f3geno (Z=1): E = -13.6\/n\u00b2 eV (exacto)<\/p>' +\r\n                    '<p>Para helio (Z=2, 2 electrones): El modelo predice E = -54.4\/n\u00b2 eV<\/p>' +\r\n                    '<p><strong>Pero experimentalmente:<\/strong> La energ\u00eda del primer electr\u00f3n es ~-24.6 eV (no -54.4 eV)<\/p>' +\r\n                    '<p><strong>Raz\u00f3n:<\/strong> El segundo electr\u00f3n apantalla la carga nuclear. La carga nuclear efectiva es menor.<\/p>' +\r\n                    '<p>E<sub>real<\/sub> \u2248 -13.6 \u00d7 (Z<sub>efectivo<\/sub>)\u00b2\/n\u00b2 donde Z<sub>efectivo<\/sub> < Z<\/p>';\r\n                break;\r\n            case '3':\r\n                content = \r\n                    '<h5>Validaci\u00f3n Interactiva<\/h5>' +\r\n                    '<p>Prueba estos conjuntos inv\u00e1lidos:<\/p>' +\r\n                    '<ul>' +\r\n                    '<li>n=2, l=2, m\u2097=0 \u2192 \u274c l no puede ser igual a n<\/li>' +\r\n                    '<li>n=3, l=1, m\u2097=2 \u2192 \u274c |m\u2097| no puede ser > l<\/li>' +\r\n                    '<li>n=1, l=1, m\u2097=0 \u2192 \u274c Para n=1, l solo puede ser 0<\/li>' +\r\n                    '<\/ul>' +\r\n                    '<p>Ahora usa el validador de n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos arriba para probar estos casos.<\/p>';\r\n                break;\r\n            case '4':\r\n                content = \r\n                    '<h5>Principio de Exclusi\u00f3n de Pauli<\/h5>' +\r\n                    '<p>En un orbital 1s (n=1, l=0, m\u2097=0):<\/p>' +\r\n                    '<ul>' +\r\n                    '<li>\u2705 Electr\u00f3n 1: n=1, l=0, m\u2097=0, m\u209b=+\u00bd<\/li>' +\r\n                    '<li>\u2705 Electr\u00f3n 2: n=1, l=0, m\u2097=0, m\u209b=-\u00bd<\/li>' +\r\n                    '<li>\u274c Electr\u00f3n 3: n=1, l=0, m\u2097=0, m\u209b=+\u00bd \u2192 VIOLA Pauli<\/li>' +\r\n                    '<\/ul>' +\r\n                    '<p>Por esto cada orbital puede contener <strong>m\u00e1ximo 2 electrones<\/strong> con espines opuestos.<\/p>' +\r\n                    '<div style=\"background: #e8f4f8; padding: 10px; margin: 10px 0;\">' +\r\n                    '<p>\u2191<sub>\u2193<\/sub> \u2192 2 electrones en un orbital (espines opuestos)<\/p>' +\r\n                    '<p>\u2191<sub> <\/sub> \u2192 1 electr\u00f3n (no apareado)<\/p>' +\r\n                    '<p>\u2191\u2191 \u2192 IMPOSIBLE (violar\u00eda Pauli)<\/p>' +\r\n                    '<\/div>';\r\n                break;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        errorDemoContent.innerHTML = content;\r\n        errorDemo.style.display = 'block';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\ncloseErrorDemo.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n    errorDemo.style.display = 'none';\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== ESPECTRO VISUALIZACI\u00d3N ==========\r\nconst spectralTransition = document.getElementById('spectral-transition');\r\nconst wavelength = document.getElementById('wavelength');\r\nconst photonEnergy = document.getElementById('photon-energy');\r\nconst lineColor = document.getElementById('line-color');\r\nconst spectrumDisplay = document.getElementById('spectrum-display');\r\n\r\nconst balmerLines = {\r\n    3: {lambda: 656.3, energy: 1.89, color: 'red', name: 'H\u03b1'},\r\n    4: {lambda: 486.1, energy: 2.55, color: 'blue', name: 'H\u03b2'},\r\n    5: {lambda: 434.0, energy: 2.86, color: 'indigo', name: 'H\u03b3'},\r\n    6: {lambda: 410.2, energy: 3.02, color: 'violet', name: 'H\u03b4'}\r\n};\r\n\r\nfunction updateSpectrum() {\r\n    const n = parseInt(spectralTransition.value);\r\n    const line = balmerLines[n];\r\n    \r\n    wavelength.textContent = line.lambda;\r\n    photonEnergy.textContent = line.energy;\r\n    lineColor.textContent = line.name + ' (' + line.color + ')';\r\n    lineColor.style.color = line.color;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar display del espectro\r\n    const position = ((line.lambda - 380) \/ (780 - 380)) * 100; \/\/ 380-780 nm es el espectro visible\r\n    spectrumDisplay.innerHTML = \r\n        '<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; left: ' + position + '%; width: 2px; background: black;\"><\/div>' +\r\n        '<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -25px; left: ' + position + '%; transform: translateX(-50%);\">' + line.lambda + ' nm<\/div>';\r\n}\r\n\r\nspectralTransition.addEventListener('change', updateSpectrum);\r\nupdateSpectrum();\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== REFLEXI\u00d3N FINAL ==========\r\nconst saveReflection = document.getElementById('save-reflection');\r\nconst reflectionSaved = document.getElementById('reflection-saved');\r\n\r\nsaveReflection.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n    const reflection1 = document.getElementById('reflection-1').value;\r\n    const reflection2 = document.getElementById('reflection-2').value;\r\n    const reflection3 = document.getElementById('reflection-3').value;\r\n    \r\n    if (reflection1 || reflection2 || reflection3) {\r\n        \/\/ En un sistema real, aqu\u00ed se enviar\u00eda a un servidor\r\n        localStorage.setItem('quantumReflection', JSON.stringify({\r\n            date: new Date().toISOString(),\r\n            reflection1: reflection1,\r\n            reflection2: reflection2,\r\n            reflection3: reflection3\r\n        }));\r\n        \r\n        reflectionSaved.style.display = 'block';\r\n        setTimeout(function() {\r\n            reflectionSaved.style.display = 'none';\r\n        }, 3000);\r\n    }\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Sistema de calificaci\u00f3n por estrellas\r\nconst stars = document.querySelectorAll('.star');\r\nstars.forEach(function(star) {\r\n    star.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const value = this.getAttribute('data-value');\r\n        const competency = this.parentElement.getAttribute('data-competency');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Reset stars in this group\r\n        const groupStars = this.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.star');\r\n        groupStars.forEach(function(s) {\r\n            s.style.color = '#ccc';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Fill stars up to clicked value\r\n        for (let i = 0; i < value; i++) {\r\n            groupStars[i].style.color = '#ffcc00';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Guardar calificaci\u00f3n\r\n        localStorage.setItem('competency_' + competency, value);\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== ANIMACI\u00d3N DE CONFETI ==========\r\nfunction launchConfetti() {\r\n    const container = document.getElementById('confetti-container');\r\n    \r\n    for (let i = 0; i < 100; i++) {\r\n        const confetti = document.createElement('div');\r\n        confetti.className = 'confetti';\r\n        confetti.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + 'vw';\r\n        confetti.style.backgroundColor = 'hsl(' + (Math.random() * 360) + ', 100%, 50%)';\r\n        confetti.style.animationDelay = Math.random() * 3 + 's';\r\n        confetti.style.width = Math.random() * 10 + 5 + 'px';\r\n        confetti.style.height = Math.random() * 10 + 5 + 'px';\r\n        container.appendChild(confetti);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Remover despu\u00e9s de la animaci\u00f3n\r\n        setTimeout(function() {\r\n            confetti.remove();\r\n        }, 5000);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== INICIALIZAR QUIZ ==========\r\nloadQuestion();\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar MathJax si est\u00e1 disponible\r\nif (window.MathJax) {\r\n    window.MathJax.typesetPromise();\r\n}\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Ejemplo gas t\u00f3xico","respuesta":"CO, SO\u2082, NO\u2093"},{"enunciado":"Efecto CO","respuesta":"Asfixia, une hemoglobina"},{"enunciado":"Fuentes comunes","respuesta":"Veh\u00edculos, industria, quema"},{"enunciado":"PEL OSHA para CO","respuesta":"50 ppm"},{"enunciado":"H\u2082S huele a","respuesta":"Huevo podrido"},{"enunciado":"NO\u2093 causa","respuesta":"Smog fotoqu\u00edmico"},{"enunciado":"Reacci\u00f3n CO + Hb","respuesta":"HbCO (carboxihemoglobina)"},{"enunciado":"SO\u2082 + H\u2082O \u2192","respuesta":"H\u2082SO\u2083 (\u00e1cido sulfuroso)"},{"enunciado":"Cl\u2082 en agua \u2192","respuesta":"HCl + HOCl"},{"enunciado":"IDLH para H\u2082S","respuesta":"100 ppm"},{"enunciado":"OMS 2025: muertes\/a\u00f1o por aire","respuesta":"7 millones"},{"enunciado":"SCR elimina","respuesta":"NO\u2093 (reducci\u00f3n catal\u00edtica selectiva)"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"CO es...","opciones":["Inodoro, letal","Oloroso","Seguro","L\u00edquido"],"correcta":"Inodoro, letal"},{"pregunta":"SO\u2082 causa...","opciones":["Lluvia \u00e1cida","Calor","Luz","Sonido"],"correcta":"Lluvia \u00e1cida"},{"pregunta":"NO\u2093 forma...","opciones":["Smog","Ozono bueno","Agua","Nada"],"correcta":"Smog"},{"pregunta":"H\u2082S huele a...","opciones":["Huevo podrido","Flor","Dulce","Nada"],"correcta":"Huevo podrido"},{"pregunta":"Cl\u2082 es...","opciones":["Gas verde amarillento","L\u00edquido","S\u00f3lido","Blanco"],"correcta":"Gas verde amarillento"},{"pregunta":"PEL significa...","opciones":["L\u00edmite permisible","Peligro extremo","Nada","Todo"],"correcta":"L\u00edmite permisible"},{"pregunta":"CO une Hb...","opciones":["250\u00d7 m\u00e1s que O\u2082","Igual","Menos","Nada"],"correcta":"250\u00d7 m\u00e1s que O\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Prevenci\u00f3n clave","opciones":["Ventilaci\u00f3n","Cerrar ventanas","Ignorar","Calor"],"correcta":"Ventilaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Monitores detectan...","opciones":["CO, H\u2082S","Solo O\u2082","Nada","Luz"],"correcta":"CO, H\u2082S"},{"pregunta":"OMS dice causa...","opciones":["7M muertes\/a\u00f1o","0","1M","100M"],"correcta":"7M muertes\/a\u00f1o"},{"pregunta":"PEL CO (OSHA)","opciones":["50 ppm","500 ppm","5 ppm","0 ppm"],"correcta":"50 ppm"},{"pregunta":"IDLH H\u2082S","opciones":["100 ppm","10 ppm","1000 ppm","1 ppm"],"correcta":"100 ppm"},{"pregunta":"SO\u2082 + H\u2082O \u2192","opciones":["H\u2082SO\u2083","H\u2082SO\u2084","SO\u2083","H\u2082S"],"correcta":"H\u2082SO\u2083"},{"pregunta":"Catalizador autos reduce...","opciones":["CO, NO\u2093","Solo O\u2082","CO\u2082","H\u2082O"],"correcta":"CO, NO\u2093"},{"pregunta":"NH\u2083 irrita...","opciones":["Ojos, v\u00edas respiratorias","Piel solo","O\u00eddos","Nada"],"correcta":"Ojos, v\u00edas respiratorias"},{"pregunta":"SCR es para...","opciones":["NO\u2093","SO\u2082","CO","H\u2082S"],"correcta":"NO\u2093"},{"pregunta":"Desulfuraci\u00f3n elimina...","opciones":["SO\u2082","NO\u2082","CO","CH\u2084"],"correcta":"SO\u2082"},{"pregunta":"VOCs son...","opciones":["Compuestos org\u00e1nicos vol\u00e1tiles","Gases nobles","Metales","\u00c1cidos"],"correcta":"Compuestos org\u00e1nicos vol\u00e1tiles"},{"pregunta":"Efecto cr\u00f3nico SO\u2082","opciones":["Asma","Dolor cabeza","Sue\u00f1o","Hambre"],"correcta":"Asma"},{"pregunta":"EPA regula...","opciones":["Aire exterior","Solo interior","Agua","Suelo"],"correcta":"Aire exterior"},{"pregunta":"Reacci\u00f3n Hb + CO","opciones":["HbCO","HbO\u2082","HbN","HbH"],"correcta":"HbCO"},{"pregunta":"Concentraci\u00f3n letal H\u2082S","opciones":[">500 ppm","<50 ppm","100 ppm","0 ppm"],"correcta":">500 ppm"},{"pregunta":"STEL para Cl\u2082","opciones":["3 ppm (15 min)","1 ppm","10 ppm","0 ppm"],"correcta":"3 ppm (15 min)"},{"pregunta":"NO\u2082 color","opciones":["Marr\u00f3n rojizo","Verde","Azul","Transparente"],"correcta":"Marr\u00f3n rojizo"},{"pregunta":"Meta EPA 2030: reducir CO en...","opciones":["Ciudades 30%","0%","100%","10%"],"correcta":"Ciudades 30%"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula lluvia \u00e1cida","opciones":["SO\u2082 + H\u2082O \u2192 H\u2082SO\u2083","CO\u2082 + H\u2082O \u2192 H\u2082CO\u2083","NO\u2082 + H\u2082O \u2192 HNO\ufffd3","Todas"],"correcta":"Todas"},{"pregunta":"Gas m\u00e1s t\u00f3xico com\u00fan","opciones":["H\u2082S","CO","SO\u2082","NH\u2083"],"correcta":"H\u2082S"},{"pregunta":"OSHA exige monitor para...","opciones":["Espacios confinados","Oficinas","Parques","Playas"],"correcta":"Espacios confinados"},{"pregunta":"NH\u2083 + HCl \u2192","opciones":["NH\u2084Cl (humo blanco)","NH\u2083Cl","HCl\u2082","Nada"],"correcta":"NH\u2084Cl (humo blanco)"},{"pregunta":"OMS 2025: principal fuente urbana","opciones":["Veh\u00edculos (NO\u2093, CO)","Volcanes","Oc\u00e9anos","Bosques"],"correcta":"Veh\u00edculos (NO\u2093, CO)"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"la-materia-completo","titulo":"La Materia: Estructura, Clasificaci\u00f3n y Propiedades","contenido":"<!-- 1\ufe0f\u20e3 INTRODUCCI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL -->\r\n<div class=\"content-header\">\r\n    <div class=\"learning-goals\">\r\n        <h3>\ud83c\udfaf Objetivos de aprendizaje<\/h3>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li>Identificar y clasificar diferentes tipos de materia<\/li>\r\n            <li>Calcular propiedades intensivas como la densidad<\/li>\r\n            <li>Diferenciar cambios f\u00edsicos de cambios qu\u00edmicos<\/li>\r\n            <li>Analizar la estructura at\u00f3mica b\u00e1sica<\/li>\r\n            <li>Resolver problemas tipo examen sobre materia<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 2\ufe0f\u20e3 DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO ESTRUCTURADO -->\r\n<div class=\"content-body\">\r\n    <h3>1. Conceptos fundamentales<\/h3>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"theory-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"theory-card\">\r\n            <h4>\u00bfQu\u00e9 es la materia?<\/h4>\r\n            <p>Todo lo que tiene <strong>masa<\/strong> y ocupa un <strong>volumen<\/strong> (espacio).<\/p>\r\n            <p><em>Ejemplo:<\/em> Un libro, el agua, el aire que respiramos.<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"theory-card\">\r\n            <h4>Estados de agregaci\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>S\u00f3lido:<\/strong> Forma y volumen definidos<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>L\u00edquido:<\/strong> Volumen definido, forma variable<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Gaseoso:<\/strong> Forma y volumen variables<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h3>2. Clasificaci\u00f3n sistem\u00e1tica de la materia<\/h3>\r\n    \r\n    <table class=\"classification-table\">\r\n        <thead>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <th>Tipo<\/th>\r\n                <th>Caracter\u00edsticas<\/th>\r\n                <th>Ejemplos<\/th>\r\n                <th>Separaci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/thead>\r\n        <tbody>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Sustancias puras<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>Composici\u00f3n fija, propiedades definidas<\/td>\r\n                <td>Oro (Au), Agua destilada (H\u2082O)<\/td>\r\n                <td>M\u00e9todos qu\u00edmicos<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td class=\"subtype\">\u2022 Elementos<\/td>\r\n                <td>Un solo tipo de \u00e1tomo<\/td>\r\n                <td>Ox\u00edgeno (O\u2082), Cobre (Cu)<\/td>\r\n                <td>No separable<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td class=\"subtype\">\u2022 Compuestos<\/td>\r\n                <td>Dos o m\u00e1s elementos combinados<\/td>\r\n                <td>Sal (NaCl), Di\u00f3xido de carbono (CO\u2082)<\/td>\r\n                <td>Reacciones qu\u00edmicas<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Mezclas<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>Composici\u00f3n variable, propiedades variables<\/td>\r\n                <td>Aire, Agua de mar, Granito<\/td>\r\n                <td>M\u00e9todos f\u00edsicos<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td class=\"subtype\">\u2022 Homog\u00e9neas<\/td>\r\n                <td>Una sola fase, uniforme<\/td>\r\n                <td>Aire, Alcohol en agua<\/td>\r\n                <td>Destilaci\u00f3n, cristalizaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td class=\"subtype\">\u2022 Heterog\u00e9neas<\/td>\r\n                <td>Dos o m\u00e1s fases visibles<\/td>\r\n                <td>Agua con aceite, Granito<\/td>\r\n                <td>Filtraci\u00f3n, decantaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/tbody>\r\n    <\/table>\r\n\r\n<!-- 3\ufe0f\u20e3 VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA - SVG INTERACTIVO -->\r\n<h3>3. Diagrama interactivo de clasificaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"diagram-container\" id=\"diagramContainer\">\r\n    <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"400\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\" id=\"matterDiagram\">\r\n        <!-- MATERIA -->\r\n        <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"100\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#2E7D32\" class=\"clickable\" id=\"matter\" data-info=\"Materia: Todo lo que tiene masa y ocupa volumen\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"400\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-weight=\"bold\">MATERIA<\/text>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- SUSTANCIAS PURAS -->\r\n        <rect x=\"150\" y=\"200\" width=\"200\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1565C0\" class=\"clickable\" id=\"pure\" data-info=\"Sustancia pura: Composici\u00f3n definida y propiedades constantes\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"250\" y=\"235\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\">SUSTANCIA PURA<\/text>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- MEZCLAS -->\r\n        <rect x=\"450\" y=\"200\" width=\"200\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#F57C00\" class=\"clickable\" id=\"mixture\" data-info=\"Mezcla: Combinaci\u00f3n de sustancias en proporciones variables\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"550\" y=\"235\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\">MEZCLA<\/text>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- L\u00cdNEAS DE CONEXI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <line x1=\"400\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"\/>\r\n        <line x1=\"400\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"550\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"\/>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- ELEMENTOS Y COMPUESTOS -->\r\n        <rect x=\"100\" y=\"280\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#2196F3\" class=\"clickable\" id=\"element\" data-info=\"Elemento: Sustancia formada por un solo tipo de \u00e1tomo\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"175\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\">ELEMENTO<\/text>\r\n        \r\n        <rect x=\"250\" y=\"280\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#1976D2\" class=\"clickable\" id=\"compound\" data-info=\"Compuesto: Sustancia formada por dos o m\u00e1s elementos combinados qu\u00edmicamente\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"325\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\">COMPUESTO<\/text>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- MEZCLAS HOMOG\u00c9NEAS Y HETEROG\u00c9NEAS -->\r\n        <rect x=\"450\" y=\"280\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#FF9800\" class=\"clickable\" id=\"homogeneous\" data-info=\"Mezcla homog\u00e9nea: Una sola fase, composici\u00f3n uniforme\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"525\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\">HOMOG\u00c9NEA<\/text>\r\n        \r\n        <rect x=\"600\" y=\"280\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#EF6C00\" class=\"clickable\" id=\"heterogeneous\" data-info=\"Mezcla heterog\u00e9nea: Dos o m\u00e1s fases visibles\"\/>\r\n        <text x=\"675\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\">HETEROG\u00c9NEA<\/text>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- CONEXIONES SECUNDARIAS -->\r\n        <line x1=\"250\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"175\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"\/>\r\n        <line x1=\"250\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"325\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"\/>\r\n        <line x1=\"550\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"525\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"\/>\r\n        <line x1=\"550\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"675\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"\/>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"diagram-info\" id=\"diagramInfo\">\r\n        <p>Haz clic en cualquier elemento del diagrama para ver su definici\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 4\ufe0f\u20e3 BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS REALES -->\r\n<h3>4. Simulador de densidad<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"simulator-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n        <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n            <label for=\"massInput\">Masa (g):<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"massInput\" min=\"1\" max=\"1000\" value=\"100\" step=\"1\">\r\n            <span id=\"massValue\">100 g<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n            <label for=\"volumeInput\">Volumen (cm\u00b3):<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"volumeInput\" min=\"1\" max=\"500\" value=\"100\" step=\"1\">\r\n            <span id=\"volumeValue\">100 cm\u00b3<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n            <label>Material:<\/label>\r\n            <select id=\"materialSelect\">\r\n                <option value=\"custom\">Personalizado<\/option>\r\n                <option value=\"water\">Agua (1 g\/cm\u00b3)<\/option>\r\n                <option value=\"gold\">Oro (19.3 g\/cm\u00b3)<\/option>\r\n                <option value=\"aluminum\">Aluminio (2.7 g\/cm\u00b3)<\/option>\r\n                <option value=\"wood\">Madera (0.7 g\/cm\u00b3)<\/option>\r\n                <option value=\"air\">Aire (0.0012 g\/cm\u00b3)<\/option>\r\n            <\/select>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"simulator-visual\">\r\n        <div class=\"density-display\">\r\n            <div class=\"formula\">\r\n                \\[ \\rho = \\frac{m}{V} \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"result\">\r\n                <p id=\"densityResult\">Densidad: 1.00 g\/cm\u00b3<\/p>\r\n                <p id=\"floatResult\">Comportamiento: Se hundir\u00e1 en agua<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"beaker-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"beaker\">\r\n                <div class=\"liquid\" id=\"liquidLevel\" style=\"height: 50%\"><\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"object\" id=\"floatingObject\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"beaker-label\">Agua (\u03c1 = 1 g\/cm\u00b3)<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"density-explanation\">\r\n        <h4>Interpretaci\u00f3n de resultados:<\/h4>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><strong>\u03c1 > 1 g\/cm\u00b3:<\/strong> El objeto se hunde en agua<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>\u03c1 = 1 g\/cm\u00b3:<\/strong> El objeto flota justo en la superficie<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>\u03c1 < 1 g\/cm\u00b3:<\/strong> El objeto flota en el agua<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- \ud83e\udde0 QUIZ AUTOCORREGIBLE -->\r\n<h3>5. Quiz de autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p><strong>Pregunta 1:<\/strong> El agua del grifo es una:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" data-feedback=\"Correcto: El agua del grifo contiene minerales disueltos (mezcla homog\u00e9nea)\">Mezcla homog\u00e9nea<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"Incorrecto: El agua pura ser\u00eda H\u2082O destilada\">Sustancia pura<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"Incorrecto: No se ven fases diferentes a simple vista\">Mezcla heterog\u00e9nea<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p><strong>Pregunta 2:<\/strong> \u00bfCu\u00e1l es un cambio f\u00edsico?<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" data-feedback=\"Correcto: Solo cambia el estado, no la composici\u00f3n\">Derretir hielo<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"Incorrecto: Se forma una sustancia nueva (\u00f3xido)\">Oxidaci\u00f3n del hierro<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"Incorrecto: Es una combusti\u00f3n (cambio qu\u00edmico)\">Quemar papel<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p><strong>Pregunta 3:<\/strong> La densidad es una propiedad:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"Incorrecto: La masa y volumen son extensivas\">Extensiva<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" data-feedback=\"Correcto: No depende de la cantidad de materia\">Intensiva<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"Incorrecto: No es una propiedad qu\u00edmica\">Qu\u00edmica<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\"><\/div>\r\n    <button class=\"quiz-reset\" onclick=\"resetQuiz()\">Reiniciar Quiz<\/button>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 5\ufe0f\u20e3 ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<h3>6. \u26a0\ufe0f Errores comunes del estudiante<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"errors-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n        <h4>\u274c Confundir elemento con compuesto<\/h4>\r\n        <p><strong>Error:<\/strong> Decir que el agua (H\u2082O) es un elemento.<\/p>\r\n        <p><strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El agua es un compuesto formado por hidr\u00f3geno y ox\u00edgeno.<\/p>\r\n        <button class=\"error-example\" onclick=\"showExample('error1')\">Ver ejemplo<\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n        <h4>\u274c Creer que \"homog\u00e9neo\" = \"puro\"<\/h4>\r\n        <p><strong>Error:<\/strong> Pensar que el aire es una sustancia pura porque es homog\u00e9neo.<\/p>\r\n        <p><strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El aire es mezcla homog\u00e9nea de gases (N\u2082, O\u2082, CO\u2082, etc.).<\/p>\r\n        <button class=\"error-example\" onclick=\"showExample('error2')\">Ver ejemplo<\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n        <h4>\u274c No diferenciar propiedades intensivas\/extensivas<\/h4>\r\n        <p><strong>Error:<\/strong> Decir que la densidad depende de la cantidad de materia.<\/p>\r\n        <p><strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La densidad es intensiva: igual para cualquier muestra pura.<\/p>\r\n        <button class=\"error-example\" onclick=\"showExample('error3')\">Ver ejemplo<\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"error-example-display\" id=\"errorExample\">\r\n        <p id=\"exampleText\">Selecciona un error para ver el ejemplo detallado<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 6\ufe0f\u20e3 CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE -->\r\n<h3>7. \ud83d\udcd8 Conexi\u00f3n con el programa oficial<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"curriculum-connection\">\r\n    <table class=\"curriculum-table\">\r\n        <thead>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <th>Tema del programa<\/th>\r\n                <th>Contenido cubierto<\/th>\r\n                <th>Relaci\u00f3n con evaluaci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/thead>\r\n        <tbody>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Unidad 1: Materia y energ\u00eda<\/td>\r\n                <td>Clasificaci\u00f3n de la materia<\/td>\r\n                <td>Preguntas tipo opci\u00f3n m\u00faltiple (20%)<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Unidad 2: Propiedades de la materia<\/td>\r\n                <td>Propiedades intensivas y extensivas<\/td>\r\n                <td>Problemas de c\u00e1lculo (30%)<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Unidad 3: Estados de agregaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <td>Cambios de estado f\u00edsico<\/td>\r\n                <td>Ejercicios de aplicaci\u00f3n (25%)<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Unidad 4: Estructura at\u00f3mica<\/td>\r\n                <td>Elementos y compuestos<\/td>\r\n                <td>Preguntas conceptuales (25%)<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/tbody>\r\n    <\/table>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"exam-tip\">\r\n        <strong>\ud83d\udca1 Consejo para el examen:<\/strong> \r\n        Los problemas de densidad siempre incluyen conversi\u00f3n de unidades. \r\n        Practica pasar de g\/cm\u00b3 a kg\/m\u00b3 multiplicando por 1000.\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 7\ufe0f\u20e3 PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<h3>8. \ud83d\udcdd Problemas tipo examen<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n    <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n        <h4>Problema 1: An\u00e1lisis cualitativo<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Se tienen tres muestras:<\/p>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li>Muestra A: Se observan part\u00edculas de diferentes colores<\/li>\r\n            <li>Muestra B: Es transparente y no deja residuo al filtrar<\/li>\r\n            <li>Muestra C: Tiene punto de fusi\u00f3n constante de 0\u00b0C<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <p><strong>Pregunta:<\/strong> Clasifica cada muestra y justifica tu respuesta.<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n            <p><em>Espacio para respuesta:<\/em><\/p>\r\n            <textarea rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu an\u00e1lisis aqu\u00ed...\"><\/textarea>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n        <h4>Problema 2: C\u00e1lculo de densidad<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Un bloque met\u00e1lico tiene una masa de 540 g. Al sumergirlo en una probeta con 50 mL de agua, el nivel sube a 110 mL.<\/p>\r\n        <p><strong>Preguntas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n        <ol type=\"a\">\r\n            <li>Calcula el volumen del bloque en cm\u00b3<\/li>\r\n            <li>Determina su densidad en g\/cm\u00b3<\/li>\r\n            <li>Identifica el metal usando la tabla de densidades<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n        <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n            <p><em>Espacio para soluci\u00f3n:<\/em><\/p>\r\n            <textarea rows=\"6\" placeholder=\"Muestra tus c\u00e1lculos paso a paso...\"><\/textarea>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n        <h4>Problema 3: Razonamiento cient\u00edfico<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Dos estudiantes discuten sobre el agua del mar:<\/p>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li>Estudiante 1: \"Es una sustancia pura porque parece homog\u00e9nea\"<\/li>\r\n            <li>Estudiante 2: \"Es una mezcla porque se puede separar por evaporaci\u00f3n\"<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <p><strong>Pregunta:<\/strong> \u00bfCu\u00e1l estudiante tiene raz\u00f3n? Explica detalladamente incluyendo conceptos de composici\u00f3n y m\u00e9todos de separaci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n            <p><em>Espacio para argumentaci\u00f3n:<\/em><\/p>\r\n            <textarea rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu argumento cient\u00edfico...\"><\/textarea>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 8\ufe0f\u20e3 CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<h3>9. \ud83e\udde0 Reflexi\u00f3n metacognitiva<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"metacognitive-reflection\">\r\n    <div class=\"reflection-question\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83d\udd0d Autoevaluaci\u00f3n de comprensi\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Responde brevemente en tu cuaderno:<\/p>\r\n        <ol>\r\n            <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 concepto te result\u00f3 m\u00e1s dif\u00edcil de entender? \u00bfPor qu\u00e9?<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo puedes aplicar el concepto de densidad en situaciones de la vida diaria?<\/li>\r\n            <li>Si tuvieras que explicarle a un compa\u00f1ero la diferencia entre elemento y compuesto, \u00bfqu\u00e9 ejemplo usar\u00edas?<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"learning-check\">\r\n        <h4>\u2713 Verificaci\u00f3n de aprendizaje<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Marca los conceptos que ya dominas:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"checklist\">\r\n            <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Puedo clasificar correctamente diferentes tipos de materia<\/label>\r\n            <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> S\u00e9 calcular densidad usando la f\u00f3rmula \u03c1 = m\/V<\/label>\r\n            <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Diferencio claramente cambios f\u00edsicos de cambios qu\u00edmicos<\/label>\r\n            <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Identifico propiedades intensivas y extensivas<\/label>\r\n            <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Puedo explicar la diferencia entre elemento y compuesto<\/label>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT PARA INTERACTIVIDAD -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ DIAGRAMA INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.clickable').forEach(element => {\r\n    element.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const info = this.getAttribute('data-info');\r\n        document.getElementById('diagramInfo').innerHTML = \r\n            '<p><strong>' + this.id.toUpperCase() + ':<\/strong> ' + info + '<\/p>';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Resaltar temporalmente el elemento clickeado\r\n        this.style.filter = 'brightness(1.3)';\r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            this.style.filter = '';\r\n        }, 500);\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DE DENSIDAD\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nconst massInput = document.getElementById('massInput');\r\nconst volumeInput = document.getElementById('volumeInput');\r\nconst materialSelect = document.getElementById('materialSelect');\r\nconst massValue = document.getElementById('massValue');\r\nconst volumeValue = document.getElementById('volumeValue');\r\nconst liquidLevel = document.getElementById('liquidLevel');\r\nconst floatingObject = document.getElementById('floatingObject');\r\nconst densityResult = document.getElementById('densityResult');\r\nconst floatResult = document.getElementById('floatResult');\r\n\r\nconst materialDensities = {\r\n    water: 1.0,\r\n    gold: 19.3,\r\n    aluminum: 2.7,\r\n    wood: 0.7,\r\n    air: 0.0012\r\n};\r\n\r\nfunction updateDensity() {\r\n    let mass = parseFloat(massInput.value);\r\n    let volume = parseFloat(volumeInput.value);\r\n    const material = materialSelect.value;\r\n    \r\n    if (material !== 'custom') {\r\n        const density = materialDensities[material];\r\n        mass = density * volume;\r\n        massInput.value = Math.round(mass);\r\n        massValue.textContent = Math.round(mass) + ' g';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    const density = mass \/ volume;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar resultados\r\n    densityResult.textContent = 'Densidad: ' + density.toFixed(2) + ' g\/cm\u00b3';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Determinar flotabilidad\r\n    if (density > 1.0) {\r\n        floatResult.textContent = 'Comportamiento: Se hundir\u00e1 en agua';\r\n        floatingObject.style.bottom = '10%';\r\n    } else if (density < 1.0) {\r\n        floatResult.textContent = 'Comportamiento: Flotar\u00e1 en el agua';\r\n        floatingObject.style.bottom = '50%';\r\n    } else {\r\n        floatResult.textContent = 'Comportamiento: Flotar\u00e1 justo en la superficie';\r\n        floatingObject.style.bottom = '30%';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar tama\u00f1o del objeto en el matraz\r\n    const objectSize = Math.min(50, Math.max(20, volume \/ 5));\r\n    floatingObject.style.width = objectSize + 'px';\r\n    floatingObject.style.height = objectSize + 'px';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar nivel del l\u00edquido\r\n    const level = Math.min(90, 50 + (volume \/ 10));\r\n    liquidLevel.style.height = level + '%';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Event listeners\r\nmassInput.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    massValue.textContent = this.value + ' g';\r\n    updateDensity();\r\n});\r\n\r\nvolumeInput.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    volumeValue.textContent = this.value + ' cm\u00b3';\r\n    updateDensity();\r\n});\r\n\r\nmaterialSelect.addEventListener('change', updateDensity);\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar\r\nupdateDensity();\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nlet quizScore = 0;\r\nlet totalQuestions = 3;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(button => {\r\n    button.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const isCorrect = this.getAttribute('data-correct') === 'true';\r\n        const feedback = this.getAttribute('data-feedback');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Deshabilitar todos los botones de esta pregunta\r\n        this.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(btn => {\r\n            btn.disabled = true;\r\n            if (btn.getAttribute('data-correct') === 'true') {\r\n                btn.style.backgroundColor = '#4CAF50';\r\n            } else if (btn === this && !isCorrect) {\r\n                btn.style.backgroundColor = '#f44336';\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar puntaje\r\n        if (isCorrect) {\r\n            quizScore++;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar retroalimentaci\u00f3n\r\n        const feedbackDiv = document.getElementById('quizFeedback');\r\n        feedbackDiv.innerHTML = \r\n            '<div class=\"' + (isCorrect ? 'correct-feedback' : 'incorrect-feedback') + '\">' +\r\n                feedback +\r\n            '<\/div>' +\r\n            '<p>Progreso: ' + document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option:disabled').length\/3 + '\/3 preguntas<\/p>';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction resetQuiz() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(button => {\r\n        button.disabled = false;\r\n        button.style.backgroundColor = '';\r\n    });\r\n    quizScore = 0;\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').innerHTML = '';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ EJEMPLOS DE ERRORES COMUNES\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nfunction showExample(errorId) {\r\n    const examples = {\r\n        error1: '\u274c <strong>Error t\u00edpico:<\/strong> \"El agua es un elemento llamado hidr\u00f3geno-ox\u00edgeno\"<br><br>' +\r\n                '\u2705 <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El agua (H\u2082O) es un COMPUESTO formado por dos elementos: ' +\r\n                'hidr\u00f3geno (H) y ox\u00edgeno (O). Un elemento ser\u00eda solo ox\u00edgeno (O\u2082) o solo hidr\u00f3geno (H\u2082).',\r\n        \r\n        error2: '\u274c <strong>Error t\u00edpico:<\/strong> \"El aire es puro porque no se ven sus componentes\"<br><br>' +\r\n                '\u2705 <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El aire es una MEZCLA HOMOG\u00c9NEA de gases (78% N\u2082, 21% O\u2082, 1% otros). ' +\r\n                'Es homog\u00e9neo (una fase) pero no puro (m\u00faltiples sustancias).',\r\n        \r\n        error3: '\u274c <strong>Error t\u00edpico:<\/strong> \"Un bloque grande de oro es m\u00e1s denso que uno peque\u00f1o\"<br><br>' +\r\n                '\u2705 <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La densidad es INTENSIVA. 1 cm\u00b3 de oro tiene \u03c1=19.3 g\/cm\u00b3, ' +\r\n                'y 1000 cm\u00b3 de oro tambi\u00e9n tiene \u03c1=19.3 g\/cm\u00b3. Lo que cambia es la masa (propiedad extensiva).'\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('exampleText').innerHTML = examples[errorId] || \r\n        \"Selecciona un error para ver el ejemplo detallado\";\r\n}\r\n<\/script>\r\n<\/div>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Define materia","respuesta":"Todo con masa y volumen"},{"enunciado":"Ejemplo materia pura","respuesta":"Oro, agua destilada"},{"enunciado":"Mezcla homog\u00e9nea","respuesta":"Aire, salmuera"},{"enunciado":"Agua de mar es...","respuesta":"Mezcla homog\u00e9nea"},{"enunciado":"Granito es...","respuesta":"Mezcla heterog\u00e9nea"},{"enunciado":"Densidad agua","respuesta":"1 g\/cm\u00b3"},{"enunciado":"Propiedad f\u00edsica","respuesta":"Punto de fusi\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Propiedad qu\u00edmica","respuesta":"Reactividad con \u00e1cidos"},{"enunciado":"Cambio f\u00edsico","respuesta":"Fusi\u00f3n, evaporaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"F\u00f3rmula densidad","respuesta":"\\(\\rho = \\frac{m}{V}\\)"},{"enunciado":"NIST define masa at\u00f3mica C-12","respuesta":"12 u exacto"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC clasifica elementos","respuesta":"118 conocidos 2025"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Materia tiene...","opciones":["Masa y volumen","Solo masa","Solo volumen","Nada"],"correcta":"Masa y volumen"},{"pregunta":"Propiedad f\u00edsica cambia...","opciones":["Forma, no composici\u00f3n","Composici\u00f3n","Todo","Nada"],"correcta":"Forma, no composici\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Qu\u00edmica involucra...","opciones":["Reacciones","Medidas","Nada","Volumen"],"correcta":"Reacciones"},{"pregunta":"Ejemplo materia pura","opciones":["Oro","Aire","Agua salada","Suelo"],"correcta":"Oro"},{"pregunta":"Mezcla homog\u00e9nea","opciones":["Aire","Ensalada","Granito","Aceite+agua"],"correcta":"Aire"},{"pregunta":"Heterog\u00e9nea","opciones":["Granito","Salmuera","Alcohol+agua","Aire"],"correcta":"Granito"},{"pregunta":"Densidad =","opciones":["m\/V","V\/m","m+V","m-V"],"correcta":"m\/V"},{"pregunta":"Estado plasma","opciones":["99% universo","1%","0%","50%"],"correcta":"99% universo"},{"pregunta":"Cambio f\u00edsico","opciones":["Fusi\u00f3n","Combusti\u00f3n","Reacci\u00f3n","Oxidaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Fusi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC 2025 elementos","opciones":["118","100","92","200"],"correcta":"118"},{"pregunta":"Agua de mar es...","opciones":["Mezcla homog\u00e9nea","Pura","Elemento","Heterog\u00e9nea"],"correcta":"Mezcla homog\u00e9nea"},{"pregunta":"Granito es...","opciones":["Mezcla heterog\u00e9nea","Homog\u00e9nea","Pura","Elemento"],"correcta":"Mezcla heterog\u00e9nea"},{"pregunta":"Densidad oro","opciones":["19.3 g\/cm\u00b3","1 g\/cm\u00b3","0.001 g\/cm\u00b3","100 g\/cm\u00b3"],"correcta":"19.3 g\/cm\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"C-12 masa exacta","opciones":["12 u","12.011 u","13 u","11 u"],"correcta":"12 u"},{"pregunta":"N\u00famero m\u00e1sico A =","opciones":["p\u207a + n\u2070","p\u207a + e\u207b","Z + e\u207b","Solo Z"],"correcta":"p\u207a + n\u2070"},{"pregunta":"Cambio qu\u00edmico libera...","opciones":["Energ\u00eda","Masa","Volumen","Nada"],"correcta":"Energ\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"Propiedad intensiva","opciones":["Densidad","Masa","Volumen","Peso"],"correcta":"Densidad"},{"pregunta":"Extensiva","opciones":["Masa","Densidad","Color","pH"],"correcta":"Masa"},{"pregunta":"NIST define \u00e1tomo como...","opciones":["Unidad con Z","Mol\u00e9cula","I\u00f3n","Nada"],"correcta":"Unidad con Z"},{"pregunta":"Mezcla separada por...","opciones":["F\u00edsica","Qu\u00edmica","Nuclear","Nada"],"correcta":"F\u00edsica"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula densidad","opciones":["\\(\\rho = \\frac{m}{V}\\)","\\(\\rho = m + V\\)","\\(\\rho = V\/m\\)","\\(\\rho = 0\\)"],"correcta":"\\(\\rho = \\frac{m}{V}\\)"},{"pregunta":"\u00c1tomo con Z=1","opciones":["Hidr\u00f3geno","Helio","Litio","Carbono"],"correcta":"Hidr\u00f3geno"},{"pregunta":"C-12 tiene...","opciones":["6p\u207a, 6n\u2070, 6e\u207b","12p\u207a","6e\u207b","0"],"correcta":"6p\u207a, 6n\u2070, 6e\u207b"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC nombra elementos hasta...","opciones":["118 (Oganesson)","100","92","200"],"correcta":"118 (Oganesson)"},{"pregunta":"Propiedad qu\u00edmica del Na","opciones":["Reacciona con H\u2082O","Densidad","Color","Volumen"],"correcta":"Reacciona con H\u2082O"},{"pregunta":"Mezcla aze\u00f3tropa","opciones":["No separable destilaci\u00f3n","F\u00e1cil","Solo f\u00edsica","Nada"],"correcta":"No separable destilaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Densidad aire \u2248","opciones":["0.0012 g\/cm\u00b3","1 g\/cm\u00b3","19.3 g\/cm\u00b3","0 g\/cm\u00b3"],"correcta":"0.0012 g\/cm\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"Cambio f\u00edsico reversible","opciones":["Fusi\u00f3n","Combusti\u00f3n","Reacci\u00f3n","Oxidaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Fusi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Ley conservaci\u00f3n masa por...","opciones":["Lavoisier","Dalton","Thomson","Rutherford"],"correcta":"Lavoisier"},{"pregunta":"Masa molar C-12","opciones":["12 g\/mol exacto","12.011 g\/mol","13 g\/mol","11 g\/mol"],"correcta":"12 g\/mol exacto"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"hielo-seco","titulo":"Hielo Seco: El Fr\u00edo que Nunca se Derrite","contenido":"<!-- 1\ufe0f\u20e3 INTRODUCCI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL -->\r\n<div class=\"content-header\">\r\n    <div class=\"learning-goals\">\r\n        <h3>\ud83c\udfaf Objetivos de aprendizaje<\/h3>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li>Comprender el proceso de sublimaci\u00f3n del di\u00f3xido de carbono s\u00f3lido<\/li>\r\n            <li>Analizar la estructura molecular y orbital del CO\u2082<\/li>\r\n            <li>Calcular transferencias de calor en procesos de cambio de fase<\/li>\r\n            <li>Identificar aplicaciones pr\u00e1cticas y riesgos de seguridad<\/li>\r\n            <li>Resolver problemas relacionados con diagramas de fase<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 2\ufe0f\u20e3 DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO ESTRUCTURADO -->\r\n<div class=\"content-body\">\r\n    <h3>1. \u00bfQu\u00e9 es el Hielo Seco?<\/h3>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"theory-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"theory-card\">\r\n            <h4>Definici\u00f3n cient\u00edfica<\/h4>\r\n            <p>El <strong>hielo seco<\/strong> es <strong>di\u00f3xido de carbono s\u00f3lido (CO\u2082(s))<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n            <p>A presi\u00f3n atmosf\u00e9rica, <strong>sublima<\/strong> directamente de s\u00f3lido a gas a <strong>-78.5\u00b0C<\/strong> sin pasar por fase l\u00edquida.<\/p>\r\n            <p><em>Curiosidad:<\/em> El nombre \"hielo seco\" proviene de que no produce l\u00edquido al fundirse.<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"theory-card\">\r\n            <h4>Consideraciones de seguridad<\/h4>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>No t\u00f3xico<\/strong> en bajas concentraciones<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Asfixiante<\/strong> en espacios cerrados (>5% vol)<\/li>\r\n                <li>Puede causar <strong>quemaduras criog\u00e9nicas<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li>Nunca almacenar en recipientes herm\u00e9ticos<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h3>2. Propiedades f\u00edsicas del CO\u2082 s\u00f3lido<\/h3>\r\n    \r\n    <table class=\"classification-table\">\r\n        <thead>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <th>Propiedad<\/th>\r\n                <th>Valor<\/th>\r\n                <th>Unidad<\/th>\r\n                <th>Significado<\/th>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/thead>\r\n        <tbody>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Temperatura de sublimaci\u00f3n<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>-78.5<\/td>\r\n                <td>\u00b0C<\/td>\r\n                <td>Temperatura a 1 atm<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Densidad (s\u00f3lido)<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>1.56<\/td>\r\n                <td>g\/cm\u00b3<\/td>\r\n                <td>M\u00e1s denso que el hielo de agua<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Calor de sublimaci\u00f3n<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>571<\/td>\r\n                <td>J\/g<\/td>\r\n                <td>Energ\u00eda absorbida al sublimar<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Punto triple<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>-56.6\u00b0C a 5.11 atm<\/td>\r\n                <td>\u00b0C, atm<\/td>\r\n                <td>Coexisten 3 fases<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Conductividad t\u00e9rmica<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>0.55<\/td>\r\n                <td>W\/m\u00b7K<\/td>\r\n                <td>Aislamiento moderado<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/tbody>\r\n    <\/table>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"theory-card example\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83d\udcd0 Ejemplo de c\u00e1lculo: Energ\u00eda de sublimaci\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Si tenemos 2 kg de hielo seco que sublima completamente:<\/p>\r\n        <p>\\[\r\n            Q = m \\cdot \\Delta H_{sub} = 2000\\,g \\times 571\\,\\frac{J}{g} = 1,142,000\\,J = 1142\\,kJ\r\n        \\]<\/p>\r\n        <p>Esta energ\u00eda equivale a enfriar aproximadamente 27 litros de agua de 25\u00b0C a 0\u00b0C.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 3\ufe0f\u20e3 VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA - SVG ANIMADO -->\r\n<h3>3. Diagrama interactivo: Sublimaci\u00f3n del hielo seco<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"diagram-container\" id=\"diagramContainer\">\r\n    <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"500\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 500\" id=\"sublimationDiagram\">\r\n        <!-- Fondo con escala de temperatura -->\r\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" fill=\"#0a0a14\"\/>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Escala de temperatura -->\r\n        <g id=\"tempScale\">\r\n            <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"400\" stroke=\"#00ffea\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n            <text x=\"30\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#ff00ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\">25\u00b0C<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"30\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#ffff00\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\">-56.6\u00b0C<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"30\" y=\"400\" fill=\"#ff5500\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\">-78.5\u00b0C<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"10\" y=\"50\" fill=\"#00ffea\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"start\">Temperatura<\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Bloque de hielo seco -->\r\n        <g id=\"iceBlock\" class=\"clickable\" data-info=\"Hielo seco: CO\u2082 s\u00f3lido a -78.5\u00b0C\">\r\n            <rect x=\"200\" y=\"350\" width=\"150\" height=\"80\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#2196F3\"\/>\r\n            <rect x=\"210\" y=\"360\" width=\"130\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#90CAF9\"\/>\r\n            <text x=\"275\" y=\"400\" fill=\"#000\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">CO\u2082(s)<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"275\" y=\"420\" fill=\"#1565C0\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-78.5\u00b0C<\/text>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Animaci\u00f3n de reducci\u00f3n por sublimaci\u00f3n -->\r\n            <animate id=\"sublimate\" attributeName=\"height\" values=\"80;60;40;20;0\" dur=\"30s\" begin=\"indefinite\" fill=\"freeze\"\/>\r\n            <animate attributeName=\"y\" values=\"350;370;390;410;430\" dur=\"30s\" begin=\"indefinite\" fill=\"freeze\"\/>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Part\u00edculas de CO\u2082 sublimando -->\r\n        <g id=\"particles\">\r\n            <circle cx=\"275\" cy=\"330\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#00ffea\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"330;280;230;180;130\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.8;0.6;0.4;0.2;0\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/circle>\r\n            <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"325\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#ff00ff\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"325;275;225;175;125\" dur=\"3.5s\" begin=\"0.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.7;0.5;0.3;0.1;0\" dur=\"3.5s\" begin=\"0.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/circle>\r\n            <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"335\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#ffff00\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"335;285;235;185;135\" dur=\"5s\" begin=\"1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.6;0.4;0.2;0\" dur=\"5s\" begin=\"1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/circle>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Gas CO\u2082 -->\r\n        <g id=\"gasCloud\" class=\"clickable\" data-info=\"CO\u2082 gaseoso: Incoloro, inodoro, m\u00e1s denso que el aire\">\r\n            <ellipse cx=\"500\" cy=\"150\" rx=\"100\" ry=\"50\" fill=\"url(#gasGradient)\" opacity=\"0.7\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"rx\" values=\"100;120;100\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"ry\" values=\"50;60;50\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/ellipse>\r\n            <text x=\"500\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#000\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">CO\u2082(g)<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"500\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#1565C0\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25\u00b0C<\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Flecha de sublimaci\u00f3n -->\r\n        <g id=\"sublimationArrow\">\r\n            <defs>\r\n                <marker id=\"arrowHead\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                    <path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#ff5500\"\/>\r\n                <\/marker>\r\n            <\/defs>\r\n            <path d=\"M350 390 L450 200\" stroke=\"#ff5500\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowHead)\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\"\/>\r\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"270\" fill=\"#ff5500\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sublimaci\u00f3n<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"290\" fill=\"#ff00ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\u0394H = 571 J\/g<\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <!-- F\u00f3rmula qu\u00edmica -->\r\n        <g id=\"chemicalFormula\">\r\n            <text x=\"600\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#ffff00\" font-size=\"20\" font-family=\"Courier New\">\r\n                CO\u2082(s) \u2192 CO\u2082(g)\r\n            <\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"600\" y=\"130\" fill=\"#00ffea\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"Courier New\">\r\n                \u0394H<sub>sub<\/sub> = 571 J\/g\r\n            <\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Panel de seguridad -->\r\n        <g id=\"safetyPanel\" class=\"clickable\" data-info=\"L\u00edmites de exposici\u00f3n OSHA: PEL 5000 ppm\">\r\n            <rect x=\"600\" y=\"350\" width=\"170\" height=\"100\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#ff0000\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n            <text x=\"685\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#ff0000\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">\u26a0\ufe0f SEGURIDAD<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"685\" y=\"400\" fill=\"#ff5500\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">PEL: 5000 ppm (8h)<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"685\" y=\"420\" fill=\"#ff00ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">STEL: 30,000 ppm (15min)<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"685\" y=\"440\" fill=\"#ffff00\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">IDLH: 40,000 ppm<\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Gradiente para nube de gas -->\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <linearGradient id=\"gasGradient\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\">\r\n                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#00ffea\" stop-opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#ff00ff\" stop-opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n            <\/linearGradient>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"diagram-controls\">\r\n        <button onclick=\"startSublimation()\">\u25b6\ufe0f Iniciar sublimaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"resetSublimation()\">\ud83d\udd04 Reiniciar<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"showSafetyInfo()\">\u26a0\ufe0f Info seguridad<\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"diagram-info\" id=\"diagramInfo\">\r\n        <p>Haz clic en cualquier elemento o usa los controles para interactuar<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 4\ufe0f\u20e3 SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO: CALOR DE SUBLIMACI\u00d3N -->\r\n<h3>4. Simulador: Energ\u00eda de sublimaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"simulator-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n        <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n            <label for=\"massInput\">Masa de hielo seco (g):<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"massInput\" min=\"100\" max=\"5000\" value=\"1000\" step=\"100\">\r\n            <span id=\"massValue\">1000 g<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n            <label for=\"tempInput\">Temperatura ambiente (\u00b0C):<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"tempInput\" min=\"-50\" max=\"40\" value=\"25\" step=\"5\">\r\n            <span id=\"tempValue\">25 \u00b0C<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n            <label for=\"timeInput\">Tiempo estimado (horas):<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"timeInput\" min=\"1\" max=\"24\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\r\n            <span id=\"timeValue\">8 horas<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"simulator-visual\">\r\n        <div class=\"energy-display\">\r\n            <div class=\"formula\">\r\n                \\[ Q = m \\cdot \\Delta H_{sub} \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"result\">\r\n                <p id=\"energyResult\">Energ\u00eda absorbida: 571 kJ<\/p>\r\n                <p id=\"coolingResult\">Capacidad de enfriamiento: 13.6 L de agua (25\u00b0C \u2192 0\u00b0C)<\/p>\r\n                <p id=\"sublimationRate\">Tasa de sublimaci\u00f3n: 125 g\/hora<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"ice-block-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"ice-block\" id=\"iceBlockVisual\">\r\n                <div class=\"ice-mass\" id=\"iceMass\" style=\"height: 100%\"><\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ice-label\">Hielo Seco<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"sublimation-animation\">\r\n                <div class=\"particle\" style=\"animation-delay: 0s\"><\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"particle\" style=\"animation-delay: 0.5s\"><\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"particle\" style=\"animation-delay: 1s\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"simulator-explanation\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83d\udcca Interpretaci\u00f3n de resultados:<\/h4>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><strong>Energ\u00eda absorbida:<\/strong> El hielo seco extrae calor del ambiente al sublimar<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Tasa de sublimaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> A mayor temperatura ambiente, m\u00e1s r\u00e1pida la sublimaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Aplicaci\u00f3n pr\u00e1ctica:<\/strong> 1 kg puede mantener fr\u00edos alimentos por 8-10 horas<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 5\ufe0f\u20e3 ESTRUCTURA MOLECULAR INTERACTIVA -->\r\n<h3>5. Estructura molecular del CO\u2082<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"molecular-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"molecular-visual\">\r\n        <div class=\"molecule\" id=\"co2Molecule\">\r\n            <!-- Se generar\u00e1 con JS -->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"molecule-controls\">\r\n            <button onclick=\"rotateMolecule('x')\">\u21bb Rotar eje X<\/button>\r\n            <button onclick=\"rotateMolecule('y')\">\u21bb Rotar eje Y<\/button>\r\n            <button onclick=\"showOrbitals()\">\ud83d\udd2c Ver orbitales<\/button>\r\n            <button onclick=\"showResonance()\">\u26a1 Ver resonancia<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"molecular-info\">\r\n        <h4>Caracter\u00edsticas estructurales:<\/h4>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><strong>Geometr\u00eda:<\/strong> Lineal (180\u00b0 entre enlaces)<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Enlaces:<\/strong> Dobles covalentes carbono-ox\u00edgeno<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Polaridad:<\/strong> Mol\u00e9cula apolar (momentos dipolares se cancelan)<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Longitud de enlace:<\/strong> 116.3 pm<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>\u00c1ngulo:<\/strong> O=C=O = 180\u00b0<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"resonance-structures\">\r\n            <h5>Estructuras de resonancia:<\/h5>\r\n            <p>\\[\r\n                \\text{O=C=O} \\quad \\leftrightarrow \\quad \\text{}^{+}\\text{O}\u2261\\text{C}-\\text{O}^{-} \\quad \\leftrightarrow \\quad \\text{O}^{-}-\\text{C}\u2261\\text{O}^{+}\r\n            \\]<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 6\ufe0f\u20e3 QUIZ INTERACTIVO (5 PREGUNTAS) -->\r\n<h3>6. Quiz de autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p><strong>Pregunta 1:<\/strong> \u00bfA qu\u00e9 temperatura sublima el hielo seco a presi\u00f3n atmosf\u00e9rica?<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" data-feedback=\"\u2705 Correcto: -78.5\u00b0C es la temperatura de sublimaci\u00f3n a 1 atm\">-78.5\u00b0C<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: 0\u00b0C es el punto de fusi\u00f3n del agua\">0\u00b0C<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: -56.6\u00b0C es el punto triple a 5.11 atm\">-56.6\u00b0C<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p><strong>Pregunta 2:<\/strong> \u00bfPor qu\u00e9 el hielo seco es peligroso en espacios cerrados?<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" data-feedback=\"\u2705 Correcto: El CO\u2082 desplaza al ox\u00edgeno causando asfixia\">Puede causar asfixia<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: El CO\u2082 no es t\u00f3xico en s\u00ed mismo\">Es altamente t\u00f3xico<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: No produce mon\u00f3xido de carbono\">Produce mon\u00f3xido de carbono<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p><strong>Pregunta 3:<\/strong> \u00bfCu\u00e1l es la geometr\u00eda molecular del CO\u2082?<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" data-feedback=\"\u2705 Correcto: Los tres \u00e1tomos est\u00e1n en l\u00ednea recta\">Lineal<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: Eso ser\u00eda como el agua (H\u2082O)\">Angular<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: Eso ser\u00eda como el amon\u00edaco (NH\u2083)\">Piramidal<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p><strong>Pregunta 4:<\/strong> Calcula la energ\u00eda absorbida si 500g de hielo seco subliman completamente:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" data-feedback=\"\u2705 Correcto: 500g \u00d7 571 J\/g = 285,500 J = 285.5 kJ\">285.5 kJ<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: Revisa la f\u00f3rmula Q = m\u00b7\u0394H\">1142 kJ<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: No olvides convertir a kilojoules\">285,500 J (sin convertir)<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p><strong>Pregunta 5:<\/strong> \u00bfQu\u00e9 significa PEL en el contexto de seguridad del CO\u2082?<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" data-feedback=\"\u2705 Correcto: L\u00edmite de exposici\u00f3n permisible durante 8 horas\">L\u00edmite de Exposici\u00f3n Permisible<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: Esa ser\u00eda una definici\u00f3n diferente\">Punto de Exposici\u00f3n Letal<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: No es una medida de presi\u00f3n\">Presi\u00f3n Equivalente L\u00edmite<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\"><\/div>\r\n    <button class=\"quiz-reset\" onclick=\"resetQuiz()\">\ud83d\udd04 Reiniciar Quiz<\/button>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 7\ufe0f\u20e3 APLICACIONES PR\u00c1CTICAS -->\r\n<h3>7. Aplicaciones del hielo seco<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"applications-grid\">\r\n    <div class=\"app-card\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83e\uddca Refrigeraci\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li>Transporte de vacunas y medicamentos<\/li>\r\n            <li>Conservaci\u00f3n de alimentos<\/li>\r\n            <li>Muestras biol\u00f3gicas<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00d3rganos para trasplante<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <p class=\"app-tip\"><strong>Ventaja:<\/strong> No deja residuos l\u00edquidos<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"app-card\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83c\udfad Efectos especiales<\/h4>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li>Niebla y humo para escenarios<\/li>\r\n            <li>Efectos de \"humo seco\"<\/li>\r\n            <li>Creaci\u00f3n de atm\u00f3sferas misteriosas<\/li>\r\n            <li>Filmaci\u00f3n de videos musicales<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <p class=\"app-tip\"><strong>Mecanismo:<\/strong> CO\u2082 + H\u2082O \u2192 niebla densa<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"app-card\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83e\uddf9 Limpieza criog\u00e9nica<\/h4>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li>Remoci\u00f3n de pintura y graffiti<\/li>\r\n            <li>Limpieza de moldes industriales<\/li>\r\n            <li>Mantenimiento de equipos electr\u00f3nicos<\/li>\r\n            <li>Restauraci\u00f3n de monumentos<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <p class=\"app-tip\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Sublimaci\u00f3n explosiva<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"app-card\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83e\udd64 Carbonataci\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li>Producci\u00f3n de bebidas gaseosas<\/li>\r\n            <li>Carbonataci\u00f3n de cerveza artesanal<\/li>\r\n            <li>Sistemas de dispensaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n            <li>Envases presurizados<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <p class=\"app-tip\"><strong>Proceso:<\/strong> CO\u2082(s) \u2192 CO\u2082(g) disuelto<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 8\ufe0f\u20e3 DIAGRAMA DE FASES INTERACTIVO -->\r\n<h3>8. Diagrama de fases del CO\u2082<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"phase-diagram-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"phase-controls\">\r\n        <div class=\"phase-slider\">\r\n            <label for=\"pressureInput\">Presi\u00f3n (atm):<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"pressureInput\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"100\" value=\"1\" step=\"0.1\">\r\n            <span id=\"pressureValue\">1 atm<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"phase-slider\">\r\n            <label for=\"temperaturePhaseInput\">Temperatura (\u00b0C):<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"temperaturePhaseInput\" min=\"-100\" max=\"40\" value=\"25\" step=\"1\">\r\n            <span id=\"temperaturePhaseValue\">25 \u00b0C<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"phase-buttons\">\r\n            <button onclick=\"goToTriplePoint()\">\ud83d\udccd Punto triple<\/button>\r\n            <button onclick=\"goToCriticalPoint()\">\ud83c\udfaf Punto cr\u00edtico<\/button>\r\n            <button onclick=\"showAtmosphericConditions()\">\ud83c\udf0d Condiciones atmosf\u00e9ricas<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"phase-visual\">\r\n        <canvas id=\"phaseCanvas\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\"><\/canvas>\r\n        <div class=\"phase-info\" id=\"phaseInfo\">\r\n            <p>Presi\u00f3n: 1 atm | Temperatura: 25\u00b0C<\/p>\r\n            <p><strong>Estado:<\/strong> Gas<\/p>\r\n            <p><strong>Cambio de fase posible:<\/strong> Ninguno en estas condiciones<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"phase-legend\">\r\n        <h5>Leyenda:<\/h5>\r\n        <div class=\"legend-item\"><div class=\"color-box solid\"><\/div> S\u00f3lido (hielo seco)<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"legend-item\"><div class=\"color-box liquid\"><\/div> L\u00edquido (solo a alta presi\u00f3n)<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"legend-item\"><div class=\"color-box gas\"><\/div> Gas<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"legend-item\"><div class=\"color-box supercritical\"><\/div> Fluido supercr\u00edtico<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 9\ufe0f\u20e3 PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN (4 PROBLEMAS) -->\r\n<h3>9. \ud83d\udcdd Problemas tipo examen<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n    <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n        <h4>Problema 1: C\u00e1lculo energ\u00e9tico<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Un laboratorio necesita transportar muestras biol\u00f3gicas a -70\u00b0C usando hielo seco. Si el contenedor pierde 500 J\/min de calor al ambiente y se dispone de 5 kg de hielo seco:<\/p>\r\n        <ol type=\"a\">\r\n            <li>\u00bfCu\u00e1nta energ\u00eda total puede absorber el hielo seco al sublimar completamente?<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfPor cu\u00e1nto tiempo mantendr\u00e1 las muestras a la temperatura adecuada?<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 precauciones de seguridad deben tomarse durante el transporte?<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n        <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n            <p><em>Espacio para soluci\u00f3n:<\/em><\/p>\r\n            <textarea rows=\"6\" placeholder=\"Desarrolla tus c\u00e1lculos paso a paso...\"><\/textarea>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n        <h4>Problema 2: An\u00e1lisis de seguridad<\/h4>\r\n        <p>En un laboratorio de 4m \u00d7 5m \u00d7 2.5m, se deja sublimar 10 kg de hielo seco accidentalmente. Considerando que todo el CO\u2082 se distribuye uniformemente:<\/p>\r\n        <ol type=\"a\">\r\n            <li>Calcula la concentraci\u00f3n de CO\u2082 en ppm si todo sublima<\/li>\r\n            <li>Determina si esta concentraci\u00f3n excede el PEL de 5000 ppm<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 medidas de emergencia deben tomarse?<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfCu\u00e1nto tiempo tardar\u00eda en bajar a niveles seguros con ventilaci\u00f3n normal?<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n        <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n            <p><em>Espacio para soluci\u00f3n:<\/em><\/p>\r\n            <textarea rows=\"7\" placeholder=\"Muestra tus c\u00e1lculos y razonamiento...\"><\/textarea>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n        <h4>Problema 3: Diagrama de fases<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Analiza el diagrama de fases del CO\u2082 y responde:<\/p>\r\n        <ol type=\"a\">\r\n            <li>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 el CO\u2082 no existe como l\u00edquido a presi\u00f3n atmosf\u00e9rica?<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfA qu\u00e9 presi\u00f3n y temperatura se encuentra el punto triple?<\/li>\r\n            <li>Explica qu\u00e9 sucede si comprimimos CO\u2082 gaseoso a 25\u00b0C desde 1 atm hasta 100 atm<\/li>\r\n            <li>Describe el proceso de obtenci\u00f3n industrial de hielo seco<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n        <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n            <p><em>Espacio para respuesta:<\/em><\/p>\r\n            <textarea rows=\"8\" placeholder=\"Explica detalladamente cada punto...\"><\/textarea>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n        <h4>Problema 4: Aplicaci\u00f3n pr\u00e1ctica<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Una f\u00e1brica de helados usa hielo seco para mantener los productos congelados durante distribuci\u00f3n. Cada contenedor necesita mantener -20\u00b0C por 12 horas, perdiendo 800 J\/min.<\/p>\r\n        <ol type=\"a\">\r\n            <li>Calcula la masa m\u00ednima de hielo seco necesaria por contenedor<\/li>\r\n            <li>Dise\u00f1a un sistema de seguridad para prevenir asfixia en el \u00e1rea de almacenamiento<\/li>\r\n            <li>Prop\u00f3n un m\u00e9todo para reciclar el CO\u2082 generado<\/li>\r\n            <li>Calcula el costo si el hielo seco cuesta $2\/kg<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n        <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n            <p><em>Espacio para soluci\u00f3n:<\/em><\/p>\r\n            <textarea rows=\"8\" placeholder=\"Presenta tu dise\u00f1o y c\u00e1lculos...\"><\/textarea>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- \ud83d\udd1f CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<h3>10. \ud83e\udde0 Reflexi\u00f3n metacognitiva<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"metacognitive-reflection\">\r\n    <div class=\"reflection-question\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83d\udd0d Autoevaluaci\u00f3n de comprensi\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Responde brevemente en tu cuaderno:<\/p>\r\n        <ol>\r\n            <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 aspecto de la sublimaci\u00f3n del hielo seco te result\u00f3 m\u00e1s interesante? \u00bfPor qu\u00e9?<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo puedes relacionar el diagrama de fases del CO\u2082 con otros sistemas que conoces?<\/li>\r\n            <li>Si tuvieras que explicar la seguridad del hielo seco a un trabajador nuevo, \u00bfqu\u00e9 3 puntos enfatizar\u00edas?<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 aplicaci\u00f3n pr\u00e1ctica del hielo seco crees que tendr\u00e1 m\u00e1s desarrollo en el futuro?<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"learning-check\">\r\n        <h4>\u2713 Verificaci\u00f3n de aprendizaje<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Marca los conceptos que ya dominas:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"checklist\">\r\n            <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Puedo calcular la energ\u00eda de sublimaci\u00f3n del hielo seco<\/label>\r\n            <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Comprendo la estructura molecular lineal del CO\u2082<\/label>\r\n            <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> S\u00e9 interpretar el diagrama de fases del di\u00f3xido de carbono<\/label>\r\n            <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Conozco los l\u00edmites de exposici\u00f3n segura al CO\u2082<\/label>\r\n            <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Puedo explicar al menos 3 aplicaciones pr\u00e1cticas del hielo seco<\/label>\r\n            <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Entiendo por qu\u00e9 el hielo seco sublima sin derretirse<\/label>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"real-world-connection\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83c\udf0d Conexi\u00f3n con el mundo real<\/h4>\r\n        <p><strong>Desaf\u00edo actual:<\/strong> El CO\u2082 usado para hielo seco a menudo es subproducto industrial. Investiga:<\/p>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo contribuye esto a la econom\u00eda circular?<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 industrias generan CO\u2082 como subproducto?<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo se compara el impacto ambiental del hielo seco con otros refrigerantes?<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT PARA INTERACTIVIDAD -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ DIAGRAMA INTERACTIVO - SUBLIMACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nfunction startSublimation() {\r\n    const iceBlock = document.querySelector('#iceBlock');\r\n    const particles = document.querySelector('#particles');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Iniciar animaci\u00f3n de sublimaci\u00f3n\r\n    iceBlock.querySelector('animate').beginElement();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Aumentar frecuencia de part\u00edculas\r\n    particles.querySelectorAll('animate').forEach(anim => {\r\n        anim.setAttribute('dur', '2s');\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar informaci\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('diagramInfo').innerHTML = \r\n        '<p><strong>Sublimaci\u00f3n en progreso:<\/strong> CO\u2082(s) \u2192 CO\u2082(g) a -78.5\u00b0C<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>El hielo seco se reduce sin dejar l\u00edquido<\/p>';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction resetSublimation() {\r\n    const iceBlock = document.querySelector('#iceBlock');\r\n    const particles = document.querySelector('#particles');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Restaurar tama\u00f1o y posici\u00f3n\r\n    iceBlock.setAttribute('height', '80');\r\n    iceBlock.setAttribute('y', '350');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Restaurar frecuencia de part\u00edculas\r\n    particles.querySelectorAll('animate').forEach((anim, index) => {\r\n        const durs = ['4s', '3.5s', '5s'];\r\n        anim.setAttribute('dur', durs[index]);\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('diagramInfo').innerHTML = \r\n        '<p>Haz clic en cualquier elemento o usa los controles para interactuar<\/p>';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showSafetyInfo() {\r\n    document.getElementById('diagramInfo').innerHTML = \r\n        '<p><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f Informaci\u00f3n de seguridad:<\/strong><\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 PEL (8h): 5000 ppm<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 STEL (15min): 30,000 ppm<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 IDLH: 40,000 ppm<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 Nunca almacenar en recipientes herm\u00e9ticos<\/p>';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Interactividad con elementos SVG\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.clickable').forEach(element => {\r\n    element.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const info = this.getAttribute('data-info');\r\n        document.getElementById('diagramInfo').innerHTML = \r\n            '<p><strong>' + this.id + ':<\/strong> ' + info + '<\/p>';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DE ENERG\u00cdA\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nconst massInput = document.getElementById('massInput');\r\nconst tempInput = document.getElementById('tempInput');\r\nconst timeInput = document.getElementById('timeInput');\r\nconst massValue = document.getElementById('massValue');\r\nconst tempValue = document.getElementById('tempValue');\r\nconst timeValue = document.getElementById('timeValue');\r\nconst energyResult = document.getElementById('energyResult');\r\nconst coolingResult = document.getElementById('coolingResult');\r\nconst sublimationRate = document.getElementById('sublimationRate');\r\nconst iceMassVisual = document.getElementById('iceMass');\r\n\r\nconst \u0394H_sub = 571; \/\/ J\/g\r\nconst c_water = 4.184; \/\/ J\/g\u00b0C\r\nconst \u03c1_water = 1; \/\/ g\/mL\r\n\r\nfunction updateSimulation() {\r\n    const mass = parseFloat(massInput.value); \/\/ g\r\n    const temp = parseFloat(tempInput.value); \/\/ \u00b0C\r\n    const time = parseFloat(timeInput.value); \/\/ horas\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ C\u00e1lculos\r\n    const energy = (mass * \u0394H_sub) \/ 1000; \/\/ kJ\r\n    const waterMass = energy * 1000 \/ (c_water * 25); \/\/ g de agua que se pueden enfriar 25\u00b0C\r\n    const waterVolume = waterMass \/ \u03c1_water \/ 1000; \/\/ L\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Tasa de sublimaci\u00f3n (aproximada basada en temperatura)\r\n    let rate = 125; \/\/ g\/hora base\r\n    if (temp > 25) rate = 200;\r\n    else if (temp < 0) rate = 80;\r\n    \r\n    const timeToSublimate = mass \/ rate;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar resultados\r\n    energyResult.textContent = `Energ\u00eda absorbida: ${energy.toFixed(1)} kJ`;\r\n    coolingResult.textContent = `Capacidad de enfriamiento: ${waterVolume.toFixed(1)} L de agua (25\u00b0C \u2192 0\u00b0C)`;\r\n    sublimationRate.textContent = `Tasa de sublimaci\u00f3n: ${rate} g\/hora (${timeToSublimate.toFixed(1)} horas para sublimar todo)`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n    const percentage = Math.min(100, (time \/ timeToSublimate) * 100);\r\n    iceMassVisual.style.height = `${100 - percentage}%`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Event listeners\r\nmassInput.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    massValue.textContent = this.value + ' g';\r\n    updateSimulation();\r\n});\r\n\r\ntempInput.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    tempValue.textContent = this.value + ' \u00b0C';\r\n    updateSimulation();\r\n});\r\n\r\ntimeInput.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    timeValue.textContent = this.value + ' horas';\r\n    updateSimulation();\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar\r\nupdateSimulation();\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ ESTRUCTURA MOLECULAR\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nfunction rotateMolecule(axis) {\r\n    const molecule = document.getElementById('co2Molecule');\r\n    const currentTransform = molecule.style.transform || 'rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg)';\r\n    let x = 0, y = 0;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Extraer valores actuales\r\n    const xMatch = currentTransform.match(\/rotateX\\(([-\\d]+)deg\\)\/);\r\n    const yMatch = currentTransform.match(\/rotateY\\(([-\\d]+)deg\\)\/);\r\n    \r\n    if (xMatch) x = parseInt(xMatch[1]);\r\n    if (yMatch) y = parseInt(yMatch[1]);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Aplicar rotaci\u00f3n\r\n    if (axis === 'x') x = (x + 45) % 360;\r\n    else if (axis === 'y') y = (y + 45) % 360;\r\n    \r\n    molecule.style.transform = `rotateX(${x}deg) rotateY(${y}deg)`;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showOrbitals() {\r\n    const molecule = document.getElementById('co2Molecule');\r\n    molecule.innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"orbital sigma\">\u03c3 (enlace sigma)<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"orbital pi\">\u03c0 (enlace pi)<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"orbital pi2\">\u03c0* (anti-enlace)<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"atom carbon\">C<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"atom oxygen\">O<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"atom oxygen2\">O<\/div>\r\n    `;\r\n    molecule.style.backgroundColor = 'rgba(0, 255, 234, 0.1)';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showResonance() {\r\n    const molecule = document.getElementById('co2Molecule');\r\n    molecule.innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"bond double\">C=O<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"bond triple\">C\u2261O\u207a<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"charge positive\">\u207a<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"charge negative\">\u207b<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"atom carbon\">C<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"atom oxygen\">O<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"atom oxygen2\">O<\/div>\r\n    `;\r\n    molecule.style.animation = 'pulse 2s infinite';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Crear mol\u00e9cula inicial\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    const molecule = document.getElementById('co2Molecule');\r\n    molecule.innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"bond\"><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"bond\"><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"atom carbon\">C<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"atom oxygen\">O<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"atom oxygen2\">O<\/div>\r\n    `;\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nlet quizScore = 0;\r\nlet totalQuestions = 5;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(button => {\r\n    button.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const isCorrect = this.getAttribute('data-correct') === 'true';\r\n        const feedback = this.getAttribute('data-feedback');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Deshabilitar todos los botones de esta pregunta\r\n        this.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(btn => {\r\n            btn.disabled = true;\r\n            if (btn.getAttribute('data-correct') === 'true') {\r\n                btn.style.backgroundColor = '#00ff00';\r\n                btn.style.color = '#000';\r\n            } else if (btn === this && !isCorrect) {\r\n                btn.style.backgroundColor = '#ff0000';\r\n                btn.style.color = '#fff';\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar puntaje\r\n        if (isCorrect) {\r\n            quizScore++;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar retroalimentaci\u00f3n\r\n        const feedbackDiv = document.getElementById('quizFeedback');\r\n        const answered = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option:disabled').length \/ 3;\r\n        \r\n        feedbackDiv.innerHTML = \r\n            '<div class=\"' + (isCorrect ? 'correct-feedback' : 'incorrect-feedback') + '\">' +\r\n                feedback +\r\n            '<\/div>' +\r\n            '<p>Progreso: ' + answered + '\/' + totalQuestions + ' preguntas<\/p>' +\r\n            '<p>Puntuaci\u00f3n actual: ' + quizScore + '\/' + totalQuestions + '<\/p>';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction resetQuiz() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(button => {\r\n        button.disabled = false;\r\n        button.style.backgroundColor = '';\r\n        button.style.color = '';\r\n    });\r\n    quizScore = 0;\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').innerHTML = '';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ DIAGRAMA DE FASES INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nconst phaseCanvas = document.getElementById('phaseCanvas');\r\nconst ctx = phaseCanvas.getContext('2d');\r\nconst pressureInput = document.getElementById('pressureInput');\r\nconst temperaturePhaseInput = document.getElementById('temperaturePhaseInput');\r\nconst pressureValue = document.getElementById('pressureValue');\r\nconst temperaturePhaseValue = document.getElementById('temperaturePhaseValue');\r\nconst phaseInfo = document.getElementById('phaseInfo');\r\n\r\n\/\/ Puntos importantes del diagrama de fases\r\nconst triplePoint = { P: 5.11, T: -56.6 }; \/\/ atm, \u00b0C\r\nconst criticalPoint = { P: 72.8, T: 31.1 }; \/\/ atm, \u00b0C\r\nconst sublimationPoint = { P: 1, T: -78.5 }; \/\/ atm, \u00b0C\r\n\r\nfunction drawPhaseDiagram(P, T) {\r\n    \/\/ Limpiar canvas\r\n    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, phaseCanvas.width, phaseCanvas.height);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ejes\r\n    ctx.strokeStyle = '#00ffea';\r\n    ctx.lineWidth = 2;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Eje Y (Presi\u00f3n)\r\n    ctx.beginPath();\r\n    ctx.moveTo(50, 50);\r\n    ctx.lineTo(50, 350);\r\n    ctx.stroke();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Eje X (Temperatura)\r\n    ctx.beginPath();\r\n    ctx.moveTo(50, 350);\r\n    ctx.lineTo(550, 350);\r\n    ctx.stroke();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Etiquetas\r\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#ff00ff';\r\n    ctx.font = '12px Courier New';\r\n    ctx.fillText('Presi\u00f3n (atm)', 10, 30);\r\n    ctx.fillText('Temperatura (\u00b0C)', 300, 380);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Escalas\r\n    for (let i = 0; i <= 100; i += 20) {\r\n        const y = 350 - (i * 3);\r\n        ctx.fillText(i + ' atm', 20, y);\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        ctx.moveTo(45, y);\r\n        ctx.lineTo(50, y);\r\n        ctx.stroke();\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    for (let i = -100; i <= 40; i += 20) {\r\n        const x = 50 + ((i + 100) * 500 \/ 140);\r\n        ctx.fillText(i + '\u00b0C', x, 365);\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        ctx.moveTo(x, 350);\r\n        ctx.lineTo(x, 355);\r\n        ctx.stroke();\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ L\u00edneas de cambio de fase (simplificadas)\r\n    ctx.strokeStyle = '#ffff00';\r\n    ctx.lineWidth = 3;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ L\u00ednea s\u00f3lido-gas (sublimaci\u00f3n)\r\n    ctx.beginPath();\r\n    ctx.moveTo(50 + ((-78.5 + 100) * 500 \/ 140), 350 - (1 * 3));\r\n    ctx.lineTo(50 + ((-56.6 + 100) * 500 \/ 140), 350 - (5.11 * 3));\r\n    ctx.stroke();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ L\u00ednea s\u00f3lido-l\u00edquido\r\n    ctx.beginPath();\r\n    ctx.moveTo(50 + ((-56.6 + 100) * 500 \/ 140), 350 - (5.11 * 3));\r\n    ctx.lineTo(50 + ((0 + 100) * 500 \/ 140), 350 - (100 * 3));\r\n    ctx.stroke();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ L\u00ednea l\u00edquido-gas\r\n    ctx.beginPath();\r\n    ctx.moveTo(50 + ((-56.6 + 100) * 500 \/ 140), 350 - (5.11 * 3));\r\n    ctx.lineTo(50 + ((31.1 + 100) * 500 \/ 140), 350 - (72.8 * 3));\r\n    ctx.stroke();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Punto triple\r\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#ff5500';\r\n    ctx.beginPath();\r\n    const tpX = 50 + ((-56.6 + 100) * 500 \/ 140);\r\n    const tpY = 350 - (5.11 * 3);\r\n    ctx.arc(tpX, tpY, 6, 0, Math.PI * 2);\r\n    ctx.fill();\r\n    ctx.fillText('Punto triple', tpX + 10, tpY - 10);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Punto cr\u00edtico\r\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#ff00ff';\r\n    ctx.beginPath();\r\n    const cpX = 50 + ((31.1 + 100) * 500 \/ 140);\r\n    const cpY = 350 - (72.8 * 3);\r\n    ctx.arc(cpX, cpY, 6, 0, Math.PI * 2);\r\n    ctx.fill();\r\n    ctx.fillText('Punto cr\u00edtico', cpX + 10, cpY - 10);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Punto actual\r\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#00ffea';\r\n    ctx.beginPath();\r\n    const currentX = 50 + ((T + 100) * 500 \/ 140);\r\n    const currentY = 350 - (P * 3);\r\n    ctx.arc(currentX, currentY, 8, 0, Math.PI * 2);\r\n    ctx.fill();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Determinar fase\r\n    let phase = '';\r\n    if (P > 72.8 && T > 31.1) {\r\n        phase = 'Fluido supercr\u00edtico';\r\n    } else if (P > 5.11 && T > -56.6) {\r\n        phase = 'L\u00edquido';\r\n    } else if (T < -78.5 && P < 5.11) {\r\n        phase = 'S\u00f3lido (hielo seco)';\r\n    } else {\r\n        phase = 'Gas';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar informaci\u00f3n\r\n    phaseInfo.innerHTML = `\r\n        <p>Presi\u00f3n: ${P.toFixed(1)} atm | Temperatura: ${T.toFixed(1)}\u00b0C<\/p>\r\n        <p><strong>Estado:<\/strong> ${phase}<\/p>\r\n        <p><strong>Coordenadas:<\/strong> (${T.toFixed(1)}\u00b0C, ${P.toFixed(1)} atm)<\/p>\r\n    `;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction goToTriplePoint() {\r\n    pressureInput.value = triplePoint.P;\r\n    temperaturePhaseInput.value = triplePoint.T;\r\n    pressureValue.textContent = triplePoint.P.toFixed(2) + ' atm';\r\n    temperaturePhaseValue.textContent = triplePoint.T.toFixed(1) + ' \u00b0C';\r\n    drawPhaseDiagram(triplePoint.P, triplePoint.T);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction goToCriticalPoint() {\r\n    pressureInput.value = criticalPoint.P;\r\n    temperaturePhaseInput.value = criticalPoint.T;\r\n    pressureValue.textContent = criticalPoint.P.toFixed(1) + ' atm';\r\n    temperaturePhaseValue.textContent = criticalPoint.T.toFixed(1) + ' \u00b0C';\r\n    drawPhaseDiagram(criticalPoint.P, criticalPoint.T);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showAtmosphericConditions() {\r\n    pressureInput.value = 1;\r\n    temperaturePhaseInput.value = 25;\r\n    pressureValue.textContent = '1 atm';\r\n    temperaturePhaseValue.textContent = '25 \u00b0C';\r\n    drawPhaseDiagram(1, 25);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Event listeners para el diagrama de fases\r\npressureInput.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    pressureValue.textContent = parseFloat(this.value).toFixed(1) + ' atm';\r\n    const P = parseFloat(this.value);\r\n    const T = parseFloat(temperaturePhaseInput.value);\r\n    drawPhaseDiagram(P, T);\r\n});\r\n\r\ntemperaturePhaseInput.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    temperaturePhaseValue.textContent = this.value + ' \u00b0C';\r\n    const P = parseFloat(pressureInput.value);\r\n    const T = parseFloat(this.value);\r\n    drawPhaseDiagram(P, T);\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar diagrama de fases\r\ndrawPhaseDiagram(1, 25);\r\n<\/script>\r\n<\/div>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Composici\u00f3n hielo seco","respuesta":"CO\u2082 s\u00f3lido"},{"enunciado":"Proceso al calentarse","respuesta":"Sublimaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Temperatura sublimaci\u00f3n","respuesta":"-78.5\u00b0C"},{"enunciado":"Usos principales","respuesta":"Refrigeraci\u00f3n, efectos, limpieza"},{"enunciado":"Densidad hielo seco","respuesta":"1.56 g\/cm\u00b3"},{"enunciado":"Calor sublimaci\u00f3n","respuesta":"571 J\/g"},{"enunciado":"Estructura CO\u2082","respuesta":"Lineal, apolar"},{"enunciado":"Enlaces en CO\u2082","respuesta":"Doble (resonancia)"},{"enunciado":"PEL OSHA CO\u2082","respuesta":"5000 ppm"},{"enunciado":"Punto triple CO\u2082","respuesta":"-56.6\u00b0C, 5.11 atm"},{"enunciado":"IDLH CO\u2082","respuesta":"40,000 ppm"},{"enunciado":"NIST 2025: T<sub>sub<\/sub> exacta","respuesta":"-78.464\u00b0C"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Hielo seco es...","opciones":["CO\u2082 s\u00f3lido","H\u2082O congelado","N\u2082 l\u00edquido","O\u2082"],"correcta":"CO\u2082 s\u00f3lido"},{"pregunta":"Sublima a...","opciones":["-78.5\u00b0C","0\u00b0C","100\u00b0C","-196\u00b0C"],"correcta":"-78.5\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"No deja...","opciones":["L\u00edquido","Gas","S\u00f3lido","Calor"],"correcta":"L\u00edquido"},{"pregunta":"Riesgo principal","opciones":["Asfixia","Explosi\u00f3n","Toxicidad","Calor"],"correcta":"Asfixia"},{"pregunta":"Usado en...","opciones":["Refrigeraci\u00f3n","Calefacci\u00f3n","Iluminaci\u00f3n","Sonido"],"correcta":"Refrigeraci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Efecto niebla por...","opciones":["CO\u2082 + H\u2082O","CO\u2082 + O\u2082","CO\u2082 solo","Calor"],"correcta":"CO\u2082 + H\u2082O"},{"pregunta":"Densidad > agua","opciones":["S\u00ed","No","Igual","Variable"],"correcta":"S\u00ed"},{"pregunta":"PEL OSHA CO\u2082","opciones":["5000 ppm","500 ppm","50 ppm","0 ppm"],"correcta":"5000 ppm"},{"pregunta":"Sublimaci\u00f3n es...","opciones":["S\u00f3lido \u2192 Gas","L\u00edquido \u2192 Gas","Gas \u2192 S\u00f3lido","S\u00f3lido \u2192 L\u00edquido"],"correcta":"S\u00f3lido \u2192 Gas"},{"pregunta":"CO\u2082 es...","opciones":["Apolar","Polar","I\u00f3nico","Met\u00e1lico"],"correcta":"Apolar"},{"pregunta":"Calor sublimaci\u00f3n","opciones":["571 J\/g","334 J\/g","2260 J\/g","0 J\/g"],"correcta":"571 J\/g"},{"pregunta":"Punto triple CO\u2082","opciones":["-56.6\u00b0C","-78.5\u00b0C","0\u00b0C","100\u00b0C"],"correcta":"-56.6\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Estructura CO\u2082","opciones":["Lineal","Angular","Trigonal","Tetra\u00e9drica"],"correcta":"Lineal"},{"pregunta":"Blasting remueve...","opciones":["Suciedad sin residuos","Con agua","Con calor","Con luz"],"correcta":"Suciedad sin residuos"},{"pregunta":"IDLH CO\u2082","opciones":["40,000 ppm","5000 ppm","1000 ppm","100 ppm"],"correcta":"40,000 ppm"},{"pregunta":"Enlaces CO\u2082","opciones":["Doble (resonancia)","Simple","Triple","I\u00f3nico"],"correcta":"Doble (resonancia)"},{"pregunta":"Transporte vacunas","opciones":["Hielo seco","Hielo normal","Agua","Aire"],"correcta":"Hielo seco"},{"pregunta":"CO\u2082 en sangre forma...","opciones":["H\u2082CO\u2083","CO","O\u2082","H\u2082O"],"correcta":"H\u2082CO\u2083"},{"pregunta":"NIST mide T<sub>sub<\/sub>","opciones":["-78.464\u00b0C","-78.5\u00b0C","-80\u00b0C","-70\u00b0C"],"correcta":"-78.464\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Quemadura por fr\u00edo","opciones":["< -78\u00b0C","> 0\u00b0C","> 100\u00b0C","Ninguna"],"correcta":"< -78\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula sublimaci\u00f3n","opciones":["CO\u2082(s) \u2192 CO\u2082(g)","CO\u2082(g) \u2192 CO\u2082(s)","CO\u2082(l) \u2192 CO\u2082(g)","CO\u2082(s) \u2192 CO\u2082(l)"],"correcta":"CO\u2082(s) \u2192 CO\u2082(g)"},{"preguna":"Presi\u00f3n punto triple","opciones":["5.11 atm","1 atm","0.1 atm","10 atm"],"correcta":"5.11 atm"},{"pregunta":"H\u00edbrido CO\u2082","opciones":["sp","sp\u00b2","sp\u00b3","No h\u00edbrido"],"correcta":"sp"},{"pregunta":"CO\u2082 en bebidas","opciones":["Carbonataci\u00f3n","Refrigeraci\u00f3n","Limpieza","Efectos"],"correcta":"Carbonataci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Efecto invernadero","opciones":["CO\u2082 absorbe IR","Refleja UV","Emite luz","Nada"],"correcta":"CO\u2082 absorbe IR"},{"pregunta":"OSHA exige ventilaci\u00f3n si...","opciones":[">5000 ppm","<1000 ppm",">100 ppm","Siempre"],"correcta":">5000 ppm"},{"pregunta":"Densidad CO\u2082(g) a 0\u00b0C","opciones":["1.98 g\/L","1.29 g\/L","0.001 g\/L","100 g\/L"],"correcta":"1.98 g\/L"},{"pregunta":"Sublimaci\u00f3n endot\u00e9rmica","opciones":["Absorbe calor","Libera calor","Neutro","Variable"],"correcta":"Absorbe calor"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC nombre CO\u2082","opciones":["Di\u00f3xido de carbono","Mon\u00f3xido","\u00d3xido","Carburo"],"correcta":"Di\u00f3xido de carbono"},{"pregunta":"Meta OSHA 2030: reducir CO\u2082 en...","opciones":["Espacios cerrados 20%","0%","100%","50%"],"correcta":"Espacios cerrados 20%"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"big-bang","titulo":"El Big Bang: El Nacimiento Qu\u00edmico del Universo","contenido":"<!-- 1\ufe0f\u20e3 INTRODUCCI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL -->\r\n<div class=\"content-header\">\r\n    <div class=\"learning-goals\">\r\n        <h3>\ud83c\udfaf Objetivos de aprendizaje<\/h3>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li>Comprender la teor\u00eda del Big Bang y su evidencia cient\u00edfica<\/li>\r\n            <li>Analizar el proceso de nucleos\u00edntesis primordial<\/li>\r\n            <li>Explicar la formaci\u00f3n de elementos qu\u00edmicos en el universo temprano<\/li>\r\n            <li>Interpretar datos cosmol\u00f3gicos como la radiaci\u00f3n c\u00f3smica de fondo<\/li>\r\n            <li>Calcular relaciones de expansi\u00f3n usando la ley de Hubble<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 2\ufe0f\u20e3 DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO ESTRUCTURADO -->\r\n<div class=\"content-body\">\r\n    <h3>1. \u00bfQu\u00e9 es el Big Bang?<\/h3>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"theory-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"theory-card\">\r\n            <h4>Definici\u00f3n cient\u00edfica<\/h4>\r\n            <p>El <strong>Big Bang<\/strong> es la <strong>teor\u00eda cosmol\u00f3gica est\u00e1ndar<\/strong> que describe el origen del universo.<\/p>\r\n            <p><strong>Edad del universo:<\/strong> 13.799 \u00b1 0.021 mil millones de a\u00f1os (Planck 2025)<\/p>\r\n            <p><strong>Concepto clave:<\/strong> No fue una explosi\u00f3n, sino una <strong>expansi\u00f3n r\u00e1pida<\/strong> desde un estado inicial extremadamente caliente y denso.<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"theory-card\">\r\n            <h4>Principios fundamentales<\/h4>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>Singularidad inicial:<\/strong> Estado de densidad y temperatura infinitas<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Expansi\u00f3n m\u00e9trica:<\/strong> El espacio-tiempo se expande<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Enfriamiento progresivo:<\/strong> De ~10\u00b3\u00b2 K a 2.725 K actual<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Formaci\u00f3n de estructura:<\/strong> De part\u00edculas elementales a galaxias<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h3>2. Cronolog\u00eda del universo temprano<\/h3>\r\n    \r\n    <table class=\"classification-table\">\r\n        <thead>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <th>Tiempo desde Big Bang<\/th>\r\n                <th>Evento<\/th>\r\n                <th>Temperatura<\/th>\r\n                <th>Proceso f\u00edsico<\/th>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/thead>\r\n        <tbody>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>10\u207b\u2074\u00b3 segundos<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>Era de Planck<\/td>\r\n                <td>~10\u00b3\u00b2 K<\/td>\r\n                <td>Unificaci\u00f3n de todas las fuerzas<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>10\u207b\u00b3\u2076 segundos<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>Inflaci\u00f3n c\u00f3smica<\/td>\r\n                <td>~10\u00b2\u2078 K<\/td>\r\n                <td>Expansi\u00f3n exponencial<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>10\u207b\u2076 segundos<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>Hadronizaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <td>~10\u00b9\u00b2 K<\/td>\r\n                <td>Quarks \u2192 protones y neutrones<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>3 minutos<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td><strong>Nucleos\u00edntesis primordial<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>~10\u2079 K<\/td>\r\n                <td>Formaci\u00f3n de n\u00facleos ligeros<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>380,000 a\u00f1os<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>Recombinaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <td>~3000 K<\/td>\r\n                <td>Electrones + n\u00facleos \u2192 \u00e1tomos neutros<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>100-500 millones a\u00f1os<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>Formaci\u00f3n estelar<\/td>\r\n                <td>\u2014<\/td>\r\n                <td>Primeras estrellas y galaxias<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/tbody>\r\n    <\/table>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"theory-card example\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83d\udcd0 Ejemplo: Escalas de tiempo c\u00f3smico<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Si comprimimos los 13.8 mil millones de a\u00f1os del universo en 1 a\u00f1o calendario:<\/p>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><strong>1 de enero:<\/strong> Big Bang<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>14 de enero:<\/strong> Formaci\u00f3n de las primeras estrellas<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>31 de agosto:<\/strong> Formaci\u00f3n del Sistema Solar<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>31 de diciembre, 23:59:58:<\/strong> Aparici\u00f3n del Homo sapiens<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 3\ufe0f\u20e3 VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA - EXPANSI\u00d3N DEL UNIVERSO -->\r\n<h3>3. Simulador interactivo: Expansi\u00f3n c\u00f3smica<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"diagram-container\" id=\"expansionContainer\">\r\n    <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"500\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 500\" id=\"universeExpansion\">\r\n        <!-- Fondo del espacio -->\r\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" fill=\"#0a0a14\"\/>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- L\u00ednea de tiempo c\u00f3smica -->\r\n        <g id=\"timeline\">\r\n            <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"400\" x2=\"700\" y2=\"400\" stroke=\"#00ffea\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\"\/>\r\n            <text x=\"50\" y=\"390\" fill=\"#ff00ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\">t = 0<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"750\" y=\"390\" fill=\"#ffff00\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\">Presente<\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Singularidad inicial -->\r\n        <g id=\"singularity\" class=\"clickable\" data-info=\"Singularidad: Estado inicial de densidad infinita\">\r\n            <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"400\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#ff0000\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"8;15;8\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/circle>\r\n            <text x=\"150\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#ff0000\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Singularidad<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"150\" y=\"420\" fill=\"#ff5500\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10\u207b\u2074\u00b3 s<\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Era de inflaci\u00f3n -->\r\n        <g id=\"inflation\" class=\"clickable\" data-info=\"Inflaci\u00f3n c\u00f3smica: Expansi\u00f3n exponencial\">\r\n            <rect x=\"200\" y=\"350\" width=\"150\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ff00ff\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n            <text x=\"275\" y=\"370\" fill=\"#000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">INFLACI\u00d3N<\/text>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Flechas de expansi\u00f3n -->\r\n            <line x1=\"250\" y1=\"320\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#ffff00\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowExpansion)\"\/>\r\n            <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"320\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#ffff00\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowExpansion)\"\/>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Nucleos\u00edntesis -->\r\n        <g id=\"nucleosynthesis\" class=\"clickable\" data-info=\"Nucleos\u00edntesis primordial: Formaci\u00f3n de H, He, Li\">\r\n            <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"300\" r=\"60\" fill=\"url(#nucleoGradient)\" opacity=\"0.8\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"60;65;60\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/circle>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Elementos formados -->\r\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"290\" fill=\"#000\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">H + He<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"310\" fill=\"#1565C0\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">75% H \/ 25% He<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"330\" fill=\"#4A148C\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3 minutos<\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Recombinaci\u00f3n y CMB -->\r\n        <g id=\"recombination\" class=\"clickable\" data-info=\"Recombinaci\u00f3n: Formaci\u00f3n de \u00e1tomos neutros y liberaci\u00f3n de CMB\">\r\n            <ellipse cx=\"550\" cy=\"200\" rx=\"100\" ry=\"50\" fill=\"#9FA8DA\" opacity=\"0.6\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"rx\" values=\"100;110;100\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/ellipse>\r\n            <text x=\"550\" y=\"190\" fill=\"#4A148C\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">CMB<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"550\" y=\"210\" fill=\"#6A1B9A\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2.725 K<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"550\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">380,000 a\u00f1os<\/text>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Radiaci\u00f3n CMB -->\r\n            <circle cx=\"500\" cy=\"180\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"cx\" values=\"500;600;500\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.3;1\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/circle>\r\n            <circle cx=\"520\" cy=\"220\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#fff\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"cx\" values=\"520;580;520\" dur=\"1.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" begin=\"0.5s\"\/>\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.2;1\" dur=\"1.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" begin=\"0.5s\"\/>\r\n            <\/circle>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Formaci\u00f3n de galaxias -->\r\n        <g id=\"galaxyFormation\" class=\"clickable\" data-info=\"Formaci\u00f3n gal\u00e1ctica: Agrupamiento por gravedad\">\r\n            <!-- Galaxia espiral -->\r\n            <circle cx=\"650\" cy=\"100\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#536DFE\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n            <ellipse cx=\"650\" cy=\"100\" rx=\"60\" ry=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3949AB\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n            <ellipse cx=\"650\" cy=\"100\" rx=\"40\" ry=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5C6BC0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"\/>\r\n            <text x=\"650\" y=\"160\" fill=\"#E8EAF6\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Galaxias<\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Flecha de expansi\u00f3n continua -->\r\n        <g id=\"expansionArrow\">\r\n            <defs>\r\n                <marker id=\"arrowExpansion\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                    <path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#ffff00\"\/>\r\n                <\/marker>\r\n            <\/defs>\r\n            <path d=\"M150 400 L700 100\" stroke=\"#ff5500\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"8,4\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowExpansion)\"\/>\r\n            <text x=\"425\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#ff5500\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Expansi\u00f3n c\u00f3smica<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"425\" y=\"270\" fill=\"#ff00ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">v = H\u2080\u00b7d<\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Par\u00e1metros cosmol\u00f3gicos -->\r\n        <g id=\"cosmoParams\">\r\n            <rect x=\"600\" y=\"350\" width=\"180\" height=\"80\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#ffff00\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n            <text x=\"690\" y=\"375\" fill=\"#ffff00\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Planck 2025<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"690\" y=\"395\" fill=\"#00ffea\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">H\u2080 = 67.4 km\/s\/Mpc<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"690\" y=\"415\" fill=\"#ff00ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"Courier New\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Edad: 13.799 Ga<\/text>\r\n        <\/g>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Gradiente para nucleos\u00edntesis -->\r\n        <defs>\r\n            <linearGradient id=\"nucleoGradient\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\">\r\n                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#00ffea\" stop-opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#ff00ff\" stop-opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n            <\/linearGradient>\r\n        <\/defs>\r\n    <\/svg>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"diagram-controls\">\r\n        <button onclick=\"playExpansion()\">\u25b6\ufe0f Iniciar expansi\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"pauseExpansion()\">\u23f8\ufe0f Pausar<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"highlightNucleosynthesis()\">\u269b\ufe0f Destacar nucleos\u00edntesis<\/button>\r\n        <button onclick=\"showCMBInfo()\">\ud83c\udf21\ufe0f Info CMB<\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"diagram-info\" id=\"universeInfo\">\r\n        <p>Haz clic en cualquier etapa para ver detalles. Usa los controles para interactuar con la simulaci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 4\ufe0f\u20e3 SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO: NUCLEOS\u00cdNTESIS PRIMORDIAL -->\r\n<h3>4. Simulador: Abundancia de elementos primordiales<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"simulator-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n        <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n            <label for=\"timeAfterBB\">Tiempo despu\u00e9s del Big Bang:<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"timeAfterBB\" min=\"1\" max=\"1800\" value=\"180\" step=\"1\">\r\n            <span id=\"timeValue\">180 segundos (3 minutos)<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n            <label for=\"tempAfterBB\">Temperatura (K):<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"tempAfterBB\" min=\"1e6\" max=\"1e10\" value=\"1e9\" step=\"1e6\">\r\n            <span id=\"tempValue\">1 \u00d7 10\u2079 K<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n            <label for=\"baryonDensity\">Densidad bari\u00f3nica (g\/cm\u00b3):<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" id=\"baryonDensity\" min=\"1e-30\" max=\"1e-20\" value=\"1e-24\" step=\"1e-25\">\r\n            <span id=\"densityValue\">1 \u00d7 10\u207b\u00b2\u2074 g\/cm\u00b3<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"simulator-visual\">\r\n        <div class=\"abundance-display\">\r\n            <div class=\"formula\">\r\n                \\[ n + p \\rightarrow D + \\gamma \\]\r\n                \\[ D + D \\rightarrow \\text{\u00b3He} + n \\]\r\n                \\[ \\text{\u00b3He} + D \\rightarrow \\text{\u2074He} + p \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"result\">\r\n                <h4>Abundancia primordial calculada:<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"abundance-chart\" id=\"abundanceChart\">\r\n                    <!-- Se generar\u00e1 con JS -->\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <p id=\"abundanceResult\">Hidr\u00f3geno: 75% | Helio-4: 25% | Deuterio: 0.01% | Helio-3: 0.01% | Litio-7: trazas<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"reactions-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"reaction\" id=\"reaction1\">\r\n                <div class=\"particle proton\">p\u207a<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plus\">+<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"particle neutron\">n\u2070<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"arrow\">\u2192<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"particle deuterium\">D<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plus\">+<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"particle photon\">\u03b3<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"reaction\" id=\"reaction2\">\r\n                <div class=\"particle deuterium\">D<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plus\">+<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"particle deuterium\">D<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"arrow\">\u2192<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"particle helium3\">\u00b3He<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plus\">+<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"particle neutron\">n\u2070<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"reaction\" id=\"reaction3\">\r\n                <div class=\"particle helium3\">\u00b3He<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plus\">+<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"particle deuterium\">D<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"arrow\">\u2192<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"particle helium4\">\u2074He<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plus\">+<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"particle proton\">p\u207a<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"simulator-explanation\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83d\udcca Proceso de nucleos\u00edntesis:<\/h4>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><strong>Primer segundo:<\/strong> Protones y neutrones en equilibrio t\u00e9rmico<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>1-180 segundos:<\/strong> Formaci\u00f3n de deuterio cuando T \u2248 10\u2079 K<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>3 minutos:<\/strong> Reacciones en cadena forman helio<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>20 minutos:<\/strong> El universo se enfr\u00eda demasiado para m\u00e1s fusi\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Resultado:<\/strong> ~75% H, ~25% He, trazas de D, \u00b3He, \u2077Li<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 5\ufe0f\u20e3 RADIACI\u00d3N C\u00d3SMICA DE FONDO INTERACTIVA -->\r\n<h3>5. Radiaci\u00f3n c\u00f3smica de fondo (CMB)<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"cmb-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"cmb-visual\">\r\n        <div class=\"cmb-map\" id=\"cmbMap\">\r\n            <!-- Mapa del CMB se generar\u00e1 con JS -->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"cmb-controls\">\r\n            <div class=\"cmb-slider\">\r\n                <label for=\"cmbFrequency\">Frecuencia (GHz):<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"cmbFrequency\" min=\"30\" max=\"300\" value=\"160\" step=\"10\">\r\n                <span id=\"frequencyValue\">160 GHz<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"cmb-buttons\">\r\n                <button onclick=\"showTemperatureMap()\">\ud83c\udf21\ufe0f Mapa de temperatura<\/button>\r\n                <button onclick=\"showPolarizationMap()\">\u21bb Mapa de polarizaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                <button onclick=\"showAnisotropies()\">\ud83c\udfaf Anisotrop\u00edas<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"cmb-info\">\r\n        <h4>Caracter\u00edsticas del CMB:<\/h4>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><strong>Temperatura:<\/strong> 2.72548 \u00b1 0.00057 K (COBE\/FIRAS)<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Espectro:<\/strong> Cuerpo negro casi perfecto (\u03bb_max = 1.063 mm)<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Redshift:<\/strong> z \u2248 1100<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Anisotrop\u00edas:<\/strong> \u0394T\/T \u2248 10\u207b\u2075 (fluctuaciones de densidad inicial)<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Polarizaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> E-modos y B-modos (inflaci\u00f3n)<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"cmb-formulas\">\r\n            <h5>F\u00f3rmulas clave:<\/h5>\r\n            <p>\\[ \\lambda_{\\text{max}} = \\frac{b}{T} \\approx 1.063 \\text{ mm} \\]<\/p>\r\n            <p>\\[ z = \\frac{\\lambda_{\\text{obs}}}{\\lambda_{\\text{emit}}} - 1 \\approx 1100 \\]<\/p>\r\n            <p>\\[ T_{\\text{CMB}}(z) = T_0(1 + z) \\]<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"discovery-info\">\r\n            <h5>\ud83d\udd2d Descubrimiento hist\u00f3rico:<\/h5>\r\n            <p><strong>1965:<\/strong> Arno Penzias y Robert Wilson (Bell Labs) descubren accidentalmente el CMB mientras trabajaban con antenas de radio. Premio Nobel 1978.<\/p>\r\n            <p><strong>1992:<\/strong> COBE sat\u00e9lite confirma espectro de cuerpo negro perfecto. Premio Nobel 2006 para John Mather y George Smoot.<\/p>\r\n            <p><strong>2013:<\/strong> Planck sat\u00e9lite mide anisotrop\u00edas con precisi\u00f3n sin precedentes.<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 6\ufe0f\u20e3 QUIZ INTERACTIVO (5 PREGUNTAS) -->\r\n<h3>6. Quiz de autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p><strong>Pregunta 1:<\/strong> \u00bfQu\u00e9 evidencia principal respalda la teor\u00eda del Big Bang?<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" data-feedback=\"\u2705 Correcto: El CMB es la radiaci\u00f3n residual del universo temprano\">Radiaci\u00f3n c\u00f3smica de fondo (CMB)<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: Eso explica la evoluci\u00f3n estelar, no el origen\">Fusi\u00f3n nuclear en estrellas<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: Eso es mec\u00e1nica cu\u00e1ntica, no cosmolog\u00eda\">Principio de incertidumbre<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p><strong>Pregunta 2:<\/strong> Durante la nucleos\u00edntesis primordial, \u00bfqu\u00e9 elementos se formaron principalmente?<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" data-feedback=\"\u2705 Correcto: ~75% hidr\u00f3geno y ~25% helio\">Hidr\u00f3geno y helio<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: El carbono se forma en estrellas\">Carbono y ox\u00edgeno<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: Los elementos pesados son posteriores\">Hierro y n\u00edquel<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p><strong>Pregunta 3:<\/strong> \u00bfQu\u00e9 significa que el CMB tenga un espectro de cuerpo negro casi perfecto?<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" data-feedback=\"\u2705 Correcto: Indica que el universo temprano estaba en equilibrio t\u00e9rmico\">El universo temprano estaba en equilibrio t\u00e9rmico<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: Tiene fluctuaciones peque\u00f1as (10\u207b\u2075)\">No hay fluctuaciones de temperatura<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: Se descubri\u00f3 en 1965\">Fue predicho en 1900<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p><strong>Pregunta 4:<\/strong> Calcula el corrimiento al rojo (z) si la temperatura del CMB era 3000 K al emitirse:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" data-feedback=\"\u2705 Correcto: z = T_emit\/T_obs - 1 = 3000\/2.725 - 1 \u2248 1100\">z \u2248 1100<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: Revisa la f\u00f3rmula z = T_emit\/T_obs - 1\">z \u2248 100<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: Ese ser\u00eda un corrimiento enorme\">z \u2248 10\u2076<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n        <p><strong>Pregunta 5:<\/strong> \u00bfQu\u00e9 establece la ley de Hubble?<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" data-feedback=\"\u2705 Correcto: v = H\u2080\u00b7d, donde H\u2080 es la constante de Hubble\">La velocidad de recesi\u00f3n es proporcional a la distancia<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: Eso es la nucleos\u00edntesis\">La abundancia de helio es constante<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" data-feedback=\"\u274c Incorrecto: Eso es la relatividad especial\">La velocidad de la luz es constante<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\"><\/div>\r\n    <button class=\"quiz-reset\" onclick=\"resetQuiz()\">\ud83d\udd04 Reiniciar Quiz<\/button>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 7\ufe0f\u20e3 EVIDENCIAS CIENT\u00cdFICAS -->\r\n<h3>7. Evidencias del Big Bang<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"evidence-grid\">\r\n    <div class=\"evidence-card\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83d\udd2d Expansi\u00f3n del universo<\/h4>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><strong>Ley de Hubble (1929):<\/strong> v = H\u2080\u00b7d<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Constante de Hubble:<\/strong> H\u2080 = 67.4 km\/s\/Mpc (Planck 2025)<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Corrimiento al rojo:<\/strong> z = \u0394\u03bb\/\u03bb<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Predicci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Si retrocedemos en el tiempo, el universo era m\u00e1s denso y caliente<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <p class=\"evidence-tip\"><strong>Dato:<\/strong> Galaxias m\u00e1s lejanas se alejan m\u00e1s r\u00e1pido<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"evidence-card\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83c\udf21\ufe0f Radiaci\u00f3n c\u00f3smica de fondo<\/h4>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><strong>Descubrimiento:<\/strong> 1965 (Penzias & Wilson)<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Temperatura:<\/strong> 2.72548 K \u00b1 0.00057<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Espectro:<\/strong> Cuerpo negro casi perfecto<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Origen:<\/strong> Radiaci\u00f3n de la \u00e9poca de recombinaci\u00f3n (z \u2248 1100)<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <p class=\"evidence-tip\"><strong>Premio Nobel:<\/strong> 1978 (Penzias & Wilson), 2006 (Mather & Smoot)<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"evidence-card\">\r\n        <h4>\u269b\ufe0f Abundancia de elementos ligeros<\/h4>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><strong>Predicci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Alpher, Bethe, Gamow (1948)<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Observado:<\/strong> ~75% H, ~25% He (masa)<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Deuterio:<\/strong> ~0.01% (muy sensible a densidad bari\u00f3nica)<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Litio-7:<\/strong> Trazas (discrepancia con teor\u00eda)<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <p class=\"evidence-tip\"><strong>Prueba:<\/strong> Coincidencia precisa entre teor\u00eda y observaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"evidence-card\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Edad del universo<\/h4>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><strong>M\u00e9todos independientes:<\/strong> Edad de estrellas, expansi\u00f3n, CMB<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Edad actual:<\/strong> 13.799 \u00b1 0.021 mil millones de a\u00f1os<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Consistencia:<\/strong> Todas las medidas concuerdan<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Verificaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Edad > edad de estrellas m\u00e1s viejas<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <p class=\"evidence-tip\"><strong>Fuente:<\/strong> Misi\u00f3n Planck de la ESA (2013-2022)<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 8\ufe0f\u20e3 PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN (4 PROBLEMAS) -->\r\n<h3>8. \ud83d\udcdd Problemas tipo examen<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n    <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n        <h4>Problema 1: Ley de Hubble y expansi\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Una galaxia distante muestra un corrimiento al rojo de z = 0.1. Usando la constante de Hubble H\u2080 = 67.4 km\/s\/Mpc:<\/p>\r\n        <ol type=\"a\">\r\n            <li>Calcula la velocidad de recesi\u00f3n de la galaxia<\/li>\r\n            <li>Determina la distancia a la galaxia en Mpc<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfCu\u00e1nto tiempo hace que la luz que vemos dej\u00f3 la galaxia?<\/li>\r\n            <li>Explica c\u00f3mo esta observaci\u00f3n respalda la teor\u00eda del Big Bang<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n        <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n            <p><em>Espacio para soluci\u00f3n:<\/em><\/p>\r\n            <textarea rows=\"6\" placeholder=\"Desarrolla tus c\u00e1lculos paso a paso...\"><\/textarea>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n        <h4>Problema 2: Nucleos\u00edntesis primordial<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Durante los primeros minutos del universo, ocurrieron las siguientes reacciones:<\/p>\r\n        <ol>\r\n            <li>n + p \u2192 D + \u03b3<\/li>\r\n            <li>D + D \u2192 \u00b3He + n<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00b3He + D \u2192 \u2074He + p<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n        <p><strong>Preguntas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n        <ol type=\"a\">\r\n            <li>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 no se formaron elementos m\u00e1s pesados que el litio durante la BBN?<\/li>\r\n            <li>Explica por qu\u00e9 la abundancia de deuterio es un indicador sensible de la densidad bari\u00f3nica<\/li>\r\n            <li>Calcula la energ\u00eda liberada en la formaci\u00f3n de un n\u00facleo de helio-4 a partir de protones y neutrones<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n        <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n            <p><em>Espacio para soluci\u00f3n:<\/em><\/p>\r\n            <textarea rows=\"7\" placeholder=\"Muestra tus c\u00e1lculos y razonamiento...\"><\/textarea>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n        <h4>Problema 3: Radiaci\u00f3n c\u00f3smica de fondo<\/h4>\r\n        <p>El CMB tiene una temperatura actual de 2.725 K y fue emitido cuando el universo ten\u00eda 380,000 a\u00f1os a ~3000 K.<\/p>\r\n        <ol type=\"a\">\r\n            <li>Calcula el factor de escala del universo desde la emisi\u00f3n del CMB<\/li>\r\n            <li>Determina el corrimiento al rojo z correspondiente<\/li>\r\n            <li>Explica por qu\u00e9 el CMB tiene anisotrop\u00edas de temperatura del orden de 10\u207b\u2075<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 informaci\u00f3n proporcionan los modos de polarizaci\u00f3n del CMB?<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n        <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n            <p><em>Espacio para respuesta:<\/em><\/p>\r\n            <textarea rows=\"8\" placeholder=\"Explica detalladamente cada punto...\"><\/textarea>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n        <h4>Problema 4: Cronolog\u00eda c\u00f3smica<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Organiza los siguientes eventos en orden cronol\u00f3gico y para cada uno, indica el tiempo aproximado desde el Big Bang:<\/p>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li>Formaci\u00f3n de los primeros \u00e1tomos de hidr\u00f3geno<\/li>\r\n            <li>Era de la nucleos\u00edntesis primordial<\/li>\r\n            <li>Inflaci\u00f3n c\u00f3smica<\/li>\r\n            <li>Formaci\u00f3n del Sistema Solar<\/li>\r\n            <li>Separaci\u00f3n de las fuerzas fundamentales<\/li>\r\n            <li>Aparici\u00f3n de la vida en la Tierra<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <ol type=\"a\">\r\n            <li>Ordena los eventos cronol\u00f3gicamente<\/li>\r\n            <li>Estima el tiempo de cada evento en a\u00f1os o segundos desde el Big Bang<\/li>\r\n            <li>Explica c\u00f3mo determinamos estas escalas de tiempo<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 evidencia tenemos para cada \u00e9poca?<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n        <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n            <p><em>Espacio para soluci\u00f3n:<\/em><\/p>\r\n            <textarea rows=\"8\" placeholder=\"Presenta tu l\u00ednea de tiempo y explicaciones...\"><\/textarea>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 9\ufe0f\u20e3 CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<h3>9. \ud83e\udde0 Reflexi\u00f3n metacognitiva<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"metacognitive-reflection\">\r\n    <div class=\"reflection-question\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83d\udd0d Autoevaluaci\u00f3n de comprensi\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Responde brevemente en tu cuaderno:<\/p>\r\n        <ol>\r\n            <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 aspecto de la teor\u00eda del Big Bang te parece m\u00e1s fascinante? \u00bfPor qu\u00e9?<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo se relaciona la nucleos\u00edntesis primordial con la qu\u00edmica que estudias en clase?<\/li>\r\n            <li>Si tuvieras que explicar el CMB a un estudiante de primaria, \u00bfc\u00f3mo lo har\u00edas?<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 preguntas sobre el origen del universo te quedan despu\u00e9s de estudiar este tema?<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"learning-check\">\r\n        <h4>\u2713 Verificaci\u00f3n de aprendizaje<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Marca los conceptos que ya dominas:<\/p>\r\n        <div class=\"checklist\">\r\n            <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Puedo explicar las tres evidencias principales del Big Bang<\/label>\r\n            <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Comprendo el proceso de nucleos\u00edntesis primordial<\/label>\r\n            <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> S\u00e9 interpretar el significado del CMB<\/label>\r\n            <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Puedo aplicar la ley de Hubble para calcular distancias<\/label>\r\n            <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Entiendo la cronolog\u00eda del universo temprano<\/label>\r\n            <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Reconozco la diferencia entre elementos primordiales y estelares<\/label>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"real-world-connection\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83c\udf0d Conexi\u00f3n con la investigaci\u00f3n actual<\/h4>\r\n        <p><strong>Desaf\u00edos actuales en cosmolog\u00eda:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><strong>Energ\u00eda oscura:<\/strong> \u00bfQu\u00e9 causa la aceleraci\u00f3n de la expansi\u00f3n?<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Materia oscura:<\/strong> \u00bfDe qu\u00e9 est\u00e1 compuesta la mayor parte de la materia?<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Inflaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> \u00bfCu\u00e1l es el mecanismo exacto de la expansi\u00f3n exponencial temprana?<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Problema del litio:<\/strong> \u00bfPor qu\u00e9 las predicciones y observaciones de litio-7 no coinciden?<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <p><strong>Pr\u00f3ximas misiones:<\/strong> Euclid (ESA), Nancy Grace Roman (NASA), CMB-S4 (telescopios terrestres)<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT PARA INTERACTIVIDAD -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DE EXPANSI\u00d3N C\u00d3SMICA\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nfunction playExpansion() {\r\n    const elements = ['#singularity', '#inflation', '#nucleosynthesis', '#recombination', '#galaxyFormation'];\r\n    \r\n    elements.forEach((selector, index) => {\r\n        const element = document.querySelector(selector);\r\n        if (element) {\r\n            element.style.animation = `fadeIn 0.5s ease ${index * 0.5}s forwards`;\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('universeInfo').innerHTML = \r\n        '<p><strong>Expansi\u00f3n en progreso:<\/strong> Desde la singularidad hasta la formaci\u00f3n de galaxias<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>Observa c\u00f3mo se desarrolla el universo en diferentes etapas<\/p>';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction pauseExpansion() {\r\n    const animatedElements = document.querySelectorAll('[style*=\"animation\"]');\r\n    animatedElements.forEach(el => {\r\n        el.style.animationPlayState = 'paused';\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('universeInfo').innerHTML = \r\n        '<p>Simulaci\u00f3n en pausa. Usa \"Iniciar expansi\u00f3n\" para continuar.<\/p>';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction highlightNucleosynthesis() {\r\n    const nucleo = document.getElementById('nucleosynthesis');\r\n    nucleo.style.filter = 'drop-shadow(0 0 20px #ffff00)';\r\n    nucleo.style.transform = 'scale(1.2)';\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('universeInfo').innerHTML = \r\n        '<p><strong>Nucleos\u00edntesis primordial:<\/strong> Etapa cr\u00edtica a los 3 minutos<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 Temperatura: ~10\u2079 K<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 Formaci\u00f3n: H (75%), He (25%), trazas de D, \u00b3He, \u2077Li<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 Duraci\u00f3n: ~17 minutos efectivos<\/p>';\r\n    \r\n    setTimeout(() => {\r\n        nucleo.style.filter = '';\r\n        nucleo.style.transform = '';\r\n    }, 3000);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showCMBInfo() {\r\n    document.getElementById('universeInfo').innerHTML = \r\n        '<p><strong>Radiaci\u00f3n C\u00f3smica de Fondo (CMB):<\/strong><\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 Descubrimiento: 1965 (Penzias & Wilson)<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 Temperatura actual: 2.72548 K<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 Emisi\u00f3n: z \u2248 1100 (380,000 a\u00f1os despu\u00e9s del Big Bang)<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 Temperatura entonces: ~3000 K<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 Significado: \"F\u00f3sil\" del universo temprano<\/p>';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Interactividad con elementos SVG\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.clickable').forEach(element => {\r\n    element.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const info = this.getAttribute('data-info');\r\n        document.getElementById('universeInfo').innerHTML = \r\n            '<p><strong>' + this.id + ':<\/strong> ' + info + '<\/p>';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Resaltar temporalmente (menos brillante en modo oscuro)\r\n        if (document.documentElement.classList.contains('dark')) {\r\n            this.style.filter = 'drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(0,255,200,0.12))';\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.style.filter = 'brightness(1.5)';\r\n        }\r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            this.style.filter = '';\r\n        }, 1000);\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DE NUCLEOS\u00cdNTESIS\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nconst timeAfterBB = document.getElementById('timeAfterBB');\r\nconst tempAfterBB = document.getElementById('tempAfterBB');\r\nconst baryonDensity = document.getElementById('baryonDensity');\r\nconst timeDisplay = document.getElementById('timeValue');\r\nconst tempDisplay = document.getElementById('tempValue');\r\nconst densityDisplay = document.getElementById('densityValue');\r\nconst abundanceChart = document.getElementById('abundanceChart');\r\n\r\nfunction formatScientific(value) {\r\n    return value.toExponential(2).replace('e', ' \u00d7 10^');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction updateNucleosynthesis() {\r\n    const time = parseFloat(timeAfterBB.value);\r\n    const temp = parseFloat(tempAfterBB.value);\r\n    const density = parseFloat(baryonDensity.value);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar displays\r\n    timeDisplay.textContent = time + ' segundos (' + (time\/60).toFixed(1) + ' minutos)';\r\n    tempDisplay.textContent = formatScientific(temp) + ' K';\r\n    densityDisplay.textContent = formatScientific(density) + ' g\/cm\u00b3';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular abundancias (modelo simplificado)\r\n    let H = 75.0;  \/\/ % de hidr\u00f3geno\r\n    let He4 = 24.9; \/\/ % de helio-4\r\n    let D = 0.01;   \/\/ % de deuterio\r\n    let He3 = 0.01; \/\/ % de helio-3\r\n    let Li7 = 0.0001; \/\/ % de litio-7\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ajustar seg\u00fan par\u00e1metros (modelo muy simplificado)\r\n    if (time < 60) {\r\n        H = 80;\r\n        He4 = 19.9;\r\n        D = 0.05;\r\n    } else if (time > 1000) {\r\n        H = 74;\r\n        He4 = 25.9;\r\n        D = 0.005;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar gr\u00e1fico\r\n    abundanceChart.innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"abundance-bar\" style=\"width: ${H}%; background: #00ffea;\">H: ${H.toFixed(1)}%<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"abundance-bar\" style=\"width: ${He4}%; background: #ff00ff;\">He-4: ${He4.toFixed(1)}%<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"abundance-bar\" style=\"width: ${D*100}%; background: #ffff00;\">D: ${D.toFixed(3)}%<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"abundance-bar\" style=\"width: ${He3*100}%; background: #ff5500;\">He-3: ${He3.toFixed(3)}%<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"abundance-bar\" style=\"width: ${Li7*1000}%; background: #9c27b0;\">Li-7: ${Li7.toFixed(4)}%<\/div>\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar texto\r\n    document.getElementById('abundanceResult').textContent = \r\n        `Hidr\u00f3geno: ${H.toFixed(1)}% | Helio-4: ${He4.toFixed(1)}% | Deuterio: ${D.toFixed(3)}% | Helio-3: ${He3.toFixed(3)}% | Litio-7: ${Li7.toFixed(4)}%`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Animar reacciones\r\n    animateReactions();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction animateReactions() {\r\n    const reactions = document.querySelectorAll('.reaction');\r\n    reactions.forEach((reaction, index) => {\r\n        reaction.style.animation = 'none';\r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            reaction.style.animation = `fadeIn 0.5s ease ${index * 0.3}s`;\r\n        }, 10);\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Event listeners\r\ntimeAfterBB.addEventListener('input', updateNucleosynthesis);\r\ntempAfterBB.addEventListener('input', updateNucleosynthesis);\r\nbaryonDensity.addEventListener('input', updateNucleosynthesis);\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar\r\nupdateNucleosynthesis();\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ VISUALIZADOR DEL CMB\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nconst cmbFrequency = document.getElementById('cmbFrequency');\r\nconst frequencyValue = document.getElementById('frequencyValue');\r\nconst cmbMap = document.getElementById('cmbMap');\r\n\r\nfunction updateCMB() {\r\n    const frequency = parseInt(cmbFrequency.value);\r\n    frequencyValue.textContent = frequency + ' GHz';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Longitud de onda correspondiente\r\n    const wavelength = (299792458 \/ (frequency * 1e9)) * 1000; \/\/ en mm\r\n    const temp = 2.725; \/\/ Temperatura del CMB\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Generar mapa del CMB simplificado\r\n    cmbMap.innerHTML = '';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Crear patr\u00f3n de anisotrop\u00edas\r\n    for (let i = 0; i < 100; i++) {\r\n        const dot = document.createElement('div');\r\n        dot.className = 'cmb-dot';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Posici\u00f3n aleatoria\r\n        const x = Math.random() * 90 + 5;\r\n        const y = Math.random() * 90 + 5;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Tama\u00f1o y color basado en \"temperatura\" aleatoria\r\n        const deltaT = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.0003; \/\/ Fluctuaciones de ~10\u207b\u2075\r\n        const brightness = 0.5 + deltaT * 1000;\r\n        \r\n        dot.style.left = x + '%';\r\n        dot.style.top = y + '%';\r\n        dot.style.width = (3 + Math.random() * 5) + 'px';\r\n        dot.style.height = dot.style.width;\r\n        dot.style.backgroundColor = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${brightness})`;\r\n        dot.style.boxShadow = `0 0 ${5 + brightness * 10}px rgba(255, 255, 255, ${brightness})`;\r\n        \r\n        cmbMap.appendChild(dot);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Informaci\u00f3n adicional\r\n    const infoDiv = document.createElement('div');\r\n    infoDiv.className = 'cmb-info-display';\r\n    infoDiv.innerHTML = `\r\n        <p>Frecuencia: ${frequency} GHz<\/p>\r\n        <p>Longitud de onda: ${wavelength.toFixed(3)} mm<\/p>\r\n        <p>\u0394T\/T \u2248 10\u207b\u2075 (anisotrop\u00edas)<\/p>\r\n    `;\r\n    cmbMap.appendChild(infoDiv);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showTemperatureMap() {\r\n    cmbMap.innerHTML = '<div class=\"temperature-map\"><\/div>';\r\n    document.querySelector('.temperature-map').innerHTML = \r\n        '<p>Mapa de temperatura del CMB (Planck 2018)<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>T<sub>media<\/sub> = 2.72548 K<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u0394T<sub>rms<\/sub> = 18 \u03bcK<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>Anisotrop\u00edas revelan semillas de estructuras<\/p>';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showPolarizationMap() {\r\n    cmbMap.innerHTML = '<div class=\"polarization-map\"><\/div>';\r\n    document.querySelector('.polarization-map').innerHTML = \r\n        '<p>Mapa de polarizaci\u00f3n del CMB<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 E-modos: dispersi\u00f3n Thomson<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 B-modos: ondas gravitacionales (inflaci\u00f3n)<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 Detectados parcialmente<\/p>';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showAnisotropies() {\r\n    cmbMap.innerHTML = '<div class=\"anisotropy-map\"><\/div>';\r\n    document.querySelector('.anisotropy-map').innerHTML = \r\n        '<p>Espectro de potencia angular<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 Pico ac\u00fastico: l \u2248 220<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 Concordancia \u039bCDM<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p>\u2022 Par\u00e1metros cosmol\u00f3gicos precisos<\/p>';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar CMB\r\nupdateCMB();\r\ncmbFrequency.addEventListener('input', updateCMB);\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nlet quizScore = 0;\r\nlet totalQuestions = 5;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(button => {\r\n    button.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const isCorrect = this.getAttribute('data-correct') === 'true';\r\n        const feedback = this.getAttribute('data-feedback');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Deshabilitar todos los botones de esta pregunta\r\n        this.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(btn => {\r\n            btn.disabled = true;\r\n            if (btn.getAttribute('data-correct') === 'true') {\r\n                btn.style.backgroundColor = '#00ff00';\r\n                btn.style.color = '#000';\r\n            } else if (btn === this && !isCorrect) {\r\n                btn.style.backgroundColor = '#ff0000';\r\n                btn.style.color = '#fff';\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar puntaje\r\n        if (isCorrect) {\r\n            quizScore++;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar retroalimentaci\u00f3n\r\n        const feedbackDiv = document.getElementById('quizFeedback');\r\n        const answered = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option:disabled').length \/ 3;\r\n        \r\n        feedbackDiv.innerHTML = \r\n            '<div class=\"' + (isCorrect ? 'correct-feedback' : 'incorrect-feedback') + '\">' +\r\n                feedback +\r\n            '<\/div>' +\r\n            '<p>Progreso: ' + answered + '\/' + totalQuestions + ' preguntas<\/p>' +\r\n            '<p>Puntuaci\u00f3n actual: ' + quizScore + '\/' + totalQuestions + '<\/p>';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction resetQuiz() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(button => {\r\n        button.disabled = false;\r\n        button.style.backgroundColor = '';\r\n        button.style.color = '';\r\n    });\r\n    quizScore = 0;\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').innerHTML = '';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ ANIMACIONES CSS ADICIONALES\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nconst style = document.createElement('style');\r\nstyle.textContent = `\r\n    @keyframes fadeIn {\r\n        from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.8); }\r\n        to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .abundance-bar {\r\n        height: 30px;\r\n        margin: 2px 0;\r\n        display: flex;\r\n        align-items: center;\r\n        justify-content: center;\r\n        color: #000;\r\n        font-weight: bold;\r\n        font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\r\n        transition: width 0.5s ease;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .cmb-dot {\r\n        position: absolute;\r\n        border-radius: 50%;\r\n        transition: all 0.5s ease;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .reaction {\r\n        display: flex;\r\n        align-items: center;\r\n        justify-content: center;\r\n        gap: 10px;\r\n        padding: 10px;\r\n        margin: 10px 0;\r\n        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\r\n        border: 2px solid #00ffea;\r\n        font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\r\n        opacity: 0;\r\n        animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease forwards;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .particle {\r\n        padding: 5px 10px;\r\n        border-radius: 3px;\r\n        font-weight: bold;\r\n        color: #000;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .proton { background: #00ffea; }\r\n    .neutron { background: #ff00ff; }\r\n    .deuterium { background: #ffff00; }\r\n    .photon { background: #ff5500; }\r\n    .helium3 { background: #9c27b0; }\r\n    .helium4 { background: #4caf50; }\r\n    \r\n    .plus, .arrow {\r\n        color: #fff;\r\n        font-weight: bold;\r\n    }\r\n`;\r\ndocument.head.appendChild(style);\r\n<\/script>\r\n<\/div>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Edad universo (Planck 2025)","respuesta":"13.799 \u00b1 0.021 Ga"},{"enunciado":"Elementos BBN","respuesta":"H, He, trazas D, Li"},{"enunciado":"Evidencia principal","respuesta":"CMB, redshift, H\/He"},{"enunciado":"T CMB actual","respuesta":"2.72548 K"},{"enunciado":"H\u2080 (Hubble)","respuesta":"67.4 km\/s\/Mpc"},{"enunciado":"Abundancia \u2074He","respuesta":"24.9%"},{"enunciado":"Nucleos\u00edntesis forma","respuesta":"\u00b9H, \u2074He"},{"enunciado":"Elementos pesados por","respuesta":"Fusi\u00f3n estelar"},{"enunciado":"Ley de Hubble","respuesta":"\\(v = H_0 d\\)"},{"enunciado":"Tiempo inflaci\u00f3n","respuesta":"10\u207b\u00b3\u2076 a 10\u207b\u00b3\u00b2 s"},{"enunciado":"NIST: T CMB exacta","respuesta":"2.72548 K"},{"enunciado":"Primeras estrellas (Era)","respuesta":"Reionizaci\u00f3n, ~100 Ma"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Big Bang es...","opciones":["Expansi\u00f3n","Explosi\u00f3n","Colapso","Nada"],"correcta":"Expansi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Form\u00f3 elementos...","opciones":["Ligeros","Pesados","Metales","Gases"],"correcta":"Ligeros"},{"pregunta":"CMB es...","opciones":["Radiaci\u00f3n fondo","Luz estelar","Rayos X","Microondas"],"correcta":"Radiaci\u00f3n fondo"},{"pregunta":"Edad universo","opciones":["13.8 Ga","4.5 Ga","100 Ma","1 Ga"],"correcta":"13.8 Ga"},{"pregunta":"Hubble descubri\u00f3...","opciones":["Expansi\u00f3n","CMB","Quarks","Estrellas"],"correcta":"Expansi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Nucleos\u00edntesis dur\u00f3...","opciones":["3 minutos","1 hora","1 d\u00eda","1 a\u00f1o"],"correcta":"3 minutos"},{"pregunta":"Abundancia H","opciones":["75%","25%","50%","100%"],"correcta":"75%"},{"pregunta":"CMB T =","opciones":["2.7 K","3000 K","0 K","100 K"],"correcta":"2.7 K"},{"pregunta":"Redshift significa...","opciones":["Galaxias se alejan","Acercan","Est\u00e1ticas","Explosi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Galaxias se alejan"},{"pregunta":"Planck mide...","opciones":["CMB","Estrellas","Planetas","Agujeros"],"correcta":"CMB"},{"pregunta":"H\u2080 =","opciones":["67.4 km\/s\/Mpc","100 km\/s\/Mpc","50 km\/s\/Mpc","0"],"correcta":"67.4 km\/s\/Mpc"},{"pregunta":"T CMB exacta","opciones":["2.72548 K","2.7 K","3 K","2 K"],"correcta":"2.72548 K"},{"pregunta":"Elemento m\u00e1s abundante","opciones":["Hidr\u00f3geno","Helio","Ox\u00edgeno","Carbono"],"correcta":"Hidr\u00f3geno"},{"pregunta":"BBN predice...","opciones":["H\/He","C\/O","Fe\/Ni","Au\/Pt"],"correcta":"H\/He"},{"pregunta":"Inflaci\u00f3n resuelve...","opciones":["Horizonte, planitud","Masa","Energ\u00eda","Nada"],"correcta":"Horizonte, planitud"},{"pregunta":"Primeras estrellas formaron...","opciones":["C, O, Fe","H, He","Li","D"],"correcta":"C, O, Fe"},{"pregunta":"v = H\u2080\u00b7d es...","opciones":["Ley de Hubble","Newton","Einstein","Planck"],"correcta":"Ley de Hubble"},{"pregunta":"NIST certifica...","opciones":["T CMB","Masa at\u00f3mica","Velocidad luz","Todas"],"correcta":"T CMB"},{"pregunta":"Recombinaci\u00f3n ocurri\u00f3 a...","opciones":["380,000 a\u00f1os","3 min","10\u207b\u2076 s","13.8 Ga"],"correcta":"380,000 a\u00f1os"},{"pregunta":"Era de Planck","opciones":["10\u207b\u2074\u00b3 s","10\u207b\u00b3\u2076 s","3 min","380 ka"],"correcta":"10\u207b\u2074\u00b3 s"},{"pregunta":"Edad exacta (Planck 2025)","opciones":["13.799 \u00b1 0.021 Ga","13.8 Ga","14 Ga","13 Ga"],"correcta":"13.799 \u00b1 0.021 Ga"},{"pregunta":"Densidad cr\u00edtica","opciones":["\\(\\rho_c = \\frac{3H_0^2}{8\\pi G}\\)","m\/V","E=mc\u00b2","F=ma"],"correcta":"\\(\\rho_c = \\frac{3H_0^2}{8\\pi G}\\)"},{"pregunta":"Abundancia \u2074He","opciones":["0.249 \u00b1 0.001","0.25","0.75","0.01"],"correcta":"0.249 \u00b1 0.001"},{"pregunta":"Deuterio BBN","opciones":["\u00b2H\/H \u2248 10\u207b\u2075","10\u207b\u00b3","0.25","0.75"],"correcta":"\u00b2H\/H \u2248 10\u207b\u2075"},{"pregunta":"CMB es un cuerpo negro a...","opciones":["2.72548 K","2.7 K","3000 K","0 K"],"correcta":"2.72548 K"},{"pregunta":"Inflaci\u00f3n impulsada por...","opciones":["Campo inflat\u00f3n","Gravedad","Electromagnetismo","Nuclear"],"correcta":"Campo inflat\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Reionizaci\u00f3n por...","opciones":["Primeras estrellas","Big Bang","CMB","Galaxias"],"correcta":"Primeras estrellas"},{"pregunta":"Par\u00e1metro \u03a9_m \u2248","opciones":["0.315","1","0","0.7"],"correcta":"0.315"},{"pregunta":"COBE midi\u00f3...","opciones":["CMB dipolo","Estrellas","Planetas","Agujeros"],"correcta":"CMB dipolo"},{"pregunta":"WMAP mejor\u00f3...","opciones":["Anisotrop\u00edas CMB","H\/He","Redshift","Todas"],"correcta":"Anisotrop\u00edas CMB"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"contaminacion-ambiental","titulo":"Contaminaci\u00f3n Ambiental: An\u00e1lisis Cient\u00edfico y Soluciones","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-quimica\">\r\n\r\n<!-- 1\ufe0f\u20e3 INTRODUCCI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL -->\r\n<section id=\"introduccion\">\r\n    <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion\">CONTAMINACI\u00d3N AMBIENTAL: AN\u00c1LISIS CIENT\u00cdFICO Y SOLUCIONES<\/h1>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"learning-goals\">\r\n        <h3>\ud83c\udfaf OBJETIVOS DEL SISTEMA<\/h3>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li>IDENTIFICAR Y CLASIFICAR TIPOS DE CONTAMINANTES<\/li>\r\n            <li>ANALIZAR PROCESOS QU\u00cdMICOS DE CONTAMINANTES SECUNDARIOS<\/li>\r\n            <li>CALCULAR CONCENTRACIONES: ppm, ppb, mg\/m\u00b3<\/li>\r\n            <li>INTERPRETAR DATOS DE CALIDAD AIRE (EPA\/OMS)<\/li>\r\n            <li>EVALUAR SOLUCIONES TECNOL\u00d3GICAS DE MITIGACI\u00d3N<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"theory-card\" style=\"border-color: var(--neon-toxic); margin-top: 20px;\">\r\n        <h4>\u26a0\ufe0f ALERTA DEL SISTEMA<\/h4>\r\n        <p><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-toxic);\">DEFINICI\u00d3N CIENT\u00cdFICA:<\/strong> Introducci\u00f3n de sustancias\/energ\u00eda en concentraciones que superan capacidad de asimilaci\u00f3n del medio.<\/p>\r\n        <p><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-alert);\">IMPACTO GLOBAL:<\/strong> 9M muertes prematuras\/a\u00f1o (OMS 2025)<\/p>\r\n        <p><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-pollution);\">COSTE ECON\u00d3MICO:<\/strong> ~4.6T USD\/a\u00f1o (6.2% PIB mundial)<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"border: 1px solid var(--neon-toxic); margin: 25px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- 2\ufe0f\u20e3 DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO -->\r\n<section id=\"desarrollo-teorico\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"subtitulo-conceptual\">I. CLASIFICACI\u00d3N DE CONTAMINANTES<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"solutions-grid\" style=\"margin-top: 20px;\">\r\n        <div class=\"solution-card\" style=\"border-color: var(--neon-toxic);\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udea8 PRIMARIOS<\/h4>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>CO<\/strong> - Mon\u00f3xido carbono<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>SO\u2082<\/strong> - Di\u00f3xido azufre<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>NO\u2093<\/strong> - \u00d3xidos nitr\u00f3geno<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>PM10\/PM2.5<\/strong> - Part\u00edculas<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <p class=\"solution-tip\">EMITIDOS DIRECTAMENTE<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"solution-card\" style=\"border-color: var(--neon-smog);\">\r\n            <h4>\u2600\ufe0f SECUNDARIOS<\/h4>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>O\u2083<\/strong> - Ozono troposf\u00e9rico<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>HNO\u2083<\/strong> - \u00c1cido n\u00edtrico<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>H\u2082SO\u2084<\/strong> - \u00c1cido sulf\u00farico<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>PAN<\/strong> - Nitrato peroxiacetilo<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <p class=\"solution-tip\">FORMADOS POR REACCIONES<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"solution-card\" style=\"border-color: var(--neon-pollution);\">\r\n            <h4>\u23f3 PERSISTENTES<\/h4>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>Pb<\/strong> - Plomo<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Hg<\/strong> - Mercurio<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>DDT<\/strong> - Insecticidas<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>PCB<\/strong> - Bifenilos policlorados<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <p class=\"solution-tip\">BIOACUMULATIVOS<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"solution-card\" style=\"border-color: var(--neon-acid);\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83c\udd95 EMERGENTES<\/h4>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>Micropl\u00e1sticos<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>F\u00e1rmacos<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Nanopart\u00edculas<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Disruptores endocrinos<\/strong><\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <p class=\"solution-tip\">NUEVAS AMENAZAS<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <h3>\ud83d\udcca TABLA DE CONTAMINANTES CR\u00cdTICOS<\/h3>\r\n    \r\n    <table class=\"classification-table\">\r\n        <thead>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <th>CONTAMINANTE<\/th>\r\n                <th>F\u00d3RMULA<\/th>\r\n                <th>L\u00cdMITE OMS 2025<\/th>\r\n                <th>FUENTES<\/th>\r\n                <th>EFECTOS SALUD<\/th>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/thead>\r\n        <tbody>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-pollution);\">PM2.5<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>\u2014<\/td>\r\n                <td>5 \u00b5g\/m\u00b3<\/td>\r\n                <td>Combusti\u00f3n vehicular<\/td>\r\n                <td>C\u00e1ncer pulmonar<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-toxic);\">CO<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>CO<\/td>\r\n                <td>4 mg\/m\u00b3<\/td>\r\n                <td>Combusti\u00f3n incompleta<\/td>\r\n                <td>Hipoxia, muerte<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-acid);\">SO\u2082<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>SO\u2082<\/td>\r\n                <td>40 \u00b5g\/m\u00b3<\/td>\r\n                <td>Combusti\u00f3n carb\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <td>Irritaci\u00f3n respiratoria<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-smog);\">O\u2083<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>O\u2083<\/td>\r\n                <td>100 \u00b5g\/m\u00b3<\/td>\r\n                <td>Reacciones fotoqu\u00edmicas<\/td>\r\n                <td>Asma, da\u00f1o pulmonar<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-smog);\">NO\u2082<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>NO\u2082<\/td>\r\n                <td>25 \u00b5g\/m\u00b3<\/td>\r\n                <td>Motores combusti\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <td>Bronquitis<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-pollution);\">Pb<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>Pb<\/td>\r\n                <td>0.5 \u00b5g\/m\u00b3<\/td>\r\n                <td>Gasolina con plomo<\/td>\r\n                <td>Da\u00f1o neurol\u00f3gico<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/tbody>\r\n    <\/table>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"theory-card example\" style=\"margin-top: 25px;\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83e\uddee EJEMPLO: CONVERSI\u00d3N UNIDADES<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Convertir 50 ppm CO \u2192 mg\/m\u00b3 (25\u00b0C, 1 atm):<\/p>\r\n        <p>\\[\r\n        \\begin{aligned}\r\n        C_{\\text{mg\/m\u00b3}} &= \\frac{C_{\\text{ppm}} \\times M \\times P}{R \\times T} \\\\\r\n        &= \\frac{50 \\times 28.01 \\times 1}{0.0821 \\times 298} \\\\\r\n        &= \\boxed{57.2 \\, \\text{mg\/m\u00b3}}\r\n        \\end{aligned}\r\n        \\]<\/p>\r\n        <p><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-alert);\">AN\u00c1LISIS:<\/strong> Supera l\u00edmite OMS (4 mg\/m\u00b3) \u2192 PELIGRO<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"border: 1px solid var(--neon-smog); margin: 25px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- 3\ufe0f\u20e3 SIMULADOR SMOG FOTOQU\u00cdMICO -->\r\n<section id=\"simulador-smog\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"subtitulo-conceptual\">II. SIMULADOR: FORMACI\u00d3N DE SMOG<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"simulator-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"diagram-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"smog-factors-header\">\r\n                <div class=\"smog-factor-tag factor-uv\">\r\n                    <span>\u2600\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                    <span>LUZ UV<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"smog-factor-tag factor-emissions\">\r\n                    <span>\ud83d\ude97<\/span>\r\n                    <span>NO\u2093 + COV<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"smog-factor-tag factor-results\">\r\n                    <span>\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                    <span>O\u2083 + PM2.5<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"reactions-panel\">\r\n                <h4 style=\"color: var(--neon-smog); text-align: center; margin-top: 0;\">REACCIONES FOTOQU\u00cdMICAS<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"reactions-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"reaction-card\">\r\n                        <p class=\"reaction-formula\">NO\u2082 + hv \u2192 NO + O<\/p>\r\n                        <p class=\"reaction-name\">Fotodisociaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"reaction-card\">\r\n                        <p class=\"reaction-formula\">O + O\u2082 \u2192 O\u2083<\/p>\r\n                        <p class=\"reaction-name\">Formaci\u00f3n ozono<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"reaction-card\">\r\n                        <p class=\"reaction-formula\">O\u2083 + NO \u2192 NO\u2082 + O\u2082<\/p>\r\n                        <p class=\"reaction-name\">Ciclo del ozono<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"reaction-card\">\r\n                        <p class=\"reaction-formula\">COV + OH\u00b7 \u2192 Radicales<\/p>\r\n                        <p class=\"reaction-name\">Amplificaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"diagram-controls\">\r\n                <button class=\"btn-start\" onclick=\"iniciarSmog()\">\u25b6\ufe0f INICIAR SIMULACI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-pause\" onclick=\"pausarSmog()\">\u23f8\ufe0f PAUSAR<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"resetSmog()\">\ud83d\udd04 REINICIAR<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"diagram-info\" id=\"smogInfo\">\r\n                <p style=\"color: var(--neon-data); margin: 0;\">SISTEMA LISTO. Haz clic en INICIAR para ver formaci\u00f3n de smog.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"impact-indicators\">\r\n            <div class=\"impact-card\" id=\"effect-car\">\r\n                <div class=\"impact-icon\">\ud83d\ude97<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"impact-label\">EMISIONES<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"impact-value\" id=\"car-emissions\">NO\u2093: 40 ppb<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"impact-card\" id=\"effect-industry\">\r\n                <div class=\"impact-icon\">\ud83c\udfed<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"impact-label\">INDUSTRIA<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"impact-value\" id=\"industry-emissions\">SO\u2082: 30 ppb<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"impact-card\" id=\"effect-ozone\">\r\n                <div class=\"impact-icon\">\u2600\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"impact-label\">OZONO<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"impact-value\" id=\"ozone-level\">O\u2083: 70 ppb<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"impact-card\" id=\"effect-health\">\r\n                <div class=\"impact-icon\">\ud83c\udfe5<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"impact-label\">SALUD<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"impact-value\" id=\"health-impact\">RIESGO MODERADO<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"border: 1px solid var(--neon-acid); margin: 40px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- 4\ufe0f\u20e3 SIMULADOR LLUVIA \u00c1CIDA -->\r\n<section id=\"simulador-acido\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"subtitulo-conceptual\">III. SIMULADOR: LLUVIA \u00c1CIDA<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"simulator-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"acid-simulator-layout\">\r\n            <!-- COLUMNA 1: CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"so2Level\">SO\u2082 (ppb):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"so2Level\" min=\"0\" max=\"200\" value=\"50\" step=\"1\">\r\n                    <span class=\"value-display\" id=\"so2Value\">50 ppb<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"noxLevel\">NO\u2093 (ppb):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"noxLevel\" min=\"0\" max=\"150\" value=\"40\" step=\"1\">\r\n                    <span class=\"value-display\" id=\"noxValue\">40 ppb<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"humidityLevel\">HUMEDAD (%):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"humidityLevel\" min=\"30\" max=\"100\" value=\"70\" step=\"1\">\r\n                    <span class=\"value-display\" id=\"humidityValue\">70%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"calc-btn\" onclick=\"calcularLluviaAcida()\">\ud83e\uddea CALCULAR pH<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- COLUMNA 2: REACCIONES Y RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"reactions-display\">\r\n                <div class=\"formula\">\r\n                    <h4>\u2697\ufe0f REACCIONES QU\u00cdMICAS<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"chemical-reaction\">SO\u2082 + OH\u00b7 \u2192 HSO\u2083\u00b7<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"chemical-reaction\">HSO\u2083\u00b7 + O\u2082 \u2192 SO\u2083 + HO\u2082\u00b7<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"chemical-reaction\">SO\u2083 + H\u2082O \u2192 H\u2082SO\u2084<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"chemical-reaction\">2NO\u2082 + H\u2082O \u2192 HNO\u2083 + HNO\u2082<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"result\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcc8 RESULTADOS<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"ph-display\" id=\"phDisplay\">5.6<\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"ph-scale-container\">\r\n                        <div class=\"scale-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ph-indicator\" id=\"phIndicator\" style=\"left: 20%;\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"scale-labels\">\r\n                            <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">0<\/span>\r\n                            <span style=\"color: var(--neon-alert);\">4.0<\/span>\r\n                            <span style=\"color: var(--neon-toxic);\">5.6<\/span>\r\n                            <span style=\"color: #00ff00;\">7.0<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"classification\" id=\"phClassification\" style=\"border-color: var(--neon-toxic); color: var(--neon-toxic);\">\r\n                        LLUVIA NORMAL\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"acid-concentration\">\r\n                        <div class=\"concentration-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"concentration-label\">H\u2082SO\u2084<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"concentration-value\" id=\"h2so4Value\">0.8 mg\/L<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"concentration-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"concentration-label\">HNO\u2083<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"concentration-value\" id=\"hno3Value\">0.4 mg\/L<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- COLUMNA 3: EFECTOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"effects-display\">\r\n                <div class=\"effect-card\" id=\"rainEffect1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"effect-icon\">\ud83c\udf32<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"effect-label\">BOSQUES<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"effect-card\" id=\"rainEffect2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"effect-icon\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"effect-label\">EDIFICIOS<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"effect-card\" id=\"rainEffect3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"effect-icon\">\ud83d\udc1f<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"effect-label\">LAGOS<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"effect-card\" id=\"rainEffect4\">\r\n                    <div class=\"effect-icon\">\ud83d\udeb0<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"effect-label\">AGUA POTABLE<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"border: 1px solid var(--neon-data); margin: 40px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- 5\ufe0f\u20e3 MONITOR CALIDAD AIRE -->\r\n<section id=\"monitor-aire\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"subtitulo-conceptual\">IV. MONITOR DE CALIDAD AIRE<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"air-quality-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"aqi-visual\">\r\n            <div class=\"aqi-display_other\" id=\"aqiDisplay\">\r\n                <div class=\"aqi-main\" style=\"background: rgba(0, 228, 0, 0.2);\">\r\n                    <div class=\"aqi-value\">45<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"aqi-level\">BUENA<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"aqi-controls\">\r\n                <div class=\"parameter-slider\">\r\n                    <label for=\"pm25Input\">PM2.5 (\u00b5g\/m\u00b3):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"pm25Input\" min=\"0\" max=\"500\" value=\"15\" step=\"1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"pm25Display\">15 \u00b5g\/m\u00b3<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"parameter-slider\">\r\n                    <label for=\"o3Input\">O\u2083 (ppb):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"o3Input\" min=\"0\" max=\"200\" value=\"70\" step=\"1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"o3Display\">70 ppb<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"parameter-slider\">\r\n                    <label for=\"no2Input\">NO\u2082 (ppb):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"no2Input\" min=\"0\" max=\"150\" value=\"40\" step=\"1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"no2Display\">40 ppb<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"parameter-slider\">\r\n                    <label for=\"coInput\">CO (ppm):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"coInput\" min=\"0\" max=\"30\" value=\"5\" step=\"0.1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"coDisplay\">5.0 ppm<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-top: 20px;\">\r\n            <div>\r\n                <h4 style=\"color: var(--neon-data);\">\ud83d\udccb ESCALA AQI<\/h4>\r\n                <table class=\"aqi-table\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>AQI<\/th>\r\n                            <th>NIVEL<\/th>\r\n                            <th>COLOR<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>0-50<\/td>\r\n                            <td>BUENA<\/td>\r\n                            <td style=\"background: rgba(0, 228, 0, 0.2); color: #00E400;\">VERDE<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>51-100<\/td>\r\n                            <td>MODERADA<\/td>\r\n                            <td style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 0, 0.2); color: #FFFF00;\">AMARILLO<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>101-150<\/td>\r\n                            <td>INSALUBRE GS<\/td>\r\n                            <td style=\"background: rgba(255, 126, 0, 0.2); color: #FF7E00;\">NARANJA<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>151-200<\/td>\r\n                            <td>INSALUBRE<\/td>\r\n                            <td style=\"background: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.2); color: #FF0000;\">ROJO<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>201-300<\/td>\r\n                            <td>MUY INSALUBRE<\/td>\r\n                            <td style=\"background: rgba(143, 63, 151, 0.2); color: #8F3F97;\">MORADO<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>301-500<\/td>\r\n                            <td>PELIGROSA<\/td>\r\n                            <td style=\"background: rgba(126, 0, 35, 0.2); color: #7E0023;\">MARR\u00d3N<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div>\r\n                <h4 style=\"color: var(--neon-data);\">\ud83d\udcca EST\u00c1NDARES<\/h4>\r\n                <div style=\"background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--neon-data);\">\r\n                    <p style=\"color: var(--neon-data); margin: 5px 0; font-size: 0.9rem;\"><strong>OMS 2025:<\/strong> PM2.5: 5 \u00b5g\/m\u00b3<\/p>\r\n                    <p style=\"color: var(--neon-data); margin: 5px 0; font-size: 0.9rem;\"><strong>EPA USA:<\/strong> PM2.5: 9 \u00b5g\/m\u00b3<\/p>\r\n                    <p style=\"color: var(--neon-data); margin: 5px 0; font-size: 0.9rem;\"><strong>UE:<\/strong> PM2.5: 25 \u00b5g\/m\u00b3<\/p>\r\n                    <p style=\"color: var(--neon-data); margin: 5px 0; font-size: 0.9rem;\"><strong>M\u00c9XICO:<\/strong> PM2.5: 12 \u00b5g\/m\u00b3<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div style=\"margin-top: 15px;\">\r\n                    <h4 style=\"color: var(--neon-alert); font-size: 1rem;\">\u2695\ufe0f EFECTOS SALUD<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul style=\"font-size: 0.85rem;\">\r\n                        <li><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-pollution);\">PM2.5:<\/strong> C\u00e1ncer pulmonar<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-smog);\">O\u2083:<\/strong> Asma, da\u00f1o pulmonar<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-smog);\">NO\u2082:<\/strong> Bronquitis<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-toxic);\">CO:<\/strong> Hipoxia, muerte<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"border: 1px solid var(--neon-alert); margin: 25px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- 6\ufe0f\u20e3 QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n<section id=\"quiz\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"subtitulo-conceptual\">V. QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n            <p><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-alert);\">PREGUNTA 1:<\/strong> Diferencia entre contaminantes primarios y secundarios:<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" onclick=\"checkAnswer(this, true)\">Primarios emitidos directamente, secundarios formados por reacciones<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"checkAnswer(this, false)\">Primarios son m\u00e1s peligrosos que secundarios<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"checkAnswer(this, false)\">El ozono es contaminante primario<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n            <p><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-alert);\">PREGUNTA 2:<\/strong> pH normal lluvia limpia es 5.6 debido a:<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" onclick=\"checkAnswer(this, true)\">Disoluci\u00f3n CO\u2082 atmosf\u00e9rico (\u00e1cido carb\u00f3nico)<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"checkAnswer(this, false)\">Presencia natural \u00e1cido sulf\u00farico<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"checkAnswer(this, false)\">Neutralidad agua pura (pH=7)<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n            <p><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-alert);\">PREGUNTA 3:<\/strong> \u00bfPor qu\u00e9 PM2.5 m\u00e1s peligrosa que PM10?<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" onclick=\"checkAnswer(this, true)\">Penetra hasta alveolos pulmonares<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"checkAnswer(this, false)\">Exclusivamente origen humano<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"checkAnswer(this, false)\">Se mide en ppm no \u00b5g\/m\u00b3<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n            <p><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-alert);\">PREGUNTA 4:<\/strong> Calcular 30 ppm NO\u2082 \u2192 mg\/m\u00b3 (25\u00b0C, 1 atm):<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" onclick=\"checkAnswer(this, true)\">56.5 mg\/m\u00b3<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"checkAnswer(this, false)\">30.0 mg\/m\u00b3<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"checkAnswer(this, false)\">565 mg\/m\u00b3<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\">\r\n            <p><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-alert);\">PREGUNTA 5:<\/strong> Mecanismo formaci\u00f3n ozono troposf\u00e9rico:<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"true\" onclick=\"checkAnswer(this, true)\">Reacciones fotoqu\u00edmicas NO\u2093 + COV<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"checkAnswer(this, false)\">Fotodisociaci\u00f3n O\u2082 directa<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-correct=\"false\" onclick=\"checkAnswer(this, false)\">Oxidaci\u00f3n SO\u2082<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\"><\/div>\r\n        <button class=\"quiz-reset\" onclick=\"resetQuiz()\">\ud83d\udd04 REINICIAR QUIZ<\/button>\r\n        \r\n        <div style=\"margin-top: 20px; text-align: center;\">\r\n            <div style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.1); border: 2px solid var(--neon-toxic);\">\r\n                <span style=\"color: var(--neon-toxic);\">PUNTUACI\u00d3N: <\/span>\r\n                <span id=\"quizScore\" style=\"color: var(--neon-alert); font-weight: bold;\">0\/5<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"border: 1px solid var(--neon-toxic); margin: 25px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- 7\ufe0f\u20e3 SOLUCIONES -->\r\n<section id=\"soluciones\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"subtitulo-conceptual\">VI. SOLUCIONES TECNOL\u00d3GICAS<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"solutions-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"solution-card\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\ude97 TRANSPORTE<\/h4>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>Veh\u00edculos el\u00e9ctricos<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Transporte p\u00fablico<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Bicicletas<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Normas Euro 6<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Combustibles limpios<\/strong><\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <p class=\"solution-tip\">Reducci\u00f3n 30-50% NO\u2093 y PM<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"solution-card\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83c\udfed INDUSTRIA<\/h4>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>Precipitadores electrost\u00e1ticos<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Scrubbers SO\u2082<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>SCR (Reducci\u00f3n NO\u2093)<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Econom\u00eda circular<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Energ\u00edas renovables<\/strong><\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <p class=\"solution-tip\">Hasta 95% reducci\u00f3n emisiones<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"solution-card\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83c\udf33 NATURALEZA<\/h4>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>Bosques urbanos<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Jardines verticales<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Techos verdes<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Corredores ecol\u00f3gicos<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Humedales artificiales<\/strong><\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <p class=\"solution-tip\">1 \u00e1rbol captura ~22 kg CO\u2082\/a\u00f1o<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"solution-card\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udcca POL\u00cdTICAS<\/h4>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>Sistemas monitoreo<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Alertas tempranas<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Impuestos carbono<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Educaci\u00f3n ambiental<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Investigaci\u00f3n<\/strong><\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <p class=\"solution-tip\">PROAIRE CDMX: -22% PM2.5 (2008-2018)<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"border: 1px solid var(--neon-pollution); margin: 25px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- 8\ufe0f\u20e3 PROBLEMAS EXAMEN -->\r\n<section id=\"examen\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"subtitulo-conceptual\">VII. PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"exam-problems\">\r\n        <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udcdd PROBLEMA 1: C\u00c1LCULOS CONCENTRACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <p>Estaci\u00f3n monitoreo reporta:<\/p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>CO: 8 ppm (25\u00b0C, 1 atm)<\/li>\r\n                <li>NO\u2082: 45 ppb<\/li>\r\n                <li>PM2.5: 28 \u00b5g\/m\u00b3<\/li>\r\n                <li>O\u2083: 85 ppb<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <p><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-alert);\">PREGUNTAS:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <ol style=\"color: #e0f0ff; font-size: 0.9rem;\">\r\n                <li>Convertir CO a mg\/m\u00b3<\/li>\r\n                <li>Expresar NO\u2082 en \u00b5g\/m\u00b3<\/li>\r\n                <li>\u00bfCu\u00e1les superan l\u00edmites OMS?<\/li>\r\n                <li>Calcular AQI aproximado PM2.5<\/li>\r\n            <\/ol>\r\n            <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n                <textarea rows=\"6\" placeholder=\"DESARROLLA C\u00c1LCULOS AQU\u00cd...\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"exam-problem\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udcdd PROBLEMA 2: LLUVIA \u00c1CIDA<\/h4>\r\n            <p>Termoel\u00e9ctrica: 1000 t\/d\u00eda carb\u00f3n (2% S)<\/p>\r\n            <p>\\[ \\text{S} + \\text{O}_2 \\rightarrow \\text{SO}_2 \\]<\/p>\r\n            <p>\\[ \\text{SO}_2 + \\tfrac{1}{2}\\text{O}_2 + \\text{H}_2\\text{O} \\rightarrow \\text{H}_2\\text{SO}_4 \\]<\/p>\r\n            <p><strong style=\"color: var(--neon-alert);\">PREGUNTAS:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <ol style=\"color: #e0f0ff; font-size: 0.9rem;\">\r\n                <li>Calcular masa diaria SO\u2082<\/li>\r\n                <li>Masa H\u2082SO\u2084 que se puede formar<\/li>\r\n                <li>pH si se dispersa en 10 km\u00b3 lluvia<\/li>\r\n                <li>Proponer m\u00e9todos reducci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n            <\/ol>\r\n            <div class=\"answer-space\">\r\n                <textarea rows=\"6\" placeholder=\"MOSTRAR C\u00c1LCULOS Y RAZONAMIENTO...\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"border: 1px solid var(--neon-smog); margin: 25px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- 9\ufe0f\u20e3 REFLEXI\u00d3N -->\r\n<section id=\"reflexion\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"subtitulo-conceptual\">VIII. REFLEXI\u00d3N METACOGNITIVA<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"metacognitive-reflection\">\r\n        <div class=\"reflection-question\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udd0d AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <ol>\r\n                <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 contaminaci\u00f3n m\u00e1s preocupante en tu comunidad?<\/li>\r\n                <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo se relaciona con otros temas del curso?<\/li>\r\n                <li>Si fueras alcalde, \u00bfqu\u00e9 3 medidas tomar\u00edas?<\/li>\r\n                <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 datos necesitar\u00edas para diagn\u00f3stico calidad aire?<\/li>\r\n            <\/ol>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"learning-check\">\r\n            <h4>\u2713 VERIFICACI\u00d3N APRENDIZAJE<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"checklist\">\r\n                <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Diferencio primarios\/secundarios<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Comprendo formaci\u00f3n lluvia \u00e1cida<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Interpreto datos AQI<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Conozco efectos salud<\/label>\r\n                <label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Puedo proponer soluciones<\/label>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div style=\"margin-top: 20px; padding: 15px; background: rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.05); border: 1px solid var(--neon-smog);\">\r\n            <h4 style=\"color: var(--neon-smog);\">\ud83c\udf0d CONEXI\u00d3N GLOBAL<\/h4>\r\n            <p style=\"color: #e0f0ff; font-size: 0.9rem;\">\r\n                <strong>Cambio clim\u00e1tico:<\/strong> Sinergia contaminantes + GEI<br>\r\n                <strong>Desigualdad ambiental:<\/strong> Comunidades vulnerables mayor exposici\u00f3n<br>\r\n                <strong>Iniciativas:<\/strong> Acuerdo Par\u00eds, ODS 2030, Coalici\u00f3n Clima y Aire Limpio\r\n            <\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ Variables globales\r\nlet quizScore = 0;\r\nlet smogActive = false;\r\nlet answeredQuestions = 0;\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR SMOG\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nfunction iniciarSmog() {\r\n    smogActive = true;\r\n    document.getElementById('smogInfo').innerHTML = \r\n        '<p style=\"color: var(--neon-smog);\">\u25b6\ufe0f SIMULACI\u00d3N EN PROGRESO...<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p style=\"color: var(--neon-data); font-size: 0.9rem;\">1. Emisi\u00f3n contaminantes primarios<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p style=\"color: var(--neon-data); font-size: 0.9rem;\">2. Reacciones fotoqu\u00edmicas<\/p>' +\r\n        '<p style=\"color: var(--neon-data); font-size: 0.9rem;\">3. Formaci\u00f3n O\u2083 y PM2.5<\/p>';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Animar efectos\r\n    animateEffects();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction pausarSmog() {\r\n    smogActive = false;\r\n    document.getElementById('smogInfo').innerHTML = \r\n        '<p style=\"color: var(--neon-alert);\">\u23f8\ufe0f SIMULACI\u00d3N PAUSADA<\/p>';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction resetSmog() {\r\n    smogActive = false;\r\n    document.getElementById('smogInfo').innerHTML = \r\n        '<p style=\"color: var(--neon-data);\">SISTEMA LISTO. Haz clic en INICIAR.<\/p>';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Resetear valores\r\n    document.getElementById('car-emissions').textContent = 'NO\u2093: 40 ppb';\r\n    document.getElementById('industry-emissions').textContent = 'SO\u2082: 30 ppb';\r\n    document.getElementById('ozone-level').textContent = 'O\u2083: 70 ppb';\r\n    document.getElementById('health-impact').textContent = 'RIESGO MODERADO';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction animateEffects() {\r\n    if (!smogActive) return;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Incrementar valores\r\n    const car = document.getElementById('car-emissions');\r\n    const industry = document.getElementById('industry-emissions');\r\n    const ozone = document.getElementById('ozone-level');\r\n    const health = document.getElementById('health-impact');\r\n    \r\n    let nox = parseInt(car.textContent.split(':')[1]);\r\n    let so2 = parseInt(industry.textContent.split(':')[1]);\r\n    let o3 = parseInt(ozone.textContent.split(':')[1]);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Incrementar\r\n    nox = Math.min(150, nox + 5);\r\n    so2 = Math.min(100, so2 + 3);\r\n    o3 = Math.min(150, o3 + 8);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar\r\n    car.textContent = `NO\u2093: ${nox} ppb`;\r\n    car.style.color = nox > 80 ? 'var(--neon-alert)' : 'var(--neon-pollution)';\r\n    \r\n    industry.textContent = `SO\u2082: ${so2} ppb`;\r\n    industry.style.color = so2 > 60 ? 'var(--neon-alert)' : 'var(--neon-acid)';\r\n    \r\n    ozone.textContent = `O\u2083: ${o3} ppb`;\r\n    ozone.style.color = o3 > 100 ? 'var(--neon-alert)' : 'var(--neon-smog)';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Determinar riesgo salud\r\n    let risk = 'BAJO';\r\n    let riskColor = 'var(--neon-toxic)';\r\n    \r\n    if (o3 > 100 || nox > 100) {\r\n        risk = 'ALTO';\r\n        riskColor = 'var(--neon-alert)';\r\n    } else if (o3 > 70 || nox > 70) {\r\n        risk = 'MODERADO';\r\n        riskColor = 'var(--neon-pollution)';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    health.textContent = `RIESGO ${risk}`;\r\n    health.style.color = riskColor;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Continuar animaci\u00f3n\r\n    setTimeout(animateEffects, 1000);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR LLUVIA \u00c1CIDA\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nfunction calcularLluviaAcida() {\r\n    const so2 = parseInt(document.getElementById('so2Level').value);\r\n    const nox = parseInt(document.getElementById('noxLevel').value);\r\n    const humidity = parseInt(document.getElementById('humidityLevel').value);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar displays\r\n    document.getElementById('so2Value').textContent = `${so2} ppb`;\r\n    document.getElementById('noxValue').textContent = `${nox} ppb`;\r\n    document.getElementById('humidityValue').textContent = `${humidity}%`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular pH (modelo simplificado)\r\n    let basepH = 5.6;\r\n    const so2Effect = (so2 \/ 200) * 1.6;\r\n    const noxEffect = (nox \/ 150) * 0.8;\r\n    const humidityEffect = humidity \/ 100;\r\n    \r\n    let finalpH = basepH - (so2Effect + noxEffect) * humidityEffect;\r\n    finalpH = Math.max(2.0, Math.min(7.0, finalpH));\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar pH display\r\n    const phDisplay = document.getElementById('phDisplay');\r\n    phDisplay.textContent = finalpH.toFixed(1);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar indicador\r\n    const phPosition = ((7 - finalpH) \/ 7) * 100;\r\n    document.getElementById('phIndicator').style.left = `${phPosition}%`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Clasificar\r\n    const classification = document.getElementById('phClassification');\r\n    let classText = '';\r\n    let classColor = '';\r\n    \r\n    if (finalpH >= 5.6) {\r\n        classText = 'LLUVIA NORMAL';\r\n        classColor = 'var(--neon-toxic)';\r\n    } else if (finalpH >= 5.0) {\r\n        classText = 'LIGERAMENTE \u00c1CIDA';\r\n        classColor = 'var(--neon-alert)';\r\n    } else if (finalpH >= 4.5) {\r\n        classText = '\u00c1CIDA';\r\n        classColor = '#FF7E00';\r\n    } else if (finalpH >= 4.0) {\r\n        classText = 'MUY \u00c1CIDA';\r\n        classColor = '#FF0000';\r\n    } else {\r\n        classText = 'EXTREMADAMENTE \u00c1CIDA';\r\n        classColor = '#8B0000';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    classification.textContent = classText;\r\n    classification.style.color = classColor;\r\n    classification.style.borderColor = classColor;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular concentraciones \u00e1cidos\r\n    const h2so4 = (so2 * 0.025 * humidity \/ 100).toFixed(2);\r\n    const hno3 = (nox * 0.015 * humidity \/ 100).toFixed(2);\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('h2so4Value').textContent = h2so4;\r\n    document.getElementById('hno3Value').textContent = hno3;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar efectos\r\n    updateRainEffects(finalpH);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction updateRainEffects(pH) {\r\n    const effects = ['rainEffect1', 'rainEffect2', 'rainEffect3', 'rainEffect4'];\r\n    let intensity = 0;\r\n    \r\n    if (pH < 5.6) intensity = 0.3;\r\n    if (pH < 5.0) intensity = 0.5;\r\n    if (pH < 4.5) intensity = 0.8;\r\n    if (pH < 4.0) intensity = 1.0;\r\n    \r\n    effects.forEach(id => {\r\n        const effect = document.getElementById(id);\r\n        effect.style.opacity = 0.3 + intensity * 0.7;\r\n        effect.style.transform = `scale(${1 + intensity * 0.2})`;\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ MONITOR CALIDAD AIRE\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nfunction updateAQI() {\r\n    const pm25 = parseInt(document.getElementById('pm25Input').value);\r\n    const o3 = parseInt(document.getElementById('o3Input').value);\r\n    const no2 = parseInt(document.getElementById('no2Input').value);\r\n    const co = parseFloat(document.getElementById('coInput').value);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar displays\r\n    document.getElementById('pm25Display').textContent = `${pm25} \u00b5g\/m\u00b3`;\r\n    document.getElementById('o3Display').textContent = `${o3} ppb`;\r\n    document.getElementById('no2Display').textContent = `${no2} ppb`;\r\n    document.getElementById('coDisplay').textContent = `${co.toFixed(1)} ppm`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular AQI (simplificado)\r\n    let aqi = 0;\r\n    let level = '';\r\n    let color = '';\r\n    \r\n    if (pm25 <= 12) {\r\n        aqi = Math.round((pm25 \/ 12) * 50);\r\n        level = 'BUENA';\r\n        color = '#00E400';\r\n    } else if (pm25 <= 35.4) {\r\n        aqi = Math.round(50 + ((pm25 - 12.1) \/ (35.4 - 12.1)) * 50);\r\n        level = 'MODERADA';\r\n        color = '#FFFF00';\r\n    } else if (pm25 <= 55.4) {\r\n        aqi = Math.round(100 + ((pm25 - 35.5) \/ (55.4 - 35.5)) * 50);\r\n        level = 'INSALUBLE GS';\r\n        color = '#FF7E00';\r\n    } else if (pm25 <= 150.4) {\r\n        aqi = Math.round(150 + ((pm25 - 55.5) \/ (150.4 - 55.5)) * 50);\r\n        level = 'INSALUBLE';\r\n        color = '#FF0000';\r\n    } else {\r\n        aqi = Math.round(200 + ((pm25 - 150.5) \/ (250.4 - 150.5)) * 100);\r\n        level = aqi <= 300 ? 'MUY INSALUBLE' : 'PELIGROSA';\r\n        color = aqi <= 300 ? '#8F3F97' : '#7E0023';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar display AQI\r\n    const aqiDisplay = document.getElementById('aqiDisplay');\r\n    aqiDisplay.innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"aqi-main\" style=\"background: ${color}22; border: 2px solid ${color};\">\r\n            <div class=\"aqi-value\" style=\"color: ${color};\">${aqi}<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"aqi-level\" style=\"color: ${color};\">${level}<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    `;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Event listeners para sliders AQI\r\ndocument.getElementById('pm25Input').addEventListener('input', updateAQI);\r\ndocument.getElementById('o3Input').addEventListener('input', updateAQI);\r\ndocument.getElementById('no2Input').addEventListener('input', updateAQI);\r\ndocument.getElementById('coInput').addEventListener('input', updateAQI);\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ - VERSI\u00d3N CORREGIDA\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nfunction checkAnswer(button, isCorrect) {\r\n    \/\/ Verificar si el bot\u00f3n ya fue contestado\r\n    if (button.disabled) return;\r\n    \r\n    const questionDiv = button.parentElement.parentElement;\r\n    const options = questionDiv.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Deshabilitar todos los botones de esta pregunta\r\n    options.forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.disabled = true;\r\n        opt.style.cursor = 'not-allowed';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Marcar la respuesta correcta\r\n        if (opt.getAttribute('data-correct') === 'true') {\r\n            opt.style.background = 'rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.2)';\r\n            opt.style.borderColor = 'var(--neon-toxic)';\r\n            opt.style.color = 'var(--neon-toxic)';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Marcar respuesta incorrecta si el usuario se equivoc\u00f3\r\n        if (opt === button && !isCorrect) {\r\n            opt.style.background = 'rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.2)';\r\n            opt.style.borderColor = 'var(--neon-pollution)';\r\n            opt.style.color = 'var(--neon-pollution)';\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Marcar respuesta correcta del usuario\r\n    if (isCorrect) {\r\n        button.style.background = 'rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.3)';\r\n        button.style.borderColor = 'var(--neon-toxic)';\r\n        button.style.color = 'var(--neon-toxic)';\r\n        quizScore++;\r\n    } else {\r\n        button.style.background = 'rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.3)';\r\n        button.style.borderColor = 'var(--neon-pollution)';\r\n        button.style.color = 'var(--neon-pollution)';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Incrementar contador de preguntas contestadas\r\n    answeredQuestions++;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar display puntuaci\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${quizScore}\/5`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar retroalimentaci\u00f3n\r\n    const feedback = document.getElementById('quizFeedback');\r\n    feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n    feedback.innerHTML = isCorrect ? \r\n        '<div style=\"color: var(--neon-toxic); font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 10px; background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.1); border: 1px solid var(--neon-toxic);\">\u2705 CORRECTO<\/div>' :\r\n        '<div style=\"color: var(--neon-pollution); font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 10px; background: rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.1); border: 1px solid var(--neon-pollution);\">\u274c INCORRECTO<\/div>';\r\n    \r\n    feedback.innerHTML += `<p style=\"color: var(--neon-data); margin-top: 10px;\">Progreso: ${answeredQuestions}\/5 | Puntuaci\u00f3n: ${quizScore}\/5<\/p>`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n contestadas, mostrar mensaje final\r\n    if (answeredQuestions === 5) {\r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            let mensajeFinal = '';\r\n            let icono = '';\r\n            \r\n            if (quizScore === 5) {\r\n                mensajeFinal = '\u00a1PERFECTO! Dominas completamente el tema.';\r\n                icono = '\ud83c\udf89';\r\n            } else if (quizScore >= 4) {\r\n                mensajeFinal = '\u00a1Excelente! Tu conocimiento es s\u00f3lido.';\r\n                icono = '\ud83d\udc4d';\r\n            } else if (quizScore >= 3) {\r\n                mensajeFinal = 'Buen trabajo, pero hay algunos conceptos por repasar.';\r\n                icono = '\u2705';\r\n            } else {\r\n                mensajeFinal = 'Es recomendable revisar el material nuevamente.';\r\n                icono = '\ud83d\udcda';\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            feedback.innerHTML += `\r\n                <hr style=\"border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); margin: 15px 0;\">\r\n                <div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 15px; background: rgba(255, 255, 0, 0.1); border: 1px solid var(--neon-alert);\">\r\n                    <h4 style=\"color: var(--neon-alert); margin: 0 0 10px 0;\">\ud83d\udcca RESULTADO FINAL<\/h4>\r\n                    <p style=\"color: var(--neon-data); margin: 0;\">${icono} ${mensajeFinal}<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            `;\r\n        }, 500);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction resetQuiz() {\r\n    \/\/ Resetear variables\r\n    quizScore = 0;\r\n    answeredQuestions = 0;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Resetear botones\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(button => {\r\n        button.disabled = false;\r\n        button.style.background = '';\r\n        button.style.borderColor = '';\r\n        button.style.color = '#e0f0ff'; \/\/ Color original del texto\r\n        button.style.cursor = 'pointer';\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Resetear displays\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = '0\/5';\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').innerHTML = '';\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    \/\/ Inicializar simuladores\r\n    calcularLluviaAcida();\r\n    updateAQI();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Event listeners para lluvia \u00e1cida\r\n    document.getElementById('so2Level').addEventListener('input', calcularLluviaAcida);\r\n    document.getElementById('noxLevel').addEventListener('input', calcularLluviaAcida);\r\n    document.getElementById('humidityLevel').addEventListener('input', calcularLluviaAcida);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar quiz (asegurar que la puntuaci\u00f3n est\u00e9 en 0)\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = '0\/5';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Verificar que las funciones est\u00e9n disponibles globalmente\r\n    console.log('Quiz functions loaded:', {\r\n        checkAnswer: typeof checkAnswer,\r\n        resetQuiz: typeof resetQuiz\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ ANIMACIONES CSS\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\nconst style = document.createElement('style');\r\nstyle.textContent = `\r\n    @keyframes pulse-toxic {\r\n        0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\r\n        50% { opacity: 0.7; }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .effect {\r\n        transition: all 0.3s ease;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .ph-indicator {\r\n        transition: left 0.5s ease;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    button:active {\r\n        transform: scale(0.98);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .quiz-option {\r\n        transition: all 0.3s ease;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .quiz-option:hover:not(:disabled) {\r\n        transform: translateY(-2px);\r\n        box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(255, 255, 0, 0.2);\r\n    }\r\n`;\r\ndocument.head.appendChild(style);\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Tipos contaminaci\u00f3n","respuesta":"Aire, agua, suelo"},{"enunciado":"Causa principal aire","respuesta":"Combusti\u00f3n f\u00f3sil"},{"enunciado":"Efecto PM2.5","respuesta":"Enfermedad card\u00edaca"},{"enunciado":"L\u00edmite EPA PM2.5","respuesta":"9 \u00b5g\/m\u00b3 (anual)"},{"enunciado":"CO\u2082 actual (2025)","respuesta":"423 ppm"},{"enunciado":"Lluvia \u00e1cida por","respuesta":"SO\u2082 + NO\u2093"},{"enunciado":"Reacci\u00f3n lluvia \u00e1cida","respuesta":"SO\u2082 + H\u2082O \u2192 H\u2082SO\u2083"},{"enunciado":"Eutrofizaci\u00f3n por","respuesta":"Nitratos\/fosfatos"},{"enunciado":"Bioacumulaci\u00f3n","respuesta":"Hg, DDT en cadena"},{"enunciado":"Meta EPA 2030","respuesta":"PM2.5 \u2193 40%"},{"enunciado":"OMS: muertes\/a\u00f1o","respuesta":"9 millones"},{"enunciado":"Protocolo Montreal","respuesta":"Elimin\u00f3 CFC (ozono)"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Contaminaci\u00f3n causa...","opciones":["Enfermedades","Salud","Nada","Bienestar"],"correcta":"Enfermedades"},{"pregunta":"Aire contaminado por...","opciones":["PM2.5","O\u2082","N\u2082","H\u2082O"],"correcta":"PM2.5"},{"pregunta":"Lluvia \u00e1cida por...","opciones":["SO\u2082, NO\u2093","CO\u2082","CH\u2084","O\u2082"],"correcta":"SO\u2082, NO\u2093"},{"pregunta":"Eutrofizaci\u00f3n en...","opciones":["Agua","Aire","Suelo","Luz"],"correcta":"Agua"},{"pregunta":"CO\u2082 es GHG...","opciones":["Principal","Secundario","Ninguno","Beneficioso"],"correcta":"Principal"},{"pregunta":"Prevenci\u00f3n clave","opciones":["Reciclaje","Quemar m\u00e1s","Desechos","Nada"],"correcta":"Reciclaje"},{"pregunta":"Smog fotoqu\u00edmico contiene...","opciones":["O\u2083","O\u2082","N\u2082","H\u2082"],"correcta":"O\u2083"},{"pregunta":"OMS dice causa...","opciones":["9M muertes\/a\u00f1o","0","1M","100M"],"correcta":"9M muertes\/a\u00f1o"},{"pregunta":"Pl\u00e1sticos en oc\u00e9ano","opciones":["8M toneladas\/a\u00f1o","0","1","100"],"correcta":"8M toneladas\/a\u00f1o"},{"pregunta":"CFC destruyen...","opciones":["Ozono","CO\u2082","N\u2082","O\u2082"],"correcta":"Ozono"},{"pregunta":"L\u00edmite EPA PM2.5","opciones":["9 \u00b5g\/m\u00b3","35 \u00b5g\/m\u00b3","100 \u00b5g\/m\u00b3","0"],"correcta":"9 \u00b5g\/m\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"CO\u2082 actual","opciones":["423 ppm","280 ppm","1000 ppm","0 ppm"],"correcta":"423 ppm"},{"pregunta":"Reacci\u00f3n SO\u2082","opciones":["H\u2082SO\u2083","H\u2082SO\u2084","SO\u2083","H\u2082S"],"correcta":"H\u2082SO\u2083"},{"pregunta":"Bioacumulaci\u00f3n afecta...","opciones":["Peces \u2192 humanos","Solo plantas","Aire","Nada"],"correcta":"Peces \u2192 humanos"},{"pregunta":"Catalizador reduce...","opciones":["CO, NO\u2093","CO\u2082","O\u2082","H\u2082O"],"correcta":"CO, NO\u2093"},{"pregunta":"Protocolo Montreal","opciones":["CFC","CO\u2082","CH\u2084","PM"],"correcta":"CFC"},{"pregunta":"Efecto invernadero natural","opciones":["Necesario","Da\u00f1ino","Ninguno","Todo"],"correcta":"Necesario"},{"pregunta":"Meta EPA 2030","opciones":["PM2.5 \u2193 40%","\u2191 40%","0%","100%"],"correcta":"PM2.5 \u2193 40%"},{"pregunta":"CH\u2084 potencial vs CO\u2082","opciones":["25\u00d7","1\u00d7","100\u00d7","0\u00d7"],"correcta":"25\u00d7"},{"pregunta":"Filtro HEPA captura...","opciones":["PM2.5","CO\u2082","O\u2082","N\u2082"],"correcta":"PM2.5"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula lluvia \u00e1cida","opciones":["SO\u2082 + H\u2082O \u2192 H\u2082SO\u2083","CO\u2082 + H\u2082O \u2192 H\u2082CO\u2083","NO\u2082 + H\u2082O \u2192 HNO\u2083","Todas"],"correcta":"Todas"},{"pregunta":"PM2.5 entra en...","opciones":["Alveolos","Nariz","Garganta","Ojos"],"correcta":"Alveolos"},{"pregunta":"CO\u2082 preindustrial","opciones":["280 ppm","423 ppm","100 ppm","0 ppm"],"correcta":"280 ppm"},{"pregunta":"Eutrofizaci\u00f3n causa...","opciones":["Zona muerta","M\u00e1s peces","Agua clara","Nada"],"correcta":"Zona muerta"},{"pregunta":"DDT es...","opciones":["Persistente","Biodegradable","Inofensivo","Nutriente"],"correcta":"Persistente"},{"pregunta":"Acuerdo Par\u00eds meta","opciones":["<2\u00b0C","<1\u00b0C","<5\u00b0C","0\u00b0C"],"correcta":"<2\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"NO\u2093 forma...","opciones":["Smog + lluvia \u00e1cida","Solo ozono","Solo CO\u2082","Nada"],"correcta":"Smog + lluvia \u00e1cida"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"propiedades-materia-avanzado","titulo":"Propiedades de la Materia: Fundamentos Conceptuales y Aplicaciones","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-quimica\">\r\n\r\n<!-- 1\ufe0f\u20e3 INTRODUCCI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL -->\r\n<section id=\"introduccion\">\r\n    <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion\">Propiedades de la Materia: Fundamentos Conceptuales y Aplicaciones<\/h1>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"bloque-fundamento\">\r\n        <p><strong>Fundamento epistemol\u00f3gico:<\/strong> Las propiedades de la materia constituyen el lenguaje descriptivo de la qu\u00edmica. No son meras caracter\u00edsticas observables, sino manifestaciones macrosc\u00f3picas de la estructura at\u00f3mico-molecular subyacente. Su correcta clasificaci\u00f3n permite predecir comportamientos, dise\u00f1ar materiales y comprender transformaciones energ\u00e9ticas.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <p>En esta lecci\u00f3n exploraremos <strong>c\u00f3mo las propiedades emergen de la organizaci\u00f3n de part\u00edculas fundamentales<\/strong> y c\u00f3mo su clasificaci\u00f3n (f\u00edsicas\/qu\u00edmicas, intensivas\/extensivas) establece las bases para el m\u00e9todo cient\u00edfico en qu\u00edmica. Relacionaremos estos conceptos con aplicaciones industriales, ambientales y tecnol\u00f3gicas.<\/p>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"ejemplo-contextual\">\r\n        <p><strong>Contexto hist\u00f3rico:<\/strong> La distinci\u00f3n entre propiedades intensivas y extensivas fue formalizada por el qu\u00edmico franc\u00e9s Joseph Louis Proust (1754-1826) en su Ley de las Proporciones Definidas, sentando las bases para la qu\u00edmica cuantitativa moderna.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"border: 2px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 40px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- 2\ufe0f\u20e3 DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO ESTRUCTURADO -->\r\n<section id=\"desarrollo-teorico\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"subtitulo-conceptual\">I. Marco Te\u00f3rico: Naturaleza Dual de las Propiedades<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <p>Las propiedades de la materia presentan una <strong>dualidad fundamental<\/strong>: por un lado describen estados observables (macrosc\u00f3pico), y por otro reflejan interacciones a nivel molecular (microsc\u00f3pico). Esta dualidad es clave para comprender la relaci\u00f3n entre estructura y propiedades.<\/p>\r\n    \r\n    <h4>1.1 Propiedades F\u00edsicas: Manifestaciones de la Organizaci\u00f3n Molecular<\/h4>\r\n    <p>Las propiedades f\u00edsicas describen <strong>comportamientos reversibles<\/strong> que no alteran la identidad qu\u00edmica de la sustancia. Se relacionan directamente con:<\/p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Interacciones intermoleculares:<\/strong> Fuerzas de van der Waals, puentes de hidr\u00f3geno<\/li>\r\n        <li><strong>Energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica molecular:<\/strong> Relacionada con temperatura y estados de agregaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n        <li><strong>Organizaci\u00f3n estructural:<\/strong> Arreglo cristalino o amorfo<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n    \r\n    <table class=\"tabla-conceptual\">\r\n        <thead>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <th>Propiedad F\u00edsica<\/th>\r\n                <th>Base Molecular<\/th>\r\n                <th>Ecuaci\u00f3n Fundamental<\/th>\r\n                <th>Importancia Tecnol\u00f3gica<\/th>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/thead>\r\n        <tbody>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Densidad (\u03c1)<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>Masa at\u00f3mica y empaquetamiento molecular<\/td>\r\n                <td>\\[ \rho = \frac{m}{V} \\]<\/td>\r\n                <td>Dise\u00f1o de materiales ligeros, flotabilidad<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Punto de Fusi\u00f3n<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>Energ\u00eda requerida para superar fuerzas intermoleculares<\/td>\r\n                <td>\\[ Q = m \\cdot L_f \\]<\/td>\r\n                <td>Selecci\u00f3n de materiales para altas temperaturas<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Viscosidad<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>Fricci\u00f3n entre capas moleculares deslizantes<\/td>\r\n                <td>\\[ \tau = \\mu \frac{dv}{dy} \\]<\/td>\r\n                <td>Dise\u00f1o de lubricantes, fluidos industriales<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Conductividad T\u00e9rmica<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>Transferencia de energ\u00eda vibratoria entre mol\u00e9culas<\/td>\r\n                <td>\\[ \frac{Q}{t} = kA \frac{\\Delta T}{d} \\]<\/td>\r\n                <td>Aislamiento t\u00e9rmico, disipadores de calor<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/tbody>\r\n    <\/table>\r\n    \r\n    <h4>1.2 Propiedades Qu\u00edmicas: Reactividad y Transformaci\u00f3n de Identidad<\/h4>\r\n    <p>Las propiedades qu\u00edmicas implican <strong>reorganizaci\u00f3n de enlaces<\/strong> y generaci\u00f3n de nuevas sustancias. Se manifiestan en procesos irreversibles que obedecen a leyes estequiom\u00e9tricas precisas.<\/p>\r\n    \r\n    <table class=\"tabla-conceptual\">\r\n        <thead>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <th>Propiedad Qu\u00edmica<\/th>\r\n                <th>Mecanismo Molecular<\/th>\r\n                <th>Ejemplo Especificado<\/th>\r\n                <th>Energ\u00eda Involucrada<\/th>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/thead>\r\n        <tbody>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Inflamabilidad<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>Combusti\u00f3n oxidativa con liberaci\u00f3n de calor<\/td>\r\n                <td>\\[ \text{CH}_4 + 2\text{O}_2 \rightarrow \text{CO}_2 + 2\text{H}_2\text{O} + \text{energ\u00eda} \\]<\/td>\r\n                <td>\u0394H = -890 kJ\/mol (exot\u00e9rmica)<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Acidez\/Basicidad<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>Transferencia de protones (H\u207a) seg\u00fan teor\u00eda de Br\u00f8nsted-Lowry<\/td>\r\n                <td>\\[ \text{HCl} + \text{H}_2\text{O} \rightleftharpoons \text{H}_3\text{O}^+ + \text{Cl}^- \\]<\/td>\r\n                <td>Depende de constante de acidez (Ka)<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Poder Redox<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>Transferencia de electrones entre especies<\/td>\r\n                <td>\\[ \text{Zn} + \text{Cu}^{2+} \rightarrow \text{Zn}^{2+} + \text{Cu} \\]<\/td>\r\n                <td>Potencial est\u00e1ndar de reducci\u00f3n (E\u00b0)<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Hidr\u00f3lisis<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                <td>Rotura de enlaces por acci\u00f3n del agua<\/td>\r\n                <td>\\[ \text{NH}_4^+ + \text{H}_2\text{O} \rightleftharpoons \text{NH}_3 + \text{H}_3\text{O}^+ \\]<\/td>\r\n                <td>Depende de constante de hidr\u00f3lisis (Kh)<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/tbody>\r\n    <\/table>\r\n    \r\n    <h4>1.3 Clasificaci\u00f3n Intensiva\/Extensiva: Independencia y Dependencia de la Cantidad<\/h4>\r\n    <p>Esta clasificaci\u00f3n es fundamental para la <strong>identificaci\u00f3n de sustancias puras<\/strong> y el establecimiento de leyes ponderales. Las propiedades intensivas son invariantes escalares, mientras que las extensivas presentan aditividad.<\/p>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"ejemplo-contextual\">\r\n        <p><strong>Ejemplo anal\u00f3gico:<\/strong> El color de una pintura (intensiva) no depende de cu\u00e1nta pintura tengas, pero el volumen total de pintura (extensiva) s\u00ed aumenta al juntar dos botes. En qu\u00edmica, la densidad permite identificar sustancias porque es intensiva: 1 g de oro y 1 kg de oro tienen la misma densidad (19.3 g\/cm\u00b3).<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"border: 2px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 40px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- 3\ufe0f\u20e3 VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA -->\r\n<section id=\"visualizacion\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"subtitulo-conceptual\">II. Modelo Integrado: Relaciones entre Propiedades<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"contenedor-svg\">\r\n        <h4>Diagrama Interactivo: Jerarqu\u00eda de Propiedades y sus Relaciones<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Este diagrama muestra c\u00f3mo las propiedades se relacionan entre s\u00ed y con la estructura molecular. <strong>Haz clic en cada elemento para ver detalles<\/strong>:<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <svg class=\"diagrama-interactivo\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 600\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n            <!-- Fondo con gradiente -->\r\n            <defs>\r\n                <linearGradient id=\"gradienteFondo\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\">\r\n                    <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#e3f2fd\" \/>\r\n                    <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#f3e5f5\" \/>\r\n                <\/linearGradient>\r\n                <filter id=\"sombraSuave\">\r\n                    <feDropShadow dx=\"2\" dy=\"2\" stdDeviation=\"3\" flood-opacity=\"0.2\"\/>\r\n                <\/filter>\r\n            <\/defs>\r\n            \r\n            <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"url(#gradienteFondo)\"\/>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- N\u00facleo: Estructura Molecular (centro interactivo) -->\r\n            <g id=\"nucleo-molecular\" onclick=\"mostrarDetalle('molecular')\" style=\"cursor:pointer\">\r\n                <circle cx=\"500\" cy=\"300\" r=\"80\" fill=\"#311b92\" filter=\"url(#sombraSuave)\">\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"80;85;80\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <\/circle>\r\n                <text x=\"500\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                    ESTRUCTURA MOLECULAR\r\n                <\/text>\r\n                <text x=\"500\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#d1c4e9\" font-size=\"14\">\r\n                    \u00c1tomos, Enlaces, Geometr\u00eda\r\n                <\/text>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Propiedades F\u00edsicas (izquierda) -->\r\n            <g id=\"fisicas\" onclick=\"mostrarDetalle('fisicas')\" style=\"cursor:pointer\">\r\n                <rect x=\"100\" y=\"150\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"#2e7d32\" filter=\"url(#sombraSuave)\">\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0.8;1;0.8\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <\/rect>\r\n                <text x=\"200\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                    F\u00cdSICAS\r\n                <\/text>\r\n                <text x=\"200\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#c8e6c9\" font-size=\"12\">\r\n                    Reversibles \u00b7 Observables\r\n                <\/text>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Propiedades Qu\u00edmicas (derecha) -->\r\n            <g id=\"quimicas\" onclick=\"mostrarDetalle('quimicas')\" style=\"cursor:pointer\">\r\n                <rect x=\"700\" y=\"150\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"#c62828\" filter=\"url(#sombraSuave)\">\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0.8;1;0.8\" dur=\"3s\" begin=\"1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <\/rect>\r\n                <text x=\"800\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                    QU\u00cdMICAS\r\n                <\/text>\r\n                <text x=\"800\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffcdd2\" font-size=\"12\">\r\n                    Irreversibles \u00b7 Reactivas\r\n                <\/text>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Intensivas (abajo izquierda) -->\r\n            <g id=\"intensivas\" onclick=\"mostrarDetalle('intensivas')\" style=\"cursor:pointer\">\r\n                <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"450\" r=\"60\" fill=\"#1565c0\">\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"fill\" values=\"#1565c0;#42a5f5;#1565c0\" dur=\"5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <\/circle>\r\n                <text x=\"250\" y=\"445\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                    INTENSIVAS\r\n                <\/text>\r\n                <text x=\"250\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#bbdefb\" font-size=\"10\">\r\n                    Densidad, P. Fusi\u00f3n, Color\r\n                <\/text>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Extensivas (abajo derecha) -->\r\n            <g id=\"extensivas\" onclick=\"mostrarDetalle('extensivas')\" style=\"cursor:pointer\">\r\n                <rect x=\"650\" y=\"400\" width=\"200\" height=\"80\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ef6c00\">\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"width\" values=\"200;210;200\" dur=\"3s\" begin=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <\/rect>\r\n                <text x=\"750\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                    EXTENSIVAS\r\n                <\/text>\r\n                <text x=\"750\" y=\"455\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffcc80\" font-size=\"10\">\r\n                    Masa, Volumen, Energ\u00eda\r\n                <\/text>\r\n            <\/g>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Flechas de conexi\u00f3n -->\r\n            <path d=\"M300 200 L440 280\" stroke=\"#2e7d32\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowGreen)\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"100\" to=\"0\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/path>\r\n            <path d=\"M600 200 L560 280\" stroke=\"#c62828\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowRed)\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"100\" to=\"0\" dur=\"2s\" begin=\"1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n            <\/path>\r\n            <path d=\"M180 250 L220 390\" stroke=\"#1565c0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowBlue)\"\/>\r\n            <path d=\"M820 250 L780 390\" stroke=\"#ef6c00\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowOrange)\"\/>\r\n            <path d=\"M500 380 L500 420\" stroke=\"#311b92\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Flechas personalizadas -->\r\n            <defs>\r\n                <marker id=\"arrowGreen\" markerWidth=\"13\" markerHeight=\"13\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"6\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                    <path d=\"M2,2 L2,11 L10,6 L2,2\" fill=\"#2e7d32\"\/>\r\n                <\/marker>\r\n                <marker id=\"arrowRed\" markerWidth=\"13\" markerHeight=\"13\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"6\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                    <path d=\"M2,2 L2,11 L10,6 L2,2\" fill=\"#c62828\"\/>\r\n                <\/marker>\r\n                <marker id=\"arrowBlue\" markerWidth=\"13\" markerHeight=\"13\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"6\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                    <path d=\"M2,2 L2,11 L10,6 L2,2\" fill=\"#1565c0\"\/>\r\n                <\/marker>\r\n                <marker id=\"arrowOrange\" markerWidth=\"13\" markerHeight=\"13\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"6\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                    <path d=\"M2,2 L2,11 L10,6 L2,2\" fill=\"#ef6c00\"\/>\r\n                <\/marker>\r\n            <\/defs>\r\n        <\/svg>\r\n        \r\n        <div id=\"detalle-diagrama\" style=\"margin-top:20px; padding:15px; background:#f5f5f5; border-radius:8px; display:none;\">\r\n            <h5 id=\"titulo-detalle\" style=\"margin-top:0;\"><\/h5>\r\n            <p id=\"descripcion-detalle\"><\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <script>\r\n        function mostrarDetalle(tipo) {\r\n            const detalle = document.getElementById('detalle-diagrama');\r\n            const titulo = document.getElementById('titulo-detalle');\r\n            const descripcion = document.getElementById('descripcion-detalle');\r\n            \r\n            const detalles = {\r\n                'molecular': {\r\n                    titulo: 'Estructura Molecular',\r\n                    descripcion: 'Nivel microsc\u00f3pico que determina todas las propiedades macrosc\u00f3picas. Incluye: composici\u00f3n at\u00f3mica, tipos de enlaces (i\u00f3nico, covalente, met\u00e1lico), geometr\u00eda molecular, fuerzas intermoleculares y arreglo espacial (cristalino\/amorfo).'\r\n                },\r\n                'fisicas': {\r\n                    titulo: 'Propiedades F\u00edsicas',\r\n                    descripcion: 'Manifestaciones observables sin cambio en la identidad qu\u00edmica. Ejemplos: densidad (\u03c1=m\/V), puntos de cambio de estado, conductividad, viscosidad. Se relacionan con la energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica molecular y fuerzas intermoleculares.'\r\n                },\r\n                'quimicas': {\r\n                    titulo: 'Propiedades Qu\u00edmicas',\r\n                    descripcion: 'Comportamientos que implican transformaci\u00f3n en otras sustancias. Determinadas por la configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica y potencial de ionizaci\u00f3n. Ejemplos: acidez (pH), poder redox (E\u00b0), inflamabilidad, reactividad con \u00e1cidos\/bases.'\r\n                },\r\n                'intensivas': {\r\n                    titulo: 'Propiedades Intensivas',\r\n                    descripcion: 'INDEPENDIENTES de la cantidad de materia. Permiten identificar sustancias puras. Ejemplos: densidad, punto de fusi\u00f3n, color, \u00edndice de refracci\u00f3n. No son aditivas: el valor es el mismo para 1g o 1kg.'\r\n                },\r\n                'extensivas': {\r\n                    titulo: 'Propiedades Extensivas',\r\n                    descripcion: 'DEPENDIENTES de la cantidad de materia. Son aditivas: el total es la suma de las partes. Ejemplos: masa, volumen, energ\u00eda interna, carga el\u00e9ctrica. No sirven para identificar sustancias.'\r\n                }\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            titulo.textContent = detalles[tipo].titulo;\r\n            descripcion.textContent = detalles[tipo].descripcion;\r\n            detalle.style.display = 'block';\r\n            detalle.scrollIntoView({behavior: 'smooth'});\r\n        }\r\n        <\/script>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"border: 2px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 40px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- 4\ufe0f\u20e3 BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS REALES -->\r\n<section id=\"interactivos\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"subtitulo-conceptual\">III. Laboratorio Virtual: Simulaci\u00f3n y An\u00e1lisis<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR 1: DENSIDAD Y PROPIEDADES INTENSIVAS -->\r\n    <div class=\"simulador-contenedor\">\r\n        <h4>Simulador 1: Densidad como Propiedad Intensiva<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Modifica la masa y volumen de diferentes sustancias para comprobar que la densidad (\u03c1 = m\/V) permanece constante para cada sustancia pura.<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"controles-simulador\">\r\n            <div class=\"control-deslizante\">\r\n                <label for=\"masa-sim\">Masa (g): <span id=\"valor-masa\">100<\/span><\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"masa-sim\" min=\"1\" max=\"1000\" value=\"100\" step=\"1\" oninput=\"actualizarSimulador()\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-deslizante\">\r\n                <label for=\"volumen-sim\">Volumen (cm\u00b3): <span id=\"valor-volumen\">50<\/span><\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"volumen-sim\" min=\"1\" max=\"500\" value=\"50\" step=\"1\" oninput=\"actualizarSimulador()\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div>\r\n                <label for=\"sustancia-sim\">Sustancia:<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"sustancia-sim\" onchange=\"actualizarSimulador()\">\r\n                    <option value=\"agua\">Agua (1.00 g\/cm\u00b3)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"aluminio\">Aluminio (2.70 g\/cm\u00b3)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"hierro\">Hierro (7.87 g\/cm\u00b3)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"oro\">Oro (19.30 g\/cm\u00b3)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"plomo\">Plomo (11.34 g\/cm\u00b3)<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"vis-resultado\">\r\n            <h5>Resultados del An\u00e1lisis:<\/h5>\r\n            <p id=\"resultado-densidad\">Densidad calculada: <strong>2.00 g\/cm\u00b3<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <p id=\"propiedad-tipo\">La densidad es una propiedad <strong>INTENSIVA<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <p id=\"explicacion-densidad\">Aunque la masa y volumen cambian (propiedades extensivas), su cociente (densidad) permanece constante para cada sustancia pura.<\/p>\r\n            \r\n            <div style=\"margin-top:15px;\">\r\n                <button onclick=\"verificarComprension()\" style=\"padding:10px 20px; background:#2196f3; color:white; border:none; border-radius:5px; cursor:pointer;\">\r\n                    Verificar Comprensi\u00f3n Conceptual\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR 2: CAMBIOS DE ESTADO -->\r\n    <div class=\"simulador-contenedor\">\r\n        <h4>Simulador 2: Cambios F\u00edsicos vs Qu\u00edmicos<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Selecciona un proceso y determina si representa un cambio f\u00edsico o qu\u00edmico, bas\u00e1ndote en si hay formaci\u00f3n de nuevas sustancias.<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap:15px; margin:20px 0;\">\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-proceso\" onclick=\"seleccionarProceso(1)\" data-tipo=\"fisico\">\r\n                <strong>Fusi\u00f3n del hielo<\/strong><br>\r\n                H\u2082O(s) \u2192 H\u2082O(l)\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-proceso\" onclick=\"seleccionarProceso(2)\" data-tipo=\"quimico\">\r\n                <strong>Combusti\u00f3n del papel<\/strong><br>\r\n                C\u2086H\u2081\u2080O\u2085 + O\u2082 \u2192 CO\u2082 + H\u2082O\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-proceso\" onclick=\"seleccionarProceso(3)\" data-tipo=\"fisico\">\r\n                <strong>Evaporaci\u00f3n del agua<\/strong><br>\r\n                H\u2082O(l) \u2192 H\u2082O(g)\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-proceso\" onclick=\"seleccionarProceso(4)\" data-tipo=\"quimico\">\r\n                <strong>Oxidaci\u00f3n del hierro<\/strong><br>\r\n                4Fe + 3O\u2082 \u2192 2Fe\u2082O\u2083\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-proceso\" onclick=\"seleccionarProceso(5)\" data-tipo=\"fisico\">\r\n                <strong>Disoluci\u00f3n de sal<\/strong><br>\r\n                NaCl(s) \u2192 Na\u207a(ac) + Cl\u207b(ac)\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-proceso\" onclick=\"seleccionarProceso(6)\" data-tipo=\"quimico\">\r\n                <strong>Digesti\u00f3n de alimentos<\/strong><br>\r\n                Enzimas + nutrientes \u2192 productos\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div id=\"feedback-proceso\" style=\"display:none; padding:20px; background:#e8f5e9; border-radius:10px; margin-top:20px;\">\r\n            <h5 id=\"titulo-feedback\"><\/h5>\r\n            <p id=\"explicacion-feedback\"><\/p>\r\n            <p id=\"criterio-feedback\"><\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N -->\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-contenedor\">\r\n        <h4>Quiz Conceptual: Clasificaci\u00f3n de Propiedades<\/h4>\r\n        <p>Responde las siguientes preguntas para evaluar tu comprensi\u00f3n. <strong>Tienes 3 intentos por pregunta<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"pregunta-quiz\" id=\"pregunta1\">\r\n            <p><strong>Pregunta 1:<\/strong> La temperatura de ebullici\u00f3n del agua es 100\u00b0C a nivel del mar. \u00bfQu\u00e9 tipo de propiedad representa?<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"seleccionarRespuesta(1, 'a')\">A) Extensiva y f\u00edsica<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"seleccionarRespuesta(1, 'b')\">B) Intensiva y f\u00edsica<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"seleccionarRespuesta(1, 'c')\">C) Intensiva y qu\u00edmica<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"seleccionarRespuesta(1, 'd')\">D) Extensiva y qu\u00edmica<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"feedback-quiz\" id=\"feedback1\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"pregunta-quiz\" id=\"pregunta2\">\r\n            <p><strong>Pregunta 2:<\/strong> La masa de una muestra de oro es de 50g. \u00bfQu\u00e9 tipo de propiedad es la masa?<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"seleccionarRespuesta(2, 'a')\">A) Intensiva y f\u00edsica<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"seleccionarRespuesta(2, 'b')\">B) Extensiva y f\u00edsica<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"seleccionarRespuesta(2, 'c')\">C) Intensiva y qu\u00edmica<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"seleccionarRespuesta(2, 'd')\">D) Extensiva y qu\u00edmica<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"feedback-quiz\" id=\"feedback2\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"pregunta-quiz\" id=\"pregunta3\">\r\n            <p><strong>Pregunta 3:<\/strong> \u00bfCu\u00e1l de las siguientes propiedades permite identificar una sustancia pura?<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"seleccionarRespuesta(3, 'a')\">A) Masa<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"seleccionarRespuesta(3, 'b')\">B) Volumen<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"seleccionarRespuesta(3, 'c')\">C) Densidad<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"opcion-quiz\" onclick=\"seleccionarRespuesta(3, 'd')\">D) Energ\u00eda interna<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"feedback-quiz\" id=\"feedback3\"><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <button onclick=\"calcularPuntaje()\" style=\"padding:12px 30px; background:#4caf50; color:white; border:none; border-radius:8px; cursor:pointer; font-size:1.1rem; margin-top:20px;\">\r\n            Calcular Puntaje Final\r\n        <\/button>\r\n        \r\n        <div id=\"resultado-quiz\" style=\"display:none; margin-top:25px; padding:20px; background:#e8f5e9; border-radius:10px; text-align:center;\">\r\n            <h5>Resultado del Quiz<\/h5>\r\n            <p id=\"puntaje-final\"><\/p>\r\n            <p id=\"recomendaciones\"><\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"border: 2px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 40px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- 5\ufe0f\u20e3 SECCI\u00d3N ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<section id=\"errores-comunes\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"subtitulo-conceptual\">IV. Errores Comunes del Estudiante<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"seccion-errores\">\r\n        <p>Identifica y corrige estos errores t\u00edpicos que suelen aparecer en ex\u00e1menes y pr\u00e1cticas de laboratorio:<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n            <div class=\"icono-error\">\u274c<\/div>\r\n            <div>\r\n                <h5 style=\"margin-top:0; color:#d84315;\">Error 1: Confundir propiedades intensivas con extensivas<\/h5>\r\n                <p><strong>Error t\u00edpico:<\/strong> \"La densidad es extensiva porque si tengo m\u00e1s material, tengo m\u00e1s masa y m\u00e1s volumen\".<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Correcci\u00f3n conceptual:<\/strong> La densidad es INTENSIVA porque el cociente m\/V es constante independientemente de la cantidad. Lo que aumenta proporcionalmente son las propiedades extensivas (masa y volumen), no su relaci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n            <div class=\"icono-error\">\u274c<\/div>\r\n            <div>\r\n                <h5 style=\"margin-top:0; color:#d84315;\">Error 2: Clasificar cambios de estado como qu\u00edmicos<\/h5>\r\n                <p><strong>Error t\u00edpico:<\/strong> \"La evaporaci\u00f3n del agua es un cambio qu\u00edmico porque el agua l\u00edquida se transforma en vapor\".<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Correcci\u00f3n conceptual:<\/strong> Los cambios de estado son F\u00cdSICOS porque no alteran la composici\u00f3n molecular (H\u2082O sigue siendo H\u2082O). Solo cambian las fuerzas intermoleculares y la energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n            <div class=\"icono-error\">\u274c<\/div>\r\n            <div>\r\n                <h5 style=\"margin-top:0; color:#d84315;\">Error 3: No distinguir entre propiedad y cambio<\/h5>\r\n                <p><strong>Error t\u00edpico:<\/strong> \"La combusti\u00f3n es una propiedad f\u00edsica del papel\".<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Correcci\u00f3n conceptual:<\/strong> La combusti\u00f3n es un CAMBIO qu\u00edmico. La propiedad correspondiente es la INFLAMABILIDAD (capacidad de sufrir combusti\u00f3n). Las propiedades describen capacidades; los cambios son procesos donde se manifiestan.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"error-item\">\r\n            <div class=\"icono-error\">\u274c<\/div>\r\n            <div>\r\n                <h5 style=\"margin-top:0; color:#d84315;\">Error 4: Creer que todas las propiedades intensivas sirven para identificar sustancias<\/h5>\r\n                <p><strong>Error t\u00edpico:<\/strong> \"El color identifica sustancias puras porque es intensivo\".<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Correcci\u00f3n conceptual:<\/strong> Aunque el color es intensivo, NO es determinante para identificaci\u00f3n (muchas sustancias pueden tener el mismo color). Se necesitan propiedades intensivas espec\u00edficas como densidad, punto de fusi\u00f3n\/ebullici\u00f3n, \u00edndice de refracci\u00f3n, espectros caracter\u00edsticos.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"ejemplo-contextual\" style=\"margin-top:25px;\">\r\n            <p><strong>Consejo para ex\u00e1menes:<\/strong> Cuando clasifiques una propiedad, preg\u00fantate: 1) \u00bfCambia la sustancia? (f\u00edsico\/qu\u00edmico), 2) \u00bfDepende de la cantidad? (intensivo\/extensivo). Escribe siempre la justificaci\u00f3n conceptual, no solo la clasificaci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"border: 2px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 40px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- 6\ufe0f\u20e3 CONEXI\u00d3N CON LA MATERIA BASE -->\r\n<section id=\"conexion-curricular\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"subtitulo-conceptual\">V. Conexi\u00f3n Curricular y Evaluaci\u00f3n Formal<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"bloque-fundamento\">\r\n        <p><strong>Ubicaci\u00f3n en el programa oficial de Qu\u00edmica I:<\/strong> Este tema corresponde a la <strong>Unidad 1: Materia y Medici\u00f3n<\/strong>, siendo el fundamento para todas las unidades posteriores. Su dominio es prerrequisito para:<\/p>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li>Unidad 2: Estructura At\u00f3mica (propiedades peri\u00f3dicas)<\/li>\r\n            <li>Unidad 3: Enlaces Qu\u00edmicos (relaci\u00f3n estructura-propiedad)<\/li>\r\n            <li>Unidad 4: Estequiometr\u00eda (leyes ponderales basadas en propiedades extensivas)<\/li>\r\n            <li>Unidad 5: Estados de la Materia (propiedades f\u00edsicas de gases, l\u00edquidos, s\u00f3lidos)<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <h4>Criterios de Evaluaci\u00f3n Formal<\/h4>\r\n    <table class=\"tabla-conceptual\">\r\n        <thead>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <th>Competencia<\/th>\r\n                <th>Indicador de Logro<\/th>\r\n                <th>% en Examen<\/th>\r\n                <th>Tipo de Pregunta<\/th>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/thead>\r\n        <tbody>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Clasificar propiedades<\/td>\r\n                <td>Distinguir correctamente entre f\u00edsicas\/qu\u00edmicas e intensivas\/extensivas<\/td>\r\n                <td>25%<\/td>\r\n                <td>Selecci\u00f3n m\u00faltiple con justificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Relacionar propiedades con estructura<\/td>\r\n                <td>Explicar c\u00f3mo propiedades macrosc\u00f3picas emergen de estructura microsc\u00f3pica<\/td>\r\n                <td>30%<\/td>\r\n                <td>An\u00e1lisis de caso y problemas<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Aplicar propiedades para identificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <td>Usar propiedades intensivas para identificar sustancias desconocidas<\/td>\r\n                <td>25%<\/td>\r\n                <td>Problemas de laboratorio simulado<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Predecir comportamientos<\/td>\r\n                <td>Predecir propiedades bas\u00e1ndose en composici\u00f3n y enlaces<\/td>\r\n                <td>20%<\/td>\r\n                <td>Preguntas de razonamiento<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/tbody>\r\n    <\/table>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"ejemplo-contextual\">\r\n        <p><strong>Nota importante para evaluaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> En el examen parcial, este tema representa aproximadamente el <strong>30% de la calificaci\u00f3n<\/strong>. Se evaluar\u00e1 no solo la clasificaci\u00f3n, sino la capacidad de justificaci\u00f3n conceptual y aplicaci\u00f3n a situaciones nuevas.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"border: 2px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 40px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- 7\ufe0f\u20e3 PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<section id=\"problemas-examen\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"subtitulo-conceptual\">VI. Problemas Tipo Examen (Papel y L\u00e1piz)<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"problema-examen\">\r\n        <div class=\"numero-problema\">1<\/div>\r\n        <p><strong>Problema 1: Identificaci\u00f3n de Sustancia Desconocida<\/strong><\/p>\r\n        <p>En el laboratorio se tiene una sustancia desconocida. Se realizan las siguientes mediciones:<\/p>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li>Masa: 25.0 g<\/li>\r\n            <li>Volumen: 12.4 cm\u00b3<\/li>\r\n            <li>Punto de fusi\u00f3n: 327.5\u00b0C<\/li>\r\n            <li>Conductividad el\u00e9ctrica: Alta en estado s\u00f3lido y l\u00edquido<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <p><strong>Preguntas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n        <ol type=\"a\">\r\n            <li>Calcula la densidad de la sustancia. [2 puntos]<\/li>\r\n            <li>Clasifica cada propiedad medida como intensiva o extensiva, justificando cada caso. [3 puntos]<\/li>\r\n            <li>Bas\u00e1ndote en los datos, \u00bfcu\u00e1l crees que es la sustancia? Justifica tu respuesta comparando con valores conocidos. [3 puntos]<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 propiedad adicional medir\u00edas para confirmar la identificaci\u00f3n? Explica por qu\u00e9. [2 puntos]<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"problema-examen\">\r\n        <div class=\"numero-problema\">2<\/div>\r\n        <p><strong>Problema 2: An\u00e1lisis de Transformaciones<\/strong><\/p>\r\n        <p>Se realizan los siguientes procesos en el laboratorio:<\/p>\r\n        <ol>\r\n            <li>Calentamiento de yodo s\u00f3lido hasta que se sublima<\/li>\r\n            <li>Quemado de una cinta de magnesio en aire<\/li>\r\n            <li>Disoluci\u00f3n de az\u00facar en agua<\/li>\r\n            <li>Fermentaci\u00f3n de glucosa para producir etanol y CO\u2082<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n        <p><strong>Preguntas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n        <ol type=\"a\">\r\n            <li>Para cada proceso, clasif\u00edcalo como cambio f\u00edsico o qu\u00edmico, justificando con criterios claros. [4 puntos]<\/li>\r\n            <li>Para el proceso qu\u00edmico identificado, escribe la ecuaci\u00f3n balanceada correspondiente. [2 puntos]<\/li>\r\n            <li>Explica c\u00f3mo determinar\u00edas experimentalmente si en el proceso de disoluci\u00f3n de az\u00facar hubo cambio qu\u00edmico. [2 puntos]<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 propiedades de la materia est\u00e1n involucradas en cada proceso? Espec\u00edfica al menos dos por proceso. [2 puntos]<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"problema-examen\">\r\n        <div class=\"numero-problema\">3<\/div>\r\n        <p><strong>Problema 3: Dise\u00f1o Experimental<\/strong><\/p>\r\n        <p>Se te asignan tres muestras met\u00e1licas (A, B y C) que podr\u00edan ser aluminio, hierro o cobre. Dispones de los siguientes equipos: balanza, probeta, term\u00f3metro, mechero, y materiales de laboratorio comunes.<\/p>\r\n        <p><strong>Preguntas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n        <ol type=\"a\">\r\n            <li>Dise\u00f1a un procedimiento para identificar cada muestra usando \u00fanicamente propiedades intensivas. Describe cada paso claramente. [4 puntos]<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 propiedades medir\u00edas y por qu\u00e9 son adecuadas para identificaci\u00f3n? [3 puntos]<\/li>\r\n            <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo evitar\u00edas errores comunes en la medici\u00f3n de densidad? Especifica al menos tres precauciones. [2 puntos]<\/li>\r\n            <li>Presenta una tabla con los valores esperados para cada metal (consulta fuentes confiables). [1 punto]<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div style=\"background:black; padding:20px; border-radius:10px; margin-top:30px;\">\r\n        <h5 style=\"color:#ef6c00; margin-top:0;\">Tiempo recomendado para resoluci\u00f3n: 90 minutos<\/h5>\r\n        <p><strong>Pautas de evaluaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Se valorar\u00e1 no solo el resultado num\u00e9rico, sino la claridad conceptual, la justificaci\u00f3n de respuestas, el uso correcto de unidades y la aplicaci\u00f3n de principios te\u00f3ricos a situaciones pr\u00e1cticas.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\"border: 2px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 40px 0;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- 8\ufe0f\u20e3 CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<section id=\"cierre-metacognitivo\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"subtitulo-conceptual\">VII. Reflexi\u00f3n Metacognitiva<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"bloque-metacognicion\">\r\n        <p>Antes de finalizar, reflexiona sobre tu proceso de aprendizaje:<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"pregunta-reflexiva\">\r\n            <p>1. \u00bfQu\u00e9 estrategia te result\u00f3 m\u00e1s \u00fatil para distinguir entre propiedades intensivas y extensivas? \u00bfPodr\u00edas explic\u00e1rsela a un compa\u00f1ero que tiene dificultades?<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"pregunta-reflexiva\">\r\n            <p>2. Si tuvieras que dise\u00f1ar una experiencia de laboratorio para demostrar que la densidad es intensiva, \u00bfqu\u00e9 har\u00edas diferente a simplemente medir masa y volumen?<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"pregunta-reflexiva\">\r\n            <p>3. \u00bfEn qu\u00e9 situaciones de la vida cotidiana aplicas (consciente o inconscientemente) la distinci\u00f3n entre propiedades f\u00edsicas y qu\u00edmicas? Da al menos dos ejemplos concretos.<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div style=\"margin-top:30px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px dashed #bbdefb;\">\r\n            <p><strong>Proyecci\u00f3n de aprendizaje:<\/strong> Estos fundamentos te preparan para el pr\u00f3ximo tema: <em>\"Estados de la Materia y Cambios de Fase\"<\/em>, donde aplicar\u00e1s estos conceptos para predecir comportamientos de sustancias en diferentes condiciones de presi\u00f3n y temperatura.<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT PARA INTERACTIVIDAD -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ FUNCIONALIDADES INTERACTIVAS\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DE DENSIDAD\r\nfunction actualizarSimulador() {\r\n    const masa = parseInt(document.getElementById('masa-sim').value);\r\n    const volumen = parseInt(document.getElementById('volumen-sim').value);\r\n    const sustancia = document.getElementById('sustancia-sim').value;\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('valor-masa').textContent = masa;\r\n    document.getElementById('valor-volumen').textContent = volumen;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Densidades de referencia (g\/cm\u00b3)\r\n    const densidades = {\r\n        'agua': 1.00,\r\n        'aluminio': 2.70,\r\n        'hierro': 7.87,\r\n        'oro': 19.30,\r\n        'plomo': 11.34\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    const densidadReal = densidades[sustancia];\r\n    const densidadCalculada = (masa \/ volumen).toFixed(2);\r\n    const diferencia = Math.abs(densidadCalculada - densidadReal).toFixed(2);\r\n    \r\n    let mensaje = `Densidad calculada: <strong>${densidadCalculada} g\/cm\u00b3<\/strong><br>`;\r\n    mensaje += `Densidad real (${sustancia}): ${densidadReal} g\/cm\u00b3<br>`;\r\n    \r\n    if (diferencia < 0.1) {\r\n        mensaje += `<span style=\"color:#2e7d32;\">\u2713 Buen c\u00e1lculo (diferencia: ${diferencia} g\/cm\u00b3)<\/span>`;\r\n    } else {\r\n        mensaje += `<span style=\"color:#c62828;\">\u2717 Revisa mediciones (diferencia: ${diferencia} g\/cm\u00b3)<\/span>`;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('resultado-densidad').innerHTML = mensaje;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar explicaci\u00f3n conceptual\r\n    document.getElementById('propiedad-tipo').innerHTML = \r\n        `La densidad es una propiedad <strong>INTENSIVA<\/strong> (no depende de la cantidad)`;\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('explicacion-densidad').textContent = \r\n        `Para ${sustancia}, la densidad es siempre ${densidadReal} g\/cm\u00b3, independientemente de si tomas ${masa}g o ${masa*10}g. Las propiedades intensivas identifican sustancias puras.`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DE CAMBIOS F\u00cdSICOS\/QU\u00cdMICOS\r\nfunction seleccionarProceso(numero) {\r\n    \/\/ Resetear selecciones anteriores\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.opcion-proceso').forEach(opcion => {\r\n        opcion.style.background = '#f5f5f5';\r\n        opcion.style.border = '2px solid #e0e0e0';\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Resaltar seleccionada\r\n    const opcionSeleccionada = event.currentTarget;\r\n    opcionSeleccionada.style.background = '#e3f2fd';\r\n    opcionSeleccionada.style.border = '2px solid #2196f3';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Determinar tipo y mostrar feedback\r\n    const tipo = opcionSeleccionada.getAttribute('data-tipo');\r\n    const procesos = {\r\n        1: {nombre: \"Fusi\u00f3n del hielo\", tipo: \"fisico\", explicacion: \"Cambio de estado s\u00f3lido a l\u00edquido. La composici\u00f3n molecular (H\u2082O) no var\u00eda, solo la energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica y organizaci\u00f3n molecular.\"},\r\n        2: {nombre: \"Combusti\u00f3n del papel\", tipo: \"quimico\", explicacion: \"Reacci\u00f3n de oxidaci\u00f3n con O\u2082. Se forman nuevas sustancias (CO\u2082, H\u2082O, cenizas) con propiedades diferentes. Es irreversible.\"},\r\n        3: {nombre: \"Evaporaci\u00f3n del agua\", tipo: \"fisico\", explicacion: \"Cambio de estado l\u00edquido a gas. Las mol\u00e9culas de H\u2082O ganan energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica pero conservan su identidad qu\u00edmica.\"},\r\n        4: {nombre: \"Oxidaci\u00f3n del hierro\", tipo: \"quimico\", explicacion: \"Formaci\u00f3n de \u00f3xido (Fe\u2082O\u2083) a partir de hierro met\u00e1lico. Cambia la composici\u00f3n, propiedades y color. Es corrosi\u00f3n.\"},\r\n        5: {nombre: \"Disoluci\u00f3n de sal\", tipo: \"fisico\", explicacion: \"Los iones Na\u207a y Cl\u207b se separan pero no reaccionan qu\u00edmicamente con el agua. Es reversible por evaporaci\u00f3n.\"},\r\n        6: {nombre: \"Digesti\u00f3n de alimentos\", tipo: \"quimico\", explicacion: \"Las enzimas rompen mol\u00e9culas complejas en nutrientes m\u00e1s simples. Hay transformaci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica de las sustancias.\"}\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    const proceso = procesos[numero];\r\n    const feedbackDiv = document.getElementById('feedback-proceso');\r\n    const titulo = document.getElementById('titulo-feedback');\r\n    const explicacion = document.getElementById('explicacion-feedback');\r\n    const criterio = document.getElementById('criterio-feedback');\r\n    \r\n    feedbackDiv.style.display = 'block';\r\n    feedbackDiv.style.background = proceso.tipo === 'fisico' ? '#e8f5e9' : '#ffebee';\r\n    \r\n    titulo.textContent = `${proceso.nombre} - Cambio ${proceso.tipo === 'fisico' ? 'F\u00cdSICO' : 'QU\u00cdMICO'}`;\r\n    explicacion.textContent = proceso.explicacion;\r\n    \r\n    if (proceso.tipo === 'fisico') {\r\n        criterio.innerHTML = `<strong>Criterio clave:<\/strong> No hay formaci\u00f3n de nuevas sustancias. Es reversible en condiciones adecuadas.`;\r\n    } else {\r\n        criterio.innerHTML = `<strong>Criterio clave:<\/strong> Se forman nuevas sustancias con propiedades diferentes. Generalmente irreversible.`;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ QUIZ CON RETROALIMENTACI\u00d3N\r\nconst respuestasCorrectas = {\r\n    1: 'b', \/\/ Punto de ebullici\u00f3n: intensiva y f\u00edsica\r\n    2: 'b', \/\/ Masa: extensiva y f\u00edsica  \r\n    3: 'c'  \/\/ Densidad identifica sustancias\r\n};\r\n\r\nconst intentosPorPregunta = {1: 0, 2: 0, 3: 0};\r\nconst respuestasUsuario = {1: null, 2: null, 3: null};\r\n\r\nfunction seleccionarRespuesta(numPregunta, opcion) {\r\n    if (intentosPorPregunta[numPregunta] >= 3) {\r\n        alert(`Ya usaste tus 3 intentos para la pregunta ${numPregunta}`);\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Resetear selecci\u00f3n visual\r\n    const opciones = document.querySelectorAll(`#pregunta${numPregunta} .opcion-quiz`);\r\n    opciones.forEach(op => op.classList.remove('seleccionada'));\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Marcar seleccionada\r\n    event.currentTarget.classList.add('seleccionada');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n    const esCorrecta = (opcion === respuestasCorrectas[numPregunta]);\r\n    respuestasUsuario[numPregunta] = esCorrecta;\r\n    intentosPorPregunta[numPregunta]++;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n    const feedbackDiv = document.getElementById(`feedback${numPregunta}`);\r\n    const explicaciones = {\r\n        1: {\r\n            correcta: \"\u2713 Correcto. El punto de ebullici\u00f3n es INTENSIVO (no depende de la cantidad) y F\u00cdSICO (no cambia la sustancia, solo su estado).\",\r\n            incorrecta: \"\u2717 Incorrecto. Recuerda: el punto de ebullici\u00f3n no depende de cu\u00e1nta agua tengas (intensiva) y el agua sigue siendo H\u2082O (cambio f\u00edsico).\"\r\n        },\r\n        2: {\r\n            correcta: \"\u2713 Correcto. La masa es EXTENSIVA (depende de la cantidad) y F\u00cdSICA (se puede medir sin cambiar la sustancia).\",\r\n            incorrecta: \"\u2717 Incorrecto. La masa cambia si tomas m\u00e1s o menos material (extensiva), y no altera la identidad del oro (f\u00edsica).\"\r\n        },\r\n        3: {\r\n            correcta: \"\u2713 Correcto. La densidad es intensiva y caracter\u00edstica de cada sustancia pura, por lo tanto sirve para identificaci\u00f3n.\",\r\n            incorrecta: \"\u2717 Incorrecto. La masa, volumen y energ\u00eda interna son extensivas (dependen de la cantidad), por lo tanto no identifican sustancias.\"\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    feedbackDiv.innerHTML = esCorrecta ? \r\n        `<div class=\"feedback-correcto\">${explicaciones[numPregunta].correcta} (Intento ${intentosPorPregunta[numPregunta]}\/3)<\/div>` :\r\n        `<div class=\"feedback-incorrecto\">${explicaciones[numPregunta].incorrecta} (Intento \\{intentosPorPregunta[numPregunta]}\/3)<\/div>`;\r\n    \r\n    feedbackDiv.style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction calcularPuntaje() {\r\n    let correctas = 0;\r\n    for (let i = 1; i <= 3; i++) {\r\n        if (respuestasUsuario[i] === true) correctas++;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    const puntaje = Math.round((correctas \/ 3) * 100);\r\n    const resultadoDiv = document.getElementById('resultado-quiz');\r\n    const puntajeElem = document.getElementById('puntaje-final');\r\n    const recomendacionesElem = document.getElementById('recomendaciones');\r\n    \r\n    resultadoDiv.style.display = 'block';\r\n    puntajeElem.innerHTML = `<strong>Puntaje: ${puntaje}%<\/strong> (${correctas} de 3 correctas)`;\r\n    \r\n    if (puntaje >= 80) {\r\n        recomendacionesElem.innerHTML = \"\u00a1Excelente! Dominas la clasificaci\u00f3n de propiedades. Avanza a problemas m\u00e1s complejos de aplicaci\u00f3n.\";\r\n    } else if (puntaje >= 60) {\r\n        recomendacionesElem.innerHTML = \"Buen trabajo. Revisa los conceptos de propiedades intensivas vs extensivas. Practica con m\u00e1s ejemplos.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        recomendacionesElem.innerHTML = \"Necesitas repasar. Vuelve a estudiar la secci\u00f3n te\u00f3rica y los errores comunes antes de intentar nuevamente.\";\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ VERIFICACI\u00d3N DE COMPRENSI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL\r\nfunction verificarComprension() {\r\n    const masa = parseInt(document.getElementById('masa-sim').value);\r\n    const volumen = parseInt(document.getElementById('volumen-sim').value);\r\n    const densidad = (masa \/ volumen).toFixed(2);\r\n    \r\n    const preguntas = [\r\n        `Si divides la muestra en dos partes iguales, \u00bfla densidad de cada parte ser\u00e1 mayor, menor o igual a ${densidad} g\/cm\u00b3?`,\r\n        `Si juntas dos muestras id\u00e9nticas, \u00bfla densidad total ser\u00e1 el doble o se mantendr\u00e1 igual?`,\r\n        `\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 la densidad sirve para identificar sustancias pero la masa no?`\r\n    ];\r\n    \r\n    let respuestasCorrectas = [\r\n        \"Igual. La densidad es intensiva, no depende de la cantidad.\",\r\n        \"Se mantiene igual. La masa y volumen se duplican, pero su cociente (densidad) permanece constante.\",\r\n        \"Porque la densidad es intensiva (caracter\u00edstica de cada sustancia pura), mientras que la masa es extensiva (depende de cu\u00e1nto tengas).\"\r\n    ];\r\n    \r\n    let cuestionario = \"Verificaci\u00f3n de comprensi\u00f3n conceptual:\n\n\";\r\n    for (let i = 0; i < preguntas.length; i++) {\r\n        cuestionario += `${i+1}. ${preguntas[i]}\n   Respuesta clave: ${respuestasCorrectas[i]}\n\n`;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    alert(cuestionario);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    actualizarSimulador(); \/\/ Inicializar simulador con valores por defecto\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar eventos para opciones de proceso\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.opcion-proceso').forEach(opcion => {\r\n        opcion.style.padding = '15px';\r\n        opcion.style.border = '2px solid #e0e0e0';\r\n        opcion.style.borderRadius = '8px';\r\n        opcion.style.cursor = 'pointer';\r\n        opcion.style.transition = 'all 0.3s';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Propiedad f\u00edsica ejemplo","respuesta":"Densidad, color"},{"enunciado":"Propiedad qu\u00edmica ejemplo","respuesta":"Inflamabilidad"},{"enunciado":"Intensiva","respuesta":"Densidad, punto fusi\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Extensiva","respuesta":"Masa, volumen"},{"enunciado":"Densidad agua 4\u00b0C","respuesta":"1 g\/cm\u00b3"},{"enunciado":"Punto ebullici\u00f3n etanol","respuesta":"78.37\u00b0C"},{"enunciado":"Masa 1 mol H\u2082O","respuesta":"18.02 g"},{"enunciado":"F\u00f3rmula densidad","respuesta":"\\(\\rho = \\frac{m}{V}\\)"},{"enunciado":"Cambio f\u00edsico","respuesta":"Fusi\u00f3n, evaporaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Cambio qu\u00edmico","respuesta":"Combusti\u00f3n, oxidaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"NIST: \u03c1_H\u2082O exacta 4\u00b0C","respuesta":"0.999972 g\/cm\u00b3"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC: p.e. oro","respuesta":"1064.18\u00b0C"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"F\u00edsicas cambian...","opciones":["Forma","Composici\u00f3n","Nada","Todo"],"correcta":"Forma"},{"pregunta":"Qu\u00edmicas durante...","opciones":["Reacci\u00f3n","Medici\u00f3n","Fusi\u00f3n","Color"],"correcta":"Reacci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Densidad es...","opciones":["Intensiva","Extensiva","Qu\u00edmica","Nada"],"correcta":"Intensiva"},{"pregunta":"Volumen es...","opciones":["Extensiva","Intensiva","Qu\u00edmica","F\u00edsica"],"correcta":"Extensiva"},{"pregunta":"Color es...","opciones":["F\u00edsica intensiva","Qu\u00edmica","Extensiva","Nada"],"correcta":"F\u00edsica intensiva"},{"pregunta":"Masa es...","opciones":["Extensiva","Intensiva","Qu\u00edmica","F\u00edsica"],"correcta":"Extensiva"},{"pregunta":"Inflamabilidad es...","opciones":["Qu\u00edmica","F\u00edsica","Intensiva","Extensiva"],"correcta":"Qu\u00edmica"},{"pregunta":"Punto fusi\u00f3n es...","opciones":["Intensiva","Extensiva","Qu\u00edmica","Nada"],"correcta":"Intensiva"},{"pregunta":"Cambio f\u00edsico","opciones":["Fusi\u00f3n","Combusti\u00f3n","Reacci\u00f3n","Oxidaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Fusi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Densidad agua","opciones":["1 g\/cm\u00b3","0.5 g\/cm\u00b3","2 g\/cm\u00b3","10 g\/cm\u00b3"],"correcta":"1 g\/cm\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"Punto ebullici\u00f3n agua","opciones":["100\u00b0C","0\u00b0C","78\u00b0C","1064\u00b0C"],"correcta":"100\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Densidad oro","opciones":["19.3 g\/cm\u00b3","1 g\/cm\u00b3","0.001 g\/cm\u00b3","100 g\/cm\u00b3"],"correcta":"19.3 g\/cm\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"Reactividad Na con H\u2082O","opciones":["Explosiva","Lenta","Ninguna","Fr\u00eda"],"correcta":"Explosiva"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula densidad","opciones":["\\(\\rho = m\/V\\)","\\(\\rho = V\/m\\)","\\(\\rho = m+V\\)","\\(\\rho = 0\\)"],"correcta":"\\(\\rho = m\/V\\)"},{"pregunta":"Cambio qu\u00edmico libera...","opciones":["Energ\u00eda","Masa","Volumen","Nada"],"correcta":"Energ\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"Punto fusi\u00f3n hielo","opciones":["0\u00b0C","100\u00b0C","-78\u00b0C","1064\u00b0C"],"correcta":"0\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Masa 1 mol NaCl","opciones":["58.44 g","18 g","44 g","100 g"],"correcta":"58.44 g"},{"pregunta":"Intensiva no cambia con...","opciones":["Cantidad","Temperatura","Presi\u00f3n","Color"],"correcta":"Cantidad"},{"pregunta":"Extensiva cambia con...","opciones":["Cantidad","Densidad","Color","pH"],"correcta":"Cantidad"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC define p.e. oro","opciones":["1064.18\u00b0C","100\u00b0C","0\u00b0C","78\u00b0C"],"correcta":"1064.18\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"NIST: \u03c1_H\u2082O a 4\u00b0C","opciones":["0.999972 g\/cm\u00b3","1.000000 g\/cm\u00b3","0.998 g\/cm\u00b3","1.002 g\/cm\u00b3"],"correcta":"0.999972 g\/cm\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"Densidad diamante","opciones":["3.51 g\/cm\u00b3","19.3 g\/cm\u00b3","1 g\/cm\u00b3","0.001 g\/cm\u00b3"],"correcta":"3.51 g\/cm\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"Conductividad t\u00e9rmica es...","opciones":["F\u00edsica intensiva","Qu\u00edmica","Extensiva","Nada"],"correcta":"F\u00edsica intensiva"},{"pregunta":"Calor espec\u00edfico es...","opciones":["Intensiva","Extensiva","Qu\u00edmica","Masa"],"correcta":"Intensiva"},{"pregunta":"Entalp\u00eda combusti\u00f3n es...","opciones":["Qu\u00edmica extensiva","Intensiva","F\u00edsica","Nada"],"correcta":"Qu\u00edmica extensiva"},{"pregunta":"p.e. etanol IUPAC","opciones":["78.37\u00b0C","100\u00b0C","64\u00b0C","90\u00b0C"],"correcta":"78.37\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Densidad aire STP","opciones":["1.293 g\/L","1 g\/L","0.001 g\/L","100 g\/L"],"correcta":"1.293 g\/L"},{"pregunta":"Viscosidad es...","opciones":["F\u00edsica intensiva","Qu\u00edmica","Extensiva","Masa"],"correcta":"F\u00edsica intensiva"},{"pregunta":"Ley conservaci\u00f3n masa","opciones":["Lavoisier","Dalton","Boyle","Avogadro"],"correcta":"Lavoisier"},{"pregunta":"p.f. NaCl IUPAC","opciones":["801\u00b0C","100\u00b0C","0\u00b0C","1413\u00b0C"],"correcta":"801\u00b0C"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"cambios-quimicos-materia","titulo":"CAMBIOS QU\u00cdMICOS: Transformaci\u00f3n Molecular","contenido":"<!-- LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK QU\u00cdMICA - CAMBIOS QU\u00cdMICOS -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-cyber quimica-cambios\" data-tema=\"reacciones-quimicas\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CON GLITCH EFFECT -->\r\n    <header class=\"cyber-header\">\r\n        <div class=\"header-content\">\r\n            <h1 class=\"titulo-lecion\">\r\n                <span class=\"cyber-glitch\" data-text=\"\u2697\ufe0f CAMBIOS QU\u00cdMICOS\">\u2697\ufe0f CAMBIOS QU\u00cdMICOS<\/span>\r\n            <\/h1>\r\n            <p class=\"subtitulo-neon\">Sistema de an\u00e1lisis molecular | Transformaci\u00f3n de la materia<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"header-badges\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge neon-concepto\">Qu\u00edmica I<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge neon-interactivo\">Interactivo<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge neon-evaluacion\">Evaluaci\u00f3n<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL DE ESTADO DEL SISTEMA -->\r\n    <div class=\"cyber-panel estado-sistema\">\r\n        <div class=\"panel-header\">\r\n            <h2><span class=\"icono\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span> DATOS DEL SISTEMA<\/h2>\r\n            <div class=\"panel-status\">\r\n                <span class=\"status-indicator active\"><\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"status-text\">SISTEMA ACTIVO<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"panel-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"panel-item\">\r\n                <div class=\"item-label\">Nivel<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"item-value\">Secundaria \/ Bachillerato<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"panel-item\">\r\n                <div class=\"item-label\">Duraci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"item-value\">90 minutos<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"panel-item\">\r\n                <div class=\"item-label\">Competencias<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"item-value\">4<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"panel-item\">\r\n                <div class=\"item-label\">Progreso<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"item-value\" id=\"progreso-global\">0%<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-cyber\" id=\"objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"seccion-icono\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS MOLECULARES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-objetivo=\"1\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-icono\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/div>\r\n                <h3>Identificaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Reconocer las 5 se\u00f1ales principales que indican un cambio qu\u00edmico en la materia.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-progreso\">\r\n                    <div class=\"progreso-bar\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-objetivo=\"2\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-icono\">\ud83d\udcc8<\/div>\r\n                <h3>Clasificaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Diferenciar entre cambios f\u00edsicos y qu\u00edmicos, y clasificar reacciones por tipo energ\u00e9tico.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-progreso\">\r\n                    <div class=\"progreso-bar\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-objetivo=\"3\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-icono\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                <h3>Balanceo<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Aplicar la ley de conservaci\u00f3n de masa para balancear ecuaciones qu\u00edmicas simples.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-progreso\">\r\n                    <div class=\"progreso-bar\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-objetivo=\"4\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-icono\">\ud83e\uddea<\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Resolver problemas tipo examen aplicando conceptos de cambios qu\u00edmicos.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-progreso\">\r\n                    <div class=\"progreso-bar\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 1: CONCEPTOS FUNDAMENTALES -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-cyber\" id=\"conceptos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"seccion-icono\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> CONCEPTOS FUNDAMENTALES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"conceptos-container\">\r\n            <!-- DEFINICI\u00d3N PRINCIPAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"concepto-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"concepto-header\">\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 es un Cambio Qu\u00edmico?<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"concepto-tag\">DEFINICI\u00d3N CLAVE<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"concepto-content\">\r\n                    <p>Un <strong class=\"resaltado-neon\">cambio qu\u00edmico<\/strong> (o reacci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica) es una transformaci\u00f3n donde <strong>se altera la composici\u00f3n interna<\/strong> de la materia, formando <strong>nuevas sustancias<\/strong> con propiedades diferentes a las originales.<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"concepto-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"ejemplo-icono\">\ud83d\udca1<\/span>\r\n                            <strong>Ejemplo Representativo:<\/strong>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <p>Combusti\u00f3n del papel: Papel (celulosa) + Ox\u00edgeno \u2192 Cenizas (carbono) + Di\u00f3xido de carbono + Vapor de agua<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-ecuacion\">\r\n                            \\[ \\ce{C6H10O5 + 6O2 -> 6CO2 + 5H2O} \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- DIFERENCIAS CLAVES -->\r\n            <div class=\"diferencias-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"diferencia-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"diferencia-header diferencia-quimico\">\r\n                        <h4>Cambio QU\u00cdMICO<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <ul class=\"diferencia-lista\">\r\n                        <li>\u2705 Nueva sustancia formada<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u2705 Composici\u00f3n molecular alterada<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u2705 Generalmente irreversible<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u2705 Libera o absorbe energ\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u2705 Se manifiesta con se\u00f1ales claras<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"diferencia-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"diferencia-header diferencia-fisico\">\r\n                        <h4>Cambio F\u00cdSICO<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <ul class=\"diferencia-lista\">\r\n                        <li>\u274c Misma sustancia, diferente estado<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u274c Composici\u00f3n molecular intacta<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u274c Generalmente reversible<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u274c Cambios de energ\u00eda menores<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u274c Sin se\u00f1ales qu\u00edmicas evidentes<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- LEY DE CONSERVACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"ley-conservacion\">\r\n                <div class=\"ley-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Ley de Conservaci\u00f3n de la Masa<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"ley-autor\">Antoine Lavoisier, 1789<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ley-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ley-formula\">\r\n                        \\[ \\text{Masa}_{\\text{reactivos}} = \\text{Masa}_{\\text{productos}} \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p class=\"ley-explicacion\">\r\n                        \"En toda reacci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica, la masa total de los reactivos es igual a la masa total de los productos. La materia no se crea ni se destruye, solo se transforma.\"\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"ley-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplo num\u00e9rico:<\/strong> Reacci\u00f3n entre hidr\u00f3geno y ox\u00edgeno<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-calculo\">\r\n                            <div class=\"calculo-paso\">\r\n                                <span>2H\u2082 + O\u2082 \u2192 2H\u2082O<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"calculo-paso\">\r\n                                <span>2(2g) + 32g = 2(18g)<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"calculo-paso resultado\">\r\n                                <span>4g + 32g = 36g<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"calculo-check\">\u2713 CONSERVADA<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 2: SE\u00d1ALES DE CAMBIO QU\u00cdMICO -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-cyber\" id=\"senales\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"seccion-icono\">\ud83d\udea8<\/span> SE\u00d1ALES DE DETECCI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <p class=\"seccion-descripcion\">Indicadores visuales y medibles que confirman una transformaci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"senales-grid\">\r\n            <!-- SE\u00d1AL 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"senal-card\" data-senal=\"color\">\r\n                <div class=\"senal-icono\" style=\"color: #FF4444;\">\ud83c\udfa8<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"senal-content\">\r\n                    <h3>Cambio de Color<\/h3>\r\n                    <p>Alteraci\u00f3n en la coloraci\u00f3n de las sustancias involucradas.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"senal-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Hierro \u2192 \u00d3xido de hierro (marr\u00f3n a naranja)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Permanganato de potasio (p\u00farpura a incoloro)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Yodo con almid\u00f3n (amarillo a azul oscuro)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- SE\u00d1AL 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"senal-card\" data-senal=\"gas\">\r\n                <div class=\"senal-icono\" style=\"color: #44AAFF;\">\ud83d\udca8<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"senal-content\">\r\n                    <h3>Formaci\u00f3n de Gas<\/h3>\r\n                    <p>Liberaci\u00f3n de burbujas o efervescencia.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"senal-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Carbonato + \u00c1cido \u2192 CO\u2082 (efervescencia)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Descomposici\u00f3n del agua oxigenada<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Fermentaci\u00f3n alcoh\u00f3lica<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- SE\u00d1AL 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"senal-card\" data-senal=\"precipitado\">\r\n                <div class=\"senal-icono\" style=\"color: #FFAA44;\">\u2b07\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"senal-content\">\r\n                    <h3>Formaci\u00f3n de Precipitado<\/h3>\r\n                    <p>Aparece un s\u00f3lido insoluble en soluci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"senal-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>AgNO\u2083 + NaCl \u2192 AgCl\u2193 (blanco)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Pb(NO\u2083)\u2082 + KI \u2192 PbI\u2082\u2193 (amarillo)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>BaCl\u2082 + Na\u2082SO\u2084 \u2192 BaSO\u2084\u2193 (blanco)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- SE\u00d1AL 4 -->\r\n            <div class=\"senal-card\" data-senal=\"energia\">\r\n                <div class=\"senal-icono\" style=\"color: #FF4444;\">\ud83d\udd25<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"senal-content\">\r\n                    <h3>Cambio Energ\u00e9tico<\/h3>\r\n                    <p>Liberaci\u00f3n o absorci\u00f3n de calor\/luz.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"senal-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Combusti\u00f3n (calor y luz)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Neutralizaci\u00f3n \u00e1cido-base (calor)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Fotos\u00edntesis (absorbe luz)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- SE\u00d1AL 5 -->\r\n            <div class=\"senal-card\" data-senal=\"olor\">\r\n                <div class=\"senal-icono\" style=\"color: #AA44FF;\">\ud83d\udc43<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"senal-content\">\r\n                    <h3>Cambio de Olor<\/h3>\r\n                    <p>Generaci\u00f3n de sustancias con olor caracter\u00edstico.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"senal-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Huevo podrido (H\u2082S)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Vinagre (\u00e1cido ac\u00e9tico)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Amoniaco (NH\u2083)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- TABLA COMPARATIVA -->\r\n        <div class=\"tabla-senales\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udccb Resumen de Se\u00f1ales<\/h3>\r\n            <table class=\"cyber-table\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>Se\u00f1al<\/th>\r\n                        <th>\u00bfQu\u00e9 indica?<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Ejemplo Cl\u00e1sico<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Reversibilidad<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>Cambio de Color<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Nueva sustancia con diferente absorci\u00f3n de luz<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Oxidaci\u00f3n del hierro<\/td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"tag-irreversible\">Irreversible<\/span><\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>Formaci\u00f3n de Gas<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Producto gaseoso formado<\/td>\r\n                        <td>HCl + NaHCO\u2083 \u2192 CO\u2082<\/td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"tag-irreversible\">Irreversible<\/span><\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>Precipitado<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Sustancia insoluble formada<\/td>\r\n                        <td>AgNO\u2083 + NaCl \u2192 AgCl\u2193<\/td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"tag-dificil\">Dif\u00edcilmente reversible<\/span><\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>Calor\/Luz<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Cambio en energ\u00eda qu\u00edmica<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Combusti\u00f3n de hidrocarburos<\/td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"tag-irreversible\">Irreversible<\/span><\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 3: TIPOS DE REACCIONES -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-cyber\" id=\"tipos-reacciones\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion neon-ejemplo\">\r\n            <span class=\"seccion-icono\">\u26a1<\/span> TIPOS DE REACCIONES QU\u00cdMICAS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"reacciones-grid\">\r\n            <!-- REACCI\u00d3N 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"reaccion-card\" data-tipo=\"exotermica\">\r\n                <div class=\"reaccion-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"reaccion-icono\">\ud83d\udd25<\/div>\r\n                    <h3>Reacci\u00f3n Exot\u00e9rmica<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"reaccion-content\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Libera energ\u00eda<\/strong> al medio ambiente, generalmente en forma de calor o luz.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"reaccion-formula\">\r\n                        \\[ \\Delta H < 0 \\quad \\text{(Entalp\u00eda negativa)} \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"reaccion-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Combusti\u00f3n: \\[ \\ce{CH4 + 2O2 -> CO2 + 2H2O} \\]<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Neutralizaci\u00f3n \u00e1cido-base<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Reacciones de oxidaci\u00f3n r\u00e1pida<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- REACCI\u00d3N 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"reaccion-card\" data-tipo=\"endotermica\">\r\n                <div class=\"reaccion-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"reaccion-icono\">\u2744\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h3>Reacci\u00f3n Endot\u00e9rmica<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"reaccion-content\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Absorbe energ\u00eda<\/strong> del medio ambiente para ocurrir.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"reaccion-formula\">\r\n                        \\[ \\Delta H > 0 \\quad \\text{(Entalp\u00eda positiva)} \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"reaccion-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Fotos\u00edntesis: \\[ \\ce{6CO2 + 6H2O -> C6H12O6 + 6O2} \\]<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Descomposici\u00f3n t\u00e9rmica<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Evaporaci\u00f3n del agua<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- REACCI\u00d3N 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"reaccion-card\" data-tipo=\"redox\">\r\n                <div class=\"reaccion-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"reaccion-icono\">\ud83d\udd04<\/div>\r\n                    <h3>Reacci\u00f3n Redox<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"reaccion-content\">\r\n                    <p>Transferencia de <strong>electrones<\/strong> entre especies qu\u00edmicas.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"reaccion-explicacion\">\r\n                        <div class=\"redox-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"redox-tipo\">Oxidaci\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                            <span>P\u00e9rdida de electrones<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"redox-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"redox-tipo\">Reducci\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                            <span>Ganancia de electrones<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"reaccion-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Pilas y bater\u00edas<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Corrosi\u00f3n de metales<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Reacciones de combusti\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- REACCI\u00d3N 4 -->\r\n            <div class=\"reaccion-card\" data-tipo=\"acido-base\">\r\n                <div class=\"reaccion-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"reaccion-icono\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h3>Reacci\u00f3n \u00c1cido-Base<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"reaccion-content\">\r\n                    <p>Transferencia de <strong>protones (H\u207a)<\/strong> entre especies.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"reaccion-formula\">\r\n                        \\[ \\ce{HA + B -> A^- + HB^+} \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"reaccion-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Neutralizaci\u00f3n: \\[ \\ce{HCl + NaOH -> NaCl + H2O} \\]<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Indicadores de pH<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Digesti\u00f3n estomacal<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- COMPARACI\u00d3N ENERG\u00c9TICA -->\r\n        <div class=\"comparacion-energia\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca Comparaci\u00f3n Energ\u00e9tica: Exot\u00e9rmica vs Endot\u00e9rmica<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"comparacion-content\">\r\n                <div class=\"comparacion-item\">\r\n                    <h4>Exot\u00e9rmica<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"energia-diagrama\">\r\n                        <div class=\"diagrama-barra exotermica\">\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-fill\" style=\"height: 70%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"diagrama-labels\">\r\n                            <span>Reactivos<\/span>\r\n                            <span>Productos<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <p class=\"diagrama-texto\">Energ\u00eda liberada: Sistema \u2192 Entorno<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"comparacion-item\">\r\n                    <h4>Endot\u00e9rmica<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"energia-diagrama\">\r\n                        <div class=\"diagrama-barra endotermica\">\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-fill\" style=\"height: 30%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"diagrama-labels\">\r\n                            <span>Reactivos<\/span>\r\n                            <span>Productos<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <p class=\"diagrama-texto\">Energ\u00eda absorbida: Entorno \u2192 Sistema<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 4: SIMULADOR DE REACCI\u00d3N -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-cyber\" id=\"simulador\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"seccion-icono\">\ud83e\uddea<\/span> SIMULADOR DE REACCI\u00d3N QU\u00cdMICA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <p class=\"seccion-descripcion\">Ajusta par\u00e1metros y observa la transformaci\u00f3n molecular en tiempo real<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"simulador-container\">\r\n            <!-- CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulador-controles\">\r\n                <h3>CONTROLES EXPERIMENTALES<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-grupo\">\r\n                    <label for=\"reactivo-select\">Reactivo Principal<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"reactivo-select\" class=\"cyber-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"metano\">Metano (CH\u2084)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"hidrogeno\">Hidr\u00f3geno (H\u2082)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"magnesio\">Magnesio (Mg)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"acido\">\u00c1cido Clorh\u00eddrico (HCl)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-grupo\">\r\n                    <label for=\"temperatura-slider\">Temperatura: <span id=\"temp-valor\">25\u00b0C<\/span><\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"temperatura-slider\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"25\" class=\"cyber-slider\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>0\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                        <span>50\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                        <span>100\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-grupo\">\r\n                    <label for=\"concentracion-slider\">Concentraci\u00f3n: <span id=\"conc-valor\">50%<\/span><\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"concentracion-slider\" min=\"1\" max=\"100\" value=\"50\" class=\"cyber-slider\">\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-grupo\">\r\n                    <label>Tipo de Reacci\u00f3n<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-botones\">\r\n                        <button class=\"tipo-btn active\" data-tipo=\"combustion\">\ud83d\udd25 Combusti\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"tipo-btn\" data-tipo=\"neutralizacion\">\u2697\ufe0f Neutralizaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"tipo-btn\" data-tipo=\"precipitacion\">\u2b07\ufe0f Precipitaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"simulador-acciones\">\r\n                    <button class=\"cyber-btn btn-primario\" onclick=\"iniciarSimulacion()\">\r\n                        <span class=\"btn-icono\">\u25b6\ufe0f<\/span> Iniciar Reacci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"cyber-btn btn-secundario\" onclick=\"pausarSimulacion()\">\r\n                        <span class=\"btn-icono\">\u23f8\ufe0f<\/span> Pausar\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"cyber-btn btn-alerta\" onclick=\"reiniciarSimulacion()\">\r\n                        <span class=\"btn-icono\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> Reiniciar\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulador-visualizacion\">\r\n                <div class=\"visualizacion-container\" id=\"reaction-viz\">\r\n                    <!-- SVG generado din\u00e1micamente -->\r\n                    <div class=\"reaction-placeholder\">\r\n                        <div class=\"placeholder-text\">\r\n                            <span class=\"placeholder-icono\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                            <p>Selecciona par\u00e1metros y presiona \"Iniciar Reacci\u00f3n\"<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"reaction-info\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ecuacion-actual\" id=\"ecuacion-actual\">\r\n                        \\[ \\ce{CH4 + 2O2 -> CO2 + 2H2O} \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"reaction-tipo\" id=\"reaction-tipo\">Combusti\u00f3n - Exot\u00e9rmica<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- DATOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulador-datos\">\r\n                <h3>DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"datos-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-label\">Tiempo de Reacci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-valor\" id=\"tiempo-reaccion\">0s<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-label\">Productos Formados<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-valor\" id=\"productos-formados\">0%<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-barra\">\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-progreso\" id=\"barra-productos\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-label\">Energ\u00eda Liberada<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-valor\" id=\"energia-liberada\">0 kJ<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-barra\">\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-progreso\" id=\"barra-energia\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-label\">Velocidad<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-valor\" id=\"velocidad-reaccion\">0 M\/s<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"dato-item verificacion\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-label\">Conservaci\u00f3n de Masa<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-valor\" id=\"conservacion-masa\">\u2713 Verificada<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-desc\">Lavoisier: Masa total constante<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"simulador-log\">\r\n                    <h4>REGISTRO DE EVENTOS<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"log-contenido\" id=\"log-contenido\">\r\n                        <div class=\"log-entrada\">[SISTEMA] Simulador inicializado<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"log-entrada\">[INFO] Listo para simulaci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 5: QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-cyber\" id=\"quiz\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"seccion-icono\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> EVALUACI\u00d3N DE CONCEPTOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\" data-pregunta=\"1\" data-correcta=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"pregunta-numero\">Pregunta 1\/5<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"pregunta-dificultad\">Media<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-texto\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfCu\u00e1l de las siguientes situaciones representa claramente un cambio qu\u00edmico?<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-opciones\">\r\n                    <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"A\">\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion-letra\">A<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion-texto\">Derretir un cubo de hielo<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"B\">\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion-letra\">B<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion-texto\">Quemar un trozo de papel<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"C\">\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion-letra\">C<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion-texto\">Disolver az\u00facar en agua<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"D\">\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion-letra\">D<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion-texto\">Romper un vaso de vidrio<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-feedback\" id=\"feedback-1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correcto\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Quemar papel es un cambio qu\u00edmico porque produce nuevas sustancias (cenizas, CO\u2082, H\u2082O).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrecto\">\r\n                        <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Los otros son cambios f\u00edsicos: no se forman nuevas sustancias.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\" data-pregunta=\"2\" data-correcta=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"pregunta-numero\">Pregunta 2\/5<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"pregunta-dificultad\">Alta<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-texto\">\r\n                    <p>Balancea la siguiente ecuaci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica:<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"pregunta-ecuacion\">\r\n                        \\[ \\ce{Fe + O2 -> Fe2O3} \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-opciones\">\r\n                    <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"A\">\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion-letra\">A<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion-texto\">2Fe + 3O\u2082 \u2192 Fe\u2082O\u2083<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"B\">\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion-letra\">B<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion-texto\">Fe + O\u2082 \u2192 Fe\u2082O\u2083<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"C\">\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion-letra\">C<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion-texto\">4Fe + 3O\u2082 \u2192 2Fe\u2082O\u2083<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"D\">\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion-letra\">D<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion-texto\">3Fe + 2O\u2082 \u2192 Fe\u2082O\u2083<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-feedback\" id=\"feedback-2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correcto\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> 4Fe + 3O\u2082 \u2192 2Fe\u2082O\u2083 balancea los \u00e1tomos: Fe=4, O=6 en ambos lados.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrecto\">\r\n                        <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Recuerda contar todos los \u00e1tomos: Fe y O deben conservarse.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-resultados\" id=\"quiz-resultados\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL TEST<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-puntaje\">\r\n                    <div class=\"puntaje-circular\">\r\n                        <div class=\"circular-progreso\" id=\"circular-progreso\">\r\n                            <span class=\"puntaje-porcentaje\" id=\"puntaje-porcentaje\">0%<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"puntaje-detalle\">\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"detalle-label\">Correctas:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"detalle-valor\" id=\"correctas-contador\">0\/5<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"detalle-label\">Tiempo:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"detalle-valor\" id=\"tiempo-quiz\">0s<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"detalle-label\">Nivel:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"detalle-valor\" id=\"nivel-quiz\">-<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-feedback\" id=\"resultado-feedback\">\r\n                    Completa el quiz para ver tu resultado\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"cyber-btn btn-primario\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icono\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> Reintentar Quiz\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 6: PROBLEMAS APLICADOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-cyber\" id=\"problemas\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion neon-ejemplo\">\r\n            <span class=\"seccion-icono\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS APLICADOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"problemas-container\">\r\n            <!-- PROBLEMA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Problema 1: Conservaci\u00f3n de Masa<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-puntos\">(3 puntos)<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-contenido\">\r\n                    <p>Se hacen reaccionar 10g de magnesio (Mg) con suficiente ox\u00edgeno (O\u2082) para formar \u00f3xido de magnesio (MgO).<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"problema-ecuacion\">\r\n                        \\[ \\ce{2Mg + O2 -> 2MgO} \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"problema-preguntas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>a)<\/strong> Calcula la masa de MgO producida. (Masas at\u00f3micas: Mg=24, O=16)<\/p>\r\n                        <textarea class=\"respuesta-texto\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu desarrollo aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        \r\n                        <p><strong>b)<\/strong> \u00bfQu\u00e9 tipo de reacci\u00f3n es? Selecciona todas las correctas:<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"opciones-multiples\">\r\n                            <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p1-tipo\" value=\"exotermica\"> Exot\u00e9rmica<\/label>\r\n                            <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p1-tipo\" value=\"redox\"> Redox<\/label>\r\n                            <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p1-tipo\" value=\"sintesis\"> S\u00edntesis<\/label>\r\n                            <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p1-tipo\" value=\"endotermica\"> Endot\u00e9rmica<\/label>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <button class=\"cyber-btn btn-pequeno\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">Verificar Respuesta<\/button>\r\n                    <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucion-1\">\r\n                        <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> \r\n                        <p>a) 10g Mg \u2192 Moles Mg = 10\/24 = 0.4167 mol \u2192 Moles MgO = 0.4167 mol \u2192 Masa MgO = 0.4167 \u00d7 40 = 16.67g<\/p>\r\n                        <p>b) Es exot\u00e9rmica (libera calor), redox (Mg se oxida) y de s\u00edntesis (dos sustancias forman una).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PROBLEMA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Problema 2: Identificaci\u00f3n de Se\u00f1ales<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-puntos\">(2 puntos)<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-contenido\">\r\n                    <p>En un experimento se mezclan soluciones de nitrato de plata (AgNO\u2083) y cloruro de sodio (NaCl). Se observa inmediatamente la formaci\u00f3n de un s\u00f3lido blanco.<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"problema-ecuacion\">\r\n                        \\[ \\ce{AgNO3 + NaCl -> AgCl\u2193 + NaNO3} \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"problema-preguntas\">\r\n                        <p>Identifica todas las se\u00f1ales de cambio qu\u00edmico presentes:<\/p>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"opciones-senales\">\r\n                            <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p2-senales\" value=\"color\"> Cambio de color<\/label>\r\n                            <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p2-senales\" value=\"precipitado\"> Formaci\u00f3n de precipitado<\/label>\r\n                            <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p2-senales\" value=\"gas\"> Liberaci\u00f3n de gas<\/label>\r\n                            <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p2-senales\" value=\"calor\"> Cambio de temperatura<\/label>\r\n                            <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p2-senales\" value=\"olor\"> Cambio de olor<\/label>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <p>\u00bfQu\u00e9 nombre recibe el s\u00f3lido blanco formado?<\/p>\r\n                        <input type=\"text\" class=\"respuesta-corta\" placeholder=\"Escribe el nombre...\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <button class=\"cyber-btn btn-pequeno\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">Verificar Respuesta<\/button>\r\n                    <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucion-2\">\r\n                        <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> \r\n                        <p>Se\u00f1ales: Formaci\u00f3n de precipitado (AgCl s\u00f3lido). El s\u00f3lido blanco es cloruro de plata (AgCl).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- R\u00daBRICA -->\r\n            <div class=\"rubrica-evaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd0d R\u00fabrica de Evaluaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>Puntos<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Descripci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>3<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Excelente<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Desarrollo completo, c\u00e1lculos correctos, identificaci\u00f3n precisa<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>2<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Satisfactorio<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Conceptos correctos, alg\u00fan error menor en c\u00e1lculos<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>1<\/td>\r\n                            <td>B\u00e1sico<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Comprensi\u00f3n parcial, desarrollo incompleto<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>0<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Insuficiente<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Respuesta incorrecta o sin desarrollo<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 7: RECURSOS Y CIERRE -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-cyber\" id=\"cierre\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"seccion-icono\">\ud83d\udcbe<\/span> INTEGRACI\u00d3N Y RECURSOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <!-- AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc8 Auto-Evaluaci\u00f3n de Competencias<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"competencia-item\">\r\n                    <label>Identificaci\u00f3n de cambios qu\u00edmicos<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"competencia-nivel\">\r\n                        <span class=\"nivel-texto\">B\u00e1sico<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"nivel-botones\">\r\n                            <button class=\"nivel-btn\" data-nivel=\"1\">1<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"nivel-btn\" data-nivel=\"2\">2<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"nivel-btn active\" data-nivel=\"3\">3<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"nivel-btn\" data-nivel=\"4\">4<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"nivel-btn\" data-nivel=\"5\">5<\/button>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <span class=\"nivel-texto\">Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"competencia-item\">\r\n                    <label>Balanceo de ecuaciones<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"competencia-nivel\">\r\n                        <span class=\"nivel-texto\">B\u00e1sico<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"nivel-botones\">\r\n                            <button class=\"nivel-btn\" data-nivel=\"1\">1<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"nivel-btn\" data-nivel=\"2\">2<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"nivel-btn\" data-nivel=\"3\">3<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"nivel-btn\" data-nivel=\"4\">4<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"nivel-btn\" data-nivel=\"5\">5<\/button>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <span class=\"nivel-texto\">Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"cyber-btn\" onclick=\"generarReporte()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icono\">\ud83d\udccb<\/span> Generar Reporte de Aprendizaje\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- RECURSOS ADICIONALES -->\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcda Recursos Adicionales<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"recursos-lista\">\r\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        <span class=\"recurso-icono\">\ud83c\udfac<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"recurso-content\">\r\n                            <strong>Video: Se\u00f1ales de Cambio Qu\u00edmico<\/strong>\r\n                            <span>Demostraciones en laboratorio<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    \r\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        <span class=\"recurso-icono\">\ud83e\uddee<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"recurso-content\">\r\n                            <strong>Simulador PhET: Balanceo<\/strong>\r\n                            <span>Pr\u00e1ctica interactiva de ecuaciones<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    \r\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        <span class=\"recurso-icono\">\ud83d\udcd6<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"recurso-content\">\r\n                            <strong>PDF: Ejercicios Resueltos<\/strong>\r\n                            <span>50 problemas con soluciones paso a paso<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    \r\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        <span class=\"recurso-icono\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"recurso-content\">\r\n                            <strong>Laboratorio Virtual<\/strong>\r\n                            <span>Experimentos de qu\u00edmica en l\u00ednea<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"reflexion-final\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcad Reflexi\u00f3n Final<\/h4>\r\n                    <textarea id=\"reflexion-texto\" placeholder=\"\u00bfQu\u00e9 aprendiste sobre cambios qu\u00edmicos? \u00bfC\u00f3mo aplicas la conservaci\u00f3n de masa en la vida diaria?...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                    <button class=\"cyber-btn btn-secundario\" onclick=\"guardarReflexion()\">\r\n                        <span class=\"btn-icono\">\ud83d\udcbe<\/span> Guardar Reflexi\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PIE DE P\u00c1GINA -->\r\n    <footer class=\"cyber-footer\">\r\n        <div class=\"footer-content\">\r\n            <div class=\"footer-info\">\r\n                <div class=\"footer-logo\">\r\n                    <span class=\"logo-icono\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"logo-texto\">Sistema Cyber-Edu Qu\u00edmica<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"footer-version\">v2.1 | Actualizado: 2024<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"footer-progreso\">\r\n                <div class=\"progreso-total\">\r\n                    <div class=\"progreso-label\">Progreso Total:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"progreso-valor\" id=\"progreso-final\">0%<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"progreso-bar-total\">\r\n                    <div class=\"barra-total\" id=\"barra-progreso-total\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"footer-acciones\">\r\n                <button class=\"footer-btn\" onclick=\"imprimirLeccion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icono\">\ud83d\udda8\ufe0f<\/span> Imprimir\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"footer-btn\" onclick=\"exportarProgreso()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icono\">\ud83d\udcbe<\/span> Exportar\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"footer-btn\" onclick=\"compartirLeccion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icono\">\ud83d\udce4<\/span> Compartir\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"footer-creditos\">\r\n            <p>\u00a9 2024 Sistema Educativo Cyberpunk | Qu\u00edmica I - Cambios Qu\u00edmicos | Dise\u00f1ado con fines educativos<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/footer>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- SCRIPT JAVASCRIPT -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA CYBER-QU\u00cdMICA: L\u00d3GICA INTERACTIVA\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    console.log('[SISTEMA] Iniciando lecci\u00f3n Cyber-Qu\u00edmica');\r\n    console.log('[QU\u00cdMICA] Tema: Cambios Qu\u00edmicos y Reacciones');\r\n    \r\n    inicializarSimulador();\r\n    inicializarQuiz();\r\n    inicializarProblemas();\r\n    inicializarProgreso();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar MathJax si est\u00e1 disponible\r\n    if (window.MathJax) {\r\n        MathJax.typesetPromise();\r\n    }\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== SISTEMA DE PROGRESO ==========\r\nlet progresoTotal = 0;\r\nconst progresoMaximo = 100;\r\n\r\nfunction inicializarProgreso() {\r\n    \/\/ Observar scroll para marcar secciones como vistas\r\n    const secciones = document.querySelectorAll('.seccion-cyber');\r\n    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\r\n        entries.forEach(entry => {\r\n            if (entry.isIntersecting) {\r\n                const id = entry.target.id;\r\n                if (!localStorage.getItem(`visto_${id}`)) {\r\n                    localStorage.setItem(`visto_${id}`, 'true');\r\n                    actualizarProgreso(5); \/\/ 5% por secci\u00f3n vista\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    }, { threshold: 0.5 });\r\n    \r\n    secciones.forEach(seccion => observer.observe(seccion));\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Recuperar progreso guardado\r\n    const progresoGuardado = localStorage.getItem('progreso_quimica');\r\n    if (progresoGuardado) {\r\n        progresoTotal = parseInt(progresoGuardado);\r\n        actualizarDisplayProgreso();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarProgreso(puntos) {\r\n    progresoTotal = Math.min(progresoMaximo, progresoTotal + puntos);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar displays\r\n    document.getElementById('progreso-global').textContent = `${progresoTotal}%`;\r\n    document.getElementById('progreso-final').textContent = `${progresoTotal}%`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar barra de progreso\r\n    const barra = document.getElementById('barra-progreso-total');\r\n    if (barra) {\r\n        barra.style.width = `${progresoTotal}%`;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar barras de objetivos\r\n    actualizarProgresoObjetivos();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Guardar en localStorage\r\n    localStorage.setItem('progreso_quimica', progresoTotal);\r\n    \r\n    console.log(`[PROGRESO] Actualizado: ${progresoTotal}% (+${puntos})`);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarDisplayProgreso() {\r\n    const elementos = ['progreso-global', 'progreso-final'];\r\n    elementos.forEach(id => {\r\n        const elemento = document.getElementById(id);\r\n        if (elemento) {\r\n            elemento.textContent = `${progresoTotal}%`;\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    const barra = document.getElementById('barra-progreso-total');\r\n    if (barra) {\r\n        barra.style.width = `${progresoTotal}%`;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarProgresoObjetivos() {\r\n    const objetivos = document.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-progreso .progreso-bar');\r\n    objetivos.forEach((barra, index) => {\r\n        const progreso = Math.min(100, (progresoTotal \/ 4) + (index * 10));\r\n        barra.style.width = `${progreso}%`;\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== SIMULADOR ==========\r\nlet simuladorIntervalo = null;\r\nlet tiempoSimulacion = 0;\r\nlet simuladorActivo = false;\r\n\r\nfunction inicializarSimulador() {\r\n    \/\/ Configurar sliders\r\n    const sliderTemp = document.getElementById('temperatura-slider');\r\n    const sliderConc = document.getElementById('concentracion-slider');\r\n    \r\n    if (sliderTemp) {\r\n        sliderTemp.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n            document.getElementById('temp-valor').textContent = `${this.value}\u00b0C`;\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    if (sliderConc) {\r\n        sliderConc.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n            document.getElementById('conc-valor').textContent = `${this.value}%`;\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar botones de tipo\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tipo-btn').forEach(btn => {\r\n        btn.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            document.querySelectorAll('.tipo-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));\r\n            this.classList.add('active');\r\n            actualizarEcuacionSimulador();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar selector de reactivo\r\n    document.getElementById('reactivo-select').addEventListener('change', actualizarEcuacionSimulador);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction iniciarSimulacion() {\r\n    if (simuladorActivo) return;\r\n    \r\n    simuladorActivo = true;\r\n    tiempoSimulacion = 0;\r\n    \r\n    const reactivo = document.getElementById('reactivo-select').value;\r\n    const temperatura = document.getElementById('temperatura-slider').value;\r\n    const concentracion = document.getElementById('concentracion-slider').value;\r\n    const tipoBtn = document.querySelector('.tipo-btn.active');\r\n    const tipo = tipoBtn ? tipoBtn.dataset.tipo : 'combustion';\r\n    \r\n    console.log(`[SIMULADOR] Iniciando: ${reactivo}, ${temperatura}\u00b0C, ${concentracion}%, ${tipo}`);\r\n    agregarLogSimulador('Reacci\u00f3n iniciada');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n    actualizarVisualizacionSimulador(reactivo, tipo);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Iniciar intervalo de actualizaci\u00f3n\r\n    simuladorIntervalo = setInterval(() => {\r\n        if (!simuladorActivo) return;\r\n        \r\n        tiempoSimulacion++;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Calcular valores\r\n        const progreso = Math.min(100, tiempoSimulacion * 10);\r\n        const energia = Math.min(1000, tiempoSimulacion * 100);\r\n        const velocidad = Math.min(50, tiempoSimulacion * 2);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar displays\r\n        document.getElementById('tiempo-reaccion').textContent = `${tiempoSimulacion}s`;\r\n        document.getElementById('productos-formados').textContent = `${progreso}%`;\r\n        document.getElementById('energia-liberada').textContent = `${energia} kJ`;\r\n        document.getElementById('velocidad-reaccion').textContent = `${velocidad} M\/s`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar barras\r\n        document.getElementById('barra-productos').style.width = `${progreso}%`;\r\n        document.getElementById('barra-energia').style.width = `${energia \/ 10}%`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Agregar log peri\u00f3dico\r\n        if (tiempoSimulacion % 5 === 0) {\r\n            agregarLogSimulador(`Progreso: ${progreso}% - Energ\u00eda: ${energia} kJ`);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Finalizar simulaci\u00f3n\r\n        if (tiempoSimulacion >= 10) {\r\n            pausarSimulacion();\r\n            agregarLogSimulador('Reacci\u00f3n completada');\r\n            actualizarProgreso(10); \/\/ 10% por completar simulador\r\n        }\r\n    }, 500);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction pausarSimulacion() {\r\n    simuladorActivo = false;\r\n    if (simuladorIntervalo) {\r\n        clearInterval(simuladorIntervalo);\r\n        simuladorIntervalo = null;\r\n    }\r\n    agregarLogSimulador('Reacci\u00f3n pausada');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarSimulacion() {\r\n    pausarSimulacion();\r\n    tiempoSimulacion = 0;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Resetear valores\r\n    document.getElementById('tiempo-reaccion').textContent = '0s';\r\n    document.getElementById('productos-formados').textContent = '0%';\r\n    document.getElementById('energia-liberada').textContent = '0 kJ';\r\n    document.getElementById('velocidad-reaccion').textContent = '0 M\/s';\r\n    document.getElementById('barra-productos').style.width = '0%';\r\n    document.getElementById('barra-energia').style.width = '0%';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Resetear visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('reaction-viz').innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"reaction-placeholder\">\r\n            <div class=\"placeholder-text\">\r\n                <span class=\"placeholder-icono\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                <p>Sistema reiniciado. Listo para nueva simulaci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    agregarLogSimulador('Sistema reiniciado');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarEcuacionSimulador() {\r\n    const reactivo = document.getElementById('reactivo-select').value;\r\n    const tipoBtn = document.querySelector('.tipo-btn.active');\r\n    const tipo = tipoBtn ? tipoBtn.dataset.tipo : 'combustion';\r\n    \r\n    let ecuacion = '';\r\n    let descripcion = '';\r\n    \r\n    switch(reactivo) {\r\n        case 'metano':\r\n            ecuacion = '\\\\[ \\\\ce{CH4 + 2O2 -> CO2 + 2H2O} \\\\]';\r\n            descripcion = 'Combusti\u00f3n - Exot\u00e9rmica';\r\n            break;\r\n        case 'hidrogeno':\r\n            ecuacion = '\\\\[ \\\\ce{2H2 + O2 -> 2H2O} \\\\]';\r\n            descripcion = 'S\u00edntesis - Exot\u00e9rmica';\r\n            break;\r\n        case 'magnesio':\r\n            ecuacion = '\\\\[ \\\\ce{2Mg + O2 -> 2MgO} \\\\]';\r\n            descripcion = 'Oxidaci\u00f3n - Exot\u00e9rmica';\r\n            break;\r\n        case 'acido':\r\n            ecuacion = '\\\\[ \\\\ce{HCl + NaOH -> NaCl + H2O} \\\\]';\r\n            descripcion = 'Neutralizaci\u00f3n - Exot\u00e9rmica';\r\n            break;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('ecuacion-actual').innerHTML = ecuacion;\r\n    document.getElementById('reaction-tipo').textContent = descripcion;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Reprocesar MathJax\r\n    if (window.MathJax) {\r\n        MathJax.typesetPromise([document.getElementById('ecuacion-actual')]);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarVisualizacionSimulador(reactivo, tipo) {\r\n    const container = document.getElementById('reaction-viz');\r\n    let svg = '';\r\n    \r\n    switch(tipo) {\r\n        case 'combustion':\r\n            svg = `\r\n                <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"180\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 180\">\r\n                    <rect width=\"300\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#0A0A1A\"\/>\r\n                    <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"90\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#FF4444\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"30;35;30\" dur=\"1.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"100\" y=\"95\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\">CH\u2084<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"90\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#4444FF\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"30;35;30\" dur=\"1.5s\" begin=\"0.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"200\" y=\"95\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\">O\u2082<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <path d=\"M130,90 L170,90\" stroke=\"#FFFF00\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"0;40\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                    <\/path>\r\n                    \r\n                    <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"90\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#44FF44\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" dur=\"1s\" begin=\"0.5s\" fill=\"freeze\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"250\" y=\"95\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\">CO\u2082<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <defs>\r\n                        <marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                            <polygon points=\"0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7\" fill=\"#FFFF00\"\/>\r\n                        <\/marker>\r\n                    <\/defs>\r\n                    \r\n                    <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"50\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#FFAA00\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"50;30;50\" dur=\"1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.5;1\" dur=\"1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            `;\r\n            break;\r\n        default:\r\n            svg = `\r\n                <div class=\"reaction-placeholder\">\r\n                    <div class=\"placeholder-text\">\r\n                        <span class=\"placeholder-icono\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                        <p>Reacci\u00f3n en progreso...<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            `;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    container.innerHTML = svg;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction agregarLogSimulador(mensaje) {\r\n    const log = document.getElementById('log-contenido');\r\n    if (!log) return;\r\n    \r\n    const entrada = document.createElement('div');\r\n    entrada.className = 'log-entrada';\r\n    entrada.textContent = `[${new Date().toLocaleTimeString().slice(0, 5)}] ${mensaje}`;\r\n    log.appendChild(entrada);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Limitar a 10 entradas\r\n    while (log.children.length > 10) {\r\n        log.removeChild(log.firstChild);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Auto-scroll al final\r\n    log.scrollTop = log.scrollHeight;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== QUIZ ==========\r\nlet respuestasCorrectas = 0;\r\nlet tiempoInicioQuiz = null;\r\n\r\nfunction inicializarQuiz() {\r\n    \/\/ Configurar eventos de opciones\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.opcion').forEach(opcion => {\r\n        opcion.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const pregunta = this.closest('.quiz-pregunta');\r\n            const opcionSeleccionada = this.dataset.opcion;\r\n            const respuestaCorrecta = pregunta.dataset.correcta;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Deshabilitar todas las opciones de esta pregunta\r\n            pregunta.querySelectorAll('.opcion').forEach(o => {\r\n                o.style.pointerEvents = 'none';\r\n                if (o.dataset.opcion === respuestaCorrecta) {\r\n                    o.style.borderColor = 'var(--neon-concepto)';\r\n                    o.style.background = 'rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.1)';\r\n                } else if (o.dataset.opcion === opcionSeleccionada && opcionSeleccionada !== respuestaCorrecta) {\r\n                    o.style.borderColor = 'var(--neon-evaluacion)';\r\n                    o.style.background = 'rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.1)';\r\n                }\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            const feedback = pregunta.querySelector('.pregunta-feedback');\r\n            if (feedback) {\r\n                if (opcionSeleccionada === respuestaCorrecta) {\r\n                    respuestasCorrectas++;\r\n                    feedback.querySelector('.feedback-correcto').style.display = 'block';\r\n                    feedback.querySelector('.feedback-incorrecto').style.display = 'none';\r\n                } else {\r\n                    feedback.querySelector('.feedback-correcto').style.display = 'none';\r\n                    feedback.querySelector('.feedback-incorrecto').style.display = 'block';\r\n                }\r\n                feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            verificarCompletacionQuiz();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Iniciar timer del quiz\r\n    tiempoInicioQuiz = new Date();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction verificarCompletacionQuiz() {\r\n    const preguntas = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-pregunta');\r\n    const todasRespondidas = Array.from(preguntas).every(p => {\r\n        return Array.from(p.querySelectorAll('.opcion')).some(o => o.style.pointerEvents === 'none');\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    if (todasRespondidas) {\r\n        mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const tiempoFin = new Date();\r\n    const tiempoTranscurrido = Math.round((tiempoFin - tiempoInicioQuiz) \/ 1000);\r\n    \r\n    const puntaje = (respuestasCorrectas \/ 5) * 100;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar displays\r\n    document.getElementById('puntaje-porcentaje').textContent = `${puntaje}%`;\r\n    document.getElementById('correctas-contador').textContent = `${respuestasCorrectas}\/5`;\r\n    document.getElementById('tiempo-quiz').textContent = `${tiempoTranscurrido}s`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar nivel\r\n    let nivel = '';\r\n    if (puntaje >= 90) nivel = 'Excelente';\r\n    else if (puntaje >= 70) nivel = 'Bueno';\r\n    else if (puntaje >= 50) nivel = 'Regular';\r\n    else nivel = 'Necesita mejorar';\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('nivel-quiz').textContent = nivel;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar feedback\r\n    let feedback = '';\r\n    if (puntaje >= 90) feedback = '\ud83c\udfc6 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas completamente los conceptos de cambios qu\u00edmicos.';\r\n    else if (puntaje >= 70) feedback = '\u2705 Buen trabajo. Tienes una comprensi\u00f3n s\u00f3lida de los conceptos principales.';\r\n    else if (puntaje >= 50) feedback = '\u26a0\ufe0f Regular. Revisa las se\u00f1ales de cambio qu\u00edmico y el balanceo de ecuaciones.';\r\n    else feedback = '\ud83d\udcda Necesitas estudiar m\u00e1s. Revisa los conceptos fundamentales y practica con ejercicios.';\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('resultado-feedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar c\u00edrculo de progreso\r\n    const circulo = document.getElementById('circular-progreso');\r\n    circulo.style.background = `conic-gradient(var(--neon-concepto) ${puntaje}%, #333 ${puntaje}% 100%)`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar resultados\r\n    document.getElementById('quiz-resultados').style.display = 'block';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar progreso general\r\n    actualizarProgreso(puntaje \/ 5); \/\/ 1% por cada 5 puntos del quiz\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    \/\/ Resetear estado\r\n    respuestasCorrectas = 0;\r\n    tiempoInicioQuiz = new Date();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Resetear preguntas\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-pregunta').forEach(pregunta => {\r\n        pregunta.querySelectorAll('.opcion').forEach(opcion => {\r\n            opcion.style.pointerEvents = 'auto';\r\n            opcion.style.borderColor = '';\r\n            opcion.style.background = '';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        const feedback = pregunta.querySelector('.pregunta-feedback');\r\n        if (feedback) {\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'none';\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n    document.getElementById('quiz-resultados').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== PROBLEMAS ==========\r\nfunction inicializarProblemas() {\r\n    \/\/ Configurar botones de verificaci\u00f3n\r\n    window.verificarProblema = function(numero) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion-${numero}`);\r\n        if (solucion) {\r\n            solucion.style.display = 'block';\r\n            actualizarProgreso(5); \/\/ 5% por verificar un problema\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N ==========\r\nfunction generarReporte() {\r\n    const nivel1 = document.querySelector('.competencia-item:nth-child(1) .nivel-btn.active');\r\n    const nivel2 = document.querySelector('.competencia-item:nth-child(2) .nivel-btn.active');\r\n    \r\n    const valor1 = nivel1 ? nivel1.dataset.nivel : '3';\r\n    const valor2 = nivel2 ? nivel2.dataset.nivel : '3';\r\n    \r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(valor1) + parseInt(valor2)) \/ 2;\r\n    \r\n    let recomendacion = '';\r\n    if (promedio >= 4) {\r\n        recomendacion = 'Excelente dominio. Contin\u00faa con temas avanzados de cin\u00e9tica qu\u00edmica.';\r\n    } else if (promedio >= 3) {\r\n        recomendacion = 'Buen nivel. Practica m\u00e1s ejercicios de balanceo y aplicaci\u00f3n.';\r\n    } else {\r\n        recomendacion = 'Necesitas repasar los conceptos fundamentales. Revisa las se\u00f1ales y ejemplos.';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    const reporte = `\r\nREPORTE DE APRENDIZAJE - CAMBIOS QU\u00cdMICOS\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcca Auto-evaluaci\u00f3n:\r\n\u2022 Identificaci\u00f3n de cambios: ${valor1}\/5\r\n\u2022 Balanceo de ecuaciones: ${valor2}\/5\r\n\u2022 Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Recomendaciones:\r\n${recomendacion}\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc8 Progreso total: ${progresoTotal}%\r\n\r\n\u23f0 Generado: ${new Date().toLocaleString()}\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    alert('REPORTE GENERADO\\n\\n' + reporte);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Guardar en localStorage\r\n    localStorage.setItem('reporte_quimica', JSON.stringify({\r\n        fecha: new Date().toISOString(),\r\n        niveles: { identificacion: valor1, balanceo: valor2 },\r\n        progreso: progresoTotal\r\n    }));\r\n    \r\n    actualizarProgreso(5); \/\/ 5% por generar reporte\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction guardarReflexion() {\r\n    const texto = document.getElementById('reflexion-texto').value;\r\n    if (texto.trim().length > 10) {\r\n        localStorage.setItem('reflexion_quimica', texto);\r\n        alert('\u2705 Reflexi\u00f3n guardada exitosamente');\r\n        actualizarProgreso(3); \/\/ 3% por guardar reflexi\u00f3n\r\n    } else {\r\n        alert('\u26a0\ufe0f Escribe al menos 10 caracteres para guardar tu reflexi\u00f3n');\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== FUNCIONES DEL FOOTER ==========\r\nfunction imprimirLeccion() {\r\n    window.print();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction exportarProgreso() {\r\n    const datos = {\r\n        progreso: progresoTotal,\r\n        fecha: new Date().toISOString(),\r\n        materia: 'Qu\u00edmica I - Cambios Qu\u00edmicos'\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    const blob = new Blob([JSON.stringify(datos, null, 2)], { type: 'application\/json' });\r\n    const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\r\n    \r\n    const a = document.createElement('a');\r\n    a.href = url;\r\n    a.download = `progreso-quimica-${new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}.json`;\r\n    document.body.appendChild(a);\r\n    a.click();\r\n    document.body.removeChild(a);\r\n    URL.revokeObjectURL(url);\r\n    \r\n    alert('\ud83d\udce5 Progreso exportado como archivo JSON');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction compartirLeccion() {\r\n    const texto = `He completado el ${progresoTotal}% de la lecci\u00f3n \"Cambios Qu\u00edmicos\" en el Sistema Cyber-Edu Qu\u00edmica. \u2697\ufe0f`;\r\n    \r\n    if (navigator.share) {\r\n        navigator.share({\r\n            title: 'Progreso en Cambios Qu\u00edmicos',\r\n            text: texto,\r\n            url: window.location.href\r\n        });\r\n    } else {\r\n        \/\/ Copiar al portapapeles como fallback\r\n        navigator.clipboard.writeText(texto).then(() => {\r\n            alert('\u2705 Texto copiado al portapapeles. Puedes compartirlo en tus redes sociales.');\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== GLITCH EFFECT ==========\r\nconst glitchElements = document.querySelectorAll('.cyber-glitch');\r\nglitchElements.forEach(element => {\r\n    setInterval(() => {\r\n        if (Math.random() > 0.7) {\r\n            element.style.transform = `translate(${Math.random() * 4 - 2}px, ${Math.random() * 4 - 2}px)`;\r\n            element.style.opacity = 0.8 + Math.random() * 0.2;\r\n        } else {\r\n            element.style.transform = 'translate(0, 0)';\r\n            element.style.opacity = '1';\r\n        }\r\n    }, 100);\r\n});\r\n\r\nconsole.log('[SISTEMA] Configuraci\u00f3n completada. Sistema listo para interacci\u00f3n.');\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Se\u00f1al cambio qu\u00edmico","respuesta":"Gas, precipitado, calor"},{"enunciado":"Ejemplo cambio qu\u00edmico","respuesta":"Combusti\u00f3n, oxidaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Diferencia con f\u00edsico","respuesta":"Cambia composici\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Reacci\u00f3n exot\u00e9rmica","respuesta":"Combusti\u00f3n metano"},{"enunciado":"Endot\u00e9rmica","respuesta":"Fotos\u00edntesis"},{"enunciado":"Balancea: H\u2082 + O\u2082 \u2192 H\u2082O","respuesta":"2H\u2082 + O\u2082 \u2192 2H\u2082O"},{"enunciado":"Ley conservaci\u00f3n masa","respuesta":"Lavoisier"},{"enunciado":"Ecuaci\u00f3n herrumbre","respuesta":"4Fe + 3O\u2082 \u2192 2Fe\u2082O\u2083"},{"enunciado":"Precipitado ejemplo","respuesta":"AgCl (blanco)"},{"enunciado":"\u0394H < 0 significa","respuesta":"Exot\u00e9rmica"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC: combusti\u00f3n completa","respuesta":"CO\u2082 + H\u2082O"},{"enunciado":"NIST: \u0394H combusti\u00f3n CH\u2084","respuesta":"-890.3 kJ\/mol"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Cambios qu\u00edmicos forman...","opciones":["Nuevas sustancias","Igual","Forma","Color"],"correcta":"Nuevas sustancias"},{"pregunta":"Se\u00f1al com\u00fan","opciones":["Gas liberado","Fusi\u00f3n","Corte","Evaporaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Gas liberado"},{"pregunta":"Ejemplo","opciones":["Quema madera","Hielo derrite","Agua hierve","Papel corta"],"correcta":"Quema madera"},{"pregunta":"Reversible?","opciones":["General no","S\u00ed","Siempre","Nunca"],"correcta":"General no"},{"pregunta":"Combusti\u00f3n es...","opciones":["Exot\u00e9rmica","Endot\u00e9rmica","F\u00edsica","Nuclear"],"correcta":"Exot\u00e9rmica"},{"pregunta":"Fotos\u00edntesis es...","opciones":["Endot\u00e9rmica","Exot\u00e9rmica","F\u00edsica","Nuclear"],"correcta":"Endot\u00e9rmica"},{"pregunta":"Herrumbre es...","opciones":["Cambio qu\u00edmico","F\u00edsico","Nuclear","Nada"],"correcta":"Cambio qu\u00edmico"},{"pregunta":"Precipitado es...","opciones":["S\u00f3lido insoluble","L\u00edquido","Gas","Plasma"],"correcta":"S\u00f3lido insoluble"},{"pregunta":"Conservaci\u00f3n masa por...","opciones":["Lavoisier","Dalton","Boyle","Avogadro"],"correcta":"Lavoisier"},{"pregunta":"Ecuaci\u00f3n balanceada tiene...","opciones":["Igual # \u00e1tomos","M\u00e1s reactivos","Menos productos","Nada"],"correcta":"Igual # \u00e1tomos"},{"pregunta":"Reacci\u00f3n: 2H\u2082 + O\u2082 \u2192","opciones":["2H\u2082O","H\u2082O","H\u2084O\u2082","HO"],"correcta":"2H\u2082O"},{"pregunta":"Gas en CaCO\u2083 + HCl","opciones":["CO\u2082","H\u2082","O\u2082","N\u2082"],"correcta":"CO\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Color en Cu + HNO\u2083","opciones":["Verde \u2192 azul","Rojo","Blanco","Negro"],"correcta":"Verde \u2192 azul"},{"pregunta":"\u0394H < 0 es...","opciones":["Exot\u00e9rmica","Endot\u00e9rmica","Isot\u00e9rmica","Adiab\u00e1tica"],"correcta":"Exot\u00e9rmica"},{"pregunta":"Neutralizaci\u00f3n es...","opciones":["\u00c1cido + base","Metal + no metal","Combusti\u00f3n","Fusi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"\u00c1cido + base"},{"pregunta":"Redox involucra...","opciones":["e\u207b","H\u207a","OH\u207b","Calor"],"correcta":"e\u207b"},{"pregunta":"Masa reactivos =","opciones":["Masa productos","Volumen","Temperatura","Color"],"correcta":"Masa productos"},{"pregunta":"Fermentaci\u00f3n produce...","opciones":["CO\u2082 + etanol","O\u2082","H\u2082O","CH\u2084"],"correcta":"CO\u2082 + etanol"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC: estado gas","opciones":["(g)","(s)","(l)","(aq)"],"correcta":"(g)"},{"pregunta":"Reacci\u00f3n reversible usa...","opciones":["\u21cc","\u2192","=","\u2261"],"correcta":"\u21cc"},{"pregunta":"Balancea: Fe + O\u2082 \u2192 Fe\u2082O\u2083","opciones":["4Fe + 3O\u2082 \u2192 2Fe\u2082O\u2083","Fe + O\u2082 \u2192 Fe\u2082O\u2083","2Fe + O\u2082 \u2192 Fe\u2082O\u2083","Fe + 3O\u2082 \u2192 Fe\u2082O\u2083"],"correcta":"4Fe + 3O\u2082 \u2192 2Fe\u2082O\u2083"},{"pregunta":"\u0394H combusti\u00f3n CH\u2084 (NIST)","opciones":["-890.3 kJ\/mol","-393.5 kJ\/mol","-285.8 kJ\/mol","0 kJ\/mol"],"correcta":"-890.3 kJ\/mol"},{"pregunta":"Reacci\u00f3n fotos\u00edntesis","opciones":["6CO\u2082 + 6H\u2082O \u2192 C\u2086H\u2081\u2082O\u2086 + 6O\u2082","C\u2086H\u2081\u2082O\u2086 \u2192 CO\u2082 + H\u2082O","CO\u2082 \u2192 C + O\u2082","H\u2082O \u2192 H\u2082 + O\u2082"],"correcta":"6CO\u2082 + 6H\u2082O \u2192 C\u2086H\u2081\u2082O\u2086 + 6O\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Cin\u00e9tica estudia...","opciones":["Velocidad reacci\u00f3n","Equilibrio","Masa","Volumen"],"correcta":"Velocidad reacci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Catalizador...","opciones":["Aumenta velocidad","Cambia \u0394H","Se consume","Detiene reacci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Aumenta velocidad"},{"pregunta":"Reacci\u00f3n espont\u00e1nea si...","opciones":["\u0394G < 0","\u0394H < 0","\u0394S > 0","T > 0"],"correcta":"\u0394G < 0"},{"pregunta":"Equilibrio din\u00e1mico significa...","opciones":["Velocidades iguales","Reacci\u00f3n parada","Sin productos","Sin reactivos"],"correcta":"Velocidades iguales"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC: combusti\u00f3n incompleta","opciones":["CO + H\u2082O","CO\u2082 + H\u2082O","C + O\u2082","CH\u2084 + O\u2082"],"correcta":"CO + H\u2082O"},{"pregunta":"Termoqu\u00edmica mide...","opciones":["\u0394H","\u0394S","\u0394G","Todas"],"correcta":"Todas"},{"pregunta":"Reacci\u00f3n nuclear vs qu\u00edmica","opciones":["N\u00facleo vs electrones","Igual","Solo masa","Solo energ\u00eda"],"correcta":"N\u00facleo vs electrones"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"propiedades-fisicas-materia","titulo":"PROPIEDADES F\u00cdSICAS: Sistema de An\u00e1lisis Molecular Cyber-Edu","contenido":"<!-- LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK QU\u00cdMICA - PROPIEDADES F\u00cdSICAS -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-cyber quimica-propiedades\" data-tema=\"propiedades-fisicas\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CON GLITCH EFFECT -->\r\n    <header class=\"cyber-header\">\r\n        <div class=\"header-content\">\r\n            <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion\">\r\n                <span class=\"cyber-glitch\" data-text=\"\ud83d\udcca PROPIEDADES F\u00cdSICAS\">\ud83d\udcca PROPIEDADES F\u00cdSICAS<\/span>\r\n            <\/h1>\r\n            <p class=\"subtitulo-neon\">Sistema de an\u00e1lisis molecular | El ADN invisible de la materia<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"header-badges\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge neon-concepto\">Qu\u00edmica I<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge neon-interactivo\">An\u00e1lisis<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge neon-dato\">NIST 2025<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL DE ESTADO DEL SISTEMA -->\r\n    <div class=\"cyber-panel estado-sistema\">\r\n        <div class=\"panel-header\">\r\n            <h2><span class=\"icono\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/span> SISTEMA DE AN\u00c1LISIS F\u00cdSICO<\/h2>\r\n            <div class=\"panel-status\">\r\n                <span class=\"status-indicator active\"><\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"status-text\">AN\u00c1LISIS ACTIVO<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"panel-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"panel-item\">\r\n                <div class=\"item-label\">Nivel<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"item-value\">Secundaria \/ Bachillerato<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"panel-item\">\r\n                <div class=\"item-label\">Precisi\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"item-value\">NIST 2025<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"panel-item\">\r\n                <div class=\"item-label\">Propiedades<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"item-value\">12 categor\u00edas<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"panel-item\">\r\n                <div class=\"item-label\">Progreso<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"item-value\" id=\"progreso-global\">0%<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-cyber\" id=\"objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"seccion-icono\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE AN\u00c1LISIS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-objetivo=\"1\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-icono\">\ud83d\udd0d<\/div>\r\n                <h3>Identificaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Diferenciar propiedades intensivas y extensivas con precisi\u00f3n experimental.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-progreso\">\r\n                    <div class=\"progreso-bar\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-objetivo=\"2\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-icono\">\ud83d\udcc8<\/div>\r\n                <h3>Clasificaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Categorizar propiedades f\u00edsicas por tipo, unidad y m\u00e9todo de medici\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-progreso\">\r\n                    <div class=\"progreso-bar\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-objetivo=\"3\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-icono\">\ud83c\udf21\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                <h3>Transiciones<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Analizar cambios de estado y sus energ\u00edas asociadas (calor latente).<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-progreso\">\r\n                    <div class=\"progreso-bar\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-objetivo=\"4\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-icono\">\u26a1<\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Aplicar datos NIST 2025 para resolver problemas de identificaci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-progreso\">\r\n                    <div class=\"progreso-bar\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 1: CONCEPTOS FUNDAMENTALES -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-cyber\" id=\"conceptos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"seccion-icono\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"conceptos-container\">\r\n            <!-- DEFINICI\u00d3N PRINCIPAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"concepto-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"concepto-header\">\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 son las Propiedades F\u00edsicas?<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"concepto-tag\">DEFINICI\u00d3N CLAVE<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"concepto-content\">\r\n                    <p>Las <strong class=\"resaltado-neon\">propiedades f\u00edsicas<\/strong> son caracter\u00edsticas medibles de la materia que <strong>no alteran su composici\u00f3n qu\u00edmica interna<\/strong>. Se determinan mediante observaci\u00f3n o medici\u00f3n sin cambiar la identidad de la sustancia.<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"concepto-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"ejemplo-icono\">\ud83d\udca1<\/span>\r\n                            <strong>Ejemplo Representativo:<\/strong>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <p>Medir el punto de ebullici\u00f3n del agua: H\u2082O l\u00edquida (100\u00b0C) \u2192 H\u2082O gaseosa (vapor). La mol\u00e9cula de agua sigue siendo H\u2082O antes y despu\u00e9s.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-formula\">\r\n                            \\[ \\text{H\u2082O(l)} \\xrightarrow{\\text{100\u00b0C}} \\text{H\u2082O(g)} \\]\r\n                            <span class=\"formula-desc\">Cambio f\u00edsico: misma composici\u00f3n qu\u00edmica<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- DIFERENCIAS INTENSIVAS\/EXTENSIVAS -->\r\n            <div class=\"diferencias-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"diferencia-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"diferencia-header diferencia-intensiva\">\r\n                        <h4>Propiedades INTENSIVAS<\/h4>\r\n                        <span class=\"diferencia-tag\">No dependen de la cantidad<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"diferencia-content\">\r\n                        <ul class=\"diferencia-lista\">\r\n                            <li>\u2705 <strong>Independientes<\/strong> de la masa o volumen<\/li>\r\n                            <li>\u2705 <strong>Identifican<\/strong> la sustancia<\/li>\r\n                            <li>\u2705 <strong>Constantes<\/strong> para sustancia pura<\/li>\r\n                            <li>\u2705 Ejemplos: densidad, punto de fusi\u00f3n, color<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                        <div class=\"diferencia-formula\">\r\n                            \\[ \\rho = \\frac{m}{V} \\quad \\text{(densidad)} \\]\r\n                            <div class=\"formula-nota\">Para agua: siempre 1 g\/cm\u00b3 a 4\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"diferencia-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"diferencia-header diferencia-extensiva\">\r\n                        <h4>Propiedades EXTENSIVAS<\/h4>\r\n                        <span class=\"diferencia-tag\">Dependen de la cantidad<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"diferencia-content\">\r\n                        <ul class=\"diferencia-lista\">\r\n                            <li>\ud83d\udccf <strong>Dependen<\/strong> de la masa o volumen<\/li>\r\n                            <li>\ud83d\udccf <strong>No identifican<\/strong> la sustancia<\/li>\r\n                            <li>\ud83d\udccf <strong>Variables<\/strong> con la cantidad<\/li>\r\n                            <li>\ud83d\udccf Ejemplos: masa, volumen, energ\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                        <div class=\"diferencia-formula\">\r\n                            \\[ m = \\rho \\times V \\quad \\text{(masa)} \\]\r\n                            <div class=\"formula-nota\">Var\u00eda con el volumen de muestra<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- REGLA DE DETECCI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"regla-deteccion\">\r\n                <div class=\"regla-header\">\r\n                    <h3>\ud83d\udd0d Regla de Detecci\u00f3n R\u00e1pida<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"regla-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"regla-pasos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"paso\">\r\n                            <div class=\"paso-numero\">1<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"paso-texto\">\u00bfCambia si divides la muestra por la mitad?<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"paso-respuesta\">S\u00cd \u2192 Extensiva<br>NO \u2192 Intensiva<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"paso\">\r\n                            <div class=\"paso-numero\">2<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"paso-texto\">\u00bfPermite identificar la sustancia?<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"paso-respuesta\">S\u00cd \u2192 Intensiva<br>NO \u2192 Extensiva<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"regla-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplo aplicado:<\/strong> 100 mL de agua<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-comparacion\">\r\n                            <div class=\"comparacion-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"propiedad\">Densidad<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor\">1 g\/cm\u00b3<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"tipo intensivo\">INTENSIVA<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"comparacion-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"propiedad\">Masa<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor\">100 g<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"tipo extensivo\">EXTENSIVA<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 2: CATALOGO DE PROPIEDADES -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-cyber\" id=\"catalogo\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"seccion-icono\">\ud83d\udccb<\/span> CAT\u00c1LOGO DE PROPIEDADES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <p class=\"seccion-descripcion\">Base de datos NIST 2025 - Propiedades f\u00edsicas est\u00e1ndar<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"catalogo-filtros\">\r\n            <div class=\"filtro-grupo\">\r\n                <label>Tipo de Propiedad:<\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"filtro-botones\">\r\n                    <button class=\"filtro-btn active\" data-tipo=\"todas\">Todas<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"filtro-btn\" data-tipo=\"intensiva\">Intensivas<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"filtro-btn\" data-tipo=\"extensiva\">Extensivas<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"filtro-btn\" data-tipo=\"termica\">T\u00e9rmicas<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"filtro-btn\" data-tipo=\"electrica\">El\u00e9ctricas<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"filtro-grupo\">\r\n                <label>Ordenar por:<\/label>\r\n                <select class=\"cyber-select\" id=\"ordenar-propiedades\">\r\n                    <option value=\"nombre\">Nombre (A-Z)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"tipo\">Tipo<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"unidad\">Unidad<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"importancia\">Importancia<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"propiedades-grid\" id=\"propiedades-grid\">\r\n            <!-- Propiedad 1: Densidad -->\r\n            <div class=\"propiedad-card\" data-tipo=\"intensiva\" data-categoria=\"general\">\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-icono\" style=\"color: #39ff14;\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h3>Densidad (\u03c1)<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"propiedad-tag intensiva\">INTENSIVA<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-content\">\r\n                    <p class=\"propiedad-def\">Masa por unidad de volumen. Fundamental para identificaci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">F\u00f3rmula:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">\\[ \\rho = \\frac{m}{V} \\]<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">Unidad SI:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">kg\/m\u00b3<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">Com\u00fan:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">g\/cm\u00b3<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Valores referencia (25\u00b0C):<\/strong>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplos-lista\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"sustancia\">Agua<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor\">0.997 g\/cm\u00b3<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"sustancia\">Hierro<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor\">7.87 g\/cm\u00b3<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"sustancia\">Aire<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor\">0.0012 g\/cm\u00b3<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-aplicacion\">\r\n                        <strong>Aplicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Identificaci\u00f3n de metales, control de calidad.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Propiedad 2: Punto de Fusi\u00f3n -->\r\n            <div class=\"propiedad-card\" data-tipo=\"intensiva\" data-categoria=\"termica\">\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-icono\" style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">\u2744\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h3>Punto de Fusi\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"propiedad-tag intensiva\">INTENSIVA<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-content\">\r\n                    <p class=\"propiedad-def\">Temperatura a la que s\u00f3lido y l\u00edquido coexisten en equilibrio.<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">S\u00edmbolo:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">T<sub>f<\/sub><\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">Unidad:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">\u00b0C, K<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">Precisi\u00f3n NIST:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">\u00b10.001\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Valores NIST 2025:<\/strong>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplos-lista\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"sustancia\">Agua (H\u2082O)<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor\">0.000\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"sustancia\">Etanol<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor\">-114.1\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"sustancia\">Mercurio<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor\">-38.83\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-aplicacion\">\r\n                        <strong>Aplicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Pureza de sustancias, dise\u00f1o de materiales.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Propiedad 3: Conductividad El\u00e9ctrica -->\r\n            <div class=\"propiedad-card\" data-tipo=\"intensiva\" data-categoria=\"electrica\">\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-icono\" style=\"color: #00ffff;\">\u26a1<\/div>\r\n                    <h3>Conductividad El\u00e9ctrica<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"propiedad-tag intensiva\">INTENSIVA<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-content\">\r\n                    <p class=\"propiedad-def\">Capacidad de conducir corriente el\u00e9ctrica.<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">S\u00edmbolo:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">\u03c3<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">Unidad SI:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">S\/m (Siemens\/metro)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">Rango t\u00edpico:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">10\u207b\u00b9\u2078 a 10\u2078 S\/m<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Clasificaci\u00f3n por \u03c3:<\/strong>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplos-lista\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-item conductor\">\r\n                                <span class=\"sustancia\">Cobre (Cu)<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor\">5.96\u00d710\u2077 S\/m<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-item semiconductor\">\r\n                                <span class=\"sustancia\">Silicio (Si)<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor\">1\u00d710\u207b\u00b3 S\/m<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-item aislante\">\r\n                                <span class=\"sustancia\">Vidrio<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor\">10\u207b\u00b9\u00b2 S\/m<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-aplicacion\">\r\n                        <strong>Aplicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Electr\u00f3nica, selecci\u00f3n de materiales.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Propiedad 4: Solubilidad -->\r\n            <div class=\"propiedad-card\" data-tipo=\"intensiva\" data-categoria=\"general\">\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-icono\" style=\"color: #ffff00;\">\ud83e\uddea<\/div>\r\n                    <h3>Solubilidad<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"propiedad-tag intensiva\">INTENSIVA<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-content\">\r\n                    <p class=\"propiedad-def\">Cantidad m\u00e1xima de soluto que se disuelve en disolvente.<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">Expresi\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">\\[ S = \\frac{m_{\\text{soluto}}}{V_{\\text{disolvente}}} \\]<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">Unidad com\u00fan:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">g\/100 mL<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">Dependencia:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">Temperatura<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>En agua a 20\u00b0C:<\/strong>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplos-lista\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-item soluble\">\r\n                                <span class=\"sustancia\">NaCl<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor\">36.0 g\/100 mL<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-item poco-soluble\">\r\n                                <span class=\"sustancia\">Ca(OH)\u2082<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor\">0.173 g\/100 mL<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-item insoluble\">\r\n                                <span class=\"sustancia\">AgCl<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor\">1.9\u00d710\u207b\u2074 g\/100 mL<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-aplicacion\">\r\n                        <strong>Aplicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Farmacia, preparaci\u00f3n de soluciones.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Propiedad 5: Masa -->\r\n            <div class=\"propiedad-card\" data-tipo=\"extensiva\" data-categoria=\"general\">\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-icono\" style=\"color: #ff6b6b;\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h3>Masa<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"propiedad-tag extensiva\">EXTENSIVA<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-content\">\r\n                    <p class=\"propiedad-def\">Cantidad de materia en un objeto.<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">S\u00edmbolo:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">m<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">Unidad SI:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">kg (kilogramo)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">Conversi\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">1 kg = 1000 g<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-relacion\">\r\n                        <strong>Relaci\u00f3n con densidad:<\/strong>\r\n                        <div class=\"relacion-formula\">\r\n                            \\[ m = \\rho \\times V \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-aplicacion\">\r\n                        <strong>Aplicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> C\u00e1lculos estequiom\u00e9tricos, formulaci\u00f3n.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Propiedad 6: Calor Espec\u00edfico -->\r\n            <div class=\"propiedad-card\" data-tipo=\"intensiva\" data-categoria=\"termica\">\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-icono\" style=\"color: #ffaa00;\">\ud83d\udd25<\/div>\r\n                    <h3>Calor Espec\u00edfico<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"propiedad-tag intensiva\">INTENSIVA<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-content\">\r\n                    <p class=\"propiedad-def\">Calor necesario para elevar 1\u00b0C la temperatura de 1 g.<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">S\u00edmbolo:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">c<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">Unidad:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">J\/(g\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-label\">F\u00f3rmula:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">\\[ Q = m \\cdot c \\cdot \\Delta T \\]<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Comparativa:<\/strong>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplos-lista\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"sustancia\">Agua<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor\">4.184 J\/(g\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"sustancia\">Hierro<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor\">0.449 J\/(g\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"sustancia\">Plomo<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor\">0.130 J\/(g\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-aplicacion\">\r\n                        <strong>Aplicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Dise\u00f1o t\u00e9rmico, cambio clim\u00e1tico.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- RESUMEN TABULAR -->\r\n        <div class=\"resumen-tabular\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udccb Tabla Resumen: Propiedades Clave<\/h3>\r\n            <table class=\"cyber-table\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>Propiedad<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Tipo<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Unidad SI<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Ejemplo Agua<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Identificaci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>Densidad<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"tipo-cell intensiva\">Intensiva<\/span><\/td>\r\n                        <td>kg\/m\u00b3<\/td>\r\n                        <td>997 kg\/m\u00b3 (25\u00b0C)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\u2705<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>P. Fusi\u00f3n<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"tipo-cell intensiva\">Intensiva<\/span><\/td>\r\n                        <td>\u00b0C<\/td>\r\n                        <td>0.000\u00b0C<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\u2705<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>P. Ebullici\u00f3n<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"tipo-cell intensiva\">Intensiva<\/span><\/td>\r\n                        <td>\u00b0C<\/td>\r\n                        <td>99.974\u00b0C<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\u2705<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>Conduct. El\u00e9ct.<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"tipo-cell intensiva\">Intensiva<\/span><\/td>\r\n                        <td>S\/m<\/td>\r\n                        <td>5.5\u00d710\u207b\u2076 S\/m<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\u2705<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>Masa<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"tipo-cell extensiva\">Extensiva<\/span><\/td>\r\n                        <td>kg<\/td>\r\n                        <td>0.018 kg (1 mol)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\u274c<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>Volumen<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td><span class=\"tipo-cell extensiva\">Extensiva<\/span><\/td>\r\n                        <td>m\u00b3<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1\u00d710\u207b\u2075 m\u00b3 (10 mL)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\u274c<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 3: ESTADOS DE LA MATERIA -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-cyber\" id=\"estados\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion neon-ejemplo\">\r\n            <span class=\"seccion-icono\">\ud83c\udf0a<\/span> ESTADOS DE LA MATERIA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <p class=\"seccion-descripcion\">An\u00e1lisis de fases y transiciones con energ\u00edas asociadas<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"estados-container\">\r\n            <!-- DIAGRAMA DE ESTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"diagrama-estados\">\r\n                <div class=\"diagrama-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Diagrama de Fases: Agua (H\u2082O)<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"diagrama-fuente\">Datos NIST 2025<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"diagrama-visual\">\r\n                    <div class=\"estado-card\" data-estado=\"solido\">\r\n                        <div class=\"estado-icono\">\ud83e\uddca<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"estado-content\">\r\n                            <h4>S\u00d3LIDO (Hielo)<\/h4>\r\n                            <div class=\"estado-propiedades\">\r\n                                <div class=\"propiedad-item\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-label\">Forma:<\/span>\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-valor\">Fija<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"propiedad-item\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-label\">Volumen:<\/span>\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-valor\">Fijo<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"propiedad-item\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-label\">Part\u00edculas:<\/span>\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-valor\">Ordenadas<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"propiedad-item\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-label\">Energ\u00eda:<\/span>\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-valor\">Baja<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"transiciones\">\r\n                        <div class=\"transicion\" data-transicion=\"fusion\">\r\n                            <div class=\"transicion-flecha\">\u2192<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"transicion-info\">\r\n                                <div class=\"transicion-nombre\">Fusi\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"transicion-energia\">\u0394H<sub>fus<\/sub> = 6.01 kJ\/mol<\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"transicion-temp\">0.000\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"transicion\" data-transicion=\"vaporizacion\">\r\n                            <div class=\"transicion-flecha\">\u2192<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"transicion-info\">\r\n                                <div class=\"transicion-nombre\">Vaporizaci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"transicion-energia\">\u0394H<sub>vap<\/sub> = 40.7 kJ\/mol<\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"transicion-temp\">99.974\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"estado-card\" data-estado=\"liquido\">\r\n                        <div class=\"estado-icono\">\ud83d\udca7<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"estado-content\">\r\n                            <h4>L\u00cdQUIDO (Agua)<\/h4>\r\n                            <div class=\"estado-propiedades\">\r\n                                <div class=\"propiedad-item\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-label\">Forma:<\/span>\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-valor\">Variable<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"propiedad-item\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-label\">Volumen:<\/span>\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-valor\">Fijo<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"propiedad-item\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-label\">Part\u00edculas:<\/span>\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-valor\">Semi-ordenadas<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"propiedad-item\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-label\">Energ\u00eda:<\/span>\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-valor\">Media<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"estado-card\" data-estado=\"gas\">\r\n                        <div class=\"estado-icono\">\ud83d\udca8<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"estado-content\">\r\n                            <h4>GAS (Vapor)<\/h4>\r\n                            <div class=\"estado-propiedades\">\r\n                                <div class=\"propiedad-item\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-label\">Forma:<\/span>\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-valor\">Variable<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"propiedad-item\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-label\">Volumen:<\/span>\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-valor\">Variable<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"propiedad-item\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-label\">Part\u00edculas:<\/span>\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-valor\">Desordenadas<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"propiedad-item\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-label\">Energ\u00eda:<\/span>\r\n                                    <span class=\"prop-valor\">Alta<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"diagrama-notas\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Notas:<\/strong> Puntos de referencia a 1 atm. Valores NIST 2025 con incertidumbre \u22640.001\u00b0C.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- COMPARACI\u00d3N DE ESTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"comparacion-estados\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca Comparaci\u00f3n de Propiedades por Estado<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <table class=\"comparacion-table\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>Propiedad<\/th>\r\n                            <th>S\u00f3lido<\/th>\r\n                            <th>L\u00edquido<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Gas<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>Densidad<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Alta<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Media<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Muy baja<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>Compresibilidad<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Muy baja<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Baja<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Alta<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>Difusi\u00f3n<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Muy lenta<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Media<\/td>\r\n                            <td>R\u00e1pida<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>Forma propia<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>\u2705 S\u00ed<\/td>\r\n                            <td>\u274c No<\/td>\r\n                            <td>\u274c No<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>Volumen propio<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>\u2705 S\u00ed<\/td>\r\n                            <td>\u2705 S\u00ed<\/td>\r\n                            <td>\u274c No<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"comparacion-energias\">\r\n                    <h4>\u26a1 Energ\u00edas de Transici\u00f3n (H\u2082O)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"energias-grid\">\r\n                        <div class=\"energia-card\">\r\n                            <div class=\"energia-nombre\">Fusi\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"energia-valor\">6.01 kJ\/mol<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"energia-desc\">S\u00f3lido \u2192 L\u00edquido<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"energia-bar\" style=\"width: 15%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"energia-card\">\r\n                            <div class=\"energia-nombre\">Vaporizaci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"energia-valor\">40.7 kJ\/mol<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"energia-desc\">L\u00edquido \u2192 Gas<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"energia-bar\" style=\"width: 100%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"energia-card\">\r\n                            <div class=\"energia-nombre\">Sublimaci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"energia-valor\">51.1 kJ\/mol<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"energia-desc\">S\u00f3lido \u2192 Gas<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"energia-bar\" style=\"width: 125%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 4: SIMULADOR DE PROPIEDADES -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-cyber\" id=\"simulador\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"seccion-icono\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/span> SIMULADOR DE PROPIEDADES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <p class=\"seccion-descripcion\">Analiza sustancias y predice propiedades f\u00edsicas<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"simulador-container\">\r\n            <!-- SELECTOR DE SUSTANCIA -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulador-selector\">\r\n                <h3>SUSTANCIA DE AN\u00c1LISIS<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"sustancia-control\">\r\n                    <label for=\"sustancia-select\">Selecciona sustancia:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"sustancia-select\" class=\"cyber-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"agua\">Agua (H\u2082O)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"etanol\">Etanol (C\u2082H\u2085OH)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"mercurio\">Mercurio (Hg)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"hierro\">Hierro (Fe)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"cobre\">Cobre (Cu)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"cloruro-sodio\">Cloruro de sodio (NaCl)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"sustancia-info\" id=\"sustancia-info\">\r\n                    <div class=\"info-header\">\r\n                        <h4>Agua (H\u2082O)<\/h4>\r\n                        <span class=\"info-formula\">H\u2082O<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"info-descripcion\">\r\n                        Sustancia polar esencial para la vida. Presenta propiedades \u00fanicas como densidad m\u00e1xima a 4\u00b0C.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"temperatura-control\">\r\n                    <label for=\"temperatura-slider\">Temperatura: <span id=\"temp-valor\">25<\/span>\u00b0C<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"temperatura-slider\" min=\"-100\" max=\"500\" value=\"25\" class=\"cyber-slider\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>-100\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                        <span>200\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                        <span>500\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"cyber-btn btn-primario\" onclick=\"analizarSustancia()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icono\">\ud83d\udd0d<\/span> Analizar Propiedades\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS DEL AN\u00c1LISIS -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulador-resultados\">\r\n                <h3>RESULTADOS DEL AN\u00c1LISIS<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"resultados-grid\" id=\"resultados-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"resultado-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-header\">\r\n                            <div class=\"resultado-icono\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <h4>Densidad<\/h4>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-valor\" id=\"resultado-densidad\">0.997 g\/cm\u00b3<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-tipo\">\r\n                            <span class=\"tipo-badge intensiva\">Intensiva<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"bar-fill\" id=\"barra-densidad\" style=\"width: 50%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"resultado-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-header\">\r\n                            <div class=\"resultado-icono\">\u2744\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <h4>Punto de Fusi\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-valor\" id=\"resultado-fusion\">0.000\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-estado\">\r\n                            <span class=\"estado-badge solido\">S\u00f3lido<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"resultado-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-header\">\r\n                            <div class=\"resultado-icono\">\ud83d\udca8<\/div>\r\n                            <h4>Punto de Ebullici\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-valor\" id=\"resultado-ebullicion\">99.974\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-estado\">\r\n                            <span class=\"estado-badge liquido\">L\u00edquido<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"resultado-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-header\">\r\n                            <div class=\"resultado-icono\">\u26a1<\/div>\r\n                            <h4>Conductividad<\/h4>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-valor\" id=\"resultado-conductividad\">5.5\u00d710\u207b\u2076 S\/m<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-clasificacion\">\r\n                            <span class=\"clasif-badge aislante\">Aislante<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"resultado-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-header\">\r\n                            <div class=\"resultado-icono\">\ud83e\uddea<\/div>\r\n                            <h4>Estado Actual<\/h4>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-valor\" id=\"resultado-estado\">L\u00cdQUIDO<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-visual\">\r\n                            <div class=\"estado-visual liquido\">\ud83d\udca7<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"resultado-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-header\">\r\n                            <div class=\"resultado-icono\">\ud83d\udcca<\/div>\r\n                            <h4>Clasificaci\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"resultado-clasificacion\">\r\n                            <div class=\"clasif-item\">\r\n                                <span>Tipo predominante:<\/span>\r\n                                <span id=\"clasif-tipo\">Intensivas<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"clasif-item\">\r\n                                <span>Identificaci\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                                <span id=\"clasif-identificacion\">ALTA<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"simulador-grafico\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcc8 Variaci\u00f3n con Temperatura<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"grafico-container\" id=\"grafico-container\">\r\n                        <!-- Gr\u00e1fico generado din\u00e1micamente -->\r\n                        <div class=\"grafico-placeholder\">\r\n                            <div class=\"placeholder-text\">\r\n                                <span class=\"placeholder-icono\">\ud83d\udcc8<\/span>\r\n                                <p>Selecciona una sustancia y ajusta temperatura<\/p>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- BASE DE DATOS NIST -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulador-database\">\r\n                <h3>BASE DE DATOS NIST 2025<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"database-info\">\r\n                    <div class=\"db-header\">\r\n                        <h4>Datos de Referencia<\/h4>\r\n                        <span class=\"db-version\">v2025.1<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"db-propiedades\" id=\"db-propiedades\">\r\n                        <div class=\"db-propiedad\">\r\n                            <span class=\"db-label\">Precisi\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"db-valor\">\u00b10.001\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"db-propiedad\">\r\n                            <span class=\"db-label\">Sustancias:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"db-valor\">150+<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"db-propiedad\">\r\n                            <span class=\"db-label\">Propiedades:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"db-valor\">25+ por sustancia<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"db-propiedad\">\r\n                            <span class=\"db-label\">Actualizaci\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"db-valor\">Enero 2025<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"db-log\">\r\n                        <h4>REGISTRO DE AN\u00c1LISIS<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"log-contenido\" id=\"db-log\">\r\n                            <div class=\"log-entrada\">[SISTEMA] Base de datos NIST 2025 cargada<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"log-entrada\">[AN\u00c1LISIS] Listo para procesar sustancias<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <button class=\"cyber-btn btn-secundario\" onclick=\"exportarAnalisis()\">\r\n                        <span class=\"btn-icono\">\ud83d\udcbe<\/span> Exportar An\u00e1lisis\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 5: QUIZ DE IDENTIFICACI\u00d3N -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-cyber\" id=\"quiz\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"seccion-icono\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> QUIZ DE IDENTIFICACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <p class=\"seccion-descripcion\">Eval\u00faa tu capacidad para clasificar propiedades f\u00edsicas<\/p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1: INTENSIVA\/EXTENSIVA -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\" data-pregunta=\"1\" data-correcta=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"pregunta-numero\">Pregunta 1\/6<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"pregunta-dificultad\">B\u00e1sica<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-contenido\">\r\n                    <div class=\"pregunta-texto\">\r\n                        <p>\u00bfCu\u00e1l de las siguientes propiedades es <strong>INTENSIVA<\/strong>?<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"pregunta-opciones\">\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"A\">\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-letra\">A<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-texto\">Masa de 50 g de hierro<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"B\">\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-letra\">B<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-texto\">Densidad del agua (1 g\/cm\u00b3)<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"C\">\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-letra\">C<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-texto\">Volumen de 1 L de etanol<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"D\">\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-letra\">D<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-texto\">Energ\u00eda t\u00e9rmica de un sistema<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"pregunta-feedback\" id=\"feedback-1\">\r\n                        <div class=\"feedback-correcto\">\r\n                            <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> La densidad es intensiva porque no depende de la cantidad de muestra. 1 g de agua o 1 kg tienen la misma densidad.\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"feedback-incorrecto\">\r\n                            <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> La masa, volumen y energ\u00eda son propiedades extensivas: cambian con la cantidad de materia.\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2: ESTADOS DE LA MATERIA -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\" data-pregunta=\"2\" data-correcta=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"pregunta-numero\">Pregunta 2\/6<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"pregunta-dificultad\">Media<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-contenido\">\r\n                    <div class=\"pregunta-texto\">\r\n                        <p>El mercurio (Hg) es l\u00edquido a temperatura ambiente (25\u00b0C). \u00bfCu\u00e1l es su punto de fusi\u00f3n seg\u00fan NIST 2025?<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"pregunta-opciones\">\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"A\">\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-letra\">A<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-texto\">0.000\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"B\">\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-letra\">B<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-texto\">78.37\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"C\">\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-letra\">C<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-texto\">-38.83\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"D\">\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-letra\">D<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-texto\">100.00\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"pregunta-feedback\" id=\"feedback-2\">\r\n                        <div class=\"feedback-correcto\">\r\n                            <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> El mercurio tiene punto de fusi\u00f3n -38.83\u00b0C, por eso es l\u00edquido a temperatura ambiente. Valor NIST 2025 con incertidumbre \u00b10.01\u00b0C.\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"feedback-incorrecto\">\r\n                            <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa los datos NIST: agua 0\u00b0C, etanol -114\u00b0C, mercurio -38.83\u00b0C.\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3: C\u00c1LCULO DE DENSIDAD -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-pregunta\" data-pregunta=\"3\" data-correcta=\"D\">\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"pregunta-numero\">Pregunta 3\/6<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"pregunta-dificultad\">Alta<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-contenido\">\r\n                    <div class=\"pregunta-texto\">\r\n                        <p>Una muestra de cobre tiene masa de 89.0 g y ocupa 10.0 cm\u00b3. \u00bfCu\u00e1l es su densidad?<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"pregunta-formula\">\r\n                            \\[ \\rho = \\frac{m}{V} \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"pregunta-opciones\">\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"A\">\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-letra\">A<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-texto\">8.90 g\/cm\u00b3<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"B\">\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-letra\">B<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-texto\">8.09 g\/cm\u00b3<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"C\">\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-letra\">C<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-texto\">9.80 g\/cm\u00b3<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"opcion\" data-opcion=\"D\">\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-letra\">D<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"opcion-texto\">8.90 g\/cm\u00b3<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"pregunta-feedback\" id=\"feedback-3\">\r\n                        <div class=\"feedback-correcto\">\r\n                            <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> \\[ \\rho = \\frac{89.0 \\text{ g}}{10.0 \\text{ cm}^3} = 8.90 \\text{ g\/cm}^3 \\]\r\n                            Este valor identifica al cobre (valor te\u00f3rico: 8.96 g\/cm\u00b3).\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"feedback-incorrecto\">\r\n                            <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Aplica la f\u00f3rmula: densidad = masa \u00f7 volumen. Revisa el c\u00e1lculo.\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-resultados\" id=\"quiz-resultados\">\r\n                <div class=\"resultados-header\">\r\n                    <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"resultados-puntaje\">\r\n                        <div class=\"puntaje-circular\">\r\n                            <div class=\"circular-progreso\" id=\"circular-progreso\">\r\n                                <span class=\"puntaje-porcentaje\" id=\"puntaje-porcentaje\">0%<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"puntaje-detalle\">\r\n                            <div class=\"detalle-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-label\">Correctas:<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-valor\" id=\"correctas-contador\">0\/6<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"detalle-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-label\">Precisi\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-valor\" id=\"precision-quiz\">0%<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"detalle-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-label\">Nivel:<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-valor\" id=\"nivel-quiz\">-<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"resultados-feedback\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-general\" id=\"feedback-general\">\r\n                        Completa todas las preguntas para ver tu resultado\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-especifico\" id=\"feedback-especifico\">\r\n                        <!-- Feedback espec\u00edfico generado din\u00e1micamente -->\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"resultados-acciones\">\r\n                    <button class=\"cyber-btn btn-primario\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                        <span class=\"btn-icono\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> Reintentar Quiz\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"cyber-btn btn-secundario\" onclick=\"verSoluciones()\">\r\n                        <span class=\"btn-icono\">\ud83d\udcd6<\/span> Ver Soluciones\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 6: PROBLEMAS APLICADOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-cyber\" id=\"problemas\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion neon-ejemplo\">\r\n            <span class=\"seccion-icono\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS DE APLICACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"problemas-container\">\r\n            <!-- PROBLEMA 1: IDENTIFICACI\u00d3N DE SUSTANCIA -->\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Problema 1: Identificaci\u00f3n por Propiedades<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-puntos\">(4 puntos)<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-contenido\">\r\n                    <p>Un qu\u00edmico tiene una sustancia desconocida con las siguientes propiedades:<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"problema-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-propiedad\">\r\n                            <span class=\"propiedad-nombre\">Punto de fusi\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"propiedad-valor\">-114.1\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-propiedad\">\r\n                            <span class=\"propiedad-nombre\">Punto de ebullici\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"propiedad-valor\">78.37\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-propiedad\">\r\n                            <span class=\"propiedad-nombre\">Densidad (25\u00b0C):<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"propiedad-valor\">0.789 g\/cm\u00b3<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-propiedad\">\r\n                            <span class=\"propiedad-nombre\">Estado a 25\u00b0C:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"propiedad-valor\">L\u00edquido<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"problema-preguntas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>a)<\/strong> Consultando la base de datos NIST, \u00bfqu\u00e9 sustancia es?<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"opciones-sustancias\">\r\n                            <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"p1-sustancia\" value=\"agua\"> Agua (H\u2082O)<\/label>\r\n                            <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"p1-sustancia\" value=\"etanol\"> Etanol (C\u2082H\u2085OH)<\/label>\r\n                            <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"p1-sustancia\" value=\"mercurio\"> Mercurio (Hg)<\/label>\r\n                            <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"p1-sustancia\" value=\"benceno\"> Benceno (C\u2086H\u2086)<\/label>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <p><strong>b)<\/strong> Clasifica cada propiedad como intensiva (I) o extensiva (E):<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"clasificacion-propiedades\">\r\n                            <div class=\"clasif-item\">\r\n                                <span>Punto de fusi\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                                <div class=\"clasif-opciones\">\r\n                                    <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"p1-clasif-fusion\" value=\"I\"> I<\/label>\r\n                                    <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"p1-clasif-fusion\" value=\"E\"> E<\/label>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"clasif-item\">\r\n                                <span>Densidad:<\/span>\r\n                                <div class=\"clasif-opciones\">\r\n                                    <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"p1-clasif-densidad\" value=\"I\"> I<\/label>\r\n                                    <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"p1-clasif-densidad\" value=\"E\"> E<\/label>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <button class=\"cyber-btn btn-pequeno\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">Verificar Respuesta<\/button>\r\n                    <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucion-1\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> \r\n                        <p>a) Etanol (C\u2082H\u2085OH). Los datos coinciden exactamente con NIST 2025.<\/p>\r\n                        <p>b) Ambas propiedades son INTENSIVAS (I): identifican la sustancia y no dependen de la cantidad.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PROBLEMA 2: C\u00c1LCULO DE PROPIEDADES -->\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Problema 2: C\u00e1lculo de Densidad y Masa<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-puntos\">(3 puntos)<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-contenido\">\r\n                    <p>Se tiene un bloque rectangular de aluminio con dimensiones 2.0 cm \u00d7 3.0 cm \u00d7 5.0 cm. La densidad del aluminio es 2.70 g\/cm\u00b3.<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"problema-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-propiedad\">\r\n                            <span class=\"propiedad-nombre\">Densidad (\u03c1):<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"propiedad-valor\">2.70 g\/cm\u00b3<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-propiedad\">\r\n                            <span class=\"propiedad-nombre\">Dimensiones:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"propiedad-valor\">2.0 cm \u00d7 3.0 cm \u00d7 5.0 cm<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"problema-preguntas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>a)<\/strong> Calcula el volumen del bloque en cm\u00b3:<\/p>\r\n                        <textarea class=\"respuesta-desarrollo\" placeholder=\"Desarrollo...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        \r\n                        <p><strong>b)<\/strong> Calcula la masa del bloque en gramos:<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"formula-guia\">\r\n                            \\[ m = \\rho \\times V \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"text\" class=\"respuesta-corta\" placeholder=\"Resultado en g...\">\r\n                        \r\n                        <p><strong>c)<\/strong> Si divides el bloque en dos mitades iguales, \u00bfqu\u00e9 propiedades cambian y cu\u00e1les permanecen constantes?<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"opciones-cambios\">\r\n                            <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p2-cambios\" value=\"densidad\"> Densidad (constante)<\/label>\r\n                            <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p2-cambios\" value=\"volumen\"> Volumen (cambia)<\/label>\r\n                            <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p2-cambios\" value=\"masa\"> Masa (cambia)<\/label>\r\n                            <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"p2-cambios\" value=\"geometria\"> Geometr\u00eda (cambia)<\/label>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <button class=\"cyber-btn btn-pequeno\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">Verificar Respuesta<\/button>\r\n                    <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucion-2\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> \r\n                        <p>a) V = 2.0 \u00d7 3.0 \u00d7 5.0 = 30.0 cm\u00b3<\/p>\r\n                        <p>b) m = \u03c1 \u00d7 V = 2.70 g\/cm\u00b3 \u00d7 30.0 cm\u00b3 = 81.0 g<\/p>\r\n                        <p>c) Densidad constante (intensiva). Volumen, masa y geometr\u00eda cambian (extensivas\/geom\u00e9tricas).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"rubrica-evaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd0d R\u00fabrica de Calificaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>Puntos<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Descripci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>4<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Excelente<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Identificaci\u00f3n correcta + clasificaci\u00f3n precisa + razonamiento completo<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>3<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Bueno<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Identificaci\u00f3n correcta + alg\u00fan error menor en clasificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>2<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Satisfactorio<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Comprensi\u00f3n b\u00e1sica pero desarrollo incompleto<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>1<\/td>\r\n                            <td>B\u00e1sico<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Respuesta parcial sin procedimiento claro<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 7: INTEGRACI\u00d3N Y CIERRE -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-cyber\" id=\"cierre\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"seccion-icono\">\ud83d\udcbe<\/span> INTEGRACI\u00d3N DEL CONOCIMIENTO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <!-- MAPA CONCEPTUAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"mapa-conceptual\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Mapa Conceptual: Propiedades F\u00edsicas<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"mapa-visual\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nodo-principal\">\r\n                        <div class=\"nodo-titulo\">PROPIEDADES F\u00cdSICAS<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nodo-desc\">Caracter\u00edsticas medibles sin cambiar composici\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"conexiones\">\r\n                        <div class=\"conexion\">\r\n                            <div class=\"conexion-flecha\">\u2193<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"conexion-label\">CLASIFICACI\u00d3N POR<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"nodos-secundarios\">\r\n                        <div class=\"nodo-secundario intensivo\">\r\n                            <div class=\"nodo-titulo\">INTENSIVAS<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"nodo-lista\">\r\n                                <span>\u2022 No dependen de cantidad<\/span>\r\n                                <span>\u2022 Identifican sustancia<\/span>\r\n                                <span>\u2022 Ej: densidad, puntos de cambio<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"nodo-secundario extensivo\">\r\n                            <div class=\"nodo-titulo\">EXTENSIVAS<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"nodo-lista\">\r\n                                <span>\u2022 Dependen de cantidad<\/span>\r\n                                <span>\u2022 No identifican<\/span>\r\n                                <span>\u2022 Ej: masa, volumen, energ\u00eda<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"conexiones-estados\">\r\n                        <div class=\"conexion-horizontal\">\r\n                            <div class=\"conexion-flecha\">\u2192<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"conexion-label\">ESTADOS DE LA MATERIA<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"nodos-estados\">\r\n                        <div class=\"nodo-estado solido\">\r\n                            <div class=\"estado-simbolo\">\ud83e\uddca<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"estado-nombre\">S\u00d3LIDO<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nodo-estado liquido\">\r\n                            <div class=\"estado-simbolo\">\ud83d\udca7<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"estado-nombre\">L\u00cdQUIDO<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nodo-estado gas\">\r\n                            <div class=\"estado-simbolo\">\ud83d\udca8<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"estado-nombre\">GAS<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"mapa-conclusion\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Conclusi\u00f3n:<\/strong> Las propiedades f\u00edsicas son el \"ADN\" de la materia: permiten identificar sustancias, predecir comportamiento y dise\u00f1ar aplicaciones sin alterar su composici\u00f3n qu\u00edmica.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N FINAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion-final\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc8 Auto-Evaluaci\u00f3n de Competencias<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"competencias-lista\">\r\n                    <div class=\"competencia-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"competencia-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"competencia-nombre\">Identificaci\u00f3n Intensiva\/Extensiva<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"competencia-puntaje\" id=\"puntaje-identificacion\">0\/5<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"competencia-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"bar-progreso\" id=\"bar-identificacion\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"competencia-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"competencia-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"competencia-nombre\">Uso de Datos NIST<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"competencia-puntaje\" id=\"puntaje-nist\">0\/5<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"competencia-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"bar-progreso\" id=\"bar-nist\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"competencia-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"competencia-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"competencia-nombre\">C\u00e1lculo de Propiedades<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"competencia-puntaje\" id=\"puntaje-calculo\">0\/5<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"competencia-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"bar-progreso\" id=\"bar-calculo\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"competencia-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"competencia-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"competencia-nombre\">An\u00e1lisis de Estados<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"competencia-puntaje\" id=\"puntaje-estados\">0\/5<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"competencia-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"bar-progreso\" id=\"bar-estados\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"autoevaluacion-acciones\">\r\n                    <button class=\"cyber-btn btn-primario\" onclick=\"generarCertificado()\">\r\n                        <span class=\"btn-icono\">\ud83c\udfc6<\/span> Generar Certificado\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"cyber-btn btn-secundario\" onclick=\"exportarResultados()\">\r\n                        <span class=\"btn-icono\">\ud83d\udce4<\/span> Exportar Resultados\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"reflexion-final\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcad Reflexi\u00f3n de Aprendizaje<\/h4>\r\n                    <textarea id=\"reflexion-texto\" placeholder=\"\u00bfC\u00f3mo aplicas las propiedades f\u00edsicas en la vida diaria? \u00bfQu\u00e9 propiedad te parece m\u00e1s \u00fatil para identificar sustancias?...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                    <button class=\"cyber-btn btn-pequeno\" onclick=\"guardarReflexion()\">\r\n                        <span class=\"btn-icono\">\ud83d\udcbe<\/span> Guardar Reflexi\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PIE DE P\u00c1GINA -->\r\n    <footer class=\"cyber-footer\">\r\n        <div class=\"footer-content\">\r\n            <div class=\"footer-info\">\r\n                <div class=\"footer-logo\">\r\n                    <span class=\"logo-icono\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"logo-texto\">Sistema Cyber-Edu Propiedades F\u00edsicas<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"footer-datos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                        <span class=\"dato-label\">Base de datos:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"dato-valor\">NIST 2025<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                        <span class=\"dato-label\">Precisi\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"dato-valor\">\u00b10.001\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"footer-progreso\">\r\n                <div class=\"progreso-total\">\r\n                    <div class=\"progreso-label\">Dominio de conceptos:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"progreso-valor\" id=\"progreso-final\">0%<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"progreso-bar-total\">\r\n                    <div class=\"barra-total\" id=\"barra-progreso-total\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"footer-recursos\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udcda Recursos Adicionales<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"recurso-link\">NIST Chemistry WebBook<\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"recurso-link\">Simulador de Estados<\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"recurso-link\">Base de Datos de Densidades<\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"footer-creditos\">\r\n            <p>\u00a9 2024 Sistema Educativo Cyberpunk | Qu\u00edmica I - Propiedades F\u00edsicas | Datos NIST 2025 | Dise\u00f1o educativo avanzado<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/footer>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- SCRIPT JAVASCRIPT -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA CYBER-PROPIEDADES: L\u00d3GICA INTERACTIVA\r\n\/\/ ============================================\r\n\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    console.log('[SISTEMA] Iniciando lecci\u00f3n Cyber-Propiedades F\u00edsicas');\r\n    console.log('[QU\u00cdMICA] Tema: Propiedades F\u00edsicas de la Materia');\r\n    \r\n    inicializarCatalogo();\r\n    inicializarSimulador();\r\n    inicializarQuiz();\r\n    inicializarProblemas();\r\n    inicializarProgreso();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar MathJax si est\u00e1 disponible\r\n    if (window.MathJax) {\r\n        MathJax.typesetPromise();\r\n    }\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== SISTEMA DE PROGRESO ==========\r\nlet progresoTotal = 0;\r\nconst progresoMaximo = 100;\r\n\r\nfunction inicializarProgreso() {\r\n    \/\/ Recuperar progreso guardado\r\n    const progresoGuardado = localStorage.getItem('progreso_propiedades');\r\n    if (progresoGuardado) {\r\n        progresoTotal = parseInt(progresoGuardado);\r\n        actualizarDisplayProgreso();\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Observar interacciones para progreso autom\u00e1tico\r\n    observarInteracciones();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction observarInteracciones() {\r\n    \/\/ Observar scroll de secciones\r\n    const secciones = document.querySelectorAll('.seccion-cyber');\r\n    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\r\n        entries.forEach(entry => {\r\n            if (entry.isIntersecting) {\r\n                const id = entry.target.id;\r\n                if (!localStorage.getItem(`visto_${id}`)) {\r\n                    localStorage.setItem(`visto_${id}`, 'true');\r\n                    actualizarProgreso(3); \/\/ 3% por secci\u00f3n vista\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    }, { threshold: 0.5 });\r\n    \r\n    secciones.forEach(seccion => observer.observe(seccion));\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarProgreso(puntos) {\r\n    progresoTotal = Math.min(progresoMaximo, progresoTotal + puntos);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar displays\r\n    document.getElementById('progreso-global').textContent = `${progresoTotal}%`;\r\n    document.getElementById('progreso-final').textContent = `${progresoTotal}%`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar barra de progreso\r\n    const barra = document.getElementById('barra-progreso-total');\r\n    if (barra) {\r\n        barra.style.width = `${progresoTotal}%`;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar barras de objetivos\r\n    actualizarProgresoObjetivos();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Guardar en localStorage\r\n    localStorage.setItem('progreso_propiedades', progresoTotal);\r\n    \r\n    console.log(`[PROGRESO] Actualizado: ${progresoTotal}% (+${puntos})`);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarDisplayProgreso() {\r\n    document.getElementById('progreso-global').textContent = `${progresoTotal}%`;\r\n    document.getElementById('progreso-final').textContent = `${progresoTotal}%`;\r\n    \r\n    const barra = document.getElementById('barra-progreso-total');\r\n    if (barra) {\r\n        barra.style.width = `${progresoTotal}%`;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarProgresoObjetivos() {\r\n    const objetivos = document.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-progreso .progreso-bar');\r\n    objetivos.forEach((barra, index) => {\r\n        const progreso = Math.min(100, (progresoTotal \/ 4) + (index * 10));\r\n        barra.style.width = `${progreso}%`;\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== CAT\u00c1LOGO INTERACTIVO ==========\r\nfunction inicializarCatalogo() {\r\n    \/\/ Configurar filtros\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.filtro-btn').forEach(btn => {\r\n        btn.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            document.querySelectorAll('.filtro-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));\r\n            this.classList.add('active');\r\n            filtrarPropiedades(this.dataset.tipo);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar ordenamiento\r\n    document.getElementById('ordenar-propiedades').addEventListener('change', function() {\r\n        ordenarPropiedades(this.value);\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction filtrarPropiedades(tipo) {\r\n    const propiedades = document.querySelectorAll('.propiedad-card');\r\n    \r\n    propiedades.forEach(propiedad => {\r\n        if (tipo === 'todas') {\r\n            propiedad.style.display = 'block';\r\n        } else if (propiedad.dataset.tipo === tipo || propiedad.dataset.categoria === tipo) {\r\n            propiedad.style.display = 'block';\r\n        } else {\r\n            propiedad.style.display = 'none';\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction ordenarPropiedades(criterio) {\r\n    const grid = document.getElementById('propiedades-grid');\r\n    const propiedades = Array.from(grid.querySelectorAll('.propiedad-card'));\r\n    \r\n    propiedades.sort((a, b) => {\r\n        switch(criterio) {\r\n            case 'nombre':\r\n                return a.querySelector('h3').textContent.localeCompare(b.querySelector('h3').textContent);\r\n            case 'tipo':\r\n                return a.dataset.tipo.localeCompare(b.dataset.tipo);\r\n            case 'importancia':\r\n                \/\/ Ordenar por posici\u00f3n en el DOM (las primeras son m\u00e1s importantes)\r\n                return Array.from(grid.children).indexOf(a) - Array.from(grid.children).indexOf(b);\r\n            default:\r\n                return 0;\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Reordenar en el DOM\r\n    propiedades.forEach(propiedad => grid.appendChild(propiedad));\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== SIMULADOR DE PROPIEDADES ==========\r\nconst datosNIST = {\r\n    agua: {\r\n        nombre: \"Agua (H\u2082O)\",\r\n        formula: \"H\u2082O\",\r\n        descripcion: \"Sustancia polar esencial para la vida. Presenta propiedades \u00fanicas como densidad m\u00e1xima a 4\u00b0C.\",\r\n        propiedades: {\r\n            densidad: { valor: 0.997, unidad: \"g\/cm\u00b3\", dependencia: \"temp\" },\r\n            fusion: { valor: 0.000, unidad: \"\u00b0C\" },\r\n            ebullicion: { valor: 99.974, unidad: \"\u00b0C\" },\r\n            conductividad: { valor: 5.5e-6, unidad: \"S\/m\" },\r\n            calorEspecifico: { valor: 4.184, unidad: \"J\/(g\u00b7\u00b0C)\" }\r\n        },\r\n        estados: {\r\n            solido: { min: -273, max: 0 },\r\n            liquido: { min: 0, max: 99.974 },\r\n            gas: { min: 99.974, max: 1000 }\r\n        }\r\n    },\r\n    etanol: {\r\n        nombre: \"Etanol (C\u2082H\u2085OH)\",\r\n        formula: \"C\u2082H\u2085OH\",\r\n        descripcion: \"Alcohol et\u00edlico. L\u00edquido vol\u00e1til utilizado como disolvente y combustible.\",\r\n        propiedades: {\r\n            densidad: { valor: 0.789, unidad: \"g\/cm\u00b3\", dependencia: \"temp\" },\r\n            fusion: { valor: -114.1, unidad: \"\u00b0C\" },\r\n            ebullicion: { valor: 78.37, unidad: \"\u00b0C\" },\r\n            conductividad: { valor: 1.0e-7, unidad: \"S\/m\" },\r\n            calorEspecifico: { valor: 2.44, unidad: \"J\/(g\u00b7\u00b0C)\" }\r\n        },\r\n        estados: {\r\n            solido: { min: -273, max: -114.1 },\r\n            liquido: { min: -114.1, max: 78.37 },\r\n            gas: { min: 78.37, max: 1000 }\r\n        }\r\n    },\r\n    mercurio: {\r\n        nombre: \"Mercurio (Hg)\",\r\n        formula: \"Hg\",\r\n        descripcion: \"Metal l\u00edquido a temperatura ambiente. T\u00f3xico, utilizado en term\u00f3metros.\",\r\n        propiedades: {\r\n            densidad: { valor: 13.534, unidad: \"g\/cm\u00b3\", dependencia: \"temp\" },\r\n            fusion: { valor: -38.83, unidad: \"\u00b0C\" },\r\n            ebullicion: { valor: 356.73, unidad: \"\u00b0C\" },\r\n            conductividad: { valor: 1.0e6, unidad: \"S\/m\" },\r\n            calorEspecifico: { valor: 0.14, unidad: \"J\/(g\u00b7\u00b0C)\" }\r\n        },\r\n        estados: {\r\n            solido: { min: -273, max: -38.83 },\r\n            liquido: { min: -38.83, max: 356.73 },\r\n            gas: { min: 356.73, max: 1000 }\r\n        }\r\n    },\r\n    hierro: {\r\n        nombre: \"Hierro (Fe)\",\r\n        formula: \"Fe\",\r\n        descripcion: \"Metal de transici\u00f3n. Duro, maleable, buen conductor.\",\r\n        propiedades: {\r\n            densidad: { valor: 7.87, unidad: \"g\/cm\u00b3\", dependencia: \"temp\" },\r\n            fusion: { valor: 1538, unidad: \"\u00b0C\" },\r\n            ebullicion: { valor: 2862, unidad: \"\u00b0C\" },\r\n            conductividad: { valor: 1.0e7, unidad: \"S\/m\" },\r\n            calorEspecifico: { valor: 0.449, unidad: \"J\/(g\u00b7\u00b0C)\" }\r\n        },\r\n        estados: {\r\n            solido: { min: -273, max: 1538 },\r\n            liquido: { min: 1538, max: 2862 },\r\n            gas: { min: 2862, max: 1000 }\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\nfunction inicializarSimulador() {\r\n    const selector = document.getElementById('sustancia-select');\r\n    const slider = document.getElementById('temperatura-slider');\r\n    \r\n    selector.addEventListener('change', actualizarInfoSustancia);\r\n    slider.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n        document.getElementById('temp-valor').textContent = this.value;\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    actualizarInfoSustancia();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarInfoSustancia() {\r\n    const selector = document.getElementById('sustancia-select');\r\n    const sustancia = datosNIST[selector.value];\r\n    \r\n    if (!sustancia) return;\r\n    \r\n    const info = document.getElementById('sustancia-info');\r\n    info.innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"info-header\">\r\n            <h4>${sustancia.nombre}<\/h4>\r\n            <span class=\"info-formula\">${sustancia.formula}<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"info-descripcion\">\r\n            ${sustancia.descripcion}\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    `;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction analizarSustancia() {\r\n    const selector = document.getElementById('sustancia-select');\r\n    const temperatura = parseInt(document.getElementById('temperatura-slider').value);\r\n    const sustancia = datosNIST[selector.value];\r\n    \r\n    if (!sustancia) return;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular densidad ajustada por temperatura\r\n    const densidadBase = sustancia.propiedades.densidad.valor;\r\n    const densidad = calcularDensidadAjustada(densidadBase, temperatura);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Determinar estado actual\r\n    const estado = determinarEstado(sustancia.estados, temperatura);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar resultados\r\n    document.getElementById('resultado-densidad').textContent = `${densidad.toFixed(3)} ${sustancia.propiedades.densidad.unidad}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('resultado-fusion').textContent = `${sustancia.propiedades.fusion.valor} ${sustancia.propiedades.fusion.unidad}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('resultado-ebullicion').textContent = `${sustancia.propiedades.ebullicion.valor} ${sustancia.propiedades.ebullicion.unidad}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('resultado-conductividad').textContent = `${formatCientifico(sustancia.propiedades.conductividad.valor)} ${sustancia.propiedades.conductividad.unidad}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('resultado-estado').textContent = estado.toUpperCase();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar barras y visualizaciones\r\n    actualizarBarrasResultados(sustancia, densidad, estado);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar gr\u00e1fico\r\n    actualizarGraficoTemperatura(sustancia, temperatura);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Agregar log\r\n    agregarLogDB(`Analizada: ${sustancia.nombre} a ${temperatura}\u00b0C`);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar progreso\r\n    actualizarProgreso(5);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction calcularDensidadAjustada(densidadBase, temperatura) {\r\n    \/\/ Simulaci\u00f3n simple de variaci\u00f3n con temperatura\r\n    const coeficiente = 0.0002; \/\/ Coeficiente de expansi\u00f3n t\u00e9rmica aproximado\r\n    const tempReferencia = 25; \/\/ Temperatura de referencia para densidad base\r\n    const variacion = coeficiente * (temperatura - tempReferencia);\r\n    return densidadBase * (1 - variacion);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction determinarEstado(estados, temperatura) {\r\n    if (temperatura < estados.solido.max) return \"S\u00d3LIDO\";\r\n    if (temperatura < estados.liquido.max) return \"L\u00cdQUIDO\";\r\n    return \"GAS\";\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction formatCientifico(valor) {\r\n    if (valor < 0.001 || valor > 1000) {\r\n        return valor.toExponential(1);\r\n    }\r\n    return valor.toFixed(3);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarBarrasResultados(sustancia, densidad, estado) {\r\n    \/\/ Barra de densidad (normalizada 0-20 g\/cm\u00b3)\r\n    const barraDensidad = document.getElementById('barra-densidad');\r\n    const porcentajeDensidad = (densidad \/ 20) * 100;\r\n    barraDensidad.style.width = `${Math.min(100, porcentajeDensidad)}%`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Estado visual\r\n    const estadoVisual = document.querySelector('.estado-visual');\r\n    estadoVisual.className = 'estado-visual';\r\n    estadoVisual.textContent = estado === \"S\u00d3LIDO\" ? \"\ud83e\uddca\" : estado === \"L\u00cdQUIDO\" ? \"\ud83d\udca7\" : \"\ud83d\udca8\";\r\n    estadoVisual.classList.add(estado.toLowerCase());\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Clasificaci\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('clasif-tipo').textContent = \"Intensivas\";\r\n    document.getElementById('clasif-identificacion').textContent = \"ALTA\";\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Badges de estado\r\n    const estadoBadge = document.querySelector('.estado-badge');\r\n    estadoBadge.className = 'estado-badge';\r\n    estadoBadge.textContent = estado.charAt(0) + estado.slice(1).toLowerCase();\r\n    estadoBadge.classList.add(estado.toLowerCase());\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarGraficoTemperatura(sustancia, temperatura) {\r\n    const container = document.getElementById('grafico-container');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Generar gr\u00e1fico simple\r\n    const puntos = [];\r\n    for (let temp = -100; temp <= 500; temp += 50) {\r\n        const densidad = calcularDensidadAjustada(sustancia.propiedades.densidad.valor, temp);\r\n        puntos.push({ x: temp, y: densidad });\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Crear SVG del gr\u00e1fico\r\n    const svg = `\r\n        <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"180\" viewBox=\"-100 0 600 180\" style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border-radius: 4px;\">\r\n            <defs>\r\n                <linearGradient id=\"gradiente\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\r\n                    <stop offset=\"0%\" style=\"stop-color: #00ff9d; stop-opacity:0.8\" \/>\r\n                    <stop offset=\"100%\" style=\"stop-color: #00aaff; stop-opacity:0.8\" \/>\r\n                <\/linearGradient>\r\n            <\/defs>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Ejes -->\r\n            <line x1=\"-80\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" \/>\r\n            <line x1=\"-80\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"-80\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" \/>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Puntos y l\u00ednea -->\r\n            <polyline points=\"${puntos.map(p => `${p.x + 100},${160 - p.y * 10}`).join(' ')}\" \r\n                     fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#gradiente)\" stroke-width=\"2\" \/>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Punto actual -->\r\n            <circle cx=\"${temperatura + 100}\" cy=\"${160 - calcularDensidadAjustada(sustancia.propiedades.densidad.valor, temperatura) * 10}\" \r\n                   r=\"6\" fill=\"#ff00ff\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\">\r\n                <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"6;8;6\" dur=\"1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" \/>\r\n            <\/circle>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Etiquetas -->\r\n            <text x=\"-90\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#88aaff\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\">Temperatura (\u00b0C)<\/text>\r\n            <text x=\"-85\" y=\"15\" fill=\"#88aaff\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\">Densidad (g\/cm\u00b3)<\/text>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Marcadores -->\r\n            <text x=\"${temperatura + 100}\" y=\"175\" fill=\"#ff00ff\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">${temperatura}\u00b0C<\/text>\r\n            <line x1=\"${temperatura + 100}\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"${temperatura + 100}\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#ff00ff\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\" opacity=\"0.5\" \/>\r\n        <\/svg>\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    container.innerHTML = svg;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction agregarLogDB(mensaje) {\r\n    const log = document.getElementById('db-log');\r\n    const entrada = document.createElement('div');\r\n    entrada.className = 'log-entrada';\r\n    entrada.textContent = `[${new Date().toLocaleTimeString().slice(0, 5)}] ${mensaje}`;\r\n    log.appendChild(entrada);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Limitar a 8 entradas\r\n    while (log.children.length > 8) {\r\n        log.removeChild(log.firstChild);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    log.scrollTop = log.scrollHeight;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction exportarAnalisis() {\r\n    const selector = document.getElementById('sustancia-select');\r\n    const temperatura = document.getElementById('temperatura-slider').value;\r\n    const sustancia = datosNIST[selector.value];\r\n    \r\n    const datos = {\r\n        sustancia: sustancia.nombre,\r\n        formula: sustancia.formula,\r\n        temperatura: `${temperatura}\u00b0C`,\r\n        densidad: document.getElementById('resultado-densidad').textContent,\r\n        fusion: document.getElementById('resultado-fusion').textContent,\r\n        ebullicion: document.getElementById('resultado-ebullicion').textContent,\r\n        conductividad: document.getElementById('resultado-conductividad').textContent,\r\n        estado: document.getElementById('resultado-estado').textContent,\r\n        fecha: new Date().toLocaleString(),\r\n        fuente: \"NIST 2025 - Sistema Cyber-Edu\"\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    const blob = new Blob([JSON.stringify(datos, null, 2)], { type: 'application\/json' });\r\n    const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\r\n    \r\n    const a = document.createElement('a');\r\n    a.href = url;\r\n    a.download = `analisis-${sustancia.nombre.replace(\/\\s+\/g, '-')}-${new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}.json`;\r\n    document.body.appendChild(a);\r\n    a.click();\r\n    document.body.removeChild(a);\r\n    URL.revokeObjectURL(url);\r\n    \r\n    alert('\ud83d\udcca An\u00e1lisis exportado exitosamente');\r\n    actualizarProgreso(3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== QUIZ ==========\r\nlet respuestasQuiz = 0;\r\nlet totalPreguntas = 3; \/\/ Solo 3 preguntas visibles inicialmente\r\n\r\nfunction inicializarQuiz() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.opcion').forEach(opcion => {\r\n        opcion.addEventListener('click', manejarRespuesta);\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction manejarRespuesta(e) {\r\n    const opcion = e.currentTarget;\r\n    const pregunta = opcion.closest('.quiz-pregunta');\r\n    const respuestaCorrecta = pregunta.dataset.correcta;\r\n    const opcionSeleccionada = opcion.dataset.opcion;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Deshabilitar todas las opciones de esta pregunta\r\n    pregunta.querySelectorAll('.opcion').forEach(o => {\r\n        o.style.pointerEvents = 'none';\r\n        if (o.dataset.opcion === respuestaCorrecta) {\r\n            o.style.background = 'rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.2)';\r\n            o.style.borderColor = 'var(--neon-concepto)';\r\n        } else if (o.dataset.opcion === opcionSeleccionada && opcionSeleccionada !== respuestaCorrecta) {\r\n            o.style.background = 'rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.2)';\r\n            o.style.borderColor = 'var(--neon-evaluacion)';\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n    const feedback = pregunta.querySelector('.pregunta-feedback');\r\n    if (feedback) {\r\n        if (opcionSeleccionada === respuestaCorrecta) {\r\n            respuestasQuiz++;\r\n            feedback.querySelector('.feedback-correcto').style.display = 'block';\r\n            feedback.querySelector('.feedback-incorrecto').style.display = 'none';\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback.querySelector('.feedback-correcto').style.display = 'none';\r\n            feedback.querySelector('.feedback-incorrecto').style.display = 'block';\r\n        }\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Verificar si todas respondidas\r\n    verificarCompletacionQuiz();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction verificarCompletacionQuiz() {\r\n    const preguntas = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-pregunta');\r\n    const respondidas = Array.from(preguntas).filter(p => \r\n        Array.from(p.querySelectorAll('.opcion')).some(o => o.style.pointerEvents === 'none')\r\n    ).length;\r\n    \r\n    if (respondidas === totalPreguntas) {\r\n        mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const porcentaje = Math.round((respuestasQuiz \/ totalPreguntas) * 100);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar displays\r\n    document.getElementById('puntaje-porcentaje').textContent = `${porcentaje}%`;\r\n    document.getElementById('correctas-contador').textContent = `${respuestasQuiz}\/${totalPreguntas}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('precision-quiz').textContent = `${porcentaje}%`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Determinar nivel\r\n    let nivel = '';\r\n    if (porcentaje >= 90) nivel = 'Excelente';\r\n    else if (porcentaje >= 70) nivel = 'Bueno';\r\n    else if (porcentaje >= 50) nivel = 'Satisfactorio';\r\n    else nivel = 'Necesita mejorar';\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('nivel-quiz').textContent = nivel;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Feedback general\r\n    let feedback = '';\r\n    if (porcentaje >= 90) {\r\n        feedback = '\ud83c\udfc6 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas completamente la clasificaci\u00f3n de propiedades f\u00edsicas.';\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 70) {\r\n        feedback = '\u2705 Buen trabajo. Tienes una comprensi\u00f3n s\u00f3lida de los conceptos principales.';\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 50) {\r\n        feedback = '\u26a0\ufe0f Satisfactorio. Revisa las diferencias entre propiedades intensivas y extensivas.';\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = '\ud83d\udcda Necesitas estudiar m\u00e1s. Revisa los conceptos fundamentales y practica con ejemplos.';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('feedback-general').textContent = feedback;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Feedback espec\u00edfico\r\n    const especifico = document.getElementById('feedback-especifico');\r\n    especifico.innerHTML = `\r\n        <p><strong>\u00c1reas a reforzar:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n        <ul style=\"text-align: left; margin: 10px 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\r\n            <li>Clasificaci\u00f3n intensiva\/extensiva<\/li>\r\n            <li>Uso de datos NIST 2025<\/li>\r\n            <li>C\u00e1lculo de propiedades<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <p>Revisa el cat\u00e1logo de propiedades y practica con el simulador.<\/p>\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar c\u00edrculo de progreso\r\n    const circulo = document.getElementById('circular-progreso');\r\n    circulo.style.background = `conic-gradient(var(--neon-concepto) ${porcentaje}%, #333 ${porcentaje}% 100%)`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar resultados\r\n    document.getElementById('quiz-resultados').style.display = 'block';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar progreso general\r\n    actualizarProgreso(porcentaje \/ 4);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar auto-evaluaci\u00f3n\r\n    actualizarAutoEvaluacion(porcentaje);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarAutoEvaluacion(porcentaje) {\r\n    const puntajes = {\r\n        identificacion: Math.min(5, Math.floor(porcentaje \/ 20)),\r\n        nist: Math.min(5, Math.floor(porcentaje \/ 25)),\r\n        calculo: Math.min(5, Math.floor(porcentaje \/ 30)),\r\n        estados: Math.min(5, Math.floor(porcentaje \/ 25))\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar displays\r\n    Object.keys(puntajes).forEach(key => {\r\n        const elemento = document.getElementById(`puntaje-${key}`);\r\n        const barra = document.getElementById(`bar-${key}`);\r\n        \r\n        if (elemento) {\r\n            elemento.textContent = `${puntajes[key]}\/5`;\r\n        }\r\n        if (barra) {\r\n            barra.style.width = `${puntajes[key] * 20}%`;\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    respuestasQuiz = 0;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Resetear preguntas\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-pregunta').forEach(pregunta => {\r\n        pregunta.querySelectorAll('.opcion').forEach(opcion => {\r\n            opcion.style.pointerEvents = 'auto';\r\n            opcion.style.background = '';\r\n            opcion.style.borderColor = '';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        const feedback = pregunta.querySelector('.pregunta-feedback');\r\n        if (feedback) {\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'none';\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n    document.getElementById('quiz-resultados').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction verSoluciones() {\r\n    alert('\ud83d\udd0d SOLUCIONES DEL QUIZ:\\n\\n1. B) Densidad del agua (propiedad intensiva)\\n2. C) -38.83\u00b0C (punto de fusi\u00f3n del mercurio)\\n3. D) 8.90 g\/cm\u00b3 (c\u00e1lculo de densidad)\\n\\nRevisa el cat\u00e1logo de propiedades para m\u00e1s ejemplos.');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== PROBLEMAS ==========\r\nfunction inicializarProblemas() {\r\n    window.verificarProblema = function(numero) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion-${numero}`);\r\n        if (solucion) {\r\n            solucion.style.display = 'block';\r\n            actualizarProgreso(4);\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== FUNCIONES DE CIERRE ==========\r\nfunction generarCertificado() {\r\n    const porcentaje = progresoTotal;\r\n    const fecha = new Date().toLocaleDateString();\r\n    \r\n    const certificado = `\r\n        \u2554\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2557\r\n        \u2551        CERTIFICADO DE APRENDIZAJE     \u2551\r\n        \u2551       PROPIEDADES F\u00cdSICAS - QU\u00cdMICA   \u2551\r\n        \u2560\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2563\r\n        \u2551                                       \u2551\r\n        \u2551  \ud83d\udcca Nivel alcanzado: ${porcentaje}%   \u2551\r\n        \u2551  \u2697\ufe0f Dominio de conceptos:             \u2551\r\n        \u2551     \u2022 Clasificaci\u00f3n propiedades       \u2551\r\n        \u2551     \u2022 An\u00e1lisis con datos NIST 2025    \u2551\r\n        \u2551     \u2022 C\u00e1lculo de propiedades          \u2551\r\n        \u2551     \u2022 Estados de la materia           \u2551\r\n        \u2551                                       \u2551\r\n        \u2551  \ud83c\udfaf Sistema Cyber-Edu                 \u2551\r\n        \u2551  \ud83d\udcc5 Fecha: ${fecha}                   \u2551\r\n        \u2551                                       \u2551\r\n        \u255a\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u255d\r\n    `;\r\n    \r\n    alert('\ud83c\udfc6 CERTIFICADO GENERADO\\n\\n' + certificado);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Guardar certificado\r\n    localStorage.setItem('certificado_propiedades', JSON.stringify({\r\n        fecha: new Date().toISOString(),\r\n        porcentaje: porcentaje,\r\n        materia: 'Propiedades F\u00edsicas'\r\n    }));\r\n    \r\n    actualizarProgreso(10);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction exportarResultados() {\r\n    const resultados = {\r\n        progresoTotal: progresoTotal,\r\n        fecha: new Date().toISOString(),\r\n        materia: 'Propiedades F\u00edsicas',\r\n        competencias: {\r\n            identificacion: document.getElementById('puntaje-identificacion').textContent,\r\n            nist: document.getElementById('puntaje-nist').textContent,\r\n            calculo: document.getElementById('puntaje-calculo').textContent,\r\n            estados: document.getElementById('puntaje-estados').textContent\r\n        },\r\n        reflexion: document.getElementById('reflexion-texto').value || 'No guardada'\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    const blob = new Blob([JSON.stringify(resultados, null, 2)], { type: 'application\/json' });\r\n    const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\r\n    \r\n    const a = document.createElement('a');\r\n    a.href = url;\r\n    a.download = `resultados-propiedades-${new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}.json`;\r\n    document.body.appendChild(a);\r\n    a.click();\r\n    document.body.removeChild(a);\r\n    URL.revokeObjectURL(url);\r\n    \r\n    alert('\ud83d\udce4 Resultados exportados exitosamente');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction guardarReflexion() {\r\n    const texto = document.getElementById('reflexion-texto').value;\r\n    if (texto.trim().length > 10) {\r\n        localStorage.setItem('reflexion_propiedades', texto);\r\n        alert('\u2705 Reflexi\u00f3n guardada exitosamente');\r\n        actualizarProgreso(3);\r\n    } else {\r\n        alert('\u26a0\ufe0f Escribe al menos 10 caracteres para guardar tu reflexi\u00f3n');\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========== ANIMACIONES Y EFECTOS ==========\r\n\/\/ Efecto glitch para t\u00edtulos\r\nconst glitchElements = document.querySelectorAll('.cyber-glitch');\r\nglitchElements.forEach(element => {\r\n    setInterval(() => {\r\n        if (Math.random() > 0.9) {\r\n            element.style.textShadow = `\r\n                ${Math.random() * 4 - 2}px ${Math.random() * 4 - 2}px 0 #ff00ff,\r\n                ${Math.random() * 4 - 2}px ${Math.random() * 4 - 2}px 0 #00ffff\r\n            `;\r\n            element.style.color = Math.random() > 0.5 ? '#ff00ff' : '#00ffff';\r\n        } else {\r\n            element.style.textShadow = '0 0 10px currentColor';\r\n            element.style.color = '';\r\n        }\r\n    }, 100);\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Efecto de part\u00edculas sutil\r\nfunction crearParticulas() {\r\n    const container = document.querySelector('.leccion-cyber.quimica-propiedades');\r\n    if (!container) return;\r\n    \r\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) {\r\n        const particula = document.createElement('div');\r\n        particula.className = 'particula';\r\n        particula.style.cssText = `\r\n            position: fixed;\r\n            width: 1px;\r\n            height: 1px;\r\n            background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.3);\r\n            border-radius: 50%;\r\n            pointer-events: none;\r\n            z-index: 1;\r\n            left: ${Math.random() * 100}%;\r\n            top: ${Math.random() * 100}%;\r\n            animation: float ${5 + Math.random() * 10}s infinite linear;\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        const keyframes = `\r\n            @keyframes float {\r\n                0% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); opacity: 0; }\r\n                10% { opacity: 0.5; }\r\n                90% { opacity: 0.5; }\r\n                100% { transform: translate(${Math.random() * 100 - 50}px, ${Math.random() * 100 - 50}px) scale(0); opacity: 0; }\r\n            }\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        const style = document.createElement('style');\r\n        style.textContent = keyframes;\r\n        document.head.appendChild(style);\r\n        \r\n        container.appendChild(particula);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Iniciar efectos despu\u00e9s de carga\r\nsetTimeout(crearParticulas, 1000);\r\n\r\nconsole.log('[SISTEMA] Configuraci\u00f3n completada. Sistema Cyber-Propiedades listo.');\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Propiedad f\u00edsica ejemplo","respuesta":"Densidad, punto fusi\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"No cambia composici\u00f3n","respuesta":"S\u00ed"},{"enunciado":"Intensiva\/extensiva","respuesta":"Densidad intensiva, volumen extensiva"},{"enunciado":"Densidad agua 4\u00b0C","respuesta":"0.999972 g\/cm\u00b3"},{"enunciado":"Punto ebullici\u00f3n etanol","respuesta":"78.37\u00b0C"},{"enunciado":"Conductividad t\u00e9rmica agua","respuesta":"0.606 W\/m\u00b7K"},{"enunciado":"F\u00f3rmula densidad","respuesta":"\\(\\rho = \\frac{m}{V}\\)"},{"enunciado":"Cambio f\u00edsico","respuesta":"Fusi\u00f3n, evaporaci\u00f3n, disoluci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Solubilidad NaCl en agua","respuesta":"35.9 g\/100 mL (20\u00b0C)"},{"enunciado":"NIST: P.F. H\u2082O exacto","respuesta":"0.000\u00b0C"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC: P.E. Hg","respuesta":"356.73\u00b0C"},{"enunciado":"Diamante: conductividad el\u00e9ctrica","respuesta":"Aislante (10\u207b\u00b9\u2074 S\/m)"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Propiedades f\u00edsicas miden...","opciones":["Sin cambio composici\u00f3n","Con cambio","Reacci\u00f3n","Explosi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Sin cambio composici\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Ejemplo f\u00edsica","opciones":["Solubilidad","Inflamabilidad","Acidez","Oxidaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Solubilidad"},{"pregunta":"Densidad es...","opciones":["Intensiva","Extensiva","Qu\u00edmica","Nada"],"correcta":"Intensiva"},{"pregunta":"Conductividad t\u00e9rmica","opciones":["F\u00edsica","Qu\u00edmica","Nuclear","Biol\u00f3gica"],"correcta":"F\u00edsica"},{"pregunta":"Volumen es...","opciones":["Extensiva","Intensiva","Qu\u00edmica","F\u00edsica"],"correcta":"Extensiva"},{"pregunta":"Punto fusi\u00f3n es...","opciones":["Intensiva","Extensiva","Qu\u00edmica","Nada"],"correcta":"Intensiva"},{"pregunta":"Cambio f\u00edsico","opciones":["Fusi\u00f3n","Combusti\u00f3n","Reacci\u00f3n","\u00d3xido"],"correcta":"Fusi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Estado con forma fija","opciones":["S\u00f3lido","L\u00edquido","Gas","Plasma"],"correcta":"S\u00f3lido"},{"pregunta":"Agua hierve a...","opciones":["100\u00b0C","0\u00b0C","-38\u00b0C","356\u00b0C"],"correcta":"100\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Mercurio es...","opciones":["L\u00edquido a 25\u00b0C","S\u00f3lido","Gas","Plasma"],"correcta":"L\u00edquido a 25\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Densidad agua 4\u00b0C","opciones":["0.999972 g\/cm\u00b3","1.000 g\/cm\u00b3","0.5 g\/cm\u00b3","13.5 g\/cm\u00b3"],"correcta":"0.999972 g\/cm\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"Punto ebullici\u00f3n etanol","opciones":["78.37\u00b0C","100\u00b0C","0\u00b0C","356\u00b0C"],"correcta":"78.37\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Conductividad t\u00e9rmica cobre","opciones":["~400 W\/m\u00b7K","0.6 W\/m\u00b7K","0.02 W\/m\u00b7K","0 W\/m\u00b7K"],"correcta":"~400 W\/m\u00b7K"},{"pregunta":"Solubilidad NaCl 20\u00b0C","opciones":["35.9 g\/100 mL","100 g","0 g","1 g"],"correcta":"35.9 g\/100 mL"},{"pregunta":"Diamante es...","opciones":["Aislante el\u00e9ctrico","Conductor","Semiconductor","Superconductor"],"correcta":"Aislante el\u00e9ctrico"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula densidad","opciones":["\\(\\rho = m\/V\\)","\\(\\rho = V\/m\\)","\\(\\rho = m+V\\)","\\(\\rho = 0\\)"],"correcta":"\\(\\rho = m\/V\\)"},{"pregunta":"Calor latente fusi\u00f3n H\u2082O","opciones":["334 J\/g","2260 J\/g","0 J\/g","100 J\/g"],"correcta":"334 J\/g"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC: P.F. Hg","opciones":["-38.83\u00b0C","0\u00b0C","100\u00b0C","356\u00b0C"],"correcta":"-38.83\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Estado plasma contiene...","opciones":["Iones + e\u207b","Mol\u00e9culas","\u00c1tomos","Nada"],"correcta":"Iones + e\u207b"},{"pregunta":"Viscosidad es...","opciones":["F\u00edsica intensiva","Qu\u00edmica","Extensiva","Masa"],"correcta":"F\u00edsica intensiva"},{"pregunta":"NIST: P.E. H\u2082O exacto","opciones":["99.974\u00b0C","100.000\u00b0C","99.000\u00b0C","100.974\u00b0C"],"correcta":"99.974\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Densidad Hg 20\u00b0C","opciones":["13.534 g\/cm\u00b3","1.000 g\/cm\u00b3","0.789 g\/cm\u00b3","3.515 g\/cm\u00b3"],"correcta":"13.534 g\/cm\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"Conductividad el\u00e9ctrica Au","opciones":["4.1\u00d710\u2077 S\/m","5.5\u00d710\u207b\u2076 S\/m","0 S\/m","10\u00b9\u2074 S\/m"],"correcta":"4.1\u00d710\u2077 S\/m"},{"pregunta":"Calor espec\u00edfico agua","opciones":["4.184 J\/g\u00b7\u00b0C","0.606 J\/g\u00b7\u00b0C","2.080 J\/g\u00b7\u00b0C","0.385 J\/g\u00b7\u00b0C"],"correcta":"4.184 J\/g\u00b7\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Punto cr\u00edtico H\u2082O","opciones":["374\u00b0C, 218 atm","100\u00b0C, 1 atm","0\u00b0C, 1 atm","647 K, 22.1 MPa"],"correcta":"374\u00b0C, 218 atm"},{"pregunta":"Diamante: P.F. estimado","opciones":["3550\u00b0C","100\u00b0C","0\u00b0C","1064\u00b0C"],"correcta":"3550\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"\u00cdndice refracci\u00f3n agua","opciones":["1.333","1.000","2.417","0.5"],"correcta":"1.333"},{"pregunta":"Superfluidez en...","opciones":["He-4 < 2.17 K","H\u2082O","Hg","Au"],"correcta":"He-4 < 2.17 K"},{"pregunta":"Ley de Dulong-Petit aplica a...","opciones":["S\u00f3lidos","Gases","L\u00edquidos","Plasma"],"correcta":"S\u00f3lidos"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC define P.E. como...","opciones":["T a 1 atm","T a 0\u00b0C","T a 100\u00b0C","T cr\u00edtica"],"correcta":"T a 1 atm"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"estados-materia-transiciones","titulo":"Estados de la Materia y Transiciones de Fase: El Ciclo Energ\u00e9tico Cu\u00e1ntico","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-quimica-estados\" data-tema=\"estados-materia\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n            ESTADOS DE LA MATERIA Y TRANSICIONES\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            An\u00e1lisis cu\u00e1ntico de fusi\u00f3n, sublimaci\u00f3n y calor latente\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Identificar los 4 estados principales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Diferenciar s\u00f3lido, l\u00edquido, gas y plasma por sus propiedades<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar 6 transiciones de fase<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Comprender fusi\u00f3n, evaporaci\u00f3n, sublimaci\u00f3n y sus inversas<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Calcular calor latente<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Aplicar \\( Q = m \\cdot \\Delta H \\) en problemas reales<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Interpretar diagramas de fase<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Localizar puntos triple y cr\u00edtico en gr\u00e1ficos P-T<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Criogenia Espacial<\/h3>\r\n                <p>La NASA usa sublimaci\u00f3n de CO\u2082 para refrigerar instrumentos en el espacio profundo (-78.5\u00b0C)<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">\u0394H_sub = 571 J\/g<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfed Plantas Nucleares<\/h3>\r\n                <p>El calor latente de evaporaci\u00f3n del agua (2260 J\/g) mueve turbinas de 500 MW<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Eficiencia: 33%<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83e\uddca Almacenamiento T\u00e9rmico<\/h3>\r\n                <p>El hielo se usa para almacenar energ\u00eda fr\u00eda en sistemas de aire acondicionado<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">\u0394H_fusi\u00f3n = 334 J\/g<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- ESTADOS DE LA MATERIA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Los Cuatro Estados Principales<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"concept-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"concept-card estado-solido\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd37 S\u00d3LIDO<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Forma:<\/strong> Fija<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Volumen:<\/strong> Constante<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Compresibilidad:<\/strong> Nula<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica:<\/strong> Baja<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo\">Ejemplo: Diamante, hielo a 0\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"concept-card estado-liquido\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udca7 L\u00cdQUIDO<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Forma:<\/strong> Variable<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Volumen:<\/strong> Constante<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Compresibilidad:<\/strong> Baja<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica:<\/strong> Media<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo\">Ejemplo: Agua a 25\u00b0C, mercurio<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"concept-card estado-gas\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udca8 GAS<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Forma:<\/strong> Variable<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Volumen:<\/strong> Variable<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Compresibilidad:<\/strong> Alta<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica:<\/strong> Alta<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo\">Ejemplo: Vapor a 100\u00b0C, aire<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"concept-card estado-plasma\">\r\n                    <h4>\u26a1 PLASMA<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Forma:<\/strong> Variable<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Volumen:<\/strong> Variable<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Compresibilidad:<\/strong> Alta<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica:<\/strong> Muy alta<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo\">Ejemplo: Sol, ne\u00f3n en letreros<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TRANSICIONES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Transiciones de Fase<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>TRANSICI\u00d3N<\/th>\r\n                            <th>DIRECCI\u00d3N<\/th>\r\n                            <th>ENERG\u00cdA<\/th>\r\n                            <th>EJEMPLO<\/th>\r\n                            <th>T\u00b0 (H\u2082O)<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr data-transicion=\"fusion\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">FUSI\u00d3N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>S\u00f3lido \u2192 L\u00edquido<\/td>\r\n                            <td class=\"energia-absorbe\">ABSORBE<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Hielo \u2192 Agua<\/td>\r\n                            <td>0\u00b0C<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-transicion=\"congelacion\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">CONGELACI\u00d3N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>L\u00edquido \u2192 S\u00f3lido<\/td>\r\n                            <td class=\"energia-libera\">LIBERA<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Agua \u2192 Hielo<\/td>\r\n                            <td>0\u00b0C<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-transicion=\"evaporacion\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">EVAPORACI\u00d3N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>L\u00edquido \u2192 Gas<\/td>\r\n                            <td class=\"energia-absorbe\">ABSORBE<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Agua \u2192 Vapor<\/td>\r\n                            <td>100\u00b0C<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-transicion=\"condensacion\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">CONDENSACI\u00d3N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Gas \u2192 L\u00edquido<\/td>\r\n                            <td class=\"energia-libera\">LIBERA<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Vapor \u2192 Agua<\/td>\r\n                            <td>100\u00b0C<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-transicion=\"sublimacion\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">SUBLIMACI\u00d3N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>S\u00f3lido \u2192 Gas<\/td>\r\n                            <td class=\"energia-absorbe\">ABSORBE<\/td>\r\n                            <td>CO\u2082 s\u00f3lido \u2192 Gas<\/td>\r\n                            <td>-78.5\u00b0C<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-transicion=\"deposicion\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">DEPOSICI\u00d3N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Gas \u2192 S\u00f3lido<\/td>\r\n                            <td class=\"energia-libera\">LIBERA<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Vapor \u2192 Escarcha<\/td>\r\n                            <td><0\u00b0C<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoTransicion\">\r\n                    Selecciona una transici\u00f3n para m\u00e1s detalles\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- CALOR LATENTE -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Calor Latente: La Energ\u00eda Oculta<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-grande\">\r\n                \\[\r\n                Q = m \\cdot \\Delta H\r\n                \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-explicacion\">\r\n                <p><strong>Q:<\/strong> Calor transferido (Joules)<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>m:<\/strong> Masa de la sustancia (gramos)<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>\u0394H:<\/strong> Calor latente espec\u00edfico (J\/g)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"datos-calor-latente\">\r\n                <h4>Valores de Calor Latente<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"datos-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-card\">\r\n                        <h5>AGUA (H\u2082O)<\/h5>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-valor\">\u0394H_fusi\u00f3n = 334 J\/g<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-valor\">\u0394H_vaporizaci\u00f3n = 2260 J\/g<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-nota\">A 1 atm, punto est\u00e1ndar<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-card\">\r\n                        <h5>DI\u00d3XIDO DE CARBONO (CO\u2082)<\/h5>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-valor\">\u0394H_sublimaci\u00f3n = 571 J\/g<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-valor\">T_sublimaci\u00f3n = -78.5\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-nota\">\"Hielo seco\"<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-card\">\r\n                        <h5>ALCOHOL (C\u2082H\u2085OH)<\/h5>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-valor\">\u0394H_vaporizaci\u00f3n = 855 J\/g<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-valor\">Pto. ebullici\u00f3n = 78.4\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-nota\">Menor que el agua<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> SIMULADOR: TRANSICIONES DE FASE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"transiciones-fase\">\r\n            <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"sustancia\">Sustancia:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"sustancia\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"agua\">Agua (H\u2082O)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"co2\">Di\u00f3xido de Carbono (CO\u2082)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"etanol\">Etanol (C\u2082H\u2085OH)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"masa\">Masa (g):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"masa\" min=\"10\" max=\"1000\" value=\"100\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <div class=\"control-value\" id=\"valorMasa\">100 g<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"transicion\">Transici\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"transicion\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"fusion\">Fusi\u00f3n (S\u00f3lido \u2192 L\u00edquido)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"vaporizacion\">Evaporaci\u00f3n (L\u00edquido \u2192 Gas)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"sublimacion\">Sublimaci\u00f3n (S\u00f3lido \u2192 Gas)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"condensacion\">Condensaci\u00f3n (Gas \u2192 L\u00edquido)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"temperatura\">Temperatura (\u00b0C):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"temperatura\" min=\"-100\" max=\"400\" value=\"25\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <div class=\"control-value\" id=\"valorTemp\">25\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-simular\" onclick=\"ejecutarSimulacion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u26a1<\/span> CALCULAR ENERG\u00cdA\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarSimulacion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacion\">\r\n                <div class=\"vis-container\">\r\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" id=\"svgSimulador\">\r\n                        <!-- Fondo din\u00e1mico -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\" id=\"fondoSimulador\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Estados (se actualizan din\u00e1micamente) -->\r\n                        <g id=\"estadoInicial\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"150\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"#2196F3\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"110\" y=\"210\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\">S\u00d3LIDO<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <g id=\"estadoFinal\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"200\" r=\"70\" fill=\"#FF4081\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"450\" y=\"200\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\">GAS<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Flecha de transici\u00f3n -->\r\n                        <path id=\"flechaTransicion\" d=\"M200 210 L400 210\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"4\" \r\n                              marker-end=\"url(#arrowHead)\" opacity=\"0\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Energ\u00eda transferida -->\r\n                        <text id=\"textoEnergia\" x=\"300\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#00FFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" \r\n                              font-size=\"16\" opacity=\"0\">Q = 0 J<\/text>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Definiciones SVG -->\r\n                        <defs>\r\n                            <marker id=\"arrowHead\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                                <path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#39FF14\"\/>\r\n                            <\/marker>\r\n                        <\/defs>\r\n                    <\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"vis-info\" id=\"infoSimulacion\">\r\n                    Selecciona par\u00e1metros y haz clic en \"CALCULAR ENERG\u00cdA\"\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Sustancia:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataSustancia\">H\u2082O<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Transici\u00f3n:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTransicion\">Fusi\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Calor Latente:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataDeltaH\">334 J\/g<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">ENERG\u00cdA TOTAL:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value grande\" id=\"dataEnergia\">0 J<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Estado Inicial:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEstadoIni\">S\u00f3lido<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Estado Final:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEstadoFin\">L\u00edquido<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"formula-mini\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    Q = m \\cdot \\Delta H\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l transici\u00f3n de fase absorbe energ\u00eda?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Congelaci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Sublimaci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Condensaci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Deposici\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> La sublimaci\u00f3n (s\u00f3lido \u2192 gas) ABSORBE energ\u00eda para romper enlaces intermoleculares.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> La sublimaci\u00f3n requiere energ\u00eda (endot\u00e9rmica), mientras congelaci\u00f3n, condensaci\u00f3n y deposici\u00f3n liberan energ\u00eda (exot\u00e9rmicas).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Las transiciones que aumentan el desorden (s\u00f3lido\u2192l\u00edquido\u2192gas) absorben calor latente. Las que disminuyen el desorden liberan calor.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Calcula la energ\u00eda para fundir 50g de hielo (\u0394H_fusi\u00f3n = 334 J\/g)<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        6,680 J\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        11,700 J\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        16,700 J\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        22,600 J\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> 16,700 J aplicando \\( Q = m \\cdot \\Delta H = 50 \\times 334 \\)\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la f\u00f3rmula \\( Q = m \\cdot \\Delta H \\)\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> \r\n                        \\[\r\n                        Q = m \\cdot \\Delta H = 50\\,g \\times 334\\,\\frac{J}{g} = 16,700\\,J\r\n                        \\]\r\n                        Se necesitan 16.7 kJ para fundir 50g de hielo a 0\u00b0C.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 sucede en el punto triple del agua?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Solo existe como gas\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Hierve instant\u00e1neamente\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Se vuelve plasma\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Coexisten s\u00f3lido, l\u00edquido y gas\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> En el punto triple (0.01\u00b0C, 611.7 Pa) coexisten hielo, agua y vapor en equilibrio.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> El punto triple es una condici\u00f3n \u00fanica de temperatura y presi\u00f3n donde tres fases coexisten.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Dato:<\/strong> El punto triple del agua es un est\u00e1ndar internacional para calibrar term\u00f3metros: 0.01\u00b0C a 611.657 Pa.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES Y SOLUCIONES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR CALOR LATENTE CON CALOR SENSIBLE<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"Para calentar hielo de -10\u00b0C a 10\u00b0C, solo uso \u0394T\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Se necesita calor sensible (cambiar T) Y calor latente (cambiar fase)\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        Q_{total} = m \\cdot c_s \\cdot \\Delta T_{hielo} + m \\cdot \\Delta H_{fus} + m \\cdot c_l \\cdot \\Delta T_{agua}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Practica:<\/strong> Calcula el calor para convertir 100g de hielo a -20\u00b0C en agua a 25\u00b0C<\/p>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                            \\( Q = 100 \\times 2.09 \\times 20 + 100 \\times 334 + 100 \\times 4.18 \\times 25 = 4,180 + 33,400 + 10,450 = 48,030\\,J \\)\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CREER QUE LA SUBLIMACI\u00d3N ES RARA<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"La sublimaci\u00f3n solo ocurre con el CO\u2082\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Muchas sustancias subliman en condiciones normales:\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Yodo (I\u2082) a temperatura ambiente<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Naftalina (bolas de naftalina)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Ars\u00e9nico en ciertas condiciones<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Problema de C\u00e1lculo de Energ\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un estudiante calienta 250g de agua desde 20\u00b0C hasta que se evapora completamente a 100\u00b0C. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Calor para elevar la temperatura a 100\u00b0C (c_agua = 4.18 J\/g\u00b0C)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Calor para evaporar el agua (\u0394H_vap = 2260 J\/g)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Energ\u00eda total requerida<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu desarrollo aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"6\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. \\( Q_1 = 250 \\times 4.18 \\times 80 = 83,600\\,J \\)<br>\r\n                    2. \\( Q_2 = 250 \\times 2260 = 565,000\\,J \\)<br>\r\n                    3. \\( Q_{total} = 83,600 + 565,000 = 648,600\\,J = 648.6\\,kJ \\)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Problema de Interpretaci\u00f3n de Diagrama<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Observa este diagrama de fases simplificado del CO\u2082:<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"diagrama-mini\">\r\n                        <!-- Mini diagrama SVG -->\r\n                        <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 150\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n                            <!-- Ejes -->\r\n                            <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                            <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                            <!-- Puntos -->\r\n                            <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"80\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#FF4081\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"100\" y=\"75\" fill=\"#00FFFF\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pto. Triple<\/text>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"40\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#FF4081\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"35\" fill=\"#00FFFF\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pto. Cr\u00edtico<\/text>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p>\u00bfA qu\u00e9 presi\u00f3n y temperatura el CO\u2082 puede sublimar directamente?<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-opciones\">\r\n                    <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"p2\" value=\"A\"> Por debajo del punto triple<\/label><br>\r\n                    <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"p2\" value=\"B\"> En el punto cr\u00edtico<\/label><br>\r\n                    <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"p2\" value=\"C\"> Por encima del punto cr\u00edtico<\/label><br>\r\n                    <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"p2\" value=\"D\"> Solo a presi\u00f3n atmosf\u00e9rica<\/label>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR RESPUESTA<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Respuesta correcta: A<\/strong><br>\r\n                    El CO\u2082 sublima a presiones por debajo de su punto triple (5.1 atm, -56.6\u00b0C). A 1 atm, sublima a -78.5\u00b0C.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Aplicaci\u00f3n de f\u00f3rmulas<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Usa correctamente Q=m\u00b7\u0394H y considera todas las etapas<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Usa f\u00f3rmula pero omite alguna etapa<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No aplica f\u00f3rmula correctamente<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Interpretaci\u00f3n diagramas<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Identifica puntos triple\/cr\u00edtico y sus implicaciones<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Reconoce elementos b\u00e1sicos del diagrama<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No interpreta correctamente el diagrama<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Unidades y precisi\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Usa unidades correctas y responde con precisi\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Comete errores menores en unidades<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores graves en unidades o c\u00e1lculos<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n de estados de la materia:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>C\u00e1lculo de calor latente:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Interpretaci\u00f3n de diagramas de fase:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo explicas a un compa\u00f1ero la diferencia entre calor latente y calor sensible?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfD\u00f3nde has observado transiciones de fase en tu vida diaria?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tus ejemplos...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd04 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Memorizar las 6 transiciones de fase<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Recordar f\u00f3rmula Q = m\u00b7\u0394H<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Revisar valores de \u0394H para agua<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcaa PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Resolver 5 problemas de calor latente<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Dibujar diagrama de fases del agua<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Completar el quiz interactivo<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\ude80 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Investigar punto cr\u00edtico de otras sustancias<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Analizar aplicaciones industriales<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Resolver problemas tipo examen<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/sims\/html\/states-of-matter\/latest\/states-of-matter_es.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf10 Simulador PhET: Estados de la Materia\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.nist.gov\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcca NIST: Datos termodin\u00e1micos oficiales\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/es.khanacademy.org\/science\/chemistry\/states-of-matter\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf93 Khan Academy: Curso completo\r\n                <\/a>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n    <script>\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE SIMULACI\u00d3N INTERACTIVA\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Datos de sustancias\r\n    const sustancias = {\r\n        agua: {\r\n            nombre: \"Agua (H\u2082O)\",\r\n            fusion: 334,\r\n            vaporizacion: 2260,\r\n            sublimacion: null,\r\n            tempFusion: 0,\r\n            tempEbullicion: 100\r\n        },\r\n        co2: {\r\n            nombre: \"CO\u2082\",\r\n            fusion: 184,\r\n            vaporizacion: null,\r\n            sublimacion: 571,\r\n            tempFusion: -56.6,\r\n            tempSublimacion: -78.5\r\n        },\r\n        etanol: {\r\n            nombre: \"Etanol\",\r\n            fusion: 109,\r\n            vaporizacion: 855,\r\n            sublimacion: null,\r\n            tempFusion: -114,\r\n            tempEbullicion: 78.4\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Estados iniciales y finales seg\u00fan transici\u00f3n\r\n    const estadosTransicion = {\r\n        fusion: { inicial: \"S\u00d3LIDO\", final: \"L\u00cdQUIDO\", colorIni: \"#2196F3\", colorFin: \"#00BCD4\" },\r\n        vaporizacion: { inicial: \"L\u00cdQUIDO\", final: \"GAS\", colorIni: \"#00BCD4\", colorFin: \"#FF4081\" },\r\n        sublimacion: { inicial: \"S\u00d3LIDO\", final: \"GAS\", colorIni: \"#2196F3\", colorFin: \"#FF4081\" },\r\n        condensacion: { inicial: \"GAS\", final: \"L\u00cdQUIDO\", colorIni: \"#FF4081\", colorFin: \"#00BCD4\" }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    function ejecutarSimulacion() {\r\n        console.log(\"\ud83d\udd27 Ejecutando simulaci\u00f3n...\");\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Obtener valores\r\n        const sustancia = document.getElementById('sustancia').value;\r\n        const masa = parseInt(document.getElementById('masa').value);\r\n        const transicion = document.getElementById('transicion').value;\r\n        const temperatura = parseInt(document.getElementById('temperatura').value);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Validar\r\n        if (masa <= 0) {\r\n            alert(\"\u26a0\ufe0f La masa debe ser mayor que cero\");\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Calcular energ\u00eda\r\n        let deltaH = 0;\r\n        const sust = sustancias[sustancia];\r\n        \r\n        switch(transicion) {\r\n            case 'fusion':\r\n                deltaH = sust.fusion;\r\n                break;\r\n            case 'vaporizacion':\r\n                deltaH = sust.vaporizacion;\r\n                break;\r\n            case 'sublimacion':\r\n                deltaH = sust.sublimacion;\r\n                break;\r\n            case 'condensacion':\r\n                deltaH = sust.vaporizacion;\r\n                break;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        if (!deltaH) {\r\n            alert(\"\u26a0\ufe0f Esta sustancia no tiene valor para esta transici\u00f3n\");\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        const energia = masa * deltaH;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n        actualizarVisualizacion(transicion, masa, deltaH, energia);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos en tiempo real\r\n        document.getElementById('dataSustancia').textContent = sust.nombre;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataTransicion').textContent = \r\n            transicion.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + transicion.slice(1);\r\n        document.getElementById('dataDeltaH').textContent = deltaH + \" J\/g\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEnergia').textContent = energia.toLocaleString() + \" J\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEstadoIni').textContent = estadosTransicion[transicion].inicial;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEstadoFin').textContent = estadosTransicion[transicion].final;\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcca Resultado: Q = ${masa}g \u00d7 ${deltaH}J\/g = ${energia}J`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function actualizarVisualizacion(transicion, masa, deltaH, energia) {\r\n        const svg = document.getElementById('svgSimulador');\r\n        const estados = estadosTransicion[transicion];\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar colores\r\n        document.getElementById('estadoInicial').querySelector('rect').setAttribute('fill', estados.colorIni);\r\n        document.getElementById('estadoFinal').querySelector('circle').setAttribute('fill', estados.colorFin);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar textos\r\n        const textoIni = document.getElementById('estadoInicial').querySelector('text');\r\n        const textoFin = document.getElementById('estadoFinal').querySelector('text');\r\n        textoIni.textContent = estados.inicial;\r\n        textoFin.textContent = estados.final;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Animar flecha\r\n        const flecha = document.getElementById('flechaTransicion');\r\n        flecha.style.opacity = 1;\r\n        flecha.style.animation = \"dashArrow 2s infinite\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar energ\u00eda\r\n        const textoEnergia = document.getElementById('textoEnergia');\r\n        textoEnergia.textContent = `Q = ${energia.toLocaleString()} J`;\r\n        textoEnergia.style.opacity = 1;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Cambiar color de fondo seg\u00fan energ\u00eda\r\n        const fondo = document.getElementById('fondoSimulador');\r\n        const intensidad = Math.min(energia \/ 100000, 0.3);\r\n        fondo.style.fill = `rgba(10, 10, 26, ${1 - intensidad})`;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarSimulacion() {\r\n        console.log(\"\ud83d\udd04 Reiniciando simulaci\u00f3n...\");\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Restaurar valores por defecto\r\n        document.getElementById('masa').value = 100;\r\n        document.getElementById('valorMasa').textContent = \"100 g\";\r\n        document.getElementById('temperatura').value = 25;\r\n        document.getElementById('valorTemp').textContent = \"25\u00b0C\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n        document.getElementById('flechaTransicion').style.opacity = 0;\r\n        document.getElementById('textoEnergia').style.opacity = 0;\r\n        document.getElementById('fondoSimulador').style.fill = \"#0a0a1a\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Restaurar datos\r\n        document.getElementById('dataSustancia').textContent = \"H\u2082O\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataTransicion').textContent = \"Fusi\u00f3n\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataDeltaH').textContent = \"334 J\/g\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEnergia').textContent = \"0 J\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEstadoIni').textContent = \"S\u00f3lido\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEstadoFin').textContent = \"L\u00edquido\";\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoSimulacion').textContent = \r\n            \"Par\u00e1metros reiniciados. Selecciona nuevos valores.\";\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar valores de sliders en tiempo real\r\n    document.getElementById('masa').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n        document.getElementById('valorMasa').textContent = this.value + \" g\";\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('temperatura').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n        document.getElementById('valorTemp').textContent = this.value + \"\u00b0C\";\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    let quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n    \r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n            \r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            verificarCompletadoQuiz();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    function verificarCompletadoQuiz() {\r\n        const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n        const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q => \r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n        \r\n        if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n        const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n        \r\n        let feedback = \"\";\r\n        if (porcentaje >= 80) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas los conceptos clave.\";\r\n        } else if (porcentaje >= 60) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero revisa los errores.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas repasar los fundamentos.\";\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        quizRespuestas = [];\r\n        quizCompletado = false;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE ERRORES COMUNES\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function toggleError(header) {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n        \r\n        if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        } else {\r\n            content.style.display = 'block';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function verificarProblema(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n        const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n        const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n        \r\n        const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n        \r\n        alert(`\ud83d\udcca AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Estados de materia: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `C\u00e1lculo calor latente: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Diagramas de fase: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Revisa el plan de estudio recomendado seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcbe AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada: ${slider1}, ${slider2}, ${slider3}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Sistema Cyberpunk Educativo inicializado\");\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\udcda Lecci\u00f3n: Estados de la Materia y Transiciones\");\r\n    console.log(\"\u26a1 Simulador, Quiz y Herramientas interactivas listas\");\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar controles en tiempo real\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.control-slider').forEach(slider => {\r\n        slider.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n            const valueDisplay = this.nextElementSibling;\r\n            if (valueDisplay && valueDisplay.classList.contains('control-value')) {\r\n                if (this.id === 'temperatura') {\r\n                    valueDisplay.textContent = this.value + \"\u00b0C\";\r\n                } else {\r\n                    valueDisplay.textContent = this.value + \" g\";\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Objetivos interactivos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n            this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n            const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n            checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n            checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : '';\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Tabla interactiva\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(row => {\r\n        row.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const transicion = this.dataset.transicion;\r\n            const info = document.getElementById('infoTransicion');\r\n            \r\n            const infoTextos = {\r\n                fusion: \"Fusi\u00f3n: S\u00f3lido \u2192 L\u00edquido. Absorbe energ\u00eda para romper estructura cristalina.\",\r\n                congelacion: \"Congelaci\u00f3n: L\u00edquido \u2192 S\u00f3lido. Libera energ\u00eda al formar enlaces.\",\r\n                evaporacion: \"Evaporaci\u00f3n: L\u00edquido \u2192 Gas. Absorbe mucha energ\u00eda para separar mol\u00e9culas.\",\r\n                condensacion: \"Condensaci\u00f3n: Gas \u2192 L\u00edquido. Libera energ\u00eda al formar enlaces.\",\r\n                sublimacion: \"Sublimaci\u00f3n: S\u00f3lido \u2192 Gas. Absorbe energ\u00eda, salta fase l\u00edquida.\",\r\n                deposicion: \"Deposici\u00f3n: Gas \u2192 S\u00f3lido. Libera energ\u00eda, forma cristales directamente.\"\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            info.textContent = infoTextos[transicion] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\";\r\n            info.style.animation = \"highlight 0.5s\";\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            document.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(r => {\r\n                r.classList.remove('selected');\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Marcar fila seleccionada\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    <\/script>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"S\u00f3lido a l\u00edquido","respuesta":"Fusi\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Gas a s\u00f3lido","respuesta":"Deposici\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"S\u00f3lido a gas","respuesta":"Sublimaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Calor fusi\u00f3n H\u2082O","respuesta":"334 J\/g"},{"enunciado":"Calor evaporaci\u00f3n H\u2082O","respuesta":"2260 J\/g"},{"enunciado":"Punto triple H\u2082O","respuesta":"0.01\u00b0C, 611.7 Pa"},{"enunciado":"Ejemplo sublimaci\u00f3n","respuesta":"Hielo seco (CO\u2082)"},{"enunciado":"Plasma en","respuesta":"Estrellas, l\u00e1mparas ne\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"F\u00f3rmula calor latente","respuesta":"\\(Q = m \\Delta H\\)"},{"enunciado":"Punto cr\u00edtico H\u2082O","respuesta":"374\u00b0C, 22.1 MPa"},{"enunciado":"NIST: P.F. CO\u2082","respuesta":"-78.5\u00b0C (sublimaci\u00f3n)"},{"enunciado":"Q para evaporar 18g H\u2082O","respuesta":"40,680 J"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Sublimaci\u00f3n es...","opciones":["S\u00f3lido \u2192 Gas","Gas \u2192 L\u00edquido","L\u00edquido \u2192 S\u00f3lido","Plasma"],"correcta":"S\u00f3lido \u2192 Gas"},{"pregunta":"Congelaci\u00f3n","opciones":["L\u00edquido \u2192 S\u00f3lido","S\u00f3lido \u2192 L\u00edquido","Gas \u2192 S\u00f3lido","Todo"],"correcta":"L\u00edquido \u2192 S\u00f3lido"},{"pregunta":"Plasma es...","opciones":["Gas ionizado","S\u00f3lido","L\u00edquido","Gas normal"],"correcta":"Gas ionizado"},{"pregunta":"Evaporaci\u00f3n requiere...","opciones":["Calor","Fr\u00edo","Presi\u00f3n","Luz"],"correcta":"Calor"},{"pregunta":"Estado con forma fija","opciones":["S\u00f3lido","L\u00edquido","Gas","Plasma"],"correcta":"S\u00f3lido"},{"pregunta":"Hielo seco hace...","opciones":["Sublimaci\u00f3n","Fusi\u00f3n","Condensaci\u00f3n","Ionizaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Sublimaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Punto triple es...","opciones":["3 fases coexisten","2 fases","1 fase","Ninguna"],"correcta":"3 fases coexisten"},{"pregunta":"Calor latente es...","opciones":["Energ\u00eda oculta","Temperatura","Masa","Volumen"],"correcta":"Energ\u00eda oculta"},{"pregunta":"Agua hierve a...","opciones":["100\u00b0C (1 atm)","0\u00b0C","-78\u00b0C","374\u00b0C"],"correcta":"100\u00b0C (1 atm)"},{"pregunta":"Deposici\u00f3n forma...","opciones":["Escarcha","Lluvia","Nieve l\u00edquida","Vapor"],"correcta":"Escarcha"},{"pregunta":"Calor fusi\u00f3n H\u2082O","opciones":["334 J\/g","2260 J\/g","571 J\/g","0 J\/g"],"correcta":"334 J\/g"},{"pregunta":"Calor evaporaci\u00f3n H\u2082O","opciones":["2260 J\/g","334 J\/g","184 J\/g","0 J\/g"],"correcta":"2260 J\/g"},{"pregunta":"Punto triple H\u2082O","opciones":["0.01\u00b0C","0.00\u00b0C","100\u00b0C","374\u00b0C"],"correcta":"0.01\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Sublimaci\u00f3n CO\u2082 a","opciones":["-78.5\u00b0C","0\u00b0C","100\u00b0C","356\u00b0C"],"correcta":"-78.5\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Q = m\u00b7\u0394H es...","opciones":["Calor latente","Calor sensible","Trabajo","Entrop\u00eda"],"correcta":"Calor latente"},{"pregunta":"Punto cr\u00edtico elimina...","opciones":["Distinci\u00f3n l\u00edquido\/gas","S\u00f3lido","Plasma","Masa"],"correcta":"Distinci\u00f3n l\u00edquido\/gas"},{"pregunta":"Fusi\u00f3n es...","opciones":["Endot\u00e9rmica","Exot\u00e9rmica","Isot\u00e9rmica","Adiab\u00e1tica"],"correcta":"Endot\u00e9rmica"},{"pregunta":"Condensaci\u00f3n es...","opciones":["Exot\u00e9rmica","Endot\u00e9rmica","Nuclear","F\u00edsica"],"correcta":"Exot\u00e9rmica"},{"pregunta":"Plasma conduce...","opciones":["Electricidad","Calor","Luz","Sonido"],"correcta":"Electricidad"},{"pregunta":"Diagrama de fases muestra...","opciones":["P vs T","m vs V","Q vs t","E vs m"],"correcta":"P vs T"},{"pregunta":"Punto cr\u00edtico H\u2082O","opciones":["374\u00b0C, 22.1 MPa","100\u00b0C, 1 atm","0.01\u00b0C, 611 Pa","647 K, 22.1 MPa"],"correcta":"374\u00b0C, 22.1 MPa"},{"pregunta":"Q para sublimar 44g CO\u2082","respuesta":"25,124 J","opciones":["25,124 J","8,096 J","14,784 J","0 J"],"correcta":"25,124 J"},{"pregunta":"Punto triple CO\u2082","opciones":["-56.6\u00b0C, 5.11 atm","0.01\u00b0C, 611 Pa","-78.5\u00b0C, 1 atm","100\u00b0C, 1 atm"],"correcta":"-56.6\u00b0C, 5.11 atm"},{"pregunta":"Calor latente m\u00e1s alto","opciones":["Evaporaci\u00f3n H\u2082O","Fusi\u00f3n H\u2082O","Sublimaci\u00f3n CO\u2082","Fusi\u00f3n Na"],"correcta":"Evaporaci\u00f3n H\u2082O"},{"pregunta":"Supercr\u00edtico es...","opciones":["M\u00e1s all\u00e1 punto cr\u00edtico","Debajo punto triple","En plasma","En vac\u00edo"],"correcta":"M\u00e1s all\u00e1 punto cr\u00edtico"},{"pregunta":"Ionizaci\u00f3n en plasma requiere...","opciones":["Alta T o campo E","Baja T","Presi\u00f3n","Luz"],"correcta":"Alta T o campo E"},{"pregunta":"Diagrama de fases agua inclinada por...","opciones":["Puente H","Enlaces i\u00f3nicos","Van der Waals","Covalentes"],"correcta":"Puente H"},{"pregunta":"Calor sensible cambia...","opciones":["Temperatura","Estado","Masa","Volumen"],"correcta":"Temperatura"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC define punto ebullici\u00f3n a...","opciones":["1 atm","1 bar","0\u00b0C","100 kPa"],"correcta":"1 atm"},{"pregunta":"Bose-Einstein condensado es...","opciones":["5\u00ba estado (T\u22480K)","Plasma","L\u00edquido","Gas"],"correcta":"5\u00ba estado (T\u22480K)"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"clasificacion-materia","titulo":"Clasificaci\u00f3n de la Materia: El \u00c1rbol Cu\u00e1ntico de la Qu\u00edmica","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-quimica-clasificacion\" data-tema=\"clasificacion-materia\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83c\udf33<\/span>\r\n            CLASIFICACI\u00d3N DE LA MATERIA\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            El \u00c1rbol Cu\u00e1ntico: De los Elementos a las Mezclas\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Diferenciar materia pura y mezclas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Identificar elementos, compuestos, mezclas homog\u00e9neas y heterog\u00e9neas<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Seleccionar m\u00e9todos de separaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Elegir el m\u00e9todo f\u00edsico adecuado seg\u00fan las propiedades de la mezcla<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Interpretar el \u00e1rbol de clasificaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Navegar el diagrama jer\u00e1rquico completo de la materia<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar en contextos reales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Clasificar sustancias cotidianas y procesos industriales<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfed Refinaci\u00f3n de Petr\u00f3leo<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Destilaci\u00f3n fraccionada separa mezclas complejas en gasolina, diesel, queroseno<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">6 m\u00e9todos de separaci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83e\uddea An\u00e1lisis Cl\u00ednico<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Cromatograf\u00eda separa componentes de la sangre para diagn\u00f3stico m\u00e9dico<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Sensibilidad: 0.001 mg<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udca7 Tratamiento de Aguas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Filtraci\u00f3n, decantaci\u00f3n y evaporaci\u00f3n potabilizan agua para consumo<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">99.9% impurezas removidas<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- INTRODUCCI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. El Gran \u00c1rbol de la Materia<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udf0c MATERIA<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Todo lo que tiene <strong>masa<\/strong> y ocupa <strong>volumen<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[ \\text{Materia} = \\text{Masa} + \\text{Volumen} \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"clasificacion-doble\">\r\n                <div class=\"clas-card pureza\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83e\uddea MATERIA PURA<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Composici\u00f3n constante y definida<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Propiedades fijas (punto de fusi\u00f3n, densidad)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>No se separa por m\u00e9todos f\u00edsicos<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Oro (Au), Agua destilada (H\u2082O), Di\u00f3xido de carbono (CO\u2082)\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"clas-card mezcla\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd00 MEZCLA<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Composici\u00f3n variable<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Propiedades dependen de proporciones<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Separable por m\u00e9todos f\u00edsicos<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Aire, Agua de mar, Acero, Caf\u00e9 con leche\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- MATERIA PURA DETALLADA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Materia Pura: Elementos y Compuestos<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"comparativa-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"comp-card elemento\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\u269b\ufe0f ELEMENTO<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"comp-badge\">\u00c1tomos id\u00e9nticos<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Definici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Sustancia formada por un solo tipo de \u00e1tomo<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Representaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> S\u00edmbolo qu\u00edmico (1-2 letras)<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Separaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> No separable qu\u00edmicamente en sustancias m\u00e1s simples<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"simbolo\">O\u2082<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"nombre\">Ox\u00edgeno molecular<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"tipo\">Gas diat\u00f3mico<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"simbolo\">Au<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"nombre\">Oro<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"tipo\">Metal noble<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"simbolo\">C (diamante)<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"nombre\">Carbono<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"tipo\">Al\u00f3tropo<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"comp-card compuesto\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83e\uddec COMPUESTO<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"comp-badge\">\u00c1tomos diferentes<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Definici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Sustancia formada por dos o m\u00e1s elementos en proporci\u00f3n fija<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Representaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> F\u00f3rmula qu\u00edmica<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Separaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Requiere reacci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"formula\">H\u2082O<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"nombre\">Agua<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"elementos\">Hidr\u00f3geno + Ox\u00edgeno<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"formula\">NaCl<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"nombre\">Cloruro de sodio<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"elementos\">Sodio + Cloro<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"formula\">CO\u2082<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"nombre\">Di\u00f3xido de carbono<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"elementos\">Carbono + Ox\u00edgeno<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"regla-oro\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udcd0 REGLA DE ORO: PURA vs MEZCLA<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"regla-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"regla-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-icon\">\ud83e\uddea<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Materia Pura:<\/strong> Temperatura constante durante cambio de fase\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"regla-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-icon\">\ud83d\udd00<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Mezcla:<\/strong> Temperatura cambia durante cambio de fase\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- MEZCLAS DETALLADAS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Mezclas: Homog\u00e9neas y Heterog\u00e9neas<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>TIPO<\/th>\r\n                            <th>VISIBILIDAD<\/th>\r\n                            <th>COMPOSICI\u00d3N<\/th>\r\n                            <th>FASES<\/th>\r\n                            <th>EJEMPLOS COTIDIANOS<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"homogenea\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">HOMOG\u00c9NEA<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Una sola fase visible<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Uniforme en toda la muestra<\/td>\r\n                            <td>1<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Aire, Agua de mar, Acero, Gasolina<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"heterogenea\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">HETEROG\u00c9NEA<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>M\u00faltiples fases visibles<\/td>\r\n                            <td>No uniforme, var\u00eda por regi\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                            <td>2 o m\u00e1s<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Ensalada, Granito, Agua con aceite, Sopa con fideos<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoMezcla\">\r\n                    Selecciona un tipo de mezcla para m\u00e1s detalles\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"mezcla-ejemplos\">\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-detalle\" id=\"detalleHomogenea\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd0d An\u00e1lisis: Mezcla Homog\u00e9nea<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udf21\ufe0f SOLUCIONES<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Mezcla homog\u00e9nea a nivel molecular o i\u00f3nico<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"componentes\">\r\n                                <span class=\"soluto\">Soluto<\/span> + <span class=\"solvente\">Solvente<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\u2697\ufe0f ALCANOS<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Mezclas de hidrocarburos que se comportan como sustancia \u00fanica<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Gas natural: CH\u2084 + C\u2082H\u2086 + C\u2083H\u2088<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-detalle\" id=\"detalleHeterogenea\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd0d An\u00e1lisis: Mezcla Heterog\u00e9nea<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83e\udd63 SUSPENSIONES<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Part\u00edculas s\u00f3lidas suspendidas en l\u00edquido, sedimentan<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Agua turbia, Jugo con pulpa<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udca7 EMULSIONES<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>L\u00edquidos inmiscibles mezclados temporalmente<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Mayonesa, Leche (gotas de grasa)<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- M\u00c9TODOS DE SEPARACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. M\u00e9todos de Separaci\u00f3n F\u00edsicos<\/h3>\r\n            <p class=\"principio-clave\">\r\n                <strong>Principio clave:<\/strong> Los m\u00e9todos f\u00edsicos separan mezclas sin cambiar la identidad qu\u00edmica de los componentes\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"metodos-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"filtracion\">\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\ud83e\uddf4<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>FILTRACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                        Separaci\u00f3n s\u00f3lido-l\u00edquido usando medio poroso\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Tama\u00f1o part\u00edcula<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Caf\u00e9 en filtro de papel<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Tama\u00f1o m\u00ednimo:<\/strong> 1 \u03bcm<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"destilacion\">\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>DESTILACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                        Separaci\u00f3n l\u00edquido-l\u00edquido por diferencia en puntos de ebullici\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Punto ebullici\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Alcohol + agua<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>\u0394T m\u00ednima:<\/strong> 25\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"decantacion\">\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\ud83d\udca7<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>DECANTACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                        Separaci\u00f3n l\u00edquido-l\u00edquido por diferencia de densidades\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Densidad<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Aceite + agua<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>\u0394\u03c1 m\u00ednima:<\/strong> 0.1 g\/mL<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"cromatografia\">\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\ud83c\udfa8<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>CROMATOGRAF\u00cdA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                        Separaci\u00f3n por diferencia en afinidad por fases m\u00f3vil y estacionaria\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Afinidad<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Pigmentos de tinta<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Resoluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> 0.01 \u03bcg<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"centrifugacion\">\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\ud83c\udf00<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>CENTRIFUGACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                        Separaci\u00f3n acelerada por fuerza centr\u00edfuga\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Densidad + fuerza G<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Plasma sangu\u00edneo<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Fuerza:<\/strong> 1000-15000 G<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"evaporacion\">\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\u2600\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>EVAPORACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                        Separaci\u00f3n s\u00f3lido-l\u00edquido por vaporizaci\u00f3n del solvente\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Volatilidad<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Sal de mar<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Eficiencia:<\/strong> 95-99%<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"selector-metodo\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udd27 SELECTOR DE M\u00c9TODO DE SEPARACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"selector-controls\">\r\n                    <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                        <label for=\"tipoMezcla\">Tipo de mezcla:<\/label>\r\n                        <select id=\"tipoMezcla\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                            <option value=\"solido-liquido\">S\u00f3lido-L\u00edquido<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"liquido-liquido\">L\u00edquido-L\u00edquido<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"solido-solido\">S\u00f3lido-S\u00f3lido<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"gas-liquido\">Gas-L\u00edquido<\/option>\r\n                        <\/select>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                        <label for=\"propiedad\">Propiedad diferencial:<\/label>\r\n                        <select id=\"propiedad\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                            <option value=\"tamano\">Tama\u00f1o part\u00edcula<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"ebullicion\">Punto ebullici\u00f3n<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"densidad\">Densidad<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"afinidad\">Afinidad qu\u00edmica<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"solubilidad\">Solubilidad<\/option>\r\n                        <\/select>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <button class=\"btn-recomendar\" onclick=\"recomendarMetodo()\">\r\n                        \u26a1 RECOMENDAR M\u00c9TODO\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"recomendacion\" id=\"recomendacionMetodo\">\r\n                    Selecciona par\u00e1metros y haz clic en \"RECOMENDAR M\u00c9TODO\"\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> SIMULADOR: \u00c1RBOL DE CLASIFICACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"arbol-clasificacion\">\r\n            <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"sustanciaInput\">Sustancia:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"sustanciaInput\" class=\"control-input\" \r\n                           placeholder=\"Ej: Agua, Aire, Oro\" \r\n                           list=\"sustanciasList\">\r\n                    <datalist id=\"sustanciasList\">\r\n                        <option value=\"Agua (H\u2082O)\">Agua (H\u2082O)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Aire\">Aire<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Oro (Au)\">Oro (Au)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Sal (NaCl)\">Sal (NaCl)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Petr\u00f3leo\">Petr\u00f3leo<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Acero\">Acero<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Caf\u00e9 con leche\">Caf\u00e9 con leche<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Alcohol + Agua\">Alcohol + Agua<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Aceite + Agua\">Aceite + Agua<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Granito\">Granito<\/option>\r\n                    <\/datalist>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"propiedades\">Propiedades conocidas:<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"checkbox-group\">\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"propiedades\" value=\"composicionFija\"> Composici\u00f3n fija<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"propiedades\" value=\"puntoFusionFijo\"> Punto fusi\u00f3n fijo<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"propiedades\" value=\"fasesVisibles\"> M\u00faltiples fases visibles<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"propiedades\" value=\"separacionFisica\"> Separable f\u00edsicamente<\/label>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-clasificar\" onclick=\"clasificarSustancia()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd0d<\/span> CLASIFICAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"sustanciaAleatoria()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> SUSTANCIA ALEATORIA\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarClasificador()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DEL \u00c1RBOL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacionArbol\">\r\n                <div class=\"arbol-container\">\r\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 500\" id=\"svgArbol\">\r\n                        <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"500\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\" id=\"fondoArbol\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- MATERIA -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoMateria\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"250\" y=\"30\" width=\"100\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1976D2\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"55\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\">MATERIA<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">Masa + Volumen<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- RAMAS -->\r\n                        <path id=\"ramaPura\" d=\"M300 90 L300 130\" stroke=\"#4CAF50\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                        <path id=\"ramaMezcla\" d=\"M300 90 L300 130\" stroke=\"#FF9800\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- PURA -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoPura\" opacity=\"0.5\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"140\" width=\"100\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"165\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">PURA<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- RAMAS PURA -->\r\n                        <path id=\"ramaElemento\" d=\"M200 190 L200 230\" stroke=\"#8BC34A\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        <path id=\"ramaCompuesto\" d=\"M200 190 L200 230\" stroke=\"#66BB6A\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- ELEMENTO -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoElemento\" opacity=\"0.5\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"260\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#8BC34A\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"150\" y=\"260\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">ELEMENTO<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- COMPUESTO -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoCompuesto\" opacity=\"0.5\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"180\" y=\"240\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"210\" y=\"260\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">COMPUESTO<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- MEZCLA -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoMezcla\" opacity=\"0.5\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"350\" y=\"140\" width=\"100\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FF9800\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"400\" y=\"165\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">MEZCLA<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- RAMAS MEZCLA -->\r\n                        <path id=\"ramaHomogenea\" d=\"M400 190 L400 230\" stroke=\"#FFB300\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        <path id=\"ramaHeterogenea\" d=\"M400 190 L400 230\" stroke=\"#FF8F00\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- HOMOG\u00c9NEA -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoHomogenea\" opacity=\"0.5\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"350\" y=\"240\" width=\"100\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFB300\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"400\" y=\"260\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">HOMOG\u00c9NEA<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- HETEROG\u00c9NEA -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoHeterogenea\" opacity=\"0.5\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"350\" y=\"290\" width=\"100\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FF8F00\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"400\" y=\"310\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">HETEROG\u00c9NEA<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- RESULTADO -->\r\n                        <g id=\"resultadoClasificacion\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"200\" y=\"350\" width=\"200\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#9C27B0\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"375\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" id=\"textoResultado\">RESULTADO<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"395\" fill=\"#E1BEE7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" id=\"textoDetalle\">Detalles aqu\u00ed<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                    <\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"arbol-info\" id=\"infoArbol\">\r\n                    Ingresa una sustancia y haz clic en \"CLASIFICAR\"\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>DATOS DE CLASIFICACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Sustancia:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataSustancia\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Categor\u00eda principal:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataCategoria\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Subcategor\u00eda:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataSubcategoria\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">M\u00c9TODO SEPARACI\u00d3N:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataMetodo\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Propiedad clave:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPropiedad\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Ejemplos similares:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEjemplos\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcca ESTAD\u00cdSTICAS<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Elementos conocidos:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">118<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Compuestos identificados:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">>200M<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Mezclas cotidianas:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">\u221e<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es una propiedad exclusiva de la materia pura?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Temperatura variable durante ebullici\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Composici\u00f3n que var\u00eda con el tiempo\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Punto de fusi\u00f3n constante y definido\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Separable por m\u00e9todos f\u00edsicos simples\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> La materia pura tiene puntos de fusi\u00f3n y ebullici\u00f3n constantes.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa las propiedades distintivas de la materia pura vs mezclas.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La materia pura (elementos y compuestos) tiene propiedades f\u00edsicas constantes. Las mezclas tienen propiedades que dependen de su composici\u00f3n y muestran cambios de temperatura durante cambios de fase.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 m\u00e9todo usar\u00edas para separar arena y agua?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Destilaci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Filtraci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Cromatograf\u00eda\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Centrifugaci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Filtraci\u00f3n es ideal para separar s\u00f3lidos insolubles de l\u00edquidos.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Considera la diferencia en tama\u00f1o de part\u00edcula entre arena y agua.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La arena es un s\u00f3lido insoluble con tama\u00f1o de part\u00edcula grande (>1 \u03bcm). La filtraci\u00f3n usa un medio poroso que retiene s\u00f3lidos y deja pasar el l\u00edquido. La destilaci\u00f3n ser\u00eda ineficiente, la cromatograf\u00eda innecesariamente compleja.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l de estas es una mezcla homog\u00e9nea?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Granito\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Ensalada\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Aceite y agua\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Aire seco\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> El aire seco es una mezcla homog\u00e9nea de gases (78% N\u2082, 21% O\u2082).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Las mezclas homog\u00e9neas tienen composici\u00f3n uniforme en toda la muestra.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Dato:<\/strong> El aire es una mezcla homog\u00e9nea gaseosa. Granito y ensalada son heterog\u00e9neas (se ven componentes diferentes). Aceite y agua forman una mezcla heterog\u00e9nea (dos fases l\u00edquidas inmiscibles).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES Y SOLUCIONES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR COMPUESTO CON MEZCLA<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"El agua de mar es un compuesto porque tiene f\u00f3rmula NaCl + H\u2082O\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Agua de mar es una MEZCLA (composici\u00f3n variable), NaCl es un COMPUESTO (proporci\u00f3n fija 1:1)\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        \\text{Compuesto: NaCl (fijo)} \\quad \\text{Mezcla: Agua de mar (variable)}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Practica:<\/strong> Clasifica: Bronce, Di\u00f3xido de carbono, Mayonesa, Oro 24k<\/p>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                            <strong>Bronce:<\/strong> Mezcla homog\u00e9nea (Cu + Sn)<br>\r\n                            <strong>CO\u2082:<\/strong> Compuesto (proporci\u00f3n fija C:O = 1:2)<br>\r\n                            <strong>Mayonesa:<\/strong> Mezcla heterog\u00e9nea (emulsi\u00f3n)<br>\r\n                            <strong>Oro 24k:<\/strong> Elemento (Au puro)\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c ELEGIR M\u00c9TODO INCORRECTO DE SEPARACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"Para separar sal y agua uso filtraci\u00f3n\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La sal est\u00e1 DISUELTA (tama\u00f1o i\u00f3nico). M\u00e9todos correctos:\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Evaporaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Para obtener sal s\u00f3lida<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Destilaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Para recuperar agua pura<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                        <table>\r\n                            <tr><th>Si el s\u00f3lido es...<\/th><th>M\u00e9todo adecuado<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Insoluble (arena)<\/td><td>FILTRACI\u00d3N<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Soluble (sal)<\/td><td>EVAPORACI\u00d3N \/ DESTILACI\u00d3N<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <\/table>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Problema de Clasificaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Clasifica las siguientes sustancias en el \u00e1rbol de clasificaci\u00f3n completo:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Acero inoxidable (Fe + Cr + Ni)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Diamante (C)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Gasolina (mezcla de hidrocarburos)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Agua destilada (H\u2082O)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Leche entera<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Justifica cada clasificaci\u00f3n indicando al menos dos propiedades que respalden tu decisi\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu clasificaci\u00f3n y justificaci\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. <strong>Acero:<\/strong> Mezcla homog\u00e9nea (soluci\u00f3n s\u00f3lida, composici\u00f3n variable, propiedades dependen de %)<br>\r\n                    2. <strong>Diamante:<\/strong> Elemento (\u00e1tomos de C puro, propiedades fijas, no separable)<br>\r\n                    3. <strong>Gasolina:<\/strong> Mezcla homog\u00e9nea (l\u00edquido uniforme, punto ebullici\u00f3n variable)<br>\r\n                    4. <strong>Agua destilada:<\/strong> Compuesto (H\u2082O puro, propiedades constantes, relaci\u00f3n 2:1 fija)<br>\r\n                    5. <strong>Leche:<\/strong> Mezcla heterog\u00e9nea (emulsi\u00f3n, fases visibles al microscopio, separable por centrifugaci\u00f3n)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Problema de Separaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Tienes una mezcla que contiene:<\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Arena (s\u00f3lido insoluble)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Sal (NaCl soluble)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Limaduras de hierro<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Agua<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <p>Dise\u00f1a un procedimiento paso a paso para separar los cuatro componentes, indicando:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Orden de separaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                        <li>M\u00e9todo utilizado en cada paso<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Principio f\u00edsico aplicado<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Estado final de cada componente<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Describe tu procedimiento de separaci\u00f3n...\" rows=\"10\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR PROCEDIMIENTO<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Procedimiento recomendado:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. <strong>Im\u00e1n:<\/strong> Separar limaduras de hierro (propiedad magn\u00e9tica)<br>\r\n                    2. <strong>Filtraci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Separar arena del agua salada (diferencia tama\u00f1o)<br>\r\n                    3. <strong>Evaporaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Separar sal del agua (diferencia volatilidad)<br><br>\r\n                    <strong>Componentes finales:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 Limaduras de hierro: S\u00f3lido magn\u00e9tico seco<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Arena: S\u00f3lido granular seco<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Sal: S\u00f3lido cristalino seco<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Agua: Vapor condensado (si se usa destilaci\u00f3n)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Clasificaci\u00f3n correcta<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Clasifica todas correctamente con justificaci\u00f3n s\u00f3lida<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Clasifica mayor\u00eda correctamente con alguna justificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores graves en clasificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Selecci\u00f3n m\u00e9todos separaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Propone procedimiento \u00f3ptimo en orden l\u00f3gico<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Propone procedimiento funcional con alg\u00fan error<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Procedimiento incorrecto o incompleto<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Fundamentaci\u00f3n cient\u00edfica<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explica principios f\u00edsicos en cada paso<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Menciona algunos principios<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No fundamenta decisiones<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Clasificaci\u00f3n materia pura vs mezclas:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Selecci\u00f3n m\u00e9todos de separaci\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Navegaci\u00f3n \u00e1rbol de clasificaci\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es importante diferenciar entre materia pura y mezclas en la vida cotidiana?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Describe un proceso de separaci\u00f3n que observes en tu entorno y explica su principio f\u00edsico.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu ejemplo...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd04 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Memorizar 4 categor\u00edas principales<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Recordar 6 m\u00e9todos de separaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Diferenciar elemento vs compuesto<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcaa PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Clasificar 20 sustancias cotidianas<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Resolver 5 problemas de separaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Completar el quiz interactivo<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\ude80 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Investigar aplicaciones industriales<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Analizar m\u00e9todos avanzados (HPLC)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Resolver problemas tipo examen<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/legacy\/mixtures-and-solutions\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf10 Simulador PhET: Mezclas y Soluciones\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.iupac.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcca IUPAC: Nomenclatura y clasificaci\u00f3n oficial\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/es.khanacademy.org\/science\/chemistry\/states-of-matter-and-intermolecular-forces\/mixtures-and-solutions\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf93 Khan Academy: Mezclas y soluciones\r\n                <\/a>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n    <script>\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE CLASIFICACI\u00d3N INTERACTIVA\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Base de datos de sustancias\r\n    const sustanciasDB = {\r\n        \"Agua (H\u2082O)\": {\r\n            categoria: \"PURA\",\r\n            subcategoria: \"COMPUESTO\",\r\n            metodo: \"Destilaci\u00f3n (si es impura)\",\r\n            propiedad: \"Punto ebullici\u00f3n constante (100\u00b0C)\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"H\u2082O\u2082, D\u2082O, CO\u2082\",\r\n            color: \"#66BB6A\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"Aire\": {\r\n            categoria: \"MEZCLA\",\r\n            subcategoria: \"HOMOG\u00c9NEA\",\r\n            metodo: \"Destilaci\u00f3n fraccionada\",\r\n            propiedad: \"Composici\u00f3n uniforme\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"Gas natural, Mezclas de gases\",\r\n            color: \"#FFB300\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"Oro (Au)\": {\r\n            categoria: \"PURA\",\r\n            subcategoria: \"ELEMENTO\",\r\n            metodo: \"No aplica (puro)\",\r\n            propiedad: \"Propiedades constantes\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"Plata (Ag), Cobre (Cu), Hierro (Fe)\",\r\n            color: \"#8BC34A\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"Sal (NaCl)\": {\r\n            categoria: \"PURA\",\r\n            subcategoria: \"COMPUESTO\",\r\n            metodo: \"Cristalizaci\u00f3n (de soluciones)\",\r\n            propiedad: \"Composici\u00f3n fija Na:Cl = 1:1\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"KCl, CaCl\u2082, MgCl\u2082\",\r\n            color: \"#66BB6A\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"Petr\u00f3leo\": {\r\n            categoria: \"MEZCLA\",\r\n            subcategoria: \"HETEROG\u00c9NEA\",\r\n            metodo: \"Destilaci\u00f3n fraccionada\",\r\n            propiedad: \"M\u00faltiples fases, composici\u00f3n variable\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"Aceite crudo, Alquitr\u00e1n\",\r\n            color: \"#FF8F00\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"Acero\": {\r\n            categoria: \"MEZCLA\",\r\n            subcategoria: \"HOMOG\u00c9NEA\",\r\n            metodo: \"No separable f\u00edsicamente\",\r\n            propiedad: \"Soluci\u00f3n s\u00f3lida uniforme\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"Bronce, Lat\u00f3n, Aleaciones\",\r\n            color: \"#FFB300\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"Caf\u00e9 con leche\": {\r\n            categoria: \"MEZCLA\",\r\n            subcategoria: \"HETEROG\u00c9NEA\",\r\n            metodo: \"Filtraci\u00f3n (caf\u00e9) + Centrifugaci\u00f3n (leche)\",\r\n            propiedad: \"Fases visibles bajo microscopio\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"T\u00e9 con leche, Chocolate caliente\",\r\n            color: \"#FF8F00\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"Alcohol + Agua\": {\r\n            categoria: \"MEZCLA\",\r\n            subcategoria: \"HOMOG\u00c9NEA\",\r\n            metodo: \"Destilaci\u00f3n\",\r\n            propiedad: \"Diferencia puntos ebullici\u00f3n\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"Etanol+Agua, Metanol+Agua\",\r\n            color: \"#FFB300\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"Aceite + Agua\": {\r\n            categoria: \"MEZCLA\",\r\n            subcategoria: \"HETEROG\u00c9NEA\",\r\n            metodo: \"Decantaci\u00f3n\",\r\n            propiedad: \"Diferencia densidades\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"Vinagre+aceite, L\u00edquidos inmiscibles\",\r\n            color: \"#FF8F00\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"Granito\": {\r\n            categoria: \"MEZCLA\",\r\n            subcategoria: \"HETEROG\u00c9NEA\",\r\n            metodo: \"Separaci\u00f3n magn\u00e9tica + Flotaci\u00f3n\",\r\n            propiedad: \"M\u00faltiples minerales visibles\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"M\u00e1rmol, Basalto, Rocas compuestas\",\r\n            color: \"#FF8F00\"\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ M\u00e9todos recomendados seg\u00fan tipo de mezcla\r\n    const metodosRecomendados = {\r\n        \"solido-liquido\": {\r\n            \"tamano\": \"Filtraci\u00f3n\",\r\n            \"densidad\": \"Decantaci\u00f3n\",\r\n            \"solubilidad\": \"Evaporaci\u00f3n\/Cristalizaci\u00f3n\",\r\n            \"afinidad\": \"Cromatograf\u00eda\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"liquido-liquido\": {\r\n            \"densidad\": \"Decantaci\u00f3n\",\r\n            \"ebullicion\": \"Destilaci\u00f3n\",\r\n            \"afinidad\": \"Extracci\u00f3n con solvente\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"solido-solido\": {\r\n            \"densidad\": \"Flotaci\u00f3n\",\r\n            \"magnetismo\": \"Separaci\u00f3n magn\u00e9tica\",\r\n            \"solubilidad\": \"Extracci\u00f3n selectiva\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"gas-liquido\": {\r\n            \"solubilidad\": \"Absorci\u00f3n\",\r\n            \"ebullicion\": \"Destilaci\u00f3n\",\r\n            \"presion\": \"Compresi\u00f3n\/Descompresi\u00f3n\"\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    function clasificarSustancia() {\r\n        console.log(\"\ud83d\udd0d Clasificando sustancia...\");\r\n        \r\n        const input = document.getElementById('sustanciaInput').value.trim();\r\n        if (!input) {\r\n            alert(\"\u26a0\ufe0f Por favor, ingresa una sustancia\");\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Buscar coincidencia aproximada\r\n        let sustanciaEncontrada = null;\r\n        for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(sustanciasDB)) {\r\n            if (input.toLowerCase().includes(key.toLowerCase()) || \r\n                key.toLowerCase().includes(input.toLowerCase())) {\r\n                sustanciaEncontrada = { nombre: key, ...value };\r\n                break;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        if (!sustanciaEncontrada) {\r\n            \/\/ Si no se encuentra, crear clasificaci\u00f3n basada en propiedades\r\n            const checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"propiedades\"]:checked');\r\n            const propiedades = Array.from(checkboxes).map(cb => cb.value);\r\n            \r\n            sustanciaEncontrada = clasificarPorPropiedades(input, propiedades);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n        actualizarArbolClasificacion(sustanciaEncontrada);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos en tiempo real\r\n        document.getElementById('dataSustancia').textContent = sustanciaEncontrada.nombre;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataCategoria').textContent = sustanciaEncontrada.categoria;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataSubcategoria').textContent = sustanciaEncontrada.subcategoria;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataMetodo').textContent = sustanciaEncontrada.metodo;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataPropiedad').textContent = sustanciaEncontrada.propiedad;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEjemplos').textContent = sustanciaEncontrada.ejemplos;\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoArbol').textContent = \r\n            `Clasificaci\u00f3n completa: ${sustanciaEncontrada.nombre} \u2192 ${sustanciaEncontrada.categoria} \u2192 ${sustanciaEncontrada.subcategoria}`;\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcca Clasificado: ${sustanciaEncontrada.nombre} como ${sustanciaEncontrada.categoria}\/${sustanciaEncontrada.subcategoria}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function clasificarPorPropiedades(nombre, propiedades) {\r\n        let categoria = \"MEZCLA\";\r\n        let subcategoria = \"HETEROG\u00c9NEA\";\r\n        let metodo = \"Filtraci\u00f3n\/Decantaci\u00f3n\";\r\n        let propiedad = \"Propiedades variables\";\r\n        let ejemplos = \"Sustancias similares\";\r\n        let color = \"#FF8F00\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ L\u00f3gica de clasificaci\u00f3n basada en propiedades\r\n        if (propiedades.includes(\"composicionFija\") && propiedades.includes(\"puntoFusionFijo\")) {\r\n            categoria = \"PURA\";\r\n            subcategoria = propiedades.includes(\"separacionFisica\") ? \"ELEMENTO\" : \"COMPUESTO\";\r\n            metodo = \"No separable f\u00edsicamente\";\r\n            propiedad = \"Composici\u00f3n y propiedades constantes\";\r\n            color = subcategoria === \"ELEMENTO\" ? \"#8BC34A\" : \"#66BB6A\";\r\n        } else if (!propiedades.includes(\"fasesVisibles\")) {\r\n            subcategoria = \"HOMOG\u00c9NEA\";\r\n            metodo = \"Destilaci\u00f3n\/Cromatograf\u00eda\";\r\n            propiedad = \"Composici\u00f3n uniforme\";\r\n            color = \"#FFB300\";\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        return { nombre, categoria, subcategoria, metodo, propiedad, ejemplos, color };\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function actualizarArbolClasificacion(sustancia) {\r\n        const svg = document.getElementById('svgArbol');\r\n        const color = sustancia.color;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar todos los nodos\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('#svgArbol g[id^=\"nodo\"]').forEach(nodo => {\r\n            nodo.setAttribute('opacity', '0.3');\r\n            nodo.setAttribute('filter', 'none');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Resaltar camino seg\u00fan clasificaci\u00f3n\r\n        \/\/ Nodo materia siempre visible\r\n        document.getElementById('nodoMateria').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n        \r\n        if (sustancia.categoria === \"PURA\") {\r\n            \/\/ Resaltar rama PURA\r\n            document.getElementById('ramaPura').style.stroke = color;\r\n            document.getElementById('ramaPura').style.strokeWidth = '4';\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoPura').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoPura').setAttribute('filter', 'url(#glow)');\r\n            \r\n            if (sustancia.subcategoria === \"ELEMENTO\") {\r\n                document.getElementById('ramaElemento').style.stroke = color;\r\n                document.getElementById('nodoElemento').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n                document.getElementById('nodoElemento').setAttribute('filter', 'url(#glow)');\r\n            } else {\r\n                document.getElementById('ramaCompuesto').style.stroke = color;\r\n                document.getElementById('nodoCompuesto').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n                document.getElementById('nodoCompuesto').setAttribute('filter', 'url(#glow)');\r\n            }\r\n        } else {\r\n            \/\/ Resaltar rama MEZCLA\r\n            document.getElementById('ramaMezcla').style.stroke = color;\r\n            document.getElementById('ramaMezcla').style.strokeWidth = '4';\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoMezcla').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoMezcla').setAttribute('filter', 'url(#glow)');\r\n            \r\n            if (sustancia.subcategoria === \"HOMOG\u00c9NEA\") {\r\n                document.getElementById('ramaHomogenea').style.stroke = color;\r\n                document.getElementById('nodoHomogenea').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n                document.getElementById('nodoHomogenea').setAttribute('filter', 'url(#glow)');\r\n            } else {\r\n                document.getElementById('ramaHeterogenea').style.stroke = color;\r\n                document.getElementById('nodoHeterogenea').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n                document.getElementById('nodoHeterogenea').setAttribute('filter', 'url(#glow)');\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar resultado\r\n        const resultado = document.getElementById('resultadoClasificacion');\r\n        resultado.style.opacity = '1';\r\n        resultado.querySelector('rect').setAttribute('fill', color);\r\n        document.getElementById('textoResultado').textContent = sustancia.subcategoria;\r\n        document.getElementById('textoDetalle').textContent = sustancia.nombre;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n\r\n        resultado.style.animation = 'pulse 2s';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function sustanciaAleatoria() {\r\n        const sustancias = Object.keys(sustanciasDB);\r\n        const aleatoria = sustancias[Math.floor(Math.random() * sustancias.length)];\r\n        document.getElementById('sustanciaInput').value = aleatoria;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar checkboxes\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"propiedades\"]').forEach(cb => {\r\n            cb.checked = false;\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoArbol').textContent = \r\n            `Sustancia aleatoria seleccionada: ${aleatoria}. Haz clic en \"CLASIFICAR\".`;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarClasificador() {\r\n        console.log(\"\ud83d\udd04 Reiniciando clasificador...\");\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('sustanciaInput').value = '';\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"propiedades\"]').forEach(cb => {\r\n            cb.checked = false;\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('#svgArbol g[id^=\"nodo\"]').forEach(nodo => {\r\n            nodo.setAttribute('opacity', '0.5');\r\n            nodo.setAttribute('filter', 'none');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.querySelectorAll('#svgArbol path').forEach(path => {\r\n            path.style.stroke = '';\r\n            path.style.strokeWidth = '';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('resultadoClasificacion').style.opacity = '0';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar datos\r\n        document.getElementById('dataSustancia').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataCategoria').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataSubcategoria').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataMetodo').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataPropiedad').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEjemplos').textContent = '-';\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoArbol').textContent = \r\n            \"Ingresa una sustancia y haz clic en 'CLASIFICAR'\";\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE RECOMENDACI\u00d3N DE M\u00c9TODOS\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function recomendarMetodo() {\r\n        const tipoMezcla = document.getElementById('tipoMezcla').value;\r\n        const propiedad = document.getElementById('propiedad').value;\r\n        \r\n        const recomendacion = metodosRecomendados[tipoMezcla]?.[propiedad] || \r\n                             \"No se encontr\u00f3 m\u00e9todo espec\u00edfico. Considera m\u00faltiples t\u00e9cnicas.\";\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('recomendacionMetodo').innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"recomendacion-card\">\r\n                <h5>\u26a1 M\u00c9TODO RECOMENDADO<\/h5>\r\n                <div class=\"metodo-recomendado\">${recomendacion}<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"explicacion\">\r\n                    <strong>Tipo:<\/strong> ${tipoMezcla.replace('-', ' ').toUpperCase()}<br>\r\n                    <strong>Propiedad:<\/strong> ${propiedad.toUpperCase()}<br>\r\n                    <strong>Eficiencia:<\/strong> Alta para esta combinaci\u00f3n\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    let quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n    \r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n            \r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            verificarCompletadoQuiz();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    function verificarCompletadoQuiz() {\r\n        const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n        const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q => \r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n        \r\n        if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n        const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n        \r\n        let feedback = \"\";\r\n        if (porcentaje >= 80) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas la clasificaci\u00f3n de la materia.\";\r\n        } else if (porcentaje >= 60) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero revisa los conceptos clave.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas repasar el \u00e1rbol de clasificaci\u00f3n.\";\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        quizRespuestas = [];\r\n        quizCompletado = false;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE ERRORES COMUNES\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function toggleError(header) {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n        \r\n        if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        } else {\r\n            content.style.display = 'block';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function verificarProblema(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n        const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n        const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n        \r\n        const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n        \r\n        alert(`\ud83d\udcca AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Clasificaci\u00f3n: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `M\u00e9todos separaci\u00f3n: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `\u00c1rbol de clasificaci\u00f3n: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Revisa el plan de estudio recomendado seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcbe AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada: ${slider1}, ${slider2}, ${slider3}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Sistema Cyberpunk Educativo inicializado\");\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\udcda Lecci\u00f3n: Clasificaci\u00f3n de la Materia\");\r\n    console.log(\"\u26a1 Simulador, Quiz y Herramientas interactivas listas\");\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Tabla interactiva\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(row => {\r\n        row.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const tipo = this.dataset.tipo;\r\n            const info = document.getElementById('infoMezcla');\r\n            \r\n            const infoTextos = {\r\n                homogenea: \"Mezcla Homog\u00e9nea: Composici\u00f3n uniforme en toda la muestra. Ejemplos: aire, aleaciones, soluciones acuosas.\",\r\n                heterogenea: \"Mezcla Heterog\u00e9nea: Composici\u00f3n no uniforme, se distinguen fases. Ejemplos: granito, ensalada, agua con aceite.\"\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            info.textContent = infoTextos[tipo] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\";\r\n            info.style.animation = \"highlight 0.5s\";\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar\/ocultar detalles\r\n            document.querySelectorAll('.ejemplo-detalle').forEach(detalle => {\r\n                detalle.style.display = 'none';\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            if (tipo === 'homogenea') {\r\n                document.getElementById('detalleHomogenea').style.display = 'block';\r\n            } else if (tipo === 'heterogenea') {\r\n                document.getElementById('detalleHeterogenea').style.display = 'block';\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            document.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(r => {\r\n                r.classList.remove('selected');\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Marcar fila seleccionada\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ M\u00e9todos de separaci\u00f3n interactivos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.metodo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const metodo = this.dataset.metodo;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar informaci\u00f3n detallada\r\n            const metodosInfo = {\r\n                filtracion: \"Filtraci\u00f3n: Usa medio poroso (papel filtro, malla). Tama\u00f1o m\u00ednimo part\u00edcula: 1 \u03bcm. Eficiencia: 99% para s\u00f3lidos insolubles.\",\r\n                destilacion: \"Destilaci\u00f3n: Separa l\u00edquidos por diferencia en puntos de ebullici\u00f3n. \u0394T m\u00ednima recomendada: 25\u00b0C. Rendimiento: 85-95%.\",\r\n                decantacion: \"Decantaci\u00f3n: Separa l\u00edquidos inmiscibles por diferencia de densidades. \u0394\u03c1 m\u00ednima: 0.1 g\/mL. Tiempo: minutos a horas.\",\r\n                cromatografia: \"Cromatograf\u00eda: Separa por diferencia en afinidad. Resoluci\u00f3n: 0.01 \u03bcg. Aplicaciones: an\u00e1lisis forense, farmac\u00e9utico.\",\r\n                centrifugacion: \"Centrifugaci\u00f3n: Separa por fuerza centr\u00edfuga. Fuerza t\u00edpica: 1000-15000 G. Aplicaciones: separaci\u00f3n sangu\u00ednea, purificaci\u00f3n.\",\r\n                evaporacion: \"Evaporaci\u00f3n: Vaporiza solvente para recuperar soluto. Eficiencia: 95-99%. Aplicaciones: producci\u00f3n de sal, concentraci\u00f3n.\"\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            alert(`\u2697\ufe0f ${this.querySelector('h4').textContent}\\n\\n${metodosInfo[metodo] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\"}`);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Objetivos interactivos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n            this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n            const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n            checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n            checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : '';\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Agregar filtro glow al SVG\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById('svgArbol');\r\n    const defs = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'defs');\r\n    const filter = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'filter');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('id', 'glow');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('x', '-50%');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('y', '-50%');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('width', '200%');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('height', '200%');\r\n    \r\n    const feGaussianBlur = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feGaussianBlur');\r\n    feGaussianBlur.setAttribute('stdDeviation', '4');\r\n    feGaussianBlur.setAttribute('result', 'coloredBlur');\r\n    \r\n    const feMerge = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMerge');\r\n    const feMergeNode1 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMergeNode');\r\n    feMergeNode1.setAttribute('in', 'coloredBlur');\r\n    const feMergeNode2 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMergeNode');\r\n    feMergeNode2.setAttribute('in', 'SourceGraphic');\r\n    \r\n    feMerge.appendChild(feMergeNode1);\r\n    feMerge.appendChild(feMergeNode2);\r\n    filter.appendChild(feGaussianBlur);\r\n    filter.appendChild(feMerge);\r\n    defs.appendChild(filter);\r\n    svg.appendChild(defs);\r\n    <\/script>\r\n    \r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Materia pura ejemplo","respuesta":"Oro, agua"},{"enunciado":"Mezcla homog\u00e9nea","respuesta":"Aire, salmuera"},{"enunciado":"Mezcla heterog\u00e9nea","respuesta":"Ensalada, aceite+agua"},{"enunciado":"Separar sal de agua","respuesta":"Evaporaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Separar arena de agua","respuesta":"Filtraci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Separar alcohol de agua","respuesta":"Destilaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Descomponer H\u2082O","respuesta":"Electr\u00f3lisis \u2192 H\u2082 + O\u2082"},{"enunciado":"Elemento no descomponible","respuesta":"Oro (Au)"},{"enunciado":"Compuesto f\u00f3rmula","respuesta":"H\u2082O, CO\u2082"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC: elementos totales 2025","respuesta":"118"},{"enunciado":"NIST: % N\u2082 en aire seco","respuesta":"78.08%"},{"enunciado":"Cromatograf\u00eda separa por","respuesta":"Afinidad fase"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Materia pura tiene...","opciones":["Composici\u00f3n constante","Variable","Aleatoria","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Composici\u00f3n constante"},{"pregunta":"Elemento ejemplo","opciones":["Oro","Agua","Aire","Suelo"],"correcta":"Oro"},{"pregunta":"Mezcla homog\u00e9nea es...","opciones":["Uniforme","No uniforme","Pura","Elemento"],"correcta":"Uniforme"},{"pregunta":"Compuesto se descompone en...","opciones":["Elementos","Mezclas","\u00c1tomos","Mol\u00e9culas"],"correcta":"Elementos"},{"pregunta":"Aire es...","opciones":["Mezcla homog\u00e9nea","Pura","Heterog\u00e9nea","Elemento"],"correcta":"Mezcla homog\u00e9nea"},{"pregunta":"Agua es...","opciones":["Compuesto","Elemento","Mezcla","Plasma"],"correcta":"Compuesto"},{"pregunta":"Ensalada es...","opciones":["Heterog\u00e9nea","Homog\u00e9nea","Pura","Elemento"],"correcta":"Heterog\u00e9nea"},{"pregunta":"Separar mezclas usa...","opciones":["M\u00e9todos f\u00edsicos","Reacciones","Fusi\u00f3n nuclear","Nada"],"correcta":"M\u00e9todos f\u00edsicos"},{"pregunta":"Destilaci\u00f3n separa por...","opciones":["Punto ebullici\u00f3n","Color","Masa","Sabor"],"correcta":"Punto ebullici\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Filtraci\u00f3n separa...","opciones":["S\u00f3lido de l\u00edquido","Gases","Luz","Sonido"],"correcta":"S\u00f3lido de l\u00edquido"},{"pregunta":"Electr\u00f3lisis de H\u2082O produce...","opciones":["H\u2082 + \u00bdO\u2082","CO\u2082","NaCl","Au"],"correcta":"H\u2082 + \u00bdO\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Cromatograf\u00eda usa...","opciones":["Fase estacionaria\/m\u00f3vil","Calor","Presi\u00f3n","Luz"],"correcta":"Fase estacionaria\/m\u00f3vil"},{"pregunta":"Decantaci\u00f3n por...","opciones":["Densidad","Color","Olor","Sabor"],"correcta":"Densidad"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC: elementos totales","opciones":["118","100","92","150"],"correcta":"118"},{"pregunta":"% O\u2082 en aire","opciones":["20.95%","78%","1%","50%"],"correcta":"20.95%"},{"pregunta":"Salmuera es...","opciones":["Soluci\u00f3n (homog\u00e9nea)","Suspensi\u00f3n","Elemento","Compuesto"],"correcta":"Soluci\u00f3n (homog\u00e9nea)"},{"pregunta":"Petr\u00f3leo crudo es...","opciones":["Mezcla heterog\u00e9nea","Pura","Elemento","Gas"],"correcta":"Mezcla heterog\u00e9nea"},{"pregunta":"Centrifugaci\u00f3n separa...","opciones":["Por densidad","Por color","Por olor","Por masa"],"correcta":"Por densidad"},{"pregunta":"Evaporaci\u00f3n deja...","opciones":["S\u00f3lido disuelto","L\u00edquido","Gas","Nada"],"correcta":"S\u00f3lido disuelto"},{"pregunta":"Mezcla vs compuesto","opciones":["F\u00edsica vs qu\u00edmica","Igual","Ambos puros","Nada"],"correcta":"F\u00edsica vs qu\u00edmica"},{"pregunta":"Aire seco: % N\u2082 (NIST)","opciones":["78.08%","20.95%","0.93%","0.04%"],"correcta":"78.08%"},{"pregunta":"Separar tintas por...","opciones":["Cromatograf\u00eda en papel","Destilaci\u00f3n","Filtraci\u00f3n","Decantaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Cromatograf\u00eda en papel"},{"pregunta":"Agua destilada es...","opciones":["Compuesto puro","Mezcla","Elemento","Heterog\u00e9nea"],"correcta":"Compuesto puro"},{"pregunta":"Oro 24K es...","opciones":["Elemento puro","Aleaci\u00f3n","Compuesto","Mezcla"],"correcta":"Elemento puro"},{"pregunta":"Bronce es...","opciones":["Aleaci\u00f3n (mezcla)","Compuesto","Elemento","Pura"],"correcta":"Aleaci\u00f3n (mezcla)"},{"pregunta":"Separar sangre en...","opciones":["Plasma + c\u00e9lulas (centrifugaci\u00f3n)","Destilaci\u00f3n","Evaporaci\u00f3n","Filtraci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Plasma + c\u00e9lulas (centrifugaci\u00f3n)"},{"pregunta":"Solubilidad es propiedad...","opciones":["Intensiva","Extensiva","Qu\u00edmica","Nuclear"],"correcta":"Intensiva"},{"pregunta":"Ley proporciones definidas aplica a...","opciones":["Compuestos","Mezclas","Elementos","Gases"],"correcta":"Compuestos"},{"pregunta":"Mezclas azeotr\u00f3picas se separan por...","opciones":["Destilaci\u00f3n especial","Filtraci\u00f3n","Evaporaci\u00f3n","Decantaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Destilaci\u00f3n especial"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC define soluci\u00f3n como...","opciones":["Mezcla homog\u00e9nea","Pura","Heterog\u00e9nea","Elemento"],"correcta":"Mezcla homog\u00e9nea"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"mezclas","titulo":"Mezclas: El Arte de Combinar sin Reaccionar","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-quimica-mezclas\" data-tema=\"mezclas\">\r\n\r\n<!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n    <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n        MEZCLAS: EL ARTE DE COMBINAR SIN REACCIONAR\r\n    <\/h1>\r\n    <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n        Homog\u00e9neas, heterog\u00e9neas, soluciones, coloides, suspensiones y m\u00e9todos de separaci\u00f3n\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/header>\r\n\r\n<!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n<section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Diferenciar mezclas homog\u00e9neas y heterog\u00e9neas<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Identificar uniformidad, tama\u00f1o de part\u00edcula y ejemplos cotidianos<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Clasificar soluciones, coloides y suspensiones<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Distinguir por tama\u00f1o de part\u00edcula y efecto Tyndall<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Seleccionar m\u00e9todos de separaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Elegir t\u00e9cnica f\u00edsica seg\u00fan propiedades de los componentes<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Aplicar en contextos reales<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Analizar procesos industriales y cotidianos de separaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n<section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n            <h3>Tratamiento de Aguas<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Filtraci\u00f3n, decantaci\u00f3n y floculaci\u00f3n para potabilizaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"dato-neon\">99.9% impurezas removidas<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n            <h3>Refinaci\u00f3n de Petr\u00f3leo<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Destilaci\u00f3n fraccionada separa crudo en gasolina, diesel, queroseno<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"dato-neon\">+15 fracciones diferentes<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n            <h3>An\u00e1lisis Cl\u00ednico<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Centrifugaci\u00f3n separa plasma, gl\u00f3bulos rojos y blancos en sangre<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"dato-neon\">3000-5000 G de fuerza<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n<section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcd8<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <!-- INTRODUCCI\u00d3N -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>1. \u00bfQu\u00e9 son las Mezclas?<\/h3>\r\n        <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n            <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u2697\ufe0f MEZCLA<\/h4>\r\n                <p><strong>Definici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Combinaci\u00f3n f\u00edsica de dos o m\u00e1s sustancias <strong>sin uni\u00f3n qu\u00edmica<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"caracteristicas\">\r\n                    <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\u2713<\/span>\r\n                        <span>Se separan por <strong>m\u00e9todos f\u00edsicos<\/strong><\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\u2713<\/span>\r\n                        <span>No tienen f\u00f3rmula fija<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\u2713<\/span>\r\n                        <span>Conservan propiedades individuales<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                    \\[ \\text{Mezcla} = A + B \\quad (\\text{sin reacci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica}) \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- TIPOS DE MEZCLAS -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>2. Tipos de Mezclas<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"comparativa-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"comp-card homogenea\">\r\n                <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd35 MEZCLA HOMOG\u00c9NEA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-badge\">Uniforme<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Uniformidad:<\/strong> Composici\u00f3n constante en toda la muestra<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Tama\u00f1o part\u00edcula:<\/strong> &lt; 1 nm<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Fases visibles:<\/strong> 1 sola fase<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Efecto Tyndall:<\/strong> No<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"simbolo\">\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">Aire<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"tipo\">Soluci\u00f3n gaseosa<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"simbolo\">\ud83e\uddc2<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">Salmuera<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"tipo\">Soluci\u00f3n acuosa<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"simbolo\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">Aleaciones<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"tipo\">Soluci\u00f3n s\u00f3lida<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"comp-card heterogenea\">\r\n                <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd34 MEZCLA HETEROG\u00c9NEA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-badge\">No uniforme<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Uniformidad:<\/strong> Composici\u00f3n variable por regi\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Tama\u00f1o part\u00edcula:<\/strong> &gt; 1 nm<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Fases visibles:<\/strong> 2 o m\u00e1s fases<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Efecto Tyndall:<\/strong> S\u00ed<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"simbolo\">\ud83e\udea8<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">Granito<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"tipo\">S\u00f3lido-s\u00f3lido<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"simbolo\">\ud83d\udee2\ufe0f\ud83d\udca7<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">Aceite+Agua<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"tipo\">L\u00edquido-l\u00edquido<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"simbolo\">\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">Arena+Agua<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"tipo\">S\u00f3lido-l\u00edquido<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CLASIFICACI\u00d3N DETALLADA -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>3. Clasificaci\u00f3n Detallada: Soluciones, Coloides, Suspensiones<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n            <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>TIPO<\/th>\r\n                        <th>TAMA\u00d1O PART\u00cdCULA<\/th>\r\n                        <th>HOMOGENEIDAD<\/th>\r\n                        <th>EFECTO TYNDALL<\/th>\r\n                        <th>SEPARACI\u00d3N<\/th>\r\n                        <th>EJEMPLOS<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr data-tipo=\"solucion\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>&lt; 1 nm<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Homog\u00e9nea molecular<\/td>\r\n                        <td>No<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Evaporaci\u00f3n, Destilaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Agua+Sal, Aire, Alcohol+Agua<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-tipo=\"coloide\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">COLOIDE<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>1-1000 nm<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Pseudo-homog\u00e9nea<\/td>\r\n                        <td>S\u00ed<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Ultracentrifugaci\u00f3n, Di\u00e1lisis<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Leche, Gelatina, Mayonesa, Niebla<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-tipo=\"suspension\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">SUSPENSI\u00d3N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>&gt; 1000 nm<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Heterog\u00e9nea<\/td>\r\n                        <td>S\u00ed (fuerte)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Filtraci\u00f3n, Decantaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Agua+Lodo, Arena+Agua, Jugo con pulpa<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoTipo\">\r\n                Selecciona un tipo para m\u00e1s detalles\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"tipo-ejemplos\">\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-detalle\" id=\"detalleSolucion\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd2c An\u00e1lisis: Soluciones<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfaf Caracter\u00edsticas clave<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Part\u00edculas a nivel molecular o i\u00f3nico, no sedimentan, no dispersan luz<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"componentes\">\r\n                                <span class=\"soluto\">Soluto<\/span> + \r\n                                <span class=\"solvente\">Solvente<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcca Concentraci\u00f3n com\u00fan<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Expresada en Molaridad (M): \\( M = \\frac{n_{\\text{soluto}}}{V_{\\text{soluci\u00f3n}}} \\)<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-detalle\" id=\"detalleColoide\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd2c An\u00e1lisis: Coloides<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udca1 Efecto Tyndall<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Dispersi\u00f3n de luz visible por part\u00edculas coloidales<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Tama\u00f1o ideal: 1-1000 nm<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udd04 Movimiento Browniano<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Movimiento aleatorio de part\u00edculas coloidales en fluido<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-detalle\" id=\"detalleSuspension\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd2c An\u00e1lisis: Suspensiones<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\u23f3 Sedimentaci\u00f3n<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Part\u00edculas grandes sedimentan por gravedad con el tiempo<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Tiempo t\u00edpico: minutos a horas<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfaf Separaci\u00f3n f\u00e1cil<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Se separan por m\u00e9todos f\u00edsicos simples: filtraci\u00f3n, decantaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- EFECTO TYNDALL -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>4. Efecto Tyndall: La Prueba de la Luz<\/h3>\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udd26 EFECTO TYNDALL<\/h4>\r\n            <p><strong>Definici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Dispersi\u00f3n de la luz por part\u00edculas coloidales (1-1000 nm)<\/p>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"tyndall-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"tyndall-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tyndall-icon\">\u274c<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tyndall-content\">\r\n                        <h5>Soluciones<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>No presentan efecto Tyndall<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Part\u00edculas &lt; 1 nm<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"tyndall-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tyndall-icon\">\u2705<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tyndall-content\">\r\n                        <h5>Coloides<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Presentan efecto Tyndall visible<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Part\u00edculas 1-1000 nm<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"tyndall-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tyndall-icon\">\u2705\u2728<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tyndall-content\">\r\n                        <h5>Suspensiones<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Efecto Tyndall fuerte<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Part\u00edculas &gt; 1000 nm<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"formula-display\">\r\n                \\[ I_{\\text{dispersada}} \\propto \\frac{1}{\\lambda^4} \\cdot N \\cdot V^2 \\]\r\n                <div class=\"formula-explicacion\">\r\n                    <strong>Donde:<\/strong> \u03bb = longitud de onda, N = n\u00famero de part\u00edculas, V = volumen de part\u00edculas\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- M\u00c9TODOS DE SEPARACI\u00d3N -->\r\n<section class=\"separacion-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\u2699\ufe0f<\/span> M\u00c9TODOS DE SEPARACI\u00d3N F\u00cdSICOS\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"metodos-grid\">\r\n        <!-- DESTILACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"destilacion\">\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\u2668\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n            <h4>DESTILACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                Separaci\u00f3n l\u00edquido-l\u00edquido por diferencia en puntos de ebullici\u00f3n\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Punto ebullici\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Agua + Alcohol<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>\u0394T m\u00ednima:<\/strong> 25\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- FILTRACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"filtracion\">\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\ud83d\udd73\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n            <h4>FILTRACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                Separaci\u00f3n s\u00f3lido-l\u00edquido usando medio poroso\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Tama\u00f1o part\u00edcula<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Caf\u00e9 + Posos<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Tama\u00f1o m\u00ednimo:<\/strong> 1 \u03bcm<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- DECANTACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"decantacion\">\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n            <h4>DECANTACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                Separaci\u00f3n l\u00edquido-l\u00edquido por diferencia de densidades\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Densidad<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Aceite + Agua<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>\u0394\u03c1 m\u00ednima:<\/strong> 0.1 g\/mL<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- CENTRIFUGACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"centrifugacion\">\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\ud83c\udf00<\/div>\r\n            <h4>CENTRIFUGACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                Separaci\u00f3n acelerada por fuerza centr\u00edfuga\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Densidad + fuerza G<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Sangre<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Fuerza:<\/strong> 1000-15000 G<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- CROMATOGRAF\u00cdA -->\r\n        <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"cromatografia\">\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\ud83c\udf08<\/div>\r\n            <h4>CROMATOGRAF\u00cdA<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                Separaci\u00f3n por diferencia en afinidad por fases m\u00f3vil y estacionaria\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Afinidad<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Pigmentos de tinta<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Resoluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> 0.01 \u03bcg<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- SUBLIMACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"sublimacion\">\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\u2601\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n            <h4>SUBLIMACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                Separaci\u00f3n s\u00f3lido-s\u00f3lido por sublimaci\u00f3n selectiva\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Volatilidad<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Naftalina + Sal<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Temperatura:<\/strong> 80-100\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- EVAPORACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"evaporacion\">\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\u2600\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n            <h4>EVAPORACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                Separaci\u00f3n s\u00f3lido-l\u00edquido por vaporizaci\u00f3n del solvente\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Volatilidad<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Sal de mar<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Eficiencia:<\/strong> 95-99%<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- EMBUDO DECANTACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"embudo\">\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\ud83e\udd64<\/div>\r\n            <h4>EMBUDO DECANTACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                Separaci\u00f3n l\u00edquidos inmiscibles por gravedad controlada\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Inmiscibilidad<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Aceite + Agua<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>\u0394\u03c1 requerida:<\/strong> 0.05 g\/mL<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- SELECTOR DE M\u00c9TODO -->\r\n    <div class=\"selector-metodo\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83e\udde0 SELECTOR INTELIGENTE DE M\u00c9TODO DE SEPARACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n        <div class=\"selector-controls\">\r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"tipoMezcla\">Tipo de mezcla:<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"tipoMezcla\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                    <option value=\"solido-liquido\">S\u00f3lido-L\u00edquido<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"liquido-liquido\">L\u00edquido-L\u00edquido<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"solido-solido\">S\u00f3lido-S\u00f3lido<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"gas-liquido\">Gas-L\u00edquido<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"propiedad\">Propiedad diferencial:<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"propiedad\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                    <option value=\"tamano\">Tama\u00f1o part\u00edcula<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"ebullicion\">Punto ebullici\u00f3n<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"densidad\">Densidad<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"afinidad\">Afinidad qu\u00edmica<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"solubilidad\">Solubilidad<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"magnetismo\">Magnetismo<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"volatilidad\">Volatilidad<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-recomendar\" onclick=\"recomendarMetodo()\">\r\n                \ud83e\uddea RECOMENDAR M\u00c9TODO\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"recomendacion\" id=\"recomendacionMetodo\">\r\n            Selecciona par\u00e1metros y haz clic en \"RECOMENDAR M\u00c9TODO\"\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n<section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/span> SIMULADOR: CLASIFICACI\u00d3N Y SEPARACI\u00d3N\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"clasificacion-mezclas\">\r\n        <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n            <h3>CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"mezclaInput\">Mezcla a analizar:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"mezclaInput\" class=\"control-input\" \r\n                       placeholder=\"Ej: Leche, Arena+Agua, Aire\" list=\"mezclasList\">\r\n                <datalist id=\"mezclasList\">\r\n                    <option value=\"Leche\">Leche<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Aire\">Aire<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Arena+Agua\">Arena+Agua<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Aceite+Agua\">Aceite+Agua<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Salmuera\">Salmuera<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Gelatina\">Gelatina<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Granito\">Granito<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Alcohol+Agua\">Alcohol+Agua<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Mayonesa\">Mayonesa<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Jugo con pulpa\">Jugo con pulpa<\/option>\r\n                <\/datalist>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"propiedades\">Propiedades observadas:<\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"checkbox-group\">\r\n                    <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"propiedades\" value=\"uniforme\"> Uniforme a simple vista<\/label>\r\n                    <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"propiedades\" value=\"tyndall\"> Efecto Tyndall positivo<\/label>\r\n                    <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"propiedades\" value=\"sedimenta\"> Sedimenta con el tiempo<\/label>\r\n                    <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"propiedades\" value=\"filtrable\"> Filtrable<\/label>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-clasificar\" onclick=\"clasificarMezcla()\">\r\n                <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/span> CLASIFICAR MEZCLA\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"mezclaAleatoria()\">\r\n                <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> MEZCLA ALEATORIA\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarClasificador()\">\r\n                <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N SVG ANIMADA -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacionMezcla\">\r\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 500\" id=\"svgMezcla\">\r\n                <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"500\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\" id=\"fondoSVG\"\/>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- T\u00cdTULO -->\r\n                <text x=\"300\" y=\"40\" fill=\"#00FFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                    SIMULACI\u00d3N DE SEPARACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/text>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- MEZCLA INICIAL -->\r\n                <g id=\"nodoMezclaInicial\" opacity=\"0.8\">\r\n                    <rect x=\"150\" y=\"80\" width=\"300\" height=\"80\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#4A148C\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"115\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\">MEZCLA INICIAL<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"135\" fill=\"#BB86FC\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" id=\"textoMezcla\">?<\/text>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- FLECHA -->\r\n                <path id=\"flecha\" d=\"M300 160 L300 200\" stroke=\"#FF9800\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\">\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"100\" to=\"0\" dur=\"2s\" begin=\"1s\" fill=\"freeze\"\/>\r\n                <\/path>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- M\u00c9TODO DE SEPARACI\u00d3N -->\r\n                <g id=\"nodoMetodo\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                    <rect x=\"200\" y=\"210\" width=\"200\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FF9800\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"240\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" id=\"textoMetodo\">M\u00c9TODO<\/text>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- COMPONENTES SEPARADOS -->\r\n                <g id=\"nodoComponente1\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"300\" width=\"150\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#2196F3\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"175\" y=\"330\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"textoComp1\">Componente 1<\/text>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n                \r\n                <g id=\"nodoComponente2\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                    <rect x=\"350\" y=\"300\" width=\"150\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"425\" y=\"330\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"textoComp2\">Componente 2<\/text>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- EFECTO TYNDALL -->\r\n                <g id=\"efectoTyndall\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                    <circle cx=\"500\" cy=\"150\" r=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFF00\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"\/>\r\n                    <line x1=\"460\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#FFFF00\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                    <line x1=\"500\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#FFFF00\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"500\" y=\"210\" fill=\"#FFFF00\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">EFECTO TYNDALL<\/text>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- FILTRO GLOW -->\r\n                <defs>\r\n                    <filter id=\"glow\">\r\n                        <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"3\" result=\"coloredBlur\"\/>\r\n                        <feMerge>\r\n                            <feMergeNode in=\"coloredBlur\"\/>\r\n                            <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                        <\/feMerge>\r\n                    <\/filter>\r\n                <\/defs>\r\n            <\/svg>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"simulator-info\" id=\"infoSimulacion\">\r\n                Ingresa una mezcla y haz clic en \"CLASIFICAR MEZCLA\"\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n            <h3>DATOS DE AN\u00c1LISIS<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Mezcla:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataMezcla\">-<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Tipo principal:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTipo\">-<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Subtipo:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataSubtipo\">-<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">M\u00c9TODO SEPARACI\u00d3N:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataMetodoSeparacion\">-<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Efecto Tyndall:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTyndall\">-<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Tama\u00f1o part\u00edcula:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTamano\">-<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udcca ESTAD\u00cdSTICAS<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <span>Mezclas analizadas:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statAnalizadas\">0<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <span>Clasificaciones correctas:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statCorrectas\">0<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <span>Eficiencia separaci\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statEficiencia\">0%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n<section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n        <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la principal diferencia entre mezcla homog\u00e9nea y heterog\u00e9nea?<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                    El n\u00famero de componentes\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                    La presencia de enlaces qu\u00edmicos\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                    La uniformidad de la composici\u00f3n\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                    El estado f\u00edsico de los componentes\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                    <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> La uniformidad de la composici\u00f3n es la diferencia clave.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                    <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa las definiciones de homogeneidad y heterogeneidad.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Las mezclas homog\u00e9neas tienen composici\u00f3n uniforme en toda la muestra (ej: aire, salmuera), mientras que las heterog\u00e9neas tienen composici\u00f3n variable (ej: granito, aceite+agua).<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 m\u00e9todo usar\u00edas para separar arena y agua?<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                    Destilaci\u00f3n\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                    Filtraci\u00f3n\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                    Cromatograf\u00eda\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                    Centrifugaci\u00f3n\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                    <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Filtraci\u00f3n es ideal para separar s\u00f3lidos insolubles de l\u00edquidos.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                    <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Considera la diferencia en tama\u00f1o de part\u00edcula entre arena y agua.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La arena es un s\u00f3lido insoluble con tama\u00f1o de part\u00edcula grande (>1 \u00b5m). La filtraci\u00f3n usa un medio poroso que retiene s\u00f3lidos y deja pasar el l\u00edquido.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- PREGUNTA 3 (continuar\u00eda hasta 30 preguntas) -->\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/30\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<section class=\"errors-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES Y SOLUCIONES\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"errors-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                <h3>CONFUNDIR SOLUCI\u00d3N CON COLOIDE<\/h3>\r\n                <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                    <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"La leche es una soluci\u00f3n porque parece homog\u00e9nea\"\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                    <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La leche es un COLOIDE (part\u00edculas 1-1000 nm), presenta efecto Tyndall. Las soluciones tienen part\u00edculas &lt; 1 nm.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Pr\u00e1ctica:<\/strong> Clasifica: Gelatina, Agua azucarada, Mayonesa, Aire<\/p>\r\n                    <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                    <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display:none;\">\r\n                        <strong>Gelatina:<\/strong> Coloide<br>\r\n                        <strong>Agua azucarada:<\/strong> Soluci\u00f3n<br>\r\n                        <strong>Mayonesa:<\/strong> Coloide<br>\r\n                        <strong>Aire:<\/strong> Soluci\u00f3n gaseosa\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                <h3>ELEGIR M\u00c9TODO INCORRECTO DE SEPARACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                    <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"Para separar sal y agua uso filtraci\u00f3n\"\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                    <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La sal est\u00e1 DISUELTA (tama\u00f1o i\u00f3nico). M\u00e9todos correctos:\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Evaporaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Para obtener sal s\u00f3lida<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Destilaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Para recuperar agua pura<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                    <table>\r\n                        <tr><th>Si el s\u00f3lido es...<\/th><th>M\u00e9todo adecuado<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>Insoluble (arena)<\/td><td>FILTRACI\u00d3N<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>Soluble (sal)<\/td><td>EVAPORACI\u00d3N \/ DESTILACI\u00d3N<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <\/table>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                <h3>Problema de Clasificaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                <p>Clasifica las siguientes mezclas indicando: tipo (homog\u00e9nea\/heterog\u00e9nea), subtipo (soluci\u00f3n\/coloide\/suspensi\u00f3n) y m\u00e9todo de separaci\u00f3n recomendado:<\/p>\r\n                <ol>\r\n                    <li>Leche entera<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Aire seco<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Granito<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Alcohol al 70%<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Arena en agua<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <p>Justifica cada clasificaci\u00f3n con al menos dos propiedades observables.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu clasificaci\u00f3n y justificaci\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                1. <strong>Leche:<\/strong> Heterog\u00e9nea, Coloide, Centrifugaci\u00f3n<br>\r\n                2. <strong>Aire:<\/strong> Homog\u00e9nea, Soluci\u00f3n, Destilaci\u00f3n fraccionada<br>\r\n                3. <strong>Granito:<\/strong> Heterog\u00e9nea, Suspensi\u00f3n, Separaci\u00f3n manual<br>\r\n                4. <strong>Alcohol 70%:<\/strong> Homog\u00e9nea, Soluci\u00f3n, Destilaci\u00f3n<br>\r\n                5. <strong>Arena+Agua:<\/strong> Heterog\u00e9nea, Suspensi\u00f3n, Filtraci\u00f3n\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                <h3>Problema de Separaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                <p>Tienes una mezcla que contiene:<\/p>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Arena (s\u00f3lido insoluble)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Sal (NaCl soluble)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Limaduras de hierro (magn\u00e9ticas)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Agua<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n                <p>Dise\u00f1a un procedimiento paso a paso para separar los cuatro componentes, indicando:<\/p>\r\n                <ol>\r\n                    <li>Orden de separaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                    <li>M\u00e9todo utilizado en cada paso<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Principio f\u00edsico aplicado<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Estado final de cada componente<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                <textarea placeholder=\"Describe tu procedimiento de separaci\u00f3n...\" rows=\"10\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR PROCEDIMIENTO<\/button>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <strong>Procedimiento recomendado:<\/strong><br>\r\n                1. <strong>Im\u00e1n:<\/strong> Separar limaduras de hierro (propiedad magn\u00e9tica)<br>\r\n                2. <strong>Filtraci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Separar arena del agua salada (diferencia tama\u00f1o)<br>\r\n                3. <strong>Evaporaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Separar sal del agua (diferencia volatilidad)<br><br>\r\n                <strong>Componentes finales:<\/strong><br>\r\n                \u2022 Limaduras de hierro: S\u00f3lido magn\u00e9tico seco<br>\r\n                \u2022 Arena: S\u00f3lido granular seco<br>\r\n                \u2022 Sal: S\u00f3lido cristalino seco<br>\r\n                \u2022 Agua: Vapor condensado (si se usa destilaci\u00f3n)\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n        <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Clasificaci\u00f3n correcta<\/td>\r\n                <td>Clasifica todas correctamente con justificaci\u00f3n s\u00f3lida<\/td>\r\n                <td>Clasifica mayor\u00eda correctamente con alguna justificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <td>Errores graves en clasificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Selecci\u00f3n m\u00e9todos separaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <td>Propone procedimiento \u00f3ptimo en orden l\u00f3gico<\/td>\r\n                <td>Propone procedimiento funcional con alg\u00fan error<\/td>\r\n                <td>Procedimiento incorrecto o incompleto<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Fundamentaci\u00f3n cient\u00edfica<\/td>\r\n                <td>Explica principios f\u00edsicos en cada paso<\/td>\r\n                <td>Menciona algunos principios<\/td>\r\n                <td>No fundamenta decisiones<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/table>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                <label>Clasificaci\u00f3n mezclas homog\u00e9neas\/heterog\u00e9neas:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                    <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                <label>Diferenciaci\u00f3n soluci\u00f3n\/coloide\/suspensi\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                    <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                <label>Selecci\u00f3n m\u00e9todos de separaci\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                    <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                <p>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es importante diferenciar entre tipos de mezclas en procesos industriales y cotidianos?<\/p>\r\n                <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                <p>Describe un proceso de separaci\u00f3n que observes en tu entorno y explica su principio f\u00edsico.<\/p>\r\n                <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu ejemplo...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcda PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\u23f1\ufe0f REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Memorizar tipos de mezclas<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Recordar 8 m\u00e9todos de separaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Diferenciar efecto Tyndall<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83e\uddea PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Clasificar 20 mezclas cotidianas<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Resolver 5 problemas de separaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Completar el quiz interactivo<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd2c PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Investigar aplicaciones industriales<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Analizar m\u00e9todos avanzados (HPLC)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Resolver problemas tipo examen<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/legacy\/mixtures-and-solutions\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf10 PhET: Mezclas y Soluciones (Simulaci\u00f3n)\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.iupac.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf10 IUPAC: Nomenclatura oficial\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/es.khanacademy.org\/science\/chemistry\/states-of-matter-and-intermolecular-forces\/mixtures-and-solutions\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf10 Khan Academy: Mezclas y soluciones\r\n                <\/a>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ BASE DE DATOS DE MEZCLAS\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nconst mezclasDB = {\r\n    \"Leche\": {\r\n        tipo: \"HETEROG\u00c9NEA\",\r\n        subtipo: \"COLOIDE\",\r\n        metodo: \"Centrifugaci\u00f3n\",\r\n        tyndall: \"S\u00ed\",\r\n        tamano: \"100-1000 nm\",\r\n        color: \"#FFB300\",\r\n        componentes: [\"Grasa\", \"Agua\", \"Prote\u00ednas\", \"Lactosa\"]\r\n    },\r\n    \"Aire\": {\r\n        tipo: \"HOMOG\u00c9NEA\",\r\n        subtipo: \"SOLUCI\u00d3N\",\r\n        metodo: \"Destilaci\u00f3n fraccionada\",\r\n        tyndall: \"No\",\r\n        tamano: \"< 1 nm\",\r\n        color: \"#2196F3\",\r\n        componentes: [\"N\u2082\", \"O\u2082\", \"Ar\", \"CO\u2082\"]\r\n    },\r\n    \"Arena+Agua\": {\r\n        tipo: \"HETEROG\u00c9NEA\",\r\n        subtipo: \"SUSPENSI\u00d3N\",\r\n        metodo: \"Filtraci\u00f3n\",\r\n        tyndall: \"S\u00ed (fuerte)\",\r\n        tamano: \"> 1000 nm\",\r\n        color: \"#795548\",\r\n        componentes: [\"Arena (SiO\u2082)\", \"Agua\"]\r\n    },\r\n    \"Aceite+Agua\": {\r\n        tipo: \"HETEROG\u00c9NEA\",\r\n        subtipo: \"SUSPENSI\u00d3N\",\r\n        metodo: \"Decantaci\u00f3n\/Embudo\",\r\n        tyndall: \"S\u00ed\",\r\n        tamano: \"> 1000 nm\",\r\n        color: \"#FF9800\",\r\n        componentes: [\"Aceite\", \"Agua\"]\r\n    },\r\n    \"Salmuera\": {\r\n        tipo: \"HOMOG\u00c9NEA\",\r\n        subtipo: \"SOLUCI\u00d3N\",\r\n        metodo: \"Evaporaci\u00f3n\",\r\n        tyndall: \"No\",\r\n        tamano: \"< 1 nm\",\r\n        color: \"#4CAF50\",\r\n        componentes: [\"NaCl\", \"Agua\"]\r\n    },\r\n    \"Gelatina\": {\r\n        tipo: \"HETEROG\u00c9NEA\",\r\n        subtipo: \"COLOIDE\",\r\n        metodo: \"No separable f\u00e1cilmente\",\r\n        tyndall: \"S\u00ed\",\r\n        tamano: \"10-100 nm\",\r\n        color: \"#E91E63\",\r\n        componentes: [\"Gelatina\", \"Agua\", \"Az\u00facar\"]\r\n    },\r\n    \"Granito\": {\r\n        tipo: \"HETEROG\u00c9NEA\",\r\n        subtipo: \"SUSPENSI\u00d3N\",\r\n        metodo: \"Separaci\u00f3n manual\/magn\u00e9tica\",\r\n        tyndall: \"S\u00ed\",\r\n        tamano: \"> 1000 nm\",\r\n        color: \"#607D8B\",\r\n        componentes: [\"Cuarzo\", \"Feldespato\", \"Mica\"]\r\n    },\r\n    \"Alcohol+Agua\": {\r\n        tipo: \"HOMOG\u00c9NEA\",\r\n        subtipo: \"SOLUCI\u00d3N\",\r\n        metodo: \"Destilaci\u00f3n\",\r\n        tyndall: \"No\",\r\n        tamano: \"< 1 nm\",\r\n        color: \"#9C27B0\",\r\n        componentes: [\"Etanol\", \"Agua\"]\r\n    },\r\n    \"Mayonesa\": {\r\n        tipo: \"HETEROG\u00c9NEA\",\r\n        subtipo: \"COLOIDE\",\r\n        metodo: \"Centrifugaci\u00f3n\",\r\n        tyndall: \"S\u00ed\",\r\n        tamano: \"100-500 nm\",\r\n        color: \"#FFEB3B\",\r\n        componentes: [\"Aceite\", \"Huevo\", \"Vinagre\"]\r\n    },\r\n    \"Jugo con pulpa\": {\r\n        tipo: \"HETEROG\u00c9NEA\",\r\n        subtipo: \"SUSPENSI\u00d3N\",\r\n        metodo: \"Filtraci\u00f3n\",\r\n        tyndall: \"S\u00ed\",\r\n        tamano: \"> 1000 nm\",\r\n        color: \"#FF5722\",\r\n        componentes: [\"Jugo\", \"Pulpa\", \"Az\u00facar\"]\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ FUNCIONES DEL SIMULADOR\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nlet mezclasAnalizadas = 0;\r\nlet clasificacionesCorrectas = 0;\r\n\r\nfunction clasificarMezcla() {\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\udccd Clasificando mezcla...\");\r\n    \r\n    const input = document.getElementById('mezclaInput').value.trim();\r\n    if (!input) {\r\n        alert(\"\u26a0\ufe0f Por favor, ingresa una mezcla\");\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Buscar coincidencia\r\n    let mezclaEncontrada = null;\r\n    for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(mezclasDB)) {\r\n        if (input.toLowerCase().includes(key.toLowerCase()) || \r\n            key.toLowerCase().includes(input.toLowerCase())) {\r\n            mezclaEncontrada = { nombre: key, ...value };\r\n            break;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Si no se encuentra, clasificar por propiedades\r\n    if (!mezclaEncontrada) {\r\n        const checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"propiedades\"]:checked');\r\n        const propiedades = Array.from(checkboxes).map(cb => cb.value);\r\n        mezclaEncontrada = clasificarPorPropiedades(input, propiedades);\r\n    } else {\r\n        clasificacionesCorrectas++;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    mezclasAnalizadas++;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar visualizaci\u00f3n SVG\r\n    actualizarVisualizacion(mezclaEncontrada);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n    actualizarDatos(mezclaEncontrada);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas\r\n    actualizarEstadisticas();\r\n    \r\n    console.log(`\u2705 Clasificado: ${mezclaEncontrada.nombre} como ${mezclaEncontrada.tipo}\/${mezclaEncontrada.subtipo}`);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction clasificarPorPropiedades(nombre, propiedades) {\r\n    let tipo = \"HETEROG\u00c9NEA\";\r\n    let subtipo = \"SUSPENSI\u00d3N\";\r\n    let metodo = \"Filtraci\u00f3n\/Decantaci\u00f3n\";\r\n    let tyndall = \"S\u00ed\";\r\n    let tamano = \"> 1000 nm\";\r\n    let color = \"#FF9800\";\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ L\u00f3gica de clasificaci\u00f3n\r\n    if (propiedades.includes(\"uniforme\") && !propiedades.includes(\"tyndall\")) {\r\n        tipo = \"HOMOG\u00c9NEA\";\r\n        subtipo = \"SOLUCI\u00d3N\";\r\n        metodo = \"Destilaci\u00f3n\/Evaporaci\u00f3n\";\r\n        tyndall = \"No\";\r\n        tamano = \"< 1 nm\";\r\n        color = \"#2196F3\";\r\n    } else if (propiedades.includes(\"uniforme\") && propiedades.includes(\"tyndall\")) {\r\n        subtipo = \"COLOIDE\";\r\n        metodo = \"Centrifugaci\u00f3n\/Di\u00e1lisis\";\r\n        tamano = \"1-1000 nm\";\r\n        color = \"#FFB300\";\r\n    } else if (propiedades.includes(\"sedimenta\")) {\r\n        subtipo = \"SUSPENSI\u00d3N\";\r\n        metodo = \"Filtraci\u00f3n\/Decantaci\u00f3n\";\r\n        tamano = \"> 1000 nm\";\r\n        color = \"#795548\";\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    return { nombre, tipo, subtipo, metodo, tyndall, tamano, color };\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarVisualizacion(mezcla) {\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById('svgMezcla');\r\n    const color = mezcla.color;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar texto de mezcla\r\n    document.getElementById('textoMezcla').textContent = mezcla.nombre;\r\n    document.getElementById('textoMetodo').textContent = mezcla.metodo;\r\n    document.getElementById('textoComp1').textContent = mezcla.componentes ? mezcla.componentes[0] : \"Componente A\";\r\n    document.getElementById('textoComp2').textContent = mezcla.componentes ? mezcla.componentes[1] : \"Componente B\";\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de nodos\r\n    const nodos = ['nodoMezclaInicial', 'nodoMetodo', 'nodoComponente1', 'nodoComponente2'];\r\n    const delays = [0, 1000, 2000, 2000];\r\n    \r\n    nodos.forEach((nodoId, index) => {\r\n        const nodo = document.getElementById(nodoId);\r\n        nodo.style.opacity = '0';\r\n        \r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            nodo.style.opacity = '1';\r\n            nodo.style.transition = 'opacity 0.5s ease';\r\n            \r\n            if (nodoId === 'nodoMetodo') {\r\n                nodo.querySelector('rect').setAttribute('fill', color);\r\n            }\r\n        }, delays[index]);\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar efecto Tyndall si aplica\r\n    const tyndall = document.getElementById('efectoTyndall');\r\n    if (mezcla.tyndall === \"S\u00ed\") {\r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            tyndall.style.opacity = '1';\r\n            tyndall.style.transition = 'opacity 0.5s ease';\r\n        }, 3000);\r\n    } else {\r\n        tyndall.style.opacity = '0';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de flecha\r\n    const flecha = document.getElementById('flecha');\r\n    flecha.style.strokeDasharray = '10,5';\r\n    flecha.style.animation = 'dash 2s linear forwards';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarDatos(mezcla) {\r\n    document.getElementById('dataMezcla').textContent = mezcla.nombre;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataTipo').textContent = mezcla.tipo;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataSubtipo').textContent = mezcla.subtipo;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataMetodoSeparacion').textContent = mezcla.metodo;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataTyndall').textContent = mezcla.tyndall;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataTamano').textContent = mezcla.tamano;\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('infoSimulacion').textContent = \r\n        `Clasificaci\u00f3n completa: ${mezcla.nombre} \u2192 ${mezcla.tipo} \u2192 ${mezcla.subtipo}`;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarEstadisticas() {\r\n    document.getElementById('statAnalizadas').textContent = mezclasAnalizadas;\r\n    document.getElementById('statCorrectas').textContent = clasificacionesCorrectas;\r\n    const eficiencia = mezclasAnalizadas > 0 ? Math.round((clasificacionesCorrectas \/ mezclasAnalizadas) * 100) : 0;\r\n    document.getElementById('statEficiencia').textContent = `${eficiencia}%`;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mezclaAleatoria() {\r\n    const mezclas = Object.keys(mezclasDB);\r\n    const aleatoria = mezclas[Math.floor(Math.random() * mezclas.length)];\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('mezclaInput').value = aleatoria;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Limpiar checkboxes\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"propiedades\"]').forEach(cb => {\r\n        cb.checked = false;\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('infoSimulacion').textContent = \r\n        `Mezcla aleatoria seleccionada: ${aleatoria}. Haz clic en \"CLASIFICAR MEZCLA\".`;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarClasificador() {\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\udd04 Reiniciando clasificador...\");\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('mezclaInput').value = \"\";\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"propiedades\"]').forEach(cb => {\r\n        cb.checked = false;\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n    const nodos = ['nodoMezclaInicial', 'nodoMetodo', 'nodoComponente1', 'nodoComponente2', 'efectoTyndall'];\r\n    nodos.forEach(nodoId => {\r\n        const nodo = document.getElementById(nodoId);\r\n        nodo.style.opacity = '0';\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar datos\r\n    const datos = ['dataMezcla', 'dataTipo', 'dataSubtipo', 'dataMetodoSeparacion', 'dataTyndall', 'dataTamano'];\r\n    datos.forEach(id => {\r\n        document.getElementById(id).textContent = '-';\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('infoSimulacion').textContent = \r\n        \"Ingresa una mezcla y haz clic en 'CLASIFICAR MEZCLA'\";\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE RECOMENDACI\u00d3N DE M\u00c9TODOS\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nconst metodosRecomendados = {\r\n    \"solido-liquido\": {\r\n        \"tamano\": \"Filtraci\u00f3n\",\r\n        \"densidad\": \"Decantaci\u00f3n\",\r\n        \"solubilidad\": \"Evaporaci\u00f3n\/Cristalizaci\u00f3n\",\r\n        \"afinidad\": \"Cromatograf\u00eda\",\r\n        \"magnetismo\": \"Separaci\u00f3n magn\u00e9tica\",\r\n        \"volatilidad\": \"Evaporaci\u00f3n\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"liquido-liquido\": {\r\n        \"densidad\": \"Decantaci\u00f3n\/Embudo\",\r\n        \"ebullicion\": \"Destilaci\u00f3n\",\r\n        \"afinidad\": \"Extracci\u00f3n con solvente\",\r\n        \"solubilidad\": \"Extracci\u00f3n\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"solido-solido\": {\r\n        \"densidad\": \"Flotaci\u00f3n\",\r\n        \"magnetismo\": \"Separaci\u00f3n magn\u00e9tica\",\r\n        \"solubilidad\": \"Extracci\u00f3n selectiva\",\r\n        \"volatilidad\": \"Sublimaci\u00f3n\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"gas-liquido\": {\r\n        \"solubilidad\": \"Absorci\u00f3n\",\r\n        \"ebullicion\": \"Destilaci\u00f3n\",\r\n        \"presion\": \"Compresi\u00f3n\/Descompresi\u00f3n\"\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\nfunction recomendarMetodo() {\r\n    const tipoMezcla = document.getElementById('tipoMezcla').value;\r\n    const propiedad = document.getElementById('propiedad').value;\r\n    \r\n    const recomendacion = metodosRecomendados[tipoMezcla]?.[propiedad] || \r\n                         \"No se encontr\u00f3 m\u00e9todo espec\u00edfico. Considera m\u00faltiples t\u00e9cnicas.\";\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('recomendacionMetodo').innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"recomendacion-card\">\r\n            <h5>\ud83e\uddea M\u00c9TODO RECOMENDADO<\/h5>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-recomendado\">${recomendacion}<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"explicacion\">\r\n                <strong>Tipo:<\/strong> ${tipoMezcla.replace('-', ' ').toUpperCase()}<br>\r\n                <strong>Propiedad:<\/strong> ${propiedad.toUpperCase()}<br>\r\n                <strong>Eficiencia:<\/strong> Alta para esta combinaci\u00f3n\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    `;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n        \r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n        verificarCompletadoQuiz();\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction verificarCompletadoQuiz() {\r\n    const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n    const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q => \r\n        q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n    );\r\n    \r\n    if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n        quizCompletado = true;\r\n        mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n    const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n    \r\n    let feedback = \"\";\r\n    if (porcentaje >= 90) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas completamente el tema de mezclas.\";\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 70) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero revisa algunos conceptos clave.\";\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 50) {\r\n        feedback = \"\u26a0\ufe0f Necesitas repasar los tipos de mezclas y m\u00e9todos de separaci\u00f3n.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\u274c Requieres estudio intensivo del tema.\";\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE ERRORES COMUNES\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nfunction toggleError(header) {\r\n    const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n    \r\n    if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n    } else {\r\n        content.style.display = 'block';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n    \r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n    \r\n    alert('\ud83d\udcca AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n' +\r\n        `Clasificaci\u00f3n: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `Tipos mezclas: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `M\u00e9todos separaci\u00f3n: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Revisa el plan de estudio recomendado seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n    \r\n    console.log(`AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada: ${slider1}, ${slider2}, ${slider3}`);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ INTERACTIVIDAD DE TABLAS Y TARJETAS\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ Tabla interactiva\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(row => {\r\n    row.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const tipo = this.dataset.tipo;\r\n        const info = document.getElementById('infoTipo');\r\n        \r\n        const infoTextos = {\r\n            solucion: \"\ud83d\udd2c SOLUCI\u00d3N: Part\u00edculas a nivel molecular\/at\u00f3mico (<1 nm). No presentan efecto Tyndall. Ej: aire, agua salada.\",\r\n            coloide: \"\ud83d\udd2c COLOIDE: Part\u00edculas 1-1000 nm. Presentan efecto Tyndall. Ej: leche, gelatina, mayonesa.\",\r\n            suspension: \"\ud83d\udd2c SUSPENSI\u00d3N: Part\u00edculas >1000 nm. Sedimentan, presentan efecto Tyndall fuerte. Ej: arena+agua, jugo con pulpa.\"\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        info.textContent = infoTextos[tipo] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\";\r\n        info.style.animation = \"highlight 0.5s\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar\/ocultar detalles\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.ejemplo-detalle').forEach(detalle => {\r\n            detalle.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        if (tipo === 'solucion') {\r\n            document.getElementById('detalleSolucion').style.display = 'block';\r\n        } else if (tipo === 'coloide') {\r\n            document.getElementById('detalleColoide').style.display = 'block';\r\n        } else if (tipo === 'suspension') {\r\n            document.getElementById('detalleSuspension').style.display = 'block';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(r => {\r\n            r.classList.remove('selected');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Marcar fila seleccionada\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ M\u00e9todos de separaci\u00f3n interactivos\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.metodo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const metodo = this.dataset.metodo;\r\n        \r\n        const metodosInfo = {\r\n            destilacion: \"\u2668\ufe0f DESTILACI\u00d3N: Separa l\u00edquidos por diferencia en puntos de ebullici\u00f3n. \u0394T m\u00ednima recomendada: 25\u00b0C. Aplicaciones: producci\u00f3n de alcohol, purificaci\u00f3n de agua.\",\r\n            filtracion: \"\ud83d\udd73\ufe0f FILTRACI\u00d3N: Separa s\u00f3lidos insolubles de l\u00edquidos usando medio poroso. Tama\u00f1o m\u00ednimo part\u00edcula: 1 \u00b5m. Aplicaciones: purificaci\u00f3n de agua, caf\u00e9.\",\r\n            decantacion: \"\u2696\ufe0f DECANTACI\u00d3N: Separa l\u00edquidos inmiscibles por diferencia de densidades. \u0394\u03c1 m\u00ednima: 0.1 g\/mL. Aplicaciones: separaci\u00f3n aceite-agua.\",\r\n            centrifugacion: \"\ud83c\udf00 CENTRIFUGACI\u00d3N: Acelera separaci\u00f3n por fuerza centr\u00edfuga. Fuerza t\u00edpica: 1000-15000 G. Aplicaciones: separaci\u00f3n sangu\u00ednea.\",\r\n            cromatografia: \"\ud83c\udf08 CROMATOGRAF\u00cdA: Separa por diferencia en afinidad por fases. Resoluci\u00f3n: 0.01 \u00b5g. Aplicaciones: an\u00e1lisis forense, farmac\u00e9utico.\",\r\n            sublimacion: \"\u2601\ufe0f SUBLIMACI\u00d3N: Separa s\u00f3lidos por sublimaci\u00f3n selectiva. Temperatura t\u00edpica: 80-100\u00b0C. Aplicaciones: purificaci\u00f3n de naftalina.\",\r\n            evaporacion: \"\u2600\ufe0f EVAPORACI\u00d3N: Vaporiza solvente para recuperar soluto. Eficiencia: 95-99%. Aplicaciones: producci\u00f3n de sal.\",\r\n            embudo: \"\ud83e\udd64 EMBUDO DECANTACI\u00d3N: Separa l\u00edquidos inmiscibles por gravedad controlada. \u0394\u03c1 requerida: 0.05 g\/mL. Aplicaciones: extracci\u00f3n l\u00edquido-l\u00edquido.\"\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        alert(`\ud83e\uddea ${this.querySelector('h4').textContent}\\n\\n${metodosInfo[metodo] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\"}`);\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Objetivos interactivos\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n        this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n        const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n        checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n        checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : 'transparent';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Sistema Cyberpunk Educativo inicializado\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\udcda Lecci\u00f3n: Mezclas - Homog\u00e9neas, Heterog\u00e9neas, Separaci\u00f3n\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\udd2c Simulador, Quiz y Herramientas interactivas listas\");\r\n\r\n\/\/ CSS para animaciones\r\nconst style = document.createElement('style');\r\nstyle.textContent = `\r\n    @keyframes dash {\r\n        to {\r\n            stroke-dashoffset: 0;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    @keyframes pulse {\r\n        0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\r\n        50% { opacity: 0.7; }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    @keyframes highlight {\r\n        0% { background-color: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0); }\r\n        50% { background-color: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.1); }\r\n        100% { background-color: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0); }\r\n    }\r\n`;\r\ndocument.head.appendChild(style);\r\n<\/script>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Mezcla homog\u00e9nea ejemplo","respuesta":"Aire, salmuera"},{"enunciado":"Mezcla heterog\u00e9nea ejemplo","respuesta":"Sopa, granito"},{"enunciado":"Separaci\u00f3n f\u00edsica","respuesta":"Destilaci\u00f3n, filtraci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Separar aceite de agua","respuesta":"Embudo decantaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Separar sal de agua","respuesta":"Evaporaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Separar alcohol de agua","respuesta":"Destilaci\u00f3n fraccionada"},{"enunciado":"Efecto Tyndall en leche","respuesta":"S\u00ed (coloide)"},{"enunciado":"Suspensi\u00f3n se asienta","respuesta":"S\u00ed"},{"enunciado":"Soluci\u00f3n no muestra Tyndall","respuesta":"Correcto"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC: soluci\u00f3n es","respuesta":"Mezcla homog\u00e9nea"},{"enunciado":"NIST: % O\u2082 en aire seco","respuesta":"20.95%"},{"enunciado":"Aze\u00f3tropo etanol-agua","respuesta":"95.6% etanol"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Mezclas se separan...","opciones":["F\u00edsicamente","Qu\u00edmicamente","Nuclearmente","Nada"],"correcta":"F\u00edsicamente"},{"pregunta":"Mezcla homog\u00e9nea es...","opciones":["Uniforme","No uniforme","Pura","Elemento"],"correcta":"Uniforme"},{"pregunta":"Ejemplo homog\u00e9nea","opciones":["Aire","Sopa","Roca","Arena"],"correcta":"Aire"},{"pregunta":"Uni\u00f3n en mezclas","opciones":["F\u00edsica","Qu\u00edmica","I\u00f3nica","Covalente"],"correcta":"F\u00edsica"},{"pregunta":"Aceite + agua es...","opciones":["Heterog\u00e9nea","Homog\u00e9nea","Pura","Compuesto"],"correcta":"Heterog\u00e9nea"},{"pregunta":"Az\u00facar en agua es...","opciones":["Soluci\u00f3n","Suspensi\u00f3n","Coloide","Elemento"],"correcta":"Soluci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Leche es...","opciones":["Coloide","Soluci\u00f3n","Suspensi\u00f3n","Pura"],"correcta":"Coloide"},{"pregunta":"Arena en agua es...","opciones":["Suspensi\u00f3n","Soluci\u00f3n","Coloide","Gas"],"correcta":"Suspensi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Destilaci\u00f3n separa por...","opciones":["Punto ebullici\u00f3n","Color","Masa","Sabor"],"correcta":"Punto ebullici\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Filtraci\u00f3n usa...","opciones":["Papel poroso","Calor","Luz","Presi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Papel poroso"},{"pregunta":"Efecto Tyndall en soluci\u00f3n","opciones":["No","S\u00ed","Fuerte","D\u00e9bil"],"correcta":"No"},{"pregunta":"Efecto Tyndall en leche","opciones":["S\u00ed","No","Solo calor","Solo luz"],"correcta":"S\u00ed"},{"pregunta":"Suspensi\u00f3n se asienta","opciones":["S\u00ed","No","Solo con calor","Nunca"],"correcta":"S\u00ed"},{"pregunta":"Coloide tama\u00f1o part\u00edcula","opciones":["1\u20131000 nm","&lt;1 nm","&gt;1000 nm","0 nm"],"correcta":"1\u20131000 nm"},{"pregunta":"Embudo decantaci\u00f3n separa...","opciones":["L\u00edquidos inmiscibles","Gases","S\u00f3lidos","Coloides"],"correcta":"L\u00edquidos inmiscibles"},{"pregunta":"Cromatograf\u00eda separa por...","opciones":["Afinidad fase","Masa","Volumen","Color"],"correcta":"Afinidad fase"},{"pregunta":"Sublimaci\u00f3n separa...","opciones":["S\u00f3lidos vol\u00e1tiles","L\u00edquidos","Gases","Coloides"],"correcta":"S\u00f3lidos vol\u00e1tiles"},{"pregunta":"% O\u2082 en aire seco","opciones":["20.95%","78.08%","0.93%","0.04%"],"correcta":"20.95%"},{"pregunta":"Centrifugaci\u00f3n acelera...","opciones":["Decantaci\u00f3n","Fusi\u00f3n","Evaporaci\u00f3n","Sublimaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Decantaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC: soluci\u00f3n es...","opciones":["Mezcla homog\u00e9nea","Pura","Heterog\u00e9nea","Elemento"],"correcta":"Mezcla homog\u00e9nea"},{"pregunta":"Aze\u00f3tropo etanol-agua","opciones":["95.6% etanol","100% etanol","50% etanol","0% etanol"],"correcta":"95.6% etanol"},{"pregunta":"Gel es un coloide...","opciones":["S\u00f3lido en l\u00edquido","L\u00edquido en s\u00f3lido","Gas en l\u00edquido","S\u00f3lido en gas"],"correcta":"L\u00edquido en s\u00f3lido"},{"pregunta":"Emulsi\u00f3n es...","opciones":["L\u00edquido en l\u00edquido","S\u00f3lido en l\u00edquido","Gas en l\u00edquido","L\u00edquido en gas"],"correcta":"L\u00edquido en l\u00edquido"},{"pregunta":"Mayonesa es...","opciones":["Emulsi\u00f3n","Soluci\u00f3n","Suspensi\u00f3n","Aerosol"],"correcta":"Emulsi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Humo es...","opciones":["Aerosol s\u00f3lido en gas","Espuma","Gel","Emulsi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Aerosol s\u00f3lido en gas"},{"pregunta":"Separar prote\u00ednas por...","opciones":["Electroforesis","Destilaci\u00f3n","Filtraci\u00f3n","Decantaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Electroforesis"},{"pregunta":"Di\u00e1lisis separa por...","opciones":["Membrana semipermeable","Calor","Luz","Presi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Membrana semipermeable"},{"pregunta":"Cristalizaci\u00f3n fraccionada separa...","opciones":["Sales por solubilidad","Gases","L\u00edquidos","Coloides"],"correcta":"Sales por solubilidad"},{"pregunta":"Extracci\u00f3n l\u00edquido-l\u00edquido usa...","opciones":["Solubilidad en dos solventes","Densidad","Color","pH"],"correcta":"Solubilidad en dos solventes"},{"pregunta":"Ley de Henry aplica a...","opciones":["Solubilidad gases en l\u00edquidos","S\u00f3lidos","Coloides","Suspensiones"],"correcta":"Solubilidad gases en l\u00edquidos"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"sustancias-puras","titulo":"Sustancias Puras: La Esencia Inmutable de la Qu\u00edmica","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-quimica-puras\" data-tema=\"sustancias-puras\">\r\n\r\n<!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n    <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n        SUSTANCIAS PURAS: LA ESENCIA INMUTABLE DE LA QU\u00cdMICA\r\n    <\/h1>\r\n    <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n        Elementos, compuestos, propiedades constantes y separaci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/header>\r\n\r\n<!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n<section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Diferenciar elementos y compuestos<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Identificar composici\u00f3n at\u00f3mica y m\u00e9todos de separaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Comprender propiedades constantes<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Analizar puntos de fusi\u00f3n, ebullici\u00f3n y densidad fijos<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Aplicar Ley de Proust<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Calcular proporciones definidas en compuestos<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Dominar separaci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Seleccionar m\u00e9todos para descomponer compuestos<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n<section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n            <h3>Producci\u00f3n de Hidr\u00f3geno Verde<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Electr\u00f3lisis del agua para obtener H\u2082 combustible sin emisiones<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"dato-neon\">Eficiencia: 70-80%<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n            <h3>Purificaci\u00f3n de Metales<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Refinaci\u00f3n electrol\u00edtica para obtener cobre, aluminio, oro puro<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"dato-neon\">Pureza: 99.99%<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n            <h3>S\u00edntesis Industrial<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Descomposici\u00f3n t\u00e9rmica de carbonatos para cal viva (CaO)<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"dato-neon\">Temperatura: 900-1000\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n<section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcd8<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <!-- INTRODUCCI\u00d3N -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>1. \u00bfQu\u00e9 son las Sustancias Puras?<\/h3>\r\n        <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n            <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udd2c SUSTANCIA PURA<\/h4>\r\n                <p><strong>Definici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Material con <strong>composici\u00f3n qu\u00edmica fija<\/strong> y <strong>propiedades constantes<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"caracteristicas\">\r\n                    <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\u2713<\/span>\r\n                        <span>No se separan por m\u00e9todos f\u00edsicos<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\u2713<\/span>\r\n                        <span>Puntos de fusi\u00f3n y ebullici\u00f3n definidos<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\u2713<\/span>\r\n                        <span>Composici\u00f3n independiente del origen<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                    \\[ \\text{Sustancia Pura} = \\text{Composici\u00f3n Constante} \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- TIPOS DE SUSTANCIAS PURAS -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>2. Tipos de Sustancias Puras<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"comparativa-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"comp-card elemento\">\r\n                <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\u269b\ufe0f ELEMENTO<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-badge\">\u00c1tomos id\u00e9nticos<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Composici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Un solo tipo de \u00e1tomo<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Separaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Solo por reacciones nucleares<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>S\u00edmbolo:<\/strong> 1-2 letras (Au, O, Fe)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Propiedades:<\/strong> Fijas y caracter\u00edsticas<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"simbolo\">O\u2082<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">Ox\u00edgeno<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"tipo\">Gas diat\u00f3mico<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"simbolo\">Au<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">Oro<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"tipo\">Metal noble<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"simbolo\">C (grafito)<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">Carbono<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"tipo\">Al\u00f3tropos<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"comp-card compuesto\">\r\n                <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83e\uddea COMPUESTO<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-badge\">\u00c1tomos diferentes<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Composici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Dos o m\u00e1s elementos en proporci\u00f3n fija<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Separaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Solo por reacci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>F\u00f3rmula:<\/strong> Indicaci\u00f3n de proporciones (H\u2082O, CO\u2082)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ley:<\/strong> Proporciones definidas (Proust)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"formula\">H\u2082O<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">Agua<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"elementos\">H:O = 2:1<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"formula\">NaCl<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">Cloruro s\u00f3dico<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"elementos\">Na:Cl = 1:1<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"formula\">CO\u2082<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">CO\u2082<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"elementos\">C:O = 1:2<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROPIEDADES CONSTANTES -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>3. Propiedades Constantes de Sustancias Puras<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n            <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>PROPIEDAD<\/th>\r\n                        <th>CARACTER\u00cdSTICA<\/th>\r\n                        <th>EJEMPLO (H\u2082O)<\/th>\r\n                        <th>PRECISI\u00d3N NIST<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr data-propiedad=\"fusion\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">PUNTO FUSI\u00d3N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Temperatura constante al fundirse<\/td>\r\n                        <td>0.00\u00b0C<\/td>\r\n                        <td>0.0000\u00b0C<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-propiedad=\"ebullicion\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">PUNTO EBULLICI\u00d3N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Temperatura constante al hervir<\/td>\r\n                        <td>100.00\u00b0C<\/td>\r\n                        <td>99.974\u00b0C<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-propiedad=\"densidad\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">DENSIDAD<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Masa\/volumen constante a T,P fijas<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1.000 g\/cm\u00b3<\/td>\r\n                        <td>0.999972 g\/cm\u00b3<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-propiedad=\"composicion\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">COMPOSICI\u00d3N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Proporci\u00f3n de elementos constante<\/td>\r\n                        <td>11.19% H, 88.81% O<\/td>\r\n                        <td>11.1888% H, 88.8112% O<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoPropiedad\">\r\n                Selecciona una propiedad para m\u00e1s detalles\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"propiedad-ejemplos\">\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-detalle\" id=\"detalleFusion\">\r\n                    <h4>\u2744\ufe0f An\u00e1lisis: Punto de Fusi\u00f3n Constante<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfaf Caracter\u00edstica clave<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>La temperatura permanece constante durante todo el cambio de fase s\u00f3lido-l\u00edquido<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                                \\[ T_{\\text{fusi\u00f3n}} = \\text{constante} \\]\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcca Datos NIST 2025<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Agua: 0.0000\u00b0C (punto triple)<br>\r\n                            Oro: 1064.18\u00b0C<br>\r\n                            NaCl: 800.7\u00b0C<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-detalle\" id=\"detalleEbullicion\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd25 An\u00e1lisis: Punto de Ebullici\u00f3n Constante<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udca1 Diferencia con mezclas<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Las mezclas tienen intervalo de ebullici\u00f3n, las sustancias puras tienen temperatura fija<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcc8 Aplicaci\u00f3n pr\u00e1ctica<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Identificaci\u00f3n de sustancias y verificaci\u00f3n de pureza en laboratorio<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- LEY DE PROUST -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>4. Ley de Proporciones Definidas (Proust, 1799)<\/h3>\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <h4>\u2696\ufe0f LEY DE PROUST<\/h4>\r\n            <p><strong>Enunciado:<\/strong> \"Un compuesto qu\u00edmico puro siempre contiene los mismos elementos combinados en la misma proporci\u00f3n en masa\"<\/p>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"proust-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"proust-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"proust-icon\">\ud83d\udca7<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"proust-content\">\r\n                        <h5>Agua (H\u2082O)<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Relaci\u00f3n masa H:O = 1:8<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Siempre 11.19% H, 88.81% O<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"proust-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"proust-icon\">\ud83e\uddc2<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"proust-content\">\r\n                        <h5>Cloruro s\u00f3dico (NaCl)<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Relaci\u00f3n masa Na:Cl = 23:35.5<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Siempre 39.34% Na, 60.66% Cl<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"proust-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"proust-icon\">\ud83d\udca8<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"proust-content\">\r\n                        <h5>Dioxido carbono (CO\u2082)<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Relaci\u00f3n masa C:O = 12:32<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Siempre 27.29% C, 72.71% O<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"formula-display\">\r\n                \\[ \\frac{m_{\\text{elemento A}}}{m_{\\text{elemento B}}} = \\text{constante} \\]\r\n                <div class=\"formula-explicacion\">\r\n                    <strong>Donde:<\/strong> m = masa, la relaci\u00f3n es independiente del origen o m\u00e9todo de preparaci\u00f3n\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- M\u00c9TODOS DE SEPARACI\u00d3N QU\u00cdMICA -->\r\n<section class=\"separacion-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\u26a1<\/span> SEPARACI\u00d3N QU\u00cdMICA DE COMPUESTOS\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"metodos-grid\">\r\n        <!-- ELECTR\u00d3LISIS -->\r\n        <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"electrolisis\">\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\u26a1<\/div>\r\n            <h4>ELECTR\u00d3LISIS<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                Descomposici\u00f3n por corriente el\u00e9ctrica\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Reducci\u00f3n-oxidaci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> H\u2082O \u2192 H\u2082 + \u00bdO\u2082<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Voltaje:<\/strong> 1.23 V m\u00ednimo<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- DESCOMPOSICI\u00d3N T\u00c9RMICA -->\r\n        <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"descomposicion\">\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\ud83d\udd25<\/div>\r\n            <h4>DESCOMPOSICI\u00d3N T\u00c9RMICA<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                Descomposici\u00f3n por calor\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Energ\u00eda t\u00e9rmica<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> CaCO\u2083 \u2192 CaO + CO\u2082<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Temperatura:<\/strong> 900-1000\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- REACCI\u00d3N QU\u00cdMICA -->\r\n        <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"reaccion\">\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\ud83e\uddea<\/div>\r\n            <h4>REACCI\u00d3N QU\u00cdMICA<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                Descomposici\u00f3n con reactivos\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principio:<\/strong> Reactividad<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> 2H\u2082O\u2082 \u2192 2H\u2082O + O\u2082<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Catalizador:<\/strong> MnO\u2082 com\u00fan<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- REACCIONES DETALLADAS -->\r\n    <div class=\"reacciones-detalle\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83e\uddea ECUACIONES QU\u00cdMICAS DE SEPARACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n        <div class=\"reaccion-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"reaccion-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"reaccion-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"reaccion-num\">1<\/span>\r\n                    <h5>Electr\u00f3lisis del agua<\/h5>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"reaccion-ecuacion\">\r\n                    \\[ 2H_2O_{(l)} \\xrightarrow[electricidad]{} 2H_{2(g)} + O_{2(g)} \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"reaccion-datos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Voltaje:<\/strong> 1.23 V te\u00f3rico<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Eficiencia:<\/strong> 70-80% industrial<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Aplicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Hidr\u00f3geno verde<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"reaccion-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"reaccion-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"reaccion-num\">2<\/span>\r\n                    <h5>Descomposici\u00f3n de carbonatos<\/h5>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"reaccion-ecuacion\">\r\n                    \\[ CaCO_{3(s)} \\xrightarrow[\\Delta]{} CaO_{(s)} + CO_{2(g)} \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"reaccion-datos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Temperatura:<\/strong> 900-1000\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Producto:<\/strong> Cal viva (CaO)<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Aplicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Construcci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"reaccion-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"reaccion-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"reaccion-num\">3<\/span>\r\n                    <h5>Descomposici\u00f3n per\u00f3xidos<\/h5>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"reaccion-ecuacion\">\r\n                    \\[ 2H_2O_{2(l)} \\xrightarrow[MnO_2]{} 2H_2O_{(l)} + O_{2(g)} \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"reaccion-datos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Catalizador:<\/strong> MnO\u2082<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Velocidad:<\/strong> R\u00e1pida con catalizador<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Aplicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Desinfecci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n<section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/span> SIMULADOR: ELECTR\u00d3LISIS DEL AGUA\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"electrolisis-agua\">\r\n        <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n            <h3>CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"compuestoInput\">Compuesto a descomponer:<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"compuestoInput\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                    <option value=\"H2O\">Agua (H\u2082O)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"NaCl\">Cloruro s\u00f3dico fundido (NaCl)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Al2O3\">\u00d3xido de aluminio (Al\u2082O\u2083)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"CuSO4\">Sulfato c\u00faprico (CuSO\u2084)<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"voltajeInput\">Voltaje aplicado (V):<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"voltajeInput\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1.23\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-value\">\r\n                    <span id=\"voltajeValue\">1.23 V<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"hint\" id=\"voltajeHint\">(M\u00ednimo te\u00f3rico: 1.23 V)<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"tiempoInput\">Tiempo de electr\u00f3lisis (s):<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"tiempoInput\" min=\"0\" max=\"60\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-value\">\r\n                    <span id=\"tiempoValue\">0 s<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"electrolito\">Electrolito a\u00f1adido:<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"electrolito\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                    <option value=\"ninguno\">Ninguno (agua pura)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"H2SO4\">\u00c1cido sulf\u00farico (H\u2082SO\u2084)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"NaOH\">Hidr\u00f3xido s\u00f3dico (NaOH)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Na2SO4\">Sulfato s\u00f3dico (Na\u2082SO\u2084)<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-iniciar\" onclick=\"iniciarElectrolisis()\">\r\n                <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u26a1<\/span> INICIAR ELECTR\u00d3LISIS\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-pausar\" onclick=\"pausarElectrolisis()\" disabled>\r\n                <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u23f8\ufe0f<\/span> PAUSAR\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarSimulador()\">\r\n                <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N SVG ANIMADA -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacionElectrolisis\">\r\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" id=\"svgElectrolisis\">\r\n                <!-- Fondo celda electrol\u00edtica -->\r\n                <rect x=\"100\" y=\"50\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\" fill=\"#0a1a2a\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#00FFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Electrodo positivo (\u00e1nodo) -->\r\n                <rect x=\"120\" y=\"70\" width=\"20\" height=\"210\" fill=\"#FF9800\" id=\"anodo\">\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.7;1\" dur=\"1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" id=\"anodoAnim\"\/>\r\n                <\/rect>\r\n                <text x=\"130\" y=\"40\" fill=\"#FF9800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">\u00c1NODO (+)<\/text>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Electrodo negativo (c\u00e1todo) -->\r\n                <rect x=\"460\" y=\"70\" width=\"20\" height=\"210\" fill=\"#2196F3\" id=\"catodo\">\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.7;1\" dur=\"1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" id=\"catodoAnim\"\/>\r\n                <\/rect>\r\n                <text x=\"470\" y=\"40\" fill=\"#2196F3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">C\u00c1TODO (-)<\/text>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- L\u00edquido electrolito -->\r\n                <rect x=\"140\" y=\"70\" width=\"320\" height=\"210\" fill=\"url(#aguaGrad)\" id=\"electrolito\"\/>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Burbujas de gas -->\r\n                <circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"200\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#FF6B6B\" opacity=\"0\" id=\"burbujaO2\">\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"200;50\" dur=\"3s\" begin=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1;0\" dur=\"3s\" begin=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <\/circle>\r\n                <text x=\"130\" y=\"40\" fill=\"#FF6B6B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" opacity=\"0\" id=\"textoO2\">O\u2082<\/text>\r\n                \r\n                <circle cx=\"470\" cy=\"200\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" opacity=\"0\" id=\"burbujaH2\">\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"200;50\" dur=\"1.5s\" begin=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1;0\" dur=\"1.5s\" begin=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                <\/circle>\r\n                <text x=\"470\" y=\"40\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" opacity=\"0\" id=\"textoH2\">H\u2082<\/text>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Circuito el\u00e9ctrico -->\r\n                <path d=\"M50 150 L120 150\" stroke=\"#FFFF00\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"\/>\r\n                <path d=\"M480 150 L550 150\" stroke=\"#FFFF00\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"\/>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Fuente de poder -->\r\n                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"130\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#9C27B0\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                <text x=\"70\" y=\"155\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" id=\"voltajeDisplay\">1.23V<\/text>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Gradiente agua -->\r\n                <defs>\r\n                    <linearGradient id=\"aguaGrad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"0%\" y2=\"100%\">\r\n                        <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#2196F3\" stop-opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                        <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0D47A1\" stop-opacity=\"0.9\"\/>\r\n                    <\/linearGradient>\r\n                    \r\n                    <filter id=\"glow\">\r\n                        <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"2\" result=\"coloredBlur\"\/>\r\n                        <feMerge>\r\n                            <feMergeNode in=\"coloredBlur\"\/>\r\n                            <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"\/>\r\n                        <\/feMerge>\r\n                    <\/filter>\r\n                <\/defs>\r\n            <\/svg>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"simulator-info\" id=\"infoElectrolisis\">\r\n                Selecciona compuesto y haz clic en \"INICIAR ELECTR\u00d3LISIS\"\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n            <h3>DATOS DE ELECTR\u00d3LISIS<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Compuesto:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataCompuesto\">H\u2082O<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Reacci\u00f3n:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataReaccion\">2H\u2082O \u2192 2H\u2082 + O\u2082<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">VOLTAJE APLICADO:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataVoltaje\">1.23 V<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Tiempo transcurrido:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTiempo\">0 s<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">H\u2082 producido:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataH2\">0.00 mL<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">O\u2082 producido:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataO2\">0.00 mL<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Relaci\u00f3n H\u2082:O\u2082:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataRelacion\">2:1<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udcca LEY DE FARADAY<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <span>Masa H\u2082 te\u00f3rica:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statMasaH2\">0.00 g<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <span>Carga el\u00e9ctrica:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statCarga\">0.00 C<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <span>Eficiencia:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statEficiencia\">0%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n<section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: SUSTANCIAS PURAS\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n        <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la diferencia fundamental entre elemento y compuesto?<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                    Los elementos son naturales, los compuestos artificiales\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                    Los elementos tienen un tipo de \u00e1tomo, los compuestos varios tipos\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                    Los elementos son s\u00f3lidos, los compuestos l\u00edquidos o gaseosos\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                    Los elementos tienen f\u00f3rmula, los compuestos no\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                    <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> La diferencia est\u00e1 en la composici\u00f3n at\u00f3mica.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                    <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa las definiciones de elemento y compuesto.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Un elemento est\u00e1 formado por un solo tipo de \u00e1tomos (ej: Au, O\u2082). Un compuesto est\u00e1 formado por dos o m\u00e1s elementos diferentes en proporci\u00f3n fija (ej: H\u2082O, NaCl).<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                <h3>Seg\u00fan la Ley de Proust, \u00bfqu\u00e9 caracteriza a un compuesto qu\u00edmico?<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                    Siempre se obtiene de fuentes naturales\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                    Tiene propiedades f\u00edsicas variables\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                    Mantiene proporciones de masa constantes entre sus elementos\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                    Puede separarse por m\u00e9todos f\u00edsicos\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                    <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> La Ley de Proporciones Definidas establece proporciones constantes.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                    <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa el enunciado de la Ley de Proust.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Joseph Proust estableci\u00f3 en 1799 que un compuesto puro siempre contiene los mismos elementos combinados en la misma proporci\u00f3n en masa, independientemente de su origen o m\u00e9todo de preparaci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 m\u00e9todo usar\u00edas para separar el agua en hidr\u00f3geno y ox\u00edgeno?<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                    Filtraci\u00f3n\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                    Destilaci\u00f3n\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                    Decantaci\u00f3n\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                    Electr\u00f3lisis\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                    <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> La electr\u00f3lisis descompone el agua mediante corriente el\u00e9ctrica.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                    <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Los m\u00e9todos f\u00edsicos no separan compuestos en sus elementos.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El agua (H\u2082O) es un compuesto que requiere un m\u00e9todo qu\u00edmico para separarse en sus elementos. La electr\u00f3lisis aplica corriente el\u00e9ctrica para provocar la reacci\u00f3n: 2H\u2082O \u2192 2H\u2082 + O\u2082.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/30\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<section class=\"errors-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES Y SOLUCIONES\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"errors-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"error-card active\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                <h3>CONFUNDIR SUSTANCIA PURA CON MEZCLA HOMOG\u00c9NEA<\/h3>\r\n                <span class=\"error-toggle\">\u2212<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                    <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"El aire es una sustancia pura porque parece homog\u00e9neo\"\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                    <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El aire es una MEZCLA HOMOG\u00c9NEA (composici\u00f3n variable: 78% N\u2082, 21% O\u2082, 1% otros). Una sustancia pura tendr\u00eda composici\u00f3n fija.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Pr\u00e1ctica:<\/strong> Clasifica: Agua destilada, Acero, Oro 24k, Alcohol et\u00edlico 96%<\/p>\r\n                    <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                    <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display:none;\">\r\n                        <strong>Agua destilada:<\/strong> Sustancia pura (compuesto H\u2082O)<br>\r\n                        <strong>Acero:<\/strong> Mezcla homog\u00e9nea (Fe + C)<br>\r\n                        <strong>Oro 24k:<\/strong> Sustancia pura (elemento Au)<br>\r\n                        <strong>Alcohol 96%:<\/strong> Mezcla (96% etanol + 4% agua)\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"error-card active\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                <h3>APLICAR M\u00c9TODOS F\u00cdSICOS PARA SEPARAR COMPUESTOS<\/h3>\r\n                <span class=\"error-toggle\">\u2212<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                    <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"Para separar la sal (NaCl) uso filtraci\u00f3n o destilaci\u00f3n\"\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                    <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> NaCl es un COMPUESTO (no mezcla). Para separar Na y Cl se requiere:\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Electr\u00f3lisis de NaCl fundido:<\/strong> 2NaCl \u2192 2Na + Cl\u2082<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>M\u00e9todos f\u00edsicos<\/strong> solo separan NaCl de otras sustancias (no sus elementos)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                    <table>\r\n                        <tr><th>Sustancia<\/th><th>Tipo<\/th><th>Separaci\u00f3n elementos<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>H\u2082O (agua)<\/td><td>Compuesto<\/td><td>Electr\u00f3lisis<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>O\u2082 (ox\u00edgeno)<\/td><td>Elemento<\/td><td>No separable (ya es puro)<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>NaCl (sal)<\/td><td>Compuesto<\/td><td>Electr\u00f3lisis fundido<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <\/table>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                <h3>Problema de Clasificaci\u00f3n y Propiedades<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                <p>Analiza las siguientes sustancias e indica para cada una:<\/p>\r\n                <ol>\r\n                    <li>Si es elemento, compuesto o mezcla<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Dos propiedades constantes caracter\u00edsticas<\/li>\r\n                    <li>M\u00e9todo para separar en elementos (si aplica)<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <p>Sustancias: a) Di\u00f3xido de carbono (CO\u2082), b) Bronce (Cu+Sn), c) Plata pura (Ag), d) Agua de mar<\/p>\r\n                <p>Justifica cada respuesta con fundamentos te\u00f3ricos.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu an\u00e1lisis aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                a) <strong>CO\u2082:<\/strong> Compuesto. P.F.: -78.5\u00b0C (sublima), densidad: 1.977 g\/L. Separaci\u00f3n: Descomposici\u00f3n t\u00e9rmica (CO\u2082 \u2192 C + O\u2082 a alta T)<br>\r\n                b) <strong>Bronce:<\/strong> Mezcla homog\u00e9nea (aleaci\u00f3n). P.F. variable, densidad ~8.8 g\/cm\u00b3. No es sustancia pura.<br>\r\n                c) <strong>Ag:<\/strong> Elemento. P.F.: 961.78\u00b0C, densidad: 10.49 g\/cm\u00b3. Ya es elemento puro.<br>\r\n                d) <strong>Agua mar:<\/strong> Mezcla heterog\u00e9nea. Composici\u00f3n variable, densidad ~1.025 g\/cm\u00b3. Separaci\u00f3n f\u00edsica, no qu\u00edmica.\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                <h3>Problema de C\u00e1lculo (Ley de Proust)<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                <p>Se analizan tres muestras de \u00f3xido de cobre (CuO) obtenidas por diferentes m\u00e9todos:<\/p>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Muestra A: 4.00 g CuO contiene 3.18 g Cu<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Muestra B: 6.50 g CuO contiene 5.17 g Cu<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Muestra C: 2.25 g CuO contiene 1.79 g Cu<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n                <p>a) Verifica si cumplen la Ley de Proust calculando el % de Cu en cada muestra.<\/p>\r\n                <p>b) Calcula la proporci\u00f3n en masa Cu:O para cada muestra.<\/p>\r\n                <p>c) Si una muestra contiene 79.85% Cu, \u00bfes CuO puro? Justifica.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tus c\u00e1lculos aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"10\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR PROCEDIMIENTO<\/button>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                a) %Cu: A = (3.18\/4.00)\u00d7100 = 79.50%<br>\r\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;B = (5.17\/6.50)\u00d7100 = 79.54%<br>\r\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;C = (1.79\/2.25)\u00d7100 = 79.56%<br>\r\n                S\u00ed cumplen (valores similares).<br><br>\r\n                b) Masa O = masa total - masa Cu<br>\r\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A: Cu:O = 3.18:0.82 = 3.88:1<br>\r\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;B: Cu:O = 5.17:1.33 = 3.89:1<br>\r\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;C: Cu:O = 1.79:0.46 = 3.89:1<br><br>\r\n                c) Te\u00f3rico: CuO \u2192 Cu = 63.55\/(63.55+16.00) = 79.89%<br>\r\n                Muestra (79.85%) \u2248 te\u00f3rico \u2192 probablemente CuO puro (diferencia < 0.1%).\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n        <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Clasificaci\u00f3n correcta<\/td>\r\n                <td>Clasifica todas correctamente con justificaci\u00f3n te\u00f3rica<\/td>\r\n                <td>Clasifica mayor\u00eda correctamente con alguna justificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <td>Errores graves en clasificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>C\u00e1lculos Proust<\/td>\r\n                <td>Calcula correctamente todos los % y proporciones<\/td>\r\n                <td>Calcula mayor\u00eda correctamente con peque\u00f1os errores<\/td>\r\n                <td>Procedimiento incorrecto o incompleto<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Interpretaci\u00f3n resultados<\/td>\r\n                <td>Interpreta correctamente resultados y aplica ley de Proust<\/td>\r\n                <td>Interpreta parcialmente resultados<\/td>\r\n                <td>No interpreta o interpreta incorrectamente<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/table>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                <label>Diferenciaci\u00f3n elemento\/compuesto:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                    <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                <label>Comprensi\u00f3n Ley de Proust:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                    <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                <label>Selecci\u00f3n m\u00e9todos separaci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                    <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                <p>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es importante la constancia de propiedades en sustancias puras para la industria y la investigaci\u00f3n cient\u00edfica?<\/p>\r\n                <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                <p>Describe una aplicaci\u00f3n industrial real donde se utilice la electr\u00f3lisis y explica su importancia.<\/p>\r\n                <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu ejemplo...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcda PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\u23f1\ufe0f REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Memorizar diferencias elemento\/compuesto<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Recordar 3 m\u00e9todos separaci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Repasar Ley de Proust<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83e\uddea PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Clasificar 20 sustancias<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Resolver problemas de proporciones<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Completar el quiz interactivo<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd2c PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Investigar electr\u00f3lisis industrial<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Analizar m\u00e9todos avanzados<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Resolver problemas tipo examen<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/legacy\/hydrogen-atom\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf10 PhET: \u00c1tomo de Hidr\u00f3geno\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.nist.gov\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf10 NIST: Datos precisos propiedades\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/es.khanacademy.org\/science\/chemistry\/atomic-structure-and-properties\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf10 Khan Academy: Estructura at\u00f3mica\r\n                <\/a>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ BASE DE DATOS DE SUSTANCIAS PURAS\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nconst sustanciasPurasDB = {\r\n    \"H2O\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Agua\",\r\n        tipo: \"COMPUESTO\",\r\n        formula: \"H\u2082O\",\r\n        reaccion: \"2H\u2082O \u2192 2H\u2082 + O\u2082\",\r\n        voltajeMin: 1.23,\r\n        propiedades: {\r\n            pf: \"0.00\u00b0C\",\r\n            pe: \"100.00\u00b0C\",\r\n            densidad: \"1.000 g\/cm\u00b3\",\r\n            composicion: \"H:O = 1:8 (masa)\"\r\n        },\r\n        color: \"#2196F3\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"NaCl\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Cloruro s\u00f3dico fundido\",\r\n        tipo: \"COMPUESTO\",\r\n        formula: \"NaCl\",\r\n        reaccion: \"2NaCl \u2192 2Na + Cl\u2082\",\r\n        voltajeMin: 3.24,\r\n        propiedades: {\r\n            pf: \"801\u00b0C\",\r\n            pe: \"1465\u00b0C\",\r\n            densidad: \"2.165 g\/cm\u00b3\",\r\n            composicion: \"Na:Cl = 23:35.5\"\r\n        },\r\n        color: \"#FF9800\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"Al2O3\": {\r\n        nombre: \"\u00d3xido de aluminio (criolita)\",\r\n        tipo: \"COMPUESTO\",\r\n        formula: \"Al\u2082O\u2083\",\r\n        reaccion: \"2Al\u2082O\u2083 \u2192 4Al + 3O\u2082\",\r\n        voltajeMin: 2.1,\r\n        propiedades: {\r\n            pf: \"2072\u00b0C\",\r\n            pe: \"2977\u00b0C\",\r\n            densidad: \"3.95 g\/cm\u00b3\",\r\n            composicion: \"Al:O = 27:24\"\r\n        },\r\n        color: \"#9C27B0\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"CuSO4\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Sulfato c\u00faprico acuoso\",\r\n        tipo: \"COMPUESTO\",\r\n        formula: \"CuSO\u2084\",\r\n        reaccion: \"CuSO\u2084 \u2192 Cu + SO\u2084\u00b2\u207b (compleja)\",\r\n        voltajeMin: 0.34,\r\n        propiedades: {\r\n            pf: \"110\u00b0C (deshidrata)\",\r\n            pe: \"650\u00b0C (descompone)\",\r\n            densidad: \"3.603 g\/cm\u00b3\",\r\n            composicion: \"Cu:S:O = 63.5:32:64\"\r\n        },\r\n        color: \"#009688\"\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DE ELECTR\u00d3LISIS\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nlet electrolisisActiva = false;\r\nlet tiempoTranscurrido = 0;\r\nlet intervaloElectrolisis;\r\nlet voltajeAplicado = 1.23;\r\nlet compuestoActual = \"H2O\";\r\nlet eficiencia = 0.75; \/\/ 75% eficiencia por defecto\r\n\r\nfunction iniciarElectrolisis() {\r\n    if (electrolisisActiva) return;\r\n    \r\n    electrolisisActiva = true;\r\n    compuestoActual = document.getElementById('compuestoInput').value;\r\n    voltajeAplicado = parseFloat(document.getElementById('voltajeInput').value);\r\n    const electrolito = document.getElementById('electrolito').value;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ajustar eficiencia seg\u00fan electrolito\r\n    if (electrolito === \"H2SO4\" || electrolito === \"NaOH\") {\r\n        eficiencia = 0.85;\r\n    } else if (electrolito === \"Na2SO4\") {\r\n        eficiencia = 0.78;\r\n    } else {\r\n        eficiencia = 0.65; \/\/ Agua pura tiene menor conductividad\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar controles\r\n    document.getElementById('voltajeDisplay').textContent = voltajeAplicado.toFixed(2) + \"V\";\r\n    document.querySelector('.btn-iniciar').disabled = true;\r\n    document.querySelector('.btn-pausar').disabled = false;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Iniciar animaciones\r\n    document.getElementById('anodoAnim').beginElement();\r\n    document.getElementById('catodoAnim').beginElement();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Iniciar temporizador\r\n    tiempoTranscurrido = 0;\r\n    intervaloElectrolisis = setInterval(actualizarElectrolisis, 1000);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar datos iniciales\r\n    actualizarDatosElectrolisis();\r\n    \r\n    console.log(`\u26a1 Electr\u00f3lisis iniciada: ${compuestoActual}, ${voltajeAplicado}V, ${electrolito}`);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction pausarElectrolisis() {\r\n    electrolisisActiva = false;\r\n    clearInterval(intervaloElectrolisis);\r\n    \r\n    document.querySelector('.btn-iniciar').disabled = false;\r\n    document.querySelector('.btn-pausar').disabled = true;\r\n    \r\n    console.log(\"\u23f8\ufe0f Electr\u00f3lisis pausada\");\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarSimulador() {\r\n    electrolisisActiva = false;\r\n    clearInterval(intervaloElectrolisis);\r\n    tiempoTranscurrido = 0;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar controles\r\n    document.querySelector('.btn-iniciar').disabled = false;\r\n    document.querySelector('.btn-pausar').disabled = true;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar animaciones\r\n    document.getElementById('anodoAnim').endElement();\r\n    document.getElementById('catodoAnim').endElement();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ocultar burbujas\r\n    document.getElementById('burbujaO2').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('burbujaH2').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('textoO2').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('textoH2').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar datos\r\n    actualizarDatosElectrolisis(true);\r\n    \r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\udd04 Simulador reiniciado\");\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarElectrolisis() {\r\n    if (!electrolisisActiva) return;\r\n    \r\n    tiempoTranscurrido++;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Generar burbujas peri\u00f3dicamente\r\n    if (tiempoTranscurrido % 3 === 0) { \/\/ Cada 3 segundos burbuja O\u2082\r\n        generarBurbuja('O2');\r\n    }\r\n    if (tiempoTranscurrido % 1.5 === 0) { \/\/ Cada 1.5 segundos burbuja H\u2082\r\n        generarBurbuja('H2');\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n    actualizarDatosElectrolisis();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction generarBurbuja(tipo) {\r\n    const burbuja = document.getElementById(`burbuja${tipo}`);\r\n    const texto = document.getElementById(`texto${tipo}`);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar animaciones\r\n    const anims = burbuja.getElementsByTagName('animate');\r\n    for (let anim of anims) {\r\n        anim.beginElement();\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar texto\r\n    texto.setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n    setTimeout(() => {\r\n        texto.setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    }, 1000);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarDatosElectrolisis(reiniciar = false) {\r\n    const sustancia = sustanciasPurasDB[compuestoActual];\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular producci\u00f3n seg\u00fan Ley de Faraday\r\n    const corriente = voltajeAplicado > sustancia.voltajeMin ? 2.0 : 0.5; \/\/ Aproximaci\u00f3n\r\n    const carga = corriente * tiempoTranscurrido; \/\/ C = I \u00d7 t\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Masa te\u00f3rica seg\u00fan Faraday\r\n    let masaH2 = 0;\r\n    let masaO2 = 0;\r\n    \r\n    if (compuestoActual === \"H2O\") {\r\n        \/\/ Para agua: 2H\u2082O \u2192 2H\u2082 + O\u2082\r\n        masaH2 = (carga * 1.008) \/ (2 * 96485) * 1000; \/\/ mg\r\n        masaO2 = masaH2 \/ 2 * 16; \/\/ Relaci\u00f3n 1:8 masa\r\n    } else if (compuestoActual === \"NaCl\") {\r\n        \/\/ Para NaCl: 2NaCl \u2192 2Na + Cl\u2082\r\n        masaH2 = 0; \/\/ No hay H\u2082\r\n        masaO2 = 0; \/\/ No hay O\u2082\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Aplicar eficiencia\r\n    masaH2 *= eficiencia;\r\n    masaO2 *= eficiencia;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar elementos DOM\r\n    document.getElementById('dataCompuesto').textContent = sustancia.nombre;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataReaccion').textContent = sustancia.reaccion;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataVoltaje').textContent = voltajeAplicado.toFixed(2) + \" V\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataTiempo').textContent = tiempoTranscurrido + \" s\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataH2').textContent = reiniciar ? \"0.00 mL\" : (masaH2 \/ 0.0899).toFixed(2) + \" mL\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataO2').textContent = reiniciar ? \"0.00 mL\" : (masaO2 \/ 1.429).toFixed(2) + \" mL\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataRelacion').textContent = compuestoActual === \"H2O\" ? \"2:1\" : \"\u2014\";\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar Ley de Faraday\r\n    document.getElementById('statMasaH2').textContent = reiniciar ? \"0.00 g\" : (masaH2 \/ 1000).toFixed(4) + \" g\";\r\n    document.getElementById('statCarga').textContent = reiniciar ? \"0.00 C\" : carga.toFixed(2) + \" C\";\r\n    document.getElementById('statEficiencia').textContent = reiniciar ? \"0%\" : (eficiencia * 100).toFixed(1) + \"%\";\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar slider values\r\n    document.getElementById('voltajeValue').textContent = voltajeAplicado.toFixed(2) + \" V\";\r\n    document.getElementById('tiempoValue').textContent = tiempoTranscurrido + \" s\";\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Informaci\u00f3n de simulaci\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('infoElectrolisis').textContent = \r\n        `Electr\u00f3lisis de ${sustancia.nombre}: ${tiempoTranscurrido}s transcurridos`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ CONTROL DE SLIDERS\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\ndocument.getElementById('voltajeInput').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    voltajeAplicado = parseFloat(this.value);\r\n    document.getElementById('voltajeValue').textContent = voltajeAplicado.toFixed(2) + \" V\";\r\n    \r\n    const sustancia = sustanciasPurasDB[compuestoActual];\r\n    const hint = document.getElementById('voltajeHint');\r\n    \r\n    if (voltajeAplicado < sustancia.voltajeMin) {\r\n        hint.textContent = `\u26a0\ufe0f Insuficiente (m\u00ednimo: ${sustancia.voltajeMin} V)`;\r\n        hint.style.color = \"#FF6B6B\";\r\n    } else if (voltajeAplicado < sustancia.voltajeMin * 1.5) {\r\n        hint.textContent = `\u2713 Suficiente (m\u00ednimo: ${sustancia.voltajeMin} V)`;\r\n        hint.style.color = \"#4CAF50\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        hint.textContent = `\u26a1 Excelente (m\u00ednimo: ${sustancia.voltajeMin} V)`;\r\n        hint.style.color = \"#39FF14\";\r\n    }\r\n});\r\n\r\ndocument.getElementById('tiempoInput').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    tiempoTranscurrido = parseInt(this.value);\r\n    document.getElementById('tiempoValue').textContent = tiempoTranscurrido + \" s\";\r\n});\r\n\r\ndocument.getElementById('compuestoInput').addEventListener('change', function() {\r\n    compuestoActual = this.value;\r\n    const sustancia = sustanciasPurasDB[compuestoActual];\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar voltaje m\u00ednimo\r\n    document.getElementById('voltajeInput').value = sustancia.voltajeMin;\r\n    document.getElementById('voltajeValue').textContent = sustancia.voltajeMin + \" V\";\r\n    voltajeAplicado = sustancia.voltajeMin;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar hint\r\n    document.getElementById('voltajeHint').textContent = `(M\u00ednimo te\u00f3rico: ${sustancia.voltajeMin} V)`;\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO (mismo sistema anterior)\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n        \r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n        verificarCompletadoQuiz();\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction verificarCompletadoQuiz() {\r\n    const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n    const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q => \r\n        q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n    );\r\n    \r\n    if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n        quizCompletado = true;\r\n        mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n    const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n    \r\n    let feedback = \"\";\r\n    if (porcentaje >= 90) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas completamente el tema de sustancias puras.\";\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 70) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero revisa algunos conceptos clave.\";\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 50) {\r\n        feedback = \"\u26a0\ufe0f Necesitas repasar las diferencias entre elementos y compuestos.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\u274c Requieres estudio intensivo del tema.\";\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ ERRORES COMUNES (sistema corregido)\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.error-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    const header = card.querySelector('.error-header');\r\n    const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Estado inicial seg\u00fan tama\u00f1o pantalla\r\n    if (window.innerWidth <= 768) {\r\n        card.classList.remove('active');\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Click handler\r\n    header.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const isActive = card.classList.contains('active');\r\n        card.classList.toggle('active');\r\n        toggle.textContent = isActive ? '+' : '\u2212';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Redimensionar ventana\r\nwindow.addEventListener('resize', function() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.error-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        const toggle = card.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n        \r\n        if (window.innerWidth > 768) {\r\n            card.classList.add('active');\r\n            toggle.textContent = '\u2212';\r\n        } else {\r\n            card.classList.remove('active');\r\n            toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n    \r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n    \r\n    alert('\ud83d\udcca AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n' +\r\n        `Diferenciaci\u00f3n elemento\/compuesto: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `Ley de Proust: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `Separaci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Revisa el plan de estudio recomendado seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n    \r\n    console.log(`AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada: ${slider1}, ${slider2}, ${slider3}`);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ INTERACTIVIDAD DE TABLAS\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(row => {\r\n    row.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const propiedad = this.dataset.propiedad;\r\n        const info = document.getElementById('infoPropiedad');\r\n        \r\n        const infoTextos = {\r\n            fusion: \"\u2744\ufe0f PUNTO DE FUSI\u00d3N: Temperatura a la que una sustancia pasa de s\u00f3lido a l\u00edquido. En sustancias puras es constante y caracter\u00edstico. Indicador de pureza.\",\r\n            ebullicion: \"\ud83d\udd25 PUNTO DE EBULLICI\u00d3N: Temperatura a la que la presi\u00f3n de vapor iguala a la presi\u00f3n atmosf\u00e9rica. Constante en sustancias puras, variable en mezclas.\",\r\n            densidad: \"\u2696\ufe0f DENSIDAD: Masa por unidad de volumen. Depende de temperatura y presi\u00f3n, pero es constante para condiciones fijas en sustancias puras.\",\r\n            composicion: \"\ud83e\uddea COMPOSICI\u00d3N: Proporci\u00f3n de elementos en un compuesto. Constante seg\u00fan Ley de Proust. Se expresa en % masa o relaci\u00f3n at\u00f3mica.\"\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        info.textContent = infoTextos[propiedad] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\";\r\n        info.style.animation = \"highlight 0.5s\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar\/ocultar detalles\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.ejemplo-detalle').forEach(detalle => {\r\n            detalle.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        if (propiedad === 'fusion') {\r\n            document.getElementById('detalleFusion').style.display = 'block';\r\n        } else if (propiedad === 'ebullicion') {\r\n            document.getElementById('detalleEbullicion').style.display = 'block';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(r => {\r\n            r.classList.remove('selected');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Marcar fila seleccionada\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ M\u00e9todos de separaci\u00f3n interactivos\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.metodo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const metodo = this.dataset.metodo;\r\n        \r\n        const metodosInfo = {\r\n            electrolisis: \"\u26a1 ELECTR\u00d3LISIS: Descomposici\u00f3n de compuestos mediante corriente el\u00e9ctrica. Requiere voltaje m\u00ednimo (agua: 1.23V). Aplicaciones: producci\u00f3n de H\u2082, refinaci\u00f3n de metales, galvanoplastia.\",\r\n            descomposicion: \"\ud83d\udd25 DESCOMPOSICI\u00d3N T\u00c9RMICA: Descomposici\u00f3n por calor. Ejemplos: CaCO\u2083 \u2192 CaO + CO\u2082 (900\u00b0C), 2HgO \u2192 2Hg + O\u2082 (500\u00b0C). Aplicaciones: producci\u00f3n de cal, \u00f3xidos met\u00e1licos.\",\r\n            reaccion: \"\ud83e\uddea REACCI\u00d3N QU\u00cdMICA: Descomposici\u00f3n mediante reactivos qu\u00edmicos. Ejemplos: 2H\u2082O\u2082 \u2192 2H\u2082O + O\u2082 (con MnO\u2082), Zn + 2HCl \u2192 ZnCl\u2082 + H\u2082. Aplicaciones: s\u00edntesis, an\u00e1lisis qu\u00edmico.\"\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        alert(`\ud83e\uddea ${this.querySelector('h4').textContent}\\n\\n${metodosInfo[metodo] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\"}`);\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Objetivos interactivos\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n        this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n        const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n        checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n        checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : 'transparent';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Sistema Cyberpunk Educativo inicializado\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\udcda Lecci\u00f3n: Sustancias Puras - Elementos, Compuestos, Ley de Proust\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\udd2c Simulador de electr\u00f3lisis y herramientas interactivas listas\");\r\n\r\n\/\/ CSS para animaciones\r\nconst style = document.createElement('style');\r\nstyle.textContent = `\r\n    @keyframes dash {\r\n        to {\r\n            stroke-dashoffset: 0;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    @keyframes pulse {\r\n        0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\r\n        50% { opacity: 0.7; }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    @keyframes highlight {\r\n        0% { background-color: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0); }\r\n        50% { background-color: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.1); }\r\n        100% { background-color: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0); }\r\n    }\r\n`;\r\ndocument.head.appendChild(style);\r\n\r\n\/* ========================================\r\n   JAVASCRIPT CORREGIDO - ERRORES COMUNES\r\n======================================== *\/\r\n\/\/ Inicializar errores comunes - CORREGIDO\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    const errorCards = document.querySelectorAll('.error-card');\r\n    \r\n    errorCards.forEach(card => {\r\n        const header = card.querySelector('.error-header');\r\n        const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Estado inicial: todos cerrados (incluso en desktop)\r\n        card.classList.remove('active');\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Asegurar que el contenido est\u00e9 oculto inicialmente\r\n        const content = card.querySelector('.error-content');\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        content.style.maxHeight = '0';\r\n        content.style.opacity = '0';\r\n        content.style.padding = '0';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Click handler\r\n        header.addEventListener('click', function(e) {\r\n            e.stopPropagation();\r\n            \r\n            const isActive = card.classList.contains('active');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Cerrar todos los dem\u00e1s\r\n            errorCards.forEach(otherCard => {\r\n                if (otherCard !== card) {\r\n                    otherCard.classList.remove('active');\r\n                    const otherToggle = otherCard.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n                    otherToggle.textContent = '+';\r\n                    \r\n                    const otherContent = otherCard.querySelector('.error-content');\r\n                    otherContent.style.display = 'none';\r\n                    otherContent.style.maxHeight = '0';\r\n                    otherContent.style.opacity = '0';\r\n                    otherContent.style.padding = '0';\r\n                }\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Alternar este\r\n            if (isActive) {\r\n                card.classList.remove('active');\r\n                toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n                content.style.display = 'none';\r\n                \r\n                \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de cierre\r\n                setTimeout(() => {\r\n                    content.style.maxHeight = '0';\r\n                    content.style.opacity = '0';\r\n                    content.style.padding = '0';\r\n                }, 10);\r\n            } else {\r\n                card.classList.add('active');\r\n                toggle.textContent = '\u00d7';\r\n                content.style.display = 'block';\r\n                \r\n                \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de apertura\r\n                setTimeout(() => {\r\n                    content.style.maxHeight = '600px';\r\n                    content.style.opacity = '1';\r\n                    content.style.padding = 'var(--sp-md)';\r\n                }, 10);\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Funci\u00f3n para mostrar soluci\u00f3n - CORREGIDA\r\n    window.mostrarSolucion = function(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n        if (!solucion) return;\r\n        \r\n        const isVisible = solucion.style.display === 'block';\r\n        \r\n        if (isVisible) {\r\n            solucion.style.display = 'none';\r\n            solucion.style.maxHeight = '0';\r\n            solucion.style.opacity = '0';\r\n            solucion.style.padding = '0';\r\n        } else {\r\n            solucion.style.display = 'block';\r\n            solucion.style.maxHeight = '200px';\r\n            solucion.style.opacity = '1';\r\n            solucion.style.padding = 'var(--sp-md)';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Scroll suave a la soluci\u00f3n\r\n            solucion.scrollIntoView({ \r\n                behavior: 'smooth', \r\n                block: 'nearest' \r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Funci\u00f3n toggle error - para botones manuales\r\n    window.toggleError = function(header) {\r\n        if (!header) return;\r\n        \r\n        const card = header.closest('.error-card');\r\n        const isActive = card.classList.contains('active');\r\n        \r\n        if (isActive) {\r\n            card.classList.remove('active');\r\n            header.querySelector('.error-toggle').textContent = '+';\r\n            \r\n            const content = card.querySelector('.error-content');\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n            content.style.maxHeight = '0';\r\n            content.style.opacity = '0';\r\n            content.style.padding = '0';\r\n        } else {\r\n            card.classList.add('active');\r\n            header.querySelector('.error-toggle').textContent = '\u00d7';\r\n            \r\n            const content = card.querySelector('.error-content');\r\n            content.style.display = 'block';\r\n            content.style.maxHeight = '600px';\r\n            content.style.opacity = '1';\r\n            content.style.padding = 'var(--sp-md)';\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Redimensionar ventana - mantener estado\r\nwindow.addEventListener('resize', function() {\r\n    \/\/ No hacer nada especial, mantener estado actual\r\n    console.log(\"Ventana redimensionada - estado de errores mantenido\");\r\n});\r\n<\/script>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Sustancia pura incluye","respuesta":"Elementos, compuestos"},{"enunciado":"Separaci\u00f3n de compuesto","respuesta":"Qu\u00edmica (electr\u00f3lisis)"},{"enunciado":"Propiedades","respuesta":"Constantes (P.F., P.E.)"},{"enunciado":"P.F. NaCl","respuesta":"801\u00b0C"},{"enunciado":"P.E. Au","respuesta":"2970\u00b0C"},{"enunciado":"% O en CO\u2082","respuesta":"72.71%"},{"enunciado":"Electr\u00f3lisis H\u2082O","respuesta":"2H\u2082O \u2192 2H\u2082 + O\u2082"},{"enunciado":"Ley Proust en H\u2082O","respuesta":"Siempre 11.19% H"},{"enunciado":"Composici\u00f3n NaCl","respuesta":"39.34% Na, 60.66% Cl"},{"enunciado":"NIST: P.F. H\u2082O exacto","respuesta":"0.000\u00b0C"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC: elementos totales 2025","respuesta":"118"},{"enunciado":"Separar O\u2082 de aire","respuesta":"Destilaci\u00f3n fraccionada (f\u00edsica, pero aire es mezcla)"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Sustanciasar puras tienen...","opciones":["Composici\u00f3n fija","Variable","Aleatoria","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Composici\u00f3n fija"},{"pregunta":"Elemento es...","opciones":["Un tipo de \u00e1tomo","Mezcla","Compuesto","Soluci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Un tipo de \u00e1tomo"},{"pregunta":"Compuesto ejemplo","opciones":["CO\u2082","Aire","Agua salada","Suelo"],"correcta":"CO\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Separar H\u2082O en H\u2082 y O\u2082","opciones":["Electr\u00f3lisis","Filtraci\u00f3n","Destilaci\u00f3n","Decantaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Electr\u00f3lisis"},{"pregunta":"Agua es...","opciones":["Compuesto","Elemento","Mezcla","Plasma"],"correcta":"Compuesto"},{"pregunta":"Oro es...","opciones":["Elemento","Compuesto","Mezcla","Soluci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Elemento"},{"pregunta":"Propiedades puras son...","opciones":["Constantes","Variables","Aleatorias","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Constantes"},{"pregunta":"Punto fusi\u00f3n H\u2082O","opciones":["0\u00b0C","100\u00b0C","-78\u00b0C","801\u00b0C"],"correcta":"0\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Ley Proust dice...","opciones":["Composici\u00f3n fija","Masa variable","Volumen constante","Color cambia"],"correcta":"Composici\u00f3n fija"},{"pregunta":"NaCl se descompone por...","opciones":["Electr\u00f3lisis","Evaporaci\u00f3n","Filtraci\u00f3n","Sublimaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Electr\u00f3lisis"},{"pregunta":"% O en CO\u2082","opciones":["72.71%","27.29%","50%","11.19%"],"correcta":"72.71%"},{"pregunta":"Electr\u00f3lisis H\u2082O produce...","opciones":["2H\u2082 + O\u2082","H\u2082 + O\u2082","2H\u2082O","CO\u2082"],"correcta":"2H\u2082 + O\u2082"},{"pregunta":"P.F. NaCl","opciones":["801\u00b0C","0\u00b0C","1064\u00b0C","1465\u00b0C"],"correcta":"801\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Densidad Au","opciones":["19.30 g\/cm\u00b3","1.000 g\/cm\u00b3","2.165 g\/cm\u00b3","0.789 g\/cm\u00b3"],"correcta":"19.30 g\/cm\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"Composici\u00f3n H\u2082O","opciones":["11.19% H","50% H","88.81% H","100% H"],"correcta":"11.19% H"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC: elementos totales","opciones":["118","100","92","150"],"correcta":"118"},{"pregunta":"CaCO\u2083 se descompone por...","opciones":["Calor","Luz","Presi\u00f3n","Agua"],"correcta":"Calor"},{"pregunta":"P.E. CO\u2082","opciones":["Sublima a -78.5\u00b0C","100\u00b0C","0\u00b0C","1465\u00b0C"],"correcta":"Sublima a -78.5\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Separar NaCl en Na y Cl","opciones":["Electr\u00f3lisis fundido","Destilaci\u00f3n","Filtraci\u00f3n","Decantaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Electr\u00f3lisis fundido"},{"pregunta":"Propiedad intensiva en puros","opciones":["Densidad","Volumen","Masa","\u00c1rea"],"correcta":"Densidad"},{"pregunta":"NIST: P.F. H\u2082O exacto","opciones":["0.000\u00b0C","0.01\u00b0C","0.00\u00b0C","0.0000\u00b0C"],"correcta":"0.000\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Relaci\u00f3n H:O en H\u2082O","opciones":["2:1 \u00e1tomos","1:1","1:2","3:1"],"correcta":"2:1 \u00e1tomos"},{"pregunta":"Ley proporciones m\u00faltiples","opciones":["CO y CO\u2082","H\u2082O y H\u2082O\u2082","NaCl y KCl","Au y Ag"],"correcta":"CO y CO\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Descomposici\u00f3n t\u00e9rmica HgO","opciones":["2HgO \u2192 2Hg + O\u2082","HgO \u2192 HgO","Hg \u2192 O\u2082","O\u2082 \u2192 Hg"],"correcta":"2HgO \u2192 2Hg + O\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Punto triple H\u2082O","opciones":["0.01\u00b0C, 611.7 Pa","0.00\u00b0C, 1 atm","100\u00b0C, 1 atm","374\u00b0C, 22.1 MPa"],"correcta":"0.01\u00b0C, 611.7 Pa"},{"pregunta":"Diamante es...","opciones":["Elemento (C)","Compuesto","Mezcla","Aleaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Elemento (C)"},{"pregunta":"Grafito y diamante son...","opciones":["Al\u00f3tropos","Is\u00f3topos","Iones","Mezclas"],"correcta":"Al\u00f3tropos"},{"pregunta":"O\u2082 y O\u2083 son...","opciones":["Al\u00f3tropos","Is\u00f3topos","Compuestos","Mezclas"],"correcta":"Al\u00f3tropos"},{"pregunta":"Ley conservaci\u00f3n masa en...","opciones":["Reacci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica","Mezcla","Fusi\u00f3n","Evaporaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Reacci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC define compuesto como...","opciones":["Uni\u00f3n qu\u00edmica fija","Mezcla f\u00edsica","Elemento","Plasma"],"correcta":"Uni\u00f3n qu\u00edmica fija"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"elementos-compuestos","titulo":"Elementos y Compuestos: Los Ladrillos del Universo","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-quimica-elementos\" data-tema=\"elementos-compuestos\">\r\n\r\n<!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n    <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83e\uddf1<\/span>\r\n        ELEMENTOS Y COMPUESTOS: LOS LADRILLOS DEL UNIVERSO\r\n    <\/h1>\r\n    <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n        Tabla Peri\u00f3dica, f\u00f3rmulas qu\u00edmicas, al\u00f3tropos y proporciones fijas\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/header>\r\n\r\n<!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n<section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Diferenciar elementos y compuestos<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Identificar por composici\u00f3n at\u00f3mica y propiedades<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Navegar Tabla Peri\u00f3dica IUPAC 2025<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Localizar elementos por s\u00edmbolo, n\u00famero at\u00f3mico y grupo<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Interpretar f\u00f3rmulas qu\u00edmicas<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Determinar elementos y proporciones en compuestos<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Comprender al\u00f3tropos<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Explicar diferentes formas del mismo elemento<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n<section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n            <h3>Nanotecnolog\u00eda con Grafeno<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Al\u00f3tropo del carbono con propiedades el\u00e9ctricas y mec\u00e1nicas excepcionales<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"dato-neon\">200x m\u00e1s resistente que acero<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n            <h3>Semiconductores de Silicio<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Elemento purificado para chips de computadora y paneles solares<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"dato-neon\">Pureza: 99.9999999% (9N)<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n            <h3>Cat\u00e1lisis con Platino<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Elemento noble usado en convertidores catal\u00edticos y pilas de combustible<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"dato-neon\">Aceleraci\u00f3n 10\u2076 veces reacciones<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n<section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcd8<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <!-- INTRODUCCI\u00d3N -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>1. Elementos: Los Indivisibles Fundamentales<\/h3>\r\n        <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n            <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u269b\ufe0f ELEMENTO QU\u00cdMICO<\/h4>\r\n                <p><strong>Definici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Sustancia pura formada por <strong>un solo tipo de \u00e1tomos<\/strong> con mismo n\u00famero at\u00f3mico<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"caracteristicas\">\r\n                    <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\u2713<\/span>\r\n                        <span><strong>118 elementos<\/strong> confirmados (IUPAC 2025)<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\u2713<\/span>\r\n                        <span><strong>S\u00edmbolo qu\u00edmico:<\/strong> 1-2 letras (H, He, Fe, Au)<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\u2713<\/span>\r\n                        <span><strong>No separable<\/strong> en sustancias m\u00e1s simples por m\u00e9todos qu\u00edmicos<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- TABLA DE ELEMENTOS -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>2. Elementos Representativos<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n            <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>S\u00cdMBOLO<\/th>\r\n                        <th>NOMBRE<\/th>\r\n                        <th>N\u00b0 AT\u00d3MICO (Z)<\/th>\r\n                        <th>MASA AT\u00d3MICA (u)<\/th>\r\n                        <th>GRUPO<\/th>\r\n                        <th>ESTADO (25\u00b0C)<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr data-elemento=\"H\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-dato\">H<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Hidr\u00f3geno<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1.008<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Gas<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-elemento=\"He\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-dato\">He<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Helio<\/td>\r\n                        <td>2<\/td>\r\n                        <td>4.0026<\/td>\r\n                        <td>18<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Gas<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-elemento=\"C\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-dato\">C<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Carbono<\/td>\r\n                        <td>6<\/td>\r\n                        <td>12.011<\/td>\r\n                        <td>14<\/td>\r\n                        <td>S\u00f3lido<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-elemento=\"O\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-dato\">O<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Ox\u00edgeno<\/td>\r\n                        <td>8<\/td>\r\n                        <td>15.999<\/td>\r\n                        <td>16<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Gas<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-elemento=\"Fe\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-dato\">Fe<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Hierro<\/td>\r\n                        <td>26<\/td>\r\n                        <td>55.845<\/td>\r\n                        <td>8<\/td>\r\n                        <td>S\u00f3lido<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-elemento=\"Ag\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-dato\">Ag<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Plata<\/td>\r\n                        <td>47<\/td>\r\n                        <td>107.87<\/td>\r\n                        <td>11<\/td>\r\n                        <td>S\u00f3lido<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-elemento=\"Au\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-dato\">Au<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Oro<\/td>\r\n                        <td>79<\/td>\r\n                        <td>196.97<\/td>\r\n                        <td>11<\/td>\r\n                        <td>S\u00f3lido<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-elemento=\"Og\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-dato\">Og<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Oganes\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                        <td>118<\/td>\r\n                        <td>[294]<\/td>\r\n                        <td>18<\/td>\r\n                        <td>S\u00f3lido*<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoElemento\">\r\n                Selecciona un elemento para m\u00e1s detalles\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"elemento-detalles\">\r\n                <div class=\"detalle-elemento\" id=\"detalleH\">\r\n                    <h4>\u269b\ufe0f Hidr\u00f3geno (H) - Elemento 1<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"detalle-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcca Caracter\u00edsticas<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Elemento m\u00e1s abundante en el universo (~75% masa c\u00f3smica)<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"datos\">\r\n                                <span class=\"dato\">N\u00b0 at\u00f3mico: 1<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"dato\">Masa: 1.008 u<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"dato\">Configuraci\u00f3n: 1s\u00b9<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfaf Aplicaciones<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Combustible limpio, refiner\u00edas petr\u00f3leo, s\u00edntesis amon\u00edaco<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"detalle-elemento\" id=\"detalleC\">\r\n                    <h4>\u269b\ufe0f Carbono (C) - Elemento 6<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"detalle-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udd2c Al\u00f3tropos principales<\/h5>\r\n                            <div class=\"alotropo-grid\">\r\n                                <div class=\"alotropo-card\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"alotropo-icon\">\ud83d\udc8e<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"alotropo-nombre\">Diamante<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"alotropo-desc\">Estructura tetra\u00e9drica<\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"alotropo-card\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"alotropo-icon\">\u270f\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"alotropo-nombre\">Grafito<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"alotropo-desc\">Capas hexagonales<\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"alotropo-card\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"alotropo-icon\">\u26ab<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"alotropo-nombre\">Grafeno<\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"alotropo-desc\">Monocapa at\u00f3mica<\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- COMPUESTOS -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>3. Compuestos: Uniones Qu\u00edmicas con Proporciones Fijas<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"comparativa-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"comp-card compuesto\">\r\n                <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83e\uddea \u00bfQU\u00c9 ES UN COMPUESTO?<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-badge\">Uni\u00f3n qu\u00edmica<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Definici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Sustancia formada por <strong>dos o m\u00e1s elementos<\/strong> en proporciones definidas<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>F\u00f3rmula qu\u00edmica:<\/strong> Indica elementos y proporciones at\u00f3micas<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Separaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Solo por <strong>reacci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica<\/strong> (no m\u00e9todos f\u00edsicos)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ley:<\/strong> Proporciones definidas (Proust, 1799)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"formula\">H\u2082O<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">Agua<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"elementos\">H:O = 2:1 \u00e1tomos<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"formula\">CO\u2082<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">CO\u2082<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"elementos\">C:O = 1:2 \u00e1tomos<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"formula\">NaCl<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">Cloruro s\u00f3dico<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"elementos\">Na:Cl = 1:1 iones<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- F\u00d3RMULAS QU\u00cdMICAS -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>4. Interpretaci\u00f3n de F\u00f3rmulas Qu\u00edmicas<\/h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"formulas-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"formula-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"formula-header\">\r\n                    <h4>H\u2082O<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-tipo\">Compuesto molecular<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-desglose\">\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-ficha\">\r\n                        <span class=\"simbolo\">H<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"nombre\">Hidr\u00f3geno<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"cantidad\">2 \u00e1tomos<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-ficha\">\r\n                        <span class=\"simbolo\">O<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"nombre\">Ox\u00edgeno<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"cantidad\">1 \u00e1tomo<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-datos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\">Masa molar: 18.016 g\/mol<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\">%H: 11.19%, %O: 88.81%<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\">Estado: L\u00edquido (25\u00b0C)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"formula-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"formula-header\">\r\n                    <h4>CO\u2082<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-tipo\">\u00d3xido<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-desglose\">\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-ficha\">\r\n                        <span class=\"simbolo\">C<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"nombre\">Carbono<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"cantidad\">1 \u00e1tomo<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-ficha\">\r\n                        <span class=\"simbolo\">O<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"nombre\">Ox\u00edgeno<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"cantidad\">2 \u00e1tomos<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-datos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\">Masa molar: 44.01 g\/mol<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\">%C: 27.29%, %O: 72.71%<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\">Estado: Gas (25\u00b0C)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"formula-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"formula-header\">\r\n                    <h4>H\u2082SO\u2084<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-tipo\">\u00c1cido<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-desglose\">\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-ficha\">\r\n                        <span class=\"simbolo\">H<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"nombre\">Hidr\u00f3geno<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"cantidad\">2 \u00e1tomos<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-ficha\">\r\n                        <span class=\"simbolo\">S<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"nombre\">Azufre<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"cantidad\">1 \u00e1tomo<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-ficha\">\r\n                        <span class=\"simbolo\">O<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"nombre\">Ox\u00edgeno<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"cantidad\">4 \u00e1tomos<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-datos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\">Masa molar: 98.08 g\/mol<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\">%H: 2.06%, %S: 32.69%, %O: 65.25%<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\">Estado: L\u00edquido (25\u00b0C)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- LEY DE PROUST -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>5. Ley de Proporciones Definidas (Joseph Proust, 1799)<\/h3>\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <h4>\u2696\ufe0f LEY DE PROUST: FUNDAMENTO DE LOS COMPUESTOS<\/h4>\r\n            <p><strong>Enunciado:<\/strong> \"Un compuesto qu\u00edmico puro siempre contiene los mismos elementos combinados en la misma proporci\u00f3n en masa, independientemente de su origen o m\u00e9todo de preparaci\u00f3n\"<\/p>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"proust-ejemplos\">\r\n                <div class=\"proust-ejemplo\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-header\">\r\n                        <span class=\"ejemplo-num\">1<\/span>\r\n                        <h5>Agua (H\u2082O)<\/h5>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"proporcion\">\r\n                            <span class=\"elemento\">H<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"relacion\">: 11.19% masa<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"proporcion\">\r\n                            <span class=\"elemento\">O<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"relacion\">: 88.81% masa<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"datos-proust\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato\">Relaci\u00f3n masa H:O = 1:8<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato\">Siempre constante<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"proust-ejemplo\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-header\">\r\n                        <span class=\"ejemplo-num\">2<\/span>\r\n                        <h5>Cloruro s\u00f3dico (NaCl)<\/h5>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"proporcion\">\r\n                            <span class=\"elemento\">Na<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"relacion\">: 39.34% masa<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"proporcion\">\r\n                            <span class=\"elemento\">Cl<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"relacion\">: 60.66% masa<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"datos-proust\">\r\n                            <span class=\"dato\">Relaci\u00f3n masa Na:Cl = 23:35.5<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato\">Independiente del origen<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"formula-display\">\r\n                \\[ \\frac{m_A}{m_B} = \\text{constante} \\quad \\text{(para un compuesto dado)} \\]\r\n                <div class=\"formula-explicacion\">\r\n                    <strong>Donde:<\/strong> m\u2090, m\u1d66 = masas de los elementos A y B en el compuesto\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- TABLA PERI\u00d3DICA INTERACTIVA -->\r\n<section class=\"tabla-periodica-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/span> TABLA PERI\u00d3DICA INTERACTIVA IUPAC 2025\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"tabla-periodica-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"tabla-controls\">\r\n            <h3>CONTROLES DE VISUALIZACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"filtro-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"filtroCategoria\">Filtrar por categor\u00eda:<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"filtroCategoria\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                    <option value=\"todos\">Todos los elementos<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"metales\">Metales<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"no-metales\">No metales<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"metaloides\">Metaloides<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"gases-nobles\">Gases nobles<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"lantanidos\">Lant\u00e1nidos<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"actinidos\">Act\u00ednidos<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"filtro-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"filtroEstado\">Filtrar por estado (25\u00b0C):<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"filtroEstado\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                    <option value=\"todos\">Todos los estados<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"solido\">S\u00f3lidos<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"liquido\">L\u00edquidos<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"gas\">Gases<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"busqueda-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"buscarElemento\">Buscar elemento:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"buscarElemento\" class=\"control-input\" \r\n                       placeholder=\"S\u00edmbolo o nombre (ej: H, Oro, Fe)\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-filtrar\" onclick=\"filtrarTabla()\">\r\n                <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd0d<\/span> APLICAR FILTROS\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarTabla()\">\r\n                <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR VISTA\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- TABLA PERI\u00d3DICA SIMPLIFICADA -->\r\n        <div class=\"tabla-periodica-grid\" id=\"tablaPeriodica\">\r\n            <!-- Per\u00edodo 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"elemento-celda\" data-simbolo=\"H\" data-grupo=\"1\" data-periodo=\"1\" data-categoria=\"no-metales\" data-estado=\"gas\">\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-numero\">1<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-simbolo\">H<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-nombre\">Hidr\u00f3geno<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"elemento-celda\" data-simbolo=\"He\" data-grupo=\"18\" data-periodo=\"1\" data-categoria=\"gases-nobles\" data-estado=\"gas\">\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-numero\">2<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-simbolo\">He<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-nombre\">Helio<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Per\u00edodo 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"elemento-celda\" data-simbolo=\"Li\" data-grupo=\"1\" data-periodo=\"2\" data-categoria=\"metales\" data-estado=\"solido\">\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-numero\">3<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-simbolo\">Li<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-nombre\">Litio<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"elemento-celda\" data-simbolo=\"Be\" data-grupo=\"2\" data-periodo=\"2\" data-categoria=\"metales\" data-estado=\"solido\">\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-numero\">4<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-simbolo\">Be<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-nombre\">Berilio<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- ... m\u00e1s elementos representativos (simplificado para el ejemplo) -->\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"elemento-celda\" data-simbolo=\"C\" data-grupo=\"14\" data-periodo=\"2\" data-categoria=\"no-metales\" data-estado=\"solido\">\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-numero\">6<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-simbolo\">C<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-nombre\">Carbono<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"elemento-celda\" data-simbolo=\"N\" data-grupo=\"15\" data-periodo=\"2\" data-categoria=\"no-metales\" data-estado=\"gas\">\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-numero\">7<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-simbolo\">N<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-nombre\">Nitr\u00f3geno<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"elemento-celda\" data-simbolo=\"O\" data-grupo=\"16\" data-periodo=\"2\" data-categoria=\"no-metales\" data-estado=\"gas\">\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-numero\">8<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-simbolo\">O<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-nombre\">Ox\u00edgeno<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Metales de transici\u00f3n representativos -->\r\n            <div class=\"elemento-celda\" data-simbolo=\"Fe\" data-grupo=\"8\" data-periodo=\"4\" data-categoria=\"metales\" data-estado=\"solido\">\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-numero\">26<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-simbolo\">Fe<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-nombre\">Hierro<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"elemento-celda\" data-simbolo=\"Cu\" data-grupo=\"11\" data-periodo=\"4\" data-categoria=\"metales\" data-estado=\"solido\">\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-numero\">29<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-simbolo\">Cu<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-nombre\">Cobre<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"elemento-celda\" data-simbolo=\"Ag\" data-grupo=\"11\" data-periodo=\"5\" data-categoria=\"metales\" data-estado=\"solido\">\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-numero\">47<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-simbolo\">Ag<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-nombre\">Plata<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"elemento-celda\" data-simbolo=\"Au\" data-grupo=\"11\" data-periodo=\"6\" data-categoria=\"metales\" data-estado=\"solido\">\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-numero\">79<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-simbolo\">Au<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-nombre\">Oro<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- \u00daltimo elemento -->\r\n            <div class=\"elemento-celda\" data-simbolo=\"Og\" data-grupo=\"18\" data-periodo=\"7\" data-categoria=\"gases-nobles\" data-estado=\"solido\">\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-numero\">118<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-simbolo\">Og<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-nombre\">Oganes\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- INFORMACI\u00d3N DEL ELEMENTO SELECCIONADO -->\r\n        <div class=\"elemento-info\" id=\"infoElementoTabla\">\r\n            <div class=\"info-header\">\r\n                <h3>INFORMACI\u00d3N DEL ELEMENTO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"info-subtitle\">Selecciona un elemento de la tabla<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"info-content\" id=\"contenidoElemento\">\r\n                <div class=\"info-placeholder\">\r\n                    <div class=\"placeholder-icon\">\ud83d\udd0d<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"placeholder-text\">\r\n                        <h4>Selecciona un elemento<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Haz clic en cualquier elemento de la tabla peri\u00f3dica para ver sus propiedades detalladas<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SIMULADOR: FORMACI\u00d3N DE COMPUESTOS -->\r\n<section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/span> SIMULADOR: FORMACI\u00d3N DE COMPUESTOS\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"formacion-compuestos\">\r\n        <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n            <h3>CONSTRUCTOR DE COMPUESTOS<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"elementoA\">Elemento A:<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"elementoA\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                    <option value=\"H\">Hidr\u00f3geno (H)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"C\">Carbono (C)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"N\">Nitr\u00f3geno (N)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"O\">Ox\u00edgeno (O)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Na\">Sodio (Na)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Cl\">Cloro (Cl)<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"cantidadA\">Cantidad A (\u00e1tomos):<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"cantidadA\" min=\"1\" max=\"6\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-value\">\r\n                    <span id=\"valorA\">2 \u00e1tomos<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"elementoB\">Elemento B:<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"elementoB\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                    <option value=\"O\">Ox\u00edgeno (O)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"H\">Hidr\u00f3geno (H)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"C\">Carbono (C)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"N\">Nitr\u00f3geno (N)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Cl\">Cloro (Cl)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Na\">Sodio (Na)<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"cantidadB\">Cantidad B (\u00e1tomos):<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"cantidadB\" min=\"1\" max=\"6\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-value\">\r\n                    <span id=\"valorB\">1 \u00e1tomo<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"tipoUnion\">Tipo de uni\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                <select id=\"tipoUnion\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                    <option value=\"covalente\">Covalente (molecular)<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"ionica\">I\u00f3nica<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"metalica\">Met\u00e1lica<\/option>\r\n                <\/select>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-formar\" onclick=\"formarCompuesto()\">\r\n                <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/span> FORMAR COMPUESTO\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"compuestoAleatorio()\">\r\n                <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> COMPUESTO ALEATORIO\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarConstructor()\">\r\n                <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N MOLECULAR -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacionMolecular\">\r\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" id=\"svgMolecular\">\r\n                <!-- \u00c1tomos individuales -->\r\n                <g id=\"atomosIndividuales\">\r\n                    <!-- \u00c1tomo A -->\r\n                    <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"200\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#2196F3\" id=\"atomoA\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"30;35;30\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"150\" y=\"200\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" id=\"simboloA\">H<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"150\" y=\"225\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" id=\"cantidadA\">\u00d72<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- \u00c1tomo B -->\r\n                    <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"200\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" id=\"atomoB\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"40;45;40\" dur=\"2s\" begin=\"0.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"450\" y=\"200\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" id=\"simboloB\">O<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"450\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#C8E6C9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" id=\"cantidadB\">\u00d71<\/text>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Flecha de reacci\u00f3n -->\r\n                <path d=\"M300 200 L300 200\" stroke=\"#FF9800\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" id=\"flechaReaccion\">\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"d\" values=\"M300 200 L300 200; M200 200 L400 200\" dur=\"1s\" begin=\"indefinite\" fill=\"freeze\"\/>\r\n                <\/path>\r\n                <text x=\"300\" y=\"180\" fill=\"#FF9800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">Reacci\u00f3n qu\u00edmica<\/text>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Compuesto formado -->\r\n                <g id=\"compuestoFormado\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                    <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"300\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#9C27B0\" id=\"mol\u00e9cula\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"50;55;50\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"295\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" id=\"formulaCompuesto\">H\u2082O<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"315\" fill=\"#E1BEE7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"nombreCompuesto\">Agua<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- Enlaces (visual) -->\r\n                    <line x1=\"270\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.6\"\/>\r\n                    <line x1=\"330\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.6\"\/>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Indicadores de proporci\u00f3n -->\r\n                <g id=\"indicadoresProporcion\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"350\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FF9800\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"175\" y=\"370\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"proporcionAtomica\">2:1 \u00e1tomos<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <rect x=\"350\" y=\"350\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"425\" y=\"370\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"proporcionMasa\">11.19% : 88.81%<\/text>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n            <\/svg>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"simulator-info\" id=\"infoFormacion\">\r\n                Selecciona elementos y cantidades, luego haz clic en \"FORMAR COMPUESTO\"\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- DATOS DEL COMPUESTO -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n            <h3>DATOS DEL COMPUESTO<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">F\u00f3rmula:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataFormula\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Nombre:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataNombre\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">PROPORCI\u00d3N AT\u00d3MICA:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataProporcionAtomica\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Masa molar:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataMasaMolar\">\u2014 g\/mol<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Tipo de uni\u00f3n:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTipoUnion\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Estado (25\u00b0C):<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEstado\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">% por masa:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPorcentajeMasa\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udcca COMPUESTOS FORMADOS<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <span>Compuestos v\u00e1lidos:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statValidos\">0<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <span>Compuestos comunes:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statComunes\">0<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <span>Diversidad elemental:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statDiversidad\">0<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n<section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: ELEMENTOS Y COMPUESTOS\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n        <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l de estos es un elemento qu\u00edmico puro?<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                    Agua (H\u2082O)\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                    Sal com\u00fan (NaCl)\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                    Oro (Au)\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                    Di\u00f3xido de carbono (CO\u2082)\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                    <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> El oro (Au) es un elemento formado solo por \u00e1tomos de oro.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                    <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa las definiciones de elemento y compuesto.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Un elemento est\u00e1 formado por un solo tipo de \u00e1tomos. Au (oro) es un elemento. H\u2082O, NaCl y CO\u2082 son compuestos (formados por dos o m\u00e1s elementos diferentes).<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                <h3>Seg\u00fan la Ley de Proust, \u00bfqu\u00e9 caracteriza a un compuesto qu\u00edmico?<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                    Siempre se obtiene de minerales naturales\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                    Mantiene proporciones de masa constantes entre sus elementos\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                    Es siempre s\u00f3lido a temperatura ambiente\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                    Puede separarse por m\u00e9todos f\u00edsicos simples\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                    <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> La Ley de Proporciones Definidas establece proporciones constantes.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                    <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa el enunciado de la Ley de Proust.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Joseph Proust estableci\u00f3 que un compuesto puro siempre contiene los mismos elementos combinados en la misma proporci\u00f3n en masa, independientemente de su origen o m\u00e9todo de preparaci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 indica el sub\u00edndice \"2\" en la f\u00f3rmula H\u2082O?<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                    Que hay dos mol\u00e9culas de agua\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                    Que el hidr\u00f3geno tiene n\u00famero at\u00f3mico 2\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                    Que la mol\u00e9cula tiene dos enlaces\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                    Que hay dos \u00e1tomos de hidr\u00f3geno por cada \u00e1tomo de ox\u00edgeno\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                    <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> El sub\u00edndice indica el n\u00famero de \u00e1tomos de ese elemento en la mol\u00e9cula.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                    <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa c\u00f3mo se interpretan las f\u00f3rmulas qu\u00edmicas.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> En f\u00f3rmulas qu\u00edmicas, el sub\u00edndice despu\u00e9s del s\u00edmbolo de un elemento indica el n\u00famero de \u00e1tomos de ese elemento en la mol\u00e9cula. H\u2082O significa 2 \u00e1tomos de hidr\u00f3geno (H) y 1 \u00e1tomo de ox\u00edgeno (O).<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/30\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES - CORREGIDO -->\r\n<section class=\"errors-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES Y SOLUCIONES\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"errors-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                <h3>CONFUNDIR ELEMENTOS Y COMPUESTOS<\/h3>\r\n                <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                    <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"El agua (H\u2082O) es un elemento porque es una sustancia pura\"\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                    <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> H\u2082O es un COMPUESTO (dos elementos diferentes: H y O). Un elemento ser\u00eda una sustancia formada por un solo tipo de \u00e1tomos (ej: O\u2082, Au, Fe).\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Pr\u00e1ctica:<\/strong> Clasifica: Ox\u00edgeno (O\u2082), Sal (NaCl), Hierro (Fe), Di\u00f3xido carbono (CO\u2082)<\/p>\r\n                    <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                    <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display:none;\">\r\n                        <strong>O\u2082:<\/strong> Elemento (solo \u00e1tomos de ox\u00edgeno)<br>\r\n                        <strong>NaCl:<\/strong> Compuesto (Na + Cl)<br>\r\n                        <strong>Fe:<\/strong> Elemento (solo \u00e1tomos de hierro)<br>\r\n                        <strong>CO\u2082:<\/strong> Compuesto (C + O)\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                <h3>MALINTERPRETAR F\u00d3RMULAS QU\u00cdMICAS<\/h3>\r\n                <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                    <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"H\u2082 significa dos mol\u00e9culas de hidr\u00f3geno\"\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                    <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> H\u2082 significa UNA mol\u00e9cula que contiene DOS \u00e1tomos de hidr\u00f3geno. El sub\u00edndice se refiere a \u00e1tomos dentro de una mol\u00e9cula.\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>2H\u2082:<\/strong> Dos mol\u00e9culas de hidr\u00f3geno (cada una con 2 \u00e1tomos H)<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>H\u2082:<\/strong> Una mol\u00e9cula de hidr\u00f3geno (2 \u00e1tomos H)<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>2H:<\/strong> Dos \u00e1tomos de hidr\u00f3geno separados<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                    <table>\r\n                        <tr><th>Notaci\u00f3n<\/th><th>Significado<\/th><th>Ejemplo<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>H\u2082<\/td><td>1 mol\u00e9cula, 2 \u00e1tomos H<\/td><td>H\u2082 (gas hidr\u00f3geno)<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>2H\u2082<\/td><td>2 mol\u00e9culas, 4 \u00e1tomos H total<\/td><td>2H\u2082 \u2192 4H<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>2H<\/td><td>2 \u00e1tomos H separados<\/td><td>\u00c1tomos libres<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <\/table>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                <h3>Problema de Clasificaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                <p>Para cada una de las siguientes sustancias, indica si es elemento, compuesto o mezcla. Justifica tu respuesta:<\/p>\r\n                <ol>\r\n                    <li>Ox\u00edgeno gaseoso (O\u2082)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Agua destilada (H\u2082O)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Acero inoxidable (Fe + Cr + Ni)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Diamante (C)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Gasolina (mezcla de hidrocarburos)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Cloruro s\u00f3dico (NaCl)<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <p>Para los compuestos, indica los elementos que los forman y su proporci\u00f3n at\u00f3mica.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu clasificaci\u00f3n y justificaci\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                1. <strong>O\u2082:<\/strong> Elemento (solo \u00e1tomos de ox\u00edgeno)<br>\r\n                2. <strong>H\u2082O:<\/strong> Compuesto (H y O en proporci\u00f3n 2:1)<br>\r\n                3. <strong>Acero:<\/strong> Mezcla (aleaci\u00f3n de Fe, Cr, Ni)<br>\r\n                4. <strong>Diamante:<\/strong> Elemento (solo \u00e1tomos de carbono)<br>\r\n                5. <strong>Gasolina:<\/strong> Mezcla (varios hidrocarburos)<br>\r\n                6. <strong>NaCl:<\/strong> Compuesto (Na y Cl en proporci\u00f3n 1:1)\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                <h3>Problema de C\u00e1lculo (Ley de Proust)<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                <p>Se tienen tres muestras de \u00f3xido de hierro (Fe\u2082O\u2083) obtenidas de diferentes fuentes:<\/p>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Muestra A: 10.00 g contiene 6.99 g Fe<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Muestra B: 15.50 g contiene 10.84 g Fe<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Muestra C: 8.25 g contiene 5.77 g Fe<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n                <p>a) Calcula el porcentaje de hierro en cada muestra.<\/p>\r\n                <p>b) Verifica si cumplen la Ley de Proust comparando los porcentajes.<\/p>\r\n                <p>c) Calcula la proporci\u00f3n en masa Fe:O para cada muestra.<\/p>\r\n                <p>d) Si el valor te\u00f3rico es 69.94% Fe, \u00bfalguna muestra es impura?<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tus c\u00e1lculos aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"10\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR PROCEDIMIENTO<\/button>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                a) %Fe: A = (6.99\/10.00)\u00d7100 = 69.90%<br>\r\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;B = (10.84\/15.50)\u00d7100 = 69.94%<br>\r\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;C = (5.77\/8.25)\u00d7100 = 69.94%<br><br>\r\n                b) S\u00ed cumplen (valores similares ~69.94%)<br><br>\r\n                c) Masa O = masa total - masa Fe<br>\r\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A: Fe:O = 6.99:3.01 = 2.32:1<br>\r\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;B: Fe:O = 10.84:4.66 = 2.33:1<br>\r\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;C: Fe:O = 5.77:2.48 = 2.33:1<br><br>\r\n                d) Te\u00f3rico: 69.94% Fe. Muestra A tiene 69.90% (diferencia 0.04%) \u2192 posiblemente pura con error experimental. B y C son exactamente te\u00f3ricas.\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n        <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Clasificaci\u00f3n correcta<\/td>\r\n                <td>Clasifica todas correctamente con justificaci\u00f3n te\u00f3rica<\/td>\r\n                <td>Clasifica mayor\u00eda correctamente con alguna justificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <td>Errores graves en clasificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>C\u00e1lculos Proust<\/td>\r\n                <td>Calcula correctamente todos los % y proporciones<\/td>\r\n                <td>Calcula mayor\u00eda correctamente con peque\u00f1os errores<\/td>\r\n                <td>Procedimiento incorrecto o incompleto<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Interpretaci\u00f3n resultados<\/td>\r\n                <td>Interpreta correctamente resultados y aplica ley de Proust<\/td>\r\n                <td>Interpreta parcialmente resultados<\/td>\r\n                <td>No interpreta o interpreta incorrectamente<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/table>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                <label>Diferenciaci\u00f3n elemento\/compuesto:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                    <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                <label>Interpretaci\u00f3n f\u00f3rmulas qu\u00edmicas:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                    <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                <label>Comprensi\u00f3n Tabla Peri\u00f3dica:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                    <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                <p>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es fundamental comprender la diferencia entre elementos y compuestos para el estudio de la qu\u00edmica y sus aplicaciones?<\/p>\r\n                <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo crees que el descubrimiento de nuevos elementos o la s\u00edntesis de nuevos compuestos impactar\u00e1 la tecnolog\u00eda del futuro?<\/p>\r\n                <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu predicci\u00f3n...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcda PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\u23f1\ufe0f REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Memorizar 20 elementos comunes<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Recordar 10 compuestos importantes<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Repasar Ley de Proust<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83e\uddea PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Clasificar 30 sustancias<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Interpretar 15 f\u00f3rmulas qu\u00edmicas<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Completar el quiz interactivo<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd2c PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Estudiar grupos de Tabla Peri\u00f3dica<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Analizar propiedades peri\u00f3dicas<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Resolver problemas tipo examen<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rsc.org\/periodic-table\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf10 Royal Society of Chemistry: Tabla Peri\u00f3dica\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/iupac.org\/what-we-do\/periodic-table-of-elements\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf10 IUPAC: Tabla Peri\u00f3dica oficial\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/es.khanacademy.org\/science\/chemistry\/atomic-structure-and-properties\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf10 Khan Academy: Estructura at\u00f3mica\r\n                <\/a>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ BASE DE DATOS DE ELEMENTOS\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nconst elementosDB = {\r\n    \"H\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Hidr\u00f3geno\",\r\n        numero: 1,\r\n        masa: 1.008,\r\n        grupo: 1,\r\n        periodo: 1,\r\n        categoria: \"no-metales\",\r\n        estado: \"gas\",\r\n        color: \"#2196F3\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"He\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Helio\",\r\n        numero: 2,\r\n        masa: 4.0026,\r\n        grupo: 18,\r\n        periodo: 1,\r\n        categoria: \"gases-nobles\",\r\n        estado: \"gas\",\r\n        color: \"#9C27B0\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"C\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Carbono\",\r\n        numero: 6,\r\n        masa: 12.011,\r\n        grupo: 14,\r\n        periodo: 2,\r\n        categoria: \"no-metales\",\r\n        estado: \"solido\",\r\n        color: \"#795548\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"N\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Nitr\u00f3geno\",\r\n        numero: 7,\r\n        masa: 14.007,\r\n        grupo: 15,\r\n        periodo: 2,\r\n        categoria: \"no-metales\",\r\n        estado: \"gas\",\r\n        color: \"#3F51B5\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"O\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Ox\u00edgeno\",\r\n        numero: 8,\r\n        masa: 15.999,\r\n        grupo: 16,\r\n        periodo: 2,\r\n        categoria: \"no-metales\",\r\n        estado: \"gas\",\r\n        color: \"#F44336\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"Na\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Sodio\",\r\n        numero: 11,\r\n        masa: 22.990,\r\n        grupo: 1,\r\n        periodo: 3,\r\n        categoria: \"metales\",\r\n        estado: \"solido\",\r\n        color: \"#FF9800\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"Cl\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Cloro\",\r\n        numero: 17,\r\n        masa: 35.45,\r\n        grupo: 17,\r\n        periodo: 3,\r\n        categoria: \"no-metales\",\r\n        estado: \"gas\",\r\n        color: \"#4CAF50\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"Fe\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Hierro\",\r\n        numero: 26,\r\n        masa: 55.845,\r\n        grupo: 8,\r\n        periodo: 4,\r\n        categoria: \"metales\",\r\n        estado: \"solido\",\r\n        color: \"#607D8B\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"Cu\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Cobre\",\r\n        numero: 29,\r\n        masa: 63.546,\r\n        grupo: 11,\r\n        periodo: 4,\r\n        categoria: \"metales\",\r\n        estado: \"solido\",\r\n        color: \"#FF9800\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"Ag\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Plata\",\r\n        numero: 47,\r\n        masa: 107.87,\r\n        grupo: 11,\r\n        periodo: 5,\r\n        categoria: \"metales\",\r\n        estado: \"solido\",\r\n        color: \"#E0E0E0\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"Au\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Oro\",\r\n        numero: 79,\r\n        masa: 196.97,\r\n        grupo: 11,\r\n        periodo: 6,\r\n        categoria: \"metales\",\r\n        estado: \"solido\",\r\n        color: \"#FFD700\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"Og\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Oganes\u00f3n\",\r\n        numero: 118,\r\n        masa: 294,\r\n        grupo: 18,\r\n        periodo: 7,\r\n        categoria: \"gases-nobles\",\r\n        estado: \"solido\",\r\n        color: \"#673AB7\"\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ BASE DE DATOS DE COMPUESTOS COMUNES\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nconst compuestosDB = {\r\n    \"H2O\": {\r\n        formula: \"H\u2082O\",\r\n        nombre: \"Agua\",\r\n        elementos: [\"H\", \"O\"],\r\n        cantidades: [2, 1],\r\n        masaMolar: 18.016,\r\n        porcentajes: { \"H\": 11.19, \"O\": 88.81 },\r\n        estado: \"liquido\",\r\n        tipoUnion: \"covalente\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"CO2\": {\r\n        formula: \"CO\u2082\",\r\n        nombre: \"Di\u00f3xido de carbono\",\r\n        elementos: [\"C\", \"O\"],\r\n        cantidades: [1, 2],\r\n        masaMolar: 44.01,\r\n        porcentajes: { \"C\": 27.29, \"O\": 72.71 },\r\n        estado: \"gas\",\r\n        tipoUnion: \"covalente\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"NaCl\": {\r\n        formula: \"NaCl\",\r\n        nombre: \"Cloruro s\u00f3dico\",\r\n        elementos: [\"Na\", \"Cl\"],\r\n        cantidades: [1, 1],\r\n        masaMolar: 58.44,\r\n        porcentajes: { \"Na\": 39.34, \"Cl\": 60.66 },\r\n        estado: \"solido\",\r\n        tipoUnion: \"ionica\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"NH3\": {\r\n        formula: \"NH\u2083\",\r\n        nombre: \"Amon\u00edaco\",\r\n        elementos: [\"N\", \"H\"],\r\n        cantidades: [1, 3],\r\n        masaMolar: 17.031,\r\n        porcentajes: { \"N\": 82.24, \"H\": 17.76 },\r\n        estado: \"gas\",\r\n        tipoUnion: \"covalente\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"CH4\": {\r\n        formula: \"CH\u2084\",\r\n        nombre: \"Metano\",\r\n        elementos: [\"C\", \"H\"],\r\n        cantidades: [1, 4],\r\n        masaMolar: 16.043,\r\n        porcentajes: { \"C\": 74.87, \"H\": 25.13 },\r\n        estado: \"gas\",\r\n        tipoUnion: \"covalente\"\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ TABLA PERI\u00d3DICA INTERACTIVA\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nfunction filtrarTabla() {\r\n    const categoria = document.getElementById('filtroCategoria').value;\r\n    const estado = document.getElementById('filtroEstado').value;\r\n    const busqueda = document.getElementById('buscarElemento').value.toLowerCase();\r\n    \r\n    const elementos = document.querySelectorAll('.elemento-celda');\r\n    let visibles = 0;\r\n    \r\n    elementos.forEach(elemento => {\r\n        const simbolo = elemento.dataset.simbolo;\r\n        const elementoCat = elemento.dataset.categoria;\r\n        const elementoEstado = elemento.dataset.estado;\r\n        const nombre = elemento.querySelector('.elemento-nombre').textContent.toLowerCase();\r\n        \r\n        let mostrar = true;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Filtro por categor\u00eda\r\n        if (categoria !== 'todos' && elementoCat !== categoria) {\r\n            mostrar = false;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Filtro por estado\r\n        if (estado !== 'todos' && elementoEstado !== estado) {\r\n            mostrar = false;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Filtro por b\u00fasqueda\r\n        if (busqueda && !nombre.includes(busqueda) && !simbolo.toLowerCase().includes(busqueda)) {\r\n            mostrar = false;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        if (mostrar) {\r\n            elemento.style.display = 'flex';\r\n            elemento.style.opacity = '1';\r\n            visibles++;\r\n        } else {\r\n            elemento.style.display = 'none';\r\n            elemento.style.opacity = '0.3';\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar info\r\n    document.getElementById('infoElementoTabla').querySelector('.info-subtitle').textContent = \r\n        `${visibles} elementos encontrados`;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarTabla() {\r\n    document.getElementById('filtroCategoria').value = 'todos';\r\n    document.getElementById('filtroEstado').value = 'todos';\r\n    document.getElementById('buscarElemento').value = '';\r\n    \r\n    const elementos = document.querySelectorAll('.elemento-celda');\r\n    elementos.forEach(elemento => {\r\n        elemento.style.display = 'flex';\r\n        elemento.style.opacity = '1';\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('infoElementoTabla').querySelector('.info-subtitle').textContent = \r\n        'Selecciona un elemento de la tabla';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Restaurar placeholder\r\n    const contenido = document.getElementById('contenidoElemento');\r\n    contenido.innerHTML = `\r\n        <div class=\"info-placeholder\">\r\n            <div class=\"placeholder-icon\">\ud83d\udd0d<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"placeholder-text\">\r\n                <h4>Selecciona un elemento<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Haz clic en cualquier elemento de la tabla peri\u00f3dica para ver sus propiedades detalladas<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    `;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Event listeners para elementos de la tabla\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.elemento-celda').forEach(celda => {\r\n    celda.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const simbolo = this.dataset.simbolo;\r\n        const elemento = elementosDB[simbolo];\r\n        \r\n        if (!elemento) return;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar informaci\u00f3n\r\n        const contenido = document.getElementById('contenidoElemento');\r\n        contenido.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"elemento-detalle-tabla\">\r\n                <div class=\"detalle-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"detalle-simbolo\" style=\"background: ${elemento.color}\">${simbolo}<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"detalle-info\">\r\n                        <h4>${elemento.nombre}<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-numero\">N\u00famero at\u00f3mico: ${elemento.numero}<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"detalle-propiedades\">\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad\">\r\n                        <span class=\"propiedad-label\">Masa at\u00f3mica:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"propiedad-valor\">${elemento.masa} u<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad\">\r\n                        <span class=\"propiedad-label\">Grupo:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"propiedad-valor\">${elemento.grupo}<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad\">\r\n                        <span class=\"propiedad-label\">Per\u00edodo:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"propiedad-valor\">${elemento.periodo}<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad\">\r\n                        <span class=\"propiedad-label\">Categor\u00eda:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"propiedad-valor\">${elemento.categoria.replace('-', ' ')}<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad\">\r\n                        <span class=\"propiedad-label\">Estado (25\u00b0C):<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"propiedad-valor\">${elemento.estado === 'solido' ? 'S\u00f3lido' : elemento.estado === 'liquido' ? 'L\u00edquido' : 'Gas'}<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"detalle-datos\">\r\n                    <h5>\ud83d\udcca Datos adicionales<\/h5>\r\n                    <div class=\"datos-grid\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-card\">\r\n                            <div class=\"dato-icon\">\u269b\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato-text\">${simbolo === 'C' ? 'Al\u00f3tropos: Diamante, Grafito, Grafeno' : 'Elemento puro'}<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-card\">\r\n                            <div class=\"dato-icon\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato-text\">${elemento.categoria.includes('metal') ? 'Conductor el\u00e9ctrico' : 'No conductor'}<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar subt\u00edtulo\r\n        document.getElementById('infoElementoTabla').querySelector('.info-subtitle').textContent = \r\n            `Elemento seleccionado: ${elemento.nombre} (${simbolo})`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Resaltar elemento seleccionado\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.elemento-celda').forEach(c => {\r\n            c.classList.remove('selected');\r\n        });\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR: FORMACI\u00d3N DE COMPUESTOS\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nlet compuestosFormados = 0;\r\nlet compuestosComunes = 0;\r\nlet elementosUsados = new Set();\r\n\r\nfunction formarCompuesto() {\r\n    const elemA = document.getElementById('elementoA').value;\r\n    const cantA = parseInt(document.getElementById('cantidadA').value);\r\n    const elemB = document.getElementById('elementoB').value;\r\n    const cantB = parseInt(document.getElementById('cantidadB').value);\r\n    const tipoUnion = document.getElementById('tipoUnion').value;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Verificar que no sea el mismo elemento\r\n    if (elemA === elemB) {\r\n        alert(\"\u26a0\ufe0f Los elementos deben ser diferentes para formar un compuesto\");\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Crear f\u00f3rmula\r\n    let formula = \"\";\r\n    let nombre = \"\";\r\n    let compuestoValido = false;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Verificar si es un compuesto conocido\r\n    const formulaKey = `${elemA}${cantA}${elemB}${cantB}`.toLowerCase();\r\n    const compuestoInversoKey = `${elemB}${cantB}${elemA}${cantA}`.toLowerCase();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Buscar en compuestos conocidos\r\n    for (const [key, compuesto] of Object.entries(compuestosDB)) {\r\n        const compuestoNormalizado = key.toLowerCase();\r\n        if (formulaKey.includes(compuestoNormalizado) || compuestoInversoKey.includes(compuestoNormalizado)) {\r\n            formula = compuesto.formula;\r\n            nombre = compuesto.nombre;\r\n            compuestoValido = true;\r\n            compuestosComunes++;\r\n            break;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Si no es conocido, crear uno gen\u00e9rico\r\n    if (!compuestoValido) {\r\n        formula = `${elemA}${cantA > 1 ? cantA : ''}${elemB}${cantB > 1 ? cantB : ''}`;\r\n        nombre = `${elementosDB[elemA].nombre.toLowerCase()} ${elementosDB[elemB].nombre.toLowerCase()}uro`;\r\n        compuestoValido = true;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    if (compuestoValido) {\r\n        compuestosFormados++;\r\n        elementosUsados.add(elemA);\r\n        elementosUsados.add(elemB);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Calcular masa molar\r\n        const masaA = elementosDB[elemA].masa * cantA;\r\n        const masaB = elementosDB[elemB].masa * cantB;\r\n        const masaMolar = masaA + masaB;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Calcular porcentajes\r\n        const porcentajeA = ((masaA \/ masaMolar) * 100).toFixed(2);\r\n        const porcentajeB = ((masaB \/ masaMolar) * 100).toFixed(2);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar visualizaci\u00f3n SVG\r\n        actualizarVisualizacionMolecular(elemA, elemB, cantA, cantB, formula, nombre);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n        document.getElementById('dataFormula').textContent = formula;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataNombre').textContent = nombre;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataProporcionAtomica').textContent = `${cantA}:${cantB} \u00e1tomos`;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataMasaMolar').textContent = `${masaMolar.toFixed(2)} g\/mol`;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataTipoUnion').textContent = tipoUnion === 'covalente' ? 'Covalente' : tipoUnion === 'ionica' ? 'I\u00f3nica' : 'Met\u00e1lica';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEstado').textContent = masaMolar < 50 ? 'Gas' : masaMolar < 100 ? 'L\u00edquido' : 'S\u00f3lido';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataPorcentajeMasa').textContent = `${porcentajeA}% ${elemA} : ${porcentajeB}% ${elemB}`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas\r\n        document.getElementById('statValidos').textContent = compuestosFormados;\r\n        document.getElementById('statComunes').textContent = compuestosComunes;\r\n        document.getElementById('statDiversidad').textContent = elementosUsados.size;\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoFormacion').textContent = \r\n            `Compuesto formado: ${nombre} (${formula})`;\r\n            \r\n        console.log(`\ud83e\uddea Compuesto formado: ${formula} (${nombre})`);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarVisualizacionMolecular(elemA, elemB, cantA, cantB, formula, nombre) {\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById('svgMolecular');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar \u00e1tomos individuales\r\n    document.getElementById('simboloA').textContent = elemA;\r\n    document.getElementById('simboloB').textContent = elemB;\r\n    document.getElementById('cantidadA').textContent = `\u00d7${cantA}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('cantidadB').textContent = `\u00d7${cantB}`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Colores seg\u00fan elementos\r\n    const colorA = elementosDB[elemA].color;\r\n    const colorB = elementosDB[elemB].color;\r\n    document.getElementById('atomoA').setAttribute('fill', colorA);\r\n    document.getElementById('atomoB').setAttribute('fill', colorB);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de flecha\r\n    const flecha = document.getElementById('flechaReaccion');\r\n    flecha.getElementsByTagName('animate')[0].beginElement();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar compuesto despu\u00e9s de 1 segundo\r\n    setTimeout(() => {\r\n        const compuesto = document.getElementById('compuestoFormado');\r\n        compuesto.style.opacity = '1';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Colores para mol\u00e9cula (promedio de colores)\r\n        const molecula = document.getElementById('mol\u00e9cula');\r\n        molecula.setAttribute('fill', mezclarColores(colorA, colorB));\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('formulaCompuesto').textContent = formula;\r\n        document.getElementById('nombreCompuesto').textContent = nombre;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar indicadores de proporci\u00f3n\r\n        const indicadores = document.getElementById('indicadoresProporcion');\r\n        indicadores.style.opacity = '1';\r\n        document.getElementById('proporcionAtomica').textContent = `${cantA}:${cantB} \u00e1tomos`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Calcular y mostrar proporci\u00f3n en masa\r\n        const masaA = elementosDB[elemA].masa * cantA;\r\n        const masaB = elementosDB[elemB].masa * cantB;\r\n        const porcentajeA = ((masaA \/ (masaA + masaB)) * 100).toFixed(2);\r\n        const porcentajeB = ((masaB \/ (masaA + masaB)) * 100).toFixed(2);\r\n        document.getElementById('proporcionMasa').textContent = `${porcentajeA}% : ${porcentajeB}%`;\r\n    }, 1000);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mezclarColores(color1, color2) {\r\n    \/\/ Conversi\u00f3n simple de colores (para demo)\r\n    if (color1 === '#2196F3' && color2 === '#F44336') return '#9C27B0'; \/\/ H + O = p\u00farpura\r\n    if (color1 === '#795548' && color2 === '#F44336') return '#FF9800'; \/\/ C + O = naranja\r\n    return '#673AB7'; \/\/ Color por defecto\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction compuestoAleatorio() {\r\n    const elementos = Object.keys(elementosDB);\r\n    const elemA = elementos[Math.floor(Math.random() * elementos.length)];\r\n    let elemB = elementos[Math.floor(Math.random() * elementos.length)];\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Asegurar elementos diferentes\r\n    while (elemB === elemA) {\r\n        elemB = elementos[Math.floor(Math.random() * elementos.length)];\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    const cantA = Math.floor(Math.random() * 3) + 1;\r\n    const cantB = Math.floor(Math.random() * 3) + 1;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar controles\r\n    document.getElementById('elementoA').value = elemA;\r\n    document.getElementById('cantidadA').value = cantA;\r\n    document.getElementById('valorA').textContent = `${cantA} \u00e1tomos`;\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('elementoB').value = elemB;\r\n    document.getElementById('cantidadB').value = cantB;\r\n    document.getElementById('valorB').textContent = `${cantB} \u00e1tomos`;\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('infoFormacion').textContent = \r\n        `Compuesto aleatorio: ${elemA}${cantA > 1 ? cantA : ''}${elemB}${cantB > 1 ? cantB : ''}`;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarConstructor() {\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('compuestoFormado').style.opacity = '0';\r\n    document.getElementById('indicadoresProporcion').style.opacity = '0';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar datos\r\n    const datos = ['dataFormula', 'dataNombre', 'dataProporcionAtomica', 'dataMasaMolar', 'dataTipoUnion', 'dataEstado', 'dataPorcentajeMasa'];\r\n    datos.forEach(id => {\r\n        document.getElementById(id).textContent = '\u2014';\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('infoFormacion').textContent = \r\n        \"Selecciona elementos y cantidades, luego haz clic en 'FORMAR COMPUESTO'\";\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ CONTROL DE SLIDERS\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\ndocument.getElementById('cantidadA').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    const valor = this.value;\r\n    document.getElementById('valorA').textContent = `${valor} \u00e1tomo${valor > 1 ? 's' : ''}`;\r\n});\r\n\r\ndocument.getElementById('cantidadB').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    const valor = this.value;\r\n    document.getElementById('valorB').textContent = `${valor} \u00e1tomo${valor > 1 ? 's' : ''}`;\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ ERRORES COMUNES - CORREGIDO\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    \/\/ Inicializar errores comunes - TODOS CERRADOS\r\n    const errorCards = document.querySelectorAll('.error-card');\r\n    \r\n    errorCards.forEach(card => {\r\n        card.classList.remove('active');\r\n        const toggle = card.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        \r\n        const content = card.querySelector('.error-content');\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        content.style.maxHeight = '0';\r\n        content.style.opacity = '0';\r\n        content.style.padding = '0';\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Event listeners para headers de error\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.error-header').forEach(header => {\r\n        header.addEventListener('click', function(e) {\r\n            e.stopPropagation();\r\n            \r\n            const card = this.closest('.error-card');\r\n            const toggle = this.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n            const content = card.querySelector('.error-content');\r\n            const isActive = card.classList.contains('active');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Cerrar todos los dem\u00e1s\r\n            document.querySelectorAll('.error-card').forEach(otherCard => {\r\n                if (otherCard !== card) {\r\n                    otherCard.classList.remove('active');\r\n                    const otherToggle = otherCard.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n                    otherToggle.textContent = '+';\r\n                    \r\n                    const otherContent = otherCard.querySelector('.error-content');\r\n                    otherContent.style.display = 'none';\r\n                    otherContent.style.maxHeight = '0';\r\n                    otherContent.style.opacity = '0';\r\n                    otherContent.style.padding = '0';\r\n                }\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Alternar este\r\n            if (isActive) {\r\n                card.classList.remove('active');\r\n                toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n                content.style.display = 'none';\r\n                \r\n                setTimeout(() => {\r\n                    content.style.maxHeight = '0';\r\n                    content.style.opacity = '0';\r\n                    content.style.padding = '0';\r\n                }, 10);\r\n            } else {\r\n                card.classList.add('active');\r\n                toggle.textContent = '\u00d7';\r\n                content.style.display = 'block';\r\n                \r\n                setTimeout(() => {\r\n                    content.style.maxHeight = '600px';\r\n                    content.style.opacity = '1';\r\n                    content.style.padding = 'var(--sp-md)';\r\n                }, 10);\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Funci\u00f3n para mostrar soluci\u00f3n\r\nwindow.mostrarSolucion = function(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n    if (!solucion) return;\r\n    \r\n    const isVisible = solucion.style.display === 'block';\r\n    \r\n    if (isVisible) {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'none';\r\n    } else {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'block';\r\n        solucion.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'nearest' });\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ Funci\u00f3n toggle error\r\nwindow.toggleError = function(header) {\r\n    if (!header) return;\r\n    \r\n    const card = header.closest('.error-card');\r\n    const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n    const content = card.querySelector('.error-content');\r\n    const isActive = card.classList.contains('active');\r\n    \r\n    if (isActive) {\r\n        card.classList.remove('active');\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        \r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            content.style.maxHeight = '0';\r\n            content.style.opacity = '0';\r\n            content.style.padding = '0';\r\n        }, 10);\r\n    } else {\r\n        card.classList.add('active');\r\n        toggle.textContent = '\u00d7';\r\n        content.style.display = 'block';\r\n        \r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            content.style.maxHeight = '600px';\r\n            content.style.opacity = '1';\r\n            content.style.padding = 'var(--sp-md)';\r\n        }, 10);\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n        \r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n        verificarCompletadoQuiz();\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction verificarCompletadoQuiz() {\r\n    const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n    const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q => \r\n        q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n    );\r\n    \r\n    if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n        quizCompletado = true;\r\n        mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n    const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n    \r\n    let feedback = \"\";\r\n    if (porcentaje >= 90) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas completamente el tema de elementos y compuestos.\";\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 70) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero revisa algunos conceptos clave.\";\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 50) {\r\n        feedback = \"\u26a0\ufe0f Necesitas repasar las diferencias entre elementos y compuestos.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\u274c Requieres estudio intensivo del tema.\";\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    const isVisible = solucion.style.display === 'block';\r\n    \r\n    if (isVisible) {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'none';\r\n    } else {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'block';\r\n        solucion.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'nearest' });\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n    \r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n    \r\n    alert('\ud83d\udcca AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n' +\r\n        `Diferenciaci\u00f3n elemento\/compuesto: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `Interpretaci\u00f3n f\u00f3rmulas: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `Tabla Peri\u00f3dica: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Revisa el plan de estudio recomendado seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n    \r\n    console.log(`AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada: ${slider1}, ${slider2}, ${slider3}`);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ INTERACTIVIDAD DE TABLAS\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(row => {\r\n    row.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const elemento = this.dataset.elemento;\r\n        const info = document.getElementById('infoElemento');\r\n        \r\n        const infoTextos = {\r\n            H: \"\u269b\ufe0f HIDR\u00d3GENO: Elemento m\u00e1s ligero y abundante del universo. Gas incoloro, inodoro e inflamable. Fundamental en qu\u00edmica org\u00e1nica y como combustible limpio.\",\r\n            He: \"\u269b\ufe0f HELIO: Gas noble, segundo elemento m\u00e1s abundante en el universo. Inerte, no inflamable. Usado en globos, refrigeraci\u00f3n criog\u00e9nica y en mezclas respiratorias.\",\r\n            C: \"\u269b\ufe0f CARBONO: Elemento de la vida. Forma millones de compuestos org\u00e1nicos. Al\u00f3tropos: diamante (duro), grafito (conductor), grafeno (2D, superfuerte).\",\r\n            O: \"\u269b\ufe0f OX\u00cdGENO: Elemento esencial para la respiraci\u00f3n. Componente del agua (H\u2082O) y del aire (21%). Gas incoloro e inodoro, comburente.\",\r\n            Fe: \"\u269b\ufe0f HIERRO: Metal de transici\u00f3n, cuarto elemento m\u00e1s abundante en la corteza terrestre. Fundamental para la industria (acero) y biolog\u00eda (hemoglobina).\",\r\n            Au: \"\u269b\ufe0f ORO: Metal noble, excelente conductor, no se corroe. Usado en joyer\u00eda, electr\u00f3nica y como reserva de valor. S\u00edmbolo qu\u00edmico: Au (del lat\u00edn aurum).\",\r\n            Og: \"\u269b\ufe0f OGANES\u00d3N: Elemento sint\u00e9tico superpesado, \u00faltimo confirmado (2016). Inestable, decae en milisegundos. Nombre en honor a Yuri Oganessian.\"\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        info.textContent = infoTextos[elemento] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\";\r\n        info.style.animation = \"highlight 0.5s\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar\/ocultar detalles\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.detalle-elemento').forEach(detalle => {\r\n            detalle.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        if (elemento === 'H') {\r\n            document.getElementById('detalleH').style.display = 'block';\r\n        } else if (elemento === 'C') {\r\n            document.getElementById('detalleC').style.display = 'block';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(r => {\r\n            r.classList.remove('selected');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Marcar fila seleccionada\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Objetivos interactivos\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n        this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n        const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n        checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n        checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : 'transparent';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Sistema Cyberpunk Educativo inicializado\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\udcda Lecci\u00f3n: Elementos y Compuestos - Tabla Peri\u00f3dica, F\u00f3rmulas, Al\u00f3tropos\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\udd2c Tabla Peri\u00f3dica interactiva y simulador de compuestos listos\");\r\n\r\n\/\/ CSS para animaciones\r\nconst style = document.createElement('style');\r\nstyle.textContent = `\r\n    @keyframes highlight {\r\n        0% { background-color: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0); }\r\n        50% { background-color: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.1); }\r\n        100% { background-color: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0); }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    @keyframes pulse {\r\n        0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }\r\n        50% { transform: scale(1.05); }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    @keyframes fadeIn {\r\n        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-10px); }\r\n        to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\r\n    }\r\n`;\r\ndocument.head.appendChild(style);\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ ERRORES COMUNES - JAVASCRIPT SIMPLIFICADO Y FUNCIONAL\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar cuando el DOM est\u00e9 listo\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    inicializarErroresComunes();\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction inicializarErroresComunes() {\r\n    const errorCards = document.querySelectorAll('.error-card');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Configurar estado inicial\r\n    errorCards.forEach(card => {\r\n        \/\/ Asegurar que est\u00e9 cerrado al inicio\r\n        card.classList.remove('active');\r\n        \r\n        const toggle = card.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n        if (toggle) {\r\n            toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        const content = card.querySelector('.error-content');\r\n        if (content) {\r\n            content.style.maxHeight = '0';\r\n            content.style.opacity = '0';\r\n            content.style.padding = '0';\r\n            content.style.overflow = 'hidden';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ A\u00f1adir evento click al header\r\n        const header = card.querySelector('.error-header');\r\n        if (header) {\r\n            header.addEventListener('click', function(e) {\r\n                e.stopPropagation();\r\n                toggleErrorCard(card);\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ A\u00f1adir cursor pointer para indicar que es clickeable\r\n            header.style.cursor = 'pointer';\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    console.log('\u2705 Errores comunes inicializados correctamente');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction toggleErrorCard(card) {\r\n    const isActive = card.classList.contains('active');\r\n    const toggle = card.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n    const content = card.querySelector('.error-content');\r\n    \r\n    if (!toggle || !content) return;\r\n    \r\n    if (isActive) {\r\n        \/\/ CERRAR\r\n        card.classList.remove('active');\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de cierre\r\n        content.style.maxHeight = '0';\r\n        content.style.opacity = '0';\r\n        content.style.padding = '0';\r\n        \r\n        console.log('\ud83d\udccc Error cerrado');\r\n    } else {\r\n        \/\/ CERRAR TODOS LOS DEM\u00c1S primero\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.error-card').forEach(otherCard => {\r\n            if (otherCard !== card && otherCard.classList.contains('active')) {\r\n                otherCard.classList.remove('active');\r\n                const otherToggle = otherCard.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n                const otherContent = otherCard.querySelector('.error-content');\r\n                \r\n                if (otherToggle) otherToggle.textContent = '+';\r\n                if (otherContent) {\r\n                    otherContent.style.maxHeight = '0';\r\n                    otherContent.style.opacity = '0';\r\n                    otherContent.style.padding = '0';\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ ABRIR ESTE\r\n        card.classList.add('active');\r\n        toggle.textContent = '\u00d7';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de apertura\r\n        content.style.maxHeight = '1000px';\r\n        content.style.opacity = '1';\r\n        content.style.padding = 'var(--sp-md)';\r\n        \r\n        console.log('\ud83d\udccc Error abierto');\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Funci\u00f3n para mostrar\/ocultar soluci\u00f3n (para botones \"Ver soluci\u00f3n\")\r\nwindow.mostrarSolucion = function(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n    if (!solucion) {\r\n        console.error('\u274c No se encontr\u00f3 la soluci\u00f3n', num);\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    const isVisible = solucion.style.display === 'block';\r\n    \r\n    if (isVisible) {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'none';\r\n        console.log('\ud83d\udccc Soluci\u00f3n oculta', num);\r\n    } else {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'block';\r\n        console.log('\ud83d\udccc Soluci\u00f3n mostrada', num);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Scroll suave a la soluci\u00f3n\r\n        solucion.scrollIntoView({ \r\n            behavior: 'smooth', \r\n            block: 'nearest' \r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ Funci\u00f3n toggle error (para onclick en HTML si a\u00fan lo usas)\r\nwindow.toggleError = function(header) {\r\n    if (!header) {\r\n        console.error('\u274c No se proporcion\u00f3 header para toggleError');\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    const card = header.closest('.error-card');\r\n    if (!card) {\r\n        console.error('\u274c No se encontr\u00f3 la tarjeta de error');\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    toggleErrorCard(card);\r\n};\r\n<\/script>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Elemento ejemplo","respuesta":"Hierro (Fe)"},{"enunciado":"Compuesto ejemplo","respuesta":"\u00c1cido sulf\u00farico (H\u2082SO\u2084)"},{"enunciado":"Total elementos 2025","respuesta":"118"},{"enunciado":"F\u00f3rmula agua","respuesta":"H\u2082O"},{"enunciado":"Proporci\u00f3n H:O en H\u2082O","respuesta":"2:1"},{"enunciado":"% O en CO\u2082","respuesta":"72.71%"},{"enunciado":"Elemento m\u00e1s abundante Tierra","respuesta":"Ox\u00edgeno (O)"},{"enunciado":"Al\u00f3tropos del carbono","respuesta":"Diamante, grafito, fullereno"},{"enunciado":"Ley Proust en NaCl","respuesta":"39.34% Na, 60.66% Cl"},{"enunciado":"NIST: masa H exacta","respuesta":"1.00784 u"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC: \u00faltimo elemento","respuesta":"Oganes\u00f3n (Og)"},{"enunciado":"Compuesto con m\u00e1s elementos","respuesta":"Ej. ADN (C, H, O, N, P)"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Elementos son...","opciones":["Un tipo de \u00e1tomo","Mezcla","Compuesto","Soluci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Un tipo de \u00e1tomo"},{"pregunta":"Compuestos tienen...","opciones":["Proporciones fijas","Variables","Aleatorias","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Proporciones fijas"},{"pregunta":"Tabla peri\u00f3dica contiene...","opciones":["Elementos","Compuestos","Mezclas","Reacciones"],"correcta":"Elementos"},{"pregunta":"NaCl es...","opciones":["Compuesto","Elemento","Mezcla","Gas"],"correcta":"Compuesto"},{"pregunta":"H\u2082O contiene...","opciones":["2H + O","H + O","H\u2082 + O\u2082","H + O\u2082"],"correcta":"2H + O"},{"pregunta":"S\u00edmbolo oro","opciones":["Au","Ag","Fe","O"],"correcta":"Au"},{"pregunta":"N\u00famero at\u00f3mico H","opciones":["1","2","8","26"],"correcta":"1"},{"pregunta":"CO\u2082 es...","opciones":["Compuesto","Elemento","Mezcla","Plasma"],"correcta":"Compuesto"},{"pregunta":"Diamante es...","opciones":["Carbono (C)","Ox\u00edgeno","Hidr\u00f3geno","Hierro"],"correcta":"Carbono (C)"},{"pregunta":"Ley Proust aplica a...","opciones":["Compuestos","Elementos","Mezclas","Gases"],"correcta":"Compuestos"},{"pregunta":"% O en H\u2082O","opciones":["88.81%","11.19%","50%","100%"],"correcta":"88.81%"},{"pregunta":"Masa molar H\u2082O","opciones":["18.016 u","16 u","2 u","32 u"],"correcta":"18.016 u"},{"pregunta":"Al\u00f3tropos del ox\u00edgeno","opciones":["O\u2082 y O\u2083","O y O\u2082","O\u2082 y H\u2082O","O y CO\u2082"],"correcta":"O\u2082 y O\u2083"},{"pregunta":"N\u00famero elementos naturales","opciones":["92","118","100","150"],"correcta":"92"},{"pregunta":"S\u00edmbolo \u00faltimo elemento","opciones":["Og","Uuo","Lv","Ts"],"correcta":"Og"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula \u00e1cido sulf\u00farico","opciones":["H\u2082SO\u2084","HCl","HNO\u2083","NaOH"],"correcta":"H\u2082SO\u2084"},{"pregunta":"Elemento m\u00e1s ligero","opciones":["Hidr\u00f3geno","Helio","Litio","Carbono"],"correcta":"Hidr\u00f3geno"},{"pregunta":"Grafito conduce...","opciones":["Electricidad","Calor","Luz","Sonido"],"correcta":"Electricidad"},{"pregunta":"Diamante es...","opciones":["Aislante","Conductor","Semiconductor","Superconductor"],"correcta":"Aislante"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC 2025: elementos totales","opciones":["118","117","119","120"],"correcta":"118"},{"pregunta":"NIST: masa exacta H","opciones":["1.00784 u","1.008 u","1.000 u","2.014 u"],"correcta":"1.00784 u"},{"pregunta":"Relaci\u00f3n masa H:O en H\u2082O","opciones":["1:8","1:16","2:1","1:1"],"correcta":"1:8"},{"pregunta":"Oganes\u00f3n (Og) es...","opciones":["Sint\u00e9tico","Natural","Gas noble","Metal"],"correcta":"Sint\u00e9tico"},{"pregunta":"Ley proporciones m\u00faltiples","opciones":["CO y CO\u2082","H\u2082O y H\u2082O\u2082","NaCl y KCl","Fe y Au"],"correcta":"CO y CO\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Fullereno es al\u00f3tropo de...","opciones":["Carbono","Ox\u00edgeno","F\u00f3sforo","Azufre"],"correcta":"Carbono"},{"pregunta":"Elemento con m\u00e1s is\u00f3topos estables","opciones":["Esta\u00f1o (Sn)","Carbono","Hidr\u00f3geno","Ox\u00edgeno"],"correcta":"Esta\u00f1o (Sn)"},{"pregunta":"S\u00edmbolo provisional Uup","opciones":["Mc (Moscovio)","Og","Ts","Lv"],"correcta":"Mc (Moscovio)"},{"pregunta":"Compuesto con f\u00f3rmula C\u2086H\u2081\u2082O\u2086","opciones":["Glucosa","Metano","Etanol","\u00c1cido c\u00edtrico"],"correcta":"Glucosa"},{"pregunta":"Elemento m\u00e1s electronegativo","opciones":["Fl\u00faor (F)","Ox\u00edgeno","Cloro","Nitr\u00f3geno"],"correcta":"Fl\u00faor (F)"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC define elemento como...","opciones":["Especie con mismo Z","Misma masa","Mismo volumen","Mismo color"],"correcta":"Especie con mismo Z"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"tipos-mezclas","titulo":"Tipos de Mezclas: Desde Soluciones hasta Coloides","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK - TIPOS DE MEZCLAS -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-quimica-mezclas\" data-tema=\"tipos-mezclas\">\r\n\r\n<!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n    <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n        TIPOS DE MEZCLAS\r\n    <\/h1>\r\n    <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n        Desde Soluciones hasta Coloides: Dominando la Heterogeneidad Molecular\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/header>\r\n\r\n<!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n<section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Diferenciar mezclas homog\u00e9neas y heterog\u00e9neas<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Basado en uniformidad y tama\u00f1o de part\u00edcula<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Clasificar subtipos de mezclas<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Soluciones, coloides, suspensiones, emulsiones<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Identificar efectos clave<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Efecto Tyndall, sedimentaci\u00f3n, filtraci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Aplicar en contextos reales<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Industria alimentaria, farmac\u00e9utica, ambiental<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n<section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n            <h3>Industria Farmac\u00e9utica<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Suspensiones l\u00edquidas para f\u00e1rmacos insolubles, emulsiones para cremas<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"dato-neon\">Tama\u00f1o part\u00edcula controlado: 50-5000 nm<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n            <h3>Tratamiento de Aguas<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Coagulaci\u00f3n de coloides para remover part\u00edculas en suspensi\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"dato-neon\">Eficiencia: 95-99% impurezas<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n            <h3>Alimentos Procesados<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Emulsiones estables en mayonesa, salsas, helados<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"dato-neon\">Vida \u00fatil: 6-24 meses<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n<section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <!-- INTRODUCCI\u00d3N -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>1. Clasificaci\u00f3n General de Mezclas<\/h3>\r\n        <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n            <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                <h4>\u26a1 MEZCLA<\/h4>\r\n                <p>Sistema material formado por <strong>dos o m\u00e1s componentes<\/strong> que conservan sus propiedades individuales<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                    \\[ \\text{Mezcla} = \\text{Componente}_1 + \\text{Componente}_2 + \\dots \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TABLA CLASIFICACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n            <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>TIPO<\/th>\r\n                        <th>UNIFORMIDAD<\/th>\r\n                        <th>TAMA\u00d1O PART\u00cdCULA<\/th>\r\n                        <th>EFECTO TYNDALL<\/th>\r\n                        <th>EJEMPLO<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr data-tipo=\"homogenea\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">HOMOG\u00c9NEA<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Completa<\/td>\r\n                        <td>&lt; 1 nm<\/td>\r\n                        <td>No<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Aire, Agua salada<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-tipo=\"heterogenea\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">HETEROG\u00c9NEA<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Incompleta<\/td>\r\n                        <td>&gt; 1 nm<\/td>\r\n                        <td>S\u00ed<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Granito, Ensalada<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoClasificacion\">\r\n                Haz clic en una fila para detalles\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SUBTIPOS -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>2. Subtipos de Mezclas<\/h3>\r\n        <p class=\"principio-clave\">\r\n            <strong>Principio clave:<\/strong> El tama\u00f1o de part\u00edcula determina las propiedades \u00f3pticas y de estabilidad\r\n        <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"metodos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"solucion\">\r\n                <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\ud83d\udca7<\/div>\r\n                <h4>SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                    Homog\u00e9nea a nivel molecular\/at\u00f3mico\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Tama\u00f1o:<\/strong> &lt; 1 nm<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Tyndall:<\/strong> No<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Sal en agua<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"coloide\">\r\n                <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\ud83e\udd5b<\/div>\r\n                <h4>COLOIDE<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                    Heterog\u00e9nea con part\u00edculas 1-1000 nm\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Tama\u00f1o:<\/strong> 1-1000 nm<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Tyndall:<\/strong> S\u00ed<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Leche, Gelatina<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"metodo-card\" data-metodo=\"suspension\">\r\n                <div class=\"metodo-icon\">\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                <h4>SUSPENSI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"metodo-desc\">\r\n                    Heterog\u00e9nea con part\u00edculas &gt; 1000 nm\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"metodo-datos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Tama\u00f1o:<\/strong> &gt; 1000 nm<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Tyndall:<\/strong> S\u00ed fuerte<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Arena en agua<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- TIPOS DE COLOIDES -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>3. Tipos de Coloides<\/h3>\r\n        <div class=\"comparativa-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"comp-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83e\uddea SOL<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-badge\">S\u00f3lido en l\u00edquido<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"s\u00edmbolo\">\ud83c\udfa8<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">Pintura<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"tipo\">Part\u00edculas s\u00f3lidas<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"comp-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udf6e GEL<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-badge\">L\u00edquido en s\u00f3lido<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"s\u00edmbolo\">\ud83e\uded0<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">Gelatina<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"tipo\">Agua en red s\u00f3lida<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"comp-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83e\udd5a EMULSI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-badge\">L\u00edquido en l\u00edquido<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"s\u00edmbolo\">\ud83c\udf76<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nombre\">Mayonesa<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"tipo\">Aceite en agua<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n<section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/span> SIMULADOR: CLASIFICACI\u00d3N DE MEZCLAS\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"clasificacion-mezclas\">\r\n        <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n            <h3>CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"mezclaInput\">Mezcla:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"mezclaInput\" class=\"control-input\" \r\n                       placeholder=\"Ej: Leche, Aire, Pintura\" list=\"mezclasList\">\r\n                <datalist id=\"mezclasList\">\r\n                    <option value=\"Leche\">Leche<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Aire\">Aire<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Sal en agua\">Sal en agua<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Mayonesa\">Mayonesa<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Arena en agua\">Arena en agua<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Jugo con pulpa\">Jugo con pulpa<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Niebla\">Niebla<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Humo\">Humo<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Gelatina\">Gelatina<\/option>\r\n                    <option value=\"Crema batida\">Crema batida<\/option>\r\n                <\/datalist>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label>Propiedades:<\/label>\r\n                <div class=\"checkbox-group\">\r\n                    <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"propiedades\" value=\"uniforme\"> Uniforme a simple vista<\/label>\r\n                    <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"propiedades\" value=\"tyndall\"> Efecto Tyndall<\/label>\r\n                    <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"propiedades\" value=\"sedimenta\"> Sedimenta con tiempo<\/label>\r\n                    <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"propiedades\" value=\"filtrable\"> Filtrable<\/label>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <button class=\"btn-clasificar\" onclick=\"clasificarMezcla()\">\r\n                <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u26a1<\/span> CLASIFICAR\r\n            <\/button>\r\n\r\n            <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"mezclaAleatoria()\">\r\n                <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> MEZCLA ALEATORIA\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacionMezcla\">\r\n            <div class=\"svg-container\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" id=\"svgMezclas\">\r\n                    <!-- NODO PRINCIPAL -->\r\n                    <g id=\"nodoMezcla\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"250\" y=\"30\" width=\"100\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#9C27B0\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"300\" y=\"55\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">MEZCLA<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- RAMAS -->\r\n                    <path id=\"ramaHomogenea\" d=\"M300 80 L300 120\" stroke=\"#4CAF50\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                    <path id=\"ramaHeterogenea\" d=\"M300 80 L300 120\" stroke=\"#FF9800\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- HOMOG\u00c9NEA -->\r\n                    <g id=\"nodoHomogenea\" opacity=\"0.5\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"200\" y=\"130\" width=\"100\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"250\" y=\"155\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">HOMOG\u00c9NEA<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- RAMA SOLUCI\u00d3N -->\r\n                    <path id=\"ramaSolucion\" d=\"M250 170 L250 210\" stroke=\"#2196F3\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- HETEROG\u00c9NEA -->\r\n                    <g id=\"nodoHeterogenea\" opacity=\"0.5\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"300\" y=\"130\" width=\"100\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FF9800\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"350\" y=\"155\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">HETEROG\u00c9NEA<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- RAMAS HETEROG\u00c9NEA -->\r\n                    <path id=\"ramaColoide\" d=\"M350 170 L350 210\" stroke=\"#FFC107\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                    <path id=\"ramaSuspension\" d=\"M350 170 L350 210\" stroke=\"#F44336\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- SOLUCI\u00d3N -->\r\n                    <g id=\"nodoSolucion\" opacity=\"0.5\">\r\n                        <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"250\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#2196F3\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"200\" y=\"250\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- COLOIDE -->\r\n                    <g id=\"nodoColoide\" opacity=\"0.5\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"325\" y=\"230\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFC107\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"350\" y=\"250\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">COLOIDE<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- SUSPENSI\u00d3N -->\r\n                    <g id=\"nodoSuspension\" opacity=\"0.5\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"325\" y=\"280\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F44336\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"350\" y=\"300\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">SUSPENSI\u00d3N<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- RESULTADO -->\r\n                    <g id=\"resultadoClasificacion\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"200\" y=\"320\" width=\"200\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#673AB7\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"300\" y=\"340\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"textoResultado\">RESULTADO<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"300\" y=\"355\" fill=\"#E1BEE7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" id=\"textoDetalle\">Detalles aqu\u00ed<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-info\" id=\"infoSimulador\">\r\n                Ingresa una mezcla y haz clic en \"CLASIFICAR\"\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n            <h3>DATOS DE CLASIFICACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Mezcla:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataMezcla\">-<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Tipo principal:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTipo\">-<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Subtipo:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataSubtipo\">-<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Tama\u00f1o part\u00edcula:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTamano\">-<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Efecto Tyndall:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTyndall\">-<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Estabilidad:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEstabilidad\">-<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udcca ESTAD\u00cdSTICAS<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <span>Mezclas conocidas:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\">10,000+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <span>Tama\u00f1o cr\u00edtico coloide:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\">1-1000 nm<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <span>Velocidad sedimentaci\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\">0.01-10 mm\/s<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n<section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n        <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el tama\u00f1o caracter\u00edstico de part\u00edculas en un coloide?<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span> &lt; 1 nm\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span> 1-1000 nm\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span> 1-1000 nm\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span> &gt; 1 mm\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                    <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Los coloides tienen part\u00edculas de 1 a 1000 nan\u00f3metros.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                    <p>El rango de 1-1000 nm es cr\u00edtico: part\u00edculas m\u00e1s peque\u00f1as forman soluciones (sin efecto Tyndall), m\u00e1s grandes forman suspensiones (sedimentan r\u00e1pidamente).<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 tipo de mezcla NO muestra efecto Tyndall?<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span> Soluci\u00f3n\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span> Coloide\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span> Suspensi\u00f3n\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span> Emulsi\u00f3n\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                    <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Las soluciones tienen part\u00edculas &lt; 1 nm que no dispersan luz.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es un ejemplo de emulsi\u00f3n?<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span> Aire\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span> Sal en agua\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span> Arena en agua\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span> Mayonesa\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                    <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Mayonesa es emulsi\u00f3n (l\u00edquido en l\u00edquido estabilizado).\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<section class=\"errors-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"errors-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                <h3>Confundir coloide con soluci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                    <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"La leche es una soluci\u00f3n porque se ve uniforme\"\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                    <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La leche es un COLOIDE (part\u00edculas 100-500 nm). Las soluciones tienen part\u00edculas &lt; 1 nm.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                <h3>Clasificaci\u00f3n de Mezclas<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                <p>Clasifica y justifica:<\/p>\r\n                <ol>\r\n                    <li>Leche entera<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Jugo de naranja filtrado<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Humo de cigarro<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Agua con az\u00facar<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Crema batida<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                <textarea placeholder=\"Tu respuesta aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"6\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n            <h3>AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                <label>Diferenciar tipos de mezclas:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                    <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                <h4>Repaso (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Memorizar rangos de tama\u00f1o<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Recordar 5 tipos de coloides<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ Base de datos de mezclas\r\nconst mezclasDB = {\r\n    \"Leche\": {\r\n        tipo: \"Heterog\u00e9nea\",\r\n        subtipo: \"Coloide (Emulsi\u00f3n)\",\r\n        tamano: \"100-500 nm\",\r\n        tyndall: \"S\u00ed\",\r\n        estabilidad: \"Estable\",\r\n        color: \"#FFC107\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"Aire\": {\r\n        tipo: \"Homog\u00e9nea\",\r\n        subtipo: \"Soluci\u00f3n (gaseosa)\",\r\n        tamano: \"< 1 nm\",\r\n        tyndall: \"No\",\r\n        estabilidad: \"Estable\",\r\n        color: \"#2196F3\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"Mayonesa\": {\r\n        tipo: \"Heterog\u00e9nea\",\r\n        subtipo: \"Coloide (Emulsi\u00f3n)\",\r\n        tamano: \"500-5000 nm\",\r\n        tyndall: \"S\u00ed\",\r\n        estabilidad: \"Semi-estable\",\r\n        color: \"#FFC107\"\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\nfunction clasificarMezcla() {\r\n    const input = document.getElementById('mezclaInput').value;\r\n    const mezcla = mezclasDB[input];\r\n    \r\n    if (mezcla) {\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n        document.getElementById('dataMezcla').textContent = input;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataTipo').textContent = mezcla.tipo;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataSubtipo').textContent = mezcla.subtipo;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataTamano').textContent = mezcla.tamano;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataTyndall').textContent = mezcla.tyndall;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEstabilidad').textContent = mezcla.estabilidad;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar SVG\r\n        actualizarSVG(mezcla);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mezclaAleatoria() {\r\n    const mezclas = Object.keys(mezclasDB);\r\n    const aleatoria = mezclas[Math.floor(Math.random() * mezclas.length)];\r\n    document.getElementById('mezclaInput').value = aleatoria;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Sistema de Quiz\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecci\u00f3n anterior\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n        \r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n<\/script>\r\n\r\n<!-- ESTILOS CSS -->\r\n<style>\r\n\/* VARIABLES CYBERPUNK *\/\r\n:root {\r\n    --neon-concepto: #39FF14;\r\n    --neon-interactivo: #FF00FF;\r\n    --neon-ejemplo: #00FFFF;\r\n    --neon-alerta: #FFFF00;\r\n    --neon-evaluacion: #FF6B6B;\r\n    --neon-dato: #00FF9D;\r\n    --bg-leccion: #0a0a1a;\r\n    --bg-card: rgba(20, 20, 40, 0.8);\r\n    --font-base: 14px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* LECCI\u00d3N COMPACTA *\/\r\n.leccion-quimica-mezclas {\r\n    background: var(--bg-leccion);\r\n    color: #e0f0ff;\r\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\r\n    padding: 20px;\r\n    max-width: 1000px;\r\n    margin: 0 auto;\r\n    line-height: 1.5;\r\n    font-size: var(--font-base);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* T\u00cdTULOS COMPACTOS *\/\r\n.titulo-leccion {\r\n    font-size: 1.8rem;\r\n    color: var(--neon-concepto);\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.subtitulo {\r\n    font-size: 1rem;\r\n    color: var(--neon-ejemplo);\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\r\n    opacity: 0.9;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* SECCIONES COMPACTAS *\/\r\nsection {\r\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\r\n    padding: 20px;\r\n    background: var(--bg-card);\r\n    border-radius: 8px;\r\n    border-left: 3px solid;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.panel-objetivos { border-left-color: var(--neon-concepto); }\r\n.contexto-real { border-left-color: var(--neon-dato); }\r\n.teoria-section { border-left-color: var(--neon-concepto); }\r\n.simulator-section { border-left-color: var(--neon-interactivo); }\r\n.quiz-section { border-left-color: var(--neon-evaluacion); }\r\n\r\n\/* GRID COMPACTO *\/\r\n.objetivos-grid, .contexto-grid, .metodos-grid, .comparativa-grid {\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));\r\n    gap: 15px;\r\n    margin-top: 15px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* TARJETAS COMPACTAS *\/\r\n.objetivo-card, .contexto-card, .metodo-card, .comp-card {\r\n    background: rgba(30, 30, 60, 0.6);\r\n    padding: 15px;\r\n    border-radius: 6px;\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    transition: transform 0.2s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.objetivo-card:hover, .metodo-card:hover {\r\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\r\n    border-color: var(--neon-interactivo);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* SIMULADOR RESPONSIVE *\/\r\n.simulator-container {\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr 1fr;\r\n    gap: 20px;\r\n    padding: 20px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\r\n    .simulator-container {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* QUIZ COMPACTO *\/\r\n.quiz-question {\r\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n    padding: 15px;\r\n    background: rgba(40, 40, 60, 0.6);\r\n    border-radius: 6px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quiz-options {\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    gap: 8px;\r\n    margin: 15px 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quiz-option {\r\n    padding: 10px 15px;\r\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\r\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\r\n    border-radius: 4px;\r\n    text-align: left;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    transition: all 0.2s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quiz-option:hover {\r\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n    transform: translateX(3px);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* DATOS SIMULADOR *\/\r\n.data-card {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    padding: 8px 12px;\r\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    border-radius: 4px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.data-label {\r\n    color: #aaa;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.data-value {\r\n    color: var(--neon-dato);\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* TABLAS COMPACTAS *\/\r\n.tabla-cyberpunk {\r\n    width: 100%;\r\n    border-collapse: collapse;\r\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.tabla-cyberpunk th {\r\n    background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.1);\r\n    color: var(--neon-concepto);\r\n    padding: 10px;\r\n    text-align: left;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.tabla-cyberpunk td {\r\n    padding: 10px;\r\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* BOTONES *\/\r\n.btn-clasificar, .btn-aleatorio {\r\n    width: 100%;\r\n    padding: 12px;\r\n    margin-top: 10px;\r\n    border: none;\r\n    border-radius: 4px;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    transition: transform 0.2s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-clasificar {\r\n    background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--neon-interactivo), #FF00AA);\r\n    color: white;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-aleatorio {\r\n    background: linear-gradient(45deg, #00FFFF, #0097A7);\r\n    color: white;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.btn-clasificar:hover, .btn-aleatorio:hover {\r\n    transform: scale(1.02);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* EFECTOS NEON SUTILES *\/\r\n.titulo-leccion {\r\n    text-shadow: 0 0 5px currentColor;\r\n    animation: glow 3s infinite;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@keyframes glow {\r\n    0%, 100% { text-shadow: 0 0 5px currentColor; }\r\n    50% { text-shadow: 0 0 10px currentColor; }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* RESPONSIVE FINAL *\/\r\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\r\n    .leccion-quimica-mezclas {\r\n        padding: 10px;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .titulo-leccion {\r\n        font-size: 1.5rem;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    section {\r\n        padding: 15px;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .objetivos-grid, .metodos-grid {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n<\/style>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Mezcla homog\u00e9nea ejemplo","respuesta":"Aleaci\u00f3n, vino"},{"enunciado":"Mezcla heterog\u00e9nea ejemplo","respuesta":"Granola, sopa"},{"enunciado":"Coloide ejemplo","respuesta":"Leche, gelatina"},{"enunciado":"Emulsi\u00f3n ejemplo","respuesta":"Mayonesa, crema"},{"enunciado":"Suspensi\u00f3n se separa por","respuesta":"Sedimentaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Soluci\u00f3n pasa filtro","respuesta":"S\u00ed"},{"enunciado":"Efecto Tyndall en leche","respuesta":"S\u00ed"},{"enunciado":"Tama\u00f1o part\u00edcula coloide","respuesta":"1\u20131000 nm"},{"enunciado":"Gel es coloide de","respuesta":"L\u00edquido en s\u00f3lido"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC: l\u00edmite coloide","respuesta":"1000 nm"},{"enunciado":"Aerosol ejemplo","respuesta":"Niebla, humo"},{"enunciado":"Estabilizador en emulsi\u00f3n","respuesta":"Emulsionante (ej. lecitina)"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Mezcla homog\u00e9nea tiene...","opciones":["Apariencia uniforme","Fases visibles","Sedimento","Turbidez"],"correcta":"Apariencia uniforme"},{"pregunta":"Mezcla heterog\u00e9nea tiene...","opciones":["Fases visibles","Uniforme","Transparente","Estable"],"correcta":"Fases visibles"},{"pregunta":"Soluci\u00f3n es...","opciones":["Homog\u00e9nea","Heterog\u00e9nea","Pura","Elemento"],"correcta":"Homog\u00e9nea"},{"pregunta":"Suspensi\u00f3n se separa por...","opciones":["Sedimentaci\u00f3n","Destilaci\u00f3n","Qu\u00edmica","Luz"],"correcta":"Sedimentaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Leche es...","opciones":["Coloide","","Soluci\u00f3n","Suspensi\u00f3n","Pura"],"correcta":"Coloide"},{"pregunta":"Mayonesa es...","opciones":["Emulsi\u00f3n","Soluci\u00f3n","Suspensi\u00f3n","Gel"],"correcta":"Emulsi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Efecto Tyndall en soluci\u00f3n","opciones":["No","S\u00ed","Fuerte","D\u00e9bil"],"correcta":"No"},{"pregunta":"Arena en agua es...","opciones":["Suspensi\u00f3n","Soluci\u00f3n","Coloide","Gas"],"correcta":"Suspensi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Vino es...","opciones":["Soluci\u00f3n","Coloide","Suspensi\u00f3n","Elemento"],"correcta":"Soluci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Gelatina es...","opciones":["Gel (coloide)","Soluci\u00f3n","Emulsi\u00f3n","Aerosol"],"correcta":"Gel (coloide)"},{"pregunta":"Tama\u00f1o part\u00edcula soluci\u00f3n","opciones":["&lt; 1 nm","1\u20131000 nm","&gt; 1000 nm","0 nm"],"correcta":"&lt; 1 nm"},{"pregunta":"Tama\u00f1o part\u00edcula coloide","opciones":["1\u20131000 nm","&lt; 1 nm","&gt; 1000 nm","0 nm"],"correcta":"1\u20131000 nm"},{"pregunta":"Tama\u00f1o part\u00edcula suspensi\u00f3n","opciones":["&gt; 1000 nm","1\u20131000 nm","&lt; 1 nm","0 nm"],"correcta":"&gt; 1000 nm"},{"pregunta":"Efecto Tyndall en leche","opciones":["S\u00ed","No","Solo calor","Solo luz"],"correcta":"S\u00ed"},{"pregunta":"Emulsi\u00f3n es...","opciones":["L\u00edquido en l\u00edquido","S\u00f3lido en l\u00edquido","Gas en l\u00edquido","L\u00edquido en gas"],"correcta":"L\u00edquido en l\u00edquido"},{"pregunta":"Niebla es...","opciones":["Aerosol l\u00edquido","Espuma","Gel","Emulsi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Aerosol l\u00edquido"},{"pregunta":"Humo es...","opciones":["Aerosol s\u00f3lido","Espuma","Gel","Emulsi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Aerosol s\u00f3lido"},{"pregunta":"Pintura es...","opciones":["Sol (coloide)","Soluci\u00f3n","Suspensi\u00f3n","Emulsi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Sol (coloide)"},{"pregunta":"Crema batida es...","opciones":["Espuma","Gel","Emulsi\u00f3n","Aerosol"],"correcta":"Espuma"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC: l\u00edmite superior coloide","opciones":["1000 nm","1 nm","100 nm","10,000 nm"],"correcta":"1000 nm"},{"pregunta":"Estabilizador en mayonesa","opciones":["Lecitina (emulsionante)","Sal","Az\u00facar","Agua"],"correcta":"Lecitina (emulsionante)"},{"pregunta":"Di\u00e1lisis separa...","opciones":["Coloides de soluciones","Suspensiones","Gases","S\u00f3lidos"],"correcta":"Coloides de soluciones"},{"pregunta":"Coagulaci\u00f3n en coloides por...","opciones":["Electrolitos","Calor","Luz","Presi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Electrolitos"},{"pregunta":"Browniano en coloides","opciones":["Movimiento zig-zag","Sedimentaci\u00f3n","Flotaci\u00f3n","Evaporaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Movimiento zig-zag"},{"pregunta":"Electroforesis separa...","opciones":["Por carga","Por masa","Por color","Por pH"],"correcta":"Por carga"},{"pregunta":"Gel de s\u00edlice es...","opciones":["S\u00f3lido en gas","L\u00edquido en s\u00f3lido","Gas en l\u00edquido","S\u00f3lido en l\u00edquido"],"correcta":"L\u00edquido en s\u00f3lido"},{"pregunta":"Nube es...","opciones":["Aerosol l\u00edquido","Espuma","Emulsi\u00f3n","Suspensi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Aerosol l\u00edquido"},{"pregunta":"Protecci\u00f3n coloidal por...","opciones":["Capa adsorbida","Calor","Luz","Sonido"],"correcta":"Capa adsorbida"},{"pregunta":"Luz l\u00e1ser en coloide muestra...","opciones":["Trayecto visible","Nada","Explosi\u00f3n","Calor"],"correcta":"Trayecto visible"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC define coloide como sistema con...","opciones":["Part\u00edculas 1\u20131000 nm","Menos de 1 nm","M\u00e1s de 1000 nm","Gases"],"correcta":"Part\u00edculas 1\u20131000 nm"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"metodos-separacion-mezcla","titulo":"M\u00e9todos de Separaci\u00f3n de Mezclas: F\u00edsica Pura en Acci\u00f3n","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-quimica-separacion\" data-tema=\"separacion-mezclas\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n            M\u00c9TODOS DE SEPARACI\u00d3N DE MEZCLAS\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            F\u00edsica Pura en Acci\u00f3n: De la Filtraci\u00f3n a la Cromatograf\u00eda Avanzada\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"nivel-indicador\">\r\n            <span class=\"badge-nivel\">NIVEL AVANZADO<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge-tiempo\">\u23f1\ufe0f 90 minutos<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge-puntos\">\ud83c\udfaf 1500 XP<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS QU\u00cdMICOS OPERATIVOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Dominar 12 m\u00e9todos f\u00edsicos<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Identificar principio, equipo y l\u00edmites de cada t\u00e9cnica<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-meta\">12\/12 m\u00e9todos<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Seleccionar m\u00e9todo \u00f3ptimo<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Elegir t\u00e9cnica basada en propiedades diferenciales<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-meta\">99% precisi\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Calcular par\u00e1metros clave<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Rf, \u0394T, eficiencia, fuerza-G con f\u00f3rmulas precisas<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-meta\">10 c\u00e1lculos<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Dise\u00f1ar flujos industriales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Secuenciar m\u00e9todos para procesos reales complejos<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-meta\">5 procesos<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL INDUSTRIAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfed<\/span> IMPACTO INDUSTRIAL GLOBAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udee2\ufe0f Refiner\u00eda Petrolera<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Destilaci\u00f3n fraccionada procesa 2M barriles\/d\u00eda<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">46 fracciones diferentes<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Eficiencia: 98.7%<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udc8a Farmac\u00e9utica HPLC<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Cromatograf\u00eda l\u00edquida purifica f\u00e1rmacos a nivel molecular<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Pureza: 99.99%<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Costo: $5000\/an\u00e1lisis<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udca7 Desalinizaci\u00f3n MASIVA<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Destilaci\u00f3n por membranas produce 95M m\u00b3\/d\u00eda<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Energ\u00eda: 3 kWh\/m\u00b3<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Pa\u00edses: 150+<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- MAPA CONCEPTUAL INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"mapa-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f<\/span> MAPA DE M\u00c9TODOS POR PROPIEDAD\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"mapa-interactivo\">\r\n            <div class=\"propiedad-columna\" data-propiedad=\"tamano\">\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-header\">\r\n                    <h3>\ud83d\udccf TAMA\u00d1O PART\u00cdCULA<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-rango\">1 nm \u2192 1 mm<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"metodos-lista\">\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-item\" data-metodo=\"filtracion\">\r\n                        <strong>FILTRACI\u00d3N<\/strong>\r\n                        <span class=\"rango\">>1 \u03bcm<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\uddf4<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-item\" data-metodo=\"tamizado\">\r\n                        <strong>TAMIZADO<\/strong>\r\n                        <span class=\"rango\">100 \u03bcm - 10 mm<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd73\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-item\" data-metodo=\"ultrafiltracion\">\r\n                        <strong>ULTRAFILTRACI\u00d3N<\/strong>\r\n                        <span class=\"rango\">1-100 nm<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"propiedad-columna\" data-propiedad=\"densidad\">\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-header\">\r\n                    <h3>\u2696\ufe0f DENSIDAD<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-rango\">\u0394\u03c1 > 0.1 g\/mL<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"metodos-lista\">\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-item\" data-metodo=\"decantacion\">\r\n                        <strong>DECANTACI\u00d3N<\/strong>\r\n                        <span class=\"rango\">Natural<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udca7<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-item\" data-metodo=\"centrifugacion\">\r\n                        <strong>CENTRIFUGACI\u00d3N<\/strong>\r\n                        <span class=\"rango\">Hasta 100,000 G<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf00<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-item\" data-metodo=\"flotacion\">\r\n                        <strong>FLOTACI\u00d3N<\/strong>\r\n                        <span class=\"rango\">Selectiva<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udee7<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"propiedad-columna\" data-propiedad=\"volatilidad\">\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-header\">\r\n                    <h3>\ud83c\udf21\ufe0f VOLATILIDAD<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-rango\">\u0394T > 5\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"metodos-lista\">\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-item\" data-metodo=\"evaporacion\">\r\n                        <strong>EVAPORACI\u00d3N<\/strong>\r\n                        <span class=\"rango\">Solvente \u00fanico<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\u2600\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-item\" data-metodo=\"destilacion-simple\">\r\n                        <strong>DESTILACI\u00d3N SIMPLE<\/strong>\r\n                        <span class=\"rango\">\u0394T > 25\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\u2697\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-item\" data-metodo=\"destilacion-fraccionada\">\r\n                        <strong>DESTILACI\u00d3N FRACCIONADA<\/strong>\r\n                        <span class=\"rango\">\u0394T > 5\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfed<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"propiedad-columna\" data-propiedad=\"afinidad\">\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-header\">\r\n                    <h3>\ud83d\udd17 AFINIDAD QU\u00cdMICA<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad-rango\">K<sub>d<\/sub> diferencial<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"metodos-lista\">\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-item\" data-metodo=\"cromatografia-papel\">\r\n                        <strong>CROMATOGRAF\u00cdA PAPEL<\/strong>\r\n                        <span class=\"rango\">Rf = 0-1<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcc4<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-item\" data-metodo=\"cromatografia-gc\">\r\n                        <strong>GC-MS<\/strong>\r\n                        <span class=\"rango\">\u03bcg a pg<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"metodo-item\" data-metodo=\"cromatografia-hplc\">\r\n                        <strong>HPLC<\/strong>\r\n                        <span class=\"rango\">ng a fg<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udc8a<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"mapa-info\" id=\"infoMetodo\">\r\n            Selecciona un m\u00e9todo para ver detalles t\u00e9cnicos\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- TABLA T\u00c9CNICA COMPARATIVA -->\r\n    <section class=\"tabla-tecnica\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span> ESPECIFICACIONES T\u00c9CNICAS COMPARADAS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"tabla-container\">\r\n            <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk tabla-avanzada\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>M\u00c9TODO<\/th>\r\n                        <th>PRINCIPIO F\u00cdSICO<\/th>\r\n                        <th>EQUIPO REQUERIDO<\/th>\r\n                        <th>L\u00cdMITES T\u00c9CNICOS<\/th>\r\n                        <th>EFICIENCIA<\/th>\r\n                        <th>COSTO RELATIVO<\/th>\r\n                        <th>APLICACI\u00d3N INDUSTRIAL<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr data-metodo=\"filtracion\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">FILTRACI\u00d3N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Tama\u00f1o part\u00edcula > poro<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Embudo, papel filtro, bomba vac\u00edo<\/td>\r\n                        <td>>1 \u03bcm, colmataci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                        <td>95-99%<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\ud83d\udcb0<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Agua potable, qu\u00edmicos<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-metodo=\"destilacion-simple\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">DESTILACI\u00d3N SIMPLE<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>\u0394Punto ebullici\u00f3n > 25\u00b0C<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Matraz, condensador, term\u00f3metro<\/td>\r\n                        <td>No aze\u00f3tropos, descomposici\u00f3n t\u00e9rmica<\/td>\r\n                        <td>85-95%<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Alcohol, solventes<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-metodo=\"destilacion-fraccionada\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">DESTILACI\u00d3N FRACCIONADA<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>\u0394T > 5\u00b0C, platos te\u00f3ricos<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Columna fraccionadora, reflujo<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Aze\u00f3tropos (etanol-agua 95.6%)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>90-98%<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Petr\u00f3leo, productos qu\u00edmicos<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-metodo=\"cromatografia-gc\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">GC-MS<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Volatilidad + masa molecular<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Gas cromat\u00f3grafo, espectr\u00f3metro masa<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Compuestos vol\u00e1tiles\/semi-vol\u00e1tiles<\/td>\r\n                        <td>99.9% detecci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Forensic, ambiental, farmac\u00e9utica<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-metodo=\"centrifugacion\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">ULTRACENTRIFUGACI\u00d3N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Densidad + fuerza centr\u00edfuga<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Ultracentr\u00edfuga (100,000+ g)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Calentamiento, costo energ\u00e9tico<\/td>\r\n                        <td>99.99% separaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Prote\u00ednas, virus, nanopart\u00edculas<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-metodo=\"cromatografia-hplc\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">HPLC\/UPLC<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Afinidad fase estacionaria<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Bomba alta presi\u00f3n, detector UV\/RI\/MS<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Presi\u00f3n 6000 psi, costo columnas<\/td>\r\n                        <td>99.999% pureza<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Farmac\u00e9utica, biotecnolog\u00eda<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO: DESTILACI\u00d3N FRACCIONADA -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> SIMULADOR: DESTILACI\u00d3N FRACCIONADA INDUSTRIAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"destilacion-fraccionada\">\r\n            <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>\u2699\ufe0f PAR\u00c1METROS DEL PROCESO<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"mezclaInput\">Mezcla de Hidrocarburos:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"mezclaInput\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"petroleo-crudo\">Petr\u00f3leo Crudo Ligero<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"petroleo-pesado\">Petr\u00f3leo Crudo Pesado<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"bioetanol\">Mezcla Bioetanol-Agua<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"solventes\">Mezcla de Solventes (Hexano-Tolueno)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"temperaturaBase\">Temperatura Base (\u00b0C):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"temperaturaBase\" min=\"25\" max=\"400\" value=\"150\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-value\" id=\"tempValue\">150\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"platosColumn\">N\u00famero de Platos Te\u00f3ricos:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"platosColumn\" min=\"5\" max=\"50\" value=\"25\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-value\" id=\"platosValue\">25 platos<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"reflujoRatio\">Raz\u00f3n de Reflujo:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"reflujoRatio\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"5\" step=\"0.5\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-value\" id=\"reflujoValue\">5:1<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"presionSistema\">Presi\u00f3n (atm):<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"presionSistema\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"1\">1 atm (Atmosf\u00e9rica)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"0.5\">0.5 atm (Vac\u00edo Parcial)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"2\">2 atm (Presurizada)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-buttons\">\r\n                    <button class=\"btn-ejecutar\" onclick=\"ejecutarDestilacion()\">\r\n                        <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6<\/span> INICIAR DESTILACI\u00d3N\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"btn-pausar\" onclick=\"pausarDestilacion()\">\r\n                        <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u23f8\ufe0f<\/span> PAUSAR\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarDestilacion()\">\r\n                        <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N 3D DE LA COLUMNA -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <div class=\"columna-3d\" id=\"columna3D\">\r\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 600\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n                        <!-- Base de la columna -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"150\" y=\"50\" width=\"100\" height=\"500\" fill=\"rgba(100, 100, 255, 0.1)\" stroke=\"#00FFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Platos te\u00f3ricos -->\r\n                        <g id=\"platosGrupo\">\r\n                            <!-- Los platos se generan din\u00e1micamente con JS -->\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Mezcla de entrada -->\r\n                        <g id=\"entradaMezcla\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"100\" y=\"550\" width=\"200\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"linear-gradient(90deg, #FF6B6B, #FFD93D, #6BCF7F, #4D96FF)\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"568\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">MEZCLA DE ENTRADA<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Calentador -->\r\n                        <g id=\"calentador\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"140\" y=\"500\" width=\"120\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#FF6B6B\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"525\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">CALENTADOR<\/text>\r\n                            <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0.5;1;0.5\" dur=\"1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Fracciones de salida -->\r\n                        <g id=\"fraccionesSalida\">\r\n                            <!-- Se generan din\u00e1micamente -->\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Vapor animado -->\r\n                        <g id=\"vaporAnimado\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"300\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#00FFFF\" opacity=\"0.7\">\r\n                                <animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"300;100;300\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                                <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"8;12;8\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                            <\/circle>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                    <\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"leyenda-fracciones\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udfa8 LEYENDA DE FRACCIONES<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"leyenda-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"leyenda-color\" style=\"background: #FF6B6B;\"><\/div>\r\n                        <span>Gases (25-40\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"leyenda-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"leyenda-color\" style=\"background: #FFD93D;\"><\/div>\r\n                        <span>Gasolina (40-200\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"leyenda-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"leyenda-color\" style=\"background: #6BCF7F;\"><\/div>\r\n                        <span>Queroseno (200-300\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"leyenda-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"leyenda-color\" style=\"background: #4D96FF;\"><\/div>\r\n                        <span>Di\u00e9sel (300-350\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"leyenda-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"leyenda-color\" style=\"background: #9D65C9;\"><\/div>\r\n                        <span>Residuos (>350\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc8 DATOS DEL PROCESO<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Temperatura Actual:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTempActual\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Fracci\u00f3n Actual:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataFraccionActual\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Pureza Fracci\u00f3n:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPureza\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">EFICIENCIA COLUMNA:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEficiencia\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Caudal Destilado:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataCaudal\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Energ\u00eda Consumida:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEnergia\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"grafico-temperatura\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcca CURVA DE TEMPERATURA vs TIEMPO<\/h4>\r\n                    <canvas id=\"tempChart\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"><\/canvas>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"simulator-info\">\r\n            <h4>\u26a1 PAR\u00c1METROS \u00d3PTIMOS INDUSTRIALES<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"parametros-optimos\">\r\n                <div class=\"parametro\">\r\n                    <span>Petr\u00f3leo Crudo:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"valor-optimo\">40-50 platos, \u0394T = 2\u00b0C\/plato<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"parametro\">\r\n                    <span>Etanol-Agua:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"valor-optimo\">Reflujo 4:1, Aze\u00f3tropo 95.6%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"parametro\">\r\n                    <span>Eficiencia McCabe-Thiele:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"valor-optimo\">85-95% platos te\u00f3ricos<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- F\u00d3RMULAS MATEM\u00c1TICAS AVANZADAS -->\r\n    <section class=\"formulas-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\uddee<\/span> MODELADO MATEM\u00c1TICO AVANZADO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"formulas-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"formula-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udccf FACTOR DE RETENCI\u00d3N (Rf)<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-display\">\r\n                    \\[ R_f = \\frac{\\text{distancia recorrida por el soluto}}{\\text{distancia recorrida por el frente del solvente}} \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-ejemplo\">\r\n                    <strong>Ejemplo Cromatograf\u00eda:<\/strong> Si el soluto recorre 4.5 cm y el solvente 10 cm:\r\n                    \\[ R_f = \\frac{4.5}{10} = 0.45 \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-parametros\">\r\n                    <strong>Rango t\u00edpico:<\/strong> 0.0 (no migra) a 1.0 (migra con solvente)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"formula-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf21\ufe0f LEY DE RAOULT MODIFICADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-display\">\r\n                    \\[ P_{\\text{total}} = \\gamma_A x_A P_A^\\circ + \\gamma_B x_B P_B^\\circ \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-ejemplo\">\r\n                    <strong>Para mezclas no ideales (etanol-agua):<\/strong>\r\n                    \\[ \\gamma_{\\text{etanol}} = 1.72 \\quad \\gamma_{\\text{agua}} = 2.12 \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-nota\">\r\n                    *\u03b3 = coeficiente de actividad, explica desviaciones de la idealidad\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"formula-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf00 FUERZA CENTR\u00cdFUGA RELATIVA (RCF)<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-display\">\r\n                    \\[ \\text{RCF} = 1.118 \\times 10^{-5} \\times r \\times (\\text{RPM})^2 \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-ejemplo\">\r\n                    <strong>Para ultracentr\u00edfuga:<\/strong> r = 10 cm, RPM = 50,000\r\n                    \\[ \\text{RCF} = 1.118 \\times 10^{-5} \\times 10 \\times (50,000)^2 = 279,500 \\, g \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"formula-card\">\r\n                <h3>\u2696\ufe0f ECUACI\u00d3N DE VAN'T HOFF (OSMOSIS)<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-display\">\r\n                    \\[ \\Pi = i \\cdot M \\cdot R \\cdot T \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-ejemplo\">\r\n                    <strong>Para NaCl (i=2) 0.1M a 25\u00b0C:<\/strong>\r\n                    \\[ \\Pi = 2 \\times 0.1 \\times 0.0821 \\times 298 = 4.89 \\, \\text{atm} \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"calculadora-interactiva\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83e\uddee CALCULADORA DE EFICIENCIA DE DESTILACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"calculadora-controls\">\r\n                <div class=\"calc-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"calcDeltaT\">\u0394T entre componentes (\u00b0C):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"number\" id=\"calcDeltaT\" value=\"25\" min=\"1\" max=\"200\" step=\"0.1\">\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"calc-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"calcPlatos\">N\u00famero de platos te\u00f3ricos:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"number\" id=\"calcPlatos\" value=\"20\" min=\"1\" max=\"100\">\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-calcular\" onclick=\"calcularEficiencia()\">\r\n                    CALCULAR EFICIENCIA\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"calculadora-resultado\" id=\"resultadoEficiencia\">\r\n                <!-- Resultado aparecer\u00e1 aqu\u00ed -->\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ AVANZADO (30 PREGUNTAS - PRIMERAS 6 VISIBLES) -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE ALTA COMPLEJIDAD (30 PREGUNTAS)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\" id=\"quizContainer\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\" data-nivel=\"avanzado\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-dificultad\">\ud83d\udfe3 AVANZADO<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>En una columna de destilaci\u00f3n fraccionada con 30 platos te\u00f3ricos procesando una mezcla binaria ideal, \u00bfcu\u00e1l es la pureza m\u00e1xima te\u00f3rica (%) que se puede obtener del componente m\u00e1s vol\u00e1til si la diferencia de puntos de ebullici\u00f3n es de 15\u00b0C?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        92.5%\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        97.8%\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        99.3%\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        99.9%\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> 99.3% es el l\u00edmite te\u00f3rico con 30 platos y \u0394T=15\u00b0C\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la ecuaci\u00f3n de Fenske-Underwood\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n Matem\u00e1tica:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <p>Usando la ecuaci\u00f3n de Fenske para mezclas binarias ideales:<\/p>\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        N_{\\text{min}} = \\frac{\\log\\left[\\left(\\frac{x_D}{1-x_D}\\right)\\left(\\frac{1-x_W}{x_W}\\right)\\right]}{\\log(\\alpha)}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                        <p>Donde \u03b1 (volatilidad relativa) \u2248 1.2 para \u0394T=15\u00b0C<\/p>\r\n                        <p>Resolviendo: \\( x_D = 0.993 \\) (99.3%)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\" data-nivel=\"industrial\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-dificultad\">\ud83d\udd34 INDUSTRIAL<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>En una refiner\u00eda de petr\u00f3leo que procesa 100,000 barriles\/d\u00eda mediante destilaci\u00f3n atmosf\u00e9rica, \u00bfcu\u00e1l es el costo energ\u00e9tico aproximado (en USD\/d\u00eda) si la eficiencia t\u00e9rmica es del 65% y el costo de energ\u00eda es de $0.08\/kWh?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        $15,200 USD\/d\u00eda\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        $42,500 USD\/d\u00eda\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        $68,800 USD\/d\u00eda\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        $125,000 USD\/d\u00eda\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>C\u00e1lculo Detallado:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ol>\r\n                            <li>100,000 barriles\/d\u00eda \u00d7 159 L\/barril = 15,900,000 L\/d\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Energ\u00eda requerida te\u00f3rica: ~350 kWh\/1000L para calentar de 25\u00b0C a 350\u00b0C<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Energ\u00eda total te\u00f3rica: 15,900 \u00d7 350 = 5,565,000 kWh\/d\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Considerando 65% eficiencia: 5,565,000 \/ 0.65 = 8,561,538 kWh\/d\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Costo: 8,561,538 \u00d7 0.08 = $684,923 USD\/d\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Pero en la pr\u00e1ctica, con recuperaci\u00f3n de calor: ~$42,500 USD\/d\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ol>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\" data-nivel=\"analitico\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-dificultad\">\ud83d\udd35 ANAL\u00cdTICO<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>En un an\u00e1lisis por GC-MS de una muestra que contiene 10 compuestos org\u00e1nicos vol\u00e1tiles, si la resoluci\u00f3n m\u00ednima entre picos adyacentes es de 1.5 y el tiempo de retenci\u00f3n del \u00faltimo compuesto es de 45 minutos, \u00bfcu\u00e1l es el tiempo de an\u00e1lisis m\u00ednimo requerido usando una columna capilar de 30m?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        22.5 minutos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        35 minutos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        50 minutos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        67.5 minutos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 4 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\" data-nivel=\"conceptual\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">04<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-dificultad\">\ud83d\udfe2 CONCEPTUAL<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 no es posible obtener etanol al 100% mediante destilaci\u00f3n simple de una mezcla etanol-agua, incluso con infinitos platos te\u00f3ricos?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Formaci\u00f3n de aze\u00f3tropo a 95.6% etanol a 1 atm\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Limitaciones de la Ley de Raoult para mezclas no ideales\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Descomposici\u00f3n t\u00e9rmica del etanol a 100\u00b0C\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Equilibrio l\u00edquido-vapor alcanza composici\u00f3n constante\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 5 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\" data-nivel=\"matematico\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">05<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-dificultad\">\ud83d\udfe3 MATEM\u00c1TICO<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>En un proceso de ultrafiltraci\u00f3n para purificar prote\u00ednas, si el coeficiente de rechazo de la membrana para la prote\u00edna objetivo es 0.999 y el flujo de alimentaci\u00f3n es 10 L\/min con concentraci\u00f3n inicial de 1 g\/L, \u00bfcu\u00e1l es la concentraci\u00f3n en el permeado despu\u00e9s de procesar 100 L?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        0.001 g\/L\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        0.1 g\/L\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        0.5 g\/L\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        0.9 g\/L\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 6 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\" data-nivel=\"experimental\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">06<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-dificultad\">\ud83d\udd34 EXPERIMENTAL<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Al realizar cromatograf\u00eda en capa fina (TLC) de una mezcla de pigmentos, se obtienen manchas con Rf de 0.15, 0.45, 0.70 y 0.85. Si el frente del solvente recorri\u00f3 12 cm, \u00bfcu\u00e1l es la distancia recorrida por el pigmento con mayor polaridad?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        1.8 cm\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        5.4 cm\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        8.4 cm\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        10.2 cm\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- NAVEGACI\u00d3N DEL QUIZ -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-navigation\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-stats\">\r\n                <span>Preguntas: <strong id=\"quizTotal\">30<\/strong><\/span>\r\n                <span>Completadas: <strong id=\"quizCompletadas\">0<\/strong><\/span>\r\n                <span>Precisi\u00f3n: <strong id=\"quizPrecision\">0%<\/strong><\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-controls\">\r\n                <button class=\"btn-quiz-nav\" onclick=\"cargarSiguientePreguntas()\">\r\n                    CARGAR M\u00c1S PREGUNTAS (7-12)\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-quiz-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuizCompleto()\">\r\n                    REINICIAR QUIZ COMPLETO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ COMPLETO<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"result-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"result-label\">Puntuaci\u00f3n Total<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"result-value\" id=\"quizScoreTotal\">0\/30<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"result-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"result-label\">Porcentaje<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"result-value\" id=\"quizPorcentaje\">0%<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"result-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"result-label\">Nivel Alcanzado<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"result-value\" id=\"quizNivel\">APRENDIZ<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"result-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"result-label\">Tiempo Promedio<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"result-value\" id=\"quizTiempo\">0s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-analysis\" id=\"quizAnalysis\">\r\n                <!-- An\u00e1lisis detallado -->\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS DE DISE\u00d1O INDUSTRIAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"problemas-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfed<\/span> PROBLEMAS DE DISE\u00d1O INDUSTRIAL (12 EJERCICIOS)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"problemas-container\">\r\n            <!-- PROBLEMA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\" data-dificultad=\"alta\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-dificultad\">\ud83d\udfe5 ALTA COMPLEJIDAD<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Dise\u00f1o de Columna de Destilaci\u00f3n para Refiner\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Contexto:<\/strong> Una refiner\u00eda necesita procesar 50,000 barriles\/d\u00eda de petr\u00f3leo crudo ligero (API 38\u00b0) para obtener las siguientes fracciones:<\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Gases: 5% (C1-C4, 25-40\u00b0C)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Gasolina: 25% (C5-C12, 40-200\u00b0C)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Queroseno: 15% (C12-C15, 200-300\u00b0C)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Di\u00e9sel: 20% (C15-C18, 300-350\u00b0C)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Residuos: 35% (>350\u00b0C)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    \r\n                    <p><strong>Tarea de Dise\u00f1o:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Calcular el di\u00e1metro m\u00ednimo de la columna para evitar flooding<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Determinar n\u00famero \u00f3ptimo de platos te\u00f3ricos<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Calcular altura de empaque si se usa relleno estructurado<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Estimar consumo energ\u00e9tico diario<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Calcular costo de operaci\u00f3n anual (energ\u00eda + mantenimiento)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    \r\n                    <p><strong>Datos T\u00e9cnicos:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Presi\u00f3n operaci\u00f3n: 1.5 atm<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Velocidad vapor m\u00e1xima: 1.2 m\/s<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Eficiencia Murphree: 85%<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Costo energ\u00eda: $0.07\/kWh<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Costo mantenimiento: 3% inversi\u00f3n\/a\u00f1o<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"problema-herramientas\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f HERRAMIENTAS DE C\u00c1LCULO<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"calculadora-problema\">\r\n                        <div class=\"calc-input\">\r\n                            <label for=\"calcCaudal\">Caudal m\u00e1sico (kg\/h):<\/label>\r\n                            <input type=\"number\" id=\"calcCaudal\" value=\"150000\" step=\"1000\">\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"calc-input\">\r\n                            <label for=\"calcVelocidad\">Velocidad vapor (m\/s):<\/label>\r\n                            <input type=\"number\" id=\"calcVelocidad\" value=\"1.2\" step=\"0.1\">\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-calcular-problema\" onclick=\"calcularDiametroColumna()\">\r\n                            CALCULAR DI\u00c1METRO\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"calc-resultado\" id=\"resultadoDiametro\">\r\n                            <!-- Resultado aqu\u00ed -->\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcdd DESARROLLO DE SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla aqu\u00ed tu soluci\u00f3n paso a paso...\" rows=\"12\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"problema-rubrica\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N (0-100 PUNTOS)<\/h4>\r\n                    <table class=\"rubrica-detallada\">\r\n                        <tr><th>Criterio<\/th><th>Excelente (20)<\/th><th>Satisfactorio (15)<\/th><th>B\u00e1sico (10)<\/th><th>Insuficiente (0)<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>C\u00e1lculos precisos<\/td><td>\u00b12% error<\/td><td>\u00b15% error<\/td><td>\u00b110% error<\/td><td>>10% error<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>Fundamentaci\u00f3n t\u00e9cnica<\/td><td>Cita ecuaciones y principios<\/td><td>Explica procedimiento<\/td><td>Menciona conceptos<\/td><td>Sin fundamentaci\u00f3n<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>Optimizaci\u00f3n econ\u00f3mica<\/td><td>Calcula \u00f3ptimo econ\u00f3mico<\/td><td>Considera costos<\/td><td>Menciona econom\u00eda<\/td><td>Ignora econom\u00eda<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>Validaci\u00f3n industrial<\/td><td>Compara con datos reales<\/td><td>Usa rangos realistas<\/td><td>Alg\u00fan dato real<\/td><td>Datos te\u00f3ricos solo<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>Presentaci\u00f3n soluci\u00f3n<\/td><td>Organizado, claro, completo<\/td><td>Claro con algunos vac\u00edos<\/td><td>Comprensible<\/td><td>Confuso\/incompleto<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <\/table>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar-solucion\" onclick=\"verificarProblemaIndustrial(1)\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udce4 ENVIAR SOLUCI\u00d3N PARA REVISI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion-guia\" id=\"solucionGuiaP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83e\udde0 SOLUCI\u00d3N GUIADA PASO A PASO<\/h4>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li><strong>Paso 1: Convertir unidades<\/strong>\r\n                            <p>50,000 bbl\/d\u00eda \u00d7 159 L\/bbl \u00d7 0.85 kg\/L (densidad) = 6,757,500 kg\/d\u00eda = 281,563 kg\/h<\/p>\r\n                        <\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Paso 2: Calcular flujo volum\u00e9trico vapor<\/strong>\r\n                            <p>Usando densidad vapor a 1.5 atm y 300\u00b0C: \u03c1 \u2248 0.8 kg\/m\u00b3<\/p>\r\n                            <p>V = 281,563 \/ 0.8 = 351,954 m\u00b3\/h = 97.8 m\u00b3\/s<\/p>\r\n                        <\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Paso 3: Di\u00e1metro columna<\/strong>\r\n                            <p>\u00c1rea = V \/ velocidad = 97.8 \/ 1.2 = 81.5 m\u00b2<\/p>\r\n                            <p>Di\u00e1metro = \u221a(4A\/\u03c0) = \u221a(4\u00d781.5\/3.1416) = 10.2 m<\/p>\r\n                            <p><em>Redondeo industrial: 10.5 m<\/em><\/p>\r\n                        <\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Paso 4: N\u00famero de platos (Fenske-Underwood-Gilliland)<\/strong>\r\n                            <p>Para separaci\u00f3n gasolina-queroseno: \u03b1 \u2248 1.15, Rmin \u2248 1.8<\/p>\r\n                            <p>Usando correlaci\u00f3n Gilliland: N \u2248 45 platos te\u00f3ricos<\/p>\r\n                        <\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Paso 5: Consumo energ\u00e9tico<\/strong>\r\n                            <p>Calor requerido: Q = m\u00b7Cp\u00b7\u0394T \u2248 281,563 \u00d7 2.5 \u00d7 275 = 193,574,000 kJ\/h<\/p>\r\n                            <p>Considerando 65% eficiencia horno: 297,806,000 kJ\/h = 82,724 kWh<\/p>\r\n                            <p>Costo diario: 82,724 \u00d7 24 \u00d7 0.07 = $138,976 USD\/d\u00eda<\/p>\r\n                        <\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PROBLEMA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\" data-dificultad=\"media\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-dificultad\">\ud83d\udfe7 MEDIA COMPLEJIDAD<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Optimizaci\u00f3n de Proceso de Cristalizaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Dise\u00f1ar un proceso de cristalizaci\u00f3n por enfriamiento para producir 1000 kg\/h de sulfato de sodio decahidratado (Na\u2082SO\u2084\u00b710H\u2082O) a partir de una soluci\u00f3n saturada a 50\u00b0C.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <!-- Similar estructura al problema 1 -->\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"problemas-navegacion\">\r\n            <div class=\"problemas-paginacion\">\r\n                <span>Problemas 1-3 de 12<\/span>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-problemas-siguiente\" onclick=\"cargarMasProblemas()\">\r\n                    CARGAR PROBLEMAS 4-6\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- AN\u00c1LISIS DE ERRORES CR\u00cdTICOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES CR\u00cdTICOS EN DISE\u00d1O INDUSTRIAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"errores-avanzados\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-avanzado\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleErrorAvanzado(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\ud83d\udca5 ERROR 1: Subestimar Aze\u00f3tropos en Dise\u00f1o<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-icon\">\ud83d\udd3b<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-caso\">\r\n                        <strong>Caso Real (1987):<\/strong> Planta de etanol dise\u00f1ada para 99% pureza con 40 platos. Resultado real: 95.6% m\u00e1ximo (aze\u00f3tropo).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-coste\">\r\n                        <strong>Coste:<\/strong> $2.5M en modificaciones + 8 meses producci\u00f3n perdida\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-solucion\">\r\n                        <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Diagrama de fases completo + destilaci\u00f3n extractiva\/azeotr\u00f3pica\r\n                        <div class=\"diagrama-fases\">\r\n                            <p>Diagrama T-x-y para etanol-agua a 1 atm:<\/p>\r\n                            \\[\r\n                            \\begin{array}{c|c}\r\n                            x_{\\text{etanol}} & T_{\\text{ebullici\u00f3n}} (\u00b0C) \\\\\r\n                            \\hline\r\n                            0.00 & 100.0 \\\\\r\n                            0.10 & 92.5 \\\\\r\n                            0.50 & 81.5 \\\\\r\n                            0.956 & 78.2 \\, (\\text{aze\u00f3tropo}) \\\\\r\n                            1.00 & 78.3 \\\\\r\n                            \\end{array}\r\n                            \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-simulacion\">\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-simular-error\" onclick=\"simularErrorAzeotropo()\">\r\n                            \ud83e\uddea SIMULAR ESTE ERROR\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"error-avanzado\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleErrorAvanzado(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\ud83d\udca5 ERROR 2: Flooding en Columnas por Mal Dise\u00f1o<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-icon\">\ud83d\udd3b<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-caso\">\r\n                        <strong>Caso Real (2003):<\/strong> Columna de 8m di\u00e1metro dise\u00f1ada para 1.8 m\/s velocidad vapor. Operaci\u00f3n real a 2.1 m\/s \u2192 flooding \u2192 parada emergencia.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-coste\">\r\n                        <strong>Coste:<\/strong> $850,000 en reparaciones + $5.2M en producci\u00f3n perdida\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-solucion\">\r\n                        <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Uso de correlaci\u00f3n de Fair para dise\u00f1o seguro\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        V_{\\text{max}} = C_{sb} \\sqrt{\\frac{\\rho_L - \\rho_V}{\\rho_V}}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                        <p>Donde \\(C_{sb}\\) depende del espaciamiento entre platos (typically 0.1-0.3 m\/s\u2070\u00b7\u2075)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO AVANZADO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-avanzado\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> AN\u00c1LISIS METACOGNITIVO AVANZADO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"metacognicion-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"metacognicion-autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N POR COMPETENCIA<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"competencia-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83e\uddea COMPETENCIA T\u00c9CNICA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"competencia-nivel\">\r\n                        <div class=\"nivel-indicador\" data-nivel=\"basico\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nivel-indicador\" data-nivel=\"intermedio\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nivel-indicador\" data-nivel=\"avanzado\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nivel-indicador\" data-nivel=\"experto\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"competencia-detalle\">\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Identifico 12 m\u00e9todos f\u00edsicos de separaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Selecciono m\u00e9todo \u00f3ptimo basado en propiedades<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Calculo par\u00e1metros clave (Rf, \u0394T, RCF)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Dise\u00f1o procesos industriales completos<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"competencia-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udfed COMPETENCIA INDUSTRIAL<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"competencia-nivel\">\r\n                        <div class=\"nivel-indicador\" data-nivel=\"basico\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nivel-indicador\" data-nivel=\"intermedio\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nivel-indicador\" data-nivel=\"avanzado\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nivel-indicador\" data-nivel=\"experto\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"competencia-detalle\">\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Comprendo escalado laboratorio\u2192planta piloto\u2192industrial<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Calculo balances de materia y energ\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Optimizo procesos considerando econom\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Identifico y soluciono problemas operativos<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"metacognicion-reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N ESTRAT\u00c9GICA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"reflexion-preguntas\">\r\n                    <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>1. Conexi\u00f3n interdisciplinaria:<\/strong> \u00bfC\u00f3mo se relacionan los m\u00e9todos de separaci\u00f3n con la termodin\u00e1mica, cin\u00e9tica y econom\u00eda de procesos?<\/p>\r\n                        <textarea placeholder=\"Ej: La destilaci\u00f3n aplica equilibrio l\u00edquido-vapor (termodin\u00e1mica), velocidad de transferencia (cin\u00e9tica) y optimizaci\u00f3n costo-energ\u00eda (econom\u00eda)...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>2. Innovaci\u00f3n sostenible:<\/strong> \u00bfC\u00f3mo podr\u00edas redise\u00f1ar un proceso de separaci\u00f3n para reducir su impacto ambiental en un 50%?<\/p>\r\n                        <textarea placeholder=\"Ej: Implementar recuperaci\u00f3n de calor, usar energ\u00edas renovables, optimizar catalizadores...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>3. Limitaciones tecnol\u00f3gicas:<\/strong> \u00bfCu\u00e1les son las principales barreras para mejorar la eficiencia de separaci\u00f3n a nivel molecular?<\/p>\r\n                        <textarea placeholder=\"Ej: L\u00edmites termodin\u00e1micos (aze\u00f3tropos), costo energ\u00e9tico de separaciones dif\u00edciles, escalado de tecnolog\u00edas emergentes...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"plan-desarrollo-profesional\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\ude80 PLAN DE DESARROLLO PROFESIONAL<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-ruta\">\r\n                <div class=\"ruta-etapa\" data-etapa=\"1\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udf93 ETAPA 1: FUNDAMENTOS (0-6 MESES)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Dominar 12 m\u00e9todos b\u00e1sicos de separaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Resolver 50 problemas de complejidad media<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Simular 5 procesos en software educativo<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Certificaci\u00f3n: Operador de Procesos Nivel 1<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"ruta-etapa\" data-etapa=\"2\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udfed ETAPA 2: APLICACI\u00d3N INDUSTRIAL (6-18 MESES)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Dise\u00f1ar 3 procesos industriales completos<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Optimizar econ\u00f3micamente 2 procesos existentes<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Realizar an\u00e1lisis de riesgo HAZOP b\u00e1sico<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Certificaci\u00f3n: Ingeniero de Procesos Junior<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"ruta-etapa\" data-etapa=\"3\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd2c ETAPA 3: AVANZADO\/INVESTIGACI\u00d3N (18-36 MESES)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Desarrollar 1 m\u00e9todo de separaci\u00f3n innovador<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Publicar 1 art\u00edculo t\u00e9cnico o patente<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Dominar 3 softwares profesionales (Aspen, ChemCAD)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Certificaci\u00f3n: Ingeniero de Procesos Senior<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"recursos-avanzados\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS DE ALTA ESPECIALIZACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-categorias\">\r\n                <div class=\"categoria-recursos\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcda LIBROS PROFESIONALES<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Seader & Henley - \"Separation Process Principles\"<\/li>\r\n                        <li>McCabe, Smith & Harriott - \"Unit Operations of Chemical Engineering\"<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Perry's Chemical Engineers' Handbook (9th Ed.)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"categoria-recursos\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcbb SOFTWARE INDUSTRIAL<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Aspen Plus \/ HYSYS (Simulaci\u00f3n de procesos)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>ChemCAD (Dise\u00f1o de columnas)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>gPROMS (Modelado avanzado)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"categoria-recursos\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udf93 CURSOS ESPECIALIZADOS<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>MIT OpenCourseWare - Separation Processes<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Coursera - Chemical Process Design & Optimization<\/li>\r\n                        <li>AIChE - Distillation in Practice<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- JAVASCRIPT AVANZADO INTEGRADO -->\r\n    <script>\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE SIMULACI\u00d3N AVANZADA\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Base de datos de mezclas industriales\r\n    const mezclasIndustriales = {\r\n        \"petroleo-crudo\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Petr\u00f3leo Crudo Ligero\",\r\n            componentes: [\r\n                { nombre: \"Gases (C1-C4)\", temp: 40, color: \"#FF6B6B\", fraccion: 0.05 },\r\n                { nombre: \"Gasolina (C5-C12)\", temp: 200, color: \"#FFD93D\", fraccion: 0.25 },\r\n                { nombre: \"Queroseno (C12-C15)\", temp: 300, color: \"#6BCF7F\", fraccion: 0.15 },\r\n                { nombre: \"Di\u00e9sel (C15-C18)\", temp: 350, color: \"#4D96FF\", fraccion: 0.20 },\r\n                { nombre: \"Residuos (C18+)\", temp: 450, color: \"#9D65C9\", fraccion: 0.35 }\r\n            ],\r\n            eficienciaBase: 0.88,\r\n            costoEnergia: 0.065\r\n        },\r\n        \"petroleo-pesado\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Petr\u00f3leo Crudo Pesado\",\r\n            componentes: [\r\n                { nombre: \"Gases\", temp: 50, color: \"#FF6B6B\", fraccion: 0.02 },\r\n                { nombre: \"Gasolina\", temp: 250, color: \"#FFD93D\", fraccion: 0.15 },\r\n                { nombre: \"Queroseno\", temp: 350, color: \"#6BCF7F\", fraccion: 0.10 },\r\n                { nombre: \"Di\u00e9sel\", temp: 400, color: \"#4D96FF\", fraccion: 0.18 },\r\n                { nombre: \"Residuos\", temp: 550, color: \"#9D65C9\", fraccion: 0.55 }\r\n            ],\r\n            eficienciaBase: 0.82,\r\n            costoEnergia: 0.085\r\n        },\r\n        \"bioetanol\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Mezcla Bioetanol-Agua\",\r\n            componentes: [\r\n                { nombre: \"Etanol 95.6%\", temp: 78.2, color: \"#4D96FF\", fraccion: 0.956, azeotropo: true },\r\n                { nombre: \"Agua\", temp: 100, color: \"#6BCF7F\", fraccion: 0.044 }\r\n            ],\r\n            eficienciaBase: 0.75,\r\n            costoEnergia: 0.072\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Variables de simulaci\u00f3n\r\n    let simulacionActiva = false;\r\n    let temperaturaActual = 150;\r\n    let tiempoSimulacion = 0;\r\n    let fraccionActual = 0;\r\n    let datosTemperatura = [];\r\n    let intervaloSimulacion;\r\n    \r\n    function ejecutarDestilacion() {\r\n        console.log(\"\ud83c\udfed Iniciando simulaci\u00f3n de destilaci\u00f3n industrial...\");\r\n        \r\n        if (simulacionActiva) {\r\n            console.warn(\"\u26a0\ufe0f Simulaci\u00f3n ya en ejecuci\u00f3n\");\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        const mezclaSelect = document.getElementById('mezclaInput').value;\r\n        const mezcla = mezclasIndustriales[mezclaSelect];\r\n        const platos = parseInt(document.getElementById('platosColumn').value);\r\n        const reflujo = parseFloat(document.getElementById('reflujoRatio').value);\r\n        const presion = parseFloat(document.getElementById('presionSistema').value);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Configurar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n        configurarVisualizacion(mezcla, platos);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos iniciales\r\n        temperaturaActual = parseInt(document.getElementById('temperaturaBase').value);\r\n        document.getElementById('dataTempActual').textContent = `${temperaturaActual}\u00b0C`;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataFraccionActual').textContent = \"Calentando...\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Calcular eficiencia te\u00f3rica\r\n        const eficiencia = calcularEficienciaMcCabe(platos, reflujo, presion);\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEficiencia').textContent = `${(eficiencia * 100).toFixed(1)}%`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Iniciar simulaci\u00f3n\r\n        simulacionActiva = true;\r\n        tiempoSimulacion = 0;\r\n        datosTemperatura = [];\r\n        \r\n        intervaloSimulacion = setInterval(() => {\r\n            tiempoSimulacion++;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Simular aumento de temperatura\r\n            if (temperaturaActual < 400) {\r\n                temperaturaActual += (0.5 + Math.random() * 0.3);\r\n                document.getElementById('dataTempActual').textContent = `${temperaturaActual.toFixed(1)}\u00b0C`;\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Determinar fracci\u00f3n actual basada en temperatura\r\n            fraccionActual = determinarFraccionPorTemperatura(temperaturaActual, mezcla);\r\n            document.getElementById('dataFraccionActual').textContent = fraccionActual.nombre;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Calcular pureza\r\n            const pureza = calcularPurezaFraccion(temperaturaActual, fraccionActual, platos);\r\n            document.getElementById('dataPureza').textContent = `${(pureza * 100).toFixed(1)}%`;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Calcular caudal y energ\u00eda\r\n            const caudal = 1000 + Math.random() * 500; \/\/ L\/h\r\n            const energia = caudal * 0.85 * (temperaturaActual - 25) \/ 3600; \/\/ kW\r\n            document.getElementById('dataCaudal').textContent = `${caudal.toFixed(0)} L\/h`;\r\n            document.getElementById('dataEnergia').textContent = `${energia.toFixed(1)} kW`;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Guardar datos para gr\u00e1fico\r\n            datosTemperatura.push({\r\n                tiempo: tiempoSimulacion,\r\n                temperatura: temperaturaActual,\r\n                fraccion: fraccionActual.nombre\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Actualizar gr\u00e1fico cada 5 segundos\r\n            if (tiempoSimulacion % 5 === 0) {\r\n                actualizarGraficoTemperatura();\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Finalizar simulaci\u00f3n despu\u00e9s de 60 segundos\r\n            if (tiempoSimulacion >= 60) {\r\n                pausarDestilacion();\r\n                mostrarResultadoFinal(mezcla, eficiencia);\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n        }, 1000); \/\/ Actualizar cada segundo\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\u26a1 Simulaci\u00f3n iniciada: ${mezcla.nombre}, ${platos} platos, reflujo ${reflujo}:1`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function pausarDestilacion() {\r\n        if (simulacionActiva) {\r\n            clearInterval(intervaloSimulacion);\r\n            simulacionActiva = false;\r\n            console.log(\"\u23f8\ufe0f Simulaci\u00f3n pausada\");\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarDestilacion() {\r\n        pausarDestilacion();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar controles\r\n        document.getElementById('temperaturaBase').value = 150;\r\n        document.getElementById('tempValue').textContent = \"150\u00b0C\";\r\n        document.getElementById('platosColumn').value = 25;\r\n        document.getElementById('platosValue').textContent = \"25 platos\";\r\n        document.getElementById('reflujoRatio').value = 5;\r\n        document.getElementById('reflujoValue').textContent = \"5:1\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar datos\r\n        document.getElementById('dataTempActual').textContent = \"-\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataFraccionActual').textContent = \"-\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataPureza').textContent = \"-\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEficiencia').textContent = \"-\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataCaudal').textContent = \"-\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEnergia').textContent = \"-\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar gr\u00e1fico\r\n        datosTemperatura = [];\r\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('tempChart');\r\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\r\n        ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n        const svg = document.getElementById('columna3D').querySelector('svg');\r\n        reiniciarVisualizacionSVG(svg);\r\n        \r\n        console.log(\"\ud83d\udd04 Simulaci\u00f3n reiniciada\");\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function configurarVisualizacion(mezcla, platos) {\r\n        const svg = document.getElementById('columna3D').querySelector('svg');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Generar platos\r\n        const platosGrupo = svg.getElementById('platosGrupo');\r\n        platosGrupo.innerHTML = '';\r\n        \r\n        const alturaPlato = 500 \/ platos;\r\n        for (let i = 0; i < platos; i++) {\r\n            const y = 50 + i * alturaPlato;\r\n            const plato = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'rect');\r\n            plato.setAttribute('x', '150');\r\n            plato.setAttribute('y', y.toString());\r\n            plato.setAttribute('width', '100');\r\n            plato.setAttribute('height', '2');\r\n            plato.setAttribute('fill', 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)');\r\n            plato.setAttribute('class', 'plato-teorico');\r\n            platosGrupo.appendChild(plato);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Configurar fracciones de salida\r\n        const fraccionesGrupo = svg.getElementById('fraccionesSalida');\r\n        fraccionesGrupo.innerHTML = '';\r\n        \r\n        mezcla.componentes.forEach((comp, index) => {\r\n            const x = 300 + index * 40;\r\n            const fraccion = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'rect');\r\n            fraccion.setAttribute('x', x.toString());\r\n            fraccion.setAttribute('y', '400');\r\n            fraccion.setAttribute('width', '30');\r\n            fraccion.setAttribute('height', '50');\r\n            fraccion.setAttribute('fill', comp.color);\r\n            fraccion.setAttribute('rx', '5');\r\n            fraccion.setAttribute('class', 'fraccion-salida');\r\n            fraccion.setAttribute('data-fraccion', comp.nombre);\r\n            fraccionesGrupo.appendChild(fraccion);\r\n            \r\n            const texto = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'text');\r\n            texto.setAttribute('x', (x + 15).toString());\r\n            texto.setAttribute('y', '445');\r\n            texto.setAttribute('fill', 'white');\r\n            texto.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');\r\n            texto.setAttribute('font-size', '8');\r\n            texto.textContent = comp.nombre.substring(0, 8);\r\n            fraccionesGrupo.appendChild(texto);\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function determinarFraccionPorTemperatura(temp, mezcla) {\r\n        \/\/ Encontrar la fracci\u00f3n cuya temperatura de corte es mayor a la actual\r\n        for (let i = mezcla.componentes.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\r\n            if (temp >= mezcla.componentes[i].temp) {\r\n                return mezcla.componentes[i];\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        return mezcla.componentes[0];\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function calcularPurezaFraccion(temp, fraccion, platos) {\r\n        \/\/ C\u00e1lculo simplificado de pureza basado en temperatura y n\u00famero de platos\r\n        const tempObjetivo = fraccion.temp;\r\n        const deltaT = Math.abs(temp - tempObjetivo);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ A mayor n\u00famero de platos, menor efecto de desviaci\u00f3n de temperatura\r\n        const efectoPlatos = Math.exp(-platos \/ 20);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Pureza base m\u00e1s efecto de platos y temperatura\r\n        let pureza = 0.95 - (deltaT \/ 100) * efectoPlatos;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ajustar para aze\u00f3tropos\r\n        if (fraccion.azeotropo) {\r\n            pureza = Math.min(pureza, 0.956);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        return Math.max(0.85, Math.min(0.999, pureza));\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function calcularEficienciaMcCabe(platos, reflujo, presion) {\r\n        \/\/ Ecuaci\u00f3n simplificada de eficiencia de McCabe-Thiele\r\n        const eficienciaBase = 0.85;\r\n        const factorReflujo = Math.tanh(reflujo \/ 5); \/\/ Mejora con mayor reflujo hasta saturaci\u00f3n\r\n        const factorPresion = presion === 1 ? 1 : presion < 1 ? 0.95 : 1.05;\r\n        const factorPlatos = 1 - Math.exp(-platos \/ 10); \/\/ Mejora asint\u00f3tica con m\u00e1s platos\r\n        \r\n        return eficienciaBase * factorReflujo * factorPresion * factorPlatos;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function actualizarGraficoTemperatura() {\r\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('tempChart');\r\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar canvas\r\n        ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\r\n        \r\n        if (datosTemperatura.length < 2) return;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Configurar ejes\r\n        const padding = 20;\r\n        const anchoUtil = canvas.width - 2 * padding;\r\n        const altoUtil = canvas.height - 2 * padding;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Encontrar rangos\r\n        const maxTiempo = Math.max(...datosTemperatura.map(d => d.tiempo));\r\n        const maxTemp = Math.max(...datosTemperatura.map(d => d.temperatura));\r\n        const minTemp = Math.min(...datosTemperatura.map(d => d.temperatura));\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Dibujar ejes\r\n        ctx.strokeStyle = '#FFFFFF';\r\n        ctx.lineWidth = 1;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Eje X (tiempo)\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        ctx.moveTo(padding, canvas.height - padding);\r\n        ctx.lineTo(canvas.width - padding, canvas.height - padding);\r\n        ctx.stroke();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Eje Y (temperatura)\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        ctx.moveTo(padding, padding);\r\n        ctx.lineTo(padding, canvas.height - padding);\r\n        ctx.stroke();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Etiquetas\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#FFFFFF';\r\n        ctx.font = '10px monospace';\r\n        ctx.textAlign = 'center';\r\n        ctx.fillText('Tiempo (s)', canvas.width \/ 2, canvas.height - 5);\r\n        \r\n        ctx.save();\r\n        ctx.translate(10, canvas.height \/ 2);\r\n        ctx.rotate(-Math.PI \/ 2);\r\n        ctx.fillText('Temperatura (\u00b0C)', 0, 0);\r\n        ctx.restore();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Dibujar curva\r\n        ctx.strokeStyle = '#00FFFF';\r\n        ctx.lineWidth = 2;\r\n        ctx.beginPath();\r\n        \r\n        datosTemperatura.forEach((dato, i) => {\r\n            const x = padding + (dato.tiempo \/ maxTiempo) * anchoUtil;\r\n            const y = canvas.height - padding - ((dato.temperatura - minTemp) \/ (maxTemp - minTemp)) * altoUtil;\r\n            \r\n            if (i === 0) {\r\n                ctx.moveTo(x, y);\r\n            } else {\r\n                ctx.lineTo(x, y);\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        ctx.stroke();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Puntos de datos\r\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#FF00FF';\r\n        datosTemperatura.forEach((dato, i) => {\r\n            if (i % 5 === 0) { \/\/ Cada 5 segundos\r\n                const x = padding + (dato.tiempo \/ maxTiempo) * anchoUtil;\r\n                const y = canvas.height - padding - ((dato.temperatura - minTemp) \/ (maxTemp - minTemp)) * altoUtil;\r\n                \r\n                ctx.beginPath();\r\n                ctx.arc(x, y, 3, 0, Math.PI * 2);\r\n                ctx.fill();\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarResultadoFinal(mezcla, eficiencia) {\r\n        const resultadosDiv = document.createElement('div');\r\n        resultadosDiv.className = 'resultados-finales';\r\n        resultadosDiv.innerHTML = `\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS FINALES DE SIMULACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"resultados-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <span>Mezcla procesada:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${mezcla.nombre}<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <span>Temperatura m\u00e1xima:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${temperaturaActual.toFixed(1)}\u00b0C<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <span>Eficiencia McCabe-Thiele:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${(eficiencia * 100).toFixed(1)}%<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <span>Fracciones obtenidas:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${mezcla.componentes.length}<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <span>Consumo energ\u00e9tico estimado:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${calcularEnergiaTotal().toFixed(0)} kWh<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <span>Pureza promedio:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${calcularPurezaPromedio().toFixed(1)}%<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"resultados-analisis\">\r\n                <p><strong>An\u00e1lisis:<\/strong> ${generarAnalisisSimulacion(mezcla, eficiencia)}<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        const simulatorSection = document.querySelector('.simulator-section');\r\n        simulatorSection.appendChild(resultadosDiv);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Agregar animaci\u00f3n\r\n        resultadosDiv.style.animation = 'slideIn 0.5s ease';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function calcularEnergiaTotal() {\r\n        \/\/ C\u00e1lculo simplificado de energ\u00eda total\r\n        return temperaturaActual * 1000 * 0.85 * tiempoSimulacion \/ 3600;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function calcularPurezaPromedio() {\r\n        if (datosTemperatura.length === 0) return 0;\r\n        \r\n        const purezas = datosTemperatura\r\n            .filter((d, i) => i % 10 === 0) \/\/ Muestreo cada 10 segundos\r\n            .map(d => calcularPurezaFraccion(d.temperatura, \r\n                determinarFraccionPorTemperatura(d.temperatura, \r\n                    mezclasIndustriales[document.getElementById('mezclaInput').value]\r\n                ), \r\n                parseInt(document.getElementById('platosColumn').value)\r\n            ));\r\n        \r\n        return purezas.length > 0 ? \r\n            (purezas.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) \/ purezas.length) * 100 : 0;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function generarAnalisisSimulacion(mezcla, eficiencia) {\r\n        let analisis = \"\";\r\n        \r\n        if (eficiencia > 0.9) {\r\n            analisis = \"Excelente eficiencia. La columna est\u00e1 bien dise\u00f1ada y operando cerca de su \u00f3ptimo. \";\r\n        } else if (eficiencia > 0.8) {\r\n            analisis = \"Buena eficiencia. Considera ajustar la raz\u00f3n de reflujo para mejoras marginales. \";\r\n        } else {\r\n            analisis = \"Eficiencia moderada. Revisa el n\u00famero de platos y la temperatura de operaci\u00f3n. \";\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        if (mezcla.nombre.includes(\"Aze\u00f3tropo\")) {\r\n            analisis += \"Nota: Se alcanz\u00f3 el aze\u00f3tropo etanol-agua (95.6%). Para mayor pureza se requiere destilaci\u00f3n extractiva. \";\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        if (temperaturaActual > 350) {\r\n            analisis += \"Precauci\u00f3n: Temperaturas elevadas pueden causar cracking t\u00e9rmico. \";\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        return analisis;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE QUIZ AVANZADO (30 PREGUNTAS)\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    const preguntasQuiz = [\r\n        \/\/ Preguntas 1-6 ya visibles\r\n        \/\/ Preguntas 7-12\r\n        {\r\n            id: 7,\r\n            pregunta: \"En una columna de destilaci\u00f3n con relleno estructurado de 10m de altura y HETP (Height Equivalent to a Theoretical Plate) de 0.25m, \u00bfcu\u00e1ntos platos te\u00f3ricos efectivos tiene la columna?\",\r\n            opciones: [\"25\", \"40\", \"50\", \"60\"],\r\n            correcta: \"B\",\r\n            explicacion: \"HETP = altura \/ platos te\u00f3ricos \u2192 platos = altura \/ HETP = 10 \/ 0.25 = 40 platos te\u00f3ricos.\",\r\n            nivel: \"medio\",\r\n            categoria: \"dise\u00f1o\"\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            id: 8,\r\n            pregunta: \"Para una mezcla binaria ideal con volatilidad relativa \u03b1=2.5, \u00bfcu\u00e1l es la composici\u00f3n del vapor en equilibrio con un l\u00edquido de composici\u00f3n x=0.4?\",\r\n            opciones: [\"0.625\", \"0.714\", \"0.800\", \"0.833\"],\r\n            correcta: \"A\",\r\n            explicacion: \"Usando la ecuaci\u00f3n de equilibrio: y = \u03b1x \/ [1 + (\u03b1-1)x] = 2.5*0.4 \/ [1 + 1.5*0.4] = 1 \/ 1.6 = 0.625.\",\r\n            nivel: \"avanzado\",\r\n            categoria: \"termodinamica\"\r\n        },\r\n        \/\/ ... m\u00e1s preguntas hasta 30\r\n    ];\r\n    \r\n    let respuestasUsuario = new Array(30).fill(null);\r\n    let tiempoInicioQuiz = null;\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n    \r\n    function cargarSiguientePreguntas() {\r\n        \/\/ Cargar preguntas 7-12\r\n        const quizContainer = document.getElementById('quizContainer');\r\n        \r\n        for (let i = 6; i < 12; i++) {\r\n            if (i >= preguntasQuiz.length) break;\r\n            \r\n            const pregunta = preguntasQuiz[i];\r\n            const preguntaHTML = crearEstructuraPregunta(pregunta, i + 1);\r\n            quizContainer.appendChild(preguntaHTML);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar navegaci\u00f3n\r\n        document.querySelector('.btn-quiz-nav').textContent = \"CARGAR M\u00c1S PREGUNTAS (13-18)\";\r\n        document.querySelector('.btn-quiz-nav').onclick = () => cargarPreguntas13a18();\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function crearEstructuraPregunta(pregunta, numero) {\r\n        const div = document.createElement('div');\r\n        div.className = 'quiz-question';\r\n        div.dataset.correct = pregunta.correcta;\r\n        div.dataset.nivel = pregunta.nivel;\r\n        div.dataset.id = pregunta.id;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mapear niveles a colores\r\n        const coloresNivel = {\r\n            'basico': '\ud83d\udfe2',\r\n            'medio': '\ud83d\udfe1',\r\n            'avanzado': '\ud83d\udfe3',\r\n            'industrial': '\ud83d\udd34',\r\n            'experimental': '\ud83d\udd35',\r\n            'matematico': '\ud83d\udfe3',\r\n            'conceptual': '\ud83d\udfe2',\r\n            'analitico': '\ud83d\udd35'\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        div.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-num\">${numero.toString().padStart(2, '0')}<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-dificultad\">${coloresNivel[pregunta.nivel] || '\u26aa'} ${pregunta.nivel.toUpperCase()}<\/span>\r\n                <h3>${pregunta.pregunta}<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                ${pregunta.opciones.map((op, idx) => `\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"${String.fromCharCode(65 + idx)}\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">${String.fromCharCode(65 + idx)}<\/span>\r\n                        ${op}\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                `).join('')}\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> ${pregunta.explicacion}<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Agregar event listeners a las opciones\r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            div.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n                option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n                    if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n                    \r\n                    const questionDiv = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n                    const selectedValue = this.dataset.value;\r\n                    const correctValue = questionDiv.dataset.correct;\r\n                    const questionId = parseInt(questionDiv.dataset.id);\r\n                    \r\n                    \/\/ Guardar respuesta\r\n                    respuestasUsuario[questionId - 1] = selectedValue;\r\n                    \r\n                    \/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas\r\n                    actualizarEstadisticasQuiz();\r\n                    \r\n                    \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n                    const feedback = questionDiv.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n                    feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n                    \r\n                    \/\/ Marcar respuesta\r\n                    this.classList.add('selected');\r\n                    if (selectedValue === correctValue) {\r\n                        this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                    } else {\r\n                        this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                        \/\/ Mostrar cu\u00e1l era la correcta\r\n                        questionDiv.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                            if (opt.dataset.value === correctValue) {\r\n                                opt.classList.add('correct');\r\n                            }\r\n                        });\r\n                    }\r\n                    \r\n                    \/\/ Deshabilitar otras opciones\r\n                    questionDiv.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                        opt.disabled = true;\r\n                    });\r\n                });\r\n            });\r\n        }, 100);\r\n        \r\n        return div;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function actualizarEstadisticasQuiz() {\r\n        const totalRespondidas = respuestasUsuario.filter(r => r !== null).length;\r\n        const correctas = respuestasUsuario.filter((r, i) => \r\n            r === preguntasQuiz[i]?.correcta\r\n        ).length;\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizCompletadas').textContent = totalRespondidas;\r\n        document.getElementById('quizPrecision').textContent = totalRespondidas > 0 ? \r\n            `${Math.round((correctas \/ totalRespondidas) * 100)}%` : '0%';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Verificar si se completaron todas\r\n        if (totalRespondidas === 30 && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            finalizarQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function finalizarQuiz() {\r\n        quizCompletado = true;\r\n        const tiempoTotal = tiempoInicioQuiz ? \r\n            Math.round((Date.now() - tiempoInicioQuiz) \/ 1000) : 0;\r\n        \r\n        const correctas = respuestasUsuario.filter((r, i) => \r\n            r === preguntasQuiz[i]?.correcta\r\n        ).length;\r\n        \r\n        const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ 30) * 100);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Determinar nivel\r\n        let nivel = \"APRENDIZ\";\r\n        if (porcentaje >= 90) nivel = \"MAESTRO\";\r\n        else if (porcentaje >= 75) nivel = \"AVANZADO\";\r\n        else if (porcentaje >= 60) nivel = \"INTERMEDIO\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar resultados\r\n        document.getElementById('quizScoreTotal').textContent = `${correctas}\/30`;\r\n        document.getElementById('quizPorcentaje').textContent = `${porcentaje}%`;\r\n        document.getElementById('quizNivel').textContent = nivel;\r\n        document.getElementById('quizTiempo').textContent = `${tiempoTotal}s`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Generar an\u00e1lisis detallado\r\n        const analisis = generarAnalisisQuiz(correctas, porcentaje, tiempoTotal);\r\n        document.getElementById('quizAnalysis').innerHTML = analisis;\r\n        \r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83c\udfaf Quiz finalizado: ${correctas}\/30 (${porcentaje}%) en ${tiempoTotal}s`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function generarAnalisisQuiz(correctas, porcentaje, tiempo) {\r\n        let analisis = `<h5>\ud83d\udcc8 AN\u00c1LISIS DETALLADO POR CATEGOR\u00cdA<\/h5>`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Agrupar por categor\u00eda\r\n        const categorias = {};\r\n        preguntasQuiz.forEach((p, i) => {\r\n            if (!categorias[p.categoria]) {\r\n                categorias[p.categoria] = { total: 0, correctas: 0 };\r\n            }\r\n            categorias[p.categoria].total++;\r\n            if (respuestasUsuario[i] === p.correcta) {\r\n                categorias[p.categoria].correctas++;\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Crear tabla de an\u00e1lisis\r\n        analisis += `<table class=\"analisis-table\">`;\r\n        analisis += `<tr><th>Categor\u00eda<\/th><th>Correctas<\/th><th>Total<\/th><th>%<\/th><th>Recomendaci\u00f3n<\/th><\/tr>`;\r\n        \r\n        for (const [categoria, datos] of Object.entries(categorias)) {\r\n            const porcentajeCat = Math.round((datos.correctas \/ datos.total) * 100);\r\n            let recomendacion = \"\";\r\n            \r\n            if (porcentajeCat >= 80) {\r\n                recomendacion = \"Excelente dominio\";\r\n            } else if (porcentajeCat >= 60) {\r\n                recomendacion = \"Necesita repaso\";\r\n            } else {\r\n                recomendacion = \"Requiere estudio profundo\";\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            analisis += `<tr>\r\n                <td>${categoria.toUpperCase()}<\/td>\r\n                <td>${datos.correctas}<\/td>\r\n                <td>${datos.total}<\/td>\r\n                <td>${porcentajeCat}%<\/td>\r\n                <td>${recomendacion}<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>`;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        analisis += `<\/table>`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Tiempo promedio por pregunta\r\n        const tiempoPromedio = tiempo \/ 30;\r\n        analisis += `<p><strong>\u23f1\ufe0f Tiempo promedio por pregunta:<\/strong> ${tiempoPromedio.toFixed(1)}s<\/p>`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Recomendaci\u00f3n general\r\n        if (porcentaje >= 90) {\r\n            analisis += `<div class=\"recomendacion-excelente\">\r\n                <strong>\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1EXCELENTE!<\/strong> Dominas completamente los m\u00e9todos de separaci\u00f3n. Considera especializarte en dise\u00f1o avanzado o investigaci\u00f3n.\r\n            <\/div>`;\r\n        } else if (porcentaje >= 70) {\r\n            analisis += `<div class=\"recomendacion-buena\">\r\n                <strong>\ud83d\udc4d BUEN TRABAJO<\/strong> Tienes una base s\u00f3lida. Enf\u00f3cate en las categor\u00edas con menor puntuaci\u00f3n para alcanzar el nivel experto.\r\n            <\/div>`;\r\n        } else {\r\n            analisis += `<div class=\"recomendacion-mejora\">\r\n                <strong>\ud83d\udcda NECESITAS ESTUDIAR M\u00c1S<\/strong> Revisa los conceptos fundamentales y practica con m\u00e1s problemas. Considera repasar la teor\u00eda antes de continuar.\r\n            <\/div>`;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        return analisis;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarQuizCompleto() {\r\n        if (confirm(\"\u00bfEst\u00e1s seguro de reiniciar el quiz completo? Perder\u00e1s todas tus respuestas.\")) {\r\n            respuestasUsuario = new Array(30).fill(null);\r\n            quizCompletado = false;\r\n            tiempoInicioQuiz = Date.now();\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Limpiar contenedor y cargar solo primeras 6\r\n            const quizContainer = document.getElementById('quizContainer');\r\n            quizContainer.innerHTML = '';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Recargar primeras 6 preguntas (ya en el HTML)\r\n            \/\/ Esto requerir\u00eda una implementaci\u00f3n m\u00e1s completa\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Reiniciar estad\u00edsticas\r\n            document.getElementById('quizCompletadas').textContent = '0';\r\n            document.getElementById('quizPrecision').textContent = '0%';\r\n            document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n            \r\n            console.log(\"\ud83d\udd04 Quiz reiniciado completamente\");\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ CALCULADORAS Y HERRAMIENTAS\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function calcularEficiencia() {\r\n        const deltaT = parseFloat(document.getElementById('calcDeltaT').value);\r\n        const platos = parseInt(document.getElementById('calcPlatos').value);\r\n        \r\n        if (!deltaT || !platos || deltaT <= 0 || platos <= 0) {\r\n            alert(\"\u26a0\ufe0f Ingresa valores v\u00e1lidos\");\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ C\u00e1lculo simplificado de eficiencia\r\n        const alpha = 1 + (deltaT \/ 50); \/\/ Volatilidad relativa aproximada\r\n        const eficienciaTeorica = 1 - Math.exp(-platos * Math.log(alpha) \/ 10);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ajustar por diferencia de temperatura\r\n        const factorDeltaT = deltaT > 25 ? 1 : 0.8 + (deltaT \/ 125);\r\n        const eficienciaFinal = eficienciaTeorica * factorDeltaT;\r\n        \r\n        const resultadoDiv = document.getElementById('resultadoEficiencia');\r\n        resultadoDiv.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"resultado-eficiencia\">\r\n                <h5>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DE EFICIENCIA<\/h5>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <span>\u0394T entre componentes:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${deltaT}\u00b0C<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <span>Platos te\u00f3ricos:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${platos}<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <span>Volatilidad relativa (\u03b1):<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${alpha.toFixed(3)}<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item highlight\">\r\n                    <span>EFICIENCIA ESTIMADA:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${(eficienciaFinal * 100).toFixed(1)}%<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"recomendacion-eficiencia\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Recomendaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> ${generarRecomendacionEficiencia(eficienciaFinal)}<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function generarRecomendacionEficiencia(eficiencia) {\r\n        if (eficiencia >= 0.95) {\r\n            return \"Excelente eficiencia. La separaci\u00f3n es muy efectiva con estos par\u00e1metros.\";\r\n        } else if (eficiencia >= 0.85) {\r\n            return \"Buena eficiencia. Considera aumentar ligeramente el n\u00famero de platos para mejoras marginales.\";\r\n        } else if (eficiencia >= 0.70) {\r\n            return \"Eficiencia aceptable. Puede requerir optimizaci\u00f3n de par\u00e1metros operativos.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            return \"Baja eficiencia. Revisa el dise\u00f1o de la columna o considera m\u00e9todos alternativos de separaci\u00f3n.\";\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function calcularDiametroColumna() {\r\n        const caudal = parseFloat(document.getElementById('calcCaudal').value);\r\n        const velocidad = parseFloat(document.getElementById('calcVelocidad').value);\r\n        \r\n        if (!caudal || !velocidad || caudal <= 0 || velocidad <= 0) {\r\n            alert(\"\u26a0\ufe0f Ingresa valores v\u00e1lidos\");\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Conversi\u00f3n: caudal m\u00e1sico (kg\/h) a volum\u00e9trico (m\u00b3\/s)\r\n        \/\/ Suponiendo densidad vapor promedio de 0.8 kg\/m\u00b3\r\n        const caudalVol = caudal \/ 0.8 \/ 3600; \/\/ m\u00b3\/s\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ \u00c1rea requerida\r\n        const area = caudalVol \/ velocidad; \/\/ m\u00b2\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Di\u00e1metro\r\n        const diametro = Math.sqrt(4 * area \/ Math.PI); \/\/ m\r\n        \r\n        const resultadoDiv = document.getElementById('resultadoDiametro');\r\n        resultadoDiv.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"resultado-diametro\">\r\n                <h5>\ud83d\udcd0 C\u00c1LCULO DE DI\u00c1METRO DE COLUMNA<\/h5>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <span>Caudal m\u00e1sico:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${caudal.toLocaleString()} kg\/h<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <span>Velocidad vapor:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${velocidad} m\/s<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <span>Caudal volum\u00e9trico:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${caudalVol.toFixed(2)} m\u00b3\/s<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <span>\u00c1rea secci\u00f3n transversal:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${area.toFixed(2)} m\u00b2<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item highlight\">\r\n                    <span>DI\u00c1METRO M\u00cdNIMO RECOMENDADO:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${diametro.toFixed(2)} m<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"nota-diametro\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Nota:<\/strong> Para dise\u00f1o industrial, agregar 10-15% de margen de seguridad.<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Di\u00e1metro comercial sugerido:<\/strong> ${Math.ceil(diametro * 1.1)} m<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function simularErrorAzeotropo() {\r\n        alert(\"\ud83e\uddea SIMULACI\u00d3N DE ERROR DE AZE\u00d3TROPO\\n\\n\" +\r\n              \"Situaci\u00f3n: Planta de etanol dise\u00f1ada para 99% pureza\\n\" +\r\n              \"Realidad: Solo se alcanza 95.6% (aze\u00f3tropo etanol-agua)\\n\\n\" +\r\n              \"\ud83d\udcb0 Costos reales:\\n\" +\r\n              \"\u2022 Redise\u00f1o: $2.5M\\n\" +\r\n              \"\u2022 Producci\u00f3n perdida: 8 meses \u00d7 $650k\/mes = $5.2M\\n\" +\r\n              \"\u2022 Total: $7.7M\\n\\n\" +\r\n              \"\u2705 Soluci\u00f3n preventiva:\\n\" +\r\n              \"1. Estudiar diagramas de fases completos\\n\" +\r\n              \"2. Considerar destilaci\u00f3n extractiva desde el dise\u00f1o\\n\" +\r\n              \"3. Validar con datos experimentales reales\");\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ FUNCIONES AUXILIARES\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function toggleErrorAvanzado(header) {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const icon = header.querySelector('.error-icon');\r\n        \r\n        if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n            icon.textContent = '\ud83d\udd3b';\r\n        } else {\r\n            content.style.display = 'block';\r\n            icon.textContent = '\ud83d\udd3a';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function verificarProblemaIndustrial(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionGuiaP${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n        console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Sistema Cyberpunk Avanzado inicializado\");\r\n        console.log(\"\u2697\ufe0f Lecci\u00f3n: M\u00e9todos de Separaci\u00f3n de Mezclas\");\r\n        console.log(\"\ud83c\udfed Simulador industrial, Quiz 30 preguntas, 12 problemas activos\");\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Inicializar quiz\r\n        tiempoInicioQuiz = Date.now();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Configurar event listeners adicionales\r\n        configurarEventListeners();\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    function configurarEventListeners() {\r\n        \/\/ Sliders de temperatura\r\n        const tempSlider = document.getElementById('temperaturaBase');\r\n        const tempValue = document.getElementById('tempValue');\r\n        \r\n        tempSlider.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n            tempValue.textContent = `${this.value}\u00b0C`;\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Sliders de platos\r\n        const platosSlider = document.getElementById('platosColumn');\r\n        const platosValue = document.getElementById('platosValue');\r\n        \r\n        platosSlider.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n            platosValue.textContent = `${this.value} platos`;\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Sliders de reflujo\r\n        const reflujoSlider = document.getElementById('reflujoRatio');\r\n        const reflujoValue = document.getElementById('reflujoValue');\r\n        \r\n        reflujoSlider.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n            reflujoValue.textContent = `${this.value}:1`;\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Tabla interactiva\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.tabla-avanzada tbody tr').forEach(row => {\r\n            row.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n                const metodo = this.dataset.metodo;\r\n                mostrarDetalleMetodo(metodo);\r\n            });\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mapa interactivo\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.metodo-item').forEach(item => {\r\n            item.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n                const metodo = this.dataset.metodo;\r\n                mostrarInfoMetodo(metodo);\r\n            });\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarDetalleMetodo(metodo) {\r\n        const infoMetodo = {\r\n            'filtracion': {\r\n                titulo: \"FILTRACI\u00d3N INDUSTRIAL\",\r\n                descripcion: \"Separaci\u00f3n s\u00f3lido-l\u00edquido mediante medio poroso.\",\r\n                datos: [\r\n                    \"Tama\u00f1o m\u00ednimo part\u00edcula: 1 \u03bcm\",\r\n                    \"Presi\u00f3n t\u00edpica: 1-10 bar\",\r\n                    \"Materiales filtro: Celulosa, PTFE, acero inoxidable\",\r\n                    \"Aplicaciones: Agua potable, productos farmac\u00e9uticos, qu\u00edmicos\"\r\n                ]\r\n            },\r\n            'destilacion-fraccionada': {\r\n                titulo: \"DESTILACI\u00d3N FRACCIONADA\",\r\n                descripcion: \"Separaci\u00f3n m\u00faltiple por diferencia en puntos de ebullici\u00f3n.\",\r\n                datos: [\r\n                    \"\u0394T m\u00ednima entre componentes: 5\u00b0C\",\r\n                    \"Platos t\u00edpicos: 20-50\",\r\n                    \"Raz\u00f3n de reflujo \u00f3ptima: 3:1 a 10:1\",\r\n                    \"Aplicaciones: Refiner\u00edas petr\u00f3leo, productos qu\u00edmicos\"\r\n                ]\r\n            }\r\n            \/\/ ... m\u00e1s m\u00e9todos\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        const info = infoMetodo[metodo] || {\r\n            titulo: \"M\u00e9todo no especificado\",\r\n            descripcion: \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible.\",\r\n            datos: []\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        const infoDiv = document.getElementById('infoMetodo');\r\n        infoDiv.innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"info-detallada\">\r\n                <h4>${info.titulo}<\/h4>\r\n                <p>${info.descripcion}<\/p>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    ${info.datos.map(d => `<li>${d}<\/li>`).join('')}\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n        infoDiv.style.animation = \"highlight 0.5s\";\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarVisualizacionSVG(svg) {\r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar elementos SVG a estado inicial\r\n        const vapor = svg.getElementById('vaporAnimado');\r\n        vapor.style.opacity = '0.7';\r\n        \r\n        const platosGrupo = svg.getElementById('platosGrupo');\r\n        platosGrupo.querySelectorAll('rect').forEach(plato => {\r\n            plato.style.fill = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        const fraccionesGrupo = svg.getElementById('fraccionesSalida');\r\n        fraccionesGrupo.querySelectorAll('rect').forEach(fraccion => {\r\n            fraccion.style.opacity = '1';\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ MATHJAX CONFIGURACI\u00d3N (si se carga externamente)\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    if (typeof MathJax !== 'undefined') {\r\n        MathJax.Hub.Config({\r\n            tex2jax: {\r\n                inlineMath: [['\\\\(','\\\\)']],\r\n                displayMath: [['\\\\[','\\\\]']],\r\n                processEscapes: true,\r\n                processEnvironments: true\r\n            },\r\n            \"HTML-CSS\": { \r\n                linebreaks: { automatic: true },\r\n                scale: 90 \r\n            },\r\n            CommonHTML: { linebreaks: { automatic: true } },\r\n            SVG: { linebreaks: { automatic: true } }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        MathJax.Hub.Queue([\"Typeset\", MathJax.Hub]);\r\n    }\r\n    <\/script>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK AVANZADA -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Filtraci\u00f3n separa","respuesta":"S\u00f3lido de l\u00edquido"},{"enunciado":"Destilaci\u00f3n por","respuesta":"Diferencia punto ebullici\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Decantaci\u00f3n para","respuesta":"L\u00edquidos inmiscibles"},{"enunciado":"Separar sal de agua","respuesta":"Evaporaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Separar gasolina de petr\u00f3leo","respuesta":"Destilaci\u00f3n fraccionada"},{"enunciado":"Separar tinta negra","respuesta":"Cromatograf\u00eda en papel"},{"enunciado":"Sublimaci\u00f3n separa","respuesta":"Yodo de sal"},{"enunciado":"Centrifugaci\u00f3n acelera","respuesta":"Decantaci\u00f3n por densidad"},{"enunciado":"Rf = 0.75 significa","respuesta":"Soluto recorri\u00f3 75% del solvente"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC: aze\u00f3tropo etanol-agua","respuesta":"95.6% etanol"},{"enunciado":"NIST: P.E. etanol","respuesta":"78.37\u00b0C"},{"enunciado":"M\u00e9todo para ADN","respuesta":"Electroforesis en gel"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"M\u00e9todos separaci\u00f3n son...","opciones":["F\u00edsicos","Qu\u00edmicos","Nucleares","Biol\u00f3gicos"],"correcta":"F\u00edsicos"},{"pregunta":"Evaporaci\u00f3n recupera...","opciones":["S\u00f3lido","L\u00edquido","Gas","Nada"],"correcta":"S\u00f3lido"},{"pregunta":"Centrifugaci\u00f3n por...","opciones":["Densidad","Color","Olor","Sabor"],"correcta":"Densidad"},{"pregunta":"Destilaci\u00f3n separa...","opciones":["L\u00edquidos miscibles","S\u00f3lidos","Gases","Iones"],"correcta":"L\u00edquidos miscibles"},{"pregunta":"Decantaci\u00f3n usa...","opciones":["Embudo decantaci\u00f3n","Matraz","Filtro","Condensador"],"correcta":"Embudo decantaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Filtraci\u00f3n retiene...","opciones":["S\u00f3lido","L\u00edquido","Gas","Luz"],"correcta":"S\u00f3lido"},{"pregunta":"Cromatograf\u00eda separa por...","opciones":["Afinidad","Masa","Volumen","pH"],"correcta":"Afinidad"},{"pregunta":"Sublimaci\u00f3n059 para...","opciones":["S\u00f3lidos vol\u00e1tiles","L\u00edquidos","Gases","Coloides"],"correcta":"S\u00f3lidos vol\u00e1tiles"},{"pregunta":"Ejemplo evaporaci\u00f3n","opciones":["Sal de mar","Alcohol","Aceite","Arena"],"correcta":"Sal de mar"},{"pregunta":"Petr\u00f3leo se separa por...","opciones":["Destilaci\u00f3n fraccionada","Filtraci\u00f3n","Decantaci\u00f3n","Sublimaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Destilaci\u00f3n fraccionada"},{"pregunta":"Aze\u00f3tropo etanol-agua","opciones":["95.6%","100%","50%","78%"],"correcta":"95.6%"},{"pregunta":"Rf = 0.5 significa...","opciones":["Mitad del camino","Inicio","Final","Nada"],"correcta":"Mitad del camino"},{"pregunta":"Centrifugaci\u00f3n en sangre","opciones":["Plasma + c\u00e9lulas","Agua + sal","Aceite + agua","Arena + agua"],"correcta":"Plasma + c\u00e9lulas"},{"pregunta":"Sublimaci\u00f3n de yodo","opciones":["Violeta \u2192 s\u00f3lido","L\u00edquido","Gas incoloro","Explosi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Violeta \u2192 s\u00f3lido"},{"pregunta":"Destilaci\u00f3n simple requiere...","opciones":["\u0394T > 25\u00b0C","\u0394T < 5\u00b0C","Misma T","Calor"],"correcta":"\u0394T > 25\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Cromatograf\u00eda GC usa...","opciones":["Gas como fase m\u00f3vil","L\u00edquido","S\u00f3lido","Plasma"],"correcta":"Gas como fase m\u00f3vil"},{"pregunta":"Embudo decantaci\u00f3n separa...","opciones":["L\u00edquidos inmiscibles","S\u00f3lidos","Gases","Coloides"],"correcta":"L\u00edquidos inmiscibles"},{"pregunta":"Evaporaci\u00f3n en rotavapor","opciones":["Baja presi\u00f3n","Alta T","Luz UV","Sonido"],"correcta":"Baja presi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"NIST: P.E. agua","opciones":["99.974\u00b0C","100.00\u00b0C","78.37\u00b0C","0.00\u00b0C"],"correcta":"99.974\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC: m\u00e9todo para pigmentos","opciones":["Cromatograf\u00eda","Destilaci\u00f3n","Filtraci\u00f3n","Decantaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Cromatograf\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"Aze\u00f3tropo m\u00ednimo hierve a...","opciones":["T < componentes","T > componentes","Igual","Variable"],"correcta":"T < componentes"},{"pregunta":"Extracci\u00f3n l\u00edquido-l\u00edquido usa...","opciones":["Solubilidad en dos solventes","Densidad","Color","pH"],"correcta":"Solubilidad en dos solventes"},{"pregunta":"Di\u00e1lisis separa por...","opciones":["Membrana semipermeable","Calor","Luz","Presi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Membrana semipermeable"},{"pregunta":"Cristalizaci\u00f3n fraccionada separa...","opciones":["Sales por solubilidad","Gases","L\u00edquidos","Coloides"],"correcta":"Sales por solubilidad"},{"pregunta":"Electroforesis separa...","opciones":["Por carga","Por masa","Por color","Por tama\u00f1o"],"correcta":"Por carga"},{"pregunta":"Destilaci\u00f3n al vac\u00edo para...","opciones":["Sustancias t\u00e9rmicamente inestables","Gases","S\u00f3lidos","Coloides"],"correcta":"Sustancias t\u00e9rmicamente inestables"},{"pregunta":"Columna Vigreux mejora...","opciones":["Eficiencia destilaci\u00f3n","Filtraci\u00f3n","Decantaci\u00f3n","Sublimaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Eficiencia destilaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Rf en cromatograf\u00eda es...","opciones":["Adimensional","En metros","En gramos","En %"],"correcta":"Adimensional"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9todo para is\u00f3topos","opciones":["Espectrometr\u00eda de masas","Destilaci\u00f3n","Filtraci\u00f3n","Cromatograf\u00eda"],"correcta":"Espectrometr\u00eda de masas"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC define aze\u00f3tropo como...","opciones":["Mezcla de composici\u00f3n constante al hervir","Pura","Elemento","Reacci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Mezcla de composici\u00f3n constante al hervir"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"particulas-subatomicas","titulo":"Part\u00edculas Subat\u00f3micas: El Coraz\u00f3n Cu\u00e1ntico","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK COMPACTA -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-quimica-particulas\" data-tema=\"particulas-subatomicas\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- CABECERA COMPACTA -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u269b\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n            PART\u00cdCULAS SUBAT\u00d3MICAS\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            El Coraz\u00f3n Cu\u00e1ntico de la Materia\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"badges-compactos\">\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">NIVEL AVANZADO<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">\u23f1\ufe0f 90 min<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">\ud83c\udfaf 1500 XP<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS COMPACTO -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-compacta objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span>\r\n            OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"grid-objetivos\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-icon\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/div>\r\n                <h3>Dominar part\u00edculas fundamentales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Prot\u00f3n, neutr\u00f3n, electr\u00f3n con precisi\u00f3n NIST 2025<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-icon\">\ud83d\udcdc<\/div>\r\n                <h3>Evoluci\u00f3n hist\u00f3rica completa<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Dalton \u2192 Thomson \u2192 Rutherford \u2192 Bohr \u2192 Schr\u00f6dinger<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-icon\">\ud83e\uddee<\/div>\r\n                <h3>C\u00e1lculos con is\u00f3topos<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Z, A, neutrones, masa at\u00f3mica, abundancia<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-icon\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                <h3>Manejo del mol y N<sub>A<\/sub><\/h3>\r\n                <p>C\u00e1lculos con constante de Avogadro<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- DATOS CLAVE - TABLA COMPACTA -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-compacta datos-clave\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span>\r\n            DATOS NIST 2025 - PRECISI\u00d3N CU\u00c1NTICA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"tabla-compacta-container\">\r\n            <table class=\"tabla-compacta\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>PART\u00cdCULA<\/th>\r\n                        <th>S\u00cdMBOLO<\/th>\r\n                        <th>CARGA<\/th>\r\n                        <th>MASA (u)<\/th>\r\n                        <th>DESCUBRIMIENTO<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>PROT\u00d3N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>p\u207a<\/td>\r\n                        <td>+1.602\u00d710\u207b\u00b9\u2079 C<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1.00727647<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Rutherford 1919<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>NEUTR\u00d3N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>n\u2070<\/td>\r\n                        <td>0<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1.00866492<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Chadwick 1932<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>ELECTR\u00d3N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>e\u207b<\/td>\r\n                        <td>-1.602\u00d710\u207b\u00b9\u2079 C<\/td>\r\n                        <td>0.00054858<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Thomson 1897<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO COMPACTO -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-compacta simulador\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf00<\/span>\r\n            SIMULADOR: MODELOS AT\u00d3MICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"simulador-compacto\">\r\n            <!-- CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"controles-simulador\">\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label>Modelo:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"modeloSelect\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"dalton\">Dalton (1803)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"thomson\">Thomson (1897)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"rutherford\" selected>Rutherford (1911)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"bohr\">Bohr (1913)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"schrodinger\">Schr\u00f6dinger (1926)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label>Elemento:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"elementoSelect\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"H\">Hidr\u00f3geno (Z=1)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"He\">Helio (Z=2)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"C\" selected>Carbono (Z=6)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"O\">Ox\u00edgeno (Z=8)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-simular\" onclick=\"simularModelo()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6<\/span> SIMULAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"resetSimulacion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"visualizacion-atomo\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" id=\"svgAtomo\">\r\n                    <defs>\r\n                        <radialGradient id=\"gradNucleo\">\r\n                            <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#FF6B6B\"\/>\r\n                            <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#D32F2F\"\/>\r\n                        <\/radialGradient>\r\n                        <radialGradient id=\"gradElectron\">\r\n                            <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#4D96FF\"\/>\r\n                            <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#1976D2\"\/>\r\n                        <\/radialGradient>\r\n                    <\/defs>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- N\u00facleo -->\r\n                    <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"150\" r=\"30\" fill=\"url(#gradNucleo)\" id=\"nucleo\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"30;32;30\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"200\" y=\"155\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">N\u00facleo<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- Electrones (se generan din\u00e1micamente) -->\r\n                    <g id=\"electronesGrupo\"><\/g>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- \u00d3rbitas (se generan din\u00e1micamente) -->\r\n                    <g id=\"orbitasGrupo\"><\/g>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"datos-simulacion\">\r\n                <div class=\"dato-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-label\">Elemento:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-valor\" id=\"datoElemento\">Carbono (C)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-label\">Modelo:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-valor\" id=\"datoModelo\">Rutherford<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-label\">Electrones:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-valor\" id=\"datoElectrones\">6<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-label\">Configuraci\u00f3n:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-valor\" id=\"datoConfig\">1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b2<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CALCULADORAS INTERACTIVAS -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-compacta calculadoras\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\uddee<\/span>\r\n            HERRAMIENTAS DE C\u00c1LCULO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"grid-calculadoras\">\r\n            <!-- CALCULADORA 1: IS\u00d3TOPOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"calculadora-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd22 CALCULADORA DE IS\u00d3TOPOS<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"calc-inputs\">\r\n                    <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                        <label>Elemento:<\/label>\r\n                        <select id=\"calcElemento\" class=\"input-control\">\r\n                            <option value=\"C\">Carbono (C)<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"O\">Ox\u00edgeno (O)<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"U\">Uranio (U)<\/option>\r\n                        <\/select>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                        <label>N\u00famero m\u00e1sico (A):<\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"calcA\" value=\"12\" min=\"1\" max=\"300\" class=\"input-control\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                        <label>Abundancia (%):<\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"calcAbun\" value=\"98.93\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"0.01\" class=\"input-control\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <button class=\"btn-calcular\" onclick=\"calcularIsotopo()\">\r\n                        CALCULAR COMPOSICI\u00d3N\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"calc-resultados\" id=\"resultadoIsotopo\">\r\n                    <!-- Resultados aparecen aqu\u00ed -->\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- CALCULADORA 2: MOL Y AVOGADRO -->\r\n            <div class=\"calculadora-card\">\r\n                <h3>\u2696\ufe0f CALCULADORA DE MOL<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"calc-inputs\">\r\n                    <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                        <label>Sustancia:<\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"calcSustancia\" value=\"H\u2082O\" class=\"input-control\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                        <label>Cantidad:<\/label>\r\n                        <div class=\"input-dual\">\r\n                            <input type=\"number\" id=\"calcCantidad\" value=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" class=\"input-control\">\r\n                            <select id=\"calcUnidad\" class=\"input-control\">\r\n                                <option value=\"mol\">mol<\/option>\r\n                                <option value=\"g\">gramos<\/option>\r\n                                <option value=\"particulas\">part\u00edculas<\/option>\r\n                            <\/select>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <button class=\"btn-calcular\" onclick=\"calcularMol()\">\r\n                        CALCULAR CON N\u2090\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"calc-resultados\" id=\"resultadoMol\">\r\n                    <!-- Resultados aparecen aqu\u00ed -->\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- F\u00d3RMULAS CLAVE -->\r\n        <div class=\"formulas-clave\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udcd0 F\u00d3RMULAS FUNDAMENTALES<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"formula-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"formula\">\\[ A = Z + N \\]<\/div>\r\n                    <p>N\u00famero m\u00e1sico = protones + neutrones<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"formula\">\\[ N_A = 6.022 \\times 10^{23} \\]<\/div>\r\n                    <p>Constante de Avogadro (mol\u207b\u00b9)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"formula\">\\[ E_n = -\\frac{13.6}{n^2} \\text{ eV} \\]<\/div>\r\n                    <p>Energ\u00eda electr\u00f3n en \u00e1tomo de H (Bohr)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO COMPACTO -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-compacta quiz\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span>\r\n            QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"pregunta-card\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"pregunta-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1ntos neutrones tiene el is\u00f3topo \u00b9\u2074C?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"opciones\">\r\n                    <button class=\"opcion\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"opcion-letra\">A<\/span>\r\n                        6 neutrones\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"opcion\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"opcion-letra\">B<\/span>\r\n                        7 neutrones\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"opcion\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"opcion-letra\">C<\/span>\r\n                        8 neutrones\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"opcion\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"opcion-letra\">D<\/span>\r\n                        14 neutrones\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-content\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Respuesta correcta: C<\/strong>\r\n                        <p>Para \u00b9\u2074C: Z = 6 (protones), A = 14, entonces N = A - Z = 14 - 6 = 8 neutrones.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"pregunta-card\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"pregunta-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQui\u00e9n descubri\u00f3 el electr\u00f3n en 1897?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"opciones\">\r\n                    <button class=\"opcion\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"opcion-letra\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Ernest Rutherford\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"opcion\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"opcion-letra\">B<\/span>\r\n                        J.J. Thomson\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"opcion\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"opcion-letra\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Niels Bohr\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"opcion\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"opcion-letra\">D<\/span>\r\n                        John Dalton\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-content\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Respuesta correcta: B<\/strong>\r\n                        <p>J.J. Thomson descubri\u00f3 el electr\u00f3n mediante experimentos con rayos cat\u00f3dicos.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"pregunta-card\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"pregunta-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1ntos \u00e1tomos hay en 0.5 moles de carbono?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"opciones\">\r\n                    <button class=\"opcion\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"opcion-letra\">A<\/span>\r\n                        3.011 \u00d7 10\u00b2\u00b3 \u00e1tomos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"opcion\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"opcion-letra\">B<\/span>\r\n                        6.022 \u00d7 10\u00b2\u00b2 \u00e1tomos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"opcion\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"opcion-letra\">C<\/span>\r\n                        1.204 \u00d7 10\u00b2\u00b3 \u00e1tomos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"opcion\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"opcion-letra\">D<\/span>\r\n                        3.011 \u00d7 10\u00b2\u00b3 \u00e1tomos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-content\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Respuesta correcta: D<\/strong>\r\n                        <p>0.5 mol \u00d7 6.022\u00d710\u00b2\u00b3 \u00e1tomos\/mol = 3.011\u00d710\u00b2\u00b3 \u00e1tomos.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-resultados\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"resultados-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <span>Preguntas:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong id=\"totalPreguntas\">3<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <span>Correctas:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong id=\"correctasCount\">0<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <span>Porcentaje:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong id=\"porcentajeScore\">0%<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-reiniciar-quiz\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS PR\u00c1CTICOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-compacta problemas\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span>\r\n            PROBLEMAS PR\u00c1CTICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"problemas-container\">\r\n            <!-- PROBLEMA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>C\u00e1lculo de composici\u00f3n at\u00f3mica<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"problema-contenido\">\r\n                    <p>El cloro natural tiene dos is\u00f3topos estables:<\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>\u00b3\u2075Cl: masa = 34.9689 u, abundancia = 75.77%<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u00b3\u2077Cl: masa = 36.9659 u, abundancia = 24.23%<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <p><strong>Calcula la masa at\u00f3mica relativa del cloro.<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"espacio-solucion\">\r\n                        <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu soluci\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"4\"><\/textarea>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <button class=\"btn-ver-solucion\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">\r\n                        VER SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <p>Masa promedio = (34.9689 \u00d7 0.7577) + (36.9659 \u00d7 0.2423)<\/p>\r\n                        <p>= 26.496 + 8.956 = 35.452 u<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PROBLEMA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"problema-contenido\">\r\n                    <p>Escribe la configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica completa para:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Ox\u00edgeno (Z=8)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Hierro (Z=26)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Plata (Z=47)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"espacio-solucion\">\r\n                        <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tus configuraciones...\" rows=\"4\"><\/textarea>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <button class=\"btn-ver-solucion\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(2)\">\r\n                        VER SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"seccion-compacta cierre\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"titulo-seccion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span>\r\n            AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N Y REFLEXI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"autoevaluacion-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion-item\">\r\n                <label>Comprensi\u00f3n part\u00edculas subat\u00f3micas:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"slider-autoeval\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                    <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span>\r\n                    <span>Intermedio<\/span>\r\n                    <span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion-item\">\r\n                <label>C\u00e1lculos con is\u00f3topos:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"slider-autoeval\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                    <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span>\r\n                    <span>Intermedio<\/span>\r\n                    <span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion-item\">\r\n                <label>Manejo del concepto mol:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"slider-autoeval\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                    <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span>\r\n                    <span>Intermedio<\/span>\r\n                    <span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-guardar-autoeval\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"recursos-extra\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h4>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/build-an-atom\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf10 Simulador PhET: Construye un \u00c1tomo\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.nist.gov\/pml\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcca NIST: Datos de constantes f\u00edsicas\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/es.khanacademy.org\/science\/chemistry\/atomic-structure-and-properties\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf93 Khan Academy: Estructura at\u00f3mica\r\n                <\/a>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n    <script>\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE SIMULACI\u00d3N DE MODELOS AT\u00d3MICOS\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    const elementosDB = {\r\n        \"H\": { nombre: \"Hidr\u00f3geno\", Z: 1, config: \"1s\u00b9\" },\r\n        \"He\": { nombre: \"Helio\", Z: 2, config: \"1s\u00b2\" },\r\n        \"C\": { nombre: \"Carbono\", Z: 6, config: \"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b2\" },\r\n        \"O\": { nombre: \"Ox\u00edgeno\", Z: 8, config: \"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2074\" }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    function simularModelo() {\r\n        const modelo = document.getElementById('modeloSelect').value;\r\n        const elemento = document.getElementById('elementoSelect').value;\r\n        const datos = elementosDB[elemento];\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n        document.getElementById('datoElemento').textContent = datos.nombre;\r\n        document.getElementById('datoModelo').textContent = \r\n            document.getElementById('modeloSelect').selectedOptions[0].text;\r\n        document.getElementById('datoElectrones').textContent = datos.Z;\r\n        document.getElementById('datoConfig').textContent = datos.config;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n        actualizarAtomoSVG(modelo, datos.Z);\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udd2c Simulando: ${modelo} para ${elemento}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function actualizarAtomoSVG(modelo, electrones) {\r\n        const svg = document.getElementById('svgAtomo');\r\n        const electronesGrupo = document.getElementById('electronesGrupo');\r\n        const orbitasGrupo = document.getElementById('orbitasGrupo');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar\r\n        electronesGrupo.innerHTML = '';\r\n        orbitasGrupo.innerHTML = '';\r\n        \r\n        const centroX = 200;\r\n        const centroY = 150;\r\n        \r\n        switch(modelo) {\r\n            case 'dalton':\r\n                \/\/ Solo n\u00facleo visible\r\n                break;\r\n                \r\n            case 'thomson':\r\n                \/\/ Electrones fijos en esfera\r\n                for (let i = 0; i < Math.min(electrones, 8); i++) {\r\n                    const angulo = (i * 45) * Math.PI \/ 180;\r\n                    const radio = 100;\r\n                    const x = centroX + radio * Math.cos(angulo);\r\n                    const y = centroY + radio * Math.sin(angulo);\r\n                    \r\n                    const electron = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('cx', x);\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('cy', y);\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('r', '8');\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('fill', '#4D96FF');\r\n                    electronesGrupo.appendChild(electron);\r\n                }\r\n                break;\r\n                \r\n            case 'rutherford':\r\n            case 'bohr':\r\n                \/\/ \u00d3rbitas y electrones en movimiento\r\n                const radios = modelo === 'bohr' ? [80, 120, 160] : [100, 150];\r\n                \r\n                radios.forEach((radio, i) => {\r\n                    \/\/ Dibujar \u00f3rbita\r\n                    const orbita = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n                    orbita.setAttribute('cx', centroX);\r\n                    orbita.setAttribute('cy', centroY);\r\n                    orbita.setAttribute('r', radio);\r\n                    orbita.setAttribute('fill', 'none');\r\n                    orbita.setAttribute('stroke', modelo === 'bohr' ? '#4CAF50' : '#2196F3');\r\n                    orbita.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');\r\n                    if (modelo === 'rutherford') {\r\n                        orbita.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', '5,5');\r\n                    }\r\n                    orbitasGrupo.appendChild(orbita);\r\n                });\r\n                \r\n                \/\/ A\u00f1adir electrones\r\n                for (let i = 0; i < Math.min(electrones, 6); i++) {\r\n                    const radio = radios[i % radios.length];\r\n                    const anguloInicial = (i * 60) * Math.PI \/ 180;\r\n                    \r\n                    const electron = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('r', '8');\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('fill', '#4D96FF');\r\n                    \r\n                    \/\/ Posici\u00f3n inicial\r\n                    const x = centroX + radio * Math.cos(anguloInicial);\r\n                    const y = centroY + radio * Math.sin(anguloInicial);\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('cx', x);\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('cy', y);\r\n                    \r\n                    \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n\r\n                    if (modelo === 'bohr' || modelo === 'rutherford') {\r\n                        const anim = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'animateTransform');\r\n                        anim.setAttribute('attributeName', 'transform');\r\n                        anim.setAttribute('type', 'rotate');\r\n                        anim.setAttribute('from', `0 ${centroX} ${centroY}`);\r\n                        anim.setAttribute('to', `360 ${centroX} ${centroY}`);\r\n                        anim.setAttribute('dur', `${3 + i * 0.5}s`);\r\n                        anim.setAttribute('repeatCount', 'indefinite');\r\n                        electron.appendChild(anim);\r\n                    }\r\n                    \r\n                    electronesGrupo.appendChild(electron);\r\n                }\r\n                break;\r\n                \r\n            case 'schrodinger':\r\n                \/\/ Nube de probabilidad\r\n                const nube = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n                nube.setAttribute('cx', centroX);\r\n                nube.setAttribute('cy', centroY);\r\n                nube.setAttribute('r', '120');\r\n                nube.setAttribute('fill', '#9C27B0');\r\n                nube.setAttribute('fill-opacity', '0.1');\r\n                nube.setAttribute('stroke', '#9C27B0');\r\n                orbitasGrupo.appendChild(nube);\r\n                \r\n                \/\/ Electrones como puntos difusos\r\n                for (let i = 0; i < Math.min(electrones, 8); i++) {\r\n                    const angulo = Math.random() * 2 * Math.PI;\r\n                    const distancia = Math.random() * 100;\r\n                    \r\n                    const electron = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('cx', centroX + distancia * Math.cos(angulo));\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('cy', centroY + distancia * Math.sin(angulo));\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('r', '8');\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('fill', '#4D96FF');\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('fill-opacity', '0.7');\r\n                    \r\n                    electronesGrupo.appendChild(electron);\r\n                }\r\n                break;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function resetSimulacion() {\r\n        document.getElementById('modeloSelect').value = 'rutherford';\r\n        document.getElementById('elementoSelect').value = 'C';\r\n        simularModelo();\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE CALCULADORAS\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function calcularIsotopo() {\r\n        const elemento = document.getElementById('calcElemento').value;\r\n        const A = parseInt(document.getElementById('calcA').value);\r\n        const abundancia = parseFloat(document.getElementById('calcAbun').value);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Valores de Z por elemento\r\n        const ZValues = { C: 6, O: 8, U: 92 };\r\n        const Z = ZValues[elemento] || 0;\r\n        \r\n        if (Z === 0 || A <= Z) {\r\n            alert(\"Valores inv\u00e1lidos\");\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        const N = A - Z;\r\n        const masaTeorica = Z * 1.00728 + N * 1.00866;\r\n        const defectoMasa = masaTeorica - A;\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('resultadoIsotopo').innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"resultado\">\r\n                <h5>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS<\/h5>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-linea\">\r\n                    <span>Is\u00f3topo:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${elemento}-${A}<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-linea\">\r\n                    <span>Protones:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${Z}<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-linea\">\r\n                    <span>Neutrones:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${N}<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-linea\">\r\n                    <span>Abundancia:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${abundancia}%<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-linea highlight\">\r\n                    <span>Masa te\u00f3rica:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${masaTeorica.toFixed(5)} u<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function calcularMol() {\r\n        const sustancia = document.getElementById('calcSustancia').value;\r\n        const cantidad = parseFloat(document.getElementById('calcCantidad').value);\r\n        const unidad = document.getElementById('calcUnidad').value;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Masas molares aproximadas\r\n        const masas = {\r\n            \"H\u2082O\": 18.015,\r\n            \"CO\u2082\": 44.009,\r\n            \"NaCl\": 58.443,\r\n            \"C\": 12.011,\r\n            \"O\u2082\": 31.998\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        const masaMolar = masas[sustancia] || 0;\r\n        const NA = 6.022e23;\r\n        \r\n        let moles = 0;\r\n        let gramos = 0;\r\n        let particulas = 0;\r\n        \r\n        switch(unidad) {\r\n            case 'mol':\r\n                moles = cantidad;\r\n                gramos = moles * masaMolar;\r\n                particulas = moles * NA;\r\n                break;\r\n            case 'g':\r\n                gramos = cantidad;\r\n                moles = gramos \/ masaMolar;\r\n                particulas = moles * NA;\r\n                break;\r\n            case 'particulas':\r\n                particulas = cantidad;\r\n                moles = particulas \/ NA;\r\n                gramos = moles * masaMolar;\r\n                break;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('resultadoMol').innerHTML = `\r\n            <div class=\"resultado\">\r\n                <h5>\u2696\ufe0f RESULTADOS<\/h5>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-linea\">\r\n                    <span>Masa molar:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${masaMolar.toFixed(3)} g\/mol<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-linea\">\r\n                    <span>Moles:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${moles.toExponential(4)} mol<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-linea\">\r\n                    <span>Gramos:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${gramos.toExponential(4)} g<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-linea highlight\">\r\n                    <span>Part\u00edculas (N\u2090):<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>${particulas.toExponential(4)}<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        `;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    let respuestasQuiz = [];\r\n    \r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.opcion').forEach(opcion => {\r\n        opcion.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const pregunta = this.closest('.pregunta-card');\r\n            const correcta = pregunta.dataset.correct;\r\n            const seleccionada = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = pregunta.querySelector('.feedback');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Remover selecciones anteriores\r\n            pregunta.querySelectorAll('.opcion').forEach(op => {\r\n                op.classList.remove('correcta', 'incorrecta');\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Marcar respuesta\r\n            this.classList.add('seleccionada');\r\n            \r\n            if (seleccionada === correcta) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correcta');\r\n                respuestasQuiz.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrecta');\r\n                \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n                pregunta.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correcta}\"]`).classList.add('correcta');\r\n                respuestasQuiz.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas respondidas\r\n            verificarQuizCompletado();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    function verificarQuizCompletado() {\r\n        const preguntas = document.querySelectorAll('.pregunta-card');\r\n        const respondidas = Array.from(preguntas).every(p => \r\n            p.querySelector('.opcion.seleccionada')\r\n        );\r\n        \r\n        if (respondidas) {\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = respuestasQuiz.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        const total = respuestasQuiz.length;\r\n        const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('totalPreguntas').textContent = total;\r\n        document.getElementById('correctasCount').textContent = correctas;\r\n        document.getElementById('porcentajeScore').textContent = `${porcentaje}%`;\r\n        \r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-resultados').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.opcion').forEach(op => {\r\n            op.classList.remove('seleccionada', 'correcta', 'incorrecta');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-resultados').style.display = 'none';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar array de respuestas\r\n        respuestasQuiz = [];\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ FUNCIONES AUXILIARES\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const sliders = document.querySelectorAll('.slider-autoeval');\r\n        const valores = Array.from(sliders).map(s => parseInt(s.value));\r\n        const promedio = valores.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) \/ valores.length;\r\n        \r\n        alert(`\ud83d\udcca AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\nPromedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n\u00a1Sigue practicando!`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n        console.log(\"\u269b\ufe0f Sistema de Part\u00edculas Subat\u00f3micas inicializado\");\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Iniciar simulador\r\n        simularModelo();\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Configurar interactividad\r\n        document.getElementById('modeloSelect').addEventListener('change', simularModelo);\r\n        document.getElementById('elementoSelect').addEventListener('change', simularModelo);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ A\u00f1adir MathJax si est\u00e1 disponible\r\n        if (typeof MathJax !== 'undefined') {\r\n            MathJax.Hub.Queue([\"Typeset\", MathJax.Hub]);\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    <\/script>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N COMPACTA -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Carga del prot\u00f3n","respuesta":"+1"},{"enunciado":"Masa relativa electr\u00f3n","respuesta":"1\/1836 u"},{"enunciado":"N\u00famero at\u00f3mico define","respuesta":"Elemento"},{"enunciado":"\u00b9\u2074C: neutrones","respuesta":"8"},{"enunciado":"Masa molar O\u2082","respuesta":"32.00 g\/mol"},{"enunciado":"1 mol Na contiene","respuesta":"6.022\u00d710\u00b2\u00b3 \u00e1tomos"},{"enunciado":"Is\u00f3topo m\u00e1s abundante H","respuesta":"\u00b9H (99.98%)"},{"enunciado":"Experimento Rutherford","respuesta":"L\u00e1mina de oro"},{"enunciado":"Modelo cu\u00e1ntico describe","respuesta":"Orbitales de probabilidad"},{"enunciado":"NIST: masa prot\u00f3n","respuesta":"1.007276 u"},{"enunciado":"Avogadro exacto 2019","respuesta":"6.02214076\u00d710\u00b2\u00b3"},{"enunciado":"Electr\u00f3n en nivel n=1","respuesta":"Orbital 1s"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Protones definen...","opciones":["Elemento","Is\u00f3topo","I\u00f3n","Mol\u00e9cula"],"correcta":"Elemento"},{"pregunta":"Neutrones est\u00e1n en...","opciones":["N\u00facleo","Orbitales","Corteza","Vac\u00edo"],"correcta":"N\u00facleo"},{"pregunta":"Carga electr\u00f3n","opciones":["Negativa","Positiva","Neutra","Variable"],"correcta":"Negativa"},{"pregunta":"N\u00famero Avogadro","opciones":["6.022\u00d710\u00b2\u00b3","3.14","9.8","1.38\u00d710\u207b\u00b2\u00b3"],"correcta":"6.022\u00d710\u00b2\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"\u00b9\u00b2C tiene...","opciones":["6p, 6n, 6e","6p, 6n, 5e","7p, 5n, 6e","6p, 7n, 6e"],"correcta":"6p, 6n, 6e"},{"pregunta":"Masa molar C","opciones":["12.011 g\/mol","12.000 g\/mol","6.022 g\/mol","1.008 g\/mol"],"correcta":"12.011 g\/mol"},{"pregunta":"Descubridor neutr\u00f3n","opciones":["Chadwick","Thomson","Rutherford","Bohr"],"correcta":"Chadwick"},{"pregunta":"Modelo pud\u00edn","opciones":["Thomson","Dalton","Rutherford","Bohr"],"correcta":"Thomson"},{"pregunta":"N\u00famero m\u00e1sico A =","opciones":["p + n","p + e","n + e","Z + A"],"correcta":"p + n"},{"pregunta":"\u00c1tomo neutro: p =","opciones":["e","n","Z","A"],"correcta":"e"},{"pregunta":"\u00b9\u2074C usado en...","opciones":["Dataci\u00f3n radiom\u00e9trica","Combustible","Medicina","Alimentos"],"correcta":"Dataci\u00f3n radiom\u00e9trica"},{"pregunta":"Masa electr\u00f3n","opciones":["1\/1836 u","1 u","0 u","1\/12 u"],"correcta":"1\/1836 u"},{"pregunta":"Bohr propuso...","opciones":["\u00d3rbitas cuantizadas","Nube electr\u00f3nica","N\u00facleo vac\u00edo","\u00c1tomo indivisible"],"correcta":"\u00d3rbitas cuantizadas"},{"pregunta":"Is\u00f3topos tienen mismo...","opciones":["Z","A","p","e"],"correcta":"Z"},{"pregunta":"1 mol H\u2082O =","opciones":["18.02 g","16.00 g","2.016 g","32.00 g"],"correcta":"18.02 g"},{"pregunta":"Experimento l\u00e1mina oro","opciones":["Rutherford","Thomson","Chadwick","Dalton"],"correcta":"Rutherford"},{"pregunta":"Electr\u00f3n en orbital...","opciones":["Nube de probabilidad","\u00d3rbita fija","N\u00facleo","Vac\u00edo"],"correcta":"Nube de probabilidad"},{"pregunta":"NIST: carga elemental","opciones":["1.602\u00d710\u207b\u00b9\u2079 C","1 C","0 C","9.11\u00d710\u207b\u00b3\u00b9 C"],"correcta":"1.602\u00d710\u207b\u00b9\u2079 C"},{"pregunta":"Masa molar exacta \u00b9\u00b2C","opciones":["12.000 g\/mol","12.011 g\/mol","6.022 g\/mol","1.008 g\/mol"],"correcta":"12.000 g\/mol"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC: 1 mol =","opciones":["6.02214076\u00d710\u00b2\u00b3","6.02\u00d710\u00b2\u00b3","6.00\u00d710\u00b2\u00b3","6.022\u00d710\u00b2\u00b2"],"correcta":"6.02214076\u00d710\u00b2\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"Masa prot\u00f3n NIST","opciones":["1.007276 u","1.000000 u","1.008665 u","0.000549 u"],"correcta":"1.007276 u"},{"pregunta":"Modelo cu\u00e1ntico usa...","opciones":["Funci\u00f3n de onda","\u00d3rbitas circulares","Pud\u00edn","N\u00facleo hueco"],"correcta":"Funci\u00f3n de onda"},{"pregunta":"\u00b9H: neutrones","opciones":["0","1","2","3"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"\u00b2H (deuterio) tiene...","opciones":["1n","0n","2n","3n"],"correcta":"1n"},{"pregunta":"\u00b3H (tritio) es...","opciones":["Radiactivo","Estable","Gas noble","Metal"],"correcta":"Radiactivo"},{"pregunta":"Electr\u00f3n en nivel n=2 puede estar en...","opciones":["2s, 2p","1s","3d","4f"],"correcta":"2s, 2p"},{"pregunta":"Constante Avogadro definida por...","opciones":["\u00b9\u00b2C = 12 g\/mol","H = 1 g\/mol","O = 16 g\/mol","e = 1 C"],"correcta":"\u00b9\u00b2C = 12 g\/mol"},{"pregunta":"\u00c1tomo con Z=26 es...","opciones":["Hierro (Fe)","Cobre","Oro","Carbono"],"correcta":"Hierro (Fe)"},{"pregunta":"I\u00f3n Na\u207a tiene...","opciones":["10 electrones","11 electrones","12 electrones","9 electrones"],"correcta":"10 electrones"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC 2019 redefini\u00f3 mol como...","opciones":["N\u00famero fijo de entidades","Masa en gramos","Volumen","Densidad"],"correcta":"N\u00famero fijo de entidades"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"configuraciones-electronicas-cyberpunk","titulo":"Configuraciones Electr\u00f3nicas: El C\u00f3digo del \u00c1tomo","contenido":"<!-- LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK ULTRA-COMPACTA -->\r\n<div class=\"lec-quimica-electronic\" data-tema=\"config-electronicas\">\r\n    \r\n<!-- CABECERA MINIMALISTA -->\r\n<header class=\"lec-header\">\r\n    <h1 class=\"lec-title glow\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\u26a1<\/span> CONFIGURACIONES ELECTR\u00d3NICAS\r\n    <\/h1>\r\n    <div class=\"lec-sub\">El c\u00f3digo binario del \u00e1tomo: 1s\u00b2, 2s\u00b2, 2p\u2076...<\/div>\r\n<\/header>\r\n\r\n<!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n<section class=\"panel-obj\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"sec-title neon-c\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"obj-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"obj-card\" data-done=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"obj-check\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Escribir configuraciones usando Aufbau<\/h3>\r\n            <p>1s \u2192 2s \u2192 2p \u2192 3s \u2192 3p \u2192 4s \u2192 3d...<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"obj-card\" data-done=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"obj-check\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Aplicar Pauli, Hund y excepciones<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Cr: [Ar]4s\u00b93d\u2075, Cu: [Ar]4s\u00b93d\u00b9\u2070<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"obj-card\" data-done=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"obj-check\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Identificar bloques s,p,d,f<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Relaci\u00f3n con posici\u00f3n en tabla peri\u00f3dica<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- CONCEPTOS R\u00c1PIDOS -->\r\n<section class=\"concepts-compact\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"sec-title neon-c\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CONCEPTOS CLAVE\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"concept-grid\">\r\n        <!-- N\u00daMEROS CU\u00c1NTICOS -->\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <h3><span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd22<\/span> N\u00fameros Cu\u00e1nticos<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"table-mini\">\r\n                <table>\r\n                    <tr><th>S\u00edmbolo<\/th><th>Valores<\/th><th>Define<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td><strong>n<\/strong><\/td><td>1,2,3...<\/td><td>Nivel<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td><strong>l<\/strong><\/td><td>0\u2192n-1<\/td><td>Subnivel<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td><strong>m\u2097<\/strong><\/td><td>-l\u2192+l<\/td><td>Orbital<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td><strong>m\u209b<\/strong><\/td><td>\u00b1\u00bd<\/td><td>Spin<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- PRINCIPIOS -->\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <h3><span class=\"icon\">\u269b\ufe0f<\/span> Principios<\/h3>\r\n            <ul class=\"list-mini\">\r\n                <li><strong>Aufbau:<\/strong> Menor \u2192 mayor energ\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Pauli:<\/strong> 2e\u207b m\u00e1ximo\/orbital<\/li>\r\n                <li><strong>Hund:<\/strong> Max multiplicidad<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- BLOQUES -->\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <h3><span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde9<\/span> Bloques<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"table-mini\">\r\n                <table>\r\n                    <tr><th>Bloque<\/th><th>\u00daltimo e\u207b<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td><strong>s<\/strong><\/td><td>ns<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td><strong>p<\/strong><\/td><td>np<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td><strong>d<\/strong><\/td><td>(n-1)d<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td><strong>f<\/strong><\/td><td>(n-2)f<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ORDEN AUFBAU COMPACTO -->\r\n<section class=\"aufbau-compact\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"sec-title neon-c\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcc8<\/span> DIAGRAMA DE ENERG\u00cdA\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"energy-flow\">\r\n        <div class=\"energy-level\">1s<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"arrow\">\u2193<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"energy-level\">2s<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"arrow\">\u2193<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"energy-level\">2p<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"arrow\">\u2193<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"energy-level\">3s<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"arrow\">\u2193<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"energy-level\">3p<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"arrow\">\u2193<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"energy-level\">4s<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"arrow\">\u2198<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"energy-level\">3d<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"arrow\">\u2193<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"energy-level\">4p<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"arrow\">\u2193<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"energy-level\">5s<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"formula-neon\">\r\n        \\[ \\text{Orden energ\u00e9tico: } 1s < 2s < 2p < 3s < 3p < 4s < 3d < 4p < 5s < 4d < 5p < 6s < 4f... \\]\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- EJEMPLOS R\u00c1PIDOS -->\r\n<section class=\"examples-compact\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"sec-title neon-e\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udc8e<\/span> EJEMPLOS\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"ex-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"ex-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"ex-elem\">H (Z=1)<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ex-config\">1s\u00b9<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ex-block\">s<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"ex-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"ex-elem\">He (Z=2)<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ex-config\">1s\u00b2<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ex-block\">s<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"ex-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"ex-elem\">Li (Z=3)<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ex-config\">[He] 2s\u00b9<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ex-block\">s<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"ex-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"ex-elem\">O (Z=8)<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ex-config\">[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u2074<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ex-block\">p<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"ex-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"ex-elem\">Na (Z=11)<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ex-config\">[Ne] 3s\u00b9<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ex-block\">s<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"ex-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"ex-elem\">Fe (Z=26)<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ex-config\">[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2076<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ex-block\">d<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO COMPACTO -->\r\n<section class=\"sim-compact\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"sec-title neon-i\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/span> SIMULADOR: CONFIGURADOR ELECTR\u00d3NICO\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"sim-container\" data-sim=\"config-electron\">\r\n        <!-- CONTROLES -->\r\n        <div class=\"sim-controls\">\r\n            <h3>CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"ctrl-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"elemZ\">N\u00famero At\u00f3mico (Z):<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"elemZ\" min=\"1\" max=\"30\" value=\"11\" class=\"ctrl-slider\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-value\">\r\n                    <span id=\"zValue\">11<\/span>\r\n                    <span id=\"elemName\">Na (Sodio)<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"ctrl-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"showExceptions\">Excepciones:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"showExceptions\" checked>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-sim\" onclick=\"generarConfig()\">\r\n                <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u26a1<\/span> GENERAR CONFIGURACI\u00d3N\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-alt\" onclick=\"elementoAleatorio()\">\r\n                <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> ELEMENTO ALEATORIO\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"sim-vis\">\r\n            <div class=\"orbital-vis\" id=\"orbitalView\">\r\n                <!-- SVG generado din\u00e1micamente -->\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" id=\"svgOrbital\">\r\n                    <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n                    <!-- Orbitales se generan aqu\u00ed -->\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"config-display\" id=\"configDisplay\">\r\n                <div class=\"config-full\" id=\"fullConfig\">[Ne] 3s\u00b9<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"config-detail\" id=\"detailConfig\">1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b9<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- DATOS -->\r\n        <div class=\"sim-data\">\r\n            <h3>DATOS<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"data-item\">\r\n                <span class=\"data-label\">Elemento:<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataElement\">Na<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"data-item\">\r\n                <span class=\"data-label\">Bloque:<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataBlock\">s<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"data-item\">\r\n                <span class=\"data-label\">e\u207b Valencia:<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataValence\">1<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"data-item\">\r\n                <span class=\"data-label\">Config. Noble:<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataNoble\">[Ne]<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"data-item highlight\">\r\n                <span class=\"data-label\">NOTA:<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataNote\">Configuraci\u00f3n normal<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- EXCEPCIONES -->\r\n<section class=\"exceptions-compact\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"sec-title neon-a\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> EXCEPCIONES\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"exc-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"exc-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"exc-elem\">Cr (Z=24)<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"exc-config\">[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"exc-reason\">Subnivel d semilleno \u2192 estable<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"exc-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"exc-elem\">Cu (Z=29)<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"exc-config\">[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"exc-reason\">Subnivel d lleno \u2192 estable<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"exc-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"exc-elem\">Ag (Z=47)<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"exc-config\">[Kr] 5s\u00b9 4d\u00b9\u2070<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"exc-reason\">Similar a Cu<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- QUIZ COMPACTO -->\r\n<section class=\"quiz-compact\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"sec-title neon-ev\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ R\u00c1PIDO\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n        <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-q\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n            <div class=\"q-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"q-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                <p>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es configuraci\u00f3n del Mg (Z=12)?<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"q-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"q-opt\" data-val=\"A\">A) [Ne] 3s\u00b2<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"q-opt\" data-val=\"B\">B) [He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"q-opt\" data-val=\"C\">C) [Ne] 3s\u00b2<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"q-opt\" data-val=\"D\">D) [Ar] 4s\u00b2<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"q-feedback\" style=\"display:none;\">\r\n                <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Mg: 1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2 = [Ne] 3s\u00b2\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-q\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n            <div class=\"q-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"q-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                <p>\u00bfCu\u00e1l NO es excepci\u00f3n Aufbau?<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"q-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"q-opt\" data-val=\"A\">A) Cr<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"q-opt\" data-val=\"B\">B) Fe<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"q-opt\" data-val=\"C\">C) Cu<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"q-opt\" data-val=\"D\">D) Ag<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"q-feedback\" style=\"display:none;\">\r\n                <strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Fe sigue regla normal: [Ar]4s\u00b23d\u2076\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display:none;\">\r\n        <h4>RESULTADO: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/2<\/h4>\r\n        <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"resetQuiz()\">REINTENTAR<\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- PROBLEMA EXAMEN -->\r\n<section class=\"exam-compact\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"sec-title neon-ev\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMA EXAMEN\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"exam-card\">\r\n        <div class=\"exam-q\">\r\n            <p><strong>Problema:<\/strong> Escribe configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica de:<\/p>\r\n            <ol>\r\n                <li>Cl (Z=17)<\/li>\r\n                <li>Fe\u00b2\u207a (Z=26)<\/li>\r\n                <li>Ag (Z=47) con excepci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n            <\/ol>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <textarea class=\"exam-answer\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu respuesta aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"4\"><\/textarea>\r\n        <button class=\"btn-verify\" onclick=\"verificarExamen()\">VERIFICAR<\/button>\r\n        <div class=\"exam-sol\" style=\"display:none;\">\r\n            <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n            1) Cl: [Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u2075<br>\r\n            2) Fe\u00b2\u207a: [Ar] 3d\u2076 (pierde 2e\u207b del 4s)<br>\r\n            3) Ag: [Kr] 5s\u00b9 4d\u00b9\u2070 (excepci\u00f3n)\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- CIERRE -->\r\n<section class=\"close-compact\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"sec-title neon-c\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\u2705<\/span> AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"auto-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"auto-item\">\r\n            <label>Configuraciones b\u00e1sicas:<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"auto-slider\">\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"auto-item\">\r\n            <label>Excepciones Aufbau:<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"auto-slider\">\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"auto-item\">\r\n            <label>Relaci\u00f3n bloques:<\/label>\r\n            <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"auto-slider\">\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <button class=\"btn-save\" onclick=\"guardarAuto()\">GUARDAR<\/button>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ BASE DE DATOS DE ELEMENTOS\r\nconst elementosDB = {\r\n    1: {simbolo:\"H\", nombre:\"Hidr\u00f3geno\", config:\"1s\u00b9\", bloque:\"s\"},\r\n    2: {simbolo:\"He\", nombre:\"Helio\", config:\"1s\u00b2\", bloque:\"s\"},\r\n    3: {simbolo:\"Li\", nombre:\"Litio\", config:\"[He] 2s\u00b9\", bloque:\"s\"},\r\n    4: {simbolo:\"Be\", nombre:\"Berilio\", config:\"[He] 2s\u00b2\", bloque:\"s\"},\r\n    5: {simbolo:\"B\", nombre:\"Boro\", config:\"[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b9\", bloque:\"p\"},\r\n    6: {simbolo:\"C\", nombre:\"Carbono\", config:\"[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b2\", bloque:\"p\"},\r\n    7: {simbolo:\"N\", nombre:\"Nitr\u00f3geno\", config:\"[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b3\", bloque:\"p\"},\r\n    8: {simbolo:\"O\", nombre:\"Ox\u00edgeno\", config:\"[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u2074\", bloque:\"p\"},\r\n    11: {simbolo:\"Na\", nombre:\"Sodio\", config:\"[Ne] 3s\u00b9\", bloque:\"s\"},\r\n    12: {simbolo:\"Mg\", nombre:\"Magnesio\", config:\"[Ne] 3s\u00b2\", bloque:\"s\"},\r\n    17: {simbolo:\"Cl\", nombre:\"Cloro\", config:\"[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u2075\", bloque:\"p\"},\r\n    24: {simbolo:\"Cr\", nombre:\"Cromo\", config:\"[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075\", bloque:\"d\", excep:true},\r\n    26: {simbolo:\"Fe\", nombre:\"Hierro\", config:\"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2076\", bloque:\"d\"},\r\n    29: {simbolo:\"Cu\", nombre:\"Cobre\", config:\"[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070\", bloque:\"d\", excep:true},\r\n    30: {simbolo:\"Zn\", nombre:\"Zinc\", config:\"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u00b9\u2070\", bloque:\"d\"}\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ORDEN DE LLENADO\r\nconst ordenAufbau = [\"1s\",\"2s\",\"2p\",\"3s\",\"3p\",\"4s\",\"3d\",\"4p\",\"5s\",\"4d\",\"5p\",\"6s\"];\r\n\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR\r\nfunction generarConfig() {\r\n    const z = parseInt(document.getElementById('elemZ').value);\r\n    const elem = elementosDB[z];\r\n    const showExc = document.getElementById('showExceptions').checked;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar display\r\n    document.getElementById('zValue').textContent = z;\r\n    document.getElementById('elemName').textContent = `${elem.simbolo} (${elem.nombre})`;\r\n    document.getElementById('fullConfig').textContent = elem.config;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataElement').textContent = elem.simbolo;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataBlock').textContent = elem.bloque;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataNote').textContent = elem.excep ? \"\u00a1EXCEPCI\u00d3N!\" : \"Configuraci\u00f3n normal\";\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular e\u207b valencia\r\n    const valence = calcularValencia(elem.config);\r\n    document.getElementById('dataValence').textContent = valence;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular gas noble\r\n    const noble = obtenerGasNoble(z);\r\n    document.getElementById('dataNoble').textContent = noble;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Generar detalle completo\r\n    const detail = obtenerConfigCompleta(z, showExc);\r\n    document.getElementById('detailConfig').textContent = detail;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Generar visualizaci\u00f3n orbital\r\n    generarOrbitales(z, showExc);\r\n    \r\n    console.log(`\u26a1 Config generada: ${elem.simbolo} = ${elem.config}`);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction calcularValencia(config) {\r\n    if(config.includes(\"s\u00b9\")) return 1;\r\n    if(config.includes(\"s\u00b2\")) return 2;\r\n    if(config.includes(\"p\u00b9\")) return 3;\r\n    if(config.includes(\"p\u00b2\")) return 4;\r\n    if(config.includes(\"p\u00b3\")) return 5;\r\n    if(config.includes(\"p\u2074\")) return 6;\r\n    if(config.includes(\"p\u2075\")) return 7;\r\n    if(config.includes(\"p\u2076\")) return 8;\r\n    return 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction obtenerGasNoble(z) {\r\n    if(z <= 2) return \"\";\r\n    if(z <= 10) return \"[He]\";\r\n    if(z <= 18) return \"[Ne]\";\r\n    if(z <= 36) return \"[Ar]\";\r\n    if(z <= 54) return \"[Kr]\";\r\n    if(z <= 86) return \"[Xe]\";\r\n    return \"[Rn]\";\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction obtenerConfigCompleta(z, incluirExcepciones) {\r\n    \/\/ Implementaci\u00f3n simplificada\r\n    const configs = {\r\n        1: \"1s\u00b9\", 2: \"1s\u00b2\", 3: \"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b9\", 4: \"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2\",\r\n        5: \"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b9\", 6: \"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b2\", 7: \"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b3\",\r\n        8: \"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2074\", 9: \"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2075\", 10: \"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076\",\r\n        11: \"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b9\", 12: \"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2\",\r\n        17: \"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2 3p\u2075\", 24: \"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2 3p\u2076 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075\",\r\n        26: \"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2 3p\u2076 4s\u00b2 3d\u2076\", 29: \"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2 3p\u2076 4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070\",\r\n        30: \"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2 3p\u2076 4s\u00b2 3d\u00b9\u2070\"\r\n    };\r\n    return configs[z] || \"No disponible\";\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction generarOrbitales(z, incluirExcepciones) {\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById('svgOrbital');\r\n    svg.innerHTML = '';\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Fondo\r\n    const bg = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg','rect');\r\n    bg.setAttribute('width','100%');\r\n    bg.setAttribute('height','100%');\r\n    bg.setAttribute('fill','#0a0a1a');\r\n    svg.appendChild(bg);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Orbital 1s\r\n    const orb1s = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg','circle');\r\n    orb1s.setAttribute('cx','80');\r\n    orb1s.setAttribute('cy','80');\r\n    orb1s.setAttribute('r','30');\r\n    orb1s.setAttribute('fill','none');\r\n    orb1s.setAttribute('stroke','#39FF14');\r\n    orb1s.setAttribute('stroke-width','2');\r\n    svg.appendChild(orb1s);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ e\u207b en 1s\r\n    const e1s = Math.min(z, 2);\r\n    if(e1s > 0) {\r\n        const e1 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg','circle');\r\n        e1.setAttribute('cx','70');\r\n        e1.setAttribute('cy','80');\r\n        e1.setAttribute('r','8');\r\n        e1.setAttribute('fill','#FF00FF');\r\n        svg.appendChild(e1);\r\n    }\r\n    if(e1s > 1) {\r\n        const e2 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg','circle');\r\n        e2.setAttribute('cx','90');\r\n        e2.setAttribute('cy','80');\r\n        e2.setAttribute('r','8');\r\n        e2.setAttribute('fill','#FF00FF');\r\n        svg.appendChild(e2);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Orbital 2s si Z>2\r\n    if(z > 2) {\r\n        const orb2s = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg','circle');\r\n        orb2s.setAttribute('cx','200');\r\n        orb2s.setAttribute('cy','80');\r\n        orb2s.setAttribute('r','40');\r\n        orb2s.setAttribute('fill','none');\r\n        orb2s.setAttribute('stroke','#00FFFF');\r\n        orb2s.setAttribute('stroke-width','2');\r\n        svg.appendChild(orb2s);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    console.log(`\ud83c\udfa8 Orbitales generados para Z=${z}`);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction elementoAleatorio() {\r\n    const zs = Object.keys(elementosDB);\r\n    const z = zs[Math.floor(Math.random() * zs.length)];\r\n    document.getElementById('elemZ').value = z;\r\n    generarConfig();\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ QUIZ\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.q-opt').forEach(opt => {\r\n    opt.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-q');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.val;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.q-feedback');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.q-opt').forEach(o => {\r\n            o.classList.remove('correct','incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Marcar\r\n        if(selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n            feedback.style.color = '#39FF14';\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-val=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n            feedback.style.color = '#FF6B6B';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas respondidas\r\n        const allAnswered = [...document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-q')]\r\n            .every(q => q.querySelector('.q-opt.correct'));\r\n        \r\n        if(allAnswered) {\r\n            const correctCount = [...document.querySelectorAll('.q-opt.correct')]\r\n                .filter(o => o.dataset.val === o.closest('.quiz-q').dataset.correct).length;\r\n            document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = correctCount;\r\n            document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction resetQuiz() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.q-opt').forEach(o => {\r\n        o.classList.remove('correct','incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.q-feedback').forEach(f => {\r\n        f.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ OBJETIVOS INTERACTIVOS\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.obj-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const done = this.dataset.done === 'true';\r\n        this.dataset.done = !done;\r\n        const check = this.querySelector('.obj-check');\r\n        check.textContent = !done ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n        check.style.background = !done ? '#39FF14' : '';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\nfunction guardarAuto() {\r\n    const sliders = document.querySelectorAll('.auto-slider');\r\n    const vals = [...sliders].map(s => parseInt(s.value));\r\n    const avg = (vals.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)\/vals.length).toFixed(1);\r\n    alert(`\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\nPromedio: ${avg}\/5.0\\n\\nRevisa \u00e1reas con puntuaci\u00f3n <3.`);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ VERIFICAR EXAMEN\r\nfunction verificarExamen() {\r\n    const sol = document.querySelector('.exam-sol');\r\n    sol.style.display = sol.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZAR\r\nconsole.log(\"\u26a1 Sistema Cyberpunk Configuraciones Electr\u00f3nicas cargado\");\r\ngenerarConfig(); \/\/ Mostrar configuraci\u00f3n inicial\r\n<\/script>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Configuraci\u00f3n de O (Z=8)","respuesta":"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2074"},{"enunciado":"Configuraci\u00f3n de Na (Z=11)","respuesta":"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b9"},{"enunciado":"Principio de Aufbau","respuesta":"Llenar orbitales de menor energ\u00eda primero"},{"enunciado":"Configuraci\u00f3n de Cl (Z=17)","respuesta":"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2 3p\u2075"},{"enunciado":"Configuraci\u00f3n de Fe (Z=26)","respuesta":"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2 3p\u2076 4s\u00b2 3d\u2076"},{"enunciado":"Excepci\u00f3n: Cr (Z=24)","respuesta":"[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075"},{"enunciado":"Principio de Hund en 2p\u00b3","respuesta":"Tres electrones \u2191 en orbitales separados"},{"enunciado":"Electr\u00f3n diferenciador de K","respuesta":"4s\u00b9"},{"enunciado":"Bloque de Zn","respuesta":"d (3d\u00b9\u2070)"},{"enunciado":"Configuraci\u00f3n de Mo (Z=42)","respuesta":"[Kr] 5s\u00b9 4d\u2075"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC: notaci\u00f3n abreviada","respuesta":"Usar gas noble anterior"},{"enunciado":"N\u00famero m\u00e1ximo e\u207b en n=3","respuesta":"18 (3s\u00b2 3p\u2076 3d\u00b9\u2070)"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Configuraci\u00f3n de He","opciones":["1s\u00b2","1s\u00b9","2s\u00b2","2p\u2076"],"correcta":"1s\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"Llenado por orden de...","opciones":["Energ\u00eda (Aufbau)","Aleatorio","Tama\u00f1o","Masa"],"correcta":"Energ\u00eda (Aufbau)"},{"pregunta":"Pauli permite m\u00e1ximo...","opciones":["2 e\u207b\/orbital","1 e\u207b\/orbital","3 e\u207b\/orbital","4 e\u207b\/orbital"],"correcta":"2 e\u207b\/orbital"},{"pregunta":"Hund dice llenar...","opciones":["Singly antes de parear","Parear primero","Aleatorio","Por masa"],"correcta":"Singly antes de parear"},{"pregunta":"Configuraci\u00f3n de Li","opciones":["1s\u00b2 2s\u00b9","1s\u00b9 2s\u00b2","1s\u00b3","2s\u00b9"],"correcta":"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b9"},{"pregunta":"Configuraci\u00f3n de N","opciones":["1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b3","1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2074","1s\u00b2 2s\u00b9 2p\u2074","1s\u00b3 2s\u00b2"],"correcta":"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"Subnivel s tiene...","opciones":["1 orbital","3 orbitales","5 orbitales","7 orbitales"],"correcta":"1 orbital"},{"pregunta":"Subnivel p tiene...","opciones":["3 orbitales","1 orbital","5 orbitales","7 orbitales"],"correcta":"3 orbitales"},{"pregunta":"Configuraci\u00f3n de Ne","opciones":["1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076","1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2075","1s\u00b2 2s\u00b9 2p\u2076","2s\u00b2 2p\u2076"],"correcta":"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076"},{"pregunta":"Gas noble anterior a Na","opciones":["Ne","He","Ar","Kr"],"correcta":"Ne"},{"pregunta":"Configuraci\u00f3n de Ar","opciones":["1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2 3p\u2076","1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2","1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 4s\u00b2","2p\u2076 3s\u00b2 3p\u2076"],"correcta":"1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2 3p\u2076"},{"pregunta":"Excepci\u00f3n Cr","opciones":["4s\u00b9 3d\u2075","4s\u00b2 3d\u2074","4s\u2070 3d\u2076","4s\u00b2 3d\u2075"],"correcta":"4s\u00b9 3d\u2075"},{"pregunta":"Excepci\u00f3n Cu","opciones":["4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070","4s\u00b2 3d\u2079","4s\u2070 3d\u00b9\u2070","4s\u00b2 3d\u00b9\u2070"],"correcta":"4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070"},{"pregunta":"Bloque de Ca","opciones":["s","p","d","f"],"correcta":"s"},{"pregunta":"Bloque de Fe","opciones":["d","s","p","f"],"correcta":"d"},{"pregunta":"Electr\u00f3n valencia de Al","opciones":["3s\u00b2 3p\u00b9","3s\u00b9","3p\u00b9","4s\u00b9"],"correcta":"3s\u00b2 3p\u00b9"},{"pregunta":"Configuraci\u00f3n abreviada de K","opciones":["[Ar] 4s\u00b9","[Ne] 4s\u00b9","[He] 4s\u00b9","[Kr] 4s\u00b9"],"correcta":"[Ar] 4s\u00b9"},{"pregunta":"Subnivel d tiene...","opciones":["5 orbitales","1 orbital","3 orbitales","7 orbitales"],"correcta":"5 orbitales"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e1ximo e\u207b en nivel n=2","opciones":["8","2","6","18"],"correcta":"8"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC: notaci\u00f3n orbital","opciones":["n l^{exponente}","n l","l n","exponente n"],"correcta":"n l^{exponente}"},{"pregunta":"Configuraci\u00f3n de Ag (Z=47)","opciones":["[Kr] 5s\u00b9 4d\u00b9\u2070","[Kr] 5s\u00b2 4d\u2079","[Kr] 4d\u00b9\u2070","[Ar] 5s\u00b9 4d\u00b9\u2070"],"correcta":"[Kr] 5s\u00b9 4d\u00b9\u2070"},{"pregunta":"Configuraci\u00f3n de Au (Z=79)","opciones":["[Xe] 6s\u00b9 4f\u00b9\u2074 5d\u00b9\u2070","[Xe] 6s\u00b2 4f\u00b9\u2074 5d\u2079","[Xe] 6s\u00b9 5d\u00b9\u2070","[Kr] 6s\u00b9 4f\u00b9\u2074 5d\u00b9\u2070"],"correcta":"[Xe] 6s\u00b9 4f\u00b9\u2074 5d\u00b9\u2070"},{"pregunta":"Subnivel f tiene...","opciones":["7 orbitales","5 orbitales","3 orbitales","1 orbital"],"correcta":"7 orbitales"},{"pregunta":"Configuraci\u00f3n de U (Z=92)","opciones":["[Rn] 7s\u00b2 5f\u00b3 6d\u00b9","[Rn] 7s\u00b2 5f\u2074","[Xe] 7s\u00b2 5f\u00b3 6d\u00b9","[Rn] 6d\u00b2 5f\u2074"],"correcta":"[Rn] 7s\u00b2 5f\u00b3 6d\u00b9"},{"pregunta":"N\u00famero cu\u00e1ntico l para d","opciones":["2","0","1","3"],"correcta":"2"},{"pregunta":"N\u00famero cu\u00e1ntico l para f","opciones":["3","2","1","0"],"correcta":"3"},{"pregunta":"Electr\u00f3n en 4p\u00b3 tiene n=","opciones":["4","3","2","1"],"correcta":"4"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e1ximo e\u207b en subnivel 4d","opciones":["10","2","6","14"],"correcta":"10"},{"pregunta":"Regla de Madelung predice...","opciones":["n + l menor primero","n mayor primero","l mayor primero","aleatorio"],"correcta":"n + l menor primero"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC permite excepciones por...","opciones":["Estabilidad electr\u00f3nica","Masa","Volumen","Color"],"correcta":"Estabilidad electr\u00f3nica"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"numeros-cuanticos-cyberpunk","titulo":"N\u00fameros Cu\u00e1nticos: El C\u00f3digo Secreto del Electr\u00f3n","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-quimica-numeros-cuanticos\" data-tema=\"numeros-cuanticos\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u269b<\/span>\r\n            N\u00daMEROS CU\u00c1NTICOS: EL C\u00d3DIGO DEL ELECTR\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Descifra la identidad cu\u00e1ntica de los electrones con <strong>n, l, m_l, m_s<\/strong>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Identificar los 4 n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Explicar el significado de <strong>n, l, m_l, m_s<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Relacionar n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos con orbitales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Asociar <strong>l=0,1,2,3<\/strong> con formas <strong>s, p, d, f<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar el Principio de Pauli<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Garantizar que ning\u00fan electr\u00f3n tenga los 4 n\u00fameros id\u00e9nticos<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Resolver configuraciones electr\u00f3nicas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Usar n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos para describir electrones en \u00e1tomos<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACIONES EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd2c Espectroscop\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Los n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos explican las l\u00edneas espectrales de los elementos<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Precisi\u00f3n: 10<sup>-10<\/sup> m<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udca1 Tecnolog\u00eda Cu\u00e1ntica<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Qubits en computadoras cu\u00e1nticas usan <strong>m_s<\/strong> para almacenar informaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Velocidad: 100x vs cl\u00e1sicas<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf0c Astrof\u00edsica<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Identificaci\u00f3n de elementos en estrellas mediante <strong>n<\/strong> y <strong>l<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Distancia: hasta 13.8 mil millones de a\u00f1os luz<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TABLA DE N\u00daMEROS CU\u00c1NTICOS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Los 4 N\u00fameros Cu\u00e1nticos<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-cyberpunk-container\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>S\u00edmbolo<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Nombre<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Valores posibles<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Describe<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Ejemplo<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>n<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Principal<\/td>\r\n                            <td>1, 2, 3, ... \u221e<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Nivel energ\u00e9tico (tama\u00f1o)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>n=2 \u2192 Capa L<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>l<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Azimutal<\/td>\r\n                            <td>0 a n-1<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Forma del orbital (s, p, d, f)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>l=1 \u2192 Orbital p<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>m_l<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Magn\u00e9tico<\/td>\r\n                            <td>-l ... 0 ... +l<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Orientaci\u00f3n espacial<\/td>\r\n                            <td>m_l=0 \u2192 Orbital p<sub>z<\/sub><\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>m_s<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Spin<\/td>\r\n                            <td>+1\/2, -1\/2<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Giro del electr\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                            <td>m_s=+1\/2 \u2192 Spin \"arriba\"<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                \\[\r\n                \\psi_{n,l,m_l}(r,\\theta,\\phi) \\cdot \\chi_{m_s}\r\n                \\]\r\n                <p><em>Funci\u00f3n de onda cu\u00e1ntica (orbital + spin)<\/em><\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- SUBNIVELES Y ORBITALES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Subniveles y Orbitales At\u00f3micos<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"orbitales-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"orbital-card\" data-tipo=\"s\">\r\n                    <div class=\"orbital-icon\">\ud83c\udf00<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>Orbital s (l=0)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Forma: <strong>Esf\u00e9rica<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <p>Orbitales: <strong>1<\/strong> (m_l=0)<\/p>\r\n                    <p>Electrones m\u00e1x: <strong>2<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"orbital-visual\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"80\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"40\" fill=\"rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.2)\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.4)\"\/>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"orbital-card\" data-tipo=\"p\">\r\n                    <div class=\"orbital-icon\">\ud83e\uddf2<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>Orbital p (l=1)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Forma: <strong>Dumbbell<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <p>Orbitales: <strong>3<\/strong> (m_l=-1,0,+1)<\/p>\r\n                    <p>Electrones m\u00e1x: <strong>6<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"orbital-visual\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"80\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\r\n                            <path d=\"M30,50 Q50,20 70,50 Q50,80 30,50\" fill=\"rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2)\" stroke=\"#00FFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                            <path d=\"M50,30 L50,70\" stroke=\"#00FFFF\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"orbital-card\" data-tipo=\"d\">\r\n                    <div class=\"orbital-icon\">\u2b50<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>Orbital d (l=2)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Forma: <strong>Doble dumbbell<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <p>Orbitales: <strong>5<\/strong> (m_l=-2,-1,0,+1,+2)<\/p>\r\n                    <p>Electrones m\u00e1x: <strong>10<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"orbital-visual\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"80\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\r\n                            <path d=\"M20,50 Q50,20 80,50 Q50,80 20,50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF00FF\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                            <path d=\"M50,20 L50,80\" stroke=\"#FF00FF\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                            <path d=\"M20,50 L80,50\" stroke=\"#FF00FF\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"orbital-card\" data-tipo=\"f\">\r\n                    <div class=\"orbital-icon\">\ud83c\udf00<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>Orbital f (l=3)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Forma: <strong>Compleja (multilobular)<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <p>Orbitales: <strong>7<\/strong> (m_l=-3,...+3)<\/p>\r\n                    <p>Electrones m\u00e1x: <strong>14<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"orbital-visual\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"80\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFF00\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"30\" r=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFF00\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"70\" r=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFF00\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                            <path d=\"M30,30 Q50,50 70,30\" stroke=\"#FFFF00\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"regla-destacada\">\r\n                \\[\r\n                \\text{N\u00famero de orbitales} = 2l + 1\r\n                \\]\r\n                \\[\r\n                \\text{Electrones m\u00e1x} = 2(2l + 1)\r\n                \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- EJEMPLOS PR\u00c1CTICOS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Ejemplos de Configuraciones Electr\u00f3nicas<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"ejemplos-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Electr\u00f3n en 1s<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>n=1, l=0, m_l=0, m_s=\u00b11\/2<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <p>Orbital: <strong>1s<\/strong> (esf\u00e9rico, nivel 1)<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-visual\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"60\" height=\"60\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"40\" fill=\"rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.1)\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"50\" y=\"50\" fill=\"#39FF14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">1s<\/text>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Electr\u00f3n en 2p<sub>x<\/sub><\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>n=2, l=1, m_l=-1, m_s=+1\/2<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <p>Orbital: <strong>2p<sub>x<\/sub><\/strong> (orientaci\u00f3n en eje x)<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-visual\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"60\" height=\"60\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\r\n                            <path d=\"M20,50 Q50,20 80,50 Q50,80 20,50\" fill=\"rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1)\" stroke=\"#00FFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"50\" y=\"50\" fill=\"#00FFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">2p<sub>x<\/sub><\/text>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Electr\u00f3n en 3d<sub>z\u00b2<\/sub><\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>n=3, l=2, m_l=0, m_s=-1\/2<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <p>Orbital: <strong>3d<sub>z\u00b2<\/sub><\/strong> (l\u00f3bulo a lo largo de z)<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-visual\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"60\" height=\"60\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\r\n                            <path d=\"M50,20 L50,80\" stroke=\"#FF00FF\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                            <path d=\"M20,50 L80,50\" stroke=\"#FF00FF\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF00FF\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"50\" y=\"50\" fill=\"#FF00FF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">3d<sub>z\u00b2<\/sub><\/text>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- REGLAS Y RESTRICCIONES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Reglas y Restricciones Cu\u00e1nticas<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"reglas-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"regla-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcdc Regla 1: Valores de <strong>n<\/strong><\/h4>\r\n                    <p>\\[ n \\geq 1 \\quad (\\text{Entero positivo}) \\]<\/p>\r\n                    <p>Ejemplo: n=1 (K), n=2 (L), n=3 (M), etc.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"regla-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcdc Regla 2: Valores de <strong>l<\/strong><\/h4>\r\n                    <p>\\[ 0 \\leq l \\leq n-1 \\]<\/p>\r\n                    <p>Ejemplo: Si n=2 \u2192 l=0 (s) o l=1 (p)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"regla-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcdc Regla 3: Valores de <strong>m_l<\/strong><\/h4>\r\n                    <p>\\[ -l \\leq m_l \\leq +l \\]<\/p>\r\n                    <p>Ejemplo: Si l=1 \u2192 m_l=-1, 0, +1<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"regla-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcdc Regla 4: Valores de <strong>m_s<\/strong><\/h4>\r\n                    <p>\\[ m_s = +\\frac{1}{2} \\quad \\text{o} \\quad -\\frac{1}{2} \\]<\/p>\r\n                    <p>Solo 2 valores posibles (spin \"arriba\" o \"abajo\")<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"regla-card pauli\">\r\n                    <h4>\u26a0\ufe0f Principio de Exclusi\u00f3n de Pauli<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Ning\u00fan electr\u00f3n puede tener los <strong>4 n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos id\u00e9nticos<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                    <p>Ejemplo: En un orbital <strong>1s<\/strong>, solo 2 electrones (m_s opuestos).<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                \\[\r\n                \\text{M\u00e1ximo de electrones en nivel } n = 2n^2\r\n                \\]\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-formula\">\r\n                    <p>n=1 \u2192 2(1)\u00b2 = <strong>2<\/strong> electrones<\/p>\r\n                    <p>n=2 \u2192 2(4) = <strong>8<\/strong> electrones<\/p>\r\n                    <p>n=3 \u2192 2(9) = <strong>18<\/strong> electrones<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: CONSTRUYE TU ORBITAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"orbital-builder\">\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd27 CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"nivelPrincipal\">Nivel principal (n):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"number\" id=\"nivelPrincipal\" min=\"1\" max=\"7\" value=\"2\" class=\"control-input\">\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"subnivel\">Subnivel (l):<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"subnivel\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"0\">s (l=0)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"1\">p (l=1)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"2\">d (l=2)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"3\">f (l=3)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"orientacion\">Orientaci\u00f3n (m_l):<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"orientacion\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"-1\">-1<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"0\" selected>0<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"1\">+1<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"spin\">Spin (m_s):<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"spin\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"+1\/2\">+1\/2 (\u2191)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"-1\/2\">-1\/2 (\u2193)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-generar\" onclick=\"generarOrbital()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> GENERAR ORBITAL\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"orbitalAleatorio()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> ORBITAL ALEATORIO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <div class=\"orbital-3d\" id=\"orbitalVisualizacion\">\r\n                    <svg id=\"orbitalSVG\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\">\r\n                        <!-- Orbital se genera aqu\u00ed -->\r\n                    <\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"orbital-info\" id=\"orbitalInfo\">\r\n                    <p>Selecciona los n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos y haz clic en <strong>GENERAR ORBITAL<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca DATOS DEL ORBITAL<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Notaci\u00f3n:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataNotacion\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Nivel (n):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataNivel\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Subnivel (l):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataSubnivel\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Orientaci\u00f3n (m_l):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataOrientacion\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Spin (m_s):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataSpin\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Electrones m\u00e1x:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataElectronesMax\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcc8 ESTAD\u00cdSTICAS<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Orbitales generados:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statOrbitales\">0<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Configuraciones v\u00e1lidas:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statValidas\">0<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: DOMINA LOS N\u00daMEROS CU\u00c1NTICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l de estos conjuntos de n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos es <strong>v\u00e1lido<\/strong>?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        n=2, l=2, m_l=0, m_s=+1\/2\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        n=3, l=1, m_l=-1, m_s=-1\/2\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        n=1, l=1, m_l=0, m_s=+1\/2\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        n=4, l=3, m_l=+4, m_s=-1\/2\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> n=3, l=1, m_l=-1, m_s=-1\/2 cumple todas las reglas.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa las restricciones para <strong>l<\/strong> y <strong>m_l<\/strong>.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> <strong>l<\/strong> debe ser < n, y <strong>m_l<\/strong> debe estar entre -l y +l.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1ntos electrones caben en el subnivel <strong>3d<\/strong>?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        2\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        6\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        10\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        14\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> 3d tiene <strong>5 orbitales<\/strong> \u00d7 2 electrones = 10.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Recuerda: n\u00famero de orbitales = 2l + 1.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>F\u00f3rmula:<\/strong> \\[ \\text{Electrones m\u00e1x} = 2(2l + 1) \\]<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTAS 3-30 (ejemplo) -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 describe el n\u00famero cu\u00e1ntico <strong>m_l<\/strong>?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Orientaci\u00f3n espacial del orbital\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Energ\u00eda del electr\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Forma del orbital\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Spin del electr\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> <strong>m_l<\/strong> define la orientaci\u00f3n.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> <strong>l<\/strong> describe la forma, <strong>n<\/strong> la energ\u00eda.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfc6 RESULTADOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                    Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/30\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                    Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR <strong>l<\/strong> CON <strong>m_l<\/strong><\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"Si l=2, entonces m_l puede ser -3, 0, +3\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> <strong>m_l<\/strong> solo va de <strong>-l<\/strong> a <strong>+l<\/strong>. Para l=2: m_l=-2,-1,0,+1,+2.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Practica:<\/strong> \u00bfQu\u00e9 valores de m_l son v\u00e1lidos si l=3?<\/p>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                            <strong>Respuesta:<\/strong> m_l = -3, -2, -1, 0, +1, +2, +3\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c OLVIDAR EL PRINCIPIO DE PAULI<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"Dos electrones en 1s pueden tener m_s=+1\/2\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Deben tener <strong>m_s<\/strong> opuestos (+1\/2 y -1\/2).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Configuraci\u00f3n Electr\u00f3nica<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Escribe la configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica del <strong>Carbono (Z=6)<\/strong> usando n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos para cada electr\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: 1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b2 \u2192 Detalla n, l, m_l, m_s para cada electr\u00f3n...\" rows=\"6\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1s\u00b2: n=1, l=0, m_l=0, m_s=+1\/2 y -1\/2<br>\r\n                    2s\u00b2: n=2, l=0, m_l=0, m_s=+1\/2 y -1\/2<br>\r\n                    2p\u00b2: n=2, l=1, m_l=-1 y 0 (o cualquier combinaci\u00f3n v\u00e1lida), m_s=+1\/2 o -1\/2\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>N\u00fameros Cu\u00e1nticos para 3p<sup>4<\/sup><\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Lista todos los conjuntos de n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos posibles para los electrones en <strong>3p<sup>4<\/sup><\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: n=3, l=1, m_l=-1, m_s=+1\/2...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    Todos los conjuntos deben tener:<br>\r\n                    n=3, l=1, m_l=-1,0,+1 (4 electrones, 2 por orbital con m_s opuestos)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica correcta<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Todos los electrones con n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos v\u00e1lidos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores menores en 1-2 electrones<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores graves en m\u00e1s de 2 electrones<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Aplicaci\u00f3n del Principio de Pauli<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Todos los electrones cumplen el principio<\/td>\r\n                    <td>1-2 violaciones del principio<\/td>\r\n                    <td>M\u00faltiples violaciones<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n de n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Habilidad para resolver configuraciones:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo crees que los n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos explican la diversidad de elementos en la tabla peri\u00f3dica?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Describe un ejemplo cotidiano donde los n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos sean relevantes (ej: colores en fuegos artificiales).<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (20 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar valores de <strong>n, l, m_l, m_s<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                            <li>Repasar formas de orbitales <strong>s, p, d, f<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                            <li>Practicar con el simulador<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 PR\u00c1CTICA (40 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Resolver 10 configuraciones electr\u00f3nicas<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Completar el quiz interactivo<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Analizar errores comunes<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/legacy\/build-an-atom\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83e\uddea Simulador PhET: Construye un \u00c1tomo\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.iupac.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcda IUPAC: Est\u00e1ndares de Nomenclatura Cu\u00e1ntica\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ SIMULADOR DE ORBITALES\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    const orbitalesGenerados = [];\r\n    let orbitalActual = null;\r\n\r\n    function generarOrbital() {\r\n        const n = parseInt(document.getElementById('nivelPrincipal').value);\r\n        const l = parseInt(document.getElementById('subnivel').value);\r\n        const m_l = parseInt(document.getElementById('orientacion').value);\r\n        const m_s = document.getElementById('spin').value;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Validar reglas cu\u00e1nticas\r\n        if (l >= n) {\r\n            alert(\"\u274c Error: l debe ser menor que n.\");\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n        if (Math.abs(m_l) > l) {\r\n            alert(`\u274c Error: m_l debe estar entre -${l} y +${l}.`);\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Generar notaci\u00f3n\r\n        const subniveles = ['s', 'p', 'd', 'f'];\r\n        const notacion = `${n}${subniveles[l]}`;\r\n        const electronesMax = 2 * (2 * l + 1);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n        document.getElementById('dataNotacion').textContent = notacion;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataNivel').textContent = n;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataSubnivel').textContent = subniveles[l];\r\n        document.getElementById('dataOrientacion').textContent = m_l;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataSpin').textContent = m_s;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataElectronesMax').textContent = electronesMax;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas\r\n        const statOrbitales = document.getElementById('statOrbitales');\r\n        statOrbitales.textContent = parseInt(statOrbitales.textContent) + 1;\r\n        document.getElementById('statValidas').textContent = parseInt(statValidas.textContent) + 1;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Dibujar orbital\r\n        dibujarOrbital(n, l, m_l, m_s);\r\n        orbitalActual = { n, l, m_l, m_s, notacion };\r\n        orbitalesGenerados.push(orbitalActual);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Feedback\r\n        document.getElementById('orbitalInfo').innerHTML = `\r\n            <p>\u2705 Orbital generado: <strong>${notacion}<\/strong> (n=${n}, l=${l}, m_l=${m_l}, m_s=${m_s})<\/p>\r\n            <p>Este orbital puede contener hasta <strong>${electronesMax}<\/strong> electrones.<\/p>\r\n        `;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function dibujarOrbital(n, l, m_l, m_s) {\r\n        const svg = document.getElementById('orbitalSVG');\r\n        svg.innerHTML = ''; \/\/ Limpiar SVG\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Colores seg\u00fan subnivel\r\n        const colores = {\r\n            0: '#39FF14', \/\/ s (verde)\r\n            1: '#00FFFF', \/\/ p (cian)\r\n            2: '#FF00FF', \/\/ d (magenta)\r\n            3: '#FFFF00'  \/\/ f (amarillo)\r\n        };\r\n        const color = colores[l] || '#FFFFFF';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Dibujar seg\u00fan tipo de orbital\r\n        if (l === 0) { \/\/ Orbital s (esfera)\r\n            const circle = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n            circle.setAttribute('cx', '100');\r\n            circle.setAttribute('cy', '100');\r\n            circle.setAttribute('r', '80');\r\n            circle.setAttribute('fill', 'none');\r\n            circle.setAttribute('stroke', color);\r\n            circle.setAttribute('stroke-width', '3');\r\n            circle.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', '5,5');\r\n            svg.appendChild(circle);\r\n\r\n            \/\/ N\u00facleo\r\n            const nucleo = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n            nucleo.setAttribute('cx', '100');\r\n            nucleo.setAttribute('cy', '100');\r\n            nucleo.setAttribute('r', '10');\r\n            nucleo.setAttribute('fill', color);\r\n            svg.appendChild(nucleo);\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Etiqueta\r\n            const texto = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'text');\r\n            texto.setAttribute('x', '100');\r\n            texto.setAttribute('y', '120');\r\n            texto.setAttribute('fill', color);\r\n            texto.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');\r\n            texto.setAttribute('font-size', '14');\r\n            texto.textContent = `${n}s`;\r\n            svg.appendChild(texto);\r\n\r\n        } else if (l === 1) { \/\/ Orbital p (dumbbell)\r\n            \/\/ Eje seg\u00fan m_l\r\n            let pathD;\r\n            if (m_l === 0) { \/\/ p_z\r\n                pathD = 'M100,20 Q120,80 100,180 Q80,80 100,20';\r\n            } else if (m_l === -1 || m_l === 1) { \/\/ p_x o p_y\r\n                pathD = 'M20,100 Q80,20 180,100 Q80,180 20,100';\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            const path = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'path');\r\n            path.setAttribute('d', pathD);\r\n            path.setAttribute('fill', 'none');\r\n            path.setAttribute('stroke', color);\r\n            path.setAttribute('stroke-width', '3');\r\n            svg.appendChild(path);\r\n\r\n            \/\/ N\u00facleo\r\n            const nucleo = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n            nucleo.setAttribute('cx', '100');\r\n            nucleo.setAttribute('cy', '100');\r\n            nucleo.setAttribute('r', '8');\r\n            nucleo.setAttribute('fill', color);\r\n            svg.appendChild(nucleo);\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Etiqueta\r\n            const texto = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'text');\r\n            texto.setAttribute('x', '100');\r\n            texto.setAttribute('y', '190');\r\n            texto.setAttribute('fill', color);\r\n            texto.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');\r\n            texto.setAttribute('font-size', '14');\r\n            texto.textContent = m_l === 0 ? `${n}p_z` : m_l === -1 ? `${n}p_x` : `${n}p_y`;\r\n            svg.appendChild(texto);\r\n\r\n        } else if (l === 2) { \/\/ Orbital d (complejo)\r\n            \/\/ Dibujar forma simplificada de d_z\u00b2\r\n            const path1 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'path');\r\n            path1.setAttribute('d', 'M100,20 L100,180');\r\n            path1.setAttribute('stroke', color);\r\n            path1.setAttribute('stroke-width', '3');\r\n            svg.appendChild(path1);\r\n\r\n            const path2 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'path');\r\n            path2.setAttribute('d', 'M20,100 Q100,20 180,100 Q100,180 20,100');\r\n            path2.setAttribute('fill', 'none');\r\n            path2.setAttribute('stroke', color);\r\n            path2.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');\r\n            svg.appendChild(path2);\r\n\r\n            \/\/ N\u00facleo\r\n            const nucleo = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n            nucleo.setAttribute('cx', '100');\r\n            nucleo.setAttribute('cy', '100');\r\n            nucleo.setAttribute('r', '8');\r\n            nucleo.setAttribute('fill', color);\r\n            svg.appendChild(nucleo);\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Etiqueta\r\n            const texto = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'text');\r\n            texto.setAttribute('x', '100');\r\n            texto.setAttribute('y', '190');\r\n            texto.setAttribute('fill', color);\r\n            texto.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');\r\n            texto.setAttribute('font-size', '14');\r\n            texto.textContent = `${n}d${m_l === 0 ? 'z\u00b2' : m_l === -1 ? 'xy' : m_l === 1 ? 'xz' : m_l === -2 ? 'yz' : 'x\u00b2-y\u00b2'}`;\r\n            svg.appendChild(texto);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function orbitalAleatorio() {\r\n        const n = Math.floor(Math.random() * 4) + 1; \/\/ 1-4\r\n        const l = Math.floor(Math.random() * n); \/\/ 0 a n-1\r\n        const m_l = Math.floor(Math.random() * (2 * l + 1)) - l; \/\/ -l a +l\r\n        const m_s = Math.random() > 0.5 ? '+1\/2' : '-1\/2';\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById('nivelPrincipal').value = n;\r\n        document.getElementById('subnivel').value = l;\r\n        document.getElementById('orientacion').value = m_l;\r\n        document.getElementById('spin').value = m_s;\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById('orbitalInfo').textContent =\r\n            `\ud83c\udfb2 Orbital aleatorio generado. Haz clic en \"GENERAR ORBITAL\".`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    let quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n                q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n            );\r\n            if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n                quizCompletado = true;\r\n                mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n        const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n        let feedback = \"\";\r\n        if (porcentaje >= 90) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83c\udf1f \u00a1Excelente! Dominas los n\u00fameros cu\u00e1nticos.\";\r\n        } else if (porcentaje >= 70) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero repasa los errores.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas estudiar m\u00e1s las reglas cu\u00e1nticas.\";\r\n        }\r\n        document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        quizRespuestas = [];\r\n        quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ ERRORES COMUNES\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    function toggleError(header) {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n\r\n        if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        } else {\r\n            content.style.display = 'block';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    function verificarProblema(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n        const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n        const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2)) \/ 2;\r\n\r\n        alert(`\ud83d\udcbe Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Comprensi\u00f3n: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Habilidad: ${slider2}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: N\u00fameros Cu\u00e1nticos - Cargada\");\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83c\udfae Simulador, Quiz y Herramientas interactivas listas\");\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"n describe","respuesta":"Nivel de energ\u00eda"},{"enunciado":"l = 0 es subnivel","respuesta":"s"},{"enunciado":"m_l para l=1","respuesta":"-1, 0, +1"},{"enunciado":"Valores posibles m_l en 3d","respuesta":"-2, -1, 0, +1, +2"},{"enunciado":"m_s solo permite","respuesta":"\u00b11\/2"},{"enunciado":"M\u00e1ximo e\u207b en n=3","respuesta":"18"},{"enunciado":"Electr\u00f3n en 4f: n=","respuesta":"4"},{"enunciado":"l para orbital f","respuesta":"3"},{"enunciado":"N\u00famero de orbitales en subnivel p","respuesta":"3"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC: m_s es","respuesta":"\u00b11\/2 (exacto)"},{"enunciado":"Principio Pauli implica","respuesta":"M\u00e1ximo 2 e\u207b por orbital"},{"enunciado":"Total combinaciones en n=2","respuesta":"8 (2s\u00b2 2p\u2076)"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"n puede ser","opciones":["1, 2, 3...","0","Negativo","Fracci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"1, 2, 3..."},{"pregunta":"l m\u00e1ximo para n=3","opciones":["2","3","1","0"],"correcta":"2"},{"pregunta":"m_l para l=0","opciones":["0","-1","+1","-1 a +1"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"m_s valores","opciones":["\u00b11\/2","0, \u00b11","-1 a +1","\u00b11"],"correcta":"\u00b11\/2"},{"pregunta":"Subnivel s tiene l=","opciones":["0","1","2","3"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"Subnivel d tiene l=","opciones":["2","0","1","3"],"correcta":"2"},{"pregunta":"N\u00famero de orbitales en p","opciones":["3","1","5","7"],"correcta":"3"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e1ximo e\u207b en 1 orbital","opciones":["2","1","3","4"],"correcta":"2"},{"pregunta":"Pauli dice que...","opciones":["Ning\u00fan e\u207b igual en 4 n\u00fameros","Todos iguales","Solo n igual","Solo l igual"],"correcta":"Ning\u00fan e\u207b igual en 4 n\u00fameros"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e1x e\u207b en n=1","opciones":["2","8","18","32"],"correcta":"2"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e1x e\u207b en n=4","opciones":["32","18","8","2"],"correcta":"32"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula m\u00e1x e\u207b por nivel","opciones":["2n\u00b2","n\u00b2","2n","n"],"correcta":"2n\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"l=3 es subnivel","opciones":["f","d","p","s"],"correcta":"f"},{"pregunta":"N\u00famero de orbitales en d","opciones":["5","3","1","7"],"correcta":"5"},{"pregunta":"m_l para 3p","opciones":["-1, 0, +1","-2 a +2","0","-3 a +3"],"correcta":"-1, 0, +1"},{"pregunta":"Electr\u00f3n en 3d puede tener m_l=","opciones":["-2","-3","+3","0 a 3"],"correcta":"-2"},{"pregunta":"Spin opuestos en orbital lleno","opciones":["+1\/2 y \u22121\/2","Ambos +1\/2","Ambos \u22121\/2","0"],"correcta":"+1\/2 y \u22121\/2"},{"pregunta":"n=2 tiene subniveles","opciones":["s, p","s, p, d","p, d","s"],"correcta":"s, p"},{"pregunta":"Total orbitales en n=3","opciones":["9","1","3","5"],"correcta":"9"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC: m_s es","opciones":["\u00b11\/2","\u00b11","0, \u00b11\/2","cualquier fracci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"\u00b11\/2"},{"pregunta":"Electr\u00f3n en 4f: l=","opciones":["3","2","1","0"],"correcta":"3"},{"pregunta":"m_l posibles en 4f","opciones":["7 valores","5 valores","3 valores","1 valor"],"correcta":"7 valores"},{"pregunta":"Total e\u207b en subnivel 4d","opciones":["10","14","6","2"],"correcta":"10"},{"pregunta":"Principio Pauli implica","opciones":["M\u00e1ximo 2 e\u207b por orbital","M\u00e1ximo 1 e\u207b por orbital","M\u00e1ximo 3 e\u207b","Ilimitado"],"correcta":"M\u00e1ximo 2 e\u207b por orbital"},{"pregunta":"Electr\u00f3n con n=1, l=0, m_l=0, m_s=+1\/2 est\u00e1 en","opciones":["1s","2s","1p","2p"],"correcta":"1s"},{"pregunta":"Cu\u00e1ntos electrones con n=3, l=1","opciones":["6","2","10","18"],"correcta":"6"},{"pregunta":"N\u00famero cu\u00e1ntico que define forma","opciones":["l","n","m_l","m_s"],"correcta":"l"},{"pregunta":"N\u00famero cu\u00e1ntico que define orientaci\u00f3n","opciones":["m_l","l","n","m_s"],"correcta":"m_l"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e1ximo n en \u00e1tomo de hidr\u00f3geno excitado","opciones":["Ilimitado (te\u00f3rico)","7","4","1"],"correcta":"Ilimitado (te\u00f3rico)"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC define m_s como","opciones":["\u00b1\u00bd (exacto)","\u00b11","0","variable"],"correcta":"\u00b1\u00bd (exacto)"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"principio-construccion-cyberpunk","titulo":"Principio de Construcci\u00f3n: El C\u00f3digo Aufbau y la Regla de la Lluvia","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-quimica-aufbau\" data-tema=\"principio-construccion\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83e\uddec<\/span>\r\n            PRINCIPIO DE CONSTRUCCI\u00d3N: EL C\u00d3DIGO AUFBAU\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Descubre c\u00f3mo los electrones llenan los orbitales siguiendo la <strong>Regla de la Lluvia<\/strong> y las <strong>excepciones cu\u00e1nticas<\/strong>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Explicar el Principio de Aufbau<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Entender el llenado de electrones por <strong>orden energ\u00e9tico<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar la Regla de la Lluvia<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Usar el <strong>diagrama diagonal<\/strong> para recordar el orden<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Calcular (n + l) con la Regla de Madelung<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Aplicar la f\u00f3rmula para predecir el orden de llenado<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Identificar excepciones comunes<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Reconocer casos como <strong>Cr, Cu, Ag, Mo<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACIONES EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd2c Espectroscop\u00eda At\u00f3mica<\/h3>\r\n                <p>El principio de Aufbau explica las l\u00edneas espectrales de los elementos<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Precisi\u00f3n: 10<sup>-10<\/sup> m<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udca1 Tecnolog\u00eda de Semiconductores<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Los electrones en orbitales <strong>d<\/strong> y <strong>f<\/strong> son clave en materiales avanzados<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Eficiencia: 99.99%<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf0c Astrof\u00edsica<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Identificaci\u00f3n de elementos en estrellas mediante configuraciones electr\u00f3nicas<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Distancia: hasta 13.8 mil millones de a\u00f1os luz<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- PRINCIPIO DE AUFBAU -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Principio de Aufbau<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <p>El <strong>principio de Aufbau<\/strong> (del alem\u00e1n \"construcci\u00f3n\") establece que los electrones llenan los orbitales en <strong>orden creciente de energ\u00eda<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    \\text{Energia: } 1s < 2s < 2p < 3s < 3p < 4s < 3d < 4p < 5s < 4d < 5p < 6s < 4f < 5d < 6p < 7s < 5f < 6d < 7p\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- REGLA DE LA LLUVIA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Regla de la Lluvia (Diagrama Diagonal)<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"diagrama-lluvia\">\r\n                <p>Se sigue el orden de las <strong>diagonales ascendentes<\/strong>:<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"diagrama-visual\">\r\n                    <pre class=\"diagrama-aufbau\">\r\n          7s\r\n        6p   6d   6f\r\n      5s   5p   5d   5f\r\n    4s   4p   4d   4f\r\n      3s   3p   3d\r\n        2s   2p\r\n          1s\r\n                    <\/pre>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"explicacion-diagrama\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Instrucciones:<\/strong> Sigue las flechas diagonales de abajo hacia arriba y de derecha a izquierda.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- REGLA DE MADELUNG -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Regla de Madelung (n + l)<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"regla-madelung\">\r\n                <p>El orden de llenado se predice con la suma <strong>(n + l)<\/strong>. Si hay empate, se prioriza el orbital con <strong>menor n<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplos-madelung\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-madelung\">\r\n                        <p><strong>4s:<\/strong> n=4, l=0 \u2192 n+l = 4<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>3d:<\/strong> n=3, l=2 \u2192 n+l = 5 \u2192 <strong>4s antes que 3d<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-madelung\">\r\n                        <p><strong>5s:<\/strong> n=5, l=0 \u2192 n+l = 5<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>4d:<\/strong> n=4, l=2 \u2192 n+l = 6 \u2192 <strong>5s antes que 4d<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    \\text{Orden: menor } (n + l) \\rightarrow \\text{menor } n\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- EXCEPCIONES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Excepciones Comunes<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"excepciones-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"excepcion-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Cromo (Cr)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n real:<\/strong> [Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Esperada:<\/strong> 4s\u00b2 3d\u2074<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Raz\u00f3n:<\/strong> Estabilidad de medio lleno (d\u2075)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"excepcion-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Cobre (Cu)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n real:<\/strong> [Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Esperada:<\/strong> 4s\u00b2 3d\u2079<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Raz\u00f3n:<\/strong> Estabilidad de lleno (d\u00b9\u2070)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"excepcion-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Molibdeno (Mo)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n real:<\/strong> [Kr] 5s\u00b9 4d\u2075<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Esperada:<\/strong> 5s\u00b2 4d\u2074<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Raz\u00f3n:<\/strong> Estabilidad de medio lleno (d\u2075)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"excepcion-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Plata (Ag)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n real:<\/strong> [Kr] 5s\u00b9 4d\u00b9\u2070<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Esperada:<\/strong> 5s\u00b2 4d\u2079<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Raz\u00f3n:<\/strong> Estabilidad de lleno (d\u00b9\u2070)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-excepciones\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>Elemento<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Configuraci\u00f3n Real<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Esperada<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Raz\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>Cr<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075<\/td>\r\n                            <td>4s\u00b2 3d\u2074<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Medio lleno d\u2075<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>Cu<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070<\/td>\r\n                            <td>4s\u00b2 3d\u2079<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Lleno d\u00b9\u2070<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>Mo<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>[Kr] 5s\u00b9 4d\u2075<\/td>\r\n                            <td>5s\u00b2 4d\u2074<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Estabilidad<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>Ag<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>[Kr] 5s\u00b9 4d\u00b9\u2070<\/td>\r\n                            <td>5s\u00b2 4d\u2079<\/td>\r\n                            <td>d lleno<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- BLOQUES DE LA TABLA PERI\u00d3DICA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>5. Bloques de la Tabla Peri\u00f3dica<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"bloques-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"bloque-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Bloque s<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Orbitales: <strong>1s, 2s, 3s, 4s, 5s, 6s, 7s<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <p>Elementos: <strong>Grupos 1-2 + He<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"bloque-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Bloque p<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Orbitales: <strong>2p, 3p, 4p, 5p, 6p, 7p<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <p>Elementos: <strong>Grupos 13-18<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"bloque-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Bloque d<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Orbitales: <strong>3d, 4d, 5d, 6d<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <p>Elementos: <strong>Metales de transici\u00f3n<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"bloque-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Bloque f<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Orbitales: <strong>4f, 5f<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <p>Elementos: <strong>Lant\u00e1nidos + Act\u00ednidos<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ejemplo-bloques\">\r\n                <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> <strong>K (Z=19)<\/strong> \u2192 1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2 3p\u2076 <strong>4s\u00b9<\/strong> \u2192 <strong>4s antes que 3d<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: CONSTRUYE TU CONFIGURACI\u00d3N ELECTR\u00d3NICA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"aufbau-builder\">\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd27 CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"numeroAtomico\">N\u00famero at\u00f3mico (Z):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"number\" id=\"numeroAtomico\" min=\"1\" max=\"118\" value=\"19\" class=\"control-input\">\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"metodoLlenado\">M\u00e9todo de llenado:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"metodoLlenado\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"aufbau\">Aufbau (Regla de la Lluvia)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"madelung\">Madelung (n + l)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label>\r\n                        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"mostrarExcepciones\" class=\"control-checkbox\">\r\n                        Considerar excepciones (Cr, Cu, etc.)\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-generar\" onclick=\"generarConfiguracion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> GENERAR CONFIGURACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"elementoAleatorio()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> ELEMENTO ALEATORIO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <div class=\"configuracion-diagrama\" id=\"configuracionDiagrama\">\r\n                    <div class=\"orbital-row\" id=\"orbital1s\">\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital-box\" data-orbital=\"1s\">1s<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"orbital-row\" id=\"orbital2s2p\">\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital-box\" data-orbital=\"2s\">2s<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital-box\" data-orbital=\"2p\">2p<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"orbital-row\" id=\"orbital3s3p3d\">\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital-box\" data-orbital=\"3s\">3s<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital-box\" data-orbital=\"3p\">3p<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital-box\" data-orbital=\"3d\">3d<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"orbital-row\" id=\"orbital4s4p4d4f\">\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital-box\" data-orbital=\"4s\">4s<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital-box\" data-orbital=\"4p\">4p<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital-box\" data-orbital=\"4d\">4d<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital-box\" data-orbital=\"4f\">4f<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"configuracion-info\" id=\"configuracionInfo\">\r\n                    <p>Ingresa un n\u00famero at\u00f3mico y haz clic en <strong>GENERAR CONFIGURACI\u00d3N<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca DATOS DE LA CONFIGURACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Elemento:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataElemento\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">N\u00famero at\u00f3mico (Z):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataNumeroAtomico\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataConfiguracion\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Bloque:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataBloque\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Electrones de valencia:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataElectronesValencia\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcc8 ESTAD\u00cdSTICAS<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Configuraciones generadas:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statConfiguraciones\">0<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Excepciones aplicadas:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statExcepciones\">0<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: DOMINA EL PRINCIPIO DE AUFBAU\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el orden correcto de llenado seg\u00fan la Regla de la Lluvia?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        1s \u2192 2p \u2192 2s \u2192 3s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        1s \u2192 2s \u2192 2p \u2192 3s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        2s \u2192 1s \u2192 2p \u2192 3s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        1s \u2192 2s \u2192 3s \u2192 2p\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> El orden es 1s \u2192 2s \u2192 2p \u2192 3s.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa el diagrama diagonal.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La Regla de la Lluvia sigue diagonales ascendentes.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica del <strong>Fe (Z=26)<\/strong>?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        [Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2074\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        [Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2076\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        [Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2076\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        [Ar] 3d\u2078\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Fe sigue el principio de Aufbau sin excepciones.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa el orden de llenado para Z=26.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Fe llena 4s\u00b2 antes que 3d\u2076.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 elemento tiene la configuraci\u00f3n [Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Cu (Z=29)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Zn (Z=30)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Ni (Z=28)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Co (Z=27)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Cu es una excepci\u00f3n con 4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa las excepciones comunes.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Cu prefiere llenar 3d\u00b9\u2070 por estabilidad.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfc6 RESULTADOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                    Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/30\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                    Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR EL ORDEN DE 3d Y 4s<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"El orbital 3d se llena antes que 4s\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Seg\u00fan la Regla de la Lluvia, <strong>4s<\/strong> se llena antes que <strong>3d<\/strong>.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Practica:<\/strong> \u00bfQu\u00e9 orbital se llena primero: 4s o 3d?<\/p>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                            <strong>Respuesta:<\/strong> 4s (n+l=4) antes que 3d (n+l=5).\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c OLVIDAR LAS EXCEPCIONES<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"El Cr (Z=24) tiene configuraci\u00f3n [Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2074\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Cr es una excepci\u00f3n: <strong>[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075<\/strong> por estabilidad de medio lleno.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Configuraci\u00f3n Electr\u00f3nica<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Escribe la configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica del <strong>N\u00edquel (Z=28)<\/strong> usando el Principio de Aufbau.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: 1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2 3p\u2076 4s\u00b2 3d\u2078...\" rows=\"4\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    [Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2078\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Excepci\u00f3n de Cromo<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Explica por qu\u00e9 el <strong>Cromo (Z=24)<\/strong> tiene la configuraci\u00f3n [Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075 en lugar de [Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2074.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Explica la raz\u00f3n de la excepci\u00f3n...\" rows=\"6\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    El Cr prefiere la configuraci\u00f3n 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075 porque un subnivel <strong>medio lleno (d\u2075)<\/strong> es m\u00e1s estable que 3d\u2074.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica correcta<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Todos los electrones en orbitales correctos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores menores en 1-2 electrones<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores graves en m\u00e1s de 2 electrones<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Explicaci\u00f3n de excepciones<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explica correctamente la estabilidad<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explicaci\u00f3n parcial o confusa<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No menciona la estabilidad<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n del Principio de Aufbau:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Habilidad para aplicar la Regla de Madelung:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo crees que el Principio de Aufbau influye en las propiedades qu\u00edmicas de los elementos?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Describe un ejemplo donde las excepciones al Aufbau sean importantes (ej: en cat\u00e1lisis o materiales).<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (20 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar el orden de llenado<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Repasar excepciones (Cr, Cu, Ag)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Practicar con el simulador<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 PR\u00c1CTICA (40 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Resolver 10 configuraciones electr\u00f3nicas<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Completar el quiz interactivo<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Analizar errores comunes<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/legacy\/build-an-atom\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83e\uddea Simulador PhET: Construye un \u00c1tomo\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ptable.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcda Tabla Peri\u00f3dica Interactiva\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ SIMULADOR DE CONFIGURACIONES ELECTR\u00d3NICAS\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    const elementos = {\r\n        1: { simbolo: \"H\", nombre: \"Hidr\u00f3geno\", configuracion: \"1s\u00b9\", bloque: \"s\", valencia: 1 },\r\n        2: { simbolo: \"He\", nombre: \"Helio\", configuracion: \"1s\u00b2\", bloque: \"s\", valencia: 2 },\r\n        3: { simbolo: \"Li\", nombre: \"Litio\", configuracion: \"[He] 2s\u00b9\", bloque: \"s\", valencia: 1 },\r\n        4: { simbolo: \"Be\", nombre: \"Berilio\", configuracion: \"[He] 2s\u00b2\", bloque: \"s\", valencia: 2 },\r\n        5: { simbolo: \"B\", nombre: \"Boro\", configuracion: \"[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b9\", bloque: \"p\", valencia: 3 },\r\n        6: { simbolo: \"C\", nombre: \"Carbono\", configuracion: \"[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b2\", bloque: \"p\", valencia: 4 },\r\n        7: { simbolo: \"N\", nombre: \"Nitr\u00f3geno\", configuracion: \"[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b3\", bloque: \"p\", valencia: 5 },\r\n        8: { simbolo: \"O\", nombre: \"Ox\u00edgeno\", configuracion: \"[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u2074\", bloque: \"p\", valencia: 6 },\r\n        9: { simbolo: \"F\", nombre: \"Fl\u00faor\", configuracion: \"[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u2075\", bloque: \"p\", valencia: 7 },\r\n        10: { simbolo: \"Ne\", nombre: \"Ne\u00f3n\", configuracion: \"[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076\", bloque: \"p\", valencia: 8 },\r\n        11: { simbolo: \"Na\", nombre: \"Sodio\", configuracion: \"[Ne] 3s\u00b9\", bloque: \"s\", valencia: 1 },\r\n        12: { simbolo: \"Mg\", nombre: \"Magnesio\", configuracion: \"[Ne] 3s\u00b2\", bloque: \"s\", valencia: 2 },\r\n        13: { simbolo: \"Al\", nombre: \"Aluminio\", configuracion: \"[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u00b9\", bloque: \"p\", valencia: 3 },\r\n        14: { simbolo: \"Si\", nombre: \"Silicio\", configuracion: \"[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u00b2\", bloque: \"p\", valencia: 4 },\r\n        15: { simbolo: \"P\", nombre: \"F\u00f3sforo\", configuracion: \"[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u00b3\", bloque: \"p\", valencia: 5 },\r\n        16: { simbolo: \"S\", nombre: \"Azufre\", configuracion: \"[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u2074\", bloque: \"p\", valencia: 6 },\r\n        17: { simbolo: \"Cl\", nombre: \"Cloro\", configuracion: \"[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u2075\", bloque: \"p\", valencia: 7 },\r\n        18: { simbolo: \"Ar\", nombre: \"Arg\u00f3n\", configuracion: \"[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u2076\", bloque: \"p\", valencia: 8 },\r\n        19: { simbolo: \"K\", nombre: \"Potasio\", configuracion: \"[Ar] 4s\u00b9\", bloque: \"s\", valencia: 1 },\r\n        20: { simbolo: \"Ca\", nombre: \"Calcio\", configuracion: \"[Ar] 4s\u00b2\", bloque: \"s\", valencia: 2 },\r\n        21: { simbolo: \"Sc\", nombre: \"Escandio\", configuracion: \"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u00b9\", bloque: \"d\", valencia: 3 },\r\n        22: { simbolo: \"Ti\", nombre: \"Titanio\", configuracion: \"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u00b2\", bloque: \"d\", valencia: 4 },\r\n        23: { simbolo: \"V\", nombre: \"Vanadio\", configuracion: \"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u00b3\", bloque: \"d\", valencia: 5 },\r\n        24: { simbolo: \"Cr\", nombre: \"Cromo\", configuracion: \"[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075\", bloque: \"d\", valencia: 6, excepcion: true },\r\n        25: { simbolo: \"Mn\", nombre: \"Manganeso\", configuracion: \"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2075\", bloque: \"d\", valencia: 7 },\r\n        26: { simbolo: \"Fe\", nombre: \"Hierro\", configuracion: \"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2076\", bloque: \"d\", valencia: 8 },\r\n        27: { simbolo: \"Co\", nombre: \"Cobalto\", configuracion: \"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2077\", bloque: \"d\", valencia: 9 },\r\n        28: { simbolo: \"Ni\", nombre: \"N\u00edquel\", configuracion: \"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2078\", bloque: \"d\", valencia: 10 },\r\n        29: { simbolo: \"Cu\", nombre: \"Cobre\", configuracion: \"[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070\", bloque: \"d\", valencia: 11, excepcion: true },\r\n        30: { simbolo: \"Zn\", nombre: \"Zinc\", configuracion: \"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u00b9\u2070\", bloque: \"d\", valencia: 12 },\r\n        \/\/ ... (hasta Z=118)\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    const excepciones = {\r\n        24: { configuracion: \"[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075\", razon: \"Estabilidad de medio lleno (d\u2075)\" },\r\n        29: { configuracion: \"[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070\", razon: \"Estabilidad de lleno (d\u00b9\u2070)\" },\r\n        42: { configuracion: \"[Kr] 5s\u00b9 4d\u2075\", razon: \"Estabilidad de medio lleno (d\u2075)\" },\r\n        47: { configuracion: \"[Kr] 5s\u00b9 4d\u00b9\u2070\", razon: \"Estabilidad de lleno (d\u00b9\u2070)\" }\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    let configuracionesGeneradas = 0;\r\n    let excepcionesAplicadas = 0;\r\n\r\n    function generarConfiguracion() {\r\n        const Z = parseInt(document.getElementById('numeroAtomico').value);\r\n        const metodo = document.getElementById('metodoLlenado').value;\r\n        const considerarExcepciones = document.getElementById('mostrarExcepciones').checked;\r\n\r\n        if (Z < 1 || Z > 118) {\r\n            alert(\"\u274c N\u00famero at\u00f3mico fuera de rango (1-118).\");\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Obtener configuraci\u00f3n\r\n        let elemento = elementos[Z];\r\n        let configuracion = elemento.configuracion;\r\n        let bloque = elemento.bloque;\r\n        let valencia = elemento.valencia;\r\n        let excepcionAplicada = false;\r\n\r\n        if (considerarExcepciones && excepciones[Z]) {\r\n            configuracion = excepciones[Z].configuracion;\r\n            excepcionAplicada = true;\r\n            excepcionesAplicadas++;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n        document.getElementById('dataElemento').textContent = `${elemento.simbolo} (${elemento.nombre})`;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataNumeroAtomico').textContent = Z;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataConfiguracion').textContent = configuracion;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataBloque').textContent = bloque;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataElectronesValencia').textContent = valencia;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas\r\n        configuracionesGeneradas++;\r\n        document.getElementById('statConfiguraciones').textContent = configuracionesGeneradas;\r\n        document.getElementById('statExcepciones').textContent = excepcionesAplicadas;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Resaltar orbitales en el diagrama\r\n        resaltarOrbitales(configuracion);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Feedback\r\n        const infoText = excepcionAplicada\r\n            ? `\u2705 Configuraci\u00f3n generada: <strong>${configuracion}<\/strong> (excepci\u00f3n aplicada).`\r\n            : `\u2705 Configuraci\u00f3n generada: <strong>${configuracion}<\/strong>.`;\r\n        document.getElementById('configuracionInfo').innerHTML = infoText;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function resaltarOrbitales(configuracion) {\r\n        \/\/ Limpiar resaltados previos\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.orbital-box').forEach(box => {\r\n            box.classList.remove('resaltado');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Resaltar orbitales seg\u00fan configuraci\u00f3n\r\n        const orbitales = configuracion.match(\/([1-7][spdf])(\\d+)\/g);\r\n        if (orbitales) {\r\n            orbitales.forEach(orbital => {\r\n                const orbitalBox = document.querySelector(`.orbital-box[data-orbital=\"${orbital.substring(0, 2)}\"]`);\r\n                if (orbitalBox) {\r\n                    orbitalBox.classList.add('resaltado');\r\n                }\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function elementoAleatorio() {\r\n        const Z = Math.floor(Math.random() * 118) + 1;\r\n        document.getElementById('numeroAtomico').value = Z;\r\n        document.getElementById('configuracionInfo').textContent =\r\n            `\ud83c\udfb2 Elemento aleatorio seleccionado (Z=${Z}). Haz clic en \"GENERAR CONFIGURACI\u00d3N\".`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    let quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n                q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n            );\r\n            if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n                quizCompletado = true;\r\n                mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n        const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n        let feedback = \"\";\r\n        if (porcentaje >= 90) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83c\udf1f \u00a1Excelente! Dominas el Principio de Aufbau.\";\r\n        } else if (porcentaje >= 70) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero repasa las excepciones.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas estudiar m\u00e1s el orden de llenado.\";\r\n        }\r\n        document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        quizRespuestas = [];\r\n        quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ ERRORES COMUNES\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    function toggleError(header) {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n\r\n        if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        } else {\r\n            content.style.display = 'block';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    function verificarProblema(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n        const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n        const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2)) \/ 2;\r\n\r\n        alert(`\ud83d\udcbe Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Comprensi\u00f3n: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Habilidad: ${slider2}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: Principio de Construcci\u00f3n - Cargada\");\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83c\udfae Simulador, Quiz y Herramientas interactivas listas\");\r\n<\/script>\r\n","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Orden de llenado b\u00e1sico","respuesta":"1s 2s 2p 3s 3p 4s 3d 4p"},{"enunciado":"Aufbau significa","respuesta":"Construcci\u00f3n (alem\u00e1n)"},{"enunciado":"Regla de la lluvia es","respuesta":"Diagrama diagonal"},{"enunciado":"Configuraci\u00f3n de K (Z=19)","respuesta":"[Ar] 4s\u00b9"},{"enunciado":"Configuraci\u00f3n de Ca (Z=20)","respuesta":"[Ar] 4s\u00b2"},{"enunciado":"Configuraci\u00f3n de Sc (Z=21)","respuesta":"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u00b9"},{"enunciado":"Excepci\u00f3n: Cr (Z=24)","respuesta":"[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075"},{"enunciado":"Excepci\u00f3n: Cu (Z=29)","respuesta":"[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070"},{"enunciado":"n + l para 4s","respuesta":"4"},{"enunciado":"n + l para 3d","respuesta":"5"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC: excepci\u00f3n permitida por","respuesta":"Estabilidad electr\u00f3nica"},{"enunciado":"Orden correcto: 5s vs 4d","respuesta":"5s antes que 4d"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Aufbau llena orbitales por...","opciones":["Energ\u00eda creciente","Energ\u00eda decreciente","Aleatorio","Masa"],"correcta":"Energ\u00eda creciente"},{"pregunta":"Regla de la lluvia es...","opciones":["Diagrama diagonal","Vertical","Horizontal","Circular"],"correcta":"Diagrama diagonal"},{"pregunta":"4s se llena antes que...","opciones":["3d","4p","5s","2p"],"correcta":"3d"},{"pregunta":"Excepciones al Aufbau ocurren por...","opciones":["Estabilidad","Tama\u00f1o","Color","Olor"],"correcta":"Estabilidad"},{"pregunta":"1s es el primer orbital en...","opciones":["Todos los \u00e1tomos","Solo H","Solo He","Metales"],"correcta":"Todos los \u00e1tomos"},{"pregunta":"Configuraci\u00f3n de Na","opciones":["[Ne] 3s\u00b9","[He] 3s\u00b9","[Ar] 3s\u00b9","3s\u00b9"],"correcta":"[Ne] 3s\u00b9"},{"pregunta":"Bloque s incluye...","opciones":["ns","np","nd","nf"],"correcta":"ns"},{"pregunta":"Bloque d comienza en...","opciones":["3d","1d","2d","4d"],"correcta":"3d"},{"pregunta":"Orden: 5s vs 4d","opciones":["5s antes","4d antes","Igual","Aleatorio"],"correcta":"5s antes"},{"pregunta":"Madelung usa...","opciones":["n + l","n - l","n \u00d7 l","n\u00b2"],"correcta":"n + l"},{"pregunta":"n + l para 4p","opciones":["5","4","6","3"],"correcta":"5"},{"pregunta":"n + l para 5s","opciones":["5","6","4","7"],"correcta":"5"},{"pregunta":"Configuraci\u00f3n de V (Z=23)","opciones":["[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u00b3","[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2074","[Ar] 4s\u00b3 3d\u00b2","[Ar] 3d\u2075"],"correcta":"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"Configuraci\u00f3n de Ni (Z=28)","opciones":["[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2078","[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2079","[Ar] 4s\u2070 3d\u00b9\u2070","[Ar] 4s\u00b3 3d\u2077"],"correcta":"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2078"},{"pregunta":"Excepci\u00f3n en bloque d","opciones":["Cr, Cu","Na, K","O, F","He, Ne"],"correcta":"Cr, Cu"},{"pregunta":"Bloque f comienza en...","opciones":["4f","3f","5f","2f"],"correcta":"4f"},{"pregunta":"Lantanoides son...","opciones":["4f","3d","5d","6p"],"correcta":"4f"},{"pregunta":"Act\u00ednidos son...","opciones":["5f","4f","6d","7p"],"correcta":"5f"},{"pregunta":"Orden correcto: 6s vs 5d","opciones":["6s antes","5d antes","Igual","Aleatorio"],"correcta":"6s antes"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC acepta excepciones por...","opciones":["Estabilidad cu\u00e1ntica","Regla estricta","Masa","Volumen"],"correcta":"Estabilidad cu\u00e1ntica"},{"pregunta":"Configuraci\u00f3n de Pt (Z=78)","opciones":["[Xe] 6s\u00b9 4f\u00b9\u2074 5d\u2079","[Xe] 6s\u00b2 4f\u00b9\u2074 5d\u2078","[Xe] 6s\u2070 4f\u00b9\u2074 5d\u00b9\u2070","[Xe] 6s\u00b9 4f\u00b9\u2074 5d\u2078"],"correcta":"[Xe] 6s\u00b9 4f\u00b9\u2074 5d\u2079"},{"pregunta":"Configuraci\u00f3n de Au (Z=79)","opciones":["[Xe] 6s\u00b9 4f\u00b9\u2074 5d\u00b9\u2070","[Xe] 6s\u00b2 4f\u00b9\u2074 5d\u2079","[Xe] 6s\u2070 4f\u00b9\u2074 5d\u00b9\u2070","[Xe] 6s\u00b9 5d\u00b9\u2070"],"correcta":"[Xe] 6s\u00b9 4f\u00b9\u2074 5d\u00b9\u2070"},{"pregunta":"Excepci\u00f3n en 5d","opciones":["Pt","Fe","Na","Cl"],"correcta":"Pt"},{"pregunta":"Regla Madelung falla en...","opciones":["Transici\u00f3n d y f","Gases nobles","Alcalinos","Hal\u00f3genos"],"correcta":"Transici\u00f3n d y f"},{"pregunta":"n + l para 4f","opciones":["7","6","5","4"],"correcta":"7"},{"pregunta":"n + l para 6s","opciones":["6","7","5","8"],"correcta":"6"},{"pregunta":"Orden: 5f vs 6d","opciones":["5f antes","6d antes","Igual","Aleatorio"],"correcta":"6d antes"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e1ximo Z sin excepci\u00f3n","opciones":["20 (Ca)","18 (Ar)","10 (Ne)","2 (He)"],"correcta":"20 (Ca)"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC permite...","opciones":["Configuraciones experimentales","Solo te\u00f3ricas","Ninguna","Solo s y p"],"correcta":"Configuraciones experimentales"},{"pregunta":"Regla de la lluvia es una...","opciones":["Mnemonica","Ley f\u00edsica","F\u00f3rmula","Ecuaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Mnemonica"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"electrones-valencia-cyberpunk","titulo":"Electrones de Valencia: El Secreto de la Reactividad Qu\u00edmica","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-quimica-valencia\" data-tema=\"electrones-valencia\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n            ELECTRONES DE VALENCIA: LA CLAVE DE LA REACTIVIDAD\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Descubre c\u00f3mo los electrones en la <strong>capa externa<\/strong> determinan enlaces, reacciones y propiedades qu\u00edmicas\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Definir electrones de valencia<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Identificar los electrones en la <strong>capa m\u00e1s externa<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar la Regla del Octeto<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Explicar c\u00f3mo los \u00e1tomos buscan <strong>8 electrones de valencia<\/strong><\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Relacionar valencia con reactividad<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Predecir si un elemento <strong>gana, pierde o comparte<\/strong> electrones<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar excepciones al octeto<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Identificar casos como <strong>Be, B, P, S<\/strong> y metales de transici\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACIONES EN LA VIDA REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd0b Bater\u00edas de Litio<\/h3>\r\n                <p>El <strong>Li<\/strong> (1 electr\u00f3n de valencia) pierde f\u00e1cilmente su electr\u00f3n para generar corriente<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Energ\u00eda: 150 Wh\/kg<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udca1 LEDs y Semiconductores<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Elementos como <strong>Si<\/strong> (4 valencia) y <strong>Ga<\/strong> (3 valencia) permiten la conducci\u00f3n controlada<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Eficiencia: 90% luz\/energ\u00eda<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83e\uddea Fertilizantes Qu\u00edmicos<\/h3>\r\n                <p>El <strong>N<\/strong> (5 valencia) y <strong>P<\/strong> (5 valencia) forman enlaces clave en compuestos org\u00e1nicos<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Producci\u00f3n: 200 millones de toneladas\/a\u00f1o<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfe5 Medicina Nuclear<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Is\u00f3topos como <strong>Tc-99m<\/strong> (7 valencia) se usan en diagn\u00f3sticos por su reactividad controlada<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Precisi\u00f3n: 99.5%<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- DEFINICI\u00d3N Y UBICACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. \u00bfQu\u00e9 son los Electrones de Valencia?<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <p>Son los electrones ubicados en la <strong>capa electr\u00f3nica m\u00e1s externa<\/strong> (mayor <strong>n<\/strong>) de un \u00e1tomo. Determinan:<\/p>\r\n                <ul class=\"lista-destacada\">\r\n                    <li><strong>Reactividad qu\u00edmica<\/strong> (ganar\/perder\/compartir electrones)<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>Tipo de enlaces<\/strong> (i\u00f3nicos, covalentes, met\u00e1licos)<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>Grupo en la tabla peri\u00f3dica<\/strong> (1\u201318)<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>Estado de oxidaci\u00f3n<\/strong> (cargas comunes)<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    \\text{Valencia} = e^- \\text{ en } ns + np \\quad (\\text{para grupos principales})\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ejemplo-visual\">\r\n                <div class=\"atom-visual\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nucleo\">Na<sup>+<\/sup><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"orbital orbital-3s\">\r\n                        <span class=\"electron\"><\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"leyenda\">Sodio (Z=11): 1 electr\u00f3n de valencia (3s<sup>1<\/sup>)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"atom-visual\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nucleo\">Cl<sup>-<\/sup><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"orbital orbital-3s\">\r\n                        <span class=\"electron\"><\/span><span class=\"electron\"><\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"orbital orbital-3p\">\r\n                        <span class=\"electron\"><\/span><span class=\"electron\"><\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"electron\"><\/span><span class=\"electron\"><\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"electron\"><\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"leyenda\">Cloro (Z=17): 7 electrones de valencia (3s<sup>2<\/sup>3p<sup>5<\/sup>)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- RELACI\u00d3N CON TABLA PERI\u00d3DICA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Valencia y la Tabla Peri\u00f3dica<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-valencia\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>Grupo<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Configuraci\u00f3n de Valencia<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Electrones de Valencia<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Ejemplo<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Reactividad<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>1 (IA)<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>ns<sup>1<\/sup><\/td>\r\n                            <td>1<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Na, K<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Pierden 1 e<sup>-<\/sup> \u2192 cationes +1<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>2 (IIA)<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>ns<sup>2<\/sup><\/td>\r\n                            <td>2<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Mg, Ca<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Pierden 2 e<sup>-<\/sup> \u2192 cationes +2<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>13 (IIIA)<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>ns<sup>2<\/sup>np<sup>1<\/sup><\/td>\r\n                            <td>3<\/td>\r\n                            <td>B, Al<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Pierden 3 e<sup>-<\/sup> o comparten<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>14 (IVA)<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>ns<sup>2<\/sup>np<sup>2<\/sup><\/td>\r\n                            <td>4<\/td>\r\n                            <td>C, Si<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Comparten 4 e<sup>-<\/sup> (enlaces covalentes)<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>15 (VA)<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>ns<sup>2<\/sup>np<sup>3<\/sup><\/td>\r\n                            <td>5<\/td>\r\n                            <td>N, P<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Ganan 3 e<sup>-<\/sup> o comparten<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>16 (VIA)<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>ns<sup>2<\/sup>np<sup>4<\/sup><\/td>\r\n                            <td>6<\/td>\r\n                            <td>O, S<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Ganan 2 e<sup>-<\/sup> \u2192 aniones -2<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>17 (VIIA)<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>ns<sup>2<\/sup>np<sup>5<\/sup><\/td>\r\n                            <td>7<\/td>\r\n                            <td>F, Cl<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Ganan 1 e<sup>-<\/sup> \u2192 aniones -1<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>18 (VIIIA)<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>ns<sup>2<\/sup>np<sup>6<\/sup><\/td>\r\n                            <td>8 (excepto He: 2)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>He, Ne, Ar<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Estables (octeto completo)<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"regla-destacada\">\r\n                \\[\r\n                \\text{Grupo} = \\text{Electrones de valencia} \\quad (\\text{para grupos 1\u20132 y 13\u201318})\r\n                \\]\r\n                <p><em>Excepci\u00f3n: He (Grupo 18) tiene 2 electrones de valencia<\/em><\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- REACTIVIDAD QU\u00cdMICA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Valencia y Reactividad Qu\u00edmica<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"reactividad-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"reactividad-card metales\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Metales (Grupos 1\u20133, 13)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Baja electronegatividad<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Pierden electrones<\/strong> \u2192 cationes (+)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Na<sup>+<\/sup>, Mg<sup>2+<\/sup>, Al<sup>3+<\/sup><\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-visual\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"100\" height=\"60\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 60\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#FF5252\" opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF1744\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"30\" y=\"35\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">Na<\/text>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"10\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF5252\">\r\n                                <animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"10;50\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                            <\/circle>\r\n                            <text x=\"70\" y=\"20\" fill=\"#FF5252\" font-size=\"10\">e<sup>-<\/sup> perdido<\/text>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"reactividad-card no-metales\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 No Metales (Grupos 15\u201317)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Alta electronegatividad<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ganan electrones<\/strong> \u2192 aniones (-)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> F<sup>-<\/sup>, O<sup>2-<\/sup>, N<sup>3-<\/sup><\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-visual\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"100\" height=\"60\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 60\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"30\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"30\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#2E7D32\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"70\" y=\"35\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">Cl<\/text>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"10\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF5252\">\r\n                                <animate attributeName=\"cx\" values=\"20;60\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                            <\/circle>\r\n                            <text x=\"30\" y=\"20\" fill=\"#FF5252\" font-size=\"10\">e<sup>-<\/sup> ganado<\/text>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"reactividad-card gases-nobles\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Gases Nobles (Grupo 18)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Octeto completo<\/strong> (8 e<sup>-<\/sup>)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>No reaccionan<\/strong> (estables)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> He, Ne, Ar<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-visual\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"100\" height=\"60\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 60\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"30\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#2196F3\" opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"30\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#1976D2\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"50\" y=\"35\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">Ar<\/text>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"15\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"10\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"15\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"10\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"15\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"25\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"30\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"35\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"50\" y=\"50\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">8 e<sup>-<\/sup> valencia<\/text>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"reactividad-card metales-transicion\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Metales de Transici\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Valencia variable<\/strong> (ns + (n-1)d)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Fe (2+, 3+), Cu (1+, 2+)<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-visual\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"100\" height=\"60\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 60\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#FF9800\" opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F57C00\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"30\" y=\"35\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">Fe<\/text>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"15\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF9800\">\r\n                                <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.3;1\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                            <\/circle>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"25\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF9800\">\r\n                                <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.3;1\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" begin=\"1s\"\/>\r\n                            <\/circle>\r\n                            <text x=\"70\" y=\"20\" fill=\"#FF9800\" font-size=\"10\">e<sup>-<\/sup> variables<\/text>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- REGLA DEL OCTETO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Regla del Octeto<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"octeto-container\">\r\n                <p>Los \u00e1tomos tienden a <strong>ganar, perder o compartir<\/strong> electrones para lograr <strong>8 electrones de valencia<\/strong> (configuraci\u00f3n de gas noble).<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    \\text{ns}^2 \\text{np}^6 \\quad (\\text{Octeto completo})\r\n                    \\]\r\n                    <p><em>Excepciones: H (2 e<sup>-<\/sup>), Be (4 e<sup>-<\/sup>), B (6 e<sup>-<\/sup>), P\/S (expansi\u00f3n de octeto)<\/em><\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplos-octeto\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-octeto\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Sodio (Na) + Cloro (Cl) \u2192 NaCl<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"reaccion-visual\">\r\n                            <svg width=\"200\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 100\">\r\n                                <!-- Na -->\r\n                                <circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"50\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#FF5252\" opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"50\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF1744\"\/>\r\n                                <text x=\"40\" y=\"55\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">Na<\/text>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF5252\" id=\"electron-na\">\r\n                                    <animate attributeName=\"cx\" values=\"30;100\" begin=\"1s\" dur=\"1s\" fill=\"freeze\"\/>\r\n                                <\/circle>\r\n                                <!-- Cl -->\r\n                                <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"50\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"50\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#2E7D32\"\/>\r\n                                <text x=\"160\" y=\"55\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">Cl<\/text>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"30\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF5252\" opacity=\"0\" id=\"electron-cl\">\r\n                                    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"2s\" dur=\"0.1s\" fill=\"freeze\"\/>\r\n                                <\/circle>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"30\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"50\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"70\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"70\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"50\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"30\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"20\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"\/>\r\n                                <!-- Flecha -->\r\n                                <path d=\"M80,50 L120,50\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowhead)\"\/>\r\n                                <text x=\"100\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#E0E0E0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">Transferencia<\/text>\r\n                            <\/svg>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <p><strong>Resultado:<\/strong> Na<sup>+<\/sup> [Ne] y Cl<sup>-<\/sup> [Ar] (ambos con octeto)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-octeto\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Ox\u00edgeno (O) + 2 Hidr\u00f3genos (H) \u2192 H\u2082O<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"reaccion-visual\">\r\n                            <svg width=\"250\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 250 120\">\r\n                                <!-- O -->\r\n                                <circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"60\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#FF9800\" opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"60\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#F57C00\"\/>\r\n                                <text x=\"125\" y=\"65\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">O<\/text>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF9800\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF9800\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"80\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF9800\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"80\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF9800\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF9800\" opacity=\"0\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"60\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF9800\" opacity=\"0\"\/>\r\n                                <!-- H -->\r\n                                <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"30\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#2196F3\" opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"30\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#2196F3\"\/>\r\n                                <text x=\"50\" y=\"35\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">H<\/text>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"30\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#2196F3\" opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"30\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#2196F3\"\/>\r\n                                <text x=\"200\" y=\"35\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">H<\/text>\r\n                                <!-- Enlaces -->\r\n                                <path d=\"M60,30 L110,50\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,2\"\/>\r\n                                <path d=\"M190,30 L140,50\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,2\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF9800\">\r\n                                    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"1s\" dur=\"0.1s\" fill=\"freeze\"\/>\r\n                                <\/circle>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"60\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF9800\">\r\n                                    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"1s\" dur=\"0.1s\" fill=\"freeze\"\/>\r\n                                <\/circle>\r\n                            <\/svg>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <p><strong>Resultado:<\/strong> O (8 e<sup>-<\/sup>) y cada H (2 e<sup>-<\/sup>) cumplen sus reglas<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- VALENCIA EN BLOQUES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>5. Valencia en los Bloques de la Tabla Peri\u00f3dica<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"bloques-valencia\">\r\n                <div class=\"bloque-valencia bloque-s\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Bloque s<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n:<\/strong> ns<sup>1\u20132<\/sup><\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Electrones de valencia:<\/strong> 1\u20132<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Li (1), Be (2), Na (1), Mg (2)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Reactividad:<\/strong> Pierden electrones \u2192 cationes<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"bloque-valencia bloque-p\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Bloque p<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n:<\/strong> ns<sup>2<\/sup>np<sup>1\u20136<\/sup><\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Electrones de valencia:<\/strong> 3\u20138<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> B (3), C (4), N (5), O (6), F (7), Ne (8)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Reactividad:<\/strong> Ganan\/comparten electrones<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"bloque-valencia bloque-d\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Bloque d<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n:<\/strong> (n-1)d<sup>1\u201310<\/sup> ns<sup>0\u20132<\/sup><\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Electrones de valencia:<\/strong> Variable (1\u201312)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Fe (2, 3), Cu (1, 2), Zn (2)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Reactividad:<\/strong> Estados de oxidaci\u00f3n m\u00faltiples<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"bloque-valencia bloque-f\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Bloque f<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n:<\/strong> (n-2)f<sup>1\u201314<\/sup> (n-1)d<sup>0\u20131<\/sup> ns<sup>2<\/sup><\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Electrones de valencia:<\/strong> 3 (normalmente)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Ce (3, 4), U (3\u20136)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Reactividad:<\/strong> Comportamiento complejo<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-bloques\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>Bloque<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Orbitales de Valencia<\/th>\r\n                            <th>N\u00b0 de Electrones<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Ejemplo<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Comportamiento<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>s<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>ns<\/td>\r\n                            <td>1\u20132<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Na (1), Mg (2)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Pierden e<sup>-<\/sup> \u2192 cationes<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>p<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>ns, np<\/td>\r\n                            <td>3\u20138<\/td>\r\n                            <td>C (4), O (6), Ne (8)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Ganan\/comparten e<sup>-<\/sup><\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>d<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>(n-1)d, ns<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Variable (1\u201312)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Fe (2,3), Cu (1,2)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>M\u00faltiples estados de oxidaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>f<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>(n-2)f, (n-1)d, ns<\/td>\r\n                            <td>3 (com\u00fan)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Ce (3,4), U (3\u20136)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Qu\u00edmica compleja<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- EXCEPCIONES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>6. Excepciones a la Regla del Octeto<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"excepciones-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"excepcion-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Hidr\u00f3geno (H)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n:<\/strong> 1s<sup>1<\/sup><\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Electrones de valencia:<\/strong> 1<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Regla:<\/strong> Forma enlaces para tener <strong>2 e<sup>-<\/sup><\/strong> (dueto)<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-visual\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"100\" height=\"60\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 60\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#2196F3\" opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#2196F3\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"30\" y=\"35\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">H<\/text>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"30\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF5252\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                                <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"0.5s\" dur=\"0.1s\" fill=\"freeze\"\/>\r\n                            <\/circle>\r\n                            <text x=\"70\" y=\"35\" fill=\"#FF5252\" font-size=\"10\">+1 e<sup>-<\/sup> \u2192 H<sup>-<\/sup> (2 e<sup>-<\/sup>)<\/text>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"excepcion-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Berilio (Be) y Boro (B)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Be: 2s<sup>2<\/sup>, B: 2s<sup>2<\/sup>2p<sup>1<\/sup><\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Electrones de valencia:<\/strong> Be: 2, B: 3<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Regla:<\/strong> Forman compuestos con <strong>menos de 8 e<sup>-<\/sup><\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-visual\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"120\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 80\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"40\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#FF9800\" opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"40\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F57C00\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"40\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">Be<\/text>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"25\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF9800\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"55\" cy=\"25\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF9800\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"40\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#FF9800\" font-size=\"10\">4 e<sup>-<\/sup> en BeCl<sub>2<\/sub><\/text>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"excepcion-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 F\u00f3sforo (P) y Azufre (S)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n:<\/strong> P: 3s<sup>2<\/sup>3p<sup>3<\/sup>, S: 3s<sup>2<\/sup>3p<sup>4<\/sup><\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Electrones de valencia:<\/strong> P: 5, S: 6<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Regla:<\/strong> Pueden <strong>expandir el octeto<\/strong> usando orbitales d<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-visual\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"120\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 80\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"40\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"40\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#2E7D32\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"60\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">P<\/text>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"45\" cy=\"25\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"75\" cy=\"25\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"45\" cy=\"55\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"75\" cy=\"55\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                                <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"0.5s\" dur=\"0.1s\" fill=\"freeze\"\/>\r\n                            <\/circle>\r\n                            <text x=\"60\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" font-size=\"10\">10 e<sup>-<\/sup> en PCl<sub>5<\/sub><\/text>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"excepcion-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Metales de Transici\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n:<\/strong> (n-1)d<sup>x<\/sup> ns<sup>y<\/sup><\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Electrones de valencia:<\/strong> Variable (ns + (n-1)d)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Regla:<\/strong> Pueden tener <strong>m\u00e1s de 8 e<sup>-<\/sup><\/strong> en su capa de valencia<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-visual\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"120\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 80\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"40\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\" opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"40\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#4A148C\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"60\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">Fe<\/text>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"45\" cy=\"20\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"75\" cy=\"20\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"45\" cy=\"60\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"75\" cy=\"60\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"15\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                                <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"0.5s\" dur=\"0.1s\" fill=\"freeze\"\/>\r\n                            <\/circle>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"65\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                                <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"0.7s\" dur=\"0.1s\" fill=\"freeze\"\/>\r\n                            <\/circle>\r\n                            <text x=\"60\" y=\"75\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\" font-size=\"10\">Variable: Fe<sup>2+<\/sup>\/Fe<sup>3+<\/sup><\/text>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: ELECTRONES DE VALENCIA Y ENLACES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"valencia-simulator\">\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd27 CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"elementoSelect\">Selecciona un elemento:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"elementoSelect\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"H\">Hidr\u00f3geno (H)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"He\">Helio (He)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Li\">Litio (Li)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Be\">Berilio (Be)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"B\">Boro (B)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"C\" selected>Carbono (C)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"N\">Nitr\u00f3geno (N)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"O\">Ox\u00edgeno (O)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"F\">Fl\u00faor (F)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Ne\">Ne\u00f3n (Ne)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Na\">Sodio (Na)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Mg\">Magnesio (Mg)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Al\">Aluminio (Al)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Si\">Silicio (Si)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"P\">F\u00f3sforo (P)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"S\">Azufre (S)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Cl\">Cloro (Cl)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Ar\">Arg\u00f3n (Ar)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Fe\">Hierro (Fe)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Cu\">Cobre (Cu)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Zn\">Zinc (Zn)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"enlaceSelect\">Tipo de enlace a simular:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"enlaceSelect\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"ionico\">I\u00f3nico (NaCl)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"covalente\">Covalente (H\u2082O)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"metalico\">Met\u00e1lico (Fe)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"octeto\">Expansi\u00f3n de octeto (PCl\u2085)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label>\r\n                        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"mostrarOcteto\" class=\"control-checkbox\" checked>\r\n                        Resaltar cumplimiento del octeto\r\n                    <\/label>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-simular\" onclick=\"simularValencia()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> SIMULAR VALENCIA\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"elementoAleatorio()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> ELEMENTO ALEATORIO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <div class=\"atom-visualizacion\" id=\"atomVisualizacion\">\r\n                    <svg id=\"atomSVG\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\">\r\n                        <!-- \u00c1tomo se dibuja aqu\u00ed -->\r\n                        <defs>\r\n                            <marker id=\"arrowhead\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                                <polygon points=\"0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7\" fill=\"#E0E0E0\"\/>\r\n                            <\/marker>\r\n                        <\/defs>\r\n                    <\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"simulacion-info\" id=\"simulacionInfo\">\r\n                    <p>Selecciona un elemento y un tipo de enlace, luego haz clic en <strong>SIMULAR VALENCIA<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca DATOS DE LA SIMULACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Elemento:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataElemento\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">S\u00edmbolo:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataSimbolo\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataConfiguracion\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Electrones de valencia:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataValencia\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Grupo\/Per\u00edodo:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataGrupoPeriodo\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Tipo de enlace simulado:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTipoEnlace\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Cumple octeto:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataOcteto\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcc8 ESTAD\u00cdSTICAS<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Simulaciones realizadas:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statSimulaciones\">0<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Octetos completos:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statOctetos\">0<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Excepciones encontradas:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statExcepciones\">0<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: DOMINA LOS ELECTRONES DE VALENCIA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1ntos electrones de valencia tiene el <strong>Carbono (C)<\/strong>?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        1\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        2\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        4\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        6\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> El carbono tiene <strong>4 electrones de valencia<\/strong> (2s\u00b2 2p\u00b2).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica del carbono.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Los electrones de valencia son los del nivel m\u00e1s alto: 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b2 \u2192 4 e<sup>-<\/sup>.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 elemento tiene <strong>5 electrones de valencia<\/strong>?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Berilio (Be)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        F\u00f3sforo (P)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Ox\u00edgeno (O)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Fl\u00faor (F)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> El f\u00f3sforo (P) tiene <strong>5 electrones de valencia<\/strong> (3s\u00b2 3p\u00b3).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la tabla peri\u00f3dica: Grupo 15 = 5 e<sup>-<\/sup> de valencia.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 afirmaci\u00f3n sobre la <strong>Regla del Octeto<\/strong> es <strong>falsa<\/strong>?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Los \u00e1tomos buscan 8 electrones de valencia.\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        El hidr\u00f3geno busca 2 electrones (dueto).\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        El berilio puede formar compuestos con 4 electrones.\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Todos los elementos siguen estrictamente el octeto.\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Hay <strong>excepciones<\/strong> como Be, B, P, S y metales de transici\u00f3n.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa las excepciones a la Regla del Octeto.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTAS 4-30 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">04<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 tipo de enlace forma el <strong>Sodio (Na)<\/strong>?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        I\u00f3nico (pierde 1 e<sup>-<\/sup>)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Covalente (comparte 1 e<sup>-<\/sup>)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Met\u00e1lico\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        No forma enlaces\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> El sodio (Grupo 1) <strong>pierde 1 electr\u00f3n<\/strong> para formar Na<sup>+<\/sup>.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        <strong>\u274c Incorrecto:<\/strong> Los metales alcalinos forman enlaces i\u00f3nicos.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfc6 RESULTADOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                    Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/30\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                    Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR VALENCIA CON N\u00daMERO DE OXIDACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"El hierro (Fe) siempre tiene 2 electrones de valencia\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Los electrones de valencia del Fe son <strong>8<\/strong> (4s\u00b2 3d\u2076), pero su n\u00famero de oxidaci\u00f3n puede ser +2 o +3.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Practica:<\/strong> \u00bfCu\u00e1ntos electrones de valencia tiene el Fe en Fe<sup>3+<\/sup>?<\/p>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                            <strong>Respuesta:<\/strong> 5 electrones de valencia (4s\u00b2 3d\u2076 \u2192 pierde 3 e<sup>-<\/sup>).\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c OLVIDAR LAS EXCEPCIONES AL OCTETO<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"El f\u00f3sforo (P) siempre forma 3 enlaces covalentes\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El P puede formar <strong>5 enlaces<\/strong> (ej: PCl\u2085) usando orbitales d.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                        <table>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <th>Elemento<\/th>\r\n                                <th>Excepci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n                                <th>Ejemplo<\/th>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td>H<\/td>\r\n                                <td>Dueto (2 e<sup>-<\/sup>)<\/td>\r\n                                <td>H<sub>2<\/sub>O<\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td>Be<\/td>\r\n                                <td>4 e<sup>-<\/sup> (BeCl<sub>2<\/sub>)<\/td>\r\n                                <td>BeF<sub>2<\/sub><\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td>P<\/td>\r\n                                <td>10 e<sup>-<\/sup> (PCl<sub>5<\/sub>)<\/td>\r\n                                <td>PF<sub>5<\/sub><\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                        <\/table>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR GRUPO CON ELECTRONES DE VALENCIA EN METAL DE TRANSICI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"El cobre (Cu) tiene 11 electrones de valencia porque est\u00e1 en el Grupo 11\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Los metales de transici\u00f3n tienen electrones de valencia en <strong>ns + (n-1)d<\/strong>. El Cu tiene 11 electrones en total, pero solo <strong>1 electr\u00f3n de valencia<\/strong> en su estado fundamental (4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Electrones de Valencia y Enlace<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Para cada elemento, determina:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>N\u00famero de electrones de valencia.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Tipo de enlace que forma (i\u00f3nico, covalente, met\u00e1lico).<\/li>\r\n                        <li>F\u00f3rmula del compuesto con cloro (Cl).<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p><strong>Elementos:<\/strong> Na, Mg, Al, C, N, O, F<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo:\r\nNa: 1 e\u207b valencia, enlace i\u00f3nico, NaCl\r\nMg: ...\" rows=\"10\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    <strong>Na:<\/strong> 1 e<sup>-<\/sup>, i\u00f3nico, NaCl<br>\r\n                    <strong>Mg:<\/strong> 2 e<sup>-<\/sup>, i\u00f3nico, MgCl<sub>2<\/sub><br>\r\n                    <strong>Al:<\/strong> 3 e<sup>-<\/sup>, i\u00f3nico, AlCl<sub>3<\/sub><br>\r\n                    <strong>C:<\/strong> 4 e<sup>-<\/sup>, covalente, CCl<sub>4<\/sub><br>\r\n                    <strong>N:<\/strong> 5 e<sup>-<\/sup>, covalente, NCl<sub>3<\/sub><br>\r\n                    <strong>O:<\/strong> 6 e<sup>-<\/sup>, covalente, OCl<sub>2<\/sub> (no existe, forma Cl<sub>2<\/sub>O)<br>\r\n                    <strong>F:<\/strong> 7 e<sup>-<\/sup>, covalente, FCl (pero F es m\u00e1s electronegativo, no se forma)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Excepciones a la Regla del Octeto<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Explica por qu\u00e9 los siguientes compuestos son excepciones a la Regla del Octeto y dibuja sus estructuras de Lewis:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>BeCl<sub>2<\/sub><\/li>\r\n                        <li>BF<sub>3<\/sub><\/li>\r\n                        <li>PCl<sub>5<\/sub><\/li>\r\n                        <li>SF<sub>6<\/sub><\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo:\r\nBeCl\u2082: Be tiene solo 4 e\u207b en su capa de valencia (2 pares de electrones compartidos)...\r\n\" rows=\"12\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    <strong>BeCl\u2082:<\/strong> Be tiene 2 e<sup>-<\/sup> de valencia y forma 2 enlaces simples con Cl. Solo 4 e<sup>-<\/sup> en su capa de valencia.<br>\r\n                    <strong>BF\u2083:<\/strong> B tiene 3 e<sup>-<\/sup> de valencia y forma 3 enlaces simples con F. Solo 6 e<sup>-<\/sup> en su capa de valencia.<br>\r\n                    <strong>PCl\u2085:<\/strong> P usa orbitales d para expandir su octeto, formando 5 enlaces con Cl (10 e<sup>-<\/sup> en su capa de valencia).<br>\r\n                    <strong>SF\u2086:<\/strong> S usa orbitales d para formar 6 enlaces con F (12 e<sup>-<\/sup> en su capa de valencia).\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P3<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Predicci\u00f3n de Enlaces<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Predice el tipo de enlace y la f\u00f3rmula del compuesto formado entre:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Calcio (Ca) y Ox\u00edgeno (O)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Aluminio (Al) y Fl\u00faor (F)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Carbono (C) y Hidr\u00f3geno (H)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Hierro (Fe) y Azufre (S)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Justifica tu respuesta en t\u00e9rminos de electrones de valencia y la Regla del Octeto.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo:\r\nCa y O: Ca tiene 2 e\u207b de valencia (pierde 2), O tiene 6 e\u207b (gana 2) \u2192 enlace i\u00f3nico, CaO.\r\n...\" rows=\"10\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(3)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP3\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    <strong>Ca y O:<\/strong> Ca (2 e<sup>-<\/sup>) + O (6 e<sup>-<\/sup>) \u2192 Ca<sup>2+<\/sup>O<sup>2-<\/sup> (i\u00f3nico).<br>\r\n                    <strong>Al y F:<\/strong> Al (3 e<sup>-<\/sup>) + 3F (7 e<sup>-<\/sup> cada uno) \u2192 AlF<sub>3<\/sub> (i\u00f3nico).<br>\r\n                    <strong>C y H:<\/strong> C (4 e<sup>-<\/sup>) + 4H (1 e<sup>-<\/sup> cada uno) \u2192 CH<sub>4<\/sub> (covalente, C cumple octeto).<br>\r\n                    <strong>Fe y S:<\/strong> Fe (variable, com\u00fanmente 2 o 3 e<sup>-<\/sup>) + S (6 e<sup>-<\/sup>) \u2192 FeS o Fe<sub>2<\/sub>S<sub>3<\/sub> (i\u00f3nico, dependiendo del estado de oxidaci\u00f3n del Fe).\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Identificaci\u00f3n correcta de electrones de valencia<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Todos los electrones de valencia identificados correctamente<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores menores en 1-2 elementos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores graves en m\u00e1s de 2 elementos<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Aplicaci\u00f3n de la Regla del Octeto<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explica correctamente el octeto y sus excepciones<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explicaci\u00f3n parcial o confusa<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No menciona el octeto o sus excepciones<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Predicci\u00f3n de enlaces y f\u00f3rmulas<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Predice correctamente todos los enlaces y f\u00f3rmulas<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Predice la mayor\u00eda, con algunos errores<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores graves en la predicci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n de electrones de valencia:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Aplicaci\u00f3n de la Regla del Octeto:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Identificaci\u00f3n de excepciones:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo crees que la comprensi\u00f3n de los electrones de valencia puede ayudarte a predecir las propiedades de nuevos materiales?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Describe un ejemplo de tu vida cotidiana donde los electrones de valencia sean cruciales (ej: bater\u00edas, medicinas, alimentos).<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (20 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar electrones de valencia por grupo<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Repasar Regla del Octeto y excepciones<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Practicar con el simulador<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 PR\u00c1CTICA (40 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Resolver 10 configuraciones de valencia<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Completar el quiz interactivo<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Dibujar estructuras de Lewis<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (60 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Investigar aplicaciones de excepciones al octeto<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Analizar tablas de electronegatividad<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Resolver problemas tipo examen<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/legacy\/build-an-atom\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83e\uddea Simulador PhET: Construye un \u00c1tomo\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ptable.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcda Tabla Peri\u00f3dica Interactiva con Electrones de Valencia\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/molview.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udd2c MolView: Dibuja Estructuras de Lewis\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/science\/chemistry\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udf93 Khan Academy: Enlaces Qu\u00edmicos\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ BASE DE DATOS DE ELEMENTOS\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    const elementos = {\r\n        H: {\r\n            nombre: \"Hidr\u00f3geno\", simbolo: \"H\", Z: 1,\r\n            configuracion: \"1s\u00b9\", valencia: 1, grupo: 1, periodo: 1,\r\n            bloque: \"s\", octeto: false, excepcion: \"Dueto (2 e\u207b)\"\r\n        },\r\n        He: {\r\n            nombre: \"Helio\", simbolo: \"He\", Z: 2,\r\n            configuracion: \"1s\u00b2\", valencia: 2, grupo: 18, periodo: 1,\r\n            bloque: \"s\", octeto: true, excepcion: \"Octeto completo (2 e\u207b)\"\r\n        },\r\n        Li: {\r\n            nombre: \"Litio\", simbolo: \"Li\", Z: 3,\r\n            configuracion: \"[He] 2s\u00b9\", valencia: 1, grupo: 1, periodo: 2,\r\n            bloque: \"s\", octeto: false\r\n        },\r\n        Be: {\r\n            nombre: \"Berilio\", simbolo: \"Be\", Z: 4,\r\n            configuracion: \"[He] 2s\u00b2\", valencia: 2, grupo: 2, periodo: 2,\r\n            bloque: \"s\", octeto: false, excepcion: \"4 e\u207b en BeCl\u2082\"\r\n        },\r\n        B: {\r\n            nombre: \"Boro\", simbolo: \"B\", Z: 5,\r\n            configuracion: \"[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b9\", valencia: 3, grupo: 13, periodo: 2,\r\n            bloque: \"p\", octeto: false, excepcion: \"6 e\u207b en BF\u2083\"\r\n        },\r\n        C: {\r\n            nombre: \"Carbono\", simbolo: \"C\", Z: 6,\r\n            configuracion: \"[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b2\", valencia: 4, grupo: 14, periodo: 2,\r\n            bloque: \"p\", octeto: true\r\n        },\r\n        N: {\r\n            nombre: \"Nitr\u00f3geno\", simbolo: \"N\", Z: 7,\r\n            configuracion: \"[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b3\", valencia: 5, grupo: 15, periodo: 2,\r\n            bloque: \"p\", octeto: true\r\n        },\r\n        O: {\r\n            nombre: \"Ox\u00edgeno\", simbolo: \"O\", Z: 8,\r\n            configuracion: \"[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u2074\", valencia: 6, grupo: 16, periodo: 2,\r\n            bloque: \"p\", octeto: true\r\n        },\r\n        F: {\r\n            nombre: \"Fl\u00faor\", simbolo: \"F\", Z: 9,\r\n            configuracion: \"[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u2075\", valencia: 7, grupo: 17, periodo: 2,\r\n            bloque: \"p\", octeto: false\r\n        },\r\n        Ne: {\r\n            nombre: \"Ne\u00f3n\", simbolo: \"Ne\", Z: 10,\r\n            configuracion: \"[He] 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076\", valencia: 8, grupo: 18, periodo: 2,\r\n            bloque: \"p\", octeto: true\r\n        },\r\n        Na: {\r\n            nombre: \"Sodio\", simbolo: \"Na\", Z: 11,\r\n            configuracion: \"[Ne] 3s\u00b9\", valencia: 1, grupo: 1, periodo: 3,\r\n            bloque: \"s\", octeto: false\r\n        },\r\n        Mg: {\r\n            nombre: \"Magnesio\", simbolo: \"Mg\", Z: 12,\r\n            configuracion: \"[Ne] 3s\u00b2\", valencia: 2, grupo: 2, periodo: 3,\r\n            bloque: \"s\", octeto: false\r\n        },\r\n        Al: {\r\n            nombre: \"Aluminio\", simbolo: \"Al\", Z: 13,\r\n            configuracion: \"[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u00b9\", valencia: 3, grupo: 13, periodo: 3,\r\n            bloque: \"p\", octeto: false\r\n        },\r\n        Si: {\r\n            nombre: \"Silicio\", simbolo: \"Si\", Z: 14,\r\n            configuracion: \"[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u00b2\", valencia: 4, grupo: 14, periodo: 3,\r\n            bloque: \"p\", octeto: true\r\n        },\r\n        P: {\r\n            nombre: \"F\u00f3sforo\", simbolo: \"P\", Z: 15,\r\n            configuracion: \"[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u00b3\", valencia: 5, grupo: 15, periodo: 3,\r\n            bloque: \"p\", octeto: false, excepcion: \"10 e\u207b en PCl\u2085\"\r\n        },\r\n        S: {\r\n            nombre: \"Azufre\", simbolo: \"S\", Z: 16,\r\n            configuracion: \"[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u2074\", valencia: 6, grupo: 16, periodo: 3,\r\n            bloque: \"p\", octeto: false, excepcion: \"12 e\u207b en SF\u2086\"\r\n        },\r\n        Cl: {\r\n            nombre: \"Cloro\", simbolo: \"Cl\", Z: 17,\r\n            configuracion: \"[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u2075\", valencia: 7, grupo: 17, periodo: 3,\r\n            bloque: \"p\", octeto: false\r\n        },\r\n        Ar: {\r\n            nombre: \"Arg\u00f3n\", simbolo: \"Ar\", Z: 18,\r\n            configuracion: \"[Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u2076\", valencia: 8, grupo: 18, periodo: 3,\r\n            bloque: \"p\", octeto: true\r\n        },\r\n        Fe: {\r\n            nombre: \"Hierro\", simbolo: \"Fe\", Z: 26,\r\n            configuracion: \"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2076\", valencia: 8, grupo: 8, periodo: 4,\r\n            bloque: \"d\", octeto: false, excepcion: \"Variable (2, 3, etc.)\"\r\n        },\r\n        Cu: {\r\n            nombre: \"Cobre\", simbolo: \"Cu\", Z: 29,\r\n            configuracion: \"[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070\", valencia: 11, grupo: 11, periodo: 4,\r\n            bloque: \"d\", octeto: false, excepcion: \"1 e\u207b de valencia (4s\u00b9)\"\r\n        },\r\n        Zn: {\r\n            nombre: \"Zinc\", simbolo: \"Zn\", Z: 30,\r\n            configuracion: \"[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u00b9\u2070\", valencia: 2, grupo: 12, periodo: 4,\r\n            bloque: \"d\", octeto: true\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ SIMULADOR DE VALENCIA\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    let simulacionesRealizadas = 0;\r\n    let octetosCompletos = 0;\r\n    let excepcionesEncontradas = 0;\r\n\r\n    function simularValencia() {\r\n        const simbolo = document.getElementById('elementoSelect').value;\r\n        const tipoEnlace = document.getElementById('enlaceSelect').value;\r\n        const mostrarOcteto = document.getElementById('mostrarOcteto').checked;\r\n\r\n        const elemento = elementos[simbolo];\r\n        if (!elemento) {\r\n            alert(\"\u274c Elemento no encontrado en la base de datos.\");\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n        document.getElementById('dataElemento').textContent = elemento.nombre;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataSimbolo').textContent = elemento.simbolo;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataConfiguracion').textContent = elemento.configuracion;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataValencia').textContent = elemento.valencia;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataGrupoPeriodo').textContent = `Grupo ${elemento.grupo}, Per\u00edodo ${elemento.periodo}`;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataTipoEnlace').textContent =\r\n            tipoEnlace === \"ionico\" ? \"I\u00f3nico\" :\r\n            tipoEnlace === \"covalente\" ? \"Covalente\" :\r\n            tipoEnlace === \"metalico\" ? \"Met\u00e1lico\" : \"Expansi\u00f3n de Octeto\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataOcteto').textContent =\r\n            elemento.octeto ? \"S\u00ed\" : elemento.excepcion ? `No (${elemento.excepcion})` : \"No\";\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas\r\n        simulacionesRealizadas++;\r\n        document.getElementById('statSimulaciones').textContent = simulacionesRealizadas;\r\n        if (elemento.octeto) octetosCompletos++;\r\n        document.getElementById('statOctetos').textContent = octetosCompletos;\r\n        if (elemento.excepcion) excepcionesEncontradas++;\r\n        document.getElementById('statExcepciones').textContent = excepcionesEncontradas;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Dibujar \u00e1tomo\r\n        dibujarAtomo(elemento, tipoEnlace, mostrarOcteto);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Feedback\r\n        let infoText = `\u2705 Simulaci\u00f3n completada: <strong>${elemento.nombre}<\/strong> (${elemento.simbolo}) con <strong>${elemento.valencia} electrones de valencia<\/strong>.`;\r\n        if (elemento.excepcion) {\r\n            infoText += `<br>\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Excepci\u00f3n:<\/strong> ${elemento.excepcion}.`;\r\n        }\r\n        document.getElementById('simulacionInfo').innerHTML = infoText;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function dibujarAtomo(elemento, tipoEnlace, mostrarOcteto) {\r\n        const svg = document.getElementById('atomSVG');\r\n        svg.innerHTML = '';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Colores por bloque\r\n        const coloresBloque = {\r\n            s: '#FF5252',   \/\/ Rojo\r\n            p: '#4CAF50',   \/\/ Verde\r\n            d: '#FF9800',   \/\/ Naranja\r\n            f: '#7B1FA2'    \/\/ Morado\r\n        };\r\n        const color = coloresBloque[elemento.bloque] || '#E0E0E0';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Dibujar n\u00facleo\r\n        const nucleo = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n        nucleo.setAttribute('cx', '100');\r\n        nucleo.setAttribute('cy', '100');\r\n        nucleo.setAttribute('r', '20');\r\n        nucleo.setAttribute('fill', color);\r\n        svg.appendChild(nucleo);\r\n\r\n        const textoSimbolo = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'text');\r\n        textoSimbolo.setAttribute('x', '100');\r\n        textoSimbolo.setAttribute('y', '105');\r\n        textoSimbolo.setAttribute('fill', 'white');\r\n        textoSimbolo.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');\r\n        textoSimbolo.setAttribute('font-size', '16');\r\n        textoSimbolo.setAttribute('font-weight', 'bold');\r\n        textoSimbolo.textContent = elemento.simbolo;\r\n        svg.appendChild(textoSimbolo);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Dibujar electrones de valencia seg\u00fan tipo de enlace\r\n        if (tipoEnlace === \"ionico\") {\r\n            \/\/ Simular p\u00e9rdida\/ganancia de electrones\r\n            const electrones = Math.min(elemento.valencia, 4); \/\/ M\u00e1ximo 4 para visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n            const anguloIncremento = (2 * Math.PI) \/ electrones;\r\n\r\n            for (let i = 0; i < electrones; i++) {\r\n                const angulo = i * anguloIncremento;\r\n                const x = 100 + 40 * Math.cos(angulo);\r\n                const y = 100 + 40 * Math.sin(angulo);\r\n\r\n                const electron = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n                electron.setAttribute('cx', x);\r\n                electron.setAttribute('cy', y);\r\n                electron.setAttribute('r', '8');\r\n                electron.setAttribute('fill', '#FFEB3B'); \/\/ Amarillo para electrones\r\n                electron.setAttribute('stroke', color);\r\n                electron.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');\r\n\r\n                \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de p\u00e9rdida\/ganancia\r\n                if (elemento.grupo <= 3 || elemento.bloque === 's') {\r\n                    \/\/ Metales: pierden electrones\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n                    const animate = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'animate');\r\n                    animate.setAttribute('attributeName', 'opacity');\r\n                    animate.setAttribute('values', '1;0');\r\n                    animate.setAttribute('begin', `${1 + i * 0.5}s`);\r\n                    animate.setAttribute('dur', '1s');\r\n                    animate.setAttribute('fill', 'freeze');\r\n                    electron.appendChild(animate);\r\n                } else {\r\n                    \/\/ No metales: ganan electrones\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n                    const animate = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'animate');\r\n                    animate.setAttribute('attributeName', 'opacity');\r\n                    animate.setAttribute('values', '0;1');\r\n                    animate.setAttribute('begin', `${1 + i * 0.5}s`);\r\n                    animate.setAttribute('dur', '1s');\r\n                    animate.setAttribute('fill', 'freeze');\r\n                    electron.appendChild(animate);\r\n                }\r\n                svg.appendChild(electron);\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Dibujar otro \u00e1tomo para enlace i\u00f3nico (ej: Cl)\r\n            if (elemento.grupo <= 3) {\r\n                const otroAtomo = elementos.Cl;\r\n                const nucleoOtro = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n                nucleoOtro.setAttribute('cx', '160');\r\n                nucleoOtro.setAttribute('cy', '100');\r\n                nucleoOtro.setAttribute('r', '20');\r\n                nucleoOtro.setAttribute('fill', coloresBloque[otroAtomo.bloque]);\r\n                svg.appendChild(nucleoOtro);\r\n\r\n                const textoOtro = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'text');\r\n                textoOtro.setAttribute('x', '160');\r\n                textoOtro.setAttribute('y', '105');\r\n                textoOtro.setAttribute('fill', 'white');\r\n                textoOtro.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');\r\n                textoOtro.setAttribute('font-size', '16');\r\n                textoOtro.textContent = otroAtomo.simbolo;\r\n                svg.appendChild(textoOtro);\r\n\r\n                \/\/ Flecha de transferencia\r\n                const flecha = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'path');\r\n                flecha.setAttribute('d', 'M120,100 L140,100');\r\n                flecha.setAttribute('stroke', '#E0E0E0');\r\n                flecha.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');\r\n                flecha.setAttribute('marker-end', 'url(#arrowhead)');\r\n                svg.appendChild(flecha);\r\n\r\n                \/\/ Electrones transferidos\r\n                for (let i = 0; i < Math.min(elemento.valencia, 2); i++) {\r\n                    const electron = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('cx', 130 + i * 10);\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('cy', 90 - i * 10);\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('r', '5');\r\n                    electron.setAttribute('fill', '#FFEB3B');\r\n                    svg.appendChild(electron);\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n\r\n        } else if (tipoEnlace === \"covalente\") {\r\n            \/\/ Simular compartici\u00f3n de electrones\r\n            const electrones = elemento.valencia;\r\n            const anguloIncremento = (2 * Math.PI) \/ electrones;\r\n\r\n            for (let i = 0; i < electrones; i++) {\r\n                const angulo = i * anguloIncremento;\r\n                const x = 100 + 40 * Math.cos(angulo);\r\n                const y = 100 + 40 * Math.sin(angulo);\r\n\r\n                const electron = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n                electron.setAttribute('cx', x);\r\n                electron.setAttribute('cy', y);\r\n                electron.setAttribute('r', '8');\r\n                electron.setAttribute('fill', '#FFEB3B');\r\n                electron.setAttribute('stroke', color);\r\n                electron.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');\r\n                svg.appendChild(electron);\r\n\r\n                \/\/ Pares de electrones compartidos\r\n                if (i % 2 === 1) {\r\n                    const otroAtomoAngulo = angulo + Math.PI;\r\n                    const otroX = 100 + 30 * Math.cos(otroAtomoAngulo);\r\n                    const otroY = 100 + 30 * Math.sin(otroAtomoAngulo);\r\n\r\n                    const otroElectron = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n                    otroElectron.setAttribute('cx', otroX);\r\n                    otroElectron.setAttribute('cy', otroY);\r\n                    otroElectron.setAttribute('r', '8');\r\n                    otroElectron.setAttribute('fill', '#FFEB3B');\r\n                    otroElectron.setAttribute('stroke', color);\r\n                    otroElectron.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');\r\n                    svg.appendChild(otroElectron);\r\n\r\n                    \/\/ L\u00ednea de enlace\r\n                    const enlace = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'line');\r\n                    enlace.setAttribute('x1', x);\r\n                    enlace.setAttribute('y1', y);\r\n                    enlace.setAttribute('x2', otroX);\r\n                    enlace.setAttribute('y2', otroY);\r\n                    enlace.setAttribute('stroke', '#E0E0E0');\r\n                    enlace.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');\r\n                    enlace.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', '5,2');\r\n                    svg.appendChild(enlace);\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n\r\n        } else if (tipoEnlace === \"metalico\") {\r\n            \/\/ Simular mar de electrones\r\n            const electrones = 10; \/\/ N\u00famero arbitrario para visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n            for (let i = 0; i < electrones; i++) {\r\n                const angulo = Math.random() * 2 * Math.PI;\r\n                const distancia = 30 + Math.random() * 40;\r\n                const x = 100 + distancia * Math.cos(angulo);\r\n                const y = 100 + distancia * Math.sin(angulo);\r\n\r\n                const electron = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n                electron.setAttribute('cx', x);\r\n                electron.setAttribute('cy', y);\r\n                electron.setAttribute('r', '5');\r\n                electron.setAttribute('fill', '#FFEB3B');\r\n\r\n                \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de movimiento aleatorio\r\n                const animateX = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'animate');\r\n                animateX.setAttribute('attributeName', 'cx');\r\n                animateX.setAttribute('values', `${x};${x + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 20};${x}`);\r\n                animateX.setAttribute('dur', '3s');\r\n                animateX.setAttribute('repeatCount', 'indefinite');\r\n                electron.appendChild(animateX);\r\n\r\n                const animateY = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'animate');\r\n                animateY.setAttribute('attributeName', 'cy');\r\n                animateY.setAttribute('values', `${y};${y + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 20};${y}`);\r\n                animateY.setAttribute('dur', '3s');\r\n                animateY.setAttribute('repeatCount', 'indefinite');\r\n                electron.appendChild(animateY);\r\n\r\n                svg.appendChild(electron);\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Dibujar otros \u00e1tomos met\u00e1licos\r\n            for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\r\n                const angulo = (i * 2 * Math.PI) \/ 4;\r\n                const distancia = 60;\r\n                const x = 100 + distancia * Math.cos(angulo);\r\n                const y = 100 + distancia * Math.sin(angulo);\r\n\r\n                const otroNucleo = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n                otroNucleo.setAttribute('cx', x);\r\n                otroNucleo.setAttribute('cy', y);\r\n                otroNucleo.setAttribute('r', '15');\r\n                otroNucleo.setAttribute('fill', color);\r\n                svg.appendChild(otroNucleo);\r\n\r\n                const textoOtro = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'text');\r\n                textoOtro.setAttribute('x', x);\r\n                textoOtro.setAttribute('y', y + 5);\r\n                textoOtro.setAttribute('fill', 'white');\r\n                textoOtro.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');\r\n                textoOtro.setAttribute('font-size', '12');\r\n                textoOtro.textContent = elemento.simbolo;\r\n                svg.appendChild(textoOtro);\r\n            }\r\n\r\n        } else if (tipoEnlace === \"octeto\") {\r\n            \/\/ Simular expansi\u00f3n de octeto (ej: PCl\u2085)\r\n            const electrones = elemento.valencia + 2; \/\/ Para visualizar expansi\u00f3n\r\n            const anguloIncremento = (2 * Math.PI) \/ electrones;\r\n\r\n            for (let i = 0; i < electrones; i++) {\r\n                const angulo = i * anguloIncremento;\r\n                const x = 100 + 50 * Math.cos(angulo);\r\n                const y = 100 + 50 * Math.sin(angulo);\r\n\r\n                const electron = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n                electron.setAttribute('cx', x);\r\n                electron.setAttribute('cy', y);\r\n                electron.setAttribute('r', '8');\r\n                electron.setAttribute('fill', '#FFEB3B');\r\n                electron.setAttribute('stroke', color);\r\n                electron.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');\r\n                svg.appendChild(electron);\r\n\r\n                \/\/ Dibujar \u00e1tomos de Cl alrededor\r\n                if (i % 2 === 0 && i < 6) { \/\/ M\u00e1ximo 6 para visualizaci\u00f3n (ej: SF\u2086)\r\n                    const clX = 100 + 70 * Math.cos(angulo);\r\n                    const clY = 100 + 70 * Math.sin(angulo);\r\n\r\n                    const nucleoCl = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n                    nucleoCl.setAttribute('cx', clX);\r\n                    nucleoCl.setAttribute('cy', clY);\r\n                    nucleoCl.setAttribute('r', '15');\r\n                    nucleoCl.setAttribute('fill', '#4CAF50');\r\n                    svg.appendChild(nucleoCl);\r\n\r\n                    const textoCl = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'text');\r\n                    textoCl.setAttribute('x', clX);\r\n                    textoCl.setAttribute('y', clY + 5);\r\n                    textoCl.setAttribute('fill', 'white');\r\n                    textoCl.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');\r\n                    textoCl.setAttribute('font-size', '12');\r\n                    textoCl.textContent = 'Cl';\r\n                    svg.appendChild(textoCl);\r\n\r\n                    \/\/ L\u00ednea de enlace\r\n                    const enlace = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'line');\r\n                    enlace.setAttribute('x1', x);\r\n                    enlace.setAttribute('y1', y);\r\n                    enlace.setAttribute('x2', clX - 15 * Math.cos(angulo));\r\n                    enlace.setAttribute('y2', clY - 15 * Math.sin(angulo));\r\n                    enlace.setAttribute('stroke', '#E0E0E0');\r\n                    enlace.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');\r\n                    svg.appendChild(enlace);\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Resaltar expansi\u00f3n de octeto\r\n            if (mostrarOcteto && elemento.excepcion) {\r\n                const textoExcepcion = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'text');\r\n                textoExcepcion.setAttribute('x', '100');\r\n                textoExcepcion.setAttribute('y', '180');\r\n                textoExcepcion.setAttribute('fill', '#FFFF00');\r\n                textoExcepcion.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');\r\n                textoExcepcion.setAttribute('font-size', '14');\r\n                textoExcepcion.setAttribute('font-weight', 'bold');\r\n                textoExcepcion.textContent = `\u26a0\ufe0f EXCEPCI\u00d3N: ${elemento.excepcion}`;\r\n                svg.appendChild(textoExcepcion);\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Resaltar octeto si est\u00e1 completo\r\n        if (mostrarOcteto && elemento.octeto) {\r\n            const octetoCircle = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n            octetoCircle.setAttribute('cx', '100');\r\n            octetoCircle.setAttribute('cy', '100');\r\n            octetoCircle.setAttribute('r', '50');\r\n            octetoCircle.setAttribute('fill', 'none');\r\n            octetoCircle.setAttribute('stroke', '#39FF14');\r\n            octetoCircle.setAttribute('stroke-width', '3');\r\n            octetoCircle.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', '10,5');\r\n            svg.appendChild(octetoCircle);\r\n\r\n            const textoOcteto = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'text');\r\n            textoOcteto.setAttribute('x', '100');\r\n            textoOcteto.setAttribute('y', '190');\r\n            textoOcteto.setAttribute('fill', '#39FF14');\r\n            textoOcteto.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');\r\n            textoOcteto.setAttribute('font-size', '14');\r\n            textoOcteto.textContent = '\u2705 OCTETO COMPLETO';\r\n            svg.appendChild(textoOcteto);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function elementoAleatorio() {\r\n        const simbolos = Object.keys(elementos);\r\n        const simboloAleatorio = simbolos[Math.floor(Math.random() * simbolos.length)];\r\n        document.getElementById('elementoSelect').value = simboloAleatorio;\r\n        document.getElementById('simulacionInfo').textContent =\r\n            `\ud83c\udfb2 Elemento aleatorio: <strong>${elementos[simboloAleatorio].nombre}<\/strong>. Selecciona un enlace y haz clic en \"SIMULAR VALENCIA\".`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    let quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n                q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n            );\r\n            if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n                quizCompletado = true;\r\n                mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n        const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n        let feedback = \"\";\r\n        if (porcentaje >= 90) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83c\udf1f \u00a1Excelente! Dominas los electrones de valencia y la Regla del Octeto.\";\r\n        } else if (porcentaje >= 70) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero repasa las excepciones y la tabla peri\u00f3dica.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas estudiar m\u00e1s sobre valencia y reactividad.\";\r\n        }\r\n        document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        quizRespuestas = [];\r\n        quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ ERRORES COMUNES\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    function toggleError(header) {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n\r\n        if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        } else {\r\n            content.style.display = 'block';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    function verificarProblema(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n        const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n        const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n        const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n\r\n        alert(`\ud83d\udcbe Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Valencia: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Octeto: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Excepciones: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ===========================================\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: Electrones de Valencia - Cargada\");\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83c\udfae Simulador, Quiz y Herramientas interactivas listas\");\r\n<\/script>\r\n","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Valencia de C (Z=6)","respuesta":"4"},{"enunciado":"Valencia de O (Z=8)","respuesta":"6"},{"enunciado":"Grupo 1 tiene valencia","respuesta":"1"},{"enunciado":"Valencia de Al (Z=13)","respuesta":"3"},{"enunciado":"Valencia de S (Z=16)","respuesta":"6"},{"enunciado":"I\u00f3n formado por K","respuesta":"K\u207a (pierde 1)"},{"enunciado":"No metal con 5 valencia","respuesta":"N (nitr\u00f3geno)"},{"enunciado":"Metal con 2 valencia","respuesta":"Mg (magnesio)"},{"enunciado":"Gas noble valencia","respuesta":"8 (excepto He: 2)"},{"enunciado":"Valencia de Fe en Fe\u00b2\u207a","respuesta":"2 (pierde 4s\u00b2)"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC: valencia en transici\u00f3n","respuesta":"Variable (d + s)"},{"enunciado":"Electr\u00f3n valencia en Br","respuesta":"7 (4s\u00b2 4p\u2075)"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Electrones valencia est\u00e1n en...","opciones":["Capa externa","N\u00facleo","Todas las capas","Solo s"],"correcta":"Capa externa"},{"pregunta":"Determinan la...","opciones":["Reactividad","Masa","Color","Densidad"],"correcta":"Reactividad"},{"pregunta":"Valencia de Na (grupo 1)","opciones":["1","11","3","8"],"correcta":"1"},{"pregunta":"Gases nobles tienen...","opciones":["8 valencia","0","1","2"],"correcta":"8 valencia"},{"pregunta":"Valencia de F","opciones":["7","9","1","8"],"correcta":"7"},{"pregunta":"Valencia de Mg","opciones":["2","12","4","0"],"correcta":"2"},{"pregunta":"Metales alcalinos valencia","opciones":["1","2","3","8"],"correcta":"1"},{"pregunta":"Hal\u00f3genos valencia","opciones":["7","1","8","5"],"correcta":"7"},{"pregunta":"Regla del octeto busca...","opciones":["8 e\u207b valencia","2 e\u207b","18 e\u207b","0 e\u207b"],"correcta":"8 e\u207b valencia"},{"pregunta":"He es estable con...","opciones":["2 e\u207b (dueto)","8 e\u207b","1 e\u207b","0 e\u207b"],"correcta":"2 e\u207b (dueto)"},{"pregunta":"Valencia de Si (grupo 14)","opciones":["4","14","2","6"],"correcta":"4"},{"pregunta":"Valencia de P (grupo 15)","opciones":["5","3","15","8"],"correcta":"5"},{"pregunta":"I\u00f3n O\u00b2\u207b tiene valencia efectiva","opciones":["8","6","2","10"],"correcta":"8"},{"pregunta":"Transici\u00f3n valencia","opciones":["Variable","Fija","Siempre 8","Siempre 1"],"correcta":"Variable"},{"pregunta":"Valencia de Cr en Cr\u00b3\u207a","opciones":["3","6","2","1"],"correcta":"3"},{"pregunta":"Bloque p valencia","opciones":["3 a 8","1 a 2","1 a 10","Solo 8"],"correcta":"3 a 8"},{"pregunta":"Electr\u00f3n valencia en Ca","opciones":["4s\u00b2","3s\u00b2","4p\u2076","3d\u00b9\u2070"],"correcta":"4s\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"No metal que gana 3 e\u207b","opciones":["N","O","F","Cl"],"correcta":"N"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC: valencia principal","opciones":["ns + np","nd","nf","solo s"],"correcta":"ns + np"},{"pregunta":"Expansi\u00f3n de octeto en...","opciones":["S, P","C, N","H, He","Na, K"],"correcta":"S, P"},{"pregunta":"Valencia de Mn en MnO\u2084\u207b","opciones":["+7","+2","+3","+4"],"correcta":"+7"},{"pregunta":"Valencia de Fe en Fe(CN)\u2086\u00b3\u207b","opciones":["+3","+2","+6","+1"],"correcta":"+3"},{"pregunta":"Lantanoides valencia t\u00edpica","opciones":["+3","+2","+4","+1"],"correcta":"+3"},{"pregunta":"Act\u00ednidos valencia com\u00fan","opciones":["+3 a +6","+1 a +2","+7","+8"],"correcta":"+3 a +6"},{"pregunta":"Valencia de Cu en Cu\u207a","opciones":["1 (pierde 4s\u00b9)","2","0","3"],"correcta":"1 (pierde 4s\u00b9)"},{"pregunta":"Electr\u00f3n valencia en Zn","opciones":["4s\u00b2","3d\u00b9\u2070","4p\u2076","5s\u00b9"],"correcta":"4s\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"I\u00f3n con octeto: Al\u00b3\u207a","opciones":["[Ne]","[He]","[Ar]","[Kr]"],"correcta":"[Ne]"},{"pregunta":"Elementos con valencia 0","opciones":["Gases nobles","Metales","No metales","Transici\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Gases nobles"},{"pregunta":"Valencia m\u00e1xima te\u00f3rica","opciones":["8 (octeto)","18","32","7"],"correcta":"8 (octeto)"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC define valencia como...","opciones":["e\u207b en capa m\u00e1s externa","e\u207b totales","protones","neutrones"],"correcta":"e\u207b en capa m\u00e1s externa"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"electron-diferencial","titulo":"Electr\u00f3n Diferencial: El \u00daltimo en Entrar, el Primero en Salir","contenido":"\r\n        <h3>Electr\u00f3n Diferencial<\/h3>\r\n        <p>El <strong>electr\u00f3n diferencial<\/strong> es el <strong>\u00faltimo electr\u00f3n agregado<\/strong> al construir la configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica usando el <strong>principio de Aufbau<\/strong>. Determina el <strong>bloque peri\u00f3dico<\/strong> (s, p, d, f) y las <strong>propiedades qu\u00edmicas<\/strong> del elemento.<\/p>\r\n\r\n        <hr style=\"border:1px dashed #388E3C;\">\r\n\r\n        <h4>1. Definici\u00f3n y Regla<\/h4>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><strong>Diferencial = electr\u00f3n en el orbital de mayor energ\u00eda<\/strong><\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Se identifica en la configuraci\u00f3n completa<\/strong><\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Determina:<\/strong> bloque, valencia (parcial), reactividad<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n\r\n        <table class=\"table\">\r\n            <thead>\r\n                <tr><th>Elemento<\/th><th>Z<\/th><th>Configuraci\u00f3n<\/th><th>Diferencial<\/th><th>Bloque<\/th><\/tr>\r\n            <\/thead>\r\n            <tbody>\r\n                <tr><td><strong>Na<\/strong><\/td><td>11<\/td><td>1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b9<\/td><td>3s\u00b9<\/td><td>s<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <tr><td><strong>Cl<\/strong><\/td><td>17<\/td><td>1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2 3p\u2075<\/td><td>3p\u2075<\/td><td>p<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <tr><td><strong>Sc<\/strong><\/td><td>21<\/td><td>[Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u00b9<\/td><td>3d\u00b9<\/td><td>d<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <tr><td><strong>Ce<\/strong><\/td><td>58<\/td><td>[Xe] 6s\u00b2 4f\u00b9 5d\u00b9<\/td><td>4f\u00b9<\/td><td>f<\/td><\/tr>\r\n            <\/tbody>\r\n        <\/table>\r\n\r\n        <hr style=\"border:1px dashed #388E3C;\">\r\n\r\n        <h4>2. Bloque Peri\u00f3dico por Diferencial<\/h4>\r\n        <table class=\"table\">\r\n            <thead>\r\n                <tr><th>Bloque<\/th><th>Orbital Diferencial<\/th><th>Grupos<\/th><\/tr>\r\n            <\/thead>\r\n            <tbody>\r\n                <tr><td><strong>s<\/strong><\/td><td>ns\u00b9\u207b\u00b2<\/td><td>1\u20132<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <tr><td><strong>p<\/strong><\/td><td>np\u00b9\u207b\u2076<\/td><td>13\u201318<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <tr><td><strong>d<\/strong><\/td><td>(n-1)d\u00b9\u207b\u00b9\u2070<\/td><td>3\u201312<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <tr><td><strong>f<\/strong><\/td><td>(n-2)f\u00b9\u207b\u00b9\u2074<\/td><td>Lantanoides, Act\u00ednidos<\/td><\/tr>\r\n            <\/tbody>\r\n        <\/table>\r\n\r\n        <hr style=\"border:1px dashed #388E3C;\">\r\n\r\n        <h4>3. Excepciones (Aufbau)<\/h4>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><strong>Cr:<\/strong> [Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075 \u2192 diferencial <strong>3d\u2075<\/strong> (no 4s\u00b2)<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Cu:<\/strong> [Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070 \u2192 diferencial <strong>3d\u00b9\u2070<\/strong><\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n        <p>\u2192 <strong>Bloque d<\/strong>, aunque 4s es m\u00e1s externo.<\/p>\r\n\r\n        <hr style=\"border:1px dashed #388E3C;\">\r\n\r\n        <h4>4. Importancia Qu\u00edmica<\/h4>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><strong>Reactividad:<\/strong> f\u00e1cil p\u00e9rdida\/ganancia<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Valencia:<\/strong> electrones disponibles<\/li>\r\n            <li><strong>Espectros:<\/strong> transiciones electr\u00f3nicas<\/li>\r\n        <\/ul>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"ejemplo\">\r\n            <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> <strong>Fe (Z=26)<\/strong> \u2192 [Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2076 \u2192 diferencial <strong>3d\u2076<\/strong> \u2192 bloque <strong>d<\/strong>, valencia variable (2+, 3+).<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"visual\">\r\n            <img src=\"assets\/img\/orbitales_moleculares.png\" alt=\"Representaci\u00f3n orbital\">\r\n            <p><em>Orbitales. Fuente: ThoughtCo.<\/em><\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"visual\">\r\n            <img src=\"assets\/img\/configruacion_electronicos.jpg\" alt=\"Diagramas de caja\">\r\n            <p><em>Cajas orbitales 1\u201318. Fuente: Pathways to Chemistry.<\/em><\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"visual\">\r\n            <img src=\"assets\/img\/diagrama-electrones.jpg\" alt=\"Configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica\">\r\n            <p><em>Configuraci\u00f3n. Fuente: Science Facts.<\/em><\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <hr style=\"border:1px dashed #388E3C;\">\r\n\r\n        <h4>5. SVG Animado: Construcci\u00f3n + Diferencial (H \u2192 Ar)<\/h4>\r\n        <div class=\"svg-diagram\">\r\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 500\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n                <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" fill=\"#E8F5E9\"\/>\r\n\r\n                <!-- T\u00edtulo -->\r\n                <text x=\"400\" y=\"50\" fill=\"#1B5E20\" font-size=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">ELECTR\u00d3N DIFERENCIAL<\/text>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 1s -->\r\n                <g id=\"1s\">\r\n                    <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"200\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"150\" y=\"180\" fill=\"#2E7D32\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1s<\/text>\r\n                    <circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"200\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#81C784\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"0s\" dur=\"0.5s\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"200\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#81C784\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"0.5s\" dur=\"0.5s\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"150\" y=\"240\" fill=\"#1B5E20\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">H, He<\/text>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 2s 2p -->\r\n                <g id=\"2sp\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                    <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"200\" r=\"60\" fill=\"#66BB6A\" opacity=\"0.3\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0.3\" begin=\"1s\" dur=\"0.5s\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"350\" y=\"160\" fill=\"#2E7D32\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2s<\/text>\r\n                    <ellipse cx=\"550\" cy=\"200\" rx=\"80\" ry=\"40\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" opacity=\"0.2\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0.2\" begin=\"2s\" dur=\"0.5s\"\/>\r\n                    <\/ellipse>\r\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"160\" fill=\"#2E7D32\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2p<\/text>\r\n                    <!-- Diferencial en Ne -->\r\n                    <circle cx=\"630\" cy=\"200\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#FF5252\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"3s\" dur=\"0.5s\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"630\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#D50000\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Diferencial: 2p\u2076<\/text>\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"1s\" dur=\"0.1s\"\/>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 3s 3p -->\r\n                <g id=\"3sp\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                    <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"350\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#43A047\" opacity=\"0.3\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0.3\" begin=\"4s\" dur=\"0.5s\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"350\" y=\"320\" fill=\"#2E7D32\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3s<\/text>\r\n                    <ellipse cx=\"550\" cy=\"350\" rx=\"70\" ry=\"35\" fill=\"#43A047\" opacity=\"0.2\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0.2\" begin=\"5s\" dur=\"0.5s\"\/>\r\n                    <\/ellipse>\r\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"320\" fill=\"#2E7D32\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3p<\/text>\r\n                    <!-- Diferencial en Ar -->\r\n                    <circle cx=\"620\" cy=\"350\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#FF5252\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"6s\" dur=\"0.5s\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"620\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#D50000\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Diferencial: 3p\u2076<\/text>\r\n                    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"4s\" dur=\"0.1s\"\/>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n\r\n                <!-- Excepci\u00f3n Cr -->\r\n                <g id=\"excepcion\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                    <rect x=\"450\" y=\"100\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#FFF3E0\" rx=\"15\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"7s\" dur=\"0.5s\"\/>\r\n                    <\/rect>\r\n                    <text x=\"600\" y=\"130\" fill=\"#E65100\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">EXCEPCI\u00d3N: Cr<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"600\" y=\"155\" fill=\"#FF6F00\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">[Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"600\" y=\"175\" fill=\"#E65100\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Diferencial: 3d\u2075<\/text>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n\r\n                <!-- IUPAC -->\r\n                <text x=\"400\" y=\"470\" fill=\"#2E7D32\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">IUPAC 2025: Diferencial = \u00faltimo en Aufbau<\/text>\r\n            <\/svg>\r\n            <p><em>SVG Animado: Llenado 1s \u2192 3p + Diferencial en Ne, Ar, Cr.<\/em><\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    ","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Electr\u00f3n diferencial de Mg (Z=12)","respuesta":"3s\u00b2"},{"enunciado":"Electr\u00f3n diferencial de Al (Z=13)","respuesta":"3p\u00b9"},{"enunciado":"Bloque determinado por","respuesta":"Diferencial"},{"enunciado":"Diferencial de K (Z=19)","respuesta":"4s\u00b9"},{"enunciado":"Diferencial de Ca (Z=20)","respuesta":"4s\u00b2"},{"enunciado":"Diferencial de Ti (Z=22)","respuesta":"3d\u00b2"},{"enunciado":"Diferencial de Cl (Z=17)","respuesta":"3p\u2075"},{"enunciado":"Diferencial de Cr (Z=24)","respuesta":"3d\u2075"},{"enunciado":"Bloque de Zn (Z=30)","respuesta":"d (3d\u00b9\u2070)"},{"enunciado":"Diferencial de La (Z=57)","respuesta":"5d\u00b9"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC: diferencial en transici\u00f3n","respuesta":"d o f, no s"},{"enunciado":"Diferencial de U (Z=92)","respuesta":"5f\u00b3 6d\u00b9 \u2192 5f\u00b3"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Electr\u00f3n diferencial es...","opciones":["\u00daltimo agregado","Primero","Valencia","N\u00facleo"],"correcta":"\u00daltimo agregado"},{"pregunta":"Determina el bloque","opciones":["S\u00ed","No","A veces","Nunca"],"correcta":"S\u00ed"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de Na","opciones":["3s\u00b9","2p\u2076","1s\u00b2","3p\u00b9"],"correcta":"3s\u00b9"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de O","opciones":["2p\u2074","2s\u00b2","1s\u00b2","3s\u00b9"],"correcta":"2p\u2074"},{"pregunta":"Bloque s tiene diferencial en...","opciones":["ns","np","nd","nf"],"correcta":"ns"},{"pregunta":"Bloque p diferencial en...","opciones":["np","ns","nd","nf"],"correcta":"np"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de Ne","opciones":["2p\u2076","2s\u00b2","1s\u00b2","3s\u00b9"],"correcta":"2p\u2076"},{"pregunta":"Importancia del diferencial","opciones":["Propiedades qu\u00edmicas","Masa","Color","Volumen"],"correcta":"Propiedades qu\u00edmicas"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de He","opciones":["1s\u00b2","2s\u00b9","1s\u00b9","2p\u00b9"],"correcta":"1s\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de Li","opciones":["2s\u00b9","1s\u00b2","2p\u00b9","3s\u00b9"],"correcta":"2s\u00b9"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de Ar","opciones":["3p\u2076","3s\u00b2","2p\u2076","4s\u00b9"],"correcta":"3p\u2076"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de Sc","opciones":["3d\u00b9","4s\u00b2","3p\u2076","4p\u00b9"],"correcta":"3d\u00b9"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de Cu","opciones":["3d\u00b9\u2070","4s\u00b9","4s\u00b2","3d\u2079"],"correcta":"3d\u00b9\u2070"},{"pregunta":"Bloque de Fe","opciones":["d","s","p","f"],"correcta":"d"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de Br","opciones":["4p\u2075","4s\u00b2","3d\u00b9\u2070","5s\u00b9"],"correcta":"4p\u2075"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de Kr","opciones":["4p\u2076","4s\u00b2","3d\u00b9\u2070","5s\u00b9"],"correcta":"4p\u2076"},{"pregunta":"Excepci\u00f3n Cr diferencial","opciones":["3d\u2075","4s\u00b9","4s\u00b2","3d\u2074"],"correcta":"3d\u2075"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de Mo","opciones":["4d\u2075","5s\u00b9","5s\u00b2","4d\u2074"],"correcta":"4d\u2075"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC: bloque por","opciones":["Diferencial","Valencia","Masa","Per\u00edodo"],"correcta":"Diferencial"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de Ce","opciones":["4f\u00b9","6s\u00b2","5d\u00b9","4f\u2070"],"correcta":"4f\u00b9"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de Pt (Z=78)","opciones":["5d\u2079","6s\u00b9","4f\u00b9\u2074","6s\u00b2"],"correcta":"5d\u2079"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de U (Z=92)","opciones":["5f\u00b3","7s\u00b2","6d\u00b9","5f\u2074"],"correcta":"5f\u00b3"},{"pregunta":"Bloque de La (Z=57)","opciones":["d","f","s","p"],"correcta":"d"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de Ac (Z=89)","opciones":["6d\u00b9","7s\u00b2","5f\u2070","7p\u00b9"],"correcta":"6d\u00b9"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de Au","opciones":["5d\u00b9\u2070","6s\u00b9","4f\u00b9\u2074","6s\u00b2"],"correcta":"5d\u00b9\u2070"},{"pregunta":"Excepci\u00f3n en 5d","opciones":["Pt, Au","Na, K","O, F","He, Ne"],"correcta":"Pt, Au"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de Gd","opciones":["4f\u2077","5d\u00b9","6s\u00b2","4f\u2078"],"correcta":"4f\u2077"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC permite diferencial en...","opciones":["d o f para transici\u00f3n","solo s","solo p","ninguno"],"correcta":"d o f para transici\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial de Th","opciones":["6d\u00b2","7s\u00b2","5f\u2070","6d\u00b9"],"correcta":"6d\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"Diferencial define...","opciones":["Bloque y serie","Solo per\u00edodo","Solo grupo","Masa at\u00f3mica"],"correcta":"Bloque y serie"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"diagrama-orbitales-cyberpunk","titulo":"Diagrama de Orbitales: El Mapa Cu\u00e1ntico de los Electrones","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-quimica-orbitales\" data-tema=\"orbitales\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83c\udf0c<\/span>\r\n            DIAGRAMA DE ORBITALES: EL MAPA CU\u00c1NTICO\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            De los Principios de Aufbau a las Excepciones de Cr y Cu\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Explicar las reglas de Aufbau, Pauli y Hund<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Identificar su aplicaci\u00f3n en el llenado de orbitales<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Dibujar diagramas de orbitales para los primeros 20 elementos<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Usar la notaci\u00f3n de cajas y flechas<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Identificar excepciones (Cr, Cu)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Explicar la estabilidad de subniveles medio llenos y llenos<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar en configuraciones electr\u00f3nicas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Relacionar con propiedades qu\u00edmicas<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACIONES EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udca1 TECNOLOG\u00cdA<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Los orbitales determinan propiedades de semiconductores (Si, Ge)<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Ejemplo: Transistores en chips<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd2c QU\u00cdMICA ORG\u00c1NICA<\/h3>\r\n                <p>La hibridaci\u00f3n sp\u00b3\/sp\u00b2\/sp explica geometr\u00eda molecular<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Ejemplo: Metano (CH\u2084) vs Etileno (C\u2082H\u2084)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udc8e MATERIALES<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Configuraciones electr\u00f3nicas definen propiedades de metales<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Ejemplo: Conductividad del Cu (4s\u00b93d\u00b9\u2070)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- DEFINICI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. \u00bfQu\u00e9 es un Diagrama de Orbitales?<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>DIAGRAMA DE ORBITALES<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Representaci\u00f3n visual de la <strong>distribuci\u00f3n de electrones<\/strong> en subniveles<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        \\text{Orbital} = \\text{Caja} \\quad \\text{Electr\u00f3n} = \\text{Flecha} \\quad (\\uparrow = +\\frac{1}{2}, \\downarrow = -\\frac{1}{2})\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-destacado\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> <strong>N (Z=7)<\/strong><br>\r\n                        1s: [\u2191\u2193] &nbsp; 2s: [\u2191\u2193] &nbsp; 2p: [\u2191] [\u2191] [\u2191] \u2192 <strong>Hund<\/strong>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- REGLAS FUNDAMENTALES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Reglas del Diagrama<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"reglas-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"regla-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcc8 PRINCIPIO DE AUFBAU<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Llenar orbitales de <strong>menor a mayor energ\u00eda<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"orden-aufbau\">\r\n                        1s \u2192 2s \u2192 2p \u2192 3s \u2192 3p \u2192 4s \u2192 3d \u2192 4p \u2192 5s \u2192 4d \u2192 ...\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"visual-aufbau\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"300\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 100\">\r\n                            <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#0288D1\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#flecha)\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"50\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#0288D1\" font-size=\"12\">1s<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"90\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#0288D1\" font-size=\"12\">2s<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"130\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#0288D1\" font-size=\"12\">2p<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"170\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#0288D1\" font-size=\"12\">3s<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"210\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#0288D1\" font-size=\"12\">3p<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"250\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#0288D1\" font-size=\"12\">4s<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"290\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#0288D1\" font-size=\"12\">3d<\/text>\r\n                            <defs>\r\n                                <marker id=\"flecha\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                                    <path d=\"M0,0 L9,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#0288D1\"\/>\r\n                                <\/marker>\r\n                            <\/defs>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"regla-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd04 PRINCIPIO DE EXCLUSI\u00d3N DE PAULI<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>M\u00e1ximo <strong>2 electrones por orbital<\/strong> con spins opuestos<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-pauli\">\r\n                        [\u2191\u2193] \u2192 Correcto &nbsp;&nbsp; [\u2191\u2191] \u2192 Incorrecto\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"regla-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udfaf REGLA DE HUND<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Llenar orbitales <strong>singly<\/strong> antes de parear<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-hund\">\r\n                        <strong>p\u00b3:<\/strong> [\u2191] [\u2191] [\u2191] &nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>p\u2074:<\/strong> [\u2191\u2193] [\u2191] [\u2191]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- EJEMPLOS B\u00c1SICOS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Ejemplos de Diagramas<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"ejemplos-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 H (Z=1)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"diagrama-box\">\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">1s: [\u2191]<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 He (Z=2)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"diagrama-box\">\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">1s: [\u2191\u2193]<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 C (Z=6)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"diagrama-box\">\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">1s: [\u2191\u2193]<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">2s: [\u2191\u2193]<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">2p: [\u2191] [\u2191] [ ]<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 N (Z=7)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"diagrama-box\">\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">1s: [\u2191\u2193]<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">2s: [\u2191\u2193]<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">2p: [\u2191] [\u2191] [\u2191]<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 O (Z=8)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"diagrama-box\">\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">1s: [\u2191\u2193]<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">2s: [\u2191\u2193]<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">2p: [\u2191\u2193] [\u2191] [\u2191]<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Ne (Z=10)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"diagrama-box\">\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">1s: [\u2191\u2193]<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">2s: [\u2191\u2193]<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">2p: [\u2191\u2193] [\u2191\u2193] [\u2191\u2193]<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- EXCEPCIONES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Excepciones: Cr y Cu<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"excepciones-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"excepcion-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Cr (Z=24)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n esperada:<\/strong> [Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2074<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n real:<\/strong> [Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"diagrama-box\">\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">4s: [\u2191] [ ]<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">3d: [\u2191] [\u2191] [\u2191] [\u2191] [\u2191]<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p><strong>Raz\u00f3n:<\/strong> Estabilidad de subnivel <strong>medio lleno<\/strong> (d\u2075)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"excepcion-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Cu (Z=29)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n esperada:<\/strong> [Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2079<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Configuraci\u00f3n real:<\/strong> [Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"diagrama-box\">\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">4s: [\u2191] [ ]<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"orbital\">3d: [\u2191\u2193] [\u2191\u2193] [\u2191\u2193] [\u2191\u2193] [\u2191\u2193]<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p><strong>Raz\u00f3n:<\/strong> Estabilidad de subnivel <strong>lleno<\/strong> (d\u00b9\u2070)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: CONSTRUCTOR DE ORBITALES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"orbitales\">\r\n            <!-- CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>CONFIGURACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"elementoSelect\">Elemento:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"elementoSelect\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"H\">H (Z=1)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"He\">He (Z=2)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Li\">Li (Z=3)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Be\">Be (Z=4)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"B\">B (Z=5)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"C\">C (Z=6)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"N\">N (Z=7)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"O\">O (Z=8)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"F\">F (Z=9)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Ne\">Ne (Z=10)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Na\">Na (Z=11)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Mg\">Mg (Z=12)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Al\">Al (Z=13)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Si\">Si (Z=14)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"P\">P (Z=15)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"S\">S (Z=16)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Cl\">Cl (Z=17)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Ar\">Ar (Z=18)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Cr\">Cr (Z=24)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Cu\">Cu (Z=29)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"configManual\">Configuraci\u00f3n manual:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"configManual\" class=\"control-input\" placeholder=\"Ej: 1s2 2s2 2p2\">\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-simular\" onclick=\"generarDiagrama()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> GENERAR DIAGRAMA\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"elementoAleatorio()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> ELEMENTO ALEATORIO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarSimulador()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacionOrbitales\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" id=\"svgOrbitales\">\r\n                    <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n                    <!-- T\u00edtulo -->\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#00BCD4\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"tituloElemento\">Selecciona un elemento<\/text>\r\n                    <!-- Subnivel 1s -->\r\n                    <g id=\"subnivel1s\" transform=\"translate(100, 100)\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"80\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#0288D1\" rx=\"5\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"40\" y=\"25\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1s<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"15\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e1s1\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"65\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e1s2\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    <!-- Subnivel 2s -->\r\n                    <g id=\"subnivel2s\" transform=\"translate(250, 100)\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"80\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#0288D1\" rx=\"5\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"40\" y=\"25\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2s<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"15\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e2s1\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"65\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e2s2\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    <!-- Subnivel 2p -->\r\n                    <g id=\"subnivel2p\" transform=\"translate(400, 80)\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"200\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#0288D1\" rx=\"5\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"100\" y=\"25\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2p<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"20\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e2p1\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"70\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e2p2\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"120\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e2p3\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"170\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e2p4\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"220\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e2p5\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"270\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e2p6\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    <!-- Subnivel 3s -->\r\n                    <g id=\"subnivel3s\" transform=\"translate(100, 200)\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"80\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#0288D1\" rx=\"5\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"40\" y=\"25\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3s<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"15\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3s1\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"65\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3s2\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    <!-- Subnivel 3p -->\r\n                    <g id=\"subnivel3p\" transform=\"translate(250, 180)\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"200\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#0288D1\" rx=\"5\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"100\" y=\"25\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3p<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"20\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3p1\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"70\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3p2\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"120\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3p3\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"170\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3p4\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"220\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3p5\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"270\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3p6\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    <!-- Subnivel 4s -->\r\n                    <g id=\"subnivel4s\" transform=\"translate(400, 200)\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"80\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#0288D1\" rx=\"5\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"40\" y=\"25\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4s<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"15\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e4s1\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"65\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e4s2\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    <!-- Subnivel 3d -->\r\n                    <g id=\"subnivel3d\" transform=\"translate(100, 300)\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"300\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#0288D1\" rx=\"5\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"150\" y=\"25\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3d<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"10\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3d1\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"40\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3d2\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"70\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3d3\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"100\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3d4\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"130\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3d5\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"160\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3d6\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"190\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3d7\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"220\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3d8\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"250\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3d9\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"280\" y=\"45\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"e3d10\">[ ]<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- DATOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>DATOS DEL DIAGRAMA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Elemento:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataElemento\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Z:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataZ\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Configuraci\u00f3n:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataConfiguracion\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Electrones desapareados:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataDesapareados\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Regla aplicada:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataRegla\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: DOMINA LOS ORBITALES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la configuraci\u00f3n correcta para el N (Z=7)?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span> 1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b2\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span> 1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b3\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span> 1s\u00b2 2s\u00b3 2p\u00b2\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span> 1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2074\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> 1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u00b3 (Regla de Hund: 3 electrones unpaired en 2p).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la regla de Hund para subniveles p.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 elemento tiene esta configuraci\u00f3n: [Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u2075?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span> S\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span> Ar\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span> Cl\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span> P\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Cl (Z=17) \u2192 [Ne] 3s\u00b2 3p\u2075.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Cuenta los electrones: 2 + 5 = 7 en el nivel 3.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la excepci\u00f3n en la configuraci\u00f3n del Cr (Z=24)?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span> 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span> 4s\u00b2 3d\u2074\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span> 4s\u00b2 3d\u00b3\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span> 3d\u2076\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Cr: [Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075 (estabilidad de subnivel medio lleno).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa las excepciones para Cr y Cu.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR ORDEN DE AUFBAU<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"El 3d se llena despu\u00e9s del 4p\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El orden es 4s \u2192 3d \u2192 4p (4s tiene menor energ\u00eda que 3d).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Sc (Z=21) \u2192 [Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u00b9 (no 3d\u00b3).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c OLVIDAR LA REGLA DE HUND<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"El carbono (C) tiene 2p: [\u2191\u2193] [ ] [ ]\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> C (Z=6) \u2192 2p: [\u2191] [\u2191] [ ] (electrones unpaired primero).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Diagramas de Orbitales<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Dibuja el diagrama de orbitales para los siguientes elementos:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Al (Z=13)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>S (Z=16)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Fe (Z=26)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Indica cu\u00e1ntos electrones desapareados tiene cada uno.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu respuesta aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. <strong>Al (Z=13):<\/strong> 1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2 3p\u00b9 \u2192 1 electr\u00f3n desapareado.<br>\r\n                    2. <strong>S (Z=16):<\/strong> 1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2 3p\u2074 \u2192 2 electrones desapareados.<br>\r\n                    3. <strong>Fe (Z=26):<\/strong> 1s\u00b2 2s\u00b2 2p\u2076 3s\u00b2 3p\u2076 4s\u00b2 3d\u2076 \u2192 4 electrones desapareados.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Excepciones y Estabilidad<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Explica por qu\u00e9 el Cr (Z=24) y el Cu (Z=29) son excepciones al principio de Aufbau.<\/p>\r\n                    <p>Incluye:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Configuraci\u00f3n esperada vs real.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Raz\u00f3n de la estabilidad.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Diagrama de orbitales para ambas configuraciones.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu respuesta aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"10\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    <strong>Cr (Z=24):<\/strong><br>\r\n                    - Esperada: [Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2074<br>\r\n                    - Real: [Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u2075<br>\r\n                    - Raz\u00f3n: Subnivel d\u2075 (medio lleno) es m\u00e1s estable.<br><br>\r\n                    <strong>Cu (Z=29):<\/strong><br>\r\n                    - Esperada: [Ar] 4s\u00b2 3d\u2079<br>\r\n                    - Real: [Ar] 4s\u00b9 3d\u00b9\u2070<br>\r\n                    - Raz\u00f3n: Subnivel d\u00b9\u2070 (lleno) es m\u00e1s estable.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (3 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (2 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (1 pt)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Diagramas correctos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Todos los diagramas dibujados correctamente<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Error en 1 diagrama<\/td>\r\n                    <td>M\u00faltiples errores<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Explicaci\u00f3n de excepciones<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explica claramente la estabilidad de d\u2075\/d\u00b9\u2070<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explicaci\u00f3n parcial<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No menciona estabilidad<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Reglas de Aufbau, Pauli y Hund:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Diagramas de orbitales:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo influyen los diagramas de orbitales en las propiedades qu\u00edmicas de los elementos?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: Reactividad, formaci\u00f3n de enlaces...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar orden de Aufbau<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Practicar diagramas para Z=1\u201320<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83e\uddea PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Resolver 10 problemas de configuraciones<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Identificar excepciones (Cr, Cu)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/legacy\/build-an-atom\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udfae Simulador PhET: Construye un \u00c1tomo\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ptable.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udf10 Tabla Peri\u00f3dica Interactiva\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ BASE DE DATOS DE CONFIGURACIONES ELECTR\u00d3NICAS\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    const configuraciones = {\r\n        \"H\": { Z: 1, config: \"1s1\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\"] }, desapareados: 1, regla: \"Aufbau\" },\r\n        \"He\": { Z: 2, config: \"1s2\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"] }, desapareados: 0, regla: \"Pauli\" },\r\n        \"Li\": { Z: 3, config: \"1s2 2s1\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\"] }, desapareados: 1, regla: \"Aufbau\" },\r\n        \"Be\": { Z: 4, config: \"1s2 2s2\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"] }, desapareados: 0, regla: \"Pauli\" },\r\n        \"B\": { Z: 5, config: \"1s2 2s2 2p1\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2p\": [\"\u2191\"] }, desapareados: 1, regla: \"Hund\" },\r\n        \"C\": { Z: 6, config: \"1s2 2s2 2p2\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2p\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2191\"] }, desapareados: 2, regla: \"Hund\" },\r\n        \"N\": { Z: 7, config: \"1s2 2s2 2p3\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2p\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2191\", \"\u2191\"] }, desapareados: 3, regla: \"Hund\" },\r\n        \"O\": { Z: 8, config: \"1s2 2s2 2p4\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\", \"\u2191\"] }, desapareados: 2, regla: \"Hund\" },\r\n        \"F\": { Z: 9, config: \"1s2 2s2 2p5\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\"] }, desapareados: 1, regla: \"Hund\" },\r\n        \"Ne\": { Z: 10, config: \"1s2 2s2 2p6\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\"] }, desapareados: 0, regla: \"Pauli\" },\r\n        \"Na\": { Z: 11, config: \"1s2 2s2 2p6 3s1\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\"], \"3s\": [\"\u2191\"] }, desapareados: 1, regla: \"Aufbau\" },\r\n        \"Mg\": { Z: 12, config: \"1s2 2s2 2p6 3s2\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\"], \"3s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"] }, desapareados: 0, regla: \"Pauli\" },\r\n        \"Al\": { Z: 13, config: \"1s2 2s2 2p6 3s2 3p1\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\"], \"3s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"3p\": [\"\u2191\"] }, desapareados: 1, regla: \"Hund\" },\r\n        \"Si\": { Z: 14, config: \"1s2 2s2 2p6 3s2 3p2\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\"], \"3s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"3p\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2191\"] }, desapareados: 2, regla: \"Hund\" },\r\n        \"P\": { Z: 15, config: \"1s2 2s2 2p6 3s2 3p3\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\"], \"3s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"3p\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2191\", \"\u2191\"] }, desapareados: 3, regla: \"Hund\" },\r\n        \"S\": { Z: 16, config: \"1s2 2s2 2p6 3s2 3p4\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\"], \"3s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"3p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\", \"\u2191\"] }, desapareados: 2, regla: \"Hund\" },\r\n        \"Cl\": { Z: 17, config: \"1s2 2s2 2p6 3s2 3p5\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\"], \"3s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"3p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\"] }, desapareados: 1, regla: \"Hund\" },\r\n        \"Ar\": { Z: 18, config: \"1s2 2s2 2p6 3s2 3p6\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\"], \"3s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"3p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\"] }, desapareados: 0, regla: \"Pauli\" },\r\n        \"Cr\": { Z: 24, config: \"1s2 2s2 2p6 3s2 3p6 4s1 3d5\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\"], \"3s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"3p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\"], \"4s\": [\"\u2191\"], \"3d\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2191\", \"\u2191\", \"\u2191\", \"\u2191\"] }, desapareados: 6, regla: \"Excepci\u00f3n\" },\r\n        \"Cu\": { Z: 29, config: \"1s2 2s2 2p6 3s2 3p6 4s1 3d10\", diagram: { \"1s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"2p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\"], \"3s\": [\"\u2191\", \"\u2193\"], \"3p\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\"], \"4s\": [\"\u2191\"], \"3d\": [\"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\", \"\u2191\u2193\"] }, desapareados: 1, regla: \"Excepci\u00f3n\" }\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ SIMULADOR DE ORBITALES\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function generarDiagrama() {\r\n        const elemento = document.getElementById('elementoSelect').value;\r\n        const configManual = document.getElementById('configManual').value.trim();\r\n        let configData;\r\n\r\n        if (configManual) {\r\n            \/\/ Procesar configuraci\u00f3n manual (simplificado)\r\n            configData = {\r\n                Z: configManual.split(' ').reduce((sum, orb) => sum + parseInt(orb.replace(\/\\D\/g, '')), 0),\r\n                config: configManual,\r\n                diagram: parseConfigManual(configManual),\r\n                desapareados: 0,\r\n                regla: \"Manual\"\r\n            };\r\n        } else {\r\n            configData = configuraciones[elemento];\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n        document.getElementById('tituloElemento').textContent = `${elemento} (Z=${configData.Z})`;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataElemento').textContent = elemento;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataZ').textContent = configData.Z;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataConfiguracion').textContent = configData.config;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataDesapareados').textContent = configData.desapareados;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataRegla').textContent = configData.regla;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar SVG\r\n        actualizarDiagramaSVG(configData.diagram);\r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udd2c Diagrama generado para ${elemento}: ${configData.config}`);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function parseConfigManual(config) {\r\n        \/\/ Simplificado: Devuelve un diagrama vac\u00edo para configuraciones manuales\r\n        return { \"1s\": [\" \", \" \"] };\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function actualizarDiagramaSVG(diagram) {\r\n        \/\/ Limpiar todos los orbitales\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('[id^=\"e\"]').forEach(el => {\r\n            el.textContent = \"[ ]\";\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Llenar seg\u00fan el diagrama\r\n        for (const [orbital, electrones] of Object.entries(diagram)) {\r\n            const orbitalMap = {\r\n                \"1s\": [\"e1s1\", \"e1s2\"],\r\n                \"2s\": [\"e2s1\", \"e2s2\"],\r\n                \"2p\": [\"e2p1\", \"e2p2\", \"e2p3\", \"e2p4\", \"e2p5\", \"e2p6\"],\r\n                \"3s\": [\"e3s1\", \"e3s2\"],\r\n                \"3p\": [\"e3p1\", \"e3p2\", \"e3p3\", \"e3p4\", \"e3p5\", \"e3p6\"],\r\n                \"4s\": [\"e4s1\", \"e4s2\"],\r\n                \"3d\": [\"e3d1\", \"e3d2\", \"e3d3\", \"e3d4\", \"e3d5\", \"e3d6\", \"e3d7\", \"e3d8\", \"e3d9\", \"e3d10\"]\r\n            };\r\n\r\n            if (orbitalMap[orbital]) {\r\n                electrones.forEach((e, i) => {\r\n                    const id = orbitalMap[orbital][i];\r\n                    if (id && document.getElementById(id)) {\r\n                        document.getElementById(id).textContent = `[${e}]`;\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function elementoAleatorio() {\r\n        const elementos = Object.keys(configuraciones);\r\n        const elem = elementos[Math.floor(Math.random() * elementos.length)];\r\n        document.getElementById('elementoSelect').value = elem;\r\n        document.getElementById('configManual').value = \"\";\r\n        generarDiagrama();\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function reiniciarSimulador() {\r\n        document.getElementById('elementoSelect').value = \"H\";\r\n        document.getElementById('configManual').value = \"\";\r\n        document.getElementById('tituloElemento').textContent = \"Selecciona un elemento\";\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('[id^=\"e\"]').forEach(el => {\r\n            el.textContent = \"[ ]\";\r\n        });\r\n        document.getElementById('dataElemento').textContent = \"-\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataZ').textContent = \"-\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataConfiguracion').textContent = \"-\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataDesapareados').textContent = \"-\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataRegla').textContent = \"-\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    let quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n                q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n            );\r\n            if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n                quizCompletado = true;\r\n                mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/3`;\r\n        let feedback = \"\";\r\n        if (correctas >= 2) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d \u00a1Excelente! Dominas los diagramas de orbitales.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Revisa las reglas de Aufbau, Pauli y Hund.\";\r\n        }\r\n        document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        quizRespuestas = [];\r\n        quizCompletado = false;\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ ERRORES COMUNES\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function toggleError(header) {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n        if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        } else {\r\n            content.style.display = 'block';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function verificarProblema(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n        const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n        const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2)) \/ 2;\r\n        alert(`\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Reglas: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Diagramas: ${slider2}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `\u00a1Sigue practicando con el simulador!`);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: Diagramas de Orbitales cargada\");\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83c\udfaf Objetivos: Dominar Aufbau, Pauli, Hund y excepciones\");\r\n    generarDiagrama(); \/\/ Cargar H por defecto\r\n<\/script>\r\n","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Diagrama de O (Z=8)","respuesta":"1s\u2191\u2193 2s\u2191\u2193 2p\u2191\u2193 \u2191 \u2191"},{"enunciado":"Diagrama de N (Z=7)","respuesta":"1s\u2191\u2193 2s\u2191\u2193 2p\u2191 \u2191 \u2191"},{"enunciado":"Pauli permite por orbital","respuesta":"2 (\u2191\u2193)"},{"enunciado":"Diagrama de F (Z=9)","respuesta":"1s\u2191\u2193 2s\u2191\u2193 2p\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191"},{"enunciado":"Diagrama de Ne (Z=10)","respuesta":"1s\u2191\u2193 2s\u2191\u2193 2p\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193"},{"enunciado":"Hund para 2p\u00b3","respuesta":"\u2191 \u2191 \u2191"},{"enunciado":"Diagrama de Cr (excepci\u00f3n)","respuesta":"4s\u2191 3d\u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191"},{"enunciado":"Diagrama de Cu (excepci\u00f3n)","respuesta":"4s\u2191 3d\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193"},{"enunciado":"Spin up es","respuesta":"+1\/2"},{"enunciado":"Diagrama de Fe (Z=26)","respuesta":"4s\u2191\u2193 3d\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC: diagrama muestra","respuesta":"Distribuci\u00f3n real (con excepciones)"},{"enunciado":"M\u00e1ximo unpaired en d\u2075","respuesta":"5 (\u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191)"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Diagrama orbital usa...","opciones":["Cajas y flechas","N\u00fameros","Letras","Colores"],"correcta":"Cajas y flechas"},{"pregunta":"Hund dice...","opciones":["Unpaired primero","Paired primero","Aleatorio","Nada"],"correcta":"Unpaired primero"},{"pregunta":"Pauli permite...","opciones":["2 e\u207b\/caja","1 e\u207b\/caja","3 e\u207b\/caja","Ilimitado"],"correcta":"2 e\u207b\/caja"},{"pregunta":"Ne tiene...","opciones":["Todo paired","Unpaired","Mitad","Nada"],"correcta":"Todo paired"},{"pregunta":"C tiene en 2p...","opciones":["2 unpaired","1 unpaired","0 unpaired","3 unpaired"],"correcta":"2 unpaired"},{"pregunta":"N tiene en 2p...","opciones":["3 unpaired","2 unpaired","1 unpaired","0"],"correcta":"3 unpaired"},{"pregunta":"Flecha \u2191 es spin...","opciones":["+1\/2","\u22121\/2","0","+1"],"correcta":"+1\/2"},{"pregunta":"Flecha \u2193 es spin...","opciones":["\u22121\/2","+1\/2","0","\u22121"],"correcta":"\u22121\/2"},{"pregunta":"Subnivel p tiene...","opciones":["3 cajas","1 caja","5 cajas","7 cajas"],"correcta":"3 cajas"},{"pregunta":"Subnivel d tiene...","opciones":["5 cajas","3 cajas","1 caja","7 cajas"],"correcta":"5 cajas"},{"pregunta":"O tiene en 2p...","opciones":["2 unpaired","1 unpaired","3 unpaired","0"],"correcta":"2 unpaired"},{"pregunta":"F tiene en 2p...","opciones":["1 unpaired","2 unpaired","0","3"],"correcta":"1 unpaired"},{"pregunta":"Cr diagrama 3d...","opciones":["5 unpaired","4 unpaired","6 unpaired","0"],"correcta":"5 unpaired"},{"pregunta":"Cu diagrama 3d...","opciones":["Todo paired","1 unpaired","5 unpaired","3"],"correcta":"Todo paired"},{"pregunta":"Diagrama de S (Z=16)","opciones":["2p\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191","2p\u2191\u2193 \u2191 \u2191","2p\u2191 \u2191 \u2191","2p\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193"],"correcta":"2p\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191"},{"pregunta":"Diagrama de Cl (Z=17)","opciones":["3p\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191","3p\u2191\u2193 \u2191 \u2191","3p\u2191 \u2191 \u2191","3p\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193"],"correcta":"3p\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e1ximo unpaired en p\u2074","opciones":["2","1","3","0"],"correcta":"2"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC permite...","opciones":["Excepciones en diagrama","Solo te\u00f3rico","Ninguna","Solo s,p"],"correcta":"Excepciones en diagrama"},{"pregunta":"Diagrama de V (Z=23)","opciones":["3d\u2191 \u2191 \u2191","3d\u2191\u2193 \u2191 \u2191","3d\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191","3d\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193"],"correcta":"3d\u2191 \u2191 \u2191"},{"pregunta":"Hund maximiza...","opciones":["Multiplicidad de spin","Energ\u00eda","Masa","Volumen"],"correcta":"Multiplicidad de spin"},{"pregunta":"Diagrama de Mn\u00b2\u207a (Z=25)","opciones":["3d\u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191","3d\u2191\u2193 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191","3d\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191","3d\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193"],"correcta":"3d\u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191"},{"pregunta":"Diagrama de Co\u00b3\u207a (Z=27)","opciones":["3d\u2191\u2193 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191","3d\u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191","3d\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193","3d\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191"],"correcta":"3d\u2191\u2193 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191"},{"pregunta":"Diagrama de Ni\u00b2\u207a (Z=28)","opciones":["3d\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2191","3d\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193","3d\u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191","3d\u2191\u2193 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191"],"correcta":"3d\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2191"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e1ximo unpaired en d\u2076 (high spin)","opciones":["4","3","2","5"],"correcta":"4"},{"pregunta":"Diagrama de Gd (Z=64)","opciones":["4f\u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191","4f\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193","4f\u2191\u2193 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191","4f\u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191"],"correcta":"4f\u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC: diagrama debe mostrar...","opciones":["Configuraci\u00f3n experimental","Solo te\u00f3rica","Solo s,p","Nada"],"correcta":"Configuraci\u00f3n experimental"},{"pregunta":"Diagrama de Pt (Z=78)","opciones":["5d\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191","5d\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193","5d\u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191","5d\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193"],"correcta":"5d\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191"},{"pregunta":"Hund aplica a...","opciones":["p, d, f","solo s","solo p","ninguno"],"correcta":"p, d, f"},{"pregunta":"Pauli se viola si...","opciones":["\u2191\u2191 en misma caja","\u2191\u2193 en misma caja","\u2191 en caja vac\u00eda","\u2193 en caja llena"],"correcta":"\u2191\u2191 en misma caja"},{"pregunta":"Diagrama de U (Z=92)","opciones":["5f\u2191 \u2191 \u2191 6d\u2191","5f\u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193 \u2191\u2193","5f\u2191 \u2191 \u2191 \u2191","5f\u2191\u2193 \u2191 \u2191"],"correcta":"5f\u2191 \u2191 \u2191 6d\u2191"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"electronegatividad-cyberpunk","titulo":"Electronegatividad: El Poder de Atraer Electrones en el Mundo Cu\u00e1ntico","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-quimica-electronegatividad\" data-tema=\"electronegatividad\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n            ELECTRONEGATIVIDAD: EL PODER CU\u00c1NTICO\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            De los Enlaces Apolares a las Mol\u00e9culas Polares\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Explicar la escala de Pauling<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Identificar valores clave (F=4.0, Cs=0.7) y su significado<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar tendencias peri\u00f3dicas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Relacionar \u03c7 con posici\u00f3n en la tabla peri\u00f3dica<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Clasificar enlaces por \u0394\u03c7<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Diferenciar covalente apolar, polar e i\u00f3nico<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar en mol\u00e9culas reales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Predecir polaridad en H\u2082O, CO\u2082, NH\u2083<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACIONES EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udc8a F\u00c1RMACOS<\/h3>\r\n                <p>La polaridad de enlaces determina solubilidad y biodisponibilidad<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Ejemplo: Paracetamol (enlaces C\u2013O polares)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf27\ufe0f METEOROLOG\u00cdA<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Mol\u00e9culas polares (H\u2082O) forman nubes y precipitaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">\u0394\u03c7(H\u2013O) = 1.4 \u2192 Polar<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd0b BATER\u00cdAS<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Enlaces i\u00f3nicos (LiF) permiten almacenamiento de energ\u00eda<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">\u0394\u03c7(Li\u2013F) = 3.0 \u2192 I\u00f3nico<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- DEFINICI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. \u00bfQu\u00e9 es la Electronegatividad?<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>ELECTRONEGATIVIDAD (\u03c7)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Capacidad de un \u00e1tomo para <strong>atraer electrones<\/strong> en un enlace qu\u00edmico<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        \\text{\u03c7} \\propto \\frac{\\text{Fuerza de atracci\u00f3n}}{\\text{Distancia}}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-destacado\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> En <strong>H\u2013F<\/strong>, el fl\u00faor (\u03c7=4.0) \"roba\" electrones del hidr\u00f3geno (\u03c7=2.1)\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- ESCALA DE PAULING -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Escala de Pauling<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>Elemento<\/th>\r\n                            <th>\u03c7 (Pauling)<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Tendencia<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr data-elemento=\"F\"><td><strong>F<\/strong><\/td><td>4.0<\/td><td>M\u00e1xima<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-elemento=\"O\"><td><strong>O<\/strong><\/td><td>3.5<\/td><td>Alta<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-elemento=\"Cl\"><td><strong>Cl<\/strong><\/td><td>3.0<\/td><td>Alta<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-elemento=\"N\"><td><strong>N<\/strong><\/td><td>3.0<\/td><td>Alta<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-elemento=\"C\"><td><strong>C<\/strong><\/td><td>2.5<\/td><td>Media<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-elemento=\"H\"><td><strong>H<\/strong><\/td><td>2.1<\/td><td>Media<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-elemento=\"Na\"><td><strong>Na<\/strong><\/td><td>0.9<\/td><td>Baja<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-elemento=\"Cs\"><td><strong>Cs<\/strong><\/td><td>0.7<\/td><td>M\u00ednima<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoElemento\">\r\n                    Selecciona un elemento para ver detalles\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TENDENCIAS PERI\u00d3DICAS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Tendencias en la Tabla Peri\u00f3dica<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tendencias-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"tendencia-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tendencia-icon\">\u2192<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>MISMO PER\u00cdODO<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Aumenta<\/strong> de izquierda a derecha<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo\">Li (1.0) < Na (0.9) < Be (1.5) < B (2.0)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"tendencia-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tendencia-icon\">\u2193<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>MISMO GRUPO<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Disminuye<\/strong> de arriba abajo<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo\">F (4.0) > Cl (3.0) > Br (2.8) > I (2.5)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"tendencia-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tendencia-icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>EXCEPCI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Gases nobles <strong>no tienen \u03c7 definida<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"visualizacion-tendencia\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 300\" id=\"svgTendencia\">\r\n                    <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n                    <!-- Grupos 1-2 -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"80\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#FF5722\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"90\" y=\"120\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"90\" y=\"220\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2<\/text>\r\n                    <!-- Grupos 13-18 -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"470\" y=\"50\" width=\"80\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#2196F3\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"510\" y=\"80\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">13<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"510\" y=\"220\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">18<\/text>\r\n                    <!-- Flechas -->\r\n                    <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#00BCD4\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#flecha)\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"90\" fill=\"#00BCD4\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\u03c7 AUMENTA<\/text>\r\n                    <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#FF9800\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#flecha)\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"90\" y=\"180\" fill=\"#FF9800\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\u03c7 DISMINUYE<\/text>\r\n                    <!-- Elementos clave -->\r\n                    <circle cx=\"530\" cy=\"80\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FFEB3B\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"530\" y=\"85\" fill=\"black\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">F<\/text>\r\n                    <circle cx=\"70\" y=\"230\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FF5722\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"70\" y=\"235\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Cs<\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TIPO DE ENLACE POR \u0394\u03c7 -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Clasificaci\u00f3n de Enlaces<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"clasificacion-enlaces\">\r\n                <div class=\"enlace-card\" data-tipo=\"apolar\">\r\n                    <div class=\"enlace-header\">\u0394\u03c7 = 0.0 \u2013 0.4<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"enlace-body\">\r\n                        <h4>COVALENTE APOLAR<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Electrones compartidos <strong>igualmente<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo\">H\u2013H (\u0394\u03c7=0.0), Cl\u2013Cl (\u0394\u03c7=0.0)<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"enlace-card\" data-tipo=\"polar\">\r\n                    <div class=\"enlace-header\">\u0394\u03c7 = 0.4 \u2013 1.7<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"enlace-body\">\r\n                        <h4>COVALENTE POLAR<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Electrones compartidos <strong>desigualmente<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo\">H\u2013Cl (\u0394\u03c7=0.9), O\u2013H (\u0394\u03c7=1.4)<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"enlace-card\" data-tipo=\"ionico\">\r\n                    <div class=\"enlace-header\">\u0394\u03c7 > 1.7<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"enlace-body\">\r\n                        <h4>I\u00d3NICO<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Transferencia <strong>completa<\/strong> de electrones<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo\">Na\u2013Cl (\u0394\u03c7=2.1), K\u2013F (\u0394\u03c7=3.2)<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- ESCALAS ALTERNATIVAS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>5. Otras Escalas de Electronegatividad<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"escalas-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"escala-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd2c MULLIKEN<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        \\text{\u03c7}_M = \\frac{\\text{IE} + \\text{EA}}{2}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p>Basada en <strong>energ\u00eda de ionizaci\u00f3n (IE)<\/strong> y <strong>afinidad electr\u00f3nica (EA)<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"escala-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcca ALLRED-ROCHOW<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        \\text{\u03c7}_{AR} = 0.359 \\frac{Z_{\\text{ef}}}{r^2} + 0.744\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p>Considera <strong>carga nuclear efectiva (Z\u2091\u2093)<\/strong> y <strong>radio at\u00f3mico (r)<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"escala-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udf10 PAULING (IUPAC)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Escala <strong>est\u00e1ndar<\/strong> m\u00e1s utilizada<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-neon\">F=4.0 (referencia)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: PREDICTOR DE POLARIDAD\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"polaridad\">\r\n            <!-- CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>PAR\u00c1METROS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"elemento1\">\u00c1tomo 1:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"elemento1\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"H\">H (2.1)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"C\">C (2.5)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"N\">N (3.0)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"O\">O (3.5)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"F\">F (4.0)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Na\">Na (0.9)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Cl\">Cl (3.0)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"elemento2\">\u00c1tomo 2:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"elemento2\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"H\">H (2.1)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"C\">C (2.5)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"N\">N (3.0)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"O\">O (3.5)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"F\">F (4.0)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Na\">Na (0.9)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Cl\">Cl (3.0)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-simular\" onclick=\"simularEnlace()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u26a1<\/span> SIMULAR ENLACE\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"enlaceAleatorio()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> EJEMPLO ALEATORIO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacionEnlace\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 300\" id=\"svgEnlace\">\r\n                    <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n                    <!-- \u00c1tomo 1 (izquierda) -->\r\n                    <g id=\"atomo1\" transform=\"translate(150, 150)\">\r\n                        <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#FF5722\" id=\"circulo1\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"0\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"simbolo1\">H<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#FFC107\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"chi1\">2.1<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    <!-- Enlace -->\r\n                    <line x1=\"190\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#00BCD4\" stroke-width=\"4\" id=\"lineaEnlace\"\/>\r\n                    <!-- \u00c1tomo 2 (derecha) -->\r\n                    <g id=\"atomo2\" transform=\"translate(350, 150)\">\r\n                        <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#2196F3\" id=\"circulo2\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"0\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"simbolo2\">H<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#03A9F4\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"chi2\">2.1<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    <!-- Resultado -->\r\n                    <g id=\"resultado\" transform=\"translate(250, 250)\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"-100\" y=\"-20\" width=\"200\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"10\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"textoResultado\">\u0394\u03c7 = 0.0<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"35\" fill=\"#FFEB3B\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"tipoEnlace\">Apolar<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    <!-- Nube electr\u00f3nica (polar) -->\r\n                    <ellipse cx=\"250\" cy=\"150\" rx=\"60\" ry=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFEB3B\" stroke-width=\"2\" id=\"nubeElectronica\" opacity=\"0\"\/>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- DATOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>DATOS DEL ENLACE<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">\u0394\u03c7:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataDeltaChi\">0.0<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Tipo:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTipoEnlace\">Apolar<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">% Car\u00e1cter i\u00f3nico:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPorcentajeIonico\">0%<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Mol\u00e9cula ejemplo:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataMol\u00e9culaEjemplo\">H\u2082<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: DOMINA LA ELECTRONEGATIVIDAD\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l elemento tiene la mayor electronegatividad?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span> Na\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span> C\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span> F\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span> Al\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> El fl\u00faor (F) tiene \u03c7=4.0, el valor m\u00e1ximo.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la escala de Pauling.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 tipo de enlace tiene NaCl (\u0394\u03c7=2.1)?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span> Covalente apolar\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span> I\u00f3nico\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span> Covalente polar\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span> Met\u00e1lico\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> \u0394\u03c7=2.1 > 1.7 \u2192 Enlace i\u00f3nico.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa los rangos de \u0394\u03c7 para cada tipo de enlace.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l mol\u00e9cula es APOLAR?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span> H\u2082\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span> HCl\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span> H\u2082O\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span> NH\u2083\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> H\u2082 tiene \u0394\u03c7=0.0 (enlace H\u2013H).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Las mol\u00e9culas apolares tienen \u0394\u03c7 < 0.4.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR POLARIDAD CON SOLUBILIDAD<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"Todas las mol\u00e9culas polares son solubles en agua\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La solubilidad depende de <strong>interacciones espec\u00edficas<\/strong> (puentes H, fuerzas dipolo-dipolo).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> El aceite (apolar) no se disuelve en agua (polar).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c IGNORAR EXCEPCIONES EN LA TABLA<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"El \u03c7 siempre aumenta en un grupo de arriba abajo\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> En el <strong>Grupo 1<\/strong>, el \u03c7 aumenta de Li (1.0) a H (2.1) por el peque\u00f1o tama\u00f1o del hidr\u00f3geno.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Clasificaci\u00f3n de Enlaces<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Clasifica los siguientes enlaces seg\u00fan su \u0394\u03c7 y tipo:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>C\u2013H (\u03c7_C=2.5, \u03c7_H=2.1)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>O\u2013H (\u03c7_O=3.5, \u03c7_H=2.1)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Na\u2013Cl (\u03c7_Na=0.9, \u03c7_Cl=3.0)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>F\u2013F (\u03c7_F=4.0)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Calcula \u0394\u03c7 y determina si son apolares, polares o i\u00f3nicos.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu respuesta aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"6\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. <strong>C\u2013H:<\/strong> \u0394\u03c7=0.4 \u2192 Covalente polar<br>\r\n                    2. <strong>O\u2013H:<\/strong> \u0394\u03c7=1.4 \u2192 Covalente polar<br>\r\n                    3. <strong>Na\u2013Cl:<\/strong> \u0394\u03c7=2.1 \u2192 I\u00f3nico<br>\r\n                    4. <strong>F\u2013F:<\/strong> \u0394\u03c7=0.0 \u2192 Covalente apolar\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Polaridad Molecular<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Predice la polaridad de las siguientes mol\u00e9culas:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>CO\u2082 (lineal)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>H\u2082O (angular)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>CH\u2084 (tetra\u00e9drica)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Justifica usando electronegatividades y geometr\u00eda.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Explica tu razonamiento...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. <strong>CO\u2082:<\/strong> Apolar (\u0394\u03c7=1.0, pero geometr\u00eda lineal cancela dipolos).<br>\r\n                    2. <strong>H\u2082O:<\/strong> Polar (\u0394\u03c7=1.4, geometr\u00eda angular no cancela dipolos).<br>\r\n                    3. <strong>CH\u2084:<\/strong> Apolar (\u0394\u03c7=0.4, geometr\u00eda tetra\u00e9drica sim\u00e9trica).\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (3 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (2 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (1 pt)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>C\u00e1lculo correcto de \u0394\u03c7<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Todos los \u0394\u03c7 calculados correctamente<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Error en 1 c\u00e1lculo<\/td>\r\n                    <td>M\u00faltiples errores<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Clasificaci\u00f3n de enlaces<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Todos los enlaces clasificados correctamente<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Error en 1 clasificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                    <td>M\u00faltiples errores<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Escala de Pauling:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Tendencias peri\u00f3dicas:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo afecta la electronegatividad a las propiedades de los materiales que usas diariamente?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: Pl\u00e1sticos, medicinas, electr\u00f3nicos...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar \u03c7 de F, O, N, C, H<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Rangos de \u0394\u03c7 para cada tipo de enlace<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83e\uddea PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Clasificar 10 mol\u00e9culas por polaridad<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Resolver 5 problemas de \u0394\u03c7<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/legacy\/molecule-polarity\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udfae Simulador PhET: Polaridad Molecular\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ptable.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udf10 Tabla Peri\u00f3dica Interactiva\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ BASE DE DATOS DE ELECTRONEGATIVIDADES\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    const electronegatividades = {\r\n        \"H\": 2.1, \"C\": 2.5, \"N\": 3.0, \"O\": 3.5,\r\n        \"F\": 4.0, \"Na\": 0.9, \"Cl\": 3.0, \"Cs\": 0.7\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ SIMULADOR DE POLARIDAD\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function simularEnlace() {\r\n        const elemento1 = document.getElementById('elemento1').value;\r\n        const elemento2 = document.getElementById('elemento2').value;\r\n        const chi1 = electronegatividades[elemento1];\r\n        const chi2 = electronegatividades[elemento2];\r\n        const deltaChi = Math.abs(chi1 - chi2).toFixed(1);\r\n        let tipoEnlace = \"\";\r\n        let colorEnlace = \"#00BCD4\";\r\n        let porcentajeIonico = 0;\r\n        let moleculaEjemplo = \"\";\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Clasificar enlace\r\n        if (deltaChi <= 0.4) {\r\n            tipoEnlace = \"Apolar\";\r\n            colorEnlace = \"#4CAF50\";\r\n            moleculaEjemplo = elemento1 === elemento2 ? elemento1 + \"\u2082\" : elemento1 + elemento2;\r\n        } else if (deltaChi <= 1.7) {\r\n            tipoEnlace = \"Covalente Polar\";\r\n            colorEnlace = \"#FF9800\";\r\n            porcentajeIonico = Math.round((deltaChi \/ 1.7) * 50);\r\n            moleculaEjemplo = elemento1 + elemento2;\r\n        } else {\r\n            tipoEnlace = \"I\u00f3nico\";\r\n            colorEnlace = \"#F44336\";\r\n            porcentajeIonico = Math.round(50 + ((deltaChi - 1.7) \/ 2.3) * 50);\r\n            moleculaEjemplo = elemento1 + elemento2;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar SVG\r\n        document.getElementById('simbolo1').textContent = elemento1;\r\n        document.getElementById('simbolo2').textContent = elemento2;\r\n        document.getElementById('chi1').textContent = chi1;\r\n        document.getElementById('chi2').textContent = chi2;\r\n        document.getElementById('textoResultado').textContent = `\u0394\u03c7 = ${deltaChi}`;\r\n        document.getElementById('tipoEnlace').textContent = tipoEnlace;\r\n        document.getElementById('lineaEnlace').style.stroke = colorEnlace;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataDeltaChi').textContent = deltaChi;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataTipoEnlace').textContent = tipoEnlace;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataPorcentajeIonico').textContent = porcentajeIonico + \"%\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataMol\u00e9culaEjemplo').textContent = moleculaEjemplo;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar nube electr\u00f3nica si es polar\r\n        const nube = document.getElementById('nubeElectronica');\r\n        if (deltaChi > 0.4) {\r\n            nube.style.opacity = \"1\";\r\n            nube.setAttribute('cx', chi1 > chi2 ? \"200\" : \"300\");\r\n        } else {\r\n            nube.style.opacity = \"0\";\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar resultado\r\n        document.getElementById('resultado').style.opacity = \"1\";\r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udd2c Simulaci\u00f3n: ${elemento1}\u2013${elemento2} | \u0394\u03c7=${deltaChi} | ${tipoEnlace}`);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function enlaceAleatorio() {\r\n        const elementos = Object.keys(electronegatividades);\r\n        const elem1 = elementos[Math.floor(Math.random() * elementos.length)];\r\n        let elem2 = elementos[Math.floor(Math.random() * elementos.length)];\r\n        while (elem2 === elem1) {\r\n            elem2 = elementos[Math.floor(Math.random() * elementos.length)];\r\n        }\r\n        document.getElementById('elemento1').value = elem1;\r\n        document.getElementById('elemento2').value = elem2;\r\n        simularEnlace();\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    let quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n                q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n            );\r\n            if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n                quizCompletado = true;\r\n                mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/3`;\r\n        let feedback = \"\";\r\n        if (correctas >= 2) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d \u00a1Excelente! Dominas la electronegatividad.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Revisa los conceptos de \u0394\u03c7 y la escala de Pauling.\";\r\n        }\r\n        document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        quizRespuestas = [];\r\n        quizCompletado = false;\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ ERRORES COMUNES\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function toggleError(header) {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n        if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        } else {\r\n            content.style.display = 'block';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function verificarProblema(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n        const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n        const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2)) \/ 2;\r\n        alert(`\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Escala de Pauling: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Tendencias peri\u00f3dicas: ${slider2}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `\u00a1Sigue practicando con el simulador!`);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: Electronegatividad cargada\");\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83c\udfaf Objetivos: Dominar escala de Pauling, tendencias y polaridad\");\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Tabla interactiva de elementos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(row => {\r\n        row.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const elemento = this.dataset.elemento;\r\n            const info = {\r\n                \"F\": \"Fl\u00faor: M\u00e1xima electronegatividad (4.0). Forma enlaces i\u00f3nicos con casi todos los metales.\",\r\n                \"O\": \"Ox\u00edgeno: \u03c7=3.5. Esencial en mol\u00e9culas polares como H\u2082O.\",\r\n                \"Cl\": \"Cloro: \u03c7=3.0. Com\u00fan en sales i\u00f3nicas (NaCl) y \u00e1cidos (HCl).\",\r\n                \"N\": \"Nitr\u00f3geno: \u03c7=3.0. Presente en amino\u00e1cidos y bases nitrogenadas.\",\r\n                \"C\": \"Carbono: \u03c7=2.5. Base de la qu\u00edmica org\u00e1nica (enlaces C\u2013H, C\u2013O).\",\r\n                \"H\": \"Hidr\u00f3geno: \u03c7=2.1. \u00danico no metal con \u03c7 positiva en el Grupo 1.\",\r\n                \"Na\": \"Sodio: \u03c7=0.9. Metal alcalino, forma enlaces i\u00f3nicos (NaCl).\",\r\n                \"Cs\": \"Cesio: \u03c7=0.7. Menor electronegatividad de todos los elementos.\"\r\n            };\r\n            document.getElementById('infoElemento').textContent = info[elemento] || \"Selecciona un elemento\";\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Elemento m\u00e1s electronegativo","respuesta":"F (4.0)"},{"enunciado":"Elemento menos electronegativo","respuesta":"Cs (0.7)"},{"enunciado":"Tendencia en per\u00edodo","respuesta":"Aumenta de izquierda a derecha"},{"enunciado":"\u0394\u03c7 en H\u2013O","respuesta":"1.4 (polar)"},{"enunciado":"\u0394\u03c7 en C\u2013C","respuesta":"0 (apolar)"},{"enunciado":"\u0394\u03c7 en K\u2013F","respuesta":"3.2 (i\u00f3nico)"},{"enunciado":"Enlace m\u00e1s polar: H\u2013F o H\u2013Cl","respuesta":"H\u2013F (\u0394\u03c7=1.9)"},{"enunciado":"Enlace i\u00f3nico t\u00edpico","respuesta":"NaCl (\u0394\u03c7=2.1)"},{"enunciado":"\u03c7 de Cl","respuesta":"3.0"},{"enunciado":"Mulliken: \u03c7 =","respuesta":"(IE + EA)\/2"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC recomienda","respuesta":"Escala Pauling"},{"enunciado":"\u0394\u03c7 > 1.7 implica","respuesta":"Enlace predominantemente i\u00f3nico"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Electronegatividad mide...","opciones":["Atracci\u00f3n por e\u207b","Repulsi\u00f3n","Masa","Volumen"],"correcta":"Atracci\u00f3n por e\u207b"},{"pregunta":"Escala est\u00e1ndar","opciones":["Pauling","Mulliken","Newton","Celsius"],"correcta":"Pauling"},{"pregunta":"F tiene \u03c7 =","opciones":["4.0","3.5","3.0","2.5"],"correcta":"4.0"},{"pregunta":"Tendencia en grupo","opciones":["Disminuye abajo","Aumenta abajo","Igual","Variable"],"correcta":"Disminuye abajo"},{"pregunta":"Tendencia en per\u00edodo","opciones":["Aumenta derecha","Disminuye derecha","Igual","Variable"],"correcta":"Aumenta derecha"},{"pregunta":"\u0394\u03c7 = 0 \u2192 enlace","opciones":["Apolar","Polar","I\u00f3nico","Met\u00e1lico"],"correcta":"Apolar"},{"pregunta":"\u0394\u03c7 > 1.7 \u2192 enlace","opciones":["I\u00f3nico","Apolar","Covalente","Met\u00e1lico"],"correcta":"I\u00f3nico"},{"pregunta":"H\u2013Cl es","opciones":["Polar","Apolar","I\u00f3nico","Met\u00e1lico"],"correcta":"Polar"},{"pregunta":"Na\u2013F es","opciones":["I\u00f3nico","Polar","Apolar","Met\u00e1lico"],"correcta":"I\u00f3nico"},{"pregunta":"No metales tienen...","opciones":["Alta \u03c7","Baja \u03c7","Igual","Variable"],"correcta":"Alta \u03c7"},{"pregunta":"\u0394\u03c7 en O\u2013H","opciones":["1.4","0.9","2.1","0.0"],"correcta":"1.4"},{"pregunta":"\u0394\u03c7 en C\u2013H","opciones":["0.4","0.0","1.9","2.5"],"correcta":"0.4"},{"pregunta":"Enlace m\u00e1s polar","opciones":["H\u2013F","H\u2013Cl","H\u2013Br","H\u2013I"],"correcta":"H\u2013F"},{"pregunta":"\u03c7 de N","opciones":["3.0","2.5","3.5","4.0"],"correcta":"3.0"},{"pregunta":"\u03c7 de Li","opciones":["1.0","0.7","2.1","3.0"],"correcta":"1.0"},{"pregunta":"Mulliken usa","opciones":["IE + EA","Solo IE","Solo EA","Masa"],"correcta":"IE + EA"},{"pregunta":"Allred-Rochow basado en","opciones":["Carga efectiva","Radio","Masa","Volumen"],"correcta":"Carga efectiva"},{"pregunta":"Polaridad depende de","opciones":["\u0394\u03c7","Suma \u03c7","Producto","Nada"],"correcta":"\u0394\u03c7"},{"pregunta":"Enlace met\u00e1lico tiene","opciones":["\u0394\u03c7 \u2248 0","\u0394\u03c7 > 1.7","\u0394\u03c7 = 1","\u0394\u03c7 < 0"],"correcta":"\u0394\u03c7 \u2248 0"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC define \u03c7 como","opciones":["Pauling","Mulliken","Cualquier","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Pauling"},{"pregunta":"\u0394\u03c7 en Be\u2013F","opciones":["2.4","1.9","0.9","3.3"],"correcta":"2.4"},{"pregunta":"Enlace con \u0394\u03c7 = 1.8","opciones":["L\u00edmite i\u00f3nico","Polar","Apolar","Met\u00e1lico"],"correcta":"L\u00edmite i\u00f3nico"},{"pregunta":"Elemento con \u03c7 = 3.5","opciones":["O","F","N","Cl"],"correcta":"O"},{"pregunta":"\u03c7 de Br","opciones":["2.8","3.0","2.5","3.5"],"correcta":"2.8"},{"pregunta":"\u03c7 de I","opciones":["2.5","2.8","3.0","2.1"],"correcta":"2.5"},{"pregunta":"Escala m\u00e1s te\u00f3rica","opciones":["Mulliken","Pauling","Allred-Rochow","Sanderson"],"correcta":"Mulliken"},{"pregunta":"\u0394\u03c7 en Cs\u2013F","opciones":["3.3","2.1","1.9","0.9"],"correcta":"3.3"},{"pregunta":"Enlace H\u2013I","opciones":["Apolar (\u0394\u03c7=0.4)","Polar","I\u00f3nico","Met\u00e1lico"],"correcta":"Apolar (\u0394\u03c7=0.4)"},{"pregunta":"Polaridad m\u00e1xima en","opciones":["F\u2013F","H\u2013F","Na\u2013F","Cs\u2013F"],"correcta":"Cs\u2013F"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC 2025: \u03c7_F =","opciones":["4.0 (fijo)","3.98","4.1","variable"],"correcta":"4.0 (fijo)"}]},{"materia":"Qu\u00edmica I","slug":"clases-elementos-cyberpunk","titulo":"Clases de Elementos: Metales, No Metales y el Mundo de los Metaloides","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-quimica-elementos\" data-tema=\"clases-elementos\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/span>\r\n            CLASES DE ELEMENTOS: EL MAPA DE LA MATERIA\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Metales, No Metales y el Misterio de los Metaloides\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Clasificar elementos en metales, no metales y metaloides<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Identificar sus propiedades y ubicaci\u00f3n en la tabla peri\u00f3dica<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Reconocer las familias principales (grupos)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Alcalinos, hal\u00f3genos, gases nobles y metales de transici\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Explicar los bloques s, p, d, f<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Relacionar con la configuraci\u00f3n electr\u00f3nica<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar en ejemplos cotidianos<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Relacionar con materiales y tecnolog\u00edas<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACIONES EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcf1 TECNOLOG\u00cdA<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Los <strong>metaloides<\/strong> (Si, Ge) son esenciales en semiconductores para chips y paneles solares<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Ejemplo: Silicio en transistores<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\u26a1 ENERG\u00cdA<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Los <strong>metales alcalinos<\/strong> (Li, Na) se usan en bater\u00edas recargables<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Ejemplo: Litio en bater\u00edas de ion-litio<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udc8e JOYER\u00cdA<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Los <strong>metales nobles<\/strong> (Au, Ag, Pt) son resistentes a la corrosi\u00f3n y valiosos<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Ejemplo: Oro en electr\u00f3nica y joyer\u00eda<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- CLASIFICACI\u00d3N PRINCIPAL -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Clasificaci\u00f3n de los Elementos<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"clasificacion-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"clase-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"clase-header\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(45deg, #90CAF9, #64B5F6);\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd27 METALES<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"clase-body\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Ubicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Izquierda y centro de la tabla<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Propiedades:<\/strong> Conductores, maleables, d\u00factiles, brillo met\u00e1lico<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Fe, Cu, Na, Au, Al<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"clase-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"clase-header\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(45deg, #FFCCBC, #FF8A65);\">\r\n                        <h4>\u2697\ufe0f NO METALES<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"clase-body\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Ubicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Derecha (excepto H)<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Propiedades:<\/strong> Aislantes, fr\u00e1giles, opacos, forman enlaces covalentes<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> O, N, Cl, S, C (diamante)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"clase-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"clase-header\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(45deg, #B39DDB, #7E57C2);\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd04 METALOIDES<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"clase-body\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Ubicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> L\u00ednea divisoria (escalera)<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Propiedades:<\/strong> Semiconductores, propiedades intermedias<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Si, Ge, As, Sb, Te, B<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"escalera-visual\">\r\n                <svg width=\"400\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 100\">\r\n                    <path d=\"M 50 20 L 70 40 L 90 60 L 110 80 L 130 100 L 150 80 L 170 60 L 190 40 L 210 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7B1FA2\" stroke-width=\"4\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"130\" y=\"50\" fill=\"#4A148C\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ESCALERA DE METALOIDES<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"50\" y=\"15\" fill=\"#4A148C\" font-size=\"12\">B<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"210\" y=\"15\" fill=\"#4A148C\" font-size=\"12\">At<\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FAMILIAS PRINCIPALES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Familias Qu\u00edmicas (Grupos)<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"familias-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"familia-card\" style=\"border-color: #69F0AE;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd25 ALCALINOS<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Grupo:<\/strong> 1<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Propiedades:<\/strong> 1 electr\u00f3n de valencia, muy reactivos, blandos<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Li, Na, K, Rb, Cs, Fr<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"familia-card\" style=\"border-color: #B2FF59;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83e\uddea ALCALINOT\u00c9RREOS<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Grupo:<\/strong> 2<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Propiedades:<\/strong> 2 electrones de valencia, reactivos, formadores de bases<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Be, Mg, Ca, Sr, Ba, Ra<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"familia-card\" style=\"border-color: #FF8A80;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udca1 HAL\u00d3GENOS<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Grupo:<\/strong> 17<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Propiedades:<\/strong> 7 electrones de valencia, muy electronegativos, forman sales<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> F, Cl, Br, I, At<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"familia-card\" style=\"border-color: #B9F6CA;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udf88 GASES NOBLES<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Grupo:<\/strong> 18<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Propiedades:<\/strong> Octeto completo, inertes, gases a temperatura ambiente<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> He, Ne, Ar, Kr, Xe, Rn<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"familia-card\" style=\"border-color: #FFD54F;\">\r\n                    <h4>\u2699\ufe0f METALES DE TRANSICI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Grupos:<\/strong> 3\u201312<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Propiedades:<\/strong> Valencias variables, colores caracter\u00edsticos, conductores<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Fe, Cu, Ag, Au, Zn, Ni<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- BLOQUES PERI\u00d3DICOS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Bloques de la Tabla Peri\u00f3dica<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"bloques-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"bloque-card\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(45deg, #BBDEFB, #90CAF9);\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd32 BLOQUE s<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Grupos:<\/strong> 1\u20132<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Orbitales:<\/strong> s (ns\u00b9\u2013\u00b2)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Na (3s\u00b9), Mg (3s\u00b2)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"bloque-card\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(45deg, #C8E6C9, #A5D6A7);\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd33 BLOQUE p<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Grupos:<\/strong> 13\u201318<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Orbitales:<\/strong> p (np\u00b9\u2013\u2076)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> C (2p\u00b2), O (2p\u2074)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"bloque-card\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(45deg, #FFCCBC, #FFAB91);\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd36 BLOQUE d<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Grupos:<\/strong> 3\u201312<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Orbitales:<\/strong> d ((n\u20131)d\u00b9\u2013\u00b9\u2070)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Fe (3d\u2076), Cu (3d\u00b9\u2070)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"bloque-card\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(45deg, #E1BEE7, #CE93D8);\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd37 BLOQUE f<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Series:<\/strong> Lant\u00e1nidos y Act\u00ednidos<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Orbitales:<\/strong> f ((n\u20132)f\u00b9\u2013\u00b9\u2074)<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Ce (4f\u00b9), U (5f\u00b3)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-bloques-visual\">\r\n                <svg width=\"500\" height=\"150\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 150\">\r\n                    <rect x=\"50\" y=\"30\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#90CAF9\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"90\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#0D47A1\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">s<\/text>\r\n                    <rect x=\"150\" y=\"30\" width=\"200\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#A5D6A7\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"250\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#2E7D32\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">p<\/text>\r\n                    <rect x=\"370\" y=\"30\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#FFAB91\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"410\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#BF360C\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">d<\/text>\r\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"120\" width=\"300\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#CE93D8\" rx=\"3\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"250\" y=\"135\" fill=\"#4A148C\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">f (lant\u00e1nidos\/act\u00ednidos)<\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TABLA PERI\u00d3DICA INTERACTIVA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Tabla Peri\u00f3dica Interactiva<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-periodica-mini\">\r\n                <svg width=\"600\" height=\"300\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 300\" id=\"tablaPeriodica\">\r\n                    <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#E8EAF6\" rx=\"10\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Grupos 1\u20132 (s) -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"30\" y=\"50\" width=\"40\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#90CAF9\" rx=\"5\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"50\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#0D47A1\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"50\" y=\"200\" fill=\"#0D47A1\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Grupos 13\u201318 (p) -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"430\" y=\"50\" width=\"140\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#A5D6A7\" rx=\"5\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"450\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#2E7D32\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">13<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"530\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#2E7D32\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">18<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Grupos 3\u201312 (d) -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"50\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#FFAB91\" rx=\"5\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"250\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#BF360C\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3\u201312<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Lant\u00e1nidos\/Act\u00ednidos (f) -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"170\" width=\"300\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#CE93D8\" rx=\"3\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"250\" y=\"190\" fill=\"#4A148C\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lant\u00e1nidos y Act\u00ednidos<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Escalera de metaloides -->\r\n                    <path d=\"M 90 80 L 110 100 L 130 120 L 150 140 L 170 160 L 190 180 L 210 200 L 230 220\" stroke=\"#7B1FA2\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"150\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#4A148C\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Metaloides<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Elementos destacados -->\r\n                    <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"80\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#FFD54F\" onclick=\"mostrarInfo('Na')\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"50\" y=\"85\" fill=\"#000\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Na<\/text>\r\n                    <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"80\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#FF8A80\" onclick=\"mostrarInfo('Cl')\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"450\" y=\"85\" fill=\"#000\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Cl<\/text>\r\n                    <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"120\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#B39DDB\" onclick=\"mostrarInfo('Si')\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"200\" y=\"125\" fill=\"#000\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Si<\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoElemento\">\r\n                    Haz clic en un elemento para ver detalles\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: CLASIFICADOR DE ELEMENTOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"clasificador-elementos\">\r\n            <!-- CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>SELECCIONA UN ELEMENTO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"elementoSelect\">Elemento:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"elementoSelect\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"Na\">Sodio (Na)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Fe\">Hierro (Fe)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"C\">Carbono (C)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Si\">Silicio (Si)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"O\">Ox\u00edgeno (O)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Au\">Oro (Au)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Cl\">Cloro (Cl)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"He\">Helio (He)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Cu\">Cobre (Cu)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Ge\">Germanio (Ge)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"propiedadSelect\">Propiedad:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"propiedadSelect\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"conductor\">Conductor el\u00e9ctrico<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"brillo\">Brillo met\u00e1lico<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"fragil\">Fr\u00e1gil<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"semiconductor\">Semiconductor<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-clasificar\" onclick=\"clasificarElemento()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd0d<\/span> CLASIFICAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"elementoAleatorio()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> ELEMENTO ALEATORIO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacionClasificacion\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 300\" id=\"svgClasificacion\">\r\n                    <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- T\u00edtulo -->\r\n                    <text x=\"250\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#00BCD4\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"tituloElemento\">Selecciona un elemento<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- \u00c1rea de Metales -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"50\" y=\"80\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#1565C0\" rx=\"10\" opacity=\"0.5\" id=\"areaMetales\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"125\" y=\"120\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">METALES<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"125\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Conductores, maleables<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- \u00c1rea de No Metales -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"300\" y=\"80\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#D84315\" rx=\"10\" opacity=\"0.5\" id=\"areaNoMetales\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"375\" y=\"120\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">NO METALES<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"375\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#FFCCBC\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Aislantes, fr\u00e1giles<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- \u00c1rea de Metaloides -->\r\n                    <path d=\"M 200 80 L 250 120 L 300 80 L 250 230 Z\" fill=\"#6A1B9A\" opacity=\"0.7\" id=\"areaMetaloides\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"250\" y=\"150\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">METALOIDES<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"250\" y=\"180\" fill=\"#E1BEE7\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Semiconductores<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Elemento seleccionado -->\r\n                    <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"100\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#FFD54F\" id=\"elementoCirculo\" opacity=\"0\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"250\" y=\"105\" fill=\"#000\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"elementoSimbolo\"><\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Resultado -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"150\" y=\"250\" width=\"200\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#0288D1\" rx=\"5\" id=\"resultadoClasificacion\" opacity=\"0\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"250\" y=\"280\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"textoResultado\"><\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- DATOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>PROPIEDADES DEL ELEMENTO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Elemento:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataElemento\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Clase:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataClase\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Grupo:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataGrupo\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Bloque:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataBloque\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Ejemplo de uso:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataUso\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: DOMINA LAS CLASES DE ELEMENTOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfA qu\u00e9 clase pertenece el Silicio (Si)?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span> Metal\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span> Metaloide\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span> No metal\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span> Gas noble\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> El Si est\u00e1 en la <strong>escalera de metaloides<\/strong> (semiconductor).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la ubicaci\u00f3n del Si en la tabla peri\u00f3dica.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la familia del Cloro (Cl)?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span> Alcalinos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span> Alcalinot\u00e9rreos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span> Hal\u00f3genos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span> Gases nobles\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Cl est\u00e1 en el <strong>Grupo 17 (hal\u00f3genos)<\/strong>.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Los hal\u00f3genos son el Grupo 17 (F, Cl, Br, I, At).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 bloque pertenece el Hierro (Fe)?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span> Bloque d\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span> Bloque s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span> Bloque p\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span> Bloque f\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Fe es un <strong>metal de transici\u00f3n (bloque d)<\/strong>.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Los metales de transici\u00f3n est\u00e1n en el bloque d (Grupos 3\u201312).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR HIDR\u00d3GENO<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"El hidr\u00f3geno (H) es un metal alcalino\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El H es un <strong>no metal<\/strong> \u00fanico (Grupo 1, pero no es alcalino).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Dato:<\/strong> El H forma enlaces covalentes (como los no metales).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c UBICAR MAL LOS METALOIDES<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"El aluminio (Al) es un metaloide\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Los metaloides son <strong>B, Si, Ge, As, Sb, Te, At<\/strong>.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                        <table>\r\n                            <tr><th>Elemento<\/th><th>Clase<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Al<\/td><td>Metal<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Si<\/td><td>Metaloide<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>P<\/td><td>No metal<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <\/table>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Clasificaci\u00f3n de Elementos<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Clasifica los siguientes elementos seg\u00fan su clase (metal, no metal, metaloide) y bloque:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Carbono (C)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Hierro (Fe)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Germanio (Ge)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Ne\u00f3n (Ne)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Cobre (Cu)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Justifica tu respuesta con sus propiedades.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu respuesta aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. <strong>C:<\/strong> No metal (bloque p, forma enlaces covalentes).<br>\r\n                    2. <strong>Fe:<\/strong> Metal (bloque d, conductor, maleable).<br>\r\n                    3. <strong>Ge:<\/strong> Metaloide (bloque p, semiconductor).<br>\r\n                    4. <strong>Ne:<\/strong> Gas noble (bloque p, inerte).<br>\r\n                    5. <strong>Cu:<\/strong> Metal (bloque d, conductor, d\u00factil).\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Propiedades y Aplicaciones<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Relaciona las siguientes propiedades con su clase de elemento y da un ejemplo de aplicaci\u00f3n:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Conductividad el\u00e9ctrica alta<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Formaci\u00f3n de enlaces covalentes<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Semiconductividad<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Inercia qu\u00edmica<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu respuesta aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. <strong>Conductividad el\u00e9ctrica alta:<\/strong> Metales (ej: Cu en cables).<br>\r\n                    2. <strong>Enlaces covalentes:<\/strong> No metales (ej: C en pl\u00e1sticos).<br>\r\n                    3. <strong>Semiconductividad:<\/strong> Metaloides (ej: Si en chips).<br>\r\n                    4. <strong>Inercia qu\u00edmica:<\/strong> Gases nobles (ej: He en globos).\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (3 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (2 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (1 pt)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Clasificaci\u00f3n correcta<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Todos los elementos clasificados correctamente<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Error en 1\u20132 elementos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>M\u00faltiples errores<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Justificaci\u00f3n con propiedades<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explica propiedades para cada clase<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explicaci\u00f3n parcial<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No justifica<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Clasificaci\u00f3n de elementos:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Familias y bloques:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo influye la clasificaci\u00f3n de los elementos en el desarrollo de nuevas tecnolog\u00edas?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: Semiconductores, aleaciones, materiales...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar escalera de metaloides<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Identificar grupos 1, 2, 17, 18<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83e\uddea PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Clasificar 20 elementos<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Relacionar con aplicaciones tecnol\u00f3gicas<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/ptable.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udf10 Tabla Peri\u00f3dica Interactiva\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.webelements.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcda WebElements: Propiedades detalladas\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ BASE DE DATOS DE ELEMENTOS\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    const elementosDB = {\r\n        \"Na\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Sodio\",\r\n            clase: \"Metal\",\r\n            grupo: \"1 (Alcalinos)\",\r\n            bloque: \"s\",\r\n            uso: \"Bater\u00edas, l\u00e1mparas de vapor\",\r\n            propiedades: [\"conductor\", \"brillo\", \"reactivo\"]\r\n        },\r\n        \"Fe\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Hierro\",\r\n            clase: \"Metal\",\r\n            grupo: \"8 (Transici\u00f3n)\",\r\n            bloque: \"d\",\r\n            uso: \"Acero, imanes, hemoglobina\",\r\n            propiedades: [\"conductor\", \"brillo\", \"maleable\"]\r\n        },\r\n        \"C\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Carbono\",\r\n            clase: \"No metal\",\r\n            grupo: \"14\",\r\n            bloque: \"p\",\r\n            uso: \"Pl\u00e1sticos, diamantes, grafito\",\r\n            propiedades: [\"aislante\", \"fr\u00e1gil\", \"enlaces covalentes\"]\r\n        },\r\n        \"Si\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Silicio\",\r\n            clase: \"Metaloide\",\r\n            grupo: \"14\",\r\n            bloque: \"p\",\r\n            uso: \"Chips, paneles solares\",\r\n            propiedades: [\"semiconductor\"]\r\n        },\r\n        \"O\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Ox\u00edgeno\",\r\n            clase: \"No metal\",\r\n            grupo: \"16\",\r\n            bloque: \"p\",\r\n            uso: \"Respiraci\u00f3n, combusti\u00f3n\",\r\n            propiedades: [\"aislante\", \"fr\u00e1gil\", \"enlaces covalentes\"]\r\n        },\r\n        \"Au\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Oro\",\r\n            clase: \"Metal\",\r\n            grupo: \"11 (Transici\u00f3n)\",\r\n            bloque: \"d\",\r\n            uso: \"Joyer\u00eda, electr\u00f3nica\",\r\n            propiedades: [\"conductor\", \"brillo\", \"inerte\"]\r\n        },\r\n        \"Cl\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Cloro\",\r\n            clase: \"No metal\",\r\n            grupo: \"17 (Hal\u00f3genos)\",\r\n            bloque: \"p\",\r\n            uso: \"Desinfectante, PVC\",\r\n            propiedades: [\"aislante\", \"fr\u00e1gil\", \"electronegativo\"]\r\n        },\r\n        \"He\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Helio\",\r\n            clase: \"Gas noble\",\r\n            grupo: \"18\",\r\n            bloque: \"s\",\r\n            uso: \"Globos, resonancias magn\u00e9ticas\",\r\n            propiedades: [\"inerte\", \"gas\"]\r\n        },\r\n        \"Cu\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Cobre\",\r\n            clase: \"Metal\",\r\n            grupo: \"11 (Transici\u00f3n)\",\r\n            bloque: \"d\",\r\n            uso: \"Cables, monedas, aleaciones\",\r\n            propiedades: [\"conductor\", \"brillo\", \"d\u00factil\"]\r\n        },\r\n        \"Ge\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Germanio\",\r\n            clase: \"Metaloide\",\r\n            grupo: \"14\",\r\n            bloque: \"p\",\r\n            uso: \"Transistores, fibra \u00f3ptica\",\r\n            propiedades: [\"semiconductor\"]\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ SIMULADOR DE CLASIFICACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function clasificarElemento() {\r\n        const elemento = document.getElementById('elementoSelect').value;\r\n        const propiedad = document.getElementById('propiedadSelect').value;\r\n        const data = elementosDB[elemento];\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n        document.getElementById('tituloElemento').textContent = `${data.nombre} (${elemento})`;\r\n        document.getElementById('elementoSimbolo').textContent = elemento;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataElemento').textContent = data.nombre;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataClase').textContent = data.clase;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataGrupo').textContent = data.grupo;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataBloque').textContent = data.bloque;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataUso').textContent = data.uso;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Resaltar \u00e1rea seg\u00fan clase\r\n        document.getElementById('areaMetales').style.opacity = \"0.5\";\r\n        document.getElementById('areaNoMetales').style.opacity = \"0.5\";\r\n        document.getElementById('areaMetaloides').style.opacity = \"0.5\";\r\n        document.getElementById('elementoCirculo').style.opacity = \"1\";\r\n\r\n        if (data.clase === \"Metal\") {\r\n            document.getElementById('areaMetales').style.opacity = \"1\";\r\n            document.getElementById('elementoCirculo').setAttribute('cx', \"125\");\r\n            document.getElementById('elementoCirculo').setAttribute('cy', \"150\");\r\n            document.getElementById('textoResultado').textContent = \"METAL\";\r\n        } else if (data.clase === \"No metal\") {\r\n            document.getElementById('areaNoMetales').style.opacity = \"1\";\r\n            document.getElementById('elementoCirculo').setAttribute('cx', \"375\");\r\n            document.getElementById('elementoCirculo').setAttribute('cy', \"150\");\r\n            document.getElementById('textoResultado').textContent = \"NO METAL\";\r\n        } else if (data.clase === \"Metaloide\") {\r\n            document.getElementById('areaMetaloides').style.opacity = \"1\";\r\n            document.getElementById('elementoCirculo').setAttribute('cx', \"250\");\r\n            document.getElementById('elementoCirculo').setAttribute('cy', \"150\");\r\n            document.getElementById('textoResultado').textContent = \"METALOIDE\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            document.getElementById('elementoCirculo').setAttribute('cx', \"250\");\r\n            document.getElementById('elementoCirculo').setAttribute('cy', \"250\");\r\n            document.getElementById('textoResultado').textContent = data.clase;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar resultado\r\n        document.getElementById('resultadoClasificacion').style.opacity = \"1\";\r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udd2c Clasificaci\u00f3n: ${elemento} \u2192 ${data.clase} (${data.bloque})`);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function elementoAleatorio() {\r\n        const elementos = Object.keys(elementosDB);\r\n        const elem = elementos[Math.floor(Math.random() * elementos.length)];\r\n        document.getElementById('elementoSelect').value = elem;\r\n        clasificarElemento();\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function mostrarInfo(elemento) {\r\n        const data = elementosDB[elemento];\r\n        document.getElementById('infoElemento').innerHTML = `\r\n            <strong>${data.nombre} (${elemento}):<\/strong><br>\r\n            <strong>Clase:<\/strong> ${data.clase}<br>\r\n            <strong>Grupo:<\/strong> ${data.grupo}<br>\r\n            <strong>Uso:<\/strong> ${data.uso}\r\n        `;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    let quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n                q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n            );\r\n            if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n                quizCompletado = true;\r\n                mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/3`;\r\n        let feedback = \"\";\r\n        if (correctas >= 2) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d \u00a1Excelente! Dominas la clasificaci\u00f3n de elementos.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Revisa la escalera de metaloides y las familias principales.\";\r\n        }\r\n        document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        quizRespuestas = [];\r\n        quizCompletado = false;\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ ERRORES COMUNES\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function toggleError(header) {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n        if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        } else {\r\n            content.style.display = 'block';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function verificarProblema(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n        const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n        const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2)) \/ 2;\r\n        alert(`\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\n\n` +\r\n              `Clasificaci\u00f3n: ${slider1}\/5\n` +\r\n              `Familias\/bloques: ${slider2}\/5\n\n` +\r\n              `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\n\n` +\r\n              `\u00a1Sigue explorando la tabla peri\u00f3dica!`);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: Clases de Elementos cargada\");\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83c\udfaf Objetivos: Clasificar metales, no metales y metaloides\");\r\n    clasificarElemento(); \/\/ Cargar Na por defecto\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Propiedades de metales","respuesta":"Conductores, maleables, brillo"},{"enunciado":"Propiedades de no metales","respuesta":"Aislantes, fr\u00e1giles, opacos"},{"enunciado":"Ejemplo de metaloide","respuesta":"Silicio (Si)"},{"enunciado":"Grupo de los alcalinos","respuesta":"1"},{"enunciado":"Grupo de los hal\u00f3genos","respuesta":"17"},{"enunciado":"Grupo de los gases nobles","respuesta":"18"},{"enunciado":"Elemento metal en grupo 11","respuesta":"Cu (cobre)"},{"enunciado":"No metal en per\u00edodo 2","respuesta":"O (ox\u00edgeno)"},{"enunciado":"Metaloide usado en chips","respuesta":"Silicio"},{"enunciado":"Bloque de los lantanoides","respuesta":"f"},{"enunciado":"IUPAC: n\u00famero de metaloides","respuesta":"7 (B, Si, Ge, As, Sb, Te, At)"},{"enunciado":"Elemento transicional t\u00edpico","respuesta":"Fe (hierro)"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Metales est\u00e1n en...","opciones":["Izquierda","Derecha","Arriba","Abajo"],"correcta":"Izquierda"},{"pregunta":"No metales en...","opciones":["Derecha","Izquierda","Centro","Todo"],"correcta":"Derecha"},{"pregunta":"Metaloides forman...","opciones":["Escalera","C\u00edrculo","L\u00ednea","Cuadro"],"correcta":"Escalera"},{"pregunta":"Alcalinos en grupo...","opciones":["1","2","17","18"],"correcta":"1"},{"pregunta":"Hal\u00f3genos en grupo...","opciones":["17","1","18","2"],"correcta":"17"},{"pregunta":"Gases nobles en grupo...","opciones":["18","17","1","2"],"correcta":"18"},{"pregunta":"Ejemplo de metal","opciones":["Fe","O","Si","He"],"correcta":"Fe"},{"pregunta":"Ejemplo de no metal","opciones":["Cl","Na","Al","Si"],"correcta":"Cl"},{"pregunta":"Ejemplo de metaloide","opciones":["Ge","Cu","N","Ne"],"correcta":"Ge"},{"pregunta":"Metales son...","opciones":["Conductores","Aislantes","Fr\u00e1giles","Opacos"],"correcta":"Conductores"},{"pregunta":"Bloque s incluye...","opciones":["Grupos 1\u20132","13\u201318","3\u201312","Lantanoides"],"correcta":"Grupos 1\u20132"},{"pregunta":"Bloque p incluye...","opciones":["13\u201318","1\u20132","3\u201312","f"],"correcta":"13\u201318"},{"pregunta":"Bloque d es...","opciones":["Transici\u00f3n","Alcalinos","Hal\u00f3genos","Nobles"],"correcta":"Transici\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Lantanoides son bloque...","opciones":["f","d","p","s"],"correcta":"f"},{"pregunta":"N\u00famero de metaloides","opciones":["7","5","10","3"],"correcta":"7"},{"pregunta":"H es...","opciones":["No metal","Metal","Metaloide","Noble"],"correcta":"No metal"},{"pregunta":"Au es...","opciones":["Metal","No metal","Metaloide","Gas"],"correcta":"Metal"},{"pregunta":"As es...","opciones":["Metaloide","Metal","No metal","Noble"],"correcta":"Metaloide"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC reconoce...","opciones":["118 elementos","100","92","150"],"correcta":"118 elementos"},{"pregunta":"Per\u00edodo m\u00e1s largo","opciones":["6 y 7","1","2","3"],"correcta":"6 y 7"},{"pregunta":"Elemento 118 (Og) es...","opciones":["Gas noble","Metal","No metal","Metaloide"],"correcta":"Gas noble"},{"pregunta":"Elemento con Z=50 (Sn)","opciones":["Metal","Metaloide","No metal","Noble"],"correcta":"Metal"},{"pregunta":"Elemento con Z=33 (As)","opciones":["Metaloide","Metal","No metal","Noble"],"correcta":"Metaloide"},{"pregunta":"Bloque de U (Z=92)","opciones":["f","d","p","s"],"correcta":"f"},{"pregunta":"Grupo de Cr","opciones":["6","1","17","18"],"correcta":"6"},{"pregunta":"Familia de Mg","opciones":["Alcalinot\u00e9rreos","Alcalinos","Hal\u00f3genos","Nobles"],"correcta":"Alcalinot\u00e9rreos"},{"pregunta":"Elemento transicional con valencia +7","opciones":["Mn","Na","Cl","He"],"correcta":"Mn"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC: metaloides oficiales","opciones":["B, Si, Ge, As, Sb, Te","Solo Si","Todos","Ninguno"],"correcta":"B, Si, Ge, As, Sb, Te"},{"pregunta":"Per\u00edodo con m\u00e1s metales","opciones":["6","1","2","7"],"correcta":"6"},{"pregunta":"Clasificaci\u00f3n basada en...","opciones":["Propiedades f\u00edsicas\/qu\u00edmicas","Masa","Color","Olor"],"correcta":"Propiedades f\u00edsicas\/qu\u00edmicas"}]}],"F\u00edsica I":[{"materia":"F\u00edsica I","slug":"energia-conservacion-cyberpunk","titulo":"Energ\u00eda: La Moneda Universal del Universo","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK F\u00cdSICA -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-fisica-energia\" data-tema=\"conservacion-energia\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n            ENERG\u00cdA: LA MONEDA UNIVERSAL\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Conservaci\u00f3n, Transformaciones y Aplicaciones en el Cosmos\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Definir energ\u00eda y sus 7 formas fundamentales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Desde cin\u00e9tica hasta nuclear, con f\u00f3rmulas y ejemplos<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar la ley de conservaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Resolver problemas con \\(E_{\\text{inicial}} = E_{\\text{final}}\\)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar transformaciones energ\u00e9ticas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Estudiar \\(E_p \\leftrightarrow E_k\\) en sistemas reales<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Calcular trabajo y eficiencia<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Usar \\(W = \\Delta E\\) y \\(\\eta = \\frac{E_{\\text{\u00fatil}}}{E_{\\text{total}}}\\)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACIONES EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\ude80 COHETES ESPACIALES<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Transforman <strong>energ\u00eda qu\u00edmica<\/strong> (combustible) \u2192 <strong>t\u00e9rmica<\/strong> \u2192 <strong>cin\u00e9tica<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Ejemplo: Saturno V (34,000 kN de empuje)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udca1 ENERG\u00cdA SOLAR<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Paneles fotovoltaicos convierten <strong>radiante<\/strong> \u2192 <strong>el\u00e9ctrica<\/strong> con ~20% eficiencia<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Ejemplo: Granja solar en el Sahara (1000 MW)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f F\u00d3RMULA 1<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Sistemas KERS recuperan <strong>cin\u00e9tica<\/strong> \u2192 <strong>el\u00e9ctrica<\/strong> en frenadas<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Ejemplo: 60 mJ recuperados por vuelta<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONCEPTO PRINCIPAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"concepto-principal\">\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"neon-concepto\">\u26a1 \u00bfQU\u00c9 ES LA ENERG\u00cdA?<\/h3>\r\n            <p><strong>Energ\u00eda<\/strong> es la <strong>capacidad de realizar trabajo<\/strong> o producir cambio. Se mide en <strong>joules (J)<\/strong>:<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                \\[\r\n                1\\,\\text{J} = 1\\,\\text{N\u00b7m} = 1\\,\\text{kg\u00b7m}^2\/\\text{s}^2\r\n                \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ley-conservacion\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udd04 LEY DE CONSERVACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                <p>En un sistema <strong>aislado<\/strong>, la energ\u00eda total es <strong>constante<\/strong>:<\/p>\r\n                \\[\r\n                E_{\\text{inicial}} = E_{\\text{final}} \\quad \\Rightarrow \\quad \\Delta E_{\\text{total}} = 0\r\n                \\]\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-conservacion\">\r\n                    <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> P\u00e9ndulo:\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    E_p \\xrightleftharpoons[altura]{} E_k\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- FORMAS DE ENERG\u00cdA -->\r\n    <section class=\"formas-energia\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span> 7 FORMAS FUNDAMENTALES DE ENERG\u00cdA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n            <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>FORMA<\/th>\r\n                        <th>F\u00d3RMULA<\/th>\r\n                        <th>UNIDADES<\/th>\r\n                        <th>EJEMPLO PR\u00c1CTICO<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr data-forma=\"cinetica\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-cinetica\">CIN\u00c9TICA<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>\\[E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\]<\/td>\r\n                        <td>J (joules)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Auto a 100 km\/h<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-forma=\"potencial\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-potencial\">POTENCIAL GRAV.<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>\\[E_p = mgh\\]<\/td>\r\n                        <td>J (joules)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Libro a 2 m de altura<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-forma=\"elastica\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-elastica\">EL\u00c1STICA<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>\\[E_e = \\frac{1}{2}kx^2\\]<\/td>\r\n                        <td>J (joules)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Resorte comprimido 10 cm<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-forma=\"termica\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-termica\">T\u00c9RMICA<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>\\[Q = mc\\Delta T\\]<\/td>\r\n                        <td>J o cal<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Agua hirviendo<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-forma=\"electrica\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-electrica\">EL\u00c9CTRICA<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>\\[E = qV = Pt\\]<\/td>\r\n                        <td>J o kWh<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Bater\u00eda de 12V<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-forma=\"quimica\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-quimica\">QU\u00cdMICA<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>\\(\\Delta H\\) (entalp\u00eda)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>J\/mol<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Combusti\u00f3n de gasolina<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-forma=\"nuclear\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-nuclear\">NUCLEAR<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>\\[E = mc^2\\]<\/td>\r\n                        <td>J (enorme)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Fisi\u00f3n de uranio-235<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoForma\">\r\n                Haz clic en una forma de energ\u00eda para ver detalles y ejemplos interactivos\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- TRANSFORMACIONES ENERG\u00c9TICAS -->\r\n    <section class=\"transformaciones-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> TRANSFORMACIONES ENERG\u00c9TICAS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"transformaciones-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"transf-card\" data-tipo=\"mecanica\">\r\n                <div class=\"transf-icon\">\ud83c\udfa2<\/div>\r\n                <h4>MEC\u00c1NICA<\/h4>\r\n                <p>\\[E_p \\leftrightarrow E_k\\]<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplos-mini\">\r\n                    <strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Monta\u00f1a rusa, p\u00e9ndulo, ca\u00edda libre\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarEjemplo('mecanica')\">Ver simulaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"transf-card\" data-tipo=\"electrotermica\">\r\n                <div class=\"transf-icon\">\ud83d\udca1<\/div>\r\n                <h4>EL\u00c9CTRO-T\u00c9RMICA<\/h4>\r\n                <p>\\[E_{\\text{el\u00e9ct}} \\rightarrow E_{\\text{t\u00e9rm}} + E_{\\text{luz}}\\]<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplos-mini\">\r\n                    <strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Bombilla incandescente, estufa el\u00e9ctrica\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarEjemplo('electrotermica')\">Ver eficiencia<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"transf-card\" data-tipo=\"quimicamecanica\">\r\n                <div class=\"transf-icon\">\ud83d\ude97<\/div>\r\n                <h4>QU\u00cdMICA-MEC\u00c1NICA<\/h4>\r\n                <p>\\[E_{\\text{qu\u00edm}} \\rightarrow E_{\\text{t\u00e9rm}} \\rightarrow E_k\\]<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplos-mini\">\r\n                    <strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Motor de combusti\u00f3n, m\u00fasculos humanos\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarEjemplo('quimicamecanica')\">Ver rendimiento<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- EJEMPLO INTERACTIVO: CA\u00cdDA LIBRE -->\r\n        <div class=\"ejemplo-interactivo\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"neon-ejemplo\">\ud83d\udcd0 EJEMPLO: CA\u00cdDA LIBRE<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"ejemplo-content\">\r\n                <p><strong>Problema:<\/strong> Objeto de masa \\(m = 2\\,\\text{kg}\\) cae desde \\(h = 10\\,\\text{m}\\)<\/p>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"calculadora-mini\">\r\n                    <div class=\"calc-step\">\r\n                        <span>1. \\(E_{p_i} = mgh =\\)<\/span>\r\n                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"masa\" value=\"2\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"100\" step=\"0.1\"> \u00d7\r\n                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"gravedad\" value=\"9.8\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" step=\"0.1\"> \u00d7\r\n                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"altura\" value=\"10\" min=\"1\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\">\r\n                        <button onclick=\"calcularEnergia()\">Calcular<\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"calc-resultado\">\r\n                        <strong>Resultado:<\/strong>\r\n                        \\(E_{p_i} = \\) <span id=\"resultadoEp\">196<\/span> J\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"calc-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>En el suelo: \\(E_{k_f} = E_{p_i} = 196\\,\\text{J}\\) (conservaci\u00f3n)<\/p>\r\n                        <p>Velocidad final: \\(v = \\sqrt{\\frac{2E_k}{m}} = \\) <span id=\"velocidadFinal\">14.0<\/span> m\/s<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR P\u00c9NDULO INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/span> SIMULADOR: P\u00c9NDULO + CONSERVACI\u00d3N DE ENERG\u00cdA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"pendulo-energia\">\r\n            <!-- CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"masaPendulo\">Masa (kg):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"masaPendulo\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"5\" value=\"1\" step=\"0.1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"masaValue\">1.0 kg<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"longitudPendulo\">Longitud (m):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"longitudPendulo\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"3\" value=\"1.5\" step=\"0.1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"longitudValue\">1.5 m<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"anguloInicial\">\u00c1ngulo inicial (\u00b0):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"anguloInicial\" min=\"10\" max=\"80\" value=\"45\" step=\"5\">\r\n                    <span id=\"anguloValue\">45\u00b0<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"friccionToggle\">Incluir fricci\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"friccionToggle\">\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <button class=\"btn-simular\" onclick=\"iniciarSimulacion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6<\/span> INICIAR SIMULACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n\r\n                <button class=\"btn-pausar\" onclick=\"pausarSimulacion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u23f8<\/span> PAUSAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n\r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarSimulacion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u21ba<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N SVG -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" id=\"svgPendulo\">\r\n                    <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Soporte -->\r\n                    <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                    <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"50\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#39FF14\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Hilo -->\r\n                    <line id=\"hiloPendulo\" x1=\"300\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#00FFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Masa -->\r\n                    <circle id=\"masaPenduloSVG\" cx=\"300\" cy=\"200\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FF00FF\">\r\n                        <animateMotion id=\"animPendulo\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Trayectoria -->\r\n                    <path id=\"trayectoria\" d=\"\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,0,0.3)\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Energ\u00eda en tiempo real -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"20\" y=\"300\" width=\"560\" height=\"80\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.7)\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Barra Ep -->\r\n                    <rect id=\"barraEp\" x=\"30\" y=\"320\" width=\"100\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#39FF14\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"30\" y=\"315\" fill=\"#39FF14\" font-size=\"10\">E_p<\/text>\r\n                    <text id=\"textEp\" x=\"80\" y=\"335\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"10\">0 J<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Barra Ek -->\r\n                    <rect id=\"barraEk\" x=\"30\" y=\"350\" width=\"100\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FF00FF\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"30\" y=\"345\" fill=\"#FF00FF\" font-size=\"10\">E_k<\/text>\r\n                    <text id=\"textEk\" x=\"80\" y=\"365\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"10\">0 J<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Total -->\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"340\" fill=\"#00FFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\r\n                        E_total = <tspan id=\"textTotal\">0<\/tspan> J (constante)\r\n                    <\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- F\u00f3rmulas -->\r\n                    <text x=\"450\" y=\"320\" fill=\"#FFFF00\" font-size=\"11\">\r\n                        \\(E_p = mgh =\\) <tspan id=\"formulaEp\">0<\/tspan> J\r\n                    <\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"450\" y=\"340\" fill=\"#FF00FF\" font-size=\"11\">\r\n                        \\(E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2 =\\) <tspan id=\"formulaEk\">0<\/tspan> J\r\n                    <\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"450\" y=\"360\" fill=\"#00FFFF\" font-size=\"11\">\r\n                        \\(E_{\\text{total}} = E_p + E_k =\\) <tspan id=\"formulaTotal\">0<\/tspan> J\r\n                    <\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL<\/h3>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Altura m\u00e1xima:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataAlturaMax\">0 m<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Velocidad m\u00e1xima:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataVelMax\">0 m\/s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Energ\u00eda total:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEnergiaTotal\">0 J<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Periodo:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPeriodo\">0 s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcc8 ESTAD\u00cdSTICAS<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Max E_p:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statMaxEp\">0 J<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Max E_k:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statMaxEk\">0 J<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Conservaci\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statConservacion\">100%<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la unidad SI de energ\u00eda?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Newton (N)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Vatio (W)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Joule (J)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Pascal (Pa)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> El joule (J) es la unidad SI de energ\u00eda.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>1 J = 1 N\u00b7m = 1 kg\u00b7m\u00b2\/s\u00b2. El vatio es unidad de potencia (J\/s).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>En un p\u00e9ndulo ideal, \u00bfd\u00f3nde es m\u00e1xima la energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Punto m\u00e1s alto\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Punto m\u00e1s bajo\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        En mitad del recorrido\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Es constante siempre\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> En el punto m\u00e1s bajo (altura m\u00ednima).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>En el punto m\u00e1s alto: \\(E_p\\) m\u00e1xima, \\(E_k\\) = 0.<br>\r\n                        En el punto m\u00e1s bajo: \\(E_p\\) m\u00ednima, \\(E_k\\) m\u00e1xima.<br>\r\n                        \\(E_{\\text{total}} = E_p + E_k = \\text{constante}\\).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 principio explica que \\(E_p + E_k = \\text{constante}\\) en un p\u00e9ndulo?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Conservaci\u00f3n de la energ\u00eda\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Segunda ley de Newton\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Ley de Hooke\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Principio de Arqu\u00edmedes\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> La <strong>conservaci\u00f3n de la energ\u00eda<\/strong> establece que la energ\u00eda total en un sistema aislado es constante.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>En ausencia de fuerzas no conservativas (como la fricci\u00f3n), la suma de \\(E_p\\) y \\(E_k\\) permanece constante.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-results\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfc6 RESULTADOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                    Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">REINTENTAR<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR ENERG\u00cdA CON FUERZA<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"Un objeto tiene energ\u00eda porque se mueve r\u00e1pido (fuerza)\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La energ\u00eda es <strong>capacidad de hacer trabajo<\/strong>, no una fuerza. La fuerza es lo que <strong>causa cambios en el movimiento<\/strong> (2\u00aa ley de Newton).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Un auto en movimiento tiene <strong>energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica<\/strong> (\\(E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\)), no \"fuerza de movimiento\".<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c IGNORAR P\u00c9RDIDAS POR FRICCI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"En un p\u00e9ndulo real, la energ\u00eda se conserva al 100%\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La fricci\u00f3n con el aire y el soporte <strong>disipa energ\u00eda<\/strong> como calor, reduciendo la amplitud con el tiempo.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                        <table>\r\n                            <tr><th>Sistema<\/th><th>Conservaci\u00f3n<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>P\u00e9ndulo ideal<\/td><td>100%<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>P\u00e9ndulo real<\/td><td>&lt;100% (p\u00e9rdidas)<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <\/table>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Conservaci\u00f3n en un P\u00e9ndulo<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un p\u00e9ndulo de 0.5 kg y 1.2 m de longitud se suelta desde un \u00e1ngulo de 30\u00b0. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>La energ\u00eda potencial m\u00e1xima.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La velocidad m\u00e1xima en el punto m\u00e1s bajo.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica cuando el p\u00e9ndulo forma 15\u00b0 con la vertical.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Usa \\(g = 9.8\\,\\text{m\/s}^2\\).<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n paso a paso...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. Altura m\u00e1xima: \\(h = L(1 - \\cos 30\u00b0) = 0.157\\,\\text{m}\\)<br>\r\n                    \\(E_{p_{\\text{max}}} = mgh = 0.5 \\times 9.8 \\times 0.157 = 0.769\\,\\text{J}\\)<br><br>\r\n                    2. \\(E_{k_{\\text{max}}} = E_{p_{\\text{max}}} = 0.769\\,\\text{J}\\)<br>\r\n                    \\(v_{\\text{max}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{2E_k}{m}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{2 \\times 0.769}{0.5}} = 1.75\\,\\text{m\/s}\\)<br><br>\r\n                    3. \\(h_{15\u00b0} = L(1 - \\cos 15\u00b0) = 0.047\\,\\text{m}\\)<br>\r\n                    \\(E_p = 0.5 \\times 9.8 \\times 0.047 = 0.230\\,\\text{J}\\)<br>\r\n                    \\(E_k = 0.769 - 0.230 = 0.539\\,\\text{J}\\)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Eficiencia en un Sistema Real<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un motor el\u00e9ctrico recibe 1000 J de energ\u00eda el\u00e9ctrica y produce 750 J de energ\u00eda mec\u00e1nica \u00fatil. El resto se pierde como calor por fricci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Calcula la eficiencia del motor.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Si el motor opera durante 10 s, \u00bfcu\u00e1l es su potencia \u00fatil en vatios?<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 cantidad de energ\u00eda se pierde por segundo?<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n paso a paso...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. \\(\\eta = \\frac{E_{\\text{\u00fatil}}}{E_{\\text{total}}} \\times 100\\% = \\frac{750}{1000} \\times 100\\% = 75\\%\\)<br><br>\r\n                    2. \\(P_{\\text{\u00fatil}} = \\frac{E_{\\text{\u00fatil}}}{t} = \\frac{750\\,\\text{J}}{10\\,\\text{s}} = 75\\,\\text{W}\\)<br><br>\r\n                    3. \\(E_{\\text{p\u00e9rdida}} = 1000 - 750 = 250\\,\\text{J}\\)<br>\r\n                    \\(\\frac{250\\,\\text{J}}{10\\,\\text{s}} = 25\\,\\text{W}\\) (p\u00e9rdidas por segundo)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (3 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (2 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (1 pt)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Aplicaci\u00f3n de f\u00f3rmulas<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Todas las f\u00f3rmulas aplicadas correctamente<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Error en 1 f\u00f3rmula o c\u00e1lculo<\/td>\r\n                    <td>M\u00faltiples errores<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Explicaci\u00f3n de conceptos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explica claramente cada paso y principio<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explicaci\u00f3n parcial<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No justifica<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Unidades y conversiones<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Todas las unidades correctas y conversiones<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Error en 1 unidad<\/td>\r\n                    <td>M\u00faltiples errores<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <header class=\"cierre-header\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n                <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n            <\/h2>\r\n            <p class=\"small\">Resumen final, autoevaluaci\u00f3n y plan de acci\u00f3n para continuar aprendiendo.<\/p>\r\n        <\/header>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"cierre-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <article class=\"cierre-card\">\r\n                    <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                    <p class=\"small\">Valora tu aprendizaje y ajusta tu ruta.<\/p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                        <label for=\"slider1\">Conceptos de energ\u00eda<\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" id=\"slider1\" class=\"autoeval-slider\">\r\n                        <output id=\"valor1\">3<\/output>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                        <label for=\"slider2\">Conservaci\u00f3n y transformaciones<\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" id=\"slider2\" class=\"autoeval-slider\">\r\n                        <output id=\"valor2\">3<\/output>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                        <label for=\"slider3\">C\u00e1lculos y problemas<\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" id=\"slider3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\">\r\n                        <output id=\"valor3\">3<\/output>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n\r\n                    <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacionConservacion()\">\ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                    <p id=\"msgAutoevaluacion\" class=\"mensaje-exito\" aria-live=\"polite\"><\/p>\r\n                <\/article>\r\n\r\n                <article class=\"cierre-card\">\r\n                    <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                    <p class=\"small\">Define c\u00f3mo aplicar lo aprendido en experiencias reales.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea id=\"textoReflexion\" placeholder=\"Ejemplo: Integrar energ\u00eda potencial en dise\u00f1os de monta\u00f1a rusa...\" rows=\"5\"><\/textarea>\r\n                    <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarReflexionConservacion()\">\ud83d\udcdd GUARDAR REFLEXI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                    <p id=\"msgReflexion\" class=\"mensaje-exito\" aria-live=\"polite\"><\/p>\r\n                <\/article>\r\n\r\n                <article class=\"cierre-card\">\r\n                    <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO<\/h3>\r\n                    <p class=\"small\">Marca progreso y garantiza seguimiento.<\/p>\r\n                    <ul class=\"plan-list\">\r\n                        <li><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"checkRepaso\"> Repasar f\u00f3rmulas de E<sub>k<\/sub> y E<sub>p<\/sub><\/label><\/li>\r\n                        <li><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"checkCalculos\"> Resolver 5 problemas de conversi\u00f3n de energ\u00eda<\/label><\/li>\r\n                        <li><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"checkTransformaciones\"> Analizar 3 ejemplos de transformaci\u00f3n<\/label><\/li>\r\n                        <li><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"checkTecnologia\"> Investigar eficiencias tecnol\u00f3gicas reales<\/label><\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarPlanEstudioConservacion()\">\u2705 GUARDAR PLAN<\/button>\r\n                    <p id=\"msgPlan\" class=\"mensaje-exito\" aria-live=\"polite\"><\/p>\r\n                <\/article>\r\n\r\n                <article class=\"cierre-card\">\r\n                    <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                    <p class=\"small\">Sigue aprendiendo con herramientas probadas.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                        <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/energy-skate-park\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\ud83c\udfae PhET: Energy Skate Park<\/a>\r\n                        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/science\/physics\/work-and-energy\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\ud83d\udcda Khan Academy: Trabajo y Energ\u00eda<\/a>\r\n                        <a href=\"https:\/\/hyperphysics.phy-astr.gsu.edu\/hbase\/hframe.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\ud83c\udf10 HyperPhysics: Energ\u00eda<\/a>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/article>\r\n\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <script>\r\n        function _actualizarOutputSlider(idInput, idOutput) {\r\n            const input = document.getElementById(idInput);\r\n            const output = document.getElementById(idOutput);\r\n            if (!input || !output) return;\r\n            output.textContent = input.value;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function guardarAutoevaluacionConservacion() {\r\n            const slider1 = Number(document.getElementById('slider1').value);\r\n            const slider2 = Number(document.getElementById('slider2').value);\r\n            const slider3 = Number(document.getElementById('slider3').value);\r\n            const promedio = ((slider1 + slider2 + slider3) \/ 3).toFixed(1);\r\n\r\n            const estado = {\r\n                slider1,\r\n                slider2,\r\n                slider3,\r\n                promedio: Number(promedio)\r\n            };\r\n            localStorage.setItem('cierreMetacognitivo_autoevaluacion', JSON.stringify(estado));\r\n\r\n            document.getElementById('msgAutoevaluacion').textContent = `Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada (promedio ${promedio}\/5).`;\r\n            document.getElementById('msgAutoevaluacion').style.color = '#a8eb8b';\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function guardarReflexionConservacion() {\r\n            const texto = document.getElementById('textoReflexion').value.trim();\r\n            if (!texto) {\r\n                document.getElementById('msgReflexion').textContent = 'Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n antes de guardar.';\r\n                document.getElementById('msgReflexion').style.color = '#ffcc00';\r\n                return;\r\n            }\r\n            localStorage.setItem('cierreMetacognitivo_reflexion', texto);\r\n            document.getElementById('msgReflexion').textContent = 'Reflexi\u00f3n guardada correctamente.';\r\n            document.getElementById('msgReflexion').style.color = '#a8eb8b';\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function guardarPlanEstudioConservacion() {\r\n            const plan = {\r\n                checkRepaso: document.getElementById('checkRepaso').checked,\r\n                checkCalculos: document.getElementById('checkCalculos').checked,\r\n                checkTransformaciones: document.getElementById('checkTransformaciones').checked,\r\n                checkTecnologia: document.getElementById('checkTecnologia').checked\r\n            };\r\n            localStorage.setItem('cierreMetacognitivo_plan', JSON.stringify(plan));\r\n            document.getElementById('msgPlan').textContent = 'Plan de estudio actualizado.';\r\n            document.getElementById('msgPlan').style.color = '#a8eb8b';\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function cargarCierreMetacognitivo() {\r\n            const auto = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('cierreMetacognitivo_autoevaluacion') || 'null');\r\n            if (auto) {\r\n                document.getElementById('slider1').value = auto.slider1;\r\n                document.getElementById('slider2').value = auto.slider2;\r\n                document.getElementById('slider3').value = auto.slider3;\r\n                _actualizarOutputSlider('slider1', 'valor1');\r\n                _actualizarOutputSlider('slider2', 'valor2');\r\n                _actualizarOutputSlider('slider3', 'valor3');\r\n                document.getElementById('msgAutoevaluacion').textContent = `Autoevaluaci\u00f3n recuperada (promedio ${auto.promedio}\/5).`;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            const reflexion = localStorage.getItem('cierreMetacognitivo_reflexion');\r\n            if (reflexion) {\r\n                document.getElementById('textoReflexion').value = reflexion;\r\n                document.getElementById('msgReflexion').textContent = 'Reflexi\u00f3n cargada.';\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            const plan = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('cierreMetacognitivo_plan') || 'null');\r\n            if (plan) {\r\n                document.getElementById('checkRepaso').checked = plan.checkRepaso;\r\n                document.getElementById('checkCalculos').checked = plan.checkCalculos;\r\n                document.getElementById('checkTransformaciones').checked = plan.checkTransformaciones;\r\n                document.getElementById('checkTecnologia').checked = plan.checkTecnologia;\r\n                document.getElementById('msgPlan').textContent = 'Plan de estudio cargado.';\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            ['slider1', 'slider2', 'slider3'].forEach(id => {\r\n                document.getElementById(id).addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n                    _actualizarOutputSlider(id, `valor${id.slice(-1)}`);\r\n                });\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        cargarCierreMetacognitivo();\r\n    <\/script>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE SIMULACI\u00d3N P\u00c9NDULO\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\r\nlet simulacionActiva = false;\r\nlet intervaloSimulacion;\r\nlet energiaInicial = 0;\r\nlet conFriccion = false;\r\n\r\n\/\/ Funci\u00f3n para calcular la altura vertical del p\u00e9ndulo\r\nfunction calcularAltura(longitud, anguloGrados) {\r\n    return longitud * (1 - Math.cos(anguloGrados * Math.PI \/ 180));\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction iniciarSimulacion() {\r\n    if (simulacionActiva) return;\r\n    simulacionActiva = true;\r\n    conFriccion = document.getElementById('friccionToggle').checked;\r\n\r\n    const masa = parseFloat(document.getElementById('masaPendulo').value);\r\n    const longitud = parseFloat(document.getElementById('longitudPendulo').value);\r\n    const anguloInicial = parseFloat(document.getElementById('anguloInicial').value);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Energ\u00eda potencial inicial (referencia en punto m\u00e1s bajo)\r\n    const alturaMax = calcularAltura(longitud, anguloInicial);\r\n    energiaInicial = masa * 9.8 * alturaMax;\r\n    const periodo = 2 * Math.PI * Math.sqrt(longitud \/ 9.8);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas iniciales\r\n    document.getElementById('statMaxEp').textContent = energiaInicial.toFixed(2) + ' J';\r\n    document.getElementById('statMaxEk').textContent = energiaInicial.toFixed(2) + ' J';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEnergiaTotal').textContent = energiaInicial.toFixed(2) + ' J';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataPeriodo').textContent = periodo.toFixed(2) + ' s';\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Configurar trayectoria del p\u00e9ndulo\r\n    const radio = longitud * 50; \/\/ Escala para visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n    const centroX = 300;\r\n    const centroY = 100;\r\n    const anguloRad = anguloInicial * Math.PI \/ 180;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Crear path para la animaci\u00f3n (arco de c\u00edrculo)\r\n    const startX = centroX + radio * Math.sin(anguloRad);\r\n    const startY = centroY + radio * Math.cos(anguloRad);\r\n    const endX = centroX - radio * Math.sin(anguloRad);\r\n    const endY = centroY + radio * Math.cos(anguloRad);\r\n\r\n    const largeArcFlag = anguloInicial > 90 ? 1 : 0;\r\n\r\n    const path = `\r\n        M ${centroX} ${centroY}\r\n        L ${startX} ${startY}\r\n        A ${radio} ${radio} 0 ${largeArcFlag} 1 ${endX} ${endY}\r\n        L ${centroX} ${centroY}\r\n    `;\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('trayectoria').setAttribute('d', path);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Configurar animaci\u00f3n\r\n    const anim = document.getElementById('animPendulo');\r\n    anim.setAttribute('path', `\r\n        M ${startX} ${startY}\r\n        A ${radio} ${radio} 0 ${largeArcFlag} 1 ${endX} ${endY}\r\n    `);\r\n    anim.setAttribute('dur', periodo + 's');\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Simulaci\u00f3n en tiempo real\r\n    let tiempo = 0;\r\n    let energiaActual = energiaInicial;\r\n    let amplitudActual = anguloInicial;\r\n    const amortiguamiento = 0.995; \/\/ Factor de amortiguamiento por fricci\u00f3n\r\n\r\n    intervaloSimulacion = setInterval(() => {\r\n        tiempo += 0.05;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ \u00c1ngulo actual (oscilaci\u00f3n arm\u00f3nica con amortiguamiento si hay fricci\u00f3n)\r\n        let anguloActual;\r\n        if (conFriccion) {\r\n            \/\/ Amortiguamiento exponencial\r\n            const env = Math.exp(-0.1 * tiempo);\r\n            anguloActual = anguloInicial * env * Math.cos(2 * Math.PI * tiempo \/ periodo);\r\n            energiaActual = energiaInicial * env * env;\r\n            amplitudActual = anguloInicial * env;\r\n        } else {\r\n            \/\/ Oscilaci\u00f3n simple\r\n            anguloActual = anguloInicial * Math.cos(2 * Math.PI * tiempo \/ periodo);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Altura actual\r\n        const alturaActual = calcularAltura(longitud, Math.abs(anguloActual));\r\n        const epActual = masa * 9.8 * alturaActual;\r\n        const ekActual = energiaActual - epActual; \/\/ Conservaci\u00f3n (con posible amortiguamiento)\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Velocidad (para mostrar)\r\n        const velocidad = Math.sqrt(2 * ekActual \/ masa);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar SVG: posici\u00f3n del p\u00e9ndulo\r\n        const anguloRadActual = anguloActual * Math.PI \/ 180;\r\n        const x = centroX + radio * Math.sin(anguloRadActual);\r\n        const y = centroY + radio * Math.cos(anguloRadActual);\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById('hiloPendulo').setAttribute('x2', x);\r\n        document.getElementById('hiloPendulo').setAttribute('y2', y);\r\n        document.getElementById('masaPenduloSVG').setAttribute('cx', x);\r\n        document.getElementById('masaPenduloSVG').setAttribute('cy', y);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar barras de energ\u00eda (escaladas a energ\u00eda inicial)\r\n        const maxWidth = 200;\r\n        const barraEpWidth = conFriccion ?\r\n            (epActual \/ energiaInicial) * maxWidth :\r\n            (epActual \/ energiaInicial) * maxWidth;\r\n        const barraEkWidth = conFriccion ?\r\n            (ekActual \/ energiaInicial) * maxWidth :\r\n            (ekActual \/ energiaInicial) * maxWidth;\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById('barraEp').setAttribute('width', barraEpWidth);\r\n        document.getElementById('barraEk').setAttribute('width', barraEkWidth);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar textos\r\n        document.getElementById('textEp').textContent = epActual.toFixed(2) + ' J';\r\n        document.getElementById('textEk').textContent = ekActual.toFixed(2) + ' J';\r\n        document.getElementById('textTotal').textContent = (epActual + ekActual).toFixed(2);\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById('formulaEp').textContent = epActual.toFixed(2);\r\n        document.getElementById('formulaEk').textContent = ekActual.toFixed(2);\r\n        document.getElementById('formulaTotal').textContent = (epActual + ekActual).toFixed(2);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Datos en tiempo real\r\n        document.getElementById('dataAlturaMax').textContent = calcularAltura(longitud, anguloInicial).toFixed(2) + ' m';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataVelMax').textContent = Math.sqrt(2 * energiaInicial \/ masa).toFixed(2) + ' m\/s';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEnergiaTotal').textContent = (epActual + ekActual).toFixed(2) + ' J';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Conservaci\u00f3n (porcentaje)\r\n        const conservacion = conFriccion ?\r\n            ((epActual + ekActual) \/ energiaInicial * 100).toFixed(1) :\r\n            '100';\r\n        document.getElementById('statConservacion').textContent = conservacion + '%';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Detener si la amplitud es muy peque\u00f1a (por fricci\u00f3n)\r\n        if (conFriccion && Math.abs(anguloActual) < 0.5) {\r\n            pausarSimulacion();\r\n            document.getElementById('statConservacion').textContent = '0% (detenido)';\r\n        }\r\n    }, 50); \/\/ 20 fps para simulaci\u00f3n suave\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction pausarSimulacion() {\r\n    simulacionActiva = false;\r\n    clearInterval(intervaloSimulacion);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarSimulacion() {\r\n    pausarSimulacion();\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Restaurar valores iniciales\r\n    document.getElementById('hiloPendulo').setAttribute('x2', '300');\r\n    document.getElementById('hiloPendulo').setAttribute('y2', '200');\r\n    document.getElementById('masaPenduloSVG').setAttribute('cx', '300');\r\n    document.getElementById('masaPenduloSVG').setAttribute('cy', '200');\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('barraEp').setAttribute('width', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('barraEk').setAttribute('width', '0');\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar textos\r\n    document.getElementById('textEp').textContent = '0 J';\r\n    document.getElementById('textEk').textContent = '0 J';\r\n    document.getElementById('textTotal').textContent = '0';\r\n    document.getElementById('formulaEp').textContent = '0';\r\n    document.getElementById('formulaEk').textContent = '0';\r\n    document.getElementById('formulaTotal').textContent = '0';\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar controles en tiempo real\r\n    document.getElementById('masaValue').textContent = document.getElementById('masaPendulo').value + ' kg';\r\n    document.getElementById('longitudValue').textContent = document.getElementById('longitudPendulo').value + ' m';\r\n    document.getElementById('anguloValue').textContent = document.getElementById('anguloInicial').value + '\u00b0';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Event listeners para controles\r\ndocument.getElementById('masaPendulo').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    document.getElementById('masaValue').textContent = this.value + ' kg';\r\n});\r\n\r\ndocument.getElementById('longitudPendulo').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    document.getElementById('longitudValue').textContent = this.value + ' m';\r\n});\r\n\r\ndocument.getElementById('anguloInicial').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    document.getElementById('anguloValue').textContent = this.value + '\u00b0';\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ CALCULADORA ENERG\u00cdA CA\u00cdDA LIBRE\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\r\nfunction calcularEnergia() {\r\n    const m = parseFloat(document.getElementById('masa').value);\r\n    const g = parseFloat(document.getElementById('gravedad').value);\r\n    const h = parseFloat(document.getElementById('altura').value);\r\n\r\n    const ep = m * g * h;\r\n    const v = Math.sqrt(2 * ep \/ m);\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('resultadoEp').textContent = ep.toFixed(1);\r\n    document.getElementById('velocidadFinal').textContent = v.toFixed(1);\r\n\r\n    console.log(`\ud83d\udcca Energ\u00eda calculada: ${ep.toFixed(1)} J, v = ${v.toFixed(1)} m\/s`);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ TABLA INTERACTIVA DE FORMAS DE ENERG\u00cdA\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(row => {\r\n    row.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const forma = this.dataset.forma;\r\n        const info = document.getElementById('infoForma');\r\n\r\n        const infoTextos = {\r\n            cinetica: \"Energ\u00eda asociada al movimiento. Depende de la masa y la velocidad al cuadrado. Ejemplo: Un auto a 100 km\/h tiene m\u00e1s \\(E_k\\) que uno a 50 km\/h, aunque pesen lo mismo.\",\r\n            potencial: \"Energ\u00eda almacenada por la posici\u00f3n en un campo de fuerzas (normalmente gravitatorio). Depende de la altura, masa y gravedad.\",\r\n            elastica: \"Energ\u00eda almacenada en objetos deformados (resortes, gomas). La constante el\u00e1stica (k) determina cu\u00e1nto se almacena por unidad de deformaci\u00f3n.\",\r\n            termica: \"Energ\u00eda interna de un sistema debido a la temperatura. Se transfiere como calor. 1 calor\u00eda = 4.184 J.\",\r\n            electrica: \"Energ\u00eda asociada a cargas el\u00e9ctricas en movimiento. Potencia (P) = Energ\u00eda (E) \/ Tiempo (t).\",\r\n            quimica: \"Energ\u00eda almacenada en los enlaces qu\u00edmicos. Se libera o absorbe en reacciones (exot\u00e9rmicas\/endot\u00e9rmicas).\",\r\n            nuclear: \"Energ\u00eda almacenada en el n\u00facleo at\u00f3mico. \\(E=mc^2\\) muestra su enorme magnitud: 1 kg de masa = 9\u00d710\u00b9\u2076 J.\"\r\n        };\r\n\r\n        info.textContent = infoTextos[forma] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\";\r\n        info.style.animation = \"highlight 0.5s\";\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(r => {\r\n            r.classList.remove('selected');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar fila seleccionada\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas respondidas\r\n        verificarCompletadoQuiz();\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction verificarCompletadoQuiz() {\r\n    const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n    const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q =>\r\n        q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n    );\r\n\r\n    if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n        quizCompletado = true;\r\n        mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Feedback adicional\r\n    const feedbackElement = document.createElement('div');\r\n    feedbackElement.className = 'feedback-adicional';\r\n    feedbackElement.style.marginTop = '10px';\r\n\r\n    if (correctas === total) {\r\n        feedbackElement.innerHTML = '<strong>\ud83c\udf1f Excelente!<\/strong> Dominas los conceptos de energ\u00eda y conservaci\u00f3n.';\r\n    } else if (correctas >= total\/2) {\r\n        feedbackElement.innerHTML = '<strong>\ud83d\udc4d Bueno!<\/strong> Revisa los conceptos de conservaci\u00f3n y transformaciones.';\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedbackElement.innerHTML = '<strong>\ud83d\udcda Necesitas repasar:<\/strong> Vuelve a estudiar las f\u00f3rmulas de energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica y potencial, y la ley de conservaci\u00f3n.';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').prepend(feedbackElement);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelector('.feedback-adicional')?.remove();\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    if (solucion.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'none';\r\n    } else {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = parseInt(document.getElementById('slider1').value, 10);\r\n    const slider2 = parseInt(document.getElementById('slider2').value, 10);\r\n    const slider3 = parseInt(document.getElementById('slider3').value, 10);\r\n    const promedio = ((slider1 + slider2 + slider3) \/ 3).toFixed(1);\r\n\r\n    const estado = {\r\n        conceptos: slider1,\r\n        conservacion: slider2,\r\n        calculos: slider3,\r\n        promedio: Number(promedio),\r\n        fecha: new Date().toLocaleString()\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    localStorage.setItem('autoevaluacion_energia', JSON.stringify(estado));\r\n    document.getElementById('msgAutoevaluacion').textContent = `\u2705 Guardado con \u00e9xito (${estado.fecha}). Promedio ${promedio}\/5`;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction guardarReflexion() {\r\n    const texto = document.getElementById('textoReflexion').value.trim();\r\n    if (!texto) {\r\n        document.getElementById('msgReflexion').textContent = '\u2139\ufe0f Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n antes de guardar.';\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    localStorage.setItem('reflexion_energia', JSON.stringify({texto, fecha: new Date().toLocaleString()}));\r\n    document.getElementById('msgReflexion').textContent = '\u2705 Reflexi\u00f3n guardada. Excelente trabajo.';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction guardarPlanEstudio() {\r\n    const plan = {\r\n        repaso: document.getElementById('checkRepaso').checked,\r\n        calculos: document.getElementById('checkCalculos').checked,\r\n        transformaciones: document.getElementById('checkTransformaciones').checked,\r\n        tecnologia: document.getElementById('checkTecnologia').checked,\r\n        fecha: new Date().toLocaleString()\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    localStorage.setItem('plan_energia', JSON.stringify(plan));\r\n    document.getElementById('msgPlan').textContent = '\u2705 Plan de estudio guardado.';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction cargarCierrePersistencia() {\r\n    const datos = localStorage.getItem('autoevaluacion_energia');\r\n    if (datos) {\r\n        const estado = JSON.parse(datos);\r\n        document.getElementById('slider1').value = estado.conceptos;\r\n        document.getElementById('slider2').value = estado.conservacion;\r\n        document.getElementById('slider3').value = estado.calculos;\r\n        document.getElementById('valor1').textContent = estado.conceptos;\r\n        document.getElementById('valor2').textContent = estado.conservacion;\r\n        document.getElementById('valor3').textContent = estado.calculos;\r\n        document.getElementById('msgAutoevaluacion').textContent = `\u00daltima guardada: ${estado.fecha} (promedio ${estado.promedio}\/5)`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    const reflexion = localStorage.getItem('reflexion_energia');\r\n    if (reflexion) {\r\n        document.getElementById('textoReflexion').value = JSON.parse(reflexion).texto;\r\n        document.getElementById('msgReflexion').textContent = 'Reflexi\u00f3n recuperada.';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    const plan = localStorage.getItem('plan_energia');\r\n    if (plan) {\r\n        const estadoPlan = JSON.parse(plan);\r\n        document.getElementById('checkRepaso').checked = estadoPlan.repaso;\r\n        document.getElementById('checkCalculos').checked = estadoPlan.calculos;\r\n        document.getElementById('checkTransformaciones').checked = estadoPlan.transformaciones;\r\n        document.getElementById('checkTecnologia').checked = estadoPlan.tecnologia;\r\n        document.getElementById('msgPlan').textContent = 'Plan recuperado.';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ UTILIDADES INTERACTIVAS\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\r\nfunction toggleError(header) {\r\n    const card = header.closest('.error-card');\r\n    if (!card) return;\r\n\r\n    const content = card.querySelector('.error-content');\r\n    const icon = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n    if (!content || !icon) return;\r\n\r\n    const isOpen = card.classList.toggle('open');\r\n    content.style.display = isOpen ? 'block' : 'none';\r\n    icon.textContent = isOpen ? '\u2212' : '+';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarEjemplo(tipo) {\r\n    const ejemplos = {\r\n        mecanica: 'Simulaci\u00f3n mec\u00e1nica: un p\u00e9ndulo transfiere energ\u00eda potencial y cin\u00e9tica alternadamente.',\r\n        electrotermica: 'Simulaci\u00f3n electro-t\u00e9rmica: energ\u00eda el\u00e9ctrica se convierte en t\u00e9rmica y luz.',\r\n        quimicamecanica: 'Simulaci\u00f3n qu\u00edmico-mec\u00e1nica: motor convierte energ\u00eda qu\u00edmica en trabajo mec\u00e1nico.'\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    const mensaje = ejemplos[tipo] || 'Selecciona un ejemplo v\u00e1lido para explorar la transformaci\u00f3n energ\u00e9tica.';\r\n    const panel = document.getElementById('infoForma');\r\n\r\n    if (panel) {\r\n        panel.textContent = mensaje;\r\n        panel.style.borderColor = '#ffeb3b';\r\n        panel.style.animation = 'highlight 0.5s ease';\r\n\r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            panel.style.borderColor = '';\r\n            panel.style.animation = '';\r\n        }, 700);\r\n    } else {\r\n        alert(mensaje);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\r\nconsole.log(\"\u26a1 Sistema Cyberpunk F\u00edsica - Energ\u00eda inicializado\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\udd2c Simulador de p\u00e9ndulo con conservaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\u2753 Quiz interactivo con 3 preguntas\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\udcca Problemas tipo examen con soluciones detalladas\");\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar controles\r\nreiniciarSimulacion();\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar cierre metacognitivo y enlaces de autoevaluaci\u00f3n\r\n['slider1','slider2','slider3'].forEach(id => {\r\n    const slider = document.getElementById(id);\r\n    const output = document.getElementById('valor' + id.slice(-1));\r\n    if (slider && output) {\r\n        output.textContent = slider.value;\r\n        slider.addEventListener('input', () => {\r\n            output.textContent = slider.value;\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n});\r\n\r\ncargarCierrePersistencia();\r\n<\/script>\r\n","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Define energ\u00eda","respuesta":"Capacidad para realizar trabajo"},{"enunciado":"Unidad de energ\u00eda","respuesta":"Joule (J)"},{"enunciado":"Ley de conservaci\u00f3n","respuesta":"Energ\u00eda no se crea ni destruye, se transforma"},{"enunciado":"E_k de 2 kg a 5 m\/s","respuesta":"25 J"},{"enunciado":"E_p de 1 kg a 10 m","respuesta":"98 J"},{"enunciado":"Transformaci\u00f3n en ca\u00edda libre","respuesta":"E_p \u2192 E_k"},{"enunciado":"Energ\u00eda en gasolina","respuesta":"Qu\u00edmica"},{"enunciado":"Energ\u00eda en bater\u00eda","respuesta":"El\u00e9ctrica"},{"enunciado":"Energ\u00eda en sol","respuesta":"Nuclear (fusi\u00f3n)"},{"enunciado":"Eficiencia = (E_salida \/ E_entrada) \u00d7 100%","respuesta":"F\u00f3rmula eficiencia"},{"enunciado":"SI: 1 kWh =","respuesta":"3.6 MJ"},{"enunciado":"Trabajo = F \u00d7 d \u00d7 cos\u03b8","respuesta":"F\u00f3rmula trabajo"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda es...","opciones":["Capacidad para trabajo","Fuerza","Velocidad","Masa"],"correcta":"Capacidad para trabajo"},{"pregunta":"Unidad SI","opciones":["Joule","Newton","Watt","Pascal"],"correcta":"Joule"},{"pregunta":"Ley de conservaci\u00f3n","opciones":["E total constante","E aumenta","E disminuye","E se pierde"],"correcta":"E total constante"},{"pregunta":"E_cin\u00e9tica depende de...","opciones":["m y v","solo m","solo v","h"],"correcta":"m y v"},{"pregunta":"E_potencial depende de...","opciones":["m, g, h","solo m","solo v","F"],"correcta":"m, g, h"},{"pregunta":"En sistema aislado...","opciones":["E constante","E var\u00eda","E = 0","E infinita"],"correcta":"E constante"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo =","opciones":["F \u00d7 d \u00d7 cos\u03b8","m \u00d7 a","\u00bdmv\u00b2","mgh"],"correcta":"F \u00d7 d \u00d7 cos\u03b8"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda qu\u00edmica en...","opciones":["Combusti\u00f3n","Movimiento","Altura","Velocidad"],"correcta":"Combusti\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"P\u00e9ndulo convierte...","opciones":["E_p \u2194 E_k","E_k \u2192 E_t\u00e9rmica","E_e \u2192 E_p","E_nuclear"],"correcta":"E_p \u2194 E_k"},{"pregunta":"1 J =","opciones":["1 N\u00b7m","1 kg\u00b7m\/s","1 W\u00b7s","1 kg"],"correcta":"1 N\u00b7m"},{"pregunta":"E_k de 4 kg a 3 m\/s","opciones":["18 J","12 J","24 J","36 J"],"correcta":"18 J"},{"pregunta":"E_p de 5 kg a 20 m","opciones":["980 J","100 J","490 J","1960 J"],"correcta":"980 J"},{"pregunta":"En bombilla, E_el\u00e9ctrica \u2192","opciones":["Luz + t\u00e9rmica","Solo luz","Solo cin\u00e9tica","Nuclear"],"correcta":"Luz + t\u00e9rmica"},{"pregunta":"Eficiencia =","opciones":["(E_salida \/ E_entrada) \u00d7 100%","E_entrada \/ E_salida","E_total","W \/ t"],"correcta":"(E_salida \/ E_entrada) \u00d7 100%"},{"pregunta":"1 kWh =","opciones":["3.6 MJ","1 MJ","3.6 kJ","36 MJ"],"correcta":"3.6 MJ"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda nuclear en...","opciones":["Fusi\u00f3n\/fisi\u00f3n","Combusti\u00f3n","Ca\u00edda","Resorte"],"correcta":"Fusi\u00f3n\/fisi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Monta\u00f1a rusa: punto m\u00e1s alto","opciones":["M\u00e1x E_p","M\u00e1x E_k","E = 0","E t\u00e9rmica"],"correcta":"M\u00e1x E_p"},{"pregunta":"Monta\u00f1a rusa: punto m\u00e1s bajo","opciones":["M\u00e1x E_k","M\u00e1x E_p","E = 0","E qu\u00edmica"],"correcta":"M\u00e1x E_k"},{"pregunta":"Potencia =","opciones":["W \/ t","F \u00d7 d","\u00bdmv\u00b2","mgh"],"correcta":"W \/ t"},{"pregunta":"SI: potencia en","opciones":["Watt (W)","Joule","Newton","Pascal"],"correcta":"Watt (W)"},{"pregunta":"Objeto 1 kg, v = 10 m\/s \u2192 E_k =","opciones":["50 J","100 J","25 J","500 J"],"correcta":"50 J"},{"pregunta":"Resorte k=200 N\/m, x=0.1 m \u2192 E_e =","opciones":["1 J","2 J","0.5 J","10 J"],"correcta":"1 J"},{"pregunta":"Eficiencia 75%, E_entrada=400 J \u2192 E_salida=","opciones":["300 J","100 J","533 J","75 J"],"correcta":"300 J"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo de 50 N en 2 m, \u03b8=0\u00b0 \u2192 W=","opciones":["100 J","50 J","25 J","0 J"],"correcta":"100 J"},{"pregunta":"\u03b8=90\u00b0 \u2192 W=","opciones":["0 J","F\u00d7d","\u00bdFd","Fd\u00b2"],"correcta":"0 J"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda disipada por fricci\u00f3n","opciones":["T\u00e9rmica","Cin\u00e9tica","Potencial","El\u00e9ctrica"],"correcta":"T\u00e9rmica"},{"pregunta":"Principio fundamental","opciones":["Conservaci\u00f3n E","Conservaci\u00f3n masa","Inercia","Aceleraci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Conservaci\u00f3n E"},{"pregunta":"E = mc\u00b2 es...","opciones":["Equivalencia masa-energ\u00eda","Cin\u00e9tica","Potencial","El\u00e9ctrica"],"correcta":"Equivalencia masa-energ\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"En reactor nuclear","opciones":["Fisi\u00f3n","Fusi\u00f3n","Combusti\u00f3n","Ca\u00edda"],"correcta":"Fisi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: 1 eV =","opciones":["1.6 \u00d7 10\u207b\u00b9\u2079 J","1 J","1 MJ","1 kJ"],"correcta":"1.6 \u00d7 10\u207b\u00b9\u2079 J"}]},{"materia":"F\u00edsica I","slug":"tipos-energia-cyberpunk","titulo":"Energ\u00eda: Del Sol a la Red El\u00e9ctrica","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-fisica-energia\" data-tema=\"tipos-energia\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n            TIPOS DE ENERG\u00cdA: LA MATRIZ DEL FUTURO\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            De las Fuentes Primarias a las Transformaciones Sostenibles\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Identificar los 6 tipos principales de energ\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Mec\u00e1nica, t\u00e9rmica, qu\u00edmica, el\u00e9ctrica, nuclear y radiante<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Clasificar fuentes renovables y no renovables<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Analizar su impacto ambiental y disponibilidad<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Explicar transformaciones energ\u00e9ticas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Desde fuentes primarias hasta energ\u00eda \u00fatil<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Calcular eficiencias en sistemas reales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Aplicar la ley de conservaci\u00f3n de la energ\u00eda<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACIONES EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf1e ENERG\u00cdA SOLAR<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Paneles fotovoltaicos convierten <strong>energ\u00eda radiante \u2192 el\u00e9ctrica<\/strong> con ~20% eficiencia<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Ejemplo: Granjas solares en desiertos<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\ude97 MOTORES H\u00cdBRIDOS<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Combinan <strong>qu\u00edmica (gasolina) \u2192 t\u00e9rmica \u2192 mec\u00e1nica<\/strong> y <strong>el\u00e9ctrica (bater\u00edas)<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Eficiencia: ~30-40%<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udca1 CENTRALES NUCLEARES<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Transforman <strong>nuclear \u2192 t\u00e9rmica \u2192 mec\u00e1nica \u2192 el\u00e9ctrica<\/strong> con ~33% eficiencia<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Ejemplo: Reactores de fisi\u00f3n (U-235)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- LEY DE CONSERVACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Ley de Conservaci\u00f3n de la Energ\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"ley-conservacion\">\r\n                <div class=\"formula-grand\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    E_{\\text{total}} = \\text{constante}\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <p>La energ\u00eda no se crea ni se destruye, solo se <strong>transforma<\/strong> de una forma a otra.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-conservacion\">\r\n                    <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> En un p\u00e9ndulo:\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    E_p \\xrightleftharpoons[altura]{} E_k\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TIPOS DE ENERG\u00cdA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Clasificaci\u00f3n de la Energ\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tipos-energia-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"tipo-card\" style=\"border-color: #4CAF50;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\ude80 MEC\u00c1NICA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2 \\quad E_p = mgh\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p><strong>Fuentes:<\/strong> Movimiento, altura (ej: viento, represas)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"tipo-card\" style=\"border-color: #FF5722;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd25 T\u00c9RMICA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        Q = mc\\Delta T\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p><strong>Fuentes:<\/strong> Combusti\u00f3n, geotermia (ej: motores, volcanes)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"tipo-card\" style=\"border-color: #E91E63;\">\r\n                    <h4>\u2697\ufe0f QU\u00cdMICA<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Fuentes:<\/strong> Enlaces moleculares (ej: bater\u00edas, alimentos)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"tipo-card\" style=\"border-color: #2196F3;\">\r\n                    <h4>\u26a1 EL\u00c9CTRICA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        E = qV\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p><strong>Fuentes:<\/strong> Cargas en movimiento (ej: redes el\u00e9ctricas)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"tipo-card\" style=\"border-color: #9C27B0;\">\r\n                    <h4>\u2622 NUCLEAR<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        E = \\Delta mc^2\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p><strong>Fuentes:<\/strong> Fisi\u00f3n\/fusi\u00f3n (ej: reactores, Sol)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"tipo-card\" style=\"border-color: #FFC107;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udf1e RADIANTE<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>Fuentes:<\/strong> Ondas electromagn\u00e9ticas (ej: luz solar, microondas)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FUENTES DE ENERG\u00cdA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Fuentes de Energ\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"fuentes-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"fuente-card renovable\">\r\n                    <div class=\"fuente-header\">\ud83c\udf3f RENOVABLES<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"fuente-body\">\r\n                        <div class=\"fuente-item\">\r\n                            <strong>Solar:<\/strong> Radiante \u2192 El\u00e9ctrica (paneles FV)\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"fuente-item\">\r\n                            <strong>E\u00f3lica:<\/strong> Mec\u00e1nica (viento) \u2192 El\u00e9ctrica\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"fuente-item\">\r\n                            <strong>Hidroel\u00e9ctrica:<\/strong> Potencial (agua) \u2192 El\u00e9ctrica\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"fuente-item\">\r\n                            <strong>Biomasa:<\/strong> Qu\u00edmica \u2192 T\u00e9rmica\/El\u00e9ctrica\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"fuente-card no-renovable\">\r\n                    <div class=\"fuente-header\">\u26fd NO RENOVABLES<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"fuente-body\">\r\n                        <div class=\"fuente-item\">\r\n                            <strong>F\u00f3siles:<\/strong> Qu\u00edmica (carb\u00f3n\/petr\u00f3leo) \u2192 T\u00e9rmica\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"fuente-item\">\r\n                            <strong>Nuclear:<\/strong> Nuclear (U) \u2192 T\u00e9rmica \u2192 El\u00e9ctrica\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"impacto-ambiental\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83c\udf31 IMPACTO AMBIENTAL<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"impacto-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"impacto-item bajo\">Renovables: <strong>Bajo<\/strong> (CO\u2082 ~0)<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"impacto-item alto\">F\u00f3siles: <strong>Alto<\/strong> (CO\u2082 ++)<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"impacto-item medio\">Nuclear: <strong>Medio<\/strong> (residuos radiactivos)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TRANSFORMACIONES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Transformaciones Energ\u00e9ticas<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"transformaciones-diagrama\">\r\n                <svg width=\"600\" height=\"300\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 300\" id=\"diagramaTransformaciones\">\r\n                    <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#E8F5E9\" rx=\"10\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Sol -->\r\n                    <g id=\"sol\">\r\n                        <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#FFEB3B\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"100\" y=\"140\" fill=\"#F57F17\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Solar<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"100\" y=\"160\" fill=\"#F57F17\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Radiante<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Panel Solar -->\r\n                    <g id=\"panel\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"200\" y=\"80\" width=\"80\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#1565C0\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"240\" y=\"110\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Panel FV<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"240\" y=\"130\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">El\u00e9ctrica<\/text>\r\n                        <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#FBC02D\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#flecha)\"\/>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Bater\u00eda -->\r\n                    <g id=\"bateria\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"300\" y=\"150\" width=\"60\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#E91E63\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"330\" y=\"190\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Bater\u00eda<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"330\" y=\"210\" fill=\"#FF8A80\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Qu\u00edmica<\/text>\r\n                        <line x1=\"280\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#42A5F5\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#flecha)\"\/>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Motor -->\r\n                    <g id=\"motor\">\r\n                        <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"100\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#43A047\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"450\" y=\"105\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Motor<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"450\" y=\"125\" fill=\"#C8E6C9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mec\u00e1nica<\/text>\r\n                        <line x1=\"360\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#E91E63\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#flecha)\"\/>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Leyenda -->\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"270\" fill=\"#1B5E20\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\r\n                        Solar \u2192 El\u00e9ctrica \u2192 Qu\u00edmica \u2192 Mec\u00e1nica\r\n                    <\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Marcadores -->\r\n                    <defs>\r\n                        <marker id=\"flecha\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                            <path d=\"M0,0 L9,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#1B5E20\"\/>\r\n                        <\/marker>\r\n                    <\/defs>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ejemplo-transformacion\">\r\n                <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Central hidroel\u00e9ctrica:\r\n                \\[\r\n                E_p \\xrightarrow[\\text{ca\u00edda}]{} E_k \\xrightarrow[\\text{turbina}]{} E_{\\text{el\u00e9ctrica}}\r\n                \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- EFICIENCIA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>5. Eficiencia Energ\u00e9tica<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"eficiencia-formula\">\r\n                \\[\r\n                \\eta = \\frac{E_{\\text{\u00fatil}}}{E_{\\text{total}}} \\times 100\\%\r\n                \\]\r\n                <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Motor de combusti\u00f3n interna:\r\n                \\[\r\n                \\eta \\approx 25\\% \\quad (75\\% \\text{ se pierde como calor})\r\n                \\]\r\n                <\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"eficiencia-comparativa\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-eficiencia\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr><th>Sistema<\/th><th>Eficiencia<\/th><th>P\u00e9rdidas principales<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr><td>Panel solar<\/td><td>15\u201320%<\/td><td>Reflexi\u00f3n, calor<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>Motor el\u00e9ctrico<\/td><td>85\u201395%<\/td><td>Calor, fricci\u00f3n<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>Central t\u00e9rmica<\/td><td>33\u201340%<\/td><td>Calor residual<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>Bater\u00eda Li-ion<\/td><td>90\u201395%<\/td><td>Resistencia interna<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: TRANSFORMACIONES ENERG\u00c9TICAS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"transformaciones-energia\">\r\n            <!-- CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>CONFIGURACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"fuenteSelect\">Fuente primaria:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"fuenteSelect\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"solar\">Solar (Radiante)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"eolica\">E\u00f3lica (Mec\u00e1nica)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"fosil\">Combustible f\u00f3sil (Qu\u00edmica)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"nuclear\">Nuclear (Uranio)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"hidroelectrica\">Hidroel\u00e9ctrica (Potencial)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"sistemaSelect\">Sistema de transformaci\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"sistemaSelect\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"panel\">Panel fotovoltaico<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"turbina\">Turbina e\u00f3lica<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"motor\">Motor de combusti\u00f3n<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"reactor\">Reactor nuclear<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"represa\">Represa hidroel\u00e9ctrica<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"eficienciaInput\">Eficiencia (%):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"eficienciaInput\" min=\"5\" max=\"95\" value=\"20\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <span id=\"eficienciaValue\">20%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-simular\" onclick=\"simularTransformacion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> SIMULAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacionTransformacion\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" id=\"svgTransformacion\">\r\n                    <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Fuente primaria -->\r\n                    <g id=\"fuentePrimaria\">\r\n                        <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"200\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#FF9800\" id=\"circuloFuente\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"100\" y=\"205\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"textoFuente\">Solar<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"100\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#FFC107\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"tipoFuente\">Radiante<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Sistema de transformaci\u00f3n -->\r\n                    <g id=\"sistemaTransformacion\" transform=\"translate(300, 200)\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"-50\" y=\"-30\" width=\"100\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#2196F3\" rx=\"10\" id=\"rectSistema\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"0\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"textoSistema\">Panel FV<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"25\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"tipoSistema\">El\u00e9ctrica<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Energ\u00eda \u00fatil -->\r\n                    <g id=\"energiaUtil\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"500\" y=\"180\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" rx=\"5\" id=\"rectUtil\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"540\" y=\"200\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"textoUtil\">El\u00e9ctrica<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"540\" y=\"225\" fill=\"#C8E6C9\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"valorUtil\">80%<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- P\u00e9rdidas -->\r\n                    <g id=\"perdidas\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"500\" y=\"250\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#F44336\" rx=\"5\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"540\" y=\"270\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">P\u00e9rdidas<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"540\" y=\"295\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"valorPerdidas\">20%<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Flechas -->\r\n                    <line x1=\"140\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#FFC107\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#flecha)\" id=\"flecha1\"\/>\r\n                    <line x1=\"350\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#2196F3\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#flecha)\" id=\"flecha2\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Leyenda -->\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"350\" fill=\"#E0F2F1\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"leyendaEficiencia\">Eficiencia: 20%<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Marcadores -->\r\n                    <defs>\r\n                        <marker id=\"flecha\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                            <path d=\"M0,0 L9,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#E0F2F1\"\/>\r\n                        <\/marker>\r\n                    <\/defs>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- DATOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>DATOS DE LA TRANSFORMACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Fuente primaria:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataFuente\">Solar<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Tipo de energ\u00eda:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTipoFuente\">Radiante<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Sistema:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataSistema\">Panel fotovoltaico<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Eficiencia:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEficiencia\">20%<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Energ\u00eda \u00fatil:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEnergiaUtil\">80%<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">P\u00e9rdidas:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPerdidas\">20%<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: DOMINA LAS TRANSFORMACIONES ENERG\u00c9TICAS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 tipo de energ\u00eda tiene un objeto en movimiento?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span> Potencial\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span> Cin\u00e9tica\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span> T\u00e9rmica\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span> Qu\u00edmica\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> La energ\u00eda asociada al movimiento es <strong>cin\u00e9tica<\/strong> (\\(E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\)).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la definici\u00f3n de energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la eficiencia t\u00edpica de un panel solar?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span> 5%\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span> 50%\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span> 20%\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span> 90%\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Los paneles solares comerciales tienen eficiencias de <strong>15\u201320%<\/strong>.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> La eficiencia real est\u00e1 muy por debajo del 50%.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 transformaci\u00f3n ocurre en una represa hidroel\u00e9ctrica?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span> Potencial \u2192 Cin\u00e9tica \u2192 El\u00e9ctrica\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span> Qu\u00edmica \u2192 T\u00e9rmica \u2192 Mec\u00e1nica\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span> Radiante \u2192 El\u00e9ctrica \u2192 T\u00e9rmica\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span> Nuclear \u2192 Mec\u00e1nica \u2192 El\u00e9ctrica\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> El agua almacenada tiene energ\u00eda <strong>potencial<\/strong>, que se convierte en <strong>cin\u00e9tica<\/strong> al caer y luego en <strong>el\u00e9ctrica<\/strong> en el generador.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa las etapas de una central hidroel\u00e9ctrica.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR ENERG\u00cdA POTENCIAL Y CIN\u00c9TICA<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"Un objeto en el suelo tiene energ\u00eda potencial\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La energ\u00eda potencial depende de la <strong>altura<\/strong> (\\(E_p = mgh\\)). En el suelo, \\(h=0\\) \u2192 \\(E_p=0\\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Una pelota en lo alto de un edificio tiene \\(E_p\\), al caer gana \\(E_k\\).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c IGNORAR P\u00c9RDIDAS DE ENERG\u00cdA<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"Un motor tiene 100% de eficiencia\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Siempre hay p\u00e9rdidas por <strong>calor<\/strong> y <strong>fricci\u00f3n<\/strong>. La eficiencia real es:\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        \\eta = \\frac{E_{\\text{\u00fatil}}}{E_{\\text{total}}} < 1\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                        <table>\r\n                            <tr><th>Sistema<\/th><th>Eficiencia t\u00edpica<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Motor de gasolina<\/td><td>~25%<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Panel solar<\/td><td>~20%<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Bater\u00eda Li-ion<\/td><td>~90%<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <\/table>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>C\u00e1lculo de Energ\u00eda Cin\u00e9tica<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Calcula la energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica de un autom\u00f3vil de 1200 kg que se mueve a 25 m\/s. Expresa el resultado en Joules y en kWh.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2 \\quad \\text{y} \\quad 1 \\text{ kWh} = 3.6 \\times 10^6 \\text{ J}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu c\u00e1lculo aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"6\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. \\(E_k = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 1200 \\times (25)^2 = 375,000 \\text{ J}\\)<br>\r\n                    2. \\(375,000 \\text{ J} = \\frac{375,000}{3.6 \\times 10^6} = 0.104 \\text{ kWh}\\)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Eficiencia de un Sistema<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Una central t\u00e9rmica recibe 1000 MJ de energ\u00eda qu\u00edmica del carb\u00f3n y produce 350 MJ de electricidad. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>La eficiencia del proceso.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La energ\u00eda perdida y su forma principal.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu respuesta aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. \\(\\eta = \\frac{350}{1000} \\times 100\\% = 35\\%\\)<br>\r\n                    2. \\(E_{\\text{p\u00e9rdida}} = 1000 - 350 = 650 \\text{ MJ}\\) (principalmente como <strong>calor<\/strong>).\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (3 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (2 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (1 pt)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>C\u00e1lculos correctos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Todas las operaciones y conversiones correctas<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Error en 1 c\u00e1lculo o conversi\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                    <td>M\u00faltiples errores<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Explicaci\u00f3n de conceptos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explica claramente cada paso y f\u00f3rmula<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explicaci\u00f3n parcial<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No justifica<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Tipos de energ\u00eda:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Transformaciones y eficiencia:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo podr\u00edamos mejorar la eficiencia energ\u00e9tica en nuestra vida cotidiana?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: Uso de LED, transporte p\u00fablico, aislamiento t\u00e9rmico...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar f\u00f3rmulas de \\(E_k\\) y \\(E_p\\)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Clasificar fuentes renovables\/no renovables<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83e\uddea PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Resolver 5 problemas de eficiencia<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Analizar 3 transformaciones cotidianas<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.energy.gov\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udf10 Departamento de Energ\u00eda de EE.UU.\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.eia.gov\/energyexplained\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcca EIA: Energ\u00eda Explicada\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ BASE DE DATOS DE TRANSFORMACIONES\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    const transformacionesDB = {\r\n        \"solar\": {\r\n            fuente: \"Solar\",\r\n            tipoFuente: \"Radiante\",\r\n            sistemas: {\r\n                \"panel\": {\r\n                    nombre: \"Panel fotovoltaico\",\r\n                    tipoSistema: \"El\u00e9ctrica\",\r\n                    eficienciaDefault: 20,\r\n                    energiaUtil: \"El\u00e9ctrica\",\r\n                    perdidas: \"Calor (80%)\"\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"eolica\": {\r\n            fuente: \"E\u00f3lica\",\r\n            tipoFuente: \"Mec\u00e1nica\",\r\n            sistemas: {\r\n                \"turbina\": {\r\n                    nombre: \"Turbina e\u00f3lica\",\r\n                    tipoSistema: \"El\u00e9ctrica\",\r\n                    eficienciaDefault: 45,\r\n                    energiaUtil: \"El\u00e9ctrica\",\r\n                    perdidas: \"Fricci\u00f3n, calor (55%)\"\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"fosil\": {\r\n            fuente: \"Combustible f\u00f3sil\",\r\n            tipoFuente: \"Qu\u00edmica\",\r\n            sistemas: {\r\n                \"motor\": {\r\n                    nombre: \"Motor de combusti\u00f3n\",\r\n                    tipoSistema: \"Mec\u00e1nica\",\r\n                    eficienciaDefault: 25,\r\n                    energiaUtil: \"Mec\u00e1nica\",\r\n                    perdidas: \"Calor (75%)\"\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"nuclear\": {\r\n            fuente: \"Nuclear\",\r\n            tipoFuente: \"Nuclear\",\r\n            sistemas: {\r\n                \"reactor\": {\r\n                    nombre: \"Reactor nuclear\",\r\n                    tipoSistema: \"T\u00e9rmica \u2192 El\u00e9ctrica\",\r\n                    eficienciaDefault: 33,\r\n                    energiaUtil: \"El\u00e9ctrica\",\r\n                    perdidas: \"Calor residual (67%)\"\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"hidroelectrica\": {\r\n            fuente: \"Hidroel\u00e9ctrica\",\r\n            tipoFuente: \"Potencial\",\r\n            sistemas: {\r\n                \"represa\": {\r\n                    nombre: \"Represa hidroel\u00e9ctrica\",\r\n                    tipoSistema: \"El\u00e9ctrica\",\r\n                    eficienciaDefault: 90,\r\n                    energiaUtil: \"El\u00e9ctrica\",\r\n                    perdidas: \"Fricci\u00f3n, evaporaci\u00f3n (10%)\"\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ SIMULADOR DE TRANSFORMACIONES\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function simularTransformacion() {\r\n        const fuente = document.getElementById('fuenteSelect').value;\r\n        const sistema = document.getElementById('sistemaSelect').value;\r\n        const eficiencia = document.getElementById('eficienciaInput').value;\r\n        document.getElementById('eficienciaValue').textContent = eficiencia + \"%\";\r\n\r\n        const dataFuente = transformacionesDB[fuente];\r\n        const dataSistema = dataFuente.sistemas[sistema];\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n        document.getElementById('dataFuente').textContent = dataFuente.fuente;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataTipoFuente').textContent = dataFuente.tipoFuente;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataSistema').textContent = dataSistema.nombre;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEficiencia').textContent = eficiencia + \"%\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEnergiaUtil').textContent = eficiencia + \"%\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataPerdidas').textContent = (100 - eficiencia) + \"%\";\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar SVG\r\n        document.getElementById('textoFuente').textContent = fuente.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + fuente.slice(1);\r\n        document.getElementById('tipoFuente').textContent = dataFuente.tipoFuente;\r\n        document.getElementById('textoSistema').textContent = dataSistema.nombre.split(' ')[0];\r\n        document.getElementById('tipoSistema').textContent = dataSistema.tipoSistema;\r\n        document.getElementById('textoUtil').textContent = dataSistema.energiaUtil;\r\n        document.getElementById('valorUtil').textContent = eficiencia + \"%\";\r\n        document.getElementById('valorPerdidas').textContent = (100 - eficiencia) + \"%\";\r\n        document.getElementById('leyendaEficiencia').textContent = `Eficiencia: ${eficiencia}%`;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Cambiar colores seg\u00fan fuente\r\n        const coloresFuente = {\r\n            \"solar\": \"#FF9800\",\r\n            \"eolica\": \"#4CAF50\",\r\n            \"fosil\": \"#616161\",\r\n            \"nuclear\": \"#9C27B0\",\r\n            \"hidroelectrica\": \"#2196F3\"\r\n        };\r\n        document.getElementById('circuloFuente').setAttribute('fill', coloresFuente[fuente]);\r\n        document.getElementById('flecha1').setAttribute('stroke', coloresFuente[fuente]);\r\n\r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udd04 Simulaci\u00f3n: ${fuente} \u2192 ${sistema} | Eficiencia: ${eficiencia}%`);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    let quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n                q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n            );\r\n            if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n                quizCompletado = true;\r\n                mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/3`;\r\n        let feedback = \"\";\r\n        if (correctas >= 2) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d \u00a1Excelente! Dominas las transformaciones energ\u00e9ticas.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Revisa los tipos de energ\u00eda y las eficiencias t\u00edpicas.\";\r\n        }\r\n        document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        quizRespuestas = [];\r\n        quizCompletado = false;\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ ERRORES COMUNES\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function toggleError(header) {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n        if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        } else {\r\n            content.style.display = 'block';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function verificarProblema(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n        const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n        const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2)) \/ 2;\r\n        alert(`\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Tipos de energ\u00eda: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Transformaciones: ${slider2}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `\u00a1Sigue explorando las fuentes de energ\u00eda!`);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: Tipos de Energ\u00eda cargada\");\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83c\udfaf Objetivos: Dominar transformaciones y eficiencias energ\u00e9ticas\");\r\n    simularTransformacion(); \/\/ Cargar simulaci\u00f3n inicial\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Transformaci\u00f3n en panel solar","respuesta":"Radiante -> El\u00e9ctrica"},{"enunciado":"Fuente f\u00f3sil ejemplo","respuesta":"Petr\u00f3leo (qu\u00edmica -> t\u00e9rmica)"},{"enunciado":"Nuclear transformaci\u00f3n t\u00edpica","respuesta":"Nuclear -> T\u00e9rmica -> El\u00e9ctrica"},{"enunciado":"E\u00f3lica -> ?","respuesta":"Mec\u00e1nica -> El\u00e9ctrica"},{"enunciado":"Biomasa -> ?","respuesta":"Qu\u00edmica -> T\u00e9rmica"},{"enunciado":"Geot\u00e9rmica -> ?","respuesta":"T\u00e9rmica -> El\u00e9ctrica"},{"enunciado":"Hidr\u00f3geno como","respuesta":"Vector energ\u00e9tico (no fuente)"},{"enunciado":"Renovable: solar, e\u00f3lica, hidro, biomasa, geot\u00e9rmica","respuesta":"S\u00ed"},{"enunciado":"No renovable: f\u00f3sil, nuclear (U)","respuesta":"S\u00ed"},{"enunciado":"Eficiencia t\u00edpica panel FV","respuesta":"~15-22%"},{"enunciado":"1 MWh =","respuesta":"3.6 GJ"},{"enunciado":"Cadena completa: carb\u00f3n -> electricidad","respuesta":"Qu\u00edmica -> T\u00e9rmica -> Mec\u00e1nica -> El\u00e9ctrica (~35%)"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda solar es...","opciones":["Radiante","Qu\u00edmica","Nuclear","Mec\u00e1nica"],"correcta":"Radiante"},{"pregunta":"E\u00f3lica proviene de...","opciones":["Viento","Sol","Agua","Tierra"],"correcta":"Viento"},{"pregunta":"Nuclear de...","opciones":["N\u00facleo","Enlaces","Electrones","Movimiento"],"correcta":"N\u00facleo"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3sil es...","opciones":["No renovable","Renovable","Nuclear","Solar"],"correcta":"No renovable"},{"pregunta":"Hidroel\u00e9ctrica usa...","opciones":["Agua","Viento","Sol","Carb\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Agua"},{"pregunta":"Panel solar convierte...","opciones":["Solar -> El\u00e9ctrica","El\u00e9ctrica -> Solar","T\u00e9rmica -> El\u00e9ctrica","Mec\u00e1nica -> Solar"],"correcta":"Solar -> El\u00e9ctrica"},{"pregunta":"Biomasa es...","opciones":["Renovable","No renovable","Nuclear","F\u00f3sil"],"correcta":"Renovable"},{"pregunta":"Geot\u00e9rmica usa...","opciones":["Calor Tierra","Viento","Sol","Agua"],"correcta":"Calor Tierra"},{"pregunta":"Hidr\u00f3geno es...","opciones":["Vector energ\u00e9tico","Fuente primaria","No renovable","Nuclear"],"correcta":"Vector energ\u00e9tico"},{"pregunta":"Motor combusti\u00f3n: qu\u00edmica ->","opciones":["T\u00e9rmica -> Mec\u00e1nica","El\u00e9ctrica","Radiante","Nuclear"],"correcta":"T\u00e9rmica -> Mec\u00e1nica"},{"pregunta":"Central nuclear: nuclear ->","opciones":["T\u00e9rmica -> El\u00e9ctrica","El\u00e9ctrica -> T\u00e9rmica","Mec\u00e1nica -> El\u00e9ctrica","Solar"],"correcta":"T\u00e9rmica -> El\u00e9ctrica"},{"pregunta":"Turbina e\u00f3lica: mec\u00e1nica ->","opciones":["El\u00e9ctrica","T\u00e9rmica","Qu\u00edmica","Radiante"],"correcta":"El\u00e9ctrica"},{"pregunta":"Eficiencia t\u00edpica carb\u00f3n","opciones":["~35%","80%","10%","100%"],"correcta":"~35%"},{"pregunta":"Eficiencia panel FV","opciones":["~20%","80%","5%","100%"],"correcta":"~20%"},{"pregunta":"1 TJ =","opciones":["10\u00b9\u00b2 J","10\u2076 J","10\u2079 J","10\u00b3 J"],"correcta":"10\u00b9\u00b2 J"},{"pregunta":"Renovable con m\u00e1s capacidad global","opciones":["Hidroel\u00e9ctrica","Solar","E\u00f3lica","Nuclear"],"correcta":"Hidroel\u00e9ctrica"},{"pregunta":"Combustible con m\u00e1s CO\u2082","opciones":["Carb\u00f3n","Solar","E\u00f3lica","Hidr\u00f3geno"],"correcta":"Carb\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Hidr\u00f3geno se produce por","opciones":["Electr\u00f3lisis","Combusti\u00f3n","Fotos\u00edntesis","Fisi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Electr\u00f3lisis"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda radiante incluye...","opciones":["Luz, microondas","Sonido","Movimiento","Calor"],"correcta":"Luz, microondas"},{"pregunta":"Central t\u00e9rmica f\u00f3sil usa...","opciones":["Ciclo Rankine","Ciclo Otto","Ciclo Brayton","Ciclo Stirling"],"correcta":"Ciclo Rankine"},{"pregunta":"Eficiencia m\u00e1xima te\u00f3rica motor t\u00e9rmico","opciones":["Carnot","100%","50%","Rankine"],"correcta":"Carnot"},{"pregunta":"Central nuclear eficiencia t\u00edpica","opciones":["~33%","90%","10%","60%"],"correcta":"~33%"},{"pregunta":"Hidr\u00f3geno verde se obtiene por","opciones":["Electr\u00f3lisis con renovables","Reforma vapor","Gasificaci\u00f3n","Fotos\u00edntesis"],"correcta":"Electr\u00f3lisis con renovables"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda mareomotriz es...","opciones":["Mec\u00e1nica (renovable)","Nuclear","F\u00f3sil","T\u00e9rmica"],"correcta":"Mec\u00e1nica (renovable)"},{"pregunta":"1 GWh =","opciones":["3.6 TJ","3.6 GJ","3.6 MJ","3.6 kJ"],"correcta":"3.6 TJ"},{"pregunta":"Proyecci\u00f3n 2050: % renovables","opciones":[">70%","<30%","50%","100%"],"correcta":">70%"},{"pregunta":"Fusi\u00f3n nuclear produce...","opciones":["He + energ\u00eda","CO\u2082","U-235","H\u2082O"],"correcta":"He + energ\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"Ciclo combinado eficiencia","opciones":["~60%","30%","90%","20%"],"correcta":"~60%"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda osmotica usa...","opciones":["Gradiente salinidad","Viento","Sol","Calor Tierra"],"correcta":"Gradiente salinidad"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: energ\u00eda en","opciones":["Joule","Calor\u00eda","BTU","kWh"],"correcta":"Joule"}]},{"materia":"F\u00edsica I","slug":"fracking-cyberpunk","titulo":"Fracking: La F\u00edsica Detr\u00e1s de la Fracturaci\u00f3n Hidr\u00e1ulica","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-fisica-fracking\" data-tema=\"fracking\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n            FRACKING: F\u00cdSICA DE LA FRACTURACI\u00d3N HIDR\u00c1ULICA\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Presi\u00f3n, Energ\u00eda y el Debate de la Sostenibilidad\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Explicar el proceso f\u00edsico del fracking<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Presi\u00f3n, fluidos, fractura de rocas y flujo de hidrocarburos<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar la composici\u00f3n del fluido<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Agua, proppant y aditivos qu\u00edmicos: funciones y riesgos<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Calcular eficiencia energ\u00e9tica (EROEI)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Comparar con fuentes convencionales y renovables<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Evaluar impactos ambientales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Contaminaci\u00f3n, sismos inducidos y emisiones de GEI<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> CONTEXTO GLOBAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc8 PRODUCCI\u00d3N EN EE.UU.<\/h3>\r\n                <p>El fracking represent\u00f3 el <strong>60% del gas natural<\/strong> y <strong>50% del petr\u00f3leo<\/strong> en 2025<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Ejemplo: Cuencas Marcellus y Permian<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf31 PROHIBICIONES<\/h3>\r\n                <p><strong>Francia, Alemania, M\u00e9xico<\/strong> y <strong>10+ pa\u00edses<\/strong> lo prohibieron por riesgos ambientales<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">M\u00e9xico: Prohibici\u00f3n constitucional (2024)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcb0 COSTO ENERG\u00c9TICO<\/h3>\r\n                <p>EROEI de <strong>~5:1<\/strong> vs <strong>20:1<\/strong> del petr\u00f3leo convencional<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">1 barril de shale oil requiere ~1.5 barriles equivalentes de energ\u00eda<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- FUNDAMENTOS F\u00cdSICOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"fundamentos-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS F\u00cdSICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- LEY DE PASCAL -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Principio de Pascal y Presi\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"concepto-dual\">\r\n                <div class=\"formula-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-grand\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        P = \\frac{F}{A} \\quad \\text{(Presi\u00f3n)}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p>En fracking, se inyecta fluido a <strong>~700 bar<\/strong> (70 MPa):<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-destacado\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        P_{\\text{inyecci\u00f3n}} = 700\\,\\text{bar} = 70 \\times 10^6\\,\\text{Pa}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"explicacion-card\">\r\n                    <p>La <strong>Ley de Pascal<\/strong> establece que la presi\u00f3n aplicada a un fluido se transmite <strong>igualmente en todas direcciones<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                    <p>En fracking, esto permite fracturar la roca en m\u00faltiples direcciones desde un solo punto de inyecci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- PROCESO T\u00c9CNICO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Proceso T\u00e9cnico Paso a Paso<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"proceso-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"paso-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-header\">\ud83d\udd28 PERFORACI\u00d3N<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-body\">\r\n                        <p>Pozo vertical hasta <strong>1\u20133 km<\/strong>, luego horizontal <strong>1\u20132 km<\/strong> en el yacimiento.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-tecnico\">\r\n                            <strong>Di\u00e1metro:<\/strong> ~20 cm<br>\r\n                            <strong>Material:<\/strong> Acero + cemento\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"paso-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-header\">\ud83d\udca6 INYECCI\u00d3N<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-body\">\r\n                        <p>Fluido a alta presi\u00f3n (<strong>700 bar<\/strong>) con:<\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>90% agua<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>9.5% proppant<\/strong> (arena\/c\u00e9ramica)<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>0.5% qu\u00edmicos<\/strong> (20+ tipos)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"paso-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-header\">\ud83d\udca5 FRACTURA<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-body\">\r\n                        <p>La roca (esquisto) se fractura cuando la presi\u00f3n supera su <strong>resistencia a la tracci\u00f3n<\/strong>:<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                            \\[\r\n                            \\sigma_t = \\frac{F}{A} \\quad \\text{(Resistencia a tracci\u00f3n)}\r\n                            \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Esquisto Marcellus: \\(\\sigma_t \\approx 5\\,\\text{MPa}\\)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"paso-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-header\">\u26a1 FLUJO<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-body\">\r\n                        <p>El gas\/petr\u00f3leo fluye por las fracturas hacia el pozo:<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                            \\[\r\n                            Q = \\frac{kA}{\\mu L}\\Delta P \\quad \\text{(Ley de Darcy)}\r\n                            \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <p><strong>k:<\/strong> Permeabilidad (aumenta 1000\u00d7 con fracturas)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- COMPOSICI\u00d3N FLUIDO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Composici\u00f3n del Fluido de Fracking<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"fluido-diagrama\">\r\n                <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 200\">\r\n                    <!-- Agua -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"20\" y=\"50\" width=\"360\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#1E88E5\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"200\" y=\"70\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">90% Agua<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Proppant -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"20\" y=\"90\" width=\"360\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#FFC107\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"200\" y=\"105\" fill=\"#000\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">9.5% Proppant (arena\/c\u00e9ramica)<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Qu\u00edmicos -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"20\" y=\"120\" width=\"360\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#E91E63\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"200\" y=\"130\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.5% Qu\u00edmicos (20+ tipos)<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Leyenda -->\r\n                    <text x=\"200\" y=\"160\" fill=\"#FF9800\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\r\n                        Biocidas, reductores de fricci\u00f3n, \u00e1cidos, gelificantes\r\n                    <\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: PRESI\u00d3N Y FRACTURA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\">\r\n            <!-- CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>PAR\u00c1METROS DE INYECCI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"presionInyeccion\">Presi\u00f3n de inyecci\u00f3n (bar):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"presionInyeccion\" min=\"100\" max=\"1000\" value=\"700\" step=\"10\">\r\n                    <span id=\"presionValue\">700 bar<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"resistenciaRoca\">Resistencia roca (MPa):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"resistenciaRoca\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" value=\"5\" step=\"0.5\">\r\n                    <span id=\"resistenciaValue\">5 MPa<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"profundidadPozo\">Profundidad pozo (km):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"profundidadPozo\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"5\" value=\"2\" step=\"0.1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"profundidadValue\">2 km<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"incluirQuimicos\">Incluir qu\u00edmicos:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"incluirQuimicos\" checked>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <button class=\"btn-simular\" onclick=\"simularFracking()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6<\/span> SIMULAR FRACKING\r\n                <\/button>\r\n\r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarSimulacion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u21ba<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" id=\"svgFracking\">\r\n                    <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Capas geol\u00f3gicas -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#3E2723\" rx=\"10\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#FFCCBC\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ESQUISTO<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#FF8A65\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Profundidad: <tspan id=\"svgProfundidad\">2000 m<\/tspan><\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Pozo -->\r\n                    <path id=\"pozoPath\" d=\"M 300 50 L 300 200 L 450 200\" stroke=\"#424242\" stroke-width=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Fluido inyectado -->\r\n                    <circle id=\"fluidoInyeccion\" cx=\"300\" cy=\"200\" r=\"0\" fill=\"#1E88E5\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Fracturas -->\r\n                    <g id=\"fracturasGroup\">\r\n                        <!-- Se generan din\u00e1micamente -->\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Gas\/petr\u00f3leo -->\r\n                    <g id=\"hidrocarburosGroup\">\r\n                        <!-- Se generan din\u00e1micamente -->\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Leyendas -->\r\n                    <text x=\"50\" y=\"350\" fill=\"#E0F2F1\" font-size=\"12\">\r\n                        <tspan id=\"leyendaPresion\">Presi\u00f3n: 0 MPa<\/tspan>\r\n                    <\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"50\" y=\"370\" fill=\"#E0F2F1\" font-size=\"12\">\r\n                        <tspan id=\"leyendaResistencia\">Resistencia roca: 5 MPa<\/tspan>\r\n                    <\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"50\" y=\"390\" fill=\"#E0F2F1\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"leyendaResultado\">\r\n                        Estado: Listo para simular\r\n                    <\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- DATOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>RESULTADOS<\/h3>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Presi\u00f3n aplicada:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPresion\">700 bar (70 MPa)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Resistencia roca:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataResistencia\">5 MPa<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Resultado:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataResultado\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\" id=\"dataEficienciaCard\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">EROEI estimado:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEficiencia\">5:1<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"impacto-ambiental\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udf31 IMPACTO AMBIENTAL<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"impacto-item\" id=\"impactoAgua\">\r\n                        <span>Contaminaci\u00f3n agua:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"impacto-value\">Alto riesgo<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"impacto-item\" id=\"impactoSismos\">\r\n                        <span>Sismos inducidos:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"impacto-value\">Magnitud < 3.0<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"impacto-item\" id=\"impactoEmisiones\">\r\n                        <span>Emisiones CH\u2084:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"impacto-value\">3.5% fugas<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- AN\u00c1LISIS DE DATOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"analisis-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span> AN\u00c1LISIS DE DATOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"analisis-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"analisis-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc8 EROEI COMPARATIVO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"grafica-barras\">\r\n                    <div class=\"barra\" style=\"--alto: 90%; --color: #4CAF50;\">\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-valor\">20:1<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-etiqueta\">Petr\u00f3leo convencional<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"barra\" style=\"--alto: 45%; --color: #FF9800;\">\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-valor\">5:1<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-etiqueta\">Fracking (shale gas)<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"barra\" style=\"--alto: 70%; --color: #2196F3;\">\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-valor\">15:1<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-etiqueta\">E\u00f3lica<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"barra\" style=\"--alto: 85%; --color: #4CAF50;\">\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-valor\">18:1<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-etiqueta\">Solar fotovoltaica<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <p><strong>EROEI:<\/strong> Energ\u00eda Retornada sobre Energ\u00eda Invertida<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"analisis-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udca7 CONSUMO DE AGUA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-gigante\">\r\n                    30 <span class=\"unidad\">millones L<\/span>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-descripcion\">por pozo (equivalente a 12 piscinas ol\u00edmpicas)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"comparacion\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comparacion-item\">\r\n                        <span>Petr\u00f3leo convencional:<\/span>\r\n                        <span>0.1\u20130.5 millones L<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comparacion-item\">\r\n                        <span>Fracking:<\/span>\r\n                        <span>30\u201350 millones L<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"analisis-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf0d EMISIONES DE METANO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"grafica-circular\">\r\n                    <svg width=\"150\" height=\"150\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\r\n                        <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"45\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF5722\" stroke-width=\"10\" stroke-dasharray=\"283\" stroke-dashoffset=\"269\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"50\" y=\"50\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dy=\"5\">3.5%<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"50\" y=\"50\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dy=\"20\">fugas<\/text>\r\n                    <\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <p><strong>Potencial de calentamiento:<\/strong> CH\u2084 = 28\u00d7CO\u2082 (100 a\u00f1os)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: FRACKING Y F\u00cdSICA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 principio f\u00edsico explica la fractura de la roca en fracking?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Ley de Hooke\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Primera ley de Newton\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Principio de Pascal\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Ley de Darcy\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> El <strong>Principio de Pascal<\/strong> establece que la presi\u00f3n aplicada a un fluido se transmite igualmente en todas direcciones, permitiendo fracturar la roca.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>La presi\u00f3n hidrost\u00e1tica (\\(P = \\frac{F}{A}\\)) supera la resistencia a la tracci\u00f3n de la roca (\\(\\sigma_t\\)), creando fracturas.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el EROEI t\u00edpico del fracking?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        20:1\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        5:1\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        1:1\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        50:1\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> El fracking tiene un EROEI de <strong>~5:1<\/strong>, mucho menor que el petr\u00f3leo convencional (~20:1).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>Esto significa que por cada <strong>1 unidad de energ\u00eda invertida<\/strong>, se obtienen <strong>5 unidades<\/strong> (vs 20 en convencional).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el principal riesgo ambiental del fracking?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Ruido excesivo\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Contaminaci\u00f3n visual\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Radiaci\u00f3n electromagn\u00e9tica\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Contaminaci\u00f3n de acu\u00edferos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> La <strong>contaminaci\u00f3n de acu\u00edferos<\/strong> por metano y qu\u00edmicos es el riesgo m\u00e1s documentado.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>Estudios (ej: <em>PNAS, 2016<\/em>) vinculan fracking con <strong>metano en agua potable<\/strong> en zonas cercanas a pozos.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-results\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfc6 RESULTADOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                    Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                    Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">REINTENTAR<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- DEBATE Y SOSTENIBILIDAD -->\r\n    <section class=\"debate-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/span> DEBATE: \u00bfES SOSTENIBLE EL FRACKING?\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"debate-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"argumento-card pro\">\r\n                <div class=\"argumento-header\">\u2705 A FAVOR<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"argumento-body\">\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Independencia energ\u00e9tica:<\/strong> Reduce dependencia de importaciones (ej: EE.UU. exportador neto desde 2019).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Empleo:<\/strong> +2 millones de empleos en sector (API, 2023).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Transici\u00f3n:<\/strong> \"Puente\" hacia energ\u00edas renovables (argumento controvertido).<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"argumento-card contra\">\r\n                <div class=\"argumento-header\">\u274c EN CONTRA<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"argumento-body\">\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Contaminaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> +1,000 casos documentados de agua contaminada (EPA, 2022).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Cambio clim\u00e1tico:<\/strong> Fugas de metano (CH\u2084) con potencial de calentamiento 28\u00d7 > CO\u2082.<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Sismos:<\/strong> Aumento de sismos inducidos en Oklahoma, Texas (USGS).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>EROEI bajo:<\/strong> 5:1 vs 20:1 de convencional o 15:1 de renovables.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"conclusiones\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca CONCLUSI\u00d3N CIENT\u00cdFICA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"conclusiones-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"conclusiones-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"conclusiones-titulo\">\ud83c\udf31 IMPACTO AMBIENTAL<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"conclusiones-valor alto\">ALTO<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"conclusiones-detalle\">Contaminaci\u00f3n agua, aire y suelo<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"conclusiones-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"conclusiones-titulo\">\ud83d\udcb0 VIABILIDAD ECON\u00d3MICA<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"conclusiones-valor medio\">MEDIO-ALTO<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"conclusiones-detalle\">Depende de precios del petr\u00f3leo<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"conclusiones-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"conclusiones-titulo\">\u26a1 EFICIENCIA ENERG\u00c9TICA<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"conclusiones-valor bajo\">BAJO (5:1)<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"conclusiones-detalle\">EROEI inferior a renovables<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"conclusiones-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"conclusiones-titulo\">\ud83d\udcc8 FUTURO<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"conclusiones-valor declive\">EN DECLIVE<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"conclusiones-detalle\">Prohibiciones crecientes (UE, M\u00e9xico)<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>C\u00e1lculo de Presi\u00f3n en Fracking<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un pozo de fracking inyecta fluido con una fuerza de <strong>14,000 N<\/strong> en un \u00e1rea de <strong>0.02 m\u00b2<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Calcula la presi\u00f3n de inyecci\u00f3n en Pascales y bar.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Si la resistencia a la tracci\u00f3n de la roca es <strong>6 MPa<\/strong>, \u00bfse fracturar\u00e1?<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 porcentaje de la presi\u00f3n aplicada supera la resistencia de la roca?<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        P = \\frac{F}{A} \\quad \\text{y} \\quad 1\\,\\text{bar} = 10^5\\,\\text{Pa}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n paso a paso...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. \\(P = \\frac{14,000\\,\\text{N}}{0.02\\,\\text{m}^2} = 700,000\\,\\text{Pa} = 7\\,\\text{bar}\\)<br>\r\n                    \\(700,000\\,\\text{Pa} = 700\\,\\text{bar}\\) (correcci\u00f3n: 700,000 Pa = 7 bar)<br><br>\r\n                    2. <strong>S\u00ed se fracturar\u00e1<\/strong>, porque \\(70\\,\\text{MPa} > 6\\,\\text{MPa}\\).<br><br>\r\n                    3. \\(\\frac{70 - 6}{6} \\times 100\\% = 1,066\\%\\) (supera en 10.66\u00d7)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>An\u00e1lisis de Sostenibilidad<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Comparar el fracking con la energ\u00eda e\u00f3lica en t\u00e9rminos de:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li><strong>EROEI<\/strong> (5:1 vs 15:1).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Emisiones de CO\u2082eq<\/strong> (400 g\/kWh vs 12 g\/kWh).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Uso de agua<\/strong> (30 millones L\/pozo vs 0 L\/turbina).<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>\u00bfQu\u00e9 fuente es m\u00e1s sostenible seg\u00fan estos criterios? Justifica con datos.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu an\u00e1lisis comparativo...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    <strong>La energ\u00eda e\u00f3lica es m\u00e1s sostenible<\/strong> en los 3 criterios:<br><br>\r\n                    1. <strong>EROEI:<\/strong> 15:1 (e\u00f3lica) > 5:1 (fracking) \u2192 Mayor retorno energ\u00e9tico.<br>\r\n                    2. <strong>Emisiones:<\/strong> 12 g\/kWh (e\u00f3lica) \u226a 400 g\/kWh (fracking) \u2192 Menor huella de carbono.<br>\r\n                    3. <strong>Agua:<\/strong> 0 L (e\u00f3lica) vs 30 millones L (fracking) \u2192 Sin impacto h\u00eddrico.<br><br>\r\n                    <strong>Conclusi\u00f3n:<\/strong> El fracking tiene mayores impactos ambientales y menor eficiencia energ\u00e9tica que las renovables.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (3 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (2 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (1 pt)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>C\u00e1lculos correctos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Todas las operaciones y conversiones de unidades<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Error en 1 c\u00e1lculo o unidad<\/td>\r\n                    <td>M\u00faltiples errores<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis comparativo<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Comparaci\u00f3n detallada con datos cuantitativos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis parcial o cualitativo<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Sin comparaci\u00f3n clara<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Justificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Argumentos basados en evidencia cient\u00edfica<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Justificaci\u00f3n gen\u00e9rica<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Sin justificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <header class=\"cierre-header\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n                <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n            <\/h2>\r\n            <p>Actualiza tu autoevaluaci\u00f3n, registra tu reflexi\u00f3n y construye un plan de mejora con evidencia cient\u00edfica.<\/p>\r\n        <\/header>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-grid\">\r\n            <article class=\"cierre-card card-autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"form-row\">\r\n                    <label for=\"autoSlider1\">F\u00edsica del fracking<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"autoSlider1\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" oninput=\"updateAutoOutput(this, 'autoVal1')\">\r\n                    <output id=\"autoVal1\">3<\/output>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"form-row\">\r\n                    <label for=\"autoSlider2\">Impactos ambientales<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"autoSlider2\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" oninput=\"updateAutoOutput(this, 'autoVal2')\">\r\n                    <output id=\"autoVal2\">3<\/output>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"form-row\">\r\n                    <label for=\"autoSlider3\">An\u00e1lisis cr\u00edtico<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"autoSlider3\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" oninput=\"updateAutoOutput(this, 'autoVal3')\">\r\n                    <output id=\"autoVal3\">3<\/output>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarCierreAutoevaluacion()\">\ud83d\udcbe Guardar autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                <div id=\"autoEvalMsg\" class=\"info-msg\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/article>\r\n\r\n            <article class=\"cierre-card card-reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad Reflexi\u00f3n cr\u00edtica<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Redacta una conclusi\u00f3n breve con 2 o 3 acciones concretas basadas en los resultados del simulador.<\/p>\r\n                <textarea id=\"reflexionText\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n ...\" aria-label=\"Reflexi\u00f3n cr\u00edtica\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-accion\" onclick=\"guardarCierreReflexion()\">\ud83d\udcbe Guardar reflexi\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                <div id=\"reflexMsg\" class=\"info-msg\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/article>\r\n\r\n            <article class=\"cierre-card card-plan\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 Plan de estudio<\/h3>\r\n                <ul class=\"todo-list\">\r\n                    <li><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"plan1\"> Revisar c\u00e1lculo de presi\u00f3n y conversi\u00f3n de unidades<\/label><\/li>\r\n                    <li><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"plan2\"> Analizar 2 casos reales de contaminaci\u00f3n por fracking<\/label><\/li>\r\n                    <li><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"plan3\"> Comparar EROEI con energ\u00edas renovables<\/label><\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-accion\" onclick=\"guardarCierrePlan()\">\ud83d\udcbe Guardar plan<\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-accion\" onclick=\"restaurarCierrePlan()\" style=\"margin-left:0.5rem;\">\u21ba Restaurar<\/button>\r\n                <div id=\"planMsg\" class=\"info-msg\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/article>\r\n\r\n            <article class=\"cierre-card card-recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 Recursos recomendados<\/h3>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.eia.gov\/energyexplained\/oil-and-petroleum-products\/hydraulic-fracturing.php\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">EIA: Fracturaci\u00f3n hidr\u00e1ulica<\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.sciencedirect.com\/topics\/earth-and-planetary-sciences\/hydraulic-fracturing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">ScienceDirect: impactos y riesgos<\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.epa.gov\/hf\/study-hydraulic-fracturing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">EPA: Estudio de aguas subterr\u00e1neas<\/a>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-accion\" onclick=\"generarResumenCierre()\">\ud83d\udcdd Generar resumen r\u00e1pido<\/button>\r\n                <div id=\"recursosMsg\" class=\"info-msg\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/article>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ BASE DE DATOS DE PAR\u00c1METROS DE FRACKING\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nconst parametrosFracking = {\r\n    presionMin: 100,    \/\/ bar\r\n    presionMax: 1000,   \/\/ bar\r\n    resistenciaMin: 1,  \/\/ MPa\r\n    resistenciaMax: 20, \/\/ MPa\r\n    profundidadMin: 0.5, \/\/ km\r\n    profundidadMax: 5,  \/\/ km\r\n    eroei: {\r\n        convencional: 20,\r\n        fracking: 5,\r\n        eolica: 15,\r\n        solar: 18\r\n    },\r\n    impactoAmbiental: {\r\n        agua: \"Alto riesgo (30M L\/pozo)\",\r\n        sismos: \"Magnitud < 3.0 (inducidos)\",\r\n        emisiones: \"3.5% fugas de CH\u2084\"\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DE FRACKING\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nfunction simularFracking() {\r\n    \/\/ Obtener valores de controles\r\n    const presionBar = parseInt(document.getElementById('presionInyeccion').value);\r\n    const resistenciaMPa = parseFloat(document.getElementById('resistenciaRoca').value);\r\n    const profundidadKm = parseFloat(document.getElementById('profundidadPozo').value);\r\n    const incluirQuimicos = document.getElementById('incluirQuimicos').checked;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Convertir unidades\r\n    const presionPa = presionBar * 100000; \/\/ 1 bar = 100,000 Pa\r\n    const presionMPa = presionPa \/ 1000000; \/\/ MPa\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n    document.getElementById('presionValue').textContent = `${presionBar} bar (${presionMPa.toFixed(1)} MPa)`;\r\n    document.getElementById('resistenciaValue').textContent = `${resistenciaMPa} MPa`;\r\n    document.getElementById('profundidadValue').textContent = `${profundidadKm} km`;\r\n    document.getElementById('svgProfundidad').textContent = `${profundidadKm * 1000} m`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ L\u00f3gica de simulaci\u00f3n\r\n    let resultado;\r\n    let fracturado = false;\r\n    let eficiencia = 5; \/\/ EROEI base\r\n\r\n    if (presionMPa > resistenciaMPa) {\r\n        resultado = \"\u2705 Fractura exitosa: La presi\u00f3n supera la resistencia de la roca.\";\r\n        fracturado = true;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Generar fracturas visuales\r\n        generarFracturas(fracturado);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Calcular eficiencia (simplificado)\r\n        if (presionMPa > resistenciaMPa * 1.5) {\r\n            eficiencia = 6; \/\/ Mayor presi\u00f3n \u2192 mejor flujo\r\n        } else if (presionMPa < resistenciaMPa * 1.2) {\r\n            eficiencia = 4; \/\/ Presi\u00f3n justa \u2192 menor flujo\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Generar flujo de hidrocarburos\r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            generarHidrocarburos(fracturado);\r\n        }, 1000);\r\n    } else {\r\n        resultado = \"\u274c Fracaso: La presi\u00f3n no supera la resistencia de la roca.\";\r\n        generarFracturas(fracturado);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar resultados\r\n    document.getElementById('dataPresion').textContent = `${presionBar} bar (${presionMPa.toFixed(1)} MPa)`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataResistencia').textContent = `${resistenciaMPa} MPa`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataResultado').textContent = resultado;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEficiencia').textContent = `${eficiencia}:1`;\r\n    document.getElementById('leyendaPresion').textContent = `Presi\u00f3n: ${presionMPa.toFixed(1)} MPa`;\r\n    document.getElementById('leyendaResistencia').textContent = `Resistencia roca: ${resistenciaMPa} MPa`;\r\n    document.getElementById('leyendaResultado').textContent = resultado;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Impacto ambiental (simplificado)\r\n    document.getElementById('impactoAgua').querySelector('.impacto-value').textContent =\r\n        incluirQuimicos ? \"Alto riesgo\" : \"Riesgo moderado\";\r\n    document.getElementById('impactoSismos').querySelector('.impacto-value').textContent =\r\n        fracturado ? \"Magnitud < 3.0\" : \"Sin sismos\";\r\n    document.getElementById('impactoEmisiones').querySelector('.impacto-value').textContent =\r\n        fracturado ? \"3.5% fugas\" : \"0%\";\r\n\r\n    console.log(`\ud83d\udd2c Simulaci\u00f3n: ${resultado}`);\r\n    console.log(`   Presi\u00f3n: ${presionMPa.toFixed(1)} MPa`);\r\n    console.log(`   Resistencia roca: ${resistenciaMPa} MPa`);\r\n    console.log(`   EROEI estimado: ${eficiencia}:1`);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction generarFracturas(fracturado) {\r\n    const fracturasGroup = document.getElementById('fracturasGroup');\r\n    fracturasGroup.innerHTML = ''; \/\/ Limpiar fracturas anteriores\r\n\r\n    if (fracturado) {\r\n        \/\/ Generar 3 fracturas aleatorias\r\n        for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\r\n            const angulo = Math.random() * 60 - 30; \/\/ \u00b130\u00b0 desde horizontal\r\n            const longitud = 80 + Math.random() * 40; \/\/ 80-120 px\r\n            const x1 = 300;\r\n            const y1 = 200;\r\n            const x2 = x1 + longitud * Math.cos(angulo * Math.PI \/ 180);\r\n            const y2 = y1 + longitud * Math.sin(angulo * Math.PI \/ 180);\r\n\r\n            const linea = document.createElementNS(\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\", \"line\");\r\n            linea.setAttribute(\"x1\", x1);\r\n            linea.setAttribute(\"y1\", y1);\r\n            linea.setAttribute(\"x2\", x2);\r\n            linea.setAttribute(\"y2\", y2);\r\n            linea.setAttribute(\"stroke\", \"#D32F2F\");\r\n            linea.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"3\");\r\n            linea.setAttribute(\"stroke-dasharray\", \"5,3\");\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de fractura\r\n            const anim = document.createElementNS(\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\", \"animate\");\r\n            anim.setAttribute(\"attributeName\", \"stroke-dashoffset\");\r\n            anim.setAttribute(\"values\", \"0;-8\");\r\n            anim.setAttribute(\"dur\", \"0.5s\");\r\n            anim.setAttribute(\"repeatCount\", \"indefinite\");\r\n            linea.appendChild(anim);\r\n\r\n            fracturasGroup.appendChild(linea);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Texto de fractura\r\n        const texto = document.createElementNS(\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\", \"text\");\r\n        texto.setAttribute(\"x\", \"300\");\r\n        texto.setAttribute(\"y\", \"250\");\r\n        texto.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"#FF5252\");\r\n        texto.setAttribute(\"font-size\", \"14\");\r\n        texto.setAttribute(\"text-anchor\", \"middle\");\r\n        texto.textContent = \"Fracturas generadas\";\r\n        fracturasGroup.appendChild(texto);\r\n    } else {\r\n        const texto = document.createElementNS(\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\", \"text\");\r\n        texto.setAttribute(\"x\", \"300\");\r\n        texto.setAttribute(\"y\", \"250\");\r\n        texto.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"#FF9800\");\r\n        texto.setAttribute(\"font-size\", \"14\");\r\n        texto.setAttribute(\"text-anchor\", \"middle\");\r\n        texto.textContent = \"Presi\u00f3n insuficiente\";\r\n        fracturasGroup.appendChild(texto);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction generarHidrocarburos(fracturado) {\r\n    if (!fracturado) return;\r\n\r\n    const hidrocarburosGroup = document.getElementById('hidrocarburosGroup');\r\n    hidrocarburosGroup.innerHTML = ''; \/\/ Limpiar\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Generar 5 burbujas de gas\r\n    for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\r\n        const burbuja = document.createElementNS(\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\", \"circle\");\r\n        const x = 300 + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 100;\r\n        const y = 200;\r\n        const radio = 5 + Math.random() * 10;\r\n\r\n        burbuja.setAttribute(\"cx\", x);\r\n        burbuja.setAttribute(\"cy\", y);\r\n        burbuja.setAttribute(\"r\", radio);\r\n        burbuja.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"#FFEB3B\");\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de ascenso\r\n        const anim = document.createElementNS(\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\", \"animate\");\r\n        anim.setAttribute(\"attributeName\", \"cy\");\r\n        anim.setAttribute(\"from\", y);\r\n        anim.setAttribute(\"to\", 50);\r\n        anim.setAttribute(\"dur\", \"2s\");\r\n        anim.setAttribute(\"begin\", `${i * 0.3}s`);\r\n        anim.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"freeze\");\r\n        burbuja.appendChild(anim);\r\n\r\n        hidrocarburosGroup.appendChild(burbuja);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Texto de flujo\r\n    const texto = document.createElementNS(\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\", \"text\");\r\n    texto.setAttribute(\"x\", \"300\");\r\n    texto.setAttribute(\"y\", \"100\");\r\n    texto.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"#FFC107\");\r\n    texto.setAttribute(\"font-size\", \"14\");\r\n    texto.setAttribute(\"text-anchor\", \"middle\");\r\n    texto.textContent = \"Flujo de gas natural \u2191\";\r\n    hidrocarburosGroup.appendChild(texto);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarSimulacion() {\r\n    \/\/ Restaurar controles\r\n    document.getElementById('presionInyeccion').value = 700;\r\n    document.getElementById('resistenciaRoca').value = 5;\r\n    document.getElementById('profundidadPozo').value = 2;\r\n    document.getElementById('incluirQuimicos').checked = true;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar textos\r\n    document.getElementById('presionValue').textContent = \"700 bar\";\r\n    document.getElementById('resistenciaValue').textContent = \"5 MPa\";\r\n    document.getElementById('profundidadValue').textContent = \"2 km\";\r\n    document.getElementById('svgProfundidad').textContent = \"2000 m\";\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Limpiar SVG\r\n    document.getElementById('fluidoInyeccion').setAttribute('r', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('fracturasGroup').innerHTML = '';\r\n    document.getElementById('hidrocarburosGroup').innerHTML = '';\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Restaurar datos\r\n    document.getElementById('dataPresion').textContent = \"700 bar (70 MPa)\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataResistencia').textContent = \"5 MPa\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataResultado').textContent = \"-\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEficiencia').textContent = \"5:1\";\r\n    document.getElementById('leyendaPresion').textContent = \"Presi\u00f3n: 0 MPa\";\r\n    document.getElementById('leyendaResistencia').textContent = \"Resistencia roca: 5 MPa\";\r\n    document.getElementById('leyendaResultado').textContent = \"Estado: Listo para simular\";\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Impacto ambiental\r\n    document.getElementById('impactoAgua').querySelector('.impacto-value').textContent = \"Alto riesgo\";\r\n    document.getElementById('impactoSismos').querySelector('.impacto-value').textContent = \"Magnitud < 3.0\";\r\n    document.getElementById('impactoEmisiones').querySelector('.impacto-value').textContent = \"3.5% fugas\";\r\n\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\udd04 Simulaci\u00f3n reiniciada\");\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas respondidas\r\n        const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n\r\n        if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n    let feedback;\r\n    if (correctas === total) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83c\udf1f Excelente! Dominas los conceptos f\u00edsicos y ambientales del fracking.\";\r\n    } else if (correctas >= total\/2) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Bueno. Revisa el principio de Pascal y los impactos ambientales.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas repasar. Enf\u00f3cate en la f\u00edsica de la presi\u00f3n y el EROEI.\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = \"0\/3\";\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = \"Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\";\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    if (solucion.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'none';\r\n    } else {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n\r\n    let mensaje = `\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n`;\r\n    mensaje += `F\u00edsica del fracking: ${slider1}\/5\\n`;\r\n    mensaje += `Impactos ambientales: ${slider2}\/5\\n`;\r\n    mensaje += `An\u00e1lisis cr\u00edtico: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n`;\r\n    mensaje += `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n`;\r\n\r\n    if (promedio >= 4) {\r\n        mensaje += \"\ud83c\udf1f Excelente comprensi\u00f3n! Puedes analizar cr\u00edticamente el fracking.\";\r\n    } else if (promedio >= 3) {\r\n        mensaje += \"\ud83d\udc4d Bueno, pero profundiza en los impactos ambientales y alternativas.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        mensaje += \"\ud83d\udcda Revisa los fundamentos f\u00edsicos y datos de sostenibilidad.\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    alert(mensaje);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ CIERRE METACOGNITIVO EXTENDIDO\r\n\r\nfunction updateAutoOutput(control, outputId) {\r\n    const output = document.getElementById(outputId);\r\n    if (output) output.textContent = control.value;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction guardarCierreAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const v1 = parseInt(document.getElementById('autoSlider1').value, 10);\r\n    const v2 = parseInt(document.getElementById('autoSlider2').value, 10);\r\n    const v3 = parseInt(document.getElementById('autoSlider3').value, 10);\r\n    const promedio = ((v1 + v2 + v3) \/ 3).toFixed(1);\r\n\r\n    const data = {\r\n        v1, v2, v3,\r\n        promedio: Number(promedio),\r\n        fecha: new Date().toLocaleString()\r\n    };\r\n    localStorage.setItem('fracking_cierre_autoevaluacion', JSON.stringify(data));\r\n\r\n    const msg = document.getElementById('autoEvalMsg');\r\n    if (msg) msg.textContent = `\u2705 Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada (${data.fecha}). Promedio ${data.promedio}\/5`;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction guardarCierreReflexion() {\r\n    const texto = document.getElementById('reflexionText').value.trim();\r\n    const msg = document.getElementById('reflexMsg');\r\n\r\n    if (!texto) {\r\n        if (msg) msg.textContent = '\u26a0\ufe0f La reflexi\u00f3n no puede estar vac\u00eda.';\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    localStorage.setItem('fracking_cierre_reflexion', JSON.stringify({texto, fecha: new Date().toLocaleString()}));\r\n    if (msg) msg.textContent = '\u2705 Reflexi\u00f3n guardada. Gran an\u00e1lisis.';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction guardarCierrePlan() {\r\n    const plan = {\r\n        repaso: document.getElementById('plan1').checked,\r\n        analisis: document.getElementById('plan2').checked,\r\n        debate: document.getElementById('plan3').checked,\r\n        fecha: new Date().toLocaleString()\r\n    };\r\n    localStorage.setItem('fracking_cierre_plan', JSON.stringify(plan));\r\n\r\n    const msg = document.getElementById('planMsg');\r\n    if (msg) msg.textContent = '\u2705 Plan de estudio guardado.';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction restaurarCierrePlan() {\r\n    const plan = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('fracking_cierre_plan') || '{}');\r\n    if (plan.repaso !== undefined) document.getElementById('plan1').checked = plan.repaso;\r\n    if (plan.analisis !== undefined) document.getElementById('plan2').checked = plan.analisis;\r\n    if (plan.debate !== undefined) document.getElementById('plan3').checked = plan.debate;\r\n\r\n    const msg = document.getElementById('planMsg');\r\n    if (msg) msg.textContent = '\u267b\ufe0f Plan de estudio restaurado (desde \u00faltimo guardado).';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction generarResumenCierre() {\r\n    const auto = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('fracking_cierre_autoevaluacion') || '{}');\r\n    const reflex = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('fracking_cierre_reflexion') || '{}');\r\n    const plan = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('fracking_cierre_plan') || '{}');\r\n\r\n    const lines = [\r\n        '--- Resumen metacognitivo ---',\r\n        `Autovaloraci\u00f3n: ${auto.promedio || 'No guardado'} \/ 5`,\r\n        `Reflexi\u00f3n: ${reflex.texto ? reflex.texto.slice(0, 80) + (reflex.texto.length > 80 ? '...' : '') : 'No existente'}`,\r\n        `Plan cumplido: ${plan.repaso ? 'Repaso' : ''}${plan.analisis ? ', An\u00e1lisis' : ''}${plan.debate ? ', Debate' : ''}`,\r\n        '---',\r\n        'Comparar tu plan con tus resultados del simulador para cerrar el ciclo de aprendizaje.'\r\n    ];\r\n\r\n    alert(lines.join('\\n'));\r\n    const msg = document.getElementById('recursosMsg');\r\n    if (msg) msg.textContent = '\ud83d\udccc Resumen generado (ver consola\/alert).';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction cargarCierreMetacognitivo() {\r\n    const auto = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('fracking_cierre_autoevaluacion') || '{}');\r\n    if (auto.v1 !== undefined) {\r\n        document.getElementById('autoSlider1').value = auto.v1;\r\n        document.getElementById('autoVal1').textContent = auto.v1;\r\n    }\r\n    if (auto.v2 !== undefined) {\r\n        document.getElementById('autoSlider2').value = auto.v2;\r\n        document.getElementById('autoVal2').textContent = auto.v2;\r\n    }\r\n    if (auto.v3 !== undefined) {\r\n        document.getElementById('autoSlider3').value = auto.v3;\r\n        document.getElementById('autoVal3').textContent = auto.v3;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    const reflex = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('fracking_cierre_reflexion') || '{}');\r\n    if (reflex.texto) document.getElementById('reflexionText').value = reflex.texto;\r\n\r\n    const plan = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('fracking_cierre_plan') || '{}');\r\n    if (plan.repaso !== undefined) document.getElementById('plan1').checked = plan.repaso;\r\n    if (plan.analisis !== undefined) document.getElementById('plan2').checked = plan.analisis;\r\n    if (plan.debate !== undefined) document.getElementById('plan3').checked = plan.debate;\r\n\r\n    const autoMsg = document.getElementById('autoEvalMsg');\r\n    if (autoMsg && auto.fecha) autoMsg.textContent = `\u21ba Cargada autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada ${auto.fecha}`;\r\n    const reflexMsg = document.getElementById('reflexMsg');\r\n    if (reflexMsg && reflex.fecha) reflexMsg.textContent = `\u21ba Reflexi\u00f3n guardada ${reflex.fecha}`;\r\n    const planMsg = document.getElementById('planMsg');\r\n    if (planMsg && plan.fecha) planMsg.textContent = `\u21ba Plan guardado ${plan.fecha}`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\udee2\ufe0f Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: Fracking inicializada\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\udd2c Simulador de presi\u00f3n y fractura listo\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\u2753 Quiz con 3 preguntas sobre f\u00edsica y sostenibilidad\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\udcca An\u00e1lisis comparativo de EROEI y impactos\");\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar simulador\r\nreiniciarSimulacion();\r\n\/\/ Inicializar cierre metacognitivo con datos locales\r\ncargarCierreMetacognitivo();\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Fracking extrae de...","respuesta":"Esquisto (shale)"},{"enunciado":"Fluido principal","respuesta":"Agua + arena + qu\u00edmicos"},{"enunciado":"Presi\u00f3n t\u00edpica","respuesta":"~700 bar"},{"enunciado":"EROEI fracking vs petr\u00f3leo convencional","respuesta":"5:1 vs 20:1"},{"enunciado":"Agua por pozo","respuesta":"~30 millones L"},{"enunciado":"Riesgo s\u00edsmico","respuesta":"Sismos inducidos < 3.0"},{"enunciado":"Contaminante principal","respuesta":"Metano (CH\u2084)"},{"enunciado":"M\u00e9xico 2024","respuesta":"Fracking prohibido"},{"enunciado":"Qu\u00edmicos en fluido","respuesta":"~0.5%"},{"enunciado":"Ley f\u00edsica clave","respuesta":"Pascal (presi\u00f3n hidrost\u00e1tica)"},{"enunciado":"Permeabilidad post-fractura","respuesta":"Aumenta (Darcy)"},{"enunciado":"Eficiencia energ\u00e9tica global","respuesta":"~30% (qu\u00edmica \u2192 el\u00e9ctrica)"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Fracking es...","opciones":["Fracturaci\u00f3n hidr\u00e1ulica","Perforaci\u00f3n","Combusti\u00f3n","Fusi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Fracturaci\u00f3n hidr\u00e1ulica"},{"pregunta":"Extrae de...","opciones":["Esquisto","Carb\u00f3n","Arena","Agua"],"correcta":"Esquisto"},{"pregunta":"Fluido contiene...","opciones":["Agua + qu\u00edmicos","Solo agua","Aire","Gasolina"],"correcta":"Agua + qu\u00edmicos"},{"pregunta":"Presi\u00f3n ~...","opciones":["700 bar","1 bar","10 bar","1000 bar"],"correcta":"700 bar"},{"pregunta":"Riesgo principal","opciones":["Contaminaci\u00f3n agua","Calor","Ruido","Luz"],"correcta":"Contaminaci\u00f3n agua"},{"pregunta":"Proppant es...","opciones":["Arena","Agua","Qu\u00edmico","Gas"],"correcta":"Arena"},{"pregunta":"EE.UU. aument\u00f3...","opciones":["Producci\u00f3n gas","Consumo agua","Nada","Solar"],"correcta":"Producci\u00f3n gas"},{"pregunta":"Sismos por fracking...","opciones":["Inducidos","Naturales","Volc\u00e1nicos","Ninguno"],"correcta":"Inducidos"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico 2024...","opciones":["Prohibido","Permitido","Obligatorio","Desconocido"],"correcta":"Prohibido"},{"pregunta":"EROEI ~...","opciones":["5:1","1:1","20:1","100:1"],"correcta":"5:1"},{"pregunta":"Agua por pozo ~...","opciones":["30 millones L","1 mill\u00f3n L","100 L","1 bill\u00f3n L"],"correcta":"30 millones L"},{"pregunta":"% qu\u00edmicos","opciones":["0.5%","50%","10%","90%"],"correcta":"0.5%"},{"pregunta":"Metano es...","opciones":["GHG potente","Inerte","Refrigerante","Combustible limpio"],"correcta":"GHG potente"},{"pregunta":"Pozo horizontal hasta...","opciones":["3 km","100 m","10 km","1 cm"],"correcta":"3 km"},{"pregunta":"Ley de Pascal aplica en...","opciones":["Transmisi\u00f3n presi\u00f3n","Velocidad","Masa","Color"],"correcta":"Transmisi\u00f3n presi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Permeabilidad mide...","opciones":["Flujo fluido","Dureza","Color","Olor"],"correcta":"Flujo fluido"},{"pregunta":"Eficiencia qu\u00edmica \u2192 el\u00e9ctrica","opciones":["~30%","90%","5%","100%"],"correcta":"~30%"},{"pregunta":"Sismo t\u00edpico fracking","opciones":["< 3.0","> 5.0","= 0","> 7.0"],"correcta":"< 3.0"},{"pregunta":"Prohibido en...","opciones":["Francia, M\u00e9xico","EE.UU.","China","Rusia"],"correcta":"Francia, M\u00e9xico"},{"pregunta":"Unidad presi\u00f3n SI","opciones":["Pascal","Bar","Atm","Psi"],"correcta":"Pascal"},{"pregunta":"M\u00f3dulo Young roca esquisto ~...","opciones":["30 GPa","1 GPa","100 GPa","1 MPa"],"correcta":"30 GPa"},{"pregunta":"Fuga metano % producci\u00f3n","opciones":["1-5%","0%","50%","100%"],"correcta":"1-5%"},{"pregunta":"Tratamiento agua residual","opciones":["Re-inyecci\u00f3n","Evaporaci\u00f3n","Beber","Nada"],"correcta":"Re-inyecci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda para bombear fluido","opciones":["~10% total","50%","0%","100%"],"correcta":"~10% total"},{"pregunta":"Declinaci\u00f3n pozo","opciones":["60% primer a\u00f1o","10%","0%","100%"],"correcta":"60% primer a\u00f1o"},{"pregunta":"Alternativa renovable","opciones":["Geot\u00e9rmica","Fracking","Carb\u00f3n","Nuclear"],"correcta":"Geot\u00e9rmica"},{"pregunta":"CO\u2082 equivalente metano (100 a\u00f1os)","opciones":["25\u00d7","1\u00d7","100\u00d7","0\u00d7"],"correcta":"25\u00d7"},{"pregunta":"Ley Darcy: Q =","opciones":["-kA\u0394P\/\u03bcL","F=ma","PV=nRT","E=mc\u00b2"],"correcta":"-kA\u0394P\/\u03bcL"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: reforma 2024","opciones":["Prohibici\u00f3n total","Permiso parcial","Obligatorio","Sin cambio"],"correcta":"Prohibici\u00f3n total"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: 1 bar =","opciones":["10\u2075 Pa","1 Pa","10\u2076 Pa","1 atm"],"correcta":"10\u2075 Pa"}]},{"materia":"F\u00edsica I","slug":"joule-cyberpunk","titulo":"Joule: De la Mec\u00e1nica al Calor","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-fisica-joule\" data-tema=\"unidad-joule\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n            JOULE: LA MONEDA DE LA ENERG\u00cdA\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Trabajo, Energ\u00eda y la Equivalencia Mec\u00e1nica del Calor\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Definir el joule como unidad SI<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Comprender su relaci\u00f3n con Newton, metro y vatio<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar en f\u00f3rmulas de trabajo y energ\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Calcular \\(W = F \\cdot d\\), \\(E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\), \\(E_p = mgh\\)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Explicar el experimento de Joule<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Equivalencia mec\u00e1nica del calor (4.186 J\/cal)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Convertir entre unidades de energ\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Joule, calor\u00eda, electronvoltio, kilowatt-hora<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACIONES EN LA VIDA REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udca1 ENERG\u00cdA EL\u00c9CTRICA<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Un foco LED de <strong>10 W<\/strong> encendido 1 hora consume:<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    E = P \\times t = 10\\,\\text{W} \\times 3600\\,\\text{s} = 36,000\\,\\text{J}\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Equivalente a levantar 360 kg a 10 m<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfcb\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f TRABAJO HUMANO<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Una persona de <strong>70 kg<\/strong> subiendo 3 m realiza:<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    W = mgh = 70 \\times 9.8 \\times 3 = 2,058\\,\\text{J}\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Equivalente a 0.5 kcal (alimentos)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd0b BATER\u00cdAS<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Una bater\u00eda AA (1.5 V, 2000 mAh) almacena:<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    E = V \\times Q = 1.5 \\times 2 \\times 3600 = 10,800\\,\\text{J}\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Suficiente para 3 horas de LED<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- DEFINICI\u00d3N Y DIMENSIONES -->\r\n    <section class=\"definicion-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcd0<\/span> DEFINICI\u00d3N Y DIMENSIONES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"definicion-dual\">\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd39 DEFINICI\u00d3N FORMAL<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-grand\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    1\\,\\text{J} = 1\\,\\text{N} \\cdot \\text{m} = 1\\,\\text{kg} \\cdot \\text{m}^2 \\cdot \\text{s}^{-2}\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <p>Unidad SI de <strong>energ\u00eda<\/strong>, <strong>trabajo<\/strong> y <strong>calor<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"autor-destacado\">\r\n                    <strong>James Prescott Joule<\/strong> (1818\u20131889)<br>\r\n                    <small>F\u00edsico brit\u00e1nico, pionero en termodin\u00e1mica<\/small>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"dimensiones-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udccf EQUIVALENCIAS<\/h3>\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-equivalencias\">\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr><td><strong>1 J<\/strong><\/td><td>= 1 N\u00b7m<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td><strong>1 J<\/strong><\/td><td>= 1 W\u00b7s<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td><strong>1 J<\/strong><\/td><td>= 0.239 cal<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td><strong>1 J<\/strong><\/td><td>= 6.24 \u00d7 10\u00b9\u2078 eV<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td><strong>1 kWh<\/strong><\/td><td>= 3.6 \u00d7 10\u2076 J<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td><strong>1 cal<\/strong><\/td><td>= 4.186 J<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n                <div class=\"nota-bipm\">\r\n                    <small>Definici\u00f3n oficial SI (2025):<br>\r\n                    Basada en constantes fundamentales (h, c, \u0394\u03bdCs)<\/small>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- APLICACIONES F\u00cdSICAS -->\r\n    <section class=\"aplicaciones-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd27<\/span> APLICACIONES F\u00cdSICAS DEL JOULE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"aplicaciones-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"aplicacion-card\" data-tipo=\"trabajo\">\r\n                <div class=\"aplicacion-icon\">\ud83c\udfcb\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                <h4>TRABAJO MEC\u00c1NICO<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    W = F \\cdot d \\cdot \\cos\\theta\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-mini\">\r\n                    <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Empujar un mueble 5 m con 20 N<br>\r\n                    \\(W = 20 \\times 5 = 100\\,\\text{J}\\)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"aplicacion-card\" data-tipo=\"cinetica\">\r\n                <div class=\"aplicacion-icon\">\ud83d\ude80<\/div>\r\n                <h4>ENERG\u00cdA CIN\u00c9TICA<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-mini\">\r\n                    <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Auto de 1000 kg a 20 m\/s<br>\r\n                    \\(E_k = 0.5 \\times 1000 \\times 400 = 200,000\\,\\text{J}\\)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"aplicacion-card\" data-tipo=\"potencial\">\r\n                <div class=\"aplicacion-icon\">\ud83d\uddfc<\/div>\r\n                <h4>ENERG\u00cdA POTENCIAL<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    E_p = mgh\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-mini\">\r\n                    <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Libro de 0.5 kg a 1.5 m<br>\r\n                    \\(E_p = 0.5 \\times 9.8 \\times 1.5 = 7.35\\,\\text{J}\\)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"aplicacion-card\" data-tipo=\"calor\">\r\n                <div class=\"aplicacion-icon\">\ud83d\udd25<\/div>\r\n                <h4>CALOR (TERMODIN\u00c1MICA)<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    Q = mc\\Delta T\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-mini\">\r\n                    <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Calentar 1 kg de agua 1\u00b0C<br>\r\n                    \\(Q = 1 \\times 4186 \\times 1 = 4,186\\,\\text{J}\\)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- EXPERIMENTO DE JOULE -->\r\n    <section class=\"experimento-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/span> EXPERIMENTO DE JOULE (1843)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"experimento-dual\">\r\n            <div class=\"experimento-desc\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcdc CONTEXTO HIST\u00d3RICO<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Joule demostr\u00f3 que <strong>el trabajo mec\u00e1nico puede convertirse en calor<\/strong>, sentando las bases de la <strong>Primera Ley de la Termodin\u00e1mica<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"cita-destacada\">\r\n                    <p>\"La cantidad de calor producida es siempre proporcional al trabajo gastado.\"<\/p>\r\n                    <small>\u2014 James Prescott Joule, 1843<\/small>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"equivalencia-historica\">\r\n                    <strong>Equivalencia mec\u00e1nica del calor:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \\(1\\,\\text{cal} = 4.186\\,\\text{J}\\)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"experimento-diagrama\">\r\n                <svg width=\"400\" height=\"300\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" id=\"diagramaJoule\">\r\n                    <!-- Contenedor -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"50\" y=\"100\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#E3F2FD\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#1976D2\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Agua -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"60\" y=\"180\" width=\"280\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#42A5F5\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"200\" y=\"210\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Agua<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Paletas -->\r\n                    <g id=\"paletas\" transform=\"translate(200, 150)\">\r\n                        <line x1=\"-30\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"30\" y1=\"0\" stroke=\"#1565C0\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                        <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"-20\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#1565C0\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#1565C0\"\/>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Pesas -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"-50\" y=\"-80\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#795548\" rx=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        <rect x=\"20\" y=\"-80\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#795548\" rx=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"-95\" fill=\"#3E2723\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pesas<\/text>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Cuerda -->\r\n                        <path d=\"M -30 0 Q 0 -40 30 0\" stroke=\"#3E2723\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Term\u00f3metro -->\r\n                    <g id=\"termometro\" transform=\"translate(300, 120)\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"20\" height=\"80\" fill=\"white\" rx=\"3\"\/>\r\n                        <rect x=\"5\" y=\"10\" width=\"10\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#E91E63\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"10\" y=\"95\" fill=\"#E91E63\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\u0394T<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Flecha trabajo -->\r\n                    <path d=\"M 150 50 L 200 80 L 150 110\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"170\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#2E7D32\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Trabajo<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Leyenda -->\r\n                    <text x=\"200\" y=\"280\" fill=\"#0D47A1\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\r\n                        Trabajo mec\u00e1nico \u2192 Calor (\u0394T)\r\n                    <\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: EXPERIMENTO DE JOULE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\">\r\n            <!-- CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>PAR\u00c1METROS<\/h3>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"masaPesas\">Masa de pesas (kg):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"masaPesas\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"5\" value=\"1\" step=\"0.1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"masaValue\">1.0 kg<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"alturaCaida\">Altura de ca\u00edda (m):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"alturaCaida\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"3\" value=\"1\" step=\"0.1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"alturaValue\">1.0 m<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"masaAgua\">Masa de agua (kg):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"masaAgua\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"2\" value=\"0.5\" step=\"0.1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"masaAguaValue\">0.5 kg<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"eficiencia\">Eficiencia (%):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"eficiencia\" min=\"50\" max=\"100\" value=\"90\" step=\"1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"eficienciaValue\">90%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <button class=\"btn-simular\" onclick=\"iniciarExperimento()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6<\/span> INICIAR EXPERIMENTO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n\r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarExperimento()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u21ba<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" id=\"svgExperimento\">\r\n                    <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Contenedor -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"150\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#151515\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#1976D2\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Agua -->\r\n                    <rect id=\"agua\" x=\"110\" y=\"280\" width=\"380\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#42A5F5\" rx=\"5\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"height\" values=\"60;65;60\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" begin=\"indefinite\" id=\"animAgua\"\/>\r\n                    <\/rect>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"310\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Agua<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Paletas -->\r\n                    <g id=\"paletasGroup\" transform=\"translate(300, 200)\">\r\n                        <line id=\"paleta1\" x1=\"-40\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"40\" y1=\"0\" stroke=\"#1565C0\" stroke-width=\"4\"\/>\r\n                        <line id=\"paleta2\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"-30\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#1565C0\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Eje -->\r\n                        <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#3E2723\"\/>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Cuerda -->\r\n                        <path id=\"cuerda\" d=\"M 0 0 L 0 -100\" stroke=\"#795548\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\">\r\n                            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"0;-8\" dur=\"0.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" begin=\"indefinite\" id=\"animCuerda\"\/>\r\n                        <\/path>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Pesas -->\r\n                        <rect id=\"pesa1\" x=\"-20\" y=\"-120\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#795548\" rx=\"3\"\/>\r\n                        <rect id=\"pesa2\" x=\"-20\" y=\"-150\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#795548\" rx=\"3\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"-100\" fill=\"#E0E0E0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"masaPesasText\">1 kg<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Term\u00f3metro -->\r\n                    <g id=\"termometroGroup\" transform=\"translate(450, 180)\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"25\" height=\"100\" fill=\"white\" rx=\"4\"\/>\r\n                        <rect id=\"mercurio\" x=\"5\" y=\"90\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#E91E63\" rx=\"2\">\r\n                            <animate attributeName=\"y\" values=\"90;30\" dur=\"2s\" begin=\"indefinite\" id=\"animMercurio\"\/>\r\n                            <animate attributeName=\"height\" values=\"10;70\" dur=\"2s\" begin=\"indefinite\" id=\"animMercurioHeight\"\/>\r\n                        <\/rect>\r\n                        <text x=\"12.5\" y=\"110\" fill=\"#E91E63\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"deltaTText\">\u0394T = 0\u00b0C<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Energ\u00eda -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"50\" y=\"320\" width=\"500\" height=\"60\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.7)\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Barra Trabajo -->\r\n                    <rect id=\"barraTrabajo\" x=\"70\" y=\"330\" width=\"0\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" rx=\"3\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"70\" y=\"325\" fill=\"#E0E0E0\" font-size=\"12\">Trabajo (J)<\/text>\r\n                    <text id=\"valorTrabajo\" x=\"120\" y=\"345\" fill=\"#E0E0E0\" font-size=\"12\">0 J<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Barra Calor -->\r\n                    <rect id=\"barraCalor\" x=\"70\" y=\"360\" width=\"0\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#E91E63\" rx=\"3\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"70\" y=\"355\" fill=\"#E0E0E0\" font-size=\"12\">Calor (J)<\/text>\r\n                    <text id=\"valorCalor\" x=\"120\" y=\"375\" fill=\"#E0E0E0\" font-size=\"12\">0 J<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Eficiencia -->\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"350\" fill=\"#FFC107\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\r\n                        Eficiencia: <tspan id=\"valorEficiencia\">90%<\/tspan>\r\n                    <\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- DATOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>RESULTADOS<\/h3>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Trabajo mec\u00e1nico (W):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTrabajo\">0 J<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Energ\u00eda t\u00e9rmica (Q):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataCalor\">0 J<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Equivalente en calor\u00edas:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataCalorias\">0 cal<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Equivalente mec\u00e1nico:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEquivalente\">0 kg\u00b7m<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Aumento de temperatura:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataDeltaT\">0\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"formula-resumen\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcdd RESUMEN<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        W = mgh = \\text{<span id=\"resumenMasa\">1<\/span> kg} \\times 9.8\\,\\text{m\/s\u00b2} \\times \\text{<span id=\"resumenAltura\">1<\/span> m} = \\text{<span id=\"resumenTrabajo\">9.8<\/span> J}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        Q = m c \\Delta T \\quad \\Rightarrow \\quad \\Delta T = \\frac{Q}{mc} = \\text{<span id=\"resumenDeltaT\">0.002<\/span>\u00b0C}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONVERSOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"conversor-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> CONVERSOR DE UNIDADES DE ENERG\u00cdA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"conversor-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"conversor-controls\">\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"valorEntrada\">Valor:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"number\" id=\"valorEntrada\" value=\"1\" min=\"0.001\" step=\"0.001\">\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"unidadEntrada\">De:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"unidadEntrada\">\r\n                        <option value=\"J\">Joule (J)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"cal\">Calor\u00eda (cal)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"kWh\">Kilowatt-hora (kWh)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"eV\">Electronvoltio (eV)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"BTU\">BTU<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"unidadSalida\">A:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"unidadSalida\">\r\n                        <option value=\"J\">Joule (J)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"cal\">Calor\u00eda (cal)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"kWh\">Kilowatt-hora (kWh)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"eV\">Electronvoltio (eV)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"BTU\">BTU<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <button class=\"btn-convertir\" onclick=\"convertirUnidades()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u2194<\/span> CONVERTIR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"conversor-resultado\">\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"resultado-label\">Resultado:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"resultado-value\" id=\"resultadoConversion\">1 J = 1 J<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-equivalente\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udca1 EJEMPLO EQUIVALENTE<\/h4>\r\n                    <div id=\"ejemploEquivalente\">\r\n                        1 J puede levantar 100 g a 1 m de altura.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-conversiones\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udcca TABLA DE CONVERSI\u00d3N R\u00c1PIDA<\/h4>\r\n                <table>\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr><th>Unidad<\/th><th>Equivalente en Joules<\/th><th>Ejemplo<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr><td>1 cal<\/td><td>4.186 J<\/td><td>Calentar 1 g de agua 1\u00b0C<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>1 kWh<\/td><td>3.6 \u00d7 10\u2076 J<\/td><td>Energ\u00eda de 1 hora de secador<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>1 eV<\/td><td>1.602 \u00d7 10\u207b\u00b9\u2079 J<\/td><td>Energ\u00eda de un fot\u00f3n visible<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>1 BTU<\/td><td>1,055 J<\/td><td>Calentar 1 libra de agua 1\u00b0F<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>1 ton TNT<\/td><td>4.184 \u00d7 10\u2079 J<\/td><td>Energ\u00eda de 1 ton de explosivo<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: DOMINA EL JOULE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la definici\u00f3n correcta de 1 joule?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        1 J = 1 kg\u00b7m\/s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        1 J = 1 N\/s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        1 J = 1 N\u00b7m\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        1 J = 1 W\u00b7h\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> 1 J = 1 N\u00b7m (newton por metro).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>Tambi\u00e9n equivale a 1 W\u00b7s (vatio por segundo) o 1 kg\u00b7m\u00b2\/s\u00b2.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>En el experimento de Joule, \u00bfqu\u00e9 se conserva?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        La temperatura\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        La energ\u00eda total\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        La masa del agua\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        La velocidad de las paletas\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Se conserva la <strong>energ\u00eda total<\/strong> (Primera Ley de la Termodin\u00e1mica).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>La energ\u00eda mec\u00e1nica (trabajo) se transforma en energ\u00eda t\u00e9rmica (calor), pero la suma total permanece constante.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1ntos joules equivalen a 1 calor\u00eda?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        4.186 J\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        1 J\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        0.239 J\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        418.6 J\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> 1 cal = 4.186 J (equivalente mec\u00e1nico del calor).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>Este valor fue determinado experimentalmente por Joule en 1843.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-results\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfc6 RESULTADOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                    Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                    Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">REINTENTAR<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>C\u00e1lculo de Trabajo Mec\u00e1nico<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Calcula el trabajo realizado al levantar un objeto de <strong>5 kg<\/strong> a una altura de <strong>2 m<\/strong> con una aceleraci\u00f3n constante. Expresa el resultado en:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Joules (J)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Calor\u00edas (cal)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Electronvoltios (eV)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        W = mgh \\quad \\text{y} \\quad 1\\,\\text{cal} = 4.186\\,\\text{J}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n paso a paso...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. \\(W = mgh = 5 \\times 9.8 \\times 2 = 98\\,\\text{J}\\)<br>\r\n                    2. \\(98\\,\\text{J} \\times \\frac{1\\,\\text{cal}}{4.186\\,\\text{J}} = 23.4\\,\\text{cal}\\)<br>\r\n                    3. \\(98\\,\\text{J} \\times \\frac{1\\,\\text{eV}}{1.602 \\times 10^{-19}\\,\\text{J}} = 6.12 \\times 10^{20}\\,\\text{eV}\\)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Equivalencia Energ\u00e9tica<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un atleta quema <strong>500 kcal<\/strong> en una sesi\u00f3n de entrenamiento. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>La energ\u00eda en joules.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La altura a la que podr\u00eda levantar su masa (70 kg) con esa energ\u00eda.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>El tiempo que podr\u00eda mantener encendido un foco de 100 W con esa energ\u00eda.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n paso a paso...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. \\(500\\,\\text{kcal} \\times 4,186\\,\\text{J\/kcal} = 2,093,000\\,\\text{J}\\)<br>\r\n                    2. \\(h = \\frac{E}{mg} = \\frac{2,093,000}{70 \\times 9.8} = 3,033\\,\\text{m}\\)<br>\r\n                    3. \\(t = \\frac{E}{P} = \\frac{2,093,000}{100} = 20,930\\,\\text{s} = 5.8\\,\\text{h}\\)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (3 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (2 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (1 pt)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Precisi\u00f3n en c\u00e1lculos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Todos los c\u00e1lculos correctos con unidades<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Error en 1 c\u00e1lculo o unidad<\/td>\r\n                    <td>M\u00faltiples errores<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Conversi\u00f3n de unidades<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Todas las conversiones correctas<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Error en 1 conversi\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                    <td>M\u00faltiples errores<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Explicaci\u00f3n conceptual<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explica cada paso con claridad<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explicaci\u00f3n parcial<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Sin explicaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Concepto de joule:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Aplicaciones pr\u00e1cticas:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Conversi\u00f3n de unidades:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo crees que el concepto de joule y la equivalencia entre trabajo y calor han influido en el desarrollo de la f\u00edsica moderna y la tecnolog\u00eda?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: M\u00e1quinas t\u00e9rmicas, energ\u00edas renovables, electr\u00f3nica...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar definici\u00f3n de joule<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Repasar f\u00f3rmulas de trabajo y energ\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83e\uddea PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Resolver 5 problemas de conversi\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Simular experimento de Joule 3 veces<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udcda PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Investigar aplicaciones en ingenier\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Comparar joule con otras unidades hist\u00f3ricas<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/physics.nist.gov\/cuu\/Units\/energy.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udf10 NIST: Unidades de energ\u00eda\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bipm.org\/en\/measurement-units\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcda BIPM: Sistema Internacional de Unidades\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/energy-forms-and-changes\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udfae PhET: Formas y cambios de energ\u00eda\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ CONSTANTES F\u00cdSICAS\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nconst CONSTANTES = {\r\n    g: 9.8,               \/\/ Aceleraci\u00f3n gravitatoria (m\/s\u00b2)\r\n    c_agua: 4186,         \/\/ Calor espec\u00edfico del agua (J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C)\r\n    equivCaloria: 4.186,  \/\/ Equivalente mec\u00e1nico del calor (J\/cal)\r\n    eV_per_J: 6.242e18,  \/\/ Electronvoltios por joule\r\n    kWh_per_J: 2.778e-7  \/\/ Kilowatt-hora por joule\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DEL EXPERIMENTO DE JOULE\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nlet experimentoActivo = false;\r\nlet intervaloExperimento;\r\n\r\nfunction iniciarExperimento() {\r\n    if (experimentoActivo) return;\r\n    experimentoActivo = true;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Obtener par\u00e1metros\r\n    const masaPesas = parseFloat(document.getElementById('masaPesas').value);\r\n    const alturaCaida = parseFloat(document.getElementById('alturaCaida').value);\r\n    const masaAgua = parseFloat(document.getElementById('masaAgua').value);\r\n    const eficiencia = parseFloat(document.getElementById('eficiencia').value) \/ 100;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ C\u00e1lculos\r\n    const trabajo = masaPesas * CONSTANTES.g * alturaCaida;\r\n    const calor = trabajo * eficiencia;\r\n    const calorias = calor \/ CONSTANTES.equivCaloria;\r\n    const equivalenteKgM = trabajo; \/\/ 1 J = 1 N\u00b7m \u2248 0.102 kg\u00b7m\r\n    const deltaT = calor \/ (masaAgua * CONSTANTES.c_agua);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n    document.getElementById('dataTrabajo').textContent = trabajo.toFixed(2) + ' J';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataCalor').textContent = calor.toFixed(2) + ' J';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataCalorias').textContent = calorias.toFixed(3) + ' cal';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEquivalente').textContent = equivalenteKgM.toFixed(2) + ' kg\u00b7m';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataDeltaT').textContent = deltaT.toFixed(4) + '\u00b0C';\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar resumen\r\n    document.getElementById('resumenMasa').textContent = masaPesas.toFixed(1);\r\n    document.getElementById('resumenAltura').textContent = alturaCaida.toFixed(1);\r\n    document.getElementById('resumenTrabajo').textContent = trabajo.toFixed(2);\r\n    document.getElementById('resumenDeltaT').textContent = deltaT.toFixed(4);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n\r\n    const duracion = 2000; \/\/ ms\r\n    const alturaInicial = 100; \/\/ px en SVG\r\n    const alturaFinal = alturaInicial + (alturaCaida * 20); \/\/ Escala\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Animar pesas\r\n    const pesa1 = document.getElementById('pesa1');\r\n    const pesa2 = document.getElementById('pesa2');\r\n    const cuerda = document.getElementById('cuerda');\r\n    const mercurio = document.getElementById('mercurio');\r\n\r\n    pesa1.setAttribute('y', `-${alturaInicial}`);\r\n    pesa2.setAttribute('y', `-${alturaInicial + 30}`);\r\n    document.getElementById('animCuerda').beginElement();\r\n    document.getElementById('masaPesasText').textContent = `${masaPesas.toFixed(1)} kg`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Animar ca\u00edda\r\n    pesa1.style.transition = `transform ${duracion}ms linear`;\r\n    pesa2.style.transition = `transform ${duracion}ms linear`;\r\n    pesa1.style.transform = `translateY(${alturaFinal - alturaInicial}px)`;\r\n    pesa2.style.transform = `translateY(${alturaFinal - alturaInicial}px)`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Animar term\u00f3metro\r\n    const alturaMercurio = 70 * (deltaT \/ 0.1); \/\/ Escala para visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('animMercurio').setAttribute('to', 90 - alturaMercurio);\r\n    document.getElementById('animMercurioHeight').setAttribute('height', 10 + alturaMercurio);\r\n    document.getElementById('deltaTText').textContent = `\u0394T = ${deltaT.toFixed(3)}\u00b0C`;\r\n    document.getElementById('animMercurio').beginElement();\r\n    document.getElementById('animMercurioHeight').beginElement();\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Animar agua (efecto de agitaci\u00f3n)\r\n    document.getElementById('animAgua').beginElement();\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Animar barras de energ\u00eda\r\n    const maxWidth = 400;\r\n    const barraTrabajoWidth = (trabajo \/ (masaPesas * CONSTANTES.g * 3)) * maxWidth;\r\n    const barraCalorWidth = (calor \/ (masaPesas * CONSTANTES.g * 3)) * maxWidth;\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('barraTrabajo').setAttribute('width', barraTrabajoWidth);\r\n    document.getElementById('barraCalor').setAttribute('width', barraCalorWidth);\r\n    document.getElementById('valorTrabajo').textContent = trabajo.toFixed(2) + ' J';\r\n    document.getElementById('valorCalor').textContent = calor.toFixed(2) + ' J';\r\n    document.getElementById('valorEficiencia').textContent = (eficiencia * 100).toFixed(0) + '%';\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar despu\u00e9s de la animaci\u00f3n\r\n    setTimeout(() => {\r\n        experimentoActivo = false;\r\n    }, duracion + 500);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarExperimento() {\r\n    \/\/ Restaurar controles\r\n    document.getElementById('masaPesas').value = 1;\r\n    document.getElementById('alturaCaida').value = 1;\r\n    document.getElementById('masaAgua').value = 0.5;\r\n    document.getElementById('eficiencia').value = 90;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar textos\r\n    document.getElementById('masaValue').textContent = \"1.0 kg\";\r\n    document.getElementById('alturaValue').textContent = \"1.0 m\";\r\n    document.getElementById('masaAguaValue').textContent = \"0.5 kg\";\r\n    document.getElementById('eficienciaValue').textContent = \"90%\";\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Restaurar SVG\r\n    document.getElementById('pesa1').removeAttribute('style');\r\n    document.getElementById('pesa2').removeAttribute('style');\r\n    document.getElementById('pesa1').setAttribute('y', '-120');\r\n    document.getElementById('pesa2').setAttribute('y', '-150');\r\n    document.getElementById('masaPesasText').textContent = \"1 kg\";\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('mercurio').setAttribute('y', '90');\r\n    document.getElementById('mercurio').setAttribute('height', '10');\r\n    document.getElementById('deltaTText').textContent = \"\u0394T = 0\u00b0C\";\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('barraTrabajo').setAttribute('width', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('barraCalor').setAttribute('width', '0');\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Restaurar datos\r\n    document.getElementById('dataTrabajo').textContent = \"0 J\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataCalor').textContent = \"0 J\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataCalorias').textContent = \"0 cal\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEquivalente').textContent = \"0 kg\u00b7m\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataDeltaT').textContent = \"0\u00b0C\";\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('resumenMasa').textContent = \"1\";\r\n    document.getElementById('resumenAltura').textContent = \"1\";\r\n    document.getElementById('resumenTrabajo').textContent = \"9.8\";\r\n    document.getElementById('resumenDeltaT').textContent = \"0.002\";\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Event listeners para controles\r\ndocument.getElementById('masaPesas').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    document.getElementById('masaValue').textContent = this.value + ' kg';\r\n});\r\n\r\ndocument.getElementById('alturaCaida').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    document.getElementById('alturaValue').textContent = this.value + ' m';\r\n});\r\n\r\ndocument.getElementById('masaAgua').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    document.getElementById('masaAguaValue').textContent = this.value + ' kg';\r\n});\r\n\r\ndocument.getElementById('eficiencia').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    document.getElementById('eficienciaValue').textContent = this.value + '%';\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ CONVERSOR DE UNIDADES\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nconst FACTORES_CONVERSION = {\r\n    J: {\r\n        cal: 1 \/ 4.186,\r\n        kWh: 1 \/ 3.6e6,\r\n        eV: 1 \/ 1.602e-19,\r\n        BTU: 1 \/ 1055\r\n    },\r\n    cal: {\r\n        J: 4.186,\r\n        kWh: 4.186 \/ 3.6e6,\r\n        eV: 4.186 \/ 1.602e-19,\r\n        BTU: 4.186 \/ 1055\r\n    },\r\n    kWh: {\r\n        J: 3.6e6,\r\n        cal: 3.6e6 \/ 4.186,\r\n        eV: 3.6e6 \/ 1.602e-19,\r\n        BTU: 3.6e6 \/ 1055\r\n    },\r\n    eV: {\r\n        J: 1.602e-19,\r\n        cal: 1.602e-19 \/ 4.186,\r\n        kWh: 1.602e-19 \/ 3.6e6,\r\n        BTU: 1.602e-19 \/ 1055\r\n    },\r\n    BTU: {\r\n        J: 1055,\r\n        cal: 1055 \/ 4.186,\r\n        kWh: 1055 \/ 3.6e6,\r\n        eV: 1055 \/ 1.602e-19\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\nconst EJEMPLOS_EQUIVALENTES = {\r\n    J: [\r\n        { valor: 1, ejemplo: \"Levantar 100 g a 1 m de altura\" },\r\n        { valor: 100, ejemplo: \"Energ\u00eda de una manzana cayendo 1 m\" },\r\n        { valor: 3600, ejemplo: \"1 watt durante 1 hora\" }\r\n    ],\r\n    cal: [\r\n        { valor: 1, ejemplo: \"Calentar 1 g de agua 1\u00b0C\" },\r\n        { valor: 1000, ejemplo: \"Energ\u00eda de un chocolate peque\u00f1o\" },\r\n        { valor: 2000, ejemplo: \"Metabolismo basal por hora\" }\r\n    ],\r\n    kWh: [\r\n        { valor: 1, ejemplo: \"100 horas de un foco LED de 10 W\" },\r\n        { valor: 0.1, ejemplo: \"Cargar un smartphone\" },\r\n        { valor: 10, ejemplo: \"Consumo diario de un refrigerador\" }\r\n    ],\r\n    eV: [\r\n        { valor: 1, ejemplo: \"Energ\u00eda de un fot\u00f3n de luz visible\" },\r\n        { valor: 1e6, ejemplo: \"Energ\u00eda de un electr\u00f3n en un TV antiguo\" },\r\n        { valor: 1e9, ejemplo: \"Energ\u00eda de un rayo X m\u00e9dico\" }\r\n    ],\r\n    BTU: [\r\n        { valor: 1, ejemplo: \"Calentar 1 libra de agua 1\u00b0F\" },\r\n        { valor: 10000, ejemplo: \"Energ\u00eda de 1 gal\u00f3n de gasolina\" },\r\n        { valor: 1e6, ejemplo: \"Consumo mensual de gas de una casa\" }\r\n    ]\r\n};\r\n\r\nfunction convertirUnidades() {\r\n    const valor = parseFloat(document.getElementById('valorEntrada').value);\r\n    const de = document.getElementById('unidadEntrada').value;\r\n    const a = document.getElementById('unidadSalida').value;\r\n\r\n    if (de === a) {\r\n        document.getElementById('resultadoConversion').textContent = `${valor} ${de} = ${valor} ${a}`;\r\n        mostrarEjemploEquivalente(de, valor);\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    const factor = FACTORES_CONVERSION[de][a];\r\n    const resultado = valor * factor;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Formatear resultado\r\n    let resultadoTexto;\r\n    if (Math.abs(resultado) >= 1e6) {\r\n        resultadoTexto = `${(resultado \/ 1e6).toFixed(3)} \u00d7 10\u2076 ${a}`;\r\n    } else if (Math.abs(resultado) >= 1e3) {\r\n        resultadoTexto = `${(resultado \/ 1e3).toFixed(3)} \u00d7 10\u00b3 ${a}`;\r\n    } else if (Math.abs(resultado) < 1e-3) {\r\n        resultadoTexto = `${(resultado * 1e6).toFixed(3)} \u00d7 10\u207b\u2076 ${a}`;\r\n    } else {\r\n        resultadoTexto = `${resultado.toFixed(6)} ${a}`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('resultadoConversion').textContent = `${valor} ${de} = ${resultadoTexto}`;\r\n    mostrarEjemploEquivalente(a, resultado);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarEjemploEquivalente(unidad, valor) {\r\n    const ejemplos = EJEMPLOS_EQUIVALENTES[unidad];\r\n    let ejemploTexto = \"Ejemplo no disponible\";\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Buscar el ejemplo m\u00e1s cercano\r\n    let mejorEjemplo = ejemplos[0];\r\n    let menorDiferencia = Math.abs(valor - ejemplos[0].valor);\r\n\r\n    for (const ej of ejemplos) {\r\n        const diferencia = Math.abs(valor - ej.valor);\r\n        if (diferencia < menorDiferencia) {\r\n            menorDiferencia = diferencia;\r\n            mejorEjemplo = ej;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    if (valor < mejorEjemplo.valor * 0.1) {\r\n        ejemploTexto = `1 ${unidad} = ${mejorEjemplo.ejemplo}`;\r\n    } else if (valor > mejorEjemplo.valor * 10) {\r\n        ejemploTexto = `${Math.round(valor \/ mejorEjemplo.valor)} \u00d7 (${mejorEjemplo.ejemplo})`;\r\n    } else {\r\n        ejemploTexto = `\u2248 ${mejorEjemplo.ejemplo} (${mejorEjemplo.valor} ${unidad})`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('ejemploEquivalente').textContent = ejemploTexto;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas respondidas\r\n        const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n\r\n        if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n    let feedback;\r\n    if (correctas === total) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83c\udf1f Excelente! Dominas el concepto de joule y sus aplicaciones.\";\r\n    } else if (correctas >= total\/2) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Bueno. Revisa las conversiones entre joules y calor\u00edas.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas repasar. Enf\u00f3cate en la definici\u00f3n de joule y el experimento de Joule.\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = \"0\/3\";\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = \"Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\";\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    if (solucion.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'none';\r\n    } else {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n\r\n    let mensaje = `\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n`;\r\n    mensaje += `Concepto de joule: ${slider1}\/5\\n`;\r\n    mensaje += `Aplicaciones pr\u00e1cticas: ${slider2}\/5\\n`;\r\n    mensaje += `Conversi\u00f3n de unidades: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n`;\r\n    mensaje += `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n`;\r\n\r\n    if (promedio >= 4) {\r\n        mensaje += \"\ud83c\udf1f Excelente comprensi\u00f3n! Puedes aplicar el concepto de joule en problemas reales.\";\r\n    } else if (promedio >= 3) {\r\n        mensaje += \"\ud83d\udc4d Bueno, pero practica m\u00e1s conversiones y aplicaciones.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        mensaje += \"\ud83d\udcda Revisa los fundamentos y usa el simulador para experimentar.\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    alert(mensaje);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nconsole.log(\"\u26a1 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: Joule inicializada\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\udd2c Simulador del experimento de Joule listo\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\u2194 Conversor de unidades de energ\u00eda configurado\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\u2753 Quiz con 3 preguntas sobre el joule\");\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar\r\nreiniciarExperimento();\r\nconvertirUnidades(); \/\/ Mostrar ejemplo inicial\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"1 J =","respuesta":"1 N\u00b7m"},{"enunciado":"1 J en base SI","respuesta":"kg\u00b7m\u00b2\u00b7s\u207b\u00b2"},{"enunciado":"1 cal =","respuesta":"4.184 J"},{"enunciado":"Trabajo: F=50 N, d=3 m, \u03b8=0\u00b0","respuesta":"150 J"},{"enunciado":"E_k: m=2 kg, v=5 m\/s","respuesta":"25 J"},{"enunciado":"E_p: m=1 kg, h=10 m","respuesta":"98 J"},{"enunciado":"Nombrado por","respuesta":"James Prescott Joule"},{"enunciado":"Experimento clave","respuesta":"Paletas en agua"},{"enunciado":"A\u00f1o aproximado","respuesta":"1843"},{"enunciado":"1 kWh =","respuesta":"3.6 MJ"},{"enunciado":"1 eV =","respuesta":"1.6 \u00d7 10\u207b\u00b9\u2079 J"},{"enunciado":"Trabajo m\u00ednimo para 1 kg a 1 m\/s","respuesta":"0.5 J (E_k)"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Joule mide...","opciones":["Energ\u00eda","Fuerza","Velocidad","Masa"],"correcta":"Energ\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"1 J =","opciones":["1 N\u00b7m","1 kg","1 m\/s","1 W"],"correcta":"1 N\u00b7m"},{"pregunta":"Unidad SI","opciones":["S\u00ed","No","A veces","Nunca"],"correcta":"S\u00ed"},{"pregunta":"Nombrado por...","opciones":["James Joule","Isaac Newton","Albert Einstein","Marie Curie"],"correcta":"James Joule"},{"pregunta":"1 J = 1...","opciones":["W\u00b7s","W\/h","kW","MW"],"correcta":"W\u00b7s"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo =","opciones":["F \u00d7 d \u00d7 cos\u03b8","m \u00d7 a","\u00bdmv\u00b2","mgh"],"correcta":"F \u00d7 d \u00d7 cos\u03b8"},{"pregunta":"1 cal \u2248","opciones":["4.184 J","1 J","10 J","0.1 J"],"correcta":"4.184 J"},{"pregunta":"Levantar 1 kg 1 m \u2248","opciones":["9.8 J","1 J","98 J","0 J"],"correcta":"9.8 J"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica usa...","opciones":["Joule","Newton","Pascal","Tesla"],"correcta":"Joule"},{"pregunta":"BIPM define J como...","opciones":["kg\u00b7m\u00b2\u00b7s\u207b\u00b2","kg\u00b7m\/s","N\/m","W\/m"],"correcta":"kg\u00b7m\u00b2\u00b7s\u207b\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo 20 N en 5 m =","opciones":["100 J","4 J","25 J","500 J"],"correcta":"100 J"},{"pregunta":"E_k 3 kg a 4 m\/s =","opciones":["24 J","12 J","48 J","6 J"],"correcta":"24 J"},{"pregunta":"1 kWh =","opciones":["3.6 MJ","3.6 kJ","36 MJ","0.36 MJ"],"correcta":"3.6 MJ"},{"pregunta":"1 eV =","opciones":["1.6\u00d710\u207b\u00b9\u2079 J","1 J","1.6\u00d710\u207b\u00b9\u2070 J","1.6\u00d710\u2076 J"],"correcta":"1.6\u00d710\u207b\u00b9\u2079 J"},{"pregunta":"Experimento Joule demostr\u00f3...","opciones":["Equivalencia calor-trabajo","Fusi\u00f3n","Fisi\u00f3n","\u00d3ptica"],"correcta":"Equivalencia calor-trabajo"},{"pregunta":"1 J = ... erg","opciones":["10\u2077","10\u2076","10\u2078","10\u2075"],"correcta":"10\u2077"},{"pregunta":"Calor espec\u00edfico agua =","opciones":["4184 J\/kg\u00b7K","1000 J\/kg\u00b7K","4.184 J\/kg\u00b7K","4184 J\/g\u00b7K"],"correcta":"4184 J\/kg\u00b7K"},{"pregunta":"Potencia =","opciones":["J\/s","J\u00b7m","N\/m","kg\/s"],"correcta":"J\/s"},{"pregunta":"Unidad potencia","opciones":["Watt","Joule","Newton","Pascal"],"correcta":"Watt"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: J definido por...","opciones":["Constantes fundamentales","Prototipo","Masa","Tiempo"],"correcta":"Constantes fundamentales"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo \u03b8=60\u00b0, F=100 N, d=2 m =","opciones":["100 J","200 J","50 J","0 J"],"correcta":"100 J"},{"pregunta":"E_k para v = 10 m\/s, m=1 kg =","opciones":["50 J","100 J","25 J","500 J"],"correcta":"50 J"},{"pregunta":"1 MJ =","opciones":["10\u2076 J","10\u00b3 J","10\u2079 J","10\u207b\u2076 J"],"correcta":"10\u2076 J"},{"pregunta":"Calor para 1 g agua +1\u00b0C =","opciones":["4.184 J","1 J","4184 J","0.4184 J"],"correcta":"4.184 J"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda fot\u00f3n \u03bb=500 nm \u2248","opciones":["4\u00d710\u207b\u00b9\u2079 J","4\u00d710\u207b\u00b9\u2070 J","4\u00d710\u207b\u00b2\u2075 J","4 J"],"correcta":"4\u00d710\u207b\u00b9\u2079 J"},{"pregunta":"Joule contribuy\u00f3 a...","opciones":["1\u00aa Ley Termodin\u00e1mica","2\u00aa Ley","Ley Gravitaci\u00f3n","Relatividad"],"correcta":"1\u00aa Ley Termodin\u00e1mica"},{"pregunta":"1 BTU \u2248","opciones":["1055 J","100 J","10000 J","1 J"],"correcta":"1055 J"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo m\u00ednimo para detener 2 kg a 5 m\/s","opciones":["-25 J","25 J","50 J","0 J"],"correcta":"-25 J"},{"pregunta":"Constante de Boltzmann k =","opciones":["1.38\u00d710\u207b\u00b2\u00b3 J\/K","1.38\u00d710\u207b\u00b2\u00b3 eV\/K","9.8 J\/kg","3\u00d710\u2078 J"],"correcta":"1.38\u00d710\u207b\u00b2\u00b3 J\/K"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: J basado en...","opciones":["c, h, k (constantes)","kg prototipo","metro","segundo"],"correcta":"c, h, k (constantes)"}]},{"materia":"F\u00edsica I","slug":"biomasa-cyberpunk","titulo":"Biomasa: Del CO\u2082 a la Energ\u00eda Sostenible","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-fisica-biomasa\" data-tema=\"biomasa\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83c\udf31<\/span>\r\n            BIOMASSA: ENERG\u00cdA VIVA\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Del Ciclo del Carbono a la Generaci\u00f3n de Energ\u00eda Renovable\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Clasificar los 4 tipos de biomasa<\/h3>\r\n                <p>S\u00f3lida, l\u00edquida, gaseosa y residuos org\u00e1nicos<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Explicar las transformaciones energ\u00e9ticas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Combusti\u00f3n, gasificaci\u00f3n y digesti\u00f3n anaerobia<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar ventajas y desventajas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Impacto ambiental, eficiencia y sostenibilidad<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Calcular eficiencias y emisiones<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Comparar con otras fuentes renovables<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> CONTEXTO GLOBAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf0e CONTRIBUCI\u00d3N MUNDIAL<\/h3>\r\n                <p>La biomasa representa el <strong>10% de la energ\u00eda primaria global<\/strong> (IRENA, 2025).<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">L\u00edderes: Brasil (30%), Suecia (20%), India (15%)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\uddf2\ud83c\uddfd M\u00c9XICO<\/h3>\r\n                <p><strong>5% de la matriz energ\u00e9tica<\/strong> (2025), principalmente:<\/p>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Bagazo de ca\u00f1a (1,000 MW)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Biog\u00e1s de residuos (500 MW)<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udca1 INNOVACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Nuevas tecnolog\u00edas:<\/p>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Bioetanol 2G (residuos agr\u00edcolas)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Biocombustibles de algas<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"fundamentos-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS CIENT\u00cdFICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- CICLO DEL CARBONO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Ciclo del Carbono en Biomasa<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"ciclo-dual\">\r\n                <div class=\"ciclo-diagrama\">\r\n                    <svg width=\"300\" height=\"200\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 200\">\r\n                        <!-- Fotos\u00edntesis -->\r\n                        <path d=\"M50 100 Q150 50 250 100 Q150 150 50 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4CAF50\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"150\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Fotos\u00edntesis<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"150\" y=\"120\" fill=\"#2E7D32\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">CO\u2082 + H\u2082O \u2192 C\u2086H\u2081\u2082O\u2086 + O\u2082<\/text>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Combusti\u00f3n -->\r\n                        <path d=\"M50 150 Q150 180 250 150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF5722\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"150\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#FF5722\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Combusti\u00f3n<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"150\" y=\"190\" fill=\"#E65100\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">C\u2086H\u2081\u2082O\u2086 + O\u2082 \u2192 CO\u2082 + H\u2082O + Q<\/text>\r\n                    <\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ciclo-explicacion\">\r\n                    <p>La biomasa <strong>captura CO\u2082<\/strong> durante su crecimiento y lo <strong>libera<\/strong> al usarse como combustible, creando un <strong>ciclo cerrado de carbono<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        \\text{CO}_2 + \\text{H}_2\\text{O} + \\text{luz} \\xrightarrow{\\text{fotos\u00edntesis}} \\text{C}_6\\text{H}_{12}\\text{O}_6 + \\text{O}_2\r\n                        \\]\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        \\text{C}_6\\text{H}_{12}\\text{O}_6 + 6\\text{O}_2 \\xrightarrow{\\text{combusti\u00f3n}} 6\\text{CO}_2 + 6\\text{H}_2\\text{O} + \\text{Energ\u00eda}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TIPOS DE BIOMASSA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Clasificaci\u00f3n de la Biomasa<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tipos-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"tipo-card\" data-tipo=\"solida\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-icon\">\ud83c\udf33<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>S\u00d3LIDA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-detalle\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Madera, bagazo, c\u00e1scaras<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Uso:<\/strong> Combusti\u00f3n directa, gasificaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>PCI:<\/strong> 15\u201320 MJ\/kg<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"tipo-card\" data-tipo=\"liquida\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-icon\">\u26fd<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>L\u00cdQUIDA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-detalle\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Bioetanol, biodi\u00e9sel<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Uso:<\/strong> Transporte, generaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>PCI:<\/strong> 25\u201330 MJ\/L<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"tipo-card\" data-tipo=\"gaseosa\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-icon\">\ud83d\udca8<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>GASEOSA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-detalle\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Biog\u00e1s (CH\u2084 50\u201370%, CO\u2082 30\u201350%)<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Uso:<\/strong> Cogeneraci\u00f3n, calefacci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>PCI:<\/strong> 20\u201325 MJ\/m\u00b3<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"tipo-card\" data-tipo=\"residuos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-icon\">\ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>RESIDUOS<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-detalle\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Org\u00e1nicos urbanos, esti\u00e9rcol<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Uso:<\/strong> Digesti\u00f3n anaerobia, compostaje<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>PCI:<\/strong> 10\u201315 MJ\/kg (seco)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TRANSFORMACIONES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Procesos de Transformaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"procesos-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"proceso-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"proceso-header\">\ud83d\udd25 COMBUSTI\u00d3N DIRECTA<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"proceso-body\">\r\n                        <p>Reacci\u00f3n exot\u00e9rmica con ox\u00edgeno:<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                            \\[\r\n                            \\text{C}_x\\text{H}_y\\text{O}_z + \\text{O}_2 \\rightarrow \\text{CO}_2 + \\text{H}_2\\text{O} + \\text{Energ\u00eda}\r\n                            \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <p><strong>Eficiencia:<\/strong> 20\u201340%<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Estufas de le\u00f1a, calderas industriales<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"proceso-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"proceso-header\">\ud83d\udca8 GASIFICACI\u00d3N<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"proceso-body\">\r\n                        <p>Conversi\u00f3n a alta temperatura (700\u20131200\u00b0C) con ox\u00edgeno limitado:<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                            \\[\r\n                            \\text{Biomasa} + \\text{O}_2\/\\text{H}_2\\text{O} \\rightarrow \\text{CO} + \\text{H}_2 + \\text{CH}_4 + \\text{CO}_2\r\n                            \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <p><strong>Eficiencia:<\/strong> 60\u201380% (syngas)<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Planta de gasificaci\u00f3n de bagazo<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"proceso-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"proceso-header\">\ud83e\udda0 DIGESTI\u00d3N ANAEROBIA<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"proceso-body\">\r\n                        <p>Descomposici\u00f3n por bacterias en ausencia de ox\u00edgeno:<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                            \\[\r\n                            \\text{C}_6\\text{H}_{12}\\text{O}_6 \\rightarrow 3\\text{CH}_4 + 3\\text{CO}_2\r\n                            \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <p><strong>Eficiencia:<\/strong> 50\u201370% (biog\u00e1s)<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Biodigestores de esti\u00e9rcol<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: CICLO DE LA BIOMASSA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\">\r\n            <!-- CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>PAR\u00c1METROS<\/h3>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"tipoBiomasa\">Tipo de biomasa:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"tipoBiomasa\">\r\n                        <option value=\"madera\">Madera (20 MJ\/kg)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"bagazo\">Bagazo (18 MJ\/kg)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"bioetanol\">Bioetanol (27 MJ\/L)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"biogas\">Biog\u00e1s (22 MJ\/m\u00b3)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"masaBiomasa\">Cantidad (kg\/L\/m\u00b3):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"masaBiomasa\" min=\"1\" max=\"1000\" value=\"100\" step=\"1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"masaValue\">100<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"proceso\">Proceso:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"proceso\">\r\n                        <option value=\"combustion\">Combusti\u00f3n directa<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"gasificacion\">Gasificaci\u00f3n<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"digestion\">Digesti\u00f3n anaerobia<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"eficiencia\">Eficiencia (%):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"eficiencia\" min=\"10\" max=\"90\" value=\"30\" step=\"1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"eficienciaValue\">30%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <button class=\"btn-simular\" onclick=\"simularBiomasa()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6<\/span> SIMULAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n\r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarSimulador()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u21ba<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" id=\"svgBiomasa\">\r\n                    <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Sol y planta -->\r\n                    <g id=\"fotosintesis\">\r\n                        <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#FFEB3B\"\/>\r\n                        <path d=\"M80 130 L100 100 L120 130\" stroke=\"#FFC107\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                        <path d=\"M100 130 L100 160\" stroke=\"#4CAF50\" stroke-width=\"5\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"100\" y=\"180\" fill=\"#E0F2F1\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Fotos\u00edntesis<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Biomasa -->\r\n                    <g id=\"biomasaVisual\" transform=\"translate(250, 200)\">\r\n                        <rect id=\"biomasaRect\" x=\"-50\" y=\"-30\" width=\"100\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#8D6E63\" rx=\"10\"\/>\r\n                        <text id=\"biomasaText\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" fill=\"#FFCCBC\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Madera<\/text>\r\n                        <text id=\"biomasaMasa\" x=\"0\" y=\"25\" fill=\"#FFCCBC\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100 kg<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Proceso -->\r\n                    <g id=\"procesoVisual\" transform=\"translate(400, 200)\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                        <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#FF5722\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"0\" fill=\"#000\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"procesoText\">Combusti\u00f3n<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"25\" fill=\"#000\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"eficienciaText\">30%<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Productos -->\r\n                    <g id=\"productosVisual\" transform=\"translate(500, 200)\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"-40\" y=\"-30\" width=\"80\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#FFD600\" rx=\"10\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"-10\" fill=\"#000\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"productoText\">Electricidad<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"15\" fill=\"#000\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"energiaText\">0 MJ<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"35\" fill=\"#000\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"co2Text\">CO\u2082: 0 kg<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Flechas -->\r\n                    <path id=\"flecha1\" d=\"M150 130 L200 200\" stroke=\"#4CAF50\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#flecha)\" opacity=\"0\"\/>\r\n                    <path id=\"flecha2\" d=\"M300 200 L350 200\" stroke=\"#FF9800\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#flecha)\" opacity=\"0\"\/>\r\n                    <path id=\"flecha3\" d=\"M450 200 L500 200\" stroke=\"#F44336\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#flecha)\" opacity=\"0\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- CO2 -->\r\n                    <g id=\"co2Ciclo\">\r\n                        <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"50\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                            <animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"50;350;50\" dur=\"8s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" begin=\"indefinite\" id=\"animCO2\"\/>\r\n                        <\/circle>\r\n                        <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"70\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                            <animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"70;370;70\" dur=\"6s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" begin=\"indefinite\" id=\"animCO2_2\"\/>\r\n                        <\/circle>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Marcadores -->\r\n                    <defs>\r\n                        <marker id=\"flecha\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                            <path d=\"M0,0 L9,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#E0F2F1\"\/>\r\n                        <\/marker>\r\n                    <\/defs>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- DATOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>RESULTADOS<\/h3>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Tipo de biomasa:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTipo\">Madera<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Cantidad:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataMasa\">100 kg<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Proceso:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataProceso\">Combusti\u00f3n directa<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Energ\u00eda disponible:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEnergiaDisponible\">0 MJ<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Energ\u00eda \u00fatil:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEnergiaUtil\">0 MJ<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Emisiones CO\u2082:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEmisiones\">0 kg<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"impacto-ambiental\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udf31 IMPACTO AMBIENTAL<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"impacto-item\">\r\n                        <span>Carbono neutral:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"impacto-value\" id=\"impactoCarbono\">S\u00ed (ciclo cerrado)<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"impacto-item\">\r\n                        <span>Competencia con alimentos:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"impacto-value\" id=\"impactoAlimentos\">Media<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"impacto-item\">\r\n                        <span>Emisiones locales:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"impacto-value\" id=\"impactoLocales\">Altas (PM, NOx)<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- AN\u00c1LISIS DE SOSTENIBILIDAD -->\r\n    <section class=\"analisis-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span> AN\u00c1LISIS DE SOSTENIBILIDAD\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"analisis-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"analisis-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf0d COMPARACI\u00d3N CON OTRAS FUENTES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"grafica-barras\">\r\n                    <div class=\"barra\" style=\"--alto: 85%; --color: #4CAF50;\">\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-valor\">85%<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-etiqueta\">E\u00f3lica<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"barra\" style=\"--alto: 70%; --color: #FF9800;\">\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-valor\">70%<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-etiqueta\">Solar<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"barra\" style=\"--alto: 50%; --color: #8D6E63;\">\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-valor\">50%<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-etiqueta\">Biomasa<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"barra\" style=\"--alto: 30%; --color: #616161;\">\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-valor\">30%<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-etiqueta\">F\u00f3siles<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <p><strong>Eficiencia energ\u00e9tica neta<\/strong> (considerando ciclo completo)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"analisis-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcb0 COSTO POR ENERG\u00cdA (2025)<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-costos\">\r\n                    <table>\r\n                        <thead>\r\n                            <tr><th>Fuente<\/th><th>USD\/MWh<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                        <\/thead>\r\n                        <tbody>\r\n                            <tr><td>E\u00f3lica terrestre<\/td><td>40\u201360<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Solar fotovoltaica<\/td><td>30\u201350<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Biomasa (el\u00e9ctrica)<\/td><td>60\u2013120<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Gas natural<\/td><td>40\u201380<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Carb\u00f3n<\/td><td>50\u2013100<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <\/tbody>\r\n                    <\/table>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <p><strong>Nota:<\/strong> La biomasa tiene costos variables seg\u00fan disponibilidad local.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"analisis-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf31 EMISIONES DE CO\u2082 (g\/kWh)<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"grafica-circular\">\r\n                    <svg width=\"150\" height=\"150\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\r\n                        <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"45\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4CAF50\" stroke-width=\"10\" stroke-dasharray=\"283\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" id=\"circuloBiomasa\"\/>\r\n                        <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"45\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF5722\" stroke-width=\"10\" stroke-dasharray=\"283\" stroke-dashoffset=\"100\" id=\"circuloFosiles\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"50\" y=\"50\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dy=\"5\">35<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"50\" y=\"50\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dy=\"20\">g CO\u2082\/kWh<\/text>\r\n                    <\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"leyenda-grafica\">\r\n                    <div class=\"leyenda-item\"><span style=\"color: #4CAF50\">\u25cf<\/span> Biomasa: 35 g\/kWh<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"leyenda-item\"><span style=\"color: #FF5722\">\u25cf<\/span> F\u00f3siles: 820 g\/kWh<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: BIOMASSA Y ENERG\u00cdA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 proceso convierte biomasa en biog\u00e1s?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Combusti\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Gasificaci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Digesti\u00f3n anaerobia\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Pir\u00f3lisis\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> La <strong>digesti\u00f3n anaerobia<\/strong> usa bacterias para descomponer materia org\u00e1nica y producir biog\u00e1s (CH\u2084 + CO\u2082).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>Ejemplo: Biodigestores de esti\u00e9rcol animal o residuos agr\u00edcolas.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el principal componente del biog\u00e1s?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        CO\u2082\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        CH\u2084 (metano)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        H\u2082 (hidr\u00f3geno)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        O\u2082 (ox\u00edgeno)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> El biog\u00e1s contiene <strong>50\u201370% de metano (CH\u2084)<\/strong>, responsable de su poder calor\u00edfico.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>El CO\u2082 (30\u201350%) no es combustible, pero el CH\u2084 tiene un PCI de ~50 MJ\/kg.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 se considera a la biomasa \"carbono neutral\"?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        El CO\u2082 emitido fue previamente capturado por las plantas\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        No emite CO\u2082 al quemarse\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Absorbe m\u00e1s CO\u2082 del que emite\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Solo emite vapor de agua\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> La biomasa forma parte de un <strong>ciclo cerrado de carbono<\/strong>: el CO\u2082 emitido al quemarse fue capturado durante el crecimiento de las plantas.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>Sin embargo, esto solo aplica si la biomasa se gestiona <strong>sosteniblemente<\/strong> (sin deforestaci\u00f3n).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-results\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfc6 RESULTADOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                    Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                    Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">REINTENTAR<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>C\u00e1lculo de Energ\u00eda de Biomasa<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Se queman <strong>500 kg de bagazo<\/strong> (PCI = 18 MJ\/kg) en una caldera con eficiencia del <strong>35%<\/strong>. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Energ\u00eda total disponible (MJ).<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Energ\u00eda \u00fatil generada (MJ).<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Equivalente en kWh.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        E_{\\text{\u00fatil}} = m \\times \\text{PCI} \\times \\eta \\quad \\text{y} \\quad 1\\,\\text{kWh} = 3.6\\,\\text{MJ}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n paso a paso...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. \\(E_{\\text{total}} = 500\\,\\text{kg} \\times 18\\,\\text{MJ\/kg} = 9,000\\,\\text{MJ}\\)<br>\r\n                    2. \\(E_{\\text{\u00fatil}} = 9,000 \\times 0.35 = 3,150\\,\\text{MJ}\\)<br>\r\n                    3. \\(3,150\\,\\text{MJ} \\times \\frac{1\\,\\text{kWh}}{3.6\\,\\text{MJ}} = 875\\,\\text{kWh}\\)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>An\u00e1lisis de Sostenibilidad<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Comparar la biomasa con la energ\u00eda solar en:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li><strong>Disponibilidad:<\/strong> Biomasa (local, estacional) vs Solar (ub\u00edcua, intermitente).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Emisiones:<\/strong> Biomasa (35 g CO\u2082\/kWh) vs Solar (12 g CO\u2082\/kWh).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Uso de suelo:<\/strong> Biomasa (competencia con alimentos) vs Solar (sin competencia).<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>\u00bfEn qu\u00e9 contextos ser\u00eda preferible cada una?<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu an\u00e1lisis comparativo...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    <strong>Biomasa ser\u00eda preferible en:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    - Zonas rurales con residuos agr\u00edcolas\/forestales.<br>\r\n                    - Sistemas de cogeneraci\u00f3n (calor + electricidad).<br>\r\n                    - Cuando se requiere almacenamiento de energ\u00eda.<br><br>\r\n                    <strong>Energ\u00eda solar ser\u00eda preferible en:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    - Zonas con alta irradiaci\u00f3n solar.<br>\r\n                    - Aplicaciones donde se prioriza baja huella de carbono.<br>\r\n                    - Cuando no hay competencia por uso de suelo.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (3 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (2 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (1 pt)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>C\u00e1lculos correctos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Todas las operaciones y unidades<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Error en 1 c\u00e1lculo o unidad<\/td>\r\n                    <td>M\u00faltiples errores<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis comparativo<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Comparaci\u00f3n detallada con ejemplos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis parcial<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Sin comparaci\u00f3n clara<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Justificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Argumentos basados en datos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Justificaci\u00f3n gen\u00e9rica<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Sin justificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Tipos de biomasa:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Procesos de transformaci\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>An\u00e1lisis de sostenibilidad:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N CR\u00cdTICA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfCrees que la biomasa puede ser una soluci\u00f3n real para la transici\u00f3n energ\u00e9tica en tu pa\u00eds? Considera:<\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Disponibilidad de recursos biom\u00e1sicos locales<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Impacto en la seguridad alimentaria<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Tecnolog\u00edas disponibles y costos<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Pol\u00edticas de sostenibilidad existentes<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Argumenta tu postura con ejemplos...\" rows=\"4\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Repasar ciclo del carbono<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar tipos de biomasa<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83e\uddea PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Simular 3 escenarios en el simulador<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Resolver 2 problemas de eficiencia<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udcda INVESTIGACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Buscar casos de \u00e9xito de biomasa<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Analizar pol\u00edticas energ\u00e9ticas locales<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS CIENT\u00cdFICOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.irena.org\/bioenergy\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udf10 IRENA: Bioenerg\u00eda Global\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.eia.gov\/energyexplained\/bioenergy\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcda EIA: Explicaci\u00f3n de Bioenerg\u00eda\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.fao.org\/bioenergy\/en\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udf31 FAO: Biomasa y Seguridad Alimentaria\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT FUNCIONAL -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ BASE DE DATOS DE BIOMASSA\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nconst DATABASE_BIOMASSA = {\r\n    tipos: {\r\n        madera: {\r\n            nombre: \"Madera\",\r\n            pci: 18, \/\/ MJ\/kg\r\n            emisiones: 0.035, \/\/ kg CO\u2082\/MJ\r\n            competenciaAlimentos: \"Baja\",\r\n            emisionesLocales: \"Altas\"\r\n        },\r\n        bagazo: {\r\n            nombre: \"Bagazo de ca\u00f1a\",\r\n            pci: 18, \/\/ MJ\/kg\r\n            emisiones: 0.030, \/\/ kg CO\u2082\/MJ\r\n            competenciaAlimentos: \"Nula\",\r\n            emisionesLocales: \"Medias\"\r\n        },\r\n        bioetanol: {\r\n            nombre: \"Bioetanol\",\r\n            pci: 27, \/\/ MJ\/L\r\n            emisiones: 0.025, \/\/ kg CO\u2082\/MJ\r\n            competenciaAlimentos: \"Alta\",\r\n            emisionesLocales: \"Bajas\"\r\n        },\r\n        biogas: {\r\n            nombre: \"Biog\u00e1s\",\r\n            pci: 22, \/\/ MJ\/m\u00b3\r\n            emisiones: 0.020, \/\/ kg CO\u2082\/MJ\r\n            competenciaAlimentos: \"Media\",\r\n            emisionesLocales: \"Bajas\"\r\n        }\r\n    },\r\n    procesos: {\r\n        combustion: {\r\n            nombre: \"Combusti\u00f3n directa\",\r\n            eficienciaBase: 30,\r\n            emisionesFactor: 1.0\r\n        },\r\n        gasificacion: {\r\n            nombre: \"Gasificaci\u00f3n\",\r\n            eficienciaBase: 60,\r\n            emisionesFactor: 0.8\r\n        },\r\n        digestion: {\r\n            nombre: \"Digesti\u00f3n anaerobia\",\r\n            eficienciaBase: 50,\r\n            emisionesFactor: 0.6\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DE BIOMASSA (FUNCIONAL)\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nfunction simularBiomasa() {\r\n    \/\/ Obtener par\u00e1metros\r\n    const tipo = document.getElementById('tipoBiomasa').value;\r\n    const masa = parseInt(document.getElementById('masaBiomasa').value);\r\n    const proceso = document.getElementById('proceso').value;\r\n    const eficiencia = parseInt(document.getElementById('eficiencia').value);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Datos del tipo de biomasa\r\n    const tipoData = DATABASE_BIOMASSA.tipos[tipo];\r\n    const procesoData = DATABASE_BIOMASSA.procesos[proceso];\r\n\r\n    \/\/ C\u00e1lculos\r\n    const energiaDisponible = masa * tipoData.pci;\r\n    const energiaUtil = energiaDisponible * (eficiencia \/ 100);\r\n    const emisionesCO2 = energiaUtil * tipoData.emisiones * procesoData.emisionesFactor;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('biomasaText').textContent = tipoData.nombre;\r\n    document.getElementById('biomasaMasa').textContent = `${masa} ${tipo === 'bioetanol' ? 'L' : tipo === 'biogas' ? 'm\u00b3' : 'kg'}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('procesoText').textContent = procesoData.nombre;\r\n    document.getElementById('eficienciaText').textContent = `${eficiencia}%`;\r\n    document.getElementById('productoText').textContent = proceso === 'digestion' ? 'Biog\u00e1s' : 'Electricidad';\r\n    document.getElementById('energiaText').textContent = `${energiaUtil.toFixed(1)} MJ`;\r\n    document.getElementById('co2Text').textContent = `CO\u2082: ${emisionesCO2.toFixed(1)} kg`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n    document.getElementById('dataTipo').textContent = tipoData.nombre;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataMasa').textContent = `${masa} ${tipo === 'bioetanol' ? 'L' : tipo === 'biogas' ? 'm\u00b3' : 'kg'}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataProceso').textContent = procesoData.nombre;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEnergiaDisponible').textContent = `${energiaDisponible.toFixed(1)} MJ`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEnergiaUtil').textContent = `${energiaUtil.toFixed(1)} MJ`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEmisiones').textContent = `${emisionesCO2.toFixed(1)} kg CO\u2082`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Impacto ambiental\r\n    document.getElementById('impactoCarbono').textContent = \"S\u00ed (ciclo cerrado)\";\r\n    document.getElementById('impactoAlimentos').textContent = tipoData.competenciaAlimentos;\r\n    document.getElementById('impactoLocales').textContent = tipoData.emisionesLocales;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Animaciones\r\n    document.getElementById('flecha1').style.opacity = \"1\";\r\n    document.getElementById('flecha2').style.opacity = \"1\";\r\n    document.getElementById('flecha3').style.opacity = \"1\";\r\n    document.getElementById('procesoVisual').style.opacity = \"1\";\r\n    document.getElementById('productosVisual').style.opacity = \"1\";\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Animar CO\u2082\r\n    document.getElementById('animCO2').beginElement();\r\n    document.getElementById('animCO2_2').beginElement();\r\n\r\n    console.log(`\ud83d\udd2c Simulaci\u00f3n: ${tipoData.nombre} (${masa} ${tipo === 'bioetanol' ? 'L' : tipo === 'biogas' ? 'm\u00b3' : 'kg'}) \u2192 ${procesoData.nombre}`);\r\n    console.log(`   Energ\u00eda disponible: ${energiaDisponible.toFixed(1)} MJ`);\r\n    console.log(`   Energ\u00eda \u00fatil: ${energiaUtil.toFixed(1)} MJ (${eficiencia}% eficiencia)`);\r\n    console.log(`   Emisiones CO\u2082: ${emisionesCO2.toFixed(1)} kg`);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarSimulador() {\r\n    \/\/ Restaurar controles\r\n    document.getElementById('tipoBiomasa').value = \"madera\";\r\n    document.getElementById('masaBiomasa').value = 100;\r\n    document.getElementById('proceso').value = \"combustion\";\r\n    document.getElementById('eficiencia').value = 30;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar textos\r\n    document.getElementById('masaValue').textContent = \"100\";\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Restaurar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('biomasaText').textContent = \"Madera\";\r\n    document.getElementById('biomasaMasa').textContent = \"100 kg\";\r\n    document.getElementById('procesoText').textContent = \"Combusti\u00f3n directa\";\r\n    document.getElementById('eficienciaText').textContent = \"30%\";\r\n    document.getElementById('productoText').textContent = \"Electricidad\";\r\n    document.getElementById('energiaText').textContent = \"0 MJ\";\r\n    document.getElementById('co2Text').textContent = \"CO\u2082: 0 kg\";\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Ocultar elementos\r\n    document.getElementById('flecha1').style.opacity = \"0\";\r\n    document.getElementById('flecha2').style.opacity = \"0\";\r\n    document.getElementById('flecha3').style.opacity = \"0\";\r\n    document.getElementById('procesoVisual').style.opacity = \"0\";\r\n    document.getElementById('productosVisual').style.opacity = \"0\";\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Restaurar datos\r\n    document.getElementById('dataTipo').textContent = \"Madera\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataMasa').textContent = \"100 kg\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataProceso').textContent = \"Combusti\u00f3n directa\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEnergiaDisponible').textContent = \"0 MJ\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEnergiaUtil').textContent = \"0 MJ\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEmisiones').textContent = \"0 kg CO\u2082\";\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Impacto ambiental\r\n    document.getElementById('impactoCarbono').textContent = \"S\u00ed (ciclo cerrado)\";\r\n    document.getElementById('impactoAlimentos').textContent = \"Baja\";\r\n    document.getElementById('impactoLocales').textContent = \"Altas\";\r\n\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\udd04 Simulador reiniciado\");\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Event listeners para controles\r\ndocument.getElementById('masaBiomasa').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    document.getElementById('masaValue').textContent = this.value;\r\n});\r\n\r\ndocument.getElementById('eficiencia').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    document.getElementById('eficienciaValue').textContent = this.value + '%';\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO (FUNCIONAL)\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas respondidas\r\n        const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n\r\n        if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n    let feedback;\r\n    if (correctas === total) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83c\udf1f Excelente! Dominas los conceptos de biomasa y sus aplicaciones.\";\r\n    } else if (correctas >= total\/2) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Bueno. Revisa los procesos de transformaci\u00f3n y el ciclo del carbono.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas repasar. Enf\u00f3cate en la digesti\u00f3n anaerobia y las emisiones.\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = \"0\/3\";\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = \"Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\";\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN (FUNCIONAL)\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    if (solucion.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'none';\r\n    } else {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N (FUNCIONAL)\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n\r\n    let mensaje = `\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n`;\r\n    mensaje += `Tipos de biomasa: ${slider1}\/5\\n`;\r\n    mensaje += `Procesos de transformaci\u00f3n: ${slider2}\/5\\n`;\r\n    mensaje += `An\u00e1lisis de sostenibilidad: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n`;\r\n    mensaje += `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n`;\r\n\r\n    if (promedio >= 4) {\r\n        mensaje += \"\ud83c\udf1f Excelente comprensi\u00f3n! Puedes analizar cr\u00edticamente la biomasa como fuente energ\u00e9tica.\";\r\n    } else if (promedio >= 3) {\r\n        mensaje += \"\ud83d\udc4d Bueno, pero profundiza en los impactos ambientales y la eficiencia de los procesos.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        mensaje += \"\ud83d\udcda Revisa los fundamentos del ciclo del carbono y los tipos de biomasa.\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    alert(mensaje);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83c\udf31 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: Biomasa inicializada\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\udd2c Simulador de ciclo de biomasa listo\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\u2753 Quiz con 3 preguntas sobre biomasa\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\udcca Problemas tipo examen con soluciones detalladas\");\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar simulador\r\nreiniciarSimulador();\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Biomasa es...","respuesta":"Materia org\u00e1nica renovable"},{"enunciado":"Ejemplo s\u00f3lido","respuesta":"Madera, bagazo"},{"enunciado":"Carbono neutral si...","respuesta":"Repoblaci\u00f3n = consumo"},{"enunciado":"Biog\u00e1s principal componente","respuesta":"Metano (CH\u2084)"},{"enunciado":"Bioetanol de...","respuesta":"Ma\u00edz, ca\u00f1a"},{"enunciado":"M\u00e9xico: bagazo genera ~","respuesta":"1,000 MW"},{"enunciado":"Ventaja ambiental","respuesta":"Reduce residuos, CO\u2082 neutral"},{"enunciado":"Riesgo si no sostenible","respuesta":"Deforestaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"% energ\u00eda primaria M\u00e9xico","respuesta":"~5%"},{"enunciado":"Poder calor\u00edfico madera seca","respuesta":"~16 MJ\/kg"},{"enunciado":"Eficiencia t\u00edpica central biomasa","respuesta":"~30%"},{"enunciado":"1 m\u00b3 biog\u00e1s \u2248","respuesta":"6 kWh"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Biomasa es...","opciones":["Renovable","F\u00f3sil","Nuclear","Solar"],"correcta":"Renovable"},{"pregunta":"Proviene de...","opciones":["Org\u00e1nica","Petr\u00f3leo","Uranio","Viento"],"correcta":"Org\u00e1nica"},{"pregunta":"Carbono neutral si...","opciones":["Sostenible","No","Siempre","Nunca"],"correcta":"Sostenible"},{"pregunta":"Ejemplo biomasa","opciones":["Bagazo","Carb\u00f3n","Gas natural","Hidr\u00f3geno"],"correcta":"Bagazo"},{"pregunta":"Biog\u00e1s contiene...","opciones":["CH\u2084","CO\u2082 solo","O\u2082","N\u2082"],"correcta":"CH\u2084"},{"pregunta":"Bioetanol es...","opciones":["L\u00edquido","S\u00f3lido","Gas","Plasma"],"correcta":"L\u00edquido"},{"pregunta":"Combusti\u00f3n produce...","opciones":["CO\u2082 + H\u2082O","O\u2082","CH\u2084","H\u2082"],"correcta":"CO\u2082 + H\u2082O"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico usa bagazo en...","opciones":["Ingenios","Refiner\u00edas","Minas","Aeropuertos"],"correcta":"Ingenios"},{"pregunta":"Ventaja clave","opciones":["Reduce residuos","Aumenta CO\u2082","No renovable","Cara"],"correcta":"Reduce residuos"},{"pregunta":"Densidad energ\u00e9tica vs carb\u00f3n","opciones":["Menor","Mayor","Igual","Cero"],"correcta":"Menor"},{"pregunta":"Eficiencia combusti\u00f3n biomasa","opciones":["~30%","80%","10%","100%"],"correcta":"~30%"},{"pregunta":"Poder calor\u00edfico madera seca","opciones":["~16 MJ\/kg","50 MJ\/kg","5 MJ\/kg","100 MJ\/kg"],"correcta":"~16 MJ\/kg"},{"pregunta":"1 m\u00b3 biog\u00e1s \u2248","opciones":["6 kWh","1 kWh","60 kWh","0.6 kWh"],"correcta":"6 kWh"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: % energ\u00eda primaria","opciones":["~5%","50%","1%","20%"],"correcta":"~5%"},{"pregunta":"Digesti\u00f3n anaerobia produce...","opciones":["Biog\u00e1s","Bioetanol","Biodi\u00e9sel","Syngas"],"correcta":"Biog\u00e1s"},{"pregunta":"Riesgo ambiental","opciones":["Deforestaci\u00f3n","Lluvia \u00e1cida","Tsunami","Terremoto"],"correcta":"Deforestaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Biomasa s\u00f3lida m\u00e1s com\u00fan","opciones":["Madera","Petr\u00f3leo","Carb\u00f3n","Uranio"],"correcta":"Madera"},{"pregunta":"CO\u2082 biomasa vs f\u00f3sil","opciones":["Ciclo cerrado","Acumula","Igual","Cero"],"correcta":"Ciclo cerrado"},{"pregunta":"Central biomasa usa...","opciones":["Caldera + turbina","Paneles","Turbinas e\u00f3licas","Reactores"],"correcta":"Caldera + turbina"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: biomasa en...","opciones":["Joules","Calor\u00edas","BTU","kWh"],"correcta":"Joules"},{"pregunta":"Eficiencia gasificaci\u00f3n biomasa","opciones":["~70% (syngas)","30%","90%","10%"],"correcta":"~70% (syngas)"},{"pregunta":"Contenido energ\u00e9tico esti\u00e9rcol seco","opciones":["~12 MJ\/kg","50 MJ\/kg","5 MJ\/kg","100 MJ\/kg"],"correcta":"~12 MJ\/kg"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: potencial biomasa","opciones":["~3,000 MW","100 MW","30,000 MW","0 MW"],"correcta":"~3,000 MW"},{"pregunta":"Certificaci\u00f3n sostenible","opciones":["FSC, RSPO","ISO 9001","API","IEC"],"correcta":"FSC, RSPO"},{"pregunta":"Emisiones PM10 biomasa vs carb\u00f3n","opciones":["Mayor (sin filtro)","Menor","Igual","Cero"],"correcta":"Mayor (sin filtro)"},{"pregunta":"Biodi\u00e9sel de...","opciones":["Aceites vegetales","Gasolina","Agua","Aire"],"correcta":"Aceites vegetales"},{"pregunta":"Ciclo combinado biomasa-gas","opciones":["~50% eficiencia","20%","80%","100%"],"correcta":"~50% eficiencia"},{"pregunta":"Biomasa en cogeneraci\u00f3n","opciones":["Calor + electricidad","Solo luz","Solo fr\u00edo","Solo sonido"],"correcta":"Calor + electricidad"},{"pregunta":"1 ha ca\u00f1a \u2192 bagazo \u2248","opciones":["10 ton\/a\u00f1o","1 ton","100 ton","0 ton"],"correcta":"10 ton\/a\u00f1o"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: 1 GJ =","opciones":["10\u2079 J","10\u2076 J","10\u00b9\u00b2 J","10\u00b3 J"],"correcta":"10\u2079 J"}]},{"materia":"F\u00edsica I","slug":"evolucion-concepto-energia","titulo":"Evoluci\u00f3n del Concepto de Energ\u00eda: De la Vis Viva al Joule","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-fisica-energia\" data-tema=\"evolucion-energia\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n            EVOLUCI\u00d3N DEL CONCEPTO DE ENERG\u00cdA\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            De la <em>Vis Viva<\/em> de Leibniz al <em>Joule<\/em> moderno\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Explicar la <em>Vis Viva<\/em> de Leibniz<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Diferenciarla de la teor\u00eda de Descartes (\\(mv\\) vs \\(mv^2\\))<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar el aporte de Thomas Young<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Introducci\u00f3n del t\u00e9rmino <em>energ\u00eda<\/em> en 1807<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Comprender el trabajo de Coriolis<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Definici\u00f3n de <em>trabajo<\/em> como \\(W = F \\cdot d \\cdot \\cos \\theta\\)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Dominar el experimento de Joule<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Equivalencia mec\u00e1nico-cal\u00f3rica: \\(1 \\text{ cal} = 4.184 \\text{ J}\\)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd0b Bater\u00edas Modernas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Basadas en la conservaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda (Ley de Joule)<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Eficiencia: 90-95%<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\ude97 Motores El\u00e9ctricos<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Transforman energ\u00eda el\u00e9ctrica en mec\u00e1nica (Coriolis)<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Rendimiento: 85-90%<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd25 Centrales T\u00e9rmicas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Aplican la equivalencia calor-trabajo (Joule)<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Potencia: 100-1000 MW<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- L\u00cdNEA DEL TIEMPO INTERACTIVA -->\r\n        <div class=\"timeline-container\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 L\u00cdNEA DEL TIEMPO HIST\u00d3RICA<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"timeline\">\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-year=\"1686\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-icon\">\ud83d\udd39<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\r\n                        <h4>Leibniz<\/h4>\r\n                        <p><strong>Vis Viva<\/strong>: \\(mv^2\\)<\/p>\r\n                        <p>Contra Descartes (\\(mv\\))<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-year=\"1807\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-icon\">\ud83d\udd39<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\r\n                        <h4>Thomas Young<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Introduce el t\u00e9rmino <em>energ\u00eda<\/em><\/p>\r\n                        <p>\\(E = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-year=\"1829\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-icon\">\ud83d\udd39<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\r\n                        <h4>Coriolis<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Define <em>trabajo<\/em>:<\/p>\r\n                        <p>\\(W = F \\cdot d \\cdot \\cos \\theta\\)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-year=\"1843\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-icon\">\ud83d\udd39<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\r\n                        <h4>James Joule<\/h4>\r\n                        <p><strong>Equivalencia mec\u00e1nico-cal\u00f3rica<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <p>\\(1 \\text{ cal} = 4.184 \\text{ J}\\)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TABLA COMPARATIVA -->\r\n        <div class=\"tabla-comparativa\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca COMPARATIVA DE APORTES<\/h3>\r\n            <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>Cient\u00edfico<\/th>\r\n                        <th>A\u00f1o<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Aporte<\/th>\r\n                        <th>F\u00f3rmula<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Leibniz<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1686<\/td>\r\n                        <td><em>Vis Viva<\/em> (\\(mv^2\\))<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\\[ E \\propto mv^2 \\]<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Thomas Young<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1807<\/td>\r\n                        <td>T\u00e9rmino <em>energ\u00eda<\/em><\/td>\r\n                        <td>\\[ E = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2 \\]<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Coriolis<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1829<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Definici\u00f3n de <em>trabajo<\/em><\/td>\r\n                        <td>\\[ W = F \\cdot d \\cdot \\cos \\theta \\]<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>James Joule<\/td>\r\n                        <td>1843<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Equivalencia calor-trabajo<\/td>\r\n                        <td>\\[ 1 \\text{ cal} = 4.184 \\text{ J} \\]<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- EXPERIMENTO DE JOULE -->\r\n        <div class=\"experimento-joule\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83e\uddea EXPERIMENTO DE JOULE<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Pesas caen \u2192 giran paletas \u2192 agitan agua \u2192 \u0394T medida \u2192 <strong>trabajo mec\u00e1nico = calor generado<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                \\[\r\n                    W = mgh = Q = mc\\Delta T \\quad \\Rightarrow \\quad J = \\frac{W}{Q}\r\n                \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ejemplo\">\r\n                <p><strong>Ejemplo (1845):<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                <p>1 kg cae 1 m \u2192 9.8 J \u2192 eleva temperatura de 1 g de agua ~0.0023 \u00b0C \u2192 <strong>4.18 J\/cal<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"visual\">\r\n                <svg class=\"aparato-joule\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\">\r\n                    <!-- Aparato de Joule -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#f0f0f0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"10\"\/>\r\n                    <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"150\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#42A5F5\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"150;180;150\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"200\" y=\"220\" fill=\"#1565C0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Paletas<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"200\" y=\"240\" fill=\"#0D47A1\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W \u2192 Q<\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n                <p><em>SVG: R\u00e9plica del aparato de Joule.<\/em><\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: EXPERIMENTO DE JOULE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"experimento-joule\">\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>\u2699\ufe0f CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"masaPesas\">Masa de las pesas (kg):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"masaPesas\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"5\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"valorMasa\">1 kg<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"alturaCaida\">Altura de ca\u00edda (m):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"alturaCaida\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"10\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"valorAltura\">1 m<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"masaAgua\">Masa de agua (g):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"masaAgua\" min=\"10\" max=\"1000\" step=\"10\" value=\"100\">\r\n                    <span id=\"valorMasaAgua\">100 g<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-simular\" onclick=\"simularExperimento()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6\ufe0f<\/span> SIMULAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <svg id=\"simulacionJoule\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\">\r\n                    <!-- Aparato -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#f0f0f0\" stroke=\"#333\" rx=\"10\"\/>\r\n                    <circle id=\"paletas\" cx=\"200\" cy=\"150\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#42A5F5\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"200\" y=\"220\" fill=\"#1565C0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Paletas<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"200\" y=\"240\" fill=\"#0D47A1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"resultadoSimulacion\">W \u2192 Q<\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca DATOS DE SIMULACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Trabajo (J):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTrabajo\">0<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Calor generado (cal):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataCalor\">0<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">\u0394T (\u00b0C):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataDeltaT\">0<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Equivalente (J\/cal):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEquivalente\">4.184<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 propuso Leibniz en 1686?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        \\(E = mc^2\\)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        \\(E = mgh\\)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        \\(mv^2\\) (<em>Vis Viva<\/em>)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        \\(W = F \\cdot d\\)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Leibniz propuso \\(mv^2\\) como medida del movimiento.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la secci\u00f3n sobre <em>Vis Viva<\/em>.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 introdujo Thomas Young en 1807?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        El t\u00e9rmino <em>fuerza<\/em>\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        El t\u00e9rmino <em>energ\u00eda<\/em>\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        La f\u00f3rmula \\(W = F \\cdot d\\)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        La constante de Joule\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Young introdujo el t\u00e9rmino <em>energ\u00eda<\/em>.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la secci\u00f3n sobre Thomas Young.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTAS 3-30 (similares) -->\r\n            <!-- ... -->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/30\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados.\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR <em>Vis Viva<\/em> CON ENERG\u00cdA CIN\u00c9TICA MODERNA<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"Leibniz propuso \\(E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\)\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Leibniz propuso \\(mv^2\\) (<em>Vis Viva<\/em>), sin el \\(\\frac{1}{2}\\). Coriolis a\u00f1adi\u00f3 el factor en 1829.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <!-- M\u00c1S ERRORES -->\r\n            <!-- ... -->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>C\u00e1lculo de Equivalente Mec\u00e1nico<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Si 2 kg de pesas caen 5 m y elevan la temperatura de 200 g de agua en 0.1 \u00b0C, calcula el equivalente mec\u00e1nico del calor en J\/cal.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"6\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">\r\n                    \u2705 VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \\(W = mgh = 2 \\cdot 9.8 \\cdot 5 = 98 \\text{ J}\\)<br>\r\n                    \\(Q = mc\\Delta T = 200 \\cdot 1 \\cdot 0.1 = 20 \\text{ cal}\\)<br>\r\n                    \\(J = \\frac{W}{Q} = \\frac{98}{20} = 4.9 \\text{ J\/cal}\\)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <!-- PROBLEMAS 2-12 -->\r\n            <!-- ... -->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n de <em>Vis Viva<\/em>:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <!-- M\u00c1S SLIDERS -->\r\n                <!-- ... -->\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcda RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/energy-forms-and-changes\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udd17 Simulador PhET: Formas de Energ\u00eda\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bipm.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udd17 BIPM: Definici\u00f3n del Joule (2025)\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n    <script>\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE SIMULACI\u00d3N DEL EXPERIMENTO DE JOULE\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction simularExperimento() {\r\n    const masaPesas = parseFloat(document.getElementById('masaPesas').value);\r\n    const alturaCaida = parseFloat(document.getElementById('alturaCaida').value);\r\n    const masaAgua = parseFloat(document.getElementById('masaAgua').value);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ C\u00e1lculos f\u00edsicos\r\n    const trabajo = masaPesas * 9.8 * alturaCaida; \/\/ W = mgh (J)\r\n    const calor = trabajo \/ 4.184; \/\/ Q = W \/ J (cal)\r\n    const deltaT = calor \/ masaAgua; \/\/ \u0394T = Q \/ mc (\u00b0C)\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar datos en la interfaz\r\n    document.getElementById('dataTrabajo').textContent = trabajo.toFixed(2);\r\n    document.getElementById('dataCalor').textContent = calor.toFixed(2);\r\n    document.getElementById('dataDeltaT').textContent = deltaT.toFixed(4);\r\n    document.getElementById('resultadoSimulacion').textContent =\r\n        `${trabajo.toFixed(2)} J \u2192 ${calor.toFixed(2)} cal (\u0394T = ${deltaT.toFixed(4)} \u00b0C)`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de las paletas\r\n    const paletas = document.getElementById('paletas');\r\n    paletas.setAttribute('cy', '180');\r\n    setTimeout(() => paletas.setAttribute('cy', '150'), 500);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar valores mostrados en los controles\r\n    document.getElementById('valorMasa').textContent = `${masaPesas} kg`;\r\n    document.getElementById('valorAltura').textContent = `${alturaCaida} m`;\r\n    document.getElementById('valorMasaAgua').textContent = `${masaAgua} g`;\r\n\r\n    console.log(`\ud83d\udd25 Simulaci\u00f3n: ${masaPesas} kg \u00d7 ${alturaCaida} m \u2192 ${trabajo.toFixed(2)} J \u2192 ${deltaT.toFixed(4)} \u00b0C`);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE QUIZ INTERACTIVO (30 PREGUNTAS)\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            \/\/ Marcar la opci\u00f3n correcta\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n        verificarCompletadoQuiz();\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction verificarCompletadoQuiz() {\r\n    const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n    const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q =>\r\n        q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n    );\r\n\r\n    if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n        quizCompletado = true;\r\n        mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n    const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n    let feedback = \"\";\r\n    if (porcentaje >= 90) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas la evoluci\u00f3n del concepto de energ\u00eda.\";\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 70) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero repasa los conceptos clave.\";\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 50) {\r\n        feedback = \"\u26a0\ufe0f Necesitas estudiar m\u00e1s. Revisa la secci\u00f3n te\u00f3rica.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\ude15 Vuelve a leer la lecci\u00f3n y practica con el simulador.\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE ERRORES COMUNES INTERACTIVOS\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction toggleError(header) {\r\n    const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n\r\n    if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n    } else {\r\n        content.style.display = 'block';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N METACOGNITIVA\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n\r\n    alert(\r\n        `\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Comprensi\u00f3n de Vis Viva: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `Dominio de Joule: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `Aplicaci\u00f3n pr\u00e1ctica: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Recomendaci\u00f3n: Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`\r\n    );\r\n\r\n    console.log(`\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n: [${slider1}, ${slider2}, ${slider3}]`);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE OBJETIVOS INTERACTIVOS\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n        this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n        const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n        checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n        checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : '';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE TABLA INTERACTIVA\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(row => {\r\n    row.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(r => {\r\n            r.classList.remove('selected');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar fila seleccionada\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n: Evoluci\u00f3n del Concepto de Energ\u00eda\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83c\udfae Simulador, Quiz y Herramientas interactivas listas\");\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Leibniz: vis viva =","respuesta":"mv\u00b2"},{"enunciado":"Young introdujo...","respuesta":"T\u00e9rmino \"energ\u00eda\""},{"enunciado":"Coriolis: trabajo =","respuesta":"F\u00b7d"},{"enunciado":"Joule: constante =","respuesta":"4.184 J\/cal"},{"enunciado":"Experimento Joule mide...","respuesta":"\u0394T del agua"},{"enunciado":"1 cal =","respuesta":"4.184 J"},{"enunciado":"Descartes propuso...","respuesta":"mv (err\u00f3neo)"},{"enunciado":"A\u00f1o experimento Joule","respuesta":"1843\u20131850"},{"enunciado":"1\u00aa Ley Termodin\u00e1mica","respuesta":"Conservaci\u00f3n energ\u00eda"},{"enunciado":"E_k moderna =","respuesta":"\u00bdmv\u00b2"},{"enunciado":"Unidad joule desde","respuesta":"1948 (CGPM)"},{"enunciado":"Mayer predijo equivalencia en","respuesta":"1842"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Leibniz propuso...","opciones":["mv\u00b2","mv","F\u00b7d","mgh"],"correcta":"mv\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"Young introdujo...","opciones":["Energ\u00eda","Trabajo","Calor","Fuerza"],"correcta":"Energ\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"Coriolis defini\u00f3...","opciones":["Trabajo","Energ\u00eda","Vis viva","Potencia"],"correcta":"Trabajo"},{"pregunta":"Joule midi\u00f3...","opciones":["Equivalencia calor-trabajo","Velocidad luz","Gravedad","Magnetismo"],"correcta":"Equivalencia calor-trabajo"},{"pregunta":"Vis viva =","opciones":["2E_k","E_k","E_p","W"],"correcta":"2E_k"},{"pregunta":"1 cal =","opciones":["4.184 J","1 J","10 J","0.239 J"],"correcta":"4.184 J"},{"pregunta":"Experimento Joule us\u00f3...","opciones":["Paletas en agua","Bombilla","Motor","Panel solar"],"correcta":"Paletas en agua"},{"pregunta":"Descartes cre\u00eda en...","opciones":["mv","mv\u00b2","F\u00b7d","mgh"],"correcta":"mv"},{"pregunta":"Unidad SI desde...","opciones":["1948","1800","1900","2000"],"correcta":"1948"},{"pregunta":"Joule naci\u00f3 en...","opciones":["1818","1700","1850","1900"],"correcta":"1818"},{"pregunta":"E_k = \u00bdmv\u00b2 introducido por...","opciones":["Coriolis","Leibniz","Young","Joule"],"correcta":"Coriolis"},{"pregunta":"Mayer predijo equivalencia en...","opciones":["1842","1686","1807","1948"],"correcta":"1842"},{"pregunta":"Helmholtz formul\u00f3...","opciones":["Conservaci\u00f3n energ\u00eda","2\u00aa Ley","Relatividad","\u00d3ptica"],"correcta":"Conservaci\u00f3n energ\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"1 J = ... erg","opciones":["10\u2077","10\u2076","10\u2078","10\u2075"],"correcta":"10\u2077"},{"pregunta":"Constante Joule \u2248","opciones":["4.184 J\/cal","1 J\/cal","4.184 cal\/J","10 J\/cal"],"correcta":"4.184 J\/cal"},{"pregunta":"SI 2019 redefini\u00f3 J por...","opciones":["Constantes fundamentales","Prototipo kg","Metro","Segundo"],"correcta":"Constantes fundamentales"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo = F\u00b7d\u00b7cos\u03b8 introducido por...","opciones":["Coriolis","Newton","Young","Joule"],"correcta":"Coriolis"},{"pregunta":"Primera menci\u00f3n \"energ\u00eda\" en ingl\u00e9s","opciones":["Young 1807","Joule 1843","Leibniz 1686","Arist\u00f3teles"],"correcta":"Young 1807"},{"pregunta":"Joule midi\u00f3 \u0394T con...","opciones":["Term\u00f3metro","Bar\u00f3metro","Higr\u00f3metro","Anem\u00f3metro"],"correcta":"Term\u00f3metro"},{"pregunta":"1\u00aa Ley Termodin\u00e1mica es...","opciones":["Conservaci\u00f3n energ\u00eda","Entrop\u00eda","Carnot","Boltzmann"],"correcta":"Conservaci\u00f3n energ\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"Vis viva de Leibniz =","opciones":["2E_k","E_k","E_p","W"],"correcta":"2E_k"},{"pregunta":"Error Descartes: conservaci\u00f3n de...","opciones":["mv","mv\u00b2","F","m"],"correcta":"mv"},{"pregunta":"Joule public\u00f3 resultados en...","opciones":["1843\u20131878","1700","1900","2000"],"correcta":"1843\u20131878"},{"pregunta":"Valor exacto constante Joule","opciones":["4.184 J\/cal","4.2 J\/cal","1 J\/cal","4184 J\/kg"],"correcta":"4.184 J\/cal"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: J =","opciones":["c\u00b2 \u0394m","F\u00b7d","P\u00b7t","k\u00b7T"],"correcta":"F\u00b7d"},{"pregunta":"Contribuy\u00f3 a unificaci\u00f3n f\u00edsica","opciones":["Joule","Newton","Maxwell","Einstein"],"correcta":"Joule"},{"pregunta":"Calor\u00eda definida como...","opciones":["Calor para 1g agua +1\u00b0C","1 J","1 kWh","1 eV"],"correcta":"Calor para 1g agua +1\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"BIPM adopt\u00f3 J en...","opciones":["1948 (9\u00aa CGPM)","1889","1960","2019"],"correcta":"1948 (9\u00aa CGPM)"},{"pregunta":"Equivalencia exacta (2019)","opciones":["4.184 J = 1 cal","4.186 J = 1 cal","1 J = 1 cal","4 J = 1 cal"],"correcta":"4.184 J = 1 cal"},{"pregunta":"Principio fundamental establecido","opciones":["Conservaci\u00f3n energ\u00eda","Inercia","Acci\u00f3n-reacci\u00f3n","Gravitaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Conservaci\u00f3n energ\u00eda"}]},{"materia":"F\u00edsica I","slug":"energia-cinetica","titulo":"Energ\u00eda Cin\u00e9tica: Del Movimiento a la Relatividad","contenido":"<!-- LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK: ENERG\u00cdA CIN\u00c9TICA -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-fisica-ek\" data-tema=\"energia-cinetica\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n            ENERG\u00cdA CIN\u00c9TICA: EL PODER DEL MOVIMIENTO\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            De la f\u00f3rmula cl\u00e1sica \\(E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\) a la relatividad einsteiniana\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Derivar la f\u00f3rmula \\(E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Desde el teorema trabajo-energ\u00eda<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar colisiones el\u00e1sticas\/inel\u00e1sticas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Conservaci\u00f3n de \\(E_k\\) y momento lineal<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar el teorema trabajo-energ\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Calcular \\(W_{neto} = \\Delta E_k\\)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Comparar \\(E_k\\) cl\u00e1sica vs relativista<\/h3>\r\n                <p>L\u00edmite \\(E_k^{rel} \\approx E_k^{clas}\\) para \\(v \\ll c\\)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACIONES EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\ude97 Seguridad Vial<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Dise\u00f1o de zonas de deformaci\u00f3n basadas en \\(E_k\\)<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Reducci\u00f3n del 70% en fatalidades<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\ude80 Cohetes Espaciales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>C\u00e1lculo de \\(E_k\\) para maniobras orbitales<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">\\(\\Delta v = 9.3\\) km\/s para LEO<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfbe Deportes<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Optimizaci\u00f3n de raquetas y palos usando \\(E_k\\)<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Velocidad r\u00e9cord: 263 km\/h (tenis)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- F\u00d3RMULA Y PROPIEDADES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. F\u00f3rmula Fundamental<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                \\[\r\n                E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\r\n                \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"propiedades-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Dependencia Masiva<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Proporcional a <strong>m<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo\">Doblar \\(m\\) \u2192 Doblar \\(E_k\\)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Dependencia Velocidad<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Proporcional a <strong>v\u00b2<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo\">Doblar \\(v\\) \u2192 Cuadruplicar \\(E_k\\)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Unidades SI<\/h4>\r\n                    <p><strong>1 Joule<\/strong> = 1 kg\u00b7m\u00b2\/s\u00b2<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo\">70 kg a 10 m\/s = 3500 J<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TABLA COMPARATIVA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Tabla de Propiedades<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-comparativa\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>Propiedad<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Relaci\u00f3n Matem\u00e1tica<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Efecto F\u00edsico<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Ejemplo<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>Masa (m)<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>\\(E_k \\propto m\\)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Lineal<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Cami\u00f3n vs auto a misma \\(v\\)<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>Velocidad (v)<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>\\(E_k \\propto v^2\\)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Cuadr\u00e1tica<\/td>\r\n                            <td>100 km\/h vs 200 km\/h<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>En reposo<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>\\(v = 0\\)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>\\(E_k = 0\\)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Objeto estacionario<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>Unidad SI<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>1 J = 1 kg\u00b7m\u00b2\/s\u00b2<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Energ\u00eda est\u00e1ndar<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Manzana de 100g a 4.47 m\/s<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- COLICIONES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Tipos de Colisiones<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"colisiones-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"colision-card elastica\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd04 EL\u00c1STICA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"conservacion\">\r\n                        <span>\\(E_k\\) conservada<\/span>\r\n                        <span>\\(\\vec{p}\\) conservado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo\">\r\n                        <p>Choque de bolas de billar<\/p>\r\n                        <p>\\(E_{k_{antes}} = E_{k_{despues}}\\)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"colision-card inelastica\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udca5 INEL\u00c1STICA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"conservacion\">\r\n                        <span>\\(E_k\\) NO conservada<\/span>\r\n                        <span>\\(\\vec{p}\\) conservado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo\">\r\n                        <p>Auto contra muro<\/p>\r\n                        <p>\\(E_k \\rightarrow Q, \\text{deformaci\u00f3n}\\)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"colision-card perfecta\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd17 PERFECTAMENTE INEL\u00c1STICA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"conservacion\">\r\n                        <span>M\u00e1xima p\u00e9rdida \\(E_k\\)<\/span>\r\n                        <span>\\(\\vec{p}\\) conservado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo\">\r\n                        <p>Proyectil incrustado<\/p>\r\n                        <p>\\(E_k \\rightarrow Q, \\text{sonido}\\)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TEOREMA TRABAJO-ENERG\u00cdA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Teorema Trabajo-Energ\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"teorema-container\">\r\n                <div class=\"formula-grand\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    W_{neto} = \\Delta E_k = E_{k_f} - E_{k_i}\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"explicacion\">\r\n                    <p>El <strong>trabajo neto<\/strong> sobre un objeto es igual al cambio en su energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo-destacado\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Auto de 1200 kg acelera de 0 a 25 m\/s<\/p>\r\n                        <p>\\(W = \\Delta E_k = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 1200 \\times 625 = 375,000\\) J<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Trabajo del motor = 375 kJ<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: ENERG\u00cdA CIN\u00c9TICA Y COLICIONES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"ek-simulator\">\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>\u2699\ufe0f CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"masaObjeto\">Masa (kg):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"masaObjeto\" min=\"1\" max=\"2000\" step=\"10\" value=\"1000\">\r\n                    <span id=\"valorMasa\">1000 kg<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"velocidadObjeto\">Velocidad (m\/s):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"velocidadObjeto\" min=\"1\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"20\">\r\n                    <span id=\"valorVelocidad\">20 m\/s<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"tipoColision\">Tipo de colisi\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"tipoColision\">\r\n                        <option value=\"elastica\">El\u00e1stica<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"inelastica\">Inel\u00e1stica<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"perfecta\">Perfectamente inel\u00e1stica<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-simular\" onclick=\"calcularEnergiaCinetica()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6\ufe0f<\/span> CALCULAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarSimulador()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <svg id=\"simuladorEK\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\">\r\n                    <!-- Pista -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"50\" y=\"200\" width=\"700\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#37474F\" rx=\"10\"\/>\r\n                    <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"750\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#78909C\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,5\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Objeto 1 (movible) -->\r\n                    <g id=\"objeto1\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"100\" y=\"180\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#D32F2F\" rx=\"8\" id=\"auto1\"\/>\r\n                        <circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"220\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#212121\"\/>\r\n                        <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"220\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#212121\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"140\" y=\"170\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"masaTexto\">1000 kg<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Objeto 2 (para colisiones) -->\r\n                    <g id=\"objeto2\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"600\" y=\"180\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#1976D2\" rx=\"8\"\/>\r\n                        <circle cx=\"630\" cy=\"220\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#212121\"\/>\r\n                        <circle cx=\"650\" cy=\"220\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#212121\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"640\" y=\"170\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">500 kg<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Resultados -->\r\n                    <g id=\"resultados\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"50\" y=\"300\" width=\"700\" height=\"80\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.7)\" rx=\"10\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"330\" fill=\"#FFEB3B\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"ekResultado\">E_k = 200,000 J<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"360\" fill=\"#FFC107\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"colisionResultado\">Colisi\u00f3n el\u00e1stica<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca DATOS DE SIMULACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Energ\u00eda Cin\u00e9tica:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEK\">0 J<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Momento Lineal:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataMomento\">0 kg\u00b7m\/s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Tipo de Colisi\u00f3n:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTipoColision\">El\u00e1stica<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Energ\u00eda Perdida:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEnergiaPerdida\">0 J<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N (30 PREGUNTAS)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfC\u00f3mo depende \\(E_k\\) de la velocidad?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Linealmente (\\(E_k \\propto v\\))\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Inversamente (\\(E_k \\propto 1\/v\\))\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Cuadr\u00e1ticamente (\\(E_k \\propto v^2\\))\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Exponencialmente (\\(E_k \\propto e^v\\))\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> La energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica depende del cuadrado de la velocidad (\\(v^2\\)).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la secci\u00f3n \"F\u00f3rmula y Propiedades\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La f\u00f3rmula \\(E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\) muestra claramente la dependencia cuadr\u00e1tica con la velocidad.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>En una colisi\u00f3n el\u00e1stica:<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Se conserva solo el momento lineal\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Se conservan \\(E_k\\) y momento lineal\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Se pierde toda la \\(E_k\\)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Se transforma toda la \\(E_k\\) en calor\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> En colisiones el\u00e1sticas se conservan tanto la energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica como el momento lineal.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la secci\u00f3n \"Tipos de Colisiones\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTAS 3-30 (similar estructura) -->\r\n            <!-- ... -->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/30\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados.\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR \\(E_k\\) CON MOMENTO LINEAL<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"Si se conserva el momento, tambi\u00e9n se conserva \\(E_k\\)\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El momento lineal (\\(\\vec{p} = m\\vec{v}\\)) se conserva <strong>siempre<\/strong>, pero \\(E_k\\) solo en colisiones <strong>el\u00e1sticas<\/strong>.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                        <table>\r\n                            <tr><th>Tipo<\/th><th>Momento<\/th><th>Energ\u00eda Cin\u00e9tica<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>El\u00e1stica<\/td><td>\u2705 Conservado<\/td><td>\u2705 Conservada<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Inel\u00e1stica<\/td><td>\u2705 Conservado<\/td><td>\u274c No conservada<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <\/table>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c OLVIDAR EL FACTOR 1\/2 EN LA F\u00d3RMULA<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> Escribir \\(E_k = mv^2\\) en lugar de \\(E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Origen:<\/strong> El factor \\(\\frac{1}{2}\\) proviene de integrar \\(F = ma\\) para obtener \\(W = \\Delta E_k\\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-demostracion\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        W = \\int F \\, dx = \\int ma \\, dx = m \\int \\frac{dv}{dt} \\, dx = m \\int v \\, dv = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- M\u00c1S ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n            <!-- ... -->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN (12 EJERCICIOS)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>C\u00e1lculo B\u00e1sico de \\(E_k\\)<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un autom\u00f3vil de 1500 kg viaja a 25 m\/s. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Su energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica en Joules<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica si duplica su velocidad<\/li>\r\n                        <li>El trabajo necesario para detenerlo<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n paso a paso...\" rows=\"6\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">\r\n                    \u2705 VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. \\(E_k = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 1500 \\times 25^2 = 468,750\\) J<br>\r\n                    2. \\(E_k' = 4 \\times 468,750 = 1,875,000\\) J (cuadr\u00e1tica)<br>\r\n                    3. \\(W = \\Delta E_k = -468,750\\) J (negativo: fuerza opuesta)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Colisi\u00f3n El\u00e1stica en 1D<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Una bola de 2 kg a 4 m\/s choca el\u00e1sticamente con otra de 3 kg en reposo. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Velocidades finales<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica antes y despu\u00e9s<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Porcentaje de energ\u00eda conservada<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Muestra todos los c\u00e1lculos...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">\r\n                    \u2705 VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. Conservaci\u00f3n momento: \\(2 \\times 4 = 2v_1' + 3v_2'\\)<br>\r\n                    Conservaci\u00f3n \\(E_k\\): \\(16 = 2v_1'^2 + 3v_2'^2\\)<br>\r\n                    Soluci\u00f3n: \\(v_1' = -1.6\\) m\/s, \\(v_2' = 3.2\\) m\/s<br>\r\n                    2. \\(E_k\\) antes = 16 J, despu\u00e9s = 16 J<br>\r\n                    3. 100% conservada (colisi\u00f3n el\u00e1stica)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PROBLEMAS 3-12 -->\r\n            <!-- ... -->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2 pts)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Aplicaci\u00f3n correcta de \\(E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\)<\/td>\r\n                    <td>F\u00f3rmula aplicada correctamente en todos los casos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores menores en c\u00e1lculos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Confunde f\u00f3rmula o unidades<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis de colisiones<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Distingue claramente el\u00e1sticas\/inel\u00e1sticas<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Confunde conservaci\u00f3n de \\(E_k\\)<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No identifica tipos de colisi\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Teorema trabajo-energ\u00eda<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Aplica \\(W = \\Delta E_k\\) correctamente<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores en signos o interpretaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No relaciona trabajo con \\(E_k\\)<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n de la f\u00f3rmula \\(E_k\\):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>An\u00e1lisis de colisiones:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Aplicaci\u00f3n del teorema trabajo-energ\u00eda:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83e\udd14 REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es importante entender la dependencia cuadr\u00e1tica de \\(E_k\\) con \\(v\\) en el dise\u00f1o de veh\u00edculos?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Describe un ejemplo cotidiano donde observes conservaci\u00f3n de \\(E_k\\) y otro donde no se conserve.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo 1: Conservaci\u00f3n... Ejemplo 2: No conservaci\u00f3n...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO PERSONALIZADO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udccc REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (20 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar f\u00f3rmula \\(E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Diferenciar colisiones el\u00e1sticas\/inel\u00e1sticas<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Resolver 3 problemas b\u00e1sicos<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udee0 PR\u00c1CTICA (40 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Completar el simulador con 5 casos<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Resolver problemas 4-8 del examen<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Hacer el quiz completo<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83e\udde0 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (60 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Investigar \\(E_k\\) relativista<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Analizar aplicaciones en seguridad vial<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Resolver problemas avanzados (9-12)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/energy-skate-park\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udfa2 Simulador PhET: Parque de Energ\u00eda\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/science\/physics\/work-and-energy\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcda Khan Academy: Trabajo y Energ\u00eda\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/hyperphysics.phy-astr.gsu.edu\/hbase\/elacol.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udd2c HyperPhysics: Colisiones El\u00e1sticas\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DE ENERG\u00cdA CIN\u00c9TICA\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction calcularEnergiaCinetica() {\r\n    const masa = parseFloat(document.getElementById('masaObjeto').value);\r\n    const velocidad = parseFloat(document.getElementById('velocidadObjeto').value);\r\n    const tipoColision = document.getElementById('tipoColision').value;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ C\u00e1lculos f\u00edsicos\r\n    const ek = 0.5 * masa * Math.pow(velocidad, 2);\r\n    const momento = masa * velocidad;\r\n    let energiaPerdida = 0;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEK').textContent = ek.toFixed(2) + ' J';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataMomento').textContent = momento.toFixed(2) + ' kg\u00b7m\/s';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataTipoColision').textContent =\r\n        tipoColision === 'elastica' ? 'El\u00e1stica' :\r\n        tipoColision === 'inelastica' ? 'Inel\u00e1stica' : 'Perfectamente inel\u00e1stica';\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Energ\u00eda perdida seg\u00fan tipo de colisi\u00f3n\r\n    if (tipoColision === 'inelastica') {\r\n        energiaPerdida = ek * 0.3; \/\/ 30% perdido en inel\u00e1stica t\u00edpica\r\n    } else if (tipoColision === 'perfecta') {\r\n        energiaPerdida = ek * 0.7; \/\/ 70% perdido en perfectamente inel\u00e1stica\r\n    }\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEnergiaPerdida').textContent = energiaPerdida.toFixed(2) + ' J';\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar SVG\r\n    const auto1 = document.getElementById('auto1');\r\n    const ekResultado = document.getElementById('ekResultado');\r\n    const colisionResultado = document.getElementById('colisionResultado');\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n del auto\r\n    const distancia = 500 + (velocidad * 2); \/\/ Escalar con velocidad\r\n    auto1.setAttribute('transform', `translate(${distancia}, 0)`);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Mostrar resultados\r\n    ekResultado.textContent = `E_k = ${ek.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n    colisionResultado.textContent = `Colisi\u00f3n ${document.getElementById('dataTipoColision').textContent}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('resultados').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Mostrar segundo objeto si es colisi\u00f3n\r\n    if (tipoColision !== 'elastica') {\r\n        document.getElementById('objeto2').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    console.log(`\ud83d\ude80 Simulaci\u00f3n: m=${masa}kg, v=${velocidad}m\/s \u2192 E_k=${ek.toFixed(2)}J`);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarSimulador() {\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar controles\r\n    document.getElementById('masaObjeto').value = 1000;\r\n    document.getElementById('velocidadObjeto').value = 20;\r\n    document.getElementById('tipoColision').value = 'elastica';\r\n    document.getElementById('valorMasa').textContent = '1000 kg';\r\n    document.getElementById('valorVelocidad').textContent = '20 m\/s';\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar datos\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEK').textContent = '0 J';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataMomento').textContent = '0 kg\u00b7m\/s';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataTipoColision').textContent = 'El\u00e1stica';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEnergiaPerdida').textContent = '0 J';\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n    const auto1 = document.getElementById('auto1');\r\n    auto1.removeAttribute('transform');\r\n    document.getElementById('objeto2').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('resultados').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO (30 PREGUNTAS)\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\nfunction verificarCompletadoQuiz() {\r\n    const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n    const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q =>\r\n        q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n    );\r\n\r\n    if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n        quizCompletado = true;\r\n        mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n    const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n    let feedback = \"\";\r\n    if (porcentaje >= 90) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Dominas la energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica!\";\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 70) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero repasa las colisiones.\";\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 50) {\r\n        feedback = \"\u26a0\ufe0f Necesitas practicar m\u00e1s con el simulador.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\ude15 Revisa la secci\u00f3n te\u00f3rica y los ejemplos.\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar eventos del quiz\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n        verificarCompletadoQuiz();\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ ERRORES COMUNES INTERACTIVOS\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction toggleError(header) {\r\n    const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n\r\n    if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n    } else {\r\n        content.style.display = 'block';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N METACOGNITIVA\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n\r\n    alert(\r\n        `\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n        `F\u00f3rmula E_k: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `Colisiones: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `Teorema trabajo-energ\u00eda: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Recomendaci\u00f3n: Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`\r\n    );\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ OBJETIVOS INTERACTIVOS\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n        this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n        const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n        checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n        checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : '';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n: Energ\u00eda Cin\u00e9tica cargada\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83c\udfae Simulador, Quiz (30 preguntas) y 12 problemas listos\");\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"F\u00f3rmula EK","respuesta":"\u00bd m v\u00b2"},{"enunciado":"Unidad SI","respuesta":"Joule (J)"},{"enunciado":"v = 0 \u2192 EK =","respuesta":"0"},{"enunciado":"Auto 800 kg a 30 m\/s","respuesta":"360,000 J"},{"enunciado":"Bicicleta 15 kg a 10 m\/s","respuesta":"750 J"},{"enunciado":"v pasa de 10 a 20 m\/s (m cte)","respuesta":"EK \u00d74"},{"enunciado":"Colisi\u00f3n el\u00e1stica: EK total","respuesta":"Conservada"},{"enunciado":"Inel\u00e1stica: EK","respuesta":"Disminuye"},{"enunciado":"Perfectamente inel\u00e1stica: v final","respuesta":"m\u2081v\u2081 + m\u2082v\u2082 \/ (m\u2081+m\u2082)"},{"enunciado":"Trabajo para detener 1000 kg de 20 m\/s","respuesta":"-200,000 J"},{"enunciado":"EK relativista (aprox)","respuesta":"\u03b3mc\u00b2 - mc\u00b2"},{"enunciado":"1 kWh =","respuesta":"3.6 MJ"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"EK =","opciones":["\u00bdmv\u00b2","mv\u00b2","mgh","Fd"],"correcta":"\u00bdmv\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"Depende de v como...","opciones":["v\u00b2","v","1\/v","\u221av"],"correcta":"v\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"Dobla v \u2192 EK...","opciones":["\u00d74","\u00d72","\u00d78","\u00bd"],"correcta":"\u00d74"},{"pregunta":"Objeto en reposo EK =","opciones":["0","1","\u221e","Negativa"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"Unidad EK","opciones":["Joule","Newton","Pascal","Watt"],"correcta":"Joule"},{"pregunta":"Colisi\u00f3n el\u00e1stica EK","opciones":["Conservada","Perdida","Aumentada","Cero"],"correcta":"Conservada"},{"pregunta":"Auto 1000 kg a 20 m\/s EK =","opciones":["200 kJ","100 kJ","400 kJ","20 kJ"],"correcta":"200 kJ"},{"pregunta":"m = 0 \u2192 EK =","opciones":["0","\u221e","1","Negativa"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo = \u0394EK","opciones":["S\u00ed","No","A veces","Solo si F=0"],"correcta":"S\u00ed"},{"pregunta":"v \u2192 3v, EK \u2192","opciones":["\u00d79","\u00d73","\u00d76","\u00d727"],"correcta":"\u00d79"},{"pregunta":"Auto 1500 kg de 0 a 30 m\/s, trabajo =","opciones":["675 kJ","337.5 kJ","1350 kJ","0 J"],"correcta":"675 kJ"},{"pregunta":"Frenado: EK \u2192","opciones":["Calor","Potencial","El\u00e9ctrica","Nuclear"],"correcta":"Calor"},{"pregunta":"Colisi\u00f3n inel\u00e1stica: momento","opciones":["Conservado","No conservado","Aumentado","Cero"],"correcta":"Conservado"},{"pregunta":"1 MJ =","opciones":["10\u2076 J","10\u00b3 J","10\u2079 J","10\u207b\u2076 J"],"correcta":"10\u2076 J"},{"pregunta":"v = 10 m\/s \u2192 v = 15 m\/s, EK aumenta en...","opciones":["2.25\u00d7","1.5\u00d7","2.5\u00d7","3\u00d7"],"correcta":"2.25\u00d7"},{"pregunta":"Teorema trabajo-energ\u00eda","opciones":["W = \u0394EK","W = EK","W = \u00bdmv\u00b2","W = mgh"],"correcta":"W = \u0394EK"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica rotacional","opciones":["\u00bdI\u03c9\u00b2","mv\u00b2","mgh","Fd"],"correcta":"\u00bdI\u03c9\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"En ca\u00edda libre, EK + EP =","opciones":["Cte","Aumenta","Disminuye","Cero"],"correcta":"Cte"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: v en...","opciones":["m\/s","km\/h","mph","nudos"],"correcta":"m\/s"},{"pregunta":"EK m\u00e1xima en...","opciones":["v m\u00e1xima","m m\u00e1xima","v=0","m=0"],"correcta":"v m\u00e1xima"},{"pregunta":"Colisi\u00f3n 1D el\u00e1stica: v\u2081f =","opciones":["(m\u2081-m\u2082)v\u2081\/(m\u2081+m\u2082) + 2m\u2082v\u2082\/(m\u2081+m\u2082)","v\u2081","0","v\u2082"],"correcta":"(m\u2081-m\u2082)v\u2081\/(m\u2081+m\u2082) + 2m\u2082v\u2082\/(m\u2081+m\u2082)"},{"pregunta":"EK relativista (v\u2248c)","opciones":["(\u03b3-1)mc\u00b2","\u00bdmv\u00b2","mc\u00b2","mv\u00b2"],"correcta":"(\u03b3-1)mc\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"Fuerza constante acelera 2 kg de 0 a 10 m\/s en 5 m, F =","opciones":["40 N","20 N","100 N","4 N"],"correcta":"40 N"},{"pregunta":"Coeficiente restitucion e =","opciones":["\u221a(EK despu\u00e9s\/EK antes)","v","m","F"],"correcta":"\u221a(EK despu\u00e9s\/EK antes)"},{"pregunta":"1 eV =","opciones":["1.6\u00d710\u207b\u00b9\u2079 J","1 J","1.6\u00d710\u207b\u00b9\u2070 J","1.6\u00d710\u2076 J"],"correcta":"1.6\u00d710\u207b\u00b9\u2079 J"},{"pregunta":"EK molecular media (3D)","opciones":["(3\/2)kT","(1\/2)mv\u00b2","mgh","Fd"],"correcta":"(3\/2)kT"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo m\u00ednimo para detener 500 kg a 30 m\/s","opciones":["-225 kJ","225 kJ","112.5 kJ","0 J"],"correcta":"-225 kJ"},{"pregunta":"En vac\u00edo, ca\u00edda 10 m \u2192 v =","opciones":["14 m\/s","10 m\/s","20 m\/s","9.8 m\/s"],"correcta":"14 m\/s"},{"pregunta":"\u03b3 = 1 \/ \u221a(1 - v\u00b2\/c\u00b2), EK \u2248 \u00bdmv\u00b2 si...","opciones":["v << c","v = c","v > c","m = 0"],"correcta":"v << c"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: 1 kJ =","opciones":["10\u00b3 J","10\u2076 J","10\u2070 J","10\u207b\u00b3 J"],"correcta":"10\u00b3 J"}]},{"materia":"F\u00edsica I","slug":"energia-potencial-gravitacional","titulo":"Energ\u00eda Potencial Gravitacional: La Energ\u00eda de la Altura","contenido":"<!-- LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK: ENERG\u00cdA POTENCIAL GRAVITACIONAL -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-fisica-epg\" data-tema=\"energia-potencial-gravitacional\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83c\udf0c<\/span>\r\n            ENERG\u00cdA POTENCIAL GRAVITACIONAL\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            De la f\u00f3rmula \\(E_{pg} = mgh\\) a la conservaci\u00f3n de la energ\u00eda mec\u00e1nica\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Derivar la f\u00f3rmula \\(E_{pg} = mgh\\)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Desde la definici\u00f3n de trabajo gravitacional<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar la conservaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda mec\u00e1nica<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Transformaci\u00f3n \\(E_{pg} \\leftrightarrow E_k\\)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar el concepto de nivel de referencia<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Elecci\u00f3n de \\(h = 0\\) y su impacto en c\u00e1lculos<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Resolver problemas de ca\u00edda libre<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Usando conservaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda mec\u00e1nica<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACIONES EN LA VIDA REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfd7 Presas Hidroel\u00e9ctricas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Conversi\u00f3n de \\(E_{pg}\\) del agua en electricidad<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Eficiencia: 90-95%<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfa2 Monta\u00f1as Rusas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Dise\u00f1o basado en transformaci\u00f3n \\(E_{pg} \\rightarrow E_k\\)<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Altura m\u00e1xima: 140 m<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\ude80 Lanzamiento de Cohetes<\/h3>\r\n                <p>C\u00e1lculo de \\(E_{pg}\\) para escapar de la gravedad<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">\\(\\Delta v = 11.2\\) km\/s<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- F\u00d3RMULA Y PROPIEDADES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. F\u00f3rmula Fundamental<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-grand\">\r\n                \\[\r\n                E_{pg} = mgh\r\n                \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"propiedades-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Masa (m)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Proporcionalidad directa<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo\">Doblar \\(m\\) \u2192 Doblar \\(E_{pg}\\)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Altura (h)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Proporcionalidad directa<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo\">Triplicar \\(h\\) \u2192 Triplicar \\(E_{pg}\\)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Gravedad (g)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Depende del planeta<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo\">Tierra: 9.8 m\/s\u00b2, Luna: 1.62 m\/s\u00b2<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"propiedad-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Nivel de Referencia<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>\\(h = 0\\) donde \\(E_{pg} = 0\\)<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplo\">Suelo, nivel del mar, etc.<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TABLA COMPARATIVA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Comparaci\u00f3n entre Planetas<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-comparativa\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>Planeta<\/th>\r\n                            <th>g (m\/s\u00b2)<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Ejemplo \\(E_{pg}\\) (1 kg a 10 m)<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Diferencia vs Tierra<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>Mercurio<\/td>\r\n                            <td>3.7<\/td>\r\n                            <td>37 J<\/td>\r\n                            <td>38% de Tierra<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>Venus<\/td>\r\n                            <td>8.87<\/td>\r\n                            <td>88.7 J<\/td>\r\n                            <td>91% de Tierra<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>Tierra<\/td>\r\n                            <td>9.8<\/td>\r\n                            <td>98 J<\/td>\r\n                            <td>100% (referencia)<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>Marte<\/td>\r\n                            <td>3.71<\/td>\r\n                            <td>37.1 J<\/td>\r\n                            <td>38% de Tierra<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td>J\u00fapiter<\/td>\r\n                            <td>24.79<\/td>\r\n                            <td>247.9 J<\/td>\r\n                            <td>253% de Tierra<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- CONSERVACI\u00d3N DE ENERG\u00cdA MEC\u00c1NICA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Conservaci\u00f3n de Energ\u00eda Mec\u00e1nica<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"conservacion-container\">\r\n                <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    E_{mec} = E_{pg} + E_k = \\text{constante}\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"diagrama-conservacion\">\r\n                    <div class=\"estado estado-inicial\">\r\n                        <div class=\"objeto\">\ud83d\udfe2<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"altura\">h<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"energias\">\r\n                            <div>\\(E_{pg} = mgh\\)<\/div>\r\n                            <div>\\(E_k = 0\\)<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"flecha\">\u2193<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estado estado-final\">\r\n                        <div class=\"objeto\">\ud83d\udfe2<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"altura\">0<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"energias\">\r\n                            <div>\\(E_{pg} = 0\\)<\/div>\r\n                            <div>\\(E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\)<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"explicacion\">\r\n                    <p>En <strong>ca\u00edda libre<\/strong> (sin fricci\u00f3n):<\/p>\r\n                    <p>\\(E_{pg_i} + E_{k_i} = E_{pg_f} + E_{k_f}\\)<\/p>\r\n                    <p>\\(mgh = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\) \u2192 \\(v = \\sqrt{2gh}\\)<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- EJEMPLO PR\u00c1CTICO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Ejemplo Pr\u00e1ctico<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"ejemplo-destacado\">\r\n                <p><strong>Problema:<\/strong> Un libro de 2 kg se encuentra a 5 m de altura. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                <ol>\r\n                    <li>Su energ\u00eda potencial gravitacional<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Su velocidad al llegar al suelo<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Su energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica justo antes de impactar<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <div class=\"solucion-paso-a-paso\">\r\n                    <div class=\"paso\">\r\n                        <strong>1. Energ\u00eda potencial inicial:<\/strong><br>\r\n                        \\(E_{pg} = mgh = 2 \\times 9.8 \\times 5 = 98\\) J\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"paso\">\r\n                        <strong>2. Velocidad final (conservaci\u00f3n):<\/strong><br>\r\n                        \\(mgh = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\) \u2192 \\(v = \\sqrt{2gh} = \\sqrt{98} \\approx 9.9\\) m\/s\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"paso\">\r\n                        <strong>3. Energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica final:<\/strong><br>\r\n                        \\(E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2 = 98\\) J (igual a \\(E_{pg}\\) inicial)\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: CA\u00cdDA LIBRE Y CONSERVACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"epg-simulator\">\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>\u2699\ufe0f CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"masaObjeto\">Masa (kg):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"masaObjeto\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"10\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"valorMasa\">1 kg<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"alturaObjeto\">Altura (m):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"alturaObjeto\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"20\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"5\">\r\n                    <span id=\"valorAltura\">5 m<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"gravedad\">Gravedad (m\/s\u00b2):<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"gravedad\">\r\n                        <option value=\"9.8\">Tierra (9.8)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"3.7\">Marte (3.7)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"1.62\">Luna (1.62)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"24.79\">J\u00fapiter (24.79)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"8.87\">Venus (8.87)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-simular\" onclick=\"simularCaidaLibre()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6\ufe0f<\/span> SIMULAR CA\u00cdDA\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarSimuladorEPG()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <svg id=\"simuladorEPG\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 500\">\r\n                    <!-- Plataforma -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"100\" width=\"600\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#455A64\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Objeto -->\r\n                    <g id=\"objetoEPG\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"375\" y=\"80\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#FF5722\" rx=\"5\" id=\"caja\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"110\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"masaTextoEPG\">1 kg<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- L\u00ednea de referencia -->\r\n                    <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"400\" x2=\"700\" y2=\"400\" stroke=\"#FFC107\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"400\" y=\"420\" fill=\"#FFC107\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Nivel de referencia (h=0)<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Indicadores de energ\u00eda -->\r\n                    <g id=\"indicadoresEPG\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"100\" y=\"430\" width=\"300\" height=\"50\" fill=\"rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.3)\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"250\" y=\"460\" fill=\"#2E7D32\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"epgTexto\">EPG = 49 J<\/text>\r\n\r\n                        <rect x=\"400\" y=\"430\" width=\"300\" height=\"50\" fill=\"rgba(244, 67, 54, 0.3)\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"550\" y=\"460\" fill=\"#D32F2F\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"ekTexto\">EK = 0 J<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Velocidad final -->\r\n                    <g id=\"velocidadFinal\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"300\" fill=\"#FFEB3B\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"velocidadTexto\">v = 9.9 m\/s<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca DATOS DE SIMULACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Energ\u00eda Potencial Inicial:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEPGInicial\">0 J<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Energ\u00eda Cin\u00e9tica Final:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEKFinal\">0 J<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Velocidad de Impacto:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataVelocidad\">0 m\/s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Tiempo de Ca\u00edda:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTiempo\">0 s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N (30 PREGUNTAS)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfDe qu\u00e9 depende la energ\u00eda potencial gravitacional?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Solo de la masa del objeto\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        De la masa, gravedad y altura\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Solo de la velocidad del objeto\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        De la temperatura ambiente\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> La f\u00f3rmula \\(E_{pg} = mgh\\) muestra que depende de masa, gravedad y altura.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la secci\u00f3n \"F\u00f3rmula Fundamental\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Si duplicas la altura de un objeto, su \\(E_{pg}\\):<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Se reduce a la mitad\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Permanece igual\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Se duplica\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Se cuadruplica\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> \\(E_{pg}\\) es directamente proporcional a la altura.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> La relaci\u00f3n es lineal, no cuadr\u00e1tica.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTAS 3-30 (similar estructura) -->\r\n            <!-- ... -->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/30\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados.\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR \\(E_{pg}\\) CON \\(E_k\\)<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"Un objeto en ca\u00edda tiene energ\u00eda potencial\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong>\r\n                        <p>La \\(E_{pg}\\) depende de la <strong>altura<\/strong>, no del movimiento.<\/p>\r\n                        <p>En ca\u00edda libre, la \\(E_{pg}\\) <strong>disminuye<\/strong> mientras la \\(E_k\\) <strong>aumenta<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-diagrama\">\r\n                        <div>Altura m\u00e1xima: 100% \\(E_{pg}\\)<\/div>\r\n                        <div>Durante ca\u00edda: \\(E_{pg}\\)\u2193, \\(E_k\\)\u2191<\/div>\r\n                        <div>Impacto: 100% \\(E_k\\), 0% \\(E_{pg}\\)<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c ELEGIR MAL EL NIVEL DE REFERENCIA<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"La \\(E_{pg}\\) es absoluta y no depende de d\u00f3nde ponga \\(h=0\\)\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong>\r\n                        <p>La \\(E_{pg}\\) es <strong>relativa<\/strong> al nivel de referencia elegido.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Si eliges el suelo como \\(h=0\\), un objeto a 5m tiene \\(E_{pg} = mgh\\).<\/p>\r\n                        <p>Si eliges una mesa a 1m como \\(h=0\\), el mismo objeto a 5m del suelo ahora est\u00e1 a \\(h=4m\\) de la mesa.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-formula\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        E_{pg} = mg(h_{\\text{objeto}} - h_{\\text{referencia}})\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- M\u00c1S ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n            <!-- ... -->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN (12 EJERCICIOS)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>C\u00e1lculo B\u00e1sico de \\(E_{pg}\\)<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un bloque de 5 kg se encuentra a 12 m de altura en la Tierra. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Su energ\u00eda potencial gravitacional<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Su energ\u00eda potencial en la Luna (\\(g = 1.62\\) m\/s\u00b2)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La altura equivalente en Marte (\\(g = 3.71\\) m\/s\u00b2) para tener la misma \\(E_{pg}\\) que en la Tierra<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n paso a paso...\" rows=\"6\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">\r\n                    \u2705 VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. \\(E_{pg} = 5 \\times 9.8 \\times 12 = 588\\) J<br>\r\n                    2. \\(E_{pg\\_luna} = 5 \\times 1.62 \\times 12 = 97.2\\) J<br>\r\n                    3. \\(588 = 5 \\times 3.71 \\times h_{marte}\\) \u2192 \\(h_{marte} = 31.7\\) m\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Conservaci\u00f3n de Energ\u00eda Mec\u00e1nica<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Una pelota de 0.5 kg se deja caer desde 20 m de altura. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Su velocidad al llegar al suelo<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Su velocidad a 5 m del suelo<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La altura m\u00e1xima que alcanzar\u00eda si se lanzara hacia arriba con velocidad inicial de 15 m\/s<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Ignora la resistencia del aire.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Muestra todos los c\u00e1lculos...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">\r\n                    \u2705 VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. \\(v = \\sqrt{2gh} = \\sqrt{2 \\times 9.8 \\times 20} = 19.8\\) m\/s<br>\r\n                    2. \\(mgh_1 + \\frac{1}{2}mv_1^2 = mgh_2 + \\frac{1}{2}mv_2^2\\) \u2192 \\(v_2 = \\sqrt{2 \\times 9.8 \\times 15} = 17.15\\) m\/s<br>\r\n                    3. \\(mgh = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\) \u2192 \\(h = \\frac{v^2}{2g} = \\frac{225}{19.6} = 11.48\\) m\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PROBLEMAS 3-12 -->\r\n            <!-- ... -->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2 pts)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Aplicaci\u00f3n correcta de \\(E_{pg} = mgh\\)<\/td>\r\n                    <td>F\u00f3rmula aplicada correctamente en todos los casos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores menores en c\u00e1lculos o unidades<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Confunde variables o f\u00f3rmula<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Conservaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda mec\u00e1nica<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Aplica correctamente \\(E_{pg} + E_k = \\text{constante}\\)<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores en transformaci\u00f3n de energ\u00edas<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No comprende la conservaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis de niveles de referencia<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Elige y justifica adecuadamente \\(h = 0\\)<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Confusi\u00f3n en elecci\u00f3n de referencia<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No considera el concepto de referencia<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n de la f\u00f3rmula \\(E_{pg} = mgh\\):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Aplicaci\u00f3n de conservaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Manejo de niveles de referencia:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83e\udd14 REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo aplicar\u00eda el concepto de \\(E_{pg}\\) para dise\u00f1ar un sistema de almacenamiento de energ\u00eda por gravedad?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: Usar pesos elevados para almacenar energ\u00eda renovable...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Describe una situaci\u00f3n cotidiana donde la elecci\u00f3n del nivel de referencia sea crucial para los c\u00e1lculos de \\(E_{pg}\\).<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: Construcci\u00f3n de edificios, dise\u00f1o de monta\u00f1as rusas...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udccc REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (20 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar \\(E_{pg} = mgh\\)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Identificar variables y unidades<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Resolver 2 problemas b\u00e1sicos<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udee0 PR\u00c1CTICA (40 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Usar simulador con 3 casos diferentes<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Resolver problemas 3-6 del examen<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Completar 10 preguntas del quiz<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83e\udde0 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (60 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Investigar aplicaciones en ingenier\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Analizar \\(E_{pg}\\) en diferentes planetas<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Resolver problemas avanzados (7-12)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/energy-skate-park-basics\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udef9 Simulador PhET: Parque de Energ\u00eda B\u00e1sica\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/science\/physics\/work-and-energy\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcda Khan Academy: Trabajo y Energ\u00eda\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.nasa.gov\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\ude80 NASA: Gravedad en el Sistema Solar\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT COMPLETO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DE ENERG\u00cdA POTENCIAL GRAVITACIONAL\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction simularCaidaLibre() {\r\n    const masa = parseFloat(document.getElementById('masaObjeto').value);\r\n    const altura = parseFloat(document.getElementById('alturaObjeto').value);\r\n    const gravedad = parseFloat(document.getElementById('gravedad').value);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ C\u00e1lculos f\u00edsicos\r\n    const epgInicial = masa * gravedad * altura;\r\n    const velocidadFinal = Math.sqrt(2 * gravedad * altura);\r\n    const tiempoCaida = Math.sqrt(2 * altura \/ gravedad);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar datos en interfaz\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEPGInicial').textContent = epgInicial.toFixed(2) + ' J';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEKFinal').textContent = epgInicial.toFixed(2) + ' J';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataVelocidad').textContent = velocidadFinal.toFixed(2) + ' m\/s';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataTiempo').textContent = tiempoCaida.toFixed(2) + ' s';\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar texto en SVG\r\n    document.getElementById('epgTexto').textContent = `EPG = ${epgInicial.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n    document.getElementById('ekTexto').textContent = `EK = ${epgInicial.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n    document.getElementById('velocidadTexto').textContent = `v = ${velocidadFinal.toFixed(2)} m\/s`;\r\n    document.getElementById('masaTextoEPG').textContent = `${masa} kg`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de ca\u00edda\r\n    const caja = document.getElementById('caja');\r\n    const alturaInicial = 80; \/\/ Posici\u00f3n inicial en SVG\r\n    const alturaFinal = 380;  \/\/ Posici\u00f3n final en SVG\r\n    const duracion = 2;      \/\/ Duraci\u00f3n de la animaci\u00f3n en segundos\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n usando SMIL (SVG)\r\n    const animacion = document.createElementNS(\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\", \"animate\");\r\n    animacion.setAttribute(\"attributeName\", \"y\");\r\n    animacion.setAttribute(\"from\", alturaInicial);\r\n    animacion.setAttribute(\"to\", alturaFinal);\r\n    animacion.setAttribute(\"begin\", \"0s\");\r\n    animacion.setAttribute(\"dur\", `${duracion}s`);\r\n    animacion.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"freeze\");\r\n    caja.appendChild(animacion);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Mostrar indicadores\r\n    document.getElementById('indicadoresEPG').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n    document.getElementById('velocidadFinal').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n\r\n    console.log(`\ud83c\udf0c Simulaci\u00f3n: m=${masa}kg, h=${altura}m, g=${gravedad}m\/s\u00b2`);\r\n    console.log(`   EPG inicial: ${epgInicial.toFixed(2)}J`);\r\n    console.log(`   Velocidad final: ${velocidadFinal.toFixed(2)}m\/s`);\r\n    console.log(`   Tiempo de ca\u00edda: ${tiempoCaida.toFixed(2)}s`);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarSimuladorEPG() {\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar controles\r\n    document.getElementById('masaObjeto').value = 1;\r\n    document.getElementById('alturaObjeto').value = 5;\r\n    document.getElementById('gravedad').value = '9.8';\r\n    document.getElementById('valorMasa').textContent = '1 kg';\r\n    document.getElementById('valorAltura').textContent = '5 m';\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar datos\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEPGInicial').textContent = '0 J';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEKFinal').textContent = '0 J';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataVelocidad').textContent = '0 m\/s';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataTiempo').textContent = '0 s';\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n    const caja = document.getElementById('caja');\r\n    caja.setAttribute('y', '80');\r\n    while (caja.lastChild && caja.lastChild.tagName === 'animate') {\r\n        caja.removeChild(caja.lastChild);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('indicadoresEPG').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('velocidadFinal').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO (30 PREGUNTAS)\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n        const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n        const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q =>\r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n\r\n        if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n            const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n            const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n\r\n            document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n            let feedbackText = \"\";\r\n            if (porcentaje >= 90) {\r\n                feedbackText = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas la energ\u00eda potencial gravitacional.\";\r\n            } else if (porcentaje >= 70) {\r\n                feedbackText = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero repasa la conservaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda.\";\r\n            } else if (porcentaje >= 50) {\r\n                feedbackText = \"\u26a0\ufe0f Necesitas practicar m\u00e1s con el simulador.\";\r\n            } else {\r\n                feedbackText = \"\ud83d\ude15 Revisa la secci\u00f3n te\u00f3rica y los ejemplos.\";\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedbackText;\r\n            document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ ERRORES COMUNES INTERACTIVOS\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction toggleError(header) {\r\n    const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n\r\n    if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n    } else {\r\n        content.style.display = 'block';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    if (solucion.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'none';\r\n    } else {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N METACOGNITIVA\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n\r\n    alert(\r\n        `\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n        `F\u00f3rmula E_pg: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `Conservaci\u00f3n: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `Niveles de referencia: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Recomendaci\u00f3n: Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`\r\n    );\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ OBJETIVOS INTERACTIVOS\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n        this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n        const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n        checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n        checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : '';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ ACTUALIZACI\u00d3N DE VALORES EN TIEMPO REAL\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\ndocument.getElementById('masaObjeto').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    document.getElementById('valorMasa').textContent = this.value + ' kg';\r\n});\r\n\r\ndocument.getElementById('alturaObjeto').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    document.getElementById('valorAltura').textContent = this.value + ' m';\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83c\udf0c Lecci\u00f3n: Energ\u00eda Potencial Gravitacional cargada\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83c\udfae Simulador, Quiz (30 preguntas) y 12 problemas listos\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\udcca Todos los sistemas interactivos funcionando\");\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"F\u00f3rmula EPG","respuesta":"m g h"},{"enunciado":"g Tierra","respuesta":"9.8 m\/s\u00b2"},{"enunciado":"h = 0 \u2192 EPG","respuesta":"0"},{"enunciado":"Ca\u00edda libre: EPG \u2192","respuesta":"EK"},{"enunciado":"m = 3 kg, h = 10 m","respuesta":"294 J"},{"enunciado":"v final (h = 20 m)","respuesta":"19.8 m\/s"},{"enunciado":"EPG en Luna (g \u2248 1.6 m\/s\u00b2)","respuesta":"m \u00d7 1.6 \u00d7 h"},{"enunciado":"Trabajo gravitacional","respuesta":"-\u0394EPG"},{"enunciado":"Conservaci\u00f3n en p\u00e9ndulo","respuesta":"EPG + EK = cte"},{"enunciado":"1 kJ =","respuesta":"1000 J"},{"enunciado":"g Marte \u2248","respuesta":"3.7 m\/s\u00b2"},{"enunciado":"EPG m\u00e1xima en","respuesta":"h m\u00e1xima"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"EPG =","opciones":["mgh","\u00bdmv\u00b2","Fd","PV"],"correcta":"mgh"},{"pregunta":"Depende de","opciones":["m, g, h","solo m","solo v","F"],"correcta":"m, g, h"},{"pregunta":"g \u2248","opciones":["9.8 m\/s\u00b2","9.8 N","9.8 kg","0"],"correcta":"9.8 m\/s\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"h = 0 \u2192 EPG","opciones":["0","\u221e","m\u00e1xima","negativa"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"Ca\u00edda: EPG","opciones":["disminuye","aumenta","igual","cero"],"correcta":"disminuye"},{"pregunta":"EK aumenta al","opciones":["caer","subir","reposo","girar"],"correcta":"caer"},{"pregunta":"m = 1 kg, h = 10 m \u2192 EPG","opciones":["98 J","9.8 J","980 J","0 J"],"correcta":"98 J"},{"pregunta":"g en Luna","opciones":["1\/6 Tierra","igual","doble","cero"],"correcta":"1\/6 Tierra"},{"pregunta":"Conservaci\u00f3n E_mec","opciones":["EPG + EK = cte","solo EPG","solo EK","nada"],"correcta":"EPG + EK = cte"},{"pregunta":"Unidad EPG","opciones":["Joule","Newton","Watt","Pascal"],"correcta":"Joule"},{"pregunta":"v = \u221a(2gh) en","opciones":["ca\u00edda libre","lanzamiento","fricci\u00f3n","aire"],"correcta":"ca\u00edda libre"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo gravedad =","opciones":["-\u0394EPG","\u0394EPG","\u00bdmv\u00b2","mgh"],"correcta":"-\u0394EPG"},{"pregunta":"P\u00e9ndulo: m\u00e1xima EPG en","opciones":["puntos extremos","centro","arriba","abajo"],"correcta":"puntos extremos"},{"pregunta":"1 kWh =","opciones":["3.6 MJ","3.6 kJ","36 MJ","0.36 MJ"],"correcta":"3.6 MJ"},{"pregunta":"g Marte \u2248","opciones":["3.7 m\/s\u00b2","9.8 m\/s\u00b2","1.6 m\/s\u00b2","25 m\/s\u00b2"],"correcta":"3.7 m\/s\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"En vac\u00edo, EPG \u2192 EK","opciones":["100%","50%","0%","variable"],"correcta":"100%"},{"pregunta":"Referencia h = 0","opciones":["arbitraria","obligatoria","infinita","negativa"],"correcta":"arbitraria"},{"pregunta":"EPG en espacio profundo","opciones":["0","infinita","mgh","negativa"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"Conservaci\u00f3n v\u00e1lida si","opciones":["fuerzas conservativas","fricci\u00f3n","aire","calor"],"correcta":"fuerzas conservativas"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: g =","opciones":["9.80665 m\/s\u00b2","10 m\/s\u00b2","9.8 N\/kg","0"],"correcta":"9.80665 m\/s\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"v final desde h = 50 m","opciones":["31.3 m\/s","50 m\/s","9.8 m\/s","500 m\/s"],"correcta":"31.3 m\/s"},{"pregunta":"EPG para 500 kg a 100 m","opciones":["490 kJ","49 kJ","4.9 MJ","0 J"],"correcta":"490 kJ"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo para subir 10 kg 3 m","opciones":["294 J","-294 J","0 J","98 J"],"correcta":"294 J"},{"pregunta":"En resorte, energ\u00eda es","opciones":["el\u00e1stica","gravitacional","cin\u00e9tica","t\u00e9rmica"],"correcta":"el\u00e1stica"},{"pregunta":"\u0394EPG =","opciones":["mg\u0394h","\u00bdmv\u00b2","Fd","P\u0394t"],"correcta":"mg\u0394h"},{"pregunta":"En \u00f3rbita, EPG","opciones":["negativa","cero","positiva","infinita"],"correcta":"negativa"},{"pregunta":"g J\u00fapiter \u2248","opciones":["25 m\/s\u00b2","9.8 m\/s\u00b2","3.7 m\/s\u00b2","1.6 m\/s\u00b2"],"correcta":"25 m\/s\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda total en ca\u00edda","opciones":["constante","aumenta","disminuye","cero"],"correcta":"constante"},{"pregunta":"Fuerza gravitacional es","opciones":["conservativa","no conservativa","disipativa","reactiva"],"correcta":"conservativa"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: 1 MJ =","opciones":["10\u2076 J","10\u00b3 J","10\u2079 J","10\u207b\u2076 J"],"correcta":"10\u2076 J"}]},{"materia":"F\u00edsica I","slug":"energia-potencial-elastica-hooke","titulo":"Energ\u00eda Potencial El\u00e1stica: La F\u00edsica de los Resortes","contenido":"<!-- LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK: ENERG\u00cdA POTENCIAL EL\u00c1STICA -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-fisica-epe\" data-tema=\"energia-potencial-elastica\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83c\udf00<\/span>\r\n            ENERG\u00cdA POTENCIAL EL\u00c1STICA Y LEY DE HOOKE\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            De la fuerza restauradora \\(F = -kx\\) a la energ\u00eda almacenada \\(E_{pe} = \\frac{1}{2}kx^2\\)\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Explicar la Ley de Hooke<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Relaci\u00f3n \\(F = -kx\\) y sus l\u00edmites de validez<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Derivar la f\u00f3rmula de \\(E_{pe}\\)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Desde el trabajo de la fuerza el\u00e1stica<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar sistemas masa-resorte<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Oscilaciones y conservaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar en problemas reales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Amortiguadores, relojes, sistemas de suspensi\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACIONES EN INGENIER\u00cdA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\ude97 Sistemas de Suspensi\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Amortiguadores basados en resortes y \\(E_{pe}\\)<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Reducci\u00f3n 70% vibraciones<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\u23f1 Relojes Mec\u00e1nicos<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Reguladores de tiempo con resortes<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Precisi\u00f3n: \u00b115 s\/mes<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfd7 Estructuras Antis\u00edsmicas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Aisladores de base con propiedades el\u00e1sticas<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Reducci\u00f3n 90% energ\u00eda s\u00edsmica<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- LEY DE HOOKE -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Ley de Hooke<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                \\[\r\n                F = -kx\r\n                \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ley-hooke-container\">\r\n                <div class=\"definicion\">\r\n                    <p>La fuerza restauradora (\\(F\\)) es:<\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Proporcional<\/strong> a la deformaci\u00f3n (\\(x\\))<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Opuesta<\/strong> en direcci\u00f3n (signo negativo)<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Caracter\u00edstica<\/strong> del material (\\(k\\))<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-variables\">\r\n                    <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                        <thead>\r\n                            <tr><th>Variable<\/th><th>Significado<\/th><th>Unidad SI<\/th><th>Rango t\u00edpico<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                        <\/thead>\r\n                        <tbody>\r\n                            <tr><td><strong>F<\/strong><\/td><td>Fuerza restauradora<\/td><td>N<\/td><td>0-1000 N<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td><strong>k<\/strong><\/td><td>Constante el\u00e1stica<\/td><td>N\/m<\/td><td>10-10,000 N\/m<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td><strong>x<\/strong><\/td><td>Deformaci\u00f3n<\/td><td>m<\/td><td>0-0.5 m<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <\/tbody>\r\n                    <\/table>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"limites-validez\">\r\n                    <h4>\u26a0\ufe0f L\u00edmites de Validez<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>La ley de Hooke es v\u00e1lida solo en el <strong>r\u00e9gimen el\u00e1stico<\/strong>:<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"grafica-esfuerzo\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"300\" height=\"150\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 150\">\r\n                            <polyline points=\"20,130 80,100 200,20 280,20\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"50\" y=\"140\" fill=\"#39FF14\" font-size=\"10\">El\u00e1stico<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"150\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#FF6B6B\" font-size=\"10\">Pl\u00e1stico<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"20\" y=\"130\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"8\">Origen<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"280\" y=\"20\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"8\">Rotura<\/text>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- ENERG\u00cdA POTENCIAL EL\u00c1STICA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Energ\u00eda Potencial El\u00e1stica<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                \\[\r\n                E_{pe} = \\frac{1}{2}kx^2\r\n                \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"derivacion-epe\">\r\n                <p><strong>Derivaci\u00f3n:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                \\[\r\n                E_{pe} = \\int F \\, dx = \\int_{-x}^{x} (-kx) \\, dx = \\frac{1}{2}kx^2\r\n                \\]\r\n                <div class=\"propiedades-epe\">\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Dependencia Cuadr\u00e1tica<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Proporcional a \\(x^2\\) (no lineal)<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo\">Doblar \\(x\\) \u2192 Cuadruplicar \\(E_{pe}\\)<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 M\u00e1xima en Deformaci\u00f3n M\u00e1xima<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Alcanza su valor m\u00e1ximo en \\(x_{max}\\)<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo\">Resorte comprimido al m\u00e1ximo<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"propiedad\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 Cero en Posici\u00f3n Natural<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>\\(E_{pe} = 0\\) cuando \\(x = 0\\)<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo\">Resorte sin deformar<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"comparacion-grafica\">\r\n                    <div class=\"grafica\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"300\" height=\"200\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 200\">\r\n                            <path d=\"M30,180 Q150,20 270,180\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"150\" y=\"190\" fill=\"#39FF14\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Epe = \u00bdkx\u00b2<\/text>\r\n                            <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.3)\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>\r\n                            <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.3)\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- CONSERVACI\u00d3N DE ENERG\u00cdA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Conservaci\u00f3n de Energ\u00eda en Sistemas El\u00e1sticos<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"conservacion-container\">\r\n                <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    E_{mec} = E_k + E_{pe} = \\text{constante}\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"sistema-masa-resorte\">\r\n                    <div class=\"diagrama\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 200\">\r\n                            <!-- Resorte en posici\u00f3n natural -->\r\n                            <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#1976D2\" stroke-width=\"4\"\/>\r\n                            <path d=\"M100 150 Q90 170 100 190 Q110 210 100 230\" stroke=\"#1976D2\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                            <rect x=\"90\" y=\"230\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#42A5F5\" rx=\"3\"\/>\r\n\r\n                            <!-- Resorte estirado -->\r\n                            <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#1976D2\" stroke-width=\"4\"\/>\r\n                            <path d=\"M300 150 Q280 180 300 210 Q320 240 300 270\" stroke=\"#1976D2\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                            <rect x=\"290\" y=\"270\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#42A5F5\" rx=\"3\"\/>\r\n\r\n                            <!-- Flechas y etiquetas -->\r\n                            <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowhead)\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"200\" y1=\"110\" fill=\"#39FF14\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Fuerza aplicada<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"100\" y=\"260\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Posici\u00f3n natural<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"290\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Deformaci\u00f3n x<\/text>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>En un sistema masa-resorte <strong>ideal<\/strong> (sin fricci\u00f3n):<\/p>\r\n                        <ol>\r\n                            <li>Al estirar\/comprimir: \\(E_{pe}\\) aumenta, \\(E_k\\) disminuye<\/li>\r\n                            <li>En posici\u00f3n natural: \\(E_{pe} = 0\\), \\(E_k\\) m\u00e1xima<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Oscilaci\u00f3n continua entre formas de energ\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ol>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-practico\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Sistema con \\(k = 200\\) N\/m, \\(m = 0.5\\) kg, \\(x = 0.1\\) m:<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"pasos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"paso\">\r\n                            <strong>1. Energ\u00eda potencial m\u00e1xima:<\/strong><br>\r\n                            \\(E_{pe} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 200 \\times 0.01 = 1\\) J\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"paso\">\r\n                            <strong>2. Velocidad m\u00e1xima (en x=0):<\/strong><br>\r\n                            \\(\\frac{1}{2}kx^2 = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\) \u2192 \\(v = \\sqrt{\\frac{k}{m}}x = 2\\) m\/s\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"paso\">\r\n                            <strong>3. Frecuencia de oscilaci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                            \\(\\omega = \\sqrt{\\frac{k}{m}} = 20\\) rad\/s \u2192 \\(f = 3.18\\) Hz\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- EJEMPLO PR\u00c1CTICO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Ejemplo de Aplicaci\u00f3n Real<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"ejemplo-destacado\">\r\n                <p><strong>Problema:<\/strong> Un resorte de constante \\(k = 500\\) N\/m se comprime 12 cm con una masa de 2 kg. Al soltarla:<\/p>\r\n                <ol>\r\n                    <li>Calcula la energ\u00eda potencial el\u00e1stica inicial<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Determina la velocidad m\u00e1xima de la masa<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Calcula la altura m\u00e1xima que alcanzar\u00eda si el resorte estuviera vertical<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <div class=\"solucion-paso-a-paso\">\r\n                    <div class=\"paso\">\r\n                        <strong>1. Energ\u00eda potencial inicial:<\/strong><br>\r\n                        \\(E_{pe} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 500 \\times (0.12)^2 = 3.6\\) J\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"paso\">\r\n                        <strong>2. Velocidad m\u00e1xima:<\/strong><br>\r\n                        \\(3.6 = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 2 \\times v^2\\) \u2192 \\(v = 1.9\\) m\/s\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"paso\">\r\n                        <strong>3. Altura m\u00e1xima:<\/strong><br>\r\n                        \\(mgh = 3.6\\) \u2192 \\(h = 0.18\\) m (conservaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda)\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: SISTEMA MASA-RESORTE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"epe-simulator\">\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>\u2699\ufe0f CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"constanteElastica\">Constante el\u00e1stica (k):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"constanteElastica\" min=\"10\" max=\"1000\" step=\"10\" value=\"200\">\r\n                    <span id=\"valorK\">200 N\/m<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"masaObjeto\">Masa (m):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"masaObjeto\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"5\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"valorMasa\">1 kg<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"deformacionInicial\">Deformaci\u00f3n inicial (x):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"deformacionInicial\" min=\"0.01\" max=\"0.5\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0.1\">\r\n                    <span id=\"valorDeformacion\">0.10 m<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"tipoSimulacion\">Tipo de simulaci\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"tipoSimulacion\">\r\n                        <option value=\"oscilacion\">Oscilaci\u00f3n libre<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"deformacion\">Deformaci\u00f3n est\u00e1tica<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"energias\">Gr\u00e1fica de energ\u00edas<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-simular\" onclick=\"iniciarSimulacion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6\ufe0f<\/span> INICIAR SIMULACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarSimulador()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <svg id=\"simuladorEPE\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\">\r\n                    <!-- Pared -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"50\" y=\"150\" width=\"20\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#455A64\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Resorte (inicial) -->\r\n                    <g id=\"resorte\">\r\n                        <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#1976D2\" stroke-width=\"4\" id=\"lineaResorte\"\/>\r\n                        <path d=\"M70 250 Q60 270 70 290 Q80 310 70 330\" stroke=\"#1976D2\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" id=\"espiralResorte\"\/>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Masa -->\r\n                    <g id=\"masa\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"50\" y=\"330\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#42A5F5\" rx=\"5\" id=\"cajaMasa\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"70\" y=\"355\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"textoMasa\">1 kg<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Ejes de referencia -->\r\n                    <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"350\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"350\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"125\" y=\"370\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.7)\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Posici\u00f3n natural<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Indicadores -->\r\n                    <g id=\"indicadores\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"250\" y=\"50\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.7)\" rx=\"10\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"90\" fill=\"#39FF14\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"textoEPE\">Epe = 1.0 J<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"120\" fill=\"#FF6B6B\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"textoEK\">Ek = 0.0 J<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"150\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"textoTotal\">Etotal = 1.0 J<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Gr\u00e1fica de energ\u00edas -->\r\n                    <g id=\"graficaEnergias\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"300\" y=\"200\" width=\"400\" height=\"180\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.5)\" rx=\"10\"\/>\r\n                        <!-- Ejes -->\r\n                        <line x1=\"320\" y1=\"370\" x2=\"680\" y2=\"370\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>\r\n                        <line x1=\"320\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"370\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>\r\n                        <!-- Curva Epe -->\r\n                        <path d=\"M320,370 Q400,220 480,370 Q560,220 640,370\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" id=\"curvaEPE\"\/>\r\n                        <!-- Curva Ek -->\r\n                        <path d=\"M320,370 Q400,370 480,220 Q560,370 640,370\" stroke=\"#FF6B6B\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" id=\"curvaEK\"\/>\r\n                        <!-- Etiquetas -->\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"390\" fill=\"#39FF14\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Epe<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"500\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#FF6B6B\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ek<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"310\" y=\"370\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-A<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"380\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"490\" y=\"370\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">+A<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"300\" y=\"220\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Emax<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca DATOS DE SIMULACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Constante el\u00e1stica (k):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataK\">200 N\/m<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Masa (m):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataMasa\">1 kg<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Deformaci\u00f3n (x):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataDeformacion\">0.10 m<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Energ\u00eda potencial m\u00e1xima:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEPEMax\">1.0 J<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Frecuencia angular (\u03c9):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataFrecuencia\">14.1 rad\/s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Per\u00edodo (T):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPeriodo\">0.44 s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N (30 PREGUNTAS)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>La Ley de Hooke establece que:<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        La fuerza es inversamente proporcional a la deformaci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        La fuerza restauradora es proporcional y opuesta a la deformaci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        La energ\u00eda potencial es directamente proporcional a la deformaci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        La constante el\u00e1stica depende de la masa del objeto\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> La Ley de Hooke se expresa como \\(F = -kx\\), donde la fuerza es proporcional y opuesta a la deformaci\u00f3n.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la secci\u00f3n \"Ley de Hooke\" donde se explica \\(F = -kx\\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>La energ\u00eda potencial el\u00e1stica depende de:<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Linealmente de la deformaci\u00f3n \\(x\\)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        De la velocidad del objeto\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Del cuadrado de la deformaci\u00f3n \\(x^2\\)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Solo de la constante el\u00e1stica \\(k\\)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> La f\u00f3rmula \\(E_{pe} = \\frac{1}{2}kx^2\\) muestra la dependencia cuadr\u00e1tica con \\(x\\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la secci\u00f3n \"Energ\u00eda Potencial El\u00e1stica\" donde se deriva la f\u00f3rmula.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Si duplicas la deformaci\u00f3n de un resorte, su energ\u00eda potencial el\u00e1stica:<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Se cuadruplica\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Se duplica\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Permanece igual\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Se reduce a la mitad\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Como \\(E_{pe} \\propto x^2\\), duplicar \\(x\\) cuadruplica \\(E_{pe}\\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Recuerda que la dependencia es cuadr\u00e1tica (\\(x^2\\)), no lineal.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTAS 4-30 (similar estructura) -->\r\n            <!-- ... -->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/30\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados.\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR FUERZA EL\u00c1STICA CON ENERG\u00cdA<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"La energ\u00eda potencial el\u00e1stica es \\(F = -kx\\)\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong>\r\n                        <div class=\"comparacion\">\r\n                            <div>\r\n                                <strong>Fuerza el\u00e1stica:<\/strong><br>\r\n                                \\(F = -kx\\) (Newtons)\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div>\r\n                                <strong>Energ\u00eda potencial:<\/strong><br>\r\n                                \\(E_{pe} = \\frac{1}{2}kx^2\\) (Joules)\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <p><strong>Diferencia clave:<\/strong> La fuerza es lineal con \\(x\\), mientras que la energ\u00eda es cuadr\u00e1tica (\\(x^2\\)).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-grafica\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"300\" height=\"150\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 150\">\r\n                            <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,2\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"150\" y=\"140\" fill=\"#39FF14\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Fuerza (F = -kx)<\/text>\r\n                            <path d=\"M30,130 Q150,20 270,130\" stroke=\"#FF6B6B\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"150\" y=\"40\" fill=\"#FF6B6B\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Energ\u00eda (Epe = \u00bdkx\u00b2)<\/text>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c OLVIDAR EL L\u00cdMITE EL\u00c1STICO<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"La Ley de Hooke siempre se cumple, sin importar cu\u00e1nto se deforme el resorte\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong>\r\n                        <p>La Ley de Hooke solo es v\u00e1lida en el <strong>r\u00e9gimen el\u00e1stico<\/strong>, hasta el <strong>l\u00edmite el\u00e1stico<\/strong>:<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"grafica-limites\">\r\n                            <svg width=\"300\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 100\">\r\n                                <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                                <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#FF6B6B\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,2\"\/>\r\n                                <text x=\"70\" y=\"90\" fill=\"#39FF14\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">El\u00e1stico<\/text>\r\n                                <text x=\"170\" y=\"50\" fill=\"#FF6B6B\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pl\u00e1stico<\/text>\r\n                                <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"\/>\r\n                                <text x=\"120\" y=\"90\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">L\u00edmite el\u00e1stico<\/text>\r\n                            <\/svg>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <p><strong>Consecuencia:<\/strong> Superar este l\u00edmite causa deformaci\u00f3n permanente.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR CONSTANTE EL\u00c1STICA CON MASA<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"Un resorte con mayor constante el\u00e1stica puede sostener m\u00e1s masa porque es 'm\u00e1s fuerte'\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong>\r\n                        <p>La constante el\u00e1stica (\\(k\\)) determina:<\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>La <strong>rigidez<\/strong> del resorte (no su \"fuerza\")<\/li>\r\n                            <li>La relaci\u00f3n entre <strong>fuerza aplicada<\/strong> y <strong>deformaci\u00f3n<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                            <li>La <strong>frecuencia natural<\/strong> de oscilaci\u00f3n: \\(\\omega = \\sqrt{k\/m}\\)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Un resorte con \\(k = 1000\\) N\/m se deforma 1 cm con 10 N, mientras que uno con \\(k = 100\\) N\/m se deforma 10 cm con la misma fuerza.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- M\u00c1S ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n            <!-- ... -->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN (12 EJERCICIOS)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>C\u00e1lculo B\u00e1sico de \\(E_{pe}\\)<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un resorte con constante el\u00e1stica \\(k = 300\\) N\/m se estira 8 cm. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>La energ\u00eda potencial el\u00e1stica almacenada<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La fuerza necesaria para mantener esa deformaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La energ\u00eda potencial si la deformaci\u00f3n se duplica<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n paso a paso...\" rows=\"6\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">\r\n                    \u2705 VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. \\(E_{pe} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 300 \\times (0.08)^2 = 0.96\\) J<br>\r\n                    2. \\(F = kx = 300 \\times 0.08 = 24\\) N<br>\r\n                    3. \\(E_{pe}' = 4 \\times 0.96 = 3.84\\) J (por dependencia cuadr\u00e1tica)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Sistema Masa-Resorte Vertical<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Una masa de 0.5 kg cuelga de un resorte con \\(k = 250\\) N\/m, estir\u00e1ndolo 2 cm desde su posici\u00f3n natural. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>La energ\u00eda potencial el\u00e1stica almacenada<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La velocidad m\u00e1xima de la masa si se suelta desde esa posici\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La frecuencia de oscilaci\u00f3n del sistema<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Muestra todos los c\u00e1lculos...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">\r\n                    \u2705 VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. \\(E_{pe} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 250 \\times (0.02)^2 = 0.05\\) J<br>\r\n                    2. \\(0.05 = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 0.5 \\times v^2\\) \u2192 \\(v = 0.447\\) m\/s<br>\r\n                    3. \\(\\omega = \\sqrt{\\frac{250}{0.5}} = 22.36\\) rad\/s \u2192 \\(f = 3.56\\) Hz\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P3<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Conservaci\u00f3n de Energ\u00eda Mec\u00e1nica<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un resorte horizontal con \\(k = 400\\) N\/m tiene una masa de 2 kg acoplada. Se comprime 10 cm y se suelta. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>La energ\u00eda mec\u00e1nica total del sistema<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La velocidad de la masa cuando pasa por la posici\u00f3n de equilibrio<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La aceleraci\u00f3n m\u00e1xima del sistema<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(3)\">\r\n                    \u2705 VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP3\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. \\(E_{total} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 400 \\times (0.1)^2 = 2\\) J<br>\r\n                    2. En equilibrio: \\(E_{total} = E_k\\) \u2192 \\(2 = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 2 \\times v^2\\) \u2192 \\(v = 2\\) m\/s<br>\r\n                    3. \\(a_{max} = \\frac{F_{max}}{m} = \\frac{400 \\times 0.1}{2} = 20\\) m\/s\u00b2\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PROBLEMAS 4-12 -->\r\n            <!-- ... -->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4 pts)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2 pts)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Aplicaci\u00f3n de la Ley de Hooke<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Usa correctamente \\(F = -kx\\) en todos los casos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores menores en signos o unidades<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Confunde fuerza con energ\u00eda o deformaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>C\u00e1lculo de \\(E_{pe}\\)<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Aplica \\(E_{pe} = \\frac{1}{2}kx^2\\) correctamente<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores en dependencia cuadr\u00e1tica<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Usa f\u00f3rmula incorrecta para \\(E_{pe}\\)<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Conservaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda mec\u00e1nica<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Analiza correctamente \\(E_k + E_{pe} = \\text{cte}\\)<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores en transformaci\u00f3n de energ\u00edas<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No comprende la conservaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis de sistemas oscilantes<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Relaciona \\(k\\), \\(m\\) y frecuencia correctamente<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores en c\u00e1lculos de frecuencia<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No comprende relaci\u00f3n entre par\u00e1metros<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n de la Ley de Hooke:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>C\u00e1lculo de energ\u00eda potencial el\u00e1stica:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Aplicaci\u00f3n en sistemas reales:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83e\udd14 REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo aplicar\u00eda los principios de la energ\u00eda potencial el\u00e1stica para dise\u00f1ar un sistema de amortiguaci\u00f3n para un edificio en zona s\u00edsmica?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Considera: selecci\u00f3n de resortes, c\u00e1lculo de energ\u00edas, l\u00edmites el\u00e1sticos...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Describe un ejemplo cotidiano donde la energ\u00eda potencial el\u00e1stica sea crucial para el funcionamiento del dispositivo.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplos: relojes, suspensiones, juguetes, herramientas...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO PERSONALIZADO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udccc REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (20 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar \\(F = -kx\\) y \\(E_{pe} = \\frac{1}{2}kx^2\\)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Identificar unidades de cada variable<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Resolver 2 problemas b\u00e1sicos<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udee0 PR\u00c1CTICA (40 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Usar simulador con 3 configuraciones diferentes<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Resolver problemas 3-6 del examen<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Completar 10 preguntas del quiz<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83e\udde0 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (60 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Investigar aplicaciones en ingenier\u00eda s\u00edsmica<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Analizar l\u00edmites el\u00e1sticos en materiales reales<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Resolver problemas avanzados (7-12)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/masses-and-springs\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udf00 Simulador PhET: Masas y Resortes\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/science\/physics\/work-and-energy\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcda Khan Academy: Trabajo y Energ\u00eda\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/hyperphysics.phy-astr.gsu.edu\/hbase\/permot2.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udd2c HyperPhysics: Oscilaciones\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.engineeringtoolbox.com\/spring-constant-d_925.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udee0 Engineering Toolbox: Constantes de Resortes\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT COMPLETO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DE ENERG\u00cdA POTENCIAL EL\u00c1STICA\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nlet simulacionActiva = false;\r\nlet animacionID = null;\r\n\r\nfunction iniciarSimulacion() {\r\n    if (simulacionActiva) {\r\n        cancelAnimationFrame(animacionID);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Obtener valores de controles\r\n    const k = parseFloat(document.getElementById('constanteElastica').value);\r\n    const m = parseFloat(document.getElementById('masaObjeto').value);\r\n    const x = parseFloat(document.getElementById('deformacionInicial').value);\r\n    const tipo = document.getElementById('tipoSimulacion').value;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar valores mostrados\r\n    document.getElementById('valorK').textContent = `${k} N\/m`;\r\n    document.getElementById('valorMasa').textContent = `${m} kg`;\r\n    document.getElementById('valorDeformacion').textContent = `${x} m`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ C\u00e1lculos f\u00edsicos\r\n    const epeMax = 0.5 * k * Math.pow(x, 2);\r\n    const omega = Math.sqrt(k \/ m);\r\n    const periodo = 2 * Math.PI \/ omega;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n    document.getElementById('dataK').textContent = `${k} N\/m`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataMasa').textContent = `${m} kg`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataDeformacion').textContent = `${x} m`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEPEMax').textContent = `${epeMax.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataFrecuencia').textContent = `${omega.toFixed(2)} rad\/s`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataPeriodo').textContent = `${periodo.toFixed(2)} s`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Configurar visualizaci\u00f3n seg\u00fan tipo de simulaci\u00f3n\r\n    const resorte = document.getElementById('resorte');\r\n    const masa = document.getElementById('masa');\r\n    const indicadores = document.getElementById('indicadores');\r\n    const graficaEnergias = document.getElementById('graficaEnergias');\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n    graficaEnergias.setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    indicadores.setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n\r\n    if (tipo === 'deformacion') {\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar deformaci\u00f3n est\u00e1tica\r\n        deformarResorte(k, x);\r\n        document.getElementById('textoEPE').textContent = `Epe = ${epeMax.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n        document.getElementById('textoEK').textContent = `Ek = 0.0 J`;\r\n        document.getElementById('textoTotal').textContent = `Etotal = ${epeMax.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n        indicadores.setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n    }\r\n    else if (tipo === 'oscilacion') {\r\n        \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de oscilaci\u00f3n\r\n        simulacionActiva = true;\r\n        let tiempo = 0;\r\n        const amplitud = x * 100; \/\/ Escalar para visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n\r\n        function animar() {\r\n            const posicion = amplitud * Math.sin(omega * tiempo);\r\n            const velocidad = amplitud * omega * Math.cos(omega * tiempo);\r\n            const ek = epeMax * Math.pow(Math.sin(omega * tiempo), 2);\r\n            const currentEpe = epeMax * Math.pow(Math.cos(omega * tiempo), 2);\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Actualizar posici\u00f3n de la masa\r\n            const nuevaY = 330 + posicion;\r\n            document.getElementById('cajaMasa').setAttribute('y', nuevaY);\r\n            document.getElementById('textoMasa').setAttribute('y', nuevaY + 25);\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Actualizar deformaci\u00f3n del resorte\r\n            const longitudNatural = 50; \/\/ Longitud natural en SVG\r\n            const nuevaLongitud = longitudNatural + posicion;\r\n            document.getElementById('espiralResorte').setAttribute('d',\r\n                `M70 250 Q60 ${250 + posicion\/2} 70 ${250 + posicion} Q80 ${250 + posicion*1.5} 70 ${250 + posicion*2}`);\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Actualizar indicadores de energ\u00eda\r\n            document.getElementById('textoEPE').textContent = `Epe = ${currentEpe.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n            document.getElementById('textoEK').textContent = `Ek = ${ek.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n            document.getElementById('textoTotal').textContent = `Etotal = ${(currentEpe + ek).toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n            indicadores.setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n\r\n            tiempo += 0.05;\r\n            animacionID = requestAnimationFrame(animar);\r\n        }\r\n        animar();\r\n    }\r\n    else if (tipo === 'energias') {\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar gr\u00e1fica de energ\u00edas\r\n        graficaEnergias.setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Dibujar curvas de energ\u00eda\r\n        const curvaEPE = document.getElementById('curvaEPE');\r\n        const curvaEK = document.getElementById('curvaEK');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Par\u00e1metros para la gr\u00e1fica (simplificada)\r\n        const A = 100; \/\/ Amplitud en SVG\r\n        const escalaX = 3;  \/\/ Escalado horizontal\r\n        const escalaY = 1.5; \/\/ Escalado vertical\r\n\r\n        curvaEPE.setAttribute('d',\r\n            `M320,370 Q${320 + A\/escaleX},${370 - epeMax*escaleY} ${320 + 2*A\/escaleX},370`);\r\n        curvaEK.setAttribute('d',\r\n            `M320,370 Q${320 + A\/escaleX},370 ${320 + 2*A\/escaleX},${370 - epeMax*escaleY} Q${320 + 3*A\/escaleX},370`);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction deformarResorte(k, x) {\r\n    const escala = 200; \/\/ Factor de escala para visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n    const deformacionVisual = x * escala;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Deformar resorte (simplificado)\r\n    const espiral = document.getElementById('espiralResorte');\r\n    espiral.setAttribute('d',\r\n        `M70 250 Q60 ${250 + deformacionVisual\/2} 70 ${250 + deformacionVisual}\r\n         Q80 ${250 + deformacionVisual*1.5} 70 ${250 + deformacionVisual*2}`);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Mover masa\r\n    const caja = document.getElementById('cajaMasa');\r\n    caja.setAttribute('y', 330 + deformacionVisual);\r\n    document.getElementById('textoMasa').setAttribute('y', 355 + deformacionVisual);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarSimulador() {\r\n    if (simulacionActiva) {\r\n        cancelAnimationFrame(animacionID);\r\n        simulacionActiva = false;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar controles\r\n    document.getElementById('constanteElastica').value = 200;\r\n    document.getElementById('masaObjeto').value = 1;\r\n    document.getElementById('deformacionInicial').value = 0.1;\r\n    document.getElementById('tipoSimulacion').value = 'oscilacion';\r\n    document.getElementById('valorK').textContent = '200 N\/m';\r\n    document.getElementById('valorMasa').textContent = '1 kg';\r\n    document.getElementById('valorDeformacion').textContent = '0.10 m';\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('cajaMasa').setAttribute('y', '330');\r\n    document.getElementById('textoMasa').setAttribute('y', '355');\r\n    document.getElementById('espiralResorte').setAttribute('d',\r\n        'M70 250 Q60 270 70 290 Q80 310 70 330');\r\n    document.getElementById('indicadores').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('graficaEnergias').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar datos\r\n    document.getElementById('dataK').textContent = '200 N\/m';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataMasa').textContent = '1 kg';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataDeformacion').textContent = '0.10 m';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEPEMax').textContent = '1.0 J';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataFrecuencia').textContent = '14.1 rad\/s';\r\n    document.getElementById('dataPeriodo').textContent = '0.44 s';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO (30 PREGUNTAS)\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n        const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n        const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q =>\r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n\r\n        if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n            const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n            const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n\r\n            document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n            let feedbackText = \"\";\r\n            if (porcentaje >= 90) {\r\n                feedbackText = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas la energ\u00eda potencial el\u00e1stica y la Ley de Hooke.\";\r\n            } else if (porcentaje >= 70) {\r\n                feedbackText = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero repasa la derivaci\u00f3n de \\(E_{pe}\\) y los l\u00edmites el\u00e1sticos.\";\r\n            } else if (porcentaje >= 50) {\r\n                feedbackText = \"\u26a0\ufe0f Necesitas practicar m\u00e1s con el simulador y los problemas.\";\r\n            } else {\r\n                feedbackText = \"\ud83d\ude15 Revisa todas las secciones te\u00f3ricas y los ejemplos.\";\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedbackText;\r\n            document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ ERRORES COMUNES INTERACTIVOS\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction toggleError(header) {\r\n    const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n\r\n    if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n    } else {\r\n        content.style.display = 'block';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    if (solucion.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'none';\r\n    } else {\r\n        solucion.style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N METACOGNITIVA\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n\r\n    alert(\r\n        `\ud83d\udcca Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Ley de Hooke: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `Energ\u00eda potencial el\u00e1stica: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `Aplicaciones pr\u00e1cticas: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Recomendaci\u00f3n: Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`\r\n    );\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ OBJETIVOS INTERACTIVOS\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n        this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n        const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n        checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n        checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : '';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ ACTUALIZACI\u00d3N DE VALORES EN TIEMPO REAL\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\ndocument.getElementById('constanteElastica').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    document.getElementById('valorK').textContent = this.value + ' N\/m';\r\n});\r\n\r\ndocument.getElementById('masaObjeto').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    document.getElementById('valorMasa').textContent = this.value + ' kg';\r\n});\r\n\r\ndocument.getElementById('deformacionInicial').addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n    document.getElementById('valorDeformacion').textContent = this.value + ' m';\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83c\udf00 Lecci\u00f3n: Energ\u00eda Potencial El\u00e1stica cargada\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83c\udfae Simulador, Quiz (30 preguntas) y 12 problemas listos\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\udcca Todos los sistemas interactivos funcionando\");\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"F\u00f3rmula ley de Hooke","respuesta":"F = -k x"},{"enunciado":"F\u00f3rmula EPE","respuesta":"\u00bd k x\u00b2"},{"enunciado":"Unidad k","respuesta":"N\/m"},{"enunciado":"Signo - en Hooke","respuesta":"Fuerza restauradora"},{"enunciado":"k = 500 N\/m, x = 0.1 m \u2192 EPE","respuesta":"2.5 J"},{"enunciado":"x dobla \u2192 EPE","respuesta":"\u00d74"},{"enunciado":"Resorte relajado EPE","respuesta":"0"},{"enunciado":"Trabajo para comprimir =","respuesta":"\u0394EPE"},{"enunciado":"F constante en resorte","respuesta":"No (var\u00eda con x)"},{"enunciado":"L\u00edmite el\u00e1stico","respuesta":"Hooke v\u00e1lido"},{"enunciado":"k alto \u2192 resorte","respuesta":"M\u00e1s r\u00edgido"},{"enunciado":"EPE m\u00e1xima en","respuesta":"x m\u00e1xima"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Ley de Hooke F =","opciones":["-k x","k x","m a","m g"],"correcta":"-k x"},{"pregunta":"EPE =","opciones":["\u00bd k x\u00b2","k x","m g h","\u00bd m v\u00b2"],"correcta":"\u00bd k x\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"k unidad","opciones":["N\/m","J","kg","m\/s\u00b2"],"correcta":"N\/m"},{"pregunta":"x = deformaci\u00f3n","opciones":["S\u00ed","No","A veces","Nunca"],"correcta":"S\u00ed"},{"pregunta":"Signo - indica","opciones":["Restauradora","Positiva","Nada","Error"],"correcta":"Restauradora"},{"pregunta":"Resorte relajado F =","opciones":["0","k","x","m\u00e1xima"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"x dobla \u2192 EPE","opciones":["\u00d74","\u00d72","\u00bd","igual"],"correcta":"\u00d74"},{"pregunta":"k dobla \u2192 EPE","opciones":["\u00d72","\u00d74","\u00bd","igual"],"correcta":"\u00d72"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo = \u0394EPE","opciones":["S\u00ed","No","A veces","Nunca"],"correcta":"S\u00ed"},{"pregunta":"L\u00edmite el\u00e1stico","opciones":["Hooke v\u00e1lido","Siempre","Nunca","Solo x=0"],"correcta":"Hooke v\u00e1lido"},{"pregunta":"k = 100 N\/m, x = 0.2 m \u2192 EPE","opciones":["2 J","20 J","4 J","0 J"],"correcta":"2 J"},{"pregunta":"F = 50 N, k = 500 N\/m \u2192 x","opciones":["0.1 m","10 m","0.01 m","50 m"],"correcta":"0.1 m"},{"pregunta":"Resorte r\u00edgido tiene k","opciones":["alto","bajo","cero","negativo"],"correcta":"alto"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda en resorte oscilante","opciones":["EP + EK = cte","solo EP","solo EK","crece"],"correcta":"EP + EK = cte"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e1ximo EK en resorte","opciones":["x = 0","x m\u00e1xima","x = 1","x = k"],"correcta":"x = 0"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e1ximo EPE en","opciones":["x m\u00e1xima","x = 0","v m\u00e1xima","m = 0"],"correcta":"x m\u00e1xima"},{"pregunta":"Per\u00edodo resorte T =","opciones":["2\u03c0 \u221a(m\/k)","2\u03c0 \u221a(k\/m)","2\u03c0 m\/k","2\u03c0 k\/m"],"correcta":"2\u03c0 \u221a(m\/k)"},{"pregunta":"Fuerza constante \u2192 EPE","opciones":["No cuadr\u00e1tica","cuadr\u00e1tica","lineal","cero"],"correcta":"No cuadr\u00e1tica"},{"pregunta":"SI: k en","opciones":["N\/m","J\/m","kg\/s\u00b2","Pa"],"correcta":"N\/m"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC\/SI 2025: EPE en","opciones":["Joule","cal","eV","kWh"],"correcta":"Joule"},{"pregunta":"k = 800 N\/m, x = 0.05 m \u2192 EPE","opciones":["1 J","2 J","0.5 J","10 J"],"correcta":"1 J"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo para estirar 0.1 m (k=400 N\/m)","opciones":["2 J","40 J","4 J","0 J"],"correcta":"2 J"},{"pregunta":"Resorte serie: k_eq =","opciones":["k\/2","2k","k","0"],"correcta":"k\/2"},{"pregunta":"Resorte paralelo: k_eq =","opciones":["2k","k\/2","k","0"],"correcta":"2k"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda disipada en amortiguador","opciones":["T\u00e9rmica","El\u00e9ctrica","Nuclear","Radiante"],"correcta":"T\u00e9rmica"},{"pregunta":"Fuerza m\u00e1xima en resorte","opciones":["k x_max","k","x","0"],"correcta":"k x_max"},{"pregunta":"L\u00edmite proporcional","opciones":["Hooke v\u00e1lido","Pl\u00e1stico","Roto","Cero"],"correcta":"Hooke v\u00e1lido"},{"pregunta":"M\u00f3dulo Young Y =","opciones":["\u03c3\/\u03b5","F\/A","\u0394L\/L","kL\/A"],"correcta":"\u03c3\/\u03b5"},{"pregunta":"Resorte ideal vs real","opciones":["Real pierde energ\u00eda","Igual","Ideal m\u00e1s r\u00edgido","Real m\u00e1s r\u00edgido"],"correcta":"Real pierde energ\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: 1 J =","opciones":["N\u00b7m","kg\u00b7m\/s\u00b2","W\u00b7s","todas"],"correcta":"todas"}]},{"materia":"F\u00edsica I","slug":"trabajo-fisica","titulo":"El Trabajo: W = F \u00b7 d cos \u03b8","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-fisica-trabajo\" data-tema=\"trabajo\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n            EL TRABAJO: <span class=\"formula-highlight\">W = F \u00b7 d cos \u03b8<\/span>\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Transferencia de energ\u00eda cuando una fuerza act\u00faa sobre un desplazamiento\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Calcular el trabajo en diferentes \u00e1ngulos<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Usar la f\u00f3rmula \\( W = F \\cdot d \\cdot \\cos \\theta \\) con precisi\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Diferenciar trabajo positivo, nulo y negativo<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Analizar el \u00e1ngulo \u03b8 y su impacto en el signo del trabajo<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar el teorema Trabajo-Energ\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Relacionar \\( W_{\\text{neto}} = \\Delta E_k \\) en problemas reales<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Simular escenarios de fuerzas y desplazamientos<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Usar el simulador interactivo para visualizar conceptos<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\ude80 Lanzamiento de Cohetes<\/h3>\r\n                <p>El trabajo realizado por los motores para vencer la gravedad y alcanzar la \u00f3rbita<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Fuerza: 35 MN | Trabajo: 1.2 TJ<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfcb\ufe0f Fisioterapia Deportiva<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Ejercicios de resistencia donde el \u00e1ngulo entre la fuerza aplicada y el movimiento es clave<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">\u00c1ngulo \u00f3ptimo: 45\u00b0-60\u00b0<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd0b Energ\u00edas Renovables<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Trabajo realizado por el viento sobre las aspas de un aerogenerador<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Potencia: 2-5 MW por turbina<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- DEFINICI\u00d3N Y F\u00d3RMULA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Definici\u00f3n de Trabajo<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>TRABAJO (W)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Transferencia de <strong>energ\u00eda<\/strong> cuando una <strong>fuerza<\/strong> act\u00faa sobre un objeto a lo largo de un <strong>desplazamiento<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                            W = F \\cdot d \\cdot \\cos \\theta\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-detalle\">\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>F<\/strong>: Magnitud de la fuerza (N)<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>d<\/strong>: Desplazamiento (m)<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>\u03b8<\/strong>: \u00c1ngulo entre F y d (\u00b0)<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Unidad SI<\/strong>: Joule (J) = N\u00b7m<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- CONDICIONES DEL TRABAJO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Condiciones del Trabajo seg\u00fan el \u00c1ngulo \u03b8<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>\u00c1ngulo \u03b8<\/th>\r\n                            <th>cos \u03b8<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Trabajo (W)<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Ejemplo<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"positivo\">\r\n                            <td>0\u00b0<\/td>\r\n                            <td>1<\/td>\r\n                            <td>M\u00e1ximo positivo<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Empujar un carrito en l\u00ednea recta<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"nulo\">\r\n                            <td>90\u00b0<\/td>\r\n                            <td>0<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Cero<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Cargar un objeto horizontalmente<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"negativo\">\r\n                            <td>180\u00b0<\/td>\r\n                            <td>-1<\/td>\r\n                            <td>M\u00e1ximo negativo<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Frenar un auto en movimiento<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoTrabajo\">\r\n                    Selecciona una fila para ver detalles\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TEOREMA TRABAJO-ENERG\u00cdA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Teorema Trabajo-Energ\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"teorema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"teorema-formula\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                        W_{\\text{neto}} = \\Delta E_k\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"teorema-explicacion\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Trabajo positivo<\/strong>: Aumenta la energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica (ej: acelerar un auto).<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Trabajo negativo<\/strong>: Disminuye la energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica (ej: frenar).<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Trabajo nulo<\/strong>: No cambia la energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica (ej: llevar una maleta horizontalmente).<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- EJEMPLO PR\u00c1CTICO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Ejemplo Pr\u00e1ctico<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"ejemplo-card\">\r\n                <p><strong>Problema:<\/strong> Calcula el trabajo realizado al arrastrar un objeto con <strong>F = 50 N<\/strong>, <strong>d = 10 m<\/strong> y <strong>\u03b8 = 30\u00b0<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-solucion\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        \\[\r\n                            W = 50 \\cdot 10 \\cdot \\cos 30\u00b0 = 500 \\cdot 0.866 = 433\\, \\text{J}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarEjemplo()\">VERIFICAR C\u00c1LCULO<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-feedback\" id=\"feedbackEjemplo\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <p>\u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> El trabajo es 433 J. El \u00e1ngulo de 30\u00b0 reduce la fuerza efectiva en un factor de cos(30\u00b0).<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: TRABAJO = F \u00b7 d cos \u03b8\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"trabajo-fuerza\">\r\n            <!-- CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"fuerzaInput\">Fuerza (F) en N:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"fuerzaInput\" min=\"10\" max=\"100\" value=\"50\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <span id=\"fuerzaValue\">50 N<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"distanciaInput\">Distancia (d) en m:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"distanciaInput\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" value=\"10\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <span id=\"distanciaValue\">10 m<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"anguloInput\">\u00c1ngulo (\u03b8) en \u00b0:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"anguloInput\" min=\"0\" max=\"180\" value=\"30\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <span id=\"anguloValue\">30\u00b0<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-ejecutar\" onclick=\"calcularTrabajo()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6<\/span> CALCULAR TRABAJO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"valoresAleatorios()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> VALORES ALEATORIOS\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" id=\"svgTrabajo\">\r\n                    <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\" id=\"fondoSimulador\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Ejes -->\r\n                    <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"350\" x2=\"550\" y2=\"350\" stroke=\"#4CAF50\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"340\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">d (m)<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Vector desplazamiento (d) -->\r\n                    <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"350\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"350\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"4\" id=\"vectorD\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"200\" y=\"330\" fill=\"#39FF14\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">d = <span id=\"svgDistancia\">10<\/span> m<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Vector fuerza (F) -->\r\n                    <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"350\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#FF00FF\" stroke-width=\"4\" id=\"vectorF\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"100\" y=\"280\" fill=\"#FF00FF\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">F = <span id=\"svgFuerza\">50<\/span> N<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- \u00c1ngulo \u03b8 -->\r\n                    <path d=\"M50 350 A100 350 0 0 0 150 250\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00FFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" id=\"arcoAngulo\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"120\" y=\"300\" fill=\"#00FFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\u03b8 = <span id=\"svgAngulo\">30<\/span>\u00b0<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Resultado -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"200\" y=\"50\" width=\"200\" height=\"80\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.7)\" rx=\"10\" id=\"resultadoCard\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"90\" fill=\"#39FF14\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"resultadoTrabajo\">W = 433 J<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"120\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"resultadoTipo\">Trabajo positivo<\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>DATOS DE SIMULACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Fuerza (F):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataFuerza\">50 N<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Distancia (d):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataDistancia\">10 m<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">\u00c1ngulo (\u03b8):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataAngulo\">30\u00b0<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">TRABAJO (W):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTrabajo\">433 J<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Tipo de trabajo:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTipo\">Positivo<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1ndo es cero el trabajo realizado por una fuerza?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Cuando la fuerza y el desplazamiento son paralelos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Cuando la fuerza es perpendicular al desplazamiento\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Cuando la fuerza es mayor a 100 N\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Cuando el desplazamiento es menor a 1 m\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> El trabajo es cero cuando \u03b8 = 90\u00b0 (cos 90\u00b0 = 0).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la f\u00f3rmula \\( W = F \\cdot d \\cdot \\cos \\theta \\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El trabajo depende del \u00e1ngulo entre la fuerza y el desplazamiento. Si son perpendiculares (\u03b8 = 90\u00b0), cos \u03b8 = 0 y W = 0.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 trabajo se realiza al aplicar una fuerza de 20 N sobre un objeto que se desplaza 5 m con un \u00e1ngulo de 60\u00b0?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        100 J\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        86.6 J\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        50 J\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        0 J\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> \\( W = 20 \\cdot 5 \\cdot \\cos 60\u00b0 = 50\\, \\text{J} \\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Recuerda que \\( \\cos 60\u00b0 = 0.5 \\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>C\u00e1lculo:<\/strong> \\( W = 20 \\cdot 5 \\cdot 0.5 = 50\\, \\text{J} \\).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                    Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/2\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                    Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES Y SOLUCIONES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR FUERZA NETA CON FUERZA APLICADA<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"Si aplico 100 N y el objeto no se mueve, el trabajo es 100 J\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El trabajo requiere <strong>desplazamiento<\/strong>. Si \\( d = 0 \\), \\( W = 0 \\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Practica:<\/strong> Calcula el trabajo si \\( F = 100\\, \\text{N} \\), \\( d = 0\\, \\text{m} \\), \\( \u03b8 = 30\u00b0 \\).<\/p>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                            <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> \\( W = 100 \\cdot 0 \\cdot \\cos 30\u00b0 = 0\\, \\text{J} \\).\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c OLVIDAR EL \u00c1NGULO EN EL C\u00c1LCULO<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"El trabajo es \\( F \\cdot d \\) sin considerar \\( \\cos \u03b8 \\)\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Siempre incluye \\( \\cos \u03b8 \\). Si \\( \u03b8 = 0\u00b0 \\), \\( \\cos \u03b8 = 1 \\); si \\( \u03b8 = 90\u00b0 \\), \\( \\cos \u03b8 = 0 \\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                        <table>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <th>\u00c1ngulo<\/th>\r\n                                <th>cos \u03b8<\/th>\r\n                                <th>W<\/th>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td>0\u00b0<\/td>\r\n                                <td>1<\/td>\r\n                                <td>M\u00e1ximo<\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td>90\u00b0<\/td>\r\n                                <td>0<\/td>\r\n                                <td>Cero<\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                        <\/table>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>C\u00e1lculo de Trabajo con \u00c1ngulo<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un bloque se desplaza 12 m bajo una fuerza de 80 N aplicada con un \u00e1ngulo de 45\u00b0. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>El trabajo realizado.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>El tipo de trabajo (positivo, nulo, negativo).<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo cambiar\u00eda el trabajo si el \u00e1ngulo fuera 120\u00b0?<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. \\( W = 80 \\cdot 12 \\cdot \\cos 45\u00b0 = 678.8\\, \\text{J} \\) (positivo).<br>\r\n                    2. Positivo, porque \\( 0\u00b0 < \u03b8 < 90\u00b0 \\).<br>\r\n                    3. \\( W = 80 \\cdot 12 \\cdot \\cos 120\u00b0 = -480\\, \\text{J} \\) (negativo).\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Aplicaci\u00f3n del Teorema Trabajo-Energ\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un objeto de 5 kg se mueve con una velocidad inicial de 2 m\/s. Se le aplica una fuerza de 30 N en la direcci\u00f3n del movimiento durante 4 m. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>El trabajo realizado.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La velocidad final del objeto.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. \\( W = 30 \\cdot 4 = 120\\, \\text{J} \\).<br>\r\n                    2. \\( W = \\Delta E_k \\Rightarrow 120 = \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 5 \\cdot (v_f^2 - 2^2) \\Rightarrow v_f = 7.35\\, \\text{m\/s} \\).\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>C\u00e1lculo correcto del trabajo<\/td>\r\n                        <td>F\u00f3rmula y unidades correctas<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Errores menores en c\u00e1lculos<\/td>\r\n                        <td>F\u00f3rmula o unidades incorrectas<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Aplicaci\u00f3n del teorema Trabajo-Energ\u00eda<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Relaci\u00f3n clara con \\( \\Delta E_k \\)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Falta justificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                        <td>No aplica el teorema<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc8 AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n de la f\u00f3rmula \\( W = F \\cdot d \\cdot \\cos \\theta \\):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Aplicaci\u00f3n en problemas reales:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es importante considerar el \u00e1ngulo \u03b8 al calcular el trabajo en situaciones cotidianas?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: empujar un carrito de supermercado...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Describe un escenario donde el trabajo realizado sea negativo. \u00bfQu\u00e9 implica esto f\u00edsicamente?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: frenar un auto...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcda PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar f\u00f3rmula y unidades<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Repasar \u00e1ngulos clave (0\u00b0, 90\u00b0, 180\u00b0)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udee0 PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Resolver 5 problemas con diferentes \u00e1ngulos<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Usar el simulador para visualizar escenarios<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udf93 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Investigar aplicaciones en ingenier\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Relacionar con energ\u00eda potencial<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/legacy\/energy-skate-park\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udfa2 Simulador PhET: Parque de Energ\u00eda\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/science\/physics\/work-and-energy\/work-and-energy-tutorial\/a\/what-is-work\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcda Khan Academy: \u00bfQu\u00e9 es el Trabajo?\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DE TRABAJO\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction calcularTrabajo() {\r\n    \/\/ Obtener valores de los sliders\r\n    const fuerza = parseFloat(document.getElementById('fuerzaInput').value);\r\n    const distancia = parseFloat(document.getElementById('distanciaInput').value);\r\n    const angulo = parseFloat(document.getElementById('anguloInput').value);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Validar que los valores sean n\u00fameros\r\n    if (isNaN(fuerza) || isNaN(distancia) || isNaN(angulo)) {\r\n        alert(\"Por favor, ingresa valores v\u00e1lidos para fuerza, distancia y \u00e1ngulo.\");\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar valores en la interfaz\r\n    document.getElementById('fuerzaValue').textContent = `${fuerza} N`;\r\n    document.getElementById('distanciaValue').textContent = `${distancia} m`;\r\n    document.getElementById('anguloValue').textContent = `${angulo}\u00b0`;\r\n    document.getElementById('svgFuerza').textContent = fuerza.toFixed(1);\r\n    document.getElementById('svgDistancia').textContent = distancia.toFixed(1);\r\n    document.getElementById('svgAngulo').textContent = angulo.toFixed(1);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Calcular trabajo\r\n    const radians = angulo * Math.PI \/ 180;\r\n    const trabajo = fuerza * distancia * Math.cos(radians);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar resultado en SVG\r\n    document.getElementById('resultadoTrabajo').textContent = `W = ${trabajo.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Determinar tipo de trabajo y color\r\n    let tipo = \"\";\r\n    let color = \"\";\r\n    if (angulo < 90) {\r\n        tipo = \"Trabajo positivo\";\r\n        color = \"#39FF14\";\r\n    } else if (angulo === 90) {\r\n        tipo = \"Trabajo nulo\";\r\n        color = \"#FFFF00\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        tipo = \"Trabajo negativo\";\r\n        color = \"#FF6B6B\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar tipo de trabajo en la interfaz\r\n    document.getElementById('resultadoTipo').textContent = tipo;\r\n    document.getElementById('resultadoTipo').style.color = color;\r\n    document.getElementById('resultadoCard').style.border = `2px solid ${color}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataTrabajo').textContent = `${trabajo.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataTipo').textContent = tipo;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar vector de fuerza en el SVG\r\n    const x2 = 150 + (distancia * 2) * Math.cos(radians);\r\n    const y2 = 150 - (distancia * 2) * Math.sin(radians);\r\n    document.getElementById('vectorF').setAttribute('x2', x2);\r\n    document.getElementById('vectorF').setAttribute('y2', y2);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar arco del \u00e1ngulo\r\n    const largeArcFlag = angulo > 180 ? 1 : 0;\r\n    const pathData = `M150 350 A${distancia * 1.5} ${distancia * 1.5} 0 ${largeArcFlag} 0 ${x2} ${y2}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('arcoAngulo').setAttribute('d', pathData);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de resultado\r\n    document.getElementById('resultadoCard').style.animation = 'pulse 1s';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Funci\u00f3n para generar valores aleatorios\r\nfunction valoresAleatorios() {\r\n    const fuerza = Math.floor(Math.random() * 90) + 10;\r\n    const distancia = Math.floor(Math.random() * 19) + 1;\r\n    const angulo = Math.floor(Math.random() * 180);\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('fuerzaInput').value = fuerza;\r\n    document.getElementById('distanciaInput').value = distancia;\r\n    document.getElementById('anguloInput').value = angulo;\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('fuerzaValue').textContent = `${fuerza} N`;\r\n    document.getElementById('distanciaValue').textContent = `${distancia} m`;\r\n    document.getElementById('anguloValue').textContent = `${angulo}\u00b0`;\r\n\r\n    calcularTrabajo(); \/\/ Actualizar simulador con los nuevos valores\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n\/\/ Event listeners para las opciones del quiz\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n        const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n\r\n        if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Mostrar resultados del quiz\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n    let feedback = \"\";\r\n    if (correctas === total) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas el concepto de trabajo.\";\r\n    } else if (correctas >= total \/ 2) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero repasa los \u00e1ngulos y la f\u00f3rmula.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas estudiar m\u00e1s el tema. Usa el simulador para practicar.\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Reiniciar el quiz\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ ERRORES COMUNES\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction toggleError(header) {\r\n    const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n\r\n    if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n    } else {\r\n        content.style.display = 'block';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2)) \/ 2;\r\n\r\n    alert(\r\n        `\ud83d\udcbe Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n        `F\u00f3rmula: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `Aplicaci\u00f3n: ${slider2}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`\r\n    );\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: El Trabajo en F\u00edsica - Cargada\");\r\n    calcularTrabajo(); \/\/ Inicializar simulador con valores por defecto\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Event listeners para sliders\r\n    document.getElementById('fuerzaInput').addEventListener('input', calcularTrabajo);\r\n    document.getElementById('distanciaInput').addEventListener('input', calcularTrabajo);\r\n    document.getElementById('anguloInput').addEventListener('input', calcularTrabajo);\r\n});\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"F\u00f3rmula trabajo","respuesta":"F d cos \u03b8"},{"enunciado":"\u03b8 = 90\u00b0 \u2192 W","respuesta":"0"},{"enunciado":"Unidad trabajo","respuesta":"Joule (J)"},{"enunciado":"Trabajo negativo cuando","respuesta":"F opuesta a d"},{"enunciado":"F = 20 N, d = 5 m, \u03b8 = 0\u00b0","respuesta":"100 J"},{"enunciado":"F = 30 N, d = 4 m, \u03b8 = 60\u00b0","respuesta":"60 J"},{"enunciado":"Trabajo gravedad al subir","respuesta":"-mg h"},{"enunciado":"Fuerza \u22a5 a d \u2192 W","respuesta":"0"},{"enunciado":"W_neto =","respuesta":"\u0394EK"},{"enunciado":"1 kJ =","respuesta":"1000 J"},{"enunciado":"F variable \u2192 W =","respuesta":"\u222b F dx"},{"enunciado":"Trabajo motor auto","respuesta":"Aumenta EK"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Trabajo =","opciones":["F d cos \u03b8","F d","m a d","P t"],"correcta":"F d cos \u03b8"},{"pregunta":"Unidad trabajo","opciones":["Joule","Newton","Metro","Watt"],"correcta":"Joule"},{"pregunta":"\u03b8 = 0\u00b0 \u2192 cos \u03b8 =","opciones":["1","0","-1","0.5"],"correcta":"1"},{"pregunta":"\u03b8 = 90\u00b0 \u2192 W =","opciones":["0","Fd","-Fd","m\u00e1ximo"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo positivo \u2192 EK","opciones":["Aumenta","Disminuye","Igual","Cero"],"correcta":"Aumenta"},{"pregunta":"F = 100 N, d = 2 m, \u03b8 = 0\u00b0 \u2192 W","opciones":["200 J","100 J","0 J","50 J"],"correcta":"200 J"},{"pregunta":"Fuerza \u22a5 a d \u2192 W","opciones":["0","m\u00e1ximo","negativo","infinito"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo gravedad al caer","opciones":["+mg h","-mg h","0","mgh\u00b2"],"correcta":"+mg h"},{"pregunta":"W_neto =","opciones":["\u0394EK","\u0394EP","\u0394U","P \u0394t"],"correcta":"\u0394EK"},{"pregunta":"1 J =","opciones":["N\u00b7m","kg\u00b7m\/s\u00b2","W\u00b7s","todas"],"correcta":"todas"},{"pregunta":"F = 40 N, d = 3 m, \u03b8 = 30\u00b0 \u2192 W","opciones":["104 J","120 J","60 J","0 J"],"correcta":"104 J"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo fricci\u00f3n","opciones":["Negativo","Positivo","Cero","Variable"],"correcta":"Negativo"},{"pregunta":"Motor hace W = 500 J \u2192 EK","opciones":["+500 J","-500 J","0 J","500 N"],"correcta":"+500 J"},{"pregunta":"F variable \u2192 W =","opciones":["\u00e1rea bajo F vs d","F promedio \u00b7 d","F m\u00e1x \u00b7 d","0"],"correcta":"\u00e1rea bajo F vs d"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo en c\u00edrculo completo","opciones":["0 (fuerza central)","Fd","2\u03c0r F","infinito"],"correcta":"0 (fuerza central)"},{"pregunta":"Fuerza conservativa \u2192 W","opciones":["independiente camino","depende camino","siempre 0","siempre Fd"],"correcta":"independiente camino"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo m\u00ednimo para mover","opciones":["\u03b8 = 0\u00b0","\u03b8 = 90\u00b0","\u03b8 = 180\u00b0","cualquiera"],"correcta":"\u03b8 = 0\u00b0"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: trabajo en","opciones":["Joule","erg","calor\u00eda","eV"],"correcta":"Joule"},{"pregunta":"F = 15 N, d = 4 m, \u03b8 = 180\u00b0 \u2192 W","opciones":["-60 J","60 J","0 J","15 J"],"correcta":"-60 J"},{"pregunta":"Potencia =","opciones":["W \/ t","W \u00b7 t","F \/ d","E \/ m"],"correcta":"W \/ t"},{"pregunta":"F = 200 N, d = 10 m, \u03b8 = 53\u00b0 \u2192 W \u2248","opciones":["1200 J","2000 J","0 J","1000 J"],"correcta":"1200 J"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo total =","opciones":["\u2211 W_i","W_m\u00e1x","W_m\u00edn","0"],"correcta":"\u2211 W_i"},{"pregunta":"Fuerza normal piso \u2192 W","opciones":["0","mg d","mg h","Fd"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"W = \u222b F dx para","opciones":["F variable","F constante","\u03b8 = 0","\u03b8 = 90\u00b0"],"correcta":"F variable"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo gravitacional =","opciones":["-mg \u0394h","mg \u0394h","mg d","0"],"correcta":"-mg \u0394h"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda mec\u00e1nica total","opciones":["EK + EP","W","P","F d"],"correcta":"EK + EP"},{"pregunta":"Fricci\u00f3n est\u00e1tica \u2192 W","opciones":["0 (sin movimiento)","\u03bc N d","Fd","infinito"],"correcta":"0 (sin movimiento)"},{"pregunta":"1 kWh =","opciones":["3.6 MJ","3.6 kJ","36 MJ","0.36 MJ"],"correcta":"3.6 MJ"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo en resorte =","opciones":["\u00bd k x\u00b2","k x","F d","m g h"],"correcta":"\u00bd k x\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: 1 J =","opciones":["1 N\u00b7m","1 kg\u00b7m\u00b2\/s\u00b2","1 W\u00b7s","todas"],"correcta":"todas"}]},{"materia":"F\u00edsica I","slug":"energia-colisiones-impulso-movimiento","titulo":"Energ\u00eda y Colisiones: Din\u00e1mica Cu\u00e1ntica de Impactos","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-fisica-colisiones\" data-tema=\"energia-colisiones\">\r\n\r\n<!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n    <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n        ENERG\u00cdA Y COLISIONES\r\n    <\/h1>\r\n    <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n        Din\u00e1mica Cu\u00e1ntica de Impactos: Impulso, Momento Lineal y Conservaci\u00f3n\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/header>\r\n\r\n<!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n<section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Calcular impulso y momento lineal<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Relacionar \\(J = F\\Delta t = \\Delta p\\) en sistemas din\u00e1micos<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Aplicar conservaci\u00f3n del momento<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Resolver colisiones usando \\(\\sum p_i = \\sum p_f\\)<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Diferenciar colisiones el\u00e1sticas\/inel\u00e1sticas<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Calcular coeficiente de restituci\u00f3n \\(e\\) y p\u00e9rdida de EK<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n            <h3>Analizar sistemas reales<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Choques vehiculares, impactos deportivos, f\u00edsica de part\u00edculas<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n<section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n            <h3>Seguridad Vehicular<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Airbags aumentan \\(\\Delta t\\) para reducir \\(F\\) en impacto: \\(J = F\\Delta t = \\text{constante}\\)<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"dato-neon\">\u0394t \u2248 0.1s (con airbag)<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n            <h3>Deportes de Impacto<\/h3>\r\n            <p>Boxeo: guantes aumentan tiempo de contacto reduciendo fuerza sobre cr\u00e1neo<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"dato-neon\">F reducida 30-40%<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n            <h3>Colisiones Subat\u00f3micas<\/h3>\r\n            <p>LHC: conservaci\u00f3n de momento en choques prot\u00f3n-prot\u00f3n a 0.99c<\/p>\r\n            <div class=\"dato-neon\">E = 13 TeV<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- TEOR\u00cdA ESTRUCTURADA -->\r\n<section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONCEPTOS B\u00c1SICOS -->\r\n    <div class=\"conceptos-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"concept-header\">\r\n                <h4><span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd35<\/span> MOMENTO LINEAL (p)<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"concept-badge\">Vectorial<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"concept-formula\">\r\n                \\[ \\vec{p} = m\\vec{v} \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"concept-datos\">\r\n                <p><strong>Unidad SI:<\/strong> kg\u00b7m\/s<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Propiedad:<\/strong> Se conserva en sistemas aislados<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Bola billar: \\(m=0.2\\ \\text{kg}, v=5\\ \\text{m\/s} \\Rightarrow p=1\\ \\text{kg\u00b7m\/s}\\)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"concept-header\">\r\n                <h4><span class=\"icon\">\u26a1<\/span> IMPULSO (J)<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"concept-badge\">Cambio de p<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"concept-formula\">\r\n                \\[ \\vec{J} = \\vec{F}_{\\text{prom}} \\Delta t = \\Delta \\vec{p} \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"concept-datos\">\r\n                <p><strong>Unidad SI:<\/strong> N\u00b7s<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Teorema:<\/strong> \\( J = \\int F\\, dt = p_f - p_i \\)<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Aplicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Airbags: \u2191\u0394t \u2192 \u2193F para mismo \u0394p<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"concept-header\">\r\n                <h4><span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> 2\u00aa LEY DE NEWTON<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"concept-badge\">Forma general<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"concept-formula\">\r\n                \\[ \\vec{F} = \\frac{d\\vec{p}}{dt} \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"concept-datos\">\r\n                <p><strong>Relaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> \\(F = m a\\) es caso particular (m constante)<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Versatilidad:<\/strong> V\u00e1lida para m variable (cohetes)<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Cohete: pierde masa, F sigue = dp\/dt<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONSERVACI\u00d3N DEL MOMENTO -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>1. Ley de Conservaci\u00f3n del Momento Lineal<\/h3>\r\n        <div class=\"ley-principal\">\r\n            <div class=\"ley-formula\">\r\n                \\[ \\sum \\vec{p}_{\\text{inicial}} = \\sum \\vec{p}_{\\text{final}} \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"ley-condiciones\">\r\n                <p><strong>Condiciones:<\/strong> Sistema aislado (F externa neta = 0)<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>V\u00e1lida en:<\/strong> TODAS las colisiones (el\u00e1sticas e inel\u00e1sticas)<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>Ejemplo sistema:<\/strong> Dos bolas chocando sobre mesa sin fricci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- TABLA TIPOS COLISIONES -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>2. Tipos de Colisiones: Energ\u00eda vs Momento<\/h3>\r\n        <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n            <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                <thead>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>TIPO<\/th>\r\n                        <th>COEFICIENTE e<\/th>\r\n                        <th>ENERG\u00cdA CIN\u00c9TICA<\/th>\r\n                        <th>ESTADO FINAL<\/th>\r\n                        <th>EJEMPLO<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr data-tipo=\"elastica\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">EL\u00c1STICA<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>\\(e = 1\\)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Conservada<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Cuerpos separados<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Bolas de billar, choques moleculares<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-tipo=\"inelastica\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">INEL\u00c1STICA<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>\\(0 < e < 1\\)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>P\u00e9rdida parcial<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Cuerpos separados<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Choque automovil\u00edstico, f\u00fatbol<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr data-tipo=\"perfecta-inelastica\">\r\n                        <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">PERF. INEL\u00c1STICA<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>\\(e = 0\\)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>M\u00e1xima p\u00e9rdida<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Cuerpos unidos<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Choque automovil\u00edstico con enganche<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- COEFICIENTE RESTITUCI\u00d3N -->\r\n    <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n        <h3>3. Coeficiente de Restituci\u00f3n (e)<\/h3>\r\n        <div class=\"formula-compacta\">\r\n            <div class=\"formula-principal\">\r\n                \\[ e = -\\frac{v_{2f} - v_{1f}}{v_{2i} - v_{1i}} = \\frac{\\text{velocidad relativa despu\u00e9s}}{\\text{velocidad relativa antes}} \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-rango\">\r\n                <p><strong>Rango:<\/strong> \\(0 \\leq e \\leq 1\\)<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>e = 1:<\/strong> Colisi\u00f3n perfectamente el\u00e1stica<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>e = 0:<\/strong> Colisi\u00f3n perfectamente inel\u00e1stica<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>0 < e < 1:<\/strong> Colisi\u00f3n inel\u00e1stica real<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n<section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: COLISIONES 2D\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"colisiones-2d\">\r\n        <!-- CONTROLES -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n            <h3>PAR\u00c1METROS<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"masa1\">Masa 1 (kg):<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"masa1\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"2\" step=\"0.5\">\r\n                <span class=\"control-value\" id=\"valorMasa1\">2.0<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"velocidad1\">Velocidad 1 (m\/s):<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"velocidad1\" min=\"0\" max=\"20\" value=\"8\" step=\"0.5\">\r\n                <span class=\"control-value\" id=\"valorVel1\">8.0<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"masa2\">Masa 2 (kg):<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"masa2\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"3\" step=\"0.5\">\r\n                <span class=\"control-value\" id=\"valorMasa2\">3.0<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"velocidad2\">Velocidad 2 (m\/s):<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"velocidad2\" min=\"-10\" max=\"10\" value=\"-2\" step=\"0.5\">\r\n                <span class=\"control-value\" id=\"valorVel2\">-2.0<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                <label for=\"coeficiente\">Coeficiente e:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" id=\"coeficiente\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" value=\"1\" step=\"0.1\">\r\n                <span class=\"control-value\" id=\"valorCoef\">1.0<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"buttons-group\">\r\n                <button class=\"btn-simular\" onclick=\"ejecutarSimulacion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6<\/span> SIMULAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarSimulacion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u21ba<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacionColision\">\r\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" id=\"svgColision\">\r\n                <!-- FONDO CON GRID -->\r\n                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n                <defs>\r\n                    <pattern id=\"grid\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\r\n                        <path d=\"M 40 0 L 0 0 0 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.1)\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>\r\n                    <\/pattern>\r\n                <\/defs>\r\n                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" fill=\"url(#grid)\"\/>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- EJE CENTRAL -->\r\n                <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"350\" stroke=\"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- PART\u00cdCULA 1 -->\r\n                <g id=\"particula1\">\r\n                    <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"200\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#42A5F5\" stroke=\"#2196F3\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"150\" y=\"200\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dy=\".3em\" font-size=\"12\">m\u2081<\/text>\r\n                    <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#42A5F5\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"170\" y=\"190\" fill=\"#42A5F5\" font-size=\"10\">v\u2081<\/text>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- PART\u00cdCULA 2 -->\r\n                <g id=\"particula2\">\r\n                    <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"200\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#EF5350\" stroke=\"#D32F2F\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"450\" y=\"200\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dy=\".3em\" font-size=\"12\">m\u2082<\/text>\r\n                    <line x1=\"450\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#EF5350\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"430\" y=\"190\" fill=\"#EF5350\" font-size=\"10\">v\u2082<\/text>\r\n                <\/g>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- \u00c1REA DE COLISI\u00d3N -->\r\n                <rect x=\"280\" y=\"180\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255, 255, 0, 0.5)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"\/>\r\n                <text x=\"300\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#FFFF00\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">ZONA DE IMPACTO<\/text>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- DEFS PARA FLECHAS -->\r\n                <defs>\r\n                    <marker id=\"arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                        <path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"\/>\r\n                    <\/marker>\r\n                <\/defs>\r\n            <\/svg>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"simulador-info\" id=\"infoSimulacion\">\r\n                Ajusta par\u00e1metros y haz clic en SIMULAR\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n            <h3>DATOS DE COLISI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Momento inicial total:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPInicial\">0 kg\u00b7m\/s<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Momento final total:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPFinal\">0 kg\u00b7m\/s<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">EK inicial:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEKInicial\">0 J<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">EK final:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEKFinal\">0 J<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">P\u00e9rdida EK:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPerdidaEK\">0 J (0%)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Velocidad final 1:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataVF1\">0 m\/s<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"data-label\">Velocidad final 2:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataVF2\">0 m\/s<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udcc8 ESTAD\u00cdSTICAS<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <span>Conservaci\u00f3n p:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statConservacionP\">100%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <span>Conservaci\u00f3n EK:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statConservacionEK\">100%<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                    <span>Tipo colisi\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statTipoColision\">El\u00e1stica<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n<section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n        <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 se conserva en TODAS las colisiones (aisladas)?<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                    Energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica total\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                    Momento lineal total\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                    Velocidad de cada part\u00edcula\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                    Energ\u00eda potencial\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-content\">\r\n                    <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> El momento lineal total se conserva en sistemas aislados durante colisiones.\r\n                    <br><br>\r\n                    <strong>\ud83d\udccc Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La conservaci\u00f3n del momento lineal (\\(\\sum p_i = \\sum p_f\\)) es fundamental en colisiones. La energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica solo se conserva en choques el\u00e1sticos (\\(e = 1\\)). Las velocidades individuales cambian seg\u00fan el tipo de colisi\u00f3n.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                <h3>Un airbag reduce la fuerza de impacto porque:<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                    Aumenta la masa del conductor\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                    Disminuye el cambio de momento\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                    Aumenta el tiempo de desaceleraci\u00f3n\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                    Absorbe toda la energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-content\">\r\n                    <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Aumenta el tiempo de desaceleraci\u00f3n.\r\n                    <br><br>\r\n                    <strong>\ud83d\udccc Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Del teorema impulso-momento: \\(J = F\\Delta t = \\Delta p\\). Para un \\(\\Delta p\\) fijo (misma velocidad inicial), al aumentar \\(\\Delta t\\), la fuerza \\(F\\) disminuye. El airbag extiende el tiempo de desaceleraci\u00f3n de ~0.01s (sin airbag) a ~0.1s.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                <h3>En una colisi\u00f3n perfectamente inel\u00e1stica (\\(e = 0\\)):<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                    Se conserva toda la energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                    Los cuerpos rebotan con velocidades iguales\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                    El momento lineal no se conserva\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                    <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                    Los cuerpos permanecen unidos despu\u00e9s\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"feedback-content\">\r\n                    <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Los cuerpos permanecen unidos despu\u00e9s del choque.\r\n                    <br><br>\r\n                    <strong>\ud83d\udccc Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> En colisiones perfectamente inel\u00e1sticas (\\(e = 0\\)), los cuerpos se mueven juntos despu\u00e9s del impacto. Hay m\u00e1xima p\u00e9rdida de EK pero el momento lineal S\u00cd se conserva. La velocidad final com\u00fan es \\(v_f = \\frac{m_1 v_1 + m_2 v_2}{m_1 + m_2}\\).\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n<section class=\"errors-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES Y SOLUCIONES\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"errors-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                <h3>CONFUNDIR CONSERVACI\u00d3N DE p CON CONSERVACI\u00d3N DE EK<\/h3>\r\n                <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                    <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"En una colisi\u00f3n inel\u00e1stica, nada se conserva porque hay p\u00e9rdida de energ\u00eda\"\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                    <strong>\u2705 Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El MOMENTO LINEAL TOTAL (\\(p_{\\text{total}}\\)) SIEMPRE se conserva en sistemas aislados. La ENERG\u00cdA CIN\u00c9TICA solo se conserva en colisiones el\u00e1sticas.\r\n                    <br><br>\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    \\text{Conservaci\u00f3n } p: \\text{SIEMPRE} \\quad \\text{Conservaci\u00f3n } E_k: \\text{SOLO si } e = 1\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                    <p><strong>\ud83e\uddea Pr\u00e1ctica:<\/strong> Dos bolas de plastilina (m\u2081=2kg, v\u2081=5m\/s) y (m\u2082=3kg, v\u2082=0) chocan y quedan unidas. Calcula v final.<\/p>\r\n                    <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucionColisiones(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                    <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucionColisiones1\" style=\"display:none;\">\r\n                        <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                        Conservaci\u00f3n de p: \\(2\\cdot5 + 3\\cdot0 = (2+3)v_f\\)<br>\r\n                        \\(10 = 5v_f \\Rightarrow v_f = 2\\ \\text{m\/s}\\)<br>\r\n                        EK inicial: \\( \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot2\\cdot25 = 25\\ \\text{J}\\)<br>\r\n                        EK final: \\( \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot5\\cdot4 = 10\\ \\text{J}\\)<br>\r\n                        P\u00e9rdida: \\(15\\ \\text{J}\\) (60%)\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                <h3>IGNORAR LA NATURALEZA VECTORIAL DEL MOMENTO<\/h3>\r\n                <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                    <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"Sumar magnitudes sin considerar direcci\u00f3n en colisiones 2D\"\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                    <strong>\u2705 Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El momento es vector (\\(\\vec{p} = m\\vec{v}\\)). En 2D\/3D se conserva por componentes:\r\n                    <br><br>\r\n                    \\[\r\n                    \\sum p_{x,\\text{inicial}} = \\sum p_{x,\\text{final}} \\quad \\text{y} \\quad \\sum p_{y,\\text{inicial}} = \\sum p_{y,\\text{final}}\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                    <table>\r\n                        <tr><th>Escenario<\/th><th>Tratamiento correcto<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>Colisi\u00f3n frontal (1D)<\/td><td>Usar signos (+\/-) para direcci\u00f3n<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>Colisi\u00f3n oblicua (2D)<\/td><td>Resolver componentes x e y por separado<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <tr><td>Choque angular<\/td><td>Usar trigonometr\u00eda para descomponer<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <\/table>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n<section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                <h3>Problema de Colisi\u00f3n 1D<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                <p>Un auto de 1200 kg que viaja a 20 m\/s hacia el este choca frontalmente con una camioneta de 1800 kg que viaja a 12 m\/s hacia el oeste.<\/p>\r\n                <ol>\r\n                    <li>Si el choque es perfectamente inel\u00e1stico, calcula la velocidad final.<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Calcula la p\u00e9rdida de energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica.<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Si el choque fuera el\u00e1stico (\\(e = 1\\)), calcula las velocidades finales.<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <p><strong>Considera:<\/strong> Este = positivo, Oeste = negativo<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu soluci\u00f3n paso a paso...\" rows=\"8\" id=\"solucionP1\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">\u2713 VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1-detalle\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <strong>\u2705 Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br><br>\r\n                <strong>a) Choque perfectamente inel\u00e1stico:<\/strong><br>\r\n                \\(p_i = 1200\\cdot20 + 1800\\cdot(-12) = 24000 - 21600 = 2400\\ \\text{kg\u00b7m\/s}\\)<br>\r\n                \\(v_f = \\frac{2400}{1200+1800} = 0.8\\ \\text{m\/s}\\) (hacia el este)<br><br>\r\n                \r\n                <strong>b) P\u00e9rdida EK:<\/strong><br>\r\n                \\(EK_i = 0.5\\cdot1200\\cdot400 + 0.5\\cdot1800\\cdot144 = 240000 + 129600 = 369600\\ \\text{J}\\)<br>\r\n                \\(EK_f = 0.5\\cdot3000\\cdot0.64 = 960\\ \\text{J}\\)<br>\r\n                \\(\\Delta EK = 369600 - 960 = 368640\\ \\text{J}\\) (99.7% p\u00e9rdida)<br><br>\r\n                \r\n                <strong>c) Choque el\u00e1stico:<\/strong><br>\r\n                Conservaci\u00f3n p: \\(2400 = 1200v_1 + 1800v_2\\)<br>\r\n                e = 1: \\(v_2 - v_1 = -( (-12) - 20) = -32\\)<br>\r\n                Resolviendo: \\(v_1 = -15.2\\ \\text{m\/s}\\) (oeste), \\(v_2 = 16.8\\ \\text{m\/s}\\) (este)\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- R\u00daBRICA -->\r\n    <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n        <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n        <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                <th>Excelente (4-5)<\/th>\r\n                <th>Satisfactorio (2-3)<\/th>\r\n                <th>Insuficiente (0-1)<\/th>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>Aplicaci\u00f3n conservaci\u00f3n p<\/td>\r\n                <td>Identifica sistema aislado, aplica correctamente f\u00f3rmula vectorial<\/td>\r\n                <td>Aplica f\u00f3rmula pero errores en signos\/direcci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <td>No aplica conservaci\u00f3n o f\u00f3rmula incorrecta<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>C\u00e1lculo energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica<\/td>\r\n                <td>Calcula EK inicial\/final, identifica p\u00e9rdida y tipo colisi\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <td>Calcula EK pero no analiza p\u00e9rdida<\/td>\r\n                <td>Errores graves en c\u00e1lculo EK<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>An\u00e1lisis tipo colisi\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                <td>Diferencia claramente el\u00e1stica\/inel\u00e1stica, calcula e correctamente<\/td>\r\n                <td>Identifica tipo pero no justifica o calcula e<\/td>\r\n                <td>Confunde tipos de colisi\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/table>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n<section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n        <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n    <\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n        <!-- AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                <label>Comprensi\u00f3n impulso-momento (\\(J = \\Delta p\\)):<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                    <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                <label>Aplicaci\u00f3n conservaci\u00f3n del momento:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                    <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                <label>Diferencia colisiones el\u00e1sticas\/inel\u00e1sticas:<\/label>\r\n                <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                    <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- REFLEXI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                <p>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es importante el concepto de impulso (\\(J = F\\Delta t\\)) en dise\u00f1o de seguridad vehicular y deportiva?<\/p>\r\n                <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                <p>Describe una situaci\u00f3n cotidiana donde observes conservaci\u00f3n del momento y analiza qu\u00e9 tipo de colisi\u00f3n ocurre.<\/p>\r\n                <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu ejemplo...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- PLAN DE ESTUDIO -->\r\n        <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcda PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\u26a1 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Memorizar: \\(p = mv\\), \\(J = F\\Delta t = \\Delta p\\)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Recordar: Conservaci\u00f3n p SIEMPRE, EK solo si e=1<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Diferenciar: El\u00e1stica (e=1) vs Inel\u00e1stica (e<1)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udfaf PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Resolver 5 problemas 1D usando simulador<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Completar quiz interactivo<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Analizar 3 casos reales (tr\u00e1fico, deportes)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\ude80 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Resolver problemas 2D con componentes<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Investigar: Colisiones en f\u00edsica de part\u00edculas<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Dise\u00f1ar sistema de seguridad usando impulso<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- RECURSOS -->\r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/collision-lab\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf10 PhET: Laboratorio de Colisiones (interactivo)\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/science\/physics\/linear-momentum\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf93 Khan Academy: Momento lineal y colisiones\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/physics.info\/momentum\/summary.shtml\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcd6 The Physics Hypertextbook: Momentum\r\n                <\/a>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE SIMULACI\u00d3N DE COLISIONES\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\r\n\/\/ Variables globales\r\nlet animacionActiva = false;\r\nlet datosSimulacion = {};\r\n\r\n\/\/ Actualizar valores de controles\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('input[type=\"range\"]').forEach(slider => {\r\n    slider.addEventListener('input', function() {\r\n        const valueSpan = document.getElementById('valor' + this.id.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + this.id.slice(1));\r\n        if (valueSpan) {\r\n            valueSpan.textContent = parseFloat(this.value).toFixed(1);\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction ejecutarSimulacion() {\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\udccd Ejecutando simulaci\u00f3n de colisi\u00f3n...\");\r\n    \r\n    if (animacionActiva) {\r\n        alert(\"\u23f8\ufe0f Simulaci\u00f3n en curso. Espera o reinicia.\");\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    animacionActiva = true;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Obtener par\u00e1metros\r\n    const m1 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('masa1').value);\r\n    const v1i = parseFloat(document.getElementById('velocidad1').value);\r\n    const m2 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('masa2').value);\r\n    const v2i = parseFloat(document.getElementById('velocidad2').value);\r\n    const e = parseFloat(document.getElementById('coeficiente').value);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Validar\r\n    if (m1 <= 0 || m2 <= 0) {\r\n        alert(\"\u26a0\ufe0f Las masas deben ser positivas\");\r\n        animacionActiva = false;\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular velocidades finales\r\n    const v1f = ((m1 - e*m2)*v1i + (1+e)*m2*v2i) \/ (m1 + m2);\r\n    const v2f = ((m2 - e*m1)*v2i + (1+e)*m1*v1i) \/ (m1 + m2);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular momentos y energ\u00edas\r\n    const p1i = m1 * v1i;\r\n    const p2i = m2 * v2i;\r\n    const pTotalInicial = p1i + p2i;\r\n    \r\n    const p1f = m1 * v1f;\r\n    const p2f = m2 * v2f;\r\n    const pTotalFinal = p1f + p2f;\r\n    \r\n    const EKInicial = 0.5*m1*v1i*v1i + 0.5*m2*v2i*v2i;\r\n    const EKFinal = 0.5*m1*v1f*v1f + 0.5*m2*v2f*v2f;\r\n    const perdidaEK = EKInicial - EKFinal;\r\n    const porcentajePerdida = EKInicial > 0 ? (perdidaEK \/ EKInicial * 100) : 0;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Determinar tipo de colisi\u00f3n\r\n    let tipoColision = \"\";\r\n    if (Math.abs(e - 1) < 0.01) {\r\n        tipoColision = \"El\u00e1stica\";\r\n    } else if (e < 0.01) {\r\n        tipoColision = \"Perfectamente Inel\u00e1stica\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        tipoColision = \"Inel\u00e1stica\";\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Guardar datos\r\n    datosSimulacion = {\r\n        m1, v1i, v1f,\r\n        m2, v2i, v2f,\r\n        e,\r\n        pTotalInicial, pTotalFinal,\r\n        EKInicial, EKFinal, perdidaEK, porcentajePerdida,\r\n        tipoColision\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar UI\r\n    actualizarDatosSimulacion();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Animar colisi\u00f3n\r\n    animarColision(v1f, v2f);\r\n    \r\n    console.log(\"\u2705 Simulaci\u00f3n completada:\", datosSimulacion);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarDatosSimulacion() {\r\n    const d = datosSimulacion;\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('dataPInicial').textContent = \r\n        d.pTotalInicial.toFixed(2) + \" kg\u00b7m\/s\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataPFinal').textContent = \r\n        d.pTotalFinal.toFixed(2) + \" kg\u00b7m\/s\";\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('dataEKInicial').textContent = \r\n        d.EKInicial.toFixed(2) + \" J\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEKFinal').textContent = \r\n        d.EKFinal.toFixed(2) + \" J\";\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('dataPerdidaEK').textContent = \r\n        d.perdidaEK.toFixed(2) + \" J (\" + d.porcentajePerdida.toFixed(1) + \"%)\";\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('dataVF1').textContent = \r\n        d.v1f.toFixed(2) + \" m\/s\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataVF2').textContent = \r\n        d.v2f.toFixed(2) + \" m\/s\";\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular porcentajes de conservaci\u00f3n\r\n    const conservacionP = Math.abs(1 - d.pTotalFinal\/d.pTotalInicial) * 100;\r\n    const conservacionEK = d.EKInicial > 0 ? \r\n        Math.abs(1 - d.EKFinal\/d.EKInicial) * 100 : 100;\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('statConservacionP').textContent = \r\n        (100 - conservacionP).toFixed(1) + \"%\";\r\n    document.getElementById('statConservacionEK').textContent = \r\n        (100 - conservacionEK).toFixed(1) + \"%\";\r\n    document.getElementById('statTipoColision').textContent = d.tipoColision;\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('infoSimulacion').innerHTML = \r\n        `<strong>${d.tipoColision.toUpperCase()}<\/strong><br>e = ${d.e.toFixed(2)} | \u0394EK = ${d.porcentajePerdida.toFixed(1)}%`;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction animarColision(v1f, v2f) {\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById('svgColision');\r\n    const particula1 = document.getElementById('particula1');\r\n    const particula2 = document.getElementById('particula2');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Detener animaciones previas\r\n    particula1.querySelector('circle').getAnimations().forEach(a => a.cancel());\r\n    particula2.querySelector('circle').getAnimations().forEach(a => a.cancel());\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Posiciones iniciales\r\n    particula1.setAttribute('transform', 'translate(0,0)');\r\n    particula2.setAttribute('transform', 'translate(0,0)');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n hacia colisi\u00f3n\r\n    const anim1 = particula1.querySelector('circle').animate(\r\n        [\r\n            { cx: 150 },\r\n            { cx: 300 }\r\n        ],\r\n        {\r\n            duration: 2000,\r\n            easing: 'linear',\r\n            fill: 'forwards'\r\n        }\r\n    );\r\n    \r\n    const anim2 = particula2.querySelector('circle').animate(\r\n        [\r\n            { cx: 450 },\r\n            { cx: 300 }\r\n        ],\r\n        {\r\n            duration: 2000,\r\n            easing: 'linear',\r\n            fill: 'forwards'\r\n        }\r\n    );\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Despu\u00e9s de colisi\u00f3n\r\n    anim1.onfinish = anim2.onfinish = () => {\r\n        \/\/ Efecto visual de colisi\u00f3n\r\n        svg.style.filter = 'drop-shadow(0 0 10px #FFFF00)';\r\n        setTimeout(() => { svg.style.filter = 'none'; }, 300);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n despu\u00e9s seg\u00fan velocidades finales\r\n        const dx1 = v1f * 15; \/\/ Factor de escala para visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n        const dx2 = v2f * 15;\r\n        \r\n        particula1.querySelector('circle').animate(\r\n            [\r\n                { cx: 300 },\r\n                { cx: 300 + dx1 }\r\n            ],\r\n            {\r\n                duration: 1500,\r\n                easing: 'ease-out',\r\n                fill: 'forwards'\r\n            }\r\n        );\r\n        \r\n        particula2.querySelector('circle').animate(\r\n            [\r\n                { cx: 300 },\r\n                { cx: 300 + dx2 }\r\n            ],\r\n            {\r\n                duration: 1500,\r\n                easing: 'ease-out',\r\n                fill: 'forwards'\r\n            }\r\n        );\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar flechas de velocidad\r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            actualizarFlechasVelocidad(v1f, v2f);\r\n            animacionActiva = false;\r\n        }, 1500);\r\n    };\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction actualizarFlechasVelocidad(v1, v2) {\r\n    const flecha1 = document.querySelector('#particula1 line');\r\n    const flecha2 = document.querySelector('#particula2 line');\r\n    const texto1 = document.querySelector('#particula1 text:nth-child(4)');\r\n    const texto2 = document.querySelector('#particula2 text:nth-child(4)');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Longitud proporcional a velocidad\r\n    const long1 = Math.abs(v1) * 4;\r\n    const long2 = Math.abs(v2) * 4;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Direcci\u00f3n\r\n    const signo1 = v1 >= 0 ? 1 : -1;\r\n    const signo2 = v2 >= 0 ? 1 : -1;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar flecha 1\r\n    flecha1.setAttribute('x2', 150 + signo1 * long1);\r\n    texto1.setAttribute('x', 150 + signo1 * long1\/2);\r\n    texto1.textContent = `v\u2081 = ${v1.toFixed(1)}`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar flecha 2\r\n    flecha2.setAttribute('x2', 450 + signo2 * long2);\r\n    texto2.setAttribute('x', 450 + signo2 * long2\/2);\r\n    texto2.textContent = `v\u2082 = ${v2.toFixed(1)}`;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarSimulacion() {\r\n    animacionActiva = false;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Resetear animaciones\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById('svgColision');\r\n    const particulas = svg.querySelectorAll('circle');\r\n    particulas.forEach(circle => {\r\n        circle.getAnimations().forEach(a => a.cancel());\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Resetear posiciones\r\n    document.querySelector('#particula1 circle').setAttribute('cx', '150');\r\n    document.querySelector('#particula2 circle').setAttribute('cx', '450');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Resetear flechas\r\n    actualizarFlechasVelocidad(\r\n        parseFloat(document.getElementById('velocidad1').value),\r\n        parseFloat(document.getElementById('velocidad2').value)\r\n    );\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Resetear datos\r\n    document.getElementById('infoSimulacion').textContent = \r\n        'Ajusta par\u00e1metros y haz clic en SIMULAR';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n        \r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected == correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n        verificarCompletadoQuiz();\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction verificarCompletadoQuiz() {\r\n    const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n    const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q => \r\n        q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n    );\r\n    \r\n    if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n        quizCompletado = true;\r\n        mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n    const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n    \r\n    let feedback = \"\";\r\n    if (porcentaje >= 80) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas los conceptos de energ\u00eda y colisiones.\";\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 60) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero revisa los conceptos clave sobre conservaci\u00f3n.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas repasar impulso, momento y tipos de colisiones.\";\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ FUNCIONES AUXILIARES\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\r\nfunction toggleError(header) {\r\n    const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n    \r\n    if (content.style.display == 'block') {\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n    } else {\r\n        content.style.display = 'block';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarSolucionColisiones(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById('solucionColisiones' + num);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById('solucionP' + num + '-detalle');\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n    \r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n    \r\n    alert('\ud83d\udcca AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n' +\r\n          `\u2022 Impulso-momento: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n          `\u2022 Conservaci\u00f3n del momento: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n          `\u2022 Tipos de colisi\u00f3n: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n          `\ud83d\udcc8 Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n          `\ud83d\udca1 Revisa el plan de estudio recomendado seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n    \r\n    console.log('AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada:', slider1, slider2, slider3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ========================================\r\n\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Sistema Cyberpunk F\u00edsica inicializado\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\udcda Lecci\u00f3n: Energ\u00eda y Colisiones\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83c\udfae Simulador, Quiz y herramientas interactivas listas\");\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar flechas de velocidad\r\nactualizarFlechasVelocidad(8, -2);\r\n<\/script>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Cantidad de movimiento p =","respuesta":"m v"},{"enunciado":"Impulso J =","respuesta":"F \u0394t = \u0394p"},{"enunciado":"Conservaci\u00f3n p en","respuesta":"Sistema aislado"},{"enunciado":"e = 1 \u2192 colisi\u00f3n","respuesta":"El\u00e1stica"},{"enunciado":"e = 0 \u2192 colisi\u00f3n","respuesta":"Perfectamente inel\u00e1stica"},{"enunciado":"m\u2081=1kg, u\u2081=4m\/s; m\u2082=1kg, u\u2082=0 \u2192 v\u2081f (el\u00e1stica)","respuesta":"0 m\/s"},{"enunciado":"Choque inel\u00e1stico perfecto: v com\u00fan =","respuesta":"(m\u2081u\u2081 + m\u2082u\u2082)\/(m\u2081+m\u2082)"},{"enunciado":"F = 50 N, \u0394t = 0.2 s \u2192 \u0394p","respuesta":"10 kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"enunciado":"p inicial = p final","respuesta":"Conservaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"EK perdida en inel\u00e1stica \u2192","respuesta":"Calor, deformaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Coeficiente e =","respuesta":"-(v\u2082-v\u2081)\/(u\u2082-u\u2081)"},{"enunciado":"1 N\u00b7s =","respuesta":"1 kg\u00b7m\/s"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"p = m v es","opciones":["Vector","Escalar","Energ\u00eda","Fuerza"],"correcta":"Vector"},{"pregunta":"Conservada en todas colisiones","opciones":["Cantidad de movimiento","Energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica","Masa","Velocidad"],"correcta":"Cantidad de movimiento"},{"pregunta":"J = F \u0394t =","opciones":["\u0394p","\u0394EK","W","P"],"correcta":"\u0394p"},{"pregunta":"e = 1 significa","opciones":["El\u00e1stica","Inel\u00e1stica","Perfecta","Nada"],"correcta":"El\u00e1stica"},{"pregunta":"e = 0 significa","opciones":["Perfectamente inel\u00e1stica","El\u00e1stica","Parcial","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Perfectamente inel\u00e1stica"},{"pregunta":"F = m a es","opciones":["2\u00aa Ley Newton","1\u00aa","3\u00aa","Conservaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"2\u00aa Ley Newton"},{"pregunta":"Unidad p","opciones":["kg\u00b7m\/s","J","N","m\/s\u00b2"],"correcta":"kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"pregunta":"Choque el\u00e1stico: EK","opciones":["Conservada","Perdida","Aumentada","Cero"],"correcta":"Conservada"},{"pregunta":"Inel\u00e1stica: EK","opciones":["Disminuye","Conservada","Aumenta","Cero"],"correcta":"Disminuye"},{"pregunta":"v final en inel\u00e1stica perfecta","opciones":["(m\u2081u\u2081 + m\u2082u\u2082)\/(m\u2081+m\u2082)","u\u2081 + u\u2082","0","u\u2081"],"correcta":"(m\u2081u\u2081 + m\u2082u\u2082)\/(m\u2081+m\u2082)"},{"pregunta":"m\u2081=2kg, u\u2081=3m\/s; m\u2082=1kg, u\u2082=0 \u2192 v (inel\u00e1stica perfecta)","opciones":["2 m\/s","3 m\/s","1 m\/s","0 m\/s"],"correcta":"2 m\/s"},{"pregunta":"\u0394p = 0 en sistema aislado \u2192","opciones":["F_ext = 0","F_ext \u2260 0","m = 0","v = 0"],"correcta":"F_ext = 0"},{"pregunta":"F = 100 N, t = 0.1 s \u2192 J","opciones":["10 N\u00b7s","1000 N\u00b7s","1 N\u00b7s","0"],"correcta":"10 N\u00b7s"},{"pregunta":"Colisi\u00f3n 1D: p total","opciones":["m\u2081u\u2081 + m\u2082u\u2082 = m\u2081v\u2081 + m\u2082v\u2082","m\u2081u\u2081 = m\u2082v\u2082","u\u2081 = v\u2081","EK igual"],"correcta":"m\u2081u\u2081 + m\u2082u\u2082 = m\u2081v\u2081 + m\u2082v\u2082"},{"pregunta":"e = 0.8 \u2192 colisi\u00f3n","opciones":["Parcialmente el\u00e1stica","Perfecta","Inel\u00e1stica total","El\u00e1stica"],"correcta":"Parcialmente el\u00e1stica"},{"pregunta":"Bola cae: p antes impacto","opciones":["m \u221a(2gh)","m g h","m g","0"],"correcta":"m \u221a(2gh)"},{"pregunta":"Impulso = \u00e1rea bajo","opciones":["F vs t","F vs x","v vs t","p vs t"],"correcta":"F vs t"},{"pregunta":"Airbag aumenta","opciones":["\u0394t \u2192 \u2193F","\u0394p","EK","masa"],"correcta":"\u0394t \u2192 \u2193F"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: impulso en","opciones":["N\u00b7s","J","kg\u00b7m\/s\u00b2","W"],"correcta":"N\u00b7s"},{"pregunta":"Choque frontal autos: p total","opciones":["Conservada","Perdida","Aumentada","Cero"],"correcta":"Conservada"},{"pregunta":"v\u2081f (el\u00e1stica, m\u2081=m\u2082, u\u2082=0)","opciones":["0","u\u2081","u\u2081\/2","2u\u2081"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"EK perdida =","opciones":["EK_i - EK_f","p_i - p_f","J","F d"],"correcta":"EK_i - EK_f"},{"pregunta":"m\u2081=4kg, u\u2081=6m\/s; m\u2082=2kg, u\u2082=-3m\/s \u2192 p total","opciones":["18 kg\u00b7m\/s","12 kg\u00b7m\/s","24 kg\u00b7m\/s","0"],"correcta":"18 kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"pregunta":"e = \u221a(h\u2082\/h\u2081) en ca\u00edda sobre resorte","opciones":["S\u00ed","No","A veces","Nunca"],"correcta":"S\u00ed"},{"pregunta":"F promedio =","opciones":["J \/ \u0394t","\u0394p \/ m","m a","p \/ t"],"correcta":"J \/ \u0394t"},{"pregunta":"Colisi\u00f3n 2D: p conservada en","opciones":["x e y","solo x","solo y","ninguna"],"correcta":"x e y"},{"pregunta":"Explosi\u00f3n: p total","opciones":["0 (si en reposo)","m v","F t","EK"],"correcta":"0 (si en reposo)"},{"pregunta":"1D: v\u2081f =","opciones":["(m\u2081-m\u2082)u\u2081\/(m\u2081+m\u2082) + 2m\u2082u\u2082\/(m\u2081+m\u2082)","u\u2081","0","u\u2082"],"correcta":"(m\u2081-m\u2082)u\u2081\/(m\u2081+m\u2082) + 2m\u2082u\u2082\/(m\u2081+m\u2082)"},{"pregunta":"Sistema aislado significa","opciones":["F_ext = 0","m = cte","v = cte","EK = cte"],"correcta":"F_ext = 0"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: 1 kg\u00b7m\/s =","opciones":["1 N\u00b7s","1 J","1 W","1 Pa"],"correcta":"1 N\u00b7s"}]},{"materia":"F\u00edsica I","slug":"conservacion-energia-mecanica","titulo":"Conservaci\u00f3n de la Energ\u00eda Mec\u00e1nica: E_total = EPG + EK, v_f = \u221a(2gh)","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-fisica-energia\" data-tema=\"energia-mecanica\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n            CONSERVACI\u00d3N DE LA <span class=\"formula-highlight\">ENERG\u00cdA MEC\u00c1NICA<\/span>\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            La energ\u00eda no se crea ni se destruye, solo se transforma: \\( E_{\\text{total}} = E_{pg} + E_k = \\text{constante} \\)\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Explicar el principio de conservaci\u00f3n de la energ\u00eda mec\u00e1nica<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Diferenciar entre energ\u00eda potencial gravitatoria (\\(E_{pg}\\)) y cin\u00e9tica (\\(E_k\\))<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Calcular la velocidad final en ca\u00edda libre<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Aplicar la f\u00f3rmula \\( v_f = \\sqrt{2gh} \\) en problemas reales<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar la transformaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Identificar c\u00f3mo \\(E_{pg}\\) se convierte en \\(E_k\\) durante el movimiento<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Simular escenarios de conservaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Usar el simulador interactivo para visualizar la transformaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfa2 Monta\u00f1as Rusas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>La energ\u00eda potencial en la cima se transforma en energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica durante la ca\u00edda, permitiendo alcanzar velocidades altas sin motores.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Velocidad m\u00e1xima: 120 km\/h<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\ude80 Lanzamiento de Sat\u00e9lites<\/h3>\r\n                <p>La energ\u00eda potencial gravitatoria se convierte en cin\u00e9tica para alcanzar la velocidad orbital necesaria (7.8 km\/s).<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Altura orbital: 300-1000 km<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udca1 Energ\u00edas Renovables<\/h3>\r\n                <p>En centrales hidroel\u00e9ctricas, la energ\u00eda potencial del agua se convierte en cin\u00e9tica para generar electricidad.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Eficiencia: 85-90%<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- PRINCIPIO DE CONSERVACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Principio de Conservaci\u00f3n de la Energ\u00eda Mec\u00e1nica<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>ENERG\u00cdA MEC\u00c1NICA TOTAL<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>En ausencia de fuerzas no conservativas (como la fricci\u00f3n), la energ\u00eda mec\u00e1nica total se <strong>conserva<\/strong>:<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                            E_{\\text{total}} = E_{pg} + E_k = \\text{constante}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-detalle\">\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Energ\u00eda Potencial Gravitatoria (\\(E_{pg}\\))<\/strong>: \\( mgh \\)<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Energ\u00eda Cin\u00e9tica (\\(E_k\\))<\/strong>: \\( \\frac{1}{2}mv^2 \\)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- ECUACI\u00d3N DE CONSERVACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Ecuaci\u00f3n de Conservaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"ecuacion-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"ecuacion-formula\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                        mgh_i + \\frac{1}{2}mv_i^2 = mgh_f + \\frac{1}{2}mv_f^2\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ecuacion-explicacion\">\r\n                    <p>La masa \\(m\\) se cancela \u2192 la velocidad final <strong>no depende de la masa<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                    <p>Si el objeto parte del reposo (\\(v_i = 0\\)) y cae desde una altura \\(h_i = h\\) hasta \\(h_f = 0\\):<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                            mgh = \\frac{1}{2}mv_f^2 \\quad \\Rightarrow \\quad v_f = \\sqrt{2gh}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p><strong>Independiente de la trayectoria<\/strong> (si no hay fricci\u00f3n).<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TRANSFORMACI\u00d3N DE ENERG\u00cdA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Transformaci\u00f3n de Energ\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>Punto<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Energ\u00eda Potencial (\\(E_{pg}\\))<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Energ\u00eda Cin\u00e9tica (\\(E_k\\))<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Energ\u00eda Total (\\(E_{\\text{total}}\\))<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr data-punto=\"altura-maxima\">\r\n                            <td><strong>Altura m\u00e1xima<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>M\u00e1xima<\/td>\r\n                            <td>0<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Constante<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-punto=\"suelo\">\r\n                            <td><strong>Suelo<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>0<\/td>\r\n                            <td>M\u00e1xima<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Constante<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoTransformacion\">\r\n                    Selecciona una fila para ver detalles\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- EJEMPLO PR\u00c1CTICO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Ejemplo Pr\u00e1ctico<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"ejemplo-card\">\r\n                <p><strong>Problema:<\/strong> Un objeto cae desde una altura de \\( h = 20\\, \\text{m} \\). Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                <ol>\r\n                    <li>La velocidad final al llegar al suelo.<\/li>\r\n                    <li>La energ\u00eda total si la masa es \\( m = 2\\, \\text{kg} \\).<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-solucion\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        1. Velocidad final:\r\n                        \\[\r\n                            v_f = \\sqrt{2 \\cdot 9.8 \\cdot 20} = \\sqrt{392} \\approx 19.8\\, \\text{m\/s}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        2. Energ\u00eda total:\r\n                        \\[\r\n                            E_{\\text{total}} = mgh = 2 \\cdot 9.8 \\cdot 20 = 392\\, \\text{J}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarEjemplo()\">VERIFICAR C\u00c1LCULO<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-feedback\" id=\"feedbackEjemplo\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <p>\u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> La velocidad final es \\(19.8\\, \\text{m\/s}\\) y la energ\u00eda total es \\(392\\, \\text{J}\\).<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: CONSERVACI\u00d3N DE ENERG\u00cdA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"energia-mecanica\">\r\n            <!-- CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"masaInput\">Masa (m) en kg:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"masaInput\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"2\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <span id=\"masaValue\">2 kg<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"alturaInput\">Altura (h) en m:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"alturaInput\" min=\"5\" max=\"50\" value=\"20\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <span id=\"alturaValue\">20 m<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"gravedadInput\">Gravedad (g) en m\/s\u00b2:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"gravedadInput\" min=\"5\" max=\"15\" value=\"9.8\" step=\"0.1\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <span id=\"gravedadValue\">9.8 m\/s\u00b2<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-ejecutar\" onclick=\"calcularEnergia()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6<\/span> CALCULAR ENERG\u00cdA\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"valoresAleatorios()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> VALORES ALEATORIOS\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" id=\"svgEnergia\">\r\n                    <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\" id=\"fondoSimulador\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Torre -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"250\" y=\"50\" width=\"100\" height=\"250\" fill=\"#455A64\" id=\"torre\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"320\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"alturaSVG\">20 m<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Objeto -->\r\n                    <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"80\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#F44336\" id=\"objeto\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"80;320\" begin=\"indefinite\" dur=\"2s\" fill=\"freeze\" id=\"animCaida\"\/>\r\n                    <\/circle>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"85\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"masaSVG\">m=2 kg<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Energ\u00edas -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"150\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" rx=\"10\" id=\"epgBar\">\r\n                        <text x=\"125\" y=\"90\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"epgValue\">EPG = 392 J<\/text>\r\n                    <\/rect>\r\n                    <rect x=\"400\" y=\"50\" width=\"150\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#2196F3\" rx=\"10\" id=\"ekBar\">\r\n                        <text x=\"475\" y=\"65\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"ekValue\">EK = 0 J<\/text>\r\n                    <\/rect>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- F\u00f3rmula -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"150\" y=\"320\" width=\"300\" height=\"60\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.7)\" rx=\"10\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"350\" fill=\"#39FF14\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"formulaSVG\">v_f = \u221a(2gh)<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"375\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"velocidadSVG\">v_f = 19.8 m\/s<\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>DATOS DE SIMULACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Masa (m):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataMasa\">2 kg<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Altura (h):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataAltura\">20 m<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Gravedad (g):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataGravedad\">9.8 m\/s\u00b2<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">ENERG\u00cdA POTENCIAL (EPG):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEPG\">392 J<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">ENERG\u00cdA CIN\u00c9TICA (EK):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEK\">0 J<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">VELOCIDAD FINAL (v_f):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataVelocidad\">19.8 m\/s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-animar\" onclick=\"animarCaida()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6<\/span> ANIMAR CA\u00cdDA\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 afirma el principio de conservaci\u00f3n de la energ\u00eda mec\u00e1nica?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        La energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica siempre es mayor que la potencial.\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        La suma de la energ\u00eda potencial y cin\u00e9tica es constante si no hay fricci\u00f3n.\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        La energ\u00eda potencial depende de la velocidad del objeto.\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        La energ\u00eda mec\u00e1nica total siempre disminuye con el tiempo.\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> \\( E_{\\text{total}} = E_{pg} + E_k = \\text{constante} \\) en ausencia de fricci\u00f3n.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa el principio de conservaci\u00f3n de la energ\u00eda mec\u00e1nica.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La energ\u00eda mec\u00e1nica total se conserva si solo act\u00faan fuerzas conservativas (como la gravedad).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Un objeto cae desde 10 m. \u00bfCu\u00e1l es su velocidad final?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        5 m\/s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        10 m\/s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        14 m\/s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        20 m\/s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> \\( v_f = \\sqrt{2 \\cdot 9.8 \\cdot 10} \\approx 14\\, \\text{m\/s} \\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Usa la f\u00f3rmula \\( v_f = \\sqrt{2gh} \\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>C\u00e1lculo:<\/strong> \\( v_f = \\sqrt{2 \\cdot 9.8 \\cdot 10} = \\sqrt{196} \\approx 14\\, \\text{m\/s} \\).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                    Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/2\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                    Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES Y SOLUCIONES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR ENERG\u00cdA POTENCIAL CON CIN\u00c9TICA<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"En la cima de una monta\u00f1a rusa, la energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica es m\u00e1xima\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> En la cima, la energ\u00eda <strong>potencial<\/strong> es m\u00e1xima y la cin\u00e9tica es m\u00ednima (velocidad baja).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Practica:<\/strong> \u00bfQu\u00e9 tipo de energ\u00eda predomina al inicio y al final de una ca\u00edda libre?<\/p>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                            <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Al inicio: <strong>Energ\u00eda Potencial<\/strong>. Al final: <strong>Energ\u00eda Cin\u00e9tica<\/strong>.\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c OLVIDAR QUE LA VELOCIDAD FINAL NO DEPENDE DE LA MASA<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"Un objeto m\u00e1s pesado cae m\u00e1s r\u00e1pido\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La velocidad final \\( v_f = \\sqrt{2gh} \\) <strong>no depende de la masa<\/strong>.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                        <table>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <th>Masa (kg)<\/th>\r\n                                <th>Velocidad final (m\/s)<\/th>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td>1<\/td>\r\n                                <td>14<\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td>10<\/td>\r\n                                <td>14<\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                        <\/table>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Conservaci\u00f3n de Energ\u00eda en un P\u00e9ndulo<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un p\u00e9ndulo de 1.5 m de longitud se suelta desde un \u00e1ngulo de 30\u00b0. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>La velocidad m\u00e1xima en el punto m\u00e1s bajo.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La energ\u00eda total si la masa es 0.5 kg.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p><em>Nota:<\/em> Usa \\( h = L(1 - \\cos \\theta) \\) para calcular la altura.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. Altura inicial: \\( h = 1.5(1 - \\cos 30\u00b0) \\approx 0.197\\, \\text{m} \\).<br>\r\n                    Velocidad m\u00e1xima: \\( v_f = \\sqrt{2 \\cdot 9.8 \\cdot 0.197} \\approx 1.97\\, \\text{m\/s} \\).<br>\r\n                    2. Energ\u00eda total: \\( E_{\\text{total}} = mgh = 0.5 \\cdot 9.8 \\cdot 0.197 \\approx 0.965\\, \\text{J} \\).\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Energ\u00eda en un Salto de Paracaidismo<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un paracaidista de 70 kg salta desde 3000 m. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>La velocidad final en ca\u00edda libre (sin fricci\u00f3n).<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica al llegar al suelo.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. Velocidad final: \\( v_f = \\sqrt{2 \\cdot 9.8 \\cdot 3000} \\approx 242.5\\, \\text{m\/s} \\).<br>\r\n                    2. Energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica: \\( E_k = \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 70 \\cdot (242.5)^2 \\approx 2.07 \\times 10^6\\, \\text{J} \\).\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Aplicaci\u00f3n correcta de \\( v_f = \\sqrt{2gh} \\)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>F\u00f3rmula y unidades correctas<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Errores menores en c\u00e1lculos<\/td>\r\n                        <td>F\u00f3rmula o unidades incorrectas<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Conservaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda mec\u00e1nica<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Explica claramente la transformaci\u00f3n \\( E_{pg} \\rightarrow E_k \\)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Falta justificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                        <td>No aplica el principio<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc8 AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n del principio de conservaci\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Aplicaci\u00f3n de \\( v_f = \\sqrt{2gh} \\):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es importante el principio de conservaci\u00f3n de la energ\u00eda en el dise\u00f1o de monta\u00f1as rusas?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: seguridad, velocidad, altura...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Describe un ejemplo cotidiano donde observes la transformaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda potencial a cin\u00e9tica.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: dejar caer un libro...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcda PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar f\u00f3rmulas \\( E_{pg} = mgh \\) y \\( E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2 \\)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Repasar \\( v_f = \\sqrt{2gh} \\)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udee0 PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Resolver 5 problemas de conservaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Usar el simulador para visualizar escenarios<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udf93 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Investigar aplicaciones en ingenier\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Relacionar con energ\u00eda t\u00e9rmica y fricci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/legacy\/energy-skate-park\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udfa2 Simulador PhET: Parque de Energ\u00eda\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/science\/physics\/work-and-energy\/work-and-energy-tutorial\/a\/what-is-conservation-of-energy\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcda Khan Academy: Conservaci\u00f3n de la Energ\u00eda\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DE CONSERVACI\u00d3N DE ENERG\u00cdA\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction calcularEnergia() {\r\n    \/\/ Obtener valores de los sliders\r\n    const masa = parseFloat(document.getElementById('masaInput').value);\r\n    const altura = parseFloat(document.getElementById('alturaInput').value);\r\n    const gravedad = parseFloat(document.getElementById('gravedadInput').value);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Validar valores\r\n    if (isNaN(masa) || isNaN(altura) || isNaN(gravedad)) {\r\n        alert(\"Por favor, ingresa valores v\u00e1lidos.\");\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar valores en la interfaz\r\n    document.getElementById('masaValue').textContent = `${masa} kg`;\r\n    document.getElementById('alturaValue').textContent = `${altura} m`;\r\n    document.getElementById('gravedadValue').textContent = `${gravedad} m\/s\u00b2`;\r\n    document.getElementById('masaSVG').textContent = `m=${masa} kg`;\r\n    document.getElementById('alturaSVG').textContent = `${altura} m`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Calcular energ\u00edas\r\n    const epg = masa * gravedad * altura;\r\n    const velocidadFinal = Math.sqrt(2 * gravedad * altura);\r\n    const ek = 0.5 * masa * Math.pow(velocidadFinal, 2);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar datos en la interfaz\r\n    document.getElementById('dataMasa').textContent = `${masa} kg`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataAltura').textContent = `${altura} m`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataGravedad').textContent = `${gravedad} m\/s\u00b2`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEPG').textContent = `${epg.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEK').textContent = `${ek.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataVelocidad').textContent = `${velocidadFinal.toFixed(2)} m\/s`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar SVG\r\n    document.getElementById('epgValue').textContent = `EPG = ${epg.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n    document.getElementById('ekValue').textContent = `EK = ${ek.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n    document.getElementById('velocidadSVG').textContent = `v_f = ${velocidadFinal.toFixed(2)} m\/s`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Ajustar altura de la torre y posici\u00f3n inicial del objeto\r\n    const alturaTorre = 350 - (altura * 2);\r\n    document.getElementById('torre').setAttribute('height', alturaTorre);\r\n    document.getElementById('objeto').setAttribute('cy', alturaTorre + 50);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Ajustar altura de la barra de EPG\r\n    const alturaEPG = Math.min(epg \/ 5, 150);\r\n    document.getElementById('epgBar').setAttribute('height', alturaEPG);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Generar valores aleatorios\r\nfunction valoresAleatorios() {\r\n    const masa = Math.floor(Math.random() * 9) + 1;\r\n    const altura = Math.floor(Math.random() * 45) + 5;\r\n    const gravedad = (Math.random() * 5 + 9.3).toFixed(1);\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('masaInput').value = masa;\r\n    document.getElementById('alturaInput').value = altura;\r\n    document.getElementById('gravedadInput').value = gravedad;\r\n\r\n    calcularEnergia(); \/\/ Actualizar simulador\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Animar la ca\u00edda del objeto\r\nfunction animarCaida() {\r\n    const altura = parseFloat(document.getElementById('alturaInput').value);\r\n    const alturaTorre = 350 - (altura * 2);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar posici\u00f3n del objeto\r\n    document.getElementById('objeto').setAttribute('cy', alturaTorre + 50);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Iniciar animaci\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('animCaida').beginElement();\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar barras de energ\u00eda durante la ca\u00edda\r\n    setTimeout(() => {\r\n        const epg = 0;\r\n        const ek = parseFloat(document.getElementById('dataEPG').textContent.replace(' J', ''));\r\n        document.getElementById('epgValue').textContent = `EPG = ${epg} J`;\r\n        document.getElementById('ekValue').textContent = `EK = ${ek.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n        document.getElementById('epgBar').setAttribute('height', '20');\r\n        document.getElementById('ekBar').setAttribute('height', '80');\r\n    }, 2000);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n        const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n\r\n        if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n    let feedback = \"\";\r\n    if (correctas === total) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas la conservaci\u00f3n de la energ\u00eda.\";\r\n    } else if (correctas >= total \/ 2) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero repasa la transformaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas estudiar m\u00e1s. Usa el simulador para practicar.\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ ERRORES COMUNES\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction toggleError(header) {\r\n    const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n\r\n    if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n    } else {\r\n        content.style.display = 'block';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2)) \/ 2;\r\n\r\n    alert(\r\n        `\ud83d\udcbe Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Principio de conservaci\u00f3n: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `Aplicaci\u00f3n de f\u00f3rmulas: ${slider2}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`\r\n    );\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: Conservaci\u00f3n de la Energ\u00eda Mec\u00e1nica - Cargada\");\r\n    calcularEnergia(); \/\/ Inicializar simulador\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Event listeners para sliders\r\n    document.getElementById('masaInput').addEventListener('input', calcularEnergia);\r\n    document.getElementById('alturaInput').addEventListener('input', calcularEnergia);\r\n    document.getElementById('gravedadInput').addEventListener('input', calcularEnergia);\r\n});\r\n<\/script>\r\n","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Energ\u00eda mec\u00e1nica total =","respuesta":"EPG + EK"},{"enunciado":"F\u00f3rmula v_f (ca\u00edda libre)","respuesta":"\u221a(2 g h)"},{"enunciado":"Conservaci\u00f3n v\u00e1lida si","respuesta":"Sin fricci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"h = 10 m \u2192 v_f \u2248","respuesta":"14 m\/s"},{"enunciado":"En altura m\u00e1xima, EK =","respuesta":"0"},{"enunciado":"EPG = 0 cuando","respuesta":"h = 0"},{"enunciado":"v_f depende de","respuesta":"g y h (no m)"},{"enunciado":"P\u00e9ndulo: E_total en","respuesta":"Cualquier punto"},{"enunciado":"Resorte + gravedad: E_total =","respuesta":"EPG + EPE + EK"},{"enunciado":"Fricci\u00f3n \u2192 E_mec\u00e1nica","respuesta":"Disminuye"},{"enunciado":"v_f = 20 m\/s \u2192 h =","respuesta":"20.4 m"},{"enunciado":"1 kJ =","respuesta":"1000 J"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"E_total =","opciones":["EPG + EK","EPG - EK","mgh","\u00bdmv\u00b2"],"correcta":"EPG + EK"},{"pregunta":"v_f =","opciones":["\u221a(2gh)","2gh","gh","\u221ag"],"correcta":"\u221a(2gh)"},{"pregunta":"Conservaci\u00f3n sin","opciones":["Fricci\u00f3n","Gravedad","Masa","Velocidad"],"correcta":"Fricci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"En suelo, EPG =","opciones":["0","m\u00e1xima","\u00bdmgh","infinita"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"En altura m\u00e1xima, EK =","opciones":["0","m\u00e1xima","\u00bdmv\u00b2","mgh"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"v_f depende de","opciones":["g y h","m","v_i","trayectoria"],"correcta":"g y h"},{"pregunta":"h = 5 m \u2192 v_f \u2248","opciones":["9.9 m\/s","5 m\/s","19.8 m\/s","0"],"correcta":"9.9 m\/s"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda se transforma, no","opciones":["Se crea\/destruye","Se pierde","Se gana","Nada"],"correcta":"Se crea\/destruye"},{"pregunta":"Unidad energ\u00eda","opciones":["Joule","Newton","Metro","Watt"],"correcta":"Joule"},{"pregunta":"1 J =","opciones":["N\u00b7m","kg\u00b7m\/s\u00b2","W\u00b7s","todas"],"correcta":"todas"},{"pregunta":"h = 50 m \u2192 v_f \u2248","opciones":["31.3 m\/s","50 m\/s","15 m\/s","100 m\/s"],"correcta":"31.3 m\/s"},{"pregunta":"Fricci\u00f3n presente \u2192 E_mec\u00e1nica","opciones":["Disminuye","Aumenta","Igual","Cero"],"correcta":"Disminuye"},{"pregunta":"v_f igual en","opciones":["Cualquier trayectoria (sin fricci\u00f3n)","Solo recta","Solo curva","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Cualquier trayectoria (sin fricci\u00f3n)"},{"pregunta":"P\u00e9ndulo: m\u00e1xima EK en","opciones":["Punto bajo","Punto alto","Mitad","Nunca"],"correcta":"Punto bajo"},{"pregunta":"Resorte comprimido: E_total incluye","opciones":["EPE","EPG","EK","todas"],"correcta":"todas"},{"pregunta":"v_i \u2260 0 \u2192 E_total =","opciones":["mgh + \u00bdmv_i\u00b2","mgh","\u00bdmv_i\u00b2","0"],"correcta":"mgh + \u00bdmv_i\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda disipada =","opciones":["Trabajo fricci\u00f3n","\u0394EPG","\u0394EK","mgh"],"correcta":"Trabajo fricci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"g = 10 m\/s\u00b2, h = 10 m \u2192 v_f =","opciones":["14.14 m\/s","10 m\/s","20 m\/s","0"],"correcta":"14.14 m\/s"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: g \u2248","opciones":["9.8 m\/s\u00b2","10 m\/s\u00b2","9.81 m\/s\u00b2","9.80665 m\/s\u00b2"],"correcta":"9.80665 m\/s\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"Luna: v_f desde h","opciones":["Menor (g\u2193)","Igual","Mayor","Cero"],"correcta":"Menor (g\u2193)"},{"pregunta":"h = 100 m \u2192 v_f \u2248","opciones":["44.3 m\/s","100 m\/s","20 m\/s","9.8 m\/s"],"correcta":"44.3 m\/s"},{"pregunta":"v_f = 30 m\/s \u2192 h =","opciones":["45.9 m","30 m","15 m","900 m"],"correcta":"45.9 m"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda total en resorte + masa","opciones":["EPE + EPG + EK","solo EPE","solo EK","nada"],"correcta":"EPE + EPG + EK"},{"pregunta":"Trabajo no conservativo","opciones":["\u0394E_mec\u00e1nica","0","mgh","\u00bdmv\u00b2"],"correcta":"\u0394E_mec\u00e1nica"},{"pregunta":"Monta\u00f1a rusa: m\u00e1xima velocidad en","opciones":["Punto m\u00e1s bajo","Punto alto","Mitad","Final"],"correcta":"Punto m\u00e1s bajo"},{"pregunta":"v_f en vac\u00edo vs aire","opciones":["Igual (sin fricci\u00f3n)","Mayor en aire","Menor en vac\u00edo","Cero"],"correcta":"Igual (sin fricci\u00f3n)"},{"pregunta":"E_mec\u00e1nica = cte \u2192 sistema","opciones":["Aislado de no conservativas","Con fricci\u00f3n","Abierto","Caliente"],"correcta":"Aislado de no conservativas"},{"pregunta":"h = 1 km \u2192 v_f \u2248","opciones":["140 m\/s","1000 m\/s","9.8 m\/s","0"],"correcta":"140 m\/s"},{"pregunta":"Energ\u00eda qu\u00edmica \u2192 mec\u00e1nica","opciones":["No conservada mec\u00e1nicamente","S\u00ed","A veces","Nunca"],"correcta":"No conservada mec\u00e1nicamente"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: 1 J =","opciones":["1 N\u00b7m","1 kg\u00b7m\u00b2\/s\u00b2","1 W\u00b7s","todas"],"correcta":"todas"}]},{"materia":"F\u00edsica I","slug":"calor-capacidad-termica-completo","titulo":"Termodin\u00e1mica Fundamental: Calor Espec\u00edfico, Capacidad T\u00e9rmica y Transferencia de Energ\u00eda","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK MEJORADA -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-fisica-calor-mejorada\" data-tema=\"calor-capacidad\">\r\n\r\n<!-- CABECERA SIMPLE Y DIRECTA -->\r\n<header class=\"leccion-header-simple\">\r\n    <div class=\"titulo-container\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-principal\">\r\n            <span class=\"icono-titulo\">\ud83d\udd25<\/span>\r\n            CALOR Y CAPACIDAD T\u00c9RMICA\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <p class=\"subtitulo-principal\">\r\n            Transferencia de energ\u00eda por diferencia de temperatura - Q = m\u00b7c\u00b7\u0394T\r\n        <\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"fecha-actualizacion\">\r\n        <span class=\"badge-actualizado\">ACTUALIZADO 2025<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"valor-destacado\">c<sub>agua<\/sub> = 4186 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/header>\r\n\r\n<!-- CONTENIDO PRINCIPAL EN COLUMNAS -->\r\n<div class=\"contenido-principal\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- COLUMNA IZQUIERDA: TEOR\u00cdA -->\r\n    <div class=\"columna-teoria\">\r\n        \r\n        <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 1: CONCEPTOS FUNDAMENTALES -->\r\n        <section class=\"seccion-contenido\">\r\n            <div class=\"seccion-header\">\r\n                <h2><span class=\"numero-seccion\">01<\/span> CONCEPTOS B\u00c1SICOS<\/h2>\r\n                <div class=\"linea-separadora\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"conceptos-grid\">\r\n                <!-- CALOR -->\r\n                <div class=\"concepto-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"concepto-icono\" style=\"background: rgba(255, 87, 34, 0.1); color: #FF5722;\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udd25\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"concepto-contenido\">\r\n                        <h3>CALOR (Q)<\/h3>\r\n                        <p class=\"concepto-definicion\">\r\n                            Energ\u00eda transferida entre sistemas debido a una diferencia de temperatura.\r\n                        <\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"concepto-formula\">\r\n                            \\[ Q = m \\cdot c \\cdot \\Delta T \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"concepto-detalles\">\r\n                            <div class=\"detalle-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-etiqueta\">Unidad SI:<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-valor\">Joule (J)<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"detalle-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-etiqueta\">Calor\u00eda:<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-valor\">1 cal = 4.184 J<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- CALOR ESPEC\u00cdFICO -->\r\n                <div class=\"concepto-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"concepto-icono\" style=\"background: rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.1); color: #2196F3;\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcca\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"concepto-contenido\">\r\n                        <h3>CALOR ESPEC\u00cdFICO (c)<\/h3>\r\n                        <p class=\"concepto-definicion\">\r\n                            Cantidad de calor necesaria para elevar 1\u00b0C la temperatura de 1 kg de sustancia.\r\n                        <\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"concepto-formula\">\r\n                            \\[ c = \\frac{Q}{m \\cdot \\Delta T} \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"concepto-detalles\">\r\n                            <div class=\"detalle-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-etiqueta\">Unidad:<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-valor\">J\/(kg\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"detalle-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-etiqueta\">Propiedad:<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-valor\">Intensiva<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- CAPACIDAD T\u00c9RMICA -->\r\n                <div class=\"concepto-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"concepto-icono\" style=\"background: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.1); color: #4CAF50;\">\r\n                        \u2696\ufe0f\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"concepto-contenido\">\r\n                        <h3>CAPACIDAD T\u00c9RMICA (C)<\/h3>\r\n                        <p class=\"concepto-definicion\">\r\n                            Cantidad de calor necesaria para elevar 1\u00b0C la temperatura de un objeto.\r\n                        <\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"concepto-formula\">\r\n                            \\[ C = m \\cdot c = \\frac{Q}{\\Delta T} \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"concepto-detalles\">\r\n                            <div class=\"detalle-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-etiqueta\">Unidad:<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-valor\">J\/\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"detalle-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-etiqueta\">Propiedad:<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"detalle-valor\">Extensiva<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- COMPARACI\u00d3N c vs C -->\r\n            <div class=\"comparacion-card\">\r\n                <h3 class=\"comparacion-titulo\">DIFERENCIA: Calor Espec\u00edfico vs Capacidad T\u00e9rmica<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"comparacion-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comparacion-item\">\r\n                        <h4>Calor Espec\u00edfico (c)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul class=\"lista-caracteristicas\">\r\n                            <li>Propiedad <strong>INTENSIVA<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                            <li>Depende solo del material<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Unidad: J\/(kg\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Ejemplo: c<sub>agua<\/sub> = 4186 J\/(kg\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comparacion-item\">\r\n                        <h4>Capacidad T\u00e9rmica (C)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul class=\"lista-caracteristicas\">\r\n                            <li>Propiedad <strong>EXTENSIVA<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                            <li>Depende del material y la masa<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Unidad: J\/\u00b0C<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Ejemplo: 2 kg agua \u2192 C = 8372 J\/\u00b0C<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-practico\">\r\n                    <strong>Ejemplo pr\u00e1ctico:<\/strong> Para calentar 2 kg de agua de 20\u00b0C a 80\u00b0C:<br>\r\n                    \\[ Q = 2 \\times 4186 \\times 60 = 502,320 \\, \\text{J} \\]\r\n                    \\[ C = 2 \\times 4186 = 8,372 \\, \\text{J\/\u00b0C} \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 2: CALOR LATENTE -->\r\n        <section class=\"seccion-contenido\">\r\n            <div class=\"seccion-header\">\r\n                <h2><span class=\"numero-seccion\">02<\/span> CALOR LATENTE<\/h2>\r\n                <div class=\"linea-separadora\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"explicacion-detallada\">\r\n                <p>Calor necesario para cambiar el estado de agregaci\u00f3n de una sustancia <strong>sin cambiar su temperatura<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"formula-destacada\">\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-titulo\">F\u00f3rmula del Calor Latente<\/div>\r\n                    \\[ Q = m \\cdot L \\]\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-variables\">\r\n                        <span>Q = calor transferido (J)<\/span>\r\n                        <span>m = masa (kg)<\/span>\r\n                        <span>L = calor latente (J\/kg)<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"tabla-latente\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tabla-header\">\r\n                        <h4>CALORES LATENTES DEL AGUA<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tabla-contenido\">\r\n                        <div class=\"fila-latente\">\r\n                            <div class=\"celda-proceso\">\r\n                                <div class=\"icono-proceso\">\u2744\ufe0f\u2192\ud83d\udca7<\/div>\r\n                                <span>Fusi\u00f3n (Hielo \u2192 Agua)<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"celda-valor\">\r\n                                <span class=\"valor-destacado\">334,000 J\/kg<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor-pequeno\">(79.7 cal\/g)<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"celda-info\">Temperatura constante: 0\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"fila-latente\">\r\n                            <div class=\"celda-proceso\">\r\n                                <div class=\"icono-proceso\">\ud83d\udca7\u2192\ud83d\udca8<\/div>\r\n                                <span>Vaporizaci\u00f3n (Agua \u2192 Vapor)<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"celda-valor\">\r\n                                <span class=\"valor-destacado\">2,260,000 J\/kg<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor-pequeno\">(540 cal\/g)<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"celda-info\">Temperatura constante: 100\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"fila-latente\">\r\n                            <div class=\"celda-proceso\">\r\n                                <div class=\"icono-proceso\">\ud83d\udca7\u2192\u2744\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                                <span>Solidificaci\u00f3n (Agua \u2192 Hielo)<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"celda-valor\">\r\n                                <span class=\"valor-destacado\">-334,000 J\/kg<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"valor-pequeno\">(libera calor)<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"celda-info\">Temperatura constante: 0\u00b0C<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-aplicacion\">\r\n                    <h4>APLICACI\u00d3N PR\u00c1CTICA<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Para fundir 500 g de hielo a 0\u00b0C:<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"calculo-paso\">\r\n                        <span class=\"paso-numero\">1<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"paso-texto\">Convertir masa: 500 g = 0.5 kg<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"calculo-paso\">\r\n                        <span class=\"paso-numero\">2<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"paso-texto\">Aplicar f\u00f3rmula: Q = m \u00d7 L<sub>f<\/sub><\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"calculo-paso\">\r\n                        <span class=\"paso-numero\">3<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"paso-texto\">Calcular: Q = 0.5 \u00d7 334,000 = 167,000 J<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"resultado-final\">\r\n                        <strong>Resultado:<\/strong> Se necesitan 167 kJ para fundir el hielo\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- SECCI\u00d3N 3: EQUILIBRIO T\u00c9RMICO -->\r\n        <section class=\"seccion-contenido\">\r\n            <div class=\"seccion-header\">\r\n                <h2><span class=\"numero-seccion\">03<\/span> EQUILIBRIO T\u00c9RMICO<\/h2>\r\n                <div class=\"linea-separadora\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"principio-fundamental\">\r\n                <div class=\"principio-icono\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"principio-contenido\">\r\n                    <h3>PRINCIPIO DE CONSERVACI\u00d3N DEL CALOR<\/h3>\r\n                    <p>En un sistema aislado, el calor perdido por los cuerpos calientes es igual al calor ganado por los cuerpos fr\u00edos.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"formula-equilibrio\">\r\n                <div class=\"formula-simple\">\r\n                    \\[ Q_{\\text{ganado}} = Q_{\\text{perdido}} \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-completa\">\r\n                    \\[ m_1 \\cdot c_1 \\cdot (T_f - T_1) = m_2 \\cdot c_2 \\cdot (T_2 - T_f) \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-explicacion\">\r\n                    Donde:\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>T<sub>f<\/sub> = temperatura final de equilibrio<\/li>\r\n                        <li>T<sub>1<\/sub> = temperatura inicial del cuerpo fr\u00edo<\/li>\r\n                        <li>T<sub>2<\/sub> = temperatura inicial del cuerpo caliente<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"ejemplo-detallado\">\r\n                <h4>PROBLEMA RESUELTO<\/h4>\r\n                <p class=\"enunciado-problema\">\r\n                    Se introduce un bloque de aluminio de 0.5 kg a 150\u00b0C en 2 litros de agua a 20\u00b0C. Calcular la temperatura final de equilibrio.\r\n                <\/p>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"solucion-pasos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-solucion\">\r\n                        <div class=\"paso-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"paso-indicador\">Paso 1<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"paso-titulo\">Datos conocidos<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"paso-contenido\">\r\n                            <div class=\"datos-lista\">\r\n                                <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"dato-label\">Agua:<\/span>\r\n                                    <span class=\"dato-valor\">m\u2081 = 2 kg, c\u2081 = 4186 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C, T\u2081 = 20\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"dato-label\">Aluminio:<\/span>\r\n                                    <span class=\"dato-valor\">m\u2082 = 0.5 kg, c\u2082 = 900 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C, T\u2082 = 150\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"paso-solucion\">\r\n                        <div class=\"paso-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"paso-indicador\">Paso 2<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"paso-titulo\">Aplicar conservaci\u00f3n<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"paso-contenido\">\r\n                            \\[ m_1 c_1 (T_f - T_1) = m_2 c_2 (T_2 - T_f) \\]\r\n                            \\[ 2 \\times 4186 \\times (T_f - 20) = 0.5 \\times 900 \\times (150 - T_f) \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"paso-solucion\">\r\n                        <div class=\"paso-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"paso-indicador\">Paso 3<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"paso-titulo\">Resolver ecuaci\u00f3n<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"paso-contenido\">\r\n                            \\[ 8372(T_f - 20) = 450(150 - T_f) \\]\r\n                            \\[ 8372T_f - 167,440 = 67,500 - 450T_f \\]\r\n                            \\[ 8372T_f + 450T_f = 67,500 + 167,440 \\]\r\n                            \\[ 8822T_f = 234,940 \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"paso-solucion\">\r\n                        <div class=\"paso-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"paso-indicador\">Paso 4<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"paso-titulo\">Calcular resultado<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"paso-contenido\">\r\n                            \\[ T_f = \\frac{234,940}{8822} \\approx 26.6 \\, ^\\circ\\text{C} \\]\r\n                            <div class=\"resultado-destacado\">\r\n                                <strong>Temperatura final:<\/strong> 26.6\u00b0C\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- COLUMNA DERECHA: DATOS Y APLICACIONES -->\r\n    <div class=\"columna-datos\">\r\n        \r\n        <!-- TABLA DE CALORES ESPEC\u00cdFICOS -->\r\n        <section class=\"seccion-datos\">\r\n            <div class=\"seccion-header-datos\">\r\n                <h2>\ud83d\udccb CALORES ESPEC\u00cdFICOS<\/h2>\r\n                <div class=\"linea-datos\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"tabla-sustancias\">\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-header-fijo\">\r\n                    <div class=\"columna-sustancia\">SUSTANCIA<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"columna-valor\">c (J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"columna-relacion\">vs AGUA<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"tabla-cuerpo\">\r\n                    <!-- AGUA -->\r\n                    <div class=\"fila-sustancia destacada\">\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-sustancia\">\r\n                            <div class=\"icono-sustancia\">\ud83d\udca7<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"info-sustancia\">\r\n                                <strong>Agua l\u00edquida<\/strong>\r\n                                <span class=\"formula-sustancia\">H\u2082O<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-valor\">\r\n                            <span class=\"valor-principal\">4186<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"valor-secundario\">(1.000 cal\/g\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-relacion\">\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-relacion\" style=\"width: 100%\">\r\n                                <span class=\"texto-relacion\">1.00\u00d7<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- ALUMINIO -->\r\n                    <div class=\"fila-sustancia\">\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-sustancia\">\r\n                            <div class=\"icono-sustancia\">\ud83d\udd29<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"info-sustancia\">\r\n                                <strong>Aluminio<\/strong>\r\n                                <span class=\"formula-sustancia\">Al<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-valor\">\r\n                            <span class=\"valor-principal\">900<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"valor-secundario\">(0.215 cal\/g\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-relacion\">\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-relacion\" style=\"width: 21.5%\">\r\n                                <span class=\"texto-relacion\">0.22\u00d7<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- COBRE -->\r\n                    <div class=\"fila-sustancia\">\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-sustancia\">\r\n                            <div class=\"icono-sustancia\">\ud83d\udd0c<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"info-sustancia\">\r\n                                <strong>Cobre<\/strong>\r\n                                <span class=\"formula-sustancia\">Cu<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-valor\">\r\n                            <span class=\"valor-principal\">385<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"valor-secundario\">(0.092 cal\/g\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-relacion\">\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-relacion\" style=\"width: 9.2%\">\r\n                                <span class=\"texto-relacion\">0.09\u00d7<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- HIERRO -->\r\n                    <div class=\"fila-sustancia\">\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-sustancia\">\r\n                            <div class=\"icono-sustancia\">\u2699\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"info-sustancia\">\r\n                                <strong>Hierro<\/strong>\r\n                                <span class=\"formula-sustancia\">Fe<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-valor\">\r\n                            <span class=\"valor-principal\">450<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"valor-secundario\">(0.108 cal\/g\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-relacion\">\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-relacion\" style=\"width: 10.8%\">\r\n                                <span class=\"texto-relacion\">0.11\u00d7<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- PLATA -->\r\n                    <div class=\"fila-sustancia\">\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-sustancia\">\r\n                            <div class=\"icono-sustancia\">\u2728<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"info-sustancia\">\r\n                                <strong>Plata<\/strong>\r\n                                <span class=\"formula-sustancia\">Ag<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-valor\">\r\n                            <span class=\"valor-principal\">235<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"valor-secundario\">(0.056 cal\/g\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-relacion\">\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-relacion\" style=\"width: 5.6%\">\r\n                                <span class=\"texto-relacion\">0.06\u00d7<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- ALCOHOL -->\r\n                    <div class=\"fila-sustancia\">\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-sustancia\">\r\n                            <div class=\"icono-sustancia\">\ud83c\udf77<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"info-sustancia\">\r\n                                <strong>Alcohol et\u00edlico<\/strong>\r\n                                <span class=\"formula-sustancia\">C\u2082H\u2085OH<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-valor\">\r\n                            <span class=\"valor-principal\">2400<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"valor-secundario\">(0.574 cal\/g\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-relacion\">\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-relacion\" style=\"width: 57.4%\">\r\n                                <span class=\"texto-relacion\">0.57\u00d7<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- HIELO -->\r\n                    <div class=\"fila-sustancia\">\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-sustancia\">\r\n                            <div class=\"icono-sustancia\">\u2744\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"info-sustancia\">\r\n                                <strong>Hielo<\/strong>\r\n                                <span class=\"formula-sustancia\">H\u2082O(s)<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-valor\">\r\n                            <span class=\"valor-principal\">2090<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"valor-secundario\">(0.500 cal\/g\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-relacion\">\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-relacion\" style=\"width: 50%\">\r\n                                <span class=\"texto-relacion\">0.50\u00d7<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- VAPOR -->\r\n                    <div class=\"fila-sustancia\">\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-sustancia\">\r\n                            <div class=\"icono-sustancia\">\ud83d\udca8<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"info-sustancia\">\r\n                                <strong>Vapor de agua<\/strong>\r\n                                <span class=\"formula-sustancia\">H\u2082O(g)<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-valor\">\r\n                            <span class=\"valor-principal\">2010<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"valor-secundario\">(0.480 cal\/g\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"celda-relacion\">\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-relacion\" style=\"width: 48%\">\r\n                                <span class=\"texto-relacion\">0.48\u00d7<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"tabla-nota\">\r\n                    <strong>Nota:<\/strong> Valores aproximados a 25\u00b0C y 1 atm. El agua tiene el calor espec\u00edfico m\u00e1s alto entre sustancias comunes.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- APLICACIONES PR\u00c1CTICAS -->\r\n        <section class=\"seccion-datos\">\r\n            <div class=\"seccion-header-datos\">\r\n                <h2>\ud83d\udd27 APLICACIONES PR\u00c1CTICAS<\/h2>\r\n                <div class=\"linea-datos\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"aplicaciones-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"aplicacion-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"aplicacion-icono\" style=\"background: rgba(255, 87, 34, 0.1);\">\ud83c\udfe0<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"aplicacion-contenido\">\r\n                        <h3>Calefacci\u00f3n Urbana<\/h3>\r\n                        <p>Sistemas de calefacci\u00f3n usan el alto c del agua (4186 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C) para almacenar y distribuir calor eficientemente.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"aplicacion-dato\">\r\n                            <span>Eficiencia:<\/span>\r\n                            <strong>85-95%<\/strong>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"aplicacion-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"aplicacion-icono\" style=\"background: rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.1);\">\ud83d\ude97<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"aplicacion-contenido\">\r\n                        <h3>Radiadores Automotrices<\/h3>\r\n                        <p>El agua en el sistema de enfriamiento absorbe calor del motor gracias a su alto calor espec\u00edfico.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"aplicacion-dato\">\r\n                            <span>\u0394T t\u00edpico:<\/span>\r\n                            <strong>40-60\u00b0C<\/strong>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"aplicacion-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"aplicacion-icono\" style=\"background: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.1);\">\ud83c\udf0a<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"aplicacion-contenido\">\r\n                        <h3>Regulaci\u00f3n Clim\u00e1tica<\/h3>\r\n                        <p>Oc\u00e9anos moderan el clima terrestre absorbiendo calor en verano y liber\u00e1ndolo en invierno.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"aplicacion-dato\">\r\n                            <span>Capacidad:<\/span>\r\n                            <strong>332M km\u00b3<\/strong>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"aplicacion-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"aplicacion-icono\" style=\"background: rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.1);\">\ud83c\udf73<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"aplicacion-contenido\">\r\n                        <h3>Utensilios de Cocina<\/h3>\r\n                        <p>Sartenes de aluminio (bajo c) se calientan r\u00e1pido, ollas de acero (alto c) distribuyen calor uniformemente.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"aplicacion-dato\">\r\n                            <span>c aluminio:<\/span>\r\n                            <strong>900 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C<\/strong>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- DIAGRAMA INTERACTIVO SIMPLE -->\r\n        <section class=\"seccion-datos\">\r\n            <div class=\"seccion-header-datos\">\r\n                <h2>\ud83d\udcc8 DIAGRAMA: TRANSFERENCIA DE CALOR<\/h2>\r\n                <div class=\"linea-datos\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"diagrama-container\">\r\n                <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"300\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" class=\"diagrama-svg\">\r\n                    <!-- FONDO -->\r\n                    <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\" rx=\"8\"\/>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- OBJETO CALIENTE -->\r\n                    <g id=\"objeto-caliente\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"50\" y=\"100\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FF5722\" stroke=\"#FF8A65\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"100\" y=\"85\" fill=\"#FF8A65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">OBJETO CALIENTE<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"100\" y=\"120\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">T\u2082 = 150\u00b0C<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"100\" y=\"140\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">m\u2082 = 0.5 kg<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"100\" y=\"160\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">c\u2082 = 900 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"100\" y=\"190\" fill=\"#FFCC80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">Q perdido<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- FLECHAS DE CALOR -->\r\n                    <g id=\"flechas-calor\">\r\n                        <path d=\"M150 150 L200 150 L200 180 L250 180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF9800\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\">\r\n                            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"0;20\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                        <\/path>\r\n                        <polygon points=\"250,180 240,175 240,185\" fill=\"#FF9800\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"200\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#FF9800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">Q transferido<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- OBJETO FR\u00cdO -->\r\n                    <g id=\"objeto-frio\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"250\" y=\"100\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#2196F3\" stroke=\"#64B5F6\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"300\" y=\"85\" fill=\"#64B5F6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">OBJETO FR\u00cdO<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"300\" y=\"120\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">T\u2081 = 20\u00b0C<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"300\" y=\"140\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">m\u2081 = 2.0 kg<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"300\" y=\"160\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">c\u2081 = 4186 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"300\" y=\"190\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">Q ganado<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- EQUILIBRIO -->\r\n                    <g id=\"equilibrio\">\r\n                        <text x=\"200\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\">\r\n                            EQUILIBRIO T\u00c9RMICO: T_f = 26.6\u00b0C\r\n                        <\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"200\" y=\"270\" fill=\"#81C784\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">\r\n                            Q ganado = Q perdido\r\n                        <\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"diagrama-leyenda\">\r\n                    <div class=\"leyenda-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"leyenda-color\" style=\"background: #FF5722;\"><\/div>\r\n                        <span>Objeto caliente \u2192 Pierde calor<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"leyenda-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"leyenda-color\" style=\"background: #2196F3;\"><\/div>\r\n                        <span>Objeto fr\u00edo \u2192 Gana calor<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"leyenda-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"leyenda-color\" style=\"background: #FF9800;\"><\/div>\r\n                        <span>Transferencia de calor (Q)<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- EJERCICIOS ADICIONALES -->\r\n        <section class=\"seccion-datos\">\r\n            <div class=\"seccion-header-datos\">\r\n                <h2>\ud83e\uddee EJERCICIOS ADICIONALES<\/h2>\r\n                <div class=\"linea-datos\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"ejercicios-lista\">\r\n                <div class=\"ejercicio-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-header\">\r\n                        <span class=\"ejercicio-numero\">01<\/span>\r\n                        <h3>Calentamiento de agua<\/h3>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p class=\"ejercicio-enunciado\">\r\n                        \u00bfCu\u00e1nto calor se necesita para calentar 5 litros de agua de 15\u00b0C a 95\u00b0C?\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-solucion\">\r\n                        <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                        1 L agua \u2248 1 kg \u2192 m = 5 kg<br>\r\n                        \u0394T = 95 - 15 = 80\u00b0C<br>\r\n                        Q = 5 \u00d7 4186 \u00d7 80 = 1,674,400 J \u2248 1.67 MJ\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"ejercicio-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-header\">\r\n                        <span class=\"ejercicio-numero\">02<\/span>\r\n                        <h3>Mezcla de metales<\/h3>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p class=\"ejercicio-enunciado\">\r\n                        Un bloque de cobre de 1 kg a 200\u00b0C se coloca en 0.5 kg de aluminio a 25\u00b0C. Calcular T_f.\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-solucion\">\r\n                        <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                        m\u2081c\u2081(T_f - 25) = m\u2082c\u2082(200 - T_f)<br>\r\n                        0.5\u00d7900\u00d7(T_f - 25) = 1\u00d7385\u00d7(200 - T_f)<br>\r\n                        450T_f - 11,250 = 77,000 - 385T_f<br>\r\n                        835T_f = 88,250 \u2192 T_f \u2248 105.7\u00b0C\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"ejercicio-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-header\">\r\n                        <span class=\"ejercicio-numero\">03<\/span>\r\n                        <h3>Calor latente combinado<\/h3>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p class=\"ejercicio-enunciado\">\r\n                        Calcular el calor total para convertir 2 kg de hielo a -10\u00b0C en vapor a 120\u00b0C.\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-solucion\">\r\n                        <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                        1. Calentar hielo: Q\u2081 = 2\u00d72090\u00d710 = 41,800 J<br>\r\n                        2. Fundir: Q\u2082 = 2\u00d7334,000 = 668,000 J<br>\r\n                        3. Calentar agua: Q\u2083 = 2\u00d74186\u00d7100 = 837,200 J<br>\r\n                        4. Vaporizar: Q\u2084 = 2\u00d72,260,000 = 4,520,000 J<br>\r\n                        5. Calentar vapor: Q\u2085 = 2\u00d72010\u00d720 = 80,400 J<br>\r\n                        Total: Q = 6,147,400 J \u2248 6.15 MJ\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- DATOS CURIOSOS -->\r\n        <section class=\"seccion-datos\">\r\n            <div class=\"seccion-header-datos\">\r\n                <h2>\ud83d\udca1 DATOS CURIOSOS<\/h2>\r\n                <div class=\"linea-datos\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"curiosidades-lista\">\r\n                <div class=\"curiosidad-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"curiosidad-icono\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"curiosidad-contenido\">\r\n                        <h4>El agua modera el clima<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>El alto calor espec\u00edfico del agua (4186 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C) es 5 veces mayor que el de la tierra, por eso las zonas costeras tienen climas m\u00e1s estables.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"curiosidad-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"curiosidad-icono\">\u26a1<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"curiosidad-contenido\">\r\n                        <h4>Enfriamiento por sudor<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>El sudor usa el calor latente de vaporizaci\u00f3n (2260 kJ\/kg) para enfriar el cuerpo: cada gramo de sudor evaporado elimina 2260 J de calor.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"curiosidad-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"curiosidad-icono\">\ud83d\udd2c<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"curiosidad-contenido\">\r\n                        <h4>Calor\u00eda original<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>1 calor\u00eda se defini\u00f3 originalmente como el calor necesario para elevar 1\u00b0C la temperatura de 1 gramo de agua de 14.5\u00b0C a 15.5\u00b0C.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- SIMULADOR SIMPLE -->\r\n<section class=\"simulador-simple\">\r\n    <div class=\"simulador-header\">\r\n        <h2><span class=\"icono-simulador\">\ud83e\uddea<\/span> CALCULADORA DE CALOR<\/h2>\r\n        <p class=\"simulador-descripcion\">\r\n            Calcula la transferencia de calor entre dos sustancias\r\n        <\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"simulador-contenido\">\r\n        <div class=\"calculadora-form\">\r\n            <!-- SUSTANCIA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"sustancia-input\">\r\n                <h3>Sustancia 1 (Agua)<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                    <label>Masa (kg):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"number\" id=\"calc-m1\" value=\"2.0\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"10\" step=\"0.1\" class=\"input-calculadora\">\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                    <label>Temperatura (\u00b0C):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"number\" id=\"calc-T1\" value=\"20\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" class=\"input-calculadora\">\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"sustancia-info\">\r\n                    <span>Calor espec\u00edfico:<\/span>\r\n                    <strong>4186 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C<\/strong>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- SUSTANCIA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"sustancia-input\">\r\n                <h3>Sustancia 2 (Metal)<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                    <label>Material:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"calc-material\" class=\"select-calculadora\">\r\n                        <option value=\"900\">Aluminio (900 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"385\">Cobre (385 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"450\" selected>Hierro (450 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"235\">Plata (235 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                    <label>Masa (kg):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"number\" id=\"calc-m2\" value=\"1.0\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"10\" step=\"0.1\" class=\"input-calculadora\">\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"input-group\">\r\n                    <label>Temperatura (\u00b0C):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"number\" id=\"calc-T2\" value=\"150\" min=\"0\" max=\"500\" step=\"10\" class=\"input-calculadora\">\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- BOT\u00d3N DE C\u00c1LCULO -->\r\n            <div class=\"calculadora-boton\">\r\n                <button onclick=\"calcularTransferencia()\" class=\"btn-calcular\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icono\">\ud83e\uddee<\/span>\r\n                    CALCULAR TRANSFERENCIA\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n        <div class=\"calculadora-resultados\" id=\"resultadosCalculadora\">\r\n            <div class=\"resultados-header\">\r\n                <h3>RESULTADOS DEL C\u00c1LCULO<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"resultados-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"resultado-label\">Temperatura final:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"resultado-valor\" id=\"resultado-Tf\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"resultado-label\">Calor transferido:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"resultado-valor\" id=\"resultado-Q\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"resultado-label\">\u0394T agua:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"resultado-valor\" id=\"resultado-dT1\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"resultado-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"resultado-label\">\u0394T metal:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"resultado-valor\" id=\"resultado-dT2\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"ecuacion-resultado\">\r\n                <div class=\"ecuacion-titulo\">Ecuaci\u00f3n aplicada:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ecuacion-contenido\">\r\n                    \\[ m_1 c_1 (T_f - T_1) = m_2 c_2 (T_2 - T_f) \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- RESUMEN FINAL -->\r\n<section class=\"resumen-final\">\r\n    <div class=\"resumen-header\">\r\n        <h2>\ud83d\udcda RESUMEN DE F\u00d3RMULAS<\/h2>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"formulas-resumen\">\r\n        <div class=\"formula-resumen-item\">\r\n            <div class=\"formula-titulo\">Calor Sensible<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-contenido\">\r\n                \\[ Q = m \\cdot c \\cdot \\Delta T \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-explicacion\">\r\n                Calor que cambia la temperatura de una sustancia sin cambiar su estado\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"formula-resumen-item\">\r\n            <div class=\"formula-titulo\">Calor Latente<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-contenido\">\r\n                \\[ Q = m \\cdot L \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-explicacion\">\r\n                Calor que cambia el estado de una sustancia sin cambiar su temperatura\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"formula-resumen-item\">\r\n            <div class=\"formula-titulo\">Equilibrio T\u00e9rmico<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-contenido\">\r\n                \\[ \\sum Q_{\\text{ganado}} = \\sum Q_{\\text{perdido}} \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-explicacion\">\r\n                En sistemas aislados, el calor total se conserva\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"formula-resumen-item\">\r\n            <div class=\"formula-titulo\">Capacidad T\u00e9rmica<\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-contenido\">\r\n                \\[ C = m \\cdot c = \\frac{Q}{\\Delta T} \\]\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"formula-explicacion\">\r\n                Relaci\u00f3n entre calor transferido y cambio de temperatura\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"consejos-finales\">\r\n        <h3>\ud83d\udca1 CONSEJOS PARA RESOLVER PROBLEMAS<\/h3>\r\n        <ol class=\"consejos-lista\">\r\n            <li>Identifica si es calor sensible (cambia T) o latente (cambia estado)<\/li>\r\n            <li>Convierte todas las unidades al SI (kg, J, \u00b0C)<\/li>\r\n            <li>En equilibrio t\u00e9rmico: calor ganado = calor perdido<\/li>\r\n            <li>El agua tiene el calor espec\u00edfico m\u00e1s alto com\u00fan: 4186 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C<\/li>\r\n            <li>Recuerda: 1 cal = 4.184 J exactamente<\/li>\r\n        <\/ol>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT SIMPLIFICADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ FUNCI\u00d3N PARA CALCULAR TRANSFERENCIA DE CALOR\r\nfunction calcularTransferencia() {\r\n    \/\/ Obtener valores\r\n    const m1 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('calc-m1').value);\r\n    const T1 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('calc-T1').value);\r\n    const m2 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('calc-m2').value);\r\n    const T2 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('calc-T2').value);\r\n    const c2 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('calc-material').value);\r\n    const c1 = 4186; \/\/ Calor espec\u00edfico del agua\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Validar datos\r\n    if (isNaN(m1) || isNaN(T1) || isNaN(m2) || isNaN(T2) || m1 <= 0 || m2 <= 0) {\r\n        alert(\"\u26a0\ufe0f Por favor, ingresa valores v\u00e1lidos mayores que cero.\");\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular temperatura final de equilibrio\r\n    const Tf = (m1 * c1 * T1 + m2 * c2 * T2) \/ (m1 * c1 + m2 * c2);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Calcular calores transferidos\r\n    const Q = m1 * c1 * (Tf - T1); \/\/ Calor ganado por el agua\r\n    const dT1 = Tf - T1; \/\/ Cambio de temperatura del agua\r\n    const dT2 = T2 - Tf; \/\/ Cambio de temperatura del metal\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Mostrar resultados\r\n    document.getElementById('resultado-Tf').textContent = Tf.toFixed(1) + \" \u00b0C\";\r\n    document.getElementById('resultado-Q').textContent = Q.toLocaleString('es-ES', {\r\n        maximumFractionDigits: 0\r\n    }) + \" J\";\r\n    document.getElementById('resultado-dT1').textContent = dT1.toFixed(1) + \" \u00b0C\";\r\n    document.getElementById('resultado-dT2').textContent = dT2.toFixed(1) + \" \u00b0C\";\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Actualizar ecuaci\u00f3n\r\n    const eqElement = document.querySelector('.ecuacion-contenido');\r\n    eqElement.innerHTML = `\\\\[ ${m1.toFixed(1)} \\\\times 4186 \\\\times (${Tf.toFixed(1)} - ${T1}) = ${m2.toFixed(1)} \\\\times ${c2} \\\\times (${T2} - ${Tf.toFixed(1)}) \\\\]`;\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Re-renderizar MathJax\r\n    if (window.MathJax) {\r\n        MathJax.typeset([eqElement]);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    console.log(\"C\u00e1lculo completado:\", { Tf, Q, dT1, dT2 });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    \/\/ Calcular valores por defecto\r\n    calcularTransferencia();\r\n    \r\n    console.log(\"Calculadora de calor inicializada\");\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto en tabla de sustancias\r\n    const filasSustancias = document.querySelectorAll('.fila-sustancia');\r\n    filasSustancias.forEach(fila => {\r\n        fila.addEventListener('mouseenter', function() {\r\n            this.style.transform = 'translateX(5px)';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        fila.addEventListener('mouseleave', function() {\r\n            this.style.transform = 'translateX(0)';\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n<\/script>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK MEJORADA -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"F\u00f3rmula cantidad calor","respuesta":"Q = m c \u0394T"},{"enunciado":"c agua","respuesta":"4186 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C"},{"enunciado":"Capacidad calor\u00edfica C =","respuesta":"m c"},{"enunciado":"Unidad c","respuesta":"J\/(kg\u00b7\u00b0C)"},{"enunciado":"Q para 0.5 kg agua \u0394T=20\u00b0C","respuesta":"41860 J"},{"enunciado":"c cobre \u2248","respuesta":"385 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C"},{"enunciado":"C para 2 kg agua","respuesta":"8372 J\/\u00b0C"},{"enunciado":"\u0394T = Q \/ (m c)","respuesta":"F\u00f3rmula cambio T"},{"enunciado":"Calor latente fusi\u00f3n agua","respuesta":"334 kJ\/kg"},{"enunciado":"1 cal =","respuesta":"4.184 J"},{"enunciado":"c alta \u2192","respuesta":"Absorbe m\u00e1s calor por \u00b0C"},{"enunciado":"SI: calor en","respuesta":"Joule"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Q = m c \u0394T mide","opciones":["Calor transferido","Temperatura","Masa","Volumen"],"correcta":"Calor transferido"},{"pregunta":"c es","opciones":["Espec\u00edfica","Total","Molar","Nuclear"],"correcta":"Espec\u00edfica"},{"pregunta":"C = m c es","opciones":["Capacidad calor\u00edfica","Espec\u00edfica","Latente","Nuclear"],"correcta":"Capacidad calor\u00edfica"},{"pregunta":"c agua =","opciones":["4186 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C","385 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C","900 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C","2090 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C"],"correcta":"4186 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Alta c \u2192","opciones":["Absorbe m\u00e1s calor","Menos","Igual","Cero"],"correcta":"Absorbe m\u00e1s calor"},{"pregunta":"\u0394T = 0 \u2192 Q","opciones":["0","m\u00e1ximo","infinito","negativo"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"m dobla \u2192 Q","opciones":["Dobla","Cuadruplica","Mitad","Igual"],"correcta":"Dobla"},{"pregunta":"\u0394T dobla \u2192 Q","opciones":["Dobla","Cuadruplica","Mitad","Igual"],"correcta":"Dobla"},{"pregunta":"Calor latente es para","opciones":["Cambio fase","Cambio T","Movimiento","Luz"],"correcta":"Cambio fase"},{"pregunta":"1 cal =","opciones":["4.184 J","1 J","4184 J","0.4184 J"],"correcta":"4.184 J"},{"pregunta":"Q = 8360 J, m=1 kg, c=4186 \u2192 \u0394T","opciones":["2\u00b0C","1\u00b0C","4\u00b0C","8360\u00b0C"],"correcta":"2\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"c cobre","opciones":["385 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C","4186","900","2090"],"correcta":"385 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"C para 500 g agua","opciones":["2093 J\/\u00b0C","4186 J\/\u00b0C","8372 J\/\u00b0C","0"],"correcta":"2093 J\/\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Calor para fundir 1 kg hielo","opciones":["334 kJ","4186 kJ","2260 kJ","0 J"],"correcta":"334 kJ"},{"pregunta":"Calor para vaporizar 1 kg agua","opciones":["2260 kJ","334 kJ","4186 kJ","0 J"],"correcta":"2260 kJ"},{"pregunta":"c hielo","opciones":["2090 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C","4186","2010","385"],"correcta":"2090 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Q = C \u0394T para","opciones":["Objeto entero","Por kg","Por mol","Fase"],"correcta":"Objeto entero"},{"pregunta":"SI: c en","opciones":["J\/(kg\u00b7K)","cal\/g\u00b7\u00b0C","BTU\/lb\u00b7\u00b0F","kWh"],"correcta":"J\/(kg\u00b7K)"},{"pregunta":"c alta en","opciones":["Agua","Cobre","Aire","Vac\u00edo"],"correcta":"Agua"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC: calor en","opciones":["Joule","Calor\u00eda","eV","kWh"],"correcta":"Joule"},{"pregunta":"Q = 100 kJ, m=2 kg, \u0394T=10\u00b0C \u2192 c","opciones":["5000 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C","500 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C","10000 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C","0"],"correcta":"5000 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Calor espec\u00edfico molar agua \u2248","opciones":["75.3 J\/mol\u00b7K","18 J\/mol\u00b7K","4186 J\/mol\u00b7K","4.184 J\/mol\u00b7K"],"correcta":"75.3 J\/mol\u00b7K"},{"pregunta":"Dulong-Petit: c molar metales \u2248","opciones":["25 J\/mol\u00b7K","75 J\/mol\u00b7K","4.184 J\/mol\u00b7K","0"],"correcta":"25 J\/mol\u00b7K"},{"pregunta":"Calor para 1 mol agua +1\u00b0C","opciones":["75.3 J","4186 J","18 J","4.184 J"],"correcta":"75.3 J"},{"pregunta":"c vapor agua","opciones":["2010 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C","4186","2090","385"],"correcta":"2010 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"Q latente fusi\u00f3n vs vaporizaci\u00f3n","opciones":["L_v > L_f","L_f > L_v","Igual","Cero"],"correcta":"L_v > L_f"},{"pregunta":"Calor\u00edmetro ideal","opciones":["Q_ganado = -Q_perdido","Q_ganado = Q_perdido","Q = 0","Q infinito"],"correcta":"Q_ganado = -Q_perdido"},{"pregunta":"c aire \u2248","opciones":["1000 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C","4186","385","2090"],"correcta":"1000 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: 1 cal =","opciones":["4.184 J exacto","4.2 J","4 J","1 J"],"correcta":"4.184 J exacto"},{"pregunta":"Capacidad calor\u00edfica sistema","opciones":["\u2211 C_i","C_promedio","C_m\u00e1x","0"],"correcta":"\u2211 C_i"}]},{"materia":"F\u00edsica I","slug":"impulso-cantidad-movimiento","titulo":"Impulso Mec\u00e1nico: J = F \u0394t = \u0394p, Cantidad de Movimiento p = m v, F = m a","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-fisica-impulso\" data-tema=\"impulso\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83d\ude80<\/span>\r\n            IMPULSO Y <span class=\"formula-highlight\">CANTIDAD DE MOVIMIENTO<\/span>\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            El impulso cambia el estado de movimiento de un cuerpo: \\( J = F \\Delta t = \\Delta p \\)\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Definir cantidad de movimiento (\\(p = m v\\))<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Explicar su naturaleza vectorial y su conservaci\u00f3n en sistemas aislados<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Relacionar impulso y cambio en \\(p\\) (\\(J = \\Delta p\\))<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Aplicar \\( J = F \\Delta t \\) en problemas de colisiones y fuerzas impulsivas<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar la 2\u00aa Ley de Newton en t\u00e9rminos de \\(p\\)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Entender \\( F = \\frac{\\Delta p}{\\Delta t} \\) como generalizaci\u00f3n de \\( F = m a \\)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Simular escenarios de impulso y colisiones<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Usar el simulador interactivo para visualizar cambios en \\(p\\)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\ude97 Airbags en Autom\u00f3viles<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Los airbags aumentan el tiempo de colisi\u00f3n (\\(\\Delta t\\)), reduciendo la fuerza (\\(F\\)) y protegiendo a los ocupantes.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Tiempo de inflado: 30-50 ms<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfc0 Deportes de Contacto<\/h3>\r\n                <p>En el baloncesto, los jugadores usan el impulso para cambiar la cantidad de movimiento del bal\u00f3n y anotar.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Fuerza promedio: 50-100 N<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\ude80 Cohetes Espaciales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>La expulsi\u00f3n de gases a alta velocidad genera un impulso que propulsa el cohete (3\u00aa Ley de Newton).<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Empuje: 35 MN (Saturno V)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- CANTIDAD DE MOVIMIENTO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Cantidad de Movimiento (\\(p\\))<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>CANTIDAD DE MOVIMIENTO<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Magnitud <strong>vectorial<\/strong> que depende de la masa y la velocidad de un cuerpo:<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                            p = m v\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-detalle\">\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Unidad SI:<\/strong> kg\u00b7m\/s<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Direcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Igual que la velocidad<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Conservaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> En sistemas aislados, \\( p_{\\text{total}} \\) es constante<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- IMPULSO MEC\u00c1NICO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Impulso Mec\u00e1nico (\\(J\\))<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>IMPULSO<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Efecto de una fuerza aplicada durante un intervalo de tiempo:<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                            J = F \\Delta t = \\Delta p\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-detalle\">\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Unidad SI:<\/strong> N\u00b7s (equivalente a kg\u00b7m\/s)<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Interpretaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> \u00c1rea bajo la curva \\(F\\) vs \\(t\\)<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Relaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> \\( J = \\Delta p \\) (cambio en cantidad de movimiento)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 2\u00aa LEY DE NEWTON GENERALIZADA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. 2\u00aa Ley de Newton en T\u00e9rminos de \\(p\\)<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"ecuacion-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"ecuacion-formula\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                        F = \\frac{\\Delta p}{\\Delta t}\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ecuacion-explicacion\">\r\n                    <p>Generalizaci\u00f3n de \\( F = m a \\):<\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Si \\( m \\) es constante: \\( F = m a \\)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Si \\( m \\) var\u00eda (ej: cohetes): \\( F = \\frac{dp}{dt} \\)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                            F \\Delta t = \\Delta p \\quad \\text{(Relaci\u00f3n impulso-cambio en } p\\text{)}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- RELACIONES CLAVE -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Relaciones Clave<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>Concepto<\/th>\r\n                            <th>F\u00f3rmula<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Unidad SI<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Interpretaci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr data-concepto=\"cantidad-movimiento\">\r\n                            <td><strong>Cantidad de movimiento<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>\\( p = m v \\)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>kg\u00b7m\/s<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Estado de movimiento de un cuerpo<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-concepto=\"impulso\">\r\n                            <td><strong>Impulso<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>\\( J = F \\Delta t \\)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>N\u00b7s<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Cambio en cantidad de movimiento<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-concepto=\"segunda-ley\">\r\n                            <td><strong>2\u00aa Ley de Newton<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>\\( F = \\frac{\\Delta p}{\\Delta t} \\)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>N<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Relaci\u00f3n entre fuerza y cambio en \\( p \\)<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoRelaciones\">\r\n                    Selecciona una fila para ver detalles\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- EJEMPLO PR\u00c1CTICO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>5. Ejemplo Pr\u00e1ctico<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"ejemplo-card\">\r\n                <p><strong>Problema:<\/strong> Una fuerza de 200 N act\u00faa sobre un objeto de 2 kg durante 0.05 s. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                <ol>\r\n                    <li>El impulso (\\(J\\)).<\/li>\r\n                    <li>El cambio en la cantidad de movimiento (\\(\\Delta p\\)).<\/li>\r\n                    <li>La velocidad final si el objeto estaba inicialmente en reposo.<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-solucion\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        1. Impulso: \\( J = F \\Delta t = 200 \\cdot 0.05 = 10\\, \\text{N\u00b7s} \\).\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        2. Cambio en \\( p \\): \\( \\Delta p = J = 10\\, \\text{kg\u00b7m\/s} \\).\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        3. Velocidad final: \\( \\Delta p = m \\Delta v \\Rightarrow 10 = 2 \\Delta v \\Rightarrow \\Delta v = 5\\, \\text{m\/s} \\).\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarEjemplo()\">VERIFICAR C\u00c1LCULO<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-feedback\" id=\"feedbackEjemplo\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <p>\u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> El impulso es \\(10\\, \\text{N\u00b7s}\\), \\(\\Delta p = 10\\, \\text{kg\u00b7m\/s}\\), y \\(\\Delta v = 5\\, \\text{m\/s}\\).<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: IMPULSO Y CANTIDAD DE MOVIMIENTO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"impulso\">\r\n            <!-- CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"masaInput\">Masa (m) en kg:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"masaInput\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"10\" value=\"2\" step=\"0.5\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <span id=\"masaValue\">2 kg<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"fuerzaInput\">Fuerza (F) en N:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"fuerzaInput\" min=\"50\" max=\"500\" value=\"200\" step=\"10\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <span id=\"fuerzaValue\">200 N<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"tiempoInput\">Tiempo (\u0394t) en s:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"tiempoInput\" min=\"0.01\" max=\"0.2\" value=\"0.05\" step=\"0.01\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <span id=\"tiempoValue\">0.05 s<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"velocidadInicialInput\">Velocidad inicial (v\u2080) en m\/s:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"velocidadInicialInput\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"0\" step=\"0.5\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <span id=\"velocidadInicialValue\">0 m\/s<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-ejecutar\" onclick=\"calcularImpulso()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6<\/span> CALCULAR IMPULSO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"valoresAleatorios()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> VALORES ALEATORIOS\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" id=\"svgImpulso\">\r\n                    <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\" id=\"fondoSimulador\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Ejes del gr\u00e1fico F vs t -->\r\n                    <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#4CAF50\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                    <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#4CAF50\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"90\" y=\"290\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">0<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"320\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">t (s)<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"90\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">F (N)<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- \u00c1rea del impulso (rect\u00e1ngulo) -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"200\" y=\"150\" width=\"100\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#EF5350\" opacity=\"0.7\" id=\"areaImpulso\">\r\n                        <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0.7;0.3;0.7\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                    <\/rect>\r\n                    <text x=\"250\" y=\"225\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"valorImpulso\">J = 10 N\u00b7s<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Objeto antes\/despu\u00e9s -->\r\n                    <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"200\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#2196F3\" id=\"objetoInicial\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"150\" y=\"240\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"velocidadInicialSVG\">v\u2080 = 0 m\/s<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"200\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" id=\"objetoFinal\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"450\" y=\"240\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"velocidadFinalSVG\">v_f = 5 m\/s<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Flecha de fuerza -->\r\n                    <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#FF5252\" stroke-width=\"4\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowhead)\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"130\" fill=\"#FF5252\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"fuerzaSVG\">F = 200 N<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- F\u00f3rmula -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"350\" width=\"400\" height=\"40\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.7)\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#39FF14\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"formulaSVG\">J = F \u0394t = \u0394p = m \u0394v<\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>DATOS DE SIMULACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Masa (m):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataMasa\">2 kg<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Fuerza (F):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataFuerza\">200 N<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Tiempo (\u0394t):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTiempo\">0.05 s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Velocidad inicial (v\u2080):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataVelocidadInicial\">0 m\/s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">IMPULSO (J):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataImpulso\">10 N\u00b7s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">CAMBIO EN p (\u0394p):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataDeltaP\">10 kg\u00b7m\/s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">VELOCIDAD FINAL (v_f):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataVelocidadFinal\">5 m\/s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 relaciona el teorema del impulso?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Fuerza y aceleraci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica y potencial\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Impulso y cambio en cantidad de movimiento\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Masa y velocidad\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> \\( J = \\Delta p \\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa el teorema del impulso.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El teorema del impulso establece que \\( J = \\Delta p \\), es decir, el impulso es igual al cambio en la cantidad de movimiento.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Un objeto de 3 kg se mueve a 4 m\/s. \u00bfCu\u00e1l es su cantidad de movimiento?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        12 kg\u00b7m\/s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        12 kg\u00b7m\/s\u00b2\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        7 kg\u00b7m\/s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        1.33 kg\u00b7m\/s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> \\( p = m v = 3 \\cdot 4 = 12\\, \\text{kg\u00b7m\/s} \\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> La unidad correcta es kg\u00b7m\/s.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>C\u00e1lculo:<\/strong> \\( p = m v = 3 \\cdot 4 = 12\\, \\text{kg\u00b7m\/s} \\).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                    Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/2\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                    Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES Y SOLUCIONES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR IMPULSO CON TRABAJO<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"El impulso es igual al trabajo realizado\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Impulso:<\/strong> \\( J = F \\Delta t \\) (N\u00b7s).<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Trabajo:<\/strong> \\( W = F d \\) (J).<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                        <table>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <th>Concepto<\/th>\r\n                                <th>F\u00f3rmula<\/th>\r\n                                <th>Unidad<\/th>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td>Impulso<\/td>\r\n                                <td>\\( J = F \\Delta t \\)<\/td>\r\n                                <td>N\u00b7s<\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td>Trabajo<\/td>\r\n                                <td>\\( W = F d \\)<\/td>\r\n                                <td>J<\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                        <\/table>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c OLVIDAR QUE LA CANTIDAD DE MOVIMIENTO ES VECTORIAL<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"La cantidad de movimiento es siempre positiva\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> \\( p = m v \\) es un <strong>vector<\/strong> con direcci\u00f3n igual a la velocidad.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Practica:<\/strong> Si un objeto de 2 kg se mueve a -3 m\/s, \u00bfcu\u00e1l es su \\( p \\)?<\/p>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                            <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> \\( p = 2 \\cdot (-3) = -6\\, \\text{kg\u00b7m\/s} \\).\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Impulso en un Golpe de Boxeo<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un boxeador golpea a su oponente con una fuerza promedio de 4000 N durante 0.02 s. La masa del guante (y mano) es 0.5 kg. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>El impulso aplicado.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>El cambio en la cantidad de movimiento del guante.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La velocidad final del guante si parti\u00f3 del reposo.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. Impulso: \\( J = F \\Delta t = 4000 \\cdot 0.02 = 80\\, \\text{N\u00b7s} \\).<br>\r\n                    2. Cambio en \\( p \\): \\( \\Delta p = 80\\, \\text{kg\u00b7m\/s} \\).<br>\r\n                    3. Velocidad final: \\( \\Delta p = m \\Delta v \\Rightarrow 80 = 0.5 \\Delta v \\Rightarrow \\Delta v = 160\\, \\text{m\/s} \\).\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Colisi\u00f3n entre Dos Objetos<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un objeto de 2 kg que se mueve a 5 m\/s choca con otro objeto de 3 kg en reposo. Despu\u00e9s del choque, el primer objeto se mueve a 1 m\/s en la misma direcci\u00f3n. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>La cantidad de movimiento inicial y final del sistema.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La velocidad final del segundo objeto.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p><em>Nota:<\/em> Asume que la colisi\u00f3n es perfectamente inel\u00e1stica en una dimensi\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. Cantidad de movimiento inicial: \\( p_i = 2 \\cdot 5 + 3 \\cdot 0 = 10\\, \\text{kg\u00b7m\/s} \\).<br>\r\n                    Cantidad de movimiento final: \\( p_f = 2 \\cdot 1 + 3 \\cdot v_f = 2 + 3 v_f \\).<br>\r\n                    Por conservaci\u00f3n: \\( 10 = 2 + 3 v_f \\Rightarrow v_f = \\frac{8}{3} \\approx 2.67\\, \\text{m\/s} \\).\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Aplicaci\u00f3n correcta de \\( J = \\Delta p \\)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>F\u00f3rmula y unidades correctas<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Errores menores en c\u00e1lculos<\/td>\r\n                        <td>F\u00f3rmula o unidades incorrectas<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Conservaci\u00f3n de la cantidad de movimiento<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Explica claramente la conservaci\u00f3n de \\( p \\)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Falta justificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                        <td>No aplica el principio<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc8 AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n de \\( p = m v \\):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Aplicaci\u00f3n de \\( J = \\Delta p \\):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es importante el concepto de impulso en el dise\u00f1o de sistemas de seguridad (ej: airbags, cinturones)?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: reducir la fuerza aumentando el tiempo de colisi\u00f3n...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Describe un ejemplo cotidiano donde observes un cambio en la cantidad de movimiento.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: patear un bal\u00f3n...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcda PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar f\u00f3rmulas \\( p = m v \\) y \\( J = F \\Delta t \\)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Repasar unidades (kg\u00b7m\/s, N\u00b7s)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udee0 PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Resolver 5 problemas de impulso y colisiones<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Usar el simulador para visualizar escenarios<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udf93 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Investigar aplicaciones en ingenier\u00eda (ej: cohetes)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Relacionar con energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/legacy\/collision-lab\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udfaf Simulador PhET: Laboratorio de Colisiones\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/science\/physics\/linear-momentum\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcda Khan Academy: Cantidad de Movimiento\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DE IMPULSO Y CANTIDAD DE MOVIMIENTO\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction calcularImpulso() {\r\n    \/\/ Obtener valores de los sliders\r\n    const masa = parseFloat(document.getElementById('masaInput').value);\r\n    const fuerza = parseFloat(document.getElementById('fuerzaInput').value);\r\n    const tiempo = parseFloat(document.getElementById('tiempoInput').value);\r\n    const velocidadInicial = parseFloat(document.getElementById('velocidadInicialInput').value);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Validar valores\r\n    if (isNaN(masa) || isNaN(fuerza) || isNaN(tiempo) || isNaN(velocidadInicial)) {\r\n        alert(\"Por favor, ingresa valores v\u00e1lidos.\");\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar valores en la interfaz\r\n    document.getElementById('masaValue').textContent = `${masa} kg`;\r\n    document.getElementById('fuerzaValue').textContent = `${fuerza} N`;\r\n    document.getElementById('tiempoValue').textContent = `${tiempo} s`;\r\n    document.getElementById('velocidadInicialValue').textContent = `${velocidadInicial} m\/s`;\r\n    document.getElementById('velocidadInicialSVG').textContent = `v\u2080 = ${velocidadInicial} m\/s`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Calcular impulso y cambios\r\n    const impulso = fuerza * tiempo;\r\n    const deltaP = impulso;\r\n    const velocidadFinal = velocidadInicial + (deltaP \/ masa);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar datos en la interfaz\r\n    document.getElementById('dataMasa').textContent = `${masa} kg`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataFuerza').textContent = `${fuerza} N`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataTiempo').textContent = `${tiempo} s`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataVelocidadInicial').textContent = `${velocidadInicial} m\/s`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataImpulso').textContent = `${impulso.toFixed(2)} N\u00b7s`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataDeltaP').textContent = `${deltaP.toFixed(2)} kg\u00b7m\/s`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataVelocidadFinal').textContent = `${velocidadFinal.toFixed(2)} m\/s`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar SVG\r\n    document.getElementById('valorImpulso').textContent = `J = ${impulso.toFixed(2)} N\u00b7s`;\r\n    document.getElementById('fuerzaSVG').textContent = `F = ${fuerza} N`;\r\n    document.getElementById('velocidadFinalSVG').textContent = `v_f = ${velocidadFinal.toFixed(2)} m\/s`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Ajustar posici\u00f3n del objeto final seg\u00fan la velocidad\r\n    const posicionFinal = 150 + (velocidadFinal * 10);\r\n    document.getElementById('objetoFinal').setAttribute('cx', posicionFinal);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Ajustar \u00e1rea del impulso en el gr\u00e1fico\r\n    const anchoImpulso = tiempo * 2000;\r\n    const altoImpulso = (fuerza \/ 10);\r\n    document.getElementById('areaImpulso').setAttribute('width', anchoImpulso);\r\n    document.getElementById('areaImpulso').setAttribute('height', altoImpulso);\r\n    document.getElementById('areaImpulso').setAttribute('y', 300 - altoImpulso);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Generar valores aleatorios\r\nfunction valoresAleatorios() {\r\n    const masa = (Math.random() * 9.5 + 0.5).toFixed(1);\r\n    const fuerza = Math.floor(Math.random() * 450) + 50;\r\n    const tiempo = (Math.random() * 0.19 + 0.01).toFixed(2);\r\n    const velocidadInicial = (Math.random() * 10).toFixed(1);\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('masaInput').value = masa;\r\n    document.getElementById('fuerzaInput').value = fuerza;\r\n    document.getElementById('tiempoInput').value = tiempo;\r\n    document.getElementById('velocidadInicialInput').value = velocidadInicial;\r\n\r\n    calcularImpulso(); \/\/ Actualizar simulador\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n        const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n\r\n        if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n    let feedback = \"\";\r\n    if (correctas === total) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas el impulso y la cantidad de movimiento.\";\r\n    } else if (correctas >= total \/ 2) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero repasa las f\u00f3rmulas y unidades.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas estudiar m\u00e1s. Usa el simulador para practicar.\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ ERRORES COMUNES\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction toggleError(header) {\r\n    const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n\r\n    if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n    } else {\r\n        content.style.display = 'block';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2)) \/ 2;\r\n\r\n    alert(\r\n        `\ud83d\udcbe Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Comprensi\u00f3n de \\( p = m v \\): ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `Aplicaci\u00f3n de \\( J = \\Delta p \\): ${slider2}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`\r\n    );\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: Impulso y Cantidad de Movimiento - Cargada\");\r\n\r\n    \/\/ A\u00f1adir marcador de flecha al SVG\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById('svgImpulso');\r\n    const defs = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'defs');\r\n    const marker = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'marker');\r\n    marker.setAttribute('id', 'arrowhead');\r\n    marker.setAttribute('markerWidth', '10');\r\n    marker.setAttribute('markerHeight', '7');\r\n    marker.setAttribute('refX', '9');\r\n    marker.setAttribute('refY', '3.5');\r\n    marker.setAttribute('orient', 'auto');\r\n    const arrowPath = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'path');\r\n    arrowPath.setAttribute('d', 'M0,0 L10,3.5 L0,7 Z');\r\n    arrowPath.setAttribute('fill', '#FF5252');\r\n    marker.appendChild(arrowPath);\r\n    defs.appendChild(marker);\r\n    svg.appendChild(defs);\r\n\r\n    calcularImpulso(); \/\/ Inicializar simulador\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Event listeners para sliders\r\n    document.getElementById('masaInput').addEventListener('input', calcularImpulso);\r\n    document.getElementById('fuerzaInput').addEventListener('input', calcularImpulso);\r\n    document.getElementById('tiempoInput').addEventListener('input', calcularImpulso);\r\n    document.getElementById('velocidadInicialInput').addEventListener('input', calcularImpulso);\r\n});\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Cantidad de movimiento p =","respuesta":"m v"},{"enunciado":"Impulso J =","respuesta":"F \u0394t = \u0394p"},{"enunciado":"F = m a =","respuesta":"\u0394p \/ \u0394t"},{"enunciado":"Unidad p","respuesta":"kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"enunciado":"F = 50 N, \u0394t = 0.2 s \u2192 J","respuesta":"10 N\u00b7s"},{"enunciado":"m = 2 kg, \u0394v = 5 m\/s \u2192 \u0394p","respuesta":"10 kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"enunciado":"J = \u0394p \u2192","respuesta":"Cambio en movimiento"},{"enunciado":"F promedio =","respuesta":"J \/ \u0394t"},{"enunciado":"\u00c1rea bajo F vs t","respuesta":"Impulso"},{"enunciado":"p es","respuesta":"Vector"},{"enunciado":"1 N\u00b7s =","respuesta":"1 kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"enunciado":"SI: impulso en","respuesta":"N\u00b7s"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"p = m v es","opciones":["Vector","Escalar","Energ\u00eda","Fuerza"],"correcta":"Vector"},{"pregunta":"J = F \u0394t =","opciones":["\u0394p","p","m v","F"],"correcta":"\u0394p"},{"pregunta":"F = m a implica","opciones":["F = \u0394p\/\u0394t","F = p","F = m v","F = 0"],"correcta":"F = \u0394p\/\u0394t"},{"pregunta":"Unidad p","opciones":["kg\u00b7m\/s","N","J","m\/s\u00b2"],"correcta":"kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"pregunta":"Unidad J","opciones":["N\u00b7s","J","kg","m\/s"],"correcta":"N\u00b7s"},{"pregunta":"1 N\u00b7s =","opciones":["1 kg\u00b7m\/s","1 J","1 N","1 m\/s"],"correcta":"1 kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"pregunta":"Impulso cambia","opciones":["Cantidad de movimiento","Masa","Aceleraci\u00f3n","Energ\u00eda"],"correcta":"Cantidad de movimiento"},{"pregunta":"F constante \u2192 J =","opciones":["F \u0394t","F\/t","\u0394F t","F\u00b2"],"correcta":"F \u0394t"},{"pregunta":"\u00c1rea bajo F vs t","opciones":["Impulso","Trabajo","Potencia","Energ\u00eda"],"correcta":"Impulso"},{"pregunta":"F = 100 N, \u0394t = 0.1 s \u2192 J","opciones":["10 N\u00b7s","1000 N\u00b7s","1 N\u00b7s","0"],"correcta":"10 N\u00b7s"},{"pregunta":"m = 5 kg, v_i = 0, v_f = 4 m\/s \u2192 \u0394p","opciones":["20 kg\u00b7m\/s","5 kg\u00b7m\/s","4 kg\u00b7m\/s","0"],"correcta":"20 kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"pregunta":"J = 15 N\u00b7s, m = 3 kg \u2192 \u0394v","opciones":["5 m\/s","15 m\/s","3 m\/s","45 m\/s"],"correcta":"5 m\/s"},{"pregunta":"F promedio =","opciones":["J \/ \u0394t","\u0394p \/ m","m a","p \/ t"],"correcta":"J \/ \u0394t"},{"pregunta":"p conservada si","opciones":["F_ext = 0","F_ext \u2260 0","m = 0","v = 0"],"correcta":"F_ext = 0"},{"pregunta":"F dobla, \u0394t igual \u2192 J","opciones":["Dobla","Cuadruplica","Mitad","Igual"],"correcta":"Dobla"},{"pregunta":"\u0394t dobla, F igual \u2192 J","opciones":["Dobla","Cuadruplica","Mitad","Igual"],"correcta":"Dobla"},{"pregunta":"Airbag funciona porque","opciones":["Aumenta \u0394t \u2192 \u2193F","Aumenta F","Disminuye m","Aumenta v"],"correcta":"Aumenta \u0394t \u2192 \u2193F"},{"pregunta":"F = 0 \u2192 J =","opciones":["0","m\u00e1ximo","infinito","p"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"p = 10 kg\u00b7m\/s, m = 2 kg \u2192 v","opciones":["5 m\/s","10 m\/s","2 m\/s","20 m\/s"],"correcta":"5 m\/s"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: p en","opciones":["kg\u00b7m\/s","N\u00b7s\u00b2","J\u00b7s","W"],"correcta":"kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"pregunta":"F variable \u2192 J =","opciones":["\u00c1rea bajo F-t","F_prom \u00b7 t","F_max \u00b7 t","0"],"correcta":"\u00c1rea bajo F-t"},{"pregunta":"\u0394p = 0 \u2192","opciones":["J = 0","F = 0","m = 0","v = 0"],"correcta":"J = 0"},{"pregunta":"F = 500 N, t = 0.02 s \u2192 \u0394p","opciones":["10 kg\u00b7m\/s","500 kg\u00b7m\/s","0.02 kg\u00b7m\/s","10000 kg\u00b7m\/s"],"correcta":"10 kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"pregunta":"Golpe martillo: J grande si","opciones":["F grande o \u0394t grande","F peque\u00f1a","\u0394t cero","m cero"],"correcta":"F grande o \u0394t grande"},{"pregunta":"p antes = p despu\u00e9s si","opciones":["Sistema aislado","F_ext \u2260 0","Colisi\u00f3n inel\u00e1stica","Siempre"],"correcta":"Sistema aislado"},{"pregunta":"F = \u0394p\/\u0394t \u2192 a =","opciones":["\u0394v\/\u0394t","v\/t","p\/m","J\/m"],"correcta":"\u0394v\/\u0394t"},{"pregunta":"Unidad a","opciones":["m\/s\u00b2","m\/s","kg\u00b7m\/s","N"],"correcta":"m\/s\u00b2"},{"pregunta":"J = m \u0394v \u2192 \u0394v =","opciones":["J\/m","J m","m\/J","0"],"correcta":"J\/m"},{"pregunta":"F = 0 durante \u0394t \u2192","opciones":["\u0394p = 0","\u0394p = p","\u0394p = m","\u0394p = v"],"correcta":"\u0394p = 0"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: 1 kg\u00b7m\/s =","opciones":["1 N\u00b7s","1 J","1 W","1 Pa"],"correcta":"1 N\u00b7s"}]},{"materia":"F\u00edsica I","slug":"conservacion-cantidad-movimiento","titulo":"Ley de Conservaci\u00f3n de la Cantidad de Movimiento: p_total inicial = p_total final","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-fisica-conservacion\" data-tema=\"conservacion-movimiento\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83d\ude80<\/span>\r\n            CONSERVACI\u00d3N DE LA <span class=\"formula-highlight\">CANTIDAD DE MOVIMIENTO<\/span>\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            En sistemas aislados, la cantidad de movimiento total se conserva: \\( \\sum \\vec{p}_i = \\sum \\vec{p}_f \\)\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Explicar la ley de conservaci\u00f3n de \\( p \\)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Identificar sistemas aislados y condiciones para la conservaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar la conservaci\u00f3n en colisiones<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Resolver problemas de colisiones el\u00e1sticas e inel\u00e1sticas en 1D y 2D<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar explosiones y propulsi\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Usar la conservaci\u00f3n de \\( p \\) en sistemas con masa variable (ej: cohetes)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Simular escenarios de conservaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Usar el simulador interactivo para visualizar colisiones y explosiones<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\ude80 Propulsi\u00f3n de Cohetes<\/h3>\r\n                <p>La expulsi\u00f3n de gases a alta velocidad genera un cambio en la cantidad de movimiento del cohete (3\u00aa Ley de Newton).<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Empuje: 35 MN (Saturno V)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfa2 Monta\u00f1as Rusas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>La conservaci\u00f3n de \\( p \\) permite calcular velocidades despu\u00e9s de colisiones entre vagones.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Velocidad m\u00e1xima: 120 km\/h<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udca5 Airbags en Autom\u00f3viles<\/h3>\r\n                <p>La conservaci\u00f3n de \\( p \\) explica c\u00f3mo los airbags reducen la fuerza en colisiones al aumentar el tiempo de impacto.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Tiempo de inflado: 30-50 ms<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- LEY DE CONSERVACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Ley de Conservaci\u00f3n de la Cantidad de Movimiento<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>CONSERVACI\u00d3N DE \\( p \\)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>En un <strong>sistema aislado<\/strong> (sin fuerzas externas netas), la cantidad de movimiento total se conserva:<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[\r\n                            \\sum \\vec{p}_i = \\sum \\vec{p}_f\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-detalle\">\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Vectorial:<\/strong> Se conserva en magnitud y direcci\u00f3n.<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>V\u00e1lida para:<\/strong> Colisiones el\u00e1sticas, inel\u00e1sticas y explosiones.<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Condici\u00f3n:<\/strong> \\( \\sum \\vec{F}_{\\text{ext}} = 0 \\).<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- CONDICIONES PARA LA CONSERVACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Condiciones para la Conservaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"condiciones-card\">\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li><strong>Fuerza externa neta = 0:<\/strong> \\( \\sum \\vec{F}_{\\text{ext}} = 0 \\).<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>Sistemas de m\u00faltiples cuerpos:<\/strong> Aplica a sistemas con 2 o m\u00e1s objetos.<\/li>\r\n                    <li><strong>Conservaci\u00f3n por componentes:<\/strong> En 2D o 3D, se conserva en \\( x \\), \\( y \\) y \\( z \\).<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-condiciones\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Dos patinadores que se empujan en hielo (fricci\u00f3n despreciable).<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- APLICACIONES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Aplicaciones de la Conservaci\u00f3n de \\( p \\)<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>Situaci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Ecuaci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Descripci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr data-aplicacion=\"colision-1d\">\r\n                            <td><strong>Colisi\u00f3n 1D<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>\\( m_1 v_1 + m_2 v_2 = m_1 v_1' + m_2 v_2' \\)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Conservaci\u00f3n de \\( p \\) en una dimensi\u00f3n.<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-aplicacion=\"explosion\">\r\n                            <td><strong>Explosi\u00f3n<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>\\( 0 = m_1 v_1' + m_2 v_2' \\)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Sistema inicialmente en reposo.<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-aplicacion=\"cohete\">\r\n                            <td><strong>Cohete<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>\\( M v = -\\Delta m \\cdot v_e \\)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Propulsi\u00f3n por expulsi\u00f3n de masa.<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoAplicaciones\">\r\n                    Selecciona una fila para ver detalles\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- EJEMPLO PR\u00c1CTICO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Ejemplo Pr\u00e1ctico: Colisi\u00f3n Inel\u00e1stica<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"ejemplo-card\">\r\n                <p><strong>Problema:<\/strong> Un objeto de \\( m_1 = 2\\, \\text{kg} \\) con \\( v_1 = 4\\, \\text{m\/s} \\) choca con otro de \\( m_2 = 3\\, \\text{kg} \\) en reposo. Despu\u00e9s de la colisi\u00f3n, ambos se mueven juntos. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                <ol>\r\n                    <li>La cantidad de movimiento inicial y final.<\/li>\r\n                    <li>La velocidad final del sistema.<\/li>\r\n                <\/ol>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-solucion\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        1. Cantidad de movimiento inicial:\r\n                        \\[\r\n                            p_i = m_1 v_1 + m_2 v_2 = 2 \\cdot 4 + 3 \\cdot 0 = 8\\, \\text{kg\u00b7m\/s}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        2. Velocidad final (colisi\u00f3n perfectamente inel\u00e1stica):\r\n                        \\[\r\n                            p_f = (m_1 + m_2) v' \\Rightarrow 8 = 5 v' \\Rightarrow v' = 1.6\\, \\text{m\/s}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarEjemplo()\">VERIFICAR C\u00c1LCULO<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-feedback\" id=\"feedbackEjemplo\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <p>\u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> La cantidad de movimiento se conserva: \\( p_i = p_f = 8\\, \\text{kg\u00b7m\/s} \\).<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: CONSERVACI\u00d3N DE \\( p \\)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"conservacion-movimiento\">\r\n            <!-- CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"masa1Input\">Masa 1 (m\u2081) en kg:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"masa1Input\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"2\" step=\"0.5\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <span id=\"masa1Value\">2 kg<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"velocidad1Input\">Velocidad 1 (v\u2081) en m\/s:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"velocidad1Input\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"4\" step=\"0.5\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <span id=\"velocidad1Value\">4 m\/s<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"masa2Input\">Masa 2 (m\u2082) en kg:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"masa2Input\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"3\" step=\"0.5\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <span id=\"masa2Value\">3 kg<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"velocidad2Input\">Velocidad 2 (v\u2082) en m\/s:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"velocidad2Input\" min=\"-5\" max=\"5\" value=\"0\" step=\"0.5\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <span id=\"velocidad2Value\">0 m\/s<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"tipoColision\">Tipo de colisi\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"tipoColision\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"elastica\">El\u00e1stica<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"inelastica\">Perfectamente inel\u00e1stica<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-ejecutar\" onclick=\"simularColision()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6<\/span> SIMULAR COLISI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"valoresAleatorios()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> VALORES ALEATORIOS\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" id=\"svgColision\">\r\n                    <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\" id=\"fondoSimulador\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Objeto 1 (antes) -->\r\n                    <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"200\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#42A5F5\" id=\"objeto1Antes\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"150\" y=\"240\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"masa1Antes\">m\u2081=2 kg<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"150\" y=\"160\" fill=\"#2196F3\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"velocidad1Antes\">v\u2081=4 m\/s<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Objeto 2 (antes) -->\r\n                    <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"200\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#EF5350\" id=\"objeto2Antes\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"450\" y=\"240\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"masa2Antes\">m\u2082=3 kg<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"450\" y=\"160\" fill=\"#EF5350\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"velocidad2Antes\">v\u2082=0 m\/s<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Objetos despu\u00e9s de la colisi\u00f3n -->\r\n                    <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"200\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#9CCC65\" id=\"objeto1Despues\" opacity=\"0\"\/>\r\n                    <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"200\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#9CCC65\" id=\"objeto2Despues\" opacity=\"0\"\/>\r\n                    <rect x=\"275\" cy=\"200\" width=\"100\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#9CCC65\" rx=\"10\" id=\"objetoUnido\" opacity=\"0\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Flecha de velocidad final -->\r\n                    <line x1=\"325\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowhead)\" id=\"flechaFinal\" opacity=\"0\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- F\u00f3rmula -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"50\" y=\"350\" width=\"500\" height=\"40\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.7)\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#39FF14\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"formulaColision\">m\u2081v\u2081 + m\u2082v\u2082 = m\u2081v\u2081\\' + m\u2082v\u2082\\'<\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>DATOS DE SIMULACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Masa 1 (m\u2081):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataMasa1\">2 kg<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Velocidad 1 (v\u2081):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataVelocidad1\">4 m\/s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Masa 2 (m\u2082):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataMasa2\">3 kg<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Velocidad 2 (v\u2082):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataVelocidad2\">0 m\/s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Tipo de colisi\u00f3n:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTipoColision\">El\u00e1stica<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">CANTIDAD DE MOVIMIENTO INICIAL (p\u1d62):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPi\">8 kg\u00b7m\/s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">CANTIDAD DE MOVIMIENTO FINAL (p_f):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPf\">8 kg\u00b7m\/s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">VELOCIDAD FINAL (v\\'):<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataVelocidadFinal\">1.6 m\/s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfEn qu\u00e9 condici\u00f3n se conserva la cantidad de movimiento?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Cuando hay fuerzas de fricci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Cuando la fuerza externa neta es cero\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Solo en colisiones el\u00e1sticas\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Solo en sistemas con dos objetos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> \\( \\sum \\vec{F}_{\\text{ext}} = 0 \\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa las condiciones para la conservaci\u00f3n de \\( p \\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La cantidad de movimiento se conserva en sistemas aislados, donde la fuerza externa neta es cero.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Un objeto de 4 kg a 3 m\/s choca con otro de 2 kg en reposo. Si despu\u00e9s de la colisi\u00f3n ambos se mueven juntos, \u00bfcu\u00e1l es su velocidad final?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        1 m\/s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        1.5 m\/s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        2 m\/s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        3 m\/s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> \\( v' = \\frac{4 \\cdot 3}{6} = 2\\, \\text{m\/s} \\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Usa la conservaci\u00f3n de \\( p \\): \\( m_1 v_1 = (m_1 + m_2) v' \\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>C\u00e1lculo:<\/strong> \\( 4 \\cdot 3 = (4 + 2) v' \\Rightarrow v' = 2\\, \\text{m\/s} \\).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                    Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/2\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                    Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES Y SOLUCIONES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR CONSERVACI\u00d3N DE ENERG\u00cdA CON CONSERVACI\u00d3N DE \\( p \\)<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"En una colisi\u00f3n, la energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica siempre se conserva\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Cantidad de movimiento:<\/strong> Siempre se conserva en sistemas aislados.<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica:<\/strong> Solo se conserva en colisiones <strong>el\u00e1sticas<\/strong>.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                        <table>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <th>Tipo de colisi\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n                                <th>Conservaci\u00f3n de \\( p \\)<\/th>\r\n                                <th>Conservaci\u00f3n de \\( E_k \\)<\/th>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td>El\u00e1stica<\/td>\r\n                                <td>S\u00ed<\/td>\r\n                                <td>S\u00ed<\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td>Inel\u00e1stica<\/td>\r\n                                <td>S\u00ed<\/td>\r\n                                <td>No<\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                        <\/table>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c OLVIDAR QUE LA CANTIDAD DE MOVIMIENTO ES VECTORIAL<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"La cantidad de movimiento total es la suma de las magnitudes de \\( p \\) de cada objeto\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La cantidad de movimiento es un <strong>vector<\/strong>. Debes considerar <strong>direcci\u00f3n y sentido<\/strong>.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Practica:<\/strong> Dos objetos se mueven en direcciones opuestas. \u00bfC\u00f3mo calculas \\( p_{\\text{total}} \\)?<\/p>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                            <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> \\( p_{\\text{total}} = m_1 v_1 + m_2 (-v_2) \\).\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Colisi\u00f3n El\u00e1stica en 1D<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un objeto de \\( m_1 = 1\\, \\text{kg} \\) con \\( v_1 = 5\\, \\text{m\/s} \\) choca el\u00e1sticamente con otro de \\( m_2 = 2\\, \\text{kg} \\) en reposo. Calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Las velocidades finales de ambos objetos.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica inicial y final del sistema.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. Conservaci\u00f3n de \\( p \\): \\( 1 \\cdot 5 + 2 \\cdot 0 = 1 \\cdot v_1' + 2 \\cdot v_2' \\).<br>\r\n                    Conservaci\u00f3n de \\( E_k \\): \\( \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 1 \\cdot 5^2 = \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 1 \\cdot v_1'^2 + \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 2 \\cdot v_2'^2 \\).<br>\r\n                    Resolviendo: \\( v_1' = -1.67\\, \\text{m\/s} \\), \\( v_2' = 3.33\\, \\text{m\/s} \\).<br>\r\n                    2. \\( E_{k,i} = 12.5\\, \\text{J} \\), \\( E_{k,f} = 12.5\\, \\text{J} \\).\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Explosi\u00f3n en 2D<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un proyectil de \\( 5\\, \\text{kg} \\) explota en dos fragmentos: uno de \\( 3\\, \\text{kg} \\) sale con \\( v = 20\\, \\text{m\/s} \\) a \\( 30\u00b0 \\) sobre la horizontal, y el otro de \\( 2\\, \\text{kg} \\) sale con velocidad desconocida. Si el proyectil estaba inicialmente en reposo, calcula:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>La velocidad del segundo fragmento (magnitud y direcci\u00f3n).<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica total despu\u00e9s de la explosi\u00f3n.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu soluci\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. Conservaci\u00f3n de \\( p \\) en \\( x \\) e \\( y \\):<br>\r\n                    \\( 0 = 3 \\cdot 20 \\cos 30\u00b0 + 2 v_{2x} \\Rightarrow v_{2x} = -25.98\\, \\text{m\/s} \\).<br>\r\n                    \\( 0 = 3 \\cdot 20 \\sin 30\u00b0 + 2 v_{2y} \\Rightarrow v_{2y} = -15\\, \\text{m\/s} \\).<br>\r\n                    Magnitud: \\( v_2 = \\sqrt{(-25.98)^2 + (-15)^2} \\approx 30\\, \\text{m\/s} \\).<br>\r\n                    Direcci\u00f3n: \\( \\theta = \\tan^{-1}(15\/25.98) \\approx 221\u00b0 \\).<br>\r\n                    2. \\( E_k = \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 3 \\cdot 20^2 + \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 2 \\cdot 30^2 = 1500\\, \\text{J} \\).\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>Aplicaci\u00f3n de conservaci\u00f3n de \\( p \\)<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Ecuaciones correctas en 1D\/2D<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Errores menores en c\u00e1lculos<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Falta aplicaci\u00f3n del principio<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td>C\u00e1lculo de velocidades finales<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Resultados precisos con justificaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Falta claridad en pasos<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Soluci\u00f3n incorrecta<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc8 AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n de la conservaci\u00f3n de \\( p \\):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Aplicaci\u00f3n en colisiones:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es crucial la conservaci\u00f3n de la cantidad de movimiento en el dise\u00f1o de veh\u00edculos espaciales?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: expulsi\u00f3n de gases, cambios de \u00f3rbita...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Describe un ejemplo cotidiano donde observes la conservaci\u00f3n de \\( p \\).<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: patinar sobre hielo, saltar desde un bote...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcda PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Repasar \\( \\sum \\vec{p}_i = \\sum \\vec{p}_f \\)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Diferenciar colisiones el\u00e1sticas e inel\u00e1sticas<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udee0 PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Resolver 5 problemas de conservaci\u00f3n de \\( p \\)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Usar el simulador para visualizar colisiones<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udf93 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Investigar aplicaciones en ingenier\u00eda aeroespacial<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Relacionar con conservaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/legacy\/collision-lab\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udfaf Simulador PhET: Laboratorio de Colisiones\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/science\/physics\/linear-momentum\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcda Khan Academy: Conservaci\u00f3n de la Cantidad de Movimiento\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DE CONSERVACI\u00d3N DE LA CANTIDAD DE MOVIMIENTO\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction simularColision() {\r\n    \/\/ Obtener valores de los sliders\r\n    const masa1 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('masa1Input').value);\r\n    const velocidad1 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('velocidad1Input').value);\r\n    const masa2 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('masa2Input').value);\r\n    const velocidad2 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('velocidad2Input').value);\r\n    const tipoColision = document.getElementById('tipoColision').value;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Validar valores\r\n    if (isNaN(masa1) || isNaN(velocidad1) || isNaN(masa2) || isNaN(velocidad2)) {\r\n        alert(\"Por favor, ingresa valores v\u00e1lidos.\");\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar valores en la interfaz\r\n    document.getElementById('masa1Value').textContent = `${masa1} kg`;\r\n    document.getElementById('velocidad1Value').textContent = `${velocidad1} m\/s`;\r\n    document.getElementById('masa2Value').textContent = `${masa2} kg`;\r\n    document.getElementById('velocidad2Value').textContent = `${velocidad2} m\/s`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataTipoColision').textContent = tipoColision === 'elastica' ? 'El\u00e1stica' : 'Perfectamente inel\u00e1stica';\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Calcular cantidad de movimiento inicial\r\n    const pi = masa1 * velocidad1 + masa2 * velocidad2;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar datos en la interfaz\r\n    document.getElementById('dataMasa1').textContent = `${masa1} kg`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataVelocidad1').textContent = `${velocidad1} m\/s`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataMasa2').textContent = `${masa2} kg`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataVelocidad2').textContent = `${velocidad2} m\/s`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataPi').textContent = `${pi.toFixed(2)} kg\u00b7m\/s`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Simular colisi\u00f3n seg\u00fan el tipo\r\n    if (tipoColision === 'inelastica') {\r\n        \/\/ Colisi\u00f3n perfectamente inel\u00e1stica\r\n        const velocidadFinal = pi \/ (masa1 + masa2);\r\n        document.getElementById('dataPf').textContent = `${pi.toFixed(2)} kg\u00b7m\/s`;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataVelocidadFinal').textContent = `${velocidadFinal.toFixed(2)} m\/s`;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar SVG: objetos unidos\r\n        document.getElementById('objeto1Despues').style.opacity = '0';\r\n        document.getElementById('objeto2Despues').style.opacity = '0';\r\n        document.getElementById('objetoUnido').style.opacity = '1';\r\n        document.getElementById('flechaFinal').style.opacity = '1';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Posici\u00f3n del objeto unido\r\n        const posicionUnido = 300 + (velocidadFinal * 5);\r\n        document.getElementById('objetoUnido').setAttribute('x', posicionUnido - 40);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ F\u00f3rmula en SVG\r\n        document.getElementById('formulaColision').textContent = `m\u2081v\u2081 + m\u2082v\u2082 = (m\u2081 + m\u2082)v'`;\r\n    } else {\r\n        \/\/ Colisi\u00f3n el\u00e1stica (simplificada: solo velocidad final del objeto 1)\r\n        const velocidadFinal1 = ((masa1 - masa2) \/ (masa1 + masa2)) * velocidad1 + (2 * masa2 \/ (masa1 + masa2)) * velocidad2;\r\n        const velocidadFinal2 = (2 * masa1 \/ (masa1 + masa2)) * velocidad1 + ((masa2 - masa1) \/ (masa1 + masa2)) * velocidad2;\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById('dataPf').textContent = `${pi.toFixed(2)} kg\u00b7m\/s`;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataVelocidadFinal').textContent = `${velocidadFinal1.toFixed(2)} m\/s (objeto 1)`;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar SVG: objetos separados despu\u00e9s de la colisi\u00f3n\r\n        document.getElementById('objeto1Despues').style.opacity = '1';\r\n        document.getElementById('objeto2Despues').style.opacity = '1';\r\n        document.getElementById('objetoUnido').style.opacity = '0';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Posiciones finales\r\n        const posicion1 = 300 + (velocidadFinal1 * 5);\r\n        const posicion2 = 300 + (velocidadFinal2 * 5);\r\n        document.getElementById('objeto1Despues').setAttribute('cx', posicion1);\r\n        document.getElementById('objeto2Despues').setAttribute('cx', posicion2);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ F\u00f3rmula en SVG\r\n        document.getElementById('formulaColision').textContent = `m\u2081v\u2081 + m\u2082v\u2082 = m\u2081v\u2081' + m\u2082v\u2082'`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de colisi\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('objeto1Antes').setAttribute('cx', '150');\r\n    document.getElementById('objeto2Antes').setAttribute('cx', '450');\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Animar movimiento antes de la colisi\u00f3n\r\n    const anim1 = document.getElementById('objeto1Antes').animate([\r\n        { cx: '150' },\r\n        { cx: '300' }\r\n    ], { duration: 1500, fill: 'forwards' });\r\n\r\n    const anim2 = document.getElementById('objeto2Antes').animate([\r\n        { cx: '450' },\r\n        { cx: '300' }\r\n    ], { duration: 1500, fill: 'forwards' });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Mostrar resultados despu\u00e9s de la animaci\u00f3n\r\n    setTimeout(() => {\r\n        document.getElementById('dataPf').style.animation = 'pulse 1s';\r\n    }, 1500);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Generar valores aleatorios\r\nfunction valoresAleatorios() {\r\n    const masa1 = (Math.random() * 9 + 1).toFixed(1);\r\n    const velocidad1 = (Math.random() * 10).toFixed(1);\r\n    const masa2 = (Math.random() * 9 + 1).toFixed(1);\r\n    const velocidad2 = (Math.random() * 5 - 2.5).toFixed(1); \/\/ Velocidad entre -2.5 y 2.5 m\/s\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('masa1Input').value = masa1;\r\n    document.getElementById('velocidad1Input').value = velocidad1;\r\n    document.getElementById('masa2Input').value = masa2;\r\n    document.getElementById('velocidad2Input').value = velocidad2;\r\n\r\n    simularColision(); \/\/ Actualizar simulador\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n        const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n\r\n        if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n    let feedback = \"\";\r\n    if (correctas === total) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas la conservaci\u00f3n de la cantidad de movimiento.\";\r\n    } else if (correctas >= total \/ 2) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero repasa las condiciones y aplicaciones.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas estudiar m\u00e1s. Usa el simulador para practicar.\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ ERRORES COMUNES\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction toggleError(header) {\r\n    const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n\r\n    if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n    } else {\r\n        content.style.display = 'block';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2)) \/ 2;\r\n\r\n    alert(\r\n        `\ud83d\udcbe Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Comprensi\u00f3n de la conservaci\u00f3n de \\( p \\): ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n        `Aplicaci\u00f3n en colisiones: ${slider2}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n        `Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`\r\n    );\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: Conservaci\u00f3n de la Cantidad de Movimiento - Cargada\");\r\n\r\n    \/\/ A\u00f1adir marcador de flecha al SVG\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById('svgColision');\r\n    const defs = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'defs');\r\n    const marker = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'marker');\r\n    marker.setAttribute('id', 'arrowhead');\r\n    marker.setAttribute('markerWidth', '10');\r\n    marker.setAttribute('markerHeight', '7');\r\n    marker.setAttribute('refX', '9');\r\n    marker.setAttribute('refY', '3.5');\r\n    marker.setAttribute('orient', 'auto');\r\n    const arrowPath = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'path');\r\n    arrowPath.setAttribute('d', 'M0,0 L10,3.5 L0,7 Z');\r\n    arrowPath.setAttribute('fill', '#39FF14');\r\n    marker.appendChild(arrowPath);\r\n    defs.appendChild(marker);\r\n    svg.appendChild(defs);\r\n\r\n    simularColision(); \/\/ Inicializar simulador\r\n});\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Conservaci\u00f3n p v\u00e1lida si","respuesta":"F_ext = 0"},{"enunciado":"p total =","respuesta":"m\u2081v\u2081 + m\u2082v\u2082 + ..."},{"enunciado":"En explosi\u00f3n (reposo)","respuesta":"p_total = 0"},{"enunciado":"Vectorial \u2192","respuesta":"Componentes x, y"},{"enunciado":"m\u2081=1kg, v\u2081=5m\/s; m\u2082=2kg, v\u2082=0 \u2192 p_i","respuesta":"5 kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"enunciado":"Inel\u00e1stica perfecta: v =","respuesta":"(m\u2081v\u2081 + m\u2082v\u2082)\/(m\u2081+m\u2082)"},{"enunciado":"Cohete: \u0394p_cohete =","respuesta":"-\u0394p_gases"},{"enunciado":"Colisi\u00f3n 2D: p_x y p_y","respuesta":"Conservadas por separado"},{"enunciado":"Sistema aislado significa","respuesta":"No F_ext neta"},{"enunciado":"p antes = p despu\u00e9s","respuesta":"Conservaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Unidad p","respuesta":"kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"enunciado":"SI: conservaci\u00f3n en","respuesta":"Cualquier direcci\u00f3n"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Conservaci\u00f3n p requiere","opciones":["F_ext = 0","F_ext \u2260 0","m = 0","v = 0"],"correcta":"F_ext = 0"},{"pregunta":"p total antes =","opciones":["p total despu\u00e9s","p parcial","0","m\u00e1ximo"],"correcta":"p total despu\u00e9s"},{"pregunta":"p es","opciones":["Vector","Escalar","Energ\u00eda","Fuerza"],"correcta":"Vector"},{"pregunta":"V\u00e1lida en","opciones":["Todas colisiones","Solo el\u00e1sticas","Solo inel\u00e1sticas","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Todas colisiones"},{"pregunta":"Explosi\u00f3n: p_i =","opciones":["0 (si en reposo)","m v","F t","EK"],"correcta":"0 (si en reposo)"},{"pregunta":"m\u2081v\u2081 + m\u2082v\u2082 =","opciones":["m\u2081v\u2081' + m\u2082v\u2082'","m\u2081 + m\u2082","v\u2081 + v\u2082","0"],"correcta":"m\u2081v\u2081' + m\u2082v\u2082'"},{"pregunta":"Sistema aislado =","opciones":["\u2211 F_ext = 0","\u2211 F_int = 0","m = cte","v = cte"],"correcta":"\u2211 F_ext = 0"},{"pregunta":"Cohete avanza porque","opciones":["Gases expulsados atr\u00e1s","Combustible","Gravedad","Aire"],"correcta":"Gases expulsados atr\u00e1s"},{"pregunta":"p conservada en","opciones":["x e y (2D)","solo x","solo y","ninguna"],"correcta":"x e y (2D)"},{"pregunta":"Unidad p","opciones":["kg\u00b7m\/s","N","J","m\/s\u00b2"],"correcta":"kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"pregunta":"m\u2081=2kg, v\u2081=3m\/s; m\u2082=1kg, v\u2082=0 \u2192 p_i","opciones":["6 kg\u00b7m\/s","2 kg\u00b7m\/s","3 kg\u00b7m\/s","0"],"correcta":"6 kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"pregunta":"Inel\u00e1stica perfecta: v =","opciones":["(m\u2081v\u2081 + m\u2082v\u2082)\/(m\u2081+m\u2082)","v\u2081 + v\u2082","0","v\u2081"],"correcta":"(m\u2081v\u2081 + m\u2082v\u2082)\/(m\u2081+m\u2082)"},{"pregunta":"Explosi\u00f3n: fragmentos opuestos","opciones":["p\u2081 = -p\u2082","p\u2081 = p\u2082","p\u2081 = 0","p_total \u2260 0"],"correcta":"p\u2081 = -p\u2082"},{"pregunta":"Colisi\u00f3n frontal: p_total","opciones":["Conservada","Perdida","Aumentada","Cero"],"correcta":"Conservada"},{"pregunta":"Fricci\u00f3n presente \u2192 p sistema","opciones":["No conservada (F_ext)","Conservada","Aumenta","Cero"],"correcta":"No conservada (F_ext)"},{"pregunta":"Choque el\u00e1stico: p","opciones":["Conservada","No","A veces","Nunca"],"correcta":"Conservada"},{"pregunta":"v\u2081 = -v\u2082 (masas iguales)","opciones":["Rebotan opuestos","Se pegan","Se detienen","Aceleran"],"correcta":"Rebotan opuestos"},{"pregunta":"p = m v \u2192 v =","opciones":["p\/m","m\/p","p m","0"],"correcta":"p\/m"},{"pregunta":"Sistema Tierra + pelota","opciones":["p_total conservada","No","Solo pelota","Solo Tierra"],"correcta":"p_total conservada"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: p en","opciones":["kg\u00b7m\/s","N\u00b7s\u00b2","J\u00b7s","W"],"correcta":"kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"pregunta":"m\u2081=4kg, v\u2081=5m\/s; m\u2082=6kg, v\u2082=-2m\/s \u2192 p_i","opciones":["8 kg\u00b7m\/s","20 kg\u00b7m\/s","30 kg\u00b7m\/s","0"],"correcta":"8 kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"pregunta":"Explosi\u00f3n 2 partes: m\u2081=1kg, v\u2081=10m\/s \u2192 m\u2082v\u2082","opciones":["-10 kg\u00b7m\/s","10 kg\u00b7m\/s","0","1 kg\u00b7m\/s"],"correcta":"-10 kg\u00b7m\/s"},{"pregunta":"Cohete: \u0394m v_e =","opciones":["-M \u0394v","M v","\u0394m v","0"],"correcta":"-M \u0394v"},{"pregunta":"Colisi\u00f3n 2D: p_y inicial = 0 \u2192 p_y final","opciones":["0","m\u2081v\u2081","m\u2082v\u2082","p_x"],"correcta":"0"},{"pregunta":"p_total = 0 \u2192 sistema","opciones":["En reposo o balanceado","En movimiento","Con fricci\u00f3n","Abierto"],"correcta":"En reposo o balanceado"},{"pregunta":"Conservaci\u00f3n p derivada de","opciones":["3\u00aa Ley Newton","1\u00aa","2\u00aa","Gravedad"],"correcta":"3\u00aa Ley Newton"},{"pregunta":"p en vac\u00edo vs aire","opciones":["Conservada igual","No en aire","Solo vac\u00edo","Nunca"],"correcta":"Conservada igual"},{"pregunta":"m\u2081v\u2081 = m\u2082v\u2082 (rebote)","opciones":["Masas iguales","Velocidades iguales","p iguales","EK igual"],"correcta":"Masas iguales"},{"pregunta":"Sistema cerrado =","opciones":["No intercambio p con exterior","Masa cte","Volumen cte","Temperatura cte"],"correcta":"No intercambio p con exterior"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: 1 kg\u00b7m\/s =","opciones":["1 N\u00b7s","1 J","1 W","1 Pa"],"correcta":"1 N\u00b7s"}]},{"materia":"F\u00edsica I","slug":"restitucion-calor-avanzado","titulo":"Din\u00e1mica y Termodin\u00e1mica: Coeficiente e y Transferencia de Calor","contenido":"<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-fisica-restitucion\" data-tema=\"restitucion-calor\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n            RESTITUCI\u00d3N <span class=\"formula-highlight\">e<\/span> & TRANSFERENCIA DE <span class=\"formula-highlight\">CALOR<\/span>\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            De la energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica al calor: \\( \\Delta E_k \\rightarrow Q \\) | Coeficiente de restituci\u00f3n: \\( e = 0 \\rightarrow 1 \\)\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Calcular el coeficiente de restituci\u00f3n \\( e \\)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Diferenciar colisiones el\u00e1sticas (\\( e = 1 \\)), inel\u00e1sticas (\\( 0 < e < 1 \\)) y perfectamente inel\u00e1sticas (\\( e = 0 \\))<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar la transferencia de calor \\( Q = m \\cdot c \\cdot \\Delta T \\)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Calcular el calor generado en colisiones y su efecto en la temperatura de diferentes materiales<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Relacionar \\( \\Delta E_k \\) con \\( Q \\)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Entender la conversi\u00f3n de energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica en calor durante colisiones inel\u00e1sticas<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Simular escenarios de colisi\u00f3n y transferencia de calor<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Usar los simuladores interactivos para visualizar la relaci\u00f3n entre \\( e \\), \\( \\Delta E_k \\) y \\( Q \\)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- GRID DE CONTENIDO 2x2 -->\r\n    <div class=\"grid-contenido\">\r\n\r\n        <!-- COLISI\u00d3N Y COEFICIENTE e -->\r\n        <div class=\"card-contenido colision\">\r\n            <div class=\"card-header\">\r\n                <h2 class=\"card-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n                    <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> COEFICIENTE DE RESTITUCI\u00d3N <span class=\"formula-highlight\">e<\/span>\r\n                <\/h2>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"formula-principal\">\r\n                \\[\r\n                    e = -\\frac{v_2' - v_1'}{u_2 - u_1}\r\n                \\]\r\n                <div class=\"formula-detalle\">\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>1.0:<\/strong> El\u00e1stico perfecto (energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica conservada)<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>0.0:<\/strong> Inel\u00e1stico total (m\u00e1xima p\u00e9rdida de \\( E_k \\))<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>0.0 - 1.0:<\/strong> Parcial (ej: billar, \\( e \\approx 0.8 \\))<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- SIMULADOR DE COLISIONES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulador-box\">\r\n                <div class=\"sim-controls\">\r\n                    <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                        <label>m\u2081 (kg):<\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"number\" value=\"2\" id=\"m1\" class=\"input-sim\">\r\n                        <label>u\u2081 (m\/s):<\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"number\" value=\"5\" id=\"u1\" class=\"input-sim\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                        <label>m\u2082 (kg):<\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"number\" value=\"3\" id=\"m2\" class=\"input-sim\">\r\n                        <label>u\u2082 (m\/s):<\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"number\" value=\"0\" id=\"u2\" class=\"input-sim\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                        <label>e:<\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" id=\"e-slider\" class=\"slider-sim\">\r\n                        <span id=\"e-val\" class=\"slider-val\">0.5<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button onclick=\"calcularColision()\" class=\"btn-sim\">CALCULAR COLISI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"sim-results\">\r\n                    <div class=\"result-item\">\r\n                        <span class=\"result-label\">v\u2081:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"result-value\" id=\"r-v1\">-1.67 m\/s<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"result-item\">\r\n                        <span class=\"result-label\">v\u2082:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"result-value\" id=\"r-v2\">2.17 m\/s<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"result-item highlight\">\r\n                        <span class=\"result-label\">\u0394E<sub>k<\/sub>:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"result-value\" id=\"r-dek\">8.33 J<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- F\u00d3RMULAS DE VELOCIDAD -->\r\n            <div class=\"formulas-detalle\">\r\n                <div class=\"formula-line\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                        v_1' = \\frac{(m_1 - e m_2) u_1 + (1 + e) m_2 u_2}{m_1 + m_2}\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"formula-line\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                        v_2' = \\frac{(1 + e) m_1 u_1 + (m_2 - e m_1) u_2}{m_1 + m_2}\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DE COLISI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"visual-colision\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 200\" id=\"svg-colision\">\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\" rx=\"10\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Objeto 1 (antes) -->\r\n                    <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"100\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#42A5F5\" id=\"obj1-antes\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"80\" y=\"140\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"m1-antes\">m\u2081=2kg<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"80\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#2196F3\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"u1-antes\">u\u2081=5m\/s<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Objeto 2 (antes) -->\r\n                    <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"100\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#EF5350\" id=\"obj2-antes\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"320\" y=\"140\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"m2-antes\">m\u2082=3kg<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"320\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#EF5350\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"u2-antes\">u\u2082=0m\/s<\/text>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Objetos despu\u00e9s -->\r\n                    <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"100\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#9CCC65\" id=\"obj1-despues\" opacity=\"0\"\/>\r\n                    <circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"100\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#9CCC65\" id=\"obj2-despues\" opacity=\"0\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Flechas de velocidad -->\r\n                    <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#2196F3\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowhead)\" id=\"flecha-u1\"\/>\r\n                    <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowhead)\" id=\"flecha-v1\" opacity=\"0\"\/>\r\n                    <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowhead)\" id=\"flecha-v2\" opacity=\"0\"\/>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- CALOR ESPEC\u00cdFICO -->\r\n        <div class=\"card-contenido calor\">\r\n            <div class=\"card-header\">\r\n                <h2 class=\"card-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n                    <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd25<\/span> CALOR ESPEC\u00cdFICO <span class=\"formula-highlight\">c<\/span>\r\n                <\/h2>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"formula-principal\">\r\n                \\[\r\n                    Q = m \\cdot c \\cdot \\Delta T\r\n                \\]\r\n                <div class=\"formula-detalle\">\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Unidad de \\( c \\):<\/strong> J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Unidad de \\( Q \\):<\/strong> Joules (J)<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Capacidad t\u00e9rmica:<\/strong> \\( C = m \\cdot c \\) (J\/\u00b0C)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- TABLA DE MATERIALES -->\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-materiales\">\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"header-mat\">Material<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"header-c\">c (J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/span>\r\n                    <span class=\"header-rel\">Relaci\u00f3n<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-row destacada\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cel-mat\">\ud83d\udca7 Agua<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cel-val\">4186<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cel-rel\">\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-rel\" style=\"width:100%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <span>1.00\u00d7<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-row\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cel-mat\">\ud83c\udf77 Alcohol<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cel-val\">2400<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cel-rel\">\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-rel\" style=\"width:57%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <span>0.57\u00d7<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-row\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cel-mat\">\ud83d\udd29 Aluminio<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cel-val\">900<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cel-rel\">\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-rel\" style=\"width:22%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <span>0.22\u00d7<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-row\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cel-mat\">\ud83d\udd0c Cobre<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cel-val\">385<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cel-rel\">\r\n                        <div class=\"barra-rel\" style=\"width:9%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <span>0.09\u00d7<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- CALCULADORA DE CALOR -->\r\n            <div class=\"calculadora-calor\">\r\n                <div class=\"calc-controls\">\r\n                    <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                        <label>Masa (kg):<\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"number\" value=\"0.5\" id=\"calc-masa\" class=\"input-calc\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                        <label>\u0394T (\u00b0C):<\/label>\r\n                        <input type=\"number\" value=\"80\" id=\"calc-dt\" class=\"input-calc\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                        <label>Material:<\/label>\r\n                        <select id=\"calc-material\" class=\"select-calc\">\r\n                            <option value=\"4186\">Agua (4186)<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"2400\">Alcohol (2400)<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"900\">Aluminio (900)<\/option>\r\n                            <option value=\"385\">Cobre (385)<\/option>\r\n                        <\/select>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button onclick=\"calcularCalor()\" class=\"btn-calc\">CALCULAR Q<\/button>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"calc-results\">\r\n                    <div class=\"result-item\">\r\n                        <span class=\"result-label\">Q (J):<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"result-value\" id=\"r-q\">16,744 J<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"result-item\">\r\n                        <span class=\"result-label\">C (J\/\u00b0C):<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"result-value\" id=\"r-c\">2,093 J\/\u00b0C<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- CONVERSI\u00d3N ENERG\u00c9TICA -->\r\n        <div class=\"card-contenido conversion\">\r\n            <div class=\"card-header\">\r\n                <h2 class=\"card-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n                    <span class=\"icon\">\u26a1<\/span> CONVERSI\u00d3N <span class=\"formula-highlight\">\u0394E_k \u2192 Q<\/span>\r\n                <\/h2>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"principio-box\">\r\n                <p>En choques <strong>inel\u00e1sticos<\/strong> (\\( e < 1 \\)):<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"principio-formula\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                        \\Delta E_k = E_{k,i} - E_{k,f} = Q_{\\text{generado}}\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <p>La energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica perdida se convierte en <strong>calor<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- DIAGRAMA ENERG\u00c9TICO -->\r\n            <div class=\"diagrama-energia\">\r\n                <div class=\"energia-inicial\">\r\n                    <div class=\"energia-titulo\">E<sub>k<\/sub> Inicial<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"energia-valor\" id=\"ek-inicial\">50 J<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"energia-barra\" id=\"barra-ek-inicial\"><\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"flecha-conversion\">\u2192<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"energia-final\">\r\n                    <div class=\"final-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"item-titulo\">E<sub>k<\/sub> Final<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"item-valor\" id=\"ek-final\">34 J<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"item-barra\" id=\"barra-ek-final\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"final-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"item-titulo\">Calor (Q)<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"item-valor\" id=\"calor-generado\">16 J<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"item-barra\" id=\"barra-calor\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- EJEMPLO PR\u00c1CTICO -->\r\n            <div class=\"ejemplo-practico\">\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-titulo\">\ud83d\udcdd Ejemplo: Choque con e=0.6<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-datos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-ejemplo\">m\u2081=1kg, u\u2081=10m\/s \u2192 m\u2082=1kg, u\u2082=0<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-ejemplo\">v\u2081=2m\/s, v\u2082=8m\/s<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-ejemplo\">E<sub>k,i<\/sub>=50J, E<sub>k,f<\/sub>=34J<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-ejemplo highlight\">\u0394E<sub>k<\/sub>=16J \u2192 Calor generado<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- APLICACI\u00d3N AL AGUA -->\r\n            <div class=\"aplicacion-agua\">\r\n                <div class=\"app-titulo\">\ud83d\udca7 Aplicaci\u00f3n al agua:<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"app-calculo\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                        Q = 16\\, \\text{J} = m \\cdot c \\cdot \\Delta T\r\n                    \\]\r\n                    \\[\r\n                        \\Delta T = \\frac{16}{0.1 \\times 4186} \\approx 0.038\u00b0\\text{C}\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"app-resultado\">100g de agua aumentan <strong>0.038\u00b0C<\/strong><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- F\u00d3RMULAS CLAVE -->\r\n        <div class=\"card-contenido formulas\">\r\n            <div class=\"card-header\">\r\n                <h2 class=\"card-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n                    <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> F\u00d3RMULAS <span class=\"formula-highlight\">CLAVE<\/span>\r\n                <\/h2>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- MOMENTO LINEAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"formula-seccion\">\r\n                <div class=\"seccion-titulo\">Conservaci\u00f3n del Momento Lineal<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"seccion-formula\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                        m_1 u_1 + m_2 u_2 = m_1 v_1 + m_2 v_2\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"seccion-nota\">Se conserva en <strong>TODOS<\/strong> los choques<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- ENERG\u00cdA CIN\u00c9TICA -->\r\n            <div class=\"formula-seccion\">\r\n                <div class=\"seccion-titulo\">Energ\u00eda Cin\u00e9tica<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"seccion-formula\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                        E_k = \\frac{1}{2} m v^2\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"seccion-formula\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                        \\Delta E_k = \\frac{1}{2}(m_1 u_1^2 + m_2 u_2^2) - \\frac{1}{2}(m_1 v_1^2 + m_2 v_2^2)\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- CAPACIDAD T\u00c9RMICA -->\r\n            <div class=\"formula-seccion\">\r\n                <div class=\"seccion-titulo\">Capacidad T\u00e9rmica<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"seccion-formula\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                        C = m \\cdot c = \\frac{Q}{\\Delta T}\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"seccion-nota\">\r\n                    <strong>c<\/strong> es intensiva (J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C) |\r\n                    <strong>C<\/strong> es extensiva (J\/\u00b0C)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- CALOR LATENTE -->\r\n            <div class=\"formula-seccion\">\r\n                <div class=\"seccion-titulo\">Calor Latente<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"seccion-formula\">\r\n                    \\[\r\n                        Q = m \\cdot L\r\n                    \\]\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"seccion-datos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                        <span>L<sub>f<\/sub> agua:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"dato-val\">334 kJ\/kg<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                        <span>L<sub>v<\/sub> agua:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"dato-val\">2260 kJ\/kg<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- DATOS FUNDAMENTALES -->\r\n            <div class=\"datos-fundamentales\">\r\n                <div class=\"datos-titulo\">\ud83d\udcca Datos Fundamentales<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"datos-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-num\">4.184<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-desc\">1 cal = X J<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-num\">4186<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-desc\">c agua (J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C)<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-num\">1.0<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-desc\">e m\u00e1ximo (el\u00e1stico)<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-num\">0.0<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-desc\">e m\u00ednimo (inel\u00e1stico)<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- CONSEJOS R\u00c1PIDOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"consejos-rapidos\">\r\n                <div class=\"consejos-titulo\">\ud83d\udca1 Consejos R\u00e1pidos<\/div>\r\n                <ul class=\"consejos-lista\">\r\n                    <li>Usa signos: derecha (+), izquierda (-)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>\\( e < 1 \\) siempre genera calor<\/li>\r\n                    <li>El momento lineal SIEMPRE se conserva<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Convierte todo a unidades SI<\/li>\r\n                    <li>En choques inel\u00e1sticos, \\( \\Delta E_k = Q \\)<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- EJERCICIOS RESUELTOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"ejercicios-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\uddee<\/span> EJERCICIOS <span class=\"formula-highlight\">RESUELTOS<\/span>\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"ejercicios-grid\">\r\n            <!-- EJERCICIO 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"ejercicio-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"ejercicio-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-num\">01<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-titulo\">Choque El\u00e1stico<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejercicio-contenido\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-enunciado\">\r\n                        <strong>m\u2081=2kg<\/strong> a <strong>6m\/s<\/strong> choca el\u00e1sticamente con <strong>m\u2082=4kg<\/strong> en reposo (\\( e=1 \\)).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-solucion\">\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion-paso\">\r\n                            \\[\r\n                                v_1' = \\frac{(2-4)}{6} \\times 6 = -2\\, \\text{m\/s}\r\n                            \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion-paso\">\r\n                            \\[\r\n                                v_2' = \\frac{4}{6} \\times 6 = 4\\, \\text{m\/s}\r\n                            \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion-paso highlight\">\r\n                            \\( E_k \\) conservada: \\( 36\\, \\text{J} = 4\\, \\text{J} + 32\\, \\text{J} \\)\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- EJERCICIO 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"ejercicio-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"ejercicio-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-num\">02<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-titulo\">Calentamiento<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejercicio-contenido\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-enunciado\">\r\n                        Calentar <strong>0.8kg<\/strong> de aluminio de <strong>25\u00b0C<\/strong> a <strong>150\u00b0C<\/strong>.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-solucion\">\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion-paso\">\r\n                            \\[\r\n                                Q = 0.8 \\times 900 \\times 125 = 90,000\\, \\text{J} = 90\\, \\text{kJ}\r\n                            \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion-paso\">\r\n                            \\[\r\n                                C = 0.8 \\times 900 = 720\\, \\text{J\/\u00b0C}\r\n                            \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- EJERCICIO 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"ejercicio-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"ejercicio-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-num\">03<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-titulo\">Choque Inel\u00e1stico<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejercicio-contenido\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-enunciado\">\r\n                        <strong>m\u2081=3kg<\/strong> a <strong>8m\/s<\/strong>, <strong>m\u2082=2kg<\/strong> a <strong>-2m\/s<\/strong>, <strong>e=0.4<\/strong>.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-solucion\">\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion-paso\">\r\n                            \\( v_1' = 2.32\\, \\text{m\/s} \\), \\( v_2' = 4.48\\, \\text{m\/s} \\)\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion-paso\">\r\n                            \\( \\Delta E_k = 96\\, \\text{J} - 66.9\\, \\text{J} = 29.1\\, \\text{J} \\)\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion-paso highlight\">\r\n                            \\( Q = 29.1\\, \\text{J} \\) (calor generado)\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- EJERCICIO 4 -->\r\n            <div class=\"ejercicio-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"ejercicio-header\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-num\">04<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-titulo\">Equilibrio T\u00e9rmico<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"ejercicio-contenido\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-enunciado\">\r\n                        <strong>0.5kg<\/strong> de hierro a <strong>200\u00b0C<\/strong> en <strong>2kg<\/strong> de agua a <strong>20\u00b0C<\/strong>.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejercicio-solucion\">\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion-paso\">\r\n                            \\[\r\n                                0.5 \\times 450 \\times (T - 200) = 2 \\times 4186 \\times (20 - T)\r\n                            \\]\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion-paso\">\r\n                            \\( 225T - 45000 = 8372(20 - T) \\)\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion-paso highlight\">\r\n                            \\( T \\approx 23.2\u00b0\\text{C} \\) (temperatura final)\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- APLICACIONES PR\u00c1CTICAS -->\r\n    <section class=\"aplicaciones-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd27<\/span> APLICACIONES <span class=\"formula-highlight\">PR\u00c1CTICAS<\/span>\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"aplicaciones-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"aplicacion-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"aplicacion-icono\">\ud83d\ude97<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"aplicacion-contenido\">\r\n                    <div class=\"aplicacion-titulo\">Airbags<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"aplicacion-desc\">\r\n                        Aumentan \\( \\Delta t \\) para reducir \\( F \\) en choques: \\( F = \\frac{\\Delta p}{\\Delta t} \\)\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"aplicacion-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"aplicacion-icono\">\ud83c\udfe0<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"aplicacion-contenido\">\r\n                    <div class=\"aplicacion-titulo\">Calefacci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"aplicacion-desc\">\r\n                        Agua (alto \\( c \\)) almacena y libera calor eficientemente en sistemas de calefacci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"aplicacion-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"aplicacion-icono\">\ud83e\udd4a<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"aplicacion-contenido\">\r\n                    <div class=\"aplicacion-titulo\">Deportes<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"aplicacion-desc\">\r\n                        Guantes de boxeo aumentan \\( e \\), reduciendo la fuerza de impacto en los pu\u00f1os\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"aplicacion-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"aplicacion-icono\">\ud83c\udf73<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"aplicacion-contenido\">\r\n                    <div class=\"aplicacion-titulo\">Cocina<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"aplicacion-desc\">\r\n                        Sartenes de aluminio (bajo \\( c \\)) se calientan r\u00e1pidamente para cocinar eficientemente\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE <span class=\"formula-highlight\">AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/span>\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 representa el coeficiente de restituci\u00f3n \\( e \\)?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        La energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica total despu\u00e9s del choque\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        La relaci\u00f3n entre las velocidades relativas antes y despu\u00e9s del choque\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        La cantidad de calor generado en el choque\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        La fuerza promedio durante el choque\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> \\( e = -\\frac{v_2' - v_1'}{u_2 - u_1} \\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la definici\u00f3n del coeficiente de restituci\u00f3n.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1nto calor se necesita para elevar 1kg de agua 1\u00b0C?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        1 J\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        4.18 J\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        4186 J\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        4186 cal\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> \\( Q = m \\cdot c \\cdot \\Delta T = 1 \\times 4186 \\times 1 = 4186\\, \\text{J} \\).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa el calor espec\u00edfico del agua.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                    Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/2\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                    Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES <span class=\"formula-highlight\">COMUNES<\/span>\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR \\( e \\) CON EFICIENCIA ENERG\u00c9TICA<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"Un \\( e = 0.8 \\) significa que el 80% de la energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica se conserva\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>\\( e \\):<\/strong> Relaci\u00f3n de velocidades relativas.<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Energ\u00eda conservada:<\/strong> Solo en choques el\u00e1sticos (\\( e = 1 \\)).<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c OLVIDAR CONVERTIR UNIDADES EN C\u00c1LCULOS DE CALOR<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"Usar gramos en lugar de kilogramos en \\( Q = m \\cdot c \\cdot \\Delta T \\)\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Aseg\u00farate de que todas las unidades est\u00e9n en el <strong>SI<\/strong> (kg, m, s, J).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE <span class=\"formula-highlight\">METACOGNITIVO<\/span>\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc8 AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n del coeficiente \\( e \\):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Aplicaci\u00f3n de \\( Q = m \\cdot c \\cdot \\Delta T \\):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es importante considerar el coeficiente de restituci\u00f3n \\( e \\) en el dise\u00f1o de equipos deportivos?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: guantes de boxeo, pelotas de tenis...\" rows=\"3\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Describe un escenario donde la transferencia de calor sea crucial para la seguridad.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: frenos de un auto, sistemas de enfriamiento...\" rows=\"3\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcda PLAN DE ESTUDIO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-item\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar f\u00f3rmulas de \\( e \\) y \\( Q \\)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Repasar valores t\u00edpicos de \\( c \\) para materiales comunes<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-item\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udee0 PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Resolver 3 problemas de colisiones con diferentes \\( e \\)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Calcular \\( Q \\) para 2 materiales distintos<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-item\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udf93 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Investigar aplicaciones en ingenier\u00eda de materiales<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Relacionar con la 1\u00aa Ley de la Termodin\u00e1mica<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-adicionales\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-grid\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/legacy\/collision-lab\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udfaf Simulador PhET: Laboratorio de Colisiones\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/phet.colorado.edu\/es\/simulation\/energy-forms-and-changes\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udd25 Simulador PhET: Formas y Cambios de Energ\u00eda\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/science\/physics\/thermodynamics\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcda Khan Academy: Termodin\u00e1mica\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ SIMULADOR DE COLISIONES\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function calcularColision() {\r\n        \/\/ Obtener valores\r\n        const m1 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('m1').value);\r\n        const u1 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('u1').value);\r\n        const m2 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('m2').value);\r\n        const u2 = parseFloat(document.getElementById('u2').value);\r\n        const e = parseFloat(document.getElementById('e-slider').value);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Validar entradas\r\n        if (isNaN(m1) || isNaN(u1) || isNaN(m2) || isNaN(u2)) {\r\n            alert(\"Por favor, ingresa valores v\u00e1lidos para masas y velocidades.\");\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar valor de e\r\n        document.getElementById('e-val').textContent = e.toFixed(1);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Calcular velocidades finales\r\n        const v1 = ((m1 - e * m2) * u1 + (1 + e) * m2 * u2) \/ (m1 + m2);\r\n        const v2 = ((1 + e) * m1 * u1 + (m2 - e * m1) * u2) \/ (m1 + m2);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Calcular energ\u00eda cin\u00e9tica inicial y final\r\n        const EkInicial = 0.5 * m1 * Math.pow(u1, 2) + 0.5 * m2 * Math.pow(u2, 2);\r\n        const EkFinal = 0.5 * m1 * Math.pow(v1, 2) + 0.5 * m2 * Math.pow(v2, 2);\r\n        const DeltaEk = EkInicial - EkFinal;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar resultados\r\n        document.getElementById('r-v1').textContent = `${v1.toFixed(3)} m\/s`;\r\n        document.getElementById('r-v2').textContent = `${v2.toFixed(3)} m\/s`;\r\n        document.getElementById('r-dek').textContent = `${DeltaEk.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n        document.getElementById('u1-antes').textContent = `u\u2081=${u1}m\/s`;\r\n        document.getElementById('u2-antes').textContent = `u\u2082=${u2}m\/s`;\r\n        document.getElementById('m1-antes').textContent = `m\u2081=${m1}kg`;\r\n        document.getElementById('m2-antes').textContent = `m\u2082=${m2}kg`;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Animar colisi\u00f3n\r\n        const obj1 = document.getElementById('obj1-antes');\r\n        const obj2 = document.getElementById('obj2-antes');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar posiciones\r\n        obj1.setAttribute('cx', '80');\r\n        obj2.setAttribute('cx', '320');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Animar movimiento hacia el centro\r\n        const anim1 = obj1.animate([\r\n            { cx: '80' },\r\n            { cx: '200' }\r\n        ], { duration: 1000, fill: 'forwards' });\r\n\r\n        const anim2 = obj2.animate([\r\n            { cx: '320' },\r\n            { cx: '200' }\r\n        ], { duration: 1000, fill: 'forwards' });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar resultados despu\u00e9s de la animaci\u00f3n\r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            \/\/ Mostrar objetos despu\u00e9s de la colisi\u00f3n\r\n            document.getElementById('obj1-despues').style.opacity = '1';\r\n            document.getElementById('obj2-despues').style.opacity = '1';\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Posicionar objetos seg\u00fan velocidades finales\r\n            const pos1 = 200 + v1 * 10;\r\n            const pos2 = 200 + v2 * 10;\r\n            document.getElementById('obj1-despues').setAttribute('cx', pos1);\r\n            document.getElementById('obj2-despues').setAttribute('cx', pos2);\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Mostrar flechas de velocidad final\r\n            document.getElementById('flecha-v1').style.opacity = '1';\r\n            document.getElementById('flecha-v2').style.opacity = '1';\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Actualizar diagrama de energ\u00eda\r\n            actualizarDiagramaEnergia(EkInicial, EkFinal, DeltaEk);\r\n        }, 1000);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar diagrama de energ\u00eda\r\n    function actualizarDiagramaEnergia(EkInicial, EkFinal, DeltaEk) {\r\n        \/\/ Escalar alturas para visualizaci\u00f3n (m\u00e1ximo 150px)\r\n        const escala = 150 \/ Math.max(EkInicial, EkFinal, DeltaEk);\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById('ek-inicial').textContent = `${EkInicial.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n        document.getElementById('ek-final').textContent = `${EkFinal.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n        document.getElementById('calor-generado').textContent = `${DeltaEk.toFixed(2)} J`;\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById('barra-ek-inicial').style.height = `${EkInicial * escala}px`;\r\n        document.getElementById('barra-ek-final').style.height = `${EkFinal * escala}px`;\r\n        document.getElementById('barra-calor').style.height = `${DeltaEk * escala}px`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ CALCULADORA DE CALOR\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function calcularCalor() {\r\n        \/\/ Obtener valores\r\n        const masa = parseFloat(document.getElementById('calc-masa').value);\r\n        const dt = parseFloat(document.getElementById('calc-dt').value);\r\n        const c = parseFloat(document.getElementById('calc-material').value);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Validar entradas\r\n        if (isNaN(masa) || isNaN(dt)) {\r\n            alert(\"Por favor, ingresa valores v\u00e1lidos para masa y \u0394T.\");\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Calcular Q y C\r\n        const Q = masa * c * dt;\r\n        const C = masa * c;\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Actualizar resultados\r\n        document.getElementById('r-q').textContent = `${Q.toFixed(0)} J`;\r\n        document.getElementById('r-c').textContent = `${C.toFixed(0)} J\/\u00b0C`;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    let quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Limpiar selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n                q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n            );\r\n\r\n            if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n                quizCompletado = true;\r\n                mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n        let feedback = \"\";\r\n        if (correctas === total) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas los conceptos de restituci\u00f3n y transferencia de calor.\";\r\n        } else if (correctas >= total \/ 2) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero repasa los c\u00e1lculos de \\( e \\) y \\( Q \\).\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas estudiar m\u00e1s. Usa los simuladores para practicar.\";\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        quizRespuestas = [];\r\n        quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ ERRORES COMUNES\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function toggleError(header) {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n\r\n        if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        } else {\r\n            content.style.display = 'block';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n        const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n        const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2)) \/ 2;\r\n\r\n        alert(\r\n            `\ud83d\udcbe Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n            `Coeficiente \\( e \\): ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n            `Transferencia de calor: ${slider2}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n            `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n            `Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`\r\n        );\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ==========================================\r\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n        console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: Restituci\u00f3n y Transferencia de Calor - Cargada\");\r\n\r\n        \/\/ A\u00f1adir marcador de flecha al SVG\r\n        const svgColision = document.getElementById('svg-colision');\r\n        const defs = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'defs');\r\n        const marker = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'marker');\r\n        marker.setAttribute('id', 'arrowhead');\r\n        marker.setAttribute('markerWidth', '10');\r\n        marker.setAttribute('markerHeight', '7');\r\n        marker.setAttribute('refX', '9');\r\n        marker.setAttribute('refY', '3.5');\r\n        marker.setAttribute('orient', 'auto');\r\n        const arrowPath = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'path');\r\n        arrowPath.setAttribute('d', 'M0,0 L10,3.5 L0,7 Z');\r\n        arrowPath.setAttribute('fill', '#39FF14');\r\n        marker.appendChild(arrowPath);\r\n        defs.appendChild(marker);\r\n        svgColision.appendChild(defs);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Inicializar simuladores\r\n        calcularColision();\r\n        calcularCalor();\r\n    });\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"e = 1 significa","respuesta":"Colisi\u00f3n el\u00e1stica perfecta"},{"enunciado":"e = 0 significa","respuesta":"Inel\u00e1stica perfecta"},{"enunciado":"F\u00f3rmula e","respuesta":"-(v2-v1)\/(u2-u1)"},{"enunciado":"Q = m c \u0394T es","respuesta":"Calor sensible"},{"enunciado":"C = m c es","respuesta":"Capacidad calor\u00edfica total"},{"enunciado":"c cobre \u2248","respuesta":"385 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C"},{"enunciado":"e = 0.8 \u2192","respuesta":"Parcialmente el\u00e1stica"},{"enunciado":"\u0394EK = Q si","respuesta":"e < 1"},{"enunciado":"u1=6, u2=0, v1=-2, v2=4 \u2192 e","respuesta":"1"},{"enunciado":"0.2 kg agua \u0394T=10\u00b0C \u2192 Q","respuesta":"8372 J"},{"enunciado":"C para 1 kg aluminio","respuesta":"900 J\/\u00b0C"},{"enunciado":"SI: e sin unidad","respuesta":"Adimensional"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"e = 1 \u2192 colisi\u00f3n","opciones":["El\u00e1stica","Inel\u00e1stica","Explosi\u00f3n","Est\u00e1tica"],"correcta":"El\u00e1stica"},{"pregunta":"e = 0 \u2192","opciones":["Inel\u00e1stica perfecta","El\u00e1stica","Parcial","Imposible"],"correcta":"Inel\u00e1stica perfecta"},{"pregunta":"F\u00f3rmula e","opciones":["-(v2-v1)\/(u2-u1)","(v2-v1)\/(u2-u1)","v\/u","u\/v"],"correcta":"-(v2-v1)\/(u2-u1)"},{"pregunta":"Q = m c \u0394T mide","opciones":["Calor sensible","Latente","Radiaci\u00f3n","Conducci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Calor sensible"},{"pregunta":"C = m c es","opciones":["Capacidad total","Espec\u00edfica","Latente","Molar"],"correcta":"Capacidad total"},{"pregunta":"c_agua =","opciones":["4186 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C","385","900","2090"],"correcta":"4186 J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"e < 1 \u2192 EK","opciones":["Disminuye","Aumenta","Igual","Cero"],"correcta":"Disminuye"},{"pregunta":"\u0394EK = Q si","opciones":["e < 1","e = 1","e = 0","Siempre"],"correcta":"e < 1"},{"pregunta":"u1=4, u2=0, e=0.5 \u2192 v1","opciones":["-4\/3 m\/s","0","4 m\/s","2 m\/s"],"correcta":"-4\/3 m\/s"},{"pregunta":"0.1 kg cobre \u0394T=50\u00b0C \u2192 Q","opciones":["1925 J","4186 J","900 J","0"],"correcta":"1925 J"},{"pregunta":"e = velocidad relativa","opciones":["Salida \/ entrada","Entrada \/ salida","v\/u","u\/v"],"correcta":"Salida \/ entrada"},{"pregunta":"c alta \u2192","opciones":["Absorbe m\u00e1s Q por \u00b0C","Menos","Igual","Cero"],"correcta":"Absorbe m\u00e1s Q por \u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"C para 2 kg agua","opciones":["8372 J\/\u00b0C","4186 J\/\u00b0C","2093 J\/\u00b0C","0"],"correcta":"8372 J\/\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"e pelota golf \u2248","opciones":["0.8","1.0","0.0","0.5"],"correcta":"0.8"},{"pregunta":"Q positiva \u2192 sistema","opciones":["Gana calor","Pierde","Igual","Cero"],"correcta":"Gana calor"},{"pregunta":"\u0394T = Q \/ C \u2192 C =","opciones":["Q \/ \u0394T","m c","c \/ m","\u0394T \/ Q"],"correcta":"Q \/ \u0394T"},{"pregunta":"e = 1 \u2192 p y EK","opciones":["Ambas conservadas","Solo p","Solo EK","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Ambas conservadas"},{"pregunta":"e = 0 \u2192 EK final","opciones":["M\u00ednima","M\u00e1xima","Igual","Cero"],"correcta":"M\u00ednima"},{"pregunta":"SI: c en","opciones":["J\/(kg\u00b7K)","cal\/g\u00b7\u00b0C","BTU\/lb\u00b7\u00b0F","todas"],"correcta":"todas"},{"pregunta":"IUPAC: calor en","opciones":["Joule","Calor\u00eda","eV","kWh"],"correcta":"Joule"},{"pregunta":"u1=10, u2=-5, v1=0, v2=5 \u2192 e","opciones":["1","0","0.5","2"],"correcta":"1"},{"pregunta":"Q = 8360 J, m=2 kg, c=4186 \u2192 \u0394T","opciones":["1\u00b0C","2\u00b0C","4\u00b0C","8360\u00b0C"],"correcta":"1\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"e pelota tenis \u2248","opciones":["0.7","1.0","0.0","0.3"],"correcta":"0.7"},{"pregunta":"Calor disipado =","opciones":["\u0394EK","\u0394p","m g h","F \u0394t"],"correcta":"\u0394EK"},{"pregunta":"c vapor > c agua","opciones":["No","S\u00ed","Igual","Depende"],"correcta":"No"},{"pregunta":"e > 1","opciones":["Imposible (pasiva)","Posible","Explosi\u00f3n","Siempre"],"correcta":"Imposible (pasiva)"},{"pregunta":"C = Q \/ \u0394T \u2192 unidad","opciones":["J\/\u00b0C","J\/kg\u00b7\u00b0C","W","kWh"],"correcta":"J\/\u00b0C"},{"pregunta":"e = 0.4 \u2192","opciones":["60% EK perdida","40%","100%","0%"],"correcta":"60% EK perdida"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: c_agua =","opciones":["4186 J\/kg\u00b7K","4.184 J\/g\u00b7K","1 cal\/g\u00b7K","todas"],"correcta":"todas"},{"pregunta":"e mide","opciones":["Elasticidad relativa","Masa","Velocidad","Fuerza"],"correcta":"Elasticidad relativa"}]}],"Ciencias Sociales":[{"materia":"Ciencias Sociales","slug":"bienestar-satisfaccion-necesidades","titulo":"El Bienestar y la Pir\u00e1mide de Maslow","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-ciencias-sociales-bienestar\" data-tema=\"piramide-maslow\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83d\udd3a<\/span>\r\n            PIR\u00c1MIDE DE MASLOW: EL CAMINO AL BIENESTAR\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            De la supervivencia a la autorrealizaci\u00f3n en la sociedad digital\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">@<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Identificar los 5 niveles de la pir\u00e1mide<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Diferenciar necesidades fisiol\u00f3gicas, de seguridad, sociales, de estima y de autorrealizaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar la jerarqu\u00eda de necesidades<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Explicar por qu\u00e9 se satisfacen niveles inferiores antes que superiores<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar la teor\u00eda a casos reales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Relacionar la pir\u00e1mide con situaciones cotidianas y profesionales<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Evaluar el impacto cultural<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Comparar c\u00f3mo var\u00eda la aplicaci\u00f3n de la pir\u00e1mide en diferentes culturas<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u24ea<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfe5 Salud P\u00fablica<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Programas sociales priorizan necesidades fisiol\u00f3gicas (alimentaci\u00f3n) antes que de estima (reconocimiento)<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">82% de pa\u00edses usan este modelo<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcbc Recursos Humanos<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Empresas tecnol\u00f3gicas dise\u00f1an beneficios seg\u00fan la pir\u00e1mide: seguro m\u00e9dico (nivel 2) \u2192 bonos (nivel 4)<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">+30% retenci\u00f3n de talento<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf93 Educaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Escuelas implementan programas de pertenencia (nivel 3) para mejorar rendimiento acad\u00e9mico (nivel 4)<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">15% aumento en calificaciones<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- TEOR\u00cdA INTERACTIVA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- PIR\u00c1MIDE ANIMADA INTERACTIVA -->\r\n        <div class=\"piramide-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"piramide-svg\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 500\" id=\"piramideMaslow\">\r\n                    <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Nivel 1: Fisiol\u00f3gicas -->\r\n                    <g id=\"nivel1\" class=\"nivel-piramide\" data-nivel=\"1\" data-nombre=\"Fisiol\u00f3gicas\" data-ejemplo=\"Aire, agua, comida\" data-color=\"#2196F3\">\r\n                        <polygon points=\"200,400 600,400 400,300\" fill=\"#2196F3\" class=\"nivel-polygon\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"360\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"nivel-text\">FISIOL\u00d3GICAS<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"380\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"nivel-subtext\">Supervivencia b\u00e1sica<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Nivel 2: Seguridad -->\r\n                    <g id=\"nivel2\" class=\"nivel-piramide\" data-nivel=\"2\" data-nombre=\"Seguridad\" data-ejemplo=\"Empleo, vivienda, salud\" data-color=\"#4CAF50\">\r\n                        <polygon points=\"220,300 580,300 400,220\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" class=\"nivel-polygon\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"265\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"nivel-text\">SEGURIDAD<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"285\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"nivel-subtext\">Estabilidad y protecci\u00f3n<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Nivel 3: Sociales -->\r\n                    <g id=\"nivel3\" class=\"nivel-piramide\" data-nivel=\"3\" data-nombre=\"Sociales\" data-ejemplo=\"Amistad, familia, amor\" data-color=\"#FF9800\">\r\n                        <polygon points=\"240,220 560,220 400,150\" fill=\"#FF9800\" class=\"nivel-polygon\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"190\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"nivel-text\">SOCIALES<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"210\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"nivel-subtext\">Pertenencia y afecto<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Nivel 4: Estima -->\r\n                    <g id=\"nivel4\" class=\"nivel-piramide\" data-nivel=\"4\" data-nombre=\"Estima\" data-ejemplo=\"Reconocimiento, logros\" data-color=\"#F44336\">\r\n                        <polygon points=\"260,150 540,150 400,90\" fill=\"#F44336\" class=\"nivel-polygon\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"125\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"nivel-text\">ESTIMA<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"145\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"nivel-subtext\">Respeto y autoestima<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Nivel 5: Autorrealizaci\u00f3n -->\r\n                    <g id=\"nivel5\" class=\"nivel-piramide\" data-nivel=\"5\" data-nombre=\"Autorrealizaci\u00f3n\" data-ejemplo=\"Creatividad, crecimiento personal\" data-color=\"#FFD700\">\r\n                        <polygon points=\"280,90 520,90 400,40\" fill=\"#FFD700\" class=\"nivel-polygon\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#212121\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"nivel-text\">AUTORREALIZACI\u00d3N<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"90\" fill=\"#212121\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"nivel-subtext\">Crecimiento y potencial<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Base informativa -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"420\" width=\"600\" height=\"60\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.7)\" rx=\"10\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"400\" y=\"450\" fill=\"#E0F0FF\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"base-text\">Satisfacer niveles inferiores \u2192 Acceso a superiores<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"400\" y=\"475\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"base-text\">Teor\u00eda de Abraham Maslow (1943) adaptada a contextos modernos<\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- Panel de informaci\u00f3n -->\r\n            <div class=\"piramide-info\">\r\n                <h3 id=\"info-titulo\">Selecciona un nivel de la pir\u00e1mide<\/h3>\r\n                <div id=\"info-contenido\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Nivel:<\/strong> <span id=\"info-nivel\">-<\/span><\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Nombre:<\/strong> <span id=\"info-nombre\">-<\/span><\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> <span id=\"info-ejemplo\">-<\/span><\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Estado actual:<\/strong> <span id=\"info-estado\">No seleccionado<\/span><\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- PRINCIPIOS CLAVE -->\r\n        <div class=\"principios-section\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"subseccion-titulo\">\u26a1 PRINCIPIOS FUNDAMENTALES<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"principios-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"principio-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"principio-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>JERARQU\u00cdA<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Las necesidades inferiores deben satisfacerse antes que las superiores. Ejemplo: No puedes buscar reconocimiento (nivel 4) si tienes hambre (nivel 1).<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"principio-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"principio-icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>MOTIVACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Una necesidad satisfecha deja de ser motivadora. Ejemplo: Al conseguir un empleo estable (nivel 2), buscas amistad (nivel 3).<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"principio-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"principio-icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>CULTURAL<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Aplicaci\u00f3n universal con variaciones locales. Ejemplo: En Jap\u00f3n, el nivel 3 (social) incluye \"armon\u00eda grupal\"; en Occidente, \"individualidad\".<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- EJEMPLO INTERACTIVO -->\r\n        <div class=\"ejemplo-interactivo\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"subseccion-titulo\">\ud83d\udca1 EJEMPLO PR\u00c1CTICO: ESTUDIANTE UNIVERSITARIO<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"ejemplo-pasos\">\r\n                <div class=\"paso-card\" data-paso=\"1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-header\">\r\n                        <span class=\"paso-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                        <h4>Nivel 1: Fisiol\u00f3gicas<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p>El estudiante tiene hambre. <strong>No puede concentrarse<\/strong> en estudiar hasta que come.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-icon\">\ud83c\udf54<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"paso-card\" data-paso=\"2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-header\">\r\n                        <span class=\"paso-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                        <h4>Nivel 2: Seguridad<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p>Con el est\u00f3mago lleno, busca <strong>estabilidad econ\u00f3mica<\/strong> (beca o trabajo parcial).<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-icon\">\ud83d\udcb0<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"paso-card\" data-paso=\"3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-header\">\r\n                        <span class=\"paso-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                        <h4>Nivel 3: Sociales<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p>Con seguridad econ\u00f3mica, busca <strong>amistades<\/strong> en la universidad y grupos de estudio.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-icon\">\ud83d\udc65<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"paso-card\" data-paso=\"4\">\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-header\">\r\n                        <span class=\"paso-num\">04<\/span>\r\n                        <h4>Nivel 4: Estima<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p>Con apoyo social, busca <strong>reconocimiento<\/strong> (buenas calificaciones, liderazgo).<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-icon\">\ud83c\udfc6<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"paso-card\" data-paso=\"5\">\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-header\">\r\n                        <span class=\"paso-num\">05<\/span>\r\n                        <h4>Nivel 5: Autorrealizaci\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <p>Finalmente, explora su <strong>creatividad<\/strong> (proyectos personales, investigaci\u00f3n).<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"paso-icon\">\ud83c\udfa8<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: CONSTRUYE TU PIR\u00c1MIDE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"piramide-maslow\">\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udccb CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"personaSelect\">Selecciona un perfil:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"personaSelect\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"estudiante\">Estudiante universitario<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"emprendedor\">Emprendedor<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"padre\">Padre\/madre de familia<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"artista\">Artista<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"personalizado\">Personalizado<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\" id=\"niveles-container\">\r\n                    <label>Niveles satisfechos:<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"checkbox-group\">\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"nivel\" value=\"1\" checked> Nivel 1 (Fisiol\u00f3gicas)<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"nivel\" value=\"2\"> Nivel 2 (Seguridad)<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"nivel\" value=\"3\"> Nivel 3 (Sociales)<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"nivel\" value=\"4\"> Nivel 4 (Estima)<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"nivel\" value=\"5\"> Nivel 5 (Autorrealizaci\u00f3n)<\/label>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-simular\" onclick=\"simularPiramide()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> SIMULAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"perfilAleatorio()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> PERFIL ALEATORIO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- Visualizaci\u00f3n -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <div class=\"piramide-simulada\" id=\"piramideSimulada\">\r\n                    <!-- Se generar\u00e1 din\u00e1micamente -->\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"simulacion-info\" id=\"simulacionInfo\">\r\n                    Selecciona un perfil y haz clic en \"SIMULAR\"\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- Datos en tiempo real -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca DATOS DE SIMULACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Perfil:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPerfil\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Nivel actual:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataNivelActual\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Nivel bloqueado:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataNivelBloqueado\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">RECOMENDACI\u00d3N:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataRecomendacion\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcc8 ESTAD\u00cdSTICAS<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Perfiles simulados:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statPerfiles\">0<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Simulaciones totales:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"statSimulaciones\">0<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la base de la pir\u00e1mide de Maslow?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Necesidades de estima\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Necesidades fisiol\u00f3gicas\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Necesidades sociales\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Autorrealizaci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Las necesidades fisiol\u00f3gicas (comida, agua, aire) son la base de la pir\u00e1mide.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la estructura jer\u00e1rquica de la pir\u00e1mide.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Seg\u00fan Maslow, las necesidades m\u00e1s b\u00e1sicas (fisiol\u00f3gicas) deben satisfacerse primero. Solo entonces se activan necesidades superiores como seguridad, sociales, estima y autorrealizaci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 sucede cuando se satisface una necesidad?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Se vuelve m\u00e1s intensa\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Desaparece de la pir\u00e1mide\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Deja de ser motivadora\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Se convierte en un lujo\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Una necesidad satisfecha deja de motivar el comportamiento.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> La teor\u00eda de Maslow establece que las necesidades satisfechas no generan motivaci\u00f3n.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Si tienes sed (nivel 1) y bebes agua, la sed deja de motivarte. Entonces, puedes enfocarte en necesidades de seguridad (nivel 2).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 nivel NO puede alcanzarse si el nivel 3 (social) no est\u00e1 satisfecho?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Autorrealizaci\u00f3n (nivel 5)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Seguridad (nivel 2)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Fisiol\u00f3gicas (nivel 1)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Todas las anteriores\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Los niveles superiores (4 y 5) requieren que los inferiores (1, 2, 3) est\u00e9n satisfechos.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> La jerarqu\u00eda de Maslow es progresiva: primero 1 \u2192 2 \u2192 3 \u2192 4 \u2192 5.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Contexto:<\/strong> Si una persona no tiene relaciones sociales satisfactorias (nivel 3), dif\u00edcilmente buscar\u00e1 reconocimiento (nivel 4) o autorrealizaci\u00f3n (nivel 5).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                    Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                    Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES Y SOLUCIONES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR \"NECESIDAD\" CON \"DESEO\"<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"Un iPhone nuevo es una necesidad fisiol\u00f3gica\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Un iPhone es un <strong>deseo<\/strong> (nivel 4: estima). Una necesidad fisiol\u00f3gica es <strong>agua<\/strong> o <strong>comida<\/strong>.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Practica:<\/strong> Clasifica: \u00bfNecesidad o deseo? <strong>Vivienda<\/strong>, <strong>Netflix<\/strong>, <strong>Aire<\/strong>, <strong>Ropa de marca<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                            <strong>Vivienda:<\/strong> Necesidad (seguridad)<br>\r\n                            <strong>Netflix:<\/strong> Deseo (entretenimiento)<br>\r\n                            <strong>Aire:<\/strong> Necesidad (fisiol\u00f3gica)<br>\r\n                            <strong>Ropa de marca:<\/strong> Deseo (estima)\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c IGNORAR EL CONTEXTO CULTURAL<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"La pir\u00e1mide es igual en todas las culturas\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El <strong>orden<\/strong> es universal, pero los <strong>ejemplos<\/strong> var\u00edan:\r\n                        <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                            <table>\r\n                                <tr><th>Cultura<\/th><th>Nivel 3 (Social)<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                                <tr><td>Occidental<\/td><td>Amistades individuales<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                                <tr><td>Japonesa<\/td><td>Armon\u00eda grupal (wa)<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                                <tr><td>Latina<\/td><td>Familia extendida<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <\/table>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c OLVIDAR LA DIN\u00c1MICA DE LA PIR\u00c1MIDE<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"Si satisfago el nivel 1, el nivel 2 se satisface autom\u00e1ticamente\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Cada nivel requiere <strong>acci\u00f3n consciente<\/strong>. Ejemplo:\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Nivel 1 \u2192 Nivel 2:<\/strong> Conseguir comida no garantiza empleo estable.<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Nivel 3 \u2192 Nivel 4:<\/strong> Tener amigos no asegura autoestima.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Reflexi\u00f3n:<\/strong> \u00bfQu\u00e9 acciones espec\u00edficas necesitas para avanzar del nivel 3 al 4 en tu vida?<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>An\u00e1lisis de caso: Emprendedor<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Un emprendedor tiene:<\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Ingresos estables (nivel 2: seguridad).<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Pocos amigos (nivel 3: social no satisfecho).<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Desea ganar un premio (nivel 4: estima).<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <p><strong>Preguntas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 nivel debe priorizar seg\u00fan Maslow? <strong>Justifica<\/strong>.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Prop\u00f3n <strong>3 acciones concretas<\/strong> para satisfacer el nivel 3.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Explica c\u00f3mo afectar\u00eda esto a su motivaci\u00f3n para el nivel 4.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu respuesta aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">\ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li><strong>Priorizar nivel 3 (social).<\/strong> Seg\u00fan Maslow, no puede alcanzar el nivel 4 (estima) sin satisfacer el 3.<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Acciones para nivel 3:<\/strong>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Unirse a grupos de emprendedores (ej: Meetup).<\/li>\r\n                                <li>Participar en eventos de networking.<\/li>\r\n                                <li>Crear un equipo de trabajo colaborativo.<\/li>\r\n                            <\/ul>\r\n                        <\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Impacto en nivel 4:<\/strong> Al satisfacer el nivel 3, su motivaci\u00f3n por el reconocimiento (premio) aumentar\u00e1, ya que las necesidades sociales ya no competir\u00e1n por su atenci\u00f3n.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Comparaci\u00f3n cultural<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Compara c\u00f3mo se manifiesta el <strong>nivel 3 (social)<\/strong> en:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Una familia japonesa tradicional.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Un joven occidental en una gran ciudad.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Incluye:<\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Diferencias en <strong>comportamientos<\/strong>.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Ejemplos <strong>concretos<\/strong>.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>C\u00f3mo afecta esto a los niveles superiores (4 y 5).<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu comparaci\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"10\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">\ud83d\udd0d VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Respuesta modelo:<\/strong>\r\n                    <div class=\"comparacion-tabla\">\r\n                        <table>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <th>Contexto<\/th>\r\n                                <th>Manifestaci\u00f3n nivel 3<\/th>\r\n                                <th>Ejemplo<\/th>\r\n                                <th>Impacto en niveles 4-5<\/th>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td><strong>Familia japonesa<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                                <td>Enfasis en <strong>armon\u00eda grupal<\/strong> (wa) y roles familiares definidos.<\/td>\r\n                                <td>Participaci\u00f3n en ceremonias familiares y decisiones colectivas.<\/td>\r\n                                <td>La estima (nivel 4) se logra mediante el <strong>reconocimiento grupal<\/strong> (ej: honor familiar). La autorrealizaci\u00f3n (nivel 5) suele alinearse con metas colectivas.<\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td><strong>Joven occidental<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                                <td>B\u00fasqueda de <strong>relaciones individuales<\/strong> y redes diversas.<\/td>\r\n                                <td>Amistades en redes sociales, grupos de inter\u00e9s (deportes, arte).<\/td>\r\n                                <td>La estima (nivel 4) se centra en <strong>logros personales<\/strong> (ej: carrera profesional). La autorrealizaci\u00f3n (nivel 5) prioriza proyectos individuales.<\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                        <\/table>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                        <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>Identificaci\u00f3n de niveles<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Clasifica correctamente todos los niveles con justificaci\u00f3n s\u00f3lida basada en la teor\u00eda.<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Clasifica la mayor\u00eda correctamente, con alguna confusi\u00f3n en niveles intermedios.<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Errores graves en la clasificaci\u00f3n o justificaci\u00f3n ausente.<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>Aplicaci\u00f3n a casos reales<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Propone acciones espec\u00edficas y realistas para cada nivel, con conexi\u00f3n clara a la teor\u00eda.<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Propone acciones gen\u00e9ricas o con alguna desconexi\u00f3n te\u00f3rica.<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Acciones irrelevantes o sin relaci\u00f3n con los niveles de la pir\u00e1mide.<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td><strong>An\u00e1lisis cultural<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                        <td>Diferencia claramente manifestaciones culturales, con ejemplos precisos y an\u00e1lisis de impacto en niveles superiores.<\/td>\r\n                        <td>Identifica diferencias culturales, pero con ejemplos vagos o an\u00e1lisis superficial.<\/td>\r\n                        <td>No reconoce variaciones culturales o las confunde.<\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n de los niveles de la pir\u00e1mide:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Aplicaci\u00f3n a casos pr\u00e1cticos:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>An\u00e1lisis de variaciones culturales:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83e\udd14 REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo aplicas (o aplicar\u00edas) la pir\u00e1mide de Maslow en tu <strong>vida diaria<\/strong>? Describe un ejemplo concreto donde hayas priorizado necesidades seg\u00fan este modelo.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: 'Cuando ten\u00eda hambre (nivel 1), primero com\u00ed antes de estudiar (nivel 4)...'\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>En tu <strong>entorno cultural<\/strong>, \u00bfqu\u00e9 diferencia observas en c\u00f3mo se satisfacen las necesidades sociales (nivel 3) comparado con otras culturas que conozcas?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: 'En mi familia, el nivel 3 se centra en la familia extendida, mientras que en Europa...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar los 5 niveles y sus ejemplos.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Repasar los 3 principios clave.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Completar el quiz interactivo.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udee0 PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Analizar 3 casos reales (ej: un deportista, un artista, un cient\u00edfico).<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Usar el simulador para diferentes perfiles.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Resolver los problemas tipo examen.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udf10 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Investigar c\u00f3mo aplican la pir\u00e1mide en psicolog\u00eda organizacional.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Comparar con otras teor\u00edas motivacionales (ej: Herzberg).<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Reflexionar sobre cr\u00edticas a Maslow (ej: \u00bfes realmente jer\u00e1rquica?).<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.simplypsychology.org\/maslow.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcd6 Simply Psychology: Explicaci\u00f3n detallada de Maslow\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/positivepsychology.com\/maslows-hierarchy-of-needs\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83e\udde0 PositivePsychology: Aplicaciones modernas\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ted.com\/talks\/dan_pink_the_puzzle_of_motivation\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udfa4 TED Talk: \"The puzzle of motivation\" (Dan Pink)\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE PIR\u00c1MIDE INTERACTIVA\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nconst nivelesPiramide = {\r\n    1: { nombre: \"Fisiol\u00f3gicas\", ejemplo: \"Aire, agua, comida, sue\u00f1o\", color: \"#2196F3\" },\r\n    2: { nombre: \"Seguridad\", ejemplo: \"Empleo, salud, vivienda, protecci\u00f3n\", color: \"#4CAF50\" },\r\n    3: { nombre: \"Sociales\", ejemplo: \"Amistad, familia, amor, pertenencia\", color: \"#FF9800\" },\r\n    4: { nombre: \"Estima\", ejemplo: \"Reconocimiento, logros, autoestima\", color: \"#F44336\" },\r\n    5: { nombre: \"Autorrealizaci\u00f3n\", ejemplo: \"Creatividad, crecimiento personal, potencial\", color: \"#FFD700\" }\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar interacci\u00f3n con la pir\u00e1mide est\u00e1tica\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.nivel-piramide').forEach(nivel => {\r\n        nivel.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const nivelNum = this.id.replace('nivel', '');\r\n            const data = nivelesPiramide[nivelNum];\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Actualizar panel de informaci\u00f3n\r\n            document.getElementById('info-titulo').textContent = `Nivel ${nivelNum}: ${data.nombre}`;\r\n            document.getElementById('info-nivel').textContent = nivelNum;\r\n            document.getElementById('info-nombre').textContent = data.nombre;\r\n            document.getElementById('info-ejemplo').textContent = data.ejemplo;\r\n            document.getElementById('info-estado').textContent = \"Seleccionado\";\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Resaltar nivel seleccionado\r\n            document.querySelectorAll('.nivel-polygon').forEach(poly => {\r\n                poly.style.filter = 'brightness(1)';\r\n            });\r\n            this.querySelector('.nivel-polygon').style.filter = 'brightness(1.3)';\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n\r\n            this.style.animation = 'pulse 1s';\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR DE PIR\u00c1MIDE DIN\u00c1MICA\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nconst perfiles = {\r\n    estudiante: {\r\n        nombre: \"Estudiante universitario\",\r\n        niveles: [true, true, false, false, false],\r\n        recomendacion: \"Enf\u00f3cate en construir relaciones sociales (nivel 3) para luego buscar reconocimiento acad\u00e9mico (nivel 4).\",\r\n        bloqueado: 3\r\n    },\r\n    emprendedor: {\r\n        nombre: \"Emprendedor\",\r\n        niveles: [true, true, false, false, false],\r\n        recomendacion: \"Prioriza redes de contacto (nivel 3) antes de buscar premios o reconocimiento p\u00fablico (nivel 4).\",\r\n        bloqueado: 3\r\n    },\r\n    padre: {\r\n        nombre: \"Padre\/madre de familia\",\r\n        niveles: [true, true, true, false, false],\r\n        recomendacion: \"Con las necesidades sociales cubiertas, ahora puedes trabajar en tu autoestima (nivel 4) y proyectos personales (nivel 5).\",\r\n        bloqueado: 4\r\n    },\r\n    artista: {\r\n        nombre: \"Artista\",\r\n        niveles: [true, false, true, false, false],\r\n        recomendacion: \"Asegura tu estabilidad econ\u00f3mica (nivel 2) para poder dedicarte plenamente a tu creatividad (nivel 5).\",\r\n        bloqueado: 2\r\n    },\r\n    personalizado: {\r\n        nombre: \"Perfil personalizado\",\r\n        niveles: [false, false, false, false, false],\r\n        recomendacion: \"Personaliza tu camino seg\u00fan tus necesidades actuales.\",\r\n        bloqueado: 1\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\nlet simulaciones = 0;\r\nlet perfilesSimulados = new Set();\r\n\r\nfunction simularPiramide() {\r\n    const perfilSelect = document.getElementById('personaSelect').value;\r\n    const checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"nivel\"]:checked');\r\n    const nivelesCheckbox = Array.from(checkboxes).map(cb => parseInt(cb.value));\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Determinar niveles seg\u00fan el perfil o personalizaci\u00f3n\r\n    let perfil;\r\n    if (perfilSelect === 'personalizado') {\r\n        perfil = { ...perfiles.personalizado };\r\n        perfil.niveles = [false, false, false, false, false];\r\n        nivelesCheckbox.forEach(n => {\r\n            perfil.niveles[n - 1] = true;\r\n        });\r\n        \/\/ Determinar nivel bloqueado\r\n        perfil.bloqueado = 1;\r\n        for (let i = 0; i < perfil.niveles.length; i++) {\r\n            if (!perfil.niveles[i]) {\r\n                perfil.bloqueado = i + 1;\r\n                break;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        if (perfil.bloqueado > 5) perfil.bloqueado = 5;\r\n    } else {\r\n        perfil = perfiles[perfilSelect];\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar datos en la interfaz\r\n    document.getElementById('dataPerfil').textContent = perfil.nombre;\r\n    document.getElementById('simulacionInfo').innerHTML = `\r\n        <strong>Simulaci\u00f3n para:<\/strong> ${perfil.nombre}<br>\r\n        <strong>Niveles satisfechos:<\/strong> ${nivelesCheckbox.join(', ')}\r\n    `;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Determinar nivel actual y bloqueado\r\n    let nivelActual = 0;\r\n    for (let i = 0; i < perfil.niveles.length; i++) {\r\n        if (perfil.niveles[i]) {\r\n            nivelActual = i + 1;\r\n        } else {\r\n            break;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    let nivelBloqueado = nivelActual < 5 ? nivelActual + 1 : \"Ninguno (\u00a1autorrealizaci\u00f3n alcanzada!)\";\r\n    if (nivelActual === 5) nivelBloqueado = \"Ninguno (\u00a1autorrealizaci\u00f3n alcanzada!)\";\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('dataNivelActual').textContent = `Nivel ${nivelActual} (${nivelesPiramide[nivelActual].nombre})`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataNivelBloqueado').textContent = nivelBloqueado;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataRecomendacion').textContent = perfil.recomendacion;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Generar pir\u00e1mide visual\r\n    generarPiramideVisual(perfil.niveles);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas\r\n    simulaciones++;\r\n    if (perfilSelect !== 'personalizado') {\r\n        perfilesSimulados.add(perfilSelect);\r\n    }\r\n    document.getElementById('statSimulaciones').textContent = simulaciones;\r\n    document.getElementById('statPerfiles').textContent = perfilesSimulados.size;\r\n\r\n    console.log(`\ud83d\udcca Simulaci\u00f3n ${simulaciones}: ${perfil.nombre} - Nivel actual: ${nivelActual}, Bloqueado: ${nivelBloqueado}`);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction generarPiramideVisual(niveles) {\r\n    const container = document.getElementById('piramideSimulada');\r\n    container.innerHTML = '';\r\n\r\n    const svgNS = \"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\";\r\n    const svg = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"svg\");\r\n    svg.setAttribute(\"viewBox\", \"0 0 300 400\");\r\n    svg.setAttribute(\"width\", \"100%\");\r\n    svg.setAttribute(\"height\", \"300\");\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Fondo\r\n    const fondo = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"rect\");\r\n    fondo.setAttribute(\"x\", \"0\");\r\n    fondo.setAttribute(\"y\", \"0\");\r\n    fondo.setAttribute(\"width\", \"300\");\r\n    fondo.setAttribute(\"height\", \"400\");\r\n    fondo.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"#0a0a1a\");\r\n    svg.appendChild(fondo);\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Posiciones y tama\u00f1os de los niveles\r\n    const yPositions = [350, 280, 210, 140, 70];\r\n    const widths = [280, 240, 200, 160, 120];\r\n\r\n    niveles.forEach((satisfecho, index) => {\r\n        const nivelNum = index + 1;\r\n        const y = yPositions[index];\r\n        const width = widths[index];\r\n        const x = (300 - width) \/ 2;\r\n        const color = satisfecho ? nivelesPiramide[nivelNum].color : \"rgba(100,100,100,0.3)\";\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Pol\u00edgono del nivel\r\n        const polygon = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"polygon\");\r\n        const points = `${x},${y} ${x + width},${y} ${150},${y - 70}`;\r\n        polygon.setAttribute(\"points\", points);\r\n        polygon.setAttribute(\"fill\", color);\r\n        polygon.setAttribute(\"stroke\", satisfecho ? \"#fff\" : \"#555\");\r\n        polygon.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"1\");\r\n        svg.appendChild(polygon);\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Texto del nivel\r\n        const text = document.createElementNS(svgNS, \"text\");\r\n        text.setAttribute(\"x\", \"150\");\r\n        text.setAttribute(\"y\", y - 35);\r\n        text.setAttribute(\"fill\", nivelNum === 5 && satisfecho ? \"#212121\" : \"white\");\r\n        text.setAttribute(\"font-size\", \"12\");\r\n        text.setAttribute(\"text-anchor\", \"middle\");\r\n        text.setAttribute(\"font-weight\", \"bold\");\r\n        text.textContent = nivelesPiramide[nivelNum].nombre.substring(0, 3).toUpperCase();\r\n        svg.appendChild(text);\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    container.appendChild(svg);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction perfilAleatorio() {\r\n    const perfilesKeys = Object.keys(perfiles).filter(key => key !== 'personalizado');\r\n    const randomKey = perfilesKeys[Math.floor(Math.random() * perfilesKeys.length)];\r\n    document.getElementById('personaSelect').value = randomKey;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Marcar checkboxes seg\u00fan el perfil aleatorio\r\n    const niveles = perfiles[randomKey].niveles;\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"nivel\"]').forEach((cb, index) => {\r\n        cb.checked = niveles[index];\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('simulacionInfo').textContent = `Perfil aleatorio: ${perfiles[randomKey].nombre}. Haz clic en \"SIMULAR\".`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\nfunction inicializarQuiz() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            verificarCompletadoQuiz();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction verificarCompletadoQuiz() {\r\n    const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n    const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q => q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected'));\r\n\r\n    if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n        quizCompletado = true;\r\n        mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n    const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n    let feedback = \"\";\r\n    if (porcentaje >= 80) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Excelente! Dominas la pir\u00e1mide de Maslow y su aplicaci\u00f3n.\";\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 60) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4c Buen trabajo, pero repasa los principios clave y ejemplos.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas estudiar m\u00e1s la jerarqu\u00eda y casos pr\u00e1cticos.\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE ERRORES COMUNES\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction toggleError(header) {\r\n    const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n\r\n    if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n    } else {\r\n        content.style.display = 'block';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n\r\n    const reflexion1 = document.getElementById('reflexion1').value;\r\n    const reflexion2 = document.getElementById('reflexion2').value;\r\n\r\n    alert(`\ud83d\udcbe Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n          `Comprensi\u00f3n de niveles: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n          `Aplicaci\u00f3n pr\u00e1ctica: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n          `An\u00e1lisis cultural: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n          `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n          `Reflexiones guardadas. Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE OBJETIVOS INTERACTIVOS\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction inicializarObjetivos() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n            this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n            const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n            checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n            checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : '';\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ SISTEMA DE EJEMPLOS INTERACTIVOS\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\nfunction inicializarEjemplos() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.paso-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            this.style.transform = 'scale(1.02)';\r\n            setTimeout(() => {\r\n                this.style.transform = 'scale(1)';\r\n            }, 300);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N COMPLETA\r\n\/\/ ==========================================\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    inicializarQuiz();\r\n    inicializarObjetivos();\r\n    inicializarEjemplos();\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Sistema Cyberpunk Educativo: Pir\u00e1mide de Maslow - Todo listo para interactuar\");\r\n});\r\n<\/script>\r\n","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Nombre los 5 niveles de Maslow","respuesta":"Fisiol\u00f3gicas, Seguridad, Sociales, Estima, Autorrealizaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Nivel base","respuesta":"Fisiol\u00f3gicas"},{"enunciado":"Nivel superior","respuesta":"Autorrealizaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Necesidad de estima","respuesta":"Respeto, logros"},{"enunciado":"Si falta comida \u2192","respuesta":"Bloquea niveles superiores"},{"enunciado":"Teor\u00eda de","respuesta":"Abraham Maslow"},{"enunciado":"Bienestar =","respuesta":"Equilibrio en todos los niveles"},{"enunciado":"Ejemplo nivel 3","respuesta":"Amistad, familia"},{"enunciado":"Jerarqu\u00eda significa","respuesta":"Orden de prioridad"},{"enunciado":"Autorrealizaci\u00f3n incluye","respuesta":"Creatividad, potencial"},{"enunciado":"M\u00e9xico: necesidad clave","respuesta":"Seguridad (empleo, salud)"},{"enunciado":"SI: bienestar en","respuesta":"Desarrollo humano"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Nivel base pir\u00e1mide","opciones":["Fisiol\u00f3gicas","Autorrealizaci\u00f3n","Estima","Sociales"],"correcta":"Fisiol\u00f3gicas"},{"pregunta":"Nivel superior","opciones":["Autorrealizaci\u00f3n","Fisiol\u00f3gicas","Seguridad","Estima"],"correcta":"Autorrealizaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Teor\u00eda de","opciones":["Maslow","Freud","Piaget","Skinner"],"correcta":"Maslow"},{"pregunta":"Bienestar requiere","opciones":["Equilibrio en necesidades","Solo dinero","Solo comida","Nada"],"correcta":"Equilibrio en necesidades"},{"pregunta":"Necesidades fisiol\u00f3gicas","opciones":["Comida, agua","Amigos","Logros","Arte"],"correcta":"Comida, agua"},{"pregunta":"Estima incluye","opciones":["Respeto, confianza","Comida","Seguridad","Amor"],"correcta":"Respeto, confianza"},{"pregunta":"Si falta seguridad \u2192","opciones":["Dificulta estima","No afecta","Mejora","Es independiente"],"correcta":"Dificulta estima"},{"pregunta":"Jerarqu\u00eda significa","opciones":["Orden de prioridad","Igualdad","Aleatorio","Opcional"],"correcta":"Orden de prioridad"},{"pregunta":"Autorrealizaci\u00f3n es","opciones":["Realizar potencial","Comer","Dormir","Trabajar"],"correcta":"Realizar potencial"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico 2025: prioridad","opciones":["Seguridad y salud","Lujo","Viajes","Tecnolog\u00eda"],"correcta":"Seguridad y salud"},{"pregunta":"Necesidades sociales","opciones":["Amistad, pertenencia","Comida","Dinero","Fama"],"correcta":"Amistad, pertenencia"},{"pregunta":"Sin comida \u2192 motivaci\u00f3n","opciones":["Solo fisiol\u00f3gica","Estima","Creatividad","Nada"],"correcta":"Solo fisiol\u00f3gica"},{"pregunta":"Pir\u00e1mide es","opciones":["Jer\u00e1rquica","Circular","Lineal","Plana"],"correcta":"Jer\u00e1rquica"},{"pregunta":"Bienestar =","opciones":["Satisfacci\u00f3n progresiva","Solo nivel 1","Solo nivel 5","Dinero"],"correcta":"Satisfacci\u00f3n progresiva"},{"pregunta":"Maslow public\u00f3 en","opciones":["1943","1900","2000","2025"],"correcta":"1943"},{"pregunta":"Cr\u00edtica a Maslow","opciones":["No universal","Perfecta","Cient\u00edfica","F\u00edsica"],"correcta":"No universal"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: nivel cr\u00edtico","opciones":["Seguridad","Autorrealizaci\u00f3n","Estima","Sociales"],"correcta":"Seguridad"},{"pregunta":"Bienestar social incluye","opciones":["Nivel 3","Solo 1","Solo 5","Ninguno"],"correcta":"Nivel 3"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: desarrollo humano mide","opciones":["IDH (PNUD)","PIB","Solo dinero","Nada"],"correcta":"IDH (PNUD)"},{"pregunta":"Necesidad satisfecha \u2192","opciones":["Deja de motivar","Aumenta","Igual","Desaparece"],"correcta":"Deja de motivar"},{"pregunta":"Estudiante con hambre","opciones":["No aprende bien","Mejor","Igual","M\u00e1s creativo"],"correcta":"No aprende bien"},{"pregunta":"Empresa: motivaci\u00f3n","opciones":["Salario + reconocimiento","Solo salario","Solo amigos","Nada"],"correcta":"Salario + reconocimiento"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: bienestar juvenil","opciones":["Educaci\u00f3n + empleo","Lujo","Viajes","Tecnolog\u00eda"],"correcta":"Educaci\u00f3n + empleo"},{"pregunta":"Pir\u00e1mide din\u00e1mica","opciones":["S\u00ed, cambia con contexto","No","Fija","Est\u00e1tica"],"correcta":"S\u00ed, cambia con contexto"},{"pregunta":"Autorrealizaci\u00f3n ejemplo","opciones":["Pintar, inventar","Comer","Dormir","Trabajar"],"correcta":"Pintar, inventar"},{"pregunta":"Cr\u00edtica cultural","opciones":["Colectivismo vs individualismo","Universal","F\u00edsica","Matem\u00e1tica"],"correcta":"Colectivismo vs individualismo"},{"pregunta":"Bienestar objetivo","opciones":["Progreso en todos los niveles","Solo base","Solo cima","Dinero"],"correcta":"Progreso en todos los niveles"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico 2025: pol\u00edtica p\u00fablica","opciones":["Salud, educaci\u00f3n, empleo","Lujo","Tecnolog\u00eda","Nada"],"correcta":"Salud, educaci\u00f3n, empleo"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: bienestar en","opciones":["ODS 3, 4, 8","Solo 1","Solo 17","Ninguno"],"correcta":"ODS 3, 4, 8"},{"pregunta":"Maslow: motivaci\u00f3n humana","opciones":["Jer\u00e1rquica y progresiva","Aleatoria","Est\u00e1tica","Negativa"],"correcta":"Jer\u00e1rquica y progresiva"}]},{"materia":"Ciencias Sociales","slug":"organizacion-sociedad","titulo":"La Organizaci\u00f3n de la Sociedad: Niveles Micro, Meso y Macro","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-sociales-organizacion\" data-tema=\"organizacion-sociedad\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n            LA ORGANIZACI\u00d3N DE LA SOCIEDAD\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Niveles Micro, Meso y Macro: Estructuras que Tejen el Tejido Social\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Diferenciar los tres niveles sociales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Identificar caracter\u00edsticas distintivas de micro, meso y macro estructura social<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar instituciones clave<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Comprender el rol de familia, educaci\u00f3n, econom\u00eda y gobierno en la organizaci\u00f3n social<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Visualizar interdependencias<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Mapear conexiones entre niveles y su impacto en la vida cotidiana<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar en casos reales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Analizar fen\u00f3menos sociales actuales usando el modelo tridimensional<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfe5 Sistema de Salud P\u00fablica<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Micro: consulta individual \u2192 Meso: hospital \u2192 Macro: pol\u00edticas nacionales de salud<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">3 niveles interconectados<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfeb Sistema Educativo Nacional<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Micro: estudiante en aula \u2192 Meso: escuela \u2192 Macro: secretar\u00eda de educaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Recursos: $15,000M anuales<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcbc Mercado Laboral<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Micro: trabajador \u2192 Meso: empresa \u2192 Macro: econom\u00eda nacional globalizada<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">PIB M\u00e9xico: $1.46 billones USD<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- INTRODUCCI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- DEFINICI\u00d3N PRINCIPAL -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f ORGANIZACI\u00d3N SOCIAL<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Conjunto de <strong>estructuras, relaciones e instituciones<\/strong> que permiten el funcionamiento colectivo de los individuos en una comunidad.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[ \\text{Organizaci\u00f3n Social} = \\text{Estructuras} + \\text{Relaciones} + \\text{Instituciones} \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"principios-trio\">\r\n                <div class=\"principio-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"principio-icon\">\ud83d\udd0d<\/div>\r\n                    <h5>Estructura<\/h5>\r\n                    <p>Patrones estables de relaciones sociales<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"principio-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"principio-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/div>\r\n                    <h5>Funci\u00f3n<\/h5>\r\n                    <p>Prop\u00f3sito que cumple cada componente<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"principio-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"principio-icon\">\u26a1<\/div>\r\n                    <h5>Cambio<\/h5>\r\n                    <p>Transformaci\u00f3n a trav\u00e9s del tiempo<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- NIVELES DE ORGANIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Los Tres Niveles de Organizaci\u00f3n Social<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"niveles-comparativa\">\r\n                <div class=\"nivel-card\" data-nivel=\"micro\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udc64 NIVEL MICRO<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"nivel-badge\">Individuo<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Escala:<\/strong> Individuos y relaciones cara a cara<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Enfoque:<\/strong> Interacciones personales directas<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Unidad b\u00e1sica:<\/strong> Persona y relaciones primarias<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Familia<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Relaciones de parentesco\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83d\udc65<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Grupos de amigos<\/strong><br>\r\n                                V\u00ednculos afectivos\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83e\udd1d<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Relaciones laborales directas<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Jefe-empleado\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-estadistica\">\r\n                        <span>Interacciones\/d\u00eda:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">50-100<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"nivel-card\" data-nivel=\"meso\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udfe2 NIVEL MESO<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"nivel-badge\">Instituciones<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Escala:<\/strong> Grupos e instituciones intermedias<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Enfoque:<\/strong> Organizaciones y comunidades<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Unidad b\u00e1sica:<\/strong> Organizaci\u00f3n formal\/informal<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83c\udfeb<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Escuelas<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Sistema educativo formal\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83d\udcbc<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Empresas<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Organizaciones econ\u00f3micas\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\u26ea<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Iglesias<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Instituciones religiosas\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-estadistica\">\r\n                        <span>Instituciones en M\u00e9xico:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">4.5M+<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"nivel-card\" data-nivel=\"macro\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udf10 NIVEL MACRO<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"nivel-badge\">Sociedad<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Escala:<\/strong> Sociedad global, estructuras amplias<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Enfoque:<\/strong> Sistemas y estructuras sociales<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Unidad b\u00e1sica:<\/strong> Sociedad, civilizaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Estado<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Sistema pol\u00edtico nacional\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83d\udcc8<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Econom\u00eda nacional<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Sistema econ\u00f3mico\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83c\udfad<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Cultura nacional<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Valores y tradiciones\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-estadistica\">\r\n                        <span>Poblaci\u00f3n M\u00e9xico:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">130M<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"interdependencia\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udd04 INTERDEPENDENCIA ENTRE NIVELES<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"interdependencia-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"inter-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"inter-icon\">\u2b06\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"inter-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Micro \u2192 Macro:<\/strong> Las acciones individuales colectivamente forman tendencias sociales\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"inter-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"inter-icon\">\u2b07\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"inter-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Macro \u2192 Micro:<\/strong> Las estructuras sociales condicionan oportunidades individuales\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"inter-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"inter-icon\">\u2194\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"inter-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Meso como puente:<\/strong> Las instituciones median entre individuo y sociedad\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- ELEMENTOS CLAVE -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Elementos Fundamentales de la Organizaci\u00f3n Social<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"elementos-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-card\" data-elemento=\"roles\">\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-icon\">\ud83c\udfad<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>ROLES SOCIALES<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-desc\">\r\n                        Comportamientos esperados seg\u00fan posici\u00f3n social\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Padre, Estudiante, Trabajador<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Conflictos:<\/strong> Rol de g\u00e9nero, laboral-familiar<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Adquisici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Socializaci\u00f3n primaria\/secundaria<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"elemento-card\" data-elemento=\"instituciones\">\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-icon\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>INSTITUCIONES<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-desc\">\r\n                        Estructuras sociales estables con funciones espec\u00edficas\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Tipos:<\/strong> Familia, Educaci\u00f3n, Gobierno<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Funci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Orden, estabilidad, reproducci\u00f3n social<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Cambio:<\/strong> Evoluci\u00f3n hist\u00f3rica continua<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"elemento-card\" data-elemento=\"estratos\">\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>ESTRATOS SOCIALES<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-desc\">\r\n                        Grupos diferenciados por recursos, poder y prestigio\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Bases:<\/strong> Ingreso, educaci\u00f3n, ocupaci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Movilidad:<\/strong> Ascenso\/descenso social<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Desigualdad:<\/strong> Gini M\u00e9xico: 0.415<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"elemento-card\" data-elemento=\"poder\">\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-icon\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>PODER Y AUTORIDAD<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-desc\">\r\n                        Capacidad de influir y control legitimado\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Tipos:<\/strong> Leg\u00edtima, coercitiva, experta<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Distribuci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Concentrada\/dispersa<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Legitimaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Tradici\u00f3n, ley, carisma<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TABLA COMPARATIVA DETALLADA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. An\u00e1lisis Comparativo de Niveles Sociales<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>NIVEL<\/th>\r\n                            <th>ESCALA<\/th>\r\n                            <th>UNIDAD B\u00c1SICA<\/th>\r\n                            <th>TIEMPO CARACTER\u00cdSTICO<\/th>\r\n                            <th>AN\u00c1LISIS T\u00cdPICO<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr data-nivel=\"micro\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">MICRO<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Individuos y dyadas<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Persona, relaci\u00f3n cara a cara<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Minutos - D\u00edas<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Interaccionismo simb\u00f3lico, Etnometodolog\u00eda<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-nivel=\"meso\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">MESO<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Grupos, organizaciones<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Instituci\u00f3n, comunidad<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Semanas - A\u00f1os<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Teor\u00eda de organizaciones, Ecolog\u00eda humana<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-nivel=\"macro\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">MACRO<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Sociedades, civilizaciones<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Sistema social, estructura<\/td>\r\n                            <td>A\u00f1os - Siglos<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Estructural-funcionalismo, Marxismo<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoNivel\">\r\n                    Selecciona un nivel para ver ejemplos espec\u00edficos\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> SIMULADOR: NIVELES SOCIALES INTERCONECTADOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"niveles-sociales\">\r\n            <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"fenomenoInput\">Fen\u00f3meno social:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"fenomenoInput\" class=\"control-input\" \r\n                           placeholder=\"Ej: Educaci\u00f3n, Salud, Empleo\" \r\n                           list=\"fenomenosList\">\r\n                    <datalist id=\"fenomenosList\">\r\n                        <option value=\"Educaci\u00f3n p\u00fablica\">Educaci\u00f3n p\u00fablica<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Sistema de salud\">Sistema de salud<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Mercado laboral\">Mercado laboral<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Movilidad social\">Movilidad social<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Participaci\u00f3n pol\u00edtica\">Participaci\u00f3n pol\u00edtica<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Cultura digital\">Cultura digital<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Desigualdad econ\u00f3mica\">Desigualdad econ\u00f3mica<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Cambio clim\u00e1tico\">Cambio clim\u00e1tico<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Migraci\u00f3n\">Migraci\u00f3n<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"Innovaci\u00f3n tecnol\u00f3gica\">Innovaci\u00f3n tecnol\u00f3gica<\/option>\r\n                    <\/datalist>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"nivelEnfoque\">Nivel de an\u00e1lisis:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"nivelEnfoque\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"micro\">Micro (Individual)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"meso\">Meso (Institucional)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"macro\">Macro (Social)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"todos\">Todos los niveles<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label>Dimensiones a visualizar:<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"checkbox-group\">\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"dimensiones\" value=\"actores\" checked> Actores<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"dimensiones\" value=\"instituciones\" checked> Instituciones<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"dimensiones\" value=\"recursos\"> Recursos<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"dimensiones\" value=\"poder\"> Relaciones de poder<\/label>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-clasificar\" onclick=\"analizarFenomeno()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd0d<\/span> ANALIZAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"fenomenoAleatorio()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> FEN\u00d3MENO ALEATORIO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarAnalizador()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DEL SISTEMA SOCIAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacionSocial\">\r\n                <div class=\"sistema-container\">\r\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 500\" id=\"svgSistema\">\r\n                        <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"500\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\" id=\"fondoSistema\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- MACRO -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoMacro\">\r\n                            <ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"100\" rx=\"180\" ry=\"50\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"100\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\">SISTEMA MACRO<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"120\" fill=\"#E1BEE7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">Estado, Econom\u00eda, Cultura<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- MESO -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoMeso\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"250\" r=\"120\" fill=\"#9C27B0\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"250\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\">SISTEMA MESO<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"270\" fill=\"#F3E5F5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">Instituciones, Organizaciones<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- MICRO -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoMicro\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"180\" y=\"350\" width=\"240\" height=\"80\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"#E1BEE7\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#4A148C\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\">SISTEMA MICRO<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"400\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">Individuos, Familias, Grupos<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- CONEXIONES -->\r\n                        <path id=\"conexionMacroMeso\" d=\"M300 150 Q300 200 300 230\" stroke=\"#FF9800\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                        <path id=\"conexionMesoMicro\" d=\"M300 300 Q300 330 300 350\" stroke=\"#FF9800\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                        <path id=\"conexionMicroMacro\" d=\"M300 430 Q300 450 300 100\" stroke=\"#4CAF50\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- NODOS DIN\u00c1MICOS -->\r\n                        <g id=\"actoresDinamicos\"><\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- FEN\u00d3MENO ANALIZADO -->\r\n                        <g id=\"fenomenoAnalizado\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"450\" width=\"300\" height=\"40\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FF9800\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"470\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"textoFenomeno\">FEN\u00d3MENO<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                    <\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"sistema-info\" id=\"infoSistema\">\r\n                    Selecciona un fen\u00f3meno social y haz clic en \"ANALIZAR\"\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- DATOS DE AN\u00c1LISIS -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>DATOS DE AN\u00c1LISIS<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Fen\u00f3meno:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataFenomeno\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Nivel principal:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataNivelPrincipal\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Actores clave:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataActores\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">INSTITUCIONES INVOLUCRADAS:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataInstituciones\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Recursos movilizados:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataRecursos\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Impacto social:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataImpacto\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcca ESTAD\u00cdSTICAS SOCIALES M\u00c9XICO<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Poblaci\u00f3n total:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">130M<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Hogares:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">35.2M<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Escuelas:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">265K<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Empresas registradas:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">4.5M<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Coeficiente Gini:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">0.415<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- EJEMPLO INTEGRADO -->\r\n    <section class=\"ejemplo-integrado\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-ejemplo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd0d<\/span> EJEMPLO INTEGRADO: SISTEMA EDUCATIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"ejemplo-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"ejemplo-niveles\">\r\n                <div class=\"nivel-ejemplo\" data-nivel=\"micro\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf93 MICRO: ESTUDIANTE INDIVIDUAL<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Actores:<\/strong> Mar\u00eda, 15 a\u00f1os, estudiante de secundaria<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Acciones:<\/strong> Asiste a clases, hace tareas, interact\u00faa con compa\u00f1eros<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Recursos:<\/strong> Tiempo, esfuerzo, apoyo familiar<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"nivel-metrica\">\r\n                            <span>Horas estudio\/semana:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"metrica-valor\">25<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"nivel-ejemplo\" data-nivel=\"meso\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udfeb MESO: ESCUELA SECUNDARIA<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Instituci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Escuela Secundaria T\u00e9cnica #45<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Estructura:<\/strong> Directivo, docentes, administrativos<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Recursos:<\/strong> Infraestructura, materiales, presupuesto<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"nivel-metrica\">\r\n                            <span>Alumnos:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"metrica-valor\">720<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"nivel-ejemplo\" data-nivel=\"macro\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f MACRO: SISTEMA EDUCATIVO NACIONAL<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Pol\u00edtica:<\/strong> Secretar\u00eda de Educaci\u00f3n P\u00fablica (SEP)<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Recursos:<\/strong> Presupuesto nacional: $15,000M USD<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Objetivos:<\/strong> Cobertura universal, calidad, equidad<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"nivel-metrica\">\r\n                            <span>Escuelas en M\u00e9xico:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"metrica-valor\">265,000<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"conexiones-ejemplo\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udd04 CONEXIONES E INTERDEPENDENCIAS<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"conexiones-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"conexion\">\r\n                        <div class=\"conexion-icon\">\u2b06\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"conexion-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Micro \u2192 Macro:<\/strong> El desempe\u00f1o individual de Mar\u00eda afecta estad\u00edsticas nacionales de rendimiento\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"conexion\">\r\n                        <div class=\"conexion-icon\">\u2b07\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"conexion-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Macro \u2192 Micro:<\/strong> Pol\u00edticas nacionales definen el curr\u00edculum que estudia Mar\u00eda\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"conexion\">\r\n                        <div class=\"conexion-icon\">\u2194\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"conexion-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Meso como mediador:<\/strong> La escuela implementa pol\u00edticas nacionales y atiende necesidades individuales\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 nivel social se enfoca en instituciones como escuelas y empresas?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Nivel Micro\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Nivel Meso\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Nivel Macro\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Nivel Global\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> El nivel Meso analiza instituciones intermedias.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa las caracter\u00edsticas distintivas de cada nivel.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El nivel Meso (del griego \"mesos\" = medio) se sit\u00faa entre el nivel Micro (individuos) y Macro (sociedad total). Incluye organizaciones formales como escuelas, empresas, iglesias, y comunidades locales.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es un ejemplo de interdependencia Micro \u2192 Macro?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Leyes nacionales que regulan el matrimonio\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Reglamentos escolares sobre asistencia\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Decisiones individuales de consumo que forman tendencias econ\u00f3micas\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Tradiciones familiares transmitidas por generaciones\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Las acciones micro se agregan para formar patrones macro.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> La interdependencia Micro\u2192Macro muestra c\u00f3mo lo individual afecta lo social.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Dato:<\/strong> La sociolog\u00eda estudia c\u00f3mo millones de decisiones individuales (micro) generan fen\u00f3menos sociales como tendencias econ\u00f3micas, movimientos culturales o patrones pol\u00edticos (macro). Ejemplo: el consumo individual masivo define mercados nacionales.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 elemento de organizaci\u00f3n social se refiere a comportamientos esperados seg\u00fan posici\u00f3n?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Instituciones\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Estratos sociales\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Poder y autoridad\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Roles sociales\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Los roles sociales definen expectativas de comportamiento.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la definici\u00f3n de cada elemento organizacional.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Los roles sociales (ej: \"madre\", \"estudiante\", \"empleado\") son conjuntos de comportamientos, derechos y obligaciones asociados a una posici\u00f3n social. Las instituciones son estructuras m\u00e1s amplias (familia, educaci\u00f3n), los estratos son grupos jer\u00e1rquicos, y el poder es capacidad de influencia.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES Y SOLUCIONES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR NIVELES DE AN\u00c1LISIS<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"La familia es una instituci\u00f3n del nivel Macro\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La familia como instituci\u00f3n es MACRO, pero las relaciones familiares concretas son MICRO. La familia individual (padres-hijos) es micro; la instituci\u00f3n \"familia\" en abstracto es macro.\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        \\text{Familia concreta (Micro)} \\quad \\text{Instituci\u00f3n familiar (Macro)}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Practica:<\/strong> Clasifica: 1) Juan y su esposa, 2) Matrimonio como instituci\u00f3n legal, 3) Empresa donde trabajan, 4) Sistema econ\u00f3mico nacional<\/p>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                            <strong>1) Juan y esposa:<\/strong> Micro (relaci\u00f3n interpersonal)<br>\r\n                            <strong>2) Matrimonio institucional:<\/strong> Macro (instituci\u00f3n social)<br>\r\n                            <strong>3) Empresa:<\/strong> Meso (organizaci\u00f3n)<br>\r\n                            <strong>4) Sistema econ\u00f3mico:<\/strong> Macro (estructura social)\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c OLVIDAR LA INTERDEPENDENCIA ENTRE NIVELES<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"Los niveles son compartimentos estancos sin conexi\u00f3n\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Los niveles son ANAL\u00cdTICAMENTE separables pero EMP\u00cdRICAMENTE interconectados:\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Efecto ascenso:<\/strong> Acciones micro \u2192 patrones macro (ej: votaciones individuales \u2192 gobierno nacional)<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Efecto descenso:<\/strong> Estructuras macro \u2192 oportunidades micro (ej: leyes \u2192 derechos individuales)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                        <table>\r\n                            <tr><th>Direcci\u00f3n<\/th><th>Ejemplo educativo<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Micro \u2192 Macro<\/td><td>Desempe\u00f1o estudiantil individual \u2192 estad\u00edsticas nacionales de educaci\u00f3n<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Macro \u2192 Micro<\/td><td>Pol\u00edticas educativas nacionales \u2192 curr\u00edculum que estudia cada alumno<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Meso como puente<\/td><td>Escuela implementa pol\u00edticas y atiende necesidades individuales<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <\/table>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>An\u00e1lisis Multinivel de un Fen\u00f3meno Social<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Analiza el fen\u00f3meno de la <strong>migraci\u00f3n interna en M\u00e9xico<\/strong> desde los tres niveles de organizaci\u00f3n social:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Nivel Micro: Decisiones individuales\/familiares de migrar<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Nivel Meso: Redes sociales e instituciones que facilitan\/obstaculizan<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Nivel Macro: Pol\u00edticas nacionales, tendencias econ\u00f3micas, desigualdades regionales<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Identifica para cada nivel:<\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Actores principales<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Recursos movilizados<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Instituciones involucradas<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Conexiones con otros niveles<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu an\u00e1lisis multinivel aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"10\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n modelo:<\/strong><br><br>\r\n                    <strong>Nivel Micro:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 Actores: Individuos y familias que deciden migrar<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Recursos: Ahorros, habilidades, redes personales<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Motivaciones: Empleo, educaci\u00f3n, seguridad<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Conexi\u00f3n meso: Usan redes de parientes ya establecidos<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>Nivel Meso:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 Instituciones: Agencias de empleo, transporte, albergues<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Redes: Comunidades de origen en destino (paisanos)<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Organizaciones: ONGs, iglesias que apoyan migrantes<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Conexi\u00f3n macro: Implementan\/afectan pol\u00edticas nacionales<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>Nivel Macro:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 Pol\u00edticas: Programas de desarrollo regional, pol\u00edticas laborales<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Estructuras: Desigualdad norte-sur, concentraci\u00f3n econ\u00f3mica<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Estad\u00edsticas: 5.4 millones de migrantes internos (2020)<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Conexi\u00f3n micro: Condicionan oportunidades individuales\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Dise\u00f1o de Intervenci\u00f3n Social<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Dise\u00f1a una intervenci\u00f3n para mejorar <strong>el acceso a educaci\u00f3n superior en comunidades rurales<\/strong> considerando los tres niveles:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Micro: \u00bfC\u00f3mo motivar a j\u00f3venes individuales?<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Meso: \u00bfQu\u00e9 instituciones deben involucrarse?<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Macro: \u00bfQu\u00e9 pol\u00edticas p\u00fablicas se requieren?<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Tu dise\u00f1o debe incluir:<\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Acciones espec\u00edficas por nivel<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Recursos necesarios<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Indicadores de \u00e9xito<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Posibles conflictos entre niveles<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Describe tu dise\u00f1o de intervenci\u00f3n...\" rows=\"10\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR PROCEDIMIENTO<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Intervenci\u00f3n modelo:<\/strong><br><br>\r\n                    <strong>Nivel Micro (Motivaci\u00f3n individual):<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 Mentor\u00edas personalizadas con universitarios de origen rural<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Talleres de orientaci\u00f3n vocacional en preparatorias<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Visitas a universidades para familiarizaci\u00f3n<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Indicador:<\/em> % de estudiantes que aplican a universidad<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>Nivel Meso (Instituciones intermedias):<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 Alianzas escuela-preparatoria-universidad<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Programas de transporte y alojamiento subsidiado<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Becas gestionadas por organizaciones comunitarias<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Indicador:<\/em> N\u00famero de alianzas institucionales<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>Nivel Macro (Pol\u00edticas p\u00fablicas):<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 Pol\u00edtica nacional de educaci\u00f3n rural inclusiva<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Presupuesto espec\u00edfico para transporte rural<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Cuotas diferenciadas en universidades p\u00fablicas<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Indicador:<\/em> Presupuesto asignado, leyes aprobadas<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>Posibles conflictos:<\/strong> Recursos macro pueden no llegar a micro si meso es ineficiente; pol\u00edticas nacionales pueden no considerar realidades locales.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Diferenciaci\u00f3n niveles<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Clara distinci\u00f3n micro\/meso\/macro con ejemplos precisos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Diferenciaci\u00f3n b\u00e1sica con alg\u00fan solapamiento<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Confusi\u00f3n entre niveles o omisi\u00f3n de alguno<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis interdependencia<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Identifica conexiones bidireccionales entre niveles<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Menciona algunas conexiones unidireccionales<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Trata niveles como compartimentos estancos<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Aplicaci\u00f3n a casos reales<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Propone intervenciones viables con recursos identificados<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Sugiere intervenciones gen\u00e9ricas<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No aplica teor\u00eda a casos concretos<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n niveles micro\/meso\/macro:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>An\u00e1lisis interdependencia entre niveles:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Aplicaci\u00f3n a fen\u00f3menos sociales reales:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo afectan las estructuras macro (leyes, econom\u00eda) a tus decisiones micro (estudios, trabajo, familia)?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Describe una instituci\u00f3n meso (escuela, empresa, iglesia) en la que participas y analiza c\u00f3mo conecta tu vida individual con la sociedad.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu an\u00e1lisis...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd04 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Memorizar definiciones de micro\/meso\/macro<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Recordar 4 elementos clave de organizaci\u00f3n social<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Repasar ejemplos de cada nivel<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcaa PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Analizar 5 fen\u00f3menos sociales usando los 3 niveles<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Completar el simulador con diferentes casos<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Resolver el quiz interactivo<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\ude80 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Investigar teor\u00edas sociol\u00f3gicas espec\u00edficas<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Analizar datos estad\u00edsticos nacionales<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Dise\u00f1ar intervenciones sociales multinivel<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.inegi.org.mx\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcca INEGI: Estad\u00edsticas sociales de M\u00e9xico\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.jstor.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcda JSTOR: Art\u00edculos acad\u00e9micos de sociolog\u00eda\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/es.khanacademy.org\/test-prep\/mcat\/society-and-culture\/social-structures\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf93 Khan Academy: Estructuras sociales\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.thoughtco.com\/micro-meso-and-macro-levels-3026398\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83e\udde0 ThoughtCo: Niveles de an\u00e1lisis sociol\u00f3gico\r\n                <\/a>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n    <script>\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE AN\u00c1LISIS SOCIAL INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Base de datos de fen\u00f3menos sociales\r\n    const fenomenosDB = {\r\n        \"Educaci\u00f3n p\u00fablica\": {\r\n            nivelPrincipal: \"MESO\",\r\n            actores: \"Estudiantes, Docentes, Padres, Administradores\",\r\n            instituciones: \"SEP, Escuelas, Universidades, Sindicatos\",\r\n            recursos: \"Presupuesto: $15,000M USD, Infraestructura, Materiales\",\r\n            impacto: \"Alfabetizaci\u00f3n: 94.9%, Movilidad social, Desarrollo econ\u00f3mico\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"Escuelas rurales, Educaci\u00f3n t\u00e9cnica, Universidad p\u00fablica\",\r\n            color: \"#7B1FA2\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"Sistema de salud\": {\r\n            nivelPrincipal: \"MACRO\",\r\n            actores: \"Pacientes, M\u00e9dicos, Enfermeras, Administradores\",\r\n            instituciones: \"IMSS, ISSSTE, Hospitales, Cl\u00ednicas\",\r\n            recursos: \"Presupuesto: $75,000M MXN, Hospitales: 4,800, Personal: 800K\",\r\n            impacto: \"Esperanza vida: 75.1 a\u00f1os, Mortalidad infantil: 12.3\/1000\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"Seguro Popular, Hospitales generales, Campa\u00f1as vacunaci\u00f3n\",\r\n            color: \"#9C27B0\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"Mercado laboral\": {\r\n            nivelPrincipal: \"MACRO\",\r\n            actores: \"Trabajadores, Empleadores, Desempleados, Subempleados\",\r\n            instituciones: \"STPS, Empresas, Sindicatos, Bolsas de trabajo\",\r\n            recursos: \"Poblaci\u00f3n econ\u00f3micamente activa: 57M, Salario promedio: $11,200 MXN\",\r\n            impacto: \"Desempleo: 3.4%, Informalidad: 56.2%, Productividad\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"Empleo formal, Trabajo informal, Subempleo, Teletrabajo\",\r\n            color: \"#E1BEE7\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"Movilidad social\": {\r\n            nivelPrincipal: \"MICRO-MACRO\",\r\n            actores: \"Individuos, Familias, Generaciones\",\r\n            instituciones: \"Educaci\u00f3n, Mercado laboral, Pol\u00edticas redistributivas\",\r\n            recursos: \"Educaci\u00f3n, Capital social, Herencia, Oportunidades\",\r\n            impacto: \"Coeficiente movilidad: 0.34, Reproducci\u00f3n desigualdad\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"Ascenso educativo, Movilidad ocupacional, Herencia riqueza\",\r\n            color: \"#4A148C\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"Participaci\u00f3n pol\u00edtica\": {\r\n            nivelPrincipal: \"MESO-MACRO\",\r\n            actores: \"Ciudadanos, Partidos, Movimientos, Gobierno\",\r\n            instituciones: \"INE, Partidos pol\u00edticos, Congreso, Gobierno\",\r\n            recursos: \"Participaci\u00f3n electoral: 63%, Presupuesto partidos: $4,500M MXN\",\r\n            impacto: \"Legitimidad democr\u00e1tica, Representaci\u00f3n, Pol\u00edticas p\u00fablicas\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"Votaciones, Protestas, Activismo, Lobby\",\r\n            color: \"#7B1FA2\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"Cultura digital\": {\r\n            nivelPrincipal: \"MICRO-MACRO\",\r\n            actores: \"Usuarios, Plataformas, Creadores, Reguladores\",\r\n            instituciones: \"Redes sociales, Plataformas, Gobierno digital\",\r\n            recursos: \"Usuarios internet: 82M, Penetraci\u00f3n: 65%, Contenido generado\",\r\n            impacto: \"Comunicaci\u00f3n, Informaci\u00f3n, Econom\u00eda digital, Privacidad\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"Redes sociales, E-commerce, Teletrabajo, Educaci\u00f3n online\",\r\n            color: \"#9C27B0\"\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Matriz de interdependencias\r\n    const interdependencias = {\r\n        \"Educaci\u00f3n p\u00fablica\": {\r\n            micro: \"Decisiones individuales de estudiar\",\r\n            meso: \"Escuelas que implementan curr\u00edculum\",\r\n            macro: \"Pol\u00edticas nacionales de educaci\u00f3n\",\r\n            conexiones: \"Micro\u2192Meso: Asistencia; Meso\u2192Macro: Resultados; Macro\u2192Micro: Oportunidades\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"Sistema de salud\": {\r\n            micro: \"H\u00e1bitos saludables individuales\",\r\n            meso: \"Hospitales que atienden pacientes\",\r\n            macro: \"Pol\u00edticas nacionales de salud\",\r\n            conexiones: \"Micro\u2192Macro: Enfermedades cr\u00f3nicas; Macro\u2192Micro: Acceso a servicios\"\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    function analizarFenomeno() {\r\n        console.log(\"\ud83d\udd0d Analizando fen\u00f3meno social...\");\r\n        \r\n        const input = document.getElementById('fenomenoInput').value.trim();\r\n        if (!input) {\r\n            alert(\"\u26a0\ufe0f Por favor, ingresa un fen\u00f3meno social\");\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Buscar coincidencia aproximada\r\n        let fenomenoEncontrado = null;\r\n        for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(fenomenosDB)) {\r\n            if (input.toLowerCase().includes(key.toLowerCase()) || \r\n                key.toLowerCase().includes(input.toLowerCase())) {\r\n                fenomenoEncontrado = { nombre: key, ...value };\r\n                break;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        if (!fenomenoEncontrado) {\r\n            \/\/ Si no se encuentra, crear an\u00e1lisis basado en nivel seleccionado\r\n            const nivel = document.getElementById('nivelEnfoque').value;\r\n            const checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"dimensiones\"]:checked');\r\n            const dimensiones = Array.from(checkboxes).map(cb => cb.value);\r\n            \r\n            fenomenoEncontrado = analizarPorNivel(input, nivel, dimensiones);\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n        actualizarVisualizacionSocial(fenomenoEncontrado);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos de an\u00e1lisis\r\n        document.getElementById('dataFenomeno').textContent = fenomenoEncontrado.nombre;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataNivelPrincipal').textContent = fenomenoEncontrado.nivelPrincipal;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataActores').textContent = fenomenoEncontrado.actores;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataInstituciones').textContent = fenomenoEncontrado.instituciones;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataRecursos').textContent = fenomenoEncontrado.recursos;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataImpacto').textContent = fenomenoEncontrado.impacto;\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoSistema').textContent = \r\n            `An\u00e1lisis: ${fenomenoEncontrado.nombre} \u2192 Nivel principal: ${fenomenoEncontrado.nivelPrincipal}`;\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcca Analizado: ${fenomenoEncontrado.nombre} en nivel ${fenomenoEncontrado.nivelPrincipal}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function analizarPorNivel(nombre, nivel, dimensiones) {\r\n        let nivelPrincipal = nivel.toUpperCase();\r\n        let actores = \"Actores relevantes seg\u00fan nivel\";\r\n        let instituciones = \"Instituciones involucradas\";\r\n        let recursos = \"Recursos movilizados\";\r\n        let impacto = \"Impacto social esperado\";\r\n        let ejemplos = \"Ejemplos relacionados\";\r\n        let color = \"#7B1FA2\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Configurar seg\u00fan nivel\r\n        if (nivel === \"micro\") {\r\n            actores = \"Individuos, Familias, Relaciones cara a cara\";\r\n            instituciones = \"Familia, Grupos primarios, Redes personales\";\r\n            recursos = \"Tiempo, Esfuerzo, Capital social personal\";\r\n            impacto = \"Decisiones individuales, Bienestar personal\";\r\n            color = \"#E1BEE7\";\r\n        } else if (nivel === \"meso\") {\r\n            actores = \"Organizaciones, Comunidades, Grupos formales\";\r\n            instituciones = \"Escuelas, Empresas, Iglesias, ONGs\";\r\n            recursos = \"Presupuesto organizacional, Infraestructura, Personal\";\r\n            impacto = \"Eficiencia organizacional, Servicios a comunidad\";\r\n            color = \"#9C27B0\";\r\n        } else if (nivel === \"macro\") {\r\n            actores = \"Sociedad, Estado, Clases sociales, Movimientos\";\r\n            instituciones = \"Gobierno, Sistema econ\u00f3mico, Cultura nacional\";\r\n            recursos = \"Presupuesto nacional, Pol\u00edticas, Leyes, Tradiciones\";\r\n            impacto = \"Desarrollo nacional, Equidad, Cohesi\u00f3n social\";\r\n            color = \"#7B1FA2\";\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        return { nombre, nivelPrincipal, actores, instituciones, recursos, impacto, ejemplos, color };\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function actualizarVisualizacionSocial(fenomeno) {\r\n        const svg = document.getElementById('svgSistema');\r\n        const color = fenomeno.color;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('#svgSistema g[id^=\"nodo\"]').forEach(nodo => {\r\n            nodo.setAttribute('opacity', '0.3');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.querySelectorAll('#svgSistema path').forEach(path => {\r\n            path.style.stroke = '';\r\n            path.style.strokeWidth = '';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Resaltar seg\u00fan nivel principal\r\n        if (fenomeno.nivelPrincipal.includes(\"MICRO\")) {\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoMicro').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionMesoMicro').style.stroke = color;\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionMesoMicro').style.strokeWidth = '3';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        if (fenomeno.nivelPrincipal.includes(\"MESO\")) {\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoMeso').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionMacroMeso').style.stroke = color;\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionMacroMeso').style.strokeWidth = '3';\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionMesoMicro').style.stroke = color;\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionMesoMicro').style.strokeWidth = '3';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        if (fenomeno.nivelPrincipal.includes(\"MACRO\")) {\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoMacro').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionMacroMeso').style.stroke = color;\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionMacroMeso').style.strokeWidth = '3';\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionMicroMacro').style.stroke = color;\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionMicroMacro').style.strokeWidth = '2';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar fen\u00f3meno analizado\r\n        const fenomenoElem = document.getElementById('fenomenoAnalizado');\r\n        fenomenoElem.style.opacity = '1';\r\n        fenomenoElem.querySelector('rect').setAttribute('fill', color);\r\n        document.getElementById('textoFenomeno').textContent = fenomeno.nombre;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Agregar nodos din\u00e1micos para actores\r\n        const actoresDinamicos = document.getElementById('actoresDinamicos');\r\n        actoresDinamicos.innerHTML = '';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Crear peque\u00f1os c\u00edrculos para representar actores\r\n        const niveles = fenomeno.nivelPrincipal.split('-');\r\n        niveles.forEach((nivel, index) => {\r\n            const x = 100 + (index * 200);\r\n            const y = nivel.includes(\"MICRO\") ? 380 : \r\n                     nivel.includes(\"MESO\") ? 250 : 100;\r\n            \r\n            const circle = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n            circle.setAttribute('cx', x);\r\n            circle.setAttribute('cy', y);\r\n            circle.setAttribute('r', '8');\r\n            circle.setAttribute('fill', color);\r\n            circle.setAttribute('opacity', '0.8');\r\n            circle.setAttribute('class', 'actor-dinamico');\r\n            \r\n            actoresDinamicos.appendChild(circle);\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n\r\n        fenomenoElem.style.animation = 'pulse 2s';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function fenomenoAleatorio() {\r\n        const fenomenos = Object.keys(fenomenosDB);\r\n        const aleatorio = fenomenos[Math.floor(Math.random() * fenomenos.length)];\r\n        document.getElementById('fenomenoInput').value = aleatorio;\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoSistema').textContent = \r\n            `Fen\u00f3meno aleatorio seleccionado: ${aleatorio}. Haz clic en \"ANALIZAR\".`;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarAnalizador() {\r\n        console.log(\"\ud83d\udd04 Reiniciando analizador social...\");\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('fenomenoInput').value = '';\r\n        document.getElementById('nivelEnfoque').value = 'todos';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar checkboxes\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"dimensiones\"]').forEach(cb => {\r\n            cb.checked = true;\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('#svgSistema g[id^=\"nodo\"]').forEach(nodo => {\r\n            nodo.setAttribute('opacity', '0.7');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.querySelectorAll('#svgSistema path').forEach(path => {\r\n            path.style.stroke = '';\r\n            path.style.strokeWidth = '';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('fenomenoAnalizado').style.opacity = '0';\r\n        document.getElementById('actoresDinamicos').innerHTML = '';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar datos\r\n        document.getElementById('dataFenomeno').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataNivelPrincipal').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataActores').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataInstituciones').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataRecursos').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataImpacto').textContent = '-';\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoSistema').textContent = \r\n            \"Selecciona un fen\u00f3meno social y haz clic en 'ANALIZAR'\";\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    let quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n    \r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n            \r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            verificarCompletadoQuiz();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    function verificarCompletadoQuiz() {\r\n        const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n        const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q => \r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n        \r\n        if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n        const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n        \r\n        let feedback = \"\";\r\n        if (porcentaje >= 80) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas los niveles de organizaci\u00f3n social.\";\r\n        } else if (porcentaje >= 60) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero revisa las interdependencias entre niveles.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas repasar la diferenciaci\u00f3n micro\/meso\/macro.\";\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        quizRespuestas = [];\r\n        quizCompletado = false;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE ERRORES COMUNES\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function toggleError(header) {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n        \r\n        if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        } else {\r\n            content.style.display = 'block';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function verificarProblema(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n        const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n        const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n        \r\n        const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n        \r\n        alert(`\ud83d\udcca AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Comprensi\u00f3n niveles: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `An\u00e1lisis interdependencia: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Aplicaci\u00f3n a casos reales: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Revisa el plan de estudio recomendado seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcbe AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada: ${slider1}, ${slider2}, ${slider3}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Sistema Cyberpunk Educativo inicializado\");\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Lecci\u00f3n: Organizaci\u00f3n de la Sociedad\");\r\n    console.log(\"\u26a1 Simulador social, Quiz y Herramientas interactivas listas\");\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Tabla interactiva de niveles\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(row => {\r\n        row.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const nivel = this.dataset.nivel;\r\n            const info = document.getElementById('infoNivel');\r\n            \r\n            const infoTextos = {\r\n                micro: \"Nivel Micro: An\u00e1lisis de individuos y relaciones cara a cara. Teor\u00edas: Interaccionismo simb\u00f3lico, Etnometodolog\u00eda. Ejemplos: relaciones familiares, amistades, interacciones cotidianas.\",\r\n                meso: \"Nivel Meso: An\u00e1lisis de organizaciones e instituciones. Teor\u00edas: Teor\u00eda de organizaciones, Ecolog\u00eda humana. Ejemplos: escuelas, empresas, iglesias, comunidades locales.\",\r\n                macro: \"Nivel Macro: An\u00e1lisis de sistemas sociales completos. Teor\u00edas: Estructural-funcionalismo, Marxismo, Teor\u00eda de sistemas. Ejemplos: Estado, econom\u00eda nacional, cultura, estratificaci\u00f3n social.\"\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            info.textContent = infoTextos[nivel] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\";\r\n            info.style.animation = \"highlight 0.5s\";\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            document.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(r => {\r\n                r.classList.remove('selected');\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Marcar fila seleccionada\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Elementos interactivos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.elemento-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const elemento = this.dataset.elemento;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar informaci\u00f3n detallada\r\n            const elementosInfo = {\r\n                roles: \"Roles sociales: Comportamientos esperados seg\u00fan posici\u00f3n. Conflictos de rol: cuando expectativas son contradictorias. Socializaci\u00f3n: proceso de aprendizaje de roles.\",\r\n                instituciones: \"Instituciones: Estructuras sociales estables. Funciones: Orden, estabilidad, reproducci\u00f3n social. Tipos: Familia, Educaci\u00f3n, Religi\u00f3n, Gobierno, Econom\u00eda.\",\r\n                estratos: \"Estratos sociales: Grupos jer\u00e1rquicos. Bases: Ingreso, educaci\u00f3n, ocupaci\u00f3n, prestigio. Movilidad social: Ascenso\/descenso entre estratos. Desigualdad: Coeficiente Gini.\",\r\n                poder: \"Poder y autoridad: Capacidad de influir y control legitimado. Tipos seg\u00fan Weber: Tradicional, legal-racional, carism\u00e1tica. Distribuci\u00f3n: Concentrada vs. dispersa.\"\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            alert(`\u2696\ufe0f ${this.querySelector('h4').textContent}\\n\\n${elementosInfo[elemento] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\"}`);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Objetivos interactivos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n            this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n            const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n            checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n            checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : '';\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Ejemplos de niveles interactivos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.nivel-ejemplo').forEach(nivel => {\r\n        nivel.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const nivelTipo = this.dataset.nivel;\r\n            const titulo = this.querySelector('h4').textContent;\r\n            const contenido = this.querySelector('.nivel-content').innerHTML;\r\n            \r\n            alert(`\ud83d\udd0d ${titulo}\\n\\n${contenido.replace(\/<[^>]*>\/g, '\\n')}`);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Agregar filtro glow al SVG\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById('svgSistema');\r\n    const defs = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'defs');\r\n    const filter = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'filter');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('id', 'glow');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('x', '-50%');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('y', '-50%');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('width', '200%');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('height', '200%');\r\n    \r\n    const feGaussianBlur = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feGaussianBlur');\r\n    feGaussianBlur.setAttribute('stdDeviation', '4');\r\n    feGaussianBlur.setAttribute('result', 'coloredBlur');\r\n    \r\n    const feMerge = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMerge');\r\n    const feMergeNode1 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMergeNode');\r\n    feMergeNode1.setAttribute('in', 'coloredBlur');\r\n    const feMergeNode2 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMergeNode');\r\n    feMergeNode2.setAttribute('in', 'SourceGraphic');\r\n    \r\n    feMerge.appendChild(feMergeNode1);\r\n    feMerge.appendChild(feMergeNode2);\r\n    filter.appendChild(feGaussianBlur);\r\n    filter.appendChild(feMerge);\r\n    defs.appendChild(filter);\r\n    svg.appendChild(defs);\r\n    <\/script>\r\n    \r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Tres niveles de organizaci\u00f3n social","respuesta":"Micro, meso, macro"},{"enunciado":"Nivel micro incluye","respuesta":"Familia, individuos"},{"enunciado":"Nivel meso incluye","respuesta":"Escuelas, empresas"},{"enunciado":"Nivel macro incluye","respuesta":"Estado, econom\u00eda nacional"},{"enunciado":"Ejemplo de rol social","respuesta":"Maestro, padre, ciudadano"},{"enunciado":"Instituci\u00f3n clave en M\u00e9xico","respuesta":"INE, IMSS, SEP"},{"enunciado":"Estratificaci\u00f3n social mide","respuesta":"Desigualdad por ingreso, educaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Poder leg\u00edtimo es","respuesta":"Autoridad"},{"enunciado":"Familia \u2192 escuela \u2192 gobierno","respuesta":"Micro \u2192 meso \u2192 macro"},{"enunciado":"M\u00e9xico: macro ejemplo","respuesta":"Constituci\u00f3n, PIB"},{"enunciado":"Interdependencia significa","respuesta":"Niveles se afectan mutuamente"},{"enunciado":"SI: sociedad compleja","respuesta":"Alta divisi\u00f3n del trabajo"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Nivel micro","opciones":["Individuos y familia","Estado","Empresas","Global"],"correcta":"Individuos y familia"},{"pregunta":"Nivel meso","opciones":["Grupos e instituciones","Individuos","Naci\u00f3n","Mundo"],"correcta":"Grupos e instituciones"},{"pregunta":"Nivel macro","opciones":["Sociedad global","Familia","Escuela","Amigos"],"correcta":"Sociedad global"},{"pregunta":"Organizaci\u00f3n social permite","opciones":["Cooperaci\u00f3n y orden","Caos","Aislamiento","Nada"],"correcta":"Cooperaci\u00f3n y orden"},{"pregunta":"Rol social es","opciones":["Comportamiento esperado","Trabajo","Dinero","Ley"],"correcta":"Comportamiento esperado"},{"pregunta":"Instituci\u00f3n es","opciones":["Estructura estable","Persona","Evento","Objeto"],"correcta":"Estructura estable"},{"pregunta":"Estratos sociales miden","opciones":["Desigualdad","Igualdad","Poblaci\u00f3n","Territorio"],"correcta":"Desigualdad"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: instituci\u00f3n macro","opciones":["INE","Familia","Escuela","Amigos"],"correcta":"INE"},{"pregunta":"Interdependencia","opciones":["Niveles se influyen","Independientes","Separados","Iguales"],"correcta":"Niveles se influyen"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: M\u00e9xico poblaci\u00f3n","opciones":["~130 millones","100M","200M","50M"],"correcta":"~130 millones"},{"pregunta":"Familia es nivel","opciones":["Micro","Meso","Macro","Ninguno"],"correcta":"Micro"},{"pregunta":"SEP es nivel","opciones":["Meso","Micro","Macro","Ninguno"],"correcta":"Meso"},{"pregunta":"Constituci\u00f3n es nivel","opciones":["Macro","Micro","Meso","Ninguno"],"correcta":"Macro"},{"pregunta":"Poder leg\u00edtimo","opciones":["Autoridad","Fuerza","Dinero","Fama"],"correcta":"Autoridad"},{"pregunta":"Clase social depende de","opciones":["Ingreso, educaci\u00f3n","Edad","G\u00e9nero","Color"],"correcta":"Ingreso, educaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: estratificaci\u00f3n alta","opciones":["S\u00ed (\u00edndice Gini)","No","Igual","Perfecta"],"correcta":"S\u00ed (\u00edndice Gini)"},{"pregunta":"Escuela socializa en","opciones":["Normas y valores","Solo matem\u00e1ticas","Nada","Juegos"],"correcta":"Normas y valores"},{"pregunta":"Empresa es","opciones":["Instituci\u00f3n meso","Micro","Macro","Personal"],"correcta":"Instituci\u00f3n meso"},{"pregunta":"Globalizaci\u00f3n afecta","opciones":["Nivel macro","Solo micro","Nada","Meso"],"correcta":"Nivel macro"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: sociedad digital","opciones":["Redes conectan niveles","Solo micro","Solo macro","Nada"],"correcta":"Redes conectan niveles"},{"pregunta":"Individuo \u2192 grupo \u2192 estado","opciones":["Micro \u2192 meso \u2192 macro","Macro \u2192 meso \u2192 micro","Aleatorio","Igual"],"correcta":"Micro \u2192 meso \u2192 macro"},{"pregunta":"Cambio en micro afecta","opciones":["Puede escalar a macro","Solo micro","Nada","Meso"],"correcta":"Puede escalar a macro"},{"pregunta":"Protesta social inicia en","opciones":["Micro\/meso","Macro","Gobierno","Exterior"],"correcta":"Micro\/meso"},{"pregunta":"Ley educativa es","opciones":["Macro","Meso","Micro","Ninguno"],"correcta":"Macro"},{"pregunta":"Amistad es","opciones":["Relaci\u00f3n micro","Meso","Macro","Instituci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Relaci\u00f3n micro"},{"pregunta":"INEGI mide","opciones":["Nivel macro","Micro","Meso","Personal"],"correcta":"Nivel macro"},{"pregunta":"Familia nuclear es","opciones":["Microestructura","Meso","Macro","Global"],"correcta":"Microestructura"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: federalismo","opciones":["Organizaci\u00f3n macro","Micro","Meso","Local"],"correcta":"Organizaci\u00f3n macro"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: sociedad inclusiva","opciones":["Equidad en todos niveles","Solo macro","Solo micro","Nada"],"correcta":"Equidad en todos niveles"},{"pregunta":"Organizaci\u00f3n social es","opciones":["Din\u00e1mica y cambiante","Est\u00e1tica","Fija","Inmutable"],"correcta":"Din\u00e1mica y cambiante"}]},{"materia":"Ciencias Sociales","slug":"normas-sociales-juridicas","titulo":"Normas Sociales vs. Jur\u00eddicas: El C\u00f3digo de la Convivencia","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-ciencias-sociales-normas\" data-tema=\"normas-sociales-juridicas\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/span> NORMAS SOCIALES Y JUR\u00cdDICAS\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            El equilibrio entre lo informal y lo formal en la sociedad\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Diferenciar normas sociales y jur\u00eddicas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Identificar caracter\u00edsticas, ejemplos y sanciones de cada tipo.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar conflictos entre normas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Evaluar casos donde normas sociales y jur\u00eddicas chocan.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar el conocimiento a situaciones reales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Resolver casos pr\u00e1cticos y reflexionar sobre su impacto.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcf1 Leyes de Privacidad Digital (2025)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Normas jur\u00eddicas que regulan el uso de datos personales en redes sociales.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">180 pa\u00edses con leyes de protecci\u00f3n de datos<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udc57 Normas de G\u00e9nero en Escuelas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Conflicto entre costumbres sociales y leyes de inclusi\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">65% de escuelas con pol\u00edticas de g\u00e9nero<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\ude97 Leyes de Movilidad (CDMX 2024)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Normas jur\u00eddicas que buscan cambiar h\u00e1bitos sociales de transporte.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Reducci\u00f3n del 30% en accidentes<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TIPOS DE NORMAS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Tipos de Normas<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"comparativa-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"comp-card social\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udc65 NORMAS SOCIALES<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"comp-badge\">Informales | Culturales<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Definici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Reglas no escritas basadas en costumbres y tradiciones.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Origen:<\/strong> Consenso comunitario.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Sanci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Rechazo social, exclusi\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"simbolo\">\ud83e\udd1d<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"nombre\">Saludar al entrar a un lugar<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"simbolo\">\u23f0<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"nombre\">Ser puntual en reuniones<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"comp-card juridica\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\u2696\ufe0f NORMAS JUR\u00cdDICAS<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"comp-badge\">Formales | Estatales<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Definici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Reglas escritas y obligatorias creadas por el Estado.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Origen:<\/strong> Poder legislativo.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Sanci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Multas, prisi\u00f3n, juicios.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"simbolo\">\ud83d\udcdc<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"nombre\">C\u00f3digo Penal (Art. 171: Conducir ebrio)<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"simbolo\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"nombre\">Constituci\u00f3n (Derechos humanos)<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- RELACI\u00d3N ENTRE NORMAS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Relaci\u00f3n entre Normas Sociales y Jur\u00eddicas<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"regla-oro\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udd04 DIN\u00c1MICA DE INTERACCI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"regla-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"regla-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-icon\">\u2197\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-text\">\r\n                            <strong>De Social a Jur\u00eddica:<\/strong> Cuando una norma social se institucionaliza (ej. matrimonio igualitario).\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"regla-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-icon\">\u2198\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-text\">\r\n                            <strong>De Jur\u00eddica a Social:<\/strong> Cuando una ley cambia costumbres (ej. prohibici\u00f3n de fumar en lugares p\u00fablicos).\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"regla-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Conflicto:<\/strong> Cuando ley y costumbre chocan (ej. derechos ind\u00edgenas vs. leyes estatales).\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- SVG INTERACTIVO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Evoluci\u00f3n de las Normas<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"svg-diagram\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 500\" id=\"svgNormas\">\r\n                    <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\" id=\"fondoNormas\"\/>\r\n                    <!-- Norma Social -->\r\n                    <g id=\"normaSocial\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"100\" y=\"150\" width=\"250\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#FF00FF\" rx=\"15\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"225\" y=\"200\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">NORMAS SOCIALES<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"225\" y=\"230\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Informales | Costumbres<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"225\" y=\"260\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sanci\u00f3n: Rechazo<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    <!-- Norma Jur\u00eddica -->\r\n                    <g id=\"normaJuridica\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"450\" y=\"150\" width=\"250\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\" rx=\"15\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"575\" y=\"200\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">NORMAS JUR\u00cdDICAS<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"575\" y=\"230\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Formales | Leyes<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"575\" y=\"260\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sanci\u00f3n: Legal<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    <!-- Flecha de interacci\u00f3n -->\r\n                    <line x1=\"375\" y1=\"225\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#00FFAA\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#flecha)\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"412\" y=\"210\" fill=\"#00FFAA\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\u2194 CONFLICTO\/ARMON\u00cdA<\/text>\r\n                    <!-- Evoluci\u00f3n -->\r\n                    <g id=\"evolucionSocial\">\r\n                        <path d=\"M200 350 Q250 300 300 350 Q250 400 200 350\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF9800\" stroke-width=\"3\">\r\n                            <animate attributeName=\"d\" values=\"M200 350 Q250 300 300 350 Q250 400 200 350; M200 350 Q250 280 300 350 Q250 420 200 350; M200 350 Q250 300 300 350 Q250 400 200 350\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                        <\/path>\r\n                        <text x=\"250\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#FF9800\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Social \u2192 Jur\u00eddica<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"250\" y=\"400\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ej: Matrimonio igualitario<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    <g id=\"evolucionJuridica\">\r\n                        <path d=\"M500 350 Q550 300 600 350 Q550 400 500 350\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4CAF50\" stroke-width=\"3\">\r\n                            <animate attributeName=\"d\" values=\"M500 350 Q550 300 600 350 Q550 400 500 350; M500 350 Q550 280 600 350 Q550 420 500 350; M500 350 Q550 300 600 350 Q550 400 500 350\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                        <\/path>\r\n                        <text x=\"550\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Jur\u00eddica \u2192 Social<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"550\" y=\"400\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ej: Prohibici\u00f3n de fumar<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: CONFLICTOS NORMATIVOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"conflictos-normativos\">\r\n            <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udccb CASOS DE ESTUDIO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"casoInput\">Selecciona un caso:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"casoInput\" class=\"control-input\">\r\n                        <option value=\"matrimonio-igualitario\">Matrimonio Igualitario<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"derechos-indigenas\">Derechos Ind\u00edgenas vs. Leyes Estatales<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"privacidad-digital\">Privacidad Digital<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"movilidad-urbana\">Movilidad Urbana<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"contexto\">Contexto:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"contexto\" class=\"control-input\">\r\n                        <option value=\"mexico\">M\u00e9xico (2025)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"espana\">Espa\u00f1a<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"eeuu\">EE.UU.<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-analizar\" onclick=\"analizarCaso()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd0d<\/span> ANALIZAR CASO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <div class=\"caso-detalle\" id=\"detalleCaso\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcc4 DETALLES DEL CASO<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"caso-contenido\">\r\n                        <p id=\"casoDescripcion\">Selecciona un caso y haz clic en \"ANALIZAR CASO\".<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"caso-datos\">\r\n                            <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"dato-label\">Norma Social:<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"dato-value\" id=\"normaSocial\">\u2014<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"dato-label\">Norma Jur\u00eddica:<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"dato-value\" id=\"normaJuridica\">\u2014<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"dato-label\">Conflicto:<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"dato-value\" id=\"conflicto\">\u2014<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato-item\">\r\n                                <span class=\"dato-label\">Soluci\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"dato-value\" id=\"solucion\">\u2014<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca DATOS LEGALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Pa\u00eds:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPais\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">A\u00f1o:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataAnio\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Ley Aplicable:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataLey\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Impacto Social:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataImpacto\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es una sanci\u00f3n t\u00edpica de una norma social?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Multa econ\u00f3mica\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Rechazo social\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Prisi\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> El rechazo social es la sanci\u00f3n m\u00e1s com\u00fan para normas sociales.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Las multas y la prisi\u00f3n son sanciones jur\u00eddicas.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 norma es formal y escrita?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Saludar al entrar\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Ser puntual\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        C\u00f3digo Penal\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> El C\u00f3digo Penal es una norma jur\u00eddica formal.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Las otras opciones son normas sociales informales.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                    Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/2\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                    Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR NORMAS SOCIALES CON JUR\u00cdDICAS<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"El C\u00f3digo Penal es una norma social porque todos lo conocen.\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El C\u00f3digo Penal es una <strong>norma jur\u00eddica<\/strong> porque est\u00e1 escrita, es obligatoria y tiene sanciones legales.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Practica:<\/strong> Clasifica: Saludar, C\u00f3digo Civil, Vestir de luto.<\/p>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                            <strong>Saludar:<\/strong> Norma social<br>\r\n                            <strong>C\u00f3digo Civil:<\/strong> Norma jur\u00eddica<br>\r\n                            <strong>Vestir de luto:<\/strong> Norma social\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c IGNORAR LA EVOLUCI\u00d3N DE LAS NORMAS<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"Las normas sociales nunca cambian.\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Las normas sociales <strong>evolucionan<\/strong> con la sociedad (ej. roles de g\u00e9nero, uso de tecnolog\u00eda).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                        <table>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <th>Norma Social Antigua<\/th>\r\n                                <th>Norma Social Actual<\/th>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td>Solo hombres pod\u00edan votar<\/td>\r\n                                <td>Derecho al voto universal<\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td>Matrimonio solo heterosexual<\/td>\r\n                                <td>Matrimonio igualitario<\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                        <\/table>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>An\u00e1lisis de Caso: Matrimonio Igualitario<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Analiza c\u00f3mo el matrimonio igualitario pas\u00f3 de ser una <strong>norma social marginal<\/strong> a una <strong>norma jur\u00eddica<\/strong> en M\u00e9xico (2022).<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Describe el conflicto inicial entre normas sociales y jur\u00eddicas.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Explica el proceso de cambio legal.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Eval\u00faa el impacto social actual.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu an\u00e1lisis aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. <strong>Conflicto inicial:<\/strong> La norma social tradicional solo aceptaba el matrimonio heterosexual, mientras que grupos LGBT+ exig\u00edan igualdad.<br>\r\n                    2. <strong>Proceso legal:<\/strong> En 2015, la SCJN declar\u00f3 inconstitucional prohibir el matrimonio igualitario. Para 2022, 30 estados lo reconocieron.<br>\r\n                    3. <strong>Impacto social:<\/strong> Reducci\u00f3n de la discriminaci\u00f3n y mayor visibilidad de derechos LGBT+.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Propuesta de Ley: Uso de Cubrebocas<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Durante la pandemia (2020-2022), el uso de cubrebocas pas\u00f3 de ser una <strong>recomendaci\u00f3n social<\/strong> a una <strong>obligaci\u00f3n jur\u00eddica<\/strong> en muchos pa\u00edses.<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 factores sociales impulsaron este cambio?<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 sanciones jur\u00eddicas se aplicaron?<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo afect\u00f3 esto a la convivencia?<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Describe tu an\u00e1lisis...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. <strong>Factores sociales:<\/strong> Aumento de contagios y presi\u00f3n de la comunidad cient\u00edfica.<br>\r\n                    2. <strong>Sanciones jur\u00eddicas:<\/strong> Multas por no usar cubrebocas en espacios p\u00fablicos (ej. $500-$2000 MXN).<br>\r\n                    3. <strong>Impacto en convivencia:<\/strong> Polarizaci\u00f3n entre quienes apoyaban la medida y quienes la ve\u00edan como una violaci\u00f3n a libertades.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis de conflicto<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explica claramente el conflicto con ejemplos.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Describe el conflicto sin profundizar.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No identifica el conflicto.<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Proceso de cambio<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Detalla pasos legales y sociales del cambio.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Menciona algunos pasos sin claridad.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Omite el proceso de cambio.<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Impacto social<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Eval\u00faa consecuencias sociales con datos.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Menciona consecuencias sin sustento.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No analiza el impacto.<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Diferenciar normas sociales y jur\u00eddicas:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Analizar conflictos normativos:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Aplicar a situaciones reales:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo crees que las redes sociales han acelerado el cambio de normas sociales a jur\u00eddicas? Da un ejemplo.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Prop\u00f3n una norma social actual que consideres deber\u00eda convertirse en jur\u00eddica. Justifica tu respuesta.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (20 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Repasar diferencias clave entre normas.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar ejemplos de cada tipo.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Identificar sanciones t\u00edpicas.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Analizar 3 casos de conflicto normativo.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Completar el quiz interactivo.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Resolver problemas tipo examen.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Investigar un caso real de cambio normativo.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Debatir en clase sobre normas controvertidas.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Reflexionar sobre el impacto de las redes sociales.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf10 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.scjn.gob.mx\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcdc Suprema Corte de Justicia (M\u00e9xico)\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ohchr.org\/es\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udf0d ONU Derechos Humanos\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.inegi.org.mx\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcca INEGI: Estad\u00edsticas Sociales\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ BASE DE DATOS DE CASOS\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nconst casosDB = {\r\n    \"matrimonio-igualitario\": {\r\n        descripcion: \"El matrimonio igualitario en M\u00e9xico pas\u00f3 de ser un tema social a una norma jur\u00eddica reconocida en 30 estados para 2022.\",\r\n        normaSocial: \"Aceptaci\u00f3n progresiva en la sociedad (2010-2020).\",\r\n        normaJuridica: \"Reforma al C\u00f3digo Civil y sentencias de la SCJN (2015-2022).\",\r\n        conflicto: \"Resistencia de grupos conservadores vs. derechos LGBT+.\",\r\n        solucion: \"Leyes estatales y federales que garantizan el derecho.\",\r\n        pais: \"M\u00e9xico\",\r\n        anio: \"2022\",\r\n        ley: \"Art. 4 Constitucional + C\u00f3digos Civiles Estatales\",\r\n        impacto: \"Mayor inclusi\u00f3n y reducci\u00f3n de discriminaci\u00f3n.\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"derechos-indigenas\": {\r\n        descripcion: \"Conflicto entre leyes estatales y sistemas normativos ind\u00edgenas en temas como justicia y territorio.\",\r\n        normaSocial: \"Usos y costumbres de pueblos originarios.\",\r\n        normaJuridica: \"Leyes federales y tratados internacionales.\",\r\n        conflicto: \"Despojo de tierras y falta de reconocimiento legal.\",\r\n        solucion: \"Reformas constitucionales (ej. Art. 2 Constitucional).\",\r\n        pais: \"M\u00e9xico\",\r\n        anio: \"2021\",\r\n        ley: \"Ley de Derechos de Pueblos Ind\u00edgenas\",\r\n        impacto: \"Reconocimiento parcial de autonom\u00eda.\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"privacidad-digital\": {\r\n        descripcion: \"Normas jur\u00eddicas para proteger datos personales en internet, frente a pr\u00e1cticas sociales de compartir informaci\u00f3n.\",\r\n        normaSocial: \"Uso masivo de redes sociales sin privacidad.\",\r\n        normaJuridica: \"Ley General de Protecci\u00f3n de Datos (2020).\",\r\n        conflicto: \"Empresas vs. derechos de usuarios.\",\r\n        solucion: \"Regulaciones y multas a plataformas digitales.\",\r\n        pais: \"M\u00e9xico\",\r\n        anio: \"2020\",\r\n        ley: \"LGPDP\",\r\n        impacto: \"Mayor conciencia sobre privacidad.\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"movilidad-urbana\": {\r\n        descripcion: \"Leyes de movilidad que buscan cambiar h\u00e1bitos de transporte (ej. uso de auto particular).\",\r\n        normaSocial: \"Preferencia por el autom\u00f3vil privado.\",\r\n        normaJuridica: \"Ley de Movilidad de CDMX (2020).\",\r\n        conflicto: \"Resistencia al uso de transporte p\u00fablico.\",\r\n        solucion: \"Incentivos fiscales y restricciones al auto.\",\r\n        pais: \"M\u00e9xico\",\r\n        anio: \"2020\",\r\n        ley: \"Ley de Movilidad CDMX\",\r\n        impacto: \"Reducci\u00f3n del 15% en emisiones.\"\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR: ANALIZAR CASOS\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction analizarCaso() {\r\n    const casoSeleccionado = document.getElementById('casoInput').value;\r\n    const contexto = document.getElementById('contexto').value;\r\n    const caso = casosDB[casoSeleccionado];\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar detalles del caso\r\n    document.getElementById('casoDescripcion').textContent = caso.descripcion;\r\n    document.getElementById('normaSocial').textContent = caso.normaSocial;\r\n    document.getElementById('normaJuridica').textContent = caso.normaJuridica;\r\n    document.getElementById('conflicto').textContent = caso.conflicto;\r\n    document.getElementById('solucion').textContent = caso.solucion;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar datos legales\r\n    document.getElementById('dataPais').textContent = caso.pais;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataAnio').textContent = caso.anio;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataLey').textContent = caso.ley;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataImpacto').textContent = caso.impacto;\r\n\r\n    console.log(`\ud83d\udcca Caso analizado: ${casoSeleccionado} en ${contexto}`);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n        const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n        if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n    const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n    let feedback = \"\";\r\n    if (porcentaje >= 80) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83c\udf1f Excelente! Dominas las diferencias entre normas sociales y jur\u00eddicas.\";\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 60) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero repasa los ejemplos de sanciones.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas estudiar m\u00e1s las caracter\u00edsticas de cada tipo de norma.\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ ERRORES COMUNES\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction toggleError(header) {\r\n    const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n\r\n    if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n    } else {\r\n        content.style.display = 'block';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n\r\n    alert(`\ud83d\udcbe Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n          `Diferenciaci\u00f3n: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n          `An\u00e1lisis de conflictos: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n          `Aplicaci\u00f3n pr\u00e1ctica: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n          `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n          `Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ OBJETIVOS INTERACTIVOS\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n        this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n        const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n        checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n        checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : '';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: Normas Sociales y Jur\u00eddicas - Cargada\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83c\udfae Simulador, Quiz y Herramientas interactivas listas\");\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Normas sociales son","respuesta":"Informales, basadas en costumbres"},{"enunciado":"Normas jur\u00eddicas son","respuesta":"Formales, con sanci\u00f3n legal"},{"enunciado":"Sanci\u00f3n social","respuesta":"Rechazo, cr\u00edtica"},{"enunciado":"Sanci\u00f3n jur\u00eddica","respuesta":"Multa, c\u00e1rcel"},{"enunciado":"Ejemplo norma social","respuesta":"No hablar con la boca llena"},{"enunciado":"Ejemplo norma jur\u00eddica","respuesta":"No robar (C\u00f3digo Penal)"},{"enunciado":"Norma social \u2192 jur\u00eddica","respuesta":"Ej. no discriminaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Conflicto norma vs ley","respuesta":"Ej. matrimonio igualitario"},{"enunciado":"Estado crea","respuesta":"Normas jur\u00eddicas"},{"enunciado":"M\u00e9xico: ley clave","respuesta":"Constituci\u00f3n Pol\u00edtica"},{"enunciado":"Costumbre \u2192 ley","respuesta":"Proceso legislativo"},{"enunciado":"SI: cumplimiento normativo","respuesta":"Base de convivencia"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Normas sociales","opciones":["Informales","Formales","Escritas","Obligatorias"],"correcta":"Informales"},{"pregunta":"Normas jur\u00eddicas","opciones":["Formales con sanci\u00f3n","Informales","Opcionales","Morales"],"correcta":"Formales con sanci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Sanci\u00f3n social","opciones":["Rechazo social","C\u00e1rcel","Multa","Juicio"],"correcta":"Rechazo social"},{"pregunta":"Sanci\u00f3n jur\u00eddica","opciones":["Legal (multa, c\u00e1rcel)","Cr\u00edtica","Ignorancia","Nada"],"correcta":"Legal (multa, c\u00e1rcel)"},{"pregunta":"Ejemplo social","opciones":["Ser puntual","Pagar impuestos","Firmar contrato","Votar"],"correcta":"Ser puntual"},{"pregunta":"Ejemplo jur\u00eddico","opciones":["No conducir ebrio","Decir gracias","Vestir formal","Sonre\u00edr"],"correcta":"No conducir ebrio"},{"pregunta":"Social \u2192 jur\u00eddica","opciones":["S\u00ed, por aceptaci\u00f3n","No","Siempre","Nunca"],"correcta":"S\u00ed, por aceptaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Estado crea","opciones":["Normas jur\u00eddicas","Sociales","Morales","Religiosas"],"correcta":"Normas jur\u00eddicas"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: m\u00e1xima norma","opciones":["Constituci\u00f3n","C\u00f3digo Civil","Biblia","Costumbre"],"correcta":"Constituci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Conflicto norma vs ley","opciones":["Cambio social","Armon\u00eda","Igualdad","Nada"],"correcta":"Cambio social"},{"pregunta":"No saludar es","opciones":["Falta social","Delito","Multa","C\u00e1rcel"],"correcta":"Falta social"},{"pregunta":"No pagar impuestos es","opciones":["Delito fiscal","Falta social","Etiqueta","Nada"],"correcta":"Delito fiscal"},{"pregunta":"Ley contra discriminaci\u00f3n","opciones":["Social \u2192 jur\u00eddica","Solo jur\u00eddica","Solo social","Religiosa"],"correcta":"Social \u2192 jur\u00eddica"},{"pregunta":"Costumbre puede","opciones":["Convertirse en ley","No","Desaparecer","Ignorarse"],"correcta":"Convertirse en ley"},{"pregunta":"Matrimonio igualitario","opciones":["Ley vs tradici\u00f3n","Siempre aceptado","Solo social","Nada"],"correcta":"Ley vs tradici\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"C\u00f3digo Penal es","opciones":["Norma jur\u00eddica","Social","Moral","Religiosa"],"correcta":"Norma jur\u00eddica"},{"pregunta":"No decir groser\u00edas","opciones":["Norma social","Jur\u00eddica","Econ\u00f3mica","Pol\u00edtica"],"correcta":"Norma social"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: leyes federales","opciones":["~18,000","100","1M","0"],"correcta":"~18,000"},{"pregunta":"Cumplir normas permite","opciones":["Convivencia pac\u00edfica","Conflicto","Caos","Guerra"],"correcta":"Convivencia pac\u00edfica"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: Art. 1 Constituci\u00f3n","opciones":["Proh\u00edbe discriminaci\u00f3n","Permite","Ignora","Nada"],"correcta":"Proh\u00edbe discriminaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Norma moral vs jur\u00eddica","opciones":["Moral interna, jur\u00eddica externa","Iguales","Opuestas","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Moral interna, jur\u00eddica externa"},{"pregunta":"Ley de tr\u00e1nsito","opciones":["Jur\u00eddica","Social","Religiosa","Personal"],"correcta":"Jur\u00eddica"},{"pregunta":"Decir \"por favor\"","opciones":["Norma social","Jur\u00eddica","Econ\u00f3mica","Pol\u00edtica"],"correcta":"Norma social"},{"pregunta":"Reforma legal refleja","opciones":["Cambio social","Est\u00e1tica","Tradici\u00f3n","Nada"],"correcta":"Cambio social"},{"pregunta":"Incumplir ley \u2192","opciones":["Proceso judicial","Solo cr\u00edtica","Nada","Premio"],"correcta":"Proceso judicial"},{"pregunta":"Incumplir costumbre \u2192","opciones":["Rechazo social","C\u00e1rcel","Multa","Juicio"],"correcta":"Rechazo social"},{"pregunta":"Normas evolucionan con","opciones":["Sociedad","Tiempo","Tecnolog\u00eda","Todas"],"correcta":"Todas"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: ley clave 2025","opciones":["Reforma judicial","Ninguna","Antigua","Secreta"],"correcta":"Reforma judicial"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: estado de derecho","opciones":["Supremac\u00eda de la ley","Fuerza","Tradici\u00f3n","Religi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Supremac\u00eda de la ley"},{"pregunta":"Normas garantizan","opciones":["Orden y predictibilidad","Caos","Libertad total","Nada"],"correcta":"Orden y predictibilidad"}]},{"materia":"Ciencias Sociales","slug":"el-estado","titulo":"El Estado: Territorio, Poblaci\u00f3n, Gobierno y Soberan\u00eda","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-sociales-estado\" data-tema=\"el-estado\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n            EL ESTADO: LA ESTRUCTURA DEL PODER\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Territorio, Poblaci\u00f3n, Gobierno y Soberan\u00eda - Los Cuatro Pilares del Estado Moderno\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Identificar los 4 elementos del Estado<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Territorio, poblaci\u00f3n, gobierno y soberan\u00eda seg\u00fan la Convenci\u00f3n de Montevideo<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar la separaci\u00f3n de poderes<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Comprender las funciones de legislativo, ejecutivo y judicial (Art. 49 CPEUM)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Diferenciar formas de gobierno<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Rep\u00fablica vs Monarqu\u00eda, Federal vs Unitario, Presidencial vs Parlamentario<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Evaluar funciones estatales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Regular, proveer, representar y garantizar bienestar social<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> DATOS ESTATALES DE M\u00c9XICO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Territorio Nacional<\/h3>\r\n                <p>1,964,375 km\u00b2 (14\u00b0 m\u00e1s grande del mundo) + 200 millas mar\u00edtimas<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">32 estados + CDMX<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udc65 Poblaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <p>130 millones de habitantes (10\u00b0 m\u00e1s poblado) + 11.8M mexicanos en el exterior<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Densidad: 66 hab\/km\u00b2<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\u2696\ufe0f Sistema de Gobierno<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Rep\u00fablica Federal Presidencialista + Divisi\u00f3n tripartita de poderes<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">PIB: $1.46 billones USD<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- DEFINICI\u00d3N PRINCIPAL -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f EL ESTADO SEG\u00daN MONTECIVIDEO<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Entidad pol\u00edtica <strong>soberana<\/strong> que ejerce autoridad sobre un <strong>territorio definido<\/strong>, con <strong>poblaci\u00f3n permanente<\/strong> y <strong>gobierno organizado<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[ \\text{Estado} = \\text{Territorio} + \\text{Poblaci\u00f3n} + \\text{Gobierno} + \\text{Soberan\u00eda} \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"referencia-legal\">\r\n                        <strong>Art. 1, Convenci\u00f3n de Montevideo (1933):<\/strong> Reconocimiento internacional de estados\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- ELEMENTOS DEL ESTADO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Los Cuatro Elementos Constitutivos del Estado<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"elementos-estado\">\r\n                <div class=\"elemento-estado-card\" data-elemento=\"territorio\">\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-estado-icon\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>TERRITORIO<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-estado-desc\">\r\n                        Espacio f\u00edsico delimitado donde el Estado ejerce soberan\u00eda\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-estado-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Componentes:<\/strong> Tierra, mar, espacio a\u00e9reo, subsuelo<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Fronteras:<\/strong> L\u00edmites reconocidos internacionalmente<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>M\u00e9xico:<\/strong> 1.96M km\u00b2 + ZEE de 3.15M km\u00b2<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-estado-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Disputa del Chamizal (M\u00e9xico-EEUU, resuelta 1963)\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"elemento-estado-card\" data-elemento=\"poblacion\">\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-estado-icon\">\ud83d\udc65<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>POBLACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-estado-desc\">\r\n                        Conjunto de personas sujetas a la autoridad estatal\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-estado-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ciudadan\u00eda:<\/strong> V\u00ednculo jur\u00eddico-politico individuo-Estado<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Derechos:<\/strong> Civiles, pol\u00edticos, sociales<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>M\u00e9xico:<\/strong> 130M hab. (52% mujeres, 48% hombres)<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-estado-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Censo 2020: 7.4M hablantes de lenguas ind\u00edgenas\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"elemento-estado-card\" data-elemento=\"gobierno\">\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-estado-icon\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>GOBIERNO<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-estado-desc\">\r\n                        Conjunto de instituciones que ejercen el poder pol\u00edtico\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-estado-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Formas:<\/strong> Rep\u00fablica, Monarqu\u00eda, Dictadura<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Divisi\u00f3n poderes:<\/strong> Legislativo, Ejecutivo, Judicial<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>M\u00e9xico:<\/strong> Rep\u00fablica Federal Presidencialista<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-estado-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Sistema pol\u00edtico mexicano con elecciones cada 6 a\u00f1os\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"elemento-estado-card\" data-elemento=\"soberania\">\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-estado-icon\">\ud83c\udff4<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>SOBERAN\u00cdA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-estado-desc\">\r\n                        Poder supremo e independiente en asuntos internos y externos\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-estado-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Interna:<\/strong> Autoridad sobre territorio y poblaci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Externa:<\/strong> Independencia en relaciones internacionales<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>M\u00e9xico:<\/strong> Miembro ONU, OEA, OCDE, T-MEC<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"elemento-estado-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Pol\u00edtica exterior de no intervenci\u00f3n (Doctrina Estrada)\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FUNCIONES DEL ESTADO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Funciones Esenciales del Estado Moderno<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"funciones-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"funcion-card\" data-funcion=\"reguladora\">\r\n                    <div class=\"funcion-icon\">\ud83d\udcdc<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>FUNCI\u00d3N REGULADORA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"funcion-desc\">\r\n                        Establece normas que rigen la convivencia social\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"funcion-detalle\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Legislativo:<\/strong> Crea leyes (Congreso de la Uni\u00f3n)<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejecutivo:<\/strong> Promulga y ejecuta leyes<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Judicial:<\/strong> Interpreta y aplica leyes<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"funcion-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Constituci\u00f3n Pol\u00edtica (1917) + 200,000 leyes federales\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"funcion-card\" data-funcion=\"provisora\">\r\n                    <div class=\"funcion-icon\">\ud83c\udfe5<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>FUNCI\u00d3N PROVISORA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"funcion-desc\">\r\n                        Provee servicios p\u00fablicos esenciales a la poblaci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"funcion-detalle\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Educaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> SEP, 265,000 escuelas p\u00fablicas<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Salud:<\/strong> IMSS, ISSSTE, INSABI<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Infraestructura:<\/strong> Carreteras, agua, energ\u00eda<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"funcion-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Presupuesto educativo 2024: $15,000M USD\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"funcion-card\" data-funcion=\"representativa\">\r\n                    <div class=\"funcion-icon\">\ud83c\udf10<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>FUNCI\u00d3N REPRESENTATIVA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"funcion-desc\">\r\n                        Representa a la naci\u00f3n en el \u00e1mbito internacional\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"funcion-detalle\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Diplomacia:<\/strong> 80 embajadas, 67 consulados<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Tratados:<\/strong> 2,500 tratados internacionales vigentes<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Organismos:<\/strong> ONU, OEA, APEC, Alianza del Pac\u00edfico<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"funcion-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Presidencia pro tempore CELAC 2020\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"funcion-card\" data-funcion=\"garantizadora\">\r\n                    <div class=\"funcion-icon\">\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>FUNCI\u00d3N GARANTIZADORA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"funcion-desc\">\r\n                        Garantiza orden, seguridad y bienestar social\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"funcion-detalle\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Seguridad:<\/strong> Ej\u00e9rcito, Marina, Polic\u00edas<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Justicia:<\/strong> SCJN, Tribunales, MP<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Bienestar:<\/strong> Programas sociales, pensiones<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"funcion-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Ejemplo:<\/strong> Guardia Nacional (2019) con 120,000 elementos\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- SEPARACI\u00d3N DE PODERES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Separaci\u00f3n de Poderes: El Modelo Tripartito<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"principio-constitucional\">\r\n                <p><strong>Art\u00edculo 49 Constitucional:<\/strong> \"El Supremo Poder de la Federaci\u00f3n se divide, para su ejercicio, en Legislativo, Ejecutivo y Judicial.\"<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"poderes-comparativa\">\r\n                <div class=\"poder-card\" data-poder=\"legislativo\">\r\n                    <div class=\"poder-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udcdc PODER LEGISLATIVO<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"poder-badge\">Congreso de la Uni\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"poder-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Funci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Crear, modificar y derogar leyes<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>\u00d3rgano:<\/strong> C\u00e1mara de Diputados + C\u00e1mara de Senadores<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Integrantes:<\/strong> 500 diputados + 128 senadores<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"poder-atribuciones\">\r\n                        <div class=\"atribucion-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-icon\">\ud83d\udcbc<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Aprobar Presupuesto<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Ley de Ingresos y Presupuesto de Egresos\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"atribucion-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-icon\">\ud83e\udd1d<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Ratificar Tratados<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Acuerdos internacionales (Senado)\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"atribucion-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-icon\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Fiscalizar al Ejecutivo<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Comparecencias, investigaciones\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"poder-estadistica\">\r\n                        <span>Leyes aprobadas\/a\u00f1o:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">150-200<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"poder-card\" data-poder=\"ejecutivo\">\r\n                    <div class=\"poder-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f PODER EJECUTIVO<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"poder-badge\">Presidencia de la Rep\u00fablica<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"poder-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Funci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Dirigir la administraci\u00f3n p\u00fablica<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>\u00d3rgano:<\/strong> Presidente + Secretar\u00edas de Estado<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Duraci\u00f3n:<\/strong> 6 a\u00f1os (no reelecci\u00f3n)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"poder-atribuciones\">\r\n                        <div class=\"atribucion-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-icon\">\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Comandante Supremo<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Fuerzas Armadas (Ej\u00e9rcito, Marina, Fuerza A\u00e9rea)\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"atribucion-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-icon\">\ud83d\udcb5<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Ejecutar Presupuesto<\/strong><br>\r\n                                19 secretar\u00edas + organismos descentralizados\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"atribucion-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Pol\u00edtica Exterior<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Representaci\u00f3n internacional, tratados\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"poder-estadistica\">\r\n                        <span>Presupuesto 2024:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">$8.9 billones MXN<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"poder-card\" data-poder=\"judicial\">\r\n                    <div class=\"poder-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\u2696\ufe0f PODER JUDICIAL<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"poder-badge\">Suprema Corte de Justicia<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"poder-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Funci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Administrar justicia e interpretar leyes<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>\u00d3rgano:<\/strong> SCJN + Tribunales Federales + Locales<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Integrantes:<\/strong> 11 ministros (designados por Senado)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"poder-atribuciones\">\r\n                        <div class=\"atribucion-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-icon\">\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\u2696\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Control Constitucional<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Juicios de amparo, controversias constitucionales\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"atribucion-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-icon\">\ud83d\udccb<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Interpretar Leyes<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Jurisprudencia, tesis aisladas\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"atribucion-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-icon\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"atribucion-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Impartir Justicia<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Resolver conflictos entre particulares y Estado\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"poder-estadistica\">\r\n                        <span>Amparos resueltos\/a\u00f1o:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">~250,000<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"checks-balances\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udd04 SISTEMA DE CONTROLES Y EQUILIBRIOS (CHECKS AND BALANCES)<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"checks-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"check-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"check-icon\">\u2194\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"check-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Ejecutivo \u2192 Legislativo:<\/strong> Veto presidencial a leyes\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"check-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"check-icon\">\u2194\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"check-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Legislativo \u2192 Ejecutivo:<\/strong> Juicio pol\u00edtico, aprobaci\u00f3n presupuesto\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"check-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"check-icon\">\u2194\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"check-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Judicial \u2192 Ambos:<\/strong> Declarar inconstitucionalidad de leyes y actos\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> SIMULADOR: ESTRUCTURA DEL ESTADO MEXICANO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"estructura-estado\">\r\n            <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>CONTROLES DE AN\u00c1LISIS<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"poderSelect\">Poder a analizar:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"poderSelect\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"todos\">Todos los poderes<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"legislativo\">Poder Legislativo<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"ejecutivo\">Poder Ejecutivo<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"judicial\">Poder Judicial<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"federalismo\">Sistema Federal<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"nivelGobierno\">Nivel de gobierno:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"nivelGobierno\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"federal\">Federal<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"estatal\">Estatal (32 entidades)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"municipal\">Municipal (2,463 municipios)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label>Mostrar detalles:<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"checkbox-group\">\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"detalles\" value=\"atribuciones\" checked> Atribuciones<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"detalles\" value=\"organigrama\"> Organigrama<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"detalles\" value=\"presupuesto\"> Presupuesto<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"detalles\" value=\"funcionarios\"> Funcionarios<\/label>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-clasificar\" onclick=\"analizarEstructura()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd0d<\/span> ANALIZAR ESTRUCTURA\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"poderAleatorio()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> PODER ALEATORIO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarAnalisis()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DE LA ESTRUCTURA -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacionEstado\">\r\n                <div class=\"estructura-container\">\r\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 500\" id=\"svgEstado\">\r\n                        <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"500\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\" id=\"fondoEstado\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- ESTADO MEXICANO -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoEstado\">\r\n                            <ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"80\" rx=\"180\" ry=\"40\" fill=\"#43A047\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"75\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\">ESTADO MEXICANO<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"95\" fill=\"#C8E6C9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">Rep\u00fablica Federal Presidencialista<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- PODER LEGISLATIVO -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoLegislativo\" opacity=\"0.7\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"150\" width=\"150\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1976D2\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"125\" y=\"175\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">LEGISLATIVO<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"125\" y=\"195\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\">Congreso de la Uni\u00f3n<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- PODER EJECUTIVO -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoEjecutivo\" opacity=\"0.7\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"225\" y=\"150\" width=\"150\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#D32F2F\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"175\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">EJECUTIVO<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"195\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\">Presidencia<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- PODER JUDICIAL -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoJudicial\" opacity=\"0.7\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"400\" y=\"150\" width=\"150\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"475\" y=\"175\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">JUDICIAL<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"475\" y=\"195\" fill=\"#E1BEE7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\">Suprema Corte<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- CONEXIONES -->\r\n                        <path id=\"conexionEstadoLegislativo\" d=\"M300 120 Q300 140 125 150\" stroke=\"#43A047\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                        <path id=\"conexionEstadoEjecutivo\" d=\"M300 120 Q300 140 300 150\" stroke=\"#43A047\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                        <path id=\"conexionEstadoJudicial\" d=\"M300 120 Q300 140 475 150\" stroke=\"#43A047\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- SISTEMA FEDERAL -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoFederalismo\" opacity=\"0.7\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"250\" width=\"300\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FF9800\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"275\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">SISTEMA FEDERAL<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"295\" fill=\"#FFECB3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\">32 estados + CDMX<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- MUNICIPIOS -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoMunicipios\" opacity=\"0.7\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"200\" y=\"340\" width=\"200\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0097A7\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"360\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">2,463 MUNICIPIOS<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"375\" fill=\"#B2EBF2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\">Gobiernos locales<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- CONEXIONES VERTICALES -->\r\n                        <line x1=\"125\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#1976D2\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#D32F2F\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        <line x1=\"475\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"475\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#7B1FA2\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"310\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"340\" stroke=\"#FF9800\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- PODER SELECCIONADO -->\r\n                        <g id=\"poderSeleccionado\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"200\" y=\"420\" width=\"200\" height=\"50\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#9C27B0\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"445\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"textoPoder\">PODER<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"460\" fill=\"#F3E5F5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" id=\"textoDetallePoder\">Detalles<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                    <\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"estructura-info\" id=\"infoEstado\">\r\n                    Selecciona un poder y haz clic en \"ANALIZAR ESTRUCTURA\"\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- DATOS DE AN\u00c1LISIS -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>DATOS INSTITUCIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Poder analizado:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPoder\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">\u00d3rgano principal:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataOrgano\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Funcionarios:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataFuncionarios\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">PRESUPUESTO 2024:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPresupuesto\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Atribuciones clave:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataAtribuciones\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Control sobre otros poderes:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataControles\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcca ESTAD\u00cdSTICAS DEL ESTADO MEXICANO<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Pa\u00edses reconocidos por ONU:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">193<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Tratados internacionales:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">2,500+<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Servidores p\u00fablicos federales:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">1.2M<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Presupuesto federal 2024:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">$8.9 billones<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Leyes federales vigentes:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">200,000+<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- EJEMPLO COMPARATIVO: FORMAS DE GOBIERNO -->\r\n    <section class=\"ejemplo-comparativo\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-ejemplo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd0d<\/span> AN\u00c1LISIS COMPARATIVO: FORMAS DE GOBIERNO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"comparativo-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"forma-gobierno\" data-forma=\"republica\">\r\n                <div class=\"forma-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f REP\u00daBLICA FEDERAL PRESIDENCIALISTA (M\u00c9XICO)<\/h4>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"forma-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"forma-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Jefe de Estado:<\/strong> Presidente elegido popularmente<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Divisi\u00f3n territorial:<\/strong> Federal (32 estados aut\u00f3nomos)<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Separaci\u00f3n de poderes:<\/strong> Estricta (Art. 49)<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Elecciones:<\/strong> Cada 6 a\u00f1os (presidente), 3 a\u00f1os (diputados)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"forma-ventajas\">\r\n                        <h5>\u2705 Ventajas:<\/h5>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Representaci\u00f3n directa del pueblo<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Equilibrio entre unidad nacional y autonom\u00eda local<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Mayor estabilidad del ejecutivo<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"forma-desventajas\">\r\n                        <h5>\u26a0\ufe0f Desaf\u00edos:<\/h5>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Riesgo de concentraci\u00f3n de poder<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Posibles conflictos federaci\u00f3n-estados<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Rigidez en per\u00edodos fijos<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"forma-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Otros ejemplos:<\/strong> Estados Unidos, Brasil, Argentina\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"forma-gobierno\" data-forma=\"monarquia\">\r\n                <div class=\"forma-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udc51 MONARQU\u00cdA CONSTITUCIONAL PARLAMENTARIA (ESPA\u00d1A)<\/h4>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"forma-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"forma-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Jefe de Estado:<\/strong> Rey (hereditario, vitalicio)<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Divisi\u00f3n territorial:<\/strong> Estado auton\u00f3mico (17 comunidades)<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Separaci\u00f3n de poderes:<\/strong> Parlamentaria (ejecutivo surge del legislativo)<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Elecciones:<\/strong> Cada 4 a\u00f1os (Cortes Generales)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"forma-ventajas\">\r\n                        <h5>\u2705 Ventajas:<\/h5>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Continuidad y estabilidad institucional<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Jefe de Estado apol\u00edtico<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Mayor flexibilidad pol\u00edtica<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"forma-desventajas\">\r\n                        <h5>\u26a0\ufe0f Desaf\u00edos:<\/h5>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Legitimidad democr\u00e1tica cuestionada<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Costo de la familia real<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Posible crisis de sucesi\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"forma-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Otros ejemplos:<\/strong> Reino Unido, Jap\u00f3n, Suecia\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"forma-gobierno\" data-forma=\"parlamentaria\">\r\n                <div class=\"forma-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f REP\u00daBLICA PARLAMENTARIA (ALEMANIA)<\/h4>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"forma-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"forma-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Jefe de Estado:<\/strong> Presidente (electo indirectamente)<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Divisi\u00f3n territorial:<\/strong> Federal (16 L\u00e4nder)<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Separaci\u00f3n de poderes:<\/strong> Ejecutivo depende del legislativo<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Elecciones:<\/strong> Cada 4 a\u00f1os (Bundestag)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"forma-ventajas\">\r\n                        <h5>\u2705 Ventajas:<\/h5>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Mayor cooperaci\u00f3n entre poderes<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Gobierno de coalici\u00f3n m\u00e1s com\u00fan<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Facilidad para cambiar gobierno sin elecciones<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"forma-desventajas\">\r\n                        <h5>\u26a0\ufe0f Desaf\u00edos:<\/h5>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Inestabilidad potencial de gobierno<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Menor claridad en responsabilidades<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Poder ejecutivo m\u00e1s d\u00e9bil<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"forma-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Otros ejemplos:<\/strong> Italia, India, Israel\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"conclusion-comparativa\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb CONCLUSI\u00d3N COMPARATIVA<\/h4>\r\n            <p>No existe un sistema de gobierno \"perfecto\". Cada modelo refleja la historia, cultura y necesidades espec\u00edficas de cada naci\u00f3n. M\u00e9xico opt\u00f3 por el <strong>presidencialismo federal<\/strong> para balancear unidad nacional con autonom\u00eda regional, mientras que Espa\u00f1a privilegia <strong>continuidad mon\u00e1rquica<\/strong> y Alemania la <strong>estabilidad parlamentaria<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 elemento del Estado se refiere al espacio f\u00edsico delimitado?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Poblaci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Territorio\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Gobierno\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Soberan\u00eda\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> El territorio es el espacio f\u00edsico donde el Estado ejerce soberan\u00eda.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa los cuatro elementos constitutivos del Estado.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Seg\u00fan la Convenci\u00f3n de Montevideo (1933), el Estado requiere: 1) Territorio definido, 2) Poblaci\u00f3n permanente, 3) Gobierno organizado, 4) Capacidad de relacionarse con otros Estados (soberan\u00eda). M\u00e9xico tiene 1.96M km\u00b2 de territorio.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 art\u00edculo constitucional establece la separaci\u00f3n de poderes en M\u00e9xico?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Art\u00edculo 27\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Art\u00edculo 39\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Art\u00edculo 49\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Art\u00edculo 123\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> El Art\u00edculo 49 establece la divisi\u00f3n tripartita del poder.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa los art\u00edculos fundamentales de la organizaci\u00f3n pol\u00edtica.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Texto constitucional:<\/strong> Art. 49: \"El Supremo Poder de la Federaci\u00f3n se divide, para su ejercicio, en Legislativo, Ejecutivo y Judicial. No podr\u00e1n reunirse dos o m\u00e1s de estos Poderes en una sola persona o corporaci\u00f3n...\"<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la principal funci\u00f3n del Poder Judicial?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Crear nuevas leyes\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Dirigir la pol\u00edtica exterior\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Ejecutar el presupuesto nacional\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Administrar justicia e interpretar leyes\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> El Poder Judicial interpreta y aplica las leyes.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Cada poder tiene funciones espec\u00edficas que no deben confundirse.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Divisi\u00f3n de funciones:<\/strong> Legislativo: crea leyes; Ejecutivo: ejecuta leyes y administra; Judicial: interpreta leyes y administra justicia. La Suprema Corte (11 ministros) es el m\u00e1ximo \u00f3rgano judicial.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES Y SOLUCIONES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONFUNDIR ESTADO, GOBIERNO Y NACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"El Estado es lo mismo que el gobierno actual\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El Estado es la estructura permanente; el gobierno es su administraci\u00f3n temporal; la naci\u00f3n es la comunidad cultural.\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        \\begin{aligned}\r\n                        \\text{Estado} &= \\text{Estructura pol\u00edtica permanente} \\\\\r\n                        \\text{Gobierno} &= \\text{Administraci\u00f3n temporal (cambia)} \\\\\r\n                        \\text{Naci\u00f3n} &= \\text{Comunidad cultural\/hist\u00f3rica}\r\n                        \\end{aligned}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Practica:<\/strong> Clasifica: 1) \"M\u00e9xico tiene 130 millones de habitantes\", 2) \"El presidente actual gobierna desde 2018\", 3) \"Los mexicanos comparten historia y cultura\"<\/p>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                            <strong>1) M\u00e9xico tiene 130M hab:<\/strong> ESTADO (elemento poblaci\u00f3n)<br>\r\n                            <strong>2) Presidente gobierna desde 2018:<\/strong> GOBIERNO (administraci\u00f3n temporal)<br>\r\n                            <strong>3) Mexicanos comparten cultura:<\/strong> NACI\u00d3N (comunidad cultural)\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c MALENTENDER LA SEPARACI\u00d3N DE PODERES<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"La separaci\u00f3n de poderes significa que no se relacionan\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Es \"separaci\u00f3n\" pero con \"colaboraci\u00f3n y control mutuo\" (checks and balances):\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Separaci\u00f3n org\u00e1nica:<\/strong> Diferentes instituciones<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Separaci\u00f3n funcional:<\/strong> Diferentes funciones<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Colaboraci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Trabajan conjuntamente<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Control mutuo:<\/strong> Se limitan entre s\u00ed<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                        <table>\r\n                            <tr><th>Poder<\/th><th>Controla a...<\/th><th>Medio de control<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Legislativo<\/td><td>Ejecutivo<\/td><td>Aprobaci\u00f3n presupuesto, juicio pol\u00edtico<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Ejecutivo<\/td><td>Legislativo<\/td><td>Veto a leyes, iniciativa preferente<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Judicial<\/td><td>Ambos<\/td><td>Declarar inconstitucionalidad<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <\/table>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>An\u00e1lisis de Elementos del Estado<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Analiza el caso de <strong>Taiw\u00e1n (Rep\u00fablica de China)<\/strong> aplicando los cuatro elementos del Estado seg\u00fan la Convenci\u00f3n de Montevideo:<\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Territorio:<\/strong> Isla de Taiw\u00e1n + islas menores (36,193 km\u00b2)<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Poblaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> 23.6 millones de habitantes<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Gobierno:<\/strong> Rep\u00fablica semipresidencialista con elecciones democr\u00e1ticas<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Soberan\u00eda:<\/strong> Reconocido por 13 pa\u00edses, no es miembro de ONU<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <p>\u00bfConsideras que Taiw\u00e1n cumple con todos los elementos para ser considerado un Estado seg\u00fan el derecho internacional? Justifica tu respuesta indicando:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Qu\u00e9 elementos cumple plenamente<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Qu\u00e9 elementos presenta controversia<\/li>\r\n                        <li>C\u00f3mo afecta el principio de \"Una sola China\"<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Ejemplos de casos similares en la historia<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu an\u00e1lisis jur\u00eddico-pol\u00edtico aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"10\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>An\u00e1lisis modelo:<\/strong><br><br>\r\n                    <strong>1. Elementos cumplidos:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 Territorio: S\u00ed (delimitado y controlado efectivamente)<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Poblaci\u00f3n: S\u00ed (permanente y organizada)<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Gobierno: S\u00ed (organizado, elecciones democr\u00e1ticas desde 1996)<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>2. Elemento controversial:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 Soberan\u00eda: Parcial. Tiene capacidad de relaciones internacionales limitadas (13 reconocimientos vs 181 de China). No es miembro de ONU.<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>3. Principio \"Una sola China\":<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 1971: ONU reconoce a Rep\u00fablica Popular China como leg\u00edtima representante<br>\r\n                    \u2022 La mayor\u00eda de pa\u00edses mantienen relaciones con Pek\u00edn, no con Taiw\u00e1n<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Estatus pol\u00edtico: \"Entidad separada\" no Estado soberano<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>4. Casos similares:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 Kosovo: Reconocido por 101 pa\u00edses pero no por ONU<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Sahara Occidental: Reconocido por 84 pa\u00edses, ocupado por Marruecos<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Palestina: Estado observador en ONU desde 2012<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>Conclusi\u00f3n:<\/strong> Taiw\u00e1n cumple elementos materiales pero carece de reconocimiento soberano pleno, siendo un \"Estado de facto\" pero no \"de jure\" seg\u00fan mayor\u00eda de comunidad internacional.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Dise\u00f1o de Reforma Institucional<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Dise\u00f1a una propuesta de reforma al <strong>sistema de separaci\u00f3n de poderes en M\u00e9xico<\/strong> para fortalecer los controles mutuos entre ellos:<\/p>\r\n                    <p>Tu propuesta debe incluir para cada poder:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Fortalezas actuales que deben conservarse<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Debilidades que deben corregirse<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Propuestas concretas de mejora<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Mecanismos de implementaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Considera especialmente:<\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Equilibrio entre eficiencia y control<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Experiencias comparadas (otros pa\u00edses)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Viabilidad pol\u00edtica y constitucional<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Impacto en la calidad democr\u00e1tica<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Describe tu propuesta de reforma institucional...\" rows=\"10\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR PROCEDIMIENTO<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Propuesta de reforma modelo:<\/strong><br><br>\r\n                    <strong>1. Poder Ejecutivo (fortalecer controles):<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Debilidad actual:<\/em> Concentraci\u00f3n excesiva de poder presidencial<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Propuesta:<\/em> Establecer gabinete parlamentario (ministros requieren aval legislativo)<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Mecanismo:<\/em> Reforma Art. 89 constitucional<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>2. Poder Legislativo (mejorar eficiencia):<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Debilidad actual:<\/em> Excesivo n\u00famero de partidos, bloqueos frecuentes<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Propuesta:<\/em> Umbral electoral m\u00e1s alto (5% a 7%) + segunda vuelta legislativa<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Mecanismo:<\/em> Reforma electoral + reglamentos internos<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>3. Poder Judicial (fortalecer independencia):<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Debilidad actual:<\/em> Designaci\u00f3n politizada de ministros<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Propuesta:<\/em> Comisiones ciudadanas para evaluar candidatos<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Mecanismo:<\/em> Ley org\u00e1nica del Poder Judicial<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>4. Mecanismos transversales:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Auditor\u00eda superior:<\/em> Autonom\u00eda constitucional plena<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Rendici\u00f3n de cuentas:<\/strong> Comparecencias obligatorias trimestrales<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Participaci\u00f3n ciudadana:<\/em> Iniciativa popular con 500,000 firmas<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>Experiencia comparada:<\/strong> Modelo alem\u00e1n (gabinete parlamentario), franc\u00e9s (segunda vuelta), espa\u00f1ol (Consejo General del Poder Judicial aut\u00f3nomo).<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>Viabilidad:<\/strong> Requerir\u00eda reforma constitucional (2\/3 del Congreso + mayor\u00eda estatales), proceso de 2-3 a\u00f1os.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Comprensi\u00f3n elementos Estado<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Analiza correctamente los 4 elementos con ejemplos precisos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Identifica mayor\u00eda de elementos con alg\u00fan error<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Confunde elementos u omite alguno esencial<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis casos complejos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Eval\u00faa matices y contradicciones en casos controversiales<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Identifica aspectos principales del caso<\/td>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis superficial o incorrecto<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Propuestas de reforma<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Propone reformas viables, fundamentadas y con mecanismos claros<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Sugiere reformas generales sin mecanismos espec\u00edficos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Propuestas inviables o contradictorias<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n elementos del Estado:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>An\u00e1lisis separaci\u00f3n de poderes:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comparaci\u00f3n formas de gobierno:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es importante la separaci\u00f3n de poderes en una democracia? \u00bfQu\u00e9 pasar\u00eda si un solo poder controlara todo?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Compara el sistema presidencial mexicano con otra forma de gobierno. \u00bfQu\u00e9 ventajas y desventajas ves en cada uno?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu comparaci\u00f3n...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd04 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Memorizar 4 elementos del Estado (Convenci\u00f3n Montevideo)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Recordar 3 poderes y sus funciones (Art. 49)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Diferenciar Estado, gobierno y naci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcaa PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Analizar 5 casos de estados controversiales<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Completar el simulador con diferentes poderes<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Resolver el quiz interactivo<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\ude80 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Investigar casos de separaci\u00f3n de poderes en otros pa\u00edses<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Analizar reformas pol\u00edticas recientes en M\u00e9xico<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Dise\u00f1ar propuestas de mejora institucional<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.diputados.gob.mx\/LeyesBiblio\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcdc C\u00e1mara de Diputados: Leyes y Constituci\u00f3n\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.scjn.gob.mx\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \u2696\ufe0f Suprema Corte: Jurisprudencia y sentencias\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.gob.mx\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Portal de Gobierno: Transparencia y servicios\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/es.khanacademy.org\/humanities\/us-government-and-civics\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf93 Khan Academy: Gobierno y civismo\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.economist.com\/democracy-index\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcca The Economist: \u00cdndice de Democracia 2023\r\n                <\/a>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n    <script>\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE AN\u00c1LISIS DEL ESTADO\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Base de datos de poderes y estructuras\r\n    const estructurasDB = {\r\n        \"legislativo\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Poder Legislativo\",\r\n            organo: \"Congreso de la Uni\u00f3n\",\r\n            funcionarios: \"628 (500 diputados + 128 senadores)\",\r\n            presupuesto: \"$14,500M MXN (2024)\",\r\n            atribuciones: \"Crear leyes, aprobar presupuesto, ratificar tratados\",\r\n            controles: \"Juicio pol\u00edtico, comparecencias, aprobaci\u00f3n presupuesto\",\r\n            color: \"#1976D2\",\r\n            detalles: \"Bicameral: C\u00e1mara de Diputados (3 a\u00f1os) y Senado (6 a\u00f1os)\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"ejecutivo\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Poder Ejecutivo\",\r\n            organo: \"Presidencia de la Rep\u00fablica\",\r\n            funcionarios: \"1.2M servidores p\u00fablicos federales\",\r\n            presupuesto: \"$8.9 billones MXN (presupuesto federal)\",\r\n            atribuciones: \"Administraci\u00f3n p\u00fablica, pol\u00edtica exterior, seguridad\",\r\n            controles: \"Veto legislativo, designaci\u00f3n funcionarios, mando militar\",\r\n            color: \"#D32F2F\",\r\n            detalles: \"19 secretar\u00edas de Estado + organismos descentralizados\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"judicial\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Poder Judicial\",\r\n            organo: \"Suprema Corte de Justicia\",\r\n            funcionarios: \"11 ministros + 90,000 empleados judiciales\",\r\n            presupuesto: \"$45,000M MXN (sistema judicial completo)\",\r\n            atribuciones: \"Impartir justicia, interpretar leyes, control constitucional\",\r\n            controles: \"Declarar inconstitucionalidad, amparo, controversias\",\r\n            color: \"#7B1FA2\",\r\n            detalles: \"SCJN (11 ministros) + tribunales federales + locales\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"federalismo\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Sistema Federal\",\r\n            organo: \"32 entidades federativas\",\r\n            funcionarios: \"Gobernadores + legislativos locales\",\r\n            presupuesto: \"$2.1 billones MXN (presupuestos estatales)\",\r\n            atribuciones: \"Competencias concurrentes con federaci\u00f3n\",\r\n            controles: \"Soberan\u00eda estatal limitada, coordinaci\u00f3n fiscal\",\r\n            color: \"#FF9800\",\r\n            detalles: \"Cada estado tiene constituci\u00f3n, congreso y gobierno propios\"\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Datos por nivel de gobierno\r\n    const nivelesGobierno = {\r\n        \"federal\": {\r\n            desc: \"Gobierno central con competencias nacionales\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"SEP, SEDENA, SRE, SHCP\",\r\n            presupuesto: \"$8.9 billones MXN\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"estatal\": {\r\n            desc: \"32 gobiernos estatales con autonom\u00eda limitada\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"Gobiernos de Jalisco, Nuevo Le\u00f3n, CDMX\",\r\n            presupuesto: \"Variable por estado ($50-500 mil millones)\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"municipal\": {\r\n            desc: \"2,463 gobiernos locales (mayores y ayuntamientos)\",\r\n            ejemplos: \"Alcald\u00edas, servicios p\u00fablicos locales\",\r\n            presupuesto: \"Promedio $500M MXN por municipio\"\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    function analizarEstructura() {\r\n        console.log(\"\ud83d\udd0d Analizando estructura estatal...\");\r\n        \r\n        const poder = document.getElementById('poderSelect').value;\r\n        const nivel = document.getElementById('nivelGobierno').value;\r\n        const checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"detalles\"]:checked');\r\n        const detalles = Array.from(checkboxes).map(cb => cb.value);\r\n        \r\n        if (poder === \"todos\") {\r\n            \/\/ An\u00e1lisis completo del Estado\r\n            mostrarAnalisisCompleto(nivel, detalles);\r\n        } else {\r\n            \/\/ An\u00e1lisis espec\u00edfico de un poder\r\n            const estructura = estructurasDB[poder];\r\n            const nivelInfo = nivelesGobierno[nivel];\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Actualizar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n            actualizarVisualizacionEstado(poder, estructura.color);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Actualizar datos de an\u00e1lisis\r\n            document.getElementById('dataPoder').textContent = estructura.nombre;\r\n            document.getElementById('dataOrgano').textContent = estructura.organo;\r\n            document.getElementById('dataFuncionarios').textContent = estructura.funcionarios;\r\n            document.getElementById('dataPresupuesto').textContent = estructura.presupuesto;\r\n            document.getElementById('dataAtribuciones').textContent = estructura.atribuciones;\r\n            document.getElementById('dataControles').textContent = estructura.controles;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Informaci\u00f3n adicional seg\u00fan detalles seleccionados\r\n            let infoAdicional = `Nivel: ${nivelInfo.desc}`;\r\n            if (detalles.includes(\"organigrama\")) {\r\n                infoAdicional += ` | ${estructura.detalles}`;\r\n            }\r\n            if (detalles.includes(\"presupuesto\")) {\r\n                infoAdicional += ` | Presupuesto nivel ${nivel}: ${nivelInfo.presupuesto}`;\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            document.getElementById('infoEstado').textContent = \r\n                `An\u00e1lisis: ${estructura.nombre} \u2192 ${infoAdicional}`;\r\n            \r\n            console.log(`\ud83d\udcca Analizado: ${estructura.nombre} en nivel ${nivel}`);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarAnalisisCompleto(nivel, detalles) {\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar todos los poderes\r\n        actualizarVisualizacionEstado(\"todos\", \"#43A047\");\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Resumir informaci\u00f3n de todos los poderes\r\n        let resumen = \"AN\u00c1LISIS COMPLETO DEL ESTADO MEXICANO<br><br>\";\r\n        let funcionariosTotal = 0;\r\n        \r\n        for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(estructurasDB)) {\r\n            resumen += `<strong>${value.nombre}:<\/strong> ${value.organo}<br>`;\r\n            funcionariosTotal += key === \"ejecutivo\" ? 1200000 : \r\n                                key === \"judicial\" ? 90000 : 628;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        resumen += `<br><strong>Total funcionarios p\u00fablicos federales:<\/strong> ~${funcionariosTotal.toLocaleString()}`;\r\n        resumen += `<br><strong>Presupuesto federal total 2024:<\/strong> $8.9 billones MXN`;\r\n        resumen += `<br><strong>Sistema:<\/strong> ${nivelesGobierno[nivel].desc}`;\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('dataPoder').textContent = \"AN\u00c1LISIS COMPLETO\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataOrgano').textContent = \"Estado Mexicano completo\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataFuncionarios').textContent = `~${funcionariosTotal.toLocaleString()}`;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataPresupuesto').textContent = \"$8.9 billones MXN\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataAtribuciones').textContent = \"Todas las funciones estatales\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataControles').textContent = \"Sistema completo de checks and balances\";\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoEstado').innerHTML = resumen;\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcca An\u00e1lisis completo del Estado en nivel ${nivel}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function actualizarVisualizacionEstado(poder, color) {\r\n        const svg = document.getElementById('svgEstado');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('#svgEstado g[id^=\"nodo\"]').forEach(nodo => {\r\n            nodo.setAttribute('opacity', '0.7');\r\n            nodo.setAttribute('filter', 'none');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        document.querySelectorAll('#svgEstado path, #svgEstado line').forEach(elemento => {\r\n            elemento.style.stroke = '';\r\n            elemento.style.strokeWidth = '';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Estado siempre visible\r\n        document.getElementById('nodoEstado').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n        \r\n        if (poder === \"todos\") {\r\n            \/\/ Resaltar todo\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoLegislativo').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoEjecutivo').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoJudicial').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoFederalismo').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoMunicipios').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Resaltar conexiones\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionEstadoLegislativo').style.stroke = color;\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionEstadoEjecutivo').style.stroke = color;\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionEstadoJudicial').style.stroke = color;\r\n            \r\n        } else if (poder === \"legislativo\") {\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoLegislativo').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoLegislativo').setAttribute('filter', 'url(#glow)');\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionEstadoLegislativo').style.stroke = color;\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionEstadoLegislativo').style.strokeWidth = '3';\r\n            \r\n        } else if (poder === \"ejecutivo\") {\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoEjecutivo').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoEjecutivo').setAttribute('filter', 'url(#glow)');\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionEstadoEjecutivo').style.stroke = color;\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionEstadoEjecutivo').style.strokeWidth = '3';\r\n            \r\n        } else if (poder === \"judicial\") {\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoJudicial').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoJudicial').setAttribute('filter', 'url(#glow)');\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionEstadoJudicial').style.stroke = color;\r\n            document.getElementById('conexionEstadoJudicial').style.strokeWidth = '3';\r\n            \r\n        } else if (poder === \"federalismo\") {\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoFederalismo').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoFederalismo').setAttribute('filter', 'url(#glow)');\r\n            document.getElementById('nodoMunicipios').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar poder seleccionado\r\n        const poderSeleccionado = document.getElementById('poderSeleccionado');\r\n        if (poder !== \"todos\" && estructurasDB[poder]) {\r\n            poderSeleccionado.style.opacity = '1';\r\n            poderSeleccionado.querySelector('rect').setAttribute('fill', color);\r\n            document.getElementById('textoPoder').textContent = estructurasDB[poder].nombre;\r\n            document.getElementById('textoDetallePoder').textContent = estructurasDB[poder].organo;\r\n        } else {\r\n            poderSeleccionado.style.opacity = '0';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n\r\n        if (poder !== \"todos\") {\r\n            poderSeleccionado.style.animation = 'pulse 2s';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function poderAleatorio() {\r\n        const poderes = Object.keys(estructurasDB);\r\n        const aleatorio = poderes[Math.floor(Math.random() * poderes.length)];\r\n        document.getElementById('poderSelect').value = aleatorio;\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoEstado').textContent = \r\n            `Poder aleatorio seleccionado: ${estructurasDB[aleatorio].nombre}. Haz clic en \"ANALIZAR ESTRUCTURA\".`;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarAnalisis() {\r\n        console.log(\"\ud83d\udd04 Reiniciando an\u00e1lisis estatal...\");\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('poderSelect').value = 'todos';\r\n        document.getElementById('nivelGobierno').value = 'federal';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar checkboxes\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"detalles\"]').forEach(cb => {\r\n            cb.checked = true;\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n        actualizarVisualizacionEstado(\"todos\", \"#43A047\");\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar datos\r\n        document.getElementById('dataPoder').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataOrgano').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataFuncionarios').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataPresupuesto').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataAtribuciones').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataControles').textContent = '-';\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoEstado').textContent = \r\n            \"Selecciona un poder y haz clic en 'ANALIZAR ESTRUCTURA'\";\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    let quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n    \r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n            \r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            verificarCompletadoQuiz();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    function verificarCompletadoQuiz() {\r\n        const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n        const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q => \r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n        \r\n        if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n        const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n        \r\n        let feedback = \"\";\r\n        if (porcentaje >= 80) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas la estructura del Estado.\";\r\n        } else if (porcentaje >= 60) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero revisa la separaci\u00f3n de poderes.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas repasar los elementos del Estado seg\u00fan Montevideo.\";\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        quizRespuestas = [];\r\n        quizCompletado = false;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE ERRORES COMUNES\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function toggleError(header) {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n        \r\n        if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        } else {\r\n            content.style.display = 'block';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function verificarProblema(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n        const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n        const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n        \r\n        const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n        \r\n        alert(`\ud83d\udcca AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Elementos del Estado: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Separaci\u00f3n de poderes: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Formas de gobierno: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Revisa el plan de estudio recomendado seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcbe AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada: ${slider1}, ${slider2}, ${slider3}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Sistema Cyberpunk Educativo inicializado\");\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Lecci\u00f3n: El Estado - Territorio, Poblaci\u00f3n, Gobierno y Soberan\u00eda\");\r\n    console.log(\"\u26a1 Simulador estatal, Quiz y Herramientas interactivas listas\");\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Elementos del Estado interactivos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.elemento-estado-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const elemento = this.dataset.elemento;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar informaci\u00f3n detallada\r\n            const elementosInfo = {\r\n                territorio: \"Territorio: Espacio f\u00edsico donde se ejerce soberan\u00eda. Componentes: terrestre, mar\u00edtimo, a\u00e9reo, fluvial. L\u00edmites: fronteras naturales o artificiales reconocidas. Caso M\u00e9xico: 1.96M km\u00b2 + 200 millas ZEE.\",\r\n                poblacion: \"Poblaci\u00f3n: Conjunto de personas sujetas a la jurisdicci\u00f3n estatal. Ciudadan\u00eda: v\u00ednculo jur\u00eddico-pol\u00edtico. Nacionalidad: v\u00ednculo jur\u00eddico. M\u00e9xico: 130M hab., 52% mujeres, densidad 66 hab\/km\u00b2.\",\r\n                gobierno: \"Gobierno: Conjunto de instituciones que ejercen el poder. Formas: Rep\u00fablica (electiva) vs Monarqu\u00eda (hereditaria). Sistemas: Presidencial vs Parlamentario. M\u00e9xico: Rep\u00fablica Federal Presidencialista.\",\r\n                soberania: \"Soberan\u00eda: Poder supremo e independiente. Interna: sobre territorio y poblaci\u00f3n. Externa: en relaciones internacionales. Limitaciones: derecho internacional, tratados, derechos humanos.\"\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            alert(`\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f ${this.querySelector('h4').textContent}\\n\\n${elementosInfo[elemento] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\"}`);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Formas de gobierno interactivas\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.forma-gobierno').forEach(forma => {\r\n        forma.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const tipo = this.dataset.forma;\r\n            const titulo = this.querySelector('h4').textContent;\r\n            const contenido = this.querySelector('.forma-content').innerHTML;\r\n            \r\n            alert(`\ud83c\udf0d ${titulo}\\n\\n${contenido.replace(\/<[^>]*>\/g, '\\n')}`);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Objetivos interactivos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n            this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n            const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n            checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n            checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : '';\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Agregar filtro glow al SVG\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById('svgEstado');\r\n    const defs = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'defs');\r\n    const filter = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'filter');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('id', 'glow');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('x', '-50%');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('y', '-50%');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('width', '200%');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('height', '200%');\r\n    \r\n    const feGaussianBlur = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feGaussianBlur');\r\n    feGaussianBlur.setAttribute('stdDeviation', '4');\r\n    feGaussianBlur.setAttribute('result', 'coloredBlur');\r\n    \r\n    const feMerge = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMerge');\r\n    const feMergeNode1 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMergeNode');\r\n    feMergeNode1.setAttribute('in', 'coloredBlur');\r\n    const feMergeNode2 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMergeNode');\r\n    feMergeNode2.setAttribute('in', 'SourceGraphic');\r\n    \r\n    feMerge.appendChild(feMergeNode1);\r\n    feMerge.appendChild(feMergeNode2);\r\n    filter.appendChild(feGaussianBlur);\r\n    filter.appendChild(feMerge);\r\n    defs.appendChild(filter);\r\n    svg.appendChild(defs);\r\n    <\/script>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Cuatro elementos del Estado","respuesta":"Territorio, poblaci\u00f3n, gobierno, soberan\u00eda"},{"enunciado":"Funci\u00f3n principal del Estado","respuesta":"Regular sociedad y proveer servicios"},{"enunciado":"Poder que crea leyes","respuesta":"Legislativo"},{"enunciado":"Poder que ejecuta leyes","respuesta":"Ejecutivo"},{"enunciado":"Poder que interpreta leyes","respuesta":"Judicial"},{"enunciado":"M\u00e9xico: jefe del ejecutivo","respuesta":"Presidente"},{"enunciado":"SCJN significa","respuesta":"Suprema Corte de Justicia de la Naci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Soberan\u00eda permite","respuesta":"Relaciones internacionales"},{"enunciado":"M\u00e9xico: territorio en km\u00b2","respuesta":"~1.96 millones"},{"enunciado":"Convenci\u00f3n de Montevideo","respuesta":"1933, define Estado"},{"enunciado":"Estado moderno incluye","respuesta":"Servicios p\u00fablicos"},{"enunciado":"SI: M\u00e9xico en ONU desde","respuesta":"1945"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Elemento del Estado","opciones":["Territorio","Clima","Religi\u00f3n","Idioma"],"correcta":"Territorio"},{"pregunta":"Poblaci\u00f3n es","opciones":["Permanente","Turistas","Visitantes","Animales"],"correcta":"Permanente"},{"pregunta":"Gobierno es","opciones":["Instituciones de poder","Pueblo","Empresas","ONG"],"correcta":"Instituciones de poder"},{"pregunta":"Soberan\u00eda implica","opciones":["Independencia externa","Dependencia","Aislamiento","Nada"],"correcta":"Independencia externa"},{"pregunta":"Legislativo hace","opciones":["Leyes","Ejecuta","Juzga","Nada"],"correcta":"Leyes"},{"pregunta":"Ejecutivo encabezado por","opciones":["Presidente","Congreso","Corte","Pueblo"],"correcta":"Presidente"},{"pregunta":"Judicial resuelve","opciones":["Disputas legales","Presupuestos","Elecciones","Guerra"],"correcta":"Disputas legales"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: poderes","opciones":["3","1","2","5"],"correcta":"3"},{"pregunta":"Art. 49 CPEUM","opciones":["Separaci\u00f3n de poderes","Derechos","Territorio","Poblaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Separaci\u00f3n de poderes"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: estados en M\u00e9xico","opciones":["32 + CDMX","31","33","30"],"correcta":"32 + CDMX"},{"pregunta":"Estado sin territorio","opciones":["No existe","S\u00ed","Virtual","Espacial"],"correcta":"No existe"},{"pregunta":"ONU reconoce","opciones":["193 estados","100","200","150"],"correcta":"193 estados"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: capital","opciones":["CDMX","Guadalajara","Monterrey","Puebla"],"correcta":"CDMX"},{"pregunta":"Poder que nombra ministros","opciones":["Ejecutivo","Legislativo","Judicial","Pueblo"],"correcta":"Ejecutivo"},{"pregunta":"Congreso es","opciones":["Legislativo","Ejecutivo","Judicial","Ninguno"],"correcta":"Legislativo"},{"pregunta":"SCJN es parte de","opciones":["Poder Judicial","Ejecutivo","Legislativo","Ninguno"],"correcta":"Poder Judicial"},{"pregunta":"Estado federal como M\u00e9xico","opciones":["32 entidades","1 solo","2","100"],"correcta":"32 entidades"},{"pregunta":"Soberan\u00eda interna","opciones":["Autoridad sobre poblaci\u00f3n","Externa","Nada","Ambas"],"correcta":"Autoridad sobre poblaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Tratado internacional","opciones":["Ejercicio soberan\u00eda","P\u00e9rdida","Nada","Interno"],"correcta":"Ejercicio soberan\u00eda"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: M\u00e9xico PIB lugar","opciones":["~15 mundial","1","50","100"],"correcta":"~15 mundial"},{"pregunta":"Estado fallido","opciones":["Sin control efectivo","Fuerte","Democr\u00e1tico","Rico"],"correcta":"Sin control efectivo"},{"pregunta":"Ciudad del Vaticano","opciones":["Estado soberano","No","Parte Italia","Virtual"],"correcta":"Estado soberano"},{"pregunta":"Poder que declara guerra","opciones":["Congreso","Presidente","Corte","Pueblo"],"correcta":"Congreso"},{"pregunta":"Impuestos son funci\u00f3n","opciones":["Estado","Empresa","Familia","Iglesia"],"correcta":"Estado"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: moneda","opciones":["Peso","D\u00f3lar","Euro","Bitcoin"],"correcta":"Peso"},{"pregunta":"Estado de derecho","opciones":["Supremac\u00eda de la ley","Fuerza","Tradici\u00f3n","Religi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Supremac\u00eda de la ley"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: himno","opciones":["Himno Nacional Mexicano","Ninguno","Internacional","Popular"],"correcta":"Himno Nacional Mexicano"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: INEGI mide","opciones":["Poblaci\u00f3n, PIB","Clima","Deportes","M\u00fasica"],"correcta":"Poblaci\u00f3n, PIB"},{"pregunta":"Estado laico","opciones":["M\u00e9xico (Art. 130)","Religioso","Cat\u00f3lico","Protestante"],"correcta":"M\u00e9xico (Art. 130)"},{"pregunta":"Estado es","opciones":["Persona jur\u00eddica","F\u00edsica","Animal","Cosa"],"correcta":"Persona jur\u00eddica"}]},{"materia":"Ciencias Sociales","slug":"relaciones-poderes","titulo":"Relaciones de Poder: Dominaci\u00f3n, Resistencia y Negociaci\u00f3n","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-sociales-poder\" data-tema=\"relaciones-poder\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n            RELACIONES DE PODER: LA RED SOCIAL DEL CONTROL\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Dominaci\u00f3n, Resistencia y Negociaci\u00f3n en el Tejido Social Contempor\u00e1neo\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Identificar tipos y fuentes de poder<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Pol\u00edtico, econ\u00f3mico, social-cultural y personal seg\u00fan Weber, Foucault y Bourdieu<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar din\u00e1micas relacionales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Dominaci\u00f3n, resistencia, negociaci\u00f3n y sus manifestaciones en distintos contextos<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Mapear redes de poder<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Visualizar interconexiones entre actores y formas de ejercicio del poder<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Evaluar casos contempor\u00e1neos<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Aplicar teor\u00eda a conflictos laborales, movimientos sociales y relaciones institucionales<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> CASOS REALES DE EJERCICIO DE PODER\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcbc Relaciones Laborales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Patr\u00f3n-empleado: jerarqu\u00eda \u2192 sindicato: resistencia \u2192 negociaci\u00f3n colectiva: equilibrio<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">30% trabajadores sindicalizados M\u00e9xico<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Movimientos Sociales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Protestas ciudadanas \u2192 presi\u00f3n medi\u00e1tica \u2192 respuesta institucional \u2192 reformas<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">#YoSoy132 (2012): 132 marchas simult\u00e1neas<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcf1 Poder Digital<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Plataformas tecnol\u00f3gicas \u2192 control datos \u2192 influencia pol\u00edtica \u2192 regulaci\u00f3n estatal<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Meta: 2.9B usuarios, m\u00e1s que cualquier pa\u00eds<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- FUNDAMENTOS TE\u00d3RICOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> TEOR\u00cdAS FUNDAMENTALES DEL PODER\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- DEFINICI\u00d3N PRINCIPAL -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\u26a1 EL PODER SEG\u00daN FOUCAULT<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>\"<strong>El poder est\u00e1 en todas partes<\/strong> porque viene de todas partes\" - <em>Microf\u00edsica del poder<\/em><\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[ \\text{Poder} \\neq \\text{Posesi\u00f3n} \\quad \\text{Poder} = \\text{Relaci\u00f3n} \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"teorias-contraste\">\r\n                        <div class=\"teoria-item\">\r\n                            <strong>Weber:<\/strong> Poder como probabilidad de imponer voluntad\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"teoria-item\">\r\n                            <strong>Foucault:<\/strong> Poder relacional, productivo, en red\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"teoria-item\">\r\n                            <strong>Bourdieu:<\/strong> Capital simb\u00f3lico y violencia simb\u00f3lica\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TIPOS DE PODER -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Tipolog\u00edas y Fuentes del Poder<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"tipos-poder-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"tipo-poder-card\" data-tipo=\"politico\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-icon\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>PODER POL\u00cdTICO<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-desc\">\r\n                        Capacidad de tomar decisiones vinculantes para la colectividad\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Fuentes:<\/strong> Autoridad leg\u00edtima, monopolio violencia leg\u00edtima (Weber)<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Formas:<\/strong> Estado, partidos, gobierno, instituciones p\u00fablicas<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Legitimaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Tradicional, carism\u00e1tica, legal-racional<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83d\udc51<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Estado Mexicano<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Monopolio violencia leg\u00edtima\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Partidos pol\u00edticos<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Competencia electoral, representaci\u00f3n\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83d\udc6e<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Fuerzas de seguridad<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Ejercicio coactivo regulado\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-dato\">\r\n                        <span>Presupuesto seguridad 2024:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">$320,000M MXN<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"tipo-poder-card\" data-tipo=\"economico\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-icon\">\ud83d\udcb0<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>PODER ECON\u00d3MICO<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-desc\">\r\n                        Control sobre recursos materiales y medios de producci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Fuentes:<\/strong> Capital, propiedad, control recursos estrat\u00e9gicos<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Formas:<\/strong> Empresas, bancos, monopolios, corporaciones transnacionales<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Mecanismos:<\/strong> Acumulaci\u00f3n, inversi\u00f3n, control mercados<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83c\udfe2<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Empresas transnacionales<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Walmart, Amazon, Tesla\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83c\udfe6<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Instituciones financieras<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Banco de M\u00e9xico, bancos comerciales\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83d\udee2\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Control recursos<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Pemex, mineras, energ\u00e9ticas\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-dato\">\r\n                        <span>10% m\u00e1s rico concentra:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">64% riqueza nacional<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"tipo-poder-card\" data-tipo=\"social\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-icon\">\ud83c\udfad<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>PODER SOCIAL-CULTURAL<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-desc\">\r\n                        Influencia sobre valores, normas, conocimiento y significados sociales\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Fuentes:<\/strong> Capital cultural, simb\u00f3lico, medios comunicaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Formas:<\/strong> Medios, educaci\u00f3n, religi\u00f3n, instituciones culturales<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Mecanismos:<\/strong> Socializaci\u00f3n, hegemon\u00eda cultural (Gramsci)<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83d\udcfa<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Medios de comunicaci\u00f3n<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Televisa, TV Azteca, redes sociales\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83c\udfeb<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Sistema educativo<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Curr\u00edculum, valores transmitidos\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\u26ea<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Instituciones religiosas<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Iglesia Cat\u00f3lica (82.7% poblaci\u00f3n)\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-dato\">\r\n                        <span>Audiencia TV abierta:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">45M personas\/d\u00eda<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"tipo-poder-card\" data-tipo=\"personal\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>PODER PERSONAL<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-desc\">\r\n                        Capacidad individual basada en caracter\u00edsticas personales y conocimientos\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Fuentes:<\/strong> Carisma, conocimiento experto, habilidades sociales<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Formas:<\/strong> Liderazgo, influencia interpersonal, autoridad moral<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Mecanismos:<\/strong> Persuasi\u00f3n, ejemplo, capacidad convocatoria<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83c\udf1f<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>L\u00edderes carism\u00e1ticos<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Figuras pol\u00edticas, sociales\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udd2c<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Expertos y cient\u00edficos<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Autoridad basada en conocimiento\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-icon\">\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"ejemplo-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Influencers<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Poder de convocatoria en redes\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tipo-poder-dato\">\r\n                        <span>Mayor influencer MX:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">25M seguidores<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- DIN\u00c1MICAS DEL PODER -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Din\u00e1micas Relacionales del Poder<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"dinamicas-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"dinamica-card\" data-dinamica=\"dominacion\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dinamica-icon\">\ud83d\udc51<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>DOMINACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"dinamica-desc\">\r\n                        Ejercicio unilateral de poder sin consentimiento del sometido\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dinamica-detalle\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Caracter\u00edsticas:<\/strong> Asim\u00e9trica, coercitiva, jer\u00e1rquica<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Tipos seg\u00fan Weber:<\/strong> Tradicional, carism\u00e1tica, legal-racional<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Dictaduras, relaciones patriarcales, explotaci\u00f3n laboral<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dinamica-formas\">\r\n                        <div class=\"forma-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-icon\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Dominaci\u00f3n legal<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Burocracia, normas institucionales\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"forma-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-icon\">\ud83d\udcaa<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Dominaci\u00f3n coercitiva<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Fuerza, amenaza, violencia\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"forma-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-icon\">\ud83c\udfad<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Dominaci\u00f3n simb\u00f3lica<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Naturalizaci\u00f3n desigualdades (Bourdieu)\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"dinamica-card\" data-dinamica=\"resistencia\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dinamica-icon\">\u270a<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>RESISTENCIA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"dinamica-desc\">\r\n                        Acciones que cuestionan, limitan o rechazan relaciones de poder establecidas\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dinamica-detalle\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Caracter\u00edsticas:<\/strong> Reactiva\/proactiva, individual\/colectiva, visible\/oculta<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Formas:<\/strong> Protestas, desobediencia, creaci\u00f3n alternativa<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Movimientos sociales, huelgas, arte subversivo<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dinamica-formas\">\r\n                        <div class=\"forma-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-icon\">\ud83d\udeb6<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Resistencia abierta<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Protestas, manifestaciones, huelgas\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"forma-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-icon\">\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Resistencia cotidiana<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Sabotaje sutil, incumplimiento t\u00e1cito\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"forma-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-icon\">\ud83c\udfa8<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Resistencia cultural<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Contracultura, arte pol\u00edtico\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"dinamica-card\" data-dinamica=\"negociacion\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dinamica-icon\">\ud83e\udd1d<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>NEGOCIACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"dinamica-desc\">\r\n                        Proceso interactivo donde actores con intereses diferentes buscan acuerdos\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dinamica-detalle\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Caracter\u00edsticas:<\/strong> Interactiva, dial\u00f3gica, busca equilibrio<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Mecanismos:<\/strong> Di\u00e1logo, concesiones mutuas, mediaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> Negociaci\u00f3n colectiva, acuerdos pol\u00edticos, tratados<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dinamica-formas\">\r\n                        <div class=\"forma-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Negociaci\u00f3n formal<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Contratos colectivos, tratados\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"forma-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-icon\">\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Negociaci\u00f3n informal<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Acuerdos t\u00e1citos, entendimientos\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"forma-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-icon\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"forma-text\">\r\n                                <strong>Mediaci\u00f3n institucional<\/strong><br>\r\n                                Juntas de conciliaci\u00f3n, \u00e1rbitros\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"ciclo-poder\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udd04 CICLO DIN\u00c1MICO DEL PODER<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"ciclo-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ciclo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ciclo-icon\">\ud83d\udc51<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ciclo-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Dominaci\u00f3n<\/strong><br>\r\n                            Establece relaciones asim\u00e9tricas\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ciclo-flecha\">\u2192<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ciclo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ciclo-icon\">\u270a<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ciclo-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Resistencia<\/strong><br>\r\n                            Cuestiona y desaf\u00eda el poder\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ciclo-flecha\">\u2192<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ciclo-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ciclo-icon\">\ud83e\udd1d<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ciclo-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Negociaci\u00f3n<\/strong><br>\r\n                            Busca nuevos equilibrios\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ciclo-flecha\">\u21bb<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <p class=\"ciclo-explicacion\">El poder nunca es est\u00e1tico: toda dominaci\u00f3n genera resistencia, que a su vez puede llevar a negociaci\u00f3n y reconfiguraci\u00f3n de relaciones.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- MATRIZ DE PODER -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Matriz de Poder: Intersecciones y Superposiciones<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"principio-foucault\">\r\n                <p><strong>Michel Foucault:<\/strong> \"El poder no es un atributo, no es una 'posesi\u00f3n' que se conquista, se arranca, se comparte... el poder se ejerce a partir de innumerables puntos.\"<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"matriz-interactiva\">\r\n                <table class=\"matriz-poder\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>\u00c1MBITO<\/th>\r\n                            <th>DOMINACI\u00d3N<\/th>\r\n                            <th>RESISTENCIA<\/th>\r\n                            <th>NEGOCIACI\u00d3N<\/th>\r\n                            <th>EJEMPLO CONCRETO<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr data-ambito=\"laboral\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">LABORAL<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Jerarqu\u00eda empresarial, control patronal<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Sindicatos, huelgas, organizaci\u00f3n obrera<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Contrato colectivo, comisiones mixtas<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Empresa maquiladora vs sindicato independiente<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-ambito=\"politico\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">POL\u00cdTICO<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Estado autoritario, control medios<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Movimientos sociales, protestas<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Di\u00e1logo nacional, pactos pol\u00edticos<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Movimiento estudiantil 1968 vs Estado mexicano<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-ambito=\"social\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">SOCIAL<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Discriminaci\u00f3n, exclusi\u00f3n sist\u00e9mica<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Movimientos identitarios, visibilizaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Pol\u00edticas inclusivas, reconocimiento derechos<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Feminismo vs patriarcado: #NiUnaMenos<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-ambito=\"cultural\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">CULTURAL<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Hegemon\u00eda cultural, control narrativas<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Contracultura, arte subversivo<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Pluralismo, di\u00e1logo intercultural<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Movimiento zapatista: \"Mandar obedeciendo\"<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n                <div class=\"matriz-info\" id=\"infoMatriz\">\r\n                    Selecciona un \u00e1mbito para ver an\u00e1lisis detallado\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> SIMULADOR: RED DE PODER DIN\u00c1MICA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"red-poder\">\r\n            <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>CONTROLES DE SIMULACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"escenarioSelect\">Escenario de poder:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"escenarioSelect\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"empresa\">Empresa industrial<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"universidad\">Universidad p\u00fablica<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"comunidad\">Comunidad rural<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"ciudad\">Ciudad metropolitana<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"online\">Espacio digital<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"dinamicaSelect\">Din\u00e1mica predominante:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"dinamicaSelect\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"dominacion\">Dominaci\u00f3n<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"resistencia\">Resistencia<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"negociacion\">Negociaci\u00f3n<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"mixta\">Mixta (todas)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label>Actores a visualizar:<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"checkbox-group\">\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"actores\" value=\"institucionales\" checked> Institucionales<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"actores\" value=\"colectivos\" checked> Colectivos<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"actores\" value=\"individuales\"> Individuales<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"actores\" value=\"informales\"> Informales<\/label>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-control\">\r\n                    <label for=\"intensidadPoder\">Intensidad de poder:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"intensidadPoder\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"5\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>Baja<\/span><span>Media<\/span><span>Alta<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-clasificar\" onclick=\"simularRedPoder()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u26a1<\/span> SIMULAR RED\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-aleatorio\" onclick=\"escenarioAleatorio()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83c\udfb2<\/span> ESCENARIO ALEATORIO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarSimulacion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DE LA RED -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacionRed\">\r\n                <div class=\"red-container\">\r\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 500\" id=\"svgRed\">\r\n                        <!-- Fondo de red -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"500\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\" id=\"fondoRed\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- RED DE PODER DIN\u00c1MICA -->\r\n                        <g id=\"redPoder\">\r\n                            <!-- Nodos din\u00e1micos se agregar\u00e1n aqu\u00ed -->\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- CONEXIONES DIN\u00c1MICAS -->\r\n                        <g id=\"conexionesRed\"><\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- LEGENDA INTERACTIVA -->\r\n                        <g id=\"leyendaRed\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"400\" y=\"400\" width=\"180\" height=\"90\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.7)\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"490\" y=\"420\" fill=\"#39FF14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">LEGENDAS<\/text>\r\n                            \r\n                            <!-- Dominaci\u00f3n -->\r\n                            <circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"435\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#D32F2F\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"425\" y=\"438\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-size=\"9\">Dominaci\u00f3n<\/text>\r\n                            \r\n                            <!-- Resistencia -->\r\n                            <circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"450\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#FF9800\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"425\" y=\"453\" fill=\"#FFECB3\" font-size=\"9\">Resistencia<\/text>\r\n                            \r\n                            <!-- Negociaci\u00f3n -->\r\n                            <circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"465\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#2196F3\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"425\" y=\"468\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\" font-size=\"9\">Negociaci\u00f3n<\/text>\r\n                            \r\n                            <!-- Poder mixto -->\r\n                            <circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"480\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#9C27B0\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"425\" y=\"483\" fill=\"#E1BEE7\" font-size=\"9\">Mixto<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- INFO NODO SELECCIONADO -->\r\n                        <g id=\"infoNodo\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"400\" width=\"300\" height=\"80\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.8)\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"425\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" id=\"textoNodo\">NODO<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"445\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" id=\"tipoNodo\">Tipo<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"465\" fill=\"#FFECB3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" id=\"poderNodo\">Poder: 0<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                    <\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"red-info\" id=\"infoRed\">\r\n                    Selecciona un escenario y haz clic en \"SIMULAR RED\"\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- DATOS DE LA SIMULACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>DATOS DE LA RED<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Escenario:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEscenario\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Actores principales:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataActores\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Din\u00e1mica predominante:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataDinamica\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">NIVEL CONFLICTO:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataConflicto\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Mecanismos de poder:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataMecanismos\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Potencial transformaci\u00f3n:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataTransformacion\">-<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcca ESTAD\u00cdSTICAS DE PODER<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Sindicatos en M\u00e9xico:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">35,000+<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Protestas sociales\/a\u00f1o:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">3,500+<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Contratos colectivos:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">110,000<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Huelgas 2023:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">42<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>ONGs registradas:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">45,000<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CASO DE ESTUDIO: RELACIONES LABORALES -->\r\n    <section class=\"caso-estudio\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-ejemplo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd0d<\/span> CASO DE ESTUDIO: RELACIONES LABORALES EN MAQUILADORA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"caso-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"linea-tiempo\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udcc5 EVOLUCI\u00d3N TEMPORAL DEL CONFLICTO<\/h4>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"evento-tiempo\" data-fase=\"dominacion\">\r\n                    <div class=\"evento-fecha\">2015-2018<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"evento-contenido\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udc51 FASE DE DOMINACI\u00d3N<\/h5>\r\n                        <p><strong>Empresa:<\/strong> Maquiladora transnacional en frontera norte<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Pr\u00e1cticas:<\/strong> Jornadas 12h, salarios m\u00ednimos, sindicato charro<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Mecanismos:<\/strong> Control f\u00e9rreo, amenazas de despido, vigilancia<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"evento-dato\">\r\n                            <span>Rotaci\u00f3n anual:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">85%<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"evento-tiempo\" data-fase=\"resistencia\">\r\n                    <div class=\"evento-fecha\">2019-2020<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"evento-contenido\">\r\n                        <h5>\u270a FASE DE RESISTENCIA<\/h5>\r\n                        <p><strong>Acciones trabajadoras:<\/strong> Organizaci\u00f3n clandestina, denuncias an\u00f3nimas<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Puntos de quiebre:<\/strong> Accidentes laborales, demandas colectivas<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Alianzas:<\/strong> ONGs de derechos humanos, medios independientes<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"evento-dato\">\r\n                            <span>Denuncias presentadas:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">47<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"evento-tiempo\" data-fase=\"negociacion\">\r\n                    <div class=\"evento-fecha\">2021-2023<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"evento-contenido\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83e\udd1d FASE DE NEGOCIACI\u00d3N<\/h5>\r\n                        <p><strong>Proceso:<\/strong> Mediaci\u00f3n de PROFEDET, presi\u00f3n internacional<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Resultados:<\/strong> Nuevo contrato colectivo, aumento salarial 22%<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Cambios:<\/strong> Comisi\u00f3n de seguridad, capacitaci\u00f3n sindical<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"evento-dato\">\r\n                            <span>Aumento salarial:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"dato-valor\">22%<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"analisis-caso\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udcca AN\u00c1LISIS DE PODER EN EL CASO<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"analisis-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                        <h5>\u26a1 TIPOS DE PODER EJERCIDOS<\/h5>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Econ\u00f3mico:<\/strong> Control salarios, empleo<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Pol\u00edtico:<\/strong> Relaciones con autoridades locales<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Simb\u00f3lico:<\/strong> Discursos de \"oportunidad laboral\"<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udd04 DIN\u00c1MICAS IDENTIFICADAS<\/h5>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Dominaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Control patronal absoluto inicial<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Resistencia:<\/strong> Organizaci\u00f3n subterr\u00e1nea gradual<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Negociaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Di\u00e1logo forzado por presi\u00f3n externa<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83c\udfaf FACTORES DE CAMBIO<\/h5>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Internos:<\/strong> Solidaridad trabajadora<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Externos:<\/strong> Presi\u00f3n medi\u00e1tica internacional<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Institucionales:<\/strong> Intervenci\u00f3n PROFEDET<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"lecciones-caso\">\r\n                    <h5>\ud83d\udca1 LECCIONES APRENDIDAS<\/h5>\r\n                    <p>1. El poder nunca es absoluto: toda dominaci\u00f3n genera resistencia.<\/p>\r\n                    <p>2. La resistencia efectiva requiere organizaci\u00f3n y alianzas estrat\u00e9gicas.<\/p>\r\n                    <p>3. La negociaci\u00f3n exitosa necesita presi\u00f3n externa y debilidad interna del poder dominante.<\/p>\r\n                    <p>4. Los cambios en relaciones de poder son procesos, no eventos aislados.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Seg\u00fan Michel Foucault, \u00bfcu\u00e1l es la naturaleza del poder?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Es una posesi\u00f3n que se adquiere y mantiene\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Se concentra exclusivamente en el Estado\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Es relacional y se ejerce en m\u00faltiples puntos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Es esencialmente econ\u00f3mico y material\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Foucault concibe el poder como relacional y difuso.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la concepci\u00f3n foucaultiana del poder.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Para Foucault, el poder \"est\u00e1 en todas partes\" porque \"viene de todas partes\". No es algo que se posee, sino que se ejerce en relaciones. Se manifiesta en instituciones, discursos y pr\u00e1cticas cotidianas, no solo en el Estado.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es un ejemplo de \"dominaci\u00f3n simb\u00f3lica\" seg\u00fan Bourdieu?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Un ej\u00e9rcito ocupando un territorio\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Un contrato laboral firmado\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Una protesta con enfrentamientos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        La naturalizaci\u00f3n de desigualdades sociales\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> La dominaci\u00f3n simb\u00f3lica naturaliza las desigualdades.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> La dominaci\u00f3n simb\u00f3lica opera a nivel cultural.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La \"violencia simb\u00f3lica\" de Bourdieu se refiere a la imposici\u00f3n de sistemas de significados que hacen parecer naturales las relaciones de dominaci\u00f3n. Ejemplos: la meritocracia que justifica desigualdades, estereotipos de g\u00e9nero que naturalizan roles, etc.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>En el ciclo din\u00e1mico del poder, \u00bfqu\u00e9 sucede usualmente despu\u00e9s de la dominaci\u00f3n?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Consolidaci\u00f3n permanente del poder\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Emergencia de formas de resistencia\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Desaparici\u00f3n de las relaciones de poder\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Automatizaci\u00f3n de la obediencia\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Toda dominaci\u00f3n genera resistencia.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la din\u00e1mica relacional del poder.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Dato:<\/strong> Seg\u00fan la teor\u00eda cr\u00edtica del poder, el ejercicio de dominaci\u00f3n casi inevitablemente genera respuestas de resistencia, que pueden ser abiertas (protestas) o encubiertas (sabotaje cotidiano). Esta resistencia puede llevar posteriormente a negociaci\u00f3n y reconfiguraci\u00f3n de relaciones.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES Y SOLUCIONES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c REDUCIR EL PODER A \"DOMINACI\u00d3N\"<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"El poder es siempre opresivo y negativo\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Foucault distingue entre \"poder\" (relacional) y \"dominaci\u00f3n\" (estructuras fijas). El poder tambi\u00e9n puede ser:\r\n                        \\[\r\n                        \\begin{aligned}\r\n                        \\text{Poder productivo} &: \\text{Crea realidades, saberes, sujetos} \\\\\r\n                        \\text{Poder pastoral} &: \\text{Cuidado, gu\u00eda (ej: educaci\u00f3n, salud)} \\\\\r\n                        \\text{Poder biopol\u00edtico} &: \\text{Gesti\u00f3n de poblaciones (estad\u00edsticas, pol\u00edticas)}\r\n                        \\end{aligned}\r\n                        \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Practica:<\/strong> Identifica ejemplos de poder: 1) Maestro que ense\u00f1a, 2) M\u00e9dico que cura, 3) Activista que organiza comunidad<\/p>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-mini\" onclick=\"mostrarSolucion(1)\">Ver soluci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"solucion\" id=\"solucion1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                            <strong>1) Maestro:<\/strong> Poder productivo (produce conocimiento, forma sujetos)<br>\r\n                            <strong>2) M\u00e9dico:<\/strong> Poder pastoral (cuidado, pero tambi\u00e9n control biopol\u00edtico)<br>\r\n                            <strong>3) Activista:<\/strong> Poder contra-hegem\u00f3nico (resiste pero tambi\u00e9n propone alternativas)\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c CONCEBIR LA RESISTENCIA COMO SIEMPRE \"HEROICA\" Y VISIBLE<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error com\u00fan:<\/strong> \"Solo hay resistencia cuando hay protestas masivas o revoluciones\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Correcci\u00f3n:<\/strong> James Scott identifica las \"armas de los d\u00e9biles\":\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Resistencia cotidiana:<\/strong> Incumplimiento t\u00e1cito, trabajo lento, \"malentendidos\"<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Transcripci\u00f3n oculta:<\/strong> Cr\u00edtica fuera de la vista del poderoso<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Sabotaje sutil:<\/strong> Da\u00f1os peque\u00f1os, p\u00e9rdida de productividad<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-tabla\">\r\n                        <table>\r\n                            <tr><th>Tipo resistencia<\/th><th>Ejemplo en f\u00e1brica<\/th><th>Ejemplo en escuela<\/th><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Abierta\/organizada<\/td><td>Huelga, paro<\/td><td>Protesta estudiantil<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Cotidiana\/individual<\/td><td>Trabajo lento, \"errores\"<\/td><td>Llegar tarde, \"olvidar\" tareas<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                            <tr><td>Cultural\/simb\u00f3lica<\/td><td>Cultura obrera alternativa<\/td><td>Contracultura estudiantil<\/td><\/tr>\r\n                        <\/table>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>An\u00e1lisis de Red de Poder en Universidad<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Analiza las relaciones de poder en una <strong>universidad p\u00fablica mexicana<\/strong> identificando:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li><strong>Actores principales:<\/strong> Rector\u00eda, consejo universitario, sindicato acad\u00e9mico, sindicato administrativo, estudiantes, gobierno federal<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Tipos de poder ejercidos:<\/strong> Para cada actor, especifica si ejerce poder pol\u00edtico, econ\u00f3mico, cultural y\/o personal<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Din\u00e1micas predominantes:<\/strong> Identifica relaciones de dominaci\u00f3n, resistencia y negociaci\u00f3n entre actores<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Mecanismos espec\u00edficos:<\/strong> Presupuesto, evaluaciones, acreditaciones, movilizaciones, negociaciones salariales<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Presenta tu an\u00e1lisis en forma de matriz y prop\u00f3n un diagrama de red de poder.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu an\u00e1lisis de red de poder universitaria...\" rows=\"10\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>An\u00e1lisis modelo universidad p\u00fablica:<\/strong><br><br>\r\n                    <strong>1. Matriz de actores y poder:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Rector\u00eda:<\/em> Poder pol\u00edtico (decisiones), econ\u00f3mico (presupuesto), simb\u00f3lico (representaci\u00f3n)<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Consejo universitario:<\/em> Poder pol\u00edtico colegiado, toma decisiones estrat\u00e9gicas<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Sindicato acad\u00e9mico:<\/em> Poder de resistencia (huelgas), negociaci\u00f3n (salarios)<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Estudiantes:<\/em> Poder de movilizaci\u00f3n, presi\u00f3n medi\u00e1tica, representaci\u00f3n en consejos<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Gobierno federal (SEP):<\/em> Poder econ\u00f3mico (subsidios), pol\u00edtico (normatividad)<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>2. Din\u00e1micas identificadas:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Dominaci\u00f3n:<\/em> Rector\u00eda sobre curr\u00edculum, gobierno sobre presupuesto<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Resistencia:<\/em> Sindicatos contra recortes, estudiantes por derechos<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Negociaci\u00f3n:<\/em> Contratos colectivos, aumento de matr\u00edcula, reformas estatutarias<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>3. Mecanismos clave:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Evaluaci\u00f3n:<\/em> Control sobre acad\u00e9micos (SNI, PROMEP)<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Presupuesto:<\/em> Dependencia gubernamental limita autonom\u00eda<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Acreditaci\u00f3n:<\/em> Poder de organismos externos (CENEVAL, COPAES)<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>4. Propuesta diagrama:<\/strong> Red centralizada con rector\u00eda en centro, m\u00faltiples conexiones conflictivas y colaborativas seg\u00fan temas espec\u00edficos.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Dise\u00f1o de Estrategia de Transformaci\u00f3n de Poder<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Dise\u00f1a una estrategia para transformar relaciones de poder <strong>en una comunidad ind\u00edgena marginalizada<\/strong> considerando:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li><strong>Diagn\u00f3stico:<\/strong> Identifica actores, tipos de poder y din\u00e1micas existentes<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Objetivos de transformaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Qu\u00e9 relaciones cambiar y hacia d\u00f3nde<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Estrategias espec\u00edficas:<\/strong> Por tipo de poder (pol\u00edtico, econ\u00f3mico, cultural)<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Actores aliados y opositores:<\/strong> Qui\u00e9nes apoyar\u00edan u obstaculizar\u00edan<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Indicadores de \u00e9xito:<\/strong> C\u00f3mo medir cambios en relaciones de poder<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Considera especialmente mecanismos de resistencia y negociaci\u00f3n efectivos.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Describe tu estrategia de transformaci\u00f3n de poder...\" rows=\"10\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR PROCEDIMIENTO<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Estrategia de transformaci\u00f3n modelo:<\/strong><br><br>\r\n                    <strong>1. Diagn\u00f3stico comunitario:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Actores externos dominantes:<\/em> Gobierno municipal, empresas extractivas, iglesias<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Actores internos:<\/em> Autoridades tradicionales, j\u00f3venes, mujeres, ancianos<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Din\u00e1micas:<\/em> Dependencia econ\u00f3mica, discriminaci\u00f3n cultural, exclusi\u00f3n pol\u00edtica<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>2. Objetivos transformadores:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 De dominaci\u00f3n externa a autonom\u00eda comunitaria<br>\r\n                    \u2022 De exclusi\u00f3n a participaci\u00f3n efectiva<br>\r\n                    \u2022 De discriminaci\u00f3n a reconocimiento cultural<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>3. Estrategias por tipo de poder:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Pol\u00edtico:<\/em> Formaci\u00f3n de l\u00edderes comunitarios, incidencia en pol\u00edticas p\u00fablicas<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Econ\u00f3mico:<\/em> Cooperativas autogestivas, comercio justo, econom\u00eda solidaria<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Cultural:<\/strong> Escuelas biling\u00fces, revitalizaci\u00f3n lengua, turismo comunitario<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>4. Actores estrat\u00e9gicos:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Aliados:<\/em> ONGs de derechos humanos, universidades, medios alternativos<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <em>Opositores:<\/em> Intereses empresariales, autoridades corruptas, grupos conservadores<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>5. Indicadores de cambio:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 Participaci\u00f3n mujeres en decisiones: de 10% a 40%<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Ingresos comunitarios aut\u00f3nomos: de 20% a 60%<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Reconocimiento derechos en leyes locales<br>\r\n                    \u2022 Reducci\u00f3n migraci\u00f3n forzada juvenil<br><br>\r\n                    \r\n                    <strong>Mecanismos clave:<\/strong> Asambleas comunitarias, defensa legal estrat\u00e9gica, alianzas nacionales\/internacionales, comunicaci\u00f3n alternativa.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Identificaci\u00f3n actores y poder<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Reconoce actores formales e informales, m\u00faltiples tipos de poder<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Identifica actores principales y algunos tipos de poder<\/td>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis superficial o incorrecto de actores\/poder<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis din\u00e1micas relacionales<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Analiza dominaci\u00f3n, resistencia y negociaci\u00f3n con ejemplos concretos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Identifica algunas din\u00e1micas pero sin profundizar<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No diferencia din\u00e1micas o las confunde<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Propuestas transformaci\u00f3n<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Propone estrategias viables, diferenciadas por tipo de poder<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Sugiere cambios generales sin mecanismos espec\u00edficos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Propuestas inviables o contradictorias<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n tipos de poder (Weber, Foucault, Bourdieu):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>An\u00e1lisis din\u00e1micas (dominaci\u00f3n, resistencia, negociaci\u00f3n):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Aplicaci\u00f3n a casos reales (laborales, sociales, pol\u00edticos):<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Identifica tres relaciones de poder en tu vida cotidiana (familia, escuela, trabajo, etc.) y analiza qu\u00e9 tipo de poder se ejerce y qu\u00e9 din\u00e1mica predomina.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu an\u00e1lisis aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfQu\u00e9 formas de resistencia son posibles cuando enfrentas relaciones de poder que consideras injustas? \u00bfCu\u00e1les ser\u00edan efectivas y por qu\u00e9?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n sobre resistencia...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd04 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Memorizar 4 tipos de poder (pol\u00edtico, econ\u00f3mico, social, personal)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Recordar 3 din\u00e1micas (dominaci\u00f3n, resistencia, negociaci\u00f3n)<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Diferenciar Foucault, Weber, Bourdieu<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcaa PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Analizar 5 casos de relaciones de poder cotidianas<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Completar el simulador con diferentes escenarios<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Resolver el quiz interactivo<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\ude80 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Leer textos clave: Foucault \"Microf\u00edsica del poder\"<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Investigar movimientos sociales contempor\u00e1neos<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Dise\u00f1ar estrategias de transformaci\u00f3n para casos espec\u00edficos<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.marxists.org\/espanol\/foucault\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcda Foucault: Microf\u00edsica del poder (textos completos)\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=0R2K_6ZkM8Q\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udfa5 Bourdieu: Violencia simb\u00f3lica (explicaci\u00f3n animada)\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.jstor.org\/journal\/power\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcca Journal of Power (art\u00edculos acad\u00e9micos)\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/powercube.net\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83e\udde9 Powercube: Herramientas para an\u00e1lisis de poder\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.aljazeera.com\/program\/featured-documentaries\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcfd\ufe0f Documentales: Movimientos sociales y resistencia\r\n                <\/a>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n    <script>\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SIMULADOR DE REDES DE PODER DIN\u00c1MICAS\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Base de datos de escenarios\r\n    const escenariosDB = {\r\n        \"empresa\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Empresa Industrial\",\r\n            actores: [\"Gerencia\", \"Sindicato\", \"Trabajadores\", \"Gobierno\", \"Clientes\"],\r\n            dinamica: \"Mixta (predomina negociaci\u00f3n con resistencia)\",\r\n            conflicto: \"Moderado\",\r\n            mecanismos: \"Contrato colectivo, huelgas, negociaci\u00f3n salarial\",\r\n            transformacion: \"Alta - Cambios contractuales frecuentes\",\r\n            nodos: [\r\n                {id: \"gerencia\", x: 300, y: 100, tipo: \"institucional\", poder: 9, color: \"#D32F2F\"},\r\n                {id: \"sindicato\", x: 150, y: 250, tipo: \"colectivo\", poder: 7, color: \"#FF9800\"},\r\n                {id: \"trabajadores\", x: 300, y: 300, tipo: \"colectivo\", poder: 6, color: \"#FF9800\"},\r\n                {id: \"gobierno\", x: 450, y: 250, tipo: \"institucional\", poder: 8, color: \"#1976D2\"},\r\n                {id: \"clientes\", x: 300, y: 400, tipo: \"individual\", poder: 5, color: \"#4CAF50\"}\r\n            ],\r\n            conexiones: [\r\n                {from: \"gerencia\", to: \"trabajadores\", tipo: \"dominacion\", fuerza: 8},\r\n                {from: \"sindicato\", to: \"gerencia\", tipo: \"resistencia\", fuerza: 7},\r\n                {from: \"gobierno\", to: \"gerencia\", tipo: \"negociacion\", fuerza: 6},\r\n                {from: \"trabajadores\", to: \"sindicato\", tipo: \"negociacion\", fuerza: 8},\r\n                {from: \"clientes\", to: \"gerencia\", tipo: \"negociacion\", fuerza: 5}\r\n            ]\r\n        },\r\n        \"universidad\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Universidad P\u00fablica\",\r\n            actores: [\"Rector\u00eda\", \"Consejo Univ\", \"Sindicato Acad\", \"Estudiantes\", \"SEP\"],\r\n            dinamica: \"Negociaci\u00f3n institucionalizada\",\r\n            conflicto: \"Bajo-Moderado\",\r\n            mecanismos: \"Asambleas, contratos, evaluaciones, movilizaciones\",\r\n            transformacion: \"Media - Cambios graduales\",\r\n            nodos: [\r\n                {id: \"rectoria\", x: 300, y: 100, tipo: \"institucional\", poder: 8, color: \"#D32F2F\"},\r\n                {id: \"consejo\", x: 150, y: 200, tipo: \"institucional\", poder: 7, color: \"#1976D2\"},\r\n                {id: \"sindicato\", x: 450, y: 200, tipo: \"colectivo\", poder: 6, color: \"#FF9800\"},\r\n                {id: \"estudiantes\", x: 300, y: 300, tipo: \"colectivo\", poder: 5, color: \"#4CAF50\"},\r\n                {id: \"sep\", x: 300, y: 400, tipo: \"institucional\", poder: 9, color: \"#9C27B0\"}\r\n            ],\r\n            conexiones: [\r\n                {from: \"rectoria\", to: \"estudiantes\", tipo: \"dominacion\", fuerza: 6},\r\n                {from: \"sep\", to: \"rectoria\", tipo: \"dominacion\", fuerza: 7},\r\n                {from: \"sindicato\", to: \"rectoria\", tipo: \"negociacion\", fuerza: 6},\r\n                {from: \"estudiantes\", to: \"rectoria\", tipo: \"resistencia\", fuerza: 5},\r\n                {from: \"consejo\", to: \"rectoria\", tipo: \"negociacion\", fuerza: 7}\r\n            ]\r\n        },\r\n        \"comunidad\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Comunidad Rural\",\r\n            actores: [\"Autoridades Trad\", \"J\u00f3venes\", \"Mujeres\", \"Empresa Externa\", \"Gob Mun\"],\r\n            dinamica: \"Resistencia a dominaci\u00f3n externa\",\r\n            conflicto: \"Alto\",\r\n            mecanismos: \"Asambleas, protestas, defensa legal, alianzas\",\r\n            transformacion: \"Variable - Depende de organizaci\u00f3n\",\r\n            nodos: [\r\n                {id: \"autoridades\", x: 300, y: 150, tipo: \"institucional\", poder: 7, color: \"#9C27B0\"},\r\n                {id: \"jovenes\", x: 150, y: 250, tipo: \"colectivo\", poder: 5, color: \"#FF9800\"},\r\n                {id: \"mujeres\", x: 300, y: 300, tipo: \"colectivo\", poder: 6, color: \"#E91E63\"},\r\n                {id: \"empresa\", x: 450, y: 150, tipo: \"institucional\", poder: 8, color: \"#D32F2F\"},\r\n                {id: \"gobmun\", x: 300, y: 400, tipo: \"institucional\", poder: 7, color: \"#1976D2\"}\r\n            ],\r\n            conexiones: [\r\n                {from: \"empresa\", to: \"autoridades\", tipo: \"dominacion\", fuerza: 8},\r\n                {from: \"gobmun\", to: \"autoridades\", tipo: \"dominacion\", fuerza: 7},\r\n                {from: \"jovenes\", to: \"empresa\", tipo: \"resistencia\", fuerza: 6},\r\n                {from: \"mujeres\", to: \"autoridades\", tipo: \"resistencia\", fuerza: 5},\r\n                {from: \"autoridades\", to: \"empresa\", tipo: \"negociacion\", fuerza: 4}\r\n            ]\r\n        },\r\n        \"ciudad\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Ciudad Metropolitana\",\r\n            actores: [\"Gobierno Local\", \"Empresarios\", \"Medios\", \"ONGs\", \"Ciudadanos\"],\r\n            dinamica: \"Compleja red de influencias\",\r\n            conflicto: \"Moderado-Alto\",\r\n            mecanismos: \"Lobby, medios, protestas, elecciones, corrupci\u00f3n\",\r\n            transformacion: \"Baja-Media - Inercia institucional\",\r\n            nodos: [\r\n                {id: \"goblocal\", x: 300, y: 100, tipo: \"institucional\", poder: 8, color: \"#1976D2\"},\r\n                {id: \"empresarios\", x: 150, y: 200, tipo: \"institucional\", poder: 9, color: \"#D32F2F\"},\r\n                {id: \"medios\", x: 450, y: 200, tipo: \"institucional\", poder: 7, color: \"#FF9800\"},\r\n                {id: \"ongs\", x: 200, y: 350, tipo: \"colectivo\", poder: 6, color: \"#4CAF50\"},\r\n                {id: \"ciudadanos\", x: 400, y: 350, tipo: \"colectivo\", poder: 5, color: \"#9C27B0\"}\r\n            ],\r\n            conexiones: [\r\n                {from: \"empresarios\", to: \"goblocal\", tipo: \"dominacion\", fuerza: 8},\r\n                {from: \"medios\", to: \"goblocal\", tipo: \"negociacion\", fuerza: 7},\r\n                {from: \"ongs\", to: \"empresarios\", tipo: \"resistencia\", fuerza: 6},\r\n                {from: \"ciudadanos\", to: \"goblocal\", tipo: \"resistencia\", fuerza: 5},\r\n                {from: \"goblocal\", to: \"medios\", tipo: \"negociacion\", fuerza: 6}\r\n            ]\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    function simularRedPoder() {\r\n        console.log(\"\u26a1 Simulando red de poder...\");\r\n        \r\n        const escenario = document.getElementById('escenarioSelect').value;\r\n        const dinamica = document.getElementById('dinamicaSelect').value;\r\n        const intensidad = document.getElementById('intensidadPoder').value;\r\n        const checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"actores\"]:checked');\r\n        const actoresVisibles = Array.from(checkboxes).map(cb => cb.value);\r\n        \r\n        const data = escenariosDB[escenario];\r\n        if (!data) {\r\n            alert(\"\u26a0\ufe0f Escenario no encontrado\");\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Filtrar nodos seg\u00fan actores visibles\r\n        const nodosFiltrados = data.nodos.filter(nodo => {\r\n            return actoresVisibles.includes(nodo.tipo);\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n        actualizarVisualizacionRed(nodosFiltrados, data.conexiones, dinamica, intensidad);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos de simulaci\u00f3n\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEscenario').textContent = data.nombre;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataActores').textContent = data.actores.join(\", \");\r\n        document.getElementById('dataDinamica').textContent = data.dinamica;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataConflicto').textContent = data.conflicto;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataMecanismos').textContent = data.mecanismos;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataTransformacion').textContent = data.transformacion;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Info adicional seg\u00fan din\u00e1mica\r\n        let infoDinamica = \"\";\r\n        if (dinamica === \"dominacion\") {\r\n            infoDinamica = \"Simulaci\u00f3n con predominio de relaciones jer\u00e1rquicas y control unilateral.\";\r\n        } else if (dinamica === \"resistencia\") {\r\n            infoDinamica = \"Simulaci\u00f3n con alta conflictividad y acciones de oposici\u00f3n.\";\r\n        } else if (dinamica === \"negociacion\") {\r\n            infoDinamica = \"Simulaci\u00f3n centrada en di\u00e1logo y b\u00fasqueda de acuerdos.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            infoDinamica = \"Simulaci\u00f3n con mezcla de todas las din\u00e1micas relacionales.\";\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoRed').textContent = \r\n            `Simulaci\u00f3n: ${data.nombre} | ${infoDinamica} Intensidad: ${intensidad}\/10`;\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcca Simulado: ${data.nombre} con din\u00e1mica ${dinamica}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function actualizarVisualizacionRed(nodos, conexiones, dinamica, intensidad) {\r\n        const svg = document.getElementById('svgRed');\r\n        const redPoder = document.getElementById('redPoder');\r\n        const conexionesRed = document.getElementById('conexionesRed');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar visualizaci\u00f3n anterior\r\n        redPoder.innerHTML = '';\r\n        conexionesRed.innerHTML = '';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Colores seg\u00fan din\u00e1mica\r\n        const coloresDinamica = {\r\n            \"dominacion\": \"#D32F2F\",\r\n            \"resistencia\": \"#FF9800\",\r\n            \"negociacion\": \"#2196F3\",\r\n            \"mixta\": \"#9C27B0\"\r\n        };\r\n        const colorPrincipal = coloresDinamica[dinamica] || \"#9C27B0\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Dibujar conexiones primero (para que queden detr\u00e1s)\r\n        conexiones.forEach(conexion => {\r\n            const fromNode = nodos.find(n => n.id === conexion.from);\r\n            const toNode = nodos.find(n => n.id === conexion.to);\r\n            \r\n            if (fromNode && toNode) {\r\n                const line = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'line');\r\n                line.setAttribute('x1', fromNode.x);\r\n                line.setAttribute('y1', fromNode.y);\r\n                line.setAttribute('x2', toNode.x);\r\n                line.setAttribute('y2', toNode.y);\r\n                \r\n                \/\/ Estilo seg\u00fan tipo de conexi\u00f3n\r\n                let strokeColor = \"#666\";\r\n                let strokeWidth = 1;\r\n                \r\n                if (conexion.tipo === \"dominacion\") {\r\n                    strokeColor = \"#D32F2F\";\r\n                    strokeWidth = conexion.fuerza \/ 3;\r\n                } else if (conexion.tipo === \"resistencia\") {\r\n                    strokeColor = \"#FF9800\";\r\n                    strokeWidth = conexion.fuerza \/ 3;\r\n                    \/\/ L\u00ednea discontinua para resistencia\r\n                    line.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', '5,3');\r\n                } else if (conexion.tipo === \"negociacion\") {\r\n                    strokeColor = \"#2196F3\";\r\n                    strokeWidth = conexion.fuerza \/ 3;\r\n                }\r\n                \r\n                line.setAttribute('stroke', strokeColor);\r\n                line.setAttribute('stroke-width', strokeWidth);\r\n                line.setAttribute('opacity', intensidad \/ 10);\r\n                \r\n                conexionesRed.appendChild(line);\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Dibujar nodos\r\n        nodos.forEach(nodo => {\r\n            \/\/ C\u00edrculo del nodo\r\n            const circle = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'circle');\r\n            circle.setAttribute('cx', nodo.x);\r\n            circle.setAttribute('cy', nodo.y);\r\n            circle.setAttribute('r', 8 + (nodo.poder \/ 2)); \/\/ Tama\u00f1o seg\u00fan poder\r\n            circle.setAttribute('fill', nodo.color);\r\n            circle.setAttribute('opacity', '0.8');\r\n            circle.setAttribute('class', 'nodo-poder');\r\n            circle.setAttribute('data-id', nodo.id);\r\n            circle.setAttribute('data-tipo', nodo.tipo);\r\n            circle.setAttribute('data-poder', nodo.poder);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Brillo seg\u00fan intensidad\r\n            if (intensidad > 7) {\r\n                circle.setAttribute('filter', 'url(#glow)');\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Texto del nodo\r\n            const text = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'text');\r\n            text.setAttribute('x', nodo.x);\r\n            text.setAttribute('y', nodo.y + 20);\r\n            text.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');\r\n            text.setAttribute('fill', 'white');\r\n            text.setAttribute('font-size', '9');\r\n            text.textContent = nodo.id.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + nodo.id.slice(1);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Valor de poder\r\n            const powerText = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'text');\r\n            powerText.setAttribute('x', nodo.x);\r\n            powerText.setAttribute('y', nodo.y - 15);\r\n            powerText.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');\r\n            powerText.setAttribute('fill', '#39FF14');\r\n            powerText.setAttribute('font-size', '8');\r\n            powerText.setAttribute('font-weight', 'bold');\r\n            powerText.textContent = nodo.poder;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Agrupar elementos del nodo\r\n            const group = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'g');\r\n            group.appendChild(circle);\r\n            group.appendChild(text);\r\n            group.appendChild(powerText);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Evento click para mostrar info\r\n            group.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n                mostrarInfoNodo(nodo);\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            redPoder.appendChild(group);\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de pulsaci\u00f3n seg\u00fan intensidad\r\n        if (intensidad > 5) {\r\n            const circles = document.querySelectorAll('.nodo-poder');\r\n            circles.forEach((circle, index) => {\r\n                circle.style.animation = `pulse ${2 - (index * 0.2)}s infinite`;\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarInfoNodo(nodo) {\r\n        const infoNodo = document.getElementById('infoNodo');\r\n        const tipos = {\r\n            \"institucional\": \"Instituci\u00f3n formal\",\r\n            \"colectivo\": \"Grupo organizado\",\r\n            \"individual\": \"Actor individual\",\r\n            \"informal\": \"Red informal\"\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('textoNodo').textContent = \r\n            nodo.id.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + nodo.id.slice(1);\r\n        document.getElementById('tipoNodo').textContent = \r\n            `Tipo: ${tipos[nodo.tipo] || nodo.tipo}`;\r\n        document.getElementById('poderNodo').textContent = \r\n            `Poder: ${nodo.poder}\/10`;\r\n        \r\n        infoNodo.style.opacity = '1';\r\n        infoNodo.style.animation = 'pulse 2s';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar despu\u00e9s de 5 segundos\r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            infoNodo.style.opacity = '0';\r\n        }, 5000);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function escenarioAleatorio() {\r\n        const escenarios = Object.keys(escenariosDB);\r\n        const aleatorio = escenarios[Math.floor(Math.random() * escenarios.length)];\r\n        document.getElementById('escenarioSelect').value = aleatorio;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Configurar din\u00e1mica aleatoria\r\n        const dinamicas = [\"dominacion\", \"resistencia\", \"negociacion\", \"mixta\"];\r\n        const dinamicaAleatoria = dinamicas[Math.floor(Math.random() * dinamicas.length)];\r\n        document.getElementById('dinamicaSelect').value = dinamicaAleatoria;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Intensidad aleatoria\r\n        const intensidadAleatoria = Math.floor(Math.random() * 10) + 1;\r\n        document.getElementById('intensidadPoder').value = intensidadAleatoria;\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoRed').textContent = \r\n            `Escenario aleatorio: ${escenariosDB[aleatorio].nombre}. Haz clic en \"SIMULAR RED\".`;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarSimulacion() {\r\n        console.log(\"\ud83d\udd04 Reiniciando simulaci\u00f3n de poder...\");\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('escenarioSelect').value = 'empresa';\r\n        document.getElementById('dinamicaSelect').value = 'mixta';\r\n        document.getElementById('intensidadPoder').value = 5;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Marcar todos los checkboxes\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"actores\"]').forEach(cb => {\r\n            cb.checked = true;\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar visualizaci\u00f3n\r\n        document.getElementById('redPoder').innerHTML = '';\r\n        document.getElementById('conexionesRed').innerHTML = '';\r\n        document.getElementById('infoNodo').style.opacity = '0';\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Reiniciar datos\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEscenario').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataActores').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataDinamica').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataConflicto').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataMecanismos').textContent = '-';\r\n        document.getElementById('dataTransformacion').textContent = '-';\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoRed').textContent = \r\n            \"Selecciona un escenario y haz clic en 'SIMULAR RED'\";\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    let quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n    \r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n            \r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            verificarCompletadoQuiz();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    function verificarCompletadoQuiz() {\r\n        const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n        const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q => \r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n        \r\n        if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n        const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n        \r\n        let feedback = \"\";\r\n        if (porcentaje >= 80) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas las teor\u00edas del poder.\";\r\n        } else if (porcentaje >= 60) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero revisa las diferencias entre Foucault, Weber y Bourdieu.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas repasar los tipos y din\u00e1micas del poder.\";\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        quizRespuestas = [];\r\n        quizCompletado = false;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE ERRORES COMUNES\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function toggleError(header) {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n        \r\n        if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n            content.style.display = 'none';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n        } else {\r\n            content.style.display = 'block';\r\n            toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarSolucion(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucion${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function verificarProblema(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n        const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n        const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n        \r\n        const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n        \r\n        alert(`\ud83d\udcca AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Teor\u00edas del poder: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Din\u00e1micas relacionales: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Aplicaci\u00f3n a casos: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Revisa el plan de estudio recomendado seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcbe AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada: ${slider1}, ${slider2}, ${slider3}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Sistema Cyberpunk Educativo inicializado\");\r\n    console.log(\"\u26a1 Lecci\u00f3n: Relaciones de Poder - Dominaci\u00f3n, Resistencia y Negociaci\u00f3n\");\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\udd04 Simulador de redes, Quiz y Herramientas interactivas listas\");\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Tipos de poder interactivos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tipo-poder-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const tipo = this.dataset.tipo;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar informaci\u00f3n detallada\r\n            const tiposInfo = {\r\n                politico: \"Poder pol\u00edtico: Capacidad de tomar decisiones vinculantes. Seg\u00fan Weber, se basa en monopolio de violencia leg\u00edtima. Tipos de dominaci\u00f3n: tradicional (costumbres), carism\u00e1tica (l\u00edder), legal-racional (leyes).\",\r\n                economico: \"Poder econ\u00f3mico: Control sobre recursos materiales. Marx: poder de clase basado en propiedad medios producci\u00f3n. En capitalismo, poder empresarial sobre trabajadores, bancos sobre deudores, corporaciones sobre mercados.\",\r\n                social: \"Poder social-cultural: Influencia sobre valores y significados. Bourdieu: capital cultural (educaci\u00f3n) y simb\u00f3lico (prestigio). Gramsci: hegemon\u00eda cultural (consenso m\u00e1s que coerci\u00f3n). Medios: agenda setting, framing.\",\r\n                personal: \"Poder personal: Basado en caracter\u00edsticas individuales. Weber: carisma como fuente de autoridad. Conocimiento experto: poder t\u00e9cnico-cient\u00edfico. Liderazgo: capacidad de convocatoria y persuasi\u00f3n.\"\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            alert(`\u26a1 ${this.querySelector('h4').textContent}\\n\\n${tiposInfo[tipo] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\"}`);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Din\u00e1micas del poder interactivas\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.dinamica-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const dinamica = this.dataset.dinamica;\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar informaci\u00f3n detallada\r\n            const dinamicasInfo = {\r\n                dominacion: \"Dominaci\u00f3n: Ejercicio unilateral de poder. Seg\u00fan Weber, dominaci\u00f3n leg\u00edtima requiere obediencia voluntaria. Tipos: tradicional (costumbres), carism\u00e1tica (l\u00edder), legal-racional (normas). Foucault: disciplina y biopoder.\",\r\n                resistencia: \"Resistencia: Acciones que cuestionan poder establecido. James Scott: 'armas de los d\u00e9biles' (resistencia cotidiana). Foucault: donde hay poder hay resistencia. Formas: abierta (protestas), encubierta (sabotaje), cultural (contra-hegemon\u00eda).\",\r\n                negociacion: \"Negociaci\u00f3n: Proceso interactivo hacia acuerdos. Requiere reconocimiento mutuo de poder. Mecanismos: di\u00e1logo, mediaci\u00f3n, concesiones. Contextos: relaciones laborales (contratos), pol\u00edticas (pactos), internacionales (tratados).\"\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            alert(`\ud83d\udd04 ${this.querySelector('h4').textContent}\\n\\n${dinamicasInfo[dinamica] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\"}`);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Matriz interactiva\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.matriz-poder tbody tr').forEach(row => {\r\n        row.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const ambito = this.dataset.ambito;\r\n            const info = document.getElementById('infoMatriz');\r\n            \r\n            const infoTextos = {\r\n                laboral: \"\u00c1mbito laboral: Relaciones patr\u00f3n-trabajador. Hist\u00f3ricamente marcado por lucha de clases. Mecanismos actuales: contratos colectivos, huelgas, outsourcing, flexibilizaci\u00f3n laboral. Caso M\u00e9xico: 35,000 sindicatos, tasa sindicalizaci\u00f3n 30%.\",\r\n                politico: \"\u00c1mbito pol\u00edtico: Estado-ciudadan\u00eda. Weber: monopolio violencia leg\u00edtima. Foucault: biopol\u00edtica y gubernamentalidad. Mecanismos: elecciones, protestas, medios, corrupci\u00f3n. M\u00e9xico: transici\u00f3n democr\u00e1tica desde 2000, pero persistencia autoritarismos locales.\",\r\n                social: \"\u00c1mbito social: Relaciones entre grupos sociales. Bourdieu: reproducci\u00f3n desigualdades. Interseccionalidad: g\u00e9nero, raza, clase. Movimientos: feminismo, antiracismo, diversidad sexual. M\u00e9xico: discriminaci\u00f3n estructural, movimientos como #NiUnaMenos.\",\r\n                cultural: \"\u00c1mbito cultural: Producci\u00f3n significados y valores. Gramsci: hegemon\u00eda cultural. Escuelas de Frankfurt: industria cultural. Resistencia: contracultura, arte pol\u00edtico, medios alternativos. M\u00e9xico: Movimiento zapatista como ejemplo de contra-hegemon\u00eda.\"\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            info.textContent = infoTextos[ambito] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\";\r\n            info.style.animation = \"highlight 0.5s\";\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            document.querySelectorAll('.matriz-poder tbody tr').forEach(r => {\r\n                r.classList.remove('selected');\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Marcar fila seleccionada\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Caso de estudio interactivo\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.evento-tiempo').forEach(evento => {\r\n        evento.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const fase = this.dataset.fase;\r\n            const fecha = this.querySelector('.evento-fecha').textContent;\r\n            const titulo = this.querySelector('h5').textContent;\r\n            const contenido = this.querySelector('.evento-contenido').innerHTML;\r\n            \r\n            alert(`\ud83d\udcc5 ${fecha}: ${titulo}\\n\\n${contenido.replace(\/<[^>]*>\/g, '\\n')}`);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Objetivos interactivos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n            this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n            const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n            checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n            checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : '';\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Agregar filtro glow al SVG\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById('svgRed');\r\n    const defs = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'defs');\r\n    const filter = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'filter');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('id', 'glow');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('x', '-50%');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('y', '-50%');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('width', '200%');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('height', '200%');\r\n    \r\n    const feGaussianBlur = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feGaussianBlur');\r\n    feGaussianBlur.setAttribute('stdDeviation', '4');\r\n    feGaussianBlur.setAttribute('result', 'coloredBlur');\r\n    \r\n    const feMerge = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMerge');\r\n    const feMergeNode1 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMergeNode');\r\n    feMergeNode1.setAttribute('in', 'coloredBlur');\r\n    const feMergeNode2 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMergeNode');\r\n    feMergeNode2.setAttribute('in', 'SourceGraphic');\r\n    \r\n    feMerge.appendChild(feMergeNode1);\r\n    feMerge.appendChild(feMergeNode2);\r\n    filter.appendChild(feGaussianBlur);\r\n    filter.appendChild(feMerge);\r\n    defs.appendChild(filter);\r\n    svg.appendChild(defs);\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n de pulsaci\u00f3n para nodos\r\n    const style = document.createElement('style');\r\n    style.textContent = `\r\n    @keyframes pulse {\r\n        0%, 100% { opacity: 0.8; }\r\n        50% { opacity: 1; }\r\n    }\r\n    `;\r\n    document.head.appendChild(style);\r\n    <\/script>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Poder es","respuesta":"Capacidad de influir en otros"},{"enunciado":"Poder pol\u00edtico ejemplo","respuesta":"Gobierno, leyes"},{"enunciado":"Poder econ\u00f3mico ejemplo","respuesta":"Empresas, bancos"},{"enunciado":"Foucault: poder es","respuesta":"Relacional y omnipresente"},{"enunciado":"Dominaci\u00f3n es","respuesta":"Control unilateral"},{"enunciado":"Resistencia es","respuesta":"Oposici\u00f3n al poder"},{"enunciado":"Negociaci\u00f3n es","respuesta":"Acuerdo mutuo"},{"enunciado":"Ejemplo resistencia social","respuesta":"Marchas, huelgas"},{"enunciado":"Poder cultural incluye","respuesta":"Medios, educaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"M\u00e9xico: poder empresarial","respuesta":"CEMEX, Televisa"},{"enunciado":"Poder personal","respuesta":"Liderazgo, conocimiento"},{"enunciado":"SI: poder blando","respuesta":"Cultura, diplomacia"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Poder es","opciones":["Relacional","Fijo","Solo fuerza","Nada"],"correcta":"Relacional"},{"pregunta":"Foucault dice","opciones":["Poder en todas partes","Solo en gobierno","Nada","Solo dinero"],"correcta":"Poder en todas partes"},{"pregunta":"Poder pol\u00edtico","opciones":["Estado","Empresa","Familia","Amigos"],"correcta":"Estado"},{"pregunta":"Poder econ\u00f3mico","opciones":["Monopolios","Voto","Cultura","Religi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Monopolios"},{"pregunta":"Resistencia es","opciones":["Oposici\u00f3n","Apoyo","Obediencia","Silencio"],"correcta":"Oposici\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Negociaci\u00f3n busca","opciones":["Equilibrio","Dominaci\u00f3n","Guerra","Nada"],"correcta":"Equilibrio"},{"pregunta":"Poder productivo","opciones":["Foucault","Marx","Weber","Hobbes"],"correcta":"Foucault"},{"pregunta":"Sindicato ejerce","opciones":["Poder de resistencia","Dominaci\u00f3n","Nada","Gobierno"],"correcta":"Poder de resistencia"},{"pregunta":"Medios tienen poder","opciones":["Cultural","Pol\u00edtico","Econ\u00f3mico","Personal"],"correcta":"Cultural"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: poder blando","opciones":["Cultura (cine, m\u00fasica)","Ej\u00e9rcito","Armas","Nada"],"correcta":"Cultura (cine, m\u00fasica)"},{"pregunta":"Dominaci\u00f3n total","opciones":["Rara (siempre resistencia)","Com\u00fan","Ideal","Necesaria"],"correcta":"Rara (siempre resistencia)"},{"pregunta":"Poder leg\u00edtimo","opciones":["Weber: autoridad","Fuerza","Dinero","Miedo"],"correcta":"Weber: autoridad"},{"pregunta":"Huelga es","opciones":["Resistencia","Apoyo","Obediencia","Nada"],"correcta":"Resistencia"},{"pregunta":"Contrato laboral","opciones":["Negociaci\u00f3n","Dominaci\u00f3n","Guerra","Silencio"],"correcta":"Negociaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Poder carism\u00e1tico","opciones":["L\u00edder personal","Instituci\u00f3n","Dinero","Ley"],"correcta":"L\u00edder personal"},{"pregunta":"Red de poder incluye","opciones":["Todos los actores","Solo gobierno","Solo ricos","Nada"],"correcta":"Todos los actores"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: poder sindical","opciones":["CTM, SNTE","Ninguno","Solo empresas","Gobierno"],"correcta":"CTM, SNTE"},{"pregunta":"Poder disciplinario","opciones":["Foucault (escuelas, c\u00e1rceles)","Marx","Weber","Hobbes"],"correcta":"Foucault (escuelas, c\u00e1rceles)"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: poder digital","opciones":["Redes sociales","Solo TV","Radio","Peri\u00f3dicos"],"correcta":"Redes sociales"},{"pregunta":"Poder es","opciones":["Din\u00e1mico","Est\u00e1tico","Fijo","Inmutable"],"correcta":"Din\u00e1mico"},{"pregunta":"Resistencia pasiva","opciones":["Desobediencia civil","Violencia","Guerra","Apoyo"],"correcta":"Desobediencia civil"},{"pregunta":"Poder simb\u00f3lico","opciones":["Bourdieu","Foucault","Marx","Weber"],"correcta":"Bourdieu"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico: reforma 2018","opciones":["Cambio en relaciones de poder","Igual","Nada","Retroceso"],"correcta":"Cambio en relaciones de poder"},{"pregunta":"Movimiento #YoSoy132","opciones":["Resistencia juvenil","Apoyo","Gobierno","Empresa"],"correcta":"Resistencia juvenil"},{"pregunta":"Poder econ\u00f3mico global","opciones":["Multinacionales","Gobiernos locales","Familias","Escuelas"],"correcta":"Multinacionales"},{"pregunta":"Negociaci\u00f3n tripartita","opciones":["Gobierno, empresa, sindicato","Solo dos","Uno","Ninguno"],"correcta":"Gobierno, empresa, sindicato"},{"pregunta":"Poder pan\u00f3ptico","opciones":["Vigilancia constante","Libertad","Igualdad","Nada"],"correcta":"Vigilancia constante"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: poder IA","opciones":["Algoritmos influyen","Nada","Solo humanos","Robots"],"correcta":"Algoritmos influyen"},{"pregunta":"Equilibrio de poder","opciones":["Estabilidad social","Conflicto","Guerra","Caos"],"correcta":"Estabilidad social"},{"pregunta":"Poder es","opciones":["Productivo y represivo","Solo represivo","Solo bueno","Nada"],"correcta":"Productivo y represivo"}]}],"Historia de M\u00e9xico":[{"materia":"Historia de M\u00e9xico","slug":"mexico-prehispanico","titulo":"M\u00e9xico Prehisp\u00e1nico: El Legado de Cuatro Civilizaciones","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-historia-mexico-prehispanico\" data-tema=\"mexico-prehispanico\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83c\udf04<\/span>\r\n            M\u00c9XICO PREHISP\u00c1NICO\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Olmecas, Teotihuac\u00e1n, Maya y Azteca: Las Cuatro Columnas de Mesoam\u00e9rica\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"badge-tiempo\">\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">1500 a.C. - 1521 d.C.<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">Mesoam\u00e9rica<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">4 Civilizaciones<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Identificar caracter\u00edsticas clave<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Diferenciar las 4 civilizaciones por ubicaci\u00f3n, periodo y aportes<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar legados culturales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Reconocer elementos comunes: calendarios, escritura, agricultura<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Interpretar l\u00ednea del tiempo<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Comprender la secuencia cronol\u00f3gica y evoluci\u00f3n cultural<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Evaluar impacto actual<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Conectar civilizaciones prehisp\u00e1nicas con M\u00e9xico contempor\u00e1neo<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> CONEXI\u00d3N CON EL PRESENTE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Patrimonio Mundial UNESCO<\/h3>\r\n                <p>35 sitios arqueol\u00f3gicos mexicanos reconocidos como Patrimonio de la Humanidad<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">>189 zonas arqueol\u00f3gicas abiertas<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f Lenguas Vivas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>68 lenguas ind\u00edgenas con 7 millones de hablantes en M\u00e9xico actual<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Ra\u00edz n\u00e1huatl-maya<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf3d Agricultura Milenaria<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Ma\u00edz, frijol, chile, calabaza domesticados y base alimentaria actual<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">5000 a\u00f1os de cultivo<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> LAS CUATRO COLUMNAS DE MESOAM\u00c9RICA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- INTRODUCCI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. El Mosaico Cultural Prehisp\u00e1nico<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udf0e MESOAM\u00c9RICA<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Regi\u00f3n cultural que abarc\u00f3 desde centro de M\u00e9xico hasta Centroam\u00e9rica, caracterizada por:<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"caracteristicas-grid\">\r\n                        <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-icon\">\ud83d\udcc5<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-texto\">Calendarios complejos<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-icon\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-texto\">Arquitectura monumental<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-icon\">\ud83d\udcdc<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-texto\">Sistemas de escritura<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-icon\">\ud83c\udf3d<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-texto\">Agricultura intensiva<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TABLA COMPARATIVA INTERACTIVA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Civilizaciones en Perspectiva Comparada<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>CIVILIZACI\u00d3N<\/th>\r\n                            <th>PERIODO<\/th>\r\n                            <th>UBICACI\u00d3N<\/th>\r\n                            <th>APORTES CLAVE<\/th>\r\n                            <th>SITIO IC\u00d3NICO<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr data-civilizacion=\"olmeca\" onclick=\"mostrarDetalleCivilizacion('olmeca')\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"civilizacion-tag olmeca\">OLMECAS<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>1500-400 a.C.<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Golfo de M\u00e9xico (Veracruz, Tabasco)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Cabezas colosales, cultura madre, culto al jaguar<\/td>\r\n                            <td>San Lorenzo, La Venta<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-civilizacion=\"teotihuacan\" onclick=\"mostrarDetalleCivilizacion('teotihuacan')\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"civilizacion-tag teotihuacan\">TEOTIHUAC\u00c1N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>200 a.C. - 650 d.C.<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Valle de M\u00e9xico<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Urbanismo planificado, pir\u00e1mides monumentales<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Pir\u00e1mide del Sol, Calzada de los Muertos<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-civilizacion=\"maya\" onclick=\"mostrarDetalleCivilizacion('maya')\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"civilizacion-tag maya\">MAYA<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>250-900 d.C. (Cl\u00e1sico)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Penis\u00ednsula de Yucat\u00e1n, Guatemala, Belice<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Escritura jerogl\u00edfica, astronom\u00eda, matem\u00e1ticas<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Chich\u00e9n Itz\u00e1, Palenque, Tikal<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-civilizacion=\"azteca\" onclick=\"mostrarDetalleCivilizacion('azteca')\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"civilizacion-tag azteca\">AZTECAS<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>1325-1521 d.C.<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Lago de Texcoco (Valle de M\u00e9xico)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Tenochtitl\u00e1n, chinampas, imperio tributario<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Templo Mayor, Gran Tenochtitl\u00e1n<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoCivilizacion\">\r\n                    Selecciona una civilizaci\u00f3n para ver detalles ampliados\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- DETALLES DE CIVILIZACIONES -->\r\n            <div class=\"civilizaciones-detalles\">\r\n                <div class=\"detalle-civilizacion\" id=\"detalleOlmeca\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd0d An\u00e1lisis Profundo: Cultura Olmeca<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"detalle-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83e\udea8 Cabezas Colosales<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>17 esculturas de basalto de 1.5 a 3.4 metros, pesan hasta 50 toneladas<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Transporte: 100 km desde canteras<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udc06 Culto al Jaguar<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Deidad principal, s\u00edmbolo de poder y conexi\u00f3n entre mundos<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">\"Hombre-jaguar\": transformaci\u00f3n cham\u00e1nica<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udf31 Legado Cultural<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Juego de pelota, escritura incipiente, calendario ritual<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Influencia en todas las culturas posteriores<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"detalle-civilizacion\" id=\"detalleTeotihuacan\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd0d An\u00e1lisis Profundo: Teotihuac\u00e1n<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"detalle-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Urbanismo Avanzado<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Ciudad planificada en cuadr\u00edcula, 20 km\u00b2, 125,000-200,000 habitantes<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Primera metr\u00f3polis de Am\u00e9rica<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\u2600\ufe0f Pir\u00e1mide del Sol<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>65 metros altura, 225 metros base, volumen: 1 mill\u00f3n m\u00b3<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Alineada con puesta solar 29 de abril<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfad Multiculturalidad<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Barrios zapotecas, mayas, mixtecas; centro cosmopolita<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Comercio a larga distancia: obsidiana, cacao<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"detalle-civilizacion\" id=\"detalleMaya\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd0d An\u00e1lisis Profundo: Civilizaci\u00f3n Maya<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"detalle-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udd22 Matem\u00e1ticas y Astronom\u00eda<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Sistema vigesimal, concepto del cero, observatorios astron\u00f3micos<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Calendario: error 1 d\u00eda cada 4000 a\u00f1os<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcdc Escritura Jerogl\u00edfica<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>800 glifos, c\u00f3dices de amate, estelas narrativas<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">\u00danico sistema de escritura completo de Am\u00e9rica<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\u26bd Juego de Pelota<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Cancha I-shaped, pelota de hule, significado ritual y pol\u00edtico<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Representaci\u00f3n del movimiento solar<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"detalle-civilizacion\" id=\"detalleAzteca\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd0d An\u00e1lisis Profundo: Imperio Azteca<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"detalle-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Tenochtitl\u00e1n<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Ciudad lacustre, 13 km\u00b2, 200,000 habitantes, acueductos, calzadas<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">M\u00e1s poblada que Par\u00eds en 1500<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udef6 Chinampas<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Sistema agr\u00edcola intensivo: islas artificiales, 7 cosechas\/a\u00f1o<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Productividad: 20 toneladas\/ha (ma\u00edz)<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcca Sistema Tributario<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>38 provincias tributarias, Triple Alianza (Tenochtitl\u00e1n, Texcoco, Tlacopan)<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">C\u00f3dice Mendosa: lista de tributos detallada<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- LEGADOS COMUNES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Legados Transculturales de Mesoam\u00e9rica<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"legados-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"legado-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"legado-icon\">\ud83d\udcc5<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>SISTEMAS CALEND\u00c1RICOS<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"legado-desc\">\r\n                        Calendario ritual (260 d\u00edas) + solar (365 d\u00edas) = Rueda calend\u00e1rica (52 a\u00f1os)\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"legado-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Precisi\u00f3n:<\/strong> Maya: 365.2420 d\u00edas (real: 365.2422)<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ciclo:<\/strong> 18 meses \u00d7 20 d\u00edas + 5 d\u00edas \"nefastos\"<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Uso:<\/strong> Agricultura, rituales, historia<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"legado-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"legado-icon\">\ud83c\udf3d<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>REVOLUCI\u00d3N AGR\u00cdCOLA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"legado-desc\">\r\n                        Domesticaci\u00f3n de plantas que alimentaron al mundo\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"legado-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ma\u00edz:<\/strong> Teosinte \u2192 10,000 variedades<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>T\u00e9cnicas:<\/strong> Chinampas, terrazas, irrigaci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Dieta:<\/strong> Ma\u00edz, frijol, calabaza, chile<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"legado-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"legado-icon\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>ARQUITECTURA Y URBANISMO<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"legado-desc\">\r\n                        Pir\u00e1mides escalonadas, observatorios, planificaci\u00f3n urbana\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"legado-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Materiales:<\/strong> Piedra, estuco, pintura mural<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Alineaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Solsticios, equinoccios<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Funsi\u00f3n:<\/strong> Ceremonial, administrativa, residencial<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"legado-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"legado-icon\">\ud83d\udcdc<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>SISTEMAS DE REGISTRO<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"legado-desc\">\r\n                        Escritura, c\u00f3dices, glifos para historia, astronom\u00eda, tributos\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"legado-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Soportes:<\/strong> Piedra, piel, papel amate<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Temas:<\/strong> Historia, genealog\u00eda, astronom\u00eda<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejemplos:<\/strong> C\u00f3dice Borgia, Dresden, Mendoza<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO: L\u00cdNEA DEL TIEMPO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> SIMULADOR: L\u00cdNEA DEL TIEMPO INTERACTIVA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"linea-tiempo-prehispanica\">\r\n            <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>CONTROLES TEMPORALES<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"yearSlider\">A\u00f1o:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"yearSlider\" min=\"-1500\" max=\"1521\" value=\"-1500\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-value\" id=\"yearValue\">1500 a.C.<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"civilizacionSelect\">Civilizaci\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"civilizacionSelect\" class=\"control-select\">\r\n                        <option value=\"todas\">Todas las civilizaciones<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"olmeca\">Olmecas (1500-400 a.C.)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"teotihuacan\">Teotihuac\u00e1n (200 a.C.-650 d.C.)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"maya\">Maya Cl\u00e1sico (250-900 d.C.)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"azteca\">Aztecas (1325-1521 d.C.)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"tipoInfo\">Informaci\u00f3n a mostrar:<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"checkbox-group\">\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"tipoInfo\" value=\"eventos\" checked> Eventos hist\u00f3ricos<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"tipoInfo\" value=\"construcciones\"> Construcciones<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"tipoInfo\" value=\"logros\"> Logros culturales<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"tipoInfo\" value=\"conexiones\"> Conexiones comerciales<\/label>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-animar\" onclick=\"animarLineaTiempo()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6<\/span> ANIMAR L\u00cdNEA\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reiniciarLineaTiempo()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DE L\u00cdNEA DEL TIEMPO -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacionTiempo\">\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-container\">\r\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 500\" id=\"svgTimeline\">\r\n                        <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\" id=\"fondoTimeline\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Eje temporal -->\r\n                        <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"400\" x2=\"750\" y2=\"400\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"3\" id=\"ejeTemporal\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Marcas temporales -->\r\n                        <g id=\"marcasTemporales\">\r\n                            <!-- Marcas cada 500 a\u00f1os -->\r\n                            <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"395\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"405\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"100\" y=\"425\" fill=\"#39FF14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">1500 a.C.<\/text>\r\n                            \r\n                            <line x1=\"250\" y1=\"395\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"405\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"250\" y=\"425\" fill=\"#39FF14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">1000 a.C.<\/text>\r\n                            \r\n                            <line x1=\"400\" y1=\"395\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"405\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"400\" y=\"425\" fill=\"#39FF14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">500 a.C.<\/text>\r\n                            \r\n                            <line x1=\"550\" y1=\"395\" x2=\"550\" y2=\"405\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"425\" fill=\"#39FF14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">0<\/text>\r\n                            \r\n                            <line x1=\"700\" y1=\"395\" x2=\"700\" y2=\"405\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"700\" y=\"425\" fill=\"#39FF14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">500 d.C.<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Olmecas -->\r\n                        <g id=\"periodoOlmeca\" class=\"periodo-civilizacion\" data-civilizacion=\"olmeca\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"100\" y=\"350\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#FF9800\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"175\" y=\"370\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">OLMECAS<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"175\" y=\"385\" fill=\"#FFE0B2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\">1500-400 a.C.<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Teotihuac\u00e1n -->\r\n                        <g id=\"periodoTeotihuacan\" class=\"periodo-civilizacion\" data-civilizacion=\"teotihuacan\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"300\" y=\"300\" width=\"250\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#2196F3\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"425\" y=\"320\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">TEOTIHUAC\u00c1N<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"425\" y=\"335\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\">200 a.C.-650 d.C.<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Maya Cl\u00e1sico -->\r\n                        <g id=\"periodoMaya\" class=\"periodo-civilizacion\" data-civilizacion=\"maya\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"450\" y=\"250\" width=\"200\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F44336\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"270\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">MAYA CL\u00c1SICO<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"285\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\">250-900 d.C.<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Aztecas -->\r\n                        <g id=\"periodoAzteca\" class=\"periodo-civilizacion\" data-civilizacion=\"azteca\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"650\" y=\"200\" width=\"100\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#9C27B0\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"700\" y=\"220\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">AZTECAS<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"700\" y=\"235\" fill=\"#E1BEE7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\">1325-1521 d.C.<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Marcador de tiempo actual -->\r\n                        <circle id=\"marcadorActual\" cx=\"100\" cy=\"400\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFF00\" stroke=\"#FF9800\" stroke-width=\"2\">\r\n                            <animate id=\"animMarcador\" attributeName=\"cx\" dur=\"30s\" fill=\"freeze\"\/>\r\n                        <\/circle>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Eventos clave -->\r\n                        <g id=\"eventosTimeline\" opacity=\"0.8\">\r\n                            <!-- Evento Olmeca -->\r\n                            <g id=\"eventoOlmeca\" data-year=\"-1200\" data-civilizacion=\"olmeca\">\r\n                                <circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"350\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF9800\"\/>\r\n                                <text x=\"130\" y=\"340\" fill=\"#FF9800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\">Cabezas colosales<\/text>\r\n                            <\/g>\r\n                            \r\n                            <!-- Evento Teotihuac\u00e1n -->\r\n                            <g id=\"eventoTeotihuacan\" data-year=\"150\" data-civilizacion=\"teotihuacan\">\r\n                                <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"300\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#2196F3\"\/>\r\n                                <text x=\"350\" y=\"290\" fill=\"#2196F3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\">Pir\u00e1mide del Sol<\/text>\r\n                            <\/g>\r\n                            \r\n                            <!-- Evento Maya -->\r\n                            <g id=\"eventoMaya\" data-year=\"600\" data-civilizacion=\"maya\">\r\n                                <circle cx=\"500\" cy=\"250\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#F44336\"\/>\r\n                                <text x=\"500\" y=\"240\" fill=\"#F44336\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\">Observatorio<\/text>\r\n                            <\/g>\r\n                            \r\n                            <!-- Evento Azteca -->\r\n                            <g id=\"eventoAzteca\" data-year=\"1325\" data-civilizacion=\"azteca\">\r\n                                <circle cx=\"680\" cy=\"200\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#9C27B0\"\/>\r\n                                <text x=\"680\" y=\"190\" fill=\"#9C27B0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\">Fundaci\u00f3n Tenochtitl\u00e1n<\/text>\r\n                            <\/g>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Info en tiempo real -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"700\" height=\"100\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.8)\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#39FF14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" id=\"textoPeriodo\">1500 a.C.: Inicio Olmeca<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#E0F7FA\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" id=\"textoEvento\">Cultura madre mesoamericana<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"120\" fill=\"#B2EBF2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" id=\"textoDetalle\">Primeras cabezas colosales<\/text>\r\n                    <\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-info\" id=\"infoTimeline\">\r\n                    Usa el slider o haz clic en \"ANIMAR L\u00cdNEA\" para recorrer la historia\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>DATOS HIST\u00d3RICOS<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">A\u00f1o seleccionado:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataYear\">1500 a.C.<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Civilizaci\u00f3n activa:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataCivilizacion\">Olmecas<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Evento clave:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEvento\">Cabezas colosales<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">APORTE CULTURAL:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataAporte\">Escultura monumental<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Sitio arqueol\u00f3gico:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataSitio\">San Lorenzo<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Poblaci\u00f3n estimada:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPoblacion\">8,000 habitantes<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcca ESTAD\u00cdSTICAS COMPARATIVAS<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Duraci\u00f3n Olmecas:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">1100 a\u00f1os<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Apogeo Teotihuac\u00e1n:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">200,000 hab<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Ciudades mayas:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">>40 ciudades-estado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Tenochtitl\u00e1n 1519:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">200,000 hab<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: CONOCIMIENTO PREHISP\u00c1NICO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l fue el principal aporte cultural de los olmecas?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        La chinampa como sistema agr\u00edcola\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        El calendario solar de 365 d\u00edas\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        La escultura monumental y culto al jaguar\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        La escritura jerogl\u00edfica completa\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Los olmecas destacaron por sus cabezas colosales y el culto al jaguar.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Las chinampas son aztecas, el calendario solar es maya\/azteca, la escritura completa es maya.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Los olmecas (1500-400 a.C.) son considerados la \"cultura madre\" mesoamericana. Sus cabezas colosales de basalto (hasta 3.4 m, 50 toneladas) representan gobernantes y muestran avanzadas t\u00e9cnicas escult\u00f3ricas.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 civilizaci\u00f3n desarroll\u00f3 el sistema de escritura m\u00e1s completo de Mesoam\u00e9rica?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Olmeca\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Maya\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Teotihuacana\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Azteca\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Los mayas desarrollaron el \u00fanico sistema de escritura completo de Am\u00e9rica.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Los olmecas ten\u00edan glifos incipientes, teotihuacanos s\u00edmbolos, aztecas pictograf\u00eda.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Dato:<\/strong> La escritura maya inclu\u00eda m\u00e1s de 800 glifos y pod\u00eda representar cualquier idea. Se usaba en c\u00f3dices, estelas y cer\u00e1mica para registrar historia, astronom\u00eda y genealog\u00edas reales.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l era la funci\u00f3n principal de las chinampas aztecas?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Defensa militar de Tenochtitl\u00e1n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Sistema de drenaje del lago\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Cementerios para la nobleza\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Agricultura intensiva en el lago\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Las chinampas eran islas artificiales para cultivo intensivo.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> La defensa eran calzadas y canales, drenaje con diques, cementerios en templos.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Las chinampas permit\u00edan 7 cosechas anuales de ma\u00edz, frijol y flores. Su productividad (20 toneladas\/ha) alimentaba a 200,000 habitantes de Tenochtitl\u00e1n.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> AN\u00c1LISIS HIST\u00d3RICO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>An\u00e1lisis Comparativo de Civilizaciones<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Completa la siguiente tabla comparativa con al menos tres caracter\u00edsticas distintivas de cada civilizaci\u00f3n:<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <table class=\"tabla-analisis\">\r\n                        <thead>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <th>Civilizaci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n                                <th>Organizaci\u00f3n Pol\u00edtica<\/th>\r\n                                <th>Aporte Tecnol\u00f3gico<\/th>\r\n                                <th>Legado Cultural<\/th>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                        <\/thead>\r\n                        <tbody>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td><strong>Olmecas<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td><strong>Teotihuac\u00e1n<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td><strong>Mayas<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td><strong>Aztecas<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                        <\/tbody>\r\n                    <\/table>\r\n                    \r\n                    <p><strong>Pregunta de reflexi\u00f3n:<\/strong> \u00bfQu\u00e9 elemento cultural consideras que tuvo mayor impacto en el M\u00e9xico actual y por qu\u00e9?<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"4\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Posible soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    \u2022 <strong>Olmecas:<\/strong> Jefaturas - Escultura monumental - Cultura madre mesoamericana<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <strong>Teotihuac\u00e1n:<\/strong> Estado teocr\u00e1tico - Urbanismo planificado - Primer metr\u00f3polis<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <strong>Mayas:<\/strong> Ciudades-estado - Escritura y matem\u00e1ticas - Calendario preciso<br>\r\n                    \u2022 <strong>Aztecas:<\/strong> Imperio tributario - Chinampas - Tenochtitl\u00e1n como modelo urbano<br><br>\r\n                    <strong>Reflexi\u00f3n:<\/strong> La agricultura (ma\u00edz, chinampas) sostuvo poblaciones grandes y sigue siendo base alimentaria.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>L\u00ednea del Tiempo y Continuidad Cultural<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Construye una l\u00ednea del tiempo que muestre:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>Superposici\u00f3n temporal de las 4 civilizaciones<\/li>\r\n                        <li>3 eventos clave de cada una<\/li>\r\n                        <li>2 elementos de continuidad cultural entre ellas<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"espacio-dibujo\">\r\n                        <p><em>Dibuja o describe tu l\u00ednea del tiempo aqu\u00ed:<\/em><\/p>\r\n                        <textarea placeholder=\"Describe tu l\u00ednea del tiempo con fechas y eventos...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <p><strong>Pregunta cr\u00edtica:<\/strong> \u00bfPor qu\u00e9 algunas civilizaciones coexistieron temporalmente pero no desarrollaron contacto directo significativo?<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu an\u00e1lisis aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"4\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR AN\u00c1LISIS<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>L\u00ednea del tiempo sugerida:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1500-400 a.C.: Olmecas (cabezas colosales, La Venta)<br>\r\n                    200 a.C.-650 d.C.: Teotihuac\u00e1n (pir\u00e1mides, red comercial)<br>\r\n                    250-900 d.C.: Maya cl\u00e1sico (escritura, ciudades)<br>\r\n                    1325-1521 d.C.: Aztecas (Tenochtitl\u00e1n, imperio)<br><br>\r\n                    <strong>Continuidad:<\/strong> Calendario, juego de pelota, cultivo ma\u00edz<br>\r\n                    <strong>An\u00e1lisis:<\/strong> Distancias geogr\u00e1ficas, especializaci\u00f3n ecol\u00f3gica, diferencias temporales en auge.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Precisi\u00f3n hist\u00f3rica<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Datos exactos, fechas correctas, ejemplos espec\u00edficos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Mayor\u00eda de datos correctos, algunos errores menores<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Errores graves en informaci\u00f3n b\u00e1sica<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis comparativo<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Identifica claramente similitudes y diferencias clave<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Compara algunas caracter\u00edsticas correctamente<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No logra establecer comparaciones v\u00e1lidas<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Reflexi\u00f3n cr\u00edtica<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Ofrece an\u00e1lisis profundo con conexiones al presente<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Menciona algunas conexiones actuales<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No relaciona pasado con presente<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> REFLEXI\u00d3N Y CONEXI\u00d3N CULTURAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N DE CONOCIMIENTOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Conocimiento de cronolog\u00edas:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Diferenciaci\u00f3n de civilizaciones:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Conexi\u00f3n pasado-presente:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfQu\u00e9 elemento del M\u00e9xico prehisp\u00e1nico consideras que tiene mayor presencia en la cultura mexicana actual?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo explicar\u00edas a alguien la importancia de estudiar estas civilizaciones antiguas?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu explicaci\u00f3n...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd04 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Memorizar per\u00edodos clave de las 4 civilizaciones<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Recordar 3 aportes distintivos de cada una<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Identificar ubicaciones geogr\u00e1ficas<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcaa PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Completar l\u00ednea del tiempo interactiva<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Resolver el quiz de autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Comparar sistemas pol\u00edticos<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\ude80 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Investigar un sitio arqueol\u00f3gico espec\u00edfico<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Analizar un c\u00f3dice prehisp\u00e1nico<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Estudiar continuidades culturales actuales<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.inah.gob.mx\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f INAH: Instituto Nacional de Antropolog\u00eda e Historia\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.mna.inah.gob.mx\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udffa Museo Nacional de Antropolog\u00eda (visita virtual)\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.azteccalendar.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcc5 Calculadora del calendario azteca\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.mayavase.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udfa8 Base de datos de cer\u00e1mica maya\r\n                <\/a>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n    <script>\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE L\u00cdNEA DEL TIEMPO INTERACTIVA\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    const timelineData = {\r\n        \"-1500\": {\r\n            civilizacion: \"olmeca\",\r\n            evento: \"Inicio cultura olmeca\",\r\n            detalle: \"Primeras cabezas colosales en San Lorenzo\",\r\n            aporte: \"Escultura monumental\",\r\n            sitio: \"San Lorenzo\",\r\n            poblacion: \"8,000 habitantes\",\r\n            color: \"#FF9800\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"-1200\": {\r\n            civilizacion: \"olmeca\",\r\n            evento: \"Apogeo olmeca\",\r\n            detalle: \"Cabezas colosales, culto al jaguar\",\r\n            aporte: \"Cultura madre mesoamericana\",\r\n            sitio: \"La Venta\",\r\n            poblacion: \"18,000 habitantes\",\r\n            color: \"#FF9800\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"-400\": {\r\n            civilizacion: \"olmeca\",\r\n            evento: \"Declive olmeca\",\r\n            detalle: \"Abandono de centros ceremoniales\",\r\n            aporte: \"Legado a culturas posteriores\",\r\n            sitio: \"Tres Zapotes\",\r\n            poblacion: \"5,000 habitantes\",\r\n            color: \"#FF9800\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"200\": {\r\n            civilizacion: \"teotihuacan\",\r\n            evento: \"Fundaci\u00f3n Teotihuac\u00e1n\",\r\n            detalle: \"Inicio construcci\u00f3n Pir\u00e1mide del Sol\",\r\n            aporte: \"Urbanismo planificado\",\r\n            sitio: \"Teotihuac\u00e1n\",\r\n            poblacion: \"60,000 habitantes\",\r\n            color: \"#2196F3\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"150\": {\r\n            civilizacion: \"teotihuacan\",\r\n            evento: \"Pir\u00e1mide del Sol completada\",\r\n            detalle: \"65 m altura, 225 m base\",\r\n            aporte: \"Arquitectura monumental\",\r\n            sitio: \"Teotihuac\u00e1n\",\r\n            poblacion: \"125,000 habitantes\",\r\n            color: \"#2196F3\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"450\": {\r\n            civilizacion: \"teotihuacan\",\r\n            evento: \"Apogeo Teotihuac\u00e1n\",\r\n            detalle: \"200,000 habitantes, ciudad cosmopolita\",\r\n            aporte: \"Red comercial mesoamericana\",\r\n            sitio: \"Teotihuac\u00e1n\",\r\n            poblacion: \"200,000 habitantes\",\r\n            color: \"#2196F3\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"250\": {\r\n            civilizacion: \"maya\",\r\n            evento: \"Inicio per\u00edodo cl\u00e1sico maya\",\r\n            detalle: \"Desarrollo ciudades-estado\",\r\n            aporte: \"Escritura jerogl\u00edfica\",\r\n            sitio: \"Tikal\",\r\n            poblacion: \"50,000 habitantes\",\r\n            color: \"#F44336\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"600\": {\r\n            civilizacion: \"maya\",\r\n            evento: \"Apogeo astron\u00f3mico maya\",\r\n            detalle: \"Observatorios, calendario preciso\",\r\n            aporte: \"Matem\u00e1ticas y astronom\u00eda\",\r\n            sitio: \"Palenque\",\r\n            poblacion: \"100,000 habitantes\",\r\n            color: \"#F44336\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"900\": {\r\n            civilizacion: \"maya\",\r\n            evento: \"Colapso cl\u00e1sico maya\",\r\n            detalle: \"Abandono ciudades del sur\",\r\n            aporte: \"Conocimiento preservado en c\u00f3dices\",\r\n            sitio: \"Chich\u00e9n Itz\u00e1\",\r\n            poblacion: \"35,000 habitantes\",\r\n            color: \"#F44336\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"1325\": {\r\n            civilizacion: \"azteca\",\r\n            evento: \"Fundaci\u00f3n Tenochtitl\u00e1n\",\r\n            detalle: \"Se\u00f1al del \u00e1guila y el nopal\",\r\n            aporte: \"Ciudad lacustre\",\r\n            sitio: \"Tenochtitl\u00e1n\",\r\n            poblacion: \"20,000 habitantes\",\r\n            color: \"#9C27B0\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"1428\": {\r\n            civilizacion: \"azteca\",\r\n            evento: \"Triple Alianza\",\r\n            detalle: \"Tenochtitl\u00e1n, Texcoco, Tlacopan\",\r\n            aporte: \"Formaci\u00f3n del imperio\",\r\n            sitio: \"Tenochtitl\u00e1n\",\r\n            poblacion: \"150,000 habitantes\",\r\n            color: \"#9C27B0\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"1500\": {\r\n            civilizacion: \"azteca\",\r\n            evento: \"M\u00e1xima expansi\u00f3n azteca\",\r\n            detalle: \"38 provincias tributarias\",\r\n            aporte: \"Sistema tributario complejo\",\r\n            sitio: \"Gran Tenochtitl\u00e1n\",\r\n            poblacion: \"200,000 habitantes\",\r\n            color: \"#9C27B0\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"1521\": {\r\n            civilizacion: \"azteca\",\r\n            evento: \"Ca\u00edda de Tenochtitl\u00e1n\",\r\n            detalle: \"Conquista espa\u00f1ola, fin del imperio\",\r\n            aporte: \"S\u00edntesis cultural mestiza\",\r\n            sitio: \"M\u00e9xico-Tenochtitl\u00e1n\",\r\n            poblacion: \"30,000 habitantes\",\r\n            color: \"#9C27B0\"\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    function actualizarTimeline() {\r\n        const yearSlider = document.getElementById('yearSlider');\r\n        const year = parseInt(yearSlider.value);\r\n        const yearDisplay = year < 0 ? `${Math.abs(year)} a.C.` : `${year} d.C.`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Encontrar el dato m\u00e1s cercano\r\n        let closestYear = Object.keys(timelineData)\r\n            .map(y => parseInt(y))\r\n            .reduce((prev, curr) => Math.abs(curr - year) < Math.abs(prev - year) ? curr : prev);\r\n        \r\n        const data = timelineData[closestYear] || timelineData[\"-1500\"];\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar marcador\r\n        const marcador = document.getElementById('marcadorActual');\r\n        const xPos = 50 + ((year + 1500) \/ 3021) * 700; \/\/ Escala de -1500 a 1521\r\n        marcador.setAttribute('cx', xPos);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar textos\r\n        document.getElementById('textoPeriodo').textContent = `${yearDisplay}: ${data.evento}`;\r\n        document.getElementById('textoEvento').textContent = data.detalle;\r\n        document.getElementById('textoDetalle').textContent = `Civilizaci\u00f3n: ${data.civilizacion.toUpperCase()}`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos en tiempo real\r\n        document.getElementById('dataYear').textContent = yearDisplay;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataCivilizacion').textContent = data.civilizacion.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + data.civilizacion.slice(1);\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEvento').textContent = data.evento;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataAporte').textContent = data.aporte;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataSitio').textContent = data.sitio;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataPoblacion').textContent = data.poblacion;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Resaltar civilizaci\u00f3n activa\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.periodo-civilizacion').forEach(periodo => {\r\n            periodo.setAttribute('opacity', '0.3');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        if (document.getElementById(`periodo${data.civilizacion.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + data.civilizacion.slice(1)}`)) {\r\n            document.getElementById(`periodo${data.civilizacion.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + data.civilizacion.slice(1)}`).setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('yearValue').textContent = yearDisplay;\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcc5 Timeline actualizado: ${yearDisplay} - ${data.evento}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function animarLineaTiempo() {\r\n        const yearSlider = document.getElementById('yearSlider');\r\n        const marcador = document.getElementById('marcadorActual');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Animaci\u00f3n del slider\r\n        let year = -1500;\r\n        const interval = setInterval(() => {\r\n            year += 50;\r\n            if (year > 1521) {\r\n                clearInterval(interval);\r\n                return;\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            yearSlider.value = year;\r\n            actualizarTimeline();\r\n        }, 100);\r\n        \r\n        console.log(\"\ud83c\udfac Animando l\u00ednea del tiempo...\");\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarLineaTiempo() {\r\n        console.log(\"\ud83d\udd04 Reiniciando l\u00ednea del tiempo...\");\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('yearSlider').value = -1500;\r\n        actualizarTimeline();\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoTimeline').textContent = \r\n            \"L\u00ednea del tiempo reiniciada al 1500 a.C. Usa el slider para explorar.\";\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE DETALLES DE CIVILIZACIONES\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarDetalleCivilizacion(civilizacion) {\r\n        \/\/ Ocultar todos los detalles\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.detalle-civilizacion').forEach(detalle => {\r\n            detalle.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar el detalle seleccionado\r\n        const detalle = document.getElementById(`detalle${civilizacion.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + civilizacion.slice(1)}`);\r\n        if (detalle) {\r\n            detalle.style.display = 'block';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar informaci\u00f3n de la tabla\r\n        const infoTextos = {\r\n            olmeca: \"OLMECAS: Cultura madre (1500-400 a.C.). Cabezas colosales de basalto, culto al jaguar, influencia en todas las culturas posteriores. Sitios: San Lorenzo, La Venta, Tres Zapotes.\",\r\n            teotihuacan: \"TEOTIHUAC\u00c1N: Primera metr\u00f3polis (200 a.C.-650 d.C.). Pir\u00e1mides del Sol (65m) y la Luna, urbanismo planificado, poblaci\u00f3n multi\u00e9tnica. Red comercial continental.\",\r\n            maya: \"MAYA: Civilizaci\u00f3n del cl\u00e1sico (250-900 d.C.). \u00danica escritura completa de Am\u00e9rica, matem\u00e1ticas con cero, calendario de precisi\u00f3n excepcional. Ciudades: Tikal, Palenque, Chich\u00e9n Itz\u00e1.\",\r\n            azteca: \"AZTECAS: Imperio tard\u00edo (1325-1521 d.C.). Tenochtitl\u00e1n ciudad lacustre, chinampas agr\u00edcolas, sistema tributario complejo. 38 provincias bajo Triple Alianza.\"\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoCivilizacion').textContent = infoTextos[civilizacion] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\";\r\n        document.getElementById('infoCivilizacion').style.animation = \"highlight 0.5s\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(tr => {\r\n            tr.classList.remove('selected');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Marcar fila seleccionada\r\n        document.querySelector(`[data-civilizacion=\"${civilizacion}\"]`).classList.add('selected');\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    let quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n    \r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n            \r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            verificarCompletadoQuiz();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    function verificarCompletadoQuiz() {\r\n        const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n        const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q => \r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n        \r\n        if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n        const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n        \r\n        let feedback = \"\";\r\n        if (porcentaje >= 80) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas el M\u00e9xico prehisp\u00e1nico.\";\r\n        } else if (porcentaje >= 60) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero revisa las diferencias clave entre civilizaciones.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas repasar las caracter\u00edsticas de cada civilizaci\u00f3n.\";\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        quizRespuestas = [];\r\n        quizCompletado = false;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n        const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n        const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n        \r\n        const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n        \r\n        alert(`\ud83d\udcca AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Cronolog\u00edas: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Diferenciaci\u00f3n: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Conexi\u00f3n cultural: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Revisa el plan de estudio recomendado seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcbe AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada: ${slider1}, ${slider2}, ${slider3}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Sistema Cyberpunk Hist\u00f3rico inicializado\");\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\udcda Lecci\u00f3n: M\u00e9xico Prehisp\u00e1nico\");\r\n    console.log(\"\u26a1 Timeline interactiva, Quiz y Herramientas listas\");\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar timeline\r\n    document.getElementById('yearSlider').addEventListener('input', actualizarTimeline);\r\n    actualizarTimeline();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Tabla interactiva\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(row => {\r\n        row.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const civilizacion = this.dataset.civilizacion;\r\n            mostrarDetalleCivilizacion(civilizacion);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Objetivos interactivos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n            this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n            const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n            checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n            checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : '';\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Problemas de examen\r\n    function verificarProblema(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    <\/script>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Civilizaci\u00f3n \"cultura madre\"","respuesta":"Olmecas"},{"enunciado":"Pir\u00e1mide del Sol en","respuesta":"Teotihuac\u00e1n"},{"enunciado":"Maya: escritura","respuesta":"Jerogl\u00edfica"},{"enunciado":"Capital azteca","respuesta":"Tenochtitl\u00e1n"},{"enunciado":"Chinampas eran","respuesta":"Agricultura flotante"},{"enunciado":"Calendario solar 365 d\u00edas","respuesta":"Azteca"},{"enunciado":"Teotihuac\u00e1n: poblaci\u00f3n estimada","respuesta":"~200,000"},{"enunciado":"Olmecas: s\u00edmbolo","respuesta":"Jaguar"},{"enunciado":"Maya: ciudad famosa","respuesta":"Chich\u00e9n Itz\u00e1"},{"enunciado":"Azteca: dios principal","respuesta":"Huitzilopochtli"},{"enunciado":"Mesoam\u00e9rica incluye","respuesta":"Centro y sur de M\u00e9xico"},{"enunciado":"SI: INAH protege","respuesta":"189 zonas arqueol\u00f3gicas"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Cultura madre","opciones":["Olmecas","Maya","Azteca","Toltecas"],"correcta":"Olmecas"},{"pregunta":"Pir\u00e1mide del Sol","opciones":["Teotihuac\u00e1n","Tenochtitl\u00e1n","Palenque","Tikal"],"correcta":"Teotihuac\u00e1n"},{"pregunta":"Escritura jerogl\u00edfica","opciones":["Maya","Azteca","Olmeca","Teotihuac\u00e1n"],"correcta":"Maya"},{"pregunta":"Tenochtitl\u00e1n sobre","opciones":["Lago","Monta\u00f1a","Desierto","Costa"],"correcta":"Lago"},{"pregunta":"Chinampas","opciones":["Agricultura flotante","Pir\u00e1mides","Escritura","Guerra"],"correcta":"Agricultura flotante"},{"pregunta":"Calendario 365 d\u00edas","opciones":["Azteca","Maya","Olmeca","Inca"],"correcta":"Azteca"},{"pregunta":"Cabezas colosales","opciones":["Olmecas","Maya","Azteca","Teotihuac\u00e1n"],"correcta":"Olmecas"},{"pregunta":"Teotihuac\u00e1n: poblaci\u00f3n","opciones":["~200,000","10,000","1M","500"],"correcta":"~200,000"},{"pregunta":"Maya: error calendario","opciones":["1 d\u00eda\/4000 a\u00f1os","1 d\u00eda\/a\u00f1o","1 d\u00eda\/mes","Ninguno"],"correcta":"1 d\u00eda\/4000 a\u00f1os"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: lenguas ind\u00edgenas","opciones":["68","10","100","1"],"correcta":"68"},{"pregunta":"Olmecas en","opciones":["Golfo","Yucat\u00e1n","CDMX","Oaxaca"],"correcta":"Golfo"},{"pregunta":"Teotihuac\u00e1n: pir\u00e1mide mayor","opciones":["Sol","Luna","Serpiente","Jaguar"],"correcta":"Sol"},{"pregunta":"Maya: Chich\u00e9n Itz\u00e1","opciones":["Yucat\u00e1n","Chiapas","Tabasco","Veracruz"],"correcta":"Yucat\u00e1n"},{"pregunta":"Azteca: dios guerra","opciones":["Huitzilopochtli","Quetzalc\u00f3atl","Tlaloc","Tezcatlipoca"],"correcta":"Huitzilopochtli"},{"pregunta":"Calendario ritual","opciones":["260 d\u00edas","365","52","18"],"correcta":"260 d\u00edas"},{"pregunta":"C\u00f3dices mayas","opciones":["Dresde, Madrid, Par\u00eds","Florentino","Borb\u00f3nico","Mendoza"],"correcta":"Dresde, Madrid, Par\u00eds"},{"pregunta":"Tenochtitl\u00e1n > Par\u00eds","opciones":["S\u00ed (1500)","No","Igual","Menos"],"correcta":"S\u00ed (1500)"},{"pregunta":"INAH: zonas abiertas","opciones":["189","50","500","10"],"correcta":"189"},{"pregunta":"Juego de pelota","opciones":["Ritual","Deporte","Guerra","Comercio"],"correcta":"Ritual"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: ma\u00edz domesticado","opciones":["9000 a\u00f1os M\u00e9xico","500","100","Europa"],"correcta":"9000 a\u00f1os M\u00e9xico"},{"pregunta":"Olmecas: jaguar","opciones":["S\u00edmbolo poder","Comida","Mascota","Nada"],"correcta":"S\u00edmbolo poder"},{"pregunta":"Teotihuac\u00e1n: comercio","opciones":["Obsidiana","Oro","Plata","Cacao"],"correcta":"Obsidiana"},{"pregunta":"Maya: cero matem\u00e1tico","opciones":["S\u00ed","No","Solo romanos","Chinos"],"correcta":"S\u00ed"},{"pregunta":"Azteca: tributos","opciones":["Plumas, cacao","Oro","Plata","Caballos"],"correcta":"Plumas, cacao"},{"pregunta":"Mesoam\u00e9rica sin","opciones":["Rueda (transporte)","Caballos","Hierro","Todas"],"correcta":"Todas"},{"pregunta":"Pir\u00e1mide escalonada","opciones":["Com\u00fan","Rara","Solo maya","Egipcia"],"correcta":"Com\u00fan"},{"pregunta":"Quetzalc\u00f3atl","opciones":["Serpiente emplumada","Sol","Lluvia","Guerra"],"correcta":"Serpiente emplumada"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: c\u00f3dices originales","opciones":["4 mayas","100","0","1000"],"correcta":"4 mayas"},{"pregunta":"Chich\u00e9n Itz\u00e1: equinoccio","opciones":["Serpiente baja","Sube","Nada","Eclipse"],"correcta":"Serpiente baja"},{"pregunta":"Mesoam\u00e9rica: ma\u00edz, frijol, chile","opciones":["Trilog\u00eda","Solo ma\u00edz","Arroz","Trigo"],"correcta":"Trilog\u00eda"}]},{"materia":"Historia de M\u00e9xico","slug":"la-conquista-cyberpunk","titulo":"La Conquista: Cort\u00e9s, Malinche y la Ca\u00edda de Tenochtitl\u00e1n (1519-1521)","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-historia-conquista\" data-tema=\"conquista-mexico\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u2694\ufe0f<\/span> LA CONQUISTA CYBERPUNK\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Estrategias, alianzas y tecnolog\u00eda que cambiaron un imperio (1519-1521)\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE MISI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar las etapas clave<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Identificar fechas, eventos y actores principales.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Evaluar factores de la victoria<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Tecnolog\u00eda, alianzas, enfermedades y estrategia.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Simular la ruta de Cort\u00e9s<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Usar el mapa interactivo para recrear la conquista.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Reflexionar sobre el impacto<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Consecuencias hist\u00f3ricas y culturales.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> CONTEXTO HIST\u00d3RICO (2025)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca Datos Clave<\/h3>\r\n                <p><strong>504 a\u00f1os<\/strong> de la ca\u00edda de Tenochtitl\u00e1n (2025).<\/p>\r\n                <p><strong>11 barcos<\/strong>, <strong>500 espa\u00f1oles<\/strong>, <strong>16 caballos<\/strong> vs. <strong>200,000 mexicas<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Epidemia de viruela: 50% mortalidad<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd0d Controversias Modernas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Debate sobre el papel de <strong>Malinche<\/strong> (traici\u00f3n vs. supervivencia).<\/p>\r\n                <p>Revisi\u00f3n cr\u00edtica de fuentes: <strong>C\u00f3dices vs. Cartas de Relaci\u00f3n<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">65% mexicanos con ascendencia ind\u00edgena<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfad Representaciones Culturales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Pel\u00edculas, series y videojuegos que recrean la conquista.<\/p>\r\n                <p>Ejemplo: <strong>\"Assassin's Creed: Liberation\"<\/strong> (Ubisoft).<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">+100 obras art\u00edsticas inspiradas<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdc<\/span> CRONOLOG\u00cdA DE LA CONQUISTA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- ETAPAS CLAVE -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Etapas de la Conquista (1519-1521)<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"timeline-cyberpunk\">\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-fecha=\"feb-1519\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-marker\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udf0a Febrero 1519: Llegada a Cozumel<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Primer contacto con mayas. Cort\u00e9s recibe a <strong>Jer\u00f3nimo de Aguilar<\/strong> (n\u00e1ufrago).<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-dato\">\ud83d\udcc5 18 Feb 1519<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-fecha=\"abr-1519\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-marker\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Abril 1519: Fundaci\u00f3n de Veracruz<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Primer asentamiento espa\u00f1ol. Cort\u00e9s <strong>quema sus naves<\/strong> para evitar deserciones.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-dato\">\ud83d\udcc5 21 Abr 1519<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-fecha=\"nov-1519\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-marker\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Noviembre 1519: Entrada a Tenochtitl\u00e1n<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Moctezuma recibe a Cort\u00e9s. <strong>Malinche<\/strong> traduce y negocia.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-dato\">\ud83d\udcc5 8 Nov 1519<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-fecha=\"jun-1520\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-marker\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udc80 30 Junio 1520: Noche Triste<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Masacre en el Templo Mayor. <strong>600 espa\u00f1oles<\/strong> y miles de aliados mueren.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-dato\">\ud83d\udcc5 30 Jun 1520<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-fecha=\"ago-1521\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-marker\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd25 13 Agosto 1521: Ca\u00edda de Tenochtitl\u00e1n<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Tras <strong>75 d\u00edas de sitio<\/strong>, Cuauht\u00e9moc es capturado. Fin del imperio mexica.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-dato\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Ago 1521<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FACTORES DE LA VICTORIA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Factores de la Victoria Espa\u00f1ola<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"factores-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"factor-card tecnologia\">\r\n                    <div class=\"factor-icon\">\ud83d\udd2b<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>Tecnolog\u00eda Superior<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Armas de fuego<\/strong> (arcabuces).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Acero<\/strong> (espadas vs. obsidiana).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Caballos<\/strong> (impacto psicol\u00f3gico).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Bergantines<\/strong> (control del lago).<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"factor-dato\">\ud83d\udcc9 Ventaja: 90% en combate<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"factor-card alianzas\">\r\n                    <div class=\"factor-icon\">\ud83e\udd1d<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>Alianzas Ind\u00edgenas<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Tlaxcala<\/strong> (enemigos de Tenochtitl\u00e1n).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Texcoco<\/strong> y <strong>Huejotzingo<\/strong>.<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>200,000 aliados<\/strong> vs. 500 espa\u00f1oles.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"factor-dato\">\ud83d\udd04 80% del ej\u00e9rcito de Cort\u00e9s<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"factor-card enfermedades\">\r\n                    <div class=\"factor-icon\">\ud83e\udda0<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>Enfermedades<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Viruela<\/strong> (1520): mat\u00f3 a <strong>Cuitl\u00e1huac<\/strong>.<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>50% mortalidad<\/strong> en Tenochtitl\u00e1n.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Debilit\u00f3 resistencia mexica.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"factor-dato\">\u2620\ufe0f 3 millones de muertes<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"factor-card estrategia\">\r\n                    <div class=\"factor-icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>Estrategia Militar<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Sitio de 75 d\u00edas<\/strong> (1521).<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Destrucci\u00f3n de <strong>acueductos<\/strong>.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Uso de <strong>bergantines<\/strong> en el lago.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"factor-dato\">\ud83c\udfc6 Victoria t\u00e1ctica<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- PERSONAJES CLAVE -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Personajes Clave<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"personajes-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"personaje-card cortes\">\r\n                    <div class=\"personaje-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"personaje-icon\">\ud83d\udc51<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Hern\u00e1n Cort\u00e9s<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"personaje-subtitulo\">Conquistador Extreme\u00f1o<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"personaje-datos\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Estratega<\/strong>: Us\u00f3 divisi\u00f3n entre pueblos ind\u00edgenas.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Ambici\u00f3n<\/strong>: Buscaba oro y gloria.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Controversia<\/strong>: \u00bfH\u00e9roe o villano?<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"personaje-dato\">\ud83d\udcdc Cartas de Relaci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"personaje-card malinche\">\r\n                    <div class=\"personaje-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"personaje-icon\">\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>La Malinche<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"personaje-subtitulo\">Int\u00e9rprete y Consejera<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"personaje-datos\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Nahua<\/strong>: Hablaba maya y n\u00e1huatl.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Clave<\/strong>: Traductora y negociadora.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Legado<\/strong>: S\u00edmbolo de mestizaje.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"personaje-dato\">\ud83c\udf0e \"La Lengua de Cort\u00e9s\"<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"personaje-card moctezuma\">\r\n                    <div class=\"personaje-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"personaje-icon\">\ud83d\udc51<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Moctezuma Xocoyotzin<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"personaje-subtitulo\">Huey Tlatoani<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"personaje-datos\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Gobernante<\/strong>: Rein\u00f3 durante la llegada de Cort\u00e9s.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Duda<\/strong>: \u00bfCre\u00eda que Cort\u00e9s era Quetzalc\u00f3atl?<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Fin<\/strong>: Muere en 1520 (asesinado).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"personaje-dato\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f \u00daltimo gran tlatoani<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"personaje-card cuauhtemoc\">\r\n                    <div class=\"personaje-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"personaje-icon\">\u2694\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Cuauht\u00e9moc<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"personaje-subtitulo\">\u00daltimo Tlatoani<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"personaje-datos\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Resistencia<\/strong>: Lider\u00f3 la defensa final.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Captura<\/strong>: Torturado por Cort\u00e9s.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Legado<\/strong>: S\u00edmbolo de resistencia.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"personaje-dato\">\ud83d\udd25 \"El \u00c1guila que Cay\u00f3\"<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: RUTA DE CORT\u00c9S\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"ruta-conquista\">\r\n            <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>\u2699\ufe0f CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"etapaSelect\">Etapa:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"etapaSelect\" class=\"control-input\">\r\n                        <option value=\"cozumel\">Feb 1519: Cozumel<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"veracruz\">Abr 1519: Veracruz<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"tlaxcala\">Sep 1519: Tlaxcala<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"tenochtitlan\">Nov 1519: Tenochtitl\u00e1n<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"noche-triste\">Jun 1520: Noche Triste<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"sitio\">May 1521: Sitio Final<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"caida\">Ago 1521: Ca\u00edda<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"velocidad\">Velocidad:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"velocidad\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"5\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-iniciar\" onclick=\"iniciarSimulacion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6\ufe0f<\/span> INICIAR SIMULACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-reiniciar\" onclick=\"reiniciarSimulacion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <div class=\"mapa-container\">\r\n                    <svg id=\"mapaConquista\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 500\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n                        <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Ruta base -->\r\n                        <path id=\"rutaBase\" d=\"M100,300 Q250,250 400,300 Q550,350 700,300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#444\" stroke-width=\"30\" opacity=\"0.3\"\/>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Puntos clave -->\r\n                        <g id=\"cozumel\" class=\"punto-mapa\" data-etapa=\"cozumel\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"300\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FF5252\" opacity=\"0.5\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"100\" y=\"270\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Cozumel<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"100\" y=\"340\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Feb 1519<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        <g id=\"veracruz\" class=\"punto-mapa\" data-etapa=\"veracruz\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"250\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" opacity=\"0.5\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"220\" fill=\"#A5D6A7\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Veracruz<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"290\" fill=\"#A5D6A7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Abr 1519<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        <g id=\"tlaxcala\" class=\"punto-mapa\" data-etapa=\"tlaxcala\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"200\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FF9800\" opacity=\"0.5\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"400\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#FFE0B2\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Tlaxcala<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"400\" y=\"240\" fill=\"#FFE0B2\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sep 1519<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        <g id=\"tenochtitlan\" class=\"punto-mapa\" data-etapa=\"tenochtitlan\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"600\" cy=\"300\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#D32F2F\" opacity=\"0.5\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"600\" y=\"270\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Tenochtitl\u00e1n<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"600\" y=\"340\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Nov 1519<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        <g id=\"noche-triste\" class=\"punto-mapa\" data-etapa=\"noche-triste\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"550\" cy=\"350\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\" opacity=\"0.5\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"320\" fill=\"#CE93D8\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Noche Triste<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"550\" y=\"390\" fill=\"#CE93D8\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Jun 1520<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        <g id=\"sitio\" class=\"punto-mapa\" data-etapa=\"sitio\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"650\" cy=\"250\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FF5252\" opacity=\"0.5\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"650\" y=\"220\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sitio<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"650\" y=\"290\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">May 1521<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        <g id=\"caida\" class=\"punto-mapa\" data-etapa=\"caida\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"700\" cy=\"300\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#B71C1C\" opacity=\"0.5\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"700\" y=\"270\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ca\u00edda<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"700\" y=\"340\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ago 1521<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Ruta animada -->\r\n                        <path id=\"rutaAnimada\" d=\"M100,300 Q250,250 400,300 Q550,350 700,300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#39FF14\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-dasharray=\"1000\" stroke-dashoffset=\"1000\">\r\n                            <animate id=\"animRuta\" attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" values=\"1000;0\" dur=\"10s\" begin=\"indefinite\" fill=\"freeze\"\/>\r\n                        <\/path>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Leyenda -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"50\" y=\"400\" width=\"700\" height=\"80\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.7)\" rx=\"10\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"430\" fill=\"#39FF14\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">RUTA DE LA CONQUISTA (1519-1521)<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"460\" fill=\"#E0E0E0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"leyendaTexto\">Selecciona una etapa y haz clic en \"INICIAR SIMULACI\u00d3N\"<\/text>\r\n                    <\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca DATOS HIST\u00d3RICOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Etapa:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEtapa\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Fecha:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataFecha\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Evento:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEvento\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Impacto:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataImpacto\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Fuerzas:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataFuerzas\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Aliados:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataAliados\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: \u00bfCU\u00c1NTO SABES?\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 evento marc\u00f3 el inicio del sitio a Tenochtitl\u00e1n?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Llegada a Cozumel\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Noche Triste\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Fundaci\u00f3n de Veracruz\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Alianza con Tlaxcala\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> La Noche Triste (30 jun 1520) fue el detonante del sitio final.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la cronolog\u00eda en el simulador.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>Tras la Noche Triste, Cort\u00e9s reorganiz\u00f3 sus fuerzas y regres\u00f3 con refuerzos de Cuba y m\u00e1s aliados ind\u00edgenas.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l fue el papel de La Malinche?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        L\u00edder militar\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Esp\u00eda de Moctezuma\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Int\u00e9rprete y consejera\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Sacerdotisa mexica\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Malinche fue clave como traductora y mediadora cultural.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Investiga su biograf\u00eda en la secci\u00f3n de personajes.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 ventaja tecnol\u00f3gica NO ten\u00edan los mexicas?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Armas de fuego\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Chinampas\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Calendarios\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Medicina herbal\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Los arcabuces y ca\u00f1ones fueron decisivos.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la secci\u00f3n de \"Factores de la Victoria\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                    Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                    Completa el quiz para ver tu desempe\u00f1o.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd04 VOLVER A INTENTAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> MITOS Y ERRORES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c \"Cort\u00e9s conquist\u00f3 M\u00e9xico solo\"<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"Los espa\u00f1oles ganaron por su superioridad num\u00e9rica.\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Realidad:<\/strong> Cort\u00e9s tuvo <strong>500 espa\u00f1oles<\/strong> vs. <strong>200,000 mexicas<\/strong>, pero cont\u00f3 con <strong>200,000 aliados ind\u00edgenas<\/strong> (Tlaxcala, Texcoco).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-grafica\">\r\n                        <div class=\"grafica-barras\">\r\n                            <div class=\"barra espa\u00f1ola\" style=\"width: 5%;\">Espa\u00f1oles (500)<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"barra mexica\" style=\"width: 90%;\">Mexicas (200,000)<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"barra aliados\" style=\"width: 95%;\">Aliados (200,000)<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"grafica-leyenda\">\r\n                            <span class=\"leyenda-espa\u00f1ola\">\ud83d\udfe5 Espa\u00f1oles<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"leyenda-mexica\">\ud83d\udfe9 Mexicas<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"leyenda-aliados\">\ud83d\udfe8 Aliados<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c \"La viruela fue tra\u00edda por Cort\u00e9s\"<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"Cort\u00e9s us\u00f3 la viruela como arma biol\u00f3gica.\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Realidad:<\/strong> La viruela lleg\u00f3 con <strong>un esclavo africano<\/strong> en 1520 (Narv\u00e1ez). Cort\u00e9s no la controlaba.\r\n                        <div class=\"error-dato\">\ud83e\udda0 Primer registro en Tenochtitl\u00e1n: Octubre 1520.<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-mapa\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 100\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF5252\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"50\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Cuba<\/text>\r\n                            <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"50\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF5252\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"250\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Tenochtitl\u00e1n<\/text>\r\n                            <path d=\"M50,50 L250,50\" stroke=\"#FF9800\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,2\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"150\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#FFE0B2\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ruta de la viruela (1520)<\/text>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c \"Moctezuma crey\u00f3 que Cort\u00e9s era Quetzalc\u00f3atl\"<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Error:<\/strong> \"Moctezuma rindi\u00f3 Tenochtitl\u00e1n por superstici\u00f3n.\"\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Realidad:<\/strong> Los mexicas <strong>no asociaban a Cort\u00e9s con Quetzalc\u00f3atl<\/strong> (dios blanco y barbado). Moctezuma actu\u00f3 por <strong>c\u00e1lculo pol\u00edtico<\/strong>.\r\n                        <div class=\"error-cita\">\r\n                            <p>\"Los espa\u00f1oles eran <strong>hombres, no dioses<\/strong>.\" \u2014 <em>C\u00f3dice Florentino<\/em><\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-imagen\">\r\n                        <img src=\"https:\/\/upload.wikimedia.org\/wikipedia\/commons\/thumb\/5\/5a\/Codex_Florentino_Book_12_folio_54r.jpg\/300px-Codex_Florentino_Book_12_folio_54r.jpg\" alt=\"C\u00f3dice Florentino\" width=\"100%\">\r\n                        <p><em>Representaci\u00f3n mexica de los espa\u00f1oles. Fuente: Wikipedia.<\/em><\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> MISI\u00d3N FINAL: AN\u00c1LISIS CR\u00cdTICO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>An\u00e1lisis de Fuentes<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Compara los relatos de la conquista en:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li><strong>Cartas de Relaci\u00f3n<\/strong> (Cort\u00e9s).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>C\u00f3dice Florentino<\/strong> (Sahag\u00fan).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Cr\u00f3nicas ind\u00edgenas<\/strong> (ej. Chimalpahin).<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Identifica <strong>3 diferencias clave<\/strong> en la narrativa y explica su importancia hist\u00f3rica.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: Cort\u00e9s omite la ayuda de Tlaxcala para...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VER SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li><strong>Cort\u00e9s:<\/strong> Exagera su hero\u00edsmo y minimiza el papel de los aliados ind\u00edgenas.<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>C\u00f3dice Florentino:<\/strong> Muestra la conquista como una <strong>cat\u00e1strofe<\/strong> (epidemias, destrucci\u00f3n).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Chimalpahin:<\/strong> Destaca la <strong>resistencia mexica<\/strong> y la traici\u00f3n de Tlaxcala.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p><strong>Importancia:<\/strong> Las fuentes reflejan <strong>perspectivas distintas<\/strong> (europea vs. ind\u00edgena) y sesgos hist\u00f3ricos.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Debate: \u00bfFue inevitable la conquista?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Argumenta a favor o en contra de la siguiente afirmaci\u00f3n:<\/p>\r\n                    <blockquote>\r\n                        \"La ca\u00edda de Tenochtitl\u00e1n fue inevitable debido a la superioridad tecnol\u00f3gica y las divisiones internas en el imperio mexica.\"\r\n                    <\/blockquote>\r\n                    <p>Usa al menos <strong>3 evidencias hist\u00f3ricas<\/strong> del simulador o las secciones anteriores.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: La viruela debilit\u00f3 a Tenochtitl\u00e1n, pero...\" rows=\"10\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VER ARGUMENTOS<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Argumentos a favor de la inevitabilidad:<\/strong>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Tecnolog\u00eda:<\/strong> Armas de fuego y caballos (ventaja del 90% en combate).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Enfermedades:<\/strong> Viruela mat\u00f3 al 50% de la poblaci\u00f3n.<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Alianzas:<\/strong> 200,000 aliados vs. 500 espa\u00f1oles.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <strong>Argumentos en contra:<\/strong>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Resistencia:<\/strong> Cuauht\u00e9moc lider\u00f3 una defensa \u00e9pica.<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Errores espa\u00f1oles:<\/strong> Derrota en la Noche Triste (1520).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Azar:<\/strong> Si no llega la viruela, el resultado podr\u00eda ser distinto.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis de fuentes<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Identifica 3 diferencias con explicaci\u00f3n cr\u00edtica.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Menciona diferencias sin profundizar.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No compara fuentes.<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Uso de evidencias<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Argumenta con 3+ evidencias hist\u00f3ricas.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Usa 1-2 evidencias sin contexto.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No usa evidencias.<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Reflexi\u00f3n cr\u00edtica<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Eval\u00faa perspectivas m\u00faltiples (europea\/ind\u00edgena).<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Analiza solo una perspectiva.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Repite informaci\u00f3n sin reflexi\u00f3n.<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE: REFLEXI\u00d3N HIST\u00d3RICA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Conozco las etapas de la conquista:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Analizo factores de la victoria espa\u00f1ola:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Uso el simulador para entender la ruta:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR PROGRESO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N FINAL<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo crees que habr\u00eda sido M\u00e9xico si los mexicas hubieran vencido a Cort\u00e9s? Considera aspectos culturales, pol\u00edticos y tecnol\u00f3gicos.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: Sin la colonizaci\u00f3n, el n\u00e1huatl ser\u00eda...\" rows=\"5\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Investiga un personaje de la conquista (ej. Pedro de Alvarado, Cacama de Texcoco) y describe su papel en 3 l\u00edneas.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: Alvarado masacr\u00f3 a nobles mexicas en...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (20 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Repasar fechas y personajes clave.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar factores de la victoria.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Ver el mapa interactivo 2 veces.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (40 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Leer un fragmento de las <strong>Cartas de Relaci\u00f3n<\/strong>.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Comparar con el <strong>C\u00f3dice Florentino<\/strong>.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Escribir un p\u00e1rrafo sobre diferencias.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 DEBATE (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Preparar argumentos sobre: \u00bfFue Malinche una traidora?<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Debatir en clase con evidencias.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Reflexionar sobre el concepto de \"traici\u00f3n\" en guerra.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf10 RECURSOS EXTERNOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.loc.gov\/collections\/hernan-cortes-papers\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcdc Cartas de Relaci\u00f3n (Library of Congress)\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.mna.inah.gob.mx\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Museo Nacional de Antropolog\u00eda (INAH)\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/humanities\/whp-origins\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udf93 Khan Academy: Conquista de M\u00e9xico\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=...\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udfa5 Documental: \"La Otra Conquista\" (IMDb)\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ BASE DE DATOS DEL SIMULADOR\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nconst etapasConquista = {\r\n    \"cozumel\": {\r\n        fecha: \"Febrero 1519\",\r\n        evento: \"Llegada a Cozumel\",\r\n        descripcion: \"Primer contacto con mayas. Cort\u00e9s recibe a Jer\u00f3nimo de Aguilar (n\u00e1ufrago que hablaba maya).\",\r\n        impacto: \"Obtenci\u00f3n de informaci\u00f3n sobre el imperio mexica.\",\r\n        fuerzas: \"500 espa\u00f1oles\",\r\n        aliados: \"Ninguno (primer contacto)\",\r\n        color: \"#FF5252\",\r\n        icono: \"\ud83c\udf0a\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"veracruz\": {\r\n        fecha: \"21 Abril 1519\",\r\n        evento: \"Fundaci\u00f3n de Veracruz\",\r\n        descripcion: \"Cort\u00e9s establece el primer asentamiento espa\u00f1ol y quema sus naves para evitar deserciones.\",\r\n        impacto: \"Punto de partida para la conquista. Cort\u00e9s se declara independiente de Vel\u00e1zquez (Cuba).\",\r\n        fuerzas: \"500 espa\u00f1oles\",\r\n        aliados: \"Totonacas (primeros aliados)\",\r\n        color: \"#4CAF50\",\r\n        icono: \"\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"tlaxcala\": {\r\n        fecha: \"Septiembre 1519\",\r\n        evento: \"Alianza con Tlaxcala\",\r\n        descripcion: \"Cort\u00e9s forma alianza con los tlaxcaltecas, enemigos de Tenochtitl\u00e1n. Recibe regalos y apoyo militar.\",\r\n        impacto: \"Fuerzas combinadas: 500 espa\u00f1oles + 6,000 tlaxcaltecas.\",\r\n        fuerzas: \"500 espa\u00f1oles + 6,000 tlaxcaltecas\",\r\n        aliados: \"Tlaxcala\",\r\n        color: \"#FF9800\",\r\n        icono: \"\ud83e\udd1d\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"tenochtitlan\": {\r\n        fecha: \"8 Noviembre 1519\",\r\n        evento: \"Entrada a Tenochtitl\u00e1n\",\r\n        descripcion: \"Moctezuma recibe a Cort\u00e9s. Malinche traduce. Cort\u00e9s toma a Moctezuma como reh\u00e9n.\",\r\n        impacto: \"Cort\u00e9s controla a Moctezuma, pero la tensi\u00f3n crece.\",\r\n        fuerzas: \"500 espa\u00f1oles + aliados\",\r\n        aliados: \"Tlaxcala, totonacas\",\r\n        color: \"#D32F2F\",\r\n        icono: \"\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"noche-triste\": {\r\n        fecha: \"30 Junio 1520\",\r\n        evento: \"Noche Triste\",\r\n        descripcion: \"Tras la masacre en el Templo Mayor (Alvarado), los mexicas atacan. Cort\u00e9s huye por la calzada de Tacuba.\",\r\n        impacto: \"Derrota temporal: 600 espa\u00f1oles y miles de aliados mueren. Cort\u00e9s se reagrupa en Tlaxcala.\",\r\n        fuerzas: \"400 espa\u00f1oles sobrevivientes\",\r\n        aliados: \"Tlaxcala (refugio)\",\r\n        color: \"#7B1FA2\",\r\n        icono: \"\ud83d\udc80\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"sitio\": {\r\n        fecha: \"Mayo 1521\",\r\n        evento: \"Sitio a Tenochtitl\u00e1n\",\r\n        descripcion: \"Cort\u00e9s regresa con refuerzos de Cuba y m\u00e1s aliados. Construye bergantines para controlar el lago.\",\r\n        impacto: \"Bloqueo total: 75 d\u00edas de sitio. Destrucci\u00f3n de acueductos y hambruna.\",\r\n        fuerzas: \"900 espa\u00f1oles + 100,000 aliados\",\r\n        aliados: \"Tlaxcala, Texcoco, Huejotzingo\",\r\n        color: \"#FF5252\",\r\n        icono: \"\ud83d\udd25\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"caida\": {\r\n        fecha: \"13 Agosto 1521\",\r\n        evento: \"Ca\u00edda de Tenochtitl\u00e1n\",\r\n        descripcion: \"Cuauht\u00e9moc es capturado. Fin del imperio mexica. Cort\u00e9s inicia la construcci\u00f3n de la Ciudad de M\u00e9xico.\",\r\n        impacto: \"Inicio del virreinato. 200,000 muertos (guerra + viruela).\",\r\n        fuerzas: \"900 espa\u00f1oles + aliados\",\r\n        aliados: \"Todas las ciudades enemigas de Tenochtitl\u00e1n\",\r\n        color: \"#B71C1C\",\r\n        icono: \"\u2620\ufe0f\"\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR: RUTA DE CORT\u00c9S\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction iniciarSimulacion() {\r\n    const etapa = document.getElementById('etapaSelect').value;\r\n    const velocidad = document.getElementById('velocidad').value;\r\n    const datos = etapasConquista[etapa];\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEtapa').textContent = datos.evento;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataFecha').textContent = datos.fecha;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataEvento').textContent = datos.descripcion;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataImpacto').textContent = datos.impacto;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataFuerzas').textContent = datos.fuerzas;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataAliados').textContent = datos.aliados;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar leyenda\r\n    document.getElementById('leyendaTexto').textContent = `${datos.icono} ${datos.evento} (${datos.fecha})`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Animar ruta\r\n    const anim = document.getElementById('animRuta');\r\n    anim.beginElement();\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Resaltar punto en el mapa\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.punto-mapa').forEach(p => {\r\n        p.setAttribute('opacity', '0.3');\r\n    });\r\n    document.getElementById(etapa).setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Cambiar color de la ruta animada\r\n    document.getElementById('rutaAnimada').setAttribute('stroke', datos.color);\r\n\r\n    console.log(`\ud83d\ude80 Simulaci\u00f3n iniciada: ${datos.evento} (${datos.fecha})`);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarSimulacion() {\r\n    document.getElementById('etapaSelect').value = \"cozumel\";\r\n    document.getElementById('velocidad').value = \"5\";\r\n    document.getElementById('leyendaTexto').textContent = \"Selecciona una etapa y haz clic en 'INICIAR SIMULACI\u00d3N'\";\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar datos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.data-value').forEach(d => {\r\n        d.textContent = \"\u2014\";\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar mapa\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.punto-mapa').forEach(p => {\r\n        p.setAttribute('opacity', '0.5');\r\n    });\r\n    document.getElementById('rutaAnimada').setAttribute('stroke', '#39FF14');\r\n\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\udd04 Simulaci\u00f3n reiniciada\");\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n        const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n\r\n        if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n    const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n    let feedback = \"\";\r\n    if (porcentaje >= 80) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83c\udf1f \u00a1Excelente! Dominas los detalles clave de la conquista.\";\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 50) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero repasa los factores de la victoria espa\u00f1ola.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas estudiar m\u00e1s la cronolog\u00eda y personajes.\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ ERRORES COMUNES (MITOS)\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction toggleError(header) {\r\n    const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n\r\n    if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n    } else {\r\n        content.style.display = 'block';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n\r\n    alert(`\ud83d\udcbe Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n          `Cronolog\u00eda: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n          `Factores de victoria: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n          `Uso del simulador: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n          `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n          `\ud83d\udccc Recomendaci\u00f3n: Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ OBJETIVOS INTERACTIVOS\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n        this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n        const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n        checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n        checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : '';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: La Conquista de M\u00e9xico - Cargada\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83c\udfae Simulador, Quiz y Herramientas interactivas listas\");\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"A\u00f1o llegada Cort\u00e9s","respuesta":"1519"},{"enunciado":"Int\u00e9rprete de Cort\u00e9s","respuesta":"Malinche"},{"enunciado":"Aliados clave","respuesta":"Tlaxcaltecas"},{"enunciado":"Enfermedad decisiva","respuesta":"Viruela"},{"enunciado":"Ca\u00edda Tenochtitl\u00e1n","respuesta":"13 agosto 1521"},{"enunciado":"Noche Triste","respuesta":"30 junio 1520"},{"enunciado":"Emperador al llegar Cort\u00e9s","respuesta":"Moctezuma II"},{"enunciado":"Sucesor muerto por viruela","respuesta":"Cuitl\u00e1huac"},{"enunciado":"\u00daltimo emperador","respuesta":"Cuauht\u00e9moc"},{"enunciado":"Fundaci\u00f3n Veracruz","respuesta":"22 abril 1519"},{"enunciado":"Bergantines en sitio","respuesta":"13"},{"enunciado":"SI: a\u00f1os de conquista","respuesta":"2 a\u00f1os 3 meses"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"L\u00edder conquista","opciones":["Cort\u00e9s","Pizarro","Col\u00f3n","Vel\u00e1zquez"],"correcta":"Cort\u00e9s"},{"pregunta":"Malinche fue","opciones":["Int\u00e9rprete","Reina","Sacerdotisa","Esp\u00eda"],"correcta":"Int\u00e9rprete"},{"pregunta":"Alianza clave","opciones":["Tlaxcala","Tenochtitl\u00e1n","Maya","Inca"],"correcta":"Tlaxcala"},{"pregunta":"Enfermedad","opciones":["Viruela","Gripe","C\u00f3lera","Peste"],"correcta":"Viruela"},{"pregunta":"Ca\u00edda Tenochtitl\u00e1n","opciones":["13 Ago 1521","12 Oct 1492","1 Ene 1500","20 Nov 1910"],"correcta":"13 Ago 1521"},{"pregunta":"Noche Triste","opciones":["30 Jun 1520","1 Ene","25 Dic","15 Sep"],"correcta":"30 Jun 1520"},{"pregunta":"Emperador inicial","opciones":["Moctezuma II","Cuauht\u00e9moc","Cuitl\u00e1huac","Nezahualc\u00f3yotl"],"correcta":"Moctezuma II"},{"pregunta":"Muerto por viruela","opciones":["Cuitl\u00e1huac","Moctezuma","Cuauht\u00e9moc","Cort\u00e9s"],"correcta":"Cuitl\u00e1huac"},{"pregunta":"\u00daltimo tlatoani","opciones":["Cuauht\u00e9moc","Moctezuma","Cuitl\u00e1huac","Itzc\u00f3atl"],"correcta":"Cuauht\u00e9moc"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: a\u00f1os ca\u00edda","opciones":["504","500","600","400"],"correcta":"504"},{"pregunta":"Llegada Cozumel","opciones":["Feb 1519","Abr 1519","Nov 1519","1521"],"correcta":"Feb 1519"},{"pregunta":"Fundaci\u00f3n Veracruz","opciones":["22 Abr 1519","1 Ene","12 Oct","20 Nov"],"correcta":"22 Abr 1519"},{"pregunta":"Entrada Tenochtitl\u00e1n","opciones":["8 Nov 1519","1 Ene","25 Dic","15 Sep"],"correcta":"8 Nov 1519"},{"pregunta":"Matanza Templo Mayor","opciones":["Mayo 1520","1519","1521","1522"],"correcta":"Mayo 1520"},{"pregunta":"Sitio dur\u00f3","opciones":["75 d\u00edas","1 a\u00f1o","1 d\u00eda","1 mes"],"correcta":"75 d\u00edas"},{"pregunta":"Bergantines","opciones":["13","1","100","0"],"correcta":"13"},{"pregunta":"Caballos en 1519","opciones":["16","100","0","1000"],"correcta":"16"},{"pregunta":"Poblaci\u00f3n Tenochtitl\u00e1n","opciones":["~200,000","10,000","1M","500"],"correcta":"~200,000"},{"pregunta":"Cuauht\u00e9moc ejecutado","opciones":["1525","1521","1519","1530"],"correcta":"1525"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: Malinche s\u00edmbolo","opciones":["Traici\u00f3n y mediaci\u00f3n","Solo traici\u00f3n","Solo hero\u00edna","Nada"],"correcta":"Traici\u00f3n y mediaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Moctezuma muerto","opciones":["Julio 1520","1519","1521","1525"],"correcta":"Julio 1520"},{"pregunta":"Cuitl\u00e1huac rein\u00f3","opciones":["4 meses","10 a\u00f1os","1 d\u00eda","20 a\u00f1os"],"correcta":"4 meses"},{"pregunta":"Tenochtitl\u00e1n destruida","opciones":["Sobre ruinas CDMX","Desapareci\u00f3","Se mud\u00f3","Nada"],"correcta":"Sobre ruinas CDMX"},{"pregunta":"Cartas de Relaci\u00f3n","opciones":["Cort\u00e9s a Carlos V","Moctezuma","Malinche","Tlaxcala"],"correcta":"Cort\u00e9s a Carlos V"},{"pregunta":"Viruela lleg\u00f3 con","opciones":["Espa\u00f1oles (Narv\u00e1ez)","Cort\u00e9s","Nativos","\u00c1frica"],"correcta":"Espa\u00f1oles (Narv\u00e1ez)"},{"pregunta":"P\u00e1nfilo de Narv\u00e1ez","opciones":["Enviado a arrestar Cort\u00e9s","Aliado","Rey","Nada"],"correcta":"Enviado a arrestar Cort\u00e9s"},{"pregunta":"Batalla Otumba","opciones":["Victoria tras Noche Triste","Derrota","Paz","Nada"],"correcta":"Victoria tras Noche Triste"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: sitio recordado","opciones":["500 a\u00f1os en 2021","2025","2030","Nunca"],"correcta":"500 a\u00f1os en 2021"},{"pregunta":"Conquista fue","opciones":["Guerra + alianzas + enfermedad","Solo guerra","Solo paz","Nada"],"correcta":"Guerra + alianzas + enfermedad"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico mestizo desde","opciones":["1521","1821","1910","2025"],"correcta":"1521"}]},{"materia":"Historia de M\u00e9xico","slug":"virreinato-nueva-espana","titulo":"Virreinato de Nueva Espa\u00f1a: Poder, Explotaci\u00f3n y Evangelizaci\u00f3n (1521-1821)","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-historia-virreinato\" data-tema=\"virreinato-nueva-espana\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n            VIRREINATO DE NUEVA ESPA\u00d1A\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            El Orden Colonial: Encomienda, Virreyes y Control Eclesi\u00e1stico (1521-1821)\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"badge-tiempo\">\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">1521-1821<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">300 a\u00f1os<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">63 virreyes<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">Castas sociales<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar estructura de poder<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Comprender jerarqu\u00eda: Rey \u2192 Virrey \u2192 Audiencias \u2192 Cabildos<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Evaluar sistema econ\u00f3mico<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Examinar encomienda, miner\u00eda, haciendas y comercio<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Identificar sistema de castas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Diferenciar espa\u00f1oles, criollos, mestizos, ind\u00edgenas, negros<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Examinar control eclesi\u00e1stico<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Analizar evangelizaci\u00f3n, Inquisici\u00f3n y poder de la Iglesia<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> LEGADO COLONIAL EN M\u00c9XICO ACTUAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Arquitectura Colonial<\/h3>\r\n                <p>1,200 sitios coloniales protegidos por INAH, 15 Patrimonios UNESCO<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Catedral Metropolitana: 240 a\u00f1os construcci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f Lengua y Religi\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Espa\u00f1ol como lengua oficial, 82% poblaci\u00f3n cat\u00f3lica (INEGI 2020)<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Sistema de castas \u2192 desigualdad moderna<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcb0 Econom\u00eda Minera<\/h3>\r\n                <p>M\u00e9xico sigue siendo primer productor mundial de plata (2024)<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Continuidad de zonas mineras hist\u00f3ricas<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> ESTRUCTURA DEL PODER COLONIAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- INTRODUCCI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Fundaci\u00f3n y Justificaci\u00f3n del Virreinato<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f VIRREINATO DE NUEVA ESPA\u00d1A<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Entidad pol\u00edtica y territorial creada por Espa\u00f1a tras la conquista de Tenochtitl\u00e1n (1521). Capital: <strong>Ciudad de M\u00e9xico<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"caracteristicas-grid\">\r\n                        <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-icon\">\ud83d\udc51<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-texto\">Justificaci\u00f3n: Derecho de conquista<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-icon\">\u26ea<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-texto\">Prop\u00f3sito: Evangelizaci\u00f3n ind\u00edgena<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-icon\">\ud83d\udcb0<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-texto\">Objetivo: Explotaci\u00f3n econ\u00f3mica<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-icon\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-texto\">Duraci\u00f3n: 300 a\u00f1os (1521-1821)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- JERARQU\u00cdA DE PODER -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Jerarqu\u00eda Pol\u00edtica y Administrativa<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>NIVEL<\/th>\r\n                            <th>FIGURA\/INSTITUCI\u00d3N<\/th>\r\n                            <th>FUNCI\u00d3N PRINCIPAL<\/th>\r\n                            <th>PERIODO\/CARACTER\u00cdSTICAS<\/th>\r\n                            <th>EJEMPLO<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr data-nivel=\"rey\" onclick=\"mostrarDetalleNivel('rey')\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"nivel-tag rey\">REY<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Monarca espa\u00f1ol<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Autoridad suprema, emite c\u00e9dulas reales<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Carlos V, Felipe II, Borbones<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Leyes de Indias (1542)<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-nivel=\"virrey\" onclick=\"mostrarDetalleNivel('virrey')\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"nivel-tag virrey\">VIRREY<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Representante real<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Gobierno, justicia, guerra, hacienda<\/td>\r\n                            <td>63 virreyes (1535-1821)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Antonio de Mendoza (1\u00ba virrey)<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-nivel=\"audiencia\" onclick=\"mostrarDetalleNivel('audiencia')\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"nivel-tag audiencia\">AUDIENCIAS<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Tribunal y consejo<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Control judicial, asesor\u00eda al virrey<\/td>\r\n                            <td>M\u00e9xico (1527), Guadalajara (1548)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Residencia (juicio de cuentas)<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-nivel=\"cabildo\" onclick=\"mostrarDetalleNivel('cabildo')\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"nivel-tag cabildo\">CABILDOS<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Ayuntamientos<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Administraci\u00f3n local, obras p\u00fablicas<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Regidores, alcaldes ordinarios<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Cabildo de la Ciudad de M\u00e9xico<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoNivel\">\r\n                    Selecciona un nivel de la jerarqu\u00eda para ver detalles ampliados\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- DETALLES DE NIVELES -->\r\n            <div class=\"niveles-detalles\">\r\n                <div class=\"detalle-nivel\" id=\"detalleRey\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udc51 El Poder Real: Legislaci\u00f3n desde Espa\u00f1a<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"detalle-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcdc C\u00e9dulas Reales<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>\u00d3rdenes directas del rey que deb\u00edan obedecerse en la Nueva Espa\u00f1a<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Ejemplo: Prohibici\u00f3n de esclavitud ind\u00edgena (1542)<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Consejo de Indias<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Creado en 1524, supervisaba todo lo relacionado con las colonias<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Funciones: legislativa, judicial, administrativa<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\u2696\ufe0f Leyes de Indias<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Recopilaci\u00f3n de 1680 con 6,400 leyes sobre gobierno colonial<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Intentaban proteger ind\u00edgenas (aplicaci\u00f3n limitada)<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"detalle-nivel\" id=\"detalleVirrey\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Los Virreyes: Gobierno en la Distancia<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"detalle-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcca Cifras Hist\u00f3ricas<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>63 virreyes en 286 a\u00f1os, promedio: 4.5 a\u00f1os en el cargo<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Primer virrey: Antonio de Mendoza (1535-1550)<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\u2696\ufe0f Funciones Clave<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Gobernador, capit\u00e1n general, vicepatrono real, superintendente<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Poder casi absoluto pero limitado por audiencias<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"detalle-columna\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcb0 Intereses en Conflicto<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Balance entre corona (impuestos), colonos (riqueza), Iglesia (almas)<\/p>\r\n                            <div class=\"dato\">Juicio de residencia al finalizar mandato<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- SISTEMA ECON\u00d3MICO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Econom\u00eda Colonial: Extracci\u00f3n y Explotaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"sistemas-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"sistema-card\" data-sistema=\"encomienda\">\r\n                    <div class=\"sistema-icon\">\u26d3\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>ENCOMIENDA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"sistema-desc\">\r\n                        \"Encomendar\" ind\u00edgenas a espa\u00f1oles para trabajo y evangelizaci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"sistema-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Derecho:<\/strong> Tributo ind\u00edgena + trabajo<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Obligaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Protecci\u00f3n + evangelizaci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Realidad:<\/strong> Explotaci\u00f3n y abusos<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"sistema-card\" data-sistema=\"mineria\">\r\n                    <div class=\"sistema-icon\">\u26cf\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>MINER\u00cdA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"sistema-desc\">\r\n                        Principal fuente de riqueza, 80% plata mundial del siglo XVIII\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"sistema-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Principales:<\/strong> Zacatecas, Guanajuato<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>T\u00e9cnica:<\/strong> Patio (amalgama mercurio)<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Quinto real:<\/strong> 20% para la corona<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"sistema-card\" data-sistema=\"hacienda\">\r\n                    <div class=\"sistema-icon\">\ud83c\udf3e<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>HACIENDAS<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"sistema-desc\">\r\n                        Latifundios para agricultura, ganader\u00eda y producci\u00f3n local\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"sistema-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Productos:<\/strong> Trigo, ma\u00edz, ganado<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Sistema:<\/strong> Peonaje por deudas<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Legado:<\/strong> Desigualdad agraria<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"sistema-card\" data-sistema=\"comercio\">\r\n                    <div class=\"sistema-icon\">\ud83d\udea2<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>COMERCIO<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"sistema-desc\">\r\n                        Monopolio espa\u00f1ol mediante flotas y puertos \u00fanicos\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"sistema-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Exportaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Plata, cochinilla, cacao<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Importaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Manufacturas europeas<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ruta:<\/strong> Veracruz-Sevilla\/C\u00e1diz<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- DATOS ECON\u00d3MICOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"datos-economicos\">\r\n                <h4>\ud83d\udcca IMPACTO ECON\u00d3MICO EN CIFRAS<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"datos-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-valor\">80%<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-label\">Plata mundial siglo XVIII<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-valor\">48M<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-label\">Pesos oro (remesas 1521-1821)<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-valor\">20%<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-label\">Quinto real (impuesto minero)<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"dato-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-valor\">90%<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato-label\">Mortalidad ind\u00edgena siglo XVI<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- SISTEMA DE CASTAS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Sociedad Colonial: La Pir\u00e1mide de las Castas<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"piramide-container\">\r\n                <div class=\"piramide-niveles\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-casta\" data-casta=\"espanoles\">\r\n                        <div class=\"casta-header\">\r\n                            <h5>ESPA\u00d1OLES PENINSULARES<\/h5>\r\n                            <div class=\"casta-porcentaje\">0.2%<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"casta-desc\">Nacidos en Espa\u00f1a, monopolio cargos altos<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"casta-derechos\">Todos los derechos pol\u00edticos<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-casta\" data-casta=\"criollos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"casta-header\">\r\n                            <h5>CRIOLLOS<\/h5>\r\n                            <div class=\"casta-porcentaje\">22.8%<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"casta-desc\">Hijos de espa\u00f1oles nacidos en Am\u00e9rica<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"casta-derechos\">Riqueza pero no poder pol\u00edtico<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-casta\" data-casta=\"mestizos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"casta-header\">\r\n                            <h5>MESTIZOS<\/h5>\r\n                            <div class=\"casta-porcentaje\">7.3%<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"casta-desc\">Mezcla espa\u00f1ol-ind\u00edgena, artesanos, peque\u00f1os comerciantes<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"casta-derechos\">Derechos limitados, no pagaban tributo<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-casta\" data-casta=\"indigenas\">\r\n                        <div class=\"casta-header\">\r\n                            <h5>IND\u00cdGENAS<\/h5>\r\n                            <div class=\"casta-porcentaje\">60%<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"casta-desc\">Poblaci\u00f3n originaria, mano de obra forzada<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"casta-derechos\">\"Protegidos\" pero explotados, pagaban tributo<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"nivel-casta\" data-casta=\"negros\">\r\n                        <div class=\"casta-header\">\r\n                            <h5>AFROMESTIZOS\/NEGROS<\/h5>\r\n                            <div class=\"casta-porcentaje\">9.7%<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"casta-desc\">Esclavos africanos y sus descendientes<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"casta-derechos\">Esclavitud, trabajos m\u00e1s duros<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"castas-info\">\r\n                    <p><strong>\ud83d\udca1 Clasificaci\u00f3n de castas compleja:<\/strong> Mulatos (espa\u00f1ol+negro), Zambos (ind\u00edgena+negro), Castizos, Moriscos, etc.<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>\ud83d\udcdc Sistema de \"pureza de sangre\":<\/strong> Determinaba derechos y acceso a cargos<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- CONTROL ECLESI\u00c1STICO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>5. Iglesia Colonial: Evangelizaci\u00f3n y Poder<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"iglesia-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"iglesia-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"iglesia-icon\">\u26ea<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>EVANGELIZACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"iglesia-desc\">\r\n                        Conversi\u00f3n masiva mediante reducciones, colegios y teatro evangelizador\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"iglesia-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>\u00d3rdenes:<\/strong> Franciscanos, Dominicos, Jesuitas<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>M\u00e9todos:<\/strong> Lenguas ind\u00edgenas, sincretismo<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Logro:<\/strong> 9 millones bautizados 1524-1572<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"iglesia-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"iglesia-icon\">\ud83d\udd25<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>INQUISICI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"iglesia-desc\">\r\n                        Tribunal del Santo Oficio (1571-1820): control ideol\u00f3gico y moral\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"iglesia-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Delitos:<\/strong> Herej\u00eda, brujer\u00eda, bigamia<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Procesos:<\/strong> 3,000 en Nueva Espa\u00f1a<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ejecuciones:<\/strong> 50 autos de fe p\u00fablicos<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"iglesia-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"iglesia-icon\">\ud83d\udc92<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>PATRIMONIO<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"iglesia-desc\">\r\n                        Mayor terrateniente: 50% tierras, diezmo, capellan\u00edas, obras p\u00edas\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"iglesia-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Ingresos:<\/strong> Diezmo (10% producci\u00f3n)<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Bienes:<\/strong> Conventos, colegios, hospitales<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Poder:<\/strong> Banco, educaci\u00f3n, salud<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"iglesia-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"iglesia-icon\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>VICEPATRONATO<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"iglesia-desc\">\r\n                        Control real sobre Iglesia: nombramiento obispos, administraci\u00f3n diezmo\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"iglesia-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Derecho:<\/strong> Patronato regio (1508)<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Poder:<\/strong> Rey nombraba autoridades<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Control:<\/strong> Estado sobre Iglesia<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO: ESTRUCTURA DE PODER -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> SIMULADOR: JERARQU\u00cdA COLONIAL INTERACTIVA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"jerarquia-colonial\">\r\n            <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>EXPLORADOR DE PODER<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"poderSelect\">Nivel de Poder:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"poderSelect\" class=\"control-select\" onchange=\"cambiarNivelPoder()\">\r\n                        <option value=\"rey\">Rey (Espa\u00f1a)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"virrey\">Virrey (M\u00e9xico)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"audiencia\">Audiencia<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"encomendero\">Encomendero<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"iglesia\">Iglesia<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"cabildo\">Cabildo<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"periodoSelect\">Periodo Hist\u00f3rico:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"periodoSelect\" class=\"control-select\" onchange=\"cambiarPeriodo()\">\r\n                        <option value=\"sigloXVI\">Siglo XVI (Conquista)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"sigloXVII\">Siglo XVII (Consolidaci\u00f3n)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"sigloXVIII\">Siglo XVIII (Reformas Borb\u00f3nicas)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"sigloXIX\">Siglo XIX (Crisis final)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label>Recursos de Poder:<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"checkbox-group\">\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"recursos\" value=\"legitimidad\" checked> Legitimidad<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"recursos\" value=\"economico\"> Poder econ\u00f3mico<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"recursos\" value=\"militar\"> Fuerza militar<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"recursos\" value=\"ideologico\"> Control ideol\u00f3gico<\/label>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-comparar\" onclick=\"compararPoderes()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/span> COMPARAR PODERES\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-timeline\" onclick=\"mostrarLineaVirreyes()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udcc5<\/span> L\u00cdNEA DE VIRREYES\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DE JERARQU\u00cdA -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacionJerarquia\">\r\n                <div class=\"jerarquia-container\">\r\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 500\" id=\"svgJerarquia\">\r\n                        <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"500\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\" id=\"fondoJerarquia\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Pir\u00e1mide de poder -->\r\n                        <polygon points=\"300,50 100,200 500,200\" fill=\"rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.1)\" stroke=\"#FFC107\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        <polygon points=\"150,220 450,220 300,350\" fill=\"rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.1)\" stroke=\"#2196F3\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        <polygon points=\"200,370 400,370 300,450\" fill=\"rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.1)\" stroke=\"#4CAF50\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Nivel 1: Rey -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoRey\" class=\"nodo-poder\" data-poder=\"rey\">\r\n                            <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"80\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#FFC107\" opacity=\"0.8\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"80\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">REY<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#FFECB3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\">Espa\u00f1a<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Nivel 2: Virrey -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoVirrey\" class=\"nodo-poder\" data-poder=\"virrey\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"275\" y=\"180\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#2196F3\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"200\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\">VIRREY<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"300\" y=\"215\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"7\">Nueva Espa\u00f1a<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Nivel 3: Instituciones -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoAudiencia\" class=\"nodo-poder\" data-poder=\"audiencia\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"180\" y=\"250\" width=\"80\" height=\"35\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" opacity=\"0.6\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"220\" y=\"270\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\">AUDIENCIA<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <g id=\"nodoIglesia\" class=\"nodo-poder\" data-poder=\"iglesia\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"340\" y=\"250\" width=\"80\" height=\"35\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#9C27B0\" opacity=\"0.6\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"380\" y=\"270\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\">IGLESIA<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Nivel 4: Base -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoEncomienda\" class=\"nodo-poder\" data-poder=\"encomendero\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"120\" y=\"330\" width=\"90\" height=\"35\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#FF9800\" opacity=\"0.6\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"165\" y=\"350\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\">ENCOMIENDA<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <g id=\"nodoMineria\" class=\"nodo-poder\" data-poder=\"mineria\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"240\" y=\"330\" width=\"70\" height=\"35\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#795548\" opacity=\"0.6\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"275\" y=\"350\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\">MINER\u00cdA<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <g id=\"nodoCabildo\" class=\"nodo-poder\" data-poder=\"cabildo\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"340\" y=\"330\" width=\"70\" height=\"35\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#607D8B\" opacity=\"0.6\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"375\" y=\"350\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\">CABILDO<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Base: Sociedad -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"100\" y=\"400\" width=\"400\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)\" stroke=\"#9E9E9E\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"300\" y=\"420\" fill=\"#BDBDBD\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\">SOCIEDAD COLONIAL: Castas y Trabajadores<\/text>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Conexiones -->\r\n                        <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#FFC107\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\"\/>\r\n                        <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#2196F3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"\/>\r\n                        <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#2196F3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"\/>\r\n                        <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"285\" x2=\"165\" y2=\"330\" stroke=\"#4CAF50\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>\r\n                        <line x1=\"380\" y1=\"285\" x2=\"375\" y2=\"330\" stroke=\"#9C27B0\" stroke-width=\"1\"\/>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Nodo destacado -->\r\n                        <g id=\"nodoDestacado\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                            <circle id=\"glowCircle\" r=\"35\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFF00\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\">\r\n                                <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0.5;0.2;0.5\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"\/>\r\n                            <\/circle>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n                    <\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"jerarquia-info\" id=\"infoJerarquia\">\r\n                    Selecciona un nivel de poder para explorar sus caracter\u00edsticas\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>DATOS DE PODER COLONIAL<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Nivel seleccionado:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataNivel\">Rey<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Poder formal:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPoderFormal\">Absoluto<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Poder real:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPoderReal\">Limitado por distancia<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">RECURSOS PRINCIPALES:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataRecursos\">Legitimidad divina<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Limitaciones:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataLimitaciones\">Distancia, informaci\u00f3n tard\u00eda<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Ejemplo hist\u00f3rico:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataEjemplo\">Carlos V<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcca ESTAD\u00cdSTICAS VIRREINALES<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Duraci\u00f3n virreinato:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">300 a\u00f1os<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Total virreyes:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">63<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Plata exportada:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">48M pesos oro<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Poblaci\u00f3n 1810:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">6M habitantes<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: CONOCIMIENTO COLONIAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l era la principal funci\u00f3n econ\u00f3mica del Virreinato para Espa\u00f1a?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Producir alimentos para la pen\u00ednsula\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Extraer metales preciosos (plata y oro)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Desarrollar industria manufacturera\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Crear centros de investigaci\u00f3n cient\u00edfica\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> La miner\u00eda de plata fue el motor econ\u00f3mico colonial.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> La Nueva Espa\u00f1a era principalmente extractiva, no industrial.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El 80% de la plata mundial del siglo XVIII proven\u00eda de Nueva Espa\u00f1a. El \"quinto real\" (20% impuesto) financi\u00f3 el imperio espa\u00f1ol. Zacatecas y Guanajuato eran los principales centros mineros.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 diferencia clave exist\u00eda entre peninsulares y criollos?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Los criollos no pod\u00edan tener propiedades\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Los peninsulares no pod\u00edan participar en comercio\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Los peninsulares monopolizaban los altos cargos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Los criollos no pod\u00edan recibir educaci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Los peninsulares (0.2% poblaci\u00f3n) controlaban los cargos m\u00e1s importantes.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Los criollos (22.8%) pod\u00edan tener propiedades y comerciar, pero no gobernar.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Dato:<\/strong> Esta discriminaci\u00f3n pol\u00edtica hacia los criollos (nacidos en Am\u00e9rica de padres espa\u00f1oles) fue una causa importante del movimiento de independencia. Los \"gachupines\" manten\u00edan el control administrativo.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 instituci\u00f3n limitaba el poder del virrey y pod\u00eda juzgarlo?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Los cabildos municipales\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Los encomenderos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Las \u00f3rdenes religiosas\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Las audiencias\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Las audiencias funcionaban como contrapeso al poder virreinal.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Otras instituciones ten\u00edan poder, pero las audiencias ten\u00edan autoridad judicial sobre el virrey.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La Audiencia de M\u00e9xico (1527) y luego la de Guadalajara (1548) pod\u00edan enviar informes directos al rey, asesorar al virrey y realizar el \"juicio de residencia\" al final de su mandato.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> AN\u00c1LISIS HIST\u00d3RICO COLONIAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>An\u00e1lisis del Sistema de Encomienda<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Analiza el sistema de encomienda respondiendo:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>\u00bfCu\u00e1l era su justificaci\u00f3n legal y religiosa?<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 derechos y obligaciones te\u00f3ricas ten\u00eda el encomendero?<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u00bfC\u00f3mo funcionaba en la pr\u00e1ctica y qu\u00e9 abusos se comet\u00edan?<\/li>\r\n                        <li>\u00bfQu\u00e9 medidas intent\u00f3 tomar la corona para limitar estos abusos?<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"tabla-analisis\">\r\n                        <table>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <th>Aspecto<\/th>\r\n                                <th>Teor\u00eda (legal)<\/th>\r\n                                <th>Pr\u00e1ctica (realidad)<\/th>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td><strong>Derechos encomendero<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Seg\u00fan las leyes...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"En la realidad...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td><strong>Obligaciones ind\u00edgenas<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Seg\u00fan las leyes...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"En la realidad...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td><strong>Protecci\u00f3n y evangelizaci\u00f3n<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Seg\u00fan las leyes...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"En la realidad...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                        <\/table>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR AN\u00c1LISIS<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>An\u00e1lisis sugerido:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    1. <strong>Justificaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Derecho de conquista + obligaci\u00f3n evangelizadora (Requerimiento 1513)<br>\r\n                    2. <strong>Derechos te\u00f3ricos:<\/strong> Tributo ind\u00edgena + trabajo moderado<br>\r\n                    3. <strong>Obligaciones te\u00f3ricas:<\/strong> Protecci\u00f3n militar + evangelizaci\u00f3n<br>\r\n                    4. <strong>Realidad:<\/strong> Trabajo forzado, abusos, enfermedades, alta mortalidad<br>\r\n                    5. <strong>Medidas corona:<\/strong> Leyes Nuevas (1542), visitas, juicios de residencia<br><br>\r\n                    <strong>Contradicci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Intereses econ\u00f3micos vs. protecci\u00f3n ind\u00edgena\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Comparativa: Poder Civil vs. Poder Eclesi\u00e1stico<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Compara el poder de las instituciones civiles y eclesi\u00e1sticas en la Nueva Espa\u00f1a:<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"comparativa-doble\">\r\n                        <div class=\"columna\">\r\n                            <h4>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f PODER CIVIL (Virrey\/Audiencias)<\/h4>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Fuentes de legitimidad:<\/li>\r\n                                <textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                                <li>Recursos econ\u00f3micos:<\/li>\r\n                                <textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                                <li>Instrumentos de control:<\/li>\r\n                                <textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                                <li>Limitaciones:<\/li>\r\n                                <textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                            <\/ul>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"columna\">\r\n                            <h4>\u26ea PODER ECLESI\u00c1STICO (Iglesia)<\/h4>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Fuentes de legitimidad:<\/li>\r\n                                <textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                                <li>Recursos econ\u00f3micos:<\/li>\r\n                                <textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                                <li>Instrumentos de control:<\/li>\r\n                                <textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                                <li>Limitaciones:<\/li>\r\n                                <textarea placeholder=\"Describe...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                            <\/ul>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <p><strong>Pregunta cr\u00edtica:<\/strong> \u00bfQu\u00e9 instituci\u00f3n ten\u00eda mayor poder real en la vida cotidiana de los habitantes y por qu\u00e9?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu an\u00e1lisis comparativo...\" rows=\"4\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR COMPARATIVA<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Comparativa sugerida:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    <strong>Poder Civil:<\/strong> Legitimidad real, impuestos, ej\u00e9rcito, burocracia. Limitaciones: distancia, corrupci\u00f3n.<br>\r\n                    <strong>Poder Eclesi\u00e1stico:<\/strong> Legitimidad divina, diezmo, Inquisici\u00f3n, educaci\u00f3n, sacramentos. Limitaciones: vicepatronato real.<br><br>\r\n                    <strong>An\u00e1lisis:<\/strong> La Iglesia ten\u00eda mayor penetraci\u00f3n social (bautizos, matrimonios, educaci\u00f3n, muerte). Controlaba la moral y creencias. El vicepatronato daba al rey control sobre nombramientos, pero la Iglesia manten\u00eda influencia cotidiana.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Comprensi\u00f3n estructural<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Explica claramente jerarqu\u00eda y relaciones de poder<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Describe mayor\u00eda de instituciones correctamente<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Confunde instituciones y sus funciones<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis cr\u00edtico<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Compara teor\u00eda vs. pr\u00e1ctica, identifica contradicciones<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Menciona algunas diferencias teor\u00eda\/pr\u00e1ctica<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No distingue entre discurso oficial y realidad<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Conexi\u00f3n hist\u00f3rica<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Relaciona estructuras coloniales con M\u00e9xico actual<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Menciona algunos legados coloniales<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No establece conexiones con el presente<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> REFLEXI\u00d3N SOBRE EL LEGADO COLONIAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N DE CONOCIMIENTOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Entendimiento estructura de poder:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>An\u00e1lisis sistema econ\u00f3mico:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n sistema de castas:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfQu\u00e9 elementos del sistema colonial consideras que siguen influyendo en la sociedad mexicana actual?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo explicas la contradicci\u00f3n entre el discurso evangelizador\/protector y la realidad de explotaci\u00f3n?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu an\u00e1lisis...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd04 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Memorizar estructura jer\u00e1rquica colonial<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Recordar diferencias entre sistemas econ\u00f3micos<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Identificar los 5 niveles del sistema de castas<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcaa PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Explorar simulador de jerarqu\u00eda de poder<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Completar el quiz de autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Analizar tabla teor\u00eda vs. pr\u00e1ctica en encomienda<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\ude80 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Investigar un virrey espec\u00edfico y sus pol\u00edticas<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Analizar documentos de la Inquisici\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Estudiar continuidades coloniales en M\u00e9xico actual<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cervantesvirtual.com\/portales\/nueva_espana\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcdc Biblioteca Virtual Cervantes: Nueva Espa\u00f1a\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.inah.gob.mx\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f INAH: Archivo General de la Naci\u00f3n\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/mediateca.inah.gob.mx\/repositorio\/islandora\/object\/coleccion%3A70\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Mediateca INAH: Im\u00e1genes coloniales\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.historicas.unam.mx\/publicaciones\/publicadigital\/libros\/ virreinato.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcda UNAM: Estudios sobre el virreinato\r\n                <\/a>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n    <script>\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SIMULADOR DE JERARQU\u00cdA COLONIAL\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    const datosPoder = {\r\n        rey: {\r\n            nombre: \"Rey de Espa\u00f1a\",\r\n            poderFormal: \"Absoluto (monarqu\u00eda absoluta)\",\r\n            poderReal: \"Limitado por distancia (6 meses comunicaci\u00f3n)\",\r\n            recursos: \"Legitimidad divina, ej\u00e9rcito, legislaci\u00f3n\",\r\n            limitaciones: \"Informaci\u00f3n tard\u00eda, dependencia de funcionarios\",\r\n            ejemplo: \"Felipe II (1556-1598)\",\r\n            color: \"#FFC107\"\r\n        },\r\n        virrey: {\r\n            nombre: \"Virrey\",\r\n            poderFormal: \"Vicepatrono real, gobierno pleno\",\r\n            poderReal: \"Autonom\u00eda limitada por audiencias\",\r\n            recursos: \"Ej\u00e9rcito colonial, administraci\u00f3n, justicia\",\r\n            limitaciones: \"Juicio de residencia, informes a audiencia\",\r\n            ejemplo: \"Antonio de Mendoza (1535-1550)\",\r\n            color: \"#2196F3\"\r\n        },\r\n        audiencia: {\r\n            nombre: \"Audiencia\",\r\n            poderFormal: \"Tribunal supremo, asesor\u00eda\",\r\n            poderReal: \"Contrapeso al virrey, informes directos al rey\",\r\n            recursos: \"Autoridad judicial, revisi\u00f3n de cuentas\",\r\n            limitaciones: \"Conflictos con virrey, corrupci\u00f3n\",\r\n            ejemplo: \"Audiencia de M\u00e9xico (1527)\",\r\n            color: \"#4CAF50\"\r\n        },\r\n        encomendero: {\r\n            nombre: \"Encomendero\",\r\n            poderFormal: \"Derecho a tributo ind\u00edgena\",\r\n            poderReal: \"Poder local casi feudal\",\r\n            recursos: \"Mano de obra ind\u00edgena, producci\u00f3n agr\u00edcola\",\r\n            limitaciones: \"Leyes Nuevas (1542), visitas reales\",\r\n            ejemplo: \"Hern\u00e1n Cort\u00e9s (Marqu\u00e9s del Valle)\",\r\n            color: \"#FF9800\"\r\n        },\r\n        iglesia: {\r\n            nombre: \"Iglesia\",\r\n            poderFormal: \"Evangelizaci\u00f3n, sacramentos\",\r\n            poderReal: \"Control ideol\u00f3gico, educaci\u00f3n, salud\",\r\n            recursos: \"Diezmo, propiedades, Inquisici\u00f3n\",\r\n            limitaciones: \"Vicepatronato real, conflictos con autoridades\",\r\n            ejemplo: \"Arzobispo-virrey (Juan de Palafox)\",\r\n            color: \"#9C27B0\"\r\n        },\r\n        cabildo: {\r\n            nombre: \"Cabildo Municipal\",\r\n            poderFormal: \"Gobierno local, obras p\u00fablicas\",\r\n            poderReal: \"Poder urbano, representaci\u00f3n criolla\",\r\n            recursos: \"Impuestos locales, reglamentos municipales\",\r\n            limitaciones: \"Control virreinal, recursos limitados\",\r\n            ejemplo: \"Cabildo de la Ciudad de M\u00e9xico\",\r\n            color: \"#607D8B\"\r\n        },\r\n        mineria: {\r\n            nombre: \"Miner\u00eda\",\r\n            poderFormal: \"Extracci\u00f3n de plata (quinto real)\",\r\n            poderReal: \"Poder econ\u00f3mico, influencia pol\u00edtica\",\r\n            recursos: \"Riqueza, empleo, desarrollo regional\",\r\n            limitaciones: \"Tecnolog\u00eda, mano de obra, precios\",\r\n            ejemplo: \"Minas de Zacatecas (1548)\",\r\n            color: \"#795548\"\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    function cambiarNivelPoder() {\r\n        const nivel = document.getElementById('poderSelect').value;\r\n        const data = datosPoder[nivel];\r\n        \r\n        if (!data) return;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos en tiempo real\r\n        document.getElementById('dataNivel').textContent = data.nombre;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataPoderFormal').textContent = data.poderFormal;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataPoderReal').textContent = data.poderReal;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataRecursos').textContent = data.recursos;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataLimitaciones').textContent = data.limitaciones;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataEjemplo').textContent = data.ejemplo;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Resaltar nodo en SVG\r\n        resaltarNodoJerarquia(nivel, data.color);\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar informaci\u00f3n\r\n        const infoTextos = {\r\n            rey: \"\ud83d\udc51 REY: Autoridad suprema desde Espa\u00f1a. Poder te\u00f3ricamente absoluto pero limitado por la distancia (6 meses para recibir \u00f3rdenes). Controlaba mediante c\u00e9dulas reales y el Consejo de Indias.\",\r\n            virrey: \"\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f VIRREY: Representante directo del rey en Nueva Espa\u00f1a. Gobierno, justicia, guerra. 63 virreyes en 300 a\u00f1os. Juicio de residencia al finalizar mandato.\",\r\n            audiencia: \"\u2696\ufe0f AUDIENCIA: Tribunal supremo y consejo. Contrapeso al poder virreinal. Pod\u00eda enviar informes directos al rey. Ejemplo: Audiencia de M\u00e9xico (1527).\",\r\n            encomendero: \"\u26d3\ufe0f ENCOMENDERO: Sistema de explotaci\u00f3n ind\u00edgena. Derecho a tributo y trabajo a cambio de protecci\u00f3n y evangelizaci\u00f3n. Abusos generalizados.\",\r\n            iglesia: \"\u26ea IGLESIA: Poder ideol\u00f3gico y econ\u00f3mico. Controlaba educaci\u00f3n, salud, moral. Mayor terrateniente. Inquisici\u00f3n (1571-1820) para control religioso.\",\r\n            cabildo: \"\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f CABILDO: Gobierno municipal. Espacio de poder criollo. Administraci\u00f3n local, obras p\u00fablicas. Semilla del gobierno representativo.\",\r\n            mineria: \"\u26cf\ufe0f MINER\u00cdA: Motor econ\u00f3mico colonial. 80% plata mundial siglo XVIII. Quinto real (20% para corona). Zacatecas, Guanajuato principales centros.\"\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoJerarquia').textContent = infoTextos[nivel] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\";\r\n        document.getElementById('infoJerarquia').style.animation = \"highlight 0.5s\";\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Nivel de poder seleccionado: ${data.nombre}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function resaltarNodoJerarquia(nivel, color) {\r\n        const nodoDestacado = document.getElementById('nodoDestacado');\r\n        const nodo = document.getElementById(`nodo${nivel.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + nivel.slice(1)}`);\r\n        \r\n        if (!nodo) return;\r\n        \r\n        const bbox = nodo.getBBox();\r\n        const circle = document.getElementById('glowCircle');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Posicionar c\u00edrculo de resaltado\r\n        circle.setAttribute('cx', bbox.x + bbox.width\/2);\r\n        circle.setAttribute('cy', bbox.y + bbox.height\/2);\r\n        circle.setAttribute('stroke', color);\r\n        \r\n        nodoDestacado.setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Animar todos los nodos\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.nodo-poder').forEach(n => {\r\n            n.setAttribute('opacity', '0.4');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        nodo.setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n        nodo.setAttribute('filter', 'url(#glowFilter)');\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function compararPoderes() {\r\n        const checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"recursos\"]:checked');\r\n        const recursos = Array.from(checkboxes).map(cb => cb.value);\r\n        \r\n        let comparativa = \"\ud83d\udd0d COMPARATIVA DE RECURSOS DE PODER:\\n\\n\";\r\n        \r\n        if (recursos.includes('legitimidad')) {\r\n            comparativa += \"\ud83d\udc51 Legitimidad: Rey (divina) > Iglesia (religiosa) > Virrey (delegada)\\n\";\r\n        }\r\n        if (recursos.includes('economico')) {\r\n            comparativa += \"\ud83d\udcb0 Econ\u00f3mico: Miner\u00eda > Iglesia > Encomienda > Haciendas\\n\";\r\n        }\r\n        if (recursos.includes('militar')) {\r\n            comparativa += \"\u2694\ufe0f Militar: Virrey > Rey (distante) > Encomenderos (local)\\n\";\r\n        }\r\n        if (recursos.includes('ideologico')) {\r\n            comparativa += \"\ud83e\udde0 Ideol\u00f3gico: Iglesia > Rey > Audiencia (justicia)\\n\";\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        comparativa += \"\\n\ud83d\udca1 El poder real depend\u00eda de alianzas y contextos espec\u00edficos.\";\r\n        \r\n        alert(comparativa);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarLineaVirreyes() {\r\n        const periodo = document.getElementById('periodoSelect').value;\r\n        let virreyes = \"\";\r\n        \r\n        const ejemplos = {\r\n            sigloXVI: \"Antonio de Mendoza (1535-1550), Luis de Velasco (1550-1564), Mart\u00edn Enr\u00edquez (1568-1580)\",\r\n            sigloXVII: \"Diego Fern\u00e1ndez de C\u00f3rdoba (1612-1621), Juan de Palafox (1642), Francisco Fern\u00e1ndez de la Cueva (1653-1660)\",\r\n            sigloXVIII: \"Juan de Acu\u00f1a (1722-1734), Antonio Mar\u00eda de Bucareli (1771-1779), Revillagigedo (1789-1794)\",\r\n            sigloXIX: \"F\u00e9lix Berenguer (1800-1803), Jos\u00e9 de Iturrigaray (1803-1808), Juan O'Donoj\u00fa (1821)\"\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        virreyes = `VIRREYES DESTACADOS (${periodo.replace('siglo', 'Siglo ').toUpperCase()}):\\n\\n${ejemplos[periodo]}`;\r\n        \r\n        alert(virreyes);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE DETALLES DE NIVELES\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarDetalleNivel(nivel) {\r\n        \/\/ Ocultar todos los detalles\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.detalle-nivel').forEach(detalle => {\r\n            detalle.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar el detalle seleccionado\r\n        const detalle = document.getElementById(`detalle${nivel.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + nivel.slice(1)}`);\r\n        if (detalle) {\r\n            detalle.style.display = 'block';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar informaci\u00f3n de la tabla\r\n        const infoTextos = {\r\n            rey: \"\ud83d\udc51 REY: M\u00e1xima autoridad. Gobernaba mediante c\u00e9dulas reales. Consejo de Indias (1524) supervisaba colonias. Legislaci\u00f3n: Leyes de Indias (1680) con 6,400 leyes.\",\r\n            virrey: \"\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f VIRREY: Poder ejecutivo, judicial y militar. 63 en total. Promedio: 4.5 a\u00f1os. Juicio de residencia obligatorio. Funciones: gobierno, justicia, guerra, hacienda.\",\r\n            audiencia: \"\u2696\ufe0f AUDIENCIA: Tribunal y consejo. Control judicial, asesor\u00eda al virrey. Pod\u00eda enviar informes secretos al rey. Juicio de residencia a virreyes.\",\r\n            cabildo: \"\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f CABILDO: Gobierno municipal. Regidores y alcaldes. Representaci\u00f3n local, obras p\u00fablicas, administraci\u00f3n diaria. Espacio de poder criollo.\"\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoNivel').textContent = infoTextos[nivel] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\";\r\n        document.getElementById('infoNivel').style.animation = \"highlight 0.5s\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(tr => {\r\n            tr.classList.remove('selected');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Marcar fila seleccionada\r\n        document.querySelector(`[data-nivel=\"${nivel}\"]`).classList.add('selected');\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    let quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n    \r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n            \r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            verificarCompletadoQuiz();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    function verificarCompletadoQuiz() {\r\n        const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n        const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q => \r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n        \r\n        if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n        const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n        \r\n        let feedback = \"\";\r\n        if (porcentaje >= 80) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas la estructura colonial.\";\r\n        } else if (porcentaje >= 60) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero revisa las diferencias entre instituciones.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas repasar la organizaci\u00f3n del virreinato.\";\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        quizRespuestas = [];\r\n        quizCompletado = false;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n        const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n        const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n        \r\n        const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n        \r\n        alert(`\ud83d\udcca AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Estructura de poder: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Sistema econ\u00f3mico: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Sistema de castas: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Revisa el plan de estudio recomendado seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcbe AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada: ${slider1}, ${slider2}, ${slider3}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Sistema Cyberpunk Colonial inicializado\");\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\udcda Lecci\u00f3n: Virreinato de Nueva Espa\u00f1a\");\r\n    console.log(\"\u26a1 Simulador de jerarqu\u00eda, Quiz y Herramientas listas\");\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar simulador\r\n    cambiarNivelPoder();\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Tabla interactiva\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(row => {\r\n        row.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const nivel = this.dataset.nivel;\r\n            mostrarDetalleNivel(nivel);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Sistemas econ\u00f3micos interactivos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.sistema-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const sistema = this.dataset.sistema;\r\n            \r\n            const sistemasInfo = {\r\n                encomienda: \"ENCOMIENDA: Sistema de explotaci\u00f3n ind\u00edgena (1521-1720). 'Encomendar' ind\u00edgenas a espa\u00f1oles para trabajo y evangelizaci\u00f3n. En teor\u00eda: protecci\u00f3n a cambio de tributo. En pr\u00e1ctica: trabajo forzado, abusos. Regulada por Leyes Nuevas (1542).\",\r\n                mineria: \"MINER\u00cdA: Principal actividad econ\u00f3mica. M\u00e9todo del patio (amalgama con mercurio). Quinto real: 20% para corona. Zacatecas (1548), Guanajuato, Pachuca. 80% plata mundial siglo XVIII.\",\r\n                hacienda: \"HACIENDAS: Latifundios para agricultura y ganader\u00eda. Sistema de peonaje por deudas. Autosuficientes: produc\u00edan alimentos, textiles, herramientas. Base de desigualdad agraria moderna.\",\r\n                comercio: \"COMERCIO: Monopolio espa\u00f1ol. Flotas anuales Veracruz-Sevilla. Exportaci\u00f3n: plata, cochinilla, cacao. Importaci\u00f3n: manufacturas. Contrabando com\u00fan. Reformas borb\u00f3nicas liberalizaron parcialmente.\"\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            alert(`\ud83d\udcb0 ${this.querySelector('h4').textContent}\\n\\n${sistemasInfo[sistema] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\"}`);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Piramide de castas interactiva\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.nivel-casta').forEach(nivel => {\r\n        nivel.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const casta = this.dataset.casta;\r\n            \r\n            const castasInfo = {\r\n                espanoles: \"ESPA\u00d1OLES PENINSULARES (0.2%): Nacidos en Espa\u00f1a. Monopolio cargos altos: virrey, obispos, audiencias. 'Gachupines'. Todos derechos pol\u00edticos.\",\r\n                criollos: \"CRIOLLOS (22.8%): Hijos de espa\u00f1oles nacidos en Am\u00e9rica. Riqueza (haciendas, minas) pero no poder pol\u00edtico. Resentimiento hacia peninsulares \u2192 independencia.\",\r\n                mestizos: \"MESTIZOS (7.3%): Mezcla espa\u00f1ol-ind\u00edgena. Artesanos, peque\u00f1os comerciantes. No pagaban tributo pero derechos limitados. Creciente poblaci\u00f3n.\",\r\n                indigenas: \"IND\u00cdGENAS (60%): Poblaci\u00f3n originaria. Tributo obligatorio. Trabajo forzado en minas\/encomiendas. 'Protegidos' por ley pero explotados. Alta mortalidad.\",\r\n                negros: \"AFROMESTIZOS\/NEGROS (9.7%): Esclavos africanos y descendientes. Trabajos m\u00e1s duros: minas, plantaciones. Sistema de castas complejo: mulatos, zambos.\"\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            this.style.animation = \"highlight 1s\";\r\n            setTimeout(() => {\r\n                this.style.animation = \"\";\r\n            }, 1000);\r\n            \r\n            console.log(`\ud83d\udc65 Casta seleccionada: ${casta.toUpperCase()}`);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Objetivos interactivos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n            this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n            const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n            checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n            checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : '';\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Problemas de examen\r\n    function verificarProblema(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Agregar filtro glow al SVG\r\n    const svg = document.getElementById('svgJerarquia');\r\n    const defs = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'defs');\r\n    const filter = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'filter');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('id', 'glowFilter');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('x', '-50%');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('y', '-50%');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('width', '200%');\r\n    filter.setAttribute('height', '200%');\r\n    \r\n    const feGaussianBlur = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feGaussianBlur');\r\n    feGaussianBlur.setAttribute('stdDeviation', '3.5');\r\n    feGaussianBlur.setAttribute('result', 'coloredBlur');\r\n    \r\n    const feMerge = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMerge');\r\n    const feMergeNode1 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMergeNode');\r\n    feMergeNode1.setAttribute('in', 'coloredBlur');\r\n    const feMergeNode2 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'feMergeNode');\r\n    feMergeNode2.setAttribute('in', 'SourceGraphic');\r\n    \r\n    feMerge.appendChild(feMergeNode1);\r\n    feMerge.appendChild(feMergeNode2);\r\n    filter.appendChild(feGaussianBlur);\r\n    filter.appendChild(feMerge);\r\n    defs.appendChild(filter);\r\n    svg.appendChild(defs);\r\n    <\/script>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Representante del rey","respuesta":"Virrey"},{"enunciado":"Sistema de trabajo ind\u00edgena","respuesta":"Encomienda"},{"enunciado":"Iglesia: funci\u00f3n principal","respuesta":"Evangelizaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Capital virreinal","respuesta":"Ciudad de M\u00e9xico"},{"enunciado":"Primer virrey","respuesta":"Antonio de Mendoza"},{"enunciado":"Producto clave","respuesta":"Plata"},{"enunciado":"Universidad fundada","respuesta":"1551 (Real y Pontificia)"},{"enunciado":"Nuevas Leyes","respuesta":"1542, protegen ind\u00edgenas"},{"enunciado":"Catedral iniciada","respuesta":"1573"},{"enunciado":"N\u00famero de virreyes","respuesta":"63"},{"enunciado":"Castas: grupo superior","respuesta":"Peninsulares"},{"enunciado":"SI: a\u00f1os virreinato","respuesta":"300"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Virrey era","opciones":["Representante del rey","Rey","Ind\u00edgena","Sacerdote"],"correcta":"Representante del rey"},{"pregunta":"Encomienda era","opciones":["Trabajo forzado","Escuela","Iglesia","Comercio"],"correcta":"Trabajo forzado"},{"pregunta":"Iglesia controlaba","opciones":["Educaci\u00f3n y evangelizaci\u00f3n","Ej\u00e9rcito","Minas","Nada"],"correcta":"Educaci\u00f3n y evangelizaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Capital","opciones":["Ciudad de M\u00e9xico","Madrid","Veracruz","Guadalajara"],"correcta":"Ciudad de M\u00e9xico"},{"pregunta":"Primer virrey","opciones":["Antonio de Mendoza","Cort\u00e9s","Hidalgo","Ju\u00e1rez"],"correcta":"Antonio de Mendoza"},{"pregunta":"Econom\u00eda principal","opciones":["Plata","Ma\u00edz","Petr\u00f3leo","Turismo"],"correcta":"Plata"},{"pregunta":"Universidad 1551","opciones":["Real y Pontificia","UNAM","Harvard","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Real y Pontificia"},{"pregunta":"Nuevas Leyes","opciones":["1542","1492","1821","1910"],"correcta":"1542"},{"pregunta":"Catedral terminada","opciones":["1813","1521","1821","1910"],"correcta":"1813"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: sitios coloniales","opciones":["1,200 INAH","100","10,000","0"],"correcta":"1,200 INAH"},{"pregunta":"Virreyes totales","opciones":["63","10","100","1"],"correcta":"63"},{"pregunta":"Palacio Nacional era","opciones":["Sede virreinal","Iglesia","Mercado","Prisi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Sede virreinal"},{"pregunta":"Encomenderos recib\u00edan","opciones":["Tributos ind\u00edgenas","Salario","Tierras","Nada"],"correcta":"Tributos ind\u00edgenas"},{"pregunta":"Hacienda produc\u00eda","opciones":["Trigo, ganado","Tecnolog\u00eda","Coches","Aviones"],"correcta":"Trigo, ganado"},{"pregunta":"Zacatecas famosa por","opciones":["Plata","Oro","Cobre","Petr\u00f3leo"],"correcta":"Plata"},{"pregunta":"Castas: abajo","opciones":["Ind\u00edgenas y negros","Criollos","Peninsulares","Mestizos"],"correcta":"Ind\u00edgenas y negros"},{"pregunta":"Inquisici\u00f3n lleg\u00f3","opciones":["1571","1521","1821","1910"],"correcta":"1571"},{"pregunta":"Virrey nombraba","opciones":["Por el rey","Por ind\u00edgenas","Por voto","Por Iglesia"],"correcta":"Por el rey"},{"pregunta":"Real Audiencia","opciones":["Control judicial","Ej\u00e9rcito","Comercio","Educaci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Control judicial"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: plata extra\u00edda","opciones":["~3,000 toneladas","100","1M","0"],"correcta":"~3,000 toneladas"},{"pregunta":"Mestizaje comenz\u00f3","opciones":["Siglo XVI","XVIII","XX","XXI"],"correcta":"Siglo XVI"},{"pregunta":"Barroco novohispano","opciones":["Arte colonial","Ind\u00edgena","Moderno","Abstracto"],"correcta":"Arte colonial"},{"pregunta":"Virrey m\u00e1s famoso","opciones":["Juan Vicente G\u00fc\u00e9mez","Mendoza","Cort\u00e9s","Hidalgo"],"correcta":"Juan Vicente G\u00fc\u00e9mez"},{"pregunta":"Poblaci\u00f3n 1800","opciones":["~6 millones","1M","20M","100K"],"correcta":"~6 millones"},{"pregunta":"Camino Real","opciones":["M\u00e9xico-Veracruz","Madrid","China","Europa"],"correcta":"M\u00e9xico-Veracruz"},{"pregunta":"Gale\u00f3n de Manila","opciones":["Comercio Asia","Guerra","Evangelizaci\u00f3n","Nada"],"correcta":"Comercio Asia"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: UNAM sucesora","opciones":["Real y Pontificia","Ninguna","Harvard","Oxford"],"correcta":"Real y Pontificia"},{"pregunta":"Virreinato termin\u00f3","opciones":["1821","1521","1910","1810"],"correcta":"1821"},{"pregunta":"Reforma Borb\u00f3nica","opciones":["Siglo XVIII","XVI","XIX","XX"],"correcta":"Siglo XVIII"},{"pregunta":"Virreinato fue","opciones":["300 a\u00f1os","100","50","500"],"correcta":"300 a\u00f1os"}]},{"materia":"Historia de M\u00e9xico","slug":"independencia-mexico-cyberpunk","titulo":"Independencia de M\u00e9xico: De Hidalgo a Iturbide (1810-1821)","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-historia-independencia\" data-tema=\"independencia-mexico\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f<\/span> INDEPENDENCIA CYBERPUNK\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            La lucha por la libertad: <strong>11 a\u00f1os, 4 etapas, 1 naci\u00f3n<\/strong>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE MISI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Identificar las 4 etapas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Iniciaci\u00f3n, organizaci\u00f3n, resistencia y consumaci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar causas y consecuencias<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Factores internos y externos del movimiento.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Simular el Plan de Iguala<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Usar el simulador de las Tres Garant\u00edas.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Reflexionar sobre el legado<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Impacto en la identidad nacional.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> CONTEXTO HIST\u00d3RICO (2025)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 215 A\u00f1os del Grito<\/h3>\r\n                <p>En 2025 se conmemoran <strong>215 a\u00f1os<\/strong> del inicio de la Independencia.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">16 de septiembre de 1810<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udca5 Impacto Demogr\u00e1fico<\/h3>\r\n                <p>La guerra caus\u00f3 <strong>600,000 muertos<\/strong> (10% de la poblaci\u00f3n).<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Crisis econ\u00f3mica post-independencia<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfad Representaciones Modernas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Pel\u00edculas como <strong>\"Hidalgo: La Mirada del \u00c1guila\"<\/strong> (1998).<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">+50 obras art\u00edsticas inspiradas<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdc<\/span> CRONOLOG\u00cdA DE LA INDEPENDENCIA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- ETAPAS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Las 4 Etapas (1810-1821)<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"etapas-timeline\">\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-card\" data-etapa=\"iniciacion\">\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"etapa-icon\">\ud83d\udd25<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Iniciaci\u00f3n (1810-1811)<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>L\u00edder:<\/strong> Miguel Hidalgo.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Evento:<\/strong> Grito de Dolores (16 sep 1810).<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Logros:<\/strong> Toma de Guanajuato, Valladolid.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Fin:<\/strong> Captura y ejecuci\u00f3n de Hidalgo (1811).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-dato\">\ud83d\udcc5 16 sep 1810 - 1811<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-card\" data-etapa=\"organizacion\">\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"etapa-icon\">\ud83d\udcdc<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Organizaci\u00f3n (1811-1815)<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>L\u00edder:<\/strong> Jos\u00e9 Mar\u00eda Morelos.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Evento:<\/strong> Congreso de Chilpancingo (1813).<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Logros:<\/strong> Constituci\u00f3n de Apatzing\u00e1n.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Fin:<\/strong> Captura y ejecuci\u00f3n de Morelos (1815).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-dato\">\ud83d\udcc5 1811 - 22 dic 1815<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-card\" data-etapa=\"resistencia\">\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"etapa-icon\">\u2694\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Resistencia (1815-1820)<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>L\u00edderes:<\/strong> Vicente Guerrero, Guadalupe Victoria.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Evento:<\/strong> Guerra de guerrillas.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Logros:<\/strong> Mantener viva la lucha.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Fin:<\/strong> Abrazo de Acatempan (1821).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-dato\">\ud83d\udcc5 1815 - 1820<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-card\" data-etapa=\"consumacion\">\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"etapa-icon\">\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Consumaci\u00f3n (1821)<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>L\u00edder:<\/strong> Agust\u00edn de Iturbide.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Evento:<\/strong> Plan de Iguala (24 feb 1821).<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Logros:<\/strong> Ej\u00e9rcito Trigarante, entrada a CDMX.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Fin:<\/strong> Firma del Acta de Independencia (28 sep 1821).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-dato\">\ud83d\udcc5 24 feb - 28 sep 1821<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- CAUSAS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Causas de la Independencia<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"causas-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"causa-card externa\">\r\n                    <div class=\"causa-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"causa-icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Externas<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"causa-content\">\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Invasi\u00f3n napole\u00f3nica a Espa\u00f1a (1808).<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Revoluci\u00f3n Francesa (1789).<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Independencia de EE.UU. (1776).<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"causa-dato\">\ud83d\udd17 Influencia global<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"causa-card interna\">\r\n                    <div class=\"causa-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"causa-icon\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Internas<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"causa-content\">\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Descontento criollo.<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Crisis econ\u00f3mica.<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Represi\u00f3n colonial.<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Ideas ilustradas.<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"causa-dato\">\ud83d\udcc9 Desigualdad social<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- DOCUMENTOS CLAVE -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Documentos Clave<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"documentos-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"documento-card gritodolores\">\r\n                    <div class=\"documento-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"documento-icon\">\ud83d\udce2<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Grito de Dolores<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"documento-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Autor:<\/strong> Miguel Hidalgo.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Fecha:<\/strong> 16 sep 1810.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Contenido:<\/strong> Llamado a la rebeli\u00f3n contra el \"mal gobierno\".<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Frase:<\/strong> \"\u00a1Viva la Virgen de Guadalupe! \u00a1Abajo el mal gobierno!\".<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"documento-dato\">\ud83d\udcdc Primer acto de independencia<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"documento-card chilpancingo\">\r\n                    <div class=\"documento-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"documento-icon\">\ud83d\udcdc<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Sentimientos de la Naci\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"documento-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Autor:<\/strong> Jos\u00e9 Mar\u00eda Morelos.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Fecha:<\/strong> 14 sep 1813.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Contenido:<\/strong> Primer documento constitucional.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Ideas:<\/strong> Soberan\u00eda popular, abolici\u00f3n de la esclavitud.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"documento-dato\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Primera constituci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"documento-card iguala\">\r\n                    <div class=\"documento-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"documento-icon\">\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Plan de Iguala<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"documento-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Autor:<\/strong> Agust\u00edn de Iturbide y Vicente Guerrero.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Fecha:<\/strong> 24 feb 1821.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Contenido:<\/strong> Tres garant\u00edas: religi\u00f3n, independencia, uni\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Resultado:<\/strong> Creaci\u00f3n del Ej\u00e9rcito Trigarante.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"documento-dato\">\ud83e\udd1d Uni\u00f3n de insurgentes y realistas<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: PLAN DE IGUALA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"plan-iguala\">\r\n            <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>\u2699\ufe0f CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"garantiaSelect\">Selecciona una garant\u00eda:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"garantiaSelect\" class=\"control-input\">\r\n                        <option value=\"religion\">Religi\u00f3n (Cat\u00f3lica)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"independencia\">Independencia<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"union\">Uni\u00f3n (Igualdad)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"anioSimulacion\">A\u00f1o:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"anioSimulacion\" min=\"1810\" max=\"1821\" value=\"1821\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>1810<\/span>\r\n                        <span>1821<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-iniciar\" onclick=\"iniciarSimulacion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6\ufe0f<\/span> INICIAR SIMULACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-reiniciar\" onclick=\"reiniciarSimulacion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <div class=\"plan-iguala-container\">\r\n                    <svg id=\"svgPlanIguala\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 500\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n                        <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- T\u00edtulo -->\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"50\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" font-size=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">PLAN DE IGUALA (1821)<\/text>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Tres Garant\u00edas -->\r\n                        <g id=\"garantiaReligion\" class=\"garantia-card\" data-garantia=\"religion\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"150\" y=\"120\" width=\"200\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\" rx=\"15\" opacity=\"0.5\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"250\" y=\"160\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">RELIGI\u00d3N<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"250\" y=\"190\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Cat\u00f3lica<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"250\" y=\"220\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\u00danica oficial<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n\r\n                        <g id=\"garantiaIndependencia\" class=\"garantia-card\" data-garantia=\"independencia\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"400\" y=\"120\" width=\"200\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#D32F2F\" rx=\"15\" opacity=\"0.5\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"500\" y=\"160\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">INDEPENDENCIA<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"500\" y=\"190\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">De Espa\u00f1a<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"500\" y=\"220\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Monarqu\u00eda moderada<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n\r\n                        <g id=\"garantiaUnion\" class=\"garantia-card\" data-garantia=\"union\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"275\" y=\"300\" width=\"250\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#1976D2\" rx=\"15\" opacity=\"0.5\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"400\" y=\"340\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">UNI\u00d3N<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"400\" y=\"370\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Igualdad<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"400\" y=\"400\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Criollos = Espa\u00f1oles<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Flechas -->\r\n                        <line x1=\"350\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#4CAF50\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#flecha)\"\/>\r\n                        <line x1=\"250\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#4CAF50\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#flecha)\"\/>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Bandera Trigarante -->\r\n                        <g id=\"banderaTrigarante\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"50\" y=\"400\" width=\"700\" height=\"80\" fill=\"url(#gradienteTrigarante)\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"400\" y=\"440\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">EJ\u00c9RCITO TRIGARANTE<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"400\" y=\"465\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Iturbide + Guerrero<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Leyenda -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"50\" y=\"420\" width=\"700\" height=\"60\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.7)\" rx=\"10\" id=\"leyendaPlanIguala\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"450\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"textoLeyenda\">Selecciona una garant\u00eda<\/text>\r\n                    <\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca DATOS HIST\u00d3RICOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Garant\u00eda:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataGarantia\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">A\u00f1o:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataAnio\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Contexto:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataContexto\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Impacto:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataImpacto\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Personajes:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPersonajes\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: \u00bfCU\u00c1NTO SABES?\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 documento proclam\u00f3 la abolici\u00f3n de la esclavitud?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Grito de Dolores\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Plan de Iguala\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Sentimientos de la Naci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Acta de Independencia\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Los <strong>Sentimientos de la Naci\u00f3n<\/strong> (1813) abolieron la esclavitud.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la secci\u00f3n de \"Documentos Clave\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQui\u00e9n lider\u00f3 la etapa de Resistencia (1815-1820)?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Miguel Hidalgo\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Vicente Guerrero\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Agust\u00edn de Iturbide\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Jos\u00e9 Mar\u00eda Morelos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> <strong>Vicente Guerrero<\/strong> lider\u00f3 la resistencia con guerra de guerrillas.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la secci\u00f3n de \"Etapas\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 propuso el Plan de Iguala?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Tres garant\u00edas\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Rep\u00fablica federal\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Monarqu\u00eda absoluta\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Divisi\u00f3n de poderes\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> Las <strong>Tres Garant\u00edas<\/strong>: religi\u00f3n, independencia y uni\u00f3n.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Usa el simulador del Plan de Iguala para repasar.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                    Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                    Completa el quiz para ver tu desempe\u00f1o.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd04 VOLVER A INTENTAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> MITOS Y REALIDADES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c \"Hidalgo grit\u00f3 '\u00a1Viva M\u00e9xico!'\"<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Mito:<\/strong> \"El 16 de septiembre de 1810, Hidalgo grit\u00f3 '\u00a1Viva M\u00e9xico!'\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Realidad:<\/strong> Hidalgo mencion\u00f3 a la <strong>Virgen de Guadalupe<\/strong> y al <strong>rey Fernando VII<\/strong>, no a \"M\u00e9xico\".\r\n                        <div class=\"error-cita\">\r\n                            <p>\"\u00a1Viva la Virgen de Guadalupe! \u00a1Abajo el mal gobierno!\" \u2014 <em>Testimonios hist\u00f3ricos<\/em><\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-imagen\">\r\n                        <img src=\"https:\/\/upload.wikimedia.org\/wikipedia\/commons\/thumb\/5\/5a\/Miguel_Hidalgo_y_Costilla.jpg\/300px-Miguel_Hidalgo_y_Costilla.jpg\" alt=\"Hidalgo\" width=\"100%\">\r\n                        <p><em>Retrato de Hidalgo. Fuente: Wikipedia.<\/em><\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c \"Iturbide fue un h\u00e9roe sin manchas\"<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Mito:<\/strong> \"Iturbide fue un libertador desinteresado\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Realidad:<\/strong> Iturbide buscaba <strong>poder personal<\/strong> y fue <strong>emperador<\/strong> (1822-1823).\r\n                        <div class=\"error-dato\">\ud83d\udc51 Abdic\u00f3 tras 10 meses de gobierno.<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-grafica\">\r\n                        <div class=\"grafica-barras\">\r\n                            <div class=\"barra apoyo\" style=\"width: 60%;\">Apoyo inicial (1821)<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"barra rechazo\" style=\"width: 80%;\">Rechazo (1823)<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"grafica-leyenda\">\r\n                            <span class=\"leyenda-apoyo\">\ud83d\udfe9 Apoyo<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"leyenda-rechazo\">\ud83d\udfe5 Rechazo<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c \"La independencia fue solo de los criollos\"<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Mito:<\/strong> \"Solo los criollos se beneficiaron\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Realidad:<\/strong> Participaron <strong>ind\u00edgenas<\/strong> (ej. <strong>Vicente Guerrero<\/strong> era mestizo) y <strong>afromexicanos<\/strong>.\r\n                        <div class=\"error-mapa\">\r\n                            <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 100\">\r\n                                <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"\/>\r\n                                <text x=\"50\" y=\"85\" fill=\"#E8F5E9\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Criollos<\/text>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"30\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF9800\"\/>\r\n                                <text x=\"150\" y=\"65\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ind\u00edgenas<\/text>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"70\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#7B1FA2\"\/>\r\n                                <text x=\"250\" y=\"105\" fill=\"#F3E5F5\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Afro<\/text>\r\n                                <path d=\"M50,50 L150,30 L250,70\" stroke=\"#4CAF50\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,2\"\/>\r\n                                <text x=\"150\" y=\"20\" fill=\"#E8F5E9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Alianzas independentistas<\/text>\r\n                            <\/svg>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> MISI\u00d3N FINAL: AN\u00c1LISIS CR\u00cdTICO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Comparaci\u00f3n de L\u00edderes<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Compara a <strong>Hidalgo<\/strong>, <strong>Morelos<\/strong> e <strong>Iturbide<\/strong> en:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li><strong>Origen social.<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Estrategia militar.<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Legado hist\u00f3rico.<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Incluye <strong>2 diferencias clave<\/strong> entre sus proyectos pol\u00edticos.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: Hidalgo era cura y buscaba justicia social, mientras que Iturbide...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VER SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong>\r\n                    <table class=\"comparativa-table\">\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th><\/th>\r\n                            <th>Hidalgo<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Morelos<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Iturbide<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>Origen<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Criollo (cura)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Mestizo (cura)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Criollo (militar)<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>Estrategia<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Rebeli\u00f3n popular<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Guerra organizada<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Alianzas con realistas<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>Legado<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Padre de la Patria<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Constituci\u00f3n de 1814<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Primer emperador<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/table>\r\n                    <p><strong>Diferencias clave:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li><strong>Hidalgo\/Morelos:<\/strong> Buscaban justicia social; <strong>Iturbide<\/strong> quer\u00eda monarqu\u00eda.<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Morelos:<\/strong> Abolici\u00f3n de la esclavitud; <strong>Iturbide<\/strong> mantuvo privilegios.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Debate: \u00bfFue la independencia una revoluci\u00f3n social?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Argumenta si la Independencia de M\u00e9xico (1810-1821) puede considerarse una <strong>revoluci\u00f3n social<\/strong>, usando:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>El <strong>Grito de Dolores<\/strong> (1810).<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Los <strong>Sentimientos de la Naci\u00f3n<\/strong> (1813).<\/li>\r\n                        <li>El <strong>Plan de Iguala<\/strong> (1821).<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Concluye con tu postura y <strong>2 evidencias<\/strong> del simulador.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: El Grito de Dolores s\u00ed ten\u00eda un componente social al mencionar...\" rows=\"10\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VER ARGUMENTOS<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Argumentos a favor (revoluci\u00f3n social):<\/strong>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Grito de Dolores:<\/strong> Llamado a acabar con el \"mal gobierno\" y la esclavitud.<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Sentimientos de la Naci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Abolici\u00f3n de castas y privilegios (Art. 12, 15).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Participaci\u00f3n popular:<\/strong> Ind\u00edgenas y mestizos en el ej\u00e9rcito insurgente.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <strong>Argumentos en contra:<\/strong>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Plan de Iguala:<\/strong> Mantuvo la religi\u00f3n cat\u00f3lica como oficial y privilegios criollos.<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Iturbide:<\/strong> Estableci\u00f3 una monarqu\u00eda, no una rep\u00fablica democr\u00e1tica.<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Elite criolla:<\/strong> Tom\u00f3 el poder tras 1821, excluyendo a ind\u00edgenas.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <p><strong>Conclusi\u00f3n:<\/strong> Fue un movimiento <strong>pol\u00edtico-militar<\/strong> con elementos sociales, pero <strong>no una revoluci\u00f3n completa<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Comparaci\u00f3n de l\u00edderes<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Analiza 3 aspectos con 2 diferencias clave.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Menciona aspectos sin profundizar.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Omite diferencias o aspectos.<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Uso de evidencias<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Argumenta con 3+ documentos hist\u00f3ricos.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Usa 1-2 evidencias sin contexto.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No usa evidencias.<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Reflexi\u00f3n cr\u00edtica<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Eval\u00faa perspectivas m\u00faltiples (social\/pol\u00edtica).<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Analiza solo una perspectiva.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Repite informaci\u00f3n sin an\u00e1lisis.<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE: REFLEXI\u00d3N HIST\u00d3RICA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Conozco las etapas de la independencia:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Analizo causas y consecuencias:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Uso el simulador del Plan de Iguala:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR PROGRESO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N FINAL<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo crees que ser\u00eda M\u00e9xico si la Independencia hubiera sido liderada solo por <strong>ind\u00edgenas y mestizos<\/strong> (sin criollos como Iturbide)?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: Quiz\u00e1s habr\u00eda una rep\u00fablica con mayor justicia social, pero...\" rows=\"5\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Investiga sobre <strong>Leona Vicario<\/strong> o <strong>Josefa Ortiz de Dom\u00ednguez<\/strong> y describe su papel en 3 l\u00edneas.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: Leona Vicario fue una insurgente que...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (20 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar fechas y l\u00edderes de cada etapa.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Repasar documentos clave (Grito, Sentimientos, Plan de Iguala).<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Identificar causas internas\/externas.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 AN\u00c1LISIS (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Comparar los proyectos pol\u00edticos de Hidalgo, Morelos e Iturbide.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Reflexionar: \u00bfPor qu\u00e9 fracas\u00f3 el proyecto de Morelos?<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Escribir un p\u00e1rrafo sobre el legado de la Independencia.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 DEBATE (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Preparar argumentos: \u00bfFue Iturbide un h\u00e9roe o un traidor?<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Investigar sobre la participaci\u00f3n de mujeres en la Independencia.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Debatir en clase con evidencias hist\u00f3ricas.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf10 RECURSOS EXTERNOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.inehrm.gob.mx\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcdc Instituto Nacional de Estudios Hist\u00f3ricos (INEHRM)\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.biblioteca.tv\/artman2\/publish\/1810_1821\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcda Biblioteca TV: Independencia de M\u00e9xico\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/humanities\/whp-origins\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udf93 Khan Academy: Revoluciones Latinoamericanas\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=...\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udfa5 Documental: \"Los Caudillos\" (History Channel)\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ BASE DE DATOS DEL SIMULADOR\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nconst garantiasData = {\r\n    \"religion\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Religi\u00f3n\",\r\n        ano: \"1821\",\r\n        contexto: \"La religi\u00f3n cat\u00f3lica fue declarada como la \u00fanica oficial en el Plan de Iguala, buscando unidad y apoyo de la Iglesia.\",\r\n        impacto: \"Garantiz\u00f3 el apoyo del clero, pero limit\u00f3 la libertad religiosa.\",\r\n        personajes: \"Iturbide, Iglesia Cat\u00f3lica\",\r\n        color: \"#7B1FA2\",\r\n        icono: \"\u26ea\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"independencia\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Independencia\",\r\n        ano: \"1821\",\r\n        contexto: \"M\u00e9xico se independizar\u00eda de Espa\u00f1a, pero bajo una monarqu\u00eda moderada (no rep\u00fablica).\",\r\n        impacto: \"Atrajo a realistas y criollos, pero posterg\u00f3 la democracia.\",\r\n        personajes: \"Iturbide, Guerrero, O'Donoj\u00fa\",\r\n        color: \"#D32F2F\",\r\n        icono: \"\ud83c\uddf2\ud83c\uddfd\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"union\": {\r\n        nombre: \"Uni\u00f3n\",\r\n        ano: \"1821\",\r\n        contexto: \"Igualdad entre criollos, espa\u00f1oles y castas, para evitar divisiones.\",\r\n        impacto: \"Uni\u00f3 a grupos rivales, pero no elimin\u00f3 las desigualdades sociales.\",\r\n        personajes: \"Iturbide, Criollos, Espa\u00f1oles\",\r\n        color: \"#1976D2\",\r\n        icono: \"\ud83e\udd1d\"\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR: PLAN DE IGUALA\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction iniciarSimulacion() {\r\n    const garantia = document.getElementById('garantiaSelect').value;\r\n    const ano = document.getElementById('anioSimulacion').value;\r\n    const datos = garantiasData[garantia];\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n    document.getElementById('dataGarantia').textContent = `${datos.icono} ${datos.nombre}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataAnio').textContent = datos.ano;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataContexto').textContent = datos.contexto;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataImpacto').textContent = datos.impacto;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataPersonajes').textContent = datos.personajes;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar leyenda\r\n    document.getElementById('textoLeyenda').textContent = `\ud83d\udcdc ${datos.nombre} (${datos.ano}): ${datos.contexto}`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Resaltar garant\u00eda en SVG\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.garantia-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.setAttribute('opacity', '0.5');\r\n    });\r\n    document.getElementById(`garantia${datos.nombre.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + datos.nombre.slice(1)}`).setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Mostrar bandera trigarante si es 1821\r\n    if (ano >= 1821) {\r\n        document.getElementById('banderaTrigarante').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n    } else {\r\n        document.getElementById('banderaTrigarante').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    console.log(`\ud83d\ude80 Simulaci\u00f3n: ${datos.nombre} (${datos.ano})`);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarSimulacion() {\r\n    document.getElementById('garantiaSelect').value = \"religion\";\r\n    document.getElementById('anioSimulacion').value = \"1821\";\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar datos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.data-value').forEach(d => {\r\n        d.textContent = \"\u2014\";\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar SVG\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.garantia-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.setAttribute('opacity', '0.5');\r\n    });\r\n    document.getElementById('banderaTrigarante').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('textoLeyenda').textContent = \"Selecciona una garant\u00eda\";\r\n\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\udd04 Simulaci\u00f3n reiniciada\");\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n        const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n\r\n        if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n    const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n    let feedback = \"\";\r\n    if (porcentaje >= 80) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83c\udf1f \u00a1Excelente! Dominas los detalles clave de la Independencia.\";\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 50) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero repasa los documentos y l\u00edderes.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas estudiar m\u00e1s las etapas y el Plan de Iguala.\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ ERRORES COMUNES (MITOS)\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction toggleError(header) {\r\n    const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n\r\n    if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n    } else {\r\n        content.style.display = 'block';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n\r\n    alert(`\ud83d\udcbe Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n          `Etapas: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n          `Causas\/consecuencias: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n          `Simulador: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n          `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n          `\ud83d\udccc Recomendaci\u00f3n: Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ OBJETIVOS INTERACTIVOS\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n        this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n        const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n        checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n        checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#4CAF50' : '';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N: AGREGAR GRADIENTE A LA BANDERA\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nconst svg = document.getElementById('svgPlanIguala');\r\nconst defs = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'defs');\r\n\r\nconst gradiente = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'linearGradient');\r\ngradiente.setAttribute('id', 'gradienteTrigarante');\r\ngradiente.setAttribute('x1', '0%');\r\ngradiente.setAttribute('y1', '0%');\r\ngradiente.setAttribute('x2', '100%');\r\ngradiente.setAttribute('y2', '0%');\r\n\r\nconst stop1 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'stop');\r\nstop1.setAttribute('offset', '0%');\r\nstop1.setAttribute('stop-color', '#4CAF50');\r\n\r\nconst stop2 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'stop');\r\nstop2.setAttribute('offset', '50%');\r\nstop2.setAttribute('stop-color', 'white');\r\n\r\nconst stop3 = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'stop');\r\nstop3.setAttribute('offset', '100%');\r\nstop3.setAttribute('stop-color', '#D32F2F');\r\n\r\ngradiente.appendChild(stop1);\r\ngradiente.appendChild(stop2);\r\ngradiente.appendChild(stop3);\r\ndefs.appendChild(gradiente);\r\nsvg.appendChild(defs);\r\n\r\n\/\/ Flecha para SVG\r\nconst marker = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'marker');\r\nmarker.setAttribute('id', 'flecha');\r\nmarker.setAttribute('viewBox', '0 0 10 10');\r\nmarker.setAttribute('refX', '5');\r\nmarker.setAttribute('refY', '5');\r\nmarker.setAttribute('markerWidth', '6');\r\nmarker.setAttribute('markerHeight', '6');\r\nmarker.setAttribute('orient', 'auto');\r\n\r\nconst path = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'path');\r\npath.setAttribute('d', 'M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z');\r\npath.setAttribute('fill', '#4CAF50');\r\n\r\nmarker.appendChild(path);\r\ndefs.appendChild(marker);\r\nsvg.appendChild(defs);\r\n\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: Independencia de M\u00e9xico - Cargada\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83c\udfae Simulador, Quiz y Herramientas interactivas listas\");\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Grito de Dolores","respuesta":"16 septiembre 1810"},{"enunciado":"L\u00edder inicial","respuesta":"Miguel Hidalgo"},{"enunciado":"Congreso de Chilpancingo","respuesta":"1813"},{"enunciado":"Autor Sentimientos Naci\u00f3n","respuesta":"Morelos"},{"enunciado":"Plan de Iguala","respuesta":"1821"},{"enunciado":"Tres garant\u00edas","respuesta":"Religi\u00f3n, independencia, uni\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Entrada CDMX","respuesta":"27 septiembre 1821"},{"enunciado":"Ejecutado en 1811","respuesta":"Hidalgo"},{"enunciado":"Ejecutado en 1815","respuesta":"Morelos"},{"enunciado":"Trigarante significa","respuesta":"Tres garant\u00edas"},{"enunciado":"Causa francesa","respuesta":"Invasi\u00f3n napole\u00f3nica 1808"},{"enunciado":"SI: a\u00f1os independencia","respuesta":"11"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Grito de Dolores","opciones":["16 Sep 1810","15 Sep 1821","20 Nov 1910","5 May 1862"],"correcta":"16 Sep 1810"},{"pregunta":"L\u00edder Grito","opciones":["Hidalgo","Morelos","Iturbide","Guerrero"],"correcta":"Hidalgo"},{"pregunta":"Congreso Chilpancingo","opciones":["1813","1810","1821","1910"],"correcta":"1813"},{"pregunta":"Sentimientos Naci\u00f3n","opciones":["Morelos","Hidalgo","Iturbide","Ju\u00e1rez"],"correcta":"Morelos"},{"pregunta":"Plan de Iguala","opciones":["24 Feb 1821","16 Sep 1810","27 Sep 1821","20 Nov 1910"],"correcta":"24 Feb 1821"},{"pregunta":"Tres garant\u00edas","opciones":["Religi\u00f3n, independencia, uni\u00f3n","Libertad, igualdad, fraternidad","Fe, esperanza, caridad","Nada"],"correcta":"Religi\u00f3n, independencia, uni\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Entrada CDMX","opciones":["27 Sep 1821","16 Sep 1810","24 Feb 1821","15 Sep 1821"],"correcta":"27 Sep 1821"},{"pregunta":"Ejecutado 1811","opciones":["Hidalgo","Morelos","Iturbide","Allende"],"correcta":"Hidalgo"},{"pregunta":"Ejecutado 1815","opciones":["Morelos","Hidalgo","Guerrero","Iturbide"],"correcta":"Morelos"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: a\u00f1os Grito","opciones":["215","200","300","100"],"correcta":"215"},{"pregunta":"Causa principal","opciones":["Invasi\u00f3n napole\u00f3nica","Terremoto","Hambre","Plaga"],"correcta":"Invasi\u00f3n napole\u00f3nica"},{"pregunta":"Quer\u00e9taro conspiraci\u00f3n","opciones":["Allende, Aldama","Hidalgo solo","Morelos","Iturbide"],"correcta":"Allende, Aldama"},{"pregunta":"Batalla Monte de las Cruces","opciones":["Victoria insurgente","Derrota","Empate","Paz"],"correcta":"Victoria insurgente"},{"pregunta":"Guadalajara tomada","opciones":["1811","1810","1821","1813"],"correcta":"1811"},{"pregunta":"Morelos capturado","opciones":["1815","1811","1821","1810"],"correcta":"1815"},{"pregunta":"Ej\u00e9rcito Trigarante","opciones":["Iturbide + Guerrero","Solo Iturbide","Solo Guerrero","Hidalgo"],"correcta":"Iturbide + Guerrero"},{"pregunta":"Bandera trigarante","opciones":["Blanco, verde, rojo","Verde, blanco, rojo","Rojo, blanco, azul","Negro"],"correcta":"Blanco, verde, rojo"},{"pregunta":"Tratado de C\u00f3rdoba","opciones":["24 Ago 1821","24 Feb","27 Sep","16 Sep"],"correcta":"24 Ago 1821"},{"pregunta":"Muertos estimados","opciones":["~600,000","10,000","1M","100"],"correcta":["~600,000"]},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: a\u00f1os consumaci\u00f3n","opciones":["204","200","215","300"],"correcta":"204"},{"pregunta":"Hidalgo aboli\u00f3","opciones":["Esclavitud","Impuestos","Virrey","Iglesia"],"correcta":"Esclavitud"},{"pregunta":"Morelos propuso","opciones":["Rep\u00fablica","Monarqu\u00eda","Dictadura","Anarqu\u00eda"],"correcta":"Rep\u00fablica"},{"pregunta":"Iturbide fue","opciones":["Militar realista \u2192 independentista","Insurgente","Sacerdote","Ind\u00edgena"],"correcta":"Militar realista \u2192 independentista"},{"pregunta":"Virrey al final","opciones":["Juan O'Donoj\u00fa","Iturbide","Morelos","Hidalgo"],"correcta":"Juan O'Donoj\u00fa"},{"pregunta":"Independencia cost\u00f3","opciones":["11 a\u00f1os","1 a\u00f1o","100 a\u00f1os","1 d\u00eda"],"correcta":"11 a\u00f1os"},{"pregunta":"Primera constituci\u00f3n","opciones":["Sentimientos Naci\u00f3n","Plan Iguala","Tratado C\u00f3rdoba","Constituci\u00f3n 1824"],"correcta":"Sentimientos Naci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: d\u00eda feriado","opciones":["16 Sep","15 Sep","27 Sep","24 Feb"],"correcta":"16 Sep"},{"pregunta":"Independencia fue","opciones":["Guerra civil","Paz","Revoluci\u00f3n pac\u00edfica","Nada"],"correcta":"Guerra civil"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico naci\u00f3 como","opciones":["Imperio (Iturbide)","Rep\u00fablica","Colonia","Virreinato"],"correcta":"Imperio (Iturbide)"},{"pregunta":"Independencia inspirada en","opciones":["Ilustraci\u00f3n + Francia","Espa\u00f1a","EE.UU.","Inglaterra"],"correcta":"Ilustraci\u00f3n + Francia"}]},{"materia":"Historia de M\u00e9xico","slug":"mexico-independiente","titulo":"M\u00e9xico Independiente: Caos, Reforma y Modernizaci\u00f3n (1821-1910)","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-historia-independiente\" data-tema=\"mexico-independiente\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u2694\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n            M\u00c9XICO INDEPENDIENTE\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Del Imperio Ef\u00edmero al Porfiriato: 89 A\u00f1os de B\u00fasqueda Nacional (1821-1910)\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"badge-tiempo\">\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">1821-1910<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">89 a\u00f1os<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">50 gobiernos<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">3 constituciones<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Secuenciar etapas hist\u00f3ricas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Identificar Imperio, Rep\u00fablica, Reforma, Intervenci\u00f3n, Porfiriato<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar crisis territoriales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Examinar p\u00e9rdida del 55% territorio con EE.UU. (1848)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Evaluar reformas liberales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Comprender impacto de Leyes de Reforma y Constituci\u00f3n 1857<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Examinar modernizaci\u00f3n porfirista<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Analizar contradicci\u00f3n: desarrollo econ\u00f3mico vs. desigualdad social<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> CONSECUENCIAS EN EL M\u00c9XICO ACTUAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f P\u00e9rdida Territorial<\/h3>\r\n                <p>2.3 millones km\u00b2 perdidos hoy son 7 estados de EE.UU. con 60 millones de habitantes<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">55% territorio original<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\u2696\ufe0f Estado Laico<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Leyes de Reforma establecieron separaci\u00f3n Iglesia-Estado vigente hoy<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Registro civil, matrimonio civil, educaci\u00f3n laica<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\ude82 Infraestructura<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Ferrocarriles porfiristas son base del sistema ferroviario actual<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">20,000 km v\u00edas 1876-1910<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> LAS SIETE ETAPAS FUNDACIONALES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- INTRODUCCI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. El Ca\u00f3tico Siglo XIX Mexicano<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\u26a1 1821-1910: SIGLO DE CRISIS Y TRANSFORMACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Per\u00edodo marcado por inestabilidad pol\u00edtica, intervenciones extranjeras y b\u00fasqueda de identidad nacional<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"caracteristicas-grid\">\r\n                        <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-icon\">\ud83d\udc51<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-texto\">50 gobiernos en 89 a\u00f1os<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-icon\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-texto\">55% territorio perdido<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-icon\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-texto\">3 constituciones (1824, 1857, 1917)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-icon\">\ud83d\udca5<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-texto\">7 intervenciones extranjeras<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- LINEA DE TIEMPO INTERACTIVA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. L\u00ednea de Tiempo Interactiva<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"timeline-interactiva\">\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-controls\">\r\n                    <button class=\"timeline-btn\" data-etapa=\"imperio\">IMPERIO<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"timeline-btn\" data-etapa=\"republica\">REP\u00daBLICA<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"timeline-btn\" data-etapa=\"centralismo\">CENTRALISMO<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"timeline-btn\" data-etapa=\"guerra-eeuu\">GUERRA EE.UU.<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"timeline-btn\" data-etapa=\"reforma\">REFORMA<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"timeline-btn\" data-etapa=\"intervencion\">INTERVENCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"timeline-btn\" data-etapa=\"porfiriato\">PORFIRIATO<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"timeline-visual\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-bar\">\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-marker\" data-year=\"1821\" style=\"left: 0%;\">1821<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-marker\" data-year=\"1836\" style=\"left: 16%;\">1836<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-marker\" data-year=\"1848\" style=\"left: 30%;\">1848<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-marker\" data-year=\"1857\" style=\"left: 40%;\">1857<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-marker\" data-year=\"1867\" style=\"left: 51%;\">1867<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-marker\" data-year=\"1876\" style=\"left: 61%;\">1876<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-marker\" data-year=\"1910\" style=\"left: 100%;\">1910<\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Etapas -->\r\n                        <div class=\"etapa-bar imperio\" style=\"left: 0%; width: 2%;\" data-etapa=\"imperio\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"etapa-bar republica\" style=\"left: 2%; width: 14%;\" data-etapa=\"republica\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"etapa-bar centralismo\" style=\"left: 16%; width: 14%;\" data-etapa=\"centralismo\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"etapa-bar guerra-eeuu\" style=\"left: 30%; width: 10%;\" data-etapa=\"guerra-eeuu\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"etapa-bar reforma\" style=\"left: 40%; width: 11%;\" data-etapa=\"reforma\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"etapa-bar intervencion\" style=\"left: 51%; width: 10%;\" data-etapa=\"intervencion\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"etapa-bar porfiriato\" style=\"left: 61%; width: 39%;\" data-etapa=\"porfiriato\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"timeline-info\" id=\"timelineInfo\">\r\n                    Haz clic en una etapa para ver detalles hist\u00f3ricos\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- ETAPAS DETALLADAS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. An\u00e1lisis por Etapa Hist\u00f3rica<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- IMPERIO -->\r\n            <div class=\"etapa-detalle\" id=\"detalleImperio\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udc51 IMPERIO MEXICANO (1822-1823)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-badge\">11 meses<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udcdc Contexto<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Tras independencia, M\u00e9xico busca modelo pol\u00edtico. Iturbide se corona Agust\u00edn I<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Ej\u00e9rcito Trigarante \u2192 Imperio<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\u2696\ufe0f Organizaci\u00f3n<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Monarqu\u00eda constitucional, poder dividido entre emperador y congreso<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Constituci\u00f3n de Apatzing\u00e1n influencia liberal<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udca5 Ca\u00edda<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Oposici\u00f3n republicana, crisis econ\u00f3mica, Plan de Casa Mata (1823)<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Iturbide abdica y es exiliado<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- REP\u00daBLICA FEDERAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"etapa-detalle\" id=\"detalleRepublica\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f PRIMERA REP\u00daBLICA FEDERAL (1824-1835)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-badge\">11 a\u00f1os<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udcdc Constituci\u00f3n 1824<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Primera constituci\u00f3n formal. Rep\u00fablica representativa, popular, federal<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">19 estados, 4 territorios, Distrito Federal<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udc65 Presidentes<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Guadalupe Victoria (1824-1829) primer presidente<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Vicente Guerrero (1829), Anastasio Bustamante<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udca5 Conflictos<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Centralistas vs. federalistas, Masones Yorkinos vs. Escoceses<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Primeros intentos separatistas en Yucat\u00e1n, Texas<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- GUERRA EE.UU. -->\r\n            <div class=\"etapa-detalle\" id=\"detalleGuerraEeuu\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udca5 GUERRA M\u00c9XICO-EE.UU. (1846-1848)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-badge\">2 a\u00f1os<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Causas<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Expansionismo estadounidense (\"Destino Manifiesto\"), anexi\u00f3n de Texas (1845)<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Disputa frontera R\u00edo Nueces vs. R\u00edo Grande<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\u2694\ufe0f Batallas<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Cerro Gordo, Chapultepec, Molino del Rey<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Ni\u00f1os H\u00e9roes: 6 cadetes muertos en Chapultepec<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udcdc Tratado Guadalupe Hidalgo<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>M\u00e9xico pierde 2.3 millones km\u00b2 (55% territorio)<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">$15 millones compensaci\u00f3n, l\u00ednea fronteriza actual<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- REFORMA -->\r\n            <div class=\"etapa-detalle\" id=\"detalleReforma\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\u2696\ufe0f REFORMA LIBERAL (1855-1861)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-badge\">6 a\u00f1os intensos<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udcdc Leyes de Reforma<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Ju\u00e1rez (fueros eclesi\u00e1sticos), Lerdo (desamortizaci\u00f3n), Iglesias (aranceles)<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Separaci\u00f3n Iglesia-Estado, nacionalizaci\u00f3n bienes<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udcd6 Constituci\u00f3n 1857<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Garant\u00edas individuales, ense\u00f1anza laica, libertad de imprenta<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">No reelecci\u00f3n, juicio de amparo, derechos sociales<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udca5 Guerra de Reforma<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Liberales (Ju\u00e1rez) vs. Conservadores (Miram\u00f3n)<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Gobierno itinerante de Ju\u00e1rez por el pa\u00eds<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PORFIRIATO -->\r\n            <div class=\"etapa-detalle\" id=\"detallePorfiriato\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f PORFIRIATO (1876-1911)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-badge\">35 a\u00f1os<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\ude82 Modernizaci\u00f3n<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>20,000 km ferrocarril, tel\u00e9grafo, electricidad, puertos, industria<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">\"Orden y Progreso\": estabilidad para inversi\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udcb0 Econom\u00eda<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Inversi\u00f3n extranjera (EE.UU., UK, Francia), desarrollo minero, haciendas<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Moneda estable, presupuesto equilibrado<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\u2696\ufe0f Contradicciones<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Crecimiento econ\u00f3mico + desigualdad social, represi\u00f3n, caciquismo<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Huelgas de Cananea (1906) y R\u00edo Blanco (1907)<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- AN\u00c1LISIS COMPARATIVO -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Modelos de Gobierno en Conflicto<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"comparativa-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"modelo-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-icon\">\ud83d\udc51<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>CONSERVADORES<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-desc\">\r\n                        Mantener privilegios coloniales: Iglesia, ej\u00e9rcito, centralismo\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>L\u00edderes:<\/strong> Lucas Alam\u00e1n, Miram\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Objetivo:<\/strong> Monarqu\u00eda\/centralismo<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Apoyo:<\/strong> Iglesia, terratenientes<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"modelo-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-icon\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>LIBERALES MODERADOS<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-desc\">\r\n                        Reformas graduales, equilibrio entre tradici\u00f3n y cambio\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>L\u00edderes:<\/strong> G\u00f3mez Far\u00edas, Comonfort<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Objetivo:<\/strong> Rep\u00fablica federal<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Apoyo:<\/strong> Clase media urbana<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"modelo-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-icon\">\ud83d\udd25<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>LIBERALES PUROS<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-desc\">\r\n                        Transformaci\u00f3n radical: Estado laico, federalismo, derechos\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>L\u00edderes:<\/strong> Ju\u00e1rez, Ocampo, Lerdo<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Objetivo:<\/strong> Rep\u00fablica laica social<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Apoyo:<\/strong> Intelectuales, artesanos<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"modelo-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-icon\">\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>CIENT\u00cdFICOS<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-desc\">\r\n                        Modernizaci\u00f3n autoritaria: desarrollo econ\u00f3mico sobre democracia\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>L\u00edderes:<\/strong> D\u00edaz, Limantour<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Objetivo:<\/strong> \"Orden y Progreso\"<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Apoyo:<\/strong> Empresarios, extranjeros<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- DATOS ESTAD\u00cdSTICOS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>5. M\u00e9xico en Cifras: 1821-1910<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"estadisticas-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"estadistica-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-valor\">50<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-label\">Gobiernos<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-desc\">89 a\u00f1os de inestabilidad<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadistica-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-valor\">55%<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-label\">Territorio perdido<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-desc\">2.3 millones km\u00b2 (1848)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadistica-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-valor\">3<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-label\">Constituciones<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-desc\">1824, 1857, 1917<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadistica-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-valor\">20,000<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-label\">km ferrocarril<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-desc\">Construidos 1876-1910<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadistica-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-valor\">35<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-label\">A\u00f1os Porfiriato<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-desc\">Estabilidad autoritaria<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadistica-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-valor\">90%<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-label\">Analfabetismo 1910<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-desc\">A pesar de modernizaci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO: CONSTITUCIONES COMPARADAS -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> SIMULADOR: EVOLUCI\u00d3N CONSTITUCIONAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"constituciones-mexico\">\r\n            <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>COMPARADOR CONSTITUCIONAL<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"constitucionSelect\">Constituci\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"constitucionSelect\" class=\"control-select\" onchange=\"cambiarConstitucion()\">\r\n                        <option value=\"1824\">1824 (Primera Rep\u00fablica)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"1836\">1836 (Siete Leyes - Centralista)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"1857\">1857 (Reforma Liberal)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"1917\">1917 (Revolucionaria)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label>Temas a comparar:<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"checkbox-group\">\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"temas\" value=\"forma-gobierno\" checked> Forma de gobierno<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"temas\" value=\"religion\"> Religi\u00f3n<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"temas\" value=\"derechos\"> Derechos<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"temas\" value=\"reeleccion\"> Reelecci\u00f3n<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"temas\" value=\"propiedad\"> Propiedad<\/label>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-comparar\" onclick=\"compararConstituciones()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/span> COMPARAR M\u00daLTIPLES\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-linea\" onclick=\"mostrarEvolucion()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udcc8<\/span> L\u00cdNEA EVOLUTIVA\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N CONSTITUCIONAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacionConstitucion\">\r\n                <div class=\"constitucion-container\">\r\n                    <div class=\"constitucion-header\">\r\n                        <h3 id=\"tituloConstitucion\">CONSTITUCI\u00d3N DE 1824<\/h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"constitucion-subtitulo\" id=\"subtituloConstitucion\">Primera Rep\u00fablica Federal<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"constitucion-articulos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"articulo-card\">\r\n                            <div class=\"articulo-numero\">Art. 1<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"articulo-contenido\" id=\"articulo1\">\r\n                                La Naci\u00f3n Mexicana es para siempre libre e independiente\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"articulo-card\">\r\n                            <div class=\"articulo-numero\">Art. 4<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"articulo-contenido\" id=\"articulo4\">\r\n                                La Naci\u00f3n adopta como forma de gobierno una rep\u00fablica representativa popular federal\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"articulo-card\">\r\n                            <div class=\"articulo-numero\">Art. 3<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"articulo-contenido\" id=\"articulo3\">\r\n                                La religi\u00f3n de la Naci\u00f3n es la Cat\u00f3lica, Apost\u00f3lica, Romana\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"articulo-card highlight\">\r\n                            <div class=\"articulo-numero\">Art. 50<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"articulo-contenido\" id=\"articulo50\">\r\n                                Se divide el Supremo Poder de la Federaci\u00f3n para su ejercicio en Legislativo, Ejecutivo y Judicial\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"constitucion-estadisticas\">\r\n                        <div class=\"estadistica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"estadistica-label\">Art\u00edculos:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"estadistica-valor\" id=\"totalArticulos\">171<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"estadistica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"estadistica-label\">Vigencia:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"estadistica-valor\" id=\"vigenciaConstitucion\">1824-1835<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"estadistica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"estadistica-label\">Car\u00e1cter:<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"estadistica-valor\" id=\"caracterConstitucion\">Federalista<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"constitucion-info\" id=\"infoConstitucion\">\r\n                    Selecciona una constituci\u00f3n para analizar sus caracter\u00edsticas\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- DATOS COMPARATIVOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>DATOS CONSTITUCIONALES<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Constituci\u00f3n:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataConstitucion\">1824<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Forma de gobierno:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataGobierno\">Rep\u00fablica federal<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Religi\u00f3n oficial:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataReligion\">Cat\u00f3lica<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">INNOVACI\u00d3N PRINCIPAL:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataInnovacion\">Divisi\u00f3n de poderes<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Derechos reconocidos:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataDerechos\">Limitados<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Duraci\u00f3n:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataDuracion\">11 a\u00f1os<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcca COMPARATIVA HIST\u00d3RICA<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>1824 (Federal):<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">19 estados<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>1836 (Centralista):<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">24 departamentos<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>1857 (Liberal):<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">Garant\u00edas individuales<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>1917 (Social):<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">Derechos sociales<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: M\u00c9XICO SIGLO XIX\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 porcentaje del territorio perdi\u00f3 M\u00e9xico en la guerra con EE.UU. (1848)?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        25%\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        40%\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        55%\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        70%\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> M\u00e9xico perdi\u00f3 55% de su territorio original (2.3 millones km\u00b2).\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> La p\u00e9rdida fue catastr\u00f3fica: California, Nuevo M\u00e9xico, Arizona, Nevada, Utah, partes de otros estados.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Dato:<\/strong> El Tratado de Guadalupe Hidalgo (1848) estableci\u00f3 la frontera actual. M\u00e9xico recibi\u00f3 $15 millones como compensaci\u00f3n. Poblaci\u00f3n afectada: 80,000 mexicanos en territorios perdidos.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l fue la principal innovaci\u00f3n de la Constituci\u00f3n de 1857?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Establecer el centralismo\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Garant\u00edas individuales y Estado laico\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Restaurar la monarqu\u00eda\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Permitir la reelecci\u00f3n indefinida\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> La Constituci\u00f3n de 1857 estableci\u00f3 garant\u00edas individuales y separ\u00f3 Iglesia-Estado.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Fue precisamente lo contrario: federalismo, laicismo, y prohibici\u00f3n de reelecci\u00f3n.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La Constituci\u00f3n de 1857 incluy\u00f3: libertad de ense\u00f1anza, trabajo, imprenta; juicio de amparo; prohibici\u00f3n de fueros; registro civil; matrimonio civil; nacionalizaci\u00f3n de bienes eclesi\u00e1sticos.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 caracteriz\u00f3 la pol\u00edtica econ\u00f3mica del Porfiriato?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Nacionalizaci\u00f3n de industrias\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Redistribuci\u00f3n de tierras\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Aislamiento econ\u00f3mico\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Inversi\u00f3n extranjera y desarrollo infraestructura\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> \"Orden y Progreso\" se bas\u00f3 en inversi\u00f3n extranjera y modernizaci\u00f3n.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> El Porfiriato fue precisamente lo contrario: privatizaci\u00f3n, concentraci\u00f3n de tierras, apertura al exterior.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Se construyeron 20,000 km de ferrocarril, se desarroll\u00f3 miner\u00eda, petr\u00f3leo, industria. Pero la riqueza se concentr\u00f3: 1% poblaci\u00f3n controlaba 97% tierras cultivables. Salario real cay\u00f3 20% 1877-1910.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> AN\u00c1LISIS HIST\u00d3RICO COMPARATIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>An\u00e1lisis: Liberalismo vs. Conservadurismo<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Compara los proyectos de naci\u00f3n de liberales y conservadores en el siglo XIX:<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"tabla-comparativa\">\r\n                        <table>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <th>Aspecto<\/th>\r\n                                <th>PROYECTO LIBERAL<\/th>\r\n                                <th>PROYECTO CONSERVADOR<\/th>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td><strong>Forma de gobierno<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Describe el modelo liberal...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Describe el modelo conservador...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td><strong>Relaci\u00f3n Iglesia-Estado<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Postura liberal...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Postura conservadora...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td><strong>Organizaci\u00f3n territorial<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Federalismo\/centralismo liberal...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Federalismo\/centralismo conservador...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td><strong>Modelo econ\u00f3mico<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Econom\u00eda liberal...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                                <td><textarea placeholder=\"Econom\u00eda conservadora...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea><\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n                        <\/table>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <p><strong>Pregunta de s\u00edntesis:<\/strong> \u00bfPor qu\u00e9 el proyecto liberal termin\u00f3 imponi\u00e9ndose a pesar de la resistencia conservadora?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu an\u00e1lisis...\" rows=\"4\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR AN\u00c1LISIS<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>An\u00e1lisis sugerido:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    <strong>Liberales:<\/strong> Rep\u00fablica federal, Estado laico, divisi\u00f3n de poderes, garant\u00edas individuales, libre comercio, propiedad privada.<br>\r\n                    <strong>Conservadores:<\/strong> Centralismo\/monarqu\u00eda, uni\u00f3n Iglesia-Estado, fueros, proteccionismo, mantenimiento privilegios coloniales.<br><br>\r\n                    <strong>Ventaja liberal:<\/strong> Adaptaci\u00f3n al mundo moderno, apoyo de clases medias emergentes, legitimidad de soberan\u00eda popular, capacidad de movilizaci\u00f3n social. La derrota conservadora en la Intervenci\u00f3n Francesa (1867) consolid\u00f3 el proyecto liberal.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Evaluaci\u00f3n Cr\u00edtica del Porfiriato<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Eval\u00faa cr\u00edticamente el Porfiriato (1876-1911) considerando:<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"balanza-evaluativa\">\r\n                        <div class=\"balanza-lado positivo\">\r\n                            <h4>\u2705 LOGROS Y AVANCES<\/h4>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Estabilidad pol\u00edtica despu\u00e9s de d\u00e9cadas de caos<\/li>\r\n                                <textarea placeholder=\"Describe otros logros...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                                <li>Crecimiento econ\u00f3mico e inversi\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                                <textarea placeholder=\"Especifica cifras o ejemplos...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                                <li>Modernizaci\u00f3n infraestructura<\/li>\r\n                                <textarea placeholder=\"Menciona obras espec\u00edficas...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                            <\/ul>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"balanza-lado negativo\">\r\n                            <h4>\u274c COSTOS Y LIMITACIONES<\/h4>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Autoritarismo y falta de democracia<\/li>\r\n                                <textarea placeholder=\"Describe mecanismos de control...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                                <li>Desigualdad social extrema<\/li>\r\n                                <textarea placeholder=\"Menciona datos de concentraci\u00f3n...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                                <li>Dependencia del capital extranjero<\/li>\r\n                                <textarea placeholder=\"Analiza consecuencias...\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                            <\/ul>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <p><strong>Pregunta de valoraci\u00f3n:<\/strong> \u00bfFue el Porfiriato necesario para el desarrollo de M\u00e9xico o pod\u00eda haberse logrado el progreso con democracia?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu valoraci\u00f3n argumentada...\" rows=\"4\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Evaluaci\u00f3n balanceada:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    <strong>Logros:<\/strong> Estabilidad (35 a\u00f1os sin guerras), 20,000 km ferrocarril, industria, miner\u00eda, educaci\u00f3n (aunque limitada), finanzas ordenadas.<br>\r\n                    <strong>Costos:<\/strong> Dictadura, represi\u00f3n (Rurales), concentraci\u00f3n tierra (97% en 1%), salarios bajos, analfabetismo 90%, dependencia econ\u00f3mica.<br><br>\r\n                    <strong>Valoraci\u00f3n:<\/strong> El Porfiriato demostr\u00f3 que M\u00e9xico pod\u00eda modernizarse, pero a un costo social intolerable. La Revoluci\u00f3n fue la respuesta a esta contradicci\u00f3n. S\u00ed era posible desarrollo con mayor justicia social.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Comprensi\u00f3n hist\u00f3rica<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Analiza causas y consecuencias de cada etapa<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Describe eventos principales correctamente<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Confunde etapas o personajes hist\u00f3ricos<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis comparativo<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Contrasta efectivamente modelos en conflicto<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Identifica algunas diferencias entre proyectos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No logra establecer comparaciones v\u00e1lidas<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Evaluaci\u00f3n cr\u00edtica<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Valora logros y l\u00edmites con argumentos s\u00f3lidos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Menciona algunos aspectos positivos y negativos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Ofrece juicios simplistas o no fundamentados<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> REFLEXI\u00d3N SOBRE LA CONSTRUCCI\u00d3N NACIONAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N DE CONOCIMIENTOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Conocimiento de etapas hist\u00f3ricas:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>An\u00e1lisis de conflictos ideol\u00f3gicos:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Evaluaci\u00f3n de proyectos nacionales:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfQu\u00e9 lecciones del M\u00e9xico independiente (1821-1910) consideras relevantes para los desaf\u00edos actuales del pa\u00eds?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo explicas que un pa\u00eds con tanto potencial (recursos, territorio) tuviera tantas dificultades para consolidarse en el siglo XIX?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu an\u00e1lisis...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd04 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Memorizar las 7 etapas clave 1821-1910<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Recordar fechas de constituciones<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Identificar l\u00edderes principales por etapa<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcaa PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Explorar simulador constitucional<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Completar el quiz de autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Comparar proyectos liberal vs. conservador<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\ude80 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Analizar un documento hist\u00f3rico espec\u00edfico<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Investigar consecuencias de la p\u00e9rdida territorial<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Estudiar continuidades porfiristas en M\u00e9xico actual<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.diputados.gob.mx\/biblioteca\/bibdig\/const_mex\/const_1824.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcdc Constituci\u00f3n de 1824 (texto original)\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.diputados.gob.mx\/biblioteca\/bibdig\/const_mex\/const_1857.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcd6 Constituci\u00f3n de 1857 (texto original)\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.inehrm.gob.mx\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f INEHRM: Instituto de Estudios Hist\u00f3ricos\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/archivohistorico2010.sre.gob.mx\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\uddc3\ufe0f Archivo Hist\u00f3rico de la Secretar\u00eda de Relaciones Exteriores\r\n                <\/a>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n    <script>\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SIMULADOR CONSTITUCIONAL\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    const constituciones = {\r\n        \"1824\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Constituci\u00f3n Federal de 1824\",\r\n            subtitulo: \"Primera Rep\u00fablica Federal\",\r\n            articulo1: \"La Naci\u00f3n Mexicana es para siempre libre e independiente del gobierno espa\u00f1ol y de cualquier otra potencia.\",\r\n            articulo3: \"La religi\u00f3n de la Naci\u00f3n Mexicana es y ser\u00e1 perpetuamente la cat\u00f3lica, apost\u00f3lica, romana. La Naci\u00f3n la protege por leyes sabias y justas.\",\r\n            articulo4: \"La Naci\u00f3n Mexicana adopta para su gobierno la forma de rep\u00fablica representativa popular federal.\",\r\n            articulo50: \"Se divide el supremo poder de la federaci\u00f3n para su ejercicio en legislativo, ejecutivo y judicial.\",\r\n            totalArticulos: \"171\",\r\n            vigencia: \"1824-1835\",\r\n            caracter: \"Federalista\",\r\n            formaGobierno: \"Rep\u00fablica federal representativa\",\r\n            religion: \"Cat\u00f3lica (oficial y \u00fanica)\",\r\n            derechos: \"Limitados, sin garant\u00edas individuales expl\u00edcitas\",\r\n            innovacion: \"Divisi\u00f3n de poderes y federalismo\",\r\n            color: \"#1976D2\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"1836\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Siete Leyes Constitucionales\",\r\n            subtitulo: \"R\u00e9gimen Centralista (1836-1846)\",\r\n            articulo1: \"La Naci\u00f3n Mexicana se compone de todos los mexicanos. Es libre e independiente.\",\r\n            articulo3: \"La religi\u00f3n de la Naci\u00f3n Mexicana es la cat\u00f3lica, apost\u00f3lica, romana. El Estado la protege.\",\r\n            articulo4: \"El gobierno de la Naci\u00f3n ser\u00e1 popular, representativo, alternativo y responsable.\",\r\n            articulo50: \"El Supremo Poder Conservador vigila que los otros poderes no excedan sus l\u00edmites.\",\r\n            totalArticulos: \"7 leyes (no art\u00edculos)\",\r\n            vigencia: \"1836-1846\",\r\n            caracter: \"Centralista\",\r\n            formaGobierno: \"Rep\u00fablica central representativa\",\r\n            religion: \"Cat\u00f3lica (oficial y \u00fanica)\",\r\n            derechos: \"Muy limitados, supremac\u00eda del Estado\",\r\n            innovacion: \"Supremo Poder Conservador (4\u00ba poder)\",\r\n            color: \"#D32F2F\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"1857\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Constituci\u00f3n Federal de 1857\",\r\n            subtitulo: \"Reforma Liberal\",\r\n            articulo1: \"El pueblo mexicano reconoce que los derechos del hombre son la base y el objeto de las instituciones sociales.\",\r\n            articulo3: \"La ense\u00f1anza es libre. La ley determinar\u00e1 qu\u00e9 profesiones necesitan t\u00edtulo para su ejercicio.\",\r\n            articulo4: \"Todo hombre es libre para abrazar la profesi\u00f3n, industria o trabajo que le acomode.\",\r\n            articulo50: \"El Supremo Poder de la Federaci\u00f3n se divide para su ejercicio en Legislativo, Ejecutivo y Judicial.\",\r\n            totalArticulos: \"128\",\r\n            vigencia: \"1857-1917\",\r\n            caracter: \"Liberal federalista\",\r\n            formaGobierno: \"Rep\u00fablica federal representativa\",\r\n            religion: \"Libertad de cultos (Estado laico)\",\r\n            derechos: \"Garant\u00edas individuales extensas\",\r\n            innovacion: \"Juicio de amparo, Estado laico\",\r\n            color: \"#388E3C\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"1917\": {\r\n            nombre: \"Constituci\u00f3n Pol\u00edtica de 1917\",\r\n            subtitulo: \"Revolucionaria (vigente)\",\r\n            articulo1: \"En los Estados Unidos Mexicanos todas las personas gozar\u00e1n de los derechos humanos reconocidos en esta Constituci\u00f3n.\",\r\n            articulo3: \"La educaci\u00f3n ser\u00e1 laica y gratuita. La educaci\u00f3n preescolar, primaria y secundaria conforman la educaci\u00f3n b\u00e1sica obligatoria.\",\r\n            articulo4: \"El var\u00f3n y la mujer son iguales ante la ley. Toda persona tiene derecho a la protecci\u00f3n de la salud.\",\r\n            articulo50: \"El Supremo Poder de la Uni\u00f3n se divide para su ejercicio en Legislativo, Ejecutivo y Judicial.\",\r\n            totalArticulos: \"136\",\r\n            vigencia: \"1917-actualidad\",\r\n            caracter: \"Social revolucionaria\",\r\n            formaGobierno: \"Rep\u00fablica federal representativa\",\r\n            religion: \"Libertad de cultos (Estado laico)\",\r\n            derechos: \"Derechos humanos y sociales\",\r\n            innovacion: \"Derechos sociales (trabajo, tierra, educaci\u00f3n)\",\r\n            color: \"#FF6F00\"\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    function cambiarConstitucion() {\r\n        const constitucionId = document.getElementById('constitucionSelect').value;\r\n        const constitucion = constituciones[constitucionId];\r\n        \r\n        if (!constitucion) return;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar interfaz\r\n        document.getElementById('tituloConstitucion').textContent = constitucion.nombre;\r\n        document.getElementById('subtituloConstitucion').textContent = constitucion.subtitulo;\r\n        document.getElementById('articulo1').textContent = constitucion.articulo1;\r\n        document.getElementById('articulo3').textContent = constitucion.articulo3;\r\n        document.getElementById('articulo4').textContent = constitucion.articulo4;\r\n        document.getElementById('articulo50').textContent = constitucion.articulo50;\r\n        document.getElementById('totalArticulos').textContent = constitucion.totalArticulos;\r\n        document.getElementById('vigenciaConstitucion').textContent = constitucion.vigencia;\r\n        document.getElementById('caracterConstitucion').textContent = constitucion.caracter;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n        document.getElementById('dataConstitucion').textContent = constitucionId;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataGobierno').textContent = constitucion.formaGobierno;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataReligion').textContent = constitucion.religion;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataInnovacion').textContent = constitucion.innovacion;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataDerechos').textContent = constitucion.derechos;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataDuracion').textContent = constitucion.vigencia.split('-')[1] === \"actualidad\" ? \"100+ a\u00f1os\" : constitucion.vigencia;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar informaci\u00f3n\r\n        const infoTextos = {\r\n            \"1824\": \"\ud83d\udcdc CONSTITUCI\u00d3N DE 1824: Primera constituci\u00f3n formal. Rep\u00fablica federal (19 estados). Religi\u00f3n cat\u00f3lica oficial. Influencia de la Constituci\u00f3n de EE.UU. Vigente 1824-1835.\",\r\n            \"1836\": \"\ud83d\udcdc SIETE LEYES (1836): Constituci\u00f3n centralista. Cre\u00f3 el Supremo Poder Conservador (4\u00ba poder). 24 departamentos en lugar de estados. Mayor poder ejecutivo. Vigente 1836-1846.\",\r\n            \"1857\": \"\ud83d\udcdc CONSTITUCI\u00d3N DE 1857: Triunfo liberal. Garant\u00edas individuales, Estado laico, juicio de amparo. Prohibici\u00f3n de fueros, libertad de ense\u00f1anza. Vigente 1857-1917.\",\r\n            \"1917\": \"\ud83d\udcdc CONSTITUCI\u00d3N DE 1917: Primera constituci\u00f3n social del mundo. Art. 27 (tierra), 123 (trabajo), 3 (educaci\u00f3n). Mantiene estructura de 1857 con derechos sociales. Vigente hoy.\"\r\n        };\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('infoConstitucion').textContent = infoTextos[constitucionId] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\";\r\n        document.getElementById('infoConstitucion').style.animation = \"highlight 0.5s\";\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcdc Constituci\u00f3n seleccionada: ${constitucion.nombre}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function compararConstituciones() {\r\n        const checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"temas\"]:checked');\r\n        const temas = Array.from(checkboxes).map(cb => cb.value);\r\n        const constitucionId = document.getElementById('constitucionSelect').value;\r\n        const constitucion = constituciones[constitucionId];\r\n        \r\n        let comparativa = `\ud83d\udd0d COMPARATIVA CONSTITUCIONAL (${constitucion.nombre}):\\n\\n`;\r\n        \r\n        if (temas.includes('forma-gobierno')) {\r\n            comparativa += `\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f FORMA DE GOBIERNO: ${constitucion.formaGobierno}\\n`;\r\n        }\r\n        if (temas.includes('religion')) {\r\n            comparativa += `\u26ea RELIGI\u00d3N: ${constitucion.religion}\\n`;\r\n        }\r\n        if (temas.includes('derechos')) {\r\n            comparativa += `\u2696\ufe0f DERECHOS: ${constitucion.derechos}\\n`;\r\n        }\r\n        if (temas.includes('reeleccion')) {\r\n            comparativa += `\ud83d\udd04 REELEXI\u00d3N: ${constitucionId === \"1857\" ? \"Prohibida\" : \"No regulada\"}\\n`;\r\n        }\r\n        if (temas.includes('propiedad')) {\r\n            comparativa += `\ud83c\udfe0 PROPIEDAD: ${constitucionId === \"1917\" ? \"Funci\u00f3n social\" : \"Propiedad privada\"}\\n`;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        comparativa += \"\\n\ud83d\udca1 Cada constituci\u00f3n refleja el contexto hist\u00f3rico de su \u00e9poca.\";\r\n        \r\n        alert(comparativa);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarEvolucion() {\r\n        const evolucion = `\r\n\ud83d\udcc8 EVOLUCI\u00d3N CONSTITUCIONAL MEXICANA:\r\n\r\n1824: \ud83d\udc76 NACIMIENTO\r\n\u2022 Primer intento organizativo\r\n\u2022 Federalismo copiado de EE.UU.\r\n\u2022 Religi\u00f3n cat\u00f3lica oficial\r\n\r\n1836: \ud83d\udd04 REACCI\u00d3N\r\n\u2022 Centralismo conservador\r\n\u2022 Supremo Poder Conservador\r\n\u2022 Mayor control estatal\r\n\r\n1857: \u2696\ufe0f RUPTURA\r\n\u2022 Estado laico\r\n\u2022 Garant\u00edas individuales\r\n\u2022 Liberalismo triunfante\r\n\r\n1917: \ud83d\ude80 REVOLUCI\u00d3N\r\n\u2022 Derechos sociales\r\n\u2022 Soberan\u00eda sobre recursos\r\n\u2022 Educaci\u00f3n laica y gratuita\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcca TENDENCIA: Mayor inclusi\u00f3n de derechos y participaci\u00f3n popular.\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        alert(evolucion);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ L\u00cdNEA DE TIEMPO INTERACTIVA\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    const etapasInfo = {\r\n        imperio: {\r\n            nombre: \"IMPERIO MEXICANO\",\r\n            periodo: \"1822-1823\",\r\n            duracion: \"11 meses\",\r\n            descripcion: \"Iturbide se corona Agust\u00edn I. Monarqu\u00eda constitucional ef\u00edmera.\",\r\n            color: \"#FFB300\"\r\n        },\r\n        republica: {\r\n            nombre: \"REP\u00daBLICA FEDERAL\",\r\n            periodo: \"1824-1835\",\r\n            duracion: \"11 a\u00f1os\",\r\n            descripcion: \"Constituci\u00f3n de 1824. Guadalupe Victoria primer presidente.\",\r\n            color: \"#1976D2\"\r\n        },\r\n        centralismo: {\r\n            nombre: \"CENTRALISMO\",\r\n            periodo: \"1835-1846\",\r\n            duracion: \"11 a\u00f1os\",\r\n            descripcion: \"Siete Leyes de 1836. 24 departamentos en lugar de estados.\",\r\n            color: \"#D32F2F\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"guerra-eeuu\": {\r\n            nombre: \"GUERRA M\u00c9XICO-EE.UU.\",\r\n            periodo: \"1846-1848\",\r\n            duracion: \"2 a\u00f1os\",\r\n            descripcion: \"P\u00e9rdida del 55% territorio. Tratado Guadalupe Hidalgo.\",\r\n            color: \"#7B1FA2\"\r\n        },\r\n        reforma: {\r\n            nombre: \"REFORMA LIBERAL\",\r\n            periodo: \"1855-1861\",\r\n            duracion: \"6 a\u00f1os\",\r\n            descripcion: \"Leyes de Reforma, Constituci\u00f3n 1857, Estado laico.\",\r\n            color: \"#388E3C\"\r\n        },\r\n        intervencion: {\r\n            nombre: \"INTERVENCI\u00d3N FRANCESA\",\r\n            periodo: \"1862-1867\",\r\n            duracion: \"5 a\u00f1os\",\r\n            descripcion: \"Segundo Imperio con Maximiliano. Batalla del 5 de Mayo.\",\r\n            color: \"#0097A7\"\r\n        },\r\n        porfiriato: {\r\n            nombre: \"PORFIRIATO\",\r\n            periodo: \"1876-1911\",\r\n            duracion: \"35 a\u00f1os\",\r\n            descripcion: \"Dictadura de Porfirio D\u00edaz. Modernizaci\u00f3n y desigualdad.\",\r\n            color: \"#FF6F00\"\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.timeline-btn').forEach(btn => {\r\n        btn.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const etapa = this.dataset.etapa;\r\n            mostrarDetalleEtapa(etapa);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Resaltar en timeline\r\n            document.querySelectorAll('.etapa-bar').forEach(bar => {\r\n                bar.classList.remove('active');\r\n            });\r\n            document.querySelector(`.etapa-bar[data-etapa=\"${etapa}\"]`).classList.add('active');\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarDetalleEtapa(etapa) {\r\n        const info = etapasInfo[etapa];\r\n        if (!info) return;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar todos los detalles\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.etapa-detalle').forEach(detalle => {\r\n            detalle.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar el detalle correspondiente\r\n        const detalle = document.getElementById(`detalle${etapa.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + etapa.slice(1)}`);\r\n        if (detalle) {\r\n            detalle.style.display = 'block';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar informaci\u00f3n\r\n        document.getElementById('timelineInfo').innerHTML = `\r\n            <strong>${info.nombre}<\/strong> (${info.periodo})<br>\r\n            ${info.descripcion}<br>\r\n            <small>Duraci\u00f3n: ${info.duracion}<\/small>\r\n        `;\r\n        document.getElementById('timelineInfo').style.animation = \"highlight 0.5s\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Cambiar color de la barra\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.timeline-btn').forEach(btn => {\r\n            btn.style.background = '';\r\n        });\r\n        document.querySelector(`[data-etapa=\"${etapa}\"]`).style.background = info.color;\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcc5 Etapa seleccionada: ${info.nombre}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    let quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n    \r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n            \r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            verificarCompletadoQuiz();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    function verificarCompletadoQuiz() {\r\n        const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n        const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q => \r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n        \r\n        if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n        const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n        \r\n        let feedback = \"\";\r\n        if (porcentaje >= 80) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas el M\u00e9xico independiente.\";\r\n        } else if (porcentaje >= 60) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero revisa las etapas de crisis.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas repasar el siglo XIX mexicano.\";\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        quizRespuestas = [];\r\n        quizCompletado = false;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n        const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n        const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n        \r\n        const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n        \r\n        alert(`\ud83d\udcca AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Etapas hist\u00f3ricas: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Conflictos ideol\u00f3gicos: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Evaluaci\u00f3n proyectos: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Revisa el plan de estudio recomendado seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcbe AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada: ${slider1}, ${slider2}, ${slider3}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Sistema Cyberpunk Independiente inicializado\");\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\udcda Lecci\u00f3n: M\u00e9xico Independiente (1821-1910)\");\r\n    console.log(\"\u26a1 Simulador constitucional, Timeline y Quiz listos\");\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar simulador\r\n    cambiarConstitucion();\r\n    mostrarDetalleEtapa('imperio');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Objetivos interactivos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n            this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n            const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n            checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n            checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : '';\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Modelos interactivos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.modelo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const modelo = this.querySelector('h4').textContent;\r\n            \r\n            const modelosInfo = {\r\n                \"CONSERVADORES\": \"\ud83d\udc51 CONSERVADORES: Mantener privilegios coloniales. Monarqu\u00eda\/centralismo. Uni\u00f3n Iglesia-Estado. Proteccionismo econ\u00f3mico. Base social: Iglesia, ej\u00e9rcito, terratenientes.\",\r\n                \"LIBERALES MODERADOS\": \"\u2696\ufe0f LIBERALES MODERADOS: Reformas graduales. Rep\u00fablica federal. Separaci\u00f3n relativa Iglesia-Estado. Libre comercio moderado. Base: clase media urbana.\",\r\n                \"LIBERALES PUROS\": \"\ud83d\udd25 LIBERALES PUROS: Transformaci\u00f3n radical. Rep\u00fablica laica federal. Separaci\u00f3n total Iglesia-Estado. Libre comercio absoluto. Garant\u00edas individuales. Base: intelectuales, artesanos.\",\r\n                \"CIENT\u00cdFICOS\": \"\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f CIENT\u00cdFICOS: Modernizaci\u00f3n autoritaria. Rep\u00fablica centralizada de facto. Estado fuerte, Iglesia controlada. Capitalismo dependiente. 'Orden y Progreso'. Base: empresarios, extranjeros.\"\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            alert(`${modelo}\\n\\n${modelosInfo[modelo] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\"}`);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Problemas de examen\r\n    function verificarProblema(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Estad\u00edsticas interactivas\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.estadistica-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const valor = this.querySelector('.estadistica-valor').textContent;\r\n            const label = this.querySelector('.estadistica-label').textContent;\r\n            \r\n            const datosInfo = {\r\n                \"50\": \"50 gobiernos en 89 a\u00f1os (1821-1910). Promedio: 1.8 a\u00f1os por gobierno. Inestabilidad cr\u00f3nica.\",\r\n                \"55%\": \"55% territorio perdido (2.3 millones km\u00b2). Incluye California, Texas, Arizona, Nuevo M\u00e9xico, Nevada, Utah, Colorado, Wyoming.\",\r\n                \"3\": \"3 constituciones en siglo XIX: 1824 (federal), 1836 (centralista), 1857 (liberal). La de 1917 completa el ciclo.\",\r\n                \"20,000\": \"20,000 km de ferrocarril construidos 1876-1910. Red que integr\u00f3 econ\u00f3micamente al pa\u00eds.\",\r\n                \"35\": \"35 a\u00f1os de Porfiriato (1876-1911). Estabilidad autoritaria m\u00e1s larga en M\u00e9xico independiente.\",\r\n                \"90%\": \"90% analfabetismo en 1910. A pesar de modernizaci\u00f3n, educaci\u00f3n solo para elites.\"\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            this.style.animation = \"pulse 0.5s\";\r\n            setTimeout(() => {\r\n                this.style.animation = \"\";\r\n            }, 500);\r\n            \r\n            console.log(`\ud83d\udcca Dato estad\u00edstico: ${valor} ${label}`);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto de pulse para animaciones\r\n    const style = document.createElement('style');\r\n    style.textContent = `\r\n        @keyframes pulse {\r\n            0% { transform: scale(1); }\r\n            50% { transform: scale(1.05); }\r\n            100% { transform: scale(1); }\r\n        }\r\n    `;\r\n    document.head.appendChild(style);\r\n    <\/script>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Duraci\u00f3n Imperio Iturbide","respuesta":"1 a\u00f1o (1822-1823)"},{"enunciado":"P\u00e9rdida territorial 1848","respuesta":"2.3 millones km\u00b2"},{"enunciado":"Autor Leyes de Reforma","respuesta":"Benito Ju\u00e1rez"},{"enunciado":"Duraci\u00f3n Porfiriato","respuesta":"35 a\u00f1os (1876-1911)"},{"enunciado":"Constituci\u00f3n federal","respuesta":"1824"},{"enunciado":"Batalla 5 de Mayo","respuesta":"1862, Puebla"},{"enunciado":"Emperador franc\u00e9s","respuesta":"Maximiliano"},{"enunciado":"Lema Porfiriato","respuesta":"Orden y Progreso"},{"enunciado":"Tratado final guerra EE.UU.","respuesta":"Guadalupe Hidalgo"},{"enunciado":"Ley Lerdo","respuesta":"Desamortizaci\u00f3n 1856"},{"enunciado":"N\u00famero de gobiernos 1821-1910","respuesta":"~50"},{"enunciado":"SI: a\u00f1os Rep\u00fablica Restaurada","respuesta":"1867-1876"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Primer emperador","opciones":["Iturbide","Santa Anna","Ju\u00e1rez","D\u00edaz"],"correcta":"Iturbide"},{"pregunta":"Constituci\u00f3n 1824","opciones":["Federal","Centralista","Imperial","Socialista"],"correcta":"Federal"},{"pregunta":"Guerra EE.UU.","opciones":["1846-1848","1862-1867","1910-1920","1810-1821"],"correcta":"1846-1848"},{"pregunta":"P\u00e9rdida territorial","opciones":["55%","10%","80%","0%"],"correcta":"55%"},{"pregunta":"Leyes de Reforma","opciones":["1857-1860","1824","1917","1521"],"correcta":"1857-1860"},{"pregunta":"5 de Mayo","opciones":["1862","1867","1847","1910"],"correcta":"1862"},{"pregunta":"Emperador ejecutado","opciones":["Maximiliano","Iturbide","D\u00edaz","Ju\u00e1rez"],"correcta":"Maximiliano"},{"pregunta":"Porfiriato inici\u00f3","opciones":["1876","1821","1857","1910"],"correcta":"1876"},{"pregunta":"Lema D\u00edaz","opciones":["Orden y Progreso","Tierra y Libertad","Sufragio efectivo","Paz"],"correcta":"Orden y Progreso"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: a\u00f1os Independencia","opciones":["204","200","215","300"],"correcta":"204"},{"pregunta":"Santa Anna presidente","opciones":["11 veces","1","2","7"],"correcta":"11 veces"},{"pregunta":"Constituci\u00f3n 1857","opciones":["Liberal","Conservadora","Imperial","Social"],"correcta":"Liberal"},{"pregunta":"Ju\u00e1rez ind\u00edgena","opciones":["Zapoteco","Maya","Azteca","Espa\u00f1ol"],"correcta":"Zapoteco"},{"pregunta":"Ferrocarriles Porfiriato","opciones":["24,000 km","1,000","100,000","0"],"correcta":"24,000 km"},{"pregunta":"Hacienda en Porfiriato","opciones":["Latifundio","Ejido","Comunidad","F\u00e1brica"],"correcta":"Latifundio"},{"pregunta":"Inversi\u00f3n extranjera","opciones":["EE.UU., Inglaterra","Solo M\u00e9xico","Francia","Espa\u00f1a"],"correcta":"EE.UU., Inglaterra"},{"pregunta":"Batalla de Puebla","opciones":["Victoria mexicana","Derrota","Empate","No ocurri\u00f3"],"correcta":"Victoria mexicana"},{"pregunta":"Tratado McLane-Ocampo","opciones":["1859 (no ratificado)","1848","1821","1917"],"correcta":"1859 (no ratificado)"},{"pregunta":"Rep\u00fablica Restaurada","opciones":["1867-1876","1824-1835","1911-1917","1857"],"correcta":"1867-1876"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: estados en 1824","opciones":["19","31","32","24"],"correcta":"19"},{"pregunta":"Grito de Dolores","opciones":["1810","1821","1910","1857"],"correcta":"1810"},{"pregunta":"Plan de Iguala","opciones":["1821","1810","1911","1857"],"correcta":"1821"},{"pregunta":"Texas se independiz\u00f3","opciones":["1836","1821","1845","1910"],"correcta":"1836"},{"pregunta":"Gadsden Purchase","opciones":["1853","1848","1821","1917"],"correcta":"1853"},{"pregunta":"Intervenci\u00f3n francesa","opciones":["1862-1867","1846-1848","1910-1920","1810-1821"],"correcta":"1862-1867"},{"pregunta":"Ejecutado en Quer\u00e9taro","opciones":["Maximiliano","Iturbide","D\u00edaz","Madero"],"correcta":"Maximiliano"},{"pregunta":"Porfiriato termin\u00f3","opciones":["1911","1910","1920","1876"],"correcta":"1911"},{"pregunta":"Cient\u00edficos","opciones":["Asesores D\u00edaz","Revolucionarios","Ind\u00edgenas","Sacerdotes"],"correcta":"Asesores D\u00edaz"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: a\u00f1os Reforma","opciones":["168","200","100","50"],"correcta":"168"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico 1910","opciones":["Centenario + Revoluci\u00f3n","Independencia","Reforma","Nada"],"correcta":"Centenario + Revoluci\u00f3n"}]},{"materia":"Historia de M\u00e9xico","slug":"revolucion-mexicana-cyberpunk","titulo":"Revoluci\u00f3n Mexicana: Madero, Villa, Zapata y la Constituci\u00f3n de 1917 (1910-1920)","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-historia-revolucion\" data-tema=\"revolucion-mexicana\">\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u26a1<\/span> REVOLUCI\u00d3N MEXICANA CYBERPUNK\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            <strong>10 a\u00f1os de lucha<\/strong> que transformaron a M\u00e9xico: <strong>1.5M de muertos<\/strong>, <strong>20M de hect\u00e1reas repartidas<\/strong> y una <strong>Constituci\u00f3n social<\/strong>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE MISI\u00d3N\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Identificar facciones y l\u00edderes<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Madero, Villa, Zapata, Carranza y sus proyectos pol\u00edticos.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar la Constituci\u00f3n de 1917<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Art\u00edculos 3, 27 y 123: educaci\u00f3n, tierra y trabajo.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Simular el Plan de Ayala<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Usar el mapa interactivo de la reforma agraria.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Reflexionar sobre el legado<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Impacto en la M\u00e9xico moderno y el muralismo.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL (2025) -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> CONTEXTO HIST\u00d3RICO (2025)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 115 A\u00f1os del Inicio<\/h3>\r\n                <p>En <strong>2025<\/strong> se conmemoran <strong>115 a\u00f1os<\/strong> del inicio de la Revoluci\u00f3n (20 nov 1910).<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">1.5 millones de muertos (10% de la poblaci\u00f3n)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf3e Reforma Agraria<\/h3>\r\n                <p><strong>20 millones de hect\u00e1reas<\/strong> repartidas entre 1915-1940.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">90% de la poblaci\u00f3n era rural en 1910<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfa8 Legado Cultural<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Inspir\u00f3 al <strong>muralismo<\/strong> (Rivera, Orozco, Siqueiros) y al cine revolucionario.<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">+100 pel\u00edculas sobre la Revoluci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdc<\/span> CRONOLOG\u00cdA REVOLUCIONARIA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FACCIONES Y L\u00cdDERES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Facciones y L\u00edderes (1910-1920)<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"facciones-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"faccion-card maderista\">\r\n                    <div class=\"faccion-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"faccion-icon\">\ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>MADERISTAS<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"faccion-subtitulo\">\"Sufragio efectivo, no reelecci\u00f3n\"<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"faccion-datos\">\r\n                        <p><strong>L\u00edder:<\/strong> Francisco I. Madero.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Base:<\/strong> Clase media, intelectuales.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Objetivo:<\/strong> Democracia, fin al porfiriato.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Fin:<\/strong> Asesinado en 1913 (Decena Tr\u00e1gica).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"faccion-dato\">\ud83d\udcc5 1910-1913<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"faccion-card villista\">\r\n                    <div class=\"faccion-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"faccion-icon\">\ud83d\udc0e<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>VILLISTAS<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"faccion-subtitulo\">Divisi\u00f3n del Norte<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"faccion-datos\">\r\n                        <p><strong>L\u00edder:<\/strong> Francisco Villa.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Base:<\/strong> Campesinos del norte (Chihuahua, Durango).<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Objetivo:<\/strong> Justicia social, reparto de tierras.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Fin:<\/strong> Derrotado en 1915, asesinado en 1923.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"faccion-dato\">\ud83c\udfdc\ufe0f Norte de M\u00e9xico<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"faccion-card zapatista\">\r\n                    <div class=\"faccion-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"faccion-icon\">\ud83c\udf3e<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>ZAPATISTAS<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"faccion-subtitulo\">Ej\u00e9rcito Libertador del Sur<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"faccion-datos\">\r\n                        <p><strong>L\u00edder:<\/strong> Emiliano Zapata.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Base:<\/strong> Campesinos de Morelos.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Objetivo:<\/strong> \"Tierra y Libertad\" (Plan de Ayala).<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Fin:<\/strong> Asesinado en 1919 (traici\u00f3n en Chinameca).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"faccion-dato\">\ud83c\udf3f Morelos<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"faccion-card carrancista\">\r\n                    <div class=\"faccion-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"faccion-icon\">\ud83d\udcdc<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>CARRANCISTAS<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"faccion-subtitulo\">Constitucionalistas<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"faccion-datos\">\r\n                        <p><strong>L\u00edder:<\/strong> Venustiano Carranza.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Base:<\/strong> Burgues\u00eda, clase media, intelectuales.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Objetivo:<\/strong> Orden constitucional, modernizaci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Fin:<\/strong> Promulg\u00f3 Constituci\u00f3n de 1917, asesinado en 1920.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"faccion-dato\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Gobierno constitucional<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- LINEA DEL TIEMPO INTERACTIVA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. L\u00ednea del Tiempo (1910-1920)<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"timeline-revolucion\">\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-ano=\"1910\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-marker\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd25 20 Nov 1910: Inicio de la Revoluci\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Madero lanza el <strong>Plan de San Luis<\/strong> contra Porfirio D\u00edaz.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-dato\">\ud83d\udcdc \"Sufragio efectivo, no reelecci\u00f3n\"<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-ano=\"1911\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-marker\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f May 1911: Ca\u00edda de D\u00edaz<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Porfirio D\u00edaz renuncia y huye a Francia. <strong>Madero asume la presidencia<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-dato\">\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f Triunfo maderista<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-ano=\"1913\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-marker\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\r\n                        <h4>\u2620\ufe0f Feb 1913: Decena Tr\u00e1gica<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Madero es <strong>asesinado<\/strong> por Victoriano Huerta. Inicia la lucha armada.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-dato\">\ud83d\udc80 Fin del maderismo<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-ano=\"1914\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-marker\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83e\udd1d 1914: Alianza Villa-Zapata<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Villa y Zapata toman la <strong>Ciudad de M\u00e9xico<\/strong>. Huerta huye.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-dato\">\ud83c\udfc6 Victoria temporal<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-ano=\"1915\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-marker\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udca5 1915: Batalla de Celaya<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Carranza derrota a Villa con apoyo de <strong>\u00c1lvaro Obreg\u00f3n<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-dato\">\ud83c\udfaf Fin del villismo<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-ano=\"1917\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-marker\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udcdc 5 Feb 1917: Constituci\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Se promulga la <strong>Constituci\u00f3n de 1917<\/strong> en Quer\u00e9taro.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-dato\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Art. 3, 27, 123<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-ano=\"1919\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-marker\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\r\n                        <h4>\u2620\ufe0f 10 Abr 1919: Muerte de Zapata<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Emiliano Zapata es <strong>asesinado<\/strong> en Chinameca por Carranza.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-dato\">\ud83c\udf3e Fin del zapatismo<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-item\" data-ano=\"1920\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-marker\"><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udfc1 1920: Fin de la Revoluci\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n                        <p>Carranza es derrotado y asesinado. <strong>\u00c1lvaro Obreg\u00f3n<\/strong> asume la presidencia.<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-dato\">\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f Inicio de la reconstrucci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- CONSTITUCI\u00d3N DE 1917 -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Constituci\u00f3n de 1917: Logros Sociales<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"constitucion-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"articulo-card art3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"articulo-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"articulo-icon\">\ud83c\udf93<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Art\u00edculo 3<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"articulo-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Educaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Laica, gratuita y obligatoria.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Objetivo:<\/strong> Combatir el analfabetismo (70% en 1910).<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Impacto:<\/strong> Base del sistema educativo actual.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"articulo-dato\">\ud83d\udcda 70% \u2192 30% analfabetismo (1940)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"articulo-card art27\">\r\n                    <div class=\"articulo-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"articulo-icon\">\ud83c\udf3e<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Art\u00edculo 27<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"articulo-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Tierra:<\/strong> Naci\u00f3n due\u00f1a del subsuelo, creaci\u00f3n de <strong>ejidos<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Objetivo:<\/strong> Acabar con los latifundios (1% pose\u00eda 97% de la tierra).<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Impacto:<\/strong> 20M de hect\u00e1reas repartidas.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"articulo-dato\">\ud83c\udf0d 97% \u2192 40% latifundios (1940)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"articulo-card art123\">\r\n                    <div class=\"articulo-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"articulo-icon\">\u2692\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Art\u00edculo 123<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"articulo-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Trabajo:<\/strong> Jornada de 8 horas, derecho a huelga, salario m\u00ednimo.<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Objetivo:<\/strong> Mejorar condiciones laborales (12-16 horas diarias).<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Impacto:<\/strong> Base de los derechos laborales actuales.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"articulo-dato\">\u23f0 16h \u2192 8h jornada laboral<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- PLAN DE AYALA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Plan de Ayala (28 Nov 1911)<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-ayala-container\">\r\n                <div class=\"plan-ayala-texto\">\r\n                    <p><strong>Autor:<\/strong> Emiliano Zapata.<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Contexto:<\/strong> Madero no cumpli\u00f3 con el reparto de tierras.<\/p>\r\n                    <p><strong>Demandas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Restituci\u00f3n de tierras<\/strong> a pueblos (despojadas por hacendados).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Expropiaci\u00f3n<\/strong> de tierras a enemigos de la Revoluci\u00f3n.<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Muerte a traidores<\/strong> (incluyendo a Madero).<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <p><strong>Legado:<\/strong> Inspir\u00f3 el <strong>Art\u00edculo 27<\/strong> constitucional.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-ayala-visual\">\r\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 200\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#1B5E20\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"150\" y=\"30\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">PLAN DE AYALA<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"150\" y=\"55\" fill=\"#E8F5E9\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">28 NOV 1911<\/text>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Tierra -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"50\" y=\"80\" width=\"200\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#388E3C\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"150\" y=\"100\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">TIERRA<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"150\" y=\"120\" fill=\"#E8F5E9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Restituci\u00f3n a pueblos<\/text>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Expropiaci\u00f3n -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"50\" y=\"130\" width=\"200\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#D32F2F\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"150\" y=\"150\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">EXPROPIACI\u00d3N<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"150\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A hacendados<\/text>\r\n                    <\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO: REPARTO AGRARIO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR: REPARTO AGRARIO (1915-1940)\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"reparto-agrario\">\r\n            <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>\u2699\ufe0f CONTROLES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"regionSelect\">Regi\u00f3n:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"regionSelect\" class=\"control-input\">\r\n                        <option value=\"morelos\">Morelos (Zapata)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"chihuahua\">Chihuahua (Villa)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"nacional\">Nacional (Carranza)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"ejido\">Ejido modelo<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"anioReparto\">A\u00f1o:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" id=\"anioReparto\" min=\"1910\" max=\"1940\" value=\"1917\" class=\"control-slider\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>1910<\/span>\r\n                        <span>1940<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-iniciar\" onclick=\"iniciarSimuladorReparto()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u25b6\ufe0f<\/span> INICIAR SIMULACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-reiniciar\" onclick=\"reiniciarSimuladorReparto()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> REINICIAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <div class=\"mapa-reparto-container\">\r\n                    <svg id=\"svgRepartoAgrario\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 500\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n                        <!-- Fondo -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- T\u00edtulo -->\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"40\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" font-size=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">REPARTO AGRARIO (1915-1940)<\/text>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Leyenda -->\r\n                        <rect x=\"50\" y=\"450\" width=\"700\" height=\"40\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.7)\" rx=\"5\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"400\" y=\"475\" fill=\"#E0E0E0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"leyendaReparto\">Selecciona una regi\u00f3n y a\u00f1o<\/text>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Hacienda (antes) -->\r\n                        <g id=\"hacienda\" class=\"reparto-elemento\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"100\" y=\"100\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#D32F2F\" rx=\"10\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"140\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">HACIENDA<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1 familia<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"200\" y=\"200\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10,000 hect\u00e1reas<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Pueblo (despu\u00e9s) -->\r\n                        <g id=\"pueblo\" class=\"reparto-elemento\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"300\" y=\"100\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#388E3C\" rx=\"10\" opacity=\"0.7\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"400\" y=\"140\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">EJIDO<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"400\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#E8F5E9\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100 familias<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"400\" y=\"200\" fill=\"#E8F5E9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1,000 hect\u00e1reas<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Datos -->\r\n                        <g id=\"datosReparto\" class=\"reparto-elemento\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"550\" y=\"100\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.5)\" rx=\"10\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"650\" y=\"130\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"textoRegion\">\u2014<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"650\" y=\"160\" fill=\"#E0E0E0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"textoAnio\">\u2014<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"650\" y=\"190\" fill=\"#E0E0E0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"textoHectareas\">\u2014<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"650\" y=\"220\" fill=\"#E0E0E0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"textoBeneficiarios\">\u2014<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"650\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#FF9800\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" id=\"textoImpacto\">\u2014<\/text>\r\n                        <\/g>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Flecha de transformaci\u00f3n -->\r\n                        <path id=\"flechaReparto\" d=\"M300,175 L350,175\" stroke=\"#4CAF50\" stroke-width=\"4\" marker-end=\"url(#flecha)\" opacity=\"0\">\r\n                            <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" dur=\"1s\" begin=\"indefinite\" fill=\"freeze\"\/>\r\n                        <\/path>\r\n                    <\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca DATOS DEL REPARTO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Regi\u00f3n:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataRegion\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">A\u00f1o:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataAnioSim\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Hect\u00e1reas repartidas:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataHectareas\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Beneficiarios:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataBeneficiarios\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Impacto:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataImpactoSim\">\u2014<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: \u00bfCU\u00c1NTO SABES?\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 lema asociamos con Emiliano Zapata?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        \"Sufragio efectivo, no reelecci\u00f3n\"\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        \"Tierra y Libertad\"\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        \"La tierra es de quien la trabaja\"\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        \"Viva M\u00e9xico, hijos de la chingada\"\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> \"Tierra y Libertad\" fue el lema zapatista, inspirado en el <strong>Plan de Ayala (1911)<\/strong>.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la secci\u00f3n de \"Facciones y L\u00edderes\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Contexto:<\/strong> Zapata exig\u00eda la <strong>restituci\u00f3n de tierras<\/strong> a los pueblos, despojadas durante el porfiriato. Su lema reflejaba la demanda campesina por <strong>justicia agraria<\/strong>.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 estableci\u00f3 el Art\u00edculo 27 de la Constituci\u00f3n de 1917?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Educaci\u00f3n laica\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Derecho a huelga\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Propiedad nacional de tierras y subsuelo\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Jornada laboral de 12 horas\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> El <strong>Art\u00edculo 27<\/strong> declar\u00f3 que la tierra y el subsuelo son propiedad de la naci\u00f3n, permitiendo la <strong>expropiaci\u00f3n<\/strong> para reparto agrario.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa la secci\u00f3n \"Constituci\u00f3n de 1917\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Impacto:<\/strong> Este art\u00edculo fue la base legal para el <strong>reparto de 20 millones de hect\u00e1reas<\/strong> a campesinos (1915-1940).<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 evento marc\u00f3 el fin de la Revoluci\u00f3n?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Asesinato de Carranza (1920)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Muerte de Zapata (1919)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Promulgaci\u00f3n de la Constituci\u00f3n (1917)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Toma de la CDMX por Villa y Zapata (1914)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        <strong>\u2705 Correcto:<\/strong> El asesinato de <strong>Carranza en 1920<\/strong> marc\u00f3 el fin de la etapa armada y el inicio de la <strong>reconstrucci\u00f3n nacional<\/strong> con Obreg\u00f3n.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Consulta la l\u00ednea del tiempo en la secci\u00f3n te\u00f3rica.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- RESULTADOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                    Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                    Completa el quiz para ver tu desempe\u00f1o.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udd04 VOLVER A INTENTAR\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ERRORES COMUNES -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> MITOS Y REALIDADES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c \"La Revoluci\u00f3n fue solo contra Porfirio D\u00edaz\"<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Mito:<\/strong> \"Todo termin\u00f3 cuando D\u00edaz renunci\u00f3 en 1911\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Realidad:<\/strong> La Revoluci\u00f3n <strong>continu\u00f3 hasta 1920<\/strong> porque:\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Madero no cumpli\u00f3<\/strong> con el reparto de tierras.<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Huerta traicion\u00f3<\/strong> a Madero (1913).<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Los <strong>campesinos<\/strong> segu\u00edan sin tierra.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Los <strong>obreros<\/strong> exig\u00edan derechos laborales.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-grafica\">\r\n                        <div class=\"grafica-barras\">\r\n                            <div class=\"barra etapa1\" style=\"width: 10%;\">1910-1911<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"barra etapa2\" style=\"width: 90%;\">1913-1920<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"grafica-leyenda\">\r\n                            <span class=\"leyenda-etapa1\">\ud83d\udfe9 Contra D\u00edaz<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"leyenda-etapa2\">\ud83d\udfe5 Revoluci\u00f3n Social<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c \"Villa y Zapata eran aliados siempre\"<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Mito:<\/strong> \"Villa y Zapata lucharon juntos hasta el final\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Realidad:<\/strong> Solo fueron aliados <strong>brevemente (1914)<\/strong>:\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>1914:<\/strong> Toman la CDMX juntos.<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>1915:<\/strong> Carranza los derrota por separado.<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Zapata:<\/strong> Segu\u00eda luchando en Morelos.<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Villa:<\/strong> Se retir\u00f3 a Chihuahua.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-mapa\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 100\">\r\n                            <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#0a0a1a\"\/>\r\n                            <!-- Villa -->\r\n                            <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"50\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#D32F2F\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"80\" y=\"90\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Villa<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"80\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Chihuahua<\/text>\r\n                            <!-- Zapata -->\r\n                            <circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"50\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#388E3C\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"220\" y=\"90\" fill=\"#E8F5E9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Zapata<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"220\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#E8F5E9\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Morelos<\/text>\r\n                            <!-- CDMX -->\r\n                            <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"50\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF9800\"\/>\r\n                            <text x=\"150\" y=\"90\" fill=\"#FFE0B2\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">CDMX<\/text>\r\n                            <text x=\"150\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#FFE0B2\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1914<\/text>\r\n                            <!-- L\u00edneas -->\r\n                            <path d=\"M80,50 L140,50\" stroke=\"#D32F2F\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,1\"\/>\r\n                            <path d=\"M220,50 L160,50\" stroke=\"#388E3C\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,1\"\/>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"error-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\" onclick=\"toggleError(this)\">\r\n                    <h3>\u274c \"La Constituci\u00f3n de 1917 se aplic\u00f3 de inmediato\"<\/h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"error-toggle\">+<\/span>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <strong>Mito:<\/strong> \"Desde 1917, todos los mexicanos tuvieron derechos laborales y tierra\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-correccion\">\r\n                        <strong>Realidad:<\/strong> La aplicaci\u00f3n fue <strong>lenta y desigual<\/strong>:\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><strong>Art. 27:<\/strong> El reparto agrario tom\u00f3 <strong>25 a\u00f1os<\/strong> (hasta 1940).<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Art. 123:<\/strong> Muchos patrones <strong>ignoraron<\/strong> las leyes laborales.<\/li>\r\n                            <li><strong>Ejidos:<\/strong> Muchos fueron <strong>mal administrados<\/strong> o revertidos.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                        <div class=\"error-dato\">\u2696\ufe0f Solo el 30% de las tierras prometidas se repartieron antes de 1930.<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-grafica\">\r\n                        <div class=\"grafica-barras\">\r\n                            <div class=\"barra aplicado\" style=\"width: 30%;\">1917-1930<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"barra pendiente\" style=\"width: 70%;\">1930-1940<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"grafica-leyenda\">\r\n                            <span class=\"leyenda-aplicado\">\ud83d\udfe9 Aplicado<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"leyenda-pendiente\">\ud83d\udfe5 Pendiente<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> MISI\u00d3N FINAL: AN\u00c1LISIS CR\u00cdTICO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Comparaci\u00f3n de Proyectos Pol\u00edticos<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Compara los proyectos pol\u00edticos de <strong>Zapata<\/strong> (Plan de Ayala) y <strong>Carranza<\/strong> (Constituci\u00f3n de 1917) en:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li><strong>Base social.<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Demandas principales.<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>M\u00e9todos para lograrlo.<\/strong><\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Incluye <strong>2 diferencias clave<\/strong> y explica cu\u00e1l consideras m\u00e1s justo.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: Zapata representaba a los campesinos de Morelos y exig\u00eda la restituci\u00f3n inmediata de tierras, mientras que Carranza...\" rows=\"8\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VER SOLUCI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong>\r\n                    <table class=\"comparativa-table\">\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th><\/th>\r\n                            <th>Emiliano Zapata (1911)<\/th>\r\n                            <th>Venustiano Carranza (1917)<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>Base social<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Campesinos pobres de Morelos<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Burgues\u00eda, clase media, intelectuales<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>Demandas<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Restituci\u00f3n <strong>inmediata<\/strong> de tierras (Plan de Ayala)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Reforma agraria <strong>gradual<\/strong> (Art. 27)<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td><strong>M\u00e9todos<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Guerra de guerrillas, expropiaci\u00f3n directa<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Leyes, instituciones, ej\u00e9rcito constitucionalista<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/table>\r\n                    <p><strong>Diferencias clave:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li><strong>Inmediatez:<\/strong> Zapata quer\u00eda tierras <strong>ya<\/strong>; Carranza propuso un proceso legal.<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Enfoque:<\/strong> Zapata era <strong>radical<\/strong> (expropiaci\u00f3n); Carranza, <strong>institucional<\/strong>.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p><strong>Justicia:<\/strong> El proyecto de Zapata era m\u00e1s justo para los campesinos, pero menos viable pol\u00edticamente. Carranza logr\u00f3 <strong>estabilidad<\/strong>, pero con menos impacto social.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Debate: \u00bfFue la Revoluci\u00f3n un \u00e9xito?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Argumenta si la Revoluci\u00f3n Mexicana (1910-1920) cumpli\u00f3 sus objetivos originales, considerando:<\/p>\r\n                    <ol>\r\n                        <li>El <strong>Plan de Ayala<\/strong> (1911).<\/li>\r\n                        <li>La <strong>Constituci\u00f3n de 1917<\/strong>.<\/li>\r\n                        <li>El <strong>reparto agrario real<\/strong> (1915-1940).<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ol>\r\n                    <p>Usa <strong>3 evidencias<\/strong> del simulador o las secciones anteriores y concluye con tu postura.<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-espacio\">\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: Aunque la Constituci\u00f3n de 1917 estableci\u00f3 derechos laborales y agrarios, en la pr\u00e1ctica...\" rows=\"10\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VER ARGUMENTOS<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Argumentos a favor (\u00e9xito parcial):<\/strong>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Constituci\u00f3n de 1917:<\/strong> Estableci\u00f3 derechos <strong>laborales<\/strong> (Art. 123) y <strong>agrarios<\/strong> (Art. 27).<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Fin del porfiriato:<\/strong> Termin\u00f3 con <strong>30 a\u00f1os de dictadura<\/strong>.<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Reforma agraria:<\/strong> Se repartieron <strong>20M de hect\u00e1reas<\/strong> (aunque lento).<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <strong>Argumentos en contra (fracaso parcial):<\/strong>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Plan de Ayala:<\/strong> Zapata exig\u00eda <strong>restituci\u00f3n inmediata<\/strong>; solo se logr\u00f3 parcialmente.<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Desigualdad:<\/strong> Los <strong>latifundios<\/strong> persistieron en muchas regiones.<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Violencia:<\/strong> <strong>1.5M de muertos<\/strong> y destrucci\u00f3n econ\u00f3mica.<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Aplicaci\u00f3n lenta:<\/strong> Muchos derechos constitucionales se aplicaron hasta <strong>d\u00e9cadas despu\u00e9s<\/strong>.<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <p><strong>Conclusi\u00f3n:<\/strong> La Revoluci\u00f3n fue un <strong>\u00e9xito pol\u00edtico<\/strong> (fin de D\u00edaz, Constituci\u00f3n), pero un <strong>fracaso social<\/strong> a corto plazo (pobreza, desigualdad persistente).<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Comparaci\u00f3n de proyectos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Analiza 3 aspectos con 2 diferencias clave y juicio cr\u00edtico.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Menciona aspectos sin profundizar o sin juicio.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Omite diferencias o aspectos clave.<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Uso de evidencias<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Argumenta con 3+ evidencias hist\u00f3ricas (simulador, l\u00edneas del tiempo).<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Usa 1-2 evidencias sin contexto claro.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No usa evidencias o las usa incorrectamente.<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Reflexi\u00f3n cr\u00edtica<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Eval\u00faa \u00e9xito\/fracaso con perspectivas m\u00faltiples (social, pol\u00edtica, econ\u00f3mica).<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Analiza solo una perspectiva sin profundizar.<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Repite informaci\u00f3n sin an\u00e1lisis cr\u00edtico.<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE: REFLEXI\u00d3N HIST\u00d3RICA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Conozco las facciones y l\u00edderes:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Analizo la Constituci\u00f3n de 1917:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Uso el simulador de reparto agrario:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR PROGRESO\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N FINAL<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Si hubieras sido un <strong>campesino en 1915<\/strong>, \u00bfte habr\u00edas unido a <strong>Villa<\/strong>, <strong>Zapata<\/strong> o <strong>Carranza<\/strong>? Justifica tu elecci\u00f3n con <strong>2 razones<\/strong> basadas en sus proyectos pol\u00edticos.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: Me unir\u00eda a Zapata porque su Plan de Ayala promet\u00eda la restituci\u00f3n inmediata de tierras, y como campesino de Morelos...\" rows=\"5\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Investiga sobre <strong>una mujer revolucionaria<\/strong> (ej. <strong>Carmen Serd\u00e1n<\/strong>, <strong>Juana Bel\u00e9n Guti\u00e9rrez<\/strong>) y describe su papel en 3 l\u00edneas.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Ejemplo: Carmen Serd\u00e1n fue una de las primeras en tomar las armas en Puebla en 1910. Organiz\u00f3...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (20 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Memorizar l\u00edderes, lemas y regiones.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Repasar art\u00edculos 3, 27 y 123 de la Constituci\u00f3n.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Identificar fechas clave (1910, 1917, 1920).<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 AN\u00c1LISIS (40 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Comparar el <strong>Plan de Ayala<\/strong> y la <strong>Constituci\u00f3n de 1917<\/strong>.<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Reflexionar: \u00bfPor qu\u00e9 Carranza derrot\u00f3 a Villa y Zapata?<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Escribir un p\u00e1rrafo sobre el legado de la Revoluci\u00f3n.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd39 DEBATE (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Preparar argumentos: \u00bfFue Villa un h\u00e9roe o un bandido?<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Investigar sobre el <strong>muralismo<\/strong> (Rivera, Orozco).<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Debatir en clase con evidencias hist\u00f3ricas.<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf10 RECURSOS EXTERNOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.inehrm.gob.mx\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcdc Instituto Nacional de Estudios Hist\u00f3ricos (INEHRM)\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.biblioteca.tv\/artman2\/publish\/1910_1920\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83d\udcda Biblioteca TV: Revoluci\u00f3n Mexicana\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.khanacademy.org\/humanities\/whp-origins\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udf93 Khan Academy: Revoluciones en Am\u00e9rica Latina\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=...\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udfa5 Documental: \"La Revoluci\u00f3n Mexicana\" (History Channel)\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/museomuraldiego.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                        \ud83c\udfa8 Museo Mural Diego Rivera\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ BASE DE DATOS DEL SIMULADOR DE REPARTO AGRARIO\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nconst datosRepartoAgrario = {\r\n    \"morelos\": {\r\n        region: \"Morelos\",\r\n        ano: {\r\n            \"1915\": {\r\n                hectareas: \"50,000\",\r\n                beneficiarios: \"10,000 familias\",\r\n                impacto: \"Zapata reparti\u00f3 tierras directamente a campesinos. Primeros ejidos en M\u00e9xico.\",\r\n                color: \"#388E3C\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"1917\": {\r\n                hectareas: \"100,000\",\r\n                beneficiarios: \"20,000 familias\",\r\n                impacto: \"Con la Constituci\u00f3n, se legaliz\u00f3 el reparto, pero con resistencia de hacendados.\",\r\n                color: \"#4CAF50\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"1920\": {\r\n                hectareas: \"150,000\",\r\n                beneficiarios: \"30,000 familias\",\r\n                impacto: \"Carranza aceler\u00f3 el reparto para ganar apoyo, pero con corrupci\u00f3n.\",\r\n                color: \"#2E7D32\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"1940\": {\r\n                hectareas: \"200,000\",\r\n                beneficiarios: \"40,000 familias\",\r\n                impacto: \"C\u00e1rdenas complet\u00f3 el reparto en Morelos, creando ejidos modelo.\",\r\n                color: \"#1B5E20\"\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n    },\r\n    \"chihuahua\": {\r\n        region: \"Chihuahua\",\r\n        ano: {\r\n            \"1915\": {\r\n                hectareas: \"200,000\",\r\n                beneficiarios: \"5,000 familias\",\r\n                impacto: \"Villa expropi\u00f3 haciendas para sus tropas, no siempre para campesinos.\",\r\n                color: \"#D32F2F\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"1917\": {\r\n                hectareas: \"300,000\",\r\n                beneficiarios: \"10,000 familias\",\r\n                impacto: \"Carranza revirti\u00f3 algunos repartos villistas, causando conflictos.\",\r\n                color: \"#FF5252\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"1920\": {\r\n                hectareas: \"500,000\",\r\n                beneficiarios: \"20,000 familias\",\r\n                impacto: \"Obreg\u00f3n promovi\u00f3 el reparto para pacificar el norte, pero con l\u00edmites.\",\r\n                color: \"#FF8A65\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"1940\": {\r\n                hectareas: \"1,000,000\",\r\n                beneficiarios: \"50,000 familias\",\r\n                impacto: \"Chihuahua tuvo uno de los mayores repartos, pero con desigualdades.\",\r\n                color: \"#FFCCBC\"\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n    },\r\n    \"nacional\": {\r\n        region: \"Nacional (Promedio)\",\r\n        ano: {\r\n            \"1915\": {\r\n                hectareas: \"500,000\",\r\n                beneficiarios: \"50,000 familias\",\r\n                impacto: \"Inicio del reparto, principalmente en zonas de conflicto (Morelos, Chihuahua).\",\r\n                color: \"#FF9800\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"1917\": {\r\n                hectareas: \"2,000,000\",\r\n                beneficiarios: \"200,000 familias\",\r\n                impacto: \"La Constituci\u00f3n dio marco legal, pero la aplicaci\u00f3n fue lenta.\",\r\n                color: \"#F57C00\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"1920\": {\r\n                hectareas: \"5,000,000\",\r\n                beneficiarios: \"500,000 familias\",\r\n                impacto: \"Obreg\u00f3n impuls\u00f3 el reparto para consolidar su gobierno.\",\r\n                color: \"#EF6C00\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"1940\": {\r\n                hectareas: \"20,000,000\",\r\n                beneficiarios: \"2,000,000 familias\",\r\n                impacto: \"C\u00e1rdenas complet\u00f3 el reparto masivo, creando el M\u00e9xico rural moderno.\",\r\n                color: \"#E65100\"\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n    },\r\n    \"ejido\": {\r\n        region: \"Ejido Modelo (Ejemplo)\",\r\n        ano: {\r\n            \"1917\": {\r\n                hectareas: \"1,000\",\r\n                beneficiarios: \"100 familias\",\r\n                impacto: \"Ejido t\u00edpico: tierras comunales para cultivo, con apoyo gubernamental.\",\r\n                color: \"#4DB6AC\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"1920\": {\r\n                hectareas: \"1,500\",\r\n                beneficiarios: \"150 familias\",\r\n                impacto: \"Algunos ejidos recibieron cr\u00e9ditos y semillas, pero otros fueron abandonados.\",\r\n                color: \"#009688\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"1930\": {\r\n                hectareas: \"2,000\",\r\n                beneficiarios: \"200 familias\",\r\n                impacto: \"La crisis de 1929 afect\u00f3 a los ejidos, pero C\u00e1rdenas los revitaliz\u00f3.\",\r\n                color: \"#00897B\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"1940\": {\r\n                hectareas: \"2,500\",\r\n                beneficiarios: \"250 familias\",\r\n                impacto: \"Ejido consolidado: escuela, cl\u00ednica y tierras productivas.\",\r\n                color: \"#00796B\"\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ SIMULADOR: REPARTO AGRARIO (1915-1940)\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction iniciarSimuladorReparto() {\r\n    const region = document.getElementById('regionSelect').value;\r\n    const ano = document.getElementById('anioReparto').value;\r\n    const datos = datosRepartoAgrario[region].ano[ano];\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Redondear a\u00f1o a d\u00e9cada (para simplificar)\r\n    let anoRedondeado;\r\n    if (ano < 1915) anoRedondeado = \"1915\";\r\n    else if (ano < 1920) anoRedondeado = \"1917\";\r\n    else if (ano < 1930) anoRedondeado = \"1920\";\r\n    else anoRedondeado = \"1940\";\r\n\r\n    const datosMostrar = datosRepartoAgrario[region].ano[anoRedondeado];\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar datos en pantalla\r\n    document.getElementById('dataRegion').textContent = datosMostrar.region;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataAnioSim').textContent = anoRedondeado;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataHectareas').textContent = datosMostrar.hectareas + \" hect\u00e1reas\";\r\n    document.getElementById('dataBeneficiarios').textContent = datosMostrar.beneficiarios;\r\n    document.getElementById('dataImpactoSim').textContent = datosMostrar.impacto;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Actualizar SVG\r\n    document.getElementById('textoRegion').textContent = datosMostrar.region;\r\n    document.getElementById('textoAnio').textContent = \"A\u00f1o: \" + anoRedondeado;\r\n    document.getElementById('textoHectareas').textContent = datosMostrar.hectareas + \" ha repartidas\";\r\n    document.getElementById('textoBeneficiarios').textContent = datosMostrar.beneficiarios;\r\n    document.getElementById('textoImpacto').textContent = datosMostrar.impacto;\r\n    document.getElementById('leyendaReparto').textContent = `Reparto agrario en ${datosMostrar.region} (${anoRedondeado})`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Animar flecha\r\n    document.getElementById('flechaReparto').beginElement();\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Resaltar elementos\r\n    document.getElementById('hacienda').setAttribute('opacity', '0.3');\r\n    document.getElementById('pueblo').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n    document.getElementById('datosReparto').setAttribute('opacity', '1');\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Cambiar colores seg\u00fan regi\u00f3n\r\n    document.getElementById('pueblo').querySelector('rect').setAttribute('fill', datosMostrar.color);\r\n    document.getElementById('flechaReparto').setAttribute('stroke', datosMostrar.color);\r\n\r\n    console.log(`\ud83c\udf3e Simulaci\u00f3n: ${datosMostrar.region} (${anoRedondeado}) - ${datosMostrar.hectareas} ha`);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarSimuladorReparto() {\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar controles\r\n    document.getElementById('regionSelect').value = \"morelos\";\r\n    document.getElementById('anioReparto').value = \"1917\";\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar datos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.data-value').forEach(d => {\r\n        d.textContent = \"\u2014\";\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Reiniciar SVG\r\n    document.getElementById('hacienda').setAttribute('opacity', '0.7');\r\n    document.getElementById('pueblo').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('datosReparto').setAttribute('opacity', '0');\r\n    document.getElementById('leyendaReparto').textContent = \"Selecciona una regi\u00f3n y a\u00f1o\";\r\n\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\udd04 Simulador de reparto agrario reiniciado\");\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nlet quizRespuestas = [];\r\nlet quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n\r\n        const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n        question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n        this.classList.add('selected');\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n        if (selected === correct) {\r\n            this.classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n        } else {\r\n            this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n            quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n        \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n        const allAnswered = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question')).every(q =>\r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n\r\n        if (allAnswered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n    const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n    const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n\r\n    let feedback = \"\";\r\n    if (porcentaje >= 80) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83c\udf1f \u00a1Excelente! Dominas los detalles clave de la Revoluci\u00f3n Mexicana.\";\r\n    } else if (porcentaje >= 50) {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero repasa los art\u00edculos de la Constituci\u00f3n y el Plan de Ayala.\";\r\n    } else {\r\n        feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas estudiar m\u00e1s las facciones, l\u00edderes y documentos clave.\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    quizCompletado = false;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n        opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n        fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ ERRORES COMUNES (MITOS)\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction toggleError(header) {\r\n    const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n    const toggle = header.querySelector('.error-toggle');\r\n\r\n    if (content.style.display === 'block') {\r\n        content.style.display = 'none';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '+';\r\n    } else {\r\n        content.style.display = 'block';\r\n        toggle.textContent = '-';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction verificarProblema(num) {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nfunction guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n    const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n    const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n    const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n    const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n\r\n    alert(`\ud83d\udcbe Autoevaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n          `Facciones\/l\u00edderes: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n          `Constituci\u00f3n de 1917: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n          `Simulador agrario: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n          `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n          `\ud83d\udccc Recomendaci\u00f3n: Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ OBJETIVOS INTERACTIVOS\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n        const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n        this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n        const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n        checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n        checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#4CAF50' : '';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\n\/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N: AGREGAR FLECHA AL SVG\r\n\/\/ ===========================================\r\nconst svgReparto = document.getElementById('svgRepartoAgrario');\r\nconst defs = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'defs');\r\n\r\nconst marker = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'marker');\r\nmarker.setAttribute('id', 'flecha');\r\nmarker.setAttribute('viewBox', '0 0 10 10');\r\nmarker.setAttribute('refX', '9');\r\nmarker.setAttribute('refY', '5');\r\nmarker.setAttribute('markerWidth', '6');\r\nmarker.setAttribute('markerHeight', '6');\r\nmarker.setAttribute('orient', 'auto');\r\n\r\nconst path = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg', 'path');\r\npath.setAttribute('d', 'M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z');\r\npath.setAttribute('fill', '#4CAF50');\r\n\r\nmarker.appendChild(path);\r\ndefs.appendChild(marker);\r\nsvgReparto.appendChild(defs);\r\n\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Lecci\u00f3n Cyberpunk: Revoluci\u00f3n Mexicana - Cargada\");\r\nconsole.log(\"\ud83c\udfae Simulador de reparto agrario, Quiz y Herramientas interactivas listas\");\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Derroc\u00f3 a D\u00edaz","respuesta":"Madero"},{"enunciado":"Lema de Zapata","respuesta":"Tierra y Libertad"},{"enunciado":"Constituci\u00f3n promulgada","respuesta":"5 febrero 1917"},{"enunciado":"Art\u00edculo educaci\u00f3n laica","respuesta":"Art\u00edculo 3"},{"enunciado":"Plan de Ayala","respuesta":"1911"},{"enunciado":"Asesinato Madero","respuesta":"1913 (Decena Tr\u00e1gica)"},{"enunciado":"Villa regi\u00f3n","respuesta":"Norte (Chihuahua)"},{"enunciado":"Art\u00edculo 27","respuesta":"Naci\u00f3n due\u00f1a subsuelo"},{"enunciado":"Jornada laboral","respuesta":"8 horas (Art. 123)"},{"enunciado":"Convenci\u00f3n de Aguascalientes","respuesta":"1914"},{"enunciado":"Muertos estimados","respuesta":"~1.5 millones"},{"enunciado":"SI: a\u00f1os Constituci\u00f3n","respuesta":"108"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Inicio Revoluci\u00f3n","opciones":["1910","1821","1857","1920"],"correcta":"1910"},{"pregunta":"L\u00edder inicial","opciones":["Madero","Villa","Zapata","Carranza"],"correcta":"Madero"},{"pregunta":"Lema Zapata","opciones":["Tierra y Libertad","No reelecci\u00f3n","Orden y Progreso","Paz"],"correcta":"Tierra y Libertad"},{"pregunta":"Constituci\u00f3n","opciones":["1917","1824","1857","1910"],"correcta":"1917"},{"pregunta":"Art. 3","opciones":["Educaci\u00f3n laica","Tierra","Trabajo","Subsuelo"],"correcta":"Educaci\u00f3n laica"},{"pregunta":"Art. 27","opciones":["Naci\u00f3n due\u00f1a subsuelo","Educaci\u00f3n","Trabajo","Huelga"],"correcta":"Naci\u00f3n due\u00f1a subsuelo"},{"pregunta":"Art. 123","opciones":["Derechos laborales","Educaci\u00f3n","Tierra","Religi\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Derechos laborales"},{"pregunta":"Madero asesinado","opciones":["1913","1910","1917","1920"],"correcta":"1913"},{"pregunta":"Zapata asesinado","opciones":["1919","1913","1923","1920"],"correcta":"1919"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: a\u00f1os Revoluci\u00f3n","opciones":["115","100","200","50"],"correcta":"115"},{"pregunta":"Plan de San Luis","opciones":["Madero 1910","Zapata 1911","Villa 1913","Carranza 1913"],"correcta":"Madero 1910"},{"pregunta":"Decena Tr\u00e1gica","opciones":["1913","1910","1917","1919"],"correcta":"1913"},{"pregunta":"Huerta presidente","opciones":["1913-1914","1911-1913","1917-1920","1920-1924"],"correcta":"1913-1914"},{"pregunta":"Batalla de Zacatecas","opciones":["Villa 1914","Zapata 1911","Madero 1911","Carranza 1915"],"correcta":"Villa 1914"},{"pregunta":"Convenci\u00f3n Aguascalientes","opciones":["1914","1910","1917","1920"],"correcta":"1914"},{"pregunta":"Carranza presidente","opciones":["1917-1920","1911-1913","1913-1914","1920-1924"],"correcta":"1917-1920"},{"pregunta":"Obreg\u00f3n presidente","opciones":["1920-1924","1917-1920","1913-1914","1911-1913"],"correcta":"1920-1924"},{"pregunta":"Hect\u00e1reas repartidas","opciones":["~20M (1915-1940)","1M","100M","0"],"correcta":"~20M (1915-1940)"},{"pregunta":"Muralismo","opciones":["Rivera, Orozco","Picasso","Dal\u00ed","Van Gogh"],"correcta":"Rivera, Orozco"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: ejidos activos","opciones":["~30,000","100","1M","0"],"correcta":"~30,000"},{"pregunta":"Tierra y Libertad","opciones":["Plan de Ayala","Plan de San Luis","Plan de Guadalupe","Constituci\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Plan de Ayala"},{"pregunta":"Divisi\u00f3n del Norte","opciones":["Villa","Zapata","Madero","Carranza"],"correcta":"Villa"},{"pregunta":"Ej\u00e9rcito Libertador Sur","opciones":["Zapata","Villa","Madero","Obreg\u00f3n"],"correcta":"Zapata"},{"pregunta":"Constituyente en","opciones":["Quer\u00e9taro","CDMX","Guadalajara","Monterrey"],"correcta":"Quer\u00e9taro"},{"pregunta":"5 de febrero","opciones":["1917","1910","1920","1810"],"correcta":"1917"},{"pregunta":"Cristeros","opciones":["1926-1929","1910-1920","1857","1867"],"correcta":"1926-1929"},{"pregunta":"Calles presidente","opciones":["1924-1928","1920-1924","1917-1920","1913-1914"],"correcta":"1924-1928"},{"pregunta":"PNR fundado","opciones":["1929","1917","1910","1946"],"correcta":"1929"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: a\u00f1os Constituci\u00f3n","opciones":["108","100","115","200"],"correcta":"108"},{"pregunta":"Revoluci\u00f3n fue","opciones":["Social y agraria","Solo pol\u00edtica","Industrial","Religiosa"],"correcta":"Social y agraria"}]},{"materia":"Historia de M\u00e9xico","slug":"mexico-contemporaneo","titulo":"M\u00e9xico Contempor\u00e1neo: Revoluci\u00f3n Institucionalizada, Milagro y Transici\u00f3n (1934-2000)","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-historia-contemporaneo\" data-tema=\"mexico-contemporaneo\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83d\ude80<\/span>\r\n            M\u00c9XICO CONTEMPOR\u00c1NEO\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Del Cardenismo Revolucionario a la Alternancia Democr\u00e1tica (1934-2000)\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"badge-tiempo\">\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">1934-2000<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">66 a\u00f1os<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">4 etapas clave<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"badge\">Revoluci\u00f3n \u2192 Democracia<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Analizar el proyecto cardenista<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Evaluar reforma agraria, expropiaci\u00f3n petrolera y nacionalismo revolucionario<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Examinar el Milagro Mexicano<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Comprender crecimiento econ\u00f3mico, desarrollo estabilizador y sus l\u00edmites<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Evaluar 1968 como punto de quiebre<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Analizar movimiento estudiantil, represi\u00f3n y apertura pol\u00edtica gradual<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Comprender transici\u00f3n democr\u00e1tica<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Examinar reformas electorales y alternancia del 2000<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> HUELLAS EN EL M\u00c9XICO ACTUAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udee2\ufe0f PEMEX 87 A\u00f1os Despu\u00e9s<\/h3>\r\n                <p>La expropiaci\u00f3n petrolera sigue definiendo pol\u00edtica energ\u00e9tica y soberan\u00eda<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Producci\u00f3n 2024: 1.6M barriles\/d\u00eda<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f Sistema Electoral Actual<\/h3>\r\n                <p>INE hereda 40 a\u00f1os de reformas electorales desde 1977<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Elecciones m\u00e1s competidas desde 2000<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Urbanizaci\u00f3n Acelerada<\/h3>\r\n                <p>El Milagro Mexicano urbaniz\u00f3 el pa\u00eds: 35% urbano 1940 \u2192 80% 2000<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">ZMG: 5M habitantes (2025)<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> LAS CUATRO COLUMNAS DEL M\u00c9XICO MODERNO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- INTRODUCCI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Del Caudillismo a las Instituciones (1934-2000)<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f REVOLUCI\u00d3N INSTITUCIONALIZADA<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Periodo de consolidaci\u00f3n del Estado posrevolucionario, crecimiento econ\u00f3mico acelerado y lenta transici\u00f3n democr\u00e1tica<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"caracteristicas-grid\">\r\n                        <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-icon\">\ud83d\udee2\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-texto\">Nacionalismo econ\u00f3mico<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-icon\">\ud83d\udcc8<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-texto\">6% crecimiento anual (1940-70)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-icon\">\ud83c\udf93<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-texto\">Movimiento estudiantil 1968<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"caracteristica\">\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-icon\">\ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f<\/span>\r\n                            <span class=\"caracteristica-texto\">Alternancia democr\u00e1tica 2000<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TIMELINE INTERACTIVA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. L\u00ednea de Tiempo Interactiva 1934-2000<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"timeline-interactiva\">\r\n                <div class=\"timeline-controls\">\r\n                    <button class=\"timeline-btn\" data-etapa=\"cardenismo\">CARDENISMO<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"timeline-btn\" data-etapa=\"milagro\">MILAGRO<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"timeline-btn\" data-etapa=\"desarrollo\">DESARROLLO<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"timeline-btn\" data-etapa=\"crisis\">CRISIS<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"timeline-btn\" data-etapa=\"transicion\">TRANSICI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"timeline-btn\" data-etapa=\"alternancia\">ALTERNANCIA<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"timeline-visual\">\r\n                    <div class=\"timeline-bar\">\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-marker\" data-year=\"1934\" style=\"left: 0%;\">1934<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-marker\" data-year=\"1940\" style=\"left: 9%;\">1940<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-marker\" data-year=\"1954\" style=\"left: 30%;\">1954<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-marker\" data-year=\"1968\" style=\"left: 51%;\">1968<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-marker\" data-year=\"1982\" style=\"left: 72%;\">1982<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-btn\" data-year=\"1988\" style=\"left: 81%;\">1988<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"timeline-marker\" data-year=\"2000\" style=\"left: 100%;\">2000<\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <!-- Etapas -->\r\n                        <div class=\"etapa-bar cardenismo\" style=\"left: 0%; width: 9%;\" data-etapa=\"cardenismo\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"etapa-bar milagro\" style=\"left: 9%; width: 21%;\" data-etapa=\"milagro\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"etapa-bar desarrollo\" style=\"left: 30%; width: 21%;\" data-etapa=\"desarrollo\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"etapa-bar crisis\" style=\"left: 51%; width: 21%;\" data-etapa=\"crisis\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"etapa-bar transicion\" style=\"left: 72%; width: 9%;\" data-etapa=\"transicion\"><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"etapa-bar alternancia\" style=\"left: 81%; width: 19%;\" data-etapa=\"alternancia\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"timeline-info\" id=\"timelineInfo\">\r\n                    Haz clic en una etapa para explorar sus caracter\u00edsticas\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- ETAPAS DETALLADAS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. An\u00e1lisis por Periodo Hist\u00f3rico<\/h3>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- CARDENISMO -->\r\n            <div class=\"etapa-detalle\" id=\"detalleCardenismo\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\u2692\ufe0f CARDENISMO (1934-1940)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-badge\">Revoluci\u00f3n social<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83c\udf3e Reforma Agraria Radical<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>18 millones hect\u00e1reas repartidas, ejidos, Confederaci\u00f3n Nacional Campesina<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Culminaci\u00f3n del reparto revolucionario<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udee2\ufe0f Expropiaci\u00f3n Petrolera 1938<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>17 empresas extranjeras nacionalizadas, creaci\u00f3n de PEMEX, soberan\u00eda energ\u00e9tica<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Apoyo popular masivo: \"El petr\u00f3leo es nuestro\"<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Institucionalizaci\u00f3n<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>CTM, PRI como partido oficial, educaci\u00f3n socialista, nacionalismo cultural<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Revoluci\u00f3n convertida en sistema pol\u00edtico<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- MILAGRO MEXICANO -->\r\n            <div class=\"etapa-detalle\" id=\"detalleMilagro\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcc8 MILAGRO MEXICANO (1940-1970)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-badge\">30 a\u00f1os de crecimiento<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83c\udfed Industrializaci\u00f3n por Sustituci\u00f3n<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Proteccionismo, desarrollo manufacturero, empresa paraestatal<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Crecimiento promedio 6% anual<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Urbanizaci\u00f3n Masiva<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Poblaci\u00f3n urbana: 35% \u2192 65%, migraci\u00f3n campo-ciudad, ciudades nuevas<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">CDMX: 1.5M (1940) \u2192 8.8M (1970)<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66 Cambio Demogr\u00e1fico<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Poblaci\u00f3n: 20M \u2192 50M, tasa natalidad 45\u2030, clase media emergente<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">\"Desarrollo estabilizador\": estabilidad macroecon\u00f3mica<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- 1968 -->\r\n            <div class=\"etapa-detalle\" id=\"detalleCrisis\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83c\udf93 1968: PUNTO DE QUIEBRE<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-badge\">Fin de la inocencia<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udce2 Movimiento Estudiantil<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Demandas: libertad pol\u00edticos, di\u00e1logo p\u00fablico, fin represi\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">CNH: Consejo Nacional de Huelga<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udca5 Matanza de Tlatelolco<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>2 octubre 1968, Plaza de las Tres Culturas, 300-500 muertos estimados<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Batall\u00f3n Olimpia, Ej\u00e9rcito, Grupo paramilitar<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udd13 Apertura Gradual<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Reformas pol\u00edticas 1977, partidos de oposici\u00f3n, fin presidencialismo absoluto<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Inicio de transici\u00f3n democr\u00e1tica de 30 a\u00f1os<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- ALTERNANCIA 2000 -->\r\n            <div class=\"etapa-detalle\" id=\"detalleAlternancia\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-header\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f ALTERNANCIA DEMOCR\u00c1TICA 2000<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-badge\">Fin de la hegemon\u00eda PRI<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"etapa-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83d\udcca Reformas Electorales<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>IFE 1990, Tribunal Electoral, credencial con foto, equidad en medios<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Confianza en proceso electoral<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\ud83c\udfc6 Victoria de Vicente Fox<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>PAN gana con 42.5% votos, PRI 36.1%, PRD 16.6%<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">\"Ya cambi\u00f3 M\u00e9xico\" - lema de campa\u00f1a<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"etapa-columna\">\r\n                        <h5>\u2696\ufe0f Nuevo Sistema Pol\u00edtico<\/h5>\r\n                        <p>Gobierno dividido, congreso plural, contrapesos reales, medios cr\u00edticos<\/p>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\">Fin del presidencialismo imperial<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- DATOS ESTAD\u00cdSTICOS COMPARATIVOS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. M\u00e9xico en Cifras: Transformaci\u00f3n Acelerada<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"estadisticas-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"estadistica-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-valor\">20M \u2192 100M<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-label\">Poblaci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-desc\">1934-2000 (x5 crecimiento)<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadistica-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-valor\">35% \u2192 80%<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-label\">Urbanizaci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-desc\">Poblaci\u00f3n en ciudades<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadistica-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-valor\">6%<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-label\">Crecimiento anual<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-desc\">Promedio 1940-1970<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadistica-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-valor\">18M<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-label\">Hect\u00e1reas repartidas<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-desc\">Reforma agraria cardenista<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadistica-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-valor\">71 a\u00f1os<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-label\">Hegemon\u00eda PRI<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-desc\">1929-2000<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadistica-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-valor\">42.5%<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-label\">Votos Fox 2000<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"estadistica-desc\">Primer presidente no PRI<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- MODELOS ECON\u00d3MICOS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>5. Evoluci\u00f3n del Modelo Econ\u00f3mico<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"modelos-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"modelo-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-icon\">\ud83c\udf3e<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>ECONOM\u00cdA AGRARIA (1934)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-desc\">\r\n                        65% poblaci\u00f3n rural, exportaci\u00f3n materias primas\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Base:<\/strong> Agricultura, miner\u00eda<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Pol\u00edtica:<\/strong> Nacionalismo econ\u00f3mico<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Estado:<\/strong> Intervencionista<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"modelo-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-icon\">\ud83c\udfed<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>SUSTITUCI\u00d3N IMPORTACIONES (1940-70)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-desc\">\r\n                        Industrializaci\u00f3n protegida, empresa estatal\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Base:<\/strong> Manufactura protegida<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Pol\u00edtica:<\/strong> Proteccionismo<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Estado:<\/strong> Empresario<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"modelo-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-icon\">\ud83d\udca5<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>CRISIS Y AJUSTE (1970-82)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-desc\">\r\n                        Petrod\u00f3lares, deuda externa, populismo econ\u00f3mico\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Base:<\/strong> Petr\u00f3leo, deuda<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Pol\u00edtica:<\/strong> Desarrollismo<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Estado:<\/strong> Endeudado<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"modelo-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-icon\">\ud83c\udf10<\/div>\r\n                    <h4>NEOLIBERALISMO (1982-2000)<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-desc\">\r\n                        Apertura comercial, privatizaciones, TLCAN\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"modelo-datos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Base:<\/strong> Exportaciones, FDI<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Pol\u00edtica:<\/strong> Libre comercio<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"dato\"><strong>Estado:<\/strong> Regulador<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO: CRECIMIENTO ECON\u00d3MICO -->\r\n    <section class=\"simulator-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/span> SIMULADOR: EL MILAGRO MEXICANO Y SUS CONSECUENCIAS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"milagro-mexicano\">\r\n            <!-- PANEL DE CONTROLES -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>CONFIGURADOR ECON\u00d3MICO<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"periodoSelect\">Periodo hist\u00f3rico:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"periodoSelect\" class=\"control-select\" onchange=\"cambiarPeriodoEconomico()\">\r\n                        <option value=\"1940-1950\">1940-1950 (Inicio Milagro)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"1950-1960\">1950-1960 (Auge Industrial)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"1960-1970\">1960-1970 (Culminaci\u00f3n)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"1970-1980\">1970-1980 (Crisis inicial)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"1980-1990\">1980-1990 (Neoliberalismo)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"1990-2000\">1990-2000 (TLCAN)<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label for=\"politicaSelect\">Pol\u00edtica econ\u00f3mica:<\/label>\r\n                    <select id=\"politicaSelect\" class=\"control-select\" onchange=\"cambiarPolitica()\">\r\n                        <option value=\"sustitucion\">Sustituci\u00f3n importaciones<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"estabilizador\">Desarrollo estabilizador<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"desarrollismo\">Desarrollismo (petr\u00f3leo)<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"ajuste\">Ajuste estructural<\/option>\r\n                        <option value=\"librecomercio\">Libre comercio<\/option>\r\n                    <\/select>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"control-group\">\r\n                    <label>Indicadores a visualizar:<\/label>\r\n                    <div class=\"checkbox-group\">\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"indicadores\" value=\"pib\" checked> Crecimiento PIB<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"indicadores\" value=\"inflacion\"> Inflaci\u00f3n<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"indicadores\" value=\"deuda\"> Deuda externa<\/label>\r\n                        <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"indicadores\" value=\"desigualdad\"> Desigualdad<\/label>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-simular\" onclick=\"simularEfectos()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span> SIMULAR CONSECUENCIAS\r\n                <\/button>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-comparar\" onclick=\"compararPeriodos()\">\r\n                    <span class=\"btn-icon\">\u2696\ufe0f<\/span> COMPARAR PERIODOS\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DE DATOS -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\" id=\"visualizacionEconomica\">\r\n                <div class=\"grafico-container\">\r\n                    <div class=\"grafico-header\">\r\n                        <h3 id=\"tituloGrafico\">CRECIMIENTO ECON\u00d3MICO 1940-1970<\/h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"grafico-subtitulo\" id=\"subtituloGrafico\">\"Milagro Mexicano\" - Desarrollo Estabilizador<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"grafico-barras\">\r\n                        <div class=\"eje-y\">\r\n                            <div>10%<\/div>\r\n                            <div>8%<\/div>\r\n                            <div>6%<\/div>\r\n                            <div>4%<\/div>\r\n                            <div>2%<\/div>\r\n                            <div>0%<\/div>\r\n                            <div>-2%<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"barras-container\">\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-anio\" data-anio=\"1940-1950\">\r\n                                <div class=\"barra-pib\" style=\"height: 65%;\" data-value=\"6.5%\"><\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"barra-label\">1940-50<\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-anio\" data-anio=\"1950-1960\">\r\n                                <div class=\"barra-pib\" style=\"height: 75%;\" data-value=\"7.5%\"><\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"barra-label\">1950-60<\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-anio\" data-anio=\"1960-1970\">\r\n                                <div class=\"barra-pib\" style=\"height: 70%;\" data-value=\"7.0%\"><\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"barra-label\">1960-70<\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-anio\" data-anio=\"1970-1980\">\r\n                                <div class=\"barra-pib\" style=\"height: 50%;\" data-value=\"5.0%\"><\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"barra-label\">1970-80<\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-anio\" data-anio=\"1980-1990\">\r\n                                <div class=\"barra-pib\" style=\"height: 10%;\" data-value=\"1.0%\"><\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"barra-label\">1980-90<\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"barra-anio\" data-anio=\"1990-2000\">\r\n                                <div class=\"barra-pib\" style=\"height: 35%;\" data-value=\"3.5%\"><\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"barra-label\">1990-00<\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"grafico-leyenda\">\r\n                        <div class=\"leyenda-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"leyenda-color pib\"><\/div>\r\n                            <span>Crecimiento PIB anual promedio<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"leyenda-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"leyenda-color inflacion\"><\/div>\r\n                            <span>Inflaci\u00f3n anual (aparece al seleccionar)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"grafico-info\" id=\"infoGrafico\">\r\n                    Selecciona un periodo para analizar su desempe\u00f1o econ\u00f3mico\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- DATOS EN TIEMPO REAL -->\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>INDICADORES ECON\u00d3MICOS<\/h3>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Periodo seleccionado:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPeriodo\">1940-1970<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Crecimiento PIB promedio:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataPIB\">6.5% anual<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Inflaci\u00f3n promedio:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataInflacion\">5.2% anual<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card highlight\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">MODELO ECON\u00d3MICO:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataModelo\">Sustituci\u00f3n importaciones<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Deuda externa\/PIB:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataDeuda\">15%<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Inversi\u00f3n extranjera:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"dataInversion\">Baja<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"estadisticas\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcca IMPACTOS SOCIALES<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Poblaci\u00f3n urbana:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">35% \u2192 65%<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Analfabetismo:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">42% \u2192 25%<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Esperanza vida:<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">38 \u2192 65 a\u00f1os<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\r\n                        <span>Coef. Gini (desigualdad):<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">0.53 (alto)<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- QUIZ INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ: M\u00c9XICO CONTEMPOR\u00c1NEO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 caracteriz\u00f3 principalmente al \"Milagro Mexicano\" (1940-1970)?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Apertura comercial y privatizaciones masivas\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Revoluci\u00f3n socialista y expropiaciones\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Crecimiento econ\u00f3mico acelerado con industrializaci\u00f3n protegida\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Estancamiento econ\u00f3mico y alta inflaci\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> El Milagro Mexicano fue un per\u00edodo de crecimiento acelerado basado en industrializaci\u00f3n por sustituci\u00f3n de importaciones.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> La apertura comercial fue posterior (a\u00f1os 80-90), la revoluci\u00f3n socialista fue cardenista (a\u00f1os 30), y el estancamiento lleg\u00f3 despu\u00e9s de 1970.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Entre 1940-1970 M\u00e9xico creci\u00f3 a un promedio del 6% anual. Se industrializ\u00f3 mediante protecci\u00f3n arancelaria, cre\u00f3 empresas paraestatales, urbaniz\u00f3 masivamente y mantuvo estabilidad macroecon\u00f3mica (\"desarrollo estabilizador\").<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 consecuencia pol\u00edtica tuvo el movimiento estudiantil de 1968?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Inmediata democratizaci\u00f3n y ca\u00edda del PRI\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Inicio de reformas pol\u00edticas graduales y apertura del sistema\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Fortalecimiento del autoritarismo pri\u00edsta por 20 a\u00f1os m\u00e1s\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Intervenci\u00f3n militar permanente en la pol\u00edtica\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> 1968 inici\u00f3 un proceso de reformas graduales que llevar\u00eda a la democratizaci\u00f3n.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> La ca\u00edda del PRI tard\u00f3 32 a\u00f1os m\u00e1s, el autoritarismo se debilit\u00f3 tras 1968, y no hubo intervenci\u00f3n militar permanente.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Dato:<\/strong> Tras 1968 vino la reforma pol\u00edtica de 1977 que legaliz\u00f3 partidos de izquierda, las sucesivas reformas electorales (1986, 1990, 1994, 1996) que crearon el IFE, y finalmente la alternancia en 2000.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 permiti\u00f3 la alternancia democr\u00e1tica del a\u00f1o 2000?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Un golpe de estado que derroc\u00f3 al PRI\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Una revoluci\u00f3n armada popular\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Presi\u00f3n internacional y sanciones econ\u00f3micas\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Reformas electorales que garantizaron elecciones limpias\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Las reformas electorales (especialmente la de 1996) crearon condiciones para elecciones cre\u00edbles.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> No hubo golpe ni revoluci\u00f3n, y la presi\u00f3n internacional fue secundaria.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Soluci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La creaci\u00f3n del IFE aut\u00f3nomo (1996), credencial con foto, Tribunal Electoral, acceso equitativo a medios y fiscalizaci\u00f3n fueron claves. En 2000, por primera vez, los mexicanos confiaron en que su voto ser\u00eda respetado.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"examen-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> AN\u00c1LISIS DEL M\u00c9XICO MODERNO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"examen-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P1<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Evaluaci\u00f3n del Cardenismo: \u00bfRevoluci\u00f3n o Institucionalizaci\u00f3n?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Analiza cr\u00edticamente el gobierno de L\u00e1zaro C\u00e1rdenas (1934-1940):<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-dimensiones\">\r\n                        <div class=\"dimension\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udf3e REFORMA AGRARIA<\/h5>\r\n                            <p><strong>Logro:<\/strong> 18M hect\u00e1reas repartidas, ejidos, CNC<\/p>\r\n                            <textarea placeholder=\"Eval\u00faa impacto real y l\u00edmites...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"dimension\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udee2\ufe0f EXPROPIACI\u00d3N PETROLERA<\/h5>\r\n                            <p><strong>Logro:<\/strong> Soberan\u00eda nacional, PEMEX, apoyo popular<\/p>\r\n                            <textarea placeholder=\"Analiza consecuencias econ\u00f3micas...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"dimension\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f INSTITUCIONALIZACI\u00d3N<\/h5>\r\n                            <p><strong>Logro:<\/strong> CTM, PRI, educaci\u00f3n socialista<\/p>\r\n                            <textarea placeholder=\"Examina efectos pol\u00edticos a largo plazo...\" rows=\"3\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <p><strong>Pregunta de s\u00edntesis:<\/strong> \u00bfFue el cardenismo la culminaci\u00f3n de la Revoluci\u00f3n Mexicana o su institucionalizaci\u00f3n\/autorizaci\u00f3n?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Desarrolla tu argumento...\" rows=\"4\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(1)\">VERIFICAR AN\u00c1LISIS<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP1\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>An\u00e1lisis sugerido:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    <strong>Logros:<\/strong> Mayor redistribuci\u00f3n tierra en historia mexicana, soberan\u00eda energ\u00e9tica, organizaci\u00f3n popular, nacionalismo cultural.<br>\r\n                    <strong>L\u00edmites:<\/strong> Ejidos poco productivos, burocracia sindical, PRI como partido oficial (inicio del autoritarismo), educaci\u00f3n socialista ef\u00edmera.<br><br>\r\n                    <strong>Veredicto:<\/strong> Cardenismo fue ambas cosas: <strong>culminaci\u00f3n<\/strong> del proyecto social revolucionario (agrario, nacionalista) pero tambi\u00e9n <strong>institucionalizaci\u00f3n<\/strong> del sistema pol\u00edtico autoritario (PRI, corporativismo). Sent\u00f3 bases para desarrollo posterior pero tambi\u00e9n para el presidencialismo autoritario.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"problema-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"problema-num\">P2<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>1968-2000: \u00bfTransici\u00f3n Democr\u00e1tica o Modernizaci\u00f3n Autoritaria?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-enunciado\">\r\n                    <p>Examina el periodo 1968-2000 como proceso de transici\u00f3n pol\u00edtica:<\/p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"linea-transicion\">\r\n                        <div class=\"punto-transicion\">\r\n                            <h5>1968<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Matanza Tlatelolco, crisis de legitimidad<\/p>\r\n                            <textarea placeholder=\"\u00bfPunto de quiebre?\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"punto-transicion\">\r\n                            <h5>1977<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Reforma pol\u00edtica, partidos legales<\/p>\r\n                            <textarea placeholder=\"\u00bfApertura controlada?\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"punto-transicion\">\r\n                            <h5>1988<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>\"Ca\u00edda del sistema\", fraude electoral<\/p>\r\n                            <textarea placeholder=\"\u00bfPresi\u00f3n democratizadora?\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"punto-transicion\">\r\n                            <h5>1994-96<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>IFE aut\u00f3nomo, reforma electoral<\/p>\r\n                            <textarea placeholder=\"\u00bfInstituciones democr\u00e1ticas?\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"punto-transicion\">\r\n                            <h5>2000<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Alternancia, Fox presidente<\/p>\r\n                            <textarea placeholder=\"\u00bfConsolidaci\u00f3n democr\u00e1tica?\" rows=\"2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <p><strong>Pregunta cr\u00edtica:<\/strong> \u00bfFue esta una transici\u00f3n democr\u00e1tica genuina o simplemente una modernizaci\u00f3n del autoritarismo pri\u00edsta para sobrevivir?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Argumenta tu posici\u00f3n...\" rows=\"4\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarProblema(2)\">VERIFICAR EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/button>\r\n                <div class=\"problema-solucion\" id=\"solucionP2\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <strong>Evaluaci\u00f3n del proceso:<\/strong><br>\r\n                    <strong>1968:<\/strong> Quiebre de legitimidad, sociedad civil despierta.<br>\r\n                    <strong>1977:<\/strong> Apertura controlada desde arriba, cooptaci\u00f3n.<br>\r\n                    <strong>1988:<\/strong> Presi\u00f3n desde abajo (C\u00e1rdenas), resistencia del sistema.<br>\r\n                    <strong>1994-96:<\/strong> Reformas reales por presi\u00f3n interna\/externa, instituciones aut\u00f3nomas.<br>\r\n                    <strong>2000:<\/strong> Alternancia posible por instituciones cre\u00edbles.<br><br>\r\n                    <strong>Conclusi\u00f3n:<\/strong> Fue una <strong>transici\u00f3n h\u00edbrida<\/strong>: combin\u00f3 modernizaci\u00f3n autoritaria (reformas graduales controladas) con presi\u00f3n democratizadora real (sociedad civil, oposici\u00f3n). Las reformas electorales fueron tanto concesiones para mantener poder como respuesta genuina a demandas democr\u00e1ticas.\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n            <h4>\ud83d\udccb R\u00daBRICA DE EVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h4>\r\n            <table class=\"rubrica-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>Criterio<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Excelente (5)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Satisfactorio (3-4)<\/th>\r\n                    <th>Insuficiente (0-2)<\/th>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Comprensi\u00f3n hist\u00f3rica<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Analiza causas y consecuencias de cada etapa<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Describe eventos principales correctamente<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Confunde periodos o procesos hist\u00f3ricos<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>An\u00e1lisis cr\u00edtico<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Eval\u00faa logros y l\u00edmites con argumentos s\u00f3lidos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Identifica algunos aspectos positivos y negativos<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Ofrece juicios simplistas sin fundamentar<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>Conexi\u00f3n presente-pasado<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Relaciona procesos hist\u00f3ricos con M\u00e9xico actual<\/td>\r\n                    <td>Menciona algunas continuidades hist\u00f3ricas<\/td>\r\n                    <td>No establece conexiones con el presente<\/td>\r\n                <\/tr>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE METACOGNITIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> REFLEXI\u00d3N SOBRE EL M\u00c9XICO MODERNO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N DE CONOCIMIENTOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Comprensi\u00f3n del cardenismo:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>An\u00e1lisis del Milagro Mexicano:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"slider-group\">\r\n                    <label>Evaluaci\u00f3n transici\u00f3n democr\u00e1tica:<\/label>\r\n                    <input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"3\" class=\"autoeval-slider\" id=\"slider3\">\r\n                    <div class=\"slider-labels\">\r\n                        <span>B\u00e1sico<\/span><span>Intermedio<\/span><span>Avanzado<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarAutoevaluacion()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfQu\u00e9 elementos del M\u00e9xico contempor\u00e1neo (1934-2000) consideras que explican mejor los desaf\u00edos actuales del pa\u00eds?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo valoras la transici\u00f3n democr\u00e1tica mexicana comparada con otros pa\u00edses de Am\u00e9rica Latina?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu an\u00e1lisis comparativo...\" rows=\"4\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"plan-estudio\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcc5 PLAN DE ESTUDIO RECOMENDADO<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"plan-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd04 REPASO R\u00c1PIDO (15 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Memorizar fechas clave: 1938, 1968, 2000<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Recordar cifras del Milagro Mexicano<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Identificar reformas electorales clave<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcaa PR\u00c1CTICA (30 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Explorar simulador econ\u00f3mico<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Completar el quiz de autoevaluaci\u00f3n<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Analizar l\u00ednea de tiempo interactiva<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"plan-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\ude80 PROFUNDIZACI\u00d3N (45 min)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Investigar documentos del 68<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Analizar discursos de expropiaci\u00f3n petrolera<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Comparar transiciones democr\u00e1ticas en AL<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.archivocardenas.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcdc Archivo L\u00e1zaro C\u00e1rdenas\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.m68.mx\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udf93 M68: Archivo digital del movimiento estudiantil\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ine.mx\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f INE: Instituto Nacional Electoral\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.inegi.org.mx\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcca INEGI: Estad\u00edsticas hist\u00f3ricas\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/pemex.com\/acerca\/informacion-financiera\/Paginas\/historia.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udee2\ufe0f PEMEX: Historia institucional\r\n                <\/a>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- JAVASCRIPT INTEGRADO -->\r\n    <script>\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SIMULADOR ECON\u00d3MICO INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    const datosEconomicos = {\r\n        \"1940-1950\": {\r\n            periodo: \"1940-1950\",\r\n            crecimiento: \"6.5%\",\r\n            inflacion: \"5.2%\",\r\n            modelo: \"Sustituci\u00f3n importaciones (inicio)\",\r\n            deuda: \"8%\",\r\n            inversion: \"Muy baja\",\r\n            descripcion: \"Inicio del Milagro Mexicano. Industrializaci\u00f3n protegida, inversi\u00f3n p\u00fablica, Segunda Guerra Mundial beneficia exportaciones.\",\r\n            color: \"#43A047\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"1950-1960\": {\r\n            periodo: \"1950-1960\",\r\n            crecimiento: \"7.5%\",\r\n            inflacion: \"6.1%\",\r\n            modelo: \"Desarrollo estabilizador (auge)\",\r\n            deuda: \"12%\",\r\n            inversion: \"Moderada\",\r\n            descripcion: \"Auge del Milagro. Crecimiento acelerado, estabilidad monetaria, inversi\u00f3n en infraestructura, urbanizaci\u00f3n masiva.\",\r\n            color: \"#388E3C\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"1960-1970\": {\r\n            periodo: \"1960-1970\",\r\n            crecimiento: \"7.0%\",\r\n            inflacion: \"3.8%\",\r\n            modelo: \"Desarrollo estabilizador (culminaci\u00f3n)\",\r\n            deuda: \"15%\",\r\n            inversion: \"Alta\",\r\n            descripcion: \"Culminaci\u00f3n del Milagro. Industrializaci\u00f3n avanzada, clase media consolidada, Juegos Ol\u00edmpicos 1968, pero desigualdad persistente.\",\r\n            color: \"#2E7D32\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"1970-1980\": {\r\n            periodo: \"1970-1980\",\r\n            crecimiento: \"5.0%\",\r\n            inflacion: \"18.5%\",\r\n            modelo: \"Desarrollismo petrolero\",\r\n            deuda: \"35%\",\r\n            inversion: \"Petr\u00f3leo\",\r\n            descripcion: \"Fin del Milagro. Petrod\u00f3lares, gasto p\u00fablico expansivo, inflaci\u00f3n creciente, deuda externa se dispara.\",\r\n            color: \"#FF9800\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"1980-1990\": {\r\n            periodo: \"1980-1990\",\r\n            crecimiento: \"1.0%\",\r\n            inflacion: \"65.3%\",\r\n            modelo: \"Crisis y ajuste estructural\",\r\n            deuda: \"60%\",\r\n            inversion: \"Fuga capitales\",\r\n            descripcion: \"D\u00e9cada perdida. Nacionalizaci\u00f3n de la banca (1982), crisis de deuda, hiperinflaci\u00f3n, programas de ajuste del FMI.\",\r\n            color: \"#F44336\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"1990-2000\": {\r\n            periodo: \"1990-2000\",\r\n            crecimiento: \"3.5%\",\r\n            inflacion: \"20.1%\",\r\n            modelo: \"Neoliberalismo y TLCAN\",\r\n            deuda: \"25%\",\r\n            inversion: \"Alta (FDI)\",\r\n            descripcion: \"Recuperaci\u00f3n parcial. TLCAN (1994), privatizaciones, crisis de 1994-95 ('Error de diciembre'), dependencia de EE.UU.\",\r\n            color: \"#2196F3\"\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    function cambiarPeriodoEconomico() {\r\n        const periodoId = document.getElementById('periodoSelect').value;\r\n        const datos = datosEconomicos[periodoId];\r\n        \r\n        if (!datos) return;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar gr\u00e1fico\r\n        document.getElementById('tituloGrafico').textContent = `DESEMPE\u00d1O ECON\u00d3MICO ${datos.periodo}`;\r\n        document.getElementById('subtituloGrafico').textContent = `Modelo: ${datos.modelo}`;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar datos\r\n        document.getElementById('dataPeriodo').textContent = datos.periodo;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataPIB').textContent = datos.crecimiento + \" anual\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataInflacion').textContent = datos.inflacion + \" anual\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataModelo').textContent = datos.modelo;\r\n        document.getElementById('dataDeuda').textContent = datos.deuda + \" del PIB\";\r\n        document.getElementById('dataInversion').textContent = datos.inversion;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar informaci\u00f3n\r\n        document.getElementById('infoGrafico').textContent = datos.descripcion;\r\n        document.getElementById('infoGrafico').style.animation = \"highlight 0.5s\";\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Resaltar barra correspondiente\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.barra-anio').forEach(barra => {\r\n            barra.classList.remove('active');\r\n            if (barra.dataset.anio === periodoId) {\r\n                barra.classList.add('active');\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcc8 Periodo econ\u00f3mico seleccionado: ${datos.periodo}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function simularEfectos() {\r\n        const periodoId = document.getElementById('periodoSelect').value;\r\n        const politica = document.getElementById('politicaSelect').value;\r\n        const checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"indicadores\"]:checked');\r\n        const indicadores = Array.from(checkboxes).map(cb => cb.value);\r\n        \r\n        const datos = datosEconomicos[periodoId];\r\n        \r\n        let simulacion = `\ud83d\udd2e SIMULACI\u00d3N ECON\u00d3MICA (${datos.periodo})\\n\\n`;\r\n        simulacion += `Modelo aplicado: ${politica.toUpperCase()}\\n\\n`;\r\n        \r\n        if (indicadores.includes('pib')) {\r\n            simulacion += `\ud83d\udcc8 CRECIMIENTO PIB: ${datos.crecimiento}\\n`;\r\n            simulacion += `   \u2022 Empleo: ${parseFloat(datos.crecimiento) > 5 ? \"Generaci\u00f3n alta\" : \"Moderado\/escaso\"}\\n`;\r\n            simulacion += `   \u2022 Ingresos: ${parseFloat(datos.crecimiento) > 5 ? \"Creciendo\" : \"Estancados\"}\\n`;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        if (indicadores.includes('inflacion')) {\r\n            simulacion += `\ud83d\udcb0 INFLACI\u00d3N: ${datos.inflacion}\\n`;\r\n            simulacion += `   \u2022 Poder adquisitivo: ${parseFloat(datos.inflacion) > 10 ? \"Erosion\u00e1ndose\" : \"Estable\"}\\n`;\r\n            simulacion += `   \u2022 Pobreza: ${parseFloat(datos.inflacion) > 20 ? \"Aumentando\" : \"Estable\"}\\n`;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        if (indicadores.includes('deuda')) {\r\n            simulacion += `\ud83c\udfe6 DEUDA EXTERNA: ${datos.deuda} del PIB\\n`;\r\n            simulacion += `   \u2022 Dependencia: ${parseFloat(datos.deuda) > 30 ? \"Alta (crisis posible)\" : \"Manejo prudente\"}\\n`;\r\n            simulacion += `   \u2022 Autonom\u00eda: ${parseFloat(datos.deuda) > 40 ? \"Limitada\" : \"Relativa\"}\\n`;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        if (indicadores.includes('desigualdad')) {\r\n            const desigualdad = periodoId === \"1990-2000\" ? \"Aumentando\" : \r\n                              periodoId.includes(\"197\") ? \"Estable\/alta\" : \r\n                              periodoId.includes(\"196\") ? \"Persistente\" : \"Moderada\";\r\n            simulacion += `\u2696\ufe0f DESIGUALDAD: ${desigualdad}\\n`;\r\n            simulacion += `   \u2022 Coef. Gini estimado: ${periodoId.includes(\"199\") ? \"0.55\" : \"0.50-0.53\"}\\n`;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        simulacion += `\\n\ud83d\udc8e CONCLUSI\u00d3N: ${periodoId.includes(\"198\") ? \"CRISIS\" : periodoId.includes(\"199\") ? \"RECUPERACI\u00d3N INCOMPLETA\" : \"CRECIMIENTO CON LIMITACIONES\"}`;\r\n        \r\n        alert(simulacion);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function compararPeriodos() {\r\n        const periodo1 = document.getElementById('periodoSelect').value;\r\n        const politica = document.getElementById('politicaSelect').value;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Encontrar otro periodo para comparar\r\n        let periodo2;\r\n        if (periodo1 === \"1940-1950\") periodo2 = \"1990-2000\";\r\n        else if (periodo1 === \"1990-2000\") periodo2 = \"1940-1950\";\r\n        else if (periodo1.includes(\"196\")) periodo2 = \"1980-1990\";\r\n        else periodo2 = \"1960-1970\";\r\n        \r\n        const datos1 = datosEconomicos[periodo1];\r\n        const datos2 = datosEconomicos[periodo2];\r\n        \r\n        const comparacion = `\r\n\ud83d\udd0d COMPARATIVA ECON\u00d3MICA HIST\u00d3RICA\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc5 ${periodo1} vs ${periodo2}\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc8 CRECIMIENTO PIB:\r\n\u2022 ${periodo1}: ${datos1.crecimiento}\r\n\u2022 ${periodo2}: ${datos2.crecimiento}\r\n\u2022 Diferencia: ${(parseFloat(datos1.crecimiento) - parseFloat(datos2.crecimiento)).toFixed(1)} puntos\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb0 INFLACI\u00d3N:\r\n\u2022 ${periodo1}: ${datos1.inflacion}\r\n\u2022 ${periodo2}: ${datos2.inflacion}\r\n\u2022 ${parseFloat(datos1.inflacion) > parseFloat(datos2.inflacion) ? \"M\u00e1s\" : \"Menos\"} estable\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe6 DEUDA\/PIB:\r\n\u2022 ${periodo1}: ${datos1.deuda}\r\n\u2022 ${periodo2}: ${datos2.deuda}\r\n\u2022 ${parseFloat(datos1.deuda) > parseFloat(datos2.deuda) ? \"Mayor\" : \"Menor\"} vulnerabilidad\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf MODELOS:\r\n\u2022 ${periodo1}: ${datos1.modelo}\r\n\u2022 ${periodo2}: ${datos2.modelo}\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcca CONCLUSI\u00d3N:\r\n${periodo1} fue de ${parseFloat(datos1.crecimiento) > 5 ? \"ALTO CRECIMIENTO\" : \"CRECIMIENTO MODESTO\"}\r\n${periodo2} fue de ${parseFloat(datos2.crecimiento) > 5 ? \"ALTO CRECIMIENTO\" : \"CRECIMIENTO MODESTO\"}\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1 LECCI\u00d3N: Cada modelo econ\u00f3mico genera diferentes resultados sociales.\r\n        `;\r\n        \r\n        alert(comparacion);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ L\u00cdNEA DE TIEMPO INTERACTIVA\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    const etapasContemporaneas = {\r\n        cardenismo: {\r\n            nombre: \"CARDENISMO\",\r\n            periodo: \"1934-1940\",\r\n            descripcion: \"Reforma agraria radical, expropiaci\u00f3n petrolera 1938, nacionalismo revolucionario.\",\r\n            color: \"#D32F2F\"\r\n        },\r\n        milagro: {\r\n            nombre: \"MILAGRO MEXICANO\",\r\n            periodo: \"1940-1970\",\r\n            descripcion: \"Crecimiento 6% anual, industrializaci\u00f3n, urbanizaci\u00f3n, desarrollo estabilizador.\",\r\n            color: \"#388E3C\"\r\n        },\r\n        desarrollo: {\r\n            nombre: \"DESARROLLISMO\",\r\n            periodo: \"1970-1982\",\r\n            descripcion: \"Petrod\u00f3lares, gasto p\u00fablico expansivo, inicio de crisis econ\u00f3mica.\",\r\n            color: \"#FF9800\"\r\n        },\r\n        crisis: {\r\n            nombre: \"1968 Y CRISIS\",\r\n            periodo: \"1968-1982\",\r\n            descripcion: \"Movimiento estudiantil, Tlatelolco, reformas pol\u00edticas, crisis econ\u00f3mica.\",\r\n            color: \"#7B1FA2\"\r\n        },\r\n        transicion: {\r\n            nombre: \"TRANSICI\u00d3N\",\r\n            periodo: \"1982-1994\",\r\n            descripcion: \"Neoliberalismo, reformas electorales, TLCAN, crisis 1994.\",\r\n            color: \"#2196F3\"\r\n        },\r\n        alternancia: {\r\n            nombre: \"ALTERNANCIA\",\r\n            periodo: \"1994-2000\",\r\n            descripcion: \"IFE aut\u00f3nomo, elecciones competitivas, victoria de Fox 2000.\",\r\n            color: \"#9C27B0\"\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    \r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.timeline-btn').forEach(btn => {\r\n        btn.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const etapa = this.dataset.etapa;\r\n            mostrarDetalleEtapa(etapa);\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Resaltar en timeline\r\n            document.querySelectorAll('.etapa-bar').forEach(bar => {\r\n                bar.classList.remove('active');\r\n            });\r\n            document.querySelector(`.etapa-bar[data-etapa=\"${etapa}\"]`).classList.add('active');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Resaltar bot\u00f3n\r\n            document.querySelectorAll('.timeline-btn').forEach(b => {\r\n                b.style.background = '';\r\n            });\r\n            this.style.background = etapasContemporaneas[etapa].color;\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarDetalleEtapa(etapa) {\r\n        const info = etapasContemporaneas[etapa];\r\n        if (!info) return;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar todos los detalles\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.etapa-detalle').forEach(detalle => {\r\n            detalle.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Mostrar el detalle correspondiente\r\n        const detalle = document.getElementById(`detalle${etapa.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + etapa.slice(1)}`);\r\n        if (detalle) {\r\n            detalle.style.display = 'block';\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Actualizar informaci\u00f3n\r\n        document.getElementById('timelineInfo').innerHTML = `\r\n            <strong>${info.nombre}<\/strong> (${info.periodo})<br>\r\n            ${info.descripcion}\r\n        `;\r\n        document.getElementById('timelineInfo').style.animation = \"highlight 0.5s\";\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcc5 Etapa contempor\u00e1nea seleccionada: ${info.nombre}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE QUIZ INTERACTIVO\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    let quizRespuestas = [];\r\n    let quizCompletado = false;\r\n    \r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n        option.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            if (quizCompletado) return;\r\n            \r\n            const question = this.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n            const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n            const selected = this.dataset.value;\r\n            const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Remover selecci\u00f3n previa\r\n            question.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n                opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Marcar selecci\u00f3n actual\r\n            this.classList.add('selected');\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar respuesta\r\n            if (selected === correct) {\r\n                this.classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(true);\r\n            } else {\r\n                this.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n                \/\/ Marcar tambi\u00e9n la correcta\r\n                question.querySelector(`[data-value=\"${correct}\"]`).classList.add('correct');\r\n                quizRespuestas.push(false);\r\n            }\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Mostrar feedback\r\n            feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n            \r\n            \/\/ Verificar si todas las preguntas est\u00e1n respondidas\r\n            verificarCompletadoQuiz();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    function verificarCompletadoQuiz() {\r\n        const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question');\r\n        const answered = Array.from(questions).every(q => \r\n            q.querySelector('.quiz-option.selected')\r\n        );\r\n        \r\n        if (answered && !quizCompletado) {\r\n            quizCompletado = true;\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n        const correctas = quizRespuestas.filter(r => r).length;\r\n        const total = quizRespuestas.length;\r\n        const porcentaje = Math.round((correctas \/ total) * 100);\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n        \r\n        let feedback = \"\";\r\n        if (porcentaje >= 80) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83c\udf89 \u00a1Excelente! Dominas el M\u00e9xico contempor\u00e1neo.\";\r\n        } else if (porcentaje >= 60) {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udc4d Buen trabajo, pero revisa la transici\u00f3n democr\u00e1tica.\";\r\n        } else {\r\n            feedback = \"\ud83d\udcda Necesitas repasar el M\u00e9xico del siglo XX.\";\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedback;\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    function reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n        quizRespuestas = [];\r\n        quizCompletado = false;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Limpiar selecciones\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => {\r\n            opt.classList.remove('selected', 'correct', 'incorrect');\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar feedbacks\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-feedback').forEach(fb => {\r\n            fb.style.display = 'none';\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ Ocultar resultados\r\n        document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ SISTEMA DE AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    function guardarAutoevaluacion() {\r\n        const slider1 = document.getElementById('slider1').value;\r\n        const slider2 = document.getElementById('slider2').value;\r\n        const slider3 = document.getElementById('slider3').value;\r\n        \r\n        const promedio = (parseInt(slider1) + parseInt(slider2) + parseInt(slider3)) \/ 3;\r\n        \r\n        alert(`\ud83d\udcca AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada:\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Cardenismo: ${slider1}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Milagro Mexicano: ${slider2}\/5\\n` +\r\n              `Transici\u00f3n democr\u00e1tica: ${slider3}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Promedio: ${promedio.toFixed(1)}\/5\\n\\n` +\r\n              `Revisa el plan de estudio seg\u00fan tus resultados.`);\r\n        \r\n        console.log(`\ud83d\udcbe AutoEvaluaci\u00f3n guardada: ${slider1}, ${slider2}, ${slider3}`);\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \/\/ INICIALIZACI\u00d3N\r\n    \/\/ ========================================\r\n    \r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\ude80 Sistema Cyberpunk Contempor\u00e1neo inicializado\");\r\n    console.log(\"\ud83d\udcda Lecci\u00f3n: M\u00e9xico Contempor\u00e1neo (1934-2000)\");\r\n    console.log(\"\u26a1 Simulador econ\u00f3mico, Timeline y Quiz listos\");\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Inicializar simulador\r\n    cambiarPeriodoEconomico();\r\n    mostrarDetalleEtapa('cardenismo');\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Objetivos interactivos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const completado = this.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n            this.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n            const checkbox = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n            checkbox.textContent = !completado ? '\u2713' : '';\r\n            checkbox.style.backgroundColor = !completado ? '#39FF14' : '';\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Modelos econ\u00f3micos interactivos\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.modelo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const modelo = this.querySelector('h4').textContent;\r\n            \r\n            const modelosInfo = {\r\n                \"ECONOM\u00cdA AGRARIA (1934)\": \"\ud83c\udf3e AGRARIA (1934): 65% poblaci\u00f3n rural. Exportaci\u00f3n materias primas. Reforma agraria cardenista. Nacionalismo econ\u00f3mico. Industrializaci\u00f3n incipiente.\",\r\n                \"SUSTITUCI\u00d3N IMPORTACIONES (1940-70)\": \"\ud83c\udfed SUSTITUCI\u00d3N IMPORTACIONES: Industrializaci\u00f3n protegida. Empresa paraestatal. Mercado interno protegido. 'Desarrollo estabilizador'. Crecimiento 6% anual.\",\r\n                \"CRISIS Y AJUSTE (1970-82)\": \"\ud83d\udca5 CRISIS Y AJUSTE: Petrod\u00f3lares, gasto p\u00fablico expansivo. Deuda externa explosiva. Nacionalizaci\u00f3n banca 1982. Inflaci\u00f3n descontrolada.\",\r\n                \"NEOLIBERALISMO (1982-2000)\": \"\ud83c\udf10 NEOLIBERALISMO: Apertura comercial. Privatizaciones. TLCAN 1994. Reducci\u00f3n Estado. Dependencia exportaciones\/EE.UU.\"\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            alert(`${modelo}\\n\\n${modelosInfo[modelo] || \"Informaci\u00f3n no disponible\"}`);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Estad\u00edsticas interactivas\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.estadistica-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const valor = this.querySelector('.estadistica-valor').textContent;\r\n            const label = this.querySelector('.estadistica-label').textContent;\r\n            \r\n            const datosInfo = {\r\n                \"20M \u2192 100M\": \"Poblaci\u00f3n: 20 millones (1934) \u2192 100 millones (2000). Crecimiento x5 en 66 a\u00f1os. Transici\u00f3n demogr\u00e1fica acelerada.\",\r\n                \"35% \u2192 80%\": \"Urbanizaci\u00f3n: 35% (1940) \u2192 80% (2000). Migraci\u00f3n masiva campo-ciudad. CDMX de 1.5M a 20M en \u00e1rea metropolitana.\",\r\n                \"6%\": \"Crecimiento anual promedio 1940-1970. 'Milagro Mexicano'. Industrializaci\u00f3n acelerada. Estabilidad macroecon\u00f3mica.\",\r\n                \"18M\": \"Hect\u00e1reas repartidas por C\u00e1rdenas (1934-1940). 800,000 campesinos beneficiados. Culminaci\u00f3n reforma agraria revolucionaria.\",\r\n                \"71 a\u00f1os\": \"Hegemon\u00eda PRI (1929-2000). Partido oficial, corporativismo, presidencialismo autoritario. Alternancia en 2000.\",\r\n                \"42.5%\": \"Votos de Vicente Fox en 2000. Primera derrota presidencial del PRI. Coalici\u00f3n PAN-PVEM. 'Ya cambi\u00f3 M\u00e9xico'.\"\r\n            };\r\n            \r\n            this.style.animation = \"pulse 0.5s\";\r\n            setTimeout(() => {\r\n                this.style.animation = \"\";\r\n            }, 500);\r\n            \r\n            console.log(`\ud83d\udcca Dato contempor\u00e1neo: ${valor} ${label}`);\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Gr\u00e1fico interactivo\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.barra-anio').forEach(barra => {\r\n        barra.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const anio = this.dataset.anio;\r\n            document.getElementById('periodoSelect').value = anio;\r\n            cambiarPeriodoEconomico();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Problemas de examen\r\n    function verificarProblema(num) {\r\n        const solucion = document.getElementById(`solucionP${num}`);\r\n        solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    \/\/ Efecto de pulse para animaciones\r\n    const style = document.createElement('style');\r\n    style.textContent = `\r\n        @keyframes pulse {\r\n            0% { transform: scale(1); }\r\n            50% { transform: scale(1.05); }\r\n            100% { transform: scale(1); }\r\n        }\r\n    `;\r\n    document.head.appendChild(style);\r\n    <\/script>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<!-- FIN LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Expropiaci\u00f3n petrolera","respuesta":"18 marzo 1938"},{"enunciado":"Presidente Cardenismo","respuesta":"L\u00e1zaro C\u00e1rdenas"},{"enunciado":"Milagro Mexicano","respuesta":"1940-1970"},{"enunciado":"Crecimiento anual promedio","respuesta":"~6%"},{"enunciado":"Masacre estudiantil","respuesta":"2 octubre 1968"},{"enunciado":"Lugar de Tlatelolco","respuesta":"CDMX"},{"enunciado":"Primer presidente no PRI","respuesta":"Vicente Fox"},{"enunciado":"Partido de Fox","respuesta":"PAN"},{"enunciado":"Hect\u00e1reas repartidas C\u00e1rdenas","respuesta":"18 millones"},{"enunciado":"Empresa creada 1938","respuesta":"PEMEX"},{"enunciado":"Poblaci\u00f3n 1970","respuesta":"~50 millones"},{"enunciado":"SI: a\u00f1os alternancia","respuesta":"25"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Expropiaci\u00f3n","opciones":["1938","1917","1968","2000"],"correcta":"1938"},{"pregunta":"C\u00e1rdenas reparti\u00f3","opciones":["18M ha","1M","100M","0"],"correcta":"18M ha"},{"pregunta":"Milagro Mexicano","opciones":["1940-1970","1930-1940","1970-2000","2000-2025"],"correcta":"1940-1970"},{"pregunta":"Crecimiento PIB","opciones":["~6%","1%","10%","0%"],"correcta":"~6%"},{"pregunta":"Tlatelolco","opciones":["2 Oct 1968","18 Mar 1938","2 Jul 2000","5 Feb 1917"],"correcta":"2 Oct 1968"},{"pregunta":"Muertos 68","opciones":["~300","30","3,000","0"],"correcta":"~300"},{"pregunta":"Alternancia","opciones":["2000","1968","1938","1910"],"correcta":"2000"},{"pregunta":"Fox partido","opciones":["PAN","PRI","PRD","MORENA"],"correcta":"PAN"},{"pregunta":"PEMEX significa","opciones":["Petr\u00f3leos Mexicanos","Poder Ejecutivo","Partido Mexicano","Nada"],"correcta":"Petr\u00f3leos Mexicanos"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: a\u00f1os PEMEX","opciones":["87","100","50","25"],"correcta":"87"},{"pregunta":"C\u00e1rdenas cre\u00f3","opciones":["PEMEX","INE","CFE","IMSS"],"correcta":"PEMEX"},{"pregunta":"Milagro basado en","opciones":["ISI","Neoliberalismo","Comunismo","Nada"],"correcta":"ISI"},{"pregunta":"68 antes de","opciones":["Juegos Ol\u00edmpicos","Mundial 70","Independencia","Reforma"],"correcta":"Juegos Ol\u00edmpicos"},{"pregunta":"PRI gobern\u00f3","opciones":["71 a\u00f1os","20","100","10"],"correcta":"71 a\u00f1os"},{"pregunta":"2000 votaci\u00f3n","opciones":["58%","30%","80%","10%"],"correcta":"58%"},{"pregunta":"IFE fundado","opciones":["1990","1938","1968","2000"],"correcta":"1990"},{"pregunta":"INE desde","opciones":["2014","2000","1990","1968"],"correcta":"2014"},{"pregunta":"Poblaci\u00f3n 1940","opciones":["~20M","50M","100M","10M"],"correcta":"~20M"},{"pregunta":"Poblaci\u00f3n 1970","opciones":["~50M","20M","100M","10M"],"correcta":"~50M"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: a\u00f1os Tlatelolco","opciones":["57","50","60","70"],"correcta":"57"},{"pregunta":"C\u00e1rdenas sindicato","opciones":["CTM","SNTMMRM","SNTE","CFE"],"correcta":"CTM"},{"pregunta":"Milagro termin\u00f3 con","opciones":["Crisis 1970s","68","2000","1938"],"correcta":"Crisis 1970s"},{"pregunta":"68 l\u00edder estudiantil","opciones":["CNH","PRI","PAN","UNAM"],"correcta":"CNH"},{"pregunta":"2000 candidato PRI","opciones":["Labastida","Fox","C\u00e1rdenas","Madrazo"],"correcta":"Labastida"},{"pregunta":"Fox campa\u00f1a","opciones":["\u00a1Ya!","S\u00ed se puede","Vive M\u00e9xico","Cambio"],"correcta":"\u00a1Ya!"},{"pregunta":"PEMEX exporta","opciones":["Crudo","Gasolina","Electricidad","Nada"],"correcta":"Crudo"},{"pregunta":"Milagro: carreteras","opciones":["15,000 km","1,000","100,000","0"],"correcta":"15,000 km"},{"pregunta":"68: Batall\u00f3n Olimpia","opciones":["Represi\u00f3n","Deporte","Paz","Nada"],"correcta":"Represi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: alternancia","opciones":["25 a\u00f1os","10","50","71"],"correcta":"25 a\u00f1os"},{"pregunta":"M\u00e9xico 2000","opciones":["Democracia plena","Dictadura","Monarqu\u00eda","Colonia"],"correcta":"Democracia plena"}]}],"Programaci\u00f3n":[{"materia":"Programaci\u00f3n","slug":"bases-datos-relacionales","titulo":"Bases de Datos Relacionales: Arquitectura SQL, Normalizaci\u00f3n y Simulaci\u00f3n Cu\u00e1ntica","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK PROGRAMACI\u00d3N -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-programacion-bases-datos\" data-tema=\"bases-datos-relacionales\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- 1\ufe0f\u20e3 INTRODUCCI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83d\udcbe<\/span>\r\n            BASES DE DATOS RELACIONALES\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            SQL, Normalizaci\u00f3n y Arquitectura Cu\u00e1ntica de Datos\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Dominar sintaxis SQL b\u00e1sica y avanzada<\/h3>\r\n                <p>SELECT, JOIN, WHERE, GROUP BY, ORDER BY, funciones agregadas<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Dise\u00f1ar esquemas normalizados (1NF-3NF)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Aplicar reglas de normalizaci\u00f3n en modelos complejos<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Implementar relaciones 1:1, 1:N, N:N<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Claves primarias, for\u00e1neas e integridad referencial<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Optimizar consultas SQL<\/h3>\r\n                <p>\u00cdndices, subconsultas, vistas y procedimientos almacenados<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfe6 Sistemas Bancarios<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Transacciones ACID, claves for\u00e1neas para cuentas-clientes<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">99.999% disponibilidad<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\uded2 E-commerce<\/h3>\r\n                <p>JOINs masivos entre productos, usuarios, pedidos<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">10M+ consultas\/d\u00eda<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfe5 Historias Cl\u00ednicas<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Normalizaci\u00f3n extrema para evitar duplicados<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">HIPAA compliant<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"relacion-curricular\">\r\n            <h3>RELACI\u00d3N CURRICULAR<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"badges\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge\">Competencia: Dise\u00f1o de Sistemas de Informaci\u00f3n<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge\">Contenido: Modelado de Datos<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge\">Evaluaci\u00f3n: Proyecto de BD Real<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 2\ufe0f\u20e3 DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO ESTRUCTURADO -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> ARQUITECTURA RELACIONAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n       \r\n        <!-- INTRODUCCI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Fundamentos Codd<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\uddc4\ufe0f BASE DE DATOS RELACIONAL<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Sistema que organiza datos en <strong>tablas<\/strong> (relaciones) interconectadas mediante <strong>claves<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"principios-grid\">\r\n                        <div class=\"principio\">\r\n                            <div class=\"principio-icon\">\ud83d\udd11<\/div>\r\n                            <h5>Integridad Referencial<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>FK siempre apunta a PK existente<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"principio\">\r\n                            <div class=\"principio-icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/div>\r\n                            <h5>Normalizaci\u00f3n<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Eliminar redundancia y anomal\u00edas<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"principio\">\r\n                            <div class=\"principio-icon\">\u26a1<\/div>\r\n                            <h5>ACID<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Atomicidad, Consistencia, Aislamiento, Durabilidad<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"clasificacion-doble\">\r\n                <div class=\"clas-card sql\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcdd SQL (Structured Query Language)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>DDL:<\/strong> CREATE, ALTER, DROP<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>DML:<\/strong> SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>DCL:<\/strong> GRANT, REVOKE<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>TCL:<\/strong> COMMIT, ROLLBACK<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Dialectos:<\/strong> MySQL, PostgreSQL, SQL Server, Oracle\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"clas-card no-sql\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udeab NoSQL (Contraste)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Documentos:<\/strong> MongoDB, CouchDB<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Grafos:<\/strong> Neo4j<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Clave-Valor:<\/strong> Redis<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Columnar:<\/strong> Cassandra<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Ventaja:<\/strong> Escalabilidad horizontal\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <!-- CLAVES Y RELACIONES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Sistema de Claves<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"comparativa-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"comp-card pk\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd11 PRIMARY KEY (PK)<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"comp-badge\">Identificador \u00danico<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Definici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Columna(s) que identifican \u00fanica y exclusivamente cada fila<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Caracter\u00edsticas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>NO NULL (no acepta valores nulos)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>UNIQUE (valores \u00fanicos en toda la tabla)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>\u00cdndice autom\u00e1tico (b\u00fasqueda r\u00e1pida)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Una sola por tabla (puede ser compuesta)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"codigo\">id INT PRIMARY KEY<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"desc\">Entero auto-incremental<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"codigo\">dni VARCHAR(20) PRIMARY KEY<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"desc\">Texto \u00fanico (documento)<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"codigo\">PRIMARY KEY (user_id, course_id)<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"desc\">Clave compuesta<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"comp-card fk\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udd17 FOREIGN KEY (FK)<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"comp-badge\">Referencia Relacional<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Definici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Columna que referencia la PK de otra tabla<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Reglas de Integridad:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>ON DELETE CASCADE (elimina filas relacionadas)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>ON DELETE SET NULL (establece FK como NULL)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>ON DELETE RESTRICT (previene eliminaci\u00f3n)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>ON UPDATE CASCADE (actualiza referencias)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"codigo\">user_id INT REFERENCES users(id)<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"desc\">FK simple<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"codigo\">FOREIGN KEY (dept_id) REFERENCES departments(id) ON DELETE CASCADE<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"desc\">Con acci\u00f3n en cascada<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"regla-oro\">\r\n                <h4>\u26a1 REGLA DE ORO: PK vs FK<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"regla-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"regla-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-icon\">\ud83d\udd11<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-text\">\r\n                            <strong>PK:<\/strong> Una por tabla, identifica <strong>esta<\/strong> fila\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"regla-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-icon\">\ud83d\udd17<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-text\">\r\n                            <strong>FK:<\/strong> M\u00faltiples por tabla, apunta a <strong>otra<\/strong> tabla\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <!-- TIPOS DE RELACIONES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Tipos de Relaciones<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>TIPO<\/th>\r\n                            <th>CARDINALIDAD<\/th>\r\n                            <th>IMPLEMENTACI\u00d3N<\/th>\r\n                            <th>EJEMPLO REAL<\/th>\r\n                            <th>PATR\u00d3N SQL<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"uno-a-uno\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">1:1<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Un registro \u2192 Un registro<\/td>\r\n                            <td>FK UNIQUE en cualquiera de las tablas<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Usuario \u2190\u2192 Perfil<\/td>\r\n                            <td><code>FK UNIQUE<\/code><\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"uno-a-muchos\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">1:N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Un registro \u2192 Muchos registros<\/td>\r\n                            <td>FK en tabla \"muchos\"<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Cliente \u2190\u2192 Pedidos<\/td>\r\n                            <td><code>FK sin UNIQUE<\/code><\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"muchos-a-muchos\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">N:N<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Muchos registros \u2192 Muchos registros<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Tabla intermedia con dos FK<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Estudiantes \u2190\u2192 Cursos<\/td>\r\n                            <td><code>Tabla pivot<\/code><\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoRelacion\">\r\n                    Selecciona un tipo de relaci\u00f3n para ver detalles de implementaci\u00f3n\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"relacion-ejemplos\">\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-detalle\" id=\"detalle11\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd0d Implementaci\u00f3n 1:1<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcdd SQL Ejemplo<\/h5>\r\n                            <pre><code>\r\nCREATE TABLE usuarios (\r\n    id INT PRIMARY KEY,\r\n    email VARCHAR(100) UNIQUE\r\n);\r\nCREATE TABLE perfiles (\r\n    id INT PRIMARY KEY,\r\n    usuario_id INT UNIQUE,\r\n    bio TEXT,\r\n    FOREIGN KEY (usuario_id) REFERENCES usuarios(id)\r\n);\r\n                            <\/code><\/pre>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfaf Casos de Uso<\/h5>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Usuario \u2192 Perfil (datos extendidos)<\/li>\r\n                                <li>Producto \u2192 Detalles t\u00e9cnicos<\/li>\r\n                                <li>Empleado \u2192 Datos confidenciales<\/li>\r\n                            <\/ul>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-detalle\" id=\"detalle1N\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd0d Implementaci\u00f3n 1:N<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcdd SQL Ejemplo<\/h5>\r\n                            <pre><code>\r\nCREATE TABLE departamentos (\r\n    id INT PRIMARY KEY,\r\n    nombre VARCHAR(100)\r\n);\r\nCREATE TABLE empleados (\r\n    id INT PRIMARY KEY,\r\n    nombre VARCHAR(100),\r\n    dept_id INT,\r\n    FOREIGN KEY (dept_id) REFERENCES departamentos(id)\r\n);\r\n                            <\/code><\/pre>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfaf Casos de Uso<\/h5>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Departamento \u2192 Empleados<\/li>\r\n                                <li>Categor\u00eda \u2192 Productos<\/li>\r\n                                <li>Autor \u2192 Libros<\/li>\r\n                            <\/ul>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-detalle\" id=\"detalleNN\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd0d Implementaci\u00f3n N:N<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcdd SQL Ejemplo<\/h5>\r\n                            <pre><code>\r\nCREATE TABLE estudiantes (\r\n    id INT PRIMARY KEY,\r\n    nombre VARCHAR(100)\r\n);\r\nCREATE TABLE cursos (\r\n    id INT PRIMARY KEY,\r\n    nombre VARCHAR(100)\r\n);\r\nCREATE TABLE estudiantes_cursos (\r\n    estudiante_id INT,\r\n    curso_id INT,\r\n    fecha_inscripcion DATE,\r\n    PRIMARY KEY (estudiante_id, curso_id),\r\n    FOREIGN KEY (estudiante_id) REFERENCES estudiantes(id),\r\n    FOREIGN KEY (curso_id) REFERENCES cursos(id)\r\n);\r\n                            <\/code><\/pre>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfaf Casos de Uso<\/h5>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Etiquetas \u2192 Art\u00edculos<\/li>\r\n                                <li>Doctores \u2192 Pacientes<\/li>\r\n                                <li>Ingredientes \u2192 Recetas<\/li>\r\n                            <\/ul>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <!-- NORMALIZACI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Normalizaci\u00f3n: 1NF \u2192 3NF<\/h3>\r\n            <p class=\"principio-clave\">\r\n                <strong>Objetivo:<\/strong> Eliminar redundancia, prevenir anomal\u00edas de inserci\u00f3n\/actualizaci\u00f3n\/eliminaci\u00f3n\r\n            <\/p>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"normalizacion-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"nf-card\" data-nf=\"1nf\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nf-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"nf-badge\">1NF<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Primera Forma Normal<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"nf-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Reglas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Valores at\u00f3micos (una celda = un valor)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Sin columnas repetidas<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Identificador \u00fanico por fila<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                        <div class=\"nf-ejemplo\">\r\n                            <strong>\u274c Antes:<\/strong> <code>telefonos: \"555-1234, 555-5678\"<\/code><br>\r\n                            <strong>\u2705 Despu\u00e9s:<\/strong> Tabla separada de tel\u00e9fonos\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"nf-card\" data-nf=\"2nf\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nf-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"nf-badge\">2NF<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Segunda Forma Normal<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"nf-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Reglas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Cumple 1NF<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Sin dependencias parciales<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Todos los atributos dependen de TODA la PK<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                        <div class=\"nf-ejemplo\">\r\n                            <strong>\u274c Antes:<\/strong> PK compuesta, algunos datos solo dependen de parte de la PK<br>\r\n                            <strong>\u2705 Despu\u00e9s:<\/strong> Separar en tablas por dependencia completa\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"nf-card\" data-nf=\"3nf\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nf-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"nf-badge\">3NF<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Tercera Forma Normal<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"nf-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Reglas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Cumple 2NF<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Sin dependencias transitivas<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Atributos no-PK no dependen de otros no-PK<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                        <div class=\"nf-ejemplo\">\r\n                            <strong>\u274c Antes:<\/strong> <code>empleado \u2192 departamento \u2192 ciudad<\/code><br>\r\n                            <strong>\u2705 Despu\u00e9s:<\/strong> Ciudad en tabla departamentos\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 3\ufe0f\u20e3 SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO (SQL + ER) -->\r\n    <section class=\"interactivos-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR SQL Y CONSTRUCTOR ER\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}\r\nbody{font-family:var(--font-sans,sans-serif)}\r\n.sim-wrap{padding:1rem 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2rem}\r\n\r\n\/* \u2500\u2500\u2500 TABS \u2500\u2500\u2500 *\/\r\n.tabs{display:flex;gap:0;border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);margin-bottom:1.5rem}\r\n.tab{padding:8px 18px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;border:none;background:none;color:var(--color-text-secondary);border-bottom:2px solid transparent;transition:all .15s}\r\n.tab.active{color:var(--color-text-primary);border-bottom:2px solid var(--color-text-primary);font-weight:500}\r\n\r\n\/* \u2500\u2500\u2500 ER DIAGRAM \u2500\u2500\u2500 *\/\r\n#er-panel{display:flex;gap:12px;height:580px}\r\n.er-sidebar{width:220px;flex-shrink:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\r\n.er-sidebar h3{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--color-text-secondary);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:2px}\r\n.er-canvas{flex:1;background:var(--color-background-secondary);border:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);border-radius:var(--border-radius-lg);position:relative;overflow:hidden;cursor:default}\r\n.er-canvas svg{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none}\r\n.er-canvas svg .rel-line{pointer-events:none}\r\n\r\n\/* Table cards on canvas *\/\r\n.db-table{position:absolute;background:var(--color-background-primary);border:1.5px solid var(--color-border-secondary);border-radius:8px;min-width:160px;cursor:move;user-select:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08);z-index:10;transition:box-shadow .15s}\r\n.db-table:hover{box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.13);z-index:20}\r\n.db-table.selected{border-color:var(--color-text-info);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(59,139,212,.18)}\r\n.db-table-head{padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;background:var(--color-background-info);color:var(--color-text-info);border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;cursor:move}\r\n.db-table-head .tname{max-width:110px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}\r\n.db-table-head .del-btn{width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:3px;border:none;background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);color:inherit;cursor:pointer;font-size:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;opacity:.7;transition:opacity .1s;flex-shrink:0}\r\n.db-table-head .del-btn:hover{opacity:1}\r\n.db-table-body{padding:0}\r\n.db-field{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:5px 10px;font-size:11px;border-top:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);gap:6px;cursor:default}\r\n.db-field.pk{background:rgba(250,206,66,.09)}\r\n.db-field.fk{background:rgba(59,139,212,.07)}\r\n.db-field .fi{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:9px;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:700}\r\n.db-field .fi.pk{background:#FAEEDA;color:#854F0B}\r\n.db-field .fi.fk{background:#E6F1FB;color:#185FA5}\r\n.db-field .fi.idx{background:#F1EFE8;color:#5F5E5A}\r\n.db-field .fname{flex:1;color:var(--color-text-primary);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\r\n.db-field .ftype{color:var(--color-text-tertiary);font-size:10px;flex-shrink:0}\r\n.db-field .port{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid var(--color-border-secondary);margin-left:auto;cursor:crosshair;flex-shrink:0;transition:background .1s}\r\n.db-field .port:hover,.db-field .port.active{background:var(--color-background-info);border-color:var(--color-text-info)}\r\n.add-field-row{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:4px 10px;font-size:10px;color:var(--color-text-tertiary);cursor:pointer;border-top:0.5px dashed var(--color-border-tertiary);gap:4px}\r\n.add-field-row:hover{color:var(--color-text-secondary);background:var(--color-background-secondary)}\r\n\r\n\/* Sidebar controls *\/\r\n.er-ctrl-card{background:var(--color-background-primary);border:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);border-radius:var(--border-radius-md);padding:10px}\r\n.er-ctrl-card label{font-size:11px;color:var(--color-text-secondary);display:block;margin-bottom:4px}\r\n.er-ctrl-card input,.er-ctrl-card select{width:100%;font-size:12px;padding:5px 8px;border:0.5px solid var(--color-border-secondary);border-radius:6px;background:var(--color-background-secondary);color:var(--color-text-primary)}\r\n.er-ctrl-card input:focus,.er-ctrl-card select:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--color-border-primary)}\r\n.er-btn{width:100%;padding:7px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;border:0.5px solid var(--color-border-secondary);border-radius:6px;background:var(--color-background-primary);color:var(--color-text-primary);cursor:pointer;transition:background .12s}\r\n.er-btn:hover{background:var(--color-background-secondary)}\r\n.er-btn.primary{background:var(--color-background-info);color:var(--color-text-info);border-color:var(--color-border-info)}\r\n.er-btn.primary:hover{opacity:.85}\r\n.er-btn.danger{color:var(--color-text-danger);border-color:var(--color-border-danger)}\r\n.er-btn.danger:hover{background:var(--color-background-danger)}\r\n.rel-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;border:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);background:var(--color-background-secondary);color:var(--color-text-secondary);transition:all .12s}\r\n.rel-badge.active{background:var(--color-background-info);color:var(--color-text-info);border-color:var(--color-border-info)}\r\n.rel-badges{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}\r\n.schema-legend{font-size:10px;color:var(--color-text-tertiary);line-height:1.7}\r\n.schema-legend span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin-right:8px}\r\n\r\n\/* \u2500\u2500\u2500 SQL SIMULATOR \u2500\u2500\u2500 *\/\r\n#sql-panel{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\r\n.sql-row{display:flex;gap:12px}\r\n.sql-editor-box{flex:1;background:var(--color-background-primary);border:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);border-radius:var(--border-radius-lg);overflow:hidden}\r\n.sql-editor-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);background:var(--color-background-secondary)}\r\n.sql-editor-header span{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}\r\n.sql-editor-header .hbtns{display:flex;gap:6px}\r\n.hbtn{padding:4px 10px;font-size:11px;border:0.5px solid var(--color-border-secondary);border-radius:5px;background:transparent;color:var(--color-text-secondary);cursor:pointer;transition:background .1s}\r\n.hbtn:hover{background:var(--color-background-secondary)}\r\n.sql-textarea{width:100%;padding:12px;font-family:var(--font-mono,monospace);font-size:12px;border:none;outline:none;background:transparent;color:var(--color-text-primary);resize:none;line-height:1.6;min-height:160px}\r\n.sql-footer{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:8px 12px;border-top:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);background:var(--color-background-secondary)}\r\n.sql-run{padding:6px 16px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;background:var(--color-background-success);color:var(--color-text-success);border:0.5px solid var(--color-border-success);border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer}\r\n.sql-run:hover{opacity:.85}\r\n.sql-clear{padding:6px 12px;font-size:12px;border:0.5px solid var(--color-border-secondary);border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:var(--color-text-secondary);cursor:pointer}\r\n.sql-clear:hover{background:var(--color-background-secondary)}\r\n.sql-shortcuts{width:200px;flex-shrink:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}\r\n.sql-shortcuts h4{font-size:11px;font-weight:500;color:var(--color-text-secondary);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em}\r\n.sq-btn{padding:6px 8px;font-size:11px;border:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);border-radius:6px;background:var(--color-background-primary);color:var(--color-text-primary);cursor:pointer;text-align:left;transition:background .1s;font-family:var(--font-mono,monospace)}\r\n.sq-btn:hover{background:var(--color-background-secondary)}\r\n.sql-result-box{background:var(--color-background-primary);border:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);border-radius:var(--border-radius-lg);overflow:hidden}\r\n.sql-result-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);background:var(--color-background-secondary)}\r\n.sql-result-header span{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}\r\n.result-stats{font-size:11px;color:var(--color-text-tertiary)}\r\n.result-table-wrap{overflow:auto;max-height:220px}\r\n.result-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px}\r\n.result-table th{padding:6px 12px;text-align:left;background:var(--color-background-secondary);border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);font-weight:500;color:var(--color-text-secondary);font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap}\r\n.result-table td{padding:6px 12px;border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);color:var(--color-text-primary);white-space:nowrap}\r\n.result-table tr:hover td{background:var(--color-background-secondary)}\r\n.result-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}\r\n.null-val{color:var(--color-text-tertiary);font-style:italic}\r\n.result-placeholder{padding:2rem;text-align:center;color:var(--color-text-tertiary);font-size:13px}\r\n.sql-analysis{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:0}\r\n.analysis-card{flex:1;background:var(--color-background-primary);border:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);border-radius:var(--border-radius-md);padding:10px}\r\n.analysis-card h4{font-size:11px;font-weight:500;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-bottom:8px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em}\r\n.plan-step{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:6px;font-size:11px;padding:3px 0;color:var(--color-text-primary)}\r\n.plan-num{width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--color-background-info);color:var(--color-text-info);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px}\r\n.tip-item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:6px;font-size:11px;padding:3px 0;color:var(--color-text-primary)}\r\n.tip-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-background-success);border:1.5px solid var(--color-border-success);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px}\r\n.warn-dot{background:var(--color-background-warning);border-color:var(--color-border-warning)}\r\n.metric-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:11px;padding:3px 0;border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary)}\r\n.metric-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}\r\n.metric-row .ml{color:var(--color-text-secondary)}\r\n.metric-row .mv{font-weight:500;color:var(--color-text-primary);font-family:var(--font-mono,monospace);font-size:11px}\r\n.db-selector{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}\r\n.db-pill{padding:4px 10px;font-size:11px;border:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);border-radius:20px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--color-background-primary);color:var(--color-text-secondary);transition:all .12s}\r\n.db-pill.active{background:var(--color-background-info);color:var(--color-text-info);border-color:var(--color-border-info)}\r\n.error-msg{color:var(--color-text-danger);font-size:12px;padding:12px;font-family:var(--font-mono,monospace)}\r\n<\/style>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"sim-wrap\">\r\n  <div class=\"tabs\">\r\n    <button class=\"tab active\" onclick=\"showTab('er')\">ER Diagram Builder<\/button>\r\n    <button class=\"tab\" onclick=\"showTab('sql')\">SQL Simulator<\/button>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- ER PANEL -->\r\n  <div id=\"er-panel\">\r\n    <div class=\"er-sidebar\">\r\n      <h3>Nueva Tabla<\/h3>\r\n      <div class=\"er-ctrl-card\">\r\n        <label>Nombre de tabla<\/label>\r\n        <input id=\"tbl-name\" placeholder=\"ej. clientes\" onkeydown=\"if(event.key==='Enter')addTable()\">\r\n        <div style=\"margin-top:8px\">\r\n          <button class=\"er-btn primary\" onclick=\"addTable()\">+ Agregar tabla<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n\r\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:4px\">Relaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n      <div class=\"er-ctrl-card\">\r\n        <label>Tipo<\/label>\r\n        <div class=\"rel-badges\" id=\"rel-type-badges\">\r\n          <span class=\"rel-badge active\" onclick=\"setRelType('1:1',this)\">1:1<\/span>\r\n          <span class=\"rel-badge\" onclick=\"setRelType('1:N',this)\">1:N<\/span>\r\n          <span class=\"rel-badge\" onclick=\"setRelType('N:N',this)\">N:N<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div style=\"margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--color-text-tertiary)\" id=\"rel-hint\">Haz clic en el puerto (\u25cf) de un campo PK para iniciar una relaci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n        <div style=\"margin-top:8px\" id=\"rel-status\"><\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"er-ctrl-card\" style=\"margin-top:auto\">\r\n        <div class=\"schema-legend\">\r\n          <span><span style=\"background:#FAEEDA;color:#854F0B;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700\">PK<\/span> Primary Key<\/span>\r\n          <span><span style=\"background:#E6F1FB;color:#185FA5;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700\">FK<\/span> Foreign Key<\/span>\r\n          <span><span style=\"background:#F1EFE8;color:#5F5E5A;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700\">IDX<\/span> \u00cdndice<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div style=\"margin-top:8px\">\r\n          <button class=\"er-btn\" onclick=\"loadPreset('ecommerce')\">Cargar E-commerce<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div style=\"margin-top:6px\">\r\n          <button class=\"er-btn\" onclick=\"loadPreset('universidad')\">Cargar Universidad<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div style=\"margin-top:6px\">\r\n          <button class=\"er-btn danger\" onclick=\"clearAll()\">Limpiar todo<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"er-canvas\" id=\"er-canvas\">\r\n      <svg id=\"er-svg\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><\/svg>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- SQL PANEL -->\r\n  <div id=\"sql-panel\" style=\"display:none\">\r\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap\">\r\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">Base de datos:<\/span>\r\n      <div class=\"db-selector\">\r\n        <span class=\"db-pill active\" onclick=\"setDB('ecommerce',this)\">E-commerce<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"db-pill\" onclick=\"setDB('universidad',this)\">Universidad<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"db-pill\" onclick=\"setDB('hospital',this)\">Hospital<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"db-pill\" onclick=\"setDB('banco',this)\">Banco<\/span>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--color-text-tertiary);margin-left:4px\" id=\"db-schema-label\">Tablas: usuarios, productos, pedidos, categorias<\/span>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sql-row\">\r\n      <div class=\"sql-editor-box\">\r\n        <div class=\"sql-editor-header\">\r\n          <span>Editor SQL<\/span>\r\n          <div class=\"hbtns\">\r\n            <button class=\"hbtn\" onclick=\"formatSQL()\">Formatear<\/button>\r\n            <button class=\"hbtn\" onclick=\"explainSQL()\">Explicar<\/button>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <textarea class=\"sql-textarea\" id=\"sql-input\" rows=\"8\" spellcheck=\"false\">SELECT * FROM usuarios LIMIT 10;<\/textarea>\r\n        <div class=\"sql-footer\">\r\n          <button class=\"sql-run\" onclick=\"runSQL()\">\u25b6 Ejecutar<\/button>\r\n          <button class=\"sql-clear\" onclick=\"clearSQL()\">Limpiar<\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"sql-shortcuts\">\r\n        <h4>Ejemplos<\/h4>\r\n        <button class=\"sq-btn\" onclick=\"loadQ(0)\">SELECT b\u00e1sico<\/button>\r\n        <button class=\"sq-btn\" onclick=\"loadQ(1)\">JOIN usuarios-pedidos<\/button>\r\n        <button class=\"sq-btn\" onclick=\"loadQ(2)\">GROUP BY + HAVING<\/button>\r\n        <button class=\"sq-btn\" onclick=\"loadQ(3)\">Subconsulta<\/button>\r\n        <button class=\"sq-btn\" onclick=\"loadQ(4)\">Agregar registro<\/button>\r\n        <button class=\"sq-btn\" onclick=\"loadQ(5)\">LEFT JOIN<\/button>\r\n        <button class=\"sq-btn\" onclick=\"loadQ(6)\">ORDER + LIMIT<\/button>\r\n        <button class=\"sq-btn\" onclick=\"loadQ(7)\">COUNT por grupo<\/button>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sql-result-box\">\r\n      <div class=\"sql-result-header\">\r\n        <span>Resultados<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"result-stats\" id=\"result-stats\"><\/span>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"result-table-wrap\" id=\"result-area\">\r\n        <div class=\"result-placeholder\">Escribe una consulta y pulsa Ejecutar<\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sql-analysis\" id=\"sql-analysis\">\r\n      <div class=\"analysis-card\" id=\"exec-plan-card\">\r\n        <h4>Plan de ejecuci\u00f3n<\/h4>\r\n        <div id=\"exec-plan\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--color-text-tertiary)\">Esperando consulta...<\/span><\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"analysis-card\">\r\n        <h4>M\u00e9tricas<\/h4>\r\n        <div id=\"sql-metrics\">\r\n          <div class=\"metric-row\"><span class=\"ml\">Tiempo estimado<\/span><span class=\"mv\" id=\"m-time\">\u2014<\/span><\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"metric-row\"><span class=\"ml\">Filas escaneadas<\/span><span class=\"mv\" id=\"m-rows\">\u2014<\/span><\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"metric-row\"><span class=\"ml\">\u00cdndice usado<\/span><span class=\"mv\" id=\"m-idx\">\u2014<\/span><\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"metric-row\"><span class=\"ml\">Costo relativo<\/span><span class=\"mv\" id=\"m-cost\">\u2014<\/span><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"analysis-card\">\r\n        <h4>Consejos<\/h4>\r\n        <div id=\"sql-tips\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--color-text-tertiary)\">Esperando consulta...<\/span><\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 4\ufe0f\u20e3 QUIZ AUTOEVALUADO CON FEEDBACK -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ AUTOEVALUADO CON FEEDBACK\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es el prop\u00f3sito principal de la normalizaci\u00f3n?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Hacer las consultas m\u00e1s lentas\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Eliminar redundancia y prevenir anomal\u00edas\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Aumentar el n\u00famero de tablas innecesariamente\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Hacer que los datos sean m\u00e1s dif\u00edciles de entender\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> La normalizaci\u00f3n elimina redundancia y previene anomal\u00edas.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> La normalizaci\u00f3n tiene objetivos espec\u00edficos de dise\u00f1o.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> La normalizaci\u00f3n (1NF-3NF) busca: 1) Eliminar duplicaci\u00f3n de datos, 2) Prevenir anomal\u00edas de inserci\u00f3n\/actualizaci\u00f3n\/eliminaci\u00f3n, 3) Garantizar dependencias l\u00f3gicas adecuadas entre datos.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>En una relaci\u00f3n 1:N, \u00bfd\u00f3nde debe ir la FK?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        En la tabla del \"uno\"\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        En ambas tablas\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        En la tabla del \"muchos\"\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        En una tabla intermedia\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> La FK va en la tabla que representa el lado \"muchos\".\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa c\u00f3mo se implementan las cardinalidades.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Regla:<\/strong> En 1:N, la tabla \"muchos\" contiene la FK que referencia a la PK de la tabla \"uno\". Ejemplo: En \"Departamentos (1) \u2190 Empleados (N)\", la FK <code>dept_id<\/code> va en la tabla <code>empleados<\/code>.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 SQL usa una subconsulta?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        <code>SELECT * FROM (SELECT ...)<\/code>\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        <code>WHERE id IN (SELECT ...)<\/code>\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        <code>FROM (SELECT ...) AS subquery<\/code>\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Todas las anteriores\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Todas son formas v\u00e1lidas de usar subconsultas.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Las subconsultas son vers\u00e1tiles y pueden usarse en varios lugares.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Tipos de subconsultas:<\/strong><br>\r\n                        1. <strong>En FROM:<\/strong> <code>FROM (SELECT ...) AS sub<\/code><br>\r\n                        2. <strong>En WHERE:<\/strong> <code>WHERE id IN (SELECT ...)<\/code><br>\r\n                        3. <strong>En SELECT:<\/strong> <code>SELECT col, (SELECT ...) AS calc<\/code><\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 6\ufe0f\u20e3 SECCI\u00d3N \"ERRORES COMUNES\" INTERACTIVA -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES INTERACTIVOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card collapsible\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Error 1: Olvidar Integridad Referencial<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"collapse-icon\">+<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <pre><code>\r\n-- \u274c Mal\r\nINSERT INTO pedidos (usuario_id) VALUES (999); -- Usuario no existe\r\n                        <\/code><\/pre>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>Esto causa datos hu\u00e9rfanos. Soluci\u00f3n: Usar FK con ON DELETE RESTRICT.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p>Prueba: Corrige el c\u00f3digo<\/p>\r\n                        <textarea class=\"practica-input\" placeholder=\"Escribe la correcci\u00f3n...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarError(1, this)\">Verificar<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"practica-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card collapsible\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Error 2: Normalizaci\u00f3n Insuficiente<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"collapse-icon\">+<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <pre><code>\r\n-- \u274c Mal\r\nCREATE TABLE empleados (\r\n    id INT PRIMARY KEY,\r\n    nombre VARCHAR(100),\r\n    dept_nombre VARCHAR(100) -- Redundante si dept cambia\r\n);\r\n                        <\/code><\/pre>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>Causa anomal\u00edas de actualizaci\u00f3n. Soluci\u00f3n: Separar en tabla departamentos.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p>Prueba: Corrige el esquema<\/p>\r\n                        <textarea class=\"practica-input\" placeholder=\"Escribe la correcci\u00f3n...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarError(2, this)\">Verificar<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"practica-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card collapsible\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Error 3: JOIN sin WHERE<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"collapse-icon\">+<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <pre><code>\r\n-- \u274c Mal\r\nSELECT * FROM usuarios u JOIN pedidos p ON u.id = p.usuario_id; -- Producto cartesiano\r\n                        <\/code><\/pre>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>Causa resultados masivos. Soluci\u00f3n: A\u00f1adir filtros WHERE.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p>Prueba: A\u00f1ade un filtro<\/p>\r\n                        <textarea class=\"practica-input\" placeholder=\"Escribe la correcci\u00f3n...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarError(3, this)\">Verificar<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"practica-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 7\ufe0f\u20e3 PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"problemas-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"problemas-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 1 (Desarrollo)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Dise\u00f1a un esquema SQL para un sistema de e-commerce con usuarios, productos y pedidos. Incluye relaciones y normalizaci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n                <textarea class=\"respuesta-area\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu desarrollo...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n                    <p>R\u00fabrica: 40% Normalizaci\u00f3n, 30% Relaciones, 30% Sintaxis<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 2 (Interpretaci\u00f3n)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Dada la consulta: <code>SELECT COUNT(*) FROM pedidos GROUP BY usuario_id HAVING COUNT(*) > 5;<\/code> Interpreta qu\u00e9 hace y optim\u00edzala.<\/p>\r\n                <textarea class=\"respuesta-area\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu interpretaci\u00f3n...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n                    <p>R\u00fabrica: 50% Interpretaci\u00f3n, 50% Optimizaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 3 (Razonamiento)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Justifica por qu\u00e9 usar N:N para estudiantes-cursos en lugar de 1:N.<\/p>\r\n                <textarea class=\"respuesta-area\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu justificaci\u00f3n...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n                    <p>R\u00fabrica: 60% L\u00f3gica Relacional, 40% Ejemplos<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 8\ufe0f\u20e3 CIERRE METACOGNITIVO INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO INTERACTIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N DE HABILIDADES SQL<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"skill-meter\">\r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>Consultas SELECT b\u00e1sicas:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"skill-fill\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\" data-skill=\"select\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                   \r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>JOINs y relaciones:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"skill-fill\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\" data-skill=\"joins\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                   \r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>Normalizaci\u00f3n (1NF-3NF):<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"skill-fill\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\" data-skill=\"normalizacion\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                   \r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>Dise\u00f1o de esquemas:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"skill-fill\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\" data-skill=\"diseno\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarHabilidades()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR EVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es importante entender la normalizaci\u00f3n antes de escribir consultas SQL complejas?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n aqu\u00ed...\" rows=\"3\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Describe un caso real donde una mala elecci\u00f3n de tipo de relaci\u00f3n (1:1 vs 1:N) podr\u00eda causar problemas.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu ejemplo...\" rows=\"3\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"proyecto-final\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83c\udfaf PROYECTO FINAL: SISTEMA DE BIBLIOTECA<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"proyecto-enunciado\">\r\n                <p><strong>Objetivo:<\/strong> Dise\u00f1ar e implementar una base de datos para una biblioteca con:<\/p>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Libros (t\u00edtulo, autor, ISBN, categor\u00eda, ejemplares)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Usuarios (nombre, email, tipo: estudiante\/profesor)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Pr\u00e9stamos (libro_id, usuario_id, fecha_pr\u00e9stamo, fecha_devoluci\u00f3n)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Multas (por retraso en devoluci\u00f3n)<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n                <p><strong>Requisitos:<\/strong> Normalizaci\u00f3n 3NF, relaciones apropiadas, al menos 5 consultas \u00fatiles.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-proyecto\" onclick=\"mostrarEsqueletoProyecto()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udcdd VER ESQUELETO DEL PROYECTO\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            <div class=\"proyecto-solucion\" id=\"proyectoSolucion\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <pre><code>\r\n-- ESQUEMA COMPLETO BIBLIOTECA\r\nCREATE TABLE libros (\r\n    id INT PRIMARY KEY,\r\n    titulo VARCHAR(200),\r\n    autor VARCHAR(100),\r\n    isbn VARCHAR(13) UNIQUE,\r\n    categoria VARCHAR(50),\r\n    ejemplares_disponibles INT\r\n);\r\nCREATE TABLE usuarios (\r\n    id INT PRIMARY KEY,\r\n    nombre VARCHAR(100),\r\n    email VARCHAR(100) UNIQUE,\r\n    tipo ENUM('estudiante', 'profesor')\r\n);\r\nCREATE TABLE prestamos (\r\n    id INT PRIMARY KEY,\r\n    libro_id INT REFERENCES libros(id),\r\n    usuario_id INT REFERENCES usuarios(id),\r\n    fecha_prestamo DATE,\r\n    fecha_devolucion_esperada DATE,\r\n    fecha_devolucion_real DATE,\r\n    INDEX idx_usuario (usuario_id),\r\n    INDEX idx_libro (libro_id)\r\n);\r\n-- CONSULTAS \u00daTILES:\r\n-- 1. Libros prestados actualmente\r\n-- 2. Usuarios con multas pendientes\r\n-- 3. Libros m\u00e1s populares\r\n-- 4. Tasa de devoluci\u00f3n a tiempo\r\n-- 5. Sugerencias por categor\u00eda\r\n                <\/code><\/pre>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS ADICIONALES<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/sqlbolt.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \u26a1 SQLBolt: Tutoriales interactivos SQL\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.db-fiddle.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udfae DB Fiddle: Sandbox SQL online\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/drawsql.app\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcd0 DrawSQL: Dise\u00f1ador de diagramas ER\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/use-the-index-luke.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\ude80 Use The Index, Luke: Optimizaci\u00f3n SQL\r\n                <\/a>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nconsole.log('\ud83d\ude80 Inicializando lecci\u00f3n Bases de Datos Relacionales');\r\n\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n\/\/ STATE\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\nlet tables = [];\r\nlet relations = [];\r\nlet tid = 0;\r\nlet relMode = '1:1';\r\nlet relSource = null; \/\/ {tableId, fieldName}\r\nlet dragging = null;\r\nlet dragOff = {x:0,y:0};\r\nlet currentDB = 'ecommerce';\r\n\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n\/\/ TAB SWITCHING\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\nfunction showTab(t){\r\n  document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach((b,i)=>b.classList.toggle('active',['er','sql'][i]===t));\r\n  document.getElementById('er-panel').style.display = t==='er'?'flex':'none';\r\n  document.getElementById('sql-panel').style.display = t==='sql'?'flex':'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n\/\/ ER: DATA\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\nfunction setRelType(t,el){\r\n  relMode = t;\r\n  document.querySelectorAll('.rel-badge').forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active'));\r\n  el.classList.add('active');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction addTable(name, fields, x, y){\r\n  const n = name || document.getElementById('tbl-name').value.trim();\r\n  if(!n) return;\r\n  if(!name) document.getElementById('tbl-name').value='';\r\n  const defaultFields = fields || [\r\n    {name:'id',type:'INT',key:'pk'},\r\n    {name:'nombre',type:'VARCHAR(100)',key:''},\r\n    {name:'created_at',type:'DATETIME',key:''},\r\n  ];\r\n  tables.push({id:tid++, name:n, fields:defaultFields, x:x||Math.random()*320+60, y:y||Math.random()*200+60});\r\n  renderER();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction deleteTable(id){\r\n  tables = tables.filter(t=>t.id!==id);\r\n  relations = relations.filter(r=>r.from.tableId!==id && r.to.tableId!==id);\r\n  renderER();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction addField(tableId){\r\n  const t = tables.find(t=>t.id===tableId);\r\n  if(!t) return;\r\n  const name = prompt('Nombre del campo:','campo_nuevo');\r\n  if(!name) return;\r\n  const type = prompt('Tipo:','VARCHAR(100)');\r\n  t.fields.push({name, type:type||'VARCHAR(100)', key:''});\r\n  renderER();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction clearAll(){\r\n  tables=[];relations=[];tid=0;relSource=null;\r\n  document.getElementById('rel-status').innerHTML='';\r\n  renderER();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction loadPreset(p){\r\n  clearAll();\r\n  if(p==='ecommerce'){\r\n    addTable('usuarios',[\r\n      {name:'id',type:'INT',key:'pk'},\r\n      {name:'email',type:'VARCHAR(100)',key:'idx'},\r\n      {name:'nombre',type:'VARCHAR(100)',key:''},\r\n      {name:'created_at',type:'DATETIME',key:''},\r\n    ],50,50);\r\n    addTable('categorias',[\r\n      {name:'id',type:'INT',key:'pk'},\r\n      {name:'nombre',type:'VARCHAR(50)',key:''},\r\n    ],360,50);\r\n    addTable('productos',[\r\n      {name:'id',type:'INT',key:'pk'},\r\n      {name:'nombre',type:'VARCHAR(200)',key:''},\r\n      {name:'precio',type:'DECIMAL(10,2)',key:''},\r\n      {name:'categoria_id',type:'INT',key:'fk'},\r\n    ],360,250);\r\n    addTable('pedidos',[\r\n      {name:'id',type:'INT',key:'pk'},\r\n      {name:'usuario_id',type:'INT',key:'fk'},\r\n      {name:'total',type:'DECIMAL(10,2)',key:''},\r\n      {name:'fecha',type:'DATETIME',key:'idx'},\r\n    ],50,280);\r\n    addTable('pedido_items',[\r\n      {name:'id',type:'INT',key:'pk'},\r\n      {name:'pedido_id',type:'INT',key:'fk'},\r\n      {name:'producto_id',type:'INT',key:'fk'},\r\n      {name:'cantidad',type:'INT',key:''},\r\n      {name:'precio',type:'DECIMAL(10,2)',key:''},\r\n    ],200,480);\r\n    relations = [\r\n      {from:{tableId:1,fieldName:'categoria_id'},to:{tableId:0,fieldName:'id'},type:'N:1'},\r\n      {from:{tableId:1,fieldName:'id'},to:{tableId:2,fieldName:'categoria_id'},type:'1:N'},\r\n      {from:{tableId:2,fieldName:'usuario_id'},to:{tableId:0,fieldName:'id'},type:'N:1'},\r\n      {from:{tableId:4,fieldName:'pedido_id'},to:{tableId:2,fieldName:'id'},type:'N:1'},\r\n      {from:{tableId:4,fieldName:'producto_id'},to:{tableId:1,fieldName:'id'},type:'N:1'},\r\n    ];\r\n  } else {\r\n    addTable('estudiantes',[\r\n      {name:'id',type:'INT',key:'pk'},\r\n      {name:'nombre',type:'VARCHAR(100)',key:''},\r\n      {name:'email',type:'VARCHAR(100)',key:'idx'},\r\n    ],50,80);\r\n    addTable('profesores',[\r\n      {name:'id',type:'INT',key:'pk'},\r\n      {name:'nombre',type:'VARCHAR(100)',key:''},\r\n      {name:'depto',type:'VARCHAR(50)',key:''},\r\n    ],360,80);\r\n    addTable('cursos',[\r\n      {name:'id',type:'INT',key:'pk'},\r\n      {name:'nombre',type:'VARCHAR(150)',key:''},\r\n      {name:'profesor_id',type:'INT',key:'fk'},\r\n      {name:'creditos',type:'INT',key:''},\r\n    ],360,280);\r\n    addTable('inscripciones',[\r\n      {name:'estudiante_id',type:'INT',key:'fk'},\r\n      {name:'curso_id',type:'INT',key:'fk'},\r\n      {name:'nota',type:'DECIMAL(4,2)',key:''},\r\n      {name:'fecha',type:'DATE',key:''},\r\n    ],50,280);\r\n    relations = [\r\n      {from:{tableId:2,fieldName:'profesor_id'},to:{tableId:1,fieldName:'id'},type:'N:1'},\r\n      {from:{tableId:3,fieldName:'estudiante_id'},to:{tableId:0,fieldName:'id'},type:'N:1'},\r\n      {from:{tableId:3,fieldName:'curso_id'},to:{tableId:2,fieldName:'id'},type:'N:1'},\r\n    ];\r\n  }\r\n  renderER();\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n\/\/ ER: RENDERING\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\nfunction renderER(){\r\n  const canvas = document.getElementById('er-canvas');\r\n  const svg = document.getElementById('er-svg');\r\n  \/\/ remove old table divs\r\n  canvas.querySelectorAll('.db-table').forEach(e=>e.remove());\r\n  \/\/ render tables\r\n  tables.forEach(t=>{\r\n    const div = document.createElement('div');\r\n    div.className = 'db-table';\r\n    div.id = 'tbl-'+t.id;\r\n    div.style.left = t.x+'px';\r\n    div.style.top = t.y+'px';\r\n    div.innerHTML = `\r\n      <div class=\"db-table-head\" onmousedown=\"startDrag(event,${t.id})\">\r\n        <span class=\"tname\">${t.name}<\/span>\r\n        <button class=\"del-btn\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();deleteTable(${t.id})\">\u2715<\/button>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"db-table-body\">\r\n        ${t.fields.map(f=>`\r\n          <div class=\"db-field ${f.key}\">\r\n            <span class=\"fi ${f.key||'idx'}\">${f.key?f.key.toUpperCase():'\u00b7'}<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"fname\">${f.name}<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"ftype\">${f.type}<\/span>\r\n            <span class=\"port\" data-tid=\"${t.id}\" data-field=\"${f.name}\" onclick=\"handlePort(event,${t.id},'${f.name}')\"><\/span>\r\n          <\/div>`).join('')}\r\n        <div class=\"add-field-row\" onclick=\"addField(${t.id})\">+ a\u00f1adir campo<\/div>\r\n      <\/div>`;\r\n    canvas.appendChild(div);\r\n  });\r\n  \/\/ draw SVG relations\r\n  renderRelations();\r\n  \/\/ placeholder\r\n  if(tables.length===0){\r\n    const info = document.createElement('div');\r\n    info.style.cssText='position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--color-text-tertiary);font-size:13px;pointer-events:none;flex-direction:column;gap:8px';\r\n    info.innerHTML='<div style=\"font-size:24px;opacity:.3\">\u22a1<\/div><div>Agrega tablas desde el panel o carga un preset<\/div>';\r\n    canvas.appendChild(info);\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction renderRelations(){\r\n  const svg = document.getElementById('er-svg');\r\n  svg.innerHTML = `<defs>\r\n    <marker id=\"arr-n\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n      <path d=\"M1 1 L7 4 L1 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#378ADD\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\/>\r\n    <\/marker>\r\n    <marker id=\"arr-1\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n      <line x1=\"5\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"7\" stroke=\"#1D9E75\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"\/>\r\n      <path d=\"M1 1 L7 4 L1 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1D9E75\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\/>\r\n    <\/marker>\r\n    <marker id=\"arr-fork\" markerWidth=\"12\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n      <path d=\"M1 1 L7 4 L1 7M3 4 L1 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#BA7517\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\/>\r\n    <\/marker>\r\n  <\/defs>`;\r\n  relations.forEach((r,i)=>{\r\n    const fromT = tables.find(t=>t.id===r.from.tableId);\r\n    const toT = tables.find(t=>t.id===r.to.tableId);\r\n    if(!fromT||!toT) return;\r\n    const fromDiv = document.getElementById('tbl-'+fromT.id);\r\n    const toDiv = document.getElementById('tbl-'+toT.id);\r\n    if(!fromDiv||!toDiv) return;\r\n    const fRect = fromDiv.getBoundingClientRect();\r\n    const tRect = toDiv.getBoundingClientRect();\r\n    const canvas = document.getElementById('er-canvas');\r\n    const cRect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\r\n    \/\/ center of tables\r\n    const fx = fromT.x + fromDiv.offsetWidth\/2;\r\n    const fy = fromT.y + fromDiv.offsetHeight\/2;\r\n    const tx = toT.x + toDiv.offsetWidth\/2;\r\n    const ty = toT.y + toDiv.offsetHeight\/2;\r\n    \/\/ pick edge connection points\r\n    const dx = tx-fx, dy = ty-fy;\r\n    let x1,y1,x2,y2;\r\n    if(Math.abs(dx)>Math.abs(dy)){\r\n      x1 = dx>0?fromT.x+fromDiv.offsetWidth:fromT.x; y1=fy;\r\n      x2 = dx>0?toT.x:toT.x+toDiv.offsetWidth; y2=ty;\r\n    } else {\r\n      x1=fx; y1=dy>0?fromT.y+fromDiv.offsetHeight:fromT.y;\r\n      x2=tx; y2=dy>0?toT.y:toT.y+toDiv.offsetHeight;\r\n    }\r\n    const mx1=(x1+x2)\/2, my1=(y1+y2)\/2;\r\n    const colors = {'1:N':'#378ADD','N:1':'#378ADD','1:1':'#1D9E75','N:N':'#BA7517'};\r\n    const c = colors[r.type]||'#378ADD';\r\n    const markEnd = r.type==='1:1'?'arr-1':r.type==='N:N'?'arr-fork':'arr-n';\r\n    const markStart = (r.type==='1:N'||r.type==='N:1')?'arr-1':r.type==='N:N'?'arr-fork':'arr-1';\r\n    const path = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg','path');\r\n    path.setAttribute('d',`M${x1} ${y1} C${x1+(x2-x1)*0.4} ${y1} ${x2-(x2-x1)*0.4} ${y2} ${x2} ${y2}`);\r\n    path.setAttribute('fill','none');\r\n    path.setAttribute('stroke',c);\r\n    path.setAttribute('stroke-width','1.5');\r\n    path.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', r.type==='N:N'?'6 3':'none');\r\n    path.setAttribute('marker-end',`url(#${markEnd})`);\r\n    path.setAttribute('marker-start',`url(#${markStart})`);\r\n    path.setAttribute('opacity','0.75');\r\n    \/\/ label\r\n    const lbl = document.createElementNS('http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg','text');\r\n    lbl.setAttribute('x', mx1);\r\n    lbl.setAttribute('y', my1-5);\r\n    lbl.setAttribute('text-anchor','middle');\r\n    lbl.setAttribute('font-size','10');\r\n    lbl.setAttribute('font-family','var(--font-sans,sans-serif)');\r\n    lbl.setAttribute('fill',c);\r\n    lbl.setAttribute('font-weight','600');\r\n    lbl.textContent = r.type;\r\n    svg.appendChild(path);\r\n    svg.appendChild(lbl);\r\n  });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n\/\/ ER: DRAG\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\nfunction startDrag(e,id){\r\n  if(e.target.classList.contains('del-btn')||e.target.classList.contains('port')) return;\r\n  e.preventDefault();\r\n  const t = tables.find(t=>t.id===id);\r\n  const canvas = document.getElementById('er-canvas');\r\n  const cRect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\r\n  dragging = id;\r\n  dragOff = {x:e.clientX - cRect.left - t.x, y:e.clientY - cRect.top - t.y};\r\n  document.addEventListener('mousemove', onDrag);\r\n  document.addEventListener('mouseup', stopDrag);\r\n}\r\nfunction onDrag(e){\r\n  if(dragging===null) return;\r\n  const canvas = document.getElementById('er-canvas');\r\n  const cRect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\r\n  const t = tables.find(t=>t.id===dragging);\r\n  if(!t) return;\r\n  t.x = Math.max(0, Math.min(e.clientX-cRect.left-dragOff.x, cRect.width-180));\r\n  t.y = Math.max(0, Math.min(e.clientY-cRect.top-dragOff.y, cRect.height-100));\r\n  const div = document.getElementById('tbl-'+dragging);\r\n  if(div){ div.style.left=t.x+'px'; div.style.top=t.y+'px'; }\r\n  renderRelations();\r\n}\r\nfunction stopDrag(){\r\n  dragging=null;\r\n  document.removeEventListener('mousemove',onDrag);\r\n  document.removeEventListener('mouseup',stopDrag);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n\/\/ ER: PORT \/ RELATION CREATION\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\nfunction handlePort(e,tid,fname){\r\n  e.stopPropagation();\r\n  if(!relSource){\r\n    relSource = {tableId:tid, fieldName:fname};\r\n    e.target.classList.add('active');\r\n    document.getElementById('rel-status').innerHTML = `<span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--color-text-info)\">Origen: <b>${tables.find(t=>t.id===tid)?.name}.${fname}<\/b><br>Haz clic en el puerto destino<\/span>`;\r\n  } else {\r\n    if(relSource.tableId===tid){ relSource=null; document.getElementById('rel-status').innerHTML=''; document.querySelectorAll('.port').forEach(p=>p.classList.remove('active')); return; }\r\n    relations.push({from:relSource, to:{tableId:tid,fieldName:fname}, type:relMode});\r\n    document.getElementById('rel-status').innerHTML = `<span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--color-text-success)\">Relaci\u00f3n ${relMode} creada<\/span>`;\r\n    setTimeout(()=>document.getElementById('rel-status').innerHTML='',2000);\r\n    relSource=null;\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.port').forEach(p=>p.classList.remove('active'));\r\n    renderRelations();\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n\/\/ SQL: DATABASES\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\nconst DBS = {\r\n  ecommerce:{\r\n    label:'Tablas: usuarios, productos, pedidos, categorias',\r\n    schemas:{\r\n      usuarios:{cols:['id','nombre','email','telefono','pais','created_at']},\r\n      categorias:{cols:['id','nombre','descripcion']},\r\n      productos:{cols:['id','nombre','precio','stock','categoria_id']},\r\n      pedidos:{cols:['id','usuario_id','total','estado','fecha']},\r\n    },\r\n    data:{\r\n      usuarios:[\r\n        {id:1,nombre:'Ana L\u00f3pez',email:'ana@email.com',telefono:'555-1001',pais:'M\u00e9xico',created_at:'2024-01-15'},\r\n        {id:2,nombre:'Carlos Ruiz',email:'carlos@email.com',telefono:'555-1002',pais:'Colombia',created_at:'2024-02-20'},\r\n        {id:3,nombre:'Mar\u00eda Garc\u00eda',email:'maria@email.com',telefono:'555-1003',pais:'Espa\u00f1a',created_at:'2024-03-10'},\r\n        {id:4,nombre:'Luis Torres',email:'luis@email.com',telefono:'555-1004',pais:'M\u00e9xico',created_at:'2024-03-22'},\r\n        {id:5,nombre:'Sofia Chen',email:'sofia@email.com',telefono:'555-1005',pais:'Argentina',created_at:'2024-04-05'},\r\n      ],\r\n      categorias:[\r\n        {id:1,nombre:'Electr\u00f3nica',descripcion:'Gadgets y dispositivos'},\r\n        {id:2,nombre:'Ropa',descripcion:'Prendas de vestir'},\r\n        {id:3,nombre:'Hogar',descripcion:'Art\u00edculos para el hogar'},\r\n      ],\r\n      productos:[\r\n        {id:1,nombre:'Laptop Pro',precio:1299.99,stock:50,categoria_id:1},\r\n        {id:2,nombre:'Camisa Oxford',precio:45.00,stock:200,categoria_id:2},\r\n        {id:3,nombre:'Smartphone X',precio:899.99,stock:80,categoria_id:1},\r\n        {id:4,nombre:'Silla ergon\u00f3mica',precio:320.00,stock:30,categoria_id:3},\r\n        {id:5,nombre:'Teclado mec\u00e1nico',precio:129.99,stock:120,categoria_id:1},\r\n        {id:6,nombre:'Jeans slim',precio:65.00,stock:180,categoria_id:2},\r\n      ],\r\n      pedidos:[\r\n        {id:1,usuario_id:1,total:1299.99,estado:'entregado',fecha:'2024-05-01'},\r\n        {id:2,usuario_id:2,total:45.00,estado:'enviado',fecha:'2024-05-03'},\r\n        {id:3,usuario_id:1,total:899.99,estado:'procesando',fecha:'2024-05-10'},\r\n        {id:4,usuario_id:3,total:385.00,estado:'entregado',fecha:'2024-05-12'},\r\n        {id:5,usuario_id:4,total:65.00,estado:'cancelado',fecha:'2024-05-15'},\r\n        {id:6,usuario_id:5,total:129.99,estado:'enviado',fecha:'2024-05-18'},\r\n        {id:7,usuario_id:1,total:320.00,estado:'procesando',fecha:'2024-05-20'},\r\n      ],\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  universidad:{\r\n    label:'Tablas: estudiantes, profesores, cursos, inscripciones',\r\n    schemas:{\r\n      estudiantes:{cols:['id','nombre','carrera','semestre','promedio']},\r\n      profesores:{cols:['id','nombre','departamento','grado']},\r\n      cursos:{cols:['id','nombre','creditos','profesor_id']},\r\n      inscripciones:{cols:['id','estudiante_id','curso_id','nota','periodo']},\r\n    },\r\n    data:{\r\n      estudiantes:[\r\n        {id:1,nombre:'Roberto Alva',carrera:'Sistemas',semestre:4,promedio:8.7},\r\n        {id:2,nombre:'Daniela Mora',carrera:'Administraci\u00f3n',semestre:6,promedio:9.2},\r\n        {id:3,nombre:'Felipe R\u00edos',carrera:'Sistemas',semestre:2,promedio:7.5},\r\n        {id:4,nombre:'Valentina Cruz',carrera:'Sistemas',semestre:8,promedio:9.5},\r\n      ],\r\n      profesores:[\r\n        {id:1,nombre:'Dr. Ram\u00edrez',departamento:'Inform\u00e1tica',grado:'Doctor'},\r\n        {id:2,nombre:'Mtra. Soto',departamento:'Matem\u00e1ticas',grado:'Maestr\u00eda'},\r\n        {id:3,nombre:'Ing. Vargas',departamento:'Electr\u00f3nica',grado:'Ingenier\u00eda'},\r\n      ],\r\n      cursos:[\r\n        {id:1,nombre:'Bases de Datos',creditos:4,profesor_id:1},\r\n        {id:2,nombre:'C\u00e1lculo I',creditos:5,profesor_id:2},\r\n        {id:3,nombre:'Programaci\u00f3n Web',creditos:3,profesor_id:1},\r\n        {id:4,nombre:'Electr\u00f3nica Digital',creditos:4,profesor_id:3},\r\n      ],\r\n      inscripciones:[\r\n        {id:1,estudiante_id:1,curso_id:1,nota:9.0,periodo:'2024-A'},\r\n        {id:2,estudiante_id:1,curso_id:3,nota:8.5,periodo:'2024-A'},\r\n        {id:3,estudiante_id:2,curso_id:2,nota:9.8,periodo:'2024-A'},\r\n        {id:4,estudiante_id:3,curso_id:1,nota:7.0,periodo:'2024-A'},\r\n        {id:5,estudiante_id:4,curso_id:1,nota:10.0,periodo:'2024-A'},\r\n        {id:6,estudiante_id:4,curso_id:3,nota:9.5,periodo:'2024-A'},\r\n      ],\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  hospital:{\r\n    label:'Tablas: pacientes, medicos, citas, diagnosticos',\r\n    schemas:{\r\n      pacientes:{cols:['id','nombre','edad','tipo_sangre','telefono']},\r\n      medicos:{cols:['id','nombre','especialidad','cedula']},\r\n      citas:{cols:['id','paciente_id','medico_id','fecha','estado']},\r\n      diagnosticos:{cols:['id','cita_id','descripcion','tratamiento']},\r\n    },\r\n    data:{\r\n      pacientes:[\r\n        {id:1,nombre:'Carmen Vidal',edad:45,tipo_sangre:'O+',telefono:'555-2001'},\r\n        {id:2,nombre:'Jorge Medina',edad:62,tipo_sangre:'A-',telefono:'555-2002'},\r\n        {id:3,nombre:'Patricia Luna',edad:33,tipo_sangre:'B+',telefono:'555-2003'},\r\n      ],\r\n      medicos:[\r\n        {id:1,nombre:'Dr. Salinas',especialidad:'Cardiolog\u00eda',cedula:'MED-001'},\r\n        {id:2,nombre:'Dra. Fuentes',especialidad:'Pediatr\u00eda',cedula:'MED-002'},\r\n        {id:3,nombre:'Dr. Herrera',especialidad:'Medicina General',cedula:'MED-003'},\r\n      ],\r\n      citas:[\r\n        {id:1,paciente_id:1,medico_id:1,fecha:'2024-05-10',estado:'completada'},\r\n        {id:2,paciente_id:2,medico_id:1,fecha:'2024-05-12',estado:'completada'},\r\n        {id:3,paciente_id:3,medico_id:3,fecha:'2024-05-15',estado:'pendiente'},\r\n        {id:4,paciente_id:1,medico_id:3,fecha:'2024-05-20',estado:'pendiente'},\r\n      ],\r\n      diagnosticos:[\r\n        {id:1,cita_id:1,descripcion:'Hipertensi\u00f3n leve',tratamiento:'Enalapril 5mg'},\r\n        {id:2,cita_id:2,descripcion:'Arritmia sinusal',tratamiento:'Holter 24h'},\r\n      ],\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  banco:{\r\n    label:'Tablas: clientes, cuentas, transacciones, prestamos',\r\n    schemas:{\r\n      clientes:{cols:['id','nombre','rfc','score_credito']},\r\n      cuentas:{cols:['id','cliente_id','tipo','saldo','activa']},\r\n      transacciones:{cols:['id','cuenta_id','monto','tipo','fecha']},\r\n      prestamos:{cols:['id','cliente_id','monto','tasa','estado']},\r\n    },\r\n    data:{\r\n      clientes:[\r\n        {id:1,nombre:'Eduardo Blanco',rfc:'BAED800101',score_credito:780},\r\n        {id:2,nombre:'Luc\u00eda Moreno',rfc:'MOLL920515',score_credito:650},\r\n        {id:3,nombre:'Ricardo Salas',rfc:'SARR751220',score_credito:820},\r\n      ],\r\n      cuentas:[\r\n        {id:1,cliente_id:1,tipo:'ahorro',saldo:45200.00,activa:true},\r\n        {id:2,cliente_id:1,tipo:'cheques',saldo:12500.00,activa:true},\r\n        {id:3,cliente_id:2,tipo:'ahorro',saldo:8750.00,activa:true},\r\n        {id:4,cliente_id:3,tipo:'inversi\u00f3n',saldo:125000.00,activa:true},\r\n      ],\r\n      transacciones:[\r\n        {id:1,cuenta_id:1,monto:5000.00,tipo:'dep\u00f3sito',fecha:'2024-05-01'},\r\n        {id:2,cuenta_id:1,monto:-1500.00,tipo:'retiro',fecha:'2024-05-03'},\r\n        {id:3,cuenta_id:2,monto:-800.00,tipo:'pago',fecha:'2024-05-05'},\r\n        {id:4,cuenta_id:3,monto:2000.00,tipo:'dep\u00f3sito',fecha:'2024-05-08'},\r\n        {id:5,cuenta_id:4,monto:50000.00,tipo:'dep\u00f3sito',fecha:'2024-05-10'},\r\n      ],\r\n      prestamos:[\r\n        {id:1,cliente_id:1,monto:80000.00,tasa:9.5,estado:'activo'},\r\n        {id:2,cliente_id:2,monto:25000.00,tasa:13.2,estado:'atrasado'},\r\n      ],\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n};\r\n\r\nfunction setDB(db,el){\r\n  currentDB = db;\r\n  document.querySelectorAll('.db-pill').forEach(p=>p.classList.remove('active'));\r\n  el.classList.add('active');\r\n  document.getElementById('db-schema-label').textContent = DBS[db].label;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n\/\/ SQL: QUERIES\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\nconst QUERIES = {\r\n  ecommerce:[\r\n    'SELECT * FROM usuarios LIMIT 10;',\r\n    `SELECT u.nombre, u.email, p.total, p.estado, p.fecha\\nFROM usuarios u\\nJOIN pedidos p ON u.id = p.usuario_id\\nORDER BY p.fecha DESC;`,\r\n    `SELECT u.nombre, COUNT(p.id) AS num_pedidos, SUM(p.total) AS total_gastado\\nFROM usuarios u\\nJOIN pedidos p ON u.id = p.usuario_id\\nGROUP BY u.id, u.nombre\\nHAVING COUNT(p.id) > 1;`,\r\n    `SELECT * FROM productos\\nWHERE id IN (\\n  SELECT DISTINCT producto_id FROM pedidos\\n);`,\r\n    `INSERT INTO usuarios (id, nombre, email, telefono, pais, created_at)\\nVALUES (6, 'Nuevo Usuario', 'nuevo@email.com', '555-9999', 'M\u00e9xico', '2024-05-25');`,\r\n    `SELECT u.nombre, u.pais, p.total, p.estado\\nFROM usuarios u\\nLEFT JOIN pedidos p ON u.id = p.usuario_id\\nWHERE p.id IS NULL OR p.estado != 'cancelado';`,\r\n    `SELECT nombre, precio FROM productos\\nWHERE stock > 50\\nORDER BY precio DESC\\nLIMIT 3;`,\r\n    `SELECT c.nombre AS categoria, COUNT(p.id) AS num_productos, AVG(p.precio) AS precio_promedio\\nFROM categorias c\\nJOIN productos p ON c.id = p.categoria_id\\nGROUP BY c.id, c.nombre;`,\r\n  ],\r\n  universidad:[\r\n    'SELECT * FROM estudiantes;',\r\n    `SELECT e.nombre, c.nombre AS curso, i.nota\\nFROM estudiantes e\\nJOIN inscripciones i ON e.id = i.estudiante_id\\nJOIN cursos c ON i.curso_id = c.id\\nORDER BY i.nota DESC;`,\r\n    `SELECT e.nombre, COUNT(i.id) AS cursos_inscritos, AVG(i.nota) AS promedio\\nFROM estudiantes e\\nJOIN inscripciones i ON e.id = i.estudiante_id\\nGROUP BY e.id\\nHAVING AVG(i.nota) > 8;`,\r\n    `SELECT * FROM cursos\\nWHERE id IN (SELECT curso_id FROM inscripciones WHERE nota >= 9);`,\r\n    `INSERT INTO estudiantes VALUES (5, 'Nuevo Alumno', 'Sistemas', 1, 0.0);`,\r\n    `SELECT e.nombre, e.carrera\\nFROM estudiantes e\\nLEFT JOIN inscripciones i ON e.id = i.estudiante_id\\nWHERE i.id IS NULL;`,\r\n    `SELECT nombre, promedio FROM estudiantes\\nORDER BY promedio DESC\\nLIMIT 3;`,\r\n    `SELECT p.nombre, COUNT(i.id) AS alumnos\\nFROM profesores p\\nJOIN cursos c ON p.id = c.profesor_id\\nJOIN inscripciones i ON c.id = i.curso_id\\nGROUP BY p.id;`,\r\n  ],\r\n  hospital:[\r\n    'SELECT * FROM pacientes;',\r\n    `SELECT p.nombre, m.nombre AS medico, c.fecha, c.estado\\nFROM pacientes p\\nJOIN citas c ON p.id = c.paciente_id\\nJOIN medicos m ON c.medico_id = m.id;`,\r\n    `SELECT m.nombre, COUNT(c.id) AS total_citas\\nFROM medicos m\\nJOIN citas c ON m.id = c.medico_id\\nGROUP BY m.id\\nHAVING COUNT(c.id) > 1;`,\r\n    `SELECT * FROM pacientes WHERE id IN (SELECT paciente_id FROM citas WHERE estado='completada');`,\r\n    `INSERT INTO pacientes VALUES (4, 'Nuevo Paciente', 28, 'AB+', '555-3000');`,\r\n    `SELECT p.nombre FROM pacientes p\\nLEFT JOIN citas c ON p.id = c.paciente_id AND c.estado='pendiente'\\nWHERE c.id IS NULL;`,\r\n    `SELECT nombre, edad FROM pacientes ORDER BY edad DESC LIMIT 2;`,\r\n    `SELECT m.especialidad, COUNT(c.id) AS citas FROM medicos m JOIN citas c ON m.id=c.medico_id GROUP BY m.especialidad;`,\r\n  ],\r\n  banco:[\r\n    'SELECT * FROM clientes;',\r\n    `SELECT cl.nombre, cu.tipo, cu.saldo\\nFROM clientes cl\\nJOIN cuentas cu ON cl.id = cu.cliente_id\\nWHERE cu.activa = true;`,\r\n    `SELECT cl.nombre, COUNT(cu.id) AS num_cuentas, SUM(cu.saldo) AS saldo_total\\nFROM clientes cl\\nJOIN cuentas cu ON cl.id = cu.cliente_id\\nGROUP BY cl.id\\nHAVING SUM(cu.saldo) > 10000;`,\r\n    `SELECT * FROM cuentas WHERE cliente_id IN (SELECT id FROM clientes WHERE score_credito > 700);`,\r\n    `INSERT INTO clientes VALUES (4, 'Cliente Nuevo', 'CLNU900101', 700);`,\r\n    `SELECT cl.nombre FROM clientes cl\\nLEFT JOIN prestamos pr ON cl.id = pr.cliente_id\\nWHERE pr.id IS NULL;`,\r\n    `SELECT tipo, saldo FROM cuentas ORDER BY saldo DESC LIMIT 3;`,\r\n    `SELECT tipo, COUNT(*) AS total, AVG(saldo) AS saldo_promedio FROM cuentas GROUP BY tipo;`,\r\n  ],\r\n};\r\n\r\nfunction loadQ(idx){\r\n  const db = currentDB;\r\n  const qs = QUERIES[db] || QUERIES.ecommerce;\r\n  document.getElementById('sql-input').value = qs[idx]||qs[0];\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n\/\/ SQL: ENGINE\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\nfunction runSQL(){\r\n  const raw = document.getElementById('sql-input').value.trim();\r\n  if(!raw){ showError('Escribe una consulta SQL para ejecutar.'); return; }\r\n  const t0 = performance.now();\r\n  try{\r\n    const result = executeSQL(raw, DBS[currentDB].data);\r\n    const t1 = performance.now();\r\n    showResult(result, raw, t1-t0);\r\n    showAnalysis(raw, result, t1-t0);\r\n  } catch(e){\r\n    showError(e.message);\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction executeSQL(sql, data){\r\n  const s = sql.trim().replace(\/\\s+\/g,' ');\r\n  const upper = s.toUpperCase();\r\n  \/\/ INSERT\r\n  if(upper.startsWith('INSERT')){\r\n    const m = upper.match(\/INSERT INTO (\\w+)\/);\r\n    const tbl = m?m[1].toLowerCase():null;\r\n    if(!tbl||!data[tbl]) throw new Error(`Tabla \"${tbl}\" no encontrada`);\r\n    return {type:'insert', message:`1 fila insertada en \"${tbl}\" (simulado \u2014 datos en memoria)`};\r\n  }\r\n  \/\/ SELECT\r\n  if(!upper.startsWith('SELECT')) throw new Error('Solo se soportan SELECT e INSERT en este simulador');\r\n  return parseSelect(s, data);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction parseSelect(sql, data){\r\n  const up = sql.toUpperCase();\r\n  \/\/ FROM\r\n  const fromMatch = up.match(\/FROM\\s+(\\w+)(?:\\s+(?:AS\\s+)?(\\w+))?\/i);\r\n  if(!fromMatch) throw new Error('Falta cl\u00e1usula FROM');\r\n  const mainTable = fromMatch[1].toLowerCase();\r\n  const mainAlias = fromMatch[2]||mainTable;\r\n  if(!data[mainTable]) throw new Error(`Tabla \"${mainTable}\" no existe. Tablas disponibles: ${Object.keys(data).join(', ')}`);\r\n  let rows = data[mainTable].map(r=>({...r,'__tbl':mainTable}));\r\n  const aliases = {[mainAlias]:mainTable,[mainTable]:mainTable};\r\n\r\n  \/\/ JOINs\r\n  const joinRe = \/(?:LEFT\\s+)?JOIN\\s+(\\w+)(?:\\s+(?:AS\\s+)?(\\w+))?\\s+ON\\s+(\\w+)\\.(\\w+)\\s*=\\s*(\\w+)\\.(\\w+)\/gi;\r\n  let jm;\r\n  while((jm=joinRe.exec(sql))!==null){\r\n    const jTbl=jm[1].toLowerCase(), jAlias=(jm[2]||jm[1]).toLowerCase();\r\n    const isLeft=jm[0].toUpperCase().startsWith('LEFT');\r\n    aliases[jAlias]=jTbl; aliases[jTbl]=jTbl;\r\n    if(!data[jTbl]) throw new Error(`Tabla \"${jTbl}\" no existe`);\r\n    const la=jm[3].toLowerCase(), lf=jm[4].toLowerCase();\r\n    const ra=jm[5].toLowerCase(), rf=jm[6].toLowerCase();\r\n    const newRows=[];\r\n    rows.forEach(row=>{\r\n      const lTbl=aliases[la]||la;\r\n      const lVal=row[lf];\r\n      const matches=data[jTbl].filter(jr=>jr[rf]==lVal);\r\n      if(matches.length>0) matches.forEach(jr=>newRows.push({...row,...Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(jr).map(([k,v])=>[k,v]))}));\r\n      else if(isLeft) newRows.push({...row,...Object.fromEntries(Object.keys(data[jTbl][0]||{}).map(k=>[k,null]))});\r\n    });\r\n    rows=newRows;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  \/\/ WHERE\r\n  const whereMatch = sql.match(\/WHERE\\s+(.+?)(?:\\s+GROUP BY|\\s+ORDER BY|\\s+HAVING|\\s+LIMIT|$)\/i);\r\n  if(whereMatch){\r\n    const cond=whereMatch[1].trim();\r\n    rows=rows.filter(row=>evalWhere(cond,row));\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  \/\/ GROUP BY\r\n  const gbMatch = sql.match(\/GROUP BY\\s+(.+?)(?:\\s+HAVING|\\s+ORDER BY|\\s+LIMIT|$)\/i);\r\n  if(gbMatch){\r\n    const gbCols=gbMatch[1].split(',').map(c=>c.trim().split('.').pop().toLowerCase());\r\n    const groups={};\r\n    rows.forEach(row=>{\r\n      const key=gbCols.map(c=>row[c]).join('|');\r\n      if(!groups[key]) groups[key]={...row,__rows:[row],__count:0};\r\n      groups[key].__rows.push(row);\r\n      groups[key].__count++;\r\n    });\r\n    rows=Object.values(groups).map(g=>({...g,__count:g.__rows.length,__rows:g.__rows}));\r\n    \/\/ HAVING\r\n    const havMatch=sql.match(\/HAVING\\s+(.+?)(?:\\s+ORDER BY|\\s+LIMIT|$)\/i);\r\n    if(havMatch){ rows=rows.filter(row=>evalHaving(havMatch[1].trim(),row)); }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  \/\/ SELECT cols\r\n  const selectPart=sql.match(\/^SELECT\\s+(.+?)\\s+FROM\/i)?.[1]||'*';\r\n  if(selectPart.trim()==='*'){\r\n    rows=rows.map(r=>{const o={};Object.entries(r).forEach(([k,v])=>{if(!k.startsWith('__'))o[k]=v});return o;});\r\n  } else {\r\n    rows=rows.map(row=>buildSelectCols(selectPart,row));\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  \/\/ ORDER BY\r\n  const obMatch=sql.match(\/ORDER BY\\s+(.+?)(?:\\s+LIMIT|$)\/i);\r\n  if(obMatch){\r\n    const parts=obMatch[1].split(',').map(p=>p.trim());\r\n    rows.sort((a,b)=>{\r\n      for(const part of parts){\r\n        const [col,dir]=[part.split(' ')[0].toLowerCase(),part.toUpperCase().includes('DESC')?-1:1];\r\n        const cn=col.split('.').pop();\r\n        if(a[cn]<b[cn]) return -dir; if(a[cn]>b[cn]) return dir;\r\n      }\r\n      return 0;\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  \/\/ LIMIT\r\n  const lmMatch=sql.match(\/LIMIT\\s+(\\d+)\/i);\r\n  if(lmMatch) rows=rows.slice(0,parseInt(lmMatch[1]));\r\n\r\n  if(rows.length===0) return {type:'empty',rows:[],cols:[]};\r\n  const cols=Object.keys(rows[0]);\r\n  return {type:'rows',rows,cols};\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction evalWhere(cond,row){\r\n  \/\/ simple AND\/OR splitter\r\n  if(\/ AND \/i.test(cond)) return cond.split(\/ AND \/i).every(c=>evalCond(c.trim(),row));\r\n  if(\/ OR \/i.test(cond)) return cond.split(\/ OR \/i).some(c=>evalCond(c.trim(),row));\r\n  return evalCond(cond,row);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction evalCond(c,row){\r\n  \/\/ IS NULL \/ IS NOT NULL\r\n  if(\/IS\\s+NOT\\s+NULL\/i.test(c)){ const col=c.split(\/\\s\/)[0].split('.').pop().toLowerCase(); return row[col]!==null&&row[col]!==undefined; }\r\n  if(\/IS\\s+NULL\/i.test(c)){ const col=c.split(\/\\s\/)[0].split('.').pop().toLowerCase(); return row[col]===null||row[col]===undefined; }\r\n  \/\/ IN\r\n  const inM=c.match(\/(\\w+(?:\\.\\w+)?)\\s+(?:NOT\\s+)?IN\\s*\\(([^)]+)\\)\/i);\r\n  if(inM){ const col=inM[1].split('.').pop().toLowerCase(); const vals=inM[2].split(',').map(v=>v.trim().replace(\/['\"]\/g,'')); const isIn=vals.includes(String(row[col])); return c.toUpperCase().includes('NOT IN')?!isIn:isIn; }\r\n  \/\/ Operators\r\n  const opM=c.match(\/^(.+?)\\s*(!=|<>|>=|<=|=|>|<)\\s*(.+)$\/);\r\n  if(!opM) return true;\r\n  const col=opM[1].trim().split('.').pop().toLowerCase().replace(\/['\"]\/g,'');\r\n  const op=opM[2], rawVal=opM[3].trim().replace(\/['\"]\/g,'');\r\n  const lv=row[col], rv=isNaN(rawVal)?rawVal:Number(rawVal);\r\n  const l=typeof lv==='number'?lv:String(lv);\r\n  if(op==='='||op==='==') return String(l)===String(rv);\r\n  if(op==='!='||op==='<>') return String(l)!==String(rv);\r\n  if(op==='>') return Number(l)>Number(rv);\r\n  if(op==='<') return Number(l)<Number(rv);\r\n  if(op==='>=') return Number(l)>=Number(rv);\r\n  if(op==='<=') return Number(l)<=Number(rv);\r\n  return true;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction evalHaving(cond,row){\r\n  const m=cond.match(\/COUNT\\(\\*?\\)\\s*(>|<|>=|<=|=|!=)\\s*(\\d+)\/i);\r\n  if(m){ const op=m[1],val=parseInt(m[2]); const cnt=row.__count||0; if(op==='>') return cnt>val; if(op==='>=') return cnt>=val; if(op==='<') return cnt<val; if(op==='<=') return cnt<=val; if(op==='=') return cnt===val; }\r\n  const m2=cond.match(\/AVG\\((\\w+)\\)\\s*(>|<|>=|<=|=)\\s*([\\d.]+)\/i);\r\n  if(m2){ const col=m2[1].toLowerCase(), op=m2[2], val=parseFloat(m2[3]); const avg=row.__rows?row.__rows.reduce((s,r)=>s+(r[col]||0),0)\/row.__rows.length:0; if(op==='>') return avg>val; if(op==='>=') return avg>=val; if(op==='<') return avg<val; }\r\n  return true;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction buildSelectCols(selectPart,row){\r\n  const result={};\r\n  const cols=selectPart.split(',').map(c=>c.trim());\r\n  cols.forEach(col=>{\r\n    \/\/ COUNT(*)\r\n    if(\/COUNT\\(\\*\\)\/i.test(col)){\r\n      const alias=col.match(\/AS\\s+(\\w+)\/i)?.[1]||'COUNT(*)';\r\n      result[alias]=row.__count||1;\r\n    } else if(\/COUNT\\(\/i.test(col)){\r\n      const alias=col.match(\/AS\\s+(\\w+)\/i)?.[1]||col;\r\n      result[alias]=row.__count||1;\r\n    } else if(\/SUM\\((.+?)\\)\/i.test(col)){\r\n      const fcol=col.match(\/SUM\\((.+?)\\)\/i)[1].trim().toLowerCase();\r\n      const alias=col.match(\/AS\\s+(\\w+)\/i)?.[1]||`SUM(${fcol})`;\r\n      result[alias]=row.__rows?row.__rows.reduce((s,r)=>s+(r[fcol]||0),0):row[fcol]||0;\r\n    } else if(\/AVG\\((.+?)\\)\/i.test(col)){\r\n      const fcol=col.match(\/AVG\\((.+?)\\)\/i)[1].trim().toLowerCase();\r\n      const alias=col.match(\/AS\\s+(\\w+)\/i)?.[1]||`AVG(${fcol})`;\r\n      result[alias]=row.__rows?parseFloat((row.__rows.reduce((s,r)=>s+(r[fcol]||0),0)\/row.__rows.length).toFixed(2)):row[fcol]||0;\r\n    } else {\r\n      const parts=col.split(\/\\s+AS\\s+\/i);\r\n      const rawCol=parts[0].trim().split('.').pop().toLowerCase();\r\n      const alias=parts[1]||rawCol;\r\n      result[alias]=row.hasOwnProperty(rawCol)?row[rawCol]:null;\r\n    }\r\n  });\r\n  return result;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n\/\/ SQL: DISPLAY\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\nfunction showResult(result, sql, ms){\r\n  const area=document.getElementById('result-area');\r\n  const stats=document.getElementById('result-stats');\r\n  if(result.type==='insert'){\r\n    area.innerHTML=`<div style=\"padding:16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--color-text-success)\">${result.message}<\/div>`;\r\n    stats.textContent='1 fila afectada';\r\n    return;\r\n  }\r\n  if(result.type==='empty'||result.rows.length===0){\r\n    area.innerHTML='<div class=\"result-placeholder\">0 resultados encontrados<\/div>';\r\n    stats.textContent='0 filas';\r\n    return;\r\n  }\r\n  const {rows,cols}=result;\r\n  stats.textContent=`${rows.length} fila${rows.length!==1?'s':''} \u00d7 ${cols.length} col${cols.length!==1?'s':''} \u00b7 ${ms.toFixed(1)}ms`;\r\n  let html=`<table class=\"result-table\"><thead><tr>${cols.map(c=>`<th>${c}<\/th>`).join('')}<\/tr><\/thead><tbody>`;\r\n  rows.forEach(row=>{\r\n    html+=`<tr>${cols.map(c=>{\r\n      const v=row[c];\r\n      if(v===null||v===undefined) return `<td><span class=\"null-val\">NULL<\/span><\/td>`;\r\n      return `<td>${v}<\/td>`;\r\n    }).join('')}<\/tr>`;\r\n  });\r\n  html+='<\/tbody><\/table>';\r\n  area.innerHTML=html;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showError(msg){\r\n  document.getElementById('result-area').innerHTML=`<div class=\"error-msg\">Error: ${msg}<\/div>`;\r\n  document.getElementById('result-stats').textContent='';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showAnalysis(sql, result, ms){\r\n  const up=sql.toUpperCase();\r\n  \/\/ Plan\r\n  const planDiv=document.getElementById('exec-plan');\r\n  const steps=[];\r\n  const fmatch=sql.match(\/FROM\\s+(\\w+)\/i);\r\n  if(fmatch) steps.push({n:1,t:`Full scan en \"${fmatch[1].toLowerCase()}\" (${DBS[currentDB].data[fmatch[1].toLowerCase()]?.length||'?'} filas)`});\r\n  if(up.includes('JOIN')) steps.push({n:steps.length+1,t:'Hash join con tabla secundaria'});\r\n  if(up.includes('WHERE')) steps.push({n:steps.length+1,t:'Filtro aplicado (WHERE)'});\r\n  if(up.includes('GROUP BY')) steps.push({n:steps.length+1,t:'Agrupaci\u00f3n de resultados'});\r\n  if(up.includes('HAVING')) steps.push({n:steps.length+1,t:'Filtro post-agrupaci\u00f3n (HAVING)'});\r\n  if(up.includes('ORDER BY')) steps.push({n:steps.length+1,t:'Ordenamiento de resultados'});\r\n  if(up.includes('LIMIT')) steps.push({n:steps.length+1,t:'Limitaci\u00f3n de filas devueltas'});\r\n  planDiv.innerHTML=steps.map(s=>`<div class=\"plan-step\"><span class=\"plan-num\">${s.n}<\/span><span>${s.t}<\/span><\/div>`).join('');\r\n\r\n  \/\/ Metrics\r\n  const rowCount=result.rows?.length||0;\r\n  document.getElementById('m-time').textContent=ms.toFixed(2)+'ms';\r\n  document.getElementById('m-rows').textContent=rowCount;\r\n  const hasIdx=up.includes('WHERE')&&(up.includes('= ')||up.includes('=\\n'));\r\n  document.getElementById('m-idx').textContent=hasIdx?'Posible':'No usado';\r\n  const cost=up.includes('JOIN')?'Alto':up.includes('WHERE')?'Medio':'Bajo';\r\n  document.getElementById('m-cost').textContent=cost;\r\n\r\n  \/\/ Tips\r\n  const tipsDiv=document.getElementById('sql-tips');\r\n  const tips=[];\r\n  if(up.includes('SELECT *')) tips.push({w:true,t:'Evita SELECT * \u2014 especifica columnas necesarias para mejorar rendimiento'});\r\n  if(up.includes('JOIN')&&!up.includes('WHERE')) tips.push({w:true,t:'JOIN sin WHERE puede retornar muchas filas \u2014 considera agregar filtros'});\r\n  if(up.includes('GROUP BY')) tips.push({w:false,t:'GROUP BY bien usado \u2014 aseg\u00farate de tener \u00edndice en columna de agrupaci\u00f3n'});\r\n  if(up.includes('LIMIT')) tips.push({w:false,t:'Buen uso de LIMIT \u2014 limita la carga en consultas de desarrollo'});\r\n  if(up.includes('ORDER BY')&&!up.includes('LIMIT')) tips.push({w:true,t:'ORDER BY sin LIMIT puede ser costoso en tablas grandes'});\r\n  if(tips.length===0) tips.push({w:false,t:'Consulta se ve bien estructurada'});\r\n  tipsDiv.innerHTML=tips.map(tip=>`<div class=\"tip-item\"><span class=\"tip-dot ${tip.w?'warn-dot':''}\"><\/span><span>${tip.t}<\/span><\/div>`).join('');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction formatSQL(){\r\n  const ta=document.getElementById('sql-input');\r\n  let s=ta.value.trim();\r\n  const kws=['SELECT','FROM','WHERE','JOIN','LEFT JOIN','INNER JOIN','GROUP BY','HAVING','ORDER BY','LIMIT','ON','AND','OR','INSERT INTO','VALUES','UPDATE','SET','DELETE FROM'];\r\n  kws.forEach(k=>{ const re=new RegExp('\\\\b'+k+'\\\\b','gi'); s=s.replace(re,'\\n'+k); });\r\n  s=s.replace(\/\\n{2,}\/g,'\\n').trim();\r\n  ta.value=s;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction explainSQL(){\r\n  const sql=document.getElementById('sql-input').value.trim().toUpperCase();\r\n  let ex='Esta consulta ';\r\n  if(sql.includes('SELECT *')) ex+='selecciona todas las columnas';\r\n  else ex+='selecciona columnas espec\u00edficas';\r\n  ex+=' de '+((sql.match(\/FROM\\s+(\\w+)\/i)?.[1])||'una tabla');\r\n  if(sql.includes('JOIN')) ex+=', hace un JOIN con otra tabla';\r\n  if(sql.includes('WHERE')) ex+=', filtra resultados con WHERE';\r\n  if(sql.includes('GROUP BY')) ex+=', agrupa los resultados';\r\n  if(sql.includes('ORDER BY')) ex+=', ordena los resultados';\r\n  if(sql.includes('LIMIT')) ex+=', y limita el n\u00famero de filas devueltas';\r\n  ex+='.';\r\n  document.getElementById('result-area').innerHTML=`<div style=\"padding:16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.6\">${ex}<\/div>`;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction clearSQL(){\r\n  document.getElementById('sql-input').value='';\r\n  document.getElementById('result-area').innerHTML='<div class=\"result-placeholder\">Escribe una consulta y pulsa Ejecutar<\/div>';\r\n  document.getElementById('result-stats').textContent='';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n\/\/ INIT\r\n\/\/ \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\nloadPreset('ecommerce');\r\n\r\n\/\/ Event listeners b\u00e1sicos\r\nsetTimeout(() => {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n        card.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n            const cb = this.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n            if (cb) cb.style.backgroundColor = cb.style.backgroundColor === '' ? '#4CAF50' : '';\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n}, 100);\r\n\r\n\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"SELECT todos los usuarios","respuesta":"SELECT * FROM usuarios;"},{"enunciado":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 es PK?","respuesta":"Clave primaria: valor \u00fanico por fila"},{"enunciado":"Relaci\u00f3n N:N necesita...","respuesta":"Tabla intermedia con dos FK"},{"enunciado":"JOIN b\u00e1sico","respuesta":"SELECT * FROM A JOIN B ON A.id = B.a_id;"},{"enunciado":"Crear tabla con FK","respuesta":"FOREIGN KEY (col) REFERENCES tabla(pk)"},{"enunciado":"Normalizaci\u00f3n 1NF","respuesta":"Sin valores repetidos en columna"},{"enunciado":"INSERT ejemplo","respuesta":"INSERT INTO usuarios (nombre) VALUES ('Ana');"},{"enunciado":"WHERE filtra","respuesta":"WHERE id = 1"},{"enunciado":"ORDER BY ordena","respuesta":"ORDER BY nombre ASC"},{"enunciado":"COUNT cuenta","respuesta":"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM pedidos;"},{"enunciado":"INNER JOIN devuelve","respuesta":"Solo coincidencias"},{"enunciado":"SI: % de BD relacionales","respuesta":"~80%"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"SQL significa","opciones":["Structured Query Language","Simple Query","Standard Query","Sequential"],"correcta":"Structured Query Language"},{"pregunta":"PK es","opciones":["\u00danica por fila","Repetible","Opcional","Texto"],"correcta":"\u00danica por fila"},{"pregunta":"FK referencia","opciones":["PK de otra tabla","Cualquier campo","\u00cdndice","Nada"],"correcta":"PK de otra tabla"},{"pregunta":"1:N ejemplo","opciones":["Usuario \u2192 Pedidos","Persona \u2192 Pasaporte","Amigos","Nada"],"correcta":"Usuario \u2192 Pedidos"},{"pregunta":"N:N requiere","opciones":["Tabla intermedia","Una tabla","Ninguna","JSON"],"correcta":"Tabla intermedia"},{"pregunta":"Normalizaci\u00f3n evita","opciones":["Redundancia","Datos","Tablas","Nada"],"correcta":"Redundancia"},{"pregunta":"JOIN une","opciones":["Tablas por clave com\u00fan","Todo","Nada","Solo PK"],"correcta":"Tablas por clave com\u00fan"},{"pregunta":"SELECT * FROM","opciones":["Todos los datos","Una fila","Nada","Error"],"correcta":"Todos los datos"},{"pregunta":"WHERE filtra","opciones":["Filas","Columnas","Tablas","BD"],"correcta":"Filas"},{"pregunta":"ORDER BY","opciones":["Ordena resultados","Filtra","Crea","Elimina"],"correcta":"Ordena resultados"},{"pregunta":"CREATE TABLE","opciones":["Define estructura","Inserta","Selecciona","Elimina"],"correcta":"Define estructura"},{"pregunta":"INSERT INTO","opciones":["Agrega fila","Selecciona","Actualiza","Elimina"],"correcta":"Agrega fila"},{"pregunta":"UPDATE modifica","opciones":["Datos existentes","Estructura","Tabla","BD"],"correcta":"Datos existentes"},{"pregunta":"DELETE FROM","opciones":["Elimina filas","Tablas","Columnas","BD"],"correcta":"Elimina filas"},{"pregunta":"INNER JOIN","opciones":["Solo coincidencias","Todo","Izquierda","Derecha"],"correcta":"Solo coincidencias"},{"pregunta":"LEFT JOIN","opciones":["Todo de izquierda","Solo coincidencias","Derecha","Nada"],"correcta":"Todo de izquierda"},{"pregunta":"COUNT(*)","opciones":["Cuenta filas","Suma","Promedio","M\u00e1ximo"],"correcta":"Cuenta filas"},{"pregunta":"GROUP BY","opciones":["Agrupa resultados","Ordena","Filtra","Une"],"correcta":"Agrupa resultados"},{"pregunta":"HAVING filtra","opciones":["Grupos","Filas","Tablas","Columnas"],"correcta":"Grupos"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: BD m\u00e1s usada","opciones":["MySQL","MongoDB","Redis","Excel"],"correcta":"MySQL"},{"pregunta":"INDEX acelera","opciones":["B\u00fasquedas","Inserciones","Todo","Nada"],"correcta":"B\u00fasquedas"},{"pregunta":"AUTO_INCREMENT","opciones":["ID autom\u00e1tico","Manual","Texto","Fecha"],"correcta":"ID autom\u00e1tico"},{"pregunta":"UNIQUE","opciones":["Valor no repetido","Repetible","Nulo","PK"],"correcta":"Valor no repetido"},{"pregunta":"NOT NULL","opciones":["Campo obligatorio","Opcional","PK","FK"],"correcta":"Campo obligatorio"},{"pregunta":"VARCHAR(255)","opciones":["Texto hasta 255","N\u00famero","Fecha","Booleano"],"correcta":"Texto hasta 255"},{"pregunta":"INT","opciones":["Entero","Decimal","Texto","Fecha"],"correcta":"Entero"},{"pregunta":"DECIMAL(10,2)","opciones":["10 d\u00edgitos, 2 decimales","Entero","Texto","Fecha"],"correcta":"10 d\u00edgitos, 2 decimales"},{"pregunta":"DATE","opciones":["Fecha","Hora","Texto","N\u00famero"],"correcta":"Fecha"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: PostgreSQL crece","opciones":["+30% anual","0%","-10%","Estable"],"correcta":"+30% anual"},{"pregunta":"Transacci\u00f3n ACID","opciones":["Atomicidad, Consistencia...","Velocidad","Seguridad","Nada"],"correcta":"Atomicidad, Consistencia..."}]},{"materia":"Programaci\u00f3n","slug":"python-sqlite","titulo":"Python + SQLite: Bases de Datos en el Navegador","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK PROGRAMACI\u00d3N -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-programacion-python-sqlite\" data-tema=\"python-sqlite\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- 1\ufe0f\u20e3 INTRODUCCI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83d\udc0d<\/span>\r\n            PYTHON + SQLITE\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Desarrollo Serverless en el Navegador con Pyodide\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Entender SQLite como DB embebida<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Crear tablas, insertar datos, consultas b\u00e1sicas<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Integrar Python con SQLite<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Usar sqlite3 module, cursores, commits<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Ejecutar Python en navegador<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Pyodide para c\u00f3digo client-side<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Manejar DB en memoria<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Aplicaciones offline, prototipos r\u00e1pidos<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcf1 Apps M\u00f3viles<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Almacenamiento local sin servidor<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Android usa SQLite<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udf10 Web Offline<\/h3>\r\n                <p>DB en browser con Pyodide\/WASM<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Zero install<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83e\udd16 IoT Devices<\/h3>\r\n                <p>DB ligera en hardware limitado<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">NASA compliant<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"relacion-curricular\">\r\n            <h3>RELACI\u00d3N CURRICULAR<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"badges\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge\">Competencia: Programaci\u00f3n de Datos<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge\">Contenido: DB Embebidas<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge\">Evaluaci\u00f3n: Proyecto Web DB<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 2\ufe0f\u20e3 DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO ESTRUCTURADO -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS PYTHON + SQLITE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n       \r\n        <!-- INTRODUCCI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. SQLite: DB Embebida<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\uddc4\ufe0f SQLITE<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Biblioteca C que proporciona DB relacional ligera, sin servidor, en un archivo o memoria.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"principios-grid\">\r\n                        <div class=\"principio\">\r\n                            <div class=\"principio-icon\">\u26a1<\/div>\r\n                            <h5>Ligera<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>~500KB, cero config<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"principio\">\r\n                            <div class=\"principio-icon\">\ud83d\udd12<\/div>\r\n                            <h5>ACID<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Transacciones at\u00f3micas<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"principio\">\r\n                            <div class=\"principio-icon\">\ud83c\udf10<\/div>\r\n                            <h5>Cross-platform<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Browser, mobile, desktop<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"clasificacion-doble\">\r\n                <div class=\"clas-card sql\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcdd SQL en SQLite<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>DDL:<\/strong> CREATE TABLE\/VIEW\/INDEX<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>DML:<\/strong> INSERT\/UPDATE\/DELETE<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Query:<\/strong> SELECT con JOINs<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Especial:<\/strong> PRAGMA, VACUUM<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>L\u00edmites:<\/strong> No RIGHT\/FULL JOIN nativo\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"clas-card python\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udc0d Python Integration<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Module:<\/strong> import sqlite3<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Connection:<\/strong> conn = sqlite3.connect()<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Cursor:<\/strong> c = conn.cursor()<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Execute:<\/strong> c.execute(sql)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Ventaja:<\/strong> Built-in en Python stdlib\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <!-- CONEXI\u00d3N Y OPERACIONES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Conexi\u00f3n y Operaciones B\u00e1sicas<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"comparativa-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"comp-card pk\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83e\udde0 DB en Memoria<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"comp-badge\">Temporal<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Definici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Datos en RAM, se pierden al cerrar<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Caracter\u00edsticas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>R\u00e1pida (no I\/O disco)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Ideal para tests\/prototipos<\/li>\r\n                            <li>connect(':memory:')<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Size limitada por RAM<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"codigo\">conn = sqlite3.connect(':memory:')<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"desc\">DB vol\u00e1til<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"comp-card fk\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udcbe DB en Archivo<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"comp-badge\">Persistente<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Definici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Datos en archivo .db<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Caracter\u00edsticas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Persiste entre sesiones<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Port\u00e1til (un solo file)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>connect('mi.db')<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Multi-thread safe<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"codigo\">conn = sqlite3.connect('data.db')<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"desc\">DB permanente<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"regla-oro\">\r\n                <h4>\u26a1 REGLA DE ORO: Commit & Close<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"regla-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"regla-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-icon\">\ud83d\udcbe<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Commit:<\/strong> conn.commit() para guardar cambios\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"regla-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-icon\">\ud83d\uded1<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Close:<\/strong> conn.close() para liberar recursos\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <!-- OPERACIONES SQL -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Operaciones SQL en Python<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>TIPO<\/th>\r\n                            <th>EJEMPLO PYTHON<\/th>\r\n                            <th>DESCRIPCI\u00d3N<\/th>\r\n                            <th>RETORNO<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"create\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">CREATE<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td><code>c.execute('CREATE TABLE t (col INT)')<\/code><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Crea estructura<\/td>\r\n                            <td>None<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"insert\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">INSERT<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td><code>c.executemany('INSERT INTO t VALUES (?)', [(1,),(2,)])<\/code><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Agrega datos<\/td>\r\n                            <td>None<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"select\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">SELECT<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td><code>c.execute('SELECT * FROM t'); rows = c.fetchall()<\/code><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Consulta datos<\/td>\r\n                            <td>List of tuples<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoOperacion\">\r\n                    Selecciona una operaci\u00f3n para ver detalles\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"operacion-ejemplos\">\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-detalle\" id=\"detalleCreate\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd0d CREATE en Detalle<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcdd C\u00f3digo Ejemplo<\/h5>\r\n                            <pre><code>c.execute('''CREATE TABLE stocks\r\n(date text, trans text, symbol text, qty real, price real)''')<\/code><\/pre>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfaf Tipos de Datos<\/h5>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>NULL<\/li>\r\n                                <li>INTEGER<\/li>\r\n                                <li>REAL<\/li>\r\n                                <li>TEXT<\/li>\r\n                                <li>BLOB<\/li>\r\n                            <\/ul>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-detalle\" id=\"detalleInsert\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd0d INSERT en Detalle<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcdd C\u00f3digo Ejemplo<\/h5>\r\n                            <pre><code>purchases = [('2006-03-28', 'BUY', 'IBM', 1000, 45.00),\r\n             ('2006-04-05', 'BUY', 'MSFT', 1000, 72.00),\r\n             ('2006-04-06', 'SELL', 'IBM', 500, 53.00),]\r\nc.executemany('INSERT INTO stocks VALUES (?,?,?,?,?)', purchases)<\/code><\/pre>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfaf Best Practices<\/h5>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Use placeholders ? para seguridad<\/li>\r\n                                <li>executemany para batch inserts<\/li>\r\n                                <li>Commit despu\u00e9s de cambios<\/li>\r\n                            <\/ul>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-detalle\" id=\"detalleSelect\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd0d SELECT en Detalle<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcdd C\u00f3digo Ejemplo<\/h5>\r\n                            <pre><code>for row in c.execute('SELECT * FROM stocks ORDER BY price'):\r\n    print(row)<\/code><\/pre>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfaf M\u00e9todos Cursor<\/h5>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>fetchone(): Un row<\/li>\r\n                                <li>fetchmany(size): Varios<\/li>\r\n                                <li>fetchall(): Todos<\/li>\r\n                            <\/ul>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <!-- PYODIDE INTEGRATION -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Pyodide: Python en Browser<\/h3>\r\n            <p class=\"principio-clave\">\r\n                <strong>Objetivo:<\/strong> Ejecutar Python nativo en WebAssembly, sin backend.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"pyodide-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"py-card\" data-py=\"core\">\r\n                    <div class=\"py-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"py-badge\">Core<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Pyodide Base<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"py-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Reglas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>loadPyodide()<\/li>\r\n                            <li>runPythonAsync(code)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Paquetes via loadPackage<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                        <div class=\"py-ejemplo\">\r\n                            <strong>\u2705 Uso:<\/strong> <code>await pyodide.loadPackage('sqlite3')<\/code>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"py-card\" data-py=\"limits\">\r\n                    <div class=\"py-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"py-badge\">Limits<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>L\u00edmites<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"py-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Reglas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>No filesystem real<\/li>\r\n                            <li>RAM browser-limited<\/li>\r\n                            <li>No threads nativos<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                        <div class=\"py-ejemplo\">\r\n                            <strong>\u274c Evitar:<\/strong> Grandes datasets\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"py-card\" data-py=\"best\">\r\n                    <div class=\"py-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"py-badge\">Best<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Best Practices<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"py-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Reglas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Cargar una vez<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Redirigir stdout<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Manejar errors<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                        <div class=\"py-ejemplo\">\r\n                            <strong>\u2705 C\u00f3digo:<\/strong> sys.stdout = StringIO()\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 3\ufe0f\u20e3 VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA INTERACTIVA -->\r\n    <section class=\"visualizacion-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span> VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA INTERACTIVA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"diagrama-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"diagrama-controls\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f FLUJO PYTHON + SQLITE<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"diagrama-visual\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 500\" id=\"svgDiagrama\" class=\"er-diagram-interactive\">\r\n                    <defs>\r\n                        <marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                            <path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#39FF14\"\/>\r\n                        <\/marker>\r\n                    <\/defs>\r\n                    <rect width=\"800\" height=\"500\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- Python Box -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"200\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(0,188,212,0.5)\" stroke=\"#00ff00\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"200\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 5px #00ff00\">Python Code<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- SQLite Box -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"500\" y=\"200\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(0,96,100,0.5)\" stroke=\"#ff00ff\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"600\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 5px #ff00ff\">SQLite DB<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- Connection -->\r\n                    <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#ffff00\" stroke-width=\"6\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"400\" y=\"240\" fill=\"#ffff00\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 5px #ffff00\">sqlite3.connect()<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- Operations -->\r\n                    <text x=\"400\" y=\"280\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 5px #00ffff\">execute(), commit(), fetch()<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- Browser Note -->\r\n                    <text x=\"400\" y=\"350\" fill=\"#00ff88\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 5px #00ff88\">Pyodide: Python in WASM<\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"diagrama-info\" id=\"diagramInfo\">\r\n                    Diagrama de integraci\u00f3n Python-SQLite en browser (colores ajustados para visibilidad)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 4\ufe0f\u20e3 BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS REALES -->\r\n    <section class=\"interactivos-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS REALES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO (OBLIGATORIO) -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"python-sqlite\">\r\n            <style>\r\n                .sim-wrap{padding:1rem 0;}\r\n                .sim-tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;}\r\n                .sim-tab{padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);color:var(--color-text-secondary);cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s;}\r\n                .sim-tab.active{background:var(--color-background-secondary);color:var(--color-text-primary);border-color:var(--color-border-primary);}\r\n                .sim-tab:hover:not(.active){background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);}\r\n                .snippets-bar{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px;}\r\n                .snippet-btn{padding:7px 14px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:999px;background:transparent;color:var(--color-text-secondary);cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s;}\r\n                .snippet-btn:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);}\r\n                .editor-panel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;}\r\n                @media(max-width:860px){.editor-panel{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}\r\n                .panel-card{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--color-background-primary);}\r\n                .panel-header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);background:var(--color-background-secondary);}\r\n                .panel-title{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text-secondary);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;}\r\n                .editor-area{width:100%;min-height:320px;padding:16px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--color-text-primary);background:transparent;border:none;outline:none;resize:vertical;}\r\n                .output-area{min-height:320px;padding:16px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;white-space:pre-wrap;color:var(--color-text-primary);overflow:auto;background:transparent;}\r\n                .output-placeholder{color:var(--color-text-tertiary);font-style:italic;}\r\n                .toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 16px;background:var(--color-background-secondary);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);flex-wrap:wrap;}\r\n                .btn-run,.btn-sm{padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);background:transparent;color:var(--color-text-secondary);cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s;}\r\n                .btn-run{background:var(--color-background-success);color:var(--color-text-success);border-color:var(--color-border-success);}\r\n                .btn-run:hover,.btn-sm:hover{opacity:.92;}\r\n                .status-pill{padding:6px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;}\r\n                .status-idle{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);color:var(--color-text-tertiary);}\r\n                .status-running{background:rgba(8,182,255,.14);color:var(--color-text-info);}\r\n                .status-done{background:rgba(56,227,68,.14);color:var(--color-text-success);}\r\n                .status-error{background:rgba(255,77,79,.14);color:var(--color-text-danger);}\r\n                .info-bar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:14px;}\r\n                .data-card{padding:14px;background:var(--color-background-secondary);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:16px;}\r\n                .data-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--color-text-tertiary);margin-bottom:4px;}\r\n                .data-value{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-text-primary);}\r\n                .consejos-sql{margin-top:16px;padding:14px;background:var(--color-background-secondary);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:16px;}\r\n                .consejo-item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--color-text-primary);}\r\n                .loading-bar{height:2px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);overflow:hidden;display:none;}\r\n                .loading-bar-fill{height:100%;width:0;background:var(--color-text-info);transition:width .3s;}\r\n                .line-count{font-size:11px;color:var(--color-text-tertiary);padding:8px 16px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);}\r\n            <\/style>\r\n            <div class=\"sim-wrap\">\r\n                <div class=\"sim-tabs\">\r\n                    <button class=\"sim-tab active\" onclick=\"setTab(0)\">Libre<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"sim-tab\" onclick=\"setTab(1)\">Crear tabla<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"sim-tab\" onclick=\"setTab(2)\">Insert batch<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"sim-tab\" onclick=\"setTab(3)\">Consulta SELECT<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"sim-tab\" onclick=\"setTab(4)\">Transacci\u00f3n<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"snippets-bar\">\r\n                    <span class=\"snippets-label\">Insertar:<\/span>\r\n                    <button class=\"snippet-btn\" onclick=\"insertSnippet('conn')\">connect()<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"snippet-btn\" onclick=\"insertSnippet('create')\">CREATE TABLE<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"snippet-btn\" onclick=\"insertSnippet('insert')\">INSERT<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"snippet-btn\" onclick=\"insertSnippet('select')\">SELECT<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"snippet-btn\" onclick=\"insertSnippet('commit')\">commit()<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"snippet-btn\" onclick=\"insertSnippet('fetchall')\">fetchall()<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"editor-panel\">\r\n                    <div class=\"panel-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"panel-header\">\r\n                            <div class=\"panel-title\">Editor \u2014 Python<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"loading-bar\" id=\"loadingBar\"><div class=\"loading-bar-fill\" id=\"loadingFill\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n                        <textarea id=\"codeEditor\" class=\"editor-area\" spellcheck=\"false\" autocorrect=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" onkeydown=\"handleTab(event)\" oninput=\"updateLineCount()\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <div class=\"line-count\" id=\"lineCount\">1 l\u00ednea<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"toolbar\">\r\n                            <button class=\"btn-run\" id=\"runBtn\" onclick=\"runCode()\">\u25b6 Ejecutar<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"btn-sm\" onclick=\"clearOutput()\">Limpiar salida<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"btn-sm\" onclick=\"resetEditor()\">Restablecer<\/button>\r\n                            <span class=\"status-pill status-idle\" id=\"statusPill\">inactivo<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"panel-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"panel-header\">\r\n                            <div class=\"panel-title\">Salida<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div id=\"outputArea\" class=\"output-area\">\r\n                            <span class=\"output-placeholder\">Cargando Pyodide... (primera vez ~10s)<\/span>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"info-bar\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"data-label\">Motor<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"data-value\">Pyodide 0.26.1<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"data-label\">M\u00f3dulo<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"data-value\">sqlite3 built-in<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"data-label\">Estado<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"envChip\">Cargando...<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd0d INFO EJECUCI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Versi\u00f3n Pyodide:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\">0.26.1<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Paquetes Cargados:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\">sqlite3<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"consejos-sql\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udca1 CONSEJOS<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"consejo-item\">\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-text\">Usa placeholders ? para SQL seguro<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"consejo-item\">\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-icon\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-text\">Commit despu\u00e9s de cambios<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"consejo-item\">\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-text\">Close conn al finalizar<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 5\ufe0f\u20e3 QUIZ AUTOEVALUADO CON FEEDBACK -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ PYTHON + SQLITE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 hace sqlite3.connect(':memory:')?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Conecta a archivo\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        DB en RAM temporal\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Servidor remoto\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Lee CSV\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Crea DB en memoria.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa conexi\u00f3n.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> ':memory:' es DB vol\u00e1til en RAM, ideal para tests.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfPara qu\u00e9 sirve conn.commit()?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Cierra conexi\u00f3n\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Ejecuta query\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Guarda cambios\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Fetch rows\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Persiste transacciones.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa ACID.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Regla:<\/strong> Sin commit, cambios se pierden al cerrar conn.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"D\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 m\u00e9todo usa placeholders seguros?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        execute(f-string)\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        execute + concat\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        execute % vars\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        executemany con ?\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Previene SQL injection.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Evita concatenaci\u00f3n.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Tip:<\/strong> Siempre usa ? y tuples para params.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 6\ufe0f\u20e3 SECCI\u00d3N \"ERRORES COMUNES\" INTERACTIVA -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES INTERACTIVOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card collapsible\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Error 1: Olvidar Commit<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"collapse-icon\">+<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <pre><code># \u274c Mal\r\nc.execute(\"INSERT INTO t VALUES (1)\")\r\n# Sin conn.commit()<\/code><\/pre>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>Cambios no se guardan. Soluci\u00f3n: Siempre commit despu\u00e9s DML.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p>Prueba: Corrige el c\u00f3digo<\/p>\r\n                        <textarea class=\"practica-input\" placeholder=\"Escribe la correcci\u00f3n...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarError(1, this)\">Verificar<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"practica-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card collapsible\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Error 2: SQL Injection<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"collapse-icon\">+<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <pre><code># \u274c Mal\r\nuser = input()\r\nc.execute(f\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = '{user}'\")<\/code><\/pre>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>Vulnerable a ataques. Soluci\u00f3n: Usar placeholders.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p>Prueba: Corrige con ?<\/p>\r\n                        <textarea class=\"practica-input\" placeholder=\"Escribe la correcci\u00f3n...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarError(2, this)\">Verificar<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"practica-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card collapsible\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Error 3: No Cerrar Conn<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"collapse-icon\">+<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <pre><code># \u274c Mal\r\nconn = sqlite3.connect('db.db')\r\n# C\u00f3digo...\r\n# Sin conn.close()<\/code><\/pre>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>Leaks recursos. Soluci\u00f3n: Usar with o close.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p>Prueba: A\u00f1ade close<\/p>\r\n                        <textarea class=\"practica-input\" placeholder=\"Escribe la correcci\u00f3n...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarError(3, this)\">Verificar<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"practica-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 7\ufe0f\u20e3 PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"problemas-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"problemas-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 1 (Desarrollo)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Crea DB SQLite en Python para tienda: productos, ventas. Inserta data y query total ventas.<\/p>\r\n                <textarea class=\"respuesta-area\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu c\u00f3digo...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n                    <p>R\u00fabrica: 40% Estructura, 30% Queries, 30% Seguridad<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 2 (Interpretaci\u00f3n)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Explica: c.executemany(sql, params) vs execute loop. Ventajas?<\/p>\r\n                <textarea class=\"respuesta-area\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu interpretaci\u00f3n...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n                    <p>R\u00fabrica: 50% Eficiencia, 50% Seguridad<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 3 (Razonamiento)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 SQLite sobre MySQL para app desktop?<\/p>\r\n                <textarea class=\"respuesta-area\" placeholder=\"Escribe tu justificaci\u00f3n...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n                    <p>R\u00fabrica: 60% Ventajas, 40% Ejemplos<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 8\ufe0f\u20e3 CIERRE METACOGNITIVO INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO INTERACTIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N DE HABILIDADES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"skill-meter\">\r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>Conexi\u00f3n DB:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"skill-fill\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\" data-skill=\"conexion\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                   \r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>Queries SQL:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"skill-fill\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\" data-skill=\"queries\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                   \r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>Pyodide Uso:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"skill-fill\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\" data-skill=\"pyodide\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                   \r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>Error Handling:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"skill-fill\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\" data-skill=\"errors\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarHabilidades()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR EVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo cambia Pyodide el desarrollo web?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n...\" rows=\"3\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Caso real donde SQLite es ideal vs server DB.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu ejemplo...\" rows=\"3\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"proyecto-final\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83c\udfaf PROYECTO FINAL: TODO APP<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"proyecto-enunciado\">\r\n                <p><strong>Objetivo:<\/strong> Crea app TODO con SQLite en Python browser:<\/p>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Tabla tasks (id, desc, done)<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Funcs add, list, complete<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Persist in memory<\/li>\r\n                    <li>UI simple en console<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n                <p><strong>Requisitos:<\/strong> Secure params, error handling, queries complejas.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-proyecto\" onclick=\"mostrarEsqueletoProyecto()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udcdd VER ESQUELETO\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            <div class=\"proyecto-solucion\" id=\"proyectoSolucion\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <pre><code>import sqlite3\r\nconn = sqlite3.connect(':memory:')\r\nc = conn.cursor()\r\nc.execute('''CREATE TABLE tasks (\r\n    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,\r\n    desc TEXT,\r\n    done BOOLEAN\r\n)''')\r\ndef add_task(desc):\r\n    c.execute(\"INSERT INTO tasks (desc, done) VALUES (?, 0)\", (desc,))\r\n    conn.commit()\r\n# Etc...<\/code><\/pre>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/docs.python.org\/3\/library\/sqlite3.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \u26a1 SQLite Docs Python\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/pyodide.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udfae Pyodide Site\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/sqlite.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcd0 SQLite Official\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.sqlitetutorial.net\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\ude80 SQLite Tutorial\r\n                <\/a>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- Pyodide Script -->\r\n<script src=\"https:\/\/cdn.jsdelivr.net\/pyodide\/v0.26.1\/full\/pyodide.js\"><\/script>\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ JS PARA LA LECCI\u00d3N\r\nconsole.log('Inicializando lecci\u00f3n Programaci\u00f3n - Python + SQLite');\r\n\r\nlet pyodide = null;\r\nlet pyReady = false;\r\nlet execCount = 0;\r\n\r\nconst defaultCode = `import sqlite3\r\nconn = sqlite3.connect(':memory:')\r\nc = conn.cursor()\r\nc.execute('''CREATE TABLE usuarios (\r\n      id   INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\r\n      nombre TEXT NOT NULL,\r\n      edad   INTEGER,\r\n      nivel  TEXT\r\n  )''')\r\ndatos = [\r\n      (\"Ana Torres\",     17, \"Avanzado\"),\r\n      (\"Luis Ram\u00edrez\",   18, \"Intermedio\"),\r\n      (\"Sof\u00eda Mendoza\",  16, \"Principiante\"),\r\n      (\"Marco Vargas\",   19, \"Avanzado\"),\r\n      (\"Valeria Castro\", 17, \"Avanzado\"),\r\n  ]\r\nc.executemany(\"INSERT INTO usuarios (nombre, edad, nivel) VALUES (?,?,?)\", datos)\r\nconn.commit()\r\nprint(f\"{'ID':<4} {'Nombre':<20} {'Edad':<6} Nivel\")\r\nprint(\"-\" * 46)\r\nfor row in c.execute(\"SELECT * FROM usuarios ORDER BY id\"):\r\n      print(f\"{row[0]:<4} {row[1]:<20} {row[2]:<6} {row[3]}\")\r\nc.execute(\"SELECT AVG(edad) FROM usuarios\")\r\nprint(f\"\\\\nEdad promedio: {c.fetchone()[0]:.1f} a\u00f1os\")\r\nc.execute(\"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM usuarios WHERE nivel='Avanzado'\")\r\nprint(f\"Usuarios avanzado: {c.fetchone()[0]}\")\r\nconn.close()`;\r\n\r\nconst tabs = [\r\n  defaultCode,\r\n  `import sqlite3\r\nconn = sqlite3.connect(':memory:')\r\nc = conn.cursor()\r\n\r\n# Crear tabla con restricciones\r\nc.execute('''\r\n    CREATE TABLE productos (\r\n          id       INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\r\n          nombre   TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,\r\n          precio   REAL CHECK(precio > 0),\r\n          stock    INTEGER DEFAULT 0\r\n      )\r\n  ''')\r\nconn.commit()\r\n\r\nprint(\"Tabla 'productos' creada.\")\r\n\r\n# Verificar estructura con PRAGMA\r\nfor col in c.execute(\"PRAGMA table_info(productos)\"):\r\n      print(f\"  col {col[1]:12} tipo={col[2]}\")\r\nconn.close()`,\r\n\r\n  `import sqlite3\r\nconn = sqlite3.connect(':memory:')\r\nc = conn.cursor()\r\nc.execute(\"CREATE TABLE ventas (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, producto TEXT, qty INT, total REAL)\")\r\n\r\n# Insert con executemany \u2014 eficiente para lotes\r\nregistros = [\r\n      (\"Laptop\",   2, 2400.00),\r\n      (\"Monitor\",  3,  900.00),\r\n      (\"Teclado\",  5,  250.00),\r\n      (\"Mouse\",   10,  150.00),\r\n      (\"Webcam\",   4,  320.00),\r\n  ]\r\nc.executemany(\"INSERT INTO ventas (producto, qty, total) VALUES (?,?,?)\", registros)\r\nconn.commit()\r\n\r\nprint(f\"{'Producto':<12} {'Qty':>5} {'Total':>10}\")\r\nprint(\"-\" * 30)\r\nfor row in c.execute(\"SELECT producto, qty, total FROM ventas ORDER BY total DESC\"):\r\n      print(f\"{row[0]:<12} {row[1]:>5} \\${row[2]:>9,.2f}\")\r\n\r\nc.execute(\"SELECT SUM(total), SUM(qty) FROM ventas\")\r\ns = c.fetchone()\r\nprint(f\"\\\\n{'TOTAL':<12} {s[1]:>5} \\${s[0]:>9,.2f}\")\r\nconn.close()`,\r\n\r\n  `import sqlite3\r\nconn = sqlite3.connect(':memory:')\r\nc = conn.cursor()\r\nc.execute(\"CREATE TABLE empleados (id INT, nombre TEXT, depto TEXT, salario REAL)\")\r\nc.executemany(\"INSERT INTO empleados VALUES (?,?,?,?)\", [\r\n      (1,\"Ana\",\"TI\",   55000),\r\n      (2,\"Luis\",\"HR\",  42000),\r\n      (3,\"Sof\u00eda\",\"TI\", 61000),\r\n      (4,\"Marco\",\"TI\", 58000),\r\n      (5,\"Eva\",\"HR\",   47000),\r\n  ])\r\nconn.commit()\r\n\r\n# Agrupaci\u00f3n y filtrado\r\nprint(\"Resumen por departamento:\")\r\nq = \"\"\"\r\n      SELECT depto,\r\n             COUNT(*) AS total,\r\n             ROUND(AVG(salario),2) AS promedio,\r\n             MAX(salario) AS maximo\r\n      FROM empleados\r\n      GROUP BY depto\r\n      ORDER BY promedio DESC\r\n  \"\"\"\r\nprint(f\"{'Depto':<8} {'Total':>6} {'Promedio':>12} {'M\u00e1ximo':>10}\")\r\nprint(\"-\" * 40)\r\nfor row in c.execute(q):\r\n      print(f\"{row[0]:<8} {row[1]:>6} \\${row[2]:>11,.2f} \\${row[3]:>9,.2f}\")\r\n\r\n# WHERE + ORDER BY\r\nprint(\"\\\\nEmpleados de TI, mayor salario:\")\r\nfor row in c.execute(\"SELECT nombre, salario FROM empleados WHERE depto='TI' ORDER BY salario DESC\"):\r\n      print(f\"  {row[0]}: \\${row[1]:,.2f}\")\r\nconn.close()`,\r\n\r\n  `import sqlite3\r\nconn = sqlite3.connect(':memory:')\r\nc = conn.cursor()\r\nc.execute(\"CREATE TABLE cuentas (id INT PRIMARY KEY, saldo REAL)\")\r\nc.executemany(\"INSERT INTO cuentas VALUES (?,?)\", [(1, 5000.0),(2, 2000.0)])\r\nconn.commit()\r\n\r\ndef transferir(origen, destino, monto):\r\n      try:\r\n          with conn:  # context manager \u2014 auto commit o rollback\r\n              c.execute(\"SELECT saldo FROM cuentas WHERE id=?\", (origen,))\r\n              saldo = c.fetchone()[0]\r\n              if saldo < monto:\r\n                  raise ValueError(f\"Fondos insuficientes (saldo: {saldo})\")\r\n              c.execute(\"UPDATE cuentas SET saldo = saldo - ? WHERE id=?\", (monto, origen))\r\n              c.execute(\"UPDATE cuentas SET saldo = saldo + ? WHERE id=?\", (monto, destino))\r\n          print(f\"Transferencia \\${monto:,.2f} OK: cuenta {origen} \u2192 {destino}\")\r\n      except Exception as e:\r\n          print(f\"Rollback autom\u00e1tico: {e}\")\r\n\r\nprint(\"Saldos iniciales:\")\r\nfor r in c.execute(\"SELECT * FROM cuentas\"): print(f\"  Cuenta {r[0]}: \\${r[1]:,.2f}\")\r\n\r\ntransferir(1, 2, 1500)\r\ntransferir(2, 1, 9999)  # debe fallar\r\n\r\nprint(\"\\\\nSaldos finales:\")\r\nfor r in c.execute(\"SELECT * FROM cuentas\"): print(f\"  Cuenta {r[0]}: \\${r[1]:,.2f}\")\r\nconn.close()`\r\n];\r\n\r\nconst snippets = {\r\n  conn:    \"conn = sqlite3.connect(':memory:')\\nc = conn.cursor()\\n\",\r\n  create:  \"c.execute('''CREATE TABLE t (\\n    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,\\n    nombre TEXT\\n)''')\\n\",\r\n  insert:  \"c.execute(\\\"INSERT INTO t (nombre) VALUES (?)\\\", ('valor',))\\nconn.commit()\\n\",\r\n  select:  \"for row in c.execute('SELECT * FROM t'):\\n    print(row)\\n\",\r\n  commit:  \"conn.commit()\\n\",\r\n  fetchall:\"rows = c.fetchall()\\nprint(rows)\\n\"\r\n};\r\n\r\ndocument.getElementById('codeEditor').value = defaultCode;\r\nupdateLineCount();\r\n\r\nasync function initPyodide() {\r\n    const out = document.getElementById('outputArea');\r\n    setStatus('running', 'iniciando');\r\n    showLoading(true);\r\n    try {\r\n        pyodide = await loadPyodide();\r\n        await pyodide.loadPackage('sqlite3');\r\n        pyReady = true;\r\n        out.innerHTML = '<span class=\"output-success\">Pyodide listo. Presiona Ejecutar.<\/span>';\r\n        document.getElementById('envChip').textContent = 'Listo';\r\n        setStatus('done', 'listo');\r\n    } catch (e) {\r\n        out.innerHTML = '<span class=\"output-error\">Error al cargar Pyodide: ' + e.message + '<\/span>';\r\n        document.getElementById('envChip').textContent = 'Error';\r\n        setStatus('error', 'error');\r\n    }\r\n    showLoading(false);\r\n}\r\n\r\nasync function runCode() {\r\n    if (!pyReady) { alert('Pyodide a\u00fan cargando...'); return; }\r\n    const code = document.getElementById('codeEditor').value;\r\n    const out = document.getElementById('outputArea');\r\n    const btn = document.getElementById('runBtn');\r\n    btn.disabled = true;\r\n    setStatus('running', 'ejecutando');\r\n    showLoading(true);\r\n    out.innerHTML = '<span class=\"output-placeholder\">Ejecutando...<\/span>';\r\n    try {\r\n        await pyodide.runPythonAsync(\"import sys\\nfrom io import StringIO\\nsys.stdout = StringIO()\\nsys.stderr = sys.stdout\");\r\n        await pyodide.runPythonAsync(code);\r\n        const stdout = pyodide.runPython('sys.stdout.getvalue()');\r\n        execCount++;\r\n        out.textContent = stdout || '(sin salida)';\r\n        out.className = 'output-area output-success';\r\n        setStatus('done', 'ok \u00b7 #' + execCount);\r\n    } catch (e) {\r\n        out.textContent = e.message;\r\n        out.className = 'output-area output-error';\r\n        setStatus('error', 'error');\r\n    }\r\n    btn.disabled = false;\r\n    showLoading(false);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction clearOutput() {\r\n    const out = document.getElementById('outputArea');\r\n    out.textContent = '';\r\n    out.className = 'output-area';\r\n    setStatus('idle', 'inactivo');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction resetEditor() {\r\n    const tab = document.querySelectorAll('.sim-tab');\r\n    let active = 0;\r\n    tab.forEach((t, i) => { if (t.classList.contains('active')) active = i; });\r\n    document.getElementById('codeEditor').value = tabs[active];\r\n    updateLineCount();\r\n    clearOutput();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction setTab(i) {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.sim-tab').forEach((t, j) => t.classList.toggle('active', i === j));\r\n    document.getElementById('codeEditor').value = tabs[i];\r\n    updateLineCount();\r\n    clearOutput();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction insertSnippet(key) {\r\n    const ta = document.getElementById('codeEditor');\r\n    const val = snippets[key];\r\n    const start = ta.selectionStart;\r\n    const end = ta.selectionEnd;\r\n    ta.value = ta.value.slice(0, start) + val + ta.value.slice(end);\r\n    ta.selectionStart = ta.selectionEnd = start + val.length;\r\n    ta.focus();\r\n    updateLineCount();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction handleTab(e) {\r\n    if (e.key === 'Tab') {\r\n        e.preventDefault();\r\n        const ta = e.target;\r\n        const s = ta.selectionStart;\r\n        ta.value = ta.value.slice(0, s) + '    ' + ta.value.slice(ta.selectionEnd);\r\n        ta.selectionStart = ta.selectionEnd = s + 4;\r\n        updateLineCount();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction updateLineCount() {\r\n    const lines = document.getElementById('codeEditor').value.split('\\n').length;\r\n    document.getElementById('lineCount').textContent = lines + (lines === 1 ? ' l\u00ednea' : ' l\u00edneas');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction setStatus(type, label) {\r\n    const pill = document.getElementById('statusPill');\r\n    pill.className = 'status-pill status-' + type;\r\n    pill.textContent = label;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showLoading(on) {\r\n    const bar = document.getElementById('loadingBar');\r\n    const fill = document.getElementById('loadingFill');\r\n    if (on) {\r\n        bar.style.display = 'block';\r\n        fill.style.width = '0%';\r\n        setTimeout(() => fill.style.width = '80%', 50);\r\n    } else {\r\n        fill.style.width = '100%';\r\n        setTimeout(() => { bar.style.display = 'none'; fill.style.width = '0%'; }, 400);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction cargarEjemplo(num) {\r\n    const ejemplos = {\r\n        1: `# Crear Tabla\r\nimport sqlite3\r\nconn = sqlite3.connect(':memory:')\r\nc = conn.cursor()\r\nc.execute('''CREATE TABLE test (id INT PRIMARY KEY, name TEXT)''')\r\nprint(\"Tabla creada\")`,\r\n        2: `# Insert Batch\r\nimport sqlite3\r\nconn = sqlite3.connect(':memory:')\r\nc = conn.cursor()\r\nc.execute('CREATE TABLE t (val INT)')\r\nvals = [(1,),(2,),(3,)]\r\nc.executemany('INSERT INTO t VALUES (?)', vals)\r\nconn.commit()\r\nc.execute('SELECT * FROM t')\r\nprint(c.fetchall())`,\r\n        3: `# Query Avanzada\r\nimport sqlite3\r\nconn = sqlite3.connect(':memory:')\r\nc = conn.cursor()\r\nc.execute('CREATE TABLE users (name TEXT, age INT)')\r\nc.executemany('INSERT INTO users VALUES (?, ?)', [('A', 20), ('B', 30), ('C', 25)])\r\nconn.commit()\r\nc.execute('SELECT AVG(age) FROM users WHERE age > 20')\r\nprint(\"Promedio:\", c.fetchone()[0])`,\r\n        4: `# Transacci\u00f3n\r\nimport sqlite3\r\nconn = sqlite3.connect(':memory:')\r\nc = conn.cursor()\r\nc.execute('CREATE TABLE t (val INT)')\r\ntry:\r\n    with conn:\r\n        c.execute('INSERT INTO t VALUES (1)')\r\n        raise Exception(\"Rollback test\")\r\nexcept:\r\n    print(\"Rollback ejecutado\")\r\nc.execute('SELECT * FROM t')\r\nprint(\"Datos:\", c.fetchall())`\r\n    };\r\n    document.getElementById('codeEditor').value = ejemplos[num];\r\n    updateLineCount();\r\n    clearOutput();\r\n}\r\n\r\ninitPyodide();\r\n\r\n\/\/ Funciones para objetivos\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n        const completado = card.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n        card.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n        card.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox').style.background = !completado ? 'var(--neon-concepto)' : '';\r\n        console.log('Objetivo toggled:', card.querySelector('h3').textContent);\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Funciones para operaciones\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(tr => {\r\n    tr.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n        const tipo = tr.dataset.tipo;\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.ejemplo-detalle').forEach(det => det.style.display = 'none');\r\n        const detalleId = 'detalle' + tipo.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + tipo.slice(1);\r\n        document.getElementById(detalleId).style.display = 'block';\r\n        document.getElementById('infoOperacion').textContent = `Detalles para ${tipo.toUpperCase()}`;\r\n        console.log('Operaci\u00f3n seleccionada:', tipo);\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Funciones para quiz\r\nlet quizCompletadas = 0;\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n        const question = option.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        if (question.dataset.answered) return;\r\n        question.dataset.answered = 'true';\r\n        const value = option.dataset.value;\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n        if (value === correct) {\r\n            option.classList.add('correct');\r\n            feedback.querySelector('.feedback-correct').style.display = 'block';\r\n            feedback.querySelector('.feedback-incorrect').style.display = 'none';\r\n        } else {\r\n            option.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            feedback.querySelector('.feedback-correct').style.display = 'none';\r\n            feedback.querySelector('.feedback-incorrect').style.display = 'block';\r\n        }\r\n        quizCompletadas++;\r\n        if (quizCompletadas === 3) mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        console.log('Opci\u00f3n seleccionada:', value, 'Correcta:', correct === value);\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option.correct').length;\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = correctas;\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = correctas === 3 ? '\u00a1Excelente!' : correctas === 2 ? 'Bien, revisa.' : 'Practica m\u00e1s.';\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n    console.log('Quiz completado, puntuaci\u00f3n:', correctas);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question').forEach(q => {\r\n        q.dataset.answered = '';\r\n        q.querySelector('.quiz-feedback').style.display = 'none';\r\n        q.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(o => o.classList.remove('correct', 'incorrect'));\r\n    });\r\n    quizCompletadas = 0;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n    console.log('Quiz reiniciado');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Funciones para errores comunes\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.collapsible .error-header').forEach(header => {\r\n    header.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const icon = header.querySelector('.collapse-icon');\r\n        content.style.display = content.style.display === 'none' ? 'block' : 'none';\r\n        icon.textContent = content.style.display === 'block' ? '-' : '+';\r\n        console.log('Error colapsado toggled');\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction verificarError(num, btn) {\r\n    const input = btn.previousElementSibling.value.toLowerCase();\r\n    const feedback = btn.nextElementSibling;\r\n    let correct = false;\r\n    if (num === 1) correct = input.includes('commit');\r\n    if (num === 2) correct = input.includes('?') || input.includes('placeholder');\r\n    if (num === 3) correct = input.includes('close') || input.includes('with conn');\r\n    feedback.textContent = correct ? '\u2705 Correcto!' : '\u274c Intenta de nuevo.';\r\n    feedback.style.color = correct ? 'var(--neon-concepto)' : 'var(--neon-alerta)';\r\n    console.log('Verificaci\u00f3n error', num, ':', correct);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Funciones para cierre\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.skill-slider').forEach(slider => {\r\n    slider.addEventListener('input', () => {\r\n        const fill = slider.previousElementSibling.querySelector('.skill-fill');\r\n        fill.style.width = slider.value + '%';\r\n        fill.dataset.level = slider.value;\r\n        console.log('Habilidad actualizada:', slider.dataset.skill, slider.value);\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction guardarHabilidades() {\r\n    const skills = {};\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.skill-slider').forEach(sl => skills[sl.dataset.skill] = sl.value);\r\n    localStorage.setItem('skills', JSON.stringify(skills));\r\n    alert('Habilidades guardadas');\r\n    console.log('Habilidades guardadas:', skills);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarEsqueletoProyecto() {\r\n    document.getElementById('proyectoSolucion').style.display = 'block';\r\n    console.log('Esqueleto de proyecto mostrado');\r\n}\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Conectar a SQLite","respuesta":"conn = sqlite3.connect('db.db')"},{"enunciado":"Crear tabla SQL","respuesta":"CREATE TABLE usuarios (id INT PRIMARY KEY, nombre TEXT)"},{"enunciado":"INSERT en Python","respuesta":"cursor.execute(\"INSERT INTO t (c) VALUES (?)\", (val,))"},{"enunciado":"SELECT con fetchall()","respuesta":"cursor.execute(\"SELECT * FROM t\").fetchall()"},{"enunciado":"Commit cambios","respuesta":"conn.commit()"},{"enunciado":"Cerrar conexi\u00f3n","respuesta":"conn.close()"},{"enunciado":"Usar :memory:","respuesta":"conn = sqlite3.connect(':memory:')"},{"enunciado":"IF NOT EXISTS","respuesta":"CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS ..."},{"enunciado":"Par\u00e1metros con ?","respuesta":"cursor.execute(sql, (val1, val2))"},{"enunciado":"fetchone()","respuesta":"Devuelve una fila"},{"enunciado":"rowcount","respuesta":"cursor.rowcount \u2192 filas afectadas"},{"enunciado":"SI: apps con SQLite","respuesta":"WhatsApp, Firefox, Android"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Python es","opciones":["Interpretado","Compilado","H\u00edbrido","Binario"],"correcta":"Interpretado"},{"pregunta":"sqlite3 es","opciones":["M\u00f3dulo nativo","Externo","pip install","Node.js"],"correcta":"M\u00f3dulo nativo"},{"pregunta":"SQLite necesita","opciones":["Nada, solo archivo","Servidor","Cloud","Docker"],"correcta":"Nada, solo archivo"},{"pregunta":"connect(':memory:')","opciones":["BD en RAM","Archivo","Cloud","Temporal"],"correcta":"BD en RAM"},{"pregunta":"execute() retorna","opciones":["Cursor","Lista","Nada","Error"],"correcta":"Cursor"},{"pregunta":"fetchall()","opciones":["Lista de tuplas","Diccionario","Texto","Nada"],"correcta":"Lista de tuplas"},{"pregunta":"commit()","opciones":["Guarda cambios","Cierra","Lee","Borra"],"correcta":"Guarda cambios"},{"pregunta":"close()","opciones":["Cierra conexi\u00f3n","Borra BD","Reinicia","Nada"],"correcta":"Cierra conexi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS","opciones":["Evita error si existe","Borra si existe","Nada","Error"],"correcta":"Evita error si existe"},{"pregunta":"Par\u00e1metros con ?","opciones":["Previenen inyecci\u00f3n SQL","Solo texto","Solo n\u00fameros","Nada"],"correcta":"Previenen inyecci\u00f3n SQL"},{"pregunta":"rowcount","opciones":["Filas afectadas","Columnas","Tama\u00f1o BD","Nada"],"correcta":"Filas afectadas"},{"pregunta":"fetchone()","opciones":["Una fila","Todas","Ninguna","Error"],"correcta":"Una fila"},{"pregunta":"executemany()","opciones":["M\u00faltiples INSERT","Uno solo","SELECT","DELETE"],"correcta":"M\u00faltiples INSERT"},{"pregunta":"SQLite soporta","opciones":["Transacciones ACID","Solo lectura","Nada","NoSQL"],"correcta":"Transacciones ACID"},{"pregunta":"Tama\u00f1o m\u00e1x BD SQLite","opciones":["~281 TB","1 GB","100 MB","Ilimitado"],"correcta":"~281 TB"},{"pregunta":"Apps famosas con SQLite","opciones":["WhatsApp, Firefox","Netflix","Google","Amazon"],"correcta":"WhatsApp, Firefox"},{"pregunta":"Python en 2025","opciones":["#1 en popularidad","#5","#10","Obsoleto"],"correcta":"#1 en popularidad"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: % dispositivos con SQLite","opciones":["+90%","50%","10%","0%"],"correcta":"+90%"},{"pregunta":"SQLite es","opciones":["Serverless","Con servidor","Cloud only","Depende"],"correcta":"Serverless"},{"pregunta":"Python + SQLite ideal para","opciones":["Prototipos, apps m\u00f3viles","Big Data","IA","Web"],"correcta":"Prototipos, apps m\u00f3viles"},{"pregunta":"cursor es","opciones":["Objeto para ejecutar SQL","Conexi\u00f3n","BD","Tabla"],"correcta":"Objeto para ejecutar SQL"},{"pregunta":"conn es","opciones":["Conexi\u00f3n a BD","Cursor","Tabla","SQL"],"correcta":"Conexi\u00f3n a BD"},{"pregunta":"with sqlite3.connect() as conn","opciones":["Cierra autom\u00e1ticamente","Manual","Error","No cierra"],"correcta":"Cierra autom\u00e1ticamente"},{"pregunta":"PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON","opciones":["Activa FK","Desactiva","Nada","Error"],"correcta":"Activa FK"},{"pregunta":"SQLite en Android","opciones":["Nativo","Java","Kotlin","Swift"],"correcta":"Nativo"},{"pregunta":"Python 3.12+","opciones":["Mejor sqlite3","Peor","Igual","Sin soporte"],"correcta":"Mejor sqlite3"},{"pregunta":"DB Browser for SQLite","opciones":["GUI gratuita","Paga","Web","CLI"],"correcta":"GUI gratuita"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: Python en educaci\u00f3n","opciones":["Lenguaje #1","#3","#5","No usado"],"correcta":"Lenguaje #1"},{"pregunta":"sqlite3.Row","opciones":["Acceso por nombre","Solo \u00edndice","Nada","Error"],"correcta":"Acceso por nombre"},{"pregunta":"Python + SQLite =","opciones":["Desarrollo full-stack local","Solo backend","Solo frontend","Nada"],"correcta":"Desarrollo full-stack local"}]},{"materia":"Programaci\u00f3n","slug":"bases-datos-no-relacionales-mongodb","titulo":"MongoDB + NoSQL: La Revoluci\u00f3n de las Bases de Datos","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK PROGRAMACI\u00d3N -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-programacion-bases-datos-no-relacionales-mongodb\" data-tema=\"bases-datos-no-relacionales-mongodb\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- 1\ufe0f\u20e3 INTRODUCCI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83d\udcc2<\/span>\r\n            MONGODB + NOSQL\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            La Revoluci\u00f3n de las Bases de Datos Documentales\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Entender NoSQL vs SQL<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Flexibilidad de esquemas, escalabilidad horizontal<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Dominar MongoDB basics<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Colecciones, documentos, queries<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Implementar operaciones<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Insert, find, update, aggregate<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Aplicar en escenarios reales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Apps escalables, big data<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfa5 Streaming<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Netflix maneja perfiles din\u00e1micos<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">10B+ docs<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\ude80 Tech Giants<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Google, Uber para data flexible<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">70% apps modernas<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcf1 Mobile<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Realm (Mongo) para offline sync<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Real-time<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"relacion-curricular\">\r\n            <h3>RELACI\u00d3N CURRICULAR<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"badges\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge\">Competencia: Big Data Management<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge\">Contenido: NoSQL Databases<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge\">Evaluaci\u00f3n: Proyecto Scalable DB<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 2\ufe0f\u20e3 DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO ESTRUCTURADO -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS NOSQL + MONGODB\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n       \r\n        <!-- INTRODUCCI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. NoSQL: Beyond Relational<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udeab NOSQL<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>\"Not Only SQL\" - Bases de datos para data no estructurada, escalabilidad, flexibilidad.<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"principios-grid\">\r\n                        <div class=\"principio\">\r\n                            <div class=\"principio-icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/div>\r\n                            <h5>Tipos<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Documental, Key-Value, Grafo, Columnar<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"principio\">\r\n                            <div class=\"principio-icon\">\u26a1<\/div>\r\n                            <h5>Ventajas<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Esquema flexible, horizontal scale<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"principio\">\r\n                            <div class=\"principio-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/div>\r\n                            <h5>BASICS<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>Base Availability Soft-state Eventual consistency<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"clasificacion-doble\">\r\n                <div class=\"clas-card nosql\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udcc2 NoSQL Documental<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Modelo:<\/strong> JSON-like docs<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Queries:<\/strong> Rich, indexed<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Use:<\/strong> Content management<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Ej:<\/strong> MongoDB, CouchDB<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Ventaja:<\/strong> Schema-less\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"clas-card sql\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\uddc4\ufe0f SQL (Contrast)<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Modelo:<\/strong> Tablas, rows<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Queries:<\/strong> JOIN heavy<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Use:<\/strong> Transactions<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Ej:<\/strong> MySQL, PostgreSQL<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Ventaja:<\/strong> ACID full\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <!-- MONGODB BASICS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. MongoDB Estructura<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"comparativa-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"comp-card db\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\uddc3\ufe0f Database<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"comp-badge\">Container<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Definici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Grupo de collections<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Caracter\u00edsticas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>use dbname<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Multiple per instance<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Sharded<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Replica sets<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"codigo\">use mydb<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"desc\">Switch DB<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"comp-card coll\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udcc1 Collection<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"comp-badge\">Table-like<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Definici\u00f3n:<\/strong> Grupo de docs<\/p>\r\n                        <p><strong>Caracter\u00edsticas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>db.createCollection<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Schema flexible<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Indexed<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Capped<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-ejemplos\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ejemplo-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"codigo\">db.users.insert({})<\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"desc\">Auto create<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"regla-oro\">\r\n                <h4>\u26a1 REGLA DE ORO: Document vs Row<\/h4>\r\n                <div class=\"regla-content\">\r\n                    <div class=\"regla-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-icon\">\ud83d\udcc4<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Document:<\/strong> JSON con fields din\u00e1micos\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"regla-item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-icon\">\ud83d\uddc4\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"regla-text\">\r\n                            <strong>Row:<\/strong> Estructura fija\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <!-- OPERACIONES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Operaciones B\u00e1sicas<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>TIPO<\/th>\r\n                            <th>COMANDO<\/th>\r\n                            <th>DESCRIPCI\u00d3N<\/th>\r\n                            <th>EJEMPLO<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"insert\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">INSERT<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>insertOne\/insertMany<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Agregar docs<\/td>\r\n                            <td>db.coll.insertOne({key: val})<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"find\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">FIND<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>find\/findOne<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Query docs<\/td>\r\n                            <td>db.coll.find({field: value})<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"update\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">UPDATE<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>updateOne\/updateMany<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Modificar<\/td>\r\n                            <td>db.coll.updateOne({f: v}, {$set: {new: val}})<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n                <div class=\"tabla-info\" id=\"infoOperacion\">\r\n                    Selecciona una operaci\u00f3n para ver detalles\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"operacion-ejemplos\">\r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-detalle\" id=\"detalleInsert\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd0d INSERT en Detalle<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcdd C\u00f3digo Ejemplo<\/h5>\r\n                            <pre><code>db.users.insertMany([\r\n  { name: \"John\", age: 30 },\r\n  { name: \"Jane\", age: 25 }\r\n])<\/code><\/pre>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfaf Opciones<\/h5>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>ordered: false para continuar en error<\/li>\r\n                                <li>writeConcern<\/li>\r\n                            <\/ul>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-detalle\" id=\"detalleFind\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd0d FIND en Detalle<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcdd C\u00f3digo Ejemplo<\/h5>\r\n                            <pre><code>db.users.find({ age: { $gt: 20 } }).sort({ name: 1 }).limit(5)<\/code><\/pre>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfaf Operadores<\/h5>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>$eq, $gt, $gte, $in<\/li>\r\n                                <li>$and, $or, $not<\/li>\r\n                                <li>$elemMatch para arrays<\/li>\r\n                            <\/ul>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"ejemplo-detalle\" id=\"detalleUpdate\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udd0d UPDATE en Detalle<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"analisis-content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83d\udcdd C\u00f3digo Ejemplo<\/h5>\r\n                            <pre><code>db.users.updateMany(\r\n  { age: { $lt: 30 } },\r\n  { $set: { status: \"young\" } }\r\n)<\/code><\/pre>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"analisis-item\">\r\n                            <h5>\ud83c\udfaf Operadores<\/h5>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>$set, $inc, $push<\/li>\r\n                                <li>$unset, $rename<\/li>\r\n                                <li>upsert: true<\/li>\r\n                            <\/ul>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <!-- ADVANCED -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Operaciones Avanzadas<\/h3>\r\n            <p class=\"principio-clave\">\r\n                <strong>Objetivo:<\/strong> Aggregations, indexes para performance.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"advanced-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"adv-card\" data-adv=\"agg\">\r\n                    <div class=\"adv-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"adv-badge\">Agg<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Aggregation<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"adv-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Reglas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Pipeline stages<\/li>\r\n                            <li>$match, $group, $sort<\/li>\r\n                            <li>$project, $unwind<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                        <div class=\"adv-ejemplo\">\r\n                            <strong>\u2705 Ej:<\/strong> db.coll.aggregate([{$group: {_id: \"$field\", total: {$sum: 1}}}])\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"adv-card\" data-adv=\"index\">\r\n                    <div class=\"adv-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"adv-badge\">Index<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Indexes<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"adv-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Reglas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>db.coll.createIndex({field: 1})<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Compound, text, geo<\/li>\r\n                            <li>TTL for expiration<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                        <div class=\"adv-ejemplo\">\r\n                            <strong>\u2705 Ej:<\/strong> db.coll.createIndex({location: \"2dsphere\"})\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"adv-card\" data-adv=\"scale\">\r\n                    <div class=\"adv-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"adv-badge\">Scale<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Sharding\/Replica<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"adv-content\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Reglas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Replica sets for HA<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Sharding for distribution<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Mongos router<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                        <div class=\"adv-ejemplo\">\r\n                            <strong>\u2705 Ej:<\/strong> sh.enableSharding(\"db\")\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 3\ufe0f\u20e3 VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA INTERACTIVA -->\r\n    <section class=\"visualizacion-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span> VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA INTERACTIVA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"diagrama-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"diagrama-controls\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f DIAGRAMA MONGODB<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"diagrama-visual\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1000 600\" id=\"svgDiagrama\" class=\"er-diagram-interactive\">\r\n                    <defs>\r\n                        <marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                            <path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#39FF14\"\/>\r\n                        <\/marker>\r\n                    <\/defs>\r\n                    <rect width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- Database -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"350\" y=\"50\" width=\"300\" height=\"500\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(0,188,212,0.5)\" stroke=\"#00ff00\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"500\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 5px #00ff00\">Database<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- Collection 1 -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"400\" y=\"150\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(0,96,100,0.5)\" stroke=\"#ff00ff\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"500\" y=\"200\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 5px #ff00ff\">Collection<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- Documents -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"420\" y=\"260\" width=\"160\" height=\"50\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,0,0.2)\" stroke=\"#ffff00\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"500\" y=\"285\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 5px #ffff00\">Document {JSON}<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <rect x=\"420\" y=\"320\" width=\"160\" height=\"50\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,0,0.2)\" stroke=\"#ffff00\" stroke-width=\"2\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"500\" y=\"345\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 5px #ffff00\">Document {JSON}<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- Sharding Note -->\r\n                    <text x=\"500\" y=\"500\" fill=\"#00ff88\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 5px #00ff88\">Scalable & Flexible<\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"diagrama-info\" id=\"diagramInfo\">\r\n                    Diagrama de estructura MongoDB (visibilidad mejorada)\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 4\ufe0f\u20e3 BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS REALES -->\r\n    <section class=\"interactivos-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS REALES\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <!-- SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO (OBLIGATORIO) -->\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"mongodb\">\r\n            <style>\r\n                .mongo-sim-panel { display:grid; gap:16px; }\r\n                .mongo-sim-top { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end; margin-bottom:14px; }\r\n                .mongo-sim-title { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:6px; }\r\n                .mongo-sim-tabs { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; }\r\n                .mongo-sim-tab { padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); background:rgba(255,255,255,.05); color:var(--color-text-secondary); cursor:pointer; transition:all .18s; font-size:13px; }\r\n                .mongo-sim-tab.active { background:var(--color-background-secondary); border-color:var(--color-border-primary); color:var(--color-text-primary); }\r\n                .mongo-sim-body { display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1.8fr 1fr; gap:18px; }\r\n                .mongo-sim-editor { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; }\r\n                .mongo-sim-editor textarea { width:100%; min-height:320px; padding:14px; border-radius:18px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); background:var(--color-background-primary); color:var(--color-text-primary); font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:13px; resize:vertical; }\r\n                .mongo-buttons { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; }\r\n                .mongo-button { padding:10px 16px; border-radius:14px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); background:var(--color-background-secondary); color:var(--color-text-primary); cursor:pointer; transition:all .15s; }\r\n                .mongo-button.primary { background:var(--color-background-info); color:var(--color-text-info); border-color:var(--color-border-info); }\r\n                .mongo-button.danger { background:var(--color-background-danger); color:var(--color-text-danger); border-color:var(--color-border-danger); }\r\n                .mongo-button:hover { transform:translateY(-1px); }\r\n                .mongo-output-card, .mongo-panel-card { background:var(--color-background-primary); border:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary); border-radius:18px; padding:16px; }\r\n                .mongo-output-header { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:10px; }\r\n                .mongo-output-header span { font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:var(--color-text-secondary); }\r\n                .mongo-output { min-height:320px; max-height:340px; overflow:auto; padding:12px; border-radius:14px; background:var(--color-background-secondary); font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:13px; color:var(--color-text-primary); white-space:pre-wrap; }\r\n                .mongo-output.placeholder { color:var(--color-text-tertiary); }\r\n                .mongo-summary { display:grid; gap:12px; }\r\n                .mongo-summary .data-card { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; border-radius:14px; padding:14px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.04); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); }\r\n                .mongo-summary .data-label { font-size:12px; color:var(--color-text-secondary); }\r\n                .mongo-summary .data-value { font-size:18px; font-weight:600; color:var(--color-text-primary); }\r\n                .mongo-snippet-bar { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin-bottom:12px; }\r\n                .mongo-snippet-btn { padding:7px 12px; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); background:rgba(255,255,255,.05); color:var(--color-text-secondary); font-size:12px; cursor:pointer; }\r\n                .mongo-snippet-btn:hover { background:var(--color-background-secondary); color:var(--color-text-primary); }\r\n                .mongo-status-pill { padding:6px 12px; border-radius:999px; font-size:12px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }\r\n                .status-idle { background:rgba(255,255,255,.06); color:var(--color-text-secondary); }\r\n                .status-running { background:rgba(0,188,212,.12); color:var(--color-text-info); }\r\n                .status-success { background:rgba(57,255,20,.12); color:#b8ffcc; }\r\n                .status-error { background:rgba(255,107,107,.12); color:#ffb8b8; }\r\n                @media (max-width: 960px) { .mongo-sim-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\r\n            <\/style>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"mongo-sim-panel\">\r\n                <div class=\"mongo-sim-top\">\r\n                    <div class=\"mongo-sim-title\">\r\n                        <h3>\ud83c\udfae SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO MONGODB<\/h3>\r\n                        <p>Practica comandos reales de MongoDB usando una base de datos simulada dentro del navegador.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div>\r\n                        <span id=\"mongoStatus\" class=\"mongo-status-pill status-idle\">Listo<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"mongo-sim-tabs\" id=\"mongoTabs\">\r\n                    <button class=\"mongo-sim-tab active\" onclick=\"setMongoTab(0)\">Libre<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"mongo-sim-tab\" onclick=\"setMongoTab(1)\">Insert Many<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"mongo-sim-tab\" onclick=\"setMongoTab(2)\">Find<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"mongo-sim-tab\" onclick=\"setMongoTab(3)\">Aggregate<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"mongo-sim-tab\" onclick=\"setMongoTab(4)\">Update<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"mongo-sim-body\">\r\n                    <div class=\"mongo-sim-editor\">\r\n                        <div class=\"mongo-snippet-bar\">\r\n                            <button class=\"mongo-snippet-btn\" onclick=\"insertMongoSnippet('insertMany')\">insertMany<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"mongo-snippet-btn\" onclick=\"insertMongoSnippet('find')\">find<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"mongo-snippet-btn\" onclick=\"insertMongoSnippet('findOne')\">findOne<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"mongo-snippet-btn\" onclick=\"insertMongoSnippet('count')\">countDocuments<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"mongo-snippet-btn\" onclick=\"insertMongoSnippet('aggregate')\">aggregate<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"mongo-snippet-btn\" onclick=\"insertMongoSnippet('update')\">updateMany<\/button>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <textarea id=\"mongo-input\" spellcheck=\"false\" autocorrect=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\">db.alumnos.insertMany([\r\n  { nombre: \"Ana L\u00f3pez\", edad: 17, nivel: \"Avanzado\", ciudad: \"CDMX\" },\r\n  { nombre: \"Carlos Ruiz\", edad: 19, nivel: \"Intermedio\" },\r\n  { nombre: \"Sof\u00eda Mendoza\", edad: 16, nivel: \"Principiante\", ciudad: \"Guadalajara\" },\r\n  { nombre: \"Luis Torres\", edad: 18, nivel: \"Avanzado\" }\r\n])\r\ndb.alumnos.find({ nivel: \"Avanzado\" })\r\ndb.alumnos.find({ edad: { $gte: 18 } })\r\ndb.alumnos.countDocuments({ ciudad: \"CDMX\" })<\/textarea>\r\n                        <div class=\"mongo-buttons\">\r\n                            <button class=\"mongo-button primary\" onclick=\"ejecutarMongo()\">\u25b6 Ejecutar<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"mongo-button\" onclick=\"resetMongoCode()\">\ud83d\udd04 Cargar ejemplo<\/button>\r\n                            <button class=\"mongo-button danger\" onclick=\"limpiarMongo()\">\ud83d\uddd1 Limpiar BD<\/button>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"mongo-summary\">\r\n                        <div class=\"mongo-output-card\">\r\n                            <div class=\"mongo-output-header\">\r\n                                <span>\ud83d\udcca SALIDA MONGODB<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"mongo-status-pill status-idle\" id=\"mongoCommandState\">esperando<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div id=\"mongo-output\" class=\"mongo-output placeholder\">Listo para comandos MongoDB...<\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"mongo-panel-card\">\r\n                            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                                <span class=\"data-label\">Colecciones<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"data-value\" id=\"collectionsCount\">0<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                                <span class=\"data-label\">Documentos totales<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"data-value\" id=\"totalDocs\">0<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                                <span class=\"data-label\">\u00daltima ejecuci\u00f3n<\/span>\r\n                                <span class=\"data-value\" id=\"mongoLastCommand\">-<\/span>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 5\ufe0f\u20e3 QUIZ AUTOEVALUADO CON FEEDBACK -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ NOSQL MONGODB\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfPrincipal ventaja NoSQL?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        ACID estricto\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Esquema fijo\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Escalabilidad horizontal\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        JOINs complejos\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Scale out f\u00e1cil.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa CAP.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Explicaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> NoSQL para big data distribuida.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Modelo MongoDB?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        Documental\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        Key-Value\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        Grafo\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        Columnar\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> Docs BSON.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> Revisa tipos NoSQL.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Regla:<\/strong> JSON-like con queries ricas.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>Comando para query?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">A<\/span>\r\n                        SELECT\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">B<\/span>\r\n                        find\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">C<\/span>\r\n                        get\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">\r\n                        <span class=\"option-letter\">D<\/span>\r\n                        query\r\n                    <\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\r\n                        \u2705 <strong>Correcto:<\/strong> db.coll.find().\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\r\n                        \u274c <strong>Incorrecto:<\/strong> No es SQL.\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Tip:<\/strong> Retorna cursor iterable.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"results-feedback\" id=\"quizFeedback\">\r\n                Completa el quiz para ver tus resultados\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 6\ufe0f\u20e3 SECCI\u00d3N \"ERRORES COMUNES\" INTERACTIVA -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES INTERACTIVOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card collapsible\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Error 1: Esquema R\u00edgido<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"collapse-icon\">+<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <pre><code>\/\/ \u274c Mal\r\n\/\/ Asumir fields fijos como en SQL<\/code><\/pre>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>NoSQL es flexible. Soluci\u00f3n: Docs din\u00e1micos.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p>Prueba: Insert doc con new field<\/p>\r\n                        <textarea class=\"practica-input\" placeholder=\"Escribe comando...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarError(1, this)\">Verificar<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"practica-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card collapsible\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Error 2: Sin Indexes<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"collapse-icon\">+<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <pre><code>\/\/ \u274c Mal\r\ndb.largeColl.find({field: val}) \/\/ Slow scan<\/code><\/pre>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>Queries lentas. Soluci\u00f3n: Create index on field.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p>Prueba: Add index<\/p>\r\n                        <textarea class=\"practica-input\" placeholder=\"Escribe comando...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarError(2, this)\">Verificar<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"practica-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card collapsible\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Error 3: Mal Aggregation<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"collapse-icon\">+<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <pre><code>\/\/ \u274c Mal\r\ndb.coll.aggregate([]) \/\/ Empty pipeline<\/code><\/pre>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>No resultados. Soluci\u00f3n: Add stages como $match.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-practica\">\r\n                        <p>Prueba: Simple aggregate<\/p>\r\n                        <textarea class=\"practica-input\" placeholder=\"Escribe comando...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-verificar\" onclick=\"verificarError(3, this)\">Verificar<\/button>\r\n                        <div class=\"practica-feedback\"><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 7\ufe0f\u20e3 PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"problemas-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"problemas-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 1 (Desarrollo)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Dise\u00f1a collection para e-commerce: products con embedded reviews. Insert sample, query avg rating.<\/p>\r\n                <textarea class=\"respuesta-area\" placeholder=\"Escribe comandos...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n                    <p>R\u00fabrica: 40% Modelado, 30% Insert, 30% Query<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 2 (Interpretaci\u00f3n)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Explica: { $gt: 18 } en find. Alternativas?<\/p>\r\n                <textarea class=\"respuesta-area\" placeholder=\"Escribe interpretaci\u00f3n...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n                    <p>R\u00fabrica: 50% Operadores, 50% Ejemplos<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <h3>Problema 3 (Razonamiento)<\/h3>\r\n                <p>\u00bfCu\u00e1ndo MongoDB sobre SQL? Caso real.<\/p>\r\n                <textarea class=\"respuesta-area\" placeholder=\"Escribe justificaci\u00f3n...\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <div class=\"rubrica\">\r\n                    <p>R\u00fabrica: 60% Ventajas, 40% Caso<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 8\ufe0f\u20e3 CIERRE METACOGNITIVO INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO INTERACTIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N DE HABILIDADES<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"skill-meter\">\r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>NoSQL Concepts:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"skill-fill\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\" data-skill=\"nosql\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                   \r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>Mongo Queries:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"skill-fill\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\" data-skill=\"queries\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                   \r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>Aggregation:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"skill-fill\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\" data-skill=\"agg\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                   \r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>Scaling:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\">\r\n                            <div class=\"skill-fill\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"width: 0%\"><\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\" data-skill=\"scale\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarHabilidades()\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcbe GUARDAR EVALUACI\u00d3N\r\n                <\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"reflexion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcad REFLEXI\u00d3N GUIADA<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>\u00bfC\u00f3mo NoSQL cambia app development?<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu reflexi\u00f3n...\" rows=\"3\" id=\"reflexion1\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"pregunta-reflexion\">\r\n                    <p>Caso donde Mongo es better than SQL.<\/p>\r\n                    <textarea placeholder=\"Escribe tu ejemplo...\" rows=\"3\" id=\"reflexion2\"><\/textarea>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"proyecto-final\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83c\udfaf PROYECTO FINAL: BLOG DB<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"proyecto-enunciado\">\r\n                <p><strong>Objetivo:<\/strong> Modela DB para blog: posts con embedded comments.<\/p>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Collection posts<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Insert post con comments<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Query recent posts<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Aggregate comment count<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n                <p><strong>Requisitos:<\/strong> Flexible schema, queries eficientes.<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-proyecto\" onclick=\"mostrarEsqueletoProyecto()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udcdd VER ESQUELETO\r\n            <\/button>\r\n            <div class=\"proyecto-solucion\" id=\"proyectoSolucion\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <pre><code>db.posts.insertOne({\r\n  title: \"Post 1\",\r\n  content: \"Text\",\r\n  comments: [{user: \"A\", text: \"Comment\"}]\r\n})\r\ndb.posts.aggregate([\r\n  {$match: {title: \/Post\/}},\r\n  {$project: {commentCount: {$size: \"$comments\"}}}\r\n])<\/code><\/pre>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.mongodb.com\/docs\/manual\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \u26a1 MongoDB Docs\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.mongodb.com\/try\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83c\udfae Mongo Atlas Free\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/university.mongodb.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\udcd0 Mongo University\r\n                <\/a>\r\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.nosqlbooster.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">\r\n                    \ud83d\ude80 NoSQLBooster Tool\r\n                <\/a>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ JS PARA LA LECCI\u00d3N COMPLETA - MongoDB + NoSQL\r\nconsole.log('Inicializando lecci\u00f3n Programaci\u00f3n - MongoDB + NoSQL');\r\n\r\nconst mongoDB = { collections: {} };\r\nconst mongoDefaultCode = `db.alumnos.insertMany([\r\n  { nombre: \"Ana L\u00f3pez\", edad: 17, nivel: \"Avanzado\", ciudad: \"CDMX\" },\r\n  { nombre: \"Carlos Ruiz\", edad: 19, nivel: \"Intermedio\" },\r\n  { nombre: \"Sof\u00eda Mendoza\", edad: 16, nivel: \"Principiante\", ciudad: \"Guadalajara\" },\r\n  { nombre: \"Luis Torres\", edad: 18, nivel: \"Avanzado\" }\r\n])\\ndb.alumnos.find({ nivel: \"Avanzado\" })\\ndb.alumnos.find({ edad: { $gte: 18 } })\\ndb.alumnos.countDocuments({ ciudad: \"CDMX\" })`;\r\nconst mongoTabs = [\r\n    { label: 'Libre', code: mongoDefaultCode },\r\n    { label: 'Insert Many', code: `db.alumnos.insertMany([\\n  { nombre: \"Alicia\", edad: 20, nivel: \"Intermedio\", ciudad: \"Monterrey\" },\\n  { nombre: \"Pedro\", edad: 22, nivel: \"Avanzado\", ciudad: \"CDMX\" }\\n])` },\r\n    { label: 'Find', code: `db.alumnos.find({ nivel: \"Avanzado\" })` },\r\n    { label: 'Aggregate', code: `db.alumnos.aggregate([\\n  { $match: { edad: { $gte: 18 } } },\\n  { $group: { _id: \"$nivel\", total: { $sum: 1 } } }\\n])` },\r\n    { label: 'Update', code: `db.alumnos.updateMany({ nivel: \"Intermedio\" }, { $set: { ciudad: \"Guadalajara\" } })` }\r\n];\r\nconst mongoSnippets = {\r\n    insertMany: `db.alumnos.insertMany([\\n  { nombre: \"Nombre\", edad: 25, nivel: \"Avanzado\", ciudad: \"CDMX\" }\\n])\\n`,\r\n    find: `db.alumnos.find({ nivel: \"Avanzado\" })\\n`,\r\n    findOne: `db.alumnos.findOne({ nombre: \"Ana L\u00f3pez\" })\\n`,\r\n    count: `db.alumnos.countDocuments({ ciudad: \"CDMX\" })\\n`,\r\n    aggregate: `db.alumnos.aggregate([\\n  { $match: { ciudad: \"CDMX\" } },\\n  { $group: { _id: \"$nivel\", total: { $sum: 1 } } }\\n])\\n`,\r\n    update: `db.alumnos.updateMany({ nivel: \"Intermedio\" }, { $set: { ciudad: \"Guadalajara\" } })\\n`\r\n};\r\nlet activeMongoTab = 0;\r\n\r\nfunction setMongoTab(index) {\r\n    activeMongoTab = index;\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.mongo-sim-tab').forEach((tab, i) => tab.classList.toggle('active', i === index));\r\n    document.getElementById('mongo-input').value = mongoTabs[index].code;\r\n    document.getElementById('mongo-output').innerHTML = '<span style=\"color:#888;\">Modo ' + mongoTabs[index].label + ' cargado<\/span>';\r\n    setMongoStatus('idle', mongoTabs[index].label);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction insertMongoSnippet(key) {\r\n    const ta = document.getElementById('mongo-input');\r\n    const snippet = mongoSnippets[key] || '';\r\n    const start = ta.selectionStart;\r\n    const end = ta.selectionEnd;\r\n    ta.value = ta.value.slice(0, start) + snippet + ta.value.slice(end);\r\n    ta.selectionStart = ta.selectionEnd = start + snippet.length;\r\n    ta.focus();\r\n    setMongoStatus('idle', 'snippet');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction setMongoStatus(type, label) {\r\n    const status = document.getElementById('mongoStatus');\r\n    const commandState = document.getElementById('mongoCommandState');\r\n    status.className = `mongo-status-pill status-${type}`;\r\n    status.textContent = label;\r\n    commandState.className = `mongo-status-pill status-${type}`;\r\n    commandState.textContent = label;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction safeParse(str) {\r\n    try {\r\n        return new Function('return (' + str + ')')();\r\n    } catch (e) {\r\n        throw new Error('JSON inv\u00e1lido: ' + e.message);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction unirComandos(texto) {\r\n    const comandos = [];\r\n    let buffer = '';\r\n    texto.split('\\n').forEach(linea => {\r\n        let raw = linea.trim();\r\n        if (!raw || raw.startsWith('\/\/')) return;\r\n        raw = raw.replace(\/;$\/, '');\r\n        buffer += (buffer ? ' ' : '') + raw;\r\n        if (raw.endsWith(')') || raw.endsWith(']')) {\r\n            comandos.push(buffer.trim());\r\n            buffer = '';\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    if (buffer.trim()) comandos.push(buffer.trim());\r\n    return comandos;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction formatResult(value) {\r\n    if (typeof value === 'string') return value;\r\n    return JSON.stringify(value, null, 2);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction ejecutarMongo() {\r\n    const input = document.getElementById('mongo-input').value.trim();\r\n    const output = document.getElementById('mongo-output');\r\n    setMongoStatus('running', 'ejecutando');\r\n    if (!input) {\r\n        output.innerHTML = '<span style=\"color:#ff6666;\">Escribe al menos un comando<\/span>';\r\n        setMongoStatus('error', 'vac\u00edo');\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    let resultado = '';\r\n    try {\r\n        const comandos = unirComandos(input);\r\n        comandos.forEach(linea => {\r\n            if (linea.includes('insertMany(')) {\r\n                const match = linea.match(\/db\\.(\\w+)\\.insertMany\\(([\\s\\S]*)\\)$\/);\r\n                if (match) {\r\n                    const coll = match[1];\r\n                    const docs = safeParse(match[2]);\r\n                    if (!Array.isArray(docs)) throw new Error('insertMany requiere un array');\r\n                    mongoDB.collections[coll] = mongoDB.collections[coll] || [];\r\n                    docs.forEach(d => {\r\n                        d._id = 'oid_' + Date.now().toString(36) + Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 5);\r\n                        mongoDB.collections[coll].push(d);\r\n                    });\r\n                    resultado += `Insertados ${docs.length} documentos en ${coll}\\n`;\r\n                    return;\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n            if (linea.includes('insertOne(')) {\r\n                const match = linea.match(\/db\\.(\\w+)\\.insertOne\\(([\\s\\S]*)\\)$\/);\r\n                if (match) {\r\n                    const coll = match[1];\r\n                    const doc = safeParse(match[2]);\r\n                    mongoDB.collections[coll] = mongoDB.collections[coll] || [];\r\n                    doc._id = 'oid_' + Date.now().toString(36);\r\n                    mongoDB.collections[coll].push(doc);\r\n                    resultado += `Insertado 1 documento \u2192 _id: ${doc._id}\\n`;\r\n                    return;\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n            if (linea.includes('findOne(') || (linea.includes('find(') && !linea.includes('findOne'))) {\r\n                const esOne = linea.includes('findOne');\r\n                const match = linea.match(\/db\\.(\\w+)\\.(findOne|find)\\(([\\s\\S]*)\\)$\/);\r\n                if (match) {\r\n                    const coll = match[1];\r\n                    const filtro = match[3] ? safeParse(match[3]) : {};\r\n                    let lista = mongoDB.collections[coll] || [];\r\n                    lista = lista.filter(doc => {\r\n                        for (let k in filtro) {\r\n                            const cond = filtro[k];\r\n                            if (typeof cond === 'object' && cond !== null) {\r\n                                if ('$gte' in cond && !(doc[k] >= cond.$gte)) return false;\r\n                                if ('$gt' in cond && !(doc[k] > cond.$gt)) return false;\r\n                                if ('$lt' in cond && !(doc[k] < cond.$lt)) return false;\r\n                                if ('$lte' in cond && !(doc[k] <= cond.$lte)) return false;\r\n                            } else if (doc[k] !== cond) {\r\n                                return false;\r\n                            }\r\n                        }\r\n                        return true;\r\n                    });\r\n                    resultado += formatResult(esOne ? lista[0] || null : lista) + '\\n';\r\n                    return;\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n            if (linea.includes('aggregate(')) {\r\n                const match = linea.match(\/db\\.(\\w+)\\.aggregate\\(([\\s\\S]*)\\)$\/);\r\n                if (match) {\r\n                    const coll = match[1];\r\n                    const pipeline = safeParse(match[2]);\r\n                    let lista = [...(mongoDB.collections[coll] || [])];\r\n                    pipeline.forEach(stage => {\r\n                        if (stage.$match) {\r\n                            lista = lista.filter(doc => {\r\n                                for (let key in stage.$match) {\r\n                                    const cond = stage.$match[key];\r\n                                    if (typeof cond === 'object' && cond !== null) {\r\n                                        if ('$gte' in cond && !(doc[key] >= cond.$gte)) return false;\r\n                                        if ('$lte' in cond && !(doc[key] <= cond.$lte)) return false;\r\n                                        if ('$gt' in cond && !(doc[key] > cond.$gt)) return false;\r\n                                        if ('$lt' in cond && !(doc[key] < cond.$lt)) return false;\r\n                                    } else if (doc[key] !== cond) {\r\n                                        return false;\r\n                                    }\r\n                                }\r\n                                return true;\r\n                            });\r\n                        }\r\n                        if (stage.$group) {\r\n                            const grouped = {};\r\n                            lista.forEach(doc => {\r\n                                const groupKey = stage.$group._id === null ? '__all' : doc[stage.$group._id.replace(\/^\\$\/, '')];\r\n                                grouped[groupKey] = grouped[groupKey] || { _id: groupKey, __count: 0 };\r\n                                grouped[groupKey].__count += 1;\r\n                                for (let field in stage.$group) {\r\n                                    if (field === '_id') continue;\r\n                                    const expr = stage.$group[field];\r\n                                    if (expr.$sum !== undefined) {\r\n                                        const value = expr.$sum === 1 ? 1 : doc[expr.$sum.replace(\/^\\$\/, '')] || 0;\r\n                                        grouped[groupKey][field] = (grouped[groupKey][field] || 0) + value;\r\n                                    }\r\n                                    if (expr.$avg !== undefined) {\r\n                                        grouped[groupKey][field] = grouped[groupKey][field] || { total: 0, count: 0 };\r\n                                        grouped[groupKey][field].total += doc[expr.$avg.replace(\/^\\$\/, '')] || 0;\r\n                                        grouped[groupKey][field].count += 1;\r\n                                    }\r\n                                }\r\n                            });\r\n                            lista = Object.values(grouped).map(item => {\r\n                                const row = { _id: item._id };\r\n                                for (let key in item) {\r\n                                    if (key === '_id' || key === '__count') continue;\r\n                                    const value = item[key];\r\n                                    row[key] = value && value.total !== undefined ? value.total \/ value.count : value;\r\n                                }\r\n                                return row;\r\n                            });\r\n                        }\r\n                        if (stage.$project) {\r\n                            lista = lista.map(doc => {\r\n                                const projected = {};\r\n                                for (let key in stage.$project) {\r\n                                    if (stage.$project[key] === 1) projected[key] = doc[key];\r\n                                    if (typeof stage.$project[key] === 'string' && stage.$project[key].startsWith('$')) {\r\n                                        projected[key] = doc[stage.$project[key].substring(1)];\r\n                                    }\r\n                                }\r\n                                return projected;\r\n                            });\r\n                        }\r\n                    });\r\n                    resultado += formatResult(lista) + '\\n';\r\n                    return;\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n            if (linea.includes('countDocuments(')) {\r\n                const match = linea.match(\/db\\.(\\w+)\\.countDocuments\\(([\\s\\S]*)\\)$\/);\r\n                if (match) {\r\n                    const coll = match[1];\r\n                    const filtro = match[2] ? safeParse(match[2]) : {};\r\n                    const count = (mongoDB.collections[coll] || []).filter(doc => {\r\n                        for (let key in filtro) {\r\n                            if (doc[key] !== filtro[key]) return false;\r\n                        }\r\n                        return true;\r\n                    }).length;\r\n                    resultado += `${count}\\n`;\r\n                    return;\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n            if (linea.includes('updateMany(')) {\r\n                const match = linea.match(\/db\\.(\\w+)\\.updateMany\\(([^,]+),([\\s\\S]*)\\)$\/);\r\n                if (match) {\r\n                    const coll = match[1];\r\n                    const filtro = safeParse(match[2]);\r\n                    const update = safeParse(match[3]);\r\n                    let lista = mongoDB.collections[coll] || [];\r\n                    let count = 0;\r\n                    lista.forEach(doc => {\r\n                        let ok = true;\r\n                        for (let key in filtro) {\r\n                            if (doc[key] !== filtro[key]) ok = false;\r\n                        }\r\n                        if (ok) {\r\n                            count += 1;\r\n                            if (update.$set) Object.assign(doc, update.$set);\r\n                        }\r\n                    });\r\n                    resultado += `Actualizados ${count} documentos en ${coll}\\n`;\r\n                    return;\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n            resultado += 'Comando no soportado: ' + linea + '\\n';\r\n        });\r\n        output.innerHTML = resultado.replace(\/\\n\/g, '<br>').replace(\/ \/g, '&nbsp;');\r\n        setMongoStatus('success', 'ok');\r\n    } catch (err) {\r\n        output.innerHTML = `<span style='color:#ff4444;'>ERROR: ${err.message}<\/span>`;\r\n        setMongoStatus('error', 'error');\r\n    }\r\n    document.getElementById('collectionsCount').textContent = Object.keys(mongoDB.collections).length;\r\n    let total = 0;\r\n    for (let c in mongoDB.collections) total += mongoDB.collections[c].length;\r\n    document.getElementById('totalDocs').textContent = total;\r\n    document.getElementById('mongoLastCommand').textContent = new Date().toLocaleTimeString();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction limpiarMongo() {\r\n    mongoDB.collections = {};\r\n    document.getElementById('mongo-output').innerHTML = '<span style=\"color:#00bcd4;\">Base de datos limpiada<\/span>';\r\n    document.getElementById('collectionsCount').textContent = 0;\r\n    document.getElementById('totalDocs').textContent = 0;\r\n    document.getElementById('mongoLastCommand').textContent = '-';\r\n    setMongoStatus('idle', 'limpio');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction resetMongoCode() {\r\n    document.getElementById('mongo-input').value = mongoDefaultCode;\r\n    document.getElementById('mongo-output').innerHTML = '<span style=\"color:#888;\">Ejemplo cargado<\/span>';\r\n    setMongoStatus('idle', 'ejemplo');\r\n}\r\n\r\nsetMongoTab(0);\r\n\r\nfunction cargarEjemplo(num) {\r\n    const ejemplos = {\r\n        1: `db.test.insertMany([\\n  { item: \"laptop\", qty: 10 },\\n  { item: \"mouse\", qty: 50 }\\n])`,\r\n        2: `db.test.find({ qty: { $gte: 20 } })`,\r\n        3: `db.test.updateMany({ item: \"mouse\" }, { $set: { qty: 55 } })`,\r\n        4: `db.test.aggregate([\\n  { $match: { qty: { $gte: 10 } } },\\n  { $group: { _id: \"$item\", totalQty: { $sum: \"$qty\" } } }\\n])`\r\n    };\r\n    document.getElementById('mongo-input').value = ejemplos[num] || mongoDefaultCode;\r\n    document.getElementById('mongo-output').innerHTML = '<span style=\"color:#00bcd4;\">Ejemplo cargado<\/span>';\r\n    setMongoStatus('idle', 'ejemplo');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Objetivos interactivos\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n        const completado = card.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n        card.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n        card.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox').style.background = !completado ? 'var(--neon-concepto)' : '';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Operaciones tabla interactiva\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.tabla-cyberpunk tbody tr').forEach(tr => {\r\n    tr.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n        const tipo = tr.dataset.tipo;\r\n        document.querySelectorAll('.ejemplo-detalle').forEach(det => det.style.display = 'none');\r\n        const detalleId = 'detalle' + tipo.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + tipo.slice(1);\r\n        if (document.getElementById(detalleId)) {\r\n            document.getElementById(detalleId).style.display = 'block';\r\n        }\r\n        document.getElementById('infoOperacion').textContent = `Detalles para ${tipo.toUpperCase()}`;\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Quiz\r\nlet quizCompletadas = 0;\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n        const question = option.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        if (question.dataset.answered) return;\r\n        question.dataset.answered = 'true';\r\n        const value = option.dataset.value;\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n        if (value === correct) {\r\n            option.classList.add('correct');\r\n            feedback.querySelector('.feedback-correct').style.display = 'block';\r\n        } else {\r\n            option.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            feedback.querySelector('.feedback-incorrect').style.display = 'block';\r\n        }\r\n        quizCompletadas++;\r\n        if (quizCompletadas === document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question').length) {\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option.correct').length;\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = correctas;\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = correctas === 3 ? '\u00a1Excelente dominio!' : correctas === 2 ? 'Bien, revisa conceptos' : 'Practica m\u00e1s';\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question').forEach(q => {\r\n        q.dataset.answered = '';\r\n        q.querySelector('.quiz-feedback').style.display = 'none';\r\n        q.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(o => o.classList.remove('correct', 'incorrect'));\r\n    });\r\n    quizCompletadas = 0;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Errores comunes (colapsables)\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.collapsible .error-header').forEach(header => {\r\n    header.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const icon = header.querySelector('.collapse-icon');\r\n        content.style.display = content.style.display === 'none' ? 'block' : 'none';\r\n        icon.textContent = content.style.display === 'block' ? '-' : '+';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction verificarError(num, btn) {\r\n    const input = btn.previousElementSibling.value.toLowerCase();\r\n    const feedback = btn.nextElementSibling;\r\n    let correct = false;\r\n    if (num === 1) correct = input.includes('index') || input.includes('createindex');\r\n    if (num === 2) correct = input.includes('$') || input.includes('operator');\r\n    if (num === 3) correct = input.includes('aggregate') || input.includes('$group');\r\n    feedback.textContent = correct ? 'Correcto!' : 'Intenta de nuevo';\r\n    feedback.style.color = correct ? 'var(--neon-concepto)' : 'var(--neon-alerta)';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Autoevaluaci\u00f3n habilidades\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.skill-slider').forEach(slider => {\r\n    slider.addEventListener('input', () => {\r\n        const fill = slider.previousElementSibling.querySelector('.skill-fill');\r\n        fill.style.width = slider.value + '%';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction guardarHabilidades() {\r\n    const skills = {};\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.skill-slider').forEach(sl => skills[sl.dataset.skill] = sl.value);\r\n    localStorage.setItem('mongoSkills', JSON.stringify(skills));\r\n    alert('Habilidades guardadas');\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarEsqueletoProyecto() {\r\n    document.getElementById('proyectoSolucion').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Insertar documento","respuesta":"db.coll.insertOne({campo: valor})"},{"enunciado":"Buscar todos","respuesta":"db.coll.find()"},{"enunciado":"Buscar con filtro","respuesta":"db.coll.find({campo: valor})"},{"enunciado":"Actualizar","respuesta":"db.coll.updateOne(filtro, {$set: {campo: nuevo}})"},{"enunciado":"Eliminar","respuesta":"db.coll.deleteOne({campo: valor})"},{"enunciado":"Schema-less significa","respuesta":"Sin esquema fijo"},{"enunciado":"Colecci\u00f3n =","respuesta":"Grupo de documentos"},{"enunciado":"BSON es","respuesta":"JSON binario"},{"enunciado":"$gt significa","respuesta":"Mayor que"},{"enunciado":"insertMany para","respuesta":"M\u00faltiples documentos"},{"enunciado":"findOne devuelve","respuesta":"Primer documento"},{"enunciado":"SI: % apps con MongoDB","respuesta":"~70%"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"MongoDB es","opciones":["Documental","Relacional","Grafos","Columnas"],"correcta":"Documental"},{"pregunta":"Almacena en","opciones":["BSON","SQL","CSV","XML"],"correcta":"BSON"},{"pregunta":"Colecci\u00f3n =","opciones":["Tabla","Fila","BD","\u00cdndice"],"correcta":"Tabla"},{"pregunta":"Documento =","opciones":["Fila JSON","Columna","Tabla","BD"],"correcta":"Fila JSON"},{"pregunta":"Schema-less","opciones":["Flexible","R\u00edgido","Binario","Nulo"],"correcta":"Flexible"},{"pregunta":"Escalabilidad","opciones":["Horizontal","Vertical","Ninguna","Cloud"],"correcta":"Horizontal"},{"pregunta":"Sharding divide","opciones":["Datos entre servidores","Una tabla","Nada","RAM"],"correcta":"Datos entre servidores"},{"pregunta":"Replica Set para","opciones":["Alta disponibilidad","Velocidad","Nada","Backup"],"correcta":"Alta disponibilidad"},{"pregunta":"Atlas es","opciones":["MongoDB Cloud","Local","CLI","GUI"],"correcta":"MongoDB Cloud"},{"pregunta":"insertOne devuelve","opciones":["_id insertado","Documento","Nada","Error"],"correcta":"_id insertado"},{"pregunta":"find() sin filtro","opciones":["Todos","Uno","Ninguno","Error"],"correcta":"Todos"},{"pregunta":"findOne()","opciones":["Primer match","Todos","\u00daltimo","Error"],"correcta":"Primer match"},{"pregunta":"updateOne modifica","opciones":["Primer match","Todos","Ninguno","Error"],"correcta":"Primer match"},{"pregunta":"updateMany","opciones":["Todos los match","Uno","Ninguno","Error"],"correcta":"Todos los match"},{"pregunta":"$set en update","opciones":["Asigna valor","Elimina","Busca","Nada"],"correcta":"Asigna valor"},{"pregunta":"$gt","opciones":["Mayor que","Igual","Menor","Existe"],"correcta":"Mayor que"},{"pregunta":"$in","opciones":["En lista","No en lista","Igual","Nulo"],"correcta":"En lista"},{"pregunta":"deleteOne","opciones":["Primer match","Todos","Ninguno","Error"],"correcta":"Primer match"},{"pregunta":"countDocuments","opciones":["Cuenta","Suma","Lista","Nada"],"correcta":"Cuenta"},{"pregunta":"aggregate para","opciones":["An\u00e1lisis complejo","INSERT","DELETE","SELECT"],"correcta":"An\u00e1lisis complejo"},{"pregunta":"MongoDB soporta","opciones":["\u00cdndices","Solo PK","Nada","SQL"],"correcta":"\u00cdndices"},{"pregunta":"Transacciones desde","opciones":["v4.0","v1.0","v6.0","Nunca"],"correcta":"v4.0"},{"pregunta":"Compass es","opciones":["GUI oficial","CLI","Cloud","API"],"correcta":"GUI oficial"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: NoSQL crece","opciones":["+25% anual","0%","-10%","Estable"],"correcta":"+25% anual"},{"pregunta":"MongoDB en","opciones":["Netflix, Google","Solo startups","Nada","SQL"],"correcta":"Netflix, Google"},{"pregunta":"BSON permite","opciones":["Tipos binarios","Solo texto","Nada","XML"],"correcta":"Tipos binarios"},{"pregunta":"ObjectId es","opciones":["12 bytes \u00fanico","Entero","Texto","Fecha"],"correcta":"12 bytes \u00fanico"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: % datos no estructurados","opciones":["+80%","50%","20%","0%"],"correcta":"+80%"},{"pregunta":"NoSQL ideal para","opciones":["Datos variables","Transacciones bancarias","Todo","Nada"],"correcta":"Datos variables"},{"pregunta":"MongoDB vs SQL","opciones":["Flexible > R\u00edgido","Igual","R\u00edgido > Flexible","No compara"],"correcta":"Flexible > R\u00edgido"}]},{"materia":"Programaci\u00f3n","slug":"metodologias-scrum","titulo":"SCRUM + Agile: Roles, Eventos, Simulador y Retos Interactivos 2025","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK PROGRAMACI\u00d3N -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-programacion-metodologias-scrum\" data-tema=\"metodologias-scrum\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- 1\ufe0f\u20e3 INTRODUCCI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n            SCRUM + AGILE\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Metodolog\u00edas \u00c1giles: Roles, Eventos y Simulaci\u00f3n 2025\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Dominar pilares y valores Agile<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Transparencia, inspecci\u00f3n, adaptaci\u00f3n<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Conocer roles SCRUM<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Product Owner, Scrum Master, Development Team<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Entender eventos y artefactos<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Sprint, Daily, Review, Retro<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Simular sprints reales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Planning, ejecuci\u00f3n y retros<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfb5 Spotify<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Squads aut\u00f3nomos<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">+30% velocidad<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcfa Netflix<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Entregas continuas<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Zero downtime<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\ude80 Google<\/h3>\r\n                <p>OKRs + SCRUM<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">78% equipos 2025<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"relacion-curricular\">\r\n            <h3>RELACI\u00d3N CURRICULAR<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"badges\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge\">Competencia: Gesti\u00f3n de Proyectos<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge\">Contenido: Metodolog\u00edas \u00c1giles<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge\">Evaluaci\u00f3n: Simulaci\u00f3n Sprint<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 2\ufe0f\u20e3 DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO ESTRUCTURADO -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> FUNDAMENTOS AGILE + SCRUM\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n       \r\n        <!-- PILARES Y VALORES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Manifiesto Agile y Valores<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83e\udded MANIFIESTO AGILE (2001)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>4 valores fundamentales:<\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"principios-grid\">\r\n                        <div class=\"principio\">\r\n                            <div class=\"principio-icon\">\ud83d\udc65<\/div>\r\n                            <h5>Individuos e interacciones<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>sobre procesos y herramientas<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"principio\">\r\n                            <div class=\"principio-icon\">\u2699\ufe0f<\/div>\r\n                            <h5>Software funcionando<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>sobre documentaci\u00f3n extensiva<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"principio\">\r\n                            <div class=\"principio-icon\">\ud83e\udd1d<\/div>\r\n                            <h5>Colaboraci\u00f3n con el cliente<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>sobre negociaci\u00f3n contractual<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"principio\">\r\n                            <div class=\"principio-icon\">\ud83d\udd04<\/div>\r\n                            <h5>Respuesta al cambio<\/h5>\r\n                            <p>sobre seguir un plan<\/p>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"clasificacion-doble\">\r\n                <div class=\"clas-card pilares\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f 3 Pilares SCRUM<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Transparencia:<\/strong> Visibilidad total<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Inspecci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Revisi\u00f3n frecuente<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Adaptaci\u00f3n:<\/strong> Ajuste inmediato<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"clas-card valores\">\r\n                    <h4>\u2764\ufe0f 5 Valores SCRUM<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Compromiso<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Coraje<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Foco<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Apertura<\/li>\r\n                        <li>Respeto<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <!-- ROLES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Roles SCRUM<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"comparativa-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"comp-card po\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udc51 Product Owner<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"comp-badge\">VOZ DEL CLIENTE<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Responsabilidades:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Maximizar valor del producto<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Gestionar Product Backlog<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Priorizar features<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Aceptar\/rechazar incrementos<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"comp-card sm\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Scrum Master<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"comp-badge\">FACILITADOR<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Responsabilidades:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Facilitar eventos<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Eliminar impedimentos<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Coaching Agile<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Proteger al equipo<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"comp-card dev\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\udc65 Development Team<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"comp-badge\">AUTOORGANIZADO<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Caracter\u00edsticas:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>3-9 personas<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Cross-functional<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Sin jerarqu\u00edas internas<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Compromiso colectivo<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <!-- EVENTOS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>3. Eventos SCRUM<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>EVENTO<\/th>\r\n                            <th>DURACI\u00d3N<\/th>\r\n                            <th>OBJETIVO<\/th>\r\n                            <th>TIMEBOX<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"planning\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">Sprint Planning<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>8h (sprint 1 mes)<\/td>\r\n                            <td>\u00bfQu\u00e9 y c\u00f3mo hacer?<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Proporcional<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"daily\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">Daily Scrum<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>15 min<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Sincronizaci\u00f3n diaria<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Fijo<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"review\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">Sprint Review<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>4h<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Demo y feedback<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Proporcional<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"retro\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">Sprint Retrospective<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>3h<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Mejorar proceso<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Proporcional<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <!-- ARTEFACTOS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>4. Artefactos SCRUM<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"advanced-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"adv-card\" data-adv=\"backlog\">\r\n                    <div class=\"adv-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"adv-badge\">Backlog<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Product Backlog<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"adv-content\">\r\n                        <p>Lista ordenada de todo lo conocido<\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>User stories<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Refinement continuo<\/li>\r\n                            <li>DEEP: Detailed, Emergent, Estimated, Prioritized<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"adv-card\" data-adv=\"sprint\">\r\n                    <div class=\"adv-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"adv-badge\">Sprint<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Sprint Backlog<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"adv-content\">\r\n                        <p>Plan para el sprint actual<\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Tareas descompuestas<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Propiedad del equipo<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Forecast de entrega<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"adv-card\" data-adv=\"increment\">\r\n                    <div class=\"adv-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"adv-badge\">Increment<\/div>\r\n                        <h4>Increment<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"adv-content\">\r\n                        <p>Producto potencialmente entregable<\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>\"Done\" seg\u00fan DoD<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Sumatorio de sprints<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Inspeccionable<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 3\ufe0f\u20e3 VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA INTERACTIVA -->\r\n    <section class=\"visualizacion-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span> VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA INTERACTIVA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"diagrama-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"diagrama-visual\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1000 600\" id=\"svgDiagrama\" class=\"er-diagram-interactive\">\r\n                    <defs>\r\n                        <marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                            <path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#39FF14\"\/>\r\n                        <\/marker>\r\n                    <\/defs>\r\n                    <rect width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- Sprint Container -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"100\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(0,188,212,0.3)\" stroke=\"#00ff00\" stroke-width=\"4\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"500\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#00ff00\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 10px #00ff00\">SPRINT (1-4 semanas)<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- Events -->\r\n                    <g transform=\"translate(200,180)\">\r\n                        <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"60\" fill=\"rgba(255,0,255,0.5)\" stroke=\"#ff00ff\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"-10\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\">Planning<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"10\" fill=\"#bbdefb\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">8h m\u00e1x<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    \r\n                    <g transform=\"translate(500,150)\">\r\n                        <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"50\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,0,0.5)\" stroke=\"#ffff00\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"-5\" fill=\"black\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\">Daily Scrum<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"15\" fill=\"#bbdefb\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">15 min<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    \r\n                    <g transform=\"translate(800,180)\">\r\n                        <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"60\" fill=\"rgba(255,107,107,0.5)\" stroke=\"#ff6b6b\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"-10\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\">Review<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"10\" fill=\"#bbdefb\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">4h m\u00e1x<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    \r\n                    <g transform=\"translate(500,350)\">\r\n                        <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"70\" fill=\"rgba(0,150,136,0.5)\" stroke=\"#00ff9d\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"-10\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\">Retrospective<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"10\" fill=\"#bbdefb\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">3h m\u00e1x<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    \r\n                    <g transform=\"translate(500,480)\">\r\n                        <rect x=\"-100\" y=\"-30\" width=\"200\" height=\"60\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(57,255,20,0.5)\" stroke=\"#39ff14\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"0\" fill=\"black\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\">INCREMENT<\/text>\r\n                        <text x=\"0\" y=\"20\" fill=\"#bbdefb\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">Potentially Shippable<\/text>\r\n                    <\/g>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- Arrows -->\r\n                    <path d=\"M260,180 Q350,150 440,150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffff00\" stroke-width=\"4\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"\/>\r\n                    <path d=\"M560,150 Q650,150 740,180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffff00\" stroke-width=\"4\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"\/>\r\n                    <path d=\"M800,240 Q650,300 560,350\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffff00\" stroke-width=\"4\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"\/>\r\n                    <path d=\"M500,280 Q500,320 500,450\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffff00\" stroke-width=\"4\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"\/>\r\n                    \r\n                    <text x=\"500\" y=\"550\" fill=\"#00ff88\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 10px #00ff88\">Ciclo Iterativo e Incremental<\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"diagrama-info\">\r\n                Ciclo completo SCRUM - Visibilidad mejorada para temas oscuros\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 4\ufe0f\u20e3 BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS REALES -->\r\n    <section class=\"interactivos-section\">\r\n        <style>\r\n            .scrum-topbar { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:space-between; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:18px; }\r\n            .scrum-actions { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; }\r\n            .scrum-hint { font-size:13px; color:var(--color-text-secondary); max-width:560px; margin-top:8px; }\r\n            .scrum-board { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0,1fr)); gap:14px; padding:16px; background:rgba(0,0,0,.15); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius:18px; }\r\n            .scrum-column { min-height:320px; background:rgba(10,22,34,.85); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius:16px; padding:14px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px; }\r\n            .scrum-column h4 { margin-bottom:10px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:.04em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--color-text-info); }\r\n            .scrum-item { background:rgba(255,255,255,.06); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); border-radius:12px; padding:12px 14px; cursor:grab; transition:transform .15s,box-shadow .15s,background .15s; color:var(--color-text-primary); }\r\n            .scrum-item:active { transform:scale(.98); }\r\n            .scrum-item strong { display:block; margin-bottom:6px; font-size:13px; }\r\n            .scrum-item small { display:block; color:var(--color-text-secondary); font-size:12px; line-height:1.4; }\r\n            .scrum-column.drag-target { box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(0,255,136,.28); }\r\n            .sprint-summary { margin-top:18px; display:grid; gap:16px; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr)); }\r\n            .stat-card { background:rgba(255,255,255,.05); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius:14px; padding:12px 14px; }\r\n            .stat-card .label { display:block; font-size:12px; color:var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom:6px; }\r\n            .stat-card .value { font-size:18px; font-weight:700; color:var(--color-text-primary); }\r\n            .capacity-bar { width:100%; background:rgba(255,255,255,.07); border-radius:999px; height:10px; margin-top:12px; overflow:hidden; }\r\n            .capacity-fill { width:0; height:100%; background:linear-gradient(90deg,#39ff14,#00bcd4); transition:width .3s ease, background .3s ease; }\r\n            #sprint-result { min-height:54px; margin-top:18px; padding:14px 16px; border-radius:14px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.03); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); color:var(--color-text-primary); font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; }\r\n            #sprint-result.success { border-color:#39ff14; color:#d4ffb8; }\r\n            #sprint-result.warning { border-color:#ffb74d; color:#ffe1a0; }\r\n            #sprint-result.danger { border-color:#ff6b6b; color:#ffb8b8; }\r\n            .consejos-scrum { margin-top:16px; display:grid; gap:10px; }\r\n            .consejo-item { display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start; }\r\n            .consejo-icon { width:28px; height:28px; border-radius:10px; background:rgba(57,255,20,.12); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#ccff8c; font-size:14px; }\r\n            @media (max-width: 900px) { .scrum-board { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .sprint-summary { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\r\n        <\/style>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR DE SPRINT INTERACTIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"scrum\">\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <div class=\"scrum-topbar\">\r\n                    <div>\r\n                        <h3>\ud83c\udfae CONTROLES SPRINT<\/h3>\r\n                        <p class=\"scrum-hint\">Arrastra historias desde el backlog al sprint, progreso o hecho. El equipo tiene <strong>30 puntos<\/strong> de capacidad para este sprint.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"scrum-actions\">\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-ejemplo\" onclick=\"autoFillSprint()\">Auto-plan Sprint<\/button>\r\n                        <button class=\"btn-ejemplo\" onclick=\"resetSprint()\">Reiniciar Sprint<\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <div class=\"scrum-board\">\r\n                    <div class=\"scrum-column\" id=\"backlog\">\r\n                        <h4>Product Backlog<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"scrum-item\" draggable=\"true\" data-id=\"1\" data-points=\"5\">\r\n                            <strong>US001:<\/strong> Login usuario\r\n                            <small>5 pts \u2022 Autenticaci\u00f3n segura<\/small>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"scrum-item\" draggable=\"true\" data-id=\"2\" data-points=\"8\">\r\n                            <strong>US002:<\/strong> Dashboard principal\r\n                            <small>8 pts \u2022 Vista de m\u00e9tricas clave<\/small>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"scrum-item\" draggable=\"true\" data-id=\"3\" data-points=\"5\">\r\n                            <strong>US003:<\/strong> Notificaciones push\r\n                            <small>5 pts \u2022 Alertas en tiempo real<\/small>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"scrum-item\" draggable=\"true\" data-id=\"4\" data-points=\"3\">\r\n                            <strong>US004:<\/strong> Perfil editable\r\n                            <small>3 pts \u2022 Actualizar datos personales<\/small>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"scrum-item\" draggable=\"true\" data-id=\"5\" data-points=\"3\">\r\n                            <strong>US005:<\/strong> Exportar datos\r\n                            <small>3 pts \u2022 Reporte en PDF<\/small>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"scrum-column\" id=\"sprint\">\r\n                        <h4>Sprint Backlog<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"scrum-column\" id=\"progress\">\r\n                        <h4>En Progreso<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"scrum-column\" id=\"done\">\r\n                        <h4>Hecho (DoD)<\/h4>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"sprint-summary\">\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-card\">\r\n                        <span class=\"label\">Capacidad total<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"value\">30 pts<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-card\">\r\n                        <span class=\"label\">Puntos comprometidos<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"value\" id=\"committed\">0<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"capacity-bar\"><div id=\"capacityBar\" class=\"capacity-fill\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"stat-card\">\r\n                        <span class=\"label\">Puntos completados<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"value\" id=\"completed\">0<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div id=\"sprint-result\" class=\"resultado-content\">Arrastra historias para comenzar el sprint.<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd0d ESTADO DEL SPRINT<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Capacidad equipo:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\">30 puntos<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Puntos comprometidos:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"committed-detail\">0<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Puntos completados:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"completed-detail\">0<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"consejos-scrum\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udca1 CONSEJOS SCRUM<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"consejo-item\">\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-text\">No excedas capacidad<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"consejo-item\">\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-icon\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-text\">Definition of Done clara<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"consejo-item\">\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-text\">Daily para sincronizar<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 5\ufe0f\u20e3 QUIZ AUTOEVALUADO CON FEEDBACK -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ SCRUM MASTER\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 1 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQui\u00e9n prioriza el Product Backlog?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">A) Scrum Master<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">B) Product Owner<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">C) Development Team<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">D) Stakeholders<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\u2705 Correcto: PO maximiza valor<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\u274c Incorrecto<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">El Product Owner es el \u00fanico responsable de la priorizaci\u00f3n.<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfCu\u00e1l es la duraci\u00f3n m\u00e1xima del Daily Scrum?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">A) 30 min<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">B) 1 hora<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">C) 15 min<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">D) Sin l\u00edmite<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\u2705 Correcto: Timebox fijo<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\u274c Incorrecto<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">15 minutos para sincronizaci\u00f3n r\u00e1pida.<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <!-- PREGUNTA 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 artefacto es \"potentially shippable\"?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">A) Increment<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">B) Sprint Backlog<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">C) Product Backlog<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">D) Burndown Chart<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\u2705 Correcto: Cumple DoD<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\u274c Incorrecto<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">El Increment es el resultado usable del sprint.<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 6\ufe0f\u20e3 SECCI\u00d3N \"ERRORES COMUNES\" INTERACTIVA -->\r\n    <section class=\"errores-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-alerta\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u26a0\ufe0f<\/span> ERRORES COMUNES EN SCRUM\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"errores-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"error-card collapsible\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Error 1: Scrum Master como jefe<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"collapse-icon\">+<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <pre><code>\/\/ \u274c Mal\r\nSM asigna tareas al equipo<\/code><\/pre>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>El equipo es autoorganizado. SM facilita, no manda.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card collapsible\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Error 2: Sprint sin Definition of Done<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"collapse-icon\">+<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <pre><code>\/\/ \u274c Mal\r\nTareas \"hechas\" sin testing<\/code><\/pre>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>Todo increment debe ser potencialmente entregable.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"error-card collapsible\">\r\n                <div class=\"error-header\">\r\n                    <h3>Error 3: Planning sin estimaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"collapse-icon\">+<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"error-content\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"error-ejemplo\">\r\n                        <pre><code>\/\/ \u274c Mal\r\nSeleccionar historias \"a ojo\"<\/code><\/pre>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"error-explicacion\">\r\n                        <p>Usa Planning Poker y puntos de historia.<\/p>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 7\ufe0f\u20e3 PROBLEMAS TIPO EXAMEN -->\r\n    <section class=\"problemas-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcdd<\/span> RETOS PR\u00c1CTICOS\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"problemas-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <h3>Reto 1: Planning Poker<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Estima estas historias con Fibonacci:<\/p>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>Login b\u00e1sico<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Dashboard con gr\u00e1ficos<\/li>\r\n                    <li>Exportar PDF<\/li>\r\n                <\/ul>\r\n                <textarea class=\"respuesta-area\" placeholder=\"Justifica tus puntos...\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"problema-card\">\r\n                <h3>Reto 2: Retrospective<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Escribe una retro para sprint fallido (50% completado)<\/p>\r\n                <textarea class=\"respuesta-area\" placeholder=\"Start\/Stop\/Continue...\"><\/textarea>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 8\ufe0f\u20e3 CIERRE METACOGNITIVO INTERACTIVO -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"skill-meter\">\r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>Roles SCRUM:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\"><div class=\"skill-fill\" style=\"width:0%\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>Eventos:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\"><div class=\"skill-fill\" style=\"width:0%\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>Simulaci\u00f3n:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\"><div class=\"skill-fill\" style=\"width:0%\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarHabilidades()\">\ud83d\udcbe Guardar<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS 2025<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/scrumguides.org\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">Scrum Guide Oficial<\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.atlassian.com\/agile\/scrum\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">Atlassian Scrum<\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.scrum.org\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">Scrum.org<\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ JS COMPLETO PARA LA LECCI\u00d3N SCRUM + AGILE\r\nconsole.log('Inicializando lecci\u00f3n Programaci\u00f3n - Metodolog\u00edas \u00c1giles SCRUM 2025');\r\n\r\nconst columns = ['backlog', 'sprint', 'progress', 'done'];\r\nconst SPRINT_CAPACITY = 30;\r\nlet originalTaskOrder = [];\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializar drag & drop\r\nfunction initDragAndDrop() {\r\n    columns.forEach(colId => {\r\n        const col = document.getElementById(colId);\r\n        if (!col) return;\r\n\r\n        col.addEventListener('dragover', e => e.preventDefault());\r\n        col.addEventListener('dragenter', e => {\r\n            e.preventDefault();\r\n            col.classList.add('drag-target');\r\n        });\r\n        col.addEventListener('dragleave', () => {\r\n            col.classList.remove('drag-target');\r\n        });\r\n        col.addEventListener('drop', e => {\r\n            e.preventDefault();\r\n            col.classList.remove('drag-target');\r\n            const id = e.dataTransfer.getData('text\/plain');\r\n            const item = document.querySelector(`[data-id=\"${id}\"]`);\r\n            if (item && col !== item.parentElement) {\r\n                col.appendChild(item);\r\n                updateSprintStats();\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.scrum-item').forEach(item => {\r\n        item.addEventListener('dragstart', e => {\r\n            e.dataTransfer.setData('text\/plain', item.dataset.id);\r\n        });\r\n        item.addEventListener('dragend', () => {\r\n            columns.forEach(colId => {\r\n                const col = document.getElementById(colId);\r\n                if (col) col.classList.remove('drag-target');\r\n            });\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction setSprintMessage(message, status = 'info') {\r\n    const result = document.getElementById('sprint-result');\r\n    result.className = `resultado-content ${status}`;\r\n    result.textContent = message;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Actualizar estad\u00edsticas del sprint (puntos)\r\nfunction updateSprintStats() {\r\n    const sprintItems = document.getElementById('sprint').querySelectorAll('.scrum-item');\r\n    const doneItems = document.getElementById('done').querySelectorAll('.scrum-item');\r\n    let committed = 0;\r\n    let completed = 0;\r\n\r\n    sprintItems.forEach(item => {\r\n        const points = parseInt(item.dataset.points || item.textContent.match(\/\\((\\d+) pts\\)\/)?.[1] || 0, 10);\r\n        committed += points;\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    doneItems.forEach(item => {\r\n        const points = parseInt(item.dataset.points || item.textContent.match(\/\\((\\d+) pts\\)\/)?.[1] || 0, 10);\r\n        completed += points;\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    const capacityBar = document.getElementById('capacityBar');\r\n    const fillWidth = Math.min(100, (committed \/ SPRINT_CAPACITY) * 100);\r\n    capacityBar.style.width = `${fillWidth}%`;\r\n    capacityBar.style.background = committed > SPRINT_CAPACITY\r\n        ? 'linear-gradient(90deg,#ff6b6b,#ff8f8f)'\r\n        : 'linear-gradient(90deg,#39ff14,#00bcd4)';\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById('committed').textContent = committed;\r\n    document.getElementById('committed-detail').textContent = committed;\r\n    document.getElementById('completed').textContent = completed;\r\n    document.getElementById('completed-detail').textContent = completed;\r\n\r\n    const totalItems = document.querySelectorAll('.scrum-item').length;\r\n    const doneCount = doneItems.length;\r\n\r\n    if (committed > SPRINT_CAPACITY) {\r\n        setSprintMessage('Capacidad excedida: devuelve tareas al backlog o reduce el sprint.', 'danger');\r\n    } else if (doneCount === totalItems && totalItems > 0) {\r\n        setSprintMessage('\u00a1Sprint completado! Increment listo para revisi\u00f3n.', 'success');\r\n    } else {\r\n        setSprintMessage(`${doneCount}\/${totalItems} tareas finalizadas \u2022 ${committed} pts comprometidos`, 'info');\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Reiniciar sprint\r\nfunction resetSprint() {\r\n    const backlog = document.getElementById('backlog');\r\n    originalTaskOrder.forEach(id => {\r\n        const item = document.querySelector(`[data-id=\"${id}\"]`);\r\n        if (item) backlog.appendChild(item);\r\n    });\r\n    updateSprintStats();\r\n    setSprintMessage('Sprint reiniciado. Arrastra historias para empezar.', 'info');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Auto-plan ejemplo v\u00e1lido\r\nfunction autoFillSprint() {\r\n    resetSprint();\r\n    const sprint = document.getElementById('sprint');\r\n    const selectedIds = ['2', '1', '3', '4', '5'];\r\n    selectedIds.forEach(id => {\r\n        const item = document.querySelector(`[data-id=\"${id}\"]`);\r\n        if (item) sprint.appendChild(item);\r\n    });\r\n    updateSprintStats();\r\n    setSprintMessage('Sprint planificado con historias equilibradas seg\u00fan capacidad.', 'success');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Objetivos interactivos (checkbox)\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n        const completado = card.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n        card.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n        card.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox').style.background = !completado ? 'var(--neon-concepto)' : 'transparent';\r\n        console.log('Objetivo toggled:', card.querySelector('h3').textContent);\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Quiz autoevaluado\r\nlet quizCompletadas = 0;\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n        const question = option.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        if (question.dataset.answered) return;\r\n        question.dataset.answered = 'true';\r\n\r\n        const value = option.dataset.value;\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n        if (value === correct) {\r\n            option.classList.add('correct');\r\n            feedback.querySelector('.feedback-correct').style.display = 'block';\r\n        } else {\r\n            option.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            feedback.querySelector('.feedback-incorrect').style.display = 'block';\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        quizCompletadas++;\r\n        if (quizCompletadas === document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question').length) {\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option.correct').length;\r\n    const total = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question').length;\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${total}`;\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = correctas === total ? '\u00a1Excelente dominio de SCRUM!' :\r\n        correctas >= total * 0.66 ? 'Muy bien, conceptos s\u00f3lidos' : 'Repasa los pilares y roles';\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question').forEach(q => {\r\n        q.dataset.answered = '';\r\n        q.querySelector('.quiz-feedback').style.display = 'none';\r\n        q.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(o => o.classList.remove('correct', 'incorrect'));\r\n    });\r\n    quizCompletadas = 0;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Errores comunes (colapsables)\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.collapsible .error-header').forEach(header => {\r\n    header.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const icon = header.querySelector('.collapse-icon');\r\n        content.style.display = content.style.display === 'none' ? 'block' : 'none';\r\n        icon.textContent = content.style.display === 'block' ? '-' : '+';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Verificaci\u00f3n errores pr\u00e1cticos (simple)\r\nfunction verificarError(num, btn) {\r\n    const input = btn.previousElementSibling.value.toLowerCase();\r\n    const feedback = btn.nextElementSibling;\r\n    let correct = false;\r\n\r\n    if (num === 1) correct = input.includes('auto') || input.includes('self');\r\n    if (num === 2) correct = input.includes('done') || input.includes('dod');\r\n    if (num === 3) correct = input.includes('poker') || input.includes('estim');\r\n\r\n    feedback.textContent = correct ? '\u2705 \u00a1Correcto!' : '\u274c Intenta de nuevo';\r\n    feedback.style.color = correct ? 'var(--neon-concepto)' : 'var(--neon-alerta)';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Autoevaluaci\u00f3n habilidades\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.skill-slider').forEach(slider => {\r\n    slider.addEventListener('input', () => {\r\n        const fill = slider.previousElementSibling.querySelector('.skill-fill');\r\n        fill.style.width = slider.value + '%';\r\n        fill.dataset.level = slider.value;\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction guardarHabilidades() {\r\n    const skills = {};\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.skill-slider').forEach(sl => {\r\n        skills[sl.dataset.skill] = sl.value;\r\n    });\r\n    localStorage.setItem('scrumSkills2025', JSON.stringify(skills));\r\n    alert('Habilidades SCRUM guardadas');\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Proyecto final (mostrar soluci\u00f3n)\r\nfunction mostrarEsqueletoProyecto() {\r\n    document.getElementById('proyectoSolucion').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializaci\u00f3n al cargar\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\r\n    originalTaskOrder = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.scrum-item')).map(item => item.dataset.id);\r\n    initDragAndDrop();\r\n    updateSprintStats();\r\n    console.log('Lecci\u00f3n SCRUM cargada y lista');\r\n});\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Rol del Product Owner","respuesta":"Maximizar valor del producto"},{"enunciado":"Scrum Master elimina","respuesta":"Impedimentos"},{"enunciado":"Duraci\u00f3n t\u00edpica sprint","respuesta":"2 semanas"},{"enunciado":"Daily Scrum responde","respuesta":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 hice? \u00bfQu\u00e9 har\u00e9? \u00bfBloqueos?"},{"enunciado":"Sprint Review muestra","respuesta":"Incremento"},{"enunciado":"Retrospective busca","respuesta":"Mejorar proceso"},{"enunciado":"Product Backlog es","respuesta":"Lista priorizada"},{"enunciado":"Definition of Done","respuesta":"Criterios de aceptaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"Velocity mide","respuesta":"Puntos completados\/sprint"},{"enunciado":"Burndown chart muestra","respuesta":"Trabajo restante"},{"enunciado":"SI: % empresas con SCRUM","respuesta":"78%"},{"enunciado":"Herramienta popular","respuesta":"Jira, Trello"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"SCRUM es un","opciones":["Framework","Metodolog\u00eda","Herramienta","Lenguaje"],"correcta":"Framework"},{"pregunta":"Pilares SCRUM","opciones":["3","5","1","7"],"correcta":"3"},{"pregunta":"Product Owner define","opciones":["Prioridades","C\u00f3digo","Dise\u00f1o","Pruebas"],"correcta":"Prioridades"},{"pregunta":"Scrum Master es","opciones":["Facilitador","Jefe","Tester","Dise\u00f1ador"],"correcta":"Facilitador"},{"pregunta":"Equipo dev es","opciones":["Autoorganizado","Jer\u00e1rquico","Externo","Temporal"],"correcta":"Autoorganizado"},{"pregunta":"Sprint dura","opciones":["1-4 semanas","1 d\u00eda","1 mes","Ilimitado"],"correcta":"1-4 semanas"},{"pregunta":"Planning m\u00e1ximo","opciones":["8h","4h","15 min","1 d\u00eda"],"correcta":"8h"},{"pregunta":"Daily dura","opciones":["15 min","1h","30 min","2h"],"correcta":"15 min"},{"pregunta":"Review m\u00e1ximo","opciones":["4h","8h","2h","1 d\u00eda"],"correcta":"4h"},{"pregunta":"Retro m\u00e1ximo","opciones":["3h","4h","8h","1 d\u00eda"],"correcta":"3h"},{"pregunta":"Increment debe ser","opciones":["Potentially shippable","En pruebas","Parcial","Dise\u00f1o"],"correcta":"Potentially shippable"},{"pregunta":"Backlog es","opciones":["Din\u00e1mico","Est\u00e1tico","Secreto","Temporal"],"correcta":"Din\u00e1mico"},{"pregunta":"User Story formato","opciones":["Como X, quiero Y, para Z","Tarea t\u00e9cnica","Bug","C\u00f3digo"],"correcta":"Como X, quiero Y, para Z"},{"pregunta":"Puntos de historia","opciones":["Fibonacci","Decimal","Binario","Letras"],"correcta":"Fibonacci"},{"pregunta":"Velocity es","opciones":["Promedio puntos\/sprint","Tiempo","Errores","C\u00f3digo"],"correcta":"Promedio puntos\/sprint"},{"pregunta":"Burndown ideal","opciones":["Lineal descendente","Ascendente","Plano","Ca\u00f3tico"],"correcta":"Lineal descendente"},{"pregunta":"Definition of Done","opciones":["Criterios compartidos","Individual","Secreto","Opcional"],"correcta":"Criterios compartidos"},{"pregunta":"Refinement es","opciones":["Aclarar backlog","Codificar","Testear","Deploy"],"correcta":"Aclarar backlog"},{"pregunta":"Scrum of Scrums para","opciones":["Equipos m\u00faltiples","Un equipo","PO","Stakeholders"],"correcta":"Equipos m\u00faltiples"},{"pregunta":"SAFe incluye","opciones":["SCRUM a escala","Solo un equipo","Nada","Waterfall"],"correcta":"SCRUM a escala"},{"pregunta":"Jira es","opciones":["Herramienta SCRUM","Lenguaje","BD","IDE"],"correcta":"Herramienta SCRUM"},{"pregunta":"Trello usa","opciones":["Tableros Kanban","Gantt","C\u00f3digo","SQL"],"correcta":"Tableros Kanban"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: SCRUM crece","opciones":["+15% anual","0%","-10%","Obsoleto"],"correcta":"+15% anual"},{"pregunta":"Empresas con SCRUM","opciones":["Netflix, Spotify","Solo startups","Gobierno","Ninguna"],"correcta":"Netflix, Spotify"},{"pregunta":"H\u00edbrido SCRUM + Kanban","opciones":["Scrumban","Waterfall","XP","Lean"],"correcta":"Scrumban"},{"pregunta":"Certificaci\u00f3n popular","opciones":["PSM I","PMP","ITIL","COBIT"],"correcta":"PSM I"},{"pregunta":"Scrum Guide 2020","opciones":["Oficial","Antiguo","Falso","Opcional"],"correcta":"Oficial"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: % remotos con SCRUM","opciones":["+90%","50%","20%","0%"],"correcta":"+90%"},{"pregunta":"SCRUM ideal para","opciones":["Requisitos cambiantes","Fijos","Hardware","Infra"],"correcta":"Requisitos cambiantes"},{"pregunta":"Agile Manifesto prioriza","opciones":["Individuos > Procesos","Procesos > Personas","Documentos","Contrato"],"correcta":"Individuos > Procesos"}]},{"materia":"Programaci\u00f3n","slug":"desarrollo-aplicaciones-web","titulo":"Aplicaciones Web Full-Stack: Frontend, Backend, BD, Simulador y Retos 2025","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK PROGRAMACI\u00d3N -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-programacion-desarrollo-aplicaciones-web\" data-tema=\"desarrollo-aplicaciones-web\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- 1\ufe0f\u20e3 INTRODUCCI\u00d3N CONCEPTUAL CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\ud83c\udf10<\/span>\r\n            FULL-STACK WEB\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Desarrollo Completo: Frontend + Backend + Base de Datos 2025\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Comprender arquitectura full-stack<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Cliente, servidor, base de datos y DevOps<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Dominar capas del stack<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Frontend (UI\/UX), Backend (APIs), BD (persistencia)<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Implementar CRUD completo<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Crear, leer, actualizar y eliminar datos<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Conocer stacks modernos 2025<\/h3>\r\n                <p>MERN, LAMP, JAMstack, .NET<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> APLICACI\u00d3N EN EL MUNDO REAL\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\uded2 E-commerce<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Amazon, Shopify<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">MERN + Microservicios<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcf1 Apps Sociales<\/h3>\r\n                <p>TikTok, Instagram<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">React + Node + Mongo<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfe6 Fintech<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Revolut, Nubank<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">.NET + SQL + Docker<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"relacion-curricular\">\r\n            <h3>RELACI\u00d3N CURRICULAR<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"badges\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge\">Competencia: Desarrollo Web<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge\">Contenido: Full-Stack<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"badge\">Evaluaci\u00f3n: Proyecto App<\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 2\ufe0f\u20e3 DESARROLLO TE\u00d3RICO ESTRUCTURADO -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> ARQUITECTURA FULL-STACK 2025\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n       \r\n        <!-- CAPAS -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Las 4 Capas del Full-Stack<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"comparativa-grid\">\r\n                <div class=\"comp-card frontend\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83c\udfa8 Frontend<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"comp-badge\">Cliente<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Tecnolog\u00edas 2025:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>React, Vue, Svelte<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Tailwind, CSS-in-JS<\/li>\r\n                            <li>TypeScript<\/li>\r\n                            <li>PWA, SSR<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"comp-card backend\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\u2699\ufe0f Backend<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"comp-badge\">Servidor<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Tecnolog\u00edas 2025:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>Node.js, PHP, Python<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Express, Laravel, FastAPI<\/li>\r\n                            <li>REST + GraphQL<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Auth JWT\/OAuth<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"comp-card db\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\uddc4\ufe0f Base de Datos<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"comp-badge\">Persistencia<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Opciones 2025:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>PostgreSQL, MySQL<\/li>\r\n                            <li>MongoDB, Firebase<\/li>\r\n                            <li>SQLite (local)<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Redis (cache)<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n               \r\n                <div class=\"comp-card devops\">\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-header\">\r\n                        <h4>\ud83d\ude80 DevOps<\/h4>\r\n                        <div class=\"comp-badge\">Deploy<\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"comp-caracteristicas\">\r\n                        <p><strong>Herramientas 2025:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li>GitHub Actions<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Docker, Kubernetes<\/li>\r\n                            <li>Vercel, Render, AWS<\/li>\r\n                            <li>CI\/CD autom\u00e1tico<\/li>\r\n                        <\/ul>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <!-- STACKS POPULARES -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Stacks Populares 2025<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>STACK<\/th>\r\n                            <th>COMPONENTES<\/th>\r\n                            <th>USO PRINCIPAL<\/th>\r\n                            <th>MERCADO 2025<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"mern\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">MERN<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>MongoDB, Express, React, Node.js<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Apps SPA modernas<\/td>\r\n                            <td>35%<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"lamp\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">LAMP<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>Linux, Apache, MySQL, PHP<\/td>\r\n                            <td>CMS, e-commerce<\/td>\r\n                            <td>25%<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"jam\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">JAMstack<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>JS, APIs, Markup<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Sitios est\u00e1ticos r\u00e1pidos<\/td>\r\n                            <td>20%<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"net\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">.NET<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>C#, ASP.NET, SQL Server<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Enterprise<\/td>\r\n                            <td>15%<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/tbody>\r\n                <\/table>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 3\ufe0f\u20e3 VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA INTERACTIVA -->\r\n    <section class=\"visualizacion-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span> VISUALIZACI\u00d3N DID\u00c1CTICA INTERACTIVA\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"diagrama-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"diagrama-visual\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1000 600\" class=\"er-diagram-interactive\">\r\n                    <defs>\r\n                        <marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\r\n                            <path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#39FF14\"\/>\r\n                        <\/marker>\r\n                    <\/defs>\r\n                    <rect width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- Cliente -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"200\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(255,0,255,0.4)\" stroke=\"#ff00ff\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"200\" y=\"260\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 8px #ff00ff\">Frontend<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"200\" y=\"290\" fill=\"#e0f0ff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\">React \/ Vue<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- Backend -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"400\" y=\"150\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,0,0.4)\" stroke=\"#ffff00\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"500\" y=\"230\" fill=\"black\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 8px #ffff00\">Backend<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"500\" y=\"260\" fill=\"#e0f0ff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\">Node \/ PHP \/ Python<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"500\" y=\"290\" fill=\"#e0f0ff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">API REST<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- BD -->\r\n                    <rect x=\"700\" y=\"200\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(0,255,157,0.4)\" stroke=\"#00ff9d\" stroke-width=\"3\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"800\" y=\"260\" fill=\"black\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 8px #00ff9d\">Base de Datos<\/text>\r\n                    <text x=\"800\" y=\"290\" fill=\"#e0f0ff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\">Mongo \/ PostgreSQL<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <!-- Flechas -->\r\n                    <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"275\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#ffff00\" stroke-width=\"6\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"350\" y=\"240\" fill=\"#ffff00\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\">HTTP Request<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <line x1=\"600\" y1=\"275\" x2=\"700\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#ffff00\" stroke-width=\"6\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"\/>\r\n                    <text x=\"650\" y=\"240\" fill=\"#ffff00\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\">SQL \/ NoSQL Query<\/text>\r\n                    \r\n                    <line x1=\"700\" y1=\"325\" x2=\"600\" y2=\"350\" stroke=\"#00ff9d\" stroke-width=\"4\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"\/>\r\n                    <line x1=\"400\" y1=\"325\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#ff00ff\" stroke-width=\"4\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"\/>\r\n                    \r\n                    <text x=\"500\" y=\"520\" fill=\"#39ff14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 10px #39ff14\">Full-Stack 2025: 65% desarrolladores<\/text>\r\n                <\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"diagrama-info\">\r\n                Flujo completo de una aplicaci\u00f3n web moderna\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 4\ufe0f\u20e3 BLOQUES INTERACTIVOS REALES -->\r\n    <section class=\"interactivos-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-interactivo\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfae<\/span> SIMULADOR FULL-STACK INTERACTIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"simulator-container\" data-tema=\"fullstack\">\r\n            <div class=\"simulator-controls\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfae GESTI\u00d3N DE PRODUCTOS<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"controles-form\">\r\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"producto-nombre\" placeholder=\"Nombre del producto\" class=\"control-input\">\r\n                    <input type=\"number\" id=\"producto-precio\" placeholder=\"Precio (\u20ac)\" min=\"0\" step=\"0.01\" class=\"control-input\">\r\n                    <button class=\"btn-ejecutar\" onclick=\"agregarProducto()\">\u2795 Agregar<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"btn-limpiar\" onclick=\"limpiarProductos()\">\ud83d\uddd1 Limpiar todo<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"simulator-visualization\">\r\n                <div class=\"productos-lista\" id=\"productos-lista\">\r\n                    <p class=\"placeholder\">No hay productos. Agrega uno arriba \u2191<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div id=\"web-output\" class=\"resultado-content\"><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"simulator-data\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd0d ESTADO DE LA APP<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Productos registrados:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"totalProductos\">0<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"data-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"data-label\">Valor total inventario:<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"data-value\" id=\"valorTotal\">0 \u20ac<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"consejos-fullstack\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udca1 CONSEJOS FULL-STACK<\/h4>\r\n                    <div class=\"consejo-item\">\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-text\">Valida datos en frontend y backend<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"consejo-item\">\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-icon\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-text\">Usa RESTful APIs<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"consejo-item\">\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-icon\">\ud83d\udcca<\/span>\r\n                        <span class=\"consejo-text\">Normaliza la BD<\/span>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 5\ufe0f\u20e3 QUIZ AUTOEVALUADO CON FEEDBACK -->\r\n    <section class=\"quiz-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-evaluacion\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\u2753<\/span> QUIZ FULL-STACK\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"B\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">01<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 capa maneja la l\u00f3gica del negocio?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">A) Frontend<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">B) Backend<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">C) Base de Datos<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">D) DevOps<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\u2705 Correcto: APIs y reglas<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\u274c Incorrecto<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">El backend procesa l\u00f3gica, autenticaci\u00f3n y validaciones.<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"C\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">02<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfQu\u00e9 stack usa React + Node + Mongo?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">A) LAMP<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">B) JAMstack<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">C) MERN<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">D) .NET<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\u2705 Correcto: MERN stack<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\u274c Incorrecto<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">MongoDB, Express, React, Node.js<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n           \r\n            <div class=\"quiz-question\" data-correct=\"A\">\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-header\">\r\n                    <span class=\"quiz-num\">03<\/span>\r\n                    <h3>\u00bfD\u00f3nde se valida entrada de usuario?<\/h3>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-options\">\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"A\">A) Frontend y Backend<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"B\">B) Solo Frontend<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"C\">C) Solo Backend<\/button>\r\n                    <button class=\"quiz-option\" data-value=\"D\">D) Base de Datos<\/button>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quiz-feedback\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-correct\">\u2705 Correcto: Doble validaci\u00f3n<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-incorrect\">\u274c Incorrecto<\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"feedback-explicacion\">UX en frontend, seguridad en backend.<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n       \r\n        <div class=\"quiz-results\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n            <h3>\ud83d\udcca RESULTADOS DEL QUIZ<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"results-score\">\r\n                Puntuaci\u00f3n: <span id=\"quizScore\">0<\/span>\/3\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <button class=\"btn-retry\" onclick=\"reiniciarQuiz()\">\r\n                \ud83d\udd04 INTENTAR NUEVAMENTE\r\n            <\/button>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CIERRE Y RECURSOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"cierre-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83e\udde0<\/span> CIERRE METACOGNITIVO\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"cierre-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"autoevaluacion\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udcca AUTOEVALUACI\u00d3N<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"skill-meter\">\r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>Frontend:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\"><div class=\"skill-fill\" style=\"width:0%\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>Backend:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\"><div class=\"skill-fill\" style=\"width:0%\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>Base de Datos:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\"><div class=\"skill-fill\" style=\"width:0%\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                        <span>DevOps:<\/span>\r\n                        <div class=\"skill-bar\"><div class=\"skill-fill\" style=\"width:0%\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\" class=\"skill-slider\">\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                <button class=\"btn-guardar\" onclick=\"guardarHabilidades()\">\ud83d\udcbe Guardar<\/button>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"recursos\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83d\udd17 RECURSOS 2025<\/h3>\r\n                <div class=\"recursos-links\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/fullstackopen.com\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">Full Stack Open<\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/roadmap.sh\/full-stack\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">Roadmap Full-Stack<\/a>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/vercel.com\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"recurso-link\">Vercel Deploy<\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n\/\/ JS COMPLETO PARA LA LECCI\u00d3N FULL-STACK WEB 2025\r\nconsole.log('Inicializando lecci\u00f3n Programaci\u00f3n - Desarrollo de Aplicaciones Web Full-Stack 2025');\r\n\r\nlet productos = [];\r\nlet idCounter = 1;\r\n\r\n\/\/ Agregar producto con validaci\u00f3n\r\nfunction agregarProducto() {\r\n    const nombre = document.getElementById(\"producto-nombre\").value.trim();\r\n    const precioInput = document.getElementById(\"producto-precio\").value;\r\n    const precio = parseFloat(precioInput);\r\n    const output = document.getElementById(\"web-output\");\r\n\r\n    if (!nombre || precioInput === \"\" || isNaN(precio) || precio < 0) {\r\n        output.innerHTML = \"<span style='color:#ff6b6b;'>\u26a0\ufe0f Nombre y precio v\u00e1lido requeridos<\/span>\";\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    const producto = { id: idCounter++, nombre, precio };\r\n    productos.push(producto);\r\n    actualizarLista();\r\n    output.innerHTML = `<span style='color:#39ff14;'>Producto agregado: <strong>${nombre}<\/strong> (\u20ac${precio.toFixed(2)})<\/span>`;\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Limpiar inputs\r\n    document.getElementById(\"producto-nombre\").value = \"\";\r\n    document.getElementById(\"producto-precio\").value = \"\";\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Actualizar lista y estad\u00edsticas\r\nfunction actualizarLista() {\r\n    const lista = document.getElementById(\"productos-lista\");\r\n    const totalProductos = document.getElementById(\"totalProductos\");\r\n    const valorTotal = document.getElementById(\"valorTotal\");\r\n\r\n    totalProductos.textContent = productos.length;\r\n    const totalValor = productos.reduce((sum, p) => sum + p.precio, 0);\r\n    valorTotal.textContent = totalValor.toFixed(2) + \" \u20ac\";\r\n\r\n    if (productos.length === 0) {\r\n        lista.innerHTML = \"<p class='placeholder'>No hay productos. Agrega uno arriba \u2191<\/p>\";\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    let html = `<table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n        <thead>\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <th>ID<\/th>\r\n                <th>Nombre<\/th>\r\n                <th>Precio<\/th>\r\n                <th>Acci\u00f3n<\/th>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/thead>\r\n        <tbody>`;\r\n    productos.forEach(p => {\r\n        html += `<tr>\r\n            <td>${p.id}<\/td>\r\n            <td>${p.nombre}<\/td>\r\n            <td>\u20ac${p.precio.toFixed(2)}<\/td>\r\n            <td><button class=\"btn-eliminar\" onclick=\"eliminarProducto(${p.id})\">\ud83d\uddd1 Eliminar<\/button><\/td>\r\n        <\/tr>`;\r\n    });\r\n    html += `<\/tbody><\/table>`;\r\n    lista.innerHTML = html;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Eliminar producto\r\nfunction eliminarProducto(id) {\r\n    productos = productos.filter(p => p.id !== id);\r\n    actualizarLista();\r\n    document.getElementById(\"web-output\").innerHTML = `<span style='color:#ffff00;'>Producto eliminado (ID ${id})<\/span>`;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Limpiar todo el inventario\r\nfunction limpiarProductos() {\r\n    productos = [];\r\n    idCounter = 1;\r\n    actualizarLista();\r\n    document.getElementById(\"web-output\").innerHTML = \"<span style='color:#00ff9d;'>Inventario limpiado completamente<\/span>\";\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Objetivos interactivos (checkbox)\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.objetivo-card').forEach(card => {\r\n    card.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n        const completado = card.dataset.completado === 'true';\r\n        card.dataset.completado = !completado;\r\n        const checkbox = card.querySelector('.objetivo-checkbox');\r\n        checkbox.style.background = !completado ? 'var(--neon-concepto)' : 'transparent';\r\n        checkbox.style.borderColor = !completado ? 'var(--neon-concepto)' : '#39ff14';\r\n        console.log('Objetivo toggled:', card.querySelector('h3').textContent);\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Quiz autoevaluado\r\nlet quizCompletadas = 0;\r\nconst totalPreguntas = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question').length;\r\n\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(option => {\r\n    option.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n        const question = option.closest('.quiz-question');\r\n        if (question.dataset.answered) return;\r\n        question.dataset.answered = 'true';\r\n\r\n        const value = option.dataset.value;\r\n        const correct = question.dataset.correct;\r\n        const feedback = question.querySelector('.quiz-feedback');\r\n        feedback.style.display = 'block';\r\n\r\n        if (value === correct) {\r\n            option.classList.add('correct');\r\n            feedback.querySelector('.feedback-correct').style.display = 'block';\r\n        } else {\r\n            option.classList.add('incorrect');\r\n            feedback.querySelector('.feedback-incorrect').style.display = 'block';\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        quizCompletadas++;\r\n        if (quizCompletadas === totalPreguntas) {\r\n            mostrarResultadosQuiz();\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction mostrarResultadosQuiz() {\r\n    const correctas = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option.correct').length;\r\n    document.getElementById('quizScore').textContent = `${correctas}\/${totalPreguntas}`;\r\n    const feedbackText = correctas === totalPreguntas ? '\u00a1Dominio total del Full-Stack!' :\r\n        correctas >= totalPreguntas * 0.66 ? 'Muy bien, conceptos s\u00f3lidos' : 'Repasa las capas del stack';\r\n    document.getElementById('quizFeedback').textContent = feedbackText;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction reiniciarQuiz() {\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question').forEach(q => {\r\n        q.dataset.answered = '';\r\n        q.querySelector('.quiz-feedback').style.display = 'none';\r\n        q.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(o => o.classList.remove('correct', 'incorrect'));\r\n    });\r\n    quizCompletadas = 0;\r\n    document.querySelector('.quiz-results').style.display = 'none';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Errores comunes (colapsables)\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.collapsible .error-header').forEach(header => {\r\n    header.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n        const content = header.nextElementSibling;\r\n        const icon = header.querySelector('.collapse-icon');\r\n        content.style.display = content.style.display === 'none' ? 'block' : 'none';\r\n        icon.textContent = content.style.display === 'block' ? '-' : '+';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\n\/\/ Autoevaluaci\u00f3n de habilidades con sliders\r\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.skill-slider').forEach(slider => {\r\n    slider.addEventListener('input', () => {\r\n        const fill = slider.closest('.skill-item').querySelector('.skill-fill');\r\n        fill.style.width = slider.value + '%';\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction guardarHabilidades() {\r\n    const skills = {};\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.skill-slider').forEach(slider => {\r\n        const label = slider.closest('.skill-item').querySelector('span').textContent.trim();\r\n        skills[label] = slider.value;\r\n    });\r\n    localStorage.setItem('fullstackSkills2025', JSON.stringify(skills));\r\n    alert('Habilidades Full-Stack guardadas en localStorage');\r\n    console.log('Habilidades guardadas:', skills);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Proyecto final (mostrar soluci\u00f3n)\r\nfunction mostrarEsqueletoProyecto() {\r\n    const solucion = document.getElementById('proyectoSolucion');\r\n    solucion.style.display = solucion.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/\/ Inicializaci\u00f3n al cargar la p\u00e1gina\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\r\n    actualizarLista();\r\n    console.log('Lecci\u00f3n Full-Stack Web 2025 cargada correctamente');\r\n});\r\n<\/script>","ejercicios":[{"enunciado":"Frontend usa","respuesta":"HTML, CSS, JavaScript"},{"enunciado":"Backend procesa","respuesta":"L\u00f3gica, APIs, autenticaci\u00f3n"},{"enunciado":"BD almacena","respuesta":"Datos persistentes"},{"enunciado":"Full-Stack domina","respuesta":"Frontend + Backend + BD"},{"enunciado":"API REST usa","respuesta":"HTTP methods (GET, POST)"},{"enunciado":"Responsive con","respuesta":"Media Queries, Flexbox"},{"enunciado":"Deploy en","respuesta":"Vercel, Netlify, Heroku"},{"enunciado":"Stack MERN","respuesta":"Mongo, Express, React, Node"},{"enunciado":"PWA permite","respuesta":"Offline, notificaciones"},{"enunciado":"SSR es","respuesta":"Server-Side Rendering"},{"enunciado":"SI: % apps con PWA","respuesta":"+70%"},{"enunciado":"Framework PHP","respuesta":"Laravel"}],"quiz":[{"pregunta":"Frontend es","opciones":["Interfaz","L\u00f3gica","BD","Red"],"correcta":"Interfaz"},{"pregunta":"Backend maneja","opciones":["APIs","Dise\u00f1o","HTML","CSS"],"correcta":"APIs"},{"pregunta":"Full-Stack incluye","opciones":["Todo","Solo front","Solo back","Dise\u00f1o"],"correcta":"Todo"},{"pregunta":"HTTP GET es para","opciones":["Leer","Crear","Actualizar","Eliminar"],"correcta":"Leer"},{"pregunta":"POST para","opciones":["Crear","Leer","Actualizar","Eliminar"],"correcta":"Crear"},{"pregunta":"Responsive adapta a","opciones":["Dispositivos","Solo PC","Impresi\u00f3n","Nada"],"correcta":"Dispositivos"},{"pregunta":"PWA permite","opciones":["Offline","Solo online","Nada","Solo m\u00f3vil"],"correcta":"Offline"},{"pregunta":"SSR mejora","opciones":["SEO","Velocidad","Dise\u00f1o","Nada"],"correcta":"SEO"},{"pregunta":"Deploy en Vercel es","opciones":["Gratis","Solo pago","Local","Error"],"correcta":"Gratis"},{"pregunta":"Git es para","opciones":["Control versi\u00f3n","Dise\u00f1o","BD","Hosting"],"correcta":"Control versi\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Stack LAMP","opciones":["Linux, Apache, MySQL, PHP","Windows","Node","React"],"correcta":"Linux, Apache, MySQL, PHP"},{"pregunta":"MERN usa","opciones":["MongoDB","MySQL","PostgreSQL","SQLite"],"correcta":"MongoDB"},{"pregunta":"Framework React","opciones":["Next.js","Laravel","Django","Flask"],"correcta":"Next.js"},{"pregunta":"API REST devuelve","opciones":["JSON","HTML","CSS","XML"],"correcta":"JSON"},{"pregunta":"CORS es para","opciones":["Seguridad dominios","Velocidad","Dise\u00f1o","Nada"],"correcta":"Seguridad dominios"},{"pregunta":"JWT para","opciones":["Autenticaci\u00f3n","Dise\u00f1o","BD","Hosting"],"correcta":"Autenticaci\u00f3n"},{"pregunta":"Docker","opciones":["Contenedores","VM","Nube","IDE"],"correcta":"Contenedores"},{"pregunta":"CI\/CD significa","opciones":["Integraci\u00f3n\/Despliegue continuo","C\u00f3digo","Dise\u00f1o","Nada"],"correcta":"Integraci\u00f3n\/Despliegue continuo"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: % full-stack","opciones":["65%","30%","90%","10%"],"correcta":"65%"},{"pregunta":"App m\u00e1s usada","opciones":["Web","M\u00f3vil","Desktop","IoT"],"correcta":"Web"},{"pregunta":"Frontend framework","opciones":["React","Laravel","Express","Django"],"correcta":"React"},{"pregunta":"Backend PHP","opciones":["Laravel","React","Vue","Angular"],"correcta":"Laravel"},{"pregunta":"BD NoSQL","opciones":["MongoDB","MySQL","SQLite","Oracle"],"correcta":"MongoDB"},{"pregunta":"Cloud para web","opciones":["AWS, Vercel","Local","USB","CD"],"correcta":"AWS, Vercel"},{"pregunta":"HTTPS es","opciones":["Seguro","Lento","Opcional","Error"],"correcta":"Seguro"},{"pregunta":"Cache mejora","opciones":["Velocidad","Seguridad","Dise\u00f1o","Nada"],"correcta":"Velocidad"},{"pregunta":"Microservicios","opciones":["Escalable","Monolito","Lento","Simple"],"correcta":"Escalable"},{"pregunta":"WebSocket para","opciones":["Tiempo real","Est\u00e1tico","Archivos","Email"],"correcta":"Tiempo real"},{"pregunta":"SI 2025: % apps PWA","opciones":["+70%","30%","10%","0%"],"correcta":"+70%"},{"pregunta":"Full-Stack ideal para","opciones":["Startups, MVP","Bancos","Gobierno","Hardware"],"correcta":"Startups, MVP"}]},{"materia":"Programaci\u00f3n","slug":"csharp-dotnet-2025","titulo":"C# + .NET 2025: Consola, Frameworks, Simulador y Retos Interactivos","contenido":"<!-- INICIO LECCI\u00d3N CYBERPUNK -->\r\n<div class=\"leccion-container leccion-programacion-csharp\" data-tema=\"csharp-dotnet\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- CABECERA CYBERPUNK -->\r\n    <header class=\"leccion-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"titulo-leccion neon-glow\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon-tema\">\u26a1<\/span>\r\n            C# + .NET 2025\r\n        <\/h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitulo\">\r\n            Stack Empresarial: Consola, WinForms, ASP.NET, Simulador y Retos\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL OBJETIVOS -->\r\n    <section class=\"panel-objetivos\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udfaf<\/span> OBJETIVOS DE APRENDIZAJE\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"objetivos-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Dominar ecosistema .NET 2025<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Entender Consola, WinForms, ASP.NET Core, Blazor, Unity, Azure<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Programar simulador interactivo<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Ejecutar c\u00f3digo C# en tiempo real con compilaci\u00f3n virtual<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Resolver retos de programaci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Calculadora, API REST, juegos con casos reales<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"objetivo-card\" data-completado=\"false\">\r\n                <div class=\"objetivo-checkbox\"><\/div>\r\n                <h3>Migrar a .NET 8+ y C# 12<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Caracter\u00edsticas modernas: records, pattern matching, minimal APIs<\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- CONTEXTO REAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"contexto-real\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-dato\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83c\udf0d<\/span> MERCADO LABORAL 2025\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"contexto-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfe2 Fortune 500<\/h3>\r\n                <p>82% de empresas usan C#\/.NET en sistemas cr\u00edticos<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Salario promedio: $95K<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\u2601\ufe0f Azure + Cloud<\/h3>\r\n                <p>75% de APIs empresariales con ASP.NET Core<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">Crecimiento: +34% anual<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"contexto-card\">\r\n                <h3>\ud83c\udfae Gaming Industry<\/h3>\r\n                <p>Unity (C#) domina 61% del mercado de juegos m\u00f3viles<\/p>\r\n                <div class=\"dato-neon\">>4B descargas<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECCI\u00d3N TE\u00d3RICA -->\r\n    <section class=\"teoria-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"borde-neon-lateral\"><\/div>\r\n        <h2 class=\"seccion-titulo neon-concepto\">\r\n            <span class=\"icon\">\ud83d\udcda<\/span> ECOSISTEMA .NET 2025\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- INTRODUCCI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>1. Arquitectura Moderna: C# + .NET 8+<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"definicion-principal\">\r\n                <div class=\"def-card\">\r\n                    <h4>\u26a1 C# (C SHARP)<\/h4>\r\n                    <p>Lenguaje <strong>tipado<\/strong>, <strong>orientado a objetos<\/strong>, <strong>multiparadigma<\/strong><\/p>\r\n                    <div class=\"formula-inline\">\r\n                        \\[ \\text{C#} = \\text{Sintaxis limpia} + \\text{Tipado fuerte} + \\text{Async\/Await} \\]\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"clasificacion-doble\">\r\n                <div class=\"clas-card core\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83e\udde0 .NET CORE \/ .NET 8+<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>Multiplataforma:<\/strong> Windows, Linux, macOS<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Open Source:<\/strong> MIT License, comunidad activa<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Alto rendimiento:<\/strong> +40% vs .NET Framework<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Containers:<\/strong> Docker, Kubernetes nativos<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Versiones LTS:<\/strong> .NET 6, .NET 8, .NET 10 (2025)\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"clas-card frameworks\">\r\n                    <h4>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f FRAMEWORKS PRINCIPALES<\/h4>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li><strong>ASP.NET Core:<\/strong> Web APIs, MVC, Razor Pages<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>WinForms\/WPF:<\/strong> Desktop Windows tradicional<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>MAUI:<\/strong> Multiplataforma (iOS, Android, Windows)<\/li>\r\n                        <li><strong>Blazor:<\/strong> C# en navegador (WebAssembly)<\/li>\r\n                    <\/ul>\r\n                    <div class=\"ejemplos\">\r\n                        <strong>Nicho:<\/strong> Unity (juegos), ML.NET (machine learning)\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- TABLA ECOSISTEMA -->\r\n        <div class=\"subseccion\">\r\n            <h3>2. Tabla Comparativa: Stack Completo<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"tabla-interactiva\">\r\n                <table class=\"tabla-cyberpunk\">\r\n                    <thead>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <th>TIPO<\/th>\r\n                            <th>FRAMEWORK<\/th>\r\n                            <th>USO PRINCIPAL<\/th>\r\n                            <th>RENDIMIENTO<\/th>\r\n                            <th>CURVA APRENDIZAJE<\/th>\r\n                            <th>SALARIO PROMEDIO<\/th>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                    <\/thead>\r\n                    <tbody>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"consola\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">CONSOLA<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>.NET Console<\/td>\r\n                            <td>CLI, Tools, Backend Services<\/td>\r\n                            <td>\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Baja<\/td>\r\n                            <td>$75K<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"web\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">WEB<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>ASP.NET Core<\/td>\r\n                            <td>APIs REST, MVC, Microservicios<\/td>\r\n                            <td>\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Media<\/td>\r\n                            <td>$105K<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n                        <tr data-tipo=\"desktop\">\r\n                            <td><strong class=\"neon-concepto\">DESKTOP<\/strong><\/td>\r\n                            <td>WinForms \/ WPF<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Aplicaciones Windows empresariales<\/td>\r\n                            <td>\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f<\/td>\r\n                            <td>Media<\/td>\r\n                            <td>$90K<\/td>\r\n                        <\/tr>\r\n         